    [" 不对劲！"] = "Something's not right!",
    [" 东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。"] = "There is a small house on the old street in the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things inside every night.",
    [" 两张？和我一样…"] = "Two? Just like me...",
