    [" 乌鸦"] = "Crow",
    [" 但是妈妈不让我和芬妮一起玩。"] = "But Mom won't let me play with Fanny.",
    [" 但这么珍贵的东西，一般不会凭空出现。是你最近向愚者祈求了什么吗？"] = "But such a precious item usually wouldn't appear out of thin air. Have you prayed to the Fool for anything recently?",
