    [" 偷走第八小节休止<P_Yellow>符</>，尾鳍剪成塔罗牌丢迷<P_Yellow>雾</>。"] = " Steal the eighth measure's rest<P_Yellow></>, cut the tail fin into a Tarot card and toss it into the fog<P_Yellow></>.",
