    [" 嫁接因果，愚弄虚实，完成致敬命运的盛大演出。"] = "Grafting causality, fooling reality and illusion, completing a grand performance paying tribute to fate.",
    [" 对啊！结果我的小猫……叼走了，一下子……一切都没了……"] = "That's right! In the end, my kitten... snatched it away, and suddenly... everything was gone...",
    [" 封印物的遗失或许并非偶然，而是一场预谋……我们会继续调查的，先追回封印物吧。"] = "The loss of the Sealed Artifact might not be an accident, but a premeditated plot... We will continue to investigate; let's retrieve the Sealed Artifact first.",
    [" 想要买什么样的花呢？"] = "What kind of flowers do you want to buy?",
    [" 我们在找乘客掉下来的东西。每当火车驶过，车窗里总会甩出些有趣的小玩意！"] = "We are looking for things dropped by passengers. Every time the train passes, some interesting little gadgets are always thrown out of the windows!",
