    ["\"正义\"：这个世界有很多非凡者 ，非凡力量的基石表现为——22条非凡途径。\n\"正义\"：每一条途径，从序列9开始，越往前，数字越小，代表的力量层次越高。"] = "\"Justice\": There are many Beyonders in this world. The foundation of Beyonder powers is represented by—22 Beyonder Pathways. \n\"Justice\": For every pathway, starting from Sequence 9, the further forward you go, the smaller the number, representing a higher level of power.",
    ["\"正义\"：非凡者通过服食魔药晋升序列，同时也是在晋升生命层次，这是一条——\n\"正义\"：从人到神的进阶之路。"] = "\"Justice\": Beyonders advance their Sequence by consuming potions, which is also an advancement in their level of life. This is a— \n\"Justice\": Path of progression from human to God.",
    ["\"火花\""] = "\"Spark\"",
    ["\"烙铁\""] = "\"Soldering Iron\"",
    ["\"白天有11位秘术导师在1点传送到古堡6处，\n第2天8点10分3秒才回到小镇\""] = "\"During the day, 11 mysticism mentors teleport to 6 locations in the castle at 1:00, \n and only return to the small town at 8:10:03 on the 2nd day.\"",
    ["\"窥秘人\"途径可以更好地掌握神秘学知识，但似乎更容易感知到一些未知的存在。老尼尔说过，他经常听到一些呓语……"] = "The [Mystery Pryer] pathway can better master mysticism knowledge, but it seems easier to perceive some unknown existences. Old Neil said he often hears some whispers...",
    ["\"近五年进出口账目全面复查\"……完了，都完了……"] = "\"Comprehensive review of import and export accounts for the last five years\"... It's over, it's all over...",
