    ["\"钻头\"-2星"] = "\"Drill\" - 2 Star",
    ["\"钻头\"-3星"] = "\"Drill\" - 3 Star",
    ["\"钻头\"召唤射线，旋转一段时间后逆转。与此同时场地内出现大量<Highlight>电场</>阻碍路径。被射线击中叠加<Highlight>过载</>层数。"] = "\"Drill\" summons rays that rotate for a period of time before reversing. At the same time, a large number of <Highlight>Electric Fields</> appear on the field, obstructing paths. Being hit by a ray adds stacks of <Highlight>Overload</>.",
    ["\"钻头\"浮空后召唤<Highlight>绝缘屏罩</>，场地出现多个<Highlight>导电圣标</>，其中一个为激活状态。全体非凡者从激活圣标处引导雷电充能其他圣标，完成充能击破<Highlight>绝缘屏罩</>，一段时间未完成则团灭。"] = "After \"Drill\" floats, it summons an <Highlight>Insulating Barrier</>. Multiple <Highlight>Conductive Holy Beacons</> appear on the field, one of which is active. All Beyonders must guide lightning from the active beacon to charge the other beacons. Completing the charge will break the <Highlight>Insulating Barrier</>; failure to do so within a certain time results in a party wipe.",
    ["\"钻头\"浮空后场地出现6处<Highlight>水池</>，每个非凡者身边出现<Highlight>电球</>自动跟踪非凡者，需将<Highlight>电球</>引入<Highlight>水池</>变成<Highlight>雷池</>。之后\"钻头\"落地开始持续随机冲锋！非凡者躲避<Highlight>雷池</>，引诱\"钻头\"踩<Highlight>雷池</>叠加<Highlight>过载</>层数，达到4层后进入<Highlight>眩晕</>状态。"] = "After \"Drill\" floats, 6 <Highlight>Water Pools</> appear on the field. <Highlight>Electric Balls</> appear around each Beyonder, automatically tracking them. Players must lead the <Highlight>Electric Balls</> into the <Highlight>Water Pools</> to turn them into <Highlight>Thunder Pools</>. Afterward, \"Drill\" lands and begins continuous random charges! Beyonders must avoid the <Highlight>Thunder Pools</> and lure \"Drill\" to step on the <Highlight>Thunder Pools</> to add stacks of <Highlight>Overload</>. Upon reaching 4 stacks, it enters a <Highlight>Stun</> state.",
    ["\"钻头\"浮空后场地出现6处<Highlight>雷池</>。引诱\"钻头\"冲锋踩到<Highlight>雷池</>叠加<Highlight>过载</>层数，达到4层后进入<Highlight>眩晕</>状态。"] = "After \"Drill\" floats, 6 <Highlight>Thunder Pools</> appear on the field. Lure \"Drill\" to charge and step on a <Highlight>Thunder Pool</> to add stacks of <Highlight>Overload</>. Upon reaching 4 stacks, it enters a <Highlight>Stun</> state.",
