    ["(木偶的嘴里发出吱呀呀的声音)别提了。我黄昏上班时就撞见了那个开膛手，那会儿他刚进林子。"] = "(A creaking sound comes from the puppet's mouth) Don't mention it. I ran into that Ripper when I started my shift at dusk; he had just entered the woods then.",
    ["(木偶的嘴里发出吱呀呀的声音)邪门了，黄昏那会儿林子里乱成一团，那群机灵的猎物像见了鬼一样全往外冲，差点把我撞个跟头。"] = "(The puppet's mouth makes a creaking sound) It's evil. At dusk, the woods were in total chaos. That group of clever prey rushed out like they'd seen a ghost, nearly knocking me over.",
    ["(未激活)"] = "(Inactive)",
    ["(累计)耗时"] = "(Cumulative) Time",
    ["(语气突然变冷)开膛手灵巧的身影刚刚顺利躲过了巡逻的警察。"] = "(Tone suddenly turns cold) The Ripper's nimble figure had just successfully evaded the patrolling police.",
    ["(还有黛比应该准备新的眼镜了……)"] = "(And Debbie should get new glasses...)",
