    ["***，不工作天上会掉便士吗。这种活给的钱比地上的多多了！"] = "***, will pennies fall from the sky if I don't work? This kind of job pays much more than the ones on the ground!",
    ["***，说了只是缓一下，规定时间内能给你干完！<P_Heart>（冲你脚下吐了一口唾沫）</>"] = "***, I said I'm just taking a break, I can finish it for you within the stipulated time! <P_Heart> (Spits at your feet) </>",
