    ["0: 三段跳落地;\n1: x 键落地"] = "0: Triple jump landing; \n 1: x key landing",
    ["0: 默认跟随释放者\n1: 跟随锁定目标\n2: 世界坐标系的朝向（取DeltaYaw值）"] = "0: Default follow caster \n 1: Follow locked target \n 2: Orientation of world coordinate system (take DeltaYaw value)",
    ["0:\"Puddle这里是类似廷根的水坑材质, 不是真正的水面\",\n1:\"Grass草地\",\n2:\"Stone石头\",\n3:\"Dirt土地\",\n4:\"Wood木板\",\n5:\"Blanket地毯\",\n6:\"Fabric布棚\",\n7:\"Glass玻璃\",\n8:\"Ice冰面\",\n9:\"Marsh湿地\",\n10:\"Metal实心金属\",\n11:\"Sand沙地\",\n12:\"Snow雪地\",\n13:\"Steelplate钢板\",\n14:\"Tile水坑\",\n15:\"Water水面\",\n16:\"WoodBoard木板\""] = "0: \"Puddle (similar to Tingen's puddle material, not actual water surface)\", \n 1: \"Grass\", \n 2: \"Stone\", \n 3: \"Dirt\", \n 4: \"Wood\", \n 5: \"Blanket\", \n 6: \"Fabric\", \n 7: \"Glass\", \n 8: \"Ice\", \n 9: \"Marsh\", \n 10: \"Solid Metal\", \n 11: \"Sand\", \n 12: \"Snow\", \n 13: \"Steel Plate\", \n 14: \"Tile Puddle\", \n 15: \"Water Surface\", \n 16: \"Wood Board\"",
    ["0:\"始终跟随释放者的位置&朝向\"\n1:\"跟随释放者的位置和播放时的初始朝向\"\n2:\"不跟随，释放时决定位置&朝向\""] = "0: \"Always follow the position & orientation of the caster\" \n 1: \"Follow the position of the caster and the initial orientation at the time of playback\" \n 2: \"Do not follow, position & orientation determined at the time of casting\"",
    ["0:\"自身Root位置\",1:\"默认目标Root位置\",2:\"位置 黑板值里的已有位置\",3:\"右摇杆拖拽传入位置\""] = "0: \"Own Root position\", 1: \"Default target Root position\", 2: \"Position already in Blackboard value\", 3: \"Position passed in by right stick drag\"",
    ["0:\"随state结束而打断\",1:\"随技能结束而打断\",2:\"不打断\""] = "0: \"Interrupt with state end\", 1: \"Interrupt with skill end\", 2: \"Do not interrupt\".",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\""] = "0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\"",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\",3:\"子弹朝向仅取决于Action配置\""] = "0: \"Default to the line between the first offset point and the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\", 3: \"Bullet orientation depends only on Action configuration\".",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\"。"] = "0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\".",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"朝向使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\",3:\"子弹朝向仅取决于Action配置\",4:\"子弹起始朝向为 input_dir\""] = "0: \"Default to the line between the first offset point and the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\", 3: \"Bullet orientation depends only on Action configuration\", 4: \"Bullet starting orientation is input_dir\".",
    ["0:不做处理\n1:当前技能锁定目标\n2:使用黑板中传入的目标"] = "0: No processing \n 1: Lock onto the current skill target \n 2: Use the target passed in the blackboard.",
    ["0:空白，1：报名中，2：报名结束，3：匹配中，4：匹配结束，5战斗中 6：战斗结束"] = "0: blank, 1: registering, 2: registration closed, 3: matching, 4: match complete, 5: in battle, 6: battle ended.",
    ["0:跟随state结束,1:跟随技能结束,2:不结束"] = "0: Follow state end, 1: Follow skill end, 2: Do not end.",
    ["0:隐藏 1:开启"] = "0: Hide, 1: Enable.",
    ["0为不限制次数"] = "0 means no limit on the number of times.",
    ["0亿/0万"] = "0 billion/0 ten thousand",
    ["0或不填：任意类型触发；\n1: 单人类型触发\n2: 双人类型触发"] = "0 or empty: Triggered by any type; \n 1: Triggered by single-player type \n 2: Triggered by double-player type",
    ["0或者不填是关，其他就是开"] = "0 or blank is off, others are on",
    ["0秒之后可Skip"] = "Skip available in 0 seconds",
    ["0秒之后可跳过"] = "Skip available in 0 seconds",
    ["0级封印物“知识皇冠”在廷根失踪，它是罗塞尔被刺杀后的遗物，有堕落母神污染的残留。 "] = "The Grade 0 Sealed Artifact \"Knowledge Moor\" has gone missing in Tingen. It is a relic from after Roselle's assassination and contains residual corruption from the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
    ["0级是最高危险等级，它的能力和负面效果，甚至可以毁灭城市。"] = "Grade 0 is the highest danger level; its abilities and negative effects can even destroy a city.",
    ["0表示不设置命中最小间隔"] = "0 means no minimum hit interval is set.",
    ["0：不旋转\n1：跟随释放者朝向\n2：固定顺时针旋转\n3：固定逆时针旋转\n4：跟随锁定目标旋转"] = "0: Do not rotate \n 1: Follow caster orientation \n 2: Fixed clockwise rotation \n 3: Fixed counter-clockwise rotation \n 4: Follow locked target rotation",
    ["0：中性buff\n1：增益buff\n2：减益buff"] = "0: Neutral buff\n1: Buff\n2: Debuff",
    ["0：以发起攻击的实体的位置  1：以攻击筛选范围的中心 "] = "0: Based on the position of the entity initiating the attack; 1: Based on the center of the attack filter range.",
    ["0：护盾buff吸收的总伤害"] = "0: Total damage absorbed by the shield buff.",
    ["0：推出当前抓取的文字版\n1：抓取选中的文字版"] = "0: Push current grabbed text version \n 1: Grab selected text version",
    ["0：攻击者与受击者的连线  1：以攻击者的面向"] = "0: The line between the attacker and the victim; 1: Based on the attacker's facing.",
    ["0：男性\n1：女性\n2：无性别"] = "0: Male \n 1: Female \n 2: No gender",
    ["0：目标\n1：同skill中的ghost\n2：特定法术场中的mesh（配合SpellFieldID使用）"] = "0: Target \n 1: Ghost within the same skill \n 2: Mesh in a specific spell field (used with SpellFieldID).",
    ["0：竞速玩法；"] = "0: Racing gameplay;",
    ["0：覆盖\n1：叠加"] = "0: Override \n 1: Additive",
    ["0：（缺省值）对Target里的每一个对象，都发射全部子弹\n1：（排队枪毙）从子弹List里逐个发射子弹，对象为Target列表里按顺序选取，直至Target耗尽，或者子弹耗尽\n2：（随机发放）从子弹List里逐个发射子弹，对象从Target列表里随机选取（可重复选取），直到子弹耗尽"] = "0: (Default) Fire all bullets at every object in Target \n 1: (Queue execution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects from the Target list in order until the Target list is exhausted or bullets are exhausted \n 2: (Random distribution) Fire bullets one by one from the bullet List, selecting objects randomly from the Target list (can be selected repeatedly) until bullets are exhausted.",
    ["1 显示； 0 不显示"] = "1: Show; 0: Hide.",
    ["1-1-与NPC对话，了解情况"] = "1-1: Talk to the NPC to understand the situation",
    ["1-1-获取火把"] = "1-1: Obtain the torch",
    ["1-使用C++实现 0-使用Lua实现"] = "1: Implement with C++, 0: Implement with Lua.",
    ["1-开启, 0-关闭"] = "1: Enable, 0: Disable.",
    ["1-开启, 0-关闭 开启后可以在PVP局内点击主界面最上方打开数据统计"] = "1: Enable, 0: Disable; once enabled, you can click the top of the main interface in PVP to open data statistics.",
    ["1-开启, 其他值-关闭"] = "1-Enable, other values-Disable",
    ["1-开启，0-关闭"] = "1: Enable, 0: Disable.",
    ["1-手枪\n2-霰弹枪\n3-狙击枪"] = "1-Pistol \n 2-Shotgun \n 3-Sniper Rifle.",
    ["1-显示, 0-隐藏"] = "1: Show, 0: Hide.",
    ["1-显示, 0-隐藏；x1,y1 左上角坐标；x2,y2 右下角坐标;如1,100,100,1024,1024"] = "1: Show, 0: Hide; x1, y1 top-left coordinates; x2, y2 bottom-right; e.g., 1, 100, 100, 1024, 1024.",
    ["1-正确"] = "1-Correct",
    ["1-流畅 2-标准 3-高清，音质越高延迟越高"] = "1-Smooth, 2-Standard, 3-HD; higher audio quality results in higher latency.",
    ["1. <Highlight>家族属性加成：</>在副本内与一定数量的同家族成员组队可以获得额外的<Highlight>复活次数加成</>和<Highlight>属性补足加成</>，离开家族后有<Highlight>24小时</>的生效冷却期。\n2. <Highlight>家族称号：</>加入家族自动获得<Highlight>家族称号</>，首席可在家族详情处修改家族名称，名称修改具有<Highlight>30天</>的冷却期，修改成功后家族称号会同步修改。"] = "1. <Highlight> Family attribute bonus: </> Teaming up with a certain number of members from the same family in a dungeon can grant additional <Highlight> resurrection count bonuses </> and <Highlight> attribute supplement bonuses </>. There is a <Highlight> 24-hour </> cooling-off period after leaving a family. \n 2. <Highlight> Family title: </> Joining a family automatically grants a <Highlight> family title </>. The chief can change the family name in the family details. Name changes have a <Highlight> 30-day </> cooldown period. After a successful change, the family title will be updated accordingly.",
    ["1. <Highlight>家族申请表：</>每位未加入家族的非凡者可填写发布个人申请表寻找适合自己的家族，申请表在发布<Highlight>3天后</>或成功加入家族后将会自动撤下。\n2. <Highlight>响应招募：</>未加入家族的非凡者，可选择自行发起或加入其他非凡者的响应招募，发起响应的非凡者默认成为<Highlight>家族首席</>。\n3. <Highlight>创建家族：</>在响应招募阶段中，家族的响应人数达到<Highlight>3人及以上</>，即可创建家族，创建过程中首席可以调整家族名称和成员位次。\n4. <Highlight>加入家族：</>当家族成员不满<Highlight>14人</>时，首席可发起家族招募。其他非凡者发起申请，并通过首席审核后，可直接加入家族。"] = "1. <Highlight>Family Application Form:</> Every Beyonder who has not joined a Family can fill out and publish a personal application form to find a suitable Family. The application form will be automatically removed <Highlight>3 days</> after publication or once you have successfully joined a Family.\n2. <Highlight>Respond to Recruitment:</> Beyonders who have not joined a Family can choose to initiate or join other Beyonders' recruitment responses. The Beyonder who initiates the response becomes the <Highlight>Family Chief</> by default.\n3. <Highlight>Create a Family:</> During the recruitment response phase, once the number of respondents for the Family reaches <Highlight>3 or more</>, the Family can be created. During the creation process, the Chief can adjust the Family name and member positions.\n4. <Highlight>Join a Family:</> When a Family has fewer than <Highlight>14 members</>, the Chief can initiate Family recruitment. Other Beyonders can submit applications, and after passing the Chief's review, they can join the Family directly.",
    ["1. <Highlight>家族申请表：</>每位未加入家族的非凡者可填写发布个人申请表寻找适合自己的家族，申请表在发布<Highlight>7天后</>或成功加入家族后将会自动撤下。\n2. <Highlight>响应招募：</>未加入家族的非凡者，可选择自行发起或加入其他非凡者的响应招募，发起响应的非凡者默认成为<Highlight>家族首席</>。\n3. <Highlight>创建家族：</>在响应招募阶段中，家族的响应人数达到<Highlight>3人及以上</>，即可创建家族，创建过程中首席可以调整家族名称和成员位次。\n4. <Highlight>加入家族：</>当家族成员不满<Highlight>14人</>时，首席可发起家族招募。其他非凡者发起申请，并通过首席审核后，可直接加入家族。"] = "1. <Highlight> Family Application Form: </> Any Beyonder not in a family can fill out and publish a personal application form to find a suitable family. The form will be automatically removed <Highlight> 7 days </> after publication or upon successfully joining a family. \n 2. <Highlight> Respond to Recruitment: </> Beyonders not in a family can choose to initiate or join another Beyonder's recruitment response. The Beyonder who initiates the response becomes the <Highlight> Family Chief </> by default. \n 3. <Highlight> Create a Family: </> During the recruitment response phase, once the family response count reaches <Highlight> 3 or more </>, you can create a family. During creation, the Chief can adjust the family name and member positions. \n 4. <Highlight> Join a Family: </> When a family has fewer than <Highlight> 14 members </>, the Chief can initiate family recruitment. Other Beyonders can apply, and upon approval by the Chief, they can join the family directly.",
    ["1. <Highlight>默契值和等级：</>完成家族每周任务可获取默契值提升家族等级，每周默契值获取上限为<Highlight>2000点</>。\n2. <Highlight>每周任务：</>家族成员组队参与对应玩法可获得默契值。每个任务在当周前<Highlight>若干次</>完成可获得<Highlight>高倍默契值</>，超出高倍次数后只可获得普通默契值加成，任务<Highlight>每周刷新</>。"] = "1. <Highlight> Rapport and Level: </> Complete weekly Family quests to gain Rapport and increase the Family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Highlight> 2000 points </>. \n 2. <Highlight> Weekly Quests: </> Family members can form teams to participate in corresponding gameplay to earn Rapport. Completing each quest for the first <Highlight> several times </> in the current week grants <Highlight> high-multiplier Rapport </>. After exceeding the high-multiplier count, only standard Rapport bonuses can be obtained. Quests <Highlight> refresh weekly </>.",
    ["1. 不同城堡每周<Highlight>高价收购的物产</>不同；可前往好友城堡进行物产出售。\n2. 多多添加好友，可以<Highlight>更容易找到、出售高价物产</>。\n3. <Highlight>城堡出售物产</>时，售价还能<Highlight>通过以下方式提升</>：提高好友间亲密度、提高城堡总评分、提高风尚值等。"] = "1. Different Castles have different <Highlight> products purchased at high prices </> each week; you can visit friends' Castles to sell products. \n 2. Add more friends to <Highlight> make it easier to find and sell high-priced products </>. \n 3. When <Highlight> selling products at the Castle </>, the selling price can also be <Highlight> increased in the following ways </>: increasing intimacy between friends, increasing the total Castle rating, increasing the Fashion Value, etc.",
    ["1. 在<Highlight>市场界面</>或是<Highlight>工坊生产界面</>，可以看到具体物产的售价和倍率。\n2. 优先找到并制作<Highlight>高倍率物产</>，可以大幅度提升城堡资产的获取速度。\n3. 制造的物产在自家城堡里出售，不存在数量限制；在好友/陌生人城堡里出售存在数量限制。"] = "1. In the <Highlight> market interface </> or <Highlight> workshop production interface </>, you can see the selling price and multiplier of specific products. \n 2. Finding and producing <Highlight> high-multiplier products </> first can significantly increase the speed of acquiring castle assets. \n 3. There is no quantity limit for selling produced goods in your own castle; there is a quantity limit for selling in friends'/strangers' castles.",
    ["1. 在大世界范围中探索，解锁奉献之灵、收集奉献之灵或完成各类隐匿恩赐解谜，提升完成度；\n2. 完成度达到对应档位要求后，玩家可以领取该档位奖励；"] = "1. Explore the open world, unlock Spirits of Devotion, collect them, or complete various Hidden Grace puzzles to increase your completion progress; \n 2. Once your completion progress reaches the required threshold, you can claim the corresponding rewards.",
    ["1. 在部分副本中，队伍人数没有组满时可发布求援\n2. 成功完成他人的求援帮助可获得一定的绑定苏勒奖励\n3. 应援失败也会获得少量绑定苏勒奖励"] = "1. In some dungeons, if the team is not full, you can post a request for help. \n 2. Successfully helping others with their requests grants a certain amount of bound Gold Pounds. \n 3. Failing to provide support also grants a small amount of bound Gold Pounds.",
    ["1. 打开礼金的玩家需要语音输入正确的密文才可以领取礼金\n2. 领取绑金礼金的玩家会获得随机数额的绑金\n3. 领取外观馈赠的玩家会获得随机类型的外观道具"] = "1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct ciphertext via voice to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["1. 打开礼金的玩家需要输入正确的密码才可以领取礼金\n2. 领取绑金礼金的玩家会获得随机数额的绑金\n3. 领取外观馈赠的玩家会获得随机类型的外观道具"] = "1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct password to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["1. 探索属性分为魅力、直觉、武力、学识四种，对应不同的行动与情境，标有大拇指的属性为该教团玩法所需要检定的属性。\n2. 进行检定时，你对应的探索属性会提供加成。基础属性为10点，每超过2点，检定结果即可获得 +1加成。"] = "1. Exploration attributes are divided into Charm, Intuition, Might, and Knowledge, corresponding to different actions and situations. Attributes marked with a thumbs-up are the attributes required for testing in that cult gameplay. \n2. When performing a test, your corresponding exploration attribute will provide a bonus. The base attribute is 10 points; for every 2 points exceeded, the test result gains a +1 bonus.",
    ["1. 普通技能\n2. 普攻\n4. 闪避 \n8.绝技\n16.解控\n32.跳跃"] = "1. Normal Skill \n 2. Basic Attack \n 4. Dodge \n 8. Ultimate \n 16. Cleanse \n 32. Jump.",
    ["1. 最多可以选择4种不同类型的外观\n2. 外观馈赠的数量等于玩家放置的外观道具数量"] = "1. You can choose up to 4 different types of appearances. \n 2. The number of appearance gifts is equal to the number of appearance items placed by the player.",
    ["1. 检定类型：分为魅力、直觉、武力、学识四种，对应不同的行动与情境。\n2. 检定加成（属性）：进行检定时，你对应的探索属性会提供加成。基础属性为10点，每超过2点，检定结果即可获得 +1加成。\n3.检定加成（直接加成）：部分探索天赋除了提升属性，还能直接提供额外的固定检定加成。\n4.优劣势：在单次检定中，若处于优势，可投两颗骰子并取较高值；若处于劣势，则需取较低值。\n5.重投机会：部分天赋或情境会赋予你重投机会。即使首次检定失败，也可选择消耗该机会重新投掷。\n6.多骰子求和：在某些情境下，你需要投出多颗骰子，并将所有点数相加之和作为基础值进行判定。"] = "1. Check Type: Divided into Charisma, Intuition, Might, and Knowledge, corresponding to different actions and situations. \n2. Check Bonus (Attributes): When performing a check, your corresponding Exploration attributes provide a bonus. The base attribute is 10 points; for every 2 points above this, the check result gains a +1 bonus.\n3. Check Bonus (Direct Bonus): In addition to increasing attributes, some Exploration Talents can directly provide additional fixed check bonuses.\n4. Advantages and Disadvantages: In a single check, if you have an advantage, you can roll two dice and take the higher value; if you have a disadvantage, you must take the lower value.\n5. Reroll Opportunity: Some talents or situations will grant you a reroll opportunity. Even if the initial check fails, you can choose to consume this opportunity to roll again.\n6. Summing Multiple Dice: In some situations, you need to roll multiple dice and use the sum of all points as the base value for the judgment.",
    ["1. 每周会有多种<Highlight>物产</>高价收购。\n2. <Highlight>高价物产</>可在<Highlight>市场界面</>和<Highlight>工坊生产界面</>查看。\n3. <Highlight>高价物产</>的种类和<Highlight>随机价格倍率</>，将<Highlight>随城堡等级提升</>而提升。"] = "1. Every week, various <Highlight> products </> will be purchased at high prices. \n 2. <Highlight> High-price products </> can be viewed in the <Highlight> Market interface </> and the <Highlight> Workshop production interface </>. \n 3. The types of <Highlight> high-price products </> and the <Highlight> random price multiplier </> will increase <Highlight> as the Castle level increases </>.",
    ["1. 消耗金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；\n2. 绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金；\n3. 外观馈赠若有时装在24小时后未领取完，则会返还购买该时装时消耗的等额金镑与赠礼额度；\n4. 外观馈赠获得的道具为绑定道具"] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Appearance gifts obtained are bound items.",
    ["1. 消耗金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；\n2. 绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金；\n3. 外观馈赠若有时装在24小时后未领取完，则会返还购买该时装时消耗的等额金镑与赠礼额度；\n4. 外观馈赠获得的道具为绑定道具。"] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Items obtained from appearance gifts are bound items.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 心动信号语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 麦序上的玩家自动获得嘉宾身份，1麦玩家为座上宾身份，语音房间内的所有嘉宾均可通过切换爆灯状态来表达情绪。通过房间右上角实况界面可更直观的查看当前所有嘉宾的发言和爆灯情况。\n4. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n5. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Heartbeat Signal voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. Players on the mic sequence automatically gain Guest status; the player on mic #1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their \"Light Up\" status. You can view the current speech and \"Light Up\" status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner. \n 4. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 5. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 新手指导语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Newbie Guide voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 有声读书语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Audio Reading voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 法庭扮演语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Court Roleplay voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 演唱会语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Concert voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 语音房间默认是自由发言模式，点击输入框旁边的开麦按钮即可自动开麦。若当前语音房间模式为房主设置发言权限模式或房主设置发言顺序模式，则需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言模式，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息和类型，进行转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Voice rooms default to Free Speech mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the room is set to Host-Controlled Speech Permission or Speech Order mode, you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech modes, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, type, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["1. 选择你要进行<Highlight>部分可见</>以及<Highlight>对谁隐身</>的范围\n2. 在群聊中若有不是你好友的玩家，范围设置将不生效"] = "1. Select the scope for <Highlight> partial visibility </> and <Highlight> who to hide from </> \n 2. If there are players in the group chat who are not your friends, the scope settings will not take effect.",
    ["1. 领取绑金礼金的玩家会获得随机数额的绑金\n2. 领取外观馈赠的玩家会获得随机类型的外观道具"] = "1. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 2. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
    ["1. 默认关闭，关闭情况下会过滤环境音、增强人声，语音聊天效果更佳。\n2. 开启后，会增强环境音，若使用其他设备外放音乐，收音效果更佳。\n3. 退出当前聊天房间后，此开关会重置为关闭状态。"] = "1. Default is off; when off, it filters ambient noise and enhances human voices for better voice chat quality. \n 2. When turned on, it enhances ambient noise, which is better if you are using other devices to play music. \n 3. This switch resets to off after exiting the current chat room.",
    ["1.10 假装离开"] = "1.10 Pretend to leave",
    ["1.11版本更新公告"] = "Version 1.11 Update Announcement",
    ["1.19 传送"] = "1.19 Teleport",
    ["1.1移动"] = "1.1 Move",
    ["1.1靠近舞台踩点"] = "1.1 Approach Stage and Mark Point",
    ["1.21 到达约定地点"] = "1.21 Arrive at Agreed Location",
    ["1.2上前看看"] = "1.2 Go up and take a look",
    ["1.3 移动"] = "1.3 Movement",
    ["1.5 查找咳声"] = "1.5 Find coughing sound",
    ["1.8找到崩掉的纽扣"] = "1.8 Find the popped button",
    ["1.<Highlight>大地图</>上实时显示旗帜所在位置。\n2.<Highlight>右上角小地图</>也会持续显示旗帜方向，可根据指引方向寻找旗帜。"] = "1. <Highlight> The large map </> displays the location of the flag in real-time. \n 2. <Highlight> The mini-map in the top right corner </> will also continuously display the direction of the flag; you can follow the guidance to find the flag.",
    ["1.<Highlight>大地图</>上实时显示旗帜所在位置。\n2.<Highlight>右上角小地图</>也会持续显示旗帜方向，可根据指引方向寻找旗帜。\n3.<Highlight>集结·俱乐部宣战</>:俱乐部宣战期间，<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可在霍纳奇斯山脉使用该道具，使用该道具将向<Highlight>地图内的本俱乐部成员</>发起集结。使用后，将以俱乐部为单位，使该道具全部进入 <Highlight>360</> 秒冷却。该道具可从 <Highlight>百货-同行商店-俱乐部</> 获取。"] = "1.<Highlight>The location of the Flag is displayed in real-time on the </>World Map\n. 2.<Highlight>The mini-map in the top right corner</> will also continuously show the direction of the Flag; you can follow the guidance to find it.\n 3.<Highlight>Assemble · Club Declaration of War</>: During a Club Declaration of War, the <Highlight>President, Vice President, and Councilors</> can use this item within the Hornacis Mountain Range. Using this item will initiate an assembly for <Highlight>members of this club within the map</>. Once used, the item will enter a <Highlight>360</>-second cooldown for the entire club. This item can be obtained from <Highlight>Department Store - Peer Shop - Club</>.",
    ["1.AOE后死亡"] = "1. Death after AOE",
    ["1.buff携带者锁血，每层对应1%。"] = "1. Buff carrier's HP is locked, each stack corresponds to 1%.",
    ["1.buff结束时触发一次转向技能。"] = "1. Trigger a Turn skill when buff ends.",
    ["1.buff结束触发"] = "1. Trigger when buff ends",
    ["1.三选一坠星"] = "1. Choose one of three falling stars",
    ["1.上传时必须选择一项自定义内容（动作、表情、音频、镜头其中一项即可）。\n2.目前仅支持上传自定义内容，暂无法上传系统动作和预设的运镜。\n3.上传后可在【我的-选择对应作品-编辑】中进行修改和删除。"] = "1. You must select one custom content (action, expression, audio, or camera) when uploading. \n2. Currently, only custom content can be uploaded; system actions and preset camera movements cannot be uploaded yet. \n3. After uploading, you can modify or delete it in [Mine - Select Corresponding Work - Edit].",
    ["1.主宰争锋玩法为<Highlight>公平3v3模式</>，双方队伍均已进行<Highlight>属性平衡</>。\n2.进入主宰争锋场景后，双方队伍出生在地图两边的准备区域中。玩法开启后，双方队伍可进入到战斗区域内进行战斗。\n3.在主宰争锋玩法里死亡后<Highlight>不可复活</>，死亡玩家以隐身状态观看其他玩家进行战斗。"] = "1. The Dominator's Clash mode is a <Highlight> fair 3v3 mode </>, where both teams have undergone <Highlight> attribute balancing </>. \n 2. After entering the Dominator's Clash scene, both teams spawn in the preparation areas on either side of the map. Once the mode begins, both teams can enter the Combat Area to engage in battle. \n 3. In the Dominator's Clash mode, players <Highlight> cannot be resurrected </> after death; dead players watch other players fight in an invisible state.",
    ["1.事件目标：在特定区域参与并完成出现的突发事件，即可获得丰厚奖励。\n2.事件类型：事件包含<Highlight>“剧情”、“挑战”、“竞技”</>三种类型。\n3.刷新规则：当玩家进入“罪恶廷根”后会直接刷新出所有满足条件的事件，其中<Highlight>“竞技”事件报名时间为两分钟</>，突发事件刷新时间间隔，会取玩家进入场景的时间，<Highlight>“挑战”事件每间隔约10秒钟后会进行刷新</>，如果事件已结束则会再次出现。\n4.奖励规则：不同事件类型的奖励规则不同，<Highlight>“剧情”事件成功可领奖，“挑战”事件有不同的分档奖励，“困难·挑战”不设分档奖励，“竞技”事件会根据玩家排名发奖。</>\n5.奖励上限：单个玩家每周通过事件获得奖励的次数无上限，但是<Highlight>每周悬赏值有上限</>。\n6.失败条件：若在事件时限内未能完成目标（若有），则视为事件失败。\n7.脱离判定：若在事件完成前离开事件区域过远，会被判定为放弃事件，无法获得奖励。\n8.玩家战力：进入“罪恶廷根”位面会进行属性平衡，玩家在其中的“剧情”、困难·挑战”、“竞技”都为属性平衡玩法，<Highlight>“激战·邦尼”会受玩家战力影响，根据玩家战力转化梯度的属性平衡</>。"] = "1. Event Objective: Participate in and complete the sudden events that appear in specific areas to receive generous rewards.\n2. Event Types: Events include three types: <Highlight>\"Story\", \"Challenge\", and \"Competition\".</>\n3. Refresh Rules: When players enter \"Sinful Tingen\", all events meeting the conditions will be refreshed immediately. Among them, the registration time for <Highlight>\"Competition\" events is two minutes</>. The refresh interval for sudden events is based on the time the player enters the scene; <Highlight>\"Challenge\" events refresh approximately every 10 seconds</>, and if an event has ended, it will reappear.\n4. Reward Rules: Reward rules vary by event type. <Highlight>\"Story\" events grant rewards upon success, \"Challenge\" events have tiered rewards, \"Hard · Challenge\" events do not have tiered rewards, and \"Competition\" events distribute rewards based on player ranking.</>\n5. Reward Limit: There is no limit to the number of times a single player can receive rewards from events per week, but <Highlight>there is a weekly cap on Bounty Points.</>\n6. Failure Conditions: If the objective (if any) is not completed within the event time limit, the event is considered failed.\n7. Departure Judgment: If you move too far away from the event area before the event is completed, it will be judged as abandoning the event, and you will not be able to receive rewards.\n8. Player Combat Power: Attribute balancing will be applied upon entering the \"Sinful Tingen\" plane. The \"Story\", \"Hard · Challenge\", and \"Competition\" modes within it are all attribute-balanced gameplay. <Highlight>\"Fierce Battle · Bonnie\" is affected by player combat power, with attribute balancing based on a gradient converted from the player's combat power.</>",
    ["1.任务分为主线、原著、支线、系统、时代、漫游六类。\n2.任务栏可查看当前进行中的任务信息，也可通过右上角剧情总览预览全部剧情信息。\n3.放弃的支线和系统任务可在任务栏重新领取，放弃的时代和漫游任务则需要重新触发。"] = "1. Quests are categorized into Main, Original, Side, System, Era, and Roaming. \n2. The quest log allows you to view information on current quests, and you can preview all plot information via the Story Overview in the top right corner. \n3. Abandoned Side and System quests can be reclaimed in the quest log, while Era and Roaming quests must be re-triggered.",
    ["1.众神之巅玩法为<Highlight>6v6模式</>，玩家需<Highlight>组建战队</>参与。\n2.进入众神之巅比赛场后，双方队伍出生在地图两边的准备区域中。玩法开启后，双方队伍可进入到战斗区域内进行战斗。\n3.在众神之巅玩法里，每个队伍拥有<Highlight>2次复活</>死亡队友的机会。"] = "1. The Peak of the Gods mode is a <Highlight> 6v6 mode </>, which requires players to <Highlight> form a team </> to participate. \n 2. After entering the Peak of the Gods arena, both teams spawn in the preparation areas on either side of the map. Once the mode begins, both teams can enter the Combat Area to engage in battle. \n 3. In the Peak of the Gods mode, each team has <Highlight> 2 opportunities to resurrect </> fallen teammates.",
    ["1.位于打手背后时增伤。"] = "1. Damage boost when behind the thug.",
    ["1.俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n2.俱乐部活动途径人数限制：部分俱乐部活动对参与成员的途径人数有限制要求，详情可见俱乐部活动说明。"] = "1. Club member locking rules: During club-based activities (such as the Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, City of Dragon Hunting, Plateau Battle), clubs are not allowed to add or remove members. \n 2. Club activity pathway participation limits: Some club activities have restrictions on the number of participants per pathway; see the club activity instructions for details.",
    ["1.先增加10层金币;2.释放老虎机技能"] = "1. Add 10 layers of Gold Coins first; 2. Release Slot Machine skill",
    ["1.全场AOE"] = "1. Full-field AOE",
    ["1.冲到场地中心"] = "1. Charge to the center of the arena",
    ["1.冲锋到场地中央"] = "1. Charge to the center of the arena",
    ["1.冲锋到武器位置"] = "1. Charge to weapon location",
    ["1.准备视频"] = "1. Prepare Video",
    ["1.剧情总览中可以预览全部剧情内容。\n2.现实主线和原著主线栏位中可以查看主线内容和完成情况。\n3.支线剧情中可以查看支线内容以及解锁等级；时代百态中可预览全部时代百态以及相关触发条件。"] = "1. You can preview all plot content in the Plot Overview. \n 2. You can view the main storyline content and completion status in the Reality Mainline and Original Mainline tabs. \n 3. In Side Quests, you can view side quest content and unlock levels; in Era Perspectives, you can preview all era perspectives and their related trigger conditions.",
    ["1.十字AOE"] = "1. Cross AOE",
    ["1.十字形或井字形AOE"] = "1. Cross-shaped or tic-tac-toe AOE",
    ["1.单体伤害"] = "1. Single-target damage",
    ["1.发出子弹"] = "1. Fire bullets",
    ["1.召唤3个分身，本体和分身同时释放矩形AOE"] = "1. Summon 3 clones; the main body and clones simultaneously release Rectangular AOE",
    ["1.召唤3个分身，释放半场AOE"] = "1. Summon 3 clones; release half-screen AOE",
    ["1.召唤3个撞击蘑菇"] = "1. Summon 3 impact mushrooms",
    ["1.召唤3件武器"] = "1. Summon 3 weapons",
    ["1.召唤3组矩形AOE"] = "1. Summon 3 sets of Rectangular AOE",
    ["1.召唤4个撞击蘑菇;\n2.扇形AOE*4;\n3.全屏击退AOE"] = "1. Summon 4 impact mushrooms;\n 2. Fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen knockback AOE",
    ["1.召唤5个分身释放矩形AOE;2.点名2个目标，释放圆形AOE或圆形分摊AOE"] = "1. Summon 5 clones to release Rectangular AOE; 2. Target 2 players to release Circular AOE or shared Circular AOE",
    ["1.召唤分身，本体和分身同时释放地脉共鸣"] = "1. Summon clones; the main body and clones simultaneously release Ley Line Resonance",
    ["1.召唤蘑菇+藤蔓;"] = "1. Summon mushrooms + vines;",
    ["1.召唤蘑菇;"] = "1. Summon mushrooms;",
    ["1.召唤蘑菇;\n2.扇形AOE*4\n3.全屏AOE击退"] = "1. Summon mushrooms;\n 2. Fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen AOE knockback",
    ["1.可以单人或双人组队进入副本，选择单/双人模式不影响奖励。\n2.战士和观众进入副本后会强制切换为输出形态。"] = "1. You can enter dungeons solo or in a party of two; choosing solo/duo mode does not affect rewards. \n2. Warriors and Spectators will be forced to switch to Offensive Stance upon entering a dungeon.",
    ["1.同一俱乐部中，每个玩家所拥有的投影相同。\n2.每个投影在一届比赛仅可上场一次，不可重复上场。"] = "1. In the same Club, every player owns the same projections. \n2. Each projection can only be fielded once per competition and cannot be reused.",
    ["1.向面前冲锋；2.增加buff检测有无撞到人"] = "1. Charge forward; 2. Add buff detection to see if anyone was hit",
    ["1.吸引AOE;\n2.场地污染;\n3.蘑菇圆形AOE+藤曼矩形AOE;\n4.持续位置跟随AOE"] = "1. Attraction AOE;\n 2. Arena pollution;\n 3. Mushroom Circular AOE + Vine Rectangular AOE;\n 4. Continuous location-following AOE",
    ["1.圆形AOE"] = "1. Circular AOE",
    ["1.增加30%生命值的护盾。\n2.持续期间减伤系数增加100%。\n3.受到金币buff时直接扣血。"] = "1. Gain a Shield equal to 30% of Health.\n2. Damage reduction coefficient increased by 100% during the duration.\n3. Deduct Health directly when receiving Gold Coin buff.",
    ["1.增加5%生命值的护盾"] = "1. Gain a Shield equal to 5% of Health",
    ["1.增加灵体表现"] = "1. Add spirit representation",
    ["1.如果在梯子脚下出现了齿轮堆，剪断第一根线。\n2.如果三根线都是蓝色，剪断第二根线。\n3.如果门口有红灯亮，且有两根及以上红色的线，剪断第二根线。\n4.如果只有一根绿线，剪断这根线。\n5.如果以上情况都不符合，剪断第三根线。"] = "1. If a pile of gears appears under the ladder, cut the first wire. \n 2. If all three wires are blue, cut the second wire. \n 3. If there is a red light at the door and there are two or more red wires, cut the second wire. \n 4. If there is only one green wire, cut this wire. \n 5. If none of the above conditions are met, cut the third wire.",
    ["1.对目标造成伤害"] = "1. Deal damage to target",
    ["1.对目标造成伤害；2.面前矩形区域额外再造成一次伤害"] = "1. Deal damage to target; 2. Deal additional damage to the rectangular area in front",
    ["1.当旗帜不在当前分线时，可点击右上角小地图上方的<Highlight>切换分线</>寻找。\n2.选择传送点即可传送至<Highlight>旗帜所在分线</>，迅速投入战斗。"] = "1. When the Flag is not in the current sub-channel, you can click <Highlight> Switch Sub-channel </> above the mini-map in the top right corner to find it. \n 2. Select a Teleport point to Teleport to the <Highlight> sub-channel where the Flag is located </> and quickly join the battle.",
    ["1.快慢半圆AOE;2.朝向跟随矩形AOE*2"] = "1. Fast/slow semicircle AOE; 2. Orientation-following rectangular AOE*2",
    ["1.怪物出生时无敌不可选中。"] = "1. Invincible and untargetable when monster spawns.",
    ["1.怪物出生时隐藏头顶信息。"] = "1. Hide overhead information when monster spawns.",
    ["1.怪物出生时隐藏模型。"] = "1. Hide model when monster spawns.",
    ["1.怪物处于特殊机制时，仅能释放特定技能。"] = "1. When monster is in a special mechanism, only specific skills can be released.",
    ["1.怪物死亡后取消碰撞。"] = "1. Cancel collision after monster dies.",
    ["1.打手展开壁垒后，壁垒给枪手增加该buff\n期间免疫伤害"] = "1. After the thug deploys the barrier, the barrier adds this buff to the gunner \n immune to damage during this period.",
    ["1.掩护队列期间，仅能释放特定技能"] = "1. During Covering Queue, only specific skills can be released",
    ["1.播放吸收LS，回收蘑菇\n2.创建子弹，分摊圆形AOE"] = "1. Play absorption LS, recycle mushrooms;\n 2. Create bullets, shared Circular AOE",
    ["1.断线<Highlight>%d</>分钟内保留排队状态，重连后可继续排队；\n2.断线超<Highlight>%d</>分钟，自动取消排队；\n3.断线状态下排到，可<Highlight>免排队</>直接进入游戏，次日失效。"] = "1. Disconnection <Highlight>%d </> minutes will retain your queue status; you can continue queuing after reconnecting. \n 2. If disconnected for over <Highlight> %d </> minutes, the queue will be automatically canceled. \n 3. If you reach your turn while disconnected, you can <Highlight> skip the queue </> and enter the game directly; this expires the next day.",
    ["1.普通镜头提供规范化的拍摄视角，便于进行角色展示与构图调整。\n2.自由镜头可自由控制拍摄位置与视角，实现更多创意取景效果。"] = "1. The normal lens provides a standardized shooting perspective, facilitating character display and composition adjustment. \n2. The free lens allows free control of the shooting position and perspective, achieving more creative framing effects.",
    ["1.枪手申请掩护"] = "1. Gunner requests cover",
    ["1.标点;\n2.场地分割;\n3.按顺序攻击3次"] = "1. Mark targets;\n 2. Arena segmentation;\n 3. Attack 3 times in sequence",
    ["1.根据获得武器buff，释放不同技能"] = "1. Release different skills based on the weapon buff obtained",
    ["1.榜单数据将每分钟自动更新一次，确保信息及时。\n2.部分榜单支持按途径筛选，您可点击顶部的 “全部途径” 按钮进行切换。\n3.部分榜单支持地区排名查看，点击上方的对应地区页签即可切换。\n4.点击榜单底部的自身信息行，可快速定位并跳转到您当前所在的排名位置。\n5.点击其他非凡者的信息行，可查看对方形象；点击其头像，则可进一步查看该非凡者的个人名片。\n6.各段位达到天使之王，且排名总榜前30或途径前5，即可获得星辰之主段位，持续14天，段位分变化后若满足条件则刷新时长为14天。"] = "1. Leaderboard data will automatically update every minute to ensure information is timely. \n2. Some leaderboards support filtering by pathway; you can click the \"All Pathways\" button at the top to switch. \n3. Some leaderboards support viewing regional rankings; click the corresponding regional tab above to switch. \n4. Click your own information row at the bottom of the leaderboard to quickly locate and jump to your current ranking position. \n5. Click other Beyonders' information rows to view their appearance; click their avatar to further view their personal profile. \n6. Once you reach King of Angels in any rank and are in the top 30 of the overall leaderboard or top 5 of a pathway, you will obtain the Lord of Stars rank for 14 days. If you still meet the conditions after the rank points change, the duration will refresh to 14 days.",
    ["1.榜单数据将每分钟自动更新一次，确保信息及时。\n2.部分榜单支持按途径筛选，您可点击顶部的 “全部途径” 按钮进行切换。\n3.部分榜单支持地区排名查看，点击上方的对应地区页签即可切换。\n4.点击榜单底部的自身信息行，可快速定位并跳转到您当前所在的排名位置。\n5.点击其他非凡者的信息行，可查看对方形象；点击其头像，则可进一步查看该非凡者的个人名片。\n6.各段位达到天使之王，且排名总榜前30或途径前5，即可获得星辰之主段位，持续14天，段位分变化后若满足条件则刷新时长为14天。\n7.副本排行榜中，只有同服玩家组队通关副本，才会计入排行榜。"] = "1. Leaderboard data will be updated automatically every minute to ensure information is timely.\n2. Some leaderboards support filtering by Pathway; you can click the \"All Pathways\" button at the top to switch.\n3. Some leaderboards support viewing regional rankings; click the corresponding regional tab above to switch.\n4. Click your own information row at the bottom of the leaderboard to quickly locate and jump to your current ranking position.\n5. Click on other Beyonders' information rows to view their appearance; click on their avatar to further view that Beyonder's personal profile.\n6. Once you reach the King of Angels rank and are in the top 30 of the overall leaderboard or top 5 of a Pathway, you will obtain the Lord of Stars rank, which lasts for 14 days. If you still meet the conditions after your rank points change, the duration will be refreshed to 14 days.\n7. In the Dungeon leaderboard, only dungeons cleared by a team of players from the same server will be counted.",
    ["1.每个人非肉体的部分分为四层，最核心叫精神体，也就是每个人最根本的灵性，万物有灵派认为，凡是生物都有灵性，都有精神体。\n2.精神体之外是星灵体，它是前者与灵界、与星空沟通的方式，属于前者的外在表现，和你当前的情绪直接相关，也是占卜的根源。\n3.再往外是心智体，与肉体结合。它牵涉头脑，属于你推理能力、思考能力、洞察能力和认识事物能力的综合呈现。\n4.最外层是以太体，它是你生命能量和肉体状态的表现，你看到的气场颜色就是以太体的外显象征。"] = "1. Everyone's non-physical part is divided into four layers. The core is called the Spirit Body, which is everyone's fundamental spirituality. The School of All Things Have Spirit believes that all living beings have spirituality and a spirit body. \n 2. Outside the spirit body is the Astral Projection, which is the way the former communicates with the Spirit World and the starry sky. It belongs to the external manifestation of the former and is directly related to your current emotions; it is also the root of divination root. \n 3. Further out is the Mental Body, combined with the physical body. It involves the mind and belongs to the comprehensive presentation of your reasoning ability, thinking ability, insight, and ability to understand things. \n 4. The outermost layer is the Ether Body, which is the manifestation of your life energy and physical state. The aura color you see is the external symbol of the Ether Body.",
    ["1.每个场次最多同时上场32名投影。\n2.单个玩家在每个场次可上场投影数量，仅受自身剩余投影数量限制。"] = "1. Each match can have a maximum of 32 projections on the field at the same time. \n2. The number of projections a single player can field in each match is limited only by the number of their remaining projections.",
    ["1.法阵技能"] = "1. Magic circle skill",
    ["1.法阵方案A"] = "1. Magic Circle Plan A",
    ["1.法阵方案B"] = "1. Magic Circle Plan B",
    ["1.清除黄铜书相关技能实体"] = "1. Clear Brass Book-related skill entities",
    ["1.满3层后触发，创建必中子弹"] = "1. Triggered after reaching 3 stacks, creating an undodgeable bullet",
    ["1.点击邮件正文收藏按钮可将邮件加入收藏夹\n2.收藏前需先领取完邮件中的所有附件\n3.加入收藏夹，可在收藏夹中永久保留此邮件"] = "1. Click the favorite button in the email body to add the email to your favorites. \n2. You must collect all attachments in the email before favoriting. \n3. Once added to favorites, this email will be permanently kept in your favorites folder.",
    ["1.点名3个目标，释放矩形AOE"] = "1. Target 3 targets and release rectangular AOE",
    ["1.点名4个目标，释放圆形AOE；2.召唤分身；3.分身点名1个目标，释放矩形AOE"] = "1. Target 4 players to release Circular AOE; 2. Summon clones; 3. Clones target 1 player to release Rectangular AOE",
    ["1.点名6个目标，在目标位置释放圆形AOE;\n2.全屏AOE"] = "1. Target 6 locations for Circular AOE;\n 2. Full-screen AOE",
    ["1.点名6个目标，在目标位置释放圆形AOE;\n2.金色扇形AOE*4\n3.全屏AOE"] = "1. Target 6 locations for Circular AOE;\n 2. Golden fan-shaped AOE*4;\n 3. Full-screen AOE",
    ["1.点名两个目标释放圆形分摊AOE，3人分摊，有伤害加深"] = "1. Target two targets and release circular shared AOE, shared by 3 people, with damage amplification",
    ["1.点名释放矩形AOE1"] = "1. Target and release rectangular AOE 1",
    ["1.状态结束后死亡，不执行死亡流程"] = "1. Die after state ends, do not execute death process",
    ["1.狂暴后持续AOE处决"] = "1. Continuous AOE execution after Berserk",
    ["1.玩家被击飞到场地中央"] = "1. Player is knocked up to the center of the arena",
    ["1.环形AOE"] = "1. Ring AOE",
    ["1.环形扩散AOE"] = "1. Ring diffusion AOE",
    ["1.监听buff添加释放攻击"] = "1. Listen for buff addition to release attack",
    ["1.矩形AOE"] = "1. Rectangular AOE",
    ["1.矩形持续AOE伤害，每次50%HP"] = "1. Rectangular continuous AOE damage, 50%HP each time",
    ["1.神座之争玩法为日常<Highlight>6v6模式</>。\n2.进入神座之争场景后，双方队伍出生在地图两边的准备区域中。玩法开启后，双方队伍可进入到战斗区域内进行战斗。\n3.在神座之争玩法里，每个队伍拥有<Highlight>2次复活</>死亡队友的机会。"] = "1. The Battle for the Throne of God mode is a daily <Highlight> 6v6 mode </>. \n 2. After entering the Battle for the Throne of God scene, both teams spawn in the preparation areas on either side of the map. Once the mode begins, both teams can enter the Combat Area to engage in battle. \n 3. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, each team has <Highlight> 2 opportunities to resurrect </> fallen teammates.",
    ["1.立旗后我方进度初始为满，站在<Highlight>旗帜范围内</>的我方成员将根据存活时间持续获得积分。\n2.此外，<Highlight>击败或助攻击败非凡者</>同样可获得积分。\n3.宣战时间结束后，<Highlight>积分高的一方获胜</>。积分相同时，<Highlight>被宣战方</>获胜。\n4.当敌方进入旗帜范围内，且<Highlight>敌方人数多于我方</>时，进度条将逐渐变为敌方进度。"] = "1. After planting the flag, our progress starts at full. Our members standing <Highlight> within the flag's range </> will continuously gain points based on their survival time. \n 2. In addition, <Highlight> defeating or assisting in defeating Beyonders </> can also earn points. \n 3. After the declaration of war ends, <Highlight> the side with higher points wins </>. If the points are the same, <Highlight> the side that was declared war upon </> wins. \n 4. When the enemy enters the flag's range and <Highlight> the number of enemies is greater than ours </>, the progress bar will gradually turn into the enemy's progress.",
    ["1.立旗后我方进度初始为满，站在<Highlight>旗帜范围内</>的我方成员将根据存活时间持续获得积分。\n2.此外，<Highlight>击败或助攻击败非凡者</>同样可获得积分。\n3.宣战时间结束后，<Highlight>积分高的一方获胜</>。积分相同时，<Highlight>被宣战方</>获胜。当一方积分大于另一方积分超过15000时，则积分高的一方直接获胜。\n4.当敌方进入旗帜范围内，且<Highlight>敌方人数多于我方</>时，进度条将逐渐变为敌方进度。"] = "1. After planting the flag, our progress starts at full. Our members standing <Highlight>within the flag's range</> will continuously gain points based on their survival time.\n2. Additionally, <Highlight>defeating or assisting in the defeat of Beyonders</> also grants points.\n3. After the declaration time ends, the <Highlight>side with more points wins</>. If points are tied, the <Highlight>side that was declared against</> wins. When one side's points exceed the other's by more than 15000, the side with more points wins immediately.\n4. When the enemy enters the flag's range and the <Highlight>number of enemies exceeds our own</>, the progress bar will gradually shift to the enemy's progress.",
    ["1.立旗后我方进度初始为满，站在<Highlight>旗帜范围内</>的我方成员将根据存活时间持续获得积分。\n2.此外，<Highlight>击败或助攻击败非凡者</>同样可获得积分。\n3.宣战时间结束后，<Highlight>积分高的一方获胜</>。积分相同时，<Highlight>被宣战方</>获胜。当一方积分大于另一方积分超过5000时，则积分高的一方直接获胜。\n4.当敌方进入旗帜范围内，且<Highlight>敌方人数多于我方</>时，进度条将逐渐变为敌方进度。"] = "1. After planting the flag, our progress is initially full, and our members standing <Highlight> within the flag's range </> will continuously gain points based on their survival time. \n 2. In addition, <Highlight> defeating or assisting in defeating Beyonders </> can also earn points. \n 3. After the declaration time ends, <Highlight> the side with more points wins </>. If the points are the same, <Highlight> the side that was declared against </> wins. When one side's points exceed the other's by more than 5000, the side with more points wins directly. \n 4. When the enemy enters the flag's range and <Highlight> the number of enemies is greater than ours </>, the progress bar will gradually change to the enemy's progress.",
    ["1.纯表演"] = "1. Pure Performance",
    ["1.组建12人团队，通过组队模式申请对应副本玩法。需要2只队伍，每只队伍都建议配置战士、观众、以及4名可以提供输出火力的非凡序列者。\n2.单人玩家可以通过人机模式申请副本玩法，黑荆棘安保公司会派遣非凡者一同参与，人机模式下队友非凡者的强度和玩家的非凡评分相关，如玩家评分远低于推荐评分，整体队伍实力可能无法通过挑战。\n3.组队模式和人机模式中，可获得的奖励次数是共享上限的。"] = "1. Form a 12-player team and apply for the corresponding dungeon via party mode. Two squads are required, and each squad is recommended to be configured with a Warrior, a Spectator, and 4 Beyonders capable of providing offensive firepower. \n2. Solo players can apply for dungeons via AI mode, where Blackthorn Security Company will dispatch Beyonders to participate. In AI mode, the strength of teammate Beyonders is related to the player's Beyonder rating; if the player's rating is far below the recommended rating, the overall team strength may not be enough to pass the challenge. \n3. Party mode and AI mode share the same limit for reward counts.",
    ["1.组建6人小队，通过组队模式申请对应副本玩法。通常队伍配置需要战士、观众、以及4名可以提供输出火力的非凡序列者。\n2.单人玩家可以通过人机模式申请副本玩法，黑荆棘安保公司会派遣非凡者一同参与，人机模式下队友非凡者的强度和玩家的非凡评分相关，如玩家评分远低于推荐评分，整体队伍实力可能无法通过挑战。\n3.组队模式和人机模式中，可获得的奖励次数是共享上限的。"] = "1. Form a 6-player squad and apply for the corresponding dungeon via party mode. Typically, a team configuration requires a Warrior, a Spectator, and 4 Beyonders capable of providing offensive firepower. \n2. Solo players can apply for dungeons via AI mode, where Blackthorn Security Company will dispatch Beyonders to participate. In AI mode, the strength of teammate Beyonders is related to the player's Beyonder rating; if the player's rating is far below the recommended rating, the overall team strength may not be enough to pass the challenge. \n3. Party mode and AI mode share the same limit for reward counts.",
    ["1.藤蔓普攻"] = "1. Vine basic attack",
    ["1.表演"] = "1. Performance",
    ["1.被金币子弹击中有计数。\n2.死亡后根据计数爆金币。"] = "1. Counted when hit by Gold Coin Bullet.\n2. Drop Gold Coins based on count after death.",
    ["1.被金币子弹击中有额外伤害。"] = "1. Extra damage when hit by Gold Coin Bullet.",
    ["1.进入场景后，俱乐部<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>将获得立旗技能，可在霍纳奇斯山脉地图中的任意分线、任意位置立旗一次。\n2.任意一人立旗后，立旗技能将会消失。"] = "1. After entering the scene, the club <Highlight>President, Vice President, and Director</> will obtain the flag-planting skill and can plant the flag once at any branch or any location on the Hornacis Mountain Range map. \n2. After any one person plants the flag, the flag-planting skill will disappear.",
