    ["1v1俱乐部宣战-机制技能-立旗"] = "1v1 Club Declaration of War - Mechanic Skill - Plant Flag",
    ["1、2、3，木头人，被看到的人……不，许，动"] = "1, 2, 3, wooden person, whoever is seen... no, moving, is out.",
    ["1、参与战略服玩法，可获得征服声望和战功；\n2、征服声望达到对应值，可提高个人征服军衔等级，获得对应奖励并解锁对应功能。"] = "1. Participate in strategic server gameplay to earn Conquest Prestige and War Merit; \n2. When Conquest Prestige reaches the corresponding value, you can increase your personal Conquest Military Rank, obtain corresponding rewards, and unlock corresponding functions.",
    ["1、双方俱乐部活动期间无法发起和接受合并申请。接受合并申请时，两方俱乐部总成员之和不得超过合入俱乐部的总成员数上限。超出上限则合并失败，需请离人员再进行合并。"] = "1. Merger requests cannot be initiated or accepted during Club activities. When accepting a merger request, the total number of members of both Clubs must not exceed the maximum member limit of the receiving Club. If it exceeds the limit, the merger will fail; you must remove members before merging.",
    ["1、征服声望每周获取上限，上限可累积两周；\n2、通过战略服终末猎杀获取的征服声望每周有上限，不可累积；\n3、装配环身“律令扉页（头部）”后，获得战功时会额外获得征服声望，该方式获得的征服声望不计算在上限中。"] = "1. There is a weekly cap on Conquest Prestige acquisition, which can be accumulated for two weeks; \n2. Conquest Prestige obtained through the strategic server's Final Hunt has a weekly cap and cannot be accumulated; \n3. After equipping the ring \"Law Decree Page (Head),\" you will receive additional Conquest Prestige when gaining War Merit. This method of obtaining Conquest Prestige does not count towards the cap.",
    ["1、根据俱乐部神选积分排名，可授予一定数量的俱乐部成员为征服先锋；\n2、被授予征服先锋的玩家，将获得道具“征服之证”；\n3、个人军衔等级四升级军衔等级三时，需消耗一个“征服之证”。"] = "1. Based on the Club's God-Chosen ranking, a certain number of Club members can be granted the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\"; \n3. When upgrading personal Military Rank from Level 4 to Level 3, one \"Proof of Conquest\" is required.",
    ["1、每周根据俱乐部神选积分排名，会长可授予一定数量的俱乐部成员为征服先锋；\n2、被授予征服先锋的玩家，将获得道具“征服之证”。"] = "1. Every week, based on the Club's Divine Selection ranking, the President can grant a certain number of Club members the title of Conquest Vanguard; \n2. Players granted the title of Conquest Vanguard will receive the item \"Proof of Conquest\".",
    ["1、每周每个副本会获得一定的<Highlight>讨伐奖励次数</>，玩家在击杀副本首领后，会增加<Highlight>讨伐奖励进度</>\n2、讨伐奖励进度<Highlight>积累满</>后，可领取一件当前副本<Highlight>未拥有的烙印装备或者外观奖励</>\n3、领取后，对应的进度将会扣除领奖所需的次数\n4、烙印装备的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：共次数的副本，共享讨伐奖励次数，每周每个首领增加1次\n5、外观的讨伐奖励次数增加规则：每个副本，每周每个首领增加2次，普通和困难难度共享次数"] = "1. Each dungeon will receive a certain number of <Highlight>Crusade Reward Counts</> every week. Players will increase their <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> after killing the dungeon boss. \n2. After the <Highlight>Crusade Reward Progress</> is fully accumulated, you can claim a piece of <Highlight>unowned Imprint Equipment or cosmetic reward</> from the current dungeon. \n3. After claiming, the corresponding progress will deduct the number of counts required for claiming the reward. \n4. Imprint Equipment Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Dungeons with shared counts share Crusade Reward Counts, and each boss adds 1 count per week. \n5. Cosmetic Crusade Reward Count increase rule: Each dungeon adds 2 counts per boss per week, and Normal and Hard difficulties share counts.",
