    ["2-049不喜欢附身时间过长"] = "2-049 does not like being possessed for too long.",
    ["2-049会目视<Disable>正前方</>，持续旋转并且不断睁眼闭眼，在2-049<Disable>睁眼状态</>下被看到的玩家将被<Disable>眩晕5秒</>。"] = "2-049 will gaze at <Disable> directly in front of it </>, continuously rotating while blinking its eyes. Players seen while 2-049 is in the <Disable> open-eye state </> will be <Disable> Stunned for 5 seconds </>.",
    ["2-049和笔记都是安提哥努斯家族遗物，瑞尔·比伯和猎龙帮也有牵连。"] = "Both 2-049 and the notebook are relics of the Antigonus Family, and Riel Bieber is also involved with the Dragon Hunter Gang.",
    ["2-049在场时与迷宫机制出现时，都会出现传送陷阱。"] = "When 2-049 is present and the maze mechanic appears, Teleport Traps will also appear.",
    ["2-049在场时，瑞尔比伯周围会随机刷新传送陷阱，将玩家传送至2-049身边。心灵迷宫机制中，所有玩家身上会周期性的出现传送陷阱。"] = "When 2-049 is on the field, Teleport Traps will randomly refresh around Riel Bieber, teleporting players to 2-049's side. In the Mind Maze mechanism, Teleport Traps will periodically appear on all players.",
