    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Chat] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> HUD Bottom Left - Chat </>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Channels: </> You can switch between different channels in the list on the left. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Settings: </> You can configure chat channels via <Assistant_System> Chat Panel - Settings button at the bottom </>. In <Assistant_System> General Settings - Chat Channel Display </>, you can set which channels to display. In <Assistant_System> Channel Settings </>, you can control which chat channels appear in the bottom left of the HUD. \n<Assistant_Title2> General Channel: </> The General channel aggregates messages from multiple channels, allowing for quick viewing. In <Assistant_System> Channel Settings </>, you can control which channel information is included in the General channel. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Window: </> In the bottom right of the chat interface, click the window button to open window mode, which allows you to drag the window freely. \n<Assistant_Title3> Basic Function Details and Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[聊天-表情包]|1414}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Chat] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> HUD Bottom Left - Chat </>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Channels: </> You can switch between different channels in the list on the left. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Settings: </> You can configure chat channels via <Assistant_System> Chat Panel - Settings button at the bottom </>. In <Assistant_System> General Settings - Chat Channel Display </>, you can set which channels to display. In <Assistant_System> Channel Settings </>, you can control which chat channels appear in the bottom left of the HUD. \n<Assistant_Title2> General Channel: </> The General channel aggregates messages from multiple channels, allowing for quick viewing. In <Assistant_System> Channel Settings </>, you can control which channel information is included in the General channel. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Window: </> In the bottom right of the chat interface, click the window button to open window mode, which allows you to drag the window freely. \n<Assistant_Title3> Basic Function Details and Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat - Stickers]|1414}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Cross-Server Friends] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System> Under the Friends - Add tab, enter the character nickname or character numeric ID to search for and add cross-server friends. </>\n Friend Gifting: <Assistant_Title2> You can use </> Friends - Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner <Assistant_System> to exchange gifts with cross-server friends and increase friendliness. </>\n Recommended Searches: <Assistant_Title3></>, {SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Cross-Server Friends] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System> Under the Friends - Add tab, enter the character nickname or character numeric ID to search for and add cross-server friends. </>\n Friend Gifting: <Assistant_Title2> You can use </> Friends - Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner <Assistant_System> to exchange gifts with cross-server friends and increase friendliness. </>\n Recommended Searches: <Assistant_Title3></>, {SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Delete/Block] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Click Avatar </>, \n<Assistant_Title2> Deleting Friends: </> Deleting a friend will mutually terminate the friendship, and they will no longer appear in your friend list. <Assistant_Red> Deleting a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title2> Blocking Friends: </> If you are currently friends, blocking will automatically terminate the friendship mutually, and you will no longer receive private messages from them after blocking. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Delete/Block] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Click Avatar </>, \n<Assistant_Title2> Deleting Friends: </> Deleting a friend will mutually terminate the friendship, and they will no longer appear in your friend list. <Assistant_Red> Deleting a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title2> Blocking Friends: </> If you are currently friends, blocking will automatically terminate the friendship mutually, and you will no longer receive private messages from them after blocking. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Friendliness] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Friend Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Source: </> Team up with a friend to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon boss, defeat a world boss as a team, complete 1 competition activity as a team, chat privately with a friend, complete 1 duo social action, or ride together to increase friendliness. Friendliness can also be increased by sending social gifts and cosmetic items. \n<Assistant_Title2> Clearing Friendliness: </><Assistant_Red> Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Friendliness] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Friend Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Source: </> Team up with a friend to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon boss, defeat a world boss as a team, complete 1 competition activity as a team, chat privately with a friend, complete 1 duo social action, or ride together to increase friendliness. Friendliness can also be increased by sending social gifts and cosmetic items. \n<Assistant_Title2> Clearing Friendliness: </><Assistant_Red> Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Social Gifting] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </> In <Assistant_System> Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity </>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to send to friends or other players. \n<Assistant_Title2> Friend Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Friend Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send friendliness gifts to increase mutual friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Personal Homepage Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Personal Homepage - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send homepage gifts to increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If you are friends, it will additionally increase friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Voice Room Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gifting </>, you can send voice room gifts to increase the current room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Social Gifting] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </> In <Assistant_System> Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity </>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to send to friends or other players. \n<Assistant_Title2> Friend Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Friend Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send friendliness gifts to increase mutual friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Personal Homepage Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Personal Homepage - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send homepage gifts to increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If you are friends, it will additionally increase friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Voice Room Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gifting </>, you can send voice room gifts to increase the current room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Befriend Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time ({SendAnswer:人脉|550}), get to know them, and borrow power from the past. \n<Assistant_Title2>Method of Befriending:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> to enter the interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, it consumes one {SendAnswer:历史明灯|556}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Rules:</>\n1. In befriending events, every 5 attempts guarantees an Epic or higher quality Connection. \n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the count resets and the probability returns to the base rate. \n3. The pity counts for permanent befriending events and limited-time befriending events accumulate separately within their respective events and do not affect each other. \n4. For permanent befriending events, you can make a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it. \n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:投影片段|557}. If the Connection has already reached its limit or you have enough materials to reach the limit, the number of projection fragments received will increase. Projection fragments can be used to exchange for Historical Beacons and specific Connections in the {SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Record:</>\nYou can view the records for specific types of befriending events by going to <Assistant_System>Connections - Befriend Connections - Corresponding Event - Record</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[人脉许愿]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Befriend Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time ({SendAnswer:Connections|550}), get to know them, and borrow power from the past. \n<Assistant_Title2>Method of Befriending:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> to enter the interface, then click Befriend 1 time/5 times to proceed. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Cost:</>\nEach time you befriend, it consumes one {SendAnswer:Historical Beacon|556}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Rules:</>\n1. In befriending events, every 5 attempts guarantees an Epic or higher quality Connection. \n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the count resets and the probability returns to the base rate. \n3. The pity counts for permanent befriending events and limited-time befriending events accumulate separately within their respective events and do not affect each other. \n4. For permanent befriending events, you can make a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it. \n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557}. If the Connection has already reached its limit or you have enough materials to reach the limit, the number of projection fragments received will increase. Projection fragments can be used to exchange for Historical Beacons and specific Connections in the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Befriending Record:</>\nYou can view the records for specific types of befriending events by going to <Assistant_System>Connections - Befriend Connections - Corresponding Event - Record</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wish]|555}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material Synthesis</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nBeyonder Material Synthesis is unlocked when your Acting level reaches 47. You can synthesize two Beyonder materials into a new one.\n1. During synthesis, the entries of the resulting product are <Assistant_Red>entirely</> randomly selected from the entries of the <Assistant_Red>input Beyonder materials</>.\n2. There is a very small probability of mutation during synthesis, generating <Assistant_Property2>Mutated Entries</>. The possible Mutated Entries vary depending on the total number and types of entries in the input Beyonder materials.\n3. When you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 4 or more entries, you unlock the ability to use 4-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis; when you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 5 entries, you unlock the ability to use 5-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis.\n4. Performing Beyonder material synthesis increases <Assistant_Property1>Synthesis Proficiency</>. Synthesis Proficiency resets each season, and you can obtain rewards after reaching certain values.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[非凡物质]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material Synthesis</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nBeyonder Material Synthesis is unlocked when your Acting level reaches 47. You can synthesize two Beyonder materials into a new one.\n1. During synthesis, the entries of the resulting product are <Assistant_Red>entirely</> randomly selected from the entries of the <Assistant_Red>input Beyonder materials</>.\n2. There is a very small probability of mutation during synthesis, generating <Assistant_Property2>Mutated Entries</>. The possible Mutated Entries vary depending on the total number and types of entries in the input Beyonder materials.\n3. When you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 4 or more entries, you unlock the ability to use 4-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis; when you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 5 entries, you unlock the ability to use 5-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis.\n4. Performing Beyonder material synthesis increases <Assistant_Property1>Synthesis Proficiency</>. Synthesis Proficiency resets each season, and you can obtain rewards after reaching certain values.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[Obtain Beyonder Material]|1269}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\n1. Materials containing Beyonder power can be slotted into <Assistant_Property1>Sealed Artifacts</> to stabilize historical projections and unlock additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects.\n2. The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into entries. Due to the different sequences and quantities of Beyonder characteristics that compose them, Beyonder materials vary in the number, type, and strength of their entries. There is at least 1 entry, and up to 6 entries; Beyonder materials with more than 6 entries have not yet been discovered.\n3. The random entries of Beyonder materials are influenced or corrupted by high-level powers, which may lead to mutations. <Assistant_Property2>Mutated Entries</> provide more powerful effects compared to normal entries. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 Mutated Entry.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\n1. Materials containing Beyonder power can be slotted into <Assistant_Property1>Sealed Artifacts</> to stabilize historical projections and unlock additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects.\n2. The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into entries. Due to the different sequences and quantities of Beyonder characteristics that compose them, Beyonder materials vary in the number, type, and strength of their entries. There is at least 1 entry, and up to 6 entries; Beyonder materials with more than 6 entries have not yet been discovered.\n3. The random entries of Beyonder materials are influenced or corrupted by high-level powers, which may lead to mutations. <Assistant_Property2>Mutated Entries</> provide more powerful effects compared to normal entries. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 Mutated Entry.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Obtain Beyonder Material]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material Synthesis]|1270}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:投影片段|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[投影片段]|557}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Projection Fragments]|557}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wish</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nIn the permanent befriending event within the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> interface, click the Wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the Wish interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>After wishing for </>a specific Connection, you can increase the probability of obtaining that Connection when befriending. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wish Rules:</>\nOnly Legendary Connections that can be befriended are eligible for a wish. \nAfter making a wish, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of it being your wish target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the Legendary Connection obtained is not your wish target, the next Legendary Connection you obtain is guaranteed to be your wish target. \nIn permanent befriending, <Assistant_Property1>each week</> you can use <Assistant_Property1>2 times</> of the wish effect, which resets on Monday. Every time you befriend <Assistant_Property1>110 times</>, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \nAfter wishing for a Connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the Cancel Wish button to cancel it. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wish</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nIn the permanent befriending event within the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> interface, click the Wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the Wish interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>After wishing for </>a specific Connection, you can increase the probability of obtaining that Connection when befriending. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wish Rules:</>\nOnly Legendary Connections that can be befriended are eligible for a wish. \nAfter making a wish, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of it being your wish target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the Legendary Connection obtained is not your wish target, the next Legendary Connection you obtain is guaranteed to be your wish target. \nIn permanent befriending, <Assistant_Property1>each week</> you can use <Assistant_Property1>2 times</> of the wish effect, which resets on Monday. Every time you befriend <Assistant_Property1>110 times</>, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \nAfter wishing for a Connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the Cancel Wish button to cancel it. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time, get to know them, and borrow power from the past.\nGetting to know them multiple times increases your understanding of the target and grants you access to more authentic and powerful abilities.\n1. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Connections</> by <Assistant_Property2>making acquaintances</>, which unlocks corresponding skills.\n2. Duplicate Connections can be used to upgrade your Connection level, thereby enhancing the effects of the corresponding skills.\n3. Making more acquaintances increases your understanding of them, improves your {SendAnswer:关系|551}Historical Research<Assistant_Property2> level, and grants certain attribute bonuses.</>\nHow to make acquaintances:<Assistant_Title2></>Click \nMenu - Connections - Make Acquaintances<Assistant_System> to enter the </>interface, then click 'Make Acquaintance 1 time/5 times' to proceed.{SendAnswer:结交人脉|554}\nCost:<Assistant_Title2></>Each attempt requires one \nHistorical Beacon{SendAnswer:历史明灯|556}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rules:</>\n1. In every 5 attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain at least one Epic-grade Connection or higher.\n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the counter resets and the probability returns to the base rate.\n3. The pity counters for permanent and limited-time events are accumulated separately and do not affect each other.\n4. For permanent events, you can set a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it.\n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:投影片段|557}projection fragments. If that Connection has already reached its maximum level or you have enough materials to reach the maximum, the number of fragments received will increase. Fragments can be used in the Connections Shop to exchange for Historical Beacons or specific Connections.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}, {SendAnswer:[人脉许愿]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time, get to know them, and borrow power from the past.\nGetting to know them multiple times increases your understanding of the target and grants you access to more authentic and powerful abilities.\n1. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Connections</> by <Assistant_Property2>making acquaintances</>, which unlocks corresponding skills.\n2. Duplicate Connections can be used to upgrade your Connection level, thereby enhancing the effects of the corresponding skills.\n3. Making more acquaintances increases your understanding of them, improves your {SendAnswer:Relationship|551}Historical Research<Assistant_Property2> level, and grants certain attribute bonuses.</>\nHow to make acquaintances:<Assistant_Title2></>Click \nMenu - Connections - Make Acquaintances<Assistant_System> to enter the </>interface, then click 'Make Acquaintance 1 time/5 times' to proceed.{SendAnswer:Befriend Connections|554}\nCost:<Assistant_Title2></>Each attempt requires one \nHistorical Beacon{SendAnswer:Historical Beacon|556}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rules:</>\n1. In every 5 attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain at least one Epic-grade Connection or higher.\n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the counter resets and the probability returns to the base rate.\n3. The pity counters for permanent and limited-time events are accumulated separately and do not affect each other.\n4. For permanent events, you can set a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it.\n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557}projection fragments. If that Connection has already reached its maximum level or you have enough materials to reach the maximum, the number of fragments received will increase. Fragments can be used in the Connections Shop to exchange for Historical Beacons or specific Connections.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wish]|555}",
