    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Mail Instructions: </>\n1. Click the <Assistant_System>Social - Mail</> icon in the bottom left of the main interface, or the <Assistant_System>Menu - Mail</> sidebar in the top right to open your mailbox.\n2. Click the star icon to bookmark mail; bookmarked mail goes to the Favorites folder. Mail in Favorites is permanent and can be viewed unless manually cleared (attachments cannot be bookmarked).\n3. Mail can only be sent by the system or a Club; for communication with friends, use <Assistant_System>Chat</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Attachment Instructions: </>\n1. The mailbox has a capacity limit; mail exceeding this limit will be <Assistant_Red>automatically cleared</>. Please claim your mail promptly.\n2. Some mail has an <Assistant_Red>expiration date</>; after this time, it will <Assistant_Red>be impossible to claim</>. Please check your mail promptly.\n3. Once deleted, mail <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</> (bookmarked mail can still be viewed in the Favorites folder after deletion).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部群发邮件]|501}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Mail Instructions: </>\n1. Click the <Assistant_System>Social - Mail</> icon in the bottom left of the main interface, or the <Assistant_System>Menu - Mail</> sidebar in the top right to open your mailbox.\n2. Click the star icon to bookmark mail; bookmarked mail goes to the Favorites folder. Mail in Favorites is permanent and can be viewed unless manually cleared (attachments cannot be bookmarked).\n3. Mail can only be sent by the system or a Club; for communication with friends, use <Assistant_System>Chat</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Attachment Instructions: </>\n1. The mailbox has a capacity limit; mail exceeding this limit will be <Assistant_Red>automatically cleared</>. Please claim your mail promptly.\n2. Some mail has an <Assistant_Red>expiration date</>; after this time, it will <Assistant_Red>be impossible to claim</>. Please check your mail promptly.\n3. Once deleted, mail <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</> (bookmarked mail can still be viewed in the Favorites folder after deletion).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Mass Mail]|501}",
