    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Shooting Weak Points】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>In levels where firearm abilities are activated, some enemies have weak points, and there will be relevant prompts in the level information. The head of most humanoid enemies is their weak point. \n<Assistant_Red>Please note</>: Only <Assistant_Red>Pistols</> and <Assistant_Red>Sniper Rifles</> can hit weak points in <Assistant_Red>aiming mode</>, and <Assistant_Property1>hitting weak points</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</> to enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Shooting Weak Points】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>In levels where firearm abilities are activated, some enemies have weak points, and there will be relevant prompts in the level information. The head of most humanoid enemies is their weak point. \n<Assistant_Red>Please note</>: Only <Assistant_Red>Pistols</> and <Assistant_Red>Sniper Rifles</> can hit weak points in <Assistant_Red>aiming mode</>, and <Assistant_Property1>hitting weak points</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</> to enemies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Shotgun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>The shotgun has a large hit detection range, can hit multiple enemies with a single shot, and deals multi-stage damage, making it very suitable for dealing with large groups of enemies. \nShotguns <Assistant_Property1>cannot</> deal extra damage to enemy weak points. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[手枪]|899}, {SendAnswer:[狙击枪]|901}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Shotgun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>The shotgun has a large hit detection range, can hit multiple enemies with a single shot, and deals multi-stage damage, making it very suitable for dealing with large groups of enemies. \nShotguns <Assistant_Property1>cannot</> deal extra damage to enemy weak points. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Sniper Rifle]|901}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Sin of Gold】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Log</>\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> After reaching <Assistant_Property1>Level 47</>, Beyonders can click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Blackthorn Incident Log - Sin of Gold</> to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2> Number of Participants: </> Team up with 5-6 people, or choose AI mode to go.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </> Level 55 Golden Equipment, Beyonder Materials, etc. 1 reward attempt per day <Assistant_Red>(shared reward attempts with Blackthorn Incident Log)</>.\n<Assistant_Title2> Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[洛克·金]|1302137}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sin of Gold】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Log</>\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> After reaching <Assistant_Property1>Level 47</>, Beyonders can click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Blackthorn Incident Log - Sin of Gold</> to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2> Number of Participants: </> Team up with 5-6 people, or choose AI mode to go.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </> Level 55 Golden Equipment, Beyonder Materials, etc. 1 reward attempt per day <Assistant_Red>(shared reward attempts with Blackthorn Incident Log)</>.\n<Assistant_Title2> Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[Locke Gold]|1302137}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Sniper Rifle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>The sniper rifle has a long range and high single-shot damage, but the shooting interval is long, and it has certain requirements for aiming. \nAfter the sniper rifle enters aiming mode, you can use the multi-magnification scope to view distant situations; in this state, <Assistant_Property1>shooting weak points</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}, {SendAnswer:[射击弱点]|902}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sniper Rifle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>The sniper rifle has a long range and high single-shot damage, but the shooting interval is long, and it has certain requirements for aiming. \nAfter the sniper rifle enters aiming mode, you can use the multi-magnification scope to view distant situations; in this state, <Assistant_Property1>shooting weak points</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Shooting Weak Points]|902}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Social Actions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>HUD - Action Button</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250058}\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Click the action icon to open the social action interface, then click on Solo Actions, Duo Actions, or Emotes to use them.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>You can preview them in <Assistant_System>Appearance - Surroundings - Actions</> to see how to obtain them. You can also click on locked action icons in the social action panel to view acquisition methods.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sanity Impact: </>Most actions will affect your Sanity after use.\n<Assistant_Title2>Duo Actions: </>Select a target player and click a Duo Action to send an invitation; once the other party accepts, you can perform the Duo Action together.<Assistant_Red>Note: Both parties must be within a certain range to initiate a Duo Action; if the distance is too great, a prompt will appear stating it cannot be initiated.</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social Actions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>HUD - Action Button</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250058}\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Click the action icon to open the social action interface, then click on Solo Actions, Duo Actions, or Emotes to use them.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>You can preview them in <Assistant_System>Appearance - Surroundings - Actions</> to see how to obtain them. You can also click on locked action icons in the social action panel to view acquisition methods.\n<Assistant_Title2>Sanity Impact: </>Most actions will affect your Sanity after use.\n<Assistant_Title2>Duo Actions: </>Select a target player and click a Duo Action to send an invitation; once the other party accepts, you can perform the Duo Action together.<Assistant_Red>Note: Both parties must be within a certain range to initiate a Duo Action; if the distance is too great, a prompt will appear stating it cannot be initiated.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[剧情模式下外观隐藏]|1324}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Hide Appearance in Story Mode]|1324}",
