    ["<Assistant_Title1>【What the Harbinger Says】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of an old house deep in the grape trellis, a man seems to be looking for something... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 65</>, go to {Location:[金秋湖(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0}the location and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【What the Harbinger Says】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of an old house deep in the grape trellis, a man seems to be looking for something... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 65</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0}the location and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
