    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·遮阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·遮阳，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Shade Eyes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Shade Eyes. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·邀请】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>组队玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·邀请，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-同行商店</>使用同行纹章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Invite】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Invite. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【带上你的亲爱的】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>霍纳奇斯花海，一位女士站在许愿树下，着急地四处张望着……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，晋升至序列9，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯花海(470,567)]|37096;46700;15483;2;5202005;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Bring Your Dear One]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands beneath the Wishing Tree, looking around anxiously...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" reach Sequence 9, and head to {Location:[Hornacis Sea of Flowers(470,567)]|37096;46700;15483;2;5202005;0}Triggerable Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sols, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【常在河边走】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>村庄里的无赖汉以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>托马斯</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Walking by the River】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A scoundrel in the village makes a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out. This time...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Lamud Castle(291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Thomas</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【常在河边走】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>村庄里的无赖汉以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>托马斯</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Always Walking by the River】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A rascal in the village makes a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out. This time... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After advancing to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Lamud Castle (291,496)]|19247;39706;1424;2;5200130;0} and speak with <Assistant_Red>Thomas</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【常胜之勋】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得常胜之勋，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过终末猎杀拍卖获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Medal of Constant Victory] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Competition gameplay accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Medal of Constant Victory; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via Final Hunt auction",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【幸运草】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，施放普攻和非解控技能时概率获得幸运层数，提高<Assistant_Red>移速</>、<Assistant_Red>暴击</>和<Assistant_Red>技能增强</>，未触发时会累积触发概率；幸运结束时会进入困顿状态，降低<Assistant_Red>移动速度</>和<Assistant_Red>体力恢复速度</>，期间无法再次触发幸运。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Four-Leaf Clover】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Casting basic attacks and non-cleanse skills has a chance to gain Luck stacks, increasing <Assistant_Red>Movement Speed</>, <Assistant_Red>Critical Hit Rate</>, and <Assistant_Red>Skill Enhancement</>. If not triggered, the trigger probability accumulates. When Luck ends, you enter a lethargic state, reducing <Assistant_Red>Movement Speed</> and <Assistant_Red>Stamina recovery speed</>, during which Luck cannot be triggered again.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Default unlocked Sealed Artifact, no additional acquisition required.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【幽林菌语】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊周边\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得幽林菌语，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-周边/>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fungal Whispers of the Dark Forest. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Accessories\n.<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【幽灵船舵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得幽灵船舵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ghost Ship Helm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Ghost Ship Helm; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【广播】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>2级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天 - 右下角广播</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250041}\n<Assistant_Title2>购买途径：</>可在广播面板快捷购买，也可在<Assistant_System>商城 - 秘藏陈列</>中购买。\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍-全域广播：</>使用道具后，可以发送全服跑马灯广播。\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍-心羽·神谕广播：</>使用道具后，可以发送全服跑马灯广播，并附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍-迅电·神谕广播：</>使用道具后，可以发送全服跑马灯广播，并附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Broadcast】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat - Broadcast at bottom right</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250041}\n<Assistant_Title2>Purchase Method: </>Can be purchased quickly in the broadcast panel, or in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction - Global Broadcast: </>After using the item, you can send a server-wide marquee broadcast.\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction - Heart Feather · Oracle Broadcast: </>After using the item, you can send a server-wide marquee broadcast and receive a gift of bound gold pounds worth half the value for the World Channel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Introduction - Swift Lightning · Oracle Broadcast: </>After using the item, you can send a server-wide marquee broadcast and receive a gift of bound gold pounds worth half the value for the World Channel.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【庄园摇铃】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得庄园摇铃，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-五月庄园·花园</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Manor Ring Bell】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Manor Ring Bell. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【庇佑者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件庇佑者，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Protector】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Protector display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【座驾】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>外观类型的一种\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>座驾可以通过任务、活动、商城或特定玩法奖励获得等等多种多样的方式都有机会获取。\n<Assistant_Title2>查看切换：</>点击菜单-外观-座驾就可以预览和切换其他座驾，还能更换座驾外观\n<Assistant_Title2>召唤座驾：</>点击右下角坐骑按钮可以召唤座驾，PC端还可以用快捷键T召唤坐骑"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Vehicle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>A type of cosmetic.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Vehicles can be obtained in various ways, such as through quests, events, the Mall, or specific gameplay rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>View and Switch: </>Click Menu - Cosmetics - Vehicle to preview and switch vehicles, or change their appearance.\n<Assistant_Title2>Summon Vehicle: </>Click the mount button in the bottom right to summon your vehicle; on PC, you can also use the shortcut key T to summon it.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【廷根】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>鲁恩王国北部的重要城市，蒸汽文明与神秘信仰在这里交汇，也是无数非凡者旅程开始的地方。\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:原著瞬间|1300064}  {JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1300065}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301070}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301071}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301068}  {JumpToUI:吟游诗人|1301066}  {JumpToUI:寻猫奇遇记|1301067}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301907}  {JumpToUI:风尚沙龙|1301906}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301069}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301063}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301958}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代百态|1302426}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302427}  {JumpToUI:城市漫游|1302428}\n<Assistant_Title2>【城市暗面】：</>\n{SendAnswer:剧情事件|879}  {SendAnswer:挑战事件|880}  {SendAnswer:竞技事件|881}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction:</>An important city in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom, where steam civilization and mysterious beliefs intersect. It is also where the journeys of countless Beyonders begin.\n<Assistant_Title2>【Order World】:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Original Work Old Dreams:</>\n{JumpToUI:Moments from the Original Work|1300064}  {JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1300065}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301070}  {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301071}  {JumpToUI:spirit body threads|1301068}  {JumpToUI:Bard|1301066}  {JumpToUI:Cat-Seeking Adventure|1301067}  {JumpToUI:Storm Chasing|1301907}  {JumpToUI:Fashion Salon|1301906}  {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301069}  {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301063}  {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301958}\n<Assistant_Title2>【Era Quests】:</>\n{JumpToUI:Life in the Era|1302426}  {JumpToUI:Acting Stories|1302427}  {JumpToUI:City Roaming|1302428}\n<Assistant_Title2>【Dark Side of the City】:</>\n{SendAnswer:Plot Events|879}  {SendAnswer:Challenge Events|880}  {SendAnswer:Competition Events|881}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【廷根印象】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>想快速了解廷根？去找中央广场的雅各布问问吧！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(971,952)]|-2860;-4680;-1510;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：随机领取<Assistant_Red>三项</>城市漫游任务"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen Impressions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Want to get to know Tingen quickly? Go ask Jacob at Central Plaza!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(971,952)]|-2860;-4680;-1510;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Randomly receive <Assistant_Red>three</> City Roaming quests",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【廷根守护者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我们是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫，也是廷根的守护者。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第六天解锁。完成主线剧情第四章《镜中的廷根》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>60级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、称号·廷根守护者、烤羊腿肉、牡蛎汤"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen Guardian】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>We are a group of poor wretches who are always fighting against danger and madness, and we are also the guardians of Tingen.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Unlocked on the 6th day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Main Story Chapter 4 \"Tingen in the Mirror\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>60</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soles, Bound Gold Pounds, Star Coins, Title: Tingen Guardian, Roasted Lamb Leg, Oyster Soup",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【廷根守护者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我们是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫，也是廷根的守护者。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第六天解锁。完成主线剧情第四章《镜中的廷根》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>60级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、称号、烤羊腿肉、牡蛎汤"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen Guardian】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>We are a group of poor wretches who are always fighting against danger and madness, and we are also the guardians of Tingen.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Unlocked on the 6th day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Main Story Chapter 4 \"Tingen in the Mirror\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>60</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Title, Roasted Lamb Leg, Oyster Soup",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【廷根时光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得廷根时光套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen Times】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Tingen Times set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【异象之物】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>受当地非凡事件影响而形成的沾染灵性之物，<Assistant_Red>触碰</>即可收集。积累一定数量后可前往某位值夜者处兑换奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 收集异象之物</>\n探索过程中，可留意散发光芒的晶状物，靠近并触碰即可完成收集。\n也可通过以下方式寻找异象之物：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【异象之物】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【异象之物】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 兑换奖励</>\n收集足够数量的异象之物后，前往<Assistant_Red>黑荆棘安保公司</>附近，与<Assistant_Red>伦纳德</>对话即可兑换奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Object of Phenomenon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Items contaminated by spirituality formed under the influence of local Beyonder incidents. <Assistant_Red>Touch </>them to collect them. After accumulating a certain amount, you can exchange them for rewards at a Nighthawk.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Collecting Objects of Phenomenon</>\nDuring exploration, keep an eye out for glowing crystalline objects; approach and touch them to complete collection.\nYou can also find them using the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Object of Phenomenon] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Object of Phenomenon] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Exchanging Rewards</>\nAfter collecting enough Objects of Phenomenon, go to the vicinity of the <Assistant_Red>Blackthorn Security Company</> and speak with <Assistant_Red>Leonard</> to exchange them for rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【异阳圣徽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>战令奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得异阳圣徽，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>战令解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Alien Sun Holy Emblem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Battle Pass reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Alien Sun Holy Emblem. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via Battle Pass",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【微笑】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Smile】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【心意派送中】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>长椅旁，几位少男少女聚在一起低声交谈，目光不时飘向黑荆棘安保公司那扇紧闭的门。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(792,908)]|-20980;-9030;-1499;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heartfelt Delivery】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside a bench, a few young boys and girls are gathered together, whispering to each other, their gazes drifting from time to time toward the closed door of the Blackthorn Security Company.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(792,908)]|-20980;-9030;-1499;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【总有明天】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂区又一次发生了命案。一位女士因目击案件而崩溃哭泣，负责案件的警官认出你是调查特殊案件的专家，请求你帮忙安抚证人。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【There is Always Tomorrow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Another murder has occurred in the factory district. A lady is crying in a breakdown after witnessing the crime. The officer in charge of the case recognizes you as an expert in investigating special cases and asks you to help pacify the witness. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting level <Assistant_Red>Level 19</>, go to {Location:[Tingen (1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【总有明天】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂区又一次发生了命案。一位女士因目击案件而崩溃哭泣，负责案件的警官认出你是调查特殊案件的专家，请求你帮忙安抚证人。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【There Is Always Tomorrow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Another murder has occurred in the factory district. A lady is crying uncontrollably after witnessing the case. The officer in charge recognizes you as an expert in investigating special cases and asks for your help to pacify the witness.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【悬赏值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>参与罪恶廷根各类事件可获取悬赏值，累计可兑换各种奖励，<Assistant_Red>每周上限1000</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取来源：</>{JumpToUI:【城市暗面】|1302443}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Value】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Participate in various events in Sinful Tingen to obtain Bounty Value, which can be accumulated to exchange for various rewards, <Assistant_Red>with a weekly cap of 1000</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Source: </>{JumpToUI:【Dark Side of the City】|1302443}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【惊情街区】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得惊情街区套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Thrilling District】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Thrilling District outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【惊讶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Surprised】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【意外的访客】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>诡异的自杀，意外的穿越，陌生又熟悉的世界。此时有人敲响了房门，外面是朋友还是敌人？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第二天解锁。完成原著剧情《灰雾之上》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>41级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Unexpected Visitor】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A bizarre suicide, an accidental transmigration, a world both strange and familiar. At this moment, someone knocks on the door. Is it a friend or an enemy outside? \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the second day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Above the Gray Fog\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 41</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【愚者福音】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>愚者教会的福音宣传……为什么会出现在大学城？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>60级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1568,976)]|56840;-2330;-1360;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Gospel of the Fool]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Gospel propaganda from the Church of the Fool... why would it appear in the University District?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>60</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1568,976)]|56840;-2330;-1360;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sols",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【愚者福音】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>愚者教会的福音宣传……为什么会出现在大学城？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>60级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1568,976)]|56840;-2330;-1360;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gospel of the Fool】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Gospel promotion of the Church of the Fool... Why would it appear in the University District?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 60</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1568,976)]|56840;-2330;-1360;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【成为蘑菇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>在金秋湖车站旁，你看到一个奇怪的人，他自称是一朵蘑菇。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，晋升至序列9，前往{Location:[金秋湖(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}，与<Assistant_Red>马勃</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Become a Mushroom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" reach Sequence 9 advancement, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(358,89)]|25856;-1082;192;2;5200085;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Puffball</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【成为非凡者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工作的事情总算搞定了，带梅丽莎吃顿好的庆祝一下吧！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第五天解锁。完成原著剧情《黑荆棘安保公司》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>56级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Beyonder】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Work is finally settled; take Melissa out for a good meal to celebrate!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fifth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Blackthorn Security Company\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>56</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【成为非凡者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工作的事情总算搞定了，带梅丽莎吃顿好的庆祝一下吧！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第五天解锁。完成原著剧情《黑荆棘安保公司》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>56级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Becoming a Beyonder】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Work is finally settled; take Melissa out for a good meal to celebrate!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fifth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Blackthorn Security Company\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>56</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【成就】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-收藏-成就</>即可查看成就。\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入成就系统后，左侧列表可以切换成就<Assistant_Red>大类、小类</>。上方输入框可以查找该大类内的<Assistant_Red>成就名称</>。当有可领取的成就奖励时，可以点击右下角<Assistant_Red>“一键领取”</>领取该大类内的所有奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>成就奖励：</>大量<Assistant_Red>绑定金镑</>、<Assistant_Red>称号</>等。\n<Assistant_Title2>查询指南：</>在攻略助手中输入对应成就名，可以查询到具体成就。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Achievement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Collection - Achievement</> to view achievements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the achievement system, the list on the left can switch between achievement <Assistant_Red>categories and subcategories</>. The input box above can be used to search for <Assistant_Red>achievement names</> within that category. When there are claimable achievement rewards, you can click <Assistant_Red>\"Claim All\"</> in the bottom right corner to claim all rewards within that category. \n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Rewards: </>A large amount of <Assistant_Red>Bound Gold Pound</>, <Assistant_Red>Titles</>, etc. \n<Assistant_Title2>Inquiry Guide: </>Enter the corresponding achievement name in the Strategy Assistant to query specific achievements.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【我不是赌神】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励周边\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得我不是赌神，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-周边/>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【I Am Not the God of Gamblers】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rewards for Competition gameplay peripherals\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After using, you will obtain I Am Not the God of Gamblers. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Peripherals/> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Shop-General-Triumph Store</>",
