    ["<Assistant_Title1>【戒指夺回计划】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>霍纳奇斯花海，约会和度假的圣地。在你散步时，从天而降的物品是——\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>62级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯花海(255,221)]|15702.22;12017.58;17403;2;5202005;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ring Retrieval Plan】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a sanctuary for dating and vacations. While you were taking a walk, the item that fell from the sky was—\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>62</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Sea of Flowers(255,221)]|15702.22;12017.58;17403;2;5202005;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
