    ["<Assistant_Title1>【战士时装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>序列晋升奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得战士时装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过签到获取限时时装，后可通过<Assistant_System>序列晋升</>获取永久时装"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warrior Outfit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Sequence Advancement Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Warrior Outfit set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain limited-time outfit via check-in, then obtain permanent outfit via <Assistant_System>Sequence advancement</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【截稿日】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>恶龙酒吧的老板说，最近佛尔思小姐好像在因为什么事情而苦恼。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[恶龙酒吧(163,108)]|6383;865;0;2;5200050;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Deadline】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The owner of the Evil Dragon Bar says that Miss Fors seems to have been troubled by something lately.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Evil Dragon Bar(163,108)]|6383;865;0;2;5200050;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【截稿日】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>恶龙酒吧的老板说，最近佛尔思小姐好像在因为什么事情而苦恼。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[恶龙酒吧(163,108)]|6383;865;0;2;5200050;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Deadline】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The owner of the Evil Dragon Bar says that Miss Fors seems to have been troubled by something recently.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Evil Dragon Bar(163,108)]|6383;865;0;2;5200050;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【手心里的太阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>盲人女孩艾米丽·莫里森用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，却始终无法摸到\"光\"的样子。作为太阳神官，使用圣光垂慕为她召唤光芒，帮她感受光的温暖，倾听她讲述的故事，见证\"光的意义，在于照亮彼此\"。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度，冒险勋章，发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sun in the Palm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blind girl Emily Morrison touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories, but she can never touch what \"light\" looks like. As a Sun priest, use Holy Light Favor to summon light for her, help her feel the warmth of light, listen to the stories she tells, and witness that \"the meaning of light lies in illuminating each other.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 7 and head to {Location:[Tingen(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【手心里的太阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>盲人女孩艾米丽·莫里森用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，却始终无法摸到\"光\"的样子。作为太阳神官，使用圣光垂慕为她召唤光芒，帮她感受光的温暖，倾听她讲述的故事，见证\"光的意义，在于照亮彼此\"。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度，冒险勋章，发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sun in the Palm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blind girl Emily Morrison touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories, yet she can never touch the appearance of \"light.\" As a Sun Priest, use Holy Light Favor to summon light for her, help her feel the warmth of light, listen to the stories she tells, and witness that \"the meaning of light lies in illuminating each other.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Promote to Sequence 7 and head to {Location:[Tingen(776,692)]|-22380;-31065;-1409;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【手枪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>能力特征：</>手枪的单发伤害和弹匣容量中等，是最常见的枪械类型。\n手枪可开启瞄准状态，此状态下<Assistant_Property1>射击弱点</>，可造成<Assistant_Property1>高额伤害</>。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903},{SendAnswer:[射击弱点]|902}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pistol】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics:</>The pistol has moderate single-shot damage and magazine capacity, making it the most common type of firearm.\nPistols can enter an aiming state, in which <Assistant_Property1>Aiming Shot</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Shoot Weakness]|902}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【报丧者说】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>葡萄架深处的旧宅前，一位男子似乎在寻找什么……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0}与<Assistant_Red>男子</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【What the Mourner Says】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of the old house deep in the grape trellis, a man seems to be looking for something...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>65</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(373,197)]|27149;9014;1136;2;5200085;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【拉姆德古堡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>沉寂已久的古堡伫立于群山深处，残存的高塔与石墙，仍诉说着昔日的辉煌。该古堡属于第四纪末统治拉姆德小镇的领主。\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301083}  {JumpToUI:原著瞬间|1301082}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301088}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301089}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301086}  {JumpToUI:吟游诗人|1301084}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301957}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301087}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301081}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301960}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302433}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302434}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Lamud Castle]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction: </>A long-silent ancient castle standing deep in the mountains. The remaining towers and stone walls still tell of its former glory. This castle belonged to the lord who ruled Lamud Town at the end of the Fourth Epoch.\n<Assistant_Title2>[Order World]:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Moments from the Original Work:</>\n{JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1301083} {JumpToUI:Moments from the Original Work|1301082}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301088} {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301089} {JumpToUI:Spirit Body Threads|1301086} {JumpToUI:Bard|1301084} {JumpToUI:Storm Chasing|1301957} {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301087} {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301081} {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301960}\n<Assistant_Title2>[Era Quests]:</>\n{JumpToUI:Era Anecdotes|1302433} {JumpToUI:Roleplay Story|1302434}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【挑战事件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>挑战事件包含首领挑战、竞速挑战及激战·邦尼等多种玩法。完成挑战可获得对应奖励，部分挑战将根据完成表现发放分档奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>\n1.完成指定前置剧情事件或挑战事件。\n2.<Assistant_Red>激战·邦尼</>需要达到指定的等级与非凡评分。\n<Assistant_Title2>助手建议：</>\n1.可以通过查看首领攻略，反复向敌人发起挑战！\n2.部分挑战拥有分档奖励，挑战表现越优秀，获得奖励越丰厚。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Challenge Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Challenge Events include various modes such as Boss Challenges, Speed Challenges, and Fierce Battle · Bonnie. Completing challenges grants corresponding rewards, and some challenges provide tiered rewards based on performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event or Challenge Event. \n2. <Assistant_Red>Fierce Battle · Bonnie</> requires reaching the specified level and Beyonder rating. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. You can check boss guides and repeatedly challenge enemies! \n2. Some challenges have tiered rewards; the better your performance, the more generous the rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【排行榜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-排行</>即可查看排行榜，在本服内查看的排行榜，均为本服内的数据。\n<Assistant_Title2>刷新时间：</>除少数特殊情况外，排行榜<Assistant_Red>每1分钟</>刷新一次数据。\n<Assistant_Title2>清榜时间：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>世界Boss分数：</>每周一8：00清榜\n    <Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨赚取值：</>每周一8：01清榜\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入排行榜系统后，左侧列表可以切换<Assistant_Red>排行榜类型</>，点击切换后，可以在排行榜上方点击切换该类型下具体的排行榜。右侧展示对应玩家的模型、外观。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行筛选：</>在排行榜系统中，部分排行榜可以进行<Assistant_Red>筛选</>，如左下角的<Assistant_Red>全服/好友筛选</>、排行榜上方的<Assistant_Red>途径筛选</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行奖励：</>部分排行榜会定期<Assistant_Red>结算、发奖</>，可以点击页面右上角<Assistant_Red>奖励预览</>来查看对应<Assistant_Red>排名奖励</>，排行榜最下方有文字显示结算、发奖的时间。\n<Assistant_Title2>排行类型：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>个人：</>风尚度 等级 成就点 秩序世界\n    <Assistant_Property1>俱乐部：</>俱乐部等级 俱乐部评分 歌剧魅影 俱乐部联赛\n    <Assistant_Property1>竞技：</>主宰争锋 命运时刻 神座之争 终末猎杀\n    <Assistant_Property1>副本：</>安提哥努斯笔记 乌托邦剧院·噩梦 五月庄园·花园等\n    <Assistant_Property1>家族：</>家族非凡评分 家族风尚度\n    <Assistant_Property1>城堡：</>铁路大亨\n    <Assistant_Property1>躺赢：</>副本 同行 冒险 趣斗\n    <Assistant_Property1>教团：</>春夜舞会"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Leaderboard】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Ranking</> to view the leaderboard. The rankings viewed within the server are all data within the current server. \n<Assistant_Title2>Refresh Time: </>Except for a few special cases, the leaderboard <Assistant_Red>refreshes data every 1 minute</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Reset Time: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>World Boss Score: </>Reset every Monday at 8:00\n    <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon Earnings: </>Reset every Monday at 8:01\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the leaderboard system, the list on the left can switch <Assistant_Red>Leaderboard Types</>. After switching, you can click above the leaderboard to switch to specific rankings under that type. The right side displays the corresponding player's model and appearance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Filter: </>In the leaderboard system, some rankings can be <Assistant_Red>filtered</>, such as the <Assistant_Red>Server-wide/Friends filter</> in the bottom left, and the <Assistant_Red>Pathway filter</> above the leaderboard. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Rewards: </>Some leaderboards will periodically <Assistant_Red>settle and distribute rewards</>. You can click <Assistant_Red>Reward Preview</> in the top right corner of the page to view the corresponding <Assistant_Red>ranking rewards</>. The bottom of the leaderboard displays the time for settlement and reward distribution. \n<Assistant_Title2>Ranking Types: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Personal: </>Fashion Level, Level, Achievement Points, Orderly World\n    <Assistant_Property1>Club: </>Club Level, Club Rating, Phantom of the Opera, Club League\n    <Assistant_Property1>Competition: </>Dominator's Clash, Moment of Fate, Battle for the Throne of God, Final Hunt\n    <Assistant_Property1>Dungeon: </>Antigonus Notebook, Utopia Theater · Nightmare, May Manor · Garden, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Family: </>Family Extraordinary Rating, Family Fashion Level\n    <Assistant_Property1>Castle: </>Railway Tycoon\n    <Assistant_Property1>Easy Win: </>Dungeon, Ride Along, Adventure, Fun Fight\n    <Assistant_Property1>Cult: </>Spring Night Ball",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【探秘】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>诡秘世界中，可探索各地图【秩序世界】，以及廷根的【城市暗面】玩法，参与玩法增加秩序世界的完成度和城市暗面的悬赏值，可以领取丰厚的进度奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>入口指引：</>\n1. 跑团入口\n打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，进入【秩序世界】或【城市暗面】。选择对应玩法或事件，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n2. 地图入口\n打开右上角地图，切换至【探秘】页签，选择进入【秩序世界】或【城市暗面】。随后选择想要体验的玩法或事件，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐：</>{JumpToUI:廷根探索合集|1301900}，{JumpToUI:金秋湖探索合集|1301901}，{JumpToUI:拉姆德古堡探索合集|1301902}，{JumpToUI:睡莲小镇探索合集|1301903}，{JumpToUI:霍纳奇斯山脉探索合集|1301904}，{JumpToUI:霍纳奇斯花海探索合集|1301905}\n<Assistant_Title2>探秘技巧：</>\n{SendAnswer:1.灵性之跃|882}：探索过程中可长按跳跃键，进入灵性腾跃状态；再次点击跳跃键腾跃更高哦~\n{SendAnswer:2.灵视|883}：点击灵视按钮进入灵视状态，可发现附近的宝箱、任务线索及可交互的解谜点。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Exploration】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>In the world of Lord of Mysteries, you can explore the 【Order World】 in various maps, as well as the 【City Dark Side】 gameplay in Tingen. Participating in the gameplay increases the completion of the Order World and the bounty value of the City Dark Side, allowing you to claim generous progress rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Entrance Guide:</>\n1. TRPG Entrance\nOpen the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any sect, and then enter the 【Order World】 or 【City Dark Side】. Select the corresponding gameplay or event and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n2. Map Entrance\nOpen the map in the top right corner, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, and select to enter the 【Order World】 or 【City Dark Side】. Then select the gameplay or event you want to experience and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended:</>{JumpToUI:Tingen Exploration Collection|1301900}, {JumpToUI:Golden Autumn Lake Exploration Collection|1301901}, {JumpToUI:Lamud Castle Exploration Collection|1301902}, {JumpToUI:Water Lily Town Exploration Collection|1301903}, {JumpToUI:Hornacis Mountain Range Exploration Collection|1301904}, {JumpToUI:Hornacis Sea of Flowers Exploration Collection|1301905}\n<Assistant_Title2>Exploration Tips:</>\n{SendAnswer:1.Leap of Spirituality|882}: During exploration, you can long-press the jump button to enter the spirituality leap state; click the jump button again to leap higher!\n{SendAnswer:2.spirit vision|883}: Click the spirit vision button to enter the spirit vision state, where you can discover nearby treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【推荐方案】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>在各个养成系统中，点击<Assistant_System>推荐方案</>按钮即可前往推荐方案系统，使用推荐方案系统可以将系统和大神玩家推荐的方案，根据自身当前养成状况，一键运用到自身方案中。\n<Assistant_Title2>使用指南：</>进入推荐方案系统后，可以点击一键使用，也可以点击各个养成模块右上角的复制按钮，将成组或单独的套路运用到自身当前的方案上。在方案界面点击左下角的<Assistant_System>分享</>按钮，即可将自身当前装配的方案分享给其他非凡者。其他非凡者可通过分享码或分享链接<Assistant_System>导入</>分享的方案。\n<Assistant_Title2>覆盖说明：</>覆盖后的方案为根据推荐的方案和角色当前的养成计算后的<Assistant_Red>智能搭配</>，并自动为角色装配合适的非凡物质。只有<Assistant_Red>同途径</>的非凡者直接可以进行方案的分享、导入和覆盖。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[非凡评分]|502}，{SendAnswer:[非凡方案]|508}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Recommended Builds】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Description: </>In various cultivation systems, click the <Assistant_System>Recommended Build</> button to go to the Recommended Build system. You can use this system to apply builds recommended by the system and top players to your own setup with one click, based on your current cultivation status.\n<Assistant_Title2> Usage Guide: </>After entering the Recommended Build system, you can click \"Use One-Click\" or click the copy button in the top right corner of each cultivation module to apply sets or individual tactics to your current build. Click the <Assistant_System>Share</> button in the bottom left corner of the build interface to share your currently equipped build with other Beyonders. Other Beyonders can <Assistant_System>import</> shared builds via share codes or links.\n<Assistant_Title2> Overwrite Description: </>The overwritten build is an <Assistant_Red>intelligent combination</> calculated based on the recommended build and the character's current cultivation, and it will automatically equip suitable Beyonder materials for the character. Only Beyonders of the <Assistant_Red>same Pathway</> can directly share, import, and overwrite builds.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Beyonder Rating]|502}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Build]|508}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【提摩西兔】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得提摩西兔，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Timothy Rabbit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Timothy Rabbit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团/跑团】</>\n<Assistant_System>教团</>是跑团体系中的核心成长与阵营系统。加入教团后，你可以获得独立的<Assistant_Property1>教团等级</>、<Assistant_Property1>教团属性</>和对应教团的专属玩法。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>主要内容：</>\n1. 选择教团并完成属性配置。\n2. 通过教团玩法获得教团行动值以及各类奖励。\n3. 提升教团等级，解锁动作、外观、称号等奖励。\n4. 在探索与教团玩法中使用魅力、直觉、学识、武力等属性进行判定。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}，{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}，{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Coven/TRPG】</>\n<Assistant_System>Coven </> is the core growth and faction system in the TRPG system. After joining a Coven, you can obtain an independent <Assistant_Property1>Coven Level</>, <Assistant_Property1>Coven Attributes</>, and exclusive gameplay for that Coven. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Main Content: </>\n1. Choose a Coven and complete attribute configuration. \n2. Obtain Coven Action Points and various rewards through Coven gameplay. \n3. Increase Coven Level to unlock rewards like actions, appearances, and titles. \n4. Use attributes like Charisma, Intuition, Knowledge, and Might for checks during exploration and Coven gameplay. \n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[How to Join a Coven]|1273}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Attribute Explanation]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团宗旨与专属玩法】</>\n每个教团都有自己的教团规章，请遵循教团规章，完成每周任务，不然会受到惩罚。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>专属玩法：</>\n不同教团拥有不同专属玩法和能力，非凡者可通过切换教团来尝试不同教团的玩法。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cult Tenets and Exclusive Gameplay】</>\nEvery cult has its own rules; please follow them and complete your weekly tasks, otherwise you will be punished.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Exclusive Gameplay:</>\nDifferent cults have different exclusive gameplay and abilities; Beyonders can try different cult gameplay by switching cults.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Cult Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团属性说明】</>\n教团相关属性主要包括<Assistant_Property1>魅力</>、<Assistant_Property1>直觉</>、<Assistant_Property1>学识</>、<Assistant_Property1>武力</>。跑团天赋可额外提供永久的属性加成，部分地区可提供临时的属性加成。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团选择与属性加点]|1274}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Order Attribute Description】</>\nOrder-related attributes mainly include <Assistant_Property1>Charisma</>, <Assistant_Property1>Intuition</>, <Assistant_Property1>Knowledge</>, and <Assistant_Property1>Force</>. TRPG Talents can provide additional permanent attribute bonuses, and some areas can provide temporary attribute bonuses.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Order Selection and Attribute Point Allocation]|1274}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团等级、突破与奖励】</>\n加入教团后默认从 1 级开始。通过教团玩法获得行动值，行动值满足后可提升等级。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>突破任务：</>\n部分等级在行动值满后还需要完成突破任务。未完成突破任务时，行动值仍然会累积。完成突破任务后，等级可继续提升。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>奖励领取：</>\n在等级奖励界面可直接领取奖励。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Level, Breakthrough and Rewards】</>\nAfter joining a Covenant, you start at Level 1 by default. Obtain Action Points through Covenant gameplay; once the points are sufficient, you can increase your level.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Breakthrough Quest: </>\nFor some levels, you must complete a breakthrough quest after reaching the Action Point cap. Action Points will continue to accumulate while the breakthrough quest is incomplete. Once completed, the level can continue to increase.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Reward Collection: </>\nRewards can be collected directly in the level rewards interface.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团行动值与周上限】</>\n教团行动值主要通过对应教团玩法获得，用于提升当前教团等级。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>周上限规则：</>\n教团行动值有每周获取上限，且最多累计两周\n\n<Assistant_Title2>通用经验：</>\n当单个教团行动值溢出时，会转为通用行动值。通用行动值可用于其他教团升级。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团等级、突破与奖励]|1277}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap】</>\nCovenant Action Points are mainly obtained through corresponding Covenant gameplay and are used to increase the current Covenant level.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Cap Rules: </>\nCovenant Action Points have a weekly acquisition cap and can accumulate for up to two weeks.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>General EXP: </>\nWhen individual Covenant Action Points overflow, they are converted into General Action Points. General Action Points can be used for other Covenant upgrades.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Level, Breakthrough and Rewards]|1277}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团选择与属性加点】</>\n加入教团时会进入类似跑团角色创建的流程，主要分为<Assistant_Property1>教团</>、<Assistant_Property1>信仰</>、<Assistant_Property1>属性</>三步。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>规则说明：</>\n1. 选择教团后，该教团的能力与信仰会自动确定。\n2. 每个教团有推荐属性方案，可以直接使用推荐加点。\n3. 属性基础值最低为 8，最高为 16，总属性点为 44。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}，{SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Covenant Selection and Attribute Points] </>\n When joining a Covenant, you will enter a process similar to tabletop RPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1> Covenant </>, <Assistant_Property1> Faith </>, and <Assistant_Property1> Attributes </>. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Rules Explanation: </>\n 1. After selecting a Covenant, the abilities and faith of that Covenant will be automatically determined. \n 2. Each Covenant has a recommended attribute scheme, which you can use directly. \n 3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points. \n\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </> {SendAnswer: [Covenant Attribute Explanation] | 1275 }, {SendAnswer: [How to Join a Covenant] | 1273 }",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【新店开张】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>街头有一家新店开张，但店主和顾客看起来都不太高兴……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>店主</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【New Store Opening】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>A new store has opened on the street, but neither the owner nor the customers look very happy...\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(743,995)]|-25670;-469;-1629;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>Store Owner</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旅行的初始】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得旅行的初始套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beginning of the Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Beginning of the Journey set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旌旗的赞颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得旌旗的赞颂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Praise of the Banner] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Praise of the Banner; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无光之地】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂外，一个工人似乎在咒骂什么……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(868,940)]|5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>罗夫特</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Land Without Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main plot Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 19 </>, head to {Location: [Tingen (868,940)] | 5929;26008;-2479;2;5200002;0 } and speak with <Assistant_Red>Rovt</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无声誓言】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得无声誓言，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Silent Covenant] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Silent Covenant; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无暗十字】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>首充奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得无暗十字，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>首次充值奖励"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cross of No Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>First-top-up reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Cross of No Darkness. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-top-up reward",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无瞳的将军】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，进入战斗后周期性召唤恶灵追踪敌对目标，命中后造成伤害、<Assistant_Red>眩晕</>并附加<Assistant_Red>仇敌</>标记，恶灵会优先锁定带标记目标；恶灵也可以对持有者造成伤害，且持有者进入战斗时会被标记为<Assistant_Red>仇敌</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本-记忆的传承·钻头（困难）首通奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【General Without Eyes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. After entering combat, periodically summons an Evil Spirit. to track hostile targets, dealing damage, <Assistant_Red>Stun</>, and applying an <Assistant_Red>Enemy</> mark upon hit. The Evil Spirit prioritizes locked targets with marks. The Evil Spirit can also deal damage to the holder, and the holder is marked as an <Assistant_Red>Enemy</> when entering combat.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-clear reward for Dungeon - Legacy of Memory: Drill (Hard).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无瞳的将军】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，进入战斗后周期性召唤恶灵追踪敌对目标，命中后造成伤害、<Assistant_Red>眩晕</>并附加<Assistant_Red>仇敌</>标记，恶灵会优先锁定带标记目标；恶灵也可以对持有者造成伤害，且持有者进入战斗时会被标记为<Assistant_Red>仇敌</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本记忆的传承六获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Eyeless General】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Upon entering combat, it periodically summons an evil spirit to track hostile targets. Upon hitting, it deals damage, causes <Assistant_Red>stun</>, and applies a <Assistant_Red>Nemesis</> mark; the evil spirit will prioritize locked targets with the mark. The evil spirit can also deal damage to the holder, and the holder will be marked as a <Assistant_Red>Nemesis</> upon entering combat.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained in Dungeon: Inheritance of Memory VI.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【无韵诗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得无韵诗套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Blank Verse] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool Outfit \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain the Blank Verse set; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【日落泳装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得日落泳装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sunset Swimwear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Sunset Swimwear outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旧日遗风】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得旧日遗风套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Old Days Legacy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Old Days Legacy set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时之钟】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得时之钟，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Clock of Time】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Clock of Time; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时之鸦】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得时之鸦，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow of Time】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Crow of Time. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时代的传奇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得时代的传奇，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>1</>张神眷牌购买"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Legend of the Era] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Legend of the Era; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时代的浪潮】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>时代的浪潮正席卷廷根，骑上黑荆棘新员工的脚踏车，到处逛逛吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第二天解锁。完成主线剧情第一章《加入黑荆棘》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>39级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、中级生命纯露、星币、武器箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tides of the Era】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Main Story (Reality)</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The tides of the era are sweeping through Tingen; hop on the new Blackthorn employee's bicycle and go for a ride.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the second day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the main story Chapter 1 \"Join Blackthorn\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>39</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Intermediate Health Potion, Star Coin, Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时代的浪潮】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>时代的浪潮正席卷廷根，骑上黑荆棘新员工的脚踏车，到处逛逛吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第二天解锁。完成主线剧情第一章《加入黑荆棘》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>39级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、天赋点、星币、停转的银色怀表、35品武器箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Tides of the Era] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </> <Assistant_Property2> Reality Main Quest </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> The tides of the era are sweeping through Tingen. Hop on the new Blackthorn employee's bicycle and go for a ride. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> Unlocks on the second day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 1 of the main story, \"Joining Blackthorn,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 39 </> in Acting Level. \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soles, Bound Gold Pounds, Talent Points, Star Coins, Stopped Silver Pocket Watch, Level 35 Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时虫宝藏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>“恶作剧之神”阿蒙藏有时之虫的宝藏散落在各处，触碰时之裂隙能唤出阿蒙的谜题。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找时虫宝藏</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【时虫宝藏】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【时虫宝藏】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 开启寻宝</>\n与时之裂隙互动，并完成与单片眼镜虚影的对话后，即可开启寻宝挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 收集宝藏</>\n根据指引寻找散落的宝箱，收集全部宝箱后即可开启最终宝箱，获得奖励。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n<Assistant_Red>灵视</>可以帮助发现隐藏的宝箱，建议在寻找过程中使用哦~\n部分隐藏宝箱需要完成挑战后才能开启。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Worm of Time Treasure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The \"God of Mischief\" Amon has hidden treasures of Worms of Time scattered everywhere. Touching a Rift of Time can summon Amon's puzzles.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Worm of Time Treasure</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Worm of Time Treasure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Worm of Time Treasure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Starting the Treasure Hunt</>\nInteract with the Rift of Time and complete the conversation with the monocle phantom shadow to start the treasure hunt challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Collecting the Treasure</>\nFollow the guidance to find the scattered treasure chests; after collecting all of them, you can open the final treasure chest to receive your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\n<Assistant_Red>spirit vision</> can help you discover hidden treasure chests; it is recommended to use it during your search~\nSome hidden treasure chests can only be opened after completing a challenge.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【明于绿夜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得明于绿夜套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Bright in Green Night] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool Outfit \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain the Bright in Green Night set; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>",
