    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暖意蹲蹲】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得暖意蹲蹲，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Squat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Warm Squat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暗夜蝙蝠】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得暗夜蝙蝠，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-星灵秘库商店</>中使用裁刀兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dark Night Bat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Dark Night Bat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暗涌的危机】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>根据现有线索，和伦纳德弗莱分头行动，协助调查从警察厅移交过来的失踪案。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>46级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、45品武器箱、初级深红精粹、初级狂暴药剂、中级生命纯露"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Level 45 Weapon Box, Primary Crimson Essence, Primary Berserk Potion, Intermediate Life Dew",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暗涌的危机】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>根据现有线索，和伦纳德弗莱分头行动，协助调查从警察厅移交过来的失踪案。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>46级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、武器箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undercurrent Crisis】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Based on existing clues, split up with Leonard and Frye to assist in investigating the missing persons case transferred from the police department.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>46</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【暮霭】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得暮霭，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Twilight Mist】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Twilight Mist after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最后一场演出】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 \n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>乔利</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Last Performance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Tingen(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Jolly</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最后一场演出】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 \n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>乔利</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Last Performance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Tingen(704,1031)]|-29577;3192;-894;2;5200002;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red>Jolly</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最后一页】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>见证求知者的追寻，翻阅最后一页。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>63级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1174,910)]|17507;-8795;-1589;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Last Page】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>Witness the seeker's pursuit and turn to the last page.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>63</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1174,910)]|17507;-8795;-1589;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最好的武器】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>集市上有人出售锈迹斑斑的旧枪，摊主说只能当装饰品。你慧眼识枪，挑出一把看似报废的老枪，当场修复撞针并一枪命中，惊艳全场。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(757,1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Best Weapon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Someone is selling rusty old guns at the market, and the stall owner says they are only for decoration. You have a keen eye for guns, pick out an old gun that looks like it's scrapped, fix the firing pin on the spot, and hit the target with one shot, stunning everyone present.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the promotion quest, promote to Sequence 7, and head to {Location:[Tingen(757,1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最好的武器】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>集市上有人出售锈迹斑斑的旧枪，摊主说只能当装饰品。你慧眼识枪，挑出一把看似报废的老枪，当场修复撞针并一枪命中，惊艳全场。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(757,1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Best Weapon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Someone is selling rusty old guns at the market, and the stall owner says they can only be used as decorations. With your keen eye, you pick out a seemingly broken old gun, repair the firing pin on the spot, and hit the target with one shot, stunning everyone.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 7 and head to {Location:[Tingen(757,1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【最好的武器】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>集市上有人出售锈迹斑斑的旧枪，摊主说只能当装饰品。你慧眼识枪，挑出一把看似报废的老枪，当场修复撞针并一枪命中，惊艳全场。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(757,1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Best Weapon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Someone at the market is selling a rusty old gun; the stall owner says it can only be used as a decoration. With your keen eye for guns, you pick out a seemingly broken old gun, repair the firing pin on the spot, and hit the target with one shot, stunning everyone.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen (757, 1118)]|-24012;11883;-2064;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【月亮纸人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，受到致命伤害时触发<Assistant_Red>纸人庇护</>，临时承担本次及后续一段时间内的溢出伤害；庇护结束时，纸人承担的部分溢出伤害会重新作用到持有者身上，并使持有者短时间<Assistant_Red>承受伤害提高</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Moon Paper Figurine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Triggers <Assistant_Red>Paper Figurine Protection</> when taking fatal damage, temporarily absorbing this and subsequent overflow damage for a period. When the protection ends, the portion of overflow damage absorbed by the figurine is applied to the holder, and the holder's <Assistant_Red>Damage Taken is increased</> for a short time.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained as a selectable Sealed Artifact reward at the Earl I rank in the ladder.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【有礼猫】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>企微关注礼展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得有礼猫，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>活动-关注有礼</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Polite Cat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Enterprise WeChat follow gift display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Polite Cat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through <Assistant_System>Event - Follow for Gifts</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【朝阳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得朝阳，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morning Sun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Morning Sun after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【未写完的信】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，晋升至序列9，前往{Location:[廷根(1294,979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>伊迪丝</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Unfinished Letter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a small house on the old street in the East District; the owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\", advance to Sequence 9, go to {Location:[Tingen (1294, 979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red>Edith</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【未诉之诗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得未诉之诗套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Unspoken Poem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Unspoken Poem set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【未邀之诗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>草坪上，一群年轻学生围成一圈激烈地讨论着什么。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1532,928)]|53260;-7200;-1370;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Uninvited Poem】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>On the lawn, a group of young students are gathered in a circle, discussing something intensely.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1532,928)]|53260;-7200;-1370;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【机械迷局】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>进入这座尘封已久的机械小屋，破解它的谜团——在一切崩解之前。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>45级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(816,1138)]|-18412;13849;-1958;2;5200002;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mechanical Mystery】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Enter this long-sealed Mechanical Hut and solve its mysteries—before everything falls apart.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>45</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(816,1138)]|-18412;13849;-1958;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【机械迷局】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>进入这座尘封已久的机械小屋，破解它的谜团——在一切崩解之前。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>45级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(816,1138)]|-18412;13849;-1958;2;5200002;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒等"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mechanical Mystery】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type:</><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description:</>Enter this long-sealed mechanical hut and solve its mystery—before everything collapses.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept:</>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 45</> in Acting, head to {Location:[Tingen(816,1138)]|-18412;13849;-1958;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, etc.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枪械射击玩法】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>在<Assistant_System>剧情任务</>和<Assistant_System>罪恶廷根</>的<Assistant_Property1>部分特定关卡</>中，枪械功能会随关卡进程激活。\n<Assistant_Title2>能力介绍：</>激活枪械后，使用普攻按键可直接进行射击，使用技能可实现切换不同枪械、开镜瞄准、辅助击退等效果。\n不同关卡中，激活的枪械类型会存在差异，请合理运用击败敌人。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903},{SendAnswer:[手枪]|899},{SendAnswer:[霰弹枪]|900},{SendAnswer:[狙击枪]|901}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Shooting Gameplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Tingen</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific stages</>, firearm functions will be activated as the stage progresses.\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Introduction: </>After activating firearms, use the Basic Attack button to shoot directly. Use skills to switch between different firearms, aim down sights, or perform auxiliary knockbacks.\nThe types of firearms activated vary by stage; please use them reasonably to defeat enemies.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Shotgun]|900}, {SendAnswer:[Snipe]|901}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枪械获取】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>在<Assistant_System>剧情任务</>和<Assistant_System>罪恶廷根</>的<Assistant_Property1>部分特定关卡</>中，枪械功能会随关卡进程激活。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[枪械玩法简介]|898}，{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Firearm Acquisition】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activation Rules: </>In <Assistant_System>Story Quests</> and <Assistant_System>Sinful Tingen</>'s <Assistant_Property1>certain specific stages</>, firearm functions will be activated as the stage progresses.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Firearm Gameplay Introduction]|898}, {SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枫树】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件枫树，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Maple】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Maple display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枯叶蝶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得枯叶蝶套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dead Leaf Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Dead Leaf Butterfly outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【柏树】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件柏树，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cypress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Cypress display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【栖蝶披风】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得栖蝶披风，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Perch Cape】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Butterfly Perch Cape. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【格尔曼的代行者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>如何让孩子停止哭泣？用戏法，用魔术，或者……用格尔曼？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(868,940)]|-13190;-5940;-1600;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>托尼</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gehrman's Proxy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Extraordinary Roleplay</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>How do you stop a child from crying? Use tricks, use magic, or... use Gehrman?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then head to {Location:[Tingen(868,940)]|-13190;-5940;-1600;2;5200002;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> Tony </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【桃心糖饼】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得桃心糖饼，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heart Sugar Cookie】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Heart Sugar Cookie. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影-搭配规则】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>搭配阶段：</>本场主题公布后，满足资格的俱乐部成员可以进入搭配界面，根据主题关卡进行时装搭配。保存搭配后会计算搭配评分，并进入俱乐部本场评分排名。动作搭配主要影响表演效果，不影响评分。\n<Assistant_Title2>风格：</>每件外观拥有5组对立风格中的属性，如优雅/嬉皮、光明/黑暗、简约/奢华、纯真/冷酷、春夏/秋冬。每场会指定主风格和次风格，主风格权重更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>分数来源：</>单件服饰风格分会根据和每场主题的匹配度计算出基本分数，还会根据不同的染色等级受到染色加成；最终总分还会受到风尚鉴赏收集度的全局加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>参赛选手：</>进入调整阶段后，搭配会被锁定，俱乐部本场搭配评分前<Assistant_Red>5</>的成员自动成为参赛选手。\n<Assistant_Title2>调整顺序：</>有权限的管理者可以调整5名参赛选手的出场顺序；比赛前一段时间会禁止继续调整。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Coordination Phase: </>After the theme for the round is announced, eligible club members can enter the coordination interface to perform fashion coordination based on the theme level. After saving the coordination, the coordination score will be calculated, and you will enter the club's score ranking for this round. Action coordination mainly affects performance effects and does not affect the score. \n<Assistant_Title2>Style: </>Each appearance has attributes from 5 opposing style groups, such as Elegant/Hippie, Light/Dark, Minimalist/Luxurious, Innocent/Cold, Spring-Summer/Autumn-Winter. Each round will specify a main style and a secondary style, with the main style having a higher weight. \n<Assistant_Title2>Score Source: </>The style score of a single piece of clothing will be calculated based on the matching degree with each round's theme, and will also receive dyeing bonuses based on different dyeing levels; the final total score will also be affected by the global bonus of Fashion Appreciation collection. \n<Assistant_Title2>Contestants: </>After entering the adjustment phase, the coordination will be locked, and the top <Assistant_Red>5</> members in the club's coordination score for this round will automatically become contestants. \n<Assistant_Title2>Adjusting Order: </>Authorized managers can adjust the appearance order of the 5 contestants; adjusting will be prohibited for a period of time before the match.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影-比赛与奖励】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>比赛流程：</>双方俱乐部各派5名选手，按顺序依次进行5场走秀对抗。每局会播放双方选手的表演动画，非凡者可以赠送礼物和点赞来影响双方的分数，最终根据表演总分和额外分数之和判断胜负。\n<Assistant_Title2>胜负规则：</>如果双方分数打平时，会在比较选手的风尚度，若风尚度也相同，最后比俱乐部赛区排名。整场比赛以5局的总胜场数决定胜负，胜场相同时排名高的俱乐部获胜。\n<Assistant_Title2>奖励规则：</>进行过搭配的成员可根据搭配的分数高低获得搭配奖励；入场观战/作为参赛选手，即可领取歌剧魅影的奖励，每赛季结束时，俱乐部参赛前五名还会获得称号奖励"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera - Match and Rewards】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Match Process: </>Both clubs send 5 contestants each, who perform 5 runway confrontations in order. Each round will play the performance animation of both contestants. Beyonders can give gifts and likes to influence the scores of both sides. The final winner is determined based on the sum of the performance total score and extra scores. \n<Assistant_Title2>Win/Loss Rules: </>If the scores of both sides are tied, the contestants' Fashion Degree will be compared. If the Fashion Degree is also the same, the club's division ranking will be compared last. The entire match is decided by the total number of wins in the 5 rounds. If the number of wins is the same, the club with the higher ranking wins. \n<Assistant_Title2>Reward Rules: </>Members who have performed coordination can receive coordination rewards based on the height of their coordination score; entering to watch/as a contestant allows you to claim Phantom of the Opera rewards. At the end of each season, the top five club contestants will also receive title rewards",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>歌剧魅影</>是俱乐部之间，比拼外观搭配的玩法，整体赛制和俱乐部联赛类似，但各位需要搭配外观，在魅影长廊一决高下。玩法会按赛季/轮次进行，和俱乐部联赛节奏保持一致。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心流程：</>每周指定时间公布本场主题 → 成员进行时装搭配并形成评分排名 → 开赛前锁定搭配评分前5名参赛选手 → 俱乐部管理调整出场顺序 → 晚间开赛进行俱乐部间 5 场对抗 → 结算胜负与奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与条件：</>俱乐部需满足赛区/等级等条件，成员需要为正式成员，候补成员无法参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-搭配规则]|910},{SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-比赛与奖励]|911}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay mode where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but you will need to coordinate outfits to compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay follows a seasonal/round-based schedule, consistent with the rhythm of the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </> The theme for the current round is announced at a designated time each week → Members perform fashion coordination to generate a score ranking → The top 5 scoring contestants are locked in before the match starts → Club management adjusts the entry order → 5 club-vs-club matches take place in the evening → Results and rewards are settled. \n<Assistant_Title2> Participation Requirements: </> The club must meet division/level requirements, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules]|910}, {SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Matches and Rewards]|911}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌颂者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bard】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌颂者时装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>序列晋升奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得歌颂者时装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过签到获取限时时装，后可通过<Assistant_System>序列晋升</>获取永久时装"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bard Outfit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Sequence Advancement Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Bard Outfit set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain limited-time outfit via check-in, then obtain permanent outfit via <Assistant_System>Sequence advancement</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【正义钱包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，直接降低受到的伤害，并在承伤时根据累计伤害提高<Assistant_Red>防御值</>；持有防御提升效果超过一定时间且仍处于战斗中时，会周期性进入<Assistant_Red>不堪重负</>状态，降低移动速度和体力恢复速度。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Justice Wallet】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Directly reduces damage taken and increases <Assistant_Red>Defense value</> based on cumulative damage when taking hits. When holding the defense boost effect for more than a certain time while still in combat, you will periodically enter an <Assistant_Red>Overwhelmed</> state, reducing movement speed and stamina recovery speed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Default unlocked Sealed Artifact, no additional acquisition required.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【死亡咏叹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>黑荆棘安保公司接到一桩复杂的寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：绑定金镑、金纺线、绑定苏勒、认知经验、腰饰【永暗蜡烛】"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Death's Lament] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </> <Assistant_Property2> Side Quest </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> The Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person commission. Frye wants you to join the investigation. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 61 </> in Acting Level, you can accept the side quest in the quest log. \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Bound Gold Pounds, Gold Thread, Bound Soles, Cognition EXP, Waist Ornament [Eternal Darkness Candle]",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【死亡咏叹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>黑荆棘安保公司接到一桩复杂的寻人委托，弗莱希望你加入一起调查。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后，在任务栏可接取支线任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务说明：</>在跟随烛光的指引前进步骤中，第一个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}，第二个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}，第三个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}，第四个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}，第五个烛火坐标{Location:[冥界之门(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>绑定金镑、金纺线、绑定苏勒、认知经验、腰饰【永暗蜡烛】、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Death's Aria】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person case, and Frye hopes you will join the investigation.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 61</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Instructions: </>During the steps of following the candlelight's guidance, the first candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}, the second candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}, the third candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}, the fourth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}, the fifth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Bound Sol, Cognition EXP, Waist Accessory [Everdark Candle], Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【毒藤】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得毒藤套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Poison Ivy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Poison Ivy set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永夜残纱】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永夜残纱，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_Link>{SendAnswer:[五月庄园·城堡]|21}</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Veil of the Eternal Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon drop accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Veil of the Eternal Night. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_Link>{SendAnswer:[May Manor · Castle]|21}</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永夜荆棘】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永夜荆棘套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Evernight Thorns】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Evernight Thorns set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永宁圣堂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台场景永宁圣堂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Evernight Sanctuary】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Evernight Sanctuary display scene. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永恒之梦】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>小程序签到奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永恒之梦，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>小程序签到获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Eternal Dream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Mini-program check-in reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain Eternal Dream. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via mini-program check-in.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永暗蜡烛】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>剧情奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永暗蜡烛，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过阿兹克支线获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Everdark Candle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Everdark Candle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Azik side quest",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【沉眠】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得沉眠套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Slumber】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Slumber set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【泥土知道答案】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>每一次告别，都是另一种重逢。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>63级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(271,214)]|17110;11416;112;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Soil Knows the Answer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Every farewell is another kind of reunion. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 63 </>, head to {Location: [Golden Autumn Lake (271,214)] | 17110;11416;112;2;5200002;0 } to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【洞察之瞳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得洞察之瞳，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Eye of Insight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Eye of Insight. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【洞悉】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得洞悉，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Insight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Insight after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【浮光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得浮光，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floating Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Floating Light after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【浮光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floating Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【消失的午餐】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>大学城有片著名的野餐地，去那吃午餐吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>43级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1458,1018)]|45628;1862;-1442;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度\n<Assistant_Title2>找到尖叫的人：</>任务位面内，前往{Location:[廷根(1572,940)]|56963;-6150;-1265;2;5230070;0}，可找到蹲下尖叫的法西尔\n<Assistant_Title2>找到蒸汽与机械系的同学：</>任务位面内，前往{Location:[廷根(1564,907)]|56278;-9000;-1265;2;5230070;0}，可找到在看雕像的拉斯特拉\n<Assistant_Title2>寻找小猫的踪迹：</>任务位面内，前往{Location:[廷根(1464,1016)]|46435;1652;-1315;2;5230070;0}，可找到来自小猫的信使"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[The Vanishing Lunch]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There's a famous picnic spot in the University District. Go there for lunch.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>43</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1458,1018)]|45628;1862;-1442;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards: </>Cognitive Experience, Bound Sols, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress\n<Assistant_Title2>Find the person screaming: </>Inside the quest instance, head to {Location:[Tingen(1572,940)]|56963;-6150;-1265;2;5230070;0} to find Fasil crouching and screaming.\n<Assistant_Title2>Find the student from the Department of Steam and Machinery: </>Inside the quest instance, head to {Location:[Tingen(1564,907)]|56278;-9000;-1265;2;5230070;0} to find Lastra looking at the statue.\n<Assistant_Title2>Find traces of the kitten: </>Inside the quest instance, head to {Location:[Tingen(1464,1016)]|46435;1652;-1315;2;5230070;0} to find the messenger from the kitten.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【消失的幸运星】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(400,666)]|30060;56920;5190;2;5200130;0}，与<Assistant_Red>弗洛</>对话可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Vanishing Lucky Star】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately; he is convinced it is because the stars have shifted positions. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Lamud Castle(400,666)]|30060;56920;5190;2;5200130;0}the location, and talk to <Assistant_Red>Flo</> to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【消失的幸运星】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(400,666)]|30060;56920;5190;2;5200130;0}，与<Assistant_Red>弗洛</>对话可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[The Vanishing Lucky Star]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Roleplay Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have shifted positions.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7, head to {Location:[Lamud Castle(400,666)]|30060;56920;5190;2;5200130;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Flo</> to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【深渊凝视】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得深渊凝视，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-公会</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Abyss Gaze] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Gameplay reward accessory \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Abyss Gaze; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Gameplay - Club </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【深红月冕】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，遭受较近距离敌人时获得<Assistant_Red>受伤减免</>，并让攻击自己的最多3个非首领目标<Assistant_Red>增伤降低</>。攻击敌人会<Assistant_Red>减速</>敌人，让自己获得<Assistant_Red>增伤</>，但进入战斗后<Assistant_Red>体力恢复速度</>会降低，造成伤害可以缓解该负面效果。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>等级提升至六十二级后解锁。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crimson Moon Crown】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Gain <Assistant_Red>Damage Reduction</> when facing enemies at close range, and reduce the <Assistant_Red>Damage Boost</> of up to 3 non-boss targets attacking you. Attacking enemies will <Assistant_Red>Slow</> them and grant yourself a <Assistant_Red>Damage Boost</>, but your <Assistant_Red>Stamina recovery speed</> will decrease after entering combat; dealing damage can alleviate this negative effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked after reaching level 62.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【深红月冕】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，遭受较近距离敌人时获得<Assistant_Red>移速提高</>并提供自身<Assistant_Red>受伤减免</>，攻击敌人会<Assistant_Red>减速</>敌人，让自己获得<Assistant_Red>增伤</>，并让自身附带<Assistant_Red>减速</>光环，但进入战斗后<Assistant_Red>体力恢复速度</>会降低，造成伤害可以缓解该负面效果。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>等级提升至六十二级后解锁。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Crimson Moon Crown] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Specialized Sealed Artifact \n <Assistant_Title2> Details: </> General-purpose Sealed Artifact. When suffering from enemies at close range, gain <Assistant_Red> Movement Speed increase </> and provide yourself with <Assistant_Red> Damage Reduction </>. Attacking enemies will <Assistant_Red> slow </> them, allowing you to gain <Assistant_Red> Damage Bonus </> and apply a <Assistant_Red> Slowing </> aura to yourself. However, after entering combat, <Assistant_Red> Stamina recovery speed </> will decrease; dealing damage can alleviate this negative effect. \n <Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked after reaching Level 62.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【湖畔的倒影】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>湖边坐着的女子，想以完美的姿态，等待丈夫归来。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(148,197)]|4918;9790;-913;2;5200052;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Reflection by the Lakeside】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The woman sitting by the lake wants to wait for her husband's return in a perfect state.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>65</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town(148,197)]|4918;9790;-913;2;5200052;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【湖边的心愿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>湖边的两个孩子好像正在争吵，去看看发生了什么吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(298,117)]|19748;1655;162;2;5200085;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lakeside Wish】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Two children by the lakeside seem to be arguing. Go and see what is happening.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(298,117)]|19748;1655;162;2;5200085;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【火柴微光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根铁十字街下街传来虚弱的呼喊，似乎是个女孩的声音。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>60级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(763,1244)]|-23665;24457;-2004;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Matchstick Glimmer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </>A weak cry, sounding like a girl's voice, comes from Lower Street on Iron Cross Street in Tingen.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>60</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(763,1244)]|-23665;24457;-2004;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灰雾之上】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>关于这枚古怪的金币，似乎还有别的秘密……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第一天解锁。扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>20级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Above the Gray Fog】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Regarding this strange gold coin, there seem to be other secrets... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the first day of the first season. Automatically accepted after reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 20</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灰雾之上】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>关于这枚古怪的金币，似乎还有别的秘密……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第一天解锁。扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>20级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备、封印物"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Above the Gray Fog】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Regarding this strange gold coin, there seem to be other secrets... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the first day of the first season. Automatically accepted after reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 20</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Sealed Artifact",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灰雾测试充值返还】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>返还概述：</>「灰雾测试」为计费删档测试。测试期间累计充值的金额（含购买金镑、愚者福音、时代恩典、命运馈赠及其他现金付费商品），将在公测后按规则返还，<Assistant_Red>1元=10金镑</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>金镑/绑定金镑返还：</>累计充值<Assistant_Red>0~4000元</>部分，返还120%金镑+50%绑定金镑；超过4000元部分，仅返还120%金镑，不额外赠送绑定金镑。举例：充值5000元，金镑返还60000（5000×10×120%），绑定金镑返还20000（4000×10×50%）。\n<Assistant_Title2>愚者福音返还：</>购买愚者福音的金额计入累计充值，公测后返还愚者福音道具，<Assistant_Red>最多返还2份</>；超过2份的金额仍计入充值总额但不额外返还道具。返还道具需主动使用，使用后获得30天权益，不会再次获得购买时赠送的金镑。\n<Assistant_Title2>时代恩典/命运馈赠返还：</>购买金额同样计入累计充值，公测后返还对应战令道具。若多角色购买多份战令，<Assistant_Red>最多返还1份</>，优先返还更高档位的命运馈赠；其余战令金额仍计入充值总额但不额外返还道具。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>公测后使用同一账号登录对应渠道，创建角色并完成第一章主线任务后，会收到返利邮件通知，前往<Assistant_Property1>廷根</>与NPC<Assistant_Property2>吉福特</>对话领取。返还的道具保存至背包，需主动使用后激活，使用前不会失效。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取期限：</>公测后<Assistant_Red>6个月</>内有效，过期后不再支持领取。同一账号下返利仅可由<Assistant_Red>一名角色领取一次</>，无法跨账号转移。官服充值仅可在官服领取，渠道服充值仅可在渠道服领取。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gray Fog Test Recharge Refund】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Refund Overview: </>\"Gray Fog Test\" is a paid data-wiping test. The total amount recharged during the test (including purchases of Gold Pounds, Fool's Gospel, Era's Grace, Fate's Gift, and other cash-paid items) will be refunded after the official launch according to the rules, <Assistant_Red>1 Yuan = 10 Gold Pounds</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gold Pound/Bound Gold Pound Refund: </>For the cumulative recharge portion of <Assistant_Red>0~4000 Yuan</>, 120% Gold Pounds + 50% Bound Gold Pounds will be refunded; for the portion exceeding 4000 Yuan, only 120% Gold Pounds will be refunded, with no additional Bound Gold Pounds. Example: For a 5000 Yuan recharge, 60000 Gold Pounds (5000×10×120%) and 20000 Bound Gold Pounds (4000×10×50%) will be refunded.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fool's Gospel Refund: </>The amount spent on purchasing Fool's Gospel counts towards the cumulative recharge. After the official launch, Fool's Gospel items will be refunded, <Assistant_Red>up to a maximum of 2 copies</>; amounts exceeding 2 copies still count towards the total recharge but no additional items will be refunded. Refunded items must be actively used to obtain 30 days of benefits; you will not receive the Gold Pounds gifted at the time of purchase again.\n<Assistant_Title2>Era's Grace/Fate's Gift Refund: </>Purchase amounts also count towards the cumulative recharge. After the official launch, corresponding Battle Pass items will be refunded. If multiple characters purchase multiple Battle Passes, <Assistant_Red>a maximum of 1 copy will be refunded</>, prioritizing the higher-tier Fate's Gift; the remaining Battle Pass amounts still count towards the total recharge but no additional items will be refunded.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Claim: </>After the official launch, log in with the same account on the corresponding platform, create a character, and complete the Chapter 1 main quest. You will receive a rebate notification email. Go to <Assistant_Property1>Tingen</> and talk to the NPC <Assistant_Property2>Gifford</> to claim it. Refunded items are saved to the Inventory and must be actively used to activate; they will not expire before use.\n<Assistant_Title2>Claim Deadline: </>Valid within <Assistant_Red>6 months</> after the official launch; claims will not be supported after expiration. Rebates under the same account can only be claimed by <Assistant_Red>one character once</> and cannot be transferred across accounts. Official server recharges can only be claimed on the official server, and platform server recharges can only be claimed on the platform server.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵体之线】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>碰触万物相连的灵体之线，就能与其建立连接，接管其意识，使其成为你的秘偶，被你控制的单位将听从你的指令。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找灵体之线</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【灵体之线】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【灵体之线】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 操控秘偶</>\n到达目标区域后，使用<Assistant_Red>【附身】</>技能控制指定单位，并运用秘偶的能力完成对应挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成挑战</>\n成功完成挑战后，即可开启宝箱并领取奖励\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n开启【附身】后，可以附身的单位上方往往出现<Assistant_Red>【可附身】</>标签提示，注意观察四周~"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【spirit body threads】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>By touching the spirit body threads that connect all things, you can establish a connection with them, take over their consciousness, and make them your marionette. Units controlled by you will obey your commands.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding spirit body threads</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [spirit body threads] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [spirit body threads] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Controlling a Marionette</>\nAfter arriving at the target area, use the <Assistant_Red>[Possession]</> skill to control the designated unit and use the marionette's abilities to complete the corresponding challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Challenge</>\nAfter successfully completing the challenge, you can open the treasure chest and claim your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nAfter activating [Possession], a <Assistant_Red>[Possessable]</> tag will often appear above units that can be possessed; keep an eye on your surroundings~",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵性之跃】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1.功能：</>灵性之跃可帮助你到达普通跳跃无法抵达的高处。\n<Assistant_Title2>2.操作：</>探索过程中，长按跳跃键进入灵性之跃状态，再次点击跳跃键即可跃至更高处。\n<Assistant_Title2>3.适用场景：</>常用于探索高台、跨越障碍或前往隐藏区域。\n<Assistant_Title1>【温馨提示】</>\n部分探索点需要结合灵性之跃才能到达~"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Leap of Spirituality】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Function: </>Leap of Spirituality helps you reach high places that normal jumps cannot reach. \n<Assistant_Title2>2. Operation: </>During exploration, long-press the jump button to enter the Leap of Spirituality state, then tap the jump button again to leap to a higher position. \n<Assistant_Title2>3. Applicable Scenarios: </>Commonly used for exploring high platforms, crossing obstacles, or reaching hidden areas. \n<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Tips】</>\nSome exploration points require the use of Leap of Spirituality to reach~",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵界浮蝶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得灵界浮蝶，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit World Floating Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Spirit World Floating Butterfly. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵视】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1.功能：</>灵视可帮助你发现探索过程中隐藏的重要信息，包括宝箱、任务线索及可交互的解谜点。\n<Assistant_Title2>2.操作：</>探索过程中，点击灵视按钮即可进入灵视状态。\n<Assistant_Title2>3.适用场景：</>探索地图、寻找宝箱、追踪任务目标或解开场景机关时，都可以使用灵视辅助探索。\n<Assistant_Title1>【温馨提示】</>\n遇到找不到目标、无法继续探索或怀疑附近存在隐藏内容时，不妨开启灵视查看周围环境。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit Vision】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Function: </>Spirit Vision helps you discover important hidden information during exploration, including treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points. \n<Assistant_Title2>2. Operation: </>During exploration, tap the Spirit Vision button to enter the Spirit Vision state. \n<Assistant_Title2>3. Applicable Scenarios: </>You can use Spirit Vision to assist exploration when exploring maps, searching for treasure chests, tracking quest targets, or solving environmental mechanisms. \n<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Tips】</>\nIf you encounter trouble finding targets, cannot continue exploring, or suspect hidden content nearby, try activating Spirit Vision to check the surrounding environment.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【烈日沙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得烈日沙套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blazing Sun Sand】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blazing Sun Sand set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【烟囱里的孩子】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂附近传来醉汉的责骂声和孩子的哭声，发生了什么事？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(974,1173)]|-2552;17366;-1828;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Child in the Chimney】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Variety</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Drunken scolding and a child's crying are coming from near the factory. What happened?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, go to {Location:[Tingen(974,1173)]|-2552;17366;-1828;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【热心演员】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>拉姆德小镇的车站上有人叫卖，会捡到好东西吗？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>66级</>后，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(17,363)]|-8170;26423;1601;2;5200130;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Enthusiastic Actor】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Someone is hawking goods at the Lamud Small Town station. Will you find anything good?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 66</>, head to {Location:[Lamud Castle(17,363)]|-8170;26423;1601;2;5200130;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【焕然衣新】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得焕然衣新套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fresh Look】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation outfit.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain the Fresh Look outfit after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【爱的方向】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(904,1070)]|-9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0}与<Assistant_Red>霍普</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Direction of Love】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location:[Tingen(904,1070)]|-9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Hope </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards: </> Cognition EXP, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【爱的方向】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(904,1070)]|-9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0}与<Assistant_Red>霍普</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Direction of Love】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> Advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location: [Tingen (904,1070)] | -9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0 } and speak with <Assistant_Red>Hope</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards: </> Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·剧中】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·剧中，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - In Play] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - In Play; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·毒藤】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·毒藤，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - Poison Ivy] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - Poison Ivy; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·烈日】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·烈日，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤200次解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Special Cut: Blazing Sun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Hairstyle\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Special Cut: Blazing Sun. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Unlock by accumulating 200 Summons in the Astral Spirit Costume Summon.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【特剪·烈日】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得特剪·烈日，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装累计召唤解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - Scorching Sun] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - Scorching Sun; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【狙击枪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>能力特征：</>狙击枪的射程远，单发伤害高，但射击间隔较长，对瞄准有一定要求。\n狙击枪开启瞄准后，可借助多倍瞄准镜查看远处的情况，此状态下<Assistant_Property1>射击弱点</>，可造成<Assistant_Property1>高额伤害</>。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[瞄准射击]|903},{SendAnswer:[射击弱点]|902}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sniper Rifle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>Sniper rifles have a long range and high single-shot damage, but the shooting interval is long, and there are certain requirements for aiming.\nAfter turning on the scope, you can use the multi-magnification scope to view distant situations. In this state, <Assistant_Property1>Shooting Weak Points</> can cause <Assistant_Property1>high damage</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Aiming Shot]|903}, {SendAnswer:[Shooting Weak Points]|902}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【猎城战】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>猎城战</>是势力战中的<Assistant_Red>1000人</>大战场。战场资格会在每轮四方联赛第一场结束后<Assistant_Red>21:00</>分配，系统会根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战。获得资格的俱乐部成员，可在<Assistant_System>以战养战-势力-猎城战</>界面查看赛程安排。同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Assistant_Red>16人</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>第一阶段：</>从己方<Assistant_Property1>要塞</>出发，沿着<Assistant_Property1>前哨</>、<Assistant_Property1>营地</>推进；占领营地后即可攻击相连接的<Assistant_Property1>战争石碑</>。需要占领和己方营地相连的两处石碑，方可攻击<Assistant_Property1>王城城门</>；己方石碑被敌方攻占后，会失去攻击城门的资格。\n<Assistant_Title2>第二阶段：</>王城城门被攻破后，可前往中央平台占领王城。平台上人数最多的势力将积累<Assistant_Property1>占领值</>；在中央平台击杀敌方势力的非凡者，也可为己方势力增加占领值。占领值达到<Assistant_Red>100%</>时，即占领王城。占领中央王城可直接结束战场，并获得最后赢家奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>战场特色：</>可在己方要塞乘坐<Assistant_Property1>蒸汽火车</>快速到达前方营地，攻击城门时可使用<Assistant_Property1>攻城车</>。<Assistant_Property1>战争巨龙</>会盘踞在中央王城，并在战斗中现身。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往猎城战]|1250322}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hunting City Battle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </><Assistant_System>Hunting City Battle</> is a <Assistant_Red>1000-player</> large-scale battlefield within the Faction War. Battlefield eligibility is assigned at <Assistant_Red>21:00</> after the first match of the Four-Way League each round. The system will assign clubs to either the Hunting City Battle or the Plateau Battle based on their overall strength. Members of eligible clubs can view the schedule in the <Assistant_System>War-for-War - Faction - Hunting City Battle</> interface. A single club can field a maximum of <Assistant_Red>16 people</> per Pathway. \n<Assistant_Title2>Phase 1: </>Depart from your own <Assistant_Property1>Stronghold</> and advance along the <Assistant_Property1>Outposts</> and <Assistant_Property1>Camps</>; after occupying a camp, you can attack the connected <Assistant_Property1>War Stele</>. You must occupy two steles connected to your camp to attack the <Assistant_Property1>Royal City Gate</>; if your stele is captured by the enemy, you will lose the eligibility to attack the gate. \n<Assistant_Title2>Phase 2: </>Once the Royal City Gate is breached, you can head to the central platform to occupy the Royal City. The faction with the most people on the platform will accumulate <Assistant_Property1>Occupation Value</>; killing enemy Beyonders on the central platform will also increase your faction's Occupation Value. When the Occupation Value reaches <Assistant_Red>100%</>, the Royal City is occupied. Occupying the central Royal City immediately ends the battlefield and grants the final winner's rewards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Battlefield Features: </>You can take a <Assistant_Property1>Steam Train</> from your stronghold to quickly reach the forward camps, and use <Assistant_Property1>Siege Engines</> when attacking the gate. <Assistant_Property1>War Dragons</> will lurk in the central Royal City and appear during the battle. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Hunting City Battle]|1250322}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【猎龙奇谭】</>  \n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>那边的人……好像有点眼熟？他看上去遇到了什么麻烦？ \n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第五章《廷根守护者》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>62级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(927,700)]|-7360;-29730;-1330;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dragon Hunter Tales】</> \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Variety</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>That person over there... he looks a bit familiar? Does he seem to be in some kind of trouble? \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 5 \"Tingen Guardian\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>62</>, then go to {Location:[Tingen(927,700)]|-7360;-29730;-1330;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【玫瑰藤杖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得玫瑰藤杖，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Vine Staff】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Rose Vine Staff. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【玫色星心·头部】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得玫色星心·头部，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Star Heart - Head】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Rose Star Heart - Head. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【玫色星心·手腕】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得玫色星心·手腕，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Star Heart - Wrist】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Rose Star Heart - Wrist. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【理智值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>加入<Assistant_System>安魂诗社</>的玩家可对其他玩家使用的特殊治疗行为，用于回复目标玩家的理智值。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>触发条件：</>目标玩家的理智值<Assistant_System>低于一定数值</>时，方可对其发起安魂。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>成功率机制：</>安魂的<Assistant_System>治疗成功率</>由两项因素共同决定——安魂者所在<Assistant_System>社团的等级</>，以及被安魂者当前的<Assistant_System>理智值高低</>。社团等级越高、对方理智值越高，安魂成功的概率也越高。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>失败风险：</>安魂并非没有风险——<Assistant_System>若安魂失败</>，参与双方的理智值均有概率受到波动，产生一定损耗。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sanity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Term Introduction: </>A special healing action that players who have joined the <Assistant_System>Requiem Poetry Society </> can use on other players to restore the target player's Sanity. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Trigger Condition: </>The target player's Sanity must be <Assistant_System>below a certain value </> before a Requiem can be initiated. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Success Rate Mechanism: </>The <Assistant_System>healing success rate </> of a Requiem is determined by two factors: the level of the <Assistant_System>Society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Assistant_System>Sanity </> level of the person receiving the Requiem. The higher the Society level and the higher the target's Sanity, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Failure Risk: </>A Requiem is not without risk—<Assistant_System>if the Requiem fails, </> both participants have a chance to experience Sanity fluctuations, resulting in a certain amount of loss.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【理智值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n<Assistant_Title2>理智值档位：</> 理智值分为以下档位，不同档位有不同效果：\n理智值充足时，角色处于<Assistant_System>「心智锚定」（100-80）</>状态，体力消耗下降且减伤提升；降至正常水平则进入<Assistant_System>「清醒」（60-79）</>状态，该状态没有任何效果。\n\n随着理智值进一步下降，角色依次进入<Assistant_System>「心神不宁」（45-59）「自我存疑」（30-44）「低语缠身」（20-29）</>状态，行动速度与冲刺稳定性受到不同程度的削弱，周遭将出现呓语干扰。\n\n当理智值降至较低区间，角色进入<Assistant_System>「陷入疯狂」（10-19）</>状态，行动限制完全解除，伤害与受到伤害均有所提升。\n\n理智值跌至更低时，角色进入<Assistant_System>「失控边缘」（1-9）</>状态，<Assistant_System>伤害提升</>，但受到伤害同步增加，且受到的治疗效果降低，自身发出红光，视野变得疯狂。\n\n当理智值为0，并持续一定时间时，会有<Assistant_Red>恐怖</>的事情发生！"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sanity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Term Introduction: </>When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause fluctuations in the player's Sanity. As Sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the Etheric Body, Astral Body, Mental Body, and Spirit Body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence, producing corresponding effects. \n<Assistant_Title2>Sanity Tiers: </> Sanity is divided into the following tiers, each with different effects: \nWhen Sanity is sufficient, the character is in the <Assistant_System>\"Mental Anchor\" (100-80) </> state, where stamina consumption is reduced and damage reduction is increased; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Sober\" (60-79) </> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Sanity decreases further, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Restlessness\" (45-59), \"Self-Doubt\" (30-44), and \"Whispers Haunting\" (20-29) </> states in sequence. Movement speed and sprint stability are weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to a lower range, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Falling into Madness\" (10-19) </> state, where movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage taken are increased. \n\nWhen Sanity drops even lower, the character enters the <Assistant_System>\"Edge of Loss of Control\" (1-9) </> state, where <Assistant_System>Damage Increase </> is active, but damage taken is simultaneously increased, healing effects received are reduced, the character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\nWhen Sanity reaches 0 and remains there for a certain period, <Assistant_Red>terrifying </> things will happen!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【甜狒萌意】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售武器外观\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得甜狒萌意，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-武器</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sweet Baboon Cuteness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Weapon Appearance\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Sweet Baboon Cuteness. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Weapon</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【生命手杖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，战斗外一段时间站立不动，会在脚下生成活化区域，持续造成少量治疗效果，同时每隔一定时间会获得<Assistant_Red>生命能量</>，在生命值不满或受到伤害时消耗<Assistant_Red>生命能量</>，为自身恢复生命值，消耗生命能量会累积<Assistant_Red>异变</>，降低自身移动速度和防御。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>等级提升至六十二级后解锁。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Life Cane】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Standing still for a period outside of combat generates an activation zone at your feet, continuously causing minor healing effects. At the same time, you gain <Assistant_Red>Life Energy</> at regular intervals. When health is not full or you take damage, it consumes <Assistant_Red>Life Energy</> to restore your own health. Consuming Life Energy accumulates <Assistant_Red>Mutation</>, reducing your movement speed and defense.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked after reaching level 62.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【生命手杖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，携带者每隔一定时间会获得<Assistant_Red>生命能量</>，在为友方治疗一定生命值后会消耗<Assistant_Red>生命能量</>，为目标施加持续回血效果并获得1枚<Assistant_Red>生命之种</>，在受到伤害且血量较低时会自动消耗<Assistant_Red>生命之种</>恢复生命，消耗生命能量会累积<Assistant_Red>异变</>，降低自身移动速度和防御。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>等级提升至六十二级后解锁。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Life Cane】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. The holder gains <Assistant_Red>Life Energy</> every certain period. After healing allies for a certain amount of health, it consumes <Assistant_Red>Life Energy</> to apply a continuous healing effect to the target and gain 1 <Assistant_Red>Seed of Life</>. When taking damage and health is low, it automatically consumes a <Assistant_Red>Seed of Life</> to restore health. Consuming Life Energy accumulates <Assistant_Red>Mutation</>, reducing your movement speed and defense.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked after reaching level 62.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【生气】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Angry】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【生物毒素瓶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，受到近距离敌人攻击时概率给攻击者施加<Assistant_Red>麻痹毒素</>、<Assistant_Red>虚弱毒素</>、<Assistant_Red>疲劳毒素</>，叠满后可触发<Assistant_Red>滞涩</>、<Assistant_Red>沉默</>或<Assistant_Red>减速</>；佩戴足够时间后死亡会留下<Assistant_Red>毒池</>，<Assistant_Red>禁锢</>并持续给范围内敌人施加毒素；战斗中持有者会周期性染上随机毒素，对攻击者染毒时会优先传递自身承受的毒素。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Biological Toxin Bottle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. When attacked by a close-range enemy, there is a chance to apply <Assistant_Red>Paralytic Toxin</>, <Assistant_Red>Weakening Toxin</>, or <Assistant_Red>Fatigue Toxin</> to the attacker. Once fully stacked, it can trigger <Assistant_Red>Stagnation</>, <Assistant_Red>Silence</>, or <Assistant_Red>Slow</>. Dying after wearing it for a sufficient time leaves behind a <Assistant_Red>Poison Pool</>, which <Assistant_Red>Imprisons</> and continuously applies toxins to enemies in range. During combat, the holder will periodically be infected with random toxins; when infecting an attacker, the holder's own toxins are prioritized.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained as a selectable Sealed Artifact reward at the Earl I rank in the ladder.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【略懂拳脚】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(684,1204)]|-31529;20429;-2274;2;5200002;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Slightly Skilled in Martial Arts】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On the streets of Tingen, an old man is slowly sweeping the floor. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location:[Tingen(684,1204)]|-31529;20429;-2274;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【略懂拳脚】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(684,1204)]|-31529;20429;-2274;2;5200002;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Slightly Skilled in Combat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On the streets of Tingen, an old man is slowly sweeping the floor. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking to cause trouble...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Promote to Sequence 8 and head to {Location:[Tingen(684,1204)]|-31529;20429;-2274;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【疯狂园丁】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得疯狂园丁套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mad Gardener】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for Connections gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Mad Gardener set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Memory Chests in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【白崖冬夜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得白崖冬夜套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【White Cliff Winter Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the White Cliff Winter Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【百里挑蛋】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>广场上人头攒动，似乎在举办什么热闹的活动。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[One in a Hundred Eggs]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The square is bustling with people; it seems some lively event is being held.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sols, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【盛放的等待】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得盛放的等待，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blooming Waiting】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Gallery Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Blooming Waiting. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Gallery</> collection progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【盛装舞步】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>家族时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得盛装舞步套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-家族</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Grand Waltz】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Family Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Grand Waltz set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Family</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【真视水晶球】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得真视水晶球，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【True Sight Crystal Ball】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the True Sight Crystal Ball. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【睡莲小镇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>临水而建的宁静聚落，一切迹象似乎与睡莲仙女的秘密有关……\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301092}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301097}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301098}  {JumpToUI:风尚沙龙|1301911}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301096}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301090}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301961}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代百态|1302435}  {JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302436}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302437}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Water Lily Town]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction: </>A tranquil settlement built by the water. All signs seem to be related to the secret of the Water Lily Fairy...\n<Assistant_Title2>[Order World]:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Moments from the Original Work:</>\n{JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1301092}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301097} {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301098} {JumpToUI:Fashion Salon|1301911} {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301096} {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301090} {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301961}\n<Assistant_Title2>[Era Quests]:</>\n{JumpToUI:Life in the Era|1302435} {JumpToUI:Era Anecdotes|1302436} {JumpToUI:Roleplay Story|1302437}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【睡莲镇漫游指南】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>睡莲小镇欢迎你。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0}，<Assistant_Red>翻阅笔记</>接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Water Lily Town welcomes you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town (134, -14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red>read the notes</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【瞄准射击】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>功能介绍：</>所有枪械均可开启瞄准状态，开启方式为使用技能栏的对应技能，再次使用对应技能可退出瞄准状态。\n<Assistant_Red>请注意</>：<Assistant_Red>手枪</>和<Assistant_Red>狙击枪</>在<Assistant_Red>瞄准状态</>下可命中弱点，造成高额伤害，<Assistant_Property1>霰弹枪</>瞄准状态下不具备该特性。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[射击弱点]|902}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Aiming Shot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Function Introduction: </> All firearms can enter an aiming state. To activate, use the corresponding skill in the skill bar; use the skill again to exit the aiming state. \n<Assistant_Red> Please Note </>: <Assistant_Red>Pistols</> and <Assistant_Red>Sniper Rifles</> can hit weak points in the <Assistant_Red>Aiming State</>, dealing high damage; <Assistant_Property1>Shotguns</> do not possess this trait in the aiming state. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Shoot Weak Points]|902}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【瞭望者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得瞭望者，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Watcher】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Watcher. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【知识所扮演的】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>是知识扮演了我，还是我扮演了知识？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(1144,1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>杂乱的书堆</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【What Knowledge Acts Out】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Is it knowledge that acts as me, or am I acting as knowledge?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen(1144,1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}, and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Cluttered Pile of Books</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【知识所扮演的】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>是知识扮演了我，还是我扮演了知识？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(1144,1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>杂乱的书堆</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Acted by Knowledge】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Did Knowledge act as me, or did I act as Knowledge?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen (1144, 1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}, and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Messy Pile of Books</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【知识过载】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得知识过载，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Knowledge Overload】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain Knowledge Overload. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【礼金 - 金镑礼金】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>2级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</>在<Assistant_System>聊天 - 对应频道右下角 - 礼金按钮</>可以发放不同频道的礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>发放频道：</>在队伍/团队频道、俱乐部频道、语音房间内，可以发放对应金镑礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>广播礼金：</>使用心羽·神谕广播和迅电·神谕广播，可以发送全服跑马灯广播，并附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。\n<Assistant_Title2>礼金消耗：</>消耗非绑金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金。\n<Assistant_Title2>运势礼金：</>无密钥，其他玩家可以直接领取，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>密语礼金：</>需要语音输入正确的密语才可以领取礼金，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>密钥礼金：</>需要输入正确的密码才可以领取礼金，领取后获得随机数额的绑定金镑奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gift Money - Gold Pound Gift Money】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>2</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Chat - bottom right of the corresponding channel - Gift Money button</>, you can distribute gift money in different channels.\n<Assistant_Title2>Distribution Channels: </>You can distribute corresponding Gold Pound gift money in Team/Group channels, Club channels, and voice rooms.\n<Assistant_Title2>Broadcast Gift Money: </>Use Heart Feather Oracle Broadcast and Lightning Oracle Broadcast to send server-wide marquee broadcasts, with half the value of Bound Gold Pound gift money for the World channel attached.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gift Money Consumption: </>Consuming non-bound Gold Pounds allows you to send Bound Gold Pound gift money; claiming gift money grants equivalent Bound Gold Pounds. 24 hours after Bound Gold Pound gift money is sent, unclaimed gift money will be returned as equivalent Bound Gold Pounds.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fortune Gift Money: </>No key required, other players can claim it directly, and after claiming, they will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Whisper Gift Money: </>Requires voice input of the correct whisper to claim the gift money, and after claiming, you will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Key Gift Money: </>Requires entering the correct password to claim the gift money, and after claiming, you will receive a random amount of Bound Gold Pound rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交·喝咖啡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>每周玩法奖励动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得社交·喝咖啡，可点击<Assistant_System>动作表情</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店</>使用发票单据兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Drinking Coffee】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Drinking Coffee. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交·炫富】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>每周玩法奖励动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得社交·炫富，可点击<Assistant_System>动作表情</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店</>使用发票单据兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social·Showing Off Wealth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Weekly Gameplay Reward Action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Social·Showing Off Wealth. You can click <Assistant_System>Action Emotes</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop-General Merchandise-Reimbursement Shop</> using invoice receipts to redeem",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交动作】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>HUD - 动作按钮</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250058}\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>点击动作图标，即可打开社交动作界面，点击单人动作、双人动作、表情即可使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取途径：</>可在<Assistant_System>外观 - 周边 - 动作</>处进行预览，查看获取途径。也可在社交动作面板，点击未解锁的动作图标，查看获取途径。\n<Assistant_Title2>san值影响：</>大部分动作在使用后，会对san值产生影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>双人动作：</>选中目标玩家点击双人动作，会向对方发起邀请，对方接受后即可共同表演双人动作。<Assistant_Red>注意：双人动作双方需在一定距离范围内才可发起，距离过远将提示无法发起。</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social Actions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System>HUD - Action Button</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250058}\n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </>Click the action icon to open the social action interface, then click on single-player actions, two-player actions, or emotes to use them.\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Methods: </>You can preview them in <Assistant_System>Appearance - Surroundings - Actions</> to see how to obtain them. You can also click on locked action icons in the social action panel to view acquisition methods.\n<Assistant_Title2> Sanity Impact: </>Most actions will affect your sanity after use.\n<Assistant_Title2> Two-Player Actions: </>Select a target player and click a two-player action to send an invitation. Once accepted, you can perform the action together.<Assistant_Red> Note: Both parties must be within a certain distance to initiate a two-player action; if the distance is too far, you will be prompted that it cannot be initiated.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【社交赠礼】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</>在<Assistant_System>商场 - 形象铭刻 - 社交人气</>中可以消耗绑定金镑和非绑金镑，购买社交礼物，赠送给好友或其他玩家。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>好友私聊 - 右下角赠礼</>可以赠送好友度礼物，赠送后会增加双方好友度。\n<Assistant_Title2>个人主页赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>个人主页 - 右下角赠礼</>可以赠送主页礼物，赠送后会增加对方的个人主页名望值。若双方是好友关系，则会额外增加好友度。\n<Assistant_Title2>语音房赠礼：</>在<Assistant_System>语音房 - 点击玩家头像 - 语音房赠礼</>可以赠送语音房礼物，赠送后会增加当前语音房间热度和对方的个人主页名望值。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social Gifts】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity</>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to give to friends or other players.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Friend Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send friendship gifts, which will increase the friendship level between both parties.\n<Assistant_Title2>Personal Homepage Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send homepage gifts, which will increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If both parties are friends, it will additionally increase the friendship level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Voice Room Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gift</>, you can send voice room gifts, which will increase the current voice room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friend-Friendship]|1410}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【祖宅的痕迹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(125,162)]|2584;6213;-592;2;5200052;0}，与<Assistant_Red>塞西</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Traces of the Ancestral Home】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old house emits strange noises every night; its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town(125,162)]|2584;6213;-592;2;5200052;0}, and talk to <Assistant_Red> Cecile </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【祖宅的痕迹】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(125,162)]|2584;6213;-592;2;5200052;0}，与<Assistant_Red>塞西</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Traces of the Ancestral Home】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old house emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After advancing to Sequence 8, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town (125,162)]|2584;6213;-592;2;5200052;0} and speak with <Assistant_Red>Thomas</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【神圣毒药】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>近日，廷根出现了一种名叫“焦糖炸弹”的饮品，不知道会是什么风味？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1216,829)]|21803.619;-17065.75;-2244;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sacred Poison】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recently, a drink called \"Caramel Bomb\" has appeared in Tingen. I wonder what it tastes like?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1216,829)]|21803.619;-17065.75;-2244;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soles, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【神座之争】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>神座之争</>是<Assistant_Red>6对6激情对战</>玩法，最多可组成<Assistant_Red>6人队伍</>参与匹配。玩法内所有玩家采用与玩法外相同的真实属性进行战斗。\n<Assistant_Title2>获胜条件：</>限时内击败敌方队伍内所有玩家即可获胜。若对局时间结束时双方队伍均有成员存活，则依次按照<Assistant_Property1>击败人数</>、<Assistant_Property1>存活人数</>、<Assistant_Property1>伤害总量</>、<Assistant_Property1>存活血量</>判定，数值较高的一方获胜。\n<Assistant_Title2>复活规则：</>在神座之争中，每个队伍拥有<Assistant_Red>2次</>复活死亡队友的机会。\n<Assistant_Title2>开放时间：</>玩法入口显示开放时间为<Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往神座之争]|1250123}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Battle for the Throne of God】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </><Assistant_System>Battle for the Throne of God</> is a <Assistant_Red>6v6 intense battle</> mode, where you can form a team of up to <Assistant_Red>6 people</> to participate in matchmaking. All players in this mode use the same real attributes as outside the mode. \n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Conditions: </>Defeat all players on the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the time ends, the winner is determined in order by <Assistant_Property1>number of kills</>, <Assistant_Property1>number of survivors</>, <Assistant_Property1>total damage dealt</>, and <Assistant_Property1>remaining HP</>, with the higher value winning. \n<Assistant_Title2>Resurrection Rules: </>In the Battle for the Throne of God, each team has <Assistant_Red>2 opportunities</> to resurrect fallen teammates. \n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Hours: </>The gameplay entrance displays the opening hours as <Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Battle for the Throne of God]|1250123}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【神灯之冠】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得神灯之冠，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Genie's Crown】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for World Adventure gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Genie's Crown. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【神秘硬皮笔记】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得神秘硬皮笔记，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysterious Hardcover Notebook】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Store Direct Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After purchasing from the store, obtain the Mysterious Hardcover Notebook; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【种在昨日的南瓜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>金秋湖畔有位失忆的年迈旅人，正在寻找自己散落的记忆。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(292,91)]|19279;-891;108;2;5200085;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度、金秋湖大南瓜"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pumpkins Planted Yesterday】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdotes</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is an elderly traveler with amnesia by Golden Autumn Lake, searching for their scattered memories. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, go to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake (292,91)]|19279;-891;108;2;5200085;0} to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Golden Autumn Lake Giant Pumpkin",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【秘偶熊背包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得秘偶熊背包，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-乌托邦剧院</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Marionette Bear Backpack】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Dungeon drop accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Marionette Bear Backpack; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon-Utopia Theater</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【秘藏学者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得秘藏学者套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hidden Scholar】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Hidden Scholar set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【穹星】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷翅膀\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得穹星，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装-翅膀</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dome Star】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Wings\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Dome Star. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit - Wings</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Goddess's Gift Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【窥秘人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Pryer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【窥秘人时装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>序列晋升奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得窥秘人时装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过签到获取限时时装，后可通过<Assistant_System>序列晋升</>获取永久时装"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Pryer Outfit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Sequence Advancement Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Mystery Pryer Outfit set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain limited-time outfit via check-in, then obtain permanent outfit via <Assistant_System>Sequence advancement</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【窥秘的角落】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>黑荆棘事件簿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Property1>19级</>后，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-黑荆棘事件簿-窥秘的角落</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与人数：</>5~6人组队，或选择人机模式前往。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>35装等金色装备、非凡物质等。每日1次奖励次数<Assistant_Red>（黑荆棘事件簿共享奖励次数）</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领攻略：</>{JumpToUI:[卡尔·埃德加]|1302139}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【A Corner of Mysteries】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Book</>\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </>After reaching <Assistant_Property1>Level 19</>, Beyonders can click <Assistant_System>Menu-World Adventure-Dungeon-Blackthorn Incident Book-A Corner of Mysteries</> to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2> Number of Participants: </>5~6 person team, or choose AI mode.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </>Level 35 Gold Equipment, Beyonder materials, etc. 1 reward count per day<Assistant_Red> (shared reward count for Blackthorn Incident Book)</>.\n<Assistant_Title2> Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[Karl Edgar]|1302139}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【竞技事件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>竞技事件包含资源争夺与追逐竞速等玩法。与其他玩家同场竞技，根据最终排名获得对应奖励\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>\n1.完成指定前置剧情事件。\n2.每日固定时间开启。\n<Assistant_Title2>助手建议：</>\n1.建议提前关注开启时间。\n2.竞技挑战拥有名次奖励，名次排行越高，获得奖励越丰厚。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Competition Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Competition Events include modes such as Resource Contention and Racing. Compete in the same arena with other players and receive rewards based on your final ranking. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Opens at fixed times daily. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. It is recommended to pay attention to the opening times in advance. \n2. Competition challenges have ranking rewards; the higher your rank, the more generous the rewards.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【童话茶会】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得童话茶会套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fairy Tale Tea Party】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Fairy Tale Tea Party outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第一次正式委托】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>新的一天，新的工作，从一套新衣服开始！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第七天解锁。完成原著剧情第四章《成为非凡者》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【First Official Commission】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A new day, a new job, starting with a new set of clothes!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the seventh day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 4 of the original story, \"Becoming a Beyonder,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>61</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第七小组制服】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>主线奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得第七小组制服套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>剧情</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Seventh Group Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Main Quest Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Seventh Group Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Plot</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第九军装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得第九军装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ninth Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ninth Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第十二个】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>暴风雪将至，一个自称向导的人，知道下山的捷径……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯山脉(294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0}与<Assistant_Red>男子</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Twelfth】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A blizzard is approaching, and a man claiming to be a guide knows a shortcut down the mountain...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range (294,449)]|19910;34435;652;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>man</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【等待戈多】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我们走吧。我们不能。我们在等待戈多。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}与<Assistant_Red>艾斯特</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type:</><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description:</>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 65</>, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town (170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0} and speak with <Assistant_Red>Ester</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【繁花一隅】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得繁花一隅，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【A Corner of Flowers】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain A Corner of Flowers. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【终末猎杀】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>终末猎杀</>是发生在<Assistant_Property1>猎龙之城</>的野外<Assistant_Red>500人混战</>玩法。你可以击败超凡生物或敌对玩家，获得<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>与段位胜点。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>将<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>提交给<Assistant_System>猎杀管家</>，推进猎杀进度并解锁阶段奖励。猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效，离开后将自动失效并清除。\n<Assistant_Title2>猎杀时刻：</>玩法全天开放；每日<Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</>为猎杀时刻，周六、周日额外开放<Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>。猎杀时刻期间，击杀或被击杀时涉及的段位胜点数量翻倍。\n<Assistant_Title2>王城事件：</>每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启10分钟后，即<Assistant_Red>19:10</>，王城中心刷新巨龙·投影；除周五晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始10分钟后刷新王城守卫者。\n<Assistant_Title2>团队结算：</>击杀者及最多29名符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与奖励结算。猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配，余数优先分配给击杀者1个，其余在其他参与者中随机分配。\n<Assistant_Title2>掠夺规则：</>玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高500个，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<Assistant_Title2>段位规则：</>段位低于<Assistant_Red>伯爵1阶</>时，被击杀不会损失段位胜点。每日01:00—08:00及短时间内重复击杀同一目标时，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点将按规则衰减。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往终末猎杀]|1250342}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Final Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Final Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>City of Dragon Hunting</> open-world <Assistant_Red>500-player melee</> mode. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</> Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunt progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting; they will automatically expire and be cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</> The mode is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the number of Rank Points involved in kills or deaths is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</> 10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., at <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, a Dragon - Projection will spawn in the center of the Royal City; outside of the Friday night session, a Royal City Guardian will spawn 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</> The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist criteria participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among participants, with the remainder given to the killer first, and the rest distributed randomly among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</> The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder percentage increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</> When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points upon being killed. Rank Points gained from killing players will decay according to the rules between 01:00—08:00 daily and when killing the same target repeatedly within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Final Hunt]|1250342}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绒绒兔耳朵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>组队玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得绒绒兔耳朵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-同行商店</>使用同行纹章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Rabbit Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Rabbit Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绒绒折兔耳】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得绒绒折兔耳，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Folded Rabbit Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Fluffy Folded Rabbit Ears. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绒绒熊耳朵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得绒绒熊耳朵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Bear Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Bear Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绒绒狗耳朵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>组队玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得绒绒狗耳朵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-同行商店</>使用同行纹章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Dog Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Dog Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【结社之辉】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>效果说明：</>位于<Assistant_System>俱乐部场景</>中时，基于<Assistant_Property1>魅力、直觉</>的检定投骰结果<Assistant_Red>+1</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>适用时间：</>常驻适用，<Assistant_Red>每周六、周日19:30~21:00</>期间，结社之辉获得效果强化。\n<Assistant_Title2>效果强化：</>效果强化期间，位于<Assistant_System>俱乐部场景</>中时，基于<Assistant_Property1>魅力、直觉</>的检定投骰结果<Assistant_Red>+3</>，参与<Assistant_System>教团玩法</>后，可获得<Assistant_Property1>战斗属性增益</>。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Radiance of the Organization】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Effect Description: </>When located in the <Assistant_System>Club</> scene, gain +1 <Assistant_Red> to dice roll results for checks based on <Assistant_Property1>Charisma and Intuition</>. </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Applicable Time: </>Always active; <Assistant_Red>during 19:30~21:00 every Saturday and Sunday, </>the Radiance of the Organization effect receives Strengthening. \n<Assistant_Title2>Strengthening Effect: </>During the Strengthening period, when located in the <Assistant_System>Club</> scene, gain +3 <Assistant_Red> to dice roll results for checks based on <Assistant_Property1>Charisma and Intuition</>, and after participating in <Assistant_System>Cult gameplay</>, you can obtain <Assistant_Property1>combat attribute bonuses</>.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绿华】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本倾向封印物，生命未满且处于安全血线以上时持续恢复已损失生命值，满血时转而治疗附近血量最低的队友；持有<Assistant_Red>护盾</>时会持续减少护盾值，且非凡物质指定位置的词条属性不生效。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>原著线第二章获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Green Bloom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A dungeon-oriented Sealed Artifact. When health is not full but above the safe threshold, it continuously restores lost health; when at full health, it instead heals the nearby teammate with the lowest health. While holding a <Assistant_Red>shield</>, the shield value will continuously decrease, and the entry attributes of Beyonder materials at specified positions will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained in Chapter 2 of the original storyline.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绿华】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本倾向封印物，生命未满且处于安全血线以上时持续恢复已损失生命值，满血时转而治疗附近血量最低的队友；持有<Assistant_Red>护盾</>时会持续减少护盾值，且非凡物质指定位置的词条属性不生效。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>完成任务-原著-意外的访客获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Green Bloom】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A dungeon-oriented Sealed Artifact. When health is not full and above a safe threshold, it continuously restores lost health. When at full health, it instead heals the nearby teammate with the lowest health. While holding a <Assistant_Red>Shield</>, the shield value will continuously decrease, and the trait attributes at the specified Beyonder material position will not take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained by completing Quest - Original Work - Unexpected Visitor.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绿宝石戒指】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得绿宝石戒指，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Emerald Ring】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Emerald Ring. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绿野之旅】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得绿野之旅套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Green Field Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Green Field Journey outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【缔约礼堂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷展台\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得缔约礼堂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-灵幻祭坛商店</>中使用灵幻牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Hall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Showcase\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Covenant Hall. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Showcase</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Spirit Illusion Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Spirit Illusion Altar Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我和你在一起，就是“最佳搭档”。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成支线剧情《美梦成真（上）》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>42级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、夜莺银哨、圣洁道袍"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Holy Robe",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我和你在一起，就是“最佳搭档”。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成支线剧情《美梦成真（上）》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>42级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、夜莺银哨、装备、肩饰、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Equipment, Shoulder Accessory, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>角落里落灰的礼物盒，不知珍藏着谁的心意……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>28级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A dusty gift box in the corner, holding someone's hidden feelings...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>28</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>角落里落灰的礼物盒，不知珍藏着谁的心意……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>28级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、解读护符"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A dusty gift box in the corner, holding someone's hidden feelings...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>28</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Interpretation Charm",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【聊天-表情包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天-输入框旁表情按钮</>\n<Assistant_Title2>表情包：</>包含emoji表情、系统表情和自定义表情。\n<Assistant_Title2>上传自定义表情：</>在自定义表情页签，点击+按钮，可以自行上传自定义表情，审核通过后即可使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>自定义表情上限：</>自定义表情上限为50个。\n<Assistant_Title2>表情同步：</>同一个账号下的不同角色，默认同步所有表情包。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[聊天]|1413}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chat - Emoticons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat - Emoticon button next to input box</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticons: </>Includes emojis, system emoticons, and custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Upload Custom Emoticons: </>In the Custom Emoticons tab, click the + button to upload your own; they can be used after approval. \n<Assistant_Title2>Custom Emoticon Limit: </>Limit is 50 custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticon Sync: </>All characters under the same account sync all emoticons by default. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat]|1413}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【聊天】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>HUD左下角-聊天</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天频道：</>可在左侧列表切换不同的频道聊天。\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天设置：</>可以通过<Assistant_System>聊天面板-下方设置按钮</>，进行聊天频道设置。在<Assistant_System>综合设置 - 聊天频道显示</>可以设置需要显示的聊天频道。在<Assistant_System>频道设置</>可以控制HUD左下角显示的聊天频道。\n<Assistant_Title2>综合频道：</>综合频道聚集了多个频道消息的信息，可以在其中进行快捷查看。在<Assistant_System>频道设置</>可以控制综合频道内包含的频道信息。\n<Assistant_Title2>聊天小窗：</>在聊天界面右下角，点击小窗按钮可打开小窗模式，小窗模式下可自由拖动小窗位置。\n<Assistant_Title3>基础功能细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[聊天-表情包]|1414}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Bottom left of HUD-Chat</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250050}\n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Channels: </> You can switch between different channels to chat in the list on the left. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Settings: </> You can perform chat channel settings via <Assistant_System>Chat Panel-Settings Button at the bottom</>. In <Assistant_System>General Settings - Chat Channel Display</>, you can set the chat channels you want to display. In <Assistant_System>Channel Settings</>, you can control the chat channels displayed in the bottom left of the HUD. \n<Assistant_Title2> General Channel: </> The General Channel gathers information from multiple channel messages, allowing for quick viewing. In <Assistant_System>Channel Settings</>, you can control the channel information included in the General Channel. \n<Assistant_Title2> Chat Mini-Window: </> In the chat interface, click the mini-window button in the bottom right to open mini-window mode; in mini-window mode, you can freely drag the window position. \n<Assistant_Title3> Basic Function Detail Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat-Emoticons]|1414}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【肃整】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得肃整，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Solemn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Solemn after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【股后黑手】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>树下似乎有什么声音……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往前往{Location:[廷根(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>卡在树上的男子</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Hidden Hand Behind the Stock】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be some sound under the tree...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reach Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, then go to {Location:[Tingen(1171,1133)]|17133;13323;-1880;2;5200002;0} and talk to the <Assistant_Red>man stuck in the tree</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【自然柔顺】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得自然柔顺发型，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Naturally Smooth] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Mall Direct-Sale Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After purchasing in the Mall, gain the Naturally Smooth hairstyle, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained through <Assistant_System> Mall </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【自省之心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得自省之心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heart of Introspection】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Heart of Introspection. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【花开半靥】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得花开半靥，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Half-Bloomed Flower】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Half-Bloomed Flower; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【花田里犯了错】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>花田里躺着的男人，在等待一个真爱之吻。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯花海(481,609)]|38048;51016;15391;2;5202005;0}与<Assistant_Red>亨利</>对话可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mistake in the Flower Field】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The man lying in the flower field is waiting for a kiss of true love.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Sea of Flowers(481,609)]|38048;51016;15391;2;5202005;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red>Henry</> to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【花镜绮宴】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得花镜绮宴套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floral Mirror Banquet】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Floral Mirror Banquet outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苍白之冕】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得苍白之冕套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pale Crown】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Pale Crown set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苍白余韵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本+F236+F249"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pale Aftertaste】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon + F236 + F249",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苍白的死亡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>黄铜书进度奖励\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得苍白的死亡，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pale Death】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Brass Book Progress Reward\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Pale Death; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苍银之风】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得苍银之风，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过终末猎杀拍卖获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Wind of Pale Silver】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Competition gameplay accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Wind of Pale Silver. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through the Final Hunt auction.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苏勒纸币】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得苏勒纸币，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Soule Banknote】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>World Adventure gameplay reward display sticker.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Soule Banknote. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【荒诞马戏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得荒诞马戏套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-安提哥努斯笔记</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Absurd Circus】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Absurd Circus set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - Antigonus Notebook</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【荒野之脊】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得荒野之脊，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>世界灾厄</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Wilderness Spine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Wilderness Spine. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>World Calamity</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【荣耀之证】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>防御类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，将<Assistant_Red>解控</>技能替换为更强的防护反制效果，解除控制后获得<Assistant_Red>霸体</>和高额<Assistant_Red>减伤</>，并可对攻击者<Assistant_Red>反弹伤害</>，结束时对周围敌人造成伤害并施加<Assistant_Red>攻击降低</>；每次反弹伤害都会延长荣耀之证的冷却时间。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Proof of Glory】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Defense-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Replaces the <Assistant_Red>Cleanse</> skill with a stronger protective counter-effect. After removing control, gain <Assistant_Red>Super Armor</> and high <Assistant_Red>Damage Reduction</>, and <Assistant_Red>reflect damage</> to the attacker. Upon ending, deal damage to surrounding enemies and apply <Assistant_Red>Attack Reduction</>. Each reflected damage extends the cooldown of Proof of Glory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Default unlocked Sealed Artifact, no additional acquisition required.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【莫尔斯小镇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得莫尔斯小镇套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morse Small Town】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Morse Small Town set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蔷薇之缚】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蔷薇之缚，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rose Binding】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Rose Binding. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【虔诚回响】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得虔诚回响套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-公会</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Devout Echo】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Devout Echo set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Guild</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【虚境】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Void Realm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蛇心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蛇心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Snake Heart】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Snake Heart. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蝶之吻】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蝶之吻，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Kiss】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Butterfly Kiss. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蝶栖流光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蝶栖流光，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Butterfly Resting on Flowing Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Butterfly Resting on Flowing Light. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蠕动的饥饿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，攻击主目标时有概率剥离其灵魂，吞噬后按目标类别获得<Assistant_Red>攻击</>、<Assistant_Red>防御</>、<Assistant_Red>移速</>、<Assistant_Red>穿透</>等增益，并对灵魂主人造成伤害和<Assistant_Red>虚弱</>效果；吞噬效果持续期间若未能击杀目标，自身会受到反噬并扣除最大生命值。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Creeping Hunger] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Attack-type Sealed Artifact \n <Assistant_Title2> Details: </> General-purpose Sealed Artifact. When attacking the main target, there is a chance to strip its soul. After devouring it, gain buffs such as <Assistant_Red> Attack </>, <Assistant_Red> Defense </>, <Assistant_Red> Movement Speed </>, and <Assistant_Red> Penetration </> based on the target's category, and deal damage and apply a <Assistant_Red> Weakness </> effect to the soul's owner. If the target is not killed during the devouring effect, you will suffer backlash and lose Max HP. \n <Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained from the Tier 1 Earl rank ladder self-selection Sealed Artifact reward.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蠕动的饥饿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，攻击目标一段时间后会剥离其灵魂到自身脚下，<Assistant_Red>10</>秒内触碰灵魂会吞噬灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂，若目标为怪物，则会粉碎怪物灵魂对其和周围的敌人造成伤害。穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂会让自身的<Assistant_Red>生命值上限</>降低，粉碎怪物灵魂后会让自身的<Assistant_Red>减伤</>降低。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Creeping Hunger】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. After attacking a target for a period, it strips their soul to your feet. Touching the soul within <Assistant_Red>10</> seconds consumes it to gain a skill corresponding to its Sequence. Using this skill releases the soul. If the target is a monster, it shatters the monster's soul, dealing damage to it and surrounding enemies. For every Beyonder soul imprisoned, the wearer's <Assistant_Red>Max Health</> decreases; shattering a monster soul decreases your <Assistant_Red>Damage Reduction</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained as a selectable Sealed Artifact reward at the Earl I rank in the ladder.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【血月杀戮】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得血月杀戮套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blood Moon Slaughter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Blood Moon Slaughter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【衔尾】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得衔尾，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-公会</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ouroboros】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Ouroboros. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Guild</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【装备评分】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>评分说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-非凡评分-装备</>即可查看当前角色的装备评分，装备评分是角色<Assistant_Red>已装配</>装备的养成评价\n<Assistant_Title2>提分指南：</>体验<Assistant_System>以战养战、世界冒险和教团玩法</>，开启非凡馈赠获取新的装备；穿戴可以形成套装的成套装备，对装备进行强化，对装备的随机词条进行<Assistant_Property1>重塑</>，获得高稀有度的<Assistant_Property1>恩赐</>，都可以提升非凡者的装备评分"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Equipment Rating】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Explanation: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Character - Beyonder Rating - Equipment</> to view your current character's Equipment Rating. The Equipment Rating is an evaluation of your character's <Assistant_Red>equipped</> gear.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Guide: </>Experience <Assistant_System>War-forged Growth, World Adventure, and Church gameplay</> to unlock Beyonder Gifts and obtain new equipment. Wearing set gear, strengthening equipment, <Assistant_Property1>reshaping</> random stats, and obtaining high-rarity <Assistant_Property1>Blessings</> will all increase your Equipment Rating.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【观众】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spectator】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【观众席位】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>黑荆棘来了两位恩马特港的值夜者同事，似乎有事求助。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[黑荆棘安保公司(100,106)]|15;460;-1;2;5200004;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spectator Seats】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Two Nighthawk colleagues from Pritz Harbor have come to Blackthorn, and they seem to need help. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 64 </>, head to {Location: [Blackthorn Security Company (100,106)] | 15;460;-1;2;5200004;0 } to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【观众时装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>序列晋升奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得观众时装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过签到获取限时时装，后可通过<Assistant_System>序列晋升</>获取永久时装"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spectator Outfit】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for Sequence advancement\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Spectator outfit set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain limited-time outfits through sign-ins, and later obtain permanent outfits through <Assistant_System>Sequence advancement</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【角落的食客】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>圣赛琳娜教堂的角落里，蜷缩着一团小小的黑色身影。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(823,780)]|-18090;-21960;-1000;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Eater in the Corner】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In the corner of Saint Selena Cathedral, a small black figure is curled up.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(823,780)]|-18090;-21960;-1000;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【誓约值】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>誓约值说明：</><Assistant_System>誓约值</>是由互为誓约关系的两位玩家组队参与并完成游戏中各项活动获得的用来提升双方誓约等级的经验。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取规则：</>①非凡者每日与自己对应的誓约对象最多可获得<Assistant_Red>600</>誓约值（未获取的上限部分不会累计）。②非凡者每周与自己对应的誓约对象最多可获得<Assistant_Red>2000</>誓约值（未获取的上限部分不会累计）。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取来源：</>①与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>队伍副本</>。②与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>团队副本</>。③与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>世界灾厄</>。④与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>乌托邦剧院双人模式（会获得更多誓约值）</>。⑤与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>神座之争</>。⑥与自己的誓约组队完<Assistant_System>成命运时刻</>。⑦与自己的誓约组队完成<Assistant_System>主宰争锋</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>誓约值用处：</>非凡者获取誓约值以后，可以用来提升与誓约对象的誓约等级，每次升级都可以领取对应的等级奖励（同等级的奖励只可领取一次）。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Points】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Points Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant Points</> are experience points earned by two players in a covenant relationship who team up to complete various activities in the game, used to increase their covenant level. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition Rules: </>① A Beyonder can earn a maximum of <Assistant_Red>600</> Covenant Points per day with their covenant partner (unearned portions of the cap do not accumulate). ② A Beyonder can earn a maximum of <Assistant_Red>2000</> Covenant Points per week with their covenant partner (unearned portions of the cap do not accumulate). \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition Sources: </>① Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Team Dungeons</>. ② Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Raid Dungeons</>. ③ Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>World Calamity</>. ④ Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Utopia Theater Duo Mode (earns more Covenant Points)</>. ⑤ Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Battle for the Throne of God</>. ⑥ Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Moment of Fate</>. ⑦ Team up with your covenant partner to complete <Assistant_System>Dominator's Clash</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Use of Covenant Points: </>After obtaining Covenant Points, Beyonders can use them to increase their covenant level with their partner. Each upgrade allows you to claim corresponding level rewards (rewards for the same level can only be claimed once).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【誓约奖励】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>誓约奖励说明：</><Assistant_System>誓约系统奖励</>一共分为2类，①是誓约等级奖励。②与誓约达到指定等级后可在同行商店购买指定的物品。\n<Assistant_Title2>等级奖励规则：</>①非凡者随着与自己誓约对象的誓约等级提升，每提升1级可以领取1次等级奖励。②每个等级的奖励只可领取一次，不可重复获取。\n<Assistant_Title2>商店奖励规则：</>非凡者可以在商城-百货-同行商店，花费同行纹章购买誓约系统相关的外观奖励，不同的外观奖励需要誓约等级达到对应要求才可购买。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Rewards】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Rewards Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant System rewards</> are divided into 2 categories: ① Covenant Level Rewards. ② After reaching a specified level with your covenant partner, you can purchase specified items in the Companion Shop. \n<Assistant_Title2>Level Reward Rules: </>① As the covenant level with your partner increases, you can claim level rewards once for every level gained. ② Rewards for each level can only be claimed once and cannot be obtained repeatedly. \n<Assistant_Title2>Shop Reward Rules: </>Beyonders can go to Mall - Department Store - Companion Shop and spend Companion Emblems to purchase appearance rewards related to the Covenant System. Different appearance rewards require the covenant level to reach the corresponding requirement before they can be purchased.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【誓约系统】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>誓约系统</>是由两名互为好友的玩家组队前往萨默尔太太处申请结成誓约关系后通过一起参与组队活动获取誓约值与同行纹章的社交玩法。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与条件：</>①需要双方等级都达到<Assistant_Red>30级</>解锁誓约系统。②双方互为好友且<Assistant_Red>好友度达到200点</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法规则：</>①达到参与条件的玩家组队前往<Assistant_Red>霍纳奇斯花海萨默尔太太处</>，由队长发起结成誓约邀请。②被邀请方接受邀请后进入互相书写誓言流程。③书写完誓言后双方互相交换查看收下对方的誓言，进入拍婚纱照流程。④双方选择拍照模版，最终确认后完成拍照流程，双方结成誓约关系。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant System】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant System</> is a social gameplay where two players who are friends form a team, go to Mrs. Sammer to apply for a covenant relationship, and then participate in team activities together to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>① Both parties must reach <Assistant_Red>Level 30</> to unlock the Covenant System. ② Both parties must be friends and have a <Assistant_Red>Friendship Level of 200 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>① Players who meet the requirements form a team and go to <Assistant_Red>Mrs. Sammer in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers</>, where the captain initiates the covenant invitation. ② After the invitee accepts, they enter the process of writing vows to each other. ③ After writing the vows, both parties exchange, view, and accept each other's vows, then enter the wedding photo process. ④ Both parties select a photo template, and after final confirmation, the photo process is completed, and the two parties form a covenant relationship.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【记忆的传承】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>5~6人家族副本</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法介绍：</>开启“记忆的传承”仪式后，玩家将进入记忆世界，与过去经历过的强敌再次交锋。与家族成员共同进入时，可获得【誓火共燃】与【血脉盟约】增益。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-记忆的传承</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领与参与条件：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>强尼：</>普通难度39级，推荐非凡评分8779；困难难度61级，推荐非凡评分39842。\n    <Assistant_Property1>钻头：</>普通难度46级，推荐非凡评分17855；困难难度63级，推荐非凡评分49578。\n    <Assistant_Property1>邦尼：</>普通难度56级，推荐非凡评分28959；困难难度66级，推荐非凡评分58189。\n    <Assistant_Property1>战争巨龙：</>普通难度60级，推荐非凡评分38619；困难难度68级，推荐非凡评分69025；噩梦难度70级，推荐非凡评分94338。\n<Assistant_Title2>开放顺序：</>普通钻头于赛季第2天开放，普通邦尼第4天开放，普通战争巨龙第5天开放；困难强尼第6天开放，困难钻头第8天开放，困难邦尼第12天开放，困难战争巨龙第14天开放；噩梦难度战争巨龙第25天开放。\n<Assistant_Title2>挑战说明：</>各首领均支持5~6人组队，并可选择人机模式。不同首领和难度独立开放，请根据角色等级与推荐非凡评分选择挑战目标。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Inheritance of Memory】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>5~6 Person Family Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>After activating the \"Inheritance of Memory\" ritual, players will enter a memory world to face powerful enemies from the past once again. When entering with family members, you can gain the [Burning Vow of Fire] and [Bloodline Covenant] buffs.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Inheritance of Memory</>to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Bosses and Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Johnny: </>Normal Level 39, recommended Beyonder Rating 8779; Hard Level 61, recommended Beyonder Rating 39842.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Drill: </>Normal Level 46, recommended Beyonder Rating 17855; Hard Level 63, recommended Beyonder Rating 49578.\n    <Assistant_Property1>Bonnie: </>Normal Level 56, recommended Beyonder Rating 28959; Hard Level 66, recommended Beyonder Rating 58189.\n    <Assistant_Property1>War Dragon: </>Normal Level 60, recommended Beyonder Rating 38619; Hard Level 68, recommended Beyonder Rating 69025; Nightmare Level 70, recommended Beyonder Rating 94338.\n<Assistant_Title2>Opening Schedule: </>Normal Drill opens on Day 2 of the season, Normal Bonnie on Day 4, Normal War Dragon on Day 5; Hard Johnny on Day 6, Hard Drill on Day 8, Hard Bonnie on Day 12, Hard War Dragon on Day 14; Nightmare War Dragon opens on Day 25.\n<Assistant_Title2>Challenge Notes: </>All bosses support 5~6 person parties and AI mode. Different bosses and difficulties open independently; please choose your challenge target based on your character level and recommended Beyonder Rating.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【记忆的传承】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>5~6人家族副本</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法介绍：</>开启“记忆的传承”仪式后，玩家将进入记忆世界，与过去经历过的强敌再次交锋。与家族成员共同进入时，可获得【誓火共燃】与【血脉盟约】增益。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-记忆的传承</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领与参与条件：</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>强尼：</>普通难度39级，推荐非凡评分9359；困难难度61级，推荐非凡评分47716。\n    <Assistant_Property1>钻头：</>普通难度46级，推荐非凡评分18236；困难难度63级，推荐非凡评分56222。\n    <Assistant_Property1>邦尼：</>普通难度56级，推荐非凡评分28651；困难难度66级，推荐非凡评分73673。\n    <Assistant_Property1>战争巨龙：</>普通难度60级，推荐非凡评分45868；困难难度68级，推荐非凡评分77962；噩梦难度70级，推荐非凡评分91225。\n<Assistant_Title2>开放顺序：</>普通钻头于赛季第2天开放，普通邦尼第4天开放，普通战争巨龙第5天开放；困难强尼第6天开放，困难钻头第8天开放，困难邦尼第12天开放，困难战争巨龙第14天开放；噩梦战争巨龙第22天开放。\n<Assistant_Title2>挑战说明：</>各首领均支持5~6人组队，并可选择人机模式。不同首领和难度独立开放，请根据角色等级与推荐非凡评分选择挑战目标。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Inheritance of Memory] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Type: </> <Assistant_Property1> 5~6 Player Family Dungeon </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Introduction: </> After starting the \"Inheritance of Memory\" ritual, players will enter the world of memory to clash again with powerful enemies from the past. When entering with family members, you can obtain [Oathfire Combustion] and [Bloodline Covenant] buffs. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> Click <Assistant_System> Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Inheritance of Memory </> to participate. \n <Assistant_Title2> Bosses and Participation Requirements: </> \n <Assistant_Property1> Johnny: </> Normal Difficulty Level 39, recommended Beyonder Rating 9359; Hard Difficulty Level 61, recommended Beyonder Rating 47716. \n <Assistant_Property1> Drill: </> Normal Difficulty Level 46, recommended Beyonder Rating 18236; Hard Difficulty Level 63, recommended Beyonder Rating 56222. \n <Assistant_Property1> Bonnie: </> Normal Difficulty Level 56, recommended Beyonder Rating 28651; Hard Difficulty Level 66, recommended Beyonder Rating 73673. \n <Assistant_Property1> War Dragon: </> Normal Difficulty Level 60, recommended Beyonder Rating 45868; Hard Difficulty Level 68, recommended Beyonder Rating 77962; Nightmare Difficulty Level 70, recommended Beyonder Rating 91225. \n <Assistant_Title2> Opening Order: </> Normal Drill opens on Day 2 of the season, Normal Bonnie on Day 4, Normal War Dragon on Day 5; Hard Johnny opens on Day 6, Hard Drill on Day 8, Hard Bonnie on Day 12, Hard War Dragon on Day 14; Nightmare War Dragon opens on Day 22. \n <Assistant_Title2> Challenge Instructions: </> All bosses support 5~6 player teams and AI mode. Different bosses and difficulties open independently; please choose your challenge target based on character level and recommended Beyonder Rating.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【记忆蛛网】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得记忆蛛网，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-星灵秘库商店</>中使用裁刀兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Memory Spider Web】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Memory Spider Web. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【许愿神灯】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>特化类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，战斗中使用道具会触发<Assistant_Red>许愿</>，根据当前血量提供不同的效果，包括生命上限提升、普攻加速或技能冷却返还；不同许愿效果会触发对应负面代价，包括减少当前生命值、<Assistant_Red>禁用普攻</>或使技能触发<Assistant_Red>双倍冷却</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>赛季剧情第二章《文明与律令》全服任务奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Wishing Lamp】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Specialized Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. Using items in combat triggers <Assistant_Red>Wish</>, providing different effects based on current health, including Max Health increase, basic attack speed boost, or skill cooldown refund. Different wish effects trigger corresponding negative costs, including reducing current health, <Assistant_Red>disabling basic attacks</>, or causing skills to trigger <Assistant_Red>Double Cooldown</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Reward for the server-wide quest in Season Story Chapter 2, \"Civilization and Order\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诚颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得诚颂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sincere Praise】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Sincere Praise after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡变宝箱】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>没有哪位经验丰富的探索者，会轻易相信一份毫无来由的财富。它们有的早已失去主人，有的仍处于守护之下，也有一些只是岁月的痕迹。对于非凡者而言，每一次尝试，都意味着一次选择，这一切的谜题，都等着你来揭晓。用武力和欺骗的手段战胜他们，让他们看看谁才是猎物。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找诡变宝箱</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【诡变宝箱】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【诡变宝箱】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 与宝箱互动</>\n到达目标地点后，与奇怪的宝箱互动，选择开启宝箱，会惊动宝箱周围的敌人。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 应对选择</>\n被敌人发现后，可选择不同方式应对：\n<Assistant_Red>正面迎战：</>击败敌人即可获得宝箱奖励。\n<Assistant_Red>天赋检定：</>通过对应检定，同样可以获得宝箱奖励；若检定失败，则需进入战斗完成挑战。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysterious Treasure Chest】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>No experienced explorer would easily trust wealth that appears out of nowhere. Some have long lost their owners, some remain under guard, and others are merely traces of time. For a Beyonder, every attempt represents a choice, and all these puzzles are waiting for you to solve them. Use force and deception to defeat them and show them who the real prey is.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding a Mysterious Treasure Chest</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Mysterious Treasure Chest] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Mysterious Treasure Chest] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Interacting with the Chest</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, interact with the strange treasure chest and choose to open it, which will alert the enemies surrounding it.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Responding to Choices</>\nOnce discovered by enemies, you can choose different ways to respond:\n<Assistant_Red>Head-on Battle:</>Defeat the enemies to obtain the treasure chest reward.\n<Assistant_Red>Talent Check:</>Pass the corresponding check to also obtain the treasure chest reward; if the check fails, you must enter combat to complete the challenge.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘之主】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lord of Mysteries】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈-关系】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>默认关注：</>诡秘圈默认关注NPC。\n<Assistant_Title2>单向关注：</>可在关注页签，看到自己关注的玩家发布的诡秘圈动态。\n<Assistant_Title2>互关：</>双方互相关注，成为好友默认互相关注诡秘圈。\n<Assistant_Title2>取消关注：</>取消关注后，无法在关注页签，查看该玩家发布的诡秘圈动态。删除好友或拉黑后，自动取消双向关注。\n<Assistant_Title2>快速操作：</>可以在<Assistant_System>个人主页</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302302}查看我的诡秘圈关注列表、粉丝列表，并进行取消关注、移除粉丝的快速操作。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle - Relationships】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Follow: </>NPCs followed by default in the Mysteries Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>One-way Follow: </>You can see the Mysteries Circle updates posted by players you follow in the Following tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mutual Follow: </>Both parties follow each other and become friends, automatically following each other in the Mysteries Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Unfollow: </>After unfollowing, you cannot see the Mysteries Circle updates posted by that player in the Following tab. Deleting a friend or blocking them will automatically cancel mutual follows.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Actions: </>You can go to <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1302302} to view your Mysteries Circle following list and follower list, and perform quick actions like unfollowing or removing followers.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈-动态】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>发布动态：</>在诡秘圈界面，点击<Assistant_System>发布</>按钮，即可编辑发布动态。发布动态时，可以编辑文本、上传图片、设置话题、可见范围、评论和转发权限。\n<Assistant_Title2>分享至诡秘圈：</>分享界面，点击<Assistant_System>分享到诡秘圈</>按钮，即可将内容截图，并分享发布到诡秘圈。\n<Assistant_Title2>删除诡秘圈和评论：</>在自己的动态和评论处，点击···更多按钮，可进行删除。\n<Assistant_Title2>注意：</><Assistant_Red>若诡秘圈动态、评论内容和图片不合规，会进行下架处理。</>如您发现其他玩家有违规行为或者异常情况，请及时举报或联系客服。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle-Dynamics】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Posting Dynamics: </>In the Mysteries Circle interface, click the <Assistant_System>Post</> button to edit and publish a dynamic. When posting, you can edit text, upload images, set topics, visibility, and comment/repost permissions.\n<Assistant_Title2> Sharing to Mysteries Circle: </>In the share interface, click the <Assistant_System>Share to Mysteries Circle</> button to screenshot the content and share it to the Mysteries Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2> Deleting Mysteries Circle Posts and Comments: </>On your own posts and comments, click the \"...\" more button to delete them.\n<Assistant_Title2> Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mysteries Circle posts, comments, or images are non-compliant, they will be taken down.</> If you discover other players engaging in violations or abnormal behavior, please report them or contact customer service promptly.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈-话题】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>创建话题：</>发布动态时可添加话题，可点击话题按钮从选择已有话题，也可通过#话题名#格式新增话题。\n<Assistant_Title2>话题排行榜：</>话题页签中显示热门话题排行。\n<Assistant_Title2>话题动态：</>点击话题，可以查看该话题下的所有动态。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystic Circle - Topics】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Create Topic: </>You can add topics when posting updates. You can click the topic button to select existing topics or create new ones using the #TopicName# format. \n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Leaderboard: </>Popular topics are displayed on the topic tab. \n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Updates: </>Click a topic to view all updates under that topic. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mystic Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mystic Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mystic Circle - Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mystic Circle - Tabs]|1393}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈-页签】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>关注页签：</>关注页签，会显示自己关注的玩家和NPC发布的诡秘圈动态。\n<Assistant_Title2>发现页签：</>发现页签会按照诡秘圈动态热度，自动推送当前热度较高的诡秘圈，可手动调整按照动态发布时间进行排序。\n<Assistant_Title2>话题页签：</>可以查看当前话题排行。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle - Tabs】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Following Tab: </>The Following tab displays updates from players and NPCs you follow in the Mysteries Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Discover Tab: </>The Discover tab automatically pushes trending Mysteries Circle posts based on their popularity. You can manually adjust the sorting to display by post time.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topics Tab: </>View current topic rankings.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Connections]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天面板 - 诡秘圈</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>我的诡秘圈：</><Assistant_System>个人主页 - 诡秘圈</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>诡秘圈数据：</>可以在<Assistant_System>个人主页</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302302}查看我的诡秘圈关注列表、粉丝列表。在<Assistant_System>点赞列表 - 诡秘圈</>中可查看点赞数据，诡秘圈点赞不会记在个人主页点赞总数中。\n<Assistant_Title2>诡秘圈操作：</>可以在诡秘圈内，点赞、评论、转发、分享其他人的诡秘圈动态。\n<Assistant_Title2>消息中心：</>可以在诡秘圈右上角的<Assistant_System>消息中心</>，收到其他人对自己诡秘圈的点赞、评论/回复、转发、@自己等行为的红点提示。\n<Assistant_Title2>注意：</><Assistant_Red>若诡秘圈动态、评论内容和图片不合规，会进行下架处理。</>如您发现其他玩家有违规行为或者异常情况，请及时举报或联系客服。\n<Assistant_Title3>基础功能细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>My Mysteries Circle: </><Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Data: </>You can view your Mysteries Circle following list and follower list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}. You can view like data in <Assistant_System>Like List - Mysteries Circle</>; Mysteries Circle likes are not counted toward the total like count on your personal homepage. \n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Actions: </>Within the Mysteries Circle, you can like, comment on, repost, and share other people's Mysteries Circle updates. \n<Assistant_Title2>Message Center: </>In the <Assistant_System>Message Center</> at the top right corner of the Mysteries Circle, you will receive red dot notifications for others liking, commenting/replying to, reposting, or @-ing you in the Mysteries Circle. \n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mysteries Circle updates, comment content, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed. </>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer service promptly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Detail Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-常驻房间】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>玩法语音房 - 右下角设置 - 右上方常驻按钮</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>常驻道具：</>可在<Assistant_System>商城 - 秘藏陈列</>中购买常驻契约，使用后可将玩法语音房间转换为常驻房间，并增加30天的常驻时长。单个道具可续时30天，连续续时上限为90天。\n<Assistant_Title2>功能介绍：</>转换为常驻房间后，在<Assistant_Red>退出常驻语音房间或离线后</>仍可保留语音房间，房主仍可保留房主身份。<Assistant_Red>常驻语音房间无法转让房主。</>\n<Assistant_Title2>数量限制：</>每个角色最多仅可拥有<Assistant_Red>1个常驻语音房间</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>解散房间：</>常驻语音房间可由房主主动解散，解散后<Assistant_Red>无法恢复</>；\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Permanent Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Play Voice Room - Settings (Bottom Right) - Permanent Button (Top Right)</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Permanent Item: </>You can purchase a Permanent Contract in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</>. Using it converts a Play Voice Room into a permanent room and adds 30 days of permanent duration. A single item can extend the duration by 30 days, with a maximum cumulative extension of 90 days.\n<Assistant_Title2>Function Introduction: </>After converting to a permanent room, the voice room will be retained even after you <Assistant_Red>exit the permanent voice room or go offline</>, and the host will retain their host status.<Assistant_Red>Permanent voice rooms cannot have their host status transferred.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quantity Limit: </>Each character can own a maximum of <Assistant_Red>1 permanent voice room</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disbanding the Room: </>A permanent voice room can be disbanded by the host; once disbanded, it <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</>;\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Gameplay]|1397}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-房主权限】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>语音房 - 左下角权限设置</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>自由发言模式：</>所有玩家均可开麦发言。\n<Assistant_Title2>房主设置发言权限：</>此模式下玩家可以点击开麦按钮主动发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可获得发言权限。房主也可在玩家列表中手动调整玩家的发言权限。\n<Assistant_Title2>房主设置发言顺序：</>此模式下最多设置8个麦序座位。默认为顺序发言，仅房主和1号麦玩家可开麦，1号麦玩家发言完毕需自行点击下麦，将麦序传给2号麦玩家。\n<Assistant_Title2>禁言：</>被禁言的玩家，将无法在本语音房间内进行实时语音、发送语音信息及文字消息。房主可在禁言管理页签进行设置。\n<Assistant_Title2>黑名单：</>被拉黑的玩家将被踢出本语音房间且无法再进入本语音房间。房主可在黑名单页签进行设置。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Host Permissions】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Voice Room - Permission Settings in the bottom left corner</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Free Speaking Mode: </>All players can unmute and speak.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Sets Speaking Permissions: </>In this mode, players can click the microphone button to actively request to speak, and can gain speaking permissions after the host approves. The host can also manually adjust player speaking permissions in the player list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Sets Speaking Order: </>In this mode, up to 8 speaking order seats can be set. It defaults to sequential speaking; only the host and the player in seat #1 can unmute. After the player in seat #1 finishes speaking, they must click to step down to pass the speaking order to the player in seat #2.\n<Assistant_Title2>Mute: </>Muted players will not be able to perform real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The host can set this in the Mute Management tab.\n<Assistant_Title2>Blacklist: </>Blacklisted players will be kicked out of this voice room and will not be able to enter again. The host can set this in the Blacklist tab.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Normal Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-普通语音房】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>10级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天面板 - 语音房</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>人数上限：</>语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n<Assistant_Title2>默认发言模式：</>普通语音房间默认是自由发言模式，点击输入框旁边的开麦按钮即可自动开麦。若当前语音房间模式为房主设置发言权限模式或房主设置发言顺序模式，则需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n<Assistant_Title2>房主操作：</>房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言模式，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息和类型，进行转让房主操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>其他操作：</>在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-玩法语音房]|1397}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Normal Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level<Assistant_Red> 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity: </>A voice room can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speaking Mode: </>Normal voice rooms default to free-speaking mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the current voice room mode is set to host-controlled speaking permissions or speaking order, you must click the microphone button to request to speak, and you can unmute after the host approves.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speaking mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and also adjust room information and types or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share voice room links or distribute voice room gifts in the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【语音房-玩法语音房】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>10级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天面板 - 语音房</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>人数上限：</>语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n<Assistant_Title2>默认发言模式：</>玩法语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n<Assistant_Title2>心动信号：</>麦序上的玩家自动获得嘉宾身份，1麦玩家为座上宾身份，语音房间内的所有嘉宾均可通过切换爆灯状态来表达情绪。通过房间右上角实况界面可更直观的查看当前所有嘉宾的发言和爆灯情况。\n<Assistant_Title2>房主操作：</>房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>其他操作：</>在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}，{SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Open Level: </>Cognitive Level <Assistant_Red>10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[[View]]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can accommodate up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speaking Mode: </>Gameplay voice rooms default to the room owner setting the speaking order. You need to click the mic button to initiate a request to speak, and you can only unmute after the room owner approves.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players in the speaking queue automatically gain guest status; the player in the 1st mic position is the guest of honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their \"light-up\" status. You can view the speaking and light-up status of all current guests more intuitively through the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Room Owner Operations: </>The room owner can adjust the speaking order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in the member permission settings. They can also adjust room information, extend the duration of permanent rooms, and transfer ownership in the settings interface on the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link and distribute voice room gifts in the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Owner Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Normal Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【谁是恶龙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>猎龙帮除了龙什么都猎，这次他们猎到你了。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Who is the Dragon]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The Dragon Hunter Gang hunts everything except dragons, and this time they've hunted you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sols",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【谁是恶龙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>猎龙帮除了龙什么都猎，这次他们猎到你了。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Who Is the Evil Dragon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The Dragon Hunter Gang hunts everything except dragons, and this time they've hunted you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【赏金猎手】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得赏金猎手套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Hunter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Bounty Hunter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【足迹追寻】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>\n你的视觉将暂时剥离于现实的表象。灵性与此地沉淀的历史孔隙产生短暂的共鸣。你的眼前，将浮现出这片土地最有魅力的时刻。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1.进入玩法</>\n可通过以下方式前往【足迹追寻】：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任一教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择玩法【足迹追寻】，选中点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【足迹追寻】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2.完成交互</>\n到达目标地点后，根据提示选择【观景】，欣赏这片土地最具美丽的景观之一并拍照留念。\n<Assistant_Title3>3.解锁记忆</>\n完成交互后，完成对应记忆的探索，增加所在地图的完成度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Footprint Tracking】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction:</>\nYour vision will temporarily detach from the surface of reality. Your spirituality will resonate briefly with the historical gaps settled in this place. Before your eyes, the most charming moments of this land will emerge.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Enter the Gameplay</>\nYou can head to [Footprint Tracking] via the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entrance:</>Open the Menu, enter [TRPG], join any Covenant, select the [Footprint Tracking] gameplay in the [Order World], and click [Go] to initiate Dowsing Rod Navigation.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entrance:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Footprint Tracking] gameplay icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to initiate Dowsing Rod Navigation.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Complete Interaction</>\nUpon arriving at the target location, follow the prompts to select [View] to appreciate one of the most beautiful landscapes of this land and take a photo as a souvenir.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Unlock Memories</>\nAfter completing the interaction, finish the exploration of the corresponding memory to increase the completion rate of the current map.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【迷失塔罗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>占卜俱乐部的书架上，似乎有灵性波动……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>51级</>后，前往{Location:[占卜俱乐部(112,94)]|923;-505;152;2;5200009;0}可触发任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Tarot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There seems to be spiritual fluctuations on the bookshelf at the Divination Club... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 51</>, go to {Location:[Divination Club (112,94)]|923;-505;152;2;5200009;0} to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【追风雪的人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一位老先生坐在雪地上，不知道是在休息，还是需要帮助？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯山脉(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0}，和<Assistant_Red>老先生</>对话可接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chaser of Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow. Is he resting, or does he need help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Gentleman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【送你一朵塞维亚菊】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>伦纳德先生请你帮他接待一位“故人”的妹妹，在黑荆棘附近寻找一下吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>35级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(868,927)]|-13241;-7214;-1586;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sending You a Sevia Daisy】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Mr. Leonard asks you to help him receive the younger sister of an \"old friend.\" Try searching near Blackthorn.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 35</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(868,927)]|-13241;-7214;-1586;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soles, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【途径评分】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>评分说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-非凡评分-途径</>即可查看当前角色的途径评分，途径评分是角色自身非凡能力养成的评价\n<Assistant_Title2>提分指南：</>不断提升角色的等级和序列，即可提升角色的途径评分。途径评分的养成内容达到100%，说明养成已达到当前时间的上限"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Pathway Rating】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Explanation: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Character - Beyonder Rating - Pathway</> to view your current character's Pathway Rating. The Pathway Rating is an evaluation of your character's own Beyonder ability development.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Guide: </>Continuously increase your character's level and Sequence to improve your Pathway Rating. When the Pathway Rating reaches 100%, it means your development has reached the current cap.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【遗失的荣耀】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得遗失的荣耀，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-五月庄园·花园</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Glory】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Lost Glory. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【遗失盟约】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得遗失盟约，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lost Covenant】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Lost Covenant. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【邮件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>邮件说明：</>\n1.点击主界面左下角<Assistant_System>社交-邮件</>图标，或右上角<Assistant_System>菜单-邮件</>边栏，均可打开邮箱\n2.点击星星图标可以收藏邮件，收藏的邮件会进入收藏夹。收藏夹中的邮件永久存在，可以打开收藏夹查看，除非手动清理收藏夹（无法收藏附件）\n3.邮件只可由系统或俱乐部发送，和好友的交流可以直接使用<Assistant_System>聊天</>系统\n<Assistant_Title2>附件说明：</>\n1.邮箱存在上限，超出上限的邮件将被<Assistant_Red>自动清理</>，请非凡者即时领取邮件\n2.部分邮件存在<Assistant_Red>有效期限</>，超时后将<Assistant_Red>无法领取</>，请非凡者注意即时查收\n3.邮件一经删除，<Assistant_Red>无法恢复</>（已收藏的邮件删除后仍可前往收藏夹查看）\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部群发邮件]|501}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mail】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Mail Instructions:</>\n1. Click the <Assistant_System>Social-Mail</> icon in the bottom left of the main interface, or the <Assistant_System>Menu-Mail</> sidebar in the top right to open your mailbox.\n2. Click the star icon to bookmark mail; bookmarked mail will go to the Favorites folder. Mail in the Favorites folder exists permanently and can be viewed unless manually cleared (attachments cannot be bookmarked).\n3. Mail can only be sent by the system or a Club; for communication with friends, you can use the <Assistant_System>Chat</> system.\n<Assistant_Title2>Attachment Instructions:</>\n1. The mailbox has a capacity limit; mail exceeding this limit will be <Assistant_Red>automatically cleared</>. Please claim your mail promptly.\n2. Some mail has an <Assistant_Red>expiration date</>; after this time, it will <Assistant_Red>be impossible to claim</>. Please be sure to check your mail promptly.\n3. Once deleted, mail <Assistant_Red>cannot be recovered</> (bookmarked mail can still be viewed in the Favorites folder after deletion).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Club Mass Mail]|501}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金枝森影】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得金枝森影套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Branch Forest Shadow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Golden Branch Forest Shadow set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>, or exchange using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards in the <Assistant_System>Goddess's Gift Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金狮之首】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得金狮之首，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Lion Head】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Golden Lion Head; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金秋湖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>廷根南部远郊，是一片与世无争的田园乐土，常年处于令人愉悦的丰收季。\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301074}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301079}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301080}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301077}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301909}  {JumpToUI:风尚沙龙|1301956}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301078}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301072}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301959}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代百态|1302429}  {JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302430}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302431}  {JumpToUI:城市漫游|1302432}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Autumn Lake】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction: </>Located in the southern suburbs of Tingen, it is an idyllic paradise isolated from the world, perpetually in a pleasant harvest season.\n<Assistant_Title2>【Order World】:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Original Dream:</>\n{JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1301074}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301079} {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301080} {JumpToUI:spirit body threads|1301077} {JumpToUI:Storm Chasing|1301909} {JumpToUI:Fashion Salon|1301956} {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301078} {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301072} {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301959}\n<Assistant_Title2>【Era Quests】:</>\n{JumpToUI:Life in the Era|1302429} {JumpToUI:Era Anecdotes|1302430} {JumpToUI:Acting Stories|1302431} {JumpToUI:City Roaming|1302432}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金翡礼颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得金翡礼颂套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Jade Hymn】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Golden Jade Hymn outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金边方框眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得金边方框眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gold-Rimmed Square Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Gold-Rimmed Square Glasses. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁誓】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铁誓，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Iron Oath】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Iron Oath. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-交易技巧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>在站点低价买入货物，在后续会收购该货物的站点高价卖出，赚取差价。\n<Assistant_Title2>判断价格：</>看到明显低于基础价的商品，可考虑买入；看到明显高于基础价的订购单，可优先卖出。每站可购买和可出售数量有限，受站点、货物倍率、区域倍率与协议加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>进阶建议：</>高难度路线更长，有时需要保留一定票券应对后续高价值机会。临近终点前，尽量把货物在高点卖出获取最大收益或确保折算价值足够冲评级。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Buy goods at a low price at a station and sell them at a high price at a subsequent station that acquires those goods to earn the price difference. \n<Assistant_Title2>Judging Prices: </>When you see goods significantly lower than the base price, consider buying; when you see purchase orders significantly higher than the base price, prioritize selling. The quantity that can be bought and sold at each station is limited, influenced by the station, goods multiplier, regional multiplier, and agreement bonuses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Advanced Advice: </>High-difficulty routes are longer, and sometimes you need to reserve a certain amount of tickets to deal with subsequent high-value opportunities. Before reaching the destination, try to sell goods at a high point to obtain maximum profit or ensure the converted value is sufficient to reach the rating.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-参与与准备】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>进入方式：</>完成引导任务后，可前往城堡火车区域与肖恩对话，或从城堡/家园相关入口进入铁路大亨页面。\n<Assistant_Title2>出发条件：</>需要消耗<Assistant_Property1>经销许可证</>，如有城堡工坊产物，可以进一步提升初始票券。开局时携带产物会按配置价格兑换为初始<Assistant_Property2>商会票券</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>准备建议：</>优先携带本周推荐品类或当前难度对应等级的产物，推荐品类会获得更高的收益；"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Participation and Preparation】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Entry Method: </>After completing the tutorial quest, you can go to the Castle train area to talk to Sean, or enter the Railway Tycoon page from the Castle/Home related entrances. \n<Assistant_Title2>Departure Conditions: </>Requires consuming <Assistant_Property1>Distribution Licenses</>. If you have Castle Workshop products, you can further increase your initial tickets. When starting, carried products will be exchanged for initial <Assistant_Property2>Chamber of Commerce Tickets</> according to the configuration price. \n<Assistant_Title2>Preparation Suggestions: </>Prioritize carrying the recommended categories for the week or products corresponding to the current difficulty level; recommended categories will yield higher returns;",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-策略卡与路线】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>策略卡：</>每次前往下一站前可选择一张策略卡，抵达下一站后按条件生效，常见效果包括获得商会票券、获得货物、货物转化，大部分卡片都和猜中站点类型有关，理解了站点顺序能大幅提高策略卡的生效概率。\n<Assistant_Title2>路线提示：</>选择策略卡时，可以根据当前和剩余站点，推理最有可能出现的下一站类型；低难度会给出更明确的后续站点信息，且不会出现连续相同的站点，可以以此判断后续站点类型；高难度下没有区域概念，你只能看到未来3站最多的站点类型，此时则可能需要结合前面数站的预测信息，综合判定站点类型。\n<Assistant_Title2>小技巧：</>确定下一站类型时优先选猜站类卡；不确定时可考虑选稳定收益卡。部分卡片需要组合才能发挥更大作用，有了好的买卖货物铺垫，部分卡片的强度会明显提升"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station sequence can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tips: </>When choosing a strategy card, you can deduce the most likely next station type based on your current and remaining stations. Low-difficulty modes provide clearer information about subsequent stations and will not feature consecutive identical stations, which you can use to determine the next station type. In high-difficulty modes, there is no concept of regions, and you can only see the most frequent station types for the next 3 stops. At this point, you may need to combine predictive information from previous stations to make a comprehensive judgment on the station type. \n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize cards that involve guessing stations when you are certain of the next type; consider choosing stable income cards when uncertain. Some cards require combinations to exert greater effects; once you have laid the groundwork for buying and selling cargo, the strength of certain cards will significantly increase.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-经销协议】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>开局会签订区域经销协议，并获得阶段性业绩目标。每经过固定数量站点，商会会检查你的业绩。\n<Assistant_Title2>达标结果：</>达成目标后，可选择维持当前协议或升级协议。升级后的协议目标更高，但会提供更强的货物数量加成和价格加成。\n<Assistant_Title2>未达标结果：</>若检查时未达到目标，本局会提前结算，最终业绩会受到折扣影响。协议等级只能提升，不能下降；"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Distribution Agreement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>At the start, you will sign a regional distribution agreement and receive phased performance targets. After passing a fixed number of stations, the Chamber of Commerce will check your performance. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Met: </>Once the target is reached, you can choose to maintain the current agreement or upgrade it. Upgraded agreements have higher targets but provide stronger bonuses to cargo quantity and prices. \n<Assistant_Title2>Target Not Met: </>If the target is not met during the check, the current session will end early, and the final performance will be affected by a discount. Agreement levels can only be increased, not decreased;",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>铁路大亨</>是城堡中的独立玩法。你需要消耗<Assistant_Property1>经销许可证</>开启线路，携带城堡工坊产物作为初始资本，在不同站点之间<Assistant_Property1>低买高卖</>，赚取<Assistant_Property2>商会票券</>并在结算时兑换为城堡货币。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心流程：</>选择难度与携带物产 → 签订经销协议 → 逐站买卖货物 → 选择策略卡 → 完成协议目标 → 终点结算评级与奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-参与与准备]|905}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-交易技巧]|906}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-经销协议]|907}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-策略卡与路线]|908}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Railway Tycoon</> is an independent game mode within the Castle. You need to consume <Assistant_Property1>Distribution Licenses</> to open routes, carry Castle Workshop products as initial capital, <Assistant_Property1>buy low and sell high</> between different stations, earn <Assistant_Property2>Chamber of Commerce Tickets</>, and exchange them for Castle currency upon settlement.\n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </>Select difficulty and cargo → Sign distribution agreements → Buy and sell goods station by station → Choose strategy cards → Complete agreement goals → Final settlement rating and rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Participation and Preparation]|905}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips]|906}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Distribution Agreements]|907}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Strategy Cards and Routes]|908}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁道旅人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法获得时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铁道旅人套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-铁路大亨</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Traveler】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Gameplay-Obtained Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Railway Traveler set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Railway Tycoon</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铂金额链】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>黄铜书进度奖励\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铂金额链，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Platinum Chain】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Brass Book Progress Reward\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Platinum Chain; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铃兰与骑士】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铃兰与骑士套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lily and Knight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Lily and Knight set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【银色狒狒背包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>直售礼包饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得银色狒狒背包，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过商城礼包解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver Baboon Backpack】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Direct-purchase bundle accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Silver Baboon Backpack. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock through Mall bundles.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【银蔷薇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得银蔷薇，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver Rose】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Silver Rose. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【锁住的童年】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一间旧公寓，锁匠大师的孩子把自己反锁在房间里，连大师本人都打不开。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，晋升至序列9，前往{Location:[廷根(710,1144)]|-28919;14469;-2102;2;5200085;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Locked Childhood】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In an old apartment, the child of a master locksmith has locked themselves in a room, and even the master himself cannot open it.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Sequence 9, and head to {Location:[Tingen (710, 1144)]|-28919;14469;-2102;2;5200085;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镀金细框眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得镀金细框眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gold-Plated Thin-Frame Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Gold-Plated Thin-Frame Glasses after character creation. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镀银眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得镀银眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Silver-Plated Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Silver-Plated Glasses after character creation. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镜中的廷根】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>越来越多的市民失踪了，必须尽快查出灾祸源头……先去梦中的诡异湖边看看。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第四天解锁。完成主线剧情第三章《暗涌的危机》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>52级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、武器箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen in the Mirror】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>More and more citizens are going missing; the source of the disaster must be found as soon as possible... First, go and check the strange lakeside in your dream. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fourth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 3 of the main story, \"Crisis of Dark Currents,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 52</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镜中的廷根】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>越来越多的市民失踪了，必须尽快查出灾祸源头……先去梦中的诡异湖边看看。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第四天解锁。完成主线剧情第三章《暗涌的危机》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>52级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、魔药主材料、武器箱、中级深红精粹、中级狂暴药剂"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen in the Mirror】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>More and more citizens are going missing; the source of the disaster must be found as soon as possible... First, go and check the strange lakeside in your dream. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fourth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 3 of the main story, \"Crisis of Dark Currents,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 52</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Potion Main Materials, Weapon Box, Intermediate Crimson Essence, Intermediate Berserk Potion",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【门径的始与终】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>听见了谁的呼喊声……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往前往{Location:[廷根(892,1117)]|-10798;11732;-1882;2;5200002;0}，与<Assistant_Red>卡在墙上的男子</>对话接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [The Beginning and End of the Doorway] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2> Acting Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Heard someone's cry for help... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main storyline Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 19 </> in Acting, go to {Location: [Tingen (892, 1117)] | -10798; 11732; -1882; 2; 5200002; 0 } and talk to the <Assistant_Red> man stuck in the wall </> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【闪电莉莉】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>廷根出现一位传奇送货员——闪电莉莉，速度快到难以想象！\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>61级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(808,1125)]|-18931;12326;-1979;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lightning Lily】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type:</><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description:</>A legendary delivery person has appeared in Tingen—Lightning Lily, whose speed is unimaginably fast!\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept:</>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 61</> in Acting, head to {Location:[Tingen(808,1125)]|-18931;12326;-1979;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【阳光普照】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得阳光普照，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sunshine】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Sunshine. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【隐秘空间】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>“魔术师”女士佛尔思利用空间隐匿将部分失控区域隐藏，留下特殊图腾。非凡者可开启，但请小心，有概率将你传送至未知区域。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找隐秘空间</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【隐秘空间】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【隐秘空间】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 进入隐秘空间</>\n到达入口后，与投影互动，即可进入对应的隐秘空间。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成挑战</>\n完成隐秘空间内的挑战后，获得宝箱奖励，并提升对应探索进度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hidden Space】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The Magician, Fors, uses space concealment to hide certain areas that have suffered from loss of control, leaving behind special totems. Beyonders can open them, but be careful—there is a chance you will be teleported to an unknown area.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding a Hidden Space</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Hidden Space] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Hidden Space] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Entering the Hidden Space</>\nAfter arriving at the entrance, interact with the projection to enter the corresponding Hidden Space.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Challenge</>\nAfter completing the challenge within the Hidden Space, you will receive a treasure chest reward and increase your exploration progress for that area.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【隔墙有暖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>有一家人的屋内好像不太暖和……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>屋内的声音</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It doesn't seem very warm inside one of the houses...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>voice from inside the house</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雕纹花坛】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件雕纹花坛，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Flower Bed】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Flower Bed display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雕花花瓶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件雕花花瓶，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Vase】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Vase display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雨夜街灯】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得雨夜街灯套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Rainy Night Street Lamp】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Rainy Night Street Lamp set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雪原呼唤】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>终年不化的积雪下，藏着不为人知的故事。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>63级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯山脉(406,364)]|30610;26480;-920;2;5200086;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Call of the Snowfield】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Beneath the snow that never melts all year round, unknown stories are hidden. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red> 63 </>, head to {Location: [Hornacis Mountain Range (406,364)] | 30610;26480;-920;2;5200086;0 } to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雾之余晖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得雾之余晖，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-五月庄园·城堡</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fog Afterglow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Fog Afterglow. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Castle</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雾都漫游】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得雾都漫游套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fog City Roaming】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Fog City Roaming set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【霍纳奇斯山脉】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>终年覆雪的群山间，古老遗迹依山而立。传说这里藏着安提哥努斯家族复兴的秘密宝藏。 \n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301914}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:隐秘空间|1301919}  {JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301920}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301917}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301921}  {JumpToUI:风尚沙龙|1301924}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301918}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301912}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301978}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务：】</>\n{JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302438}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hornacis Mountain Range】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Map Introduction:</>Among the snow-capped mountains, ancient ruins stand against the slopes. Legend has it that the secret treasure of the Antigonus Family's revival is hidden here. \n<Assistant_Title2>【Order World】:</>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Original Work Old Dreams:</>\n{JumpToUI:Footprint Tracking|1301914}\n<Assistant_Title3>② World Gameplay:</>\n{JumpToUI:Hidden Space|1301919}  {JumpToUI:Worm of Time Treasure|1301920}  {JumpToUI:spirit body threads|1301917}  {JumpToUI:Storm Chasing|1301921}  {JumpToUI:Fashion Salon|1301924}  {JumpToUI:Mysterious Treasure Chest|1301918}  {JumpToUI:Object of Phenomenon|1301912}  {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Roleplay|1301978}  \n  <Assistant_Title2>【Era Quests:】</>\n{JumpToUI:Era Anecdotes|1302438}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【霍纳奇斯花海】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>地图简介：</>盛放的花木沿湖岸绵延，与群山相映成趣。这里是热恋中的人们最钟爱的胜地。当你从高空俯视这片草原时，可以看到爱心形状的公路。\n<Assistant_Title2>【秩序世界】：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>①原著旧梦：</>\n{JumpToUI:足迹追寻|1301927}\n<Assistant_Title3>②世界玩法：</>\n{JumpToUI:时虫宝藏|1301933}  {JumpToUI:灵体之线|1301930}  {JumpToUI:吟游诗人|1301928}  {JumpToUI:风暴追逐|1301934}  {JumpToUI:风尚沙龙|1301937}  {JumpToUI:诡变宝箱|1301931}  {JumpToUI:异象之物|1301931}  {JumpToUI:非凡扮演|1301977}\n<Assistant_Title2>【时代任务】：</>\n{JumpToUI:时代百态|1302439}  {JumpToUI:时代逸闻|1302440}  {JumpToUI:扮演故事|1302441}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Hornacis Sea of Flowers] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Map Introduction: </> Blooming flowers and trees stretch along the lake shore, complementing the mountains. This is the most beloved destination for people in love. When you look down at this grassland from a high altitude, you can see a heart-shaped road. \n<Assistant_Title2> [Order World]: </>\n<Assistant_Title3> ① Old Dreams of the Original Work: </>\n{JumpToUI: Footprint Tracking | 1301927 } \n <Assistant_Title3> ② World Gameplay: </>\n{JumpToUI: Worm of Time Treasure | 1301933 } {JumpToUI: spirit body threads | 1301930 } {JumpToUI: Bard | 1301928 } {JumpToUI: Storm Chasing | 1301934 } {JumpToUI: Fashion Salon | 1301937 } {JumpToUI: Mysterious Treasure Chest | 1301931 } {JumpToUI: Object of Phenomenon | 1301931 } {JumpToUI: Extraordinary Roleplay | 1301977 } \n <Assistant_Title2> [Era Quests]: </> \n {JumpToUI: Life in the Era | 1302439 } {JumpToUI: Anecdotes of the Era | 1302440 } {JumpToUI: Acting Story | 1302441 }",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【霰弹枪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>能力特征：</>霰弹枪的命中判定范围较大，单发可命中多个敌人，造成多段伤害，很适合应对大群的敌人。\n霰弹枪<Assistant_Property1>无法</>针对敌人的弱点造成额外伤害。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[手枪]|899},{SendAnswer:[狙击枪]|901}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Shotgun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Ability Characteristics: </>The hit detection range of the shotgun is relatively large. A single shot can hit multiple enemies and cause multi-stage damage, making it very suitable for dealing with large groups of enemies. \nShotguns<Assistant_Property1> cannot</> cause extra damage to enemy weaknesses.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Pistol]|899}, {SendAnswer:[Snipe]|901}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【露台求爱】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>红月亮街上，有人在当街大喊我爱你。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(945,903)]|-5921;-9567;-1668;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Courtship on the Terrace】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On Red Moon Street, someone is shouting \"I love you\" in the middle of the street.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(945,903)]|-5921;-9567;-1668;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Bound Soules",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【露台求爱】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>红月亮街上，有人在当街大喊我爱你。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(945,903)]|-5921;-9567;-1668;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Terrace Courtship】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On Red Moon Street, someone is shouting \"I love you\" in the middle of the street.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(945,903)]|-5921;-9567;-1668;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【露营物语】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得露营物语套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Camping Story】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Camping Story outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡人物评分】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>评分说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-非凡评分-非凡人物</>即可查看当前角色的非凡人物评分，非凡人物评分是角色<Assistant_Red>已装配</>的秘偶和人脉技能，以及秘偶属性和历史研究的养成评价\n<Assistant_Title2>提分指南：</>体验<Assistant_System>以战养战、世界冒险和教团玩法</>，获取<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>和<Assistant_Property1>历史明灯</>，进行人脉和秘偶养成；提高自身的等级和序列，以提升自身的技能等级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beyonder Character Rating】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Explanation: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Character - Beyonder Rating - Beyonder Character</> to view your current character's Beyonder Character Rating. This is an evaluation of your <Assistant_Red>equipped</> marionettes, Connection Skills, marionette attributes, and historical research.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Guide: </>Experience <Assistant_System>War-forged Growth, World Adventure, and Church gameplay</> to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Beacon</> to develop Connections and marionettes; increase your level and Sequence to raise your skill levels.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡扮演】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>蕴含着其他途径能力的<Assistant_Red>光球</>，触碰后可运用不同途径的非凡能力，寻获隐蔽宝箱。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找非凡扮演</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【非凡扮演】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【非凡扮演】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 扮演序列者</>\n与光球互动，完成检定后即可进入对应途径的非凡扮演，体验专属非凡能力。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 获取奖励</>\n扮演完毕后，获得隐藏宝箱奖励，增加所在地图的完成度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Extraordinary Roleplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Spheres of light containing the abilities of other pathways. <Assistant_Red>Touch </>them to utilize the extraordinary abilities of different pathways and find hidden treasure chests.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding Extraordinary Roleplay</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Extraordinary Roleplay] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Extraordinary Roleplay] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Roleplaying a Sequence Beyonder</>\nInteract with the sphere of light and complete the check to enter the Extraordinary Roleplay of the corresponding pathway and experience exclusive extraordinary abilities.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Obtaining Rewards</>\nAfter finishing the roleplay, you will receive a hidden treasure chest reward and increase the completion progress of the current map.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡方案】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-技能-非凡方案</>即可配置非凡方案，包括技能、封印物和天赋；点击<Assistant_System>菜单-技能-一键辅助</>即可配置一键辅助方案，自动为玩家释放连招；点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-左下角</>即可配置装备方案，快速切换角色当前的装备。\n<Assistant_Title2>方案切换：</>点击主界面技能轮盘或下方技能列表上的<Assistant_System>快捷装配</>按钮，可将玩家当前的方案快速在已经配置的各个方案之间快速切换，以适应不同的对战环境\n<Assistant_Title2>成组切换：</>点击主界面技能轮盘或下方技能列表上的<Assistant_System>快捷装配</>按钮，并开启成组切换后，即可一键切换所有的方案；同时开启<Assistant_Property1>自动切换</>功能，根据非凡者进入的场景自动选择合适的成组方案进行切换。\n<Assistant_Title2>方案分享：</>在非凡方案界面点击左下角的<Assistant_System>分享</>按钮，即可将自身当前装配的方案分享给其他非凡者。其他非凡者可通过分享码或分享链接<Assistant_System>导入</>分享的方案。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[推荐方案]|507}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beyonder Schemes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Instructions: </> Click <Assistant_System>Menu-Skill-Beyonder Schemes</> to configure Beyonder schemes, including skills, Sealed Artifacts, and talents; click <Assistant_System>Menu-Skill-One-Click Support</> to configure one-click support schemes to automatically release combos for the player; click <Assistant_System>Menu-Character-Bottom Left</> to configure equipment schemes to quickly switch the character's current equipment. \n<Assistant_Title2> Scheme Switching: </> Click the <Assistant_System>Quick Equip</> button on the main interface skill wheel or the skill list below to quickly switch the player's current scheme among the configured ones to adapt to different combat environments. \n<Assistant_Title2> Group Switching: </> Click the <Assistant_System>Quick Equip</> button on the main interface skill wheel or the skill list below and enable group switching to switch all schemes with one click; simultaneously enable the <Assistant_Property1>Auto-Switch</> function to automatically select the appropriate group scheme based on the scene the Beyonder enters. \n<Assistant_Title2> Scheme Sharing: </> Click the <Assistant_System>Share</> button in the bottom left corner of the Beyonder Schemes interface to share your currently equipped scheme with other Beyonders. Other Beyonders can <Assistant_System>Import</> the shared scheme via a share code or link. \n\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Recommended Schemes]|507}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡评分】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>评分说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-非凡评分</>即可查看当前角色的非凡评分，非凡评分是角色各个方面养成情况和战力强弱的评价指标\n<Assistant_Title2>提分指南：</>进入非凡评分系统后，即可查看各个养成系统的<Assistant_Red>养成百分比</>，百分比较低的即为推荐提升的养成模块（百分比仅表示根据非凡者当前养成状况，推荐进行养成的模块，部分养成内容达到100%后仍可进一步提升哦）\n<Assistant_Title2>如何提升：</>在非凡评分系统中，点击想要提升的模块，即可查看该模块所需的<Assistant_Red>养成材料</>和<Assistant_Red>获取途径</>；点击“前往”按钮即可前往评分对应的系统；点击”攻略“按钮即可打开攻略站查看攻略\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[途径评分]|503}，{SendAnswer:[装备评分]|504}，{SendAnswer:[封印物评分]|505}，{SendAnswer:[非凡人物评分]|506}，{SendAnswer:[推荐方案]|507}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beyonder Rating】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Explanation: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Character - Beyonder Rating </> to view the current character's Beyonder Rating. Beyonder Rating is an evaluation index for the character's overall development and combat strength. \n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Improvement Guide: </>After entering the Beyonder Rating system, you can view the <Assistant_Red>development percentage </> of each development system. Modules with lower percentages are recommended for improvement (the percentage only indicates modules recommended for development based on the Beyonder's current status; some content can still be further improved even after reaching 100%). \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Improve: </>In the Beyonder Rating system, click on the module you wish to improve to view the <Assistant_Red>development materials </> and <Assistant_Red>acquisition methods </> required for that module; click the \"Go\" button to navigate to the corresponding system; click the \"Guide\" button to open the guide site and view strategies. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Pathway Rating]|503}, {SendAnswer:[Equipment Rating]|504}, {SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact Rating]|505}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Character Rating]|506}, {SendAnswer:[Recommended Builds]|507}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【颂诗礼服】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得颂诗礼服套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ode Dress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ode Dress set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风尚沙龙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>在鲁恩王国的上流社会,对时尚的品鉴是身份与数养的象征。绅士淑女们对服饰有着苛刻追求。根据场合、身份与季节,塔配得体的眼装,方能在社交圈中贏得尊重。通过品鉴挑战,展现你的审美,在上流圈声名鹊起。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找风尚沙龙</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【风尚沙龙】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【风尚沙龙】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 时装搭配PK</>\n与NPC对话后开启挑战，可以根据风格与评分进行搭配，PK胜利获得对应奖励。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n风尚沙龙不会计入秩序世界的完成度哟~"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fashion Salon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>In the high society of the Loen Kingdom, an appreciation for fashion is a symbol of status and cultivation. Gentlemen and ladies have exacting standards for their attire. By coordinating appropriate outfits according to the occasion, status, and season, you can earn respect in social circles. Show off your aesthetic sense through appreciation challenges and make a name for yourself in high society.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Fashion Salon</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Fashion Salon] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Fashion Salon] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Fashion Coordination PK</>\nStart the challenge after speaking with the NPC; you can coordinate based on style and ratings, and winning the PK will grant corresponding rewards.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nThe Fashion Salon does not count towards the completion progress of the Orderly World~",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风暴之泪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>星币池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得风暴之泪，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-星灵奇装</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Tear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Storm Tear. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风暴追逐】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>竞速，是风暴的缩影。驾驭蒸汽车疾驰于街巷，乘风破浪冲过险滩，借灵性之跃腾空飞跃追逐风暴之主的脚步，赢取独属于你的荣耀与馈赠。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找风暴追逐</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【风暴追逐】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【风暴追逐】玩法图标，并根据图标指引在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 发起挑战</>\n到达目标地点后，与竞速爱好者对话，选择开启竞速挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成竞速</>\n进入竞速位面后，根据路线指引前进，在倒计时结束前抵达终点即可完成挑战。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n触碰<Assistant_Property1>白色光圈</>可获得加速效果。\n触碰<Assistant_Red>红色光圈</>受到减速效果，建议尽量避开。\n挑战失败后可重新发起挑战！"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Chasing】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Racing is the epitome of a storm. Drive your steam car at full speed through the streets, ride the waves across dangerous shoals, and use the Leap of Spirituality to soar through the air as you follow in the footsteps of the Lord of Storms to win the glory and gifts that belong only to you.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding Storm Chasing</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Storm Chasing] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Storm Chasing] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Initiating a Challenge</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, speak with the racing enthusiast to start the racing challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Race</>\nAfter entering the racing plane, follow the route markers and reach the finish line before the countdown ends to complete the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nTouch the <Assistant_Property1>white ring</> to gain an acceleration effect.\nTouch the <Assistant_Red>red ring</> to receive a slow effect; it is recommended to avoid these.\nYou can restart the challenge if you fail!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飒爽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得飒爽，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Brisk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Brisk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飓风之斧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，战斗中提升自身<Assistant_Red>移动速度</>与<Assistant_Red>普攻攻速</>，普攻命中时概率造成<Assistant_Red>滞涩</>并触发闪电伤害；对目标触发闪电时，有概率触发闪电击中自己。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本-记忆的传承·强尼（普通）首通奖励。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hurricane Axe】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Increases your <Assistant_Red>Movement Speed</> and <Assistant_Red>Basic Attack Speed</> during combat. Basic attacks have a chance to cause <Assistant_Red>Stagnation</> and trigger lightning damage. When triggering lightning on a target, there is a chance to trigger lightning on yourself.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-clear reward for Dungeon - Legacy of Memory: Johnny (Normal).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飓风之斧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，战斗中提升自身<Assistant_Red>移动速度</>与<Assistant_Red>普攻攻速</>，普攻命中时概率造成<Assistant_Red>滞涩</>并触发闪电伤害；对目标触发闪电时，有概率触发闪电击中自己。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>副本记忆的传承一获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Hurricane Axe] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Attack-type Sealed Artifact \n <Assistant_Title2> Details: </> Competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Increases your <Assistant_Red> Movement Speed </> and <Assistant_Red> Basic Attack Speed </> in combat. Basic attacks have a chance to cause <Assistant_Red> Stagnation </> and trigger lightning damage. When triggering lightning on a target, there is a chance to trigger lightning on yourself. \n <Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained from the Inheritance of Memory I dungeon.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【餐食改良计划】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>铁十字街人头攒动，似乎正在举办什么活动。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(771,1144)]|-22840;14440;-2220;2;5200002;0}使用动作表情【四处观察】可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Meal Improvement Plan】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Iron Cross Street is bustling with people; it seems some kind of event is being held.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(771,1144)]|-22840;14440;-2220;2;5200002;0} and use the emote [Look Around] to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【马丁的菜摊】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>集市的肉摊前，摊主莫里正中气十足地叫……骂。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>66级</>后，前往{Location:[拉姆德古堡(248,496)]|14656;39861;1050;2;5200130;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Martin's Vegetable Stall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In front of the meat stall at the market, the stall owner, Mori, is shouting... and cursing with great vigor.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 66</>, go to {Location:[Lamud Castle(248,496)]|14656;39861;1050;2;5200130;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【高原战】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>高原战</>是势力战中的<Assistant_Red>800人</>战场。战场资格会在每轮四方联赛第一场结束后<Assistant_Red>21:00</>分配，获得资格的俱乐部成员可在<Assistant_System>以战养战-势力-高原战</>界面查看赛程安排。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Assistant_Property1>死亡骑士</>。死亡骑士会跟随身边<Assistant_Red>20米</>内非凡者数量最多的势力，且获得跟随至少需要<Assistant_Red>5人</>。死亡骑士身边的势力会定时增加势力积分，获得死亡骑士跟随的势力加分更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>胜利规则：</>成功将死亡骑士送达本阵营广场，可额外获得<Assistant_Red>1200势力积分</>。达到<Assistant_Red>15000势力积分</>的势力会提前获胜；战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名发放不同档次奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>劣势机制：</>与第一名相差<Assistant_Red>3000势力积分</>的势力会被视为劣势势力。每<Assistant_Red>5分钟</>，劣势势力广场前会投放<Assistant_Property1>绊马索</>，只有本势力非凡者可以拾取，使用后可减速死亡骑士；每<Assistant_Red>8分钟</>，劣势势力广场会开启集合传送，需要<Assistant_Red>1名</>非凡者前往广场区域激活，成功后该势力所有非凡者可传送至广场区域并获得强力buff。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往高原战]|1250323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Highland Battle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</><Assistant_System>Highland Battle</> is an <Assistant_Red>800-player</> battlefield in the Faction War. Battlefield eligibility is assigned at <Assistant_Red>21:00</> after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League. Club members who have obtained eligibility can view the schedule in the <Assistant_System>War-Driven Growth - Faction - Highland Battle</> interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Each faction needs to compete for the <Assistant_Property1>Death Knight</> on the central platform of the battlefield. The Death Knight will follow the faction with the most Beyonders within <Assistant_Red>20 meters</>, and at least <Assistant_Red>5 people</> are required to obtain the follow. Factions near the Death Knight will periodically gain faction points, and the faction followed by the Death Knight gains more points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Rules:</>Successfully delivering the Death Knight to your faction's plaza grants an additional <Assistant_Red>1200 faction points</>. The faction that reaches <Assistant_Red>15000 faction points</> wins early; when the battle ends, rewards of different tiers are distributed based on the faction point ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disadvantage Mechanism:</>Factions with a difference of <Assistant_Red>3000 faction points</> from the first place are considered disadvantaged. Every <Assistant_Red>5 minutes</>, <Assistant_Property1>Tripwires</> will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza, which can only be picked up by Beyonders of that faction. Using them can slow down the Death Knight. Every <Assistant_Red>8 minutes</>, a group teleport will open at the disadvantaged faction's plaza, requiring <Assistant_Red>1</> Beyonder to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successful, all Beyonders of that faction can teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Highland Battle]|1250323}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魅惑】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>名词介绍：</>加入<Assistant_System>春夜舞会</>的玩家可对其他玩家发起<Highlight>魅惑对决邀请</>，比拼魅力。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>具体玩法：</>春夜舞会玩家<Highlight>选中目标玩家</>，使用<Highlight>魅惑技能（卜杖寻路和灵体之线同位置按钮）</>发起邀请，且对方玩家在一段时间内接受邀请，则双方进入<Assistant_System>风尚对决</>流程。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>魅力检测：</>开始正式比拼前，双方将进行投骰，投骰检定通过可在后续比拼环节获得<Highlight>得分加成</>。发起方的<Assistant_System>社团等级</>越高，双方的<Assistant_System>投骰目标数值</>将随之变化。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>无论胜负双方均可获得一定奖励，<Assistant_System>魅惑失败</>的一方将强制佩戴包含<Highlight>胜利者名字</>的称号，持续<Highlight>15分钟</>。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Charm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Term Introduction:</>Players who have joined the <Assistant_System>Spring Night Ball</> can initiate <Highlight>Charm Duel invitations</> to other players to compete in charm.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Specific Gameplay:</>Spring Night Ball players <Highlight>select a target player</> and use the <Highlight>Charm skill (the same button position as Dowsing Rod Navigation and spirit body threads)</> to initiate an invitation. If the other player accepts the invitation within a certain period, both parties enter the <Assistant_System>Fashion Duel</> process.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Charm Check:</>Before the official competition begins, both parties will roll dice. Passing the dice check grants a <Highlight>score bonus</> in the subsequent competition phase. The higher the initiator's <Assistant_System>Covenant Level</>, the more the <Assistant_System>target dice value</> for both parties will change.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rewards:</>Both parties can receive certain rewards regardless of victory or defeat. The party that <Assistant_System>fails the Charm</> will be forced to wear a title containing the <Highlight>winner's name</> for <Highlight>15 minutes</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女与野兽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>听说廷根大剧院附近有一本神奇的故事书，去试着找找吧。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>30级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1068,996)]|6816;-314;-1868;2;5200002;0}捡起故事书后可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Witch and the Beast】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>I heard there's a magical storybook near the Tingen Grand Theater. Try to find it. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 30</>, go to {Location:[Tingen (1068,996)]|6816;-314;-1868;2;5200002;0} and pick up the storybook to trigger the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soules, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的余味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的余味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Aftertaste of the Witch] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Aftertaste of the Witch set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的回味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的回味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Witch's Aftertaste】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Witch's Aftertaste set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>城市暗面玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的滋味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>城市暗面悬赏值解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for City of Shadows gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Taste of the Witch set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via City of Shadows Bounty Value.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味真不错】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>50级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备、挂画·春夜之邀、双人·牵手"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Tingen have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Tingen's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of the Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味真不错】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>50级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备、挂画·春夜之邀、双人·牵手、称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Recent times in Tingen have not been peaceful. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks squad, you have been assigned a strange case. It points toward a certain salon in Tingen's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>50</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment, Hanging Painting: Invitation of Spring Night, Duo: Holding Hands, Title",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女雕像】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女雕像，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Witch Statue】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward display component\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Witch Statue. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔药茶会】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一位廷根富商的女儿失踪了，似乎与只在午夜举办的茶会有关。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>63级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(762,943)]|-23551;-5573;-1628;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Potion Tea Party】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type:</><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description:</>The daughter of a wealthy Tingen merchant has gone missing, and it seems to be related to a tea party held only at midnight.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept:</>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Level 63</> in Acting, head to {Location:[Tingen(762,943)]|-23551;-5573;-1628;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【鸦语】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得鸦语套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow Talk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Crow Talk outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄昏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得黄昏，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dusk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Dusk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄昏面具】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技倾向封印物，主动进入<Assistant_Red>强化状态</>后提升战斗技能和终结技攻速，并持续返还冷却时间，击杀或助攻可延长强化时间；强化状态结束时若仍处于战斗中，会进入<Assistant_Red>虚弱</>状态，降低攻击和移动速度。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>隐秘空间-双生余烬获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Twilight Mask】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A competitive-oriented Sealed Artifact. Actively entering the <Assistant_Red>Strengthening state</> increases the attack speed of combat skills and ultimate skills, and continuously refunds cooldowns. Kills or assists extend the duration of the strengthening. If you are still in combat when the strengthening ends, you enter a <Assistant_Red>Weakness</> state, reducing attack and movement speed.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained from Hidden Space - Twin Embers.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄金之罪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>黑荆棘事件簿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Property1>47级</>后，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-黑荆棘事件簿-黄金之罪</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与人数：</>5~6人组队，或选择人机模式前往。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>55装等金色装备、非凡物质等。每日1次奖励次数<Assistant_Red>（黑荆棘事件簿共享奖励次数）</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领攻略：</>{JumpToUI:[洛克·金]|1302137}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sin of Gold】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Log</>\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>After Beyonders reach <Assistant_Property1>Level 47</>, click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Blackthorn Incident Log - Sin of Gold</> to participate. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participants: </>Team of 5-6, or choose AI mode. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rewards: </>Level 55 Gold Equipment, Beyonder Materials, etc. 1 reward attempt per day <Assistant_Red>(shared with Blackthorn Incident Log)</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[Rock King]|1302137}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄金梦土】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷展台\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得黄金梦土，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-灵幻祭坛商店</>中使用灵幻牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Dreamland】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Showcase\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Golden Dreamland. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Showcase</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Spirit Illusion Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Spirit Illusion Altar Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄铜唱片机】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落展台\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得黄铜唱片机，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-五月庄园</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Brass Phonograph】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Showcase\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Brass Phonograph. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Showcase</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑占卜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一次占卜，一个巧合。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第十一天解锁。完成原著剧情《安提哥努斯笔记》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Black Divination】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A divination, a coincidence.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the eleventh day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Antigonus Notebook\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑占卜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一次占卜，一个巧合。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第十一天解锁。完成原著剧情《安提哥努斯笔记》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Black Divination】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A divination, a coincidence.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the eleventh day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Antigonus Notebook\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑暗】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台场景\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑色窄框眼镜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得黑色窄框眼镜，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-家族</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Black Narrow-Frame Glasses】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Gameplay Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Black Narrow-Frame Glasses; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay-Family</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑荆棘事件簿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>黑荆棘安保公司的主要业务就是处理廷根中发生的非凡者事件。加入公司后，需要处理各式各样的案件。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Property1>19级</>后，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-黑荆棘事件簿</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>世界冒险宝箱、金色装备、非凡物质等。每日1次奖励次数。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blackthorn Incident Log】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </> The main business of Blackthorn Security Company is to handle Beyonder incidents occurring in Tingen. After joining the company, you need to handle various cases.\n<Assistant_Title2> How to Participate: </> After reaching <Assistant_Property1>Level 19</>, Beyonders can click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - Blackthorn Incident Log</> to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Rewards: </> World Adventure Chests, Golden Equipment, Beyonder Materials, etc. 1 reward attempt per day.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黑荆棘安保公司】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>邓恩的邀请实在令人心动，去黑荆棘安保公司看看吧，人总是要工作的。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第三天解锁。完成原著剧情《意外的访客》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>48级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯、装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blackthorn Security Company】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Dunn's invitation is truly tempting; go check out the Blackthorn Security Company. One always needs to work.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the third day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing the original story \"Unexpected Visitor\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>48</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon, Equipment",
