    ["<Assistant_Title1>人偶发条</>\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍：</>\n1、秘偶培养达到上限后，溢出的<Assistant_Property1>秘偶碎片</>会转化为<Assistant_Property1>人偶发条</>。\n2、使用人偶发条可在<Assistant_System>秘偶-兑换-秘偶商店</>界面兑换道具。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[获取秘偶]|536}，{SendAnswer:[秘偶商店]|545}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Marionette Mainspring</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Introduction: </>\n 1. After Marionette Cultivation reaches the limit, overflowing <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Shards</> will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Mainsprings</>. \n 2. You can use Marionette Mainsprings to exchange for items in the <Assistant_System>Marionette-Exchange-Marionette Shop</> interface. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Obtain Marionette]|536}, {SendAnswer:[Marionette Shop]|545}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人好，喵好，大家好</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-漫游\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成漫游任务《雨中邂逅》"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Good People, Good Cats, Good Everyone </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Roaming \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Complete the Roaming quest \"Encounter in the Rain\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人形圣水</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>为非凡者恢复san值时累计成功20次"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Human Holy Water</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Successfully restore sanity to Beyonders 20 times in total",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人生真是喵喵又咪咪</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在时代百态《魔药茶会》中从猫咪嘴里获得线索"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Life is Just Meow Meow and Mimi </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Era Life \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Obtain clues from a cat in the Era Life \"Potion Tea Party\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n借助封印物<Assistant_Property1>历史回廊</>，可在历史孔隙中寻找散落在历史中的人物，与他们结识，向过去借取力量。\n多次结识能提高自身对目标的了解程度，获得对方更真实强大的能力。\n1、可通过<Assistant_Property1>结交</>获取<Assistant_Property2>人脉</>，解锁对应技能。\n2、重复获取的人脉可用来提升人脉层次，从而增强相应技能效果。\n3、结交更多人脉，可以增进对他们{SendAnswer:关系|551}的了解，提升<Assistant_Property2>历史研究</>程度，进而获得一定属性提升。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交方式：</>\n点击<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>进入{SendAnswer:结交人脉|554}界面，而后点击结交1次/5次，即可进行结交。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交消耗：</>\n每一次结交需要消耗一盏{SendAnswer:历史明灯|556}。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交规则：</>\n1、在结交活动中，每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n3、常驻结交活动与限时结交活动的保底次数会一直累积在对应活动中，互相独立计算，互不影响。\n4、对于常驻结交活动，可许愿指定人脉，提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n5、重复获得相同人脉时，将额外获得{SendAnswer:投影片段|557}。如果该人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，获得的投影片段数量将提高。投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换历史明灯、特定人脉。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}，{SendAnswer:[人脉许愿]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Connections </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </>\n Using the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1> Historical Void </>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history in the gaps of time, get to know them, and borrow power from the past. \n Getting to know them multiple times can improve your understanding of the target and allow you to obtain more authentic and powerful abilities from them. \n 1. You can obtain <Assistant_Property2> Connections </> through <Assistant_Property1> Socialize </> to unlock corresponding skills. \n 2. Repeatedly obtained Connections can be used to upgrade the level of the Connection, thereby enhancing the corresponding skill effects. \n 3. Making more Connections can improve your understanding of their {SendAnswer: Relationship | 551 }, increase your <Assistant_Property2> Historical Research </> level, and thus gain certain attribute bonuses. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Socialize: </> \n Click <Assistant_System> Menu-Connections-Socialize </> to enter the {SendAnswer: Socialize | 554 } interface, then click Socialize 1 time/5 times to perform the action. \n <Assistant_Title2> Socialize Consumption: </> \n Each time you socialize, it consumes one {SendAnswer: Historical Beacon | 556 }. \n <Assistant_Title2> Socialize Rules: </> \n 1. In the Socialize event, every 5 times you socialize, you are guaranteed to obtain an Epic or higher level Connection. \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive socializations, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 socializations. After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets and the probability returns to the base probability. \n 3. The pity counts for permanent Socialize events and limited-time Socialize events will always accumulate within their respective events, calculated independently and without affecting each other. \n 4. For permanent Socialize events, you can wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it when socializing. \n 5. When you repeatedly obtain the same Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer: Projection Fragments | 557 }. If the Connection has already reached its limit or you have enough materials to upgrade it to the limit, the number of Projection Fragments obtained will increase. Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for Historical Beacons or specific Connections in the Connection Shop. \n <Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </> {SendAnswer: [Relationship] | 551 }, {SendAnswer: [Socialize] | 554 }, {SendAnswer: [Connection Wish] | 555 }",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉商店</>\n<Assistant_Title2>查看：</>\n点击<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-兑换</>即可打开{SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}。\n<Assistant_Title2>兑换：</>\n可使用{SendAnswer:投影片段|557}兑换相应道具奖励，获取后可在背包使用。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[投影片段]|557}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Projection Fragments]|557}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉许愿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n在<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>界面的常驻结交活动中，点击视频左下方许愿按钮可进入许愿界面。\n<Assistant_Property2>许愿</>指定人脉后，可提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n<Assistant_Title2>许愿规则：</>\n可许愿的人脉为可结交的传说人脉。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，获取许愿目标的概率提高到<Assistant_Property1>80%</>。如果获得的传说人脉不是许愿目标，那下次获得的传说人脉必定为许愿目标。\n常驻结交中，<Assistant_Property1>每周</>可以生效<Assistant_Property1>2次</>许愿效果，周一重置。每当结交人脉<Assistant_Property1>110次</>，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。\n许愿一位人脉后，若误操作选错许愿目标，可点击取消许愿按钮取消许愿。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wishing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nIn the permanent connection event in the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Make Connections</> interface, click the wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the wishing interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>Wishing </> for a specific connection can increase the probability of obtaining that connection when making connections. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wishing Rules: </>\nConnections that can be wished for are legendary connections that can be made. \nAfter wishing, when you obtain a legendary connection, the probability of getting the wished target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the legendary connection obtained is not the wished target, the next legendary connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wished target. \nIn permanent connections, you can have <Assistant_Property1>2</> wish effects take effect <Assistant_Property1>per week</>, resetting on Monday. Every time you make <Assistant_Property1>110</> connections, you can obtain one additional wish attempt. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset attempts. \nAfter wishing for a connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the cancel wish button to cancel the wish. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationships]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
