    ["<Assistant_Title1>历史明灯</>\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍：</>\n使用历史明灯可在结交人脉界面结交人脉。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交方式：</>\n点击<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-结交人脉</>进入结交界面，而后点击结交1次/5次，即可进行结交。\n<Assistant_Title2>结交消耗：</>\n每一次结交需要消耗一盏历史明灯。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>\n1、在结交人脉界面点击结交，历史明灯不足时会弹出快捷购买。\n2、进入<Assistant_System>商城-商城-秘藏陈列</>购买。\n3、进入<Assistant_System>商城-百货-报销商店/冒险商店</>购买。\n4、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-兑换</>打开人脉商店兑换。\n5、通过<Assistant_System>命运的馈赠</>或<Assistant_System>段位天梯</>获得。\n6、通过部分<Assistant_System>跑团</>玩法或<Assistant_System>任务</>获得。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historical Beacon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Description:</>\nUse a Historical Beacon to make connections in the Connection interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Connect:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Make Connections</> to enter the connection interface, then click Connect 1x/5x to perform a connection.\n<Assistant_Title2>Connection Cost:</>\nEach connection consumes one Historical Beacon.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>\n1. Click Connect in the Connection interface; if you have insufficient Historical Beacons, a quick purchase prompt will appear.\n2. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-Shop-Secret Collection</> to purchase.\n3. Enter <Assistant_System>Shop-General-Reimbursement Shop/Adventure Shop</> to purchase.\n4. Open the Connection Shop via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange.\n5. Obtain through <Assistant_System>Fate's Gift</> or <Assistant_System>Ranked Ladder</>.\n6. Obtain through certain <Assistant_System>TRPG</> gameplay or <Assistant_System>Quests</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
