    ["<Assistant_Title1>困难·瑞尔比伯</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀困难难度瑞尔比伯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hard · Riel Bieber</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Riel Bieber on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>困难·西尔维娅</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀困难难度西尔维娅"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hard · Sylvia</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Sylvia on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>困难·龟龟！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀困难难度厄水巨龟"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hard · Turtle!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Misfortune Water Giant Turtle on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>圣光！净化！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>净化污染词条为非凡词条"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Holy Light! Purification!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Purify a corruption trait into an Extraordinary trait",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>地下黑市</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第三章主线中，通过暗门，进入恶龙酒吧地下市场。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Underground Black Market</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Story\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>In the third chapter main story, pass through the secret door and enter the Evil Dragon Bar underground market.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>均衡战术</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在一届内的8轮以上场次投入幻影"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Balanced Tactics</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Invest phantoms in more than 8 rounds within a single session",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城主阁下</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>城堡等级达到6级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Your Lordship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - May Manor · Castle\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Castle Level 6",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡-工坊</>\n<Assistant_Title2>基础介绍：</>\n1. 放置<Assistant_Property1>秘偶</>后，可选择并生产各种<Assistant_Property2>物产</>。\n2. 升级<Assistant_Property2>工坊</>后解锁更多物产。\n3. 工坊升级需要消耗<Assistant_Property2>城堡资产</>，同时升级受到城堡等级的限制。\n<Assistant_Title2>生产相关：</>\n1. <Assistant_Property1>上阵秘偶</>：工坊必须上阵秘偶，才能开始生产。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>稀有物产</>：制造物产时，有概率出现稀有物产（稀有物产的售价更高）。\n3. <Assistant_Property1>生产诀窍</>：查看他人城堡的高价回购清单，优先生产高价物产。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle-Workshop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Basic Introduction: </>\n1. After placing a <Assistant_Property1>marionette</>, you can select and produce various <Assistant_Property2>products</>.\n2. Upgrade the <Assistant_Property2>Workshop</> to unlock more products.\n3. Upgrading the workshop consumes <Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> and is limited by the castle level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Production Details: </>\n1. <Assistant_Property1>Deploy Marionette</>: A marionette must be deployed in the workshop to begin production.\n2. <Assistant_Property2>Rare Products</>: There is a chance to produce rare products during manufacturing (rare products have a higher selling price).\n3. <Assistant_Property1>Production Tips</>: Check the high-price buyback lists of other castles and prioritize producing high-value products.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡-市场</>\n<Assistant_Title2>高价收购：</>\n1. 每周会有多种<Assistant_Property2>物产</>高价收购。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>高价物产</>可在<Assistant_System>工坊生产界面</>和<Assistant_System>市场界面</>查看。\n3. 高价收购的物产数量和随机价格倍率，将随城堡等级提升而提升。\n<Assistant_Title2>他人城堡：</>\n1. 不同城堡的每周<Assistant_Property2>高价收购清单</>不同；可前往好友城堡进行物产出售。\n2. 出售物产时，在自家城堡出售不限数量，在好友城堡出售有数量上限（建议去不同好友城堡里出售物产）。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle-Market</>\n<Assistant_Title2>High-Price Acquisition: </>\n1. Every week, there will be various <Assistant_Property2>products</> acquired at high prices.\n2. <Assistant_Property2>High-Price Products</> can be viewed in the <Assistant_System>Workshop Production Interface</> and the <Assistant_System>Market Interface</>.\n3. The quantity of high-price acquisitions and the random price multiplier will increase as the castle level rises.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Castles: </>\n1. The weekly <Assistant_Property2>High-Price Acquisition List</> varies for different castles; you can visit friends' castles to sell products.\n2. When selling products, there is no limit to the quantity sold in your own castle, but there is a limit when selling in friends' castles (it is recommended to visit different friends' castles to sell products).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n玩家自行建造<Assistant_Property2>城堡</>，可在城堡内进行<Assistant_Property1>建造</>、<Assistant_Property1>工坊生产</>、<Assistant_Property1>市场收购</>、<Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨</>等玩法。\n<Assistant_Title2>获得方式：</>\n扮演等级>19级的非凡者，通过完成奇迹的城堡任务解锁城堡，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-城堡</>可回到城堡。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡升级条件：</>\n1. 当前城堡可升级（城堡最高等级随服务器开服天数逐步开放）。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>城堡总评分</>（城堡组件评分总和）达到指定评分。 \n3. <Assistant_Property2>城堡建造评分</>（城堡实际摆放的组件评分总和）达到指定评分。\n4. 以上条件达成后，再消耗一定<Assistant_Property2>城堡资产</>即可升级。 \n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产作用：</>\n<Assistant_Property2>城堡资材</>可用于购买家具和城堡升级消耗。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产获得：</>\n1. 任务奖励——完成<Assistant_Property1>铁路大亨</>任务可获得城堡资产。\n2. 市场收购——非凡者可以通过将城堡工坊产出的物产，去他人城堡卖出获得城堡资产。\n<Assistant_Title2>城堡资产存储：</>\n1. 城堡可获得资产有每周上限，超过可获得上限的资产将无法累计；同理，超过城堡存储资产上限也将无法累计。\n2. 每周可获得资产、城堡资产存储上限将随城堡等级一并提升。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\nPlayers can build their own <Assistant_Property2>Castle</>, where they can engage in <Assistant_Property1>Construction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Workshop Production</>, <Assistant_Property1>Market Acquisition</>, <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon</>, and other gameplay.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>\nBeyonders with an Acting Level > 19 can unlock the castle by completing the Miracle Castle quest. Click <Assistant_System>Menu-Castle</> to return to the castle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Castle Upgrade Conditions: </>\n1. The current castle can be upgraded (the maximum castle level gradually opens based on the number of days the server has been live).\n2. <Assistant_Property2>Total Castle Rating</> (sum of castle component ratings) reaches the specified rating. \n3. <Assistant_Property2>Castle Construction Rating</> (sum of ratings of components actually placed in the castle) reaches the specified rating.\n4. After meeting the above conditions, consume a certain amount of <Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> to upgrade. \n<Assistant_Title2>Purpose of Castle Assets: </>\n<Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> can be used to purchase furniture and for castle upgrade costs.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain Castle Assets: </>\n1. Quest Rewards—Complete <Assistant_Property1>Railway Tycoon</> quests to obtain Castle Assets.\n2. Market Acquisition—Beyonders can sell products produced by their castle workshop at other players' castles to obtain Castle Assets.\n<Assistant_Title2>Castle Asset Storage: </>\n1. There is a weekly cap on the assets a castle can obtain; assets exceeding the cap cannot be accumulated. Similarly, assets exceeding the castle's storage limit cannot be accumulated.\n2. The weekly obtainable assets and the castle asset storage limit will increase along with the castle level.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡初兴</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>城堡总评分达到1000分"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle's Early Rise</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - May Manor · Castle\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach a total Castle rating of 1000 points",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡的落幕沉眠</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>通关五月庄园·城堡困难难度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Castle's Curtain Call Slumber</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Clear May Manor · Castle on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>天灾化身的恩眷</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得1个带有<天灾化身>词条的非凡物质"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Blessing of the Disaster Avatar</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Cultivation - Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 1 Extraordinary material with the <Disaster Avatar> tag",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>好奇心</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成首个诡变宝箱"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Curiosity</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the first Mysterious Treasure Chest",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>妙手回春啊大师</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>成功为至少100位处于失控或失控边缘的非凡者恢复理智"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Master of Healing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>TRPG-Covenant\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Successfully restore sanity for at least 100 Beyonders who are experiencing loss of control or are on the edge of loss of control",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>子嗣守护</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度子嗣守护"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Offspring Protection</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Offspring Protection on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>子爵夫人</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度子爵夫人"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Viscountess</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Viscountess on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>学徒永远及时</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第三章主线中，危急时刻获得丽贝卡的及时援助。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Apprentices Are Always On Time</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Story\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>In the third chapter main story, receive timely assistance from Rebecca in a critical moment.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>学徒真好用</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在时代百态《闪电莉莉》中击败混混帮闪电莉莉脱困"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Apprentice is Really Useful </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Era Life \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Defeat the thugs to help Lightning Lily escape in the Era Life \"Lightning Lily\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>守序市民</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第五章主线中默默排队买票。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Orderly Citizen</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Silently wait in line to buy tickets in the Chapter 5 main quest.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>守序市民</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第五章现实主线排队买票（与让我先来互斥）"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Orderly Citizen </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Plot - Reality Main Story \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Wait in line to buy a ticket in the Chapter 5 Reality Main Story (Mutually exclusive with Let Me Go First)",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>守护者的馈赠</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得1个带有<守护者>词条的非凡物质"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Gift of the Guardian</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Cultivation - Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Obtain 1 Extraordinary material with the <Guardian> entry.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>安全了！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第四章主线中，击退异变的狼人，成功进入安全屋。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Safe!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Story\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>In the fourth chapter main story, repel the mutated Werewolf and successfully enter the Safe House.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>安全护送</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>普通难度成功护送马车"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Safe Escort</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Successfully escort the carriage on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>安魂十律\n</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在教团【安魂诗社】中成长为【圣使】"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Ten Laws of Requiem\n</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Grow to [Saint Envoy] in the [Requiem Poetry Society]",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>安魂邀约</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>加入教团【安魂诗社】"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Requiem Invitation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Join the organization [Requiem Poetry Society]",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>完美扮演者</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>序列9消化进度达到100%"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Perfect Actor</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Sequence 9 digestion progress reaches 100%",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>宝藏猎人</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成6个时虫宝藏"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Treasure Seeker</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete 6 Worm of Time Treasures",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>密修会的小丑</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度小丑"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Clown of the Secret Order</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Clown on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>寻宝人</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成首个时虫宝藏"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Treasure Hunter</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the first Worm of Time Treasure",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>封印物</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统说明：</>\n你正在使用的封印物，本质上是由某位神秘的“奇迹师”所召唤的<Assistant_Property1>历史投影</>。这种历史投影相较于原版封印物，能力有所弱化，但负面效果也有所减轻，能为非凡者带来各种提升。\n其中，<Assistant_Property1>普通封印物</>分为攻击、防御、特化三种，每类封印物最多携带一件使用；<Assistant_Property2>特殊封印物</>为非凡者提供各种特殊能力，不直接提升非凡者战力。\n1、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-封印物</>或快捷键<Assistant_Property1>F5</>可以进入封印物系统，选择<Assistant_Property2>封印物</>携带。\n2、普通封印物初始均为“3”级，可以消耗<Assistant_Property1>历史回响</>将封印物提升到“2”级；可以消耗<Assistant_Property2>历史结晶</>将封印物提升到“1”级。“3”级封印物最多可生效4条非凡物质词条效果，“2”级封印物最多可生效5条非凡物质词条效果。\n3、扮演等级达到42级时，可解锁<Assistant_Property1>非凡物质</>填充。为封印物填充不同的非凡物质，能为封印物附加上各种额外的效果。\n4、封印物填充非凡物质时，根据非凡物质的词条数量，额外生效<Assistant_Property2>非凡共鸣</>效果，封印物等级提升，会提高非凡共鸣所能生效的最大词条数量。\n5、提升<Assistant_Property1>非凡知识</>等级，能使你更好地掌控非凡之力，封印物非凡能力效果、非凡物质固定属性值与非凡共鸣属性值会随非凡知识等级提升。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[获取封印物]|1266}，{SendAnswer:[封印物升级]|1267}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质]|1268}，{SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Sealed Artifact</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Explanation:</>\nThe Sealed Artifact you are currently using is essentially a <Assistant_Property1>historical projection</> summoned by a mysterious \"Miracle Invoker.\" Compared to the original Sealed Artifact, this historical projection has weakened abilities, but its negative effects are also mitigated, providing various enhancements to Beyonders.\nAmong them, <Assistant_Property1>Common Sealed Artifacts</> are divided into Attack, Defense, and Specialization types, with a maximum of one of each type equipped; <Assistant_Property2>Special Sealed Artifacts</> provide Beyonders with various special abilities and do not directly increase combat power.\n1. You can enter the Sealed Artifact system via <Assistant_System>Menu-Sealed Artifact</> or the shortcut <Assistant_Property1>F5</> to select a <Assistant_Property2>Sealed Artifact</> to equip.\n2. Common Sealed Artifacts start at Level 3; you can consume <Assistant_Property1>Historical Echoes</> to upgrade them to Level 2, and consume <Assistant_Property2>Historical Crystals</> to upgrade them to Level 1. Level 3 Sealed Artifacts can have up to 4 Beyonder material effect entries active, while Level 2 Sealed Artifacts can have up to 5.\n3. When your Acting level reaches 42, you can unlock <Assistant_Property1>Beyonder Material</> filling. Filling a Sealed Artifact with different Beyonder materials can grant it various additional effects.\n4. When filling a Sealed Artifact with Beyonder materials, additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects will take effect based on the number of material entries. Upgrading the Sealed Artifact level increases the maximum number of entries that can be affected by Beyonder Resonance.\n5. Increasing your <Assistant_Property1>Beyonder Knowledge</> level allows you to better control Beyonder powers; the effects of Sealed Artifact Beyonder abilities, fixed attributes of Beyonder materials, and Beyonder Resonance attribute values will increase with your Beyonder Knowledge level.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Obtain Sealed Artifact]|1266}, {SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact Upgrade]|1267}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[Obtain Beyonder Material]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material Aggregation]|1270}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>封印物升级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n普通封印物初始均为“3”级，可以消耗<Assistant_Property1>历史回响</>将封印物提升到“2”级；可以消耗<Assistant_Property2>历史结晶</>将封印物提升到“1”级。“3”级封印物最多可生效4条非凡物质词条效果，“2”级封印物最多可生效5条非凡物质词条效果。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[获取封印物]|1266}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Sealed Artifact Upgrade</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Explanation: </>\nNormal Sealed Artifacts start at Level 3. You can consume <Assistant_Property1>Echoes of History</> to upgrade a Sealed Artifact to Level 2, and consume <Assistant_Property2>Crystals of History</> to upgrade it to Level 1. A Level 3 Sealed Artifact can have up to 4 Extraordinary Material entry effects active, while a Level 2 Sealed Artifact can have up to 5.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Obtaining Sealed Artifacts]|1266}",
