    ["<Assistant_Title1>胜利的滋味</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>自身召唤的投影取得单场第一"] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Taste of Victory</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>A projection summoned by yourself takes first place in a single round",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>脱离卡死</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-漫游\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在漫游任务中帮助卡门脱离困境"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Unstuck </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Story - Roaming \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Help Carmen get out of trouble in the Roaming quest",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>舞台之上焦点</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成春夜舞会系列成就【月下十重舞】【万人迷】【强者也得为我倾倒】"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Focus on the Stage</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>TRPG-Covenant\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Complete the Spring Night Ball series achievements [Ten Dances Under the Moon], [Heartthrob], [Even the Strong Must Fall for Me]",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>舞池新手</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在廷根任意跳舞点累计跳舞超过1小时"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Dance Floor Novice</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Accumulate over 1 hour of dancing at any Dance Point in Tingen",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>花园的终局盛放</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>通关五月庄园·花园困难难度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Garden's Final Bloom</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Clear May Manor · Garden on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>荒芜主母的恩眷</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得1个带有<荒芜主母>词条的非凡物质"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Favor of the Matriarch of Desolation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Development - Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 1 Beyonder Material with the <Matriarch of Desolation> entry",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>获取封印物</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n通过<Assistant_System>菜单-封印物</>或快捷键<Assistant_Property1>F5</>可以进入封印物系统，点击“攻击封印物”、“防御封印物”、“特化封印物”进行封印物携带界面，选中想要获取的封印物，封印物详情底部显示对应封印物的获得途径。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[封印物升级]|1267}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Obtain Sealed Artifact</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nEnter the Sealed Artifact system via <Assistant_System>Menu - Sealed Artifact</> or the shortcut key <Assistant_Property1>F5</>. Click on \"Attack Sealed Artifact,\" \"Defense Sealed Artifact,\" or \"Specialized Sealed Artifact\" to enter the equipment interface. Select the desired Sealed Artifact, and the acquisition method will be displayed at the bottom of the details page.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search:</>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact Upgrade]|1267}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>获取秘偶</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n“愚者”先生赐予的封印物<Assistant_Property1>乌托邦剧院</>，可以帮助非凡者获取并操控秘偶。\n1、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-秘偶-获取秘偶</>可以进入<Assistant_Property1>乌托邦剧院</>，抽选<Assistant_Property2>秘偶</>，解锁对应秘偶技能。\n2、乌托邦剧院戏台每次<Assistant_Property1>刷新</>会上架<Assistant_Red>3个</>秘偶，可供抽选。若抽选后戏台上只剩<Assistant_Red>紫色</>品质秘偶，戏台会自动刷新。\n序幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*3，从台上3个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n中幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*6，从台上剩余2个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n落幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*12，必定获得台上剩余的1个秘偶。\n3、序幕抽选后，也可以主动<Assistant_Property1>放弃</>剩余秘偶，进行刷新。\n4、进行<Assistant_Property1>秘偶许愿</>，选择特定的秘偶，可以提升该秘偶出现的概率。\n5、重复获取的秘偶会转化为秘偶碎片，可用来进行<Assistant_Property1>秘偶培养</>，提升角色属性和增强秘偶技能。\n6、秘偶培养达到上限后，溢出的<Assistant_Property1>秘偶碎片</>会转化为<Assistant_Property1>人偶发条</>，可以到<Assistant_Property1>秘偶商店</>兑换为其他道具。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[秘偶培养]|537}，{SendAnswer:[人偶发条]|543}，{SendAnswer:[秘偶商店]|545}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Obtain Marionette</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\nThe Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Utopia Theater</> bestowed by Mr. Fool can help Beyonders obtain and control marionettes.\n1. You can enter the <Assistant_System>Utopia Theater</> via <Assistant_Property1>Menu - Marionette - Obtain Marionette</> to draw <Assistant_Property2>marionettes</> and unlock corresponding Marionette Skills.\n2. The Utopia Theater stage will <Assistant_Property1>refresh</> and list <Assistant_Red>3</> marionettes available for selection each time. If only <Assistant_Red>Purple</> quality marionettes remain on the stage after drawing, the stage will automatically refresh.\nPrologue Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*3 to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 marionettes on stage.\nInterlude Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*6 to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining marionettes on stage.\nCurtain Call Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*12 to guarantee obtaining the 1 remaining marionette on stage.\n3. After the Prologue Draw, you can also choose to <Assistant_Property1>give up</> on the remaining marionettes and refresh.\n4. Perform <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Wish</> and select a specific marionette to increase the probability of that marionette appearing.\n5. Duplicate marionettes obtained will be converted into Marionette Shards, which can be used for <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Cultivation</> to increase character attributes and enhance Marionette Skills.\n6. After Marionette Cultivation reaches the limit, excess <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Shards</> will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Clockwork</>, which can be exchanged for other items in the <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Shop</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Marionette Cultivation]|537}, {SendAnswer:[Marionette Clockwork]|543}, {SendAnswer:[Marionette Shop]|545}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>获取非凡物质</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n可以通过<Assistant_Property1>世界冒险-副本</>、<Assistant_Property1>以战养战-竞逐</>、<Assistant_Property1>任务</>、<Assistant_Property1>报销商店</>、<Assistant_Property1>凯旋商店</>、<Assistant_Property1>交易所</>等途径获取。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质]|1268}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Obtain Extraordinary Materials</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\nCan be obtained through <Assistant_Property1>World Adventure - Dungeon</>, <Assistant_Property1>War-based Progression - Competition</>, <Assistant_Property1>Quest</>, <Assistant_Property1>Reimbursement Shop</>, <Assistant_Property1>Triumph Shop</>, <Assistant_Property1>Exchange Market</>, and other channels.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Extraordinary Material]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[Extraordinary Material Aggregation]|1270}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>蒸汽赞歌</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>工坊累计生产5000个物产"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hymn of Steam</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - May Manor · Castle\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Workshops have produced a total of 5000 items",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>行走的宝库</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>穿戴8件橙色品质及以上装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Walking Treasury</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Equip 8 items of Orange quality or higher",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>被选中之“人”</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-趣味\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>被选定成为幻象投影一次"] = "<Assistant_Title1>The Chosen \"Person\"</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>Leisure-Fun\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Selected to become a phantom projection once",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>装备品质：</>紫色、金色、橙色、红色（神话）。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>装备部位：</>当前赛季开放的装备部位有武器、胸针、指环、护符、帽子、披风、鞋靴、护甲。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>获取途径：</>装备可通过开启世界冒险/以战养战/社交馈赠秘宝、挑战各类副本、参加各类大型竞技玩法获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Quality: </> Purple, Gold, Orange, Red (Mythical). \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Slots: </> The equipment slots available for the current season are Weapon, Brooch, Ring, Amulet, Hat, Cloak, Shoes, and Armor. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </> Equipment can be obtained by opening World Adventure/War-forged/Social Gift treasures, challenging various dungeons, and participating in large-scale competition activities.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备强化</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、每个部位都可以通过消耗强化材料进行强化，最多强化至8阶。\n\n2、每个阶段都可以提升角色的属性能力，提升的属性展示在装备的基础属性部分。\n\n3、更换装备时，强化效果无损转移；未穿戴对应部位装备时，强化效果不生效。\n\n4、每个部位的强化阶段同时达到对应要求后，将激活强化套装，进一步提升角色能力。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>道具获取：</>强化材料可通过报销商店兑换、开启世界冒险/以战养战/社交馈赠秘宝获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment Strengthening </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. Each slot can be strengthened by consuming strengthening materials, up to a maximum of Tier 8. \n\n 2. Each stage increases the character's attribute capabilities, which are displayed in the base attribute section of the equipment. \n\n 3. When changing equipment, the strengthening effect is transferred without loss; the effect is not active if the corresponding slot is empty. \n\n 4. Once the strengthening stages of all slots reach the corresponding requirements, the strengthening set will be activated, further enhancing character capabilities. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Acquisition: </> Strengthening materials can be obtained via Reimbursement Shop exchanges or by opening World Adventure/War-forged/Social Gift treasures.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备词条</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、装备在产出时，会带有随机词条。\n\n2、获得带有非凡词条的装备时，词条组合将被保存，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中应用已保存的词条组合。\n例如：获得带有2条非凡词条的指环时，指环上的词条组合将自动保存，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中找到被保存的方案，并应用到任意指环。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment Affixes </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. Equipment comes with random affixes upon acquisition. \n\n 2. When obtaining equipment with Extraordinary affixes, the affix combination will be saved, and you can apply saved combinations via the \"Gift\" section on the right side of the Reshape interface. \n Example: When obtaining a ring with 2 Extraordinary affixes, the affix combination on the ring will be automatically saved, and you can find the saved scheme in the \"Gift\" section on the right of the Reshape interface to apply it to any ring.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>装备重塑</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、当前赛季中，武器、护甲、胸针、帽子部位将依次解锁词条重塑功能。解锁后，可消耗蓝山晶石对装备进行重塑，获得随机的装备词条。\n\n2、未解锁重塑的部位，仍可进行词条保存和应用。例如：通过玩法获得带有2条非凡词条的指环时，该词条组合将自动保存，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中应用到任意指环。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>道具获取：</>可通过分解装备、报销商店兑换等方式获取蓝山晶石。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Equipment Reshaping </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. In the current season, the Weapon, Armor, Brooch, and Hat slots will unlock the affix reshaping function sequentially. Once unlocked, you can consume Blue Mountain Crystals to reshape equipment and obtain random equipment affixes. \n\n 2. Slots that have not unlocked reshaping can still have their affixes saved and applied. For example, when obtaining a ring with 2 Extraordinary affixes through gameplay, the combination is automatically saved and can be applied to any ring via the \"Gift\" section on the right of the Reshape interface. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Acquisition: </> Blue Mountain Crystals can be obtained by dismantling equipment or exchanging in the Reimbursement Shop.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>西尔维娅</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度西尔维娅"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Sylvia</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Sylvia on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>见证众神之战</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与众神之巅玩法后取得八强荣誉称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Witnessing the Battle of the Gods</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 8 honorary title after participating in the Peak of the Gods gameplay",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>让我先来！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-现实主线\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在第五章主线中试图插队买票。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Let Me Go First!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Reality Main Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Attempt to cut in line to buy tickets in the Chapter 5 main quest.",
