    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡大飙客</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成5个竞速玩法探索"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Speedster</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete 5 racing gameplay explorations",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡学徒</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>累计进行50次非凡物质聚合"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Extraordinary Apprentice</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Perform 50 Extraordinary material aggregations",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡宗师</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>累计进行500次非凡物质聚合"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Extraordinary Grandmaster</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Perform 500 Extraordinary material aggregations",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡抱团</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-教团\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>加入任意一个教团"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Gathering</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Group Play-Organization\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Join any Organization",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡挚友</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到隐秘盟友"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Best Friend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach \"Secret Ally\" friendship level with any friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡物质</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n1、带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入<Assistant_Property1>封印物</>来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的<Assistant_Property2>非凡共鸣</>效果。\n2、非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n3、非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，<Assistant_Property2>异变词条</>相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。异变词条在单个非凡物质上最多出现1条。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </>\n1. Materials containing Beyonder power can be filled into <Assistant_Property1>Sealed Artifacts</> to stabilize historical projections and unlock more additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects.\n2. The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into entries. Due to the different Beyonder characteristic sequences and quantities that compose them, Beyonder materials vary in the number, type, and strength of their entries. There is at least 1 entry, and up to 6 entries; Beyonder materials with more than 6 entries have not yet been discovered.\n3. The random entries of Beyonder materials are influenced or corrupted by high-level powers, which may lead to mutations. <Assistant_Property2>Mutated entries</> bring more powerful effects compared to ordinary entries. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 mutated entry.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Obtaining Beyonder Materials]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material Aggregation]|1270}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡物质聚合</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n扮演等级达到47级解锁非凡物质聚合，可以将两个非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质。\n1、聚合时，聚合产物的词条会<Assistant_Red>全部</>从<Assistant_Red>放入的非凡物质</>的词条中随机选取。\n2、聚合时有极小概率出现异变，生成<Assistant_Property2>异变词条</>，放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数量与类型不同时，可以出现的异变词条不同。\n3、当前持有的4词条及以上攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁4词条攻击非凡物质放入聚合；当前持有的5词条攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁5词条非凡物质放入聚合。\n4、进行非凡物质聚合时会提升<Assistant_Property1>聚合熟练度</>，聚合熟练度赛季重置，达到一定值后可以获得奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质]|1268}，{SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material Synthesis</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nBeyonder Material Synthesis is unlocked when your Acting level reaches 47. You can synthesize two Beyonder materials into a new one.\n1. During synthesis, the entries of the resulting product are <Assistant_Red>entirely</> randomly selected from the entries of the <Assistant_Red>input Beyonder materials</>.\n2. There is a very small probability of mutation during synthesis, generating <Assistant_Property2>Mutated Entries</>. The possible Mutated Entries vary depending on the total number and types of entries in the input Beyonder materials.\n3. When you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 4 or more entries, you unlock the ability to use 4-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis; when you possess at least 2 Attack Beyonder materials and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 5 entries, you unlock the ability to use 5-entry Beyonder materials for synthesis.\n4. Performing Beyonder material synthesis increases <Assistant_Property1>Synthesis Proficiency</>. Synthesis Proficiency resets each season, and you can obtain rewards after reaching certain values.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Extraordinary Material]|1268}, {SendAnswer:[Obtain Extraordinary Material]|1269}",
