    ["<Assistant_Title1>龙息之下</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-势力\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在猎城战直面战争巨龙，受到巨龙的伤害"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Under the Dragon's Breath</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Faction\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Face the War Dragon in the Hunting City Battle and take damage from it",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>龟龟！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度厄水巨龟"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Turtle!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Misfortune Water Giant Turtle on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Assistant_Title2>装修说明：</>\n1. 可通过右上方的<Assistant_Property1>装修</>按钮，进入<Assistant_Property2>城堡装修模式</>。\n2. 装修功能：<Assistant_Property1>家具装修</>（放置、连铺、回收）、<Assistant_Property1>智能镜头</>（自由视角、俯视视角、跟随视角）、<Assistant_Property1>快捷功能</>（快捷购买、快捷回收、高层显隐等）。\n3. 快捷功能：<Assistant_Property1>奇迹建造</>（圈出范围，自动生成建筑群）、<Assistant_Property1>城堡模板</>（下载官方模板，快速生成城堡）。\n<Assistant_Title2>装修界面说明：</>\n1. <Assistant_Property2>家具库</>：下方是家具库，可以选择、搜索、筛选家具。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>建造镜头</>：右上方可进行镜头切换。\n3. <Assistant_Property2>评分与消耗</>：右上方为评分区，展示<Assistant_Property2>城堡总评分</>和<Assistant_Property2>城堡资产</>数量。\n4. <Assistant_Property2>家具选中状态</>：放置家具时，蓝色表示此处可以摆放；红色表示此处不可摆放。"] = "<Assistant_Title2>Decoration Instructions: </>\n1. You can enter <Assistant_Property2>Castle Decoration Mode</> via the <Assistant_Property1>Decoration</> button in the top right.\n2. Decoration Functions: <Assistant_Property1>Furniture Decoration</> (placement, tiling, recycling), <Assistant_Property1>Smart Camera</> (free view, top-down view, follow view), <Assistant_Property1>Shortcut Functions</> (quick purchase, quick recycle, high-level visibility toggle, etc.).\n3. Shortcut Functions: <Assistant_Property1>Miracle Construction</> (circle an area to automatically generate building clusters), <Assistant_Property1>Castle Templates</> (download official templates to quickly generate a castle).\n<Assistant_Title2>Decoration Interface Explanation: </>\n1. <Assistant_Property2>Furniture Library</>: Located at the bottom, you can select, search, and filter furniture here.\n2. <Assistant_Property2>Construction Camera</>: Switch camera modes in the top right.\n3. <Assistant_Property2>Rating and Consumption</>: The top right is the rating area, displaying the <Assistant_Property2>Total Castle Rating</> and the amount of <Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</>.\n4. <Assistant_Property2>Furniture Selection Status</>: When placing furniture, blue indicates it can be placed here; red indicates it cannot.",
    ["<BigText>契</>言交<BigText>换</>"] = "<BigText> Oa </> th Ex <BigText> chan </> ge",
    ["<Brown>预存物品</>供俱乐部成员自取，被领取后可以获得奖励"] = "<Brown> Pre-stored items </> for club members to take; rewards can be obtained after they are claimed.",
    ["<Bubble_Heart>（我对老尼尔的道德品质有了全新的认识。）</>"] = "<Bubble_Heart>(I have a whole new understanding of Old Neil's moral character.)</>",
    ["<Bubble_Heart>（看起来他会把钱包还回去……）</>"] = "<Bubble_Heart>(Looks like he's going to return the wallet...)</>",
    ["<Bubble_Heart>（老尼尔会弹钢琴？）</>"] = "<Bubble_Heart>(Old Neil can play the piano?)</>",
    ["<Bubble_Heart>（老尼尔要怎么用魔法解决30镑的债务？）</>"] = "<Bubble_Heart>(How is Old Neil going to use magic to solve a 30-pound debt?)</>",
    ["<Bubble_Heart>（阿兹克先生，您的信使会不会太夸张了？）</>"] = "<Bubble_Heart>(Mr. Azik, isn't your messenger a bit too exaggerated?)</>",
    ["<Bubble_NPC>Dog Owner</>：小托比！太好了！你没有被兔子迷惑！你赢了！"] = "<Bubble_NPC>Dog Owner</>: Toby! That's great! You weren't fooled by the rabbit! You won!",
    ["<Bubble_NPC>Host</>：本轮的第一名是——小狗托比！"] = "<Bubble_NPC>Host</>: The winner of this round is—Toby the puppy!",
