    ["<Color_Spectator>辅助治疗</>"] = "<Color_Spectator>Support Healing</>",
    ["<Color_Warrior>近战防御</>"] = "<Color_Warrior>Melee Defense</>",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>290</>。受到攻击时，额外提高怪物专攻<Mark>50</>，持续8秒。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Brand has expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>290</>. When attacked, Monster Specialization is additionally increased by <Mark>50</> for 8 seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>320</>。受到攻击后额外提高怪物专攻<Mark>50</>，持续<Mark>8</>秒。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Brand has expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>320</>. After being attacked, additionally increase Monster Specialization by <Mark>50</>, lasting for <Mark>8</> seconds.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>35</>。守护附近的队友，使附近小队成员技能抵挡增加<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Imprint has expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>35</>. Guard nearby teammates, increasing the Skill Block of nearby squad members by <Mark>10</>.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>40</>。守护附近的队友，使附近小队成员技能抵挡增加<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2,（Imprint expired）}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>40</>. Guards nearby teammates, increasing Skill Block for nearby squad members by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>220</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。进入战斗时，每有一个小队成员拥有威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>，攻击额外提高<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 2, (Brand expired) }</> Attack increased <Mark> 220 </>, Defense decreased <Mark> 15 </>. Grants the wearer the <Mark> Virtue </> of the Witherell family. When entering battle, for every squad member who possesses the <Mark> Virtue </> of the Witherell family, Attack is increased by an additional <Mark> 10 </>. \n Does not take effect when the set Iron and Blood Covenant <Mark> </> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>250</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。进入战斗时，每有一个小队成员拥有威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>，攻击额外提高<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2, (Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>250</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Wetherell family. Upon entering combat, for every team member possessing the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Wetherell family, Attack is increased by an additional <Mark>10</>.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>275</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2,（Brand has expired）}</> Attack increased by <Mark> 275 </>. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>190</>，进入战斗后暴击额外提高，每<Mark>5</>秒暴击提高<Mark>10</>，最高额外提高<Mark>80</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 2, (Brand has expired) }</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>190</>. After entering combat, crit rate is further increased; every <Mark>5</> seconds, crit rate increases by <Mark>10</>, with a maximum additional increase of <Mark>80</>. \nDoes not take effect when the set <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>220</>，进入战斗后暴击额外提高，每<Mark>5</>秒暴击提高<Mark>10</>，最高额外提高<Mark>80</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Brand has expired)}</>Crit rate increased <Mark>220</>. After entering combat, crit rate increases additionally. Every <Mark>5</> seconds, crit rate increases by <Mark>10</>, up to a maximum additional increase of <Mark>80</>.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>165</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Brand has expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>165</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Witherell family.\n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>185</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2, (Brand Expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>185</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Wetherell family.\n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by team members.\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>250</>，暴击降低<Mark>20</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Piercing increased by <Mark>250</>, Crit decreased by <Mark>20</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family.\n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members.\nDoes not take effect when the set <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>280</>，暴击降低<Mark>20</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 2, (Brand has expired)}</>Piercing increased by <Mark>280</>, Critical Hit decreased by <Mark>20</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Wither Family. \n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> provides additional attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Iron and Blood Covenant</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>250</>。距离上次受到伤害超过<Mark>2</>秒后破防提高<Mark>70</>，持续<Mark>5</>秒。 \n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 2, (Brand has expired) }</>Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark>250</>. After more than <Mark>2</> seconds since last taking damage, Armor Break is increased by <Mark>70</>, lasting for <Mark>5</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the set <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>310</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Pathway specialization increased <Mark>310</>. \nDoes not take effect when the set <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>350</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,2,（Imprint expired）}</>Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark>350</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专防提高<Mark>250</>。受到攻击有概率触发邂逅，途径专防提高<Mark>180</>，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 2, (Brand expired) }</> Pathway-specific Defense increased <Mark> 250 </>. When attacked, there is a chance to trigger an Encounter, increasing Pathway-specific Defense <Mark> 180 </>, lasting <Mark> 10 </> seconds, triggering at most once every <Mark> 30 </> seconds. \n Does not take effect when the set Echo of Spirit and Knowledge <Mark> </> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专防提高<Mark>300</>。受到攻击有概率触发邂逅，途径专防提高<Mark>180</>，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 2, (Brand expired) }</> Pathway-specific Defense increased <Mark> 300 </>. When attacked, there is a chance to trigger an Encounter, increasing Pathway-specific Defense <Mark> 180 </>, lasting <Mark> 10 </> seconds, triggering at most once every <Mark> 30 </> seconds. \n Does not take effect when the set Echo of Spirit and Knowledge <Mark> </> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>265</>，穿刺降低<Mark>40</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。造成伤害/治疗时获得一层荒芜之力，每<Mark>2</>秒最多获得一层，使用<Mark>终结技能</>造成伤害/治疗时根据累计的荒芜之力额外造成伤害/治疗。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，荒芜之力会对自身造成少量伤害。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 3, (Brand has expired)}</> Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>265</>, Pierce reduced by <Mark>40</>, Corruption value increased by <Mark>15</>. Gain one layer of Power of Desolation when dealing damage/healing, up to one layer every <Mark>2</> seconds; when using a <Mark>Finisher Skill</> to deal damage/healing, deal additional damage/healing based on the accumulated Power of Desolation. \n Corruption Effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> Corruption value, Power of Desolation will cause a small amount of damage to yourself. <Mark>{ 1, 4, (Purified)}</>\n Current Corruption Value: {2, 1, *d, F1690001, Corruption}\n Does not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>300</>，穿刺降低<Mark>30</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。造成伤害/治疗时获得一层荒芜之力，每<Mark>2</>秒最多获得一层，使用<Mark>终结技能</>时根据累计的荒芜之力额外造成伤害/治疗。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，荒芜之力会对自身造成少量伤害。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,3, (Brand Expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>300</>, Pierce reduced by <Mark>30</>, Corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. Gain one layer of Power of Desolation when dealing damage/healing, gaining at most one layer every <Mark>2</> seconds. When using a <Mark>Finisher Skill</>, deal additional damage/healing based on the accumulated Power of Desolation. \nCorruption Effect: Upon reaching <Mark>30</> Corruption, Power of Desolation will deal a small amount of damage to yourself. <Mark>{1,4, (Purified)}</>\nCurrent Corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>75</>，技能抵挡降低<Mark>5</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，技能抵挡降低<Mark>5</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,3, (Brand Expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>75</>, Skill Block reduced by <Mark>5</>, Corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \nCorruption Effect: Upon reaching <Mark>30</> Corruption, Skill Block is reduced by <Mark>5</>. <Mark>{1,4, (Purified)}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>345</>，防御降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，防御降低<Mark>10</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,3, (Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>345</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>10</>, Corruption increased by <Mark>15</>.\nCorruption Effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> Corruption, Defense is decreased by <Mark>10</>.<Mark>{1,4, (Purified)}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>350</>，技能增强降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击提高<Mark>30</>，攻击降低<Mark>45</>。\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,3, (Brand has expired) }</>Attack increased by <Mark>350</>, Skill Enhancement decreased by <Mark>10</>, Corruption value increased by <Mark>15</>. \nCorruption Effect: Upon reaching <Mark>30</> Corruption value, Crit Resistance increased by <Mark>30</>, Attack decreased by <Mark>45</>. \nCurrent Corruption value: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the set <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>375</>，技能增强降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击提高<Mark>30</>，攻击降低<Mark>45</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1, 3, (Brand has expired)}</>Attack Boost <Mark>375</>, Skill Enhancement reduced by <Mark>10</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>.\nCorruption Effect: Upon reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance increased by <Mark>30</>, Attack reduced by <Mark>45</>.<Mark>{1, 4, (Purified)}</>\nCurrent Corruption: {2, 1, *d, F1690001, Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>300</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。使用社交动作<Mark>行礼</>后，暴击提高效果改为攻击提高<Mark>320</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 3, (Brand expired) }</> Crit rate increased <Mark> 300 </>, Anti-crit decreased <Mark> 15 </>, Corruption increased <Mark> 15 </>. After using the social action <Mark> Bow </>, the Crit rate increased effect changes to Attack increased <Mark> 320 </>. \n Corruption effect: When reaching <Mark> 30 </> Corruption, Anti-crit decreased <Mark> 15 </>. <Mark>{ 1, 4, (Purified) }</>\n Current Corruption: { 2, 1, *d, F1690001, Corruption }\n Does not take effect when the set Iron and Blood Covenant <Mark> </> is activated.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>325</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{1,3,（Brand Expired）}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>325</>, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>. <Mark>{1,4,（Purified）}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<CostRed>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>325</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。使用社交动作<Mark>行礼</>后，暴击提高效果改为攻击提高<Mark>340</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<CostRed>{ 1, 3, (Brand expired) }</> Crit rate increased <Mark> 325 </>, Anti-crit decreased <Mark> 15 </>, Corruption increased <Mark> 15 </>. After using the social action <Mark> Bow </>, the Crit rate increased effect changes to Attack increased <Mark> 340 </>. \n Corruption effect: When reaching <Mark> 30 </> Corruption, Anti-crit decreased <Mark> 15 </>. <Mark>{ 1, 4, (Purified) }</>\n Current Corruption: { 2, 1, *d, F1690001, Corruption }\n Does not take effect when the set Iron and Blood Covenant <Mark> </> is activated.",
