    ["<DarkGrey>实时语音：</><GreenWanted>%s</><T_Default>人</>"] = "<DarkGrey> Real-time Voice: </><GreenWanted>%s</><T_Default> people </>",
    ["<DecH>套装文字:</>套装文字套装文字套装文字套装文字套装文字套装文字套装文字套装文字"] = "<DecH>Set Text:</>Set Text Set Text Set Text Set Text Set Text Set Text Set Text Set Text",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</> 哥特街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </> Gothic Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</> 青藤蔓生\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Green Vine Overgrowth \n Poison vines entwine the silence, and deadly elegance hides in the deep dark green.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>不灭力量熔铸\n不灭之力如活化血肉般滚烫。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Forged with Undying Power \n The Undying Power is as scalding as living flesh.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>丝绸精裁・秘纹繁绣\n心怀敬畏，窥探神秘，直至此身明晰万物之真理，方能止息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Silk Tailoring · Arcane Embroidery \n Hold awe in your heart, pry into the mysterious, and only when this body understands the truth of all things can it find rest.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>丝绸精裁・秘纹繁绣・学者长袍\n心怀敬畏，窥探神秘，直至此身明晰万物之真理，方能止息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Silk Tailoring · Arcane Embroidery · Scholar's Robe \n Hold awe in your heart, pry into the mysterious, and only when this body understands the truth of all things can it find rest.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>云纱堆叠・晨露缀饰\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Cloud Gauze Stacking - Morning Dew Ornament \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>云纱堆叠・晨露缀饰・芬芳纱裙\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Cloud Gauze Stacking - Morning Dew Ornament - Fragrant Gauze Skirt \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>亚麻棉纺・田园便服\n于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Linen Cotton · Pastoral Casual Wear \n In the golden wheat waves of Morse Small Town, pick up a gentle time from the past.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>亚麻棉纺・麦穗刺绣・田园便服\n于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Linen Cotton · Wheat Ear Embroidery · Pastoral Casual Wear \n In the golden wheat waves of Morse Small Town, pick up a gentle time from the past.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>修身剪裁\n观众总是置身幕后，静观一切戏剧之欢呼，洞悉一切角色之走向。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Slim Fit \n The Spectator is always behind the scenes, quietly observing the cheers of every drama and discerning the direction of every character.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Distressed Leather \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革・朋克街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Distressed Leather - Punk Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革・金衬叠穿・沉稳长风衣\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Distressed Leather · Gold-lined Layering · Steady Long Trench Coat \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革・银钉链饰・朋克街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Distressed Leather - Silver Stud Chain - Punk Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>军旅戎装\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Military Uniform \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a judgment, like an oath.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>利落剪裁・肃整无饰\n深蓝色经典制服，修长利落的战场剪影，代表秩序的开端。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Clean Cut · Solemn and Unadorned\nA classic deep blue uniform, a slender and sharp silhouette on the battlefield, representing the beginning of order.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>利落剪裁・肃整无饰・轻便制服\n深蓝色经典制服，修长利落的战场剪影，代表秩序的开端。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Clean Cut · Solemn and Unadorned · Lightweight Uniform\nA classic deep blue uniform, a slender and sharp silhouette on the battlefield, representing the beginning of order.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>压纹皮革\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Embossed Leather \n The never-flowing sunset lingers on the shoulder armor; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>压纹皮革・银铆轻铠・轻便战甲\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Embossed Leather - Silver Rivet Light Armor - Lightweight Battle Armor \n The never-flowing sunset lingers on the shoulder armor; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>友好的灵界生物，经过“橘光”启蒙的喵呜贼\n（积极地扭动）（光明且适度地爬行）（大方地前进）\n（随风飘荡）（脚步轻盈）（沐浴阳光） "] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World creature, a Meow-Meow Thief enlightened by \"Orange Light\" \n (Wiggles actively) (Crawls brightly and moderately) (Advances generously) \n (Drifts with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathed in sunlight)",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>古旧灵木・手工花饰\n芬芳之下，花朵与荆棘是命运的两面。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Old Spirit Wood · Hand-made Flower Ornament \n Beneath the fragrance, flowers and thorns are two sides of fate.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>哑光布艺・休闲漫步装\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Matte Fabric & Leisure Stroll Outfit\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best moments at the start of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>哑光布艺・细密针织・休闲漫步装\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Matte Fabric, Fine Knitting & Leisure Stroll Outfit\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best moments at the start of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>圣白薄纱\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Holy White Gauze \n The radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-seeker receives a sacred coronation during morning prayer.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>圣白薄纱・金丝刺绣・仪典礼服\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Holy White Gauze · Gold Thread Embroidery · Ceremonial Gown \n The radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-seeker receives a sacred coronation during morning prayer.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>圣白麻纱・金纹刺绣\n祈祷声穿透穹顶化作光环，虔诚在圣殿的石柱间回响不息。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Holy White Linen & Gold Embroidery\nThe sound of prayer pierces the dome, transforming into a halo; piety echoes endlessly between the stone pillars of the sanctuary.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>圣白麻纱・金纹刺绣・祭司祭袍\n祈祷声穿透穹顶化作光环，虔诚在圣殿的石柱间回响不息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Holy White Linen · Gold Pattern Embroidery · Priest's Vestment \n The sound of prayer pierces the dome and turns into a halo, and piety echoes endlessly between the stone pillars of the temple.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・星尘披风・魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Blue Velvet · Stardust Cape · Magic Uniform \n Some mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・星尘披风・魔法制服 \n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Midnight Blue Velvet, Stardust Cloak & Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden within star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Blue Velvet · Magic Uniform \n Some mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・魔法制服 \n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Midnight Blue Velvet & Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden within star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>嬉笑诡面・命运杂耍・怪诞小丑服\n红蓝彩条外套配上小丑的礼帽。不变的笑面后，隐藏着无人在意的真心或假意。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Laughing Trickster Mask · Fate Juggling · Grotesque Clown Suit \n A red and blue striped coat paired with a clown's top hat. Behind the unchanging smiling face, there hides a sincerity or pretense that no one cares about.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>学院制服\n学院的围墙上，青苔与泥土在方砖的缝隙里交替生长，一格青绿，一格棕黄。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Academy Uniform\nOn the walls of the academy, moss and soil grow alternately in the gaps of the square bricks, one grid of green, one grid of brown.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>工业翻糖・爱心模具\n蒸汽教会翻糖实验的产物。可惜作为食品来说，似乎有些太硬了。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Industrial Fondant - Heart Mold \n A product of the Steam Church's fondant experiments. Unfortunately, as food, it seems a bit too hard.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>幽绿织缎・青藤蔓生・曳地礼裙\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Deep Green Satin · Green Vine Overgrowth · Floor-length Gown \n Poison vines entwine the silence, and deadly elegance hides in the deep dark green.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>幽绿织缎・青藤蔓生・精工礼服\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Deep Green Satin · Green Vine Overgrowth · Precision Gown \n Poison vines entwine the silence, and deadly elegance hides in the deep dark green.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>战旗织锦・历战肩甲\n百战的勇士归来，荣光闪烁于披风之上。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade & Battle-Hardened Pauldrons\nThe battle-hardened warrior returns, and glory glimmers upon their cloak.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>战旗织锦・常胜肩甲\n常胜的勇士出征，为其授勋的是下一场胜利。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade & Ever-Victorious Pauldrons\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, decorated for the next victory.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>手工做旧\n无论在地下酒馆，还是南大陆的码头，赏金猎手都会获得人们充分的尊敬。毕竟谁也不想成为猎物，不是吗？"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Hand-distressed \n Whether in an underground tavern or at the docks of the Southern Continent, bounty hunters earn people's full respect. After all, no one wants to become the prey, right?",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>手工做旧・破魔猎装\n无论在地下酒馆，还是南大陆的码头，赏金猎手都会获得人们充分的尊敬。毕竟谁也不想成为猎物，不是吗？"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Hand-distressed · Demon-breaking Hunting Suit \n Whether in an underground tavern or at the docks of the Southern Continent, bounty hunters earn people's full respect. After all, no one wants to become the prey, right?",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>手工做旧・银链环饰・破魔猎装\n无论在地下酒馆，还是南大陆的码头，赏金猎手都会获得人们充分的尊敬。毕竟谁也不想成为猎物，不是吗？"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Hand-distressed · Silver Chain Ornament · Demon-breaking Hunting Suit \n Whether in an underground tavern or at the docks of the Southern Continent, bounty hunters earn people's full respect. After all, no one wants to become the prey, right?",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink and clatter, and a journey of steam and engine sounds begins.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>摩卡织锦\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Mocha Brocade\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>摩卡织锦・花叶刺绣\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Mocha Brocade - Floral Embroidery\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>摩卡织锦・花叶刺绣・韵律礼裙\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Mocha Brocade - Floral Embroidery - Rhythmic Gown\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>摩卡织锦・花叶刺绣・韵律轻装\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Mocha Brocade - Floral Embroidery - Rhythmic Light Outfit\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>摩卡织锦・韵律轻装\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Mocha Brocade - Rhythmic Light Outfit\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>旅迹裁量\n星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>星光织锦・旅迹裁量\n星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>星光织锦・旅迹裁量・短斗篷套装\n星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all doors are reachable. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you are never lost.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>星月交辉・命运轮转・秘纹占卜服\n星辰的轨迹，塔罗的秘义，彼此交错，占卜出关于未来的启迪。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Star and Moon Brilliance · Fate Rotation · Arcane Divination Suit \n The trajectory of the stars and the mysteries of the Tarot intersect, divining enlightenment regarding the future.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>星月交辉・命运轮转・进阶占卜服\n修行无穷无尽，星轨与塔罗永不停歇。持续向奥秘前进，占卜出更多关于未来的启迪。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Stars and Moon Intertwined, Fate's Rotation & Advanced Divination Robe\nCultivation is endless, and the star tracks and Tarot never cease. Continue to advance toward the mysteries and divine more revelations about the future.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>晨露缀饰\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Morning Dew Ornament \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Night Velvet\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒・蝶舞花饰\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Night Velvet · Butterfly Flower Ornaments\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒・蝶舞花饰・宽摆晚礼裙\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Night Velvet · Butterfly Flower Ornaments · Wide-hem Evening Gown\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜丝绸・蝶舞肩饰・魅力轻礼服\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Night Silk - Butterfly Dance Shoulder Ornament - Charming Light Gown\nIn the Midsummer Night's Wonderland, it is not just the wings of fairies that glide across the sky, but also the fluttering hearts of poets.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜呢料・诗意裁剪\n于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Woolen · Poetic Tailoring \n Guided by the night, the Nighthawks walk in secrecy. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜呢料・诗意裁剪・长燕尾外套\n于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Woolen · Poetic Tailoring · Long Tailcoat \n Guided by the night, the Nighthawks walk in secrecy. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Night Gown \n The night and the scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the vampires; dangerous, beautiful, and causing one to ache.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗影黑绸・光暗礼装\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Shadow Black Silk - Light and Dark Outfit \n Wings stretch in the brilliance, metal condenses in the shadows, reflecting each other, each complete.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗影黑绸・饰银手甲・光暗礼装\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Shadow Black Silk - Silver Decorated Gauntlet - Light and Dark Outfit \n Wings stretch in the brilliance, metal condenses in the shadows, reflecting each other, each complete.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗纹提花・塔罗领扣・知性学派装\n以塔罗之名传递火种，只为末日之后，仍有明日。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Pattern Jacquard - Tarot Collar Button - Intellectual School Outfit \n Passing the spark in the name of Tarot, just so that after the apocalypse, there is still a tomorrow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗纹提花・知性学派装\n以塔罗之名传递火种，只为末日之后，仍有明日。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Pattern Jacquard - Intellectual School Outfit \n Passing the spark in the name of Tarot, just so that after the apocalypse, there is still a tomorrow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗纹绒缎・干练军装\n银纹织就的誓言在肩头沉淀，铁与布在风中低语，像某种无声的律令。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Patterned Velvet · Professional Military Uniform\nThe oath woven in silver patterns settles on the shoulders; iron and cloth whisper in the wind, like some silent decree.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗纹绒缎・秘银鳞甲・干练军装\n银纹织就的誓言在肩头沉淀，铁与布在风中低语，像某种无声的律令。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Patterned Velvet · Mithril Scale Armor · Professional Military Uniform\nThe oath woven in silver patterns settles on the shoulders; iron and cloth whisper in the wind, like some silent decree.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗银丝绸・霜色刺绣・苍白礼服\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞，黑灰的王冠在死寂中为他加冕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Silver Silk · Frost-colored Embroidery · Pale Formal Wear \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together, and the ashen crown crowns him in the dead silence.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗银织纱・霜色刺绣\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Silver Gauze · Frost-colored Embroidery \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together. She came draped in frost-colored bone gauze.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗银织纱・霜色刺绣・苍白礼裙\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Silver Gauze · Frost-colored Embroidery · Pale Gown \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together. She came draped in frost-colored bone gauze.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗黑鸦羽\n华彩在深黑之上流淌，诡谲却又优雅，令一切庸俗的颜色都黯然。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Raven Feather \n Brilliant colors flow over deep black, grotesque yet elegant, making all vulgar colors dim.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗黑鸦羽・重工皮革\n华彩在深黑之上流淌，诡谲却又优雅，令一切庸俗的颜色都黯然。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Raven Feather - Heavy Industry Leather \n Brilliant colors flow over deep black, grotesque yet elegant, making all vulgar colors dim.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗黑鸦羽・重工皮革・哥特晚礼服\n华彩在深黑之上流淌，诡谲却又优雅，令一切庸俗的颜色都黯然。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Dark Raven Feather - Heavy Industry Leather - Gothic Evening Gown \n Brilliant colors flow over deep black, grotesque yet elegant, making all vulgar colors dim.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>枯叶流光\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Withered Leaf Flowing Light\nThe realm of golden autumn, the rich scenery of ruins; withering turns into rebirth, withered leaves break out of their cocoons like butterflies.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>枯叶流光・蝶翼堆绣\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Withered Leaf Flowing Light - Butterfly Wing Stacking Embroidery \n In the realm of golden autumn, the ruins are abundant; the withered leaves turn into new life, breaking out of their cocoons like butterflies.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>枯叶流光・蝶翼堆绣・古雅礼服\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Withered Leaf Flowing Light - Butterfly Wing Stacking Embroidery - Antique Gown \n In the realm of golden autumn, the ruins are abundant; the withered leaves turn into new life, breaking out of their cocoons like butterflies.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>枯叶流光・鳞甲层掩・古雅战铠\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Withered Leaf Flowing Light · Scale Armor Layering · Antique Battle Armor\nThe realm of golden autumn, the rich scenery of ruins; withering turns into rebirth, withered leaves break out of their cocoons like butterflies.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Soft Silk - Lace Veil\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary. After long appreciation, this flavor must have deeply permeated your body and mind.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Soft Light Silk · Lace Gauze\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary; tasting it now truly has a unique flavor.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱・修身睡裙\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Soft Light Silk · Lace Gauze · Slim-fit Nightgown\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary; tasting it now truly has a unique flavor.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱・新款睡裙\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Soft Silk - Lace Veil - New Nightgown\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary. After long appreciation, this flavor must have deeply permeated your body and mind.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔色布艺・精巧花边・温婉日间裙\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Soft-colored Fabric · Exquisite Lace · Gentle Day Dress\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best time at the beginning of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>柔韧外套・漫游杂饰・探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Supple Coat · Roaming Accessories · Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink and clang, and a railway journey interwoven with steam and engine sounds begins here.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>格纹织棉・流苏缀饰・野外便装\n星空为被，大地为床，篝火旁藏着冒险的梦想。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Plaid Cotton · Tassel Embellishments · Outdoor Casual Wear\nThe starry sky as a quilt, the earth as a bed; dreams of adventure hide beside the campfire.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>橄榄丝绒・金纹提花・刺绣长裙\n伴随红月而来的疯狂呓语，小说家颂念了愚者的尊名，此时她尚且不知，这将是一场跨越家族和历史的旅行。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Olive Velvet · Gold Pattern Jacquard · Embroidered Long Skirt \n Accompanied by the mad whispers that came with the red moon, the novelist recited the honorific name of The Fool; at this time, she did not yet know that this would be a journey spanning families and history.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>水晶纱绉\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Radiance Dotted \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染・华美礼服\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Radiance Dotted · Gorgeous Gown \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染・繁花蓬裙\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Radiance Dotted · Flowering Puffy Skirt \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>沉黑皮革・坚实护腕・蓄力轻战甲\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Deep Black Leather - Solid Bracers - Power-Charging Light Armor\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>沉黑皮革・蓄力轻战甲\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Deep Black Leather - Power-Charging Light Armor\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>浅金柔缎・红绒菱格・安眠睡袍\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Light Gold Soft Satin · Red Velvet Diamond Pattern · Slumber Robe \n Like the floor tiles of an old house corridor that have been laid for a winter, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>浪花波纹・跃动坠饰・活力泳装\n波纹涌动，明快的金橙色破开滚滚热浪。水花绽放，夏日登场！"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Wave Ripple - Jumping Ornament - Vibrant Swimsuit \n Ripples surge, and bright golden-orange breaks through the rolling heat waves. Water splashes, summer is here!",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>深棕皮甲・菌络背饰・生物学者装\n大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Deep Brown Leather Armor · Fungal Network Back Ornament · Biologist's Outfit \n A mad existence upon the sea; strange and varied life forms are born under leather gloves, and every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in experiments.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>湛蓝披风\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Azure Cape\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>漆面皮革\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Lacquered Leather \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a judgment, like an oath.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>漆面皮革・军旅戎装\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Lacquered Leather - Military Uniform \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a judgment, like an oath.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>漆面皮革・坚韧护甲・军旅戎装\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Lacquered Leather - Tough Armor - Military Uniform \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a judgment, like an oath.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>漫游杂饰・探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Roaming Accessories · Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink and clang, and a railway journey interwoven with steam and engine sounds begins here.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>狒狒绒毛・精致缝纫\n银色的柔绒小包。（非常适合存放香蕉！）"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Baboon Fur · Exquisite Sewing \n A small, soft silver bag. (Very suitable for storing bananas!)",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>猩红织锦・暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Scarlet Brocade · Night Gown \n The night and the scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the vampires; dangerous, beautiful, and causing one to ache.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>猩红织锦・荆棘环绕・暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Scarlet Brocade · Thorn-wrapped · Night Gown \n The night and the scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the vampires; dangerous, beautiful, and causing one to ache.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>猩红织锦・荆棘骨刺\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Scarlet Brocade & Thorn Bone Spikes\nNight and scarlet are the thorns entwined around the eternal life of the vampires—dangerous, beautiful, and painfully piercing.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>玄黑绒呢・银饰扣环・鲁恩学者礼服\n知识在褶皱间沉淀，岁月在衣摆上流连。\n这是属于旧时代的优雅，亦是属于守护者的沉默。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Jet-black Velvet · Silver Buckle · Loen Scholar's Formal Wear \n Knowledge settles in the folds, and time lingers on the hem. \n This is the elegance belonging to the old era, and it is also the silence belonging to the Guardian.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>珍珠华饰\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>珠串缠绕\n黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Bead String Entwining \n Yellow sand buries the past, His Gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the Blazing Sun has never dissipated.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>珠白柔缎・量身裁剪\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Pearl White Soft Satin - Tailored Fit \n A poem sung with heart does not necessarily need rhymes, and a short shirt tailored with heart does not necessarily need intricate carvings.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>珠白柔缎・量身裁剪・精致短衫\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Pearl White Soft Satin - Tailored Fit - Exquisite Short Shirt \n A poem sung with heart does not necessarily need rhymes, and a short shirt tailored with heart does not necessarily need intricate carvings.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>白羽织纱・鎏金缀饰\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>White Feather Woven Gauze · Gilded Embellishments\nThe hem of the morning prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of the hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>白羽织纱・鎏金缀饰・圣咏礼装\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>White Feather Woven Gauze · Gilded Embellishments · Hymn Ceremonial Dress\nThe hem of the morning prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of the hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>白金织锦・枝蔓刺绣・精灵长袍\n黄金枝叶编织王冠，丛影深处自有不朽，藤蔓缠绕金箔，森林也将低眉。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Platinum Brocade · Branch Embroidery · Elf Robe\nGolden branches and leaves weave a crown; immortality exists in the depths of the shadows, vines entwine gold leaf, and the forest will also bow its head.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>皇室华缎・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Royal Satin - Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is forged; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>皇室华缎・至尊甲胄\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Royal Satin - Supreme Armor\nWhen the King arrives, an era is forged; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>皇室华缎・至尊甲胄・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Royal Satin - Supreme Armor - Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is forged; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>知性学派装\n以塔罗之名传递火种，只为末日之后，仍有明日。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Intellectual School Outfit \n Passing the spark in the name of Tarot, just so that after the apocalypse, there is still a tomorrow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>知性花饰\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Intellectual Floral Ornament\nNever stop walking; trace the past and look toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the crevices of history.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>祝圣织锦・烈阳光纹・歌颂战甲\n至诚至纯的灵魂，将如日光般神圣，赤心颂唱时，太阳也为你首肯。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Consecrated Brocade · Blazing Sun Light Pattern · Eulogy Battle Armor \n A soul that is sincere and pure will be as sacred as sunlight; when you chant with a sincere heart, the sun will also give its nod to you.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银编织・黑羽纹饰\n为一切的告别奏响安眠之歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mithril Weaving · Black Feather Ornament \n Play a song of Slumber for all farewells.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银缝制·永生花\n花香会抚慰所有不甘于沉眠的灵魂。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Sewing · Preserved Flower\nThe fragrance of flowers will soothe all souls unwilling to sleep.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银锻甲\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Forged Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银锻甲・湛蓝披风・骑士战铠\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Forged Armor · Azure Cape · Knight's Battle Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银锻甲・骑士战铠\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Forged Armor · Knight's Battle Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银雕琢・精工镶嵌\n指尖的一缕清凉收束着灵性，似乎让每一次的仪式都变得更加顺利。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mithril Carving · Precision Inlay \n A wisp of coolness at the fingertips gathers spirituality, seemingly making every ritual go more smoothly.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银鳞甲・干练军装\n银纹织就的誓言在肩头沉淀，铁与布在风中低语，像某种无声的律令。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Scale Armor · Professional Military Uniform\nThe oath woven in silver patterns settles on the shoulders; iron and cloth whisper in the wind, like some silent decree.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Fairy Tale Gown \n Even as an accidental visitor, please follow the dress code. Put on the playful blue-black diamond-patterned gown and join the grotesque and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工丝绸\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Silk \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain on the feast. The first wisp of evening breeze brushes the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工丝绸・盛宴晚礼服\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Silk · Feast Evening Gown \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain on the feast. The first wisp of evening breeze brushes the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工丝绸・网纱罗织・盛宴晚礼服\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Silk · Mesh Weaving · Feast Evening Gown \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain on the feast. The first wisp of evening breeze brushes the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工棉纺・博物学者服\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Precision Cotton - Naturalist Outfit\nNever stop walking; trace the past and look toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the crevices of history.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工棉纺・知性花饰・博物学者服\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Precision Cotton - Intellectual Floral Ornament - Naturalist Outfit\nNever stop walking; trace the past and look toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the crevices of history.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工皮面\n黑色是黑夜赐予的隐秘，红色是戒律的森严。女神的使者们，为守护而行。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Leather \n Black is the concealment granted by the night, red is the severity of the commandments. The Goddess's messengers walk for the sake of protection.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工皮面・绯红翻领・值夜者外袍\n黑色是黑夜赐予的隐秘，红色是戒律的森严。女神的使者们，为守护而行。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Leather · Crimson Lapel · Nighthawk Robe \n Black is the concealment granted by the night, red is the severity of the commandments. The Goddess's messengers walk for the sake of protection.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精工银链\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Precision Silver Chain \n Even as an accidental visitor, please follow the dress code. Put on the playful blue-black diamond-patterned gown and join the grotesque and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精锻白铁・手工打造\n无情的铁面，无法抵抗的命运。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Precision-Forged White Iron & Handcrafted\nA heartless iron mask, an inescapable fate.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精锻黄铜・蔷薇缠缚\n极为精美的仿真蔷薇，据说是第四纪遗留的古董饰品，担当着不对称审美的一环。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Precision Forged Brass · Rose Entanglement\nAn extremely exquisite artificial rose, said to be an antique accessory left over from the Fourth Epoch, serving as a part of asymmetrical aesthetics.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精雕铂金・珍珠垂饰\n以纯净的铂金编织的精美的额饰，繁复花纹似乎能吸引神明的庇佑。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Finely Carved Platinum & Pearl Pendant\nAn exquisite forehead ornament woven from pure platinum; its intricate patterns seem capable of attracting the protection of the gods.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精鞣皮革\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Tanned Leather\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for one's own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>精鞣皮革・轻便裁剪・都市漫步装\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Tanned Leather - Lightweight Cut - Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for one's own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>素白亚麻・茶色褶裙・简约领结\n用稚嫩的肩膀撑起莫雷蒂家的天空，于贫寒中不失体面与尊严。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Plain White Linen · Tea-colored Pleated Skirt · Simple Bow Tie\nSupporting the sky of the Moretti family with immature shoulders, maintaining decency and dignity amidst poverty.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>素色棉麻・简约淡雅\n毫无染饰的天然面料，象征灵魂初始之洁。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Plain Cotton and Linen - Simple and Elegant \n Natural fabric without any dye, symbolizing the initial purity of the soul.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>素色棉麻・简约淡雅・基础单衣\n毫无染饰的天然面料，象征灵魂初始之洁。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Plain Cotton and Linen - Simple and Elegant - Basic Undergarment \n Natural fabric without any dye, symbolizing the initial purity of the soul.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>红绒缎面・黑金蕾丝・魔女礼裙\n裙裾拖曳的声响轻如秘密，只有靠得够近的人，才能听见诱惑在低语。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Red Velvet Satin & Black Gold Lace Witch's Gown\nThe sound of the hem trailing is as soft as a secret; only those close enough can hear the whisper of temptation.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>红绒菱格\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Red Velvet Diamond Pattern\nLike the floor tiles laid for a winter in the hallway of an old house, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>纤白纱裙・鲜红宝饰・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Slender White Gauze · Bright Red Jewelry · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the hem, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose a never-ending masterpiece.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>纯金锻造・珠钻豪镶\n某珠宝公司曾试图推出的顶级饰品，然而却因为未知的原因接连失败，现存的成品也寥寥无几。也许是因为命运吧。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Pure Gold Forging & Luxury Diamond Inlay\nA top-tier accessory that a certain jewelry company once attempted to launch, but failed repeatedly for unknown reasons. Few finished products remain today. Perhaps it is fate.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>织纱连缀・珠串缠绕・南大陆风情装\n黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gauze Interlacing · Bead String Entwining · Southern Continent Style Outfit \n Yellow sand buries the past, His Gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the Blazing Sun has never dissipated.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>绯红缎面\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Crimson Satin\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>绯红缎面・苍银暗纹\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Crimson Satin · Pale Silver Dark Patterns\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>绯红缎面・苍银暗纹・锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Crimson Satin · Pale Silver Dark Patterns · Sharp Hunting Outfit\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>绿格背心・黑丝领结・学院制服\n学院的围墙上，青苔与泥土在方砖的缝隙里交替生长，一格青绿，一格棕黄。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Green Plaid Vest · Black Silk Bow Tie · Academy Uniform\nOn the walls of the academy, moss and soil grow alternately in the gaps of the square bricks, one grid of green, one grid of brown.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>网纱罗织\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mesh Weaving \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain on the feast. The first wisp of evening breeze brushes the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>网纱衬里\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mesh Lining \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>网纱衬里・灵质链饰\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mesh Lining · Spirit-quality Chain Ornament \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>网纱衬里・灵质链饰・不规则斜裁裙\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mesh Lining · Spirit-quality Chain Ornament · Irregular Bias-cut Skirt \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>羊毛混纺・户外短装\n阳光在晨起时就打了照面，晴朗的一天从现在开始。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Wool Blend - Outdoor Short Outfit\nThe sun greets you at dawn; a bright day begins now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>羊毛混纺・洁白内衬・户外短装\n阳光在晨起时就打了照面，晴朗的一天从现在开始。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Wool Blend - White Lining - Outdoor Short Outfit\nThe sun greets you at dawn; a bright day begins now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>翡绿羊绒・暗纹提花・保暖毛衫\n当迷雾散去时，旅人会发现脚下的路比想象中更柔软，原来绿野不只存在于传说里。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Emerald Cashmere · Dark Pattern Jacquard · Warm Sweater\nWhen the fog clears, the traveler will find that the road under their feet is softer than imagined; it turns out that the green fields do not only exist in legends.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>翡翠织锦・珍珠华饰・优雅室内裙\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>至尊甲胄\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Supreme Armor\nWhen the King arrives, an era is forged; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>至尊甲胄・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Supreme Armor - Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is forged; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>苍银暗纹\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Pale Silver Dark Patterns\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>荆棘环绕\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Thorn-wrapped \n The night and the scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the vampires; dangerous, beautiful, and causing one to ache.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>荆棘黑纱・蓝宝幽光・破碎礼裙\n子爵夫人她就站在那里，等着苹果树开花，等着果实成熟，等着她一直在等的人。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Thorn Black Gauze · Blue Gem Ghost Light · Broken Gown \n The Viscountess stands there, waiting for the apple tree to bloom, waiting for the fruit to ripen, waiting for the person she has always been waiting for.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>菌络背饰\n大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Fungal Network Back Ornament \n A mad existence upon the sea; strange and varied life forms are born under leather gloves, and every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in experiments.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Blue-White Lace \n Even if you are an accidental visitor, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the blue-white diamond-patterned playful dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-white lace dress and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Blue-White Lace · Playful Bunny Ears \n Even if you are an accidental visitor, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the blue-white diamond-patterned playful dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace · Playful Rabbit Ears\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-white lace dress and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Blue-White Lace · Playful Bunny Ears · Fairy Tale Dress \n Even if you are an accidental visitor, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the blue-white diamond-patterned playful dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace · Playful Rabbit Ears · Fairytale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-white lace dress and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Blue-White Lace · Fairy Tale Dress \n Even if you are an accidental visitor, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the blue-white diamond-patterned playful dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace · Fairytale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-white lace dress and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蓝黑菱格・精工银链・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Blue-Black Diamond Pattern - Precision Silver Chain - Fairy Tale Gown \n Even as an accidental visitor, please follow the dress code. Put on the playful blue-black diamond-patterned gown and join the grotesque and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蕾丝软缎・黑紫荷叶・哥特街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Lace Satin - Black-Purple Frills - Gothic Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Lace Veil\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary. After long appreciation, this flavor must have deeply permeated your body and mind.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Lace Gauze\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary; tasting it now truly has a unique flavor.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蝶翼堆绣\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Butterfly Wing Stacking Embroidery \n In the realm of golden autumn, the ruins are abundant; the withered leaves turn into new life, breaking out of their cocoons like butterflies.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蝶舞花饰\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Butterfly Flower Ornaments\nIn the midsummer night wonderland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of elves, but also the fluttering poetic heart.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>象牙缎面\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Ivory Satin Finish\nWhen the gates of the court stables open once more, neither one's pace nor one's poise shall falter in the slightest.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>象牙缎面・珠链点缀・宫廷骑装\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Ivory Satin · Bead Chain Ornament · Court Riding Suit \n When the gates of the court stables open again, the pace and demeanor are just as sharp as ever.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>赭红暗纹\n堕落的侵蚀，邪恶的呓语……但骑士的精神，不容玷污。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Ochre Red Dark Pattern \n The erosion of corruption, the whispers of evil... but the spirit of the knight must not be defiled.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>跃动坠饰\n波纹涌动，明快的金橙色破开滚滚热浪。水花绽放，夏日登场！"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Jumping Ornament \n Ripples surge, and bright golden-orange breaks through the rolling heat waves. Water splashes, summer is here!",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>轻柔网纱・白羽缀饰\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Soft Mesh - White Feather Ornament \n Wings stretch in the brilliance, metal condenses in the shadows, reflecting each other, each complete.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>轻柔网纱・白羽缀饰・光暗礼装\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Soft Mesh - White Feather Ornament - Light and Dark Outfit \n Wings stretch in the brilliance, metal condenses in the shadows, reflecting each other, each complete.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>部落编织・粗犷宝饰\n具有荒野风情的奇异披风，据说是罗塞尔大帝开辟航道之旅的战利品之一。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Tribal Weaving · Rugged Jewelry\nA strange cape with a wilderness style, said to be one of the spoils of Emperor Roselle's journey to open up shipping routes.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>重工皮革・哥特晚礼服\n华彩在深黑之上流淌，诡谲却又优雅，令一切庸俗的颜色都黯然。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Heavy-duty Leather · Gothic Evening Gown\nBrilliance flows over deep black, treacherous yet elegant, making all vulgar colors pale in comparison.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>野外便装\n星空为被，大地为床，篝火旁藏着冒险的梦想。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Outdoor Casual Wear\nThe starry sky as a quilt, the earth as a bed; dreams of adventure hide beside the campfire.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>野性垂缎・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Wild Draping Satin · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the hem, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose a never-ending masterpiece.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>野性垂缎・金狮纹章・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Wild Draping Satin · Golden Lion Emblem · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the hem, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose a never-ending masterpiece.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>量身裁剪\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Tailored Fit \n A poem sung with heart does not necessarily need rhymes, and a short shirt tailored with heart does not necessarily need intricate carvings.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>金丝刺绣\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gold Thread Embroidery \n The radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-seeker receives a sacred coronation during morning prayer.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金织缀\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Weaving \n The bright golden light intertwines with the clear brilliance of emerald, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Weaving - Emerald Luxury Inlay \n The bright golden light intertwines with the clear brilliance of emerald, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶\n灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Weaving - Emerald Luxury Inlay \n The bright golden light intertwines with the clear brilliance of emerald, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶・金缕礼服\n灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Weaving - Emerald Luxury Inlay - Golden Thread Gown \n The bright golden light intertwines with the clear brilliance of emerald, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶・金缕礼裙\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Weaving - Emerald Luxury Inlay - Golden Thread Gown \n The bright golden light intertwines with the clear brilliance of emerald, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金缀饰\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Embellishments\nThe hem of the morning prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of the hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金缀饰・圣咏礼装\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Embellishments · Hymn Ceremonial Dress\nThe hem of the morning prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of the hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>铂金镶嵌・海水珠\n自海上打捞的古老饰品。无论是精美的海珠和自然的纹理，似乎都在讲述“精灵”所在的那个古老而神秘的年代……"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Platinum Inlay · Sea Pearl \n Ancient accessories salvaged from the sea. Both the exquisite sea pearls and the natural textures seem to be telling of that ancient and mysterious era where \"Elves\" existed...",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>铂金镶嵌・透蓝辉石\n闭上眼睛，却开启了新的视野。蓝色眼瞳照亮的真理就在前方。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Platinum Inlay · Translucent Blue Gem\nClosing your eyes opens up a new vision. The truth illuminated by blue pupils is right ahead.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>银丝覆面\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Silver Thread Veil\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>银光锦缎・华美皮草\n将寒风缀于肩头，胜利的容光不惧任何凛冽冰雪。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Silver Brocade & Gorgeous Fur\nAdorn your shoulders with the cold wind; the radiance of victory fears no biting ice or snow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>银质肩甲・钻石镶嵌\n荆棘舒展，于满月之夜绽放，危险而美丽。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Silver Shoulder Armor · Diamond Inlay\nThorns stretch and bloom on the night of the full moon, dangerous and beautiful.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>银鳞丝绸・修身剪裁・剧场礼服\n观众总是置身幕后，静观一切戏剧之欢呼，洞悉一切角色之走向。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Silver-scaled Silk · Slim Fit · Theater Gown \n The Spectator is always behind the scenes, quietly observing the cheers of every drama and discerning the direction of every character.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Sharp Hunting Outfit\nSincerity is like a new moon blooming; silent oaths are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>镀金打造・剧演华饰\n 白裙覆满鲜血，金狮步步紧随。帷幕之下演绎着丛林的法则，精彩永不谢幕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Gilded Craft · Theater Ornament \n The white dress is covered in blood, and the golden lion follows step by step. Beneath the curtain, the laws of the jungle are performed, and the brilliance never bows out.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>镂空蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Hollow Lace \n Even if you are an accidental visitor, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the blue-white diamond-patterned playful dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>防水皮革・漆光翻领・雨夜外出装\n身着雨披行于街角，让绵密的水珠从身侧滑落，你就是夜里一盏温暖的灯。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Waterproof Leather - Lacquered Lapel - Rainy Night Outing Wear\nWalking the street corners in a raincoat, letting the dense water droplets slide off your side, you are a warm lamp in the night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>防水皮革・雨夜外出装\n身着雨披行于街角，让绵密的水珠从身侧滑落，你就是夜里一盏温暖的灯。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Waterproof Leather - Rainy Night Outing Wear\nWalking the street corners in a raincoat, letting the dense water droplets slide off your side, you are a warm lamp in the night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾光垂纱・优雅刺绣\n织物如云如雾，也像一位女士无可奈何却终将面对的结局。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mist Light Draping Gauze - Elegant Embroidery \n The fabric is like clouds and mist, and also like the ending that a lady is helpless to face but will eventually face.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾灰精纺・暗纹提花・占卜之服\n即便在命运的巨变到来之际，也别忘记嘴角上扬，嘲弄于它。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Fog-gray Fine-spun · Dark Pattern Jacquard · Divination Garb \n Even when the great changes of fate arrive, do not forget to raise the corners of your mouth and mock them.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mist Colored Brocade - Morning Dew Ornament \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰・清雅礼服\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Mist Colored Brocade - Morning Dew Ornament - Elegant Gown \n In the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mist Blue Gauze\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱・铃兰刺绣\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mist Blue Gauze · Lily of the Valley Embroidery\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱・铃兰刺绣・淑女长裙\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mist Blue Gauze · Lily of the Valley Embroidery · Lady's Long Dress\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the blooming roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>霜色刺绣\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Frost-colored Embroidery \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together. She came draped in frost-colored bone gauze.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>青铜甲胄・岁月锈蚀・古董重铠\n艾弗利家族的荣耀在锈蚀中哀鸣，孢子侵蚀着骑士精神，只余破败的低语。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Bronze Armor · Aged Rust · Antique Heavy Armor \n The glory of the Avery Family wails in the rust, spores erode the chivalry, leaving only broken whispers.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>非凡雕琢・水晶镶嵌\n触感如冰雪一般的秘仪手链，似乎可以帮助收敛非凡者的灵性。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Beyonder Carving & Crystal Inlay\nA ritual bracelet with a touch as cold as ice and snow, seemingly capable of helping a Beyonder restrain their spirituality.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>香槟金属・手工镶嵌\n由鲁恩顶级珠宝商推出的化装舞会面饰，据说灵感来自于佛尔思·沃尔女士那篇患者面部开花的恐怖小说。当然，他们做了不少美化。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Champagne Metal & Hand-Inlaid\nA masquerade mask launched by a top Loen jeweler, said to be inspired by Ms. Fors Wall's horror novel about a patient whose face blooms with flowers. Of course, they made quite a few aesthetic adjustments.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>驼色软呢・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>驼色软呢・洁白内衬・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - White Lining - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>魅力轻礼服\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Charming Light Gown\nIn the Midsummer Night's Wonderland, it is not just the wings of fairies that glide across the sky, but also the fluttering hearts of poets.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>魔法制服\n 某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden within star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Magic Uniform \n Some mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鲜红宝饰\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Bright Red Jewelry \n The white of the aria blooms in the hem, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose a never-ending masterpiece.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鲜红宝饰・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Bright Red Jewelry · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the hem, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose a never-ending masterpiece.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>黄铜镶嵌・暗红血石\n信仰需要指向对的方向，时刻审视自我之心，切勿跌入无尽的迷途。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Brass Inlay · Dark Red Bloodstone \n Faith needs to point in the right direction; always scrutinize your own heart, and do not fall into an endless lost path.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>黑紫荷叶\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Black-Purple Frills\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>黯色织缎・柔语曳地裙\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Dark Satin - Soft-Whisper Floor-Length Dress\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>黯色织缎・银丝覆面・柔语曳地裙\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Dark Satin - Silver Thread Veil - Soft-Whisper Floor-Length Dress\nSoft whispers and passionate punches can both complete an irresistible long sleep.",
    ["<Default>%s</><Brown>%d</><Default>人</>"] = "<Default> %s </> <Brown> %d </> <Default> people </>",
    ["<Default>夜晚活跃</><Brown>%d</><Default>人</>"] = "<Default> Nighttime Active </><Brown>%d</><Default> people </>",
    ["<Default>奥尔尼娅曾经是血族的女王。在第二纪时，他作为从神侍奉于莉莉丝；在第四纪时，他带领血族投奔特伦索斯特国，并嫁予特伦索斯特为妻。礼是月亮途径的序列1－美神。奥尔尼娅登上台面时，正逢第二纪黑暗纪元，彼时袖则为侍奉在古神血族始祖莉莉丝的从神：美神奥尔尼娅。由于某种很罕见的情况，奥尔尼娅在莉莉丝掌握在序列0的情况下，得以维持并以月亮途径的序列1：美神存在。在古神互相开始厮杀后，失去主神的从神不是殒落调零，就是另投他主。去主</><Default>奥尔尼娅曾经是血族的女王。在第二纪时，他作为从神侍奉于莉莉丝；在第四纪时，他带领血族投奔特伦索斯特国，并嫁予特伦索斯特为妻。礼是月亮途径的序列1－美神。奥尔尼娅登上台面时，正逢第二纪黑暗纪元，彼时袖则为侍奉在古神血族始祖莉莉丝的从神：美神奥尔尼娅。由于某种很罕见的情况，奥尔尼娅在莉莉丝掌握在序列0的情况下，得以维持并以月亮途径的序列1：美神存在。在古神互相开始厮杀后，失去主神的从神不是殒落调零，就是另投他主。去主</>"] = "<Default>Auernia was once Queen of the Sanguines. During the Second Epoch, she served Lilith as a subsidiary god; during the Fourth Epoch, she led the Sanguines to the Trunsoest Empire and married Trunsoest. She was the Moon pathway's Sequence 1, Beauty Goddess. Auernia rose to prominence during the Dark Age of the Second Epoch, when she served the ancient god Lilith, Progenitor of the Sanguines, as the subsidiary god Beauty Goddess Auernia. Due to a very rare circumstance, even while Lilith held Sequence 0, Auernia was able to remain the Moon pathway's Sequence 1, Beauty Goddess. After the ancient gods began slaughtering one another, subsidiary gods who lost their chief deity either perished and withered away or pledged themselves to another. Without their chief deity</><Default>Auernia was once Queen of the Sanguines. During the Second Epoch, she served Lilith as a subsidiary god; during the Fourth Epoch, she led the Sanguines to the Trunsoest Empire and married Trunsoest. She was the Moon pathway's Sequence 1, Beauty Goddess. Auernia rose to prominence during the Dark Age of the Second Epoch, when she served the ancient god Lilith, Progenitor of the Sanguines, as the subsidiary god Beauty Goddess Auernia. Due to a very rare circumstance, even while Lilith held Sequence 0, Auernia was able to remain the Moon pathway's Sequence 1, Beauty Goddess. After the ancient gods began slaughtering one another, subsidiary gods who lost their chief deity either perished and withered away or pledged themselves to another. Without their chief deity</>",
    ["<Default>正在拼点分配下列资源，</><Tips>优先分配给想要的玩家。</>"] = "<Default>Rolling for these resources. </><Tips>Interested players get priority.</>",
