    ["<Grey>请选择要赠送给</><Stress>%s</><Grey>的礼物</>"] = "<Grey> Please select the gift to give to </><Stress>%s</><Grey> </>",
    ["<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">兔子</>之神<Delete id=\"#158\">比必币</>庇佑，信徒愿意一生吃<Delete id=\"#158\">书数</>蔬菜，只希<Delete id=\"#158\">忘</>望您宽恕我的罪过。\n我会用白色<Delete id=\"#158\">拉</>蜡烛，按照兔子的形状<Delete id=\"#158\">拜</>摆放祭坛，绝不忘记圆圈中心的眼睛和<Delete id=\"#158\">比</>鼻子！"] = "May the God of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Rabbits</><Delete id=\"#158\">Bibi Coins</> bless me. This believer vows to eat <Delete id=\"#158\">books</> vegetables for life and only <Delete id=\"#158\">forgets</> hopes that You will forgive my sins.\nI will use white <Delete id=\"#158\">pull</> candles and <Delete id=\"#158\">worship</> arrange the altar in the shape of a rabbit, never forgetting the eyes and <Delete id=\"#158\">compare</> nose in the center of the circle!",
    ["<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">……</>这几天，我的心脏总跳的很快，这是一种不安。从镇外的工厂下班回家，我不再敢走古堡那条路。镇子上的气氛很怪，每个人的情绪都很坏，告示板说，有一户人家被灭门了，他们说是流窜的通缉犯做的，但直觉告诉我，没那么简单。照理来说，按照我的探索精神，我应该去和亡魂、和灵去探究，但是，知道这个消息的那个瞬间，我居然在想，我会不会就是下一个？\n\n  这不是好的预兆，我想这是一个提示。"] = "<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">...</>These past few days, my heart has been beating very fast; it's a sense of unease. After getting off work at the factory outside the town, I no longer dare to take the road by the old castle. The atmosphere in the town is very strange, everyone's mood is very bad. The notice board says that a family was wiped out; they say it was done by a fugitive on the run, but my intuition tells me it's not that simple. Logically speaking, with my spirit of exploration, I should go and investigate with the ghosts and spirits, but the moment I heard this news, I was actually thinking, could I be the next one? \n\n This is not a good omen; I think this is a hint.",
    ["<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">不可名</><Delete id=\"#157_R\">状者</>"] = "<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">The Nameless </><Delete id=\"#157_R\">One</>",
    ["<HighLight>%s</>天<HighLight>%s</>时<HighLight>%s</>分"] = "<HighLight>%s</> days <HighLight>%s</> hours <HighLight>%s</> minutes",
    ["<HighLight>%s</>时<HighLight>%s</>分<HighLight>%s</>秒"] = "<HighLight>%s</> at <HighLight>%s</> minutes <HighLight>%s</> seconds",
    ["<HighLight>%s</>紫气东来，%s重塑获得恩赐<HighLight>%s</>，真是羡煞旁人！"] = "<HighLight>%s</>, the purple aura comes from the east, %s has reshaped and obtained the blessing <HighLight>%s</>; truly, others are envious!",
    ["<HighLight>%s秒</>后开始下一局匹配 "] = "Next match starts in <HighLight>%s seconds </>",
    ["<HighLight>15%</>攻击力，<HighLight>10%</>额外吸血；"] = "<HighLight>15%</> Attack, <HighLight>10%</> additional Life Steal.",
    ["<HighLight>16%</>最大生命值护盾，<HighLight>10%</>伤害减免；"] = "<HighLight>16%</> maximum Health Shield, <HighLight>10%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["<HighLight>25%</>攻击力，<HighLight>20%</>额外吸血；"] = "<HighLight>25%</> Attack, <HighLight>20%</> additional Life Steal.",
    ["<HighLight>26%</>最大生命值护盾，<HighLight>15%</>伤害减免；"] = "<HighLight>26%</> maximum Health Shield, <HighLight>15%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["<HighLight>40%</>最大生命值护盾，<HighLight>15%</>伤害减免；"] = "<HighLight>40%</> maximum Health Shield, <HighLight>15%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>与<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战已正式开战，胜负即将揭晓！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> and <HighLight>[%s]</>'s club war has officially begun, the outcome will soon be revealed!",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>回绝了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，不战而退，选择认输。"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> rejected the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, retreating without a fight and choosing to concede.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>在宣战决斗中击败[%s]，这个名字将与胜利一同被历史铭记。"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> defeated [%s] in a declaration duel; this name will be remembered by history along with the victory.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>已向<HighLight>[%s]</>发起俱乐部宣战——战火将起，胜负未定。"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> has declared a club war against <HighLight>[%s]</>—the flames of war are about to rise, and the outcome is uncertain.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>接受了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，决斗将在[今天%s]开启！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [today %s]!",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>接受了<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战，决斗将在[明天%s]开启！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> accepted the club war declaration from <HighLight>[%s]</>, the duel will begin [tomorrow %s]!",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>正式开启“名流盛宴”活动，欢迎所有非凡者参与！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> has officially started the 'Celebrity Feast' event, all Beyonders are welcome to participate!",
    ["<HighLight>[可拍卖]</>"] = "<HighLight>[Auctionable]</>",
    ["<HighLight>一段</>：观众解除自身控制状态，自身脚下展开潜意识海持续为范围内的友方目标回复生命值，最长持续9秒；潜意识海范围内自身队友获得减伤效果。\n<HighLight>二段</>：观众散去潜意识海并对范围内友方目标回复生命值，潜意识海存在时间越短回复量越多。"] = "<HighLight> Stage 1 </>: The Spectator removes their own Crowd Control, and a Sea of Subconsciousness unfolds at their feet, continuously restoring Health to allied targets within range for up to 9 seconds; teammates within the Sea of Subconsciousness gain Damage Reduction. \n <HighLight> Stage 2 </>: The Spectator dissipates the Sea of Subconsciousness and restores Health to allied targets within range; the shorter the duration the Sea of Subconsciousness existed, the higher the healing amount.",
    ["<HighLight>众神眷顾，荣光为冕，世人皆见！</>恭喜<HighLight>%s</>获得了<HighLight>%s</>赛区的众神之巅冠军！"] = "<HighLight>Favored by the gods, glory as a crown, seen by all!</> Congratulations to <HighLight>%s</> for winning the Peak of the Gods championship in the <HighLight>%s</> division!",
    ["<HighLight>卡牌能量</>满5点时自身<HighLight>穿刺</>的数值增加，持续5秒。若同时激活<HighLight>魔术表演</>节点，则满4点时自身<HighLight>穿刺</>的数值也会增加，持续5秒。"] = "When <HighLight>Card Energy</> reaches 5 points, your <HighLight>Piercing</> value increases for 5 seconds. If the <HighLight>Trick Performance</> node is also activated, your <HighLight>Piercing</> value also increases when reaching 4 points, for 5 seconds.",
    ["<HighLight>卡牌能量</>满5点时自身<HighLight>穿刺</>的数值增加，持续5秒；\n若同时激活<HighLight>混沌牌序</>节点，则满4点时自身<HighLight>穿刺</>的数值也会增加，持续5秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\">灵性爆发</>的<HighLight>易伤</>效果提高5%。"] = "When <HighLight> Card Energy </> reaches 5 points, your <HighLight> Pierce </> value increases for 5 seconds. \n If the <HighLight> Chaos Card Sequence </> node is also active, your <HighLight> Pierce </> value also increases when reaching 4 points for 5 seconds. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Spirituality Burst </> <HighLight> Vulnerability </> effect increased by 5%.",
    ["<HighLight>卡牌能量</>达到5点时才可释放。消耗5点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>，在2.7秒内持续向锁定目标发射卡牌，对目标及其小范围内敌方造成12次spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方怪物，施法过程中可以释放其他技能和移动。\n只要本技能处于可释放状态，<HighLight>终结技能</>就不会切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>或<HighLight>灵性爆发</>，但它们依然可通过收集<HighLight>命运黄牌</>或<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>解锁，并在本技能释放后立刻进入可用状态。"] = "Can only be released when <HighLight>Card Energy</> reaches 5 points. Consume 5 points of <HighLight>Card Energy</> to continuously fire cards at the locked target for 2.7 seconds, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage 12 times to the target and enemies in a small area, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy monsters. You can release other skills and move while casting. \nAs long as this skill is available, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> will not switch to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>, but they can still be unlocked by collecting <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> and will become available immediately after this skill is cast.",
    ["<HighLight>卡牌能量</>达到5点时才可释放。消耗5点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>，在2.7秒内持续向锁定目标发射卡牌，对目标及其小范围内敌方造成12次spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害，并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方怪物，施法过程中可以释放其他技能和移动。\n只要本技能处于可释放状态，<HighLight>终结技能</>就不会切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>或<HighLight>灵性爆发</>，但它们依然可通过收集<HighLight>命运黄牌</>或<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>解锁，并在本技能释放后立刻进入可用状态。"] = "Can only be released when <HighLight>Card Energy</> reaches 5 points. Consume 5 points of <HighLight>Card Energy</> to continuously fire cards at the locked target for 2.7 seconds, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage 12 times to the target and enemies in a small area, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy monsters. You can release other skills and move while casting. \nAs long as this skill is available, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> will not switch to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>, but they can still be unlocked by collecting <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</> or <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> and will become available immediately after this skill is cast.",
    ["<HighLight>太阳能量</>不少于2点时方可施放。消耗所有<HighLight>太阳能量</>，对锁定目标造成*d点物理伤害并触发<HighLight>无暗</>。\n<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得额外效果：损失自身*f**当前生命，对目标造成自身当前生命或已损生命mul(*f**,*f)的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"15\">固定伤害</>（取最大）。对8米内其他拥有<HighLight>异端</>效果的敌方掷出小枪造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并触发<HighLight>无暗</>。\n击败敌方玩家时，重置本技能冷却时间。\n\n<FaintYellow>无暗</>：消耗3/4/5点太阳能量时，基础伤害提高*d**/mul(*d**,2)/mul(*d**,3)。若目标为玩家且生命低于*d**，此次伤害的基础值提高15%（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下提高30%）。此次伤害击败敌方玩家时，短时间后将<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\">净化</>目标。"] = "<HighLight>Solar Energy</> must be at least 2 points to cast. Consumes all <HighLight>Solar Energy</>, dealing *d physical damage to the locked target and triggering <HighLight>Unshadowed</>. \n<HighLight>Blazing Sun</> state grants an additional effect: Lose *f** of your current Health, and deal <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"15\">Fixed Damage</> to the target equal to the greater of your current Health or lost Health multiplied by mul(*f**,*f). Throw small spears at other enemies within 8 meters affected by <HighLight>Heresy</>, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage and triggering <HighLight>Unshadowed</>. \nDefeating an enemy player resets this skill's Cooldown. \n\n<FaintYellow>Unshadowed</>: When consuming 3/4/5 points of Solar Energy, base damage is increased by *d**/mul(*d**,2)/mul(*d**,3). If the target is a player and their Health is below *d**, the base value of this damage is increased by 15% (increased by 30% in the <HighLight>Blazing Sun</> state). If this damage defeats an enemy player, the target will be <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\">Purified</> after a short duration.",
    ["<HighLight>太阳能量</>不少于2点时方可施放。消耗所有<HighLight>太阳能量</>，对锁定目标造成*d点物理伤害并触发<HighLight>无暗</>。\n<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得额外效果：损失自身*f**当前生命，对目标造成自身当前生命或已损生命mul(*f**,*f)的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"15\">固定伤害</>（取最大）。对8米内其他拥有<HighLight>异端</>效果的敌方掷出小枪造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并触发<HighLight>无暗</>。\n击败敌方玩家时，重置本技能冷却时间。\n\n<FaintYellow>无暗</>：消耗3/4/5点太阳能量时，基础伤害提高*d**/mul(*d**,2)/mul(*d**,3)。若目标为玩家且生命低于<HighLight>30%</>，此次伤害的基础值提高<HighLight>15%</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下提高<HighLight>30%</>）。此次伤害击败敌方玩家时，短时间后将<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\">净化</>目标。"] = "<HighLight>Solar Energy</> must be at least 2 points to cast. Consumes all <HighLight>Solar Energy</>, dealing *d physical damage to the locked target and triggering <HighLight>Unshadowed</>. \n<HighLight>Blazing Sun</> state grants an additional effect: Lose *f** of your current Health, and deal <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"15\">Fixed Damage</> to the target equal to the greater of your current Health or lost Health multiplied by mul(*f**,*f). Throw small spears at other enemies within 8 meters affected by <HighLight>Heresy</>, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage and triggering <HighLight>Unshadowed</>. \nDefeating an enemy player resets this skill's Cooldown. \n\n<FaintYellow>Unshadowed</>: When consuming 3/4/5 points of Solar Energy, base damage is increased by *d**/mul(*d**,2)/mul(*d**,3). If the target is a player and their Health is below <HighLight>30%</>, the base value of this damage is increased by <HighLight>15%</> (increased by <HighLight>30%</> in the <HighLight>Blazing Sun</> state). If this damage defeats an enemy player, the target will be <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\">Purified</> after a short duration.",
    ["<HighLight>太阳能量</>不少于3点时方可施放。消耗3点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（入战时若未命中不消耗能量），对前方范围内敌方造成*d点物理伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物。\n<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，本技能获得额外效果：攻击最大目标数提高，攻击范围扩大，基础伤害提高至*d点，若目标拥有<HighLight>异端</>效果则额外提高至*d点。"] = "Can only be cast when <HighLight> Spirituality </> is at least 3 points. Consumes 3 points of <HighLight> Spirituality </> (no energy consumed if it misses upon entering combat), dealing *d physical damage to enemies in a frontal range and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"> Knocking Down </> enemy monsters. \n <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state: This skill gains additional effects: the maximum number of targets hit increases, the attack range expands, base damage increases to *d, and if the target has the <HighLight> Heresy </> effect, it further increases to *d.",
    ["<HighLight>完成</>"] = "<HighLight> completed </>",
    ["<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>命中目标时，会对目标施加<HighLight>异端</>标记，持续5秒。\n<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，普通攻击<HighLight>烈阳斩</>和普通技能命中目标时也会对目标施加<HighLight>异端</>标记。\n\n<HighLight>异端</>：拥有<HighLight>异端</>标记的目标，受到所有来自歌颂者的伤害提高10%。"] = "When <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </> hit a target, they apply a <HighLight> Heresy </> mark for 5 seconds. \n <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state: Basic Attack <HighLight> Blazing Sun Slash </> and basic skills also apply a <HighLight> Heresy </> mark upon hitting a target. \n \n <HighLight> Heresy </>: Targets with a <HighLight> Heresy </> mark take 10% increased damage from all Bard sources.",
    ["<HighLight>折幕</>的叠加上限提升至<HighLight>10</>层。达到<HighLight>10</>层时，返还<HighLight>3秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">空间牢笼</>冷却时间和<HighLight>5秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">漫游</>冷却时间。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">空间牢笼</>协同攻击伤害提高<HighLight>100%</>。"] = "The stack limit of <HighLight>Folding Screen</> is increased to <HighLight>10</> stacks. Upon reaching <HighLight>10</> stacks, refund <HighLight>3 seconds</> of the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Space Cage</> cooldown and <HighLight>5 seconds</> of the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Roaming</> cooldown. The coordinated attack damage of \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Space Cage</> is increased by <HighLight>100%</>.",
    ["<HighLight>星空能量</>最大储存数量增加至<HighLight>10</>。"] = "The maximum storage capacity of <HighLight>Star Sand</> energy is increased to <HighLight>10</>.",
    ["<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，自身将跃至敌方身前，随后向前全力劈砍造成1次*d点物理伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物，且在命中后获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>。"] = "In the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state, you will leap in front of the enemy and then slash forward with full force, dealing 1 instance of *d physical damage and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"> knocking down </> enemy monsters, and gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> upon hitting.",
    ["<HighLight>研习</>期间，每次<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">足迹再现</>（根据层数）可以返还<HighLight>1秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051050\" color=\"#f4a067\">星云咏叹</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051010\" color=\"#f4a067\">戏法演绎</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051060\" color=\"#f4a067\">放逐</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051090\" color=\"#f4a067\">记录</>冷却时间。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">空间牢笼</>协同攻击伤害提高<HighLight>100%</>。"] = "During <HighLight>Study</>, each <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Footprint Reappearance</> (based on stacks) can refund <HighLight>1 second</> of the cooldown for <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Nebula Aria</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Trick Performance</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Exile</>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051090\" color=\"#f4a067\">Record</>. The coordinated attack damage of \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Space Cage</> is increased by <HighLight>100%</>.",
    ["<HighLight>研习</>期间，获得额外<HighLight>攻击力</>与<HighLight>技能增强</>。"] = "During <HighLight>Study</>, gain additional <HighLight>Attack Power</> and <HighLight>Skill Enhancement</>.",
    ["<HighLight>致迷途的羔羊与渴求庇护的灵魂</>：\n能占用一下您的时间吗？我想给您讲一讲我们的道标和救主，“愚者”先生。\n我主自称愚者，在过去，在现在，也在未来，他是支配灵界的伟大主宰，也是执掌好运的黄黑之王，更是每个生灵追求永恒的道标。\n他是怜悯的，他是仁慈的，他是这个世界的救主，他让我们以他来代称，而非祂。\n他的仁爱播撒在人间，为家家户户带去温暖。我们将这关怀化作触手可及的回馈，将愚者的福音传遍大地——\n每月购买愚者福音，您将获得每日返现，以及福音定期馈赠的材料物资。我们还将为您带来每日福音券的抽取，解读运势。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！赞美愚者的馈赠！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，愿这福音成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！"] = "<HighLight>To the lost lambs and souls seeking shelter</>: \nMay I have a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about our beacon and savior, Mr. Fool. \nMy Lord calls himself The Fool. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great ruler who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living creature pursuing eternity. \nHe is compassionate, He is merciful, and He is the savior of this world. He lets us refer to Him as 'him' instead of 'He'. \nHis benevolence is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We transform this care into tangible rewards, spreading the Gospel of The Fool throughout the land—\nPurchase the Gospel of The Fool every month to receive daily cashbacks, as well as materials and supplies gifted regularly by the Gospel. We will also bring you daily Gospel Ticket draws and fortune readings. \nListen to the 'Scripture of The Fool', praise The Fool! Praise the gifts of The Fool! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and may this Gospel become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward!",
    ["<HighLight>衰败</>的最大持续时间增加15秒。"] = "The maximum duration of <HighLight>Decay</> is increased by 15 seconds.",
    ["<HighLight>衰败</>的最大持续时间增加15秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">猎魔瞬斩</>的禁锢时间延长至3秒。"] = "Maximum duration of <HighLight> Decay </> increased by 15 seconds. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Hunter Instant Slash </> Imprisonment duration extended to 3 seconds.",
    ["<HighLight>过载</>期间，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051030\" color=\"#f4a067\">逃脱戏法</>霸体时间延长，释放时额外获得<HighLight>1</>层<HighLight>足迹</>。"] = "During <HighLight>Overload</>, the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Escape Trick</> Super Armor duration is extended, and releasing it grants an additional <HighLight>1</> stack of <HighLight>Footprints</>.",
    ["<HighLight_L>[%s]</>已向本俱乐部发起宣战。会长可<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【点击前往俱乐部宣战】</>应战或认输——若<HighLight_L>1小时内未响应</>，将视为自动认输，并扣除相应资金。"] = "<HighLight_L>[%s]</> has declared war on this Club. The President can <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【Click to go to Club War】</> accept the challenge or concede—if there is no response within <HighLight_L> 1 hour </>, it will be treated as an automatic concession, and the corresponding funds will be deducted.",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>%s倍积分结算倒计时 <Highlight>%s秒</>"] = "Countdown to <Highlight>%s</>%sx point settlement <Highlight>%s seconds</>",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>不足，是否选择抵扣<Highlight>%d</>个<Highlight>%s</>"] = "Insufficient <Highlight>%s</>. Do you want to choose to offset <Highlight>%d</> <Highlight>%s</>?",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>后恢复1点体力，可使用道具快速恢复体力"] = "1 Stamina restored after <Highlight>%s</>, use items to restore stamina quickly",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>后系统将自动分配并确认"] = "<Highlight> %s </> System will automatically assign and confirm after",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>在你的帮助下恢复了理智，感谢你为人们带来安宁。"] = "<Highlight>%s</> has restored Sanity with your help. Thank you for bringing peace to others.",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>按键设置为空，请确认 是否需要重新设置！"] = "<Highlight>%s</> key settings are empty. Please confirm if you need to reset them!",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>新染色内容将覆盖并储存至当前染色方案，是否确认？"] = "The new dye content of <Highlight>%s</> will overwrite and be stored in the current dye scheme. Confirm?",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>部位已解锁重塑，非凡者可以通过重塑获得更强的恩赐效果。"] = "Reshaping has been unlocked for the <Highlight>%s</> parts. Beyonders can obtain stronger gift effects through reshaping.",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>高倍据点结算倒计时 <Highlight>%s秒</>"] = "Countdown to <Highlight>%s</> high-multiplier stronghold settlement <Highlight>%s seconds </>",
    ["<Highlight>05时23分38秒</>后系统将自动分配并确认"] = "System will automatically assign and confirm after <Highlight>05:23:38</>",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>受到控制后，获得<Mark>30</>点控制闪避、<Mark>50</>点控制抵挡，持续<Mark>3</>秒，每<Mark>10</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>After being controlled, gain <Mark>30</> Control Dodge and <Mark>50</> Control Resistance for <Mark>3</> seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>10</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>100</>。距离上次受到伤害超过<Mark>2</>秒后破防提高<Mark>70</>，持续<Mark>5</>秒。 \n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>100</>. If no damage has been taken for over <Mark>2</> seconds, Armor Break is increased by <Mark>70</> for <Mark>5</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>150</>。受到攻击时，额外提高怪物专攻<Mark>50</>，持续8秒。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>150</>. When taking damage, Monster Specialization is additionally increased by <Mark>50</> for 8 seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>180</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>180</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>180</>。受到攻击后额外提高怪物专攻<Mark>50</>，持续<Mark>8</>秒。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>180</>. After taking damage, Monster Specialization is additionally increased by <Mark>50</> for <Mark>8</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>180</>。战斗中站立不动<Mark>5</>秒后怪物专攻降低<Mark>25</>，持续<Mark>5</>秒，闪避后怪物专攻提高<Mark>25</>持续<Mark>15</>秒。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>180</>. Standing still in combat for <Mark>5</> seconds decreases Monster Specialization by <Mark>25</> for <Mark>5</> seconds; after a Dodge, Monster Specialization is increased by <Mark>25</> for <Mark>15</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>220</>，穿刺降低<Mark>20</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>220</>, Piercing decreased by <Mark>20</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>30</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>30</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>35</>。守护附近的队友，使附近小队成员技能抵挡增加<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>35</>. Guards nearby teammates, increasing Skill Block for nearby squad members by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>40</>。守护附近的队友，使附近小队成员技能抵挡增加<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>40</>. Guards nearby teammates, increasing Skill Block for nearby squad members by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>180</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。进入战斗时，每有一个小队成员拥有威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>，攻击额外提高<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>180</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. Upon entering combat, for every squad member possessing the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family, Attack is additionally increased by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>200</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Attack increased by <Mark>200</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>210</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。进入战斗时，每有一个小队成员拥有威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>，攻击额外提高<Mark>10</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>210</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. Upon entering combat, for every squad member possessing the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family, Attack is additionally increased by <Mark>10</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>275</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</> Attack increased by <Mark> 275 </>. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>100</>，进入战斗后暴击额外提高，每<Mark>5</>秒暴击提高<Mark>10</>，最高额外提高<Mark>80</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>100</>. After entering combat, Crit rate is additionally increased by <Mark>10</> every <Mark>5</> seconds, up to a maximum additional increase of <Mark>80</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>80</>，进入战斗后暴击额外提高，每<Mark>5</>秒暴击提高<Mark>10</>，最高额外提高<Mark>80</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>80</>. After entering combat, Crit rate is additionally increased by <Mark>10</> every <Mark>5</> seconds, up to a maximum additional increase of <Mark>80</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>格挡提高<Mark>120</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Block increased by <Mark>120</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>110</>。释放技能和普攻会引来2-049的注视，注视叠加三层后造成额外伤害，每<Mark>4</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>110</>. Using skills and Basic Attacks draws the Gaze of 2-049. After stacking three layers of the gaze, it deals additional damage, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>4</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>110</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>110</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. \n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>130</>，防御降低<Mark>15</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>130</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>15</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. \n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>破防提高<Mark>80</>。受击时，有一定概率获得<Mark>60</>点防御，持续<Mark>5</>秒，每<Mark>10</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Armor Break increased by <Mark>80</>. When taking damage, there is a chance to gain <Mark>60</> Defense for <Mark>5</> seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>10</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>120</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Piercing increased by <Mark>120</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>120</>，暴击降低<Mark>20</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Piercing increased by <Mark>120</>, Crit rate decreased by <Mark>20</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. \n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>140</>，暴击降低<Mark>20</>。使装备者获得威瑟尔家族的<Mark>美德</>。\n<Mark>美德</>：武器<Mark>知识之乡</>会根据小队成员拥有的<Mark>美德</>额外提高攻击加成效果。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Piercing increased by <Mark>140</>, Crit rate decreased by <Mark>20</>. Grants the wearer the <Mark>Virtue</> of the Weil Family. \n<Mark>Virtue</>: The weapon <Mark>Land of Knowledge</> will provide additional Attack bonuses based on the <Mark>Virtue</> possessed by squad members. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>穿刺提高<Mark>90</>。处于战斗状态时使全队暴击提高<Mark>30</>、防御降低<Mark>15</>。\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Piercing increased by <Mark>90</>. While in combat, increases the entire squad's Crit rate by <Mark>30</> and decreases Defense by <Mark>15</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>100</>，途径专防提高<Mark>100</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark>100</>, Pathway Special Defense increased by <Mark>100</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>250</>。距离上次受到伤害超过<Mark>2</>秒后破防提高<Mark>70</>，持续<Mark>5</>秒。 \n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</> Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark> 250 </>. After more than <Mark> 2 </> seconds since last taking damage, Armor Break increased by <Mark> 70 </>, lasting <Mark> 5 </> seconds. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>310</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</> Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark> 310 </>. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专攻提高<Mark>350</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Pathway Specialization increased by <Mark>350</>. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专防提高<Mark>250</>。受到攻击有概率触发邂逅，途径专防提高<Mark>180</>，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</> Pathway Defense increased by <Mark> 250 </>. Taking damage has a chance to trigger Encounter, Pathway Defense increased by <Mark> 180 </>, lasting <Mark> 10 </> seconds, can be triggered at most once every <Mark> 30 </> seconds. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专防提高<Mark>300</>。受到攻击有概率触发邂逅，途径专防提高<Mark>180</>，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Pathway Special Defense increased by <Mark>300</>. Taking damage has a chance to trigger an Encounter, increasing Pathway Special Defense by <Mark>180</> for <Mark>10</> seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>30</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>造成伤害后，获得<Mark>90</>点暴击、<Mark>90</>点抗暴击，持续3秒，每5秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>After dealing damage, gain <Mark>90</> Crit rate and <Mark>90</> Crit Resistance for 3 seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every 5 seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>释放解控技能后，获得<Mark>50</>点技能抵挡，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2, (Brand has expired) }</>After releasing a Cleanse Skill, gain <Mark>50</> Skill Block for <Mark>10</> seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>30</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>240</>，穿刺降低<Mark>40</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。造成伤害/治疗时获得一层荒芜之力，每<Mark>2</>秒最多获得一层，使用<Mark>终结技能</>造成伤害/治疗时根据累计的荒芜之力额外造成伤害/治疗。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，荒芜之力会对自身造成少量伤害。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>240</>, Piercing decreased by <Mark>40</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. Gain one layer of Power of Desolation when dealing damage/healing, with a maximum of one layer every <Mark>2</> seconds. Using a <Mark>Finisher Skill</> to deal damage/healing causes additional damage/healing based on the accumulated Power of Desolation. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Power of Desolation will cause a small amount of damage to the wearer. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>怪物专攻提高<Mark>270</>，穿刺降低<Mark>40</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。造成伤害/治疗时获得一层荒芜之力，每<Mark>2</>秒最多获得一层，使用<Mark>终结技能</>时根据累计的荒芜之力额外造成伤害/治疗。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，荒芜之力会对自身造成少量伤害。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>270</>, Piercing decreased by <Mark>40</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. Gain one layer of Power of Desolation when dealing damage/healing, with a maximum of one layer every <Mark>2</> seconds. Using a <Mark>Finisher Skill</> causes additional damage/healing based on the accumulated Power of Desolation. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Power of Desolation will cause a small amount of damage to the wearer. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>技能增强提高<Mark>75</>，技能抵挡降低<Mark>5</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，技能抵挡降低<Mark>5</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>75</>, Skill Block decreased by <Mark>5</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Skill Block decreased by <Mark>5</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>230</>，技能增强降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击提高<Mark>30</>，攻击降低<Mark>45</>。\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>230</>, Skill Enhancement decreased by <Mark>10</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance increased by <Mark>30</>, Attack decreased by <Mark>45</>. \nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>260</>，技能增强降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击提高<Mark>30</>，攻击降低<Mark>45</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>260</>, Skill Enhancement decreased by <Mark>10</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance increased by <Mark>30</>, Attack decreased by <Mark>45</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>345</>，防御降低<Mark>10</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，防御降低<Mark>10</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Attack increased by <Mark>345</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>10</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Defense decreased by <Mark>10</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>140</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。使用社交动作<Mark>行礼</>后，暴击提高效果改为攻击提高<Mark>205</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>140</>, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. After using the social action <Mark>Salute</>, the Crit rate increase effect is changed to an Attack increase of <Mark>205</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>160</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。使用社交动作<Mark>行礼</>后，暴击提高效果改为攻击提高<Mark>235</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n当前污染值：{2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\n激活套装<Mark>铁与血誓约</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>160</>, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. After using the social action <Mark>Salute</>, the Crit rate increase effect is changed to an Attack increase of <Mark>235</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nCurrent corruption: {2,1,*d,F1690001,Corruption}\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Covenant of Iron and Blood</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,3,（烙印已失效）}</>暴击提高<Mark>325</>，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>，污染值提高<Mark>15</>。\n污染效果：达到<Mark>30</>污染值时，抗暴击降低<Mark>15</>。<Mark>{1,4,（已净化）}</>\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,3,(Brand Expired)}</>Crit rate increased by <Mark>325</>, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>, corruption increased by <Mark>15</>. \ncorruption effect: When reaching <Mark>30</> corruption, Crit Resistance decreased by <Mark>15</>. <Mark>{1,4,(Purified)}</>\nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>“律令扉页”</>征服声望加成"] = "<Highlight>\"Law Command Page\"</> Conquest prestige bonus",
    ["<Highlight>【%s】</>不足，是否前往商城进行购买？"] = "Insufficient <Highlight>【%s】</>. Go to the mall to purchase?",
    ["<Highlight>【廷根旧梦】</>为限时结交人脉活动。\n活动期间，<Highlight>克莱恩·莫雷蒂</>结交概率大幅提升。当获得传说人脉时，80%概率为克莱恩·莫雷蒂。如果本次结交的传说人脉不是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，则下次结交获得传说人脉时必定为克莱恩·莫雷蒂。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：克莱恩·莫雷蒂、奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【廷根旧梦】的保底次数会一直累积在限时结交活动中，与常驻结交活动独立计算互不影响。\n\n4、限时结交活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight> [Tingen Old Dreams] </> is a limited-time Befriending Connections activity. \n During the activity, the Befriending probability of <Highlight> Klein Moretti </> is greatly increased. When you obtain a Legendary Connection, there is an 80% probability that it is Klein Moretti. If the Legendary Connection obtained this time is not Klein Moretti, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be Klein Moretti. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Probability Information </> \n <Highlight> [Legendary] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74%. \n Includes: Klein Moretti, Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson. \n \n <Highlight> [Epic] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56%. \n Includes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti. \n \n <Highlight> [General Items] Related </>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70%. \n Includes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Befriending Details </> \n 1. Every 5 Befriending attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain a Connection of Epic quality or higher. \n \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection in 24 consecutive Befriending attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \n You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 Befriending attempts. \n After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n \n 3. The pity count for [Tingen Old Dreams] will always accumulate in the limited-time Befriending activity and is calculated independently of the permanent Befriending activity, not affecting each other. \n \n 4. In the limited-time Befriending activity, you can obtain 100 Befriending attempts per day, which can be accumulated up to 700 times. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Repeatedly Obtaining Connections </> \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Legendary Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 10 Projection Fragments. If that Legendary Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 40 Projection Fragments. \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Epic Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 2 Projection Fragments. If that Epic Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 2 Projection Fragments. \n Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Connection Shop.",
    ["<Highlight>【我来 我见 我征服】</>为限时结交人脉活动。\n活动期间，<Highlight>罗塞尔·古斯塔夫</>结交概率大幅提升。当获得传说人脉时，80%概率为罗塞尔·古斯塔夫。如果本次结交的传说人脉不是罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，则下次结交获得传说人脉时必定为罗塞尔·古斯塔夫。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：罗塞尔·古斯塔夫、阿兹克·艾格斯、克莱恩·莫雷蒂、奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【我来 我见 我征服】的保底次数会一直累积在限时结交活动中，与常驻结交活动独立计算互不影响。\n\n4、限时结交活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight>[I Came, I Saw, I Conquered]</> is a limited-time contact recruitment event. \nDuring the event, the recruitment probability of <Highlight>Roselle Gustav</> is significantly increased. When obtaining a Legendary contact, there is an 80% probability that it will be Roselle Gustav. If the Legendary contact obtained this time is not Roselle Gustav, the next Legendary contact obtained is guaranteed to be Roselle Gustav. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Information</>\n<Highlight>[Legendary]</> quality contact: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74% \nIncludes: Roselle Gustav, Azik Eggers, Klein Moretti, Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson \n\n<Highlight>[Epic]</> quality contact: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56% \nIncludes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti \n\n<Highlight>[Regular Items] Related</>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70% \nIncludes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Recruitment Details</>\n1. Every 5 recruitments, you are guaranteed to obtain an Epic or higher quality contact. \n\n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary contact for 24 consecutive recruitments, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \nYou are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary contact every 40 recruitments. \nThe count resets after obtaining a Legendary contact, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n\n3. The pity count for [I Came, I Saw, I Conquered] will always accumulate in the limited-time recruitment event and is calculated independently from the permanent recruitment event. \n\n4. You can obtain 100 recruitment attempts per day in the limited-time recruitment event, up to a maximum of 700. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Duplicate Contacts</>\nWhen you obtain a duplicate Legendary contact, it will be converted into 1 corresponding contact upgrade material and 10 projection fragments. If the Legendary contact has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade to the ultimate level, the excess upgrade materials will be converted into 40 projection fragments. \nWhen you obtain a duplicate Epic contact, it will be converted into 1 corresponding contact upgrade material and 2 projection fragments. If the Epic contact has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade to the ultimate level, the excess upgrade materials will be converted into 2 projection fragments. \nProjection fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Contact Shop.",
    ["<Highlight>【星灵奇装】</>\n群星璀璨之时，星光加身一刻，美将再现于此。\n\n<Highlight>【召唤规则】</>\n使用星币进行灵界召唤，概率获得珍贵的宝物奖励。\n奖励分为<Highlight>神眷</>、<Highlight>灵幻</>、<Highlight>非凡</>三档。累计使用<Highlight>10</>个星币且未获得神眷奖励后，神眷概率逐渐增加，每使用<Highlight>40个</>星币必定获得<Highlight>神眷</>奖励，每使用<Highlight>10个</>星币必定获得<Highlight>灵幻</>奖励。\n召唤获得的奖励均无法交易或赠送。\n\n<Highlight>【其它规则】</>\n使用<Highlight>裁刀</>可以在星灵秘库商店兑换奖励，获得超过拥有上限的灵幻或神眷档次外观奖励时，将会被分解为特定数量的<Highlight>裁刀</>。\n获得神眷品质奖励时，将<Highlight>优先获得未拥有</>的外观奖励（神眷发型与时装散件分开计算），可在外观收集进度中查看详情。\n\n<Highlight>【概率公示】</>\n神眷奖励概率（含保底）：5.230%\n<Highlight>神眷发型</>：0.596%\n<Highlight>神眷时装散件</>：4.634%\n\n灵幻奖励概率（含保底）：12.222%\n风暴之泪、玫瑰藤杖、栖蝶披风、蔷薇之缚、银蔷薇\n\n非凡奖励概率（含保底）：82.548%\n聚合因子、泡沫染膏、珊瑚染料、爆爆烟花、彩带烟花、派对烟花、古怪的药剂、简易的火把、纯情鲁特琴、小象玩偶、冰冷的裹布、荣耀的传承、卷毛狒狒的毛发、幸运大转盘、贝壳项链、珍珠胸花"] = "<Highlight>【Star Spirit Exotic Attire】</>\nWhen the stars shine bright and starlight descends, beauty shall reappear here.\n\n<Highlight>【Summoning Rules】</>\nUse Star Coins to perform Spirit World summoning for a chance to obtain precious treasure rewards.\nRewards are divided into three tiers: <Highlight>God's Favor</>, <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</>, and <Highlight>Beyonder</>. After using a total of <Highlight>10</> Star Coins without obtaining a God's Favor reward, the probability of obtaining one will gradually increase. Every <Highlight>40</> Star Coins used guarantees a <Highlight>God's Favor</> reward, and every <Highlight>10</> Star Coins used guarantees a <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</> reward.\n Rewards obtained from summoning cannot be traded or gifted.\n\n<Highlight>【Other Rules】</>\nUse <Highlight>Cutting Blades</> to exchange for rewards in the Star Spirit Secret Vault Shop. If you obtain a Spirit Illusion or God's Favor tier cosmetic reward that exceeds your ownership limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Cutting Blades</>.\nWhen obtaining a God's Favor quality reward, you will <Highlight>prioritize obtaining unowned</> cosmetic rewards (God's Favor hairstyles and outfit pieces are calculated separately). You can view details in the Cosmetic Collection Progress.\n\n<Highlight>【Probability Disclosure】</>\nGod's Favor reward probability (including pity): 5.230%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Hairstyle</>: 0.596%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Outfit Piece</>: 4.634%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 12.222%\nStorm's Tear, Rose Vine Staff, Butterfly-Perching Cape, Rose Binding, Silver Rose\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 82.548%\nAggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Eccentric Potion, Simple Torch, Innocent Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Shroud, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Seashell Necklace, Pearl Corsage",
    ["<Highlight>【死亡永渡】</>为限时结交人脉活动。\n活动期间，<Highlight>阿兹克·艾格斯</>结交概率大幅提升。当获得传说人脉时，80%概率为阿兹克·艾格斯。如果本次结交的传说人脉不是阿兹克·艾格斯，则下次结交获得传说人脉时必定为阿兹克·艾格斯。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：阿兹克·艾格斯、克莱恩·莫雷蒂、奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【死亡永渡】的保底次数会一直累积在限时结交活动中，与常驻结交活动独立计算互不影响。\n\n4、限时结交活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight> [Death's Eternal Crossing] </> is a limited-time Befriending Connections activity. \n During the activity, the Befriending probability of <Highlight> Azik Eggers </> is greatly increased. When you obtain a Legendary Connection, there is an 80% probability that it is Azik Eggers. If the Legendary Connection obtained this time is not Azik Eggers, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be Azik Eggers. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Probability Information </> \n <Highlight> [Legendary] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74%. \n Includes: Azik Eggers, Klein Moretti, Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson. \n \n <Highlight> [Epic] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56%. \n Includes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti. \n \n <Highlight> [General Items] Related </>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70%. \n Includes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Befriending Details </> \n 1. Every 5 Befriending attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain a Connection of Epic quality or higher. \n \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection in 24 consecutive Befriending attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \n You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 Befriending attempts. \n After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n \n 3. The pity count for [Death's Eternal Crossing] will always accumulate in the limited-time Befriending activity and is calculated independently of the permanent Befriending activity, not affecting each other. \n \n 4. In the limited-time Befriending activity, you can obtain 100 Befriending attempts per day, which can be accumulated up to 700 times. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Repeatedly Obtaining Connections </> \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Legendary Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 10 Projection Fragments. If that Legendary Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 40 Projection Fragments. \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Epic Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 2 Projection Fragments. If that Epic Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 2 Projection Fragments. \n Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Connection Shop.",
    ["<Highlight>【段位奖励说明】</>\n\n1、段位玩法包括：冒险、同行、副本、趣斗、主宰争锋、神座之争、命运时刻、终末猎杀。\n\n2、游玩每种玩法可分别积累对应胜点，继而提升段位，获得段位奖励。\n\n3、每个段位的奖励<Highlight>至多领取三次</>，可自由选择喜欢的3种玩法体验，<Highlight>无需全部游玩</>。\n\n4、系统会自动把当前段位最高的三个玩法列在主要位置，点击各个模块可快捷前往对应玩法界面。\n\n5、段位重置后，段位奖励也会重置。"] = "<Highlight>【Rank Reward Description】</>\n\n 1. Ranked modes include: Adventure, Companion, Dungeon, Fun Fight, Dominator's Clash, Battle for the Throne of God, Moment of Fate, and Final Hunt.\n\n 2. Playing each mode accumulates corresponding victory points, which increase your rank and grant rank rewards.\n\n 3. Rewards for each rank can be claimed <Highlight>up to three times</>. You can freely choose 3 modes you enjoy; <Highlight>you do not need to play all of them</>.\n\n 4. The system automatically lists the three modes with your highest rank in the primary positions. Click on each module to quickly navigate to the corresponding mode interface.\n\n 5. Rank rewards will reset when the rank resets.",
    ["<Highlight>【灵界焕容】</>\n触及美，焕发美，成为美之本我，世间美的奇迹。\n\n<Highlight>【召唤规则】</>\n使用圣杯进行灵界召唤，概率获得珍贵的宝物奖励。\n奖励分为<Highlight>神眷</>、<Highlight>灵幻</>、<Highlight>非凡</>三档。累计使用<Highlight>60</>个圣杯且未获得神眷奖励后，神眷概率逐渐增加，每使用<Highlight>140个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>神眷</>奖励，每使用<Highlight>10个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>灵幻或灵幻以上</>品质的奖励。\n其中，圣杯·绑的使用次数将独立计算，使用圣杯·绑进行召唤获得的奖励无法交易或赠送。\n\n<Highlight>【其它规则】</>\n使用<Highlight>神眷牌</>可以在美神馈赠商店兑换<Highlight>神眷</>奖励。\n使用<Highlight>灵幻牌</>可在灵幻祭坛商店兑换奖励，获得超过拥有上限的灵幻档次外观奖励时，将会被分解为特定数量的<Highlight>灵幻牌</>。\n勾选使用<Highlight>圣杯</>抵扣<Highlight>圣杯·绑</>进行召唤后，使用圣杯进行召唤获得的奖励将<Highlight>无法交易或赠送</>，并计入圣杯·绑保底进度。\n\n<Highlight>【概率公示】</>\n神眷奖励概率（含保底）：0.873%\n<Highlight>神眷牌</>：0.793%\n<Highlight>苍白之冕</>：0.080%\n\n灵幻奖励概率（含保底）：10.928%\n星映绿夜·上装、星映绿夜·下装、星映绿夜·饰品、星映绿夜·配饰、颂诗礼服·发型、颂诗礼服·上装、颂诗礼服·下装、颂诗礼服·饰品、花开半靥、幽灵船舵、时之钟、灵幻牌*10、灵幻牌*5\n\n非凡奖励概率（含保底）：88.199%\n灵幻牌、聚合因子、泡沫染膏、珊瑚染料、爆爆烟花、彩带烟花、派对烟花、古怪的药剂、简易的火把、纯情鲁特琴、小象玩偶、冰冷的裹布、荣耀的传承、卷毛狒狒的毛发、幸运大转盘、贝壳项链、珍珠胸花"] = "<Highlight>[Spirit World Rejuvenation]</>\nTouch beauty, rejuvenate beauty, become the true self of beauty, a miracle of beauty in the world. \n\n<Highlight>[Summoning Rules]</>\nUse the Holy Grail for Spirit World summoning to have a chance to obtain precious treasure rewards. \nRewards are divided into three tiers: <Highlight>Divine Blessed</>, <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</>, and <Highlight>Beyonder</>. After cumulatively using <Highlight>60</> Holy Grails without obtaining a Divine Blessed reward, the probability of Divine Blessed increases gradually. Every <Highlight>140</> Holy Grails used guarantees a <Highlight>Divine Blessed</> reward, and every <Highlight>10</> Holy Grails used guarantees a reward of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion or higher</> quality. \nAmong them, the usage count of Bound Holy Grails will be calculated independently, and rewards obtained using Bound Holy Grails cannot be traded or gifted. \n\n<Highlight>[Other Rules]</>\nUse <Highlight>Divine Blessed Cards</> in the Beauty God's Gift Shop to redeem <Highlight>Divine Blessed</> rewards. \nUse <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</> in the Spirit Illusion Altar Shop to redeem rewards. When obtaining a Spirit Illusion tier appearance reward that exceeds the possession limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</>. \nAfter checking to use <Highlight>Holy Grails</> to offset <Highlight>Bound Holy Grails</> for summoning, the rewards obtained using Holy Grails for summoning will <Highlight>not be tradable or giftable</> and will be counted towards the Bound Holy Grail pity progress. \n\n<Highlight>[Probability Disclosure]</>\nDivine Blessed reward probability (including pity): 0.873%\n<Highlight>Divine Blessed Card</>: 0.793%\n<Highlight>Pale Crown</>: 0.080%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 10.928%\nStar-Reflected Green Night Top, Star-Reflected Green Night Bottom, Star-Reflected Green Night Accessory, Star-Reflected Green Night Ornament, Ode Dress Hairstyle, Ode Dress Top, Ode Dress Bottom, Ode Dress Accessory, Flower Half-Face, Ghost Ship Helm, Time Clock, Spirit Illusion Card*10, Spirit Illusion Card*5\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 88.199%\nSpirit Illusion Card, Aggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Strange Potion, Simple Torch, Pure Love Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Wrapping Cloth, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Shell Necklace, Pearl Brooch",
    ["<Highlight>【灵界焕容】</>\n触及美，焕发美，成为美之本我，世间美的奇迹。\n\n<Highlight>【召唤规则】</>\n使用圣杯进行灵界召唤，概率获得珍贵的宝物奖励。\n奖励分为<Highlight>神眷</>、<Highlight>灵幻</>、<Highlight>非凡</>三档。累计使用<Highlight>60</>个圣杯且未获得神眷奖励后，神眷概率逐渐增加，每使用<Highlight>140个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>神眷</>奖励，每使用<Highlight>10个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>灵幻或灵幻以上</>品质的奖励。\n其中，圣杯·绑的使用次数将独立计算，使用圣杯·绑进行召唤获得的奖励无法交易或赠送。\n\n<Highlight>【其它规则】</>\n使用<Highlight>神眷牌</>可以在美神馈赠商店兑换<Highlight>神眷</>奖励。\n使用<Highlight>灵幻牌</>可在灵幻祭坛商店兑换奖励，获得超过拥有上限的灵幻档次外观奖励时，将会被分解为特定数量的<Highlight>灵幻牌</>。\n勾选使用<Highlight>圣杯</>抵扣<Highlight>圣杯·绑</>进行召唤后，使用圣杯进行召唤获得的奖励将<Highlight>无法交易或赠送</>，并计入圣杯·绑保底进度。\n\n<Highlight>【概率公示】</>\n神眷奖励概率（含保底）：0.873%\n<Highlight>神眷牌</>：0.793%\n<Highlight>金枝森影</>：0.080%\n\n灵幻奖励概率（含保底）：10.928%\n星映绿夜·上装、星映绿夜·下装、星映绿夜·饰品、星映绿夜·配饰、颂诗礼服·发型、颂诗礼服·上装、颂诗礼服·下装、颂诗礼服·饰品、花开半靥、幽灵船舵、时之钟、灵幻牌*10、灵幻牌*5\n\n非凡奖励概率（含保底）：88.199%\n灵幻牌、聚合因子、泡沫染膏、珊瑚染料、爆爆烟花、彩带烟花、派对烟花、古怪的药剂、简易的火把、纯情鲁特琴、小象玩偶、冰冷的裹布、荣耀的传承、卷毛狒狒的毛发、幸运大转盘、贝壳项链、珍珠胸花"] = "<Highlight>【Spirit World Rejuvenation】</>\nTouch beauty, radiate beauty, become the true self of beauty, a miracle of beauty in this world.\n\n<Highlight>【Summoning Rules】</>\nUse Holy Cups to perform Spirit World summoning for a chance to obtain precious treasure rewards.\nRewards are divided into three tiers: <Highlight>God's Favor</>, <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</>, and <Highlight>Beyonder</>. After using a total of <Highlight>60</> Holy Cups without obtaining a God's Favor reward, the probability of obtaining one will gradually increase. Every <Highlight>140</> Holy Cups used guarantees a <Highlight>God's Favor</> reward, and every <Highlight>10</> Holy Cups used guarantees a reward of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion or higher</> quality.\n Note that the usage count for Bound Holy Cups is calculated independently, and rewards obtained using Bound Holy Cups cannot be traded or gifted.\n\n<Highlight>【Other Rules】</>\nUse <Highlight>God's Favor Cards</> to exchange for <Highlight>God's Favor</> rewards in the Goddess's Gift Shop.\nUse <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</> to exchange for rewards in the Spirit Illusion Altar Shop. If you obtain a Spirit Illusion tier cosmetic reward that exceeds your ownership limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</>.\nIf you check the option to use <Highlight>Holy Cups</> to offset <Highlight>Bound Holy Cups</> for summoning, the rewards obtained will be <Highlight>untradeable and ungiftable</>, and will count towards the pity progress for Bound Holy Cups.\n\n<Highlight>【Probability Disclosure】</>\nGod's Favor reward probability (including pity): 0.873%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Card</>: 0.793%\n<Highlight>Golden Branch Forest Shadow</>: 0.080%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 10.928%\nStar-Reflected Green Night Top, Star-Reflected Green Night Bottom, Star-Reflected Green Night Accessory, Star-Reflected Green Night Ornament, Hymn Dress Hairstyle, Hymn Dress Top, Hymn Dress Bottom, Hymn Dress Accessory, Half-Face Bloom, Ghost Ship Rudder, Clock of Time, Spirit Illusion Card*10, Spirit Illusion Card*5\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 88.199%\nSpirit Illusion Card, Aggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Eccentric Potion, Simple Torch, Innocent Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Shroud, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Seashell Necklace, Pearl Corsage",
    ["<Highlight>【规则说明】</>\n\n<Title>灵性之力</>\n1.邦尼洒下了灵性碎片，疯狂的抢夺吧。\n2.场地中央降下一道雷电特性，触碰即可暂时掌控雷电之力。\n3.使用雷电之力击败敌人即可获得大量灵性，但期间无法拾取其他任何灵性之力。\n<Title>收集灵性</>\n1.场地上还会四处飘浮着其他灵性光球，触碰可获得不同的能力。\n2.巧妙运用获得的技能与敌人周旋，同时尽可能收集更多的灵性碎片。\n3.有时候，拳头可能比灵性更好用。\n<Title>随机规则</>\n1.游戏共进行三轮，每轮仪式都会出现不同的规则。\n2.根据环境的变化调整你的策略，成为最终赢家！\n3.不努力的人可是得不到邦尼奖励的奥。"] = "<Highlight>【Rule Description】</>\n\n<Title>Spirituality Power</>\n1. Bonnie has scattered fragments of spirituality; scramble to grab them!\n2. A lightning attribute will descend in the center of the field; touch it to temporarily control the power of lightning.\n3. Use the power of lightning to defeat enemies to gain a large amount of spirituality, but you cannot pick up any other spirituality power during this time.\n<Title>Collecting Spirituality</>\n1. Other spiritual light orbs will float around the field; touch them to gain different abilities.\n2. Use the skills you've gained to maneuver around enemies while collecting as many spiritual fragments as possible.\n3. Sometimes, your fists might be more useful than spirituality.\n<Title>Random Rules</>\n1. The game consists of three rounds, and different rules will appear for each ritual.\n2. Adjust your strategy according to environmental changes and become the final winner!\n3. Those who don't put in the effort won't get Bonnie's rewards!",
    ["<Highlight>【规则说明】</>\n\n<Title>逃离监狱</>\n1.你被困在危机四伏的监狱之中，突破重重机关，找到逃生点。\n2.超过其他狱友，获取更多的积分，赢取丰厚奖励。\n3.10分钟时间耗尽仍未完成逃脱，逃离失败。\n<Title>躲避光照</>\n1.监狱中会有巡逻光照不断扫过场地，被发现后会被锁链束缚。\n2.不要掉进毒液池中，也要躲避毒液花的攻击。\n<Title>符文谜题</>\n1.逃生出口需要破解符文屏障才能打开，需要在地面寻找散落的符文。\n2.累计找到16个符文后，屏障将被破除。"] = "<Highlight>【Rules】</>\n\n<Title>Escape from Prison</>\n1. You are trapped in a dangerous prison; break through various mechanisms to find the escape point. \n2. Surpass other inmates to earn more points and win generous rewards. \n3. If the escape is not completed within 10 minutes, the escape fails. \n<Title>Avoid the Light</>\n1. Patrol lights in the prison will constantly scan the area; being discovered will result in being bound by chains. \n2. Do not fall into the venom pools, and avoid attacks from venom flowers. \n<Title>Rune Puzzle</>\n1. The escape exit requires breaking the rune barrier, which requires finding scattered runes on the ground. \n2. After finding a total of 16 runes, the barrier will be broken.",
    ["<Highlight>【非凡历史】</>为常驻结交人脉活动。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【非凡历史】的保底次数与其它活动独立计算，互不影响。\n\n4、可通过许愿提升结交获得对应人脉的概率。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，对应目标概率提高到80%。\n如果获得的传说人脉不是目标，则下次获得传说人脉必为许愿目标。\n许愿每周可生效2次，周一重置。\n每当结交人脉110次，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。\n\n5、本活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight> [Beyonder History] </> is a permanent Befriending Connections activity. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Probability Information </> \n <Highlight> [Legendary] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74%. \n Includes: Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson. \n \n <Highlight> [Epic] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56%. \n Includes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti. \n \n <Highlight> [General Items] Related </>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70%. \n Includes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Befriending Details </> \n 1. Every 5 Befriending attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain a Connection of Epic quality or higher. \n \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection in 24 consecutive Befriending attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \n You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 Befriending attempts. \n After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n \n 3. The pity count for [Beyonder History] is calculated independently of other activities and does not affect each other. \n \n 4. You can increase the probability of obtaining a corresponding Connection through wishing. \n After wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of the corresponding target increases to 80%. \n If the Legendary Connection obtained is not the target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the wish target. \n Wishing can be effective twice a week, resetting on Monday. \n Every time you perform 110 Befriending attempts, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \n \n 5. In this activity, you can obtain 100 Befriending attempts per day, which can be accumulated up to 700 times. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Repeatedly Obtaining Connections </> \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Legendary Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 10 Projection Fragments. If that Legendary Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 40 Projection Fragments. \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Epic Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 2 Projection Fragments. If that Epic Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 2 Projection Fragments. \n Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Connection Shop.",
    ["<Highlight>一键辅助：</>\n·勾选后开启一键辅助，使用普攻按键（默认E键）会依次释放技能，长按普攻按键（默认E键）2秒后进入自动释放技能状态。\n·进入自动释放技能状态后，脱战或者手动点击技能可以中断自动状态。\n·可以在设置-战斗-操作-自动战斗模式中切换移动优先模式或者技能优先模式，此设置将决定“一键辅助”在角色移动时是否会尝试释放技能。\n<Highlight>新手方案：</>\n·新手方案为游戏默认的一键辅助方案。\n·使用新手方案时，可以在技能快捷装配面板通过点击技能栏上技能右上角的区域，来将该技能添加进入或者移出一键辅助序列，只有点亮对勾的技能才可以通过一键辅助释放。\n<Highlight>进阶方案：</>\n·进阶方案可以自定义一键辅助，可以通过技能-一键辅助进入编辑界面。\n·可以创建10个进阶方案，在进阶方案中可以自定义技能释放优先级和释放条件。"] = "<Highlight>One-Click Support:</>\n · When enabled, using the Basic Attack key (default E) will trigger skills in sequence. Holding the Basic Attack key (default E) for 2 seconds enters auto-skill casting mode.\n · After entering auto-skill mode, exiting combat or manually clicking a skill will interrupt the auto-state.\n · You can switch between \"Movement Priority\" or \"Skill Priority\" modes in Settings-Combat-Operation-Auto-Combat Mode. This setting determines whether \"One-Click Support\" attempts to cast skills while the character is moving.\n<Highlight>Novice Scheme:</>\n · The Novice Scheme is the default one-click support scheme.\n · When using the Novice Scheme, you can add or remove skills from the one-click support sequence by clicking the area in the top-right corner of the skill slot in the skill quick-equip panel. Only skills with a checkmark can be cast via One-Click Support.\n<Highlight>Advanced Scheme:</>\n · Advanced Schemes allow for custom one-click support, which can be edited via Skills-One-Click Support.\n · You can create 10 Advanced Schemes, where you can customize skill casting priority and conditions.",
    ["<Highlight>主动挡住混沌能量，注意自身命运的颜色，碰撞和自身命运同色的能量会被晕眩，</>不要让能量接触到萨斯利尔"] = "<Highlight>Actively block the Chaos Energy, paying attention to the color of your own fate. Colliding with energy of the same color as your fate will cause you to be stunned. </>Do not let the energy touch Sasrir.",
    ["<Highlight>仅限猎杀时刻活动期间</>于【命运祭坛】处召唤命运人偶，将其击败可获得猩红遗物材料。王城区域危机四伏，建议<Highlight>团队前往挑战</>。"] = "<Highlight> Only during the Hunting Time event </>, you can summon a Fate Marionette at the [Altar of Fate]. Defeating it will grant Scarlet Relic materials. The Royal City area is fraught with danger; it is recommended that a <Highlight> team go to challenge it </>.",
    ["<Highlight>伦纳德</>近日停留在俱乐部，收集四散在各地的异象之物。\n如果收集到了足够数量的异象之物，可前往<Highlight>俱乐部场景</>从伦纳德处换取丰厚的奖励。"] = "<Highlight>Leonard</> has been staying at the Club recently, collecting Objects of Phenomenon scattered everywhere. \nIf you have collected a sufficient number of Objects of Phenomenon, you can go to the <Highlight>Club scene</> to exchange them for generous rewards from Leonard.",
    ["<Highlight>伦纳德·米切尔</>，前值夜者小队成员，现任黑夜教会高级执事。性格散漫随性，有诗人一般的气质，被克莱恩称为“诗人同学”，身体里寄宿着“偷盗者”途径的天使帕列斯·索罗亚斯德。"] = "<Highlight>Leonard Mitchell</>, a former member of the Nighthawks squad, currently a high-ranking deacon of the Church of the Evernight. He has a laid-back and casual personality with a poet-like temperament. He is called \"Poet Classmate\" by Klein and hosts the angel Pallez Zoroast of the Marauder pathway in his body.",
    ["<Highlight>俱乐部</>功能已经解锁，点击前往查看。"] = "The <Highlight>Club</> function is unlocked. Click to view it.",
    ["<Highlight>俱乐部乱斗</>源自一个镜盘样式的拥有古代学者能力的封印物，玩家可以作为暂时使用古代学者能力的召唤师，召唤出其中的<Highlight>历史投影</>进行对决。历史投影是选取了玩家过去某一时间点的状态，形成了对应样子的历史投影。\n玩法于每周周二、周四中午<Highlight>12:00</>开放报名，并于晚间<Highlight>19:00~20:30</>开启战斗（服务器首届比赛将于周六<Highlight>中午12点</>开放报名）。\n开放的轮次将根据上一届玩法<Highlight>参与人数</>决定（俱乐部成员需在20人以上，活跃度100以上，俱乐部内首届比赛轮次将根据俱乐部成员人数决定）。"] = "<Highlight>Club Brawl</> originates from a mirror-disk-style Sealed Artifact that possesses the abilities of an Ancient Scholar. Players can act as Summoners temporarily using the abilities of an Ancient Scholar to summon <Highlight>Historical Projections</> from within to duel. A Historical Projection is a state of the player selected from a past point in time, forming a Historical Projection of the corresponding appearance. \nRegistration for the gameplay opens every Tuesday and Thursday at <Highlight>12:00</>, and combat begins in the evening from <Highlight>19:00~20:30</> (the server's first competition will open for registration on Saturday at <Highlight>12:00 noon</>). \nThe number of rounds opened will be determined by the <Highlight>number of participants</> in the previous session (Clubs must have more than 20 members with an activity level of 100 or higher; the first competition round within the Club will be determined by the number of Club members).",
    ["<Highlight>先驱者的胜利在灵界中化作不灭回响，为后来者提供庇护。</>\n副本首通后，进入副本的非凡者会获得属性增益。"] = "<Highlight> The victory of the pioneers turns into an eternal echo in the Spirit World, providing shelter for those who follow. </>\n After the first clear of a dungeon, Beyonders who enter the dungeon will receive attribute bonuses.",
    ["<Highlight>先驱者的胜利在灵界中化作不灭回响，为后来者提供庇护。</>\n副本首通后，进入副本的非凡者会获得属性增益。\n首通第1周：生命提升500点，怪物专攻提升100点。\n首通后第2周：生命提升1000点，怪物专攻提升200点。\n首通后第3周：生命提升2000点，怪物专攻提升400点。"] = "<Highlight> The victory of the pioneers turns into an eternal echo in the Spirit World, providing shelter for those who follow. </>\n After the first clear of a dungeon, Beyonders who enter the dungeon will receive attribute bonuses. \n 1st week after first clear: Health increased by 500, Monster Specialization increased by 100. \n 2nd week after first clear: Health increased by 1000, Monster Specialization increased by 200. \n 3rd week after first clear: Health increased by 2000, Monster Specialization increased by 400.",
    ["<Highlight>克莱恩·莫雷蒂</>，本名周明瑞，1349年穿越成为克莱恩·莫雷蒂，穿越后卷入神秘学事件，并因此加入廷根值夜者小队，成为“占卜家”途径非凡者。机缘巧合下创立了塔罗会，代号“愚者”。在穿越后一直以“回家”为初心，但在卷入阴谋死而复生后，克莱恩义无反顾地走上复仇之路。"] = "<Highlight>Klein Moretti</>, originally named Zhou Mingrui, transmigrated to become Klein Moretti in 1349. After transmigrating, he became involved in occult events and thus joined the Tingen Nighthawks squad, becoming a Beyonder of the Seer pathway. By chance, he founded the Tarot Club with the codename \"The Fool\". After transmigrating, his original intention was always to \"go home\", but after being involved in a conspiracy and dying only to be resurrected, Klein embarked on a path of revenge without hesitation.",
    ["<Highlight>刺杀齐林格斯</>：受阿尔杰的委托，奥黛丽联合佛尔思、休一同调查“飓风中将”齐林格斯。后来，奥黛丽在舞会上识破其伪装，成功阻止他刺杀尼根公爵的计划。最终齐林格斯在逃亡途中被阿兹克截杀，他持有的非凡物品“蠕动的饥饿”被转赠给克莱恩。"] = "<Highlight>Assassinate Xilings</>: Commissioned by Alger, Audrey joined forces with Fors and Xio to investigate the 'Admiral of Hurricane' Xilings. Later, Audrey saw through his disguise at a ball and successfully prevented his plan to assassinate Duke Negan. Eventually, Xilings was intercepted and killed by Azik while fleeing, and the Beyonder item he held, 'Creeping Hunger', was gifted to Klein.",
    ["<Highlight>前往</>%s城堡"] = "<Highlight> Go to </>%s Castle",
    ["<Highlight>叹息之种·争怪任务可接取次数</>，任务目标为<Highlight>前往指定争怪区域接取并击败试炼怪物</>。"] = "<Highlight> Remaining attempts for the Seed of Sighs: Monster Dispute quest </>. The quest objective is to <Highlight> go to the designated dispute area to accept and defeat the trial monster </>.",
    ["<Highlight>叹息之种·狩怪任务可接取次数</>，任务目标为<Highlight>寻找并击败猎龙之城中游荡的骑士</>。"] = "<Highlight> Remaining attempts for the Seed of Sighs: Monster Hunt quest </>. The quest objective is to <Highlight> find and defeat the knights wandering in the City of Dragon Hunting </>.",
    ["<Highlight>名流盛宴正在进行中</>"] = "<Highlight> Celebrity Feast is in progress </>",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，击杀召唤出来的<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">灾异先锋</>。|击败灾异先锋：<Highlight>%d</>/1"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, kill the summoned <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Calamity Vanguard </>. | Defeat Calamity Vanguard: <Highlight>%d</>/1",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，击败3场波次<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">失控生物</>。|当前潮汐波次：<Green>%s</>/<Highlight>3</>"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, defeat 3 waves of <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> loss of control creatures </>. | Current tide wave: <Green>%s</>/<Highlight>3</>",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，寻找并击败地图中游荡的<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">守卫者</>。|击败守卫者：<Highlight>%d</>/2"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/2",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，寻找并击败地图中游荡的<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">守卫者</>。|击败守卫者：<Highlight>%d</>/3"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/3",
    ["<Highlight>坦克玩家</>需要及时拉住仇恨。"] = "The <Highlight>tank player</> needs to hold aggro in time.",
    ["<Highlight>坦克玩家</>需要抗下此技能。"] = "The <Highlight>Tank player</> needs to withstand this skill.",
    ["<Highlight>塔罗会</>，由克莱恩·莫雷蒂创立。成员以塔罗牌中的名字为代号，他们的途径和所属势力各不相同。塔罗聚会召开时间为每周一下午三点。"] = "<Highlight>Tarot Club</>, founded by Klein Moretti. Members use names from the Tarot cards as codenames, and their pathways and affiliated forces are all different. The Tarot Club meeting is held every Monday at 3:00 PM.",
    ["<Highlight>守护廷根</>：梅高欧丝因被兰尔乌斯欺骗，怀上了真实造物主的子嗣，并在因斯·赞格威尔的幕后操控下于黑荆棘安保公司失控。邓恩、伦纳德、克莱恩三人拼尽全力阻击试图诞生的邪神子嗣，最终成功守护了廷根。"] = "<Highlight>Guard Tingen</>: Megose, having been deceived by Ince Zangwill, became pregnant with the offspring of the True Creator and lost control at the Blackthorn Security Company under the manipulation of Ince Zangwill. Dunn, Leonard, and Klein tried their best to intercept the evil god's offspring that was attempting to be born, and ultimately succeeded in protecting Tingen.",
    ["<Highlight>安魂途径</>\n玩家可以通过<Highlight>安魂</>来提升理智值，缓解精神侵蚀带来的负面影响。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1、安魂诗社接引人</>\n玩家可在世界中寻找安魂诗社的接引人进行安魂，即时提升理智值。<Highlight>需支付一定费用</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2、向安魂诗社玩家求助 【推荐】</>\n可在各频道发送求助信息，向安魂诗社的教团成员寻求安魂协助，<Highlight>全程免费，无需任何费用</>。"] = "<Highlight>Requiem Pathway</>\nPlayers can use <Highlight>Purification</> to increase Sanity and alleviate the negative effects brought by mental erosion. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1. Requiem Poetry Society Guide </>\nPlayers can find a guide from the Requiem Poetry Society in the world to perform Purification and instantly increase Sanity. <Highlight>A certain fee is required</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2. Seek help from Requiem Poetry Society players [Recommended] </>\nYou can send help requests in various channels to seek Purification assistance from members of the Requiem Poetry Society. <Highlight>The entire process is free, with no fees required</>.",
    ["<Highlight>封印物</>：你正在使用的封印物，本质上是由某位神秘的“奇迹师”所召唤的历史投影。这种历史投影相较于原版封印物，能力有所弱化，但负面效果也有所减轻，能为非凡者带来各种提升。\n其中，普通封印物分为攻击、防御、特化三种，每类封印物最多携带一件使用；特殊封印物为非凡者提供各种特殊能力，不直接提升非凡者战力。\n<Highlight>封印物等级</>：普通封印物初始均为“3”级，扮演等级达到46级后可以消耗“历史回响”将封印物提升到“2”级。“3”级封印物最多可生效4条非凡物质词条效果，“2”级封印物最多可生效5条非凡物质词条效果。\n<Highlight>非凡物质</>：扮演等级达到42级时，可解锁非凡物质填充。为封印物填充不同的非凡物质，能为封印物附加上各种额外的效果。\n<Highlight>非凡共鸣</>：封印物填充非凡物质时，根据非凡物质的词条数量，生效额外的非凡效果，封印物等级提升，会提高非凡共鸣所能生效的最大词条数量。\n<Highlight>非凡知识</>：提升非凡知识等级，能使你更好地掌控非凡之力，封印物非凡能力效果、非凡物质固定属性值与非凡共鸣属性值会随非凡知识等级提升。\n<Highlight>聚合</>：扮演等级达到47级时，可解锁非凡物质聚合。将两个金色品质的非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质，可能获得更多词条的非凡物质。"] = "<Highlight> Sealed Artifact </>: The Sealed Artifact you are currently using is essentially a historical projection summoned by a mysterious \"Miracle Invoker.\" Compared to the original Sealed Artifact, this historical projection has weakened abilities, but its negative effects are also reduced, and it can bring various improvements to the Beyonder. \n Among them, ordinary Sealed Artifacts are divided into Attack, Defense, and Specialized types, with a maximum of one of each type being carried for use; Special Sealed Artifacts provide Beyonders with various special abilities and do not directly increase the Beyonder's combat power. \n <Highlight> Sealed Artifact Level </>: Ordinary Sealed Artifacts are all initially Level 3. After reaching Acting Level 46, you can consume \"Historical Echoes\" to upgrade the Sealed Artifact to Level 2. A Level 3 Sealed Artifact can have up to 4 Beyonder material affix effects active, while a Level 2 Sealed Artifact can have up to 5 Beyonder material affix effects active. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Material </>: When your Acting Level reaches 42, you can unlock Beyonder material filling. Filling the Sealed Artifact with different Beyonder materials can attach various additional effects to it. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Resonance </>: When a Sealed Artifact is filled with Beyonder materials, additional Beyonder effects take effect based on the number of affixes on the Beyonder materials. Increasing the Sealed Artifact level will increase the maximum number of affixes that can be effective for Beyonder Resonance. \n <Highlight> Beyonder Knowledge </>: Increasing your Beyonder Knowledge level allows you to better control Beyonder powers. The effects of the Sealed Artifact's Beyonder abilities, the fixed attribute values of Beyonder materials, and the Beyonder Resonance attribute values will all increase with the Beyonder Knowledge level. \n <Highlight> Aggregation </>: When your Acting Level reaches 47, you can unlock Beyonder material aggregation. Aggregating two gold-quality Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material may result in a Beyonder material with more affixes.",
    ["<Highlight>将猩红遗物材料呈交猎杀管家</>，推进<Highlight>猎杀进度</>，解锁阶段<Highlight>丰厚奖励</>。请注意：<Highlight>猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效</>，离开后将<Highlight>自动失效并清除</>。"] = "<Highlight> Submit Crimson Relic materials to the Hunt Butler </> to advance <Highlight> Hunt Progress </> and unlock <Highlight> rich rewards </> for each stage. Please note: <Highlight> Crimson Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting </>; they will <Highlight> automatically expire and be cleared </> upon leaving.",
    ["<Highlight>尽快击破所有分身，</>中止小丑的研究。"] = "<Highlight>Destroy all projections as soon as possible</> to stop the Clown's research.",
    ["<Highlight>尽快转火献祭幻影</>不要让任何幻影触碰到萨斯利尔"] = "<Highlight>Switch targets to the Sacrifice Phantoms as soon as possible</>. Do not let any phantoms touch Sasrir.",
    ["<Highlight>工坊建造</>\n玩家可以通过<Highlight>指派雇员</>来建造工坊。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1、雇员建造速度</>\n指派雇员<Highlight>数量越多</>，建造速度越快；指派雇员<Highlight>稀有度越高</>，建造速度越快。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2、秘偶幻化 【推荐】</>\n星虫可以<Highlight>幻化成其他玩家</>，指派幻化后的星虫进行建造，<Highlight>建造速度会大幅度提升</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3、建造速度上限</>\n每个工坊存在<Highlight>建造速度上限</>，达到上限后继续指派雇员不会提升建造速度。"] = "<Highlight>Workshop Construction</>\nPlayers can build workshops by <Highlight>assigning employees</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1. Employee construction speed </>\nThe more <Highlight>employees assigned</>, the faster the construction speed; the higher the <Highlight>rarity of the assigned employees</>, the faster the construction speed. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2. Marionette Illusion [Recommended] </>\nStar Insects can <Highlight>transform into other players</>. Assigning transformed Star Insects to build will <Highlight>significantly increase construction speed</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3. Construction speed limit </>\nEach workshop has a <Highlight>construction speed limit</>. After reaching the limit, assigning more employees will not increase the construction speed.",
    ["<Highlight>工坊生产</>\n玩家可以通过<Highlight>指派雇员</>到工坊，来生产物产。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1、雇员生产速度</>\n指派雇员<Highlight>数量越多</>，生产速度越快；指派雇员<Highlight>稀有度越高</>，生产速度越快。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2、提升生产速度</>\n<Highlight>升级秘偶等级</>后，会<Highlight>提升生产速度</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3、生产速度上限</>\n每个工坊存在<Highlight>生产速度上限</>，达到上限后继续指派雇员不会提升生产速度。"] = "<Highlight>Workshop Production</>\nPlayers can produce products by <Highlight>assigning employees</> to the workshop. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1. Employee production speed </>\nThe more <Highlight>employees assigned</>, the faster the production speed; the higher the <Highlight>rarity of the assigned employees</>, the faster the production speed. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2. Increase production speed </>\n<Highlight>Upgrading the marionette level</> will <Highlight>increase production speed</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3. Production speed limit </>\nEach workshop has a <Highlight>production speed limit</>. After reaching the limit, assigning more employees will not increase the production speed.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</> 哥特街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Gothic Streetwear\nDisdaining explanation and having no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive promptly at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</> 青藤蔓生\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Green Vine Overgrowth\nPoison ivy entwines with silence, hiding a deadly elegance within the deep dark green.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>不灭力量熔铸\n不灭之力如活化血肉般滚烫。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Forged with Undying Power\nUndying Power is as scalding as living flesh.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>丝绸精裁・秘纹繁绣\n心怀敬畏，窥探神秘，直至此身明晰万物之真理，方能止息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Silk Tailoring · Secret Pattern Embroidery \n Hold awe in your heart and peek into the mysterious, until this body understands the truth of all things, only then can it cease.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>丝绸精裁・秘纹繁绣・学者长袍\n心怀敬畏，窥探神秘，直至此身明晰万物之真理，方能止息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Silk Tailoring · Secret Pattern Embroidery · Scholar's Robe \n Hold awe in your heart and peek into the mysterious, until this body understands the truth of all things, only then can it cease.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>云纱堆叠・晨露缀饰\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Cloud Gauze Layering & Morning Dew Embellishments\nAmidst the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>云纱堆叠・晨露缀饰・芬芳纱裙\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Cloud Gauze Layering, Morning Dew Embellishments, & Fragrant Gauze Skirt\nAmidst the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>亚麻棉纺・田园便服\n于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Linen Cotton - Pastoral Casual Wear\nPick up a piece of gentle time in the golden wheat waves of Morse Town.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>亚麻棉纺・麦穗刺绣・田园便服\n于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Linen Cotton · Wheat Ear Embroidery · Pastoral Casual Wear \n In the golden wheat waves of the small town of Morse, pick up a piece of gentle time from the past.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>亚麻精纺·书页压纹·敞襟长袍\n心怀敬畏，窥探神秘，直至此身明晰万物之真理，方能止息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Linen Fine Spun · Page Embossed · Open-Front Robe \n Hold awe in your heart, peek into the mysterious, and only when this body understands the truth of all things can it cease.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>修身剪裁\n观众总是置身幕后，静观一切戏剧之欢呼，洞悉一切角色之走向。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Slim Fit \n The Spectator is always behind the scenes, quietly observing the cheers of every drama and discerning the direction of every character.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>做旧皮革\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Distressed Leather \n \"I will recall the dreams we explored together, every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>做旧皮革・朋克街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Distressed Leather・Punk Streetwear\nDisdaining explanation and having no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive promptly at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>做旧皮革・金衬叠穿・沉稳长风衣\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Distressed Leather · Gold Lining Layering · Steady Long Trench Coat \n \"I will recall the dreams we explored together, every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>做旧皮革・银钉链饰・朋克街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Distressed Leather・Silver Stud Chain・Punk Streetwear\nDisdaining explanation and having no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive promptly at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>军旅戎装\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Military Uniform \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a verdict, like an oath.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>利落剪裁・肃整无饰\n深蓝色经典制服，修长利落的战场剪影，代表秩序的开端。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Clean Cut/Stern and Unadorned\nA classic dark blue uniform, a slender and sharp silhouette on the battlefield, representing the beginning of order.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>利落剪裁・肃整无饰・轻便制服\n深蓝色经典制服，修长利落的战场剪影，代表秩序的开端。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Clean Cut/Stern and Unadorned/Light Uniform\nA classic dark blue uniform, a slender and sharp silhouette on the battlefield, representing the beginning of order.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>压纹皮革\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Embossed Leather\nThe never-flowing twilight lingers on the shoulder armor; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>压纹皮革·银铆轻铠·轻便战甲\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Embossed Leather · Silver Rivet Light Armor · Lightweight Battle Armor \n The never-flowing twilight lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>压纹皮革・银铆轻铠・轻便战甲\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Embossed Leather, Silver Rivet Light Armor, & Lightweight Battle Gear\nThe unmoving twilight lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, it still holds the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>友好的灵界生物，经过“橘光”启蒙的喵呜贼\n（积极地扭动）（光明且适度地爬行）（大方地前进）\n（随风飘荡）（脚步轻盈）（沐浴阳光） "] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight) ",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>友好的灵界生物，经过“橘光”启蒙的喵呜贼\n（积极地扭动）（光明且适度地爬行）（大方地前进）\n（随风飘荡）（脚步轻盈）（沐浴阳光） \n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Friendly Spirit World Creature, the Meow Thief enlightened by the \"Orange Light\" \n (Actively wiggling) (Crawling brightly and moderately) (Advancing generously) \n (Floating with the wind) (Light-footed) (Bathing in sunlight) \n Duplicate acquisitions will be automatically decomposed into Bound Gold Pounds ×100.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>古旧灵木・手工花饰\n芬芳之下，花朵与荆棘是命运的两面。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Antique Spirit Wood · Handmade Floral Ornament\nBeneath the fragrance, flowers and thorns are two sides of fate.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>哑光布艺・休闲漫步装\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Matte Fabric · Leisure Stroll Outfit\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best time at the beginning of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>哑光布艺・细密针织・休闲漫步装\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Matte Fabric · Fine Knitting · Leisure Stroll Outfit\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best time at the beginning of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣白薄纱\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Holy White Tulle\nThe radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-Seeker accepts the holy coronation during morning prayers.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣白薄纱・金丝刺绣・仪典礼服\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Holy White Gauze · Gold Thread Embroidery · Ceremonial Gown \n The radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Light-Seeker accepts the sacred coronation during the morning prayer.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣白麻纱・金纹刺绣\n祈祷声穿透穹顶化作光环，虔诚在圣殿的石柱间回响不息。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Holy White Linen · Gold Thread Embroidery\nThe sound of prayer pierces the dome, turning into a halo, and piety echoes endlessly among the stone pillars of the temple.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣白麻纱・金纹刺绣・祭司祭袍\n祈祷声穿透穹顶化作光环，虔诚在圣殿的石柱间回响不息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Holy White Linen · Gold Embroidery · Priest Robe \n The sound of prayer pierces the dome and turns into a halo, and piety echoes endlessly between the stone pillars of the sanctuary.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>圣者之布·日光镶边·垂坠圣甲\n至诚至纯的灵魂，将如日光般神圣，赤心颂唱时，太阳也为你首肯。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Saint's Cloth · Sunlight Edging · Draping Holy Armor \n A soul that is sincere and pure will be as sacred as sunlight; when you chant with a red heart, the Sun will also nod for you.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>夜蓝绒面・星尘披风・魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Night Blue Velvet · Stardust Cape · Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
