    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>战旗织锦・常胜肩甲\n常胜的勇士出征，为其授勋的是下一场胜利。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade · Ever-Victorious Shoulder Armor\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, and it is the next victory that bestows the honor upon them.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>手工做旧\n无论在地下酒馆，还是南大陆的码头，赏金猎手都会获得人们充分的尊敬。毕竟谁也不想成为猎物，不是吗？"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Hand-Distressed \n Whether in an underground tavern or at the docks of the Southern Continent, bounty hunters earn people's full respect. After all, no one wants to be the prey, right?",
