    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Explorer's Outfit\nThe tracks stretch into the distance, tools clatter, and a railway journey interwoven with the sounds of steam and engines begins here.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>摩卡织锦\n午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mocha Brocade\nThe afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the pleasant mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
