    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>星月交辉・命运轮转・秘纹占卜服\n星辰的轨迹，塔罗的秘义，彼此交错，占卜出关于未来的启迪。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Intertwining Stars and Moon · Fate Rotation · Secret Pattern Divination Suit \n The trajectories of the stars and the mysteries of the Tarot intersect, divining enlightenment about the future.",
