    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗夜呢料・诗意裁剪\n于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Dark Night Wool · Poetic Tailoring \n Under the guidance of the night, the Nighthawks walk in concealment. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗夜呢料・诗意裁剪・长燕尾外套\n于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Dark Night Wool · Poetic Tailoring · Long Tailcoat \n Under the guidance of the night, the Nighthawks walk in concealment. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Night Gown \n The night and scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the Kindred; dangerous, beautiful, and piercingly painful.",
