    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗影黑绸・饰银手甲・光暗礼装\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Shadow Black Silk, Silver-trimmed Gauntlets, & Light-Dark Attire\nWings spread in brilliance, metal condenses in shadow; they are reflections of each other, each complete in itself.",
