    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗银织纱・霜色刺绣・苍白礼裙\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Dark Silver Gauze · Frost Embroidery · Pale Gown \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together. She came draped in frost-colored bone gauze.",
