    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>枯叶流光・蝶翼堆绣\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Withered Leaf Shimmer & Butterfly Wing Layered Embroidery\nIn the realm of golden autumn, amidst the scenery of ruins, decay transforms into rebirth, and withered leaves break from their cocoons to become butterflies.",
