    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱・修身睡裙\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Soft Light Silk/Lace Tulle/Slim-fit Nightgown\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary, which is indeed quite tasteful to appreciate now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔光软绸・蕾丝轻纱・新款睡裙\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Soft-Light Satin・Lace Veil・New Nightgown\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary. After long appreciation, this flavor has surely penetrated your body and mind.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔色布艺・精巧花边・温婉日间裙\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Soft-colored Fabric/Exquisite Lace/Gentle Day Dress\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best time at the beginning of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>柔韧外套・漫游杂饰・探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Flexible Coat · Roaming Accessories · Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink, and a railway journey interwoven with steam and engine sounds begins.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>格纹织棉・流苏缀饰・野外便装\n星空为被，大地为床，篝火旁藏着冒险的梦想。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Plaid Cotton, Tassel Embellishments, & Outdoor Casual Wear\nThe starry sky as a quilt, the earth as a bed; dreams of adventure hide beside the campfire.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>橄榄丝绒・金纹提花・刺绣长裙\n伴随红月而来的疯狂呓语，小说家颂念了愚者的尊名，此时她尚且不知，这将是一场跨越家族和历史的旅行。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship:</> Olive Velvet, Gold-Threaded Jacquard, Embroidered Long Dress\nAccompanied by the mad whispers that arrived with the red moon, the novelist recited the honorific name of The Fool. At this moment, she did not yet know that this would be a journey spanning across families and history.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>水晶纱绉\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Luminous Dotted \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染・华美礼服\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Luminous Dotted · Gorgeous Gown \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染・繁花蓬裙\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Luminous Dotted · Floral Puffy Skirt \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>沉黑皮革・坚实护腕・蓄力轻战甲\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Deep Black Leather・Sturdy Bracers・Power-Charging Light Armor\nBoth soft whispers and passionate punches can complete an irresistible long slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>沉黑皮革・蓄力轻战甲\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Deep Black Leather・Power-Charging Light Armor\nBoth soft whispers and passionate punches can complete an irresistible long slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>浅金柔缎・红绒菱格・安眠睡袍\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Light Gold Soft Satin · Red Velvet Diamond Pattern · Slumber Nightgown \n Like the floor tiles laid in the corridor of an old house for a winter, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>浪花波纹・跃动坠饰・活力泳装\n波纹涌动，明快的金橙色破开滚滚热浪。水花绽放，夏日登场！"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Wave Ripples, Dynamic Pendants, & Vibrant Swimwear\nRipples surge, and bright golden-orange breaks through the rolling heat waves. Splashes bloom, and summer arrives!",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>深棕皮甲・菌络背饰・生物学者装\n大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Dark Brown Leather Armor · Fungal Back Ornament · Biologist Outfit \n A mad existence on the sea; strange lives are born under leather gloves. Every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in experiments.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>湛蓝披风\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Azure Cloak\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>漆面皮革・坚韧护甲・军旅戎装\n深蓝漆面吞尽所有刀光，只在转身刹那折出冷峻的色彩，如宣判，似誓言。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Lacquered Leather · Tough Armor · Military Uniform \n The deep blue lacquer swallows all blade light, reflecting a cold, stern color only in the moment of turning, like a verdict, like an oath.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>漫游杂饰・探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Roaming Accessories · Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink, and a railway journey interwoven with steam and engine sounds begins.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>狒狒绒毛・精致缝纫\n银色的柔绒小包。（非常适合存放香蕉！）"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Baboon Fur · Exquisite Stitching\nA soft silver pouch. (Perfect for storing bananas!)",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>猩红织锦・暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Scarlet Brocade · Night Gown \n The night and scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the Kindred; dangerous, beautiful, and piercingly painful.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>猩红织锦・荆棘环绕・暗夜礼服\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Scarlet Brocade · Thorn Surround · Night Gown \n The night and scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the Kindred; dangerous, beautiful, and piercingly painful.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>猩红织锦・荆棘骨刺\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Scarlet Brocade · Thorn Bone Spikes\nNight and scarlet are the thorns entwined around the long life of the Blood Clan; they are dangerous, beautiful, and cause endless stinging pain.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>玄黑绒呢・银饰扣环・鲁恩学者礼服\n知识在褶皱间沉淀，岁月在衣摆上流连。\n这是属于旧时代的优雅，亦是属于守护者的沉默。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Jet Black Velvet · Silver Buckle · Loen Scholar Gown \n Knowledge settles in the folds, and time lingers on the hem. \n This is the elegance of the old era, and also the silence of the Guardian.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珍珠华饰\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珠串缠绕\n黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Bead String Wrapping \n Yellow sand buries the past, His gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the Blazing Sun has never dissipated.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珠白柔缎・量身裁剪\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Pearl White Satin & Tailored Fit\nA poem sung from the heart does not necessarily require rhyme, and a shirt tailored with care does not necessarily possess elaborate carvings.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>珠白柔缎・量身裁剪・精致短衫\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl White Soft Satin · Tailored Fit · Exquisite Short Shirt \n A poem sung with heart does not necessarily need rhymes, and a short shirt tailored with heart does not necessarily possess ornate carvings.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>白羽织纱・鎏金缀饰\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>White Feather Woven Yarn/Gilded Ornament\nThe hem of the prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of a hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>白羽织纱・鎏金缀饰・圣咏礼装\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>White Feather Woven Yarn/Gilded Ornament/Chant Ceremonial Outfit\nThe hem of the prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of a hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>白金织锦・枝蔓刺绣・精灵长袍\n黄金枝叶编织王冠，丛影深处自有不朽，藤蔓缠绕金箔，森林也将低眉。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Platinum Brocade/Branch Embroidery/Elf Robes\nGolden branches and leaves weave a crown; there is immortality deep in the shadows of the forest, vines entwine gold foil, and the forest will also bow its head.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>皇室华缎・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Royal Satin・Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>皇室华缎・至尊甲胄\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Royal Satin・Supreme Armor\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>皇室华缎・至尊甲胄・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Royal Satin・Supreme Armor・Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>知性学派装\n以塔罗之名传递火种，只为末日之后，仍有明日。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Intellectual School Attire\nPassing the spark in the name of the Tarot, only so that after the apocalypse, there is still a tomorrow.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>知性花饰\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Intellectual Floral Ornament\nWalking without stopping, tracing the past and looking toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the gaps of history.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>祝圣织锦・烈阳光纹・歌颂战甲\n至诚至纯的灵魂，将如日光般神圣，赤心颂唱时，太阳也为你首肯。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Consecrated Brocade · Blazing Sun Pattern · Bard Battle Armor \n A soul that is sincere and pure will be as sacred as the sunlight. When you sing with a sincere heart, the sun will also give its nod to you.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银编织・黑羽纹饰\n为一切的告别奏响安眠之歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Weave · Black Feather Ornament\nPlaying a song of Slumber for every farewell.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银缝制・永生花\n花香会抚慰所有不甘于沉眠的灵魂。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Stitching/Eternal Flower\nThe fragrance of flowers will soothe all souls unwilling to slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银锻甲\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Forged Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银锻甲・湛蓝披风・骑士战铠\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Forged Armor/Azure Cloak/Knight Battle Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银锻甲・骑士战铠\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Forged Armor/Knight Battle Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银雕琢・精工镶嵌\n指尖的一缕清凉收束着灵性，似乎让每一次的仪式都变得更加顺利。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Carving · Precision Inlay\nA wisp of coolness at the fingertips constricts spirituality, seemingly making every ritual proceed more smoothly.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银鳞甲・干练军装\n银纹织就的誓言在肩头沉淀，铁与布在风中低语，像某种无声的律令。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Scale Armor & Professional Military Uniform\nVows woven in silver settle on the shoulders; iron and cloth whisper in the wind like some silent decree.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Fairy Tale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and black diamond-patterned dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
