    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工丝绸・盛宴晚礼服\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Precision Silk · Feast Evening Gown \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain of the feast. The first wisp of the evening breeze caresses the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工丝绸・网纱罗织・盛宴晚礼服\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Precision Silk · Mesh Weaving · Feast Evening Gown \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain of the feast. The first wisp of the evening breeze caresses the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
