    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工棉纺・知性花饰・博物学者服\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Cotton・Intellectual Floral Ornament・Naturalist Outfit\nWalking without stopping, tracing the past and looking toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the gaps of history.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工皮面\n黑色是黑夜赐予的隐秘，红色是戒律的森严。女神的使者们，为守护而行。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Precision Leather \n Black is the concealment granted by the night, and red is the strictness of the commandments. The Goddess's messengers walk for the sake of protection.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工皮面・绯红翻领・值夜者外袍\n黑色是黑夜赐予的隐秘，红色是戒律的森严。女神的使者们，为守护而行。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Precision Leather · Crimson Lapel · Nighthawk Robe \n Black is the concealment granted by the night, and red is the strictness of the commandments. The Goddess's messengers walk for the sake of protection.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工银链\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Precision Silver Chain\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and black diamond-patterned dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精锻白铁・手工打造\n无情的铁面，无法抵抗的命运。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Forged White Iron · Handmade\nA heartless iron face, an irresistible fate. \nRepeated acquisition will automatically decompose into Bound Pounds ×100.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精锻黄铜・蔷薇缠缚\n极为精美的仿真蔷薇，据说是第四纪遗留的古董饰品，担当着不对称审美的一环。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Forged Brass/Rose Entanglement\nAn extremely exquisite artificial rose, said to be an antique ornament left over from the Fourth Epoch, serving as a piece of asymmetrical aesthetics.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精雕铂金・珍珠垂饰\n以纯净的铂金编织的精美的额饰，繁复花纹似乎能吸引神明的庇佑。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Carved Platinum · Pearl Pendant\nAn exquisite forehead ornament woven from pure platinum; the intricate patterns seem capable of attracting the protection of the Gods. \nRepeated acquisition will automatically decompose into Bound Pounds ×100.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精鞣皮革\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the City of Cities.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精鞣皮革・轻便裁剪・都市漫步装\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather・Lightweight Cut・Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>素白亚麻・茶色褶裙・简约领结\n用稚嫩的肩膀撑起莫雷蒂家的天空，于贫寒中不失体面与尊严。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Plain White Linen/Tea-colored Pleated Skirt/Simple Bow Tie\nSupporting the sky of the Moretti family with young shoulders, maintaining decency and dignity amidst poverty.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>素色棉麻・简约淡雅\n毫无染饰的天然面料，象征灵魂初始之洁。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Plain Cotton and Linen/Simple and Elegant\nUndyed natural fabric, symbolizing the initial purity of the soul.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>素色棉麻・简约淡雅・基础单衣\n毫无染饰的天然面料，象征灵魂初始之洁。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Plain Cotton and Linen · Simple and Elegant · Basic Single Garment \n Natural fabric without any dyeing, symbolizing the initial purity of the soul.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>红绒缎面・黑金蕾丝・魔女礼裙\n裙裾拖曳的声响轻如秘密，只有靠得够近的人，才能听见诱惑在低语。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Red Velvet Satin/Black Gold Lace/Witch Gown\nThe sound of the trailing skirt is as light as a secret; only those close enough can hear the whispers of temptation.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>红绒菱格\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Red Velvet Diamond Pattern\nLike the floor tiles of an old mansion's corridor that have been laid for a winter; stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>纤白纱裙・鲜红宝饰・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Slim White Gauze · Bright Red Jewelry · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the skirt, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose an endless masterpiece.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>纯金锻造・珠钻豪镶\n某珠宝公司曾试图推出的顶级饰品，然而却因为未知的原因接连失败，现存的成品也寥寥无几。也许是因为命运吧。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Pure Gold Forging · Pearl and Diamond Inlay\nA top-tier accessory once attempted by a jewelry company, but it failed repeatedly for unknown reasons, and few finished products remain. Perhaps it is fate.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>织纱连缀・珠串缠绕・南大陆风情装\n黄沙掩埋往昔，祂的凝视穿透时光，烈日的梦从未消散。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Gauze Interlacing · Bead String Wrapping · Southern Continent Style Outfit \n Yellow sand buries the past, His gaze pierces through time, and the dream of the Blazing Sun has never dissipated.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>绯红缎面\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Crimson Satin\nAs pure as a new moon rising, the silent vow is more fervent than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>绯红缎面・苍银暗纹\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Crimson Satin/Pale Silver Dark Pattern\nAs pure as a new moon rising, the silent vow is more fervent than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>绯红缎面・苍银暗纹・锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Crimson Satin, Pale Silver Dark Patterns, & Sharp Hunting Gear\nSincerity is like the new moon blooming; silent vows are hotter than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>绿格背心・黑丝领结・学院制服\n学院的围墙上，青苔与泥土在方砖的缝隙里交替生长，一格青绿，一格棕黄。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Green Plaid Vest/Black Silk Bow Tie/Academy Uniform\nOn the walls of the academy, moss and soil grow alternately in the gaps of the square bricks, one square green, one square brownish-yellow.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>网纱罗织\n序曲奏响，开场舞揭开盛宴的帷幕。第一缕晚风轻抚衣摆，夜色在轻柔吐息。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Mesh Weaving \n The overture plays, and the opening dance lifts the curtain of the feast. The first wisp of the evening breeze caresses the hem, and the night is breathing softly.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>网纱衬里\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Mesh Lining \n \"I will recall the dreams we explored together, every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>网纱衬里・灵质链饰\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Mesh Lining · Ethereal Chain Ornament \n \"I will recall the dreams we explored together, every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>网纱衬里・灵质链饰・不规则斜裁裙\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Mesh Lining · Ethereal Chain Ornament · Irregular Slant Skirt \n \"I will recall the dreams we explored together, every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>羊毛混纺・户外短装\n阳光在晨起时就打了照面，晴朗的一天从现在开始。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Wool Blend・Outdoor Short Outfit\nThe sun greeted you as you rose, and a sunny day begins now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>羊毛混纺・洁白内衬・户外短装\n阳光在晨起时就打了照面，晴朗的一天从现在开始。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Wool Blend・White Lining・Outdoor Short Outfit\nThe sun greeted you as you rose, and a sunny day begins now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>翡绿羊绒・暗纹提花・保暖毛衫\n当迷雾散去时，旅人会发现脚下的路比想象中更柔软，原来绿野不只存在于传说里。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Emerald Cashmere/Dark Pattern Jacquard/Warm Sweater\nWhen the fog clears, the traveler will find the road beneath their feet softer than imagined; it turns out that the green fields do not only exist in legends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>翡翠织锦・珍珠华饰・优雅室内裙\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>至尊甲胄\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Supreme Armor\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>至尊甲胄・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Supreme Armor・Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>苍银暗纹\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Pale Silver Dark Pattern\nAs pure as a new moon rising, the silent vow is more fervent than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>荆棘环绕\n黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Thorn Surround \n The night and scarlet are thorns entwined around the eternal life of the Kindred; dangerous, beautiful, and piercingly painful.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>荆棘黑纱・蓝宝幽光・破碎礼裙\n子爵夫人她就站在那里，等着苹果树开花，等着果实成熟，等着她一直在等的人。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Thorned Black Veil · Sapphire Glint · Shattered Gown\nThe Viscountess stands there, waiting for the apple tree to bloom, waiting for the fruit to ripen, and waiting for the person she has always been waiting for.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>菌络背饰\n大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Fungal Back Ornament \n A mad existence on the sea; strange lives are born under leather gloves. Every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in experiments.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Blue and White Lace\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and white lace dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
