    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Blue and White Lace - Playful Rabbit Ears\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and white lace dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
