    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Blue and White Lace - Playful Rabbit Ears - Fairy Tale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and white lace dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace & Fairytale Gown\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Crafting:</> Blue and White Lace - Fairy Tale Dress\nEven if you are an unexpected guest, please observe the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue and white lace dress and join the whimsical and bizarre tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蕾丝软缎・黑紫荷叶・哥特街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Lace Satin・Black-Purple Ruffles・Gothic Streetwear\nDisdaining explanation and having no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive promptly at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Lace Veil\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary. After long appreciation, this flavor has surely penetrated your body and mind.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蕾丝轻纱\n某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Lace Tulle\nA certain emperor once left an unfinished remark in his diary, which is indeed quite tasteful to appreciate now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蝶翼堆绣\n金秋之境，遗迹丰景，凋萎变作新生，枯叶破茧成蝶。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Butterfly Wing Layered Embroidery\nIn the realm of golden autumn, amidst the scenery of ruins, decay transforms into rebirth, and withered leaves break from their cocoons to become butterflies.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蝶舞花饰\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Butterfly Dance Flower Ornament\nIn the Midsummer Night's fairyland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of fairies, but also the fluttering of poetic hearts.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>象牙缎面\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Ivory Satin\nWhen the gates of the royal stables open once more, the pace and poise remain as impeccable as ever.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>象牙缎面・珠链点缀・宫廷骑装\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Ivory Satin · Bead Chain Accents · Court Riding Habit\nWhen the gates of the royal stables open once more, the pace and poise remain as impeccable as ever.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>赭红暗纹\n堕落的侵蚀，邪恶的呓语……但骑士的精神，不容玷污。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Ochre Red Dark Pattern \n The erosion of corruption, the whispers of evil... but the spirit of the knight must not be tarnished.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>跃动坠饰\n波纹涌动，明快的金橙色破开滚滚热浪。水花绽放，夏日登场！"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Dynamic Pendants\nRipples surge, and bright golden-orange breaks through the rolling heat waves. Splashes bloom, and summer arrives!",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>轻柔网纱・白羽缀饰\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Soft Mesh & White Feather Embellishments\nWings spread in brilliance, metal condenses in shadow; they are reflections of each other, each complete in itself.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>轻柔网纱・白羽缀饰・光暗礼装\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Soft Mesh, White Feather Embellishments, & Light-Dark Attire\nWings spread in brilliance, metal condenses in shadow; they are reflections of each other, each complete in itself.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>部落编织・粗犷宝饰\n具有荒野风情的奇异披风，据说是罗塞尔大帝开辟航道之旅的战利品之一。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tribal Weaving/Rugged Jewelry\nA strange cloak with a wilderness style, said to be one of the spoils of Emperor Roselle's journey to open up trade routes.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>重工皮革・哥特晚礼服\n华彩在深黑之上流淌，诡谲却又优雅，令一切庸俗的颜色都黯然。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Heavy Leather/Gothic Evening Gown\nBrilliance flows over deep black, eerie yet elegant, making all vulgar colors pale in comparison.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>野外便装\n星空为被，大地为床，篝火旁藏着冒险的梦想。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Outdoor Casual Wear\nThe starry sky as a quilt, the earth as a bed; dreams of adventure hide beside the campfire.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>野性垂缎・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Wild Draping Satin · Dance Drama Costume\nAria white blooms among the skirt hems, and recitative gold surges beneath the cloak; behind the curtain, they compose an endless epic.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>野性垂缎・金狮纹章・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Wild Draping Satin · Golden Lion Emblem · Dance Drama Costume\nAria white blooms among the skirt hems, and recitative gold surges beneath the cloak; behind the curtain, they compose an endless epic.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>量身裁剪\n用心吟唱的诗歌不一定需要韵脚，而用心裁制的短衫也不一定拥有繁美的雕琢。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Tailored Fit \n A poem sung with heart does not necessarily need rhymes, and a short shirt tailored with heart does not necessarily possess ornate carvings.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>金丝刺绣\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Gold Thread Embroidery\nThe radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-Seeker accepts the holy coronation during morning prayers.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金织缀\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Weaving\nThe brilliant golden light interweaves with the clear radiance of emeralds, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Weaving & Emerald Inlay\nThe brilliant golden light interweaves with the clear radiance of emeralds, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶\n灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Weaving & Emerald Inlay\nThe brilliant golden light interweaves with the clear radiance of emeralds, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶・金缕礼服\n灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Weaving, Emerald Inlay, & Gold-threaded Attire\nThe brilliant golden light interweaves with the clear radiance of emeralds, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金织缀・翡翠豪镶・金缕礼裙\n 灿金光芒交织翡翠清辉，光影浮动，吟咏着一首无声的颂歌。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Weaving, Emerald Inlay, & Gold-threaded Gown\nThe brilliant golden light interweaves with the clear radiance of emeralds, light and shadow floating, chanting a silent hymn.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金缀饰\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Gilded Ornament\nThe hem of the prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of a hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鎏金缀饰・圣咏礼装\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Gilded Ornament/Chant Ceremonial Outfit\nThe hem of the prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of a hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>铂金镶嵌・海水珠\n自海上打捞的古老饰品。无论是精美的海珠和自然的纹理，似乎都在讲述“精灵”所在的那个古老而神秘的年代……"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Platinum Inlay · Sea Pearl\nAn ancient accessory salvaged from the sea. Both the exquisite sea pearls and the natural textures seem to tell of the ancient and mysterious era where the \"Sea Spirits\" resided...",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>铂金镶嵌・透蓝辉石\n闭上眼睛，却开启了新的视野。蓝色眼瞳照亮的真理就在前方。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Platinum Inlay/Translucent Blue Gem\nClosing your eyes opens up a new vision. The truth illuminated by the blue pupils lies just ahead.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>银丝覆面\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Silver Thread Face Cover\nBoth soft whispers and passionate punches can complete an irresistible long slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>银光锦缎・华美皮草\n将寒风缀于肩头，胜利的容光不惧任何凛冽冰雪。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Silver Brocade · Gorgeous Fur\nAdorn your shoulders with the cold wind; the radiance of victory fears no biting ice or snow.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>银质肩甲・钻石镶嵌\n荆棘舒展，于满月之夜绽放，危险而美丽。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Silver Shoulder Armor/Diamond Inlay\nThorns stretch out, blooming on the night of the full moon, dangerous and beautiful.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>银鳞丝绸・修身剪裁・剧场礼服\n观众总是置身幕后，静观一切戏剧之欢呼，洞悉一切角色之走向。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Silver-Scaled Silk · Slim Fit · Theater Gown \n The Spectator is always behind the scenes, quietly observing the cheers of every drama and discerning the direction of every character.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Sharp Hunting Outfit\nAs pure as a new moon rising, the silent vow is more fervent than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>镀金打造・剧演华饰\n 白裙覆满鲜血，金狮步步紧随。帷幕之下演绎着丛林的法则，精彩永不谢幕。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Gilded Craft · Theatrical Ornament\nThe white dress is covered in blood, and the golden lion follows step by step. Behind the curtain, the laws of the jungle are performed, and the spectacle never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>镂空蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Cut-out Lace\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>防水皮革・漆光翻领・雨夜外出装\n身着雨披行于街角，让绵密的水珠从身侧滑落，你就是夜里一盏温暖的灯。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Waterproof Leather・Lacquer Lapel・Rainy Night Outing Wear\nWalking through street corners in a raincoat, letting the dense water droplets slide off your side, you are a warm lamp in the night.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>防水皮革・雨夜外出装\n身着雨披行于街角，让绵密的水珠从身侧滑落，你就是夜里一盏温暖的灯。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Waterproof Leather・Rainy Night Outing Wear\nWalking through street corners in a raincoat, letting the dense water droplets slide off your side, you are a warm lamp in the night.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾光垂纱・优雅刺绣\n织物如云如雾，也像一位女士无可奈何却终将面对的结局。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist-light Draped Veil/Elegant Embroidery\nThe fabric is like clouds and mist, and also like the ending a lady is helpless to face but must eventually confront.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾灰精纺·暗纹提花·占卜之服\n即便在命运的巨变到来之际，也别忘记嘴角上扬，嘲弄于它。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Fog Gray Fine Spun · Dark Pattern Jacquard · Divination Garment \n Even when the great changes of fate arrive, don't forget to raise the corners of your mouth and mock it.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾灰精纺・暗纹提花・占卜之服\n即便在命运的巨变到来之际，也别忘记嘴角上扬，嘲弄于它。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Fog Gray Spun · Dark Jacquard · Divination Suit \n Even when the great changes of fate arrive, do not forget to raise the corners of your mouth and mock it.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Mist-colored Brocade & Morning Dew Embellishments\nAmidst the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰・清雅礼服\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Mist-colored Brocade, Morning Dew Embellishments, & Elegant Gown\nAmidst the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist Blue Tulle\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱・铃兰刺绣\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist Blue Tulle/Lily of the Valley Embroidery\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱・铃兰刺绣・淑女长裙\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist Blue Tulle/Lily of the Valley Embroidery/Lady's Long Dress\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>霜色刺绣\n冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Frost Embroidery \n By the banks of the River of Death, death and eternity dance together. She came draped in frost-colored bone gauze.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>青铜甲胄・岁月锈蚀・古董重铠\n艾弗利家族的荣耀在锈蚀中哀鸣，孢子侵蚀着骑士精神，只余破败的低语。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Bronze Armor · Aged Rust · Antique Heavy Armor \n The glory of the Avery Family wails in the rust, spores erode the chivalry, leaving only broken whispers.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>非凡雕琢・水晶镶嵌\n触感如冰雪一般的秘仪手链，似乎可以帮助收敛非凡者的灵性。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Beyonder Carving · Crystal Inlay\nA ritual bracelet with a touch like ice and snow, seemingly capable of helping to restrain a Beyonder's spirituality.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>香槟金属・手工镶嵌\n由鲁恩顶级珠宝商推出的化装舞会面饰，据说灵感来自于佛尔思·沃尔女士那篇患者面部开花的恐怖小说。当然，他们做了不少美化。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Champagne Metal · Handmade Inlay\nA masquerade mask launched by a top Loen jeweler, said to be inspired by the horror novel about a patient's face blooming with flowers by Ms. Fors Wall. Of course, they made quite a few aesthetic improvements.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>驼绒精呢·修身剪裁·剧场礼服\n观众总是置身幕后，静观一切戏剧之欢呼，洞悉一切角色之走向。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Camel Hair Fine Wool · Slim Cut · Theater Formal Wear \n The audience is always behind the scenes, quietly watching the cheers of all dramas, discerning the direction of all characters.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>驼色软呢・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>驼色软呢・洁白内衬・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・White Lining・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>魅力轻礼服\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Charming Light Gown\nIn the Midsummer Night's fairyland, it is not just the wings of sprites that streak across the sky, but also the fluttering hearts of poets.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>魔法制服\n 某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Magic Uniform\nSome mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鲜红宝饰\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Bright Red Jewelry \n The white of the aria blooms in the skirt, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose an endless masterpiece.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>鲜红宝饰・舞剧演出服\n咏叹之白在裙裾间盛放，宣叙之金在大氅下翻涌，帷幕之下，他们谱写永不停歇的华章。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Bright Red Jewelry · Dance Drama Costume \n The white of the aria blooms in the skirt, the gold of the recitative surges under the cloak; beneath the curtain, they compose an endless masterpiece.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>黄铜镶嵌・暗红血石\n信仰需要指向对的方向，时刻审视自我之心，切勿跌入无尽的迷途。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Brass Inlay · Dark Red Bloodstone\nFaith must be pointed in the right direction; always scrutinize your own heart, and never fall into an endless maze.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>黑紫荷叶\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Black-Purple Ruffles\nDisdaining explanation and having no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive promptly at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>黯色织缎・柔语曳地裙\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Dark Satin・Soft-Whisper Floor-Length Dress\nBoth soft whispers and passionate punches can complete an irresistible long slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>黯色织缎・银丝覆面・柔语曳地裙\n轻柔的细语与激情的轰拳，都可以完成一场难以抵抗的长眠。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Dark Satin・Silver Thread Face Cover・Soft-Whisper Floor-Length Dress\nBoth soft whispers and passionate punches can complete an irresistible long slumber.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n信息、知识\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n窥探世界背后的神秘学真相，解析万物运行的隐秘规律，窥视被隐藏的秘密。可隐藏自身于知识迷雾中，但知识本身即是诅咒——知晓越多越接近疯狂。是未知领域的探索者，隐秘知识的守护者，也是代价的承担者。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Information, Knowledge \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Peeks into the occult truths behind the world, analyzes the hidden laws of all things, and spies on hidden secrets. Can hide oneself in the fog of knowledge, but knowledge itself is a curse—the more one knows, the closer one is to madness. It is the explorer of unknown fields, the guardian of hidden knowledge, and the bearer of the price.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n奇迹、诡秘、愚弄、历史\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n愚弄命运、时间与历史，在历史迷雾中追溯过往、窥探未来。掌控诡秘变化，游走于灵界深处，于绝境中创造奇迹。是命运的玩笑者，时间的愚弄者，以诡秘之力愚昧现实法则，在不可能中创造可能。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Miracle, Mystery, Fooling, History \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Fools fate, time, and history, tracing the past and peeking into the future within the fog of history. Controls mysterious changes, roams deep within the Spirit World, and creates miracles in desperate situations. It is the joker of fate, the fooler of time, using mysterious power to fool the laws of reality and creating possibilities within the impossible.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n神圣、光、秩序\n\n<Highlight>核心能力</>：\n掌控太阳领域的神圣之火与秩序之光，订立不可违背的神圣契约，净化一切邪祟与污染。是光明的化身，邪恶的永恒克星，以太阳之名裁决世间不公。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Divinity, Light, Order \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability </>: \n Controls the holy fire and order light of the Sun domain, establishes inviolable sacred contracts, and purifies all evil and corruption. It is the incarnation of light, the eternal nemesis of evil, and judges injustice in the world in the name of the Sun.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n空想、心灵、洞察\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n主宰心灵岛屿与集体潜意识大海，深入一切生灵的精神领域。\n核心权柄「空想」——所想即可化为现实，编织梦境、植入暗示、安抚治愈。是心灵世界的支配者，精神的审判者，亦可将虚幻的空想降临于真实世界。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Fantasy, Mind, Insight \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Dominates the islands of the mind and the sea of collective subconscious, delving into the spiritual realm of all living beings. \n Core Authority \"Fantasy\"—what is imagined can become reality, weaving dreams, implanting suggestions, and pacifying and healing. It is the ruler of the mental world, the judge of the spirit, and can also bring illusory fantasies into the real world.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n门、空间、封印\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n掌控「门」的概念与空间法则，无视距离限制，开启通往任何地方的缝隙。漫游星界与灵界，封印隔绝万物。凡有缝隙之处皆可通行，是空间的折叠者、世界的旅者，亦是封印与放逐的掌控者。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Door, Space, Sealing \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Controls the concept of \"Door\" and the laws of space, ignoring distance limits to open gaps leading anywhere. Roams the Astral World and Spirit World, sealing and isolating all things. Wherever there is a gap, one can pass; it is the folder of space, the traveler of the world, and the master of sealing and exile.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n黄昏、战斗\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n承载黄昏领域的终结之力，掌控恐怖力量与坚韧生命。以巨人般的体魄与钢铁意志粉碎阻碍，越战越勇。黄昏意味着万物的衰败与时间的流逝，是力量的掌控者，黄昏的化身，走向永恒停滞之时。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Twilight, Combat \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Bears the ending power of the Twilight domain, controlling terrifying strength and resilient life. Crushes obstacles with a giant-like physique and iron will, growing stronger with every battle. Twilight signifies the decay of all things and the passage of time; it is the master of power, the incarnation of twilight, moving toward eternal stagnation.",
    ["<Highlight>廷根</>，一座位于鲁恩王国北部的城市，喧闹的早晨、匆忙的工人与流动的摊贩构成了它日常的底色。在这座城市里，克莱恩遇到了记忆不佳却可靠的队长邓恩，结识了善良而执拗的老师老尼尔，也寻得了跨越漫长历史的导师阿兹克先生。"] = "<Highlight>Tingen</>, a city located in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom. Noisy mornings, hurried workers, and flowing street vendors constitute the background of its daily life. In this city, Klein met the reliable Captain Dunn, who had a poor memory, got to know the kind and stubborn teacher Old Neil, and found Mr. Azik, a mentor who spanned a long history.",
    ["<Highlight>引导军团士兵互相撞击</>。"] = "<Highlight>Guide the legion soldiers to collide with each other</>.",
    ["<Highlight>当前狩猎任务已完成</>，叹息回响仍持续回荡，可继续<Highlight>狩猎其它敌人，夺取更多段位胜点</>。\n\n或将已，夺取的<Highlight>猎杀进度</>与<Highlight>猩红遗物</>，呈递给那位自称<Highlight>猎杀管家</>的苍白身影，即可换取<Highlight>属于你的那份非凡馈赠</>。"] = "<Highlight> Current hunting quest completed </>, the echo of sighs still lingers, you can continue to <Highlight> hunt other enemies and seize more rank points </>. \n \n Or, present the seized <Highlight> Hunting Progress </> and <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </> to the pale figure who calls himself the <Highlight> Hunting Butler </> to exchange for <Highlight> that Beyonder gift belonging to you </>.",
    ["<Highlight>往事陈列馆</>中兑换"] = "Exchanged in the <Highlight> Museum of Past Events </>",
    ["<Highlight>战士</>需注意终结技能命中巨龙的时机，其他非凡者<Highlight>远离</>巨龙的移动路径"] = "The <Highlight>Warrior</> needs to pay attention to the timing of the Finisher Skill hitting the Giant Dragon. Other Beyonders should <Highlight>stay away from</> the Giant Dragon's movement path.",
    ["<Highlight>戴莉·西蒙妮</>，原廷根市值夜者小队队员，是阿霍瓦郡最有名的通灵者，因自行总结出扮演法导致晋升极快而被圣堂注意，后调往贝克兰德。她与邓恩队长的关系似乎非同一般。"] = "<Highlight>Daly Simone</>, a former member of the Tingen Nighthawks squad, is the most famous Spirit Medium in Awwa County. She was noticed by the Holy Cathedral because she summarized the Acting Method herself, leading to extremely fast advancement, and was later transferred to Backlund. Her relationship with Captain Dunn seems to be unusual.",
    ["<Highlight>护盾</>你可以无敌3秒。"] = "<Highlight>Shield</> You can be invincible for 3 seconds.",
    ["<Highlight>拥有舞蹈</>的非凡者，需要进入对应<Highlight>舞阵内跳舞</>。"] = "Beyonders <Highlight>who possess a dance</> need to enter the corresponding <Highlight>dance formation to dance</>.",
    ["<Highlight>接取叹息之种任务后</>，猩红遗物可通过击杀<Highlight>猎龙之城中的超凡生物</>或击败其他敌对玩家<Highlight>掠夺获取</>。当被敌方玩家击杀时，<Highlight>猩红遗物也将按比例掉落</>。\n可将其提交至<Highlight>【猎杀管家】</>处推进<Highlight>猎杀进度</>奖励。<Highlight>猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效</>，离开后将<Highlight>自动失效并清除</>。"] = "<Highlight> After accepting the Seed of Sighs quest </>, Scarlet Relics can be obtained by killing <Highlight> Beyonder creatures in the City of Dragon Hunting </> or by defeating other hostile players <Highlight> to plunder them </>. When killed by an enemy player, <Highlight> Scarlet Relics will also be dropped proportionally </>. \n You can submit them to the <Highlight> [Hunting Butler] </> to advance <Highlight> hunting progress </> rewards. <Highlight> Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting </>; upon leaving, they will <Highlight> automatically expire and be cleared </>.",
    ["<Highlight>收集白银城散落的灵能碎片带到充能区域，为白银庇护充能</>充能完毕的区域内可以免疫一次毁灭性的伤害"] = "<Highlight>Collect the scattered spirituality fragments in the City of Silver and bring them to the charging area to charge the Silver Shelter.</> Within the fully charged area, you can be immune to one instance of devastating damage.",
    ["<Highlight>教团等级奖励</>获取"] = "Obtained as a <Highlight> Coven Level Reward </>",
    ["<Highlight>既是猎手，也是猎物</>——你可击杀他人，<Highlight>夺取遗物材料与段位胜点</>。但亦随时可能沦为其它非凡者的攻击目标，<Highlight>建议组队开启狩猎</>！"] = "<Highlight>You are both the hunter and the prey</>—you can kill others to <Highlight>seize relic materials and rank points</>. However, you may also become the target of other Beyonders at any time, <Highlight>so it is recommended to form a team to begin your Hunt</>!",
    ["<Highlight>星之虫</>类型的秘偶，可以<Highlight>幻化</>成其他非凡者。幻化后可以<Highlight>自由装扮</>。"] = "<Highlight>Star Worm</> type marionettes can <Highlight>Transform</> into other Beyonders. After transforming, you can <Highlight>freely dress up</>.",
    ["<Highlight>楼层高度</>决定奇迹建造生成的建筑物<Highlight>最高高度</>。\n城堡等级提升，会解锁新的楼层高度。\n不同建造风格，可选择的楼层高度范围也不同。"] = "<Highlight>Floor Height</> determines the <Highlight>maximum height</> of the buildings generated by Miracle Construction.\nIncreasing the Castle level will unlock new floor heights.\nDifferent construction styles have different ranges of selectable floor heights.",
    ["<Highlight>死亡骑士</>会跟随他身边<Highlight>20米</>内非凡者数量最多的势力（获得跟随需要最少<Highlight>5</>人）。\n<Highlight>死亡骑士</>身边的势力会定时增加势力积分，获得<Highlight>死亡骑士</>跟随的势力加分分数更高，成功将<Highlight>死亡骑士</>送达本阵营的广场将获得额外<Highlight>1200</>势力积分，到达<Highlight>15000</>势力积分的势力将提前获胜。"] = "<Highlight>Death Knight</> will follow the faction with the highest number of Beyonders within <Highlight>20 meters </> of them (a minimum of <Highlight>5</> people is required to gain their following). \n<Highlight>Death Knight</> will periodically grant faction points to the faction they are following, with factions followed by the <Highlight>Death Knight</> receiving a higher point bonus. Successfully escorting the <Highlight>Death Knight</> to your faction's plaza will grant an additional <Highlight>1200</> faction points. The first faction to reach <Highlight>15000</> faction points will win the match early.",
    ["<Highlight>没做完占坑</>，参与副本<Highlight>罗塞尔大帝（普通）</>，有概率获得下列外观。"] = "<Highlight>Not yet completed placeholder</>, participating in the dungeon <Highlight>Emperor Roselle (Normal)</> gives a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["<Highlight>没做完占坑</>，参与副本<Highlight>罗塞尔大帝（英雄）</>，有概率获得下列外观。"] = "<Highlight>Placeholder for incomplete content</>, participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Emperor Roselle (Hero)</>, there is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["<Highlight>没做完占坑</>，组队模式参加副本<Highlight>罗塞尔大帝（普通）</>，可以参与公共掉落的分配与拍卖。有概率获得下列外观。"] = "<Highlight>Placeholder for incomplete content</>, participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Emperor Roselle (Normal)</> in team mode to participate in the distribution and auction of public drops. There is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["<Highlight>没做完占坑</>，组队模式参加副本<Highlight>罗塞尔大帝（英雄）</>，可以参与公共掉落的分配与拍卖。有概率获得下列外观。"] = "<Highlight>Placeholder for incomplete content</>, participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Emperor Roselle (Hero)</> in team mode to participate in the distribution and auction of public drops. There is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["<Highlight>治疗玩家</>及时释放群体治疗技能。"] = "The <Highlight>Healing player</> should release group healing skills in time.",
    ["<Highlight>注意</>：模板建设时会优先铺设地板，没有铺设地板的组件不会被自动放置。\n摆放时会清除当前城堡的摆设！！！"] = "<Highlight>Note</>: During template construction, flooring will be laid first. Components without flooring will not be placed automatically. \n Placing will clear the current castle's decorations!!!",
    ["<Highlight>注意观察阿蒙分身们的运动轨迹</>，做好提前规避。"] = "<Highlight>Pay attention to the movement trajectories of the Amon Avatars</> and prepare to evade in advance.",
    ["<Highlight>注意远离奥黛丽</>。"] = "<Highlight>Be careful to stay away from Audrey</>.",
    ["<Highlight>派对正在火热进行中</>"] = "<Highlight> Party is in full swing </>",
    ["<Highlight>消化进度的上限</>会随<Highlight>赛季天数</>解锁。"] = "The <Highlight>Cap on Digestion Progress</> will be unlocked as <Highlight>Season Days</> pass.",
    ["<Highlight>源自第四纪的古战场历史投影</>，分为<Highlight>猎城战</>和<Highlight>高原战</>两大战场。虽然第四纪的四皇之战已淹没在历史中，但强大的能量依旧残留在那片古战场上，于特定时间整个战场将被短暂活化。\n\n<Highlight>战场资格</>将在每轮<Highlight>四方联赛第一场结束后21:00</>分配，系统将根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战，届时请留意查收邮件。\n\n<Highlight>猎城战：</>获得资格的俱乐部可前往「以战养战-势力-猎城战」界面查看势力分配，提前组织备战。参与即可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等丰厚馈赠。\n\n<Highlight>高原战：</>获得资格的俱乐部请关注战场报名时间，及时参与。亦可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等馈赠。\n\n更多详细规则请前往「以战养战-势力」界面查看。"] = "<Highlight>Historical projection of an ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch</>, divided into two major battlefields: <Highlight>Hunting City War</> and <Highlight>Plateau War</>. Although the War of the Four Emperors of the Fourth Epoch has been submerged in history, powerful energy still remains on that ancient battlefield, and the entire battlefield will be briefly activated at specific times.\n\n<Highlight>Battlefield Eligibility</>will be allocated at 21:00 after the first match of each round of the <Highlight>Four-Way League</>. The system will allocate each club to the Hunting City War or Plateau War based on the club's overall strength. Please check your mail at that time.\n\n<Highlight>Hunting City War: </>Eligible clubs can go to the \"War-to-War - Faction - Hunting City War\" interface to view faction allocation and organize preparations in advance. Participating will grant generous gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sule dividends, and battlefield titles.\n\n<Highlight>Plateau War: </>Eligible clubs should pay attention to the battlefield registration time and participate in time. You can also obtain gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sule dividends, and battlefield titles.\n\nFor more detailed rules, please go to the \"War-to-War - Faction\" interface to view.",
    ["<Highlight>源自第四纪的古战场历史投影</>，分为<Highlight>猎城战</>和<Highlight>高原战</>两大战场。虽然第四纪的四皇之战已淹没在历史中，但强大的能量依旧残留在那片古战场上，于特定时间整个战场将被短暂活化。\n\n<Highlight>战场资格</>将在每轮<Highlight>四方联赛第一场结束后21:20</>分配，系统将根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战，届时请留意查收邮件。\n\n<Highlight>猎城战：</>获得资格的俱乐部可前往「以战养战-势力-猎城战」界面查看势力分配，提前组织备战。参与即可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等丰厚馈赠。\n\n<Highlight>高原战：</>获得资格的俱乐部请关注战场报名时间，及时参与。亦可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等馈赠。\n\n更多详细规则请前往「以战养战-势力」界面查看。"] = "<Highlight>Historical projection of the ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch</>, divided into two major battlefields: <Highlight>Hunting City Battle</> and <Highlight>Plateau Battle</>. Although the War of the Four Emperors of the Fourth Epoch has been submerged in history, powerful energy still remains on that ancient battlefield, and the entire battlefield will be briefly activated at specific times. \n\n<Highlight>Battlefield Eligibility</> will be allocated at 21:20 after the first match of each round of the <Highlight>Four-Way League</>. The system will allocate each club to the Hunting City Battle or Plateau Battle based on the club's comprehensive strength. Please pay attention to your mail. \n\n<Highlight>Hunting City Battle: </>Clubs that have obtained eligibility can go to the \"War-to-War - Faction - Hunting City Battle\" interface to view faction allocation and organize preparations in advance. Participating will grant generous rewards such as contact and marionette drawing items, Sul dividends, and battlefield titles. \n\n<Highlight>Plateau Battle: </>Clubs that have obtained eligibility should pay attention to the battlefield registration time and participate in time. You can also obtain rewards such as contact and marionette drawing items, Sul dividends, and battlefield titles. \n\nFor more detailed rules, please go to the \"War-to-War - Faction\" interface.",
    ["<Highlight>灵体之线</>会在连线双方<Highlight>距离超过一定值</>后断开，玩家需要与被连线的另一名玩家向反方向跑开"] = "The <Highlight>spirit body threads</> will break when the distance between the two connected parties <Highlight>exceeds a certain value</>. Players need to run in the opposite direction from the other connected player.",
    ["<Highlight>猩红犬魂已锁定异化猎犬！</>"] = "<Highlight> The Scarlet Hound Soul has locked onto the Alienated Hound! </>",
    ["<Highlight>率先获得3000积分</>的俱乐部即刻锁定胜局；若对局结束时无人达到3000分，则按当前积分高低排定名次。积分相同时，依次比较<Highlight>总击杀数</>、<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>。\n局内积分的唯一来源为<Highlight>占领守卫及守卫归属结算</>：首次占领守卫可获得<Highlight>50积分</>；每5秒进行一次小归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>1积分</>；每30秒进行一次大归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>18积分</>。<Highlight>守卫归属高倍积分结算</>将在比赛第4、8、12、16、20分钟随机刷新，并提前90秒预告。高倍结算期间，每个已占领守卫在大归属结算时可提供<Highlight>72积分或108积分</>，分别对应四倍与六倍积分收益，具体倍率根据刷新的守卫位置决定。"] = "The Club that first reaches <Highlight> 3000 points </> immediately locks in the victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are equal, compare <Highlight> Total Kills </>, then <Highlight> Total Club Beyonder Rating </>. \n The only source of points in the match is <Highlight> Occupying Guardians and Guardian Ownership Settlement </>: First occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, each occupied Guardian provides <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, each occupied Guardian provides <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> Guardian ownership high-multiplier point settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlement, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, depending on the refreshed Guardian location.",
    ["<Highlight>眩晕飞弹</>射出飞弹让敌人眩晕5秒。"] = "<Highlight>Stun Missile</> Fire a missile to stun enemies for 5 seconds.",
    ["<Highlight>禁言：</>被禁言的玩家，将无法在本语音房间内进行实时语音、发送语音信息及文字消息。房主可在禁言管理页签进行设置。\n<Highlight>黑名单：</>被拉黑的玩家将被踢出本语音房间且无法再进入本语音房间。房主可在黑名单页签进行设置。"] = "<Highlight> Muted: </> Muted players will not be able to use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The room owner can set this in the mute management tab. \n <Highlight> Blacklist: </> Blacklisted players will be kicked out of this voice room and will not be able to enter it again. The room owner can set this in the blacklist tab.",
    ["<Highlight>秘偶游历</>时概率获得(每周<Highlight>%s</>/%s)"] = "Obtained with a certain probability when <Highlight> Marionette travels </> (Weekly <Highlight> %s </>/%s).",
    ["<Highlight>秘宝开启次数共享：</>世界冒险秘宝、以战养战秘宝、社交馈赠宝箱三个秘宝共享开启次数。\n<Highlight>开启次数累计：</>从周一开始时，每日新增并累积共享开启次数，直到下周一重置。具体规则如下：\n1. 周一到周五每天新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数；\n2. 从开服第二周开始，周六到周日不限次；\n3. 开服首周的周五、周六、周日仍然会每日新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数。\n4. 已获得但未开启的秘宝在解锁新的秘宝后可手动进行丢弃。\n\n<Highlight>开启活力消耗：</>共享开启次数消耗的活力将随着非凡者已开启次数增加。具体规则如下：\n1-5次：消耗<Highlight>20</>活力；\n6-10次：消耗<Highlight>50</>活力；\n11-20次：消耗<Highlight>100</>活力；\n21-30次：消耗<Highlight>150</>活力；\n30次以后：消耗<Highlight>200</>活力。"] = "<Highlight>Secret Treasure Opening Count Sharing: </>World Adventure Secret Treasure, War-Nurturing Secret Treasure, and Social Gift Treasure Chest share the opening count. \n<Highlight>Opening Count Accumulation: </>Starting from Monday, new shared opening counts are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening counts are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server opening, there is no limit on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server opening, <Highlight>10</> shared opening counts will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new secret treasures. \n\n<Highlight>Opening Vitality Consumption: </>The vitality consumed by shared opening counts will increase as the number of times the Beyonder has opened them increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> vitality.",
    ["<Highlight>窥秘的角落：周一开放</>\n<Highlight>哀嚎黑市：周二/五开放</>\n<Highlight>黄金之罪：周三/六开放</>\n<Highlight>亡者疑踪：周四/日开放</>"] = "<Highlight>A Corner of Mysteries: Opens on Monday</> \n <Highlight> Wailing Black Market: Opens on Tuesday/Friday </> \n <Highlight> Sin of Gold: Opens on Wednesday/Saturday </> \n <Highlight> Traces of the Dead: Opens on Thursday/Sunday </>",
    ["<Highlight>自由发言模式：</>所有玩家均可开麦发言。\n<Highlight>房主设置发言权限：</>此模式下玩家可以点击开麦按钮主动发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可获得发言权限。房主也可在玩家列表中手动调整玩家的发言权限。\n<Highlight>房主设置发言顺序：</>此模式下最多设置8个麦序座位。默认为顺序发言，仅房主和1号麦玩家可开麦，1号麦玩家发言完毕需自行点击下麦，将麦序传给2号麦玩家。"] = "<Highlight> Free Speech Mode: </> All players can unmute and speak. \n<Highlight> Host-Controlled Speech Permission: </> In this mode, players can click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speech permission. The host can also manually adjust speech permissions in the player list. \n<Highlight> Host-Controlled Speech Order: </> In this mode, up to 8 microphone seats can be set. It defaults to sequential speech; only the host and the player on mic #1 can unmute. After the player on mic #1 finishes, they must click \"Step Down\" to pass the sequence to the player on mic #2.",
    ["<Highlight>蓝圈</>出现时，使用<Orange>猎魔子弹</>反击攻击！"] = "When the <Highlight>Blue Circle</> appears, use <Orange>Demon Hunter Bullet</> to counterattack!",
    ["<Highlight>蓝圈</>出现时，按<Highlight>Z</>或点击此处使用<Orange>猎魔子弹</>反击攻击！"] = "When the <Highlight>blue circle</> appears, press <Highlight>Z</> or click here to use <Orange>Demon Hunter Bullet</> to counterattack!",
    ["<Highlight>蓝圈</>出现时，点击此处使用<Orange>猎魔子弹</>反击攻击！"] = "When the <Highlight>blue circle</> appears, click here to use <Orange>Demon Hunter Bullet</> to counterattack!",
    ["<Highlight>观察射线初始位置和旋转方向 ，避免触碰</>，躲避射线的同时记得阻挡混沌能量"] = "<Highlight>Observe the initial position and rotation direction of the rays to avoid touching them</>. While dodging the rays, remember to block the Chaos Energy.",
    ["<Highlight>观察河流涌动的节奏</>在河流平静时穿过，在河流即将喷发时避开"] = "<Highlight>Observe the rhythm of the river's surge</> to cross when the river is calm, and avoid it when it is about to erupt.",
    ["<Highlight>许愿</>指定人脉后，可提升结交时获得对应人脉的概率。\n可许愿的人脉为可结交的传说人脉。\n许愿后，获得传说人脉时，获取许愿目标的概率提高到<Highlight>80%</>。如果未获取许愿目标，那下次获得的传说人脉必定为许愿目标。\n\n常驻结交中，<Highlight>每周</>可以生效<Highlight>2次</>许愿效果，周一重置。\n每当结交人脉<Highlight>110次</>，可额外获得一次许愿次数。该次数不会被重置，且消耗优先级低于每周重置的次数。"] = "<Highlight>Wishing</> for a designated Connection can increase the probability of obtaining the corresponding Connection during Socializing. \nThe Connections that can be wished for are Legendary Connections that can be socialized with. \nAfter Wishing, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of obtaining the Wish target increases to <Highlight>80%</>. If you do not obtain the Wish target, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be the Wish target. \n\nIn permanent Socializing, <Highlight>every week</> you can have <Highlight>2</> Wishing effects take effect, resetting on Monday. \nEvery <Highlight>110 Socializing attempts</>, you can obtain one additional Wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count.",
    ["<Highlight>躺赢</>中含有各类玩法，点击此处打开。"] = "<Highlight>Idle Win</> contains various gameplay modes; click here to open.",
    ["<Highlight>躺赢</>中含有各类玩法，点击这里打开菜单进入"] = "<Highlight>Leisure</> contains various gameplay modes. Click here to open the menu and enter.",
    ["<Highlight>输出玩家</>需要尽快将其消灭。"] = "The <Highlight>DPS player</> needs to eliminate it as soon as possible.",
    ["<Highlight>输出玩家</>需要尽快将随从消灭。"] = "The <Highlight>DPS player</> needs to eliminate the minions as soon as possible.",
    ["<Highlight>输出职业</>需要及时将其消灭。"] = "The <Highlight>DPS class</> needs to eliminate it in time.",
    ["<Highlight>输出职业</>需要尽快将其消灭。"] = "The <Highlight>DPS class</> needs to eliminate it as soon as possible.",
    ["<Highlight>远离空想之龙的影响范围</>。"] = "<Highlight>Stay away from the range of influence of the Dragon of Imagination</>.",
    ["<Highlight>重点文本</>一般文本一般文本一般文本"] = "<Highlight>Key Text</> Normal text normal text normal text.",
    ["<Highlight>金色</>的任务为效率更高的任务，推荐优先完成。"] = "<Highlight>Golden</> quests are more efficient and are recommended to be completed first.",
    ["<Highlight>长按</>可以进入<Highlight>灵性腾跃</>。"] = "<Highlight>Long-press</> to enter <Highlight>Spirituality Leap</>.",
    ["<Highlight>长按跳跃按钮</>可以进入灵性之跃状态。\n此状态下可消耗体力继续跳跃上升或冲刺，快速到达高处寻找目标。"] = "<Highlight>Long-press the Jump button</> to enter the Leap of Spirituality state. \nIn this state, you can consume stamina to continue jumping upwards or dashing to quickly reach high places to find targets.",
    ["<Highlight>防护职业</>需要及时将瑞尔比伯<Highlight>拉远2-049</>。"] = "The <Highlight>Protection class</> needs to promptly pull Riel Bieber <Highlight>away from 2-049</>.",
    ["<Highlight>防护职业</>需要站在瑞尔比伯<Highlight>前方</>，开启减伤技能并替其他玩家阻挡射线伤害，<Highlight>治疗职业</>也要注意观察防护职业的血量。"] = "The <Highlight>Protection class</> needs to stand in <Highlight>front of Riel Bieber</>, activate damage reduction skills, and block ray damage for other players. <Highlight>Healing classes</> should also pay attention to the health of the Protection class.",
    ["<Highlight>防护职业</>需要站在瑞尔比伯<Highlight>前方</>，替其他玩家阻挡射线伤害。"] = "The <Highlight>Protection class</> needs to stand in <Highlight>front of Riel Bieber</> to block ray damage for other players.",
    ["<Highlight>隐身</>你可以隐身6秒。"] = "<Highlight>Invisibility</> You can be invisible for 6 seconds.",
    ["<Highlight>集中攻击高背椅</>来解决被束缚的队友。"] = "<Highlight>Focus attacks on the high-backed chair</> to rescue the bound teammate.",
    ["<Highlight>集中站位</>，避免占位过于分散导致飞弹影响范围太大无法躲避。"] = "<Highlight>Gather together</> to avoid being too spread out, which would make the missile's area of effect too large to dodge.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡物质</>：带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入封印物来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的非凡效果（非凡共鸣）。\n<Highlight>随机词条</>：非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n<Highlight>异变词条</>：非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，异变词条相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。"] = "<Highlight> Beyonder Material </>: A substance containing Beyonder power that can be filled into a Sealed Artifact to stabilize the historical projection and unlock more additional Beyonder effects (Beyonder Resonance). \n <Highlight> Random Affixes </>: The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into affixes. Due to the different Beyonder characteristic sequences and quantities that make up different Beyonder materials, the number, type, and strength of affixes will vary. There is at least 1 affix, and up to 6 affixes can be reached; Beyonder materials with more than 6 affixes have not yet been discovered. \n <Highlight> Mutated Affixes </>: The random affixes of a Beyonder material may undergo mutation due to the influence or corruption of high-level powers. Compared to ordinary affixes, mutated affixes bring more powerful effects.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡物质</>：带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入封印物来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的非凡效果（非凡共鸣）。\n<Highlight>随机词条</>：非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n<Highlight>异变词条</>：非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，异变词条相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。异变词条在单个非凡物质上最多出现1条。"] = "<Highlight>Beyonder Material</>: A material containing Beyonder power that can be filled into a Sealed Artifact to stabilize a historical projection and unlock additional Beyonder effects (Beyonder Resonance).\n<Highlight>Random Traits</>: The power of a Beyonder characteristic is quantified into traits. Due to the different sequences and quantities of Beyonder characteristics that compose them, different Beyonder materials will have different numbers, types, and strengths of traits. There is at least 1 trait, and up to 6 traits can be reached. Beyonder materials with more than 6 traits have not yet been discovered.\n<Highlight>Mutated Traits</>: The random traits of a Beyonder material may be affected or corrupted by high-level power, potentially leading to mutations. Compared to ordinary traits, mutated traits bring more powerful effects. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 mutated trait.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡聚合</>：可以将两个非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质。\n<Highlight>词条继承</>：非凡聚合时，聚合产物词条会<Highlight>全部</>从<Highlight>放入的非凡物质</>的词条中随机选取。\n<Highlight>词条异变</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有极小概率出现异变，生成异变词条，放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数量与类型不同时，可以出现的异变词条不同。\n<Highlight>词条升级</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有概率触发词条升级，部分词条的属性值提升。\n<Highlight>高级聚合</>：当前持有的4词条及以上攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁4词条攻击非凡物质放入聚合；当前持有的5词条攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁5词条非凡物质放入聚合。\n<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>：进行非凡物质聚合时会提升<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>，聚合熟练度赛季重置，达到一定值后可以获得奖励。"] = "<Highlight>Beyonder Aggregation</>: You can aggregate two Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material.\n<Highlight>Trait Inheritance</>: During Beyonder Aggregation, the traits of the resulting product will be <Highlight>all</> randomly selected from the traits of the <Highlight>input Beyonder materials</>.\n<Highlight>Trait Mutation</>: When the total number of traits of the input Beyonder materials is 6 or more, there is a very small chance of mutation after aggregation, generating a mutated trait. Different mutated traits can appear depending on the total number and types of traits in the input Beyonder materials.\n<Highlight>Trait Upgrade</>: When the total number of traits of the input Beyonder materials is 6 or more, there is a chance to trigger a trait upgrade after aggregation, increasing the attribute values of some traits.\n<Highlight>Advanced Aggregation</>: When you currently possess 2 attack Beyonder materials with 4+ traits and 2 defense Beyonder materials with 4+ traits, you unlock the ability to use 4-trait Beyonder materials in aggregation; when you possess 2 attack Beyonder materials with 5 traits and 2 defense Beyonder materials with 5 traits, you unlock the ability to use 5-trait Beyonder materials in aggregation.\n<Highlight>Aggregation Proficiency</>: Performing Beyonder material aggregation will increase <Highlight>Aggregation Proficiency</>. Aggregation Proficiency resets each season, and you can obtain rewards upon reaching certain values.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡聚合</>：可以将两个非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质。\n<Highlight>词条继承</>：非凡聚合时，聚合产物词条会<Highlight>全部</>从<Highlight>放入的非凡物质</>的词条中随机选取。\n<Highlight>词条异变</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有极小概率出现异变，生成异变词条，放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数量与类型不同时，可以出现的异变词条不同。每次聚合，如果未出异变，会使后续聚合触发异变的概率提高。\n<Highlight>词条升级</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有概率触发词条升级，部分词条的属性值提升。\n<Highlight>高级聚合</>：当前持有的4词条及以上攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁4词条攻击非凡物质放入聚合；当前持有的5词条攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁5词条非凡物质放入聚合。\n<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>：进行非凡物质聚合时会提升<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>，聚合熟练度赛季重置，达到一定值后可以获得奖励。"] = "<Highlight> Beyonder Aggregation </>: You can aggregate two Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material. \n <Highlight> Affix Inheritance </>: During Beyonder aggregation, the affixes of the resulting product will be <Highlight> all </> randomly selected from the affixes of the <Highlight> Beyonder materials </> put in. \n <Highlight> Affix Mutation </>: When the total number of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation is 6 or more, there is a very small probability of mutation occurring after aggregation, generating a mutated affix. If the total quantity and types of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation are different, the mutated affixes that can appear will be different. Each time you aggregate, if no mutation occurs, the probability of triggering a mutation in subsequent aggregations will increase. \n <Highlight> Affix Upgrade </>: When the total number of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation is 6 or more, there is a probability of triggering an affix upgrade after aggregation, increasing the attribute values of some affixes. \n <Highlight> Advanced Aggregation </>: When you currently possess 2 Attack Beyonder materials with 4 or more affixes and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 4 or more affixes, you unlock the ability to put 4-affix Attack Beyonder materials into aggregation; when you currently possess 2 Attack Beyonder materials with 5 affixes and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 5 affixes, you unlock the ability to put 5-affix Beyonder materials into aggregation. \n <Highlight> Aggregation Proficiency </>: Performing Beyonder material aggregation will increase <Highlight> Aggregation Proficiency </>. Aggregation Proficiency resets each season, and you can receive rewards after reaching a certain value.",
    ["<Highlight>非凡途径</>又称<Highlight>神之途径</>，是一套以魔药为核心的晋升体系。"] = "<Highlight>Beyonder Pathway</>, also known as the <Highlight>God's Pathway</>, is an advancement system centered on potions.",
    ["<Highlight>黑夜女神教会</>，建立于第三纪，第四纪联合帝国时期成为正统教会，其成员信仰黑夜女神，与战神教会水火不容。教会总部为宁静教堂，俗称“圣堂”，位于北部凛冬郡。\n 组织架构：教宗为地上天使，是黑夜女神的眷者，执掌教会。教宗之下是十三位大主教与九位高级执事，其中接近一半达到半神层次，其他也是得到圣物承认的序列5非凡者。在地位层面是完全平等的，只遵循黑夜女神的神谕，只对教宗负责。再下面是各教区主教和值夜者执事，晋升为序列5即足以担任。"] = "<Highlight>Church of the Evernight Goddess</>, established in the Third Epoch, became the orthodox church during the United Empire period of the Fourth Epoch. Its members worship the Evernight Goddess and are at odds with the Church of the God of Combat. The church headquarters is the Saint Samuel Cathedral, commonly known as the 'Holy Cathedral', located in the northern Winter County. \n Organizational structure: The Pope is an angel on earth, a Blessed of the Evernight Goddess, who governs the church. Below the Pope are thirteen Archbishops and nine High Deacons, nearly half of whom have reached the demigod level, while others are Sequence 5 Beyonders recognized by holy artifacts. They are completely equal in status, follow only the oracles of the Evernight Goddess, and are only responsible to the Pope. Below them are the bishops of each diocese and the Nighthawk deacons; advancing to Sequence 5 is sufficient to serve as one.",
    ["<Highlight>黑市商人</>处购买（周一、三、五、七）"] = "Purchased from the <Highlight> Black Market Merchant </> (Monday, Wednesday, Friday, Sunday)",
    ["<Highlight>黑市商人</>处购买（周二、四、六、七）"] = "Purchased from the <Highlight> Black Market Merchant </> (Tuesday, Thursday, Saturday, Sunday)",
    ["<Highlight>黑荆棘商店</>兑换获得"] = "Obtained by exchanging at the <Highlight> Blackthorn Shop </>",
    ["<Highlight>黑荆棘安保公司</>，看似是一个安保公司，实则为黑夜女神教会下属的官方非凡者组织“值夜者”在廷根市的分部，主要承担处理超凡事件的职责。"] = "<Highlight>Blackthorn Security Company</>, which appears to be a security company, is actually the Tingen branch of the 'Nighthawks', an official Beyonder organization under the Church of the Evernight Goddess, primarily responsible for handling supernatural events.",
    ["<Highlight_L>%s</>已成为新团长"] = "<Highlight_L>%s</> has become the new team leader.",
    ["<Highlight_L>%s</>已成为新队长"] = "<Highlight_L>%s</> has become the new captain.",
    ["<Highlight_L>[%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[今天%s]</>！"] = "<Highlight_L>[%s]</> has accepted the war declared by our club. The start time is <Highlight_L>[Today %s]</>!",
    ["<Highlight_L>[%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[明天%s]</>！"] = "<Highlight_L>[%s]</> has accepted the war declared by our club. The start time is <Highlight_L>[Tomorrow %s]</>!",
    ["<Highlight_L>[%s]</>通过守卫旗帜获得<Highlight_L>[%s]</>积分！"] = "<Highlight_L>[%s]</> has gained <Highlight_L>[%s]</> points by guarding the flag!",
    ["<Highlight_L>宣战告急</>：我方俱乐部成员<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[霍纳奇斯山脉(%d,%d) 分线%s]</>惨遭<Reminder_Red>[%s]</>俱乐部的<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>击败，这是对本俱乐部的公然挑衅！点击前往支援！"] = "<Highlight_L> War Emergency </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> was defeated by <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</>. This is an open provocation to our club! Click to provide support!",
    ["<Highlight_L>宣战捷报</>：我方俱乐部成员<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>已在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[霍纳奇斯山脉(%d,%d) 分线%s]</>成功击败<Reminder_Red>[%s]</>俱乐部的<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>并获得宣战积分%s分！点击前往追击！"] = "<Highlight_L> War Bulletin </>: Our club member <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has successfully defeated <HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> of the <Reminder_Red>[%s]</> club at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</> and gained %s war points! Click to pursue!",
    ["<Highlight_L>猎场告急</>：我方猎手<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[猎龙之城(%d,%d)]</>惨遭%s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>猎杀！这是对我方猎手的公然挑衅！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【前往驰援】</>"] = "<Highlight_L>Hunt Emergency</>: Our hunter <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> was tragically hunted by %s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[City of Dragon Hunting(%d,%d)]</>! This is a blatant provocation against our hunters! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【Go to Reinforce】</>",
    ["<Highlight_L>猎场捷报</>：我方猎手<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>已在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[猎龙之城(%d,%d)]</>成功猎杀%s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>！敌方已经付出代价！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【前往追击】</>"] = "<Highlight_L>Hunt Report</>: Our hunter <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has successfully hunted %s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[City of Dragon Hunting(%d,%d)]</>! The enemy has paid the price! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【Go to Pursue】</>",
    ["<HigtLight>玩家名称七个字</>"] = "<HigtLight> Player name seven chars </>",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> 击杀了<Chat_Highlight>%s俱乐部</> 的会长<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>，此战将被吟游诗人传唱。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> killed the President <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> of the <Chat_Highlight> %s Club </>, this battle will be sung by bards.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>任命<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>为%s"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> appointed <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> as %s.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>加入了俱乐部，让我们欢迎新成员吧~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"guildWelcome\">【点击欢迎】</>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has joined the club. Let's welcome the new member~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"guildWelcome\"> [Click to welcome] </>",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在争夺战中已连斩超过<Chat_Highlight>%s</>人，新的传说正在加冕。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has achieved more than <Chat_Highlight>%s</> consecutive kills in the battle. A new legend is being crowned.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>接力<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>，成为了俱乐部新一任%s"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> succeeded <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> and became the new %s of the club.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>撤销了<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>的%s一职"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> revoked <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </>'s position as %s.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>离开了俱乐部，有缘再会"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has left the club; hope to see you again.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>终结了<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>的连斩。传说终结传说，英雄打败英雄。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> ended <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </>'s streak. Legends end legends, heroes defeat heroes.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>花费了%d俱乐部基金，将%s升级到%d级"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> spent %d club funds to upgrade %s to level %d.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>赠送了%s个%s给<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>，为本房间增加了%s点热度"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> gifted %s %s to <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>, increasing the room's heat by %s points.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>赠送了%s个%s给<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>，为本语音房间增加了%s点热度"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> gifted %s %s to <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>, increasing the heat of this voice room by %s points",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">【玩家A】</> 为 <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">【玩家B】</>提供了【XXX物资】，让我们感谢他的慷慨~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_AT\" u=\"guildFlower\">【点击送花】</>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">【Player A】</> provided <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">【Player B】</> with 【XXX Supplies】. Let us thank them for their generosity~ <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_AT\" u=\"guildFlower\">【Click to send flowers】</>",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">小怪</>击杀概率掉落"] = "Dropped by <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Minions </> with a certain probability",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"22\">唤醒</>消散的小队或团队队友，使其在观众施法位置复苏并回复其50%生命。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"22\"> Awaken </> dissipated squad or team members, causing them to revive at the Spectator's casting position and restore 50% of their Health.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>变为可充能2次的充能技能，且造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Purifying Slash</> becomes a chargeable skill with 2 charges, and its damage is increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害提高15%，效果触发间隔从0.8秒缩短至0.6秒，减速的基础概率增加至90%。"] = "Damage dealt by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Hurricane Axe</> is increased by 15%, the effect trigger interval is reduced from 0.8 seconds to 0.6 seconds, and the base probability of Slow is increased to 90%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害提高15%，效果触发间隔从0.8秒缩短至0.6秒，滞涩的基础概率增加至90%。"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Hurricane Axe</> is increased by 15%, the effect trigger interval is shortened from 0.8 seconds to 0.6 seconds, and the base probability of stagnation is increased to 90%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害提高15%，效果触发间隔从0.8秒缩短至0.6秒，滞涩的基础概率增加至90%。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>变为可充能2次的充能技能，且造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Hurricane Axe </> damage increased by 15%, trigger interval reduced from 0.8s to 0.6s, and base probability of Stagnation increased to 90%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Purifying Slash </> becomes a skill with 2 charges, and damage is increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害时有65%概率附加2秒25%减速。"] = "When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Hurricane Axe</> deals damage, it has a 65% probability to apply a 25% slow for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>范围内施放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">惩戒</>，将减少<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>冷却时间1.5秒。"] = "Casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Punishment</> within the range of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Solar Oath</> reduces the cooldown of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Solar Oath</> by 1.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>及其分支技能施放后，10秒内下3个<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">惩戒</>造成的伤害提升20%。"] = "After casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sun Chaser</> and its branch skills, the damage dealt by the next 3 <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Punishment</> effects within 10 seconds is increased by 20%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>及其分支技能施放后，10秒内下3个<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">惩戒</>造成的伤害提升20%。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>范围内施放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\">惩戒</>，将减少<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\">太阳誓约</>冷却时间1.5秒。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Sun Chaser </> and its branch skills deal 20% increased damage with the next 3 <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Punishment </> casts within 10 seconds. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Solar Oath </>: Casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011070\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Punishment </> within the range reduces the cooldown of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Solar Oath </> by 1.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>获得分支技能<HighLight>逐光</>：快速向目标突刺，击倒目标及周围敌人，同时附带减疗和滞涩效果。分支技能可充能2次并拥有10秒充能时间。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sun Chaser</> gains the branch skill <HighLight>Light Chaser</>: Quickly thrust towards the target, knocking down the target and surrounding enemies, while applying healing reduction and stagnation effects. The branch skill has 2 charges and a 10-second recharge time.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>获得分支技能<HighLight>逐光</>：快速向目标突刺，击倒目标及周围敌人，同时附带减疗和滞涩效果。分支技能可充能2次并拥有10秒充能时间。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011060\" color=\"#f4a067\">神圣盔甲</>二段技额外获得短暂<Orange>霸体</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Sun Chaser </> gains the branch skill <HighLight> Light Chaser </>: Rapidly thrust towards the target, knocking down the target and nearby enemies, while applying Healing Reduction and Stagnation. The branch skill has 2 charges and a 10-second recharge time. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011060\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Holy Armor </>: The second stage of the skill gains a brief <Orange> Super Armor </> effect.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>造成伤害提高15%。"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sun Chaser</> is increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>获得分支技能<HighLight>圣焰焚净</>：\n净化范围内消散的敌方玩家，引发爆炸对存活目标造成伤害。分支技能拥有8秒冷却时间。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Holy Light Purification</> gains the branch skill <HighLight>Holy Flame Cleansing</>: \nPurifies enemy players who dissipate within the range, triggering an explosion that deals damage to surviving targets. The branch skill has an 8-second Cooldown.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>获得分支技能<HighLight>圣焰焚净</>：\n净化范围内消散的敌方玩家，引发爆炸对存活目标造成伤害。分支技能拥有8秒冷却时间。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>效果变更：<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，半径70米内的小队成员增伤提高3%，攻击/技能增强根据技能等级每级提高15/2.16点，总提升量不超过歌颂者自身攻击/技能增强的10%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Holy Light Purification </> gains the branch skill <HighLight> Holy Flame Cleansing </>: \n Purify and dissipate enemy players within range, triggering an explosion that deals damage to survivors. The branch skill has an 8-second cooldown. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Heresy Verdict </> effect changed: While in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state, party members within a 70-meter radius gain 3% increased damage, and Attack/Skill Enhancement increases by 15/2.16 points per skill level, with a total increase not exceeding 10% of the Bard's own Attack/Skill Enhancement.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>额外提升暴击和穿刺，增伤效果提高5%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Holy Light Purification</> additionally increases crit and piercing, and the damage boost effect is increased by 5%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>额外提升暴击和穿刺，增伤效果提高5%。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>变为可充能2次的充能技能，且造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Holy Light Purification</> additionally increases critical hit rate and piercing, and the Damage Boost effect is increased by 5%; \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Purifying Slash</> becomes a chargeable skill with 2 charges, and damage dealt is increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>额外提升暴击和穿刺，增伤效果提高5%。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Holy Light Purification </> additionally increases Crit and Pierce, and damage boost effect increased by 5%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Sun Chaser </> damage increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011060\" color=\"#f4a067\">神圣盔甲</>二段技额外获得短暂<Orange>霸体</>。"] = "The second stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Holy Armor</> gains an additional brief period of <Orange>Super Armor</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\">无暗之枪</>获得<HighLight>神罚</>效果：根据目标已损失生命的百分比和自身物理攻击造成物理伤害，目标生命越低，伤害越高，至多造成自身物理攻击100%基础值的物理伤害。<HighLight>无暗</>对生命低于40%的敌方目标生效。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Unshadowed Spear</> gains the <HighLight>Divine Punishment</> effect: Deals physical damage based on the target's percentage of lost HP and the user's physical attack. The lower the target's HP, the higher the damage, up to 100% of the user's physical attack base value. <HighLight>Unshadowed</> takes effect on enemy targets with HP below 40%; \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sun Chaser</> damage dealt is increased by 15%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\">无暗之枪</>获得<HighLight>神罚</>效果：根据目标或自身已损失生命的百分比和自身物理攻击对敌方玩家造成物理伤害，目标或自身生命越低，伤害越高，至多造成自身物理攻击100%基础值的物理伤害。<HighLight>无暗</>对生命低于40%的敌方玩家生效。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Unshadowed Spear</> gains the <HighLight>God's Punishment</> effect: Deals physical damage to enemy players based on the percentage of lost health (of the target or yourself) and your own physical attack. The lower the health, the higher the damage, up to a maximum of 100% of your physical attack as base physical damage. <HighLight>Unshadowed</> takes effect on enemy players with health below 40%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\">无暗之枪</>获得<HighLight>神罚</>效果：根据目标或自身已损失生命的百分比和自身物理攻击对敌方玩家造成物理伤害，目标或自身生命越低，伤害越高，至多造成自身物理攻击100%基础值的物理伤害。<HighLight>无暗</>对生命低于40%的敌方玩家生效。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">烈阳之魂</>内置冷却时长减少30秒，状态期间重伤效果从80%降低至75%。;"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011080\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Unshadowed Spear </> gains the <HighLight> Divine Punishment </> effect: Deals physical damage to enemy players based on the percentage of health lost by the target or yourself and your own physical attack. The lower the health, the higher the damage, up to 100% of your physical attack as base damage. <HighLight> Unshadowed </> takes effect on enemy players with less than 40% health. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Soul of the Blazing Sun </> internal cooldown reduced by 30 seconds, and the Grievous Injury effect during the state is reduced from 80% to 75%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">烈阳之魂</>内置冷却时长减少30秒，状态期间重伤效果从80%降低至75%。"] = "The internal cooldown of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Soul of the Blazing Sun</> is reduced by 30 seconds, and the grievous injury effect during the state is reduced from 80% to 75%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">秩序审判</>获得被动效果：\n    <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>每次命中目标，自身获得1层无尽，达到12层时自身进入烈阳状态，持续4秒。\n    该烈阳状态与<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">秩序审判</>主动效果的时长相互叠加。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Order Judgment</> gains a passive effect: \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Hurricane Axe</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Purifying Slash</>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sun Chaser</> each hit on a target grants 1 stack of Endless. Upon reaching 12 stacks, you enter the Blazing Sun state for 4 seconds. \n This Blazing Sun state duration stacks with the active effect duration of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Order Judgment</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">秩序审判</>获得被动效果：\n    <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\">逐日</>每次命中目标，自身获得1层无尽，达到12层时自身进入烈阳状态，持续4秒。\n    该烈阳状态与<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\">秩序审判</>主动效果的时长相互叠加。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>效果提升：<HighLight>异端</>目标受到来自歌颂者的伤害额外提高10%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Order Judgment </> gains a passive effect: \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Hurricane Axe </>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Purifying Slash </>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011040\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Sun Chaser </> each hit grants 1 stack of Endless. Upon reaching 12 stacks, you enter the Blazing Sun state for 4 seconds. \n This Blazing Sun state duration stacks with the active effect of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86013010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Order Judgment </>. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Heresy Verdict </> effect improved: <HighLight> Heresy </> targets take an additional 10% damage from the Bard.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>对小队成员的增益数值效果和效果上限提高66.7%。（需要先激活无暗之地节点）"] = "The buff values and effect caps of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Heresy Verdict</> for party members are increased by 66.7%. (Requires the Unshadowed Land node to be activated first.)",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>对小队成员的增益数值效果和效果上限提高66.7%。（需要先激活无暗之地节点）;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害时有65%概率附加2秒25%减速。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Heresy Verdict </>: Buff values and caps for party members increased by 66.7%. (Requires activating the Unshadowed Land node first). \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Hurricane Axe </>: Attacks have a 65% chance to apply a 25% slow for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>效果变更：<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下，同场景内的所有小队成员增伤提高4.5%，攻击/技能增强根据技能等级每级提高19.2/2.7点，总提升量不超过歌颂者自身攻击/技能增强的12%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Heresy Verdict</> effect changed: While in the <HighLight>Blazing Sun</> state, damage boost for all party members in the same scene is increased by 4.5%. Attack/Skill Enhancement increases by 19.2/2.7 points per skill level, with the total increase not exceeding 12% of the Bard's own Attack/Skill Enhancement.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">异端裁决</>效果提升：<HighLight>异端</>目标受到来自歌颂者的伤害额外提高10%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86015020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Heresy Verdict</> effect improved: Damage dealt to <HighLight>Heresy</> targets by the Bard is increased by an additional 10%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">意识冲击</>命中后附加一层持续7秒的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">噩梦</>，叠加3层后梦魇爆发对目标和其3米内的敌方造成相当于基础效果85%的魔法伤害。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Consciousness Shock</> applies one layer of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Nightmare</> lasting 7 seconds upon hit. After stacking 3 layers, Nightmare Burst deals magic damage to the target and enemies within 3 meters equal to 85% of the base effect.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">意识冲击</>命中后附加一层持续7秒的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\">噩梦</>，叠加3层后梦魇爆发对目标和其3米内的敌方造成相当于基础效果85%的魔法伤害。\n对<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021020\" color=\"#f4a067\">精神瘟疫</>影响的目标造成伤害时，额外追加一次协同攻击，造成相当于基础效果85%的魔法伤害。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Consciousness Shock </> applies a 7-second <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86020010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Nightmare </> stack upon hit. After 3 stacks, the Nightmare explosion deals magic damage to the target and enemies within 3 meters equal to 85% of the base effect. \n Dealing damage to targets affected by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Mental Plague </> triggers an additional coordinated attack, dealing magic damage equal to 85% of the base effect.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021010\" color=\"#f4a067\">洞察</>伤害基础值提高40%，易伤持续时间降低为8秒，易伤效果提高5%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Insight </> base damage increased by 40%, Vulnerability duration reduced to 8 seconds, and Vulnerability effect increased by 5%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021030\" color=\"#f4a067\">梦境分析</>区域内友方减伤提高5%，若每次治疗目标小于4个，返还1秒冷却时间。"] = "Damage reduction for allies within the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dream Analysis</> area is increased by 5%. If fewer than 4 targets are healed, 1 second of cooldown is refunded.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021030\" color=\"#f4a067\">梦境分析</>区域内友方减伤提高5%，若每次治疗目标小于4个，返还1秒冷却时间。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021060\" color=\"#f4a067\">心灵引导</>每次弹射治疗衰减降低5%。"] = "Friendly Damage Reduction within the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Dream Analysis </> area increased by 5%. If fewer than 4 targets are healed, 1 second of cooldown is refunded. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021060\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Mental Guidance </>: Healing decay per bounce reduced by 5%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021050\" color=\"#f4a067\">震慑</>命中敌方后附加4秒滞涩。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Deterrence</> applies a 4-second stagnation effect after hitting an enemy.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021060\" color=\"#f4a067\">心灵引导</>每次弹射治疗衰减降低5%。"] = "The healing decay per bounce of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Mental Guidance</> is reduced by 5%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021070\" color=\"#f4a067\">梦境编织</>对<HighLight>瘟疫</>状态下的目标造成伤害提高30%。"] = "Damage dealt by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dream Weaving</> to targets in the <HighLight>Plague</> state is increased by 30%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021070\" color=\"#f4a067\">梦境编织</>对<HighLight>瘟疫</>状态下的目标造成伤害提高30%。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021050\" color=\"#f4a067\">震慑</>命中敌方后附加4秒滞涩。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021070\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Dream Weaving </> damage against targets in the <HighLight> Plague </> state increased by 30%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021050\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Deterrence </> applies 4 seconds of Stagnation upon hitting an enemy.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021080\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理暗示</>使目标5秒内格挡大幅提升。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021080\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Psychological Suggestion </> significantly increases the target's Block for 5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021110\" color=\"#f4a067\">读心</>获得新的分支技能<HighLight>愈心</>：\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021111\" color=\"#f4a067\">愈心</>使25米内所有小队成员获得<HighLight>愈心标记</>效果，持续5秒，拥有20秒小队公共冷却时间。\n<HighLight>愈心标记</>：获得20%减伤，当标记的施法者造成治疗时，标记的持有者固定回复效果量80%的生命。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021110\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Mind Reading </> gains the new branch skill <HighLight> Heart Healing </>: \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86021111\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Heart Healing </> grants all party members within 25 meters the <HighLight> Heart Healing Mark </> effect for 5 seconds, with a 20-second party-wide cooldown. \n <HighLight> Heart Healing Mark </>: Grants 20% Damage Reduction. When the caster of the mark heals, the mark holder recovers health equal to 80% of the healing amount.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023010\" color=\"#f4a067\">心灵之火</>的<Orange>禁锢</>效果基础概率提升到75%，催眠时间提升到2.5秒。"] = "The base probability of the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Mind Fire </> <Orange> Imprisonment </> effect increased to 75%, and Hypnosis duration increased to 2.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>产生的治疗量提升10%。当<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>可用时，释放治疗性战斗技能将自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>。"] = "The healing amount of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</> is increased by 10%. When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</> is available, releasing a healing combat skill will automatically trigger <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>产生的治疗量提升10%。当<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>可用时，释放治疗性战斗技能将自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">意识操纵</>产生的治疗量提升10%。"] = "Healing from <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</> is increased by 10%. When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</> is available, casting a healing combat skill will automatically cast <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychotherapy</>; \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Consciousness Manipulation</> healing is increased by 10%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>和<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">意识操纵</>产生的治疗量提升10%。当<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>可用时，释放治疗性战斗技能将自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理治疗</>"] = "Healing from <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Psychotherapy </> and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Consciousness Manipulation </> increased by 10%. When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Psychotherapy </> is available, casting a healing combat skill will automatically trigger <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Psychotherapy </>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">意识操纵</>产生的治疗量提升10%。"] = "The healing amount of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86023020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Consciousness Manipulation</> is increased by 10%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每次造成伤害可减少<HighLight>空气子弹</>冷却时间0.5秒。"] = "Each time <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Reveal Card</> deals damage, it reduces the cooldown of <HighLight>Air Bullet</> by 0.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每隔45秒获得<HighLight>灵性预警</>，可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "Every 45 seconds, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Reveal Card</> grants <HighLight>Spirituality Warning</>, which can remove one control effect. After triggering, your movement speed increases by 25% for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031010\" color=\"#f4a067\">纸牌飞刀</>第三段会为目标附加6秒<HighLight>流血</>，每秒损失施法者最大生命值的2%（不超过施法者攻击的60%）。"] = "The third stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Card Flying Dagger</> applies <HighLight>Bleed</> to the target for 6 seconds, causing the target to lose 2% of the caster's maximum health per second (not exceeding 60% of the caster's attack).",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031010\" color=\"#f4a067\">纸牌飞刀</>第三段会为目标附加6秒<HighLight>流血</>，每秒损失施法者最大生命值的2%（不超过施法者攻击的60%）。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">火焰跳跃</>二段释放时解除自身受到的<HighLight>控制效果</>。"] = "The third stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Card Flying Dagger </> applies 6 seconds of <HighLight> Bleed </>, causing the target to lose 2% of the caster's maximum health per second (not exceeding 60% of the caster's attack). \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Flame Jump </> second stage cast removes <HighLight> Crowd Control </> effects from yourself.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031020\" color=\"#f4a067\">塔罗牌阵</>的伤害基础值提升10%，有85%概率令主目标<HighLight>减速</>50%，持续2.5秒。"] = "The base damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Tarot Array</> is increased by 10%, and it has an 85% probability to <HighLight>Slow</> the main target by 50% for 2.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\">空气子弹</>期间移动速度提高25%，可额外攻击目标3米内的2个敌人，每击以50%的基础概率使敌方<HighLight>滞涩</>并<HighLight>减速</>50%，持续1秒。"] = "During <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Air Bullet</>, movement speed is increased by 25%, and it can additionally attack 2 enemies within 3 meters of the target. Each hit has a 50% base probability to <HighLight>Stagnate</> the enemy and <HighLight>Slow</> them by 50% for 1 second.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\">空气子弹</>期间移动速度提高25%，可额外攻击目标3米内的2个敌人，每击以50%的基础概率使敌方<HighLight>滞涩</>并<HighLight>减速</>50%，持续1秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每次造成伤害可减少<HighLight>空气子弹</>冷却时间0.5秒。"] = "During <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Air Bullet </>, movement speed increases by 25%, and it can attack 2 additional enemies within 3 meters of the target. Each hit has a 50% base chance to <HighLight> Stagnate </> and <HighLight> Slow </> the enemy by 50% for 1 second. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Reveal Card </> damage reduces the cooldown of <HighLight> Air Bullet </> by 0.5 seconds per hit.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\">空气子弹</>期间移动速度提高25%，可额外攻击目标3米内的2个敌人，每击使敌方<HighLight>滞涩</>1秒，并以50%的基础概率施加50%<HighLight>减速</>，持续1秒。"] = "During <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Air Bullet</>, movement speed is increased by 25%, and it can additionally attack 2 enemies within 3 meters of the target. Each hit causes the enemy to suffer <HighLight>Stagnation</> for 1 second and applies a 50% <HighLight>Slow</> effect with a 50% base probability for 1 second.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">火焰跳跃</>一段释放时会在4秒内移动速度提升50%。"] = "Releasing the first stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Flame Jump</> increases movement speed by 50% for 4 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">火焰跳跃</>一段释放时会在4秒内移动速度提升50%。\n每次受到伤害前获得持续8秒的<HighLight>护盾</>效果和持续4秒的50%加速效果，该效果冷却时长20秒。"] = "Casting the first stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Flame Jump </> increases movement speed by 50% for 4 seconds. \n Gain a <HighLight> Shield </> effect lasting 8 seconds and a 50% Acceleration effect lasting 4 seconds before taking damage; this effect has a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">火焰跳跃</>二段释放时解除自身受到的<HighLight>控制效果</>。"] = "Releasing the second stage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86031070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Flame Jump</> removes <HighLight>Crowd Control</> effects from yourself.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033010\" color=\"#f4a067\">命运愚弄</>冷却时长减少3秒，释放<HighLight>命运愚弄</>后，普攻施加<HighLight>愚弄标记</>的概率提升为100%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Fooling of Fate </> cooldown reduced by 3 seconds. After casting <HighLight> Fooling of Fate </>, the probability of applying a <HighLight> Fooling Mark </> with Normal Attacks increases to 100%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\">灵性爆发</>的<HighLight>易伤</>效果提高5%。"] = "The <HighLight>Vulnerability</> effect of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Spirituality Burst</> is increased by 5%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\">灵性爆发</>的冷却时长降低3秒，施法后增加自身攻击力，持续10秒。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Spirituality Burst </> cooldown reduced by 3 seconds, and casting it increases your Attack for 10 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\">洗牌</>需要的<HighLight>卡牌能量</>减少1点，并且伤害基础值提高20%，第一击有90%概率<HighLight>禁锢</>目标，持续0.8秒。"] = "The <HighLight>Card Energy</> required for <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Shuffle Cards</> is reduced by 1 point, its base damage is increased by 20%, and the first hit has a 90% probability to <HighLight>Imprison</> the target for 0.8 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\">洗牌</>需要的<HighLight>卡牌能量</>减少1点，并且伤害基础值提高20%，第一击有90%概率<HighLight>禁锢</>目标，持续0.8秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每隔45秒获得<HighLight>灵性预警</>，可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86033030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Shuffle Cards </> requires 1 less <HighLight> Card Energy </>, and base damage is increased by 20%. The first hit has a 90% chance to <HighLight> Imprison </> the target for 0.8 seconds. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Reveal Card </> grants <HighLight> Spirituality Warning </> every 45 seconds, which can remove one control effect and increases movement speed by 25% for 2 seconds upon triggering.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">足迹再现</>伤害提高<HighLight>50%</>。"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Footprint Reappearance</> is increased by <HighLight>50%</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">足迹再现</>现在会向目标突进一小段距离。消耗<HighLight>3</>层<HighLight>足迹</>时，还会为目标附加<HighLight>1</>层<HighLight>层叠印记</>，最多叠加<HighLight>2</>层。\n\n<FaintYellow>层叠印记</>：\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">层叠之门</>会引爆目标身上的全部<HighLight>层叠印记</>，每层使本次伤害提高<HighLight>60%</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Footprint Reappearance</> now dashes a short distance towards the target. Consuming <HighLight>3</> stacks of <HighLight>Footprints</> also applies <HighLight>1</> layer of <HighLight>Stacked Mark</> to the target, stacking up to <HighLight>2</> layers. \n\n<FaintYellow>Stacked Mark</>: \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Layered Gate</> detonates all <HighLight>Stacked Mark</> on the target, with each layer increasing this damage by <HighLight>60%</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051020\" color=\"#f4a067\">灵界穿梭</>伤害提高<HighLight>10%</>。"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Spirit World Travel</> is increased by <HighLight>10%</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">漫游</>状态额外附加<HighLight>隐身</>效果，释放技能、受到攻击或使用物品会解除<HighLight>隐身</>效果。"] = "The <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Roaming</> state additionally applies an <HighLight>Invisibility</> effect. Releasing a skill, taking damage, or using an item will remove the <HighLight>Invisibility</> effect.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">猎魔瞬斩</>的禁锢时间延长至3秒。"] = "The imprisonment duration of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Demon Hunter Instant Slash</> is extended to 3 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">猎魔瞬斩</>获得新的分支<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061025\" color=\"#f4a067\">驱魔卫斩</>：防御形态下，对敌方释放时与原猎魔瞬斩效果一致，对友方释放时为友方解除弱控和减速，并附加20%的减伤和25%的移速增加，持续5秒。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Demon Hunter Instant Slash</> gains a new branch <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061025\" color=\"#f4a067\">Exorcism Slash</>: In Defense Form, releasing it on an enemy has the same effect as the original Demon Hunter Instant Slash. Releasing it on an ally removes soft crowd control and slow effects, and applies 20% damage reduction and 25% movement speed increase for 5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">王庭号令</>技能对命中的敌方目标造成攻击力降低15%，持续5秒。"] = "The <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">Royal Court Command</> skill reduces the attack power of hit enemy targets by 15% for 5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061030\" color=\"#f4a067\">日暮飓风</>的首次攻击会给命中玩家附加2秒<HighLight>滞涩</>。并且自身在日暮飓风持续期间获得15%的减伤，移速提高15%。"] = "The first attack of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Sunset Hurricane</> applies <HighLight>Stagnation</> to hit players for 2 seconds. You also gain 15% damage reduction and 15% movement speed increase for the duration of Sunset Hurricane.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061030\" color=\"#f4a067\">日暮飓风</>的首次攻击会给命中玩家附加2秒<HighLight>滞涩</>。并且自身在日暮飓风持续期间获得15%的减伤，移速提高15%。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">巨剑斩击</>剑阵爆炸后残留黄昏之力，对范围内敌人造成持续吸附效果，持续2秒。"] = "The first attack of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Sunset Hurricane </> applies 2 seconds of <HighLight> Stagnation </> to hit players. You gain 15% Damage Reduction and 15% Movement Speed Increase for the duration of Sunset Hurricane. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Greatsword Slash </>: The sword formation explosion leaves behind Twilight Power, causing continuous suction on enemies within range for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护坚壁</>获得新的分支<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护壁垒</>：展开领域，为周围30米范围内生命值最低的两个友方加上高额护盾和15%的减伤，护盾值根据消耗的<HighLight>黄昏印记</>数增加。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Guardian Wall</> gains a new branch <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\">Guardian Rampart</>: Deploy a field that grants a high-value shield and 15% damage reduction to the two allies with the lowest health within 30 meters. The shield value increases based on the number of <HighLight>Dusk Marks</> consumed.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061100\" color=\"#f4a067\">暮色连斩</>对敌方玩家的击飞时间延长至3秒，并且释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061100\" color=\"#f4a067\">暮色连斩</>时若<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">银白细剑</>未处于技能冷却中时则自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">银白细剑</>，未携带<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">银白细剑</>时也可以生效。"] = "The Knockup duration of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061100\" color=\"#f4a067\">Twilight Combo Slash</> against enemy players is extended to 3 seconds. Additionally, when casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061100\" color=\"#f4a067\">Twilight Combo Slash</>, if <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Silver Rapier</> is not on Cooldown, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Silver Rapier</> will be automatically cast; this effect can trigger even if <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Silver Rapier</> is not equipped.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">巨剑斩击</>剑阵爆炸后残留黄昏之力，对范围内敌人造成持续吸附效果，持续2秒。"] = "After the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">Greatsword Slash</> sword formation explodes, it leaves behind the Power of Dusk, causing a continuous suction effect on enemies within range for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">巨剑斩击</>对命中目标打断0.5秒，输出形态下对敌人附加2秒沉默，并且额外加6秒<HighLight>衰败</>，对<HighLight>衰败</>状态的敌方造成的伤害增加<HighLight>10%</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">Greatsword Slash</> interrupts hit targets for 0.5 seconds. In Offensive Stance, it applies a 2-second silence to enemies, adds 6 seconds of <HighLight>Decay</>, and increases damage dealt to enemies in the <HighLight>Decay</> state by <HighLight>10%</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\">凋零之刃</>每次命中后对目标附加<HighLight>减速</>，并在使用后每<HighLight>2</>秒获得<HighLight>1</>枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，持续6秒。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Blade of Withering</> applies <HighLight>Slow</> to the target after each hit, and grants <HighLight>1</> <HighLight>Dusk Mark</> every <HighLight>2</> seconds after use, lasting 6 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\">凋零之刃</>每次命中后对目标附加<HighLight>减速</>，并在使用后每<HighLight>2</>秒获得<HighLight>1</>枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，持续6秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">巨剑斩击</>对命中目标打断0.5秒，输出形态下对敌人附加2秒沉默，并且额外加6秒<HighLight>衰败</>，对<HighLight>衰败</>状态的敌方造成的伤害增加<HighLight>10%</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Blade of Withering </> applies <HighLight> Slow </> to targets on each hit and grants <HighLight> 2 </> <HighLight> 1 </> <HighLight> Twilight Mark </> every 2 seconds for 6 seconds after use. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Greatsword Slash </> interrupts targets for 0.5 seconds. In Offensive Stance, it applies 2 seconds of Silence to enemies, adds 6 seconds of <HighLight> Decay </>, and increases damage against enemies in the <HighLight> Decay </> state by <HighLight> 10% </>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识逐人</>额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Knowledge Pursuit</> obtains an additional 10 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识逐人</>额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">星沙</>的伤害提高50%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，降低穿刺的数值提高"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Knowledge Pursuit </> gains an additional 10 points of <HighLight> Mystical Knowledge </>. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Star Sand </> damage increased by 50%, gains an additional 10 points of <HighLight> Mystical Knowledge </>, and increases the Pierce value reduction.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识逐人</>额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">星沙</>的伤害提高90%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，降低穿刺的数值提高"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Knowledge Pursuit</> grants 10 additional <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Star Sand</> damage is increased by 90%, grants 10 additional <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</>, and applies a stronger Pierce reduction.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识逐人</>额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">星沙</>的伤害提高90%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，降低穿刺的数值提高;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">光之折射</>攻击的目标若为怪物，则伤害提高15%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Knowledge Pursuit</> grants 10 additional <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Star Sand</> damage is increased by 90%, grants 10 additional <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</>, and applies a stronger Pierce reduction;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Refraction of Light</> deals 15% increased damage to monsters.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">光之折射</>攻击的目标若为怪物，则伤害提高15%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Refraction of Light</> deals 15% increased damage to monsters.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">光之折射</>的伤害提高50%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Refraction of Light</> is increased by 50%, and an additional 10 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> are obtained.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">光之折射</>的伤害提高50%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86072010\" color=\"#f4a067\">星海穿梭</>的霸体时间提高至4.5秒"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Refraction of Light</> damage increased by 50%, gain an additional 10 points of <HighLight>Mystical Knowledge</>; \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86072010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Voyage Through the Sea of Stars</> Super Armor duration increased to 4.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">星沙</>的伤害提高50%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，降低穿刺的数值提高"] = "The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Star Sand</> is increased by 50%, an additional 10 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> are obtained, and the piercing reduction value is increased.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">星沙</>的伤害提高90%，额外获取10点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，降低穿刺的数值提高"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Star Sand</> damage is increased by 90%, grants 10 additional <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</>, and applies a stronger Pierce reduction.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">皇帝的新衣</>伤害吸收量提高25%"] = "The damage absorption of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">The Emperor's New Clothes</> is increased by 25%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">皇帝的新衣</>伤害吸收量提高25%;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">神秘再现</>召唤的神秘幻象每次攻击可以回复5点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>技能期间自身额外获得10%减伤，增益最多持续7秒"] = "The damage absorption of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">The Emperor's New Clothes</> is increased by 25%. Each attack from the Mysterious Illusion summoned by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Mystical Re-enactment</> restores 5 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>. During <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</>, you gain an additional 10% damage reduction, with the buff lasting up to 7 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的伤害提升30%"] = "Damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> increased by 30%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的伤害提升53%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> damage is increased by 53%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的击退效果变为100%基础概率的击飞"] = "The knockback effect of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> is changed to a knockup with a 100% base probability.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的击退效果变为100%基础概率的击飞，伤害提高18%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> knockback becomes a knockup with a 100% base chance, and its damage is increased by 18%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">神秘再现</>召唤的神秘幻象每次攻击可以回复5点<HighLight>神秘知识</>"] = "Each attack from the Mysterious Illusion summoned by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Mystical Re-enactment</> restores 5 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86072010\" color=\"#f4a067\">星海穿梭</>的霸体时间提高至4.5秒"] = "The Super Armor duration of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86072010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Voyage Through the Sea of Stars</> is increased to 4.5 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>初始消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>和后续递增消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>同时减少3点"] = "The initial <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> cost and the subsequent incremental <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> cost of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> are both reduced by 3 points.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>初始消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>和后续递增消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>同时减少3点;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的伤害提升30%"] = "The initial <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> cost and the subsequent incremental <HighLight>Secret Peeking</> cost of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> are both reduced by 3 points. The damage of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> is increased by 30%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>初始消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>和后续递增消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>同时减少3点;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的伤害提升53%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</>'s initial <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> cost and subsequent <HighLight>Mysterious Knowledge</> cost increases are both reduced by 3; <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> damage is increased by 53%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>技能期间自身额外获得10%减伤，增益最多持续7秒"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> grants an additional 10% damage reduction during the skill's duration, with the buff lasting up to 7 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>改为围绕自身旋转，且会跟随自身移动，技能期间自身获得10%减伤、25%加速，增益最多持续7秒"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> now rotates around you and follows your movement. During the skill, you gain 10% damage reduction and 25% acceleration, with the buff lasting up to 7 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>改为围绕自身旋转，且会跟随自身移动，技能期间自身获得10%减伤、25%加速，增益最多持续7秒;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的击退效果变为100%基础概率的击飞"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> now rotates around you and follows your movement. During the skill, you gain 10% damage reduction and 25% acceleration, with the buff lasting up to 7 seconds. The knockback effect of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> is changed to a knockup with a 100% base probability.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>改为围绕自身旋转，且会跟随自身移动，技能期间自身获得10%减伤、25%加速，增益最多持续7秒;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">窥秘之眼</>的击退效果变为100%基础概率的击飞，伤害提高18%"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> now rotates around you and follows your movement. While active, you gain 10% damage reduction and 25% acceleration for up to 7 seconds; <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Eyes of Mystery Prying</> knockback becomes a knockup with a 100% base chance, and its damage is increased by 18%.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识旋涡</>的触发概率提高10%，触发<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识旋涡</>时额外获得5点<HighLight>神秘知识</>"] = "The trigger probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Knowledge Pursuit</> is increased by 10%. When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Knowledge Pursuit</> is triggered, gain an additional 5 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识旋涡</>的触发概率提高10%，触发<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">知识旋涡</>时额外获得5点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;释放强化普攻<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86070040\" color=\"#f4a067\">朗基努斯之枪</>后获得2.5秒<Orange>霸体</>"] = "The trigger probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> is increased by 10%. When <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86075010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</> is triggered, gain an additional 5 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>. After releasing the enhanced basic attack <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86070040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Spear of Longinus</>, gain 2.5 seconds of <Orange>Super Armor</>.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"\">小怪</>击杀概率掉落"] = "Dropped by <HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"\"> Minions </> with a certain probability",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250150\">拍摄</>吃狼鱼罐头的莱昂"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250150\"> Photograph </> Leon eating wolf-fish canned food",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250150\">拍摄</>工作中的莱昂"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250150\"> Photograph </> Leon at work",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\\\"Chat_Task\\\" u=\\\"guildTaskHelp=%s,%d,%s,%s,%s,%s\\\">点击帮助</>"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\\\"Chat_Task\\\" u=\\\"guildTaskHelp=%s,%d,%s,%s,%s,%s\\\"> Click for help </>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.【俱乐部宣战】</>\n<InvDefault>1）优化宣战基础体验，将提前获胜所需的积分差由 5000 上调至 15000。调整后，当一方积分领先另一方超过 15000 分时，积分高的一方将直接获胜。</><InvHighlight>调整将在</><InvHighlight>8月27日</><InvHighlight>20点之后</><InvDefault>的宣战场次生效。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调击杀、助攻时可获得的俱乐部宣战积分。</><InvHighlight>调整将在8月27日20点之后</><InvDefault>的宣战场次生效。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1.【Club War Declaration】</>\n<InvDefault>1）The basic declaration-of-war experience has been improved, increasing the point lead required for an early victory from 5000 to 15000. After the adjustment, when one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the side with the higher score will win immediately.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after </><InvHighlight>August 27</><InvHighlight>at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>2）The club-war points awarded for kills and assists have been reduced.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after August 27 at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.为了提升游戏公平性，【礼金】功能调整了的每日领取上限，以便让更多非凡者领取到礼金。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了副本【记忆的传承·强尼】中替罪羔羊技能伤害区域提示不够明显的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【亡者隘口】关卡中僵尸群的移动速度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击力。</>\n<InvDefault>4）增加了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击间隔。</>\n<InvDefault>5）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院·普通】和【乌托邦剧院·困难】整体难度，并下调了首领【亵渎魔女】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下原著主线《意外的访客》中邓恩表现异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>2）提高了现实主线第四章《镜中的廷根》异变狼人战斗中，玩家【霰弹枪】技能、【手枪射击】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.【跑团】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】玩法中【非凡扮演】因交互物消失导致流程停滞的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）优化了【城市暗面】剧情事件【血色谢幕】中邦尼加冕仪式的玩法指引，并下调了玩法难度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】霍纳奇斯花海地图，坐标【518,316】处的异象之物无法正常显示获取的问题，非凡者可前往对应点位正常获取异象之物。</>\n<InvDefault>5.【装备】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了武器恩赐【铁火铸就的盟约】中，铁火状态伤害频率描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了装备词条中，格挡属性的描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下【占卜家】获取卡牌时，卡牌颜色显示异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>7.优化了【家族】系统招募相关提示文本。</>\n<InvDefault>8.修复了特殊情况下【学徒】无法获得足迹的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>9.修复了少数情况下，【秘偶许愿】保底不生效的问题，完成数据核查后，将根据受影响的次数补偿对应的【金纺线】道具。 </>\n<InvDefault>10.修复了小部分时装染色后表现不一致的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>11.修复了PC端异常出现移动端壁纸的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>12.修复了特殊情况下【命运时刻】、【主宰争锋】、【神座之争】实际段位分变化正常但结算面板段位分变化显示异常的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>13.修复了使用不同词条数的非凡物质聚合时获得<The Fool>词条保底值异常偏低的问题，后续会对之前进行过不同词条数聚合（例如六词条与二词条、五词条与三词条等）的非凡者补发缺失的<The Fool>词条保底进度。</>\n<InvDefault>14.修复了【人脉好感度】中佛尔思邀约对话称呼错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>15.修复了少数情况下【交易所】抢购商品失败时不返还苏勒的情况，完成数据核查后，将全额退还未返还的苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>16.修复了极少数情况下鸿蒙平台切换渠道登录不生效的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>17.优化了【观众】部分技能的施放速度和手感，相应地略微下调治疗效果，保证整体治疗效率不变。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. To improve game fairness, the daily claim limit for 【Gift Money】 has been adjusted so more Beyonders can receive it.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where the damage-area indicator for the Scapegoat skill was insufficiently visible in 【Legacy of Memory · Johnny】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced the movement speed of zombie groups in the 【Dead Man's Pass】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Reduced zombie attack power in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Increased the interval between zombie attacks in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>5）Reduced the overall difficulty of 【Utopia Theatre · Normal】 and 【Utopia Theatre · Hard】, and reduced the damage dealt by the boss 【Blasphemy Sorceress】.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed Dunn behaving incorrectly under special circumstances in the original-story main quest 《An Unexpected Visitor》.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Increased the damage of the player's 【Shotgun】 skill and 【Pistol Shot】 during the mutated werewolf battle in Chapter Four of the real-world main quest 《Tingen in the Mirror》.</>\n<InvDefault>4.【TRPG】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where 【Beyonder Acting】 could become stuck when an interactive object disappeared in 【World of Order】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Improved the gameplay guidance for Bonnie's coronation ritual in the 【Crimson Curtain Call】 story event of 【Dark Side of the City】, and reduced its difficulty.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed an Anomaly Item at coordinates 【518,316】 on the Hornacis Flower Sea map in 【World of Order】 not appearing or being obtainable correctly. Beyonders can now visit the location to obtain it normally.</>\n<InvDefault>5.【Equipment】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an incorrect description of the Ironfire state's damage frequency for the weapon boon 【Covenant Forged in Iron and Fire】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed an incorrect description of the Block attribute on equipment affixes.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed card colors displaying incorrectly when a 【Seer】 obtained cards under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Improved recruitment-related text in the 【Family】 system.</>\n<InvDefault>8. Fixed an issue where 【Apprentice】 could not obtain Footprints under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>9. Fixed the pity guarantee for 【Marionette Wish】 not activating in rare cases. After data verification, affected players will receive the corresponding 【Golden Spun Thread】 items based on the number of affected attempts.</>\n<InvDefault>10. Fixed minor inconsistencies in the appearance of some dyed outfits.</>\n<InvDefault>11. Fixed mobile wallpapers appearing unexpectedly on PC.</>\n<InvDefault>12. Fixed the settlement panel incorrectly displaying ranked-point changes in 【Moment of Destiny】, 【Battle for Supremacy】, and 【Throne War】 under special circumstances, despite the actual ranked-point changes being correct.</>\n<InvDefault>13. Fixed the <The Fool> affix pity value being abnormally low when combining Beyonder materials with different affix counts. Beyonders who previously combined materials with different affix counts, such as six-affix with two-affix or five-affix with three-affix materials, will receive the missing <The Fool> affix pity progress.</>\n<InvDefault>14. Fixed an incorrect form of address in Fors's invitation dialogue under 【Contact Affinity】.</>\n<InvDefault>15. Fixed rare cases where soli were not returned after a failed rush purchase on the 【Exchange】. After data verification, all unreturned soli will be refunded.</>\n<InvDefault>16. Fixed channel switching at login occasionally failing on the HarmonyOS platform.</>\n<InvDefault>17. Improved the casting speed and feel of some 【Spectator】 skills while slightly reducing their healing effects, keeping overall healing efficiency unchanged.</>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.为了提升游戏公平性，【礼金】功能调整了的每日领取上限，以便让更多非凡者领取到礼金。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了副本【记忆的传承·强尼】中替罪羔羊技能伤害区域提示不够明显的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【亡者隘口】关卡中僵尸群的移动速度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击力。</>\n<InvDefault>4）增加了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击间隔。</>\n<InvDefault>5）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院·普通】和【乌托邦剧院·困难】整体难度，并下调了首领【亵渎魔女】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下原著主线《意外的访客》中邓恩表现异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>2）提高了现实主线第四章《镜中的廷根》异变狼人战斗中，玩家【霰弹枪】技能、【手枪射击】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.【跑团】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】玩法中【非凡扮演】因交互物消失导致流程停滞的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）优化了【城市暗面】剧情事件【血色谢幕】中邦尼加冕仪式的玩法指引，并下调了玩法难度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】霍纳奇斯花海地图，坐标【518,316】处的异象之物无法正常显示获取的问题，非凡者可前往对应点位正常获取异象之物。</>\n<InvDefault>5.【装备】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了武器恩赐【铁火铸就的盟约】中，铁火状态伤害频率描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了装备词条中，格挡属性的描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下【占卜家】获取卡牌时，卡牌颜色显示异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>7.优化了【家族】系统招募相关提示文本。</>\n<InvDefault>8.修复了特殊情况下【学徒】无法获得足迹的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>9.修复了少数情况下，【秘偶许愿】保底不生效的问题，完成数据核查后，将根据受影响的次数补偿对应的【金纺线】道具。 </>\n<InvDefault>10.修复了小部分时装染色后表现不一致的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>11.修复了PC端异常出现移动端壁纸的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>12.修复了特殊情况下【命运时刻】、【主宰争锋】、【神座之争】实际段位分变化正常但结算面板段位分变化显示异常的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>13.修复了使用不同词条数的非凡物质聚合时获得<愚者>词条保底值异常偏低的问题，后续会对之前进行过不同词条数聚合（例如六词条与二词条、五词条与三词条等）的非凡者补发缺失的<愚者>词条保底进度。</>\n<InvDefault>14.修复了【人脉好感度】中佛尔思邀约对话称呼错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>15.修复了少数情况下【交易所】抢购商品失败时不返还苏勒的情况，完成数据核查后，将全额退还未返还的苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>16.修复了极少数情况下鸿蒙平台切换渠道登录不生效的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>17.优化了【观众】部分技能的施放速度和手感，相应地略微下调治疗效果，保证整体治疗效率不变。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. To improve game fairness, the daily claim limit for 【Gift Money】 has been adjusted so more Beyonders can receive it.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where the damage-area indicator for the Scapegoat skill was insufficiently visible in 【Legacy of Memory · Johnny】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced the movement speed of zombie groups in the 【Dead Man's Pass】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Reduced zombie attack power in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Increased the interval between zombie attacks in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>5）Reduced the overall difficulty of 【Utopia Theatre · Normal】 and 【Utopia Theatre · Hard】, and reduced the damage dealt by the boss 【Blasphemy Sorceress】.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed Dunn behaving incorrectly under special circumstances in the original-story main quest 《An Unexpected Visitor》.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Increased the damage of the player's 【Shotgun】 skill and 【Pistol Shot】 during the mutated werewolf battle in Chapter Four of the real-world main quest 《Tingen in the Mirror》.</>\n<InvDefault>4.【TRPG】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where 【Beyonder Acting】 could become stuck when an interactive object disappeared in 【World of Order】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Improved the gameplay guidance for Bonnie's coronation ritual in the 【Crimson Curtain Call】 story event of 【Dark Side of the City】, and reduced its difficulty.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed an Anomaly Item at coordinates 【518,316】 on the Hornacis Flower Sea map in 【World of Order】 not appearing or being obtainable correctly. Beyonders can now visit the location to obtain it normally.</>\n<InvDefault>5.【Equipment】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an incorrect description of the Ironfire state's damage frequency for the weapon boon 【Covenant Forged in Iron and Fire】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed an incorrect description of the Block attribute on equipment affixes.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed card colors displaying incorrectly when a 【Seer】 obtained cards under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Improved recruitment-related text in the 【Family】 system.</>\n<InvDefault>8. Fixed an issue where 【Apprentice】 could not obtain Footprints under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>9. Fixed the pity guarantee for 【Marionette Wish】 not activating in rare cases. After data verification, affected players will receive the corresponding 【Golden Spun Thread】 items based on the number of affected attempts.</>\n<InvDefault>10. Fixed minor inconsistencies in the appearance of some dyed outfits.</>\n<InvDefault>11. Fixed mobile wallpapers appearing unexpectedly on PC.</>\n<InvDefault>12. Fixed the settlement panel incorrectly displaying ranked-point changes in 【Moment of Destiny】, 【Battle for Supremacy】, and 【Throne War】 under special circumstances, despite the actual ranked-point changes being correct.</>\n<InvDefault>13. Fixed the <​The Fool> affix pity value being abnormally low when combining Beyonder materials with different affix counts. Beyonders who previously combined materials with different affix counts, such as six-affix with two-affix or five-affix with three-affix materials, will receive the missing <​The Fool> affix pity progress.</>\n<InvDefault>14. Fixed an incorrect form of address in Fors's invitation dialogue under 【Contact Affinity】.</>\n<InvDefault>15. Fixed rare cases where soli were not returned after a failed rush purchase on the 【Exchange】. After data verification, all unreturned soli will be refunded.</>\n<InvDefault>16. Fixed channel switching at login occasionally failing on the HarmonyOS platform.</>\n<InvDefault>17. Improved the casting speed and feel of some 【Spectator】 skills while slightly reducing their healing effects, keeping overall healing efficiency unchanged.</>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.因“非凡之路，感谢同行”福利计划，我们本周新增了【零元购凭证】的更多获取途径，修改内容如下：</>\n<InvDefault>【神降惊喜礼盒福利加码】</>\n<InvDefault>1）新增奖励内容：原秘宝箱子中获取的</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒稀有概率不变，新增了零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券奖励类型</><InvDefault>，且未获得稀有奖励时必定获得一定数量的绑定苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修改开启方式：</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒从默认自动开启修改为需手动确认开启</><InvDefault>。</>\n<InvDefault>3）我们将为符合情况的对应非凡者，发送本周已开启的神降惊喜礼盒对应数量的新增奖励礼盒，包括：概率获取的零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券和一定数量的绑定苏勒，之后将通过邮件形式发放，请非凡者关注后续邮件。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下，达到指定等级未正常开启主线任务的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了现实主线《廷根守护者》中部分步骤黑屏时间过长的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特殊情况下现实主线《暗涌的危机》中无法找到伦纳德、弗莱的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>4）优化了部分主线动画的Skip节奏。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·黄金之罪】中“洛克·金”骗局陷阱和债务之护机制处理失败后的技能伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院】困难和噩梦难度下，双人模式中怪物的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.优化了【座驾】中车辆【留声机】的播放规则，若下车前已经暂停或者关闭留声机，再次上车会记录留声机状态，不会默认播放。</>\n<InvDefault>5.修复了【廷根】的【马车】和【骑警】的音效问题以及移动表现问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下，【原著瞬间】等【秩序世界】玩法物件消失无法交互，导致玩法无法完成的问题，非凡者可以回到原点位正常完成玩法。</>\n<InvDefault>7.修复了学徒技能【记录】和【漫游】在网络波动环境下触发异常的问题。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. As part of the ‘Path of the Beyonder, Thank You for the Journey’ benefit program, more ways to obtain 【Zero-Cost Vouchers】 have been added this week, with the following changes:</>\n<InvDefault>【Divine Descent Surprise Gift Box Bonus】</>\n<InvDefault>1）New rewards: the original Treasure Chest's </><InvHighlight>rare-drop rate for Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes is unchanged, while Zero-Cost Vouchers and several pound-voucher reward types have been added</><InvDefault>. A quantity of bound soli is guaranteed whenever no rare reward is obtained.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Opening method changed: </><InvHighlight>Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes now require manual confirmation instead of opening automatically by default</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Eligible Beyonders will receive additional reward boxes matching the number of Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes opened this week. These may grant Zero-Cost Vouchers, several kinds of pound vouchers, and a quantity of bound soli. They will be delivered by mail; please watch for future messages.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed the main quest not starting normally upon reaching the required level under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed excessively long black screens during some steps of the real-world main quest 《Guardian of Tingen》.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed Leonard and Frye being impossible to find under special circumstances in the real-world main quest 《Undercurrent Crisis》.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Improved the Skip pacing of some main-story cinematics.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Reduced skill damage after failing the Locke King scam-trap and Debt Protection mechanics in 【Blackthorn Casebook · Sin of Gold】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced monster damage in two-player mode on Hard and Nightmare difficulties in 【Utopia Theatre】.</>\n<InvDefault>4. Improved the playback rules for the 【Gramophone】 vehicle feature under 【Mounts】. If the gramophone was paused or switched off before dismounting, its state is now remembered when mounting again instead of playback starting automatically.</>\n<InvDefault>5. Fixed sound and movement issues affecting 【Carriages】 and 【Mounted Police】 in 【Tingen】.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed 【World of Order】 objects such as 【Original-Story Moments】 disappearing and becoming non-interactive under special circumstances, preventing completion. Beyonders can now return to the original location and finish normally.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Fixed abnormal triggering of the Apprentice skills 【Record】 and 【Wander】 during network instability.</>",
    ["<InvDefault>1.因“非凡之路，感谢同行”福利计划，我们本周新增了【零元购凭证】的更多获取途径，修改内容如下：</>\n<InvDefault>【神降惊喜礼盒福利加码】</>\n<InvDefault>1）新增奖励内容：原秘宝箱子中获取的</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒稀有概率不变，新增了零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券奖励类型</><InvDefault>，且未获得稀有奖励时必定获得一定数量的绑定苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修改开启方式：</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒从默认自动开启修改为需手动确认开启</><InvDefault>。</>\n<InvDefault>3）我们将为符合情况的对应非凡者，发送本周已开启的神降惊喜礼盒对应数量的新增奖励礼盒，包括：概率获取的零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券和一定数量的绑定苏勒，之后将通过邮件形式发放，请非凡者关注后续邮件。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下，达到指定等级未正常开启主线任务的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了现实主线《廷根守护者》中部分步骤黑屏时间过长的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特殊情况下现实主线《暗涌的危机》中无法找到伦纳德、弗莱的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>4）优化了部分主线动画的跳过节奏。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·黄金之罪】中“洛克·金”骗局陷阱和债务之护机制处理失败后的技能伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院】困难和噩梦难度下，双人模式中怪物的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.优化了【座驾】中车辆【留声机】的播放规则，若下车前已经暂停或者关闭留声机，再次上车会记录留声机状态，不会默认播放。</>\n<InvDefault>5.修复了【廷根】的【马车】和【骑警】的音效问题以及移动表现问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下，【原著瞬间】等【秩序世界】玩法物件消失无法交互，导致玩法无法完成的问题，非凡者可以回到原点位正常完成玩法。</>\n<InvDefault>7.修复了学徒技能【记录】和【漫游】在网络波动环境下触发异常的问题。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. As part of the ‘Path of the Beyonder, Thank You for the Journey’ benefit program, more ways to obtain 【Zero-Cost Vouchers】 have been added this week, with the following changes:</>\n<InvDefault>【Divine Descent Surprise Gift Box Bonus】</>\n<InvDefault>1）New rewards: the original Treasure Chest's </><InvHighlight>rare-drop rate for Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes is unchanged, while Zero-Cost Vouchers and several pound-voucher reward types have been added</><InvDefault>. A quantity of bound soli is guaranteed whenever no rare reward is obtained.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Opening method changed: </><InvHighlight>Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes now require manual confirmation instead of opening automatically by default</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Eligible Beyonders will receive additional reward boxes matching the number of Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes opened this week. These may grant Zero-Cost Vouchers, several kinds of pound vouchers, and a quantity of bound soli. They will be delivered by mail; please watch for future messages.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed the main quest not starting normally upon reaching the required level under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed excessively long black screens during some steps of the real-world main quest 《Guardian of Tingen》.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed Leonard and Frye being impossible to find under special circumstances in the real-world main quest 《Undercurrent Crisis》.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Improved the Skip pacing of some main-story cinematics.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Reduced skill damage after failing the Locke King scam-trap and Debt Protection mechanics in 【Blackthorn Casebook · Sin of Gold】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced monster damage in two-player mode on Hard and Nightmare difficulties in 【Utopia Theatre】.</>\n<InvDefault>4. Improved the playback rules for the 【Gramophone】 vehicle feature under 【Mounts】. If the gramophone was paused or switched off before dismounting, its state is now remembered when mounting again instead of playback starting automatically.</>\n<InvDefault>5. Fixed sound and movement issues affecting 【Carriages】 and 【Mounted Police】 in 【Tingen】.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed 【World of Order】 objects such as 【Original-Story Moments】 disappearing and becoming non-interactive under special circumstances, preventing completion. Beyonders can now return to the original location and finish normally.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Fixed abnormal triggering of the Apprentice skills 【Record】 and 【Wander】 during network instability.</>",
    ["<InvDefault>拖拽右侧的文字至左侧空白格内，还原正确答案即可完成本题</>"] = "<InvDefault>Drag the text on the right into the blank spaces on the left to restore the correct answer and complete this task.</>",
    ["<InvHighlight>1号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者大幅降低了<InvHighlight>真弹的比例</>，使第一次选择命中真弹的概率变得<InvHighlight>微乎其微</>。\n\n当一颗假弹被排除后，剩余选项中出现真弹的概率随之上升。因此，<InvHighlight>更换选择</>更为有利。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 1</> is real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire significantly reduced the <InvHighlight>proportion of real bullets</>, making the probability of hitting a real bullet on the first choice <InvHighlight>negligible</>. \n\nWhen a fake bullet is excluded, the probability of a real bullet appearing among the remaining options rises. Therefore, <InvHighlight>changing your choice</> is more advantageous. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
    ["<InvHighlight>2号、3号和4号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者增加了<InvHighlight>子弹的总数</>。四枚子弹中有三枚真弹，第一次选择命中真弹的概率高达<InvHighlight>四分之三</>。\n\n最初的选择已经占据明显优势，因此，<InvHighlight>坚持最初的选择</>最为稳妥。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 2, No. 3, and No. 4</> are real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire increased the <InvHighlight>total number of bullets</>. Three out of the four bullets are real, and the probability of hitting a real bullet on the first choice is as high as <InvHighlight>three-quarters</>. \n\nThe initial choice already holds a clear advantage, therefore, <InvHighlight>sticking to the initial choice</> is the safest bet. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
    ["<InvHighlight>2号和3号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者增加了<InvHighlight>真弹的数量</>，使第一次选择命中真弹的概率达到<InvHighlight>三分之二</>。\n\n当一颗真弹被排除后，重新选择的胜率反而降至<InvHighlight>二分之一</>。因此，<InvHighlight>坚持原本的选择</>更为有利。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 2 and No. 3</> are real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire increased the <InvHighlight>number of real bullets</>, making the probability of hitting a real bullet on the first choice reach <InvHighlight>two-thirds</>. \n\nWhen a real bullet is excluded, the win rate of choosing again actually drops to <InvHighlight>one-half</>. Therefore, <InvHighlight>sticking to the original choice</> is more advantageous. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
    ["<InvHighlight>2号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者拿出了<InvHighlight>三枚子弹</>，其中只有<InvHighlight>一颗真弹</>。第一次选择便命中真弹的概率，仅为<InvHighlight>三分之一</>。\n\n当一颗假弹被排除后，重新选择的胜率将提升至<InvHighlight>二分之一</>。因此，<InvHighlight>更换选择</>更为有利。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 2</> is real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire brought out <InvHighlight>three bullets</>, of which only <InvHighlight>one is a real bullet</>. The probability of hitting the real bullet on the first choice is only <InvHighlight>one-third</>. \n\nWhen a fake bullet is excluded, the win rate of choosing again increases to <InvHighlight>one-half</>. Therefore, <InvHighlight>changing your choice</> is more advantageous. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
    ["<InvHighlight>5月11日 晴</>\n　　镇上采风，小宁芙很有趣，说自己吃了二十年煎蛋……\n\n<InvHighlight>5月12日 晴</>\n　　镇上采风，弹唱者伊桑唱了四十年歌……\n\n<InvHighlight>5月13日 晴</>\n　　镇上采风，尝试了永远喝不完的睡莲啤酒……"] = "<InvHighlight> May 11th Sunny </>\n　　Gathering material in town. The little nymph is very interesting, saying she has been eating fried eggs for twenty years... \n\n<InvHighlight> May 12th Sunny </>\n　　Gathering material in town. The singer Ethan has been singing for forty years... \n\n<InvHighlight> May 13th Sunny </>\n　　Gathering material in town. Tried the water lily beer that never runs out...",
    ["<InvHighlight>5月14日 晴</>\n　　有些不对劲。\n　　感觉一切都在<Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\">重复</>？\n\n<InvHighlight>5月15日 晴</>\n　　真的不对劲。\n　　真的在<Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\">重复</>。\n　　为什么？\n\n<InvHighlight>5月16日 晴</>\n　　尝试调查……\n\n<InvHighlight>5月17日 晴</>\n　　尝试调查……"] = "<InvHighlight> May 14th Sunny </>\n　　Something is not right. \n　　Feel like everything is <Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\"> repeating </>? \n\n<InvHighlight> May 15th Sunny </>\n　　Something is really not right. \n　　It really is <Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\"> repeating </>. \n　　Why? \n\n<InvHighlight> May 16th Sunny </>\n　　Attempting to investigate... \n\n<InvHighlight> May 17th Sunny </>\n　　Attempting to investigate...",
    ["<InvHighlight>5月9日 晴</>\n　　终于抵达了睡莲小镇，窗外就是湖景，种着好多睡莲。听旅馆老板讲了<Mark id=\"#159\">睡莲仙女</>的故事，有意思……\n　　希望度过美好的一周。\n\n<InvHighlight>5月10日 晴</>\n　　发现了当地的神奇之处——没有黑夜，一直是白天，可能纬度太高了……\n　　小镇围绕黑夜教堂建造，风格古典……"] = "<InvHighlight>May 9th, Sunny</>\n　　Finally arrived at Water Lily Town. Outside the window is a lake view, with many water lilies planted. Heard the story of the <Mark id=\"#159\">Water Lily Fairy</> from the innkeeper, interesting...\n　　Hope to have a wonderful week.\n\n<InvHighlight>May 10th, Sunny</>\n　　Discovered the magical aspect of this place—there is no night, it is always daytime. Maybe the latitude is too high...\n　　The small town is built around the Church of the Night, with a classical style...",
    ["<InvHighlight>序言</>\n迷雾中的巨人：重估罗塞尔的历史地位\n\n<InvHighlight>第一章</>\n古斯塔夫家族：没落贵族复兴序曲\n\n<InvHighlight>第二章</>\n蒸汽时代浪潮：工业革命的推动者\n\n<InvHighlight>第三章</>\n战争与秩序：世界格局的奠基者\n\n<InvHighlight>第四章</>\n伟大的航道：南北大陆航道开拓者"] = "<InvHighlight>Preface</>\nThe Giant in the Mist: Reevaluating Roselle's Historical Status\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 1</>\nThe Gustav Family: Prelude to the Revival of a Fallen Aristocracy\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 2</>\nThe Wave of the Steam Age: The Driving Force of the Industrial Revolution\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 3</>\nWar and Order: The Founders of the World Order\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 4</>\nThe Great Sea Route: Pioneers of the North-South Continental Routes",
    ["<InvHighlight>歌谣仅供参考，谨慎尝试。</>\n\n                       远航去\n                       漩涡里\n                 狂暴波涛寂静心\n\n                       勇激荡\n                       狂翻涌\n                 海浪深处存安宁\n\n                       闪闪鳞光\n                       照耀浪花\n                 梦境汹涌永远的家\n\n                       怒吼求救\n                       无奈放纵\n                 海风味的一抹乡愁"] = "<InvHighlight> The ballad is for reference only; proceed with caution. </> \n \n Sailing away \n Into the whirlpool \n Violent waves, silent heart \n \n Bravely surging \n Wildly churning \n Peace exists in the depths of the sea waves \n \n Glittering scales \n Shining on the spray \n Dreams surging, an eternal home \n \n Roaring for help \n Helplessly indulging \n A touch of homesickness with the scent of sea breeze",
    ["<InvHighlight>第五章</>\n法典与学堂：社会制度的革新者\n\n<InvHighlight>第六章</>\n诗歌与小说：跨时代的先锋艺术\n\n<InvHighlight>第七章</>\n抽水马桶到蒸汽机：伟大的发明与改良\n\n<InvHighlight>第八章</>\n执政官到皇帝：帝国的缔造与权力巅峰\n\n<InvHighlight>第九章</>\n一个时代的终结：白枫宫遇刺案探析\n\n<InvHighlight>后记</>\n遗产与回响：永不熄灭的灯塔"] = "<InvHighlight>Chapter 5</>\nCodes and Schools: Innovators of Social Systems\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 6</>\nPoetry and Novels: Avant-Garde Art Across Eras\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 7</>\nFrom Flush Toilets to Steam Engines: Great Inventions and Improvements\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 8</>\nFrom Consul to Emperor: The Creation of the Empire and the Peak of Power\n\n<InvHighlight>Chapter 9</>\nThe End of an Era: An Analysis of the White Maple Palace Assassination\n\n<InvHighlight>Afterword</>\nLegacy and Echoes: The Lighthouse That Never Extinguishes",
    ["<Italic>——不知从何时起，迈出的每一步都比预想的慢了半拍。 或许这并不是身体出了问题，而是某种无形的东西，开始一点点拽住你的脚踝。</>"] = "<Italic>—Since when, every step you take has been half a beat slower than expected. Perhaps it's not a problem with your body, but something invisible starting to drag at your ankles bit by bit.</>",
    ["<Italic>——你开始听得到一些不可名状的低语，它们像是某种从意识深处漏出来的碎语，没有方向，没有意义，却无法被忽视。 每当你试图快速移动，那些声音就会骤然放大，世界在你眼中短暂地旋转、倾斜、归位。可你也不敢笃定，下一次、再下一次，世界还会如常归位。</>"] = "<Italic>—You begin to hear some unspeakable whispers; they are like fragments of speech leaking from the depths of your consciousness, directionless and meaningless, yet impossible to ignore. Whenever you try to move quickly, those sounds suddenly amplify, and the world briefly rotates, tilts, and resets in your eyes. But you dare not be certain that the next time, and the time after that, the world will reset as usual.</>",
    ["<Italic>——你开始怀疑自己的判断。在决定\"动\"的那一瞬间，脑海里有另一个声音像恶魔蛊惑的低语：真的要跑吗？真的要冲吗？ 虽然迟疑只有半秒，但半秒已经足够让一切变得不同。 你越来越难以说服自己，那个犹豫的声音，究竟是谨慎，还是恐惧，还是别的什么东西，它们如跗骨之蛆，扎根在了你的灵魂里。 </>"] = "<Italic>—You begin to doubt your own judgment. At the very moment you decide to \"move,\" another voice in your mind whispers like a demon's seduction: Do you really want to run? Do you really want to charge? Although the hesitation lasts only half a second, half a second is enough to make everything different. You find it increasingly difficult to convince yourself whether that hesitating voice is caution, fear, or something else. They are like maggots attached to bones, rooted in your soul. </>",
    ["<Italic>——你开始怀疑自己的判断。在决定\"动\"的那一瞬间，脑海里有另一个声音像恶魔蛊惑的低语：真的要跑吗？真的要冲吗？ 虽然迟疑只有半秒，但半秒已经足够让一切变得不同。 你越来越难以说服自己，那个犹豫的声音，究竟是谨慎，还是恐惧，还是别的什么东西，它们如附骨之疽，扎根在了你的灵魂里。 </>"] = "<Italic>—You begin to doubt your own judgment. At the very moment you decide to \"move,\" another voice in your mind whispers like a demon's temptation: Do you really want to run? Do you really want to charge? Although the hesitation lasts only half a second, half a second is enough to change everything. You find it increasingly difficult to convince yourself whether that hesitant voice is caution, fear, or something else. They have taken root in your soul like a persistent disease. </>",
    ["<Italic>——你感受到了久违的、不可控的力量在身体里翻涌。 它让你的血液流速加快，每一拳落下都比从前更重——可你是否确定，那真的是力量？还是只是你对疼痛的感知，正在悄然发生变化？你开始不再在意对疼痛的感知，不在意视野会在某些瞬间发生无声地抖动，就像一张被人轻轻撕过一角的画。</>"] = "<Italic>—You feel a long-lost, uncontrollable power surging within your body. It makes your blood flow faster, and every punch you throw lands heavier than before—but are you sure it's really power? Or is it just that your perception of pain is quietly changing? You begin to no longer care about the perception of pain, nor do you care that your vision shakes silently at certain moments, like a painting with a corner torn off by someone.</>",
    ["<Italic>——你的双眼清澈，呼吸平稳，心跳正常。世界依旧如常运转，脚下的大地坚实而真实。 你还是你。</>"] = "<Italic>—Your eyes are clear, your breathing is steady, and your heartbeat is normal. The world continues to function as usual, and the earth beneath your feet is solid and real. You are still you.</>",
    ["<Italic>——名为“你”的存在消失了。 而某种更古老、更邪异的东西从你的躯壳里站起来，它吞噬了你的精神，征服了你的皮囊，它不懂什么是朋友，无法辨认方向，更不认识任何语言。 它只知道猎物。你已成为毫无理智的怪物。</>"] = "<Italic>—The existence known as \"you\" has vanished. Instead, something more ancient and sinister has risen from your shell. It has devoured your spirit and conquered your flesh; it knows not what a friend is, cannot discern direction, and recognizes no language. It only knows prey. You have become a monster devoid of all reason.</>",
    ["<Italic>——有什么东西在你的皮肤下燃烧，把你从内到外染成猩红的月色。 你的力量远超常人，那些想要束缚你的枷锁，在你眼中不过是笑话。 可你的人性也在逐渐流失，你的认知开始错乱，无法感知到敌友的区别。 你的非凡之力在涌动，却不听你的命令。 你的躯体在发出暗红的光，就像一根即将烧断的引线。你已在危险的边缘，下一步，就是深渊。</>"] = "<Italic>—Something is burning beneath your skin, dyeing you from the inside out in the color of a scarlet moon. Your strength far exceeds that of an ordinary person; those shackles that sought to bind you are nothing but a joke in your eyes. Yet, your humanity is also gradually slipping away; your perception is becoming distorted, and you cannot distinguish between friend and foe. Your Beyonder powers are surging, but they no longer obey your commands. Your body is emitting a dark red light, like a fuse about to burn out. You are on the edge of danger; the next step is the abyss.</>",
    ["<Italic>——某种平静笼罩着你，心境如同无风的湖面。 你的每一个决定都清晰而确定，脑海中没有杂音，没有犹疑，没有不速之客。这意味着你的眼睛能看见它本该看见的东西，你的手能落在它应该落下的位置。 这种安宁也许来自修炼，也许来自某种你说不清的意志—— 但无论如何，此刻的你，比任何人都更像自己。 </>"] = "<Italic>—A certain calmness envelops you, your state of mind like a windless lake. Every decision you make is clear and certain; there is no noise in your mind, no hesitation, no uninvited guests. This means your eyes can see what they are meant to see, and your hands can land where they are supposed to land. This peace may come from training, or perhaps from some will you cannot quite name—but regardless, at this moment, you are more like yourself than anyone else. </>",
    ["<Letter_Highlight>怨灵残留的粉尘</>，165镑。\n木乃伊粉末，10克，5镑。\n鱼人黏液，30毫升，29镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>成年七彩蜥龙的龙翼160镑</>，心脏200镑。\n需要水鬼的脑组织，视完整程度，3镑至15镑不等。"] = "<Letter_Highlight>Dust left by a Wraith</>, 165 pounds. \nMummy powder, 10 grams, 5 pounds. \nMerman mucus, 30 ml, 29 pounds. \n<Letter_Highlight>Dragon wings of an adult Rainbow Lizard Dragon, 160 pounds</>, heart 200 pounds. \nRequires brain tissue of a Water Ghost, depending on the degree of integrity, ranging from 3 to 15 pounds.",
    ["<Letter_Highlight>采摘草药</>：在第三个月升日采摘铁筷子草，6镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>短期雇佣</>：雇佣一位有航海经验的保镖，为期一月，600镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>金梧桐区案件</>：本周金梧桐区发生一起恶性入室抢劫杀人案，提供相关线索者，一经核实有效，即可获得10镑奖励。\n<Letter_Highlight>通缉悬赏</>：通缉犯海盗格斯出现于廷根，每条有效线索5镑。\n<Letter_Highlight>寻狗启事</>：三日前爱犬维纳于水仙花街走丢，通体黑色面部白色，若有线索，重金酬谢！"] = "<Letter_Highlight> Pick Herbs </>: Pick Hellebore during the sunrise in the third month, 6 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Short-term Employment </>: Hire a bodyguard with sailing experience for one month, 600 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Golden Indus District Case </>: A vicious home invasion and murder occurred in the Golden Indus District this week. Anyone who provides relevant clues that are verified as effective will receive a 10-pound reward. \n <Letter_Highlight> Wanted Bounty </>: Wanted pirate Gus has appeared in Tingen. 5 pounds per effective clue. \n <Letter_Highlight> Lost Dog Notice </>: My beloved dog, Vina, went missing on Daffodil Street three days ago. She is all black with a white face. If you have any clues, a generous reward will be given!",
    ["<LevelText_Special>神性等级%d级</>"] = "<LevelText_Special> Divinity Level %d </>",
    ["<M_Default>「你所宣称的未来，或将上演，成为现实。」</>\n<M_Default>为了更好地为各位非凡者效劳，更好地守护廷根、守护诡秘之主的世界，代号诡秘开发组</><M_Red>#空想家计划#</><M_Default>现向所有非凡者征集你理想中的诡秘之主游戏玩法！</>\n<M_Default>欢迎留下你的创意和意见，世界会将你的想法带给开发组：</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=https://lotm.tzxxx.com/\">代号诡秘官网</>"] = "<M_Default>\"The future you claim may unfold and become reality.\"</>\n<M_Default>To better serve all Beyonders and better guard Tingen and the world of the Lord of Mysteries, the Code: Mysteries development team</><M_Red>#VisionaryProject#</><M_Default>is now collecting the Lord of Mysteries gameplay you envision from all Beyonders!</>\n<M_Default>Welcome to leave your creative ideas and feedback, and the world will bring your thoughts to the development team:</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=https://lotm.tzxxx.com/\">Code: Mysteries Official Website</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的商会成员：</>\n铁路大亨赛季已结束，未领取的赛季任务和常规任务奖励已通过邮件发放，请及时查收"] = "<M_Default>Dear Chamber of Commerce member: </>\nThe Railway Tycoon season has ended. Unclaimed season quest and regular quest rewards have been sent via email. Please check them in time.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者： </>\n    四方联赛拍卖即将开启，由于您未参与本周四方联赛，故无法获得本周拍卖分红，详细规则信息见四方联赛玩法说明。参与四方联赛可获得丰厚奖励，期待您下次与俱乐部成员一同参与。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n The Four-Way League auction is about to begin. Since you did not participate in this week's Four-Way League, you are not eligible for this week's auction dividends. See the Four-Way League gameplay instructions for detailed rules. Participating in the Four-Way League can earn you generous rewards. We look forward to you participating with your club members next time.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者： </>\n    四方联赛拍卖即将开启，由于您积极参与本周联赛对战，获得参与拍卖资格，并且在拍卖结束后能够获得拍卖分红，期待您下次与俱乐部成员继续一同奋战。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n The Four-Way League auction is about to begin. Since you actively participated in this week's league battles, you are eligible to participate in the auction and will receive auction dividends after the auction ends. We look forward to you continuing to fight alongside your club members next time.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者： </>\n    四方联赛第一轮拍卖将于20:30开启，请留意开启时间。拍卖参与资格及拍卖分红将依据本轮联赛参与情况确定，详细规则信息见四方联赛玩法说明。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n The first round of the Four-Way League auction will start at 20:30. Please pay attention to the start time. Auction participation eligibility and auction dividends will be determined based on participation in this round of the league. For detailed rules, see the Four-Way League gameplay instructions.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者： </>\n    四方联赛第二轮拍卖将于21:20开启，请留意开启时间。拍卖参与资格及拍卖分红将依据本轮联赛参与情况确定，详细规则信息见四方联赛玩法说明。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n The second round of the Four-Way League auction will start at 21:20. Please pay attention to the start time. Auction participation eligibility and auction dividends will be determined based on participation in this round of the league. For detailed rules, see the Four-Way League gameplay instructions.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n    您上周参与终末猎杀有未领取的猎杀进度奖励，现已自动发放至您的邮箱，请注意查收。"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n You have unclaimed progress rewards from last week's participation in the Final Hunt. They have now been automatically sent to your mailbox; please check them.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n  <M_Default>战略服势力调整</>已结束，可前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302515\">【势力分配】</>查看！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n  <M_Default>Strategic Server faction adjustment</> has ended. You can go to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302515\">【Faction Allocation】</> to view it!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n  贵俱乐部凭借<M_Default>战略服筛选总积分前4名</>的成绩，获得<M_Default>参与战略服的资格</>，现<M_Default>战略服势力调整</>已开始，将于今日18：00结束，请前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302515\">【势力调整】</>查看。\n【特别说明】\n    1. 进入<M_Default>势力调整阶段</>后，除各赛区积分<M_Default>第一俱乐部</>势力锁定外，其余俱乐部均可自行调整己方势力，请会长/理事密切关注。\n    2. 调整时间截止到今日<M_Default>18：00</>，届时尚未选择势力的俱乐部将被系统分配到有空位的势力！\n    3. 请抓紧时间整军备战、协调阵容、调度资源，为本服赛区争夺更高荣誉！\n    愿诸位旗开得胜，凯旋而归！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n  Your club, by virtue of ranking in the top 4 of the <M_Default>Strategic Server screening total points</>, has obtained the <M_Default>qualification to participate in the Strategic Server</>. Now, the <M_Default>Strategic Server faction adjustment</> has begun and will end at 18:00 today. Please go to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302515\">【Faction Adjustment】</> to view it. \n【Special Note】\n    1. After entering the <M_Default>faction adjustment stage</>, except for the club ranked first in points in each division whose <M_Default>faction is locked</>, all other clubs can adjust their own factions. Please have the President/Councilors pay close attention. \n    2. The adjustment time ends at 18:00 today<M_Default>18:00</>. At that time, clubs that have not yet selected a faction will be assigned by the system to a faction with available slots! \n    3. Please hurry to prepare for battle, coordinate lineups, and dispatch resources to compete for higher honors in this server's division! \n    May you all win your first battle and return in triumph!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n  贵俱乐部凭借<M_Default>战略服筛选总积分前4名</>的成绩，获得<M_Default>参与战略服的资格</>，现<M_Default>战略服势力预分配</>已开始，将于明日中午12：00结束，请及时关注！\n【特别说明】\n    1. <M_Default>势力预分配后</>，将进入<M_Default>势力调整阶段</>。\n    2. 进入<M_Default>势力调整阶段</>后，除各赛区积分<M_Default>第一俱乐部</>势力锁定外，其余俱乐部均可自行调整己方势力，请会长/理事密切关注。\n    3. 请抓紧时间整军备战、协调阵容、调度资源，为本服赛区争夺更高荣誉！\n    愿诸位旗开得胜，凯旋而归！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n  Your club, by virtue of ranking in the top 4 of the <M_Default>Strategic Server screening total points</>, has obtained the <M_Default>qualification to participate in the Strategic Server</>. Now, the <M_Default>Strategic Server faction pre-allocation</> has begun and will end at 12:00 noon tomorrow. Please pay close attention! \n【Special Note】\n    1. <M_Default>After faction pre-allocation</>, you will enter the <M_Default>faction adjustment stage</>. \n    2. After entering the <M_Default>faction adjustment stage</>, except for the club ranked first in points in each division whose <M_Default>faction is locked</>, all other clubs can adjust their own factions. Please have the President/Councilors pay close attention. \n    3. Please hurry to prepare for battle, coordinate lineups, and dispatch resources to compete for higher honors in this server's division! \n    May you all win your first battle and return in triumph!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>《诡秘之主》公测已至，非凡世界的大门已向您敞开，欢迎踏上这片真实与隐秘交织的大地。</>\n\n<M_Default>为感谢您在【灰雾测试】期间的陪伴与信任，您曾留下的那一笔笔“投资”，如今穿梭灵界而来，化作更加丰富的返还奖励。</>请前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000067\">廷根·吉福特</>处领取您的充值返还奖励。\n\n愿这些回馈能让您在新世界的旅途玩得更加开心。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The public beta of \"Lord of Mysteries\" has arrived, and the door to the Extraordinary World has opened to you. Welcome to this land intertwined with reality and mystery. </>\n\n<M_Default>To thank you for your companionship and trust during the [Gray Fog Test], the \"investments\" you left behind have now traveled through the Spirit World and transformed into even richer return rewards. </>Please go to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000067\">Tingen Gifford</> to claim your recharge return rewards. \n\nMay these returns make your journey in the new world even more enjoyable.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>一份觉醒契约已送达——来自诡秘的绑定请求。</>\n请点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">确认绑定</>完成契约签署。\n 若非本人操作，请忽略此邮件。\n感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>An Awakening Contract has arrived—a binding request from the Lord of Mysteries. </>\nPlease click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Confirm Binding</> to complete the contract signing. \n If this was not performed by you, please ignore this email. \nThank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>下列物品无人竞拍，已被系统随机发放给您。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>The following items received no bids and have been randomly distributed to you by the system.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>你的常驻语音房间剩余时间已不足24小时，如需保留常驻状态，请尽快续时。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your permanent voice room has less than 24 hours remaining. If you need to retain the permanent status, please renew it as soon as possible.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>你的誓约对象:%s已与%s解除了誓约。\n过往的契约已成旧页，而与你的那一页，仍在续写。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your Covenant partner:%s has dissolved the Covenant with %s. \nThe past contract has become an old page, but the page with you is still being written. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>很遗憾地通知您，您创建的俱乐部未达响应要求，之前的创建费用已全额返还，请及时在附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>We regret to inform you that the club you created did not meet the response requirements. The previous creation fee has been fully refunded. Please collect it from the attachments in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>很遗憾地通知您，您响应的家族已被首席取消创建，该家族的群聊已自动解散，请寻找其他家族加入吧。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>We regret to inform you that the family you responded to has been cancelled by the Chief, and the family's group chat has been automatically dissolved. Please look for another family to join.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>很遗憾地通知您，您已被原家族的首席请离家族，您现在可以申请其他的家族。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>We regret to inform you that you have been removed from the family by the original Chief. You can now apply for other families.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在主宰争锋玩法中跻身全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide in the Dominator's Clash. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在主宰争锋玩法中跻身市排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 in your city in the Dominator's Clash. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在主宰争锋玩法中跻身本职业全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide for your profession in the Dominator's Clash. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在主宰争锋玩法中跻身省排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 in your province in the Dominator's Clash. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
