    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在趣斗玩法中跻身本职业全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide for your profession in the Fun Fight mode. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您所在俱乐部在本次宣战中战胜了[%s]！您已获得专属限时称号，可前往称号界面查看。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>Congratulations to your club for defeating [%s] in this declaration of war! You have obtained an exclusive limited-time title. You can go to the title interface to view it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您上周的家族工资未被领取，未被领取的内容已返还给您。请及时在附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your family salary from last week was not claimed. The unclaimed portion has been returned to you. Please collect it from the attachments in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您发送的礼金未被领取完，未被领取的内容已根据礼金规则返还给您。请及时在附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>The gift money you sent was not fully claimed. The unclaimed portion has been returned to you according to the gift money rules. Please collect it from the attachments in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在主宰争锋中达到天使之王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of King of Angels in the Dominator's Clash. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在主宰争锋中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Emperor of Conquest in the Dominator's Clash. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在主宰争锋中达到星辰之主段位，称号奖励已解锁，可前往称号界面使用。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Lord of Stars in the Dominator's Clash. The title reward has been unlocked and can be used in the title interface.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在主宰争锋中达到血色亲王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Crimson Prince in the Dominator's Clash. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在之前参与的乌托邦剧院副本中，有未领取的每周进度奖励。我们为您将奖励储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>In the Utopia Theater dungeon you participated in before, there are unclaimed weekly progress rewards. We have stored the rewards in your mailbox for you. Please claim them in time. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在之前参与的名流盛宴活动中，有部分个人热度奖励未领取（未主动领取、网络波动、提前离开地图等原因发放失败）。我们为您将奖励储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>You have some unclaimed personal popularity rewards from the Celebrity Feast event you previously participated in (failed to distribute due to not claiming manually, network fluctuations, leaving the map early, etc.). We have stored the rewards in your mailbox; please collect them in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在之前参与的名流盛宴活动中，有部分盛宴热度奖励未领取（未主动领取、网络波动、提前离开地图等原因发放失败）。我们为您将奖励储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>You have some unclaimed feast popularity rewards from the Celebrity Feast event you previously participated in (failed to distribute due to not claiming manually, network fluctuations, leaving the map early, etc.). We have stored the rewards in your mailbox; please collect them in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在之前参与的玩法中，有部分奖励未领取（未主动领取、网络波动、提前离开地图等原因发放失败）。我们为您将奖励储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>You have some unclaimed rewards from your previous gameplay (failed to distribute due to not claiming manually, network fluctuations, leaving the map early, etc.). We have stored the rewards in your mailbox; please collect them in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在冒险中达到天使之王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of King of Angels in the Adventure. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在冒险中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Emperor of Conquest in the Adventure. Below are your title rewards.</>",
