    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在命运时刻中达到血色亲王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Blood Prince in Moment of Fate. The following is your title reward. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在神座之争中获得以下胜场奖励，请查收。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have obtained the following victory rewards in the Battle for the Throne of God. Please check them. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在神座之争中达到天使之王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of King of Angels in the Battle for the Throne of God. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在神座之争中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Emperor of Conquest in the Battle for the Throne of God. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在神座之争中达到星辰之主段位，称号奖励已解锁，可前往称号界面使用。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Lord of Stars in the Battle for the Throne of God. The title reward has been unlocked and can be used in the title interface.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在神座之争中达到血色亲王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Crimson Prince in the Battle for the Throne of God. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在终末猎杀中达到天使之王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of King of Angels in the Final Hunt. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在终末猎杀中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Emperor of Conquest in the Final Hunt. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在终末猎杀中达到星辰之主段位，称号奖励已解锁，可前往称号界面使用。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Lord of Stars in the Final Hunt. The title reward has been unlocked and can be used in the title interface.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在终末猎杀中达到血色亲王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Crimson Prince in the Final Hunt. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在趣斗中达到天使之王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of King of Angels in Competition. The following is your title reward. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在趣斗中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Conqueror Emperor in Competition. The following is your title reward. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在趣斗中达到星辰之主段位，称号奖励已解锁，可前往称号界面使用。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Lord of Stars in Competition. The title reward has been unlocked and can be used in the title interface. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在趣斗中达到血色亲王段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Blood Prince in Competition. The following is your title reward. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您完成了轻松躺赢任务未领取每周奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>You completed the Easy Lay-Back quest but did not claim the weekly rewards. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您完成了轻松躺赢任务未领取每日奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>You completed the Easy Lay-Back quest but did not claim the daily rewards. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您已成为新会长，请及时设置俱乐部英雄！<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302513\">点击前往设置</></>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have become the new president. Please set your club heroes in time! <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302513\">Click to go and set</></>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您已被设置为俱乐部英雄！请及时领取奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have been set as a club hero! Please claim your rewards in time. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您所在的家族中%s对%s发起的弹劾流程已结束，%s已成为新的家族首席。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>The impeachment process initiated by %s against %s in your family has ended, and %s has become the new Family Chief.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您所在的家族中%s对%s发起的弹劾流程已结束，当前家族首席已回归并拒绝了您的弹劾流程。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>The impeachment process initiated by %s against %s in your family has ended. The current Family Chief has returned and rejected your impeachment process.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您所在的家族中的%s已对首席%s发起弹劾流程。弹劾流程倒计时结束后，若首席仍没有上线处理，则%s将成为新的家族首席。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>%s in your family has initiated an impeachment process against the Chief %s. After the impeachment process countdown ends, if the Chief still has not logged in to handle it, %s will become the new Family Chief.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您昨日的愚者福音奖励尚未领取。我们为您将奖励储存于邮箱中，请及时领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your Fool's Gospel rewards from yesterday have not been claimed. We have stored the rewards in your mailbox; please collect them in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您未领取之前俱乐部秘仪奉献物品，已自动发放到您邮箱内。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You did not claim your previous Club ritual offering items. They have been automatically sent to your mailbox.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您未领取之前赛季的段位奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You did not claim your rank rewards from the previous season. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您的背包剩余空间不足，或领取的物品超出最大持有数量限制，我们已为您将部分无法领取的道具暂时存放于邮箱中，请先清理背包中的物品，再于附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your inventory does not have enough space, or the items you are claiming exceed the maximum holding limit. We have temporarily stored some items that could not be claimed in your mailbox. Please clear your inventory before claiming them from the attachments.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您的背包已满，我们为您将部分道具暂时存放于邮箱中，请及时在附件中领取。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>Your inventory is full. We have temporarily stored some items in your mailbox. Please collect them from the attachments in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>战令活动已结束，未领取的奖励已通过邮件发放，请及时查收。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The Battle Pass event has ended. Unclaimed rewards have been sent via mail; please check them in time.</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>本周俱乐部积分已结算，您的俱乐部排名为%s，可获得%s个俱乐部英雄名额！<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302513\">点击前往设置俱乐部英雄！</></>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The club points for this week have been settled. Your club's ranking is %s, and you can receive %s club hero slots! <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302513\">Click to go and set your club heroes! </></>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>本轮四方联赛已结束，您已获得赛事奖励领取资格。请前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302310\">【赛事奖励】</><M_Default>领取本周奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>This round of the Four-Way League has ended, and you have obtained the qualification to claim tournament rewards. Please go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302310\">[Tournament Rewards]</><M_Default> to claim this week's rewards. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>检测到您的角色存在言论违规行为，现已被禁言处理。</>\n良好的游戏环境需要广大非凡者共同维护，请您自觉遵守规则。\n若您有任何疑问，可以通过客服途径进行反馈，或者在反馈界面留下您的建议。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>It has been detected that your character has engaged in speech violations and has now been muted. </>\nA healthy gaming environment requires the joint maintenance of all Beyonders; please consciously abide by the rules. \nIf you have any questions, you can provide feedback through customer service channels or leave your suggestions in the feedback interface.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>这是您在答题活动中获得的奖励，感谢您的参与！</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>These are the rewards you earned in the quiz event. Thank you for participating!</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>这是您在迷雾残影中获得的排名奖励，感谢您的参与！</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>These are the ranking rewards you earned in the Mist Shadows. Thank you for participating!</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>限时外观</><M_Orange>%s</>将在<M_Orange>24小时</>内到期，到期后将对其进行回收，请您留意。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The limited-time appearance </><M_Orange>%s</> will expire within <M_Orange>24 hours</>. It will be reclaimed after expiration; please take note.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>限时外观</><M_Orange>%s</>有效期已结束，已对其进行回收，请您留意。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The validity period of the limited-time appearance </><M_Orange>%s</> has ended, and it has been reclaimed; please take note.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>：你重复获得了坐骑%s，现已转化为以下道具，请查收。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>: You have obtained a duplicate mount %s, which has now been converted into the following items. Please check them.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周日20:45，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周日20:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Sunday at 20:45. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 20:30 on Sunday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”第一场搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周五20:00，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周五19:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe first \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Friday at 20:00. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 19:30 on Friday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”第三场搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周五20:00，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周五19:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe third \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Friday at 20:00. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 19:30 on Friday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”第二场搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周三20:00，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周三19:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe second \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Wednesday at 20:00. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 19:30 on Wednesday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n　　《诡秘之主》游戏的公测版本终于迎来了与非凡者的相见之日。非凡世界的大门在此为您敞开，欢迎来到诡秘之主的世界！\n　　为庆祝非凡者跨越灰雾，从旧日而来，降临到这个世界，我们特此献上了一份您的专属礼物表达感谢。\n　　感谢您的参与，您将是诡秘之主世界中恢弘故事展开的重要一环。期待您在非凡世界日后的冒险之旅，祝您旅途愉快！"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n The open beta version of the Lord of Mysteries game has finally arrived to meet the Beyonders. The doors to the Extraordinary World are open for you here; welcome to the world of Lord of Mysteries! \n To celebrate Beyonders crossing the gray fog, coming from the Great Old One, and descending into this world, we have specially presented an exclusive gift to express our gratitude. \n Thank you for your participation. You will be an important part of the unfolding of the magnificent story in the world of Lord of Mysteries. We look forward to your future adventures in the Extraordinary World. Have a pleasant journey!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n　　你好！我是萨默尔太太，爱情与誓约的见证者。\n　　在这个充满未知与危险的世界里，能找到一个可以托付信任的人是何等幸运。我听闻你已在非凡世界中站稳脚跟，或许也该考虑寻找那个能与你并肩同行的人生伴侣了。\n　　若你有兴趣了解誓约的事宜，欢迎携带这枚誓约之证随时来找我。我在霍纳奇斯花海那里等你。\n　　愿女神的光辉照耀你的前路。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\n　　Hello! I am Mrs. Sammer, a witness to love and Covenants. \n　　In this world full of unknowns and dangers, how lucky it is to find someone you can entrust your trust to. I have heard that you have established a firm footing in the Extraordinary World, and perhaps you should consider finding that life partner who can walk by your side. \n　　If you are interested in learning about Covenants, you are welcome to bring this Proof of Covenant and come to see me at any time. I will be waiting for you at the Hornacis Sea of Flowers. \n　　May the Goddess's radiance shine upon your path.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n冷静期已结束，您与誓约对象的誓约已正式解除。\n过往的羁绊不会消失，愿各自的前路依然精彩。\n<M_Default>故事迎来终章，但廷根的街道上总会有新的相遇。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nThe cooling-off period has ended, and your Covenant with your partner has been officially dissolved. \nPast bonds will not disappear. May your respective paths ahead remain brilliant. \n<M_Default>The story has reached its final chapter, but there will always be new encounters on the streets of Tingen. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n在本次势力战中，决胜战场的<M_Orange>%s</>代表的<M_Orange>%s</>势力获得了完胜，给本战区所有该势力的参与玩家发放如下奖励，请查收"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nIn this faction war, the <M_Orange>%s</> faction represented by <M_Orange>%s</> on the decisive battlefield has achieved a complete victory. The following rewards are issued to all participating players of this faction in this war zone. Please check them.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您俱乐部本周战略服排名d%，获得神选席位d%个。\n    愿诸位旗开得胜，凯旋而归！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYour club's ranking in the Strategic Server this week is d%, and you have obtained d% God-chosen seats. \n    May you all win your first battle and return in triumph!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与了世界灾厄活动且未领取奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYou participated in the World Calamity event and did not claim your rewards. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与了歌剧魅影的搭配阶段，最终搭配总评为%s，对应奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYou participated in the matching phase of the Phantom of the Opera. Your final total score is %s, and the corresponding rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与了歌剧魅影的比赛阶段，奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nYou participated in the competition phase of Phantom Corridor, and the rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与了签到活动且未领取奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYou participated in the check-in event and did not claim your rewards. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与了赛季指引活动且未领取奖励，补发奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nYou participated in the season guide event and did not claim your rewards. The reissued rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您参与的【俱乐部乱斗】活动已结束，您在本届比赛中获得第<M_Orange>%s</>名，其中您召唤的幻象投影<M_Orange>%s</>得分最高，累计得分<M_Orange>%s</>点，<M_Orange>%s</>击败最多，累计击败<M_Orange>%s</>名投影。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe 【Club Brawl】 event you participated in has ended. You placed <M_Orange>%s</> in this competition. Among them, the phantom projection <M_Orange>%s</> you summoned scored the highest, with a cumulative score of <M_Orange>%s</> points, and <M_Orange>%s</> defeated the most, with a cumulative total of <M_Orange>%s</> projections defeated.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您发起了誓约解除申请，双方将进入24小时冷静期。冷静期内您可以主动取消解除申请，冷静期后誓约将正式结束。<M_Default>给对方一些时间，也再给自己一次思考的机会。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYou have initiated a request to dissolve the Covenant. Both parties will enter a 24-hour cooling-off period. During the cooling-off period, you can actively cancel the dissolution request. After the cooling-off period, the Covenant will officially end. <M_Default>Give the other party some time, and give yourself another chance to think. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您在本赛季参与歌剧魅影活动数达到了俱乐部的前五名，根据最终的俱乐部组别，对应奖励已自动发放到您邮箱内。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nYour participation count in the Phantom Corridor event this season reached the top five in the Club. Based on the final Club group, the corresponding rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您已被选中成为本届俱乐部乱斗的幻象投影，期待您的化身的精彩表现。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302301\">【点击此处】</>查看详情。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nYou have been selected to become a phantom projection for this Club Brawl. We look forward to the wonderful performance of your avatar. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302301\">[Click here]</> to view details.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部<M_Orange>%s</>已开启<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302301\">【俱乐部乱斗】</>活动，前往参加即可以获得丰厚奖励，排名优异者更能获得<M_Orange>限定称号</>奖励！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe Club <M_Orange>%s</> you belong to has started the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302301\">【Club Brawl】</> event. Participate to receive generous rewards, and those with excellent rankings can even win <M_Orange>limited title</> rewards!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部<M_Orange>%s</>已经连续<M_Orange>%s</>天处于低活跃状态，由于议事厅等级已于上周降至<M_Orange>%s</>级，俱乐部被解散。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe Club <M_Orange>%s</> you belong to has been in a state of low activity for <M_Orange>%s</> consecutive days. Since the Council Hall level dropped to <M_Orange>%s</> last week, the Club has been disbanded.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部<M_Orange>%s</>已经连续<M_Orange>%s</>天处于低活跃状态，议事厅等级已降低至<M_Orange>%s</>级。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYour club <M_Orange>%s</> has been in a low-activity state for <M_Orange>%s</> consecutive days, and the Council Hall level has been reduced to <M_Orange>%s</>.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您所在的俱乐部已被邀请加入盛大的贸易战争，您所在的俱乐部将获得以下站点的管理权：%s，利用好他们，在贸易战争中让廷根再次伟大吧！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYour club has been invited to join the grand Trade War. Your club will gain management rights over the following sites: %s. Make good use of them and Make Tingen Great Again in the Trade War!",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n您的誓约对象%s发起了誓约解除申请，双方将进入24小时冷静期。冷静期内对方可以主动取消解除申请，冷静期后誓约将正式结束。<M_Default>或许只是暂时的迷茫，不妨给对方一些时间。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nYour Covenant partner %s has initiated a request to dissolve the Covenant. Both parties will enter a 24-hour cooling-off period. During the cooling-off period, the other party can actively cancel the dissolution request. After the cooling-off period, the Covenant will officially end. <M_Default>Perhaps it is just temporary confusion; you might as well give the other party some time. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n本届<M_Orange>【俱乐部乱斗】</>现已结束，您被选做幻象投影并获得了以下限时称号奖励：<M_Orange>【%s】</>，可前往称号界面查看详情。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThis <M_Orange>【Club Brawl】</> has now ended. You were selected as a phantom projection and received the following limited-time title reward: <M_Orange>【%s】</>. You can go to the title interface to view the details.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n本轮赛区战区分配已结束，可前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302324\">【战略服】</><M_Default>界面查看。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nThe war zone allocation for this round has ended. You can go to the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302324\">【Strategic Server】</><M_Default> interface to view it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n歌剧魅影搭配阶段已经结束，稍后即将开启正式比赛，欢迎前往魅影长廊进行观看。\n调整阶段已开启，会长/副会长还可通过调整顺序提升队伍的胜率，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250321\">前往调整</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe Phantom Corridor matching phase has ended. The official competition will begin shortly; you are welcome to go to the Phantom Corridor to watch. \nThe adjustment phase has begun. The President/Vice President can still increase the team's win rate by adjusting the order. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250321\">Go to adjust</>",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n经过一个赛季的努力，您的段位达到<M_Red>%s</><M_Default>段！已根据当前段位重置新的赛季段位，请在附件中查收段位奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder:</>\nAfter a season of hard work, your rank has reached <M_Red>%s</><M_Default>! The new season rank has been reset based on your current rank. Please check the rank rewards in the attachments.</>",
    ["<M_Default>各位俱乐部成员请注意：</>\n    战略服筛选阶段的联赛前两轮结束后，本俱乐部凭借<M_Default>战略服筛选总积分前4名</>的成绩，成功晋级<M_Default>四方联赛天启组</>，并获得<M_Default>参与战略服的资格</>，将作为<M_Default>本服赛区代表</>之一，与其余三家晋级俱乐部共同前往战略服！\n【特别说明】\n    1. <M_Default>晋级期内（自本邮件发送起1个月）</>，本俱乐部不再参与本服务器本赛季后续四方联赛，准备参与战略服后续玩法。\n    2. 战略服开放时间、参与方式及后续玩法安排将以后续公告为准，请会长/理事密切关注。\n    3. 请抓紧时间整军备战、协调阵容、调度资源，为本服赛区争夺更高荣誉！\n    愿诸位旗开得胜，凯旋而归！"] = "<M_Default>Attention all club members: </>\n After the first two rounds of the league in the strategic server screening stage, this club successfully advanced to the <M_Default>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> by virtue of being in the <M_Default>top 4 in total points for the strategic server screening</>, and obtained the <M_Default>qualification to participate in the strategic server</>. We will go to the strategic server together with the other three advancing clubs as one of the <M_Default>representatives of this server's division</>! \n[Special Note]\n 1. <M_Default>During the advancement period (1 month from the sending of this email)</>, this club will no longer participate in the subsequent Four-Way League of this server this season, and will prepare to participate in the subsequent gameplay of the strategic server. \n 2. The opening time, participation method, and subsequent gameplay arrangements for the strategic server will be subject to subsequent announcements. Please have the president/councilors pay close attention. \n 3. Please hurry up to prepare for battle, coordinate lineups, and allocate resources to fight for higher honors for this server's division! \n May you all win the first battle and return in triumph!",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的教团成员：</>\n\n       原初的恩赐已从你身上消失。\n       由于你上周缺席了两次魅惑邀约，这让你的魅力在镜中世界里逐渐黯淡。根据教团守则，自下周起，你的魅力将暂时蒙尘（魅力属性-5），直至你重新参与两次魅惑邀约并获得胜利，方可恢复魔女的青睐。\n       莫要让镜中那个完美的自己彻底消失。"] = "<M_Default>Respected member of the Church: </>\n\n The gift of the Primordial has disappeared from you. \n Because you missed two Charm Invitations last week, your charm has gradually dimmed in the Mirror World. According to the Church's code, starting next week, your charm will be temporarily tarnished (Charm attribute -5) until you participate in two Charm Invitations again and achieve victory, only then can you restore the favor of the Witch. \n Do not let that perfect self in the mirror disappear completely.",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的教团成员：</>\n\n       黑夜的眷顾并非永恒。\n       经查明，你上周未能成功完成三次安魂仪式。根据教团守则，自本周起，你的直觉将暂时受到压制（直觉属性-5），直至你当周重新成功完成三次安魂仪式。\n       愿黑夜指引你回归宁静。"] = "<M_Default>Respected member of the Church: </>\n\n The favor of the Night is not eternal. \n It has been verified that you failed to successfully complete the Requiem Ceremony three times last week. According to the Church's code, starting this week, your intuition will be temporarily suppressed (Intuition attribute -5) until you successfully complete the Requiem Ceremony three times again within the current week. \n May the Night guide you back to peace.",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>我们已收到您的退款申请，并回收退款金额涉及的等价数量的金镑/绑定金镑。</>\n<M_Default>如有疑问，您可联系游戏内的客服进行咨询。感谢您一直以来对《诡秘之主》游戏的支持与理解！</>"] = "<M_Default>Respected Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>We have received your refund application and have reclaimed the equivalent amount of Pounds/Bound Pounds involved in the refund. </>\n<M_Default>If you have any questions, you can contact the in-game customer service for consultation. Thank you for your continued support and understanding of the \"Lord of Mysteries\" game! </>",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>本场四方联赛已落下帷幕，本俱乐部获得了%s点战略服预选积分。感谢各位成员的并肩奋战，愿我们继续携手前行，在接下来的征程中再创佳绩！</>\n<M_Default>可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302324\">【战略服】</><M_Default>界面查看。</>"] = "<M_Default>Respected Beyonder:</>\n<M_Default>This Four-Way League has come to an end. This club has obtained %s Strategic Server pre-selection points. Thank you to all members for fighting side by side. May we continue to move forward together and achieve even better results in the upcoming journey! </>\n<M_Default>You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302324\">【Strategic Server】</><M_Default> interface to view it. </>",
    ["<M_Default>尊敬的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>系统检测到您的账号存在恶意退款风险，现已回收退款金额等价数量的金镑/绑定金镑，并限制了商城、交易行以及灵界召唤相关功能，您可在补齐金镑/绑定金镑后解除相关限制。</>\n<M_Default>若恶意退款持续，此账号或将面临处罚：包括但不限于账号永久封禁。为了您的账号安全，请您仔细确认物品信息谨慎购买，感谢您的配合与理解！</>\n<M_Default>如有疑问，您可联系游戏内客服进行咨询。</>"] = "<M_Default>Respected Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The system has detected that your account is at risk of malicious refund. We have reclaimed the equivalent amount of Pounds/Bound Pounds for the refund amount and restricted functions related to the mall, trading house, and Spirit World summoning. You can lift the relevant restrictions after making up the Pounds/Bound Pounds. </>\n<M_Default>If malicious refunding continues, this account may face penalties: including but not limited to permanent account ban. For the safety of your account, please carefully confirm item information and purchase with caution. Thank you for your cooperation and understanding! </>\n<M_Default>If you have any questions, you can contact in-game customer service for consultation. </>",
    ["<M_Default>尊贵的非凡者阁下：</>\n　　你是那位伟大存在特别眷顾之人，世界也因你的活跃而焕新。如今，我将替祂感谢你在这里付出的一切，为你定制了一份特别礼物。\n　　请收下这份与你相称的荣光，领取属于你的专属充值奖励。"] = "<M_Default> Honorable Beyonder: </>\n You are one specially favored by that Great Old One, and the world has been renewed by your activity. Now, I shall thank you on Their behalf for everything you have contributed here and have customized a special gift for you. \n Please accept this glory befitting you and claim your exclusive top-up rewards.",
    ["<M_Default>致新同事：</>\n\n       我注意到你已经收集到了不少的异象之物，我最近正好在俱乐部这边停留，记得有空来找我，我为你准备了丰厚的兑换奖励。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000009\">【前往俱乐部】</>\n\n       顺便多说一句——如果你还没加入俱乐部，那我非常建议你来试试。官方非凡者的身份虽然好用，但有些门路和消息，只有在这种地方才能获取。我在值夜者之外，也总需要一些自己的“消息来源”和“熟人圈子”，这些在非凡之路的晋升上帮过我不止一次。\n\n       总之，先来俱乐部找我。兑换的事，当面交接比较稳妥。      "] = "<M_Default> To my new colleague: </>\n\n I noticed you have collected quite a few Objects of Phenomenon. I happen to be staying at the Club recently; remember to come find me when you have time. I have prepared generous exchange rewards for you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000009\"> [Go to Club] </> \n \n By the way—if you haven't joined a Club yet, I highly recommend you try it. While being an official Beyonder is useful, some channels and information can only be obtained in such places. Outside of the Nighthawks, I always need my own \"sources of information\" and \"circle of acquaintances.\" These have helped me more than once in my advancement on the path of the Beyonder. \n\n Anyway, come find me at the Club first. It's safer to handle the exchanges in person.",
    ["<M_Default>致春夜的宠儿：</>\n\n　　渴望美之人，你已被春夜选中。\n\n　　若你想要了解真相，想要触及美或毁灭，请前往珠宝店门口右侧， 寻找莉丝·埃文斯。\n　　她会告诉你一切。"] = "<M_Default>To the darling of the spring night: </>\n\n You who long for beauty, you have been chosen by the spring night. \n\n If you want to know the truth, if you want to touch beauty or destruction, please go to the right side of the jewelry store entrance and look for Lis Evans. \n She will tell you everything.",
    ["<M_Default>被黑夜眷顾的灵魂：</>\n\n　　若你听到了安宁的呼唤，请前往拉斐尔墓园，寻找守夜人赛勒斯·莫宁。\n　　他会为你揭示真相。\n\n　　愿黑夜庇护你。"] = "<M_Default>Soul favored by the Night: </>\n\n If you have heard the call of peace, please go to Raphael Cemetery and look for the Nighthawk, Cyrus Morning. \n He will reveal the truth to you. \n\n May the Night shelter you.",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>已向你的俱乐部发起宣战，静候回应。 请在<M_Orange>1小时内</>前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【俱乐部宣战】</>作出裁决——逾期未应，将视为自动认输，<M_Orange>并扣除相应俱乐部资金</>。"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has declared war on your club. Awaiting response. Please go to <M_Orange>within 1 hour</> to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【Club War Declaration】</> to make a ruling—failure to respond will be considered an automatic forfeit, <M_Orange>and the corresponding club funds will be deducted</>.",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>已向你的俱乐部发起宣战，静候回应。 请在<M_Orange>1小时内</>前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【俱乐部宣战】</>作出裁决——逾期未应，将视为自动认输，<M_Orange>并扣除相应俱乐部资金</>。\n可点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【俱乐部宣战玩法攻略】</>查看玩法攻略！"] = "<M_Orange> [%s] </> has declared war on your Club. We await your response. Please proceed to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\"> [Club War] </> within <M_Orange> 1 hour </> to make a judgment—failure to respond within the time limit will be considered an automatic forfeiture, <M_Orange> and the corresponding Club funds will be deducted </>. \n You can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\"> [Club War Strategy Guide] </> to view the guide!",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，决斗将在<M_Orange>[今天%s]</>开启。战火已至，胜负即将揭晓——霍纳奇斯山脉将见证这场决斗的结局。为了共同的荣耀，全员就位。\n可点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【俱乐部宣战玩法攻略】</>查看玩法攻略！"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has accepted the declaration of war initiated by our club. The duel will begin on <M_Orange>[Today%s]</>. The flames of war have arrived, and the outcome is about to be revealed—the Hornacis Mountain Range will witness the end of this duel. For our shared glory, all members, take your positions. \nYou can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【Club Declaration of War Gameplay Guide】</> to view the gameplay guide!",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>接受了我方俱乐部发起的宣战，决斗将在<M_Orange>[明天%s]</>开启。战火已至，胜负即将揭晓——霍纳奇斯山脉将见证这场决斗的结局。为了共同的荣耀，全员就位。\n可点击<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【俱乐部宣战玩法攻略】</>查看玩法攻略！"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has accepted the declaration of war initiated by our club. The duel will begin on <M_Orange>[Tomorrow%s]</>. The flames of war have arrived, and the outcome is about to be revealed—the Hornacis Mountain Range will witness the end of this duel. For our shared glory, all members, take your positions. \nYou can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【Club Declaration of War Gameplay Guide】</> to view the gameplay guide!",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部和<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部因为俱乐部资金不足被强制合并，望各位成员团结一心，一起发展新的俱乐部！"] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club and <M_Orange>%s </> Club have been forcibly merged due to insufficient club funds. We hope all members will unite and develop the new club together!",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部已完成响应，成功建立！\n· 加入俱乐部后每天可以参与特色玩法。\n· 可获得专属的俱乐部领地。\n· 还能带领会员参与联赛，赢取最高荣耀。\n· 参与活动前请先确认职位分配情况，正式会员是俱乐部的中坚力量，可以参与俱乐部内的玩法活动；候补成员是俱乐部的储备力量，部分俱乐部活动无法参与，可以保持活跃状态，联系管理转正为会员。"] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club has finished responding and was successfully established! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member.",
    ["<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部欢迎您的加入！\n· 加入俱乐部后每天可以参与特色玩法。\n· 可获得专属的俱乐部领地。\n· 还能带领会员参与联赛，赢取最高荣耀。\n· 参与活动前请先确认职位分配情况和活动途径人数限制，正式会员是俱乐部的中坚力量，可以参与俱乐部内的玩法活动；候补成员是俱乐部的储备力量，部分俱乐部活动无法参与，可以保持活跃状态，联系管理转正为会员。"] = "<M_Orange>%s </> Club welcomes you! \n· After joining a club, you can participate in special gameplay every day. \n· You can obtain exclusive club territory. \n· You can also lead members to participate in leagues and win the highest glory. \n· Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation and activity pathway participant limits. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in club activities; reserve members are the reserve force of the club and cannot participate in some club activities. You can maintain activity and contact management to be promoted to an official member.",
    ["<M_Red>%s</>分钟后过期自动<M_Red>删除</>"] = "<M_Red>%s</> Expires in minutes and will be automatically <M_Red> deleted </>",
    ["<M_Red>%s</>天后过期自动<M_Red>删除</>"] = "<M_Red>%s</> Expires in days and will be automatically <M_Red> deleted </>",
    ["<M_Red>%s</>小时后过期自动<M_Red>删除</>"] = "<M_Red>%s</> Expires in hours and will be automatically <M_Red> deleted </>",
    ["<M_Red>1</>分钟后过期自动<M_Red>删除</>"] = "<M_Red>1</> minutes until automatic <M_Red>deletion</>",
    ["<M_Red>5</><M_Default>天后到期</><M_Red>24小时后自动删除</>"] = "<M_Red> 5 </> <M_Default> Expires in days </> <M_Red> Automatically deleted after 24 hours </>",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得200绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷1</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      欢迎您来到这片交织隐秘与启示的世界，愿灵性为您指引前路。\n      尽管这是初次步入此间，但您或许已经对眼前徐徐展开的世界有了独特的感知与构想。我们始终以敬畏之心观察并记录着一切——您在此间每一瞬的所见、所思与所感，在我们看来皆是珍贵的启示。在此，我们诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，向我们传达您的想法。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 200 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 1</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      Welcome to this world intertwined with secrets and revelations. May your spirituality guide your path. \n      Although this is your first time stepping into this place, you may already have unique perceptions and ideas about the world unfolding before you. We always observe and record everything with awe—every moment of what you see, think, and feel here is a precious revelation to us. Here, we sincerely invite you to convey your thoughts to us through the secret channel in the letter. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得200绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷1</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    欢迎您来到这片交织隐秘与启示的世界，愿灵性为您指引前路。\n    尽管这是初次步入此间，但您或许已经对眼前徐徐展开的世界有了独特的感知与构想。我们始终以敬畏之心观察并记录着一切——您在此间每一瞬的所见、所思与所感，在我们看来皆是珍贵的启示。在此，我们诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，向我们传达您的想法。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 200 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 1</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    Welcome to this world intertwined with secrets and revelations. May your spirituality guide your path. \n    Although this is your first time stepping into this place, you may already have unique perceptions and ideas about the world unfolding before you. We always observe and record everything with awe—every moment of what you see, think, and feel here is a precious revelation to us. Here, we sincerely invite you to convey your thoughts to us through the secret channel in the letter. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷2</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n      自从您被命运召唤来到这个世界之后，想必您已初步领略了廷根的风貌。在街巷中，是哪里让您第一次驻足，感受到了这个世界的真实？在战斗中，是哪个瞬间让您心跳加速，成功“扮演”了您的序列身份？在剧情里，又是哪个选择或哪句台词，触动了您的心弦？\n      无论您的答案为何，我们都将无比珍视。诚邀您再次通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的见证与感悟传递给我们。您的每一处洞察，都将助力我们雕琢出更真实的诡秘世界。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 300 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 2</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      May your Extraordinary journey be smooth and steady. \n      Since you were summoned by fate to this world, you have likely had a preliminary taste of Tingen's style. In the streets and alleys, where was the place that made you stop for the first time and feel the reality of this world? In battle, which moment made your heart race as you successfully \"acted\" out your Sequence identity? In the story, which choice or line touched your heartstrings? \n      Whatever your answer may be, we will cherish it immensely. We sincerely invite you to convey your witness and insights to us again through the secret channel in the letter. Every one of your insights will help us carve out a more realistic world of mysteries. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-PVE专题</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n    在这个世界的旅途中，您是否曾接受弗莱队长的委托，作为黑荆棘安保公司的一员，守护城市的安宁？又是否曾步入五月庄园的幽暗深处，解开其核心的秘密？诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您在事件簿中的经历、感受与建议分享给我们。\n    您的每一份建议 ，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVE Special</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your Beyonder path be smooth and steady. \n    During your journey in this world, have you ever accepted a commission from Captain Frye and, as a member of the Blackthorn Security Company, guarded the peace of the city? Or have you ever stepped into the dark depths of May Manor to unravel its core secrets? We sincerely invite you to share your experiences, feelings, and suggestions in the event log with us through the secret channel in the letter. \n    Every suggestion of yours will help us carve out a more real world. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-PVP专题</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿灵性为您指引前路。\n    我们希望了解您对游戏当前PVP竞技玩法的真实体验与看法。整体战斗是否紧张刺激？不同模式的平衡性、匹配机制或战斗节奏，是否有让您觉得不够满意、有待优化之处？\n    诚邀您点击邮件中的隐秘通道，将您在对战中的宝贵感受与建议分享给我们。\n    您的反馈将直接帮助我们优化战斗平衡、完善匹配体验，打磨更公平激烈的竞技环境。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - PVP Special</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your spirituality guide your path. \n    We hope to understand your true experience and views on the game's current PVP competitive gameplay. Is the overall combat tense and exciting? Are there any aspects of the balance, matching mechanism, or combat rhythm of different modes that you feel are unsatisfactory or need optimization? \n    We sincerely invite you to click the secret channel in the email to share your valuable feelings and suggestions during the battle with us. \n    Your feedback will directly help us optimize combat balance, improve the matching experience, and polish a fairer and more intense competitive environment. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-休闲玩法专题</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n    在这个世界的旅途中，您是否曾驻足记录下某个令您心动的剪影？又是否曾于自己的居所中，塑造出一片独属于您的风景？诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的看法与建议分享给我们。\n    您的每一份建议，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - Leisure Gameplay Special</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your Beyonder path be smooth and steady. \n    During your journey in this world, have you ever stopped to record a silhouette that moved you? Or have you ever shaped a landscape unique to you in your own residence? We sincerely invite you to share your views and suggestions with us through the secret channel in the letter. \n    Every suggestion of yours will help us carve out a more real world. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷2</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n    自从您被命运召唤来到这个世界后，已经悄然过去了两日。在廷根的街巷之中，是哪里让您第一次驻足，感受到了这个世界的真实？在战斗中，是哪个瞬间让您心跳加速，成功\"扮演\"了您的序列身份？在剧情里，又是哪个选择或哪句台词，触动了您的心弦？\n    无论您的答案为何，我们都将无比珍视。诚邀您再次通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的见证与体悟传递给我们。您的每一处洞察，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 2</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your Beyonder path be smooth and steady. \n    Since you were summoned by fate to this world, two days have passed quietly. In the streets and alleys of Tingen, where did you first stop and feel the reality of this world? In battle, which moment made your heart race and allowed you to successfully \"act\" as your Sequence identity? In the story, which choice or line touched your heartstrings? \n    No matter what your answer is, we will cherish it immensely. We sincerely invite you to pass your witness and insights to us again through the secret channel in the letter. Every insight of yours will help us carve out a more real world. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷3</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      这些时日以来，您已在廷根留下了不少足迹。您的每一次战斗、每一次选择、每一次对这个世界产生的好奇心，都为我们照亮了前路。\n      此时此刻，随着体验和扮演的深入，您对这个世界是否有了更清晰的认知？有哪些内容让您印象深刻，又有哪些地方让您感到困惑或不够完善？这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为这个世界持续完善，所投下的重要一票。\n      您所传递的一切声音，都将成为指引我们前行的明灯。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 400 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 3</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      Over these days, you have left quite a few footprints in Tingen. Every battle, every choice, and every curiosity you have had about this world has illuminated the path forward for us. \n      At this very moment, as your experience and acting deepen, do you have a clearer understanding of this world? What content has left a deep impression on you, and what areas make you feel confused or imperfect? This is not just a questionnaire, but an important vote you are casting for the continuous improvement of this world. \n      Every voice you convey will become a beacon guiding us forward. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷4</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      在这段时光里，您穿梭在廷根的昼夜中，经历了战斗的紧张与剧情的跌宕，也在这个世界中留下了属于您的印记。从初次踏入到如今，您已对这个世界有了全面而深入的了解。\n      此时此刻，我们希望聆听您更完整的声音。回顾这段旅程，您最满意的体验是什么？哪些设计让您感到惊喜？又有哪些方面您认为还有提升的空间？这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为这个世界持续完善，所投下的关键一票。\n      您所传递的一切声音，都将成为指引我们前行的明灯。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 400 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 4</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      During this time, you have traveled through the days and nights of Tingen, experienced the tension of battle and the ups and downs of the story, and left your own mark on this world. From your first step in until now, you have gained a comprehensive and in-depth understanding of this world. \n      At this moment, we hope to hear your more complete voice. Looking back on this journey, what was your most satisfying experience? Which designs surprised you? And which aspects do you think still have room for improvement? This is not just a questionnaire, but a key vote you are casting for the continuous improvement of this world. \n      Every voice you convey will become a beacon guiding us forward. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷5</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n      在这个世界的旅途中，您是否曾踏入那座笼罩在迷雾中的古老庄园？您是否战胜了那忠诚的看门猎犬，击败了身披铠甲的守卫，又与那位管家展开了一场激烈的交锋？ \n      然而，五月庄园的秘密远不止于此。在更深的幽暗之中，仍有未曾揭开的谜团在等待着勇敢的探索者。诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的经历、感受与建议分享给我们——无论是已经历的挑战，还是对未来探索的期待。您的每一份建议，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red> \"Complete the questionnaire to receive 400 bound pounds!\" </>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\"> Open Beta Survey 5 </>\n Dear Beyonder: \n May your path as a Beyonder be smooth and steady. \n In your journey through this world, have you ever stepped into that ancient manor shrouded in mist? Have you overcome the loyal guard hound, defeated the armored guards, and engaged in a fierce confrontation with the butler? \n However, the secrets of May Manor go far beyond this. In the deeper darkness, there are still unsolved mysteries waiting for brave explorers. We cordially invite you to share your experiences, feelings, and suggestions with us through the secret channel in your letter—whether it be the challenges you have already faced or your expectations for future exploration. Every suggestion you provide will help us sculpt a more authentic world. \n Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion soon and master the extraordinary.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷3</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们的测试旅程已进行到第三天。这短短旅途中您的每一次战斗、每一次选择、每一次对这个世界产生的好奇心，都为我们照亮了前路。此时此刻，我们希望能再次聆听您的声音。这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为《诡秘之主》未来正式降临，所投下的重要一票。您所传递的一切声音，都将成为我们前行的锚点。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 400 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 3</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    Our test journey has reached its third day. Every battle, every choice, and every curiosity you have had about this world during this short journey has illuminated our path forward. At this moment, we hope to hear your voice again. This is not just a questionnaire, but an important vote you have cast for the future official descent of Lord of Mysteries. Every voice you convey will become an anchor for us to move forward. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷4</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们的测试旅程已进行到第七天。这一周的时光里，您穿梭在廷根的迷雾中，经历了战斗的紧张与剧情的跌宕，也在这个世界中留下了属于您的印记。每一次您的反馈，都在帮助我们更清晰地描绘出《诡秘之主》未来的模样。\n    此时此刻，我们希望能再次聆听您的声音。您在这一周中最深刻的感受是什么？哪些体验让您印象深刻，又有哪些地方让您觉得仍需完善？这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为这个世界未来的完整呈现，所投下的关键一票。您所传递的一切声音，都将成为我们前行的锚点。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>\"Complete the questionnaire to receive 400 Bound Pounds!\"</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\nDear Beyonder: \n Our test journey has reached the seventh day. In this week, you have traveled through the fog of Tingen, experienced the tension of battle and the ups and downs of the plot, and left your mark on this world. Every piece of your feedback helps us more clearly depict the future appearance of \"Lord of Mysteries\". \n At this moment, we hope to listen to your voice again. What is your most profound feeling this week? Which experiences left a deep impression on you, and which areas do you think still need improvement? This is not just a questionnaire, but a key vote you cast for the complete presentation of this world's future. Every voice you convey will become an anchor for us to move forward. \n Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion soon and master your Extraordinary powers.",
    ["<Mark id=\"#159\">私人</>垃圾桶，严禁乱丢垃圾！\n\n\n\n此垃圾桶仅供约翰一家使用，外人勿扰！违者后果自负！\n特别提醒：乱丢垃圾者，小心被<Hide id=\"#157\">“垃圾大王”</>盯上！——你不想惹麻烦吧？"] = "<Mark id=\"#159\"> Private </> trash can, littering is strictly prohibited! \n\n\n\n This trash can is for the John family only, outsiders keep away! Violators will bear the consequences! \n Special reminder: Litterers, beware of being targeted by the <Hide id=\"#157\"> \"Trash King\" </>! ——You don't want any trouble, do you?",
    ["<Mask>赠给：</><Mask_2>%s</>"] = "<Mask> gifted to: </><Mask_2>%s</>",
    ["<Name>#学徒除了送外卖还能干什么？</>在温暖的午后<Name>#学徒除了送外卖还能干什么？</>在温暖的午后"] = "<Name>#What can an Apprentice do besides delivering food?</> On a warm afternoon <Name>#What can an Apprentice do besides delivering food?</> On a warm afternoon",
    ["<NewRow>文本</>块"] = "<NewRow> Text </> block",
    ["<Not>剩余免费开启次数：%d</>"] = "<Not> remaining free attempts: %d</>",
    ["<Not>参与对应玩法可累积进度</>"] = "<Not>Participate in the corresponding gameplay to accumulate progress</>",
    ["<Notice>双人模式下和</><Highlight>誓约</><Notice>伙伴一起进入副本，可提升至副本</><Highlight>达标评分</><Notice>。</>\n\n乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。"] = "<Notice> Enter the dungeon in duo mode with </><Highlight> Covenant </><Notice> Partner to increase to the dungeon </><Highlight> target score </><Notice>. </>\n\n Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes within the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a hidden channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder's level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder's level.",
    ["<Notice>双人模式下和</><Highlight>誓约</><Notice>伙伴一起进入副本，可提升至副本</><Highlight>达标评分</><Notice>。</>\n\n乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的1.5倍。"] = "<Notice> Enter the dungeon in duo mode with </><Highlight> Covenant </><Notice> Partner to increase to the dungeon </><Highlight> target score </><Notice>. </>\n\n Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes within the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a hidden channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder's level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder's level. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 1.5 times that of the normal difficulty.",
    ["<Notice>双人模式下和</><Highlight>誓约</><Notice>伙伴一起进入副本，可提升至副本</><Highlight>达标评分</><Notice>。</>\n\n乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n每周竞速通关成绩进入本途径前100名的玩家将会获得专属头衔，为保证竞速公平，剧院中的敌人等级将会在每周一早上8:00更新。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的2倍。"] = "<Notice> Entering the dungeon with a </><Highlight> Covenant </><Notice> Partner in Duo Mode allows you to reach the dungeon's </><Highlight> Target Score </><Notice>. </>\n\n The Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes within the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia Small Town, clear out the lost-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun times enter the top 100 for this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fair competition, the levels of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Afterglow is twice that of Normal difficulty.",
    ["<Orange>世界剧情</>已解锁，点击此处查看。"] = "<Orange>World Plot</> is unlocked; click here to view.",
    ["<Orange>临时技能</>将显示在此处，点击触发"] = "<Orange>Temporary Skills</> will be displayed here; click to trigger.",
    ["<Orange>城市暗面</>中会刷新各种事件和挑战。"] = "Various events and challenges will refresh in the <Orange>City Dark Side</>.",
    ["<Orange>拖动轮盘</>进行移动"] = "<Orange> Drag the wheel </> to move",
    ["<Orange>检视信息</>显示在这里。"] = "<Orange>Inspection Information</> is displayed here.",
    ["<Orange>滑动屏幕</>转动物品，寻找<Orange>检视线索</>。"] = "<Orange>Swipe the screen</> to rotate the item and search for <Orange>Investigation Clues</>.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>%s</>发起了%s匹配"] = "<PVPHighlight>%s</> initiated %s matchmaking.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>%s</>取消了%s匹配"] = "<PVPHighlight>%s</> cancelled %s matchmaking.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>%s</>攻占了<PVPHighlight>%s</>。"] = "<PVPHighlight> %s </> captured <PVPHighlight> %s </>.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>%s</>攻占了我方<PVPHighlight>%s</>。"] = "<PVPHighlight> %s </> captured our <PVPHighlight> %s </>.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>巨龙·投影</>已离开<PVPHighlight>猎龙城王城中心</>，王城战鼓渐息，本轮讨伐暂告结束。"] = "<PVPHighlight> Dragon - Projection </> has left the <PVPHighlight> center of the Dragon Hunting City royal city </>, the royal city war drums fade, this round of subjugation has ended.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>巨龙·投影</>的灵性正在消散，<PVPHighlight>10分钟后</>将离开<PVPHighlight>猎龙城王城中心</>，请尽快完成讨伐。"] = "The spirituality of <PVPHighlight> Dragon - Projection </> is dissipating, it will leave the <PVPHighlight> center of the Dragon Hunting City royal city </> in <PVPHighlight> 10 minutes </>, please complete the subjugation as soon as possible.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>巨龙·投影</>的灵性正在消散，<PVPHighlight>5分钟后</>将离开<PVPHighlight>猎龙城王城中心</>，请尽快完成讨伐。"] = "The spirituality of <PVPHighlight> Dragon - Projection </> is dissipating, it will leave the <PVPHighlight> center of the Dragon Hunting City royal city </> in <PVPHighlight> 5 minutes </>, please complete the subjugation as soon as possible.",
    ["<PVPHighlight>巨龙·投影</>轰然溃散！本团队合力将其击退，成功取得本轮<PVPHighlight>最终拍卖奖励归属</>！"] = "The <PVPHighlight> Giant Dragon - Projection </> has collapsed! Our team worked together to repel it and successfully secured the final auction reward for this round <PVPHighlight> belonging to </>!",
    ["<P_Heart>  1万苏勒？？  这么便宜，说不定是骗子，占卜下看看</>"] = "<P_Heart> 10,000 Gold Pounds?? So cheap, maybe it's a scam, let's do a divination to see. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>  （哽咽）</> 我知道你还记得……为什么他平时那么强健，也挺不过这场流感呢？"] = "<P_Heart> (Choking with sobs) </> I know you still remember... Why was he so strong usually, yet he couldn't survive this flu?",
    ["<P_Heart> (Enthusiastic) </> Hello, {{先生|女士}}! This is Blackthorn Security Company."] = "<P_Heart> (Enthusiastic) </> Hello, {{Sir|Madam}}! This is Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Looks at you) </> You've learned very well! {{小伙子|小姑娘}}!"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks at you) </> You've learned very well! {{Young man|Young lady}}!",
    ["<P_Heart> (Muttering to oneself) </> {{他|她}} Knowing I am Watchtower and still asking if I'm a Beyonder, there must be some deep meaning behind it."] = "<P_Heart> (Muttering to oneself) </> {{He|She}} knowing I am Watchtower and still asking if I'm a Beyonder, there must be some deep meaning behind it.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{英俊的先生|优雅的女士}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet."] = "<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{handsome gentleman|elegant lady}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet.",
    ["<P_Heart> (This {{先生|女士}} I just met has been looking at me since just now, could it be—) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (This {{gentleman|lady}} I just met has been looking at me since just now, could it be—) </>",
    ["<P_Heart> (happily) </> I wish you wealth too, {{先生|女士}}!"] = "<P_Heart> (happily) </> I wish you wealth too, {{Sir|Madam}}!",
    ["<P_Heart> (sighs) </>, I understand that sometimes promises can become shackles, but please think twice, {{先生|女士}}. A unilateral termination will leave a rift between you. Is this really the result you want?"] = "<P_Heart> (sighs) </>, I understand that sometimes promises can become shackles, but please think twice, {{Sir|Madam}}. A unilateral termination will leave a rift between you. Is this really the result you want?",
    ["<P_Heart> （使用卜杖寻路找到约会的地点吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Use Dowsing Rod Navigation to find the meeting spot!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart> （压低声音）</>既然你问到了，我就不得不告诉你，其实我们这还有一种特调，叫“项圈”。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering his voice) </> Since you asked, I have to tell you that we actually have a special blend called 'Collar.'",
    ["<P_Heart> （声音越来越小）</>家里剩的钱不多了，廷根的工厂又在招男工，我想……"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice getting quieter) </> There isn't much money left at home, and the factories in Tingen are hiring male workers again, I think...",
    ["<P_Heart> （担忧地思考片刻）</> 嗯。琳达！——"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking worriedly for a moment) </> Hmm. Linda!—",
    ["<P_Heart> （温柔地笑）</> 每年拍一次，这是我们的老习惯了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling gently) </> Taking one every year is our old habit.",
    ["<P_Heart> （琳达的状态看起来不太好……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Linda's condition doesn't look very good...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart> （自言自语）</>幽灵？有机会去古堡看看……"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to himself) </> Ghost? I'll have a chance to go to the castle and see...",
    ["<P_Heart> （自言自语）</>托马斯，今天又有人要收购酒馆……"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to himself) </> Thomas, someone wants to buy the tavern again today...",
    ["<P_Heart> （试试占卜家最常用的灵摆占卜！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Try the most common Pendulum Divination for a Seer!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart> （那张残破票据是重要证据……马桶里的怨念来自死去的流浪者……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (That tattered receipt is important evidence... the resentment in the toilet comes from the dead homeless people...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>(Shaking head) </>No, this time let this {先生|女士} write it. Is that okay?"] = "<P_Heart>(Shaking head) </>No, this time let this {gentleman|lady} write it. Is that okay?",
    ["<P_Heart>(Spreads hands)</> So, we are of the same generation. She should also call you {{叔叔|姨姨}}."] = "<P_Heart>(Spreads hands)</> So, we are of the same generation. She should also call you {{Uncle|Aunt}}.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> That's right, Jenny... this {{先生|女士}}, do you know little Jenny?"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> That's right, Jenny... this {{gentleman|lady}}, do you know little Jenny?",
    ["<P_Heart>(Trembling)</> Are you sure, Witch {{先生|女士}}? He was just glowing a moment ago."] = "<P_Heart>(Trembling)</> Are you sure, Witch {{gentleman|lady}}? He was just glowing a moment ago.",
    ["<P_Heart>(小声)</> 小姐她…可能只是走远了赏景……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> The young lady... she might have just walked further away to enjoy the scenery...",
    ["<P_Heart>(小声)</>“流浪狗”是它最讨厌的单词，你可千万别在它面前提狗！"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> 'Stray dog' is its most hated word; you must never mention dogs in front of it!",
    ["<P_Heart>(小声)</>谁知道济贫院那些食物是用什么做的，万一是老鼠呢……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Who knows what the food in the poorhouse is made of? What if it's rats...",
    ["<P_Heart>(掏出机械装置)</>如果您想做什么，它的尖叫会让整个铁十字街都听见。"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes out a mechanical device) </> If you want to do anything, its scream will make the whole Iron Cross Street hear it.",
    ["<P_Heart>(无奈地打开门）</>……好吧，是我。"] = "<P_Heart>(Opens the door helplessly)</>...Alright, it's me.",
    ["<P_Heart>【获得铃铛】</>"] = "<P_Heart>【Obtained Bell】</>",
    ["<P_Heart>一座凭空出现的小镇……飞速盖起的建筑……还有这座小镇的名字，“乌托邦”……</>"] = "<P_Heart>A small town that appeared out of thin air... buildings that were built rapidly... and the name of this town, \"Utopia\"...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>不愧是大师，走路这么快……</>"] = "<P_Heart> As expected of a master, walking so fast... </>",
    ["<P_Heart>不知不觉地默念</>不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄黑之王……"] = "<P_Heart>Unconsciously chanting</> The Fool that doesn't belong to this era, the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck...",
    ["<P_Heart>他或许也在这里，去周围找找看吧。</>"] = "<P_Heart>He might be here too; let's look around.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>他这是心虚了？</>"] = "<P_Heart>Is he feeling guilty?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>似乎看见了一段……不太熟悉的历史……</>"] = "<P_Heart> Seems to have seen a piece of... unfamiliar history... </>",
    ["<P_Heart>冰冻</>标记触发星云咏叹减6秒冷却"] = "<P_Heart>Freeze</> Mark triggers Nebula Aria Cooldown reduction of 6 seconds",
    ["<P_Heart>刚才……应该不是巧合。</>"] = "<P_Heart> That just now... shouldn't have been a coincidence. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>印象里应该是这么做没错......要多加味精才够鲜......</>"] = "<P_Heart>I remember it should be done this way... need to add more MSG for it to be savory enough...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>印象里应该是这么做没错……要多加味精才够鲜……</>"] = "<P_Heart>In my memory, this is how it should be done... need to add plenty of MSG for it to be savory enough...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>嗯，只有进入非凡的世界，才有可能得知穿越的真相，才能回家。</>"] = "<P_Heart> Hmm, only by entering the Beyonder world can I possibly learn the truth about my transmigration and be able to go home. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>头有点晕晕的…….</>"] = "<P_Heart>My head feels a bit dizzy...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>头有点晕晕的……</>"] = "<P_Heart>My head feels a bit dizzy...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>好像没什么特别的，还是离开吧。</>"] = "<P_Heart> Doesn't seem like anything special, better leave. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>居然是真的？</>  愿神保佑您和您的家人。至于这宅子我愿意出钱。"] = "<P_Heart> It's actually true? </> May God bless you and your family. As for this house, I am willing to pay for it.",
    ["<P_Heart>工人们看起来很困惑……</>"] = "<P_Heart>The workers look confused...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>工人们看起来情绪高昂！</>"] = "<P_Heart>The workers look high-spirited!</>",
    ["<P_Heart>序列魔药都很危险，而我无法获得更多信息了。在这些前提下，我相信穿越者前辈留下的信息！</>"] = "<P_Heart>Sequence potions are all dangerous, and I can't obtain more information. Given these premises, I trust the information left by the transmigrator predecessor!</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我可以制作一些去火气的丝瓜汤，邀请大家品尝！</>"] = "<P_Heart>I can make some loofah soup to reduce internal heat and invite everyone to taste it!</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我怎么感觉......被当成小白鼠了......</>"] = "<P_Heart>Why do I feel like... I've been treated as a lab rat...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我想想，丝瓜......</>"] = "<P_Heart>Let me think, luffa...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我想想，丝瓜……</>"] = "<P_Heart>Let me think, loofahs...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我明白了，是因为这里的食谱有限，单卖丝瓜也缺少噱头，我有办法了。</>"] = "<P_Heart>I understand now. It's because the menu here is limited, and selling luffa alone lacks a gimmick. I have an idea.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我明白了，是因为这里的食谱有限，单卖丝瓜也缺少噱头，我有办法了。</> "] = "<P_Heart>I understand now. It's because the recipes here are limited, and selling loofahs alone lacks a gimmick. I have an idea.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>我选择——赌一把！</>"] = "<P_Heart> I choose—to take a gamble! </>",
    ["<P_Heart>或许应该推出一些女装……或者，女士们喜欢的男装。</>"] = "<P_Heart>Perhaps I should introduce some womenswear... or menswear that ladies would like.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>把乌鸦作为宠物？在鲁恩也不算罕见。</>"] = "<P_Heart>Keeping a crow as a pet? That's not exactly rare in Loen.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>整理一下思路吧。</>"] = "<P_Heart> Let's organize my thoughts. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>施佩尔先生的……灵感剧院？</>"] = "<P_Heart> Mr. Speer's... Theater of Inspiration? </>",
    ["<P_Heart>是的，我需要选择一条能帮我更好地研究、理解、掌握神秘学知识的非凡途径。</>"] = "<P_Heart>Yes, I need to choose an extraordinary pathway that can help me better research, understand, and master occult knowledge.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>吱……那天晚上……主人还没回来……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> Squeak... that night... the Master hadn't returned yet...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>吱吱吱！醒来后……主人就躺在厨房里……已经……已经凉了……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> Squeak squeak squeak! After I woke up... the Master was lying in the kitchen... already... already cold...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>它发出笑声……很轻，却让我灵体颤抖……它说……它已经收割了好多灵魂……这次也……势在必得……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> It laughed... very softly, but it made my spirit body tremble... It said... it had already harvested many souls... this time too... it was determined to succeed...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>它在地上画格子……一块、两块、好多块……那些格子泛着诡异的光……像是……像是某种秘术……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> It drew squares on the ground... one, two, many squares... those squares were glowing with an eerie light... like... like some kind of secret art...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>它说……它要的东西……就算只是路过的居民……也会一并收入囊中……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> It said... the things it wants... even if it's just a passing resident... it will take them all into its pocket...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>我不知怎的，好困好困……像是被什么东西……压住了灵性……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> I don't know why, I felt so sleepy... as if something... was suppressing my spirituality...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>然后……我就什么都不知道了……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> And then... I didn't know anything anymore...",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>迷迷糊糊中，我看见一团……漆黑的影子……在屋子里游走……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> In a daze, I saw a mass of... pitch-black shadow... wandering in the room...",
    ["<P_Heart>然后，为了达成这个目的，我最需要的途径能力是……</>"] = "<P_Heart>Then, to achieve this goal, the pathway ability I need most is...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>老先生没受伤就好……管不了那么多，还是先去买票吧。</>"] = "<P_Heart> As long as the old gentleman isn't hurt... I can't worry about that much, I'd better go buy the ticket first. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>脑袋怎么突然有点痛。</>"] = "<P_Heart>Why does my head suddenly hurt a bit?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>要讲些什么？</>"] = "<P_Heart>What are you going to talk about?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>许下愿望</>我希望……这里出现一座城堡……"] = "<P_Heart>Make a wish</> I wish... for a castle to appear here...",
    ["<P_Heart>路边售卖的廉价奶油蛋糕，上面写着：1350年 詹森35岁生日快乐！</>"] = "<P_Heart>Cheap cream cake sold on the roadside, with '1350, Happy 35th Birthday Jensen!' written on it.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>这下我要多做一些丝瓜汤了。.</>"] = "<P_Heart>I should make more luffa soup now.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>这下我要多做一些丝瓜汤了。</>"] = "<P_Heart>I'll have to make more loofah soup now.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>这双手套有一定厚度，可能隔绝体感……</>"] = "<P_Heart>These gloves have a certain thickness, they might be insulating my sense of touch...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>那么，我应该选哪条途径呢？</>"] = "<P_Heart>So, which pathway should I choose?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>风吹动桌上的书籍，让书页停留在某一章的开头。</>"] = "<P_Heart> The wind blows the books on the table, leaving the pages open at the beginning of a certain chapter. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>首先，我成为非凡者的主要目的是……</>"] = "<P_Heart>First, my main purpose for becoming a Beyonder is...</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（10镑？也不错啦……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(10 pounds? That's not bad...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（12镑就是240苏勒，或者2880铜便士，换算成穿越前的钱有一万多！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(12 pounds is 240 soli, or 2880 copper pence, which converts to over ten thousand in the money from before I transmigrated!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（1万镑？！按照班森之前的周薪，需要工作208年才能赚到1万镑。这金额即使在贝克兰德，也可以做个富翁了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (10,000 pounds?! Based on Benson's previous weekly salary, it would take 208 years to earn 10,000 pounds. This amount of money could make one a rich person even in Backlund!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（1镑是20苏勒，1苏勒又等同于12便士。而且这里1便士的购买力相当于穿越前的3、4块钱，那……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(1 pound is 20 soli, and 1 soli is equivalent to 12 pence. And here, the purchasing power of 1 penny is equivalent to 3 or 4 yuan before I transmigrated, so...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（5镑？！几乎是我两周的薪水……而且最近刚搬完家，交完租金后，手里剩下了不到2镑。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(5 pounds?! That's almost two weeks of my salary... and I just moved recently; after paying the rent, I have less than 2 pounds left.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“∞”符号还在发光。我们必须尽快破解循环。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The \"∞\" symbol is still glowing. We must break the cycle as soon as possible.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“占卜家”对应的序列8是小丑？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Sequence 8 corresponding to Seer is Clown?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“愚者”先生究竟是哪一位，这样威严又和善的存在……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Who exactly is Mr. Fool, such a majestic and kind existence...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“愚者”先生究竟是哪一位，这样威严又和善的神明……但是，不可直视神，不可质疑神。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Who exactly is Mr. Fool, such a majestic and kind god... but, one cannot look directly at a god, one cannot question a god.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“愚者”先生？！罗珊的婚事居然要过问一位真神？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Mr. 'Fool'?! Rozanne's marriage actually needs to be consulted by a True God?!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“月亮”先生调查的污染，会跟这个吸血鬼传闻有关吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could the contamination Mr. Moon investigated be related to these vampire rumors?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“梦想成真”？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(\"Dreams come true\"?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“正义”女士看起来很年轻，但很受尊敬，像一位大人物……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Ms. \"Justice\" looks young, but is highly respected, like a big shot...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“汤姆，我无法回应你的心情”、“杰茜小姐，我们是没有未来的”？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> ('Tom, I cannot respond to your feelings', 'Miss Jessie, we have no future'?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“聚会”能让我收获更多的非凡奥秘和神秘学知识，有助于将来穿越回去。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>('Gatherings' can allow me to gain more extraordinary mysteries and occult knowledge, which will help me return to my world in the future.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（“鱼人鳞片”明显是染色处理过的普通鱼鳞，那“海妖之石”更荒唐，不过是普通的蓝色玻璃。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (\"Merman scales\" are clearly just ordinary fish scales that have been dyed, and those \"Siren Stones\" are even more ridiculous—they're just common blue glass.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……他睡着了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...He fell asleep...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……但我不敢高声说话，唯恐惊扰了天上诸神的安眠。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...But I dare not speak loudly, for fear of disturbing the slumber of the gods in heaven.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……再去休息室喝点东西吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...Go to the lounge and have something to drink.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……去问问鱼摊老板吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...I'll go ask the fishmonger.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……坏了，我成幽灵船了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...Oh no, have I become a ghost ship?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……好神秘。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...So mysterious.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……就这些？她根本没在想医生，那医生为什么觉得她喜欢自己？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...That's it? She's not thinking about the doctor at all, so why does the doctor think she likes him?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……我尝试从祂给我灌输的知识中寻找答案，头痛却越来越难以忍受。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...I tried to find the answer from the knowledge He instilled in me, but the headache became increasingly unbearable.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……或许有风险，但也是个机会！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...perhaps there are risks, but it is also an opportunity!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……清醒一点，{{PlayerName}}！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...Stay clear-headed, {{PlayerName}}!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……烟草、薄荷和消毒水的味道……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...the smell of tobacco, mint, and disinfectant...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……艾德的气场颜色的确显示他身患重疾啊……难道连他自己都不知道自己已经病危？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...Ed's aura color does indeed show that he is suffering from a serious illness... could it be that even he doesn't know he's critically ill?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……行吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (...Fine then.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……这位老先生，眼睛……是不是不太好？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...This old gentleman, are his eyes... not very good?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（……这间屋子里的气息，有些奇怪？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(...The aura in this room is a bit strange?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（《非凡生物在哪里》？或许能在这里找到梦境捕手的线索……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>('Where Are the Beyonder Creatures'? Perhaps I can find clues about the Dream Catcher here...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一丝灵性的波动……她也是非凡者？希望不是敌人……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A trace of spiritual fluctuation... Is she also a Beyonder? I hope she isn't an enemy...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一个小孩当负责人？那就试着和他说说吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A child in charge? I'll try talking to him then.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一个尝试？一个尝试就能让我从房间“来”到这满是灰雾的地方？这也太匪夷所思了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A test? A single test allowed me to 'come' from my room to this place full of gray fog? This is too unbelievable!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一个神秘符号“∞”？微弱的流光循环流淌？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A mysterious symbol \"∞\"? A faint flow of light circulating?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一件古董？）</>你最后一次见到他是什么时候？"] = "<P_Heart> (An antique?) </> When was the last time you saw him?",
    ["<P_Heart>（一位苦恼的教师……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A troubled teacher...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一只普通的小狗，穿着黑白大衣，看着你的眼神充满期待）</>汪呜——"] = "<P_Heart> (An ordinary puppy, wearing a black and white coat, looking at you with anticipation) </> Woof—",
    ["<P_Heart>（一只猫叼着食物消失了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A cat disappeared with the food?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一名老师和一名学生正在讨论着什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A teacher and a student are discussing something...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一声巨响）</>轰——"] = "<P_Heart> (A loud bang) </> Boom—",
    ["<P_Heart>（一声微弱而带着祈求的叫声，小脑袋歪头看着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A faint, pleading cry; it tilts its little head to look at you.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一对陷入热恋的青年……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A couple in love...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一想到这些面具是从活生生的人身上剥取的情绪，就感觉一阵反胃……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Just thinking that these masks were emotions stripped from living people makes me feel nauseous...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（一把夺过）</>猎龙宣言！"] = "<P_Heart>(Snatches it away)</> Dragon Hunting Manifesto!",
    ["<P_Heart>（一直不出声，不会失控了吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Hasn't made a sound, hope he hasn't lost control...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（三段式描述……几乎等阶于七位正统存在。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Three-part description... almost equivalent to the seven orthodox existences.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（三镑换算成穿越前的钱，应该是周薪两千多的样子，这还只是刚开始……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Three pounds converted to the currency before I transmigrated should be around two thousand plus a week, and this is just the beginning...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（上下打量了你一圈）</>你看着像我这些日子见到的第一个文明人。"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks you up and down)</> You look like the first civilized person I've seen in these days.",
    ["<P_Heart>（上下打量）</>……呵。"] = "<P_Heart> (looks you up and down) </>... Heh.",
    ["<P_Heart>（上下打量）</>你是这里的占卜师吗？你是做什么占卜的？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looking up and down)</> Are you the diviner here? What kind of divination do you do?",
    ["<P_Heart>（上下打量）</>头一回来的都这么问，我来简单给您讲讲。"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks you up and down)</> Everyone who comes for the first time asks that. Let me give you a brief explanation.",
    ["<P_Heart>（上下打量，嘴角一勾）</>新面孔啊，第一次来？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks you up and down, a smirk on her lips)</> A new face, first time here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（上前一步）</>带着你的棍子滚得远些，不然我来帮你醒醒酒。"] = "<P_Heart> (Steps forward) </> Get lost with your stick, or I'll help you sober up.",
    ["<P_Heart>（上面写着……“前方”，“危险”？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It says... \"Ahead\", \"Danger\"?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（下意识看向价目表）</>高品质正装套装……7镑、9镑、6镑8苏勒……"] = "<P_Heart> (Subconsciously looks at the price list) </> High-quality suit... 7 pounds, 9 pounds, 6 pounds 8 soli...",
    ["<P_Heart>（不……我也弄反了啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No... I got it backwards too.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不一样？梅丽莎发现了什么？虽然接受了原主的记忆，但细节上还是会不小心呈现出自己真实的性格……只能先找个理由了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Different? Did Melissa discover something? Although I accepted the original owner's memories, I might accidentally reveal my true personality in the details... I can only find an excuse.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不不不，一旦变成工作的话，相比起快乐地到处走走逛逛看看，一定还是专业性更强一些吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No, no, no, once it becomes a job, compared to happily walking around and looking at things, it must be more professional.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好意思地笑了笑）</>母亲不允许我再购入小说，家里所有的钱都需要为政府雇员统一考试做准备。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiled embarrassedly) </> Mother doesn't allow me to buy novels anymore; all the money at home needs to be prepared for the government employee unified exam.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好意思）</>被你一说……好像确实是这么回事。 "] = "<P_Heart> (Embarrassed) </> Now that you mention it... it seems that's really the case.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好意思）</>这是我们黑荆棘安保公司的传统，守护廷根，是我们的职责！"] = "<P_Heart>(Embarrassed)</> This is the tradition of our Blackthorn Security Company, guarding Tingen is our duty!",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好，杰克陷入了混乱，污染程度更深了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Oh no, Jack has fallen into confusion, the level of corruption is deeper.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好，被发现了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Oh no, I've been discovered.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好，难道真是查尼斯门？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Oh no, could it really be the Chanis Gate?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不如问问能帮上他什么忙。有我在外面，至少能更安心些。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I might as well ask how I can help him. With me outside, at least he can feel more at ease.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不如，我来充当一次心愿女神。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Perhaps I should act as the Goddess of Wishes for once.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不对劲，再了解一下霍普的想法吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Something's not right, let's understand Hope's thoughts more.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不对劲，阿尔伯特有危险！）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (Something's wrong, Albert is in danger!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不对，一个大活人，怎么说自己死了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Wait, a living person, how can they say they are dead?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不对，有人在注视我？打量我？监视我？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No, is someone watching me? Checking me out? Monitoring me?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不对，罗塞尔大帝绝不会无动于衷。再想想……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No, Emperor Roselle would never be indifferent. Think again...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不干净的东西？可能有非凡力量，跟他去看看吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Unclean things? Might have Beyonder powers, go check it out with him.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不得不承认，这真是我穿越以来见过颜值最高的女孩了。奇怪，她怎么一直在颤抖？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I have to admit, this is the most beautiful girl I've seen since I transmigrated. Strange, why is she shaking all the time?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不得不说，这样的日子还是很幸福的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I have to say, a life like this is still quite blissful...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不愧是“愚者”先生，我完全明白了“扮演”的含义。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (As expected of Mr. Fool, I have completely understood the meaning of \"Acting.\") </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不愧是愚者先生，我完全明白了“扮演”的含义。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(As expected of Mr. Fool, I completely understand the meaning of \"acting\".)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不敢高声语，恐惊天上人？大帝啊大帝……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Dare not speak aloud, for fear of disturbing the heavenly beings? Oh, Emperor, Emperor...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知从哪掏出一个小罐子）</>悄悄告诉你，都是多亏了这玩意，罗塞尔大帝才有了风流的本钱。"] = "<P_Heart> (Taking out a small jar from somewhere) </> Let me tell you quietly, it's all thanks to this thing that Emperor Roselle had the capital for romance.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道“月亮”先生能否预知我的到来？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I wonder if Mr. Moon could have foreseen my arrival?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道会遇到什么，还是不要带着伊妮德了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I don't know what I might encounter; it's better not to bring Enid along.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道是不是蒙特利的把戏，这张面具会让伊琳想起昨天发生的事情。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I wonder if this is one of Monterey's tricks; this mask might remind Irene of what happened yesterday.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道爱丽丝找到瑞尔了吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I wonder if Alice found Ray?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道这么处理是否合适……先找丽贝卡谈谈吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I don't know if this is the right way to handle it... Let's talk to Rebecca first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道这样是否行得通……先和丽贝卡谈谈吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I don't know if this will work... Let's talk to Rebecca first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道这样是否行得通……先找丽贝卡谈谈吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I wonder if this will work... Let me talk to Rebecca first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道那份资料放在哪……只能到处找找了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I don't know where that document was put... I'll just have to look around.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道马西莫有没有发现……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I wonder if Massimo noticed...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不管哪个世界，都没有只存在好处的事啊。但至少“聚会”的召集和解散都在我的掌握中……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No matter which world, there is no such thing as only benefits. But at least the summoning and dismissal of the \"gathering\" are under my control...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不能大意，告解室活化相当于非凡物品，得小心……）</> 你为什么要制造这个梦境？"] = "<P_Heart> (Can't be careless, an animated confessional is equivalent to a Beyonder item, must be careful...) </> Why did you create this dream?",
    ["<P_Heart>（不能对陌生人暴露身份，伪装一下吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I cannot reveal my identity to strangers. I should use a disguise.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不能把窥探者引到公寓，这会把梅丽莎他们也拉入危险！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Cannot lead the lurker to the apartment; this would drag Melissa and the others into danger!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不能把窥探者引回去，这会把梅丽莎他们也拉入危险！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can't lead the stalker back. That would put Melissa and the others in danger!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不行，水泼进去不一定能把火灭掉，还容易产生大量蒸汽，烫伤道奇。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No, pouring water in might not put out the fire, and it's easy to create a lot of steam, which would scald Dodge.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不过她应该不记得我了，蒙特利删掉了她在戏里的记忆。哎……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But she shouldn't remember me; Monterey deleted her memories of the play. Sigh...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不过，我也要考虑变强大，才有可能回家。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (However, I also need to consider becoming stronger to have a chance to go home.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不雇佣孩子、广播体操、日程表和馊掉的盒饭……他参与了多少？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No child labor, radio gymnastics, schedules, and spoiled boxed lunches... how much is he involved?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不，一点也不……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No, not at all...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不，不能回家！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No, I can't go home!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（不，女神不会的……违禁香水应该存在让人放松警惕的力量，难怪我像个热心市民，毫不怀疑就上当了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No, the Goddess wouldn't... the forbidden perfume must have the power to make people relax their vigilance, no wonder I was like a concerned citizen and was fooled without any suspicion...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（两位女士似乎在争吵些什么，先听听看吧……）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (The two ladies seem to be arguing about something, let me listen in first...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（严肃）</>当你试图窥探那些远超你理解的存在时，你的行为就像黑暗中点燃火把——"] = "<P_Heart> (Solemnly) </> When you try to pry into those existences that far exceed your understanding, your actions are like lighting a torch in the dark—",
    ["<P_Heart>（严肃）</>桑娜，你放心，我知道啦，男人不能画饼。我答应你的事情都会做到。"] = "<P_Heart> (Serious) </> Sanna, don't worry, I know. A man shouldn't make empty promises. I will do everything I promised you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（严肃）</>相信我，你不会想体验的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Seriously)</> Believe me, you don't want to experience it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（中断仪式需要一个独立的房间，还要摆上神秘学物品。看来我需要一个帮手……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(An interrupted ritual requires a separate room and occult items. It seems I need a helper...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为什么我的灵感在警告我？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why is my Inspiration warning me?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为什么有人要游行反对它？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why would anyone protest against it?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为什么有种莫名的羞耻感……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why do I feel an inexplicable sense of shame...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为什么没人提过？等等，我不会是最后一个知道的吧？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why has no one mentioned it? Wait, I'm not the last one to know, am I?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为什么，我竟然下不了手？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Why, why can't I bring myself to do it?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为何有种诡异感，还是先不问了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why is there a sense of eeriness? Better not ask.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（为难）</>铲子？我，我弄丢了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Embarrassed) </> Shovel? I, I lost it...",
    ["<P_Heart>（丽埃娜？！她和乔纳尔医生互相认识？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Liana?! She and Dr. Jonar know each other?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（乌鸦的声音）</>嘎——嘎——"] = "<P_Heart> (The sound of a crow) </> Caw—caw—",
    ["<P_Heart>（也不一定，这可能是整个廷根最货真价实的鬼屋了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Not necessarily, this might be the most authentic haunted house in all of Tingen.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（也许一根火柴比食物或水更能让她感到安慰。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Maybe a match can bring her more comfort than food or water.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（也许再多的话语，也比不上一份沉甸甸的食物。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Perhaps no amount of words can compare to a hearty meal.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（也许我能扮演小丑，替他赢得赏钱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Maybe I can act as a clown and win him some tips...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（也许班森说的对，应该给女孩们一些自己的空间。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Maybe Benson is right; I should give the girls some space of their own.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（也许能用它来进行</><P_Yellow>卜杖占卜</><P_Heart>，确定乔纳尔医生的位置？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Maybe I can use it to perform </> <P_Yellow> pendulum divination </> <P_Heart> to determine Dr. Jonar's location?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（事已至此……愿“愚者”先生保佑……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It has come to this... May Mr. Fool bless us...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（事已至此……愿愚者先生保佑……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It has come to this... May Mr. Fool bless me...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（五海之外呢？会不会有第六海、地下海……天空，是不是海？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What about beyond the Five Seas? Could there be a Sixth Sea, an underground sea... is the sky a sea?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（五海之外的……大地之下的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Beyond the Five Seas... beneath the earth...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（亡魂的执念……）</>写给谁的信？"] = "<P_Heart> (The obsession of a lingering spirit...) </> A letter to whom?",
    ["<P_Heart>（交谈中……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (In conversation...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（亲昵）</>汪！汪汪！"] = "<P_Heart> (Affectionately) </> Woof! Woof woof!",
    ["<P_Heart>（什么剧情这么复杂……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What kind of plot is so complicated...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（什么声音？有非凡力量！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What sound? There is Beyonder power!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（仆人为什么要说谎？有些奇怪啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Why would the servant lie? It's a bit strange.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（今早邻居的狗也一直对我叫，肯定是想跟我走吧，连狗都喜欢我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The neighbor's dog has been barking at me all morning too, it must want to follow me, even dogs like me.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（从批注来看，她或许是因为对原形毕露的丈夫过于失望，才会陷入故事带来的幻想。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Judging from the annotations, she might have fallen into the fantasy brought by the story because she was too disappointed in her husband, who had revealed his true colors.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（从未听说过的名号，似乎隐含着可怕的隐秘与力量……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A title I have never heard of, it seems to imply terrible secrets and power...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（从门外传来的喊声）</>爱丽丝，新货到了，你出来看看。"] = "<P_Heart>(A shout from outside the door)</> Alice, the new shipment is here, come out and take a look.",
    ["<P_Heart>（从零钱箱里随手拿出几枚零钱）</>车票和找零请收好。还有半小时发车，您可以在候车区等一会儿。"] = "<P_Heart> (casually takes some change from the cash box) </> Here is your ticket and change. The train leaves in half an hour, you can wait in the waiting area for a while.",
    ["<P_Heart>（仔细检查过后，好像只有这一个护身符比较特别。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (After a careful inspection, it seems only this one amulet is quite special.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（仔细检查）</>货真价实，没有问题。"] = "<P_Heart>(Carefully checking)</> The real deal, no problems.",
    ["<P_Heart>（仔细阅读）</>这些是什么字？<P_Heart>（恐慌）</>我怎么一个都不认识？<P_Heart>（暴怒）</>我怎么这么笨！上了夜校，也一个字都不认识！"] = "<P_Heart>(Reading carefully)</> What are these characters? <P_Heart>(Panic)</> Why don't I recognize a single one? <P_Heart>(Rage)</> Why am I so stupid! Even after going to night school, I don't recognize a single character!",
    ["<P_Heart>（仔细）</>我没有在镇上见过你……你也是外面来的吧？"] = "<P_Heart>(Observant)</> I haven't seen you in town before... You're from outside, right?",
    ["<P_Heart>（他……还会来吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Will he... still come?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他不再哭泣了。甚至看上去十分……平静。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He has stopped crying. He even looks very... calm.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他不说话了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He stopped talking...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们两个虽然语气听着不好，实际行为却挺讲礼貌。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Although their tone sounds bad, their actual behavior is quite polite.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎在因为某位死者而烦恼。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They seem to be troubled because of a certain deceased person.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎在玩近几年最受孩子们欢迎的游戏，“大冒险家格尔曼”。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They seem to be playing the game most popular among children in recent years, 'The Great Adventurer Gehrman'.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎忘记了罗塞尔大帝……这是个扮演歌颂者的好机会。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They seem to have forgotten Emperor Roselle... This is a good opportunity to act as a Bard.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎是刚才的深红星辰带来的，就像星辰在灰雾之上的投影……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They seem to have been brought by the crimson star from just now, like a projection of the stars above the gray fog...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们似乎认为我是警察，没有什么理由还是先不招惹他们了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They seem to think I'm a police officer. There's no reason to provoke them for now.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们在为难那个女孩？上去帮帮她吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Are they giving that girl a hard time? Go up and help her!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们在敲诈那个老人？去帮帮忙吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Are they blackmailing that old man? Let's go help!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们在畏惧我……这次事件里，他们是来客，我是主人！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They are fearing me... In this incident, they are the guests, and I am the host!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们好像在讲以前的传说？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They seem to be talking about old legends?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们生前的环境、死后的墓葬都需要调查。） </>"] = "<P_Heart>(Their living environments and their burials after death all need to be investigated.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们的关系好像没那么糟糕……）</>你不生气了？"] = "<P_Heart> (Their relationship doesn't seem that bad...) </> You're not angry anymore?",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们说的“毒药”，难道是那个？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could the 'poison' they mentioned be that one?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他们说的是东边那三颗星的上面对吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They are talking about the ones above those three stars in the east, right...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他仿佛没有听到你的话，喃喃自语，重新沉浸在了悲痛中。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He seemed not to hear your words, muttering to himself, immersed in grief again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他伤得并没有看起来那么重……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He isn't as badly injured as he looks...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎也是个非凡者……而且状态不太好，去问问吧。）"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to be a Beyonder too... and his state isn't very good, let's go ask.)",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎也是个非凡者……而且精神状态不太好，去问问吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He seems to be a Beyonder as well... and his mental state isn't very good. I should go ask him.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎变得悲伤了，但是还没有要离开天台的意思。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to have become sad, but he still has no intention of leaving the rooftop.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎变得愤怒了，但是还没有要离开天台的意思。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to have become angry, but he still has no intention of leaving the rooftop.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎在和旁边的艾尔萨小姐交谈。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to be talking to Miss Elsa next to him.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎想要跳下去了，试试改变他的情绪和想法吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He seems to want to jump down. Let's try to change his emotions and thoughts.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他全说对了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He got it all right...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他刚刚提到的发明笔记，和工厂会有关系吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The invention notes he just mentioned, could they be related to the factory?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他在假装自己是蘑菇！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He's pretending to be a mushroom!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他在哪里……先装作还被控制的样子，看看他到底想做什么。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Where is he... I'll pretend to still be controlled and see what he really wants to do.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他在找什么？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What is he looking for?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他好像有些困扰？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems a bit troubled?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他完全陷入到自己的苦恼内了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He is completely trapped in his own distress.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他是主动选择成为蘑菇的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He chose to become a mushroom of his own volition.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他是怎么认路的？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(How does he know the way?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他根本不相信自己能逃出去。对他而言，最大的希望就是清洗烟囱，拿到这笔救命钱。但一个人下去又太危险，既然这样…… ）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He doesn't believe at all that he can escape. For him, the greatest hope is to clean the chimneys and get this life-saving money. But going down alone is too dangerous, in that case... ) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他沉默了，难道……不、不可试探……神？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He is silent, could it be... no, do not test... a god?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他没问题，不知道其他孩子怎么样？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He's fine, I wonder how the other children are doing?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他的执念，最终也消散殆尽了。愿他能在神的国度和伙伴们重聚……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (His obsession finally dissipated completely. May he reunite with his partners in the kingdom of God...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他的服务确实很周到……）</>只可惜我不需要。"] = "<P_Heart>(His service is indeed very thoughtful...)</> It's just a pity I don't need it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（他的目光怎么突然坚定起来了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why did his gaze suddenly become so firm...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他的脸色看起来好可怕。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(His complexion looks so terrible.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他的面孔很熟悉，应该在别的地方也见过他。我记得是在……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(His face is very familiar, I must have seen him somewhere else. I remember it was in...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他眉眼低垂，好像有些难过。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He lowers his head, looking a bit sad.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他看出我的身份了？很敏锐……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He figured out my identity? Very sharp...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他看起来很在乎男爵。）</>没关系，管家先生，请节哀。"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to care about the Baron.) </> It's alright, Mr. Butler, please accept my condolences.",
    ["<P_Heart>（他眼神怎么躲躲闪闪的？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why are his eyes darting around?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他绕了一下……像是在避开不存在的石头？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He took a detour... as if he were avoiding an invisible stone?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他被呓语侵蚀了，必须压制他的疯狂！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He has been eroded by the whispers; his madness must be suppressed!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他觉得这里很陌生，还有着和时代明显不符的思想和行为……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He feels like a stranger here, possessing thoughts and behaviors clearly inconsistent with this era...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他过于焦虑了，是时候帮他卸下一些心理负担了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He is too anxious, it's time to help him unload some psychological burden!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他过于焦虑了，是时候帮他卸下一些心里负担了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He is far too anxious; it is time to help him unburden some of his mental load!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他需要一点勇气。歌颂者的歌，正好派上用场。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He needs a little courage. The Bard's song comes in handy.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他面色苍白，气场黯淡，是真的要死了，不像骗人……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He is pale and his aura is dim; he really is dying, he doesn't look like he's lying...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（以后如果想锻炼格斗技巧，也许可以来尝试一下吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If I want to train my fighting skills in the future, maybe I can give it a try.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（以太体没什么问题……伊琳的星灵体呈绿色，表明她现在很平静。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The Ether Body is fine... Irene's Astral Projection is green, indicating she is very calm now.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（以手按胸）</>赞美女神。"] = "<P_Heart>(Pressing hand to chest)</> Praise the Goddess.",
    ["<P_Heart>（仰起头）</>一起坐一会儿吧，廷根难得有这样的好天气。"] = "<P_Heart> (looking up) </> Let's sit for a while; it's rare for Tingen to have such good weather.",
    ["<P_Heart>（仿佛问了不应该问的问题，还是赶紧告辞吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It feels like I asked a question I shouldn't have; I'd better take my leave...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（伊琳为什么会出现在这里？她应该不记得我了，蒙特利删掉了她在戏里的记忆。哎……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why is Irene here? She shouldn't remember me; Monterey deleted her memories of the play. Sigh...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（伊琳为什么会出现在这里？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Why would Irene appear here?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（优雅地整理袖口）</>首先，看他们拿酒杯的手势——某些途径的非凡者会不自觉地做出象征手势。"] = "<P_Heart>(Elegantly adjusting cuffs)</> First, look at the way they hold their wine glasses—Beyonders of certain pathways will unconsciously make symbolic gestures.",
    ["<P_Heart>（优雅）</>很高兴你能记住夫人为此做出的贡献。"] = "<P_Heart> (Elegant) </> I am glad you remember the contribution the Lady has made for this.",
    ["<P_Heart>（会长居然是因蒂斯的皇长女？是罗塞尔大帝的亲女儿？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The President is actually the eldest princess of Intis? Is she Emperor Roselle's own daughter?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（会长说过，会一直守着我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The President said she would always watch over me.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（伦纳德·米切尔，序列8的“午夜诗人”……他看起来很悠闲，得让他再去背几本诗集了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Leonard Mitchell, a Sequence 8 \"Midnight Poet\"... he looks very relaxed, I'll have to make him memorize a few more poetry collections.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（伦纳德先生还要询问谁的意见？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Whose opinion does Mr. Leonard still need to ask?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎不对，这是接下来要出现的纪元的，再试试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That doesn't seem right; this one belongs to the next epoch. Let me try again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎在摇头晃脑）</> 不是我造的，是神父爷爷，他用这个来装大家的告解。"] = "<P_Heart> (Seemingly shaking its head) </> I didn't create it; Father did. He used this to store everyone's confessions.",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎在自言自语）</>老头，下次能不能偷点牌运给我，多少让我赢一回啊……"] = "<P_Heart> (Seemingly talking to himself) </> Old man, can you steal some card luck for me next time? Just let me win once...",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎挺有意思的，让我想想可以做些什么吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting. Let me think about what I can do!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎是两个刚采购完的女仆……要听听她们的闲聊吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Seems to be two maids who just finished shopping... want to listen to their gossip?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎是在告别，要不要听听看呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems like a farewell, should I listen in?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎有所感应）</>你……身上有乌达留下的力量，是祂让你来的么？"] = "<P_Heart> (seems to sense something) </> You... have the power left by Uda on you. Did He send you here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎没有更多的线索了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There don't seem to be any more clues...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎还挺有意思的，要不要看看？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting, should I take a look?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但……普通人还是不要卷入这种非凡事件比较好。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But... it's better for ordinary people not to get involved in these Beyonder incidents.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但他为此坚持上山几十年，并且记得这条路上的一切……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But he has insisted on climbing the mountain for decades for this, and he remembers everything on this road...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但他怎么来到了拉姆德古堡，还从棺材里醒来？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But how did he come to Lamud Castle and wake up from a coffin?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但就这么站着聊？有点不高级……这种神秘的集会应该在一个古老宏伟的神殿里吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But just standing here chatting? It's a bit low-class... A mysterious gathering like this should be in an ancient, magnificent temple, right.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但既然奥利弗已经去了教会，官方非凡者迟早会注意到这件事并加以处置，或许我可以…… ）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But since Oliver has already gone to the Church, the official Beyonders will notice this matter sooner or later and deal with it. Perhaps I could...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但是河里为什么会漂浮崭新的生活用品啊！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But why are brand-new household items floating in the river!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但最近的事件，更像是危险在追着我跑……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But recent events feel more like danger is chasing after me...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但罗塞尔大帝在他的日记里说，魔药的关键不是掌握和挖掘，而是消化和扮演……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But Emperor Roselle said in his diary that the key to the potion is not mastering and digging, but digestion and Acting...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但越多的“聚会”也越容易暴露自身的虚实……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But the more \"gatherings\" there are, the easier it is to expose my own reality...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但还不知道对方的真正图谋，这可能会使我暴露、被他逃走。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But I don't know the other party's true intentions yet. This might expose me and let him escape.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但这些颜色又在剧烈地变化，说明他的精神处于不健康的活跃状态，得想办法让他平静下来。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But these colors are changing violently, indicating that his mind is in an unhealthy, active state. I must find a way to calm him down.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（但这样的事在此地常有，我对此也无能为力。本就是投机者的游戏，赢了也许一夜乍富，输了就是地覆天翻。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But things like this happen often here, and I'm powerless to help. It's a speculator's game; win, and you might be rich overnight, lose, and everything is turned upside down.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（低下头）</>嗯…除去为了生活，我也想学走钢丝，极限刺激，和平时一点都不一样。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers head) </> Hmm... besides making a living, I also want to learn tightrope walking, extreme thrills, it's completely different from my usual life.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低声）</>怎么样，看看你学的如何？"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> How about it? See how well you've learned?",
    ["<P_Heart>（低声）</>我的父亲去了那里，刚开始，我们还能收到他的信……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> My father went there. At first, we could still receive his letters...",
    ["<P_Heart>（低声）</>至少，没有了嵌在灵魂里的负担，睡去的时候，会更安静一些。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispers)</> At least, without the burden embedded in my soul, it will be quieter when I fall asleep.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低头）</>凯瑟琳开始酗酒。乔安娜放弃了练习。艾米嫁给了一个她不爱的人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers head) </> Catherine started drinking heavily. Joanna gave up practicing. Amy married a man she didn't love.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低头）</>我要是会变魔术就好了。从那顶帽子里放出六只鸽子，她可能就不找了。她现在只记得这一件事。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Looking down) </>I wish I knew how to do magic. If I could release six pigeons from that hat, she might stop looking. That's the only thing she remembers now.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>……我没有要提问的，<P_Yellow>无论命运给出什么样的指示，我都会回答“好”</>。这才是我们这些羔羊该做的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Low chuckle)</>... I have no questions to ask. <P_Yellow>No matter what instructions fate gives, I will answer 'good'</>. This is what we lambs should do.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>不是我的执着……你还不明白吗，是命运如此安排。"] = "<P_Heart>(Low chuckle)</> It's not my obsession... don't you understand yet? It is fate that has arranged it so.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>你果然很聪明。挑选你来提问，我没有选错。"] = "<P_Heart>(Chuckling)</> You are indeed very clever. I did not choose wrong in picking you to ask questions.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低笑）</>呵呵……我知道为什么……"] = "<P_Heart>(Chuckling)</> Hehe... I know why...",
    ["<P_Heart>（低落）</> 可是突然从一天开始，爷爷再没有来过。排队告解的人越来越多，我只好先替他听大家告解，替他维护这个梦境。"] = "<P_Heart> (Dejected) </> But suddenly, starting one day, Grandpa never came again. More and more people were lining up for confession, so I had to listen to everyone's confessions for him and maintain this dream for him.",
    ["<P_Heart>（低语）</>故事的走向，是否如你所愿？你的命运，是由谁在支配？"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Is the story unfolding as you wish? Who is it that controls your destiny?",
    ["<P_Heart>（作战？这里很安静，雪地也很平整，不像是有战役的样子……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A battle? It's very quiet here, and the snow is smooth and undisturbed. It doesn't look like a battle took place here...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你伸手触碰宝箱的锁扣，指尖却传来一阵寒意——这让你感到，某种存在正注视着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You reach out to touch the lock of the treasure chest, but a chill runs through your fingertips—this makes you feel that some existence is watching you.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你大概知道发生了什么，看着眼前稚嫩而单纯的孩子，沉默了一会。）</> 叔叔阿姨说得对。"] = "<P_Heart> (You probably know what happened, and looking at the young and innocent child in front of you, you remain silent for a while.) </> Your aunt and uncle are right.",
    ["<P_Heart>（你大概知道发生了什么，看着眼前稚嫩而单纯的孩子，沉默了一会。）</> 我愿意。"] = "<P_Heart> (You roughly know what happened, and looking at the naive and innocent child before you, you fall silent for a moment.) </> I am willing.",
    ["<P_Heart>（你掏出了一张用鲜血写满“救命”的门票）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You pull out a ticket covered in blood with the word \"Help\" written all over it) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你正准备打开这个宝箱，但你感觉有不知何处的眼睛盯着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(You are preparing to open this treasure chest, but you feel eyes from somewhere unknown staring at you.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你留意到她眼里涌动的光芒渐渐平静下来。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You notice the light surging in her eyes gradually calm down.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你的双手，你的健康，你的国家……爱国卫生运动……人人有责。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Your hands, your health, your country... Patriotic Health Campaign... everyone is responsible.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你趁着店主不注意偷偷摸了摸小猫）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You took advantage of the shopkeeper's inattention to secretly pet the kitten) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（你鼓起勇气品尝了一块）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(You muster the courage to taste a piece)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（佩服）</>太厉害了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Admiringly)</> That's amazing.",
    ["<P_Heart>（例如在这里放一张长桌……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (For example, putting a long table here...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（例如在这里放一张长桌和众多雕刻着古老花纹、满是神秘感觉的靠背座椅，我就端坐在最上首……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(For example, placing a long table here with numerous high-backed chairs carved with ancient patterns and filled with a mysterious aura, and I would sit at the very head...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（侧头，语气惊讶）</>贵族小姐也想学这个吗？我以为只有我这种不想当洗衣女的贫穷姑娘，才会想到来马戏团找一份出路。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tilts head, tone surprised) </> A noble lady wants to learn this too? I thought only poor girls like me, who don't want to be laundry maids, would think of coming to the circus to find a way out.",
    ["<P_Heart>（信封上写着“给我的女儿”）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The envelope says \"To my daughter\")</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（俱乐部……？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Club...?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（值夜者……邓恩先生提到过他属于廷根市的值夜者小队。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Nighthawks... Mr. Dunn mentioned that he belongs to the Tingen Nighthawks squad.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（值夜者好像就属于特殊行动部第七小组？）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (The Nighthawks seem to belong to the Special Operations Department's Seventh Group?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（值夜者还需要会画画？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Nighthawks also need to know how to draw?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（假装严肃）</>好呀，那听好啦，鲍威尔同学。在感情里呢，需要你的时候你不来，你来了也不需要你了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Pretending to be serious) </> Alright then, listen up, classmate Powell. In a relationship, when you are needed, you don't show up, and when you do show up, you're no longer needed!",
    ["<P_Heart>（做侦探这么赚钱吗……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is being a detective this profitable...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（停下来了……他的状态还是很不稳定。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It stopped... his state is still very unstable.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（停下，有些尴尬）</>……大概就是这种感觉。"] = "<P_Heart>(Stops, somewhat embarrassed)</> ...That's about the feeling.",
    ["<P_Heart>（停顿）</>敬畏，还有怀疑。"] = "<P_Heart>(Pauses)</> Awe, and suspicion.",
    ["<P_Heart>（停顿）</>极其偶尔，梦里的人，梦里说的话，会让我恍惚那是现实还是梦境。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pausing) </> Extremely rarely, the people in the dreams, the things said in the dreams, make me dazed as to whether it is reality or a dream.",
    ["<P_Heart>（偷笑）</>年纪大些好，年纪大的会疼人，有想法啊年轻人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Snickering) </> Older is good; older people know how to cherish others and have their own ideas, young man.",
    ["<P_Heart>（催促）</>请先上岸，海水在涨潮了，浪会把你卷走的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Urging) </> Please go ashore first, the tide is rising, the waves will sweep you away.",
    ["<P_Heart>（充满向往）</>这种缝隙很奇妙，它藏在各种地方。"] = "<P_Heart> (Full of longing) </> This kind of gap is very wonderful, it hides in all sorts of places.",
    ["<P_Heart>（先出去吧，不要吵醒梅丽莎。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's go out first, don't wake Melissa.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先前往尸体被发现的位置看看吧，希望有进一步的发现。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's head to the location where the body was found first. I hope to make further discoveries.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先去公司附近试探一下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's go near the company to test the waters first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先去占卜一下，看看能不能获得什么信息。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let's go perform divination first to see if I can get any information.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先去受害者的墓地看看吧，也许能找到线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's go check the victim's grave first; maybe I can find a clue.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先在酒吧里转转……或许能打听到有用的线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'll wander around the bar first... Maybe I can pick up some useful clues.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先按他说的做吧，提前去那里埋伏，到时候再抓个人赃俱获!）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'll do as he says for now, ambush there in advance, and then catch him red-handed!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先查看下赛琳娜的情况，通常魔镜中会映照出她当前的状态。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Check Selina's condition first, usually the magic mirror will reflect her current state.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先稳住它再说。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's stabilize it first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（先自己看看吧，这里有常见的黑麦面包、廷根饼、柠檬蛋糕……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Take a look for yourself first; there's common rye bread, Tingen biscuits, lemon cake here...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（克莱恩·莫雷蒂，我们新加入的“占卜家”，一个聪明的新队员。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Klein Moretti, our newly joined \"Seer,\" a smart new team member.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（免费？免费的东西才是最贵的，有本事你就占卜出我是穿越的！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Free? The things that are free are the most expensive. If you're so capable, try divining that I'm a transmigrator!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（免费？免费的东西才是最贵的，有本事你就占卜出来我是穿越的！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Free? The things that are free are the most expensive. If you're so capable, divine that I'm a transmigrator!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（全人类的共识——当你看到一只■■时，就意味着还有一千只！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The consensus of all mankind—when you see one ■■, it means there are a thousand more!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>去吧，带上那个残缺的故事，去探寻唯一的答案吧！"] = "<P_Heart>(Excited)</> Go on, take that incomplete story and go seek the only answer!",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>吱吱！吱吱！"] = "<P_Heart>(Excited)</> Squeak! Squeak!",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>呜呜……呜呜……"] = "<P_Heart> (Excited) </> Wuu wuu... wuu wuu...",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>她走了，就剩下我一个人！"] = "<P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> She's gone, now I'm the only one left!",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>对！你想一想，如果牛能像麦子一样从地里长出来，农民就不用花那么多精力去饲养了！一块田里，上面长麦穗，下面长牛腿，多完美的设计！"] = "<P_Heart>(Excitedly)</> Yes! Think about it, if cows could grow out of the ground like wheat, farmers wouldn't have to spend so much energy raising them! In one field, wheat ears grow on top, and cow legs grow underneath—what a perfect design!",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>我要再去寻觅我的吸血鬼大人了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Excitedly)</> I'm going to go look for my Lord Vampire again.",
    ["<P_Heart>（兴奋）</>那是自然！以感官解构文字，正是我创造的一种全新的话语体系，别看这出戏剧叫做《夏夜之梦》，其实隐喻的是完全相反的内容！"] = "<P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> That's natural! Deconstructing text through the senses is a brand-new discourse system I created. Don't look at this play called 'A Midsummer Night's Dream'; it actually metaphors the exact opposite content!",
    ["<P_Heart>（其实……是你不能忘记他……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Actually... it's that you can't forget him...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（其实他仍有能力自己生活……希望他能振作起来，不要放弃自己的命运吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Actually, he still has the ability to live on his own... I hope he can pull himself together and not give up on his fate.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（再到他的住处看看，有没有什么线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'll go to his place and see if there are any clues.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（再四处看看吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let's look around some more.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（再根据卜杖的指引，就可以找到珍妮在哪里。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Then according to the guidance of the dowsing rod, I can find where Jenny is.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（冒头）</>财政大臣！快走！外交大臣被帽子帮抢活了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Pops head out)</> Minister of Finance! Run! The Minister of Foreign Affairs had his work snatched by the Hat Gang!",
    ["<P_Heart>（冲上前）</>海莉！"] = "<P_Heart> (Rushes forward) </> Haley!",
    ["<P_Heart>（决定了。利用对方现在的心理状态，把握自身的最大优势！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Decided. Use the other party's current psychological state and grasp my own greatest advantage!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（决心）</>为了拿到梦境捕手的心脏……"] = "<P_Heart>(Determination)</> In order to get the Dream Catcher's heart...",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷笑）</> 呵，又让你跨过了一道门槛。 不过……我必须承认，你确实比上次见面时，强了那么一点。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sneers) </> Heh, you've crossed another threshold. But... I must admit, you are indeed a little stronger than when we last met.",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷笑）</>又一个觉得自己什么都能打开的人？"] = "<P_Heart> (Sneers) </> Another person who thinks they can open anything?",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷笑）</>睡得挺香。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sneer)</> Sleeping quite soundly.",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷酷地吹了吹枪口）</>我欣赏你，新人。"] = "<P_Heart>(Coldly blows on the muzzle of the gun)</> I admire you, newcomer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（冷静，冷静……雷克斯习惯于钻法律的漏洞，我得抓住这一点。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Calm down, calm down... Rex is used to exploiting legal loopholes, I have to seize on that.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（凝视深渊，即可前往极乐世界。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Gaze into the abyss, and you can go to the paradise.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（凶悍）</>我还没问你为啥在这儿呢？别打扰我干活！"] = "<P_Heart>(Fiercely)</> I haven't even asked why you're here! Don't disturb me while I'm working!",
    ["<P_Heart>（出身高贵的小姐……我的表现，我的口音这么明显吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A lady of noble birth... Is my performance, my accent that obvious?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（刚刚的猎人的态度也有点奇怪……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (That hunter's attitude just now was a little strange too...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（刚刚那本书的女主人公看起来是一个渴望自由的贵族夫人，也许白莉夫人在这一点上和她产生了共鸣。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The protagonist of that book looked like a noble lady longing for freedom; perhaps Lady Baily resonated with her on that point.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（刚才听旁边两个人说，他好像叫山姆？似乎还有什么，私生子……家产……情人？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I heard the two people next to me say his name is Sam? And something about... an illegitimate child... inheritance... a mistress?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（刚才这里的变化！好恐怖的力量！这是祂的国……神国？祂一定是如同神明般的存在！是哪位未知降临了，还是从隐秘中苏醒的伟大存在？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The change here just now! What a terrifying power! Is this His kingdom... a Divine Kingdom? He must be an existence like a god! Which unknown being has descended, or is it a great existence awakening from secrecy?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（别又卷进麻烦里）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Don't get dragged into trouble again) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（制作药剂的材料还不够再去收集一些吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The materials for making the potion are not enough, go collect some more...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（刺耳电流音）</>你眼神都散了！再这样下去你就真把自己当成这里的客人了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Harsh static)</> Your eyes are losing focus! If you keep this up, you'll really start thinking of yourself as a guest here!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刺耳电流音）</>喂！喂！听见我说话吗？！"] = "<P_Heart>(Harsh static)</> Hey! Hey! Can you hear me?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刺耳电流音）</>给我清醒过来！深呼吸，想想你是来干什么的！"] = "<P_Heart>(Harsh static)</> Snap out of it! Take a deep breath and remember why you're here!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意压低声音）</>我不……不不想，跟你这种……吸……吸血鬼说话。"] = "<P_Heart> (deliberately lowering voice) </> I d-d-don't want to talk to a... v-v-vampire like you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意压低声音）</>我没努力吗？我很努力的！努力能挣钱吗？我努力了什么都没有！"] = "<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately lowered voice) </> Haven't I worked hard? I've worked very hard! Does hard work earn money? I worked hard and got nothing!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意压低声音）</>那个卡米拉，就是你偷偷包养的情妇！小报说的都是真的！"] = "<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately lowered voice) </> That Camilla, she's the mistress you're secretly keeping! The tabloids are all true!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意尖声说话）</>别装作若无其事的样子。快离开！这是我睡觉的地方！"] = "<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately shrill voice) </> Don't act like nothing is happening. Get away! This is where I sleep!",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意尖声说话）</>嘿，你这该死的鸽子，给我下来。"] = "<P_Heart> (speaking in a deliberately shrill voice) </> Hey, you damn pigeon, get down here.",
    ["<P_Heart>（刻意尖声说话）</>要是有人能在这危急关头献上50块小鱼干，日后就是廷根市长！"] = "<P_Heart> (deliberately speaking in a high-pitched voice) </> If anyone can offer 50 dried fish at this critical moment, they will be the Mayor of Tingen in the future!",
    ["<P_Heart>（前来探望的一家人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A family coming to visit.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（前面好热闹……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It's so lively up ahead...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（前面就是拉姆德古堡了，那里或许会有更多线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Lamud Castle is just ahead. There may be more clues there.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（剧本陷入死一般的寂静，随后机械地开口）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The script fell into a deathly silence, then spoke mechanically)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（动容）</>……"] = "<P_Heart> (Moved) </> ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（努力回忆）</>我好像看到……一些数字，有0……和1……"] = "<P_Heart> (Struggling to recall) </> I think I saw... some numbers, there were 0... and 1...",
    ["<P_Heart>（北大陆的最西边，也是因蒂斯的最西边，那是迷雾海。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The far west of the Northern Continent, and also the far west of Intis, that is the Fog Sea.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（半路有雨……奇怪的名字。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Rain halfway... what a strange name.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（华贵精美的珠宝，都悬挂着小小的、让人并不愿意看清数字的价签。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Luxurious and exquisite jewelry, all hanging with small price tags that make one not want to see the numbers clearly.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（卜杖占卜总是指向这些孩子的位置，莫非他们就是我要找的人？我来问问好了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Dowsing rod divination always points to the location of these children. Could they be the people I am looking for? I'll go ask.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（卜杖占卜？这是“愚者”先生给我嫁接的能力之一。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Dowsing rod divination? This is one of the abilities Mr. Fool grafted onto me.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（占卜师说话总是很模糊啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Diviners are always so vague.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（占卜的结果指向地下，难道物品的原主人……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The result of the divination points underground; could the original owner of the item...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（危险很大，难道它是高序列生物？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The danger is great, could it be a high-sequence creature?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（即使承受着极端的痛苦，也要坚持记录吗？按理说应该劝说她停止追查，没收记录。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is she insisting on recording even while enduring extreme pain? Logically, I should persuade her to stop investigating and confiscate the records.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（即使是孩子，也需要私人空间。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Even children need personal space.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（即便要付出我的身体，我的生命，我的一切……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Even if I have to pay with my body, my life, my everything...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（厂主会这么坦诚地把问题告诉工人们吗？总感觉怪怪的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Would a factory owner be so honest about problems to the workers? It feels strange.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（历史里那本“安提哥努斯家族笔记”的其中一个受害人，好像就叫韦尔奇！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (One of the victims of that \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" in history, I think his name was Welch!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</> 我听说，斯嘉丽有婚约在身，当时差一点就结婚了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering voice) </> I heard Scarlett was engaged and almost got married back then!",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</> 有些议员建议这件事委托给黑夜女神教会进行调查……你知道的，他们非常擅长处理恶灵作祟之类的事。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering voice) </> Some council members suggest entrusting this matter to the Church of the Evernight Goddess for investigation... You know, they are very skilled at dealing with things like evil spirits haunting places.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>……有个农场佬带来一些南瓜，说是好东西，能让人“梦想成真”。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowering voice)</>... A farmhand brought some pumpkins, claiming they were good stuff that could make one's \"dreams come true.\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>不过聪明人都知道……真宝贝谁敢摆明面上？"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering voice) </> But smart people know... who would dare to put real treasures out in the open?",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>会不会是……马丁的鬼魂？"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering his voice) </> Could it be... Martin's ghost?",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>别提了，前两天狒狒发狂了，到了需要叫警察的地步！"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers voice) </> Don't mention it, the baboon went crazy two days ago, to the point where the police had to be called!",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>前面两幕是他写的。第三幕不是。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> He wrote the first two acts. The third act was not him.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>小点声，还有客人在呢……"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowering voice)</> Keep it down, there are guests...",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>我们厂的领班，我有件事想请他通融……你懂的，空手上门不像话。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowering voice) </> My factory foreman, there's something I need him to be flexible about... you know, showing up empty-handed isn't appropriate.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>我听说，莉莉的酒量也是有上限的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowering voice)</> I heard that Lily has a limit to her alcohol tolerance too.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>我怀疑她对我……呃，产生了某种特殊的情愫。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers voice) </> I suspect she has... uh, developed some kind of special affection for me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>明白，您稍等，我给您拿。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> Understood, please wait a moment, I'll get it for you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>而且你看，廷根的物价比贝克兰德便宜多了，还是在这里买划算。"] = "<P_Heart> (lowering voice) </> And look, the cost of living in Tingen is much cheaper than in Backlund; it's more cost-effective to buy here.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>能长头发的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> The one that makes hair grow.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>要小心，这个镇子不对劲，一切都在重复。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lowering voice)</> Be careful, this town isn't right. Everything is repeating.",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>那个，就是那个！她原先住豪尔斯街呢……"] = "<P_Heart> (lowers voice) </> That one, that's the one! She used to live on Howls Street...",
    ["<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>那里曾经有一种原始的祭祀传统，信仰所谓的“天气之神”。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lowers voice) </> There used to be a primitive sacrificial tradition there, worshipping a so-called 'God of Weather'.",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来只是个赌徒……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So it was just a Gambler...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来她是在担心我……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So she was worried about me...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来如此，这就是为什么我不必花高额的价格买下它……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So that's why I didn't have to pay a high price to buy it...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来如此，道奇缺少一个能为他指路的“眼睛”。或许……简单的占卜能弥补这个缺口。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I see, Dodge lacks an \"eye\" that can guide him. Perhaps... simple divination can make up for this gap.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来安迪……也是重复与循环中的一环……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So Andy... is also a part of the repetition and cycle...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来蒙特利不止邀请我一个人去吃饭，还邀请了伊琳……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So Monterey didn't just invite me to dinner; he invited Irene as well...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来这就是被病人信赖的感觉。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So this is what it feels like to be trusted by a patient.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（原来这段未竟的旋律背后，是一份活下去的希望……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So behind this unfinished melody, there is a hope to live on...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（去世？可我收到的情报是昏睡……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Passed away? But the information I received was that she was in a deep sleep...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（去看看？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Go take a look?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（去问问咖啡馆的女士吧，她或许知道些什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Go ask the lady at the cafe, she might know something...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（又失去了一次报销的机会……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Lost another chance for reimbursement...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（又拍了拍你的肩膀）</>朋友，金秋湖归我罩，遇到事别忘了我！"] = "<P_Heart>(Pats your shoulder again)</> Friend, Golden Autumn Lake is under my protection. Don't forget me if you run into trouble!",
    ["<P_Heart>（又提到工厂区……这和之前得知的廷根灾难有关系吗？总之，先回黑荆棘向队长汇报这件事。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Mentioning the Factory District again... Does this have any connection to the Tingen disaster I learned about earlier? Regardless, I should return to Blackthorn to report this to the Captain.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（又是一阵叹息声）</>尤德拉降下了庇护，但也带来了可怕的荒芜。所以我们必须变成这样，让自己成为容器，吸收荒芜，不让尤德拉破坏这片大地。"] = "<P_Heart> (Another sigh) </> Yodra brought shelter, but also brought terrible desolation. So we must become like this, becoming containers to absorb the desolation so that Yodra doesn't destroy this land.",
    ["<P_Heart>（又盯着你看了很久）</>……"] = "<P_Heart> (Staring at you for a long time again) </> ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（叉腰）</>你不懂，有钱人也有有钱人的烦恼！反正我不差钱！"] = "<P_Heart> (Hands on hips) </> You don't understand, rich people have rich people's troubles! Anyway, I'm not short on money!",
    ["<P_Heart>（发出了若有若无的叹息）</>就是瀑布那边的……我知道祂想做的事。在那之前，能不能帮我一个忙？"] = "<P_Heart> (emits a faint, ethereal sigh) </> It's the one by the waterfall... I know what He wants to do. Before that, can you do me a favor?",
    ["<P_Heart>（发出疑似抽噎的声音）</> 都是我不好，我真是个废物呜呜呜……"] = "<P_Heart> (Makes a sound like sobbing) </> It's all my fault, I'm such a loser, wuwuwu...",
    ["<P_Heart>（只是普通人，没有非凡力量痕迹……所以被放过了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They are just ordinary people, with no traces of Beyonder power... so they were let go...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（只有门口的雕塑，还注视着拉姆德曾经的荣耀。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Only the sculpture at the entrance still gazes upon the former glory of Lamud.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可以用沙土掩埋煤堆！这样比较安全！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I can use sand and dirt to bury the coal pile! That's safer!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可怜的小瓦莱莉）……</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Poor little Valerie) ... </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可怜的罗塞尔大帝，又被无良奸商拿来编故事了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Poor Emperor Roselle, being used by unscrupulous merchants to make up stories again...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可恶，竟然用这一招吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Damn, they're actually using this trick?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可我什么都记不起来，是因为我的死而复生，还是我压根就没有这段记忆？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But I can't remember anything. Is it because of my resurrection, or did I never have these memories at all?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可我还是想不起来昨天发生了什么……走一步算一步吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(But I still can't remember what happened yesterday... I'll just take it one step at a time.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（可能是非凡事件？）</>您能打开门让我进去看看吗？我也许有办法。"] = "<P_Heart> (Could this be a Beyonder incident?) </> Can you open the door and let me go in and take a look? I might have a way.",
    ["<P_Heart>（右手抚胸，微微低头）</>现在我只想说——这是我们的荣幸，“愚者”先生。"] = "<P_Heart>(Places right hand on chest, bows slightly)</> Now I only want to say—it is our honor, Mr. Fool.",
    ["<P_Heart>（右手抚胸，微微低头）</>现在我只想说——这是我们的荣幸，愚者先生。"] = "<P_Heart>(Places right hand on chest and bows slightly)</> Now I only wish to say—this is our honor, Mr. Fool.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹息）</>我不愿意回到那个状态。所以，我选择了现在这样，即使还要重复死而复生和失忆，但至少我保有过去和人性。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I don't want to return to that state. So, I chose to be like this now. Even if I have to repeat resurrection and amnesia, at least I retain my past and my humanity.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹息）</>费内波特已经没有大地教会了……而且我早就……"] = "<P_Heart> (sighs) </> There is no Church of Earth in Feneport anymore... and I have long since...",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹息）</>，我理解有时约定会变成枷锁，但请再三思，{{先生|女士}}。单方解契会在你们之间留下裂痕，这真的是你想要的结果吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </>, I understand that sometimes promises can become shackles, but please think twice, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. Unilateral termination of the covenant will leave a rift between you. Is this really the result you want?",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</> 他们是廷根的守护者啊……"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> They are the Guardians of Tingen...",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</> 我就说了，这不是什么好事……"] = "<P_Heart>(sighs)</> I said it, this isn't a good thing...",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</> 我说了很多次了，我不是什么毒素专家。我只是比较擅长让植物和动物产生一些特殊的化合物。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I've said it many times, I'm not a Toxin Expert. I'm just quite good at getting plants and animals to produce certain special compounds.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>人生本来就很短暂了，需要做的事情却很多。但偏偏写作这件事，虽然折磨人，却是我为数不多的爱好之一。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> Life is already very short, and there are many things to do. But writing, although it torments people, is one of my few hobbies.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>今天只来了两个客人。再这样下去，我要付不起房租了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> Only two customers came today. If this continues, I won't be able to pay the rent.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>你们……王国最近有遇到事吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> Have you... has the kingdom encountered anything recently?",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>唉，不能，对吧……"] = "<P_Heart> (sighs) </> Sigh, no, right...",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>好吧好吧，现在我还要花钱去买遮雨布了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sigh)</> Well, well, now I have to spend money to buy rain tarps.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>工作很繁琐，单据堆成山，还要应付各种关系。有时候加班到深夜，看着窗外的雾气，我会想……这一切值得吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> The work is very tedious, documents are piled up like a mountain, and I have to deal with all kinds of relationships. Sometimes working overtime until late at night, looking at the fog outside the window, I think... is all this worth it?",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>我在家找不到她，猜到她是去了广场。谢谢您跑这一趟，我这就去。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighing) </>I couldn't find her at home, I guessed she went to the square. Thank you for making this trip, I'll go right now.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>是么，请带我去见他们吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</>Is that so? Please take me to see them.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>是啊，希望他们也能在女神的国度和家人朋友重逢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> Yeah, I hope they can reunite with their families and friends in the Goddess's kingdom.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>父亲……你的老毛病又犯了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighing) </>Father... your old habit has flared up again.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>至少，我们还有这么多来自故乡的同伴。"] = "<P_Heart> (sighing) </> At least, we still have so many companions from home.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>还有菜筐，学着收拾一下吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighing) </> And the vegetable basket, learn to tidy it up.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>那年我把儿子送回乡下。后来我们那条街闹了瘟疫，好几个孩子没了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> That year I sent my son back to the countryside. Later, there was a plague on our street, and several children were lost.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>那曾经是扮演“海洋歌者”的必要环节。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> That was once a necessary step for acting as a 'Sea King'.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>那都是过去的事了，现在老身只是一块石头。"] = "<P_Heart> (sighs) </> That's all in the past. Now, I'm just a rock.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>阿兹克先生遗失了很多记忆。他现在正在世界各地旅行，寻找能唤醒记忆的线索。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighing) </> Mr. Azik has lost many memories. He is currently traveling around the world, looking for clues that can awaken his memories.",
    ["<P_Heart>（合唱）</>我们会抬头仰望那片夜空，温情地说出祂的名字：黑夜女神……"] = "<P_Heart>(Chorus)</> We will look up at that night sky and tenderly speak Her name: Evernight Goddess...",
    ["<P_Heart>（吉瑞尔出海回来了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Girel is back from sea?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（吊牌上刻着一个名字“甜冰茶”）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A name is engraved on the tag: \"Sweet Iced Tea\") </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（向佐特兰街走能找到胸针主人——灵摆顺时针转动，表示肯定！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Walking toward Zoutland Street to find the owner of the brooch—the pendulum rotates clockwise, indicating affirmation!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（向你展示手中的毛绒玩具。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Shows you the plush toy in their hand.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（吓了一跳）</>没、没有。我在想事情……"] = "<P_Heart> (Startled) </> N-no. I was just thinking about something……",
    ["<P_Heart>（吓了一跳）</>看来它已经迫不及待了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Startled)</> It seems it can't wait any longer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（听一下吧，现在扭头就走有点太不礼貌了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's listen; it would be too impolite to turn and leave now...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听上去很危险，晚上来看一下吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds dangerous, let's come and take a look at night...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听上去很美好，然而我并没有钱……只能先回家，重新规划下家庭支出。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds great, but I don't have the money... I can only go home first and re-plan my family expenses.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听听他们在聊点什么）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Listening to what they are chatting about) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听见狗在笑，一定是我疯了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Hearing a dog laugh, I must have gone crazy.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听起来像非凡事件，不过他是普通人发现不了，所以被吓成这样……）</>好，我先去四处看看，说不定能找到什么异常。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds like a Beyonder incident, but since he's an ordinary person and couldn't detect it, that's why he's so terrified...) </>Alright, I'll go look around first. Maybe I'll find something unusual.",
    ["<P_Heart>（听起来和非凡有关……）</>好啊。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds like it's related to Beyonders...)</> Sure.",
    ["<P_Heart>（听起来和非凡有关……）好啊。</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds related to the Beyonder world...) </>Sure.",
    ["<P_Heart>（听起来蜡烛工坊经营不善，欠了不少钱。这个村民想保护芬恩……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Sounds like the candle workshop was poorly managed and owed a lot of money. This villager wants to protect Finn...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（吱吱）</>你是怎么发现的？"] = "<P_Heart> (Squeak) </> How did you find out?",
    ["<P_Heart>（吸气）</>然后呢？"] = "{<P_Heart>} (gasps) {</>} And then?",
    ["<P_Heart>（吸溜）</>再写一个“白痴”！"] = "<P_Heart>(Slurp)</> Write another 'idiot'!",
    ["<P_Heart>（吸溜）</>小蚂蚁，快爬，快爬！爬出一个“混蛋”！"] = "<P_Heart>(Slurp)</> Little ants, crawl fast, crawl fast! Crawl out a 'bastard'!",
    ["<P_Heart>（吸血鬼？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A vampire?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（吸鼻子）</>呃，有点冷，这难道就是神的启示？"] = "<P_Heart> (Sniffing) </> Uh, it's a bit cold, is this a revelation from God?",
    ["<P_Heart>（吹了声口哨）</> 都便宜了山姆这个小子！"] = "<P_Heart> (Whistles) </> It all went to that kid Sam!",
    ["<P_Heart>（吼叫）</>啊——玛丽安——你怎么不懂我的爱——啊——"] = "<P_Heart> (Howl) </> Ah—Mary Ann—why don't you understand my love—ah—",
    ["<P_Heart>（呃……还是用稳妥一些的办法吧。我现在的身份是罗塞尔，那么按他的逻辑行事，应该就能找到那位夫人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Uh... let's use a safer method. My current identity is Roselle, so if I act according to his logic, I should be able to find that lady.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（呆呆地没说话）</>……"] = "<P_Heart>(Staring blankly without speaking)</>...",
    ["<P_Heart>（呕……）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (Ugh...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（呼吸渐渐平稳下来）</>……我好像，没有那么痛了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Breathing gradually stabilizes)</>... I think, it doesn't hurt as much anymore.",
    ["<P_Heart>（呼吸逐渐平稳）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Breathing gradually steadying) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（呼喊）</> 阿尔伯特！阿尔伯特？奇怪，他刚刚还在这里。"] = "<P_Heart> (Calling out) </> Albert! Albert? Strange, he was just here a moment ago.",
    ["<P_Heart>（和克莱恩对视一眼，同时叹气）</>唉……"] = "<P_Heart> (Exchanging a glance with Klein, sighing simultaneously) </> Sigh...",
    ["<P_Heart>（和戴维结婚，把他葬在这里……都是老先生虚构的记忆？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Marrying David and burying him here... Are these all fabricated memories of the old gentleman?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（和手上的那个符号有关？不如……回去请教下阿罗德斯……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Related to the symbol on the hand? Perhaps... go back and ask Arrodes...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（和这位温和的老奶奶聊会儿天吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's chat with this gentle old lady for a while.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（和那个符号有关？找阿罗德斯请教一下……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is it related to that symbol? I'll go ask Arrodes for advice...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（和马勃搭话前，他似乎重复着“蘑菇不会饿”……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Before I spoke to Puffball, he seemed to be repeating \"mushrooms don't get hungry\"...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咕————）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Gurgle————) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咕咕——咕）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Gurgle—gurgle) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咕哝）</>唔……嗝，已经过去了三年……不，六年。还要多少年我才能在廷根拥有一个家？"] = "<P_Heart> (Muttering) </> Hmm... *hiccup*, it's already been three years... no, six. How many more years until I can have a home in Tingen?",
    ["<P_Heart>（咖啡厅……心理放松……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A cafe... mental relaxation...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咦，好像不对，我再想想。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Huh, that doesn't seem right either, let me think again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咦，好像旁边就有一只小猫。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Huh, there seems to be a kitten nearby.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咦，那张羊皮纸……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Huh, that piece of parchment...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（咳嗽）</>咳咳！好多黑烟……这可怎么办。"] = "<P_Heart>(Coughing)</> Ahem! So much black smoke... What should I do?",
    ["<P_Heart>（哇……他怎么能说得这么坚定，明明白白的人渣！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Wow... how can he say that so firmly? He's clearly a piece of trash!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（哇……苔伦头顶突然劈下一道闪电，烧焦了她的头发！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Wow... A bolt of lightning suddenly struck down on top of Taelon's head, scorching her hair!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（响声很闷，后面像是一堵实体的墙。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The sound is very muffled, as if there is a solid wall behind it.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（哎……可怜的福戈，感觉有些东西在渐渐浮出水面了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sigh... poor Fogo. It feels like some things are gradually coming to light.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（哦对，刚才聊到斯嘉丽……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Oh right, we were talking about Scarlett...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（哭泣）</>吃完了就好了 ，好了就不会被带走了…"] = "<P_Heart>(crying)</> It'll be fine once you've eaten, and you won't be taken away anymore...",
    ["<P_Heart>（哭腔）</>鲁本，开门啊！爸爸知道错了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Crying) </> Ruben, open the door! Dad knows he was wrong!",
    ["<P_Heart>（哼唱艾登的曲子）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Humming Aiden's tune) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（哼唱）</>除了“黑夜女神”，没有别的话语。"] = "<P_Heart>(Humming)</> Apart from the 'Evernight Goddess', there are no other words.",
    ["<P_Heart>（哼歌）</>祝你生日快乐，祝你生日快乐，祝亲爱的詹森生日快乐。"] = "<P_Heart>(Humming)</> Happy birthday to you, happy birthday to you, happy birthday to dear Jensen.",
    ["<P_Heart>（哽咽）</>我们家在铁十字街……父亲辛苦把我养成大学生。我却天天在这里喝个烂醉，像块在墙上粘不住的泥巴。"] = "<P_Heart>(Choking with sobs)</> Our family is on Iron Cross Street... Father worked hard to raise me as a university student. Yet I get drunk here every day, like mud that can't stick to the wall.",
    ["<P_Heart>（哽咽）</>非凡世界很危险……爸爸你不要当值夜者……老尼尔你不要信……邓恩队长你不要去……"] = "<P_Heart>(Choking with sobs)</> The Extraordinary World is dangerous... Dad, don't be a Nighthawk... Old Neil, don't believe... Captain Dunn, don't go...",
    ["<P_Heart>（唉……看来这位小姐是误会了什么。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Sigh... It seems this young lady has misunderstood something.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（唉……）</>妈妈很爱你，这就够了不是吗？我陪你等妈妈出来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sigh...) </> Mom loves you very much, isn't that enough? I'll keep you company until Mom comes out.",
    ["<P_Heart>（唉，谁忍心拒绝一只小猫的要求呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sigh, who could bear to refuse a little kitten's request?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（唉，还是离开吧。根本没法交流。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Sigh, better leave. There's no way to communicate at all.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（唏嘘）</>本来，他也应该和我一样站在这里……"] = "<P_Heart>(Sighs)</> Originally, he should have been standing here just like me...",
    ["<P_Heart>（啊，有一位女士在花丛旁洒水。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Ah, there is a lady watering plants by the flowers.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（啊，那个护身符在发光！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Ah, that amulet is glowing!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（喂，你还是信一下吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Hey, you'd better believe it!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（喂，大帝，你的节操呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Hey, Emperor, where is your integrity...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（喂，我不是许愿机啊。等下，他说的白银之城，之前在罗塞尔大帝的日记中也有提到过，先了解下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Hey, I'm not a wish-granting machine. Wait, the City of Silver he mentioned was also mentioned in Emperor Roselle's diary before. Let me learn about it first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（喃喃自语）</>弟弟，这是弟弟的礼物。有了脚踏车，就能送更多的报纸，我也可以下班去酒馆再打一份工……"] = "<P_Heart>(Muttering to himself)</> Brother, this is my brother's gift. With a bicycle, I can deliver more newspapers, and I can also go to the tavern to work another job after getting off work...",
    ["<P_Heart>（喘气）</>呼，呼……糟糕，看小说看入迷了，忘记了今天是闭馆日。"] = "<P_Heart> (Panting) </> Phew, phew... Oh no, I was so engrossed in the novel that I forgot today is a closing day.",
    ["<P_Heart>（喧哗）</>啊！"] = "<P_Heart> (Uproar) </> Ah!",
    ["<P_Heart>（嗅嗅）</>汪。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sniff sniff)</>Woof.",
    ["<P_Heart>（嗯……我怎么知道对不对啊……糟糕……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Hmm... how would I know if it's right or not... oh no...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（嗯？是我的错觉吗，这位女士似乎在看向我？咳咳……是时候展现罗塞尔的魅力了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Hmm? Is it my imagination, or is this lady looking at me? Cough, cough... it's time to show Roselle's charm.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（嗯？灵感有所触动？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Hmm? My spirituality is reacting?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（嗯？那边有两个人在指着他</><P_Yellow>窃窃私语</><P_Heart>，有点好奇。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Hmm? There are two people over there pointing at him </><P_Yellow> whispering </><P_Heart>, I'm a bit curious.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘟囔）</>……这才不是真爱之吻。"] = "<P_Heart>(Muttering)</> ...That's not a kiss of true love.",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘟囔）</>唔……艾丽的星盘似乎是落在……"] = "<P_Heart>(Muttering)</> Hmm... Ellie's horoscope seems to fall into...",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘴角含笑）</>想看跳舞，找个位置坐着就行。想多聊几句……先让酒杯满上。 "] = "<P_Heart> (with a smile on her lips) </> If you want to watch a dance, just find a seat. If you want to chat a bit more... fill up the wine glass first.",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘴角微扬）</>山丘吧。有绿色草坪的那种。不是黑面草……是真正的、柔软的绿色。"] = "<P_Heart> (Corners of mouth raised slightly) </> Hills, perhaps. The kind with green lawns. Not dark-faced grass... but real, soft green.",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘶吼）</>呜嗷——"] = "<P_Heart>(Roar)</> Woo-roar—",
    ["<P_Heart>（嘶吼）</>嗷吼——"] = "<P_Heart>(Roar)</> Awoo-roar—",
    ["<P_Heart>（嚼嚼嚼）</>也许它需要一些改进……"] = "<P_Heart> (chew chew chew) </> Maybe it needs some improvements...",
    ["<P_Heart>（回忆）</>在那里，我遇到了一个海盗打扮的女士……"] = "<P_Heart>(Recalling)</> There, I met a lady dressed as a pirate...",
    ["<P_Heart>（回忆）</>是啊，那时候进出口公司裁员，我差点失业。每天早上醒来，第一件事就是担心会不会收到辞退信。"] = "<P_Heart>(Recalls)</> Yes, back then the import-export company was laying off staff, and I almost lost my job. Every morning when I woke up, the first thing I worried about was whether I would receive a dismissal letter.",
    ["<P_Heart>（回忆）</>还有比霍纳奇斯山脉更东，比迷雾海更西的地方？"] = "<P_Heart> (Recollection) </> Is there any place further east than the Hornacis Mountain Range, or further west than the Fog Sea?",
    ["<P_Heart>（回忆）</>追了整整三天，穿越了风暴海域。他们熟悉那里的暗礁和洋流，我们差点跟丢。"] = "<P_Heart>(Recalls)</> We chased them for three whole days, crossing the stormy sea area. They were familiar with the reefs and currents there, and we almost lost them.",
    ["<P_Heart>（回神）</>太好了，终于有人来了！麻烦您帮我看看，那边到底有没有人？"] = "<P_Heart>(Coming to my senses)</> Thank goodness, someone is finally here! Could you please help me check if there's anyone over there?",
    ["<P_Heart>（回过神时，一个身影从花簇中翩然起身，它笑盈盈看着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (When you come to your senses, a figure rises gracefully from the flower clusters, looking at you with a smile.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（因蒂斯皇女、要素黎明首领、神秘女王、塔罗学派……会长的经历也太丰富了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Intis princess, leader of the Element Dawn, Mystic Queen, Tarot Club... the president's experiences are just too rich.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（因蒂斯皇女、要素黎明首领、神秘女王、塔罗学院……院长的经历也太丰富了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Intis princess, leader of the Dawn of Elements, Mystic Queen, Tarot Academy... The Dean has had such an eventful life.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（困惑）</>这些名字很熟悉，但我想不起来是谁了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Confused)</> These names are familiar, but I can't remember who they are.",
    ["<P_Heart>（固执）</>才不会！吸血鬼大人只会温柔地吻我，才不会伤害我！ "] = "<P_Heart>(Stubbornly)</> No they won't! Lord Vampire will only kiss me gently; he won't hurt me!",
    ["<P_Heart>（在廷根的危险到来前，我需要抓紧消化魔药、提升实力。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Before the danger in Tingen arrives, I need to hurry up and digest my potion to increase my strength.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在廷根的危险到来前，我需要抓紧消化魔药，提升实力。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Before the danger in Tingen arrives, I need to focus on digesting my potion and increasing my strength.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在我无助的时候，艾登给了我力量，现在我该如何安慰艾登才好呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (When I was helpless, Aiden gave me strength. Now, how should I comfort Aiden...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在教堂附近会更安全，也容易通知到值夜者们……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It will be safer near the cathedral, and it will be easier to notify the Nighthawks...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在普通人面前使用非凡力量会产生不必要的麻烦……还是独自行动吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Using Beyonder powers in front of ordinary people will cause unnecessary trouble... I'd better act alone.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在神秘学的世界里，观众可不只是观众。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (In the world of mysticism, a Spectator is not just a spectator.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在这种地方总不能用真名……对了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(In a place like this, I can't use my real name... Right.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（在这种隐秘集会中，总不能用真名……对了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(In such a secret gathering, I can't use my real name... Right.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（地上的痕迹看起来像是……“救”？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The marks on the ground look like... \"Save\"?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（坐下）</>她是真正的占卜家。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sits down) </> She is a true Seer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（坚持）</>试试吧，先开个教学局，无论胜负都不算钱，<P_Heart>（小声）</>让我感受一下赢的滋味就行……"] = "<P_Heart> (Insisting) </> Give it a try. Let's start with a tutorial round; it won't count for money regardless of who wins, <P_Heart> (Whispering) </> just let me experience the feeling of winning for once...",
    ["<P_Heart>（坦然）</>我在湖边醒过来时，浑身上下什么都没有，脑子里就更空了。镇上的人见了我都害怕，后来遇到非凡者，说这可能是非凡失控，是我命大活下来了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Composed)</> When I woke up by the lake, I had absolutely nothing on me, and my mind was even emptier. The people in town were afraid of me when they saw me. Later, I met a Beyonder who said this might have been a Beyonder loss of control, and that I was lucky to have survived.",
    ["<P_Heart>（墓前放着鲜花。初代拉姆德男爵距离现在已经一千多年了吧，竟然还有人来祭奠他的孩子……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Flowers have been placed before the grave. It has been over a thousand years since the first Baron Lamud, yet someone still comes to pay respects to his child...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音从高处传来）</>它正在成型。但还差最后一步——神明的祝福。"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice coming from above) </> It is taking shape. But it is still missing the final step—the blessing of a deity.",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音似乎是那边传来的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The voice seems to be coming from over there.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音发颤）</>布丁？"] = "<P_Heart>(Voice trembling)</> Pudding?",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音发颤）</>爸爸，妈妈，我好冷……"] = "<P_Heart>(Voice trembling)</> Daddy, Mommy, I'm so cold...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音发颤）</>这滑梯真的结实吗？我怎么看着有点不牢固…"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice trembling) </> Is this slide really sturdy? It looks a bit unstable to me...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音变低）</>我妻子生病那年冬天，我觉得撑不下去了。是海莉夫人这番话让我没有放弃。"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice lowers) </> The winter my wife got sick, I felt like I couldn't hold on. It was Madam Haley's words that kept me from giving up.",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音放柔）</>闭上眼睛。"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice softening) </> Close your eyes.",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音有些发颤）</>你们怕吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Voice trembling slightly)</> Are you afraid?",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音有些颤抖）</>冷……我感觉有点冷……"] = "<P_Heart>(Voice trembling slightly)</> Cold... I feel a bit cold...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音犹如蚊子哼哼）</>因为要上课……"] = "<P_Heart>(The voice is like a mosquito humming)</> Because I have to attend class...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音越来越小）</>可是，万一我滑到一半飞出去了怎么办…"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice getting quieter) </> But, what if I fly off halfway through...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音隐隐传来）</> 对了对了，我昨天看到房东史密斯先生了，估计是房东太太车祸受伤，他良心发现，抛下情人回家了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Voice faintly audible) </> Oh right, right, I saw the landlord, Mr. Smith, yesterday. I guess his wife got injured in a car accident, and his conscience got the better of him, so he left his mistress and went home...",
    ["<P_Heart>（声音颤抖）</>不、不，不要逼我！我无法冷静地面对她！"] = "<P_Heart>(Voice trembling)</> No, no, don't force me! I can't face her calmly!",
    ["<P_Heart>（大喘气）</>知道了，诶，慢点跑，还要留着力气比赛呢！"] = "<P_Heart>(Heavy breathing)</> Got it, hey, slow down, we still need to save energy for the competition!",
    ["<P_Heart>（大声地）</>我是疯子。"] = "<P_Heart> (Loudly) </> I am a madman.",
    ["<P_Heart>（大家似乎都在想着什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Everyone seems to be thinking about something...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大家的情绪和反应都很合理……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Everyone's emotions and reactions are very reasonable...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大帝已经被吃得差不多了……管理员希罗多德先生看到了一定会气成奥秘熔炉的！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Emperor has already been eaten up quite a bit... If the administrator, Mr. Herodotus, sees this, he will definitely be as angry as a Mystery Furnace!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大帝真是我的穿越者同胞！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Emperor really is my fellow transmigrator!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大帝绝不会对美女说“不”！再想想……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Emperor would never say 'no' to a beautiful woman! Think again...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大概……是一位在找雇主丢失的小猫的……私家侦探吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Probably... a private detective looking for a kitten lost by an employer...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大概地说明意图，暂略）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Briefly explain the intention, omitted for now)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（大笑）</>现在看都是误会，以后在金秋湖遇到麻烦，记得喊我<P_Heart>（重重拍了怕你的肩膀）</>！"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughing)</> It was all a misunderstanding. If you run into trouble at Golden Autumn Lake in the future, remember to call me <P_Heart>(pats your shoulder heavily)</>!",
    ["<P_Heart>（天台上似乎有人想要 从高处跳下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There seems to be someone on the rooftop wanting to jump from a high place.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（天台上似乎有人想要 从高处跳下，这是个扮演心理医生的好机会。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There seems to be someone on the rooftop wanting to jump from a high place, this is a good opportunity to act as a psychologist.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（天啊，为什么心跳得这么快？冷静……我只是在扮演“罗塞尔”！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Oh my god, why is my heart beating so fast? Calm down... I'm just acting as 'Roselle'!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（太奇怪了……再到处看看。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(How strange... I'll look around some more.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（太诡异了，我要看看你身上究竟发生了什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This is too bizarre, I need to see what exactly happened to you...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（失神）</>永暗的蜡烛，永恒的宁静……"] = "<P_Heart> (In a trance) </> The candle of eternal darkness, eternal peace...",
    ["<P_Heart>（失踪事件……神秘怨念，看来的确是非凡事件。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Disappearance incident... mysterious resentment, it seems this is indeed a Beyonder incident.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（头部和脑部表面呈现淡紫色，整体笼罩在灰色中……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The head and the surface of the brain appear pale purple, and the whole is shrouded in gray...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（奇怪的动作……他也是非凡者？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Strange movements... is he also a Beyonder?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（奇怪，灵视里干干净净，并没有邪灵的痕迹。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Strange, it's clean in spirit vision, there are no traces of evil spirits.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（奇迹？愚者教会的圣典里说，愚者执掌奇迹……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Miracle? The scriptures of the Fool's Church say that the Fool governs miracles...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（女孩似乎在等一位叫泽维尔的人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The girl seems to be waiting for someone named Xavier.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（女神啊，只是送一份礼物，他怎么说得像求婚——）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Goddess, it's just giving a gift, why does he make it sound like a marriage proposal—)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她们聊到了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They are talking about...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她似乎沉浸在自己的世界里，听不见我的声音了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (She seems immersed in her own world and can no longer hear my voice...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她好像一直期盼有一个英雄登场，似乎</><P_Yellow>十分确信对方的存在</><P_Heart>。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (She seems to have been waiting for a hero to appear, and it seems </> <P_Yellow> she is very certain of their existence </> <P_Heart>.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她局促地舔了舔嘴唇，脏污的脚前进又后退，犹豫了半晌，终于还是离开了这里。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (She licked her lips awkwardly, her dirty feet moving forward and back. After hesitating for a long time, she finally left.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她很痛苦，像在忍受着非人的折磨。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(She is in great pain, as if enduring inhuman torment.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她担心我是因为焦虑面试而失眠了吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is she worried that I have insomnia because of anxiety about the interview?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她注视着你，在她清澈而智慧的目光下，你的一切想法似乎都无处遁形。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (She gazes at you, and under her clear and wise eyes, all your thoughts seem to have nowhere to hide.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她的反应……看来…… )</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Her reaction... it seems...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她的情绪看起来很不好……先检查一下亚伦的尸体吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(She seems to be in a terrible mood... I should examine Aaron's body first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她的状态很不对劲，已经无法正常沟通了……“魔术师”女士借我的笔记上记录了“催眠读心”的能力，可以试试……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Her condition is very wrong; she can no longer communicate normally... The notes lent to me by the Magician record the ability of 'Hypnosis' and 'Mind Reading', I can try that...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她的眼神传递出挫败。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Her eyes convey frustration.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她眯起眼睛，嘴角上扬，笑得很开心。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(She squints her eyes, the corners of her mouth lift, and she smiles very happily.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她脸上绽放出自豪的微笑。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A proud smile blooms on her face.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她要真是大地母神信徒，这可就是毒誓了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If she really is a believer of the Earth Mother, this is a deadly oath...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（她说造铁甲舰？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Did she say she's building an ironclad warship?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好、好长……而且好像什么尊名……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So, so long... and it sounds like some kind of honorific name...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好主意，总不能一直称呼你们为先生和小姐。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Good idea, I can't keep calling you Mr. and Miss.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好主意，总不能一直称呼你们为男士和女士。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Good idea. I can't keep calling you 'sir' and 'lady'.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好乱，好奇怪……老先生原本和戴维相爱，但戴维爱上了阿斯兰？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So chaotic, so strange... The old gentleman was originally in love with David, but David fell in love with Aslan?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像又忘记了什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems I've forgotten something again...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像只是个普通病人？用读心者的能力试试吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (She seems like just an ordinary patient? Let me try using my Spectator abilities.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像可以移动了……难道是这张牌带来的力量？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems I can move now... Could it be the power brought by this card?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像在小声咒骂，听不清她在说什么。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems to be cursing under her breath, can't hear what she's saying.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像是有顾客一直试穿又退换衣服啊……真是糟糕的行为。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems like a customer keeps trying on and returning clothes... what a terrible behavior.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像有人来了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Someone seems to be coming.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像有哪里不对）</>你是说，她是你喝酒时认识的？有没有可能，她对每个人都是这么说的？"] = "<P_Heart> (Something seems wrong) </> You mean, you met her while drinking? Is it possible that she says this to everyone?",
    ["<P_Heart>（好像错了，我换另外的试试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That seems wrong, let me try something else.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好凶……要不要先去报警……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So fierce... should I call the police first...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好可怜的乞丐，给点硬币吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What a pitiful beggar, give him some coins.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好吧，并不是。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Well, it's not.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好吧，至少还没被人掀了摊子，也许动嘴皮子狡辩求饶也是“智慧”的一种表现。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Well, at least he hasn't had his stall overturned yet, perhaps glib-tongued sophistry and begging for mercy is also a form of \"wisdom\".) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好吵……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So noisy...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好喝……温暖的味道……心情似乎也好多了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Delicious... a warm taste... my mood seems much better...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好奇）</>为什么？您唱的是什么歌呢？"] = "<P_Heart>(Curiously)</> Why? What kind of song do you sing?",
    ["<P_Heart>（好奇）</>那后来是怎么解决的？"] = "<P_Heart>(Curiously)</> Then how was it resolved later?",
    ["<P_Heart>（好恶心、好可怕……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So disgusting, so terrifying...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好浓郁的香气，有一股特别的风味。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Such a rich aroma, it has a special flavor.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好累……去休息一会儿吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So tired... I'll go get some rest.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好累……去休息室坐会儿吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So tired... I'll go sit in the lounge for a while.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好苛刻的条件，都是什么人在租这种房子啊？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What harsh conditions, what kind of people are renting this kind of place?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好诡异……但好像都是梦境或潜意识的问题？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(How strange... but it seems like they are all problems of dreams or the subconscious?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如今拉姆德男爵早已没有直系后裔，小镇也变成了度假胜地。 ）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Nowadays, Baron Lamud no longer has any direct descendants, and the small town has become a vacation resort.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果仪式魔法真的指向他，那、那就必须用祂来尊称了。真是幸运啊，我一直表现得很配合，没有做一些蠢事，即使试探也在合理范围内……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If the Ritual Magic truly points to Him, then, then I must use the honorific \"He\" to address Him. How fortunate I am; I have always behaved cooperatively and haven't done anything stupid, even my probing was within reasonable limits...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果我也是非凡者的话，就不会这么慌张了吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If I were also a Beyonder, I wouldn't be this panicked...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果是在黑荆棘附近，或许是神秘学力量在发挥作用呢。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If it's near Blackthorn, perhaps mysterious powers are at play.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果真是我导致了他们的死亡……我完全不记得了，我会被抓起来吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(If it really was me who caused their deaths... I don't remember it at all. Will I be arrested?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果能帮他演完这出戏，或许就能打破这个空间，让他恢复正常。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(If I can help him finish this play, perhaps I can break this space and restore him to normal.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果能熟练掌握占卜的技巧，应该就能预测未来的天气吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If I could master the techniques of divination, I should be able to predict the future weather...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（如果靠蹩脚小把戏骗人也能称为智慧的话……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If relying on cheap tricks to deceive people can also be called wisdom...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（妹妹，你们非要挑选最危险的魔镜占卜吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sister, do you really have to choose the most dangerous Mirror Divination?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（妻子？他？什么情况……戴维，一个男性名字？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Wife? He? What's going on... David, a male name?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（委屈）</>吼……吼吼……"] = "<P_Heart>(Aggrieved)</> Roar... roar roar...",
    ["<P_Heart>（姿势庄严，静默不语的古老铠甲。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Ancient armor, solemn in posture, silent and motionless.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（嫌弃地）</>喵……喵！"] = "<P_Heart> (disdainfully) </> Meow... meow!",
    ["<P_Heart>（学徒途径的短距离传送？还是其他什么能力……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Short-distance teleportation from the Apprentice pathway? Or some other ability...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（孩子们都爱看小丑杂耍……扮演小丑试试吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Children love watching clown juggling... Let's try acting as a clown.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（它们在宝箱旁发出了一声声嗡鸣——仿佛在做着最后的警告。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (They emit a buzzing sound next to the treasure chest—as if they are giving a final warning.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（它会说话？果然是只非凡生物。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It can talk? It really is a Beyonder creature.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（它发出一声舒适的呜咽，主动往你旁边靠了靠，低头嗅着食物。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It lets out a comfortable whimper, leans against you, and lowers its head to sniff the food.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（它呆住了两秒，然后庄重地抬起右前爪，在胸口顺时针连点四下——一个简单但准确的黑夜女神圣徽轮廓。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It freezes for two seconds, then solemnly raises its right front paw and taps its chest four times in a clockwise direction—a simple but accurate outline of the Evernight Goddess's holy emblem.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（安全。可以进去。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Safe. You can go in.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（安迪还在小镇，安迪还在小镇……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Andy is still in the small town, Andy is still in the small town...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（完成地图的那一刻，席卷我的不是满足……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The moment I finished the map, what swept over me was not satisfaction...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（宝箱周围散落着各式各样亮闪闪的石头，宝箱的主人似乎很喜欢这些会发光的小东西。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Various shiny stones are scattered around the treasure chest; the owner of the chest seems to like these little glowing things very much.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（宝箱周围的空气裹挟着一股怪异的花香袭来——那香气甜得过分，甜到让视线都有一刹那的失焦。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The air around the treasure chest is filled with a strange floral fragrance—the scent is excessively sweet, so sweet that your vision loses focus for a moment.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（宝箱旁摆放着三柄铭刻有符文的武器，虽然看上去锈迹斑斑，却能清晰的感觉到它们散发的寒意。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Three weapons engraved with runes are placed next to the treasure chest; although they look rusty, you can clearly feel the chill they emit.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（宠溺的笑）</>不敢多看？那你这眼睛往哪儿瞟呢？"] = "<P_Heart>(Doting smile)</> Don't dare to look too much? Then where are your eyes darting to?",
    ["<P_Heart>（害羞）</>嘿嘿，真的吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Shy) </>Hehe, really?",
    ["<P_Heart>（害羞）</>好嘛，那吃完我请你喝点上好的南威尔啤酒。听说今晚月色很好，我们还可以去码头散散步，吹吹风。你出差整整一周了，肯定有好多话想和我说，对不对？"] = "<P_Heart> (Shyly) </> Alright then, after we eat, I'll treat you to some fine Southwell beer. I heard the moonlight is beautiful tonight, and we can go for a walk at the dock and enjoy the breeze. You've been on a business trip for a whole week; you must have a lot to tell me, right?",
    ["<P_Heart>（害羞）</>这位{{英俊的先生|优雅的女士}}，请恕我还……没想明白这个问题。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shy)</> This { { handsome gentleman | elegant lady } }, please forgive me, I... haven't figured that question out yet.",
    ["<P_Heart>（对了，下一个纪元是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That's right, the next epoch is...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（对了，那个消失的艾利欧，不知道去哪里了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Right, that missing Elio, I wonder where he went...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（对于这个时候的艾登来说，也许音乐就是他最好的慰藉……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (For Aiden at this time, perhaps Music is his best comfort...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（对方挥手招呼你靠近）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The other party waves for you to come closer) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（对着蔬菜摊）</>听着，摊子已经是我的了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Facing the vegetable stall) </> Listen, the stall is already mine!",
    ["<P_Heart>（对老妇人）</>在塔罗牌里，逆位死神的标准释义是拒绝改变、停滞不前、无法获得新生。"] = "<P_Heart> (To the old woman) </> In Tarot, the standard interpretation of Death reversed is a refusal to change, stagnation, and an inability to achieve a new beginning.",
    ["<P_Heart>（对，伊丽莎白是一位神秘学爱好者，应该能帮上忙。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Right, Elizabeth is an occult enthusiast, she should be able to help.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（寻人应该可以使用“占卜家”能力中的“卜杖寻路”，但需要任务对象的贴身物件。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Dowsing Rod Navigation should be usable for finding people using the Seer's abilities, but it requires a personal item belonging to the target.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声嘀咕）</>  我也要回去试试看。说不定借助“神降”仪式散发的力量，也能召唤出什么好东西。"] = "<P_Heart>(Muttering to himself)</> I should go back and try it too. Maybe with the power emitted by the 'divine descent' ritual, I can also summon something good.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声嘀咕）</>说起来，这位前辈……真是一点也不给后人留活路啊。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering to himself) </> Come to think of it, this predecessor... really didn't leave any room for those who came after.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声念叨）</>{{他|她}}明知我是瞭望塔，还要问是不是非凡者，肯定有什么深意。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering to self) </>{{ He| She}} knows I am a Watchtower, yet still asks if I am a Beyonder. There must be some deeper meaning.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声惊呼）</> 我没看错吧……是梅兰妮和斯嘉丽？她们一起参加告解？"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering in surprise) </> Am I seeing things... Is that Melanie and Scarlett? Are they attending confession together?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>{{PlayerName}}，逛得差不多了，我们去旁边聊聊吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> {{PlayerName}}, we've looked around enough, let's go over there and talk.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>……行，就这块了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </>... Fine, I'll take this one.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>……还是算了，万一结果不好，她会更难过的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</>...Better not. If the result is bad, she'll be even more upset.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>万一吃坏了肚子，还可以报销嘛。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> If it upsets our stomachs, we can still get reimbursed.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>下次得小心说话了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Need to be careful with my words next time...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>什么，竟然有成效？噢，当然了，女士。再可怕的今天之后，总会有明天。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> What, it actually worked? Oh, of course, ma'am. After even the most terrifying today, there will always be a tomorrow.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>伦纳德先生？您怎么在这？"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Mr. Leonard? Why are you here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>你……快过来一下……我有件东西给你……"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</>You... come here for a second... I have something for you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>你确实是个很有外交才能的人，兰格看人真准。"] = "<P_Heart> (whispering) </> You are indeed a person with great diplomatic talent; Lange's judgment of people is truly accurate.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>再坚持一下，再坚持攒上半年的工资，我就能拥有它了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Just hold on a little longer, save up for another half a year's salary, and I can have it!",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>别这么不解风情，给他们点独处时间。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Don't be so dense; give them some time alone.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>又是这无赖……上个月讹了我五苏勒。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> This scoundrel again... he swindled me out of five soli last month.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>呼……掌握节奏，就像找到打字机的节奏一样。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Phew... master the rhythm, just like finding the rhythm of a typewriter.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>和我好好聊天了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> chatted with me properly.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>咳，可能是女神的指引。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Cough, it might be the guidance of the Goddess.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>她看起来很伤心。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</>She looks very sad.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>她那么能干，又招人喜欢，要是有一天觉得我太没用，离开我怎么办？"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> She's so capable and well-liked, what if one day she thinks I'm too useless and leaves me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>如果经费允许的话。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> If the budget allows it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>威士忌啊，我的宝贝，我要是不能给艾米莉亚一个好的生活怎么办？"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Whiskey, my baby. What if I can't provide a good life for Amelia?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>对了，还有一位的意见要询问，来帮我做一下准备吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> By the way, there is one more person's opinion to ask. Come help me prepare.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>应该没发现我和她俩的关系吧……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> She shouldn't have discovered my relationship with both of them, right...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>开玩笑的啦，她才舍不得呢，嘻嘻。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> She's just joking, she couldn't bear to do that, hee hee.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>想亲眼看我幸福就不要做这么危险的……"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> If you want to see me happy with your own eyes, don't do such dangerous...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>我学占卜不就是为了帮助别人吗！"] = "<P_Heart>(Quietly)</> Isn't helping others why I learned divination?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>我来廷根出差几天，怎么能错过这么有趣的事？"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> I'm here in Tingen for a few days on business, how could I miss such an interesting thing?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>拜托，帮我逃走！我拖住他们，你去拿架子上的魔药！"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Please, help me escape! I'll hold them off, you go get the potion on the shelf!",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>新人，先做这个动作！"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Newbie, do this movement first!",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>洛罗总这么吃，迟早会出事的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> If Loro keeps eating like this, something will happen sooner or later.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>给西里尔太太找的女仆不能太聪明，不然太难管束了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> The maid found for Mrs. Cyril can't be too smart, otherwise, she'll be too hard to manage.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>血迹，消失了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> The bloodstains, they've disappeared.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>该死，这里好福利的名声已经传出去了，竞争者有点多啊……"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> Damn, the reputation of the good benefits here has already spread. There are quite a few competitors...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>这时间也太巧了，我还以为您是为了罗珊的相亲专门回来的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> The timing is too coincidental; I thought you came back specifically for Rozanne's blind date.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>那罗珊他们呢？"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> What about Rozanne and the others?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>隔得那么远，还好意思说……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> He's so far away, yet he has the nerve to say that...",
    ["<P_Heart>（小心翼翼地捧出）</>这就是我们的镇店之宝——星辰之泪！"] = "<P_Heart> (Carefully holding out) </> This is the treasure of our shop—Tears of the Stars!",
    ["<P_Heart>（小心观察，保持观众身份，避免被它发现。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Observe carefully, maintain the identity of a Spectator, and avoid being discovered by it.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小心询问）</>请问这位……呃，瞭望塔先生，您应该是非凡者吧？"] = "<P_Heart> (Ask cautiously) </> Excuse me, Mr... uh, Watchtower, you must be a Beyonder, right?",
    ["<P_Heart>（小新闻？她应该认为这是颠覆性的大新闻才对。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A small piece of news? She should think this is earth-shattering, major news.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小狗一味地傻笑，什么也没有发生。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The puppy just giggles foolishly, and nothing happens.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小猫优雅地看过来，惬意地伸了个懒腰。）</>喵呜。"] = "<P_Heart> (The kitten looks over elegantly and stretches comfortably.) </> Meow.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小猫发出了轻微的鼾声）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (The kitten let out a slight snoring sound) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小猫看上去不太对劲，催催拉斯特拉吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The kitten doesn't look right. Let's hurry up and urge Lastra.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小猫记忆里的锅，又写着“苏醒的友人”，应该是小猫的信？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The pot in the kitten's memory, also inscribed with \"Awakened Friend,\" this must be the kitten's letter?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小鸟扑腾着翅膀，发出了焦急的叫声。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The little bird flutters its wings, letting out anxious cries.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小黛西？黛西小姐？听他们的口吻，不是一个人？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Little Daisy? Miss Daisy? Judging by their tone, they aren't the same person?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（尖叫）</>哥哥！哥哥！"] = "<P_Heart>(Screams)</> Brother! Brother!",
    ["<P_Heart>（就不该听信……疯子的话……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Shouldn't have listened to... the madman's words...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（就和她因为坐在公共长椅之上而道歉一样。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Just as she apologized for sitting on a public bench.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（就差一点……只要能多承受一点……我就能找到答案……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Just a little more... as long as I can endure a little more... I can find the answer...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（就这么慢慢地、把对方引去教堂附近……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Just like this, slowly lead the other party toward the cathedral...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（尴尬）</>我手上这瓶是最后的了，如果您不嫌弃的话。"] = "<P_Heart>(Embarrassed)</> This bottle in my hand is the last one, if you don't mind.",
    ["<P_Heart>（尾巴竖起炸开）</>咕噜咕噜！"] = "<P_Heart> (tail stands up and puffs out) </> Gulu gulu!",
    ["<P_Heart>（巡视）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Patrol) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（工作真可怕啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Work is truly terrifying.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（工厂陷入了困境……但老莱纳是看见福戈才提到抵押商铺的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The factory is in trouble... but old Lainer only mentioned mortgaging the shop after seeing Fogo.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（差不多到约定的时间了……去湖边找安迪汇合吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It's almost time for the appointment... Let's go to the Lakeside to meet Andy.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（已经倒入了3份酸液，根据纸条上的描述，根茎的用量ω是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (3 parts of acid have already been poured; according to the description on the note, the dosage ω of the rhizome is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（已经倒入了6份酸液，根据纸条上的描述，根茎的用量ω是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (6 parts of acid have already been poured; according to the description on the note, the dosage ω of the rhizome is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（已经倒入了9份酸液，根据纸条上的描述，根茎的用量ω是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (9 parts of acid have already been poured; according to the description on the note, the dosage ω of the rhizome is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（已经找不到菲利普的踪影了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can no longer find any trace of Philip.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（布雷登……是一个灵体？这是怎么回事！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Braden... is a spirit body? What is going on!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（希望曼妮莎小姐勇敢动身之后，这对可爱小恋人能快快相聚。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I hope that after Miss Manisha bravely sets off, this cute little couple can reunite quickly.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（希望这次是真的没有别的事了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Hope there really isn't anything else this time...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（希望附近的墙里不要再出现一个破洞的屁股……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I hope another butt with a hole in it doesn't appear in the nearby wall...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（帕里克也在找梦境捕手的资料？这倒帮了我的忙。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Parick is also looking for information on the Dream Catcher? That actually helps me.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（带着哭腔）</>我一定会回来的！"] = "<P_Heart> (With a sobbing tone) </> I will definitely be back!",
    ["<P_Heart>（带着愤怒和气势）</>吼！吼！吼！吼吼哦——吼！"] = "<P_Heart> (With Anger and momentum)</> Roar! Roar! Roar! Roar-roar-oh—roar!",
    ["<P_Heart>（帮店铺配送……也许是个商机？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Helping the shop with deliveries... maybe that's a business opportunity?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（帮忙占卜下未来的天气吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Help me divine the future weather...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（平静地看着你）</>你说完了吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks at you calmly) </> Are you finished?",
    ["<P_Heart>（平静地看着玩家）</>你说完了吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looking at the player calmly)</> Are you finished?",
    ["<P_Heart>（平静）</>这就是海上的日常。商船需要保护，邪教徒需要清剖，遗迹需要探索，还有……"] = "<P_Heart>(Calmly)</> This is just daily life at sea. Merchant ships need protection, cultists need to be purged, ruins need to be explored, and also...",
    ["<P_Heart>（平静）</>这就是海上的日常。商船需要保护，邪教徒需要清剿，遗迹需要探索，还有……"] = "<P_Heart> (Calmly) </> This is the daily routine at sea. Merchant ships need protection, cultists need to be purged, ruins need to be explored, and also...",
    ["<P_Heart>（序列8，午夜诗人，伦纳德……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sequence 8, Midnight Poet, Leonard...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（序列9？魔药配方？水手和观众？非凡者是指拥有非凡能力的人？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sequence 9? Potion formulas? Sailor and Spectator? Does Beyonder refer to someone who possesses extraordinary abilities?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（序列9？魔药配方？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sequence 9? Potion formula?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（应该不会发生什么非凡事件吧？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Nothing extraordinary should happen, right?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（应该是是在工厂中受到了一些非凡影响……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems he was affected by some Beyonder influence in the factory...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（开心）</>吼吼！"] = "<P_Heart>(Happy)</> Roar roar!",
    ["<P_Heart>（开朗一笑）</>哈哈，再有钱，也要细细规划呀！每一个硬币都应该花在值得的地方。"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs brightly)</> Haha, no matter how much money you have, you still need to plan carefully! Every coin should be spent where it's worth it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（开朗一笑）</>哈哈，班森很适合在财务部工作。但莫雷蒂家的宗旨是——每个硬币都应该花在值得的地方。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughs brightly) </> Haha, Benson is very well-suited for the finance department. But the Moretti family motto is—every coin should be spent where it's worth it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（异口同声）</>没错，等待戈多！"] = "<P_Heart> (In unison) </> That's right, waiting for Godot!",
    ["<P_Heart>（弗洛的弟弟？看起来不太喜欢占星术啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Flo's younger brother? Doesn't seem to like astrology very much.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（弗莱先生似乎很了解济贫院……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Mr. Frye seems to know a lot about the poorhouse...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（张大嘴）</>这枪我卖五苏勒都没人要！"] = "<P_Heart> (Mouth agape) </> I couldn't even sell this gun for five soli!",
    ["<P_Heart>（张望）</>帕里克呢？"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking around) </> Where is Palik?",
    ["<P_Heart>（强忍颤抖）</>呃……我说老伙计，咱们非得用这种方式较量不可吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Struggling to suppress the trembling) </> Uh... I say, old pal, do we really have to compete in this way?",
    ["<P_Heart>（很兴奋）</>了不起，你居然撞破了冰山！"] = "<P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> Amazing, you actually broke through the iceberg!",
    ["<P_Heart>（很好！没有被控制。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Great! Not controlled.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（很抱歉擅自评价他人，但她并非“美丽无比”，应该不是那位奥莉薇女士。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I'm sorry to judge others, but she is not \"incredibly beautiful,\" she probably isn't that Ms. Olivia.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（得先摸清情况，确定会不会给市民带来危险。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I must first assess the situation and determine if it poses a danger to the citizens.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（得想想该怎么说……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Need to think about how to say this...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（得教训一下他们。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Need to teach them a lesson.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（得赶紧灭火，应该用什么？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Must put out the fire quickly, what should I use?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（微弱的声音）</>有人吗？救命——"] = "<P_Heart> (Faint voice) </> Is anyone there? Help—",
    ["<P_Heart>（微微一愣）</>不，拥有非凡力量必须要承受相应的代价……"] = "<P_Heart> (Slightly stunned) </> No, possessing Beyonder powers requires bearing the corresponding price...",
    ["<P_Heart>（微微一笑）</>当然，这只是老人家的一点玄谈，您不必当真。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles slightly) </> Of course, this is just some old man's mystical talk; you don't have to take it seriously.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微微抬起头）</>面包房……对，我会在送完面包后，在柜台后面画我的图纸！"] = "<P_Heart>(Slightly raising her head)</> Bakery... Yes, I draw my drawings behind the counter after delivering the bread!",
    ["<P_Heart>（微微鞠躬）</>所以想拜托你帮我取一下图纸。"] = "<P_Heart> (Bows slightly) </> So I would like to ask you to help me pick up the blueprint.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微微鞠躬）</>领主大人，请跟我来，我将为您介绍这片领地。"] = "<P_Heart> (Bows slightly) </> Lord, please follow me, I will introduce you to this territory.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>不用太有压力，你还只是非凡世界的新生。在你成长起来之前，我们不会让你面对到那些恐怖的存在。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Don't feel too much pressure; you are still a newcomer to the Extraordinary World. Before you grow up, we will not let you face those terrifying existences.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>不，在现实世界我有很多身份，你如果想找我，可以去鲁恩慈善基金会。至于心理治疗，这是“观众”途径的非凡能力。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Fund. As for psychotherapy, that is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Spectator' pathway.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>他就是“愚者”先生启示里的那位新生。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiling)</> He is the newcomer mentioned in Mr. Fool's revelation.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>但当我拿到薪水……我知道这每一苏勒都不是白来的，也不会浪费……"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> But when I get my salary... I know that every soli didn't come easily, and it won't be wasted...",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>你是一个好的占卜家了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> You are a good Seer now.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>你是说他的家庭？那不重要，我们只是把海伍德当成一起追梦的朋友。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Are you talking about his family? That's not important; we just consider Heywood a friend chasing dreams with us.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>你是说他的身份？那不重要，我们只是把海伍德当成我们并肩的伙伴。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> Are you talking about his identity? That's not important; we just treat Haywood as our comrade-in-arms.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>你的猫很漂亮。它叫什么？"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> Your cat is beautiful. What's its name?",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>嗯，我知道。不必在意，这样的事情有时会发生。"] = "<P_Heart> (smiles) </> Hmm, I know. Don't worry about it, things like this happen sometimes.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>在成为非凡者之前，我也这么认为。但现在我知道，占卜确实有效，只是需要正确的方法。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Before I became a Beyonder, I thought the same. But now I know that divination is indeed effective; it just requires the right method.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>太阳……温暖的光……很适合他。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Sun... warm light... it suits him very well.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我们得到了“愚者”先生的启示，知道你得到了神话织茧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> We received the revelation from Mr. \"The Fool\" and knew you had obtained the Mythical Cocoon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我们得到了愚者先生的启示，知道你得到了神话织茧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiling)</> We have received the revelation from Mr. Fool, knowing that you have obtained the Mythical Cocoon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我回想起的记忆，或许能对历史系的研究起到一些帮助。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> The memories I recall might be of some help to the research in the history department.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我的选择和你一样。这也是我成为塔罗学派导师的原因。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> My choice is the same as yours. This is also the reason why I became a mentor at the Tarot Club.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我直接告诉他——“弗兰奇先生，我们是来退租的。”然后开始谈判……"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> I told him directly—'Mr. Frank, we are here to terminate the lease.' Then I started negotiating...",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我看得出来，你一定会全力以赴。而你的实力想必也足以佐证我的话语。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> I can tell that you will definitely give it your all. And your strength must also be enough to substantiate my words.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>我知道你想问序列是什么。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiling)</> I know you want to ask what a Sequence is.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>所以，谢谢你的喜欢——这对我来说很重要。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> So, thank you for liking it—this is very important to me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>没事，不用安慰我。我知道，他并没有真正地离开我们。只是、只是有一点点，一点点伤感罢了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> It's okay, you don't need to comfort me. I know he hasn't truly left us. It's just, just a little, a little bit sad.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>谬赞。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> You flatter me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（微笑）</>这确实是非常合理的价格。请为我包起来吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> This is indeed a very reasonable price. Please wrap it up for me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（心中一惊）</>他怎么长成这样……"] = "<P_Heart>(Startled)</> How did he end up looking like this...",
    ["<P_Heart>（心情低落）</>吼……"] = "<P_Heart>(Feeling down)</> Roar...",
    ["<P_Heart>（心生一丝愧疚）</> 唉，偷听总归不太好……"] = "<P_Heart> (Feeling a hint of guilt) </> Sigh, eavesdropping is never really a good thing...",
    ["<P_Heart>（必须阻止他们。不过，最好先确认一下风险……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Must stop them. However, it's best to confirm the risks first...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（忍住笑意）</>我来吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Suppressing a smile) </> Let me do it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（忍笑）</> 那也就是说，如果有一天你们要切磋的话……"] = "<P_Heart>(Suppressing a laugh)</> That means, if one day you two were to spar...",
    ["<P_Heart>（忍笑）</>其实……很有力量感？"] = "<P_Heart>(Holding back laughter)</> Actually... it has a sense of power?",
    ["<P_Heart>（忙忙碌碌）</>算了算了走开点，别挡道。"] = "<P_Heart> (Busy) </> Forget it, forget it, get out of the way, don't block the road.",
    ["<P_Heart>（忽然传出沙哑的声音）</>咳咳……两苏勒，先交钱，后交货。"] = "<P_Heart> (a hoarse voice suddenly comes out) </> Cough, cough... two soli, pay first, then get the goods.",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎、怎么不说话……不会又要发疯吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (W-why aren't you speaking... don't tell me you're going to go crazy again...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎么回事，头有些痛，感觉要撑不住了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What's going on? My head hurts a bit, I feel like I can't hold on anymore...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎么想也是这个最不靠谱啊！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (How could this be the least reliable one!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎么感觉这具身体这么陌生？我为什么在这里？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why does this body feel so unfamiliar? Why am I here?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎么有一个人蹲在这里？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why is someone squatting here?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怎么看都只是一家酒吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It just looks like a bar no matter how you look at it...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（怒意）</>你……你刚才在和公爵阁下约会？"] = "<P_Heart> (Angrily) </> You... were you just on a date with the Duke?",
    ["<P_Heart>（怔住）</>什么意思？"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned) </> What do you mean?",
    ["<P_Heart>（怔怔地看着菊花）</>……"] = "<P_Heart> (Stares blankly at the chrysanthemums) </> ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（怔怔望着面具）</>为什么……看着它的时候，我的心像是要胀裂一般疼……"] = "<P_Heart>(Staring blankly at the mask)</> Why... does my heart feel like it's about to burst with pain when I look at it...",
    ["<P_Heart>（思索）</><P_Heart>（大冒险家格尔曼？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking) </> <P_Heart> (The Great Adventurer Gehrman?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考片刻）</>你在广场上就像是一面<P_Yellow>旗帜</>，和你聊天真是件<P_Yellow>喜事</>。"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking for a moment) </> You are like a <P_Yellow> flag </> in the square; chatting with you is truly a <P_Yellow> joyous occasion </>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考片刻）</>我也常常在生活的韵脚里穿针引线。"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking for a moment) </> I also often thread needles in the rhymes of life.",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考）</>“织梦黑匣”，由记忆编织的梦境空间……"] = "<P_Heart>(Thinking)</> 'Dream-Weaving Black Box', a Dream Space woven from memories...",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考）</>会不会是你唱的有问题？它不喜欢你的节奏？"] = "<P_Heart>(Thinking)</> Could it be that there's a problem with your singing? It doesn't like your rhythm?",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考）</>正好！有个涉及非凡因素的案件……你是“启明小队”的正式成员，应该不算太危险。"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking) </> Perfect! There is a case involving Beyonder factors... You are an official member of the 'Dawn Squad', so it shouldn't be too dangerous.",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考）</>购买材料像是一个考验……先进去看看。"] = "<P_Heart> (Thinking) </> Buying materials seems like a test... let's go in and see.",
    ["<P_Heart>（思考）</>那肯定是手术成功率！ 虽说我们医院最近几年才把手术作为重要治疗手段，但是我们的医生学习得都很快，治好了不少工厂工人的工伤和急症。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Thinking)</> That must be the success rate of the surgery! Although our hospital has only used surgery as an important treatment method in recent years, our doctors learn very quickly and have cured many industrial injuries and acute illnesses of factory workers.",
    ["<P_Heart>（总不能说我被奇怪的事件缠上，为了保命不得不做了这份工作……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can't exactly say that I've been entangled in strange events and had to take this job to save my life...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（总之先别管这个晕乎乎的家伙了。刚才两个人都快走远了，八卦还没听完呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Anyway, let's ignore this dizzy fellow for now. The other two are almost gone, and I haven't finished hearing the gossip yet...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（总感觉哪里怪怪的）</>先生，看来你也对演讲有研究？"] = "<P_Heart> (Always feel something is weird) </> Sir, it seems you also have research on oratory?",
    ["<P_Heart>（总感觉哪里怪怪的）</>先生，看起来你也很喜欢诗歌，聊聊你对诗歌的看法？"] = "<P_Heart> (Always feel something is weird) </> Sir, it seems you also like poetry, tell me your thoughts on poetry?",
    ["<P_Heart>（总算松了一口气……再去喝一杯好了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Finally, I can breathe a sigh of relief... I'll go have another drink.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（恍惚）</>不管怎样，结束了，菲尔疯了，安迪死了，还有那么多死去的兄弟……"] = "<P_Heart>(Dazed)</> Regardless, it's over. Phil has gone mad, Andy is dead, and so many other brothers have passed away...",
    ["<P_Heart>（恍惚）</>结束了，安迪也……"] = "<P_Heart>(Dazed)</> It's over, and Andy is also...",
    ["<P_Heart>（恐怕很长时间，我都睡不好了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'm afraid I won't be able to sleep well for a long time...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（恐惧）</>没人来过，是凭空消失的！就像真的有……有……"] = "<P_Heart>(Horror)</> No one has been here, it disappeared into thin air! As if there really were... were...",
    ["<P_Heart>（恶狠狠）</>立刻离开，不然你会永远被埋葬在这。"] = "<P_Heart> (Viciously) </> Leave immediately, or you will be buried here forever.",
    ["<P_Heart>（恶魔附身……难道苜蓿号惨案并非意外？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Demon possession... Could the Clover tragedy not have been an accident?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（悲伤）</>时间开了一个多么残忍的玩笑。 在我无知的岁月里，我的朋友都被带走了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sadness) </> What a cruel joke time has played. In my ignorant years, my friends were all taken away.",
    ["<P_Heart>（情绪兴奋……应该是因为今天的生日晚宴吧，暂时看起来没事。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Emotionally excited... that must be because of tonight's birthday banquet. Everything seems fine for now.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊叹）</>果然是神话造物。"] = "<P_Heart> (Amazed) </> As expected of a mythical creation.",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊叹）</>简直是手枪大师！"] = "<P_Heart> (Exclaims in awe) </> Simply a master of pistols!",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>你是来给305的小女孩表演的吗？她今天疼得一直哭，如果看到小丑，她一定会笑的！"] = "<P_Heart> (surprised) </> Are you here to perform for the little girl in 305? She's been crying in pain all day; if she sees a Clown, she'll definitely smile!",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>你认识她？"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> You know her?",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>尊贵的阿罗德斯大人……"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised) </> Honorable Lord Arrodes...",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>您是说，如此精美别致的饰品现在只需要两百金镑？请一并包起来吧——如果还有类似的款式，请也都为我包一套。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pleasantly surprised) </> You mean, such exquisite and unique jewelry only costs two hundred gold pounds now? Please wrap them up together—if there are similar styles, please wrap a set for me as well.",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>真的吗？你能让我摸到光吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised) </>Really? Can you let me touch the light?",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊喜）</>真的？！竟然是这样的指示！"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> Really?! It's actually such an instruction!",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊恐）</>真的有鬼？鬼！鬼啊！"] = "<P_Heart> (Terrified) </> Are there really ghosts? A ghost! A ghost!",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊讶）</>你身后就是医院吧？不过看样子，恐怕罗塞尔大帝来了也没办法了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised) </> Isn't the hospital right behind you? But looking at you, I'm afraid even Emperor Roselle couldn't help.",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊讶）</>咦？我感觉到了……好温暖！"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised)</> Huh? I feel... so warm!",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊讶）</>啊？这……我还真没有从这方面想过……"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised) </> Huh? This... I really haven't thought about it from that perspective...",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊讶）</>您认识我？"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised) </> You know me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（惊讶）</>拆座钟？"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> Taking apart the grandfather clock?",
    ["<P_Heart>（想了想）</> 一般来说，像这样强大的灵界生物，很容易失败。"] = "<P_Heart>(Thinking for a moment)</> Generally speaking, for such powerful Spirit World creatures, it is very easy to fail.",
    ["<P_Heart>（想到火车站的经历）</>在站台时，你也在清理非凡动物？"] = "<P_Heart>(Thinking of the experience at the train station)</> Were you also clearing out Beyonder creatures at the platform?",
    ["<P_Heart>（想必“月亮”先生也是一位高序列强者？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could Mr. Moon also be a high-sequence powerhouse?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（想起来了，我在历史迷雾中见过他！是克莱恩在霍伊大学的老师——阿兹克·艾格斯！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I remember now, I saw him in the Fog of History! It's Klein's teacher at Khoy University—Azik Eggers!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（惴惴不安）</> 我也变得越来越奇怪，一旦忍不住，也会像刚才一样说一堆话……明明神父爷爷说过，告解的话是不能让人知道的……"] = "<P_Heart> (Anxious) </> I'm also becoming stranger and stranger. Once I can't hold it back, I'll say a bunch of things just like before... even though Father said that confessions shouldn't be known by others...",
    ["<P_Heart>（愁眉苦脸）</>海莉夫人！我终于等到你了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Frowning)</> Madam Hayley! I've finally found you!",
    ["<P_Heart>（意外的爽朗和好说话……）</>好说、好说……我叫{{姓名}}，阁下怎么称呼？"] = "<P_Heart>(Unexpectedly cheerful and easy to talk to...) </> Easy, easy... My name is {{Name}}, what should I call you, sir?",
    ["<P_Heart>（愚者先生究竟是哪一位，这样威严又和善的存在……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Who exactly is Mr. Fool, such a majestic and kind existence...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（愚者先生？！罗珊的婚事居然要过问一位真神？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Mr. Fool?! Does Rozanne's marriage actually require the consultation of a true god?!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（愚者？塔罗的零号牌？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Fool? The zero card of Tarot?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（感动）</>……我会好好珍藏的。谢谢你，艾米丽。"] = "<P_Heart>(Moved) </>...I will treasure it well. Thank you, Emily.",
    ["<P_Heart>（感动）</>你管得真多。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Touched)</> You're quite bossy.",
    ["<P_Heart>（感动）</>所以我要用我的研究成果回报她！等我研究出能让整艘船都变成活体的方法，“未来号”就永远不需要靠岸补给了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Moved) </> So I must repay her with my research results! Once I figure out how to turn the entire ship into a living organism, the Future will never need to dock for supplies again!",
    ["<P_Heart>（感动）</>艾米丽……"] = "<P_Heart>(Moved) </>Emily...",
    ["<P_Heart>（感慨）</> 这狗屎运怎么就落不到我头上……对了，估计梅兰妮也不会再和他吵架了吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighing) </> Why can't this kind of dumb luck fall on me... By the way, I guess Melanie won't be arguing with him anymore either.",
    ["<P_Heart>（感慨）</>黑荆棘啊……是我的家。"] = "<P_Heart> (With emotion) </> Blackthorn... it is my home.",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉不太正常……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Feels not quite right...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉他们有点可疑，身为值夜者，我可能应该去通知警察。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(They seem a bit suspicious. As a Nighthawk, I should probably go notify the police.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉变得更难喝了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Feels like it's become even worse...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉很宁静……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Feels very peaceful...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉记得差不多了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I feel like I remember it well enough...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>哎呀，没有啦，我只是单纯紧张和焦虑发作了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> Oh, no, it's nothing. I'm just having a simple bout of nervousness and anxiety.",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>尖晶石？不是红宝石？"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> Spinel? Not a ruby?",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>您是怎么看出来的……"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> How did you figure that out...",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣了一下，眼眶红了）</>艾米丽……"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment, eyes turning red) </> Emily...",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣住）</>……打中了？"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned) </> ...Did it hit?",
    ["<P_Heart>（愣住）</>你是说，他不想当着我们……好。拜托你了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned) </> You mean, he doesn't want to... in front of us? Alright. I'll leave it to you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（愤怒的大字）</>不服是吧？行行行！笔给你，你来写！"] = "<P_Heart> (Angry big letters) </> You don't accept it, right? Fine, fine, fine! Here is the pen, you write it!",
    ["<P_Heart>（愤怒）</>我有个女徒弟，前几天下工后走的就是这条路，然后人就消失了，消失了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Anger) </> I have a female apprentice who walked this path after work a few days ago, and then she disappeared, disappeared!",
    ["<P_Heart>（憋笑）</>您欣赏艺术的角度，很独特。"] = "<P_Heart>(Suppressing a laugh)</>Your perspective on art is very unique.",
    ["<P_Heart>（懊恼）</>该死……这把锁是我亲手装的，居然打不开了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Annoyed) </> Damn it... I installed this lock myself, and now it won't open...",
    ["<P_Heart>（懒散）</>我不在，有事找我同事吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Lazy)</> I'm not here. If you have anything, find my colleague.",
    ["<P_Heart>（懵懂）</> 神国？很远？所以爷爷一直没回来啊……"] = "<P_Heart> (Ignorant) </> Kingdom of God? Very far? So that's why Grandfather never came back...",
    ["<P_Heart>（我……说过吗？为什么不记得了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I... did I say that? Why can't I remember...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我……这里什么都没有，但他好像真看见了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I... there's nothing here, but he seems to really see it?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我也不知道配方或材料是不是真的啊。不过，看来我也得尽快成为非凡者……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I don't know if the formula or materials are real either. However, it seems I need to become a Beyonder as soon as possible...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我也不知道配方或材料是不是真的啊，但这可能跟我的穿越有关……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I don't know if the formula or materials are real either, but this might be related to my transmigration...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我们好像还不熟。不过，好像忘记了什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(We don't seem to be that familiar yet. But, I feel like I've forgotten something...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我们生活在北大陆，还会不会有南大陆？或者东大陆？西大陆？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (We live in the Northern Continent. Could there be a Southern Continent? Or an Eastern Continent? A Western Continent?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我刚逃脱反复死亡的噩梦……又来到一个面临末日危机的世界？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I just escaped a nightmare of repeated death... and now I've come to a world facing a doomsday crisis?!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我刚逃脱反复死亡的噩梦……又要面对末日危机？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I just escaped the nightmare of repeated death... and now I have to face an apocalyptic crisis?!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我又……回来了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Have I... returned again?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我发誓，一切都是为了任务！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I swear, everything is for the quest!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我在“愚者”先生记忆里知道他……应该是涉及非凡相关，消息被封锁了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I know him from Mr. Fool's memory... it should be related to Beyonders, and the news was sealed.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我得抢先一步把它毁掉！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I must get to it first and destroy it!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我怎么也开始结巴了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Why did I start stammering too?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我想想……需要用珍妮的贴身物品进行占卜。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let me think... I need to use Jenny's personal belongings to perform the divination.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我想想，第一个出现的纪元是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let me think, the first epoch to appear was...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我想起了那个血肉魔法，让灵界谜虫吞吃了我的身体。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I remembered that Flesh Magic, letting the Spirit World Mystery Insect devour my body.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我想起来了，他是泰瑞）</>你又被猎龙帮欺负了？"] = "<P_Heart> (I remember now, he is Terry) </> Were you bullied by the Dragon Hunter Gang again?",
    ["<P_Heart>（我是……邓恩·史密斯，廷根市值夜者小队的队长。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I am... Dunn Smith, captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我有一套燕尾服可以给班森，而梅丽莎……嗯，买一套新衣服。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I have a tuxedo I can give to Benson, and for Melissa... well, buy a new dress.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我现在充当着罗塞尔的角色……按照他的逻辑行事，应该就能找到那位夫人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I am currently acting as Roselle... if I act according to his logic, I should be able to find that lady.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我的导师昆汀·科恩先生，希望他不要责怪我突然取消面试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(My mentor, Mr. Quentin Cohen, I hope he doesn't blame me for suddenly canceling the interview.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我看是只有疯子才……不对，那我不也成疯子了吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I think only a madman would... wait, doesn't that make me a madman too?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我竟然会再次遇到他，也许他就是那个</><P_Yellow>关键人物</><P_Heart>。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(To think I would run into him again. Perhaps he is that </><P_Yellow>key figure</><P_Heart>.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我竟然会再次遇到他，也许他就是那个</><P_Yellow>关键人物</><P_Heart>）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(To think I would meet him again; perhaps he is that </><P_Yellow>key figure</><P_Heart>)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我能感觉到他们与这片灰雾的微弱联系。切断这个联系，投影就会消散，他们就能回归。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I can feel their faint connection to this gray fog. Sever this connection, and the projection will dissipate, allowing them to return.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我被困在这里了？该怎么离开？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Am I trapped here? How can I leave?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我被驯兽师占卜了命运？果然，天下没有免费的占卜。还是去干点正事吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I had my fate divined by a beast tamer? As expected, there's no such thing as a free divination in this world. Better go do something productive.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我要先观察，再交流……扮演好一个观众。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I need to observe first, then interact... and play the role of a Spectator well.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我还无法应对非凡者，或许应该回公司向值夜者同事们求助……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I am not yet able to deal with a Beyonder, perhaps I should return to the company to seek help from my Nighthawk colleagues...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我还是稍微离远一点吧，免得被误伤。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'd better stay a bit further away, so I don't get caught in the crossfire.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我还没同意加入……但这样的伟大存在是不会考虑我们的意愿的，而“正义”看起来像是被保护得太好的贵族小姐。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I haven't agreed to join yet... but such a great existence wouldn't consider our wishes, and Justice looks like a noble lady who has been protected too well.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我这几天晚上没发现星星有什么变化，难道……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I haven't noticed any changes in the stars these past few nights, could it be...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我进入了埃莉诺的记忆？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Did I enter Eleanor's memory?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我追溯过霍克斯男爵生前的场景，他在第二次敲门声响起时就已经倒下，又怎么可能回应仆人？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I traced the scene before Baron Hawkes' death; he had already collapsed when the second knock sounded, so how could he have responded to the servant?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我错了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I was wrong...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（我需要检查一下房间是否安全，不然伊琳一个人在这里可能会有危险。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I need to check if the room is safe; otherwise, it might be dangerous for Irene to be here alone.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（或许应该以主导者的姿态引导发展，维持神秘的压迫感，获取信息和利益。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Perhaps I should guide the development with the attitude of a leader, maintain a mysterious sense of oppression, and obtain information and benefits.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（或许应该装作一无所知，隐藏信息，换取信任……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Perhaps I should pretend to know nothing, hide information, and trade for trust...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（或许我可以在塔罗会发布寻找罗塞尔大帝日记的委托任务……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Perhaps I can post a quest to find Emperor Roselle's diary at the Tarot Club...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（戳他屁股的……是一头狒狒？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The one poking his butt... is a baboon?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（戴娜的反应好像有些奇怪，以防万一，跟上去看看吧？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Dana's reaction seems a bit strange, just in case, should I follow and see?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（房间里好像没什么异常情况……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There doesn't seem to be anything unusual in the room...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（所以这五年来，湖边的“艾拉”，其实都是丈夫假扮的？）</>……是的，他说想打扮成最漂亮的样子。"] = "<P_Heart> (So for these five years, \"Ayla\" by the lakeside was actually the husband in disguise?) </>... Yes, he said he wanted to dress up as the most beautiful version of himself.",
    ["<P_Heart>（手套下有些微光？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A faint glow under the glove?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（才没有说想回家……不过看来成功混过去了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I didn't say I wanted to go home... but it seems I successfully bluffed my way through.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（打了个隔）</>好啊，正好我要减肥呢，你不把我打扁，我还真瞧不起你！"] = "<P_Heart> (Burps)</> Alright, I happen to be trying to lose weight. If you can't beat me flat, I'll really look down on you!",
    ["<P_Heart>（打量一番）</>身手果然不错，行，我交你这个朋友了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Looking him over)</> Your skills are indeed impressive. Alright, I'll make you my friend.",
    ["<P_Heart>（打量你一眼）</>是送人还是自用？"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes a look at you) </> Is this a gift, or for yourself?",
    ["<P_Heart>（打量你）</>你也是占卜师？看起来和俱乐部那些人不太一样。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sizes you up) </> Are you a diviner too? You look a bit different from the people in the club.",
    ["<P_Heart>（打量着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks you over.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（扬声）</>如果戈多来了，告诉他别再迟到！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Raising voice) </> If Godot comes, tell him not to be late again!",
    ["<P_Heart>（扭曲）</> 不行……<P_Heart>（痛苦）</> 忍不住了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Distortion) </> No... <P_Heart> (Pain) </> I can't hold it back anymore...",
    ["<P_Heart>（扭转了塔罗牌的位置）</>那我就给它换个位置。"] = "<P_Heart> (Reverses the position of the Tarot card) </> Then I'll just change its position.",
    ["<P_Heart>（扯出微笑）</>先生，请您7天后前往恶龙酒吧的“狗拿耗子”赛事，押注一只左耳被咬了个豁口的锈红色猎犬。"] = "<P_Heart>(Forcing a smile)</> Sir, please go to the 'Dog Catches Mouse' race at the Evil Dragon Bar in 7 days and bet on a rust-red hound with a notch in its left ear.",
    ["<P_Heart>（扶额）</>你花钱来这里，就为了看这些吗……"] = "<P_Heart> (Holding forehead) </> You spent money to come here just for this...",
    ["<P_Heart>（扶额）</>这灯，我再去问问……"] = "<P_Heart> (Forehead palm) </> This lamp, I'll go ask again...",
    ["<P_Heart>（把枪收起来，笑了笑）</>是你不会用。"] = "<P_Heart> (Puts the gun away and smiles) </> You just don't know how to use it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（把钞票塞进亨利的嘴里）</>竟敢用恶臭的钞票玷污贝儿小姐的声誉，我绝不容许这种行为在我眼前发生。"] = "<P_Heart>(Stuffing the banknotes into Henry's mouth)</> How dare you defile Miss Belle's reputation with filthy money! I will never allow such behavior to happen in front of me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（抓住你的手）</>不要，非凡者很危险，你做文职吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Grabbing your hand)</> Don't. Beyonders are dangerous; you should take a clerical job.",
    ["<P_Heart>（抓着笔勉力书写）</>被污染者……内脏剧痛……肌肉痉挛……"] = "<P_Heart>(Clutching the pen and writing with great effort)</> The contaminated... severe visceral pain... muscle spasms...",
    ["<P_Heart>（抚摸墓碑）</>她叫凯瑟琳。我们曾经是最好的朋友。"] = "<P_Heart> (Strokes the tombstone) </> Her name is Catherine. We used to be best friends.",
    ["<P_Heart>（报告给值夜者……等下，这里去黑荆棘来回要30分钟，万一事情恶化……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Report to the Nighthawks... wait, it takes 30 minutes to go to Blackthorn and back, what if things get worse...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（抬头看向你）</>但那是“我看到的”命运，我把它们说成了“唯一的”命运。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks up at you) </> But that was the fate \"I saw\"; I spoke of them as the \"only\" fate.",
    ["<P_Heart>（抬头看看……呼，猜对了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Look up... phew, guessed right.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（抬眸）</>我只记得，每放牧一个灵魂，就多一份离开黑暗的可能。"] = "<P_Heart> (Lifts eyes) </> I only remember that for every soul I herd, there is one more possibility of leaving the darkness.",
    ["<P_Heart>（抱怨）</>琳娜的未婚夫还在旁边，你小声些，我过一会去看看。"] = "<P_Heart>(Complaining)</> Linna's fiancé is still nearby, keep your voice down, I'll go check in a while.",
    ["<P_Heart>（抱紧猫）</>我们的感情是不是破裂了？"] = "<P_Heart> (Holds the cat tightly) </> Is our relationship broken?",
    ["<P_Heart>（抿嘴笑）</>我应该知道什么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Pouts and smiles) </> What should I know?",
    ["<P_Heart>（担心）</>还会有失败的概率吗？你们会有危险吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Worried) </> Is there still a chance of failure? Will you be in danger?",
    ["<P_Heart>（担忧）</>伊琳……"] = "<P_Heart> (Worried) </> Irene...",
    ["<P_Heart>（拍了拍头）</> ……难怪。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pats head) </> ...No wonder.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出一个粗糙的戒指）</>贝儿小姐，如果你愿意的话，就让我为你戴上这个戒指吧，这是我亲手做的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Taking out a crude ring)</> Miss Belle, if you are willing, let me put this ring on you. I made it myself.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出一个精致的项圈）</>哈基猿，如果你愿意的话，就让我为你戴上这个项圈吧，这是我亲手做的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Taking out an exquisite collar)</> Haji-Ape, if you are willing, let me put this collar on you. I made it myself.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出一叠钞票）</>光是今晚的比赛，就有无数人在我身上重金押注，一场拳赛我就能赚到一辈子都花不完的钱。"] = "<P_Heart>(Taking out a stack of banknotes)</> Just from tonight's match alone, countless people have placed heavy bets on me. I can earn more money in one fight than I could spend in a lifetime.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出一枚粗糙的戒指）</>贝儿小姐，你愿意……"] = "<P_Heart>(Taking out a crude ring)</> Miss Belle, would you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出怀表看了眼）</> 怎么都这个时间了，得赶紧去告解了，快走吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes out a pocket watch and glances at it) </> Why is it this late already? Must hurry to confession, let's go.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出烟斗）</>吸烟斗，或者喝咖啡。"] = "<P_Heart> (Taking out a pipe) </> Smoking a pipe, or drinking coffee.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿起宝剑侍从）</>这是你的牌。手里握着剑，眼睛望着高处。"] = "<P_Heart> (Picks up the Page of Swords) </> This is your card. Holding a sword in your hand, eyes looking toward the heights.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿起星币八）</>这是你的牌。工匠的手，一枚一枚地雕刻。很慢，很辛苦。"] = "<P_Heart> (Picks up the Eight of Pentacles) </> This is your card. A craftsman's hands, carving one by one. Very slow, very hard work.",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿过钱包）</>下次再让我遇到你们“闹着玩”，哼哼，你知道后果。"] = "<P_Heart>(Takes the wallet)</> If I catch you 'messing around' again, hmph, you know the consequences.",
    ["<P_Heart>（指了指桌面）</>这徽章……邦尼给的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pointing to the table) </> This badge... given by Bonnie.",
    ["<P_Heart>（指向远处）</>沿着这条路一直走，就能走出雪山了。我还要在雪山待几天，就不继续送你们了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Points into the distance) </> Follow this road all the way, and you can walk out of the Snowy Mountain. I still have to stay in the Snowy Mountain for a few days, so I won't continue to see you off.",
    ["<P_Heart>（按下开关，发出一声犹如捕鼠夹闭合的沉闷“咔哒”声。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Pressing the switch, it makes a dull \"click\" sound like a mousetrap closing.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（挑眉）</>哟，美女？来看热闹还是来找人的？"] = "<P_Heart>(Raises an eyebrow)</> Oh, a beauty? Here for the excitement or looking for someone?",
    ["<P_Heart>（挑眉）</>我和他的事？听起来没什么可说的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Raises eyebrows) </> My business with him? Doesn't sound like there's much to say.",
    ["<P_Heart>（挠头）</>我只是刚好懂得孩子的心事。"] = "<P_Heart> (Scratches head) </> I just happen to understand a child's heart.",
    ["<P_Heart>（挠挠鼻头）</>我竟然这么厉害？那我必须得把你们安全带出去了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Scratches her nose) </> I'm actually that amazing? Then I must get you all out safely.",
    ["<P_Heart>（挣扎）</>动不了……这算什么真相？"] = "<P_Heart> (Struggling) </> I can't move... what kind of truth is this?",
    ["<P_Heart>（挣扎）</>狗屁荣耀，你们这是抢劫！放开我……"] = "<P_Heart>(Struggling)</> Bullshit glory, this is robbery! Let me go...",
    ["<P_Heart>（挫败）</>好吧，我果然是个没有幽默感的人。"] = "<P_Heart>(Frustrated)</> Well, I guess I really am a person without a sense of humor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（挽救破碎家庭……马桶里的怨念，或许也与爱国卫生运动有关？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Saving broken families... Could the resentment in the toilet also be related to the Patriotic Health Campaign?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（掏出一枚硬币）</>既然海莉夫人不在，你帮我占卜怎么样？"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes out a coin) </> Since Madam Hali isn't here, how about you do a divination for me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（掏出猎龙宣言晃了晃）</>锻炼到连这个都丢掉了？"] = "<P_Heart>(Takes out the Dragon Hunting Manifesto and shakes it)</> Exercising to the point of losing even this?",
    ["<P_Heart>（接下来……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Next...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（接过话）</>工匠雕刻的不只是星币，还有他自己的技艺。"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes over) </> The craftsman isn't just carving pentacles; he's also carving his own skill.",
    ["<P_Heart>（接过零钱）</>咦，这不就是……"] = "<P_Heart> (takes the change) </> Huh, isn't this...",
    ["<P_Heart>（接近了，再完成一个就成功了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Getting closer, just one more to go and it'll be a success!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（揉太阳穴）</>女神啊……这是什么世道。"] = "<P_Heart> (Rubs temples) </> Goddess... what kind of world is this.",
    ["<P_Heart>（提高嗓门，一脸得意）</>你看啊，我们食堂的装修那是数一数二的，完全是高档餐厅的水准，亮堂又气派；座椅软乎乎的，舒服得很；同时价格也非常便宜。"] = "<P_Heart>(Raising his voice, looking proud)</> Look, the decoration of our cafeteria is second to none; it's completely at the level of a high-end restaurant, bright and imposing; the seats are soft and very comfortable; and the prices are also very cheap.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摆手）</>不，请你留着吧。这是艾米丽想送给你的小太阳。"] = "<P_Heart>(Waving hand) </>No, please keep it. This is the little sun Emily wants to give to you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摆手）</>热闹是热闹，但也让人头疼。比如早上，梅丽莎会为了她的机械闹钟和我争论。"] = "<P_Heart>(Waves hand)</> It's lively, but it's also a headache. For example, in the morning, Melissa would argue with me about her mechanical alarm clock.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</> 尝试过了，效果不是很好。"] = "<P_Heart>(shakes head)</> Tried it, the effect wasn't very good.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>不用道歉，都过去了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shakes head)</> No need to apologize, it's all in the past.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>不，这次就让这位{{先生|女士}}来写吧。可以吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Shakes head)</> No, let this {{Mr.|Ms.}} write it this time. Is that okay?",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>他不说，就有不说的理由。我们一家都是这样，更习惯默默关心彼此……这样就够了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shakes head) </> If he doesn't say it, he has his reasons. Our family is like that; we are more used to caring for each other silently... That's enough.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>你和海莉夫人说的完全不一样。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shakes head) </> What you said is completely different from Madam Haley.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>占卜讲究的是准确。她这样乱说，亵渎了塔罗。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shakes head) </> Divination is about accuracy. Her talking nonsense like that is a blasphemy against the Tarot.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>我可做不到。虽然嘴上总说她麻烦，但……她是我最好的朋友。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shaking head) </> I couldn't do it. Although I always say she's troublesome, but... she is my best friend.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>我是船长，负责的是另一片战场。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shakes head)</> I am a captain; I am responsible for a different battlefield.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>（指向玩家）不，这次就让这位{{先生|女士}}来写吧。可以吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Shaking head)</> (Pointing at the player) No, let this {{Mr.|Ms.}} write this time. Is that alright?",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇摇头）</>这是哪里？我的工厂呢？<P_Heart>（惊恐）</>我记得了，他们，他们变成了怪物！"] = "<P_Heart> (Shakes head) </> Where is this? Where is my factory? <P_Heart> (Terrified) </> I remember now, they, they turned into monsters!",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇摇头）</>这是哪里？我的工厂呢？<P_Heart>（惊恐）</>我记得了，工人，工人变成了怪物！"] = "<P_Heart>(Shaking head)</> Where is this? Where is my factory? <P_Heart>(Terrified)</> I remember now, the workers, the workers turned into monsters!",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇骰子）</>叮！廷根静谧夜！薰衣草配热牛奶，祝您今晚好梦。"] = "<P_Heart> (Rolling the dice) </> Ding! Tingen Quiet Night! Lavender with hot milk, wishing you a good dream tonight.",
    ["<P_Heart>（摊手）</>所以，我们是同辈。她也应该叫你一声{{叔叔|姨姨}}。"] = "<P_Heart>(Spreads hands)</> So, we are of the same generation. She should also call you {{Uncle|Aunt}}.",
    ["<P_Heart>（擦眼泪）</>我们会走下去的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Wipes away tears) </> We will keep moving forward.",
    ["<P_Heart>（攥拳）</>如果我们就这么空着手回去，简直、简直就是……"] = "<P_Heart>(Clenches fist)</> If we go back empty-handed like this, it's simply, it's simply...",
    ["<P_Heart>（收了起来）</>没什么。"] = "<P_Heart> (puts it away) </> It's nothing.",
    ["<P_Heart>（放下工具，想了想）</> 有一块怀表，表盖内侧刻了字，是两个人的名字和一个日期。"] = "<P_Heart>(Puts down tools, thinks for a moment)</> There was a pocket watch with words engraved on the inside of the cover: two names and a date.",
    ["<P_Heart>（放下报纸）</>什么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Puts down the newspaper) </> What?",
    ["<P_Heart>（放下盘子）</>在我看来，你虽然是男人，却比所有女人都更有魅力。"] = "<P_Heart>(Putting down the plate)</> In my eyes, even though you are a man, you are more charming than any woman.",
    ["<P_Heart>（放下茶杯）</>是的，在帕斯河谷考察古代习俗时，偶然参加了当地的“寂静丰祭”。村民们赠予的骨雕面具很特别——戴上后能听见风里残留的古老祈祷声。"] = "<P_Heart>(Putting down the teacup)</> Yes, while investigating ancient customs in the Pas Valley, I accidentally participated in the local 'Silent Harvest Festival.' The bone-carved masks gifted by the villagers were very special—after putting them on, you could hear the ancient prayers lingering in the wind.",
    ["<P_Heart>（教育不仅是培养品德，也为了培养智慧、体魄与审美。或许我应该劝劝罗丁。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Education is not only about cultivating morality, but also about cultivating wisdom, physique, and aesthetics. Perhaps I should persuade Rodin.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（敲门声停息，三次呼吸后，紧闭的门后传来了沉闷的声音。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The knocking stopped, and after three breaths, a muffled sound came from behind the tightly closed door.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（旁边的魔女传来了痛苦的哀嚎）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A painful wail comes from the Witch beside) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈地打开门）</>……好吧，是我。"] = "<P_Heart> (Opens the door helplessly) </>... Alright, it's me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>你还是去前台看一下俱乐部图册，挑一个合适的吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Helplessly)</> You should go to the front desk and look at the club catalog and pick a suitable one.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>我今天还有点事，你还是去前台看一下俱乐部图册吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Helplessly)</> I have some things to do today, you should go to the front desk and look at the club catalog.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>我和上面反映过了，但是一直没人处理。唉，他们才不会管我们死活。"] = "<P_Heart> (Helpless) </> I've reported it to the higher-ups, but no one has dealt with it. Sigh, they won't care if we live or die.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>我试过很多次，但……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>效果不太理想。"] = "<P_Heart>(Helplessly)</> I've tried many times, but... <P_Heart>(Pauses)</> the effect wasn't very ideal.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>有人说，别人唱歌是要钱，我唱歌……是要命。"] = "<P_Heart>(Helplessly)</> Someone once said, others sing for money, but when I sing... it's for lives.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>那是罗珊告诉你的吧？没错，最多的一次，我一个晚上输掉了4苏勒5便士——那可是我当时全部的零花钱。"] = "<P_Heart> (Helplessly) </> That must have been Rozanne who told you, right? That's correct. The most I ever lost was 4 soli and 5 pence in a single night—that was all my pocket money at the time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无奈）</>阿尔杰，我还要去取一封重要的信件，这个演出非看不可吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Helplessly) </> Alger, I still need to go pick up an important letter. Is this performance a must-see?",
    ["<P_Heart>（无法抵达的真相？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A truth that can never be reached?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（无法拒绝，就顺势加入。或许有风险，但也是个机会！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I can't refuse, so I'll just go with the flow and join. There might be risks, but it's also an opportunity!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</><P_Yellow>楼梯口</>有人守着，二楼可能有什么重要的线索。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> There's someone guarding the <P_Yellow>staircase</>. There might be some important clues on the second floor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>不好，被察觉到了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Oh no, I've been spotted.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>但听着——<P_Yellow>别太清醒，也别太沉醉</>。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> But listen—<P_Yellow>don't be too sober, and don't be too intoxicated</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>信号可算恢复了！你没事吧？"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> The signal is finally back! Are you okay?",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>出口全堵死了，这帮杂碎动作真快。先撑住，等我杀过来。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio)</>All the exits are blocked. Those bastards moved fast. Hold out. I'll fight my way to you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>去大厅找找看，那些客人和侍女身上也许有线索。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Go check the main hall; there might be clues on the guests and the waitresses.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>呼……没事就行。看看二楼有什么东西，没有也不要紧，给我安全回来……"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Phew... as long as you're okay. See if there's anything on the second floor; if not, it doesn't matter, just come back safely...",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>嗯……<P_Yellow>徽章</>。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Hmm... the <P_Yellow>badge</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>她应该还在玫瑰天堂，找到她，想办法把<P_Yellow>徽章</>弄到手。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> She should still be at the Rose Paradise. Find her and figure out a way to get your hands on the <P_Yellow>badge</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>干得漂亮，真让你找到了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Well done, you actually found it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>恰到好处，明白吗？让他们觉得你是来玩的，但你自己心里得跟明镜似的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Just the right amount, understand? Make them think you're here to have fun, but keep your own mind as clear as a mirror.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>我建议去<P_Yellow>楼梯口</>问问，碰碰运气。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> I suggest you go to the <P_Yellow>stairwell</> and ask around; try your luck.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>找到徽章，然后上楼。别磨蹭，咱们的时间可不多。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Find the badge, then head upstairs. Don't dawdle; we don't have much time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>状态不错呀。接下来去<P_Yellow>舞池</>看看吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> You're doing well. Next, go check out the <P_Yellow>dance floor</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>看见前面的<P_Yellow>吧台</>了吗？先去要杯酒暖暖场，让自己看起来……像是来寻欢作乐的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> See the <P_Yellow>bar</> ahead? Go get a drink to warm up and make yourself look... like you're here to have a good time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>看见没？那些面具女都在看你。你太清醒了——像绵羊闯进狼群。你需要<P_Yellow>沉醉</>进去！"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> See that? Those masked women are all looking at you. You're too sober—like a sheep wandering into a pack of wolves. You need to <P_Yellow>get intoxicated</>!",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>缺口开了！往我这儿跑，快！"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio)</>The breach is open! Run to me, now!",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>行了……还好你没事。咱们干正事吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</>Alright... it's a good thing you're okay. Let's get down to business.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>觉得难受，就去<P_Yellow>静坐一下</>、<P_Yellow>照照镜子</>，或者<P_Yellow>洗把脸</>。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</>If you're feeling uncomfortable, go <P_Yellow>sit quietly</>, <P_Yellow>look in the mirror</>, or <P_Yellow>splash some water on your face</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>趁还没什么动静，快<P_Yellow>离开这里</>。我在外面等你。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> While there's no movement yet, <P_Yellow>leave this place</> quickly. I'll wait for you outside.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>这帮被异化的东西生命力早被榨干，自己就垮了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio)</>These aberrated things had already had their life force drained dry. They collapsed on their own.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>金色短发……她应该就是<P_Yellow>莉莉</>了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</>Short blonde hair... she must be <P_Yellow>Lily</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无论如何都来不及了吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It's too late no matter what!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（既然丽贝卡推荐坐船，还是等等吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Since Rebecca recommended taking the ship, I suppose I should wait...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（既然都来了，不如先加入俱乐部，顺便看看是否有顾客能够带来新线索。)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Since I'm already here, I might as well join the club and see if any customers can bring new clues.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（既然都来了，不如先加入俱乐部，顺便看看是否有顾客能够带来新线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Since I'm already here, I might as well join the club and see if any customers can provide new clues.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（日光太强烈了，头好晕……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The sunlight is too intense, my head is spinning...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（时间还早，哪里来的月亮？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It's still early, where would the moon come from?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（明天休息半天……正好上午去占卜俱乐部扮演，下午回黑荆棘继续神秘学课程。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Half a day off tomorrow... It's perfect to go to the Divination Club in the morning to Act, and return to Blackthorn in the afternoon to continue my occult studies.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（明天休息半天……正好上午去占卜家俱乐部扮演，下午回黑荆棘继续神秘学课程。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Half a day off tomorrow... perfect for acting at the Divination Club in the morning and returning to Blackthorn for occult lessons in the afternoon.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（昏昏沉沉）</>值夜者……要处理非凡事件……非凡世界很危险……"] = "<P_Heart>(Drowsy)</> Nighthawks... have to deal with Extraordinary events... the Extraordinary World is dangerous...",
    ["<P_Heart>（昏昏沉沉）</>未来……"] = "<P_Heart>(Drowsy)</> Future...",
    ["<P_Heart>（星空、星空之上的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The starry sky, and above the starry sky...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（昨天那家的蛋糕真不错，今天还要吃。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The cake from that shop yesterday was really good, I'll have it again today.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（是在谈论街角那位夫人吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You must be talking about that lady on the street corner.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（是封印物？还是有非凡因素的介入？或者有特殊的关闭方法……总之，现在还没办法影响这个倔强的炉子，以后再来吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is this a Sealed Artifact? Or is there an intervention of Beyonder factors? Or perhaps there is a special way to shut it down... In any case, there is no way to affect this stubborn furnace for now; I will come back later.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（是的，我来就是为了听这个。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Yes, I came here just to hear this.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（是管理员希罗多德——也是阿曼达女士的丈夫。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It's the administrator, Herodotus—also Mrs. Amanda's husband.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（是错觉吗？门把手上的铜锈似乎有些脱落。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is it an illusion? The rust on the doorknob seems to be peeling off.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（晃悠）</>你那拳……刚才从旁边飞过去了…… "] = "<P_Heart>(Swaying)</> That punch of yours... just flew past from the side...",
    ["<P_Heart>（晕晕乎乎）</>我一直在这儿……是你眼花了…… "] = "<P_Heart>(Dizzy)</> I've been here the whole time... your eyes are playing tricks on you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（晚安……梅丽莎……班森……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Good night... Melissa... Benson...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（暴怒）</>放屁！上周她还夸我身上有劳动人民的踏实气息！"] = "<P_Heart> (Furious) </> Bullshit! Last week she even praised me for having the solid scent of a working person!",
    ["<P_Heart>（更多的爱？难道是指这个？不知道哪里可以买到。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(More love? Could it mean this? I don't know where to buy it.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（更换餐厅也会有……呃……背叛感？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Does changing restaurants also bring about... uh... a sense of betrayal?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（最后一声重重的叹息）</>唉……"] = "<P_Heart> (a final, heavy sigh) </> Sigh...",
    ["<P_Heart>（最好先等她弹完……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Better wait for her to finish playing...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有个学生的样子很奇怪，凑近观察一下……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A student looks very strange, let me get closer and observe...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有了！既然他这么喜欢躺地上……就让他躺个够。 ）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Got it! Since he likes lying on the ground so much... let him lie to his heart's content.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些好奇）</>什么真相？"] = "<P_Heart> (Curiously) </> What truth?",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些好奇）</>用了这个你就能离开金秋湖么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Curious) </> Can you leave Golden Autumn Lake after using this?",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些尴尬，你下意识摸了摸口袋）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Feeling a bit awkward, you subconsciously pat your pockets.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些慌乱）</>不，不能轻信祂，我不能相信祂。"] = "<P_Heart>(Somewhat panicked)</> No, I cannot trust Him lightly, I cannot believe Him.",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些生气）</>太失礼了，老身曾是大地教会的神眷者，怎能和邪神相提并论！老身、老身要把你变成一根豌豆苗！"] = "<P_Heart> (Somewhat angry) </> How rude! I was once a Blessed of the Church of the Earth, how can I be compared to an Evil God! I, I will turn you into a pea sprout!",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些紧张）</> 要毁了它吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (somewhat nervous) </> Are you going to destroy it?",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些紧张）</>啊，我吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(A bit nervous)</> Ah, me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（有些落寞）</> 神父爷爷好久没来这里啦。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking somewhat lonely) </> Father hasn't been here for a long time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（有人争执？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is someone arguing?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有人在战争中给了主教蜡烛……难道背后有其它势力？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Someone gave the bishop a candle during the war... could there be other forces behind this?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有人走过来了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Someone is walking over...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有点累了……再去休息室喝点东西吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A bit tired... I'll go to the lounge and have something to drink.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有点累了……再去喝一杯好了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'm a bit tired... I'll go have another drink.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（有种不祥的预感）</>我？"] = "<P_Heart> (Has a bad premonition) </> Me?",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向墙上的合照）</>怪不得伦纳德和弗莱都找借口溜出去了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at the group photo on the wall) </> No wonder Leonard and Frye both found excuses to slip out.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向永恒的黑暗）</>我没有背叛白银城……从来没有。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks toward the eternal darkness) </> I did not betray the City of Silver... never.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远处）</>不是，我要去见一个人。一个我等了很久的人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks into the distance) </> No, I'm going to see someone. Someone I've waited a long time for.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远处）</>再唱首歌，很慢很慢的那种，跑调了也没关系，反正羊不会笑话我。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking into the distance) </> Then sing a song, a very, very slow one; it doesn't matter if I'm off-key, the sheep won't laugh at me anyway.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远处）</>有时候，信仰是一种手段，而非终点。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking into the distance) </> Sometimes, faith is a means, not an end.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远处）</>还能借光躲藏，隐去恶意。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking into the distance) </> It can also borrow light to hide and conceal malice.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远方）</>作为风暴教会的船长，我有责任监视那片海域。"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks into the distance)</> As a captain of the Church of Storms, I have a responsibility to monitor that sea area.",
    ["<P_Heart>（望着你离去的背影，发出一声失落的低鸣。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It lets out a disappointed whimper as it watches you walk away.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（朝你眨了眨眼）</>对吧？好心的年轻人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Winks at you) </> Right? Kind young man.",
    ["<P_Heart>（朦胧）</>你……你还好吗？我怎么……看见两个你……"] = "<P_Heart> (hazy) </> Are... are you okay? Why do I... see two of you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（本来还想先回家重新规划支出，攒钱缴纳占卜俱乐部的年费，现在离凑齐5镑越来越远了。算了，还是家人更重要。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I was planning to go home first to re-plan my expenses and save money for the Divination Club's annual fee. Now, I'm getting further and further away from saving up 5 pounds. Forget it, family is more important.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（本来还想先回家重新规划支出，攒钱缴纳占卜家俱乐部的年费，现在离凑齐5镑越来越远了。算了，还是家人更重要。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I originally wanted to go home first to re-plan my expenses and save up for the Divination Club's annual fee, but now I'm getting further and further away from the 5 pounds. Never mind, family is more important.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（松了一口气）</>幸好罗珊你没事。"] = "<P_Heart> (Relieved) </> Thank goodness you're okay, Rozanne.",
    ["<P_Heart>（松了口气）</> 那……能不能顺便让它换个别的用处？比如书柜、邮箱、垃圾桶……"] = "<P_Heart> (relieved) </> Then... could you perhaps let it be used for something else? Like a bookcase, a mailbox, a trash can...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠接住面包碎屑，熟练地塞进两颊，然后双爪作揖般上下摆动，像是在表示感谢，随后继续投来期待的眼神。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The squirrel catches the bread crumbs, skillfully stuffs them into its cheeks, then moves its front paws up and down as if bowing to express gratitude, before continuing to look up with expectant eyes.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠有些抗拒地推开了手。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The squirrel pushes the hand away with some resistance.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>吱……那天晚上……主人还没回来……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> Squeak... that night... Master hadn't come back yet...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>吱吱吱！醒来后……主人就躺在厨房里……已经……已经凉了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> Squeak, squeak, squeak! When I woke up... Master was lying in the kitchen... and he was... he was already cold...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>它发出笑声……很轻，却让我灵体颤抖……它说……它已经收割了好多灵魂……这次也……势在必得……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> It laughed... very softly, but it made my spirit body tremble... It said... it had already harvested many souls... and this time too... it was determined to succeed...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>它在地上画格子……一块、两块、好多块……那些格子泛着诡异的光……像是……像是某种秘术……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> It's drawing a grid on the ground... one square, two squares, many squares... those squares are glowing with an eerie light... it's like... like some kind of mysticism...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>它说……它要的东西……就算只是路过的居民……也会一并收入囊中……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> It said... whatever it wanted... even if it was just a passing resident... it would take them all in...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>我不知怎的，好困好困……像是被什么东西……压住了灵性……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> I don't know why, I'm so, so sleepy... It's like something... is suppressing my spirituality...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>然后……我就什么都不知道了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> And then... I didn't know anything anymore...",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>迷迷糊糊中，我看见一团……漆黑的影子……在屋子里游走……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> In my daze, I saw a... pitch-black shadow... wandering around the room...",
    ["<P_Heart>（果然……又回来了。)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(As expected... back again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（果然……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(As expected...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（根据纸条上的描述，酸液的用量β是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (According to the description on the note, the dosage β of the acid is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（梅丽莎刚才看我的眼神，像是在关爱智障哥哥。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The look Melissa just gave me was like she was pitying her mentally challenged brother.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（梅丽莎这话……很有“愚者”先生的风范。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Melissa's words... are very much in the style of Mr. Fool.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（梅丽莎这话……很有愚者先生的风范。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Melissa's words... have quite the air of Mr. Fool.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（梦境捕手相关内容都圈出来了，像教科书被划出重点……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The content related to the Dream Catcher is all circled, like a textbook with key points highlighted...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（森林里似乎有声音……在呼唤我？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There seems to be a sound in the forest... calling me?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（模仿贵族腔）</>“亲爱的，这杯香槟的味道可真独特，柑橘与蜜饯的香醇中混合了恰到好处的咸味。”"] = "<P_Heart> (imitating an aristocratic tone) </> \"My dear, the taste of this champagne is truly unique; the mellow aroma of citrus and candied fruit is mixed with just the right amount of saltiness.\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（欣喜）</>十三只了！谢谢你，小辛迪。"] = "<P_Heart>(Joyful)</> Thirteen already! Thank you, little Cindy.",
    ["<P_Heart>（欣喜）</>我知道，工作很累。但我绝对不会拖欠大家的工钱，只要我们一起努力，就会建设出更光明的未来。"] = "<P_Heart>(Joyful)</> I know, the work is tiring. But I will never owe anyone their wages. As long as we work hard together, we will build a brighter future.",
    ["<P_Heart>（欣喜）</>珍妮第一次遇见像您这么慷慨的人！"] = "<P_Heart>(Joyfully)</> Jenny has never met someone as generous as you!",
    ["<P_Heart>（欲哭无泪）</>我的胃啊，你的好日子终于要来了——"] = "<P_Heart> (Tears of joy) </> Oh, my stomach, your good days are finally coming—",
    ["<P_Heart>（歌声传来）</>睡莲合上紫色的花瓣， 我等的人在天边还是水边？"] = "<P_Heart>(Singing drifts over)</> The water lily closes its violet petals. Is the one I await at the horizon or by the water's edge?",
    ["<P_Heart>（正在浇水的地方……会在哪里呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Where... could the place where she is watering be?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（正好给福戈一点冷静的时间，我先回塔罗学派去问问会长吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Just enough time to let Fogo calm down. I'll go back to the Tarot Club and ask the president first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（正当你要坐下去的时候……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Just as you are about to sit down...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（正色）</>你问这个……看来你不止对美景和古董感兴趣。"] = "<P_Heart>(Solemnly)</> You ask about this... it seems you are interested in more than just beautiful scenery and antiques.",
    ["<P_Heart>（死而复生？难道这里有非凡力量的存在……用灵视检查一下吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Resurrection? Could there be Extraordinary power here... let me check with spirit vision.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（残留有无序的非凡力量，用窥秘之眼看看现场留下的痕迹吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There are residual chaotic Beyonder powers; let me use my Spirit Vision to check for traces left at the scene.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（每个自杀者身边都有大量的蜡烛，需要查清蜡烛的来源。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There are a large number of candles around every suicide victim; I need to find out the source of the candles.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（比南大陆更南，比北大陆更北，比苏尼亚海更东，比迷雾海更西……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Further south than the Southern Continent, further north than the Northern Continent, further east than the Sonia Sea, further west than the Fog Sea...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（毕竟也是从历史书里走出来的人啊……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(After all, she is also someone who walked out of history books...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（气氛变得好凝重……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The atmosphere has become so heavy...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（水手……海眷者……风暴……气场的颜色又纯粹了一些……他晋升了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Sailor... Sea-Blessed... Storm... The color of his aura has become a bit purer... Did he advance?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（水鬼？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Water ghosts?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（污染……疯狂……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Corruption... Madness...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉吟）</>按理说应该由队长安排，不过这桩案子不复杂，我可以带你一起，算是见习。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pondering) </> It should logically be arranged by the Captain, but this case isn't complicated, I can take you along, consider it an internship.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉声）</>上个月，听说班西港的原始祭祀似乎有复苏的迹象……"] = "<P_Heart>(In a deep voice)</> Last month, I heard that the primitive sacrifices in Bansy Harbor seemed to show signs of reviving...",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉声）</>我已经不再质疑，唯有虔诚地侍奉，遵从他的意志。"] = "<P_Heart>(In a deep voice)</> I no longer question; I only serve piously and obey his will.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉思）</>多年前有一次，我们在苏尼亚海深处追踪一艘海盗船。"] = "<P_Heart> (Contemplating) </> Many years ago, we were tracking a pirate ship deep in the Sonia Sea.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉思）</>看来，你的到来，不是巧合。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pondering) </> It seems your arrival is no coincidence.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉思）</>这场危机还涉及知识与罗塞尔大帝，那我大概猜到那位女士的身份了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pondering) </> This crisis also involves knowledge and Emperor Roselle, so I think I've guessed that lady's identity.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉思）</>那就是……<P_Yellow>徽章</>。在一个<P_Yellow>女人</>手里？"] = "<P_Heart>(Pondering)</> That is... the <P_Yellow>badge</>. In the hands of a <P_Yellow>woman</>?",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉浸在自己的世界里……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Immersed in his own world...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉迷）</>哦，冰冷的伯爵阁下，您要亲吻我的脖颈吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Obsessed) </> Oh, cold Count, will you kiss my neck?",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉醉于喝酒，看上去已经微醺）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Indulging in drinking, looks already tipsy)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默了很久）</>三个月前我老婆死了，我埋在东岸。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a long time) </> My wife died three months ago, and I buried her on the east bank.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默了很久）</>就这些？"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a long time) </> That's all?",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默了片刻）</> 需要写报告申请，可能要你提供一些梦里的细节。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> I need to write a report to apply for this; you might need to provide some details from the dream.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默很久）</>他说“疼”。说“我不想死”。说“救我”。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a long time) </> He said \"It hurts.\" He said \"I don't want to die.\" He said \"Save me.\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</> 您说得好像有点道理。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> What you say seems to make some sense.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>他从小就不一样。别的孩子害怕黑暗，他却总望着天空。别的孩子顺从命运，他却一直在问为什么。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> He was different since he was a child. Other children feared the darkness, but he always looked at the sky. Other children obeyed fate, but he kept asking why.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>好。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> Very well.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>孤独吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Silent for a moment)</> It's lonely.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>年轻时我在马戏团工作。凯瑟琳、乔安娜、艾米——我们四个挤在一辆篷车里，一起练杂技，四个人分一块黑面包。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> When I was young, I worked in a circus. Catherine, Joanna, Amy—the four of us squeezed into a caravan, practicing acrobatics together, sharing a single piece of bread among the four of us.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>我每隔一段时间就会陷入沉睡，醒来之后会失忆，然后开启下一段人生。就这样不断地沉睡，醒来，失去，寻找……"] = "<P_Heart>(Silence for a moment)</> I fall into a deep sleep every so often. After waking up, I lose my memories and then start the next life. Just like that, constantly sleeping, waking up, losing, and searching...",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默片刻）</>那是很久以前的事了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a moment) </> That was a long time ago.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默良久）</>……没想过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a long time) </>... I haven't thought about it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>……"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent) </>...",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>你觉得什么是信仰？"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent) </> What do you think faith is?",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>所以你改变了占卜的方式。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silence) </> So you changed the way you perform divination.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>是啊。很简单。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent) </> Yes. It's simple.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>是的。但这或许是非凡者必须承受的代价，一个时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silence) </> Yes. But perhaps this is the price a Beyonder must pay, a poor wretch constantly fighting against danger and madness.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>谈不上好不好的，只是过日子罢了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent) </> It's not a matter of good or bad, it's just living life.",
    ["<P_Heart>（没人在，屋内一片混乱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No one is here, the room is in chaos...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没听过这个神啊……而且总感觉这个祭坛哪里不对……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Never heard of this god... and I always feel like something is wrong with this altar...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没想到阿兹克先生也来了，他也是霍伊大学历史系的教员，以前帮我很多。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I didn't expect Mr. Azik to be here too. He is also a faculty member in the History Department at Khoy University and has helped me a lot in the past.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没抬头）</>别赶我走。我还没找到。等我找到，我自己会走的……"] = "<P_Heart> (Doesn't look up) </> Don't chase me away. I haven't found it yet. Once I find it, I will leave on my own...",
    ["<P_Heart>（没抬头）</>嗯。"] = "<P_Heart> (Didn't look up) </> Yeah.",
    ["<P_Heart>（没救了……蒙特利坠下时当场毙命。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It's hopeless... Monterey died on impact when he fell.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没时间纠缠了，得先把道奇救出来！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No time to argue, I have to get Dodge out first!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没有了……没有了……哪怕往前一步的方向，都没有了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There is nothing left... nothing left... not even a direction to take one step forward...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没有反应，我再试试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No response, let me try again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没有析出非凡特性，身体直接消散了，她调配的魔药有问题？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No Beyonder characteristic was precipitated, the body simply dissipated. Was there a problem with the potion she concocted?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（没有灵性波动，不是污染……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(No spiritual fluctuations, this isn't contamination...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（沮丧）</>不，我的琴声是导火索……"] = "<P_Heart> (Depressed) </> No, my violin playing was the trigger...",
    ["<P_Heart>（沮丧）</>呜呜……呜呜……"] = "<P_Heart>(Depressed)</> Wuu... wuu...",
    ["<P_Heart>（流泪）</>我想所有人……都活着。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tearing up) </> I want everyone... to be alive.",
    ["<P_Heart>（流浪汉……看来得从他身上着手调查。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A vagrant... it seems I'll have to start the investigation from him.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（浓雾逼近）</>你走吧……我离开这里的那天，你会知道的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Thick fog approaches)</> You go... the day I leave here, you will know.",
    ["<P_Heart>（浮现发光的字迹）</>没错，《美女与野兽》是罗塞尔大帝笔下最成功的爱情故事！"] = "<P_Heart>(Glowing text appears)</> That's right, \"Beauty and the Beast\" is the most successful love story written by Emperor Roselle!",
    ["<P_Heart>（海上的神奇力量……吉瑞尔对非凡力量有了解？阿尔伯特会不会受到了他的影响？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Magical powers at sea... Does Girel know about Beyonder powers? Could Albert have been influenced by him?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（涨红了脸）</>喂，不许说那么大声！"] = "<P_Heart>(Blushing deeply)</> Hey, don't speak so loudly!",
    ["<P_Heart>（淡淡一笑）</>这件项链的设计令人印象深刻。既然如此，请把这条项链和当季的新品全部包装好，送至子爵府邸吧——至于账单，请直接交由我的女仆长来处理。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles faintly) </> The design of this necklace is impressive. In that case, please pack this necklace and all the new arrivals of the season and send them to the Viscount's Mansion—as for the bill, please hand it directly to my head maid to handle.",
    ["<P_Heart>（淡灰眼眸微垂）</>污染？在白银城，呼吸都在被污染。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pale gray eyes droop slightly) </> Corruption? In the City of Silver, even breathing is being corrupted.",
    ["<P_Heart>（淡灰眼眸微抬）</>你怎么知道？"] = "<P_Heart> (Pale gray eyes raised slightly) </> How do you know?",
    ["<P_Heart>（深吸一口气）</>哼……看了又能怎样？"] = "<P_Heart> (takes a deep breath) </> Hmph... what good would looking do?",
    ["<P_Heart>（深呼吸）</>如果不是您，我们可能会永远困在狭小又肮脏的烟囱里。我想知道您的名字……可以吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Deep breath) </> If it weren't for you, we might have been trapped in that narrow, dirty chimney forever. I want to know your name... may I?",
    ["<P_Heart>（深情地）</>命运眷顾我……给了我新的提示。我也向神明祈求，得到了这次重新探寻真相的机会。"] = "<P_Heart>(Affectionately)</> Fate favors me... and gave me a new hint. I also prayed to the gods and got this chance to re-explore the truth.",
    ["<P_Heart>（深眠花精油的气味……这是曾经举行了一场向黑夜女神祈祷的仪式魔法吗……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The scent of Midnight Flower essential oil... Was a Ritual Magic praying to the Evernight Goddess held here once?...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（清了清嗓子）</>咳咳！尊敬的，热心的，廷根杀鼠人……不，廷根卫生大使……请允许我代替卫生合作公司向您表达感谢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Clears throat) </> Ahem! Respected, enthusiastic, Tingen rat-killer... no, Tingen Hygiene Ambassador... please allow me to express my gratitude to you on behalf of the Hygiene Cooperation Company.",
    ["<P_Heart>（清了清嗓子，故作正式）</> 请问你想占卜些什么呢？"] = "<P_Heart>(Clearing throat, pretending to be formal)</> May I ask what you want to divine?",
    ["<P_Heart>（清嗓子，开始唱）</>冲激，冲激，冲激，大海啊，冲激灰而冷的岩石！"] = "<P_Heart>(Clears throat, begins to sing)</> Surge, surge, surge, oh sea, surge against the gray and cold rocks!",
    ["<P_Heart>（清嗓）</>调配魔药并不那么依赖天赋。在寻求帮助前，先试试自己动手。"] = "<P_Heart> (Clearing throat) </> Preparing potions doesn't rely that much on talent. Before seeking help, try doing it yourself first.",
    ["<P_Heart>（清清嗓子）</> 比星空更崇高，比永恒更久远的黑夜女神， 愿您降下慈悲与宽恕，赦免告解者的罪过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Clearing throat) </> Evernight Goddess, more noble than the starry sky, more eternal than eternity, may you bestow mercy and forgiveness to absolve the sins of the confessor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（温和一笑）</>谢谢你。我要去寻找一些老物件，看能不能想起什么。明天我们在<P_Yellow>集市下的广场</>汇合。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles gently) </> Thank you. I am going to look for some old items to see if I can remember anything. We will meet tomorrow at the <P_Yellow> square under the market </>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（温和）</>我想，不要小看神灵的祝福，他会选择你，一定是有他的原因。"] = "<P_Heart> (Gently) </> I think you shouldn't underestimate the blessings of a god. He chose you for a reason.",
    ["<P_Heart>（温和）</>是的，这是你的特殊之处。"] = "<P_Heart>(Gentle)</> Yes, that is what makes you special.",
    ["<P_Heart>（温柔）</>你也需要签名吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Gently) </> Do you need a signature too?",
    ["<P_Heart>（满意）</>是的，顺应每一次占卜的结果，我一直是这样做的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Satisfied)</> Yes, complying with the results of every divination, I have always done so.",
    ["<P_Heart>（满脸写着高兴）</>航行开始，真理号准备起航！"] = "<P_Heart>(Face full of joy)</> The voyage begins, the Truth is ready to set sail!",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动地望向你）</>年轻人，你也是来投入新时代的建设的吗？！"] = "<P_Heart>(Looking at you excitedly)</> Young man, are you also here to contribute to the construction of the new era?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>感、感谢您的慷慨，小姐！我们这就为您准备！"] = "<P_Heart> (excitedly) </> Th-thank you for your generosity, Miss! We will prepare everything for you right away!",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>我不是吸血鬼！"] = "<P_Heart>(Excitedly)</> I am not a vampire!",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>我实在放心不下，就跑上来看看……"] = "<P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> I couldn't stop worrying, so I ran up to check...",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>我无法冷静，看到您这样强大的、美艳的、冷酷的、吸血鬼，我的血液都沸腾了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Excitedly)</> I cannot stay calm. Seeing such a powerful, beautiful, cold vampire as you, my blood is boiling.",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>那……那我们的工作……"] = "<P_Heart>(Excited)</> Then... then what about our jobs...",
    ["<P_Heart>（激动）</>顺应命运的安排就是我们这些羔羊最该做的！我绝不会违背每一次占卜的结果！"] = "<P_Heart>(Excited)</> Complying with the arrangements of fate is what we lambs should do most! I will never go against the results of any divination!",
    ["<P_Heart>（火车遇到什么麻烦了吗？）</>需要帮忙么？"] = "<P_Heart>(Did you run into trouble on the train?)</> Do you need help?",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵性力量发生了波动……在那边？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (spirituality fluctuated... over there?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵性直觉似乎提示我，要找的东西就在他身上）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (My spirituality intuition seems to suggest that what I'm looking for is on him) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵性突然有所触动。难道说，这只松鼠不是寻常的动物，而是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(My spirituality is suddenly touched. Could it be that this squirrel is not an ordinary animal, but...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵感一动）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Inspiration stirs)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵感有所触动……那边的书里好像夹着一张信纸？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(My spirituality is stirred... is there a letter tucked inside that book over there?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（灵摆在飞速做顺时针运动。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The pendulum is moving clockwise at high speed.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>他们相信风暴的意志就是直接、狂暴、不留余地。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> They believe that the will of the storm is direct, berserk, and leaves no room for anything else.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>他只是……不太会直接说。"] = "<P_Heart> (Nods) </> He just... isn't very good at saying it directly.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>他说，梅丽莎以后会成为贝克兰德最伟大的蒸汽机械师。"] = "<P_Heart> (Nods) </> He said Melissa would become the greatest steam mechanic in Backlund.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>你爸爸……确实做得不对。"] = "<P_Heart> (Nods) </> Your father... is indeed in the wrong.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>后来港口被风暴教会接管，用正统的祭礼取代了这种邪恶的传统。但地下的东西……未必清理干净了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> Later, the harbor was taken over by the Church of Storms, which replaced this evil tradition with orthodox rituals. But the things underground... may not have been cleaned up completely.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>吱吱！"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> Squeak!",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>好主意。比如烫伤后立刻用凉水冲洗，而不是乱抹药膏；小伤口要先用煮沸放凉的盐水清洁，再用干净棉布包扎。这些简单的处理能避免很多后续的感染。 "] = "<P_Heart> (Nodding) </> Good idea. For example, rinse with cold water immediately after a burn instead of smearing random ointments; small wounds should be cleaned with boiled and cooled saline before being wrapped in clean cotton cloth. These simple treatments can avoid many subsequent infections.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>对极了！我有很多有趣的事儿想和你说。对了，我还从贝克兰德带了点特产回来，等等吃饭的时候拿给你！"] = "<P_Heart> (Nodding) </> Absolutely! I have many interesting things I want to tell you. By the way, I also brought back some local specialties from Backlund; I'll give them to you when we eat later!",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>当然。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nodding)</> Of course.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>当然，那是她的梦想，我和克莱恩一直支持她。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> Of course, that is her dream, and Klein and I have always supported her.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>有一定难度，所以我白天工作，晚上自学文法和会计。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> It had a certain level of difficulty, so I worked during the day and self-studied grammar and accounting at night.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>海上战斗从不会轻松。我们损失了两门舷炮，有三个水手受伤。"] = "<P_Heart> (Nods) </> Battles at sea are never easy. We lost two broadside cannons, and three sailors were injured.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>费尔默咖啡很苦，但很香。解决任务后来一杯，是一种享受。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> Fermo coffee is very bitter, but very fragrant. Having a cup after solving a quest is a treat.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>那里有最好的实验室。但学费很贵，所以我现在得攒很多钱。"] = "<P_Heart> (Nods) </> They have the best laboratories there. But the tuition is very expensive, so I have to save a lot of money now.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点燃的蜡烛……颂念的尊名……他们在向什么神祈祷？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Lit candles... chanted honorific names... what god are they praying to?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（烦躁）</>不止啊。还有那望不到头的未来！满城的煤烟、噪声和钢铁怪物，哪里容得下一张安静的书桌？我的笔，写得出诗句，却劈不开这厚重的迷雾。"] = "<P_Heart> (Irritated) </> It's not just that. There's also the endless future! The city full of coal smoke, noise, and steel monsters—where is there room for a quiet desk? My pen can write poetry, but it can't cut through this thick fog.",
    ["<P_Heart>（热情）</>您好，{{先生|女士}}！这里是黑荆棘安保公司。"] = "<P_Heart> (Enthusiastic) </> Hello, {{Mr.|Ms.}}! This is Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["<P_Heart>（然后，我就有两套体面的正装了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Then I'll have two decent formal outfits!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（照明蜡烛应该不需要来地下市场买吧？难道是——仪式用的蜡烛？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Surely you don't need to come to the underground market to buy lighting candles? Could it be—candles for a ritual?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（熟悉的大叫，头身分离……该不会又是？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That familiar screaming, the head separated from the body... Could it be that again?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（爬起，意识到什么）</>你、你搞鬼！"] = "<P_Heart> (Gets up, realizing something) </> You, you're playing tricks!",
    ["<P_Heart>（爱丽丝也认识皮特？刚好顺便问问情况。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Does Alice know Pete too? I'll just ask about the situation while I'm at it.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（爱丽丝想说的话，我可能带不到了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I might not be able to deliver what Alice wanted to say...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（特里斯……这个少年，居然在这么危险的时刻还能保持理智和淡定。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Triss... this boy, actually able to remain rational and calm at such a dangerous moment.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（特里斯……难道他救人只是表象，其实是要把所有人推向深渊？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Triss... could it be that his saving people was just a facade, and he was actually pushing everyone into the abyss?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（状态都没问题……看来这些孩子身上不存在污染。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Their states are all fine... It seems there is no corruption on these children.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>……你怎么不跟别人一样，说是我的问题？说是我不懂事？"] = "<P_Heart> (Hesitating) </> ...Why aren't you like the others, saying it's my problem? Saying I'm being unreasonable?",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>你到底想做什么？"] = "<P_Heart>(Hesitates)</> What exactly do you want to do?",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>你手头还宽裕吗？我听说班森在贝克兰德的财务部工作，工作还顺利吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (hesitating) </> Are you still doing well financially? I heard Benson works in the finance department in Backlund; is his work going smoothly?",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>你手头还宽裕吗？我听说黑荆棘会按月发抚恤金。"] = "<P_Heart>(Hesitant)</> Are you still doing well financially? I heard Blackthorn pays a monthly pension.",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>可是……"] = "<P_Heart> (Hesitating) </> But...",
    ["<P_Heart>（犹豫）</>这可能有点突然……但你的实力让我印象深刻。能拜托你帮我让他现身吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Hesitant)</> This might be a bit sudden... but your strength has left a deep impression on me. Could I trouble you to help me make him appear?",
    ["<P_Heart>（狒狒还在动手动脚……该怎么把卡门从树上弄下来呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The baboon is still messing around... how can I get Carmen down from the tree?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（狗抓老鼠比赛？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Dog catching mouse race?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（猛地停住）</> 我、我怎么都说出来了！呜呜呜呜呜我错了我不该忍不住我真是个废物……"] = "<P_Heart> (Stops abruptly) </> I, why did I say all that! Wuwuwuwu, I'm wrong, I shouldn't have been unable to hold it back, I'm such a loser...",
    ["<P_Heart>（猛地打断）</>住口！别说了……你根本什么都不明白……快走开！"] = "<P_Heart>(Interrupts abruptly)</> Stop! Don't say another word... you don't understand anything at all... go away!",
    ["<P_Heart>（猛地转身）</>啥？！"] = "<P_Heart>(Suddenly turns around)</> What?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（玛格丽特刚才看我的眼神太热情了，唉，魅力啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Miss Margaret's gaze toward me just now was too passionate. Sigh, the burden of charm.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（玩点什么呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What should I play with?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（玩蚂蚁的小孩，骂着脏话，用融化的冰淇淋在地上写字……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A child playing with ants, swearing, using melted ice cream to write on the ground...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（环视四周，目光微微一顿）</>这件红宝石饰品……"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks around, gaze pauses slightly) </> This ruby jewelry...",
    ["<P_Heart>（环顾四周）</>不在？"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks around) </> Not here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（现在有十四个自杀者，其中六个被阿兹克先生救下。先调查之前的受害者有什么共性。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There are fourteen suicides now, six of whom were saved by Mr. Azik. First, investigate what the previous victims had in common.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（珍妮在光里看到了之前的经历？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Did Jenny see her past experiences in the light?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（班森的口才都像是某种非凡能力了，他应该挺适合从政，成为一名政府工作人员。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Benson's eloquence is like some kind of Beyonder power. He would be quite suited for politics, becoming a government official.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（班森的周薪才1镑10苏勒，钱可真不禁花啊……嗯，我得尽快工作赚钱。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Benson's weekly salary is only 1 pound and 10 shillings; money really doesn't last long... hmm, I must work and earn money as soon as possible.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（班森经常说弗兰奇先生的智商不如卷毛狒狒，轻易说服了他安装煤气管道，为了我读书方便……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Benson often says Mr. Frank's IQ is not as good as a Curly-Haired Baboon, and he easily persuaded him to install gas pipes, for the sake of my studies...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（班森还在出差，梅丽莎与这件事无关，应该不会受影响。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Benson is still away on business, and Melissa has nothing to do with this, so she shouldn't be affected.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（班森，接下来就交给你了 。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Benson, I'll leave it to you.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（瑞尔·比伯得到的家族遗产，应该就是安提哥努斯笔记。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The family inheritance Ray Bieber obtained must be the Antigonus Notebook.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（瑟瑟发抖）</> 就、就在你眼前……"] = "<P_Heart> (Shivering) </> Right... right in front of you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（用审视的目光盯着你。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Staring at you with a look of Scrutiny.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（用窥秘看看现场，可能会留下非凡力量的痕迹。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Use Clairvoyance to examine the scene; it might have left traces of Beyonder powers.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（用胸针占卜试试，也许能找到茶会会场。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Try divination with the brooch; perhaps I can find the Tea Party Venue.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（用非凡能力帮助一下他们吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's use Beyonder powers to help them out.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（电流爆鸣声）</>喂……到吗……醒……那是……阱……"] = "<P_Heart>(Electrical crackling)</> Hello... can you... hear... wake... that is... trap...",
    ["<P_Heart>（略微错愕，连忙点头）</>是、是，当然！您非凡的品味令人赞叹。此外，这边还有一套新品翡翠耳饰，正逢“静谧之夜”特惠活动期间，可以以两百金镑的价格买下……"] = "<P_Heart> (Slightly stunned, nods quickly) </> Y-yes, of course! Your extraordinary taste is admirable. In addition, there is a set of new jade earrings here. During the 'Silent Night' special event, you can buy them for two hundred gold pounds...",
    ["<P_Heart>（略显失望）</>哦。那你知道这里谁占卜最准吗？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looking slightly disappointed)</> Oh. Then do you know who is the most accurate diviner here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（痛苦）</>呃……"] = "<P_Heart> (Pain) </> Uh...",
    ["<P_Heart>（痴狂）</>原来如此！我全部、全部明白了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Demented)</> So that's it! I understand everything, everything!",
    ["<P_Heart>（白紧张了……说了又好像没说。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Nervous for nothing... it's like he said nothing at all.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（皮特的行为很奇怪，请一周假，接回伊妮德，去地下市场……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Pete's behavior is very strange, taking a week off, bringing Enid back, going to the underground market...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（皱眉）</>……现在，打扰你们的声音已经……永远消失了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Frowns) </>... Now, the voices disturbing you have... disappeared forever.",
    ["<P_Heart>（皱眉）</>先去墓地广场看看。"] = "<P_Heart> (Frowns) </> Let's go to the cemetery square and see.",
    ["<P_Heart>（皱眉）</>嗯……或许有一个具体的问题吗？如果有一个明确的方向，有机会获得更准确的回答哦。"] = "<P_Heart>(Frowning)</> Um... perhaps a specific question? If there is a clear direction, there is a chance to get a more accurate answer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（监工的灵呆滞地望着纺织厂内）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The supervisor's spirit stares blankly into the textile factory) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（盒子里真的会有东西吗……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is there really something in the box...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（目不斜视地回望。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks back without averting eyes.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（目瞪口呆）</> 她们……这就又变回知心姐妹了？难道是因为山姆要继承亿万家产，这是金钱的力量？"] = "<P_Heart> (Stunned) </> They... they're back to being best friends just like that? Could it be because Sam is about to inherit billions, and this is the power of money?",
    ["<P_Heart>（盯……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Stare...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（盯着台上）</>罗莎今天那条裙子……"] = "<P_Heart>(Staring at the stage)</> Rosa's dress today...",
    ["<P_Heart>（盯着看，忽然笑了）</>原来小丑这么可爱。我还以为会很丑呢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Staring, then suddenly laughing) </> So Clowns are this cute. I thought they would be very ugly.",
    ["<P_Heart>（盯着翅膀看了很久）</> ……啧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Staring at the wings for a long time) </> ...Tsk.",
    ["<P_Heart>（直面失控怪物并受到精神污染，对普通人来说果然还是太极端了。她选择性遗忘了非凡相关，这也是合理的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Facing a loss-of-control monster and suffering mental corruption is indeed too extreme for an ordinary person. It is reasonable that she selectively forgot matters related to Beyonders.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看上去不会再做出回答，先观察一下他吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Doesn't seem like he will respond again, let's observe him first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看上去他们正在做大弥撒。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It looks like they are holding a grand mass.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看了一眼怀表）</>时候不早了，我要先去准备了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Glanced at his pocket watch) </> It's getting late; I need to go prepare.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看了看你）</>……"] = "<P_Heart> (looks at you) </> ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（看了看剧院）</>听着，那玩意儿就在里面。"] = "<P_Heart> (looks at the theater) </> Listen, that thing is inside.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看他的穿着，是一名士兵？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at his attire, is he a soldier?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看他这副走路都傻笑的样子，也难怪会撞到路边花盆了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at how he's giggling while walking, it's no wonder he bumped into a roadside flowerpot.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向你手中的金色子弹）</>我在附近感觉到了一些灵性波动。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at the golden bullet in your hand) </> I sense some spirituality fluctuations nearby.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向你）</>学得很好嘛！ {{小伙子|小姑娘}}！"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks at you)</>You've learned well! {{Young man|Young lady}}!",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向你）</>这是我新的同伴，我们会一起为你们占卜。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks at you) </> This is my new companion. We will perform the divination for you together.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向你）</>这次，我们一起。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks at you) </> This time, we do it together.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向自己的手）</>我……刚刚……"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at his own hands) </> I... just now...",
    ["<P_Heart>（看向闪闪发光的垃圾们）</>嗯……别管这该死的好奇心了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking at the glittering trash) </> Hmm... forget this damn curiosity.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看得人昏昏欲睡……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It's making me drowsy...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来“魔术师”小姐已经沉浸在创作中了，暂时不去打扰她了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Miss Magician is already immersed in her creation, better not disturb her for now.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来不用太担心他了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems I don't need to worry about him too much.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来他也暂时无法清醒，这周围也许有知识的谜题。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems he is also temporarily unable to wake up; there might be a puzzle of knowledge around here.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来他们可以度过温暖的一天了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems they can spend a warm day.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来她们已经没时间顾及我了，希望能够帮上忙。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems they have no time to pay attention to me, I hope I can be of help.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来孩子的死带走了他最后的念想，那他残留的执念又是什么呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems the child's death took away his last attachment. What, then, is his lingering obsession?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来就是这里了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems this is the place.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来已经被这群可爱的小家伙包围了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems you have been surrounded by these cute little guys.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来很害羞，换个话题吧）</>有什么值得推荐的书吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Seems very shy, let's change the subject) </> Do you have any books to recommend?",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来施佩尔先生的灵体被困在了这个空间，所以现实世界的他才会疯疯癫癫的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Mr. Speer's spirit body is trapped in this space, which is why he is acting crazy in the real world.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来有心灵领域的官方非凡者关注并管控着报刊行业，吉尔达的记忆和心智受到了干扰。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems official Beyonders from the Mind domain are monitoring and controlling the newspaper industry; Gilda's memory and mind have been tampered with.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来玛莎是整个事件的突破口。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Martha is the breakthrough point for the entire incident.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来还要继续起哄。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks like I need to keep stirring things up.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来这些女孩子正在进行星象占卜。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems these girls are performing astrological divination.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来阿兹克先生了解非凡世界，也知道黑荆棘的情况。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Mr. Azik understands the Extraordinary World and also knows about the situation at Blackthorn.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来，得多多使用“灵视”，一楼和二楼都不能放过。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems I have to use 'spirit vision' more often; I can't let either the first or second floor go.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来，某些小猫正在发展有趣的关系呢，我记得谁家猫是黑色的来着……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems some kittens are developing an interesting relationship, I remember whose cat was black...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来，这是佐伊的记忆……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems this is Zoe's memory...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看看盒饭里面有什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's see what's inside the lunch box...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来不像是夸奖……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Doesn't look like a compliment...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来他们是一伙的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks like they're in on it together...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来安洁莉卡的反应很正常，再</><P_Yellow>用灵视</><P_Heart>观察下其它人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Angelica's reaction seems normal. Let me </><P_Yellow>use Spirit Vision</><P_Heart> to observe the others.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来完全没相信……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Doesn't seem to believe it at all...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来是在聊一些零食生意……嗯，我也想吃。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks like they're chatting about some snack business... hmm, I want to eat too.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来是金秋镇的人，他是怎么了？）</>谁要吃你？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks like someone from Golden Autumn Town, what happened to him?)</> Who wants to eat you?",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来赞美有效果，就把案件交给这位警官继续处理吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems the praise was effective. I'll leave the case to this officer to continue handling.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看起来这位老人非常厌恶他的护士，可能有什么别的原因。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems this old man is very disgusted with his nurse, there might be some other reason.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看错了吧，猪又不会写字。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I must have misread it; pigs can't write.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真好喝……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So delicious...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真是不知悔改……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He really doesn't know how to repent...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真是个让人饥饿的话题，我在分泌唾液了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What a hunger-inducing topic, my mouth is watering.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真是复杂的国家往事……现在的因蒂斯可是共和国了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What a complicated national history... Intis is a republic now.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真清闲啊，要是我也能每天这样摸鱼就好了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (How leisurely. If only I could slack off like this every day.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真的会有这种天上掉金币的事情吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could there really be such a thing as gold coins falling from the sky?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真的有？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is there really?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（真高冷……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So cold and aloof...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（眨眨眼）</>想啊。但是姐姐得先请我喝一杯，我才能名正言顺地……赖着不走。"] = "<P_Heart>(Blinks)</>I do. But you have to buy me a drink first, then I can rightfully... linger and not leave.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眨眨眼）</>我在这儿这么多年，什么男人没见过？哄男人这事儿……<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>得学会挑，学会等，学会——点到为止。"] = "<P_Heart>(Winks)</> I've been here for so many years, what kind of man haven't I seen? Coaxing men... <P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> you have to learn to pick, learn to wait, and learn—to stop at the right moment.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼中泪光闪烁）</>同样在我眼里，你虽然长着獠牙和爪子，却比所有男人更像绅士。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tears shimmering in eyes) </> Likewise in my eyes, although you have fangs and claws, you are more like a gentleman than any other man.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼中泪光闪烁）</>谢谢你，哈基猿……你虽然长着獠牙和爪子，却比所有男人更像绅士。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tears shimmering in eyes) </> Thank you, Haki-ape... Although you have fangs and claws, you are more like a gentleman than any other man.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼前一亮）</>你对这些感兴趣？天哪……终于有人愿意听一个老头子唠叨了？"] = "<P_Heart>(Eyes light up)</> You're interested in these? My god... finally someone willing to listen to an old man ramble?",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼前一亮）</>真的？那您快帮我算！咱们找个单独的房间，费用随便开！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes lighting up) </> Really? Then please calculate for me! Let's find a private room, name your price!",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼含热泪）</> 世上没有什么比梅兰妮更重要！我们说定了，以后要一起经营花店，生意一定比现在的更好。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tears in her eyes) </> There is nothing more important in the world than Melanie! We've decided, we're going to run a flower shop together, and business will definitely be better than it is now.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼球微动，他在想事情，而且很清醒。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes twitching slightly, he is thinking, and he is very clear-headed.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛一亮）</>哟，今天有货！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes light up) </> Oh, something good today!",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛亮亮的）</>姐姐，你今天这身裙子真好看，我都不敢多看。"] = "<P_Heart>(Eyes shining)</> Sister, your dress today is so beautiful, I don't even dare to look too much.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛亮起来）</>当然！那里存着一些教会几百年前的神秘学手抄本。我一直在申请经费重新誊抄，可邓恩说得排在装备采购后面。"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes light up) </> Of course! It holds some occult manuscripts from the Church from hundreds of years ago. I've been applying for funding to re-transcribe them, but Dunn says it has to come after equipment procurement.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛发亮）</>当然，是因为我想学马戏啦！我不喜欢父母安排的那些钢琴课、绘画课……"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes shining) </> Of course, it's because I want to learn circus arts! I don't like the piano and painting lessons my parents arrange...",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛发光）</>真的吗？我们可以结婚？"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes shining) </> Really? Can we get married?",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛微亮）</>荷叶边衬衫配马甲外套重新流行起来了！不过真正有趣的是……"] = "<P_Heart>(Eyes brighten slightly)</> Ruffled shirts paired with vest jackets are back in fashion! But what's truly interesting is...",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼睛微微发亮）</>嗯。不是维修师，是设计师。能设计自己的机械，让它们真的转起来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes shining slightly) </> Yes. Not a repairman, but a designer. To be able to design my own machines and make them really turn.",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼神呆滞）</>真是的……每天都这样……不吵一架不行……"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes dull) </> Honestly... it's like this every day... we just have to argue...",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼神清亮）</>图纸！是的，我的图纸没有丢！"] = "<P_Heart>(Eyes clear)</> Drawings! Yes, my drawings are not lost!",
    ["<P_Heart>（眼神闪了一下）</>你故意找茬是不是？要就要，不要就走，别耽误我做生意。后面还有人排队呢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes flickered) </> Are you looking for trouble on purpose? If you want it, take it; if not, leave. Don't delay my business. There are people waiting in line behind you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（睁眼，眼眶泛红）</>谢谢你。"] = "<P_Heart> (Opening eyes, eyes rimmed with red) </> Thank you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（睡吧……明天……明天……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Sleep... tomorrow... tomorrow...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（瞪大双眼）</>还有比霍纳奇斯山脉更东，比迷雾海更西的地方？"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes wide open) </> Is there any place further east than the Hornacis Mountain Range, or further west than the Fog Sea?",
    ["<P_Heart>（瞪大眼睛）</>您，您要帮忙吗？真的吗？可是您在外面，该怎么……"] = "<P_Heart> (Eyes wide) </> You, you want to help? Really? But you're outside, how could you...",
    ["<P_Heart>（知识……知识……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Knowledge... knowledge...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（短短几天，发生了好多事情……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(So many things have happened in just a few days...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（破旧的亚麻床单……上面没有灰尘，它是近期被铺在这里的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (A worn-out linen sheet... there's no dust on it; it was placed here recently.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（确实在重复……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It is indeed repeating...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（确实，相亲对象不一定是个真诚的人，我也去看着罗珊点吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Indeed, a blind date candidate might not be a sincere person, I should go and keep an eye on Rozanne too.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（确认小男孩不在当场）</>他先回去了，但大夫不信小孩子，要你出面才行，你快回去吧，再晚就来不及了！"] = "<P_Heart> (Confirming the little boy is not on the scene) </> He went back first, but the doctor doesn't believe a child, you need to step forward. Go back quickly, it will be too late if you are any later!",
    ["<P_Heart>（碎碎念）</>不对我根本还没问啊为什么要劈我呜呜呜……"] = "<P_Heart>(Muttering)</> No, I didn't even ask yet, why did you strike me, wuwuwu...",
    ["<P_Heart>（祈祷已经开始了，阿尔伯特会不会沾染上了邪异的气息？最好用灵视检查一下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The prayer has already begun. Could Albert have been tainted by an evil aura? It's best to check with spirit vision.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（神使大人……是邮筒？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Lord Messenger... is a mailbox?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（神奇的茶水……听起来有非凡力量参与，去看看吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Magical tea... sounds like it involves extraordinary power, let's go check it out.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（神情严肃）</>冰山，是我们共同的敌人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Solemn expression) </> The iceberg is our common enemy.",
    ["<P_Heart>（神情狂热）</>没错，只要我能继承它，就能改变所有人的命运！"] = "<P_Heart> (Fanatical expression) </> That's right, as long as I can inherit it, I can change everyone's fate!",
    ["<P_Heart>（神秘力量……看来要报告给队长了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Mysterious power... looks like I need to report this to the captain...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（神秘地笑）</>我有我的办法，我很擅长……砍价，但有时也需要克莱恩和梅丽莎配合。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles mysteriously) </> I have my ways. I am very good at... bargaining, but sometimes I also need Klein and Melissa to cooperate.",
    ["<P_Heart>（神色凝重）</>……一个被诅咒的港口。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks solemn) </>... A cursed port.",
    ["<P_Heart>（神色变得痛苦）</>……"] = "<P_Heart>(Expression turns painful)</> ...",
    ["<P_Heart>（稍显放松）</>不过这方面我们医院的护士可能更擅长一些。我去找一个护士做搭档吧！"] = "<P_Heart> (Slightly relaxed) </> But our hospital nurses might be better at this aspect. I'll go find a nurse to be my partner!",
    ["<P_Heart>（突然传来一阵异响）</>你……能听到我的声音？"] = "<P_Heart> (a strange noise suddenly comes) </> You... can hear my voice?",
    ["<P_Heart>（突然回神）</>不……不！老师不是自杀的！"] = "<P_Heart> (Suddenly coming to his senses) </> No... no! Teacher didn't commit suicide!",
    ["<P_Heart>（突然生起气来）</>你不是疯子，你根本不懂！滚开点！"] = "<P_Heart> (Suddenly getting angry) </> You are not a madman, you don't understand at all! Get away!",
    ["<P_Heart>（突然自己振作起来了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Suddenly she pulled herself together...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（立刻双手奉上钱包）</>啊，都、都是误会！误会！我们只是闹着玩，闹着玩……"] = "<P_Heart>(Immediately offers the wallet with both hands)</> Ah, i-it's all a misunderstanding! A misunderstanding! We were just messing around, just messing around...",
    ["<P_Heart>（站起身）</>我知道。所以我说你不是一个好的占卜师。"] = "<P_Heart>(Stands up)</> I know. That's why I said you aren't a good diviner.",
    ["<P_Heart>（竟然就这么直接地承认了吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Did he just admit it so directly?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（竟然愣住了）</>……抱歉，我从未想过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Actually stunned) </> ...Sorry, I never thought of that.",
    ["<P_Heart>（竟然是预先留给我的信……“魔术师”小姐的非凡能力太惊人了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(To think she left a letter for me in advance... Miss Magician's Beyonder abilities are truly astonishing...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑了一下）</>谢谢医生。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiled slightly) </> Thank you, doctor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑了笑）</>上周有些着凉，没什么大事。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> I caught a bit of a cold last week, nothing serious.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑容满面）</>唱我儿子！我儿子哈维，考上霍伊大学了！是大学生！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Beaming) </> Singing about my son! My son Harvey, he got into Hoey University! He's a university student!",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑容满面）</>您的品味与气度无人能及！"] = "<P_Heart> (Beaming) </> Your taste and bearing are unmatched!",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑容灿烂）</>最后啊，黑暗被驱散了！所有住在黑夜里的人，都在光明的世界里重逢啦！"] = "<P_Heart> (Bright smile) </> In the end, the darkness was dispelled! Everyone living in the night reunited in the world of light!",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑得更开心）</> 我…当然！乐意至极，画家先生。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling even more happily) </> I... of course! I would be delighted, Mr. Painter.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑眯眯）</> 年轻好啊，年轻人之间恋爱得有激情、有火花！"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> Youth is good; love between young people should have passion and sparks!",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>但最后我通过了。虽然不是名列前茅，但足够让我进入财政部工作……"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> But in the end, I passed. Although I wasn't at the top of the list, it was enough for me to enter the Ministry of Finance to work...",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>你每次都顺路吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> Is it always on your way?",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>你这双手，我怎么舍得让你受累呢。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> How could I bear to let your hands get tired?",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>反正他第三天又来了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> Either way, he came back on the third day.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>听起来很热闹。"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> Sounds very lively.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>哦，那是我们在廷根时的房东，铁十字街出租公寓的“传奇人物”。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughs) </> Oh, that was our landlord back in Tingen, a 'legendary figure' of the Iron Cross Street apartment building.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>如果有机会，我很乐意为你弹奏一首。"] = "<P_Heart>(Smiles)</> If there's a chance, I'd be very happy to play one for you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>对，而且拆了还能装回去，甚至装得更好。"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> Yes, and she could put it back together after taking it apart, and even make it work better.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>我这个年纪，还是适合待在温暖的占卜摊里，不适合爬山了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughs) </> At my age, it's better to stay in a warm divination stall; it's not suitable for climbing mountains.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>或许这些隐藏在序列途径里的秘密，只有你亲自体验才能体会得到。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughs) </> Perhaps these secrets hidden within the Sequence Pathways can only be understood once you experience them yourself.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>放心，我分得清。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughing) </> Don't worry, I can tell them apart.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>既然她不想暴露，就当我们不知道吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> Since she doesn't want to be exposed, let's pretend we don't know.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>有一点混乱，但也很温馨。"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> A bit chaotic, but also very warm.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>有熟人在旁边，也能缓解一些紧张感呢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiling) </> Having someone you know nearby can also relieve some of the tension.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>算你爱做攻略吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughing) </> Consider it your love for making guides.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>这枪管都锈穿了，拿回去当烧火棍？"] = "<P_Heart> (Laughs) </> The barrel is rusted through; are you taking it back to use as a fire poker?",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>逗你的，你要是真想让我看清楚，待会儿可以来请我喝一杯。我喝高兴了，说不定会离你更近一点。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> Just kidding. If you really want me to see you clearly, you can buy me a drink later. If I'm in a good mood, I might just get a little closer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑）</>那您怎么应对？"] = "<P_Heart>(Laughs)</> Then how did you deal with it?",
    ["<P_Heart>（等等——折莫比乌斯环用的纸，是乔纳尔亲手写的病情记录！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Wait—the paper used for the Mobius ring is the medical record written by Jonar himself!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（等等、我怎么也……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Wait, why am I also...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（等等，一个月就消化完魔药，这速度绝对会引来高层的怀疑，最好还是先铺垫下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Wait, digesting the potion in a month, this speed will definitely attract the suspicion of the higher-ups. It's best to lay some groundwork first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（等等，我也晕了，到底是什么来着……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Wait, I'm confused too, what was it again...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（等等，班森的厨艺？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Wait, Benson's cooking?!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（精神状态稍微有点差，毕竟她刚才经历了那么多事情……看来蒙特利没有骗我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Her mental state is a bit poor; after all, she just went through so much... It seems Monterey didn't lie to me.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（紧张）</>你们……还好吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Nervous) </> Are you... are you okay?",
    ["<P_Heart>（紧张）</>是……是我把鸟吓走了吗？对不起，我马上走——"] = "<P_Heart> (Nervous) </> Did... did I scare the birds away? I'm sorry, I'll leave right away—",
    ["<P_Heart>（紧张）</>这是什么意思？"] = "<P_Heart> (Nervous) </> What does this mean?",
    ["<P_Heart>（紧紧抱住猫）</>法律不重要。重要的是女神知道我们相爱。"] = "<P_Heart> (Hugs the cat tightly) </> The law is not important. What's important is that the Goddess knows we are in love.",
    ["<P_Heart>（终于……过去了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Finally... it's over...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（终会有所磨损的木质或金属守卫们。也许世界的某个角落，会有一面耐久度惊人的勇士之盾……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Wooden or metal guards that will eventually wear out. Perhaps in some corner of the world, there will be a warrior's shield with amazing durability...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（经历了这些还能坚持……看来是真的热爱猎龙啊……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(To be able to persist after experiencing all this... it seems they really love dragon hunting...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（绝对是被无良摊主骗了吧！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He was definitely scammed by an unscrupulous merchant!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（维拉夫人说，罗塞尔大帝风流成性……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Lady Villa said that Emperor Roselle was a philanderer...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（维斯塔蜡烛工坊……想起来了，维斯塔是芬恩的老师！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Vista's Candle Workshop... I remember now, Vista is Finn's teacher!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（缓缓浮现文字）</>虽然很疯狂，但不得不承认……是个精彩的故事。"] = "<P_Heart> (Words slowly emerge) </> Although it is crazy, I have to admit... it is a wonderful story.",
    ["<P_Heart>（缥缈而柔和的声音）</> 比星空更崇高，比永恒更久远的黑夜女神， 愿您降下慈悲与宽恕，赦免告解者的罪过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Ethereal and soft voice) </> Evernight Goddess, who is more noble than the stars and more eternal than eternity, may you bestow mercy and forgiveness and pardon the sins of the confessor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（网络交友平台了解一下？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is this like an online social platform?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（羞愧）</>抱歉，我没有钱……"] = "<P_Heart> (Ashamed) </> I'm sorry, I don't have any money...",
    ["<P_Heart>（羞涩）</>做些这样的手工能让我感觉很放松。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shyly) </> Doing this kind of handiwork makes me feel very relaxed.",
    ["<P_Heart>（羞涩）</>我只是觉得，姐姐买的酒，喝起来会比较甜。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shyly)</>I just think that the wine you buy tastes a bit sweeter.",
    ["<P_Heart>（翻开一张牌——正位隐士）</>比我们所有人都更懂占卜的意义。"] = "<P_Heart> (Flips over a card—The Hermit, upright) </> She understands the meaning of divination better than any of us.",
    ["<P_Heart>（翻开信查看）</>这……"] = "<P_Heart> (Opens the letter to check) </> This...",
    ["<P_Heart>（翻看）</>这些诗……都很不错，也许你可以把诗投稿给廷根的报刊杂志。"] = "<P_Heart> (Browsing) </> These poems... are all very good, maybe you can submit them to Tingen's newspapers and magazines.",
    ["<P_Heart>（老尼尔居然直接答应了，没有找借口推脱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Old Neil actually agreed directly without making excuses...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（老尼尔提醒了我，占卜家的魔药消化比预期早了几周，后续的晋升计划，最好回家去灰雾上占卜一下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Old Neil reminded me that the Seer potion digestion was a few weeks earlier than expected. For the subsequent advancement plan, it's best to go home and divine it above the gray fog.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（而且这是公务花销，或许能报销？）</>行吧，我来付吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(And this is an official expense, maybe it can be reimbursed?)</> Fine, I'll pay it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（而且，万一他们发现我是穿越者，还有那片古怪的灰雾空间……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(And, what if they discover I'm a transmigrator, along with that strange gray fog space...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（而是贪婪。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But greed.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（耳畔嗡嗡作响，我好像从马桶里……获得了知识？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A buzzing in my ears... did I just... gain knowledge from a toilet?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>习惯了。十九岁失去家人后，我就和死亡绑在一起了。与其假装自己还能当个普通人，不如活成收尸人途径的非凡者该有的样子。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shrugging)</> I'm used to it. After losing my family at nineteen, I was tied to death. Rather than pretending I could still be an ordinary person, it's better to live as a Beyonder of the Corpse Collector pathway should.",
    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>我想他做这些，也许是出于一种补偿感吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shrugging) </> I think he did these things, perhaps out of a sense of compensation.",
    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>猎龙需要钱。我们不偷不抢，难道指望政客慈善、富豪施舍、神明恩赐？"] = "<P_Heart> (Shrugs) </> Hunting dragons requires money. We don't steal or rob, so should we rely on politicians' charity, the wealthy's alms, or the gods' gifts?",
    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>还好，这是长兄的责任。但总体来说，生活还是很有趣的……"] = "<P_Heart>(Shrugs)</> It was okay; this is the responsibility of the eldest brother. But overall, life was still very interesting...",
    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>随你怎么说。反正我是不会花大价钱坐这种花里胡哨的船。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shrugs) </> Say what you want. Anyway, I wouldn't spend a fortune to ride such a flashy ship.",
    ["<P_Heart>（肚子里的婴儿会哼歌、吹口哨？怎么听着不对劲……最好用灵视查看下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The baby in her stomach hums and whistles? That doesn't sound right... It's best to check with spirit vision.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（胡子发抖）</>玛丽安……是这只猫？"] = "<P_Heart> (Beard trembling) </> Mary Ann... is this cat?",
    ["<P_Heart>（脚下像是一张长桌？先从桌子上下去吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It feels like a long table under my feet? Let's get off the table first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（脚踢了踢地上的非凡生物）</>失控的非凡动物，最近越来越多，一开始都在野外，最近开始往镇上跑了。"] = "<P_Heart>(Kicks the Beyonder creature on the ground)</> Beyonder creatures losing control—there have been more and more of them lately. At first, they were all in the wild, but recently they've started running into town.",
    ["<P_Heart>（脸红）</> 麦迪！停下，你干什么！"] = "<P_Heart> (blushing) </> Maddy! Stop, what are you doing!",
    ["<P_Heart>（脸红）</>我还差点都吃光了……他做得真挺不错的，除了用了太多昂贵的调料……"] = "<P_Heart> (Blushing) </> I almost ate it all... He really made it quite well, except he used too many expensive seasonings...",
    ["<P_Heart>（脸红）</>是一封告白信和铜镜。我、我是在十字街买的镜子，那个老板说是特价甩卖……我并不知道它和案件有关。"] = "<P_Heart>(Blushing)</> It's a confession letter and a copper mirror. I, I bought the mirror at Cross Street, the boss said it was a special clearance sale... I didn't know it was related to the case.",
    ["<P_Heart>（脸色变了）</>……你问保真？"] = "<P_Heart>(Complexion changed)</>... You're asking if it's authentic?",
    ["<P_Heart>（自信）</>没错，这算是事实。"] = "<P_Heart>(Confident)</> That's right, that is a fact.",
    ["<P_Heart>（自恋狂……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Narcissist...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</> 和梅丽莎、伊丽莎白一起度过的日子就像是在昨天一样清晰。"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to herself) </> The days spent with Melissa and Elizabeth are as clear as if they were yesterday.",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</>下一次来这里也不知道是什么时候？最近手头太紧了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to himself) </> I wonder when I'll be able to come here again? Money has been really tight lately...",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</>感谢你，生命的源泉！赞美你，万物的母亲！"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to herself) </> Thank you, source of life! Praise you, mother of all things!",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</>打听得差不多了，回去告诉他们吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Self-talk)</>I've asked around enough, time to go back and tell them.",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</>身体要灵活，重心要低，趁对方扑空的时候绕后。这老鼠……有点东西啊。"] = "<P_Heart> (Talking to himself) </> The body must be agile, the center of gravity low, and you must circle behind when the opponent misses. This rat... actually has some skills.",
    ["<P_Heart>（自言自语）</>身法要灵活，重心要低，趁对方扑空的时候绕后。这老鼠……有点东西啊。"] = "<P_Heart>(Talking to himself)</> Keep your movements agile, keep your center of gravity low, and circle behind when the opponent misses. This rat... is actually quite something.",
    ["<P_Heart>（至于猎龙帮……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (As for the Dragon Hunter Gang...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（艰难）</>我不想去那种地方……我只想恢复正常……"] = "<P_Heart> (Struggling) </> I don't want to go to such a place... I just want to return to normal...",
    ["<P_Heart>（若有所思）</> 所以那句话的意思是……"] = "<P_Heart>(Thoughtfully)</> So that sentence means...",
    ["<P_Heart>（若有所思）</>点到为止就行？"] = "<P_Heart>(Thoughtful)</> Just keep it moderate?",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦恼）</>最近的退货率高得吓人，也不知道怎么回事……"] = "<P_Heart> (distressed) </> The return rate has been shockingly high lately, I don't know what's going on...",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦涩）</>但是我现在是一张牌，只能回应他人的问题，无法向自己提问。所以……<P_Yellow>你能帮我提问吗？</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Bitterly)</> But I am a card now; I can only respond to others' questions and cannot ask myself. So... <P_Yellow>can you help me ask?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦笑）</>何止是认识。我们先进去吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Bitter smile)</> \"Know\" is an understatement. Let's head inside first.",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦笑）</>后来我就进了工厂，再也没上过学，嫁了一个父母安排好的男人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Bitterly smiling) </> Later, I went into the factory, never went to school again, and married a man my parents arranged for me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦笑）</>盖尔，你知道的，我没有力气再继续爱你了。"] = "<P_Heart> (A bitter smile) </> Gail, you know, I don't have the strength to keep loving you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦笑）</>谢谢你，道理其实我都明白的……算了，喝完这杯我就回去，总不能真烂在这里，你说是吧？"] = "<P_Heart> (Bitter smile) </> Thank you, I actually understand the logic... Forget it, I'll go back after finishing this glass. I can't really rot here, right?",
    ["<P_Heart>（苦笑）</>那会儿真觉得被诅咒了，连天气都眷顾弗萨克人。"] = "<P_Heart> (Bitter smile) </> At that time, I really felt cursed, even the weather favored the Feysacians.",
    ["<P_Heart>（茫然地看着一堆文字）</> 呃……难道不眠者序列的非凡者失控……就是变成一堆梦话？"] = "<P_Heart> (Staring blankly at a pile of text) </> Uh... could it be that when a Beyonder of the Sleepless pathway loses control... they just turn into a bunch of sleep-talking?",
    ["<P_Heart>（茫然）</>拒绝改变……停滞不前……"] = "<P_Heart> (Blankly) </> Refusing change... stagnation...",
    ["<P_Heart>（茫然）</>这涉及到故事，我无法回答。得不到关键问题的答案，我也无法推理故事的原貌。"] = "<P_Heart>(Blankly)</> This involves the story, and I cannot answer. Without the answer to the key question, I cannot deduce the original appearance of the story.",
    ["<P_Heart>（蒂亚的灵兴奋地漂浮在火炉前）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Tia's spirit floats excitedly in front of the furnace) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（蒙特利在这儿自吹自擂半天，到底吃不吃饭了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Monterey has been bragging here for ages; are we going to eat or not?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虔诚）</>“愚者”先生，我是为了神话织茧而来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pious) </> Mr. \"The Fool,\" I have come for the Mythical Cocoon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（虔诚）</>愚者先生，我是为了神话织茧而来。"] = "<P_Heart>(Pious)</> Mr. Fool, I have come for the Mythical Cocoon.",
    ["<P_Heart>（虚弱地呢喃）</>唔……结束了吗？如此恐怖又如此神奇，要把这一切，都记下来。"] = "<P_Heart>(Murmurs weakly)</> Ugh... is it over? So terrifying yet so miraculous. I must write all of this down.",
    ["<P_Heart>（虚弱地睁眼）</>是你……你怎么来了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Opens eyes weakly) </> It's you... how did you come here...",
    ["<P_Heart>（虚弱微笑）</>真……有天赋。"] = "<P_Heart> (Weak smile) </> Truly... gifted.",
    ["<P_Heart>（虚弱）</>你是小丑吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Weak) </> Are you a Clown?",
    ["<P_Heart>（虚弱）</>有人吗？"] = "{<P_Heart>} (Weakness) {</> Is anyone there?",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然之前有听说过官方非凡者失控的情况，但真正遇到还是第一次，而且失控的还是代罚者，该怎么处理？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Although I have heard of official Beyonders losing control, this is the first time I've encountered it, and it's a Punisher. How should I handle this?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然依旧疯，但至少疯得很平静。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Although still insane, at least it's a calm insanity.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然我有办法直接进入房间，但最好还是不要让他们看到。得支开他们。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Although I have a way to enter the room directly, it's best not to let them see. I need to get them away.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然暂时没有危险，但也不像恶作剧那么简单。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Although there is no immediate danger, it's not as simple as a prank.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然梅丽莎和班森不在家，但还是要记得反锁房门。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Although Melissa and Benson aren't home, I must remember to lock the door.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然达到了效果，怎么感觉跟预想的不太一样。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Although it achieved the effect, why does it feel different from what I expected?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（虽然这书看着也不怎么靠谱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Although this book doesn't look very reliable either...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（街边，一辆雇佣马车旁，男女乘客的交谈声隐约传来。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (By the roadside, near a hired carriage, the voices of male and female passengers can be heard faintly.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（表情僵硬）</>……谁告诉你的？"] = "<P_Heart>(Expression stiffens)</> ...Who told you that?",
    ["<P_Heart>（表情柔和）</>没错，她很特别。"] = "<P_Heart>(Expression softens)</> That's right, she is very special.",
    ["<P_Heart>（装满了的酒桶，桶栓看起来很久没有打开过了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(A full wine barrel; the tap looks like it hasn't been opened in a long time.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（要不要去和她讲话呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Should I go and talk to her...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（要不要调查一下？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Should I investigate?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（要是能打一个响指，就奇迹般地清理干净就好了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If I could snap my fingers and have it miraculously cleaned, that would be great.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（角落里有暗红色的气场，不像邪灵，反而像是……活人的星灵体？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There's a dark red aura in the corner. It doesn't look like an evil spirit, but rather like... a living person's Astral Projection?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（警察徽章……或许能帮我进入地下市场？找酒吧老板</><P_Yellow>斯维因</><P_Heart>，伪装警官？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Police badge... perhaps it can help me enter the underground market? Find the bar owner </><P_Yellow> Swain </><P_Heart>, disguise as a police officer?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（警惕环顾，发现没有变化）</>……如果真是邪神，好像也不是很强……"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking around vigilantly, finding no changes) </> ...If it really is an Evil God, it doesn't seem very strong...",
    ["<P_Heart>（警惕）</>你是那张塔罗牌？是你在说话？"] = "<P_Heart>(Vigilant)</> Are you that Tarot card? Is it you speaking?",
    ["<P_Heart>（警惕）</>你要干什么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Alert) </> What are you doing?",
    ["<P_Heart>（警惕）</>您问这个干什么？他虽然好吃懒做神神秘秘，但他是个好人……"] = "<P_Heart> (vigilant) </> Why are you asking this? Although he is lazy and mysterious, he is a good person...",
    ["<P_Heart>（警觉）</>你想干什么？"] = "<P_Heart> (Alert) </> What do you want?",
    ["<P_Heart>（警觉）</>那它的副作用是……"] = "<P_Heart>(Alert)</> Then what is its side effect...",
    ["<P_Heart>（认真地）</>对。我爱她胜过一切。她也会蹭我的手，会在我难过的时候趴在我膝盖上。我想知道我们的感情有没有未来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Seriously) </> Yes. I love her more than anything. She rubs against my hand and lies on my lap when I'm sad. I want to know if our relationship has a future.",
    ["<P_Heart>（认真）</>桑娜老师，请你教教我这个单纯但勤奋的同学吧！"] = "<P_Heart> (Earnest) </> Teacher Sanna, please teach this simple but diligent classmate of mine!",
    ["<P_Heart>（讥讽）</>留着你的口才，等着为我惊叹吧。我会一直在这里等待提问，直到真相指引我的道路。"] = "<P_Heart>(Mockery)</> Save your eloquence and wait to be amazed by me. I will stay here waiting for questions until the truth guides my path.",
    ["<P_Heart>（让他得到教训，停止他的花心。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Teach him a lesson and put an end to his philandering.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（让他结束其中一段关系，造福三个人。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let him end one of the relationships, benefiting three people.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（让小孩子管理工厂 ，这位老厂主真是自信又大胆……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Letting a child manage a factory, this old factory owner is truly confident and bold...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（让我想想，在纸条上写下要占卜的事情，“《大冒险家》初版错印珍本的下落”，然后入睡……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let me think, write down what I want to divine on a slip of paper, \"The whereabouts of the first edition misprinted rare copy of 'The Great Adventurer',\" then go to sleep...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（让我看看，他双手抱头，下巴埋在膝盖里，像是在抗拒外界。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Let me see, he is holding his head with both hands, chin buried in his knees, as if resisting the outside world.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（诊费好贵啊，快点治好吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The consultation fee is so expensive, hope I get better soon.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（试试戏法大师的拿手好戏——摔倒术。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Try the Magician's specialty—the Falling Technique.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（诚实）</>在非凡世界，轻易相信一个未知存在是危险的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Honestly)</> In the Extraordinary world, easily trusting an unknown existence is dangerous.",
    ["<P_Heart>（诚恳）</>你要不要去报个歌唱班？我认识一个老师，教得挺好的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sincere) </> Would you like to sign up for a singing class? I know a teacher who teaches quite well.",
    ["<P_Heart>（该怎么把卡门从墙上弄下来呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (How can I get Carmen down from the wall?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（该用什么办法把卡门从墙里弄出来呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What method should I use to get Carmen out of the wall?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（诧异）</>什么？"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> What?",
    ["<P_Heart>（诧异）</>她就是菲丽丝？！"] = "<P_Heart>(Surprised)</> She is Phyllis?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（诧异）</>没错，珍妮……这位{{先生|女士}}，您知道小珍妮？"] = "<P_Heart> (Surprised) </> That's right, Jenny... This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, do you know little Jenny?",
    ["<P_Heart>（语无伦次）</>那、那边有个怪物，被他碰到的东西，也、也会变成怪物。不、不要过来啊——"] = "<P_Heart>(Incoherent)</> Th-there's a monster over there, things touched by him w-will also turn into monsters. D-don't come over—",
    ["<P_Heart>（语气变重）</>如果我告诉她“拒绝改变、无法新生”，她今晚就会走进这片湖。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tone becomes heavy) </> If I had told her \"refusing change, unable to be reborn,\" she would have walked into this lake tonight.",
    ["<P_Heart>（说明情况）</>事情就是这样……"] = "<P_Heart>(Explain the situation)</>That is how things are...",
    ["<P_Heart>（说明情况）</>会长……我的内心指引我这样做，但那三位遇难的人……"] = "<P_Heart>(Explain the situation)</>President... My inner guidance led me to do this, but those three people who met with disaster...",
    ["<P_Heart>（说明情况）</>会长……我的原则和理性指引我这样做。但那三位遇难的人……"] = "<P_Heart>(Explain the situation)</>President... My principles and rationality led me to do this. But those three people who met with disaster...",
    ["<P_Heart>（诶，这就走了？斯嘉丽到底怎么了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Eh, leaving already? What happened to Scarlett?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（请普通人离开，再做更深入的调查吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Please, ordinary people, leave so I can conduct a more thorough investigation.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（读出声）</> 有参加慈善拍卖会的老实人透露，质检公司老板的怀表足够换二十套安全阀！"] = "<P_Heart> (Read aloud) </> An honest man who attended the charity auction revealed that the quality inspection company boss's pocket watch is enough to trade for twenty sets of safety valves!",
    ["<P_Heart>（谁在说话？似乎是头顶传来的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Who is talking? It seems to be coming from above...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（谨慎地尝了一口）</>呕——！"] = "<P_Heart> (Tastes it cautiously) </> Ugh—!",
    ["<P_Heart>（谨慎起见，观察一下周围吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (For the sake of caution, let's observe the surroundings.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（贝克……猎龙帮……之前的账还没算……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Baker... Dragon Hunter Gang... the previous debt hasn't been settled yet...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（贝尔纳黛殿下，我知道了霍纳奇斯山脉更东边是鲁恩王国，还不知道迷雾海的更西边是哪里。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Your Highness Bernadette, I know that east of the Hornacis Mountain Range is the Loen Kingdom, but I don't know where it is further west than the Fog Sea.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（赛拉如果回不来，就不能帮她实现生日愿望了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (If Serra can't come back, she won't be able to help her fulfill her birthday wish.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（赛琳娜大概率是向邪恶的存在祈祷，这样下去她会变成恶灵，在场的所有人都有危险……最好立刻进行中断仪式。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Selena is most likely praying to an evil existence. If this continues, she will turn into an evil spirit, and everyone present will be in danger... It's best to perform an interrupted ritual immediately.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（赛琳娜的脸色是有点不对，用灵视查看一下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Selena's expression is a bit off, let me check with spirit vision.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（赞美愚者！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Praise the Fool!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（走上前）</>逆位死神。"] = "<P_Heart> (Steps forward) </> Death, reversed.",
    ["<P_Heart>（走之前，跟班森打声招呼。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Before I leave, I should say hello to Benson.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（跑酷玩法预留处）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Reserved for parkour gameplay)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（距离三点还有一段时间，或许可以提前进入灰雾之上。趁这个机会，好好探查下那里！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There is still some time before three o'clock, perhaps I can enter above the gray fog early. Take this opportunity to explore that place properly!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（跟邓恩先生一起上门调查的另一个警察？他果然也是值夜者……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Another policeman who came to investigate with Mr. Dunn? He really is a Nighthawk too...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（蹭了蹭你的手）</>喵呜~"] = "<P_Heart> (Nuzzles your hand) </> Meow~",
    ["<P_Heart>（蹭蹭你）</>呼噜呼噜呼噜——"] = "<P_Heart>(Rubs against you)</> Purr purr purr—",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻叹一声）</>我已经开始犹豫搬到这里是不是一个好选择了……但愿不要影响到茜茜。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs softly) </> I've already started to hesitate whether moving here was a good choice... I hope it won't affect Cici.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻咳一声，耳尖微红）</>夫人…你又不是不知道…"] = "<P_Heart> (Coughs lightly, ear tips slightly red) </> Madam... you know...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻咳）</>能不能不提日记……"] = "<P_Heart>(Coughs lightly)</> Can we not mention the diary...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声呢喃）</>不过，我或许应该先买一双手套。淑女的手不会有这般粗糙。"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering softly) </> Still, perhaps I should buy a pair of gloves first. A lady's hands should not be this rough.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声呢喃）</>你说…我们还有可能继续吗？我…还没准备好……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering softly) </> Tell me... is there still a chance for us? I... I'm not ready yet...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声念出）</>第十三章，《黑夜渐袭》……"] = "<P_Heart> (whispering) </> Chapter Thirteen, 'The Night Approaches'...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>……好些了，谢谢你。"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> ...I feel better now, thank you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>他已经不在了，没能从那场战争中回来，你还记得吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> He is already gone and didn't return from that war. Do you remember?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>制造魔像的能力……来自另一个。"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> The ability to create golems... comes from another one.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>好。路上小心。"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> Good. Be careful on the way.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>好的，赫蒂小姐。"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</>Very well, Miss Hedy.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>您今晚好像有心事？"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> You seem to have something on your mind tonight?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>我想坐在那儿，放牧真正的羊群。白色的，在草地上慢慢走，低着头吃草，偶尔抬头“咩”一声。"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> I want to sit there and herd real sheep. White ones, walking slowly on the grass, heads down eating, occasionally looking up to \"baa\".",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>我能同时把他们俩都干趴下，可惜……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> I could take them both down at the same time, but unfortunately...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>科林……首席他看到了吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> Colin... did the Chief see it?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>艾拉女士，您先上来，我们慢慢说。"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> Ms. Ella, come up first, let's talk about it slowly.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>这种变化成他人容貌的能力，还真是适合隐藏踪迹啊。"] = "<P_Heart> (Softly) </> This ability to change into someone else's appearance is really suitable for hiding tracks.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>这里就是<P_Yellow>玫瑰天堂</>……"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> This is the <P_Yellow>Rose Paradise</>...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>那种滋味，比面对任何恶灵都难受。"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> That feeling is more painful than facing any Evil Spirit.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑一声）</>刚才在浴室那边晃悠的，也是你吧？还有卡座那边……"] = "<P_Heart> (chuckles) </> You were the one loitering by the bathroom earlier, weren't you? And over by the booths...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑一声）</>哼……不要小瞧“工匠”的手艺。"] = "<P_Heart> (chuckles) </> Hmph... don't underestimate the craft of an 'Artisan'.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>习惯了吧。在海上，太讲究规矩的人往往活不长。"] = "<P_Heart>(Chuckles)</> I'm used to it. At sea, people who are too particular about rules often don't live long.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>他们这么说的？"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckles) </> They said that?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>你说那条舌头？"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckles) </> You mean that tongue?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>原来是这件小事，我还以为是一件很重要的事……"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckles) </> So it was just this small matter; I thought it was something very important...",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>所以它才会在你足够强大之后才出现。这说明“愚者”先生认为你已经准备好了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckling) </> That's why it only appeared after you were strong enough. This shows that Mr. Fool believes you are ready.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>所以它才会在你足够强大之后才出现。这说明愚者先生认为你已经准备好了。"] = "<P_Heart>(chuckles softly)</>That's why it only appeared after you became strong enough. It means Mr. Fool believes you're ready.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>真有意思，你总是这样和人说话吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckling) </> How interesting, do you always talk to people like this?",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>累了吧？我一直看着你呢……看着你强撑清醒的样子，真让人，心疼。"] = "<P_Heart>(chuckles softly)</>Tired? I've been watching you... Watching you struggle to stay awake is truly heartbreaking.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>聪明。"] = "<P_Heart> (Chuckles) </> Smart.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>靠实力，也靠运气和勇气。"] = "<P_Heart>(Chuckles)</> By strength, and also by luck and courage.",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是不要翻开了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Better not open it...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是先占卜一下房间内是否危险吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Better use divination to see if the room is dangerous first.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是先去找邓恩先生吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Better go find Mr. Dunn first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是劝劝他吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I should still try to persuade him.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是及时止损吧……）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (Better cut my losses now...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还有一页，好像是大家的留言？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There's another page, it seems to be messages from everyone?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还真会吹嘘……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(He really knows how to brag...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这……是什么意思？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This... what does it mean?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这……这都是什么乱七八糟的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This... what kind of mess is this...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这一切太奇怪了，我什么也想不起来，必须弄清楚。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Everything is so strange. I can't remember anything; I must get to the bottom of this.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这一幕的时间是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The time for this scene is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这一幕的角色是……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The character for this scene is...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这下人赃俱获，该收网了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Now that I've caught him red-handed, it's time to close the net!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这不是常见的豆角和竹笋吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Aren't these just common green beans and bamboo shoots?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这不是真实的理由，库克在隐瞒什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This isn't the real reason, Cook is hiding something...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这两个人竟然是一伙的，演得好一出戏，逼迫心软的旅客买下烛台。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(These two are actually in cahoots, putting on quite a show to force soft-hearted travelers to buy the candlestick.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个世界……似乎到此而已了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This world... seems to end here.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个人在演什么苦情话剧吗……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is this person acting out some kind of melodramatic play...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个兰尔乌斯真是可恶，不仅骗财，还骗色啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This Ince Zangwill is truly despicable; not only did he swindle money, but he also deceived her emotionally.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个名字……是会长？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This name... is the President?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个名字……是院长？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This name... is it the Dean?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个名字我好像在哪听过。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I feel like I've heard this name somewhere before.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个声音……）</>你是那个邮筒？"] = "<P_Heart>(This voice...)</> Are you that mailbox?",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个女人真是……不行，我怎么开始期待接下来会发生什么了？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This woman is really... no, why am I starting to look forward to what happens next?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个感觉是……我消化了部分魔药？为什么……因为我成功扮演了一次占卜家？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This feeling is... did I digest part of the potion? Why... because I successfully acted as a Seer once?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个男子似乎有线索，但不愿意直说，用灵视观察一下……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This man seems to have clues, but is unwilling to say it directly, let me observe with spirit vision...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个警察好像是刚刚那个醉汉。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This policeman seems to be the drunkard from earlier.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个警察好像是刚刚那个醉汉）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This policeman seems to be the drunkard from earlier.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这个问题果然来了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This question came after all...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这么任性，这就是“皇帝”吗？现在的因蒂斯好像是共和国了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So capricious, is this what an \"Emperor\" is like? It seems Intis is a republic now.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这么大一片地，就算雇人来清理，也得花上几个月。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Such a large piece of land, even if I hired people to clean it, it would take months.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这么浓的雾，弗莱先生他们在哪呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Such thick fog, where are Mr. Frye and the others?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这么直白地说出来了？不是说鲁恩人都很含蓄吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Did they just say that so directly? Aren't Loen people supposed to be very reserved?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这也是对你推荐的答谢。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This is also a thank you for your recommendation.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这些人好像有些苦恼？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(These people seem a bit troubled?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这些南瓜有古怪，先检查看看。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(These pumpkins are strange, let's check them first.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这些幸福的画面，是不是只是珍妮的想象？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Are these happy scenes just products of Jenny's imagination?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这些是……拉姆齐的画？他是王室的御用画师，罗塞尔大帝的卧房里就挂着他的画……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Are these... Ramsay's paintings? He was the royal court painter, and his paintings hung in Emperor Roselle's bedroom...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位先生在找什么东西吗？要不要搭句话呢。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is this gentleman looking for something? Should I say something?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位先生这是……在向露台上的小姐表达爱意？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is this gentleman... expressing his love to the lady on the balcony?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位小姐真是主动，参与这样的隐秘组织对我们都有利有弊。处在世界不同地方的人，在这片灰雾空间里交流信息……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This lady is really proactive. Participating in such a secret organization has both pros and cons for us. People from different parts of the world exchanging information in this gray fog space...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位小姐真是主动，参与隐秘组织有利有弊……但或许可以从中找到回家的线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This lady is really proactive. Participating in a secret organization has its pros and cons... but perhaps I can find clues to get home from this.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位才认识的{{先生|女士}}从刚才起就一直看着我，莫非——）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This {{ Mr.| Ms.}} I just met has been looking at me since just now, could it be—) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位母亲陷入了长久的沉默之中，似乎在思索该怎样说出让全世界都能理解并赞同的话语。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This mother fell into a long silence, seemingly pondering how to say something that the whole world could understand and agree with.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位演员好像一台感谢机器……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This actor seems like a gratitude machine...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这叫什么，穿越之我在隐秘组织当Boss？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What is this, 'Transmigration: I'm a Boss in a Secret Organization'?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这和几个隐秘组织信奉的真实造物主有点像，但又有很大的不同……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This is somewhat similar to the True Creator worshipped by several secret organizations, but there are also significant differences...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这场战争似乎无法简单地讨论胜利与否……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This war seems impossible to discuss simply in terms of victory or defeat...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这声音好耳熟……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This voice sounds so familiar...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这声音是……有人在求救？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This voice is... someone calling for help?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这太糟糕了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This is terrible...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这女孩怎么不讲讲价……）</>太贵了！毕竟它看起来距离真正的护身符还很遥远。"] = "<P_Heart> (Why doesn't this girl haggle...) </> Too expensive! After all, it looks like it's still a long way from being a real amulet.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这孩子似乎被人利用了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This child seems to be being used by someone.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这家伙……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This guy...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这家伙好像撞到了路边的花盆……看起来迷迷糊糊的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This guy seems to have bumped into a roadside flowerpot... He looks all dazed.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这家伙虽然平时很随意，但真正做起事情来还挺靠谱的嘛。根据他的描述尝试下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This guy is usually very casual, but he's actually quite reliable when it comes to real work. Let's try it based on his description.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这就是那些痕迹……过去看看。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (These are the traces... let's go check it out.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这应该是个扮演歌颂者的好机会，试试安抚这位女士的情绪吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This should be a good opportunity to act as a Bard, let's try to pacify this lady's emotions.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这张牌在努力通过有限的回答向我透露更多信息，似乎也和它想要逃离这里的愿望相符……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This card is trying hard to reveal more information to me through limited answers, which also seems to align with its desire to escape from here...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是……乐队？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is this... a band?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是……信使？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This is... a messenger?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是……静夜思？咳咳，大帝怎么逮着一个人薅啊……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is this... Quiet Night Thought? Ahem, why does the Emperor keep picking on one person...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是什么问题……不对，“正义”的情绪有点慌乱，难道她干出了类似的蠢事？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What kind of question is this... No, Justice's emotions are a bit flustered. Could it be that she did something foolish like that?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是在吵什么？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(What are they arguing about?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是在讨论什么呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (What are they discussing?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是我从灵感启示里看到的男人，他是从棺材里醒来的吗？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This is the man I saw in the inspiration revelation. Did he wake up from a coffin?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这是这么艰难的选择？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is this such a difficult choice?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这样……圆润的头型，实在是说不出安慰的话啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Such... a round head shape, I really can't find words of comfort.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这椅子坐不下这么多人！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This chair can't fit so many people!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这片草地真不错，就在这野餐吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This meadow is lovely, let's have a picnic here.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这看起来像是某种仪式）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This looks like some kind of ritual)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这种人不教训一下，看来是不会长记性了。）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (If this kind of person isn't taught a lesson, it seems he won't learn.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这种情况更适合用星盘占卜，但今天没带星盘，只能用灵摆占卜了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This situation is more suitable for astrolabe divination, but I didn't bring an astrolabe today, so I can only use pendulum divination.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这种时候她没有出手，应该就是还没有危险。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(She didn't make a move at this time, so there shouldn't be any danger yet.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这类事件确实不能让普通市民们知道，不过，老师们会不会听说过那本笔记？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Such events really shouldn't be known by ordinary citizens, but I wonder if the teachers have heard of that notebook?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这绝对不能告诉他！但是占卜已经显示这样的结果了，我该怎么办……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This absolutely cannot be told to him! But the divination has already shown such a result, what should I do...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这群小猫似乎正在发生争执，它们战斗的身姿似乎藏着什么秘密）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This group of kittens seems to be fighting, their fighting postures seem to hide some secret.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这股花香不对劲！不能吸进去！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This floral scent is wrong! I mustn't inhale it!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这酬金来得太及时了，幸好队长没忘记！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This reward came just in time; fortunately, the captain didn't forget!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里不简单，得小心行事。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Things aren't simple here, I must be careful.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里不适合休息，还是换个地方吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This isn't a good place to rest, I should find somewhere else...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里似乎在讨论什么，凑近听听。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It seems like they are discussing something here; let me get closer and listen.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里似乎有一位刚遭遇不幸的人。听听在说什么……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There seems to be someone here who just encountered misfortune. Let's hear what they're saying...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里是……一座墓葬？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is this... a tomb?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里是睡莲小镇，但花摊里好像……没有睡莲？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (This is Water Lily Town, but there don't seem to be... any water lilies at the flower stall?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里曾是拉姆德男爵的领土，核心建筑便是这座以家族命名的古堡。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This was once the territory of Baron Lamud, and the core building is this castle named after the Family.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里残留的非凡特性都被我清理干净了，伊琳不会再遇到危险。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I've cleaned up the remaining Beyonder characteristic here; Irene won't encounter any more danger.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里的人提起死亡，就像在说今天的天气一样稀松平常……是永暗蜡烛影响的吗？ ）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The people here mention death as casually as if they were talking about today's weather... Is this the influence of the Eternal Darkness candle?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里跟梦中那个湖一模一样……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This place is exactly the same as the lake in the dream...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（进行情绪暗示）</>你本是尘土，仍要归于尘土。"] = "<P_Heart>(Performing emotional suggestion)</> You are dust, and to dust you shall return.",
    ["<P_Heart>（进行情绪暗示）</>所有动物一律平等，但有些动物比其他动物更加平等。"] = "<P_Heart> (Perform emotional suggestion) </> All animals are equal, but some animals are more equal than others.",
    ["<P_Heart>（进行情绪暗示）</>没事的，这一切终将过去。"] = "<P_Heart>(Performing emotional suggestion)</> It's okay, all of this will pass.",
    ["<P_Heart>（连声感谢）</>多谢多谢！"] = "<P_Heart>(Repeatedly expresses gratitude)</> Thank you, thank you!",
    ["<P_Heart>（连牌的数量都不对了啊！自求多福吧……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The number of cards is wrong too! Good luck to you...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（迷恋）</>您……您是银月公爵吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Infatuated) </> Are... are you the Duke of Silver Moon?",
    ["<P_Heart>（迷茫）</>那别人呢？邻居的狗呢？"] = "<P_Heart> (Confused) </> Then what about others? The neighbor's dog?",
    ["<P_Heart>（迷蒙）</>叽里咕噜说什么呢，我的威士忌呢？我的挚爱，我的兄弟——"] = "<P_Heart>(Dazed)</> What are you mumbling about? Where's my whiskey? My beloved, my brother—",
    ["<P_Heart>（迷迷糊糊）</>别管我，让我醉到天亮……反正……反正同学会把我抬回去的……"] = "<P_Heart> (Dazed) </> Leave me alone, let me get drunk until dawn... anyway... anyway, my classmates will carry me back...",
    ["<P_Heart>（迷迷糊糊）</>时代……"] = "<P_Heart>(Dazed)</> Era...",
    ["<P_Heart>（逐渐亢奋）</>知识！知识！更好的时代！"] = "<P_Heart>(Becoming increasingly excited)</> Knowledge! Knowledge! A better era!",
    ["<P_Heart>（递出20特里尔）</>买一张。"] = "<P_Heart> (hands over 20 Trier) </> Buy one.",
    ["<P_Heart>（递出一颗金色子弹）</>这是从那家伙身上找到的。"] = "<P_Heart> (Handing over a golden bullet) </> This was found on that guy.",
    ["<P_Heart>（递出）</>这个就是你丢的旅行符咒吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (hands it over) </> Is this the travel charm you lost?",
    ["<P_Heart>（递过小纸条）</>……今天有同事调查到了金狼的行踪。"] = "<P_Heart> (Passing a small note) </>... A colleague investigated the Golden Wolf's whereabouts today.",
    ["<P_Heart>（递过小纸条）</>……从一名同事的尸体上搜到的。"] = "<P_Heart>(Hands over a small note)</>... Found it on the corpse of a colleague.",
    ["<P_Heart>（递过来一张纸）</>警局在戒严，这是议院治安队的内部通知。"] = "<P_Heart>(Handing over a piece of paper)</> The police station is under martial law. This is an internal notice from the Parliament Security Force.",
    ["<P_Heart>（速写本上还真是什么都有……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There really is everything in this sketchbook...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（造物主？真实造物主？不少隐秘组织确实尊崇这位古老存在。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Creator? True Creator? Many secret organizations do indeed revere this ancient existence.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（遗憾）</>以后我们都喝不到“焦糖炸弹”了吗？"] = "<P_Heart> (Regretful) </> Will we never be able to drink 'Caramel Bomb' again?",
    ["<P_Heart>（那个小女孩是伊琳……？我先站远点观察一下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Is that little girl Irene...? I'll stand further away and observe for a moment.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那个红色的月亮！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That red moon!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那位疑似穿越者前辈的罗塞尔大帝？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That Emperor Roselle who is a suspected transmigrator predecessor?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那只老鼠，是非凡者！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (That rat is a Beyonder!) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那座残破的石像？而且……这里怎么会有花呢？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That broken stone statue? And... how could there be flowers here?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那我能从他的日记里获得一些珍贵隐秘的信息，甚至回家的线索……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Then I might be able to obtain some precious and secret information from his diary, or even clues to go home...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那是……托马斯神父？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is that... Father Thomas?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那是……珠宝店的爱丽丝？不知道他们和猎龙帮之间的问题怎么样了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is that... Alice from the jewelry store? I wonder how things are going between them and the Dragon Hunter Gang.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那种被注视的感觉没有消失，非凡者能跑的比马车还快？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That feeling of being watched hasn't disappeared. Can a Beyonder run faster than a carriage?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那边好像有一对新婚的夫妻，过去看看吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (There seems to be a newlywed couple over there, let's go take a look.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（那边的是……）</>你是谁？为什么在这里？"] = "<P_Heart>(Who is that over there...)</> Who are you? Why are you here?",
    ["<P_Heart>（那边的霍普医生，看上去有些烦恼？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Dr. Hope over there, does he look a bit troubled?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（醉醺醺）</>你刚才明明在那！怎么一眨眼跑这儿来了？ "] = "<P_Heart>(Drunkenly)</> You were clearly right there just now! How did you run over here in the blink of an eye?",
    ["<P_Heart>（醉醺醺）</>我今天，偏要把你打扁！"] = "<P_Heart> (Drunkenly)</> Today, I am determined to beat you flat!",
    ["<P_Heart>（醉醺醺）</>猎龙帮！猎……龙！你来当老大！"] = "<P_Heart> (Drunkenly) </> Dragon Hunter Gang! Dragon... Hunter! You be the boss!",
    ["<P_Heart>（醒悟）</>对呀！我没死，我怎么会以为自己死了！我自由了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Realization)</> That's right! I didn't die, how could I have thought I was dead! I'm free!",
    ["<P_Heart>（释然）</> ……原来是这样。  我以为我失约了，我以为时间把我丢在了路上。但它没有，它只是替我走完了另一段路。 "] = "<P_Heart>(Relieved)</> ...So that's how it is. I thought I had broken my promise, I thought time had left me behind on the road. But it didn't; it just walked another path for me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（金秋湖的风险看起来更小。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The risk at Golden Autumn Lake seems smaller.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（铁十字街真热闹，去其他地方逛逛吧。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Iron Cross Street is really lively, let's go visit other places.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（门上锁了……我怎么进去比较好呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The door is locked... what's the best way for me to get in...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（门上锁了……看来我不得不做些暴力拆解工作。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The door is locked... looks like I'll have to resort to some forceful measures.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（门上锁了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The door is locked...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（闭上眼）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Closing eyes) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（问得好！我也想知道答案……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Good question! I also want to know the answer...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（闻到的？那珍妮或许从没吃过真正的烧鹅……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(She smelled it? Perhaps Jenny has never actually eaten real roast goose...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（队长他们……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Captain and the others...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（队长好像记性不太好……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Captain doesn't seem to have a very good memory...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿兹克先生也不知道。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Mr. Azik doesn't know either.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿兹克先生竟然能将我也带入冥界，他的非凡层次恐怕远在半神之上。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Mr. Azik was actually able to bring me into the Underworld; his Beyonder level must be far beyond a Demigod.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿罗德斯大人好严苛……但它不会说话，还要“正义”女士代劳，真是非凡啊……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Lord Arrodes is so strict... but it can't speak and has to have Ms. Justice act as its mouthpiece; how truly extraordinary...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿罗德斯说可以讨价还价，用灵视观察摊主的情绪……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Arrodes said we can bargain, use spirit vision to observe the stall owner's emotions...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（陌生的森林、突然消失的女孩、脑子里的另一个声音……这一切都太诡异了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Strange forest, a girl who suddenly disappeared, another voice in my head... everything is just too eerie...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（院长居然是因蒂斯的皇长女？是罗塞尔大帝的亲女儿？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(To think the Dean is the eldest princess of Intis? Emperor Roselle's own daughter?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（院长说过，会一直守着我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Dean said she would always watch over me.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（陶醉）</>啊……您凶起来的样子，更让人心动了！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Enraptured) </> Ah... the way you look when you're fierce is even more heart-fluttering!",
    ["<P_Heart>（难不成真闹鬼了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could it really be haunted...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难不成，我需要扮演占卜家？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could it be that I need to act as a Seer?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难以形容的音乐声……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Indescribable music...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难怪塔芒先生不让他出师……）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (No wonder Mr. Tamang won't let him graduate...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道……？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could it be...?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道她和侠盗黑皇帝早就相识？一直在等对方带自己脱离苦海？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could it be that she and the Phantom Thief Black Emperor have known each other for a long time? And has been waiting for him to take her out of the sea of misery?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道是《婚礼进行曲》太复杂了？让艾伯特换个简单点的试试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Could the 'Wedding March' be too complex? Let Albert try something simpler.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道是驯兽师？或者其他能与动物沟通的非凡者？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could she be a Beast Tamer? Or another Beyonder who can communicate with animals?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道有非凡力量参与？追上去看看！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could there be Beyonder powers involved? Let's follow it and see!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道案件背后还涉及隐秘组织……有必要向队长汇报。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could it be that a secret organization is involved behind the case... it's necessary to report to the Captain.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道说……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Could it be...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（需要潜入？佛尔思女士借给我的莱埃诺笔记中，灵体之线的能力或许可以派上用场，我可以试试用它操控</><P_Yellow>老鼠</><P_Heart>进去制造混乱……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Need to sneak in? The spirit body threads ability in the Leano notes that Ms. Fors lent me might come in handy. I can try to use it to control </> <P_Yellow> mice </> <P_Heart> to go in and create chaos...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</> 你……是告解室？！<P_Heart>（左右张望）</> 神职人员呢？"] = "<P_Heart> (Shocked) </> You... are the confessional?! <P_Heart> (Looking left and right) </> Where is the clergyman?",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>不、不可能……已经过去七十年了？老查克和小柯莱…… 他们已经…… "] = "<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> No, impossible... seventy years have passed? Old Chuck and Little Colley... They have already...",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>你怎么知道？你跟踪我，想撬走我的生意？"] = "<P_Heart> (shocked) </> How do you know? Are you stalking me, trying to steal my business?",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>你是那个顾客？！那你怎么会被困在这个塔罗牌里……"] = "<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> You are that customer?! Then how could you be trapped in this Tarot card...",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>啊！！！<P_Heart>（他、他会在一周后杀了我……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> Ah!!! <P_Heart>(He, he will kill me in a week...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>这……这是蒙特利？！"] = "<P_Heart> (Shocked) </> This... is this Monterey?!",
    ["<P_Heart>（震撼）</>追逐了这么多年，终于……见到了……"] = "<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> After chasing for so many years, finally... I've seen it...",
    ["<P_Heart>（霍普医生不是第一次被病人示爱？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Is this not the first time Dr. Hope has been confessed to by a patient?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（露出“我都懂”的笑容）</>好吧，那你记得转告你那位朋友。"] = "<P_Heart> (shows an 'I understand' smile) </> Alright, then remember to tell your friend.",
    ["<P_Heart>（露出笑容）</>好多了。能下床走动了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Much better. She can get out of bed and walk around.",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡世界对普通人来说，太危险了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The Extraordinary World is too dangerous for ordinary people.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡世界里，所做的一切选择都要付出相应的代价……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(In the Beyonder world, every choice made comes with a corresponding price...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡交易？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Beyonder trade?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（靠近宝箱时，你隐约听见周围的草丛里传来一声粗重的喘息。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (When you approach the treasure chest, you vaguely hear a heavy panting coming from the surrounding grass.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（面无表情）</>种地。"] = "<P_Heart>(Expressionless)</> Farming.",
    ["<P_Heart>（面色潮红）</>我就能独占吸血鬼大人了！"] = "<P_Heart>(Flushed)</> Then I can have Lord Vampire all to myself!",
    ["<P_Heart>（韦尔奇……记忆零乱又破碎，但我记得他们……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Welch... my memories are messy and fragmented, but I remember them...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（顺时针、小幅度旋转……有较低的风险，可以行动。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Clockwise, small rotation... there's a low risk, I can proceed.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（顺着手指的方向看过去）</>那边……铁轨上？"] = "<P_Heart>(Looks in the direction of the finger)</> Over there... on the tracks?",
    ["<P_Heart>（顿了顿）</>对了，我最近总做梦，老伙计。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pausing) </> By the way, I've been having dreams lately, old pal.",
    ["<P_Heart>（顿了顿）</>我可以教你什么是好的占卜师。跟我来。"] = "<P_Heart> (Pauses) </> I can teach you what a good diviner is. Follow me.",
    ["<P_Heart>（颤声）</> 我……我要忏悔，我听到了好多好多人的秘密。忍不住都想说出来……"] = "<P_Heart> (Trembling voice) </> I... I want to repent, I've heard so, so many people's secrets. I can't help but want to say them all out...",
    ["<P_Heart>（颤抖）</>你们……还和当年一样……"] = "<P_Heart> (Trembling) </> You... you are the same as you were back then...",
    ["<P_Heart>（颤抖）</>你确定吗，巫师{{先生|女士}}，他刚刚还在发光。"] = "<P_Heart>(Trembling)</> Are you sure, Wizard {{ Mr. | Ms. }}? He was just glowing a moment ago.",
    ["<P_Heart>（马洛没有反应，难道只有我能看到？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Marlow isn't reacting. Could it be that only I can see it?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（骄傲）</>那我来读小萨拉的信。"] = "<P_Heart>(Proudly)</> Then I will read little Sarah's letter.",
    ["<P_Heart>（高兴）</>也祝你发财，{{先生|女士}}！"] = "<P_Heart> (happily) </> I wish you wealth too, {{Mr.|Ms.}}!",
    ["<P_Heart>（高兴）</>我记得你，你帮过我的忙，因为猎龙帮抢我的票……哎呦……"] = "<P_Heart> (Happy) </> I remember you, you helped me out because the Dragon Hunter Gang snatched my ticket... ouch...",
    ["<P_Heart>（魔药的关键不是掌握和挖掘，而是消化和扮演……是什么意思？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The key to a potion is not mastering and digging, but digestion and acting... what does that mean?)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（黑荆棘安保公司附近……需要向值夜者们求助，但这有可能让我主动暴露。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Near Blackthorn Security Company... need to ask the Nighthawks for help, but this might expose me.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（黛西？还有一个黛西？！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Daisy? There's another Daisy?!)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（黯然）</>算了，老身在这里快五百年了……再等还不知要多久。年轻人，在附近的林子里，应该有不少像我一样的“石像”吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (despondent) </> Forget it, I've been here for nearly five hundred years... I don't know how much longer I'd have to wait. Young man, there should be many 'stone statues' like me in the nearby forest.",
    ["<P_Heart>（鼓掌）</>做得不赖。"] = "<P_Heart>(Claps)</> Not bad.",
    ["<P_Heart>（（我想起来了，他是泰瑞）</>你又被猎龙帮欺负了？"] = "<P_Heart>（(I remember now, he is Terry)）</>Were you bullied by the Dragon Hunting Gang again?",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：所有灵性力量的母亲……</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': The mother of all spiritual powers...</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：泥尘之城 献予红月</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': City of mud and dust, offered to the red moon</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：独一无二的红月……生命与美丽的象征……</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': The unique red moon... a symbol of life and beauty...</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：生命与美丽的象征……</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': A symbol of life and beauty...</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：血肉之躯 祭予永恒</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': Flesh and blood, sacrificed to eternity</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：颂母之名 诞育新生</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': Praise the mother's name, give birth to new life</>",
    ["<P_Red>“教授”：颂母之名 诞育神嗣</>"] = "<P_Red>'Professor': Praise the Mother's name, give birth to the divine offspring</>",
    ["<P_Red>“母亲”</>"] = "<P_Red> \"Mother\"</>",
    ["<P_Red>你翻开了笔记……</>"] = "<P_Red>You open the notebook...</>",
    ["<P_Red>所有灵性力量的母亲……</>"] = "<P_Red>The mother of all spiritual powers...</>",
    ["<P_Red>独一无二的红月……</>"] = "<P_Red> The one and only Red Moon... </>",
    ["<P_Red>生命与美丽的象征……</>"] = "<P_Red>A symbol of life and beauty...</>",
    ["<P_Title><Blackthorn reception></>Rozanne：那是我们前任队长的烟斗，他已经牺牲快五年了……"] = "<P_Title><Blackthorn reception></>Rozanne: That was our former captain's pipe. He died nearly five years ago...",
    ["<P_Title><Blackthorn reception></>Rozanne：顺便给你准备了入职大礼包，待会儿打开看看吧。"] = "<P_Title><Blackthorn reception></>Rozanne: I also prepared a welcome package for you. Open it later and have a look.",
    ["<P_Yellow>{{PlayerName}}</> 吸收了遗落星光，尽快运送到星光烛台储存，否则会被管家吸收"] = "<P_Yellow>{{PlayerName}}</> Absorbed the lost starlight, transport it to the starlight candlestick for storage as soon as possible, otherwise it will be absorbed by the butler",
    ["<P_Yellow>——“这里埋葬着初代拉姆德男爵的长子，一位骑士，一位无惧死亡的勇者。”</>"] = "<P_Yellow>—\"Here lies the eldest son of the first Baron Lamud, a knight, a brave man who feared no death.\"</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>“不要打开！”</>……<P_Yellow>“不要打开！”</>……<P_Yellow>“不要打开！”</>……"] = "<P_Yellow>\"Don't open it!\"</>...<P_Yellow>\"Don't open it!\"</>...<P_Yellow>\"Don't open it!\"</>...",
    ["<P_Yellow>“堕落母神”</>过于强大，哪怕只是新生者梦中残存的部分污染……"] = "The <P_Yellow>Mother Goddess of Depravity</> is too powerful, even if it is just the residual corruption in the Newborn's dream...",
    ["<P_Yellow>“我们是守护者，也是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。”</>"] = "<P_Yellow>\"We are guardians, but also a group of poor wretches who are constantly fighting against danger and madness.\"</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>“星星”先生</>会指引你加入其中一个组织，方便保护你。"] = "<P_Yellow> Mr. Star </> will guide you to join one of the organizations to make it easier to protect you.",
    ["<P_Yellow>“月亮仆从”的核心成员</>\n代号“教授”，真实身份不详，下落不明，疑似整个献祭计划的策划者。\n代号“夫人”，五月庄园主人，收尸人途径序列4，主持献祭与新生仪式。\n代号“管家”，窥秘人途径序列5，知识皇冠的直接持有者。\n代号“风信子”……\n代号“蒲公英”……"] = "<P_Yellow>Core members of the \"Moon Servants\"</>\nCodename \"Professor\", real identity unknown, whereabouts unknown, suspected to be the mastermind behind the entire sacrificial plan.\nCodename \"Viscountess\", owner of May Manor, Sequence 4 of the Corpse Collector pathway, presides over the sacrifice and rebirth rituals.\nCodename \"Butler\", Sequence 5 of the Mystery Pryer pathway, direct holder of the Knowledge Crown.\nCodename \"Hyacinth\"...\nCodename \"Dandelion\"...",
    ["<P_Yellow>“翻开笔记。”</>"] = "<P_Yellow> \"Open the notebook.\"</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>“这是梦，噩梦在重复，逃出去！”</>"] = "<P_Yellow>\"This is a dream, the nightmare is repeating, escape!\"</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>……我祈求女神的力量……我期待黑夜的眷顾……</>"] = "<P_Yellow>...I pray for the Goddess's power... I look forward to the Night's favor...</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>《美女与野兽》</>？看署名，这也是罗塞尔大帝的作品……"] = "<P_Yellow>\"Beauty and the Beast\"</>? Looking at the signature, this is also a work by Emperor Roselle...",
    ["<P_Yellow>【获得玩偶小羊】</>"] = "<P_Yellow>【Obtained Doll Lamb】</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>【获得红月牌】</>"] = "<P_Yellow>【Obtained Red Moon Card】</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>【获得羊皮纸】</>"] = "<P_Yellow>【Obtained Parchment】</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>三项漫游</>已经列在您的<P_Yellow>任务栏</>了，具体的细节已为您备忘。愿您旅途顺利，有所发现。 "] = "<P_Yellow> Three items of Roaming </> have been listed in your <P_Yellow> Quest </> bar, and the specific details have been noted for you. May your journey go smoothly and may you have discoveries.",
    ["<P_Yellow>两点五十五分</>，我在餐厅整理银器。那时夫人正在和老爷争吵……我本该去劝一劝，但老爷最近脾气很差，不想和任何人交流。"] = "At <P_Yellow>two fifty-five</>, I was in the dining room organizing the silverware. At that time, the Madam was arguing with the Master... I should have gone to persuade them, but the Master has been in a bad temper lately and didn't want to communicate with anyone.",
    ["<P_Yellow>五月庄园，高薪短工</>\n\n<P_Yellow>工作职责</> 前往五月庄园简单培训后，修剪苹果树。\n\n<P_Yellow>基本要求</>\n年龄不限，吃苦耐劳，认真负责，接受夜班。\n<P_Yellow>工作时间</>\n每天工作时间不低于14小时，为期两周。\n<P_Yellow>薪资待遇</>\n提供饮食、住宿和工作服，周薪四镑，可预付。"] = "<P_Yellow> May Manor, High-Paying Short-Term Job </>\n\n<P_Yellow> Job Responsibilities </> After simple training at May Manor, prune apple trees. \n\n<P_Yellow> Basic Requirements </>\n No age limit, hardworking, responsible, must accept night shifts. \n<P_Yellow> Working Hours </>\n Working hours no less than 14 hours per day, for a period of two weeks. \n<P_Yellow> Salary and Benefits </>\n Food, accommodation, and work clothes provided, weekly salary of four pounds, can be paid in advance.",
    ["<P_Yellow>他让卫生有进步，他让契约有了法；</>"] = "<P_Yellow>He improved hygiene, he gave laws to contracts;</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>仰望星空派！</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Star-Gazing Pie!</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>你忽然改变了主意</>。\n或许是因为没有得到抚摸许可，或许是因为它太过投入，抑或许只是因为忽然闻到了咖啡豆的味道——温暖、馥郁、让人安心，还有一丝雨后潮湿的风味，那是门外廷根的味道？\n\n好像不那么在意它毛发的触感了。"] = "<P_Yellow>You suddenly changed your mind</>. \nPerhaps it was because you didn't get permission to pet it, perhaps because it was too engrossed, or perhaps it was just because you suddenly smelled the scent of coffee beans—warm, rich, comforting, with a hint of damp wind after the rain; was that the smell of Tingen outside the Door? \n\nYou don't seem to care about the feel of its fur as much anymore.",
    ["<P_Yellow>侦探的助手</>突然冲出人群，挡在了少女身前。"] = "<P_Yellow>The detective's assistant</> suddenly rushed out of the crowd, blocking the girl's path.",
    ["<P_Yellow>侦探的助手</>突然冲出人群，挡在了穿洋装的少女身前。"] = "<P_Yellow>The detective's assistant</> suddenly rushed out of the crowd and blocked the path in front of the young lady in the Western-style dress.",
    ["<P_Yellow>别进来。</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Don't come in.</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>占卜</>……她是神秘学爱好者？"] = "<P_Yellow>Divination</>... Is she an occult enthusiast?",
    ["<P_Yellow>占卜家</>俱乐部……"] = "The <P_Yellow>Seer</> Club...",
    ["<P_Yellow>可罗塞尔大帝不一样，他看见人们的困难与彷徨——</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Emperor Roselle is different; he sees the hardships and hesitation of the people—</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>右边</>这杯里有不好的事物。"] = "There is something bad in the cup on the <P_Yellow> right </>.",
    ["<P_Yellow>咳咳咳咳咳咳不我什么也没有说！请忘掉吧！</>"] = "<P_Yellow> Cough cough cough cough cough, no, I didn't say anything! Please forget it! </>",
    ["<P_Yellow>失控的非凡者</>非常危险，必须尽快找到她。"] = "<P_Yellow>An out-of-control Beyonder</> is extremely dangerous; we must find her as soon as possible.",
    ["<P_Yellow>威廉靠着铁与火，南方国王捧着谷物；</>"] = "<P_Yellow>William relies on iron and fire, the Southern King holds the grain;</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>安提戈努斯笔记？！</>它居然是海纳斯卖给韦尔奇的，我又在俱乐部遇到海纳斯……"] = "<P_Yellow>The Antigonus family notebook?!</> It was Haines who sold it to Welch, and now I've run into Haines at the club...",
    ["<P_Yellow>密级</> 机密\n<P_Yellow>报告人</> 伦纳德·米切尔\n<P_Yellow>日期</> 1354年7月\n\n<P_Yellow>事件概述</>\n自1354年6月起，廷根市接连发生多起市民离奇失踪案件。经黑荆棘安保公司介入调查，确认事件背后存在隐秘的非凡力量干预，最终证实为邪神组织“月亮仆从”策划的大规模献祭仪式，其目标是借助知识皇冠与绝望魔镜，将整座城市献祭于“伟大母亲”（经确认，实为▇▇▇▇的化身），以诞育邪神子嗣。\n\n<P_Yellow>失踪案详情</>\n失踪者多为廷根普通市民，涵盖各个阶层：工人、富商、学生等。\n多数失踪者近期接触过罗塞尔大帝相关物品，包括戏剧节铜镜、海报、宣传品。\n部分失踪者在失踪前曾参与五月庄园的高薪短工招募。\n\n<P_Yellow>救援&伤亡情况</>\n救援名单\n……查理……珍妮……莉迪亚……杰克……\n伤亡名单\n……卡尔……约翰逊……琼……\n\n<P_Yellow>相关势力</>\n月亮仆从（详见月亮仆从调查报告）\n\n<P_Yellow>相关封印物</>\n知识皇冠\n绝望魔镜"] = "<P_Yellow> Security Level </> Confidential \n<P_Yellow> Reporter </> Leonard Mitchell \n<P_Yellow> Date </> July 1354 \n\n<P_Yellow> Event Overview </>\n Since June 1354, a series of bizarre disappearance cases of citizens have occurred in Tingen. After the Blackthorn Security Company intervened in the investigation, it was confirmed that there was hidden Beyonder power intervention behind the events, and it was finally confirmed to be a large-scale Sacrifice Ritual planned by the evil god organization \"Moon Servant.\" Its goal was to use the Crown of Knowledge and the Magic Mirror of Despair to sacrifice the entire city to the \"Great Mother\" (confirmed to be the avatar of ▇▇▇▇) to give birth to the evil god's offspring.\n\n<P_Yellow> Details of Disappearance Cases </>\n Most of the missing persons were ordinary Tingen citizens, covering all walks of life: workers, wealthy merchants, students, etc. \n Most of the missing persons had recently come into contact with items related to Emperor Roselle, including drama festival mirrors, posters, and promotional materials. \n Some of the missing persons had participated in the high-paying short-term job recruitment at May Manor before going missing. \n\n<P_Yellow> Rescue & Casualty Situation </>\n Rescue List \n... Charlie... Jenny... Lydia... Jack... \n Casualty List \n... Karl... Johnson... Joan... \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Factions </>\n Moon Servant (see Moon Servant Investigation Report for details) \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Sealed Artifacts </>\n Crown of Knowledge \n Magic Mirror of Despair",
    ["<P_Yellow>封印物·知识皇冠</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n0级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n窥秘人\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n罗塞尔大帝在白枫宫被刺杀后，体内未排除的知识皇帝特性与其皇冠结合形成的遗物，蕴含▇▇母神的污染。 \n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n知识具象化，可将实物瓦解为知识洪流。\n通晓大部分知识，并直接解读隐秘信息（包括神灵的隐秘）。\n理解超越序列的宇宙真理与神秘本质。\n能对低位格者下达精神控制与认知重塑的指令。 \n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n皇冠会持续灌输无法承受的海量真理与禁忌知识，解读知识会随机失去一部分理智或人格。\n摘下皇冠会触发知识洪流反噬，导致持有者灵魂被瞬间冲散，成为无知无识的空壳。\n\n<P_Yellow>封印物·绝望魔镜</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n不明，未定级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n刺客\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n绝望魔女赫尔嘉晋升序列3时失败而失控，为避免其彻底化为怪物，子爵夫人亲手终结其生命，其遗留的非凡特性与一枚镜子结合并异化。赫尔嘉生前与子爵夫人相识，二人情谊深厚。其死后残存意志与特性结合，形成此封印物。\n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n可构建独立的镜中空间。\n具备意识封印能力，可将强大的精神体或神性意志分割封印。\n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n具有强烈的自毁意识与厌世倾向，会诱导周边生物摧毁魔镜，镜面破碎会爆发强烈的灵性反噬。\n无差别地吸收周围生命的希望与情感，将其转化为维持镜中世界的养分，范围内的生物会逐渐感到空虚、麻木，最终主动走向自我毁灭。"] = "<P_Yellow>Sealed Artifact · Knowledge Crown</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nLevel 0\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nMystery Pryer\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nA relic formed after Emperor Roselle was assassinated at White Maple Palace, combining the unexpelled Knowledge Emperor characteristic within his body with his crown. It contains the corruption of the ▇▇ Mother Goddess. \n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nMaterializes knowledge, capable of disintegrating physical objects into a Torrent of Knowledge.\nGrants knowledge of most subjects and allows for the direct interpretation of hidden information (including the secrets of deities).\nProvides understanding of cosmic truths and mystical essences that transcend Sequences.\nCan issue commands for Mind Control and cognitive restructuring to those of a lower Sequence. \n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nThe crown continuously instills an unbearable amount of truth and Forbidden Knowledge; interpreting this knowledge results in a random loss of sanity or personality.\nRemoving the crown triggers a backlash of the Torrent of Knowledge, instantly shattering the holder's soul and leaving them an ignorant, empty shell.\n\n<P_Yellow>Sealed Artifact · Magic Mirror of Despair</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nUnknown, Unrated\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nAssassin\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nFormed when the Despair Witch Helga failed her advancement to Sequence 3 and lost control. To prevent her from fully transforming into a monster, the Viscountess ended her life personally. The remaining Beyonder characteristic combined with a mirror and mutated. Helga and the Viscountess were close friends during Helga's lifetime. Her residual will combined with the characteristic to form this Sealed Artifact.\n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nCapable of constructing an independent mirror world.\nPossesses consciousness-sealing abilities, capable of segmenting and sealing powerful spirits or divine wills.\n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nPossesses a strong self-destructive consciousness and misanthropic tendencies; it will induce nearby creatures to destroy the magic mirror. If the mirror surface shatters, it triggers a violent spiritual backlash.\nIndiscriminately absorbs the hope and emotions of surrounding life forms, converting them into nutrients to sustain the mirror world. Creatures within range will gradually feel empty and numb, eventually walking toward self-destruction.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：三个宝箱，一个真货，两个惊喜！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Three treasure chests, one is real, two are surprises!",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：不过既然你来了……不如也一起玩点“有趣”的游戏吧。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: But since you're here... why not play some 'interesting' games together?",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：别担心，你不会像我一样失控的……大概吧？嘻嘻嘻！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Don't worry, you won't lose control like me... probably? Hehehe!",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：别紧张，我不过是一个痴迷赌局、输掉自己的“小丑”。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Don't be nervous, I'm just a 'Clown' obsessed with gambling who lost himself.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：可惜等不及了呢~"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: It's a pity I couldn't wait any longer~",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：哈哈！又有人来了！来看笑话？还是来送死的？     "] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Haha! Someone else is here! Are you here to watch a joke? Or to die?",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：哦～不错嘛！你看见了侍卫说的话。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Oh~ not bad! You saw what the guard said.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：啊哈！你抓住了皇后的裙摆呢～"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Aha! You've caught the hem of the Queen's dress~",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：嘻嘻~"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Hehe~",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：嘻嘻……看呀，一位好奇的访客！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Hehe... look, a curious visitor!",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：如果输了嘛……嘻嘻……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: If you lose, well... hehe...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：当年我也是这样，等待、跳跃、再等待……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: I was like this back then, waiting, jumping, and waiting again...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：恭喜过关，但你还能继续这么幸运吗，嘻嘻……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Congratulations on passing, but can you stay this lucky? Hehe...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：恭喜！但有时候眼前的“希望”，可能才是命运最大的玩笑……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Congratulations! But sometimes the 'hope' right before your eyes might be fate's greatest joke...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：恭喜！你找到了正确的王座～"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Congratulations! You've found the correct throne~",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：我们永远在刀尖上跳舞，却没发现脚下的幸运早就飘走啦。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: We are always dancing on the edge of a blade, never noticing that the luck beneath our feet has long since drifted away.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：我就是那个J，企图弑王的骑士，可王后先背叛了我。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: I am that Jack, the knight who attempted to kill the King, but the Queen betrayed me first.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：我跳了步，结果就笑得停不下来了……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: I jumped a step, and as a result, I couldn't stop laughing...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：来来来，陪我回顾那些美好回忆~解开三个谜题，就能拿走我的宝物。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Come, come, come, join me in reviewing those wonderful memories~ Solve three riddles, and you can take my treasure.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：而那个可怜虫，眼里只有命运的赌桌，失去了身边的一切……"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: And that poor wretch, with eyes only for the gambling table of fate, lost everything around him...",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：这个世界，嘻嘻~总有人比你更绝情！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: In this world, hehe~ there is always someone more heartless than you!",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：那个家伙…总以为自己是非凡的主宰，不知道一次失误就是万丈深渊。"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: That guy... always thinks he is the master of the extraordinary, unaware that a single mistake is an abyss.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小黛西</>会永远活在最快乐的时刻，我们也会在那里相聚，对吧？"] = "<P_Yellow> Little Daisy </> will live in her happiest moment forever, and we will also meet there, right?",
    ["<P_Yellow>左边</>这杯里有不好的事物。"] = "The cup on the <P_Yellow>left</> has something bad in it.",
    ["<P_Yellow>廷根大学</>的讲师面试也在今天，虽然已经决定加入值夜者，但还是要去一趟学校，取消面试。"] = "The interview for a lecturer at <P_Yellow>Tingen University</> is also today. Although I have decided to join the Nighthawks, I still need to go to the university to cancel the interview.",
    ["<P_Yellow>廷根的毁灭日？</>他们在谋划什么……"] = "<P_Yellow>The Doomsday of Tingen?</> What are they plotting...",
    ["<P_Yellow>弗萨克帝国</>盘踞在北端，<P_Yellow>鲁恩王国</>蛰伏于东面，<P_Yellow>费内波特王国</>守着南方，西边就是我们伟大的<P_Yellow>因蒂斯帝国</>。"] = "The <P_Yellow> Feysac Empire </> occupies the northern end, the <P_Yellow> Loen Kingdom </> lies in the east, the <P_Yellow> Feynapotter Kingdom </> guards the south, and to the west is our great <P_Yellow> Intis Republic </>.",
    ["<P_Yellow>当你听见渺远的钟声回响，那便是愚者的天使，在向你遥望~</>"] = "<P_Yellow>When you hear the distant chime of bells, that is the Fool's angel, looking toward you from afar~</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>我主居于灵界之上，俯瞰着万物生长~</>"] = "<P_Yellow>My Lord resides above the spirit world, overlooking the growth of all things~</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>我主的身边围绕着六位天使，守护着命运与希望~</>"] = "<P_Yellow>My Lord is surrounded by six angels, guarding fate and hope~</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>托马斯神父</>就是主教！"] = "<P_Yellow> Father Thomas </> is the Bishop!",
    ["<P_Yellow>提示：使用方向键左右移动，躲避攻击</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Tip: Use the arrow keys to move left and right to dodge attacks</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>有趣</>，戏剧还有用鼻子看的？"] = "<P_Yellow>Interesting</>, can drama be watched with the nose?",
    ["<P_Yellow>正确的时间是</>……<P_Yellow>黄昏</>……"] = "<P_Yellow>The correct time is </>... <P_Yellow>Dusk</>...",
    ["<P_Yellow>爽文是不同世界不同人民的共同追求！</>"] = "<P_Yellow>'Refreshing' stories are the common pursuit of different people in different worlds!</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>玫瑰天堂</>——邦尼的地盘，藏在东区这片巷子里。"] = "<P_Yellow> Rose Paradise </>—Bonnie's territory, hidden in these alleys of the East District.",
    ["<P_Yellow>皎洁的月光</>终于取代了黄昏，静静地照亮了这片幽深的森林。"] = "<P_Yellow>The bright moonlight</> finally replaced the twilight, quietly illuminating this deep, dark forest.",
    ["<P_Yellow>祂的仁慈洒满了天国和大地，如同夕阳洒在这石墙上~</>"] = "<P_Yellow>His mercy is sprinkled across heaven and earth, like the sunset on this stone wall~</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>穿着长裙的少女</>踏入草地，轻松赢得了这局捉迷藏。"] = "<P_Yellow>The girl in the long dress</> stepped onto the grass, easily winning this game of hide-and-seek.",
    ["<P_Yellow>答案的位置</>本身也是一种回答？！"] = "The <P_Yellow>location of the answer</> itself is also a form of response?!",
    ["<P_Yellow>罗珊</>？这个时间，你不是应该在工作吗？"] = "<P_Yellow>Rozanne</>? Shouldn't you be at work at this hour?",
    ["<P_Yellow>菲丽丝</>？她已经好了，之后启明小队会调查原因。"] = "<P_Yellow>Phyllis</>? She is already better, and the Dawn Squad will investigate the cause later.",
    ["<P_Yellow>蜂蜜炖猪肠！</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Honey-Stewed Pork Intestines!</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>课本上配着画儿，穷小子也能看懂几行字——</>"] = "<P_Yellow>Textbooks are illustrated, so even a poor boy can read a few lines—</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>这几页</>是3-888的详细资料，你可以看看。"] = "<P_Yellow>These pages</> are the detailed information on 3-888, you can take a look.",
    ["<P_Yellow>附近的灵</>或许能给我们一些线索。"] = "The <P_Yellow> spirits nearby </> might be able to give us some clues.",
    ["<P_Yellow>霍纳奇斯</>……算了，还是先解决安娜小姐的问题。"] = "<P_Yellow> Hornacis </>... Never mind, let's solve Miss Anna's problem first.",
    ["<P_Yellow>（不知何处传来的声音）</>呜……"] = "<P_Yellow> (A voice coming from nowhere) </> Woo...",
    ["<P_Yellow>（洗牌递到你面前）</>你想探索哪个秘密？ "] = "<P_Yellow> (Shuffles the cards and hands them to you) </> Which secret do you wish to explore?",
    ["<Probability>概率</>"] = "<Probability>Probability</>",
    ["<Prompt_Red>俱乐部资料室达到%d级</>"] = "<Prompt_Red> Club Archive reached level %d </>",
    ["<Prompt_Red>扮演等级达到%d级</>"] = "<Prompt_Red> Acting level reached level %d </>",
    ["<Quality_3>精良</>物品"] = "<Quality_3>Fine</> Item",
    ["<Quality_4>危险等级3</>物品"] = "<Quality_4>Danger Level 3</> Item",
    ["<Quality_4>稀有</>物品"] = "<Quality_4>Rare</> Item",
    ["<Quality_5>传说</>伙伴"] = "<Quality_5> Legendary </> Partner",
    ["<Quality_5>危险等级2</>物品"] = "<Quality_5>Danger Level 2</> Item",
    ["<Quality_6>危险等级1</>物品"] = "<Quality_6>Danger Level 1</> Item",
    ["<Quality_6>神话</>伙伴"] = "<Quality_6> Mythical </> Partner",
    ["<Rank1>\"1级\"</>封印物仅在战略服生效，本服生效<Rank2>“2级”</>效果"] = "<Rank1>\"Level 1\"</> Sealed Artifact only takes effect in the strategic server, this server takes effect <Rank2>\"Level 2\"</> effect",
    ["<Ranking>赛区前四</>俱乐部可晋级战略服"] = "The top four <Ranking> clubs in the division </> can advance to the Strategic Server.",
    ["<Rate>80%</>概率出现许愿秘偶,若未出现,则下次必定出现"] = "<Rate>80%</> chance for a Wishing Marionette to appear; if it doesn't appear, it is guaranteed to appear next time",
    ["<Red>%s</>团队归属"] = "<Red>%s</> Team Affiliation",
    ["<Red>%s</>所属团队获得归属权"] = "Team belonging to <Red>%s</> gains ownership",
    ["<Red>伪证罪</>：携带者的技能公证失败时，该技能本次施放造成的增伤降低60%，治疗增幅降低60%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Perjury</>: When the carrier's skill Notarization fails, the Damage Boost caused by that skill cast is reduced by 60%, and the Healing Boost is reduced by 60%. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>光芒耗散</>：光芒牢笼反弹伤害时，延长荣耀之证的冷却时间0.5秒，最多触发10次。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Light Dissipation</>: When Cage of Light reflects damage, it extends the Cooldown of Proof of Glory by 0.5 seconds, triggering up to 10 times. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>后怕</>：嫁祸效果结束后的10秒内，减伤降低10%。连续触发危险直觉之后的冷却期内，控制命中、控制抗性降低。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Lingering Fear</>: Within 10 seconds after the Frame effect ends, Damage Reduction is lowered by 10%. During the Cooldown period after continuously triggering Danger Intuition, control hit and control resistance are reduced. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>尖啸虚弱</>：携带者脱离尖啸刺激时，若依然身处战斗之中，则会陷入虚弱，降低5%的攻击、15%移动速度。直至离开战斗，或者再次戴上面具，才能摆脱虚弱。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Screech Weakness</>: When the wearer leaves Screech Stimulation, if they are still in combat, they will fall into Weakness, reducing Attack by 5% and movement speed by 15%. This persists until leaving combat or putting the mask back on. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material entry attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>异变</>：携带者每消耗1点生命能量，身体会积攒1层异变，降低移动速度5%，降低防御5%。异变效果最多累积10层。脱离战斗后，或者站立不动时，异变会随时间逐渐消散。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Mutation</>: For every 1 point of Life Energy consumed, the bearer accumulates 1 stack of Mutation, reducing movement speed by 5% and defense by 5%. Mutation effects can stack up to 10 times. After exiting combat or standing still, Mutation will gradually dissipate over time. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attribute entries become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<Red>弑主</>：恶灵视主人为敌对单位，且主人进入战斗时，会被刻上持续10秒的仇敌印记。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Regicide</>: The Evil Spirit views its master as a hostile unit, and when the master enters combat, they will be marked with an Enemy mark lasting 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<Red>引雷</>：持有者对目标触发闪电时，有50%概率对自己也施加闪电造成伤害，闪电有50%几率触发3秒的滞涩效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Lightning Attraction</>: When the holder triggers lightning on a target, there is a 50% probability that it will also deal lightning damage to themselves, and the lightning has a 50% chance to trigger a 3-second Stagnation effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>恋家</>：布偶回到主人身上后，需要休息10秒，才能再次被转移出去。\n<Red>祸心</>：被唤醒的布偶停留在主人身上期间，主人也会遭受厄运缠身效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Homesick</>: After the doll returns to the master, it needs to rest for 10 seconds before it can be transferred again. \n<Red>Malicious Heart</>: While the awakened doll is on the master, the master will also suffer from the Beset by Misfortune effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<Red>招惹蚊虫</>：佩戴者持有护盾时，每秒减少2.5%生命值上限等额的护盾值。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Attracting Insects</>: When the wearer has a Shield, they lose an amount of Shield value equal to 2.5% of their maximum Health per second. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>挥发性</>：战斗中每隔1秒，携带者会染上3种毒素中的随机一种，持续8秒。当携带者对攻击者染毒时，有65%概率优先将自身承受的毒素传递出去。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Volatility</>: Every 1 second during combat, the carrier will be infected with one of the 3 toxins at random, lasting 8 seconds. When the carrier infects an attacker, there is a 65% probability of prioritizing the transfer of toxins they are currently suffering from. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>星空污染</>：发射弹丸会使自身附加星疫效果：每隔2秒受到最大生命值1%的伤害，持续10秒，该效果可叠加3层；\n<Red>腐蚀性</>：毒液溅射效果也对自己生效；\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Starry Corruption</>: Firing bullets will apply the Star Plague effect to yourself: take 1% of maximum Health as damage every 2 seconds for 10 seconds, and this effect can stack up to 3 layers; \n<Red>Corrosiveness</>: The Venom Splash effect also applies to yourself; \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>枯竭</>：幸运结束时，佩戴者陷入持续4秒的困顿：移动速度降低*d**、体力恢复速度降低*d**，且期间无法触发幸运。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Depletion</>: When Luck ends, the wearer falls into a state of exhaustion for 4 seconds: movement speed is reduced by *d**, stamina recovery speed is reduced by *d**, and Luck cannot be triggered during this period. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute entry becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>欲望剥离</>：战斗中每隔7秒，携带者也会进入迷失状态，持续1秒。携带者受到伤害或治疗均会延缓这一进程。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Desire Stripping</>: Every 7 seconds during combat, the carrier also enters the Lost state for 1 second. Taking damage or receiving healing will delay this process. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>污染词条</>可通过灰雾隔离净化为普通或非凡词条"] = "<Red>Corruption Affixes</> can be purified into Normal or Beyonder Affixes via the gray fog",
    ["<Red>渴血症</>：作为强制召唤秘偶的代价，指环会吞噬自身5%的最大生命值。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Bloodthirst Syndrome</>: As the cost for the forced summon of the marionette, the ring will consume 5% of your maximum Health. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>灌注灵性</>：佩戴者扣下扳机时，消耗自身20点体力值作为代价，若体力不足20点，则清空体力，并在接下来的2秒内无法恢复体力。\n<Red>弱点反噬</>：佩戴者使用丧钟后的2秒内，无法继续揭露弱点。期间减伤降低*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Infusing Spirituality</>: When the wearer pulls the trigger, they consume 20 points of their own Stamina as a cost. If Stamina is less than 20, all Stamina is cleared, and they cannot recover Stamina for the next 2 seconds. \n<Red>Weakness Backlash</>: Within 2 seconds after the wearer uses Death Knell, they cannot continue to expose weaknesses. During this time, Damage Reduction is lowered by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>灌注灵性</>：佩戴者扣下扳机时，消耗自身20点体力值作为代价，若体力不足20点，则清空体力，并在接下来的2秒内无法恢复体力。\n<Red>弱点反噬</>：佩戴者使用丧钟后的3秒内，无法继续揭露弱点。期间受到伤害提高*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Infuse Spirituality</>: When the wearer pulls the trigger, they consume 20 points of their own Stamina as a price. If Stamina is less than 20, it is emptied, and Stamina cannot be recovered for the next 2 seconds. \n<Red>Weakness Backlash</>: Within 3 seconds after the wearer uses Death Knell, they cannot continue to reveal weaknesses. During this period, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>灵魂重负</>：穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂，期间自身生命值上限降低*f**。\n<Red>贪食血肉</>：穿戴者吞噬怪物灵魂，获得灵魂压制期间，受到伤害提高*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Beyonder soul the wearer imprisons, their own Max HP is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: When the wearer devours a monster soul and gains Soul Suppression, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>灵魂重负</>：穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂，期间自身生命值上限降低*f**。\n<Red>贪食血肉</>：穿戴者粉碎怪物灵魂后，减伤降低*f**，持续10秒。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Beyonder soul imprisoned by the wearer, their own maximum Health is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: After the wearer crushes a monster's soul, their Damage Reduction is lowered by *f** for 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>脆弱</>：庇护效果结束时，纸人所承受溢出伤害的15%会重新作用到主人身上，并使主人在接下来的15秒内，减伤降低15%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the protection effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage absorbed by the paper figurine is reapplied to the master, and the master's Damage Reduction is lowered by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>脆弱</>：庇护效果结束时，纸人所承受溢出伤害的15%会重新作用到主人身上，并使主人在接下来的15秒内，受到伤害提高15%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the Shelter effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage taken by the Paper Figurine is reapplied to the owner, and the owner's damage taken is increased by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>血液冻结</>：进入战斗后，佩戴者的血液会逐渐变冷，降低体力恢复速度直至完全无法恢复体力。通过持续不断的造成伤害，可以缓解乃至消除该效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Blood Freezing</>: After entering combat, the wearer's blood will gradually cool, reducing Stamina recovery speed until Stamina cannot be recovered at all. This effect can be alleviated or even eliminated by continuously dealing damage. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material entry attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<Red>视力损伤</>：异界状态结束后的5秒内陷入视野模糊状态，期间格挡降低*f**，防御降低*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Vision Impairment</>: Within 5 seconds after the Otherworldly state ends, you fall into a blurred vision state, during which Block is reduced by *f** and Defense is reduced by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>遗恨回响</>：身处战斗中时，携带者间歇性降低理智值，无法获得移动速度提升效果。\n<Red>尸骨诅咒</>：活化土地存在期间，携带者无法主动复活或被队友复活，如果尸体被强制净化，则活化土地只保留生命值恢复效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Echo of Regret</>: While in combat, the carrier intermittently loses sanity and cannot gain movement speed boost effects. \n<Red>Bone Curse</>: While the activated land exists, the carrier cannot actively resurrect or be resurrected by teammates. If the corpse is forcibly purified, the activated land only retains the Health restoration effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<Red>钱多压身</>：携带者持有苦难财富超过20秒后，若依然处于战斗中，则会每隔10秒陷入持续5秒的不堪重负状态：降低*f**移动速度和*f**体力恢复速度。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Wealth Burden</>: After the carrier has held Wealth of Misery for more than 20 seconds, if they are still in combat, they will fall into an Overburdened state lasting 5 seconds every 10 seconds: reducing *f** movement speed and *f** Stamina recovery speed. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<RedStage>%s</>/%s件装备强化至%s阶"] = "<RedStage>%s</>/%s pieces of equipment strengthened to Tier %s",
    ["<RedStage>%s</>/%s件装备精炼至%d阶%d%%完美"] = "<RedStage>%s</>/%s pieces of equipment refined to Tier %d %d%% Perfect",
    ["<Reminder_Red>%s</>被小丑设置了定时炸弹，赶快靠近帮助他分摊伤害。"] = "<Reminder_Red>%s</> has been set with a timed bomb by the Clown, hurry over to help share the damage.",
    ["<Reminder_Red>一键辅助</>处于关闭状态，若有需求请重新开启"] = "<Reminder_Red> One-tap Support </> is currently disabled. Please re-enable it if needed.",
    ["<Reminder_Red>剩余%d秒</>"] = "<Reminder_Red> %d seconds remaining </>",
    ["<Reminder_Red>剩余%d秒爆炸</>"] = "<Reminder_Red> Explodes in %d seconds </>",
    ["<Reminder_Red>当前位置NavMesh未加载！！！</>"] = "<Reminder_Red> Current location NavMesh not loaded!!! </>",
    ["<Reminder_Red>快速击破护盾</>，中断施放全屏伤害技能。"] = "<Reminder_Red> quickly break the shield </> to interrupt the casting of the full-screen damage skill.",
    ["<Reminder_Red>注意地面预警</>，小心走位。"] = "<Reminder_Red> pay attention to the ground warnings </> and watch your positioning.",
    ["<SeeKHelp>已拥有</>"] = "<SeeKHelp>Already owned</>",
    ["<ShortTime>24时</>"] = "<ShortTime>24 hours</>",
    ["<StandbyApplication>额外</>"] = "<StandbyApplication>Extra</>",
    ["<Stress>参战</>伙伴提供<Stress>5%</>的属性加成。\n<Stress>助战</>伙伴提供<Stress>1%</>的属性加成。"] = "<Stress>Active</> partners provide a <Stress>5%</> attribute bonus. \n<Stress>Support</> partners provide a <Stress>1%</> attribute bonus.",
    ["<Synthesis>可合成</>"] = "<Synthesis>Synthesizable</>",
    ["<TDun>成功击杀%s。</>"] = "<TDun> successfully killed %s. </>",
    ["<TDun>玩法提示%s</>"] = "<TDun>Gameplay Tip%s</>",
    ["<TMis2>简短介绍%s</>"] = "<TMis2> Brief Introduction %s </>",
    ["<TMis>开启每日任务</><TMis3>%s</>"] = "<TMis> Open Daily Quests </><TMis3>%s</>",
    ["<TMis>挑战开始%s</>"] = "<TMis>Challenge Start%s</>",
    ["<TMis>满</><P_Yellow>%d人</><TMis>响应</>"] = "<TMis> Full </><P_Yellow>%d people </><TMis> respond </>",
    ["<TarotContractHighLight>%d</>/月"] = "<TarotContractHighLight> %d </>/month",
    ["<TarotContractHighLight>%s</>/%s名队员已签署完成"] = "<TarotContractHighLight> %s </>/%s members have signed",
    ["<Team_Target>[求助]净化请求</>  我在冒险中不幸受伤，请求值夜者队员帮忙净化"] = "<Team_Target> [Help] Purification Request </> I was unfortunately injured during my adventure; requesting Nighthawk members to help with purification.",
    ["<Team_Target>[求助]安魂请求</>  我的理智过低，请求<Chat_Highlight>安魂诗社</>成员协助我恢复宁静。"] = "<Team_Target> [Help] Requiem Request </> My sanity is too low, requesting <Chat_Highlight> Requiem Poetry Society </> members to assist me in restoring tranquility.",
    ["<Team_Target>[约战房间]</> %s"] = "<Team_Target> [Battle Room] </> %s",
    ["<Team_Target>[邀请]魅惑之约</>  敢直视我的双眼吗？来与我共赴<Chat_Highlight>春夜舞会</>，品尝真正的快乐…"] = "<Team_Target> [Invite] Charm Appointment </> Dare to look me in the eyes? Come with me to the <Chat_Highlight> Spring Night Ball </> and taste true pleasure...",
    ["<Time>%s 秒 </> 后自动进入"] = "Automatically entering in <Time>%s seconds </>",
    ["<Time>剩余%d小时</>"] = "<Time> Remaining %d Hours </>",
    ["<Time>剩余%d日%d小时</>"] = "<Time> Remaining %d Days %d Hours </>",
    ["<Time>剩余0小时%d分</>"] = "<Time> Remaining 0 Hours %d Minutes </>",
    ["<TimeLimit>赛季</>"] = "<TimeLimit>Season</>",
    ["<TimeLimit>限时</>"] = "<TimeLimit>Limited time</>",
    ["<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">接受拼租：</>\n白班与夜班工人可以共享一张床位。\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">安全保障：</>\n管理员24小时巡逻，只保障您个人安全，不保障您财务安全。\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">设施齐全：</>\n热水价格仅为冷水的一倍，灶台公用，按小时收费。\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">价格实惠：</>\n“每周仅需8便士，押金10便士，欢迎年轻工人入住。\n咨询请找管理员老汤姆——他在一楼左手第一个房间，随时恭候！"] = "<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Accept room sharing: </>\n Day shift and night shift workers can share one bed. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Security guarantee: </>\n Administrator patrols 24 hours a day, only guarantees your personal safety, does not guarantee your financial safety. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Complete facilities: </>\n Hot water price is only double that of cold water, stove is public, charged by the hour. \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> Affordable price: </>\n \"Only 8 pence per week, 10 pence deposit, young workers are welcome to move in. \n For inquiries, please find the administrator Old Tom—he is in the first room on the left on the first floor, waiting at any time!",
    ["<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\">布满污迹的纸条上，只剩几行还能辨认的字：</>\n“我终于明白了……”\n“第一轮是<Letter_Highlight_HW>二号</>！二号是<Letter_Highlight_HW>真的</>！”\n“欲念使者说的都是<Letter_Highlight_HW>实话</>，可我们还是会死——”\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">字迹断了</>，<Hide id=\"#157\">后面是一道擦过的暗色污痕。</>                                                                                         "] = "<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\"> On the stained note, only a few lines of legible text remain: </>\n \"I finally understand...\" \n \"The first round is <Letter_Highlight_HW> Number Two </>! Number Two is <Letter_Highlight_HW> real </>!\" \n \"The Messenger of Desire told the <Letter_Highlight_HW> truth </>, but we will still die—\" \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\"> The handwriting breaks off </>, <Hide id=\"#157\"> followed by a smeared dark stain. </>",
    ["<Tips_BrownTitle>增益</>"] = "<Tips_BrownTitle> Buff </>",
    ["<Tips_GrayTitle>领域特性提升解锁</>"] = "<Tips_GrayTitle> Domain Characteristic Enhancement Unlocked </>",
    ["<Tips_TRedTitle>影响</>"] = "<Tips_TRedTitle> Influence </>",
    ["<Title>势力对战</>\n参与战略服的俱乐部将以最终确定的势力开启为期一个月的势力对战，参与<Highlight>霜陨领主、战略服猎城战、俱乐部征服宣令、战略服终末猎杀</>等玩法，获取俱乐部神选积分，并根据每周排名与最终排名争夺神选席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>战略战备</>\n本次战略服将开放三项战略服专属战备：\n<Highlight>战略技能：</>每个途径可获得专属战略技能，合理使用将对战局产生重要影响。\n<Highlight>历史结晶：</>玩家可使用历史结晶将封印物提升至1级，并逐步解锁装配非凡物质的额外槽位。\n<Highlight>大帝征途：</>参与各项战略服玩法均可获得征服声望，可用于提升战略服军衔等级。\n<Highlight>以上战备仅在战略服内生效</>。\n\n<Title>神选荣耀</>\n势力对战结束后，将开启<Highlight>胜者宣言大会</>。大会结束后统一发放神选席位奖励与限时神降。后续还将根据各俱乐部的神选积分开启本服<Highlight>贸易战争</>，敬请期待。"] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Historical Crystals: </> Players can use Historical Crystals to upgrade Sealed Artifacts to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Beyonder materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned.",
    ["<Title>势力对战</>\n参与战略服的俱乐部将以最终确定的势力开启为期一个月的势力对战，参与<Highlight>霜陨领主、战略服猎城战、俱乐部征服宣令、战略服终末猎杀</>等玩法，获取俱乐部神选积分，并根据每周排名与最终排名争夺神选席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>战略战备</>\n本次战略服将开放三项战略服专属战备：\n<Highlight>战略技能：</>每个途径可获得专属战略技能，合理使用将对战局产生重要影响。\n<Highlight>历史结晶：</>玩家可使用历史结晶将封印物提升至1级，并逐步解锁装配非凡物质的额外槽位。\n<Highlight>大帝征途：</>参与各项战略服玩法均可获得征服声望，可用于提升战略服军衔等级。\n<Highlight>以上战备仅在战略服内生效</>。\n\n<Title>神选荣耀</>\n势力对战结束后，将开启<Highlight>胜者宣言大会</>。大会结束后统一发放神选席位奖励与限时顶奢。后续还将根据各俱乐部的神选积分开启本服<Highlight>贸易战争</>，敬请期待。"] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month faction battle with the finally determined factions. Participate in activities such as <Highlight> Frostfall Lord, Strategic Server Hunting City Battle, Club Conquest Declaration, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to earn Club Divine Selection Points and compete for Divine Selection Seats based on weekly and final rankings. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a club are distributed internally by the club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive strategic skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle situation. \n <Highlight> History Crystals: </> Players can use History Crystals to upgrade Sealed Artifacts to level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Beyonder materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server activities can earn Conquest Prestige, which can be used to increase your Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> Divine Selection Glory </> \n After the faction battle ends, the <Highlight> Victory Declaration Ceremony </> will begin. After the ceremony, Divine Selection Seat rewards and limited-time top luxury items will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, <Highlight> Trade Wars </> for this server will be opened based on each club's Divine Selection Points; stay tuned.",
    ["<Title>势力预分配</>\n<Highlight>9月12日21:30—9月13日12:00</>，系统将统一进行一次势力预分配。\n\n<Title>势力调整</>\n<Highlight>9月13日12:00—9月13日18:00</>，各赛区筛选第1名俱乐部将被锁定，无法调整势力；其余俱乐部可手动调整己方势力。每个势力最多容纳<Highlight>4个俱乐部</>。截止18:00，仍未选择势力的俱乐部将由系统随机分配。\n\n<Title>势力对战</>\n9月13日18:00后，所有俱乐部势力将锁定。<Highlight>9月17日维护后</>将开启为期一个月的势力对战；对战期间势力不会变动，各俱乐部将代表所属势力角逐战略服荣耀。"] = "<Title>Faction Pre-allocation</>\n<Highlight>September 12, 21:30—September 13, 12:00</>, the system will perform a unified faction pre-allocation.\n\n<Title>Faction Adjustment</>\n<Highlight>September 13, 12:00—September 13, 18:00</>, the 1st place club in each division will be locked and cannot adjust their faction; other clubs can manually adjust their faction. Each faction can accommodate a maximum of <Highlight>4 clubs</>. By 18:00, clubs that have not yet chosen a faction will be randomly assigned by the system.\n\n<Title>Faction Battle</>\nAfter September 13, 18:00, all club factions will be locked.<Highlight>After the September 17 maintenance</>, a month-long Faction Battle will begin; factions will not change during the battle, and each club will represent its faction to compete for the glory of the strategic server.",
    ["<Title>势力预分配</>\n<Highlight>9月12日21:30—9月13日12:00</>，系统将统一进行一次势力预分配。\n\n<Title>势力调整</>\n<Highlight>9月13日12:00—9月13日18:00</>，各赛区筛选第1名俱乐部将被锁定，无法调整势力；其余俱乐部的会长可手动调整己方势力。每个势力最多容纳<Highlight>4个俱乐部</>。截止18:00，仍未选择势力的俱乐部将由系统随机分配。\n\n<Title>势力对战</>\n9月13日18:00后，所有俱乐部势力将锁定。<Highlight>9月17日维护后</>将开启为期一个月的势力对战；对战期间势力不会变动，各俱乐部将代表所属势力角逐战略服荣耀。"] = "<Title>Faction Pre-assignment</>\n<Highlight>September 12, 21:30 – September 13, 12:00</>, the system will perform a unified faction pre-assignment.\n\n<Title>Faction Adjustment</>\n<Highlight>September 13, 12:00 – September 13, 18:00</>, the top-ranked Club in each division will be locked and cannot change factions; leaders of other Clubs can manually adjust their faction. Each faction can hold a maximum of <Highlight>4 Clubs</>. By 18:00, Clubs that have not selected a faction will be randomly assigned by the system.\n\n<Title>Faction War</>\nAfter 18:00 on September 13, all Club factions will be locked.<Highlight>After the maintenance on September 17,</> a month-long Faction War will begin; factions will not change during the war, and each Club will represent its faction to compete for the glory of the Strategic Server.",
    ["<Title>势力预分配</>\n战区筛选完成后，将于<Highlight>9月13日12：00</>完成势力预分配。\n\n<Title>势力调整</>\n预分配完成后，可根据规则手动调整所属势力；<Highlight>9月13日18：00</>势力调整结束并确定最终势力。调整期间，<Highlight>各赛区第1名俱乐部将被锁定，无法调整势力</>。后续将以分配好的固定势力完成一个月的势力对战。"] = "<Title>Faction Pre-assignment</>\nOnce the war zone selection is complete, faction pre-assignment will be finalized on <Highlight>September 13th at 12:00</>. \n\n<Title>Faction Adjustment</>\nAfter pre-assignment is complete, you may manually adjust your faction according to the rules; <Highlight>September 13th at 18:00</>, faction adjustments will end and the final factions will be determined. During the adjustment period, <Highlight>the 1st place Club in each competition zone will be locked and cannot change factions</>. Afterward, the faction battles will be completed over the course of one month with the fixed factions assigned.",
    ["<Title>复活次数加成</>\n队伍或团队中，3~8人处于同一家族，获得1次额外复活次数；9人以上处于同一家族，获得2次额外复活次数。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。\n<Title>属性补足加成</>\n队伍或团队中，拥有相同家族成员时，获得属性增益。团队内同家族成员数量越多，增益效果越高。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "<Title>Resurrection Count Bonus</>\nIf 3–8 people in a party or team belong to the same Family, gain 1 extra resurrection attempt; if 9 or more people belong to the same Family, gain 2 extra resurrection attempts. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.\n<Title>Attribute Supplement Bonus</>\nIf there are members of the same Family in a party or team, gain attribute bonuses. The more members of the same Family in the team, the higher the bonus effect. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.",
    ["<Title>巨龙现身</>\n巨龙·投影于每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，现身<Highlight>猎龙城王城中心</>。若20:00前未被击退，巨龙将离开，且不触发击杀结算。\n\n<Title>归属伤害</>\n仅在巨龙周围<Highlight>40米</>内存活并对其造成伤害时，伤害才会计入玩家当前所在团队。巨龙被击退时，<Highlight>当前有效归属伤害最高的团队</>获得最终归属及拍卖奖励。靠近巨龙后，可实时查看当前归属伤害。\n\n<Title>伤害衰减</>\n玩家死亡、离开巨龙讨伐范围、切换分线或离开团队后，该玩家已为团队累计的归属伤害将开始衰减，并同步影响团队当前的有效归属伤害。\n\n触发衰减后的<Highlight>前5秒</>，归属伤害保持不变；从第6秒开始，<Highlight>每6秒减少原累计归属伤害的5%</>，持续120秒后归零。\n\n重新进入<Highlight>巨龙讨伐范围</>并恢复参战后，衰减停止。当前剩余的归属伤害将被保留，并在此基础上继续累计新造成的伤害。\n\n<Title>拍卖奖励</>\n击退巨龙后，将根据激战值开启对应档位的拍卖。<Highlight>激战值越高，可开启的拍卖奖励档位越高</>。\n\n<Title>资格限制</>\n每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。"] = "<Title>Giant Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Giant Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> 10 minutes after the <Highlight>Hunting Time</> starts on Friday night, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the Giant Dragon will leave, and the kill settlement will not be triggered. \n\n<Title>Attribution Damage</>\nDamage is only counted towards the player's current team if they are alive within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon and dealing damage to it. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective attribution damage</> receives the final attribution and auction rewards. After approaching the Giant Dragon, you can view the current attribution damage in real-time. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the attribution damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, and this will synchronously affect the team's current effective attribution damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the attribution damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>it decreases by 5% of the original accumulated attribution damage every 6 seconds</>, and reaches zero after 120 seconds. \n\nAfter re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The current remaining attribution damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to be accumulated on this basis. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the Giant Dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be opened</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the qualification for the Giant Dragon - Projection's Final Hunt auction at most <Highlight>1 time</>; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event.",
    ["<Title>神选席位</>\n战略服势力对战阶段，神选席位由<Highlight>每周排名结算席位</>与<Highlight>最终排名结算席位</>共同组成。每周将根据战略服各势力的周排名，以及俱乐部在所属势力内的排名发放席位，排名越高，可获得的席位越多；战略服结算时，将根据各势力的最终排名，为势力内俱乐部发放最终排名结算席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>奖励内容</>\n神选奖励包括<Highlight>战略服专属外观奖励、养成道具、苏勒、绑定金镑</>等。\n\n<Title>限时神降</>\n战略服结算时，最终排名第一的势力中，四个俱乐部的<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可获得限时30天的神降时装<Highlight>铁与血之歌</>。\n\n<Title>奖励发放</>\n奖励将于<Highlight>战略服胜者宣言大会结束后</>统一发放。"] = "<Title>Divine Selection Seats</>\nDuring the strategic server faction battle phase, Divine Selection Seats are composed of <Highlight>weekly ranking settlement seats</> and <Highlight>final ranking settlement seats</>. Every week, seats will be distributed based on the weekly ranking of each faction on the strategic server and the Club's ranking within its faction; the higher the ranking, the more seats can be obtained. Upon strategic server settlement, final ranking settlement seats will be distributed to Clubs within the faction based on the final ranking of each faction. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n\n<Title>Reward Content</>\nDivine Selection rewards include <Highlight>strategic server exclusive cosmetic rewards, cultivation items, Sol, bound Gold Pounds</>, etc. \n\n<Title>Limited-Time Divine Descent</>\nUpon strategic server settlement, the <Highlight>President, Vice President, and Directors</> of the four Clubs in the faction ranked first overall can obtain the limited-time 30-day Divine Descent outfit <Highlight>Song of Iron and Blood</>. \n\n<Title>Reward Distribution</>\nRewards will be distributed uniformly <Highlight>after the strategic server Victor's Declaration ceremony ends</>.",
    ["<Title>神选席位</>\n战略服势力对战阶段，神选席位由<Highlight>每周排名结算席位</>与<Highlight>最终排名结算席位</>共同组成。每周将根据战略服各势力的周排名，以及俱乐部在所属势力内的排名发放席位，排名越高，可获得的席位越多；战略服结算时，将根据各势力的最终排名，为势力内俱乐部发放最终排名结算席位。俱乐部获得的神选席位由俱乐部管理在俱乐部内部分配。\n\n<Title>奖励内容</>\n神选奖励包括<Highlight>战略服专属外观奖励、养成道具、苏勒、绑定金镑</>等。\n\n<Title>限时顶奢</>\n战略服结算时，最终排名第一的势力中，四个俱乐部的<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可获得限时30天的顶奢时装<Highlight>铁与血之歌</>。\n\n<Title>奖励发放</>\n奖励将于<Highlight>战略服胜者宣言大会结束后</>统一发放。"] = "<Title> Divine Selection Seats </> \n During the Strategic Server faction battle phase, Divine Selection Seats are composed of <Highlight> Weekly Ranking Settlement Seats </> and <Highlight> Final Ranking Settlement Seats </>. Every week, seats will be distributed based on the weekly rankings of each faction on the Strategic Server and the club's ranking within its faction; the higher the ranking, the more seats can be obtained. Upon the Strategic Server settlement, Final Ranking Settlement Seats will be distributed to clubs within the faction based on the final rankings of each faction. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a club are distributed internally by the club management. \n \n <Title> Reward Content </> \n Divine Selection rewards include <Highlight> Strategic Server exclusive cosmetic rewards, cultivation items, Soules, Bound Pounds </>, etc. \n \n <Title> Limited-Time Top Luxury </> \n Upon the Strategic Server settlement, the <Highlight> President, Vice President, and Council Members </> of the four clubs in the faction that ranks first overall can obtain the 30-day limited-time top luxury outfit <Highlight> Song of Iron and Blood </>. \n \n <Title> Reward Distribution </> \n Rewards will be distributed uniformly <Highlight> after the Strategic Server Victory Declaration Ceremony concludes </>.",
    ["<Title_HW>一月三日</>\n　　当初的选择还是太草率了，现在看来，不管是<InvHighlight_HW>学徒</>，还是<InvHighlight_HW>占卜家</>，<InvHighlight_HW>偷盗者</>，都更加好。\n　　　　可惜，没办法再回头了。\n<Title_HW>一月四日</>\n　　为什么我的孩子们会那么蠢！我说过一万遍了，不要被那些神棍忽悠。不，那些神棍或许自己也被忽悠了。\n　　魔药的关键不是掌握，是消化；不是挖掘，是扮演。而魔药的名称也不仅仅是核心象征，还是具体意象，更是消化的钥匙。\n　　……"] = "<Title_HW> January 3 </> \n The initial choice was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it is <InvHighlight_HW> Apprentice, </> or <InvHighlight_HW> Seer, </> <InvHighlight_HW> Marauder, </> would have been better. \n Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back. \n <Title_HW> January 4 </> \n Why are my children so stupid! I have said it ten thousand times, do not be fooled by those charlatans. No, perhaps those charlatans were fooled themselves. \n The key to potions is not mastery, but digestion; not digging, but Acting. And the name of the potion is not only the core symbol, but also the concrete imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion. \n ...",
    ["<Title_HW>十一月十八日</>\n　　真是件神奇的事情，一个异想天开的实验和一个偶然出现的失误，让我发现了一位困于风暴之中、迷失于黑暗深处的可怜家伙，他甚至只能在每个月满月的时候才能稍微靠近现实世界，可依然无法将他的呼喊传递进来。\n　　他是幸运的，他遇见了我——这个时代的主角。\n　　写完上面这段话，自己读了一遍，忽然有点唏嘘，哪怕是用汉字，也不知不觉带上了浓烈的翻译腔，四十年弹指一挥间啊，以往的记忆真的就像梦一样了。\n　　……"] = "<Title_HW> November 18 </> \n It is truly a magical thing. A whimsical experiment and an accidental mistake allowed me to discover a poor guy trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness. He can only get close to the real world during the full moon every month, yet he still cannot convey his cries. \n He is lucky; he met me—the protagonist of this era. \n After writing the above paragraph and reading it myself, I suddenly felt a bit emotional. Even when using Chinese, I unknowingly adopted a strong translation tone. Forty years have passed in a flash; past memories really are like a dream. \n ...",
    ["<Title_Red>[CameraBlackboard - 基础模式]</>"] = "<Title_Red>[CameraBlackboard - Basic Mode]</>",
    ["<Title_Red>[CameraBlackboard - 战斗/锁定]</>"] = "<Title_Red>[CameraBlackboard - Combat/Lock-on]</>",
    ["<UpgradGreen>已满足</>"] = "<UpgradGreen> satisfied </>",
    ["<UpgradRed>未满足</>"] = "<UpgradRed> not satisfied </>",
    ["<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32秒}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Cooldown. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Cooldown. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>伤害转移</>：短时间受到超过生命值上限<Yellow>30%</>的伤害，会获得持续<Yellow>5秒</>的嫁祸能力，对选中的敌对目标施放嫁祸后，接下来<Yellow>8秒</>内自身受到的直接伤害的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</>会被转移到该目标身上。转移伤害总量不能超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>2</>倍，且会随目标过远而失效。嫁祸能力每<Yellow>30秒</>内最多获得1次。\n<Yellow>危险直觉</>：即将受到控制时，有<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率规避该次控制，短时间（3秒）内若触发<Yellow>3次</>，则会进入<Yellow>10秒</>的冷却时间。"] = "<Yellow>Transfer Damage</>: If you take damage exceeding <Yellow>30%</> of your maximum Health within a short period, you gain the Frame ability for <Yellow>5 seconds</>. After casting Frame on a selected hostile target, <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=1?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085014)=3?90%}</> of the direct damage you take over the next <Yellow>8 seconds</> will be transferred to that target. The total transferred damage cannot exceed <Yellow>2</> times your maximum Health and will be invalidated if the target is too far away. The Frame ability can be obtained at most once every <Yellow>30 seconds</>. \n<Yellow>Danger Intuition</>: When about to be controlled, you have a <Yellow>100%</> base probability to evade the control effect. If this is triggered <Yellow>3 times</> within a short period (3 seconds), it will enter a <Yellow>10-second</> Cooldown.",
    ["<Yellow>你已被毒素浸透骨髓</>"] = "<Yellow>You have been permeated by toxins to the bone marrow</>",
    ["<Yellow>你背负起了被诅咒的命运，死亡时你的尸骨会活化周围土地</>"] = "<Yellow> You have shouldered a cursed fate; upon death, your bones will animate the surrounding land </>",
    ["<Yellow>公证</>：携带者在战斗中施放普通技能和终结技能时，自动触发对该技能的公证，分别有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</>的概率公证成功，获得<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</>层公证。有10%概率公证失败，失去1层公证。每层公证使携带者提高<Yellow>*f</>攻击和<Yellow>*f</>技能增强。\n公证最多可累积<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</>层。技能触发的公证超出层数上限时，超出的层数自动消耗，每层使该技能本次施放的增伤提高<Yellow>10%</>，治疗增幅提高<Yellow>10%</>。\n离开场景时，清除所有公证层数。"] = "<Yellow>Notarization</>: When the carrier casts basic skills and Finisher Skills in combat, Notarization of the skill is automatically triggered, with a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</> probability of successful Notarization, granting <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</> stack(s) of Notarization. There is a 10% probability of failure, losing 1 stack of Notarization. Each stack of Notarization increases the carrier's Attack by <Yellow>*f</> and Skill Enhancement by <Yellow>*f</>. \nNotarization can accumulate up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</> stacks. When the stacks triggered by skills exceed the maximum limit, the excess stacks are automatically consumed, each stack increasing the Damage Boost of the current skill cast by <Yellow>10%</> and Healing Boost by <Yellow>10%</>. \nWhen leaving the scene, all Notarization stacks are cleared.",
    ["<Yellow>厄运</>：布偶随主人进入战斗而唤醒，当主人技能命中敌方主目标时，布偶会附到目标身上，使其遭受<Yellow>厄运缠身</>效果：buffdisc(*id)，持续30秒。主人切换目标进行攻击时，布偶也会随之转移附身到新的目标身上。在外附身时间累计达到30秒后，布偶会短暂回到主人身上，直到再次被转移出去。"] = "<Yellow>Misfortune</>: The doll awakens as its master enters combat. When the master's skill hits the primary enemy target, the doll attaches itself to the target, causing them to suffer from the <Yellow>Beset by Misfortune</> effect: buffdisc(*id), lasting 30 seconds. When the master switches targets to attack, the doll will also transfer its attachment to the new target. After a cumulative 30 seconds of attachment, the doll will briefly return to the master until it is transferred again.",
    ["<Yellow>奥尔米尔的冠冕</>：将佩戴者的解控技能置换成更强大的<Yellow>荣耀之证</>：\n解除自身控制，进入4秒的<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>状态，期间获得<Yellow>霸体</>和<Yellow>50%</>减伤，将每次受到伤害里不超过生命值上限10%的部分，按<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</>倍反弹给攻击者（对8米外的目标，反弹伤害额外衰减，最多衰减至8米内的20%）。<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>结束时，对周身8米内的最多6名敌对目标造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并对其施加持续<Yellow>10</>秒的<Yellow>眩目</>效果，使其攻击降低<Yellow>*d</>。\n技能冷却时间：30秒。"] = "<Yellow>Almir's Crown</>: Replaces the wearer's Control Break Skill with the more powerful <Yellow>Proof of Glory</>: \nRemoves all control effects from yourself and enter a 4-second <Yellow>Cage of Light</> state, during which you gain <Yellow>Super Armor</> and <Yellow>50%</> Damage Reduction. Any portion of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum Health is reflected back to the attacker at <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times the value (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters). <Yellow>When the Cage of Light</> ends, deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</> damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a <Yellow>10</>-second <Yellow>Dazzle</> effect, reducing their Attack by <Yellow>*d</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 30 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>异界祝福</>：战斗状态下施放灵视时，灵视效果缩短至<Yellow>5秒</>，灵视技能冷却延长至<Yellow>20秒</>，期间获得灵体生物的祝福，每秒恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</>上限生命值，并提高减伤<Yellow>*f**</>。\n该治疗效果受减疗和重伤效果影响。"] = "<Yellow>Otherworldly Blessing</>: When using spirit vision while in combat, the spirit vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, the spirit vision skill Cooldown is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>, and you gain the blessing of spirit entities, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of your maximum Health per second and increasing Damage Reduction by <Yellow>*f**</>. \nThis healing effect is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["<Yellow>异界祝福</>：战斗状态下施放灵视时，灵视效果缩短至<Yellow>5秒</>，灵视技能冷却延长至<Yellow>20秒</>，期间获得灵体生物的祝福，每秒恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</>上限生命值，并降低受到的伤害<Yellow>*f**</>。\n该治疗效果受减疗和重伤效果影响。"] = "<Yellow>Otherworld Blessing</>: When casting Spirit Vision in combat, the Spirit Vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the Spirit Vision skill cooldown is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>. During this period, gain the blessing of spirit-body creatures, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of Max HP per second and reducing damage taken by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n This healing effect is affected by healing reduction and grievous wound effects.",
    ["<Yellow>弱点攻击</>：佩戴者攻击主目标时，可对其施加<Yellow>弱点揭露</>效果，每秒最多揭露1层，最多可揭露<Yellow>30</>层。每消耗<Yellow>15</>层，可扣下丧钟的扳机，攻击目标灵体，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</>点伤害、<Yellow>3秒</>受到治疗增幅降低<Yellow>70%</>和移动速度降低<Yellow>*f**</>效果，另有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</>的基础概率使目标眩晕<Yellow>1秒</>。若目标处于霸体状态，则对其重新施加<Yellow>3</>层弱点揭露。"] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposed</> effect, revealing up to 1 stack per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> stacks. For every <Yellow>15</> stacks consumed, you can pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's spirit body to deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, reduce incoming Healing by <Yellow>70%</> for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and reduce movement speed by <Yellow>*f**</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to Stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Super Armor state, re-apply <Yellow>3</> stacks of Weakness Exposed to them.",
    ["<Yellow>弱点攻击</>：佩戴者攻击主目标时，可对其施加<Yellow>弱点揭露</>效果，每秒最多揭露1层，最多可揭露<Yellow>30</>层。每消耗<Yellow>15</>层，可扣下丧钟的扳机，攻击目标灵体，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</>点伤害、<Yellow>3秒</>受治疗效果降低<Yellow>70%</>和<Yellow>1秒</>移动速度降低<Yellow>90%</>效果，另有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</>的基础概率使目标眩晕<Yellow>1秒</>。若目标处于霸体状态，则对其重新施加<Yellow>5</>层弱点揭露。"] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposure</> effect, revealing up to 1 layer per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> layers. Every <Yellow>15</> layers consumed allows the wearer to pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's spirit body, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, <Yellow>3 seconds</> of 70% healing reduction <Yellow>70%</>, and <Yellow>1 second</> of 90% movement speed reduction <Yellow>90%</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Super Armor state, re-apply <Yellow>5</> layers of Weakness Exposure to them.",
    ["<Yellow>恶灵</>：恶灵随主人进入战斗而苏醒，从第5秒开始，每隔<Yellow>10秒</>，恶灵出现在场上，锁定一名随机敌对目标追踪移动，对触碰到的敌对单位执行复仇然后短暂沉睡。复仇造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</>点伤害、以<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>秒的眩晕效果，并对其刻上持续10秒的<Yellow>仇敌</>印记，使其移动速度降低<Yellow>20%</>。恶灵下一次出现时，<Yellow>优先锁定</>带仇敌印记的目标。\n同一时间，恶灵只能将1个目标标记为仇敌。"] = "<Yellow>Evil Spirit</>: The Evil Spirit awakens as its master enters combat. Starting from the 5th second, every <Yellow>10 seconds</>, the Evil Spirit appears on the field, locking onto a random hostile target to track and move towards. Upon touching a hostile unit, it executes vengeance and then briefly falls asleep. Vengeance deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</> damage, has a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>-second Stun effect, and marks the target with a 10-second <Yellow>Enemy</> mark, reducing their movement speed by <Yellow>20%</>. When the Evil Spirit appears next, it <Yellow>prioritizes locking onto</> targets with the Enemy mark. \nAt any given time, the Evil Spirit can only mark 1 target as an Enemy.",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并获得持续<Yellow>20</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n每20秒最多触发一次剥离灵魂效果，囚禁灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Graze Soul</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows it to be devoured, causing different effects based on the soul owner's type: \nDevour Beyonder soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them, and by imprisoning their soul, gain one corresponding Sequence skill. Using this skill releases their soul: \n Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Sun Oath</>; \n Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Chant</>; \n Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Inculcation</>; \n Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Mystery Realm</>; \n Secrets Supplicant Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \n When Creeping Hunger's danger level increases, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nDevour monster soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them and gains the <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect for <Yellow>20</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Before the imprisoned soul is released, another soul cannot be stripped from its owner. A maximum of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls can be imprisoned simultaneously.",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：立刻粉碎灵魂，对目标和周围<Yellow>5</>名怪物造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并给目标施加持续<Yellow>5</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n剥离灵魂效果每20秒最多可触发一次，囚禁的灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Beyonder's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Sequence by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Mystery Pryer Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously.",
    ["<Yellow>毒雾弥漫</>：携带者受到8米内的敌人攻击时，有<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率使其随机染上3种毒素之一，持续<Yellow>8秒</>，每种毒素最多叠加<Yellow>5层</>。染毒效果每0.5秒最多触发1次，对单个目标每2秒最多触发1次。\n<Yellow>毒素侵染</>：携带此封印物5分钟后，进入<Yellow>毒素入骨</>状态，携带者在该状态下死亡时会残留持续<Yellow>10秒</>的毒池。毒池出现时，有<Yellow>100%</>基础概率禁锢范围内的敌人<Yellow>3秒</>，并每秒尝试给范围内的敌人各施加1层3种毒素，身处毒池内时，移动速度降低<Yellow>50%</>，毒池最多影响<Yellow>10</>人。\n三种毒素具体效果如下：\n\n<Yellow>麻痹毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的滞涩状态；\n<Yellow>虚弱毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击力，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的沉默状态；\n<Yellow>疲劳毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>移动速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的减速50%状态。"] = "<Yellow>Poison Mist Filling</>: When the carrier is attacked by an enemy within 8 meters, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing them to be randomly infected with one of 3 toxins, lasting <Yellow>8 seconds</>, with each toxin stacking up to <Yellow>5 layers</>. The poisoning effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds, and at most once every 2 seconds for a single target. \n<Yellow>Toxin Infection</>: After carrying this Sealed Artifact for 5 minutes, you enter the <Yellow>Toxin into Bone</> state. When the carrier dies in this state, they leave behind a poison pool lasting <Yellow>10 seconds</>. When the poison pool appears, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of Imprisonment on enemies within the range for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and it attempts to apply 1 layer of each of the 3 toxins to enemies in the range every second. While in the poison pool, movement speed is reduced by <Yellow>50%</>, and the poison pool affects at most <Yellow>10</> people. \nThe specific effects of the three toxins are as follows: \n\n<Yellow>Paralytic Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Attack Speed, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Stagnation state; \n<Yellow>Weakening Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Attack, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Silence state; \n<Yellow>Fatigue Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> movement speed, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second 50% Slow state.",
    ["<Yellow>治愈轻伤</>：佩戴者生命值不满，且高于<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>时，绿华每秒为佩戴者恢复已损失生命值的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</>（恢复量不低于生命值上限的<Yellow>0.5%</>）。如果佩戴者生命值已满，绿华会转而治疗周围生命值最低的队友，同一单位在1秒内无法多次受到来自他人绿华的治疗。\n绿华的恢复效果受减疗和重伤影响。"] = "<Yellow>Healing Minor Wounds</>: When the wearer's Health is not full and is higher than <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?48%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?46%}</>, Green Bloom restores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=1?4.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=2?5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085027)=3?5.5%}</> of the wearer's lost Health per second (the restoration amount is no less than <Yellow>0.5%</> of the maximum Health). If the wearer's Health is full, Green Bloom will instead heal the nearby teammate with the lowest Health. The same unit cannot receive healing from others' Green Bloom more than once per second. \nThe restoration effect of Green Bloom is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["<Yellow>满月</>：强化自身以及队友的战斗技能，使其等级<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>，可叠加生效；\n<Yellow>召唤之门</>：强化秘偶，使秘偶技能的伤害和治疗效果提高<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>。当秘偶技能处于冷却中时，对目标施放普攻攻击和战斗技能，有概率强制召出秘偶，施放一次秘偶技能。秘偶技能的单次冷却周期内，强制召出效果最多触发<Yellow>1</>次。"] = "<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' combat skills, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the marionette, increasing the damage and healing effects of Marionette Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Marionette Skill is on Cooldown, using Basic Attacks and combat skills on a target has a chance to force the marionette to be summoned, casting one Marionette Skill. Within a single Cooldown cycle of a Marionette Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time.",
    ["<Yellow>满月诅咒</>：受到来自<Yellow>8</>米内的敌方伤害时，激活深红月冕，使佩戴者减伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>。对<Yellow>8</>米内攻击过自己的最多<Yellow>3</>个非首领目标维持满月诅咒，使其增伤降低<Yellow>*f**</>；深红月冕效果持续<Yellow>5</>秒，每<Yellow>10</>秒最多被激活<Yellow>1</>次。\n<Yellow>黑暗法术</>：对敌方目标造成伤害时，获得持续<Yellow>5</>秒的腐蚀之爪效果：增伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>、使受到伤害的敌方单位移动速度降低<Yellow>*f**</>，持续<Yellow>4</>秒（对单目标生效1次）。该效果每<Yellow>10</>秒最多触发<Yellow>1</>次。"] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, activate Crimson Moon Crown, increasing the wearer's Damage Reduction by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintain Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked you, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spell</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain Corrosive Claw effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage dealt increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units taking damage have their movement speed reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (takes effect once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>满月诅咒</>：受到来自<Yellow>8</>米内的敌方伤害时，激活深红月冕，使玩家受到伤害降低<Yellow>*f**</>。对<Yellow>8</>米内攻击过自己的最多<Yellow>3</>个非首领目标维持满月诅咒，使其造成伤害降低<Yellow>*f**</>；深红月冕效果持续<Yellow>5</>秒，每<Yellow>10</>秒最多被激活<Yellow>1</>次。\n<Yellow>黑暗法术</>：对敌方目标造成伤害时，获得持续<Yellow>5</>秒的腐蚀之爪效果：伤害提高<Yellow>*f**</>、使受到伤害的敌方单位移动速度降低<Yellow>*f**</>，持续<Yellow>4</>秒（对单目标生效1次）。该效果每<Yellow>10</>秒最多触发<Yellow>1</>次。"] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, the Crimson Moon Crown is activated, reducing damage taken by the player by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintains the Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked the player, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; the Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spells</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain the Corrosive Claws effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units that take damage have their movement speed reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (applies once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续10秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The bearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the bearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the bearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, 1 stack is consumed per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the bearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed amount of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续10秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。\n身处主宰争锋玩法中时，生命手杖效果降低。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The wearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the wearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the wearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds.\n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consumes 1 stack per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP.\n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the wearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP. The effect of the Life Staff is reduced while in the Dominator's Clash mode.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续6秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The carrier gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a holding limit of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing the carrier causes to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own Max HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 layers of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 6 seconds, and 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</> is gained, with a holding limit of 3. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consume 1 layer per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the carrier takes damage, if HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of Max HP.",
    ["<Yellow>眷顾</>：佩戴者施放普攻和非解控类技能时，有概率触发持续10秒的<Yellow>幸运</>：每层提高移动速度<Yellow>*f**</>、暴击<Yellow>*d</>、技能增强<Yellow>*d</>。未触发幸运则积攒概率至下一次技能施放，直至触发。触发概率随持有<Yellow>幸运</>的层数逐渐降低，初始概率为<Yellow>25%</>，5层时触发概率降至0。"] = "<Yellow>Favor</>: When the wearer performs a Normal Attack or a non-cleansing skill, there is a chance to trigger <Yellow>Luck</> for 10 seconds: each stack increases movement speed by <Yellow>*f**</>, critical hit rate by <Yellow>*d</>, and Skill Enhancement by <Yellow>*d</>. If Luck is not triggered, the probability accumulates for the next skill cast until it triggers. The trigger probability gradually decreases with the number of <Yellow>Luck</> stacks, starting at <Yellow>25%</> and dropping to 0 at 5 stacks.",
    ["<Yellow>窥伺冥界</>：携带者获得技能<Yellow>黄昏面具</>：戴上面具，沉入现实和冥界的交界处，在无休止的尖啸刺激下，强化所有战斗技能，提升其<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</>攻击速度，每秒返还其冷却时间<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32秒}</>。携带者可承受<Yellow>20秒</>，期间若造成击杀或助攻，则能延长承受时间<Yellow>5秒</>，延长效果最多可触发<Yellow>2次</>。\n技能冷却时间：60秒。"] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>纸人庇护</>：主人受到致命伤害时，触发<Yellow>8</>秒的纸人庇护效果，期间纸人代主人承受过量伤害，提高主人的控制闪避<Yellow>*d</>和控制抵挡<Yellow>*d</>，使主人免疫移动速度降低效果。纸人承受的过量伤害总额不超过主人生命值上限的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</>。达到上限时，庇护效果提前结束。\n庇护效果每120秒最多触发一次。"] = "<Yellow>Paper Figurine Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Paper Figurine Protection effect. During this time, the paper figurine absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to movement speed reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the paper figurine cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>苏勒防身</>：携带者减伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>。\n<Yellow>苦难财富</>：携带者受到伤害时，根据累积受到伤害值提高防御，持续<Yellow>30秒</>，防御最多提高<Yellow>*d</>点。"] = "<Yellow>Sule's Self-Defense</>: The carrier's Damage Reduction is increased by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Wealth of Misery</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the cumulative damage received, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points.",
    ["<Yellow>苏勒防身</>：携带者受到伤害降低<Yellow>*f**</>。\n<Yellow>苦难财富</>：携带者受到伤害时，根据累积受到伤害值提高防御，持续<Yellow>30秒</>，防御最多提高<Yellow>*d</>点。"] = "<Yellow>Sule's Protection</>: Damage taken by the carrier is reduced by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Suffering Wealth</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the accumulated damage taken, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points.",
    ["<Yellow>金</>:%s  <Purple>紫</>:%s"] = "<Yellow> Gold </>:%s <Purple> Purple </>:%s",
    ["<Yellow>锈弹</>：攻击命中主目标时，有概率对其发射一枚墨绿的毒丸，使其身体腐蚀溃烂，每秒造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#占位#)</>点伤害，持续<Yellow>5</>秒，冷却时间5秒，期间攻击该目标，会触发<Yellow>毒液溅射</>效果，对<Yellow>8</>米范围内的最多6名其他敌对目标造成伤害，每2秒最多造成一次溅射。"] = "<Yellow>Rust Bullet</>: When an attack hits the main target, there is a chance to fire a dark green venom pellet, causing their body to suffer from Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds. Cooldown is 5 seconds. Attacking the target during this period will trigger the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within a <Yellow>8</>-meter radius. Splash damage can occur at most once every 2 seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>镇定情绪</>：战斗中激活，安抚携带者周围的敌方目标。若敌方目标身处携带者8米范围内超过3秒，则会进入持续4秒的<Yellow>迷失</>状态。敌方若攻击携带者，则会加速这一进程，触发加速的间隔为<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</>秒，敌方受到伤害则会延缓这一过程，触发延缓的间隔为2秒。\n每<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</>秒最多使周围目标进入一次迷失状态。\n\n<Yellow>迷失</>：buffdisc(*id)"] = "<Yellow>Calming Emotions</>: Activated in combat, pacifying enemy targets around the carrier. If an enemy target remains within 8 meters of the carrier for more than 3 seconds, they will enter a <Yellow>Lost</> state lasting 4 seconds. If the enemy attacks the carrier, this process is accelerated, with the acceleration interval being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</> seconds. If the enemy takes damage, this process is delayed, with the delay interval being 2 seconds. \nEvery <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</> seconds, targets nearby can be made to enter the Lost state at most once. \n\n<Yellow>Lost</>: buffdisc(*id)",
    ["<Yellow>霸体</>，减伤提高50%，并对攻击者反弹<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</>倍伤害，攻击者超过8米之外时，反弹伤害随距离衰减。"] = "<Yellow> Super Armor </>, damage reduction increased by 50%, and reflects <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times damage to the attacker. If the attacker is more than 8 meters away, reflected damage decays with distance.",
    ["<Yellow>飓风</>：持有者战斗中移动速度提高<Yellow>10%</>，普攻攻速提高<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>；\n<Yellow>闪电</>：持有者普攻命中敌对目标时，有<Yellow>15%</>的概率对目标释放闪电打击，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</>点伤害，闪电有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</>的基础概率造成<Yellow>3秒</>的滞涩效果。"] = "<Yellow>Hurricane</>: The holder's movement speed is increased by <Yellow>10%</> in combat, and Basic Attack speed is increased by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>; \n<Yellow>Lightning</>: When the holder's Basic Attack hits a hostile target, there is a <Yellow>15%</> probability of unleashing a Lightning Strike on the target, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</> damage. The lightning has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>3-second</> Stagnation effect.",
    ["<Yellow>黑面草之地</>：使携带者进入濒临诅咒状态，持续5分钟后，转化为<Yellow>背负诅咒</>状态。该状态下死亡时，会在原地长出一片半径8米的活化土地，持续10秒，对范围内的最多10名友方玩家施加下述效果：\n每秒恢复携带者生命值上限<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</>的生命值，优先选择剩余生命值较低的友方，超过5人则治疗量衰减；\n获得攻击提升效果，提升值为携带者攻击的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</>，最多对10人生效；\n免除<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</>人次控制效果。\n效果触发后，或者切换场景时，濒临诅咒重新开始生效。"] = "<Yellow>Land of Black-Faced Grass</>: Causes the carrier to enter a near-cursed state, which transforms into the <Yellow>Bearing the Curse</> state after 5 minutes. When dying in this state, an activated land with a radius of 8 meters will grow on the spot, lasting 10 seconds, applying the following effects to up to 10 friendly players in the range: \nRestores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</> of the carrier's maximum Health per second, prioritizing friendly units with lower remaining Health; if there are more than 5 people, the healing amount is reduced; \nGains an Attack Boost effect, with the increase value being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</> of the carrier's Attack, effective for up to 10 people; \nExempts <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</> instances of control effects. \nAfter the effect is triggered, or when switching scenes, the near-cursed state begins to take effect again.",
    ["<h> 追上去！</> "] = "<h> Chase after it!</>",
