    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>【活动时间】</>\n2026年8月27日8:00:00—2026年9月17日6:00:00\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>【鲁恩风尚】</>\n活动期间，点击传送前往各打卡点，与打卡点互动并完成拍照即可成功打卡。累计完成指定数量的打卡任务，即可领取对应奖励。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>【Event Time】</>\nAugust 27, 2026, 8:00:00 — September 17, 2026, 6:00:00\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>【Loen Fashion】</>\nDuring the event, click Teleport to go to various check-in points, interact with the check-in points, and complete taking photos to successfully check in. Accumulate the specified number of check-in tasks to claim corresponding rewards.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>保护胜点</>\n正常完成对局即可获得一定的保护胜点，保护胜点可以<Highlight>抵扣</>对局失败时扣除的胜点。\n原有保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n本局获得保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n本局应扣除胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n当前剩余保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Protection Points </> \n You can obtain a certain amount of protection points by completing matches normally. Protection points can <Highlight> offset </> the points deducted when a match is lost. \n Original Protection Points: <Highlight> %s </> \n Protection Points Obtained This Match: <Highlight> %s </> \n Points That Should Be Deducted This Match: <Highlight> %s </> \n Current Remaining Protection Points: <Highlight> %s </>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部分为休闲俱乐部和战斗俱乐部，可在俱乐部信息修改处进行调整，休闲俱乐部不会在成员列表显示非凡评分。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, obtain rich event rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop.\nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Beyonder ratings in the member list.\nClub member locking rules: During Club-based gameplay activities (such as Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), Clubs do not allow members to join or leave.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating a Responsive Club</>\nWhen your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create one yourself.\nCreating a Club requires paying a creation fee. If the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours after creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor active cancellation of creation will refund the creation fee.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a club to participate in various club activities, earn generous activity rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\nClub Member Lock Rule: During club-based gameplay activities (such as the Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), clubs are not allowed to add or remove members.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating/Responding to a Club</>\nOnce your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a club or create one yourself.\nCreating a club requires a creation fee. If 4 people respond within 24 hours of creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor voluntary cancellation will refund the creation fee.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部资金消耗</>\n建筑升级需要消耗俱乐部资金，并且需要等待一定时间。每个建筑都有对应的等级提升效果，其他建筑等级不能超过议事厅的等级。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>时间限制</>\n建筑升级上限随服务器时间逐步开放，每级的天数限制为:\n3级：开服第7天早晨8点后\n4级：开服第14天早晨8点后\n5级：开服第21天早晨8点后\n6级：开服第30天早晨8点后\n7级：开服第45天早晨8点后\n8级：开服第60天早晨8点后"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Club Fund Consumption </>\n Building upgrades consume club funds and require a certain amount of time. Each building has corresponding level-up effects, and other buildings cannot exceed the level of the Council Hall. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Time Restrictions </>\n Building upgrade caps are gradually unlocked based on server time. The daily limits for each level are: \n Level 3: After 8:00 AM on the 7th day of the server \n Level 4: After 8:00 AM on the 14th day of the server \n Level 5: After 8:00 AM on the 21st day of the server \n Level 6: After 8:00 AM on the 30th day of the server \n Level 7: After 8:00 AM on the 45th day of the server \n Level 8: After 8:00 AM on the 60th day of the server",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>光线追踪</>\n光线追踪是一种通过模拟光线在三维场景中的传播路径来生成逼真图像的渲染技术。开启光线追踪后，会让游戏内的光照效果更加真实。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>设备支持</>\n光线追踪需要特定的显卡支持，目前仅限<Highlight>NVIDIA RTX 20/30/40系列</>支持，建议玩家在开启光追前检查显卡驱动或更新显卡驱动。光线追踪对设备的性能要求较高，玩家需根据需求选择是否开启该功能。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ray Tracing </>\n Ray tracing is a rendering technique that generates realistic images by simulating the path of light in a 3D scene. Enabling ray tracing will make the lighting effects in the game more realistic. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Device Support </>\n Ray tracing requires specific graphics card support, currently limited to <Highlight> NVIDIA RTX 20/30/40 series </>. It is recommended that players check or update their graphics card drivers before enabling ray tracing. Ray tracing has high performance requirements for devices; players should choose whether to enable this feature based on their needs.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>全局期望质量</>\n调节特效质量与强度的全局开关，玩家与场景的特效质量无法高于全局设置。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>智能特效</>\n当玩家开启<Highlight>智能</>子选项后，特效效果将依据玩法类型进行<Highlight>动态</>调节。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Global Expected Quality</>\nA global switch to adjust the quality and intensity of special effects. The special effect quality of players and scenes cannot be higher than the global setting.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Smart Effects</>\nWhen the player enables the <Highlight>Smart</> sub-option, the special effect quality will be <Highlight>dynamically</> adjusted based on the gameplay type.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>友敌关系</>\n相同队伍、团队或俱乐部的成员视为友方，<Highlight>其余玩家均为敌对关系</>，可自由攻击。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>团队结算</>\n击败敌对玩家时，击杀者及最多<Highlight>29名</>符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与本次猩红遗物与段位胜点结算。\n本次可分配的猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配并向下取整。存在余数时，击杀者优先额外获得1个，其余部分在其他参与者中随机分配，每人最多额外获得1个。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>掠夺规则</>\n击败敌对玩家后，可从目标处掠夺<Highlight>段位胜点</>与其持有的<Highlight>猩红遗物</>。玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高<Highlight>500个</>，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位保护</>\n段位低于<Highlight>伯爵1阶</>的玩家，被击杀时不扣除段位胜点。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点衰减</>\n每日<Highlight>01:00—08:00</>，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点调整为正常值的<Highlight>10%</>，猎杀进度提供的段位胜点不受影响。\n同一玩家在10分钟内重复击杀同一目标时，第1—3次获得100%段位胜点，第4次获得50%，第5次获得20%，第6次及以后不再获得。两项衰减规则同时生效时，最终结果按比例乘算。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Friend/Enemy Relationship </> \n Members of the same team, group, or Club are considered allies; <Highlight> all other players are hostile </> and can be attacked freely. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Team Settlement </> \n When defeating a hostile player, the killer and up to <Highlight> 29 </> team members who meet the assist criteria participate in this Crimson Relic and Rank Point settlement. \n The distributable Crimson Relics are divided equally among the participants and rounded down. If there is a remainder, the killer gets priority for 1 extra, and the rest are distributed randomly among other participants, with each person receiving at most 1 extra. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Plunder Rules </> \n After defeating a hostile player, you can plunder <Highlight> Rank Points </> and the <Highlight> Crimson Relics </> they hold from the target. The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Crimson Relics that can be plundered; for every <Highlight> 500 </> fragments above the head, the plunder percentage increases accordingly. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Protection </> \n Players with a rank lower than <Highlight> Earl Tier 1 </> will not lose Rank Points when killed. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Point Decay </> \n Daily <Highlight> 01:00—08:00 </>, Rank Points obtained from killing players are adjusted to <Highlight> 10% </> of the normal value; Rank Points provided by hunting progress are not affected. \n When the same player kills the same target repeatedly within 10 minutes, the 1st—3rd times grant 100% Rank Points, the 4th time grants 50%, the 5th time grants 20%, and the 6th time and onwards grant none. When both decay rules are in effect simultaneously, the final result is calculated by multiplying the proportions.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>发起宣战</>\n1.可发起宣战的时间为：<Highlight>周一至周五17:00-23:00；周六至周日11:00-23:00</>。\n2.可宣战的时间点为：<Highlight>周一至周四12:00-14:00、20:00-23:00；周五12:00-14:00、21:00-23:00；周六至周日12:00-18:00、22:00-23:00</>。\n3.发起宣战将消耗俱乐部资金，资金根据俱乐部等级、实力差别及血仇值进行扣除。\n4.若宣战方获胜，则返还<Highlight>30%</>俱乐部资金，失败则不返还；若被宣战方失败则根据俱乐部等级扣除相应资金，获胜则不扣除。\n5.若连续宣战同一俱乐部并获胜，再次宣战消耗俱乐部资金将提升<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n6.若连续被同一俱乐部宣战并失败，再次被宣战消耗俱乐部资金将减少<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n1.俱乐部宣战将在霍纳奇斯山脉大世界地图进行自由战斗，宣战开始后，仅互相宣战的双方互相进入对决状态。\n2.立旗：发起方首先获得立旗权，<Highlight>（会长、副会长、理事）</>中任意一人立旗后，俱乐部立旗技能将消失。立旗后在旗帜周围根据存活时间以获得积分。\n3.旗帜轮换：旗帜归属时间结束后，立旗权将轮换至对方俱乐部，或可以通过<Highlight>抢旗成功</>后轮换立旗权。\n4.击败对手或参与击败对手，也将获得积分。\n5.整场宣战将持续<Highlight>30分钟</>，结算时积分高的一方获胜，若分数相同，则被发起宣战的一方获胜。\n6.宣战期间，可使用<Highlight>\"集结·俱乐部宣战\"</>道具在霍纳奇斯山脉中<Highlight>发起集结</>，道具可在同行商店-俱乐部中查看。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initiate War Declaration</>\n1. The time to initiate a war declaration is: <Highlight>Monday to Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 11:00-23:00</>. \n2. The time points for declaring war are: <Highlight>Monday to Thursday 12:00-14:00, 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00, 21:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 12:00-18:00, 22:00-23:00</>. \n3. Initiating a war declaration will consume Club Funds, which are deducted based on the club's level, strength difference, and Blood Feud value. \n4. If the declaring party wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the Club Funds will be refunded; if they lose, they will not be refunded. If the declared party loses, corresponding funds will be deducted based on the club's level; if they win, no funds will be deducted. \n5. If you continuously declare war on the same club and win, the Club Funds consumed for declaring war again will increase <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n6. If you are continuously declared war on by the same club and lose, the Club Funds consumed for being declared war on again will decrease <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n1. Club war declaration will take place in the Hornacis Mountain Range open world map for free combat. After the war declaration begins, only the two parties who declared war on each other will enter a duel state. \n2. Plant Flag: The initiating party first obtains the right to plant the flag. After any one of the <Highlight>(President, Vice President, Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill will disappear. After planting the flag, you will gain points based on the survival time around the flag. \n3. Flag Rotation: After the flag ownership time ends, the right to plant the flag will rotate to the other club, or the right to plant the flag can be rotated after <Highlight>successfully seizing the flag</>. \n4. Defeating opponents or participating in defeating opponents will also grant points. \n5. The entire war declaration will last for <Highlight>30 minutes</>. At the time of settlement, the party with the higher points wins. If the scores are the same, the party that was declared war on wins. \n6. During the war declaration, you can use the <Highlight>\"Assemble - Club War Declaration\"</> item to <Highlight>initiate an assembly</> in the Hornacis Mountain Range. The item can be viewed in the Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>发起宣战</>\n1.可发起宣战的时间为：<Highlight>周一至周五17:00-23:00；周六至周日11:00-23:00</>。\n2.可宣战的时间点为：<Highlight>周一至周四12:00-14:00、20:00-23:00；周五12:00-14:00、21:00-23:00；周六至周日12:00-18:00、22:00-23:00</>。\n3.发起宣战将消耗俱乐部资金，资金根据俱乐部等级、实力差别及血仇值进行扣除。\n4.若宣战方获胜，则返还<Highlight>30%</>俱乐部资金，失败则不返还；若被宣战方失败则根据俱乐部等级扣除相应资金，获胜则不扣除。\n5.若连续宣战同一俱乐部并获胜，再次宣战消耗俱乐部资金将提升<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n6.若连续被同一俱乐部宣战并失败，再次被宣战消耗俱乐部资金将减少<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n1.俱乐部宣战将在霍纳奇斯山脉大世界地图进行自由战斗，宣战开始后，仅互相宣战的双方互相进入对决状态。\n2.立旗：发起方首先获得立旗权，<Highlight>（会长、副会长、理事）</>中任意一人立旗后，俱乐部立旗技能将消失。立旗后在旗帜周围根据存活时间以获得积分。\n3.旗帜轮换：旗帜归属时间结束后，立旗权将轮换至对方俱乐部，或可以通过<Highlight>抢旗成功</>后轮换立旗权。\n4.击败对手或参与击败对手，也将获得积分。\n5.整场宣战将持续<Highlight>30分钟</>，结算时积分高的一方获胜，若分数相同，则被发起宣战的一方获胜。当一方积分大于另一方积分超过15000时，则积分高的一方直接获胜。\n6.宣战期间，可使用<Highlight>\"集结·俱乐部宣战\"</>道具在霍纳奇斯山脉中<Highlight>发起集结</>，道具可在同行商店-俱乐部中查看。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Declare War</>\n1. War can be declared during: <Highlight>Monday-Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 11:00-23:00</>.\n2. Available battle time slots: <Highlight>Monday-Thursday 12:00-14:00 and 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00 and 21:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 12:00-18:00 and 22:00-23:00</>.\n3. Declaring war consumes club funds. The amount is based on club level, the difference in strength, and Blood Feud value.\n4. If the declaring side wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the club funds are refunded; no funds are refunded after a loss. If the challenged side loses, funds are deducted according to club level; none are deducted if it wins.\n5. After repeatedly declaring war on and defeating the same club, the cost of declaring war on it again will increase <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n6. After repeatedly being challenged by and losing to the same club, the challenger's cost to declare war again will decrease <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Rules</>\n1. Club War is fought freely on the Hornacis Mountains open-world map. Once it begins, only the two clubs at war enter a combat state with each other.\n2. Planting the flag: the declaring side receives the first right to plant it. After any <Highlight>(President, Vice President, or Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill disappears. Members earn points around the flag based on survival time.\n3. Flag rotation: when a club's ownership period ends, the right to plant the flag rotates to the opposing club. It can also rotate after a <Highlight>successful flag capture</>.\n4. Defeating opponents or assisting in their defeat also awards points.\n5. The war lasts <Highlight>30 minutes</>. The side with more points at settlement wins; if tied, the challenged side wins. If one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the leading side wins immediately.\n6. During Club War, use the <Highlight>\"Rally · Club War\"</> item to <Highlight>start a rally</> in the Hornacis Mountains. The item is available in Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>召唤次数获取</>\n可通过以下方式获得召唤次数：\n<Highlight>每日刷新</>：每日可获得【灾异先锋】、【命运人偶】各1次召唤次数；\n<Highlight>领取猎杀进度奖励</>：解锁猎杀进度档位并领取奖励，可额外获得召唤次数。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重置规则</>\n召唤次数<Highlight>可在当周累积</>，每周一<Highlight>早上8:00</>统一重置。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Summon Counts</>\nYou can obtain summon counts in the following ways:\n<Highlight>Daily Refresh</>: You can obtain 1 summon count each for [Calamity Vanguard] and [Fate Marionette] daily;\n<Highlight>Claiming Hunt Progress Rewards</>: Unlock hunt progress tiers and claim rewards to obtain additional summon counts.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reset Rules</>\nSummon counts<Highlight> can be accumulated during the current week</> and will be uniformly reset every Monday at <Highlight>8:00 AM</>.\n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>培养推荐</>\n1.根据非凡者选取的<Highlight>目标场景</>、非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>和<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>，自动为非凡者推荐养成<Highlight>期望收益</>较大的属性；\n2.仅计算常见的<Highlight>养成属性</>，部分未显示属性（如攻击速度增幅、获得护盾增幅）不纳入计算范围；\n3.<Highlight>期望收益</>同时受到该属性在<Highlight>目标场景</>的<Highlight>能力提升幅度</>和<Highlight>养成难度</>的影响；\n4.<Highlight>期望收益</>仅考虑当前属性少量增加的情况，部分属性大量提升后（或与对抗目标的对抗属性相差较大时）的收益会<Highlight>显著增加</>或<Highlight>显著减少</>，推荐仅供参考。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Cultivation Recommendation </>\n 1. Based on the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> selected by the Beyonder, the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>, automatically recommend attributes with higher <Highlight>Expected Returns</> for the Beyonder's cultivation; \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Cultivation Attributes</> are calculated; some unshown attributes (such as Attack Speed Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> are simultaneously influenced by the <Highlight>Ability Improvement Magnitude</> of the attribute in the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> and the <Highlight>Cultivation Difficulty</>; \n 4. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> only consider the situation of a small increase in current attributes. After a large increase in some attributes (or when there is a large difference compared to the opponent's confrontation attributes), the returns will <Highlight>Significantly Increase</> or <Highlight>Significantly Decrease</>. The recommendation is for reference only.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n团队副本通关每个阶段后可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励，共计<Highlight>3</>个阶段，每个阶段奖励次数每周增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>2</>次。\n不同难度的副本每周增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>，即每周可领取<Highlight>6</>次奖励。解锁新副本时，之前剩余的奖励次数不会累积到新副本上。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>初始奖励次数：</>\n新副本解锁时会额外获得<Highlight>1</>次初始奖励次数，<Highlight>初始奖励次数优先消耗，且不计入累计次数上限，也不受共上限影响</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nAfter clearing each stage of a team dungeon, you can claim <Highlight>1</> reward, for a total of <Highlight>3</> stages. Reward counts for each stage increase by <Highlight>1</> weekly, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2</>. \nThe weekly reward count increase for different difficulties of dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>, meaning you can claim <Highlight>6</> rewards per week. When a new dungeon is unlocked, remaining reward counts from previous dungeons will not carry over. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initial reward counts: </>\nWhen a new dungeon is unlocked, you will receive an additional <Highlight>1</> initial reward count. <Highlight>Initial reward counts are consumed first and do not count towards the cumulative limit, nor are they affected by the shared cap.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n通关任意日常副本，可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励。奖励次数每日增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>3</>次，不同副本每日增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n当前日常副本：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nClearing any daily dungeon grants <Highlight>1</> reward. Reward counts increase by <Highlight>1</> daily, up to a maximum of <Highlight>3</>. The daily reward count increase for different dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\nCurrent daily dungeon: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</>. \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n队伍副本通关每个阶段后可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励，共计<Highlight>3</>个阶段，每个阶段奖励次数每周增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>2</>次。\n不同难度，不同类型的副本每周增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>，即每周可领取<Highlight>3</>次奖励。但解锁新副本时，之前剩余的奖励次数不会累积到新副本上。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>初始奖励次数：</>\n新副本解锁时会额外获得<Highlight>1</>次初始奖励次数，<Highlight>初始奖励次数优先消耗，且不计入累计次数上限，也不受共上限影响</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nAfter clearing each stage of a party dungeon, you can claim <Highlight>1</> reward, for a total of <Highlight>3</> stages. Reward counts for each stage increase by <Highlight>1</> weekly, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2</>. \nThe weekly reward count increase for different difficulties and types of dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>, meaning you can claim <Highlight>3</> rewards per week. However, when a new dungeon is unlocked, remaining reward counts from previous dungeons will not carry over. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initial reward counts: </>\nWhen a new dungeon is unlocked, you will receive an additional <Highlight>1</> initial reward count. <Highlight>Initial reward counts are consumed first and do not count towards the cumulative limit, nor are they affected by the shared cap.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数规则：</>\n通关任意难度的记忆的传承副本，可以领取<Highlight>一次性的</>通关奖励。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Frequency Rules: </>\nClear the Inheritance of Memory dungeon at any difficulty to claim a <Highlight>one-time</> clear reward.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数规则：</>\n通关此难度的乌托邦剧院，可以领取<Highlight>一次性的</>通关奖励。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Rules:</>\nClearing Utopia Theater at this difficulty allows you to claim a <Highlight>one-time </>clear reward.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>对等原则</>\n阿罗德斯遵循一问一答的对等原则，阿罗德斯的问题可以被拒绝或者积攒，但一定要被解决。\n若拒绝回答问题、回答错误或者撒谎，将会受到阿罗德斯的惩罚。\n阿罗德斯回答完毕以及提出的问题被解决后，才能再次发起提问。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>NPC说明</>\n阿罗德斯NPC的认知范围限制于诡秘之主世界观，在与阿罗德斯交流跨越时代背景或者思维跳脱的话题，阿罗德斯可能无法进行回答，敬请谅解。\n阿罗德斯NPC的回答均由AI模型生成，回答结果可能会出现内容模糊和偏差，可以通过对话框的举报按钮，进行对应反馈，帮助我们丰富阿罗德斯的体验效果。\n若同时互动玩家人数过高，阿罗德斯可能会出现响应时间过长的现象，在短暂等待后即可恢复。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Principle of Reciprocity</>\n Arrodes follows the principle of reciprocity: one question for one answer. Arrodes' questions can be refused or accumulated, but they must be resolved.\n If you refuse to answer a question, answer incorrectly, or lie, you will be punished by Arrodes.\n You can only initiate a new question after Arrodes has finished answering and the question posed by Arrodes has been resolved.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> NPC Note</>\n The Arrodes NPC's knowledge is limited to the Lord of Mysteries worldview. Arrodes may not be able to answer questions that transcend the era or involve abstract, jumping logic. We appreciate your understanding.\n The Arrodes NPC's answers are generated by an AI model, and results may be vague or inaccurate. You can use the report button in the chat box to provide feedback, helping us enrich Arrodes' experience.\n If too many players are interacting with Arrodes simultaneously, there may be a delay in response. It will recover after a short wait.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>展台编辑权限</>\n<Highlight>普通成员：</>仅可编辑本人角色。\n<Highlight>首席：</>可编辑所有成员角色、镜头、场景、置景、风向、调色。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>编辑使用权限</>\n<Highlight>编辑角色时：</>仅可使用<Highlight>被编辑者</>已解锁的动作与表情。\n<Highlight>编辑场景与置景时：</>仅可使用<Highlight>编辑者</>已解锁内容范围。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>内容移除规则</>\n成员离开家族时，其<Highlight>展台角色</>、所编辑的<Highlight>场景</>、<Highlight>置景</>将自动从展台移除。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>家族专属场景</>\n家族等级到达<Highlight>2级、6级时</>，将开放家族展台专属场景的使用权限。此类场景仅可在家族展台中使用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Exhibition Stand Editing Permissions</>\n<Highlight>Ordinary Member: </>Can only edit their own character. \n<Highlight>Chief: </>Can edit all member characters, camera, scene, set pieces, wind direction, and color grading. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Editing Usage Permissions</>\n<Highlight>When editing a character: </>Can only use actions and expressions already unlocked by the <Highlight>edited person</>. \n<Highlight>When editing scenes and set pieces: </>Can only use the scope of content already unlocked by the <Highlight>editor</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Content Removal Rules</>\nWhen a member leaves the Family, their <Highlight>exhibition character</>, edited <Highlight>scene</>, and <Highlight>set pieces</> will be automatically removed from the exhibition stand. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Family Exclusive Scenes</>\nWhen the Family reaches <Highlight>Level 2 or Level 6</>, the usage permissions for Family exhibition stand exclusive scenes will be unlocked. These scenes can only be used in the Family exhibition stand.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>征服宣令</>\n1、战略服开放期间，每周日12:00-19:30开放宣战；\n2、宣战开放时，可向俱乐部神选积分排名与己方俱乐部差距在3及之内的俱乐部宣战；\n3、可战斗时间为周日20:00-20:25、20:30-20：55两场，宣战方宣战时可自由选择任一时间段；\n4、一个俱乐部可以同时被多俱乐部宣战，若被多个俱乐部宣战，各进攻方也互为敌对阵营；\n5、俱乐部可同时处于宣战他人和被他人宣战状态，也可以同时宣战多个俱乐部，可在征服宣令界面在各战斗俱乐部场景自由传送；\n6、战斗中，进攻方需占据上下两座征服之碑（任意进攻方即可，无需同一进攻方占据），方可打开战争之门，攻打征服旌旗；\n7、若征服旌旗被攻占，进攻方全员获胜，并掠夺防守方神选积分，夺得尾刀方将获得更多神选积分；\n8、若时间结束征服旌旗未被攻占，进攻方全员失败，将损失俱乐部神选积分，防守方获得神选积分。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Conquest Decree</>\n1. During the Strategic Server opening period, declarations of war are open every Sunday from 12:00 to 19:30;\n2. When declarations of war are open, you can declare war on Clubs whose God-Chosen point ranking is within 3 places of your own Club;\n3. Battle times are two sessions: Sunday 20:00-20:25 and 20:30-20:55. The declaring party can freely choose either time period when declaring war;\n4. A Club can be declared war upon by multiple Clubs simultaneously. If declared war upon by multiple Clubs, each attacking party is also a hostile faction to the others;\n5. A Club can be in a state of declaring war on others and being declared war upon by others simultaneously. It can also declare war on multiple Clubs at the same time and can freely teleport between various combat Club scenes in the Conquest Decree interface;\n6. During battle, the attacking party must occupy the two Conquest Monuments (any attacking party is fine, no need for the same attacking party to occupy both) to open the War Gate and attack the Banner of Conquest;\n7. If the Banner of Conquest is captured, all members of the attacking party win and plunder the God-Chosen points of the defending party. The party that lands the final blow will receive more God-Chosen points;\n8. If the Banner of Conquest is not captured when time runs out, all members of the attacking party lose, will lose Club God-Chosen points, and the defending party will gain God-Chosen points.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战场背景</>\n<Highlight>末日将近</>，星空中的污染日益逼近，<Highlight>非凡事件</>频发。各大非凡俱乐部自发组织联合演练，在历史沙盘中模拟对抗，以应对即将到来的危机。<Highlight>四方联赛</>，便是其中规模最大、最接近实战的训练场。<Highlight>俱乐部</>同场竞技，争夺的不仅是荣誉，更是锤炼<Highlight>末日来临</>时守护人类的能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battlefield Background </>\n <Highlight> The apocalypse is near </>, corruption from the starry sky is closing in, and <Highlight> Beyonder incidents </> are frequent. Major Beyonder clubs have spontaneously organized joint drills, simulating confrontations in historical sandboxes to prepare for the coming crisis. The <Highlight> Four-Way League </> is the largest and most realistic training ground among them. <Highlight> Clubs </> compete in the same arena, vying not just for honor, but to hone the ability to <Highlight> protect humanity when the apocalypse arrives </>.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战场背景</>\n源自第四纪古战场的历史投影，仅在<Highlight>特定时段</>方可激活。未开启时，战场处于血皇帝亚利斯塔·图铎残存力量的主导之下，充斥着<Highlight>扭曲与杀戮</>。身处其中的非凡者皆受其影响，渴求铁与血的洗礼，体验<Highlight>厮杀的快感</>。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Battlefield Background</>\nA historical projection originating from the ancient battlefields of the Fourth Epoch, which can only be activated during <Highlight>specific periods</>. When not active, the battlefield is under the dominance of the residual power of the Red Emperor Alista Tudor, filled with <Highlight>distortion and slaughter</>. Beyonders within it are all affected by it, craving the baptism of iron and blood, and experiencing <Highlight>the thrill of slaughter</>.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战队人数</>\n战队成员上限<Highlight>6人</>，同途径人数不超过<Highlight>2人</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战队报名</>\n报名战队锁定后，无法取消战队报名，战队成员无法退出已报名战队。未报名战队仍可添加新的队员，继续报名。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Team Size </>\n The team member limit is <Highlight> 6 people </>, with no more than <Highlight> 2 people </> of the same pathway. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Team Registration </>\n Once team registration is locked, you cannot cancel registration, and team members cannot leave the registered team. Teams that have not registered can still add new members and continue to register.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>手动暂存</>\n可将当前改装方案保存至手动暂存记录中。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>自动暂存</>\n每次进行改装时，会按规则将改装前方案存入自动暂存记录，具体如下：\n若自动暂存记录未满，则方案将直接存入空位；\n若自动暂存记录已满，且方案风尚度<Highlight>高于</>记录中最低风尚度时，则自动替换风尚度最低的记录。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>暂存记录</> \n每条记录将保存一份车辆的<Highlight>改装数据</>，可随时预览并切换，并可在切换后的记录上继续改装。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>记录清除</> \n<Highlight>装配方案</>和<Highlight>封装车辆</>后，会清除车辆携带的所有暂存记录。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Manual Temporary Storage</>\nYou can save the current modification plan to the manual temporary storage record. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Automatic Temporary Storage</>\nEach time you perform a modification, the pre-modification plan will be stored in the automatic temporary storage record according to the rules, as follows: \nIf the automatic temporary storage record is not full, the plan will be directly stored in an empty slot; \nIf the automatic temporary storage record is full, and the plan's Fashion Value <Highlight>is higher than</> the lowest Fashion Value in the record, it will automatically replace the record with the lowest Fashion Value. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Temporary Storage Record</> \nEach record will save a copy of the vehicle's <Highlight>modification data</>, which can be previewed and switched at any time, and you can continue to modify on the switched record. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Record Clearing</> \n<Highlight>Assembly Plan</> and <Highlight>Encapsulating Vehicle</> will clear all temporary storage records carried by the vehicle.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演与消化</>\n通过扮演魔药名称（也即序列名称）代表的角色，完成消化任务，提升消化进度，总结扮演守则。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演守则</>\n非凡者总结出相应的扮演守则，按照守则行事，能帮助非凡者绕过阻碍、瓦解魔药内残余的精神影响，从而降低失控风险、加速消化魔药，掌控非凡能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting and Digestion</>\nBy acting out the role represented by the potion name (which is also the Sequence name), you can complete digestion quests, increase your digestion progress, and summarize the Acting Principles.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Acting Principles</>\nBeyonders who summarize the corresponding Acting Principles and act according to them can help bypass obstacles and dissolve the residual mental influence within the potion, thereby reducing the risk of loss of control, accelerating potion digestion, and mastering Beyonder abilities.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>提升评估</>\n1.展示此物品的<Highlight>属性词条</>带来的能力提升，不考虑特殊效果（如装备的烙印、套装、恩赐效果，封印物愚者词条）的影响；\n2.仅计算常见的<Highlight>攻防属性</>，部分特殊属性（如攻击速度增幅、获得护盾增幅）不纳入计算范围；\n3.提升幅度会随选取的<Highlight>目标场景</>、非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>和<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>变动，并非完全准确，仅供参考。\n4.当非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>与<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>差距过大时，部分效果值已达上限或下限，提升幅度会迅速衰减甚至归零，此时的评估会严重失真。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Improvement Assessment </>\n 1. Displays the ability improvement brought by the <Highlight>Attribute Entries</> of this item, without considering the influence of special effects (such as equipment imprints, sets, boon effects, Sealed Artifact Fool entries); \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Attack and Defense Attributes</> are calculated; some special attributes (such as Attack Speed Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. The improvement magnitude will change with the selected <Highlight>Target Scenario</>, the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>. It is not completely accurate and is for reference only. \n 4. When the gap between the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</> and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</> is too large, some effect values have reached the upper or lower limit, and the improvement magnitude will decay rapidly or even return to zero. The assessment at this time will be severely distorted.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>操作方式</>\n通过<Highlight>鼠标拖动</>或<Highlight>右下角的按钮</>旋转中央的锁芯，利用锁扣带动外圈的锁圈。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>完成条件</>\n调整内外圈锁芯的位置，<Highlight>旋转缺口</>到<Highlight>钥匙</>处，让钥匙能够插入锁芯。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Operation Method</>\nRotate the central lock core by <Highlight>dragging with the mouse</> or using the <Highlight>button in the bottom right corner</>, using the lock catch to drive the outer lock ring. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Completion Conditions</>\nAdjust the positions of the inner and outer lock cores, <Highlight>rotate the notch</> to the <Highlight>key</>, so that the key can be inserted into the lock core.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>改装效果</>\n通过神铸改装，可对车辆的外观和性能进行改变。具体每个部位的改装效果如下：\n<Highlight>涂装：</>改变车漆效果\n<Highlight>车身：</>改变车身造型\n<Highlight>轮胎：</>改变轮胎造型\n<Highlight>车牌：</>改变车牌造型和车牌号码\n<Highlight>引擎：</>改变车辆性能、手感、引擎声浪以及尾焰\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>部位解锁</>\n驭械秘印可在<Highlight>商城-形象铭刻</>中购买获取。改装时，每消耗<Highlight>1个</>驭械秘印，车辆会增加<Highlight>10~12点</>改装值。当改装值累积到一定数量时，会解锁新的改装部位。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>部位锁定</>\n改装时，可以对部位进行锁定，被锁定的部位在改装时不会改变。同时，锁定部位进行改装时，驭械秘印消耗数量会增加。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案品质</>\n每个部位的改装方案按照品质分为：<Quality_3>普通</>/<Quality_4>稀有</>/<Quality_5>非凡</>/<Quality_6>神眷</>/<Quality_7>神铸</>，开放规则具体如下：\n解锁<Highlight>1个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_3>普通</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>2个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_4>稀有</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>3个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_5>非凡</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>4个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_6>神眷</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>5个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n风尚度随机范围随方案品质提升，此外随着驭械秘印的消耗数量提升，也将提升风格值的随机范围。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率公示</>\n<Quality_3>普通</>级方案概率：55%\n<Quality_4>稀有</>级方案概率：29.7%\n<Quality_5>非凡</>级方案概率：11.4%，每20次改装必定出现<Quality_5>非凡</>及以上方案\n<Quality_6>神眷</>级方案概率：2.9%，每60次改装必定出现<Quality_6>神眷</>及以上方案\n<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案概率：1%，每200次改装必定出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n锁定四个部位后，<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案概率提升至3.7%，每30次改装必定出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>二手车交易</>\n因二手车交易政策限制，拥有车牌（改装值在<Highlight>1600及以上</>）的神铸改装车辆可封装为道具，在交易行进行出售。每辆二手车外观激活后，需等待30日才可再次进行封装。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Beyonder</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Beyonder</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案</>\n方案分为非凡方案与装备方案，非凡方案是角色技能、天赋、封印物组成的搭配，装备方案是角色装备、恩赐、套装效果组成的搭配。当前方案会随玩家的当前搭配实时变动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案切换</>\n通过技能-非凡方案或装备-装备方案，将特定的搭配保存为方案后，即可通过方案切换，一键更改当前的搭配。战斗状态下无法进行方案切换。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>成组切换</>\n可将特定的非凡方案和装备方案打包为成组方案，切换成组方案时可以同时切换装备和非凡方案。可以为成组方案设置自动切换，前往特定场景时自动切为特定的成组方案。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Schemes</>\n Schemes are divided into Beyonder Schemes and Equipment Schemes. Beyonder Schemes consist of character skills, talents, and Sealed Artifacts, while Equipment Schemes consist of character equipment, gifts, and set effects. The current scheme updates in real-time based on the player's current setup.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Scheme Switching</>\n Through Skills-Beyonder Schemes or Equipment-Equipment Schemes, you can save specific setups as schemes and then switch them with one click. You cannot switch schemes while in combat.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Group Switching</>\n You can bundle specific Beyonder Schemes and Equipment Schemes into Group Schemes. When switching Group Schemes, you can change both equipment and Beyonder schemes simultaneously. You can set up automatic switching for Group Schemes to automatically change to a specific scheme when entering certain areas.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>核心目标</>\n收集<Highlight>猩红遗物</>并提交至猎杀管家，<Highlight>推进猎杀进度，解锁阶段奖励</>。猩红遗物可通过<Highlight>击败敌对玩家进行掠夺</>，或<Highlight>击杀猎龙之城中的怪物</>获得。猩红遗物仅在<Highlight>猎龙之城</>内有效，离开后将自动失效并清除。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Core Goal </> \n Collect <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </> and submit them to the Hunting Butler to <Highlight> advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards </>. Scarlet Relics can be obtained by <Highlight> defeating enemy players to plunder them </> or <Highlight> killing monsters in the City of Dragon Hunting </>. Scarlet Relics are only valid within the <Highlight> City of Dragon Hunting </> and will automatically become invalid and be cleared upon leaving.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位奖励</>\n每个赛季达到对应段位后，即可领取对应奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n赛季结束后，奖励内容将会重置。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Rank Rewards</>\n Once you reach the corresponding rank each season, you can claim the corresponding rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Season Reset</>\n After the season ends, the reward content will be reset.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>比赛规则</>\n赛场使用<Highlight>玩家真实属性</>，<Highlight>装备、封印物、秘偶、人脉、非凡天赋系统效果</>均可生效。玩家将以战队形式进行比赛，每个战队内同途径玩家最多为两名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>报名规则</>\n比赛报名开启后，玩家即可组建或加入战队，战队成员<Highlight>达到5名</>后即可报名。\n开启报名至锁定报名期间，战队队长可自由调整战队成员，成员也可自由离开战队，已报名战队若成员变动导致成员数量小于5名后将自动取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>锁定规则</>\n锁定报名期间，已报名战队可以进入准备场地，未报名战队仍可以进行报名操作，玩家也可以加入战队，但不可以主动离开或队长请离战队，已报名战队将不允许取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>对战规则</>\n比赛正式开始后，玩家需要<Highlight>停留在准备场地</>以保证正常进入比赛，擅自离开准备场地将导致无法正常参加比赛。\n小组赛阶段，每轮随机匹配对手进行单局比赛，共进行六轮，根据胜场数选出16支队伍晋级，胜场数相同会根据<Highlight>荣耀值决出晋级者（荣耀值参考击杀数、战斗时长）</>。\n小组赛结束后进入助力阶段，淘汰赛开始前根据<Highlight>助力值和荣耀值总和</>确定淘汰赛位次，淘汰赛开始后仍可进行助力，但不再影响淘汰赛位次。\n淘汰赛阶段将进行<Highlight>三局两胜</>来确定胜负，决赛将进行<Highlight>五局三胜</>决出冠军！"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Match Rules </>\n The arena uses <Highlight> player's real attributes </>, and the effects of <Highlight> equipment, Sealed Artifacts, marionettes, connections, and Beyonder talent systems </> are all effective. Players will compete as a team, with a maximum of two players of the same pathway per team. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Registration Rules </>\n Once match registration opens, players can form or join a team. Once a team <Highlight> reaches 5 members </>, they can register. \n From the opening of registration until it is locked, the team leader can freely adjust members, and members can freely leave. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Locking Rules </>\n During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area. Unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the leader. Registered teams cannot cancel their registration. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battle Rules </>\n After the match officially begins, players must <Highlight> stay in the preparation area </> to ensure they enter the match normally; leaving the preparation area without authorization will result in being unable to participate. \n In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for a single-game match. There are six rounds in total, and 16 teams are selected to advance based on wins. If wins are tied, <Highlight> Glory Value (based on kills and combat duration) </> will determine the advancer. \n After the group stage, the support phase begins. Before the knockout stage, the knockout bracket is determined based on the <Highlight> sum of support value and Glory Value </>. Support can still be given after the knockout stage begins, but it will no longer affect the bracket. \n The knockout stage will use a <Highlight> best-of-three </> format to determine the winner, and the final will use a <Highlight> best-of-five </> format to determine the champion!",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活动规则</>\n活动开放期间，每日12:00至24:00，可前往霍纳奇斯花海时之门处，申请参与。进入玩法后，玩家将和世界灾厄进行战斗。玩法支持单人或队伍申请，建议<Highlight>完成组队后再进行申请</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活动奖励</>\n世界灾厄死亡时，参与战斗的玩家根据贡献值可获得灾厄残迹。每周最多获得<Highlight>1200个</>。灾厄残迹达到一定档位时可在世界灾厄介绍页领取对应档位的奖励。\n世界灾厄死亡时，根据队伍的输出伤害换算成积分进行排名。每周前1000排名的玩家可获得排名奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>排行榜说明</>\n组队情况下，会取玩家所在队伍成员的<Highlight>输出伤害前5的总和</>作为排名积分。\n在战斗中，队伍成员发生变动时，将自动取消积分排名的资格。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rules </>\n During the event, you may apply to participate at the Gate of Time in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers between 12:00 and 24:00 daily. Upon entering, players will battle the World Calamity. This mode supports solo or team applications; it is recommended to <Highlight> form a team before applying </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rewards </>\n When the World Calamity dies, participating players receive Calamity Remnants based on their contribution. You can earn a maximum of <Highlight> 1200 </> per week. Once your Calamity Remnants reach certain thresholds, you can claim corresponding rewards on the World Calamity introduction page. \n When the World Calamity dies, rankings are calculated based on the team's damage output. The top 1000 players each week receive ranking rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ranking Explanation </>\n In a team, the <Highlight> sum of the top 5 damage outputs </> from team members is used as the ranking score. \n If team members change during combat, the team is automatically disqualified from the ranking.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活跃度等级</>\n俱乐部活跃度等级由高到低分为\n会务冷清(＜720)\n常规运营（720~2400）\n事务繁荣（＞2400）\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活跃度来源</>\n活跃津贴\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活跃度说明</>\n俱乐部活跃度越高，每周俱乐部分红奖励越高。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活跃度消耗</>\n俱乐部每日维护将扣除%d%%的当前活跃度，活跃度连续%d日处于会务冷清时，则降低%d级议事厅等级。议事厅等级低于%d级，俱乐部将自动解散。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Activity Level</>\nClub activity levels are ranked from high to low as: \nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Sources of Activity</>\nActivity Allowance\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Activity Description</>\nThe higher the club activity, the higher the weekly club dividend rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Activity Consumption</>\nDaily club maintenance will deduct %d%% from the current activity. If the activity remains at 'Quiet Affairs' for %d consecutive days, the Council Hall level will decrease by %d. If the Council Hall level falls below level %d, the club will be automatically disbanded.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>猎杀时刻活动时间</>\n<Highlight>每日19:00—20:00</>开放；每周六、周日额外开放<Highlight>14:00—15:00</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>王城区域限时事件</>\n猎杀时刻期间，可在王城中心【异变营地】限时召唤<Highlight>命运人偶</>，击败后可获得猩红遗物材料。\n每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>巨龙·投影</>。击退巨龙时，当前有效归属伤害最高的团队获得拍卖奖励。每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。\n除周五晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始<Highlight>10分钟后</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>王城守卫者</>。击败王城守卫者后，完成最后一击的团队成员共享对应奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点双倍收益</>\n猎杀时刻期间，击杀敌对玩家可掠夺<Highlight>双倍段位胜点</>；被击杀时，损失的段位胜点同样翻倍。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time event time</>\n<Highlight>Open daily from 19:00—20:00; additionally open every Saturday and Sunday from </><Highlight>14:00—15:00</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Royal City area limited-time event</>\nDuring Hunting Time, you can summon a limited-time <Highlight>Fate Marionette</> at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City. Defeating it will grant Crimson Relic materials.\n10 minutes after<Highlight> the Hunting Time event begins on Friday night</>, i.e., at <Highlight>19:10</>, a <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective damage contribution will receive auction rewards. During each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the final kill auction qualification for the <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> at most 1 time; players who have already obtained this qualification cannot obtain it again during the current event.\nExcept for the Friday night session, 10 minutes after<Highlight> other Hunting Time events begin</>, a <Highlight>Royal City Guardian</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, the team members who land the final blow will share the corresponding rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Double Rank Point Gains</>\nDuring Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight>double Rank Points</>; when killed, the Rank Points lost are also doubled.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>猎杀时刻活动时间</>\n常规时段：终末猎杀全天开放；\n<Highlight>高倍时段：每日19:00 – 20:00；额外时段：每周六、周日14:00 – 15:00。</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time Event Time</>\nRegular period: Terminal Hunt is open all day;\n<Highlight>High-multiplier period: 19:00 – 20:00 daily; Extra period: 14:00 – 15:00 every Saturday and Sunday.</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n主宰争锋为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成3人队伍参与匹配。进入主宰争锋玩法后，所有玩家获得<Highlight>公平</>的属性调整。\n玩家需要击败敌方队伍内的所有玩家，或者限时内伤害更高，才能取得对局胜利。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nDominator's Clash is a team-based competitive mode where you can form a squad of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering Dominator's Clash, all players receive <Highlight>fair</> attribute adjustments. \nPlayers must defeat all members of the opposing team or deal more damage within the time limit to achieve victory.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n主宰争锋为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成3人队伍参与匹配。进入主宰争锋玩法后，所有玩家获得<Highlight>公平</>的属性调整，<Highlight>封印物统一为“3级”</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n进入玩法后，死亡的玩家<Highlight>无法</>被观众途径<Highlight>复活</>。玩家需要击败敌方队伍内的所有玩家，或者限时内伤害更高才能取得对局胜利。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n Dominator's Clash is a team competition mode where you can form a team of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering, all players receive <Highlight> fair </> attribute adjustments, and <Highlight> Sealed Artifacts are standardized to \"Level 3\" </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n Once in the mode, players who die <Highlight> cannot </> be resurrected by the Spectator <Highlight> pathway </>. Players must defeat all members of the enemy team or have higher damage output within the time limit to win the match.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n在命运时刻战场中，非凡者分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Highlight>4分钟</>，对局结束时分数较高的一方获胜，积分相同则依次判断击杀数和伤害量，高的一方获胜，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>机制说明</>\n<Highlight>积分获取：</>可通过拾取增益光点、击杀、助攻、进入纷争漩涡争夺来获取。\n<Highlight>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Highlight>15秒</>，届时根据锚点<Highlight>需求人数</>进入锚点，人数达到要求后持续<Highlight>3秒</>后将会将本阵营非凡者集结于此，同时参与集结的非凡者将获得限时属性加成。\n<Highlight>纷争漩涡：</>战场中间会出现纷争漩涡，纷争漩涡<Highlight>倒计时结束时</>留在漩涡内的非凡者将平分积分。\n<Highlight>增益光点：</>战场中会出现增益光点，拾取增益光点会获得<Highlight>积分及属性加成</>。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Beyonders must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n在命运时刻战场中，非凡者分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Highlight>4分钟</>，对局结束时分数较高的一方获胜，积分相同则依次判断击杀数和伤害量，高的一方获胜，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>机制说明</>\n<Highlight>积分获取：</>可通过拾取增益光点、击杀、助攻、进入纷争漩涡争夺来获取。\n<Highlight>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Highlight>15秒</>，届时根据锚点<Highlight>需求人数</>进入锚点，人数达到要求后持续<Highlight>3秒</>后将会将本阵营非凡者集结于此，同时参与集结的非凡者将获得限时属性加成。\n<Highlight>纷争漩涡：</>战场中间会出现纷争漩涡，纷争漩涡<Highlight>倒计时结束时</>留在漩涡内的非凡者将平分积分。\n<Highlight>增益光点：</>战场中会出现增益光点，拾取增益光点会获得<Highlight>积分及属性加成</>。\n<Highlight>命运蘑菇：</>非凡者在命运时刻战场中，连续阵亡三次后会掉落命运蘑菇：友方阵亡将掉落拥有丰饶力量的绿色命运蘑菇，拾取后恢复生命值，敌方阵亡将掉落拥有毁灭力量的红色命运蘑菇，拾取后将扣除生命值，请注意分辨后拾取。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n愚者棋局为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成8人队伍参与匹配。进入愚者棋局玩法后，所有非凡者<Highlight>挑选棋子出场战斗</>，并通过<Highlight>凑齐羁绊、提升棋子星级</>来提升强度，最终击败所有对手。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n进入玩法后，淘汰的非凡者可以继续留在场上<Highlight>旁观</>其他非凡者。非凡者需要通过棋子对战，击败其他所有非凡者的棋子阵容，才能取得对局胜利。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>组队规则</>\n多人组队时，将按照<Highlight>队伍内最高段位非凡者</>的水平开始匹配。若组队人数大于等于6人，则非凡者无法获得胜点。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nFool's Gambit is a team competition gameplay where up to 8 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. After entering the Fool's Gambit gameplay, all Beyonders <Highlight>choose chess pieces to fight</> and increase their strength by <Highlight>collecting bonds and upgrading the star level of the chess pieces</>, eventually defeating all opponents. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning conditions </>\nAfter entering the gameplay, eliminated Beyonders can remain on the field to <Highlight>spectate</> other Beyonders. Beyonders need to use chess piece battles to defeat the chess piece lineups of all other Beyonders to win the match. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Team formation rules </>\nWhen forming a team with multiple people, matchmaking will begin according to the level of the <Highlight>highest-ranked Beyonder in the team</>. If the number of people in the team is 6 or more, Beyonders cannot obtain victory points.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n神座之争为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成6人队伍参与匹配。神座之争玩法内，所有玩家采用与玩法外相同的<Highlight>真实</>属性进行战斗。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n限时时间内击败敌方队伍内所有玩家获胜，若对局时间结束时双方队伍均有成员存活，则顺次按照击败人数、存活人数、伤害总量、存活血量判定较高的一方获胜。在神座之争玩法里，每个队伍拥有<Highlight>2次复活</>死亡队友的机会。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n Battle for the Throne of God is a team competition mode, where up to 6 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, all players use the same <Highlight>Real</> attributes as outside the mode for combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning Conditions</>\nDefeat all players in the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the match time ends, the side with more kills, more survivors, higher total damage, and higher remaining health will be judged the winner in order. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, each team has <Highlight>2 opportunities to resurrect</> dead teammates.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n竞技之约是支持<Highlight>跨服自由组队</>的PVP房间系统，可邀请好友与同好共聚一堂，体验<Highlight>主宰争锋、神座之争、命运时刻、四方联赛、1v1决斗</>等多种玩法，自定义对局，尽情切磋。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nThe Covenant of Competition is a PVP room system that supports <Highlight>cross-server free team formation</>. You can invite friends and like-minded people to gather together to experience various gameplays such as <Highlight>Dominator's Clash, Battle for the Throne of God, Moment of Fate, Four-Way League, and 1v1 Duels</>, customize matches, and spar to your heart's content.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>理智值</>\n在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>安魂</>\n加入安魂诗社的玩家可以对其他玩家进行安魂，<Highlight>回复</>对应玩家的理智值。\n\n打开灵视之后，点击其他玩家可以查看他的理智值状态。当目标玩家的理智值<Highlight>低于一定值</>时，即可对其发起安魂。\n安魂的<Highlight>治疗成功率</>取决于两个因素：安魂者所在<Highlight>社团的等级</>，以及被安魂者当前的<Highlight>理智值高低</>。社团等级越高、对方理智值越高，安魂成功的概率也越高。\n需要注意的是，安魂并非没有风险——<Highlight>若安魂失败</>，参与双方的理智值均有概率受到波动，产生一定损耗。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Sanity </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's sanity to fluctuate. As sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and spirit body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's sanity. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their sanity status. When the target player's sanity <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> sanity level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's sanity, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing sanity fluctuations and incurring a certain loss.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>理智值</>\n在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n\n理智值充足时，角色处于<Highlight>「心智锚定」</>状态，体力消耗下降且减伤提升；降至正常水平则进入<Highlight>「清醒」</>状态，该状态没有任何效果。\n\n随着理智值进一步下降，角色依次进入<Highlight>「心神不宁」「自我存疑」「低语缠身」</>状态，体力与冲刺稳定性受到不同程度的削弱，周遭将出现呓语干扰。\n\n当理智值降至较低区间，角色进入<Highlight>「陷入疯狂」</>状态，行动限制完全解除，伤害与受到伤害均有所提升。\n\n理智值跌至最低时，角色进入<Highlight>「失控边缘」</>状态，<Highlight>伤害提升</>，但受到伤害同步增加，且受到的治疗效果降低，自身发出红光，视野变得疯狂。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>恢复理智</>\n当理智值降至一定程度时，玩家可向安魂诗社成员寻求帮助以恢复理智值。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>失控</>\n若角色长时间处于「失控」状态而未得到净化，五体的侵蚀将持续加深，届时可能引发难以预料的严重后果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Sanity</>\nWhen acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Sanity to fluctuate. As Sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually erode the Ether Body, Mental Body, Astral Body, and Spirit Body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence, producing corresponding effects. \n\nWhen Sanity is sufficient, the character is in the <Highlight>\"Mental Anchor\"</> state, with reduced stamina consumption and increased damage reduction; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Sober\"</> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Sanity decreases further, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Restlessness,\" \"Self-Doubt,\" and \"Whispers Haunting\"</> states in sequence. Stamina and sprint stability will be weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to a low range, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Falling into Madness\"</> state; movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage received are increased. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to the minimum, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Edge of Loss of Control\"</> state, <Highlight>Damage Increase</>, but damage received also increases, and healing effects received are reduced. The character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Restore Sanity</>\nWhen Sanity drops to a certain level, players can seek help from members of the Requiem Poetry Society to restore Sanity. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Loss of Control</>\nIf a character remains in a \"loss of control\" state for a long time without being purified, the erosion of the five bodies will continue to deepen, which may lead to unpredictable and serious consequences.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>社交奖励领取规则：</>\n通关副本时，若队伍满足以下任一条件，对应成员可获得社交奖励：\n队伍中有 3 名及以上来自同一家族的玩家时，该家族的队伍成员可获得奖励。\n队伍中有 3 名及以上来自同一俱乐部的玩家时，该俱乐部的队伍成员可获得奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数消耗规则：</>\n社交奖励次数仅在满足领取条件且通关副本时消耗。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Social Reward Claiming Rules: </>\nWhen clearing a dungeon, if the team meets any of the following conditions, the corresponding members can obtain social rewards: \nWhen there are 3 or more players from the same Family in the team, the team members of that Family can obtain rewards. \nWhen there are 3 or more players from the same Club in the team, the team members of that Club can obtain rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward count consumption rules: </>\nSocial reward counts are only consumed when the claim conditions are met and the dungeon is cleared.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>秘宝简介</>\n1、秘宝分为<Highlight>世界冒险秘宝</>、<Highlight>以战养战秘宝</>、<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>，不同秘宝进度与奖励彼此独立。\n2、开启秘宝可获得对应装等的装备，<Highlight>世界冒险和以战养战秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>丰富的养成资源</>，<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>可交易的资源</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获得秘宝</>\n1、参与对应玩法可<Highlight>累积秘宝进度</>，秘宝进度满后可自动转化为获得对应类型的秘宝。\n2、35装等、45装等、55装等的秘宝进度转化秘宝有次数上限，最多<Highlight>10</>次，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>开启次数累计</>\n从周一开始时，每日新增并累积共享开启次数，直到下周一重置。若当周次数未使用，将会被清空。具体规则如下：\n1. 周一到周五每天新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数；\n2. 从开服第二周开始，周六到周日<Highlight>不限次</>；\n3. 开服首周的周五、周六、周日仍然会每日新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数。\n4. 已获得但未开启的秘宝在解锁新的秘宝后可手动进行丢弃。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活力消耗规则</>\n共享开启次数消耗的活力将随着非凡者已开启次数增加。具体规则如下：\n1-5次：消耗<Highlight>20</>活力；\n6-10次：消耗<Highlight>50</>活力；\n11-20次：消耗<Highlight>100</>活力；\n21-30次：消耗<Highlight>150</>活力；\n30次以后：消耗<Highlight>200</>活力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Beyonder's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>积分说明</>\n在<Highlight>战略服筛选阶段</>的联赛前两轮，将启用战略服筛选积分规则。战略服筛选积分与用于判定当前比赛胜负的<Highlight>局内积分相互独立</>。局内积分用于决定当前比赛的胜负与名次；战略服筛选积分根据每场比赛名次及每轮最终排名累计，用于决定俱乐部的战略服筛选排名与晋级资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>单场名次积分</>\n每场比赛结束后，根据俱乐部在该场比赛中的最终名次获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：30分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：15分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：10分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：5分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第一轮最终排名积分</>\n第一轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：60分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：45分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：40分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：10分</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>第二轮最终排名积分</>\n第二轮全部比赛结束后，根据俱乐部最终排名额外获得战略服筛选积分：\n<Highlight>第1名：200分</>\n<Highlight>第2名：100分</>\n<Highlight>第3名：70分</>\n<Highlight>第4名：50分</>\n<Highlight>第5至第8名：15分</>\n战略服筛选阶段的联赛前两轮结束后，将根据各俱乐部累计获得的<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>进行排名。本赛区战略服筛选总积分<Highlight>前4名</>的俱乐部将晋级<Highlight>四方联赛天启组</>，并获得<Highlight>参与战略服</>的资格。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>同分排序规则</>\n战略服筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战略服筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Points Explanation</>\nDuring the first two rounds of the league in the <Highlight>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening points rules will be enabled. Strategic Server Screening points are independent of the <Highlight>In-match Points</> used to determine the outcome of the current match. In-match Points are used to determine the victory and ranking of the current match; Strategic Server Screening points are accumulated based on the ranking of each match and the final ranking of each round, and are used to determine the club's Strategic Server Screening ranking and qualification for advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Single Match Ranking Points</>\nAfter each match, Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking in that match:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 30 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 15 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 10 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 5 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>First Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the first round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 60 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 45 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 40 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 10 points</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Second Round Final Ranking Points</>\nAfter all matches in the second round are completed, additional Strategic Server Screening points are awarded based on the club's final ranking:\n<Highlight>1st Place: 200 points</>\n<Highlight>2nd Place: 100 points</>\n<Highlight>3rd Place: 70 points</>\n<Highlight>4th Place: 50 points</>\n<Highlight>5th to 8th Place: 15 points</>\nAfter the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening phase are completed, rankings will be based on the <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> accumulated by each club. The top <Highlight>4 clubs</> in total Strategic Server Screening points for this division will advance to the <Highlight>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Highlight>participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tie-breaking Rules</>\nThe Strategic Server Screening ranking is primarily ordered from high to low based on <Highlight>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</>. When total points are tied: After the first or second round of the league, clubs are ranked according to their <Highlight>Final Ranking</> in that round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, if a final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, tied clubs will not be distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round.\n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>胜点说明</>\n完成比赛将根据胜负与表现情况给予或扣除一定胜点。玩家段位每满<Highlight>100胜点</>，可以提升至下一阶。胜点扣除后若当前段位胜点<Highlight>小于0</>，则会掉至上一小段。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>保护段位</>\n男爵及以下段位时，对局<Highlight>不会扣除</>胜点。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Victory Points Explanation</>\nCompleting a match will grant or deduct a certain number of Victory Points based on the win/loss and performance. For every <Highlight>100 Victory Points</> a player earns, they can advance to the next tier. If the current tier's Victory Points <Highlight>drop below 0</> after deduction, the player will drop to the previous sub-tier. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tier Protection</>\nAt the Baron tier and below, matches <Highlight>will not deduct</> Victory Points.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>胜点说明</>\n完成比赛将根据胜负与表现情况给予或扣除一定胜点。玩家段位每满<Highlight>100胜点</>，可以提升至下一阶。胜点扣除后若当前段位胜点<Highlight>小于0</>，则会掉至上一小段。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>保护胜点</>\n正常完成对局即可获得一定的保护胜点，保护胜点可以<Highlight>抵扣</>对局失败时扣除的胜点。\n当前剩余保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Victory Points Description </> \n After completing a match, certain victory points will be given or deducted based on the outcome and performance. Every time a player's rank reaches <Highlight> 100 victory points </>, they can be promoted to the next tier. If the current rank's victory points are <Highlight> less than 0 </> after deduction, you will drop to the previous sub-tier. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Protection Points </> \n You can obtain a certain amount of protection points by completing matches normally. Protection points can <Highlight> offset </> the points deducted when a match is lost. \n Current Remaining Protection Points: <Highlight> %s </>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知限制</>\n当前扮演等级限制：<Yellow>%s级</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Limit</>\nCurrent Acting Level Limit: <Yellow>%s Level</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知限制</>\n当前神性等级限制：<Yellow>%s级</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Limit</>\nCurrent Divinity Level Limit: <Yellow>%s Level</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知限制</>\n扮演等级限制已达上限：<Yellow>%s级</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Limit</>\nActing Level Limit has reached the cap: <Yellow>%s Level</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知限制</>\n神性等级限制已达本赛季上限：<Yellow>%s级</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Limit</>\nDivinity Level Limit has reached the season cap: <Yellow>%s Level</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>词条保存</>\n装备在产出时，会带有随机词条。\n获得<Highlight>带有非凡词条</>的装备时，词条组合<Highlight>将被保存</>，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中<Highlight>应用</>已保存的词条组合。\n未开启重塑功能的部位，<Highlight>也可以使用</>该保存和应用功能。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>随机重塑</>\n开启重塑功能的部位，可对已穿戴装备的随机词条进行重塑，需要消耗<Highlight>重塑材料</>，重塑后将对词条数和所有词条的<Highlight>属性类型、数值</>进行一次随机。\n触发多个非凡词条后，将会获得额外的恩赐效果，不同非凡词条和词条数的恩赐效果有所不同。\n更换装备时，重塑词条<Highlight>无损转移</>（未穿戴对应部位装备时不生效）。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Affix Saving</>\nEquipment comes with random affixes when produced. \nWhen you obtain <Highlight>equipment with Beyonder affixes</>, the affix combination <Highlight>will be saved</>, and you can <Highlight>apply</> the saved affix combination in the \"Blessing\" section on the right side of the Reshape interface. \nFor parts where the Reshape function is not unlocked, <Highlight>you can still use</> this save and apply function. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Random Reshape</>\nFor parts where the Reshape function is unlocked, you can reshape the random affixes of equipped gear by consuming <Highlight>reshaping materials</>. After reshaping, the number of affixes and all affix <Highlight>attribute types and values</> will be randomized. \nTriggering multiple Beyonder affixes will grant additional Blessing effects, which vary depending on the different Beyonder affixes and the number of affixes. \nWhen replacing equipment, reshaped affixes are <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped).",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>诡秘世界</>\n诡秘世界页签中，可查看各地图<Highlight>秩序世界</>和<Highlight>城市暗面</>的玩法进度，并领取<Highlight>进度奖励</>。\n<Highlight>风尚沙龙、时代任务</>不会计入秩序世界的完成度。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>跑团天赋</>\n跑团天赋页签中，可根据秩序世界的完成度获得跑团相关的<Highlight>天赋加成</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>趣味玩法</>\n趣味玩法收纳了冒险过程中遇到的各种玩法事件教程。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>珍藏瞬间</>\n珍藏瞬间中收纳了冒险过程中收集到的宝贵瞬间记录。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mystery World </>\n In the Mystery World tab, you can view the progress of the <Highlight> Order World </> and <Highlight> City Dark Side </> maps and claim <Highlight> progress rewards </>. \n<Highlight> Fashion Salon and Era Quests </> do not count toward Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> TRPG Talents </>\n In the TRPG Talents tab, you can obtain TRPG-related <Highlight> talent bonuses </> based on your Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Fun Modes </>\n Fun Modes contains tutorials for various gameplay events encountered during your adventure. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Treasured Moments </>\n Treasured Moments stores the precious records collected during your adventure.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>资金来源</>\n俱乐部活跃津贴和俱乐部活动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>资金说明</>\n可用于俱乐部建筑升级，提升俱乐部实力、福利和规模。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Funding Sources </>\n Club activity stipends and club events. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Funding Explanation </>\n Can be used for club building upgrades to improve club strength, benefits, and scale.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:00进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs on <Highlight> the Sunday at 12:00 PM of the first week </> after the server opens, and the divisions and groups will be announced at <Highlight> 6:00 PM that same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) will start at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week, and subsequent Four-Way Leagues will be adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams in the group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight> randomly assigned </>, provided this rule is met. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the Winners' Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match will feature matchups within the Winners' and Losers' Brackets respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place on Saturday at 9:00 PM: <Highlight> For the Holy Name Group and above </>, the top two in the group promote to the higher group, and the bottom two relegate to the lower group; <Highlight> For the Hero Group and below </>, the first place in the group promotes two groups, the second place promotes one group, the seventh place relegates one group, and the eighth place relegates two groups. Among them, <Highlight> Legendary Group, Epic Group, and Traveler Group </> are special groups: Legendary Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 6th and 7th both relegate one group, 8th relegates two groups; Epic Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 7th relegates one group, 8th relegates two groups; Traveler Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd promotes one group, 7th and 8th relegate two groups; Challenger Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd and 3rd promote one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Beyonder rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:20进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide regions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs <Highlight> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening at 12:00 PM </>, and the regions and groups will be announced <Highlight> at 6:00 PM on the same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) starts at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening, and subsequent leagues are adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams in the group will be assigned to different match groups, and <Highlight> randomly assigned </> while meeting this rule. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the winner's bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the loser's bracket. The second match will feature winner's bracket and loser's bracket duels respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the match results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place at 9:20 PM on that Saturday: <Highlight> For the Saint Name group and above </>, the top two in the group are promoted to the previous group, and the bottom two are relegated to the next group; <Highlight> For the Hero group and below </>, the first in the group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups. Among them, <Highlight> the Legend, Epic, and Traveler groups </> are special groups: the first and second in the Legend group are promoted one group, the sixth and seventh are relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first and second in the Epic group are promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first in the Traveler group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Beyonder score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>进度增长规则</>\n于猎杀管家处提交<Highlight>猩红遗物碎片可推进猎杀进度</>，当达到<Highlight>对应档位进度将解锁对应档位奖励</>。在猎杀活动期间，提交猩红碎片推进猎杀进度的<Highlight>效率将显著提升</>！\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重置规则</>\n每周一<Highlight>早上8:00</>重置刷新。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位分保底规则</>\n当段位达到<Highlight>血色亲王</>段位时，猎杀进度奖励将<Highlight>不再提供段位胜点</>。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Progress Growth Rules</>\nSubmit <Highlight>Scarlet Relic Fragments to the Hunt Butler to advance the hunt progress</>. When you reach the <Highlight>corresponding tier, you will unlock the corresponding tier rewards</>. During the hunt event, the <Highlight>efficiency</> of submitting Scarlet Fragments to advance the hunt progress will be significantly increased!\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reset Rules</>\nResets and refreshes every Monday at <Highlight>8:00 AM</>.\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Tier Point Guarantee Rules</>\nWhen the tier reaches <Highlight>Blood Prince</>, hunt progress rewards will <Highlight>no longer provide tier victory points</>.\n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>部位强化</>\n每个部位都可以通过消耗<Highlight>强化材料</>进行强化，最多强化至<Highlight>8阶</>。\n每个阶段都可以提升角色的属性能力，提升的属性展示在装备的<Highlight>基础属性</>部分。\n更换装备时，强化效果<Highlight>无损转移</>（未穿戴对应部位装备时不生效）。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>强化套装</>\n每个部位的强化阶段同时达到对应要求后，将激活强化套装，进一步提升角色能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Strengthening</>\nEach part can be strengthened by consuming <Highlight>strengthening materials</>, up to a maximum of <Highlight>8 stages</>. \nEach stage improves the character's attribute capabilities, and the improved attributes are displayed in the <Highlight>Basic Attributes</> section of the equipment. \nWhen replacing equipment, the strengthening effect is <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped). \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Strengthening Set</>\nWhen the strengthening stage of each part reaches the corresponding requirement, the strengthening set will be activated, further improving character capabilities.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>阵营与基础规则</>\n<Highlight>4家俱乐部</>同场竞技，每家俱乐部可以出战<Highlight>60名正式成员</>，单局共240名玩家展开激战。同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Highlight>16人</>，请合理规划阵容配置。每场比赛持续<Highlight>23分钟</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>胜负规则</>\n<Highlight>率先获得3000积分</>的俱乐部即刻锁定胜局；若对局结束时无人达到3000分，则按当前积分高低排定名次。积分相同时，依次比较<Highlight>总击杀数</>、<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>局内积分获取</>\n局内积分的唯一来源为<Highlight>占领守卫及守卫归属结算</>：首次占领守卫可获得<Highlight>50积分</>；每5秒进行一次小归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>1积分</>；每30秒进行一次大归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>18积分</>。<Highlight>守卫归属高倍积分结算</>将在比赛第4、8、12、16、20分钟随机刷新，并提前90秒预告。高倍结算期间，每个已占领守卫在大归属结算时可提供<Highlight>72积分或108积分</>，分别对应四倍与六倍积分收益，具体倍率根据刷新的守卫位置决定。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>守卫争夺</>\n地图中共设有<Highlight>5位守卫</>。完成对守卫最后一击的俱乐部将获得该守卫的控制权。占领成功后，守卫将立即重生并归属本方。守卫<Highlight>无法被治疗</>，但周围没有敌人时可以缓慢自动恢复生命。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>资源与指挥权限</>\n<Highlight>击败敌方玩家</>或<Highlight>占领守卫</>均可获得资源点，并自动积累<Highlight>士气等级</>。<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可以消耗资源点释放指挥技能。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>指挥技能</>\n<Highlight>克敌宣言</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方全体成员的全途径压制提高15%，持续20秒。冷却时间180秒。<Highlight>急行进军</>：消耗600资源点，使本方全体成员的移动速度提高60%，持续10秒。冷却时间120秒。<Highlight>归零敕令</>：消耗1500资源点，立即清除本方全体成员当前的复活等待；随后5秒内阵亡的本方成员同样可以立即复活。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>召集传送</>：消耗2400资源点，将本方全体成员召集至指定集结点。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>圣域庇佑</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方所有守卫恢复相当于其最大生命值50%的生命。冷却时间180秒。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Factions and Basic Rules </>\n<Highlight> 4 Clubs </> compete on the same field, with each Club fielding <Highlight> 60 official members </>, totaling 240 players in a single match. A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 players </> from the same Club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. Each match lasts <Highlight> 23 minutes </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n<Highlight> The first Club to reach 3000 points </> immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are tied, the <Highlight> total kills </> and <Highlight> total Club Beyonder rating </> are compared in order. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> In-Match Point Acquisition </>\n The only source of in-match points is <Highlight> occupying Guardians and Guardian ownership settlement </>: The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> High-multiplier Guardian ownership settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during the major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, with the specific multiplier determined by the refreshed Guardian location. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Guardian Contention </>\n There are <Highlight> 5 Guardians </> on the map. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian will gain control of it. After a successful occupation, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to your side. Guardians <Highlight> cannot be healed </>, but they can slowly recover Health automatically when there are no enemies nearby. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Resources and Command Authority </>\n<Highlight> Defeating enemy players </> or <Highlight> occupying Guardians </> will grant resource points and automatically accumulate <Highlight> Morale Level </>. <Highlight> The President, Vice President, and Council Members </> can consume resource points to unleash Command Skills. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Command Skills </>\n<Highlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to increase the all-Pathway Suppression of all your members by 15% for 20 seconds. Cooldown 180 seconds. <Highlight> Forced March </>: Consumes 600 resource points to increase the movement speed of all your members by 60% for 10 seconds. Cooldown 120 seconds. <Highlight> Zero-Order Edict </>: Consumes 1500 resource points to immediately clear the current Resurrection wait time for all your members; members of your side who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds can also be resurrected immediately. Cooldown 240 seconds. <Highlight> Summon Teleport </>: Consumes 2400 resource points to summon all your members to a designated assembly point. Cooldown 240 seconds. <Highlight> Sanctuary Protection </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to restore 50% of the maximum Health of all your Guardians. Cooldown 180 seconds. \n",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡天赋系统</>\n1.每名非凡者有两种不同的非凡天赋方向，每个方向包含<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>和<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n2.使用<Highlight>天赋点</>升级天赋节点，<Highlight>天赋点</>通过<Highlight>序列晋升</>获得。\n3.升级<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>，能够获得更强的力量。部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>升级后，可以解锁<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>。\n4.<Highlight>特殊天赋节点</>通常蕴含着特殊的非凡能力，升级后会使自身的某些能力获得强化或改变。\n5.<Highlight>天赋点</>可以同时给两个非凡天赋方向加点，非凡者能够同时在两个方向上强化不同的<Highlight>天赋节点</>。但同一时间内只能激活一个方向，让其发挥作用。\n6.部分<Highlight>基础天赋节点</>的升级受到<Highlight>序列等级</>的限制。但非凡者可以随时重置任意天赋节点，体验不同的强化效果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Beyonder Talent System </> \n 1. Each Beyonder has two different Beyonder talent directions, each containing <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> and <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 2. Use <Highlight> Talent Points </> to upgrade talent nodes; <Highlight> Talent Points </> are obtained through <Highlight> Sequence advancement </>. \n 3. Upgrading <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> grants stronger power. After upgrading certain <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </>, you can unlock <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </>. \n 4. <Highlight> Special Talent Nodes </> usually contain special Beyonder abilities; upgrading them will strengthen or change certain abilities of your own. \n 5. <Highlight> Talent Points </> can be used to add points to both Beyonder talent directions simultaneously, allowing a Beyonder to strengthen different <Highlight> Talent Nodes </> in both directions at the same time. However, only one direction can be activated at a time to take effect. \n 6. The upgrade of some <Highlight> Basic Talent Nodes </> is restricted by the <Highlight> Sequence level </>. However, Beyonders can reset any talent node at any time to experience different strengthening effects.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡方案</>\n非凡方案是角色技能、天赋、封印物组成的搭配，当前方案会随玩家的当前搭配实时变动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案切换</>\n将特定的搭配保存为方案后，即可通过方案切换，一键更改当前的搭配。战斗状态下无法进行方案切换。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>推荐方案</>\n推荐方案中包含本途径的多种搭配，可以将推荐方案中的搭配一键运用到自身的方案中。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Beyonder Build</>\nA Beyonder build is a combination of character skills, talents, and Sealed Artifacts. The current build changes in real-time based on your current setup. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Build Switch</>\nAfter saving a specific setup as a build, you can switch builds to change your current setup with one tap. Builds cannot be switched during combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Recommended Builds</>\nRecommended builds include various setups for this pathway, which can be applied to your own build with one tap.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡评分</>\n非凡评分是非凡者战斗能力和养成情况的综合性评价，可以以此为参考评估自身的发展情况。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>养成详情</>\n点击角色展示界面右下方的非凡评分，可以查看自身各个模块的详细养成情况（部分养成上限随赛季推进解锁）。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>评分提升</>\n在非凡评分系统中点击想要提升的模块，可以了解提升养成所需材料的相关信息和获取途径。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Beyonder Rating </> \n The Beyonder Rating is a comprehensive evaluation of a Beyonder's combat ability and development status, which can be used as a reference to assess your own development. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Development Details </> \n Click on the Beyonder Rating in the bottom right corner of the character display interface to view the detailed development status of each of your modules (some development caps are unlocked as the season progresses). \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rating Improvement </> \n Click on the module you want to improve in the Beyonder Rating system to learn about the relevant information and acquisition channels for the materials needed for development.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡途径与序列等级</>\n非凡途径又称神之途径，是以魔药为核心的一整套晋升体系。每条途径分为10个序列，从9到0，序列数字越低，品阶越高，能力越强。\n非凡者可以通过收集魔药配方，服用序列魔药以提升序列等级，并提升消化序列魔药的进度，提升实力。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋升</>\n完成所有晋升的前置条件后，即可领取晋升任务，制作并服用下一序列的魔药，提升序列等级。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Beyonder Pathways and Sequence Levels</>\nBeyonder Pathways, also known as Divine Pathways, are a complete advancement system centered around potions. Each pathway is divided into 10 Sequences, from 9 to 0. The lower the Sequence number, the higher the rank and the stronger the ability.\nBeyonders can increase their Sequence level and strength by collecting potion formulas, consuming Sequence potions, and progressing in their digestion of the potions.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Advancement</>\nOnce all prerequisites for advancement are met, you can accept the advancement quest, craft and consume the next Sequence's potion, and increase your Sequence level.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>风尚度上限</>\n同一车辆模板改装出的车辆中，仅风尚度排名前<Highlight>20</>的车辆会计入外观总风尚度。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Fashion Rating Cap</>\nAmong vehicles modified from the same vehicle template, only the vehicles with the top <Highlight>20</> Fashion Ratings will be counted towards the total appearance Fashion Rating.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>首胜机制</>\n每天主宰争锋可获得一次首胜奖励，未使用的奖励次数可累计，最多可累积至三次。在主宰争锋中获胜后，会消耗一次首胜次数，获得双倍胜点奖励。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> First Victory Mechanism </>\n You can obtain a First Victory reward in Dominator's Clash every day. Unused reward counts can be accumulated up to three times. Winning in Dominator's Clash consumes one First Victory count and grants double victory points.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药配方</>\n晋升至更高序列的必须品，包含主材料和辅助材料。集齐下一序列的魔药配方中的所有魔药材料后，才能进行制作对应序列的魔药，完成晋升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药材料获取</>\n到达相应的消化进度之后，非凡者将获得灵性指引，引导其完成相应的任务，获得魔药材料。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Potion Formulas</>\nEssential items for advancing to a higher Sequence, containing main ingredients and auxiliary ingredients. Only after collecting all the potion materials in the next Sequence's potion formula can you craft the corresponding Sequence potion and complete the advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Potion Materials</>\nUpon reaching the corresponding digestion progress, Beyonders will receive spiritual guidance, leading them to complete the corresponding quests and obtain potion materials.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/>饰品%s：%s%s：%d分"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> Accessory %s: %s %s: %d points",
    ["<player>%s</>开启“别野派对”，邀请各位非凡者参加！"] = "<player>%s</> starts a \"Villa Party\", inviting all Beyonders to attend!",
