    ["But {{他|她}} is right. My grandmother passed away ten years ago, but I always feel like she's there—airing out the quilts on a nice day, and when the wind blows, it's like she's patting my head."] = "But {{he|she}} is right. My grandmother passed away ten years ago, but I always feel like she's there—airing out the quilts on a nice day, and when the wind blows, it's like she's patting my head.",
    ["Buying a ticket, {{先生|女士}}? I have some, no need to queue."] = "Buying a ticket, {{Sir|Madam}}? I have some, no need to queue.",
    ["By the way, {{先生|女士}}, do you want today's newspaper? The front-page headline this time is quite extraordinary."] = "By the way, {{Sir|Madam}}, do you want today's newspaper? The front-page headline this time is quite extraordinary.",
    ["By the way, {{先生|女士}}, there's a madman who loves to drink over there. Take my advice and stay away from him."] = "By the way, {{Sir|Madam}}, there's a madman who loves to drink over there. Take my advice and stay away from him.",
