    ["Carrying bricks every day, gnawing on rye bread... Hey! Why am I saying this, {{先生|女士}}, thank you for listening to my nagging."] = "Carrying bricks every day, gnawing on rye bread... Hey! Why am I saying this, {{Sir|Madam}}, thank you for listening to my nagging.",
    ["ClampSpeed(min=1.0, max=1.3)，代表将速度被修正的话，限制其最小值和最大值，即人物速度不能小于默认值的100%，也不能大于130%\n同时，和战斗常常量表的SPEED_RATE_LOWER_LIMIT同时生效，两者取更严格的。只支持一层，后面来的直接把前面覆盖掉"] = "ClampSpeed(min=1.0, max=1.3), meaning if speed is modified, its minimum and maximum values are restricted; i.e., character speed cannot be less than 100% of the default value, nor greater than 130%. \n Simultaneously, it takes effect with the combat constant SPEED_RATE_LOWER_LIMIT, with the stricter of the two being applied. Only supports one layer; subsequent ones overwrite the previous ones.",
