    ["Every drink here comes from the gift of the dragon... if the drink you ordered even counts as a drink. Enjoy the deliciousness, {{先生|女士}}."] = "Every drink here comes from the gift of the dragon... if the drink you ordered even counts as a drink. Enjoy the deliciousness, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
