    ["Finally about to finish. There's one last step. Miss Justice, should I send {{他|她}} to Tingen now?"] = "Finally about to finish. There's one last step. Miss Justice, should I send {{him|her}} to Tingen now?",
    ["Find the object of prophecy, glimpse the truth, and escape the nightmare—\n<P_Yellow>One object hidden, the sound of the lamb returning home no longer plays.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object stored, the seed of rebirth, buried beside the stone statue.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object concealed, crimson moonlight shines upon it.</>\n...\n...\nThe reborn one, reborn again.\nNineteenth time, {{他|她}} has died in the dream nineteen times.\nThis time is {{他|她}}'s twentieth nightmare.\n{{他|她}} opens the Antigonus Notebook, which should not have appeared here.\nThen, dies from the loss of control caused by the notebook's power.\nThe reborn one, reborn again.\nThis time is {{他|她}}'s twenty-first nightmare.\n...\nThe reborn one sees the Antigonus Notebook again.\n{{他|她}} does not open the notebook, but draws a ⬛⬛ card instead.\n...\nThe reborn one comes to the altar filled with flowers and decides to do something.\nA strong desire to understand the truth arises in the reborn one's heart.\n{{他|她}} observes the altar and obtains a piece of parchment containing the prophecy.\nThe reborn one will follow the revelation of the prophecy..."] = "Find the object of prophecy, glimpse the truth, and escape the nightmare—\n<P_Yellow>One object hidden, the sound of the lamb returning home no longer plays.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object stored, the seed of rebirth, buried beside the stone statue.</>\n<P_Yellow>One object concealed, crimson moonlight shines upon it.</>\n...\n...\nThe reborn one, reborn again.\nNineteenth time, {{he|she}} has died in the dream nineteen times.\nThis time is {{his|her}} twentieth nightmare.\n{{He|She}} opens the Antigonus Notebook, which should not have appeared here.\nThen, dies from the loss of control caused by the notebook's power.\nThe reborn one, reborn again.\nThis time is {{his|her}} twenty-first nightmare.\n...\nThe reborn one sees the Antigonus Notebook again.\n{{He|She}} does not open the notebook, but draws a ⬛⬛ card instead.\n...\nThe reborn one comes to the altar filled with flowers and decides to do something.\nA strong desire to understand the truth arises in the reborn one's heart.\n{{He|She}} observes the altar and obtains a piece of parchment containing the prophecy.\nThe reborn one will follow the revelation of the prophecy...",
