    ["In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,（已生效）}</>"] = "In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,(applied)}</>",
