    ["Is that really okay? {{先生|女士}}, why are you helping me like this?"] = "Is that really okay? {{sir|madam}}, why are you helping me like this?",
    ["Isn't there still {{他|她}}?"] = "Isn't there still {{him|her}}?",
    ["It is a pleasure to see you, {{先生|女士}}."] = "It is a pleasure to see you, {{sir|madam}}.",
    ["It seems this {{先生|女士}} has been listening to our discussion for a long time, are you also a loyal reader of Miss Fors?"] = "It seems this {{sir|madam}} has been listening to our discussion for a long time, are you also a loyal reader of Miss Fors?",
    ["It's more than that, {{先生|女士}}. Bayam is famous across the sea for its spices, brothels, and casinos. Once you touch gambling, it's hard to get out."] = "It's more than that, {{sir|madam}}. Bayam is famous across the sea for its spices, brothels, and casinos. Once you touch gambling, it's hard to get out.",
    ["It's okay, Consultant {{先生|女士}}, leave the rest to us."] = "It's okay, Consultant {{sir|madam}}, leave the rest to us.",
    ["It's you! Kind {{先生|女士}}"] = "It's you! Kind {{sir|madam}}",
    ["It's {{PlayerName}}{{哥哥|姐姐}}! My sister went to train, and she left a letter for you."] = "It's {{PlayerName}}{{brother|sister}}! My sister went to train, and she left a letter for you.",
