    ["Jimmy, {{先生|女士}}... Mom works as a maid during the day and has to go out to dance in very cold clothes at night. She said she would send me to be an apprentice when she saved enough money. But... but the police said Mom did something bad... is Mom a bad person?"] = "Jimmy, {{sir|madam}}... Mom works as a maid during the day and has to go out to dance in very cold clothes at night. She said she would send me to be an apprentice when she saved enough money. But... but the police said Mom did something bad... is Mom a bad person?",
