    ["KimID=邮箱前缀，可不填只显示到客户端"] = "KimID = mailbox prefix, optional (only displays on client).",
    ["Kind {{先生|女士}}, have you found the matches for Jenny?"] = "Kind {{sir|madam}}, have you found the matches for Jenny?",
    ["Kind {{先生|女士}}, if you like my dance, please go to the meat stall in front and support my sister Mary Jane's business."] = "Kind {{sir|madam}}, if you like my dance, please go to the meat stall in front and support my sister Mary Jane's business.",
    ["Kind {{先生|女士}}, please give a little more... there are many other children who haven't eaten..."] = "Kind {{sir|madam}}, please give a little more... there are many other children who haven't eaten...",
    ["Kind {{先生|女士}}, thank you for listening to my rambling. Knowing that there is still someone in this world who remembers Jenny is enough to comfort me."] = "Kind {{sir|madam}}, thank you for listening to my rambling. Knowing that there is still someone in this world who remembers Jenny is enough to comfort me.",
