    ["Last time after praying to the Lord of the Washroom, a policeman {{先生|女士}} descended from the sky and helped us solve the diarrhea problem. If we pray again, could it resurrect 'Caramel Bomb'?"] = "Last time after praying to the Lord of the Washroom, a policeman {{sir|madam}} descended from the sky and helped us solve the diarrhea problem. If we pray again, could it resurrect 'Caramel Bomb'?",
