    ["Let {{他|她}} in."] = "Let {{him|her}} in.",
    ["Let's go. Take your \"darling,\" thank this {{哥哥|姐姐}} who helped me find you, and let's go home."] = "Let's go. Take your \"darling,\" thank this {{brother|sister}} who helped me find you, and let's go home.",
