    ["Of course, no problem, respected {{先生|女士}}."] = "Of course, no problem, respected {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Oh my— thank you, respected {{先生|女士}}, thank you for your blessings. When the time comes—"] = "Oh my— thank you, respected {{Sir|Madam}}, thank you for your blessings. When the time comes—",
    ["Oh no! {{他|她}} heard you say the lock is easy to open!"] = "Oh no! {{He|She}} heard you say the lock is easy to open!",
