    ["Tell me, {{先生|女士}}, you saw it too, the ghost that's killing people everywhere!"] = "Tell me, {{Sir|Madam}}, you saw it too, the ghost that's killing people everywhere!",
    ["Text Block<HighLight>150次</>伤害伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%伤害提升10%"] = "Text Block<HighLight>150 times</>Damage Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10%",
    ["TextureParams 材质参数名称不可为空"] = "TextureParams material parameter name cannot be empty",
    ["Thank you for the compliment, {{先生|小姐}}!"] = "Thank you for the compliment, {{Sir|Miss}}!",
    ["Thank you for today... {{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you for today... {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you for your hard work, kind {{先生|女士}}!"] = "Thank you for your hard work, kind {{Sir|Madam}}!",
    ["Thank you for your help, {{先生|女士}}. This is a small token of appreciation. I look forward to our next meeting."] = "Thank you for your help, {{Sir|Madam}}. This is a small token of appreciation. I look forward to our next meeting.",
    ["Thank you for your help, {{先生|女士}}. This is a small token of meeting, looking forward to our next meeting."] = "Thank you for your help, {{Sir|Madam}}. This is a small token of our meeting; I look forward to our next one.",
    ["Thank you for your help, {{先生|女士}}. You aren't hurt, are you?"] = "Thank you for your help, {{Sir|Madam}}. You aren't hurt, are you?",
    ["Thank you for your support, {{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you for your support, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you so much! You are simply {{丝瓜国王|丝瓜女王}}. I'm going to cook a bowl of loofah soup to drink when I get home tonight."] = "Thank you so much! You are simply the {{King of Loofah|Queen of Loofah}}. I'm going to cook a bowl of loofah soup to drink when I get home tonight.",
    ["Thank you so much, kind {{先生|女士}}, if you see it, please be sure to tell me."] = "Thank you so much, kind {{Sir|Madam}}, if you see it, please be sure to tell me.",
    ["Thank you so much, {{先生|女士}}. The members of the Tingen Fashion Association are truly the most difficult guests to host on this street!"] = "Thank you so much, {{Sir|Madam}}. The members of the Tingen Fashion Association are truly the most difficult guests to host on this street!",
    ["Thank you very much, {{先生|女士}}. These are our birthdays. We are all very eager to know our recent fortunes."] = "Thank you very much, {{Sir|Madam}}. These are our birthdays. We are all very eager to know our recent fortunes.",
    ["Thank you! Kind {{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you! Kind {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you, Clown{{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you, Clown {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you, Magician {{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you, Magician {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you, brave {{先生|女士}}."] = "Thank you, brave {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["Thank you, charming {{先生|女士}}. '—Now there is nothing troublesome, except for this habitual creation'"] = "Thank you, charming {{Sir|Madam}}. '—Now there is nothing troublesome, except for this habitual creation'",
    ["Thank you, kind {{先生|女士}}, may the Goddess watch over you."] = "Thank you, kind {{Sir|Madam}}, may the Goddess watch over you.",
    ["Thank you, {{先生|女士}}. May the Goddess bless you. If you see my father, Mr. Bellman, on Iron Cross Street, please help me hide it from him; he is still looking for little Irene..."] = "Thank you, {{Sir|Madam}}. May the Goddess bless you. If you see my father, Mr. Bellman, on Iron Cross Street, please help me hide it from him; he is still looking for little Irene...",
    ["Thank you, {{先生|女士}}. The medical oath doesn't say 'count the coins before counting the pulse.' Regardless, I will uphold the ethics of a doctor to the very end."] = "Thank you, {{Sir|Madam}}. The medical oath doesn't say 'count the coins before counting the pulse.' Regardless, I will uphold the ethics of a doctor to the very end.",
    ["Thank you, {{先生|女士}}. This is just my story; perhaps other knights will experience even more magnificent adventures."] = "Thank you, {{Sir|Madam}}. This is just my story; perhaps other knights will experience even more magnificent adventures.",
    ["Thank you, {先生|女士}. Emily is rarely this happy."] = "Thank you, {Sir|Madam}. Emily is rarely this happy.",
    ["That being said, {{他|她}} is more suitable to sail with you than I am..."] = "That being said, {{he|she}} is more suitable to sail with you than I am...",
    ["That's how I became who I am today, {{先生|女士}}."] = "That's how I became who I am today, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["That's right! {{先生|女士}}, do you also understand the mystery of it?"] = "That's right! {{Sir|Madam}}, do you also understand the mystery of it?",
    ["The Minister of Foreign Affairs is me, {{先生|女士}}, we've met. The Hat Gang is another homeless child organization active in this neighborhood, most of them ran away from the textile mills."] = "The Minister of Foreign Affairs is me, {{Sir|Madam}}, we've met. The Hat Gang is another homeless child organization active in this neighborhood; most of them ran away from the textile mills.",
    ["The best souvenir from Lamud Castle! {{先生|女士}}, this is the perfect choice for picking out gifts for your family and friends!"] = "The best souvenir from Lamud Castle! {{Sir|Madam}}, this is the perfect choice for picking out gifts for your family and friends!",
    ["The best souvenir in Lamud Town! {{先生|女士}}, this is the best choice for picking gifts for your family and friends!"] = "The best souvenir in Lamud Town! {{Sir|Madam}}, this is the best choice for picking gifts for your family and friends!",
    ["The corruption is initially sealed, but the will of {{他|她}} has been repeatedly ravaged. Should we wake {{他|她}} up in the real world like this?"] = "The corruption is initially sealed, but the will of {{him|her}} has been repeatedly ravaged. Should we wake {{him|her}} up in the real world like this?",
    ["The latest series of \"The Great Adventurer\", {{先生|女士}}, I am studying the expression style of the famous writer Ms. Fors Wall."] = "The latest series of \"The Great Adventurer\", {{Sir|Madam}}, I am studying the expression style of the famous writer Ms. Fors Wall.",
    ["The most classic way to eat it; even the maids of the gentlemen in the wealthy district often come to patronize! {{先生|女士}} Want a piece?"] = "The most classic way to eat it; even the maids of the gentlemen in the wealthy district often come to patronize! {{Sir|Madam}}, want a piece?",
    ["The requiem process has completely spiraled out of control, You's Sanity <Highlight>-5</>, <Highlight>塔莉娅·赫德森</>'s Sanity <Highlight>-10</>"] = "The requiem process has completely spiraled out of control. Your Sanity <Highlight>-5</>; <Highlight>Thalia Hudson</>'s Sanity <Highlight>-10</>.",
    ["The weather is so nice today, dear {{先生|小姐}}, come have some grapes; these might be the best grapes in Golden Autumn Lake!"] = "The weather is so nice today, dear {{Sir|Miss}}, come have some grapes; these might be the best grapes in Golden Autumn Lake!",
    ["Then {{大哥哥|大姐姐}}, come see me again when you have time, maybe by then I will have bloomed."] = "Then {{big brother|big sister}}, come see me again when you have time; maybe by then I will have bloomed.",
    ["There are impact dents on the front of the carriage, but the person was brought back intact. You worked very efficiently, Consultant {{先生|女士}}."] = "There are impact dents on the front of the carriage, but the person was brought back intact. You worked very efficiently, Consultant {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["There is maintenance ahead, this road is blocked, {{先生|女士}}."] = "There is maintenance ahead, this road is blocked, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["These peddlers specialize in scamming passersby. {{先生|女士}}, don't pay attention to him."] = "These peddlers specialize in scamming passersby. {{Sir|Madam}}, don't pay attention to him.",
    ["This Mr. Da Vinci and this {{先生|女士}}!"] = "This Mr. Da Vinci and this {{Sir|Madam}}!",
    ["This generous and kind {{先生|女士}}, Jenny hopes to share this joy with you. Would you be willing to help me strike a match?"] = "This generous and kind {{Sir|Madam}}, Jenny hopes to share this joy with you. Would you be willing to help me strike a match?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}} passing by, are you also here to visit the church?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}} passing by, are you also here to visit the church?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}!"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}!",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, are you here to volunteer too?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, are you here to volunteer too?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, can you help me hold my place in line? I've been waiting for hours and I really can't hold it anymore, I have to go to the restroom... We can dine together later!"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, can you help me hold my place in line? I've been waiting for hours and I really can't hold it anymore, I have to go to the restroom... We can dine together later!",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, come and see the souvenirs of the Sculpture of Knowledge!"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, come and see the souvenirs of the Sculpture of Knowledge!",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, do you know Godot?"] = "Excuse me, {{sir|madam}}, do you know Godot?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, may I ask if you know Godot?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, may I ask if you know Godot?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, may I take a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about my Lord, Mr. Fool."] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, may I take a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about my Lord, Mr. Fool.",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, tell me, how can a doctor refuse to make house calls?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, tell me, how can a doctor refuse to make house calls?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, thank you for discovering the abnormality. Perhaps it's not too late... It seems you also have an understanding of Beyonder powers?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, thank you for discovering the abnormality. Perhaps it's not too late... It seems you also have an understanding of Beyonder powers?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, would you like a ride? If not, do you need anything delivered?"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, would you like a ride? If not, do you need anything delivered?",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, you are dressed very interestingly. Miss Elsa and I are doing design research."] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, you are dressed very interestingly. Miss Elsa and I are doing design research.",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, you are so thoughtful and gentle, the blessings from you will surely come true!"] = "This {{Sir|Madam}}, you are so thoughtful and gentle, the blessings from you will surely come true!",
    ["This {{先生|小姐}}, perhaps you can help Manisha... Oh, but you don't know either!"] = "This {{Sir|Miss}}, perhaps you can help Manisha... Oh, but you don't know either!",
    ["This {{先生|小姐}}, you are so thoughtful and gentle, the blessings from you will surely come true!"] = "This {{Sir|Miss}}, you are so thoughtful and gentle, the blessings from you will surely come true!",
    ["This {{先生|小姐}}, you see, our Manisha has been in such a hurry since she slipped out this afternoon."] = "This {{Sir|Miss}}, you see, our Manisha has been in such a hurry since she slipped out this afternoon.",
    ["This {先生|女士}, please don't mind her, it's no use talking to her."] = "Please don't mind her, {sir|madam}. There's no use talking to her.",
    ["To  读者"] = "To Readers",
    ["To 占卜家\n    占卜不是万能。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Seer \n Divination is not omnipotent. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 占卜家\n    愿你的灵摆永远指向\n    正确的方向。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Seer \n May your pendulum always point in the \n correct direction. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 命运之轮的眷顾者\n    幸运的天平永远倒向你。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To the favored of the Wheel of Fortune \n May the scales of luck always tip in your favor. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 学徒\n    不要迷路。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Apprentice \n Do not get lost. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 学徒\n    祝你打开每扇门，\n    都有新的惊喜。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Apprentice \n May every Door you open \n bring a new surprise. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 战士\n    黄昏是白昼的结束，\n    黎明是夜晚的终点。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Warrior \n Dusk is the end of the day, \n dawn is the end of the night. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 歌颂者\n    赞美太阳！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Bard \n Praise the Sun! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 窥秘人\n     为所欲为，但勿伤害。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Mystery Pryer \n Do as you will, but do no harm. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 观众\n    观众只能是观众。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Spectator \n A Spectator can only be a spectator. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    不属于这个时代的愚者，\n    灰雾之上的神秘主宰，\n    执掌好运的黄黑之王。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n The Fool that doesn't belong to this era, \n the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, \n the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    不要相信过去，\n          不要畏惧未来。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n Do not trust the past, \n do not fear the future. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    光就是一切的意义！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n Light is the meaning of everything! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    凡有言，必被知。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n Whatever is spoken, shall be known. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    总有些事情，高于其他！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n There are always things that are higher than others! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    我们是守护者，也是一群\n    时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的\n    可怜虫。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n We are Guardians, but also a group of \n poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness. \n \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    我们都是时代的囚徒，\n    但总有人试图在牢笼里起舞。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n We are all prisoners of the era, \n but there are always those who try to dance in the cage. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    所有命运的馈赠，\n    都早已在暗中标注好了价格。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n All gifts of fate \n have already been marked with a price in the dark. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["To 非凡者\n    祝你的未来和奥黛丽一样富有。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n May your future be as wealthy as Audrey's. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["Today's sunset is perfect for painting. I have to go back, {{先生|女士}}, goodbye."] = "Today's sunset is perfect for painting. I have to go back, {{sir|madam}}, goodbye.",
    ["Tom奴役的灵魂"] = "Soul Enslaved by Tom",
    ["Towards the station! Th-thank you, kind {{先生|女士}}..."] = "Towards the station! Th-thank you, kind {{sir|madam}}...",
    ["To《诡秘之主》游戏\n祝公测大卖！“愚者”先生庇佑\nBug归零，非凡者魔药顺利消化！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To \"Lord of Mysteries\" game \n Wishing for a successful open beta! May Mr. \"Fool\" bless \n the bug count to be zero, and may the Beyonder digest their potion smoothly! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["Tri1_剩余强者"] = "Tri1_Remaining Strong Individuals",
