    ["{\"notificationTitle\": \"下载已暂停\",\"notificationContent\":\"由于您当前的网络环境切换至了流量环境，游戏已暂停下载，当您处于WiFi环境时，我们将自动为您恢复下载。\",\"showProgress\":false}"] = "{\"notificationTitle\": \"Download Paused\",\"notificationContent\":\"Your network environment has switched to mobile data, so the game download has been paused. We will automatically resume the download when you are on a WiFi connection.\",\"showProgress\":false}",
    ["{\"notificationTitle\": \"资源下载失败\",\"notificationContent\":\"下载失败\",\"showProgress\":false}"] = "{ \"notificationTitle\": \"Resource download failed\", \"notificationContent\": \"Download failed\", \"showProgress\": false }",
    ["{\"notificationTitle\":\"正在下载资源\",\"notificationContent\":\"{2}%\",\"showProgress\":true,\"progress\":{2}}"] = "{\"notificationTitle\":\"Downloading Resources\",\"notificationContent\":\"{2}%\",\"showProgress\":true,\"progress\":{2}}",
    ["{\"notificationTitle\":\"资源下载完成\",\"notificationContent\":\"下载完成\",\"showProgress\":false}"] = "{\"notificationTitle\":\"Resource download complete\",\"notificationContent\":\"Download complete\",\"showProgress\":false}",
