    ["《伯爵归来》25周年首演定在了廷根，我想起了伊琳，我想在她改变过去的美梦里，收集“释怀”的情绪。"] = "The 25th-anniversary premiere of 《The Count's Return》 is set in Tingen. I thought of Irene, and I want to collect the emotion of 'relief' from her dream where she changes the past.",
