    ["《大冒险家》最新一册昨晚就卖完了？不是前天刚到货吗？"] = "The latest volume of \"The Great Adventurer\" sold out last night? Didn't it just arrive the day before yesterday?",
    ["《大冒险家》最新系列，{{先生|女士}}，我在学习名作家佛尔思·沃尔女士的表达方式。"] = "The latest series of \"The Great Adventurer\", Mr./Ms. {{|}}, I am studying the expression style of the famous writer, Ms. Fors Wall.",
    ["《大冒险家》本轮廷根末场，前五十位观众可得原著作者佛尔思·沃尔小姐的签名海报！"] = "'The Great Adventurer' final Tingen show of this round, the first fifty audience members can get a signed poster from the original author, Miss Fors Wall!",
