    ["《女士审美》（第六号至十一号刊 合集）　　订购人：克莉丝汀\n\n《漆黑的管家》精装典藏版 　　订购人：塞巴斯蒂安\n\n《调教的艺术》入门至精进三卷 　　订购<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">口口口口口</>"] = "\"Ladies' Aesthetics\" (Issues No. 6 to 11, Omnibus Edition)　　Subscriber: Christine\n\n\"The Jet-Black Butler\" Hardcover Collector's Edition 　　Subscriber: Sebastian\n\n\"The Art of Discipline\" Introductory to Advanced, Three Volumes 　　Subscriber<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">□□□□□</>",
    ["《女巫之书》"] = "Book of Witches",
    ["《女巫之书》、《第二纪十大未解之谜》，总有人致力于拨开神秘学的迷雾，你有什么感兴趣的吗？"] = "'Book of Witches', 'Ten Unsolved Mysteries of the Second Epoch'—there are always people dedicated to clearing the fog of mysticism. Is there anything you are interested in?",
    ["《学会看书》？我要是会看进去这本书还要学吗真是的。"] = "\"Learning to Read\"? If I knew how to read, would I still need to learn from this book? Seriously.",
