    ["《廷根市老实人报》、《廷根晨报》、《塔索克报》！"] = "The Tingen Honest News, Tingen Morning Post, Tussock Times!",
    ["《廷根市老实人报》是廷根市最著名的报纸之一，这份报纸日期为1354年6月28日。"] = "The Tingen Honest Newspaper is one of the most famous newspapers in Tingen. This issue is dated June 28, 1354.",
    ["《廷根市老实人报》说我们的安全条例像歌剧院的假胡子——中看不中用。"] = "The \"Tingen Honest Man Newspaper\" says our safety regulations are like the fake beards in the opera house—good to look at but useless.",
    ["《廷根市老实人报》，最新的新闻！"] = "The Tingen Honest Newspaper, the latest news!",
    ["《廷根市老实人报》？我好像已经买过了。"] = "The Tingen Honest Newspaper? I think I have already bought it.",
    ["《廷根日报》"] = "Tingen Daily.",
    ["《廷根晨报》"] = "Tingen Morning Post",
    ["《廷根晨报》1便士一份。"] = "The Tingen Morning Post, 1 penny per copy.",
    ["《廷根老实人》！邻里大新闻！"] = "The Tingen Honest Man! Neighborhood big news!",
    ["《廷根酒徒威廉与血腥奇遇记：身为醉酒无赖的他发现廷根的吸血鬼巢穴，他的房东还有城中的工厂大王与银行家实际上是吸血鬼；讲述他如何独力以木桩刺穿吸血鬼的贪利之心，由此成为鲁恩最负盛名的吸血鬼猎人的故事》\n\n作者：克利夫·威廉\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>能火！！！</>\n\n该死的巴兹尔，到处说我坏话，你只能活两个章节！\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">这一段内容是编的这一段内容是编的这一段</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">猫不会说话。</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">鸽子也是。</>"] = "《Tingen Drunkard William and the Bloody Adventure: As a drunken rogue, he discovers a vampire nest in Tingen. His landlord, the factory tycoon, and the banker in the city are actually vampires; it tells the story of how he single-handedly pierces the greedy hearts of the vampires with wooden stakes, thus becoming Loen's most renowned vampire hunter.》\n\n Author: Cliff William \n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> This will be a hit!!! </>\n\n Damn Basil, badmouthing me everywhere, you'll only live for two chapters! \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> This part is made up. This part is made up. This part </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Cats can't talk. </>\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> Neither can pigeons. </>",
    ["《心灵岛屿的潜意识及其音乐性》"] = "Subconscious of the Mind Island and Its Musicality",
    ["《心理医学评论》《心理学会月刊》……这不是普通乡绅会订阅的刊物。"] = "Review of Psychological Medicine, Psychological Society Monthly... These aren't publications an ordinary squire would subscribe to.",
    ["《忏悔录》"] = "Confessions",
    ["《惊情德古拉》？是本吸血鬼爱情小说。"] = "\"Dracula\"? It's a vampire romance novel.",
    ["《我与格尔曼·斯帕罗二三事》已经加印第五版了，可《第三纪十大未解之谜》的销量还是很低迷，得拜托吉尔希多宣传一下。"] = "'Things Between Me and Gehrman Sparrow' has already been reprinted for the fifth edition, but the sales of 'The Ten Unsolved Mysteries of the Third Epoch' are still very sluggish. I have to ask Gielshido to promote it.",
    ["《我最喜欢的事情》\n我最喜欢在上课的时候闭上眼睛，因为很舒服。眼睛前面<Hide id=\"#157\">甲</>黑乎乎的，耳朵里面也黑乎乎的。\n拉夫老师说，起来！上课不许睡觉。\n原来我最喜欢的事情是上课<Hide id=\"#157\">睡</>垂觉。"] = "《My Favorite Thing》 \n I like to close my eyes during class because it's comfortable. In front of my eyes <Hide id=\"#157\"> A </> it's pitch black, and inside my ears it's pitch black too. \n Teacher Ralph says, \"Get up! No sleeping in class.\" \n So my favorite thing is <Hide id=\"#157\"> sleep </> ing in class.",
    ["《我最喜欢的事情》\n我最喜欢的事，呃，这不能说啊！\n走在成长的道路上，注定要背负很多秘密……\n拉夫老师，别怪我。\n等你收卷，我就要做最喜欢的事情了。"] = "《My Favorite Things》\n My favorite thing, uh, I can't say that! \n Walking on the path of growth, I am destined to carry many secrets... \n Mr. Laff, don't blame me. \n Once you collect the papers, I will do my favorite thing.",
