    ["《诡秘之主》 官方授权声明\n\n第一条  授权内容\n快手游戏尊重知识产权并注重保护用户享用的各项权利。在快手游戏服务中，您可能需要通过上传、发布等各种方式提供内容。\n您在此明确同意，您在【装扮广场】功能下提供内容的同时，不可撤销地授权快手游戏及其关联公司（以下简称“我们”或“官方”或“快手游戏”）永久免费使用您在【装扮广场】上传、发布的作品及数据，使用方式包括但不限于以复制、发行、出租、展览、表演、广播、修改、改编、信息网络传播及其他方式使用，同时包括商业目的和非商业目的使用，本游戏内和本游戏外使用，也包括在【装扮广场】内和【装扮广场】外使用。前述使用的权利以下统称“使用权”，同时授权我们可以将前述使用权转授权或分许可第三方使用。\n\n第二条  承诺与保证 \n2.1 授权官方的作品为您完全独立自主创作，不存在抄袭、盗用等侵犯他人著作权、肖像权、商标权以及其他权利和利益的内容，或已经取得权利人的合法授权"] = "《Lord of Mysteries》 Official Authorization Statement \n\nArticle 1 Authorization Content\nKuaishou Games respects intellectual property rights and focuses on protecting the various rights enjoyed by users. In Kuaishou Games services, you may need to provide content through various means such as uploading or publishing. \nYou hereby expressly agree that while providing content under the 【Dress-up Plaza】 feature, you irrevocably authorize Kuaishou Games and its affiliated companies (hereinafter referred to as \"we\" or \"official\" or \"Kuaishou Games\") to use the works and data you upload and publish in the 【Dress-up Plaza】 permanently and free of charge. The methods of use include but are not limited to copying, distributing, renting, exhibiting, performing, broadcasting, modifying, adapting, disseminating over information networks, and other methods of use, including both commercial and non-commercial purposes, use inside and outside this game, and use inside and outside the 【Dress-up Plaza】. The aforementioned rights of use are collectively referred to as \"Right of Use,\" and we are also authorized to sub-license or sub-delegate the aforementioned Right of Use to third parties. \n\nArticle 2 Promises and Guarantees \n2.1 The works authorized to the official are created by you completely independently and autonomously, and do not contain content that infringes on others' copyrights, portrait rights, trademark rights, and other rights and interests, such as plagiarism or theft, or you have already obtained legal authorization from the rights holder.