    ["【A占位】一个温文甜美的女子站在窗边，她推开窗户，美丽的眼睛望着你。她洒了粉末后，消失了，突然闪现到了伦纳德的身后，一下子将匕首捅入了伦纳德的后腰。"] = "[Placeholder A] A gentle and sweet woman stands by the window. She pushes it open, her beautiful eyes looking at you. After scattering some powder, she disappears, suddenly flashing behind Leonard and plunging a dagger into his lower back.",
    ["【A占位】伦纳德：克莱恩，我们之间不需要假装。\n伦纳德：我曾经对你说过，这个世界上有很多特殊的人，比如说你，也比如说我。\n伦纳德：我并不认为藏着秘密的非凡者就一定是坏蛋，只要你的行为没有危害到我和值夜者，那你就还是我的队友。"] = "[Placeholder A] Leonard: Klein, there's no need to pretend between us. \nLeonard: I once told you that there are many special people in this world, for example, you, and for example, me. \nLeonard: I don't think a Beyonder hiding secrets is necessarily a bad person. As long as your actions don't harm me or the Nighthawks, then you are still my teammate.",
    ["【A占位】先是染红的海水和厮杀声，然后画面一转，天气转晴，乔伊斯走向一个有玩具风车的房子里。"] = "[A Placeholder] First, there was the red-dyed seawater and the sounds of slaughter, then the scene shifted, the weather cleared, and Joyce walked into a house with a toy windmill.",
    ["【A级动画占位】随着玩家诵念秘文。所有的书籍漂浮了起来，形成了一个实质化的空间入口。"] = "【A-level animation placeholder】As the player chants the secret text, all the books float up, forming a materialized entrance to the space.",
    ["【B占位】克莱恩从沙发背后走过，偷偷瞄向赛琳娜的镜子。\n镜中映照出一道人影，形貌扭曲，散发着邪异的黑绿。"] = "[Placeholder B] Klein walks past the back of the sofa, secretly peeking at Selena's mirror. \nThe mirror reflects a figure, its appearance distorted, radiating an evil black-green hue.",
    ["【B占位】克莱恩坐下，进入冥想。黑暗中，他看到一个绝望的中年男人撕碎了欠债的账单，洒向空中。\n纵火犯：我……我什么都没有了！"] = "[Placeholder B] Klein sits down and enters meditation. In the darkness, he sees a desperate middle-aged man tearing up his debt bills and scattering them into the air. \nPyromaniac: I... I have nothing left!",
    ["【B占位】镜子破裂，克莱恩回到现实。"] = "[Placeholder B] The mirror shatters, and Klein returns to reality.",
    ["【B占位】镜面聚合，呈现回忆，特里斯和一个戴着兜帽的女人面对面而站。\n兜帽女子：做得不错，廷根变得更动荡了……恐惧和死亡总是最好的养料。\n男子：我已经完成任务，你答应过我，会给我晋升的材料。\n兜帽女子：当然，晋升的下个序列是——女巫。\n男子：女巫？！我要晋升为女巫？开什么玩笑？"] = "[Placeholder B] The mirror surface converges, presenting a memory. Trissy and a hooded woman stand face to face. \nHooded Woman: Well done, Tingen has become even more chaotic... Fear and death are always the best nourishment. \nMan: I have completed the quest. You promised me the materials for advancement. \nHooded Woman: Of course, the next Sequence for advancement is—Witch. \nMan: Witch?! I'm to advance to a Witch? Are you kidding me?",
    ["【B占位】马车驶向黑荆棘门口，克莱恩下车，正好遇到一个美丽的女子准备上车。\n她甜美温顺、黑色长发，白皙的皮肤，不知道是不是因为冷，身体有一点点颤抖，但还是显得楚楚可人。\n克莱恩：（不得不承认，这真是我穿越以来见过颜值最高的女孩了。奇怪，她怎么一直在颤抖？）"] = "[Placeholder B] The carriage drives toward the entrance of Blackthorn. Klein gets off and happens to encounter a beautiful woman preparing to board. \n She is sweet and gentle, with long black hair and fair skin. Perhaps due to the cold, her body is trembling slightly, yet she still appears quite charming. \n Klein: (I have to admit, this is truly the most beautiful girl I have seen since I transmigrated. Strange, why does she keep trembling?)",
    ["【CS-1.1】雏菊凋落-第一次循环"] = "【CS-1.1】 Daisy Falls - First Cycle",
