    ["【C占位】\n克莱恩：祭台的位置。\n那是一栋沐浴着黄昏光彩的二层灰蓝色房屋，窗边站着一个女人的背影。房屋的不远处有一条河在静静流淌。"] = "[C Placeholder] \n Klein: The location of the altar. \n It is a two-story gray-blue house bathed in the glow of dusk, with the back of a woman standing by the window. Not far from the house, a river flows quietly.",
    ["【C占位】一个灵体的妇女出现，在糊制着火柴盒。\n妇女：胸好闷……\n慈善医疗虽然是免费的……但要花费一天时间……算了，今天不干活，明天就没饭吃了……"] = "[C Placeholder] A spiritual woman appears, pasting matchboxes. \n Woman: My chest feels so tight... \n Although charity medical care is free... it takes a whole day... forget it, if I don't work today, I won't have food tomorrow...",
    ["【C占位】马车行驶过铁十字街下街，停在一处破旧的房子前。"] = "[Placeholder C] The carriage travels through Lower Street of Iron Cross Street and stops in front of a dilapidated house.",
    ["【C级动画占位】玩家通过梦境占卜，看到了一些模糊的画面。"] = "【C-level animation placeholder】 The player sees some blurry images through dream divination.",
