    ["【QTE】击掌\n克莱恩：我也是这样的态度。\n伦纳德：很高兴我们达成共识。\n伦纳德：在那些冒险小说里，这就叫两位主角相遇了，历史的车轮开始滚滚向前。"] = "[QTE] High five \n Klein: I have the same attitude. \n Leonard: I'm glad we reached a consensus. \n Leonard: In those adventure novels, this is called two protagonists meeting, and the wheels of history begin to roll forward.",
