    ["【cs】克莱恩伸手触摸灰雾空间中的红色星辰，忽然身上涌出水纹，深红星辰爆发出红色的光芒。"] = "[CS] Klein reaches out to touch the red star in the gray fog space, suddenly water ripples emerge on his body, and the deep red star erupts with red light.",
