    ["【临时】你战至力竭，绯红如潮水般席卷而来。"] = "[Temporary] You fight until exhaustion, and the crimson color sweeps over like a tide.",
    ["【临时】克莱恩伸手触摸灰雾空间中的红色星辰，忽然身上涌出水纹，深红星辰爆发出红色的光芒。\n在神弃之地，戴里克悲伤地跪着，面对着水晶球祈祷着。\n“伟大的神灵啊，请重新将目光投向这个被您遗弃的地方。”\n“伟大的神灵啊，请让我们这些黑暗之民摆脱那宿命的诅咒。”\n正当他要绝望时，水晶球中爆发的一团深红将画面淹没。高大的戴里克出现在灰雾之上，他抬头看着青铜长桌对面被灰雾笼罩的克莱恩。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein reached out to touch the red star in the gray fog space, and suddenly water ripples surged on his body; the deep red star erupted with red light. \n In the Forsaken Land of the Gods, Derrick knelt in sadness, praying while facing a crystal ball. \n \"Great God, please cast your gaze once again upon this place abandoned by you.\" \n \"Great God, please let us, the people of darkness, be rid of that fated Curse.\" \n Just as he was about to despair, a mass of deep red erupting from the crystal ball drowned the scene. The tall Derrick appeared above the gray fog, and he looked up at Klein, who was shrouded in gray fog across the long bronze table.",
    ["【临时】克莱恩和戴里克握着剑，戴里克的手在微微颤抖，他发出一声压抑的呜咽，伴随着天空的一道闪电，将剑插入父母的恶灵。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein and Derrick held the sword; Derrick's hand was trembling slightly. He let out a suppressed sob, and accompanied by a flash of lightning in the sky, he plunged the sword into his parents' Evil Spirit.",
    ["【临时】克莱恩回想着这段时间的占卜，脑中浮现出黄水晶，突然有一些感悟。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein recalled the divination from this period, and a yellow crystal appeared in his mind; he suddenly had some insights.",
    ["【临时】韦尔奇家，凡森特和一位极光灰成员，将安提哥努斯笔记卖给了韦尔奇，最后定格在笔记上。"] = "[Placeholder] At Welch's House, Vincent and a member of the Aurora Order sold the Antigonus Notebook to Welch, finally freezing on the notebook.",
    ["【临时占位】QTE1-克莱恩往坩埚里撒了些奇异的粉末。"] = "[Placeholder] QTE1-Klein sprinkles some strange powder into the crucible.",
    ["【临时占位】QTE2-克莱恩往坩埚里倒了些闪烁的液体。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] QTE2-Klein pours some shimmering liquid into the crucible.",
    ["【临时占位】QTE3-克莱恩往坩埚里放了块不规则的晶体。"] = "[Placeholder] QTE3-Klein puts an irregular crystal into the crucible.",
    ["【临时占位】“她的花一夜开到天明\n但待到白昼睁开了眼睛\n被凝视羞得无处可躲\n她便在眩晕中蔫萎掉落……”"] = "[Placeholder] \"Her flowers bloom overnight until dawn \n But when the day opens its eyes \n Ashamed of being under the Gaze, with nowhere to hide \n She withers and falls in a Stun...\"",
    ["【临时占位】“好的，我去把书包放好！”说着，梅丽莎便匆匆回屋放好了书包……"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] \"Okay, I'll go put my schoolbag away!\" Saying this, Melissa rushes back to her room to put away her schoolbag...",
    ["【临时占位】“霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……霍纳奇斯……弗雷格拉……”"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] \"Hornacis... Flegrea... Hornacis... Flegrea... Hornacis... Flegrea...\"",
    ["【临时占位】一只手给梅丽莎的机械玩偶上了几圈发条。松手后，萌萌的玩偶一摇一摆、在摆满了菜肴的桌子上走着。"] = "[Placeholder] A hand winds up Melissa's mechanical doll a few times. After letting go, the cute doll wobbles and walks on the table filled with dishes.",
    ["【临时占位】你的手指间突然冒出了一点火红的颜色。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] A bit of fiery red color suddenly appears between your fingers.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩下定决心，干脆地一口喝下了魔药。\n很快他不由自主地抽搐起来，眼前迅速变得模糊。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein made up his mind and decisively drank the potion in one gulp. \n Soon, he began to twitch uncontrollably, and his vision rapidly blurred.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩再次尝试——这次，他试图在脑海中勾勒一枚洲际导弹，结果却失败了。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein tries again—this time, he attempts to outline an intercontinental missile in his mind, but fails.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩努力思考了片刻。这次，他决定勾勒一颗光球。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein thinks hard for a moment. This time, he decides to outline a ball of light.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩努力集中精神，想象出一顶半高丝绸礼帽。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Klein tries hard to focus, imagining a silk top hat.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩尝试着集中注意力，并开始在脑海中勾勒一顶半高礼帽……"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Klein tries to concentrate and begins to outline a top hat in his mind...",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩往前走了几步，画面突然发生震动，四周灰雾突然涌起包围形成空气墙。\n灰雾中一个人踉跄出现，痛苦地哀嚎几声，然后崩溃成怪物。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein took a few steps forward, the screen suddenly shook, and gray fog surged around to form an air wall. \n A person stumbled out of the gray fog, wailed in pain, and then collapsed into a monster.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩悠闲地走在大学城的路上，突然感觉不太对。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein was walking leisurely on the road in the University District when he suddenly felt something was wrong.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩掏出刚到手的工资，得意地向梅丽莎展示着。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein takes out his newly received salary and proudly shows it to Melissa.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩环顾四周，科恩黎在处理尸体，周围有行人路过，但对地上的尸体没反应，周围有一层蓝蒙蒙的透明墙的感觉，不远处的唱诗班还在歌唱。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein looks around; Kenley is disposing of the corpse, pedestrians are passing by but not reacting to the body on the ground. There is a feeling of a hazy blue transparent wall around, and the choir not far away is still singing.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩笑着点点头，此时班森从外面走进来，扬了扬手上的纸袋：还有这个。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Klein smiles and nods. At this moment, Benson walks in from outside and raises the paper bag in his hand: And this.",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩转过头，看到两位正走进来的线索。为首的先生和善地打了个招呼，而另外一位先生则手里攥着一份报纸。\n【弹出角色介绍：阿兹克】"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Klein turns his head and sees two clues walking in. The gentleman in the lead greets him kindly, while the other gentleman is clutching a newspaper. \n [Pop up character introduction: Azik]",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩：庆祝未来更好的生活。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein: To a better life in the future.",
    ["【临时占位】大家：干杯！"] = "[Placeholder] Everyone: Cheers!",
    ["【临时占位】怪物突然暴怒，扑向了克莱恩。\n这时，邓恩突然出现，举枪击退怪物，同时开始了吟唱 。"] = "[Placeholder] The monster suddenly flew into a rage and lunged at Klein. \n At this moment, Dunn suddenly appeared, raised his gun to repel the monster, and began to chant.",
    ["【临时占位】房间内的事物开始出现重影，克莱恩的脑袋剧烈疼痛起来，耳边也传来了缥缈的呓语——"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Objects in the room begin to double, Klein's head aches violently, and ethereal whispers reach his ears—",
    ["【临时占位】房间内，老尼尔正在桌前读着书页。突然，他注意到了克莱恩的目光，抬头看了过来。\n【弹出角色介绍：老尼尔】"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] In the room, Old Neil is reading pages at the table. Suddenly, he notices Klein's gaze and looks up. \n [Pop up character introduction: Old Neil]",
    ["【临时占位】梅丽莎：唔（嘴里塞着咀嚼的声音）好吃……赞美女神！"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Melissa: Mmm (chewing sounds in her mouth) delicious... Praise the Lady!",
    ["【临时占位】片刻后，房间里充满了食物的香气。克莱恩满意地点了点头，随后开始把餐食通通摆上餐桌。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] A moment later, the room is filled with the aroma of food. Klein nods with satisfaction and then begins to set all the food on the table.",
    ["【临时占位】班森：来，庆祝克莱恩找到不错的工作！"] = "[Placeholder] Benson: Come, let's celebrate Klein finding a good job!",
    ["【临时占位】画面拉远，兄妹三人围着桌子上正温馨地享用晚餐。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] The camera zooms out; the three siblings are gathered around the table, warmly enjoying dinner.",
    ["【临时占位】眼前闪过白天的另一扇门、梦境的门与桌子上的笔记"] = "[Placeholder] Another door from the day, the door of the dream, and the notebook on the table flashed before your eyes",
    ["【临时占位】突然，你看到了一双没长睫毛的冷漠眼睛。\n它就在老尼尔的身后！"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Suddenly, you see a pair of cold, lashless eyes. \n They are right behind Old Neil!",
    ["【临时占位】红的更红、蓝的更蓝、色块浓郁，灰蒙而虚幻的雾气淡淡弥漫、迷雾深处七彩的光芒闪闪烁烁……"] = "[Placeholder] Reds became redder, blues became bluer, the color blocks were rich, a gray and illusory fog faintly permeated, and seven-colored lights flickered in the depths of the mist...",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔告诉你，这是你自己气场的颜色。\n在他的引导下，你开始四下打量别的东西……"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Old Neil tells you that this is the color of your own aura. \n Under his guidance, you begin to look around at other things...",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔摆了个动作，不知道看到了什么……"] = "[Placeholder] Old Neil strikes a pose, wondering what he saw...",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“在脑海里想象一件常见的物品，将所有注意力都放在上面，不断重复和勾勒这件物品。”"] = "[Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Imagine a common object in your mind, focus all your attention on it, and keep repeating and outlining this object.\"",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“将所有的注意力都放在上面，不断地重复和勾勒这件物品。”"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Put all your attention on it, and keep repeating and outlining this object.\"",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“小家伙，集中精神！”"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Little guy, focus!\"",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“是不是感觉好一点了？”"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Do you feel a bit better?\"",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“然后将勾勒出的物品用一件世界上不存在的、凭空想象出来的物品替换掉。”"] = "[Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Then replace the outlined object with an object that does not exist in the world, something imagined out of thin air.\"",
    ["【临时占位】老尼尔：“这下是不是感觉好一点了？”"] = "[Placeholder] Old Neil: \"Does it feel a bit better now?\"",
    ["【临时占位】这时，梅丽莎也回来了。看着桌上的大餐，她感到十分惊讶：“这都是你做的？”。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] At this time, Melissa also returns. Looking at the feast on the table, she is very surprised: \"Did you make all this?\"",
    ["【临时占位】这里是一段精美的动画"] = "[Placeholder] This is a beautiful animation",
    ["【临时占位】邓恩与敌人僵持着，似乎一起陷入了沉睡。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Dunn is in a stalemate with the enemy, and it seems they have both fallen into a deep sleep.",
    ["【临时占位】邓恩动了起来，一枪击杀了怪物。而值夜者科恩黎也赶了过来，开始清场控场。"] = "[Placeholder] Dunn moved and killed the monster with a single shot. The Nighthawk Kenley also arrived to clear and control the scene.",
    ["【临时占位】邓恩安抚克莱恩：没事了，克莱恩，先回公司。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] Dunn pacifies Klein: It's alright, Klein, go back to the company first.",
    ["【临时占位】钢笔在合同上的最后一笔抬起，克莱恩拿起合同递给了邓恩。\n邓恩接过后草草看了一眼，笑着向克莱恩伸出手：欢迎你，克莱恩，从现在开始，你就是我们的一员了。"] = "[Temporary Placeholder] The pen lifts after the final stroke on the contract, and Klein picks up the contract and hands it to Dunn. \n Dunn takes it, glances at it briefly, and smiles as he reaches out to Klein: Welcome, Klein. From now on, you are one of us.",
    ["【临时占位标注：本任务所有资产都是临时资产，仅过剧情流程用，正式内容大部分是cs】\n祈祷声落，灰雾弥漫的▉▉"] = "[Placeholder: All assets in this quest are temporary and for plot flow only; most official content is CS] \n As the prayer ended, the gray fog permeated ▉▉",
