    ["【加入房间】"] = "[Join Room]",
    ["【加入阵营】我挺你！"] = "[Join Faction] I support you!",
    ["【北区氛围】哈罗德百货安保"] = "[North District Atmosphere] Harold Department Store Security",
    ["【北区氛围】黑夜教堂前导游"] = "[North District Atmosphere] Tour Guide in front of Night Cathedral",
    ["【北区氛围】黑夜教堂前扫地"] = "[North District Atmosphere] Sweeper in front of Night Cathedral",
    ["【占】伦纳德高举知识皇冠，大家都成功在廷根瓦解前回到了现实世界。\n一段时间后，大家的生活似乎都回到了正轨，黑荆棘在紫藤花廊下拍照。"] = "[Placeholder] Leonard holds the Crown of Knowledge high, and everyone successfully returns to the real world before Tingen collapses.\n After a period of time, everyone's lives seem to have returned to normal, and the Nighthawks are taking photos under the wisteria corridor.",
    ["【占】你与弗莱被屏障击退，被身后的藤蔓扶了一把。\n一名神秘女士顺着藤蔓楼梯优雅走来。\n神秘女士：找到你的同事了？"] = "[Placeholder] You and Frye are knocked back by the barrier and are supported by the vines behind you.\n A mysterious lady walks down the vine staircase elegantly.\n Mysterious lady: Found your colleague?",
    ["【占】安全屋前，罗珊正焦急地帮助幸存市民逃生，弗莱以血肉之躯帮众人挡住镜雨。"] = "[Placeholder] In front of the safe house, Rozanne is anxiously helping surviving citizens escape, and Frye uses his flesh and blood to block the mirror rain for everyone.",
    ["【占】弗莱：……不好，安全屋有危险！"] = "[Placeholder] Frye: ...Not good, the safe house is in danger!",
    ["【占】扒手要逃跑，汤姆骑着新自行车狠狠撞翻了他。\n玩家：记住，这次是猎龙帮惹到我了。"] = "[Placeholder] The pickpocket tries to run away, but Tom rides his new bicycle and knocks him over hard.\n Player: Remember, this time the Dragon Hunter Gang messed with the wrong person.",
    ["【占】玩家和弗莱来到路口，半空的建筑从天而降，二人接连躲闪，被迫分开。"] = "[Placeholder] The player and Frye arrive at the intersection, and buildings from mid-air fall from the sky. The two dodge repeatedly and are forced to separate.",
    ["【占】玩家和弗莱离开安全屋，发现绯红月色下，市民们接连化作信息洪流，真正的危机到来。"] = "[Placeholder] The player and Frye leave the safe house and discover that under the crimson moonlight, the citizens are turning into a torrent of information one after another; the real crisis has arrived.",
    ["【占】玩家四下找不到钱包，远处扒手贝克正要得意离开，被玩家发现。"] = "[Placeholder] The player looks around but cannot find their wallet; in the distance, the pickpocket Baker is about to leave triumphantly when he is discovered by the player.",
    ["【占】玩家对受伤的子爵夫人开枪，绝望魔镜替子爵夫人挡住致命的子弹。\n绝望魔镜：唔……再见……海伦……娜……"] = "[Placeholder] The player fires at the injured Viscountess, and the Magic Mirror of Despair blocks the fatal bullet for her.\n Magic Mirror of Despair: Ugh... goodbye... Helena...",
    ["【占】玩家终于甩开了绯色洪流，到达了中央广场，弗莱已经在这里等候。\n绯红月色下，教授正在举行献祭仪式，疯狂的市民涌向广场中央，化作信息洪流献祭给母神。"] = "[Placeholder] The player finally shakes off the crimson torrent and reaches the Central Plaza, where Frye is already waiting.\n Under the crimson moonlight, the professor is holding a sacrifice ritual, and the crazed citizens are pouring into the center of the plaza, turning into a torrent of information to be sacrificed to the Mother Goddess.",
    ["【占】罗塞尔的意志苏醒，汇聚知识洪流凝聚成大炮，轰向屏障，月亮瞬间变成了银白色。"] = "[Placeholder] Roselle's will awakens, gathering a torrent of knowledge into a cannon, which blasts at the barrier, and the moon instantly turns silver-white.",
    ["【占】魔镜碎裂之际，子爵夫人出现。\n子爵夫人：不得无礼！"] = "[Placeholder] As the magic mirror shatters, the Viscountess appears.\n Viscountess: Do not be rude!",
    ["【占位-QTE】克莱恩飞快地构建起灵性之墙，封死了整个房间。"] = "[Placeholder-QTE] Klein quickly constructs a wall of spirituality, sealing off the entire room.",
    ["【占位-动画】“你知道韦尔奇和娜娅的事吗？”"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] \"Do you know about Welch and Naya?\"",
    ["【占位-动画】三人开心地出了门，坐上了驶向法尼亚街的马车。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] The three of them happily go out and get into a carriage heading to Fania Street.",
    ["【占位-动画】三兄妹（一起碰杯）：“干杯！”"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] The three siblings (clinking glasses together): \"Cheers!\"",
    ["【占位-动画】克莱恩沿着楼梯向上走去。突然，一道身影拦在了他的面前。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Klein walks up the stairs. Suddenly, a figure blocks his path.",
    ["【占位-动画】克莱恩给梅丽莎的机械玩偶上了几圈发条，让它在摆满菜肴的桌子上一摇一摆地走了起来。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Klein winds up Melissa's mechanical doll a few times, letting it wobble across the table filled with dishes.",
    ["【占位-动画】克莱恩（也举杯）：“庆祝未来更好的生活！”"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Klein (also raising his glass): \"To a better life in the future!\"",
    ["【占位-动画】接着，他飞快地点燃蜡烛、激活了净化仪式。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Next, he quickly lights the candles and activates the purification ritual.",
    ["【占位-动画】梅丽莎：“唔（咀嚼声）……好吃……赞美女神！”"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Melissa: \"Mmm (chewing sound)... delicious... Praise the Goddess!\"",
    ["【占位-动画】玩家走近前台，罗珊正在照镜子。罗珊注意到玩家，镜子放桌面，给特写两人进行对话"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] The player walks to the front desk, and Rozanne is looking in the mirror. Rozanne notices the player, puts the mirror on the table, and a close-up shows the two of them talking.",
    ["【占位-动画】班森（举杯）：“来，庆祝克莱恩找到不错的工作！”"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Benson (raising his glass): \"Come, let's celebrate Klein finding a good job!\"",
    ["【占位-动画】画面拉远，兄妹三人围着桌子，正温馨地享用着晚餐。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] The camera zooms out to show the three siblings gathered around the table, warmly enjoying their dinner.",
    ["【占位-动画】调配魔药动画"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Potion brewing animation.",
    ["【占位-动画】赛琳娜似乎察觉到了什么！她迅速转身，不仅皮肤变得苍白，还长出了尖锐骇人的指甲。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Selena seems to have sensed something! She turns around quickly, her skin not only becoming pale but also growing sharp, terrifying nails.",
    ["【占位-动画】趁赛琳娜东张西望的空隙，克莱恩从角落里悄悄现身了。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Taking advantage of the moment Selena is looking around, Klein quietly appears from the corner.",
    ["【占位-对话】“没事的，这是查尼斯门，名字来源于值夜者体系的创立者查尼斯大主教。”"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] \"It's fine, this is the Chanis Gate, named after Archbishop Chanis, the founder of the Nighthawk system.\"",
    ["【占位-对话】克莱恩凑近查尼斯门，仔细地观察了一通。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] Klein leans close to the Chanis Gate and observes it carefully.",
    ["【占位-对话】在罗珊的介绍下，克莱恩和弗莱寒暄了一番。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] Under Rozanne's introduction, Klein exchanges pleasantries with Frye.",
    ["【占位-对话】在罗珊的介绍下，克莱恩和科恩黎、西迦寒暄了一番。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] Under Rozanne's introduction, Klein exchanges pleasantries with Kenley and Xiga.",
    ["【占位-对话】突然，从门内传出了剧烈的锤击声，整个门都跟着震动了起来。看到这种变故，克莱恩惊恐地向后退去。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] Suddenly, violent pounding sounds come from inside the door, and the entire door shakes along with it. Seeing this turn of events, Klein retreats in terror.",
    ["【占位-对话】邓恩从克莱恩身后走了出来。看到他出现，克莱恩也不由得放松了下来。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] Dunn walks out from behind Klein. Seeing him appear, Klein cannot help but relax.",
    ["【占位-对话】震动突然停息，就和它开始的时候一样突然。克莱恩不明所以地盯着这扇门（同时也惊魂未定）。"] = "[Placeholder-Dialogue] The shaking stops as suddenly as it began. Klein stares at the door, bewildered (and still shaken).",
    ["【占位】玩家从文字道路上拆下文字，填入【污水引离法】后，排水口打开，污水排走，玩家离开。"] = "[Placeholder] The player removes the text from the text path and fills it into the [Sewage Diversion Method]. The drain opens, the sewage drains away, and the player leaves.",
    ["【占位】链条底端的黄水晶轻轻动了起来，做出顺时针旋转。"] = "【Placeholder】The yellow crystal at the end of the chain moves gently, rotating clockwise.",
    ["【占位】闪回梦境占卜中温妮失踪前的一幕。"] = "【Placeholder】 Flashback to the scene before Winnie went missing in the dream divination.",
    ["【占卜家】(2) 距离越远伤害越高，最高追加15%攻击力的距离增伤。"] = "【Seer】(2) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 15% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["【占卜家】(4) 距离越远伤害越高，最高追加30%攻击力的距离增伤。"] = "【Seer】(4) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 30% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["【占卜家】(6) +25%攻击力"] = "【Seer】(6) +25% Attack Power",
    ["【右摇杆模式1】对选取范围内所有敌人造成多次不同效果的伤害"] = "【Right Stick Mode 1】 Deals multiple types of damage with different effects to all enemies within the selected range.",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，可释放连击技能，连击完成后进入冷却"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Deals effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center. Can release combo skills; enters cooldown after the combo is finished.",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并释放连击技能，连击完成后进入冷却"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Use self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front, and release a combo skill; enters cooldown after the combo is completed.",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】模板7技能的连击，以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并击退"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, dealing effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center, and knocks back.",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】模板7技能的连击，以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并挑飞"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, using self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front and knock enemies into the air.",
    ["【右摇杆模式4】对身前矩形范围内敌人攻击。"] = "[Right Stick Mode 4] Attack enemies in a rectangle in front.",
    ["【右摇杆模式4】对身前矩形范围内敌人攻击。注意目标筛选的长宽参数与右摇杆模式预警参数是相关的。"] = "[Right Stick Mode 4] Attacks enemies within a rectangular range in front. Note that the target filtering length and width parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters.",
    ["【右摇杆模式7】对身前圆形范围内敌人攻击。注意目标筛选的偏移和半径参数与右摇杆模式预警参数是相关的。"] = "[Right Stick Mode 7] Attacks enemies within a circular range in front. Note that the target filtering offset and radius parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters.",
    ["【告解室】位面用保底复活点"] = "[Confessional] Plane-use safety respawn point",
    ["【命运人偶】应召降临，乱战一触即发，各位猎手速速集结，莫让猎物落入他人之手！"] = "【Fate Marionette】 has descended upon summons. A chaotic battle is imminent. Hunters, assemble quickly, and do not let the prey fall into others' hands!",
    ["【嘶~】小羊玩偶的肚子被切开，露出了一些奇怪的金属光泽。"] = "[Hiss~] The belly of the lamb doll is cut open, revealing some strange metallic luster.",
    ["【回收】退款处理"] = "[Recovery] Refund Processing",
    ["【困难】挑战“剥面人”强尼"] = "[Hard] Challenge \"Face-Ripper\" Johnny",
    ["【困难】挑战“头狼”鲁珀"] = "[Hard] Challenge Luper, the Alpha Wolf",
    ["【困难】挑战“审判官”布莱克"] = "[Hard] Challenge Blake, the Judge",
    ["【困难】挑战“钻头”"] = "[Hard] Challenge Drill",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“剥面人”强尼失去理智，向你亮出了利爪。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Face-Peeler\" Johnny has lost his mind and bared his claws at you.",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“头狼”鲁珀彻底疯狂，向你亮出了獠牙。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Alpha Wolf\" Luper has gone completely mad and bared his fangs at you.",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“审判官”布莱克不再隐藏，向你举起了屠刀。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Inquisitor\" Blake is no longer hiding and has raised his butcher's knife at you.",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“钻头”完全失控，向你发射出电流。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Drill\" has completely lost control and is firing currents at you.",
    ["【困难难度】已解锁"] = "[Hard Difficulty] unlocked",
