    ["【墓园】谢谢"] = "[Cemetery] Thank you",
    ["【增强】对<HighLight>3</>格内敌方持续施加<HighLight>0.75%</>灼烧和<HighLight>30%</>重伤效果。"] = "[Enhanced] Continuously inflict <HighLight>0.75%</> Burn and <HighLight>30%</> Grievous Injury on enemies within <HighLight>3</> tiles.",
    ["【增强】对<HighLight>3</>格内敌方持续施加<HighLight>25%</>防御削减。"] = "[Enhanced] Continuously inflict <HighLight>25%</> Defense reduction on enemies within <HighLight>3</> tiles.",
    ["【增强】对生命值高于<HighLight>50%</>的目标，造成的伤害加深<HighLight>15%</>。"] = "[Enhanced] Deals <HighLight>15%</> increased damage to targets with higher than <HighLight>50%</> Health.",
    ["【增强】战斗开始后<HighLight>25</>秒内获得霸体，免疫控制。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain Super Armor and immunity to crowd control for <HighLight>25</> seconds after combat starts.",
    ["【增强】战斗开始时获得相当于<HighLight>30%</>最大生命值的护盾，持续<HighLight>8</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>30%</> Max Health for <HighLight>8</> seconds at the start of combat.",
    ["【增强】战斗开始时获得相当于<HighLight>35%</>最大生命值的护盾，持续<HighLight>8</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>35%</> Max Health for <HighLight>8</> seconds at the start of combat.",
    ["【增强】攻击和技能造成持续<HighLight>5</>秒的<HighLight>1.5%</>灼烧和<HighLight>50%</>重伤效果。"] = "[Enhanced] Attack and skill damage inflict <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>1.5%</> Burn and <HighLight>50%</> Grievous Injury.",
    ["【增强】攻击或技能造成伤害后，使目标防御降低<HighLight>45%</>，持续<HighLight>3</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] After dealing damage with an attack or skill, reduce the target's Defense by <HighLight>45%</> for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["【增强】普攻后恢复<HighLight>5</>点法力值。"] = "[Enhanced] Restores <HighLight>5</> Mana after a basic attack.",
    ["【增强】暴击后有额外<HighLight>50%</>暴击伤害，持续<HighLight>3</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits deal an additional <HighLight>50%</> Critical Damage for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["【增强】暴击提供持续<HighLight>5</>秒的<HighLight>5%</>伤害加深，可叠加至多<HighLight>4</>次。"] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits provide <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>5%</> increased damage, stacking up to <HighLight>4</> times.",
    ["【增强】每次普攻获得<HighLight>7%</>攻速，最多叠加<HighLight>10</>次。"] = "[Enhanced] Each basic attack grants <HighLight>7%</> Attack Speed, stacking up to <HighLight>10</> times.",
    ["【增强】每秒恢复<HighLight>4</>点生命值。"] = "[Enhanced] Restores <HighLight>4</> Health per second.",
    ["【增强】生命值低于<HighLight>40%</>时，获得相当于<HighLight>35%</>最大生命值的护盾，持续<HighLight>5</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] When Health is below <HighLight>40%</>, gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>35%</> Max Health for <HighLight>5</> seconds.",
    ["【增强】生命值低于<HighLight>50%</>时，额外获得<HighLight>20%</>伤害减免。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain an additional <HighLight>20%</> Damage Reduction when Health is below <HighLight>50%</>.",
    ["【增强】造成或承受伤害时获得<HighLight>2%</>攻击加成，最高叠加<HighLight>15</>层。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain <HighLight>2%</> Attack bonus when dealing or taking damage, stacking up to <HighLight>15</> times.",
    ["【复活点】"] = "[Resurrection Point]",
    ["【失败】场景红光"] = "[Failure] Scene Red Light",
    ["【奖励】公测预约奖励"] = "[Reward] Open Beta Pre-registration Rewards",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演占卜家】\n霍纳奇斯花海，一位女士站在许愿树下，着急地四处张望着……"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Seer】 \n At the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously...",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演学徒】\n一间旧公寓，锁匠大师的孩子把自己反锁在房间里，连大师本人都打不开。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as an Apprentice】 \n In an old apartment, the locksmith master's child has locked themselves in the room, and even the master himself cannot open it.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演战士】\n在金秋湖畔的木屋边，你看见两个粗暴的混混正在找一个女孩的麻烦……"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Warrior】 \n Beside the wooden house by Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演歌颂者】\n街角长椅上，年轻人的肩膀微微发抖。他面前摆着一束花和一封信，但手怎么都伸不出去。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Bard】 \n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演窥秘人】\n东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Mystery Pryer】 \n There is a small house on the old street in the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演观众】\n在金秋湖车站旁，你看到一个奇怪的人，他自称是一朵蘑菇。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Spectator】 \n Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演占星人】\n占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演太阳神官】\n艾米丽·莫里森，一个看不见光的盲人女孩。但她用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，她是街角最明亮的小太阳。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Sun Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演巫师】\n午夜时分，居然还有营业的书店？"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演心理医生】\n深夜的街道上，一个年轻人坐在路灯下，眼神空洞，显然已经很久没有好好睡过一觉了。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Psychiatrist】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演武器大师】\n集市上有人在卖生锈的旧枪，只能当装饰品挂在墙上。你觉得有意思，特意过去淘货。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Weapon Master】 \n Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be hung on the wall as decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演魔术师】\n廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Magician】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演小丑】\n儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 "] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Clown】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演戏法大师】\n村庄里的无赖以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time...",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗学者】\n巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗家】\n廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Tingen, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演祈光人】\n一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演读心者】\n诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Reader】 \n Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something.",
