    ["【实证】"] = "[Empirical Evidence]",
    ["【实证】仪式魔法造成的伤害增加30%。"] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 30%.",
    ["【实证】仪式魔法造成的伤害增加40%。"] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 40%.",
    ["【实证】加速效果提升至15%，减速效果提升至15%。"] = "[Proof] Acceleration effect increased to 15%, Slow effect increased to 15%.",
    ["【实证】回复量增加10%，不超过施法者血量上限22%。"] = "[Empirical] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 22% of the caster's maximum health.",
    ["【实证】引爆暗影能量的伤害提高20%。"] = "[Proof] Damage from detonating shadow energy increased by 20%.",
    ["【实证】明灯的护盾量增加10%，爆炸伤害增加30%。"] = "[Proof] Beacon's Shield amount increased by 10%, Explosion damage increased by 30%.",
    ["【实证】死亡之握的伤害额外增加30%。"] = "[Proof] Damage of Grasp of Death. increased by an additional 30%.",
    ["【实证】每次叠加扭曲效果时会同时造成一次伤害，若目标身上有护盾，则伤害变为1.5倍。"] = "[Proof] Each time a Distortion effect is stacked, it simultaneously deals damage. If the target has a Shield, the damage becomes 1.5 times.",
    ["【实证】灰雾加持时间内，释放技能自身体力值额外增加2点。"] = "[Proof] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points.",
    ["【实证】电流效果持续时间加1秒，伤害增加5%。"] = "[Proof] Current effect duration increased by 1 second, damage increased by 5%.",
    ["【实证】羁绊【风闻】削弱的技能抵挡进一步提高。"] = "[Proof] The Skill Block weakened by the [Rumor] bond is further increased.",
    ["【实证】诗意光环持续时间增加1秒。"] = "[Proof] Poetic aura duration increased by 1 second.",
