    ["【晋升】序列晋升上限提升至7,1250340"] = "【Advancement】Sequence advancement cap increased to 7, 1250340",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演占星人】\n占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演太阳神官】\n艾米丽·莫里森，一个看不见光的盲人女孩。但她用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，她是街角最明亮的小太阳。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Solar High Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演巫师】\n午夜时分，居然还有营业的书店？"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演心理医生】\n深夜的街道上，一个年轻人坐在路灯下，眼神空洞，显然已经很久没有好好睡过一觉了。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Psychiatrist】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演武器大师】\n集市上有人在卖生锈的旧枪，只能当装饰品挂在墙上。你觉得有意思，特意过去淘货。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Weapon Master】 \n Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be hung on the wall as decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演魔术师】\n廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Magician】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演小丑】\n儿童病房里有个小女孩，已经很久没笑过了。她最大的愿望是看一场小丑表演。 "] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Clown】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance.",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演戏法大师】\n村庄里的无赖以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time...",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗学者】\n巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗家】\n廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Tingen, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演祈光人】\n一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演读心者】\n诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Reader】 \n Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something.",
    ["【暂代】十几个市民聚集在罗珊周围"] = "[Placeholder] More than a dozen citizens gather around Rozanne.",
    ["【暂代】有人突然高举双手，有人的躯体僵硬地扭曲，开始攻击周围人。人群发出尖叫，四散开来。"] = "[Placeholder] Someone suddenly raises their hands, while others' bodies twist stiffly and begin to attack those around them. The crowd screams and scatters.",
    ["【暂代】罗珊救人时，被怪物偷袭，贝尔纳黛突然出现，抬手解决了怪物。"] = "[Placeholder] When Rozanne is saving someone, she is ambushed by a monster, and Bernadette suddenly appears, raising her hand to take care of the monster.",
    ["【暂代资源】玩家磕完药意识回到炼金室动画制作中……"] = "[Placeholder Resource] Animation of the player's consciousness returning to the alchemy room after taking the potion is in production...",
    ["【暂代资源】神之途径动画制作中……"] = "[Placeholder Resource] God's Pathway animation in production...",
    ["【暂用】浇醒菲利普"] = "[Temporary] Wake up Philip",
    ["【暗影斗篷】+5%伤害减免"] = "【Shadow Cloak】+5% Damage Reduction",
    ["【替代3D检视】一只玩偶小羊，看得出来它的主人很爱惜它。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] A plush lamb doll; it is clear that its owner cherished it very much.",
    ["【替代3D检视】一张维多利亚风格的贺卡。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] A Victorian-style greeting card.",
    ["【替代3D检视】一本古朴的笔记，静静地躺在那里。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] A quaint notebook, lying there quietly.",
    ["【替代3D检视】一本古朴的笔记，靠近时耳边隐约响起了一些呓语。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] A quaint notebook; as you approach, faint whispers echo in your ears.",
    ["【替代3D检视】小羊肚子上有缝合的痕迹，使用<P_Yellow>利器</>也许可以割开。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] There are stitches on the lamb's belly. Perhaps you could cut it open using a <P_Yellow>sharp tool</>.",
    ["【替代3D检视】月亮型花架上开满花，中间放着一个僵直的月亮木偶。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] A moon-shaped flower stand covered in flowers, with a stiff moon puppet placed in the center.",
    ["【替代3D检视】树干上依稀可以看到一些杂乱的刻痕，好像是什么人留下的信息。"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] Some messy carvings are faintly visible on the tree trunk, as if they were information left by someone.",
    ["【替代3D检视】法阵的中央空着一块，要把什么摆上去呢？"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] The center of the magic circle is empty. What should be placed there?",
    ["【最后一页】窥秘人进入"] = "[Last Page] Mystery Pryer enters",
    ["【最后一页】触发"] = "【Last Page】Trigger",
    ["【最后一页】进入位面"] = "[Last Page] Enter plane",
    ["【最后横路西侧封路】"] = "【Final road closure on the west side of the crossroad】",
    ["【本相】"] = "[True Form]",
    ["【本相】仪式魔法在第3次伤害时，对于有死亡侵蚀效果的目标伤害额外提升150%，对于无死亡侵蚀的目标有16%概率附加死亡侵蚀效果。"] = "[True Form] On the 3rd hit of Ritual Magic, damage is increased by an additional 150% for targets with the Death Erosion effect, and there is a 16% chance to apply Death Erosion to targets without it.",
    ["【本相】友方离开通灵仪式范围后可以额外保留2秒加速效果。敌方离开通灵仪式范围内时减速效果额外保留2秒。"] = "[True Form] Allies can retain the Acceleration effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range. Enemies retain the Slow effect for an additional 2 seconds after leaving the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range.",
    ["【本相】插下旗帜的同时，帝国旗帜对范围内敌方目标造成一定伤害，对范围的其他旗帜或有护盾的目标额外造成50%的伤害。"] = "[True Form] Upon planting the flag, the Imperial Flag deals a certain amount of damage to enemy targets within range, and deals an additional 50% damage to other flags or targets with Shields within range.",
    ["【本相】新增二段—合奏诗篇：释放后获得合奏效果：若自身和合奏效果的友方对同一个目标造成伤害，则额外造成目标已损失血量10%的伤害（不超过自身攻击23.7%），同一个目标2秒只能触发1次，持续10秒。"] = "[True Form] Adds a second-stage skill—Ensemble Poem: After release, gain the Ensemble effect: If self and allies with the Ensemble effect deal damage to the same target, deal an additional 10% of the target's lost Health as damage (not exceeding 23.7% of own Attack). The same target can only trigger this once every 2 seconds, lasting 10 seconds.",
    ["【本相】梦魇冲击的引爆伤害命中敌人数大于等于3时，生成一个梦魇核心，延迟1秒后梦魇核心发生爆炸，造成范围伤害。"] = "[True Form] When the detonation damage of Nightmare Impact hits 3 or more enemies, it generates a Nightmare Core. After a 1-second delay, the Nightmare Core explodes, dealing area damage.",
    ["【本相】梦魇命中后生成的仪式魔法会扩大两次，造成的伤害也会相应提高。"] = "[True Form] The Ritual Magic generated after Nightmare hits will expand twice, and the damage dealt will increase accordingly.",
    ["【本相】梦魇命中敌方目标后令敌方目标在6秒内带有宁静光环，该光环可减少周围敌方目标技能抵挡。"] = "[True Form] After Nightmare hits an enemy target, it inflicts a Tranquility aura on the enemy target for 6 seconds. This aura reduces the Skill Block of surrounding enemy targets.",
    ["【本相】死亡之握每命中一个目标，降低自身冷却时间1秒，最多降低4秒。\n死亡之握每命中一个目标都会汲取目标的一个灵魂碎片，汲取10个灵魂碎片后在目标位置生成一个亡灵，亡灵在3秒后进行灵魂收割，对周围目标造成伤害。\n如果伤害击杀目标则算作汲取2个碎片。"] = "[True Form] Each target hit by Grasp of Death. reduces own Cooldown by 1 second, up to 4 seconds. \n Each target hit by Grasp of Death. will extract a Soul Fragment from the target. After extracting 10 Soul Fragments, a Wraith is generated at the target's location. The Wraith performs a Soul Harvest after 3 seconds, dealing damage to surrounding targets. \n If the damage kills the target, it counts as extracting 2 fragments.",
    ["【本相】电流持续期间目标脚下会生成一个跟随目标的静电立场，对范围内的敌人持续造成伤害，持续5秒。"] = "[True Form] During the Current duration, a static field following the target is generated at the target's feet, continuously dealing damage to enemies within range for 5 seconds.",
    ["【本相】若未触发低于20%立即恢复生命效果，则额外降低该技能冷却时间2秒。"] = "[True Form] If the immediate Health restoration effect below 20% is not triggered, reduce the skill's Cooldown by an additional 2 seconds.",
    ["【本相】释放二段技能灰雾加持或者灰雾压制后，降低自身解控技能冷却时间3秒。"] = "[True Form] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, reduce the Cooldown of own Cleanse skills by 3 seconds.",
    ["【本相】释放灰雾加持或者灰雾压制时，使身上具有历史明灯标志的友方额外获得护盾，但是会移除历史明灯标志，该护盾结束时不会对周围目标造成伤害。"] = "[True Form] When releasing gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, allies with the Historical Beacon mark gain an additional Shield, but the Historical Beacon mark is removed. This Shield does not deal damage to surrounding targets when it ends.",
    ["【查看详情】"] = "[View Details]",
