    ["【正式资源】告解室"] = "[Official Resource] Confessional",
    ["【正式资源】告解室门帘"] = "[Official Resource] Confessional curtain",
    ["【正式资源】墓园告解室"] = "【Official Resource】Cemetery Confessional",
    ["【死亡教派】(3) 全队 +10%攻击力"] = "【Death Sect】(3) Entire team +10% Attack Power",
    ["【死亡教派】(5) 全队 +20%攻击力 +5%吸血"] = "【Death Sect】(5) Entire team +20% Attack Power +5% Life Steal",
    ["【死亡教派】(7) 全队 +35%攻击力 +10%吸血"] = "【Death Sect】(7) Entire team +35% Attack Power +10% Life Steal",
    ["【死神装备】额外提升<HighLight>10%</>攻击。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Attack.",
    ["【死神装备】额外获得<HighLight>10%</>吸血。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Life Steal.",
    ["【死神装备】额外获得<HighLight>5%</>伤害减免。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>5%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["【死神镰刀】+10%攻击力"] = "【Death Scythe】+10% Attack Power",
    ["【氛围】文献库门光点"] = "[Ambience] Library Door Light Point",
    ["【氛围】炼金室门光点"] = "[Atmosphere] Alchemy Room door light spot",
    ["【氛围】舞蹈"] = "【Atmosphere】Dance",
    ["【氛围】隐藏场景原有门"] = "[Ambience] Original Door in Hidden Scene",
    ["【氛围】音乐"] = "[Atmosphere] Music",
    ["【浅见】"] = "[Shallow Insight]",
    ["【浅见】宁静光环内的友方和自身每次攻击目标可以回复少量生命，1秒最多触发1次，诗意光环半径增加2米。"] = "[Insight] Allies and self within the Tranquility aura can recover a small amount of Health with each attack on a target, triggering at most once per second. The Poetic aura radius is increased by 2 meters.",
    ["【浅见】帝国旗帜对范围内的目标每4秒叠加1层扭曲效果（扭曲：降低控制抵抗），最多3层。"] = "[Insight] The Imperial Flag stacks 1 layer of Distortion effect on targets within range every 4 seconds (Distortion: reduces Control resistance), up to 3 layers.",
    ["【浅见】明灯的护盾结束时造成一次爆炸，对护盾周围至多2个目标造成伤害。"] = "[Insight] When the Beacon's Shield ends, it causes an Explosion, dealing damage to up to 2 targets around the Shield.",
    ["【浅见】暗影能量爆炸命中的玩家目标30%概率附加恐惧，持续时间为1.2秒，恐惧效果实际命中率和时长受眩晕相关属性影响。"] = "[Insight] Player targets hit by the shadow energy explosion have a 30% chance to be inflicted with Horror for 1.2 seconds. The actual hit rate and duration of the Horror effect are affected by Stun-related attributes.",
    ["【浅见】梦魇命中目标后有30%基础概率附加滞涩，持续3秒，生成的仪式魔法附加5%减速。"] = "[Insight] After Nightmare hits a target, it has a 30% base chance to apply Stagnation for 3 seconds, and the generated Ritual Magic applies a 5% Slow.",
    ["【浅见】梦魇突袭命中目标后减少目标护盾一定值，若目标不存在护盾，则该技能额外削弱目标技能抵挡。"] = "[Insight] After Nightmare Assault hits a target, it reduces the target's Shield by a certain value. If the target does not have a Shield, this skill additionally weakens the target's Skill Block.",
    ["【浅见】死亡之爪生成的仪式魔法会附加5%减速和30%重伤效果，持续4秒。减速效果可以叠加。"] = "[Insight] The Ritual Magic generated by Grasp of Death applies a 5% Slow and 30% Grievous Injury effect for 4 seconds. The Slow effect can stack.",
    ["【浅见】死亡侵蚀期间目标获得66%重伤。"] = "[Insight] During Death Erosion, the target gains 66% Grievous Injury.",
    ["【浅见】电流期间目标受到的电流伤害有概率产生波动，波动区间为100%-150%。"] = "[Insight] During the Current effect, the Current damage dealt to the target has a chance to fluctuate, with a fluctuation range of 100%-150%.",
    ["【浅见】触发低于20%立即恢复生命效果时目标额外获得减伤20%，持续5秒。"] = "[Insight] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 20% Damage Reduction for 5 seconds.",
    ["【浅见】释放二段技能灰雾加持或者灰雾压制后，10秒内提升自身控制抵挡。"] = "[Insight] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, increase own Control resistance for 10 seconds.",
    ["【浅见】释放通灵仪式时（仅释放瞬间）驱散范围内友方身上的减速效果。"] = "[Insight] When releasing the Spirit Mediumship Ritual (only at the moment of release), dispel Slow effects on allies within range.",
    ["【测试】"] = "[Test]",
