    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>10%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>5%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>10%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>5%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>20%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>10%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>20%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>10%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>30%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>15%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>30%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>15%</> Damage Reduction.",
    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>50%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>25%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>50%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>25%</> Damage Reduction.",
