    ["【转弯操控 】<Quality_3>普通</>\n【冲刺速度 】<Quality_4>3 级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局出厂的优秀款式，零件易换，故障少，动力系统足够支持每一次畅行</>"] = "【Steering Control】<Quality_3>Normal</>\n【Sprint Speed】<Quality_4> Level 3 </>\n<Dark>An excellent model from the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau, parts are easy to replace, few faults, and the power system is sufficient to support every smooth journey</>",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_3>普通</>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_3>1级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局的最初杰作，象征着这个品牌的起点与建立，经得起一切历史的打磨与考验，真正的奠基之作。</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_3>Normal</>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_3>Level 1</>\n<Dark> The initial masterpiece of the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau, symbolizing the starting point and establishment of this brand, capable of withstanding the test of all history—a true foundational work.</>",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_3>普通</>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_4>2级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局的经典款式，它结构简洁，重量轻便，保留原点之作的基础上，进一步迭代出属于制造局的经典杰作。</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_3>Normal</>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_4>Level 2</>\n<Dark> A classic model from the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau. With a simple structure and light weight, it further iterates into a classic masterpiece belonging to the Bureau based on the original work.</>",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_3>普通</>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_5>3级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局出厂的优秀款式，零件易换，故障少有，动力系统足够支持每一次畅行，属于是中产阶级最宠爱的居家出行必备交通工具。</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_3>Normal</>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_5>Level 3</>\n<Dark> An excellent model from the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau. Parts are easy to replace, breakdowns are rare, and the power system is sufficient for every smooth journey—it is the essential home travel tool most loved by the middle class.</>",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_6>优秀 </>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_6>4级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局荣誉出品，出厂的每一台都在试车场测试过，动力扎实，转向跟手，是廷根人最信得过的“汽车心脏”，是上层社会的宠儿。</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_6>Excellent </>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_6>Level 4</>\n<Dark> Honorably produced by the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau, every unit has been tested on the track. With solid power and responsive steering, it is the most trusted \"car heart\" for Tingen residents and a darling of the upper class.</>",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_7>卓越</>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_7>5级</>\n<Dark>制造局的首席工程师监制，全鲁恩限量出品，动力强劲，加速响应敏捷。它将用速度奏响华丽的乐章，它是你最为可靠与勇猛的伙伴！</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_7>Superior</>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_7>Level 5</>\n<Dark> Supervised by the Chief Engineer of the Manufacturing Bureau and limited to Loen, it features powerful performance and agile acceleration. It will play a magnificent movement with speed; it is your most reliable and valiant partner!</>",
