    ["【附身中】"] = "[Possessing]",
    ["【隐秘学派】(2) 全队每秒恢复1.5法力值"] = "[Hermit School of Thought] (2) All allies recover 1.5 Mana per second",
    ["【隐秘学派】(4) 全队每秒恢复3法力值"] = "[Hermit School of Thought] (4) All allies recover 3 Mana per second",
    ["【隐秘学派】(6) 全队每秒恢复5法力值"] = "[Hermit School of Thought] (6) All allies recover 5 Mana per second",
    ["【隐迹】"] = "[Hidden Trace]",
    ["【隐迹】叠加扭曲效果的速度由4秒缩短至2秒叠加一次。"] = "[Hidden] The speed of stacking the Distortion effect is shortened from every 4 seconds to every 2 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】处于仪式魔法中的敌方玩家目标获得生命流逝效果：降低8%生命上限。"] = "[Hidden] Enemy player targets within the Ritual Magic gain a Health drain effect: reduces max Health by 8%.",
    ["【隐迹】明灯的护盾爆炸影响到的目标每秒受到灼烧伤害，持续4秒。"] = "[Hidden] Targets affected by the Beacon's Shield Explosion take Burn damage every second for 4 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】暗影能量爆炸附加恐惧的概率增加15%。"] = "[Hidden] Chance to apply Horror upon shadow energy explosion increased by 15%.",
    ["【隐迹】梦魇突袭命中目标后滞涩目标，持续3秒。"] = "[Hidden] After Nightmare Assault hits a target, it inflicts Stagnation on the target for 3 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】死亡之握对敌方及其周围6米范围内目标均造成相同伤害。"] = "[Hidden] Grasp of Death. deals the same amount of damage to the enemy and targets within a 6-meter radius.",
    ["【隐迹】死亡之爪生成的仪式魔法减速效果叠加3层后，有36%基础概率令目标恐惧1秒。"] = "[Hidden] After the Ritual Magic generated by Grasp of Death stacks the Slow effect 3 times, it has a 36% base chance to inflict Horror on the target for 1 second.",
    ["【隐迹】每次攻击均有10%概率增加电流效果持续时间1秒，最多增加5秒，每0.5秒最多触发1次。"] = "[Hidden] Each attack has a 10% chance to increase the Current effect duration by 1 second, up to a maximum of 5 seconds, triggering at most once every 0.5 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】灰雾加持期间，每次通过技能恢复体力时，额外增加自身护甲，最多叠加3层，持续5秒。"] = "[Hidden] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each time Health is recovered via a skill, gain additional Armor, stacking up to 3 layers, lasting 5 seconds.",
    ["【隐迹】自身在通灵仪式范围内时免疫减速效果。敌方在通灵仪式范围内会处于滞涩状态。"] = "[Hidden] When self is within the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range, become immune to Slow effects. Enemies within the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range will be in a state of Stagnation.",
    ["【隐迹】触发低于20%立即恢复生命效果时目标额外获得4秒霸体。"] = "[Hidden] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 4 seconds of Super Armor.",
    ["【隐迹】诗意光环内的友方和自身会增加自身和友方的暴击。"] = "[Hidden] Allies and self within the Poetic aura gain increased Critical Hit rate for self and allies.",
    ["【雾林眷族】棋子每次普攻获得<HighLight>1</>层【苔影汲取】，每层获得<HighLight>2%</>吸血和<HighLight>1%</>最大生命，最多叠加<HighLight>6</>层。"] = "Each basic attack from a [Fog Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack(s) of [Moss Shadow Absorption], with each stack granting <HighLight>2%</> Life Steal and <HighLight>1%</> Max Health, stacking up to <HighLight>6</> times.",
    ["【雾林眷族】棋子每次普攻获得<HighLight>1</>层【苔影汲取】，每层获得<HighLight>3%</>吸血和<HighLight>2%</>最大生命，最多叠加<HighLight>6</>层；每场玩家对战后获得<HighLight>1</>个随机雾林眷族棋子。"] = "Each basic attack from a [Fog Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack(s) of [Moss Shadow Absorption], with each stack granting <HighLight>3%</> Life Steal and <HighLight>2%</> Max Health, stacking up to <HighLight>6</> times; gain <HighLight>1</> random Fog Forest Kin piece(s) after each player combat.",
