    ["【风闻】"] = "[Rumor]",
    ["【风闻】使用通灵仪式时会召唤出邓恩的灵体，为范围内的友方提供10%的加速，并降低范围内敌人10%的移动速度。"] = "[Rumor] Using the Spirit Mediumship Ritual will summon Dunn's spirit body, providing 10% Acceleration to allies in range and reducing the movement speed of enemies in range by 10%.",
    ["【风闻】友方和自身每秒获得诗意效果，诗意效果会增加自身和友方的途径专攻，诗意光环半径6米。"] = "[Rumor] Allies and self gain a Poetic effect every second. The Poetic effect increases the Pathway Specialty of self and allies. The Poetic aura radius is 6 meters.",
    ["【风闻】完成转运仪式后为周围的友方目标释放历史明灯，使其获得少量护盾，持续10秒，并且获得历史明灯标志。"] = "[Rumor] After completing the Fortune-Turning Ritual., release Historical Beacon to surrounding allies, granting them a small Shield for 10 seconds and the Historical Beacon mark.",
    ["【风闻】审视效果存在时若目标血量低于20%则立刻恢复目标最大生命值的15%，不超过施法者生命20%，只能生效一次。若没触发效果，则施法者在5秒内可以使用一个二段技能为目标立刻进行治疗。"] = "[Rumor] If the target's Health is below 20% while the Scrutiny effect is active, it immediately restores 15% of the target's max Health, not exceeding 20% of the caster's Health, and can only take effect once. If the effect is not triggered, the caster can use a second-stage skill within 5 seconds to immediately heal the target.",
    ["【风闻】对锁定目标附加电流效果，持续3秒，每秒造成一次伤害。"] = "[Rumor] Applies a Current effect to the locked target, lasting 3 seconds, dealing damage once per second.",
    ["【风闻】帝国旗帜生命值提升15%。"] = "[Rumor] Imperial Flag Health increased by 15%.",
    ["【风闻】梦魇冲击命中主目标后会引爆暗影能量，造成范围伤害。"] = "[Rumor] After Nightmare Impact hits the main target, it detonates shadow energy, causing area damage.",
    ["【风闻】梦魇命中目标后削弱目标技能抵挡，持续5秒。"] = "[Rumor] After Nightmare hits a target, it weakens the target's Skill Block for 5 seconds.",
    ["【风闻】梦魇命中目标后在目标处生成仪式魔法，仪式魔法持续6秒，仪式魔法每秒对范围内的敌人造成伤害。"] = "[Rumor] After Nightmare hits a target, it generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location. The Ritual Magic lasts 6 seconds and deals damage to enemies within range every second.",
    ["【风闻】死亡之爪在目标位置生成仪式魔法，造成3次伤害，伤害递增。"] = "[Rumor] Grasp of Death generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location, dealing 3 hits of damage, with the damage increasing each time.",
    ["【风闻】死亡之爪新增二段技能—死亡之握，对目标造成少量伤害，若目标身上具有死亡侵蚀，伤害提升。"] = "[Rumor] Grasp of Death adds a second-stage skill—Grasp of Death., dealing a small amount of damage to the target. If the target is affected by Death Erosion, the damage is increased.",
    ["【风闻】灰雾加持时间内，每次释放技能均可增加自身体力值4点，每2秒最多触发1次。"] = "[Rumor] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each skill cast increases own Health by 4 points, triggering at most once every 2 seconds.",
