    ["一名童工被醉汉拦在街角，他们的争吵似乎愈演愈烈……"] = "A child laborer is stopped by a drunkard at the street corner; their argument seems to be intensifying...",
    ["一名金色短发的女性"] = "A woman with short golden hair",
