    ["一君"] = "Yi Jun",
    ["一周后"] = "One week later",
    ["一周后她坟头长了一棵藤，开着不合季节的花。后来藤蔓结出了这些南瓜。"] = "A week later, a vine grew on her grave, blooming with out-of-season flowers. Later, the vines bore these pumpkins.",
    ["一周后，你正在广场闲逛……"] = "A week later, you are strolling around the square...",
    ["一周后，你正在廷根闲逛……"] = "A week later, you are strolling through Tingen...",
    ["一周的工钱都押进去了，别让我失望！"] = "A week's wages are bet on this, don't let me down!",
    ["一命换一命，一纸替一人。"] = "A life for a life, a paper for a person.",
    ["一哲"] = "Yi Zhe",
    ["一地暮紫"] = "Dusk Purple Ground",
    ["一地的纸片，好像是我刚才弄乱的。"] = "Papers all over the floor, it seems I messed them up just now.",
    ["一地碎片镜头"] = "A floor of fragments camera shot",
    ["一场“意外”被安排在我身上，曾经的我，索罗·布莱克就这样“死”在任务里。"] = "An 'accident' was arranged for me, and the former me, Solo Black, thus 'died' in the mission.",
    ["一场战斗"] = "A battle",
    ["一场战斗测试。放心，这一切都发生在梦境中。"] = "A combat test. Don't worry, this all takes place in a dream.",
    ["一场派对"] = "A party",
    ["一场滑稽的小丑表演正在铁十字下街进行……"] = "A comical clown performance is taking place on Iron Cross Lower Street...",
    ["一场特别的际遇，您明白的，命运的齿轮开始转动了。"] = "A special encounter, you understand, the gears of fate have begun to turn.",
    ["一场献祭"] = "A sacrifice",
    ["一场碎尸案的受害者，我在尝试还原他完整的样貌。"] = "The victim of a dismemberment case. I am trying to restore his complete appearance.",
    ["一场精彩的表演！"] = "A wonderful performance!",
    ["一场美梦，一缕香气，一个见面礼。"] = "A beautiful dream, a wisp of fragrance, a welcome gift.",
    ["一场谋害"] = "A murder",
    ["一场谋杀"] = "A murder",
    ["一场遗憾的求婚"] = "A regrettable proposal",
    ["一块三分熟的牛排和一块五分熟的牛排相遇了，他们为什么不打招呼？"] = "A medium-rare steak and a medium steak met, why didn't they say hello?",
    ["一块坚硬厚实的木板。"] = "A hard and thick wooden board.",
    ["一块怀表"] = "A pocket watch",
    ["一块拼接成的破布，不过洗得很干净，像是一顶帽子。"] = "A piece of rag stitched together, but it's washed very clean, like a hat.",
    ["一块普通的石头，与堆砌祭坛的石头并无不同。"] = "An ordinary stone, no different from the stones used to build the altar.",
    ["一块水晶……“看见他人，忘记自己”。"] = "A crystal... 'See others, forget yourself'.",
    ["一块洗不净的暗色血痕，我不想回忆当时的场景。"] = "A dark bloodstain that won't wash off; I don't want to recall the scene at that time.",
    ["一块火腿，肉质普通，是送给流浪儿们的生日礼物。"] = "A piece of ham, ordinary meat, a birthday gift for the homeless children.",
    ["一块石头，上面刻有红色的单词“母亲”。"] = "A stone with the word \"Mother\" carved in red.",
    ["一块精心切割的透明棱镜，能够折射光线，也能\"折射\"记忆的容量，让你的表演动作更加丰富多彩。"] = "A carefully cut transparent prism that can refract light and also \"refract\" the capacity of memory, making your performance movements more rich and colorful.",
    ["一块肥皂"] = "A Bar of Soap",
    ["一块蛋糕。"] = "A piece of cake.",
    ["一块蛋糕换一张报纸！"] = "One cake for one newspaper!",
    ["一块血迹"] = "A Bloodstain",
    ["一块鱼派卖1金镑！还是卖给贝克兰德人吧！"] = "A fish pie sells for 1 Pound! Might as well sell it to the people of Backlund!",
    ["一坨"] = "A pile of...",
    ["一堆饰品"] = "A Pile of Accessories",
    ["一墨"] = "Yi Mo",
    ["一声叹息"] = "A sigh",
    ["一声枪响传来，\n随之而来的，\n是一阵夹杂着痛苦悲鸣的嘈杂人声。"] = "A gunshot rang out, \n followed by \n a cacophony of human voices mixed with painful wails.",
    ["一声枪响在寂静的雪原上回荡。乌鸦没有倒下，但也没有飞远，仿佛没听到一般在原地张望。"] = "A gunshot echoed across the silent snowy plains. The crow did not fall, but it did not fly far either, as if it hadn't heard it, looking around in place.",
    ["一壶热水"] = "A pot of hot water",
    ["一夜的辗转，克莱恩第二天早早醒来，前往占卜俱乐部……"] = "After a night of tossing and turning, Klein wakes up early the next day and heads to the Divination Club...",
    ["一夜过去……"] = "One night passed...",
    ["一夜过后……"] = "After one night...",
    ["一大波活尸正在接近！"] = "A large wave of zombies is approaching!",
    ["一天只需要花5苏勒……不，3苏勒，就能带它去“那些”酒馆报名，它能替你赢钱的。"] = "It only costs 5 soli a day... no, 3 soli, to take it to 'those' taverns to sign up, it can win you money.",
    ["一天后……"] = "A day later...",
    ["一天天的……风吹雨打……啥时候是个头……"] = "Day after day... wind and rain... when will this ever end...",
    ["一天，两天……<P_Heart>（小声）</> 他到底去哪里了，什么时候才能回来啊……"] = "One day, two days... <P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Where did he go, when will he come back...",
    ["一头棕黄色的头发的淳朴少年"] = "A simple boy with brownish-yellow hair",
    ["一套杯具"] = "A Set of Cups",
    ["一奥"] = "Yi Ao",
    ["一婷"] = "Yi Ting",
    ["一字帅"] = "Cool and sharp",
    ["一定、一定！"] = "Definitely, definitely!",
    ["一定会向亡者显露纯净的笑容："] = "Will surely show a pure smile to the dead:",
    ["一定会的。"] = "She definitely will.",
    ["一定会的吧！"] = "We definitely will!",
    ["一定是<P_Yellow>赛琳娜</>寄来的，她说过要邀请我们一家人去参加晚宴，还说学习了新占卜要展示给我看。"] = "It must be from <P_Yellow>Selena</>. She said she wanted to invite our family to a dinner party and also said she learned a new divination to show me.",
    ["一定是你的配方不对，怎么还来怪我呢！"] = "It must be your recipe that's wrong, why are you blaming me!",
    ["一定是你要长脑子了！"] = "It must be because your brain is growing!",
    ["一定是吧？不然怎么会有人一身双排扣礼服出现在雪山上，嘴里说着……"] = "It must be, right? Otherwise, why would someone appear on the Snowy Mountain in a double-breasted suit, saying...",
    ["一定是哪里有问题，我眼睛瞎了，记忆也瞎了吗？"] = "There must be something wrong somewhere. My eyes are blind, but has my memory gone blind too?",
    ["一定是女神的力量庇佑着这里。"] = "It must be the Goddess Protection that keeps this place safe.",
    ["一定是她，是她在报复我们？"] = "It must be her. Is she taking revenge on us?",
    ["一定是它们位置变了，吸走了我的幸运！你说可不可怕！"] = "It must be that their positions have changed, sucking away my luck! Don't you think that's terrifying?",
    ["一定有非凡因素导致他们疯狂……他们的目标是2-049！保护好马车！"] = "There must be an Extraordinary factor causing them to go mad... their target is 2-049! Protect the carriage!",
    ["一定能找到的，小姐，祝你好运。"] = "You will definitely find it, miss, good luck.",
    ["一定能，我们回迪西海湾！"] = "It definitely will. Let's go back to Tisi Bay!",
    ["一定要小心啊"] = "Be careful.",
    ["一定要小心啊。"] = "Be careful.",
    ["一定要打断皮特的仪式！"] = "Must interrupt Pete's ritual!",
    ["一定要说的话，我觉得那条蛋白石的项链或许更能衬托您的容颜。"] = "If I had to say, I think that opal necklace might better set off your complexion.",
    ["一定！"] = "Definitely!",
    ["一家以古物寻找、收集和保护为使命的安保公司，他们需要专业的顾问。"] = "A security company with the mission of finding, collecting, and protecting antiquities. They need professional consultants.",
    ["一家俱乐部亮灯，打开门欢迎贵族入场。\n侍者：希望这场雨没有给您带来不便。\n贵族：当然，我淋不到一滴雨。 "] = "A club lights up and opens its doors to welcome the nobles. \nWaiter: I hope this rain hasn't caused you any inconvenience. \nNoble: Of course, I didn't get a single drop of rain on me.",
    ["一家高端整容医院"] = "A high-end plastic surgery clinic",
    ["一家黑暗料理"] = "A place serving dark cuisine",
    ["一家黑暗料理餐厅"] = "A restaurant serving dark cuisine",
    ["一宸"] = "Yi Chen",
    ["一对A。怎么，怀斯曼欠你钱了？"] = "A pair of Aces. What, does Wiseman owe you money?",
    ["一对J。老兄，快点儿，我等得花都谢了。"] = "A pair of Jacks. Come on, buddy, I've been waiting until I'm withered.",
    ["一对Q。今天我输的钱，你们回去问怀斯曼要。"] = "A pair of Queens. The money I lost today, you can go ask Wiseman for it later.",
    ["一对恋人，一群朋友，一个春天。"] = "A pair of lovers, a group of friends, a spring.",
    ["一对红色的拳套。"] = "A pair of red boxing gloves.",
    ["一对谈情说爱的青年，不愧是充满活力的大学之城"] = "A young couple in love—just what you'd expect from a vibrant university city.",
    ["一对，两对，三对..."] = "One pair, two pairs, three pairs...",
    ["一封从小家伙身上掉落的短笺，收件人却准确指向正在查看的你。信中的内容，竟是来自世界之外的神秘赠言。"] = "A note that fell from the little guy, but the recipient is accurately pointed at you, who is currently viewing it. The content of the letter is actually a mysterious message from outside the world.",
    ["一封信"] = "Letter",
    ["一封信件。打开看一下吧。"] = "A letter. Let's open it and take a look.",
    ["一封信笺"] = "A Letter",
    ["一封信笺？落款是卢娜。她人呢？"] = "A note? Signed by Luna. Where is she?",
    ["一封信？看起来还没有寄出去。"] = "A letter? It looks like it hasn't been sent yet.",
    ["一封写给“奥斯瓦尔德”的信。内容是要订购一件神奇物品。"] = "A letter addressed to \"Oswald.\" The content is an order for a mystical item.",
    ["一封写给帕里克的信，署名是西奥多。"] = "A letter written to Patrick, signed by Theodore.",
    ["一封卷好的许愿信！"] = "A rolled-up wish letter!",
    ["一封安魂诗社的邀请函。"] = "An invitation to the Requiem Poetry Society.",
    ["一封春夜舞会的邀请函。"] = "An invitation to the Spring Night Ball.",
    ["一封来自伦纳德先生的信件"] = "A letter from Mr. Leonard.",
    ["一封来自莱昂的感谢信。"] = "A thank-you letter from Leon.",
    ["一封没有寄出的信，折痕已经磨白了，像是被人反复揣在怀里。"] = "An unsent letter with white, worn creases, as if it had been repeatedly clutched to someone's chest.",
    ["一封没来得及寄出的信，收件人是霍伊大学的昆汀·科恩资深副教授。"] = "A letter that was never sent, addressed to Senior Associate Professor Quentin Cohen of Hoy University.",
    ["一封黑伍德庄园晚宴的邀请函。"] = "An invitation to the Heywood Manor banquet.",
    ["一小片营养美味的面包，满足胃口，更疗愈伤口。"] = "A small piece of nutritious and delicious bread. It satisfies the appetite and heals wounds.",
    ["一尘"] = "Yi Chen",
    ["一层氛围僵尸"] = "First Floor Atmosphere Zombie",
    ["一帆"] = "Yi Fan",
    ["一帮小孩在进行纸飞机比赛。"] = "A group of children are having a paper airplane competition.",
    ["一帮穷鬼，没钱别来沾边。"] = "A bunch of poor wretches, don't come near if you don't have money.",
    ["一幅宣传海报，画面中的人物正是罗塞尔大帝。\n他头戴皇冠、手持权杖，走向台阶之上的王座。"] = "A promotional poster, the figure in the picture is none other than Emperor Roselle.\n He wears a crown, holds a scepter, and walks toward the throne atop the steps.",
    ["一幅画像"] = "A Portrait",
    ["一幅罗塞尔大帝的宣传海报。"] = "A promotional poster of Emperor Roselle.",
    ["一年前"] = "One year ago",
    ["一年前的今天……我和我的孩子，被另一所济贫院分开安置……最终失散了。"] = "Today, one year ago... my child and I were separated by another poorhouse... and eventually lost each other.",
    ["一年前，我的味觉失灵了。医生说成因复杂，也很难根治，我因此失去了工作。从那时起，我就不敢再做菜了……"] = "A year ago, I lost my sense of taste. The doctor said the cause was complex and difficult to cure, so I lost my job. Since then, I haven't dared to cook again...",
    ["一年晋升序列8，再一年序列7，三年到序列6，是非常有天赋的非凡者。"] = "Advancing to Sequence 8 in one year, Sequence 7 in another, and Sequence 6 in three years—that is a very talented Beyonder.",
    ["一座伟岸的蒸汽之城，一个登月的神奇构想，一缕熟悉的知识残影……"] = "A majestic city of steam, a miraculous concept of landing on the moon, a familiar lingering shadow of knowledge...",
    ["一座山峰上的非人类宫殿……对我的无声注视……扭曲而古怪的蠕虫意象……"] = "A non-human palace on a mountain peak... the silent gaze upon me... the twisted and strange worm imagery...",
    ["一开始只是卖几件廷根大剧院瞧不上的瑕疵品，结果意外地受欢迎。"] = "At first, I just sold a few defective items that the Tingen Grand Theater didn't like, but they were unexpectedly popular.",
    ["一开始我以为阿尔伯特得了老年病……后来发现是被封印物影响了。"] = "At first, I thought Albert had developed an age-related illness... later, I discovered he was being influenced by the Sealed Artifact.",
    ["一开始玩家看向的地方"] = "The place the player looks at initially",
    ["一开始隐藏"] = "Hidden at start",
    ["一开始，我忌惮它。它会剥夺使用者的心智，使其丧失相应的情绪能力，严重者甚至会被污染、死亡。"] = "At first, I was wary of it. It would strip away the user's sanity, causing them to lose their corresponding emotional capabilities; in severe cases, they could even be corrupted or die.",
    ["一张1苏勒的钞票，色泽墨绿泛白，印着鲁恩国王乔治三世严肃的脸。"] = "A 1-Soli banknote, greenish-white in color, printed with the stern face of Loen King George III.",
    ["一张3……这也太小了……偷偷换成……"] = "A 3... this is too small... secretly swap it for...",
    ["一张<h>传单</>"] = "A <h>flyer</>",
    ["一张“月亮”先生自己很满意的画像。"] = "A portrait that Mr. \"Moon\" is very satisfied with.",
    ["一张三……这怎么赢？"] = "A three... how can I win this?",
    ["一张不知从何而来的纸条，仿佛特意为你留下。"] = "A note that appeared from nowhere, as if left specifically for you.",
    ["一张书签"] = "A Bookmark",
    ["一张五年前的陈旧报销单……我也可以申请报销吗？"] = "An old reimbursement form from five years ago... can I apply for reimbursement too?",
    ["一张交易记录表……精灵花、深潜者的舌头、变形怪的脸皮……这里是一处黑市交易点！"] = "A transaction record sheet... Elf flower, Deep One's tongue, Faceless's skin... This is a black market trading point!",
    ["一张价值5便士的长途邮票，上面印有罗塞尔大帝的头像。"] = "A long-distance stamp worth 5 pence, featuring the portrait of Emperor Roselle.",
    ["一张价值5便士的长途邮票，画面主体是蒸汽列车头。\n罗塞尔大帝站在一旁，似乎正望向烟囱中的滚滚浓烟。"] = "A long-distance stamp worth 5 pence, with a steam train engine as the main image. \n Emperor Roselle stands to the side, seemingly looking at the billowing smoke from the chimney.",
    ["一张便签"] = "Note",
    ["一张写满“救命”的门票，将你引向一座诡异剧院。"] = "A ticket filled with the word \"Help\" leads you to a bizarre theater.",
    ["一张写满救命的门票指向了一座诡异的剧院，你决定一探究竟……"] = "A ticket filled with pleas for help points to a bizarre theater; you decide to investigate...",
    ["一张印有罗塞尔大帝的明信片。"] = "A postcard featuring Emperor Roselle.",
    ["一张又大又软非常舒服的床"] = "A large, soft, and very comfortable bed",
    ["一张塔罗牌"] = "Tarot Card",
    ["一张塔罗牌浮现在半空中"] = "A Tarot card floats in mid-air",
    ["一张塔罗牌，一种命运，你选择相信何种解读？"] = "A Tarot card, a fate; which interpretation do you choose to believe?",
    ["一张塔罗牌？怎么会夹在这里……"] = "A Tarot card? How did it get stuck in here...",
    ["一张夜校的报名传单，上面写着标语：\n“扫盲班！上夜校！有知识！有未来！”"] = "A registration flyer for night school, with the slogan:\n \"Literacy class! Attend night school! Have knowledge! Have a future!\"",
    ["一张大合照，这是罗珊小姐……那是伦纳德先生？"] = "A large group photo. This is Miss Rozanne... and that is Mr. Leonard?",
    ["一张宣传画报"] = "Promotional Poster",
    ["一张小纸条？"] = "A small note?",
    ["一张床"] = "A bed",
    ["一张很结实的长桌，四条腿站得笔直，心里却盘算着怎么绊你一脚。"] = "A sturdy long table, its four legs standing straight, but it is secretly planning how to trip you.",
    ["一张掉落在地上的车票，边缘沾上了泥土和水渍"] = "A train ticket dropped on the ground, its edges stained with mud and water marks.",
    ["一张普普通通的圆桌，底座雕着花，摆上茶点，便是日常的模样。"] = "An ordinary round table with flowers carved on the base; set with tea and snacks, it is the appearance of daily life.",
    ["一张柔软的大床上"] = "On a large, soft bed",
    ["一张核爆炸的图片，右下角用中文写着“切尔诺贝利”。"] = "A picture of a nuclear explosion, with 'Chernobyl' written in Chinese in the bottom right corner.",
    ["一张沾着污迹的小纸条被压在角落。"] = "A small, stained note was pressed into the corner.",
    ["一张泛黄的羊皮纸，上面用古赫密斯语写着几行模糊的咒文，隐约能感受到契约那边连接的强大灵性力量。"] = "A yellowed piece of parchment with a few lines of blurred incantations written in ancient Hermes, faintly sensing the powerful spiritual force connected to the other side of the contract.",
    ["一张画像，上面是穿着精致礼服的男孩，想必就是这位叫做艾略特的小绅士。"] = "A portrait of a boy in an exquisite dress, who must be this little gentleman named Elliot.",
    ["一张画着生日蛋糕的贺卡，上面写着一行生日\n祝福，如同一句尚未说破的密语。"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday\n wishes written on it, like a secret code yet to be spoken.",
    ["一张画着生日蛋糕的贺卡，上面写着一行生日\n祝福，如同一句尚未说破的密语。\n\n“<P_Yellow>生日快乐</>，健康成长——爱你的，哥哥。”"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday\n wishes written on it, like a secret code yet to be spoken.\n\n '<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.'",
    ["一张画着生日蛋糕的贺卡，上面写着一行生日\n祝福，如同一句尚未说破的密语。\n\n“<P_Yellow>生日快乐</>，健康成长——爱你的，哥哥。”\n\n贺卡背面用赫密斯文写下了鲜红的文字：\n<P_Red>“噩梦！拒绝……逃离！拒绝……逃……”</>"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday \n blessings written on it, like a secret code that hasn't been spoken yet.\n\n\"<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.\"\n\nOn the back of the card, bright red words are written in Hermes:\n<P_Red>\"Nightmare! Refuse... escape! Refuse... escape...\"</>",
    ["一张看着很舒服的沙发，坐上来的人往往会把不该说的都说了。"] = "A very comfortable-looking sofa; people who sit on it often say things they shouldn't.",
    ["一张看起来就是用来坐的沙发，还是能坐多人的那款。"] = "A sofa that looks like it's meant for sitting, and the kind that can seat many people.",
    ["一张精致的白色瓷质面具，没有任何表情。顶部镶嵌着淡金色的花纹，摸上去有细微的凹凸感。这是玫瑰天堂的入场凭证——只有戴上它，你才能真正\"看见\"门后的世界。"] = "An exquisite white porcelain mask with no expression. The top is inlaid with pale gold patterns that have a subtle texture to the touch. This is the admission pass for Rose Paradise—only by wearing it can you truly \"see\" the world behind the Door.",
    ["一张结实的方桌，看起来很适合用来斗邪恶。"] = "A sturdy square table, looks very suitable for fighting evil.",
    ["一张莱昂在慈善医院刷马桶的照片。"] = "A photo of Leon scrubbing toilets at the charity hospital.",
    ["一张莱昂带着扭曲笑容与狼鱼罐头的合影。"] = "A photo of Leon with a twisted smile, holding a can of wolf fish.",
    ["一张蕴含庞大灵性的卡牌，持有者可以此媒介沟通灵界，进行运气与命运的交换，从灵界中获取宝物。"] = "A card containing vast spirituality. The holder can use this medium to communicate with the Spirit World, exchange luck and fate, and obtain treasures from the Spirit World.",
    ["一张薄薄的纸从书页之间滑落"] = "A thin piece of paper slipped out from between the pages",
    ["一张被水浸过的寻人启事，贴着褪色的照片。\n上面写着：\"寻找我弟弟，最后出现在金秋湖农场附近。如有线索请联系灰鸽旅馆。\"\n启事边缘被人撕掉了一半。"] = "A water-damaged missing person notice with a faded photo. \n It reads: \"Looking for my younger brother, last seen near Golden Autumn Lake Farm. If you have any clues, please contact Gray Pigeon Inn.\" \n Half of the notice has been torn off.",
    ["一张试卷"] = "Test Paper",
    ["一张边角卷曲的老照片，画面已经模糊不清，只能辨认出两个依偎在一起的小小身影，和一片苹果树的轮廓。"] = "An old photo with curled corners; the image is already blurry, and one can only make out two small figures huddled together and the outline of an apple tree.",
    ["一张镶嵌有珍贵宝石的特殊卡牌，容纳了灵界中关于“美”的概念。在被灵界生物带回现实后，能够化作不同种类的最为珍贵的美神收藏品。"] = "A special card inlaid with precious gems, containing the concept of \"beauty\" from the Spirit World. After being brought back to reality by Spirit World creatures, it can transform into various types of the most precious Goddess of Beauty collectibles.",
    ["一张青年男性照片"] = "A photo of a young man",
    ["一张青年男性的照片，眉宇间和雪伦夫人相似……"] = "A photo of a young man who bears a resemblance to Mrs. Sharon in his features...",
    ["一思"] = "Yi Si",
    ["一恒"] = "Yi Heng",
    ["一想到友情和羁绊，我就感觉浑身充满了力量！"] = "The moment I think of friendship and bonds, I feel filled with strength!",
    ["一想到要去这么美丽的城市定居……呵呵，我这颗老心脏都恢复活力了。"] = "Just thinking about settling down in such a beautiful city... Hehe, my old heart has regained its vitality.",
    ["一想到这个，我就心情愉悦，忍不住想多喝一杯上好的苏尼亚血酒。"] = "Just thinking about it makes me feel happy, I can't help but want another glass of fine Soniath blood wine.",
    ["一打《女士审美》期刊，包装上贴着写有“订购人：克莉丝汀”的便签。"] = "A dozen \"Ladies' Aesthetics\" journals, with a sticky note reading \"Ordered by: Christine\" attached to the packaging.",
    ["一打精心保存的来自间海郡的信。"] = "A dozen well-preserved letters from Intis County.",
    ["一把<h>手枪</>"] = "A <h>handgun</>",
    ["一把<h>霰弹枪</>"] = "A <h>shotgun</>",
    ["一把匕首，看起来还算锋利，应该可以划开某些东西。"] = "A dagger, looks sharp enough, should be able to cut something open.",
    ["一把好枪，一把好剑，谁更胜一筹？\n枪剑合一，在这个蒸汽时代，助您成为史上最强！"] = "A good gun, a good sword, which is better?\nCombining gun and sword, in this steam age, will help you become the strongest in history!",
    ["一把左轮"] = "A revolver",
    ["一把左轮……有些昂贵，应该是非法的。"] = "A revolver... a bit expensive, it must be illegal.",
    ["一把左轮手枪"] = "A revolver",
    ["一把沉甸甸的斧头，或许可以用它劈开坚硬的东西。"] = "A heavy axe, perhaps it can be used to split hard things.",
    ["一把泛着黄铜光泽的左轮手枪，被好好收在腋下枪袋里。"] = "A revolver with a brass luster, kept securely in an underarm holster.",
    ["一把泛着黄铜色泽的左轮手枪，很精巧，显然不是莫雷蒂家买得起的。"] = "A revolver with a brass luster, very exquisite, obviously not something the Moretti family could afford.",
    ["一把精巧的左轮手枪。"] = "An exquisite revolver.",
    ["一把足够精准的枪械，正适合您这样优雅的{{先生|女士}}。您想看哪一种？"] = "A sufficiently precise firearm is just right for an elegant {{Mr.|Ms.}} like you. Which one would you like to see?",
    ["一把铁黑色的左轮手枪，克莱恩最珍视的武器之一。\n操作简单、威力惊人，当它上膛的一刻开始，鲜血和哀嚎不绝于耳。\n其实克莱恩更期盼无须流血的结局，但现实总是事与愿违。\n许多生灵都被命运推搡到枪口之下。\n“请饶恕我……”丑陋的灵魂乞求着。戴半高丝绸礼帽的身影步步逼近，因斯·赞格威尔盯着那双褐色的眼眸，却没看见里面映照出任何一样东西，只余死亡的倒影。\n砰！\n丧钟为谁而鸣？\n丧钟为他而鸣。"] = "An iron-black revolver, one of Klein's most cherished weapons. \n Simple to operate and devastating in power, from the moment it is loaded, blood and wails become constant companions. \n In truth, Klein longed for an outcome that required no bloodshed, but reality always defied his wishes. \n Many living beings were pushed by fate beneath its muzzle. \n \"Please, spare me...\" the ugly soul begged. The figure in the tall silk hat stepped closer; Ince Zangwill stared into those brown eyes, yet saw nothing reflected within them, only the shadow of death. \n Bang! \n For whom does the death knell toll? \n The death knell tolls for him.",
    ["一把锋利的大剪刀"] = "A pair of sharp, large scissors",
    ["一把长枪飞来，贯穿了你的身体"] = "A long spear flies over and pierces your body",
    ["一把长柄斧头，其本身的存在也是未知的谜团，\n或许能<P_Yellow>劈开</>那些坚硬的东西。"] = "A long-handled axe, its very existence is an unknown mystery,\n perhaps it can<P_Yellow> split open</> those hard things.",
    ["一报还一报"] = "Tit for Tat",
    ["一拉绳子就会拍锣的发条玩具猴，名气大于声响。偶尔会有人被它吓到。"] = "A clockwork toy monkey that claps cymbals when the string is pulled; its fame is greater than its sound. Occasionally, someone gets startled by it.",
    ["一指乾坤·始"] = "One Finger Universe: Start",
    ["一指乾坤·终"] = "One Finger Universe: End",
    ["一摞信件"] = "Stack of Letters",
    ["一撮狒狒金色的毛，收藏一下。"] = "A tuft of golden baboon fur, I'll collect it.",
    ["一支模样奇特，不知从何而来的花朵。"] = "A strange-looking flower of unknown origin.",
    ["一支生锈烛台。锈迹太均匀了，像故意做旧的。"] = "A rusty candlestick. The rust is too uniform, as if it were deliberately aged.",
    ["一支羽毛笔书写：\n“子嗣的仪式成功了！尽管克莱恩发现了贫民区的连续死亡，但这并不影响故事的继续。"] = "A fountain pen writes: \n \"The ritual for the offspring was a success! Although Klein discovered the serial deaths in the slums, this does not affect the continuation of the story.",
    ["一整个夏天的阳光，都储存在了叶片里。"] = "A whole summer's worth of sunlight is stored in the leaves.",
    ["一整个屋子刷下来，五苏勒，还得管饭。"] = "Five soli to paint an entire room, and they have to provide meals.",
    ["一整份营养美味的面包，香甜可口，吃饱才有好精神！"] = "A whole portion of nutritious and delicious bread. Fragrant and tasty—you need a full stomach to have high spirits!",
    ["一整幅帷幕，多了中间衔接的帘幕，拉起时即便是白日也能保证屋内的幽闭安宁。"] = "A full curtain with an additional connecting drape in the middle, ensuring seclusion and peace in the room even during the day when drawn.",
    ["一斩之下，罪孽两断，唯留纯白。 "] = "Under one slash, sins are severed, leaving only pure white.",
    ["一旁等待"] = "Waiting on the side",
    ["一旦出现这种情况，非凡力量无法正常稳定使用，你将面临严重危险。"] = "Once this happens, your Beyonder powers cannot be used normally and stably, and you will face serious danger.",
    ["一旦失误，就会一步步走向失控。现代值夜者体系的创立者，查尼斯大主教曾经说过——"] = "Once a mistake is made, one will step by step move towards loss of control. The founder of the modern Nighthawk system, Archbishop Chanis, once said—",
    ["一旦成为天使，自身将不可避免地被非凡特性影响，越来越冷酷，越来越残忍，越来越漠视生命，因此必须有足够的锚，通用的锚是凡人的信仰。"] = "Once one becomes an Angel, they are inevitably affected by their Beyonder characteristic, becoming increasingly cold, cruel, and indifferent to life. Therefore, one must have sufficient anchors, and the universal anchor is the faith of mortals.",
    ["一旦真假分不清，问问警察最放心！！！"] = "Once you can't tell real from fake, asking the police is the safest!!!",
    ["一旦进入战斗，厄运布偶就会伺机作祟。技能命中敌人时，布偶会附身到他身上，降低其防御与抗暴击，并随你切换目标转移。它回到你身上时，厄运便由你承担。"] = "Once entering battle, the Misfortune Doll will wait for an opportunity to cause trouble. When a skill hits an enemy, the doll will possess them, reducing their Defense and critical resistance, and transfer as you Switch targets. When it returns to you, you bear the misfortune.",
    ["一旦遇到队友失控，不管归属于哪只队伍，我们都会出手帮忙。"] = "Once we encounter a teammate losing control, regardless of which team they belong to, we will step in to help.",
    ["一时无言"] = "Speechless for a moment",
    ["一晨"] = "Yi Chen",
    ["一晴"] = "Yi Qing",
    ["一月一签？"] = "Signed monthly?",
    ["一月十七日，我梦到了快要遗忘的#Space2#。"] = "January 17th, I dreamed of #Space2#, which I was about to forget.",
    ["一期《廷根市老实人报》，上面记载着金秋湖连续出现多起的少女死亡事件。"] = "An issue of the Tingen Honest Newspaper, reporting a series of young girl deaths at Golden Autumn Lake.",
    ["一期《廷根市老实人报》，上面骇人听闻的案件似乎与俱乐部的占卜师有关。"] = "An issue of the Tingen Honest Newspaper; the shocking case reported seems to be related to the club's diviner.",
    ["一本……会说话的剧本？"] = "A... talking script?",
    ["一本……小册子？图画歪歪扭扭的，像是孩子自己画的。"] = "A... booklet? The drawings are crooked, like a child drew them themselves.",
    ["一本……日记？"] = "A... diary?",
    ["一本《罗塞尔诗选》，大家最喜欢的诗集之一。"] = "A copy of 'Roselle's Poetry Collection', one of everyone's favorite poetry books.",
    ["一本书"] = "A book",
    ["一本刊物——《心理医学评论》。翻开的一页\n刊登着关于“创伤性记忆丧失”的论文，边缘\n有阅读折痕。\n\n旁边还有《鲁恩心理学会月刊》，封面文章标\n题为《梦境与潜意识：最新研究综述》。"] = "A publication—\"Psychiatric Review\". The open page \n features a paper on \"Traumatic Memory Loss\", with reading creases on the edge \n. \n\n Next to it is the \"Loen Psychological Society Monthly\", with the cover article titled \n \"Dreams and the Subconscious: A Review of Recent Research\".",
    ["一本厚实的相册，第一页是三个年轻人的合照。"] = "A thick photo album; the first page shows a group photo of three young people.",
    ["一本厚实的相册，第一页是这三个年轻人的合照。"] = "A thick photo album. The first page is a group photo of these three young people.",
    ["一本手工装订的书，封面上画着些色彩斑斓的蝴蝶和兔子。"] = "A handmade book with colorful butterflies and rabbits drawn on the cover.",
    ["一本未知的书籍。"] = "An unknown book.",
    ["一本格外厚重又陈旧的书籍，不知道管理员先生是从哪里搜罗来的。"] = "An exceptionally thick and old book, I don't know where the administrator found it.",
    ["一本流行爱情小说，讲述的是侠盗黑皇帝对女主角玫瑰夫人一见钟情，而后带她脱离贵族的牢笼，奔赴大海的故事。"] = "A popular romance novel about the chivalrous Black Emperor falling in love at first sight with the heroine, Lady Rose, and then taking her away from the cage of the nobility to the sea.",
    ["一本皮质封面的厚重笔记本，纸页被反复翻阅得起了毛边，字迹从工整变得狂乱。"] = "A thick notebook with a leather cover. The pages are frayed from repeated reading, and the handwriting shifts from neat to frantic.",
    ["一本看似普通的笔记，封面由硬纸制成，完全染上了黑色。它就是故事开始的原因——安提哥努斯家族笔记。"] = "A seemingly ordinary notebook with a cover made of hard paper, completely dyed black. It is the reason why the story began—the Antigonus Family Notebook.",
    ["一本笔记，保存得很仔细。"] = "A notebook, kept very carefully.",
    ["一本笔记，这页没有日期，只有一行字——"] = "A notebook. This page has no date, only one line of text—",
    ["一本笔记？"] = "A notebook?",
    ["一本笔记？<h></>"] = "A notebook?<h></>",
    ["一本笔记？上面写着……《睡莲镇漫游指南》？"] = "A notebook? It says... \"A Roaming Guide to Water Lily Town\"?",
    ["一本笔记？封面写着……《睡莲镇漫游指南》？"] = "A notebook? The cover says... \"A Roaming Guide to Lotus Town\"?",
    ["一本被翻烂的教材，扉页上潦草地写着“老师没教被附身怎么办”，内页插图中疑似有蠕动的血迹。"] = "A tattered textbook with 'What to do if possessed, not taught by the teacher' scribbled on the title page, and suspected squirming bloodstains in the illustrations.",
    ["一本记录着各种谜题的手册，上面似乎是总结出的某种规律。只有两页纸能看清了。"] = "A manual recording various puzzles, which seem to summarize a certain pattern. Only two pages are legible.",
    ["一本诗集"] = "A book of poetry",
    ["一本诡异的人皮书，等待着下一个被选中的人。"] = "A strange human-skin book awaits the next person to be chosen.",
    ["一本诡异的人皮书，等待着下一个被选中的人。知识是馈赠，也是刑罚——克服它，才能继续前行。"] = "A strange book made of human skin is waiting for the next chosen one. Knowledge is a gift, but also a punishment—only by overcoming it can you continue to move forward.",
    ["一本边缘磨损的牛皮笔记本，纸页上沾着细小的金属碎屑。"] = "A worn-edged leather notebook with tiny metal shavings on the pages.",
    ["一本附着灵性的旧书，字里行间隐约指向金秋湖，似乎藏着某个耗尽生命也要追寻的“真理”。"] = "An old book imbued with spirituality. The lines between the words vaguely point toward Golden Autumn Lake, seemingly hiding a \"truth\" that someone exhausted their life to pursue.",
    ["一本鲁恩士兵的日记，记录了战争时的点点滴滴。里面还有许多士兵们的速写，虽然潦草，但姿态生动，看得出绘画功底深厚。"] = "A diary of a Loen soldier, recording the bits and pieces of the war. There are also many sketches of soldiers, which, although rough, are vivid in posture, showing a deep foundation in drawing.",
    ["一朵巨大的红花，颜色和月亮的颜色类似，似乎能感应到有人靠近而闭合起来。"] = "A huge red flower, similar in color to the moon, seems to close up when it senses someone approaching.",
    ["一朵沉睡的，或许即将凋落的雏菊……"] = "A sleeping daisy, perhaps about to wither...",
    ["一朵蔷薇"] = "A Rose",
    ["一杆经过改装的双管霰弹枪，崔佛往弹壳里混入了从仲裁者那里搞来的银粉——虽然不知道具体原理，但他说这玩意儿能让玫瑰天堂那些\"打不死的傀儡\"真正感受到疼痛。"] = "A modified double-barreled Shotgun; Trevor mixed silver powder he got from an Arbiter into the shell casings—although he doesn't know the exact principle, he says this stuff can make those \"undying puppets\" in Rose Paradise truly feel pain.",
    ["一束塞维亚菊"] = "A Bouquet of Sevia Daisies",
    ["一束深眠花"] = "A bunch of Deep Sleep Flowers",
    ["一束破碎的鲜花……还有卡片。"] = "A bunch of broken fresh flowers... and a card.",
    ["一束精心准备的塞维亚菊。"] = "A carefully prepared bouquet of Sevia chrysanthemums.",
    ["一束纯洁、美好的雏菊。"] = "A bouquet of pure, beautiful daisies.",
    ["一束绯红月光射在湖面上。\n而“母亲”的部分意志，也随之降生到湖面之上。"] = "A beam of crimson moonlight shines on the lake. \n And a portion of the \"Mother's\" will descends upon the lake surface.",
    ["一束肃穆清幽的花朵。"] = "A bouquet of solemn and quiet flowers.",
    ["一束雏菊"] = "A Bunch of Daisies",
    ["一束鲜花"] = "A Bouquet of Flowers",
    ["一条可以扭曲他人意识的领带，这就是我们都将你视为侠盗黑皇帝的原因。"] = "A necktie that can distort the consciousness of others—this is why we all view you as the Phantom Thief Black Emperor.",
    ["一条血统不那么纯正的金毛大狗，一个购买猎狐犬的赠品。她的世界一度很简单：阳光、庭院、饼干，和那个总是笑着蹲下来摸她脑袋的小女孩。\n直到那瓶魔药被意外打翻。\n命运从不征求谁的同意。当非凡特性渗入她的皮毛、血液、骨骼，以及那颗懵懂跳动的心脏时，苏茜拥有了第一缕“意识”。她能听懂更多了——那些话语之下的沉默，笑容背后的疲惫，还有奥黛丽在深夜独处时、连她自己都未必察觉的孤独。\n她从不掩饰自己是一条狗。这是她的骄傲。狗能嗅出谎言，而人类只能听见语言；狗能用尾巴告诉你所有真心话，而人类学会了用微笑筑墙。当她趴在霍尔家的地毯上，守望着来往的客人时，她看见的比任何一位宾客都多——那些虚伪的殷勤、算计的眼神、隐藏在赞美之下的嫉妒。\n她曾思考过：作为一条拥有了智慧的狗，你觉得自己更像人，还是更像狗？\n她摇了摇尾巴，得出了自己的答案。\n“我更像我自己。一条学会了说话却依然喜欢追尾巴的金毛犬，一条读完了心理学中的人性却依然相信善良的非凡生物。不必成为人，依旧可以用一双与众不同的眼睛，为所有孤独的心灵，带来一片温暖的安宁。”\n\n“毕竟，我只是一条狗。而这，恰恰是我最擅长的事。”"] = "A golden retriever of not-so-pure blood, a freebie from buying a foxhound. Her world was once very simple: sunshine, the courtyard, biscuits, and the little girl who always smiled and squatted down to pat her head. \n Until that bottle of potion was accidentally knocked over. \n Fate never asks for anyone's consent. When the Beyonder characteristic seeped into her fur, blood, bones, and that innocently beating heart, Susie gained her first glimmer of \"consciousness.\" She could understand more—the silence beneath those words, the exhaustion behind the smiles, and the loneliness Audrey felt when alone late at night, which perhaps even Audrey herself hadn't noticed. \n She never hides the fact that she is a dog. This is her pride. Dogs can sniff out lies, while humans can only hear language; dogs can use their tails to tell you all their true feelings, while humans have learned to build walls with smiles. When she lay on the Hall family's carpet, watching the guests come and go, she saw more than any guest—the hypocritical obsequiousness, the calculating eyes, and the jealousy hidden beneath praise. \n She once pondered: As a dog with wisdom, do you feel more like a human or more like a dog? \n She wagged her tail and reached her own answer. \n \"I am more like myself. A golden retriever who learned to speak but still likes to chase her tail, a Beyonder creature who has read about human nature in psychology books but still believes in kindness. There is no need to become human; one can still use a pair of unique eyes to bring a piece of warm peace to all lonely hearts.\" \n \n \"After all, I am just a dog. And that is exactly what I am best at.\"",
    ["一条趴在工人身上吸血的水蛭！"] = "A leech clinging to a worker, draining their life!",
    ["一条铁路自西而东贯穿金秋湖，从廷根直达贝克兰德。"] = "A railway runs through Golden Autumn Lake from west to east, directly from Tingen to Backlund.",
    ["一杯 “安慰剂” 正是你需要的，闻起来是花香味的主调，但入口又会有偏酸涩的口感。"] = "A 'Placebo' is exactly what you need. It smells mainly of flowers, but it has a sour and astringent taste when you drink it.",
    ["一杯咖啡"] = "A cup of coffee",
    ["一杯咖啡的香气会带来安宁。"] = "The aroma of a cup of coffee brings peace.",
    ["一杯咖啡，凝望窗外，聆听喧嚣，品味命运。那么，你要几分糖？"] = "A cup of coffee, gazing out the window, listening to the hustle and bustle, savoring fate. So, how much sugar would you like?",
    ["一杯咖啡，加一块方糖、两勺牛奶。"] = "A cup of coffee, with one sugar cube and two spoons of milk.",
    ["一杯咖啡，加一块方糖，两勺牛奶，谢谢。"] = "A cup of coffee, one sugar cube, two spoons of milk, please.",
    ["一杯咖啡，加了一块方糖，两勺牛奶。"] = "A cup of coffee with a sugar cube and two spoons of milk.",
    ["一杯热茶，刚刚还有人在这里占卜。"] = "A cup of hot tea; someone was just here doing a divination.",
    ["一杯甜冰茶，阿曼达女士希望你饮下后能做个清爽的梦。"] = "A glass of sweet iced tea, Ms. Amanda hopes you will have a refreshing dream after drinking it.",
    ["一杯甜腻冰爽的茶，用冰块与糖调和的夏日饮品。可以试试加柠檬片！"] = "A sweet and icy cup of tea, a summer drink mixed with ice cubes and sugar. You can try adding a lemon slice!",
    ["一枚“金币”"] = "A 'Gold Coin'",
    ["一枚不规则多面骰子，散发着金芒，触手温热，像有意识在内部缓缓翻动。握住它掷出时，仿佛命运在那一瞬主动倾身，眷顾即将到来的落点。"] = "An irregular multi-sided die that emits a golden glow, warm to the touch, as if something is slowly turning inside with consciousness. When you hold it and roll it, it feels as if fate leans in actively at that moment, favoring the upcoming landing point.",
    ["一枚不规则多面骰子，释放着幽暗的气息，暗紫色的光泽在棱线间流动。掷出时它会在空中停顿半息，像是在做一个决定。然后落向它挑中的那一面。"] = "An irregular multi-sided die that releases a dark aura, with dark purple luster flowing between the edges. When rolled, it will pause in the air for half a breath, as if making a decision. Then it falls toward the side it has chosen.",
    ["一枚常见的铜镜，外形小巧，崭新精致，很适合做随身携带的化妆镜。"] = "A common bronze mirror, small in size, brand new and exquisite, very suitable as a portable makeup mirror.",
    ["一枚怀表……指针停在凌晨三点。"] = "A pocket watch... the hands are stopped at three in the morning.",
    ["一枚指环带来的遗产纷争，究竟谁才是杀害子爵的凶手？"] = "A dispute over an inheritance brought by a ring; who is the real murderer of the Viscount?",
    ["一枚旧铜币。"] = "An old copper coin.",
    ["一枚泛着星空色泽的古老钱币，能够通过精神体响应灵界、星空。上面镌刻着来自亚伯拉罕家族天使绘制的隐秘铭文，每一次使用如同开启一场星空漫游，能够为使用者带来旅途中的见闻与收获。"] = "An ancient coin with the luster of the starry sky, capable of responding to the Spirit World and the cosmos through the spirit body. Engraved with secret inscriptions drawn by an Angel of the Abraham family, each use is like starting a journey through the stars, bringing the user insights and gains from the journey.",
    ["一枚由欲望组成的齿轮，咬合着贪婪与痴迷。欲念使者乐意将它送给任何人——反正它总会回到自己手上，浸满持有者的祈求和渴念。\n赌徒输光最后一苏勒时摸到了它，商人签完最后一纸契约时攥住了它，没人记得是怎么接过来的，就像没人记得自己什么时候开始渴望。\n\"再赌一次！就一次！\"持有者发抖而偏执的声音总是那么悦耳。\n\"好啊。\"他总是这么回答，微笑着，见证一个又一个人匍匐在他面前，亲吻他的掌心。\n持有齿轮的人，总会听到内心渴望的回音，总会与他相遇。"] = "A gear made of desire, interlocking with greed and obsession. The Messenger of Desire is happy to give it to anyone—it always finds its way back to them, soaked in the prayers and cravings of its holder. \n The gambler touched it when he lost his last sou, and the merchant gripped it when he signed his final contract. No one remembers how they received it, just as no one remembers when they began to crave. \n \"One more bet! Just one more!\" The holder's trembling, paranoid voice is always so pleasant. \n \"Very well.\" He always replies, smiling, witnessing one person after another crawl before him, kissing his palm. \n Those who hold the gear will always hear the echo of their inner desires and will always meet him.",
    ["一枚粗糙的戒指"] = "A crude ring",
    ["一枚精致的徽章，这是老托马斯为他视为家人的孩子打造的护身符。他曾说：\"再好的工艺品也会磨损，但守护的意愿不会。\""] = "An exquisite badge, an amulet crafted by Old Thomas for the children he considers family. He once said: \"Even the best craftsmanship will wear out, but the will to guard will not.\"",
    ["一枚警徽，每个黑荆棘安保公司的正式成员都会拥有。"] = "A police badge, which every official member of the Blackthorn Security Company possesses.",
    ["一枚连接着精细链条的水晶吊坠，是灵摆占卜的上佳媒介。"] = "A crystal pendant connected to a fine chain, an excellent medium for Pendulum Divination.",
    ["一枚造型古朴优雅的徽章。这是玫瑰天堂高级成员的身份象征，拥有它，夜总会的任何区域都会为你开放。"] = "A badge with a simple and elegant design. This is the symbol of status for high-level members of Rose Paradise; possessing it will open any area of the Nightclub to you.",
    ["一枚铜币……战争之前的旧便士。"] = "A copper coin... an old penny from before the war.",
    ["一枚雕刻了巨龟纹样的指环，上面的裂纹仿佛诉说着生长的印记。"] = "A ring engraved with a giant turtle pattern; the cracks on it seem to tell the marks of growth.",
    ["一枝花"] = "A Flower",
    ["一架朴素的钢琴，看起来有不少年头了。"] = "A simple piano, it looks like it has been around for many years.",
    ["一柄能够剪裁命运丝线的锋利裁刀。掌握命运者也被命运左右，它的每一次剪裁都将带来未知的变化，愿好运永远与你相伴。"] = "A sharp cutting tool capable of trimming the threads of fate. Those who master fate are also controlled by it; every cut it makes will bring unknown changes. May good luck always be with you.",
    ["一柳"] = "Yi Liu",
    ["一样"] = "Same",
    ["一样等戈多么？是的。"] = "Waiting for Godot just the same? Yes.",
    ["一根、三根、五根……满满一盒！珍妮，珍妮从来没有见过这么多火柴！"] = "One, three, five... a full box! Jenny, Jenny has never seen so many matches!",
    ["一根手杖"] = "A cane",
    ["一根火柴"] = "A Match",
    ["一根火柴……"] = "A single match...",
    ["一根火柴。"] = "A match.",
    ["一根燃烧的火柴"] = "A burning match",
    ["一根？"] = "One?",
    ["一棵树形挺拔的金黄枫树，它会把你的影子染成黄色，然后偷偷藏起来。"] = "A golden maple tree with a tall, straight shape; it will dye your shadow yellow and then secretly hide it away.",
    ["一棵沉默的柏树，枝叶在风中纹丝不动。它听不懂人类的期盼，只会把那些愿望变成柏籽掉在地上。"] = "A silent cypress tree, its branches and leaves motionless in the wind. It does not understand human expectations, only turning those wishes into cypress seeds that fall to the ground.",
    ["一楼似乎有宝箱开启了"] = "A treasure chest seems to have been opened on the first floor.",
    ["一楼是舞步和酒杯交织的地方。您要是想找姑娘们喝一杯，不妨过去坐坐。不管您打算聊什么，她们都懂得如何让人开口。"] = "The first floor is where dance steps and wine glasses intertwine. If you want to find the ladies for a drink, feel free to go over and sit. No matter what you intend to talk about, they know how to get people to open up.",
    ["一楼有什么好的。客人大多只往台上看，台下也没人请我喝一杯。"] = "What's so good about the first floor? Most guests only look at the stage, and no one invites me for a drink downstairs.",
    ["一楼没有声音…或许菲利普在二楼的卧室。"] = "There is no sound on the first floor... perhaps Philip is in the bedroom on the second floor.",
    ["一次占卜，一个巧合。"] = "A divination, a coincidence.",
    ["一次又一次……他展现的知识，他回应的祈求，他对塔罗会和白银城的庇护……"] = "Time and time again... the knowledge he displayed, the prayers he answered, his protection of the Tarot Club and Silver City...",
    ["一次回眸，如一滴香水坠入静水，就此扩散蔓延。在裙摆摇曳的间隙里，在慌乱的温热鼻息间，所有防线已在芬芳中溃散。臣服吧，甘愿成为那不可抗拒的魅力的战利品、所有物。"] = "A single glance back, like a drop of perfume falling into still water, spreading and extending. In the swaying of the skirt, in the chaotic warm breath, all defenses have collapsed in the fragrance. Submit, willing to become the trophy and possession of that irresistible charm.",
    ["一次形式完备的祈祷。是否被聆听，属于不可知领域。"] = "A complete ritual of prayer. Whether it was heard belongs to the realm of the unknowable.",
    ["一次循环结束了……<P_Yellow>谜题</>也要出现了？"] = "One cycle has ended... Is the <P_Yellow> puzzle </> about to appear too?",
    ["一次性买这么多？能不能给后面的人留一点！"] = "Buying so many at once? Can't you leave some for the people behind you!",
    ["一次性任务"] = "One-time Quest",
    ["一次性回复玩家30%血量"] = "Restores 30% of the player's HP instantly.",
    ["一次性奖励"] = "One-time Reward",
    ["一次机会"] = "One chance",
    ["一次次的“救赎”，到底有什么乐趣可言？"] = "What fun is there in 'redemption' time after time?",
    ["一次购买两个雕像，我还可以给您一定的优惠。"] = "If you buy two statues at once, I can give you a certain discount.",
    ["一次购买的数量太多。"] = "Purchase quantity too high.",
    ["一款因蒂斯宫廷钟表的设计图纸。"] = "A design blueprint for an Intis court clock.",
    ["一款小众的木质调香水，液体漆黑但气味独特。"] = "A niche woody-scented perfume; the liquid is pitch black, but the scent is unique.",
    ["一步"] = "One step",
    ["一步一摆，抵达群星之间。"] = "One step, one sway, arriving among the stars.",
    ["一段低频的噪音，缸中的思维噼啪作响。"] = "A low-frequency noise, the thoughts in the vat crackling and popping.",
    ["一段剑气对命中目标有60%概率造成击退。"] = "The first stage of sword energy has a 60% chance to cause knockback on the target hit.",
    ["一段命运的支流，像凝固的晚霞，又像某条平行世界中永不熄灭的黎明。"] = "A tributary of fate, like solidified sunset glow, or like a dawn that never fades in some parallel world.",
    ["一段新的历史迷雾被点亮了。"] = "A new piece of the Fog of History has been illuminated.",
    ["一段时间不见，你脸上迷茫的表情似乎消退了很多。"] = "It's been a while, and the look of confusion on your face seems to have faded quite a bit.",
    ["一段时间不见，有想我吗？\n我是上个冬天来到这里的灰色花猫，最爱睡在集市的丝瓜筐里。\n我想对帮过我的人说，谢谢你们。\n如果没有那些碎肉和剩鱼，我早就长不大啦。\n最近，我住进了村口的稻草房子里，也有了新的名字。\n我叫<Letter_Highlight_HW>毛毛草</>，再见面的时候，请叫我的名字吧。\n谢谢你们！"] = "Haven't seen you for a while, did you miss me? \n I came here last winter as a gray tabby cat, and I love sleeping in the loofah basket at the market. \n I want to say thank you to those who helped me. \n If it weren't for those scraps of meat and leftover fish, I wouldn't have grown up. \n Recently, I moved into the straw house at the entrance of the village and have a new name. \n My name is <Letter_Highlight_HW> Fluffgrass </>, please call my name when we meet again. \n Thank you all!",
    ["一段时间内fightvalue统计值超过一定值"] = "Fightvalue statistical value exceeds a certain value within a period of time",
    ["一段时间内设置HpLockValue的值"] = "Set the value of HpLockValue over a period of time.",
    ["一段时间后……"] = "After some time……",
    ["一段时间后，你想知道后续情况，所以再次来到霍伊大学……"] = "Some time later, you wanted to know the outcome, so you came to Hoy University again...",
    ["一段时间过去，再去廷根码头问问，能否买到“万都之都”号的船票。"] = "After some time has passed, go to Tingen Dock and ask if you can buy a ticket for the 'Capital of Capitals'.",
    ["一段爆炸表现，爆炸的声效、火光和震屏特效之类的，周围的铁栅栏应声倒下……"] = "An explosion performance, with explosion sound effects, firelight, and screen-shaking effects, and the surrounding iron fences collapsed in response...",
    ["一段记忆呈现了出来"] = "A memory is presented",
    ["一段震地伤害提升60%。"] = "First-stage ground stomp damage increased by 60%.",
    ["一段：半径3.5米的扇形区域"] = "Phase 1: Sector area with a 3.5m radius",
    ["一段：半径4.2米的扇形区域"] = "Stage 1: Sector area with a radius of 4.2 meters",
    ["一段：半径4米的扇形区域"] = "Phase 1: Sector area with a 4m radius",
    ["一段：半径5米的扇形区域"] = "Phase 1: Sector area with a 5m radius",
    ["一段：半径为5.5米的圆形区域"] = "Phase 1: Circular area with a 5.5m radius",
    ["一段：目标和其1.5米内的敌方"] = "Stage 1: Target and enemies within 1.5 meters",
    ["一段：自身3米范围内的区域"] = "Phase 1: Area within 3m of self",
    ["一比一阶段"] = "One-to-one stage",
    ["一沓绑定苏勒"] = "A Stack of Bound Soles",
    ["一洋"] = "Yi Yang",
    ["一浪更比一浪高！小东西！"] = "One wave higher than the last! Little thing!",
    ["一涵"] = "Yi Han",
    ["一淼"] = "Yi Miao",
    ["一点小伤，阻碍不了我的成功。"] = "A small injury won't hinder my success.",
    ["一点点……小情趣？本以为这里偏僻，不会有人听见的。"] = "A little bit of... romantic fun? I thought this place was secluded and no one would hear.",
    ["一点点。"] = "Just a little.",
    ["一点虚心、一点耐心、一点恒心。\n还有一点热爱愚弄他人的心，哈哈！我的好学生，谢谢你的300镑！"] = "A bit of humility, a bit of patience, a bit of perseverance.\nAnd a bit of a heart that loves to fool others, haha! My good student, thank you for your 300 pounds!",
    ["一点零花钱"] = "A Little Pocket Money",
    ["一然"] = "Yi Ran",
    ["一片<h>碎片</>"] = "A <h>fragment</>",
    ["一片厚切的吐司，呈现出温暖的金黄色泽。黄油的丰腴与牛奶的温润在口中交织，越嚼越香。"] = "A thick slice of toast with a warm golden hue. The richness of butter and the gentleness of milk intertwine in the mouth, becoming more fragrant the more you chew.",
    ["一片厚重的土灰色鳞片，表面布满细密的裂纹，像是承载着某种无法言说的重负。"] = "A thick, earth-gray scale covered in fine cracks, as if bearing some unspeakable burden.",
    ["一片布料"] = "Piece of Fabric",
    ["一片布料，熟悉的花纹，这好像是……值夜者制服的一部分？"] = "A piece of fabric, familiar pattern, this seems to be... part of a Nighthawk uniform?",
    ["一片废墟"] = "Ruins",
    ["一片废墟散落在水面上，木板和碎石凌乱堆积，依稀还能看出原本拱起的轮廓。"] = "A pile of ruins lies scattered across the water, with wooden planks and rubble heaped in a mess, though the original arched outline can still be vaguely discerned.",
    ["一片散发着微光的羽毛，轻若无物，隐约能感受到其中蕴含的神圣祝福。"] = "A feather emitting a faint light, as light as nothing, with a subtle sense of the divine blessing contained within.",
    ["一片白雾茫茫……"] = "A vast expanse of white fog...",
    ["一物收存，新生之种，葬于石像之旁"] = "One item stored, the seed of rebirth, buried beside the stone statue",
    ["一物藏匿，羔羊归家之音不再奏响"] = "One item hidden, the sound of the lamb returning home no longer plays",
    ["一献一束花"] = "Offer a bouquet of flowers",
    ["一献十束花"] = "Offer Ten Bunches of Flowers",
    ["一琪"] = "Yi Qi",
    ["一琳"] = "Yi Lin",
    ["一瓣沉入梦境深处，做未完成的命运注解。"] = "One petal sank deep into the dream, making an unfinished annotation of fate.",
    ["一瓶名为“焦糖炸弹”的神秘饮料让你邂逅了人生中最急促的肠道危机。你闯入盥洗室，却撞见两个虔诚的学生对着马桶颂念尊名。原来“神圣毒药”的受害者不止你一人。你与饮料发明者谢尔敏试图优化这款罪恶甜水。几番折腾，配方越改越神秘，绝望的谢尔敏将残液倒进马桶，马桶竟然变得光洁如新！ 一周后，廷根市民人手一瓶柠檬味清洁药剂，而在盥洗室点蜡烛祈祷的学生，至今仍盼望着“焦糖炸弹”重新归来。"] = "A mysterious drink called 'Caramel Bomb' leads you to the most urgent intestinal crisis of your life. You rush into the restroom, only to find two devout students chanting a holy name toward the toilet. It turns out you are not the only victim of this 'sacred poison'. You and the drink's inventor, Shermin, try to optimize this sinful sweet water. After several attempts, the formula becomes increasingly mysterious, and a desperate Shermin pours the residue into the toilet—the toilet becomes as clean as new! A week later, every Tingen citizen has a bottle of lemon-scented cleaning agent, while the students who light candles and pray in the restroom are still hoping for the return of the 'Caramel Bomb'.",
    ["一瓶奥尔米尔葡萄酒"] = "A bottle of Olmier wine",
    ["一瓶盛放在玻璃瓶中的神秘液体。据说饮下它的人，能够暂时遗忘自己已经习得的能力，从而在命运的分岔路口，重新做出选择。"] = "A mysterious liquid contained in a glass bottle. It is said that those who drink it can temporarily forget the abilities they have already learned, thereby making a new choice at the crossroads of fate.",
    ["一瓶绿色，一瓶金色……是非凡药剂？"] = "A bottle of green, a bottle of gold... are these Beyonder potions?",
    ["一瓶苦艾酒"] = "A bottle of absinthe",
    ["一瓶蕴含特殊效果的神奇药剂，服用后可以让人获得心灵平静。"] = "A magical potion with special effects that can bring peace of mind to those who take it.",
    ["一瓶非凡药剂，绿色的液体在瓶中缓慢流动，偶尔浮现出一些重叠的符号。"] = "A Beyonder potion, green liquid flowing slowly in the bottle, occasionally showing some overlapping symbols.",
    ["一瓶非凡药剂，透过玻璃外壁能够看见里面弥漫着的金色烟雾。"] = "A Beyonder potion, through the outer glass wall, you can see the golden mist permeating inside.",
    ["一生一次的求婚，难得聚会的家人，人生中的重要时刻，都需要钢琴来见证。"] = "A once-in-a-lifetime proposal, family members gathered for a rare occasion, important moments in life—they all need a piano to bear witness.",
    ["一百二十便士。"] = "One hundred and twenty pence.",
    ["一百金币打水漂，就当消灾。"] = "One hundred gold coins down the drain, just consider it a disaster averted.",
    ["一百镑！相当于普通中产家庭一年的收入了！"] = "One hundred pounds! That's equivalent to a year's income for an ordinary middle-class family!",
    ["一盒火柴"] = "A Box of Matches",
    ["一盒火柴。"] = "A box of matches.",
    ["一盒烟丝"] = "Box of Tobacco",
    ["一盒破旧的火柴"] = "Box of Old Matches",
    ["一直以来，我都非常感谢你对我的帮助……与救赎。"] = "All this time, I have been very grateful for your help... and salvation.",
    ["一直到头发花白，才明白自己当初了解的知识，还只是神秘学入门的程度。"] = "It wasn't until my hair turned gray that I realized the knowledge I understood back then was only at the introductory level of the occult.",
    ["一直在你口袋里？"] = "It was in your pocket the whole time?",
    ["一直在来回走动监督，一刻都不休息。"] = "He's constantly pacing back and forth to supervise, not resting for even a second.",
    ["一直在身上"] = "Always on me",
    ["一直在？"] = "Always?",
    ["一直放置在外面啊……风吹日照的就会折旧，难怪衣角这片有些发白起线。"] = "It's been out there for a long time... wind and sun will cause depreciation, no wonder this corner of the hem is a bit white and fraying.",
    ["一直是满的？听起来老板是个很勤快的人。"] = "Always full? Sounds like the boss is a very diligent person.",
    ["一直暧昧，害怕告白"] = "Always ambiguous, afraid to confess",
    ["一看就是任人拿捏的新手"] = "Looks like a total newbie who's easy to push around",
    ["一看就是陷阱 我才不会吃呢！"] = "It looks like a trap at a glance, I won't eat it!",
    ["一看您就能理解咸鱼的魅力，哈哈。您想要咸鱼还是咸鱼派，又或者浓缩咸鱼风味汤？"] = "I can tell at a glance that you understand the charm of salted fish, haha. Do you want salted fish, salted fish pie, or concentrated salted fish flavored soup?",
    ["一知"] = "Yi Zhi",
    ["一种提神醒脑的植物提取物，不含糖分。"] = "A plant extract that refreshes the mind, containing no sugar.",
    ["一种特别的气息，一种久违的感觉。"] = "A special scent, a long-lost feeling.",
    ["一种特殊的材料，能够作为调配魔药的基底，此为众人觊觎的财富，无人不争。"] = "A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is wealth coveted by all, which everyone fights for.",
    ["一种特殊的材料，能够作为调配魔药的基底，此为独属于你的胜利，无人可夺。"] = "A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is your victory alone, which no one can take away.",
    ["一种独到的见解。至少在感情上，我完全、彻底地认同您的看法。"] = "A unique insight. At least emotionally, I completely and thoroughly agree with your view.",
    ["一种香料，不会产生气泡。"] = "A spice that does not produce bubbles.",
    ["一笔10镑的酬金，足以支付占卜俱乐部的年费。"] = "A reward of 10 pounds, enough to pay the annual fee for the Divination Club.",
    ["一笔生活费"] = "Living Expenses",
    ["一笔画"] = "One-stroke drawing",
    ["一笔画-启动仪式"] = "One-Stroke - Start Ritual",
    ["一笔画-启动仪式new"] = "One-stroke drawing - Start ritual new",
    ["一笔画-启动仪式魔法"] = "One-Stroke Drawing - Start Ritual Magic",
    ["一笔画-启动仪式魔法new"] = "One-Stroke Drawing - Start Ritual Magic new",
    ["一笔画不可通行格子初始状态"] = "One-Stroke Impassable Grid Initial State",
    ["一笔画可通行格子初始状态"] = "One-Stroke Passable Grid Initial State",
    ["一笔画可通行格子踩踏过状态"] = "One-Stroke Passable Grid Stepped-On State",
    ["一笔画开启"] = "One-stroke drawing enabled",
    ["一笔画开启临时NPC"] = "One-stroke activation of temporary NPC",
    ["一笔画开启双投骰"] = "One-stroke drawing enables double dice roll",
    ["一笔画组件不可通行格子"] = "One-Stroke Component Impassable Grid",
    ["一笔画组件可通行格子"] = "One-Stroke Component Passable Grid",
    ["一笔画组件终点"] = "One-Stroke Component End",
    ["一笔画组件起点"] = "One-Stroke Component Start",
    ["一笔画组件锁定宝箱"] = "One-Stroke Component Locked Treasure Chest",
    ["一笔画终点初始状态"] = "One-Stroke End Point Initial State",
    ["一笔画终点激活状态"] = "One-Stroke End Point Activated State",
    ["一笔画终点锁定状态"] = "One-Stroke End Point Locked State",
    ["一笔画起点初始状态"] = "One-Stroke Start Point Initial State",
    ["一笔画起点激活状态"] = "One-Stroke Start Point Activated State",
    ["一笔酬金"] = "Remuneration",
    ["一箩大概有130盒，我只能把空余的地方租给别人……"] = "A basket has about 130 boxes, so I can only rent the spare space to others...",
    ["一箱苏勒"] = "A Box of Soles",
    ["一箱，两箱……三箱……"] = "One box, two boxes... three boxes...",
    ["一篮水果"] = "A basket of fruit",
    ["一级车"] = "Level 1 Vehicle",
    ["一级防御跑塔"] = "Level 1 Defense Tower",
    ["一纸公司合同，鲁恩王国常见的样式。纸张崭新，连火漆都是新印的。落款处写着黑荆棘安保公司和克莱恩·莫雷蒂的名字。"] = "A company contract, in a style common to the Loen Kingdom. The paper is brand new, and even the wax seal is freshly stamped. The signature line bears the names of Blackthorn Security Company and Klein Moretti.",
    ["一组"] = "Group 1",
    ["一缕朦胧的非凡特性碎屑，握在手心的瞬间，有一股沉甸甸的重量，像是握住了某种还没说完的意志。"] = "A wisp of hazy Beyonder characteristic fragments. The moment it is held in the palm, it carries a heavy weight, as if holding a will that has yet to be fully expressed.",
    ["一罐猪油"] = "A can of lard",
    ["一群……虫子"] = "A bunch of... bugs",
    ["一群不知天高地厚的家伙，竟敢在我的地盘撒野！"] = "A bunch of ignorant guys, daring to run wild on my turf!",
    ["一群人从门内冲出，围住莉莉……"] = "A group of people rushed out from inside the door and surrounded Lily...",
    ["一群小孩"] = "A group of children",
    ["一群废物 猎龙帮全是没用的废物"] = "A bunch of losers. The Dragon Hunter Gang is full of useless trash.",
    ["一群普通的红色蚂蚁，凌乱挤在一起，仔细看看，行进路线的确像一句“滚回去”。"] = "A group of ordinary red ants, huddled together in a mess. Looking closely, the path they are taking does indeed look like the words 'Go back'.",
    ["一群穿越者？"] = "A group of transmigrators?",
    ["一群脏兮兮的孤儿。"] = "A bunch of dirty orphans.",
    ["一群蚂蚁"] = "A group of ants",
    ["一群被他守护的羔羊，能带来怎样的乐趣？"] = "What kind of fun can a group of lambs guarded by him bring?",
    ["一群调皮的小孩正兴奋地四散奔逃，躲进各个角落里。"] = "A group of mischievous children were excitedly running in all directions, hiding in every corner.",
    ["一股令人恶心的味道填满了你的鼻腔"] = "A disgusting smell filled your nasal cavity",
    ["一股奇异的香气弥漫在魔药房中，一个身影“嗖”地浮现，陶醉地看着药剂，丝毫没意识到自己被捉住了。"] = "A strange fragrance permeated the potion room, and a figure \"whooshed\" into view, looking at the potion with intoxication, completely unaware that it had been caught.",
    ["一股神奇的冲动促使你迫切地想要尝试下。 “去拿起来试试吧”他说, 恶魔的语言在你心底挠痒痒"] = "A magical urge compels you to desperately want to try it. 'Go pick it up and try,' he says, the devil's language tickling your heart.",
    ["一股神秘力量阻止了你继续攀升。"] = "A mysterious force prevents you from continuing to climb.",
    ["一股神秘的力量指引你前往命运咖啡厅。"] = "A mysterious force guides you to the Fate Café.",
    ["一腔热血的副队长"] = "Passionate vice-captain",
    ["一航"] = "Yihang",
    ["一般"] = "Average",
    ["一般值夜者小队需要驻守在自己的辖区内，没有允许不能去辖区外追捕罪犯，这其实不太方便。"] = "Generally, Nighthawk squads need to be stationed within their own jurisdictions and cannot pursue criminals outside of them without permission, which is actually quite inconvenient.",
    ["一般来说 遭遇这种事件"] = "Generally speaking, encountering this kind of incident",
    ["一般来说，序列等级越高，可以掌控的非凡能力越强，但……"] = "Generally speaking, the higher the Sequence level, the stronger the Extraordinary abilities one can control, but...",
    ["一般来说，魔药配方和材料，尤其是主材料，都非常昂贵。"] = "Generally speaking, potion formulas and ingredients, especially the main ingredients, are very expensive.",
    ["一般般。我叫丽贝卡，是命运咖啡厅的店主。"] = "Just average. My name is Rebecca, and I am the owner of Fate Café.",
    ["一般般。而且你跑步速度很快，不是正常人能做到的。"] = "It's average. Besides, you run very fast, which isn't something a normal person can do.",
    ["一艘空艇失控落在花海了？快过去看看！"] = "An airship lost control and crashed into the flower sea? Hurry over and take a look!",
    ["一苏勒"] = "One Soule",
    ["一苏勒的钞票，色泽墨绿泛白，印着鲁恩国王乔治三世严肃的脸。"] = "A one-sol note, greenish-white in color, printed with the stern face of King George III of Loen.",
    ["一茗"] = "Yiming",
    ["一茜"] = "Yiqian",
    ["一茹"] = "Yiru",
    ["一菡"] = "Yihan",
    ["一菲"] = "Yifei",
    ["一萌"] = "Yimeng",
    ["一薇"] = "Yiwei",
    ["一行值夜者站在紧闭的门前"] = "A line of Nighthawks stands before the closed door",
    ["一袋仪式材料，用来向神祈祷。"] = "A bag of ritual materials used for praying to the gods.",
    ["一览战争东线的哨塔，充满了混乱与失序的气息。占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "An outpost overlooking the eastern front of the war, filled with the aura of chaos and disorder. After occupying it, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp, gaining a fixed 20 resources per minute.",
    ["一览战争西线的哨塔，充满了混乱与失序的气息。 占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "An outpost overlooking the western front of the war, filled with the aura of chaos and disorder. After occupying it, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp, gaining a fixed 20 resources per minute.",
    ["一言为定！"] = "It's a deal!",
    ["一言难尽"] = "Hard to describe",
    ["一诗"] = "Yishi",
    ["一说起药剂我就停不下来，那些老东西每次都嫌我吵……"] = "I can't stop once I start talking about potions; those old fogies always complain that I'm noisy...",
    ["一诺"] = "Yinuo",
    ["一起<h>去吃工作餐</>"] = "Go <h>have a work meal</> together",
    ["一起<h>品尝新款饮料</>"] = "Taste the new drink <h> together </>",
    ["一起<h>过去看看</>"] = "Go <h>over there and take a look</> together",
    ["一起出去玩玩吗？"] = "Want to go out and play together?",
    ["一起分享喜悦"] = "Share the joy together",
    ["一起前往<h>文献库</>"] = "Go to the <h>archives</> together",
    ["一起加油吧，{{PlayerName}}。努力提升自己，总有一天，我们都会回到故乡。"] = "Let's work hard together, {{PlayerName}}. Strive to improve ourselves, and one day, we will both return to our hometown.",
    ["一起和安西娅玩游戏吧！"] = "Let's play a game with Anthea!",
    ["一起喝咖啡"] = "Drink coffee together",
    ["一起喝！"] = "Let's drink together!",
    ["一起打回去！"] = "Hit him back together!",
    ["一起找丽贝卡提交战利品<h></>"] = "Submit the spoils <h></> to Rebecca together",
    ["一起来跳舞！"] = "Let's dance together!",
    ["一起装死"] = "Play dead together",
    ["一起走"] = "Go together",
    ["一起走2"] = "Go together 2",
    ["一起跳舞"] = "Dance together",
    ["一起跳舞-中心舞阵标记buff"] = "Dance Together - Central Dance Formation Mark Buff",
    ["一起跳舞-舞者NPC特殊标记"] = "Dance Together - Dancer NPC Special Mark",
    ["一起跳舞NPC标记buff"] = "Dance Together NPC Mark Buff",
    ["一起跳舞吗？\n持续参与，将获得某些神秘存在的馈赠。"] = "Shall we dance together? \n Continue participating to receive gifts from certain mysterious existences.",
    ["一起跳舞隐身怪QTE"] = "Dance Together Stealth Monster QTE",
    ["一起跳舞隐身怪tag"] = "Dance Together Stealth Monster Tag",
    ["一起跳舞隐身怪tag+特效"] = "Dance Together Stealth Monster Tag + Effect",
    ["一起躺平"] = "Lie flat together",
    ["一起过去吧。"] = "Let's go together.",
    ["一起进去吧，这件事需要一个了结。"] = "Let's go in together. This matter needs an ending.",
    ["一路来到果园深处，异常盛放的苹果花下，传来心脏跳动的声音。这时，猩红的利刃指向了你们——"] = "Arriving deep in the orchard, beneath the exceptionally blooming apple blossoms, comes the sound of a heartbeat. Just then, a scarlet blade points at you—",
    ["一轩"] = "Yixuan",
    ["一转眼都这么多年了……"] = "So many years have passed in the blink of an eye...",
    ["一辆<h>自行车</>"] = "A <h>bicycle</>",
    ["一辆马车飞驰而过，俱乐部里点亮了灯，\n门童：“这糟糕的天气，辛苦您了。”\n俱乐部内，奢靡宴会的角落，\n一只苍白的手在酒杯旁留下了一张“节制”牌"] = "A carriage speeds by, and the lights in the Club are lit. \n Doorman: \"Such terrible weather, thank you for your hard work.\" \n Inside the Club, in a corner of the extravagant banquet, \n a pale hand leaves a \"Temperance\" card beside a wine glass.",
    ["一边去！没看见鱼都被你吓跑了吗？"] = "Get out of the way! Can't you see you've scared the fish away?",
    ["一连串特效表现"] = "A series of special effects performance",
    ["一通忙碌后，你终于安葬了芙拉，让她和杰温安息在了一起……"] = "After a flurry of activity, you finally buried Fula, letting her and Jewen rest in peace together...",
    ["一道送分题，像是儿童游戏……"] = "A freebie question, like a children's game...",
    ["一铭"] = "Yiming",
    ["一锅热汤。"] = "A pot of hot soup.",
    ["一锅端"] = "One Pot Sweep",
    ["一锅端-烂番茄-给自己挂陷阱BUFF"] = "One Pot Sweep - Rotten Tomato - Apply Trap BUFF to Self",
    ["一锅端-烂番茄个数"] = "One Pot Sweep - Rotten Tomato Count",
    ["一锅端-至尊小萝卜-给自己挂陷阱BUFF"] = "One Pot Sweep - Supreme Little Radish - Hang Trap BUFF on yourself",
    ["一锅端-至尊小萝卜个数"] = "One Pot Sweep - Supreme Radish Count",
    ["一锅鲜美的蘑菇汤。\n咕嘟作响，蒸腾着热气，散发出奇异的芬芳。"] = "A pot of delicious mushroom soup.\n It bubbles and hisses, steaming with heat and emitting a strange fragrance.",
    ["一键上阵"] = "One-click Deploy",
    ["一键使用"] = "One-Click Use",
    ["一键养成"] = "One-click cultivation",
    ["一键分解"] = "One-tap Decomposition",
    ["一键分配"] = "One-click allocation",
    ["一键升级"] = "One-click Upgrade",
    ["一键取消"] = "One-click Cancel",
    ["一键合成"] = "One-click Synthesis",
    ["一键培养"] = "One-Click Cultivation",
    ["一键复制并导入"] = "One-click copy and import",
    ["一键大片"] = "One-click Cinematic",
    ["一键将角色提升到中R玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to mid-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions.",
    ["一键将角色提升到大R玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to whale player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions.",
    ["一键将角色提升到小R玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to low-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions.",
    ["一键将角色提升到月卡战令玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to monthly card/battle pass player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions.",
