    ["一闪而过的身影"] = "A fleeting figure",
    ["一间公共厕所"] = "A public restroom",
    ["一间旧公寓，锁匠大师的孩子把自己反锁在房间里，连大师本人都打不开。"] = "An old apartment where the child of a master locksmith locked themselves inside, and even the master himself cannot open it.",
    ["一阵天旋地转……"] = "Everything is spinning...",
    ["一阵星芒落下，谜虫松开了对你的钳制，丢了魂一般瘫软在这梦幻的牢笼中。"] = "A burst of starlight fell, the Mystery Worm released its grip on you, and lay limp in this dreamlike cage as if it had lost its soul.",
    ["一阵猛烈的眩晕感袭来……"] = "A wave of intense dizziness strikes...",
    ["一阵阴冷的风吹起，伴随而来一阵诡异的口琴声……"] = "A cold, eerie wind blew, accompanied by the sound of a strange harmonica...",
    ["一阶"] = "Tier 1",
    ["一阶及以上骑士前往交锋处对决！"] = "First-rank and above knights, go to the engagement point to duel!",
    ["一阶段-长戟兵小怪组"] = "Stage 1 - Halberdier Minion Group",
    ["一阶段跳砸禁锢"] = "Phase 1 Jump Smash Imprisonment",
    ["一霖"] = "Yilin",
    ["一面古旧的镜子。\n镜面几乎被污渍全部遮蔽，再也无法映照出观\n看者的容貌。"] = "An old, worn-out mirror.\n The surface is almost entirely obscured by stains, no longer able to reflect the face of the viewer.\n",
    ["一面复古梳妆镜，镜框缠绕着花纹，镜面却异常地清澈——在这座充满迷雾的玫瑰天堂里，它干净得近乎突兀。\n镜框边缘渗出淡淡的灵性，像是有生命般缓缓流动……"] = "A vintage vanity mirror with a patterned frame, yet the mirror surface is unusually clear—in this fog-filled Rose Paradise, it is clean to the point of being abrupt. \n Faint spirituality seeps from the edge of the frame, flowing slowly as if it were alive...",
    ["一面镀银镜子，魔镜占卜所需的仪式道具。擦拭干净，置于象征月亮的位置，虔诚祈求，便能从银面上获得启示……"] = "A silver-plated mirror, a ritual tool required for mirror divination. Wipe it clean, place it in a position symbolizing the moon, and pray devoutly to receive revelations from the silver surface...",
    ["一顶属于旧时代的童帽。\n面料虽寻常，针脚却细密整齐，仿佛曾因某种\n执念而被保存完好。"] = "A child's hat from the old era.\n Although the fabric is ordinary, the stitches are fine and neat, as if it had been kept well-preserved due to some\n obsession.",
    ["一顶老旧的帽子，是里埃尔亲手为艾拉做的。"] = "An old hat that Riel made for Ella with his own hands.",
    ["一颗仍在搏动的心脏，从梦境捕手的尸体上捕获。其筋膜包裹着无数凝结的梦境沉淀，呈现出不自然的瑰丽色彩。"] = "A heart that is still beating, captured from the corpse of a Dream Catcher. Its fascia is wrapped in countless condensed dream sediments, presenting an unnaturally gorgeous color.",
    ["一颗仍在跳动的火山，烫穿了持有者的理智。"] = "A volcano still beating, burning through the holder's sanity.",
    ["一颗奇怪的食人花，没有表现出攻击性，炼药锅一旁放着一本被酸液侵染的笔记。"] = "A strange Man-Eating Flower that shows no aggression; a notebook stained with acid is placed next to the alchemy pot.",
    ["一颗拳头大小的透明水晶球，内部仿佛封存着流动的光影。轻触水晶，那些优雅的舞步便会在脑海中重现，仿佛灵魂曾亲身经历过那场演出。而艺术的本质，便是将瞬间化为永恒。"] = "A fist-sized transparent crystal ball, inside which flowing light and shadow seem to be sealed. Lightly touch the crystal, and those elegant dance steps will reappear in your mind, as if your soul had personally experienced that performance. And the essence of art is to turn the moment into eternity.",
    ["一颗散发着紫色光芒的晶球，它象征着俱乐部的凝聚力，以及你的活跃与贡献。"] = "A crystal ball emitting purple light; it symbolizes the cohesion of the club, as well as your activity and contribution.",
    ["一颗沉甸甸的金色南瓜，来自柯莱奶奶的南瓜园。它不只是一颗果实，更是一份跨越七十年的约定。"] = "A heavy golden pumpkin from Grandma Cole's pumpkin patch. It is not just a fruit, but a promise spanning seventy years.",
    ["一颗沾染着夜幕色泽的骰子。掷出它，也许会有其他存在于暗处替你拨转命运。"] = "A die stained with the color of the night. Roll it, and perhaps another existence in the shadows will nudge fate for you.",
    ["一颗猎魔子弹，形状和正常手枪子弹相同，外表银白，射出去的时候像一颗璀璨的星星"] = "A Demon Hunter Bullet, identical in shape to a normal pistol bullet, silver-white in appearance, looking like a brilliant star when fired.",
    ["一颗神奇的苹果，它的状态不断变化着，从腐烂到新鲜，再从新鲜回归到腐烂……"] = "A magical apple whose state is constantly changing, from rotten to fresh, and then from fresh back to rotten...",
    ["一颗覆盖着晨曦光辉的骰子。掷出它，也许命运更偏爱你这一隅光芒。"] = "A die covered in the radiance of dawn. Roll it, and perhaps fate will favor this corner of light you occupy.",
    ["一饮而尽"] = "Drink in One Gulp",
