    ["一！二！三！木头人！"] = "One! Two! Three! Red Light, Green Light!",
    ["一，二，一，二……"] = "One, two, one, two...",
    ["一，是计数的起源。\n\n很不幸也成为这位死者的终点，除了一本笔记外，包括他本人在内的一切信息均已被他身上的污染消除。"] = "One is the origin of counting. \n \n Unfortunately, it also became the end for this deceased person; except for a notebook, all information including the person himself has been erased by the corruption on him.",
