    ["万物衰败，终焉来临。黄昏与死亡，总是无常。"] = "All things decay, the end is coming. Dusk and death are always fickle.",
    ["万物衰败，风暴来临。凋零与衰败，常伴我身。"] = "All things decay, the storm is coming. Wither and decay are always with me.",
