    ["万都之都 希望之地——"] = "The city of all cities, the land of hope—",
    ["万都之都号承诺：您将体验全鲁恩最优雅的航行，祝您旅途愉快。"] = "The City of Cities promises: You will experience the most elegant voyage in all of Loen. Have a pleasant Journey.",
