    ["丈夫"] = "Husband",
    ["丈夫去世得早，两夫妇也没有孩子，只留下这些花给她。"] = "Her husband passed away early, and the couple had no children, leaving only these flowers for her.",
    ["三"] = "Three",
    ["三 二 一——"] = "Three, two, one—",
    ["三万三战力的全国第七哈哈哈"] = "Ranked seventh nationwide with thirty-three thousand power, hahaha.",
    ["三个圆形区域，对应三个“预言之物”？放上去试试。"] = "Three circular areas, corresponding to three 'Prophetic Objects'? Let's try placing them on there.",
    ["三个字"] = "Three characters",
    ["三个异常。"] = "Three anomalies.",
    ["三个月。每天一闭眼就是那天的事。"] = "Three months. Every time I close my eyes, it's that day's events.",
    ["三个月前，水手乘船送来一封信，说她的丈夫在特里尔有了新的生活，不回来了。"] = "Three months ago, a sailor delivered a letter saying her husband had started a new life in Trier and wasn't coming back.",
    ["三个月前，水手说她的丈夫在有了新的生活，不回来了。"] = "Three months ago, a sailor said her husband had a new life and wasn't coming back.",
    ["三个月的凝视，镜中已沉淀出另一个完整的你。"] = "Three months of Gaze, and another complete you has settled in the mirror.",
    ["三二一，不许动！"] = "Three, two, one, don't move!",
