    ["三根线"] = "Three clues",
    ["三次追上弗拉-鱼篓附近"] = "Catch up with Fula three times - near the fish basket",
    ["三步"] = "Three steps",
    ["三段1：长6米宽3米的矩形区域"] = "Phase 3-1: 6m long, 3m wide rectangular area",
    ["三段2：自身4米范围内的区域"] = "Phase 3-2: Area within 4m of self",
    ["三段2：自身6米范围内的区域"] = "Phase 3-2: Area within 6m of self",
    ["三段式尊名不仅是一个名字，它更接近一种神性的注视、一种召唤的咒文。"] = "The three-part honorific name is not just a name, it is closer to a divine gaze, a spell of summoning.",
    ["三段式连招，发射精神能量攻击，每段对敌方造成bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)点魔法伤害。\n仅<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>可用，<HighLight>空想姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>安抚</>。"] = "A three-stage combo that launches mental energy attacks, each stage dealing bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) magic damage to enemies. \n Only available in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Pacify </> in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>.",
    ["三段式连招，安抚友方精神，每段回复友方目标*d/*d/*d点生命。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>意识冲击</>。"] = "A three-stage combo that pacifies the minds of allies, each stage restoring *d/*d/*d Health to allied targets. \n Only available in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Consciousness Shock </> in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>.",
    ["三段重拳共造成180%攻击力伤害，末段击飞并获得12%最大生命护盾。"] = "Three-stage heavy punch dealing a total of 180% attack damage, with the final stage knocking up the target and granting a 12% max health shield.",
    ["三段：15米内的单体目标"] = "Third stage: Single target within 15 meters",
    ["三段：半径4米的扇形区域"] = "Phase 3: Sector area with a 4m radius",
    ["三段：身前半径2.7米的圆形区域"] = "Phase 3: Circular area with a 2.7m radius in front",
    ["三段：长6米宽3米的矩形区域"] = "Stage 3: Rectangular area 6 meters long and 3 meters wide",
    ["三段：长9米宽3米的矩形区域"] = "Stage 3: Rectangular area 9 meters long and 3 meters wide",
    ["三沙"] = "Sansha",
    ["三波灵界轰击分别造成<HighLight>140%/140%/280%</>攻击伤害；第一波牵引，第二波使攻击降低15%。"] = "Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>140%/140%/280%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%.",
    ["三波灵界轰击分别造成<HighLight>70%/70%/140%</>攻击伤害；第一波牵引，第二波使攻击降低15%。"] = "Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>70%/70%/140%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%.",
    ["三点二十分，管家带人闯进卧室，他第一个发现了尸体，并掌握着案发现场的情况。"] = "At three-twenty, the butler broke into the bedroom with others; he was the first to discover the body and had control over the crime scene.",
    ["三烛仪式"] = "Three-Candle Ritual",
