    ["三环AOE"] = "Three-Ring AOE",
    ["三环蔓袭"] = "Three-Ring Vine Entrapment",
    ["三百万镑？呵！"] = "Three million pounds? Heh!",
    ["三百便士就能饱餐一顿了，难道邪神不用吃饭的吗？艺术创作要融入生活……"] = "Three hundred pence is enough for a full meal. Don't evil gods need to eat? Artistic creation must integrate into life...",
    ["三百回合……"] = "Three hundred rounds...",
    ["三百零三，三百零四，三百零五……"] = "Three hundred and three, three hundred and four, three hundred and five...",
    ["三眼乌鸦"] = "Three-Eyed Crow",
    ["三眼乌鸦释放致命打击，保持移动！"] = "The Three-Eyed Crow releases a fatal blow; keep moving!",
    ["三种形态，代表着流动、静止与凝固。"] = "Three forms representing flow, stillness, and solidification.",
