    ["三聚光灯"] = "Three Spotlights",
    ["三脚猫占卜师满地乱跑，我只想要真正可靠的占卜家……"] = "Amateur diviners are running around everywhere; I only want a truly reliable Seer...",
    ["三色舞池"] = "Three-Color Dance Floor",
    ["三色舞池需玩家交互变身为小狒狒才能看见。"] = "Players must interact with the Three-Color Dance Floor and transform into a small baboon to see it.",
    ["三色迷舞·困难"] = "Three-Color Maze Dance · Hard",
    ["三苏勒，我全部的钱了……或许能为她买到一条项链？"] = "Three soli, all my money... perhaps I can buy her a necklace?",
