    ["上<h>马车</>"] = "Get on the <h>carriage</>",
    ["上、课！典籍真的很难编！船长看完我的初稿后就把我送到这里要我深造学业！"] = "Att-attend class! The classics are really hard to compile! After the captain read my first draft, he sent me here to further my studies!",
