    ["上一局"] = "Previous Match",
    ["上一次是罗茜，再上次是苏菲亚，还是黛比？"] = "Last time it was Rosie, and before that Sophia, or was it Debbie?",
    ["上一步"] = "Previous step",
    ["上一秒我们还在正常交谈，下一秒他就用警惕陌生的眼神看我……没有一种医学术语能形容他的状态。"] = "One second we were talking normally, the next he was looking at me with wary, unfamiliar eyes... No medical term can describe his state.",
    ["上一章节达成后开启"] = "Unlocked after completing the previous chapter.",
    ["上下"] = "Up/Down",
    ["上下铺·胡桃木"] = "Bunk Bed: Walnut",
    ["上下铺·蓝梧桐"] = "Bunk Bed: Blue Sycamore",
    ["上个学期的选修课又被劳伦斯老师打了不及格，我是不是应该去初代校长雕像那儿祈祷一下？"] = "I failed the elective course last semester again because of Professor Lawrence, should I go pray at the statue of the first principal?",
    ["上个月的预言棒棒糖卖得很好！每个人舔完都能看到自己的未来——虽然大多数人看到的是“明天还要工作”，但这确实是未来啊！"] = "Last month's prophecy lollipops sold very well! Everyone who licks one can see their future—although most people see 'I have to work tomorrow,' that is indeed the future!",
    ["上个月的预言棒棒糖卖得很好！每个人舔完都能看到自己的未来——虽然大多数人看到的是“明天还要工作”，但这确实是未来啊！  "] = "Last month's prophecy lollipops sold very well! Everyone could see their own future after licking them—although most people saw 'I have to work tomorrow,' that is indeed the future!",
    ["上个月那不一样。上个月那条丝带，是真的好看。"] = "Last month was different. That ribbon last month was truly beautiful.",
