    ["上传50条作品至艺术档案"] = "Upload 50 works to the Art Archive",
    ["上传<Highlight>已经准备好</>的短视频（<Highlight>快手/抖音</>等平台下载的<Highlight>30秒以内</>的视频），确保人物清晰，<Highlight>全身尤佳</>。\n\n若视频过长，可使用<Highlight>快影/剪映</>等剪辑工具，将视频裁剪至<Highlight>30秒以内</>，再开始创作。"] = "Upload a short video <Highlight> that is ready </> (<Highlight> downloaded from platforms like Kuaishou/Douyin </>, etc., <Highlight> under 30 seconds </>), ensuring the character is clear, <Highlight> full-body is preferred </>. \n\n If the video is too long, you can use editing tools like <Highlight> Kuaiying/Jianying </> to trim the video to <Highlight> under 30 seconds </> before starting your creation.",
