    ["上午好，阿兹克先生。"] = "Good morning, Mr. Azik.",
    ["上半场"] = "First Half",
    ["上去吧。下面的只是前戏……上面才是正片。"] = "Go on up. What's below is just the foreplay... the real show is above.",
    ["上台看看伊琳的状态"] = "Go on stage to check Irene's condition",
    ["上周一笔大单子，从我手里过的。"] = "A big order last week, passed through my hands.",
    ["上周就说要和劳伦斯去恶龙酒吧……现在都没空去，万恶的工厂主。"] = "I said last week I'd go to the Evil Dragon Bar with Lawrence... still haven't had time to go, those evil factory owners.",
    ["上周您来的时候气色不太好，这周看着好多了。"] = "You didn't look very well when you came in last week, but you look much better this week.",
    ["上周教堂区那边出了件怪事，你听说了吗？"] = "Did you hear about the strange thing that happened in the Church District last week?",
    ["上周的拍卖会，有人拍卖码头区附近的一间陈旧仓库。"] = "At last week's auction, someone auctioned off an old warehouse near the Dock District.",
    ["上周的拍卖会，有人拍卖码头区附近的一间陈旧仓库，竟然卖出了3000便士。"] = "At last week's auction, someone auctioned off an old warehouse near the dock area, and it actually sold for 3000 pennies.",
    ["上周被辞退后，威廉跳河了，三个孩子只能送去济贫院了。"] = "After being laid off last week, William jumped into the river, and the three children had to be sent to the poorhouse.",
    ["上周被辞退后，威廉跳河自杀了，他那三个年幼的孩子只能被送去济贫院了。"] = "After being laid off last week, William jumped into the river and committed suicide; his three young children have no choice but to be sent to the poorhouse.",
    ["上唇中"] = "Center of upper lip",
    ["上唇内侧"] = "Inner upper lip",
    ["上唇外侧"] = "Outer upper lip",
    ["上唇整体"] = "Overall upper lip",
    ["上啊，我要再加1000苏勒！"] = "Go on, I'll add another 1000 sous!",
    ["上回向盥洗室之主祈祷后，就从天而降一位警察{{先生|女士}}，帮助我们解决了腹泻问题，如果再祈祷一次，是不是能让“焦糖炸弹”复活？"] = "After praying to the Lord of the Washroom last time, a police {{Mr.|Ms.}} descended from the sky and helped us solve our diarrhea problem. If we pray one more time, could we bring \"Caramel Bomb\" back to life?",
    ["上场"] = "Participate",
