    ["上学遇到两百个秘术导师，占坑"] = "Met two hundred mysticism tutors while going to school, occupying the spot.",
    ["上层（有bug，走旁边传送门）"] = "Upper Level (Bugged, use the portal on the side)",
    ["上帝"] = "God",
    ["上帝啊，为什么这里的香水有这么多选择？"] = "God, why are there so many choices for perfume here?",
