    ["上架商品已满。"] = "Listing limit reached.",
    ["上架失败，低于最小汇率范围"] = "Listing failed, below the minimum exchange rate range.",
    ["上架失败，该道具可能已不存在。"] = "Listing failed, the item may no longer exist.",
    ["上架失败，高于最大汇率范围"] = "Listing failed, above the maximum exchange rate range.",
    ["上架时间"] = "Listing Time",
    ["上架秘偶已刷新"] = "Listed marionettes have refreshed.",
    ["上柜陈列餐具，下柜储藏食物，开门时要小心不要将柜子碰倒。"] = "Display tableware in the upper cabinet and store food in the lower cabinet; be careful not to knock the cabinet over when opening it.",
    ["上校"] = "Colonel",
    ["上次东区有个代罚者失控，就是我跟斯维因一起解决的。"] = "Last time, a Wind-blessed lost control in the East District, and it was Swain and I who solved it.",
    ["上次你说要搬家，搬了吗？"] = "Last time you said you were moving, did you move?",
    ["上次和赛琳娜去哈罗德百货商店的时候……"] = "Last time when I went to Harold Department Store with Selena...",
    ["上次喝了用它调配的药剂，我看到许多小人在跳舞！"] = "Last time I drank the potion mixed with it, I saw many little people dancing!",
    ["上次坐在这里时，我连廷根什么样都不知道，现在……"] = "The last time I sat here, I didn't even know what Tingen was like, and now...",
    ["上次她出门前喷了一瓶，我问她叫什么名字，她说\"快去上学，别迟到了\"……"] = "Last time before she went out, she sprayed a bottle. I asked her what it was called, and she said 'Go to school, don't be late'...",
    ["上次就差一点点，这次我一定成功！"] = "Last time it was just a little bit off, this time I'll definitely succeed!",
    ["上次您帮安娜占卜的事情，已经在俱乐部传开了。"] = "The divination you did for Anna last time has already spread throughout the club.",
    ["上次我们一起来这家店的时候，是三个月前吧。"] = "The last time we came to this shop together was three months ago, right?",
    ["上次有人质疑她用魔法，她气得三天没接那人的单。"] = "Last time someone questioned if she used magic, she was so angry she didn't take that person's orders for three days.",
    ["上次案件的受害者，我在尝试还原他完整的样貌。"] = "The victim of the last case, I'm trying to restore his complete appearance.",
    ["上次的木雕还在抽屉里，摆出来看看。"] = "The wood carving from last time is still in the drawer. Let's put it out and look at it.",
    ["上次说要挖运河，结果挖到一半发现下面是墓地。"] = "Last time they said they were going to dig a canal, but halfway through, they found out it was a cemetery underneath.",
    ["上次调查的结果提交给总部，圣堂的回复是“最深处的污染来自红月之上”。"] = "The results of the last investigation were submitted to headquarters. The Cathedral's reply was \"the deepest corruption comes from above the Red Moon\".",
    ["上次败在那颗浅褐斑纹蛋上，这次我连蛋壳上的呼吸孔分布都记熟了！"] = "I lost to that light brown spotted egg last time, this time I've even memorized the distribution of the breathing holes on the shell!",
    ["上次配制的午夜油膏还缺一株曼陀罗草，不知道有没有人接我的委托。"] = "The midnight ointment I prepared last time is still missing a mandrake root. I wonder if anyone will take my commission.",
    ["上次配制的午夜油膏还缺曼陀罗草，还没有人接我的委托。"] = "The midnight ointment I prepared last time is still missing mandrake, and no one has taken my commission yet.",
    ["上流社会？"] = "High society?",
