    ["上炮车人数已满，请稍后"] = "The Cannon Carriage is full, please wait.",
    ["上班地一号和上班地二号，死了都逃不过打工的命运。"] = "Workplace number one and workplace number two. Even in death, one cannot escape the fate of being a wage slave.",
