    ["下一次诗社活动我们邀请他一起吧？"] = "Shall we invite him to join our next poetry club event?",
    ["下一次闪击将被强化"] = "The next Flash Strike will be strengthened.",
    ["下一步"] = "Next Step",
    ["下一神性等级解锁时间：<Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知经验获取</>\n足够的认知有利于扮演的推进。完成主线、支线、时代与漫游任务，以及参与各类日常玩法（包括<Yellow>轻松躺赢、以战养战、世界冒险</>等），均可获得大量认知经验。当你重历“愚者”先生的历史时，受“嫁接”的力量影响，同样可以获取属于自己的那份认知经验。玩家到达扮演等级上限之后，获取的认知经验将被转化，继续提升神性等级。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>等级限制规则</>\n扮演等级提升至最终上限后，继续积累的认知经验将以一定比例转化，用于提升神性等级。当非凡者的神性等级达到当前上限，将无法继续获取认知经验。直到开放新的神性等级，方可继续提升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演中的人性与神性</>\n“万物皆有神性，当扮演超出限度，你将逐步走向最初的神性。”\n非凡者通过日常的体验、任务与探索，不断接受关于这个世界的认知，并将其转化为<Yellow>认知经验</>。积累认知经验，可逐步提升自我的<Yellow>扮演等级</>，通过扮演以巩固精神与存在的稳定性。\n然而，认知与扮演本身蕴含风险，扮演的每一步也在支付着代价。当扮演等级提升至最终上限后，人性将无法维持扮演带来的影响——后续的扮演将开始塑造神性。非凡者将在扮演中逐步走向神性，从而提升<Yellow>神性等级</>。\n为防止短时间内接收过量认知导致精神崩溃，您被“愚者”先生赋予了限制等级的保护性祝福。在当前的扮演等级或神性等级下，身体与精神必须经历足够的适应与沉淀，方能突破等级限制，承受更高层次的认知，迈向下一阶段。"] = "Next Divinity Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. After players reach the Acting Level cap, the Cognitive Experience gained will be converted to continue increasing the Divinity Level. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nAfter the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be converted at a certain ratio to increase the Divinity Level. When a Beyonder's Divinity Level reaches the current cap, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Divinity Level is opened. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nBeyonders continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Beyonders will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
