    ["下不来了吧！笨蛋！"] = "Can't get down, can you! Idiot!",
    ["下不来了吧，笨蛋！"] = "Can't get down, can you, dummy!",
    ["下劈：身前半径2.7米的圆形区域"] = "Downward Slash: Circular area with a 2.7m radius in front",
    ["下午<InvHighlight>三点</>，仆人去准备下午茶。\n<InvHighlight>三点十分</>左右，仆人将茶送到卧室门口时，发现<InvHighlight>房门锁着。</>\t\n仆人敲门后，没有立刻等到回应。一段时间后，卧室里才传来男爵的声音：<InvHighlight>“别进来。”</>\n仆人没有进入卧室，而是将托盘<InvHighlight>放在门口</>后离开。\t\t"] = "At 3:00 PM <InvHighlight>, the servant went to prepare afternoon tea. </>\nAround 3:10 PM <InvHighlight>, when the servant brought the tea to the bedroom door, he found that </>the door was locked. <InvHighlight>\t</>After the servant knocked, he did not receive an immediate response. After some time, the Baron's voice came from inside the bedroom: \n“Don't come in.” <InvHighlight></>The servant did not enter the bedroom, but instead placed the tray \nat the door <InvHighlight>and left. </>\t\t",
    ["下午<InvHighlight>两点五十五分</>，管家正在餐厅整理银器，听见卧室里传来男女主人的争吵声。\n<InvHighlight>三点</>左右，他亲眼看到男爵夫人离开卧室。\n随后，霍克斯男爵感到心脏不适，呼唤管家进入书房送药。管家两分钟后离开。\n<InvHighlight>三点二十分</>左右，管家去找霍克斯男爵，发现霍克斯男爵始终没有回应，于是叫人一起撞开房门。\n霍克斯男爵倒在书桌旁，地上是打翻的茶。"] = "At 2:55 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler was in the dining room organizing the silverware when he heard the master and mistress arguing in the bedroom. </>\nAround 3:00 PM <InvHighlight>, he saw the Baroness leave the bedroom with his own eyes. </>Shortly after, Baron Hawkes felt discomfort in his heart and called for the butler to enter the study to deliver medicine. The butler left two minutes later. \n\nAround 3:20 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler went to find Baron Hawkes and discovered that he was not responding, so he called for others to help him break down the door. </>Baron Hawkes was lying next to the desk with spilled tea on the floor. \n",
    ["下午<P_Yellow>三点前</>。当时我们吵了一架，我劝他把那件古董处理掉，可他根本不听。"] = "Before <P_Yellow>three o'clock</> in the afternoon. We had an argument at the time, and I advised him to get rid of that antique, but he wouldn't listen at all.",
    ["下午好 又见面了"] = "Good afternoon, we meet again.",
    ["下午好！“正义”小姐、“魔术师”小姐、“星星”先生，你们怎么都在？"] = "Good afternoon! Miss \"Justice,\" Miss \"Magician,\" Mr. \"The Star,\" why are you all here?",
    ["下午好，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Good afternoon, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["下午好，{{PlayerName}}，我预感到了你会出现。"] = "Good afternoon, {{PlayerName}}, I had a premonition that you would appear.",
    ["下午好，“倒吊人”先生。"] = "Good afternoon, Mr. Hanged Man.",
    ["下午好，“愚者”先生。"] = "Good afternoon, Mr. Fool.",
    ["下午好，倒吊人先生。"] = "Good afternoon, Mr. Hanged Man.",
    ["下午好，和你相遇真是意外之喜，请问愿意顺道和我一起享用下午茶吗？"] = "Good afternoon, meeting you is truly an unexpected joy. Would you be willing to join me for afternoon tea on the way?",
    ["下午好，愚者先生。"] = "Good afternoon, Mr. Fool.",
    ["下午好，我叫安洁莉卡，占卜俱乐部的接待员。"] = "Good afternoon, my name is Angelica, the receptionist of the Divination Club.",
    ["下午好，我叫安洁莉卡，占卜家俱乐部的接待员。"] = "Good afternoon, my name is Angelica, the receptionist at the Divination Club.",
    ["下午好，请问我可以为你做些什么？"] = "Good afternoon. Is there anything I can do for you?",
    ["下午我碰到了班森，他说你们要搬去水仙花街了，你是忘记了什么回来取吗？"] = "I ran into Benson this afternoon, and he said you were moving to Daffodil Street. Did you forget something and come back to get it?",
    ["下午茶"] = "Afternoon Tea",
    ["下午茶可以尝试柠檬蛋糕和小松饼，可以搭配费内波特的高原咖啡，或者我家乡的甜冰茶。"] = "For afternoon tea, you can try lemon cake and small muffins, which can be paired with Feynapot's highland coffee or the sweet iced tea from my hometown.",
    ["下午茶回答状态"] = "Afternoon tea answer state",
    ["下午茶奇遇触发器"] = "Afternoon Tea Encounter Trigger",
    ["下午茶推荐"] = "Afternoon tea recommendation",
    ["下午茶点心也会用这笔钱够买。"] = "This money will also be used to buy afternoon tea snacks.",
    ["下午茶点心也会用这笔钱购买。"] = "Afternoon tea snacks are also purchased with this money.",
    ["下午茶简单相机"] = "Afternoon Tea Simple Camera",
    ["下午茶默认状态"] = "Afternoon tea default state",
    ["下半场"] = "Second Half",
    ["下半脸"] = "Lower Half of Face",
    ["下去下去，这里很危险！"] = "Get down, get down, it's dangerous here!",
    ["下去，不要打扰工人工作！"] = "Get down, don't disturb the workers!",
    ["下发任务道具"] = "Distribute quest items",
    ["下周剧场又要公演《伯爵归来》了……真是经典的版本。"] = "The theater is performing \"The Return of the Count\" again next week... It's such a classic version.",
    ["下周就要在教堂里演出了，还唱得这么糟糕！"] = "The performance in the church is next week, and you are still singing so poorly!",
    ["下周开组会，我一定会被导师夸的，嘿嘿！看来今年不用延毕咯！ "] = "I have a group meeting next week, I will definitely be praised by my mentor, hehe! Looks like I don't have to delay graduation this year!",
    ["下周的场次，位置还不错。 "] = "Next week's session, the seats are pretty good.",
    ["下周，索菲已经辞掉了纺织厂的工作，在专心收拾我们弗拉德街的新房子了。"] = "Next week, Sophie has already quit her job at the textile mill and is focusing on tidying up our new house on Vlad Street.",
