    ["下次一定……"] = "Next time for sure...",
    ["下次一起去听音乐会吧——如果你能保证不睡着的话。"] = "Let's go to a concert together next time—if you can guarantee you won't fall asleep.",
    ["下次再与你相会吧，美丽的女士。（临时）"] = "Let's meet again next time, beautiful lady. (Temporary)",
    ["下次再去吧"] = "Go next time",
    ["下次再回家，他会不会也在这里等我们呢？"] = "When he comes home next time, will he be waiting for us here too?",
    ["下次再把新谱子带来吧。我等着弹。 但是，别再熬到后半夜了，好吗？"] = "Bring the new sheet music next time. I'll be waiting to play it. But, don't stay up until the middle of the night again, okay?",
    ["下次再来"] = "Come back next time",
    ["下次再来吧"] = "Come back next time",
    ["下次再来啊。"] = "Come again next time.",
    ["下次再看见她，我联系你。女神在上，别再给我增加工作量了。"] = "I'll contact you next time I see her. Goddess above, don't add to my workload anymore.",
    ["下次再聊！"] = "Let's talk again next time!",
    ["下次卡斯伯特女士回来时，会做什么样的新甜品呢？"] = "What kind of new dessert will Ms. Cuthbert make when she returns next time?",
    ["下次可以让罗伯特带你来！"] = "Next time you can let Robert bring you!",
    ["下次吧"] = "Next time",
    ["下次恢复"] = "Recover Next Time",
    ["下次我会为你引荐廷根时尚协会的。"] = "I will recommend you to the Tingen Fashion Association next time.",
    ["下次把睡袋拿上来……"] = "Bring the sleeping bag up next time...",
    ["下次更新前不再弹出"] = "Do not pop up again before next update",
    ["下次有事直接说，妈妈保证不骂你。"] = "Next time, just tell me directly. Mom promises not to scold you.",
    ["下次有急件，我是不是也可以找你？"] = "If there's an urgent delivery next time, can I come to you?",
    ["下次能不能打德州，这不公平！我那边都没见过你们这种打法。"] = "Can we play Texas Hold'em next time? This isn't fair! I've never seen your style of play where I'm from.",
    ["下次要不要试试新口味的咖啡，黄油拿铁怎么样？"] = "Would you like to try a new coffee flavor next time? How about a butter latte?",
    ["下次见面，把他们给你讲的睡前故事说给我听就好。"] = "Next time we meet, just tell me the bedtime stories they told you.",
    ["下次路过，要是听说了什么稀奇古怪的石头或者画儿的故事，一定记得跟我讲讲呀！我这别的没有，故事和酒管够。"] = "Next time you pass by, if you hear any stories about strange rocks or paintings, be sure to tell me! I may not have much else, but I have plenty of stories and wine.",
    ["下次，还有机会见面吗？"] = "Will there be a chance to meet again next time?",
