    ["下水道恶臭？和议员有什么关系……这也是非凡事件？"] = "A foul stench from the sewers? What does that have to do with the councilman... Is this also a Beyonder incident?",
    ["下水道治理就是其中一项举措，这一壮举后来推广至全世界，挽救了无数即将破碎的家庭！"] = "Sewer management was one of the measures. This feat was later promoted worldwide, saving countless families from falling apart!",
    ["下水道系统已经初步建立，\r\n灭鼠行动也持续进行中。"] = "The sewer system has been initially established,\r\nand the rat extermination campaign is also in Continuous progress.",
    ["下水道系统需要持续建设，\r\n使用【】，\r\n才能真正缓解城市污染。"] = "The sewer system requires Continuous construction,\r\nusing【】,\r\nto truly alleviate the city's corruption.",
