    ["下雨了……我去雇一辆马车。"] = "It's raining... I'll go hire a carriage.",
    ["下雨好！喝着浓香的咖啡，静静地坐在这里听雨，一天也不会腻……"] = "Rainy days are good! Drinking rich coffee, sitting here quietly listening to the rain, I wouldn't get tired of it even for a whole day...",
