    ["不 不要拥抱那背负污染的红月"] = "No, do not embrace the red moon that carries corruption",
    ["不 我还是来晚了 不"] = "No, I'm still too late, no",
    ["不 这不是新生"] = "No, this is not rebirth",
    ["不 这只是一位被伟大主人眷顾的……新人"] = "No, this is just a... newcomer favored by the great master.",
    ["不——时代的洪流，永不终结！"] = "No—the torrent of the era never ends!",
    ["不——！"] = "No—!",
    ["不……"] = "No...",
    ["不……不……"] = "No... no...",
    ["不……不可能！"] = "No... impossible!",
    ["不……不好意思，我刚……来，说话有……有点不利索。"] = "I... I'm sorry, I just... arrived, my speech is... a bit clumsy.",
    ["不……不是的，泽维尔只是……<P_Heart>（她看起来很是慌乱，在急于为她的心上人辩解。）</>"] = "No... it's not like that, Xavier is just... <P_Heart> (She looks very flustered, eager to defend her sweetheart.) </>",
    ["不……不要！"] = "No... don't!",
    ["不……不！知识为什么……抛弃我……"] = "No... no! Why does knowledge... abandon me...",
    ["不……你不能带走……"] = "No... you cannot take it away...",
    ["不……你听我说……山里有东西……我不该接这份活……这是对山脉的不敬……"] = "No... listen to me... there's something in the mountains... I shouldn't have taken this job... it's a disrespect to the mountains...",
    ["不……只是把她那份也喝了。"] = "No... just drinking her share too.",
    ["不……啊——"] = "No... ah—",
    ["不……她不会的……"] = "No... she wouldn't...",
    ["不……实在不好意思，还需要麻烦你另一件事，帮我把怀表还给……菲利普吧。"] = "No... I'm really sorry, but I need to trouble you with one more thing. Please help me return the pocket watch to... Philip.",
    ["不……我不是这样的……"] = "No... I'm not like that...",
    ["不……我不能再沉沦下去了……"] = "No... I cannot sink any further...",
    ["不……我的仪式……"] = "No... my ritual...",
    ["不……我绝对不会就这样放弃……"] = "No... I will never give up just like this...",
    ["不……抱歉，没什么，谢谢你的帮助。"] = "No... sorry, it's nothing. Thank you for your help.",
    ["不……是谁？危险……快离开……"] = "No... who is it? Danger... leave quickly...",
    ["不……现在不是时候。观众不登台。先看接下来会发生什么。"] = "No... now is not the time. A Spectator does not take the stage. Let's see what happens next.",
    ["不……这应该是完全没有将肉浸泡过冰水的结果，他应该不会犯这样的错……"] = "No... this should be the result of not soaking the meat in ice water at all, he shouldn't make such a mistake...",
    ["不……这怎么可能？！"] = "No... how is this possible?!",
    ["不……难道，您已经吃了那个青蛙？！"] = "No... could it be that you have already eaten that frog?!",
    ["不……！西德尼！你背叛了我！"] = "No...! Sidney! You betrayed me!",
    ["不、不、不，点燃就会消失，消失就是死亡。"] = "No, no, no, if you light it, it will disappear, and disappearance is death.",
    ["不、不可能！廷根怎么可能有比我们更时尚的人！"] = "No, impossible! How could there be anyone in Tingen more fashionable than us!",
    ["不、不是，是我有一个朋友买过。"] = "No, it's not that. It's just that I have a friend who bought one.",
    ["不、不用了，我只是陪同他来的。"] = "No, no need, I'm just accompanying him.",
    ["不、不要吃我，不要吃我啊！！！"] = "No, don't eat me, don't eat me!!!",
    ["不。我知道我做了什么。"] = "No. I know what I did.",
    ["不一样吗？你难道没送过人，或者更奇怪的东西？"] = "Is it different? Haven't you delivered people, or even stranger things?",
    ["不一样，这片边上缺了一块，是特别的。"] = "It's not the same, this one is missing a piece on the edge, it's special.",
    ["不一样？"] = "Different?",
    ["不不不。相处下来，我发现他们为人友善，力气也大，很快，大家就一起捕鱼出海了。不然，你哪能见到我来廷根度假？"] = "No, no. After getting along, I found they were friendly and strong, and soon everyone was fishing and going to sea together. Otherwise, how could you see me coming to Tingen for a vacation?",
    ["不不不用，我还是当瞭望塔吧！"] = "No, no, no, I'd better be the Watchtower!",
    ["不不不，塔芒先生是全廷根最优秀最专业的咖啡师了。"] = "No, no, no, Mr. Tamang is the best and most professional barista in all of Tingen.",
    ["不不不，我不养那种大家伙，我喜欢那种小巧可爱，不会叫的小宠物。"] = "No, no, no, I don't keep those big guys; I like those small, cute pets that don't make noise.",
    ["不不不，我不是这个意思，我只是例行问问病情。祝您健康！"] = "No, no, no, that's not what I meant. I was just asking about your condition as a routine. I wish you good health!",
    ["不不不，我并没有恰好拿走什么东西。"] = "No, no, no, I didn't happen to take anything.",
    ["不不不，我的意思是，这一切就跟做梦似的……"] = "No, no, no, I mean, all of this is like a dream...",
    ["不不不，抱歉……失礼了，我这就给您包起来。"] = "No, no, no, I'm sorry... excuse my rudeness, I'll wrap it up for you right away.",
    ["不不不，直走那条路不是我们的营地。"] = "No, no, no, that road straight ahead is not our camp.",
    ["不不不，答案是我家的鱼！"] = "No, no, no, the answer is the fish at my house!",
    ["不不不，这种东西，不该继续售卖，就该倒进马桶！"] = "No, no, no, this kind of thing shouldn't be sold anymore, it should be poured down the toilet!",
    ["不不，你是能触碰到世界真相的人！"] = "No, no, you are someone who can touch the truth of the world!",
    ["不不，我们还没有交易！对不起，我下次再也不敢了！"] = "No, no, we haven't made a deal yet! I'm sorry, I won't dare to do it again!",
    ["不不，是打算送给朋友的礼物。"] = "No, no, it's a gift I intend to give to a friend.",
    ["不严重怎么称得上“事故”？只有严重到要登报纸了，管理才会把这么火的节目撤掉，我们的小猪跳圈才有机会被看见。"] = "If it wasn't serious, how could it be called an 'accident'? Only if it's serious enough to make the newspapers will management cancel such a popular program, and our 'Piggy Jumping Hoops' will have a chance to be seen.",
    ["不为什么，再见。"] = "For no reason, goodbye.",
    ["不久前我在这遇到您，您也说自己要上厕所。"] = "I met you here not long ago, and you also said you needed to go to the bathroom.",
    ["不久后，眼前的海洋消散，露出了一个温暖的房间。"] = "Not long after, the ocean before you dissipates, revealing a warm room.",
    ["不久，混乱世界出现多个有魔力的湖泊，湖下再次分裂出新的秩序世界....."] = "Before long, multiple magical lakes appeared in the chaotic world, and new orderly worlds split off from beneath the lakes again...",
    ["不买"] = "Not buying",
    ["不买了吧。"] = "Let's not buy it.",
    ["不了。我怕我一张嘴，你们就跑光了。"] = "No. I'm afraid that as soon as I open my mouth, you two will run away.",
    ["不了不了"] = "No, no",
    ["不了不了！我改！我重新做人！"] = "No, no! I'll change! I'll turn over a new leaf!",
    ["不了不了，我不怎么会玩……"] = "No, no, I don't really know how to play...",
    ["不了！"] = "No!",
    ["不了，免费的就是最贵的。"] = "No thanks, the free stuff is the most expensive.",
    ["不了，我还要把晒干的草药送去谢尔敏的草药店。"] = "No, I still have to send the dried herbs to Shermin's herbal shop.",
    ["不了，谢谢"] = "No, thanks",
    ["不了，赶时间。 "] = "No, I'm in a hurry.",
    ["不予置评"] = "No comment",
    ["不仅和我分享了下午茶，还说会帮我寻求一个银行的职务。"] = "Not only did he share afternoon tea with me, but he also said he would help me seek a position at a bank.",
    ["不仅如此，偶尔还有人说它会惨叫……大约只是传言罢了。"] = "Not only that, occasionally people say it screams... it's probably just a rumor.",
    ["不仅如此，它竟然连放屁都很动听，不然怎么“屁美”呢？真是头神奇的猪……"] = "Not only that, it even sounds pleasant when it farts, otherwise why would it be called 'Fart Beauty'? What a magical pig...",
    ["不仅如此，我兄弟说工厂后面最近总有怪声，像是……在磨骨头！ "] = "Not only that, my brother said there have always been strange noises behind the factory recently, like... grinding bones!",
    ["不仅如此，箱子还在动！你可能看不出来，虽然很缓慢，但它在移动，我已经观察它很久了。"] = "Not only that, the box is moving! You might not be able to tell, but although it's very slow, it is moving. I've been observing it for a long time.",
    ["不仅是偷东西！被偷走的东西还会被埋在野外，旁边还立了块墓碑！"] = "It's not just stealing! The stolen items are buried in the wild, and there's even a tombstone set up next to them!",
    ["不仅黛丝的死和占卜结果有关，这个回答也在暗示和<P_Yellow>前来占卜的顾客</>有关！"] = "Not only is Daisy's death related to the divination result, but this answer also implies it's related to the <P_Yellow>customer who came for a divination</>!",
    ["不介意的话，我陪你一起去吧。"] = "If you don't mind, I'll go with you.",
    ["不介意的话，这块给你尝尝吧，我本来打算带回家的！"] = "If you don't mind, have a taste of this piece; I was originally planning to take it home!",
    ["不以学术之名，行屠戮之实。"] = "Do not commit slaughter in the name of academia.",
    ["不以血缘相连，却以血为契。从此命脉相系，生死与共。队伍或团队中，3~8人处于同一家族，获得1次额外复活次数，9人及以上处于同一家族，获得2次额外复活次数。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "Not connected by blood, but bound by blood. From now on, your lifelines are linked, sharing life and death. When 3-8 people in a party or team are in the same Family, gain 1 extra Resurrection count; when 9 or more are in the same Family, gain 2 extra Resurrection counts. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.",
    ["不以血缘相连，却以誓言共筑。在这个非凡与疯狂并存的世界里，你选择了最珍贵的事——相信彼此。"] = "Not connected by blood, but built together by oaths. In this world where the extraordinary and madness coexist, you have chosen the most precious thing—trusting each other.",
    ["不会"] = "Won't",
    ["不会再次眩晕"] = "Will not be stunned again",
    ["不会写诗的诗人"] = "The Poet Who Cannot Write Poetry",
    ["不会卖光了吧？"] = "They haven't sold out, have they?",
    ["不会啊，我绕了几十年了，戴维曾说它像一颗心脏。"] = "That can't be. I've been going around it for decades. David once said it looked like a heart.",
    ["不会是落在咖啡厅里了吧。"] = "Could it have been left at the Cafe?",
    ["不会最后票都被黄牛买走了吧？"] = "Are all the tickets going to be bought by scalpers in the end?",
    ["不会有人发现的，哈哈！！！"] = "No one will notice, haha!!!",
    ["不会熄灭！"] = "It will not be extinguished!",
    ["不会的，带走3-888之前，我会让小黛西再次进入循环。"] = "That won't happen. Before I take away 3-888, I will let little Daisy enter the cycle again.",
    ["不会真的只有我一个人在努力吧……"] = "Am I really the only one putting in any effort...?",
