    ["不会禁用的左键"] = "Left Click (Cannot be Disabled)",
    ["不会被卖出的，永远陪伴着“工匠”的。"] = "The one that will not be sold, the one that will forever accompany the \"Artisan\".",
    ["不会被变木偶"] = "Will not be turned into a puppet",
    ["不会被木偶选为目标"] = "Will not be targeted by puppets",
    ["不会觉得吓人吗？"] = "Don't you find it scary?",
    ["不会触发 CD 相关 event"] = "Will not trigger CD-related events.",
    ["不会，那不是他对待厨艺的态度……我必须对我写的文章负责。我们点一道芥末章鱼，这道菜我印象深刻，如果有问题，我能立刻尝出来。"] = "No, that's not his attitude towards cooking... I must be responsible for the article I wrote. Let's order a mustard octopus, I have a deep impression of this dish, if there's a problem, I can taste it immediately.",
    ["不传配方ID默认当前序列的下一个序列的配方与材料"] = "If recipe ID is not passed, it defaults to the next sequence's recipe and materials for the current sequence",
    ["不伤文和"] = "Unscathed Wenhe",
    ["不使用"] = "Do not use",
    ["不信的话，你可以进来看看……"] = "If you don't believe me, you can come in and see...",
    ["不信邪"] = "Don't believe in evil",
    ["不信？告诉你，我可是<P_Yellow>威廉·海默</>——这门课的老师，连卷子都是我出的！"] = "Don't believe me? Let me tell you, I am <P_Yellow> William Hamer </>—the teacher of this course, even the exam papers were written by me!",
    ["不停寻找妈妈的小女孩，直到她找到了伟大的……"] = "A little girl who kept looking for her mother until she found the great...",
    ["不像我，没人买我的羊毛呢子，我只能喝酒……"] = "Unlike me, no one buys my wool cloth, so I can only drink...",
    ["不像有的富家子弟，他只会爬到树上求我帮忙，像我很闲似的。"] = "Unlike some rich kid, he only knows how to climb a tree and ask me for help, as if I have nothing better to do.",
    ["不像钢琴的钢琴木雕。"] = "A wooden carving of a piano that doesn't look like a piano.",
    ["不允许引用除/Game和/Engine以外的资源 %s"] = "Referencing resources other than /Game and /Engine is not allowed %s",
