    ["不受控制地走向邦尼"] = "Uncontrollably walking towards Bonnie",
    ["不受治疗方属性加成或减少，也不受被治疗方属性加成或减少的生命回复。"] = "Health recovery not affected by the healer's or the target's attribute bonuses or reductions.",
    ["不受治疗方属性加成或减少，也不受被治疗方属性加成或减少的生命回复。（此治疗依据治疗方属性存在最大值上限。）"] = "Health recovery not affected by the healer's or the target's attribute bonuses or reductions. (This healing has a maximum cap based on the healer's attributes.)",
    ["不受灵界所困，可以进入星空遨游星界，前往不同的星球，在宇宙间自由穿行，探索未知的星河与世界。"] = "Not trapped by the Spirit World, you can enter the starry sky to roam the Astral World, travel to different planets, move freely through the universe, and explore unknown galaxies and worlds.",
    ["不受进攻属性加成，也不受防御属性减免的伤害。（此伤害依据进攻方进攻属性存在最大值上限。）"] = "Damage that is not affected by offensive attribute bonuses or defensive attribute reductions. (This damage has a maximum cap based on the attacker's offensive attributes.)",
