    ["不可复制"] = "Not Copyable",
    ["不可对会员进行撤职"] = "Cannot revoke a member's position.",
    ["不可对自己发起私聊"] = "You cannot initiate a private chat with yourself.",
    ["不可思议！你居然让阿比输掉了比赛，我可从没有看到他在擂台晕过去！"] = "Incredible! You actually made Abi lose the match. I've never seen him pass out in the ring before!",
    ["不可惊扰！"] = "Do not disturb!",
    ["不可打听，不可外传，不可描述，不可窥探"] = "Do not inquire, do not spread, do not describe, do not pry",
    ["不可打断"] = "Cannot Interrupt",
    ["不可添加自己为好友"] = "You cannot add yourself as a friend.",
    ["不可犹豫，不可退缩，心怀信念。所以我也称呼它为“信仰之跃”。"] = "Do not hesitate, do not shrink back, keep faith in your heart. That's why I also call it the \"Leap of Faith.\"",
    ["不可犹豫，不可退缩，心怀信念。所以我也称呼它为“红月之跃”。"] = "Do not hesitate, do not retreat, keep faith in your heart. That's why I also call it \"Leap of the Red Moon.\"",
    ["不可直视"] = "Cannot Be Looked At Directly",
    ["不可直视神"] = "Cannot Be Looked At Directly God",
    ["不可直视神！"] = "Cannot be looked at directly, God!",
    ["不可知力量"] = "Unknown power",
    ["不可能……这东西怎么回来了？！"] = "Impossible... how did this thing get back here?!",
    ["不可能跑远……"] = "He couldn't have run far...",
    ["不可能！她明明经常来！还一直看着我！"] = "Impossible! She clearly comes often! And she keeps looking at me!",
    ["不可能！廷根怎么会有比我更懂时尚的人！"] = "Impossible! How could there be anyone in Tingen who understands fashion better than me!",
    ["不可能！没计划就找不到戒指，找不到戒指我的人生就完了——"] = "Impossible! Without a plan, I can't find the ring, and if I can't find the ring, my life is over—",
    ["不可能，我分明是严格按照戏剧规律来创作的，优雅、高贵而理性……这怎么会有问题？"] = "Impossible, I clearly created it in strict accordance with the laws of drama, elegant, noble, and rational... How could there be a problem?",
    ["不可能，我昨天根本没吃饭！"] = "Impossible, I didn't eat yesterday at all!",
    ["不可能，菲利普是个胆小鬼，哪敢开枪。"] = "Impossible, Philip is a coward, how would he dare to pull the trigger.",
    ["不可自满，不可盲信自身的占卜解读。"] = "Do not be complacent, and do not blindly trust your own divination interpretations.",
    ["不可获取"] = "Obtainable",
    ["不可行走区域的酸液特效"] = "Acid special effect in non-walkable area",
    ["不可行走区域的酸液特效2"] = "Acid effect 2 for non-walkable areas",
    ["不可行走区域的酸液特效3"] = "Acid effect in non-walkable area 3",
    ["不可被敌方选中"] = "Cannot Be Targeted by Enemies",
    ["不可诱惑当前非凡者哦"] = "You cannot charm this Beyonder.",
    ["不可购买"] = "Not purchasable",
    ["不可赠送"] = "Cannot be gifted",
    ["不可达区域氛围"] = "Inaccessible Area Atmosphere",
    ["不可违逆正义，我即秩序的化身。"] = "Justice cannot be defied; I am the embodiment of order.",
    ["不可选中"] = "Untargetable",
    ["不可选中+无敌"] = "Untargetable + Invincibility",
    ["不可选中+隐身"] = "Unselectable + Invisibility",
    ["不可选择自己为目标哦"] = "You cannot select yourself as a target.",
    ["不可通过Action的方式手动配置，该Action是程序处理技能表里的后摇配置时，自动生成所依托的模板Action（类似DoFightAction）"] = "Cannot be manually configured via Action; this Action is a template Action (similar to DoFightAction) automatically generated when the program processes the post-swing configuration in the skill table.",
    ["不可重叠标记Buff"] = "Non-stacking mark buff",
    ["不可附身"] = "Cannot be possessed",
    ["不可隐藏所有类型技能"] = "Cannot hide all types of skills.",
    ["不可饶恕。"] = "Unforgivable.",
    ["不吃就还给我。"] = "Give it back if you're not going to eat it.",
    ["不合格！拒绝入学。"] = "Unqualified! Admission denied.",
    ["不合理"] = "Unreasonable",
    ["不同瓶罐分类摆放，烹饪时只需一伸手就能找到想要的味道。"] = "Different bottles and jars are classified and placed, so you can find the flavor you want with just a reach while cooking.",
    ["不同的人脉之间也有着特殊的<Highlight>关系</>，集齐对应人脉即可解锁/提升相应的关系，精进自己对历史的研究。\n根据历史研究程度，可获得一定的属性加成。\n关系可分为<Highlight>协战关系</>和<Highlight>历史关系</>两类，两者都可以提升历史研究。\n对于协战关系，解锁后还能为部分人脉提供一定的能力增强，但是对于一个人脉只能生效一种协战关系的提升效果。"] = "There are also special <Highlight>Relationships</> between different Connections. Collecting the corresponding Connections allows you to unlock/upgrade the corresponding relationships and refine your research on history. \nDepending on the degree of historical research, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships can be divided into two categories: <Highlight>Co-combat Relationships</> and <Highlight>Historical Relationships</>, both of which can improve historical research. \nFor Co-combat Relationships, once unlocked, they can also provide certain ability enhancements for some Connections, but only one Co-combat Relationship enhancement effect can be active for a single Connection.",
    ["不同的人脉之间也有着特殊的<Highlight>关系</>，集齐对应人脉即可解锁/提升相应的关系，精进自己对历史的研究。\n根据历史研究程度，可获得一定的属性加成。\n关系可分为<Highlight>协战关系</>和<Highlight>历史关系</>两类，两者都可以提升历史研究。\n对于协战关系，解锁后还能为部分人脉提供一定的能力增强，但是对于一个人脉只能生效一种协战关系的提升效果。\n\n在战略服中，当协战关系达到【本相】层次，能够连接命运支流的力量。使用<Highlight>支流结晶</>对其进行<Highlight>唤启</>，可以提升支流刻度，进而获取命运余响，提升余响音阶，以在战略服获得额外属性提升。（该属性仅在战略服生效）"] = "There are also special <Highlight>relationships</> between different contacts. Collecting corresponding contacts will unlock/upgrade the corresponding relationship, refining your research on history. \nDepending on the level of historical research, you can obtain certain attribute bonuses. \nRelationships can be divided into two categories: <Highlight>Co-combat Relationship</> and <Highlight>Historical Relationship</>, both of which can improve historical research. \nFor Co-combat Relationships, unlocking them can also provide certain ability enhancements for some contacts, but only one Co-combat Relationship enhancement effect can be active for a single contact. \n\nIn the Strategy Server, when a Co-combat Relationship reaches the [True Form] level, it can connect to the power of the tributary of fate. Use <Highlight>Tributary Crystals</> to <Highlight>Awaken</> it to increase the tributary scale, thereby obtaining Echoes of Fate and increasing the Echo Scale to gain additional attribute boosts in the Strategy Server. (This attribute only takes effect in the Strategy Server.)",
    ["不同的关系会有不同的效果加成，可点击查看具体信息。"] = "Different relationships provide different effect bonuses; click to view specific details.",
    ["不同的商人会有不同的报价，选择报价更高的商人有更高的收益。"] = "Different merchants offer different quotes; choosing a merchant with a higher quote yields higher profits.",
    ["不同的封印物有着不同的作用。例如隐秘一块区域，或者让目标陷入迷雾迷宫的幻觉。"] = "Different Sealed Artifacts have different effects. For example, concealing an area, or making the target fall into the hallucination of a foggy maze.",
    ["不同的是它们鲜少会迎来你这样的客人——旁边克制不住地用余光瞥着你的老人才是它们的常客。"] = "The difference is that they rarely see a customer like you—the old woman nearby who can't help but glance at you is their regular customer.",
    ["不同的珍宝被放置在展示柜中向外炫耀，告知来客主人的品味。"] = "Various treasures are placed in display cabinets to show off, informing visitors of the owner's taste.",
    ["不同的隐藏空间中1"] = "In different hidden spaces 1",
    ["不同的隐藏空间中2"] = "In different hidden spaces 2",
    ["不同途径组成的队伍战斗时策略应当有所区别，例如“门”途径的学徒更适合突进切入。"] = "Strategies should differ when teams composed of different pathways fight; for example, Apprentices of the 'Door' pathway are more suitable for rushing in.",
    ["不同阶段的人们，却能在同一张照片里相遇，真是有趣。"] = "People from different stages can meet in the same photo; it's truly interesting.",
    ["不同颜色有不同的含义 代表着情绪或者身体的状态"] = "Different colors have different meanings, representing emotions or the state of the body.",
    ["不同颜色有不同的含义代表着情绪或者身体的状态"] = "Different colors have different meanings, representing emotions or physical states",
    ["不吝啬对他人的赞美,尤其是对于同伴。"] = "Do not be stingy with praise for others, especially for companions.",
    ["不吝惜赞美他人，尤其要鼓励身边的同伴。"] = "Do not be stingy with praise for others, especially encourage your companions.",
    ["不听不信守金镑，涉及钱财多思量！！！"] = "Don't listen, don't believe, keep your gold pounds, think twice when it involves money!!!",
    ["不听话就会变成木头人哦，嘿嘿，不能动了吧。"] = "If you don't listen, you'll become a wooden doll, hehe, can't move now, can you?",
    ["不听话的孩子……要挨打的。"] = "Disobedient children... deserve a beating.",
    ["不告诉你"] = "I won't tell you.",
    ["不告诉你喵，你是来抓主人的喵。"] = "Not telling you, meow. You are here to catch the master, meow.",
    ["不咋样，淡入淡出的功能不建议频繁使用，打断性会比较强。"] = "Not great. It is not recommended to use the fade-in/fade-out function frequently, as it can be quite disruptive.",
    ["不喜欢尤朵拉的笛声吗？我努力练习了很久的……"] = "Do you not like Yodora's flute playing? I practiced very hard for a long time...",
    ["不喜欢苹果的安德鲁不是好猎犬！"] = "An Andrew who doesn't like apples is not a good Hound!",
    ["不喜欢，换一个。"] = "Don't like it, change it.",
    ["不回答"] = "Do not answer",
    ["不在乎"] = "Don't care",
    ["不在乎喵，我只关心什么时候开饭喵。"] = "I don't care, meow. I only care about when dinner is served, meow.",
    ["不在仓库门口啊……"] = "Not at the warehouse entrance...",
