    ["不在原服务器或与队长不在同一个服，无法进入"] = "Not on the original server or not on the same server as the Captain; cannot enter.",
    ["不在召唤区域内，请前往指定区域后再行召唤。"] = "Not in the summon area, please head to the designated area before summoning.",
