    ["不太对？哪里不对？"] = "Not quite right? What's wrong?",
    ["不太清楚"] = "Not very clear",
    ["不好"] = "No",
    ["不好 他要跑了！"] = "No, he's going to run!",
    ["不好 火柴快熄灭了"] = "Oh no, the match is about to go out",
    ["不好……我计划求婚，海蒂冷傲拒绝。我计划找戒指，戒指在口袋。我扔了你们的结婚戒指， 你们骂都不骂我。"] = "Not alright... I planned to propose, and Heidi coldly rejected me. I planned to find the ring, and the ring was in my pocket. I threw away your wedding ring, and you didn't even scold me.",
    ["不好……罗珊在镜中廷根待的时间也到了临界点，她的意识开始混乱了。"] = "Not good... Rozanne's time in Tingen in the Mirror has also reached a critical point, her consciousness has begun to become chaotic.",
    ["不好。"] = "No.",
    ["不好了陛下，因为你的变脸，导致臣民认不出你，接下来解决赶来的士兵，先逃走吧！"] = "Oh no, Your Majesty! Because of your face change, your subjects don't recognize you. Deal with the approaching soldiers and escape first!",
    ["不好吃，想吃火锅……"] = "Not tasty, I want to eat hot pot...",
    ["不好意思{{先生|女士}}，是我带你进入这里，让你吃到了不干净的食物。"] = "I'm sorry, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, it was me who brought you here and caused you to eat unclean food.",
    ["不好意思哦！俱乐部真的没有这个人。"] = "I'm sorry! There really is no such person at this club.",
    ["不好意思女士，本店不接待宠物狗。"] = "Sorry, Madam, this shop does not accept pet dogs.",
    ["不好意思，不……不能道歉，能不能骂我两句？"] = "Sorry, no... I can't apologize, can you scold me twice?",
    ["不好意思，容我再考虑考虑。"] = "Sorry, let me think about it some more.",
    ["不好意思，我不是要冒犯您的意思……"] = "Excuse me, I don't mean to offend you...",
    ["不好意思，我不知道你们的关系。你怎么样？"] = "Sorry, I didn't know about your relationship. Are you alright?",
    ["不好意思，我对这里的情况也不太了解。"] = "Sorry, I'm not very familiar with this area either.",
    ["不好意思，我有约了。"] = "Sorry, I have an appointment.",
    ["不好意思，我没有这个想法。"] = "Sorry, I don't have that in mind.",
    ["不好意思，我要工作了，改天再聊！"] = "Sorry, I have to work, let's talk another day!",
    ["不好意思，我还有事情，恐怕得先走了。"] = "Sorry, I have things to do, I'm afraid I have to go first.",
    ["不好意思，现在不太方便(%s 秒)"] = "Sorry, not convenient right now (%s seconds)",
    ["不好玩"] = "Not fun",
    ["不好的事物？具体要放……"] = "Something bad? Specifically, what should I put...",
    ["不好说。她有时候一周来两回，有时候半个月不见人。"] = "Hard to say. Sometimes she comes twice a week, sometimes she's gone for half a month.",
    ["不好，2-049逃脱了，小心它的非凡诅咒！"] = "Oh no, 2-049 has escaped, watch out for its Extraordinary curse!",
    ["不好，他好像要失控了，快控制住他！"] = "Oh no, he looks like he's about to lose control. Quickly, restrain him!",
    ["不好，她要逃走！"] = "Oh no, she's trying to escape!",
    ["不好，我得赶快买火车票，啊，还有行李，天哪我不知道那边的天气！"] = "Oh no, I have to hurry and buy a train ticket. Ah, and my luggage! Goodness, I don't even know what the weather is like over there!",
    ["不好，是被那个女孩困在了这个城堡吗，得设法离开！"] = "Oh no, am I trapped in this castle by that girl? I must find a way to leave!",
    ["不好，有东西想从门外进来……"] = "Oh no, something is trying to come in from outside the door...",
    ["不好，有人被滞涩了，快推醒他！"] = "Oh no, someone is stagnated, hurry and wake them up!",
    ["不好，第一版坐凳子都是坏的"] = "Not good, the first version of the stools are all broken",
    ["不好，被发现了！"] = "Oh no, I've been discovered!",
    ["不好，被拦住了。"] = "Oh no, we've been blocked.",
    ["不好，要迟到了……"] = "Oh no, I'm going to be late...",
    ["不好，路被堵死了！大家合力击破它！"] = "Oh no, the road is blocked! Everyone, work together to break through it!",
    ["不好，这水龙卷也忒强了！快找找哪里还有烂番茄，加到锅里破坏汤底！"] = "Oh no, this water tornado is too strong! Quickly find where there are more rotten tomatoes and add them to the pot to ruin the soup base!",
    ["不好，那本日记是她不愿面对这一切的心，它要靠近碎片，把记忆藏起来。"] = "Oh no, that diary is her heart that doesn't want to face all this. It wants to get close to the fragment and hide the memory.",
    ["不如"] = "Not as good as",
    ["不如先问问，是计划有用，还是找到了有用？"] = "Why not ask first: is it the plan that's useful, or is it finding it that's useful?",
    ["不如去找阿曼达女士要一杯喝的吧，嗯，也该好好休息一下。"] = "Why not go ask Ms. Amanda for a drink? Hmm, it's time for a good rest, too.",
    ["不如去教堂祈祷一下吧。"] = "Why not go to the church and pray?",
    ["不如我们分头行动，总能找到通路！"] = "Why don't we split up? We're bound to find a path!",
    ["不如来杯度数适中的南威尔啤酒，这可是全鲁恩自产的最好的啤酒。"] = "How about a glass of moderately alcoholic Southwell beer? This is the best beer produced in all of Loen.",
    ["不如来看看我手头的这几套房子，不收押金，合同正规，包您满意！"] = "Why not take a look at the houses I have on hand? No deposit, formal contract, I guarantee you'll be satisfied!",
    ["不如用卜杖占卜试一试吧。"] = "Might as well try divination with a dowsing rod.",
    ["不如看看报纸对此的评论。"] = "Why not look at the newspaper's commentary on this.",
    ["不如看看这匹呢，浅杏色的混纺，比薄缎便宜不少，做礼服也很好看。"] = "Why not take a look at this one? It is a light apricot blend, much cheaper than the thin satin, and it looks very beautiful for a gown as well.",
    ["不如让我们……亲身体验一下吧？"] = "Why don't we... experience it personally?",
    ["不妙啊似乎有奇怪的东西要出来了，门口的石板好像在闪光！"] = "This is bad, it seems like something strange is about to come out, the stone slab at the door seems to be flashing!",
    ["不妙，看来您胳膊摔伤了……我想，必须尽快送您去医院。"] = "This is bad. It looks like you've injured your arm... I think we must get you to a hospital as soon as possible.",
    ["不妙，里面有什么正在散发邪异的气息！"] = "Not good, there is something inside emitting an evil aura!",
    ["不存mesh，流程图需要额外check"] = "No mesh stored, flowchart requires additional check",
    ["不存在"] = "Does not exist",
    ["不存在的 凭空想象出来的 地球上的东西算不算？"] = "Something that doesn't exist, imagined out of thin air... Does something from Earth count?",
    ["不存在的徽章ID: %s"] = "Non-existent badge ID: %s",
    ["不存在，便不会消亡。"] = "If it does not exist, it will not perish.",
    ["不安"] = "Uneasy",
    ["不安……"] = "Unease...",
    ["不完全是，一般来说，“不眠者”序列的同事成为“午夜诗人”后，会为了消化魔药去写诗。"] = "Not entirely. Generally speaking, colleagues of the 'Seer' pathway will write poetry to digest their potion after becoming 'Midnight Poets'.",
    ["不完整"] = "Incomplete",
    ["不完整的途径"] = "Incomplete Pathway",
    ["不定时"] = "Irregular",
    ["不客气。你刚才说的后台，不会是我吧？"] = "You're welcome. The \"backing\" you mentioned just now, it wouldn't be me, would it?",
    ["不客气！我们只想请您帮个小忙，可以吗？"] = "You're welcome! We just wanted to ask you for a small favor, is that okay?",
    ["不客气，你还好吗？"] = "You're welcome, are you okay?",
    ["不客气，国王。"] = "You're welcome, King.",
    ["不客气，太太。入学考试主要会涉及到一些礼仪、文学以及宗教方面知识的考察。"] = "You are welcome, Madam. The entrance examination will mainly involve assessments of etiquette, literature, and religious knowledge.",
    ["不客气，希望你们的遗憾已经得到弥补。"] = "You're welcome. I hope your regrets have been mended.",
    ["不客气，祝你心情愉快，一切顺利。"] = "You're welcome. I hope you're in a good mood and everything goes smoothly.",
    ["不客气，西奥多，我们是朋友！"] = "You're welcome, Theodore, we are friends!",
    ["不客气，这是我的职责所在。"] = "You're welcome, this is my duty.",
    ["不对。刚才在墓碑前，她一直在说凯瑟琳的死，说自己的愧疚。"] = "That's not right. Just now in front of the tombstone, she kept talking about Catherine's death and her own guilt.",
    ["不对。还是不对。"] = "Wrong. Still wrong.",
    ["不对不对……"] = "Wrong, wrong...",
    ["不对不对。海莉夫人不是这样说的。"] = "No, no. That's not what Madam Haley said.",
    ["不对不对，骑士劈开的是恶龙吐出的乌云，阳光照进来，才赶走了恶龙！"] = "No, no, the knight split the dark clouds spewed by the wicked dragon, and the sunlight shone in, driving the wicked dragon away!",
    ["不对劲"] = "Something is wrong",
    ["不对吗？"] = "Is it not?",
    ["不对啊。格尔曼什么时候在慈善医院做过义工了？那是去执行秘密任务，写得什么乱七八糟的……"] = "That's not right. When did Gehrman ever volunteer at the Charity Hospital? He was there on a secret mission. What kind of nonsense is this written here...",
    ["不对啊。格尔曼什么时候在慈善医院做过义工了？那是去执行秘密任务，写的什么乱七八糟的……"] = "That's not right. When did Gehrman ever volunteer at a charity hospital? That was for a secret mission, what kind of nonsense is written here...",
    ["不对啊！我得到的启示是太阳升起时对着城堡鞠躬十次，丢失的物品就会自动回来。"] = "That's not right! The revelation I received was to bow to the castle ten times when the sun rises, and the lost items will automatically return.",
    ["不对！我听的版本是戴着礼帽的灰兔。"] = "Wrong! The version I heard was a gray rabbit wearing a top hat.",
    ["不对！那是褐星，旁边的那颗才是蓝星。我敢说莱利叔叔和你说话时喝太多朗齐酒了。"] = "Wrong! That's the Brown Star, the one next to it is the Blue Star. I bet Uncle Riley drank too much Ronchi wine when he talked to you.",
    ["不对，不对……这才是我的领结！"] = "No, no... this is my bowtie!",
    ["不对，不对不对，不应该是这样！这并不公平！"] = "No, no, no, it shouldn't be like this! This isn't fair!",
    ["不对，不对，你的口音不像外乡人啊！你转过来，转过来……"] = "No, no, your accent doesn't sound like an outsider! Turn around, turn around...",
    ["不对，不是发掘，是扮演！"] = "No, it's not exploring, it's acting!",
    ["不对，他已经不能被称为人类了！"] = "No, he can no longer be called a human!",
    ["不对，你查的资料不够权威……"] = "No, the information you checked isn't authoritative enough...",
    ["不对，再想想……"] = "No, let me think again...",
    ["不对，发生了什么？！"] = "No, what happened?!",
    ["不对，我刚才在黑荆棘炼金室冥想……"] = "No, I was just meditating in the Blackthorn alchemy room...",
    ["不对，是你先提的……对，咳咳，你说这话的目的是什么？动机是什么？谁指使你的？你是不是被某些危险存在蛊惑了？跟我走一趟！"] = "No, you're the one who brought it up first... Right, ahem, what is your purpose in saying this? What is your motive? Who instigated you? Have you been bewitched by some dangerous existence? Come with me!",
    ["不对，根据谢尔敏先生的配方，可乐果只能带来提神效果。"] = "That's not right; according to Mr. Shermin's recipe, cola nuts only provide a refreshing effect.",
    ["不对，等一等。"] = "Wait, hold on.",
    ["不对，这瓶太甜了，妈妈不喜欢甜的，她说太腻了。"] = "No, this bottle is too sweet. Mom doesn't like sweet scents, she says they are too cloying.",
    ["不小心吸入了点炼药的烟雾，但这让你感觉活力焕发…"] = "You accidentally inhaled some brewing fumes, but it makes you feel revitalized...",
    ["不小心碰到了一下天平…空间内的秩序似乎不受控制了！"] = "Accidentally touched the scale... the order within the space seems to be out of control!",
    ["不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "Disdaining explanation and having no intention of obeying, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is right now.",
    ["不属于这个时代的#Space3#"] = "#Space3# that does not belong to this era",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者——"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era—",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者……"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era...",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者。"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era.",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者啊"] = "Fool that doesn't belong to this era",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者啊……"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era...",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄昏之王。"] = "The Fool who does not belong to this era, the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck.",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄黑之王……"] = "The Fool who does not belong to this era; the mysterious ruler above the gray fog; the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck...",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄黑之王。"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era, the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck.",
    ["不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄黑之王。赞美愚者！"] = "The Fool that doesn't belong to this era; the mysterious ruler above the gray fog; the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck. Praise the Fool!",
    ["不工作……哈哈！你见过我同事渥克吗？你没见过！"] = "Not work... Haha! Have you seen my colleague Walk? You haven't!",
    ["不带你们好好欣赏一下，实在是显得我十分小气。"] = "It would be quite stingy of me not to let you all enjoy it properly.",
    ["不幸有三"] = "Misfortune Comes in Threes",
    ["不幸者"] = "The Unfortunate",
    ["不应该"] = "Should not be",
    ["不应该……"] = "Should not be...",
    ["不建议做存档步骤（流程图没有写mesh检测）"] = "Not recommended as a save step (flowchart does not have mesh detection)",
    ["不建议存档，玩家位置不好判断"] = "Saving not recommended, player position is difficult to determine",
    ["不开门"] = "Don't open the door",
    ["不当言论"] = "Inappropriate Speech",
    ["不得不说，你是位聪明的小姐，所以现在也请聪明地跟我们走吧。"] = "I must say, you are a clever young lady, so please be clever and come with us now.",
    ["不得不说，你父亲对你的培养是有效果的。"] = "I must say, your father's upbringing has been effective.",
    ["不得不说，我开始期待这个故事了。"] = "I have to say, I'm starting to look forward to this story.",
    ["不得不说，派利得，你这次的工作做的很完美。但这显然是因为模特过于出色。"] = "I must say, Palide, your work this time is perfect. But this is clearly because the model is too outstanding.",
    ["不得不说，遇见您这样一位活泼风趣的太太，和这样一间面包房，真是让人高兴。"] = "I must say, meeting a lively and humorous lady like you, and such a bakery, is truly a joy.",
    ["不得无礼！"] = "Do not be rude!",
    ["不必再流浪、不必再挨饿、不必再被买卖……"] = "No more wandering, no more starving, no more being bought and sold...",
    ["不必在意，我什么也不会做的。只是，想要看看。"] = "Don't mind me, I won't do anything. I just want to watch.",
    ["不必在意，我只是一名观众。"] = "Don't mind me, I'm just a Spectator.",
    ["不必多问。"] = "No need to ask more.",
    ["不必客气，探索神秘的道路上，分享知识是应有的美德。"] = "You're welcome. Sharing knowledge is a virtue that should be upheld on the path of exploring the mysterious.",
    ["不必忧虑，用光明驱散黑暗，这里就能恢复往日的宁静了。"] = "Do not worry, use light to dispel the darkness, and the tranquility of the past can be restored here.",
    ["不必悲伤，我的孩子们。我死于五年前，我的故事早就结束了。"] = "Do not be sad, my children. I died five years ago; my story ended long ago.",
    ["不必担心时间的问题，我们只是在戏里……"] = "Don't worry about the time; we are just in a play...",
    ["不必担心，《救赎圣典》中的祂只是重现的历史投影，不具备原本的力量，前进吧。"] = "Do not worry, the version of Him in the \"Book of Salvation\" is merely a projected history and does not possess His original power. Move forward.",
    ["不必担心，下面有堆草垛……想试试吗？跃下的感觉棒极了！"] = "No need to worry, there's a pile of hay below... want to try it? The feeling of leaping down is fantastic!",
    ["不必担心，我这里有两张多出来的特等票。"] = "Don't worry, I have two extra premium tickets here.",
    ["不必担忧，女神会眷顾祂的每一位信徒。"] = "Do not worry, the Goddess will look after every one of Her believers.",
    ["不必拘谨。会长这个头衔并不代表你我之间有地位的高下，我接受它，只是因为我接受了随它而来的责任和义务。"] = "No need to be reserved. The title of President doesn't mean there is a difference in status between you and me; I accepted it only because I accepted the responsibilities and obligations that come with it.",
    ["不必这么紧张，你看了那份报告吗？"] = "No need to be so nervous. Have you read that report?",
    ["不必道歉，这位女士。"] = "No need to apologize, Madam.",
    ["不必露出忧伤的表情，比起其他，这并不算坏。"] = "No need to show a sad expression; compared to other things, this is not bad.",
    ["不必！…我是说…谢谢你，好心的小姐/先生。"] = "No need!... I mean... thank you, kind lady/sir.",
    ["不忠的男人……"] = "An unfaithful man...",
    ["不怕菇毒"] = "Not Afraid of Mushroom Poison",
    ["不思考也没关系。"] = "It's okay not to think.",
    ["不急的票我不卖，不急的票我卖什么？"] = "I don't sell tickets for non-urgent matters; if it's not urgent, what am I selling?",
    ["不急，我为你简化了入职流程，先签合同吧。"] = "No rush. I've simplified the onboarding process for you; let's sign the contract first.",
    ["不惧阴影笼罩，踏足之地必有光辉闪耀。"] = "Do not fear the encroaching shadows; where you step, light shall shine.",
    ["不想  →"] = "Don't want to →",
    ["不想做这份工作了……"] = "Don't want to do this job anymore...",
    ["不想卖的票我不卖，我不想卖我怎么卖？"] = "I don't sell tickets I don't want to sell; if I don't want to sell, how can I sell?",
    ["不想去见专家的话"] = "If you don't want to see the expert...",
    ["不想和陌生人说话"] = "Don't want to talk to strangers",
    ["不想玩"] = "Don't want to play",
    ["不想见专家的话……"] = "If you don't want to see the experts...",
    ["不想让人看，还贴在这么显眼的地方？"] = "If you don't want people to see, why stick them in such a conspicuous place?",
    ["不感兴趣"] = "Not interested",
    ["不愧是“愚者”先生，祂在真正地关心着底层人民的生活。赞美愚者！有机会，我一定要去基金会实地拜访一下。"] = "As expected of Mr. Fool, He is truly caring about the lives of the people at the bottom. Praise the Fool! If I have the chance, I must visit the foundation in person.",
    ["不愧是……龙……"] = "As expected of... a dragon...",
    ["不愧是上个纪元就活跃于大陆舞台的魔女教派……"] = "As expected of the Demoness Sect that has been active on the continent's stage since the previous epoch...",
    ["不愧是您，我们的风云人物，就算是挑剔的柯达先生看了也会哑口无言！"] = "As expected of you, our man of the hour; even the picky Mr. Kodak would be speechless after seeing this!",
    ["不愧是您，我们的风云人物，柯达先生这次也会对胶片爱不释手！"] = "As expected of you, our man of the hour, Mr. Kodak will also be unable to put the film down this time!",
    ["不愧是愚者先生，祂在真正地关心着底层人民的生活。赞美愚者！有机会，我一定要去基金会实地拜访一下。"] = "As expected of Mr. Fool, He truly cares about the lives of the common people. Praise the Fool! If I have the chance, I must visit the foundation in person.",
    ["不愧是机械学院的学生……"] = "As expected of a student from the Mechanical Academy...",
    ["不愧是水手途径"] = "As expected of the Sailor Pathway",
    ["不愧是水手途径啊"] = "As expected of the Sailor Pathway",
    ["不成真神，终为灰烬！"] = "If you don't become a True God, you will end up as ashes!",
    ["不打扰"] = "Won't disturb",
    ["不打扰了"] = "I won't disturb you",
    ["不打扰他们了"] = "I won't disturb them",
    ["不打扰她了"] = "Won't bother her anymore",
    ["不打扰，不打扰！有问题随时来找我！"] = "No bother, no bother! Come to me anytime if you have questions!",
    ["不抢"] = "Don't Rob",
    ["不排除这种可能。“教唆者”擅长诱发每个人心中的恶欲，制造冲突。"] = "That possibility cannot be ruled out. An \"Instigator\" is good at inducing the evil desires in everyone's heart and creating conflicts.",
    ["不排除这种可能。工厂区的怨念……廷根的灾难……"] = "That possibility cannot be ruled out. The resentment in the factory district... the disaster in Tingen...",
    ["不接受这个结局"] = "Do not accept this ending",
    ["不接受这样的重启"] = "Do not accept this kind of restart.",
    ["不提这些旧事了，{{先生|女士}}，别让这些影响您欣赏山脚下的景色。"] = "Let's not talk about these old matters, {{Mr.|Ms.}}. Don't let these affect your enjoyment of the scenery at the foot of the mountain.",
    ["不支持效果叠加，已有一个效果的话，后面的效果直接失败；效果移除的时候，最大资源值更新为RoleMechanism配表初始值"] = "Effect stacking is not supported; if an effect already exists, subsequent effects will fail directly; when the effect is removed, the maximum resource value is updated to the initial value in the RoleMechanism table",
    ["不敢了不敢了！ "] = "I won't dare, I won't dare!",
    ["不敢的话，就回去换个人来调查。"] = "If you don't dare, go back and send someone else to investigate.",
    ["不敢相信"] = "Can't believe it",
    ["不敢说全部，但几乎都是。毕竟每朵花都像孩子，得知道它们的脾气。"] = "I wouldn't say all, but almost all. After all, every flower is like a child, you have to know their temperaments.",
    ["不断,老实廷根郊外怪事不断,老实廷根郊外怪事不断,老实人卡莱布声称头顶长出一廷根郊外怪事不断,老实廷根郊外怪事不断,老实廷根郊外怪株红色斑点蘑菇佛尔思·沃尔系列大作《大冒险家》火热连载中,成为社交舞会必备话系列列。廷根郊外怪事不断,老实人卡莱布声称头顶长出一株红色斑点蘑菇佛尔思·沃尔系列系列大作《大冒险家》火热连载中，成为社交舞会必备话题。最多<HighLight>最多178</>"] = "Non-stop, honest Tingen Suburbs strange events non-stop, honest man Caleb claims a red-spotted mushroom grew on his head Tingen Suburbs strange events non-stop, honest Tingen Suburbs strange events non-stop, honest Fors Wall's masterpiece \"The Great Adventurer\" is currently being serialized, becoming a must-have topic for social balls. Tingen Suburbs strange events non-stop, honest man Caleb claims a red-spotted mushroom grew on his head Fors Wall's masterpiece \"The Great Adventurer\" is currently being serialized, becoming a must-have topic for social balls. Max <HighLight>Max 178</>",
    ["不断使用升级技能，把战斗力提升到极限！"] = "Keep using upgrade skills to push your combat power to the limit!",
    ["不断失踪的领地居民，生机异常蓬勃的花园……庄园内究竟隐藏着什么秘密？"] = "Residents of the territory keep disappearing, and the garden is thriving with abnormal vitality... What secrets are hidden within the manor?",
    ["不断提升自我，精通每一种你掌握的武器。"] = "Continuously improve yourself and master every weapon you wield.",
    ["不断重复和勾勒这件物品"] = "Repeatedly repeating and outlining this item",
    ["不旋转石柱"] = "Non-rotating Stone Pillar",
    ["不明"] = "Unknown",
    ["不明嗡鸣……失踪学生……灵性直觉告诉我，这似乎有所联系……"] = "Unexplained humming... missing students... my spiritual intuition tells me that these seem to be connected...",
    ["不明嗡鸣扰民数月惹投诉"] = "Unidentified Humming Causes Complaints for Months",
    ["不明堆积物采集"] = "Unknown pile collectable",
    ["不明声音"] = "Unknown voice",
    ["不明液体"] = "Unknown Liquid",
    ["不明点位，疑似废弃"] = "Unknown point, suspected abandoned",
    ["不明牌"] = "Hide Cards",
    ["不明物"] = "Unknown Object",
    ["不明白我的意思？那很好。抱歉，闲聊的话恕不奉陪。我还有事要忙。"] = "Don't understand what I mean? That's good. Sorry, I won't accompany you for idle chatter. I have things to do.",
    ["不明白，不明白。"] = "Don't understand, don't understand.",
    ["不是"] = "No",
    ["不是……<P_Heart>（糟糕，我忘记搬家的事了！）</>"] = "No... <P_Heart>(Oh no, I forgot about the move!)</>",
    ["不是……她终于搬到了金梧桐区，过上了梦想中的生活，我替她开心，哈哈哈哈！"] = "No... she finally moved to the Golden Phoenix District and started the life she dreamed of. I'm happy for her, hahahaha!",
    ["不是……这次我带着从特里尔买的戒指，终于回到了廷根……露西已经成了一位布料商人的妻子。"] = "No... this time I brought the ring I bought in Trier and finally returned to Tingen... Lucy has already become the wife of a cloth merchant.",
    ["不是……难不成都交给我？"] = "Wait... don't tell me it's all left to me?",
    ["不是。"] = "No.",
    ["不是。但你可以叫我伯爵阁下。"] = "No. But you may call me Count.",
    ["不是一个好父亲。我做出了太多错误的选择，伤害了太多我爱的人。但如果重来一次，我还是会选择保护你，哪怕你看不到，哪怕你恨我。\n        还有夏尔、博诺瓦……我的孩子们。愿你们能在这个我亲手改变过的世界里，找到属于自己的幸福。\n        我也许又要沉眠了。我不知道，哪一次道别，会成为真正的告别。但不要悲伤。我，罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，黄涛——即使死亡，也要死得轰轰烈烈！况且……谁说我真的死了呢？\n        只要还有人记得我的名字，只要我的故事还在流传，只要这个世界还在使用我留下的发明和律法……我就从未真正"] = "was he a good father. I made too many wrong choices and hurt too many people I loved. But if I could do it all over again, I would still choose to protect you, even if you can't see it, even if you hate me.\n        And Charles, Bernadette... my children. May you find your own happiness in this world I changed with my own hands.\n        I may have to sleep again. I don't know which farewell will become the true one. But do not be sad. I, Roselle Gustav, Huang Tao—even if I die, I will die in a blaze of glory! Besides... who says I am truly dead?\n        As long as there is still someone who remembers my name, as long as my story is still being told, as long as this world is still using the inventions and laws I left behind... I have never truly",
    ["不是二手吗？怎么还这么贵？"] = "Isn't it second-hand? Why is it still so expensive?",
    ["不是你的错，他们本来就有矛盾。"] = "It's not your fault; they already had conflicts.",
    ["不是你说想听实话吗？说了你又不高兴，真搞不懂……"] = "Didn't you say you wanted to hear the truth? You're unhappy when I say it, I really don't understand...",
    ["不是偷的，也不是抢的，是用我的第一桶金买的。"] = "They weren't stolen or robbed; I bought them with my first pot of gold.",
    ["不是卡住！咳，如你所见，我在进行一项…突破极限的实验。马戏团即将到来的新节目，压轴大戏 “空中飞人”！"] = "It's not stuck! *Cough*, as you can see, I am conducting an... experiment to push my limits. The circus's new upcoming program, the grand finale, 'Aerial Trapeze'!",
    ["不是合适目标，无法执行该操作"] = "Not a suitable target; this operation cannot be performed.",
    ["不是学生"] = "Not a student",
    ["不是小偷！"] = "It's not a thief!",
    ["不是当前城堡场景主人，需要回到自己城堡再操作"] = "You are not the owner of the current castle scene; you need to return to your own castle to perform operations.",
    ["不是很好玩呢，较为失败的一个游戏。"] = "It's not very fun. A rather failed game.",
    ["不是想了解伟大主人的尊名吗？快跟上。"] = "Don't you want to know the honorable name of the great master? Follow me.",
    ["不是愚人号吗"] = "Isn't it the Fool's Ship?",
    ["不是我……"] = "It's not me...",
    ["不是我。"] = "It wasn't me.",
    ["不是我们镇上的……但他懂我们的痛。他说他见过很多可怜的人，在一场很远很远的战争里。"] = "He is not from our town... but he understands our pain. He said he had seen many poor people in a very, very distant war.",
    ["不是我想唱，是魔药的要求。想消化“海洋歌者”的魔药，必须在海上歌唱，用歌声引发风暴。"] = "It's not that I wanted to sing; it was a requirement of the potion. To digest the 'Sea King' potion, one must sing at sea, using the voice to trigger storms.",
    ["不是我，是我们……"] = "Not me, it was us...",
    ["不是我，是我旁边这位。"] = "It's not me, it's the person next to me.",
    ["不是掌握，是消化。\n不是发掘，是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">扮演</>。\n魔药的名称不只是象征，还是意象，更是消化的钥匙。"] = "It is not mastery, it is digestion.\nIt is not excavation, it is <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">acting</>.\nThe name of the potion is not just a symbol, but an imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion.",
    ["不是改变占卜。是改变“解读”塔罗的方式。"] = "Not changing the divination itself. It's changing the way I \"interpret\" the Tarot.",
    ["不是教堂，我说的是北区的塔楼，我以后也一定要住在那上边，能够俯视整个廷根！"] = "Not the cathedral, I'm talking about the tower in the North District. I must live on top of it in the future so I can overlook all of Tingen!",
    ["不是昨天，不是明天，不是三十年后。"] = "Not yesterday, not tomorrow, not thirty years later.",
    ["不是每一扇门都可以被闯入。"] = "Not every door can be broken into.",
    ["不是每天。只是……每一便士都有它的用处。省下来的钱，可以买一本参考书，或者让哥哥少加一次班。"] = "Not every day. It's just... every penny has its use. The money saved can buy a reference book or let my brother work one less overtime shift.",
    ["不是淑女当然也可以的！"] = "If you're not a lady, that's fine too!",
    ["不是的。"] = "No, I'm not.",
    ["不是的！我说的是真的！你们都是听说，我是亲眼所见啊！"] = "No! I'm telling the truth! You all heard it from others, but I saw it with my own eyes!",
    ["不是的，没有这种不公平的命运。"] = "No, there is no such unfair fate.",
    ["不是的，这……是我未婚夫的遗物。"] = "No, this... is a memento of my fiancé.",
    ["不是要看小说吗？ "] = "Isn't it the novel you want to read?",
    ["不是说一次……只影响一个……人吗……"] = "Didn't they say it... only affects one... person at a time...",
    ["不是说拦住就行吗？唉 我们试试吧"] = "Didn't they say just to stop them? Sigh, let's try.",
    ["不是还有{{他|她}}吗？"] = "Isn't there still {{him|her}}?",
    ["不是这本书……那力量来源是什么？"] = "It's not this book... then what is the source of the power?",
    ["不是这瓶……她最喜欢柑橘调。"] = "It is not this bottle... She likes citrus notes the most.",
    ["不是陪伴的问题……我把剪羊毛换来的私房钱全藏在咸鱼里了！"] = "It's not a question of company... I hid all my private money from shearing sheep in the salted fish!",
    ["不是！<P_Heart>（小声）</>“那份”手稿……怎么样了？你看完了吗？"] = "No! <P_Heart>(Whispering)</> 'That' manuscript... how is it? Have you finished reading it?",
    ["不是！<P_Heart>（小声）</>那份“手稿”……你看完了吗？"] = "No! <P_Heart>(whispering)</> That 'manuscript'... have you finished reading it?",
    ["不是！时代英雄拯救廷根，危机之中尽显风采，畅销作家佛尔思全新力作——《时代守护者》！"] = "No! A hero of the era saves Tingen, showing true brilliance in the midst of crisis—the brand new masterpiece by best-selling author Fors: \"Guardian of the Era\"!",
    ["不是！是、是我有个朋友买过。"] = "No! It, it was a friend of mine who bought them.",
    ["不是，因为我有，有点结，结巴。"] = "No, because I have, a bit of a stam, stammer.",
    ["不是，就这？"] = "No, that's it?",
    ["不是，我只是……只是想在他得到永暗蜡烛的垂怜前跟他说几句话。"] = "No, I just... I just wanted to say a few words to him before he receives the mercy of the Candle of Eternal Darkness.",
    ["不是，是给报社投稿的文章。"] = "No, it's an article for the newspaper.",
    ["不是，这也叫面包？"] = "No, this is called bread?",
    ["不是，这就走"] = "No, I'm leaving now",
    ["不曾遗忘的守护"] = "Unforgotten Guard",
    ["不曾遗忘的守护·污染"] = "Unforgotten Guard - Corruption",
    ["不替换并离开"] = "Do not replace and leave",
    ["不朽之志"] = "Immortal Will",
    ["不朽之志·污染"] = "Will of Immortality - Corruption",
    ["不朽传奇"] = "Immortal Legend",
    ["不朽引擎"] = "Immortal Engine",
    ["不朽棋局"] = "Immortal Chess Game",
    ["不朽永燃"] = "Immortal Eternal Burn",
    ["不来一点格尔曼辣奶油蛋糕吗？"] = "Would you like some Gehrman spicy cream cake?",
    ["不枉我排了那么久的队！"] = "It was worth waiting in line for so long!",
    ["不止是想，人生在世，何妨一试！也就试了几次而已。"] = "Not just thought about it, in this life, why not give it a try! I only tried it a few times.",
    ["不止芬恩，而是<P_Yellow>在场所有的人</>。"] = "Not just Finn, but <P_Yellow> everyone present </>.",
    ["不止，他情人也跟来了，还带着半岁的孩子……他情人叫什么来着……凯瑟琳？"] = "Not only that, his mistress also followed, and she brought a half-year-old child... What was his mistress's name... Catherine?",
    ["不死之躯"] = "Body of Immortality",
    ["不死乌鸦"] = "Undead Crow",
    ["不死者"] = "Undying",
    ["不死者的庇佑"] = "Blessing of the Undead",
    ["不注意看的话，应该发现不了。"] = "If you don't look closely, you probably won't notice it.",
    ["不消耗活力则无法获得通关奖励，是否继续？"] = "You cannot receive clear rewards without consuming Vitality. Do you want to continue?",
    ["不清楚。我给你父亲的贴身男仆塞了钱，他才肯告诉我这个消息。"] = "Not sure. I bribed your father's personal valet, and he was the one who told me this news.",
    ["不清楚，反正不少了。难道是因为<P_Yellow>金狼</>的事？"] = "Not sure, but it's quite a lot. Could it be because of the <P_Yellow>Golden Wolf</> incident?",
    ["不满足入队条件"] = "Does not meet the requirements to join the party.",
    ["不满足增益条件，无法施放这个技能。"] = "Buff conditions not met; cannot cast this skill.",
    ["不满足开战条件，请调整后重试。"] = "Battle conditions not met; please adjust and try again.",
    ["不满足职业要求，使用失败。"] = "Class requirement not met; use failed.",
    ["不满足职业要求，无法装备。"] = "Class requirement not met; cannot equip.",
    ["不灭之力"] = "Undying Power",
    ["不灭之力如红云压城般袭来。"] = "The Undying Power descends like red clouds pressing down on the city.",
    ["不灭之印"] = "Indestructible Seal",
    ["不灭之握"] = "Grip of Immortality",
    ["不灭华焰"] = "Undying Flame",
    ["不灭华焰套装"] = "Undying Flame Set",
    ["不灭战火的宣言书"] = "Declaration of Undying War Fire",
    ["不灭的见证"] = "Undying Witness",
    ["不然上线教堂变游泳池"] = "Otherwise, the church will turn into a swimming pool once it goes online",
    ["不然你猜猜我这里为什么是半袋呢？"] = "Otherwise, why do you think I have half a bag here?",
    ["不然呢？是好是坏总得试试，我可不想进了坟墓还抱着膝盖喊妈妈。"] = "What else? Good or bad, I have to try. I don't want to be holding my knees and calling for my mother even when I'm in the grave.",
    ["不然它为什么叫猫呢？在瑞恩收养猫之前，他的煎肉摊总是被老鼠光顾。"] = "Why else would it be called Cat? Before Ryan adopted the cat, his fried meat stall was always visited by mice.",
    ["不然，一个亡魂的投影无法在现实驻留如此之久。"] = "Otherwise, a projection of a dead soul could not stay in reality for so long.",
    ["不玩了不玩了，今天酒钱到手，我得去趟恶龙酒吧了！"] = "Not playing anymore, not playing anymore, the money for drinks is in hand today, I have to go to the Evil Dragon Bar!",
    ["不理他，看看卖什么"] = "Ignore him, see what's for sale",
    ["不甘……我不甘心啊……"] = "Unreconciled... I am not reconciled...",
    ["不甘命运的复仇"] = "Revenge Against Fate",
    ["不甘命运的复仇·污染"] = "Revenge Against Fate - Corruption",
    ["不用一两镑，不用三四镑，只要十苏勒！"] = "Not one or two pounds, not three or four pounds, just ten soli!",
    ["不用上交了，手枪配合猎魔子弹后，真遇到什么危险你也能保护自己，或者给你勇气。"] = "No need to hand it in. Once the revolver is paired with Demon Hunter Bullets, you can protect yourself if you really encounter any danger, or it might give you courage.",
    ["不用不用，我就是想起班森缺一条颜色活泼的领带。这样他去赴宴时，或许能显得不那么沉闷。"] = "No, no, I just remembered that Benson is missing a brightly colored tie. That way, he might not look so dull when he goes to the banquet.",
    ["不用不用，我就是想起班森缺一条颜色活泼的领带。这样他去赴宴时，或许能显得不那么沉闷。 "] = "No, no, I just remembered that Benson needs a brightly colored tie. That way, he might not look so dull when he goes to a banquet.",
    ["不用了"] = "No need",
    ["不用了……"] = "No need...",
    ["不用了谢谢"] = "No thanks",
    ["不用了，不过你确实有很好的外交能力。"] = "No need, but you do have excellent diplomatic skills.",
    ["不用了，我就随便转转。"] = "No thanks, I'm just browsing.",
    ["不用了，我已经都说完了。不过……我可以附身在你身上做点别的，例如，你一直犹豫的事情？"] = "No need, I've already said everything. However... I could possess you to do something else, for example, that thing you've been hesitating about?",
    ["不用了，我自己能喝，把药给我吧。"] = "No need, I can drink it myself. Just give it to me.",
    ["不用了，替我回绝母亲已经是最大的回报。"] = "That won't be necessary. Refusing my mother on my behalf is already the greatest reward.",
    ["不用了，最近廷根有几起儿童失踪案，这几天尽量不要让阿诺德独自出门。"] = "No need. There have been several child abduction cases in Tingen recently. Try not to let Arnold go out alone these days.",
    ["不用了，谢谢"] = "No need, thank you",
    ["不用了，谢谢。"] = "No need, thank you.",
    ["不用了，谢谢，我喝不下东西。"] = "No need, thank you. I cannot drink anything.",
    ["不用传入任何参数"] = "No parameters required.",
    ["不用在意"] = "Don't worry about it",
    ["不用在意。不过你的灵感很高，有些天赋。"] = "Don't mind it. However, your Inspiration is high; you have some talent.",
    ["不用在意，女士"] = "Don't mind it, Madam",
    ["不用在意，这个世界上有很多特殊的人，总是能做别人做不到的事情，比如说你……"] = "Don't worry about it. There are many special people in this world who can always do things others can't, like you...",
    ["不用在意，阁下，您同我说话的声音像落叶一样轻。"] = "Don't mind it, my lord, your voice when speaking to me is as light as a falling leaf.",
    ["不用太担心他，他比大多数人要幸运，至少有支持他、爱他的父亲。"] = "Don't worry too much about him. He is luckier than most people; at least he has a father who supports and loves him.",
    ["不用奇怪，每个月的市政拨款，根本不够里边的人吃饱饭。"] = "Don't be surprised; the monthly municipal funding is simply not enough for the people inside to eat their fill.",
    ["不用始作俑者来算阵营和属性"] = "Do Not Use Instigator for Faction and Attribute Calculation",
    ["不用客气。"] = "You're welcome.",
    ["不用客气，我不靠这个赚钱。"] = "Don't mention it, I don't rely on this to make money.",
    ["不用害怕，他本来是个正常人，却意外遭受某件封印物力量的波及，变成了可怕的猩猩。"] = "Don't be afraid, he was originally a normal person, but he was accidentally affected by the power of a Sealed Artifact and turned into a terrifying gorilla.",
    ["不用害怕，笔记的事件和影响，到这里就结束了。"] = "Don't be afraid. The incidents and influence of the notebook end here.",
    ["不用害怕，过来握住我的手。"] = "Don't be afraid, come over and hold my hand.",
    ["不用急着选择，平静下来，问问自己的内心。"] = "Don't rush to choose. Calm down and ask your heart.",
    ["不用急，多来几次，稳定一下，再去看看别的地方。"] = "No rush. Try a few more times to stabilize yourself before checking other places.",
    ["不用担心 说起来 这是我们的新人？挺帅气的嘛"] = "Don't worry. Speaking of which, is this our newcomer? He's quite handsome.",
    ["不用担心。说起来，这是我们的新人？挺帅气的嘛。"] = "Don't worry. Speaking of which, is this our newcomer? He's quite handsome.",
    ["不用担心房租，在哪都能住……"] = "You don't have to worry about rent, you can live anywhere...",
    ["不用担心！一切花销由俱乐部承担，您只用在我的引导下展示风采即可！"] = "Don't worry! All expenses are covered by the club, you just need to show your demeanor under my guidance!",
    ["不用担心，任务里的损失都是可以报销的。"] = "Don't worry, losses in missions can be reimbursed.",
    ["不用担心，只有你能看到我。在路人眼里，你只是个在水池边自言自语的傻瓜。"] = "Don't worry, only you can see me. In the eyes of passersby, you are just a fool talking to himself by the fountain.",
    ["不用担心，塔罗学院不会有太多考试的。"] = "Don't worry, there won't be too many exams at Tarot Academy.",
    ["不用担心，我也算是黑荆棘的老朋友。"] = "Don't worry, I'm also an old friend of Blackthorn.",
    ["不用担心，我们为你准备了一个身份——恩马特港的外贸商人。今晚黑伍德庄园将举办一场投资晚宴，你可以用这封邀请函进入庄园舞会。"] = "Don't worry, we have prepared an identity for you—a foreign trade merchant from Port Enmat. An investment dinner will be held at Heywood Manor tonight, and you can use this invitation to enter the manor's ball.",
    ["不用担心，我只是想带她回家。"] = "Don't worry, I just want to take her home.",
    ["不用担心，我已经选好了绝佳的拍摄地点，一定能衬托出您的风采。走吧，我们前往霍纳奇斯雪山！"] = "Don't worry, I have already chosen an excellent filming location, it will definitely set off your demeanor. Let's go, we are heading to the Hornacis Snowy Mountain!",
    ["不用担心，我手上还有一点闲钱呢。"] = "Don't worry, I still have some spare money.",
    ["不用担心，这是我们的职责。"] = "Don't worry, this is our duty.",
    ["不用留出呼吸的余量，小家伙，把腰线收紧到极致就好。"] = "No need to leave room for breathing, little one, just tighten the waistline to the limit.",
    ["不用着急，班森，我们还有很多时间。我先去公司啦。"] = "No rush, Benson, we have plenty of time. I'm heading to the company now.",
    ["不用着急，考虑好以后，到佐特兰街36号2楼“<P_Yellow>黑荆棘安保公司</>”找我。"] = "No rush. Once you've considered it, come find me at 36 Zoutland Street, 2nd floor, \"<P_Yellow>Blackthorn Security Company</>\".",
    ["不用等多久，我们就能一起去贝克兰德了！"] = "It won't be long before we can go to Backlund together!",
    ["不用管桌上的材料，我还没看完呢。"] = "Don't touch the materials on the table; I haven't finished reading them yet.",
    ["不用紧张，你很快就能见到你父亲和老管家刻利，要不我们来局昆特牌？"] = "Don't be nervous. You'll see your father and the old butler Keli soon. How about we play a game of Gwent?",
    ["不用紧张，只是日常巡逻。"] = "Don't be nervous, it's just a routine patrol.",
    ["不用紧张，只要按照我说的做，就不会有危险。另外记住，不要打扰里面的其他女士。"] = "Don't be nervous, as long as you do as I say, there won't be any danger. Also, remember, don't disturb the other ladies inside.",
    ["不用紧张，只要按照我说的做，就不会有危险。另外记住，不要打扰里面的其它女士。"] = "Don't be nervous. As long as you do as I say, there will be no danger. Also, remember, do not disturb the other ladies inside.",
    ["不用紧张，我们只是惯例询问。"] = "Don't be nervous, we're just asking some routine questions.",
    ["不用紧张，请坐。"] = "Don't be nervous, please sit.",
    ["不用紧张，这是一种“入学仪式”。让我们通过这种方式，增进彼此的了解。"] = "Don't be nervous, this is a kind of \"entrance ceremony.\" Let us use this method to increase our mutual understanding.",
    ["不用练习，可以多休息一会儿，或许也是一种幸运呢？"] = "No need to practice, you could rest a bit more. Perhaps that's a stroke of luck?",
    ["不用羞于开口，{{先生|女士}}，像你这样没有足够的钱买车票的人还有很多。"] = "Don't be ashamed to speak up, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. There are many others like you who don't have enough money for a ticket.",
    ["不用装袋子，我现在就吃。"] = "No need to bag it, I'll eat it now.",
    ["不用试戴，她不会说话，也无法走动。"] = "No need to try it on. She cannot speak, nor can she walk.",
    ["不用说，我看到了你被污染的噩梦。"] = "Needless to say, I saw the nightmare you were corrupted by.",
    ["不用谢，你得需要一笔“启动资金”嘛。"] = "You're welcome, you need some 'starting capital' after all.",
    ["不用谢，你都需要一笔“启动资金”嘛。"] = "You're welcome, you need 'startup capital' after all.",
    ["不用谢，这只是一个街头魔术师的日常表演。"] = "No need to thank me, this is just a daily performance for a street magician.",
    ["不用谢，这是我该做的。我想问你，有没有见过一个穿绿裙子的女孩。"] = "You're welcome, it's what I should do. I want to ask you, have you seen a girl wearing a green dress?",
    ["不用谦虚，你果然是个特殊的人。"] = "No need to be humble, you are indeed a special person.",
    ["不用这么看着我，别担心，我很好、我真的很好，我们早就应该习惯离别了。"] = "Don't look at me like that. Don't worry, I'm fine—I'm really fine. We should have gotten used to parting ways long ago.",
    ["不用顾忌我，拿出你的最大实力就好。"] = "Don't hold back for my sake, just show me your full strength.",
    ["不用麻烦了，非常感谢。"] = "No need to trouble yourself, thank you very much.",
    ["不用，你喝吧，我本来就不爱喝酒。"] = "No need, you drink it. I don't really like drinking anyway.",
    ["不用，小事情而已，我们在附近等着就好，灵性会指引它会回到这里的。"] = "No need, it's just a small matter. We'll just wait nearby; spirituality will guide it back here.",
    ["不用，我有自己的办法。"] = "No, I have my own ways.",
    ["不用，我认得路。"] = "No need, I know the way.",
    ["不用，谢谢"] = "No, thanks",
    ["不用，谢谢您。您瞧，我又有钱买吃的了！"] = "No, thank you. You see, I have money to buy food again!",
    ["不看"] = "Don't look",
    ["不眠余音"] = "Sleepless Echo",
    ["不眠者"] = "Sleepless",
    ["不眠者很少睡觉，所以时常准备一件斗篷来假装自己在休息。这件斗篷的主人在贝克兰德东区守了十七年的夜，替那些睡着的人盯着黑暗。每当有人做噩梦，斗篷的缝隙中就会漏出一丝星光，把梦里的怪物照得无处躲藏。\n他守了无数个夜晚，却从没人为他守过一个白天。同事们找到他时，斗篷盖在他身上，缝隙里的星光还在微弱地亮着。现在这件斗篷偶尔会在深夜自己飘起来，披在某个正在做噩梦的人身上，带走他的恐惧，留下一个呢喃般的祝福。"] = "Sleepwalkers rarely sleep, so they often prepare a cloak to pretend they are resting. The owner of this cloak kept watch in the East District of Backlund for seventeen years, staring into the darkness for those who were asleep. Whenever someone had a nightmare, a sliver of starlight would leak from the seams of the cloak, leaving the monsters in the dream with nowhere to hide. \n He kept watch for countless nights, yet no one ever kept watch for him during the day. When his colleagues found him, the cloak was covering him, and the starlight in the seams was still glowing faintly. Now, this cloak occasionally floats up by itself in the dead of night, draping over someone having a nightmare, taking away their fear and leaving behind a whisper-like blessing.",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列3“恐惧主教”"] = "Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 3 \"Bishop of Fear\"",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列7“梦魇”"] = "Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 7 \"Nightmare\"",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列8“午夜诗人”"] = "Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 8 \"Midnight Poet\"",
    ["不眠者途径 | 序列9“不眠者”"] = "Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 9 \"Sleepless\"",
    ["不着急的话可以，放在这儿，三天后来取。"] = "If you're not in a hurry, you can leave it here and come pick it up in three days.",
    ["不着急，在舞台的帷幕升起前，你有充足的时间准备。"] = "No rush, you have plenty of time to prepare before the stage curtain rises.",
    ["不瞒你们说，我全身的毛都长得飞快，而且又长又硬，如果不是每天都修剪好几遍，别人都以为我是只刺猬呢。"] = "I won't hide it from you, all the hair on my body grows fast, and it's long and hard. If I didn't trim it several times a day, others would think I was a hedgehog.",
    ["不瞒你说，我们家四口人生日都是同一天。"] = "I won't lie to you, all four of us in our family have the same birthday.",
    ["不瞒你说，我就像这道菜，虽然用料丰富，表面看起来也很独特，但味道却一言难尽……"] = "To tell you the truth, I am like this dish. Although it has rich ingredients and looks unique on the surface, the taste is... hard to describe...",
    ["不瞒你说，我略懂些灵摆占卜和塔罗占卜。 "] = "To be honest, I know a little bit about Pendulum Divination and Tarot Divination.",
    ["不瞒您说……连老疤脸都嘀咕，说廷根下水道里的老鼠见了您都得立正行礼呐！"] = "To be honest... even Old Scarface mutters that the rats in the Tingen sewers have to stand at attention and salute when they see you!",
    ["不瞒您说，今天我们第一次见面。但是，我已经深深爱上了她。"] = "To tell you the truth, we met for the first time today. But, I have already fallen deeply in love with her.",
    ["不知不觉，已经三十年都没回过廷根了……"] = "Before I knew it, it's been thirty years since I last returned to Tingen...",
    ["不知为何，感觉他很亲切。"] = "For some reason, I feel he is very kind.",
    ["不知为何，木偶对你的兴趣远远超过了对皮特的。\n它飞扑过来扒住了你，并邀请你拥抱“母亲”。"] = "For some reason, the puppet was far more interested in you than in Pete. \n It pounced on you, clinging to you, and invited you to hug the \"Mother\".",
    ["不知出于谁手的纹样设计，大片沉郁的蓝色让整个房间都显得安静。"] = "A pattern design of unknown origin; large areas of deep blue make the whole room look quiet.",
    ["不知好歹的小混蛋……别在这儿……演可怜！当心我的棍子——"] = "Ungrateful little brat... don't... act pitiful here! Watch out for my stick—",
    ["不知怎么，总感觉有些眼熟……您家里有兄弟吗？"] = "I don't know why, but you look familiar... do you have any brothers?",
    ["不知所措"] = "At a loss",
    ["不知是从哪本书里掉落的文件……"] = "A document that fell out of some book...",
    ["不知是哪条途径的非凡者，如此出众！"] = "I wonder which Pathway this Beyonder belongs to; they are so outstanding!",
    ["不知是学艺不精还是运气不佳，本次安魂失败了"] = "Whether due to lack of skill or bad luck, this Requiem failed",
    ["不知是学艺不精还是运气不佳，本次安魂失败了，你的理智降低了%s。"] = "Whether due to lack of skill or bad luck, this Requiem failed, and your Sanity decreased by %s.",
    ["不知是学艺不精还是运气不佳，本次安魂失败了，对方理智降低了%s。"] = "Whether due to lack of skill or bad luck, this Requiem failed, and the other party's Sanity decreased by %s.",
    ["不知死活的家伙们，竟然追到了这种地方。"] = "You reckless fools, to think you'd actually chase me to a place like this.",
    ["不知死活，竟然抢猎龙帮的马车！"] = "How reckless—stealing the Dragon Hunters' carriage!",
    ["不知能否再次邀您用餐，让我表达歉意？"] = "Would you be willing to dine with me again, so I may express my apologies?",
    ["不知谁留在这里的尖碑，用非凡力量记录了几个区域地点。"] = "A stele left here by someone unknown, recording several regional locations with Beyonder powers.",
    ["不知身在何处"] = "Don't know where I am",
    ["不知道"] = "Don't know",
    ["不知道“正义”小姐和“倒吊人”有没有找到合适的环境，可惜这个世界没有手机和网络，无法即时通信。"] = "I wonder if Miss Justice and The Hanged Man have found a suitable environment. It is a pity that this world lacks mobile phones and the internet, making instant communication impossible.",
    ["不知道。我们一般都去他的诊所请他过来，在<P_Yellow>奥尔斯纳街</>。"] = "I don't know. We usually go to his clinic to invite him over, on <P_Yellow>Olsna Street</>.",
    ["不知道为什么，总感觉有点<P_Yellow>巧合</>。刚遇到海纳斯不久，就发现他可能是隐秘组织的成员。"] = "I don't know why, but I can't help but feel it's a bit of a <P_Yellow>coincidence</>. Not long after meeting Haines, I discovered he might be a member of a secret organization.",
    ["不知道为什么，我有些紧张……"] = "I don't know why, but I'm a little nervous...",
    ["不知道什么时候能收到好消息呢？"] = "I wonder when I'll receive the good news?",
    ["不知道伦纳德先生准备得怎么样了"] = "I wonder how Mr. Leonard is preparing",
    ["不知道你是否听说过，二十一年前轰动了整个廷根市的连环杀手。"] = "I don't know if you have heard of the serial killer who shocked the entire city of Tingen twenty-one years ago.",
    ["不知道你注意到没有？自从新的环境法案推出，贝克兰德街上的公共垃圾桶们就像经历了大屠杀般销声匿迹。"] = "I don't know if you've noticed? Since the new environmental act was introduced, the public trash cans on the streets of Backlund have disappeared as if they had gone through a massacre.",
    ["不知道哪里传出的消息，说背对净化之泉，右手拿硬币从左肩上方向后投入水中，能够实现自己的愿望。"] = "I don't know where the rumor came from, but they say if you stand with your back to the Fountain of Purification, hold a coin in your right hand, and toss it over your left shoulder into the water, your wish will come true.",
    ["不知道啊，昨天来了，前天......似乎也来了，看样子明天还会来。"] = "I don't know. They came yesterday, the day before... it seems they came then too. It looks like they'll be back tomorrow.",
    ["不知道啊，昨天来了，前天……似乎也来了，看样子明天还会来。"] = "I don't know. They came yesterday, the day before yesterday... it seems they came then too. It looks like they'll come again tomorrow.",
    ["不知道园丁先生的名字是什么。"] = "I don't know the gardener's name.",
    ["不知道奥黛丽小姐近况如何。"] = "I wonder how Miss Audrey is doing lately.",
    ["不知道她现在怎么样了……"] = "I wonder how she is now...",
    ["不知道她白天看上的那一款需要多少钱？这还是我第一次买这样的奢侈品……"] = "I wonder how much the one she saw during the day costs? This is my first time buying such a luxury item...",
    ["不知道它醒来后有没有忘记这一切呢？呵呵。"] = "I wonder if it will forget all this after it wakes up? Hehe.",
    ["不知道您是否愿意，和我——"] = "I don't know if you would be willing to, with me—",
    ["不知道我们未来的孩子叫什么名字呢？"] = "I wonder what our future children will be named?",
    ["不知道是不是我的错觉，自从你来了后，周围的非凡事件发生的频率似乎在直线上升。"] = "I don't know if it's just my imagination, but ever since you arrived, the frequency of Beyonder incidents in the area seems to be skyrocketing.",
    ["不知道是哪个倒霉蛋会遇到我呢，嘿嘿……"] = "I wonder which unlucky soul will run into me, hehe...",
    ["不知道是哪个可怜的人失去了他可怜的馅饼"] = "I wonder which poor person lost their poor pie.",
    ["不知道是哪个混蛋这么诅咒我们！"] = "I don't know which bastard is cursing us like this!",
    ["不知道是哪位流浪汉的铺盖，和周围一起散发着骚臭的气息。"] = "I don't know which homeless person's bedding it is, and it emits a foul smell along with the surroundings.",
    ["不知道是花香，还是因为其他的原因……"] = "I don't know if it's the floral scent, or because of something else...",
    ["不知道是谁留下的。"] = "I don't know who left it.",
    ["不知道是谁留下的书稿？"] = "I wonder whose manuscript this is?",
    ["不知道最近有没有非凡案件要处理，回黑荆棘看看吧。"] = "I wonder if there are any Beyonder cases to handle recently. Let's head back to Blackthorn Security to check.",
    ["不知道最近有没有非凡案件要处理，回黑荆棘看看吧。\r\n"] = "I wonder if there are any Beyonder cases to handle recently. Let's go back to Blackthorn and see.",
    ["不知道杜伦刚才在办公室里听到那些话是什么想法……问问他吧。"] = "I wonder what Duren thought after hearing those words in the office just now... Let's ask him.",
    ["不知道查理是它的名字还是主人的名字，以后多留意一下吧。"] = "I don't know if Charlie is its name or the owner's name; I'll pay more attention to it in the future.",
    ["不知道猎龙帮又在搞什么鬼……还是去看看吧。"] = "I don't know what the Dragon Hunter Gang is up to again... I'd better go check it out.",
    ["不知道猎龙帮的人怎么样了……"] = "I wonder what happened to the people from the Dragon Hunting Gang...",
    ["不知道玛尔特收到信没有呢？"] = "I wonder if Mart received the letter yet?",
    ["不知道琳达和艾里克怎么样了，去看看他们吧。"] = "I wonder how Linda and Eric are doing, let's go check on them.",
    ["不知道福戈还在不在原来的地方……四处找找吧。"] = "I wonder if Fogo is still where he was... let's look around.",
    ["不知道西沃咖啡最近有什么新品。"] = "I wonder if there are any new products at Sivo Coffee recently.",
    ["不知道让他等了多久……他没生气吧？"] = "I wonder how long I've kept him waiting... is he angry?",
    ["不知道还敢来？滚回去写你的作业吧！"] = "You don't know and you dare to come here? Go back and do your homework!",
    ["不知道这个“它”，如今还在不在这里……\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：日记残片）</>"] = "I wonder if 'it' is still here... \n<P_Yellow>(Obtained a clue and placed it in the Inventory: Diary Fragment)</>",
    ["不知道这个“它”，如今还在不在这里……\\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：日记残片）</>"] = "I wonder if this \"it\" is still here today...\\n<P_Yellow> (Obtained clue and added to inventory: Diary Fragment)</>",
    ["不知道这样的故事写出来，那些要名誉的工厂还想不想和你惹上关系……"] = "I wonder if, after such a story is written, those factories that care about their reputation will still want to be associated with you...",
    ["不知道这里发生过什么……"] = "I wonder what happened here...",
    ["不知道这里有没有人知道海精灵的下落，找个人问问吧。"] = "I wonder if anyone here knows the whereabouts of the Sea Spirit, let's find someone to ask.",
    ["不知道连接着何处的铃铛。"] = "A bell that I don't know where it connects to.",
    ["不知道那个特伦什么帝国在哪里，我从来没听说过。"] = "I don't know where that Tren-something Empire is; I've never heard of it.",
    ["不知道那些热情过头的学生是怎么找到我家地址的……"] = "I don't know how those overly enthusiastic students found my home address...",
    ["不知道那老头是怎么回事，死活不承认他这个私生子，还突然发善心，把家产都捐给了济贫院……"] = "I don't know what's wrong with that old man. He refused to acknowledge him as his illegitimate son, and then suddenly had a change of heart and donated all his property to the poorhouse...",
    ["不知道阿尔菲他们现在过得怎么样……"] = "I wonder how Alfie and the others are doing now...",
    ["不知道高级花店的花，是不是能比其他普通地方的在东区的雾霾里活得久……"] = "I wonder if flowers from a high-end florist can live longer in the smog of the East District than those from ordinary places...",
    ["不知道，她从来不跟我们提这些。每年这时候她都去，说是去看一位故人。"] = "No, she never mentions these things to us. She goes away at this time every year, saying she's going to visit an old friend.",
    ["不知道，它没有带项圈，应该是只野猫。"] = "I don't know, it doesn't have a collar, it must be a stray Cat.",
    ["不知道，我又没有恋人……这和这件事有关系吗？"] = "I don't know, I don't have a lover... does that have anything to do with this?",
    ["不知道，我和她打招呼，她只点了个头，话都没说，带了好多箱子，搬了整整一个下午。"] = "I don't know. I greeted her, and she just nodded without saying a word. She brought so many boxes, it took her a whole afternoon to move in.",
    ["不知道？"] = "You don't know?",
    ["不确定"] = "Not sure",
    ["不确定……不过我有预感，后面还会再见到它的。"] = "Not sure... but I have a premonition that we'll see it again later.",
    ["不确定，看起来能容纳很多人。"] = "Not sure, it looks like it can hold a lot of people.",
    ["不祥的气息向你扑来，你躲不过去，被诅咒缠身。"] = "An ominous aura rushed towards you; you couldn't dodge it and were cursed.",
    ["不称职的女儿"] = "Unfilial Daughter",
    ["不稳定的力量"] = "Unstable power",
    ["不符合礼金领取条件"] = "Does not meet the conditions for claiming the gift money.",
    ["不符合队伍要求，无法加入"] = "Does not meet party requirements; unable to join.",
    ["不算周日的话，一周就是12苏勒。"] = "Not counting Sundays, that's 12 soli a week.",
    ["不管你了，我先走了，大难临头各自飞"] = "I'm not waiting for you anymore, I'm leaving. Every man for himself when disaster strikes.",
    ["不管你是神灵，还是愚者，我的祈求都不改变，我希望白银之城的所有人摆脱宿命的诅咒，希望天空中出现，出现那些书籍里描述的太阳。"] = "Whether you are a god or a Fool, my prayer remains unchanged. I hope everyone in the City of Silver can get rid of the curse of fate, and I hope the sun described in those books will appear in the sky.",
    ["不管发生了什么，都不是对孩子实施暴力的理由。"] = "Whatever happened, it's no reason to use violence against a child.",
    ["不管多少钱也赎不回我在暗无天日的大牢里咽下的冤屈和折磨，承不起我用自己的血水浇铸、骨头打磨出的复仇之剑。"] = "No amount of money can redeem the injustice and torment I swallowed in the dark prison, nor can it bear the sword of revenge I cast with my own blood and polished with my bones.",
    ["不管多远的地方，妈妈都会回来的！很爱你的人不会丢下你，大姐姐你要相信妈妈哦~"] = "No matter how far away it is, Mom will come back! People who love you very much won't abandon you, big sister, you have to believe in Mom~",
    ["不管怎么样，如果能被侠盗黑皇帝带去大海，那可真让人羡慕啊。"] = "Regardless, if one could be taken to the sea by the Rogue Black Emperor, that would truly be enviable.",
    ["不管怎么样，我们有必要去一趟梅森工厂。"] = "Regardless, we need to make a trip to the Mason Factory.",
    ["不管怎么样，我还是想要试试。"] = "Regardless, I still want to try.",
    ["不管怎样，他们住宫殿，咱们三个人挤一间破房。哪个皇帝关心普通人的生活？ "] = "Regardless, they live in palaces, while the three of us are squeezed into a broken house. Which emperor cares about the lives of ordinary people?",
    ["不管怎样，先让我眯一会儿吧！"] = "Regardless, let me take a nap for a while first!",
    ["不管怎样，我可不建议您掺和进去。"] = "Regardless, I don't suggest you get involved.",
    ["不管怎样，我都会陪着你的。"] = "No matter what, I will be with you.",
    ["不管我是非凡者、是“囚犯”、还是“疯子”，只有她愿意当我的朋友……"] = "Whether I am a Beyonder, a 'Prisoner', or a 'madman', only she is willing to be my friend...",
    ["不管是“占卜家”，还是“小丑”，都能在马戏团里找到。"] = "Whether it's Seer or Clown, both can be found in a circus.",
    ["不管是危机还是末日，大家都会一起面对。"] = "Whether it's a crisis or the apocalypse, we will face it together.",
    ["不管是哪种，今晚我不太想讲故事。酒你随便喝，故事……留到下次吧。"] = "Whichever it is, I don't really feel like telling stories tonight. Drink whatever you like, but the stories... let's save those for next time.",
    ["不管是真是假，有些谜底，不知道比知道要好。"] = "Whether it's true or false, some mysteries are better left unknown than known.",
    ["不管有再多的烦恼，明天终究会来临。"] = "No matter how many troubles there are, tomorrow will eventually come.",
    ["不管要什么属性，多少点数，我超级属性加点精灵都能一口气全满足，绝对把你打造成最纯正的数值怪！"] = "No matter what attribute or how many points you want, I, the Super Attribute Point Elf, can satisfy them all at once, absolutely turning you into the purest numerical monster!",
    ["不给钱"] = "Don't Pay",
    ["不老"] = "Ageless",
    ["不老魔女"] = "Witch of Agelessness",
    ["不老魔女魔药"] = "Unaging Witch Potion",
    ["不能"] = "Cannot",
    ["不能……这样……结束！"] = "It cannot... end... like this!",
    ["不能。"] = "No.",
    ["不能修改成当前按键"] = "Cannot change to the current key.",
    ["不能充分享受博弈中随机性的人，不能真正地享受“斗邪恶”。"] = "Those who cannot fully enjoy the randomness in a game cannot truly enjoy 'fighting evil'.",
    ["不能动、不停喊话、等死"] = "Cannot move, shouting continuously, waiting for death",
    ["不能吃？煮一煮、炖一炖，照样填饱肚子！你们这些体面的少爷小姐，怎么会知道下街人的生活？"] = "Can't eat it? Boil it, stew it, it'll still fill your stomach! How would you decent young masters and ladies know the life of the people in the Lower Street?",
    ["不能向自己发起决斗"] = "Cannot initiate a duel against yourself.",
    ["不能应用高等级模板"] = "Cannot apply high-level templates.",
    ["不能急。弗莱说过，观众最重要的是观察。再等等。"] = "I can't be hasty. Frye said that the most important thing for a Spectator is to observe. Let's wait a bit longer.",
    ["不能找你做衣服吗？"] = "Can't I have you make clothes for me?",
    ["不能报警……我们还有别的办法吗？"] = "We can't call the police... do we have any other options?",
    ["不能报警。安提科勋爵一直霸占着白莉夫人父亲留下的遗产，肆意挥霍，听说白莉夫人终于不堪忍受，正在接触律师，想通过法律途径离婚并拿回遗产。"] = "We can't call the police. Lord Antigonus has been monopolizing the inheritance left by Lady Beryl's father and squandering it recklessly. I heard that Lady Beryl finally couldn't take it anymore and is contacting a lawyer, hoping to divorce and reclaim the inheritance through legal means.",
    ["不能收？我可费了好大劲！怎么不能收了？"] = "You can't accept it? I went to great lengths for this! Why can't you accept it?",
    ["不能给自己送礼"] = "Cannot send gifts to yourself.",
    ["不能让他们找到瑞尔比伯先生！"] = "We can't let them find Mr. Riel Bieber!",
    ["不能让她看到这些"] = "Can't let her see these",
    ["不能让她看到这些！"] = "Can't let her see this!",
    ["不能证明什么"] = "Cannot prove anything",
    ["不能诱捕正在审讯的仲裁人"] = "Cannot lure an Arbiter who is currently interrogating.",
    ["不能说不能说！"] = "Can't say, can't say!",
    ["不能跳"] = "Cannot Jump",
    ["不能退缩，真相已经在向你招手了！"] = "You cannot shrink back, the truth is already beckoning to you!",
    ["不能重复发送申请"] = "Cannot send duplicate requests.",
    ["不能，我们哪也不去。 "] = "No, we're not going anywhere.",
    ["不良的生活严重影响了他的健康，看来需要作为心理医生对他进行干预了。"] = "His poor lifestyle has severely affected his health. It seems I need to intervene as his psychiatrist.",
    ["不良竞争？"] = "Unfair competition?",
    ["不苦不累！每日高薪工作适合你！"] = "Not bitter or tiring! High-paying daily jobs suitable for you!",
    ["不落之日冕"] = "Corona of the Unsetting Sun",
    ["不行 我无法召唤出他的灵……"] = "No, I cannot summon his spirit...",
    ["不行……这些情况不符合……"] = "No... these conditions don't match...",
    ["不行。就算我开3便士，也有人抢着干，信不信？"] = "No. Even if I offered 3 pence, people would still fight over the job. Believe it or not?",
    ["不行不行！要忍住！"] = "No, no! Must hold back!",
    ["不行不行，你回来！不许走！"] = "No, no, come back! You are not allowed to leave!",
    ["不行！妈妈晾的衣服还在外面挂着！"] = "No! Mom's laundry is still hanging outside!",
    ["不行！我要赶紧逃掉，这一切都乱套了！"] = "No! I have to escape quickly, everything is in chaos!",
    ["不行，不行，得等着梅丽莎一块吃。"] = "No, no, I have to wait for Melissa to eat together.",
    ["不行，伊迪丝，这种力量很神奇，但也很危险。知道得太多对你不是好事，有我来保护你就足够了。"] = "No, Edith, this power is magical, but also dangerous. Knowing too much is not good for you; having me to protect you is enough.",
    ["不行，伊迪斯，咱们得先把那个弄到手！"] = "No, Edith, we have to get that first!",
    ["不行，作为一个有职业操守的剧作家，我绝不会离开自己作品的首演场！"] = "No, as a playwright with professional integrity, I will never leave the premiere of my own work!",
    ["不行，实在不行就偷渡去费内波特王国找种子，那里的植物不是挺耐活的吗……虽然路费可能更贵。 "] = "No, if it really doesn't work, I'll just smuggle myself to the Feynapotter Kingdom to find seeds. Aren't the plants there quite hardy... although the travel fare might be more expensive.",
    ["不行，必须遵守我的方式。"] = "No, you must follow my way.",
    ["不行，我真的不知道，再见。"] = "No, I really don't know, goodbye.",
    ["不行，我要回家了！"] = "No, I have to go home!",
    ["不行，新品的味道还是不够特别……"] = "No, the taste of the new product still isn't special enough...",
    ["不行，要振作！一直忙着找治疗莎莉的方法，现在必须整理一下了。"] = "No, I must pull myself together! I've been busy looking for a way to heal Sally, and now I must organize things.",
    ["不行，这样擦不干净，需要拿东西遮挡一下。"] = "No, it won't be clean if I wipe it like this. I need to use something to cover it up.",
    ["不被他者的目光所奴役，不为迎合他人的期许而活。"] = "Do not be enslaved by the gaze of others, and do not live to cater to the expectations of others.",
    ["不装了，我就是车神！"] = "No more pretending, I am the god of driving!",
    ["不要"] = "No",
    ["不要 不要变成可怜虫"] = "Don't, don't become a wretch.",
    ["不要 不要成为非凡者"] = "Don't, don't become a Beyonder.",
    ["不要……不要靠近我……"] = "Don't... don't come near me...",
    ["不要……伤害她！！！"] = "Don't... hurt her!!!",
    ["不要……怎么地主牌这么好？"] = "No... how could the landlord's hand be this good?",
    ["不要……求求你们，不要抢我的票……"] = "Don't... please, don't take my ticket...",
    ["不要……这副样子……他不喜欢！"] = "Don't... this look... he doesn't like it!",
    ["不要一脸不在乎啊！危机感，要有危机感啊！"] = "Don't look so indifferent! A sense of crisis, you must have a sense of crisis!",
    ["不要东张西望，快过来。"] = "Don't look around, come here.",
    ["不要乱动！嘶，这领结怎么把我的手也缠进去了……"] = "Don't move around! *Hiss*, how did this bowtie get my hand tangled in it too...",
    ["不要乱扔秘偶，会被追踪的。"] = "Don't throw marionettes around randomly; you will be tracked.",
    ["不要介意，我只是喜欢这个，但我的占卜和解读有时候真挺准，真的……"] = "Don't mind it, I just like this, but my divinations and interpretations are sometimes really accurate, really...",
    ["不要介意，我只是喜欢这个，但我的占卜和解读有时候都挺准，真的……"] = "Don't mind it; I just enjoy this, but my divinations and interpretations are sometimes quite accurate, really...",
    ["不要伤害她！"] = "Don't hurt her!",
    ["不要伤害她，不要吓坏她，夜莺是好鸟，夜莺的歌，好听！"] = "Don't hurt her, don't scare her. The Nightingale is a good bird, the Nightingale's song is beautiful!",
    ["不要再往前"] = "Do not go any further",
    ["不要再想了，你需要祈求神灵的帮助。尽快找到真神教会的神职人员，告诉他们你的经历，能做到吗？"] = "Don't think about it anymore. You need to pray for the help of the gods. Find the clergy of a True God's church as soon as possible and tell them about your experience. Can you do that?",
    ["不要再打啦"] = "Stop Fighting",
    ["不要再来打扰希维尔备考了！他可是要成为市政厅秘书的！"] = "Stop disturbing Xivir's studies! He is going to be a City Hall secretary!",
    ["不要再追我了，我有不得不拿的理由。"] = "Don't chase me anymore, I have a reason I must take it.",
    ["不要写了，让我先解决你身上的污染。"] = "Stop writing. Let me deal with the corruption on you first.",
    ["不要冲动！"] = "Don't be impulsive!",
    ["不要去不要去不要去"] = "Don't go don't go don't go",
    ["不要去聆听那些低语。"] = "Do not listen to those whispers.",
    ["不要叹气，卡莱斯，你知道他们化作石像时是快乐的。"] = "Don't sigh, Carles, you know they were happy when they turned into stone statues.",
    ["不要听信谣言啊……怎么还越传越广了。"] = "Don't listen to rumors... how is it spreading even further.",
    ["不要吵了，最近天气干燥，容易上火，可能是肝火太旺了。"] = "Stop arguing. The weather has been dry lately, it's easy to get inflamed; it might be that your liver fire is too high.",
    ["不要啊！"] = "Don't!",
    ["不要啊，我亲爱的艾米——每天两杯！"] = "Don't, my dear Amy—two glasses a day!",
    ["不要在墓园闲逛。"] = "Do not wander around the cemetery.",
    ["不要太勉强，你还只是个孩子。我来帮你想想，盒饭的事情要怎么和老爷商量……"] = "Don't push yourself too hard, you're still just a child. Let me help you think about how to discuss the lunch box matter with the master...",
    ["不要奇怪，和风暴之主教会的那帮家伙不同，在我们这里，女士也是可以口头调戏别人的。"] = "Don't be surprised. Unlike those guys from the Lord of Storms Church, here, ladies can also tease others verbally.",
    ["不要小瞧比你序列低的人，序列八也可以打败序列五……"] = "Don't look down on people with a lower Sequence than you; a Sequence 8 can also defeat a Sequence 5...",
    ["不要忘记带上冒险故事，千万别忘。"] = "Don't forget to bring the adventure stories; don't forget, absolutely.",
    ["不要忘记，铁十字街的……阳光……"] = "Don't forget, the... sunlight... of Iron Cross Street.",
    ["不要怕，威尔，你可以的！"] = "Don't be afraid, Will, you can do it!",
    ["不要总当自己是诗人，事实上，你还是只会吟诵别人的作品。"] = "Don't always think of yourself as a poet. In fact, you still only recite other people's works.",
    ["不要把自己的背后交给任何人，即使是曾经一起训练的同伴。"] = "Do not turn your back to anyone, even a companion you once trained with.",
    ["不要担心，范宁，主教会给予你帮助的。"] = "Don't worry, Fanning, the Bishop will provide you with help.",
    ["不要挣扎了，在主人的力量面前屈服吧！"] = "Don't struggle, surrender before the master's power!",
    ["不要挤，不要挤，喂！你别插队啊！"] = "Don't push, don't push, hey! Don't cut in line!",
    ["不要攻击命运相同的敌人！"] = "Do not attack enemies with the same fate!",
    ["不要攻击相同命运的敌人！"] = "Do not attack enemies with the same fate!",
    ["不要放松警惕。"] = "Stay alert.",
    ["不要温顺地走进那安息的长夜。"] = "Do not go gentle into that good night.",
    ["不要犹豫，过了今天，它就会恢复原价二十苏勒！"] = "Don't hesitate, after today, it will return to its original price of twenty soli!",
    ["不要直接在最下面加新buff"] = "Do not add new buffs directly at the bottom",
    ["不要相信过去，不要畏惧未来。"] = "Do not trust the past, do not fear the future.",
    ["不要看我！我知道自己的舞步很滑稽。哎，这都是为了我的小鸟，你知道的，它从小就离开了妈妈……"] = "Don't look at me! I know my dance steps are funny. Sigh, this is all for my little bird, you know, it left its mother when it was very young...",
    ["不要着急，得先搞清现在的情况……也得整理一下房间，这里看起来像个命案现场。"] = "Don't rush. I need to figure out the current situation first... and I should tidy up the room; it looks like a crime scene.",
    ["不要离开我，阿诺德！！！"] = "Don't leave me, Arnold!!!",
    ["不要紧张，我们塔罗学派是一个友爱的大家庭，遇到困难可以咨询伟大的阿罗德斯大人，祂会给出答案的……"] = "Don't be nervous, our Tarot Club is a loving family. If you encounter difficulties, you can consult the great Lord Arrodes; He will provide the answer...",
    ["不要紧，我还能动……<P_Heart>（抬头）</>是你！"] = "It's alright, I can still move... <P_Heart>(Looks up)</> It's you!",
    ["不要自责，激活仪式是逃离这里的必要环节，这次你做得很好。"] = "Do not blame yourself. Activating the ritual was a necessary step to escape from here. You did very well this time.",
    ["不要被命运相同的能量碰撞到！"] = "Do not get hit by energy of the same fate!",
    ["不要被她迷惑。那不是救赎，是自我毁灭。"] = "Don't be deceived by her. That is not salvation, it is self-destruction.",
    ["不要被幽魂碰到，吱！"] = "Don't get touched by the wraith, squeak!",
    ["不要装傻，我知道你听得懂！"] = "Don't play dumb, I know you can understand!",
    ["不要让任何人触碰黛西小姐，这很危险，我很快就会回来。"] = "Don't let anyone touch Miss Daisy, it's dangerous. I'll be back soon.",
    ["不要误撞命运同色能量！"] = "Do not collide with fate energy of the same color!",
    ["不要说我心狠，在这糟糕的时代里，我们自己能活下去就很不容易了，又哪有那么多心思来可怜别人呢？"] = "Don't say I'm heartless. In this terrible era, it's not easy for us to survive ourselves, so how can we have the heart to pity others?",
    ["不要质疑神使的决定！"] = "Do not question the decision of the divine messenger!",
    ["不要轻易占卜"] = "Do not divine lightly",
    ["不要过去那边，不要！我不想面对那里的东西……"] = "Don't go over there, don't! I don't want to face what's there...",
    ["不要过来！你不准跟着我！……#$&$&**&@%……"] = "Don't come over! You are not allowed to follow me!... #$&$&**&@%...",
    ["不要进入……雾气……"] = "Do not enter... fog...",
    ["不要错过难得的好剧！"] = "Don't miss out on a rare good play!",
    ["不要阻拦我！"] = "Don't stop me!",
    ["不要随意靠近它，否则会沾染厄运。"] = "Do not approach it casually, or you will be tainted by misfortune.",
    ["不要靠近水边。"] = "Do not go near the water.",
    ["不要靠近金秋湖的丰饶之树，否则你的理智将直线下降。"] = "Do not go near the Tree of Abundance at Golden Autumn Lake, or your sanity will plummet.",
    ["不要靠近！"] = "Do not come closer!",
    ["不要，不要抛弃我……叔叔……"] = "Don't, don't abandon me... Uncle...",
    ["不要，请叫我丽贝卡，我还没过十八岁生日呢。"] = "Don't, please call me Rebecca. I haven't had my eighteenth birthday yet.",
    ["不要，迪文娜学姐！"] = "No, Senior Divina!",
    ["不要，非凡者很危险，你做文职吧。"] = "No, Beyonders are dangerous, you should do clerical work.",
    ["不覆盖"] = "Do Not Overwrite",
    ["不见了就不见了吧……"] = "If it's gone, it's gone...",
    ["不见了？"] = "Disappeared?",
    ["不计入常规棋子定位体系。"] = "Not included in the standard chess piece positioning system.",
    ["不认识……"] = "Never heard of her...",
    ["不认识的叔叔，你好！"] = "Hello, stranger uncle!",
    ["不认识，上快点！"] = "Don't know you, hurry up!",
    ["不讨好任何人，帝王的霸气在您的身上显现出来！"] = "Not pandering to anyone—the emperor's dominance is manifesting in you!",
    ["不记得了"] = "Don't remember",
    ["不记得了……我找了三个月了。当时应该就放在桌上……"] = "I don't remember... I've been looking for three months. It should have been on the table at the time...",
    ["不许再偷吃花种！"] = "Stop stealing the flower seeds!",
    ["不许动！"] = "Don't Move!",
    ["不许动！你被捕了！"] = "Don't move! You're under arrest!",
    ["不许去。"] = "You are not allowed to go.",
    ["不许去就是不许去。"] = "I said you are not allowed to go, and that's that.",
    ["不许更改！把你的手拿开！所有的<P_Yellow>角色</>都已经就位 ，谁也别想来打断这场完美的处刑！"] = "No changes allowed! Take your hands off! All the <P_Yellow> characters </> are in position; no one is allowed to interrupt this perfect execution!",
    ["不许离开！"] = "Don't leave!",
    ["不许获取占卜结果"] = "Do not obtain Divination Result",
    ["不许获取隐秘信息"] = "Do not obtain secret information",
    ["不许赞美太阳"] = "Do not Praise the Sun",
    ["不许靠近我，你这个女人！"] = "Don't come near me, you woman!",
    ["不论他留下的巨额遗产会留给他四个儿子中的哪一个，都让我们缅怀他，令他在女神的神国得以安息。"] = "Regardless of which of his four sons his massive inheritance will be left to, let us remember him and let him rest in peace in the Goddess's kingdom.",
    ["不论发条、齿轮、还是蒸汽。"] = "Be it clockwork, gears, or steam.",
    ["不论如何，我们都要开始更好的新生活了。"] = "No matter what, we are going to start a better new life.",
    ["不论如何，我得先找个地方藏起来……要是被发现靠着魔药偷偷通宵学习的事就糟了。"] = "Anyway, I have to find a place to hide first... it would be bad if I were caught studying all night secretly relying on potions.",
    ["不论如何，谢谢你。我想我很快就要和他们团聚了……"] = "Regardless, thank you. I think I will be reunited with them soon...",
    ["不论宴会或街头，观众永远是观众。 "] = "Whether at a banquet or on the street, a Spectator is always a Spectator.",
    ["不论是男是女，我对你的感觉绝不会变。"] = "Whether I am a man or a woman, my feelings for you will never change.",
    ["不论有没有路牌，有没有红色巨石，有没有优美的雕塑……"] = "Regardless of whether there are road signs, red boulders, or beautiful sculptures...",
    ["不论诗文、小说、还是歌剧。"] = "Be it poetry, novels, or opera.",
    ["不论贫穷或是富贵 不论健康或是疾病"] = "Whether in poverty or wealth, in sickness or in health,",
    ["不识抬举的小家伙们！等你们饿得受不了的时候，可别回来求我……"] = "Ungrateful little brats! When you're starving and can't take it anymore, don't come back begging me...",
    ["不该多招人"] = "Should not recruit more people",
    ["不该翻开的纸页——是厄运，还是毁灭？"] = "A page that should not be turned—is it misfortune, or destruction?",
    ["不说"] = "Don't tell",
    ["不说了，我赶着去接下一个委托了。"] = "Enough talk, I'm in a hurry to take the next commission.",
    ["不说了，还是看看菜吧。新鲜的黄瓜、西红柿，多么可爱！"] = "Enough talk, let's look at the vegetables. Fresh cucumbers, tomatoes, how lovely!",
    ["不说是吧？我看看，这里离警察局好像不远……"] = "Not talking, huh? Let me see, it doesn't seem far from the police station here...",
    ["不说这些了，今天的百合刚到——客人，您要包一束送给心上人吗？ "] = "Enough of that. The lilies just arrived today—customer, would you like to wrap a bouquet for your sweetheart?",
    ["不调查"] = "Don't investigate",
    ["不败旌旗"] = "Invincible Flag.",
    ["不赞同"] = "Disagree",
    ["不走技能检查，所有逻辑在单帧里执行完毕，非独立技能，可以理解为调用方（父技能、Buff）的一部分"] = "Does not go through skill checks; all logic is executed in a single frame. It is not an independent skill and can be understood as part of the caller (parent skill, Buff).",
    ["不起眼的小圆框眼镜，让佩戴者不自觉地专注下来。"] = "Inconspicuous small round glasses that make the wearer focus unconsciously.",
    ["不足1小时"] = "Less than 1 hour",
    ["不足一小时"] = "Less than an hour",
    ["不跟上"] = "Don't follow",
    ["不跳"] = "Don't jump",
    ["不躲，这样也挺好的。你说老了之后，我们也会这样吗？"] = "I won't. This is actually quite nice. Do you think we'll be like this when we're old?",
    ["不轻信，不花钱，谨防诈骗！"] = "Don't be gullible, don't spend money, beware of fraud!",
    ["不过 一切都慢慢好起来了 这真好"] = "However, everything is slowly getting better. That's really good.",
    ["不过——你可是有“愚者”先生的眷顾，在一位强大神明的庇护和注视下完成仪式，不会出问题的。"] = "However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful God, there won't be any problems.",
    ["不过——你可是有愚者先生的眷顾，在一位强大神明的庇护和注视下完成仪式，不会出问题的。"] = "However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful deity, nothing will go wrong.",
    ["不过……"] = "However...",
    ["不过……<P_Heart>（表情柔和）</>其实我很感激他们。"] = "However... <P_Heart>(Expression softens)</> actually, I am very grateful for them.",
    ["不过……为了保护他们，我现在尽量不和他们见面。非凡世界太危险了，我不想让危险波及到他们。"] = "However... to protect them, I try not to see them now. The Extraordinary World is too dangerous, and I don't want the danger to reach them.",
    ["不过……也到此为止了！"] = "However... this is as far as you go!",
    ["不过……在这期间，我看到夫人、约翰先生，还有仆人都去过卧室。"] = "However... during this time, I saw the lady, Mr. John, and the servant all go into the bedroom.",
    ["不过……灰雾之上会不会有多个主宰，再加一重保险。"] = "However... what if there are multiple rulers above the gray fog? I should add another layer of insurance.",
    ["不过下次——衷心建议你别在我们的封锁线里“改主意”太频繁。"] = "But next time—I sincerely suggest you don't 'change your mind' too frequently within our blockade.",
    ["不过也很正常，它毕竟算是两百年前的历史文物了。"] = "But that's normal; after all, it's a historical artifact from two hundred years ago.",
    ["不过今天真不巧，他刚刚出门了。"] = "But it's really unfortunate today; he just went out.",
    ["不过他们估计也没想到，作为首领的“愚者”，竟然才刚刚消化完“占卜家”魔药。"] = "However, they probably didn't expect that the 'Fool' as the leader had just finished digesting the 'Seer' potion.",
    ["不过他去了一趟贝克兰德，回来就变了个人……到处扔这块怀表，但怀表总会回到他手里……"] = "But he went to Backlund once and came back a different person... he throws this pocket watch everywhere, but it always returns to his hand...",
    ["不过他应该与这次的恶性杀人案件无关，他有不在现场的证明，死亡时间内他正在参加另一场拳赛。"] = "However, he shouldn't be related to this vicious murder case. He has an alibi; he was participating in another boxing match at the time of death.",
    ["不过他很活泼，不太像个老师——哪有老师一天到晚做些“黄金雨”之类的实验，拿它们哄妻子开心的……"] = "But he is very lively, not much like a teacher—what teacher spends all day doing experiments like \"Golden Rain\" to coax his wife into being happy...",
    ["不过他的精神还没有完全恢复，最近还得休息一段时间。"] = "However, his mind has not fully recovered yet, and he will have to rest for a while recently.",
    ["不过他至少付钱了。比某些客人强。"] = "At least he paid. Better than some customers.",
    ["不过以前在值夜者娱乐室，我经常弹曲子给队员们听。"] = "However, back in the Nighthawks' recreation room, I often played tunes for the team members.",
    ["不过以前我们这确实有一户人家去了大城市……噢，是莫雷蒂一家。"] = "But there was indeed a family here that went to the big city before... oh, it was the Moretti family.",
    ["不过以前我们这确实有一户人都变成金凤凰了，对，莫雷蒂一家，兄妹三人。"] = "But we did have a family here who turned into golden phoenixes—yes, the Moretti family, the three siblings.",
    ["不过你不害怕吗？作为一名值夜者，你会经常面对危险、甚至是死亡的威胁。"] = "But aren't you afraid? As a Nighthawk, you will often face danger, even the threat of death.",
    ["不过你倒是提醒我了，是该见见老朋友。"] = "But you did remind me; it's time to see some old friends.",
    ["不过你既然已经找到了入口，不妨去那个世界看看，这对你的恢复也有好处。"] = "However, since you've already found the entrance, you might as well take a look at that world. It will also be beneficial for your recovery.",
    ["不过你的相机里，不是还留下了她在阳光下的瞬间吗？"] = "But didn't you capture a moment of her in the sunlight with your camera?",
    ["不过你费了这么多功夫抓我，应该不是为了和我谈论教学方式吧。"] = "But you went to so much trouble to catch me, it shouldn't be just to discuss teaching methods with me.",
    ["不过凡事都有代价。万一您不幸失败了，那就只能委屈您也变成木偶了……很划算的交易吧？"] = "However, everything has a price. In case you unfortunately fail, then I can only wrong you by turning you into a puppet too... A very cost-effective deal, right?",
    ["不过去贝克兰德的确是个好主意。"] = "However, going to Backlund is indeed a good idea.",
    ["不过变故很快发生了。"] = "But a change happened soon after.",
    ["不过在此之前，我需要使用一些手段，来隔绝封印物3-116的负面影响。"] = "But before that, I need to use some means to isolate the negative effects of Sealed Artifact 3-116.",
    ["不过在这之后爷爷就生病了，就是门外那位医生。"] = "But after that, Grandpa got sick, and that's the doctor outside the door.",
    ["不过她偶尔也会来买白色的百合，安安静静包好。我问过一次，她说“是去看望一位总在睡觉的老朋友啦”，应该是去拉斐尔墓园吧。"] = "However, she occasionally comes to buy white lilies, wrapping them up quietly. I asked once, and she said, \"I'm going to visit an old friend who is always sleeping.\" She must be going to Raphael Cemetery.",
    ["不过好在救赎已至，请坚信，我们必将在“愚者”先生的带领下步入无暗的时代。"] = "But fortunately, salvation has arrived. Please believe that we will surely step into an era without darkness under the leadership of Mr. Fool.",
    ["不过好消息是：右边这瓶药，会治愈您的皮肤。"] = "But the good news is: the bottle on the right will heal your skin.",
    ["不过妈妈说他会是个好裁缝的，你想要找妈妈做衣服还是找哥哥做衣服呢？"] = "But Mom says he'll be a great tailor. Are you looking for Mom to make your clothes, or my brother?",
    ["不过对于淑女的甜点来说，或许刚好。"] = "However, for a lady's dessert, perhaps it's just right.",
    ["不过对你来说，这是一件好事。"] = "But for you, this is a good thing.",
    ["不过序列9的能力有限，更多是理论上的认识。"] = "However, the abilities of Sequence 9 are limited, and it's mostly theoretical knowledge.",
    ["不过我也得再努力点了，我打算再买几本会计方面的书籍，进行更深入的学习。"] = "But I also need to work harder. I plan to buy a few more accounting books for more in-depth study.",
    ["不过我十分感谢奥斯汀先生的收留，你一定想象不到，在那之前我是一个整天游荡在大街上抢钱的赖皮鬼。"] = "However, I am very grateful to Mr. Austin for taking me in. You wouldn't imagine that before that, I was a rascal who spent all day wandering the streets stealing money.",
    ["不过我可不会这么放纵自己，下班后在河边坐下喝杯黑麦啤酒，就很惬意了。"] = "However, I won't indulge myself like that. Sitting by the river after getting off work and having a glass of rye beer is quite pleasant.",
    ["不过我听说，内维尔那家伙好像从山上带了什么东西下来。"] = "But I heard that Neville guy seems to have brought something down from the mountain.",
    ["不过我怀疑他根本不会和我打。阿尔弗雷德先生是那种很讲规矩的人——他为什么要和一条狗打架呢？"] = "However, I doubt he would fight me at all. Mr. Alfred is the type of person who is very particular about rules—why would he fight a dog?",
    ["不过我现在才序列9，可能接收不到……或许把我和灰雾之上那片神秘空间捆绑在一起……"] = "However, I am only Sequence 9 right now and might not be able to receive it... Perhaps if I bind myself to that mysterious space above the gray fog...",
    ["不过我遇到过两次异常……是因为嫁接的力量不稳定？"] = "But I've encountered two anomalies... is it because the grafted power is unstable?",
    ["不过我那时太小，并不记得这些了，是长大后看卷宗才了解的。"] = "But I was too young then, I don't remember it. I only learned about it after reading the files when I grew up.",
    ["不过抛哪了？我问你，金镑拋哪了？"] = "But where did you throw it? I'm asking you, where did you throw the gold pounds?",
    ["不过无所谓，来这里的人都有自己的理由。"] = "But it doesn't matter, everyone who comes here has their own reasons.",
    ["不过既然你有勇气来这里，说明你有资格成为我们的朋友。"] = "But since you have the courage to come here, it means you are qualified to be our friend.",
    ["不过是有位夫人把我从码头区捡回来，授了我这门吃饭的手艺。 "] = "It's just that a lady picked me up from the dock area and taught me this trade to make a living.",
    ["不过有一件还算幸运的好事。"] = "But there is one fortunate thing.",
    ["不过没事，我这不来找他了吗？看见我他一定会很惊喜的！"] = "But it's okay, didn't I come to find him? He'll definitely be pleasantly surprised to see me!",
    ["不过没关系，我们可以把墓建在这里，就当是大家陪他一起。"] = "But it doesn't matter. We can build the tomb here, as if everyone is keeping him company.",
    ["不过没关系，有了脚踏车我卖报能快些，很快就能把钱赚回来的！"] = "But it's okay, with the bicycle I can sell newspapers faster, and I'll be able to earn the money back soon!",
    ["不过特里斯就像从廷根蒸发了一样，这件事官方还会继续追查。"] = "However, it is as if Trissy has evaporated from Tingen. The authorities will continue to pursue this matter.",
    ["不过现在也挚好，看书，研究神秘学，教教你们这些年轻人。"] = "But things are quite good now—reading books, studying mysticism, and teaching you young people.",
    ["不过现在也挺好，看书，研究神秘学，教教你们这些年轻人。"] = "But it's quite good now, reading books, studying the occult, and teaching you young people.",
    ["不过现在只能从其它线索入手了。伦纳德，你先去一趟警察局，看看最近有没有关于工厂区的异常案件。"] = "However, we can only start from other clues now. Leonard, you go to the police station first and see if there have been any unusual cases in the factory district recently.",
    ["不过现在，可以和我聊聊大约翰身上发生了什么吗？"] = "But for now, can you tell me what happened to Big John?",
    ["不过瞧着方向，他应该往家里去了。他家在集市上做<P_Yellow>酿酒</>生意，沿着<P_Yellow>河堤</>就到了。"] = "But looking at the direction, he should have gone home. His family runs a <P_Yellow> winemaking </> business in the market, just follow the <P_Yellow> river embankment </> and you'll be there.",
    ["不过祭品而已……竟敢阻止我！"] = "Just a sacrifice... yet you dare to stop me!",
    ["不过花开不久又会枯萎……要不然我还是晚点开花吧？"] = "But flowers will wither soon after blooming... Should I bloom later?",
    ["不过蒸汽列车也能带来别的地方的报纸和杂志，比如贝克兰德日报。像家庭杂志、故事评论，塔索克报也不错。"] = "However, steam trains can also bring newspapers and magazines from other places, such as the Backlund Daily. Family magazines, story reviews, and the Tussock Times are also good.",
    ["不过要提醒你一件事，你接下来拍到的东西，不一定都是好看的。毕竟诡节嘛……呵呵，有趣就好。"] = "But I must remind you of one thing: the things you capture next might not all be pleasant. After all, it is the Weird Festival... Heh, as long as it's interesting.",
    ["不过要等我把这该死的小偷抓到先！"] = "But I have to wait until I catch this damn thief first!",
    ["不过话说回来……虽然喜欢教学，但我毕竟一把年纪了，像现在这样每天从早忙到晚实在是吃不消。"] = "But having said that... although I enjoy teaching, I am getting on in years, and being busy from morning till night like this is really more than I can handle.",
    ["不过话说回来，整个鲁恩王国都是这样，希望你不讨厌雨天。"] = "But then again, the entire Loen Kingdom is like this. I hope you don't dislike rainy days.",
    ["不过说起海上冒险家……我只想得到《大冒险家》里写的那位。"] = "But speaking of adventurers from the sea... the only one I can think of is the one written about in \"The Great Adventurer\".",
    ["不过调香是精细活，不如两位先回去把家中的上批香水用完，下周再来取货，如何？"] = "However, perfumery is delicate work. Why don't you two go back and finish the last batch of perfume you have at home, and come back to pick up the goods next week?",
    ["不过还不够，这广阔的世界本身就是个传奇……"] = "But it's not enough, this vast world itself is a legend...",
    ["不过还得谢谢你，让我知道带着狒狒“开门”的感觉，老师可不会讲这些……等等。"] = "But I still have to thank you for letting me know what it feels like to \"Open Door\" with a baboon; the teacher wouldn't teach these things... wait.",
    ["不过还是要祝贺你，成为一位真正的非凡者。"] = "However, I must congratulate you on becoming a true Beyonder.",
    ["不过还是谢谢您，我再选选看吧。"] = "But thank you anyway, I'll keep looking.",
    ["不过这个地方，好像是有点凉飕飕的……"] = "But this place, it feels a bit chilly...",
    ["不过这些都不重要了，等我们成功，钱财和地位都会有。"] = "But none of that matters anymore. When we succeed, we will have both money and status.",
    ["不过这几天她都没有出现，出什么事了吗？"] = "But she hasn't appeared for a few days. Did something happen?",
    ["不过这本笔记目前也在值夜者组织，而且……之前看到值夜者的保密资料中，没有提供占卜家序列8和7的魔药名称，难道里面还藏着什么秘辛？"] = "However, this notebook is currently with the Nighthawks, and... I saw in the Nighthawks' confidential documents that they didn't provide the potion names for Seer Sequence 8 and 7. Could there be some hidden secret inside?",
    ["不过这里的每杯酒都来自恶龙的馈赠。尽享美味吧，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "However, every drink here comes from the gift of the dragon. Enjoy the deliciousness, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["不过都已经这么久了，他怎么还不找过来呢？唔，那个爱哭鬼，不会是又哭鼻子了吧……"] = "But it's been so long, why hasn't he found his way here yet? Ugh, that crybaby, he wouldn't be crying again, would he...",
    ["不过雪莉，你认得这块怀表吗？照片上的这位女士看起来和你有些像。"] = "But Shirley, do you recognize this pocket watch? The lady in the photo looks a bit like you.",
    ["不过非凡者的道路从来都是危险和疯狂的，走向失控和死亡也是意料中事。"] = "However, the path of a Beyonder is always dangerous and mad; heading toward loss of control and death is also expected.",
    ["不过非要说的话，我喜欢观察植物生长。看着一颗种子从土里钻出来，慢慢长高，长出叶子，开花结果——这个过程太美妙了。"] = "But if I had to say, I like observing plants grow. Watching a seed sprout from the soil, slowly grow taller, sprout leaves, bloom, and bear fruit—this process is simply wonderful.",
    ["不过预言中的灾难似乎并没有发生……喔，难道是有“大人物”保护了金秋湖？"] = "But the disaster in the prophecy doesn't seem to have happened... Oh, could it be that a \"big shot\" protected Golden Autumn Lake?",
    ["不过，“黑夜渐袭”……呵，或许也不全算是巧合。我向来是女神的虔诚信徒，若说冥冥之中蒙受些许黑夜的眷顾，倒也合乎情理。"] = "However, \"The Night Approaches\"... Heh, perhaps it's not entirely a coincidence. I have always been a devout believer of the Goddess. If it is said that I have received some slight favor from the night in the dark, it is reasonable.",
    ["不过，不少野生非凡者很忌惮他们，所以记得隐蔽身份。"] = "However, many wild Beyonders are wary of them, so remember to conceal your identity.",
    ["不过，他们似乎是在执行重要的任务，这就是“欲戴皇冠，必承其重”吗……"] = "However, they seem to be carrying out important quests. Is this what they mean by \"heavy is the head that wears the crown\"...",
    ["不过，你是怎么摆脱封印物影响的？你只是个普通人，却在迷雾中找到了正确的方向。"] = "However, how did you get rid of the influence of the Sealed Artifact? You are just an ordinary person, yet you found the correct direction in the fog.",
    ["不过，你现在这样很好，真的很好。"] = "However, you look great now, really great.",
    ["不过，你的建议有一定的价值。我会和他们提议的。"] = "However, your suggestion has some value. I will propose it to them.",
    ["不过，你知道有关学校的初代校长雕像的事吗？听说对着它许愿往往都能应验……"] = "However, do you know about the statue of the school's first principal? I heard that making a wish to it often comes true...",
    ["不过，使用者身边的人将会受到“戏剧大师”影响，不受控制地表演一出喜剧或悲剧。佩戴时间不得超过两个小时。"] = "However, those around the user will be affected by the \"Dramaturg,\" uncontrollably performing a comedy or a tragedy. It must not be worn for more than two hours.",
    ["不过，关于这个问题，我倒是很好奇邓恩的回答呢……"] = "However, regarding this question, I am quite curious about Dunn's answer...",
    ["不过，医生啊，你总一个人住在诊所楼上不是办法。我远房表亲的朋友的姑妈的女儿的同学在图书馆做事，和你一样爱看书。"] = "However, Doctor, it's not a solution for you to always live alone above the clinic. My distant cousin's friend's aunt's daughter's classmate works at the Library and loves reading just like you.",
    ["不过，原来不眠者也会需要喝咖啡吗？"] = "However, do Sleepless even need to drink coffee?",
    ["不过，发生在这片雪山上，倒也不奇怪。"] = "However, it's not surprising that it happened on this snowy mountain.",
    ["不过，在我们的世界里，这些都是童话传说，没有它们是真实存在的证据。我更倾向是这个世界的神秘学知识扰乱时空传到我们的世界。"] = "However, in our world, these are all fairy tales; there is no evidence that they are real. I am more inclined to believe that the occult knowledge of this world disrupted space-time and transmitted to our world.",
    ["不过，在潜入调查前，我需要对你进行一项小小的考验。"] = "However, before we dive into the investigation, I need to put you through a small test.",
    ["不过，天天吸厂里的煤灰，也许我会先死在病床上，而不是铁桶里，谁知道呢！"] = "But, breathing the coal dust in the factory every day, maybe I'll die in a hospital bed first, instead of in an iron bucket, who knows!",
    ["不过，她很漂亮，也很善良，像我们这样的艺术家都喜欢美的东西不是吗？我经常邀请她来画室做客呢！"] = "However, she is very beautiful and kind. Artists like us all like beautiful things, don't we? I often invite her to visit the studio!",
    ["不过，她的头发倒是梳得很整齐。看样子就算贫穷，她也有深爱她的家人。"] = "However, her hair was combed very neatly. It seems that even in poverty, she had family who loved her deeply.",
    ["不过，她这次去得有点久了，不会出什么事吧？"] = "However, she's been gone a bit long this time. Could something have happened?",
    ["不过，妈妈总会找到你的，不用担心。"] = "However, Mom will always find you, don't worry.",
    ["不过，感觉还不够精确，最好补充一些<P_Yellow>个人特质</>。"] = "However, it doesn't feel precise enough. It would be best to add some <P_Yellow> personal traits </>.",
    ["不过，我保证！"] = "However, I promise!",
    ["不过，我可以大胆地告诉你，你买一整块也不会感到失望。"] = "However, I can boldly tell you that you won't be disappointed if you buy a whole piece.",
    ["不过，我并非现在的“拜朗人”，我所属的国家是拜朗帝国。"] = "However, I am not a \"Balam\" of the present; the country I belonged to was the Balam Empire.",
    ["不过，我必须先将这件事情通报给圣堂，等到他们确认了笔记的保密等级，再考虑能不能给你看。"] = "However, I must first report this matter to the Holy Cathedral. Once they confirm the confidentiality level of the notebook, we will consider whether you can see it.",
    ["不过，我现在过得很好。我维护这里的交易公平，我相信这是神真正想要的。"] = "However, I am doing very well now. I maintain the fairness of transactions here, and I believe this is what God truly wants.",
    ["不过，我看得出来，他和我很不一样。我刚来这里的时候，把这里当做游戏，玩得很爽，很开心。"] = "However, I can tell that he is very different from me. When I first came here, I treated this place as a game, and I played very happily and joyfully.",
    ["不过，我要提醒你一下，“神降”仪式还需要准备其他材料，记得收集齐再来开启仪式。"] = "However, I must remind you that the 'divine descent' ritual also requires other materials; remember to collect them all before starting the ritual.",
    ["不过，我需要提醒你一点。如果遇见非凡事件，记得及时上报教会，也算是为你自己着想。"] = "However, I need to remind you of one thing. If you encounter Beyonder incidents, remember to report them to the Church in time; it's for your own good.",
    ["不过，既然灾难无法避免，高塔崩塌之后，才会有重建的希望。"] = "However, since disaster is unavoidable, only after the tower collapses can there be hope for reconstruction.",
    ["不过，望着海面，我感受到了风暴的启示。"] = "However, looking at the sea, I felt the revelation of the storm.",
    ["不过，正因如此，我们才更要努力变强，守护平静的日常生活不被打扰。"] = "However, precisely because of this, we must strive to become stronger to protect our peaceful daily lives from being disturbed.",
    ["不过，没有什么有用的信息。"] = "However, there is no useful information.",
    ["不过，现在我要向女神祷告，希望女神能庇佑我妈妈的病快点好起来。"] = "However, right now I need to pray to the Goddess, hoping the Goddess can protect my mother so she gets better soon.",
    ["不过，由于3-888的失踪，《谜题破解法》的保密等级提升了，需要<P_Yellow>找希罗多德申请</>。"] = "However, due to the disappearance of 3-888, the confidentiality level of \"Puzzle-Solving Methods\" has been raised; you need to <P_Yellow> apply to Herodotus for </>.",
    ["不过，罗塞尔大帝说过，只要尝试组合字句的次数够多，卷毛狒狒也能写出伟大的诗作。"] = "However, Emperor Roselle said that as long as you try to combine words enough times, a Curly-Haired Baboon can also write great poetry.",
    ["不过，至少他不用为后半生无法画画而伤心了，哈哈……唉……"] = "But at least he doesn't have to be sad about not being able to paint for the rest of his life, haha... sigh...",
    ["不过，至少我能面对安迪了，我准备去他的墓前，去……喝一杯。"] = "However, at least I can face Andy now. I'm going to his grave to... have a drink.",
    ["不过，请一定替我谢谢凯尔文。他选的东西很实用，对于一个喜欢写点东西的人来说，没有什么比能随时记录下想法的纸笔更珍贵的礼物了。"] = "However, please be sure to thank Kelvin for me. The items he chose are very practical; for someone who likes to write, there is no gift more precious than paper and pens to record thoughts at any time.",
    ["不过，躲在这里果然还是太吓人了……我还是回去找比利吧，下次再换个地方藏。"] = "However, hiding here is really too scary... I'd better go back and find Billy, and hide somewhere else next time.",
    ["不过，还是要好心提醒你一下——这可不是一个轻松的任务，但足够有趣，好好享受吧。"] = "However, I must kindly remind you—this is not an easy Quest, but it's interesting enough. Enjoy it.",
    ["不过，还需要更多的资料去验证。"] = "However, more data is needed to verify it.",
    ["不过，这些和莫妮卡看着门票时会有的喜悦比起来，都不算什么！"] = "However, none of that compares to the joy Monica feels when looking at the tickets!",
    ["不过，鲁莽泄恨的人，往往只会自己喝下苦酒。"] = "However, those who vent their hatred recklessly often only end up drinking bitter wine themselves.",
    ["不这么做的话，我怎么追捕一个海上的亡命徒？向格尔曼·斯帕罗祈祷吗？"] = "If I don't do this, how can I hunt down a fugitive at sea? Pray to Gehrman Sparrow?",
    ["不进去吗？"] = "Not going in?",
    ["不远处好像是……"] = "Not far ahead, it seems to be...",
    ["不远处，一位年轻男士驾马车，载黛西小姐快速朝玩家方向前进。\n黛西小姐手捧一束雏菊。男士一边驾车，一边把黛西小姐逗得大笑。"] = "Not far away, a young man drove a carriage, carrying Miss Daisy quickly towards the player. \nMiss Daisy held a bouquet of daisies. The man drove while teasing Miss Daisy, making her laugh out loud.",
    ["不适话题"] = "Inappropriate Topics",
    ["不透明度"] = "Opacity",
    ["不速之音"] = "Uninvited Sound",
    ["不速之音-园丁"] = "Uninvited Sound - Gardener",
    ["不速之音-建议换歌"] = "Uninvited Sound - Suggest Changing Song",
    ["不速之音-情侣归来"] = "Uninvited Sound - Couple Returns",
    ["不速之音-湖边情侣"] = "Uninvited Sound - Couple by the Lake",
    ["不速之音-艾伯特对话"] = "Uninvited Sound - Albert Dialogue",
    ["不速之音-艾伯特对话2"] = "Uninvited Sound - Albert Dialogue 2",
    ["不速之音接取trigger"] = "Uninvited Sound acceptance trigger",
    ["不重复地通过所有地块，抵达祈祷台前吟唱颂词"] = "Pass through all tiles without repeating to reach the prayer altar and chant the incantation",
    ["不重要，我们等的戈多说好今天来。"] = "Doesn't matter, the Godot we are waiting for said he would come today.",
    ["不错……看来你进步不小。"] = "Not bad... looks like you've made significant progress.",
    ["不错……这里……很温暖……"] = "Not bad... it's... very warm here...",
    ["不错。不少离奇的案件，都是由不起眼的小事引起的。"] = "Correct. Many bizarre cases are caused by inconspicuous little things.",
    ["不错。先闻闻<P_Yellow>“绿色心情”</>，这能让你知晓第一轮比赛题目。"] = "Not bad. First, smell the <P_Yellow>\"Green Mood\"</>, this will let you know the topic of the first round.",
    ["不错。调查过程中如果遇到意外情况，一定要确保自己的安全，有问题随时联系我。"] = "Good. If you encounter any accidents during the investigation, be sure to ensure your own safety. Contact me if you have any problems.",
    ["不错嘛——那么现在开始，热身结束咯。"] = "Not bad—so now, let's begin, the warm-up is over.",
    ["不错的回答，漂亮的眼神。"] = "Good answer, beautiful eyes.",
    ["不错的提议"] = "Good suggestion",
    ["不错的选择，在做好之前，您可以先试试我们工坊的存货，请跟我来。"] = "A good choice. Before it's ready, you can try our workshop's stock first. Please come with me.",
    ["不错的雕像艺术，但缺了点浓郁的情感和色彩。"] = "Nice statue art, but it lacks rich emotion and color.",
    ["不错，不从众，和我当年一样有性格。而且足够幸运，占卜家的魔药材料还剩两份，否则就要等很久了。"] = "Not bad, not following the crowd, you have character just like I did back then. And you're lucky enough, there are two portions of Seer potion materials left, otherwise you would have to wait a long time.",
    ["不错，你观察得很仔细。他们在等人，但或许永远等不到。"] = "Not bad, you observe very carefully. They are waiting for someone, but perhaps they will never wait for them.",
    ["不错，就决定是它了！"] = "Nice, that's the one!",
    ["不错，很听劝，我们分头行动。记住，我们在守护廷根。"] = "Good, very sensible. Let's split up. Remember, we are guarding Tingen.",
    ["不错，很有品位。"] = "Not bad, very tasteful.",
    ["不错，很有品味。"] = "Not bad, very tasteful.",
    ["不错，很有舞蹈天赋嘛！"] = "Not bad, you have a real talent for dancing!",
    ["不错，我和你想的一样。"] = "Not bad, I think the same as you.",
    ["不错，我没白死。"] = "Not bad, my death wasn't in vain.",
    ["不错，挑战到此结束。"] = "Not bad, the challenge ends here.",
    ["不错，看不出这是个昨天刚死过的倒霉蛋。"] = "Not bad, you can't tell this is a poor soul who died just yesterday.",
    ["不错，看来你已经适应和掌控了这股力量。"] = "Not bad. It seems you have adapted to and mastered this power.",
    ["不错，精彩的比赛，有做拳击手的潜力。"] = "Not bad, a wonderful match, you have the potential to be a boxer.",
    ["不错，还有呢。"] = "Not bad, what else?",
    ["不错，这就是初步的窥密之眼，不愧是“占卜家”，只比我当初差一点点。"] = "Not bad, this is the preliminary Spirit Vision. As expected of a \"Seer,\" only slightly worse than I was back then.",
    ["不错，那我们开始今天的课程——制作符咒。"] = "Not bad, then let's start today's lesson—making charms.",
    ["不限"] = "Unlimited",
    ["不限性别"] = "Any gender",
    ["不限次"] = "Unlimited",
    ["不隐藏Mesh名称列表"] = "Mesh Name List Not to Hide",
    ["不需要"] = "Not needed",
    ["不需要  →"] = "No need →",
    ["不需要了"] = "No longer needed",
    ["不需要的话，填0；填了攻击ID不是指执行相应的Attack；而是为了播一下对应Attack对应的攻击特效；不需要的话，填0"] = "If not needed, fill in 0; filling in an attack ID does not mean executing the corresponding Attack, but rather playing the attack effect corresponding to that Attack; if not needed, fill in 0.",
    ["不需要，不喜欢？这都是你们自己买的呀！"] = "Don't need it, don't like it? You bought these yourselves!",
    ["不需要，不需要！本来收租就烦，离我远点！"] = "No, no! Rent collection is annoying enough as it is, stay away from me!",
    ["不需要，孩子。在教堂，你不需要做那些危险的工作。直到杰姆好起来之前，你们都可以安心地呆在这里。"] = "No, child. In the cathedral, you don't need to do that kind of dangerous work. You can stay here safely until Jem gets better.",
    ["不需要，谢谢。"] = "No, thank you.",
    ["不靠谱的……"] = "Unreliable...",
    ["不！"] = "No!",
    ["不！——如果失去了我的秀发，变成一个秃头，我活着还有什么意义！"] = "No!—If I lose my beautiful hair and become bald, what meaning is there left in my life!",
    ["不！不——！这一切……不会结束的……！神明……终将回归于这片大地……！"] = "No! No—! All of this... will not end...! The gods... will eventually return to this land...!",
    ["不！不可能！生下你，教派就放弃了我……你是真实存在的！"] = "No! Impossible! After giving birth to you, the sect abandoned me... you are real!",
    ["不！不带食物回去，大家都会变成怪物！不！"] = "No! If we don't bring food back, everyone will turn into monsters! No!",
    ["不！不是我！怎么可能是我！我没有理由杀害老爷啊！"] = "No! It wasn't me! How could it be me! I have no reason to kill the Master!",
    ["不！不是的！那个吻和他们没有任何关系！"] = "No! That's not it! That kiss had nothing to do with them!",
    ["不！不要！"] = "No! Don't!",
    ["不！为什么，为什么我们出生就注定要背负这样的诅咒，要亲手终结自己父母的生命？"] = "No! Why, why are we destined to bear such a curse from birth, and to have to end our parents' lives with our own hands?",
    ["不！我一天见不到毛球心就要碎了，你再去多贴几张告示。"] = "No! My heart will break if I don't see Fur Ball for a day. Go put up more notices.",
    ["不！我的资本！那是合法的！你们这群……野蛮的强盗！！"] = "No! My capital! That is legal! You bunch of... barbaric robbers!!",
    ["不！我的钱！我的钱！！！我的钱！！！！！"] = "No! My money! My money!!! My money!!!!!",
    ["不！我离开莉莉会失去对生活的热爱……吉娜离开我会发疯，她们两个我都无法放弃。"] = "No! If I leave Lily, I will lose my love for life... If Gina leaves me, I will go crazy. I cannot give up either of them.",
    ["不！爷爷！爷爷还在下面！本杰明哥哥……"] = "No! Grandpa! Grandpa is still downstairs! Brother Benjamin...",
    ["不！黛西……她还在等我教她做苹果派……"] = "No! Daisy... she is still waiting for me to teach her how to make apple pie...",
    ["不，{{先生|女士}}，我们就是从济贫院被他买走的……我不要回到那样的地方，他们只想着把孩子卖掉，根本不会关心卖给什么样的人！"] = "No, {{ Mr. | Ms. } }, we were bought from the poorhouse by him... I don't want to go back to a place like that. They only think about selling children; they don't care at all what kind of person they're being sold to!",
    ["不，一定不要"] = "No, definitely not",
    ["不，一杯不够，最起码要三杯！"] = "No, one glass isn't enough; at least three!",
    ["不，不会是海岸线餐厅。海岸线餐厅以南部美食闻名，而南威尔红酒产自北方的鲁恩王国，到海岸线餐厅喝南威尔红葡萄酒并不合适……"] = "No, it wouldn't be the Coastline Restaurant. The Coastline Restaurant is famous for southern cuisine, while Southwell wine is produced in the northern Loen Kingdom. It's not appropriate to drink Southwell red wine at the Coastline Restaurant...",
    ["不，不可垂怜于我！女神，请您忘记我的祷告吧！"] = "No, do not have mercy on me! Goddess, please forget my prayer!",
    ["不，不太能……"] = "No, not really...",
    ["不，不对。这是罗塞尔大帝日记里的字符。"] = "No, that's not right. These are characters from Emperor Roselle's diary.",
    ["不，不我要先学习这些知识，有了知识才不会被时代淘汰。"] = "No, no, I must learn this knowledge first. Only with knowledge will I not be left behind by the times.",
    ["不，不是你想的那样！"] = "No, it's not what you think!",
    ["不，不是占卜的问题，是我高估了队长的记忆力……"] = "No, it's not a problem with the divination; it's that I overestimated the Captain's memory...",
    ["不，不是这样，相反，现在的日子要好得多，我得到了一大笔遗产。"] = "No, it's not like that. On the contrary, life now is much better, I received a large inheritance.",
    ["不，不是那个意思……"] = "No, that's not what I meant...",
    ["不，不行。这太不符合规则了……或许翻窗户更悄无声息一点。"] = "No, that won't do. It's too against the rules... Perhaps climbing through the window would be quieter.",
    ["不，不要！这些东西，我准备了半年！"] = "No, don't! I've been preparing these things for half a year!",
    ["不，不，女士，高歌是指这种蘑菇从离开盆栽开始就会高声唱歌，哪怕是被臼齿咀嚼、被咽进胃袋，也绝对不会停止！"] = "No, no, madam, \"Singing\" refers to the fact that this mushroom will sing loudly from the moment it leaves the pot, and even if it is chewed by molars or swallowed into the stomach, it will absolutely not stop!",
    ["不，不，我要先学习这些知识，有了知识才不会被时代淘汰。"] = "No, no, I must learn this knowledge first. Only with knowledge will I not be eliminated by the era.",
    ["不，不，那危险的东西就在城堡的废墟里，等待人放松警惕，等我们以为安全了，然后就会……杀了所有人！"] = "No, no, that dangerous thing is in the ruins of the castle, waiting for people to let their guard down. Once we think we're safe, then it will... kill everyone!",
    ["不，为了小黛西，为了小黛西！"] = "No, for little Daisy, for little Daisy!",
    ["不，亲爱的，你比我要年轻整整两个月呢，我才是不中用的老头子！"] = "No, my dear, you are two whole months younger than me, I'm the one who's useless, the old man!",
    ["不，亲爱的，我是真心爱你的！"] = "No, my dear, I truly love you!",
    ["不，他会回来的。我已经报案了，警察会找到他的。"] = "No, he will be back. I have already reported it to the police, they will find him.",
    ["不，他只是一个租客。这个房间每周要3苏勒10便士，我妻子糊制1箩火柴盒才能拿到2.25便士。"] = "No, he's just a tenant. This room costs 3 shillings and 10 pence a week, and my wife only gets 2.25 pence for pasting 1 basket of matchboxes.",
    ["不，他和他父亲不一样。他是个很体贴、很讨人喜欢的孩子。"] = "No, he is not like his father. He is a very considerate and likable child.",
    ["不，他很喜欢讲冷笑话。尤其是关于以前的房东弗兰奇先生的。"] = "No, he likes telling dad jokes. Especially about our former landlord, Mr. Frank.",
    ["不，你不能带走它。没有循环空间，小黛西会死，她会死！"] = "No, you cannot take it away. Without the cycle space, little Daisy will die, she will die!",
    ["不，你刚才已经打破小黛西的循环，她会一步步走向死亡。"] = "No, you have already broken little Daisy's loop, and she will move toward death step by step.",
    ["不，你刚才已经打破小黛西的循环，她会走向死亡。"] = "No, you have already broken little Daisy's loop, and she will move toward death.",
    ["不，你想错了……"] = "No, you're wrong...",
    ["不，你是伟大的先驱，真理的起源，文明中徘徊的幽灵，一切疯癫的尽头——愚、人、号！"] = "No, you are the great pioneer, the origin of truth, the ghost wandering in civilization, the end of all madness—The Fool!",
    ["不，你的样子很美，艾拉女士。"] = "No, you look beautiful, Ms. Ella.",
    ["不，你的解释不对！"] = "No, your explanation is wrong!",
    ["不，先生！不要！"] = "No, sir! Don't!",
    ["不，卢瑟，你不能放弃。再多问几次，总会成功的。"] = "No, Luther, you can't give up. Ask a few more times, and you'll succeed eventually.",
    ["不，卢瑟，我没有时间可以浪费。"] = "No, Luther, I don't have time to waste.",
    ["不，危机正在酝酿，廷根正面临毁灭的危险。"] = "No, a crisis is brewing, and Tingen is facing the danger of destruction.",
    ["不，只差一点了，只差一点了！"] = "No, it's almost done, just a little bit more!",
    ["不，只是对你这位眉头紧皱小姐如此。现在眉头松开了，也更好看了。"] = "No, only to a lady with a furrowed brow like you. Now that your brow has relaxed, you look even better.",
    ["不，因为它好像就……窝在你后面啊……\n<P_Heart>（这种水平真的适合当私家侦探吗？）</>"] = "No, because it seems to be... curled up right behind you... \n <P_Heart> (Is this level really suitable for being a private detective?) </>",
    ["不，在现实世界我有很多身份，你如果想找我，可以去鲁恩慈善基金会。至于心理治疗，这是“观众”途径的非凡能力。"] = "No, I have many identities in the real world. If you want to find me, you can go to the Loen Charity Foundation. As for psychotherapy, this is an Extraordinary ability of the 'Spectator' pathway.",
    ["不，多半会被评估定级，成为封印物。幸好它的负面影响并不严重，经过一些处理，也可以完全避免。"] = "No, it will most likely be evaluated and classified as a Sealed Artifact. Fortunately, its negative effects are not severe, and with some processing, they can be completely avoided.",
    ["不，女士，我没有质疑……只是听说很少有人见过斯帕罗先生。"] = "No, ma'am, I am not questioning... it's just that I've heard very few people have seen Mr. Sparrow.",
    ["不，她非常警惕，也很强大……至少是序列7的非凡者，追她需要花费一些时间。"] = "No, she is very vigilant and also very powerful... at least a Sequence 7 Extraordinary. It will take some time to track her.",
    ["不，妈妈！你们害死了妈妈！"] = "No, Mama! You killed Mama!",
    ["不，它是我们唯一的希望，你不能带走它！"] = "No, it is our only hope, you cannot take it away!",
    ["不，安东尼，今天是我们所有人共同的生日。"] = "No, Anthony, today is our collective birthday.",
    ["不，您肯定知道，我看见您从那边走过！伊迪斯，快！"] = "No, you definitely do, I saw you walking past there! Edith, quick!",
    ["不，我……养了一只很像章鱼的宠物，它就像我的家人一样，所以我不太想烹饪和它很像同类的章鱼，所有用到章鱼的菜品，都从菜单上撤下了。"] = "No, I... have a pet that looks like an octopus. It's like family to me, so I don't really want to cook octopuses that are similar to it. All dishes using octopus have been removed from the menu.",
    ["不，我一直都是这么年轻。你要买多少面包？"] = "No, I've always been this young. How much bread do you want to buy?",
    ["不，我不同意这么做！"] = "No, I don't agree with doing that!",
    ["不，我不想"] = "No, I don't want to",
    ["不，我不是堕落的肉身。"] = "No, I am not a corrupted flesh.",
    ["不，我不是戈多，我来错了。"] = "No, I am not Godot, I came to the wrong place.",
    ["不，我不是邪恶的怪胎。"] = "No, I am not an evil freak.",
    ["不，我不能就这样沉沦……我需要一个能理解我的人。对，去找玛格丽特吧，她总是那么温柔体贴。也许……也许她才是命运为我安排的那个人。"] = "No, I cannot just sink like this... I need someone who can understand me. Yes, I should go find Margaret; she is always so gentle and considerate. Perhaps... perhaps she is the one fate has arranged for me.",
    ["不，我不能想起来，我得忘记。下个月，再从山下出发……"] = "No, I cannot remember. I must forget. Next month, I will start from the foot of the mountain again...",
    ["不，我们只是用火祛除她身上的邪异。"] = "No, we are just using fire to remove the evil from her.",
    ["不，我原本想在这里见到我的女儿，然后告诉她，我已经等到了我一直等待的，不需要更多了，一面就已经足够了。而现在……"] = "No, I originally wanted to see my daughter here and tell her that I have waited for what I have been waiting for. I don't need anything more; one meeting is enough. But now...",
    ["不，我可能知道，你刚才提到<P_Yellow>南威尔红葡萄酒</>对吧？"] = "No, I might know. You mentioned <P_Yellow> South Will Red Wine </> just now, right?",
    ["不，我并不为此感到伤心。那些记忆很久远，而且，那时的我人性淡漠，对这一切并没有真切的感知。"] = "No, I don't feel sad about that. Those memories are very distant, and at that time, my humanity was indifferent, so I didn't have a real perception of all this.",
    ["不，我很抱歉最初隐瞒了我的目的，但你对工厂做出的种种举措我十分认可。你所做的事情究竟意味着什么，和我去街上看看吧。"] = "No, I am sorry for hiding my purpose initially, but I highly approve of the various measures you have taken for the factory. Come with me to the street to see what your actions actually mean.",
    ["不，我想去贝克兰德，或者是特里尔。"] = "No, I want to go to Backlund, or perhaps Trier.",
    ["不，我收获了满肚子的气。"] = "No, I gained a belly full of anger.",
    ["不，我明白……我想自己去做。"] = "No, I understand... I want to do it myself.",
    ["不，我是女神虔诚的信徒，只是我害怕女神再次满足我的愿望。"] = "No, I am a devout believer of the Goddess, it's just that I'm afraid the Goddess will satisfy my wishes again.",
    ["不，我是想弄清楚残影是什么，防止这里有非凡力量外泄。看来，您也是非凡者？"] = "No, I want to find out what the remnant shadow is to prevent any Extraordinary power from leaking here. It seems you are also a Beyonder?",
    ["不，我是说那个脏兮兮的搬运工长得和比尔一模一样！"] = "No, I mean that dirty porter looks exactly like Bill!",
    ["不，我根本不知道她是谁。"] = "No, I have no idea who she is.",
    ["不，我的重点，我的意思是，阁下，我该怎样做才能成为非凡者？"] = "No, my point—what I mean is, Your Excellency, what must I do to become a Beyonder?",
    ["不，我负责部分采购和情报工作。"] = "No, I am responsible for some procurement and intelligence work.",
    ["不，我还能继续。"] = "No, I can continue.",
    ["不，拜托……我找遍廷根才买到这个，它对我真的很重要！"] = "No, please... I searched all over Tingen to buy this; it really means a lot to me!",
    ["不，是我的文案被偷了。"] = "No, my document was stolen.",
    ["不，是祂。祂告诉我，这样能控制顾客的欲望。"] = "No, it was Him. He told me that this could control the customers' desires.",
    ["不，最后木马骑士倒下了，他的盔甲周围开出了白色的小花。"] = "No, in the end, the Wooden Horse Knight fell, and small white flowers bloomed around his armor.",
    ["不，污染还没有彻底消失——画的深处还藏着什么东西！"] = "No, the corruption hasn't completely disappeared—there is still something hidden deep within the painting!",
    ["不，泽维尔也许只是……赛弗拉，再陪我等等吧，好吗……？"] = "No, Xavier is perhaps just... Sephra, wait with me a little longer, okay...?",
    ["不，现在不是打安全牌的时候。万一咒文指向别人，那乐子可就大了……"] = "No, now is not the time to play it safe. If the incantation points to someone else, that would be a huge joke...",
    ["不，琳达，不是这样的……"] = "No, Linda, it's not like that...",
    ["不，给我一点时间。我需要……冷静一下。一杯酒就好，我保证。"] = "No, give me a moment. I need to... calm down. Just a glass of wine, I promise.",
    ["不，维克罗尔先生只是一个普通的商人。而且解救的事情，他相信警察们更加专业。"] = "No, Mr. Vickor is just an ordinary businessman. Besides, regarding the rescue, he believes the police are more professional.",
    ["不，要不是梅丽莎为我即将到来的面试考虑，本来一周才能吃两回肉的……"] = "No, if it weren't for Melissa considering my upcoming interview, we would only have meat twice a week...",
    ["不，警局只是戒严，而且下了死命令，只能站岗不能动手，议院治安队的人自己在处理。"] = "No, the police station is just under martial law, and they've given a strict order: stand guard only, do not intervene. The Parliament Security Force is handling it themselves.",
    ["不，说抱歉的应该是我才对。这不是什么听了会让人微笑的故事。"] = "No, I should be the one saying sorry. This isn't a story that makes people smile.",
    ["不，费内波特的国王才是！"] = "No, the King of Feysac is!",
    ["不，还是有共同点的。"] = "No, there are still commonalities.",
    ["不，还需要灵性……我有了新的思路！"] = "No, it also requires spirituality... I have a new idea!",
    ["不，这不太礼貌。呃……我能请问一下，是关于什么的报告吗？"] = "No, that's not very polite. Uh... may I ask what the report is about?",
    ["不，这并不是我厉害，而是因为我所卖的材料。"] = "No, it's not that I'm impressive, but because of the materials I sell.",
    ["不，这应该是画中的幻象……我、我被困在了画里？"] = "No, this must be an illusion within the painting... Am I, am I trapped in the painting?",
    ["不，这是个好结局。"] = "No, this is a good ending.",
    ["不，这是必须的。你想想，你还愿意住现在的公寓吗？连盥洗室都要和好几户公用，而且……"] = "No, this is necessary. Think about it, are you still willing to live in your current apartment? Even the washroom has to be shared with several households, and besides...",
    ["不，这栋宅子还在，那位老爷的后人也还在。"] = "No, this house is still here, and the descendants of that master are still here.",
    ["不，那是关于斯蒂姆宫的知识洪流……"] = "No, that is the Torrent of Knowledge regarding the Steam Palace...",
