    ["与势力积分第一名的势力相差<Highlight>3000</>势力积分的势力会被视为劣势势力，可以获得以下机制辅助\n<Highlight>绊马索</>，每过<Highlight>5分钟</>，劣势势力广场前将会投放绊马索道具，只有本势力非凡者可以拾取，拾取后获得特殊技能，对骑士使用可以减速骑士。\n<Highlight>集合传送</>，每过<Highlight>8分钟</>，劣势势力广场将会开启集合机制，需要<Highlight>1名</>非凡者前往广场区域激活，成功激活后该势力所有非凡者可以传送至广场区域并获得强力buff。"] = "Factions with a difference of <Highlight> 3000 </> faction points from the top-ranked faction are considered disadvantaged factions and can receive the following mechanism support: \n <Highlight> Tripwire </>: Every <Highlight> 5 minutes </>, a Tripwire item will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza. Only Beyonders of this faction can pick it up. After picking it up, they gain a Special Skill that can be used against Knights to Slow them. \n <Highlight> Group Teleport </>: Every <Highlight> 8 minutes </>, a gathering mechanism will be activated at the disadvantaged faction's plaza. It requires <Highlight> 1 </> Beyonder to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successfully activated, all Beyonders of that faction can Teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.",
