    ["与誓约一起游玩各玩法获得的硬币，可以在誓约商店中进行兑换。"] = "Coins obtained by playing various game modes with a Covenant can be exchanged in the Covenant Shop.",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n与誓约对象组队参与乌托邦剧院双人模式，会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章，玩法中还会有额外能力加成。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Form a team with your Oath partner to complete various daily activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. Oath Points can be used to automatically increase your Oath Level. \n There are multiple Oath Levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching specified levels. \n A Beyonder can earn a maximum of 600 Oath Points per day with a single Oath partner, and a maximum of 2000 per week. Participate in designated activities while teamed up with your Oath partner to earn additional Companion Emblems. \n Teaming up with your Oath partner for the Utopia Theater Duo Mode will grant more Oath Points and Companion Emblems, along with additional ability bonuses during the activity. \n Companion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Oath-related rewards require your Oath Level to meet specific requirements). \n Beyonders can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Oath partner. Beyonders can change their own character's actions (you cannot edit the other person's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \n Beyonders can apply for a solo Oath dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can Cancel the dissolution. \n Beyonders can also team up to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Oath dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Soules at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Oath. During the cooling-off period, both parties can Cancel the dissolution.",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入乌托邦剧院，可提升至副本达标评分，还会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量绑定苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nBeyonders can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nBeyonders can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nBeyonders can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nBeyonders can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
    ["与誓约组队完成各类日常玩法即可获得誓约值与同行纹章，誓约值可用于自动提升誓约等级。\n誓约等级共设多级，达到指定等级可领取等级奖励。\n非凡者每日与单个誓约最多可获取600誓约值，每周最多可获取2000誓约值。与誓约对象组队参与指定活动，还可额外获得同行纹章。\n双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入乌托邦剧院，可提升至副本达标评分，还会获得更多誓约值与同行纹章。\n同行纹章可用于在同行商店购买物品（誓约相关的奖励需要与誓约的等级达到指定要求）。\n非凡者可点击更换展台，进入与对应誓约对象的主页编辑功能，非凡者可更换自己角色的动作（不可编辑对方的），更换双人主页的展台，摆放摆件。\n非凡者可以在萨默尔太太处申请单人解契，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间发起申请的非凡者可以取消解契。\n非凡者也可组队前往萨默尔太太处申请双人解除解约，申请后会开始为期24小时的冷静期，冷静期结束后可以正式在萨默尔太太处缴纳少量苏勒解除誓约，冷静期间双方可以取消解契。"] = "Forming a team with a Covenant partner to complete various daily activities can earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase the Covenant level. \nThere are multiple Covenant levels, and you can claim level rewards upon reaching the specified level. \nBeyonders can obtain a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner, and a maximum of 2000 Covenant Points per week. Forming a team with a Covenant partner to participate in designated activities can also earn additional Companion Emblems. \nIn duo mode, entering the Utopia Theater with a Covenant partner can increase the dungeon standard score and also earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require the Covenant level to reach the specified requirements). \nBeyonders can click to change the display stand to enter the homepage editing function with the corresponding Covenant partner. Beyonders can change their character's actions (cannot edit the other party's), change the display stand on the duo homepage, and place ornaments. \nBeyonders can apply for a solo Covenant dissolution at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution. \nBeyonders can also form a team to go to Mrs. Sammer's to apply for a duo Covenant dissolution. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. After the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of Sul at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
