    ["专属"] = "Exclusive",
    ["专属于你的潜意识梦境训练场，变幻莫测的地图，小规模战斗训练的绝佳场所。"] = "Your exclusive subconscious dream training ground. With ever-changing maps, it is the perfect place for small-scale combat training.",
