    ["专有名词"] = "Terminology",
    ["专治疑难杂症，诊金低廉，医术高超！\n\n现<Highlight>主治病症</>包括但不限于：\n\n<Highlight>止小儿夜啼</>、<Highlight>治挑食多动</>、<Highlight>助力智力发育</>、\n<Highlight>祛痘除癣</>、<Highlight>清除腋下足底异味</>、<Highlight>防治瘟疫</>、\n<Highlight>老鼠害虫扑杀</>、<Highlight>野猫野狗驱逐</>、<Highlight>住家环境布置</>、\n<Highlight>菜园杂草清除</>、<Highlight>廷根市再就业培训</>等。\n\n行医四十年，业务纯熟，值得信赖！"] = "Specializing in difficult and miscellaneous diseases, low consultation fees, superb medical skills! \n\n Current <Highlight> main treatable conditions </> include but are not limited to: \n\n<Highlight> Stop children's night crying </>, <Highlight> treat picky eating and hyperactivity </>, <Highlight> assist intellectual development </>, \n<Highlight> remove acne and ringworm </>, <Highlight> clear underarm and foot odor </>, <Highlight> prevent and treat plague </>, \n<Highlight> rat and pest extermination </>, <Highlight> stray cat and dog expulsion </>, <Highlight> home environment arrangement </>, \n<Highlight> vegetable garden weed removal </>, <Highlight> Tingen City re-employment training </>, etc. \n\n Forty years of medical practice, skilled in business, trustworthy!",
    ["专注"] = "Focus",
    ["专注的"] = "Focused",
    ["专用于裁启信封的短刀。珐琅柄身以金丝嵌制，华美而繁复。"] = "A short knife specifically for opening envelopes. The enamel handle is inlaid with gold thread, gorgeous and complex.",
    ["专用邮筒"] = "Dedicated Mailbox",
    ["专研"] = "Specialization",
    ["专门用于筛选出马车"] = "Specifically used to filter out Carriage",
    ["且"] = "And",
    ["世"] = "World",
    ["世上最美好的姑娘。如果当初我没有在街头搭讪其他姑娘，她就不会离开我，而我，也不会如此追悔莫及……"] = "The most beautiful girl in the world. If I hadn't hit on other girls on the street back then, she wouldn't have left me, and I wouldn't be so full of regret...",
    ["世上竟然有这么巧的事情。"] = "I can't believe there's such a coincidence in the world.",
    ["世事无常啊……"] = "The world is impermanent...",
    ["世事无常啊……之前总看到汉特夫妻俩笑眯眯地坐在店里。"] = "Life is unpredictable... I used to always see the Hunter couple sitting in the shop with smiles on their faces.",
    ["世代效忠威瑟尔家族的文森特，在庄园遇袭之夜启动了先祖铠甲，铠甲却被未知污染侵蚀，反过来屠尽了庄园。绝望中，他发现海伦娜还活着。她是唯一的幸存者，她不知道铠甲失控的真相。文森特咽下了坦白与忏悔，发誓用余生弥补。他将铠甲封锁，独自追查仇敌与污染源头，为获取力量不择手段。直到某人告诉他“知识皇冠”的存在，他看见了希望。\n“知识就是力量。”"] = "Vincent, who had served the Wetherell family for generations, activated the Ancestor Armor on the night the manor was attacked, but the armor was eroded by unknown corruption and turned to slaughter the manor in return. In despair, he discovered that Helena was still alive. She was the only survivor, and she did not know the truth about the armor's loss of control. Vincent swallowed his confession and repentance, vowing to spend the rest of his life making amends. He sealed the armor and pursued the enemies and the source of the corruption alone, stopping at nothing to gain power. Until someone told him about the existence of the 'Crown of Knowledge,' he saw hope. \n \"Knowledge is Power.\"",
    ["世代服务于威瑟尔家族的管家文森特，每一任都会使用这个名字，至今已是第三十七任。"] = "Butler Vincent, who has served the Wessel family for generations; every successor uses this name, and he is now the thirty-seventh.",
