    ["两个人一起调查会更快，毕竟孩子们等不了太久。"] = "Investigating together will be faster. After all, the children can't wait too long.",
    ["两个伯爵像发情的孔雀似的围着她转……我倒是好奇，这丫头究竟有什么魅力，听说她连自己的店都是别人送的。"] = "Two counts circling her like peacocks in heat... I'm curious, what charm does this girl have? I heard she didn't even buy her own shop.",
