    ["两个土豆"] = "Two potatoes",
    ["两个学生越走越远，消失在街道的尽头……"] = "The two students walk further and further away, disappearing at the end of the street...",
    ["两个小丑搭档还算有意思，喏，赏你五个便士！"] = "Two Clown partners are quite interesting, here, have five pennies!",
    ["两个小时后……"] = "Two hours later...",
    ["两个异变物质的聚合将在后续版本开放，敬请期待！"] = "The aggregation of two mutated substances will be opened in future versions. Please look forward to it!",
    ["两个征服之碑均被任意进攻方占领后，战争之门开启。"] = "Once both Banners of Conquest are occupied by any attacking side, the Gate of War will open.",
    ["两个游人坐在小船里"] = "Two tourists sitting in a small boat",
    ["两个调查，切换描述"] = "Two investigations, switch descriptions",
    ["两个醉汉愈吵愈烈……"] = "The two drunks are arguing more and more intensely...",
    ["两个问题的答案一次在占卜桌的椅子上，一次在桌面……<P_Yellow>线索似乎仍然在指向占卜这件事</>？"] = "The answers to the two questions were once on the chair of the divination table, and once on the tabletop... <P_Yellow>The clues seem to still be pointing to the act of divination</>?",
    ["两人"] = "Two people",
    ["两人中景镜头"] = "Two-person medium shot",
    ["两人侧面"] = "Two people side view",
    ["两人就这样消失了"] = "The two of them just disappeared like that",
    ["两人正视"] = "Two people front view",
    ["两人正视01"] = "Two people front view 01",
    ["两人的告解不断浮现……"] = "The two's confessions keep emerging...",
    ["两人观众"] = "Two people audience",
    ["两人过渡"] = "Two people transition",
    ["两件套\r\n进入战斗时,为自身增加400点格挡,持续3秒"] = "2-piece set\nUpon entering combat, gain 400 points of Block for 3 seconds.",
    ["两份银白的魔药，两个新生的“观众”。"] = "Two silver-white potions, two newborn \"Spectators\".",
    ["两位大人的慷慨真让我惶恐……"] = "The generosity of you two lords truly makes me anxious...",
    ["两位客人有什么需要吗？可以回到位置上叫我们服务。"] = "Do the two guests need anything? You can call us for service from your seats.",
    ["两位小姐，能占用一下您们的时间吗？"] = "Two ladies, could I take a moment of your time?",
    ["两位有选定的花束吗？"] = "Do you two have a chosen bouquet?",
    ["两位真幸福啊，祝你们新婚快乐！"] = "You two are truly happy. Wishing you a happy marriage!",
    ["两位，黄水晶房目前空着，请随我来。"] = "Both of you, the Yellow Crystal Room is currently free, please follow me.",
    ["两侧战争石碑均被占领，前去攻打城门！"] = "Both War Steles have been captured; go and attack the city gate!",
    ["两侧石碑均占领，可攻击城门"] = "Both stone tablets captured, you can attack the city gate",
    ["两千五百八十三年间，被神遗弃的黑暗之民，生活在宿命的诅咒之中。"] = "For two thousand five hundred and eighty-three years, the dark people abandoned by God have lived under the curse of fate.",
    ["两千多年里，正神从未垂怜过我们。黑暗里只有祂回应了我，带来了……希望。"] = "For over two thousand years, the true gods have never shown mercy to us. Only He responded to me in the darkness, bringing... hope.",
    ["两千苏勒一磅。"] = "Two thousand Sol per pound.",
    ["两只一苏勒，先生，上不封顶，多多益善！"] = "Two for one soule, sir, no limit, the more the better!",
    ["两只小猫"] = "Two kittens",
    ["两只小猫都好可爱……"] = "Both kittens are so cute...",
    ["两名非凡者集合！将于身前密契门径！"] = "Two Beyonders gather! A secret path will be formed in front of you!",
    ["两周八金镑，还包吃住，这些钱够去趟贝克兰德了。"] = "Eight pounds for two weeks, including room and board. This money is enough to go to Backlund.",
    ["两周前这里死了一个流浪汉，这琴声就是从那之后出现的。"] = "A homeless man died here two weeks ago, and this piano music has appeared ever since.",
    ["两居室"] = "Two-Bedroom Apartment",
    ["两居室的房租是每周5苏勒6便士，相信我，这是全廷根市最划算的公寓！"] = "The rent for a two-bedroom apartment is 5 soli and 6 pence per week, believe me, this is the most cost-effective apartment in all of Tingen!",
    ["两年前的战争里，要不是教会那位枢机主教出手，我们早就喂鱼了。"] = "In the war two years ago, if it weren't for that Cardinal from the Church, we would have been fish food long ago.",
    ["两年前，我邀请贝儿小姐共度美好的一夜，却狠狠挨了她一巴掌。"] = "Two years ago, I invited Miss Belle to spend a wonderful night together, but I was slapped hard for it.",
    ["两年后……第五纪，1354年。"] = "Two years later... Fifth Epoch, 1354.",
    ["两年多了，海上的状况瞬息万变，不清楚下一次什么时候能靠岸。平时，辛苦你照顾阿尔伯特了。"] = "More than two years. Conditions at sea change rapidly; it's unclear when we can dock next time. Thank you for taking care of Albert all this time.",
    ["两张票可真是用了不少钱…也不知还要再多送多少封信，才能攒出下一份4苏勒零8便士…"] = "Two tickets really cost a lot... I don't know how many more letters I'll have to deliver to save up the next 4 shillings and 8 pence...",
    ["两张票的价格可不少，你多少天没休息好了？"] = "The price of two tickets isn't small. How many days have you not rested well?",
    ["两张菜单"] = "Two menus",
    ["两扇铁门"] = "Two Iron Gates",
    ["两把剑是可以一起带进村子的……我们当初成功过……方法藏在我家的屋顶……"] = "Two swords can be brought into the village together... we succeeded once before... the method is hidden on the roof of my house...",
    ["两把大剑收集完毕，可以去探查城堡·归一之庭了，或许那里有回归现实的方法。（提示：乘上滑轨，快速抵达城堡门前。）"] = "Both greatswords have been collected. You can now go to investigate the Castle of the Court of Convergence; perhaps there is a way to return to reality there. (Hint: Board the rail to reach the castle gate quickly.)",
    ["两拳？竟然两拳就打倒了布雷德？"] = "Two punches? She actually knocked out Blade in just two punches?",
    ["两枚一大一小的厚实齿轮，可以用于火车升级"] = "Two thick gears, one large and one small, can be used for train upgrades.",
