    ["丹尼·"] = "Danny ",
    ["丹尼卡"] = "Danica",
    ["丹尼尔"] = "Daniel",
    ["丹尼尔·"] = "Daniel ",
    ["丹尼斯"] = "Dennis",
    ["丹尼斯(废弃)"] = "Dennis (Discarded)",
    ["丹尼斯·"] = "Dennis ",
    ["丹尼斯再次出现"] = "Dennis Appears Again",
    ["丹尼斯想靠引咎辞职躲避更大的风险，真是个胆小鬼。"] = "Dennis wants to avoid greater risks by resigning; what a coward.",
    ["丹总是爱说别人闲话，好像最近越来越爱说了，但只是偷偷嘀咕，倒也没有大声宣扬……"] = "Dan always loves to gossip about others, it seems he's been doing it more often lately, but he only mutters secretly, he hasn't been shouting it out loud...",
    ["丹移动路径"] = "Dan's Movement Path",
    ["丹移动路径2"] = "Dan Movement Path 2",
    ["丹移动路径3"] = "Dan Movement Path 3",
    ["为\r\n什\r\n么\r\n？"] = "W\r\nh\r\ny\r\n?",
    ["为%s赠送了%s×%s，%s"] = "Gifted %s × %s to %s, %s.",
    ["为<h>丹尼斯</>占卜"] = "Divination for <h>Dennis</>",
    ["为<h>年轻男女</>"] = "For the <h>young man and woman</>",
    ["为<h>玛丽</>占卜"] = "Divination for <h>Mary</>",
    ["为<h>老约翰</>占卜"] = "Divination for <h>Old John</>",
    ["为true时，反伤伤害不会触发该event"] = "When true, Damage Reflection damage will not trigger this event",
    ["为上层贵族年轻人量身打造的敞篷双座车，开着它出城兜风，是每一位少爷小姐的周末习惯。"] = "A convertible two-seater tailored for young aristocrats; taking it out of the city for a drive is a weekend habit for every young master and miss.",
    ["为丹尼斯占卜"] = "Divination for Dennis",
    ["为了“愚者”先生……我决定接下这份委托。那么，我要去哪里拍？"] = "For Mr. Fool... I have decided to accept this commission. So, where should I go to take photos?",
    ["为了书里那段推理情节，你知道我掉了多少根头发，失了多少次眠吗？"] = "For that reasoning plot in the book, do you know how many hairs I lost and how many times I suffered from insomnia?",
    ["为了你，无论是高墙还是深渊，我都愿意越过。"] = "For you, whether it's a high wall or an abyss, I am willing to cross it.",
    ["为了原始而野性的异域风情，我们还特地保留了手工的痕迹。"] = "For that primitive and wild exotic flair, we have specifically preserved the traces of handcrafting.",
    ["为了及时发现队友被2-049控制，值夜者小队集体做屈臂伸展动作，于是出现了很有画面感的值夜者尬舞团。"] = "To detect teammates controlled by 2-049 in time, the Nighthawks squad collectively performed arm extension stretches, resulting in a very vivid Nighthawks awkward dance troupe.",
    ["为了可爱的因蒂斯，我愿把荣誉丢弃"] = "For lovely Intis, I am willing to discard honor",
    ["为了和想要守护的人并肩作战，你必须学习比想象中更多得多的知识，变得更强。"] = "To fight side by side with the people you want to guard, you must learn much more knowledge than you imagine and become stronger.",
    ["为了回味……您唇上的温度。"] = "To savor... the temperature of your lips.",
    ["为了在春天重逢……这不是很会说话吗？"] = "To meet again in spring... he's quite good with words, isn't he?",
    ["为了家人！为了明天！"] = "For my family! For tomorrow!",
    ["为了家人！为了未来！"] = "For family! For the future!",
    ["为了家族的荣耀，前进！"] = "For the glory of the family, advance!",
    ["为了庆祝？"] = "To celebrate?",
    ["为了我的安全，邓恩先生邀请我加入他们，成为值夜者的一员。"] = "For my safety, Mr. Dunn invited me to join them and become a member of the Nighthawks.",
    ["为了我的小萝拉能平安生活。"] = "For my little Lola to live in peace.",
    ["为了支持原来template的timer类型特意加的事件"] = "Event added specifically to support the timer type of the original template",
    ["为了方便您在不同的场合欣赏这些雕像。手掌尺寸，书桌尺寸和展柜尺寸都可供您选择。"] = "To make it convenient for you to appreciate these statues on different occasions. Palm-sized, desk-sized, and display-case-sized are all available for you to choose from.",
    ["为了普通人的安全，非凡事件的真相无法公布出去，但我还是希望更多人知道他们的故事。"] = "For the safety of ordinary people, the truth about Beyonder incidents cannot be made public, but I still hope more people know their stories.",
    ["为了更好地理解人类，也为了更好地陪伴奥黛丽。"] = "To better understand humans, and to better accompany Audrey.",
    ["为了权力和力量，我放弃了软弱，一步步爬到了现在的高度。"] = "For power and strength, I gave up my weakness and climbed step by step to the height I am at now.",
    ["为了比星空更崇高，比永恒更久远的黑夜女神……"] = "For the Evernight Goddess, who is more noble than the stars and more eternal than eternity...",
    ["为了活下去，我先开了枪，一击毙命。检查尸体时我才发现，对方也只是个新兵，而他的枪并没有上膛。"] = "To survive, I fired first, killing him instantly. It was only when I checked the body that I realized he was just a new recruit, and his gun wasn't even loaded.",
    ["为了生活"] = "For a living",
    ["为了画外音能完整播的增加步骤"] = "Added steps so the voiceover can play completely",
    ["为了维系济贫院的运转，在这里也有干不完的活，吃的只够保证饿不死。"] = "To maintain the operation of the poorhouse, there is endless work to do here, and the food is only enough to ensure you don't starve to death.",
    ["为了美食"] = "For gourmet food",
    ["为了美食-触发器"] = "For Gourmet - Trigger",
    ["为了获得胜利，各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Highlight>死亡骑士</>。战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名获得不同档次的奖励，通过多次引领<Highlight>死亡骑士</>到达本阵营<Highlight>广场</>，获得大量势力积分，可提前结束战场，获得完胜奖励。\n以俱乐部为单位进行分配，将筛选非凡者人数、活跃度、非凡评分符合要求的俱乐部参与，获得资格的俱乐部非凡者可在以战养战-势力-高原战界面查看赛程安排。"] = "To achieve victory, each faction needs to compete for the <Highlight> Death Knight </> on the central platform of the battlefield. When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the Four Emperors faction points. By leading the <Highlight> Death Knight </> to your faction's <Highlight> plaza </> multiple times, you can obtain a large number of faction points, end the battlefield early, and obtain complete victory rewards. \n Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Beyonders, activity, and Beyonder score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Beyonders can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Plateau Battle interface.",
    ["为了让你们更好地适应非凡世界，“愚者”先生指引我们创立了塔罗学院。"] = "To help you better adapt to the Beyonder world, Mr. Fool guided us to establish the Tarot Academy.",
    ["为了追捕管家，你们来到五月庄园。这里草木繁茂，生机异常蓬勃，依稀可见曾经的富饶。\n这时，一颗鲜艳的苹果猝然掉落，滚至你们眼前。"] = "To hunt down the butler, you arrive at May Manor. The vegetation here is lush, and the vitality is exceptionally vigorous, faintly revealing its former richness. \n Just then, a bright apple suddenly falls and rolls before your eyes.",
    ["为了避免直视星空引发失控，你可以通过观察星象仪内部揭示星空的奥秘，调节旋转和缩放来探寻隐藏的星座。"] = "To avoid loss of control caused by staring directly at the starry sky, you can observe the mysteries of the stars revealed within the planetarium, adjusting rotation and zoom to explore hidden constellations.",
    ["为了避免被注视，需要在“隐秘”的权柄下谈论它。"] = "To avoid being watched, we need to discuss it under the authority of \"Secrecy.\"",
    ["为了那些珠宝……"] = "For the sake of those jewels……",
    ["为了重要的人，谁都可以变勇敢……"] = "For the sake of important people, anyone can become brave...",
    ["为了铁十字街，本杰明·克劳德……必须死。"] = "For the sake of Iron Cross Street, Benjamin Cloud... must die.",
    ["为了集中献祭？"] = "For a concentrated sacrifice?",
    ["为什么NPC好感不涨"] = "Why is NPC favorability not increasing?",
    ["为什么“正义”女士会带着你来办理入学？没有一个新生得到过这样的殊荣。让全知的阿罗德斯来看看答案……"] = "Why would Miss Justice bring you here to enroll? No other freshman has ever received such an honor. Let the omniscient Arrodes see the answer...",
    ["为什么……为什么我的真心换不来回应？也许莉娜从未真正了解过我。"] = "Why... why can't my sincerity be met with a response? Perhaps Lena has never truly understood me.",
    ["为什么……为什么祂的灌输越来越频繁了。"] = "Why... why is His indoctrination becoming more and more frequent?",
    ["为什么……为什么祂的灌输越来越频繁了？"] = "Why... why is His indoctrination becoming more and more frequent?",
    ["为什么……母子感应之类的？"] = "Why... mother-child connection or something?",
    ["为什么一定要我点啊！"] = "Why does it have to be me who lights it!",
    ["为什么一定要赶尽杀绝？你们得到的东西还不够多吗？"] = "Why must you kill them all? Haven't you gotten enough?",
    ["为什么不像其他摊主一样把垃圾留给清洁工呢？"] = "Why not leave the trash for the cleaners like other stall owners?",
    ["为什么不出诊呢……"] = "Why won't you make a house call...",
    ["为什么不卖？"] = "Why not sell it?",
    ["为什么不去富人更多的地区试试呢？那里的人也许会更有兴趣。"] = "Why not try areas with more wealthy people? People there might be more interested.",
    ["为什么不去试试呢？"] = "Why not give it a try?",
    ["为什么不回答爸爸？还是你想让爸爸来帮你决定？"] = "Why aren't you answering Dad? Or do you want Dad to help you decide?",
    ["为什么不在宽敞又明亮的一楼大厅待着呢？"] = "Why not stay in the spacious and bright Hall on the first floor?",
    ["为什么不按照约定付工钱？你明知道这点钱什么都做不了。"] = "Why didn't you pay the wages as agreed? You know full well that this amount of money can't do anything.",
    ["为什么不按照约定付工钱？你明知道那是给杰姆救命用的。"] = "Why didn't you pay the wages as agreed? You know full well that money was for Jem's life-saving treatment.",
    ["为什么不能切换教团"] = "Why can't I switch cults",
    ["为什么不能？"] = "Why not?",
    ["为什么不能？它们的裂纹分岔角度不同，黑点排列，钝端的曲率也有细微差别……这些不都清清楚楚地在那儿吗？ 您不是也看到了吗？"] = "Why not? Their crack patterns have different angles, the arrangement of black spots, the curvature of the blunt end also has subtle differences... aren't these all clearly there? Didn't you see them too?",
    ["为什么不自己写呢？"] = "Why don't you do it yourself?",
    ["为什么不自己给他？"] = "Why don't you give it to him yourself?",
    ["为什么不让劳拉进去？"] = "Why not let Laura in?",
    ["为什么不进俱乐部去找卢瑟呢？"] = "Why not go into the club and find Luther?",
    ["为什么他们会叫它“甜冰茶”呢？"] = "Why would they call it \"Sweet Iced Tea\"?",
    ["为什么他们都……"] = "Why did they both...",
    ["为什么会变成这样？"] = "Why did it turn out like this?",
    ["为什么会有那么多地方要用到纯水？\n我今天已经蒸馏出第几瓶纯水了？我不想再蒸馏纯水了！"] = "Why is there so much need for pure water?\nWhich bottle of pure water have I distilled today? I don't want to distill pure water anymore!",
    ["为什么会这样……克莱恩，他是最好的哥哥……"] = "Why did it turn out like this... Klein, he was the best brother...",
    ["为什么又出现在了纺织厂？"] = "Why did they appear in the textile factory again?",
    ["为什么呢，万一她也不知道说什么，岂不是很尴尬？"] = "Why? What if she doesn't know what to say either? Wouldn't that be awkward?",
    ["为什么呢？"] = "Why?",
    ["为什么呢？变化是什么？"] = "Why? What is the change?",
    ["为什么呢？那种冷雨浸透白鸢尾的调子，哪怕是在鲁恩王室的舞会上也足以令人倾倒！"] = "Why? That scent of cold rain soaking white irises is enough to captivate even at a Loen royal ball!",
    ["为什么图书馆借不到《死灵之书》？"] = "Why can't I borrow the 'Book of Necromancy' from the library?",
    ["为什么在地上睡觉？休息室有更舒服的空间。"] = "Why sleep on the floor? The lounge has more comfortable spaces.",
    ["为什么在这里看书？"] = "Why are you reading here?",
    ["为什么安慰我……你们的戒指都被我扔了！"] = "Why are you comforting me... I threw away your rings!",
    ["为什么得是我遇见这种事？我就这么倒霉吗？"] = "Why does it have to be me who encounters this kind of thing? Am I really that unlucky?",
    ["为什么我的灵感永远会被他早一步想到！"] = "Why is it that my inspiration is always thought of by him a step earlier!",
    ["为什么我非要在这里不可……"] = "Why must I be here...",
    ["为什么扔硬币？"] = "Why flip a coin?",
    ["为什么是“二号”？"] = "Why is it \"Number Two\"?",
    ["为什么是两份？"] = "Why two portions?",
    ["为什么是八十和四十……我试试。"] = "Why forty and eighty... I'll give it a try.",
    ["为什么是安保公司？"] = "Why is it a security company?",
    ["为什么是狼鱼罐头？"] = "Why a can of wolf fish?",
    ["为什么是美梦？"] = "Why is it a sweet dream?",
    ["为什么没人愿意让我的占卜？难道我真的不行吗？"] = "Why is no one willing to let me perform a divination? Am I really that bad at it?",
    ["为什么没有人报警……我的腿，我的腿软了……"] = "Why hasn't anyone called the police... My legs, my legs have gone weak...",
    ["为什么没有关系？"] = "Why wouldn't it have anything to do with me?",
    ["为什么病人越来越多了！"] = "Why are there more and more patients!",
    ["为什么离开大城市？"] = "Why leave the big city?",
    ["为什么突然不租了？他怎么跟你说的？"] = "Why did he suddenly decide not to rent it? What did he say to you?",
    ["为什么菲利普会随身带着你亡夫的怀表？"] = "Why does Philip carry your late husband's pocket watch with him?",
    ["为什么行动值满了不能升级"] = "Why can't I upgrade when action points are full",
    ["为什么要假扮侠盗黑皇帝？"] = "Why pretend to be the Black Emperor?",
    ["为什么要做绑匪 愉快地当文明人不行吗？"] = "Why be a kidnapper? Can't you just be a civilized person?",
    ["为什么要做绑匪，愉快地当文明人不行吗？"] = "Why be a kidnapper? Can't you just happily be a civilized person?",
    ["为什么要去？我甚至不认识他！"] = "Why would I go? I don't even know him!",
    ["为什么要叫我恶魔？"] = "Why call me a demon?",
    ["为什么要告诉我？我是说，坦诚地告诉我一切？"] = "Why tell me? I mean, tell me everything honestly?",
    ["为什么要在这么显眼的地方，挂一张被烧坏的照片？"] = "Why hang a burnt photo in such a conspicuous place?",
    ["为什么要在这里编写，不留在教堂之类的地方？"] = "Why write it here instead of staying in a place like a church?",
    ["为什么要对我这么温柔？您是罗塞尔大帝，整个王国最尊贵的人。而我，只是一个一无所有的寡妇……不敢想象人们会怎么编排您。"] = "Why are you so gentle with me? You are Emperor Roselle, the most noble person in the entire kingdom. And I am just a widow with nothing... I dare not imagine how people would gossip about you.",
    ["为什么要把戏服拿出来卖呢？"] = "Why sell the costumes?",
    ["为什么要逃呢？我要记住你们的样子……"] = "Why are you running? I must remember what you look like...",
    ["为什么评分没有增长"] = "Why is the rating not increasing",
    ["为什么说这些"] = "Why say these things?",
    ["为什么还要排队。"] = "Why is there still a queue?",
    ["为什么这么便宜？"] = "Why so cheap?",
    ["为什么这么说？"] = "Why do you say that?",
    ["为什么这么问，是发生什么事了吗？"] = "Why do you ask? Did something happen?",
    ["为什么这里会有一张纸条？去纸条里说的地方看看吧。"] = "Why is there a note here? Go and check the place mentioned in the note.",
    ["为什么这里看起来很少有人来，是生意不好吗？"] = "Why does it look like so few people come here? Is business bad?",
    ["为什么选择“占卜家”？提醒你，一旦服用了魔药，就没有后悔的机会了。"] = "Why choose \"Seer\"? I remind you, once you consume the potion, there is no chance to regret it.",
    ["为什么铁路大亨不能出发"] = "Why can't Railway Tycoon depart",
    ["为什么霍森医生就不愿意出诊一下？我女儿最近又染上咳嗽了……"] = "Why is Dr. Hosen unwilling to make house calls? My daughter has caught a cough again recently...",
    ["为什么霍森医生就不愿意出诊一下？我女儿最近又染上咳嗽了，她病得很虚弱……"] = "Why won't Dr. Horson make a house call? My daughter caught a cough recently, and she's very weak...",
    ["为什么非得有帽子？"] = "Why must there be a hat?",
    ["为什么！为什么！为什么你们总要来打扰我种地！都给我去死！"] = "Why! Why! Why do you always come to disturb my farming! All of you go to hell!",
    ["为什么，为什么？为什么他明知道死亡，还是走了进来？"] = "Why, why? Why did he walk in even though he knew it meant death?",
    ["为什么？"] = "Why?",
    ["为什么？\n怎么可能？\n这意味着什么？"] = "Why? \nHow is that possible? \nWhat does this mean?",
    ["为什么？为什么我就不用代价。"] = "Why? Why don't I have to pay a price?",
    ["为什么？仅仅是很久没做过章鱼了吗？还是你对厨艺的态度发生了改变？"] = "Why? Is it just because you haven't made octopus for a long time? Or has your attitude towards cooking changed?",
    ["为什么？你明明是从小陪伴他的管家，为什么要谋害霍克斯男爵？"] = "Why? You were the butler who had accompanied him since childhood; why would you murder Baron Hawkes?",
    ["为什么？你看上去挺友善的。"] = "Why? You look quite friendly.",
    ["为什么？哦，那当然是为了更好地训练需要我帮助的俱乐部成员了！"] = "Why? Oh, that's naturally to better train the club members who need my help!",
    ["为什么？女神不喜欢吵闹的孩子吗？"] = "Why? Does the Goddess not like noisy children?",
    ["为什么？好事要庆祝的！"] = "Why? Good things should be celebrated!",
    ["为什么？我……我不想别人也变成这样。自从那天我见到了那副场景，一切都变了。可怕，太可怕了……"] = "Why? I... I don't want others to end up like this. Ever since I saw that scene that day, everything changed. It's terrifying, too terrifying...",
    ["为什么？管家想做什么？男爵又在做什么？"] = "Why? What does the butler want to do? And what is the Baron doing?",
    ["为什么？贝克兰德可是大都市，机会更多吧？"] = "Why? Backlund is a metropolis, surely there are more opportunities?",
    ["为何别人称呼你为大侦探呢？"] = "Why do people call you a great detective?",
    ["为何这么叫我？"] = "Why call me that?",
    ["为何阻拦"] = "Why block",
    ["为你们奢望的奇迹，忏悔吧！"] = "Repent for the miracles you extravagantly hope for!",
    ["为你嫁接未来命运中的能力，一份足以对抗噩梦污染的力量。"] = "Grafting the ability from your future fate onto you—a power sufficient to resist the nightmare's corruption.",
    ["为你提供相当于你最大生命值20%的护盾。此护盾每30秒刷新一次。"] = "Provides a shield equivalent to 20% of your maximum Health. This shield refreshes every 30 seconds.",
    ["为你高兴"] = "Happy for you",
    ["为保障游戏完整性，只开头存档一次"] = "To ensure game integrity, save only once at the beginning",
    ["为值夜者们献上鲜花"] = "Offer flowers to the Nighthawks",
    ["为值得尊敬的人们献上一束鲜花吧。"] = "Offer a bouquet of fresh flowers to those worthy of respect.",
    ["为友方与敌人附加额外加/减速效果"] = "Apply additional Acceleration/Slow effects to allies and enemies",
    ["为友方提供助攻次数最多的非凡者"] = "The Beyonder who provided the most assists to allies.",
    ["为友方提供援护冲锋，解除其受到的弱控和减速，并为其提供减伤和加速增益，自身获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。使用后解锁王庭号令。"] = "Provide support charge to allies, dispelling their soft crowd control and slow, and providing them with damage reduction and acceleration buffs. You gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use.",
    ["为友方提供治疗量最高的非凡者"] = "The Beyonder who provided the most healing to allies.",
    ["为啥不走后处理？"] = "Why not use post-processing?",
    ["为啥做到战斗里，而不是FlowChart或者SystemAction里？\n（是魔狼的特殊机制，要打开背包使用魔狼给的道具）"] = "Why is it done in combat instead of FlowChart or SystemAction? \n (It is a special mechanism of the Demon Wolf; one must open the Inventory to use the item given by the Demon Wolf).",
    ["为啥要定制一个Action\n做了渐隐渐出的材质表现"] = "Why customize an Action? \n Created a fade-in/fade-out material effect.",
    ["为啥要监听，直接在拍照Action里Check不就行？\n（魔狼boss战斗中使用）"] = "Why listen? Just check it in the Photo Action, right?\n (Used in Demon Wolf boss battle)",
    ["为处于失控或失控边缘的非凡者恢复理智"] = "Restore sanity to Beyonders who are experiencing or on the verge of loss of control.",
    ["为女学生们占星"] = "Perform astrology for the female students",
    ["为女学生提供建议"] = "Provide advice to the female students",
    ["为帮助阿兹克·艾格斯找回过去，克莱恩与他建立了长期的书信联系。信件内容多为分享历史线索、询问非凡知识或告知行程，是维系这段亦师亦友关系的重要纽带。"] = "To help Azik Eggers recover his past, Klein established a long-term correspondence with him. The letters mostly consist of sharing historical clues, asking about Beyonder knowledge, or informing him of travel plans, serving as an important bond for this mentor-friend relationship.",
    ["为年轻男女占卜"] = "Divination for Young Couple",
    ["为庆祝战争胜利，\n\n本俱乐部为每位新加入的会员免费提供100枚子弹！\n\n老会员每介绍一位新人加入，可获得30枚子弹！\n\n每月将举行一场射击比赛，\n\n获胜者可免除当月会费！\n\n愿女神庇佑您与您爱的人。"] = "To celebrate the victory of the war, \n \n this club provides 100 bullets for free to every new member! \n \n Old members can get 30 bullets for every new person they introduce! \n \n A shooting competition will be held every month, \n \n the winner can be exempted from that month's membership fee! \n \n May the Goddess protect you and your loved ones.",
    ["为您打点好在廷根租房的一切事宜……我保证！"] = "I'll take care of everything for renting a house in Tingen for you... I promise!",
    ["为您投票？"] = "Vote for you?",
    ["为您效劳 “蒲公英”先生"] = "At your service, Mr. Dandelion.",
    ["为感谢劳工阶层一直以来对廷根市的辛勤付出，凡持有香槟街租房合同的劳工，可前往本剧院，低价购票。"] = "To thank the laboring class for their continued hard work for Tingen, any laborer holding a rental contract for Champagne Street may go to this theater to purchase tickets at a low price.",
    ["为我喝彩吧！"] = "Cheer for me!",
    ["为我献上鲜血吧，羔羊！"] = "Offer me blood, lamb!",
    ["为我鼓掌吧，先生女士们！"] = "Applaud for me, ladies and gentlemen!",
    ["为所欲为，但勿伤害"] = "Do What Thou Wilt, But Harm None",
    ["为所欲为，但勿伤害。"] = "Do what you will, but do no harm.",
    ["为所欲为，但绝不可有伤害之心。"] = "Do as you please, but never harbor a heart of malice.",
    ["为抗争者加冕，不朽的火焰永燃于王座之上。"] = "Crown the resister, the immortal flame burns forever on the throne.",
    ["为梅丽莎准备的项链饰品，她会喜欢的。"] = "Necklace accessory prepared for Melissa, she will like it.",
    ["为烈阳高照的午后提供阴凉，为喧闹嘈杂的宴会提供僻静。"] = "Provides shade for afternoons with the blazing sun, and provides seclusion for noisy and chaotic banquets.",
    ["为猎龙献上心脏"] = "Offer Your Heart for Dragon Hunting",
    ["为猎龙献上心脏！"] = "Offer your heart for dragon hunting!",
    ["为猎龙献上生命与心脏！"] = "Offer your life and heart to the Dragon Hunter!",
    ["为玛丽占卜"] = "Divination for Mary",
    ["为玩家角色添加永久免疫伤害及受击效果buff"] = "Add permanent damage immunity and hit effect buff to player character",
    ["为琳达加油"] = "Cheer for Linda",
    ["为琳达加油鼓劲"] = "Cheer for Linda",
    ["为琳达呐喊"] = "Cheer for Linda",
    ["为目标提供护盾、治疗"] = "Provide Shield and Healing to targets",
    ["为知识奔走的旅人，旷野点燃的孤灯，风的方向答案飘扬……"] = "A traveler running for knowledge, a lone lamp lit in the wilderness, the answer fluttering in the direction of the wind...",
    ["为确保游客的人身安全，采摘期间，请务必遵守以下规则。\n1.苹果是一种圆形的红色水果，表皮光滑，口感甜脆。请不要采摘苹果之外的东西。\n2.如果你看见苹果上长出稻谷，请立即远离，并寻找看守人员。\n<Delete id=\"#158\">3.长出小麦是正常的，请放心品尝。</>\n4.请注意，苹果不会长出任何人体组织。\n5.如果你服用了长出稻谷或器官的苹果，不要尝试呕吐，请立即寻找看守人员。\n6.本告示共有五条。\n0.欢迎大家前来湖心岛果园品尝苹果！"] = "To ensure the personal safety of tourists, please be sure to follow the following rules during picking. \n 1. An apple is a round red fruit with smooth skin and a sweet and crisp taste. Please do not pick anything other than apples. \n 2. If you see rice growing on an apple, please stay away immediately and look for the guards. \n<Delete id=\"#158\"> 3. It is normal for wheat to grow, please feel free to taste it. </>\n 4. Please note that apples will not grow any human tissue. \n 5. If you have consumed an apple that has grown rice or organs, do not try to vomit, please look for the guards immediately. \n 6. There are five rules in this notice. \n 0. Welcome everyone to the orchard on the island in the middle of the lake to taste apples!",
    ["为神使祈祷"] = "Pray for the Divine Messenger",
    ["为美好的一天，购买一束鲜花吧！"] = "Buy a bouquet of fresh flowers for a beautiful day!",
    ["为老尼尔献上<h>深眠花</>"] = "Offer <h>Sleep-inducing Flowers</> to Old Neil",
    ["为老约翰占卜"] = "Divination for Old John",
    ["为自身周围30米半径范围内的友方恢复100点SAN值，随机提升学识、魅力、武力、直觉，并施加<HighLight>龙之体魄</>和<HighLight>龙之怒意</>，持续<HighLight>1800</>秒。<HighLight>（仅限地面施放）</>\n<HighLight>龙之体魄</>：增加<HighLight>4</>点所有五维，与高级深红精粹效果不可叠加。\n<HighLight>龙之怒意</>：增加<HighLight>25</>点攻击，<HighLight>5</>点技能加强，与高级狂暴药剂效果不可叠加。"] = "Restore 100 SAN points to allies within a 30-meter radius around the user, randomly increase Erudition, Charisma, Martial Strength, or Intuition, and apply <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </> and <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>, lasting for <HighLight> 1800 </> seconds. <HighLight> (Only castable on the ground) </> \n <HighLight> Dragon's Physique </>: Increases all five dimensions by <HighLight> 4 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Crimson Essence. \n <HighLight> Dragon's Fury </>: Increases Attack by <HighLight> 25 </> points and Skill Enhancement by <HighLight> 5 </> points; does not stack with the effects of Advanced Berserk Potion.",
    ["为艾米丽召唤光芒"] = "Summon light for Emily",
    ["为范围内友方附加光之律动，提高其攻击，持续15秒。"] = "Applies Rhythm of Light to allies within range, increasing their Attack for 15 seconds.",
    ["为那些渴望在街头留下印记的年轻人而生。它的尾焰沿路蔓延，仿佛在无声宣告着：这座城市的夜晚，属于敢燃烧的人。"] = "Born for young people who crave to leave their mark on the streets. Its tail flame spreads along the road, as if silently declaring: The night of this city belongs to those who dare to burn.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计失败20次"] = "Fail to restore sanity to Beyonders 20 times in total.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计成功200次"] = "Successfully restore sanity to Beyonders 200 times in total.",
    ["为非凡者恢复理智时累计成功20次"] = "Successfully restore sanity to Beyonders 20 times in total.",
    ["为鲜花停留的人，\n赞美你的好奇心！\n请随意取用车上的花朵，\n我会派人定期来补货。\n希望花朵的色彩，\n能让你繁忙的生活开心一点。"] = "To those who stop for flowers, \npraise your curiosity!\nPlease feel free to take the flowers from the cart, \nI will send someone to restock them regularly.\nI hope the colors of the flowers \ncan make your busy life a little happier.",
    ["主"] = "Main",
    ["主人又在研究新的怪茶咪。"] = "The master is researching new weird teas again, meow.",
    ["主人对海洋的向往，静静承载于这艘小小帆船之上。"] = "The owner's longing for the ocean is quietly carried on this small sailboat.",
    ["主人是位魔药天才！能为她工作真是幸福啊！"] = "Master is a potion genius! It's truly a blessing to work for her!",
    ["主人离开家族后做的茶好闻多了，但她居然因此减少和我玩的时间。"] = "Master's tea smells much better since she left the Family, but now she spends less time playing with me because of it.",
    ["主人！享用祭品吧！"] = "Master! Enjoy the sacrifice!",
    ["主动使用3次朗基努斯之枪后展开真理裂隙，只命中一个目标时伤害提高50%。"] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 3 times, unfold Rift of Truth; damage is increased by 50% when hitting only one target.",
    ["主动使用8次朗基努斯之枪后展开真理裂隙。"] = "After actively using Spear of Longinus 8 times, deploy Rift of Truth.",
    ["主动前往<Highlight>法阵中集合分摊</>，可以阻止奥赛库斯造成灭团伤害。"] = "Proactively go to the <Highlight>magic circle to gather and share damage</>, which can prevent Osekus from causing a party wipe.",
    ["主动怪"] = "Aggressive monster",
    ["主动攻击绿、黄名非凡者增加10失控度"] = "Actively attacking green or yellow-named Beyonders increases loss of control by 10.",
    ["主动查找"] = "Manual Search",
    ["主动释放一次朗基努斯之枪后会使岁月的棋局的冷却时间减少1秒。"] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once reduces the Cooldown of Gambit of the Ages by 1 second.",
    ["主动释放一次朗基努斯之枪后会使岁月的棋局的冷却时间减少3秒。"] = "Actively casting Spear of Longinus once will reduce the Cooldown of Gambit of the Ages by 3 seconds.",
    ["主厨"] = "Head chef",
    ["主啊，伟大的风暴，请您体恤我火热的心灵，洗濯我内心的污秽！"] = "Lord, great Storm, please have pity on my burning soul and wash away the filth in my heart!",
    ["主地块"] = "Main Plot",
    ["主城"] = "Main City",
    ["主天赋树"] = "Main Talent Tree",
    ["主宰之战"] = "Dominator's Clash",
    ["主宰争锋3V3玩法开启"] = "Dominator's Clash 3V3 mode opened",
    ["主宰争锋·不败者"] = "Dominator's Clash · Undefeated",
    ["主宰争锋·凯旋者"] = "Dominator's Clash · Triumphant",
    ["主宰争锋·初露锋芒"] = "Dominator's Clash · Emerging Talent",
    ["主宰争锋·历战者"] = "Dominator's Clash · Veteran",
