    ["丽贝卡办公室"] = "Rebecca's Office",
    ["丽贝卡去办公室路线"] = "Rebecca's route to the Office",
    ["丽贝卡在调查小铜镜，得到了另一件封印物“绝望魔镜”的线索。镜中廷根由“知识皇冠”构建，并非是真正的镜中世界。"] = "Rebecca is investigating the small copper mirror and has obtained clues about another Sealed Artifact, the \"Magic Mirror of Despair.\" Tingen in the Mirror is constructed by the \"Crown of Knowledge\" and is not a true mirror world.",
    ["丽贝卡坐下对位置"] = "Rebecca Sit Down Position Alignment",
    ["丽贝卡带着侍者送来两杯咖啡。"] = "Rebecca brings two cups of coffee with a waiter.",
    ["丽贝卡开门离开"] = "Rebecca opens the door and leaves",
    ["丽贝卡技能1普通"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Normal",
    ["丽贝卡技能1狂暴"] = "Rebecca Skill 1 Berserk",
    ["丽贝卡把案件委托给你了？噢，我叫<P_Yellow>丽埃娜</>。"] = "Rebecca entrusted the case to you? Oh, my name is <P_Yellow>Liana</>.",
    ["丽贝卡护送"] = "Rebecca escort",
    ["丽贝卡提供的线索很及时，这枚小铜镜就是突破口，罗珊应该也有一个。"] = "The clues provided by Rebecca are very timely. This small copper mirror is the breakthrough point, Rozanne should have one too.",
    ["丽贝卡救场后"] = "After Rebecca Saves the Day",
    ["丽贝卡施放占星术，技能得到增强！"] = "Rebecca casts Astrology; her skills are enhanced!",
    ["丽贝卡的手画草图。"] = "A hand-drawn sketch by Rebecca.",
    ["丽贝卡看书视线目标"] = "Rebecca's gaze target while reading",
    ["丽贝卡离开路径"] = "Rebecca departure path",
    ["丽贝卡移动终点"] = "Rebecca's movement destination",
    ["丽贝卡移动路径"] = "Rebecca movement path",
    ["丽贝卡给予的警察徽章，可以帮助你隐藏身份。"] = "The police badge given by Rebecca, which can help you hide your identity.",
    ["丽贝卡给你的银制匕首，价值不菲。"] = "A silver dagger given to you by Rebecca, which is quite valuable.",
    ["丽贝卡路径"] = "Rebecca Path",
    ["丽贝卡迅速地清了清场。不久后，学派大厅内就只剩下了你们。"] = "Rebecca cleared the scene quickly. Soon, only you were left in the school hall.",
    ["丽贝卡进休息室路径"] = "Rebecca enters lounge path",
    ["丽贝卡颁奖站位"] = "Rebecca award ceremony position",
    ["丽贝卡！你回来了！"] = "Rebecca! You're back!",
    ["丽贝卡，我和莱西亚组队。"] = "Rebecca, I'm teaming up with Leysia.",
    ["丽贝卡，我还是忍不住回想这个案子……"] = "Rebecca, I still can't help but think about this case...",
    ["丽贝卡？！你怎么来了？"] = "Rebecca?! Why are you here?",
    ["丽雅"] = "Ria",
    ["举个例子，假如你是“占卜家”，就可以考虑去占卜俱乐部，或是到街边支个占卜摊子，替人占卜，收获反馈。"] = "For example, if you are a \"Seer,\" you could consider going to a Divination Club or setting up a divination stall on the street to divine for others and receive feedback.",
    ["举刀buffID（不填则不检查举刀，和默认attack效果一样"] = "Raise sword buff ID (if left blank, raising sword is not checked, same effect as default attack).",
    ["举办全服派对"] = "Host Server-wide Party",
    ["举办全服派对需要获得举办时间，举办时间通过竞拍获得"] = "To host a server-wide party, you need to obtain a hosting time, which is acquired through auction",
    ["举办时间"] = "Hosting Time",
    ["举办派对"] = "Host Party",
    ["举办者"] = "Host",
    ["举办者：玩家名称七个字"] = "Organizer: Seven-character player name",
    ["举办背景"] = "Background of the event",
    ["举手之劳"] = "A small favor",
    ["举报"] = "Report",
    ["举报俱乐部"] = "Report Club",
    ["举报原因"] = "Reason for Report",
    ["举报反馈"] = "Report Feedback",
    ["举报成功！"] = "Report successful!",
    ["举报欺诈"] = "Report Fraud",
    ["举报玩家"] = "Report Player",
    ["举报称号"] = "Report Title",
    ["举报结局-消息通报"] = "Report outcome - Message notification",
    ["举行仪式中"] = "Performing ritual...",
    ["举起奖杯"] = "Raise the trophy",
    ["举起相机的刹那，时间在取景框里绊了一跤，于是定格成永恒。"] = "The moment the camera is raised, time trips in the viewfinder and freezes into eternity.",
    ["举起酒杯"] = "Raise Wine Glass",
    ["举钱包"] = "Lift wallet",
    ["久别重逢女"] = "Woman reunited after a long time",
    ["久等了，我来为大家切点火腿！"] = "Sorry to keep you waiting, I'm going to slice some ham for everyone!",
    ["久经舞场"] = "Seasoned Dancer",
    ["久经风霜的石像、冥冥之中你有一种对其<P_Yellow>行礼</>的冲动"] = "A weathered stone statue; in the dark, you have an urge to <P_Yellow> pay respects </> to it.",
    ["义诊医生晚上出现"] = "Free clinic doctor appears at night",
    ["之前从塔罗会那里拿到了2-049的复制品，应该能在这里派上用场。"] = "I previously obtained a replica of 2-049 from the Tarot Club; it should come in handy here.",
    ["之前从塔罗会那里拿到了格罗塞尔游记的复制品，应该能在这里派上用场。"] = "I previously obtained a replica of the Groselle's Travels from the Tarot Club; it should come in handy here.",
    ["之前从戴纳那接了寻找秘银矿的委托，听说廷根边缘有出现过少量秘银矿，可位置太难确定了。"] = "I previously took a commission from Daina to find a mithril mine. I heard a small amount of mithril ore appeared on the outskirts of Tingen, but the location is too hard to pinpoint.",
    ["之前他们写我“当众酒醒”，害得我好几个月都没有演出。"] = "Before, they wrote that I was \"sobering up in public,\" which cost me several months of performances.",
    ["之前他们小队一起出任务，只有他回来了，从那之后他就像变了一个人。"] = "Previously, their team went on a quest together, and only he returned. Ever since then, he has been like a different person.",
    ["之前他攒了好久的存款，本来是为去贝克兰德准备的。结果花在了我的脚踏车上……"] = "He had been saving for a long time, originally intending to go to Backlund. But it all ended up being spent on my bicycle...",
    ["之前刚购置过一些食材……"] = "I just bought some ingredients earlier...",
    ["之前听其他信徒唱过，祷词很美呢，像诗一样。"] = "I've heard other believers sing it before; the prayer is beautiful, like a poem.",
    ["之前听说，只要有对方的相关物品，就可以尝试占卜他的下落？"] = "I heard before that as long as you have an item related to the person, you can try to divine their whereabouts?",
    ["之前和其他学员下了几局，我才知道自己对这类游戏规则的理解还有待精进。"] = "I only realized after playing a few games with other students that my understanding of the rules for this type of game still needs improvement.",
    ["之前和弗莱队长调查廷根中央广场时，曾进入罗塞尔相关的知识空间。难道这里也存在一个知识空间？"] = "When I was investigating the Central Plaza of Tingen with Captain Frye, I entered a knowledge space related to Roselle. Could there be a knowledge space here too?",
    ["之前四道题的答案，可能已经<P_Yellow>为最后一题提供了线索</>。再回顾一下吧。"] = "The answers to the previous four questions might have already <P_Yellow>provided clues for the final question</>. Let's review them again.",
    ["之前在灰雾空间，我让他们称呼我“愚者”。不妨沿用这个代号。"] = "Back in the gray fog space, I had them call me \"The Fool.\" I might as well keep using this codename.",
    ["之前在甲板上认识的科尼先生真是善良又慷慨。"] = "Mr. Koni, whom I met on the deck earlier, is truly kind and generous.",
    ["之前基本每天都来。"] = "I used to come here almost every day.",
    ["之前塔罗学派工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试。"] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Tarot Club artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try that.",
    ["之前塔罗学派工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试偷走他奋斗的想法。"] = "The mystical item 'Fingers of Dexterity' crafted by the Tarot Club artisans can steal thoughts from the other person's brain. We can try stealing his idea of working hard.",
    ["之前塔罗学院工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试。"] = "The Sealed Artifact 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Tarot Club's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try that.",
    ["之前塔罗学院工匠打造的神奇物品“灵巧之指”能够窃取对方大脑中的念头，可以试试偷走他奋斗的想法。"] = "The Sealed Artifact 'Dexterous Fingers' crafted by the Tarot Club's artisan can steal thoughts from a person's brain; we could try stealing his desire to strive.",
    ["之前安保公司的伦纳德先生帮助过我。听说他还是一位“贵族诗人”，我抄写了诗歌……能帮忙转交吗？ "] = "Mr. Leonard from the security company helped me before. I heard he is also a 'noble poet', and I copied some poems... could you help me pass them on?",
    ["之前我们帮人提行李可以收3便士，现在他们收2便士了。"] = "We used to charge 3 pence for carrying luggage, now they charge 2 pence.",
    ["之前所在俱乐部阵营与新加入的俱乐部阵营不同，是否继续？"] = "Your previous Club faction is different from the new Club faction. Do you want to continue?",
    ["之前所在俱乐部阵营可能会与新加入的俱乐部阵营不同，是否确认一键申请当前可加入的俱乐部？"] = "Your previous Club faction might be different from the new Club faction. Are you sure you want to apply to all currently joinable Clubs with one click?",
    ["之前接了寻找秘银矿的委托，听说廷根边缘出现过秘银矿。"] = "I previously accepted a commission to find a mithril mine; I heard that a mithril mine had appeared on the outskirts of Tingen.",
    ["之前是欧维一家住在里面，欧维夫人死在了工厂，小欧维冬天冻死了。"] = "The Ove family used to live inside; Mrs. Ove died in the factory, and little Ove froze to death in the winter.",
    ["之前有个人，因为受不了自己太太打呼噜，还专门去二楼的隐蔽包厢待了一晚上，来安抚自己被折磨的神经。"] = "There was a guy before who couldn't stand his wife's snoring, so he spent a whole night in a private booth on the second floor to pacify his tortured nerves.",
    ["之前有个打扮奇怪的女士，来咖啡厅找人，看上去怒气冲冲的，感觉不是什么好事。"] = "A strangely dressed lady came to the cafe to look for someone earlier, looking furious. It didn't feel like anything good.",
    ["之前有个路过的客人帮我取了名字，叫“仰望星空”。不过，我把它改成了“仰望绯月”，这更符合我的信仰，哈哈。"] = "A passing guest helped me name it 'Looking Up at the Stars' before. However, I changed it to 'Looking Up at the Crimson Moon,' which fits my faith better, haha.",
    ["之前有人骑着脚踏车挂在了生命之脉上，那辆肇事脚踏车还在工匠房放着呢。"] = "Previously, someone rode a bicycle and hung it on the Pulse of Life; that offending bicycle is still in the craftsman's room.",
    ["之前的自杀者都是拉姆德小镇周边的居民，亚瑟是从廷根来的，特意来拉姆德……自杀。"] = "The previous suicides were all residents around Lamud Small Town. Arthur came from Tingen specifically to Lamud... to commit suicide.",
    ["之前说的口令……"] = "The password mentioned earlier...",
    ["之前进来过几个抽劣质雪茄的，味道一直没散……"] = "A few people who smoke cheap cigars came in earlier, and the smell still hasn't dissipated...",
    ["之后再把脚踏车股票质押给银行，用贷款归还前面的贷款。"] = "After that, pledge the bicycle stocks to the bank and use the loan to repay the previous loan.",
    ["之后和工友们美美享用了宵夜。"] = "Afterward, I enjoyed a wonderful late-night snack with the fellow workers.",
    ["乌兰察布"] = "Ulanqab",
    ["乌啾共鸣：用露米的共鸣之力解锁机关！开辟道路吧！"] = "Wuju Resonance: Use Lumian's resonance power to unlock the mechanism! Open the path!",
    ["乌啾遁行"] = "Crow Escape",
    ["乌啾飞行：用露米的飞行和跳跃探索未知吧！"] = "Wuju Flight: Use Lumian's flight and jump to explore the unknown!",
    ["乌安特，我知道你，二流的剧作家，不入流的“观众”，即使有了非凡的力量，你仍徘徊于世俗的评价中，认为自己的才华无人可以超越。你写了无数手稿，等待一个被欣赏的机会；你大声批评热剧的庸俗，你嫉妒那些作者的文字；你憎恶这个世界，又渴望让全世界的目光都聚焦于你；你想要获得满足，无论付出什么样的代价。\n坐在台下的观众不适合你，我有一个仪式，可以让你向神明祈求。只需要你用足够张扬的死亡取悦祂，你就能实现愿望。"] = "Uante, I know you, a second-rate playwright, a mediocre \"Spectator.\" Even with Beyonder power, you still linger in secular evaluation, thinking that your talent is beyond anyone's reach. You have written countless manuscripts, waiting for an opportunity to be appreciated; you loudly criticize the vulgarity of hit dramas; you are jealous of the words of those authors; you hate this world, yet you long for the eyes of the whole world to focus on you; you want to be satisfied, no matter what the price. \n Sitting in the audience is not for you; I have a ritual that can allow you to pray to the Gods. You only need to please Him with a sufficiently flamboyant death, and you will be able to fulfill your wish.",
    ["乌托邦"] = "Utopia",
    ["乌托邦剧院"] = "Utopia Theater",
    ["乌托邦剧院·单人"] = "Utopia Theater - Solo",
    ["乌托邦剧院·噩梦"] = "Utopia Theater · Nightmare",
    ["乌托邦剧院·困难"] = "Utopia Theater · Hard",
    ["乌托邦剧院·多人"] = "Utopia Theater - Multiplayer",
    ["乌托邦剧院·普通"] = "Utopia Theater · Normal",
    ["乌托邦剧院·极难"] = "Utopia Theater - Very Hard",
    ["乌托邦剧院·难度7"] = "Utopia Theater - Difficulty 7",
    ["乌托邦剧院中失控秘偶死亡后凝结形成的秘偶精粹，可在精粹收集者商人处换购商品。"] = "Marionette essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control marionette in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant.",
    ["乌托邦剧院中无法进行非凡方案切换"] = "Beyonder loadouts cannot be switched within Utopia Theater.",
    ["乌托邦剧院为单人玩法，无需组队"] = "Utopia Theater is a single-player mode; no team required.",
    ["乌托邦剧院副本奖励说明"] = "Utopia Theater Dungeon Reward Explanation",
    ["乌托邦剧院副本进行中，无法中途加入"] = "Utopia Theater dungeon is in progress, cannot join midway.",
    ["乌托邦剧院噩梦难度单人模式竞速排名头衔"] = "Utopia Theater Nightmare difficulty solo mode speedrun ranking title",
    ["乌托邦剧院噩梦难度双人模式竞速排名头衔"] = "Utopia Theater Nightmare difficulty duo mode speedrun ranking title",
    ["乌托邦剧院怎么打"] = "How do I clear Utopia Theater?",
    ["乌托邦剧院怎么玩"] = "How does Utopia Theater work?",
    ["乌托邦剧院戏台每次刷新会上架3个秘偶，可供抽选。若抽选后戏台上只剩紫色秘偶，戏台会自动刷新。\n序幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*3，从台上3个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n中幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*6，从台上剩余2个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n落幕抽选：消耗【金纺线】*12，必定获得台上剩余的1个秘偶。"] = "The Utopia Theater stage will refresh with 3 marionettes available for selection each time. If only purple marionettes remain on the stage after selection, the stage will automatically refresh. \nPrologue Selection: Consumes 3 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 marionettes on stage. \nMid-Act Selection: Consumes 6 [Gold Spun Threads] to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining marionettes on stage. \nCurtain Call Selection: Consumes 12 [Gold Spun Threads] to guaranteed obtain the 1 remaining marionette on stage.",
    ["乌托邦剧院是“愚者”先生留下的封印物，但内部回廊最近发生了异变，希望里面的“演员”还认得自己的剧本。"] = "The Utopia Theater is a Sealed Artifact left by Mr. Fool, but the internal corridors have recently undergone mutations; I hope the \"actors\" inside still recognize their scripts.",
    ["乌托邦剧院是和“愚者”先生记忆相关的封印物，母神试图污染它，以影响祂的精神……"] = "The Utopia Theater is a Sealed Artifact related to Mr. Fool's memories. The Mother Goddess is attempting to corrupt it to influence His spirit...",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第1层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 1 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第2层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 2 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第3层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 3 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第4层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 4 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第5层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 5 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院的第6层回廊"] = "Utopia Theater Floor 6 Corridor",
    ["乌托邦剧院秘偶刷新时，如果出现与许愿秘偶同品质的秘偶，有80%概率是许愿秘偶。如果本次没有出现许愿秘偶，则下一次必定是许愿秘偶。"] = "When marionettes refresh in the Utopia Theater, if a marionette of the same quality as the Wish Marionette appears, there is an 80% probability that it is the Wish Marionette. If the Wish Marionette does not appear this time, the next one is guaranteed to be the Wish Marionette.",
    ["乌托邦剧院获取"] = "Utopia Theater acquisition",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has permeated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes within the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a hidden channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to influence the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former town of Utopia, clear out the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and ultimately cut off the source of the corruption.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder level.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n剧院中的敌人等级将会随非凡者等级同步提升，推荐非凡评分也会跟随非凡者等级变化。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的1.5倍。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n The level of enemies in the theater will synchronize with the Beyonder level, and the recommended Beyonder rating will also change with the Beyonder level. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 1.5 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n每周竞速通关成绩进入本途径前100名的玩家将会获得专属头衔，为保证竞速公平，剧院中的敌人等级将会在每周一早上8:00更新。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的2倍。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun results enter the top 100 of this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fairness in speedrunning, the level of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 2 times that of normal difficulty.",
    ["乌洛琉斯"] = "Ouroboros",
    ["乌洛琉斯-普通"] = "Ouroboros - Normal",
    ["乌洛琉斯将发动力量，摧毁一切<Disable>受命运效果影响</>的敌人。玩家需要两两一组，与<Disable>相反命运的人接触</>来消除命运效果。"] = "Ouroboros will unleash its power to destroy all enemies <Disable>affected by fate effects</>. Players need to pair up and make contact with someone of the <Disable>opposite fate</> to eliminate the fate effect.",
    ["乌洛琉斯将同时对场上的所有玩家、梅迪奇、奥赛库斯随机赋予一种命运效果，分别为<Disable>顺遂</>和<Disable>挫败</>。玩家如果攻击与自身相同的敌人时将会受到巨额<Disable>反弹伤害</>。"] = "Ouroboros will simultaneously assign a random fate effect to all players, Medici, and Alista, which are <Disable>Success</> and <Disable>Failure</>. If players attack an enemy with the same fate as themselves, they will take massive <Disable>reflected damage</>.",
    ["乌洛琉斯残影"] = "Ouroboros Shadow",
    ["乌洛琉斯狂暴"] = "Ouroboros Berserk",
    ["乌洛琉斯通过命运涡流召唤出过去的高背椅，<Disable>强制一名玩家坐在上面无法动弹</>，队友需要快速摧毁高背椅进行抢救。"] = "Ouroboros summons high-backed chairs from the past through a fate vortex, <Disable>forcing a player to sit on one and be unable to move</>. Teammates need to quickly destroy the high-backed chair to rescue them.",
