    ["乔纳尔"] = "Jonar",
    ["乔纳尔……"] = "Jonar...",
    ["乔纳尔不知道塔罗学派……现在，我们可以坦诚地聊聊了。"] = "Jonar doesn't know about the Tarot Club... Now, we can talk honestly.",
    ["乔纳尔写的病情记录"] = "Medical records written by Jonar",
    ["乔纳尔医生写的病情记录？您随便使用。"] = "Dr. Jonar's medical records? Feel free to use them.",
    ["乔纳尔医生检查过，没发现任何异常，之前那位警官也认同这个结论。"] = "Dr. Jonar checked and found no abnormalities, and the previous police officer also agreed with this conclusion.",
    ["乔纳尔医生还没来。昨天这个时间，已经接诊到第10位病人了。"] = "Dr. Jonar hasn't arrived yet. At this time yesterday, he had already seen his 10th patient.",
    ["乔纳尔医生，你的职业是治病救人，我的职责也是保护更多的人免于厄运。"] = "Dr. Jonar, your profession is to heal the sick and save people, and my duty is also to protect more people from misfortune.",
    ["乔纳尔医生，我也希望小黛西，能一直特殊地“活下去”。"] = "Dr. Jonar, I also hope that little Daisy can continue to \"live\" in a special way.",
    ["乔纳尔医生，我送送您。"] = "Dr. Jonar, let me see you out.",
    ["乔纳尔医生，看来你对“活着”和“死亡”，有了新的看法。"] = "Dr. Jonar, it seems you have a new perspective on \"living\" and \"death\".",
    ["乔纳尔医生？环？还记得是什么样的环吗？"] = "Dr. Jonar? A ring? Do you remember what kind of ring it was?",
    ["乔纳尔和丽埃娜用尽最后一分力气，挣扎到小黛西身边。他们相视会意，微微一笑，一同触摸黛西的手腕……"] = "Jonar and Liana used their last bit of strength to struggle to little Daisy's side. They looked at each other knowingly, smiled slightly, and touched Daisy's wrist together...",
    ["乔纳尔夫妇受到反噬伤害，陷入虚弱"] = "The Jonar couple receives Backlash Damage and falls into a weakened state.",
    ["乔纳尔夫妇的疼爱和眷恋，就是小黛西的“呼吸”和“心跳”，是她“活着”的标志。"] = "The love and attachment of the Jonar couple are little Daisy's \"breathing\" and \"heartbeat,\" the signs that she is \"alive.\"",
    ["乔纳尔技能3"] = "Jonar Skill 3",
    ["乔纳尔留下的非凡特性，散发出黄昏般的辉光。"] = "The Beyonder characteristic left behind by Jonar, emitting a twilight-like glow.",
    ["乔纳尔的非凡特性"] = "Jonar's Beyonder characteristic",
