    ["乖 小家伙 别害怕。"] = "There, there, little one, don't be afraid.",
    ["乖……别学你爸咳嗽……药钱够买三磅牛肉呢!"] = "Be good... don't learn to cough like your dad... the medicine money is enough to buy three pounds of beef!",
    ["乖乖投降吧！"] = "Surrender obediently!",
    ["乖啊"] = "Be good",
