    ["乖，再等会儿，生日惊喜马上就要准备好了。"] = "Good, wait a little longer. The birthday surprise will be ready soon.",
    ["乖，摸摸头，不是你的错，盔甲之神会原谅你。"] = "There, there, let me pat your head. It's not your fault; the God of Armor will forgive you.",
    ["乘<h>马车</>去廷根大学"] = "Take a <h>carriage</> to Tingen University",
    ["乘上汽车，逃离此处"] = "Get in the car and escape from here",
