    ["乞丐"] = "Beggar",
    ["乞丐王"] = "King of Beggars",
    ["乞丐的命不值钱，老乞丐的命更不值得救，我只有这一个心愿了……"] = "A beggar's life isn't worth much, and an old beggar's life is even less worth saving. This is my only wish left...",
    ["乞丐盘子"] = "Beggar Plate",
    ["乞丐盘子2"] = "Beggar Plate 2",
    ["乞丐路点"] = "Beggar Waypoint",
    ["乞丐金币"] = "Beggar gold coin",
    ["也不一定吧……还可以，呃，去探寻学派里藏匿的未解之谜？"] = "Not necessarily... We could also, uh, go explore the unsolved mysteries hidden in the school?",
    ["也不会遇见邓恩他们，呼……还是与死人对话坦诚轻松些。"] = "I wouldn't have met Dunn and the others either. Phew... it's still more honest and relaxing to talk to the dead.",
    ["也不太干净，我还是站着吧。"] = "It's not very clean either, I'd better just stand.",
    ["也不是没可能。"] = "It's not impossible.",
    ["也不知道博尔吉亚他们遭遇了什么，真是令人担心。"] = "I wonder what happened to Borgia and the others. It's worrying.",
    ["也不知道我是怎么了，把这件小事当做爆炸性新闻投递给多家报社。只有《老实人报》的主编认真对待，还请了首都报业协会的大人物来审阅。"] = "I don't know what came over me, but I sent this trivial matter to several newspapers as explosive news. Only the editor-in-chief of the 'Tingen Honest Man' took it seriously and even invited a big shot from the capital's Newspaper Association to review it.",
    ["也不能完全怪他。后来我们的儿子出生了，得给他买吃的、用的、玩的，还得供他上学。"] = "I can't blame him entirely. Later, our son was born, and we had to buy him food, necessities, toys, and pay for his schooling.",
    ["也不能说完全不会，我其实有努力过的，但每次念完，别人的表情都有些奇怪。"] = "I can't say I'm completely incapable. I actually tried hard, but every time I finished reciting, others would have a strange expression on their faces.",
    ["也不能说白忙活。您这份致敬，还是……挺特别的。"] = "I wouldn't say for nothing. Your tribute was... quite unique.",
    ["也不能这么说吧，至少这里的花又好又便宜呀。"] = "I wouldn't say that, at least the flowers here are good and cheap.",
    ["也会让她最终在没有痛苦的美梦中离开。"] = "And it will also let her finally leave in a beautiful dream without pain.",
    ["也发现了密室的真相。"] = "You also discovered the truth of the locked room.",
    ["也只有通过这种方式降低考试难度，才会有更多的学生为了学分和文凭，愿意继续选择历史专业。"] = "And only by lowering the difficulty of the exams in this way will more students be willing to continue choosing the history major for the sake of credits and diplomas.",
    ["也可以像邓恩队长说的那样，在路上随便逛逛？说不定就碰到笔记相关的线索了。"] = "Or I could wander around on the way, just like Captain Dunn said? Maybe I'll run into clues related to the notebook.",
    ["也可以自行选择2个非凡物质作为聚合素材，消耗素材生成新的非凡物质，快来试试吧！"] = "You can also manually select 2 Beyonder materials as aggregation ingredients, consuming them to generate new Beyonder materials. Come and try it!",
    ["也可以解读为不顺利和顺利。这块灵摆送给你了，更细节的你自己去体验吧。"] = "It can also be interpreted as unfavorable and favorable. This pendulum is a gift for you; experience the details yourself.",
    ["也可以通过<Highlight>模板</>功能建造城堡，点击此处进入。"] = "You can also build a castle through the <Highlight>Template</> function. Click here to enter.",
    ["也可点击骰子进行检定，检定通过直接完成推理"] = "You can also click the dice to perform a check; if the check passes, the deduction is completed directly.",
    ["也够买辆脚踏车了。但看起来很辛苦，哥哥要报名吗？"] = "It's also enough to buy a bicycle. But it looks very hard, is brother going to sign up?",
    ["也好。"] = "That's fine too.",
    ["也就是说，你对我完全没有敌意？也不想利用我？这还真是新奇。"] = "In other words, you have absolutely no hostility toward me? And you don't want to use me? That's truly novel.",
    ["也就是说，你梦中的阴谋并非不是没有结束，而是——尚未开始。"] = "In other words, the conspiracy in your dream didn't end; rather—it hasn't even begun.",
    ["也就是说，你用灵视除了能直接看到一些灵体、鬼魂和怨灵，还能看到“以太体”，可以通过气场不同的状态来判断对方的健康和情绪。"] = "In other words, besides being able to directly see some spirits, ghosts, and vengeful spirits with spirit vision, you can also see the 'Ether Body', and you can judge the other party's health and emotions through the different states of the aura.",
    ["也就是说，我不用害怕会诡异自杀，或者被奇怪的人跟踪了？"] = "In other words, I don't have to worry about committing suicide strangely or being followed by weird people?",
    ["也意味着要离开黑荆棘。"] = "It also means having to leave Blackthorn.",
    ["也感谢你们为廷根所做的一切，愿女神庇佑你们！"] = "Thank you all for everything you have done for Tingen, may the Goddess protect you!",
    ["也救了我。"] = "And she saved me too.",
    ["也是一群 时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的"] = "and also a group that constantly fights against danger and madness.",
    ["也是个官"] = "Also an official",
    ["也是厄难与恐惧的女皇，安眠和寂静的领主。"] = "She is also the Empress of Disaster and Horror, and the Lord of Slumber and Silence.",
    ["也是可怜虫！"] = "And a poor wretch too!",
    ["也是在我学会说话之后，没有把我当成怪物的人。"] = "She is also the one who didn't treat me like a monster after I learned to speak.",
    ["也是守护者"] = "Also a Guardian",
    ["也是我们认识一周年的纪念日！"] = "It's also the one-year anniversary of us meeting!",
    ["也是最好的弟弟……我最好的弟弟……"] = "And the best younger brother... my best younger brother...",
    ["也是，她从前买一只猎犬的钱，说不定能购买这儿的一栋房子呢。"] = "That's true, the money she used to buy a hound could probably buy a house here.",
    ["也有人认为这来自畏罪自杀的埃德萨克王子。对鲁恩来说，他是个罪人，但对于社交界，一位王子痴迷上美丽且神秘的平民，这件事可贡献了不少谈资。"] = "Some people also think it came from Prince Edessak, who committed suicide to escape punishment. For Loen, he was a sinner, but for the social circle, a prince obsessed with a beautiful and mysterious commoner contributed a lot of gossip.",
    ["也有点疯疯的"] = "A bit crazy too",
    ["也比如说我。"] = "And like me, too.",
    ["也没什么，新人总是对这里充满好奇，然后向阿罗德斯大人发问。"] = "Nothing much, newcomers are always full of curiosity about this place, and then they ask Lord Arrodes questions.",
    ["也没错，大厅里这艘的确只是它的模型。"] = "That's also correct, the one in the hall is indeed just a model of it.",
    ["也看不出你有什么特别的，居然是伦纳德亲自带你去黑荆棘的。"] = "I don't see anything special about you, yet Leonard actually took you to Blackthorn himself.",
    ["也祝您好运！"] = "Good luck to you too!",
    ["也算告一段落了。"] = "I suppose that's that for now.",
    ["也许<P_Yellow>侠盗黑皇帝</>从一开始就是为了白莉夫人来的呢？他的眼神可骗不了我。"] = "Perhaps the <P_Yellow>Phantom Thief Black Emperor</> was here for Lady Bai Li from the very beginning? His eyes couldn't lie to me.",
    ["也许……我们应该直接把老约翰烧了。"] = "Perhaps... we should just burn Old John.",
    ["也许……有过但我忘了？忘了就算没有。"] = "Maybe... I did, but I forgot? If I forgot, it means I didn't.",
    ["也许下面有什么线索，先清理出来看看吧。"] = "Perhaps there are clues underneath. Let's clear it away and see.",
    ["也许不是水果，记忆里有个模糊的人影一直在用勺喂我。"] = "Perhaps it's not fruit. In my memory, there's a blurry figure who was always feeding me with a spoon.",
    ["也许事情似乎比我想得更为复杂。"] = "Perhaps things are more complicated than I thought.",
    ["也许他已经去别的地方了呢？你要不要换个地方找找？"] = "Perhaps he has gone somewhere else? Would you like to try looking somewhere else?",
    ["也许他是个省心的仆人。"] = "Perhaps he is a worry-free servant.",
    ["也许他有事耽搁了。"] = "Maybe he was delayed by something.",
    ["也许你可以求助警察。"] = "Maybe you can ask the police for help.",
    ["也许你对星相的解读错了？"] = "Perhaps your interpretation of the astrology is wrong?",
    ["也许你能给我点启发？金秋湖让你想到什么？"] = "Perhaps you can give me some inspiration? What does Golden Autumn Lake make you think of?",
    ["也许你说的是霍伊大学那片草坪？有不少同学去那里野餐。"] = "Perhaps you are talking about the lawn at Hoy University? Many students go there for picnics.",
    ["也许可以用那辆炮车，把我送过去。"] = "Maybe I can use that Cannon Carriage to send me there.",
    ["也许吧。"] = "Perhaps.",
    ["也许吧。我只是希望我女儿赶紧好起来。"] = "Perhaps. I just hope my daughter gets better soon.",
    ["也许吧，昨天，今天，明天，我没有留意。"] = "Maybe. Yesterday, today, tomorrow, I haven't paid attention.",
    ["也许在正确的引导下了解非凡，比一无所知或一知半解更加安全。"] = "Perhaps understanding the Beyonder world under proper guidance is safer than knowing nothing or only knowing half-truths.",
    ["也许它又回大学去了？"] = "Maybe it went back to the university?",
    ["也许它只是在想事情，我们别打扰它了。"] = "Maybe it's just thinking about something, let's not disturb it.",
    ["也许它迷路了？妈妈说，有的人害怕的时候会乱发脾气。"] = "Maybe it got lost? Mom says some people throw tantrums when they're scared.",
    ["也许您可以问问克莉丝汀小姐，她的消息一向灵通。"] = "Perhaps you could ask Miss Christine; she is always well-informed.",
    ["也许您在找的就是这种果子汤？"] = "Perhaps this fruit soup is what you are looking for?",
    ["也许我从未离开过故乡，但却再也回不去了……"] = "Perhaps I never left my hometown, but I can never go back...",
    ["也许我们会结婚，以后一起住在码头区，跟你当邻居。"] = "Maybe we will get married and live in the Dock area in the future, being your neighbors.",
    ["也许我可以帮你。"] = "Maybe I can help you.",
    ["也许我可以帮您。"] = "Maybe I can help you.",
    ["也许我能帮你把帽子取来？"] = "Perhaps I can help you fetch your hat?",
    ["也许我该找一份工作……也许我会继续躺着。"] = "Maybe I should find a job... maybe I'll just keep lying here.",
    ["也许我该把学完的东西实践一下，谁叫我是“学徒”呢……"] = "Maybe I should put what I've learned into practice; after all, I am an \"Apprentice\"...",
    ["也许我需要一个人静静……今天真的非常感谢你。再见，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Perhaps I need some time alone... Thank you very much for today. Goodbye, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["也许报销要适度，毕竟经费有限……您喜欢在教会工作吗？"] = "Perhaps reimbursements should be moderate, after all, funds are limited... Do you like working at the Church?",
    ["也许明年，也许后年……我会登上邮轮，当最好的厨师！"] = "Maybe next year, maybe the year after... I'll board a cruise ship and become the best chef!",
    ["也许是哪家的千金。"] = "Perhaps she is the daughter of some family.",
    ["也许是因为你这些年来过于依赖报幕员，过度使用超出了它的使用限制……"] = "Perhaps it's because you've relied too much on the Announcer over these years, overusing it beyond its limits...",
    ["也许是因为我在祈求着……期待这样的力量来帮我。"] = "Perhaps it's because I am praying... expecting such power to help me.",
    ["也许是因为有了好的工作和不错的收入，整个人都变得自信了。"] = "Maybe it's because I have a good job and a decent income, so I've become more confident.",
    ["也许是昨天出现的侠盗先生让安提科勋爵长出了一个小时的良心，时间到了，他的良心也就消失了。"] = "Perhaps it was the Phantom Thief who appeared yesterday that gave Lord Antigonus an hour of conscience; once the time was up, his conscience vanished as well.",
    ["也许是，不过这里看起来能容纳很多人，我正准备检查此处。"] = "Perhaps, but this place looks like it could accommodate many people. I'm just about to inspect it.",
    ["也许有一天，我还能请科尼先生来我的俱乐部喝酒呢！"] = "Maybe one day, I can even invite Mr. Koni to my club for a drink!",
    ["也许有那么一瞬间，你听到了真正的“女神之叹”？"] = "Perhaps for a moment, you heard the true \"Sigh of the Goddess\"?",
    ["也许漫长的时间已经让他产生了一些动摇。"] = "Perhaps the long passage of time has already caused him to waver.",
    ["也许能迎来机遇"] = "Perhaps an opportunity will come",
    ["也许能通过报纸了解廷根，买一份看看。"] = "Maybe I can learn about Tingen through the newspaper, buy a copy and see.",
    ["也许能错过这次考试，但是还要补考啊……"] = "Maybe I could miss this exam, but I'd still have to take the make-up exam...",
    ["也许茶会主人的线索和猫有关？"] = "Perhaps the clue to the tea party host is related to the cat?",
    ["也许该突击检查质检公司的账户。"] = "Perhaps we should conduct a surprise inspection of the quality inspection company's accounts.",
    ["也许这样的感情，只有同为老乡的你，才能够理解吧。"] = "Perhaps only you, as a fellow countryman, can understand such feelings.",
    ["也许那是某种恩赐，抑或是不可言说的呓语，谁知道呢？"] = "Perhaps that is some kind of gift, or perhaps it is an unspeakable whisper, who knows?",
    ["也许附近还有其它的线索，再找找看吧。"] = "Maybe there are other clues nearby. Let's look around again.",
    ["也许骑士是在帮助他的龙朋友冷静下来？"] = "Maybe the knight was helping his dragon friend calm down?",
    ["也许，也许我是一个活了很久很久的人。"] = "Perhaps, perhaps I am someone who has lived for a very, very long time.",
    ["也许，会让您能轻松回想起一些重要的事情。"] = "Perhaps it will allow you to easily recall some important things.",
    ["也许，命运和诗篇一样，都经不起逐字推敲。"] = "Perhaps fate, like poetry, cannot withstand word-by-word scrutiny.",
    ["也许，某种意义上，你的出现，也算是克莱恩寄出的一封信。"] = "Perhaps, in a sense, your appearance can also be considered a letter sent by Klein.",
    ["也许，这个药剂做出来它就会出现？"] = "Perhaps, if this potion is made, it will appear?",
    ["也该有人去和玛里琳告个状了！他家在诊所旁边，带院子的那栋房子。"] = "Someone should go and complain to Marilyn! Their house is next to the clinic, the one with the yard.",
    ["也请不要告诉她我知道她在看小说的事，这是她的小秘密，我希望她自己告诉我。"] = "Also, please don't tell her that I know she is reading novels. This is her little secret, and I hope she tells me herself.",
    ["也谢谢你……没有丢下我。"] = "And thank you... for not abandoning me.",
    ["习"] = "Learn",
    ["习得后的小光环"] = "Small aura after learning",
    ["习惯了。每天扫这一段，就当活动筋骨，也能看看这条街。"] = "I'm used to it. Sweeping this section every day is like exercising my bones, and I get to see this street.",
    ["习惯就好"] = "You'll get used to it.",
    ["习惯就好。"] = "You'll get used to it.",
    ["习惯就好了。"] = "You get used to it.",
    ["乡下钟表匠，修一辈子表，也做不出像样的东西。"] = "A country watchmaker, working on watches for a lifetime, still can't make anything decent.",
    ["乡巴佬是这样的。"] = "That's how bumpkins are.",
    ["乡村中的"] = "In the countryside",
    ["乡村学校结业考试试卷（1/5）"] = "Village School Graduation Exam Paper (1/5)",
    ["乡村学校结业考试试卷（5/5）"] = "Village School Graduation Exam Paper (5/5)",
    ["乡村教师"] = "Village teacher",
    ["乡绅"] = "Squire",
    ["书"] = "Book",
    ["书1"] = "Book 1",
    ["书2"] = "Book 2",
    ["书3"] = "Book 3",
    ["书4"] = "Book 4",
    ["书上写的！你们看，这儿明明白白写着——"] = "The book says so! Look, it's written clearly right here—",
    ["书上是这么写的，我们至少得试试！"] = "That's what the book says, we have to at least try!",
    ["书中藏有黄金般的住所"] = "Within books lie golden dwellings",
    ["书中藏有黄金般的住所，而这本书里，藏有拯救庄园的秘密——"] = "Books contain golden dwellings, and this book contains the secret to saving the manor—",
    ["书们"] = "Books",
    ["书信"] = "Letter",
    ["书信往来"] = "Correspondence",
    ["书写动画占位"] = "Writing Animation Placeholder",
    ["书写并交换誓言。"] = "Write and exchange vows.",
    ["书和眼"] = "Book and Eye",
    ["书堆环绕的角落，西迦执笔停驻在稿纸上。"] = "In a corner surrounded by piles of books, Xiga pauses with her pen on the manuscript paper.",
    ["书射灯"] = "Book Spotlight",
    ["书店"] = "Bookstore",
    ["书店trigger"] = "Bookstore trigger",
    ["书店老板"] = "Bookstore owner",
    ["书店老板的小猫，总趴在摊开的旧书上，压皱了好几页纸。"] = "The bookstore owner's kitten is always lying on the open old books, wrinkling several pages.",
