    ["书摊"] = "Book Stall",
    ["书摊上所有的东西都泛着雨水干透后的水印，它们已经被遗弃在这里有一段时间了，没人在意理由，就像没人在意它们。"] = "Everything on the book stall has watermarks from dried rain; they have been abandoned here for some time, and no one cares about the reason, just as no one cares about them.",
    ["书摊小贩"] = "Book Stall Vendor",
    ["书摊摊主"] = "Book stall owner",
    ["书摊摊贩"] = "Book Stall Vendor",
    ["书摊老板"] = "Book Stall Owner",
    ["书摊老板1"] = "Book Stall Owner 1",
    ["书摊老板2"] = "Book Stall Owner 2",
    ["书摊老板说是典藏版，花了我不少钱。我想照着格尔曼做过的事也做一遍，回头好跟女儿搭上话。您能否陪我走一趟？替我做个见证。"] = "The book stall owner said it was a collector's edition, it cost me quite a bit. I want to do everything Gehrman did, so I can strike up a conversation with my daughter later. Could you accompany me? Act as a witness for me.",
    ["书本"] = "Book",
    ["书本便签1"] = "Book Note 1",
    ["书本便签2"] = "Book Note 2",
    ["书本便签3"] = "Book Note 3",
    ["书本效果"] = "Book Effect",
    ["书架"] = "Bookshelf",
    ["书架上都是落了灰的旧书，没有找到信。"] = "The bookshelves are full of dusty old books, but I didn't find the letter.",
    ["书架怪持续aoe"] = "Bookshelf monster continuous AoE",
    ["书架怪的持续伤害"] = "Bookshelf Monster Continuous Damage",
    ["书架衍生空气怪标记"] = "Bookshelf Derived Air Monster Marker",
    ["书柜"] = "Bookcase",
    ["书柜上有血液，不是人类的，闻起来有股海腥味。"] = "There is blood on the bookshelf. It's not human; it smells like the sea.",
    ["书柜上的血迹"] = "Bloodstains on the bookcase",
    ["书柜上那非人类、有鱼腥味的味的血液，难道是配方上“深海枪鱼的血液”？"] = "That inhuman, fishy-smelling blood on the bookshelf—could it be the 'Deep Sea Spearfish Blood' from the formula?",
    ["书柜后看起来不错！"] = "Behind the bookcase looks like a good hiding spot!",
    ["书桌"] = "Desk",
    ["书桌·典雅"] = "Desk: Elegant",
    ["书桌·简洁"] = "Desk: Minimalist",
    ["书桌上放着一只银质托盘和配套茶壶，和地上的茶杯应该是一对的。"] = "On the desk sits a silver tray and a matching teapot; they should be a set with the teacup on the floor.",
    ["书桌前"] = "In front of the desk",
    ["书桌的纸张上还残留着笔痕，似乎有人在这里写过东西。"] = "There are still pen marks on the paper on the desk; it seems someone was writing here.",
    ["书桌笔记"] = "Desk Notes",
    ["书桌表面看起来有些污渍和划痕，但都是可以去除的。我检查了抽屉的滑轨和桌腿的接合处，其实结构还很结实。"] = "The surface of the desk looked like it had some stains and scratches, but they could all be removed. I checked the drawer rails and the joints of the table legs; the structure was actually still very sturdy.",
    ["书桌触发"] = "Desk trigger",
    ["书桌踩点"] = "Desk waypoint",
    ["书真不少啊……慢慢看吧。"] = "There are quite a lot of books here... I'll take my time reading them.",
    ["书稿"] = "Manuscript",
    ["书签"] = "Bookmark",
    ["书签断章"] = "Bookmark Fragment",
    ["书签的右下角画了一朵小苹果花，笔触很稚拙，像是学着孩子的样子画的。"] = "A small apple blossom is drawn on the bottom right corner of the bookmark, with clumsy brushstrokes, as if drawn by imitating a child.",
    ["书籍"] = "Books",
    ["书籍中间夹着一幅老旧的画像，已经模糊不清了，好像画的是一家人？"] = "An old portrait is tucked between the books; it's already blurred, but it looks like a family?",
