    ["书籍通道效果测试"] = "Book Passage Effect Test",
    ["书籍通道替代，等5s自动传送"] = "Book passage replacement, waiting 5s for automatic Teleport",
    ["书脊抵住掌心，知识还在纸页间沉睡，姿态已经醒来。"] = "The spine of the book against the palm; knowledge is still sleeping between the pages, but the posture has already awakened.",
    ["书身"] = "Book Cover",
    ["书里是这么写的，不信你自己看。"] = "That's what's written in the book, if you don't believe me, see for yourself.",
