    ["争气点！掏出戒指走过去！"] = "Get it together! Take out the ring and walk over!",
    ["争论？呵呵，只是就一些研究和我的学生彼此交流罢了，谈不上争论。"] = "Argument? Heh, it's just exchanging some research with my students, it doesn't count as an argument.",
