    ["事件结束"] = "Event End",
    ["事件结束-前置"] = "Event end - prerequisite",
    ["事件结案后，值夜者处理了后续。有人匿名在《廷根市老实人报》发表了一份“民俗研究”。"] = "After the case was closed, the Nighthawks handled the aftermath. Someone anonymously published a 'folklore study' in the 'Tingen City Honest Man'.",
    ["事件通报"] = "Incident Report",
    ["事先声明，我们的珠宝都有正规来源。"] = "I'll state in advance that our jewelry has legitimate sources.",
    ["事先声明，我这里只出售一些固定功效的药方，有可能有用，也有可能没用。"] = "I'll state in advance that I only sell prescriptions with fixed effects here; they might be useful, or they might be useless.",
    ["事先声明，此事与庄园无关。"] = "I must state in advance that this matter has nothing to do with the manor.",
    ["事先说明，我可不是为了偷懒才站在这里。"] = "Just to be clear, I'm not standing here to slack off.",
    ["事到如今，只能借用3-888的力量了。"] = "At this point, I have no choice but to borrow the power of 3-888.",
    ["事务繁荣"] = "Prosperous Affairs",
    ["事后清晨"] = "The Morning After",
    ["事实上，交朋友的话，街对面的画室更适合一点。"] = "Actually, if you want to make friends, the art studio across the street is more suitable.",
    ["事实上，我心爱的演出《大冒险家》末场马上就要开票了，但这个月我剩下的薪水……这张票我买还是不买呢？"] = "In fact, tickets for the final show of my beloved performance, \"The Great Adventurer,\" are about to go on sale, but my remaining salary for this month... Should I buy this ticket or not?",
    ["事实上，我根本没参加面试。我提前找到了其他工作，今天刚入职，周薪三镑。"] = "Actually, I didn't attend the interview at all. I found another job in advance and just started today, with a weekly salary of three pounds.",
    ["事已至此，先去食堂吃饭吧！雷克斯你也一起吧。"] = "Since it's come to this, let's go to the cafeteria to eat! Rex, you come too.",
    ["事已至此，先吃葡萄吧。"] = "What's done is done, let's eat some grapes first.",
    ["事态恶化"] = "The situation worsens",
    ["事情不对劲，相信我。"] = "Something isn't right, trust me.",
    ["事情似乎比我想得更为复杂。"] = "Things seem more complicated than I thought.",
    ["事情告一段落"] = "The matter has come to an end",
    ["事情已经很清晰了：这里是个黑市交易点，有非凡者介入了这起案件。"] = "The situation is already very clear: this is a black market trading point, and a Beyonder has intervened in this case.",
    ["事情没那么简单，我在梦中感受到了被污染的气息。"] = "It's not that simple. I felt the scent of corruption in my dream.",
    ["事情结束了？"] = "Is it over?",
    ["事情结束了？刚才发生了什么？"] = "Is it over? What happened just now?",
    ["事情都告一段落了，队长说不用担心后续的影响和危险，我可以好好睡一觉了。"] = "The matter has come to an end. The captain said not to worry about any follow-up influence or danger, and that I can get a good night's sleep.",
    ["事故？"] = "Accident?",
