    ["二人离开了"] = "The two have left",
    ["二人近景"] = "Close-up of the two",
    ["二位在做什么？"] = "What are you two doing?",
    ["二位日安，也是来做告解的？"] = "Good day, you two. Are you here for confession as well?",
    ["二位的咖啡，请慢慢享用。"] = "Coffee for you both, please enjoy.",
    ["二副"] = "Second Mate",
    ["二十一年前，连杀了五位少女，有的取走心脏，有的拿走胃部的那个“血腥屠夫——开膛手杰斯”！"] = "Twenty-one years ago, the 'Bloody Butcher—Jack the Ripper,' who killed five young girls in a row, taking the hearts of some and the stomachs of others!",
    ["二十二年，足够命运留下痕迹。"] = "Twenty-two years is enough for fate to leave a mark.",
    ["二十二条神之途径"] = "Twenty-two Divine Pathways",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：不眠者、序列8：午夜诗人、序列7：梦魇、序列6：安魂师、序列5： 灵巫、序列4： 守夜人、序列3： 恐惧主教、序列2： 隐秘之仆、序列1： 厄难骑士、序列0： 黑暗"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Sleepless, Sequence 8: Midnight Poet, Sequence 7: Nightmare, Sequence 6: Soul Assurer, Sequence 5: Spirit Warlock, Sequence 4: Nightwatcher, Sequence 3: Horror Bishop, Sequence 2: Servant of Concealment, Sequence 1: Knight of Misfortune, Sequence 0: Darkness",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：仲裁人、序列8：治安官、序列7：审讯者、序列6：法官、序列5：惩戒骑士、序列4：律令法师、序列3：混乱猎手、序列2：平衡者、序列1：秩序之手、序列0：审判者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Arbiter, Sequence 8: Sheriff, Sequence 7: Interrogator, Sequence 6: Judge, Sequence 5: Disciplinary Paladin, Sequence 4: Imperative Mage, Sequence 3: Chaos Hunter, Sequence 2: Balancer, Sequence 1: Hand of Order, Sequence 0: Justiciar",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：占卜家、序列8：小丑、序列7：魔术师、序列6：无面人、序列5：秘偶大师、序列4：诡法师、序列3：古代学者、序列2：奇迹师、序列1：诡秘侍者、序列0：愚者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Seer, Sequence 8: Clown, Sequence 7: Magician, Sequence 6: Faceless, Sequence 5: Marionettist, Sequence 4: Bizarro Sorcerer, Sequence 3: Scholar of Yore, Sequence 2: Miracle Invoker, Sequence 1: Attendant of Mysteries, Sequence 0: The Fool",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：学徒、序列8：戏法大师、序列7：占星人、序列6：记录官、序列5：旅行家、序列4：秘法师、序列3：漫游者、序列2：旅法师、序列1：星之匙、序列0：门"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Apprentice, Sequence 8: Trickmaster, Sequence 7: Astrologer, Sequence 6: Scribe, Sequence 5: Traveler, Sequence 4: Secrets Sorcerer, Sequence 3: Wanderer, Sequence 2: Planeswalker, Sequence 1: Key of Stars, Sequence 0: Door",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：战士、序列8：格斗家、序列7：武器大师、序列6：黎明骑士、序列5：守护者、序列4：猎魔者、序列3：银骑士、序列2：荣耀者、序列1：神明之手、序列0：黄昏巨人"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Warrior, Sequence 8: Pugilist, Sequence 7: Weapon Master, Sequence 6: Dawn Paladin, Sequence 5: Guardian, Sequence 4: Demon Hunter, Sequence 3: Silver Knight, Sequence 2: Glory, Sequence 1: Hand of God, Sequence 0: Twilight Giant",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：收尸人、序列8：掘墓人、序列7：通灵者、序列6：死灵导师、序列5：看门人、序列4：不死者、序列3：摆渡人、序列2：死亡执政官、序列1：苍白皇帝、序列0：死神"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Corpse Collector, Sequence 8: Gravedigger, Sequence 7: Spirit Medium, Sequence 6: Spirit Guide, Sequence 5: Gatekeeper, Sequence 4: Undying, Sequence 3: Ferryman, Sequence 2: Death Consul, Sequence 1: Pale Emperor, Sequence 0: Death",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：歌颂者、序列8：祈光人、序列7：太阳神官、序列6：公证人、序列5：光之祭司、序列4：无暗者、序列3：正义导师、序列2：逐光者、序列1：纯白天使、序列0：太阳"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Bard, Sequence 8: Light Suppliant, Sequence 7: Solar High Priest, Sequence 6: Notary, Sequence 5: Priest of Light, Sequence 4: Unshadowed, Sequence 3: Justice Mentor, Sequence 2: Lightseeker, Sequence 1: White Angel, Sequence 0: Sun",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：窥秘人、序列8：格斗学家、序列7：巫师、序列6：卷轴教师、序列5：星象师、序列4：神秘学家、序列3：预言大师、序列2：贤者、序列1：知识皇帝、序列0：隐者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Mystery Pryer, Sequence 8: Melee Scholar, Sequence 7: Warlock, Sequence 6: Scrolls Professor, Sequence 5: Constellations Master, Sequence 4: Mysticologist, Sequence 3: Clairvoyant, Sequence 2: Sage, Sequence 1: Knowledge Emperor, Sequence 0: Hermit",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：观众、序列8：读心者、序列7：心理医生、序列6：催眠师、序列5：梦境行者、序列4：操纵师、序列3：织梦人、序列2：洞察者、序列1：作家、序列0：空想家"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Spectator, Sequence 8: Telepathist, Sequence 7: Psychiatrist, Sequence 6: Hypnotist, Sequence 5: Dreamwalker, Sequence 4: Manipulator, Sequence 3: Dream Weaver, Sequence 2: Discerner, Sequence 1: Author, Sequence 0: Visionary",
    ["二十分钟？怀表才走这么一点点呢！"] = "Twenty minutes? The pocket watch has only moved a little bit!",
    ["二十多次的尝试，终于见证到你的奇迹。欢迎新成员加入黑荆棘， 有什么问题，都可以问我，或者弗莱。"] = "After more than twenty attempts, I have finally witnessed your miracle. Welcome to the Nighthawks, new member. If you have any questions, feel free to ask me or Frye.",
