    ["二楼更安静，更私密。私下谈生意的、想一个人待会儿的，还有……<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>有些不方便公开聊的，都上二楼去。"] = "The second floor is quieter, more private. People discussing business in private, those who want to be alone for a while, and... <P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> some things that aren't convenient to talk about in public, all go to the second floor.",
