    ["二段剑气伤害提升20%。若二段未命中目标，返还10%技能冷却。"] = "Second-stage sword energy damage increased by 20%. If the second stage misses the target, 10% of the skill cooldown is refunded.",
    ["二段剑气伤害提升25%。若二段未命中目标，返还10%技能冷却。"] = "Secondary sword energy damage increased by 25%. If the secondary hit misses, 10% of the skill's Cooldown is refunded.",
