    ["二阶段镜子高亮无法分辨，需逐个尝试找到出口。"] = "In the second phase, the mirrors are highlighted and indistinguishable; you must try them one by one to find the exit.",
    ["二阶段陨石生成击退扩散波，触碰场地边缘致死。"] = "In the second phase, meteorites generate knockback diffusion waves; touching the edge of the field results in death.",
    ["二驴"] = "Er Lu",
    ["于"] = "Yu",
    ["于%s%s"] = "At %s %s",
    ["于%s在%s破茧"] = "Broke cocoon at %s in %s",
    ["于【灾异巢穴】处召唤灾异先锋，将其击败可获得猩红遗物材料。灾异先锋实力强大，建议<Highlight>组队前往挑战</>。"] = "Summon a Calamity Vanguard at the [Calamity Lair]. Defeating it will grant Scarlet Relic materials. The Calamity Vanguard is powerful; it is recommended to <Highlight> form a team to challenge it </>.",
    ["于万千目光之中，坚守本我的真谛。"] = "Amid countless gazes, hold fast to the truth of your own self.",
    ["于宗玄"] = "Yu Zongxuan",
    ["于宗玄-日常本封印"] = "Yu Zongxuan - Daily Quest Seal",
    ["于宗玄-日常本档案"] = "Yu Zongxuan - Daily Quest Archive",
    ["于宗玄-肉鸽demo"] = "Yu Zongxuan - Roguelike Demo",
    ["于廷根首次发布并售卖的蒸汽机械车，独具格调的外形设计使其受到绅士淑女们的青睐，它向人们证明，潮流与优雅总是集于一身。"] = "The steam-powered vehicle first released and sold in Tingen. Its unique, stylish design made it a favorite among gentlemen and ladies, proving that trend and elegance always go hand in hand.",
    ["于廷根首次发布并售卖的蒸汽机械车，独居格调的外形设计使其受到绅士淑女们的青睐，它向人们证明，潮流与优雅总是集于一身。"] = "The first steam-powered vehicle released and sold in Tingen. Its unique, stylish design has made it a favorite among gentlemen and ladies, proving that trend and elegance always go hand in hand.",
    ["于心湖投石，漾开名为疯狂的涟漪。 "] = "Cast a stone into the lake of the heart, rippling with madness.",
    ["于是它作为一棵平平无奇的金桦树，在这里停留了几百年。直到最近……我感受到它的变化，它快醒了……"] = "So it stayed here for hundreds of years as an unremarkable golden birch tree. Until recently... I felt its change, it's about to wake up...",
    ["于是我们和伊森他们商量，一起去贷了一笔钱，想要租下这家店。"] = "So we discussed it with Ethan and the others, took out a loan together, and wanted to rent this shop.",
    ["于是我把报幕员邮给了她。没想到，我竟收获了名为“绝望”的情绪。"] = "So I mailed the Announcer to her. I didn't expect to reap the emotion known as 'despair'.",
    ["于是我把海鱼的基因和卷心菜结合了一下。结果是——它能长在海里了，但吃起来有鱼腥味。"] = "So I combined the genes of sea fish with cabbage. The result is—it can grow in the sea, but it tastes fishy.",
    ["于是相聚在这里。"] = "And so, we gathered here.",
    ["于是除了要送笔记的你，韦尔奇和娜娅都当场自杀了，但我不知道你为什么能活下来。"] = "As a result, Welch and Naya committed suicide on the spot, but I don't know why you survived.",
    ["于暗夜中托起繁星"] = "Holding Up the Stars in the Dark Night",
    ["于此刻亮起刀兵，在众神的共同注目下争夺荣光，见证力量，获得神明级认可。"] = "Take up arms at this moment, compete for glory under the collective gaze of the gods, witness power, and receive recognition at the god level.",
    ["于神战遗迹的隐秘角落，埋藏着诸多失落遗物与禁忌知识。使用<Highlight>叹息之种</>开启仪式，循着指引完成仪式，你将收集到<Highlight>猎杀进度</>与<Highlight>猩红遗物</>。将其呈递给那位自称<Highlight>猎杀管家</>的苍白身影，即可换取<Highlight>属于你的那份非凡馈赠</>。"] = "In the hidden corners of the Relics of the God War, many lost relics and Forbidden Knowledge are buried. Use <Highlight> Seed of Sighs </> to start the ritual, follow the guidance to complete the ritual, and you will collect <Highlight> Hunting Progress </> and <Highlight> Scarlet Relics </>. Present them to the pale figure who calls himself the <Highlight> Hunting Butler </> to exchange for <Highlight> that Beyonder gift belonging to you </>.",
    ["于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "In the golden wheat waves of Morse Small Town, pick up a segment of gentle time from the past.",
    ["于迷雾中寻找<h>斯卡纳</>"] = "Search for <h>Skana</> in the fog",
    ["于迷雾中追寻灵性气息……"] = "Pursuing spiritual aura in the fog...",
    ["于黑夜的引领下，红手套在隐秘之中穿行。守护此夜的，正是其中最明亮的一颗星星。"] = "Under the guidance of the night, the Red Gloves walk in secrecy. The one guarding this night is the brightest star among them.",
