    ["云朵，你又坐在满天星上了，下来。"] = "Cloud, you're sitting on the baby's breath again, get down.",
    ["云朵，那位先生已经是第三次看那束向日葵了，他在等什么呢。"] = "Cloud, that gentleman has looked at that bouquet of sunflowers for the third time. What is he waiting for?",
