    ["五便士也可以啊！朋友！不要走！"] = "Five pence is fine too! Friend! Don't go!",
    ["五分钟后……"] = "Five minutes later...",
    ["五分钟过去了，怎么还没有人来找我？"] = "Five minutes have passed, why hasn't anyone come to find me?",
    ["五分钟，女士。只要先给我们五分钟……"] = "Five minutes, ma'am. Just give us five minutes...",
    ["五十分钟？你可以坐车去，这太远了。"] = "Fifty minutes? You can take a carriage, that's too far.",
    ["五十金币，不赚不亏。"] = "Fifty gold coins, neither earning nor losing.",
    ["五十镑！整整五十镑啊！我……我都算不过来……贝蒂，你脑子快，五十镑是多少便士？够咱这条街所有人吃多久？"] = "Fifty pounds! A full fifty pounds! I... I can't even count that high... Betty, your brain is fast, how many pennies is fifty pounds? How long would it feed everyone on this street?",
    ["五官朦胧却依旧能让人感受到沉沦的魅力，毒蛇般的长发蜿蜒，令人心悸。"] = "The features are hazy, yet one can still feel the charm of sinking; the snake-like long hair winds, making one's heart palpitate.",
