    ["亚伯拉罕家族遗留的传送之杖。为目标刻下星痕标记，射程不足时消耗标记瞬移到位再出手，闪避之后还能追加一次瞬移。但触发越多，越可能失控迷路。"] = "The Teleport staff left behind by the Abraham family. Carve a star mark on the target; when the range is insufficient, consume the mark to Teleport into position before attacking, and you can add another Teleport after a Dodge. But the more it is triggered, the more likely you are to lose control and get Lost.",
