    ["亚巴顿的攻击和攻速提高3%，最多叠加5层。"] = "Abaddon's Attack and Attack Speed increased by 3%, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["亚巴顿的老巢，亡灵的源头。终结这一切，或是成为他的又一件收藏。"] = "Abaddon's lair, the source of the undead. End all of this, or become another one of his collections.",
    ["亚巴顿的诅咒渗入。层数越高，离永眠越近。叠加至20层时会被转化。"] = "Abaddon's curse seeps in. The higher the stack, the closer to eternal sleep. Converted upon reaching 20 stacks.",
    ["亚巴顿释放禁忌咒语，在场上召唤大量附带邪恶能量的陨星从天而降。若陨星坠落至地面则会爆炸，对全场玩家造成伤害并附加<Disable>邪恶印记</>效果，若陨星在落地前被玩家接住，则只对该名玩家造成伤害和附加<Disable>邪恶印记</>效果。"] = "Abaddon releases a forbidden spell, summoning a large number of meteors infused with evil energy to fall from the sky. If a meteor hits the ground, it will explode, dealing damage to all players and applying an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect. If a player catches a meteor before it hits the ground, it will only deal damage to that player and apply an <Disable>Evil Mark</> effect.",
