    ["人"] = "People",
    ["人一定要有车"] = "One must have a carriage.",
    ["人事通知"] = "Personnel Notice",
    ["人交给我们就好。他会被送进那座‘永恒监狱’——你们听说过吧？就是那座邪门的监狱。"] = "Just leave the person to us. He will be sent to that 'Eternal Prison'—you've heard of it, right? That eerie prison.",
    ["人人都可以走上人生顶峰，但每个人生顶峰都不一样！"] = "Everyone can reach the peak of their life, but every peak is different!",
    ["人们从混乱世界穿越到秩序世界中安家生活，发现也有无数的湖泊......"] = "People traveled from the world of Chaos to settle down in the world of Order, only to find countless lakes there as well...",
    ["人们会通过服饰去理解一个人，不同的场合、不同的身份，都有属于它的风尚语言。让我们来一场时尚品鉴吧！"] = "People understand a person through their attire; different occasions and different identities have their own fashion language. Let's have a fashion appreciation challenge!",
    ["人们在村庄里过着安宁幸福的生活，但其实这里酝酿着一个诡异的阴谋……"] = "People live peaceful and happy lives in the village, but in reality, a bizarre conspiracy is brewing here...",
    ["人们来回往返于混乱与秩序，使得两个世界的物品乱置，世界濒临崩溃......"] = "People traveled back and forth between Chaos and Order, causing items from both worlds to be misplaced, and the world is on the verge of collapse...",
    ["人们来此度过闲暇时光，花房为人们包装花束、递送祝福。"] = "People come here to spend their leisure time, and the flower shop packages bouquets and delivers blessings for them.",
    ["人们每天拿出八小时，来换取#CanMove金钱#。"] = "People give up eight hours every day to exchange for #CanMoveMoney#.",
    ["人们求助"] = "People Seeking Help",
    ["人们生活在巨大的差距里，但城市看起来还算平静。"] = "People live in huge disparities, but the city looks calm enough.",
    ["人们的看法"] = "People's opinions",
    ["人们看得到城市表面的繁华，那背后呢，又会有怎样有趣的事情？"] = "People can see the prosperity on the surface of the city, but behind that, what kind of interesting things are there?",
    ["人们研究历史，以锚点习得真理。然而人们从历史学到的唯一真理就是：历史总在重蹈覆辙。"] = "People study history to learn truth through anchors. However, the only truth people learn from history is: history always repeats itself.",
    ["人们至少要在美食面前保持诚实。"] = "People should at least remain honest in front of gourmet food.",
    ["人体是一种立体的艺术，关注服饰的每一个角度，这样的美丽才是无懈可击的。"] = "The human body is a three-dimensional art. Focus on every angle of the clothing; only then is such beauty impeccable.",
    ["人倒霉起来真倒霉……不知怎么的，就想起了死。"] = "When a person is down on their luck, they are truly unlucky... Somehow, I just started thinking about death.",
    ["人偶"] = "Doll",
    ["人偶发条"] = "Puppet Clockwork",
    ["人傻钱多，明明是条肥鱼。"] = "A fool and his money, it's clearly a fat fish.",
    ["人像"] = "Portrait",
    ["人力物力劳动力，路费车费误工费……嗯，还得再算算……"] = "Manpower, material resources, labor costs, travel expenses, lost wages... hmm, I have to calculate again...",
    ["人口失踪"] = "Missing persons",
