    ["人呢？还做不做生意了！"] = "Where are the people? Are you still doing business or not!",
    ["人和牌"] = "Person and card",
    ["人和牛杂交除了让人长出犄角和尾巴、变得强壮又耐劳、可以哞哞叫……<P_Heart>（逐渐心虚）</>以外，还有什么好处吗？"] = "Besides making people grow horns and tails, becoming strong and enduring, and being able to moo... <P_Heart>(Growing guilty) </>are there any other benefits to crossbreeding humans and cows?",
    ["人品"] = "Character",
    ["人啊，终归是要有一份正经工作，才能堂堂正正的吃饱饭。"] = "People, in the end, need to have a proper job to be able to eat with dignity.",
    ["人回来了，我们走吧。"] = "People are back, let's go.",
    ["人在弹钢琴"] = "Someone is playing the piano",
    ["人好，喵好，大家好"] = "Good People, Good Cats, Good Everyone",
    ["人好，喵好，大家好，廷根好喵。"] = "People are good, meows are good, everyone is good, Tingen is good meow.",
    ["人家卖烟草不叫走私，叫贸易。"] = "Selling tobacco isn't called smuggling; it's called trade.",
    ["人少的地方"] = "Place with few people",
