    ["什么都听不见……不过，总感觉里面藏着了不得的东西。"] = "I can't hear anything... However, I have a feeling that something extraordinary is hidden inside.",
    ["什么都吵，开门吵，收摊吵，你碍我晾香肠、我挡你搬蔬菜……一天天可热闹了。"] = "Everything is a quarrel: opening the door is a quarrel, closing the stall is a quarrel, you're in my way of hanging sausages, I'm blocking you from moving vegetables... it's so lively every single day.",
