    ["仆人的证词"] = "Servant's Testimony",
    ["仆人端着茶，是最后一个前往卧室的人。根据证言，他有说谎的可能，嫌疑很大。"] = "The servant, who brought the tea, was the last person to go to the bedroom. According to the testimony, he has the possibility of lying, and his suspicion is high.",
    ["仆人表示，他将托盘放门口就离开了。但观察现场发现，托盘摆在卧室桌面，茶水有被重沏过的痕迹。"] = "The servant stated that he left the tray at the door. However, observation of the scene revealed that the tray was on the bedroom table, and the tea had signs of being re-brewed.",
    ["仆人设置为小彩蛋"] = "Set servant as a small easter egg",
    ["仆人谎称自己听见了霍克斯男爵的声音……不对，不应该有这么多矛盾，就像是……什么地方出现了错误一样。"] = "The servant lied about hearing Baron Hawkes's voice... no, there shouldn't be so many contradictions. It's as if... something went wrong somewhere.",
    ["仆人？"] = "Servant?",
    ["仆从%s已出现，等待对方回应……"] = "Servant %s has appeared; waiting for their response...",
    ["仆从当前的强度等级，最高3级。"] = "Servant's current strength level, max level 3.",
