    ["今夜琴声温柔-莎莉自言自语丑木雕"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - Sally talks to herself about the ugly wood carving",
    ["今夜琴声温柔-莎莉试图弹琴病倒"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - Sally falls ill after attempting to play the piano",
    ["今夜琴声温柔-询问报销单和老尼尔"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - Asking about the reimbursement forms and Old Neil",
    ["今夜琴声温柔-询问罗珊在理什么"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - Asking what Rozanne is organizing",
