    ["今夜琴声温柔-黑荆棘的温柔闲暇"] = "Gentle Piano Music Tonight - A gentle, leisurely moment at Blackthorn",
    ["今夜邀请诸位，除共叙情谊，还有一件重要的事宣布。"] = "Inviting you all tonight, besides sharing friendship, there is also an important matter to announce.",
    ["今夜，你与魔女饮酒、共舞，度过良宵……"] = "Tonight, you drink and dance with the witch, spending a wonderful evening...",
    ["今夜，愿廷根市的大家依旧得享美梦。"] = "Tonight, may everyone in Tingen City continue to enjoy sweet dreams.",
    ["今夜，我们将加入狩猎！"] = "Tonight, we join the hunt!",
    ["今天"] = "Today",
    ["今天一大早就听说安提科勋爵将酒庄和15万磅赠予了白莉夫人，真让人惊讶。"] = "Early this morning, I heard that Lord Antico gave Lady Bailey the winery and 15 lots of ten thousand pounds. What a surprise.",
    ["今天一定要把巴顿的鱼竿弄到手。"] = "I must get Barton's fishing rod today.",
    ["今天上工迟到了，工头又要罚我钱了。"] = "I'm late for work today; the foreman is going to dock my pay again.",
    ["今天不给出说法就不开工！"] = "We're not starting work until we get an explanation today!",
    ["今天也在唾沫飞溅地激烈辩论呢……"] = "Still debating heatedly with spit flying everywhere today, I see...",
    ["今天也想摸鱼"] = "Want to Slack Off Today Too",
    ["今天也想来一场城市旅行吗？"] = "Would you like to go on a city tour today as well?",
    ["今天也打扮得很完美，他会夸我漂亮又可爱吗？"] = "I'm dressed perfectly today, will he praise me for being beautiful and cute?",
    ["今天也是和平的一天……"] = "Today is also a peaceful day...",
    ["今天也没发现正规且有效的仪式魔法……"] = "Still haven't found any formal and effective Ritual Magic today...",
    ["今天人不多，真好。"] = "Not many people today, that's great.",
    ["今天会扔出来什么呢？"] = "What will be thrown out today?",
    ["今天会捞出什么呢？"] = "What will be fished out today?",
    ["今天你们谁也别想跑了，特别是你，要不是你带头，老子需要这么麻烦？"] = "None of you are running away today, especially you. If it weren't for you leading the way, would I have needed so much trouble?",
    ["今天你没吃东西吧？我给你带了面包……你不是每次都要在我吃的时候凑过来嘛，我知道你会想吃一点的。"] = "You didn't eat anything today, did you? I brought you some bread... You always come over when I'm eating, I know you'll want some.",
    ["今天又被他讹了钱…… "] = "I was swindled out of money by him again today...",
    ["今天又被他讹了钱……我就赶个车，他自个儿往车轮底下钻。"] = "I was swindled out of money by him again today... I was just driving the carriage, and he threw himself under the wheels.",
    ["今天只是路过。"] = "Just passing by today.",
    ["今天吃点什么呢？"] = "What should I eat today?",
    ["今天向该小丑表演打赏已达上限，请明日再试吧"] = "You have reached the daily limit for tipping this Clown's performance. Please try again tomorrow.",
    ["今天和熟人碰面也太开心了，聊到停不下来！"] = "It's so happy to run into an acquaintance today, couldn't stop chatting!",
    ["今天天气不错啊。"] = "The weather is nice today.",
    ["今天天气不错，在危机之后，城市需要修复，我们也需要休整。"] = "The weather is nice today. After the crisis, the city needs repair, and we also need to rest.",
    ["今天天气很好，休息一天。"] = "The weather is great today, taking a day off.",
    ["今天天气真好，亲爱的{{先生|小姐}}，来串葡萄尝尝，这没准是金秋湖最好吃的葡萄呢！"] = "The weather is so nice today, dear {{Mr.|Ms.}}. Have some grapes; these might be the best grapes in Golden Autumn Lake!",
    ["今天天气真好，亲爱的先生/小姐，来串葡萄尝尝，这没准是金秋湖最好吃的葡萄呢！"] = "The weather is so nice today, dear sir/madam. Come try a bunch of grapes; these might just be the most delicious grapes in Golden Autumn Lake!",
    ["今天天气真好，总觉得，适合在长椅上看书。"] = "The weather is lovely today. It feels perfect for reading on a bench.",
    ["今天奥利安娜太太忙晕了，我来帮弗莱买一些办公用品。"] = "Mrs. Orianna was busy today, so I came to help Frye buy some office supplies.",
    ["今天客人也挺多的……"] = "There are quite a lot of customers today too……",
    ["今天少干一点，明天少干一点，根本没人会发现。"] = "Do a little less today, a little less tomorrow, and nobody will ever notice.",
    ["今天就到这里吧，我也该走了。<P_Heart>（小声嘀咕）</>……从哪里搞到的这种材料，我也好想要一套。"] = "Let's stop here for today; I should be going. <P_Heart> (Muttering to himself) </> ...Where did he get this kind of material? I want a set too.",
    ["今天就到这里结束吧，我会很期待下次的见面。"] = "Let's end it here for today, I look forward to our next meeting.",
    ["今天就在这附近转转……"] = "I'll just wander around here today...",
    ["今天就能把这辆马车修好，等拿到尾款给珊妮买条鱼。"] = "I can finish fixing this carriage today. Once I get the final payment, I'll buy Sunny a fish.",
    ["今天就让你知道“终结者”的厉害。我会让你后悔来到这个场上！"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the 'Terminator'. I'll make you regret coming to this field!",
    ["今天就让你知道终结者的厉害。你会后悔来到这个场上！"] = "Today I'll show you the power of the Terminator. You'll regret coming to this arena!",
    ["今天已经有三位客人问那瓶茉莉晨露了，奈拉小姐还是不肯上架。"] = "Three customers have already asked about that bottle of Jasmine Morning Dew today, but Miss Naila still refuses to put it on the shelves.",
    ["今天已经签到过了，请明天再来"] = "Already checked in today. Please come back tomorrow.",
    ["今天已经给他打赏的够多了，明天再赏"] = "You have already rewarded them enough today; try again tomorrow.",
    ["今天带了好吃的……来，你说一句。"] = "I brought something delicious today... come on, say something.",
    ["今天开始，我，新的，“至尊霹雳舞王”！"] = "Starting today, I, the new, \"Supreme Breakdance King\"!",
    ["今天很晚了，你们可以先回家，明天休息半天。"] = "It's very late today, you can go home first, and take half a day off tomorrow.",
    ["今天怎么迟到了？"] = "Why are you late today?",
    ["今天我是来归还的，我们已经成功回到了自己的王国，我也想以个人的名义再次感谢帽子帮的成员们——"] = "Today I came to return it. We have successfully returned to our own kingdom, and I also want to thank the members of the Hat Gang again in my personal capacity—",
    ["今天我要把所有占卜法都试一遍！ 占卜师们在哪里？"] = "Today I'm going to try every divination method! Where are the diviners?",
    ["今天手气肯定不错，试试运气总没错！"] = "My luck must be good today, trying my luck is never wrong!",
    ["今天早上错过了九点钟的点名……反正已经错过点名了，去和不去也没有什么区别了。"] = "I missed the nine o'clock roll call this morning... Anyway, since I've already missed it, it doesn't make any difference whether I go or not.",
    ["今天是个特殊的日子，永暗蜡烛允诺你们永恒的安宁。"] = "Today is a special day; the Candle of Eternal Darkness promises you eternal peace.",
    ["今天是他的大日子，他会获得永暗蜡烛的垂怜！肯定在哪准备呢！"] = "Today is his big day; he will receive the mercy of the Candle of Eternal Darkness! He must be preparing somewhere!",
    ["今天是你第一天入职，可以先熟悉一下。"] = "Today is your first day on the job, so you can familiarize yourself with things first.",
    ["今天是情人的登台一周年，市长候选人要来看她的演出。"] = "Today is the one-year anniversary of his lover's debut, and the mayoral candidate is coming to see her performance.",
    ["今天是意外情况，以后应该不会、不经常这样，我挺喜欢这份工作。"] = "Today was an accidental situation; it shouldn't happen often in the future. I quite like this job.",
    ["今天是我的生日？我不记得了，但你们不需要做这些。"] = "Today is my birthday? I didn't remember, but you didn't need to do all this.",
    ["今天是珍妮最幸福的一天，珍妮从来没有这么开心过。珍妮会好好把这些记忆藏在心底。"] = "Today is the happiest day of Jenny's life; Jenny has never been this happy before. Jenny will keep these memories tucked away deep in her heart.",
    ["今天是第三轮比赛，去屏障碎片附近吧。"] = "Today is the third round of the competition; let's head near the barrier fragment.",
    ["今天有个年轻男人来找你占卜，抱着猫来的。"] = "A young man came to you for divination today, carrying a cat.",
    ["今天有家人不在，没让进。"] = "The family wasn't home today, they didn't let me in.",
    ["今天有特大新闻，快来看一看！"] = "Big news today, come and take a look!",
    ["今天有的是行李箱需要我们搬运，每个人都有机会赚上几苏勒！"] = "There are plenty of suitcases to move today, and everyone has a chance to earn a few shillings!",
    ["今天正好是学生社团招新的日子，很有趣，去看看吧。"] = "Today just happens to be the day for student club recruitment. It sounds interesting; let's go take a look.",
    ["今天点赞数量已达上限"] = "Daily like limit reached.",
    ["今天特意过来这里，马戏团却休息了，好遗憾啊…"] = "I came here specially today, but the circus is closed. What a pity...",
    ["今天由我帮父亲照看报亭，这是你要的日报，没什么事就赶快走吧！"] = "I'm helping my father look after the newsstand today. Here is the daily paper you wanted, hurry off if there's nothing else!",
    ["今天的“幸运蛋”想必大家都看过了，它来自一只身份特殊的鸡，当然我们的工作人员也相当努力，挑选了和“幸运蛋”几乎一模一样的其他蛋！"] = "Everyone must have seen today's \"Lucky Egg\"; it comes from a chicken with a special identity. Of course, our staff also worked quite hard to select other eggs that are almost identical to the \"Lucky Egg\"!",
    ["今天的《塔索克报》，新鲜出炉的报纸。"] = "Today's Tussock Times, fresh off the press.",
    ["今天的事按部就班做完就好，没什么特别的。"] = "Just finish today's tasks as planned, nothing special.",
    ["今天的你格外有魅力。别浪费这份迷人，多交些朋友吧！"] = "You are exceptionally charming today. Don't waste this allure; go make some friends!",
    ["今天的勿忘我依旧很漂亮……"] = "Today's forget-me-nots are still very beautiful...",
    ["今天的南瓜怎么这么轻……像是空心的？"] = "Why is today's pumpkin so light... like it's hollow?",
    ["今天的夕阳很适合画画。我得回去了，{{先生|女士}}，再见。"] = "Today's sunset is perfect for painting. I must return now, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. Goodbye.",
    ["今天的天气不好不坏，很平常。"] = "Today's weather is neither bad nor good, very ordinary.",
    ["今天的天气可真不错，你也来这里散散心吗？"] = "The weather is really nice today. Are you here to relax too?",
    ["今天的工作顺利吗？"] = "Did work go well today?",
    ["今天的床有点硬……"] = "The bed is a bit hard today...",
    ["今天的廷根也很和平啊。"] = "Tingen is very peaceful today as well.",
    ["今天的手冲味道很浓郁，可惜没什么人点。"] = "Today's pour-over is very rich, but unfortunately, no one ordered it.",
    ["今天的手冲就很不错，迪西咖啡，十分醇厚。如果喜欢甜一点的，茉莉拿铁也是不错的选择。"] = "Today's pour-over is quite good, a Deisi coffee, very mellow. If you prefer something sweeter, the jasmine latte is also a good choice.",
    ["今天的报纸。这里有篇文章讲到教育改革。听说教会学校今年扩招了。"] = "Today's newspaper. There's an article here about educational reform. I heard the church schools expanded their enrollment this year.",
    ["今天的拍摄到此为止，真期待下次会拍到什么有趣的画面呢。"] = "Today's shooting ends here. I really look forward to what interesting scenes we will capture next time.",
    ["今天的拍摄就到这里吧，让我们下次再见。"] = "Let's stop today's shooting here, let's meet again next time.",
    ["今天的整理和打扫工作也都做完了。"] = "Today's tidying and cleaning work are all done too.",
    ["今天的新闻可不得了！"] = "The news today is incredible!",
    ["今天的柴火怎么点不着啊……"] = "Why won't the firewood light today...",
    ["今天的氛围真好，安安静静的很舒心。"] = "The atmosphere today is really good, quiet and comfortable.",
    ["今天的活儿就快干完了……"] = "Today's work is almost done...",
    ["今天的白玫瑰开得很好，可惜来买白玫瑰的人，心情大多不太好。"] = "Today's white roses are blooming beautifully, but unfortunately, most people who come to buy white roses are not in a good mood.",
    ["今天的肉沫炖土豆，我找了一个小时才找到几粒肉沫！"] = "Today's minced meat stewed potatoes, I searched for an hour and only found a few grains of minced meat!",
    ["今天的肉看起来真新鲜。"] = "The meat looks really fresh today.",
    ["今天的菜是你做的？"] = "Did you make today's dishes?",
    ["今天的衣料供应商真好说话……咦？前面那位小姐的身形好眼熟。"] = "The fabric supplier was so easy to talk to today... Huh? The figure of that lady ahead looks so familiar.",
    ["今天的货物好像没齐啊……"] = "The goods don't seem to be complete today...",
    ["今天的运势被迷雾笼罩，充满未知。坚信内心的方向，命运在你的手中！"] = "Today's fortune is shrouded in mist, full of unknowns. Trust the direction in your heart, fate is in your hands!",
    ["今天的面试在<P_Yellow>行政办公室</>，你沿着主路一直走就到了。"] = "Today's interview is at the <P_Yellow>Administrative Office</>. Just follow the main road and you'll be there.",
    ["今天的风好舒服啊！"] = "The wind is so comfortable today!",
    ["今天看到了很有趣的内容，就到此为止吧。"] = "I saw some very interesting content today, let's stop here.",
    ["今天真的谢谢你，但是时候说再见了。"] = "Thank you for everything today, but it is time to say goodbye.",
    ["今天祷告的时候，有几个孩子跳起来，嘴里叫着“无聊”“听不懂”。"] = "During prayer today, a few children jumped up, shouting 'boring' and 'I don't understand'.",
    ["今天累得都快散架了。"] = "I'm so tired today I'm about to fall apart.",
    ["今天罗珊和一个来委托的女孩成为了朋友，还约好休息日去逛街。"] = "Roselle became friends with a girl who came to commission a task today, and they even agreed to go shopping on their day off.",
    ["今天苹果花开了，我摘了几朵放在你床边。 你说你喜欢这个味道， 所以我每年都会摘。\n\n不管发生什么，这里的花还会开， 妈妈也还会在。\n\n你只管好好睡， 等你醒来，一切都会好的。"] = "The apple blossoms bloomed today, so I picked a few and placed them by your bedside. You said you liked this scent, so I pick them every year. \n\n No matter what happens, the flowers here will still bloom, and Mother will still be here. \n\n You just sleep well; when you wake up, everything will be fine.",
    ["今天要几点才能去买咖啡、面包和黄油呢？"] = "What time can I go buy coffee, Bread, and butter today?",
    ["今天说要和你去看日出，明天又想去森林里漫步。"] = "One day they want to watch the sunrise with you, the next they want to stroll in the forest.",
    ["今天谢谢你……{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Thank you for today... {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["今天还得完成巴纳比队长交代的事。"] = "I still have to finish what Captain Barnaby assigned today.",
    ["今天还有68套要拍摄，不知道能不能做完……"] = "There are 68 more sets to shoot today, I don't know if I can finish...",
    ["今天这首，你弹得真好。"] = "You played this piece really well today.",
    ["今天迟到这么久，去了也是挨骂。或许我该直接回家，躺在沙发上，假装这一切都没发生。"] = "Being this late today, I'll just get scolded if I go. Maybe I should just go home, lie on the sofa, and pretend none of this ever happened.",
    ["今天需要展示一下剧情编辑器的一些功能，需要你配合一下。"] = "I need to demonstrate some features of the plot editor today, and I need your cooperation.",
    ["今天鸟儿们没有来……"] = "The birds didn't come today...",
    ["今天，今天我应该虔诚祈祷，让女神眷顾我明天的牌运！"] = "Today, today I should pray devoutly and let the Goddess bless my luck with cards tomorrow!",
    ["今天，她就要被别人求婚了。而我？我连一句确定的承诺都不敢说出口！"] = "Today, she is going to be proposed to by someone else. And me? I don't even dare to make a firm promise!",
    ["今天，我们之所以相聚在这里，是为了祭奠我们的老朋友，霍普先生。"] = "Today, the reason we have gathered here is to pay our respects to our old friend, Mr. Hope.",
    ["今天，我们有会员还带着他的朋友慕名前来。"] = "Today, we have a member who even brought his friend here, having heard of your reputation.",
    ["今年是最后一学年了，毕业后不知道该去做些什么？"] = "This is the last academic year, I don't know what to do after graduation?",
    ["今年的卷心菜干巴巴的。"] = "The cabbages are dry and withered this year.",
    ["今年的政府雇员统一考试报名开始了，你准备好了吗？"] = "The registration for this year's government employee unified exam has started, are you ready?",
