    ["以下仅在战略模式下生效"] = "The following only takes effect in Strategy Mode",
    ["以下哪个是鲁恩王国正统教会之名？"] = "Which of the following is the name of an orthodox church in the Loen Kingdom?",
    ["以下哪位不是救赎蔷薇的成员？"] = "Which of the following is not a member of the Rose Redemption?",
