    ["以下角色属性35%生效"] = "The following character attributes are 35% effective",
    ["以下谁不是愚者座下的天使？"] = "Which of the following is not an Angel under the Fool?",
    ["以不停歇的连续攻势打断敌人并造成多段伤害，随后灵性凝结为巨人实体发动终结一击，对衰败的敌人额外增伤。释放后获得4枚黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。"] = "Interrupt enemies with an unceasing continuous offensive, dealing multi-stage damage, then condense spirituality into a giant entity to launch a finisher, dealing extra damage to decayed enemies. Gain 4 Dusk Marks (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills) after release.",
    ["以为要下雨根本没下，伞白带了一整天。"] = "Thought it would rain but it didn't, carried the umbrella for nothing all day.",
    ["以他们的方式致敬！"] = "Pay tribute in their way!",
    ["以众神为证，以命运为契。无论前路如何，你我同行。"] = "With the gods as witness, with fate as the contract. No matter what lies ahead, we walk together.",
    ["以体内迸发的光辉凝聚三柄短斧，短斧环绕自身持续打击周身的敌人，造成伤害、减疗和滞涩，自身持续获得太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）。"] = "Condense three short axes with the radiance bursting from within; the axes orbit the user, continuously striking surrounding enemies, dealing damage, Healing Reduction, and Stagnation. The user continuously gains Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear).",
    ["以体内迸发的光辉凝聚三柄短斧，短斧环绕自身持续打击周身的敌人，造成伤害与减速效果。"] = "Condense three short axes from the brilliance bursting from within; the axes orbit you, continuously striking surrounding enemies and dealing damage and slow.",
    ["以体内迸发的光辉凝聚三柄短斧，短斧环绕自身持续打击周身的敌人，造成伤害和减速效果。"] = "Condenses three short axes from the radiance bursting within the body. The axes orbit the user, continuously striking nearby enemies, dealing damage and applying a slow effect.",
    ["以你们的死亡，颂扬家族的荣耀！"] = "With your deaths, praise the glory of the Family!",
    ["以你的序列，最好别有这种危险的念头，不然——嗯，谁的信？"] = "Given your Sequence, it's best not to have such dangerous thoughts, otherwise—hmm, whose letter is this?",
    ["以俱乐部为单位进行分配，将筛选非凡者人数、活跃度、非凡评分符合要求的俱乐部参与，获得资格的俱乐部非凡者可在以战养战-势力-猎城战界面查看赛程安排。\n同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Highlight>16人</>，请合理规划阵容配置。\n战役结束时，会根据四皇势力积分、排名分获得不同档次的奖励，<Highlight>占领中央王城</>可直接结束战场，获得最后赢家的奖励。"] = "Distribution is carried out on a club basis, screening clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Beyonders, activity level, and Beyonder rating to participate. Qualified club Beyonders can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Hunting City Battle interface. \n A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 people </> on the field per club; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n At the end of the campaign, different tiers of rewards will be obtained based on the Four Emperors faction points and ranking points. <Highlight> Occupying the Central Royal City </> can directly end the battlefield and obtain the final winner's rewards.",
    ["以俱乐部为单位进行分配，将筛选非凡者人数、活跃度、非凡评分符合要求的俱乐部参与，获得资格的俱乐部非凡者可在以战养战-势力-猎城战界面查看赛程安排。\n同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Highlight>16人</>，请合理规划阵容配置。\n战役结束时，会根据王城占领进度排名分获得不同档次的奖励，进度相同时根据势力积分来排名。<Highlight>占领中央王城</>可直接结束战场，获得最后赢家的奖励。"] = "Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Beyonders, activity, and Beyonder score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Beyonders can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - City of Dragon Hunting interface. \n A single pathway can have at most <Highlight> 16 people </> from the same club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. \n When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the royal city occupation progress. If the progress is the same, the ranking will be based on faction points. <Highlight> Occupying the central royal city </> can directly end the battlefield and obtain the winner's rewards.",
    ["以先祖的荣耀起誓，冲锋——"] = "Swearing by the glory of the ancestors, charge—",
    ["以光为证，裁定尔罪，当受烈阳之怒。"] = "With light as witness, I judge your sins; suffer the wrath of the Blazing Sun.",
    ["以全身心的虔诚为引，撕裂现实与太阳领域的微薄壁垒，召唤一道不掺丝毫凡俗杂质的圣光垂落自身。"] = "Using wholehearted piety as a guide, tear the thin barrier between reality and the Sun domain, summoning a beam of Holy Light untainted by any mundane impurities to descend upon oneself.",
    ["以全身心的虔诚为引，撕裂现实与太阳领域的微薄壁垒，召唤一道不掺丝毫凡俗杂质的圣光垂落自身。圣光如温润水流般包裹躯体，缓缓涤荡灵性中沾染的污秽、战斗残留的精神耗损与内心滋生的迷茫。\n使自身获得学识加4，魅力加2。"] = "Using wholehearted piety as a guide, tear through the thin barrier between reality and the Sun's domain, summoning a beam of Holy Light that falls upon you, untainted by any worldly impurities. The Holy Light wraps around your body like gentle water, slowly washing away the filth stained upon your spirituality, the mental exhaustion remaining from battle, and the confusion born within. \n Grants yourself +4 Knowledge and +2 Charisma.",
    ["以公证能力无效化自身受到的控制并获得增益，回复生命，获得霸体和减伤，同时对周身的敌人造成伤害。"] = "Use Notarization ability to nullify control effects received and gain buffs, restore health, and gain Super Armor and Damage Reduction, while dealing damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["以前你和克莱恩一起生活在廷根吗？"] = "Did you and Klein live in Tingen before?",
    ["以前她一走，瓦莱莉就哭。她索性编了故事哄小瓦莱莉开心。"] = "In the past, whenever she left, Valerie would cry. So she simply made up a story to cheer little Valerie up.",
    ["以前我不觉得，现在发现，他说话还真有点道理。"] = "I didn't think so before, but now I find that what he says actually makes some sense.",
    ["以前母亲虔诚地信仰着黑夜女神，莫雷蒂家每天都要向女神祈祷，因此我们学了不少颂歌。"] = "My mother used to be a devout believer of the Evernight Goddess, and the Moretti family prayed to the Goddess every day, so we learned quite a few hymns.",
    ["以前每年会去一两次，我记得拍卖会上有件趣事：巴顿男爵坚称某幅油画是名家真迹，花了八百镑拍下。"] = "I used to go once or twice a year. I remember an interesting incident at an auction: Baron Barton insisted that a certain oil painting was an authentic work by a famous master and spent eight hundred pounds to win the bid.",
    ["以前的那个家。"] = "That home from before.",
    ["以前这叫维尔的餐厅，时间可过得真快，现在都成老维尔餐厅了。"] = "It used to be called Will's Restaurant. Time really flies; now it's become Old Will's Restaurant.",
    ["以前这里是廷根最热闹的广场，现在已经没落了。看看周遭的环境你就知道，这儿的人为什么越来越少了。"] = "This used to be the liveliest square in Tingen, but now it has declined. Look at the surrounding environment and you'll know why there are fewer and fewer people here.",
    ["以前邓恩队长说过，很多年前，一场疾病夺走了老尼尔即将订婚的恋人。"] = "Captain Dunn once said that many years ago, a disease took away Old Neil's fiancée, whom he was about to marry.",
    ["以前都不知道他上班，要走这么远。"] = "I never knew he had to walk so far to get to work.",
    ["以前？"] = "Before?",
    ["以剑气连续攻击当前目标。"] = "Continuously attack the current target with sword energy.",
    ["以十字路口为核心，两条道路交错而成的铁十字街。"] = "With the intersection as the core, Iron Cross Street is formed by two intersecting roads.",
    ["以单体伤害和死灵印记削弱关键目标。"] = "Weakens key targets with single-target damage and Necrotic Mark.",
    ["以及什么？"] = "And what else?",
    ["以及你。"] = "And you.",
    ["以及将城堡打理得井井有条之人，乃至在交错铁路上积累财富成就大亨之人——任意一条，皆可留名于此。"] = "And those who keep the castle in perfect order, or even those who have accumulated wealth on the crisscrossing railways to become tycoons—any one of these can leave their name here.",
    ["以及，必须遵守规则，否则我们的人会随时请你离开。"] = "Also, you must follow the rules, otherwise our people will ask you to leave at any time.",
    ["以及，指导我们的新鲜血液。"] = "And to guide our fresh blood.",
    ["以双手托举星辉，用歌声守护美梦。\n\n卡萝·比舍普"] = "Holding starlight in both hands, guarding beautiful dreams with song.\n\nCarol Bishop",
    ["以后你要是遇到类似的情况，千万不要遗漏，那或许是相当重要的物品。"] = "If you encounter similar situations in the future, never overlook them; they might be quite important items.",
    ["以后如果在海上听到这种歌声，建议你立刻捂住耳朵，或者……跳进海里。"] = "If you hear this kind of singing at sea in the future, I suggest you cover your ears immediately, or... jump into the sea.",
    ["以后就不再空荡荡了。"] = "It won't be empty anymore.",
    ["以后有机会的话，我们可以一起坐下来、喝杯咖啡、聊聊天。"] = "If there's a chance in the future, we can sit down together, have a cup of coffee, and chat.",
    ["以后还有很多机会互相了解，队长应该正等着你，去吧。"] = "There will be plenty of opportunities to get to know each other later. The captain should be waiting for you, go ahead.",
    ["以后这套拳法就叫——<P_Yellow>我要你鼠</>！拳法！"] = "From now on, this martial art shall be called—<P_Yellow> I Want You Rat </>! Martial Arts!",
    ["以后这棵树会长得比我高吗？"] = "Will this tree grow taller than me in the future?",
    ["以后，教会的人会指导你使用非凡能力，告诉你那些地方在哪里。"] = "In the future, people from the church will guide you in using Beyonder powers and tell you where those places are.",
    ["以塔罗之名传递火种，只为末日之后，仍有明日。"] = "Passing the spark in the name of the Tarot, only so that after the apocalypse, there is still a tomorrow.",
    ["以多段震地覆盖大范围敌人。"] = "Covers a large area of enemies with multi-stage ground slams.",
    ["以太体"] = "Ether Body",
    ["以太阳之名，净化一切不洁。"] = "In the name of the Sun, purify all that is unclean.",
    ["以太阳途径象征物萃取的精油，可强化光、勇气与精神意志。"] = "Essential oil extracted from Sun Pathway symbols, which can strengthen light, courage, and mental will.",
    ["以契合太阳神性象征的词句咏颂赞歌。"] = "Chant hymns with phrases that fit the symbolism of the Sun God's divinity.",
    ["以契合太阳神性象征的词句咏颂赞歌，使自身获得魅力加1。\n期间周围的玩家可以获得临时技能来加入赞颂烈阳，加入赞颂烈阳的玩家也可以获得魅力加1。"] = "Chant a hymn using words that resonate with the divinity of the Sun, granting yourself +1 Charisma. \n During this time, surrounding players can gain a temporary skill to join in Praising the Sun; players who join in Praising the Sun also gain +1 Charisma.",
    ["以女神之名，播撒慈爱之光\n\n<Letter_Highlight>食物供应</>\n黑面包和豌豆汤\n\n<Letter_Highlight>夜间庇护</>\n提供吊床或地铺\n\n<Letter_Highlight>工作机会</>\n简单易上手的劳动\n\n床位有限，需排队，最多入住五天"] = "In the name of the Goddess, spreading the light of compassion \n\n<Letter_Highlight> Food supply </>\n Black bread and pea soup \n\n<Letter_Highlight> Night shelter </>\n Hammocks or floor mats provided \n\n<Letter_Highlight> Job opportunities </>\n Simple and easy labor \n\n Beds are limited, queuing required, maximum stay of five days",
    ["以它为圆心，十米范围内将充斥纯净温暖的力量，正常人无法察觉，但死灵类怪物将不断受到伤害，它们会如同炽热火球下的水池，飞快地“蒸发”着，哪怕怨魂和幽影，也同样如此，只是会支撑得更久一点。"] = "With it as the center, a ten-meter radius will be filled with pure and warm power. Normal people cannot perceive it, but undead monsters will be continuously damaged. They will \"evaporate\" rapidly like a pool under a scorching fireball, even Wraiths and Shadows, though they will last a bit longer.",
    ["以宝石为食的异常生物，体内残留强烈矿物灵性。"] = "An abnormal creature that feeds on gemstones, with strong mineral spirituality remaining in its body.",
    ["以家族为名，不以血缘相连，却以誓言为锁。"] = "In the name of the family, not connected by blood, but locked by oaths.",
    ["以家族为名，以誓言为锁，向各自信仰的神灵起誓：在疯狂降临时彼此拉回，在黑暗侵袭时互为眼睛，在命运的深渊边缘互为锚点。"] = "In the name of the Family, with oaths as our locks, we swear to the deities we each believe in: to pull each other back when madness descends, to be each other's eyes when darkness encroaches, and to serve as each other's anchors at the edge of the abyss of fate.",
    ["以家族为名，以誓言为锁，在命运的深渊边缘互为锚点"] = "In the name of the Family, with oaths as our locks, we serve as each other's anchors at the edge of the abyss of fate.",
    ["以往一个重伤就会把一个家搞垮。现在靠手术，不少人都能重返岗位了。就算术后偶有感染，我们把后续的消毒和换药流程也早练得熟透了，大多都能稳住！"] = "In the past, one serious injury would ruin a family. Now, thanks to surgery, many people can return to their posts. Even if there is occasional post-operative infection, we have long practiced the subsequent disinfection and dressing change procedures, and most can be stabilized!",
    ["以心为钥，打开世界的门扉，行走于空间的夹缝之中。"] = "Use the heart as a key to open the door of the world and walk in the cracks of space.",
    ["以怒潮三击进行多段输出，并借雷潮护盾承受伤害。"] = "Perform multi-stage output with Three Strikes of the Angry Tide and use the Thunder Tide Shield to absorb damage.",
    ["以恐惧尖叫打击周围敌人；登场时召唤同星级巴尼先生作为陪伴的玩偶。"] = "Strike surrounding enemies with a fearful scream; summon Mr. Barney of the same star level as a companion doll upon entry.",
    ["以恒"] = "Yiheng",
    ["以恶意与污秽之名，我，欲念使者与<TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>设立赌约，一经签署，双方不可违背。\n\n1、桌上有<Highlight>真</>与<Highlight>假</>两种子弹，每轮数量不同，你选择时，无法辨别其真伪。\n2、我知晓每一枚子弹的真伪，并按每轮规则，对其进行排除。\n3、你可以在剩下的子弹中，<Highlight>重新</>选择一次。\n4、我只会说<Highlight>实话</>。\n\n赌注很简单：\n你赢了，<Highlight>奖励</>归你。\n你输了，<Highlight>性命</>归我，<Highlight>欲望</>归我。\n——签下你的名字吧，赌徒。"] = "In the name of malice and filth, I, the Messenger of Desire, and <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </> set a wager; once signed, neither party may renege. \n\n 1. There are <Highlight>real</> and <Highlight>fake</> bullets on the table, with different quantities each round; you cannot distinguish them when choosing. \n 2. I know the truth of every bullet and will exclude them according to the rules of each round. \n 3. You may <Highlight>re-choose</> once from the remaining bullets. \n 4. I will only speak the <Highlight>truth</>. \n\n The stakes are simple: \nIf you win, the <Highlight>reward</> is yours. \n If you lose, your <Highlight>life</> is mine, and your <Highlight>desires</> are mine. \n —Sign your name, Gambler.",
    ["以恶意冲击伤害并击退前方敌人。"] = "Use Malice Impact to damage and knock back enemies in front.",
    ["以悠扬歌声赞美太阳，为同伴注入勇气与力量，消解恐惧与阴霾，带来虔诚之心与服从之意，让温暖的旋律在战场上回荡。"] = "Praises the Sun with a melodious song, infusing companions with courage and strength, dissolving fear and gloom, bringing a heart of piety and obedience, and letting warm melodies echo on the battlefield.",
    ["以惊人的怒吼震慑敌人，随后召唤巨人分身猛击地面，造成范围伤害和减速效果。"] = "Deter enemies with a stunning Roar, then summon a giant projection to Slam the ground, causing area damage and a Slow effect.",
    ["以我的人格、信仰作为担保，我的行为全部遵守公司规章制度，并无违规操作的部分。"] = "With my character and faith as a guarantee, my actions all comply with company regulations, and there are no non-compliant operations.",
    ["以我的审美，还会欺骗你吗？不愧是“愚者”先生亲自祝福过的翅膀……质感确实不一样。"] = "With my aesthetic sense, would I lie to you? As expected of wings personally blessed by Mr. Fool... the texture is indeed different.",
    ["以我的审美，还会欺骗你吗？不愧是愚者先生亲自祝福过的翅膀……质感确实不一样。"] = "Given my aesthetic standards, would I lie to you? These wings are truly worthy of the blessing from Mr. Fool himself... The texture is indeed different.",
    ["以战养战"] = "Sustain War with War",
    ["以战养战-势力"] = "Sustain War with War - Faction",
    ["以战养战-征伐"] = "Sustain War with War - Conquest",
    ["以战养战-竞逐"] = "Sustain War with War - Competition",
    ["以战养战·势力"] = "War-Driven Growth: Faction",
    ["以战养战·竞逐"] = "War-Driven Growth: Competition",
    ["以战养战秘宝"] = "War-Nourished Treasure",
    ["以战养战秘宝进度"] = "War-Nourished Treasure Progress",
    ["以手中之剑刺破世间之恶。"] = "Pierce the evil of the world with the sword in hand.",
    ["以手中巨剑，代黄昏裁决。"] = "Use the greatsword in hand to judge on behalf of the dusk.",
    ["以手为枪向前瞄准。这或许是一个玩笑，也可能不是。"] = "Aiming forward with hands as a gun. This might be a joke, or it might not.",
    ["以挂接骨骼的方式播放音效/音频事件"] = "Play sound effect/audio event by attaching to skeleton",
    ["以斯拉"] = "Ezra",
    ["以旁观之眼，洞察潜意识，疗愈心灵的岛屿。"] = "With the eye of a spectator, gain insight into the subconscious and heal the islands of the heart.",
    ["以时代的洪流，叩开镜中的国度。"] = "With the torrent of the era, knock open the kingdom within the mirror.",
    ["以星芒凝聚囚笼，对目标造成伤害和眩晕并获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。可被技能知识逐人强化，控制变为范围控制。"] = "Condense a cage with starlight to deal damage and stun the target, gaining mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills). Can be strengthened by the Knowledge Pursuit skill, turning the control into area control.",
    ["以晨曦之剑，刺破擅闯者的虚伪！"] = "With the Sword of Dawn, pierce the hypocrisy of the trespassers!",
    ["以最快的速度清剿丧尸"] = "Clear out the zombies as fast as possible",
    ["以极佳评价完成“厂际竞速”事件"] = "Complete the \"Inter-factory Racing\" event with an Excellent rating.",
    ["以极致的工艺打磨边缘至璨金，令每次投掷时，都闪烁着流光溢彩的色泽，是实力与品味最耀眼的证明。"] = "Polished with exquisite craftsmanship to a brilliant gold edge, it glimmers with iridescent colors with every roll—the most dazzling proof of strength and taste.",
    ["以此为印，封存另一重容貌。"] = "With this as a seal, seal away another appearance.",
    ["以气势震慑风雪"] = "Deter the snow and wind with aura",
    ["以水银之蛇的名义，标记你的宿命。 "] = "In the name of the Mercury Snake, mark your destiny.",
    ["以潮拳对1格内当前目标造成90%攻击力伤害。"] = "Deal 90% attack damage to the current target within 1 grid with Tide Fist.",
    ["以灰雾至高位格影响目标—100%基础概率沉默*d秒，影响结束后目标受到*d点伤害，如果期间目标解控则受到*d点伤害。（影响同时自身获得灰雾加持效果）"] = "Influence the target with the high-level status of the gray fog—100% base probability to Silence for *d seconds. After the effect ends, the target takes *d damage. If the target uses Cleanse during this period, they take *d damage. (You gain the gray fog Blessing effect simultaneously.)",
    ["以灰雾至高位格影响目标，影响结束后目标受到一定伤害，如果期间目标解控则会受到高额伤害。（影响同时自身获得灰雾加持效果）"] = "Influence the target with the high-level status of the gray fog. After the effect ends, the target takes damage. If the target uses Cleanse during this period, they take high damage. (You gain the gray fog Blessing effect simultaneously.)",
    ["以灵力凝弦，弹射一道贯穿大地的锋矢。箭出如律令，破开一切挡在前路的障碍——无论是敌人，还是命运。"] = "Condense strings with spirituality and fire an arrow that pierces the earth. The arrow flies like a command, breaking through every obstacle in its path—whether it be enemies or fate.",
    ["以灵性凝聚剑气，将敌人拉至身前并附加滞涩，随后向前方全力跳劈造成伤害，自身获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能），对玩家造成禁锢和减疗。防御形态可嘲讽怪物。"] = "Condense sword energy with spirituality to pull enemies toward you and apply stagnation, then perform a full-force jump slash forward to deal damage. You gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills), and apply imprisonment and healing reduction to players. Defense Form can taunt monsters.",
    ["以灵性凝聚铠甲覆盖全身，获得吸收伤害的护盾和黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能），在护盾被击破时持续霸体。携带此技能在低生命时获得防御和减伤。"] = "Condense armor with spirituality to cover your body, gaining a shield that absorbs damage and a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Gain continuous super armor when the shield is broken. Carrying this skill grants defense and damage reduction at low health.",
    ["以灵性凝聚铠甲覆盖全身，获得吸收伤害的护盾和黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能），在护盾被击破时持续霸体。携带此技能在低生命时获得高额减伤。"] = "Condense armor with spirituality to cover your body, gaining a shield that absorbs damage and a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Gain continuous super armor when the shield is broken. Carrying this skill grants high damage reduction at low health.",
    ["以灵性凝聚铠甲覆盖全身，获得吸收伤害的护盾，在护盾被击破时持续霸体。"] = "Condense armor with spirituality to cover your body, gaining a shield that absorbs damage, and maintain Super Armor when the shield is broken.",
    ["以灵性凝聚银白细剑发动出其不意的打击，获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能），攻击力获得强化，并且在攻击时会进行追击造成额外伤害。"] = "Condense a silver rapier with spirituality to launch a surprise attack, gaining a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Attack power is strengthened, and you perform a pursuit attack for extra damage.",
    ["以灵性驱动后会发出夜莺鸣唱般的声音"] = "After being driven by spirituality, it will emit a sound like a nightingale's song",
    ["以热情的言辞消融寒冰"] = "Melt the ice with enthusiastic words",
    ["以爪击和狼嚎攻击前方敌人。"] = "Attack enemies in front with Claw Strike and Wolf Howl.",
    ["以爱之名，开启一生的旅程。你是我在命运的路途上最坚定选择的同行者。"] = "In the name of love, start a lifelong journey. You are the companion I have most firmly chosen on the path of fate.",
    ["以特制星象盘为媒介观测星轨投影，解读星轨运行变化以获取事态趋势与危险预感，同时可小幅干扰他人的基础占卜，是占星人触碰星界空间与星象法则的核心能力。"] = "Use a special astrolabe as a medium to observe astral projections, interpreting changes in star orbits to obtain trends and danger warnings. It can also slightly interfere with others' basic divination; this is the core ability for an Astrologer to touch upon astral space and the laws of astrology.",
    ["以狼王之名"] = "In the Name of the Wolf King",
    ["以璀璨之名"] = "In the Name of Brilliance",
    ["以疯狂谢幕"] = "Curtain call with madness",
    ["以白枫木板拼接打磨而成，造型朴实，适合日常书案收纳。"] = "Made by splicing and polishing white maple boards, the design is simple and suitable for daily desk storage.",
    ["以知识的力量，赋予未来。"] = "Bestow upon the future with the power of knowledge.",
    ["以知识解读"] = "Interpret with Knowledge",
    ["以磅礴的知识力量创造信息洪流不断冲击敌人，持续消耗神秘知识造成高额伤害。"] = "Use the power of vast knowledge to create a Torrent of Information that continuously strikes enemies, consuming mystical knowledge to deal high damage over time.",
    ["以神之名"] = "In the Name of God",
    ["以纯白之光毁灭强敌，炽热的光芒如闪电般劈下对目标造成多次打击，每次造成伤害递增。"] = "Destroy strong enemies with pure white light; the scorching light strikes like lightning, dealing multiple hits to the target, with each hit dealing increasing damage.",
    ["以脱手形式施放特定技能"] = "Cast a specific skill in a detached form.",
    ["以自身窥秘灵性凝出一张隐秘纸条，展开后纸上会浮现一条无关紧要的日常小秘密，揭示周遭被忽略的细碎真相，看完后纸条便随灵性消散，是窥秘人触碰 “隐秘” 本质的入门能力。"] = "Use your Mystery Pryer spirituality to condense a Secret Note. When unfolded, a trivial daily secret appears on it, revealing overlooked fragments of truth in the surroundings. The note dissipates with your spirituality after being read; it is an introductory ability for a Mystery Pryer to touch the essence of the \"Hidden\".",
    ["以舞步丈量人心，用回眸收割沉沦。"] = "Measure the human heart with dance steps, harvest the fallen with a glance back.",
    ["以血焰横扫前方，造成<HighLight>180%</>攻击伤害；自身攻速提高<HighLight>30%</>，持续<HighLight>4</>秒。"] = "Sweep forward with blood flames, dealing <HighLight>180%</> attack damage; self Attack Speed increased by <HighLight>30%</>, lasting <HighLight>4</> seconds.",
    ["以裹挟潮水的重拳攻击1格内当前目标，造成<color=red>90%攻击力伤害</color>。"] = "Attack the current target within 1 grid with a heavy punch imbued with sea waves, dealing <color=red>90% attack damage</color>.",
    ["以誓言为薪，以羁绊为火。队伍或团队中，拥有相同家族成员时，获得属性增益。成员数量越多，增益越强。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "Use oaths as fuel, use bonds as fire. Gain attribute bonuses when members of the same Family are in the party or team. The more members, the stronger the bonus. There is a 24-hour cooldown period after leaving a Family.",
    ["以诗句平复呓语，用韵脚缝合理智。"] = "Soothe the whispers with verses, stitch together sanity with rhymes.",
    ["以谦逊之心，接受前辈教诲。"] = "With a humble heart, accept the teachings of your predecessors.",
    ["以退为进"] = "Retreat to Advance",
    ["以退为进失效，上一站进行了交易操作"] = "Retreat as Advance failed, a transaction was made at the previous station",
    ["以退为进生效，本站所有买入价格降低80%，卖出价提升80%"] = "Strategic Retreat effective, all purchase prices at this station reduced by 80%, selling prices increased by 80%",
    ["以金色光芒凝聚盔甲护佑自身，获得格挡提升和太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪），释放二段连招后解除控制。"] = "Condense armor with golden light to protect oneself, gaining increased block and Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear). Release the second stage of the combo to remove control effects.",
    ["以防万一，我的确是带着原材料过来的。"] = "Just in case, I did bring the raw materials with me.",
    ["以鲜血证明实力，击杀一切敌对目标。\n积攒段位胜点：<Green>%s</>/<Highlight>200</>"] = "Prove your strength with blood and kill all hostile targets. \n Accumulate Rank Points: <Green>%s</>/<Highlight>200</>",
    ["以黑与白裁出的移动礼服，银纹沿车身蜿蜒，如亲手绣就的绅士徽章。在廷根的上流社交圈里，它是最体面的出行方式。"] = "A mobile formal suit tailored in black and white, with silver patterns winding along the body like a gentleman's badge embroidered by hand. In Tingen's high-society circles, it is the most decent way to travel.",
    ["仪式"] = "Ritual",
    ["仪式上的蜡烛"] = "Candles at the Ceremony",
    ["仪式中断，强尼陷入虚弱！"] = "The ritual is interrupted; Johnny has fallen into Weakness!",
    ["仪式净化"] = "Ritual Purification",
    ["仪式净化目标"] = "Ritual purification target",
    ["仪式功能暂时关闭"] = "The ritual feature is temporarily closed.",
    ["仪式即将成形……"] = "The ritual is about to take shape...",
    ["仪式完成后，你就能痊愈，就能获得新生了。"] = "After the ritual is complete, you will be healed and reborn.",
    ["仪式引来邪神注视，周围的一切都被污染了。"] = "The ritual attracted the gaze of an evil god, and everything around was corrupted.",
    ["仪式怪物"] = "Ritual Monster",
    ["仪式房间"] = "Ritual Room",
    ["仪式所需的一切 都齐全了"] = "Everything needed for the ritual is complete",
    ["仪式是人与神秘之间的契约，而契约需要见证。"] = "Rituals are covenants between humans and the mysterious, and covenants require witnesses.",
    ["仪式材料"] = "Ritual Materials",
    ["仪式材料？这不是个菜摊吗？"] = "Ritual materials? Isn't this a vegetable stall?",
    ["仪式桌子"] = "Ritual Table",
    ["仪式残留"] = "Ritual Residue",
    ["仪式点位1"] = "Ritual Point 1",
    ["仪式点位2"] = "Ritual Point 2",
    ["仪式点位3"] = "Ritual Point 3",
    ["仪式物品"] = "Ritual items",
    ["仪式用深红月长石粉末"] = "Ritualistic Crimson Moonstone Powder",
    ["仪式痕迹初始状态"] = "Ritual trace initial state",
    ["仪式结束之后，我们还可以留下来帮忙打扫场地。"] = "After the ceremony, we can stay behind to help clean the venue.",
    ["仪式结束后，是否有不知名的存在向你们许下承诺？你们到底……在用什么献祭？"] = "After the ritual, did any unknown existence make a promise to you? What exactly... are you using for the sacrifice?",
    ["仪式边界"] = "Ritual Boundary",
    ["仪式连接着未知的秘密，窥探者共享那些不该被知晓的真相。"] = "Rituals connect to unknown secrets; the Seeker shares truths that should not be known.",
    ["仪式重生点"] = "Ritual Respawn Point",
    ["仪式魔法"] = "Ritual Magic",
    ["仪式魔法书籍"] = "Ritual Magic Book",
    ["仪式魔法可以分成三个部分，第一个是取悦或者引起对应存在兴趣的祭祀部分，第二个是描述了具体祈求对象的咒文部分，第三个是想要获得什么帮助的实质部分，需要用格式化的对应语言和一定的象征符号来阐明。"] = "Ritual magic can be divided into three parts: the first is the sacrificial part to please or pique the interest of the corresponding entity; the second is the incantation part that describes the specific object of prayer; and the third is the substantive part detailing what help is sought, which needs to be clarified using a formatted corresponding language and certain symbolic signs.",
    ["仪式魔法开启，点亮所有蜡烛，赞美愚者。"] = "Ritual Magic initiated, light all candles, praise the Fool.",
    ["仪式魔法材料"] = "Ritual Magic Materials",
    ["仪式魔法确实是一门实践性极强的学问，它不仅需要理解符号、咒文和仪轨，更需要用灵性去感受、去引导。"] = "Ritual Magic is indeed a highly practical discipline. It requires not only an understanding of symbols, incantations, and ritual procedures but also the use of spirituality to sense and guide.",
    ["仪式魔法草稿"] = "Ritual Magic Draft",
    ["仪式魔法，核心在于通过特定的仪轨、符号、祷文和祭品，引导灵性力量，构建一个临时的、符合某种规则的场，"] = "The core of Ritual Magic lies in using specific ritual procedures, symbols, prayers, and offerings to guide spiritual power and construct a temporary field that conforms to certain rules,",
    ["仪式魔法：\n向神明祈求之术"] = "Ritual Magic: \nThe Art of Praying to Gods",
    ["仪态大师"] = "Master of Etiquette",
    ["仰射"] = "Upward Shot",
    ["仰望天空"] = "Look Up at the Sky",
    ["仰望星空"] = "Look Up at the Starry Sky",
    ["仰望星空桌子"] = "Looking Up at the Starry Sky Table",
    ["仰望星空派"] = "Stargazing Pie",
    ["仰望星空派吗，听起来不错，我看看价格……啊！"] = "Stargazer Pie, huh? Sounds good. Let me check the price... Ah!",
    ["仰望星空派！名字取自鱼群跃出海面，仰望繁星的意象。采用间海郡新鲜河鱼佐以贝克兰德上等黄油与凛冬郡面粉……"] = "Looking-at-the-Stars Pie! The name is taken from the imagery of fish leaping out of the sea to gaze at the stars. It uses fresh river fish from Midseashire County, seasoned with top-quality butter from Winter County and flour from Backlund...",
    ["仰泳"] = "Backstroke",
    ["仰泳漂浮"] = "Backstroke Float",
    ["仰视2"] = "Look Up 2",
    ["仰视Actor1"] = "Look Up Actor 1",
    ["仲夏夜"] = "Midsummer Night",
    ["仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "In the Midsummer Night's fairyland, it is not just the wings of elves that streak across the sky, but also the fluttering poetic hearts.",
    ["仲夏草"] = "Midsummer Grass",
