    ["价格"] = "Price",
    ["价格……比隔壁墓地贵1金镑，女士，先别急着摇头。购买我们的墓地，还额外附赠我们公司的“灵魂安息保险”——"] = "The price... is 1 pound more than the neighboring plot, madam. Don't be in such a hurry to shake your head. Purchasing our plot also includes our company's 'Soul Rest Insurance'—",
    ["价格便宜，香甜可口！"] = "Cheap price, sweet and delicious!",
    ["价格加成"] = "Price Bonus",
    ["价格取决于您选择的品类，先生。"] = "The price depends on the variety you choose, sir.",
    ["价格合理，量大不压货，有卖老鼠的快看过来了！"] = "Reasonable price, large quantity without backlog, those selling mice come and look here!",
    ["价格昂贵是合理的。"] = "The high price is reasonable.",
    ["价格说明"] = "Price Explanation",
    ["价格超出限制范围。"] = "Price exceeds the allowed range.",
    ["价格？价格当然会比售票厅贵上一点。但我保证，我是这里最划算的那个。"] = "The price? The price will of course be a little more expensive than at the ticket office. But I guarantee, I'm the best deal here.",
    ["任什么苦难也不能使我移动。"] = "No suffering can make me move.",
    ["任何恩赐均需确认"] = "Confirm All Blessings",
    ["任何时间，任何地点，一定送达"] = "Anytime, anywhere, guaranteed delivery",
    ["任何理智的人，面对那种超越想象的力量，都会先选择谨慎。"] = "Any rational person, facing that power beyond imagination, would first choose to be cautious.",
    ["任何重复或遗漏，都可能导致仪式失败，甚至引发反噬。"] = "Any repetition or omission could lead to ritual failure or even trigger a backlash.",
