    ["伙计，我真羡慕你的车技。"] = "Mate, I really envy your driving skills.",
    ["伙计，把这瓶劣质啤酒当香槟喝吧，听说厂长用克扣的我们的周薪，给他心爱的夫人买了一枚华贵的发卡。"] = "Mate, just drink this swill as if it were champagne. I heard the factory manager used the weekly wages he docked from us to buy his beloved wife a luxurious hair clip.",
