    ["传湖-市场"] = "Lake - Market",
    ["传火"] = "Pass Fire",
    ["传统的选择是费内波特的高原咖啡，不过本店售卖南方的甜冰茶，这也是最近的流行。"] = "The traditional choice is Feynapot's highland coffee, but this shop sells southern sweet iced tea, which is also a recent trend.",
    ["传言？我只知道，少爷管理工厂后我们的薪水涨了……"] = "Rumors? All I know is that our wages increased after the young master took over the factory...",
    ["传说"] = "Legendary",
    ["传说中的睡莲仙女呀……"] = "The legendary Water Lily Fairy...",
    ["传说人脉"] = "Legendary Connection",
    ["传说可以用来拘束魔鬼的宝瓶，然而此时里面空空如也。"] = "A vase rumored to be able to restrain devils, yet it is empty inside at this moment.",
    ["传说曾有神殒落于此。"] = "Legend has it that a god once fell here.",
    ["传说有个长相俊美的吸血鬼在这里出没，好多姑娘跑来想偶遇他。"] = "Legend has it that a handsome vampire haunts this place, and many girls come here hoping to run into him.",
