    ["传说由你铸就，此令为证。用于嘉奖非凡者在%s的势力战中的英勇表现。"] = "Legends are forged by you; let this order be the proof. Used to reward the heroic performance of Beyonders in %s faction wars.",
    ["传说研究会会长"] = "Legend Research Society President",
    ["传说这种生长在吊死者尸体下的植物能治疗多种疾病……"] = "Legend has it that this plant, growing beneath the corpse of a hanged man, can cure many diseases...",
    ["传说这里藏着安提哥努斯家族复兴的秘密宝藏。"] = "Legend has it that the secret treasure of the Antigonus family's revival is hidden here.",
