    ["伤害转移承受方（Buff持有者）承受转移伤害达到上限后，不再承受转移伤害（Buff始作俑者吃满全额伤害）。超出上限那一次伤害，需要截断确保不溢出"] = "When the damage transfer recipient (buff holder) reaches the limit of transferred damage taken, it no longer takes transferred damage (the buff originator takes the full amount of damage). The damage that exceeds the limit needs to be truncated to ensure no overflow.",
