    ["伦纳德·米切尔"] = "Leonard Mitchell",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔-1星"] = "Leonard Mitchell - 1 Star",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔-2星"] = "Leonard Mitchell - 2 Star",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔-3星"] = "Leonard Mitchell - 3 Star",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔-紫藤絮语"] = "Leonard Mitchell - Wisteria Whispers",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Leonard Mitchell, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔的来信"] = "A Letter from Leonard Mitchell",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔的来信提醒"] = "Leonard Mitchell's Letter Reminder",
    ["伦纳德·米切尔，是个诗人的名字。\n——虽然他本人并不会写诗。\n一个不会写诗的诗人，听起来就充满了戏剧性，这也符合他曾经对自己的期待——故事的主角，特殊的命运，传奇的人生。\n起初一切的确按照这个方向发展：他顺利成为非凡者，掌握一些“秘密”，结识靠谱的同伴，无数次守护廷根。历史的车轮滚滚向前，从未因他的散漫而有所薄待，这大概就是主角的标配吧，一点过人的天赋，一群过命的朋友，一段不凡的旅程……\n\n多么平淡、美好、无聊的日子啊。\n直到邪神降临，无情地击碎了一切。\n\n伦纳德·米切尔，并非命运的眷儿。\n只是个弱小而不自知的凡人。\n\n但纵使是凡人也不会停止前进的步伐，如同星星虽然微小，却始终在努力发光。\n他收起散漫，走上了一条沉默的成长之路。\n他成为了红手套。\n他成为了“星星”。\n他完成了复仇。\n——但他依旧不会写诗。\n\n“那又有什么关系呢？我很满意我现在的样子。\n“一个不会写诗的午夜诗人，才是我灵魂中最重要的部分。\n“这样，不管在非凡路上走多久，不管离疯狂和失控多近……\n“只要还拥有这些，我就始终记得自己属于哪里。\n“疯狂和痛苦，就永远不会伤害我。”"] = "Leonard Mitchell is a poet's name.\n — though he himself cannot write poetry.\n A poet who cannot write poetry sounds full of drama, which fits what he once expected of himself—the protagonist of a story, a special fate, a legendary life.\n At first, everything did indeed develop in that direction: he successfully became a Beyonder, mastered some \"secrets,\" met reliable companions, and guarded Tingen countless times. The wheels of history rolled forward, never slighting him because of his indolence; this was probably the standard equipment for a protagonist: a bit of exceptional talent, a group of friends who would die for each other, and an extraordinary journey...\n\n What dull, beautiful, boring days they were.\n Until the evil god's descent, which ruthlessly shattered everything.\n\n Leonard Mitchell was not a child of fate.\n Just a weak mortal who didn't know it.\n\n But even a mortal would not stop moving forward, just as stars, though tiny, are always trying to shine.\n He put away his indolence and embarked on a silent path of growth.\n He became a Red Glove.\n He became \"The Star.\"\n He completed his revenge.\n — But he still cannot write poetry.\n\n \"And what does that matter? I am satisfied with who I am now.\n \"A midnight poet who cannot write poetry is the most important part of my soul.\n \"This way, no matter how long I walk on the Beyonder path, no matter how close I get to madness and loss of control...\n \"As long as I still possess these, I will always remember where I belong.\n \"Madness and pain will never be able to hurt me.\"",
    ["伦纳德·终点"] = "Leonard - Finish Line",
    ["伦纳德·结尾"] = "Leonard - Ending",
    ["伦纳德·走向伊妮德定位"] = "Leonard - Walk to Enid positioning",
    ["伦纳德·起点"] = "Leonard · Start point",
    ["伦纳德·进入战斗位置"] = "Leonard_Enter Combat Position",
    ["伦纳德·进屋后位置"] = "Leonard - Position after entering room",
    ["伦纳德·阻拦伊妮德定位"] = "Leonard·Block Enid Position",
    ["伦纳德·靠近后解除跟随定位"] = "Leonard - Remove Follow Positioning After Approaching",
    ["伦纳德也摘下红手套，吟唱起一首赠与逝者的安眠诗——\n“他收到黑夜的请柬，从此得到安眠。”\n“存活于白日的人，镌刻他，直至永恒。”"] = "Leonard also took off his red glove and chanted a slumber poem for the deceased—\n 'He received an invitation from the dark night and has since found eternal slumber.'\n 'Those who live in the daylight, engrave him, until eternity.'",
    ["伦纳德也来了，也很合理……"] = "Leonard came too, that makes sense...",
    ["伦纳德书"] = "Leonard's book",
