    ["伦纳德先生"] = "Mr. Leonard",
    ["伦纳德先生似乎突然有急事，他留了一封信给您。"] = "Mr. Leonard seems to have had an urgent matter arise suddenly; he left a letter for you.",
    ["伦纳德先生请你帮他接待一位“故人”的妹妹，在黑荆棘附近寻找一下吧。"] = "Mr. Leonard asks you to help him receive the younger sister of an \"old friend.\" Look for her near Blackthorn.",
    ["伦纳德先生请你帮他接待一位“故人”的妹妹，在黑荆棘附近寻找一下吧。\r\n"] = "Mr. Leonard asked you to help him receive the sister of an \"old friend.\" Go look for her near Blackthorn.",
    ["伦纳德先生，“星星”这个代号是您自己选的吗？"] = "Mr. Leonard, did you choose the codename 'Star' yourself?",
    ["伦纳德先生，你怎么来了这里？"] = "Mr. Leonard, why are you here?",
    ["伦纳德先生，值夜者都要学会写诗吗？"] = "Mr. Leonard, do all Nighthawks have to learn how to write poetry?",
    ["伦纳德先生，大概在炼金室吧，过去看看"] = "Mr. Leonard is probably in the alchemy room. Let's go check.",
    ["伦纳德先生，您不是官方非凡者吗？为什么您会出现在……这种非官方非凡者的隐秘集会处？"] = "Mr. Leonard, aren't you an official Beyonder? Why are you appearing at... this kind of secret gathering place for unofficial Beyonders?",
    ["伦纳德先生，您当初为什么会加入黑夜教会？"] = "Mr. Leonard, why did you join the Church of the Evernight originally?",
    ["伦纳德先生，您特地赶回来？"] = "Mr. Leonard, you came back specifically for this?",
    ["伦纳德先生，我怎么成了这里的员工？"] = "Mr. Leonard, how did I become an employee here?",
    ["伦纳德先生，没打扰你休息吧？有位叫莉娅的姑娘托我给你带点东西，感谢你之前的帮助。 "] = "Mr. Leonard, did I disturb your rest? A girl named Leah asked me to bring you something to thank you for your previous help.",
    ["伦纳德先生，这里是？"] = "Mr. Leonard, where is this?",
    ["伦纳德先生，黑荆棘对您意味着什么？"] = "Mr. Leonard, what does Blackthorn mean to you?",
    ["伦纳德先生？"] = "Mr. Leonard?",
    ["伦纳德先生？伦纳德先生？"] = "Mr. Leonard? Mr. Leonard?",
    ["伦纳德先生？您怎么在这里？"] = "Mr. Leonard? Why are you here?",
    ["伦纳德先行离开"] = "Leonard leaves first",
    ["伦纳德入职培训"] = "Leonard's Onboarding Training",
    ["伦纳德出生buff"] = "Leonard spawn buff",
    ["伦纳德出门"] = "Leonard goes out",
    ["伦纳德刚出完任务回来，应该就在附近。我正好要去找他，可以帮你转交。 "] = "Leonard just returned from a mission and should be nearby. I happen to be looking for him, so I can pass it on for you.",
    ["伦纳德刚出完任务回来，我正好要去找他，可以帮你转交。 "] = "Leonard just came back from a mission, I happen to be going to find him, I can help you pass it on.",
    ["伦纳德半身"] = "Leonard half-body",
    ["伦纳德向我提起过，如果有您的帮助，成功的希望会更大。"] = "Leonard mentioned you to me; if we have your help, the hope of success will be much greater.",
    ["伦纳德吟唱了诗篇，为虚弱的队友恢复生机！"] = "Leonard has chanted a poem, restoring vitality to the weakened teammates!",
    ["伦纳德吟诵安魂诗篇，使周围6米内目标获得70%重伤效果，持续4秒，自身获得持续<Highlight>6</>秒半径<Highlight>6</>米的精神光环，光环可使敌人buffdisc(*id)。"] = "Leonard recites the Requiem Poem, causing targets within 6 meters to suffer a 70% Grievous Injury effect for 4 seconds, while you gain a Mental Aura with a radius of <Highlight> 6 </> meters for <Highlight> 6 </> seconds, which causes enemies to be buffdisc(*id).",
    ["伦纳德吟诵安魂诗篇，使敌方重伤并且自身获得光环，该光环可降低周围敌方目标移动速度。"] = "Leonard chants a Requiem, causing Grievous Injury to enemies and granting himself an aura that reduces the movement speed of nearby enemy targets.",
    ["伦纳德在说什么？"] = "What is Leonard saying?",
    ["伦纳德坐下"] = "Leonard sits down",
    ["伦纳德坐椅子路径"] = "Leonard sitting on chair path",
    ["伦纳德就干过这种蠢事 他在成为“不眠者”的第一天就试图以冲刺的速度下楼"] = "Leonard did something this stupid. On his first day as a \"Sleepless\", he tried to go downstairs at a sprint.",
    ["伦纳德就干过这种蠢事，他在成为“不眠者”的第一天就试图以冲刺的速度下楼。"] = "Leonard has done such stupid things; on his first day as a \"Nighthawk\", he tried to run down the stairs at a sprint.",
    ["伦纳德带着一位警察进来了"] = "Leonard brings a police officer in",
    ["伦纳德弗兰奇路径"] = "Leonard French Path",
    ["伦纳德得知你即将晋升后，回到黑荆棘安保公司为你指引……"] = "After learning you are about to advance, Leonard returns to Blackthorn Security Company to guide you...",
    ["伦纳德悲伤"] = "Leonard sad",
    ["伦纳德拜托你接待克莱恩的妹妹梅丽莎。你在黑荆棘附近找到她，她正精打细算地砍价——为了给哥哥班森买一条新领带。她此行是为毕业论文取一份钟表图纸，却不愿踏进黑荆棘大门，因为那里总会让她想起克莱恩第一天入职的情景。你帮她取来图纸和钟表，还有伦纳德特意准备的一束塞维亚菊。梅丽莎怔怔接过，仰头说幸好这条路是明亮的，哥哥在她心里从未真正离开。"] = "Leonard asks you to host Klein's sister, Melissa. You find her near Blackthorn, where she is meticulously haggling—trying to buy a new tie for her brother Benson. She is there to pick up a clock blueprint for her graduation thesis, but she refuses to step into the Blackthorn gates because it always reminds her of Klein's first day on the job. You help her retrieve the blueprints and the clock, along with a bouquet of Sevia daisies Leonard prepared. Melissa takes them, stunned, and looks up to say that it is fortunate this path is bright, and that her brother has never truly left her heart.",
