    ["伦纳德还得准备一会儿，先换上新衣服，去廷根逛逛，试试自己的新车吧！"] = "Leonard still needs to prepare for a while, put on your new clothes first, go for a walk in Tingen, and try your new bike!",
    ["伦纳德通知了警察处理后续的事情，然后返回了黑荆棘安保公司……"] = "Leonard notifies the police to handle the aftermath, then returns to Blackthorn Security Company...",
