    ["伯尔纳"] = "Berna",
    ["伯德"] = "Bird",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔"] = "Baldwin Wetherell",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔以非凡者身份征战背誓之战，载誉而归。临终前，他将自己的非凡特性融入铠甲，赋予它“坚强不屈的灵魂”，为它取名伊桑。此后六百年，伊桑守护着威瑟尔家族，只需一句古赫密斯语便能拔剑出鞘。直到庄园遇袭之夜，它被未知污染侵蚀，机械地执行命令，屠尽了庄园内每一个活人。\n“为了家族的荣耀！”"] = "Baldwin Wetherell fought in the War of Broken Oaths as a Beyonder and returned with honors. Before his death, he fused his Beyonder characteristic into his armor, endowing it with a 'strong and unyielding soul,' and named it Ethan. For the next six hundred years, Ethan guarded the Wetherell family, requiring only a single phrase in ancient Hermes to draw its sword. Until the night the manor was attacked, it was eroded by unknown corruption, mechanically executing orders and slaughtering every living person in the manor. \n \"For the glory of the family!\"",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔已经失控狂暴！"] = "Baldwin Wetherell has lost control and gone berserk!",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔成为见习骑士时，得到了一枚护符。赏赐他的人说：“上一任主人戴着它从战场活着回来了，祝你也有这样的运气。”\n他携带这枚护符历经无数战役，一路晋升，创立了自己的苍鹰骑士团。他受过很多次伤，但每一次倒下都有人把他拖回来，就像他拖回过很多人一样。\n后来，伯德温将这枚护符赠予了麾下最得力的一名骑士。再后来，这枚护符又从这位骑士手中传递给了下一个见习骑士。每一位送走它的骑士都战功赫赫，每一位接过它的骑士都还年轻。\n交接时，他们往往只说一句：“活着回来。”\n对方答：“你也是。”\n于是二人翻身上马，走向不同道路，直到马蹄扬起的尘土迷蒙双眼。"] = "When Baldwin Wetherell became a squire, he received an amulet. The person who rewarded him said: \"The previous owner wore it and returned from the battlefield alive; I wish you the same luck.\" \n He carried this amulet through countless battles, advancing all the way, and founded his own Goshawk Knights. He had been injured many times, but every time he fell, someone dragged him back, just as he had dragged many people back. \n Later, Baldwin gifted this amulet to the most capable knight under his command. Later still, this amulet was passed from this knight to the next squire. Every knight who sent it away had great military achievements, and every knight who received it was still young. \n When handing it over, they usually only said one sentence: \"Come back alive.\" \n The other replied: \"You too.\" \n So the two turned onto their horses and walked on different paths, until the dust raised by the horse's hooves blurred their eyes.",
    ["伯德温·威瑟尔留下的无数遗产中，最珍贵的当属他的铠甲·伊桑——是他亲自取的名字，含义为坚强不屈的灵魂。\n伯德温生前的最后一句话是：“我死后，非凡特性要留给伊桑。序列5的收割者足以让它获得灵性，继承我的意志，成为真正的……”\n不朽的、家族守护者。\n伯德温停止呼吸后，铠甲动了，在一众悲痛和敬畏中，行了一个标准的骑士礼。\n就这样，先祖铠甲世世代代守护威瑟尔家族，利剑出鞘，不死不休。直到数年前，一种强大又可怕的力量浸染了庄园，污染了铠甲。\n那一夜，铠甲屠戮了整个家族。\n它背叛了坚守600年的意志，它成为了家族覆灭的罪人。它同它的罪恶一起被掩埋入大地深处，直到许多年后，有人再次唤醒它。\n“为我所用吧，伊桑。”\n来自威瑟尔家族最后的血脉，同时也是那种强大力量的眷顾者。\n“用你不朽的意志，来守护我的儿子……和一切吧。”"] = "Among the countless legacies left by Baldwin Wetherell, the most precious is his armor, Ethan—a name he chose himself, meaning a strong and unyielding soul. \n Baldwin's last words before he died were: \"After I die, the Beyonder characteristic must be left to Ethan. A Sequence 5 Reaper is enough to give it spirituality, inherit my will, and become a true...\" \n Immortal, family Guardian. \n After Baldwin stopped breathing, the armor moved and, amidst the grief and awe of the crowd, performed a standard knight's salute. \n Thus, the Ancestor Armor guarded the Wetherell family for generations, sword drawn, never dying, never resting. Until a few years ago, a powerful and terrifying force permeated the manor, corrupting the armor. \n That night, the armor slaughtered the entire family. \n It betrayed the will it had upheld for 600 years; it became the sinner of the family's destruction. It was buried deep in the earth along with its sins, until many years later, someone awakened it again. \n \"Be used by me, Ethan.\" \n From the last bloodline of the Wetherell family, who was also the favored one of that powerful force. \n \"Use your immortal will to guard my son... and everything else.\"",
    ["伯德温·艾弗利"] = "Baldwin Avery",
    ["伯德温遗产中最珍贵的铠甲·伊桑，含义为坚强不屈的灵魂。"] = "The most precious armor in the Baldwin legacy, 'Ethan,' meaning a strong and unyielding soul.",
