    ["伯顿"] = "Burton",
    ["估计一小时差不多，就按时间算。我们这就出发？ "] = "An hour should be about right, let's go by time. Shall we set off?",
    ["伴随一声猴叫，卡门的下半身如闪电般归去。"] = "Accompanied by a monkey's cry, Carmen's lower body returns like lightning.",
    ["伴随一阵急促的铃声，邮差在撞到你之前，勉强将脚踏车在你面前刹停。"] = "Accompanied by a sharp ringing, the postman barely manages to brake his bicycle in front of you before hitting you.",
    ["伴随吟唱，信徒纷纷倒地或振飞，红月消失，天气正常。\n伦纳德缓缓走近，结束施法"] = "Accompanied by the chanting, the believers fall one after another or are sent flying, the red moon disappears, and the weather returns to normal.\n Leonard walks over slowly, ending the spellcasting.",
    ["伴随着悠扬的曲调，一只海精灵快乐地飘了出来，哼着不知名的小调一头撞进了{{PlayerName}}的怀里。"] = "Accompanied by a melodious tune, a Sea Spirit floated out happily, humming an unknown melody as it bumped straight into {{PlayerName}}'s arms.",
    ["伴随红月而来的疯狂呓语，小说家颂念了愚者的尊名，此时她尚且不知，这将是一场跨越家族和历史的旅行。"] = "Accompanied by the mad whispers that arrived with the red moon, the novelist recited the honorific name of The Fool. At this moment, she did not yet know that this would be a journey spanning across families and history.",
    ["伴随自己掉落的绯红晶体，里面隐约有什么在缓缓蠕动，还不知道用处。"] = "The crimson crystal that fell with you, with something faintly wriggling inside, its use is still unknown.",
    ["伴随陨落星体形成的高灵性结晶。"] = "High-spirituality crystals formed accompanying a fallen star.",
    ["伸出手"] = "Reach out",
    ["伸出手！"] = "Reach out!",
    ["伸头一锤"] = "Hammer Strike",
    ["伸左手"] = "Extend Left Hand",
    ["伸懒腰"] = "Stretching",
    ["伸手"] = "Reach out",
    ["伸手扶起……"] = "Reaching out to help up...",
    ["伸手试探，宝箱纹丝不动——它被锁住了。"] = "Reaching out to test it, the treasure chest doesn't budge—it's locked.",
    ["似乎……似乎过去好久了……"] = "It seems... it seems like a long time has passed...",
    ["似乎产生了一些奇妙的新东西…"] = "Something wonderful seems to have been created...",
    ["似乎出现了转机"] = "A turning point seems to have appeared",
    ["似乎到目的地了"] = "Seems we have arrived at the destination",
    ["似乎到达了目的地"] = "It seems you have reached the destination",
    ["似乎受到了神秘力量的眷顾，在运气方面，海精灵就没有输过。"] = "Seemingly blessed by mysterious forces, the Sea Spirit has never lost when it comes to luck.",
    ["似乎只是一具普通的尸体。"] = "It seems to be just an ordinary corpse.",
    ["似乎在这附近了。"] = "Seems to be around here.",
    ["似乎感受到了一丝狒哥的战斗技巧。"] = "I seem to have sensed a hint of the Baboon's combat techniques.",
    ["似乎感受到了一些情绪，这种怀念的感觉……"] = "It seems to have sensed some emotions; this feeling of nostalgia...",
    ["似乎找到了斯卡纳的位置"] = "Seems to have found Skana's location",
    ["似乎是……记录了一些谜题和解法，看起来是总结出的某种规律？"] = "It seems to be... recording some puzzles and solutions. Does it look like some kind of pattern summarized?",
    ["似乎是一架钢琴……应该是一架钢琴……大概。"] = "It seems to be a piano... It should be a piano... probably.",
    ["似乎是小女孩和成年男性的手……这局的结果应该是和棋了，那怎么还在下呢？"] = "It seems to be the hands of a little girl and an adult man... The result of this game should be a draw, so why is it still being played?",
    ["似乎是废弃的任务trigger"] = "Seems to be an abandoned quest trigger",
    ["似乎是毒气"] = "It seems to be poison gas",
    ["似乎有<h>委托人</>上门"] = "It seems a <h>client</> has arrived",
    ["似乎有严重的危机正在廷根酝酿，这种感觉不是太好。"] = "It seems that a serious crisis is brewing in Tingen. This feeling is not very good.",
    ["似乎有些不对劲……"] = "Something seems wrong...",
    ["似乎有什么出现了……"] = "Something seems to have appeared...",
    ["似乎有什么残留的痕迹……"] = "It seems there are some lingering traces...",
    ["似乎有什么残留的痕迹。"] = "It seems there are some lingering traces.",
    ["似乎有包裹到了"] = "A package seems to have arrived",
    ["似乎有点启发……"] = "Seems a bit inspiring...",
    ["似乎有琴声传来……"] = "It seems like music is coming...",
    ["似乎没人在家……"] = "Seems like no one is home...",
    ["似乎没什么变化，再试试别的吧"] = "It doesn't seem to have changed anything; try something else.",
    ["似乎没能领悟格斗的要诀，再仔细观察一下吧……"] = "It seems you haven't grasped the essentials of fighting; let's observe more carefully...",
    ["似乎看到了过去的事……"] = "Seems to have seen things from the past...",
    ["似乎等级还不够开启裂缝"] = "It seems your level is not high enough to open the rift.",
    ["似乎都是关于心理状况的测试题目，在卷首有时写着出卷人正义，有时印着像动物踩上去的爪子一样的黑印。"] = "They seem to be test questions about psychological conditions. Sometimes 'Justice' is written at the beginning of the paper, and sometimes there's a black mark that looks like an animal's paw print.",
    ["似乎需要燃料启动，可以用来销毁这双舞鞋吗？"] = "It seems to need fuel to start. Can it be used to destroy these dancing shoes?",
    ["但<P_Yellow>新生者</>也在努力抗争，这是“愚者”先生看中的<P_Yellow>人性</>，是成功的关键。"] = "But <P_Yellow>Newborn</> is also struggling hard. This is the <P_Yellow>humanity</> that Mr. Fool values, and it is the key to success.",
    ["但{{他|她}}说得对。我奶奶走了十年，可我总觉得她在——在好天气里晒被子，风刮过来，像她在摸我的头。"] = "But {{he|she}} is right. My grandmother has been gone for ten years, but I always feel she is—sun-drying quilts in good weather, and when the wind blows, it's like she's stroking my head.",
    ["但……不要喝下去就好！"] = "But... just don't drink it!",
    ["但……但他看起来那么严肃，我根本不敢靠近他。"] = "But... but he looks so serious, I don't dare to approach him at all.",
    ["但……你现在的眼神，和这里的人一样了。"] = "But... your eyes now are the same as the people here.",
    ["但……帕里克，你没有报名？而且你中途离开过学派吗？"] = "But... Parick, you didn't sign up? And have you left the school halfway through?",
    ["但……我不会停留 "] = "But... I will not stay ",
    ["但、但我们只带了烟丝、报纸和南瓜馅饼，万一他们看、看不上我的东西……"] = "But, but we only brought tobacco, newspapers, and pumpkin pies. What if they don't, don't like my things...",
    ["但一定需要懂得品味甜点的人！"] = "But it definitely needs people who know how to appreciate desserts!",
    ["但一开始有无形的力量密封了房间，在使用仪式魔法时，经常会有类似的操作。"] = "But at the beginning, an invisible force sealed the room. This is a common procedure when using Ritual Magic.",
    ["但一想到有许多同伴陪着我，我就一点也不害怕了。"] = "But once I thought about having many companions with me, I wasn't afraid at all.",
    ["但丁·"] = "Dante ",
    ["但不必太过紧张。作为一名资深的“心理医生”，我可以回答你大部分的相关疑问。"] = "But there is no need to be too nervous. As a senior 'Psychiatrist', I can answer most of your related questions.",
    ["但不止这样，还有——"] = "But it's not just that, there's also—",
    ["但不知怎么了，对着肉摊，我的心特别慌，空落落的。"] = "But for some reason, whenever I faced that meat stall, my heart felt particularly panicked and empty.",
    ["但不管我走到多远的地方，我永远记得黑荆棘，只要我回到这里，我就又回到了家。"] = "But no matter how far I go, I will always remember Blackthorn. As long as I return here, I am back home again.",
    ["但与此同时，内心那个疯狂的、冲动的我，却在期待今晚再次见到您……再次，触碰您……我一定是疯了！"] = "But at the same time, the crazy, impulsive me inside is looking forward to seeing you again tonight... to touch you again... I must be crazy!",
    ["但两把剑不知何处......"] = "But the two swords are nowhere to be found...",
    ["但为什么……会在这里，这首歌……还这么诡异……"] = "But why... is it here? This song... and it's so eerie...",
    ["但为何我甚至无法得到长眠？"] = "But why can I not even find eternal rest?",
    ["但之前你的入梦被强行打断了，梦里还有污染，这太危险了。"] = "But your dream entry was forcibly interrupted before, and there is still corruption in the dream. This is too dangerous.",
    ["但之后我们只有一次机会，进去和小黛西团聚，而且还会害死她。"] = "But after that, we will only have one chance to go in and reunite with little Daisy, and it will also cause her death.",
    ["但也只有一个名为“诗歌”的标题。"] = "But it only has a title called 'Poetry'.",
    ["但也要小心，别让自己陷入危险。"] = "But also be careful, don't let yourself fall into danger.",
    ["但也要小心，周围的人会因2-049发生滞涩，如果不及时解救，会被同化成木偶"] = "But be careful, people around will experience stagnation because of 2-049. If not rescued in time, they will be assimilated into puppets.",
    ["但也要随时保持警惕，有些学员很喜欢恶作剧，一定要谨慎对待入口的药剂。"] = "But also remain vigilant at all times; some students love pranks, so be Cautious when dealing with potions you consume.",
    ["但事实是，这种自负让我卡进墙里，还让我忘记，“学徒”是需要向老师虚心学习的。"] = "But the truth is, this arrogance caused me to get stuck in the wall and made me forget that an \"Apprentice\" needs to humbly learn from their teacher.",
    ["但人们并不知道，敬爱的领主其实是从死亡国度归来的恐怖存在，而他们都是这场庆典的祭品。"] = "But the people did not know that their beloved lord was actually a terrifying entity returned from the realm of the dead, and they were all sacrifices for this festival.",
    ["但从来没听说哪个邪教信仰兔子，祈祷仪式听上去也并不邪恶……"] = "But I've never heard of any cult worshipping a rabbit, and the prayer ritual doesn't sound evil either...",
    ["但他一直认为是因为你的牺牲，而我们从你的死亡中发觉了非凡特性不灭定律、被圣堂注意，他才能当上这个队长。"] = "But he has always believed that it was because of your sacrifice, and the fact that we discovered the Law of Beyonder Characteristic Indestructibility from your death, which drew the attention of the Holy Cathedral, that he was able to become this Captain.",
    ["但他们不知道我们在保护他们。"] = "But they don't know we are protecting them.",
    ["但他们很容易感知到隐藏于事物背后的某些存在，必须小心翼翼，对非凡力量充满敬畏。"] = "But they easily perceive certain existences hidden behind things and must be very careful, remaining in awe of Beyonder powers.",
    ["但他们是不可能查到任何痕迹的。"] = "But they will never find any traces.",
    ["但他对学分最慷慨了！"] = "But he is the most generous with credits!",
    ["但他想用这个仪式和永暗蜡烛做什么呢？"] = "But what does he want to do with this ritual and the Candle of Eternal Darkness?",
    ["但他最近……忽然变得很冷淡。"] = "But he has... suddenly become very cold lately.",
    ["但他最近老往外跑，你看，这会儿又不知道去哪了。"] = "But he's been running out a lot lately. Look, he doesn't know where he went again.",
    ["但他没有……一直没有……"] = "But he didn't... he never did...",
    ["但他没有害怕尖叫、他愿意跟我说话……"] = "But he didn't scream in fear, he was willing to talk to me...",
    ["但他没有害怕尖叫，他愿意跟我说话……"] = "But he didn't scream in fear, he was willing to talk to me...",
    ["但他这么焦急……用占卜帮帮忙吧……"] = "But he is so anxious... I should use divination to help him out...",
    ["但作为非凡者，你需要睁开眼睛，跟上我。"] = "But as a Beyonder, you need to open your eyes and keep up with me.",
    ["但你不是一个好的占卜师。"] = "But you are not a good diviner.",
    ["但你不是仆人，阿尔伯特。你是我的家人。"] = "But you are not a servant, Albert. You are my family.",
    ["但你也多少了解到这其中的奥秘了，跟你交流这方面，应该不算违反约定。"] = "But you have already learned some of the mysteries, so discussing this aspect with you shouldn't be considered a breach of the oath.",
    ["但你也将直面噩梦中污染的象征，直到彻底战胜它。"] = "But you will also face the symbol of corruption in the nightmare directly until you completely defeat it.",
    ["但你也随之从高空落了下去，落在了一段长长的光阶之前。"] = "But you fall from a great height, landing before a long flight of stairs made of light.",
    ["但你人还是来了，还是走到了我面前。"] = "But you still came, and you still walked up to me.",
    ["但你会。你是自己走到这里，自己选择蹲下的，对吗？"] = "But you do. You walked here yourself and chose to squat down yourself, right?",
    ["但你却能通过胸针找到我……"] = "But you were able to find me through the brooch...",
    ["但你压根算不上强壮，你这种弱鸡连给贝儿小姐提鞋的资格都没有。"] = "But you aren't strong at all. A weakling like you isn't even qualified to tie Miss Belle's shoes.",
    ["但你只是今天比我时尚，只允许你今天坐在这里！"] = "But you're only more fashionable than me today, so you're only allowed to sit here today!",
    ["但你怎么能证明这不是新反应的产物？"] = "But how can you prove this isn't the product of a new reaction?",
    ["但你所拥有的好奇心和热情，在任何时候都能给你帮助。"] = "But the curiosity and enthusiasm you possess can help you at any time.",
    ["但你所有拥有的好奇心和热情，在任何时候都能给你帮助。"] = "But all the curiosity and passion you possess can help you at any time.",
    ["但你是来回收我、回收这件封印物的吧？"] = "But you're here to recover me, to recover this Sealed Artifact, right?",
    ["但你是身体的灵 掌握着整片大海的秘密"] = "But you are the spirit of the body, mastering the secrets of the entire ocean.",
    ["但你没有看到你自己的。"] = "But you didn't see your own.",
    ["但你的记忆被封印了，这一切对你来说都很陌生。"] = "But your memories have been sealed, and all of this is very unfamiliar to you.",
    ["但你看墙上——已经挂着六枚了。他每刻一枚，墙上就多一枚。总有一天，墙上会挂满星币。"] = "But look at the wall—there are already six hanging there. Every time he carves one, there's one more on the wall. One day, the wall will be covered in pentacles.",
    ["但你看起来并不太好。"] = "But you don't look too good.",
    ["但你知道罗塞尔大帝是在何时何地、什么状况下说出这句话的吗？这就不知道了吧，那天，罗塞尔走在路上……<P_Heart>（滔滔不绝）</>"] = "But do you know when, where, and under what circumstances Emperor Roselle said this? You don't know that, right? That day, Roselle was walking on the road... <P_Heart>(Rambling on)</>",
    ["但你知道，这不是梦境。"] = "But you know, this is not a dream.",
    ["但你确实是位不错的{{绅士|小姐}}，愿意成为我的第76位情人吗？"] = "But you are indeed a fine {{gentleman|lady}}, would you be willing to become my 76th lover?",
    ["但你这样的弱鸡，连给贝儿小姐提鞋的资格都没有。"] = "But a weakling like you isn't even qualified to tie Miss Belle's shoes.",
    ["但先喝杯咖啡，放松一下吧。"] = "But first, have a cup of coffee and relax.",
    ["但先梳理一下信息吧，今天发生了好多事。"] = "But let's sort out the information first; so many things happened today.",
    ["但其实在南方，人们吃的是米饭……呵呵。"] = "But actually in the south, people eat rice... hehe.",
    ["但凡你也被鱼刺卡过喉咙，你也会认同我的话。"] = "If you had ever been choked by a fish bone, you would agree with me too.",
    ["但别担心，我们有可靠的非凡者组织，正在守护廷根。"] = "But don't worry, we have a reliable Beyonder organization that is guarding Tingen.",
    ["但加入黑荆棘，意味着你也要和我们一起承担职责。"] = "But joining Blackthorn means you must also shoulder responsibilities with us.",
    ["但勿伤害"] = "But Do No Harm",
    ["但医学上的奇迹是很渺茫的，我已经没有治疗办法了。"] = "But medical miracles are very slim; I have no way to treat her anymore.",
    ["但十几年来，他的想法好像从来没有变过……哪怕是我已经走到他的家门前。"] = "But for over a decade, his thoughts seem to have never changed... even though I have already arrived at his doorstep.",
    ["但卡尔拖欠整整一周的房租，人现在还不知道在哪里。"] = "But Karl is a full week behind on rent, and no one knows where he is now.",
    ["但却有人为一句承诺，守了它这么多年……"] = "But someone guarded it for so many years because of a promise...",
    ["但只有掌握谜题的答案，我们才能时常安全进出循环空间，见到小黛西最快乐的时候。"] = "But only by mastering the answers to the puzzles can we safely enter and exit the loop space from time to time to see Little Daisy at her happiest.",
    ["但只要有闲暇时间，或者心情不好的时候，我就会来这里坐坐。然后，我就能平静下来……"] = "But whenever I have free time, or when I'm in a bad mood, I come here to sit. Then, I can calm down...",
    ["但只要能让孩子们填饱肚子、露出笑容，我就甘愿一直做最滑稽的小丑。"] = "But as long as I can fill the children's bellies and make them smile, I am willing to be the most ridiculous clown forever.",
    ["但可以确定的是，短时间内我回不去了。"] = "But one thing is certain: I can't go back for the time being.",
    ["但后来一想到能给家里减轻负担，这点苦就不算什么了。"] = "But later, when I thought about being able to reduce the burden on my family, this bit of hardship didn't count for anything.",
    ["但后来克莱恩找到工作，我们打算搬去水仙花街。但租期还剩半年，又要赔一笔违约金……"] = "But later, Klein found a job, and we planned to move to Daffodil Street. However, there was still half a year left on the lease, and we had to pay a penalty...",
    ["但命运热衷于戏耍她"] = "But fate is keen on playing with her.",
    ["但唯一让我担心的是……她太懂事了……承担了很多不是她这个年纪应该承担的……"] = "But the only thing that worries me is... she is too sensible... taking on a lot of things she shouldn't have to at her age...",
    ["但回到这里，我总是会想起克莱恩第一天入职的情景。"] = "But returning here, I always think of the scene of Klein's first day on the job.",
    ["但因为一位成员的疏忽，笔记进入古物市场、被韦尔奇得到，现在他们不得不派人到处追寻。"] = "But due to a member's negligence, the notebook entered the antique market and was obtained by Welch. Now they have to send people everywhere to track it down.",
    ["但因为我的清醒，我潜意识的影响消失了……这给了对方机会。"] = "But because of my awakening, my subconscious influence disappeared... This gave the other party an opportunity.",
    ["但在1192年，罗塞尔大帝又将因蒂斯共和国改为了因蒂斯帝国……"] = "But in 1192, Emperor Roselle changed the Intis Republic back into the Intis Empire...",
    ["但在你看不见的地方，依然有很多人为了守护廷根而奋不顾身。"] = "But in places you cannot see, there are still many people who are risking their lives to protect Tingen.",
    ["但在我学会说话，并劝她改掉拖稿的习惯后，她就把我丢出窗户让我去学习一下人类的说话艺术。"] = "But after I learned to speak and urged her to break her habit of delaying manuscripts, she threw me out the window to learn the art of human speech.",
    ["但在我学会说话，并劝她改掉拖稿的习惯后，她把我丢出窗户让我去学习一下人类的说话艺术。"] = "But after I learned to speak and persuaded her to break her habit of missing deadlines, she threw me out the window and told me to go learn the art of human conversation.",
    ["但在正式开始之前，你需要了解最基础的知识。"] = "But before we officially begin, you need to understand the basics.",
    ["但坟墓怎么会没有呢？我亲手安葬了戴维，亲手刻的墓志铭……"] = "But how could there be no grave? I buried David with my own hands, and I carved the epitaph myself...",
    ["但塔芒先生不会允许一只狗进他的咖啡店的，他根本无法接受这种事，唉。"] = "But Mr. Tamang won't allow a dog into his cafe. He just can't accept that kind of thing, sigh.",
    ["但大学的学费太高昂了，那不是我能负担的。"] = "But university tuition is too expensive; it's not something I can afford.",
    ["但太阳不只在因蒂斯落下。"] = "But the sun doesn't only set in Intis.",
    ["但奇怪的是，学得越多，我越觉得自己不需要学那么多。有时候，只需要趴在她脚边，把脑袋搁上去就好了。"] = "But strangely, the more I learn, the more I feel I don't need to learn that much. Sometimes, I just need to lie at her feet and rest my head on her.",
    ["但她仍然一天天走向死亡……我们想让小黛西一直、一直<P_Yellow>“活”</>下去。"] = "But she is still moving toward death day by day... We want little Daisy to \"live\" forever, forever <P_Yellow>\"live\"</>.",
    ["但她同样也不会醒来……"] = "But she won't wake up either...",
    ["但她现在，就算在摊位上坐着的时候，也时不时盯着丈夫留给她的项链看。"] = "But even now, when she sits at her stall, she stares at the necklace her husband left her from time to time.",
    ["但她的戒指下方，隐约可见极细的针尖，灯光\n下一闪而逝。"] = "But beneath her ring, a very fine needle tip is faintly visible, flashing under the light\n.",
    ["但她的戒指下方，隐约可见极细的针尖，灯光下一闪而逝。"] = "But beneath her ring, a tiny needle tip was faintly visible, flashing under the light.",
    ["但如今，我在这里遇见了你这样的恶魔，我就没理由放过你，让你去夺走更多无辜者的性命！"] = "But now that I have met a devil like you here, I have no reason to let you go and take more innocent lives!",
    ["但如果你想要不一样的结局，或许可以换一个地方，"] = "But if you want a different ending, perhaps you could try a different place,",
    ["但如果你现在去诊所，你还有机会重新开始，而且这还能帮我们找到兰尔乌斯，拿回被诈骗的钱。"] = "But if you go to the clinic now, you still have a chance to start over, and this can help us find Ince Zangwill and get back the money that was swindled.",
    ["但如果你的心已做好准备，那么女神会看到你的虔诚。"] = "But if your heart is prepared, then the Goddess will see your piety.",
    ["但如果能顺利救出小少爷，他愿意将报酬翻倍，一次性给予200镑。"] = "But if the young master can be successfully rescued, he is willing to double the reward, giving 200 pounds at once.",
    ["但妈妈工作已经很辛苦了……加油，夏莉，你可以忍住！"] = "But Mother's work is already so hard... Come on, Sharry, you can endure it!",
    ["但孩子们总说鱼肉的味道太腥了……"] = "But the children always say the fish tastes too fishy...",
    ["但它不是灰色的，只是看起来有点脏。"] = "But it's not gray, it just looks a bit dirty.",
    ["但实际上什么都没发生，不是吗？"] = "But in reality, nothing has happened, has it?",
    ["但客人们失去的美好时光无法弥补，比如被您打断的求婚。"] = "But the wonderful time the guests lost cannot be made up for, such as the proposal you interrupted.",
    ["但家里水管也得修了……管他的！先吃顿好的！"] = "But the water pipes at home need fixing too... Screw it! Let's have a good meal first!",
    ["但密修会随时都会再来，笔记的危险也没有消除，封印物2-049的负面效果随时可能影响我们……"] = "But the Rose School of Thought will come again at any time, the danger of the notebook has not been eliminated, and the negative effects of Sealed Artifact 2-049 could affect us at any moment...",
    ["但富人居住区附近怎么会有劫匪？还是在白天？实在是蹊跷……悄悄查看一下吧！"] = "But how could there be robbers near the wealthy residential area? And in broad daylight? It's truly suspicious... Let's observe quietly!",
    ["但对我这种人来说，已经是梦了。"] = "But for someone like me, it's already a dream.",
    ["但小少爷不让我们再雇佣任何一个孩子，还让他们……这个不能告诉你，去那边站好吧。"] = "But the young master won't let us hire any more children, and he even made them... I can't tell you that, just go stand over there.",
    ["但小黛西和乔纳尔弥补了我心中的某种缺憾，也许是被我遗忘了的缺憾，他们是我在这个世界活下去的意义。"] = "But little Daisy and Jonar made up for a certain deficiency in my heart, perhaps a deficiency I had forgotten. They are the meaning of my living in this world.",
    ["但尤朵拉是一个被恶魔引诱、无可救药的孩子。或者说，她就是个披着人皮的怪物，不值得任何怜悯。"] = "But Yodora is a child seduced by a demon, beyond saving. Or rather, she is a monster in human skin, not worthy of any pity.",
    ["但山谷的雏菊真的很美……"] = "But the daisies in the valley are truly beautiful...",
    ["但工厂区的怨念与日俱增……"] = "But the resentment in the factory district is growing day by day...",
    ["但平静的日子不会一直持续下去。有一天，他的大学老师诡异地死在了图书馆里。"] = "But the peaceful days would not last forever. One day, his university professor died mysteriously in the library.",
    ["但幸好，这条路是明亮的。"] = "But fortunately, this road is bright.",
    ["但廷根已经到了需要改革的时候！"] = "But Tingen has reached the point where reform is necessary!",
    ["但廷根被一百多年前的时代浪潮笼罩，不太对劲。"] = "But Tingen is shrouded in the tide of an era from over a hundred years ago, which is not quite right.",
    ["但恐怕我要让您伤心了，对于约会，我的答案是不。"] = "But I'm afraid I have to disappoint you; as for a date, my answer is no.",
    ["但您会说话，会读心理学，还会进入梦境……"] = "But you can speak, read psychology, and enter dreams...",
    ["但您瞧，我们不需要怜悯。铁针和丝线擅长跑腿，毡毡和布布的编织技术很好，羊毛适合打听消息……样样在行。"] = "But you see, we don't need pity. Iron Needle and Silk Thread are good at running errands, Felt and Cloth are great at weaving, Wool is good at gathering information... we're good at everything.",
    ["但愿不会有这么一天"] = "I hope that day never comes",
    ["但愿不会有这么一天。"] = "I hope that day never comes.",
    ["但愿你说的是真的……"] = "I hope you're telling the truth...",
    ["但愿女神……在间隙……"] = "May the Goddess... in the gap...",
    ["但愿女神在天使唱歌的间隙"] = "May the Goddess be there in the gaps between the angels' singing",
    ["但愿如此……我会烧掉我的手稿，重新回到被斥为“粗俗”的褶皱里，写一部真正动人的作品，到时候再请你也来一起观赏。"] = "I hope so... I will burn my manuscripts and return to the folds dismissed as 'vulgar' to write a truly moving work. When that time comes, I will invite you to watch it together.",
    ["但愿它有助于你查清案件。有些事听起来普通，但真相却令人心惊。"] = "I hope it helps you clear up the case. Some things sound ordinary, but the truth is chilling.",
    ["但愿这次别再有坏货了，上次那批红酒全漏了，熏得我头疼了整整一周！"] = "I hope there won't be any bad cargo this time, the last batch of red wine leaked, and the smell gave me a headache for a whole week!",
    ["但成为红手套，我就不能留在黑荆棘了。"] = "But if I become a Nighthawk, I won't be able to stay in Blackthorn.",
    ["但我一直以为这和他解雇了所有孩子有关，好像、好像是说让他们不要待在工厂，回学校去？"] = "But I always thought it had to do with him firing all the children; it seems, it seems he said to keep them out of the factory and send them back to school?",
    ["但我不会停留"] = "But I will not stay",
    ["但我不后悔。活着的时候，该用的能力都用过了，该报的仇也报了。比起那些苟延残喘却一事无成的非凡者，我这辈子够本了。"] = "But I have no regrets. While I was alive, I used all the abilities I should have used and took all the revenge I needed to take. Compared to those Beyonders who just struggle to survive and achieve nothing, I've lived a life worth living.",
    ["但我不理解，{{先生|女士}}，你不认为爱情只是命运的捉弄吗？怎么会有一见钟情这样荒谬的事，让人愿意为陌生人付出一切呢？"] = "But I don't understand, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, don't you think love is just a trick of fate? How can there be such an absurd thing as love at first sight that makes people willing to give everything for a stranger?",
    ["但我也不会太放纵，晚上在河边喝杯黑麦啤酒，就够了。"] = "But I won't be too indulgent; having a glass of rye beer by the river at night is enough.",
    ["但我也不是什么消息都“灵通”，八卦的话瑞克了解的更多些。"] = "But I'm not 'well-informed' about everything. Rick knows more about gossip.",
    ["但我也是她的家人。我想，有很多事情，家人之间是不需要多问的。"] = "But I am also her family. I think there are many things that family members don't need to ask too much about.",
    ["但我也要提醒你……这份守护，未来将面临更大的考验。"] = "But I must also remind you... this duty of guarding will face even greater tests in the future.",
    ["但我们一直在相互治愈。他会耐心地抚慰我的伤痛，而我鼓励他写作，教他在恐惧时，握住熟悉的物品，例如……这块怀表。"] = "But we have been healing each other all along. He patiently soothes my pain, while I encourage him to write and teach him to hold onto familiar objects when he feels afraid, like... this pocket watch.",
    ["但我们不能。"] = "But we can't.",
    ["但我们实在凑不出人的话，他还是会来的。"] = "But if we really can't scrape enough people together, he will still come.",
    ["但我们恰好也可以顺着日记上去，抢在它之前拿到碎片！"] = "But we can also happen to go up along the diary and get the fragment before it does!",
    ["但我们暂时不提供甜品，因为我妈妈去贝克兰德进修啦，她是最棒的甜品师！"] = "But we don't provide desserts for the time being, because my mother went to Backlund for further studies, and she is the best dessert chef!",
    ["但我们死后才发现，正常死去的人，灵魂会顺着冥河往下漂，漂到属于他们的安息之地。"] = "But we only realized after we died that people who die normally have their souls drift down the River of Death to their place of rest.",
    ["但我们真的只是一家安保公司。"] = "But we really are just a security company.",
    ["但我们老大是谁啊，凯文·斯托克，他当然不能退。"] = "But who is our boss? Kevin Stock, of course he couldn't retreat.",
    ["但我们都知道，真实的伤痛依然存在，廷根失去了一些好市民，卡尔、查林……他们的名字值得被记住。"] = "But we all know that the real pain still exists. Tingen has lost some good citizens; Karl, Charling... their names deserve to be remembered.",
    ["但我们需要先解决面前的问题，这个失控的小家伙看起来不会轻易放我们去追兰尔乌斯。"] = "But we need to solve the problem in front of us first. This little one who has lost control doesn't look like they will easily let us go after Lanevus.",
    ["但我似乎丢失了一些记忆，包括27号我做过什么、看到了什么，我甚至不记得我去过韦尔奇家！"] = "But I seem to have lost some memories, including what I did or saw on the 27th. I don't even remember going to Welch's house!",
    ["但我似乎还有一个名字，很奇怪……我的直觉告诉我那很危险……"] = "But I seem to have another name, it's very strange... my intuition tells me it's dangerous...",
    ["但我保证，将会部分尊重你做出的选择。"] = "But I guarantee that I will partially respect the choices you have made.",
    ["但我只是想让船自己养活自己啊。这不是很棒的生存策略吗？"] = "But I just want the ship to be self-sustaining. Isn't that a brilliant survival strategy?",
    ["但我向你保证，它一定精彩！"] = "But I promise you, it's definitely brilliant!",
    ["但我和哥哥还要租房吃饭，每周能攒下的钱非常少。"] = "But my brother and I still have to pay rent and eat, so the money we can save each week is very little.",
    ["但我唯独不能医治我的膝盖疼痛……这多可悲。"] = "But I, for one, cannot heal my own knee pain... how pathetic.",
    ["但我太虚弱了，他无法听见我的声音。"] = "But I was too weak, and he couldn't hear my voice.",
    ["但我已经给太多人带来了痛苦！"] = "But I have brought pain to too many people!",
    ["但我已经解读出了其中几个符号，确认那是数字的表达，发现这其实是一本日记！"] = "But I have already deciphered a few symbols from it, confirmed that they are expressions of numbers, and discovered that this is actually a diary!",
    ["但我希望，每个廷根市民都能感受到关怀与被尊重，这是我想要奋斗终生的理想。"] = "But I hope that every Tingen citizen can feel cared for and respected; this is the ideal I want to strive for my whole life.",
    ["但我并不后悔，我度过了懦弱但幸福的一生。"] = "But I do not regret it; I have lived a cowardly but happy life.",
    ["但我并没有从启蒙教起的时间。"] = "But I don't have the time to teach you from the basics.",
    ["但我很抱歉，如果我能早点意识到占卜不是万能的，说不定就不会被特里斯逃走了……"] = "But I'm sorry. If I had realized sooner that divination isn't omnipotent, maybe Trissy wouldn't have escaped...",
    ["但我得到了一份其他的工作，他们还预支了我四周的薪水。"] = "But I got another job, and they even advanced me four weeks of salary.",
    ["但我得啰嗦一句，最近您必须小心——万一反复脱臼，可不是闹着玩的！"] = "But I must add a word of caution: you must be careful lately—if you keep dislocating your joints, it's no laughing matter!",
    ["但我得感谢他，否则我无法获得这份工作，家里的孩子都要饿死。"] = "But I have to thank him, otherwise I wouldn't have gotten this job, and the children at home would starve to death.",
    ["但我想了很久很久，我还是想要成为你们这样的人，走你们曾走过的路。"] = "But I've thought about it for a long, long time, and I still want to become someone like you, walking the path you once walked.",
    ["但我想要雇佣的不是同伴，是一群保镖！"] = "But I'm not looking to hire companions, I'm looking for a group of bodyguards!",
    ["但我想，他对美食的热情，终究唤醒了我体内的某些东西。"] = "But I think his passion for gourmet food eventually awakened something within me.",
    ["但我感觉放松多了。"] = "But I feel much more relaxed.",
    ["但我感觉领口有点紧，胸口也闷得难受，还有袖口这里……"] = "But I feel the collar is a bit tight, my chest feels stuffy, and the cuffs here...",
    ["但我无法将这作为行业的标准去要求其他人，只能帮助很少一部分人。"] = "But I cannot use this as an industry standard to demand from others; I can only help a very small number of people.",
    ["但我早已窥见了命运，你们的落幕……我必将见证！"] = "But I have long since glimpsed fate; your curtain call... I shall witness it!",
    ["但我明白您的意思了，如果去其中一个不会有好结果，那我就两个都去！"] = "But I understand what you mean. If going to one of them won't have a good result, then I'll go to both!",
    ["但我更怕活着……每次闭上眼睛，我就看到那些被我杀死的敌人……他们问我，为什么你还活着……"] = "But I am even more afraid of living... Every time I close my eyes, I see those enemies I killed... They ask me, why are you still alive...",
    ["但我最喜欢的，还是那些具有特殊意义的小东西们。"] = "But what I like most are those little things with special significance.",
    ["但我根本就没架梯子啊！"] = "But I haven't even set up the ladder yet!",
    ["但我根本没有能搭配这条项链的衣服。"] = "But I don't have any clothes to match this necklace at all.",
    ["但我每用一次，就忘掉一点。开始只是小事——忘了早餐，忘了昨天见过谁。"] = "But every time I used them, I forgot a little bit. At first, it was just small things—forgetting breakfast, forgetting who I saw yesterday.",
    ["但我没办法。我试过把南瓜砸了——没用，砸烂了第二天还是会长出来。只能接着卖。卖一颗，就能见她一次。"] = "But I have no choice. I tried smashing the pumpkins—it was useless, they would just grow back the next day. I can only keep selling them. If I sell one, I get to see her once.",
    ["但我没有动手！一定是那件东西害了他！一定！"] = "But I didn't do it! It must have been that thing that harmed him! It must be!",
    ["但我猜 你刻意选择了遗忘这句话 对吧？"] = "But I guess you deliberately chose to forget that sentence, right?",
    ["但我现在很困，为什么鸟儿们没来叫醒我呢？为什么我怎么都梦不见妈妈呢？"] = "But I am very sleepy now, why didn't the birds come to wake me up? Why can't I dream of Mother no matter what?",
    ["但我相信你能处理好。毕竟，你也很特殊。"] = "But I believe you can handle it. After all, you are also quite special.",
    ["但我知道，她只是把所有的情感都藏在了那些齿轮里。"] = "But I knew she was just hiding all her emotions in those gears.",
    ["但我确实什么都不记得了。"] = "But I really don't remember anything.",
    ["但我算过，就算每晚少睡三个小时，也只能再记录几百种。"] = "But I have calculated that even if I sleep three hours less every night, I can only record a few hundred more.",
    ["但我老记不住！也许带一束回家，就能记住了吧！"] = "But I can never remember them! Maybe if I take a bouquet home, I'll be able to remember!",
    ["但我要先去<P_Yellow>取消廷根大学的面试</>，毕竟是导师介绍的机会，去打个招呼，这样才礼貌。"] = "But I need to go to <P_Yellow>cancel my interview at Tingen University</> first. After all, it was an opportunity introduced by my mentor, so it's only polite to go and say hello.",
    ["但我觉得应该叫“潮湿之城”或者“多雨之城”，因为这里总是下雨。"] = "But I think it should be called the 'Damp City' or the 'Rainy City' because it's always raining here.",
    ["但我记得在书里，大冒险家格尔曼只戴过礼帽啊？"] = "But I recall that in the books, the great adventurer Gehrman only ever wore a top hat?",
    ["但我说，不！还不够！女神保佑，我们能赢得比以往任何时候都多！"] = "But I say, no! It's not enough! Goddess bless us, we can win more than ever before!",
    ["但我还是喜欢到这里来。"] = "But I still like coming here.",
    ["但我这次只是来找人，以一个普通人的身份。"] = "But this time, I am only here to find someone, as an ordinary person.",
    ["但我隐约觉得，我没有太多时间了。"] = "But I vaguely feel that I don't have much time left.",
    ["但我需要补习文法、法律和数学……这需要花费一笔不小的钱，还有我全部的精力。"] = "But I need to take remedial classes in grammar, law, and mathematics... that costs a significant amount of money, plus all my energy.",
    ["但承载神明的力量，需要直面祂的注视。这近乎直视神——你的精神将承受巨大的冲击。稍有松懈，便可能迷失在呓语之中。"] = "But carrying the power of a deity requires facing Her gaze directly. This is almost like looking directly at a god—your spirit will endure a huge impact. If you relax even a little, you may be lost in the whispers.",
    ["但技术的光辉永远不会熄灭。"] = "But the brilliance of technology will never be extinguished.",
    ["但据说这种蘑菇要完全煮熟才能食用，否则的话这些蘑菇会汲取人的血肉，直到将人变成巨大的蘑菇。"] = "But it is said that this mushroom must be completely cooked before it can be eaten. Otherwise, these mushrooms will drain a person's blood and flesh until they turn into a giant mushroom.",
    ["但时尚协会的大门，只对时尚的人敞开，而你……"] = "But the doors of the Fashion Association are only open to those who are fashionable, and you...",
    ["但是"] = "However",
    ["但是……"] = "But...",
    ["但是……“他”到底做了些什么？"] = "But... what exactly did \"he\" do?",
    ["但是……污染扭曲了现实，普通的方法无法进入。"] = "But... the corruption has distorted reality, and normal methods cannot enter.",
    ["但是……没有挂饵？"] = "But... there's no bait on the hook?",
    ["但是……这次我带着从特里尔买的戒指，终于回到了廷根……露西已经嫁给一个布料商了。"] = "But... this time I brought back the ring I bought in Trier and finally returned to Tingen... Lucy has already married a cloth merchant.",
    ["但是……这间屋子里真的还剩下神奇物品吗？这些证据似乎是相反的……"] = "But... are there really any mystical items left in this room? These pieces of evidence seem to suggest the opposite...",
    ["但是……随着时间流逝，周围人开始变得奇怪。"] = "But... as time passed, the people around us started acting strange.",
    ["但是、但是！我的女神啊，你知道那有多么危险吗？队长没告诉你吗？"] = "But, but! My Goddess, do you know how dangerous that is? Didn't the captain tell you?",
    ["但是下面这些日记……它想毁掉这些记忆。"] = "But these diaries below... it wants to destroy these memories.",
    ["但是人都去哪里了？"] = "But where did everyone go?",
    ["但是今天，你让我意识到了问题，时代早已经变了，戏剧也该跟着变化。"] = "But today, you made me realize the problem: the times have long since changed, and drama should change along with them.",
    ["但是他看起来，只是……只是个普通人，我……呕！"] = "But he looked like, just... just an ordinary person, I... *gag*!",
    ["但是以我的家境，哪有钱和渠道买枪。"] = "But with my family background, where would I have the money and channels to buy a gun?",
    ["但是你也许看到了，负责来取货的俱乐部仆役刚刚在那边被马车撞飞了，看起来骨头有些不妙，得去看医生。"] = "But as you might have seen, the club servant responsible for picking up the goods was just hit by a carriage over there, his bones don't look good, he has to see a doctor.",
    ["但是你晋升的话，就能加入红手套了，我们还可以一起合作。"] = "But if you advance, you could join the Red Gloves, and we could work together.",
    ["但是入口被这些柱子封锁起来了，我们要破坏它们！"] = "But the entrance is blocked by these pillars; we must destroy them!",
    ["但是刻骨的仇恨他一刻也没有忘怀，经过多年的仔细调查，他已经查明了真相，找到了陷害自己的仇人。"] = "However, he never forgot his bone-deep hatred for a single moment. After years of careful investigation, he had uncovered the truth and found the enemies who had framed him.",
    ["但是呀，说真的，艾恩夫妇对小艾恩实在太严格了，这个年纪的孩子，就应该开开心心地玩嘛。"] = "But really, honestly, the Aine couple is too strict with little Aine. A child at this age should just be playing happily.",
    ["但是坦白讲，我尊敬每一位自愿成为值夜者的人。"] = "But honestly, I respect everyone who volunteers to become a Nighthawk.",
    ["但是垃圾没有消失。因为垃圾实在没有地方可去——"] = "But the trash hasn't disappeared. Because the trash really has nowhere to go—",
    ["但是它的副作用无法避免，您的皮肤会开始龟裂变色，就像年久失修的墙皮。"] = "But its side effects are unavoidable. Your skin will start to crack and change color, just like old, neglected wall plaster.",
    ["但是对当地居民来说，是非常具有性价比的……"] = "But for the local residents, it's very cost-effective...",
    ["但是寻宝之旅哪能这样简单，要想得到这份财富，格尔曼还需要一把开启宝藏的钥匙。"] = "But a treasure hunt can't be that simple. To obtain this wealth, Gehrman also needs a key to open the treasure.",
    ["但是我也请大家看看，我们的工厂正在产出最坚固的钢铁，这是工业的基础，是王国的未来！"] = "But I also want everyone to see that our factory is producing the strongest steel, which is the foundation of industry and the future of the kingdom!",
    ["但是我从下周开始，就打算每周只来周日那一天了。"] = "But starting next week, I plan to only come on Sundays.",
    ["但是我总觉得，人类的心理学书有时候写得不太对。"] = "But I always feel that human psychology books sometimes aren't quite right.",
    ["但是我敢说，你有当演员的天赋，你不仅满足我所有要求，而且你眼神里的故事感一定能打动观众，这一切肯定是女神的安排。"] = "But I dare say, you have the talent to be an actor. You not only meet all my requirements, but the sense of story in your eyes will definitely move the audience. This must be an arrangement by the Goddess.",
    ["但是我最喜欢留在村里，我会帮贝利亚学习、帮奶奶犁地。大家说，我很善良。"] = "But I like staying in the village the most. I help Bella study and help Grandma plow the fields. Everyone says I am very kind.",
    ["但是我根本不在家啊！"] = "But I'm not home at all!",
    ["但是我没有……啊，您控制了它的力量，保护了我。"] = "But I don't have... Ah, you controlled its power and protected me.",
    ["但是我的朋友伊莎贝尔可以，她很聪明，她的妈妈达洛维夫人也很支持。"] = "But my friend Isabelle can. She's very smart, and her mother, Mrs. Dalov, is very supportive.",
    ["但是我还是决定一再邀请你，昔日的佣兵啊，和我们一同为丰厚的宝藏冒险吧！"] = "But I have decided to invite you repeatedly. Former mercenary, come with us and adventure for the rich treasure!",
    ["但是把3换成小王是不是太大了？真的很容易被逮到啊。"] = "But isn't swapping a 3 for a small Joker too big a move? It's really easy to get caught.",
    ["但是更关键的是，她要制造多起死亡的目的。"] = "But the more critical point is her purpose in creating multiple deaths.",
    ["但是杰姆说，他以后都没办法跟我一起工作了，这不只是因为生病……"] = "But Jem said he won't be able to work with me anymore, and it's not just because of the illness...",
    ["但是根据公式，我们需要它增重到200公斤才能触发。"] = "But according to the formula, we need it to increase in weight to 200 kilograms to trigger it.",
    ["但是根据对等原则，阿罗德斯也会要求对方回答一个问题，或者接受雷击的惩罚。"] = "But according to the principle of equivalence, Arrodes will also require the other party to answer a question or accept the punishment of a Lightning Strike.",
    ["但是现在，让我歇会儿，睡十分钟，就十分钟……呼呼……"] = "But for now, let me rest for a while. Sleep for ten minutes, just ten minutes... *snore*...",
    ["但是还愿后想要回去就再没有这样轻易了。复杂的站名和交错的路线图把我的脑子搅和得一团乱！"] = "But returning after fulfilling the vow is not as easy. The complex station names and the crisscrossing route maps have made my brain a complete mess!",
    ["但是还是便宜的呀。反正不论半袋还是一袋都用不完，为什么不买便宜的。"] = "But it's still cheap. Anyway, you won't finish either half a bag or a whole bag, so why not buy the cheaper one?",
    ["但是这些门卫看起来可不太友善，先击败他们吧。"] = "But these guards don't look very friendly; let's defeat them first.",
    ["但是这份悠闲是因为什么而得到变化呢？"] = "But what caused this leisure to change?",
    ["但是这几年生意越来越差了，人们更相信那些动不动拿刀的医生们。"] = "But business has been getting worse these past few years; people trust those doctors who are always ready to pull out a knife more.",
    ["但是这里很危险。"] = "But it's dangerous here.",
    ["但是这里有个牌子，写着闲人勿入，违者重罚……"] = "But there is a sign here that says 'No Trespassing, Violators Will Be Severely Punished'...",
    ["但是这里的灵性痕迹混乱，敌人故意留下了混淆的信息，想要阻碍追踪。"] = "But the spiritual traces here are chaotic; the enemy deliberately left confusing information to hinder the pursuit.",
    ["但是韦尔奇、娜娅、瑞尔·比伯和他的母亲，却因为笔记事件死去了，爱丽丝也失去了她的爱人……"] = "But Welch, Naya, Ray Bieber, and his mother died because of the notebook incident, and Alice also lost her lover...",
    ["但是，人类从历史中吸取的唯一教训，就是人类不会从历史中吸取教训。"] = "However, the only lesson humans learn from history is that humans do not learn lessons from history.",
    ["但是，先生，你必须吃药了。不然你的病永远不会好……"] = "But, sir, you must take your medicine. Otherwise, your illness will never get better...",
    ["但是，女神啊，您知道的……\r\n时间总是会磨平激情！"] = "But, Goddess, you know... time always wears down passion!",
    ["但是，如果我不能再见上父母一面便死去，那该多遗憾啊。所以我一直努力活下来。"] = "But if I die without seeing my parents one more time, what a pity that would be. So I have been trying hard to survive.",
    ["但是，就你一个人吗？"] = "But, are you alone?",
    ["但是，我发誓，风暴在上！我真的拍到了幽灵！"] = "But, I swear, Storm above! I really photographed a ghost!",
    ["但是，我可不想表现得像个卷毛狒狒一样！"] = "But I don't want to act like a Curly-Haired Baboon!",
    ["但是，我最近好像一直听到一位先生念叨这本书，也许，我是说也许，你可以问问他。"] = "But, I seem to have heard a gentleman mentioning this book recently. Perhaps, I mean perhaps, you could ask him.",
    ["但是，我相信没用。"] = "However, my belief is useless.",
    ["但是，明明所有考卷都是我亲自印刷，直到考试当天都是用火漆密封的。我调查了很久，也没搞清楚原题是怎么泄露出去的！"] = "However, all the exam papers were printed by me personally and sealed with wax until the day of the exam. I've investigated for a long time, but I still haven't figured out how the original questions were leaked!",
    ["但是，服食不完整魔药还能得到好结果的概率很低，何况芙拉女士还长期精神不佳。她很可能……会当场失控。"] = "However, the probability of getting a good outcome from consuming an incomplete potion is very low, not to mention that Ms. Fula has been in poor mental health for a long time. She is very likely... to lose control on the spot.",
    ["但是，身体能力的提升并不代表成为了不受伤害的铁人。"] = "However, the improvement of physical capabilities does not mean you have become an indestructible iron man.",
    ["但是，首先你需要好的枪法，不然你的子弹会先打中队友，或者你自己。"] = "However, first you need good marksmanship, otherwise your bullets will hit your teammates first, or yourself.",
    ["但是？"] = "But?",
    ["但更高序列意味着更强力量，可以保护更多人……"] = "But a higher Sequence means stronger power, which can protect more people...",
    ["但最后还是把他们击沉了。那些海盗……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>要么被海流卷走，要么成了鲨鱼的猎物。"] = "But in the end, we sank them. Those pirates... <P_Heart>(Pauses)</> were either swept away by the currents or became prey for the sharks.",
    ["但最底下那几张不是，那些是我们回忆老朋友用的。"] = "But the ones at the very bottom are not, those are for us to remember old friends.",
    ["但最近瑞尔不知道怎么了，突然间就对开店不感兴趣了。"] = "But recently, I don't know what happened to Riel, he suddenly lost interest in opening the shop.",
    ["但有人愿意帮我解决这桩麻烦事，我当然十分欢迎，廷根的戏码我早就看腻了，让那个疯狂戏剧节滚蛋吧！"] = "But if someone is willing to help me solve this trouble, I am certainly very welcome. I've long been tired of the dramas in Tingen; let that crazy drama festival get lost!",
    ["但有她的帮助，成功的概率会大很多。"] = "But with her help, the probability of success will be much higher.",
    ["但有段时间他很少讲，南大陆的局势不好，他们公司裁了很多人，他为了保住工作，不得不接受更繁重的任务，经常加班，去环境恶劣的地方出差。"] = "But for a while, he rarely talked about it. The situation in the Southern Continent was bad, their company laid off many people, and to keep his job, he had to accept heavier tasks, often working overtime and going on business trips to places with harsh environments.",
    ["但根据教会总堂的命令，我要先向你通报0级封印物失踪的情况。"] = "But according to the orders from the Church's headquarters, I must first inform you about the disappearance of the Grade 0 Sealed Artifact.",
    ["但梅丽莎人呢？我还想看看她读大学后有没有长高呢，希望不要比我高太多。"] = "But where is Melissa? I still want to see if she has grown taller after going to university; I hope she isn't too much taller than me.",
    ["但此时他的心情远比海浪更汹涌澎湃……"] = "But at this moment, his mood is far more turbulent than the sea waves...",
    ["但每份调查报告都写着“无法复现故障”，您不觉得这很蹊跷吗？"] = "But every investigation report says 'unable to reproduce the fault'. Don't you think that's suspicious?",
    ["但每在这种时候，我还是需要来教堂，向女神祷告。"] = "But whenever this happens, I still need to come to the cathedral to pray to the Goddess.",
    ["但没有得到小队的批准，你不能以任何借口离开廷根，并需要尽量向家人保密。"] = "But without the squad's approval, you cannot leave Tingen under any excuse, and you need to try your best to keep it a secret from your family.",
    ["但爱情，总需要一点不规矩的弧度。 "] = "But love always requires a bit of an unconventional curve.",
    ["但狗也可以聪明，也可以思考，也可以选择自己的生活方式。"] = "But a dog can also be smart, can also think, and can also choose its own way of life.",
    ["但现在找上门的线索只有那个在大街上发疯失控的家伙，到底是怎么回事……"] = "But the only clue that has come to my door now is that guy who went crazy and lost control on the street. What exactly is going on...",
    ["但现在，你们应该有更重要的事情要去做吧。"] = "But for now, you should have more important things to do.",
    ["但现在，你需要的是好好地、安稳地睡一觉。"] = "But for now, you need to get a good, sound sleep.",
    ["但看他跳舞的认真劲，让我有点摸不准她到底是想出道，还是想出任务了。"] = "But seeing how serious she is about dancing, I can't tell if she wants to debut or go on a mission.",
    ["但看包装日期，这些咖啡都已经过期很久了……要怎么处理它们？"] = "But looking at the packaging date, these coffee beans have been expired for a long time... how should we handle them?",
    ["但真实造物主毕竟是邪神，您不担心被污染吗？"] = "But the True Creator is an evil god after all, aren't you worried about being corrupted?",
    ["但经历了这些后，我觉得这两句话反过来念也同样有意义。"] = "But after experiencing all this, I feel that these two sentences are equally meaningful when read in reverse.",
    ["但维护秩序不代表呆板的遵守和服从，如果有任何困难或不满，都可以来找我。"] = "But maintaining order does not mean rigid compliance and obedience. If you have any difficulties or dissatisfaction, you can always come to me.",
    ["但罗珊肯定还在工厂里面！她说她要把里面的人都带出来。"] = "But Rozanne must still be in the factory! She said she would bring everyone inside out.",
    ["但老爷们的信好像都还在，那……那丢的会是谁的呢？"] = "But the lords' letters all seem to be here, so... whose could be missing?",
    ["但至少花香还在，为什么不闻一闻？"] = "But at least the floral fragrance is still there, why not smell it?",
    ["但艾琳娜小姐选的是贝克兰德最英俊的新郎，又不是最能跑的新郎……"] = "But Miss Elena chose the most handsome groom in Backlund, not the one who could run the fastest...",
    ["但蘑菇当久了，也会饿的。"] = "But even if you've been a mushroom for a long time, you'll still get hungry.",
    ["但要小心一点，我们也不想失去任何一位队友。"] = "But be careful; we don't want to lose any more teammates.",
    ["但要小心某些存在的力量，老尼尔也说过他晚上经常睡不好、听到一些奇怪的呓语……"] = "But be careful of the power of certain existences. Old Neil also said he often doesn't sleep well at night and hears some strange whispers...",
    ["但要是最近的话，应该是我留下的各种历史痕迹、“亵渎之牌”，和贝尔纳黛，让我们最后得以见面。"] = "But if it's recent, it should be the various historical traces I left behind, the 'Blasphemy Card', and Bernadette, which allowed us to finally meet.",
    ["但记住——永远不要占卜自己，也不要占卜高位存在。前者会让你陷入自我欺骗，后者会让你被“注视”。"] = "But remember—never divine for yourself, and never divine for high-level existences. The former will lead you into self-deception, and the latter will cause you to be \"watched.\"",
    ["但记住，真正的战斗还没有结束……"] = "But remember, the real battle is not over yet...",
    ["但该死的，她成功勾起了我——作为“罗塞尔大帝”的兴趣。"] = "But damn it, she successfully piqued my interest—as 'Emperor Roselle'.",
    ["但该死的，她成功勾起了我——作为“罗塞尔大帝”的兴趣。 "] = "But damn it, she successfully piqued my interest—as 'Emperor Roselle'.",
    ["但还……远远不够"] = "But still... far from enough.",
    ["但还有什么曲子能在婚礼上演奏的呢？"] = "But what other songs can be played at a wedding?",
    ["但这个尝试非常危险，所以你将在我们的注视下进行。 "] = "But this attempt is very dangerous, so you will proceed under our watch.",
    ["但这个序列缺乏直接的对敌手段，而且我们只有它的序列9配方。圣堂有没有藏着别的，我就不清楚了。"] = "But this sequence lacks direct means of fighting enemies, and we only have its Sequence 9 formula. Whether the Cathedral has hidden others, I don't know.",
    ["但这也太夸张了，马西莫甚至叫库克为“厨王之王”！"] = "But this is too exaggerated, Massimo even called Cook the \"King of Chefs\"!",
    ["但这些人是不可能查到痕迹的。"] = "But these people couldn't possibly find any traces.",
    ["但这些信息需要解读，而解读的准确性取决于占卜者的经验。"] = "However, this information needs to be interpreted, and the accuracy of the interpretation depends on the diviner's experience.",
    ["但这些症状很快就消失了，而菲丽丝却陷入沉睡。"] = "But these symptoms disappeared quickly, yet Phyllis fell into a deep sleep.",
    ["但这份礼物似乎没能送到那个人的手上……"] = "But this gift seems to have never reached that person's hands...",
    ["但这儿的确是我家，你是怎么进来的？"] = "But this is indeed my home. How did you get in?",
    ["但这对整个王国来说，已经是在进步的路上了。"] = "But for the entire kingdom, this is already on the path of progress.",
    ["但这对认真努力的学生来说并不公平，投机取巧的学生以后也不会对历史学有贡献。"] = "But this is not fair to students who work hard, and students who take shortcuts will not contribute to history in the future.",
    ["但这很容易造成一种“活着”的假象，让更多无辜的人牵涉其中，甚至丧命。"] = "But this easily creates an illusion of being \"alive,\" causing more innocent people to get involved, and even lose their lives.",
    ["但这星图……弗洛最近会和家人有矛盾？"] = "But this star chart... will Flo have a conflict with his family recently?",
    ["但这是因为她已经没什么亲人了。我照顾了她很久，她想把她死后珍贵的非凡特性交给我继承，还有那串手链……"] = "But that's because she didn't have any relatives left. I took care of her for a long time, and she wanted to pass on her precious Beyonder characteristic to me after she died, along with that bracelet...",
    ["但这杯我想自己喝完。你去别的地方看看吧。"] = "But I'd like to finish this drink by myself. Why don't you go look somewhere else?",
    ["但这样的集会真的很有趣也很有意义，您是否愿意允许我们，之后也能在这里进行交流？"] = "But such a gathering is truly interesting and meaningful. Would you be willing to allow us to continue communicating here in the future?",
    ["但这次……我们都活着"] = "But this time... we are all alive.",
    ["但这次，你的魔药配方由愚者教会提供，材料由“正义”小姐赞助。"] = "But this time, your potion formula is provided by the Church of the Fool, and the ingredients are sponsored by Miss Justice.",
    ["但这次，你的魔药配方由黑荆棘提供，材料由“正义”小姐赞助。"] = "But this time, your potion formula is provided by Blackthorn, and the ingredients are sponsored by Miss Justice.",
    ["但这还是不公平的。"] = "But this is still unfair.",
    ["但这道河流可能被许多因素干扰：占卜者自身的潜意识、环境中游离的灵性、甚至其他高位存在的无意一瞥，都会让水面映出扭曲的倒影。 "] = "But this river can be interfered with by many factors: the diviner's own subconscious, the free-floating spirituality in the environment, or even an unintentional glance from other high-level existences, all of which will cause the water surface to reflect distorted images.",
    ["但这里明明是<P_Yellow>男厕所</>！你为什么会出现在这里？"] = "But this is clearly the <P_Yellow>men's restroom</>! Why are you here?",
    ["但这里有两扇门，是哪一边？"] = "But there are two doors here, which one is it?",
    ["但这附近多是工薪阶层的普通家庭，恐怕负担不起钢琴课。"] = "But most of the people around here are ordinary working-class families; I'm afraid they can't afford piano lessons.",
    ["但那个地方是我们的整个人生，整个历史。"] = "But that place is our entire life, our entire history.",
    ["但那样的结局 会是你们想要的吗……"] = "But would that be the ending you wanted...",
    ["但那样的结局，会是你们想要的吗……"] = "But would that be the ending you wanted...",
    ["但非正式成员仍然被允许使用俱乐部内的大部分设施，只要您定期缴纳30镑的年费。"] = "But non-official members are still allowed to use most of the club's facilities, as long as you pay the annual fee of 30 pounds regularly.",
    ["但饿着肚子也要去卖花，要不然家里所有人都没有食物。"] = "But I had to go sell flowers even with an empty stomach, otherwise, no one in the family would have food.",
    ["但黛西小姐手臂温热、柔软、富有弹性……我更愿意相信，她是睡着了。"] = "But Miss Daisy's arms are warm, soft, and elastic... I would rather believe that she is asleep.",
    ["位于俱乐部场景中时，基于魅力、直觉的检定投骰结果<Yellow>+1</>。\n<Yellow>每周六、周日19:30~21:00</>期间，该增益强化为投骰结果<Yellow>+3</>，并在参与教团玩法后，获得<Yellow>战斗属性增益</>。"] = "When in the Club scene, dice roll results based on Charisma and Intuition are <Yellow>+1 </>. \n<Yellow> Every Saturday and Sunday from 19:30 to 21:00 </>, this buff is enhanced to dice result <Yellow>+3 </>, and after participating in the cult gameplay, you gain <Yellow> combat attribute bonuses </>.",
    ["位于俱乐部场景中时，基于魅力、直觉的检定投骰结果<Yellow>+3</>，并在参与教团玩法后，获得<Yellow>战斗属性增益</>。"] = "When in the Club scene, dice roll results based on Charisma and Intuition are <Yellow>+3 </>, and after participating in the cult gameplay, you gain <Yellow> combat attribute bonuses </>.",
    ["位于俱乐部场景中时，将获得【结社之辉】增益效果：进行教团玩法（安魂，魅惑）时，投骰结果+1。\n每周周六、周日19:30~21：00期间，【结社之辉】效果获得强化：改为投骰结果+3。且在参与教团玩法后，参与双方获得战斗属性增益（与药品效果共用上限）。"] = "When located in the Club scene, you will gain the 【Radiance of the Organization】 buff effect: when performing cult gameplay (Requiem, Charm), the dice result is +1. \nEvery Saturday and Sunday from 19:30 to 21:00, the 【Radiance of the Organization】 effect is strengthened: it changes to a dice result of +3. Additionally, after participating in cult gameplay, both participating parties gain combat attribute buffs (shares a cap with potion effects).",
    ["位于俱乐部场景中时，玩家将获得【结社之辉】增益：基于魅力、直觉的检定投骰结果+1。"] = "When located in the Club scene, players will gain the [Radiance of the Organization] buff: +1 to dice results for Charisma and Intuition checks.",
    ["位于南大陆<Highlight>星星高原</>上的一片区域，源自第四纪的古战场历史投影。四皇之战后，从中攫取了最大利益的冥皇将宝藏带回星星高原。死亡骑士一直守护着这份含有禁制的宝藏，如此秘宝吸引了无数势力前来争夺，纷争从古至今，仍不停歇。\n每次激活战场，各大俱乐部将被随机分配至<Highlight>血皇帝、黑皇帝、夜皇、冥皇</>，四皇中的一个势力，化身为四皇麾下的勇士，让这片高原再度掀起刀兵。勇士们将争夺能够开启冥皇宝藏的<Highlight>死亡骑士</>，为自己的势力赢得荣耀。"] = "An area located on the <Highlight>Star Plateau</> in the Southern Continent, a historical projection of the ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch. After the War of the Four Emperors, the Underworld Emperor, who had reaped the greatest benefits, brought the treasure back to the Star Plateau. The Death Knight has been guarding this treasure, which contains restrictions. Such a secret treasure has attracted countless factions to compete for it, and the strife has continued from ancient times to the present.\n Each time the battlefield is activated, major clubs are randomly assigned to one of the four factions: <Highlight>Blood Emperor, Black Emperor, Night Emperor, or Underworld Emperor</>. They transform into warriors under the four emperors, causing this plateau to erupt in war once again. Warriors will compete for the <Highlight>Death Knight</>, who can open the Underworld Emperor's treasure, to win glory for their faction.",
    ["位于同一家族的玩家参与副本时，可以获得属性加成与额外复活次数。"] = "When players from the same Family participate in a dungeon, they can receive stat bonuses and extra resurrection counts.",
    ["位于小镇的最高处，向四周散播着宁静。"] = "Located at the highest point of the town, spreading tranquility to the surroundings.",
    ["位于廷根市中心的地标性广场，因此得名中央广场。"] = "A landmark plaza located in the center of Tingen, hence the name Central Plaza.",
    ["位于廷根郊外，已故艾弗利子爵的领土之一，现任主人是子爵夫人海伦娜……\n今年四月起，因不明原因封闭，疑似小子爵▇▇▇▇▇▇……\n……\n失踪人口增加，排查后都和庄园相关……\n……\n监测到不明污染，持续增加……\n……\n探明庄园为月亮仆从的据点之一……\n……\n庄园发生了异变，情况不明……\n……"] = "Located in the Tingen Suburbs, one of the territories of the late Viscount Everly. The current owner is Viscountess Helena...\nClosed since April of this year for unknown reasons, suspected to involve the young Viscount ▇▇▇▇▇▇...\n...\nThe number of missing persons has increased, and investigations link them all to the manor...\n...\nUnidentified corruption detected, continuously increasing...\n...\nThe manor has been confirmed as one of the strongholds for the Moon Servants...\n...\nThe manor has undergone a strange mutation, situation unknown...\n...",
    ["位于拉姆德古堡脚下的小镇，迎接着来来往往的游客。"] = "A small town at the foot of Lamud Castle, welcoming tourists coming and going.",
    ["位于鲁恩北部的金秋湖，是王国木材的供应地。"] = "Located in the north of Loen, Golden Autumn Lake is the kingdom's timber supply base.",
