    ["低价出售——精美古董——美美把玩——"] = "Low price sale—exquisite antiques—fun to play with—",
    ["低垂的红色桌布上摆放着精美的餐点，人们在此处进行着早晨的颂祷和夜晚的喜乐。"] = "Exquisite meals are laid out on the low-hanging red tablecloth, where people perform morning prayers and evening celebrations.",
    ["低声些！"] = "Keep your voice down!",
    ["低头lookat"] = "Look down",
    ["低序列"] = "Low Sequence",
    ["低序列者有时会引发小范围的短暂异变，比如让雨滴悬浮或让风短暂转向——不过大多是无意识的行为，很难持续。"] = "Low-sequence individuals sometimes trigger small-scale, short-term anomalies, such as making raindrops hover or making the wind turn briefly—but most are unconscious behaviors and are difficult to sustain.",
    ["低矮的小几被安静摆放于此，正适合那些平淡的闲暇时光。"] = "A low table is quietly placed here, perfect for those plain, leisurely moments.",
    ["低矮的金黄花海铺在小径两侧，最适合做早餐桌前那扇窗户的背景。"] = "A low sea of golden flowers spreads on both sides of the path, perfect as a background for that window by the breakfast table.",
