    ["体质_百分比加成"] = "Constitution_Percentage Bonus",
    ["体质强健，对疾病与恶劣环境有着极强抵抗力，掌握太阳领域神术，召唤圣光净化邪祟，是温暖光芒的坚定守护者。"] = "Physically robust, with extreme resistance to disease and harsh environments, masters Sun domain divine arts, summons Holy Light to purify evil, and is a steadfast guardian of warm light.",
