    ["体质求助文本1待文案包装"] = "Constitution Help Text 1 (Pending Copy)",
    ["体质获得极大增强，掌握公证之力辨别契约真伪，赋予有效之力以神圣光辉，令违约者付出沉重代价，是商业秩序的守护者。"] = "Physically greatly enhanced, masters the power of Notarization to distinguish the authenticity of contracts, bestows sacred radiance upon valid power, forces those who break contracts to pay a heavy price, and is the guardian of commercial order.",
