    ["你……要离开了吗？"] = "Are you... leaving now?",
    ["你、你仰慕我……"] = "You, you admire me...",
    ["你、你仰慕我……我、我倾慕你，这间花店甜似蜜！"] = "You, you admire me... I, I admire you, this flower shop is sweet as honey!",
    ["你、你你……搞偷袭！这不公平！  "] = "You, you, you... playing dirty! This isn't fair!",
    ["你、你去了风车那边？风暴在上，你快去教堂祈祷平安吧。"] = "You, you went to the windmill? Lord of Storms above, you should hurry to the church and pray for safety.",
