    ["你一定会成为你一定会成为你一定会成为你一定会成为你一定会成为"] = "You will definitely become you will definitely become you will definitely become you will definitely become you will definitely become",
    ["你一定会成功的"] = "You will definitely succeed",
    ["你一定喜欢！"] = "You will definitely like them!",
    ["你一定就是那位爱管闲事的非凡者吧？"] = "You must be that meddlesome Beyonder, right?",
    ["你一定想不到，你会在这里看到什么！"] = "You would never guess what you'll see here!",
    ["你一定要坚持错误的答案，我无话可说，只希望法庭上出示证据时，您也可以如此自信。"] = "If you insist on the wrong answer, I have nothing to say. I just hope you can be this confident when evidence is presented in court.",
    ["你一直在看那边那个喝醉的人吗？"] = "Have you been watching that drunk person over there the whole time?",
    ["你一直面朝路口，在等人吗？"] = "You've been facing the intersection the whole time. Are you waiting for someone?",
    ["你一觉醒来，却成了另一个人——霍伊大学历史系毕业生，有一个哥哥和一个妹妹，口袋里只剩几枚便士。这算什么？一场离奇的梦，还是命运开的一个玩笑？\n\n穿越，这是克莱恩给自己的第一个答案。\n他以为这只是一次意外的偏离，以为只要找到回家的路，就能回到原来曾经的家，回到那个不需要扮演任何人的世界。于是他小心翼翼地披上“克莱恩”的外壳，学习非凡，总结扮演法则，从泛黄的典籍里试着拼凑出一条归乡的路。\n\n可故事并未朝着他所期待的方向发展。长辈失控，队长牺牲，身不由己地卷入了一场与己无关的巨大阴谋。他死过一次，又从深渊的边缘死而复生。当他再度睁开眼时，发现自己早已不再是这个世界的过客，那些真实存在过的温暖与记忆，已经成了他维系人性、不可或缺的锚点。\n\n只是，现在的它们都被无情地碾碎了。于是他暂时收起“回家”的执念，走上另一条路——复仇。不再徘徊，不再犹豫。他开始谋划，开始变强，戴上小丑的面具，在灰雾之上以“愚者”之名俯瞰众生。\n“总有一天，我会回去的。”他低声说，“但不是现在。”\n还有太多账没有算清，太多人还没等到迟来的审判。回家，似乎成了一个遥远而漫长的目标。\n“但幸运的是，我是一个有耐心的人。”\n\n灰雾之上，“愚者”先生缓缓睁开了眼睛。 "] = "You wake up, but you have become someone else—a history graduate of Khoy University, with an older brother and a younger sister, and only a few pence left in your pocket. What is this? A bizarre dream, or a joke played by fate? \n \n Transmigration, this is the first answer Klein gave himself. \n He thought it was just an accidental deviation, thinking that as long as he found the way home, he could return to his former home, to the world where he didn’t need to act as anyone. So he carefully put on the shell of “Klein,” learned about Beyonders, summarized the acting principles, and tried to piece together a way home from the yellowed classics. \n \n But the story did not develop in the direction he expected. The elder lost control, the captain sacrificed, and he was involuntarily involved in a huge conspiracy that had nothing to do with him. He died once, and died and resurrected from the edge of the abyss. When he opened his eyes again, he found that he was no longer a passerby in this world, and those warm memories that had truly existed had become the anchors he needed to maintain his humanity. \n \n It’s just that they have all been ruthlessly crushed now. So he temporarily put away the obsession of “going home” and embarked on another path—revenge. No more wandering, no more hesitation. He began to plan, began to become stronger, put on the mask of a clown, and overlooked all living beings above the gray fog in the name of “The Fool.” \n “One day, I will go back.” He whispered, “But not now.” \n There are too many accounts that have not been settled, and too many people who have not waited for the late judgment. Going home seems to have become a distant and long goal. \n “But fortunately, I am a patient person.” \n \n Above the gray fog, Mr. “The Fool” slowly opened his eyes.",
    ["你一路上一定没少遇见想要卖你古董的家伙，还有带你进去探险的——现在的人，对历史一点敬畏都没有！"] = "You must have met plenty of guys trying to sell you antiques along the way, and those who offer to take you exploring—people nowadays have no respect for history at all!",
    ["你上个月也是这么说的。"] = "You said the same thing last month.",
    ["你上次的试穿被打断，是否要恢复成试穿的搭配？"] = "Your last try-on was interrupted. Restore the tried-on outfit?",
    ["你下班后直接来新家就好，地点是<P_Yellow>“水仙花街2号”</>。"] = "Just come to the new home after you get off work. The location is <P_Yellow>2 Daffodil Street</>.",
    ["你不也是，让我看看你的手。为了攒这些钱，你是不是把洗衣缝补的活都接了？"] = "Aren't you the same? Let me see your hands. To save this money, did you take on all the laundry and mending work?",
    ["你不也是？"] = "Aren't you doing the same?",
    ["你不仅非法剥削童工，还涉嫌虐待儿童。杰姆的病，还有道奇身上的伤就是最好的证据。"] = "You not only illegally exploit child labor, but you are also suspected of child abuse. Jem's illness and the injuries on Dodge are the best evidence.",
    ["你不介意吗？"] = "You don't mind?",
    ["你不会想要坐三等座的，米娜，那种座位拥挤又肮脏。"] = "You wouldn't want to sit in third class, Mina. Those seats are crowded and filthy.",
    ["你不会明白的，我时常感觉自己不属于这里！不，让我一个人待会……我最重要的<P_Yellow>发明笔记</>都被他扔进了壁炉……"] = "You wouldn't understand, I often feel like I don't belong here! No, let me be alone for a while... all my most important <P_Yellow>Invention Notes</> were thrown into the fireplace by him...",
    ["你不会是想讹我吧？"] = "You aren't trying to scam me, are you?",
    ["你不信我？那我今晚就带你去看！要是真瞧见了，你得让我玩玩你的怀表；要是没有，我那辆脚踏车就借你骑两天！"] = "You don't believe me? Then I'll take you to see it tonight! If you actually see it, you have to let me play with your pocket watch; if not, I'll lend you my bicycle to ride for two days!",
    ["你不在队伍或团队中，无法查询奖励次数信息"] = "You are not in a party or team, cannot query reward attempt information.",
    ["你不太舒服？这次我看不见你的想法。"] = "Are you not feeling well? This time I can't see your thoughts.",
    ["你不好奇吗？我的意思是，人总会累的，即使是教会圣者。"] = "Aren't you curious? I mean, people always get tired, even Saints of the Church.",
    ["你不怕枪声吗？"] = "Aren't you afraid of the sound of gunfire?",
    ["你不想让铁十字街的事重演吧？那就把你的心，变成铁做的。"] = "You don't want the events of Iron Cross Street to repeat, do you? Then turn your heart into iron.",
    ["你不感觉时间很紧迫吗？消化魔药，战斗训练，任务实践……"] = "Don't you feel that time is very pressing? Digesting potion, combat training, quest practice...",
    ["你不愿意，就算了。一个月了，每次到最后一步，我都做不到……"] = "If you don't want to, then forget it. It's been a month, and every time I reach the final step, I just can't bring myself to do it...",
    ["你不懂，我回去就结婚了，当然要整整齐齐。"] = "You don't understand, I'm getting married when I go back, so of course I have to look neat.",
    ["你不找海蒂女士，却急着找一枚戒指？"] = "You're not looking for Ms. Heidi, but you're in a hurry to find a ring?",
    ["你不是一直都很奇怪，我们的高层为什么都是女性？"] = "Haven't you always found it strange why our higher-ups are all women?",
    ["你不是团队团长，无法查询奖励次数信息"] = "You are not the team leader, cannot query reward attempt information.",
    ["你不是在路边找到了一个愿意和你合租的室友吗？他人呢？"] = "Didn't you find a roommate on the side of the road who was willing to share an apartment with you? Where is he?",
    ["你不是小队队长，无法查询奖励次数信息"] = "You are not the party leader, cannot query reward attempt information.",
    ["你不是很相信我？暴风雪就是肆虐的野驴啊。"] = "You don't really trust me? A blizzard is just a wild donkey on a rampage.",
    ["你不是怪物，你是一个真正的天才、一个很好很善良的人。"] = "You are not a monster. You are a true genius, a very good and kind person.",
    ["你不是戏法大师吗！"] = "Aren't you a Magician!",
    ["你不是疯子，卢娜。你只是个诚实面对自己的女人。"] = "You're not a madman, Luna. You're just a woman who is honest with herself.",
    ["你不是纵火家吗！"] = "Aren't you a Pyro-maniac!",
    ["你不是说你记得很清楚吗！"] = "Didn't you say you remembered it very clearly!",
    ["你不是说，常坐同一个位置就能让老板注意我吗？"] = "Didn't you say that sitting in the same seat often would make the boss notice me?",
    ["你不是说，要像你一样有操控风和浪的能力，才能在海上生存吗？我想，只要我有了其中一个，也许你就会同意带我去了。"] = "Didn't you say that one needs the ability to control wind and waves like you to survive at sea? I thought if I had one of them, maybe you would agree to take me.",
    ["你不是这里的医生？"] = "Aren't you the doctor here?",
    ["你不用担心，她不会被抓走，安全也有保障。"] = "You don't need to worry, she won't be arrested, and her safety is guaranteed.",
    ["你不相信？"] = "You don't believe it?",
    ["你不知道吗？传说金秋湖受到了大地的恩赐，所以常年处于丰收季。不过——"] = "Don't you know? Legend has it that Golden Autumn Lake received the blessing of the earth, so it is in a harvest season all year round. However—",
    ["你不知道沼泽女巫的传说吗？接触到这片池塘的人都会连做好几天噩梦！"] = "Don't you know the legend of the Swamp Witch? Anyone who touches this pond will have nightmares for days!",
    ["你不知道那老家伙多吝啬，见我找到了工厂的工作，就每个月要求涨租金，呸！比吃了狼鱼罐头还恶心！"] = "You don't know how stingy that old guy is. Seeing that I found a job at the factory, he demanded a rent increase every month. Bah! It's more disgusting than eating canned wolf fish!",
    ["你不知道？"] = "You didn't know?",
    ["你不知道？前两天的事……警察都来过了……"] = "You don't know? What happened a couple of days ago... the police even came...",
    ["你不知道？她和史密斯离婚了！听说那些房子她分了一半，现在还是我们的房东。这下租金总是她自己拿着了吧。"] = "You didn't know? She divorced Smith! I heard she got half of those houses, so she's still our landlady. At least she'll be the one collecting the rent now.",
    ["你不能总是放纵自己……我年薪十八镑，你年薪十二镑，但你攒下的远少于我。"] = "You can't always indulge yourself... I have an annual salary of eighteen pounds, you have twelve, but you save far less than I do.",
    ["你不能购买自己上架的道具。"] = "You cannot purchase items you have listed yourself.",
    ["你不能这样羞辱卡尔，他年轻时的贡献值得所有人尊敬。"] = "You cannot insult Karl like that, his contributions when he was young are worthy of everyone's respect.",
    ["你不要过来啊~"] = "Don't come over here~",
    ["你不要过来啊！"] = "Don't come any closer!",
    ["你不觉得很过分吗？"] = "Don't you think it's too much?",
    ["你不觉得这很美吗？"] = "Don't you think this is beautiful?",
    ["你不觉得那很压抑吗，每天随着人流两点一线。"] = "Don't you think that's depressing, going back and forth between two points every day with the flow of people?",
    ["你不试试怎么知道雪莉不会懂？"] = "How do you know Shirley won't understand if you don't try?",
    ["你不说我怎么给你考试范围。"] = "If you don't tell me, how can I give you the exam scope?",
    ["你不需要沮丧，序列7的非凡者不是那么容易抓住的，你已经做得很好了。"] = "You don't need to be discouraged. A Sequence 7 Beyonder isn't that easy to catch, and you've already done very well.",
    ["你不需要跟我比，你就是邓恩·史密斯，一位合格的值夜者小队队长。"] = "You don't need to compare yourself to me. You are Dunn Smith, a qualified Nighthawk squad captain.",
    ["你与%s成为好友，打个招呼吧~"] = "You and %s are now friends; say hello!",
    ["你与另一头搭起了连线，但不知道连线拉断会有什么后果…."] = "You have established a connection with another, but you do not know what the consequences will be if the connection is broken...",
    ["你与小狗并排坐下，它困惑地看了你一眼，礼貌地待在你身边，安静的你们与喧闹的牌桌互相对峙着。"] = "You sit down next to the puppy. It looks at you in confusion, politely stays by your side, and the two of you, in your quietude, stand in opposition to the noisy card table.",
    ["你与弗莱离开安全屋，重新回到镜中廷根……\n找到绝望魔镜，摧毁它，拯救更多的人！"] = "You and Frye leave the safe house and return to Tingen in the Mirror...\n Find the Magic Mirror of Despair, destroy it, and save more people!",
    ["你与弗莱队长离开安全屋，突破重重阻拦赶往中央广场，见到绯红满月降临，献祭仪式开始，异变市民化为洪流被吞噬。在神秘女士贝尔纳黛的指引下，你们进入各个隐藏空间收集罗塞尔的残存意志——故乡、女儿、时代，大帝的残存意志苏醒，一击打破污染屏障，你们趁势摧毁绝望魔镜，打断了献祭，伦纳德在停滞的时间中救下众人，再一次拯救廷根。然而调查报告揭示，月亮仆从的势力未被根除，五月庄园的邪神子嗣仍在孕育，真正的危机尚未解除……"] = "You and Captain Frye leave the safe house, break through numerous obstacles, and rush to Central Plaza, where you see the crimson full moon descend and the Sacrifice Ritual begin, with mutated citizens turning into a torrent and being swallowed. Under the guidance of the mysterious lady Bernadette, you enter various hidden spaces to collect Roselle's residual will—hometown, daughter, era. The Emperor's residual will awakens, breaking the corruption barrier with one strike. You take the opportunity to destroy the Magic Mirror of Despair, interrupting the sacrifice. Leonard saves everyone in the stagnant time, saving Tingen once again. However, the investigation report reveals that the forces of the Moon Servant have not been eradicated, the offspring of the evil god in May Manor is still gestating, and the true crisis has not yet been resolved...",
    ["你与灵界签订了秘密契约：所有体力消耗降低50%，仿佛获得了“门”的无限支持。"] = "You have signed a secret covenant with the Spirit World: All stamina consumption is reduced by 50%, as if you have gained the infinite support of the Door.",
    ["你与灵界签订了秘密契约：所有体力消耗降低50%，仿佛获得了“门”途径的无限支持。"] = "You have signed a secret contract with the Spirit World: all stamina consumption is reduced by 50%, as if you have gained the infinite support of the \"Door\" pathway.",
    ["你与灵界间的“通道”已被拓宽。你能更快地平息灵性的扰动，从而更频繁地开启灵视。 <Talent>【灵视】 技能的冷却时间-1秒</>。"] = "The \"channel\" between you and the Spirit World has been widened. You can calm the disturbances of spirituality faster, thereby opening spirit vision more frequently. <Talent>【spirit vision】 Skill Cooldown -1 second</>.",
    ["你与露米建立了共鸣联系，意识在两具身体间流转"] = "You have established a resonance connection with Lumian, consciousness flows between the two bodies",
    ["你个老家伙，就是嘴硬。"] = "You old geezer, you're just being stubborn.",
    ["你个蠢货，要驱魔，走远一点，别妨碍巫师{{先生|女士}}。"] = "You idiot, if you want to exorcise, go further away and don't get in the way of the wizard {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["你为什么……"] = "Why are you...",
    ["你为什么一直看楼上？"] = "Why do you keep looking upstairs?",
    ["你为什么不向这对情侣推销？"] = "Why don't you try selling to that couple?",
    ["你为什么不直接去投诉？学院会受理的。"] = "Why don't you just file a complaint? The college will handle it.",
    ["你为什么不跳舞？"] = "Why aren't you dancing?",
    ["你为什么不进去喝咖啡呢？"] = "Why don't you go inside and have some coffee?",
    ["你为什么会在地下交易市场卖人偶？"] = "Why are you selling dolls in the Underground Market?",
    ["你为什么会盯上阿诺德？"] = "Why did you target Arnold?",
    ["你为什么会这样想？"] = "Why do you think that?",
    ["你为什么坐在墙头？"] = "Why are you sitting on the wall?",
    ["你为什么待在炮筒里？是卡住出不来了吗？"] = "Why are you staying in the cannon? Are you stuck and unable to get out?",
    ["你为什么成为了流浪汉？"] = "Why did you become a homeless person?",
    ["你为什么独自在这里练习？"] = "Why are you practicing here alone?",
    ["你为什么被关在里面？"] = "Why are you locked inside?",
    ["你为什么要朝一个水池许愿呢？"] = "Why are you making a wish to a pool?",
    ["你为什么要杀死男爵?     "] = "Why did you kill the Baron?",
    ["你为什么要翻垃圾桶呢？"] = "Why are you digging through the trash can?",
    ["你为什么要谋害男爵？"] = "Why did you murder the Baron?",
    ["你为什么要跟着我？不要多管闲事。"] = "Why are you following me? Don't be a busybody.",
    ["你为什么躲在这里？"] = "Why are you hiding here?",
    ["你为什么还是躲在这里练习？"] = "Why are you still hiding here to practice?",
    ["你为什么问我为什么坐在墙头？"] = "Why are you asking me why I am sitting on the wall?",
    ["你为什么问我为什么问你坐在墙头？"] = "Why do you ask me why I ask you why you are sitting on the wall?",
    ["你为它留下了一顿饱餐，一方屋檐，与一夜安眠。"] = "You left it a full meal, a roof over its head, and a night of slumber.",
    ["你之前忽然提到马戏表演的时候，我就应该想到的！只是…我当时光想着…"] = "I should have guessed when you suddenly mentioned the circus performance! It's just... I was only thinking about...",
    ["你之前提到的和同事的打赌游戏，你们是怎么开始的？"] = "How did you and your colleagues start the betting game you mentioned earlier?",
    ["你也一样。戴着面具，说什么话，其实都没差别。"] = "You're the same. Wearing a mask, it doesn't really matter what you say.",
    ["你也为我倾倒吧"] = "Fall for me too",
    ["你也会变得和我一样……哈哈（咳嗽）……早晚的事……"] = "You will also become like me... haha (cough)... it's only a matter of time...",
    ["你也别小瞧我，我将来会成为很厉害的小说家的，像大名鼎鼎的佛尔思·沃尔一样！"] = "Don't look down on me either; I will become a very great novelist in the future, just like the famous Fors Wall!",
    ["你也可以去找墙角坐着的那堆家伙，字是一个不认，但办事很利落。"] = "You could also go find that bunch sitting in the corner. They don't know a single letter, but they get things done efficiently.",
    ["你也可以看看，明天就得开始帮我做这方面的工作了。"] = "You can take a look too. You'll have to start helping me with this work tomorrow.",
    ["你也听过这首诗！"] = "You've heard this poem too!",
    ["你也坐下吧，不要太拘谨。"] = "You sit down too, don't be too formal.",
    ["你也小心些，随意靠近它会让你沾染上厄运的。"] = "You should be careful too; getting too close to it will bring bad luck upon you.",
    ["你也想与我共舞一曲吗！"] = "Do you want to dance a piece with me too!",
    ["你也想练习灵数占卜吗？"] = "Do you also want to practice numerology divination?",
    ["你也想起舞吗？可以在那边的看板上报名！"] = "Do you also want to dance? You can sign up on the notice board over there!",
    ["你也敢嘲笑我，我要给你点颜色看看！"] = "You dare to mock me, I'll show you!",
    ["你也无法做出任何回应，所以，人还是在活着的时候好好珍惜吧。"] = "You also cannot make any response, so people should cherish life while they are still alive.",
    ["你也明白吧？怪人总是会有一些怪癖，比如人偶狂热爱好什么的……"] = "You understand, right? Weirdos always have some strange quirks, like a fanatical obsession with dolls or something...",
    ["你也是个什么都没有的家伙。——喂，布雷登，你有纽扣吗？"] = "You're also a guy who has nothing. —Hey, Braden, do you have any buttons?",
    ["你也是个诗人？"] = "Are you a poet too?",
    ["你也是吸血鬼？"] = "Are you a vampire too?",
    ["你也是来买戏服的吗？请先去预约吧。"] = "Are you here to buy costumes too? Please go make an appointment first.",
    ["你也是来取笑我的吗？"] = "Are you here to mock me too?",
    ["你也是来看本季新款的？"] = "Are you here to see this season's new arrivals too?",
    ["你也是来看病的吗？"] = "Are you here to see a doctor too?",
    ["你也是来祈祷的吗？隔壁还有位置。"] = "Are you here to pray too? There's still a seat next to me.",
    ["你也是来追寻真理的？"] = "Are you also here to seek the truth?",
    ["你也是猎龙帮？"] = "Are you also with the Dragon Hunter Gang?",
    ["你也是被报纸骗来的？原来是两只猫在打架啊。"] = "Were you also tricked by the newspaper? It turns out it was just two cats fighting.",
    ["你也是被选中的人吧，这个世界上总有些人是特殊的，不是吗？"] = "You are also a chosen one, right? There are always some people in this world who are special, aren't there?",
    ["你也是要来投诉我暴力执法的吗？"] = "Are you also here to complain about my violent law enforcement?",
    ["你也是钓鱼佬？"] = "Are you an angler too?",
    ["你也有这样的感觉，对吧？"] = "You have that feeling too, right?",
    ["你也来看看"] = "You come and see too",
    ["你也欠钱了？"] = "Do you owe money too?",
    ["你也没有资格来告诉我，我应该怎样活下去！"] = "And you have no right to tell me how I should live my life!",
    ["你也渴了吧，我为你点了一杯喝的。"] = "You must be thirsty too; I ordered a drink for you.",
    ["你也看看这些资料吧"] = "You should take a look at these materials too",
    ["你也看看这些资料吧。"] = "You should look at these materials as well.",
    ["你也知道咖啡重要？那还不赶紧还钱！如果每个人都像你这样，我的小摊子早就关门了！"] = "You know coffee is important? Then hurry up and pay me back! If everyone were like you, my little stall would have closed long ago!",
    ["你也经历了诡异可怕的非凡案件？"] = "You also experienced a strange and terrifying Beyonder case?",
    ["你也能看到？我打算在灵性之墙内，消除那些影响。希望……还不会太严重。"] = "You can see it too? I intend to eliminate those influences within a wall of spirituality. I hope... it's not too serious yet.",
    ["你也被困在这里了……"] = "You are also trapped here...",
    ["你也要嫁给吸血鬼？！"] = "You want to marry a vampire too?!",
    ["你也要来劝我放弃吗？"] = "Are you here to convince me to give up too?",
    ["你也要来帮忙吗？你真是个好人！"] = "You want to help too? You really are a good person!",
    ["你也觉得是我做错了，对不对……{{先生|女士}}，我想拜托你一件事，如果你在铁十字街见到我的父亲贝尔曼先生，请帮我瞒着他，谢谢您。"] = "You also think I did something wrong, don't you... {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, I want to ask a favor of you. If you see my father, Mr. Bellman, on Iron Cross Street, please help me keep it from him. Thank you.",
    ["你也让我感觉很熟悉，你到底是谁？"] = "You also make me feel very familiar; who exactly are you?",
    ["你也许需要点时间休息，剩下的事由丽贝卡处理。"] = "You might need some time to rest; Rebecca will handle the rest.",
    ["你也这么觉得对不对！我这次一定能成！她收我项链的时候眼睛都在笑呢——一定是心动了。 "] = "You think so too, right! I'll definitely succeed this time! Her eyes were smiling when she accepted my necklace—she must be moved.",
    ["你也这样认为？"] = "Do you think so too?",
    ["你也遇到了那位女士！"] = "You met that lady too!",
    ["你也闻到了吧，这东西连狗都不会碰！"] = "You smelled it too, right? Even a dog wouldn't touch this stuff!",
    ["你也需要一套自己的正装了。"] = "You also need a formal suit of your own.",
    ["你也饿了吗？要不要吃点我的小饼干？"] = "Are you hungry too? Would you like some of my cookies?",
    ["你买了单程票？"] = "Did you buy a one-way ticket?",
    ["你亲爱的老师"] = "Your dear teacher",
    ["你人真好，这么多天来你是唯一一个听到这里还没跑的人。"] = "You're such a good person, you're the only one who hasn't run away after hearing this for so many days.",
    ["你什么意思！"] = "What do you mean!",
    ["你什么时候出发？"] = "When are you leaving?",
    ["你今天去市场买些食材，还得去斯林太太那里买些黑麦面包。"] = "You go to the market today to buy some ingredients, and you also need to buy some rye bread from Mrs. Shling.",
    ["你今天怎么问题这么多？"] = "Why do you have so many questions today?",
    ["你仍是凡俗之躯，却蕴藏着无限可能，尚未窥见超凡之门。"] = "You are still a mortal, yet you contain infinite possibilities, having not yet glimpsed the door to the extraordinary.",
    ["你从二十二岁就在最后一步了。现在你六十岁了。"] = "You've been at the last step since you were twenty-two. Now you are sixty.",
    ["你从宝箱里获得的药水，冒出一股不妙的气息，可千万不要喝下。"] = "A potion you obtained from a treasure chest that emits an ominous aura; do not drink it under any circumstances.",
    ["你从宝箱里获得的衣服，冒出一股不妙的气息，可千万不要穿上。"] = "Clothing you obtained from a treasure chest that emits an ominous aura; do not wear it under any circumstances.",
    ["你从宝箱里获得的金币，不知道是真是假。"] = "Gold coins you obtained from a treasure chest; it is unknown if they are real or fake.",
    ["你从来就没希望我获得胜利，对吧？"] = "You never hoped for me to achieve victory, right?",
    ["你从来没有做错什么，你一直做得很好。"] = "You never did anything wrong; you have always done well.",
    ["你仔细感受一下"] = "Feel it carefully",
    ["你仔细挑选了一磅肉，并满怀期待地把钱塞到了狗肚子底下。"] = "You carefully select a pound of meat and, full of anticipation, stuff the money under the dog's belly.",
    ["你仔细看了我的文章！没错，不仅如此，油量也经过了严密配比，既美味又健康！"] = "You read my article carefully! That's right, not only that, the amount of oil has also been strictly proportioned, making it both delicious and healthy!",
    ["你仔细看碑文了吗？我越来越觉得……这根本不是普通的恶作剧。"] = "Have you looked closely at the inscriptions? I'm increasingly feeling... this is not just an ordinary prank.",
    ["你代表的是塔罗学派，和你对抗没有意义，只希望你能理解。理解万岁——罗塞尔大帝这样说过？"] = "You represent the Tarot Club, and it is meaningless to oppose you. I just hope you can understand. Long live understanding—did Emperor Roselle say that?",
    ["你以为 那是他的妻子 是吗？"] = "You thought that was his wife, didn't you?",
    ["你以为你只是个见证者？不。你也是被召唤来的。那本书选择了你，因为你也在追——追一个你自己都说不清的东西。"] = "Do you think you are just a witness? No. You were also summoned. That book chose you because you are also chasing—chasing something you can't even clearly define yourself.",
    ["你以为故事到此为止，没想到，塔罗牌中走出一只恶灵——正是那位找黛丝占卜的顾客，一个无比相信命运的偏执狂。它后续占卜得知自己被欺骗，向邪神祈求完成使命的机会，最终被抽出灵魂放到塔罗牌里，在占卜俱乐部等待能解开真相的人。"] = "You thought the story ended there, but unexpectedly, an Evil Spirit. emerged from the Tarot cards—it was the very customer who had asked Daisy for a divination, a paranoid person who believed in fate above all else. Later, it learned through divination that it had been deceived, prayed to an evil god for a chance to complete its mission, and was eventually soul-extracted into the Tarot cards, waiting in the Divination Club for someone who could unravel the truth.",
    ["你以为每家店铺都能得到廷根时尚协会的认可吗？"] = "Do you think every shop can get the approval of the Tingen Fashion Association?",
    ["你以为这样就能够动摇我的这颗心了吗？"] = "Do you think you can shake my heart with this?",
    ["你以后一定会成为出色的高空杂技演员，但是还是希望你能注意安全。"] = "You will surely become an outstanding high-altitude acrobat in the future, but I still hope you will pay attention to safety.",
    ["你以后如果工作太忙，我就帮你预订工作餐。"] = "If you are too busy with work in the future, I will help you order work meals.",
    ["你以后执行任务，可以使用封印物协助，但要小心它的负面效果。"] = "When you carry out missions in the future, you can use Sealed Artifacts to assist you, but be careful of their negative effects.",
    ["你以旁观者姿态，独自站在街边。\n街上的人流凭空一个个出现，逐渐变得非常热闹，但没人注意到你的存在。"] = "You stand alone on the side of the street as an observer. \nThe flow of people on the street appears out of thin air one by one, gradually becoming very lively, but no one notices your existence.",
    ["你们——好……"] = "You—hello...",
    ["你们……想进入小黛西的循环空间？"] = "You... want to enter little Daisy's cycle space?",
    ["你们……我好像全都明白了"] = "You... I think I understand everything now",
    ["你们……我好像全都明白了。"] = "You... I think I understand everything now.",
    ["你们……是食物！！！"] = "You... are food!!!",
    ["你们……还想去猎龙吗？"] = "Do you... still want to hunt the dragon?",
    ["你们……都在……"] = "You... are all...",
    ["你们……都是孤儿？"] = "You... are all orphans?",
    ["你们、你们是？"] = "You, who are you?",
    ["你们、你们，请保护好阿诺德……叔叔他在做一些事情、一些很危险的事情。"] = "You, you, please protect Arnold... Uncle is doing some things, some very dangerous things.",
    ["你们一定是搞错了什么，我向女神发誓，我没有做任何坏事，我的玫瑰也只是普通的玫瑰。我只是从廷根来贝克兰德找姐姐的……"] = "You must have misunderstood something. I swear to the Goddess, I haven't done anything bad, and my roses are just ordinary roses. I just came from Tingen to Backlund to look for my sister...",
    ["你们一定过的很幸福。"] = "You must have lived very happily.",
    ["你们一起上吧，我赶时间"] = "Come at me together, I'm in a hurry.",
    ["你们一起愉快地吃光了美味的嫩豌豆炖羔羊肉，这是一顿很棒的晚餐。"] = "You all happily finished the delicious tender peas stewed with lamb; it was a wonderful dinner.",
    ["你们不在乎，那就扔了！"] = "If you don't care, then throw it away!",
    ["你们不是在表演，不要套招！"] = "You aren't performing, don't fake the moves!",
    ["你们不是庄园的客人，清除你们！"] = "You are not guests of the manor, eliminate you!",
    ["你们不要再打了啦！"] = "Stop fighting, you two!",
    ["你们不要再打啦！"] = "You guys stop fighting!",
    ["你们不要误导我的弟弟。我的父母已经得到了永恒的宁静与幸福。"] = "Don't mislead my younger brother. My parents have already attained eternal peace and happiness.",
    ["你们不要过来呀！我好几天没洗澡了不好吃的！"] = "Don't come over here! I haven't bathed in days, I don't taste good!",
    ["你们不要过来啊啊啊啊"] = "Don't come over here, ahhhhhh",
    ["你们不要过来啊啊啊啊\r\n"] = "Don't come over here, ahhhhhh\n",
    ["你们不负责治疗他们吗？"] = "Are you not responsible for treating them?",
    ["你们也不喜欢那群孤儿吗？"] = "Do you guys not like those orphans either?",
    ["你们也是来面试的吗？"] = "Are you here for the interview too?",
    ["你们以为赢了？账单……永远还不完！"] = "You think you've won? The bills... are never-ending!",
    ["你们休想找到主人的踪迹！"] = "You won't find the master's trail!",
    ["你们做得已经足够好了。"] = "You have already done well enough.",
    ["你们做得很好。不过她制造了多起惨案，肯定不好对付，接下来的行动交给我和伦纳德。"] = "You did well. However, she has committed multiple tragedies and will definitely be difficult to deal with. Leave the subsequent actions to Leonard and me.",
    ["你们兄妹有着这样深的羁绊，为什么却断开了联系？"] = "You two siblings have such a deep bond, why have you cut off contact?",
    ["你们先前的冒险经验一定很丰富吧，不考虑重新体验刺激的生活吗？"] = "You must have had many rich adventures before; have you considered re-experiencing an exciting life?",
    ["你们写完作业，我抽完烟，就都可以回家了。"] = "Once you finish your homework and I finish my cigarette, we can all go home.",
    ["你们冷静一点，听我解释……"] = "Everyone, calm down, listen to my explanation...",
    ["你们别忘了，这里曾经可是有过午夜掘墓人出现的……听起来就很可怕！"] = "Don't forget, a Midnight Gravedigger once appeared here... that sounds terrifying!",
    ["你们到底是从哪里听说这些的？"] = "Where on earth did you all hear these things?",
    ["你们去一趟工厂区，做进一步的调查。克莱恩可以提供占卜或者仪式魔法的辅助。"] = "You should go to the Factory District and conduct a further investigation. Klein can provide support with divination or Ritual Magic.",
    ["你们去加入他们吧，学会这套动作也是你们工作的一部分。"] = "You go and join them. Learning this set of movements is also part of your job.",
    ["你们去猎龙城干什么？"] = "What are you going to Dragon Hunting City for?",
    ["你们又这样！{{PlayerName}} 你也和他们一起胡闹！连老维尔先生都串通好了！"] = "You guys again! {{PlayerName}} You're messing around with them too! Even Old Will was in on it!",
    ["你们只能向我许愿，祈求怜悯！"] = "You can only make wishes to me and beg for mercy!",
    ["你们可以在空闲时间尝试一个仪式魔法，它可以让你们遇到问题时能提前祈求和请假。"] = "You can try a Ritual Magic in your spare time; it will allow you to pray for help or ask for leave in advance when you encounter problems.",
    ["你们可以学点别的，做个学徒，或者……随便什么。以你们的聪明和勤劳，不会挨饿的。"] = "You can learn something else, become an apprentice, or... whatever. With your intelligence and diligence, you won't go hungry.",
    ["你们可以称呼我"] = "You may call me",
    ["你们可以称呼我——"] = "You can call me—",
    ["你们可以进去了。"] = "You may go in now.",
    ["你们可能是触动了笔记的诡异力量，而这力量的目的就是将笔记送给瑞尔·比伯，并且不让人发现。"] = "You likely triggered the notebook's strange power, and the purpose of this power was to deliver the notebook to Ray Bieber without anyone noticing.",
    ["你们吵就吵，为什么要丢我的菜……"] = "Argue if you must, but why throw my vegetables...",
    ["你们回到了小镇墓地"] = "You have returned to the town cemetery",
    ["你们在做什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你们在向什么神祈祷？"] = "What god are you praying to?",
    ["你们在干什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你们在我的后厨干什么？"] = "What are you doing in my kitchen?",
    ["你们在玩什么？"] = "What are you playing?",
    ["你们在聊什么？"] = "What are you guys talking about?",
    ["你们在聊谁？"] = "Who are you talking about?",
    ["你们在讨论什么？"] = "What are you discussing?",
    ["你们在说什么？"] = "What are you talking about?",
    ["你们在说谁？"] = "Who are you talking about?",
    ["你们在调查尤朵拉？那个可怜的小家伙呀……"] = "You are investigating Yodora? That poor little thing...",
    ["你们在这个营地呆了多久？"] = "How long have you been staying at this camp?",
    ["你们在这里做什么？"] = "What are you doing here?",
    ["你们在黛西小姐身上的尝试，间接害死两位仆人和一位管家……"] = "Your attempts on Miss Daisy indirectly caused the deaths of two servants and a butler...",
    ["你们太过分了！都不理我！"] = "You guys are too much! None of you are paying attention to me!",
    ["你们太霸道了！"] = "You are too overbearing!",
    ["你们女神信徒就是好，银饰戴着多体面。我信仰蒸汽与机械之神，祂的象征金属是青铜……总不能穿一身青铜盔甲出门吧？"] = "You Goddess believers are lucky, silver jewelry is so decent to wear. I believe in the God of Steam and Machinery, His symbolic metal is bronze... I can't go out wearing a full set of bronze armor, can I?",
    ["你们好，弗兰奇先生，托尼先生，我是警察。"] = "Hello, Mr. Franky, Mr. Tony, I am a police officer.",
    ["你们好，我是{{PlayerName}}，阿尔伯特在吗？"] = "Hello, I am {{PlayerName}}. Is Albert in?",
    ["你们好，我是热可可。"] = "Hello everyone, I am Hot Cocoa.",
    ["你们好，我是警察，在调查一起案件。请问你们见过这个小铜镜吗？"] = "Hello, I am a police officer investigating a case. Have you seen this small copper mirror?",
    ["你们安保公司在我们店里点了多少次餐了，你们的喜好我当然记得。"] = "How many times has your security company ordered from our shop? Of course I remember your preferences.",
    ["你们对封印物3-888的持有和使用，违反封印物守则。我不得不带回3-888，并汇报全部真相。"] = "Your possession and use of Sealed Artifact 3-888 violate the Sealed Artifact rules. I have to bring back 3-888 and report the whole truth.",
    ["你们对赛艇的热爱我感受到了，下次可以麻烦你们自己带椅子吗！"] = "I have felt your passion for rowing, next time could you please bring your own chairs!",
    ["你们将作为最后的祭品，见证一场伟大的新生！"] = "You shall serve as the final sacrifice to witness a great rebirth!",
    ["你们将是这份杰作，最后的见证与养料！"] = "You will be the final witnesses and nourishment for this masterpiece!",
    ["你们将进入其中，通过调查和推理，找出关键线索。"] = "You will enter it, and through investigation and reasoning, find the key clues.",
    ["你们小心点，可别摔着了。"] = "Be careful, don't fall.",
    ["你们就尽情的串吧，等你们把灵森灵林串的忧郁了，我就像一道光一样走进她们的生活，让她们离不开我"] = "You guys can keep flirting all you want. Once you've made Ling Sen and Ling Lin feel melancholy, I'll walk into their lives like a ray of light, making them unable to live without me.",
    ["你们帮了超过二十五个家庭远离了在斩杀线上挣扎的命运。奖励200枚金币。"] = "You have helped over twenty-five families escape a fate struggling on the execution line. Reward: 200 gold coins.",
    ["你们帮了超过五个家庭远离了在斩杀线上挣扎的命运。奖励50枚金币。"] = "You have helped over five families escape a fate struggling on the execution line. Reward: 50 gold coins.",
    ["你们帮了超过十五个家庭远离了在斩杀线上挣扎的命运。奖励100枚金币。"] = "You have helped over fifteen families escape a fate struggling on the execution line. Reward: 100 gold coins.",
    ["你们应该提前开票！那可是罗塞尔戏剧节！"] = "You should have opened ticket sales earlier! That's the Roselle Drama Festival!",
    ["你们度过了快乐的一天"] = "You spent a happy day",
    ["你们怎么知道我是占卜师？"] = "How did you know I was a diviner?",
    ["你们怎么能这样 票是我买到的！"] = "How could you do this? I bought that ticket!",
    ["你们怎么都不理我啊……"] = "Why are you all ignoring me...",
    ["你们想知道这个？只要找到姐姐，怎样都可以。要不然，我不会说的，我什么都不会说的！"] = "You want to know this? As long as you find my sister, anything is fine. Otherwise, I won't say anything, I won't say a word!",
    ["你们慢聊，那我先回去了。<P_Heart>（祝好运，不会写诗的诗人先生。）</>"] = "You two keep chatting, I'll head back first. <P_Heart>(Good luck, Mr. Poet who can't write poetry.)</>",
    ["你们所站立的不仅仅是一艘船，而是鲁恩王国工业智慧的结晶。"] = "What you are standing on is not just a ship, but the crystallization of the industrial wisdom of the Loen Kingdom.",
    ["你们打算怎么做？"] = "What do you plan to do?",
    ["你们把廷根守护得很好，而且你们救了小阿诺德，谢谢你们。"] = "You have guarded Tingen very well, and you saved little Arnold. Thank you.",
    ["你们拿着画像去询问这里的住户，做最后的确认，然后以谋杀母亲的名义通缉他。"] = "Take the portrait and go ask the residents here for final confirmation, then issue a warrant for his arrest on the charge of murdering his mother.",
    ["你们擅长调查什么"] = "What are you good at investigating?",
    ["你们早就该告诉我卡萝队长的意念残留在封印物里……我是“通灵者”，或许我会有办法。"] = "You should have told me long ago that Captain Carro's lingering thoughts remained in the Sealed Artifact... I am a \"Spirit Medium,\" perhaps I will have a way.",
    ["你们明明就很需要工人，为什么还要辞退我们！"] = "You clearly need workers, so why are you firing us!",
    ["你们昨天的案件怎么样了？"] = "How did your case go yesterday?",
    ["你们是从贝克兰德来的？"] = "Are you from Backlund?",
    ["你们是在？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你们是怎么被困在这里的？"] = "How did you get trapped here?",
    ["你们是考古学家？"] = "Are you archaeologists?",
    ["你们是警察？好……一定要治好菲丽丝！"] = "Are you police? Okay... you must cure Phyllis!",
    ["你们是谁，在这里做什么？"] = "Who are you, and what are you doing here?",
    ["你们是谁？"] = "Who are you?",
    ["你们是谁？在这里干什么？"] = "Who are you? What are you doing here?",
    ["你们是谁？！"] = "Who are you?!",
    ["你们是遇上什么事情了吗？"] = "Did you run into some trouble?",
    ["你们最近见过面吗？"] = "Have you seen him recently?",
    ["你们有没有发现什么？"] = "Did you find anything?",
    ["你们有没有发现，自从那个叫西尔维娅的外乡人来了之后，怪事就不断发生！"] = "Have you noticed that since that outsider named Sylvia came, strange things have been happening constantly!",
    ["你们有见到我的小艾琳吗……她漂亮，善良，也很乖巧……"] = "Have you seen my little Eileen... She is beautiful, kind, and very well-behaved...",
    ["你们来了，我们走吧……一起回家。"] = "You're here. Let's go... let's go home together.",
    ["你们没仔细看过那个风车？叶片上密密麻麻的都是……头发！"] = "You haven't looked closely at that windmill? The blades are covered in... hair!",
    ["你们没仔细看过那个风车？叶片背后，密密麻麻的都是……头发！"] = "Didn't you look closely at that windmill? Behind the blades, it's densely packed with... hair!",
    ["你们没看见那个女孩？"] = "You didn't see that girl?",
    ["你们河与海教堂会发吃的吗？圣赛琳娜教堂之前可是发过面包。"] = "Does your Church of the River and Sea give out food? Saint Selena Cathedral gave out bread before.",
    ["你们的人生没有计划吗？！这样也不是大事吗？！"] = "Is there no plan in your life?! Is this not a big deal?!",
    ["你们的价格是？"] = "What is your price?",
    ["你们的婚礼也得请我参加啊，我用塔利姆给的房费买了条漂亮的新裙子，正愁没场合穿。"] = "You have to invite me to your wedding too. I bought a beautiful new dress with the rent money Talim gave me, and I've been worried about not having an occasion to wear it.",
    ["你们的底价是？"] = "What is your bottom price?",
    ["你们的房间甚至有安装煤气管道，但我没有涨房租，你们再也找不到比我更慷慨的房东了！"] = "Your room even has gas pipes installed, but I haven't raised the rent. You will never find a more generous landlord than me!",
    ["你们的确是个严谨、独立的国家。"] = "You are indeed a rigorous, independent nation.",
    ["你们的结婚戒指丢了！还不是大事？！"] = "Your wedding ring is lost! And that's not a big deal?!",
    ["你们看不见……他们看不见……只有我看见了！"] = "You can't see... they can't see... only I can see it!",
    ["你们看看这个。"] = "Look at this.",
    ["你们看起来非常美味，今晚是用你们来做焗饭呢，还是做浓汤呢？"] = "You look very delicious. Should I use you for a gratin tonight, or a thick soup?",
    ["你们看！我搞到了他们三年前的航线图！据说“黄金梦想号”在某个神秘岛屿埋藏了无法估量的宝藏！"] = "Look! I got their route map from three years ago! It is said that the \"Golden Dream\" buried immeasurable treasures on a mysterious island!",
    ["你们看，我定制的手包。用纯银镶嵌出繁星，这样随身带着，就像被女神祝福一样。"] = "Look, my custom-made handbag. It uses pure silver to inlay stars, so carrying it with me is like being blessed by the Goddess.",
    ["你们看，这是姐姐给我的信，我没有说谎！"] = "Look, this is the letter my sister gave me, I'm not lying!",
    ["你们知道她去哪了吗？"] = "Do you know where she went?",
    ["你们知道我爬上来观赏瀑布有多不容易吗！"] = "Do you have any idea how hard it was for me to climb up here to see the waterfall!",
    ["你们知道？谢谢你，丽贝卡，也谢谢弗莱队长。"] = "You knew? Thank you, Rebecca, and thank you, Captain Frye.",
    ["你们破坏了仪式，“伟大母亲”不会原谅你们的！"] = "You have disrupted the ritual; the 'Great Mother' will not forgive you!",
    ["你们确实令人敬佩。那么，你们的未来呢？"] = "You are indeed admirable. So, what about your future?",
    ["你们继续"] = "You guys continue",
    ["你们继续。"] = "You may continue.",
    ["你们聚在大厅做什么？"] = "What are you all gathered in the hall for?",
    ["你们聚在这里做什么？斗邪恶吗？"] = "What are you all doing gathered here? Fighting evil?",
    ["你们自杀的原因已经清楚，那本笔记也到了瑞尔·比伯的手里，诡异力量的目的已经达成了。"] = "The reason for your suicide is clear, and that notebook has reached Ray Bieber's hands. The goal of the strange power has been achieved.",
    ["你们藏好没有？"] = "Have you all hidden well?",
    ["你们被安西娅发现了，战斗一触即发，全体非凡者将被传送至战斗区域。"] = "You have been discovered by Anthea; battle is imminent, and all Beyonders will be teleported to the combat area.",
    ["你们要<CS_Yellow>永远</>在一起哦 "] = "You must <CS_Yellow>forever</> be together.",
    ["你们要去贝克兰德？"] = "Are you going to Backlund?",
    ["你们要和我一起，参与“启明小队”的调查。"] = "You are going to join me in participating in the \"Dawn Squad\" investigation.",
    ["你们要干什么？不要再让我想起来！"] = "What are you trying to do? Don't make me remember again!",
    ["你们要干什么？票是我买到的。"] = "What are you doing? I bought this ticket.",
    ["你们要是还想着偷懒，那便是这个社会的罪犯。"] = "If you are still thinking about slacking off, then you are a criminal to this society.",
    ["你们要烧死菲丽丝？！给我住手！"] = "You are going to burn Phyllis to death?! Stop it!",
    ["你们要绑架谁？"] = "Who are you planning to kidnap?",
    ["你们解读出了什么？"] = "What did you interpret?",
    ["你们认识海莉夫人很久了吗？"] = "Have you known Madam Haley for a long time?",
    ["你们认识？"] = "Do you know each other?",
    ["你们说得太夸张了，我只是一个老乞丐呀。"] = "You're exaggerating too much. I'm just an old beggar.",
    ["你们说的杰瑞米是？"] = "Who is the Jeremy you mentioned?",
    ["你们说的毒药，是“焦糖炸弹”？"] = "Is the poison you mentioned 'Caramel Bomb'?",
    ["你们说的那个人在哪？"] = "Where is the person you're talking about?",
    ["你们说的那个占卜师，她叫什么？在哪里摆摊？"] = "What is the name of the diviner you're talking about? Where does she set up her stall?",
    ["你们说，主真的会回应我们的祈祷吗？"] = "Do you think the Lord will really answer our prayers?",
    ["你们读过上周更新的那章了吗？富豪先生在宴会上与冒险家朋友联手窃取情报的故事。"] = "Have you read the chapter updated last week? The story of the rich man teaming up with his adventurer friend to steal intelligence at the banquet.",
    ["你们谁愿意指引{{他|她}}？"] = "Who among you is willing to guide {{him|her}}?",
    ["你们还不回家吗，天快要黑了"] = "Aren't you going home yet? It's getting dark.",
    ["你们还有店歌？"] = "You have a shop song?",
    ["你们还翻到过什么？"] = "What else have you found?",
    ["你们这一晚上十五苏勒，是怎么算的？捉到的老鼠有啥标准不？"] = "How did you calculate this 15 soli for the night? Is there a standard for the rats caught?",
    ["你们这些强盗，把马车还回来！"] = "You robbers, give the carriage back!",
    ["你们这些税金小偷！之前已经回答过了，为什么还要再问一遍！"] = "You tax thieves! I've already answered that, why are you asking again!",
    ["你们这些穷人蝼蚁，真可笑！一辈子在斩杀线上挣扎，一辈子也爬不上来。"] = "You poor ants, how ridiculous! Struggling on the execution line for a lifetime, never able to climb up.",
    ["你们这是什么营地？"] = "What kind of camp is this?",
    ["你们这群鸟，竟敢啄我的脑袋！"] = "You bunch of birds, how dare you peck at my head!",
    ["你们这还有其他的款式吗？"] = "Do you have any other styles here?",
    ["你们这里最好喝的酒"] = "The best drink you have here",
    ["你们都成长了很多呢，真令人放心……"] = "You've all grown so much. That's truly reassuring...",
    ["你们都是好孩子……"] = "You are all good children...",
    ["你们都是神仆，为什么把他的话当做命令？"] = "You are all servants of God, why do you treat his words as commands?",
    ["你们都来看"] = "Come look, everyone",
    ["你们都知道他是……"] = "You all know that he is...",
    ["你们都知道海伍德是……"] = "You all know that Heywood is...",
    ["你们错了，死亡是寂静，一切都消失了。"] = "You are wrong, death is silence, everything has disappeared.",
    ["你们需要赔偿我精神损失费，为那些枯萎的花朵道歉！"] = "You need to compensate me for my emotional distress and apologize for those withered flowers!",
    ["你们非凡者总是这样，说一些我听不懂的话。"] = "You Beyonders are always like this, saying things I don't understand.",
    ["你们魔术师……有时候就像神一样，能表演出奇迹！"] = "You magicians... sometimes you're just like gods, capable of performing miracles!",
    ["你们！！！好吃！！！"] = "You!!! Delicious!!!",
    ["你们，最终有没有在一起呢？"] = "Did you two end up together?",
    ["你仰慕我，我倾慕你，这间花店甜似蜜！来，试试看！"] = "You admire me, I admire you, this flower shop is sweet as honey! Come on, give it a try!",
    ["你会下象棋吗？我正需要一个对手。"] = "Do you play chess? I am in need of an opponent.",
    ["你会写化学课论文吗？"] = "Can you write a chemistry essay?",
    ["你会后悔的，不信咱们走着瞧！"] = "You will regret this, just wait and see!",
    ["你会希望凯娜继续陪你玩游戏吗？像昨天那样。"] = "Would you like Kena to keep playing games with you? Like she did yesterday?",
    ["你会惹恼“母亲”的！"] = "You will annoy the \"Mother\"!",
    ["你会演戏？"] = "You can act?",
    ["你会说话，不是普通小猫。偷东西就应该受到惩罚！"] = "You can talk, you are not an ordinary kitten. Stealing things should be punished!",
    ["你会身份高贵、被爱意包裹，而且子女运势应该很不错。"] = "You will have a noble status, be surrounded by love, and your prospects for children should be quite good.",
    ["你似乎仔细处理过，但房间中还是有血的味道。"] = "You seem to have cleaned up carefully, but there is still the smell of blood in the room.",
    ["你似乎并没有对自己的死亡感到遗憾和痛苦。"] = "You don't seem to feel regret or pain about your own death.",
    ["你似乎有一个有趣的新朋友，你们刚才在做什么？"] = "You seem to have an interesting new friend. What were you two doing just now?",
    ["你低头看一眼法阵，想退出仪式区域，但也被藤蔓缠住，身上出现绯红污染。"] = "You looked down at the magic circle and wanted to Exit the ritual area, but you were also entangled by the vines, and crimson corruption appeared on your body.",
    ["你低头观察了一下这些能量线，它们将能量源——秩序之网——秩序水阀连接在一起。"] = "You lowered your head to observe these energy lines; they connect the energy source—the Web of Order—to the Order Water Valve.",
    ["你住这里？"] = "Do you live here?",
    ["你体内的枪伤正在恶化，邦尼埋下的\"花种\"即将生根。前往金梧桐剧院与崔佛碰头，击破潜藏在其中的能量核心\"原始镜面\"，斩断这场诅咒的源头。"] = "The gunshot wound in your body is worsening, and the \"flower seeds\" planted by Bonnie are about to take root. Head to the Golden Indus Theater to meet Trevor and destroy the \"Primal Mirror,\" the energy core hidden within, to sever the source of this curse.",
    ["你信哪个神？告诉我你信哪个！"] = "Which god do you believe in? Tell me which one you believe in!",
    ["你俩别吵了，难得回廷根一次。让您见笑了。"] = "You two stop arguing; it's rare to return to Tingen once. Please excuse the spectacle.",
    ["你倒是抬头仔细看看……"] = "You should look up and take a closer look...",
    ["你倒是洒脱。"] = "You are quite carefree.",
    ["你倒是直接。"] = "You're quite direct.",
    ["你做了一个古怪的梦，梦中的你成为了一名骑士……"] = "You had a strange dream, and in the dream, you became a knight...",
    ["你做得很好 像个真正的非凡者了"] = "You did well, like a real Beyonder",
    ["你做得很好。先喝杯咖啡平复一下吧。"] = "You did well. Have a cup of coffee first to calm down.",
    ["你做得很好，像个真正的非凡者了。"] = "You did well; you're like a real Beyonder now.",
    ["你做这些……是为了让我带你去海上？"] = "You did all this... just to get me to take you to the sea?",
    ["你做错了事"] = "You did something wrong",
    ["你偶然得到一张泛黄的灵界古卷，上面写着模糊的咒文。它似乎与召唤灵界生物有关。\n带着它去找现在的序列3召唤大师埃姆林·怀特，他或许知道这是什么。"] = "You accidentally obtained an ancient, yellowed Spirit World scroll with blurred incantations written on it. It seems to be related to summoning Spirit World creatures. \nTake it to the current Sequence 3 Summoning Master, Emlyn White; he might know what this is.",
    ["你偶然得到一张泛黄的灵界古卷，上面写着模糊的咒文。它似乎与召唤灵界生物有关。\r\n带着它去找现在的序列3召唤大师埃姆林·怀特，他或许知道这是什么。"] = "You accidentally obtained a yellowed, ancient scroll from the Spirit World with blurry incantations written on it. It seems to be related to summoning Spirit World creatures.\nTake it to the current Sequence 3 Master of Puppets, Emlyn White; he might know what this is.",
    ["你偶然得到一片散发着微光的羽毛。它轻若无物，却蕴含着难以言喻的灵性。\n带着它去找埃姆林·怀特，他或许知道这是什么。"] = "You accidentally obtained a feather emitting a faint glow. It is as light as nothing, yet contains indescribable spirituality. \nTake it to Emlyn White; he might know what this is.",
    ["你偶然得到一片散发着微光的羽毛。它轻若无物，却蕴含着难以言喻的灵性。\r\n带着它去找埃姆林·怀特，他或许知道这是什么。"] = "You accidentally obtained a feather that emits a faint glow. It is as light as nothing, yet it contains an indescribable spirituality.\nTake it to Emlyn White; he might know what this is.",
    ["你像一只生锈的飞轮，在工厂区的暗巷里嘎吱作响地追逐。每一次过弯都带着金属摩擦的尖叫——不快，但足够让人记住你。"] = "You are like a rusted flywheel, chasing creakily in the dark alleys of the factory area. Every turn carries the scream of metal friction—not fast, but enough to make people remember you.",
    ["你儿子长什么样？"] = "What does your son look like?",
    ["你先上去，我也能借助日记上去！"] = "You go up first, I can also use the diary to go up!",
    ["你先休息会儿，随便看看，也可以再去廷根逛逛。"] = "Rest for a while, look around, or you can go for a walk in Tingen again.",
    ["你先去坐一下吧，我这还有病人。"] = "You go sit for a moment first, I have another patient here.",
    ["你先去忙吧，以后还有很多机会问问题。"] = "Go attend to your business first; there will be plenty of opportunities to ask questions later.",
    ["你先告诉我故事是什么，我考虑一下。"] = "Tell me what the story is first, and I'll consider it.",
    ["你先在廷根适应一段时间，便于我们保护你的安全。"] = "You should adapt in Tingen for a while, which will make it easier for us to protect your safety.",
    ["你先带上它，我以后再和你讲“破晓号”的故事。"] = "You take it first, I'll tell you the story of \"Dawn\" later.",
    ["你先换个地方看吧"] = "You go look somewhere else first",
    ["你先进房间再说。"] = "Go into the room first and then we'll talk.",
    ["你先退战"] = "You withdraw from battle first.",
    ["你关闭了自动播放该频道语音功能"] = "You have disabled the automatic voice playback for this channel.",
    ["你其实是故意说给我听的，对吧？"] = "You were actually saying that for me to hear, weren't you?",
    ["你再不把钥匙还我！我要赶不上回家给爸爸做饭了！"] = "If you don't give me back my key, I'm going to be late to go home and cook for my dad!",
    ["你再去找会计<P_Yellow>奥利安娜太太</>预支四周的薪水，之后每周只领取一半的薪水，直到偿还完。"] = "Go find the accountant, <P_Yellow>Mrs. Orianna</>, to draw an advance of four weeks' salary. Afterward, you will only receive half your salary each week until it is paid off.",
    ["你再次无视灵性预警，触碰了它。理智降低的同时，你似乎听清了来自那棵树的询问：“你是？”"] = "You ignore the Spirituality Warning again and touch it. As your sanity drops, you seem to hear the tree's question clearly: \"Who are you?\"",
    ["你再次遇到报童汤姆，发现罗塞尔大帝的风潮正席卷廷根。你骑车带他到大剧院，围观戏剧节售票活动，了解罗塞尔生平，成功阻止抢票的猎龙帮混混，受邀在罗塞尔画像上签名，并获赠铜镜。你送汤姆去工厂区，发现他的哥哥杰克被解雇后，决定去五月庄园打短工。你返回黑荆棘，在伦纳德引导下喝下序列9魔药，战胜潜意识中的未知存在，成为真正的非凡者。最后你见到弗莱队长，了解知识皇冠失踪案，分析各种线索后三人分头调查。"] = "You meet the newsboy Tom again and discover that the trend of Emperor Roselle is sweeping through Tingen. You take him to the Grand Theater by bike, watch the theater festival ticket sales event, learn about Roselle's life, successfully stop the Dragon Hunter Gang thugs from grabbing tickets, are invited to sign on Roselle's portrait, and are gifted a bronze mirror. You take Tom to the factory district and discover that after his brother Jack was fired, he decided to do odd jobs at May Manor. You return to Blackthorn, drink the Sequence 9 potion under Leonard's guidance, defeat the Unknown Existence in your subconscious, and become a true Beyonder. Finally, you meet Captain Frye, learn about the Knowledge Crown disappearance case, and after analyzing various clues, the three of you split up to investigate.",
    ["你再看看我是谁！"] = "Look at who I am again!",
    ["你再说一遍，这幅肖像收我多少钱？"] = "Say that again, how much are you charging me for this portrait?",
    ["你写了这么多夸张的报道？！"] = "You wrote so many exaggerated reports?!",
    ["你冲刺时穿过的敌人会受到伤害和减速"] = "Enemies you pass through while sprinting will take damage and be slowed.",
    ["你冲刺时穿过的敌人会受到伤害和减速。"] = "Enemies you pass through while sprinting will take damage and be slowed.",
    ["你冲进盥洗室，畅快地进行了一番代谢废物行为。"] = "You rush into the washroom and happily perform a metabolic waste disposal act.",
    ["你冷静一点。"] = "Calm down.",
    ["你几乎是途径的象征本身，每一举动都撼动世界底层结构，具备半神权能。"] = "You are almost the symbol of the pathway itself; every action shakes the underlying structure of the world, and you possess Demigod authority.",
    ["你几乎能感到雪松在嘴里发芽破土，微苦的木香余韵在唇舌之间。"] = "You can almost feel the cedar sprouting and breaking through the soil in your mouth, with a slightly bitter woody aftertaste lingering between your lips and tongue.",
    ["你出发调查失踪案途中，偶遇梦中那对兄妹，追踪途中被“风信子”带人阻拦。在丽贝卡的帮助下，你们成功击退他们，并了解月亮仆从的信息。商议后，你继续调查清洗工卡尔、富商查理和纺织女工珍妮失踪案。但在用占卜寻找珍妮来到中央广场后，却意外看见罗珊瓦解为信息洪流消散。你立即回黑荆棘报告，并与弗莱和伦纳德汇总分析线索，发现失踪案与铜镜和知识皇冠有关。你们三人分头行动，分别前往三个失踪点处理和进一步调查。"] = "On your way to investigate the missing persons case, you encounter that pair of siblings from your dream and are blocked by \"Hyacinth\" and his men while tracking them. With Rebecca's help, you successfully repel them and learn information about the Moon Servant. After discussion, you continue to investigate the missing persons cases of the cleaner Karl, the wealthy merchant Charlie, and the textile worker Jenny. But after using divination to find Jenny and arriving at Central Plaza, you accidentally see Rozanne disintegrate into a Torrent of Information and dissipate. You immediately return to Blackthorn to report, and after summarizing and analyzing the clues with Frye and Leonard, you discover that the missing persons case is related to the bronze mirror and the Knowledge Crown. The three of you split up to go to the three disappearance points to handle the situation and investigate further.",
    ["你击败了%s，获得%s分"] = "You defeated %s and gained %s points",
    ["你击败了<Chat_Red>%s</>。"] = "You defeated <Chat_Red>%s</>.",
    ["你击败了<Chat_Red>未知目标</>。"] = "You defeated the <Chat_Red> unknown target </>.",
    ["你刚刚提到了二楼……"] = "You just mentioned the second floor...",
    ["你刚刚是在做梦吗？一直在说头好痛"] = "Were you dreaming just now? You kept saying your head hurt",
    ["你刚刚说，你是来这里找人？"] = "You just said you came here to look for someone?",
    ["你刚才在想什么？怎么叫也叫不醒？"] = "What were you thinking about just now? I couldn't wake you up no matter how I called.",
    ["你刚才对付的那个“我”就来自外面的力量……祂想要成为我……祂想要降临……祂是……母亲……<P_Heart>（痛苦）</>不，祂不是……"] = "The 'me' you just dealt with came from an external force... It wants to become me... It wants to descend... It is... Mother... <P_Heart>(Pain)</> No, it is not...",
    ["你刚才怎么不说！"] = "Why didn't you say so just now!",
    ["你刚才提到，在梦里你见到了群飞的、唱着奇怪曲调的鸟群吗？"] = "You mentioned earlier that in your dream, you saw flocks of birds flying and singing strange tunes?",
    ["你刚才没发挥好吗，请再表演一次"] = "You didn't perform well just now, please perform again",
    ["你刚才藏在哪里了？"] = "Where were you hiding just now?",
    ["你刚才说，一个房间住六个人？他们都是谁？"] = "You just said, six people live in one room? Who are they all?",
    ["你刚才说，我们都看到了那场婚礼？！"] = "You just said we both saw that wedding?!",
    ["你刚提到还有一个兜帽女子？"] = "You just mentioned there was also a hooded woman?",
    ["你创建了团队"] = "You created a team.",
    ["你创建了队伍"] = "You created a squad.",
    ["你创建的群组数量已达上限。"] = "The number of groups you have created has reached the limit.",
    ["你初见途径的真正面貌，力量与理智的代价并存，已成为影响局势的实体。"] = "You have caught a glimpse of the true face of the pathway, where the costs of power and reason coexist, and you have become an entity that influences the situation.",
    ["你别得意，下次一定是我当选……"] = "Don't get cocky, I'll definitely be the one elected next time...",
    ["你别把本钱输完就好。"] = "Just don't lose all your capital.",
    ["你别看她平时在玫瑰天堂雷厉风行的，<P_Yellow>真喝嗨了可没人拦得住</>。"] = "Don't let her usual efficient and decisive demeanor at Rose Paradise fool you; <P_Yellow>once she's truly drunk, no one can stop her</>.",
    ["你别看我这样，其实我特别能干！上能盖瓦铺墙，下能耕地种花！"] = "Don't look at me like that; I'm actually very capable! I can lay tiles and build walls, and I can plow fields and plant flowers!",
    ["你别管我！我就要嫁给吸血鬼！"] = "Don't you worry about me! I'm going to marry a vampire!",
    ["你别管我！我已经是大人了！"] = "Don't worry about me! I'm already an adult!",
    ["你别误会，我可不是怕打针。"] = "Don't get me wrong, I'm not afraid of injections.",
    ["你别说，这男人也真是厉害，把一个慈悲的修女，逼到要为自己无心的善举后悔终生的地步。"] = "Don't say, this man is truly formidable, forcing a compassionate nun to regret her unintentional good deeds for the rest of her life.",
    ["你别追了，小心闪到腰！"] = "Stop chasing, you'll throw out your back!",
    ["你到底去哪了，我亲爱的奥罗拉……我一定会找到你……"] = "Where did you go, my dear Aurora... I will definitely find you...",
    ["你到底是什么？！"] = "What on earth are you?!",
    ["你到底爱几个人！"] = "How many people do you actually love!",
    ["你前往廷根湖调查，在湖边遇到一对情侣因铜镜消失。市民失踪疑案愈发严重，你决定诵念咒语进入镜中廷根，救出罗珊和失踪市民。在镜中廷根里，你发现部分失踪市民已经异化成怪物，街头充斥着知识洪流与堕落母神的信徒。随后，你在工厂区救下紧守脚踏车的杰克、被知识控制的工厂主查理、女工珍妮，得知罗珊正引导众人逃往廷根大剧院“安全屋”。找到罗珊时她已濒临失控，邓恩、老尼尔、罗珊父亲等亡魂现身，以“我们是值夜者、是可怜虫、更是守护者”的呼唤唤醒了罗珊的理智。在安全屋前，你们遇到了幕后势力五月庄园的“管家”，你拼尽全力击退了管家召唤的“异变狼人”，但在伦纳德和弗莱赶来支援的最后一刻，“管家”戴上了污染的“知识皇冠”，凭借污染的力量逃匿。"] = "You go to Tingen Lake to investigate and meet a couple by the lake who are affected by the disappearance of the bronze mirror. The mysterious missing persons case becomes increasingly serious, and you decide to chant the incantation to enter Tingen in the Mirror to rescue Rozanne and the missing citizens. Inside Tingen in the Mirror, you discover that some of the missing citizens have mutated into monsters, and the streets are filled with the Torrent of Knowledge and followers of the Mother Goddess of Depravity. Subsequently, you save Jack, who is guarding his bicycle in the factory district, the factory owner Charlie, who is controlled by knowledge, and the worker Jenny, and learn that Rozanne is guiding everyone to escape to the \"Safe House\" at the Tingen Grand Theater. When you find Rozanne, she is on the verge of loss of control, and the souls of Dunn, Old Neil, Rozanne's father, and others appear, awakening Rozanne's sanity with the call, \"We are Nighthawks, we are poor wretches, and even more so, we are Guardians.\" In front of the safe house, you encounter the \"Butler\" from the May Manor, the mastermind behind the scenes. You try your best to repel the \"Mutated Werewolf\" summoned by the butler, but at the last moment when Leonard and Frye arrive to support, the \"Butler\" puts on the corrupted \"Knowledge Crown\" and escapes using the power of corruption.",
    ["你前往金秋湖和拉姆德古堡的结果在我的占卜里都不算好。爱人还是要一心一意，对您和那两位姑娘都好。"] = "The results of your trip to Golden Autumn Lake and Lamud Castle are not good in my divination. Love should be single-minded; it's better for you and those two young ladies.",
    ["你加入了团队"] = "You joined a team.",
    ["你加入了队伍"] = "You joined a squad.",
    ["你动一动试试！"] = "Try moving!",
    ["你即将扮演"] = "You are about to act as",
    ["你即将骑车载报童前往下一任务地点，体会廷根街市的风土人情，<P_Yellow>耗时约1-2分钟</>。是否选择快速前往？（选择不影响任务奖励的获取）"] = "You are about to ride your bike to take the newsboy to the next quest location to experience the local customs of Tingen's streets, <P_Yellow> taking about 1-2 minutes </>. Do you want to fast travel? (Choosing to do so will not affect the acquisition of quest rewards)",
    ["你即将骑车载报童前往下一任务地点，体会廷根街市的风土人情，耗时约1-2分钟。\n是否选择快速前往？"] = "You are about to ride your bike to take the newsboy to the next quest location, experiencing the local customs of Tingen's streets, which will take about 1-2 minutes.\n Do you want to choose to travel quickly?",
    ["你却知道得这么清楚，你果然不是普通的非凡者。"] = "You know so much about it; you're certainly no ordinary Beyonder.",
    ["你去了吗？"] = "Did you go?",
    ["你去哪？"] = "Where are you going?",
    ["你去廷根大剧院，那里有一面镜子，镜子后面是安全屋。"] = "Go to the Tingen Grand Theater, there is a mirror there, and behind the mirror is the Safe House.",
    ["你去老尼尔那里的时候，记得领取一些猎魔子弹。"] = "When you go to Old Neil's place, remember to collect some Demon Hunter Bullets.",
    ["你去过廷根湖！那里有好多警察，我们都不敢再靠近了，你是怎么知道这些的？"] = "You've been to Tingen Lake! There are so many police there, we don't dare to go near it anymore. How did you know about this?",
    ["你去那个棺材里的尸体上找找，那是我们的卧底，刚归队就死了，他身上应该有线索。"] = "Go check the corpse in that coffin. That was our undercover agent. He died just as he was returning to the team. He should have clues on him.",
    ["你参与击败%s，获得%s分"] = "You participated in defeating %s and gained %s points",
    ["你又再次回到了混乱之地。"] = "You have returned to the Land of Chaos once again.",
    ["你又受伤了？"] = "Are you hurt again?",
    ["你又向他们询问了一些信息，并记录在调查档案上。"] = "You asked them for some more information and recorded it in the investigation file.",
    ["你又在找那些不着边际的魔法书了，我们下周还有蒸汽机原理的考试要复习呢。"] = "You're looking for those far-fetched magic books again. We still have an exam on the principles of steam engines to review for next week.",
    ["你又忘了什么，在这里摇来晃去惹人烦？"] = "What did you forget again, swaying around here and annoying people?",
    ["你又迟到了。"] = "You're late again.",
    ["你及时送上的“最后一抱”成功的解决了危机！"] = "The \"last hug\" you delivered in time successfully resolved the crisis!",
    ["你发现了吗？金秋小镇的葡萄长得飞快，简直像蒸汽机塞了涡轮一样！"] = "Have you noticed? The grapes in Golden Autumn Town are growing fast, almost like a steam engine with a turbocharger!",
    ["你发起了%s匹配"] = "You initiated %s matchmaking.",
    ["你发送的邀请数量太多啦，稍后再邀请吧"] = "You have sent too many invitations; try again later.",
    ["你叔叔出事了！"] = "Something happened to your uncle!",
    ["你取消了语音发送"] = "You canceled the voice message.",
    ["你受伤了？"] = "Are you injured?",
    ["你受到失控的精神污染，我需要布置仪式为你清除。"] = "You have been subjected to mental corruption from losing control; I need to set up a ritual to cleanse you.",
    ["你受托为“月亮”先生送一本新书，刚抵达金秋湖，就撞见少女为痴迷“吸血鬼”与母亲激烈争执——当地已接连出现“德古拉的新娘”命案。你在墓地找到“月亮”先生，他当场揭穿真相：所谓吸血鬼不过是遭魔药污染的人类怪物，正用爱情小说蛊惑少女赴死，真凶就藏在墓地的棺材里。你击败凶手后，“月亮”先生继续追查“丰饶污染”，只留下你一个人应付那位狂热追随者。"] = "You are entrusted with delivering a new book to Mr. Moon. Upon arriving at Golden Autumn Lake, you stumble upon a young girl in a heated argument with her mother over her obsession with 'vampires'—as a series of 'Dracula's Bride' murders have occurred locally. You find Mr. Moon at the cemetery, where he immediately reveals the truth: the so-called vampires are merely human monsters corrupted by potions, using romance novels to lure girls to their deaths. The real culprit is hiding in a coffin in the cemetery. After you defeat the murderer, Mr. Moon continues his pursuit of the 'Abundance Corruption', leaving you alone to deal with the fanatical follower.",
    ["你变脸的速度可真快。"] = "You change your expression really fast.",
    ["你只把他当弟弟？"] = "You only see him as a younger brother?",
    ["你只是治脱发！管那么多呢！"] = "You're just treating hair loss! Why care so much?",
    ["你只是被骗了"] = "You were just deceived",
    ["你只有空次机会"] = "You only have empty opportunities",
    ["你只需要停下来，仔细想一想，就能想起我的指引。"] = "You just need to stop, think carefully, and you will be able to remember my guidance.",
    ["你只需要花一点点的金钱，我就能帮你调查想要知道的事。"] = "You only need to spend a little money, and I can help you investigate what you want to know.",
    ["你叫什么名字呢？要不叫你……小布丁？"] = "What's your name? How about I call you... Little Pudding?",
    ["你叫什么名字？"] = "What is your name?",
    ["你叫什么？"] = "What is your name?",
    ["你叫啊，你叫破喉咙也没有警官会理会一个票贩子！"] = "Go ahead and scream. No officer will care about a ticket scalper!",
    ["你叫我国王？"] = "You called me King?",
    ["你叫珍妮？为什么需要一根火柴？"] = "Your name is Jenny? Why do you need a match?",
    ["你可以一边享受音乐，一边品尝面包，就像那些贵族小孩一样。"] = "You can enjoy Music while tasting Bread, just like those noble children.",
    ["你可以伪装成任何人，但只能是自己。"] = "You can disguise yourself as anyone, but you can only be yourself.",
    ["你可以先去老维尔餐厅，想办法将他们带来。"] = "You can go to Old Will's Restaurant first and find a way to bring them here.",
    ["你可以再抽一张塔罗牌，占卜一下如何解决危机。"] = "You can draw another Tarot card to divine how to resolve the crisis.",
    ["你可以去找瑞安娜，她是一位很有名的占卜师，就在白水晶房。"] = "You can go find Riana; she is a very famous diviner, right in the White Crystal Room.",
    ["你可以去文献室，查阅3级封印物的资料。"] = "You can go to the archives room and look up the information on Grade 3 Sealed Artifacts.",
    ["你可以去看看。"] = "You can go and take a look.",
    ["你可以去香槟街的“廷根市帮助家庭仆人协会”登记，他们会定期组织基本培训，帮助你找到合适的工作。"] = "You can go to the 'Tingen City Association for Helping Domestic Servants' on Champagne Street to register. They organize basic training regularly to help you find a suitable job.",
    ["你可以在我的棚子里看看。出了什么事吗？"] = "You can take a look in my shed. What happened?",
    ["你可以慢慢来，先把眼前的学业搞定，之后再考虑找工作的事情。路都是一步一步走出来的。"] = "You can take it slow, finish your studies first, and then consider finding a job. The path is walked one step at a time.",
    ["你可以押注哪只狗是优秀的“猎手”，甚至可以押注它们能抓到几只！"] = "You can bet on which dog is the best 'hunter', or even bet on how many they can catch!",
    ["你可以指责曾经的我是个骗子，但如今我可是如假包换的占卜家，就连那个最顽固的唯物主义者都拜倒在我的星盘下！"] = "You can accuse the former me of being a liar, but now I am a genuine Seer; even the most stubborn materialist has bowed down before my astrolabe!",
    ["你可以理解为更擅长“看”的人。"] = "You can understand it as someone who is better at \"seeing\".",
    ["你可以理解为，在梦境中活动的能力。"] = "You can understand it as the ability to act within dreams.",
    ["你可以的，童话的结局，主角总能战胜困难，不是吗？"] = "You can. In the ending of a fairy tale, the protagonist can always overcome difficulties, can't they?",
    ["你可以考虑加入我们，成为文职人员。如果有危险的征兆，我们也能够及时发现。"] = "You can consider joining us as a civilian staff member. If there are signs of danger, we can discover them in time.",
    ["你可以试试巴贝特副教授的古典音乐史。她从来不点名，只要期末参加考试就行。"] = "You can try Associate Professor Babette's History of Classical Music. She never takes attendance, you just need to take the exam at the end of the term.",
    ["你可以这么理解。之前的经历可能让你对这些东西变得敏感。"] = "You could understand it that way. Your previous experiences might have made you sensitive to these things.",
    ["你可以通过我的意识探索空间、回收碎片。"] = "You can explore the space and recover the fragments through my consciousness.",
    ["你可以随心所欲，走走停停，逗弄一下奇形怪状的无害生物，看它们在原地打转。"] = "You can do as you please, walking and stopping, teasing strange and harmless creatures, and watching them spin in circles.",
    ["你可创建的群组数量已达上限。"] = "The number of groups you can create has reached the limit.",
    ["你可别问我。我就是个在车站卖熏鱼的，那些事一概不知道。"] = "Don't ask me. I'm just someone selling smoked fish at the station; I don't know anything about those matters.",
    ["你可找对地方了，铁十字街的街坊很多都是在我这做的衣服，我的裁缝手艺很不错的！"] = "You've come to the right place. Many of the neighbors on Iron Cross Street have their clothes made by me; my tailoring skills are quite excellent!",
    ["你可是拿过罗塞尔文学奖的剧作家啊！"] = "But you're a playwright who has won the Roselle Literary Prize!",
    ["你可真<P_Yellow>幽默</>，买报纸要找鸽子？"] = "You are truly <P_Yellow>humorous</>, looking for a pigeon to buy a newspaper?",
    ["你可真目标远大，去看看这两个地方哪个更大吗？"] = "You certainly have high ambitions. Want to see which of those two places is bigger?",
    ["你可能有很多疑问，刚好现在是休息时间。"] = "You probably have many questions. It just so happens to be break time now.",
    ["你可能还有很多疑问，上车再说吧，马车等我们很久了。"] = "You probably still have many questions. Let's talk on the carriage; it's been waiting for us for a long time.",
    ["你可问对了人了，我家世代都从事传统草药行业。有病没病，人们喝点草药合剂总是没问题的。"] = "You've asked the right person. My family has been in the traditional herb industry for generations. Whether sick or not, people drinking some herbal concoctions is always fine.",
    ["你同时将获得见习督察的身份，在某些时候，这会非常管用。"] = "You will also receive the status of a probationary inspector, which will be very useful at times.",
    ["你向%s赠送了一个礼物~"] = "You sent a gift to %s~",
    ["你向弗莱队长说明情况，并让杰德接受了净化。"] = "You explained the situation to Captain Frye and had Jade undergo purification.",
    ["你向教会揭发了那位主教？"] = "You exposed that bishop to the church?",
    ["你向谢尔敏说明了饮料令人腹泻的情况。"] = "You explain the diarrhea-inducing situation of the drink to Shermin.",
    ["你听不见妈妈的声音吗？明明就在这里，她不会骗我的……"] = "Can't you hear Mom's voice? She's clearly right here, she wouldn't lie to me...",
    ["你听到了“伟大母亲”的呼唤！"] = "You have heard the call of the 'Great Mother'!",
    ["你听到了什么？"] = "What did you hear?",
    ["你听到什么了？我告诉你根本没有这回事！"] = "What did you hear? I'm telling you, there's no such thing!",
    ["你听她提起过我？那一定不是什么好话。"] = "You heard her mention me? That must not have been anything good.",
    ["你听见一声惨叫从车间外传来，转身看去，那只怪物奄奄一息地向你爬来，眼中满是哀求。"] = "You hear a scream coming from outside the workshop. Turning to look, you see the monster crawling toward you, dying, its eyes filled with pleading.",
    ["你听见病人的惨叫声了吗？这家诊所很不对劲。"] = "Did you hear the patient's screams? This clinic is very wrong.",
    ["你听说了么，山姆因天降巨额遗产而欣喜发狂！你听说了么，梅兰妮的情敌就是好姐妹斯嘉丽！你听说了么，房东先生有了秘密情人！你听说了么……咳咳，这样不好，不好，得去告解室洗涤一下灵魂。但为什么在告解室里，那些隐藏的秘密又出现了？欺骗、嫉妒、贪婪、死亡，无穷的欲望，无限变化的人心……一个小小的告解室居然这么多东西，怪不得它看起来摇摇欲坠，唔……那它是不是也需要一场告解呢？"] = "Have you heard? Sam went mad with joy over a massive inheritance! Have you heard? Melanie's rival in love is her good sister Scarlett! Have you heard? The landlord has a secret lover! Have you heard... Ahem, this is not good, not good; you must go to the confessional to cleanse your soul. But why do those hidden secrets appear inside the confessional? Deception, jealousy, greed, death, endless desires, the infinitely changing human heart... A tiny confessional holds so much; no wonder it looks like it's about to collapse. Hmm... does it need a confession of its own?",
    ["你听说了吗？有人说那边的稻草人会扭来扭去，喏，就在那儿。"] = "Have you heard? Some people say that the scarecrow over there twists and turns, look, right there.",
    ["你听说了吗？铁十字街最近那个新来的女人。"] = "Have you heard? That new woman on Iron Cross Street recently.",
    ["你听起来很会说话，但这里，光会说话可不够。"] = "You sound like you have a silver tongue, but here, just being able to talk isn't enough.",
    ["你听过罗塞尔写的诗歌吗？“爱情是一只自由鸟，任谁都无法驯服。”"] = "Have you heard the poem written by Roselle? 'Love is a free bird, no one can tame it.'",
    ["你听，呜——"] = "Listen, woo—",
    ["你告诉我，你是不是和克莱拉好上了！"] = "Tell me, did you hook up with Clara!",
    ["你呢，也许能从你进来的地方出去？"] = "What about you? Perhaps you can leave from where you came in?",
    ["你呢？既赶走了我的客人，又在搭讪落单的女孩，你怎么证明你跟刚才的人不一样。"] = "What about you? You drove away my customer and are now hitting on a lone girl. How can you prove you're any different from that person just now?",
    ["你呢？有什么烦心事吗？"] = "How about you? Do you have any troubles?",
    ["你呢？看起来也不像是来寻欢作乐的。"] = "What about you? You don't look like you're here to seek pleasure either.",
    ["你和%s聊得很开心，但快乐的时光总是短暂的"] = "You had a great time chatting with %s, but happy times are always short-lived",
    ["你和他们一样愚笨。始终只看见了凶手，却没看见我。"] = "You are just as foolish as they are. You have always only seen the murderer, but never me.",
    ["你和你旁边的人是双胞胎？"] = "Are you and the person next to you twins?",
    ["你和你父亲……办公室里，是有什么误会吗？"] = "Is there some misunderstanding between you and your father... in the office?",
    ["你和内维尔、马丁之间有矛盾？"] = "Do you have a conflict with Neville and Martin?",
    ["你和凯娜采取了一些行动。</n>\n第二日，你准备以【侠盗黑皇帝】的身份，前往海岸线餐厅。"] = "You and Kena took some actions. </n>\n The next day, you prepared to go to the Coastline Restaurant as the 'Phantom Thief Black Emperor'.",
    ["你和崔佛按照调查线索，追查到一处教堂，发现崔佛的上司菲尔守在门口，而他的“主人”正在完成最终的晋升仪式……"] = "Following the clues, you and Trevor tracked down a cathedral and found Trevor's superior, Phil, guarding the door, while his \"Master\" is completing the final advancement ritual...",
    ["你和我都清楚，这和章鱼产地关系不大，是处理肉的方式有问题。"] = "You and I both know that it has little to do with the origin of the octopus, there's a problem with the way the meat is handled.",
    ["你和清醒了的罗珊一起将昏睡过去的安多扶到一旁的沙发上。"] = "Together with a now-sober Rozanne, you help the sleeping Ando onto the sofa nearby.",
    ["你和班森都还没成家，现在家里每便士的开支都得做好计划。"] = "You and Benson are not married yet, and every penny of the family's expenses must be planned.",
    ["你和约翰先生认识？"] = "Do you know Mr. John?",
    ["你和莱丝莉相处得怎么样？"] = "How are you getting along with Lesley?",
    ["你和蒙特利不一样"] = "You are different from Monterey",
    ["你和邓恩"] = "You and Dunn",
    ["你和那本安提哥努斯家族的笔记似乎有着某种宿命的羁绊，这样都能遇上。"] = "You and that Antigonus Family notebook seem to have some sort of fated connection to have encountered each other like this.",
    ["你咒骂的老女人，不会是你的妻子吧？"] = "The old woman you're cursing, wouldn't that be your wife?",
    ["你品尝咖啡，奥黛丽介绍所在地：廷根市。"] = "You taste the coffee, and Audrey introduces the location: Tingen City.",
    ["你喊是没用的，还是去餐厅拿杯水给他吧。"] = "It's useless to shout; you'd better go to the dining room and get him a glass of water.",
    ["你喊是没用的，还是浇醒他吧。"] = "It's useless to shout at him, better splash some water to wake him up.",
    ["你喜欢卖高价票是吗？"] = "You like selling overpriced tickets, do you?",
    ["你喜欢历史吗？"] = "Do you like history?",
    ["你喜欢她？"] = "Do you like her?",
    ["你喜欢臭臭的东西？"] = "Do you like smelly things?",
    ["你喜欢花吗，小狗？"] = "Do you like flowers, little dog?",
    ["你喜欢雏菊，丽埃娜？"] = "Do you like daisies, Liana?",
    ["你喝了不少"] = "You've had quite a lot to drink",
    ["你喝醉了，这样很危险！还是下来吧。"] = "You're drunk, this is very dangerous! Come down.",
    ["你嘴上说着自己失去了最基本的情绪，你的欲望却是如此强烈。"] = "You claim to have lost your most basic emotions, yet your desires are so intense.",
    ["你嘴真甜。"] = "You have a sweet tongue.",
    ["你回来了……"] = "You're back...",
    ["你回来了……事情怎么样了？"] = "You're back... How did things go?",
    ["你回来了。污染清除了？"] = "You're back. Is the corruption cleared?",
    ["你回来了！<P_Heart>（紧张）</>结果怎么样？"] = "You're back! <P_Heart>(Nervous)</> What's the result?",
    ["你回来了！太好了！"] = "You're back! That's great!",
    ["你回来了！队长说他们在查尼斯门前等你！"] = "You're back! The captain said they are waiting for you in front of the Chanis Gate!",
    ["你回来了，伦纳德？"] = "You're back, Leonard?",
    ["你回来了，克莱恩。"] = "You're back, Klein.",
    ["你回来了？找到那个骗子了吗？"] = "You're back? Did you find that fraud?",
    ["你回来了？调查得怎么样？"] = "You're back? How did the investigation go?",
    ["你困在封印物里了？"] = "Are you trapped in the Sealed Artifact?",
    ["你在乱讲什么？！"] = "What are you talking about?!",
    ["你在做什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你在做擦鞋的工作？"] = "Are you working as a shoeshiner?",
    ["你在偷东西！！！"] = "You are stealing!!!",
    ["你在写什么"] = "What are you writing?",
    ["你在剧院的长椅上捡到罗塞尔写下的《美女与野兽》，这是一本能自主写作的神奇物品，它向你发起挑战，看看你是否能像罗塞尔一样，写出足以流传后世的精彩故事。你灵感大发，大胆改编《美女与野兽》，导演出了更吸引眼球的《魔女与野兽》！"] = "You picked up \"Beauty and the Beast\" written by Roselle on a bench in the theater. This is a mystical item capable of autonomous writing. It challenges you to see if you can write a brilliant story that will be passed down to future generations, just like Roselle. You are struck by inspiration and boldly adapt \"Beauty and the Beast,\" directing an even more eye-catching \"Witch and the Beast\"!",
    ["你在发什么呆？所以你果然忘记今天是什么日子了，对吗？"] = "What are you spacing out for? So you really did forget what day it is, didn't you?",
    ["你在叫我？"] = "Are you calling me?",
    ["你在吸收养分？"] = "Are you absorbing nutrients?",
    ["你在命运咖啡厅被“正义”小姐唤醒，看到窗外城市的生活图景，获知“愚者”先生的尊名后，踏入现实中的廷根市，苏茜将“正义”小姐馈赠的零花钱送给你。你通过汤姆购买报纸，了解时事，在“魔术师”女士帮助下开启旅行尖碑，但在追踪梦中男子时，遭遇邪神信徒围攻。幸好“星星”先生及时救场，并将一枚源于“愚者”先生的金币送给你。你们回到黑荆棘安保公司，在罗珊协助下，你签署合同成为正式员工，获赠入职大礼包，并拥有一辆脚踏车。"] = "You are awakened by Miss \"Justice\" at the Fate Café, see the life scenes of the city outside the window, and after learning the honorific name of Mr. Fool, you step into the real Tingen City, where Xio sends you the pocket money gifted by Miss \"Justice.\" You buy a newspaper through Tom to learn about current events, and with the help of Miss \"Magician,\" you open the travel stele, but while tracking the man from your dream, you are besieged by followers of the evil god. Fortunately, Mr. \"Star\" saves the day and gives you a gold coin originating from Mr. Fool. You return to Blackthorn Security Company, and with Rozanne's assistance, you sign a contract to become a formal employee, receive an onboarding gift package, and get a bicycle.",
    ["你在和谁说话？"] = "Who are you talking to?",
    ["你在哪里搞到的？他们的航线图怎么会落到你手上？是真的吗？"] = "Where did you get that? How could their route map fall into your hands? Is it true?",
    ["你在哪？"] = "Where are you?",
    ["你在大学城捡到了愚者教会福音宣传，有些好奇，于是深夜寻访奇迹邮筒，结果发现有无数学生真的在拜邮筒，并且真的发生了奇迹。到最后才得知，一切的一切都是因为愚者教会的神使需要资料来完成论文……长夜漫漫，旧的论文终于结束了，但新的论文又要开始了，神使大人……真的能写完吗？"] = "You pick up a gospel pamphlet for the Church of the Fool in the University District and, out of curiosity, visit the Miracle Mailbox late at night. You discover that countless students are truly praying to the mailbox, and miracles are actually happening. In the end, you learn that everything is because the emissary of the Church of the Fool needs data to finish a thesis... The night is long, the old thesis is finally finished, but a new one is about to begin. Can the emissary... really finish it?",
    ["你在学写字？"] = "Are you learning to write?",
    ["你在害怕什么？"] = "What are you afraid of?",
    ["你在害怕吗？"] = "Are you afraid?",
    ["你在小黛西的循环空间中，都看到了什么？"] = "What did you see in Little Daisy's loop space?",
    ["你在干什么"] = "What are you doing",
    ["你在干什么！"] = "What are you doing!",
    ["你在干什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你在干嘛"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你在廷根图书馆遇到一本附着残影的旧书，被引到金秋湖，遇见被“最后一页”呓语折磨四十年的老人马洛。他帮老师带选择了真理的同门进了知识的深处，而自己选了生命——他一直觉得这是懦弱。你随他进入“知识领域”，亲历了三个求知者的终局：植物学家用余生换了看尽所有叶子的机会，数学家用三十八年的生命换来猜想的终点，导师陪学生走进了光里——他们看见真理的瞬间停止了呼吸，但嘴角都挂着满足的弧度。他们不是被知识杀死的，是甘愿用命换一个见证真理的机会。马洛在金秋湖的树下把守知派毕生的知识交给了你，带着他懦弱但幸福的一生，走向了最后的宁静。"] = "You encounter an old book with a lingering shadow in the Tingen Library and are led to Golden Autumn Lake, where you meet Marlow, an old man tormented by the whispers of the 'Last Page' for forty years. He helped his teacher's fellow students who chose truth enter the depths of knowledge, while he chose life—he always felt this was cowardice. You follow him into the 'Domain of Knowledge' and witness the end of three seekers: the botanist traded the rest of his life for the chance to see every leaf, the mathematician traded thirty-eight years of life for the end of a conjecture, and the mentor walked into the light with his student—they stopped breathing the moment they saw the truth, but their mouths were curled in satisfaction. They were not killed by knowledge; they were willing to trade their lives for a chance to witness the truth. Under the tree at Golden Autumn Lake, Marlow hands you the lifelong knowledge of the Knowers, and with his cowardly but happy life, he walks toward the final peace.",
    ["你在廷根的集体意识中失去了形态，意识正在退回现实..."] = "You lost form within Tingen's collective consciousness. Your consciousness is returning to reality...",
    ["你在廷根的集体潜意识中失去了形态，意识正在退回现实……"] = "You have lost your form in Tingen's collective subconscious, and your consciousness is retreating to reality...",
    ["你在廷根街头遇到又被猎龙帮欺负的泰瑞，决心为他伸张正义。教训了混混后，你意外得知他们正筹备一场荒唐的“猎龙行动”——这是瑞尔·比伯创建猎龙帮时的宏大理想，被他的好兄弟凯文坚决继承。当然，在真正的巨龙面前，渺小的猎龙帮还是太渺小了。不过那又如何，他们仍有理想，他们仍在坚持，他们依旧能重新开始——在恶龙酒吧通过吹嘘不存在的“勇者斗恶龙”招揽帮众……"] = "You meet Terry on the streets of Tingen, who is being bullied by the Dragon Hunter Gang again, and decide to seek justice for him. After teaching the thugs a lesson, you accidentally learn that they are preparing for an absurd 'Dragon Hunting Operation'—this was the grand ideal of Ray Bieber when he founded the Dragon Hunter Gang, which his good brother Kevin is determined to inherit. Of course, in front of a real giant dragon, the tiny Dragon Hunter Gang is still too tiny. But so what? They still have ideals, they are still persisting, and they can still start over—by bragging about non-existent 'Hero Slaying Dragons' at the Evil Dragon Bar to recruit gang members...",
    ["你在恍惚中潜入花海之湖底，这里竟藏着两个名为“秩序”与“混乱”的世界……"] = "In a trance, you dive into the bottom of the Lake of Flower Sea, where two worlds named \"Order\" and \"Chaos\" are hidden...",
    ["你在我这永远是最好看的！"] = "You will always be the most beautiful to me!",
    ["你在房间里待了多久？"] = "How long have you been in the room?",
    ["你在找什么？"] = "What are you looking for?",
    ["你在找夜莺？"] = "Are you looking for the Nightingale?",
    ["你在找我？"] = "Are you looking for me?",
    ["你在找神父爷爷吗？他不在这里。这里只有我，一直是我在跟你说话……"] = "Are you looking for Father? He's not here. There's only me; it's always been me talking to you...",
    ["你在拉姆德小镇找到一间充满灵异秘术的屋子，里面竟是一个凶案现场……"] = "You found a house full of mysticism in Ramd Small Town, and it turned out to be a crime scene...",
    ["你在摆摊中关注商品的数量已达到上限。"] = "You have reached the maximum number of items you can follow at the stall.",
    ["你在摆摊中出售的<Reminder_Orange>%d</>个%s已售出，共获得<Reminder_Orange>%d</>苏勒请在摆摊[出售]界面点击[交易提款]提取苏勒。"] = "The <Reminder_Orange> %d </> units of %s you were selling at the stall have been sold, for a total of <Reminder_Orange> %d </> Sol. Please go to the [Sell] interface of the stall and click [Withdraw] to collect your Sol.",
    ["你在摆摊中出售的<Reminder_Orange>%s</>审核期已结束，共获得<Reminder_Orange>%d</>苏勒。请在摆摊[出售]界面点击[交易提款]提取苏勒。"] = "The review period for the <Reminder_Orange> %s </> you were selling at the stall has ended. You have received a total of <Reminder_Orange> %d </> Sol. Please go to the [Sell] interface of the stall and click [Withdraw] to collect your Sol.",
    ["你在摆摊中出售的<Reminder_Orange>%s</>已售出，审核期为<Reminder_Orange>%d</>小时，审核通过后可获得<Reminder_Orange>%d</>苏勒。"] = "The <Reminder_Orange> %s </> you were selling at the stall has been sold. The review period is <Reminder_Orange> %d </> hours. Once approved, you will receive <Reminder_Orange> %d </> Sol.",
    ["你在摆摊中的上架功能已被冻结，如有疑问请询问系统管理员。"] = "Your listing function at the stall has been frozen. If you have any questions, please ask the system administrator.",
    ["你在摆摊中的提款功能已被冻结，如有疑问请询问系统管理员。"] = "Your withdrawal function at the stall has been frozen. If you have any questions, please ask the system administrator.",
    ["你在摆摊中的购买功能已被冻结，如有疑问请询问系统管理员。"] = "Your purchasing function at the stall has been frozen. If you have any questions, please ask the system administrator.",
    ["你在收老鼠？收老鼠干什么？"] = "You're collecting rats? What for?",
    ["你在本次【疯抢之夜】中获得第五名，下局试试调整策略，再创佳绩！"] = "You won fifth place in this 【Night of Frenzied Grabbing】 challenge. Try adjusting your strategy next time for better results!",
    ["你在本次【疯抢之夜】中获得第六名，下局试试调整策略，再创佳绩！"] = "You won sixth place in this 【Night of Frenzied Grabbing】 challenge. Try adjusting your strategy next time for better results!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第一名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won first place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第三名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won third place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第二名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won second place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第五名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won fifth place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第六名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won sixth place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在本次【逃离监狱】玩法中获得第四名，但很遗憾，没能成功逃离，下局再战！"] = "You won fourth place in this 【Escape from Prison】 challenge, but unfortunately, you failed to escape. Try again next time!",
    ["你在构思什么？小说么？"] = "What are you brainstorming? A novel?",
    ["你在树下醒来，不远处一个小女孩背对着你在玩耍"] = "You wake up under a tree, a little girl not far away is playing with her back to you",
    ["你在煮什么？"] = "What are you cooking?",
    ["你在用学徒的技能跑腿？"] = "Are you using an Apprentice's skill to run errands?",
    ["你在画什么？"] = "What are you drawing?",
    ["你在画什么？<P_Heart>（值夜者还需要会画画？）</>"] = "What are you drawing? <P_Heart>(Nighthawks also need to know how to draw?)</>",
    ["你在看什么呢？"] = "What are you looking at?",
    ["你在看什么？"] = "What are you looking at?",
    ["你在看哪里？镜子才是我。"] = "Where are you looking? The mirror is me.",
    ["你在等人吗？"] = "Are you waiting for someone?",
    ["你在等待英雄登场？"] = "Are you waiting for a hero to appear?",
    ["你在等这位“老爷”？"] = "Are you waiting for this \"Master\"?",
    ["你在箱子里吗？"] = "Are you in the box?",
    ["你在背什么"] = "What are you reciting?",
    ["你在苏珊娜女士家工作？这项链还是三年前我带回廷根，卖给她丈夫的。"] = "You work at Ms. Susanna's house? I brought this necklace back to Tingen three years ago and sold it to her husband.",
    ["你在说什么！什么牺牲！该死，清醒一点！这里发生了什么！"] = "What are you talking about! What sacrifices! Damn it, wake up! What happened here!",
    ["你在说啥？"] = "What are you talking about?",
    ["你在这里住的怎么样？"] = "How are you living here?",
    ["你在这里做什么呢？"] = "What are you doing here?",
    ["你在这里做什么？"] = "What are you doing here?",
    ["你在这里干什么？"] = "What are you doing here?",
    ["你在这里教课？"] = "You teach lessons here?",
    ["你在这里站着做什么呢？"] = "What are you standing here for?",
    ["你在这里躺着，我以为你生病了，看起来你只是睡着了。"] = "You were lying here, and I thought you were sick, but it looks like you were just asleep.",
    ["你在铁十字街试餐活动中偶遇罗珊，一同品尝各店新菜。绯月派造型惊悚、罗勒牛尾汤清新美味，老维尔餐厅却记得每位值夜者的口味——弗莱少吃莴笋、伦纳德不吃花椰菜、邓恩爱黑胡椒、克莱恩偏好甜食。罗珊在香草白酱煎肉中怀念故人，感慨有些东西无法替代。"] = "You run into Rozanne during a food-tasting event on Iron Cross Street and taste new dishes from various shops together. The Crimson Moon style is terrifying, the basil oxtail soup is fresh and delicious, but Old Will's restaurant remembers the tastes of every Nighthawk—Frye eats less lettuce, Leonard doesn't eat broccoli, Dunn loves black pepper, and Klein prefers sweets. Rozanne misses old friends while eating the herb white sauce fried meat, sighing that some things cannot be replaced.",
    ["你在附近看到梅了吗？"] = "Have you seen May nearby?",
    ["你在雪山深处听见微弱的呼救声。一个名叫布雷登的年轻士兵求你救救被困的战友——他们和大部队走散，缺衣少食，已经撑不了多久。你带着他寻找物资、追踪营地，却发现事情逐渐变得古怪——积雪厚得不正常，营地的物品破败不堪。真相浮出水面——布雷登原是漂泊雪原数年的灵，只为寻找解救战友的办法。记忆的碎片一段段苏醒，他忆起战友们鲜活的面容，可战争早已结束，他怔在原地：为何而死，又为何而等？执念终了，他如风雪般消散。愿神的国度里，他们能真正重逢。"] = "You hear a faint cry for help deep in the snowy mountains. A young soldier named Braden begs you to save his trapped comrades—they were separated from the main force, lacking food and clothing, and cannot hold on much longer. You take him to find supplies and track the camp, but things gradually become strange—the snow is abnormally thick, and the items in the camp are dilapidated. The truth surfaces—Braden was originally a spirit who had been wandering the snowy plains for years, just to find a way to save his comrades. Fragments of memory awaken one by one, and he recalls the vivid faces of his comrades, but the war has long ended. He stands there, stunned: why did he die, and why did he wait? The obsession ends, and he dissipates like the wind and snow. May they truly reunite in the kingdom of God.",
    ["你在霍纳奇斯花海散步时，一束鲜花从天而降。你循声找到了计划狂埃德温，他在热气球上向女友海蒂求婚，却被当场拒绝。为寻找他丢失的珍贵戒指，你们遇见了一对弄丢结婚戒指却毫不在意的老夫妻——埃德温划分五十个搜索网格寻找戒指，而老夫妻连戒指什么时候丢的都忘了。埃德温当场崩溃时，却发现一个从始至终藏在他口袋里的秘密……这一天，他所有的计划都被意外打破。也正是这些意外让他明白了，人生不按计划走又怎样？日子还得过，花海依然美。"] = "While walking in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a bouquet of flowers falls from the sky. Following the sound, you find the control freak Edwin, who is proposing to his girlfriend Heidi in a hot air balloon, only to be rejected on the spot. To find his lost precious ring, you meet an elderly couple who lost their wedding rings but don't care at all—Edwin divides fifty search grids to find his ring, while the old couple has even forgotten when they lost theirs. Just as Edwin breaks down, he discovers a secret that had been hidden in his pocket all along... On this day, all his plans were ruined by accidents. It is precisely these accidents that make him understand: what if life doesn't go according to plan? Life goes on, and the sea of flowers remains beautiful.",
    ["你在黑荆棘安保公司打扫卫生时，发现角落里的一个礼物盒。打开后，灰雾将你拉入历史孔隙。你先后进入邓恩与戴莉的视角：邓恩在生日当天被队员们吵醒，外出看望前队长卡萝的儿子阿诺德，发现阿诺德与神秘人接触，用梦境能力救下他并带回公司；戴莉奉命回收封印物“夜莺银哨”，发现其中残留着前队长卡萝的意识。卡萝希望找到自己的执念，戴莉带着她的灵体在廷根游历，偶遇邓恩。两人决定合作调查儿童失踪案。"] = "While cleaning at Blackthorn Security Company, you find a gift box in the corner. After opening it, the gray fog pulls you into a gap in history. You enter the perspectives of Dunn and Daly in succession: Dunn is woken up by his team members on his birthday and goes out to visit Arnold, the son of former captain Daly, discovering that Arnold is in contact with a mysterious person. He uses his dream ability to save him and brings him back to the company. Daly is ordered to recover the Sealed Artifact \"Nightingale Silver Whistle\" and discovers the consciousness of former captain Daly lingering within. Daly hopes to find her obsession, so she takes her spirit body to travel through Tingen, where she happens to meet Dunn. The two decide to cooperate to investigate the child abduction case.",
    ["你在黛西小姐的循环空间中，都看到了什么？"] = "What did you see in Miss Daisy's loop space?",
    ["你坐的是我的位置，小姐，这儿视线可是最好的。"] = "You're sitting in my seat, miss. This place has the best view.",
    ["你处理得很好，在恶灵还没有完全附身前举行了中断仪式。"] = "You handled it well, performing the interrupted ritual before the evil spirit could fully possess her.",
    ["你复习得怎么样了？"] = "How is your review going?",
    ["你多大了？"] = "How old are you?",
    ["你大概能在墓园里看到自己死后的情景，可能被人惦记，也可能被人谩骂，当然更多的是被人遗忘。"] = "You can probably see what happens after you die in the cemetery. You might be missed by others, or you might be cursed, but of course, most are forgotten.",
    ["你大醉了一场。"] = "You got very drunk.",
    ["你太吵了"] = "You're too noisy",
    ["你太急了。“看见我”的副作用是丢失记忆。阿尔伯特每用一次，记忆就少一分。但他对战友的执念太深，即使忘记一切，依然记得要那块地。"] = "You were too impatient. The side effect of 'See Me' is memory loss. Every time Albert uses it, his memory diminishes. But his obsession with his comrades is too deep; even if he forgets everything, he still remembers wanting that land.",
    ["你太过清醒，引起了他们的警觉……请重新尝试。"] = "You were too sober, which raised their suspicions... Please try again.",
    ["你太过清醒，引起了怀疑……"] = "You are too sober, which has aroused suspicion...",
    ["你头上连帽子都没有。帽子都没有的人，不会知道鸽子在哪。"] = "You don't even have a hat on your head. People without hats won't know where the pigeons are.",
    ["你好"] = "Hello.",
    ["你好 克莱恩 好久不见"] = "Hello, Klein. Long time no see.",
    ["你好 我是伦纳德·米切尔"] = "Hello, I am Leonard Mitchell.",
    ["你好 我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂"] = "Hello, I am Klein Moretti.",
    ["你好 罗珊小姐"] = "Hello, Miss Rozanne.",
    ["你好 阿霍瓦郡警察部"] = "Hello, Awwa County Police Department",
    ["你好……“焦糖炸弹”是出了什么问题吗？"] = "Hello... is there something wrong with 'Caramel Bomb'?",
    ["你好……？"] = "Hello...?",
    ["你好。"] = "Hello.",
    ["你好像对食物很有研究。"] = "You seem to have a lot of research on food.",
    ["你好像很痛苦？"] = "You seem to be in pain?",
    ["你好先生，我想尝试挑战拳王阿比。"] = "Hello, sir. I would like to try challenging Champion Abi.",
    ["你好呀，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Hello there, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["你好呀，这里是玛丽与天使衣帽店，不过请小心一些，不要吓跑小鸟哦。"] = "Hello there! This is Mary and the Angel's Hat Shop, but please be careful and don't scare the little birds.",
    ["你好啊。都是些学生之间流通的二手货，随便看看吧。"] = "Hello there. These are all second-hand goods circulating among students, feel free to take a look.",
    ["你好啊同志"] = "Hello, comrade.",
    ["你好啊，陌生人，你也是到屋顶来享受片刻安宁的吗？"] = "Hello there, stranger. Are you also here on the roof to enjoy a moment of peace?",
    ["你好点了吗？"] = "Are you feeling any better?",
    ["你好罗珊，这是谁？我们的新人？"] = "Hello Rozanne, who is this? Our newcomer?",
    ["你好！"] = "Hello!",
    ["你好！你中了一辆车！快来领！"] = "Hello! You've won a car! Come and claim it!",
    ["你好！欢迎来到拉姆德小镇！我是亚伦上士，是小镇的巡逻员！"] = "Hello! Welcome to Lamud Town! I am Sergeant Aaron, the town patrolman!",
    ["你好！看你的打扮不是学生吧？"] = "Hello! Looking at your attire, you're not a student, are you?",
    ["你好！霍伊大学赛艇俱乐部，愿意了解一下吗？全廷根最优秀的队员都在这里！"] = "Hello! Hoy University Rowing Club, would you like to learn about it? The best team members in all of Tingen are here!",
    ["你好，{PlayerName}，要来点什么吗？"] = "Hello, {PlayerName}, would you like something?",
    ["你好，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Hello, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["你好，{{先生|女士}}。如你所见，我正在研究关于污水治理的……神奇议案。"] = "Hello, {{Mr.| Ms.}}. As you can see, I am researching a... magical proposal regarding sewage treatment.",
    ["你好，{{先生|女士}}，又见面了"] = "Hello, {{ Mr. | Ms. } }, we meet again.",
    ["你好，{{先生|女士}}，我看见你的脸上洋溢着求知的光芒！"] = "Hello, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, I can see the light of thirst for knowledge shining on your face!",
    ["你好，一张去贝克兰德的船票。"] = "Hello, one ticket to Backlund, please.",
    ["你好，不，你不好，不对……"] = "Hello, no, you are not good, no...",
    ["你好，你在这里徘徊很久了，请问需要帮助吗？"] = "Hello, you've been wandering here for a long time, do you need help?",
    ["你好，你对魔药房有什么问题吗？"] = "Hello, do you have any questions about the potion room?",
    ["你好，你是一朵……蘑菇？"] = "Hello, are you a... mushroom?",
    ["你好，你是在取景吗？"] = "Hello, are you taking pictures?",
    ["你好，你是邓恩叔叔和戴莉姐姐的朋友吗？"] = "Hello, are you a friend of Uncle Dunn and Sister Daly?",
    ["你好，你来祈祷，还是有棘手的污秽需要以光明驱除？"] = "Hello, are you here to pray, or is there some troublesome corruption that needs to be dispelled by the light?",
    ["你好，保罗先生，这是我的证件，找你问点事情。"] = "Hello, Mr. Paul, this is my identification, I'm here to ask you about something.",
    ["你好，俱乐部的伙伴。“歌剧魅影”即将开启，要了解一下吗？"] = "Hello, partner of the Club. The \"Phantom of the Opera\" is about to begin. Would you like to know more?",
    ["你好，先生。我们在排练黑夜颂歌，准备在下次的月亮弥撒上献给女神。"] = "Hello, sir. We are rehearsing the Hymn of the Evernight, preparing to offer it to the Goddess at the next Moon Mass.",
    ["你好，克莱恩。"] = "Hello, Klein.",
    ["你好，刚刚似乎有尖叫从这边传来？"] = "Hello, did a scream just come from this direction?",
    ["你好，发生什么事了吗？"] = "Hello, did something happen?",
    ["你好，大侦探！"] = "Hello, Great Detective!",
    ["你好，女士。"] = "Hello, Madam.",
    ["你好，尊敬的贵客。需要出售物产吗？"] = "Hello, respected guest. Do you need to sell produce?",
    ["你好，小{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Hello, little {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["你好，小家伙。我叫{{PlayerName}}，请问你也认识艾登吗？"] = "Hello, little one. My name is {{PlayerName}}. Do you happen to know Aiden as well?",
    ["你好，小朋友……买一份今天的报纸。"] = "Hello, little kid... I'll buy today's newspaper.",
    ["你好，屋顶上有什么特别的吗？"] = "Hello, is there something special about the roof?",
    ["你好，年轻人，看到你在这里半天，想一起参加讨论吗？"] = "Hello, young man. Seeing you here for a while, would you like to join the discussion?",
    ["你好，店长，是你研发了“焦糖炸弹”吗？"] = "Hello, Shopkeeper, did you develop 'Caramel Bomb'?",
    ["你好，怎么称呼？有什么事要委托？"] = "Hello, how should I address you? What would you like to commission?",
    ["你好，愿女神庇佑你。"] = "Hello, may the Goddess protect you.",
    ["你好，我们想给他买套正装，有什么推荐吗？"] = "Hello, we'd like to buy a formal suit for him. Do you have any recommendations?",
    ["你好，我刚才品尝了“焦糖炸弹”，味道真不错，请问是你自己制作的吗？"] = "Hello, I just tasted 'Caramel Bomb', it tastes quite good. May I ask if you made it yourself?",
    ["你好，我叫克莱恩·莫雷蒂。"] = "Hello, my name is Klein Moretti.",
    ["你好，我想我们之前见过，尤朵拉。"] = "Hello, I think we have met before, Yodora.",
    ["你好，我想要一束百合。"] = "Hello, I want a bouquet of lilies.",
    ["你好，我想要占卜一件事情。"] = "Hello, I would like to have a divination done.",
    ["你好，我想要最新款，最昂贵的戒指。"] = "Hello, I want the newest, most expensive ring.",
    ["你好，我想购买一些高级火腿。"] = "Hello, I'd like to buy some high-quality ham.",
    ["你好，我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，是邓恩·史密斯先生邀请我来的。"] = "Hello, I am Klein Moretti. Mr. Dunn Smith invited me here.",
    ["你好，我是因蒂斯军事学院的。正在做实地考察。"] = "Hello, I'm from the Intis Military Academy. I'm doing field research.",
    ["你好，我是活动的向导，带他们来参加。"] = "Hello, I am the guide for the event, bringing them here to participate.",
    ["你好，我是爱帮忙的乌贼。有问题尽管开口！"] = "Hello, I am the Helpful Squid. Feel free to ask if you have any questions!",
    ["你好，我是警察，这是我的证件。"] = "Hello, I am a police officer. Here is my identification.",
    ["你好，我是邓恩，黑荆棘安保公司的邓恩·史密斯。"] = "Hello, I am Dunn, Dunn Smith from the Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["你好，我是阿霍瓦郡警察厅的警员。关于史蒂芬男爵的案件，我需要了解一些情况。"] = "Hello, I am an officer from the Awwa County Police Department. I need to understand some information regarding the case of Baron Stephan.",
    ["你好，我要一张去贝克兰德的……"] = "Hello, I would like a ticket to Backlund...",
    ["你好，我要点单"] = "Hello, I'd like to order",
    ["你好，我要看看。"] = "Hello, I'd like to take a look.",
    ["你好，斯林太太。兰格，你想要哪种蛋糕？"] = "Hello, Mrs. Slin. Lange, which kind of cake do you want?",
    ["你好，新客人，欢迎来到……哦，欢迎光临“命运”咖啡厅！"] = "Hello, new guest, welcome to... oh, welcome to the 'Fate' Cafe!",
    ["你好，旁边有长椅可以坐。"] = "Hello, there's a bench nearby where you can sit.",
    ["你好，是要擦皮鞋吗？很抱歉现在不行，我们得离开教堂。"] = "Hello, do you need a shoeshine? I'm sorry, not right now, we have to leave the church.",
    ["你好，有什么事吗？"] = "Hello, is there anything I can help you with?",
    ["你好，有看到我的猫吗？我一直在找它。"] = "Hello, have you seen my cat? I've been looking for it everywhere.",
    ["你好，朋友，愿意加入俱乐部一起锻炼吗？"] = "Hello, friend, are you willing to join the club and exercise together?",
    ["你好，洛耀女士。"] = "Hello, Ms. Luo Yao.",
    ["你好，特邀观众。"] = "Hello, special guest.",
    ["你好，瓦莱莉！"] = "Hello, Valerie!",
    ["你好，看上去，这位是您的客人？ "] = "Hello, it looks like this person is your guest?",
    ["你好，罗珊女士，我叫安多，今天就麻烦你了。"] = "Hello, Ms. Rozanne, my name is Ando, sorry to trouble you today.",
    ["你好，蒙特利"] = "Hello, Monterey",
    ["你好，试试珍妮特奶奶的正宗迪西馅饼吗？"] = "Hello, would you like to try Grandma Janet's authentic Dicy pie?",
    ["你好，请问你是索菲娅吗？"] = "Hello, may I ask if you are Sophia?",
    ["你好，请问你有没有看见过我的朋友？"] = "Hello, have you seen my friend?",
    ["你好，请问你有见到可疑的人吗？"] = "Hello, have you seen any suspicious people?",
    ["你好，请问你能送我一束花吗？"] = "Hello, may I ask if you could give me a bouquet of flowers?",
    ["你好，请问应该去哪里参加今天大学讲师的面试？"] = "Hello, may I ask where I should go for today's university lecturer interview?",
    ["你好，请问想要点什么呢？"] = "Hello, what would you like to order?",
    ["你好，请问是想找杂活女仆吗？我手脚麻利，热情洋溢，保证您雇佣了我天天都有好心情！"] = "Hello, are you looking for a general maid? I'm quick-handed, enthusiastic, and I guarantee that if you hire me, you'll have a good mood every day!",
    ["你好，请问有什么需要帮助的吗？"] = "Hello, is there anything I can help you with?",
    ["你好，这位{{先生|女士}}，欢迎来到廷根，请允许我向您推荐我社的观光马车游览服务。"] = "Hello, this {{Mr.|Ms.}}, welcome to Tingen. Please allow me to recommend our agency's sightseeing carriage tour service.",
    ["你好，这位{{英俊的先生|优雅的女士}}。"] = "Hello, {{handsome Mr.|elegant Ms.}}.",
    ["你好，这位淑女和毛绒绅士。"] = "Hello, to this lady and the fluffy gentleman.",
    ["你好，这只怀表……"] = "Hello, this pocket watch...",
    ["你好，这是我的门票。"] = "Hello, this is my ticket.",
    ["你好，迷茫的客人，想试试灵摆占卜吗？"] = "Hello, lost guest, would you like to try Pendulum Divination?",
    ["你好，陌生人，茶的味道如何？"] = "Hello, stranger. How does the tea taste?",
    ["你好？"] = "Hello?",
    ["你如果在现场，也会跟我一样记忆深刻。我回来后画了一张速写想找到他，表达我的感激。"] = "If you were there, you would have as deep an impression as I do. After I returned, I drew a sketch wanting to find him to express my gratitude.",
    ["你妻子死之前有什么异常吗？"] = "Was there anything unusual before your wife died?",
    ["你妻子现在呢？"] = "How is your wife now?",
    ["你妻子说你不会丢下他们，对了，她还为你痛骂了你的老板。"] = "Your wife said you wouldn't abandon them. By the way, she also cursed your boss on your behalf.",
    ["你始终关注着凶手，却没看见我。"] = "You have been focusing on the murderer the whole time, but you didn't see me.",
    ["你学会的东西，将来会变成你手里的剑。"] = "The things you learn will eventually become the sword in your hand.",
    ["你完全不工作吗"] = "Do you not work at all?",
    ["你完全不工作吗？"] = "Do you not work at all?",
    ["你完蛋了！"] = "You're finished!",
    ["你定定地凝视着微笑的黛西和雏菊花束。\n忽然间，小黛西和雏菊同时消失了。"] = "You stared fixedly at the smiling Daisy and the bouquet of daisies. \nSuddenly, little Daisy and the daisies disappeared at the same time.",
    ["你家住哪儿？我送你回去。"] = "Where do you live? I'll walk you back.",
    ["你家族的%s%s已上线"] = "Your family's %s%s is online.",
    ["你家门口是否有一架玩具风车？"] = "Is there a toy windmill at your door?",
    ["你对世界的未来非常重要，但这涉及神明的博弈，我也无法窥见全貌。"] = "You are very important to the future of the world, but this involves the game of gods, and I cannot see the full picture.",
    ["你对建筑很有研究，是从事这个行业？还是这个专业的学生？"] = "You have a deep understanding of architecture; are you in this industry? Or a student in this major?",
    ["你对目标施放的第一个逐日/逐光将永久降低其20%的生命值和攻击力。"] = "The first Sun Chaser/Light Chaser you cast on a target will permanently reduce its Health and Attack by 20%.",
    ["你对目标施放的第一个逐日或逐光将永久降低其20%的生命值和攻击力。"] = "The first Sun Chaser or Light Chaser you cast on a target will permanently reduce their Health and Attack by 20%.",
    ["你对茜安做了什么？它是无辜的！"] = "What did you do to Cian? She's innocent!",
    ["你对金属制品有兴趣？还是……只是找话题？"] = "Are you interested in metalwork? Or... just looking for a conversation starter?",
    ["你将以什么品质书写结局？"] = "what quality will you use to write the ending?",
    ["你将以什么战术取胜？"] = "What tactical approach will you use to win?",
    ["你将发生的事告诉了杰西。"] = "You tell Jesse what happened.",
    ["你将头盔放置在其中。<P_Heart>（失去道具——头盔）</>"] = "You place the helmet in it. <P_Heart>(Lost item—Helmet)</>",
    ["你将昨天梦境中发生的事情，一五一十地告诉了弗莱队长。"] = "You told Captain Frye everything that happened in your dream yesterday, word for word.",
    ["你将永远无法醒来"] = "You will never be able to wake up",
    ["你将玩偶放置在其中。<P_Heart>（失去道具——玩偶）</>"] = "You place the doll in it. <P_Heart>(Lost item—Doll)</>",
    ["你将现场观众的评价转述给了施佩尔。"] = "You relayed the audience's evaluation to Speer.",
    ["你将蛤蟆放置在其中。<P_Heart>（失去道具——蛤蟆）</>"] = "You place the toad in it. <P_Heart>(Lost item—Toad)</>",
    ["你将象棋放置在其中。<P_Heart>（失去道具——象棋）</>"] = "You place the chess piece in it. <P_Heart>(Lost item—Chess piece)</>",
    ["你将踏上和“愚者”先生相同的起点 开启自己的旅程"] = "You will step onto the same starting point as Mr. \"Fool\" and begin your own journey.",
    ["你将选择什么姿态与末日周旋？"] = "what stance will you choose to contend with the apocalypse?",
    ["你小子！年纪轻轻就攒够了钱……也好，早点离开这个地方。"] = "You kid! Saved up enough money at such a young age... that's good, leave this place early.",
    ["你小子，结完婚后，变化怎么这么大？"] = "You kid, how have you changed so much since you got married?",
    ["你小时候来过这里吗？"] = "Have you been here when you were a child?",
    ["你小点声啊，这里人多，别给人听到了。"] = "Keep your voice down! There are too many people here; don't let anyone hear you.",
    ["你尚未达到%s道具的%s限制等级。"] = "You have not reached the %s level requirement for the %s item.",
    ["你尝尝看！"] = "Try it!",
    ["你尝试使用神秘的“混乱”大剑，发现完全使不上力，似乎只有某些关键时刻才能运用。（提示：从湖上的台板跃入湖中，穿越到湖下的世界，或是调查荆棘，或许会有新的发现。）"] = "You try to wield the mysterious Greatsword of Chaos, but cannot draw on its power at all. It seems it can only be used at certain crucial moments. (Hint: Leap into the lake from one of the platforms above it to cross into the world beneath the lake, or investigate the thorns; you may discover something new.)",
    ["你尝试占卜特莉丝逃跑的目标位置。"] = "You attempt to divine the destination of Trissy's escape.",
    ["你就不害怕吗？"] = "Aren't you afraid?",
    ["你就不能像杰瑞米学学？你儿子每天在外面玩得多开心啊！"] = "Can't you learn from Jeremy? Your son plays so happily outside every day!",
    ["你就不要谦虚了，一天就抓住凶手，可不是运气两个字能概括的。"] = "Don't be modest. Catching the murderer in one day cannot be summarized by the word 'luck'.",
    ["你就像……就像传说中的魔法师一样！"] = "You are like... like a magician from a legend!",
    ["你就吹吧！我看你什么传说也没听过，只好自己现编了一个！"] = "Stop bragging! I can tell you haven't heard a single legend, so you just made one up on the spot!",
    ["你就告诉他——“<P_Yellow>风暴比烈酒更烈</>。”"] = "Just tell him—\"<P_Yellow>The storm is fiercer than strong liquor.</>\"",
    ["你就待在这儿，用手，把院子里的杂草一棵棵都拔干净了！"] = "You stay right here and pull out every single weed in the yard by hand!",
    ["你就是“内部资料”的神秘卖家吧！"] = "You must be the mysterious seller of the 'insider information'!",
    ["你就是之前向我推销火柴的外交大臣？"] = "You're the Minister of Foreign Affairs who tried to sell me matches earlier?",
    ["你就是克莱恩·莫雷蒂？刚才小罗珊过来说你很有礼貌。"] = "You must be Klein Moretti? Little Rozanne just said you are very polite.",
    ["你就是军情大臣？"] = "Are you the Minister of Military Intelligence?",
    ["你就是在嫌我花哨。"] = "You are just saying I am too flashy.",
    ["你就是此案的真凶"] = "You are the real murderer of this case",
    ["你就是那个刚加入黑荆棘的新人？"] = "Are you the newcomer who just joined Blackthorn?",
    ["你就是黑荆棘安保公司的人？听说你们经常处理一些……特别的案子。"] = "Are you from the Blackthorn Security Company? I heard you often handle some... special cases.",
    ["你就没怀疑过是书出问题吗？"] = "Didn't you ever suspect that there was something wrong with the book?",
    ["你就说好不好看吧？"] = "Just tell me, is it good or not?",
