    ["你就说，哥们的功能牛不牛逼吧？"] = "Just tell me, isn't this guy's functionality awesome?",
    ["你就追上我了"] = "You will have caught up to me.",
    ["你居然是个魔女，你骗了我，我不能接受！"] = "You are actually a witch, you lied to me, I can't accept this!",
    ["你已倒下，邦尼的残影冷眼俯视，缓缓隐去。"] = "You have fallen, and Bonnie's afterimage looks down coldly, slowly fading away.",
