    ["你已成为凡俗与神秘的分界者，思维、感知与力量都在脱离人类范畴。"] = "You have become the boundary between the mortal and the mysterious; your thinking, perception, and power are all departing from the human category.",
    ["你已成为洛克·金的债务目标，脚下的资产负重即将凝结并形成持续生效的危险区域。"] = "You have become a debt target of Rock King, the asset burden under your feet is about to condense and form a dangerous area that takes continuous effect.",
