    ["你已破解当前符文，并打乱了其他狱友的符文谜题。"] = "You have cracked the current rune and scrambled the rune puzzles of other inmates.",
    ["你已离开教堂，祂会一致注视着你"] = "You have left the church; He will always be watching you.",
    ["你已经了解提问的规则了，走向下一题吧，就在你身后。"] = "You have already understood the rules of the questions; proceed to the next one, it is right behind you.",
    ["你已经做出自己的决定，对吗？"] = "You have made your decision, haven't you?",
    ["你已经在木桩训练场中"] = "You are already in the dummy training ground.",
    ["你已经在该分线"] = "You are already in this channel.",
    ["你已经完成了誓言，可以往前走了，我会借光明的力量指引你。"] = "You have already fulfilled your vow and can move forward. I will guide you with the power of light.",
    ["你已经成为了我们的文职人员，但是否能成为正式的非凡者，还要看之后的际遇。"] = "You have already become our clerical staff, but whether you can become a formal Beyonder depends on your future encounters.",
    ["你已经成功在表演者的粉丝团中啦"] = "You have successfully joined the performer's fan group.",
    ["你已经拖欠了一周的咖啡钱！"] = "You've been behind on your coffee payments for a week!",
    ["你已经是俱乐部之星了"] = "You are already a Club Star.",
    ["你已经是大孩子了"] = "You are already a big kid",
    ["你已经是当前拍卖物品的最高出价者。"] = "You are already the highest bidder for this item.",
    ["你已经有房间了，是否退出当前房间<Highlight>%s</>？"] = "You already have a room. Exit the current room <Highlight>%s</>?",
    ["你已经证明了你的价值不过这只是一场游戏"] = "You have proven your worth, but this is only a game",
    ["你已能灵活运用序列力量，初步拥有应对非凡事件的自保与制敌手段。"] = "You can now flexibly use sequence powers and initially possess self-protection and enemy-defeating means to deal with Beyonder events.",
    ["你已获得开麦权限"] = "You have been granted microphone access.",
    ["你已获得联赛指挥权限"] = "You have obtained league command permissions.",
    ["你已获得过%s，已转化为%d%s"] = "You have already obtained %s, which has been converted into %d%s",
    ["你已被主指挥控麦"] = "You have been muted by the main commander.",
    ["你已被俱乐部%s移出"] = "You have been removed from club %s.",
    ["你已被对方拉黑，无法查看对方诡秘圈"] = "You have been blocked by the other person; cannot view their Mystery Circle.",
    ["你已被异化猎犬锁定，挣脱束缚并存活下来！"] = "You have been locked by the Alienated Hound, break free from the binding and survive!",
    ["你已被我……完全洞察！"] = "You have been... completely seen through by me!",
    ["你已被房主拉黑"] = "You have been blacklisted by the room owner.",
    ["你已被房主禁言"] = "You have been muted by the room owner.",
    ["你已被猩红犬魂锁定，将其引入捕兽夹并击败！"] = "You have been locked onto by the Scarlet Hound Soul; lure it into the bear trap and defeat it!",
    ["你已被该房间拉黑，无法进入"] = "You have been blacklisted by this room and cannot enter.",
    ["你已进入%s匹配队列。"] = "You have entered the %s matchmaking queue.",
    ["你已进入廷根的集体潜意识-罪恶廷根，清理污秽，拯救这座城市！"] = "You have entered Tingen's collective subconscious—Sinful Tingen. Cleanse the filth and save this city!",
    ["你已进入教堂，请诚心忏悔"] = "You have entered the church; please repent sincerely.",
    ["你已集齐所有散落的篇章。这些知识在你脑中拼接完整，构筑起一个比任何史书都更真实的罗塞尔·古斯塔夫。"] = "You have collected all the scattered chapters. This knowledge pieces together in your mind, constructing a Roselle Gustav more real than any history book.",
    ["你希望使用哪种占卜？"] = "Which type of divination would you like to use?",
    ["你希望成为一名非凡者吗？只能从不完整序列里挑选起始的非凡者。"] = "Do you wish to become a Beyonder? You can only choose a starting Beyonder from an incomplete sequence.",
    ["你希望有谁？这群咋咋呼呼的小家伙，我这张你看了十几年的老脸，还是你希望在聚会上看见圣赛琳娜教堂的主教大人？"] = "Who do you hope for? This bunch of noisy little brats? My old face that you've been looking at for over a decade, or do you hope to see the Bishop of Saint Selena Cathedral at the party?",
    ["你带来的书，书里的残影，都是“最后一页”的呼唤……"] = "The book you brought, the remnant shadow within it, are all calls from the \"Last Page\"...",
    ["你帮了我，当然要为你买单。"] = "You helped me, of course I have to pay for you.",
    ["你帮帮我。用你的占卜，找找艾琳的位置。"] = "Help me. Use your divination to find Aileen's location.",
    ["你平安回来就好，海上那么危险，光是听你信里描述的什么“冒险”“海盗”就吓得我一身冷汗……我和阿尔伯特都很担心你。"] = "I'm just glad you're back safely. The sea is so dangerous; just hearing about the 'adventures' and 'pirates' you described in your letters made me break out in a cold sweat... Albert and I were both very worried about you.",
    ["你平时玩什么游戏？"] = "What games do you usually play?",
    ["你应该也看出来了，我能在一个横放的木桶上保持平衡。"] = "You should be able to tell that I can maintain my balance on a wooden barrel placed horizontally.",
    ["你应该去和会长聊聊。实际上，这件事就是她让我委托给你的。"] = "You should go talk to the President. In fact, she was the one who asked me to entrust this matter to you.",
    ["你应该去和会长聊聊。实际上，这起案件就是会长让我委托给你的。"] = "You should go talk to the President. In fact, this case was entrusted to you by the President.",
    ["你应该去找医生看看。"] = "You should go see a doctor.",
    ["你应该找工作去"] = "You should go find a job",
    ["你应该用<P_Yellow>更新鲜、更有意思</>的方式来吸引学生感兴趣。"] = "You should use <P_Yellow> fresher and more interesting </> ways to attract students' interest.",
    ["你应该用大家都<P_Yellow>能听懂、好理解</>的方式来讲历史课。"] = "You should teach history in a way that everyone <P_Yellow> can understand and grasp easily </>.",
    ["你应该称呼我为邓恩队长了。"] = "You should address me as Captain Dunn now.",
    ["你应该称我为尊贵的阿罗德斯大人！"] = "You should address me as the honorable Lord Arrodes!",
    ["你应该能听出我的诚恳。<P_Heart>（我说的都是真话，当然，只是真话的一部分！）</>"] = "You should be able to hear my sincerity. <P_Heart>(I'm telling the truth, of course, only part of the truth!)</>",
    ["你应该获得比她们更高级的称号，“时尚公爵”怎么样？"] = "You should get a higher title than them, how about 'Fashion Duke'?",
    ["你应该说昨天就来过。对了，忘了提前介绍了……"] = "You should say you were here yesterday. By the way, I forgot to introduce her in advance...",
    ["你废话真多，我和灰猫大人的交流岂是你能窃听的！你只管都包起来，还有那条红玛瑙项链！"] = "You talk too much, how could you possibly eavesdrop on my communication with Lord Gray Cat! Just pack it all up, and that red agate necklace too!",
    ["你度过了漫长且无梦的一夜……"] = "You spent a long and dreamless night...",
    ["你开启了自动播放该频道语音功能"] = "You have enabled the automatic voice playback for this channel.",
    ["你开始挣扎了"] = "You've started struggling",
    ["你开枪啊"] = "Go ahead and shoot",
    ["你开玩笑吧？"] = "Are you kidding?",
    ["你弹得真好听"] = "You played that beautifully.",
    ["你当初也是……"] = "You were also...",
    ["你当前正在被其他非凡者诱捕"] = "You are currently being lured by another Beyonder.",
    ["你当前没有可提取的苏勒。"] = "You currently have no Sol to withdraw.",
    ["你当然可以难过，死亡是悲伤的。"] = "You can certainly be sad; death is sorrowful.",
    ["你彻底杀死了这只黑雾中的怪物，静静地看着怪物眼中的光芒消散。你榨出自己的最后一点灵性，将怪物的灵唤出……"] = "You have thoroughly killed this monster in the black mist, watching silently as the light in its eyes dissipates. You squeeze out your last bit of spirituality to summon the monster's spirit...",
    ["你很了解这些"] = "You know a lot about these",
    ["你很关注{{PlayerName}}，{{他|她}}究竟是什么人？"] = "You are very concerned about {{PlayerName}}, {{he|she}} who exactly is he/she?",
    ["你很勇敢啊！"] = "You're very brave!",
    ["你很可爱"] = "You're cute",
    ["你很在意朱莉？"] = "Do you care a lot about Julie?",
    ["你很够意思，我没看错人，接下来我要去调查三个地方。"] = "You're a reliable one. I didn't misjudge you. I'm going to investigate three places next.",
    ["你很快就会习惯的。贝克兰德发生了一件案子，需要你前去调查。"] = "You will get used to it soon. A case has occurred in Backlund, and you need to go investigate it.",
    ["你很懂塔罗。正位逆位，每一套体系的释义，你都能背出来。"] = "You know Tarot very well. Upright, reversed, you can recite the interpretations of every system.",
    ["你很擅长用<P_Yellow>幽默</>为自己辩解。"] = "You are very good at using <P_Yellow>humor</> to defend yourself.",
    ["你很敏锐。没错，它就是我序列9时的魔药“收尸人”的主材料。那本书里“看到亡父灵魂”的描述，指的也是“收尸人”看见灵体的能力……"] = "You are very sharp. That's right, it is the main ingredient for my Sequence 9 potion, 'Corpse Collector'. The description in that book about 'seeing the soul of a dead father' also refers to the 'Corpse Collector's' ability to see spirits...",
    ["你很有品"] = "You have good taste",
    ["你很有天赋，但每次过分练习或者使用灵视后，都需要通过睡眠来恢复灵性，你可以回家休息了。"] = "You are very talented, but after every excessive practice or use of spirit vision, you need to recover your spirituality through sleep. You can go home and rest.",
    ["你很有想象力"] = "You have a lot of imagination",
    ["你很烦恼？"] = "Are you very troubled?",
    ["你很聪明，孩子，并且你看起来干净整洁，令人感到舒适。"] = "You're very smart, child, and you look clean and tidy, which is comforting.",
    ["你很难过"] = "You are very sad",
    ["你很需要钱？"] = "Do you really need money?",
    ["你得上学了"] = "You need to go to school",
    ["你得了什么病？"] = "What illness do you have?",
    ["你得亲自和他说，一起去吧。"] = "You have to tell him yourself. Let's go together.",
    ["你得到了一种罕见的神奇材料，里面蕴含强大的超凡力量，和浓郁的灰雾气息。奥黛丽小姐似乎早已得到此物的启示，正在“命运咖啡厅”等你。"] = "You have obtained a rare magical material that contains powerful Beyonder powers and a dense aura of gray fog. Miss Audrey seems to have already received a revelation about this and is waiting for you at the \"Fate Café\".",
    ["你心中充满治愈的力量，噩梦的阴霾仿佛被暂时驱散。"] = "Your heart is filled with the power of healing, and the haze of the nightmare seems to be temporarily dispelled.",
    ["你必须成为真正的非凡者，掌控属于自己的能力，才能让嫁接更稳定。"] = "You must become a true Beyonder and master your own abilities to make the Grafting more stable.",
    ["你必须扼灭噩梦的种子，才能离开这里。"] = "You must extinguish the seeds of the nightmare to leave this place.",
    ["你忍痛站起，身上有着污染的红色。\n坚定地拒绝。"] = "You stood up through the pain, your body stained with the red of corruption. \n You firmly refused.",
    ["你忘记了任务，迷失在这玫瑰天堂中……"] = "You forgot the quest and got lost in this Rose Paradise...",
    ["你快走吧！被少爷看见了，我们也会有麻烦的。"] = "You should leave quickly! If the young master sees you, we'll be in trouble too.",
    ["你怀疑过阿尔伯特，怀疑过艾琳娜。但没有停留在第一印象。继续观察，修正判断，直到看见真相。"] = "You suspected Albert, you suspected Elena. But you didn't stop at the first impression. You continued to observe, corrected your judgment, until you saw the truth.",
    ["你怎么……把你最珍惜的东西……给我了……"] = "Why did you... give me... your most precious thing...",
    ["你怎么一个人在这睡觉？你的爸爸妈妈呢？"] = "Why are you sleeping here alone? Where are your mom and dad?",
    ["你怎么上来了？快下去！"] = "Why did you come up? Get down quickly!",
    ["你怎么不自己去？"] = "Why don't you go yourself?",
    ["你怎么不进去店里买？"] = "Why don't you go into the shop to buy it?",
    ["你怎么不高兴"] = "Why aren't you happy?",
    ["你怎么也进了这个群？没必要为了追我去专门进群 我暂时没有谈恋爱的打算 抱歉 请你自重"] = "Why did you join this group too? There's no need to join a group just to chase after me. I don't have any plans to date right now. Sorry, please respect yourself.",
    ["你怎么了！你还好吗？"] = "What's wrong with you! Are you okay?",
    ["你怎么了？"] = "What's wrong with you?",
    ["你怎么了？为什么喝这么多酒？"] = "What's wrong with you? Why are you drinking so much?",
    ["你怎么了？身体不舒服吗？"] = "What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?",
    ["你怎么了？需要帮忙吗？"] = "What happened to you? Do you need help?",
    ["你怎么会在这里！"] = "How are you here!",
    ["你怎么像我老师似的！不行，我还是出不来！"] = "Why are you acting like my teacher! No, I still can't get out!",
    ["你怎么又在假扮我"] = "Why are you pretending to be me again?",
    ["你怎么又在假扮我！给人占卜是我的工作！"] = "Why are you pretending to be me again! Giving divinations is my job!",
    ["你怎么又知道了……"] = "How do you know about that again...",
    ["你怎么变成了这样？你的手臂全都是木纹…… "] = "How did you become like this? Your arms are all wood grain...",
    ["你怎么哭啦？不是你弟弟是什么意思？"] = "Why are you crying? What do you mean he's not your brother?",
    ["你怎么啦？"] = "What's wrong with you?",
    ["你怎么在这上面，这里很危险？"] = "Why are you up here? It's dangerous here.",
    ["你怎么对脚踏车这么感兴趣？"] = "Why are you so interested in bicycles?",
    ["你怎么就剩一个头了？"] = "How come you're just a head now?",
    ["你怎么敢直呼他的名字？请尊称他为，伟大的罗塞尔大帝。"] = "How dare you address him by his name? Please refer to him respectfully as the Great Emperor Roselle.",
    ["你怎么样？还能坚持吗？"] = "How are you? Can you still hold on?",
    ["你怎么每天都有事？"] = "Why do you have something going on every day?",
    ["你怎么用了心理炼金会那帮疯子的理论？"] = "Why are you using the theories of those lunatics from the Psychology Alchemists?",
    ["你怎么睡在这里？你怎么了？"] = "Why are you sleeping here? What's wrong with you?",
    ["你怎么知道……菲丽丝告诉你的？"] = "How did you know... did Phyllis tell you?",
    ["你怎么知道我在找马车？"] = "How did you know I was looking for a carriage?",
    ["你怎么知道这些的？"] = "How do you know all this?",
    ["你怎么知道那里有松鼠窝……"] = "How did you know there was a squirrel's nest there...",
    ["你怎么知道，嘿嘿，不愧是邓恩叔叔，偷偷告诉你，我觉得……"] = "How did you know? Hehe, as expected of Uncle Dunn. Let me tell you secretly, I think...",
    ["你怎么知道？"] = "How do you know?",
    ["你怎么突然开始发呆了？"] = "Why did you suddenly start spacing out?",
    ["你怎么突然醒悟了？"] = "Why did you suddenly wake up?",
    ["你怎么能用这种态度跟我说话，你以前不是这样的。"] = "How can you talk to me with that attitude? You weren't like this before.",
    ["你怎么能说出这样的话？！你是在利用她！"] = "How can you say such things?! You are using her!",
    ["你怎么能这么自私，这么残忍！就一个人走了。"] = "How could you be so selfish, so cruel! Just leaving all alone.",
    ["你怎么还随身携带这些，顺便卖卖教材？"] = "Why are you still carrying these around, and selling textbooks on the side?",
    ["你怎么这么说哥哥呢？我太伤心了。"] = "How can you say that to your brother? I'm so heartbroken.",
    ["你总是那么敏锐，你是我们三个人中最聪明的。"] = "You are always so sharp, you are the smartest of the three of us.",
    ["你总算爬过来了。听好，没时间废话。"] = "You finally crawled over. Listen up, no time for nonsense.",
    ["你惊醒了，原来只是一个噩梦。"] = "You woke up, it was just a nightmare.",
    ["你想买下这位水手吗，年轻人？"] = "Do you want to buy this sailor, young man?",
    ["你想买什么？我现在手上有“安格尔威德之梦”、“夜访魔女”，以及“浴火的吞尾蛇”。"] = "What do you want to buy? I currently have 'Angellweed's Dream', 'Night Visit of the Witch', and 'Fire-Bathed Ouroboros'.",
    ["你想买哪种魔药？我现在手上有“安格尔威德之梦”、“夜访魔女”，以及“浴火的吞尾蛇”。"] = "Which kind of potion do you want to buy? I currently have \"Dream of Angerwade\", \"Night-Visiting Witch\", and \"Fire-Bathed Ouroboros\".",
    ["你想了解什么呢？"] = "What would you like to know?",
    ["你想了解菲丽丝的情况，就去赢得比赛，加入启明小队。"] = "If you want to know about Phyllis's situation, go win the competition and join the Qiming Team.",
    ["你想了解菲丽丝的情况，就去赢得比赛，加入启明小队。    "] = "If you want to understand Phyllis's situation, go win the competition and join the Dawn Squad.",
    ["你想使用那个炉子？"] = "Do you want to use that stove?",
    ["你想做什么？"] = "What do you want to do?",
    ["你想再见艾德蒙一面吗？"] = "Do you want to see Edmond one more time?",
    ["你想去哪里，我一定准时送达！"] = "Where do you want to go? I will definitely deliver you on time!",
    ["你想去就去吧"] = "Go if you want to",
    ["你想去警察局喝饮料？"] = "Do you want to go to the police station to drink?",
    ["你想听真话还是谎话？"] = "Do you want the truth or a lie?",
    ["你想多了……"] = "You are overthinking it...",
    ["你想实现的理想，可能不仅仅需要时间，也需要更多的同伴。"] = "The ideals you want to realize may require not just time, but also more companions.",
    ["你想带他们回去过生日？"] = "You want to take them back to celebrate the birthday?",
    ["你想干什么？"] = "What are you trying to do?",
    ["你想扔掉的是那个被评委否定的自己。"] = "What you want to throw away is that version of yourself that was rejected by the judges.",
    ["你想把我抓走，关在黑暗的地底？"] = "Do you want to arrest me and lock me in a dark dungeon?",
    ["你想摸摸兔子粉白的耳朵。\n兔子掏出手枪指着你：我讨厌没有礼貌的家伙！\n四周顿时乱作一团。\n“砰！”"] = "You want to touch the rabbit's pinkish-white ears. \n The rabbit pulls out a pistol and points it at you: \"I hate impolite guys!\" \n The surroundings immediately descend into chaos. \n \"Bang!\"",
    ["你想来一把斗邪恶吗？"] = "Do you want to play a round of Fight Evil?",
    ["你想看哪张牌？"] = "Which card do you want to look at?",
    ["你想知道世界的真相吗？它为什么这样运转，它最终会走向哪里。所有追问的尽头。"] = "Do you want to know the truth of the world? Why it operates this way, where it will eventually lead. The end of all questioning.",
    ["你想知道什么是非凡力量，什么是非凡者？"] = "Do you want to know what Extraordinary power is, and what a Beyonder is?",
    ["你想租一层楼40个人公用一间盥洗室，三层上下铺之间连帘子都没有，空气中全是汗味和脚臭味的这个鬼地方？"] = "You want to rent a place where 40 people share one washroom, where there isn't even a curtain between the three-tier bunks, and the air is full of the smell of sweat and stinky feet?",
    ["你想聊点什么？"] = "What would you like to talk about?",
    ["你想要吗？这可是真正的古董！ "] = "Do you want it? This is a real antique!",
    ["你想要咨询什么问题？"] = "What question do you want to ask?",
    ["你想要挑战哪个关卡？"] = "Which level do you want to challenge?",
    ["你想要查询哪段进度？"] = "Which progress do you want to check?",
    ["你想让诅咒停在自己这里，堵上灾难的大门？"] = "Do you want the curse to stop with you and block the gate of disaster?",
    ["你想说，和平时的我完全不一样对吧？"] = "You want to say that I'm completely different from my usual self, right?",
    ["你想进去念书？"] = "Do you want to go to school there?",
    ["你意外触碰了占卜俱乐部书架上的塔罗牌，进入了神秘的历史空间。原来曾有一位著名占卜家离奇自杀，留下了这张塔罗牌，你通过向塔罗牌提问，最终还原了事情的真相，这一切都源于对命运的欺瞒和抗争。"] = "You accidentally touched a Tarot card on the bookshelf of the Divination Club and entered a mysterious historical space. It turns out that a famous Seer once committed suicide under strange circumstances, leaving behind this Tarot card. By asking the Tarot card questions, you eventually restored the truth of the matter; all of this stemmed from the deception and resistance against fate.",
    ["你感到一阵头晕目眩……"] = "You feel a wave of dizziness...",
    ["你感受到一股阴冷目光的注视"] = "You feel the gaze of a cold, chilling stare",
    ["你感觉你身上失去了点什么。"] = "You feel like you've lost something.",
    ["你愿意吗？"] = "Are you willing?",
    ["你愿意让它成为我送你的结婚十周年纪念礼物吗？"] = "Would you like it to be the tenth-anniversary gift I give you?",
    ["你懂什么！很快了，很快我们就可以拿回属于我们的荣耀！"] = "What do you know! Soon, very soon we can take back the glory that belongs to us!",
    ["你成为非凡者是基于应对危险和寻找笔记的需要。之后你需要跟随老尼尔额外学习神秘学知识，这个你们自己安排时间，有问题吗？"] = "Your becoming a Beyonder is based on the need to deal with danger and find the notebook. Afterwards, you need to follow Old Neil to learn additional occult knowledge. You can arrange the time for this yourselves. Any questions?",
    ["你成了一个小偷？"] = "You became a thief?",
    ["你成功中断了秩序之网的力量，被困住的大剑掉了下来。现在村内可以自由携带任何大剑了。"] = "You have successfully interrupted the power of the Web of Order, and the trapped greatsword has fallen. Now, any greatsword can be freely carried within the village.",
    ["你成功乘上老爷车，逃出生天！"] = "You successfully boarded the vintage car and escaped!",
    ["你成功找回了足够的灵性，脱离危险！"] = "You successfully recovered enough spirituality and are out of danger!",
    ["你成功逃离了玫瑰天堂，通过灵性追溯获知了击败金狼的方法——斩断红线……但你身上的枪伤，仍在隐隐作痛。"] = "You successfully escaped Rose Paradise and learned the method to defeat the Golden Wolf through Spiritual Retrospection—sever the red thread... but the gunshot wound on your body still aches.",
    ["你成长了不少，我能感受到。魔药都消化完了吧？"] = "You've grown quite a bit, I can feel it. Have you fully digested the potion?",
    ["你或许听说过老尼尔？他以前负责看守材料、武器和文献库，需要经常采购。"] = "You might have heard of Old Neil? He used to be responsible for guarding materials, weapons, and the archives, and needed to make frequent purchases.",
    ["你或许看不出来，但我的腿受过严重的伤，它们每到雨天都会因为潮湿而阵痛。"] = "You might not be able to tell, but my legs were seriously injured, and they ache whenever it rains because of the dampness.",
    ["你或许需要一些时间休息，剩下的事由丽贝卡处理。"] = "You might need some time to rest; Rebecca will handle the rest.",
    ["你所关注的物品已下架。"] = "The item you are following has been delisted.",
    ["你所关注的道具%s的公示期很快就要结束了"] = "The public notice period for the item %s you are following is about to end.",
    ["你所在的团队加入了联盟"] = "The team you are in has joined the alliance.",
    ["你所在的团队退出了联盟"] = "Your group has exited the alliance.",
    ["你所学到的一切非凡知识，都能成为击败敌人的刀刃。"] = "Everything you have learned about Beyonder knowledge can become a blade to defeat enemies.",
    ["你所珍视的一切，都有可能被偷走，包括时间。"] = "Everything you cherish can be stolen, including time.",
    ["你所积累的“人脉”，接下来将为你提供帮助和指引"] = "The \"connections\" you have accumulated will provide you with help and guidance",
    ["你所购买的物品已售出或已下架。"] = "The item you are purchasing has been sold or delisted.",
    ["你所购买的物品已失效。"] = "The item you are purchasing is no longer valid.",
    ["你所购买的物品数量已发生变化。"] = "The quantity of the item you are purchasing has changed.",
    ["你才不务正业，我在认真生活，欣赏这宏伟的屏障，美丽的窗景。"] = "You're the one not doing your proper work; I am living seriously, appreciating this magnificent Barrier and the beautiful window view.",
    ["你才怪物！ 你咋变成俩了？现在二打一！不公平！ "] = "You're the monster! How did you turn into two people? It's two against one now! That's unfair!",
    ["你才是"] = "You are the one",
    ["你才是猪！"] = "You're the pig!",
    ["你才是笨蛋！妈妈没有骗过我，我的愿望会实现的。"] = "You're the dummy! Mom never lied to me, my wish will come true.",
    ["你才是那个临时演员？那这位是……"] = "You're the real temporary actor? Then who is this...",
    ["你才来不久，可能不知道这些事情，后边就会清楚的，这不是秘密，邓恩队长是个好人，克莱恩也是很不错的值夜者。"] = "You haven't been here long, so you might not know about these things, but you will understand later. This is no secret; Captain Dunn is a good man, and Klein is also a very good Nighthawk.",
    ["你打回去了吗？"] = "Did you fight back?",
    ["你打开门，请拉蒂兹进来了。"] = "You open the door and invite Ladis in.",
    ["你打得过柯莱特吗？"] = "Can you beat Collet?",
    ["你打算带阿尔伯特出海？"] = "You plan to take Albert to sea?",
    ["你打算怎么办？ 这上面写的看起来是你和他们的约定。"] = "What do you plan to do? What's written here looks like an agreement between you and them.",
    ["你打算怎么开口？"] = "How do you plan to bring it up?",
    ["你扔不掉它，也许存在什么原因。我会把怀表送回原位，今晚守着它，看它到底为什么回来。"] = "You can't throw it away; perhaps there is a reason. I will return the pocket watch to its original place and watch it tonight to see why it keeps coming back.",
    ["你执意选择拥抱“伟大母亲”，心理治疗失败，被污染完全侵蚀。"] = "You insisted on choosing to hug the \"Great Mother\"; the Psychotherapy failed, and you were completely eroded by the corruption.",
    ["你扭头一看，一只章鱼正在灶台前忙碌。"] = "You turn your head and see an octopus busy in front of the stove.",
    ["你找他干什么？维斯塔把工坊的欠款都还了吧，芬恩都要自杀了，你们就别找麻烦了。"] = "What are you looking for him for? Vesta has already paid off the workshop's debts. Finn is on the verge of suicide, so stop causing trouble for them.",
    ["你找到了凶手。"] = "You found the murderer.",
    ["你找到了目标所在的位置？"] = "You found the location of the target?",
    ["你把他买走，他就有钱给我了。"] = "If you buy him, he'll have the money to pay me.",
    ["你把他们引来了！"] = "You brought them here!",
    ["你把侍者服换了下来。"] = "You took off the waiter's uniform.",
    ["你把手交给了这位女士。片刻后，一股温暖的力量流遍了你的身体。"] = "You hand your hand to this lady. A moment later, a warm power flows through your entire body.",
    ["你把星相解读都背下来了？还几眼就能解出我的命运？"] = "You memorized all the astrological interpretations? And you can solve my fate in just a few glances?",
    ["你把朱莉当姐姐？"] = "You see Julie as an older sister?",
    ["你把泻药放进哪颗南瓜里了？最好没人发现我们动了手脚……"] = "Which pumpkin did you put the laxative in? It's best if no one finds out we tampered with it...",
    ["你把自己的未婚妻叫做女巫？"] = "You call your own fiancée a witch?",
    ["你把自己锁起来，是想让他知道打不开的感觉？"] = "Did you lock yourself in to let him know what it feels like to be unable to open something?",
    ["你拍了十三张照片，帮一只乌鸦收集了十三种记忆。你有没有好奇过……是谁让那只乌鸦活到第十四天的？"] = "You have taken thirteen photographs and helped a crow collect thirteen types of memories. Have you ever wondered... who allowed that crow to live until the fourteenth day?",
    ["你拍了这么多张照片，帮一只乌鸦收集灵性痕迹。你有没有好奇过……是谁让那只灵体乌鸦活到这时候的？"] = "You've taken so many photos, helping a crow collect traces of spirituality. Have you ever been curious... about who kept that spirit crow alive until now?",
    ["你拼命敲砸，终于打破了这团绯红的光茧。"] = "You knock and pound desperately, finally breaking through this crimson cocoon of light.",
    ["你拾取了命运光点，获得%s分"] = "You picked up a Fate Light, gaining %s points.",
    ["你拿着这个去找老尼尔，他就明白了。"] = "Take this to Old Neil, and he will understand.",
    ["你指的是什么？"] = "What are you referring to?",
    ["你指谁？"] = "Who are you referring to?",
    ["你挑一个。"] = "You pick one.",
    ["你挣扎着清醒过来，发现自己已身处一个奇异的空间内，\n而不远处有个熟悉的人影——“愚者”先生"] = "You struggle to wake up and find yourself in a strange space, \n and not far away is a familiar figure—Mr. Fool.",
    ["你换了身衣服？"] = "You changed your clothes?",
    ["你掌控超凡者的“本质”，能力完整，开始触及神秘规则的边缘。"] = "You control the 'essence' of a Beyonder, your abilities are complete, and you have begun to touch the edges of mysterious rules.",
    ["你接不住！"] = "You can't catch it!",
    ["你摸到了玫瑰天堂的大门，接下来，重头戏才正要开始。"] = "You've touched the gates of Rose Paradise; the main event is just about to begin.",
    ["你收到请柬了？其实我自己都忘记了，是老尼尔他们……"] = "You received an invitation? Actually, I even forgot about it myself; it was Old Neil and the others...",
    ["你收到黑荆棘的任务，前往黑伍德庄园调查封印物失窃案。混入舞会后，你观察到一个举止惹眼的神秘女子、一位行为僵硬的黑伍德男爵，以及他身边那位戴着特殊眼镜的老管家。随着调查深入，你发现管家被封印物“看见我”侵蚀了记忆，而男爵早已识破一切，正等待幕后黑手现身……最终你协助男爵击退了隐藏的欺诈师，见证了一段跨越时光的主仆深情。"] = "You receive a quest from Blackthorn to investigate the theft of a Sealed Artifact at Heywood Manor. After infiltrating the ball, you observe a mysterious woman with eye-catching behavior, a stiff-acting Baron Heywood, and the old butler wearing special glasses by his side. As the investigation deepens, you discover the butler's memory has been eroded by the Sealed Artifact 'See Me', and the Baron has long seen through everything, waiting for the mastermind to appear... In the end, you assist the Baron in repelling the hidden Faceless and witness a deep bond between master and servant that transcends time.",
    ["你救不了他。"] = "You couldn't save him.",
    ["你救了我，也知道我的秘密了，对吗？"] = "You saved me, and you know my secret now, right?",
    ["你救治了濒死的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "You saved the dying <Chat_Highlight>%s</>.",
    ["你敢想象没有卫生系统的因蒂斯当初是什么样吗？！简直不忍直视！到处都是恶心的排泄物！"] = "Can you imagine what Intis was like without a sanitation system back then?! It was simply unbearable to look at! There was disgusting excrement everywhere!",
    ["你无视了所有灵性预警，向它伸出了手。你在感到理智降低的同时，似乎也在耳畔听到什么声音：“嗯”"] = "You ignore every Spirituality Warning and reach out to it. As your sanity drops, you seem to hear something whisper in your ear: \"Hmm.\"",
    ["你既让犯罪的人接受惩罚，又带回封印物3-888、消除潜在危险。"] = "You have both made the criminals accept punishment and brought back Sealed Artifact 3-888, eliminating potential dangers.",
    ["你早晚会知道的。在这之前，不如先决定一下要不要接受这份拍摄委托。当然，这只是个建议，拍不拍随你。只不过，如果错过的话，就很无趣了。"] = "You will know sooner or later. Before that, why not decide whether you want to accept this photography commission? Of course, this is just a suggestion; it's up to you whether you take it or not. It's just that it would be very dull if you missed it.",
    ["你时髦的纺织品与奇怪的食物"] = "Your stylish textiles and strange food",
    ["你时髦的衣衫与奇怪的食物"] = "Your stylish clothes and strange food",
    ["你明明就答应了我可以去的！你说谎！"] = "You clearly promised me I could go! You're lying!",
    ["你明明演的是个真正的男子汉，却被写成了怂包，要是我被羞辱，可不会这么好说话！"] = "You were clearly playing a real man, but you were written as a coward. If I were humiliated, I wouldn't be so easy to talk to!",
    ["你明明答应我可以去的！你说谎！"] = "You clearly promised I could go! You're lying!",
    ["你明白什么了？喂！"] = "What do you understand? Hey!",
    ["你明白就好。所以……我们没有多少时间可以用来难过，还有很多任务在等着我们。"] = "It's good that you understand. So... we don't have much time to be sad; there are still many tasks waiting for us.",
    ["你昏睡前见到的最后一个人是谁，还记得吗？"] = "Do you remember who the last person you saw before you fell into a coma was?",
    ["你是"] = "You are",
    ["你是#Space6#。"] = "You are #Space6#.",
    ["你是……"] = "You are...",
    ["你是……{{PlayerName}}{{先生|女士}}，我没说错吧？我在警局档案室看过你的文件，上面标注你是调查特殊案件的专家。"] = "You are... {{PlayerName}}{{ Mr. | Ms. }}, am I right? I've seen your file in the police station archives, and it notes that you are an expert in investigating special cases.",
    ["你是……不，您、您是占卜家吗！"] = "Are you... no, are, are you a Seer!",
    ["你是……不，您、您是占卜师吗！"] = "Are you... no, are you a diviner?",
    ["你是……俱乐部那个人。你是怎么进来的？！你怎么会和雪莉在一起？"] = "You are... that person from the club. How did you get in?! How are you with Shirley?",
    ["你是……我们的新人？"] = "Are you... our newcomer?",
    ["你是……我女儿失踪了，你有没有见过她？"] = "Are you... My daughter is missing, have you seen her?",
    ["你是……艾、艾米？！"] = "You are... Am, Amy?!",
    ["你是……艾拉？"] = "Are you... Ella?",
    ["你是……？我们见过？"] = "Who are you...? Have we met?",
    ["你是一个很合格的观众。"] = "You are a very qualified Spectator.",
    ["你是不会懂的。"] = "You wouldn't understand.",
    ["你是不是也收到了那封信？该死，我就该在看到那封信的时候一把火把它烧掉！"] = "Did you also receive that letter? Damn it, I should have burned it the moment I saw it!",
    ["你是不是也被那张纸骗过来的？该死，我就该在看到那张纸的时候一把火把它烧掉！"] = "Were you also tricked into coming here by that piece of paper? Damn it, I should have burned it the moment I saw it!",
    ["你是不是外面有其他女人了？怎么连陪我的时间都没有？"] = "Do you have another woman outside? How come you don't even have time to accompany me?",
    ["你是不是根本没收钱？"] = "Did you not collect the money at all?",
    ["你是不能忘记的朋友，也是无法释怀的过去。"] = "You are a friend I cannot forget, and a past I cannot let go of.",
    ["你是个人？"] = "Are you even human?",
    ["你是个懦夫"] = "You are a coward",
    ["你是个有天赋的占卜师，记住我今天说的话。我该走了。"] = "You are a gifted diviner. Remember what I said today. I should be going.",
    ["你是个没有家的怪物！"] = "You are a monster without a home!",
    ["你是个警察？"] = "You're a policeman?",
    ["你是什么途径？"] = "What is your Pathway?",
    ["你是今天第一位来占卜的人，免费。"] = "You are the first person to come for divination today, it's free.",
    ["你是他的谁？维斯塔把工坊的欠款都还了吧，芬恩都要自杀了，你们就别找麻烦了。"] = "Who are you to him? Vista has already paid off the workshop's debts. Finn is about to commit suicide, so don't cause trouble for him.",
    ["你是做什么的？为什么这么晚还在外面转？"] = "What do you do? Why are you still out so late?",
    ["你是刚来这卖花吗？"] = "Did you just come here to sell flowers?",
    ["你是占卜师，你来决定。"] = "You are the diviner, you decide.",
    ["你是卫生监察员，那我是谁？"] = "You're a health inspector? Then who am I?",
    ["你是历史系毕业生，我们需要研究第四纪文献和遗物的人才。"] = "You are a history graduate; we need talent to study Fourth Epoch documents and relics.",
    ["你是否听说过特伦索斯特黄铜书？"] = "Have you ever heard of the Trunsoest Brass Book?",
    ["你是否希望自己的伴侣不是人类？"] = "Do you wish for your partner not to be human?",
    ["你是否想要摆脱身上污秽的污染？"] = "Do you want to get rid of the filthy corruption on your body?",
    ["你是否活着都不会再影响到后续的发展，造成的这一切的神秘力量不会再特别重视你了。"] = "Whether you are alive or not will no longer affect the subsequent developments. The mysterious power that caused all this will no longer pay special attention to you.",
    ["你是和家人走散了吗？"] = "Are you separated from your family?",
    ["你是和珍妮特奶奶一起来的吗？"] = "Are you with Grandma Janet?",
    ["你是在和我说话？"] = "Are you talking to me?",
    ["你是在哪里听见的声音？"] = "Where did you hear that voice?",
    ["你是在哪里听见的声音？ "] = "Where did you hear the sound?",
    ["你是在回答我的问题吗？好聪明呀！"] = "Are you answering my question? How smart!",
    ["你是在塔罗会成员的注视下诞生的，我当然认识你。"] = "You were born under the gaze of the Tarot Club members, so of course I know you.",
    ["你是在说桌子上那些报销单吗？"] = "Are you talking about those reimbursement forms on the table?",
    ["你是大学生？"] = "Are you a university student?",
    ["你是幸运的，你遇见了我，这个时代的主角。 "] = "You are lucky, you met me, the protagonist of this era.",
    ["你是廷根的人吗？抱歉，我哥哥说话太没礼貌了。"] = "Are you from Tingen? Sorry, my brother is too impolite.",
    ["你是怎么做到的？房租还剩六个月。提前搬家等于违约，要是被告上法庭，我们得赔一大笔钱。"] = "How did you do it? There are six months left on the lease. Moving out early is a breach of contract. If we were taken to court, we'd have to pay a huge sum.",
    ["你是恶魔吗？"] = "Are you a demon?",
    ["你是想直接将人送去黑夜女神的神国吗？"] = "Are you trying to send someone directly to the Evernight Goddess's divine kingdom?",
    ["你是想说……传说都是假的吗？布丁不会回来了……对吗？"] = "Are you trying to say... the legends are all fake? Pudding won't come back... right?",
    ["你是我们之中最年轻的，要代替我们回去啊。"] = "You are the youngest among us, you must go back for us.",
    ["你是我煽动的纷争与灾祸中，唯一的意义。"] = "You are the only meaning in the strife and disaster I incited.",
    ["你是执掌好运的黄黑之王"] = "You are the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck",
    ["你是摊主？"] = "Are you the stall owner?",
    ["你是故意的……"] = "Did you do that on purpose...",
    ["你是新来的？别乱找人占卜，他们大多连最基本的灵数都算不清！"] = "Are you new here? Don't go around asking people for divination; most of them can't even calculate the most basic spirit numbers!",
    ["你是本地人吗？我循着地址来，但主人不在。"] = "Are you a local? I followed the address, but the owner isn't here.",
    ["你是来体验生活的？"] = "Are you here to experience life?",
    ["你是来参加面试的？"] = "Are you here for the interview?",
    ["你是来问我关于马桶的事吧？"] = "You're here to ask me about the toilet, right?",
    ["你是水箱里的那只章鱼！"] = "You're that octopus in the water tank!",
    ["你是温弗的剧迷吗？"] = "Are you a fan of Winfr's?",
    ["你是灰雾之上的神秘主宰"] = "You are the mysterious ruler above the gray fog",
    ["你是皮特？"] = "Are you Pete?",
    ["你是看报纸过来的吗，来看看，我这有廷根市面上最齐全的家伙！"] = "Did you come here after reading the newspaper? Come and take a look; I have the most complete stock in Tingen!",
    ["你是第一次吗？有些紧张？不用担心。"] = "Is this your first time? A bit nervous? Don't worry.",
    ["你是维托吗？码头的工人告诉我，维托下船后总在这一片活动。"] = "Are you Vito? The dock workers told me that Vito always hangs around this area after getting off the ship.",
    ["你是维托吗？码头的工人说维托下船后总在这一片活动。"] = "Are you Vito? The dock workers say Vito is always active in this area after getting off the ship.",
    ["你是罗森？"] = "Are you Rosen?",
    ["你是老罗德先生的什么人？"] = "What are you to Mr. Rhode?",
    ["你是蒙特利的朋友？你认识我？"] = "Are you a friend of Montley's? Do you know me?",
    ["你是被“愚者”先生选中的人，一定没问题的！"] = "You are the person chosen by Mr. 'Fool', you'll definitely be fine!",
    ["你是观众途径的非凡者，没有比你更合适的人选，注意宾客的微表情，注意环境里的异常，注意所有“看起来不太对”的东西。"] = "You are a Beyonder of the Spectator pathway; there is no one more suitable than you. Pay attention to the guests' micro-expressions, notice any anomalies in the environment, and watch for everything that 'doesn't seem quite right'.",
    ["你是警察？官方和教会不是不管这里吗？"] = "You're a police officer? Don't the officials and the Church stay out of this place?",
    ["你是说 枪声"] = "You mean, gunfire?",
    ["你是说……"] = "You mean...",
    ["你是说……今天早上被人发现饿死的那两个流浪画家？"] = "Are you talking about... those two wandering painters who were found starved to death this morning?",
    ["你是说……菜不是他做的？作为主厨，也许他不需要亲自上灶台做菜？"] = "You mean... the food wasn't made by him? As a head chef, maybe he doesn't need to cook personally?",
    ["你是说《大冒险家》？"] = "You mean \"The Great Adventurer\"?",
    ["你是说一个在鲁恩，一个在弗萨克，写了十多年的信？"] = "Are you saying that one was in Loen and the other in Feysac, and they wrote letters for over ten years?",
    ["你是说亚特先生？他似乎在忙着把葡萄发酵成酒。"] = "You mean Mr. Yate? He seems busy fermenting grapes into wine.",
    ["你是说唱歌手？"] = "Are you a rapper?",
    ["你是说我的小猫？它们……能少打翻我几瓶药剂就好。"] = "Are you talking about my kittens? If only... they could knock over fewer of my potions.",
    ["你是说我的猫不爱我，一切只是我的自作多情？！"] = "Are you saying my cat doesn't love me, and everything was just me being delusional?!",
    ["你是说莱茵？她真的是一个很内向的女孩，你去找她说说话就会明白了，哈哈哈。"] = "You mean Rhine? She really is a very introverted girl. You'll understand once you go talk to her, hahaha.",
    ["你是说这个少年……在船上的厮杀中救了你们？"] = "You mean this boy... saved you all during the slaughter on the ship?",
    ["你是说那个像偷渡上来的？叫什么来着……"] = "You mean the one who looked like he snuck on board? What was his name again...",
    ["你是说那个闹鬼的房子吗？窗户还是我帮忙钉上的。"] = "You mean that haunted house? I even helped nail the windows shut.",
    ["你是说隔壁……"] = "You mean next door...",
    ["你是说，他最近都没有出海贸易，所以没有接触过违禁物品？"] = "You mean, he hasn't been engaged in overseas trade recently, so he hasn't had contact with contraband?",
    ["你是说，你在寻找姐姐，你的姐姐失踪了？"] = "Are you saying you are looking for your sister, and your sister has gone missing?",
    ["你是说，她发现了我们作假，却依旧离开了？"] = "You mean she discovered we were faking it, yet she still left?",
    ["你是说，学习赚钱的方法？"] = "You mean, learn the method of making money?",
    ["你是说，崔佛警官让你用“共感手铐”来压制非凡者失控吗！？"] = "Are you saying that Officer Trevor asked you to use the \"Empathy Handcuffs\" to suppress a Beyonder's loss of control!?",
    ["你是说，崔佛警官让你用“共感手铐”来压制非凡者失控吗？"] = "Are you saying Officer Trevor asked you to use the \"Empathy Handcuffs\" to suppress a Beyonder's loss of control?",
    ["你是说，崔佛让你用“共感手铐”来压制非凡者失控吗！？"] = "Are you saying that Trevor asked you to use \"Empathy Handcuffs\" to suppress a Beyonder's loss of control!?",
    ["你是说，我已经死了？我就死在了这里？"] = "Are you saying I'm already dead? Did I die right here?",
    ["你是说，有非凡力量在故意制造死亡？"] = "Are you saying that there is Extraordinary power deliberately causing these deaths?",
    ["你是谁！"] = "Who are you!",
    ["你是谁！？为什么躺在我的床上！"] = "Who are you!? Why are you lying in my bed!",
    ["你是谁，为什么要赶走我的客人？"] = "Who are you, and why are you driving away my customer?",
    ["你是谁？"] = "Who are you?",
    ["你是谁？为什么跟踪我？"] = "Who are you? Why are you following me?",
    ["你是谁？你怎么知道？"] = "Who are you? How do you know that?",
    ["你是谁？怎么在我的房间里？"] = "Who are you? Why are you in my room?",
    ["你是谁？懂不懂俱乐部的规矩？要先预约——"] = "Who are you? Don't you know the Divination Club's rules? You need an appointment—",
    ["你是谁？我没在问你。"] = "Who are you? I wasn't asking you.",
    ["你是谁？敢插手猎龙帮的事！"] = "Who are you? How dare you interfere with the affairs of the Dragon-Hunting Gang!",
    ["你是谁？这是什么？"] = "Who are you? What is this?",
    ["你是谁？！怎么在我的房间里？"] = "Who are you?! Why are you in my room?",
    ["你是贵族？"] = "Are you a noble?",
    ["你是这的学生吗？"] = "Are you a student here?",
    ["你是遇到什么烦心事了吗"] = "Did you encounter any troubles?",
    ["你是遇到什么烦心事了吗？"] = "Did you encounter any troubles?",
    ["你是那个醉汉？"] = "Are you that drunkard?",
    ["你是那个顾客？"] = "Are you that customer?",
    ["你是食堂的厨师吧？遇上什么难事了？ "] = "You're the cafeteria cook, right? Did you run into some trouble?",
    ["你是马西莫，那个美食评论家？"] = "You are Massimo, that food critic?",
    ["你是鲁恩人吧？你可以加入黑夜女神教会、风暴之主教会或蒸汽与机械之神教会，获得成为非凡者的机会。"] = "You are a Loenese, right? You can join the Church of the Evernight Goddess, the Church of the Lord of Storms, or the Church of the God of Steam and Machinery to gain the opportunity to become a Beyonder.",
    ["你是黄牛？"] = "Are you a scalper?",
    ["你是黛丝？"] = "Are you Daisy?",
    ["你是！你是……不属于这个时代的人……"] = "You are! You are... someone who doesn't belong to this era...",
    ["你是？"] = "Who are you?",
    ["你是？？"] = "Who are you??",
    ["你暂时获得了雷电灵性的力量。"] = "You have temporarily gained the power of lightning spirituality.",
    ["你更恐惧失去哪样感官？"] = "Which sense are you more afraid of losing?",
    ["你最喜欢的占星术没告诉你？这位可是一眼就看出来了！"] = "Your favorite astrology didn't tell you? This person saw it at a glance!",
    ["你最多也就出了一半的力，还想要全部的钱？做梦！对了，你的铲子呢？"] = "You did at most half the work, and you want all the money? Dream on! By the way, where's your shovel?",
    ["你最多只能在济贫院内待五天。"] = "You can only stay in the poorhouse for five days at most.",
    ["你最近一直在用占卜解决事情，但这不意味着你可以依赖占卜，占卜不是万能的。"] = "You have been using divination to solve problems recently, but that doesn't mean you can rely on it. Divination is not omnipotent.",
    ["你最近还好吗？噢，许久不见，你变得更迷人了。"] = "How have you been lately? Oh, long time no see, you've become even more charming.",
    ["你有%i条入会申请待处理"] = "You have %i membership applications pending",
    ["你有%s条新消息"] = "You have %s new messages",
    ["你有一次选择的机会。"] = "You have one chance to choose.",
    ["你有东西被抢了吗？"] = "Did you have something stolen?",
    ["你有为实现梦想拼过命吗？"] = "Have you ever risked your life to achieve your dream?",
    ["你有些不忍，终于还是走过去，站在了他的身后。"] = "You couldn't bear it, and finally walked over and stood behind him.",
    ["你有什么事？阿尔伯特这孩子，唉。"] = "What is it? That child Albert, sigh.",
    ["你有什么想知道的，只要是在廷根的，我都能帮你调查明白。"] = "Whatever you want to know, as long as it's in Tingen, I can help you investigate it clearly.",
    ["你有仔细看它们吗？没有的话，可以先去看看。"] = "Have you looked at them carefully? If not, you can go take a look first.",
    ["你有兴趣参加下一届恶龙争霸赛吗？"] = "Are you interested in participating in the next Dragon Championship?",
    ["你有本事就搬走！跟你待在一起真是晦气！"] = "If you're so capable, move out! Being with you is just bad luck!",
    ["你有本事找女人，你有本事开门啊！"] = "If you have the ability to find a woman, you have the ability to open the door!",
    ["你有梦想吗"] = "Do You Have a Dream",
    ["你有梦想吗？你的梦想是什么？"] = "Do you have a dream? What is your dream?",
    ["你有没有"] = "Have you",
    ["你有没有幻想过自己成为书里的角色？高贵美丽的公主、勇武过人的骑士、自由自在的海盗……每个人都会在书里找到自己想成为的角色吧？"] = "Have you ever imagined yourself as a character in a book? A noble and beautiful princess, a valiant and peerless knight, a carefree pirate... Everyone finds a character they want to be in a book, right?",
    ["你有没有想过，沉睡症有多种原因，菲丽丝是哪一种？"] = "Have you ever thought that there are many causes for sleeping sickness, which one is Phyllis's?",
    ["你有没有考虑过！我们要是放过他，我们可就没命了！"] = "Have you considered! If we let him go, we'll be the ones who lose our lives!",
    ["你有没有见过……"] = "Have you ever seen...",
    ["你有没有闻到？周围有一阵酒香。"] = "Did you smell it? There is a scent of wine around.",
    ["你有猜想了吗？向前走走看。"] = "Do you have a guess? Walk forward and see.",
    ["你有种特别的气质。"] = "You have a special temperament.",
    ["你有空的话，可以进去给夏尔夫先生帮忙。"] = "If you have time, you can go in and help Mr. Scharf.",
    ["你有见过一只黑白大狗吗？前两天维纳出去玩却再也没回来……"] = "Have you seen a big black and white dog? Vina went out to play two days ago and never came back...",
    ["你有队友在副本中，请先让他们退出副本，在重新点击<Highlight_L>世界灾厄</>按钮"] = "You have teammates in the dungeon; please have them exit the dungeon first, then click the <Highlight_L> World Calamity </> button again.",
    ["你服务态度也太差了吧，女士。"] = "Your service attitude is terrible, miss.",
    ["你本该……是最鲜艳的那一笔……"] = "You were supposed to be... the most vivid stroke...",
    ["你杀了一个弗萨克新兵，这就是你恐惧的来源吗？"] = "You killed a Feysac recruit; is that the source of your fear?",
    ["你来了……"] = "You've come...",
    ["你来了…… 你终于来了…… 门在天上…… 别回头…… 你是逃脱不了的！！！！！"] = "You're here... You're finally here... The Door is in the sky... Don't look back... You can't escape it!!!!!",
    ["你来了。"] = "You're here.",
    ["你来了。收到那封信的人，都有着被女神眷顾的灵魂。"] = "You have come. Those who receive that letter all have souls favored by the Goddess.",
    ["你来了！"] = "You're here!",
    ["你来了，想必你已经见过那些奇异的漂浮物了，教会称它们为“异象之物”。\n如果你收集到了一些，可以交付给我。"] = "You're here. I presume you have already seen those strange floating objects; the Church calls them 'Object of Phenomenon'. \n If you have collected some, you can deliver them to me.",
    ["你来了，看这起报道：“凌晨码头区一家制铅工厂发生爆炸。”我们怀疑这就是廷根市隐藏的黑市交易地点。"] = "You're here. Look at this report: \"An explosion occurred at a lead factory in the Dock area early this morning.\" We suspect this is the hidden black market trading location in Tingen.",
    ["你来了，要开始拍照吗？"] = "You're here, want to start taking photos?",
    ["你来了，议院治安队那群骗子又要通过演讲来欺骗市民获得支持了，我希望可以借机刺杀掉演讲的骗子。"] = "You've come; those liars from the Council's security team are going to use speeches to deceive citizens and gain support again. I hope to take this opportunity to assassinate the liar giving the speech.",
    ["你来了，雷电灵性将在此地降落，我们需要你的帮助。"] = "You've come; the lightning spirituality will descend here, and we need your help.",
    ["你来了？刚好跟着我！"] = "You're here? Just follow me!",
    ["你来做安西娅的木偶吧！"] = "You come be Anthea's puppet!",
    ["你来做瞭望塔，我做船员，就从……大副开始做好了！"] = "You be the Watchtower, I'll be the crew, let's start from... First mate!",
    ["你来到现实，我对你进行了一周的心理治疗后，才在刚刚唤醒你。"] = "You arrived in reality, and after a week of psychotherapy, I just woke you up.",
    ["你来得很准时。"] = "You are very punctual.",
    ["你来得很快，再往前走就是那位卧底的祖宅了。"] = "You're fast. A little further ahead is the undercover agent's ancestral home.",
    ["你来得晚，那是几年前的事情了。"] = "You're late; that happened several years ago.",
    ["你来得正是时候！"] = "You came at the perfect time!",
    ["你来得比我预想的要快。"] = "You arrived faster than I expected.",
    ["你来抓我呀！"] = "Catch me if you can!",
    ["你来指挥，我们跟随你。"] = "You command, we follow.",
    ["你来推动这一切……"] = "You are the one driving all of this...",
    ["你来晚了……你真是一个厉害的猎手，勇敢，细心……"] = "You're late... you really are a formidable hunter, brave, meticulous...",
    ["你来洗牌 切牌"] = "You shuffle the cards, cut the cards",
    ["你来洗牌、切牌，要占卜什么？"] = "You shuffle and cut the cards. What do you want to divine?",
    ["你来看我演出不会被拍到吧，最近可是你的竞选关键期。"] = "You coming to see my performance won't get you photographed, right? This is your critical campaign period.",
    ["你来过这里？"] = "Have you been here before?",
    ["你来这里多久啦？"] = "How long have you been here?",
    ["你来，这里多了新的<P_Yellow>遗书</>，可能是为庆典准备的。"] = "Come here, there are new <P_Yellow> suicide notes </> here. They might be prepared for the celebration.",
    ["你果然又在这喝酒。"] = "You're drinking here again, as expected.",
    ["你果然在家。是雪莉拜托我来和你聊聊的。雪莉说过你们的事，为什么你不愿意见她呢？"] = "You really are at home. Shirley asked me to come and talk to you. Shirley told me about your situation; why don't you want to see her?",
    ["你果然来了，很高兴能够再见面，我的新同事。"] = "You really did come. I'm very happy to see you again, my new colleague.",
    ["你查到什么了吗？后来那六个自杀者是谁救下的？"] = "Did you find anything? Who saved the six suicide victims later?",
    ["你根本不清楚我经历过怎样的痛苦……"] = "You have no idea what kind of pain I've experienced...",
    ["你根本不知道为什么……"] = "You have no idea why...",
    ["你根本不知道自己带回来了什么。"] = "You have no idea what you've brought back.",
    ["你正在穿越历史的迷雾"] = "You are traversing the mists of history",
    ["你正处于疯狂状态，无法决斗"] = "You are in a state of madness; cannot duel.",
    ["你死了，不过没关系，这只是一场梦，以后对猪好一点"] = "You died, but it doesn't matter, this is just a dream, be nicer to pigs in the future",
    ["你母亲生病的时候，你还在马场里砸钱呢！"] = "When your mother was sick, you were still throwing money away at the racecourse!",
    ["你每天早上一杯咖啡，雷打不动，怎么不说手头紧？没有咖啡，你连机器都开不动，别以为我不知道！"] = "You have a cup of coffee every morning, without fail, how can you say you're tight on cash? Without coffee, you can't even start the machines, don't think I don't know!",
    ["你每天都这样精打细算？"] = "Do you calculate like this every day?",
    ["你比我想象中能干。"] = "You are more capable than I imagined.",
    ["你比预期来得晚了一点，遇到什么麻烦了吗？"] = "You're a little later than expected. Did you run into any trouble?",
    ["你永远可以放心将背后交予它。"] = "You can always safely entrust your back to it.",
    ["你没事吧！"] = "Are you alright!",
    ["你没事吧？"] = "Are you okay?",
    ["你没听过那句话吗？被关起来的鸟没有价值。"] = "Haven't you heard that saying? A caged bird has no value.",
    ["你没有伤害别人，危险的其实是你自己。"] = "You haven't hurt anyone; the one in danger is actually you.",
    ["你没有做错。不过随着序列晋升，人性的情感会越来越稀缺，你需要警惕。"] = "You did nothing wrong. However, as your Sequence advances, human emotions will become increasingly scarce; you need to be vigilant.",
    ["你没有关注任何商品"] = "You are not following any items",
    ["你没有去过那地方吧。"] = "You haven't been to that place, have you?",
    ["你没有去过那地方吧？站在巨大的钟下，感觉自己不过是世界上最不起眼的一只甲壳虫，在灰尘里爬来爬去。"] = "You haven't been to that place, have you? Standing under the giant bell, feeling like you're just the most insignificant beetle in the world, crawling around in the dust.",
    ["你没有取得路人的信任，再试试吧。"] = "You didn't gain the passerby's trust, try again.",
    ["你没有团队，无法邀请"] = "You do not have a team; cannot invite.",
    ["你没有学会崩塌的教训，正在废墟中建立新的囚笼。历史正在重演，警惕重蹈覆辙。 "] = "You have not learned the lesson of the collapse and are building a new cage in the ruins. History is repeating itself; beware of repeating the same mistakes.",
    ["你没有忘记。只是暂时想不起来。"] = "You didn't forget. You just couldn't remember for a while.",
    ["你没有监视他吗？"] = "Didn't you monitor him?",
    ["你没有被扭曲认知？"] = "Your cognition wasn't distorted?",
    ["你没有计划……为什么也能找到方向？"] = "You don't have a plan... why can you find the direction?",
    ["你没有错过。曾经的你，已经回来过了。 "] = "You didn't miss it. The you from the past had already returned.",
    ["你没有问过他最近变化的原因吗？"] = "Didn't you ask him the reason for his recent changes?",
    ["你没见过流浪儿的住所吗？"] = "Have you never seen a homeless child's residence?",
    ["你没错，但你敢相信吗？他装病这么久，却直到入狱检查时，才发现自己真的身患重疾！"] = "You aren't to blame, but would you believe it? He faked illness for so long that it wasn't until his medical checkup in prison that he discovered he was actually suffering from a serious disease!",
    ["你没错，该团伙在地下市场购买了能迷惑人心的违禁香水，就算是女神来也会被蒙蔽！"] = "You are right, the gang bought forbidden perfume that can confuse people's minds in the underground market, even the Goddess would be deceived!",
    ["你没问题的，克里斯！"] = "You can do it, Chris!",
    ["你渴望的不止这些，\r\n对吧？"] = "You crave more than this, don't you?",
    ["你熟知贝茨太太的弱点，出现在这并不是偶然。"] = "You know Mrs. Bates's weaknesses well; your appearance here is no coincidence.",
    ["你爱的是他的灵魂，不要在意这些细节。"] = "You love his soul; don't worry about these details.",
    ["你父亲我年轻的时候……嗝，一天就能卖出5担鳕鱼……"] = "When your father was young... *hic*, I could sell 5 loads of cod in a single day...",
    ["你父亲生前可是条硬汉，向他学着点！"] = "Your father was a tough man when he was alive, learn from him!",
    ["你父母不在吗？怎么留你一个人在这里？"] = "Are your parents not here? Why are you left here alone?",
    ["你父母呢"] = "Where are your parents?",
    ["你牺牲那年他刚7岁，这样的信任是不是太沉重了？"] = "He was only 7 when you sacrificed yourself. Isn't such trust too heavy?",
    ["你犯规啦！"] = "You broke the rules!",
    ["你猜我会收到什么礼物呢？"] = "Guess what gift I will receive?",
    ["你猜猜"] = "Guess",
    ["你猜的没错，那个黑斑青蛙并不只是传说里的噱头。事实上，它是一个我很熟悉的东西。"] = "You guessed right; that black-spotted frog isn't just a gimmick from legends. In fact, it's something I'm very familiar with.",
    ["你现在不在厂里。你在街上。路灯很亮，风很凉。你活着，你没事。"] = "You are not at the factory now. You are on the street. The streetlights are bright, the wind is cool. You are alive, you are alright.",
    ["你现在可以向尊敬的阿罗德斯大人问好了。"] = "You may now greet the honorable Mr. Arrodes.",
    ["你现在已经是非凡者了，但如何真正掌握魔药的力量，还需要你自己去挖掘它的象征意义。在这个过程中，你要小心规避失控的风险。"] = "You are already a Beyonder now, but how to truly master the power of the potion still requires you to dig into its symbolic meaning yourself. In this process, you must be careful to avoid the risk of loss of control.",
    ["你现在看到的每一个角落，都可能藏着一段历史留下的痕迹。它们正在慢慢消散，但如果你用灵性底片拍下来，就能保留下这些痕迹。"] = "Every corner you see now may hide traces left by history. They are slowly dissipating, but if you take a picture with a spirituality negative, you can preserve these traces.",
    ["你现在还很虚弱，先喝下这个，我再向你解释。"] = "You are still very weak. Drink this first, and then I will explain it to you.",
    ["你现在连埃文医生都开始怀疑了。"] = "You've even started suspecting Dr. Evan now.",
    ["你现在需要休息，我先带你回黑荆棘。"] = "You need to rest now. I'll take you back to Blackthorn first.",
    ["你生前常来教堂吗？"] = "Did you come to the church often when you were alive?",
    ["你用双手堵住了通往救赎的大门，拒绝接受改变的可能。执念让你成为了自己的囚徒。 "] = "You have blocked the door to redemption with your own hands, refusing to accept the possibility of change. Obsession has made you a prisoner of yourself.",
    ["你用自己的能力帮助别人，这不是坏事。"] = "Using your own abilities to help others is not a bad thing.",
    ["你疯了吗，去哪里烧？我们之间有人愿意，哪怕只是碰他吗？在这里？在孩子们面前把他烧成灰？"] = "Are you crazy? Where would we burn him? Is there anyone among us willing to even touch him? Here? Burn him to ashes in front of the children?",
    ["你的%s%s已上线"] = "Your %s %s has come online.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>净化了<Chat_Red>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> purified <Chat_Red> %s </>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对<Chat_Red>%s</>造成了<Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight>%s</> dealt <Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</> to <Chat_Red>%s</>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对<Chat_Red>%s</>造成了<Chat_Red>%d</>点%s%s伤害<Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight>%s</> dealt <Chat_Red>%d</> points of %s%s damage to <Chat_Red>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对<Chat_Red>未知目标</>造成了<Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </> to the unknown target <Chat_Red> </>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对<Chat_Red>未知目标</>造成了<Chat_Red>%d</>点%s%s伤害<Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Red> %d </> points of %s %s damage to the unknown target <Chat_Red> </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>治疗<Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Green>%d</>生命<Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> healed <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Green> %d </> Health <Chat_Highlight> %s </>.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>治疗<Chat_Highlight>未知目标</><Chat_Green>%d</>生命<Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> healed <Chat_Highlight> unknown target </> <Chat_Green> %d </> Health <Chat_Highlight> %s </>.",
    ["你的“混乱”大剑被吸走了！"] = "Your \"Chaos\" Greatsword has been absorbed!",
    ["你的“秩序”大剑被吸走了！"] = "Your \"Order\" Greatsword has been absorbed!",
    ["你的“释怀”是这么耀眼——"] = "Your \"relief\" is so dazzling—",
    ["你的主人也是非凡者吗？委托你收集素材的人也是她？"] = "Is your owner also a Beyonder? Is she the one who commissioned you to collect materials?",
    ["你的亲爱的"] = "Your Dear",
    ["你的伙伴们也将与你并肩作战，共同净化岛屿中的污染，需要小心其中更加危险的精英岛屿。努力净化更多的污染岛屿，朝着最终的目的地进发。"] = "Your partners will also fight alongside you to purify the pollution on the islands together. Be careful of the even more dangerous elite islands. Strive to purify more polluted islands and head toward the final destination.",
    ["你的伙伴前来助力\n恭喜你获得了一次额外的<Highlight>重掷</>机会"] = "Your partner has arrived to assist \n Congratulations on obtaining an extra <Highlight> Reroll </> opportunity",
    ["你的伤还好吗？"] = "Is your injury okay?",
    ["你的俱乐部获得了%d俱乐部资金"] = "Your club has received %d club funds.",
    ["你的到来让周围的景色都黯然失色！"] = "Your arrival makes the surrounding scenery pale in comparison!",
    ["你的即兴表演违背了戏剧的情节发展，请重新选择。"] = "Your improvisation violates the plot development of the play, please choose again.",
    ["你的叔叔叫什么名字？"] = "What is your uncle's name?",
    ["你的口才真好！我也没法讲得更好了！看看那些工人，好像真的懂了什么似的！"] = "You are so eloquent! I couldn't have said it better myself! Look at those workers, they seem to have actually understood something!",
    ["你的叫卖……很特别。"] = "Your hawking... is very unique.",
    ["你的同伴们，还有你说的封印物，都一直留在金秋湖，一直庇护这片大地。"] = "Your companions, and the Sealed Artifact you mentioned, have all remained at Golden Autumn Lake, always protecting this land.",
    ["你的名字"] = "Your Name",
    ["你的命运里怎么弥漫着灰雾？！"] = "Why is your destiny permeated with gray fog?!",
    ["你的命运，与背叛者们同流。"] = "Your fate is aligned with the traitors.",
    ["你的品质令人钦佩，顾问{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Your character is admirable, Consultant {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["你的善良，你的软弱……"] = "Your kindness, your weakness...",
    ["你的喜好还挺特别……到底是什么宠物？"] = "Your preferences are quite unique... what kind of pet is it exactly?",
    ["你的坚盾，你的堡垒，你最忠实的伙伴。你的利剑，你的先锋，你最勇敢的战友。"] = "Your shield, your fortress, your most loyal partner. Your sharp sword, your vanguard, your bravest comrade-in-arms.",
    ["你的大臣们很好地履行着职责，你也尽全力保护了他们，你值得成为他们的国王。"] = "Your ministers are performing their duties well, and you have done your best to protect them; you deserve to be their king.",
    ["你的失控值增加到%d点。你变得越来越不像自己。"] = "Your loss of control value increased to %d points. You are becoming less and less like yourself.",
    ["你的失控值增加到%d点。感觉身体有些不受控制。"] = "Your loss of control value increased to %d points. You feel your body is somewhat out of control.",
    ["你的失控值增加到%d点。灵性开始枯竭。"] = "Your loss of control value increased to %d points. Spirituality is beginning to dry up.",
    ["你的失控值增加到%d点。耳畔响起一些未曾听过的声音。"] = "Your loss of control value increased to %d points. Some unheard voices echoed in your ears.",
    ["你的头发都吹到我脸上了。"] = "Your hair is blowing into my face.",
    ["你的头突然很痛。\n与此同时，一阵红雾从你身上逸散而出。"] = "Your head suddenly aches violently. \n Meanwhile, a burst of red fog dissipates from your body.",
    ["你的妈妈……"] = "Your mom...",
    ["你的妈妈一定很爱你。"] = "Your mother must have loved you very much.",
    ["你的妻子呢？你的孩子呢？你就这样丢下她们吗？"] = "What about your wife? What about your children? Are you just going to leave them behind like this?",
    ["你的存在正在向“概念”靠拢，能力涉及因果、命运或法则层面，凡物难以理解。"] = "Your existence is approaching a 'concept', and your abilities involve the level of cause and effect, fate, or laws, which are difficult for mortal things to understand.",
    ["你的家族已在响应阶段，无法申请或响应其他家族"] = "Your Family is in the response phase; cannot apply or respond to other Families.",
    ["你的家族成员%s已加入队伍"] = "Your family member %s has joined the team.",
    ["你的序列这么暴力？"] = "Is your Sequence that violent?",
    ["你的开麦权限已被房主取消"] = "Your microphone permission has been revoked by the room owner.",
    ["你的开麦申请已被房主拒绝"] = "Your microphone application has been rejected by the room owner.",
    ["你的弈子们增加15%攻击速度和15%生命值。"] = "Your pieces gain 15% Attack Speed and 15% Max Health.",
    ["你的弈子们增加15%防御和15%生命值。"] = "Your pieces gain 15% Defense and 15% Max Health.",
    ["你的弈子们获得10%伤害减免。"] = "Your pieces gain 10% Damage Reduction.",
    ["你的弈子们获得12%伤害增幅。"] = "Your chess pieces gain 12% damage amplification.",
    ["你的弈子们获得12%攻击速度。"] = "Your pieces gain 12% Attack Speed.",
    ["你的弈子们获得6%伤害减免。"] = "Your pieces gain 6% Damage Reduction.",
    ["你的弈子们获得6%攻击速度。"] = "Your pieces gain 6% Attack Speed.",
    ["你的弈子们获得7%伤害增幅。"] = "Your chess pieces gain 7% damage amplification.",
    ["你的恐惧能完全压倒你对雪莉的爱吗？"] = "Can your fear completely overwhelm your love for Shirley?",
    ["你的想法和戴莉很像啊，她一直说要做个真正的通灵者。"] = "Your thinking is very similar to Daly's; she always says she wants to be a real Spirit Medium.",
    ["你的意思是我们现在该去试炼场互殴？"] = "Do you mean we should go to the training grounds and beat each other up now?",
    ["你的意思是，超凡因素存在于劳维斯太太被拍的那一下，来源于那位有着纤细之手的小姐或者女士。"] = "You mean, the supernatural factor existed in the pat Mrs. Lauwis received, coming from that lady or miss with the slender hands.",
    ["你的意思是，这道菜不是库克自己做的？"] = "You mean, this dish wasn't made by Cook himself?",
    ["你的意思是？"] = "What do you mean?",
    ["你的战斗技巧还要补补课呢。"] = "Your combat skills still need some remedial lessons.",
    ["你的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>不幸被<PVPHighlight>%s</>的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>击败，失去得分能力"] = "Your projection <PVPHighlight>%s</> was unfortunately defeated by <PVPHighlight>%s</>'s projection <PVPHighlight>%s</>, losing scoring ability.",
    ["你的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>击败了<PVPHighlight>%s</>的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>，获得<PVPHighlight>%s</>分"] = "Your projection <PVPHighlight>%s</> defeated <PVPHighlight>%s</>'s projection <PVPHighlight>%s</>, obtained <PVPHighlight>%s</> points.",
    ["你的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>助攻击败了<PVPHighlight>%s</>的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>，获得<PVPHighlight>%s</>分"] = "Your projection <PVPHighlight>%s</> assisted in defeating <PVPHighlight>%s</>'s projection <PVPHighlight>%s</>, obtained <PVPHighlight>%s</> points.",
    ["你的投影<PVPHighlight>%s</>在第<PVPHighlight>%s</>轮战斗存活到了最后，获得<PVPHighlight>%s</>分"] = "Your projection <PVPHighlight>%s</> survived until the end in the <PVPHighlight>%s</> round of battle, obtained <PVPHighlight>%s</> points.",
    ["你的损失。"] = "Your loss.",
    ["你的搭讪技巧一直这么烂吗？"] = "Are your pickup lines always this bad?",
    ["你的搭配，比这片终年不化的白雪更令人印象深刻。来吧，让我看看，你会如何诠释属于雪境的品鉴方式。"] = "Your outfit is more impressive than this eternal white snow. Come on, let me see how you interpret the way of appreciation belonging to the snow realm.",
    ["你的擦鞋工具什么时候才回来？"] = "When will your shoe-shining kit be back?",
    ["你的攻击会给目标添加光明印记，攻击带有光明印记的单位时，将回复自身最大生命值0.2%的血量，回复效果每0.5秒最多触发一次。"] = "Your attacks will add a Mark of Light to the target. When attacking a unit with a Mark of Light, you will recover 0.2% of your Max Health. The healing effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds.",
    ["你的攻击会给目标添加光明印记，攻击带有光明印记的单位时，将回复自身最大生命值0.3%的血量，回复效果每0.5秒最多触发一次。"] = "Your attacks apply a Mark of Light to the target. Attacking units with a Mark of Light recovers 0.3% of your maximum Health. This recovery effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds.",
    ["你的攻击有10%概率引动星象师的法术，召唤一道流星攻击，对目标周围半径4米内的敌人造成伤害，此效果每2秒最多触发一次。"] = "Your attacks have a 10% chance to trigger the spell of an Astrologer, summoning a meteor to attack, dealing damage to enemies within a 4-meter radius of the target. This effect can trigger at most once every 2 seconds.",
    ["你的攻击有5%概率给目标附加痛苦魔女的感染，在 8 秒内对目标造成持续伤害。"] = "Your attacks have a 5% chance to apply a Pain Witch infection to the target, dealing Continuous Damage to the target over 8 seconds.",
    ["你的攻击有几率引动星象师的法术，召唤一道流星攻击，对目标周围半径3米内的敌人造成伤害。"] = "Your attacks have a chance to trigger the Astrologer's spell, summoning a meteor to attack, dealing damage to enemies within a 3-meter radius of the target.",
    ["你的攻击有几率给目标附加痛苦魔女的感染，在 8 秒内对目标造成持续伤害"] = "Your attacks have a chance to inflict the Pain Witch's infection on the target, dealing continuous damage over 8 seconds.",
    ["你的攻击逐渐揭露目标的弱点，只待合适的时机，对其发起关键一击。"] = "Your attacks gradually reveal the target's weaknesses, waiting for the right moment to launch a critical hit.",
    ["你的故事，是我见过最明亮的太阳。"] = "Your story is the brightest sun I have ever seen.",
    ["你的数值增加了！（+1体力+1臣民怨气）"] = "Your stats have increased! (+1 Stamina, +1 Subject Resentment)",
    ["你的数值增加了！（+1社交+1臣民怨气）"] = "Your stats have increased! (+1 Social, +1 Subject Resentment)",
    ["你的数值增加了！（+1魅力+1臣民怨气）"] = "Your stats have increased! (+1 Charm, +1 Subject Resentment)",
    ["你的数值增加了！（+2臣民怨气）"] = "Your stats have increased! (+2 Subject Resentment)",
    ["你的朋友"] = "Your friend",
    ["你的朋友失踪了？"] = "Your friend went missing?",
    ["你的朋友是谁？长什么样？"] = "Who is your friend? What do they look like?",
    ["你的本色"] = "Your true colors",
    ["你的板车上有黑荆棘的标志，你是值夜者？"] = "There's a Blackthorn symbol on your cart. Are you a Nighthawk?",
    ["你的歌声可以驱散所有负面影响 同时让人感到内心愉悦舒适"] = "Your singing voice can dispel all negative influences while making people feel joyful and comfortable inside",
    ["你的气色看起来很不错，斯林太太。"] = "You look like you're in good spirits, Mrs. Slin.",
    ["你的泰利"] = "Your Terry",
    ["你的消息果然很灵通，那你知道是谁订购的《调教的艺术》吗？"] = "You are indeed well-informed. Do you know who ordered \"The Art of Discipline\"?",
    ["你的灵体在被撕裂，装载了太多疯狂的碎片。"] = "Your spirit body is being torn apart, loaded with too many fragments of madness.",
    ["你的灵性也许在提醒你，这个人有异常，只是你下意识不去怀疑他，所以看不见他的样子。尝试看清这双手的主人。"] = "Perhaps your spirituality is reminding you that this person is abnormal, but you are subconsciously avoiding suspecting him, which is why you cannot see his appearance. Try to see the owner of these hands clearly.",
    ["你的灵性如同一面瞬间映照危险的明镜，在需要依靠直觉决断的关头，能提供超越理性的清晰指引。<Talent>基于【直觉】的检定时，获得优势</>。"] = "Your spirituality is like a mirror that instantly reflects danger. At critical moments when you need to rely on intuition to make decisions, it can provide clear guidance that transcends rationality. <Talent>When performing a check based on 【Intuition】, gain Advantage</>.",
    ["你的灵性果然很敏锐，这是你的奖励。"] = "As expected, your spirituality is very sensitive. Here is your reward.",
    ["你的灵性真敏锐，竟然能找出藏着的我。\n不如来玩一场捉迷藏吧，把附近的宝箱都找出来，就能开启我的宝藏。"] = "Your spirituality is truly sharp, to be able to find me hiding. \n Why not play a game of hide-and-seek? Find all the nearby treasure chests, and you can open my treasure.",
    ["你的灵性被封印，小心点！"] = "Your spirituality is sealed, be careful!",
    ["你的父亲？"] = "Your father?",
    ["你的物品并非凡物，自然仪式也要有相应的位格。而且，我隐约感觉，它也许能帮助“愚者”先生早日从沉眠中醒来。"] = "Your item is not an ordinary object, so naturally, the ritual must have a corresponding level. Moreover, I vaguely feel that it might help Mr. Fool wake up from His slumber sooner.",
    ["你的物品并非凡物，自然仪式也要有相应的位格。而且，我隐约感觉，它也许能帮助愚者先生早日从沉眠中醒来。"] = "Your item is no ordinary object, so the ritual must have a corresponding level of status. Furthermore, I have a vague feeling that it might help Mr. Fool wake up from his slumber sooner.",
    ["你的理解和接受能力一如既往地优秀。"] = "Your understanding and acceptance are as excellent as always.",
    ["你的生活"] = "Your life",
    ["你的眼前突然闪过许多画面，\n绯红的月亮、沾血的笔记……"] = "Many scenes suddenly flash before your eyes: \n a crimson moon, a blood-stained diary...",
    ["你的眼前，浮现出这片土地最有魅力的时刻。"] = "Before your eyes, the most charming moment of this land emerges.",
    ["你的确不是镇上的人……嗯，是我的表。"] = "You are indeed not from this town... Hmm, it is my watch.",
    ["你的礼物盒里是什么？"] = "What's in your gift box?",
    ["你的票位置很好 现在是我们的了"] = "Your seat is excellent. It's ours now.",
    ["你的笛子是哪里来的？它有什么作用？"] = "Where did you get your flute? What does it do?",
    ["你的翻盘计划是？"] = "What is your comeback plan?",
    ["你的能力显现独有的锋芒，非凡之处深入血肉，开始从“能力者”向“超凡者”迈进。"] = "Your abilities show a unique edge, and your extraordinary nature has penetrated your flesh and blood, beginning your transition from a 'power-user' to a 'Beyonder.'",
    ["你的脑海中闪过一段记忆，年轻的女工穿着这双舞鞋，纵身投向火炉之中。"] = "A memory flashes through your mind: the young female worker, wearing these dancing shoes, throws herself into the furnace.",
    ["你的脑海中闪过许多画面，被滞涩的人群、脸上涂着油彩的古怪小丑、疯狂的灰白怪物……这些是“他”的历史碎片。"] = "Many images flash through your mind: a crowd in stagnation, a strange clown with greasepaint on his face, a crazed gray-white monster... These are fragments of \"his\" history.",
    ["你的脑袋里一定冒出了很多问题？调查就是解答疑问的过程！"] = "Your head must be popping with questions? Investigation is the process of answering questions!",
    ["你的腿……"] = "Your leg...",
    ["你的腿……抱歉，我没发现……"] = "Your leg... I'm sorry, I didn't notice...",
    ["你的腿不疼了？"] = "Is your leg not hurting anymore?",
    ["你的舞伴已离开，是否要退出玩法？"] = "Your Dance Partner has left. Exit the mode?",
    ["你的舞台我做主"] = "Your Stage, My Rules",
    ["你的舞姿太惊艳啦~"] = "Your dance moves are stunning~",
    ["你的舞步，有什么特别的？"] = "What's so special about your dance moves?",
    ["你的薪水将立刻翻倍，达到每周6镑的程度，而且之后每年都会有一定程度的增长。"] = "Your salary will immediately double to 6 pounds per week, and it will increase to a certain extent every year thereafter.",
    ["你的表现非常出色，还亲手击杀了一位邪恶组织的成员。"] = "Your performance was excellent, and you personally killed a member of an evil organization.",
    ["你的视觉将暂时剥离于现实的表象。灵性与此地沉淀的历史孔隙产生短暂的共鸣。你的眼前，将浮现出这片土地最有魅力的时刻。"] = "Your vision will be temporarily detached from the appearance of reality. Spirituality resonates briefly with the historical gaps deposited here. Before your eyes, the most charming moments of this land will emerge.",
    ["你的誓约已和他人解约"] = "Your Covenant has been dissolved with another",
    ["你的誓约迎来新的羁绊"] = "Your Covenant has found a new bond",
    ["你的警察证呢？我只相信眼睛见到的，没有证件证明身份，你才是可疑的人吧。"] = "Where is your police badge? I only believe what I see with my own eyes. Without a badge to prove your identity, you are the suspicious one, aren't you?",
    ["你的计划里也没有海蒂扔戒指这一条。"] = "Heidi throwing the ring wasn't in your plan either.",
    ["你的记忆被“堕落母神”污染，因此精神状态非常不稳定。如果再遇到一次梦境污染，你可能会被祂的意志完全操控，陷入永恒的疯狂。"] = "Your memories have been corrupted by the \"Mother Tree of Desire,\" which is why your mental state is very unstable. If you encounter dream corruption again, you might be completely controlled by Her will and fall into eternal madness.",
    ["你的记忆？ "] = "Your memories?",
    ["你的诗，不该只待在这种地方。 "] = "Your poetry shouldn't just stay in a place like this.",
    ["你的话语能与倾听者灵性深处的频率共鸣，在至关重要的社交时刻，你的言辞拥有直抵人心的穿透力。<Talent>基于【魅力】的检定时，获得优势</>。"] = "Your words can resonate with the frequency of the listener's deep spirituality. At crucial social moments, your words have a penetrating power that reaches the heart. <Talent>When performing a check based on 【Charm】, gain Advantage</>.",
    ["你的责任是调查黛西小姐的案件，现在调查已经结束。"] = "Your responsibility was to investigate Miss Daisy's case, and now the investigation is over.",
    ["你的身上长出无形的神秘倒刺，反弹所受伤害的500%。"] = "Invisible, mysterious barbs grow on your body, reflecting 500% of the damage received.",
    ["你的身上，寄托了对抗末日的希望。"] = "You carry the hope of resisting the apocalypse.",
    ["你的身手不错，小伙子"] = "You've got good skills, young man",
    ["你的运气一向好，1350年弗萨克的飞空艇炸弹炸下来，你在现场也能逃脱。"] = "Your luck has always been good; even when a Feysac airship bomb fell in 1350, you managed to escape while being at the scene.",
    ["你的运气爆棚是指？"] = "What do you mean by explosive luck?",
    ["你的这个朋友……"] = "This friend of yours...",
    ["你的选择称得上出色，不过，“占卜家”的后续竟然是“小丑”，真是奇怪……感觉两者完全没关系。"] = "Your choice is excellent, though it's strange that the Seer's follow-up is Clown... it feels like the two have nothing to do with each other.",
    ["你的选择，让廷根工厂区发生了微妙的变化。"] = "Your choice has caused subtle changes in the Tingen factory district.",
    ["你的那些携带1件装备的弈子们会获得120生命值并且每秒恢复2法力值。"] = "Your pieces carrying 1 piece of equipment gain 120 Health and restore 2 Mana per second.",
    ["你的那些携带1件装备的弈子们会获得180生命值并且每秒恢复3法力值。"] = "Your pieces carrying 1 piece of equipment gain 180 Health and restore 3 Mana per second.",
    ["你的钱包，柔软又坚固的皮质外壳妥善保管着你的每一枚钱币，想买东西的时候就从里面拿钱吧。"] = "Your wallet; the soft yet sturdy leather shell properly keeps every one of your coins. Take money from it when you want to buy something.",
    ["你的闪电速度，来源于学徒途径的能力。"] = "Your lightning speed comes from the abilities of the Apprentice pathway.",
    ["你的队伍平均非凡评分未达推荐非凡评分，暂时无法组队匹配，建议和人机进行战斗或单独匹配"] = "Your team's average Beyonder rating does not meet the recommended rating. You cannot matchmake at this time. It is recommended to fight against AI or matchmake solo.",
    ["你的非凡之处开始稳定成型，学会以能力回应危险，也学会与风险共舞。"] = "Your extraordinary nature begins to stabilize, and you have learned to respond to danger with your abilities and dance with risk.",
    ["你的非凡评分未达推荐非凡评分，匹配时间可能较长，是否继续匹配？"] = "Your Beyonder rating does not meet the recommended rating, so matching may take longer. Do you want to continue matching?",
    ["你的顾客就在那边的盥洗室门口。"] = "Your customer is right there by the restroom door.",
    ["你的饮料大受欢迎，已经很厉害了。"] = "Your drink is very popular, that's already quite impressive.",
    ["你的魅力源于自己"] = "Your charm comes from yourself",
    ["你盘子里的柠檬蛋糕看起来很别致，是在哪家店买的呢？"] = "The lemon cake on your plate looks very unique; which shop did you buy it from?",
    ["你相信吗？只要我轻轻拍两下手背，一切的幽灵都会在我眼前显形，然后……全部消失。"] = "Do you believe it? As long as I gently clap the back of my hands, all ghosts will manifest before my eyes, and then... they will all disappear.",
    ["你看。"] = "Look.",
    ["你看上去已经知道“0”级封印物的危险性了。"] = "You seem to already know the danger of a Grade 0 Sealed Artifact.",
    ["你看上去很兴奋啊。"] = "You look very excited.",
    ["你看上去很难过，还好吗？"] = "You look very sad, are you okay?",
    ["你看上去有些苦恼？"] = "You look a bit troubled?",
    ["你看上去有点眼熟，我们见过？"] = "You look a bit familiar. Have we met?",
    ["你看不起谁？我敢说全廷根知识面最广的人就在你面前。"] = "Who are you looking down on? I dare say the person with the broadest knowledge in all of Tingen is right in front of you.",
    ["你看人的方式挺烦的。"] = "The way you look at people is quite annoying.",
    ["你看什么看？此路不通！看不见吗！"] = "What are you looking at? This road is blocked! Can't you see!",
    ["你看他们，饿的、病的、冷的……每一个都需要帮助。但你们帮得过来吗？"] = "Look at them, hungry, sick, cold... everyone needs help. But can you help them all?",
    ["你看出来什么没有……"] = "Did you see anything...",
    ["你看到了不该看的东西！"] = "You saw something you shouldn't have!",
    ["你看到了什么？"] = "What did you see?",
    ["你看到了埃莉诺的叶子，佐伊的冰山，埃德温的答案。你看到了他们为什么走进来。"] = "You saw Eleanor's leaves, Zoe's iceberg, Edwin's answer. You saw why they walked in.",
    ["你看到了自己气场的颜色 这就是灵视"] = "You see the color of your own aura. This is spirit vision.",
    ["你看到弗兰克吗？船刚靠岸，他就不见了，真令人担心。"] = "Have you seen Frank? He disappeared as soon as the ship docked. It's truly worrying.",
    ["你看到我旁边那位学员了吗？他总是待在那里不走，也许有什么烦恼想要倾诉。"] = "Do you see that student next to me? He always stays there and doesn't leave. Perhaps he has some troubles he wants to confide in someone.",
    ["你看到的颜色是你自己的气场，不同颜色有不同的含义，可以从中观察情绪或者身体状态。"] = "The colors you see are your own aura. Different colors have different meanings, and you can observe your emotions or physical state from them.",
    ["你看她多美……"] = "Look how beautiful she is...",
    ["你看它，它那么大，像一座会移动的海上宫殿。"] = "Look at it, it's so big, like a moving palace on the sea.",
    ["你看我的墓碑，就在你旁边。"] = "Look at my tombstone, right next to yours.",
    ["你看我，柔弱无法自理，如果得不到遗产，我恐怕就会死……"] = "Look at me, weak and unable to take care of myself. If I don't get the inheritance, I'm afraid I'll die...",
    ["你看旁边这个！你戏剧的海报！这不就是你被认可的证明吗？"] = "Look at this next to you! Your play's poster! Isn't this proof that you've been recognized?",
    ["你看清车身了吗？"] = "Did you see the car body clearly?",
    ["你看看就知道了。"] = "You'll see once you take a look.",
    ["你看着不像本地人，也是被宝藏传说骗来的？"] = "You don't look like a local. Were you also tricked by the treasure legends?",
    ["你看船头，体面的绅士怎么会允许自己这么狼狈！"] = "Look at the bow of the ship. How could a decent gentleman allow himself to be so disheveled!",
    ["你看见了祂们，祂们也看见了你。"] = "You see Them, and They also see you.",
    ["你看见他往哪里走了吗？"] = "Did you see which way he went?",
    ["你看起来不像这附近的教师。"] = "You don't look like a teacher from around here.",
    ["你看起来不太开心。"] = "You don't look very happy.",
    ["你看起来也有想忘记的东西。要不然……你不会在这里。"] = "You look like you have things you want to forget too. Otherwise... you wouldn't be here.",
    ["你看起来好惬意啊。没有课吗？"] = "You look so comfortable. No class?",
    ["你看起来对基金会很感兴趣，它曾是“愚者”先生创立的，位于贝克兰德北区，佩斯菲尔街22号，有机会你也可以去那里看一看。"] = "You seem very interested in the foundation. It was founded by Mr. Fool, located at 22 Pesez Street in the North Borough of Backlund. If you have the chance, you can go there and take a look.",
    ["你看起来对基金会很感兴趣，它曾是愚者先生创立的，位于贝克兰德北区，佩斯菲尔街22号，有机会你也可以去那里看一看。"] = "You seem very interested in the Foundation. It was founded by Mr. Fool and is located at 22 Phelps Street in the North Borough of Backlund. If you have the chance, you should go take a look.",
    ["你看起来很洒脱，完全不像一个阴魂不散的魂灵。"] = "You look very carefree, not at all like a lingering spirit.",
    ["你看起来很生气啊"] = "You look very angry",
    ["你看起来很疲惫。"] = "You look very tired.",
    ["你看起来心情不太好？"] = "You don't seem to be in a good mood?",
    ["你看起来心情不好，遇到什么事了吗？"] = "You look like you're in a bad mood. Did something happen?",
    ["你看起来有些……憔悴。里面发生了什么？"] = "You look a bit... haggard. What happened in there?",
    ["你看起来还算精干……无所谓了，只要能按照主题说上两句，30苏勒就到手了，不会有人在意那该死的抗议运动。"] = "You look capable enough... Never mind, as long as you can say a few words according to the theme, 30 Soles will be yours. No one will care about that damn protest movement.",
    ["你看起来遇到了麻烦。"] = "You look like you've run into trouble.",
    ["你看这日光。昨天，今天，明天，永恒的太阳高悬！"] = "Look at this sunlight. Yesterday, today, tomorrow, the Eternal Sun hangs high!",
    ["你看那个人……"] = "Look at that person...",
    ["你看那家餐厅，店主老维尔经常会分些东西给我吃。"] = "Look at that restaurant; the owner, Old Will, often shares some food with me.",
    ["你看那床前洒落的\n莫非是秋霜的痕迹？\n不，我亲爱的朋友\n那是月亮投下的温柔低语\n\n我不禁抬起双眼\n凝视那轮皎洁\n________________\n________________"] = "Could those scattered \n by the bedside be traces of autumn frost? \n No, my dear friend, \n those are gentle whispers cast by the moon. \n \n I cannot help but raise my eyes, \n gazing at that bright orb. \n ________________ \n ________________",
    ["你看错了"] = "You saw it wrong",
    ["你看，前面有好多花。"] = "Look, there are so many flowers ahead.",
    ["你看，前面这些还挺正常——“帮忙到邮局领取家人寄的书信”……"] = "Look, the ones at the beginning are quite normal—'Help pick up letters sent by family at the post office'...",
    ["你看，在这里，连摊主都不必时刻盯着摊位，这在之前是不可想象的。"] = "Look, here, even the stall owners don't have to stare at their stalls all the time, which was unimaginable before.",
    ["你看，我才听了一次就已经记住了。小巴特更加不会忘记你为他写的这首曲子！"] = "Look, I remembered it after hearing it just once. Little Bart will definitely not forget the song you wrote for him!",
    ["你看，我觉得这个更适合你。"] = "Look, I think this one suits you better.",
    ["你看，我面前这些卷心菜，看似朴素，却藏着你未曾知晓的非凡力量。我就是吃了它，才获得了平衡之力！"] = "Look, these cabbages in front of me, while seemingly simple, hide Beyonder powers you've never known. It was only after eating them that I gained the power of balance!",
    ["你看，知识！"] = "Look, knowledge!",
    ["你看，那个风车转起来了，我会召唤风了！这样，你是不是能带我去海上了？"] = "Look, the windmill is turning! I can summon the wind! With this, can you take me to the sea?",
    ["你看，里昂就是这么爱我。"] = "See, Leon loves me so much.",
    ["你真<P_Yellow>会说笑</>。"] = "You really {<P_Yellow>} know how to joke {</>}.",
    ["你真厉害。这很复杂吧？"] = "You're amazing. This must be complicated, right?",
    ["你真好！我也有礼物给你，等等我们就可以一起交换礼物了，想想就开心！"] = "You're so kind! I have a gift for you too, we can exchange gifts later, just thinking about it makes me happy!",
    ["你真是……唉，一会儿妻子又要骂你了！"] = "You really are... sigh, your wife is going to scold you in a bit!",
    ["你真是一个幸运的小伙，才加入我们多久，就能遇上价值200镑的委托。"] = "You really are a lucky lad. How long have you been with us, and you've already encountered a commission worth 200 pounds.",
    ["你真是个好人。"] = "You really are a good person.",
    ["你真是个热心的好人，不过已经很麻烦你了，我想我们可以解决的。"] = "You really are a kind and helpful person, but you've already been troubled enough, I think we can solve it.",
    ["你真是嘴甜……你觉得哪款更好看？"] = "You really have a sweet tongue... which one do you think looks better?",
    ["你真棒，奖励你和我一起写诗。"] = "You're great, I'll reward you by writing poetry with me.",
    ["你真正做到了！怎么样，还顺利吗？"] = "You really did it! How was it? Did it go smoothly?",
    ["你真的很纯粹。"] = "You are truly pure.",
    ["你真的想买“内部资料”吗？"] = "Do you really want to buy the 'insider materials'?",
    ["你真的是神使？！"] = "Are you really a divine messenger?!",
    ["你真的没事吗？有没有哪里不舒服？"] = "Are you really okay? Is there anywhere you feel uncomfortable?",
    ["你真的还在研究魔镜占卜？！风暴在上，你该知道那有多危险。"] = "Are you still researching Magic Mirror divination?! Storm above, you should know how dangerous that is.",
    ["你真该去做波拿巴餐厅做个美食评论家，这条鱼我也要了。"] = "You really should go to Bonaparte Restaurant and be a food critic. I'll take this fish too.",
    ["你真该去波拿巴餐厅做个美食评论家，这条鱼我也要了。"] = "You really should be a food critic at Bonaparte Restaurant. I'll take this fish too.",
    ["你着迷般紧盯着马桶深处，脑海一阵眩晕，栽入其中，失去了意识。"] = "You stare obsessively into the depths of the toilet, a wave of dizziness hits your mind, and you fall into it, losing consciousness.",
    ["你瞅瞅，这码头上的猫，全给我招来了，赶都赶不走！ "] = "Look at this, all the cats on the dock have been lured here by me, I can't drive them away!",
    ["你瞎了吗？没看到有人在清扫烟囱？"] = "Are you blind? Don't you see someone is cleaning the chimney?",
    ["你瞧见了吗？那儿有个没人的菜摊子。"] = "Do you see that? There's an unattended vegetable stall over there.",
    ["你瞧见那家伙了吧？古古怪怪的，说给点钱就能给你讲个什么大智慧。"] = "Did you see that guy? He's weird, saying he can tell you some great wisdom if you give him some money.",
    ["你瞧车站边上，帮着人提行李赚点小钱的也是他们。还有带路，递话，了解些本地消息。"] = "Look at the side of the station, those who help people carry luggage to earn a little money are also them. And guiding the way, delivering messages, knowing some local news.",
    ["你瞧，多有趣啊。一棵树，竟然要比人的记忆更加可靠。"] = "Look, how interesting. A tree is actually more reliable than human memory.",
    ["你瞧，老东西，咱们的结婚戒指又丢了。算了，过几天再找。"] = "Look, old man, our wedding ring is lost again. Never mind, we'll look for it in a few days.",
    ["你瞧，连路过的{{先生|女士}}都赞同我的建议。"] = "Look, even the passing {{Mr.|Ms.}} agrees with my suggestion.",
    ["你知不知道这一天我经历了什么？！我制定找戒指计划，翻遍了花海，趴在地上找了一天，还扔了他们的结婚戒指，而我的戒指一直在我口袋里！"] = "Do you have any idea what I've been through today?! I made a plan to find the ring, searched the entire flower field, spent the whole day crawling on the ground, and even threw away their wedding ring, all while my own ring was in my pocket the whole time!",
    ["你知晓世界真相后的表情，就是我玩这场游戏的目的。"] = "The expression on your face after knowing the truth of the world is the purpose of me playing this game.",
    ["你知道“扮演法”吧？“扮演法”通过解读魔药名称，获得其核心象征和具体意象，并在日常生活中与其贴合，总结出扮演守则。"] = "You know about the 'Acting Method', right? The 'Acting Method' involves interpreting the potion name, obtaining its core symbols and specific imagery, fitting into it in daily life, and summarizing the rules of Acting.",
    ["你知道一块三分熟的牛排和一块五分熟的牛排相遇，他们为什么不打招呼吗？"] = "Do you know why a medium-rare steak and a medium steak don't say hello when they meet?",
    ["你知道仪式魔法？"] = "You know about Ritual Magic?",
    ["你知道兜售考题是违法的吗？"] = "Do you know that selling exam questions is illegal?",
    ["你知道十六年前轰动了整个廷根市的那个连环杀手吗？"] = "Do you know about the serial killer who shocked the entire city of Tingen sixteen years ago?",
    ["你知道吗，最近新搬来了一个年轻姑娘。"] = "Do you know, a young lady just moved in recently.",
    ["你知道吗？“未来号”本身也是我的研究对象！"] = "Do you know? The \"Future\" itself is also the subject of my research!",
    ["你知道吗？奈拉小姐刚刚对我笑了，敷衍的一笑也是笑！"] = "Do you know? Miss Naila just smiled at me, a perfunctory smile is still a smile!",
    ["你知道奥黛丽小姐在里面做什么吗？不会好奇吗？"] = "Do you know what Miss Audrey is doing inside? Aren't you curious?",
    ["你知道就算把自己喝死，她也回不来了吧？"] = "You know that even if you drink yourself to death, she won't come back, right?",
    ["你知道开膛手杰克吗？"] = "Do you know Jack the Ripper?",
    ["你知道我在说什么，{{先生|女士}}。用用你们的气象仪或者别的，让我们卡普顿知道今天不应该出发！"] = "You know what I'm talking about, {{ Mr. | Ms. } }. Use your meteorological instruments or something else to let us at Kapton know that we shouldn't set off today!",
    ["你知道我在说什么，{{先生|女士}}。用用你们的气象仪或者别的，让我们船长知道今天不应该出发！"] = "You know what I'm talking about, {{ Mr.| Ms.}}. Use your astrolabe or something else to let our captain know that we shouldn't set sail today!",
    ["你知道我是谁？"] = "Do you know who I am?",
    ["你知道我的名字，你认识我？"] = "You know my name? Do you know me?",
    ["你知道我的名字？什么危险物品？我只是在这里卖花……你是说我的玫瑰是危险物品？"] = "You know my name? What dangerous items? I'm just selling flowers here... are you saying my roses are dangerous items?",
    ["你知道我离证明它只差最后一步了吗？"] = "Do you know that I am only one step away from proving it?",
    ["你知道我这辈子在哪里见到的穷人最多吗？"] = "Do you know where I've seen the most poor people in my life?",
    ["你知道我醒来的情景？<P_Heart>（愣了一下）</>哈哈，我懂了，你看到的是两个月前的“历史”，而“历史”也是他的权柄之一。"] = "You know the scene when I woke up? <P_Heart> (Stunned for a moment) </> Haha, I understand. What you saw was the \"history\" from two months ago, and \"history\" is also one of his authorities.",
    ["你知道最有趣的是什么吗？是我们家以前的房东弗兰奇先生。"] = "Do you know what the most interesting thing was? It was our former landlord, Mr. Frank.",
    ["你知道白天公园有场演出吗？"] = "Do you know there is a performance in the park during the day?",
    ["你知道的，你一直都想我考上好大学，希望我离开南区。"] = "You know, you've always wanted me to get into a good university, hoping I'd leave the South District.",
    ["你知道的，我不能独自留在这里。"] = "You know, I can't stay here alone.",
    ["你知道的，我并不擅长那些……"] = "You know, I'm not good at those...",
    ["你知道的，我根本不擅长应付孩子……"] = "You know I'm not good at dealing with children at all...",
    ["你知道的，我经常忘记一些事情，这给了他们可乘之机。"] = "You know, I often forget things, and this gave them an opportunity.",
    ["你知道的，现在非凡事件越来越多了，凡事小心。"] = "You know, there are more and more Beyonder incidents lately. Be careful with everything.",
    ["你知道的，老规矩。"] = "You know, the old rules.",
    ["你知道的，这种生日宴会上会有不少出色的小姐和女士参加。"] = "You know, there will be many outstanding young ladies and women attending this kind of birthday party.",
    ["你知道的，那些该死的非凡材料实在是太贵了！"] = "You know, those damn Beyonder materials are just too expensive!",
    ["你知道见老人摔倒不搀扶是违背道德的吗？"] = "Do you know that not helping an elderly person who has fallen is against morality?",
    ["你知道赛琳娜的<P_Yellow>神秘物品</>放在哪个房间吗？"] = "Do you know which room Selena's <P_Yellow>mystical item</> is in?",
    ["你知道赛琳娜的神秘物品放在哪个房间吗？"] = "Do you know which room Selena's mystical item is kept in?",
    ["你知道蹲着不能进行光合作用吧？"] = "You know you can't photosynthesize while squatting, right?",
    ["你知道这几天，证券交易所的人为什么这么多吗？是因为有一家老铁路公司，准备发新股。"] = "Do you know why there are so many people at the stock exchange these days? It's because an old railway company is preparing to issue new shares.",
    ["你知道，我这儿消息总是慢半拍。"] = "You know, my news is always a beat slow.",
    ["你知道？"] = "You know it?",
    ["你破坏了舞队！"] = "You ruined the dance formation!",
    ["你确定……要用生命换取窥见真理的机会吗？"] = "Are you sure... you want to trade your life for a chance to glimpse the truth?",
    ["你确定周围的朋友……还是他们自己吗？"] = "Are you sure the friends around you... are still themselves?",
    ["你确定要跳过吗？"] = "Are you sure you want to skip?",
    ["你确定要问我吗？毕竟，我只是一只失忆的猫。"] = "Are you sure you want to ask me? After all, I am just a cat with amnesia.",
    ["你确定霍克斯男爵回复了你？"] = "Are you sure Baron Hawkes replied to you?",
    ["你确定？"] = "Are you sure?",
    ["你离开了失序迷宫，进入春夜沙龙。"] = "You left the Disordered Maze and entered the Spring Night Salon.",
    ["你离开咖啡厅。\n展示廷根接头热闹景象。"] = "You leave the cafe. \nShow the bustling scene of Tingen streets.",
    ["你租这个房子花了和邻居一样的钱，你们是一样的，不需要因为别人的不礼貌而内疚。"] = "You paid the same rent for this house as your neighbors. You are the same; you don't need to feel guilty because of other people's rudeness.",
    ["你究竟是谁？"] = "Who exactly are you?",
    ["你穿戴的%s与%s不可同时穿戴，已自动脱下。"] = "The %s and %s you are wearing cannot be worn at the same time and have been automatically unequipped.",
    ["你窥见了镜中的身影，黑发褐瞳、神情惊恐。\n等等，这不是你！"] = "You catch a glimpse of a figure in the mirror, with black hair, brown eyes, and a terrified expression.\n Wait, that's not you!",
    ["你站在时代的浪潮之上，目睹潮汐的涌退。"] = "You stand on the tide of the era, witnessing the rise and fall of the tides.",
    ["你竟然利用你的亲妹妹……伊琳在这出戏里真情实感地度过了三十五年。"] = "To think you would use your own younger sister... Irene spent thirty-five years living through this play with genuine feelings.",
    ["你竟然相信帕里克？和我组队吧！"] = "You actually trust Palik? Team up with me!",
    ["你端详着手里的塔罗牌"] = "You examine the Tarot card in your hand",
    ["你端详着这张牌"] = "You examine this card",
    ["你笑着抿下最后一口咖啡，和大家一起收拾好杯具，黑荆棘又恢复了平时的模样。"] = "You smile as you sip the last of your coffee and tidy up the cups with everyone else, and Blackthorn returns to its usual state.",
    ["你简直无法想象，这么一个腼腆的少年，在最恶劣最绝望的时候，坚定地站在了众人前方。"] = "You can't imagine that such a shy boy stood firmly in front of everyone at the worst and most desperate moment.",
    ["你算了吧。"] = "Forget it.",
    ["你终于不想着离开廷根了，好事啊！买束花给莱丝莉，女孩子喜欢这个。"] = "You finally don't want to leave Tingen, that's a good thing! Buy a bouquet of flowers for Leslie; girls like that.",
    ["你终于取回秩序大剑。此时回到守序村，就能切断秩序之网的力量源头，解放混乱大剑。"] = "You have finally retrieved the Order Greatsword. Now, if you return to the Village of Order, you can cut off the source of the Web of Order's power and liberate the Chaos Greatsword.",
    ["你终于完成了这漫长的旅程，抵达成功之门。 回望来路，你值得所有的赞美。"] = "You have finally completed this long journey and reached the door of success. Looking back at the path you have traveled, you deserve all the praise.",
    ["你终于来了。"] = "You finally came.",
    ["你终于来了！"] = "You're finally here!",
    ["你终于来了！快快快，去那边，还好赶上了！"] = "You finally came! Hurry, hurry, hurry, go over there, good thing you made it!",
    ["你终于来了，情况还好吗？"] = "You're finally here. How is the situation?",
    ["你终于来了，最近的非凡案件数量越来越多，我们也需要更多的人手，辛苦你了！"] = "You're finally here. The number of Beyonder cases has been increasing recently, and we need more manpower. Thank you for your hard work!",
    ["你终于来了？"] = "You finally came?",
    ["你终于醒啦？"] = "You're finally awake?",
    ["你终于醒啦？你刚刚是在做梦吗？一直在说头好痛。"] = "You're finally awake? Were you having a nightmare just now? You kept saying your head hurt.",
    ["你终将折返。"] = "You will eventually return.",
    ["你经历了一场无法停歇的战斗。"] = "You have experienced a battle that cannot be stopped.",
    ["你给我下来！"] = "Get down here!",
    ["你给我小点声！总之，只有几个人见过她<P_Yellow>喝醉</>的样子。"] = "Keep your voice down! Anyway, only a few people have seen what she's like when she's <P_Yellow>drunk</>.",
    ["你给我等着！"] = "You just wait!",
    ["你给狒狒下药的时候，没留下什么马脚吧？"] = "You didn't leave any traces when you drugged the baboon, did you?",
    ["你给玫瑰留下了伤痕，她捂着伤口退入阴影，但你记得，玫瑰的根还在土里，她很快就会再开。"] = "You left a scar on the rose; she retreated into the shadows clutching her wound, but you remember that the rose's roots are still in the soil, and she will bloom again soon.",
    ["你给的工作，让他们死在机器旁边。你给的饭，让他们背一辈子的债。"] = "The work you gave them makes them die beside the machines. The food you gave them makes them carry debt for a lifetime.",
    ["你绝对想不到，这里被谜虫入侵了！"] = "You would never guess, this place has been invaded by Mystery Bugs!",
    ["你绞尽脑汁思考，这次炼药似乎可以回收一些药材…"] = "You racked your brains, and it seems this brewing session could recover some ingredients...",
    ["你绞尽脑汁思考，这次炼药似乎可以有更多收益…"] = "You racked your brains, and it seems this brewing session could yield more benefits...",
    ["你聊历史，她能接住；聊政治，她能接住；聊生意、聊艺术、聊哪家剧院新上演的戏……她都能接住。而且接得漂亮。"] = "You talk history, she can keep up; talk politics, she can keep up; talk business, art, which theater has a new play... she can keep up with it all. And she does it elegantly.",
    ["你肯定不知道，现在风靡鲁恩的投球运动，一开始来自金秋湖的一场儿童游戏。"] = "You probably don't know that the pitching sport currently sweeping Loen originated from a children's game at Golden Autumn Lake.",
    ["你肯定想不到那个幽灵有多威风！他就在古堡门口，穿着一身制服，走起路来皮靴啪嗒啪嗒的，就像……就像个刚打完胜仗的锡兵！"] = "You wouldn't believe how majestic that ghost is! He's right at the entrance of the ancient castle, wearing a uniform, his boots clicking as he walks, just like... just like a tin soldier who just won a battle!",
    ["你背后有双眼睛！"] = "There are eyes behind you!",
    ["你能不能帮我试探一下？"] = "Can you help me test the waters?",
    ["你能为我记录下这个时刻吗？"] = "Can you record this moment for me?",
    ["你能做到的！"] = "You can do it!",
    ["你能听见逝者的声音，却越来越难听见活人的。他们害怕你，觉得你身上带着死亡的气息。"] = "You can hear the voices of the deceased, but it's becoming increasingly difficult to hear the living. They fear you, feeling that you carry the aura of death.",
    ["你能在这里找到很多你想要的东西，消息、物品、悬赏，其他的你就自己去发掘吧。"] = "You can find many things you want here: news, items, bounties. You'll have to discover the rest yourself.",
    ["你能在这里找到很多你需要的东西，消息、物品、悬赏……其他的，自己去发掘吧。"] = "You can find many things you need here: news, items, bounties... as for the rest, go and discover it yourself.",
    ["你能帮我什么"] = "What can you help me with?",
    ["你能想象一位年长的病人突然向你展示了穿墙术的那种震撼吗？"] = "Can you imagine the shock of an elderly patient suddenly showing you the ability to walk through walls?",
    ["你能感受到吗？我总觉得……他，我的孩子就在这里。"] = "Can you feel it? I always feel that... he, my child, is right here.",
    ["你能打造神奇物品？"] = "Can you craft mystical items?",
    ["你能理解我的感受吗？"] = "Can you understand how I feel?",
    ["你能看出什么来？你们什么都不懂！"] = "What can you see? You don't understand anything!",
    ["你能看到“他们”吗？如果可以，请替我问声好吧。"] = "Can you see 'them'? If you can, please say hello for me.",
    ["你能看到我们？"] = "You can see us?",
    ["你能看到这段描述就证明有BUG，请汇报"] = "If you can see this description, it proves there is a BUG. Please report it.",
    ["你能看穿密室是伪造的，现场被改动过，连嫁祸仆人的手法都推理出来了，比那些只会盯着表面证据的蠢货强得多。"] = "You were able to see through the fact that the secret room was faked, that the scene had been tampered with, and you even deduced the method used to frame the servant. You are much better than those idiots who only stare at surface-level evidence.",
    ["你能看见我？"] = "You can see me?",
    ["你能窥见并触碰万物相连的灵体之线，锁定目标后，与其建立连接，最终接管其意识，使其成为你的秘偶，被你控制的单位将听从你的指令，谨慎使用这份主宰命运的力量。"] = "You can glimpse and touch the spirit body threads that connect all things. After locking onto a target, establish a connection with it, and eventually take over its consciousness, making it your marionette. The units controlled by you will follow your instructions; use this power to dominate fate with caution.",
    ["你脸红了，琼！女神会眷顾她在爱情上主动出击的信徒！"] = "You're blushing, Joan! The Goddess will favor her believers who take the initiative in love!",
    ["你自己抬头看啊！"] = "Look up yourself!",
    ["你自己进去吧 我去找西迦要的资料了"] = "You go in yourself; I'm going to find the files Xiga asked for.",
    ["你自己进去吧，我去找西迦要的资料了。"] = "You go in yourself, I'm going to get the documents Xiga asked for.",
    ["你自己？！"] = "You yourself?!",
    ["你获得了\"刺客\"途径序列7\"女巫\"的部分黑焰掌控力，伤害加深提高30%。深渊的灼热与冰霜缠绕着你的武器，焚烧一切阻碍。"] = "You have gained partial control over the Black Flame of the \"Assassin\" pathway, Sequence 7 \"Witch\", increasing Damage Increase by 30%. The scorching heat and frost of the Abyss entwine around your weapon, incinerating all obstacles.",
    ["你获得了\"怪物\"途径序列7\"幸运儿\"向上晋升后的部分命运感知，命中提高*d点。命运的河流在你眼前展开，你能隐约窥见敌人下一步的轨迹，仿佛命中注定般精准命中目标。"] = "You have gained some fate perception from the Monster pathway, Sequence 7, Lucky One, after advancement; Accuracy increased by *d points. The river of fate unfolds before your eyes, and you can vaguely glimpse the enemy's next trajectory, hitting the target with the precision of destiny.",
    ["你获得了\"怪物\"途径序列7\"幸运儿\"的部分命运感知，穿刺提高40%。你能隐约窥见敌人下一步的轨迹，仿佛命中注定般精准命中目标。"] = "You have gained some fate perception of the Monster Pathway Sequence 7, Lucky One, Pierce increased by 40%. You can faintly glimpse the trajectory of the enemy's next move, hitting the target with precision as if it were fated.",
    ["你获得了\"战士\"途径序列5\"守护者\"的部分防御权柄，格挡提高*d点。你的躯体如同钢铁铸就的城墙。"] = "You have gained some defense authority from the Warrior pathway, Sequence 5, Guardian; Block increased by *d points. Your body is like a wall cast from steel.",
    ["你获得了\"战士\"途径序列5\"守护者\"的部分防御权柄，格挡提高40%。你的躯体如同钢铁铸就的城墙。"] = "You have gained some defense authority of the Warrior Pathway Sequence 5, Guardian, Block increased by 40%. Your body is like a wall cast from steel.",
    ["你获得了\"战士\"途径序列6\"黎明骑士\"的部分剑术感悟，攻击提高30%。你的每一次挥击都如同破晓的晨曦般锐利，能撕裂黑暗的帷幕。"] = "You have gained some sword art insights of the Warrior Pathway Sequence 6, Dawn Knight, Attack increased by 30%. Every swing of yours is as sharp as the dawn of daybreak, capable of tearing through the veil of darkness.",
    ["你获得了\"战士\"途径序列6\"黎明骑士\"的部分剑术感悟，攻击提高45%。你的每一次挥击都如同破晓的晨曦般锐利，能撕裂黑暗的帷幕。"] = "You have gained some sword mastery insights from the Warrior pathway, Sequence 6, Dawn Knight; Attack increased by 45%. Every swing of yours is as sharp as the breaking dawn, capable of tearing through the veil of darkness.",
    ["你获得了\"魔女\"途径序列7\"女巫\"的部分黑焰掌控力，伤害加深提高30%。深渊的灼热与冰霜缠绕着你的武器，焚烧一切阻碍。"] = "You have gained some Black Flame control from the Witch pathway, Sequence 7, Witch; Damage Boost increased by 30%. The scorching heat and frost of the abyss entwine with your weapon, incinerating all obstacles.",
    ["你获得了%s"] = "You obtained %s",
    ["你获得了%s×<Chat_Highlight>%d</>。"] = "You obtained %s×<Chat_Highlight>%d</>.",
    ["你获得了%s。"] = "You obtained %s.",
    ["你获得了<Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s。"] = "You obtained <Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s.",
    ["你获得了<Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s（+<Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s）。"] = "You obtained <Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s (+<Chat_Highlight>%d</>%s).",
    ["你获得了“水手”途径的部分恩赐，冲刺不再有冷却限制"] = "You have gained some blessings of the \"Sailor\" pathway; sprinting no longer has a cooldown limit.",
    ["你获得了“水手”途径的部分恩赐，冲刺不再有冷却限制。"] = "You have gained part of the gift of the Sailor Pathway, sprinting no longer has a cooldown limit.",
    ["你获得了“观众”途径的部分心理暗示：你受到的治疗量增加40%，但你潜意识中不愿伤害他人，造成的治疗和伤害下降20%。"] = "You have gained some psychological suggestions from the \"Spectator\" pathway: the healing you receive is increased by 40%, but subconsciously you are unwilling to harm others, reducing the healing and damage you deal by 20%.",
    ["你获得了“观众”途径的部分心理暗示：你造成和受到的治疗量增加30%，但你潜意识中不愿伤害他人，暴击下降10%。"] = "You have gained part of the Psychological Suggestion of the Spectator Pathway: The healing you deal and receive is increased by 30%, but subconsciously you are unwilling to harm others, Critical Hit decreased by 10%.",
    ["你获得了仲裁人序列的能力，攻击时会产生一个领域，领域内己方暴击和伤害加深提高，敌方防御和格挡降低。"] = "You have gained the ability of the Arbiter Sequence. Attacking will create a field where your side's Critical Hit and damage are increased, and the enemy's Defense and Block are decreased.",
    ["你获得了仲裁人序列的能力，攻击时会产生一个领域，领域内己方暴击和伤害增幅提升，敌方防御力和格挡降低。"] = "You have gained the abilities of the Arbiter Sequence. Attacking creates a domain where your side's critical hit rate and damage are increased, while the enemy's Defense and Block are reduced.",
    ["你获得了巨人的形体，你的体型增大 100%，并且在战斗中会自动击退所有靠近你 1米以内的敌人。"] = "You have obtained the form of a Giant; your size increases by 100%, and you automatically knock back all enemies within 1 meter of you during combat.",
    ["你获得了巨人的形体，你的体型增大 100%，并且在战斗中每8秒击退所有靠近你 2米以内的敌人。"] = "You have gained the Giant's physique; your size increases by 100%, and you knock back all enemies within 2 meters of you every 8 seconds in combat.",
    ["你获得了灵界的援助，你攻击时，通灵巨兽有10%概率协助你进行攻击，此效果每5秒最多触发一次。"] = "You have gained the assistance of the Spirit World. When you attack, the Spirit Mediumship beast has a 10% chance to assist you in attacking. This effect can trigger at most once every 5 seconds.",
    ["你获得了灵界的援助，你攻击时，通灵巨兽有概率协助你进行攻击。"] = "You have gained the assistance of the Spirit World; when you attack, the Spirit Mediumship beast has a chance to assist you in attacking.",
    ["你获得了破晓勋章"] = "You have obtained the Dawn Medal",
    ["你获得了穿行空间的能力，战斗中每15秒，你会转移到另一个位面，受到的伤害大幅减少 ，持续 3 秒。"] = "You have gained the ability to travel through space. Every 15 seconds in battle, you will shift to another plane, and the damage received will be significantly reduced for 3 seconds.",
    ["你获得了门序列穿行空间的能力，战斗中，每隔一段时间，你会随机转移到另一个位面，受到的伤害减少 99%，持续 3 秒。"] = "You have gained the ability of the Door pathway to travel through space. In combat, at intervals, you will randomly shift to another plane, reducing damage taken by 99% for 3 seconds.",
    ["你被%s邀请加入了%s群组。"] = "You were invited by %s to join the %s group.",
    ["你被2-049盯上了，快远离队友！"] = "You have been targeted by 2-049; stay away from teammates!",
    ["你被一场危险的梦境困住了，那梦境中有来自邪神的污染。通过心理治疗，你成功控制了污染。"] = "You were trapped in a dangerous dream, and that dream contained corruption from an evil god. Through psychological treatment, you successfully controlled the corruption.",
    ["你被净化了，进入虚弱状态，攻击力降低*f**"] = "You have been purified, entering a state of Weakness, reducing Attack by *f**.",
    ["你被发现了。"] = "You have been discovered.",
    ["你被它欺负了？"] = "Were you bullied by it?",
    ["你被封印物2-049盯上了，<Dungeon_Highlight>呼叫队友点击按钮</>解救"] = "You have been targeted by Sealed Artifact 2-049, <Dungeon_Highlight> call a teammate to click the button </> to rescue you.",
    ["你被封印物2-049盯上了，<Dungeon_Highlight>尽快远离队友！</>"] = "You have been targeted by Sealed Artifact 2-049, <Dungeon_Highlight> stay away from your teammates as soon as possible! </>",
    ["你被欺负了？"] = "Were you bullied?",
    ["你被母亲眷顾了！"] = "You have been favored by the Mother!",
    ["你被洪流淹没了……"] = "You have been drowned by the torrent...",
    ["你被盯上了"] = "You are being watched",
    ["你被荆丛扎得满手是血。找一把【合适】的武器斩断它们吧。（提示：查看荆丛旁石柱上的刻字。）"] = "Your hands are covered in blood from the thicket. Find a [suitable] weapon to cut them down. (Hint: Check the inscription on the stone pillar next to the thicket.)",
    ["你被非凡力量影响了，失去了理智。"] = "You were affected by Beyonder powers and lost your sanity.",
    ["你被黑雾侵蚀，每秒会损失一定生命值。"] = "You are eroded by Black Fog, losing a certain amount of Health every second.",
    ["你要再苦着个脸，我就往你晚饭里加苦艾草！"] = "If you keep that sour face, I'll add wormwood to your dinner!",
    ["你要去廷根，就帮我顺路捎给他，怎么样？"] = "If you're going to Tingen, why don't you take them to him on your way?",
    ["你要找人？"] = "Are you looking for someone?",
    ["你要是不小心滑倒了，明天的头条就会是——"] = "If you slip and fall, tomorrow's headline will be—",
    ["你要是到占卜俱乐部，可以和前台安洁莉卡小姐说一声，是我介绍来的，我和她是朋友。"] = "If you go to the Divination Club, you can tell Ms. Angelica at the front desk that I introduced you. She and I are friends.",
    ["你要是想上去的话，那你找错人了。我不负责带路，也不负责引荐。"] = "If you want to go up there, you've asked the wrong person. I'm not in charge of guiding or making introductions.",
    ["你要是想买墓地的话，去门口问小科勒。"] = "If you want to buy a cemetery plot, go to the entrance and ask Little Kohler.",
    ["你要是没有活老鼠，就赶紧走，别惹麻烦！"] = "If you don't have live rats, get out quickly and don't cause trouble!",
    ["你要是碰巧在大学那边看见他，一定替我带声好。我灰头土脸，就不去那边给他丢人啦。"] = "If you happen to see him at the university, be sure to say hello for me. I'm a bit of a mess, so I won't go there and embarrass him.",
    ["你要晕船药吗？我这里有特效药。"] = "Do you want seasickness medicine? I have a special remedy here.",
    ["你要查询哪位首领的进度？"] = "Which leader's progress do you want to check?",
    ["你要爆炸了！快去请矮人将你带到空中！"] = "You are about to explode! Go ask the dwarf to take you into the air!",
    ["你要的货"] = "The goods you wanted",
    ["你要知道，我并不是真正的占卜家。"] = "You have to know, I am not a true Seer.",
    ["你要离开廷根？"] = "Are you leaving Tingen?",
    ["你要等一等 再等一等"] = "You have to wait a while, just wait a little longer.",
    ["你要跟我一起调查？你的任务呢？"] = "You want to investigate with me? What about your quest?",
    ["你要迟到了"] = "You're going to be late",
    ["你要问我廷根哪所大学更好的话，我当然会认为是咱们霍伊大学。"] = "If you ask me which university in Tingen is better, I would of course think it's our Hoy University.",
    ["你见到他的话，就让他快回家吧，再贪玩就会被妈妈揍了。"] = "If you see him, tell him to hurry home, or Mom will spank him for playing too much.",
    ["你见到的画面，或许是老尼尔心中最珍贵的回忆。"] = "The scene you saw was perhaps the most precious memory in Old Neil's heart.",
    ["你见证了贝茨太太的失控消亡，又亲身体验过非凡的可怕，应该明白，远离神秘世界，忘了今天发生的一切对你最好。"] = "You witnessed Mrs. Bates lose control and perish, and you have experienced the terror of the extraordinary yourself. You should understand that staying away from the mystical world and forgetting everything that happened today is best for you.",
    ["你见过她未婚夫？"] = "Have you seen her fiancé?",
    ["你见过她输吗？我可不跟你赌。"] = "Have you ever seen her lose? I'm not betting against you.",
    ["你观察得很仔细。"] = "You observe very carefully.",
    ["你觉得呢？"] = "What do you think?",
    ["你觉得怎么样？"] = "What do you think?",
    ["你觉得我们四个人谁写得最好？"] = "Who do you think writes the best among the four of us?",
    ["你觉得摇篮可能指什么？"] = "What do you think the cradle might refer to?",
    ["你觉得新警车怎么样？"] = "What do you think of the new police car?",
    ["你觉得知识是什么？"] = "What do you think knowledge is?",
    ["你觉得这只是恶作剧？那混蛋把我心爱的钓竿偷了，还毁掉了！"] = "You think this is just a prank? That bastard stole my beloved fishing rod and destroyed it!",
    ["你觉得这对吗？"] = "Do you think this is right?",
    ["你觉得这里谁最可疑？"] = "Who do you think is the most suspicious here?",
    ["你觉得，以他们的随性程度，会在意你的行为吗？"] = "Do you think, given how easygoing they are, they would even care about your actions?",
    ["你触碰了“窥秘人”的禁忌知识：造成的伤害增加30%，但你的身体变得如玻璃般脆弱，最大生命值降低15%。"] = "You have touched the forbidden knowledge of the \"Mystery Pryer\": damage dealt is increased by 30%, but your body becomes as fragile as glass, and your maximum Health is reduced by 15%.",
    ["你触碰了“隐秘学派”的禁忌知识：造成的伤害增加40%，但你的身体变得如玻璃般脆弱，最大生命值降低15%。"] = "You have touched the Forbidden Knowledge of the Hermit Order: Damage dealt increased by 40%, but your body has become as fragile as glass, Max Health decreased by 15%.",
    ["你认得他？"] = "You know him?",
    ["你认得我？"] = "You recognize me?",
    ["你认识<P_Yellow>韦尔奇</>吧？霍伊大学的毕业生，来自间海郡的康斯顿。"] = "You know <P_Yellow>Welch</>, right? A graduate of Hoy University, from Coniston in Midseashire.",
    ["你认识“大胃王”洛罗？"] = "Do you know 'Big Eater' Loro?",
    ["你认识他？他是一家俱乐部的工作主管，性格额……十分认真。"] = "You know him? He is a work supervisor at a club, his personality is, uh... very serious.",
    ["你认识我师父？"] = "You know my master?",
    ["你认识我？"] = "Do you know me?",
    ["你让我喝的其实不是茶，是非凡药剂吧？"] = "The tea you made me drink isn't actually tea, but a Beyonder potion, right?",
    ["你记住 你惹到猎龙帮了！"] = "Remember, you've messed with the Dragon Hunter Gang!",
    ["你记得吗？跪在这里，看着玛莎倒下，看着托马斯被杀死，看着安妮消失……"] = "Do you remember? Kneeling here, watching Martha fall, watching Thomas be killed, watching Annie disappear...",
    ["你记得我上次穿什么？"] = "You remember what I wore last time?",
    ["你记这个干什么？"] = "Why are you keeping track of that?",
    ["你话真多……封印你不也一样拿到报酬？"] = "You talk too much... don't you get the reward just by sealing you?",
    ["你该休息了，再这样下去你会得病的。"] = "You should rest. If you go on like this, you'll get sick.",
    ["你该去找赫拉学学怎么说话。"] = "You should go find Hera and learn how to speak.",
    ["你该学学比利——上次他直接在薪水单上画大便！对A！"] = "You should learn from Billy—last time he drew a pile of crap on his payslip! Pair of Aces!",
    ["你该庆幸烧的是裤子而不是胡子！"] = "You should be glad it burned your pants and not your beard!",
    ["你诱惑的仆从已达上限，上限是%i个"] = "You have reached the limit for seduced servants; the limit is %i.",
    ["你说……我们是朋友？你不在意我是个“偷盗者”？"] = "You said... we are friends? You don't mind that I'm a 'Thief'?",
    ["你说……我这瓜，保真吗？"] = "Tell me... is my pumpkin authentic?",
    ["你说什么呢？猫本来就是睡在鸟巢里的呀？"] = "What are you talking about? Cats are supposed to sleep in bird's nests, aren't they?",
    ["你说什么？"] = "What did you say?",
    ["你说什么？不，我不饿。"] = "What did you say? No, I'm not hungry.",
    ["你说什么？亨利·怀恩！你再说一遍！"] = "What did you say? Henry Wine! Say that again!",
    ["你说什么？咳咳，好大的烟！有人在烧火？！去房间里看看！"] = "What did you say? Cough, cough—there's so much smoke! Is someone lighting a fire?! Go check the room!",
    ["你说什么？我刚刚没听清。"] = "What did you say? I didn't hear you clearly just now.",
    ["你说你们被骗了？"] = "You said you were deceived?",
    ["你说你会来看我们，可你骗人，呜呜——"] = "You said you would come to see us, but you lied, *sob*—",
    ["你说咱们什么时候才能离开这个鬼地方？"] = "Tell me, when will we be able to leave this godforsaken place?",
    ["你说奎迪？是我的哥哥哦，只有对着布料才能正常说话的哥哥。"] = "You mean Creed? He's my older brother, the kind of brother who can only speak normally when he's talking to fabric.",
    ["你说对吗？"] = "Don't you agree?",
    ["你说得……也有道理。"] = "What you said... also makes sense.",
    ["你说得对"] = "You're right",
    ["你说得对……我是老了……新的求知者就在眼前……带进去……把他带进去……"] = "You're right... I am old... a new seeker of knowledge is right before me... take him in... take him inside...",
    ["你说得对！我就应该和朋友一起出行，让你跟你亲爱的因蒂斯女郎去迪西度假，吃海鲜饭喝啤酒！"] = "You're right! I should have traveled with friends, and let you go to Dixi with your dear Intis lady to eat paella and drink beer!",
    ["你说得对！我这就去。"] = "You're right! I'll go now.",
    ["你说得对！朋友，那我要写格尔曼的什么事迹呢……"] = "You're right! Friend, then what deeds of Gehrman should I write about...",
    ["你说得对，{{PlayerName}}！现在并不是沮丧的时候！"] = "You're right, {{PlayerName}}! Now is not the time to be depressed!",
    ["你说得对，即便是流言蜚语，也无法掩盖真相。先生，你很有见识。"] = "You're right; even rumors cannot hide the truth. Sir, you are very knowledgeable.",
    ["你说得对，我们应该给老约翰一个体面的死法。"] = "You're right. We should give Old John a decent death.",
    ["你说得对，我听说西区那边最近有些邪教徒在活动，专门用食物引诱穷人，然后……<P_Heart>（压低声音，几乎耳语）</>干些见不得人的勾当。"] = "You're right. I heard that there are some cultists active in the West District lately, specifically using food to lure the poor, and then... <P_Heart> (lowering voice, almost whispering) </> doing unspeakable things.",
    ["你说得对，我的确收获满满。"] = "You're right, I did gain a lot.",
    ["你说得对，我知道一个还不错的地方，跟我来！"] = "You're right, I know a pretty good spot, follow me!",
    ["你说得对，或许……我想我应该再多等等。"] = "You're right, perhaps... I think I should wait a little longer.",
    ["你说得有道理……盒饭本身不需要付出太高的成本，我还可以试着劝说父亲和农场主建立优惠价格的合作？"] = "You have a point... The lunch boxes themselves don't require high costs. Could I try to persuade my father to establish a partnership with the farm owner for discounted prices?",
    ["你说得没错，至少他对女神的呼唤是从一而终的。"] = "You're right, at least his call to the Goddess is consistent.",
    ["你说得确实没错，我们背靠背这么多年，还从没见你腿打颤！"] = "You're right about that. We've been back-to-back for so many years, and I've never seen your legs tremble!",
    ["你说得还真是！说不上为什么，我就是喜欢这地方。"] = "You're really right! I can't say why, but I just like this place.",
    ["你说我们小时候要是住在这种地方，会天天来这儿玩吗？"] = "Do you think if we lived in a place like this when we were kids, we would have come here to play every day?",
    ["你说我们这炼钢炉能不能修理一下，像患了哮喘的老头！"] = "Tell me, can we repair this steel furnace? It's like an old man with asthma!",
    ["你说我家老头子啊，他是外出问诊了吧。放心，我大儿子在坐班，交给他你可以放心。"] = "Are you asking about my old man? He went out for a house call. Don't worry, my eldest son is on duty, you can trust him.",
    ["你说我来哈德罗百货做侍者怎么样？"] = "What do you think about me working as a waiter at Harold Department Store?",
    ["你说我老爹把遗嘱藏在这里面了？真的假的？能不能拿到遗产，就靠这玩意了。"] = "You're saying my old man hid the will in here? Is that for real? Whether I can get the inheritance depends on this thing.",
    ["你说我要不要邀请她去猎狐？但她似乎更喜欢安静……"] = "Do you think I should invite her to go fox hunting? But she seems to prefer quiet...",
    ["你说有些东西你没看到在哪？哦，这很简单，拿出你最趁手的吊坠、水晶球、魔镜，然后等待命运的启示就好了。"] = "You say there are some things you don't see where they are? Oh, that's simple; take out your handiest pendant, crystal ball, or magic mirror, and just wait for the revelation of fate.",
    ["你说的卢瑟是？"] = "Who is this Luther you're talking about?",
    ["你说的奥罗拉是谁？"] = "Who is this Aurora you're talking about?",
    ["你说的山……"] = "The mountain you mentioned...",
    ["你说的山，难道就是……"] = "The mountain you're talking about, could it be...",
    ["你说的有道理，我自己也知道这不是解决根本问题的方法。"] = "What you said makes sense, I know myself that this is not a way to solve the fundamental problem.",
    ["你说的朋友，不会是你自己吧？"] = "The friend you mentioned—wouldn't that be yourself?",
    ["你说的沼泽女巫是什么？"] = "What is this Swamp Witch you speak of?",
    ["你说的珍是谁？"] = "Who is this Jane you're talking about?",
    ["你说的这个朋友会不会就是……"] = "Could this friend you're talking about be...",
    ["你说的这个朋友，不会就是你自己吧！"] = "This friend you're talking about, wouldn't that be yourself!",
    ["你说的那个该死的“主人”到底是谁？"] = "Who exactly is this damn 'Master' you're talking about?",
    ["你说的那位……士兵？他怎么样？"] = "That... soldier you mentioned? How is he?",
    ["你说的那场战争都结束了，现在大地教会和知识教会没有冲突，不过在鲁恩，知识教会不能像大地教会一样修建教堂和传教。"] = "The war you mentioned is over. Now there is no conflict between the Church of the Earth and the Church of Knowledge, but in Loen, the Church of Knowledge cannot build churches or preach like the Church of the Earth.",
    ["你说的闹鬼祖宅是怎么回事？"] = "What's this about the haunted ancestral home you mentioned?",
    ["你说的马桶，不会是切斯庄园的……"] = "The toilet you mentioned, it wouldn't happen to be the one at the Chess Manor...",
    ["你说罗珊？"] = "You mean Rozanne?",
    ["你说老大到底看上那小子什么了？"] = "What do you think the boss sees in that kid?",
    ["你说莉娅吗？她是个可怜的女人。"] = "Are you talking about Leah? She is a pitiful woman.",
    ["你说过你会留下，（递出）这是具体的工作内容。"] = "You said you would stay. (Hands over) These are the specific work details.",
    ["你说过你讨厌脏东西……它最近在换羽，掉得到处是羽粉，我在巷子里帮它梳理……"] = "You said you hated dirty things... it's molting recently, dropping feather dust everywhere, so I was helping it groom in the alley...",
    ["你说这个池子怎么一条鱼都没有？"] = "How come there isn't a single fish in this pond?",
    ["你说这是第几起了？"] = "Do you know how many incidents this has been?",
    ["你说，他这次会回信吗？"] = "Tell me, do you think he'll write back this time?",
    ["你说，她真的是贝克兰德的贵族小姐吗？"] = "Tell me, is she really a noble lady from Backlund?",
    ["你说，弗兰奇先生会允许我养宠物吗？"] = "Tell me, would Mr. Frank allow me to keep a pet?",
    ["你说，我今天运气怎么样？"] = "Tell me, how is my luck today?",
    ["你说，等我们长大了，是不是也能像那些大人一样，每天穿着体面的衣服，口袋里装着叮当响的硬币？"] = "Tell me, when we grow up, will we be able to be like those adults, wearing decent clothes every day with jingling coins in our pockets?",
    ["你读书少，我不怪你。"] = "You don't read much, I don't blame you.",
    ["你谁啊！别捣乱！"] = "Who are you! Don't cause trouble!",
    ["你负责男爵的药物。趁着送药毒杀了男爵，伪装出男爵还活着的假象，甚至伪造案发现场，嫁祸仆人。"] = "You are in charge of the Baron's Medicine. You poisoned the Baron while delivering the medicine, faked the illusion that he was still alive, and even forged the crime scene to frame the servants.",
    ["你走吧！我的生意都要被你挡完了。"] = "Go away! You're blocking all my business.",
    ["你走吧，其实今天不会有暴风雪，我骗你的。"] = "You should go. Actually, there won't be a blizzard today; I lied to you.",
    ["你走得这么辛苦……呼吸这么沉重。崔佛·墨菲，他把你当成工具，就像他把自己当成工具一样。"] = "You walk with such difficulty... your breathing is so heavy. Trevor Murphy, he treats you like a tool, just as he treats himself like a tool.",
    ["你趁着给霍克斯男爵送药毒杀了他，伪装出他还活着的假象，甚至伪造案发现场，嫁祸仆人。"] = "You poisoned Baron Hawkes while delivering his medicine, faked the illusion that he was still alive, and even forged the crime scene to frame the servant.",
    ["你跟你的老师一样，一样勇敢和智慧。"] = "You are just like your teacher, equally brave and wise.",
    ["你跪下来，缓缓抬头看向母神，木然地流下眼泪"] = "You kneel down, slowly look up at the Mother Goddess, and shed tears blankly.",
    ["你跳错了舞！"] = "You did the wrong dance!",
    ["你踏入了非凡之路，获得最初的特性，力量虽微，却已超越常人。"] = "You have stepped onto the path of the extraordinary and obtained your initial characteristics; though your power is slight, you have already surpassed ordinary people.",
    ["你身上也有这些南瓜的气息——你确定那些，也保真吗？"] = "You also have the scent of these pumpkins on you—are you sure those are authentic too?",
    ["你身上散发出微弱的灵界能量，每 5 秒对附近的敌人造成较低的伤害。"] = "You emit faint Spirit World energy, dealing low damage to nearby enemies every 5 seconds.",
    ["你身上散发出灵界能量，每3秒对附近的敌人造成伤害。"] = "You emit Spirit World energy, dealing damage to nearby enemies every 3 seconds.",
    ["你身上有坏人的味道咪。"] = "You have the smell of a bad person, meow.",
    ["你身上有被封印的邪神污染，廷根最近也危机重重。"] = "You have the sealed corruption of an evil god on you, and Tingen has also been full of crises recently.",
    ["你身上有那种气质。海莉夫人也有——往那一站，就让人想把自己的事说给她听。"] = "You have that temperament. Madam Haley has it too—just standing there makes people want to tell her their troubles.",
    ["你身上本就有祂的污染，很容易被卷入相关事件。"] = "You already have His corruption on you, so it's easy to get involved in related events.",
    ["你身体里的力量，对付他们应该没什么问题。"] = "The power within you should have no problem dealing with them.",
    ["你躺在地上做什么？"] = "What are you doing lying on the ground?",
    ["你转向声音的来源，却没看到任何人。\n一回头，街道已再次变得空空荡荡，只剩地上散落的雏菊，和空中飘荡的雏菊花瓣。"] = "You turned to the source of the sound, but didn't see anyone. \nTurning back, the street had become empty again, with only daisies scattered on the ground and daisy petals floating in the air.",
    ["你轻点啊！啊——我的纽扣！"] = "Be gentle! Ah—my button!",
    ["你迅速换上了戏服……"] = "You quickly changed into your costume...",
    ["你还不到工作的年纪吧。"] = "You're not at the age to be working yet, are you?",
    ["你还不是来了？如果没遇上我，你是不是打算背着我们熬夜准备入学考试？"] = "Aren't you here too? If you hadn't run into me, were you planning to stay up all night preparing for the entrance exam behind our backs?",
    ["你还不知道吗？美食家马西莫写了篇文章，带火了这里的主厨库克，我们都是来尝味道的。"] = "Don't you know yet? Gourmet Massimo wrote an article that made the chef here, Cook, a hit. We're all here to taste the food.",
    ["你还不知道我的问题是什么呢？"] = "You don't even know what my question was yet?",
    ["你还不符合这里的着装要求，下次再来吧。"] = "You don't meet the dress code here yet. Come back next time.",
    ["你还卖这些东西？小绅士，我可以先看看吗？"] = "You sell these things too? Little gentleman, can I take a look first?",
    ["你还在磨蹭什么？那个蠢货的怀表都快晃到我脸上了！你到底干不干？"] = "What are you dawdling for? That idiot's pocket watch is almost shaking in my face! Are you going to do it or not?",
    ["你还好吗，怎么一个人在这里喝闷酒？"] = "Are you okay? Why are you drinking alone here?",
    ["你还好吗？"] = "Are you okay?",
    ["你还好吗？嗯……看起来不太好。"] = "Are you alright? Um... you don't look very well.",
    ["你还并不是真正的非凡者，却被允许使用了非凡能力，甚至更高序列的力量。"] = "You are not yet a true Beyonder, yet you have been permitted to use Beyonder abilities, and even powers of a higher Sequence.",
    ["你还想和我见面？"] = "You still want to see me?",
    ["你还是别和我一起玩了，上次因为和我玩，你妈妈好生气。"] = "You'd better not play with me anymore; your mother was so angry last time because you played with me.",
    ["你还是回家找妈妈吧！"] = "You should just go home and find your mother!",
    ["你还是等不及了。"] = "You still couldn't wait.",
    ["你还是要自行解开箱子的锁，才能取得资料——这是必要的测试，用来确保你有足够的能力、不会因此陷入危险。"] = "You still have to unlock the box yourself to obtain the document—this is a necessary test to ensure you have sufficient ability and will not fall into danger because of it.",
    ["你还是这么会说情话，萨里斯先生。"] = "You're still so good at saying sweet things, Mr. Saris.",
    ["你还有一个更隐秘的名字"] = "You have another, more secret name.",
    ["你还有什么想问的吗？"] = "Do you have anything else you want to ask?",
    ["你还有其他想去的地方吗？你可是自己拼命要回廷根的。"] = "Are there any other places you want to go? You were the one who fought so hard to return to Tingen.",
    ["你还未加入俱乐部，赶快找一个心仪的俱乐部加入吧！"] = "You have not joined a club yet. Hurry up and find a club you like to join!",
    ["你还未编辑签名哦"] = "You haven't edited your signature yet",
    ["你还没有好友哦"] = "You don't have any friends yet",
    ["你还没有找到真相呢……"] = "You haven't found the truth yet...",
    ["你还没有获得权限，可联系会长授予"] = "You do not have permission yet; please contact the president to grant it.",
    ["你还没有适应这个集体潜意识世界……"] = "You have not yet adapted to this collective subconscious world...",
    ["你还没看这篇《厨王之王》吗？这可是马西莫最好的作品！"] = "You haven't read this \"King of Chefs\" yet? This is Massimo's best work!",
    ["你还真是不委屈自己。"] = "You really don't hold back, do you.",
    ["你还真是崇拜罗、伟大的罗塞尔大帝啊。"] = "You really do worship the, uh, great Emperor Roselle.",
    ["你还研究历史？"] = "You study history as well?",
    ["你还算善良。前面十几个人，杀掉任何一个，你就解脱了。"] = "You're still kind-hearted. Out of the dozen or so people before you, you would have been free if you had killed any one of them.",
    ["你还能感受到温度吗？"] = "Can you still feel the temperature?",
    ["你还记得什么？"] = "What else do you remember?",
    ["你还记得你的朋友吗？是一只橘猫，他在集市那边的车筐里等你呢！"] = "Do you still remember your friend? It's an orange cat, waiting for you in the basket by the market!",
    ["你还记得梦中的那对兄妹吗？他们是现实中真实存在的。根据我们的调查，现实中的皮特还没有真正信仰“伟大母亲”。"] = "Do you still remember the brother and sister from your dream? They truly exist in reality. According to our investigation, the Peter in reality has not yet truly begun to worship the \"Mother Tree of Desire\".",
    ["你还需要寻找其他狱友合作，救赎之路，从此开始。"] = "You still need to find other inmates to cooperate with; the path to redemption begins here.",
    ["你这不是廷根很有名的药草店吗？"] = "Isn't this a very famous herb shop in Tingen?",
    ["你这个人，比我这把老骨头还爱管闲事。"] = "You, you're even more meddlesome than my old bones.",
    ["你这个小混蛋，我这次一定要告诉你妈妈！"] = "You little brat, I'm definitely telling your mother this time!",
    ["你这个朋友莫非是？"] = "Could this friend of yours be?",
    ["你这个疯子……为了廷根市其他人的安危，不管是作为值夜者，还是普通市民，我都要阻止你！"] = "You madman... For the safety of others in Tingen, whether as a Nighthawk or an ordinary citizen, I will stop you!",
    ["你这个该死的骗子！"] = "You damn swindler!",
    ["你这个邪教徒！你残害了多少无辜者的性命，现在你已经无处可逃了！"] = "You cultist! How many innocent lives have you harmed? Now you have nowhere to run!",
    ["你这么一说，我好像是有点印象……"] = "Now that you mention it, I do seem to have a bit of an impression...",
    ["你这么一问，我才发现我竟然已经为教会奉献三十多年了。"] = "Now that you ask, I realize I've actually dedicated over thirty years to the Church.",
    ["你这么偷偷摸摸的，不会在做坏事吧？"] = "You're being so sneaky, you aren't doing anything bad, are you?",
    ["你这么确定？但我们的调查样本暂时还只有两个。"] = "You're that sure? But our investigation sample is still only two for now.",
    ["你这些诗比外面许多人好。愿意换个地方写吗？ "] = "Your poems are better than many people's out there. Would you be willing to write somewhere else?",
    ["你这人……唉！"] = "You really are... sigh!",
    ["你这人怎么这样！"] = "What is wrong with you!",
    ["你这南瓜多少钱一磅？"] = "How much is your pumpkin per pound?",
    ["你这家伙，真<P_Yellow>会说笑</>……"] = "You guy, you really <P_Yellow>know how to joke</>...",
    ["你这小子！这么年轻就存了很多钱……那也好，早点离开这儿吧。"] = "You kid! You've saved up a lot of money at such a young age... That's fine, leave this place early.",
    ["你这是在干什么呢？摘睡莲吗？"] = "What are you doing? Picking water lilies?",
    ["你这是在干什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["你这是怎么了？"] = "What's wrong with you?",
    ["你这是谋杀！"] = "That's murder!",
    ["你这样活着，也是在被慢慢毁掉啊。"] = "Living like this, you are also being slowly ruined.",
    ["你这段时间似乎被章鱼控制了，不过现在没事了。"] = "You seem to have been controlled by the octopus for a while, but you're fine now.",
    ["你这海盗狗，还我面包！"] = "You pirate dog, give me back my bread!",
    ["你这猫太庸俗！不和你说！"] = "You cat are too vulgar! I won't talk to you!",
    ["你这班我也想上"] = "I want this job of yours too",
    ["你这瓜保熟吗-任务触发器"] = "Is this melon ripe? - Quest Trigger",
    ["你这瓜保真吗"] = "Is This Melon Authentic",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-到达谷仓"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Arriving at the Barn",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-到达车站"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Arriving at the Station",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-南瓜怪"] = "Is Your Melon Authentic - Pumpkin Monster",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-古德曼买瓜"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Goodman Buys Melons",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-古德曼对质"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Goodman Confronts",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-古德曼战败"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Goodman Defeated",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-古德曼消失"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Goodman Disappears",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-古德曼说真相"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Goodman Tells the Truth",
    ["你这瓜保真吗-约翰森打听"] = "Are These Melons Authentic? - Johansen Inquires",
    ["你这表里不一的伪君子，我就是要看你众叛亲离，让你的妻子和儿女都以你为耻，让你变成颜面尽丧的流浪汉。"] = "You two-faced hypocrite, I intend to watch you be abandoned by everyone, to have your wife and children be ashamed of you, and to turn you into a disgraced vagrant.",
    ["你这贪婪善妒的守财奴，我就是要你失去积攒一生的财富，变成身无分文的穷光蛋。"] = "You greedy, jealous miser, I intend for you to lose the wealth you have accumulated over a lifetime and become a penniless pauper.",
    ["你这身衣服……"] = "These clothes of yours...",
    ["你这造型倒是挺别致……行吧，怎么找？"] = "Your pose is quite unique... fine, how do I find it?",
    ["你这里不卖睡莲吗？"] = "Don't you sell water lilies here?",
    ["你这里有“隐藏服务”？"] = "Do you have 'hidden services' here?",
    ["你这里的蔬菜种类还挺多。"] = "You have quite a variety of vegetables here.",
    ["你这里这么多种帽子，都是格尔曼同款的……？"] = "You have so many different kinds of hats here, and they're all the same style as Gehrman's...?",
    ["你连原著都读过？那书可不好找。"] = "You've even read the original? That book isn't easy to find.",
    ["你连我哪天该笑都写在计划里！我把花扔下去你计划到了吗？你和计划过一辈子吧！"] = "You even have the time I'm supposed to laugh written into your plan! Did you plan for me throwing the flowers down too? Why don't you just spend your whole life with your plan!",
    ["你追我赶的尸骸逃亡开始！"] = "The chase for survival against the dead has begun!",
    ["你退出了团队"] = "You have left the group.",
    ["你退出了队伍"] = "You have left the team.",
    ["你逃不掉的……种子！"] = "You can't escape... Seed!",
    ["你选择了1号子弹"] = "You chose Bullet 1",
    ["你选择了2号子弹"] = "You chose Bullet 2",
    ["你选择了3号子弹"] = "You chose Bullet 3",
    ["你选择了4号子弹"] = "You chose Bullet 4",
    ["你选择了生命？"] = "You chose life?",
    ["你选择向%s宣战，请选择宣战场次："] = "You have chosen to declare war on %s, please select the battle session:",
    ["你选择塔罗学院的初衷，你的梦想，你未来的非凡职业规划。"] = "Your original intention for choosing the Tarot Academy, your dreams, and your future career plans as a Beyonder.",
    ["你造成的每次伤害有50%概率召唤烈阳炮，对目标造成你的生命值上限50%的额外伤害，此效果对同一目标每2秒最多触发一次。"] = "Every instance of damage you deal has a 50% chance to summon a Blazing Sun Cannon, dealing extra damage equal to 50% of your maximum Health to the target. This effect can trigger at most once every 2 seconds on the same target.",
    ["你遇到过吗？"] = "Have you encountered it?",
    ["你邀请的人太受欢迎了，稍后再试试吧"] = "The person you invited is too popular; try again later.",
    ["你那是蹲久了……歇会就好了。"] = "That's just because you've been squatting for too long... you'll be fine after a rest.",
    ["你那是野史。根据论文，目前只能证明祂和贝尔纳黛会长的合作关系，由此推出其在建校历程中的重大作用……<P_Heart>（滔滔不绝）</>"] = "That's unofficial history. According to the thesis, it can only be proven that He and President Bernadette have a cooperative relationship, thus inferring His significant role in the founding process... <P_Heart>(Rambling on)</>",
    ["你那点头疼算什么，瞧瞧这个——我上次被那车从西维拉斯郡运过来的矿石砸到脚，到现在还肿着呢。"] = "Your headache is nothing, look at this—I was hit in the foot by that cart of ore transported from Sivellas County, and it's still swollen.",
    ["你都不知道车厢里的气味有多糟糕。"] = "You have no idea how bad the smell in the carriage is.",
    ["你都像廷根的烈日一般夺目！"] = "You are as dazzling as the scorching sun of Tingen!",
    ["你都治什么病？"] = "What illnesses do you treat?",
    ["你都知道了？"] = "You knew?",
    ["你都等了好久了……"] = "You've been waiting for a long time...",
    ["你都等了好久了……他难道真的不来吗？"] = "You've been waiting for a long time... Is he really not coming?",
    ["你都长这么大了……我差点全都忘记了。"] = "You've grown so big... I almost forgot everything.",
    ["你醉了"] = "You're drunk",
    ["你醒了……"] = "You're awake...",
    ["你醒了过来……"] = "You woke up...",
    ["你重生了，重生在还没有被罢黜的前三个月，这一次，你将拿回属于你的一切。"] = "You have been reborn, reborn three months before you were deposed. This time, you will take back everything that belongs to you.",
    ["你错过了真相。塔罗牌嘀嘀咕咕，仍对黛丝的死亡有诸多猜想。你向塔罗牌表达没有救出它，很抱歉。它将你踢出了这个空间，表示要继续等待下一位提问者。对话的字里行间透出诡异，离开后你获得了1分钟的负面buff，你想不通……"] = "You missed the truth. The Tarot cards mutter, still harboring many speculations about Daisy's death. You express your apologies to the Tarot cards for failing to save it. It kicks you out of the space, indicating it will continue to wait for the next questioner. The lines of the conversation feel eerie, and after leaving, you receive a 1-minute negative buff; you can't figure it out...",
    ["你镜头中的主角是？"] = "Who is the protagonist in your lens?",
    ["你长得，确实和老爷有些像。"] = "You do look a bit like the Master.",
    ["你问吧，我对她的爱现在很坚定！"] = "Ask away, my love for her is very firm now!",
    ["你问我什么时候抢的？"] = "You're asking me when I grabbed it?",
    ["你问我哪里不满意？我哪里都不满意！"] = "You ask me what I'm dissatisfied with? I'm dissatisfied with everything!",
    ["你问我？！是不是你藏起来了？"] = "You're asking me?! Did you hide it?",
    ["你问谁寄的？嘘，还能有谁，就住在贝克兰德西区的那些贵族老爷们呗！ "] = "You ask who sent it? Shh, who else could it be, those noble lords living in the West District of Backlund!",
    ["你问问题的角度很刁钻，你这个人很不会聊天。"] = "The angle from which you ask questions is very tricky; you are not very good at chatting.",
    ["你闯出了玫瑰天堂，先别松懈，他们还在后面。"] = "You've broken out of Rose Paradise, but don't relax yet; they're still behind you.",
    ["你闻到了吗？好像有一股味道。"] = "Do you smell it? There seems to be a smell.",
    ["你防我防大家防，金镑诈骗无处藏！！！"] = "Guard against each other, gold pound scams are everywhere!!!",
    ["你陷入无尽循环的噩梦，经历多次死亡和意志的摧残后，再次从森林中醒来，但除了胸口和太阳穴的疼痛，什么都想不起来。经过调查，你按照羊皮纸上的启示，找齐三个预言之物，却意外闯入向邪神献祭的仪式。幸好“愚者”先生及时出现，为你嫁接来自未来命运中的力量，帮助你对抗梦中残留的污染。你没有向邪神屈服，最终觉醒不灭之力，战胜“月之污染”。在“愚者”先生和塔罗会的帮助下，你身上的污染被暂时封印，即将从现实中醒来。"] = "You fall into an endless cycle of nightmares, and after experiencing multiple deaths and the destruction of your will, you wake up in the forest again, but except for the pain in your chest and temples, you can't remember anything. After investigation, you follow the revelations on the parchment and find the three prophetic items, but accidentally intrude upon a sacrifice ritual to an evil god. Fortunately, Mr. Fool appears in time to graft power from future fate onto you, helping you resist the corruption remaining in your dream. You do not submit to the evil god, eventually awakening the Undying Power and defeating the \"Moon Corruption.\" With the help of Mr. Fool and the Tarot Club, the corruption on you is temporarily sealed, and you are about to wake up in reality.",
    ["你难道不知道现在的咖啡豆有多么昂贵吗？如果你再不还钱，我得去找你的经理谈谈了！"] = "Don't you know how expensive coffee beans are now? If you don't pay me back, I'll have to go talk to your manager!",
    ["你需要借钱吗？"] = "Do you need to borrow money?",
    ["你需要准备好，因为“祂”仍在注视你。"] = "You need to be prepared, for \"He\" is still watching you.",
    ["你需要前往廷根，得到“愚者”先生的启示，驱散噩梦的阴影。"] = "You need to head to Tingen to receive the revelation from Mr. Fool and dispel the shadows of your nightmares.",
    ["你需要半成品的银片吗？"] = "Do you need semi-finished silver pieces?",
    ["你需要天然矿石吗？"] = "Do you need natural minerals?",
    ["你需要帮助吗？"] = "Do you need help?",
    ["你需要我提供什么帮助吗？"] = "Do you need any help from me?",
    ["你需要草药粉末吗？"] = "Do you need herbal powder?",
    ["你靠近那肢体富足的渺小生灵，安静得像一只匍匐在房檐上的猫。"] = "You approach the tiny creature with abundant limbs, as quiet as a cat crouching on the eaves.",
    ["你靠近，仰头观察旅行尖碑。\n旁边一位女士（佛尔思）正在悠闲地读书。\n佛尔思注意到疑惑的你，合上书，转头微笑走来，变魔术般，凭空抽出一张魔术师塔罗牌。"] = "You approach and look up to observe the travel stele.\n A lady (Fors) is reading leisurely nearby.\n Fors notices you looking puzzled, closes her book, turns, and walks over with a smile, magically pulling a Magician tarot card out of thin air.",
    ["你面对枪口时的冷静眼神，有格尔曼·斯帕罗的气质。"] = "Your calm eyes when facing the muzzle of a gun have the temperament of Gehrman Sparrow.",
    ["你马上就会知道的，我们进去吧。"] = "You'll know soon enough. Let's go in.",
    ["你骂我？"] = "Are you scolding me?",
    ["你骗我到这里，让我做替死鬼，解除你的诅咒？"] = "You tricked me here to make me a scapegoat to lift your curse?",
    ["你！"] = "You!",
    ["你！你有没有看到我的小杰克？"] = "You! Have you seen my little Jack?",
    ["你！你！那边的！还有你"] = "You! You! The one over there! And you too!",
    ["你！哦，真是粗鄙之人，我就不该和你说话！"] = "You! Oh, what a vulgar person; I shouldn't have spoken to you at all!",
    ["你！哼，好！我看你挺能说，精神挺不错啊！看来是干的活儿太少了！"] = "You! Hmph, fine! I see you're quite eloquent and in high spirits! It seems you haven't been doing enough work!",
    ["你！哼，好！我看你挺能说，精神挺不错啊！看来是活儿太少了！"] = "You! Hmph, fine! I see you can talk well, and your spirit is quite good! It seems there's too little work!",
    ["你！我……"] = "You! I...",
    ["你！那边的！拜托救救我！"] = "You! The one over there! Please save me!",
    ["你！那边的！要试试新品蛋糕吗？"] = "You! The one over there! Want to try the new cake?",
    ["你，"] = "You,",
    ["你，你……"] = "You, you...",
    ["你，你好……"] = "H-hello...",
    ["你，你怎么会知道？这可是近十年来，我最拿手的笑话了……难不成，你才是笑话之王？"] = "You, how could you know? This has been my best joke for the last ten years... Could it be that you are the King of Jokes?",
    ["你，你是什么人？不，不要过来！"] = "You, who are you? No, don't come over!",
    ["你，你点亮了永暗蜡烛？！"] = "You, you lit the Candle of Eternal Darkness?!",
    ["你，你的脸……"] = "You, your face...",
    ["你，哪里来的，这里，“至尊霹雳舞王”的地盘，呜嘎。"] = "You, where from, here, \"Supreme Breakdance King\" territory, ooga.",
    ["你，拿到了徽章。"] = "You, you got the badge.",
    ["你，是来聆听福音之人？"] = "You, are you the one here to listen to the gospel?",
    ["你，舞王？我才是，“至尊霹雳舞王”。"] = "You, Dance King? I am, the \"Supreme Breakdance King\".",
    ["你？"] = "You?",
    ["你？你早就过了“不眠者”的阶段，这种消耗对你来说算不上什么。不过，我差点忘了……"] = "You? You've long since passed the Sleepless stage; this kind of consumption is nothing to you. However, I almost forgot...",
    ["你？哈哈哈哈哈！会让你把隔夜饭都吐出来，小鬼。"] = "You? Hahahahaha! It'll make you throw up your overnight meal, kid.",
    ["你？我才是这里的“神”。"] = "You? I am the only \"god\" here.",
    ["佣人怎么又跑了……"] = "Why did the servant run away again...",
    ["佣兵小队"] = "Mercenary squad",
    ["佩"] = "Pei",
    ["佩儿·"] = "Pearl ",
    ["佩克"] = "Peck",
    ["佩内洛普"] = "Penelope",
    ["佩内洛普·"] = "Penelope ",
    ["佩吉"] = "Peggy",
    ["佩奇"] = "Page",
    ["佩妮"] = "Penny",
    ["佩妮·"] = "Penny ",
    ["佩姬，佐治，我后悔了。"] = "Peggy, George, I regret it.",
    ["佩尔斯到底去哪了？她不是最喜欢来这了吗？"] = "Where on earth did Pells go? Isn't this her favorite place to come to?",
    ["佩恩"] = "Payne",
    ["佩恩（白天）"] = "Payne (Daytime)",
    ["佩戴"] = "Equip",
    ["佩戴中"] = "Equipped",
    ["佩戴者眼中的扭曲，贿赂秩序的真理。"] = "The Distortion in the wearer's eyes bribes the truth of order.",
    ["佩戴超过60秒后，灯神从沉眠中苏醒，开始按自己的理解回应佩戴者的愿望：\n<Yellow>青春永驻</>：使用解控技时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则灯神满足你的“愿望”，使你获得青春永驻：<Yellow>30</>秒内buffdisc(*id)\n<Yellow>同心之援</>：使用终结技时，如果<Yellow>30</>米内有至少1名队友，则灯神满足你的“愿望”，使你获得同心之援：<Yellow>30</>秒内buffdisc(*id)\n<Yellow>背水一击</>：除解控技和终结技外，技能均进入冷却时，如果<Yellow>30</>米内没有队友，则灯神满足你的“愿望”，使你获得背水一击：<Yellow>30</>秒内buffdisc(*id)\n所有愿望均会触发60秒的冷却时间，同心之援与背水一击共享冷却。"] = "After being equipped for more than 60 seconds, the Genie awakens from its slumber and begins to respond to the wearer's wishes according to its own understanding: \n<Yellow>Eternal Youth</>: When using a Cleanse skill, if your Health is below <Yellow>50%</>, the Genie will grant your \"wish,\" granting you Eternal Youth: buffdisc(*id) for <Yellow>30</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Concentric Aid</>: When using a Finish skill, if there is at least 1 teammate within <Yellow>30</> meters, the Genie will grant your \"wish,\" granting you Concentric Aid: buffdisc(*id) for <Yellow>30</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Last Stand</>: When all skills except for Cleanse and Finish skills are on Cooldown, if there are no teammates within <Yellow>30</> meters, the Genie will grant your \"wish,\" granting you Last Stand: buffdisc(*id) for <Yellow>30</> seconds. \nAll wishes will trigger a 60-second Cooldown, and Concentric Aid and Last Stand share the same Cooldown.",
    ["佩拉格娅"] = "Pelageya",
    ["佩斯利·"] = "Paisley ",
    ["佩格·"] = "Peg ",
    ["佩特"] = "Pete",
    ["佩珀"] = "Pepper",
    ["佩珊"] = "Peishan",
    ["佩里"] = "Perry",
    ["佩顿·"] = "Payton ",
    ["佯装离开"] = "Pretend to leave",
    ["佳木斯"] = "Jiamusi",
    ["使命……"] = "Mission...",
    ["使命……你还在执着于完成“杀死黛丝”的命运吗？"] = "Mission... are you still obsessed with completing the fate of 'killing Daisy'?",
    ["使命？"] = "Mission?",
    ["使封印物负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害减免提升%s"] = "Nullifies Sealed Artifact negative effects, all skill levels +1, Damage Reduction %s",
    ["使封印物负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害加深提升%s"] = "Nullifies Sealed Artifact negative effects, all skill levels +1, Damage Deepening %s",
    ["使徒"] = "Apostle",
    ["使徒-头部特效（未进战可用）"] = "Apostle-Head special effect (available out of combat)",
    ["使徒战斗区域"] = "Apostle Combat Area",
    ["使怪物目标的仇恨对象锁定为自身。"] = "Forces the monster's target to lock onto yourself.",
    ["使我们远离邪恶的沾染，摆脱厄难的缠绕……"] = "Keep us away from the contamination of evil, and free us from the entanglement of disaster...",
    ["使本技能进入CD/冷却（或扣除一次充能）"] = "Put this skill into Cooldown (or deduct one charge).",
    ["使用 <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Shift\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\"/> 进行冲刺，跟上他！"] = "Use <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Shift\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\"/> to sprint and keep up with him!",
    ["使用 <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Shift\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\"/> 进行闪避"] = "Use <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Shift\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\"/> to Dodge.",
    ["使用 <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Tab\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\"/> 锁定敌人！"] = "Use <img id=\"KeyPrompt_Tab\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\"/> to lock onto enemies!",
    ["使用\"共感手铐\""] = "Use Empathy Handcuffs",
    ["使用\"显形墨水\""] = "Use \"Revealing Ink\"",
    ["使用1次游历药品"] = "Use 1 Travel Medicine.",
    ["使用1次社交表情动作"] = "Use 1 social emote",
    ["使用1次表情动作"] = "Use 1 emote",
    ["使用2005179"] = "Use 2005179",
    ["使用2005180"] = "Use 2005180",
    ["使用2次光之折射后张开洞察之眼。"] = "Use Refraction of Light 2 times to open the Eye of Insight.",
    ["使用2次光之折射后张开洞察之眼，洞察之眼命中的人脚下会生成真理之眼。"] = "After using Refraction of Light 2 times, open Eyes of Mystery Prying; an Eye of Truth will be generated at the feet of those hit by Eyes of Mystery Prying.",
    ["使用3次火焰跳跃后对范围内敌人造成一次大量伤害。"] = "Using Flame Jump 3 times deals massive damage to enemies within range.",
    ["使用3次火焰跳跃后释放一次脚下伤害。"] = "Release damage at your feet after using Flame Jump 3 times.",
    ["使用5次单人动作或表情"] = "Use single-player actions or emotes 5 times",
    ["使用<Highlight>人造死神</>可以驱散附近所有玩家的<Highlight>暗光</>效果"] = "Using <Highlight>Artificial Death</> can dispel the <Highlight>Dark Light</> effect from all nearby players.",
    ["使用<Highlight>叹息之种</>激活叹息之力, 开启叹息任务, 完成任务获得丰富奖励。"] = "Use <Highlight> Seed of Sighs </> to activate Power of Sighs, start the Sighs Quest, and complete it to receive rich rewards.",
    ["使用<Highlight>灰雾感知</>探测<Highlight>乌暗之影</>的位置，并寻找空隙躲避攻击"] = "Use <Highlight>Gray Fog Perception</> to detect the location of the <Highlight>Dark Shadow</> and find gaps to avoid attacks.",
    ["使用<Highlight>灰雾感知</>探测<Highlight>魔狼眷族</>的位置并转火攻击，<Highlight>风暴祷言</>可以击晕<Highlight>魔狼眷族</>使其暂时显形并失去攻击和移动能力"] = "Use <Highlight>Gray Fog Perception</> to detect the location of the <Highlight>Demon Wolf Kin</> and switch targets to attack them. <Highlight>Storm Prayer</> can stun the <Highlight>Demon Wolf Kin</>, making them temporarily visible and causing them to lose their ability to attack and move.",
    ["使用<Highlight>灰雾感知</>探测魔狼雕像的位置并在黑暗吞噬全场之前击碎所有魔狼雕像，<Highlight>风暴祷言</>同样可以击碎雕像，同时需要注意使用<Highlight>人造死神</>驱散乌黯魔狼施加的暗光效果"] = "Use <Highlight>Gray Fog Perception</> to detect the location of the Demon Wolf statues and shatter all of them before the Dark Devour consumes the field. <Highlight>Storm Prayer</> can also shatter the statues. At the same time, be sure to use <Highlight>Artificial Death</> to dispel the Dark Light effect applied by the Dark Demonic Wolf.",
    ["使用<Highlight>解控或位移技能</>，离开技能中心。"] = "Use a <Highlight>Control Break or Displacement Skill</> to leave the center of the skill.",
    ["使用<Highlight>解控技能</>，及时拉开距离。"] = "Use a <Highlight>Control Break Skill</> to create distance in time.",
    ["使用<Highlight>金币飞掷</>，给予贫苦人足够的理智金币，贫苦人将恢复理智<Highlight>转化为我方阵营助战</>。"] = "Use <Highlight>Gold Coin Toss</> to give the poor enough rational gold coins. The poor will regain their rationality and <Highlight>turn into our faction to assist in the battle</>.",
