    ["使用“<h>卜杖</>”找到失主"] = "Use \"<h>Dowsing Rod</>\" to find the owner",
    ["使用“<h>灵视</>”查看"] = "Use \"<h>spirit vision</>\" to view.",
    ["使用“手枪瞄准”技能可切换射击状态，射击命中灵性石柱可以影响附近的机关。"] = "Use the \"Pistol Aiming\" skill to switch shooting states; shooting and hitting spirituality pillars can affect nearby mechanisms.",
    ["使用“手枪瞄准”技能，射击灵性石柱激活机关"] = "Use the \"Pistol Aiming\" skill to shoot the spiritual stone pillar and activate the mechanism",
    ["使用“抓取文字”技能抓取词语"] = "Use the \"Grab Text\" skill to grab words.",
    ["使用“显形墨水”"] = "Use \"Revealing Ink\"",
    ["使用“消除墨水”"] = "Use \"Eraser Ink\"",
    ["使用“消除墨水”<h></>"] = "Use \"Eraser Ink\" <h></>",
    ["使用“灵视”查看"] = "Use \"Spirit Vision\" to view",
    ["使用“瞄准射击”技能可切换射击状态，射击命中火炬可以影响附近的机关。"] = "Use the \"Aiming Shot\" skill to switch shooting modes; hitting torches with shots can affect nearby mechanisms.",
    ["使用“瞬息之旅”"] = "Use \"Traveler's Door\"",
    ["使用“破晓号”"] = "Use the \"Dawn\"",
    ["使用“读心者”的非凡能力"] = "Use the Beyonder ability of \"Mind Reader\"",
    ["使用“露米代行”技能与露米交换意识！"] = "Use the \"Lumian Proxy\" skill to swap consciousness with Lumian!",
    ["使用“露米代行”技能与露米交换意识，变小后钻进入口"] = "Use the \"Lumian Proxy\" skill to swap consciousness with Lumian, then shrink down to crawl into the entrance.",
    ["使用”消除墨水”<h></>"] = "Use \"Eraser Ink\"<h></>",
    ["使用【入梦】技能"] = "Use the [Enter Dream] skill",
    ["使用【合适】的大剑，割开棘丛，前往无尽的前方"] = "Use the 【Suitable】 Greatsword to cut through the thickets and head toward the endless future",
    ["使用【灵性之跃】进行快速移动"] = "Use Leap of Spirituality to move quickly",
    ["使用【通灵】技能"] = "Use the [Spirit Mediumship] skill",
    ["使用一键聚合后，将消耗非凡者拥有的非凡物质、聚合因子与绑定苏勒，依次按照1词条与1词条非凡物质聚合、2词条与2词条非凡物质聚合、3词条与3词条非凡物质聚合进行聚合，并自动按照带有愚者词条最优先，带有其它异变词条次优先，评分优先的规则保留聚合产物。\n注意：不会将两个带有异变词条的非凡物质进行聚合，当剩余非凡物质数量较少时不会进行一键聚合。可交易非凡物质不会被一键聚合与自定义聚合，带有异变词条的非凡物质会被一键聚合，不会被自定义聚合。"] = "After using One-Click Aggregation, the Beyonder's Beyonder Materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soules will be consumed. Aggregation will proceed in order: 1-stat with 1-stat materials, 2-stat with 2-stat materials, and 3-stat with 3-stat materials. The system will automatically retain products based on the rule: Fool stat priority, followed by other Mutation stats, and then rating priority. \nNote: Two Beyonder Materials with Mutation stats will not be aggregated. One-Click Aggregation will not occur if the number of remaining Beyonder Materials is low. Tradable Beyonder Materials will not be included in One-Click or Custom Aggregation. Beyonder Materials with Mutation stats will be included in One-Click Aggregation but not in Custom Aggregation.",
    ["使用不灭之力攻击月之污染！"] = "Use Undying Power to attack the Moon Corruption!",
    ["使用中键将会替换锁定操控方案，具体为：中键按下-进入/退出锁定，上滚轮：逆序轮选，下滚轮：顺序轮选，届时相关按键会被占用，您将无法主动调整视距，是否确认替换？"] = "Using the middle mouse button will replace the lock-on control scheme. Specifically: Middle button press - enter/exit lock-on, scroll wheel up: reverse selection, scroll wheel down: sequential selection. Relevant keys will be occupied, and you will not be able to actively adjust the view distance. Are you sure you want to replace it?",
    ["使用临时按钮搏一搏，获取会获得女神的祝福"] = "Use the temporary button to take a chance; you will receive the Goddess's blessing",
    ["使用书籍引导"] = "Use book guidance",
    ["使用了带有橙色繁复纹样的墙纸。木质的护墙板做成漂亮的纹路。"] = "Uses wallpaper with orange intricate patterns. The wooden wainscoting is made into beautiful patterns.",
    ["使用了带有橙色繁复纹样的墙纸，典雅沉稳。"] = "Uses wallpaper with orange intricate patterns, elegant and steady.",
    ["使用了带有橙色繁复纹样的墙纸，增加了嵌在其中的玻璃拱窗。"] = "Uses wallpaper with intricate orange patterns, with a glass arched window embedded within.",
    ["使用了带有深褐色菱形纹路的墙纸，散发自然温暖与独特韵味。"] = "Uses wallpaper with dark brown diamond patterns, exuding natural warmth and a unique charm.",
    ["使用了带有绿色古典纹样的墙纸，古朴优雅。"] = "Uses wallpaper with green classical patterns, simple and elegant.",
    ["使用了带有绿色古典纹样的墙纸，古朴优雅，增加了嵌在其中的玻璃拱窗。"] = "Uses wallpaper with green classical patterns, simple and elegant, with a glass arched window embedded within.",
    ["使用了带有绿色菱形格的墙纸，似乎令人内心安定。"] = "Uses wallpaper with green diamond patterns, which seems to bring inner peace.",
    ["使用了带有蓝色古典纹样的墙纸，端庄雅致。"] = "Uses wallpaper with blue classical patterns, dignified and elegant.",
    ["使用了旅行笔记"] = "Used Travel Notes.",
    ["使用人造死神驱散暗光！"] = "Use Artificial Death to dispel the dark light!",
    ["使用任务道具"] = "Use quest item",
    ["使用催眠符咒"] = "Use Hypnosis Charm.",
    ["使用减伤技能"] = "Use damage reduction skill",
    ["使用剑"] = "Use sword",
    ["使用加速配合冲刺，快速跑到目的地"] = "Use acceleration combined with a dash to quickly reach the destination",
    ["使用匕首"] = "Use Dagger",
    ["使用华丽的戏法掩盖实力，以此戏耍对手。"] = "Use flashy tricks to cover up your strength and use them to play with your opponents.",
    ["使用单通道颜色（0否1是）"] = "Use single-channel color (0: No, 1: Yes)",
    ["使用南大陆的硬质玉米，压制、焙烤成金黄脆片，香酥可口。"] = "Using hard corn from the Southern Continent, pressed and roasted into golden crispy chips, fragrant and delicious.",
    ["使用卜杖占卜"] = "Use dowsing rod for divination",
    ["使用卜杖寻路"] = "Use Dowsing Rod Navigation",
    ["使用卜杖寻路寻找<h>海莉</>"] = "Use Dowsing Rod Navigation. to find <h>Hayley</>",
    ["使用卜杖寻路寻找踪迹"] = "Use Dowsing Rod Navigation to find traces",
    ["使用卜杖寻路找到弗莱"] = "Use Dowsing Rod Navigation to find Frye",
    ["使用卜杖寻路技能"] = "Use Dowsing Rod Navigation skill",
    ["使用卜杖进行占卜<h></>"] = "Use a dowsing rod to perform a divination <h></>",
    ["使用口琴"] = "Use the harmonica",
    ["使用叹息之中中..."] = "Using Seed of Sighs...",
    ["使用叹息之种·潮汐，完成你的第一次猩红狩猎。"] = "Use the Seed of Sighs: Tide to complete your first scarlet hunt.",
    ["使用叹息之种，击杀怪物或掠夺玩家获取猎物碎片，寻找律令伯爵提交兑换奖励"] = "Use Seed of Sighs, kill monsters or loot players to obtain Prey Fragments, find the Earl of Order to submit and exchange for rewards",
    ["使用同行纹章兑换物品"] = "Use Peer Emblem to exchange items",
    ["使用后一次性回复非凡者30%血量。"] = "After use, instantly restore 30% of a Beyonder's Health.",
    ["使用后下一次投掷必定出现大失败。本效果与【命运之吻】互斥，以最后使用者为准。该效果不影响特殊定制投骰玩法的结果。"] = "After use, your next roll is guaranteed to be a critical failure. This effect is mutually exclusive with [Kiss of Fate]; the last user's effect takes precedence. This effect does not affect the results of special custom dice gameplay.",
    ["使用后下一次投掷必定出现大成功。本效果与【厄数之骰】互斥，以最后使用者为准。该效果不影响特殊定制投骰玩法的结果。"] = "After use, your next roll is guaranteed to be a critical success. This effect is mutually exclusive with [Dice of Misfortune]; the last user's effect takes precedence. This effect does not affect the results of special custom dice gameplay.",
    ["使用后从下列35品金色装备任意自选一款获得，部位包括武器、胸针、鞋靴、护甲、披风、护符。"] = "After use, choose one piece of level 35 gold-quality equipment from the following options. Available slots include weapons, brooches, boots, armor, cloaks, and amulets.",
    ["使用后从下列60品金色装备任意自选一款获得，部位包括武器、胸针、鞋靴、护甲、披风、护符、帽子、指环。"] = "After use, choose one piece of level 60 gold-quality equipment from the following options. Available slots include weapons, brooches, boots, armor, cloaks, amulets, hats, and rings.",
    ["使用后从下列外观任意自选一款获得。"] = "After use, select and obtain one cosmetic from the following list.",
    ["使用后体力恢复至<Highlight>%s/%s</>"] = "Stamina restored to <Highlight>%s/%s</> after use",
    ["使用后使用占卜家扮演技能：灵摆占卜。"] = "After use, perform the Seer Acting Skill: Pendulum Divination.",
    ["使用后使用小丑扮演技能：悲面欢颜。"] = "After use, perform the Clown Acting Skill: Sad Face, Happy Smile.",
    ["使用后可以变身成为卷毛狒狒，最多持续1分钟，主动使用技能会解除变身状态。"] = "After use, you can transform into a Curly-Haired Baboon for up to 1 minute. Actively using a skill will cancel the transformation state.",
    ["使用后可以变身成为小象玩偶，最多持续1分钟，主动使用技能会解除变身状态。"] = "After use, you can transform into a small elephant doll for up to 1 minute. Actively using a skill will cancel the transformation state.",
    ["使用后可以变身成为幽影，最多持续1分钟，主动使用技能会解除变身状态。"] = "After use, you can transform into a Shadow for up to 1 minute. Actively using a skill will cancel the transformation state.",
    ["使用后可以变身成为骑士，最多持续1分钟，主动使用技能会解除变身状态。"] = "After use, you can transform into a Knight for up to 1 minute. Actively using a skill will cancel the transformation state.",
    ["使用后可以在蠕动的饥饿、生物毒素瓶、月亮纸人中选择一个封印物获得。"] = "After use, you can choose one Sealed Artifact from Creeping Hunger, Biological Poison Bottle, or Moon Paper Figurine.",
    ["使用后可以将动捕动作保存至社交动作。"] = "After use, you can save motion capture actions to social actions.",
    ["使用后可以短暂进入空间的另一形态。"] = "Briefly enter another form of space after use.",
    ["使用后可以转动幸运大转盘。"] = "After use, you can spin the Lucky Big Wheel.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·优雅回眸</>"] = "After use, you can perform the <Highlight>Phantom Action: Elegant Glance Back</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·俏皮模式</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Playful Mode</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·劲舞律动</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Energetic Dance Rhythm</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·威风堂堂</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Majestic Presence</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·完美闪避</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight> Phantom Action · Perfect Dodge </> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·应援号召</>"] = "After use, you can perform the <Highlight>Phantom Action: Support Call</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·月光滑步</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Moonwalk</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·爱意连射</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Love Barrage</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·甜魅双倍</>"] = "After use, you can perform the <Highlight>Phantom Action: Sweet Charm Double</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·绝杀时刻</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Finishing Move</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·花赠美人</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Flower Gift to Beauty</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·邀约之手</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Hand of Invitation</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·飒爽女王</>"] = "After use, you can perform <Highlight>Phantom Action: Dashing Queen</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可在歌剧魅影玩法中表演<Highlight>魅影动作·飞吻投递</>"] = "After use, you can perform the <Highlight>Phantom Action - Blow Kiss Delivery</> in the Phantom of the Opera gameplay.",
    ["使用后可将玩法语音房间转换为常驻房间，并增加30天的常驻时长。"] = "Use to convert a gameplay voice room into a permanent room and add 30 days of permanent duration.",
    ["使用后可将限时外观：【外观名称】，变更为永久拥有。"] = "Use to change a time-limited appearance: [Appearance Name] into a permanent one.",
    ["使用后可开启香槟喷洒效果。（在全服活动“名流盛宴”中，可以增加个人热度值）"] = "After use, you can trigger a champagne spray effect. (In the server-wide event \"Celebrity Feast,\" this can increase your personal popularity value.)",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：占星人的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Astrologer potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：太阳神官的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Solar High Priest potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：女巫的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Witch potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：审讯者的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Interrogator potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：巫师的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Witch potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：心理医生的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Psychologist potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：武器大师的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Weapon Master potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列七：魔术师的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 7: Magician potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列九：仲裁人的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 9: Arbiter potion, which contains mysterious power.",
