    ["使用后可晋升至序列九：占卜家的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 9: Seer potion, which contains mysterious power.",
    ["使用后可晋升至序列九：学徒的魔药，蕴含着神秘的力量。"] = "After use, you can advance to Sequence 9: Apprentice potion, which contains mysterious power.",
