    ["使用后可自选获得下列道具之一"] = "After use, you can choose one of the following items to obtain.",
    ["使用后可获得2个<Highlight>转运水晶</>，并有一定概率额外获得1个<Highlight>圣杯·绑</>。"] = "After use, you can obtain 2 <Highlight>Transmutation Crystals</>, with a certain chance to obtain an additional 1 <Highlight>Holy Grail (Bound)</>.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>占卜家套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Seer Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>占卜家套装（永久）</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Seer Outfit (Permanent)</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>发型·不灭华焰</>和<Highlight>顶饰·不朽永燃</>\n也可兑换为<Highlight>2</>张神眷牌"] = "Use to receive <Highlight>Hairstyle: Undying Brilliant Flame</> and <Highlight>Head Ornament: Immortal Ever-burning</>. \nCan also be exchanged for <Highlight>2</> God-Favored Cards.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>学徒套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Apprentice Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台场景</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> Corresponding Display Stand Scene </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台组件</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> corresponding display stand component </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台组件</>\n若已拥有此外观，则可选择分解获得3万绑定苏勒"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> corresponding display stand component </>. \n If you already own this appearance, you may choose to dismantle it to obtain 30,000 Bound Soles.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台表情</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> corresponding display stand expression </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台贴纸</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> corresponding display stand sticker </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应展台贴纸</>\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定苏勒×10000"] = "Use to obtain the <Highlight>corresponding display-stand sticker</>.\nDuplicates are automatically dismantled into 10000 Bound Soule.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>对应座驾</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> corresponding vehicle </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>战士套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Warrior Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>歌颂者套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Bard Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>窥秘人套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Mystery Pryer Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>观众套装</>，若拥有对应限时时装，可解除限时限制。"] = "After use, you can obtain the <Highlight>Spectator Outfit</>. If you already own the corresponding limited-time outfit, the time limit will be removed.",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>誓约专用展台场景</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> Covenant Exclusive Display Stand Scene </>",
    ["使用后可获得<Highlight>辉光圣庭专用展台场景</>"] = "Use to obtain <Highlight> Radiant Holy Court Exclusive Display Stand Scene </>",
    ["使用后可获得对应途径的序列时装（30天），晋升序列8后可升级为永久时装。"] = "After use, you can obtain the Sequence outfit for the corresponding Pathway (30 days). After advancing to Sequence 8, it can be upgraded to a permanent outfit.",
    ["使用后可获得神降座驾<Highlight>君临·火焰</>。\n可以赠送给好友，但无法在交易所出售。"] = "Use to obtain the divine descent vehicle <Highlight> Sovereign · Flame </>. \n Can be gifted to friends, but cannot be sold on the exchange.",
    ["使用后可重塑容貌。"] = "Use to reshape your appearance.",
    ["使用后可重新调整探秘属性，并将新方案保存至当前所在教团。"] = "After use, you can readjust your Exploration Attributes and save the new configuration to your current Order.",
    ["使用后可额外恢复活力值<Highlight>300</>，参与<Highlight>世界冒险、以战养战、教团等</>玩法后，可获得对应秘宝，消耗活力开启获得对应奖励。"] = "After use, you can restore an additional <Highlight>300</> Vitality. After participating in gameplay such as <Highlight>World Adventure, War-for-War, and Cults</>, you can obtain corresponding secret treasures, which can be opened with Vitality to receive rewards.",
    ["使用后在场景5209996变身为警察或扫帚，在廷根只会变身为警察"] = "After use, transform into a policeman or a broom in scene 5209996; in Tingen, you will only transform into a policeman.",
    ["使用后增加1点<Highlight>丰饶之树</>副本的<Highlight>外观讨伐进度</>，外观讨伐进度达一定值后可获得1件该副本内的随机普通外观"] = "After use, increases the <Highlight>Appearance Conquest Progress</> for the <Highlight>Tree of Abundance</> dungeon by 1 point. Once the progress reaches a certain value, you can obtain 1 random common appearance from that dungeon.",
    ["使用后增加1点<Highlight>五月庄园城堡</>副本的<Highlight>外观讨伐进度</>，外观讨伐进度达一定值后可获得1件该副本内的随机普通外观"] = "After use, increases the <Highlight>Appearance Conquest Progress</> for the <Highlight>May Manor · Castle</> dungeon by 1 point. Once the progress reaches a certain value, you can obtain 1 random common appearance from that dungeon.",
    ["使用后增加1点<Highlight>五月庄园花园</>副本的<Highlight>外观讨伐进度</>，外观讨伐进度达一定值后可获得1件该副本内的随机普通外观"] = "After use, increases the <Highlight>Appearance Conquest Progress</> for the <Highlight>May Manor · Garden</> dungeon by 1 point. Once the progress reaches a certain value, you can obtain 1 random common appearance from that dungeon.",
    ["使用后增加1点<Highlight>安提哥努斯笔记</>副本的<Highlight>外观讨伐进度</>，外观讨伐进度达一定值后可获得1件该副本内的随机普通外观"] = "After use, increases the <Highlight>Appearance Conquest Progress</> for the <Highlight>Antigonus Notebook</> dungeon by 1 point. Once the progress reaches a certain value, you can obtain 1 random common appearance from that dungeon.",
    ["使用后对使用者周围所有玩家（包含使用者）各扣除一部分理智值"] = "After use, deduct a portion of Sanity from all players (including the user) around the user.",
    ["使用后将根据性别自动获得下列外观部件"] = "After use, you will automatically obtain the following cosmetic parts based on your gender.",
    ["使用后将根据性别自动获得下列头像"] = "After use, you will automatically obtain the following avatars based on your gender.",
    ["使用后将获得下列外观部件。"] = "Use to obtain the following cosmetic parts.",
    ["使用后将解锁<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>典藏版，可获得发票单据获取效率提升、背包数量上限增加等特权奖励，随等级提升还可领取限定时装、限定饰品、圣杯·绑、染色材料等丰厚奖励，且使用后等级直接提升15级。\n请注意，只有当前未激活<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>时，才可使用道具。"] = "After use, you will unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Collector's Edition, granting privileges such as increased efficiency in obtaining invoices and increased inventory capacity. As you level up, you can also claim rich rewards including limited-edition outfits, limited-edition accessories, Grail (Bound), and dyeing materials. Additionally, your level will immediately increase by 15. \nPlease note that this item can only be used if the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> is not currently activated.",
    ["使用后将解锁<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>豪华版，可获得发票单据获取效率提升、背包数量上限增加等特权奖励，随等级提升还可领取限定时装、限定饰品、圣杯·绑、染色材料等丰厚奖励。\n请注意，只有当前未激活<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>时，才可使用道具。"] = "After use, you will unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Deluxe Edition, granting privileges such as increased efficiency in obtaining invoices and increased inventory capacity. As you level up, you can also claim rich rewards including limited-edition outfits, limited-edition accessories, Grail (Bound), and dyeing materials. \nPlease note that this item can only be used if the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> is not currently activated.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件基础装备。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Basic Equipment.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件普通成装。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Normal Finished Equipment.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件独珍装备。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Unique Equipment.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件神话装备。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Mythical Equipment.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件羁绊纹章。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Bond Emblem.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件进阶装备。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Advanced Equipment.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升10%。"] = "After use, marionette travel rewards increase by 10% for 12 hours.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索俱乐部区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Club area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索廷根区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Tingen area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索拉姆德古堡区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Lamud Castle area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索睡莲小镇区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Water Lily Town area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索金秋湖区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Golden Autumn Lake area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索霍纳奇斯山脉区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Hornacis Mountain Range area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升20%，且秘偶会自动探索霍纳奇斯花海区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 20%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Hornacis Sea of Flowers area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索俱乐部区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Club area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索廷根区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Tingen area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索拉姆德古堡区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Lamud Castle area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索睡莲小镇区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Water Lily Town area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索金秋湖区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Golden Autumn Lake area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索霍纳奇斯山脉区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Hornacis Mountain Range area.",
    ["使用后持续12小时，秘偶游历奖励提升30%，且秘偶会自动探索霍纳奇斯花海区域。"] = "Lasts for 12 hours after use. Marionette travel rewards increase by 30%, and the marionette will automatically explore the Hornacis Sea of Flowers area.",
    ["使用后播放花瓣特效（玩家个人可见）"] = "Plays a petal effect upon use (visible only to the player).",
