    ["使用后获得1件35装等的金色装备，会根据当前已穿戴装备，获得提升最大的装备。"] = "After use, obtain one piece of level 35 gold-quality equipment. It will provide the equipment that offers the greatest improvement based on your currently equipped gear.",
