    ["使用后获得1件64装等橙色装备，会根据当前已穿戴装备，获得提升最大的装备。"] = "After use, you will receive 1 piece of Level 64 Orange Equipment. It will be the piece that provides the greatest upgrade based on your currently equipped gear.",
