    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【奥秘灵光】</>。\n窥见奥秘，在千万种可能中精准地把握胜利。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Mysterious Aura] </>. \n Glimpse the mysteries and grasp victory precisely among thousands of possibilities.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【好运之触】</>。\n灵性触动的一瞬间，总是带来好运，大胆地赌上一切吧。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Touch of Good Luck] </>. \n The moment spirituality is touched, it always brings good luck; bet everything boldly.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【律法裁决】</>。\n只有律令，才是永恒，一时的成败只会带来微小的扰动。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Legal Judgment] </>. \n Only the law is eternal; temporary success or failure will only bring minor disturbances.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【永夜安宁】</>。\n无论结果如何，都不能打破命运中永恒的安宁。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Eternal Night Peace] </>. \n No matter the result, it cannot break the eternal peace of fate.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【灰雾主宰】</>。\n灰雾之上，命运早已落定。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Dominator of the Gray Fog] </>. \n Above the gray fog, fate has long been settled.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【皇室荣耀】</>。\n继承荣耀的命运，沐浴好运的眷顾。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Royal Glory] </>. \n Inherit the fate of glory and bathe in the favor of good luck.",
    ["使用后解锁专属投骰结算皮肤<Highlight>【纵横四海】</>。\n征服者无畏变数，而将四海收入囊中。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice settlement skin <Highlight> [Conqueror of the Four Seas] </>. \n The conqueror fears no variables and claims the four seas as their own.",
