    ["使用后解锁投骰结算.金"] = "Unlocks Dice Settlement: Gold upon use.",
    ["使用后释放巨人化技能，自身体型在30秒内变大1.5倍。"] = "After use, release the Giantification skill, increasing your size by 1.5 times for 30 seconds.",
    ["使用后释放执火者技能，在30秒内可以手持火把移动，冲刺和跳跃可以打断手持火炬状态。"] = "After use, release the Fire Holder skill. You can move while holding a torch for 30 seconds. Sprinting and jumping will interrupt the torch-holding state.",
    ["使用后随机获得一件高品阶的装备"] = "After use, randomly obtain one piece of high-tier equipment.",
    ["使用后，可以从以下<Highlight>橙色秘偶碎片</>中选择一个获得。"] = "After use, you can choose one from the following <Highlight>Orange Marionette Fragments</> to obtain.",
    ["使用后，可以从以下人脉历史投影中选择一个获得。"] = "After use, you can choose one from the following historical projections of connections to obtain.",
    ["使用后，可获得提升战斗技能、秘偶技能、人脉技能等级的点数"] = "After use, gain points to increase the level of combat skills, marionette skills, and connection skills.",
    ["使用后，回复1点贸易战争玩法中的商队体力"] = "After use, restore 1 point of caravan stamina in the Trade War gameplay.",
    ["使用后，对使用者周围至多12名玩家（含使用者本人）各恢复一部分理智值。"] = "After use, restore a portion of Sanity to up to 12 players (including the user) around the user.",
    ["使用后，开启任务“<Highlight>【神降】荣光织造·灵骑</>”，开启任务不会消耗该道具。\n可交易的该道具上架<Highlight>商城—交易所</>时，推荐售价<Highlight>40000万苏勒</>。"] = "After use, starts the quest \"<Highlight>[God's Descent] Glory Weaving · Spirit Mount</>\". Starting the quest will not consume this item. \n When this tradable item is listed on the <Highlight>Mall—Exchange</>, the recommended price is <Highlight>400,000,000 Sol </>.",
    ["使用后，开启任务“【神降】荣光织造·套装”。"] = "After use, starts the quest \"[God's Descent] Glory Weaving · Set\".",
    ["使用后，开启任务“【神降】荣光织造·翅膀”。"] = "After use, starts the quest \"[God's Descent] Glory Weaving · Wings\".",
    ["使用后，有<Highlight>极小概率获得零元购凭证</>或神降材料：<Highlight>神之契约、灵界星尘</>。"] = "After use, there is a <Highlight>very small chance to obtain a Zero-Cost Voucher</> or God-Descending materials: <Highlight>God's Contract, Spirit World Stardust</>.",
    ["使用后，有<Highlight>极小概率获得零元购凭证</>或神降材料：<Highlight>神之契约、灵界星尘、神话织茧、织茧游丝</>。"] = "After use, there is a <Highlight>very small chance to obtain a Zero-Cost Voucher</> or God-Descending materials: <Highlight>God's Contract, Spirit World Stardust, Mythical Cocoon, Cocoon Silk</>.",
    ["使用后，有概率获得<Highlight>零元购凭证</>、300金镑代金券、100金镑代金券、60金镑代金券或绑定苏勒。"] = "Use for a chance to obtain a <Highlight>Zero-Cost Voucher</>, a 300 Gold Pound Voucher, a 100 Gold Pound Voucher, a 60 Gold Pound Voucher, or Bound Soles.",
    ["使用后，立即恢复使用者一部分理智值。"] = "After use, immediately restore a portion of the user's Sanity.",
    ["使用后，立即降低使用者一部分理智值。"] = "After use, immediately reduce a portion of the user's Sanity.",
    ["使用后，解锁专属投骰背景皮肤<Highlight>【伦纳德·米切尔-紫藤絮语】</>。\n也许，命运和诗篇一样，都经不起逐字推敲。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice background skin <Highlight> [Leonard Mitchell - Wisteria Whispers] </>. \n Perhaps fate, like poetry, cannot withstand word-for-word scrutiny.",
    ["使用后，解锁专属投骰背景皮肤<Highlight>【命运赌桌】</>。\n在一切尚未尘埃落定之前，赌桌之上无人知晓成败。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice background skin <Highlight> [Fate Gambling Table] </>. \n Before everything is settled, no one knows success or failure at the gambling table.",
    ["使用后，解锁专属骰子皮肤<Highlight>【晨曦之骰】</>。\n一颗覆盖着晨曦光辉的骰子。掷出它，也许命运更偏爱你这一隅光芒。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice skin <Highlight> [Dawn Dice] </>. \n A die covered in the radiance of dawn. Throwing it might make fate favor your corner of light more.",
    ["使用后，解锁专属骰子皮肤<Highlight>【暗夜之骰】</>。\n一颗沾染着夜幕色泽的骰子。掷出它，也许会有其他存在于暗处替你拨转命运。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice skin <Highlight> [Night Dice] </>. \n A die stained with the color of the night. Throwing it might cause other existences in the shadows to manipulate fate for you.",
    ["使用后，解锁专属骰子皮肤<Highlight>【豪掷之金】</>。\n以极致的工艺打磨边缘至璨金，令每次投掷时，都闪烁着流光溢彩的色泽，是实力与品味最耀眼的证明。"] = "Use to unlock the exclusive dice skin <Highlight> [Golden Throw] </>. \n Polished with exquisite craftsmanship to a brilliant gold, every throw shimmers with iridescent colors; it is the most dazzling proof of strength and taste.",
    ["使用命运黄牌强化占卜家依靠普通攻击造成伤害的能力"] = "Use Fate Yellow Card to enhance the Seer's ability to deal damage via Normal Attacks",
    ["使用四叶手镯，挡住她的攻击！"] = "Use the Four-Leaf Bracelet to block her attack!",
    ["使用墨水……"] = "Using ink...",
    ["使用墨水位置"] = "Ink Usage Position",
    ["使用外挂"] = "Use of Cheats",
    ["使用夜香草、薄荷、月亮花等混合制作、又附加了特殊仪式效果的药剂。有一股清新的香味，闻起来令人头脑清醒、心情宁静。"] = "A potion made by mixing night-scented herbs, mint, moonflowers, etc., and adding special ritual effects. It has a fresh fragrance that makes one feel clear-headed and calm.",
    ["使用失败：使用后城堡资产溢出。礼包已存入背包。"] = "Use failed: castle assets will overflow after use. The gift pack has been stored in the inventory.",
    ["使用学徒扮演技能"] = "Use Apprentice acting skill",
    ["使用它，喊停的人开始狂奔，奔逃的人僵立原地。"] = "Using it, the one who calls for a halt begins to run wildly, while the one fleeing freezes in place.",
    ["使用山野珍稀食材制成的特级三明治，多层畅享，每一口都蕴含祝福。"] = "A premium sandwich made with rare wild ingredients. Enjoy the multi-layered taste; every bite contains a blessing.",
    ["使用岁月的棋局后自身获得8秒15%的减伤，岁月的棋局伤害提高100%。"] = "After using Gambit of the Ages, gain 15% Damage Reduction for 8 seconds; Gambit of the Ages damage increased by 100%.",
    ["使用岁月的棋局后自身获得8秒25%的减伤，岁月的棋局伤害提高250%。"] = "Using Gambit of the Ages grants you 25% Damage Reduction for 8 seconds; Gambit of the Ages damage increased by 250%.",
    ["使用并解锁"] = "Use and Unlock",
    ["使用愚者祝福时会释放彩带，造成范围伤害，并且降低命中的敌人攻击力的25%。"] = "Using Fool's Blessing releases ribbons, dealing area damage and reducing the Attack of hit enemies by 25%.",
    ["使用愚者祝福时，获得自身最大生命15%的护盾，持续10秒。"] = "Using Fool's Blessing grants a Shield equal to 15% of your Max Health, lasting 10 seconds.",
    ["使用愚者祝福时，获得自身最大生命20%的护盾，持续10秒。"] = "Using Fool's Blessing grants a Shield equal to 20% of your Max Health, lasting 10 seconds.",
    ["使用愤怒的蘑菇技能清除荒芜之藤！"] = "Use the Angry Mushroom skill to clear the Withered Vine!",
    ["使用成功，俱乐部资金增加%d"] = "Used successfully. Club funds increased by %d.",
    ["使用成功，俱乐部资金增加0(俱乐部资金已满)"] = "Used successfully. Club funds increased by 0 (Club funds are full).",
    ["使用成功，可前往封印物界面查看"] = "Used successfully, you can view it in the Sealed Artifact interface.",
    ["使用所选方案中的指定模块来覆盖当前方案的指定模块，注意此操作不可逆，请确保要替换的方案是您希望被替换的方案。"] = "Use the specified module from the selected scheme to overwrite the specified module of the current scheme. Note that this operation is irreversible; please ensure that the scheme you want to replace is the one you intend to replace.",
    ["使用手杖，进入半冥想状态，感知身体和心灵的变化，从而准确找到目标物体或人的位置。"] = "Uses a cane to enter a semi-meditative state, sensing changes in body and mind to accurately locate the target object or person.",
    ["使用手枪与空气炮攻击前方敌人。"] = "Use a pistol and Air Cannon to attack enemies in front.",
    ["使用手枪可造成高额单体伤害"] = "Use a pistol to deal high single-target damage",
