    ["使用指定道具  玩家移除任务道具（全部删除）  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  延迟执行  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  延迟执行  "] = "Use specified item; player removes quest item (delete all); player plays speech text visible only to themselves; delayed execution; player plays speech text visible only to themselves; delayed execution.",
    ["使用推荐"] = "Use recommendation",
    ["使用推荐方案替换当前方案"] = "Replace current scheme with recommended scheme",
    ["使用新框架的ReminderUI"] = "Use new framework ReminderUI",
    ["使用方式：<InvHighlight>使用者手指伸进环孔，手腕会浮现循环符号，并被读取当前记忆中印象最深的情景，灵魂陷入这一段情景的无限循环中。</>触碰受害者手腕符号的人，会以<Mark id=\"#159\">旁观者</>身份进入循环空间。\n\n注意事项：旁观者进入循环空间后，<InvHighlight>每经历一次循环，都会随机出现一个机关谜题</>。如果没有在限定时间内解开，就会被<Mark id=\"#159\">吞噬</>、转化为一个全新的机关谜题。"] = "Usage:<InvHighlight> When the user inserts their finger into the loop, a circular symbol will appear on their wrist, and the most profound scene in their current memory will be read, trapping their soul in an infinite loop of that scene.</> Anyone who touches the symbol on the victim's wrist will enter the loop space as a <Mark id=\"#159\">Bystander</>.\n\nPrecautions: After a Bystander enters the loop space,<InvHighlight> a random mechanism puzzle will appear with every cycle experienced.</> If it is not solved within the time limit, the person will be <Mark id=\"#159\">devoured</> and transformed into a brand-new mechanism puzzle.",
    ["使用旅行指南"] = "Use the Travel Guide",
    ["使用旅行指南吧，它会带我们去见第一片金雨落下的地方。"] = "Use the Travel Guide; it will take us to the place where the first golden rain fell.",
    ["使用旅行指南，前往下一目的地"] = "Use the Travel Guide to head to the next destination",
    ["使用本源技能后，能在挥舞击打中附加风刃效果，提升移速、破防、技能增强。同时，你也会因为这位歌者的糟糕歌喉，间歇性地获得禁锢、沉默、属性降低的负面效果。"] = "After using a source skill, you can add a Wind Blade effect to your strikes, increasing movement speed, Armor Break, and Skill Enhancement. At the same time, due to the terrible singing voice of this singer, you will intermittently receive negative effects such as Imprisonment, Silence, and attribute reduction.",
    ["使用条件"] = "Usage Conditions",
    ["使用模板"] = "Use Template",
    ["使用水晶球进行占卜，掌握星相学的各种知识。拥有干扰占卜及灵性直觉的能力。"] = "Uses a crystal ball for divination, mastering various knowledge of astrology. Possesses the ability to interfere with divination and spiritual intuition.",
    ["使用污秽果实的特殊能力，破除失智者身上的无敌效果"] = "Use the special ability of the Filthy Fruit to break the invincibility effect on the Demented One",
    ["使用洗牌时恢复自身最大生命值20%的血量。"] = "Using Shuffle Cards restores 20% of your Max Health.",
