    ["使用火焰跳跃后获得“火耀”效果：10秒内技能火焰跳跃可增加400%伤害，最多叠加3层。"] = "Using Flame Jump grants the \"Fire Flare\" effect: within 10 seconds, the Flame Jump skill can deal 400% increased damage, stacking up to 3 times.",
    ["使用火焰跳跃后降低诡秘之境冷却时间4秒，诡秘之境范围内的敌人伤害降低20%。"] = "Using Flame Jump reduces the Cooldown of Realm of Mysteries by 4 seconds, and enemies within the range of Realm of Mysteries have their damage reduced by 20%.",
