    ["使用限次"] = "Usage Limit",
    ["使用随机戏法攻击目标位置敌人，并根据戏法类型附加额外效果。"] = "Use random tricks to attack enemies at the target location and apply additional effects based on the trick type.",
    ["使用随机戏法攻击目标位置敌人，并根据戏法类型附加额外效果。释放空间牢笼后本技能效果得到强化并额外获得星空能量。"] = "Use random tricks to attack enemies at the target location, applying additional effects based on the trick type. After releasing Space Cage, this skill's effects are strengthened and you gain additional starlight energy.",
    ["使用霰弹枪可造成高额群体伤害"] = "Use the Shotgun to deal high group damage",
