    ["使用齿轮装置造成范围伤害并获得护盾。"] = "Use a gear device to deal area damage and gain a Shield.",
    ["使用！<h>非凡药剂</>"] = "Use! <h> Beyonder potion </>",
    ["使目标敌人防御降低，并对其造成伤害。"] = "Reduce the target enemy's defense and deal damage to them.",
    ["使自己难以被敌人所察觉，解除自身所受控制，进入霸体状态，获得减伤、受治疗提升并加速。"] = "Make oneself difficult to be detected by enemies, remove control effects received, enter Super Armor state, gain Damage Reduction, increased healing received, and acceleration.",
    ["例如学校，例如人类最珍贵的东西——知识与智慧。"] = "For example, a school, for example, the most precious things to humans—knowledge and wisdom.",
