    ["侍奉护盾"] = "Service Shield",
    ["侍奉诡秘的天使，初步掌握了相应领域的权柄。灵体和血肉之躯没有明显界限，既一体又分散，处在相当微妙的状态中，难以被锁定。"] = "An Angel serving the Mysteries, having initially mastered the authority of the corresponding domain. There is no clear boundary between the spirit body and the flesh; it is both integrated and dispersed, existing in a very subtle state that is difficult to lock onto.",
    ["侍奉连斩"] = "Servant's Flurry",
    ["侍女"] = "Maid",
    ["侍女-1星"] = "Maid - 1 Star",
    ["侍女-2星"] = "Maid - 2 Star",
    ["侍女-3星"] = "Maid - 3 Star",
    ["侍女捆绑禁锢"] = "Maid binding imprisonment",
    ["侍女（右）"] = "Maid (Right)",
    ["侍女（左）"] = "Maid (Left)",
    ["侍女：王子殿下让我给您说声抱歉，他还有事情，无法等待太久。"] = "Maid: His Highness asked me to apologize to you; he has other matters and cannot wait too long.",
    ["侍女：莫里亚蒂侦探，您又和那位小姐错过了。"] = "Maid: Detective Moriarty, you've missed that lady again.",
    ["侍者"] = "Attendant",
    ["侍者为你们端上了咖啡\n窗外阳光正好\n临街的咖啡桌上有人正在交谈。\n佛尔思和休坐在一张桌子上，盯着眼前的一块蛋糕。"] = "The waiter served you coffee \n The sun outside the window was just right \n Someone was talking at a coffee table by the street. \n Fors and Xio sat at a table, staring at a piece of cake in front of them.",
    ["侍者出来叫号了"] = "The waiter has come out to call the number",
