    ["依彤"] = "Yitong",
    ["依思"] = "Yisi",
    ["依我看，这事儿肯定是幽灵作祟！"] = "In my opinion, this must be the work of a ghost!",
    ["依托"] = "A pile of...",
    ["依托小丑序列的身体协调性与表情掌控能力，演绎 “欢笑掩悲伤” 的矛盾式表演，以夸张滑稽的外在动作、通过表层荒诞与内里落寞的强烈反差，贴合序列 “命运无奈却强装欢笑” 的核心特性。"] = "Utilizing the Clown pathway's physical coordination and facial control, perform a contradictory act of 'laughter masking sadness.' Through exaggerated, comical physical movements and a strong contrast between superficial absurdity and inner desolation, you align with the core characteristic of the sequence: 'helplessness of fate while forced to laugh.'",
    ["依托小丑序列赋予的超凡身体协调性与精准神态操控能力，将 “以荒诞表象遮蔽命运无奈，以夸张欢笑掩藏内心悲戚” 的序列核心特性，外化为一场情绪张力极强的扮演展演。\n使自己的魅力加3，学识加1。"] = "Relying on the extraordinary physical coordination and precise expression control granted by the Clown Sequence, the core Sequence trait of \"masking the helplessness of fate with absurd appearances, and hiding inner sorrow with exaggerated laughter\" is externalized into a performance with strong emotional tension. \nIncreases your Charisma by 3 and Knowledge by 1.",
    ["依托戏法大师对空间节点的精准感知，在特制戏法盒内布下微末空间锚点，打开盒盖时引动灵性激活一枚光粒锚点，光粒锚点激活则迸发一瞬刺目强光，同步伴类似照相机闪光灯的清脆音效。\n使自己的学识加3，武力加1。"] = "Relying on the Trick Master's precise perception of spatial nodes, place minor spatial anchors within a special trick box. When the lid is opened, spirituality is channeled to activate a light particle anchor, which bursts into a blinding flash of light, accompanied by a crisp sound effect similar to a camera flash. \nIncreases your Knowledge by 3 and Might by 1.",
    ["依托星灵体与灵界、星空的隐秘联系，以水晶、宝石或特殊金属制成的灵摆为媒介，感知目标事物的吉凶与趋势。\n灵摆转动方向与速度对应不同指引强度：\n ▸顺时针快速摆动为强烈肯定 / 顺遂倾向\n ▸顺时针慢速摆动为微弱肯定 / 平缓趋势\n ▸逆时针快速摆动为强烈否定 / 阻滞风险\n ▸逆时针慢速摆动为微弱否定 / 潜在阻碍\n ▸静止则代表无明确启示或存在干扰"] = "Relying on the secret connection between the astral body, the Spirit World, and the starry sky, use a pendulum made of crystal, gemstone, or special metal as a medium to perceive the fortune and trends of a target. \n The direction and speed of the pendulum's rotation correspond to different levels of guidance: \n ▸ Rapid clockwise swing: Strong affirmation / Favorable trend \n ▸ Slow clockwise swing: Weak affirmation / Gentle trend \n ▸ Rapid counter-clockwise swing: Strong negation / Stagnation risk \n ▸ Slow counter-clockwise swing: Weak negation / Potential obstacle \n ▸ Stationary: No clear revelation or interference present",
    ["依托星灵体与灵界、星空的隐秘联系，以水晶、宝石或特殊金属制成的灵摆为媒介，感知目标事物的吉凶与趋势。\n灵摆转动方向与速度对应不同指引强度：\n▸顺时针快速摆动为强烈肯定 / 顺遂倾向\n▸顺时针慢速摆动为微弱肯定 / 平缓趋势\n▸逆时针快速摆动为强烈否定 / 阻滞风险\n▸逆时针慢速摆动为微弱否定 / 潜在阻碍\n▸静止则代表无明确启示或存在干扰"] = "Relying on the secret connection between the astral body, the Spirit World, and the starry sky, use a pendulum made of crystal, gemstone, or special metal as a medium to perceive the fortune and trends of a target. \n The direction and speed of the pendulum's rotation correspond to different levels of guidance: \n ▸ Rapid clockwise swing: Strong affirmation / Favorable trend \n ▸ Slow clockwise swing: Weak affirmation / Gentle trend \n ▸ Rapid counter-clockwise swing: Strong negation / Stagnation risk \n ▸ Slow counter-clockwise swing: Weak negation / Potential obstacle \n ▸ Stationary: No clear revelation or interference present",
    ["依托魔术师提前备好的纸人与序列灵性，在预设触发条件达成时，使目标肉身转化为纸人替身并逐步消散，实现无痕迹退场。本质是提前规划的 “完美落幕”，契合 “魔术师不做无准备演出” 的核心原则，用于规避危险或完成扮演闭环。"] = "Relying on the paper figurines prepared by the Magician and the sequence's spirituality, transform the physical body into a Paper Figurine Substitute when pre-set conditions are met, causing it to gradually dissipate and allowing for a traceless exit. Essentially a pre-planned 'perfect curtain call,' this aligns with the core principle that 'a Magician never performs without preparation,' used to avoid danger or complete an acting loop.",
    ["依据不同层数进入不同state"] = "Enter different states based on different layers.",
