    ["依然要打开"] = "Still want to open it",
    ["依照羊皮纸上的预言，在祭坛上摆放<P_Yellow>预言之物</>。\n“一物收存，新生之种，葬于石像之旁。“"] = "According to the prophecy on the parchment, place the<P_Yellow> object of prophecy</> on the altar.\n \"One object stored, the seed of new life, buried beside the stone statue.\"",
    ["依照羊皮纸上的预言，在祭坛上摆放<P_Yellow>预言之物</>。\n“一物藏匿，羔羊归家之音不再奏响。”"] = "According to the prophecy on the parchment, place the<P_Yellow> object of prophecy</> on the altar.\n \"One object hidden, the sound of the lamb returning home no longer plays.\"",
    ["依照羊皮纸上的预言，在祭坛上摆放<P_Yellow>预言之物</>。\n“一物隐蔽，绯红月辉照耀其上。”"] = "According to the prophecy on the parchment, place the<P_Yellow> object of prophecy</> on the altar.\n \"One object concealed, crimson moonlight shines upon it.\"",
