    ["保持的san值，并且阻拦生效期间的所有san值修改\n\n那些被阻拦的reason照样认为是正常触发了的，也就是计入次数上限\n\n也会认为是一次修改，触发修改相关的trigger"] = "Maintained SAN value, and blocks all SAN value modifications during the effective period \n \n Those blocked reasons are still considered to have been triggered normally, i.e., counted towards the frequency limit \n \n It will also be considered as a modification, triggering modification-related triggers.",
