    ["俯身后退重硬直"] = "Heavy Stiffness (Leaning Forward, Knockback)",
    ["俯身持戟，一往无前地向敌人冲锋，携势将目标持续击退并造成伤害，随后终结一击刺出长戟将目标击退并造成伤害，附加减疗和滞涩，自身获得太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）。目标霸体会停止冲撞。"] = "Lean forward holding the halberd and charge at the enemy with unstoppable momentum, continuously knocking back the target and dealing damage. Then, deliver a finishing thrust with the halberd to knock back the target and deal damage, adding Healing Reduction and Stagnation. The user gains Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear). The charge will stop if the target has Super Armor.",
    ["俯身持戟，宛如流光般向敌人突刺，携势将目标刺倒在地，附加减疗和滞涩，自身获得太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）。"] = "Lean forward holding the halberd and thrust at the enemy like a stream of light, knocking the target to the ground with the momentum, adding Healing Reduction and Stagnation. The user gains Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear).",
