    ["俱乐部四方联赛赛区晋级天启组"] = "Club Four-Way League division promoted to Apocalypse Group",
    ["俱乐部图书馆中积累的每一本典籍，都是前辈非凡者以生命换来的经验结晶；而那些在命运转折处伸出援手的同道，则是比任何魔药都更可靠的依靠。 知识与同伴，是诡秘世界中最稳固的庇护。\n<Talent>在秩序世界地图探索时，体力上限增加10%</>。"] = "Every classic book accumulated in the club library is the crystallization of experience exchanged for the lives of predecessor Beyonders; and those fellow travelers who lend a helping hand at the turning points of fate are more reliable than any potion. Knowledge and companions are the most stable shelter in the mysterious world. \n<Talent>When exploring the Order World map, Stamina cap increases by 10%</>.",
    ["俱乐部图书馆中积累的每一本典籍，都是前辈非凡者以生命换来的经验结晶；而那些在命运转折处伸出援手的同道，则是比任何魔药都更可靠的依靠。 知识与同伴，是诡秘世界中最稳固的庇护。\n<Talent>在秩序世界地图探索时，体力上限增加10%</>。\n<Talent>投骰时，获得俱乐部成员协助重投的概率增加10%</>。"] = "Every classic book accumulated in the club library is the crystallization of experience exchanged for the lives of predecessor Beyonders; and those fellow travelers who lend a helping hand at the turning points of fate are more reliable than any potion. Knowledge and companions are the most stable shelter in the mysterious world. \n<Talent>When exploring the Order World map, Stamina cap increases by 10%</>. \n<Talent>When rolling dice, the probability of obtaining assistance from club members for a reroll increases by 10%</>.",
    ["俱乐部图书馆中积累的每一本典籍，都是前辈非凡者以生命换来的经验结晶；而那些在命运转折处伸出援手的同道，则是比任何魔药都更可靠的依靠。 知识与同伴，是诡秘世界中最稳固的庇护。\n<Talent>在秩序世界地图探索时，体力上限增加10%</>。\n<Talent>投骰时，获得俱乐部成员协助重投的概率增加30%</>。"] = "Every classic book accumulated in the club library is the crystallization of experience exchanged for the lives of predecessor Beyonders; and those fellow travelers who lend a helping hand at the turning points of fate are more reliable than any potion. Knowledge and companions are the most stable shelter in the mysterious world. \n<Talent>When exploring the Order World map, Stamina cap increases by 10%</>. \n<Talent>When rolling dice, the probability of obtaining assistance from club members for a reroll increases by 30%</>.",
    ["俱乐部图书馆中积累的每一本典籍，都是前辈非凡者以生命换来的经验结晶；而那些在命运转折处伸出援手的同道，则是比任何魔药都更可靠的依靠。 知识与同伴，是诡秘世界中最稳固的庇护。\n<Talent>投骰时，获得俱乐部成员协助重投的概率增加10%</>。"] = "Every classic book accumulated in the club library is the crystallization of experience exchanged for the lives of predecessor Beyonders; and those fellow travelers who lend a helping hand at the turning points of fate are more reliable than any potion. Knowledge and companions are the most stable shelter in the mysterious world. \n<Talent>When rolling dice, the probability of obtaining assistance from club members for a reroll increases by 10%</>.",
