    ["候补会员无法进入联赛，请保持活跃，联系管理加入正式会员"] = "Substitute members cannot enter the league. Please stay active and contact management to become a full member.",
    ["候补会员是俱乐部的储备力量，有部分公会玩法无法参与，可继续努力，保持活跃联系管理加入会员。"] = "Reserve members are the Club's reserve force; some guild activities are unavailable to them. Keep working hard and stay active to contact management for promotion to official member.",
