    ["候补会员转正"] = "Probationary Member Promotion",
    ["候补成员无参赛资格"] = "Substitute members are not qualified for competition",
    ["候补是俱乐部的储备力量，有部分公会玩法无法参与，可继续努力，保持活跃联系管理加入会员。"] = "Reserves are the club's reserve force; they cannot participate in some guild modes. Keep working hard, stay active, and contact management to join as a member.",
