    ["倚着邓恩"] = "Leaning against Dunn",
    ["借<h>金币</>重历历史"] = "Borrow the <h>gold coin</> to relive history",
    ["借光潜藏"] = "Hide by Light",
    ["借光潜藏-获得资源"] = "Hide by Light - Obtain Resource",
    ["借助3-888的能力，让小黛西的灵体进入循环，从而保持身体的不死？"] = "By using the ability of 3-888 to let Little Daisy's spirit body enter the loop, thereby keeping her body from dying?",
    ["借助<Highlight>愚者</>的伟力，让玩家暂时获得建造<Highlight>乌托邦</>的能力。\n\n建造流程如下：\n\n· 圈出范围——圈选一块要生成的建筑面积（如果场上已有建筑，可以点击清空按钮重置建造区）\n\n· 调整参数——调整建筑的高度，点击右上角建筑比例按钮，可以调整更详细的参数\n\n· 查看生成效果——点击生成按钮后，会先生成建筑群预览效果，如果不满意可以点击按钮刷新\n\n· 消耗城堡资产并生成——确定要生成的样式后，点击生成按钮，消耗城堡资产并生成\n"] = "With the great power of the <Highlight>Fool</>, players can temporarily gain the ability to build a <Highlight>Utopia</>.\n\nThe construction process is as follows:\n\n· Circle the area—Select an area for the building to be generated (if there are already buildings on the field, you can click the clear button to reset the construction area)\n\n· Adjust parameters—Adjust the height of the building; click the building scale button in the top right corner to adjust more detailed parameters\n\n· View generation effect—After clicking the generate button, a preview of the building complex will be generated first. If you are not satisfied, you can click the button to refresh\n\n· Consume Castle assets and generate—After confirming the style to be generated, click the generate button to consume Castle assets and generate the building.\n",
    ["借助封印于空想格罗塞尔游记中的神秘力量，穿越散落世界各地的残页，踏入每一页独立封存的异域秘境。\n来吧，亲爱的伙伴，这是你的故事，这是你的传奇。"] = "With the help of the mysterious power sealed in the empty Groselle's Travels, travel through the scattered pages of the world and step into the independent secret realms sealed on each page. \n Come, dear partner, this is your story, this is your legend.",
    ["借助封印物<Highlight>历史回廊</>，可在历史孔隙中寻找散落在历史中的人物，与他们结识，向过去借取力量。\n多次结识能提高自身对目标的了解程度，获得对方更真实强大的能力。\n1、可通过<Highlight>结交</>获取<Highlight>人脉</>，解锁对应技能\n2、重复获取的人脉可用来提升人脉层次，从而增强相应技能效果"] = "With the help of the Sealed Artifact <Highlight> Corridor of History </>, you can search for figures scattered in history within the gaps of history, get to know them, and borrow power from the past. \n Getting to know them multiple times can improve your understanding of the target and obtain more authentic and powerful abilities from them. \n 1. You can obtain <Highlight> Connections </> through <Highlight> Befriending </> to unlock corresponding skills. \n 2. Repeatedly obtained Connections can be used to improve the level of Connections, thereby enhancing the corresponding skill effects.",
    ["借口"] = "Excuse",
    ["借口离开"] = "Make an excuse to leave",
    ["借学徒序列赋予的基础空间灵性，感知空间锚点，打开一扇通往未知的传送门，学徒可以自身通过这个传送门进行穿梭。\n仅可以在廷根使用。\n使自身获得直觉加1。"] = "Borrowing the basic spatial spirituality granted by the Apprentice Sequence, sense spatial anchors and open a portal to the unknown, which the Apprentice can use to travel through. \nCan only be used in Tingen.\n Increases your Intuition by 1.",
    ["借学徒序列赋予的基础空间灵性，感知空间锚点，打开一扇通往未知的传送门，学徒可以自身通过这个传送门进行穿梭。\n通过开门对「空间解构与重构」的基础感知，彰显学徒对空间规则的初步触碰。"] = "Relying on the basic spatial spirituality granted by the Apprentice sequence, perceive spatial anchors to open a portal to the unknown, allowing the Apprentice to traverse through it. \n Through the basic perception of 'spatial deconstruction and reconstruction' when opening the door, the Apprentice's initial contact with spatial rules is manifested.",
    ["借我五十，不，五金镑，我会给你百分之百的利润报酬！"] = "Lend me fifty, no, five pounds, and I will give you a 100% profit return!",
    ["借我五十，待我卷土重来！"] = "Lend me fifty, until I make a comeback!",
    ["借格斗学者对格斗技巧的精准解析与钻研，瞬间摆出一套标准到极致的格斗起手式，凝势保持数秒后自然恢复常态。起手式凝练的技巧轨迹留存在周身，让自身下一次攻击同步浮现一道格斗残影，贴合格斗学者 “以窥秘之精，塑格斗之势” 的核心特性。"] = "Drawing on the Fighting Scholar's precise analysis and study of combat techniques, you instantly strike a standard, ultimate combat stance. After holding the stance for a few seconds, you naturally return to your normal state. The refined technique trajectory from the stance lingers around you, causing your next attack to manifest a combat afterimage, adhering to the core characteristic of the Fighting Scholar: \"Using the essence of mystery to shape the momentum of combat.\"",
    ["借用一下"] = "Borrow it for a moment",
    ["借用警车"] = "Borrow Police Car",
    ["借由占卜家序列赋予的星灵体感知，以蕴含自然灵性的灵摆为桥梁，搭建现实与灵界的微弱通道，将抽象的灵界象征转化为具象的摆动信号。\n使自己的直觉加1。"] = "Utilizing the astral perception granted by the Seer Sequence, using a pendulum containing natural spirituality as a bridge to build a weak channel between reality and the Spirit World, converting abstract Spirit World symbols into concrete swinging signals. \nIncreases your Intuition by 1.",
