    ["值夜者3"] = "Nighthawk 3",
    ["值夜者以及其他类似的审判机关里，每年处理的非凡事件中，有四分之一是<P_Yellow>非凡者的失控</>。"] = "Among the Beyonder incidents handled by the Nighthawks and other similar judicial organizations every year, one-fourth are <P_Yellow>loss of control by Beyonders</>.",
    ["值夜者们追踪宣扬罗塞尔大帝的宣传单，在中央广场发现了一个污染入口。"] = "The Nighthawks tracked the flyers promoting Emperor Roselle and discovered a corruption entrance in the Central Plaza.",
    ["值夜者们都该死！"] = "Nighthawks should all die!",
    ["值夜者们（一）"] = "The Nighthawks (I)",
    ["值夜者们（三）"] = "The Nighthawks (III)",
    ["值夜者们（二）"] = "The Nighthawks (II)",
    ["值夜者合照"] = "Nighthawks Group Photo",
    ["值夜者和代罚者之间会有竞争吗？"] = "Is there competition between the Nighthawks and the Mandated Punishers?",
    ["值夜者守这里。这是廷根的中轴线——尸潮要是过这条线，半个城就没了。"] = "Nighthawks guard here. This is the central axis of Tingen—if the zombie tide crosses this line, half the city will be gone.",
    ["值夜者小队"] = "Nighthawk Squad",
    ["值夜者小队再度集结，向最危险地带进发。任务目标：不惜代价，夺回笔记！"] = "The Nighthawk squad gathers once more to head into the most dangerous zone. Mission objective: Retrieve the notebook at all costs!",
    ["值夜者小队利用封印物2-049寻找安提哥努斯后裔的特性，驾车寻找瑞尔比伯的下落……"] = "The Nighthawks squad uses the characteristics of Sealed Artifact 2-049 to search for the descendants of Antigonus, driving to find the whereabouts of Riel Bieber...",
    ["值夜者小队利用封印物2-049寻找安提哥努斯后裔的特性，驾车寻找瑞尔比伯的下落……\n\n<Notice>组队模式下和</><Highlight>家族</><Notice>成员一起进入副本，若未达到推荐战力，可获得属性增益补正。补正效果与队伍同家族成员数目和家族等级相关。</>"] = "The Nighthawk squad uses the Sealed Artifact 2-049 to locate the characteristics of the Antigonus family descendants, driving to find the whereabouts of Riel Bieber... \n\n<Notice> Enter the dungeon in team mode with </><Highlight> Family </><Notice> members. If the recommended combat power is not met, you can receive attribute bonus adjustments. The adjustment effect is related to the number of family members in the team and the family level. </>",
    ["值夜者小队利用封印物2-049寻找安提哥努斯后裔的特性，驾车寻找瑞尔比伯的下落。"] = "The Nighthawk team used the characteristics of Sealed Artifact 2-049 to track the Antigonus descendant, driving to find Riel Bieber's whereabouts.",
    ["值夜者小队藉此查到海纳斯，邓恩巧合地在他梦里看见了真实造物主的清晰形象，受到了巨大的伤害……”"] = "The Nighthawks squad used this to track down Haines. Dunn coincidentally saw the clear image of the True Creator in his dream and suffered tremendous damage...",
    ["值夜者小队长"] = "Nighthawk Captain",
    ["值夜者小队队员"] = "Nighthawk Squad Member",
    ["值夜者小队队长"] = "Nighthawks Squad Captain",
    ["值夜者小队？"] = "Nighthawks squad?",
    ["值夜者就是在这样的事件中，一次又一次尽力保护着廷根。对抗敌人，也对抗我们自己。"] = "Nighthawks are the ones who, in such events, try their best to protect Tingen time and time again. Fighting against enemies, and also fighting against ourselves.",
    ["值夜者总部"] = "Nighthawks Headquarters",
    ["值夜者掌握的完整途径是“不眠者”，应该是队长和伦纳德他们所在的途径。但是我需要继续积攒功劳，才能有成为“不眠者”的资格。"] = "The complete pathway mastered by the Nighthawks is [Seleepless], which should be the pathway Captain and Leonard belong to. But I need to continue accumulating merit to be eligible to become a [Sleepless].",
    ["值夜者有危险，阻止怪物击破防护罩！"] = "The Nighthawks are in danger; stop the monsters from breaking the protective shield!",
    ["值夜者来考察？这也……太夸张了吧？是不是先问问罗珊的想法比较好？"] = "Nighthawks coming to vet? This is... too exaggerated, isn't it? Wouldn't it be better to ask Rozanne's thoughts first?",
    ["值夜者献花"] = "Nighthawk Offering Flowers",
    ["值夜者男"] = "Nighthawk (Male)",
    ["值夜者的工作，大部分时间紧张忙碌，但也要学着给自己找些放松的方式。"] = "The work of a Nighthawk is tense and busy most of the time, but one must also learn to find ways to relax.",
    ["值夜者的情报指向玫瑰天堂——邦尼掌控的夜总会。潜入纸醉金迷的牢笼，揭露色欲之罪背后的真相。"] = "The Nighthawks' intelligence points to Rose Paradise—the nightclub controlled by Bonnie. Infiltrate this cage of debauchery and reveal the truth behind the sin of lust.",
    ["值夜者的新合照"] = "New Nighthawks Group Photo",
    ["值夜者紧急集合！全新的挑战就在眼前，你的每个选择，都将决定命运！"] = "Nighthawks, assemble! A brand new challenge is right before you. Every choice you make will determine your fate!",
    ["值夜者聚餐"] = "Nighthawks Dinner",
    ["值夜者聚餐-记忆回溯"] = "Nighthawks Dinner - Retrace",
    ["值夜者还会给你们报销射击练习的子弹？"] = "Do the Nighthawks even reimburse you for shooting practice bullets?",
