    ["值夜者，有人要自杀，你跟我一起来。"] = "Nighthawk, someone is trying to commit suicide. Come with me.",
    ["值夜者，那蜡烛会引来亡灵。我去照看罗德，你解决亡灵。"] = "Nighthawk, that candle will attract the undead. I'll go look after Rod, you deal with the undead.",
    ["值夜者，黑夜女神教会的高级执事之一；塔罗会成员，代号“星星”。\n黑鬓绿瞳，长相不错，有股诗人的浪漫气质，天生不喜欢规矩。"] = "Nighthawk, one of the high-ranking deacons of the Evernight Goddess Church; member of the Tarot Club, codenamed \"The Star.\" \n Black hair and green eyes, good-looking, with a poet's romantic temperament, naturally disliking rules.",
    ["值得赞赏的努力……让我们再挑战一次！"] = "An effort worthy of praise... let's challenge it again!",
