    ["假设仆人所言属实，即他进入卧室前男爵已经死去，那当时屋内必定有人在伪装男爵的声音。"] = "Assuming the servant's statement is true—that the Baron was already dead before he entered the bedroom—then someone must have been faking the Baron's voice inside the room at that time.",
