    ["偏见蒙蔽了你的双眼，错误的判断将带来灾难。放下成见，否则你将成为不公的帮凶。 "] = "Prejudice blinds your eyes; wrong judgments will bring disaster. Let go of your preconceptions, or you will become an accomplice to injustice.",
    ["做个好梦，阿曼达女士。"] = "Have a good dream, Ms. Amanda.",
    ["做个实验，逗他们玩玩，前十一个都没什么意思。"] = "Just an experiment, playing around with them. The first eleven were all quite boring.",
    ["做个木雕吗？"] = "Should I make a wood carving?",
    ["做义工能够平衡我们的劳动付出，我和她再也不因此吵架了。"] = "Volunteering can balance our labor input, and she and I no longer argue because of it.",
    ["做了他们的夫人，就不用再为别人洗衣服了。来这里也不用攒上三个月的钱……"] = "If I become their lady, I won't have to wash clothes for others anymore. I wouldn't have to save up for three months just to come here...",
    ["做出正确的舞蹈动作至少5次"] = "Perform the correct dance moves at least 5 times",
    ["做到观众席"] = "Sit in the audience",
    ["做好准备"] = "Prepare",
    ["做好准备后，告知崔佛"] = "Inform Trevor once you are ready",
    ["做好议员的秘诀是足够<P_Yellow>幽默</>。"] = "The secret to being a good councilor is to be sufficiently <P_Yellow>humorous</>.",
    ["做完了？算你运气好……你的三苏勒，拿去。"] = "Finished? Consider yourself lucky... Here's your three shillings.",
    ["做完面包做炖汤，做完炖汤做甜品……别急，都做得完。"] = "Make bread, then make stew, then make dessert... don't worry, it can all be done.",
    ["做工不错。但这是单股银。朱利安，你看起来脸色不大好。"] = "The workmanship is good. But this is single-strand silver. Julian, you don't look so good.",
    ["做工精致造型古典的烟斗，角落里刻着D.S。"] = "An exquisitely crafted, classic-style pipe with 'D.S.' engraved in the corner.",
    ["做工考究的女士包袋，里面有个青蛙标本正探出头来。"] = "An elegantly crafted lady's handbag with a frog specimen peeking out from inside.",
    ["做幕后的谋划者，哪怕目的已经达成，也无人察觉。"] = "Be the mastermind behind the scenes; even when the goal is achieved, no one will notice.",
    ["做得好！仅仅出于嫉妒就要把别人置于死地，愿太阳把这阴暗丑恶的灵魂化为灰烬！"] = "Well done! To drive someone to their death out of mere jealousy—may the sun turn this dark and ugly soul into ashes!",
    ["做得好，现在强化你的技能吧。"] = "Well done, now strengthen your skills.",
    ["做得很好。灵性之墙已成，仪式空间初步稳固。现在，仪式的核心开始了。看那些被点亮的区域。"] = "Well done. The Wall of Spirituality is formed, and the ritual space is initially stabilized. Now, the core of the ritual begins. Look at those illuminated areas.",
    ["做得很好，现在告诉我，你看见什么了？"] = "Well done. Now tell me, what do you see?",
    ["做我的辅助。走吧。"] = "Be my support. Let's go.",
    ["做点什么好呢？首先得有肉！"] = "What should I make? First, there must be meat!",
    ["做研究太累了，上周那个实验的数据又错了，早上的组会又被老师骂了一通。"] = "Doing research is too exhausting. The data for last week's experiment was wrong again, and I was scolded by my professor at the group meeting this morning.",
    ["做蘑菇多好。"] = "It's nice to be a mushroom.",
    ["做计划的目的不是束缚自己，而是提醒。"] = "The point of making a plan isn't to constrain yourself, but to serve as a reminder.",
    ["做这些事的意义是什么？"] = "What is the meaning of doing these things?",
    ["停下！泡泡，土豆，妈妈的亲亲小宝贝，我们该去公园了！"] = "Stop! Bubble, Potato, Mommy's precious little baby, we have to go to the park!",
    ["停下，{{先生|女士}}……请原谅我的鲁莽，但您暂时不能靠近这里。"] = "Stop, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}... Please forgive my rudeness, but you cannot approach this place for the time being.",
    ["停下，先生……请原谅我的鲁莽，但您暂时不能靠近这里。"] = "Stop, sir... Please forgive my rudeness, but you cannot approach this area for the time being.",
