    ["停！你有没有感觉到一阵阴风？好冷啊……"] = "Stop! Do you feel a cold breeze? It's so cold...",
    ["停，我的戒指是路边小摊最廉价的，上面有红色的玻璃。我弄丢戒指时，常常去松鼠窝旁的花丛晒太阳。"] = "Stop, my ring is the cheapest one from a roadside stall, with red glass on it. When I lost my ring, I often went to sunbathe in the flower bushes by the squirrel nest.",
    ["健壮的"] = "Robust",
    ["健壮的猪"] = "A robust pig",
    ["健壮的猪，沉稳的牛，听话的狗，灵巧的兔！只有您想不到的，没有我们没有的！来，选一位吧！"] = "Strong pigs, steady cows, obedient dogs, agile rabbits! There is nothing you can't think of that we don't have! Come, pick one!",
    ["健康护符"] = "Health Amulet",
    ["健康游戏忠告： 抵制不良游戏，拒绝盗版游戏。注意自我保护，谨防受骗上当。适度游戏益脑，沉迷游戏伤身。合理安排时间，享受健康生活。\n本游戏适合年满16周岁以上（未成年人请在家长陪同下体验）的用户使用。本公司积极履行《网络游戏行业防沉迷自律公约》。 \n根据国家新闻出版署 《关于防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》和《关于进一步严格管理 切实防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》，所有用户必须使用本人身份信息进行实名登记，未成年人将纳入防沉迷限制。\n著作权人：杭州弹指宇宙科技有限公司 运营单位：杭州弹指宇宙网络有限公司 出版单位：上海文艺音像电子出版社有限公司 批准文号：国新出审[2024]659号 出版物号：ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP备案号：<HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"https://beian.miit.gov.cn\">浙ICP备2024115807号-3A</>"] = "Healthy Gaming Advice: Resist harmful games, refuse pirated games. Protect yourself and beware of scams. Moderate gaming is good for the brain, while addiction is harmful to the body. Arrange your time reasonably and enjoy a healthy life. \n This game is suitable for users aged 16 and above (minors should be accompanied by parents). Our company actively fulfills the \"Online Game Industry Anti-Addiction Self-Discipline Convention\". \n According to the \"Notice on Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" and the \"Notice on Further Strictly Managing and Effectively Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" issued by the National Press and Publication Administration, all users must use their personal identity information for real-name registration, and minors will be subject to anti-addiction restrictions. \n Copyright Holder: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Technology Co., Ltd. Operator: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Network Co., Ltd. Publisher: Shanghai Literature and Art Audio-Visual Electronic Publishing House Co., Ltd. Approval Number: Guo Xin Chu Shen [2024] No. 659 Publication Number: ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP Filing Number: <HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"https://beian.miit.gov.cn\"> Zhe ICP Bei 2024115807 Hao-3A </>",
    ["健康游戏忠告： 抵制不良游戏，拒绝盗版游戏。注意自我保护，谨防受骗上当。适度游戏益脑，沉迷游戏伤身。合理安排时间，享受健康生活。\n本游戏适合年满16周岁以上（未成年人请在家长陪同下体验）的用户使用。本公司积极履行《网络游戏行业防沉迷自律公约》。 \n根据国家新闻出版署 《关于防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》和《关于进一步严格管理 切实防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》，所有用户必须使用本人身份信息进行实名登记，未成年人将纳入防沉迷限制。\n著作权人：杭州弹指宇宙科技有限公司 运营单位：杭州弹指宇宙网络有限公司 出版单位：上海文艺音像电子出版社有限公司 批准文号：国新出审[2024]659号 出版物号：ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP备案号：<Underline>浙ICP备2024115807号-3A</>"] = "Healthy Gaming Advice: Resist harmful games, refuse pirated games. Protect yourself and beware of scams. Moderate gaming is good for the brain, while addiction is harmful to the body. Arrange your time reasonably and enjoy a healthy life. \n This game is suitable for users aged 16 and above (minors should be accompanied by parents). Our company actively fulfills the \"Online Game Industry Anti-Addiction Self-Discipline Convention\". \n According to the \"Notice on Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" and the \"Notice on Further Strictly Managing and Effectively Preventing Minors from Becoming Addicted to Online Games\" issued by the National Press and Publication Administration, all users must use their personal identity information for real-name registration, and minors will be subject to anti-addiction restrictions. \n Copyright Holder: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Technology Co., Ltd. Operator: Hangzhou Danzhi Universe Network Co., Ltd. Publisher: Shanghai Literature and Art Audio-Visual Electronic Publishing House Co., Ltd. Approval Number: Guo Xin Chu Shen [2024] No. 659 Publication Number: ISBN 978-7-498-13290-1 ICP Filing Number: <Underline> Zhe ICP Bei 2024115807 Hao-3A </>",
    ["健康真好，我经常被头痛折磨。"] = "It's great to be healthy; I am often tormented by headaches.",
    ["偶尔也会有得不到答案的情况，这种时候，也许是命运在向你说“这个不能问”吧。"] = "Occasionally, there are situations where you cannot get an answer. At such times, perhaps it is fate telling you, 'You cannot ask this.'",
    ["偶尔会想起以前的事，那些已经离开的同伴。"] = "Occasionally, I think of the past, of those companions who have already left.",
    ["偶尔我能在睡梦中闻到他身上佛手柑和迷迭香的味道……但出声的话肯定会把他吓跑吧？"] = "Occasionally, I can smell the scent of bergamot and rosemary on him in my dreams... but if I were to speak up, I'd definitely scare him away, right?",
    ["偶尔探望他们，是我唯一能做的事了。"] = "Visiting them occasionally is the only thing I can do.",
    ["偶尔缺一个文职人员，市政厅照样运转！"] = "City Hall will still run even if a clerical worker is missing occasionally!",
    ["偶尔还能去旁听感兴趣的讲座。我可太满意这份工作了。"] = "I can even occasionally sit in on lectures I'm interested in. I'm so satisfied with this job.",
    ["偶戏面具"] = "Marionette Mask",
    ["偶然来到这里的格尔曼注意到了庆典的异动，他想要阻止这场恐怖的献祭。"] = "Gehrman, who had arrived by chance, noticed the anomalies in the festival and wanted to stop this horrific sacrifice.",
    ["偶然相遇"] = "Chance Encounter",
    ["偶遇乞讨的流浪儿"] = "Encounter a begging homeless child",
    ["偶遇克莱恩"] = "Bump into Klein",
    ["偶遇斯林太太"] = "Ran into Mrs. Stiling",
    ["偶遇罗珊"] = "Encountering Rozanne",
    ["偷"] = "Steal",
    ["偷东西被辱骂"] = "Insulted for stealing",
    ["偷偷观察"] = "Secretly observe",
    ["偷偷观察相亲"] = "Secretly Observe Blind Date",
    ["偷偷跟在<h>丹和奈特</>后面"] = "Secretly follow behind <h> Dan and Knight </>",
    ["偷取工人的懒惰念头"] = "Steal the worker's lazy thoughts",
    ["偷取工贼的念头"] = "Steal the scab's thoughts",
    ["偷取目标的休息念头！\n提示：需要将休息念头推到目标点。"] = "Steal the target's thought of resting!\nHint: You need to push the thought of resting to the target point.",
    ["偷取目标的工作念头！\n提示：需要将工作念头推到目标点。"] = "Steal the target's thought of working!\nHint: You need to push the thought of working to the target point.",
    ["偷听"] = "Eavesdrop",
    ["偷听-禁锢+播动作"] = "Eavesdrop - Imprisonment + Play Animation",
    ["偷听一下"] = "Eavesdrop",
    ["偷听两人说什么"] = "Eavesdrop on what the two are saying",
    ["偷听中……"] = "Eavesdropping...",
    ["偷听了侦探与占卜师的交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">侦探的助手抢走了占卜师的道具，并在路口死死缠住了开膛手。</>\n与侦探交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">当前无人的“夜晚”是被剧本篡改的，正确的舞台时间应是黄昏。</>\n\n经过推理，知道了这一幕的真相是：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">在黄昏之下，侦探的助手借着表演的名义拦住了开膛手，从而解救了少女。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the conversation between the detective and the diviner, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The detective's assistant snatched the diviner's prop and held the Ripper fast at the intersection. </>\nCommunicated with the detective, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The current deserted \"night\" was tampered with by the script; the correct stage time should be dusk. </>\n\nAfter reasoning, the truth of this scene is: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">At dusk, the detective's assistant blocked the Ripper under the guise of a performance, thereby rescuing the young girl. </>",
    ["偷听了侦探与占卜师的交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">侦探的助手</>抢走了占卜师的道具，并在路口死死缠住了开膛手。\n与侦探交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n当前无人的“夜晚”是被剧本篡改的，正确的舞台时间应是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">黄昏</>。\n\n经过推理，知道了这一幕的真相是：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">在黄昏之下，侦探的助手借着表演的名义拦住了开膛手，从而解救了少女。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the conversation between the detective and the diviner, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">The detective's assistant </> snatched the diviner's prop and held the Ripper fast at the intersection. \nCommunicated with the detective, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \nThe current deserted \"night\" was tampered with by the script; the correct stage time should be <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">dusk</>. \n\nAfter reasoning, the truth of this scene is: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">At dusk, the detective's assistant blocked the Ripper under the guise of a performance, thereby rescuing the young girl. </>",
    ["偷听了侦探与占卜师的交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">侦探的助手</>抢走了占卜师的道具，并在路口死死缠住了开膛手。\n与侦探交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n当前无人的“夜晚”是被剧本篡改的，正确的舞台时间应是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">黄昏</>。\n\n这一幕的真相是：\n在<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">黄昏之下</>，<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">侦探的助手</>借着表演的名义拦住了开膛手，从而解救了少女。"] = "Eavesdropped on the conversation between the detective and the diviner, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">The detective's assistant </> snatched the diviner's prop and held the Ripper fast at the intersection. \nCommunicated with the detective, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \nThe current deserted \"night\" was tampered with by the script; the correct stage time should be <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">dusk</>. \n\nThe truth of this scene is: \nIn <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the dusk</>, <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the detective's assistant </> blocked the Ripper under the guise of a performance, thereby rescuing the young girl.",
    ["偷听了女职员讨论，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">传闻昨晚并非副队长，而是队长持枪出门，在解决掉路上接应凶手的混混后，他亲自击毙了开膛手。</>\n与居民交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">半夜原本漆黑的夜晚，被刺眼光芒照耀得如同白昼。</>\n与马车夫交流后，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">地点的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">那名看似被怪物追杀而慌不择路的少女，实则是故意将凶手引向了警局总部。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the female employees' discussion, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Rumor has it that last night it wasn't the deputy captain, but the captain who went out with a gun. After taking care of the thugs supporting the murderer on the road, he personally shot the Ripper dead. </>\nCommunicated with the residents, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The pitch-black night of midnight was illuminated by a blinding light as if it were day. </>\nAfter communicating with the carriage driver, obtained clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> location </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">That young girl, who appeared to be fleeing in panic while being chased by a monster, was actually intentionally leading the murderer to the police headquarters. </>",
    ["偷听了女职员讨论，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">角色的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">传闻昨晚并非副队长，而是队长持枪出门，在解决掉路上接应凶手的混混后，他亲自击毙了开膛手。</>\n与居民交流，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">时间的线索</>：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">半夜原本漆黑的夜晚，被刺眼光芒照耀得如同白昼。</>\n与马车夫交流后，获取了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">地点的线索</>：\n那名看似被怪物追杀而慌不择路的少女，实则是故意将凶手引向了<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">警局总部。</>"] = "Eavesdropped on the female employees' discussion, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> character </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Rumor has it that last night it wasn't the deputy captain, but the captain who went out with a gun. After taking care of the thugs supporting the murderer on the road, he personally shot the Ripper dead. </>\nCommunicated with the residents, obtaining clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> time </>: \n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">The pitch-black night of midnight was illuminated by a blinding light as if it were day. </>\nAfter communicating with the carriage driver, obtained clues about the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> location </>: \nThat young girl, who appeared to be fleeing in panic while being chased by a monster, was actually intentionally leading the murderer to the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">police headquarters. </>",
