    ["傻瓜！就是去年住你隔壁的邻居米尔夫的朋友的叔叔呀！"] = "Fool! It's the uncle of the friend of the neighbor who lived next door to you last year!",
    ["傻瓜，不管你梦见了什么，最重要的是，我们该去宣誓了。"] = "Silly, no matter what you dreamed of, the most important thing is that we should go and take our vows.",
    ["傻瓜，我支持你是因为相信你的才华，不是因为你是什么教授。"] = "Fool, I support you because I believe in your talent, not because of what professor you are.",
    ["像一只飞蛾看着火焰，明知会被灼伤，却忍不住靠近。陛下，您知道，您有多危险吗？"] = "Like a moth looking at a flame, knowing it will be burned, yet unable to stop itself from getting closer. Your Majesty, do you know how dangerous you are?",
    ["像之前一样，颂念伟大主人的尊名，祈求进入历史迷雾的许可。"] = "As before, chant the honorific name of the great master and pray for permission to enter the fog of history.",
    ["像你这么抠门，真是可怜了那姑娘。"] = "Being as stingy as you, that girl is really pitiful.",
    ["像你这样有眼力的年轻人不多了！你能认识到写诗的重要性，明了紧迫性、坚持自觉性、拿出主动性，已经很棒了！"] = "There aren't many young people like you with such a keen eye! You can recognize the importance of writing poetry, understand the urgency, persist in consciousness, and show initiative; that's already great!",
    ["像你这样有眼力的年轻人不多了！你能认识到演讲的重要性，明了紧迫性、坚持自觉性、拿出主动性，已经很棒了！"] = "There aren't many young people like you with such a keen eye! You can recognize the importance of oratory, understand the urgency, persist in consciousness, and show initiative; that's already great!",
    ["像你这样虚心学习的年轻人不多了！我也很高兴你对演讲有自己独特的理解！"] = "There aren't many young people like you who are willing to learn! I'm also very happy that you have your own unique understanding of oratory!",
    ["像你这样虚心学习的年轻人不多了！我也很高兴你对诗歌有自己独特的理解！"] = "There aren't many young people like you who are willing to learn! I'm also very happy that you have your own unique understanding of poetry!",
    ["像做梦一样？"] = "Like dreaming?",
    ["像参加永远无法通关的礼仪考试。上周我在三场茶会重复了七遍“您今天的帽子真别致”。"] = "Like participating in an etiquette exam that you can never pass. Last week, I repeated 'Your hat is truly chic today' seven times at three tea parties.",
    ["像咸鱼一样愣着 尖碑是不会自动开启的"] = "Standing there like a salted fish won't make the stele open automatically.",
    ["像咸鱼一样愣着，尖碑是不会自动开启的。"] = "If you just stand there like a salted fish, the stele won't activate automatically.",
    ["像循环一样重复，太怪了！我调查过，这似乎和睡莲仙女有关。"] = "It repeats like a cycle, it's too strange! I've investigated, and it seems to be related to the Water Lily Fairy.",
    ["像您一样高贵的猫，做事一定有自己的原因？"] = "A cat as noble as you must have your own reasons for doing things?",
    ["像戏剧的观众那样，去观察那个世界。如果你愿意尝试做些什么，也许还能给某人带来救赎。"] = "Observe that world like a spectator in a theater. If you are willing to try and do something, perhaps you can even bring salvation to someone.",
    ["像我们这样富有的纳税人，是不会每天在工厂里数钱的。我正因为不知道他偷了什么，才焦急啊！"] = "Wealthy taxpayers like us don't spend every day counting money in the factory. I'm anxious precisely because I don't know what he stole!",
    ["像我这样没有家的人，躺在这儿正好。"] = "For someone like me who has no home, lying here is just right.",
    ["像房屋租赁合同这种，六便士一份；遗嘱和诉状，至少一苏勒，你得告诉我你的情况，才能判断。"] = "Something like a housing lease contract is six pence; wills and petitions are at least one sol. You'll have to tell me your situation before I can judge.",
    ["像所有的光都会被吞噬，前面应该就是尽头。"] = "It's as if all light will be swallowed, this should be the end.",
    ["像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "Like the floor tiles laid in the corridor of an old house for a winter, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["像是一个梦？"] = "Like a dream?",
    ["像是一顿吃撑了，麻秆一样的身体，顶着一个圆滚滚的肚子。"] = "Like they had eaten too much, their stick-like bodies topped with a round, bulging belly.",
    ["像是刚做过一场美梦"] = "It feels like just having had a beautiful dream.",
    ["像是有人在这举行过仪式，但布置得很粗糙。"] = "It looks like someone held a ritual here, but it was set up very crudely.",
    ["像是民间的探险队……或者是登山团队临时驻扎的？"] = "Like civilian expedition teams... or temporary camps set up by mountaineering groups?",
    ["像是骗子……"] = "Seems like a scammer...",
    ["像猫咪一样灵动地招手，是捉弄还是邀请？"] = "Waving like a cat, is it teasing or an invitation?",
    ["像真理号撞破冰山那样，撞破缝隙吧！"] = "Just like the Truth breaking through the iceberg, break through the gap!",
    ["像老友的拥抱，粗砺质感里包裹着细腻的灵魂。"] = "Like an old friend's hug, wrapping a delicate soul in a rough texture.",
    ["像老友的拥抱，粗砺质感里包裹着细腻的灵魂。</>"] = "Like the hug of an old friend, a delicate soul wrapped in a rough texture. </>",
    ["像蚂蚁一样……谁都能踩一脚……"] = "Like ants... anyone can step on us...",
    ["像这样。"] = "Like this.",
    ["像这种窗子，\r\n关得不严实，\r\n趴在窗沿底下，\r\n就很容易听见……"] = "Windows like this, \r\n aren't closed tightly, \r\n lying under the window sill, \r\n can easily hear...",
    ["像这种门，\r\n锁芯从来不换，\r\n撬开一次，\r\n就能打开第二次。"] = "For a door like this, \r\n the lock core is never changed; \r\n once it's picked, \r\n it can be opened a second time.",
    ["像阳光照进玻璃窗，让人忘记烦恼，专注于当下的愉悦。"] = "Like sunlight shining through a glass window, it makes people forget their worries and focus on the pleasure of the present.",
    ["像隐士一般避开阳光。"] = "Avoiding the sunlight like a hermit.",
    ["僭越者……居然破坏伟大的斯蒂姆宫！"] = "Usurper... actually destroying the great Steam Palace!",
