    ["兄弟……你是非凡者，是我们中能力最强的人了。"] = "Brother... you are a Beyonder, the most capable person among us.",
    ["兄弟……占卜也不是万能的啊。"] = "Brother... divination isn't omnipotent, you know.",
    ["兄弟们，动手！"] = "Brothers, do it!",
    ["兄弟们，厂里欠了我们一个月薪水了，我和利奥、桑托商量了一下，今天不给出说法就不开工！"] = "Brothers, the factory has owed us a month's wages, I discussed it with Leo and Santo, we won't start work today until they give us an explanation!",
    ["兄弟们，砸烂这马车！"] = "Brothers, smash this carriage!",
