    ["充满爱的一幅画就要诞生了。"] = "A painting full of love is about to be born.",
    ["充满秩序和思想的书桌，陈设反映出主人对知识的喜爱。"] = "A desk full of order and thought; the display reflects the owner's love for knowledge.",
