    ["充能护盾机制开发中，请瞎逼跑跑假装在处理机制谢谢"] = "Charging shield mechanism under development; please run around blindly and pretend to be handling the mechanism, thanks.",
    ["充能激活"] = "Charge Activated",
    ["先<h>吃饭</>吧"] = "Let's <h>eat</> first",
    ["先<h>离开</>会长办公室"] = "First <h>leave</> the President's office",
    ["先<h>离开</>诊所一带"] = "First <h>leave</> the clinic area",
    ["先……先生，这位女士的手臂实在太僵硬了，而且……好像没有温度……"] = "S-sir, this lady's arm is really stiff, and... it doesn't seem to have any warmth...",
    ["先下手为强"] = "Strike first",
    ["先下楼去考个世界观"] = "Go downstairs first to take a test on worldviews.",
    ["先不开-暂时的聚光灯1"] = "Not opening yet-temporary spotlight 1",
    ["先不玩了"] = "Stop playing for now",
    ["先不玩了。"] = "Not playing anymore.",
    ["先不用了"] = "Not needed for now",
    ["先不看了"] = "Not looking for now",
    ["先不离开"] = "Don't leave yet",
    ["先不管了"] = "Never mind",
    ["先不管了，快去买仪式要用的面包，回家比较重要……"] = "Never mind that for now. Hurry up and buy the bread needed for the ritual; getting home is more important...",
    ["先为唐尼占卜去哪的结果？"] = "First, divine the result of where Donnie went?",
    ["先交后播"] = "Submit first then play",
    ["先交后播参数版<h></>"] = "Submit first then play parameter version <h></>",
    ["先付利息"] = "Pay Interest First",
    ["先出去看看吧。"] = "Let's go out and take a look first.",
    ["先出发吧！"] = "Let's set off first!",
    ["先别忙着沮丧，我们还有办法！这不就是你找我的意义吗！"] = "Don't be so depressed yet, we still have a way! Isn't that why you came to me!",
    ["先别忙着沮丧，我们还有办法！这不就是你找我给你提意见的意义吗！"] = "Don't be discouraged just yet, we still have a way! Isn't that the whole point of you asking me for advice!",
    ["先别急着进去，找我试一试吧？"] = "Don't rush to go in yet, why not try me first?",
    ["先别急，你身上有和他们关系密切的物品吗？也许我可以通过占卜找到他们。"] = "Don't be in a hurry; do you have any items closely related to them? Maybe I can find them through divination.",
    ["先别管箱子了！你的命更要紧！"] = "Forget about the crate! Your life is more important!",
    ["先别说话。我拉你出来。"] = "Don't talk yet. I'll pull you out.",
    ["先去<h>排队</>"] = "Go <h> queue up </> first",
    ["先去下街看看吧。"] = "Let's go to Lower Street first.",
    ["先去劳维斯太太那看看，走吧。"] = "Let's go to Mrs. Lauwis's place first, let's go.",
    ["先去和雪莉说一下情况吧。"] = "Go and tell Shirley about the situation first.",
    ["先去找旅行尖碑吧，应该就在这附近。"] = "Let's go find the travel obelisk first; it should be somewhere around here.",
    ["先去找艾伯特吧，他应该没走远。"] = "Go find Albert first; he shouldn't have gone far.",
    ["先去找苏茜问问看吧。"] = "Let's go ask Susie first.",
    ["先去那几个熟人家门口晃，呵呵，尽可能让他们眼红。"] = "First, go hang around the doors of those acquaintances, hehe, make them as jealous as possible.",
    ["先喝下这瓶复苏药水，现在最重要的是清醒神志、恢复健康。"] = "Drink this bottle of recovery potion first; the most important thing now is to clear your mind and restore your health.",
    ["先噔，噔蹬蹬蹬，然后噔噔噔噔噔。"] = "First deng, deng deng deng deng, then deng deng deng deng deng.",
    ["先四处找找线索吧……"] = "Let's look around for clues first...",
    ["先回去休息吧，你需要好好睡一觉。"] = "Go back and rest first; you need a good sleep.",
    ["先回去休息吧，你需要好好睡一觉。 "] = "Go back and rest first; you need a good sleep.",
    ["先回家吧，试着放松下来……"] = "Let's go home first, try to relax...",
    ["先回营地吧，《猎龙宣言》还在那里，不能弄丢。"] = "Let's go back to the camp first, the 'Dragon Hunting Manifesto' is still there, we can't lose it.",
    ["先在这休息一会吧。"] = "Rest here for a while first.",
    ["先坐蒸汽地铁到……换有轨马车……"] = "First take the steam subway to... change to the tram Carriage...",
    ["先埋葬旧的廷根，再新生一座无瑕的新城。"] = "Bury the old Tingen first, then build a flawless new city.",
    ["先对行动进行占卜"] = "Divinate the action first",
    ["先将我在船舶公司的股份，短期质押给银行，拿到贷款后买入脚踏车股票。"] = "First, pledge my shares in the shipping company to the bank for a short term, and after getting the loan, buy the bicycle stocks.",
    ["先将我在船舶公司的股份，短期质押给银行，拿到贷款后买入脚踏车股票，之后再把脚踏车股票质押给银行，用贷款归还前面的贷款。"] = "First, pledge my shares in the shipping company to the bank for a short term, get a loan to buy bicycle stocks, then pledge the bicycle stocks to the bank, and use the loan to repay the previous loan.",
    ["先布置仪式场地，我记得要把食物放在房间的四个角落。"] = "First, set up the ritual site. I remember needing to place the food in the four corners of the room.",
    ["先往前走走吧，说不定能发现什么。"] = "Let's walk forward first, maybe we'll discover something.",
    ["先手"] = "Initiative",
    ["先找个安全处暂避"] = "Find a safe place to hide first",
    ["先找个隐蔽的地方藏起来，等他带来内部资料，有了证据再抓他。"] = "Find a hidden place to hide first, wait for him to bring the insider materials, and then catch him once I have evidence.",
    ["先找到桌球室，如果有人拦你……"] = "Find the billiards room first, if anyone stops you...",
    ["先找到菲利普，一切就都清楚了。"] = "Find Philip first, and everything will be clear.",
    ["先找到菲利普，一切就都清楚了。不过这块怀表似乎也可以<P_Yellow>先交给雪莉保管</> ……"] = "Once we find Philip, everything will be clear. However, this pocket watch could also <P_Yellow>be left with Shirley for safekeeping</>...",
    ["先找斯林太太问清楚皮特的情况，才更有把握阻止他。"] = "We should ask Mrs. Slin to clarify Pete's situation first, so we'll have a better chance of stopping him.",
    ["先把花放进背包里吧。"] = "Let's put the flowers in the inventory first.",
    ["先拆马车，再杀人！"] = "Dismantle the carriage first, then kill!",
    ["先按照配方中的材料和剂量，调配序列9魔药吧。"] = "First, prepare the Sequence 9 potion according to the ingredients and dosages in the formula.",
    ["先播后交"] = "Play first then submit",
    ["先播后交参数版<h></>"] = "Play first then submit parameter version <h></>",
    ["先播放画外音"] = "Play the voiceover first",
    ["先收起来吧，再看看其他地方探索一下。\n<P_Yellow>（已放入背包：《机械屋解谜手册》）</>"] = "Put it away for now and explore other places. \n<P_Yellow>(Placed in Inventory: Mechanical Hut Puzzle Manual)</>",
    ["先收起来吧，再看看其他地方探索一下。\\n<P_Yellow>（已放入背包：《机械屋解谜手册》）</>"] = "Put it away for now and explore other places. \n<P_Yellow>(Added to backpack: \"Mechanical House Puzzle Manual\")</>",
    ["先是一阵虚幻的破碎声，接着我感受到有东西在溶解，和我的精神慢慢融合……"] = "First, there was an illusory sound of shattering, then I felt something dissolving and slowly merging with my spirit...",
    ["先是减少承诺的福利，一点点试探我们的底线！"] = "First they reduced the promised benefits, testing our bottom line little by little!",
    ["先是推掉和矿业公司的合作，现在又送地……他精神是不是出问题了？"] = "First he called off the partnership with the mining company, now he's giving away land... has he lost his mind?",
    ["先来段环境描写……这里的气味浓稠到可以切块，烈酒、汗臭和廉价香水混合出某种难以言喻的甜腥味……"] = "First, a bit of environmental description... the smell here is so thick it could be sliced; strong liquor, sweat, and cheap perfume mix into some kind of indescribable sweet and fishy stench...",
    ["先来试着上阵一下这个小星虫秘偶吧。"] = "First, try deploying this Little Star Worm marionette.",
    ["先查看赛琳娜情况"] = "Check Selena's situation first",
    ["先民古道"] = "Ancient Path of the Forefathers",
    ["先民古道传送点"] = "Ancient Path of the Forefathers Teleport Point",
    ["先沿主廊道往里走，也许能遇到他。"] = "Follow the main corridor inward first; you might run into him.",
    ["先熟悉下魔药配方和材料吧。"] = "Let's get familiar with the potion formula and ingredients first.",
    ["先爬<h>上去</>吧"] = "Let's climb <h> up </> first",
    ["先生/女士，你也有那方面的烦恼？"] = "Sir/Madam, do you have that kind of trouble too?",
    ["先生/女士，先生/女士？"] = "Sir/Madam, Sir/Madam?",
    ["先生……"] = "Sir...",
    ["先生……我不是来抓你的，你看上去需要一些帮助。"] = "Sir... I'm not here to catch you, you look like you need some help.",
    ["先生……教堂里，有需要清扫的烟囱吗？"] = "Sir... are there any chimneys in the cathedral that need cleaning?",
    ["先生……这是今天的钱。六家烟囱，六便士。"] = "Sir... this is today's money. Six chimneys, six pence.",
    ["先生他并不放心，希望能从另外的方向进行调查和协助，确保小艾略特能被安全解救。"] = "He is not at ease and hopes to investigate and assist from other directions to ensure that little Elliott can be safely rescued.",
    ["先生们女士们，欢迎来到诡秘舞会！"] = "Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the Mystery Ball!",
    ["先生们女士们，记得排好队，一个个来。"] = "Gentlemen and ladies, remember to line up, one by one.",
    ["先生们，冷静一些。福戈少爷，您看看今天的盒饭。"] = "Gentlemen, calm down. Master Fors, take a look at today's boxed meal.",
    ["先生们，女士们。我宣布新的拳王已经诞生！"] = "Ladies and gentlemen, I announce that a new boxing champion has been born!",
    ["先生们，女士们，要来份报纸吗？"] = "Gentlemen, ladies, would you like a newspaper?",
    ["先生们，最近产能有限，工人们已经加班加点地干了……我毕竟是个善良的人。"] = "Gentlemen, production capacity has been limited recently, and the workers have been working overtime... After all, I am a kind person.",
    ["先生您好，我们这里有试戴服务，请问您的未婚妻有一同前来吗？"] = "Hello, sir. We have a try-on service here. Is your fiancée with you?",
    ["先生您看起来真是稳重中不失优雅，厚重里又有几分韵味，这套衣服很衬您的气质！"] = "Sir, you look steady yet elegant, with a bit of charm in your gravitas. This outfit really suits your temperament!",
    ["先生请拿好您的两张票。"] = "Please take your two tickets, sir.",
    ["先生这样的成功人士，有没有想过给家人留点保障？"] = "For a successful person like yourself, sir, have you ever thought about leaving some security for your family?",
    ["先生！女士！有人需要雇佣马车吗！"] = "Sir! Madam! Does anyone need to hire a Carriage!",
    ["先生，一根火柴，好吗……"] = "Sir, a match, please...",
    ["先生，不好意思，这是一次意外。"] = "Sir, I'm sorry, this was an accident.",
    ["先生，也许小昂格只是想交个新朋友。"] = "Sir, perhaps little Unger just wants to make a new friend.",
    ["先生，也请看看这个，原料是来自南大陆的树胶，请尝试。"] = "Sir, please take a look at this too. The raw material is gum from the Southern Continent. Please, give it a try.",
    ["先生，今天有您感兴趣的关于教会的报道。"] = "Sir, there is a report about the Church today that you might find interesting.",
    ["先生，你在纠结什么？"] = "Sir, what are you struggling with?",
    ["先生，你是在找谁吗？"] = "Sir, are you looking for someone?",
    ["先生，你最好别插手，我们有合同在的。"] = "Sir, you'd better not interfere. We have a contract.",
    ["先生，你现在觉得怎么样？"] = "Sir, how are you feeling now?",
    ["先生，你还清醒吗？你记得这里发生了什么吗？"] = "Sir, are you still conscious? Do you remember what happened here?",
    ["先生，其实我正要去剧院，去晚的话就抢不到票了……"] = "Sir, actually, I'm on my way to the theater. If I'm late, I won't be able to get a ticket...",
    ["先生，别拒绝我……"] = "Sir, don't refuse me...",
    ["先生，占卜吗？我塔罗占卜很准的。"] = "Sir, divination? My Tarot divination is very accurate.",
    ["先生，历史上有一位如你所说的大帝，请允许我歌颂他的事迹。"] = "Sir, there was an emperor in history like the one you described. Please allow me to sing of his deeds.",
    ["先生，可以给您上餐了吗？"] = "Sir, may I serve your meal now?",
    ["先生，和您续约可真是痛快！"] = "Sir, it's truly a pleasure to renew the contract with you!",
    ["先生，太感谢了，您看这些要多少钱？"] = "Sir, thank you so much. How much do I owe you for these?",
    ["先生，女士，需要票吗？"] = "Sir, ma'am, need tickets?",
    ["先生，女神的仁慈不会以金钱与利益来度量，所有的信徒都是祂的孩子，只要内心足够真诚。"] = "Sir, the Goddess's mercy is not measured by money and profit. All believers are Her children, as long as their hearts are sincere enough.",
    ["先生，对您来说，大概只是每天一杯咖啡的钱，但足以提供给您和您夫人、孩子二十年的安稳。"] = "Sir, for you, it's probably just the price of a cup of coffee a day, but it's enough to provide twenty years of stability for you, your wife, and your children.",
    ["先生，广场上禁止吸烟——您没看见告示牌吗？"] = "Sir, smoking is prohibited in the square—didn't you see the sign?",
    ["先生，您一个人喝多没劲，而我恰好知道这瓶酒怎么喝最妙。"] = "Sir, it's boring to drink alone, and I happen to know the best way to drink this bottle of wine.",
    ["先生，您为何一直在看报纸？"] = "Sir, why have you been staring at the newspaper the whole time?",
    ["先生，您冷静一点……"] = "Sir, please calm down...",
    ["先生，您好像把笼子给弄坏了。"] = "Sir, it seems you've broken the cage.",
    ["先生，您抓好好带着笼子回来找我俩就行！我们给您结账！"] = "Sir, just bring the cage back to us and we'll settle the payment for you!",
    ["先生，您昨晚在河边，有注意到什么吗？"] = "Sir, were you by the river last night? Did you notice anything?",
    ["先生，您是南大陆人？"] = "Sir, are you from the Southern Continent?",
    ["先生，您没事吧？"] = "Sir, are you alright?",
    ["先生，您看见了什么？"] = "Sir, what did you see?",
    ["先生，您看这几只病怏怏的，看着就像是得了鼠疫的，这要是给我们的老鼠都染了病了，我们可就赔惨啦，可不能收，不能收！"] = "Sir, look at these few. They're sickly and look like they have the plague. If they infect our other rats, we'll suffer a huge loss! We can't accept them, we really can't!",
    ["先生，您蹲在那儿鬼鬼祟祟干什么？"] = "Sir, what are you doing crouching there so sneakily?",
    ["先生，您这是在……"] = "Sir, are you...",
    ["先生，您这是怎么了？有什么我可以帮您的吗？您看起来有些憔悴。"] = "Sir, what's wrong with you? Is there anything I can help you with? You look a bit haggard.",
    ["先生，您这本是盗版书。"] = "Sir, this book of yours is a pirated copy.",
    ["先生，我们已经拒绝你很多次了。"] = "Sir, we have already refused you many times.",
    ["先生，我们当然不是……那个印子确实比较深，修补需要材料和时间……"] = "Sir, of course we are not... That mark is indeed quite deep, and repairs require materials and time...",
    ["先生，我们真的没有……"] = "Sir, we really don't have...",
    ["先生，我刚才听您说，有一个叫弗兰奇公寓的地方需要租客，对吗？"] = "Sir, I just heard you say that there is a place called Frankie Apartment that needs tenants, right?",
    ["先生，我可以做什么？"] = "Sir, what work can I do?",
    ["先生，我已经一再拒绝过了。"] = "Sir, I have already refused repeatedly.",
    ["先生，我想诊金并不是关键。或许这是霍森医生的某种行事准则吧。"] = "Sir, I don't think the fee is the key. Perhaps this is some kind of code of conduct for Dr. Hosen.",
    ["先生，我是市政府派来的卫生监察员，请问下水道的出口在哪里？"] = "Sir, I am a health inspector sent by the city government. May I ask where the sewer exit is?",
    ["先生，我替战友们谢谢您！"] = "Sir, I thank you on behalf of my comrades!",
    ["先生，我的头好痛，眼睛也睁不开……"] = "Sir, my head hurts so much, and I can't open my eyes...",
    ["先生，我还有问题需要询问。"] = "Sir, I still have questions to ask.",
    ["先生，我这里有一份草药配方很适合您啊，请务必收下。"] = "Sir, I have a herbal formula here that is very suitable for you, please be sure to take it.",
    ["先生，打扰了，我想您家里应该聘请了家庭医生？或者您需要什么额外的帮助吗？"] = "Sir, excuse me, I assume you have a family doctor hired at home? Or do you need any additional help?",
    ["先生，放松一些！"] = "Sir, relax a little!",
    ["先生，是你在叫我？"] = "Sir, are you calling me?",
    ["先生，是否有人往马桶里扔过垃圾？"] = "Sir, has anyone ever thrown trash into the toilet?",
    ["先生，最近有民众投诉“塔索克河污水治理”不达标。"] = "Sir, recently there have been public complaints that the \"Tussock River sewage treatment\" is not up to standard.",
    ["先生，有什么能够为您效劳？"] = "Sir, is there anything I can do for you?",
    ["先生，来看看新鲜的丝瓜吧！"] = "Sir, come and see these fresh loofahs!",
    ["先生，案件发生前你在干什么？"] = "Sir, what were you doing before the case happened?",
    ["先生，现在可以应聘哪个岗位？"] = "Sir, which positions are hiring right now?",
    ["先生，现在很晚了，你应该回家休息。"] = "Sir, it's very late now, you should go home and rest.",
    ["先生，看在梅塞苔丝的面子上，我赠给你一句忠告！"] = "Sir, for Mercedes' sake, I'll give you a piece of advice!",
    ["先生，看您气度不凡，肯定能抓到不少老鼠！"] = "Sir, you look like a man of extraordinary bearing; you'll surely be able to catch plenty of rats!",
    ["先生，等您女儿在纺织厂咳出第一口血痰时，您就会觉得这海报比歌剧院的广告还美丽。"] = "Sir, when your daughter coughs up her first mouthful of blood in the textile mill, you'll find this poster more beautiful than any advertisement for the opera house.",
    ["先生，要去哪里？"] = "Sir, where to?",
    ["先生，警局接到报案，休伯特·切斯议员家的马桶发生了异常故障？"] = "Sir, the police station received a report that there was an abnormal malfunction with the toilet at Councilor Hubert Chase's house?",
    ["先生，请一定要看看这个……"] = "Sir, you must take a look at this...",
    ["先生，请您不要给他人妄下罪名。"] = "Sir, please do not cast groundless accusations on others.",
    ["先生，请您收回这句话，我虽然不是贵族，荣誉却同样不容侵犯。"] = "Sir, please retract that statement. Although I am not an aristocrat, my honor is equally inviolable.",
    ["先生，请看这种食物，我想它会大卖的！"] = "Sir, please look at this food, I think it will sell well!",
    ["先生，请问……"] = "Sir, may I ask...",
    ["先生，请问你有没有见过一个叫戈多的人？"] = "Sir, have you seen a person named Godot?",
    ["先生，请问您需要什么启示？"] = "Sir, what kind of revelation do you need?",
    ["先生，这和我想的不一样，请给我解释的机会！"] = "Sir, this isn't what I expected. Please give me a chance to explain!",
    ["先生，这是你丢的表吗？"] = "Sir, is this the watch you lost?",
    ["先生，这条观光路线大约需要一小时。按时间算一小时2苏勒，超过后每刻加6便士。如果按里程，城里是一公里4便士。您看哪种合适？ "] = "Sir, this sightseeing route takes about an hour. By time, it's 2 soli per hour, with 6 pennies for every quarter-hour after that. If by distance, it's 4 pennies per kilometer in the city. Which do you think is better?",
    ["先生，这里不安全，你先跟上我。"] = "Sir, it's not safe here. Follow me first.",
    ["先生，这，这和说好的不一样……"] = "Sir, this, this isn't what we agreed on...",
    ["先生，需要占卜吗？"] = "Sir, do you need a divination?",
    ["先生，需要帮助吗？"] = "Sir, do you need help?",
    ["先生，需要帮忙吗？"] = "Sir, do you need any help?",
    ["先由我来治愈{{他|她}}被梦魇折磨的心灵吧"] = "Let me first heal {{ his | her } } mind, which has been tormented by nightmares.",
    ["先看看书里写了什么吧。"] = "Let's see what's written in the book first.",
    ["先看看情况"] = "Check the situation first",
    ["先看看这些案件。"] = "Let's look at these cases first.",
    ["先看看队长给的档案吧。"] = "Let's look at the files the captain gave us first.",
    ["先看看附近情况"] = "Check the nearby situation first",
    ["先看看附近情况<h></>"] = "Check the surroundings first<h></>",
    ["先看看雅各布说的“漫游”分别是什么吧。"] = "Let's first take a look at what Jacob meant by \"roaming\".",
    ["先看看雅各布说的“漫游”分别是什么吧。 "] = "Let's first see what Jacob meant by \"roaming\" separately.",
    ["先睡他个三天三夜"] = "Sleep for three days and three nights first",
    ["先瞄准敌人，然后点击此处进行<Orange>射击</>。"] = "Aim at the enemy first, then click here to <Orange>Shoot</>.",
    ["先知"] = "Prophet",
    ["先确认伊妮德的安全"] = "Confirm Enid's safety first",
    ["先祖与母亲的亡灵啊……请赐予我力量！"] = "Spirits of the ancestors and mother... please grant me power!",
    ["先祖加速"] = "Ancestor Acceleration",
    ["先祖壁垒"] = "Ancestor Bulwark",
    ["先祖庇护"] = "Ancestral Protection",
    ["先祖的，印记。"] = "The ancestor's, mark.",
    ["先祖破刃"] = "Ancestor's Broken Blade",
    ["先祖铠甲"] = "Ancestor Armor",
    ["先祖铠甲-1星"] = "Ancestor Armor - 1 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲-2星"] = "Ancestor Armor - 2 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲-3星"] = "Ancestor Armor - 3 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲-PVE BOSS"] = "Ancestor Armor - PVE BOSS",
    ["先祖铠甲-锁血1%"] = "Ancestor Armor - Health Lock 1%",
    ["先祖铠甲-锁血60%"] = "Ancestor Armor - Health Lock 60%",
    ["先祖铠甲冲锋形成的护盾,需要尽快击碎"] = "Shield formed by Ancestor Armor charge, needs to be broken as soon as possible",
    ["先祖铠甲召唤士兵，以各种阵型向四面八方发起连续冲锋。"] = "Ancestor Armor summons soldiers to launch continuous Charges in all directions in various formations.",
    ["先祖铠甲同时点名最多2个玩家，接着<Disable>先后对这2名玩家发起扬击</>，扬击伤害极高需要<Disable>多人共同分摊</>，但被扬击击中的玩家短期内无法再承受第二次扬击。"] = "Ancestor Armor targets up to 2 players simultaneously, then <Disable> launches a Leaping Slash at these 2 players in succession </>. The damage is extremely high and requires <Disable> multiple people to share </>, but players hit by the slash cannot withstand a second one in the short term.",
    ["先祖铠甲在场上召唤出多个待复苏的精神体，精神体可以被治疗解救，如果解救失败会导致骑士失控狂暴！"] = "Ancestor Armor summons multiple spirits waiting to be revived on the field. The spirits can be rescued by Healing; if the rescue fails, the knight will lose control and go Berserk!",
    ["先祖铠甲在场上召唤出多个被污染的精神体，精神体被攻击解救后会释放出<Disable>1个神秘特性</>，拾取神秘特性的玩家会在随后的对决环节中<Disable>变身为骑兵</>。"] = "Ancestor Armor summons multiple polluted spirits on the field. Once a spirit is attacked and rescued, it will release <Disable> 1 mysterious trait </>. Players who pick up the mysterious traits will <Disable> transform into Cavalry </> during the subsequent duel phase.",
    ["先祖铠甲在场上召唤出多个被污染的精神体，精神体被攻击解救后会释放出<Disable>2个神秘特性</>，拾取神秘特性的玩家会在随后的对决环节中<Disable>变身为骑兵</>。"] = "Ancestor Armor summons multiple polluted spirits on the field. Once a spirit is attacked and rescued, it will release <Disable> 2 mysterious traits </>. Players who pick up the mysterious traits will <Disable> transform into Cavalry </> during the subsequent duel phase.",
    ["先祖铠甲在场地四周释放<Disable>腐蚀污染</>，同时在场边连续召唤长戟兵向内场冲锋，污染区域会对玩家造成高额伤害；拾取神秘特性的玩家此时会<Disable>变身为免疫伤害的骑兵</>，参与击杀长戟兵能够获得<Disable>荣耀之证</>，荣耀之证最多可以升到三级；一段时间后，先祖铠甲向持有荣耀之证的玩家发起对决，对决失败则全体玩家受到惩罚且先祖铠甲获得减伤，对决成功则玩家获得增伤增益。"] = "Ancestor Armor releases <Disable> corrosive corruption </> around the field while continuously summoning Halberdiers from the sidelines to charge into the inner field. The polluted area deals massive damage to players. Players who picked up mysterious traits will <Disable> transform into damage-immune Cavalry </> at this time. Participating in killing Halberdiers grants <Disable> Proof of Glory </>, which can be upgraded up to level three. After a period of time, Ancestor Armor initiates a duel against players holding Proof of Glory. If the duel fails, all players are punished and Ancestor Armor gains Damage Reduction; if successful, players gain a damage boost.",
    ["先祖铠甲小兵"] = "Ancestor Armor Minion",
    ["先祖铠甲小兵-1星"] = "Ancestor Armor Minion - 1 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲小兵-2星"] = "Ancestor Armor Minion - 2 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲小兵-3星"] = "Ancestor Armor Minion - 3 Star",
    ["先祖铠甲点名6名玩家施加意志污染，产生持续跟随且间歇扩大的法术场，对范围内队友和自己造成伤害；此外会释放6个意志碎片，被污染的6名玩家各自触碰1个碎片后解除污染。"] = "The Ancestor Armor marks 6 players with Will Contamination, creating a spell field that follows them and intermittently expands, dealing damage to the player and nearby teammates. Additionally, it releases 6 Will Fragments; the 6 contaminated players must each touch one fragment to remove the contamination.",
    ["先祖铠甲登场时，召唤<HighLight>2</>名同星级先祖铠甲小兵，并为友方提供短时庇护。"] = "When Ancestor Armor enters the field, summon <HighLight>2</> Ancestor Armor minions of the same star level and provide short-term Shelter to allies.",
    ["先祖铠甲的主人伯德温·威瑟尔，曾参与背誓之战，凯旋后获得无数封赏。"] = "Baldwin Wetherell, the owner of the Ancestor Armor, participated in the War of the Broken Oath and received countless rewards after his triumphant return.",
    ["先祖铠甲碎片"] = "Ancestor Armor Fragment",
    ["先祖霸体"] = "Ancestor Super Armor",
    ["先祖骑士"] = "Ancestor Knight",
    ["先祖骑士残魂"] = "Ancestor Knight Remnant Soul",
    ["先离开会长办公室"] = "Leave the president's office first.",
    ["先离开梦境"] = "Leave the dream first",
    ["先离开诊所"] = "Leave the clinic first.",
    ["先离开，找找线索"] = "Leave first, look for clues",
    ["先约个会怎么样？在我执念消散前能看到你们的婚礼吗？"] = "How about going on a date first? Can I see your wedding before my obsession dissipates?",
    ["先结束这场聊天……"] = "Let's end this conversation first...",
    ["先给你的妻子发份电报报平安吧，你把脖子上的伤养好再回去，免得家里人担心。"] = "Send a telegram to your wife to let her know you're safe first. Let the wound on your neck heal before you go back, so your family doesn't worry.",
    ["先自己四处看看"] = "Look around myself first",
    ["先见自己的导师"] = "See my own mentor first",
    ["先解决完危机再训斥我吧，队长。"] = "Let's resolve the crisis before you lecture me, Captain.",
    ["先试着聊聊如何？"] = "How about we try talking first?",
    ["先说说工厂区的情况吧。"] = "Let's talk about the situation in the Factory District first.",
    ["先走吧"] = "Leave first",
    ["先跟我去文献室，了解最基础的知识吧。"] = "Come with me to the archives first to learn the most basic knowledge.",
    ["先跟我回公司吧，我会派人通知布朗太太。"] = "Come back to the company with me first; I will send someone to notify Mrs. Brown.",
    ["先跟瑞尔好好谈谈，然后带他去跟伊森他们道歉！让他们揍瑞尔一顿消气也可以！"] = "Talk to Ray properly first, then take him to apologize to Ethan and the others! It's fine if you let them beat Ray up to vent their anger!",
    ["先过掉这个任务进行下一环"] = "Pass this quest to proceed to the next link",
    ["先这样吧。"] = "Let's leave it at that.",
    ["先退出当前位面，再通过小地图旁的<Highlight_L>世界灾厄</>按钮，返回队长所在区域"] = "Exit the current plane first, then return to the area where the captain is located via the <Highlight_L> World Calamity </> button next to the mini-map.",
    ["先选择一个基底。"] = "First, choose a base.",
    ["先通过占卜，看看有没有其它获取“小丑”配方的途径。"] = "First, use divination to see if there are other ways to obtain the 'Clown' formula.",
    ["先锋"] = "Vanguard",
    ["先锋之勇，虽率先战死，但英姿永存。"] = "The courage of a vanguard; though you fell first, your heroic posture remains forever.",
    ["先闻魔药了解题目……得找个合适的地方。"] = "Smell the potion first to understand the problem... I need to find a suitable place.",
    ["先随便选杯喝的？红茶或者咖啡？"] = "Want to pick a drink first? Black tea or coffee?",
    ["先靠近看看情况"] = "Approach to check the situation first",
    ["先驱的馈赠"] = "Gift of the Pioneer",
    ["先驱的馈赠(Inactive)"] = "Pioneer's Gift (Inactive)",
    ["先驱者的胜利在灵界中化作不灭回响，为后来者提供庇护。\n副本首通后，进入副本的非凡者会获得属性增益。\n生命提升1000点，怪物专攻提升200点。"] = "The victory of the pioneers turns into an eternal echo in the Spirit World, providing shelter for those who follow. \n After the first clear of a dungeon, Beyonders who enter the dungeon will receive attribute bonuses. \n Health increased by 1000, Monster Specialization increased by 200.",
    ["先驱者的胜利在灵界中化作不灭回响，为后来者提供庇护。\n副本首通后，进入副本的非凡者会获得属性增益。\n生命提升2000点，怪物专攻提升400点。"] = "The victory of the pioneers turns into an eternal echo in the Spirit World, providing shelter for those who follow. \n After the first clear of a dungeon, Beyonders who enter the dungeon will receive attribute bonuses. \n Health increased by 2000, Monster Specialization increased by 400.",
    ["先驱者的胜利在灵界中化作不灭回响，为后来者提供庇护。\n副本首通后，进入副本的非凡者会获得属性增益。\n生命提升500点，怪物专攻提升100点。"] = "The victory of the pioneers turns into an eternal echo in the Spirit World, providing shelter for those who follow. \n After the first clear of a dungeon, Beyonders who enter the dungeon will receive attribute bonuses. \n Health increased by 500, Monster Specialization increased by 100.",
    ["光"] = "Light",
    ["光与发酵的交界，平凡中孕育神圣。"] = "The boundary between light and fermentation, where the sacred is nurtured in the mundane.",
    ["光与影在花瓣边缘达成和解。"] = "Light and shadow reach a reconciliation at the edge of the petals.",
    ["光之圣剑"] = "Holy Sword of Light",
    ["光之坚壁"] = "Wall of Light",
    ["光之律动"] = "Rhythm of Light",
    ["光之律动-天赋-额外伤害"] = "Rhythm of Light - Talent - Bonus Damage",
    ["光之折射"] = "Refraction of Light",
    ["光之折射也发射长枪，是否确认选择这项能力？选择后其他2个会消失"] = "Refraction of Light also fires a spear. Confirm this ability? Choosing it will cause the other 2 to disappear.",
    ["光之折射会对命中的目标追加发射一根朗基努斯之枪，如果仅命中一个目标则会发射三根。"] = "Refraction of Light will fire an additional Spear of Longinus at the hit target; if only one target is hit, it will fire three.",
    ["光之折射会对命中的目标追加发射一根朗基努斯之枪，如果仅命中一个目标则会发射三根；朗基努斯之枪的伤害提高100%。"] = "Refraction of Light will fire an additional Spear of Longinus at the hit target; if only one target is hit, it will fire three; Spear of Longinus damage increased by 100%.",
    ["光之折射伤害提高25%。"] = "Refraction of Light Damage Increased by 25%.",
    ["光之折射具有3层充能，释放星海穿梭时恢复3层充能。"] = "Refraction of Light has 3 charges; casting Voyage Through the Sea of Stars restores 3 charges.",
    ["光之折射具有5层充能。"] = "Refraction of Light has 5 charges.",
    ["光之折射可以再次命中之前命中过的敌人。"] = "Refraction of Light can hit enemies it has hit before.",
    ["光之折射命中的敌人附加一层【折射标记】，使其受到的折射伤害提高5%，最多叠加10层。"] = "Enemies hit by Refraction of Light are afflicted with one stack of [Refraction Mark], increasing the Refraction damage they take by 5%, stacking up to 10 times.",
    ["光之折射命中的敌人附加一层【折射标记】，使其受到的折射伤害提高50%，最多叠加20层。"] = "Enemies hit by Refraction of Light are applied with one layer of [Refraction Mark], increasing the Refraction damage they take by 50%, stacking up to 20 times.",
    ["光之折射命中的目标增伤降低15%，光之折射伤害提高150%。"] = "Damage Boost on targets hit by Refraction of Light is reduced by 15%, and Refraction of Light damage is increased by 150%.",
    ["光之折射命中的目标脚下会生成真理之眼。"] = "An Eye of Truth will be generated at the feet of targets hit by Refraction of Light.",
    ["光之折射的折射次数增加6次。"] = "Refraction of Light's refraction count is increased by 6.",
    ["光之折射的折射次数增加6次；光之折射伤害提高100%。"] = "Refraction of Light refraction count increased by 6; Refraction of Light damage increased by 100%.",
    ["光之祭司"] = "Priest of Light",
    ["光之祭司魔药"] = "Priest of Light Potion",
    ["光之钥"] = "Key of Light",
    ["光之领域"] = "Domain of Light",
    ["光之风暴"] = "Hurricane of Light",
    ["光之风暴冷却-5秒。印记不足时光之风暴享受满印效果但会透支（每缺1印+3秒，最多20秒冷却5秒）透支期间无法获得印记受治疗降低"] = "Hurricane of Light Cooldown -5 seconds. When marks are insufficient, Hurricane of Light enjoys the full mark effect but will trigger Overdraft (each missing mark adds 3 seconds, up to 20 seconds; 5-second Cooldown). During Overdraft, you cannot gain marks and healing received is reduced.",
    ["光之风暴冷却减5秒。印记不足时光之风暴享受满印效果但会透支（每缺1印加3秒，最多20秒，冷却5秒），透支期无法获得印记且受治疗降低。"] = "Hurricane of Light Cooldown reduced by 5 seconds. If marks are insufficient, Hurricane of Light enjoys the full mark effect but enters Overdraft (each missing mark adds 3 seconds, up to 20 seconds, 5-second cooldown). During Overdraft, you cannot gain marks and healing received is reduced.",
    ["光之风暴引爆目标身上的衰败时不再移除衰败，并且额外增加一段引爆伤害"] = "Hurricane of Light no longer removes Decay when detonating it on targets, and additionally adds an instance of detonation damage.",
    ["光之风暴引爆目标身上的衰败时不再移除衰败，并且额外增加一段引爆伤害。"] = "When Hurricane of Light detonates Decay on the target, it no longer removes Decay and deals an additional instance of detonation damage.",
    ["光亮度"] = "Light brightness",
    ["光会照亮真相，也会灼烧谎言。"] = "Light will illuminate the truth, and it will also burn lies.",
    ["光圈道具"] = "Aperture Prop",
    ["光在液体中流淌，连接着两个世界。"] = "Light flows in the liquid, connecting two worlds.",
    ["光在，我在，照亮万物，摧毁黑暗，订立不可违背的神圣契约，令一切不谐皆受净化，皆被驱散，带来永恒的希望与秩序。"] = "Where light is, I am, illuminating all things, destroying darkness, establishing inviolable sacred contracts, making all disharmony purified and dispelled, and bringing eternal hope and order.",
    ["光就是一切的意义"] = "Light Is the Meaning of Everything",
    ["光就是一切的意义。"] = "Light is the meaning of everything.",
    ["光影双生"] = "Light and Shadow Twin",
    ["光影诗人"] = "Poet of Light and Shadow",
    ["光效"] = "Light Effect",
    ["光效数据"] = "Light effect data",
    ["光既是武器也是审判，不能沦为私欲。"] = "Light is both a weapon and a judgment, it cannot become a tool for selfish desires.",
    ["光明"] = "Light",
    ["光明不仅驱散黑暗，也照亮被遗忘的曾经。"] = "Light not only dispels darkness but also illuminates the forgotten past.",
    ["光明之刃"] = "Blade of Light",
    ["光明之刃节点神罚可对怪物生效且效果提升300%。若未解锁天赋光明之刃节点，此能力会额外获得该节点的“神罚”效果。"] = "The Blade of Light node Divine Punishment can affect monsters and its effect is increased by 300%. If the Blade of Light node talent is not unlocked, this ability will additionally grant the \"Divine Punishment\" effect of that node.",
    ["光明之刃节点神罚效果提升300%。（如果光明之刃节点未解锁，将会自动解锁）"] = "Blade of Withering node's Judgment effect is increased by 300%. (If the Blade of Withering node is not unlocked, it will be unlocked automatically.)",
    ["光明印记"] = "Mark of Light",
    ["光明在愚者雕像周围缓缓旋转，最多十道，实时流转。"] = "The light rotates slowly around the Fool statue, with up to ten rays flowing in real-time.",
    ["光明的祝福"] = "Blessing of Light",
