    ["光蚀灯"] = "Light-Etching Lamp",
    ["光记样子可不够，我这半个月都在研究不同光线下蛋壳的反光规律——早晨的斜射光和午后的顶光，会让同一枚蛋看起来截然不同。"] = "Just memorizing the appearance isn't enough. I've spent the last half month studying the reflection patterns of eggshells under different light—morning oblique light and afternoon overhead light make the same egg look completely different.",
