    ["克罗伊，你看，禁止在学派骑脚踏车，哈哈哈哈好离谱的院规啊……你怎么不笑？"] = "Chloe, look, riding a bicycle is prohibited in the school, hahahaha, what an absurd school rule... why aren't you laughing?",
