    ["克莱恩·呕吐定位"] = "Klein · Vomiting positioning",
    ["克莱恩·小丑结束"] = "Klein·Clown Ends",
    ["克莱恩·玩法结束"] = "Klein - Gameplay End",
    ["克莱恩·看见队长后位置"] = "Klein - position after seeing the captain",
    ["克莱恩·终点"] = "Klein - Destination",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂"] = "Klein Moretti",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂……上面写着他今天刚加入俱乐部，水准值得信赖吗？"] = "Klein Moretti... it says here he just joined the club today. Is his level trustworthy?",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂。"] = "Klein Moretti.",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂先生，你是否愿意正式加入廷根市值夜者小队，成为我们的一员？"] = "Mr. Klein Moretti, are you willing to officially join the Tingen Nighthawks squad and become one of us?",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂曾受导师推荐，来廷根大学面试讲师。"] = "Klein Moretti was once recommended by his tutor to interview for a lecturer position at Tingen University.",
    ["克莱恩·莫雷蒂，新来的文职人员。终于有人来跟我分摊轮值工作了，赞美女神，我不用再经常熬夜了！"] = "Klein Moretti, the new clerk. Finally, someone to share the shift work with me. Praise the Goddess, I don't have to stay up late as often!",
    ["克莱恩·起点"] = "Klein - Start Point",
    ["克莱恩·进屋后位置"] = "Klein - Position after entering room",
    ["克莱恩……"] = "Klein...",
    ["克莱恩……嗯，他倒没什么不吃的，就是偏好甜味的食物。"] = "Klein... well, he doesn't dislike anything, but he prefers sweet foods.",
    ["克莱恩……（远处模糊的声音感）"] = "Klein... (a sense of distant, muffled voice)",
    ["克莱恩一家三口照片的画面"] = "Scene of the photo of Klein's family of three.",
    ["克莱恩一家受邀参加赛琳娜的生日宴会，发现赛琳娜被邪恶的魔镜占卜侵蚀、即将沦为恶灵。克莱恩借助伊丽莎白的配合，举行中断仪式向黑夜女神祈求庇护，成功驱逐了赛琳娜身上的污染。从伊丽莎白口中得知海纳斯传授的黑占卜咒文涉及“真实造物主”，克莱恩立刻向邓恩汇报。邓恩潜入海纳斯的梦境调查，目睹了真实造物主的倒吊形象，遭受巨大精神伤害，而海纳斯本人随即死于\"突发心脏病\"——一切过于巧合，线索再次断裂。"] = "Klein's family was invited to Selena's birthday party, where they discovered that Selena had been eroded by evil mirror divination and was on the verge of becoming an Evil Spirit. With Elizabeth's cooperation, Klein held an interrupted ritual to pray to the Evernight Goddess for shelter, successfully dispelling the corruption from Selena. Learning from Elizabeth that the black divination incantation taught by Haines involved the True Creator, Klein immediately reported to Dunn. Dunn infiltrated Hynes's Dream to investigate, witnessed the inverted image of the True Creator, and suffered severe mental damage. Haines himself subsequently died of a \"sudden heart attack\"—everything was too coincidental, and the trail went cold once again.",
    ["克莱恩一家年纪最小的妹妹，廷根技术学校蒸汽与机械系学生。\n黑发褐眼，性格沉稳，过早负担起照顾家庭的忧虑而心思早熟。\n痴迷齿轮发条与蒸汽机械，立志成为蒸汽机械师。"] = "Klein's youngest sister, a student in the Department of Steam and Machinery at Tingen Technical School. \nShe has black hair and brown eyes, with a calm and steady personality. Having shouldered the burden of caring for the family too early, she is precocious for her age. \nShe is obsessed with gears, clockwork, and steam machinery, and is determined to become a steam mechanic.",
    ["克莱恩上前"] = "Klein steps forward",
    ["克莱恩上床光点"] = "Klein Bed Light Point",
    ["克莱恩也传到咖啡前定位"] = "Klein also teleports to coffee positioning",
    ["克莱恩书店"] = "Klein's Bookstore",
    ["克莱恩书店-记忆回溯"] = "Klein Bookstore - Retrace",
    ["克莱恩仔细阅读着日记，努力回忆"] = "Klein reads the diary carefully, trying hard to recall.",
    ["克莱恩传到魔药后位置"] = "Klein's position after teleporting to the potion",
    ["克莱恩传送到吃饭位"] = "Klein teleports to dining position",
    ["克莱恩传送到床前"] = "Klein teleports to the bedside",
    ["克莱恩传送进门点位"] = "Klein Teleport Entry Point",
    ["克莱恩先生教会了我许多特色菜的做法，让挑剔的男爵都赞不绝口；班森先生作为政府雇员为我出具了推荐信；梅丽莎小姐更是一直与我通信，鼓励我追求事业。"] = "Mr. Klein taught me how to make many specialty dishes, which made even the picky baron praise them endlessly; Mr. Benson provided me with a letter of recommendation as a government employee; and Miss Melissa has been writing to me, encouraging me to pursue my career.",
    ["克莱恩先生，我听说您来自廷根市？"] = "Mr. Klein, I heard you are from Tingen?",
    ["克莱恩先生，我最近总觉得钱不够用……您有什么省钱的建议吗？"] = "Mr. Klein, I always feel like I don't have enough money recently... Do you have any money-saving advice?",
    ["克莱恩先生，我注意到您常常提到“阿兹克先生”，他是您的导师吗？"] = "Mr. Klein, I noticed that you often mention \"Mr. Azik.\" Is he your mentor?",
    ["克莱恩先生，我知道非凡者需要通过“扮演”来消化魔药，但具体该怎么做，我很想听听您的理解。"] = "Mr. Klein, I know that Beyonders need to digest potions through \"Acting,\" but I would really like to hear your understanding of how to do it specifically.",
    ["克莱恩先生，说实话，曾经的我以为占卜只是骗人的把戏。"] = "Mr. Klein, to be honest, I used to think divination was just a deceptive trick.",
    ["克莱恩入镜"] = "Klein enters frame",
    ["克莱恩前进一步"] = "Klein takes a step forward",
    ["克莱恩匆匆回到了家中。"] = "Klein rushes back home.",
    ["克莱恩匆忙冲出小巷，背后黑雾从小巷涌出，其不得不继续向前逃窜（过场文本先行占位）。"] = "Klein rushes out of the alley, with black fog pouring out from behind him, forcing him to continue fleeing forward (cutscene text placeholder).",
    ["克莱恩去买了些蔬菜和肉类后，匆匆赶回家里"] = "Klein buys some vegetables and meat and then rushes home.",
    ["克莱恩去右边浅滩的定位trigger"] = "Klein's Positioning Trigger to Right Shallows",
    ["克莱恩发现罗珊不在的范围"] = "Range where Klein discovers Rozanne is missing",
    ["克莱恩变身-猎魔子弹预备状态"] = "Klein Transform: Demon Hunter Bullet Ready State",
    ["克莱恩右手微抬，空间内灰雾蒸腾，一根根柱子拔地而起，灰雾之中凭空出现了一整个巍峨雄伟的大殿。"] = "Klein raised his right hand slightly, and gray fog billowed in the space. Pillars rose from the ground, and a majestic, towering palace appeared out of thin air within the gray fog.",
    ["克莱恩回家进门踩点"] = "Klein go home enter door waypoint",
    ["克莱恩回房"] = "Klein returns to room",
    ["克莱恩回房踩点"] = "Klein returns to room to scout",
    ["克莱恩在匆忙间跳上了马车。"] = "Klein jumped onto the carriage in a hurry.",
    ["克莱恩在大街小巷中奔跑，终于甩开了邓恩。（跑酷玩法预留）"] = "Klein runs through the streets and alleys, finally shaking off Dunn. (Parkour gameplay reserved)",
    ["克莱恩在居民区偶遇兜售古董的男子，对方拿出拉姆德初代男爵画像。\n克莱恩一看——画像右耳垂上的黑痣，与阿兹克先生一模一样。"] = "Klein encountered a man selling antiques in a residential area, and the other party took out a portrait of the first Baron Lamud. \nKlein took one look—the mole on the right earlobe of the portrait was exactly the same as Mr. Azik's.",
    ["克莱恩在路上感受到被人追踪，身陷迷局，危机时刻被赶来的邓恩救下，得知跟踪他的人是密修会成员。为了获得保护自己的力量，克莱恩选择成为非凡者。在老尼尔的指导下调配并喝下魔药后，克莱恩终于成为了一名“占卜家”。"] = "Klein feels he is being tracked on the road, falls into a trap, and is saved by Dunn who arrives in the nick of time during a crisis, learning that the person tracking him is a Rose School of Thought Member. To gain the power to protect himself, Klein chooses to become a Beyonder. Under Old Neil's guidance, after preparing and drinking the potion, Klein finally becomes a \"Seer\".",
    ["克莱恩坐"] = "Klein sits",
    ["克莱恩坐下的椅子"] = "Chair Klein sits on",
    ["克莱恩坐下，困意逐渐袭来。\n不知过了多久……"] = "Klein sits down, and sleepiness gradually washes over him. \n Who knows how much time has passed...",
    ["克莱恩墓碑"] = "Klein's Tombstone",
    ["克莱恩墓碑-记忆回溯"] = "Klein's Tombstone - Memory Retrace",
    ["克莱恩对话1"] = "Klein Dialogue 1",
    ["克莱恩对话2"] = "Klein Dialogue 2",
    ["克莱恩对话3"] = "Klein Dialogue 3",
    ["克莱恩射击连段段数标志"] = "Klein Shoot Combo Count Mark",
    ["克莱恩往外走路点"] = "Klein waypoint to exit",
    ["克莱恩思考"] = "Klein Thinking",
    ["克莱恩总是熬夜看书，他的房间经常亮着灯，直到后半夜。"] = "Klein was always staying up late reading; his room light was often on until the middle of the night.",
    ["克莱恩恍恍惚惚地准备回家……"] = "Klein dizzily prepares to go home...",
    ["克莱恩感觉……平静又舒适。戴莉一边往烛火里加材料一边解释——"] = "Klein feels... calm and comfortable. Daly explains while adding materials to the candle flame—",
    ["克莱恩抬头看到红月注视的画面"] = "Scene of Klein looking up at the gaze of the red moon.",
    ["克莱恩抵达贝克兰德火车站-记忆回溯"] = "Klein Arrives at Backlund Train Station - Retrace",
    ["克莱恩挂接药水"] = "Klein Attach Potion",
    ["克莱恩推理后置"] = "Klein Deduction Post-Event",
    ["克莱恩搬家"] = "Klein Moves",
    ["克莱恩搬家-记忆回溯"] = "Klein Moves - Memory Retrace",
    ["克莱恩权杖连段段数标志"] = "Klein Scepter Combo Count Mark",
    ["克莱恩枪反-怪物可枪反标记"] = "Klein Gun Parry - Monster Gun Parryable Mark",
    ["克莱恩枪反-枪反成功标记"] = "Klein Gun Counter - Gun Counter Success Mark",
    ["克莱恩枪反教学"] = "Klein Gun Parry Tutorial",
    ["克莱恩枪反教学自动释放枪反"] = "Klein Gun Parry Tutorial Auto-Release Gun Parry",
    ["克莱恩标记"] = "Klein mark",
    ["克莱恩正视2"] = "Klein looking straight 2",
    ["克莱恩正面"] = "Klein front view",
    ["克莱恩每天可以从公司领取三十发子弹，然后去佐特兰街3号的地下靶场练习射击，那里有一块专属于值夜者的场地。除此之外，克莱恩休息日之外的每天下午还得跟着老师练习至少两个小时的格斗。\n\n“高文老师是一位专业又严格的格斗老师，我学到了很多……”又一次被练吐后，克莱恩奄奄一息地说。但为了提升自己的实战和生存能力，他每次的练习都认真得像是个正在高考的孩子。"] = "Klein can collect thirty bullets from the company every day and then go to the underground shooting range at 3 Zoutland Street to practice shooting, where there is a field exclusively for Nighthawks. In addition, Klein has to practice combat for at least two hours every afternoon, except on his days off. \n\n \"Instructor Gawain is a professional and strict combat instructor; I've learned a lot...\" Klein said, gasping for air after being trained to the point of vomiting again. But in order to improve his combat and survival skills, he practices as diligently as a student preparing for the college entrance exam every time.",
    ["克莱恩毕业于霍伊大学历史系。"] = "Klein graduated from the Department of History at Khoy University.",
    ["克莱恩漫步"] = "Klein strolling",
    ["克莱恩登场时，根据当前激活羁绊数量为全队提供攻击和伤害加深。"] = "When Klein enters the field, provide Attack and Damage Increase to the entire team based on the number of currently active kinships.",
    ["克莱恩的兄长。通过政府雇员考试之前，曾供职于一家进出口公司，即使薪水微薄，也会全力支持克莱恩与梅丽莎的梦想。"] = "Klein's older brother. Before passing the government employee exam, he worked at an import and export company. Even with a meager salary, he would fully support the dreams of Klein and Melissa.",
    ["克莱恩的周薪刚刚翻倍，莫雷蒂家不必那么为储蓄焦虑了，是得有一些娱乐活动了。"] = "Klein's weekly salary has just doubled, so the Moretti family doesn't have to be so anxious about savings; it's time for some entertainment.",
    ["克莱恩的墓碑"] = "Klein's Tombstone",
    ["克莱恩的妹妹。在机械领域展现出独特的兴趣与天赋，后凭借自己的努力考上贝克兰德技术大学。"] = "Klein's younger sister. She showed unique interest and talent in the field of mechanics, and later relied on her own efforts to be admitted to Backlund Technical University.",
    ["克莱恩的日记上写着……"] = "Klein's diary says...",
    ["克莱恩的椅子"] = "Klein's chair",
    ["克莱恩的纸条"] = "Klein's note",
    ["克莱恩的钱包，生活费、报销金、活动经费都在其中，是非凡之路不可或缺的重要依仗。"] = "Klein's wallet, containing living expenses, reimbursement money, and activity funds, is an indispensable and important reliance on the Beyonder path.",
    ["克莱恩的队伍"] = "Klein's Team",
    ["克莱恩看向目标"] = "Klein looks at target",
    ["克莱恩确认了心中的担忧，后退一步保持距离，开始思考对策。"] = "Klein confirms his concerns, takes a step back to keep his distance, and begins to think of a countermeasure.",
    ["克莱恩移动终点"] = "Klein movement destination",
    ["克莱恩第一次见到我的时候，也是这么想的——“打扮得像个真正的通灵者，这是在扮演自己？”"] = "When Klein first met me, he thought the same—'Dressed like a real Spirit Medium, is this Acting as himself?'",
    ["克莱恩精心制作的手冲咖啡。"] = "Klein's carefully crafted hand-drip coffee.",
    ["克莱恩终点"] = "Klein destination",
    ["克莱恩莫雷蒂"] = "Klein Moretti",
    ["克莱恩落座"] = "Klein sits down",
    ["克莱恩讲述了刚刚在俱乐部发生的事情。"] = "Klein recounts what just happened at the Club.",
    ["克莱恩讲述了自己在赛琳娜家的遭遇，并重点提及了海纳斯的举动。"] = "Klein recounted his experience at Selena's House and highlighted Haines's actions.",
    ["克莱恩讲述了自己所见。"] = "Klein recounts what he saw.",
    ["克莱恩走1"] = "Klein walk 1",
    ["克莱恩走上前"] = "Klein walks forward",
    ["克莱恩走位"] = "Klein positioning",
    ["克莱恩身体靠后，闭上眼睛，进入冥想。"] = "Klein leans back, closes his eyes, and enters meditation.",
    ["克莱恩躺在床上睡着了。"] = "Klein lies on the bed and falls asleep.",
    ["克莱恩近2"] = "Klein close-up 2",
    ["克莱恩近景"] = "Klein close-up",
    ["克莱恩进门路点"] = "Klein waypoint to enter door",
    ["克莱恩通灵结果"] = "Klein Spirit Mediumship Result",
    ["克莱恩隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Klein secret bond reward.",
    ["克莱恩顺利完成了他的第一个委托任务，与伦纳德一起营救被绑架的小艾略特。但在当夜的梦中，克莱恩却得到了灵性提醒，绑架案对面房间中隐藏着和笔记有关的线索。第二天，值夜者们进入对面房间调查，意外发现了瑞尔·比伯死去的母亲。"] = "Klein successfully completed his first commissioned task, rescuing the kidnapped little Elliot alongside Leonard. However, in his dream that night, Klein received a spiritual warning that clues related to the notebook were hidden in the room opposite the kidnapping site. The next day, the Nighthawks entered the room to investigate and unexpectedly discovered the deceased mother of Riel Bieber.",
    ["克莱恩飞快看完一页后，将目光投向了后面。\n“十月二日，他们决定让我和阿贝尔家族的玛蒂尔达订婚！不行，我要反抗包办婚姻！”\n“十月五日，玛蒂尔达小姐真漂亮啊。​”"] = "After Klein quickly finished reading a page, he turned his gaze to the back. \n \"October 2nd, they decided to have me engaged to Matilda of the Abel family! No, I must resist this arranged marriage!\" \n \"October 5th, Miss Matilda is truly beautiful.\"",
    ["克莱恩首次出场遮挡特效-祭坛前"] = "Klein first appearance occlusion VFX - in front of altar",
    ["克莱恩（仰）"] = "Klein (low angle)",
    ["克莱恩（特写）"] = "Klein (close-up)",
    ["克莱恩，你不会喜欢……她才十六岁。"] = "Klein, you wouldn't like... she's only sixteen.",
    ["克莱恩，你作为替代弗莱的辅助要格外小心。我会尝试将她拉入梦境。"] = "Klein, you must be extra careful as you are replacing Frye as support. I will attempt to pull her into a dream.",
    ["克莱恩，你先说。"] = "Klein, you speak first.",
    ["克莱恩，你去占卜俱乐部，观察下会员们对海纳斯·凡森特突然死亡的反应。"] = "Klein, you go to the Divination Club and observe the members' reactions to the sudden death of Haines Vincent.",
    ["克莱恩，你变得有些不一样了。"] = "Klein, you've become a bit different.",
    ["克莱恩，你和老尼尔退到我们身后。"] = "Klein, you and Old Neil step behind us.",
    ["克莱恩，你就这样穿着去公司吧，回头咱们再洗洗熨烫一下就好。"] = "Klein, just wear that to the company. We can wash and iron it later.",
    ["克莱恩，你是因为被邪异事件波及，本身又有特长，才被队长邀请的吗？"] = "Klein, were you invited by the captain because you were affected by an evil incident and also have special talents?",
    ["克莱恩，你的判断很正确。是教堂附近的同事发现了你的异常，我们才能及时赶到。"] = "Klein, your judgment was very correct. It was the colleagues near the cathedral who discovered your abnormality that allowed us to arrive in time.",
    ["克莱恩，你知道韦尔奇和娜娅的事吗？我看报纸说他们被入室强盗杀害了。"] = "Klein, do you know about Welch and Naya? I read in the newspaper that they were killed by home invaders.",
    ["克莱恩，你觉得呢？"] = "Klein, what do you think?",
    ["克莱恩，准备好沉眠符咒，在适当的时候丢出去。"] = "Klein, get the Sleep Charm ready and throw it at the appropriate time.",
    ["克莱恩，尝试占卜特莉丝逃跑的位置。"] = "Klein, try to divine the location of Trissy's escape.",
    ["克莱恩，弗兰奇先生刚才慷慨地同意了我们提前退租的请求。"] = "Klein, Mr. Franky has generously agreed to our request to move out early.",
    ["克莱恩，快来快来。"] = "Klein, come here, come here.",
    ["克莱恩，感觉怎么样？"] = "Klein, how do you feel?",
    ["克莱恩，我们去宴会上转转。给女孩子们一些自己的空间。"] = "Klein, let's go walk around the party. Give the girls some space of their own.",
    ["克莱恩，我发现你的命运有不协调的地方。"] = "Klein, I have discovered that there are inconsistencies in your fate.",
    ["克莱恩，我叫你克莱恩吧。你今天的表现非常出色，竟然能击杀一位密修会成员。"] = "Klein, I'll call you Klein. Your performance today was excellent; you actually managed to kill a Rose School of Thought Member.",
    ["克莱恩，我赢了2苏勒8便士。"] = "Klein, I won 2 soli and 8 pence.",
    ["克莱恩，有事记得写信给我们，地址依然是霍伊大学历史系办公室。"] = "Klein, if you need anything, remember to write to us. The address is still the History Department office at Hoy University.",
    ["克莱恩，有什么事情？"] = "Klein, what's the matter?",
    ["克莱恩，班森今天坐火车回廷根，下午六点会到火车站，要记得去接他，如果你有时间的话。"] = "Klein, Benson is taking the train back to Tingen today and will arrive at the train station at 6 PM. Remember to pick him up, if you have time.",
    ["克莱恩，要来杯咖啡吗？"] = "Klein, want a cup of coffee?",
    ["克莱恩，调查结束了，但你必须保证要对这起案件保密，连家人都不能告诉。"] = "Klein, the investigation is over, but you must guarantee to keep this case confidential, even from your family.",
    ["克莱恩，这么早你在做什么呢？"] = "Klein, what are you doing so early?",
    ["克莱恩，这些会不会太多了？"] = "Klein, won't this be too much?",
    ["克莱恩，这套和刚才右街沃特先生店里的那套，你更喜欢哪个？不过沃特先生说还能再送个新领结，嗯……"] = "Klein, which one do you prefer, this set or the one from Mr. Wat's shop on Right Street earlier? Although Mr. Wat said he could throw in a new bowtie, hmm...",
    ["克莱恩，这就是社会的规则，欢迎来到大人的世界。"] = "Klein, these are the rules of society. Welcome to the adult world.",
    ["克莱恩，这里熟悉吗？"] = "Klein, does this place look familiar?",
    ["克莱恩，醒醒。"] = "Klein, wake up.",
    ["克莱恩，醒醒！"] = "Klein, wake up!",
    ["克莱恩，非凡的道路上充满诱惑与危险，一不小心就会堕落失控，你一定要记住。"] = "Klein, the path of the Beyonder is full of temptation and danger. If you are not careful, you will fall and lose control. You must remember this.",
    ["克莱恩：“就这么慢慢地、把对方引去教堂附近……”"] = "Klein: \"Just like this, slowly lead the other party toward the church...\"",
    ["克莱恩：“梅丽莎，我们有啤酒，你有这个。”"] = "Klein: \"Melissa, we have beer, you have this.\"",
    ["克莱恩：“这是……中文？！”\n强压下震惊，克莱恩认真读起了日记。"] = "Klein: \"This is... Chinese?!\" \n Suppressing his shock, Klein reads the diary seriously.",
    ["克莱恩：“那个唱诗班——教堂就在那个方向！”"] = "Klein: \"That choir—the church is in that direction!\"",
    ["克莱恩：“那种被注视的感觉没有消失，非凡者能跑的比马车还快？”"] = "Klein: \"That feeling of being watched hasn't disappeared. Can a Beyonder run faster than a carriage?\"",
    ["克莱恩：《伯爵归来》绝对是场值得观看的戏剧，它在贝克兰德上演的场次都是爆满！"] = "Klein: \"The Earl's Return\" is definitely a play worth watching; every performance in Backlund is sold out!",
    ["克莱恩：三，有争执请找大厅的守卫。"] = "Klein: Three, if there is a dispute, please find the guard in the hall.",
    ["克莱恩：二，不得随地大小便，不得随地吐痰。"] = "Klein: Two, do not urinate or defecate in public, do not spit in public.",
    ["克莱恩：你为什么不做一个更加简单的，比如，只有两个轮子，只能载一个人，不要外壳的。"] = "Klein: Why don't you make a simpler one, for example, one with only two wheels, that can only carry one person, and without a shell?",
    ["克莱恩：况且，廷根有许多大学生，看完了还可以再卖给他们。"] = "Klein: Besides, there are many college students in Tingen; we can sell them to them after reading.",
    ["克莱恩：呼，我们应该雇佣一辆马车的，会让我们看着体面一些。"] = "Klein: Phew, we should have hired a carriage; it would make us look more decent.",
    ["克莱恩：四，不能在任何一个房间内开狼鱼罐头！"] = "Klein: Four, you cannot open canned wolf fish in any room!",
    ["克莱恩：太太，我希望租赁15号那栋房屋。"] = "Klein: Ma'am, I would like to rent the house at number 15.",
    ["克莱恩：太好了，我去问问订票日的开放时间！"] = "Klein: Great, I'll go ask about the ticket booking opening time!",
    ["克莱恩：好吧，梅丽莎，你偶尔可以……"] = "Klein: Alright, Melissa, you can occasionally...",
    ["克莱恩：好的。但我需要先去一趟盥洗室，肚子不太舒服。"] = "Klein: Alright. But I need to go to the washroom first; my stomach is feeling a bit uncomfortable.",
    ["克莱恩：好的，麻烦你了。"] = "Klein: Alright, sorry for the trouble.",
    ["克莱恩：如果今天没能顺利租到房屋，就找家不需要身份证明的小旅馆暂时住下……"] = "Klein: If I can't successfully rent a house today, I'll find a small inn that doesn't require identification to stay in for now...",
    ["克莱恩：如果你成为了政府处理具体事务的雇员，我们的家庭收入会增加多少？"] = "Klein: If you become a government employee handling specific affairs, how much will our family income increase?",
    ["克莱恩：害怕父亲不是正常的吗？"] = "Klein: Isn't it normal to be afraid of one's father?",
    ["克莱恩：小姐，您没事吧？\n女士：感谢您的关心，我没事，只是有点疲惫。\n后面的人：快下车，别堵在车门口。\n克莱恩和这位女士擦肩而过。\n克莱恩：没来得及用灵视检查下。算了，先回黑荆棘。"] = "Klein: Miss, are you alright? \n Lady: Thank you for your concern, I am fine, just a little tired. \n Person behind: Get off quickly, don't block the carriage door. \n Klein brushes past this lady. \n Klein: I didn't have time to use spirit vision to check. Forget it, let's head back to Blackthorn first.",
    ["克莱恩：希望能有这个荣幸，但还得看邓恩先生的决定。"] = "Klein: I hope to have the honor, but it still depends on Mr. Dunn's decision.",
    ["克莱恩：并不知道接下来会遭遇什么事情，一次支付掉50镑会让我抵御风险的能力下降。"] = "Klein: I don't know what might happen next, and paying 50 pounds all at once would reduce my ability to withstand risks.",
    ["克莱恩：成交！"] = "Klein: Deal!",
    ["克莱恩：我之后再找事务律师弄正式的合同，添加一些细节性的条款，比如，要是再有人投资，必须先得到我的同意。"] = "Klein: I'll find a business lawyer later to get a formal contract and add some detailed clauses, for example, if anyone else invests, they must get my consent first.",
    ["克莱恩：我们先草拟一份简单的合同，将这件事情定下来。"] = "Klein: Let's draft a simple contract first to finalize this matter.",
    ["克莱恩：我和你的非凡能力不同，战斗风格也不同，这样的衣物不会造成任何负面影响，甚至还很适合我。"] = "Klein: My Beyonder abilities are different from yours, and my combat style is different too. Such clothing won't cause any negative impact; it's actually quite suitable for me.",
    ["克莱恩：我投资你100金镑，加上我刚才的建议，我共占据……"] = "Klein: I'll invest 100 pounds in you, plus my suggestion just now, I'll hold a total of...",
    ["克莱恩：我的周薪刚刚翻倍到6镑，加上班森的薪水，完全负担得起偶尔看一场戏剧。"] = "Klein: My weekly salary has just doubled to 6 pounds, plus Benson's salary, we can totally afford to see a play occasionally.",
    ["克莱恩：我的极限是半年，25镑。"] = "Klein: My limit is half a year, 25 pounds.",
    ["克莱恩：救命啊！"] = "Klein: Help!",
    ["克莱恩：救命啦！"] = "Klein: Help!",
    ["克莱恩：是的。"] = "Klein: Yes.",
    ["克莱恩：有什么不协调？"] = "Klein: What is inconsistent?",
    ["克莱恩：杀人啦！"] = "Klein: Murder!",
    ["克莱恩：梅丽莎，伯爵归来最受欢迎的配角是位天才机械师。"] = "Klein: Melissa, the most popular supporting character in The Count Returns is a genius mechanic.",
    ["克莱恩：比如，它的口袋很多，能将不同的物品装在不同的地方，以免着急的时候拿错，将生命葬送在可笑的失误上。"] = "Klein: For example, it has many pockets, so you can put different items in different places to avoid taking the wrong one in a hurry and burying your life in a ridiculous mistake.",
    ["克莱恩：注意事项一，遵守秩序，严格排队。"] = "Klein: Note one, follow order, strictly queue up.",
    ["克莱恩：狼鱼罐头？这是什么？有趣……"] = "Klein: Canned wolf fish? What is this? Interesting...",
    ["克莱恩：笔……记……"] = "Klein: Note... book...",
    ["克莱恩：萨默尔太太，你应该看得出来，我刚到贝克兰德。"] = "Klein: Mrs. Sammer, you should be able to tell that I just arrived in Backlund.",
    ["克莱恩：这就是贝克兰德啊，万都之都，希望之地。"] = "Klein: This is Backlund, the capital of capitals, the land of hope.",
    ["克莱恩：这才六点半吧？就跟九点十点了一样……"] = "Klein: It's only 6:30, right? It feels like 9:00 or 10:00...",
    ["克莱恩：这是必要的投资。"] = "Klein: This is a necessary investment.",
    ["克莱恩：这样也行？"] = "Klein: This works too?",
    ["克莱恩：邮差，有点积蓄的工人阶级，不需要太多体面但能攒下钱的商人……这在贝克兰德有很多。"] = "Klein: Postmen, working-class people with some savings, merchants who don't need too much decency but can save money... there are many of these in Backlund.",
    ["克莱恩：钱包？"] = "Klein: A wallet?",
    ["克莱恩：（我因为肚子疼而错过了？这有些不对劲啊……）"] = "Klein: (I missed her because of a stomach ache? This is a bit strange...)",
    ["克莱恩：（我对老尼尔的道德品质有了全新的认识。）"] = "Klein: (I have a whole new understanding of Old Neil's moral character.)",
    ["克莱恩：（我已经尽快了……平时拿着报纸，我能再蹲一阵……）"] = "Klein: (I was as fast as I could... usually, with a newspaper, I could squat for a while longer...)",
    ["克莱恩：（看起来他会把钱包还回去……）"] = "Klein: (It looks like he's going to return the wallet...)",
    ["克莱恩：（老尼尔要怎么用魔法解决30镑的债务？）"] = "Klein: (How is Old Neil going to use magic to solve the 30-pound debt?)",
    ["克莱恩？"] = "Klein?",
    ["克莱恩？他是我见过最有天赋的占卜家，只是……很可惜他已经回归女神的拥抱了！"] = "Klein? He is the most talented Seer I have ever met, but... it's a pity that he has returned to the Goddess's embrace!",
    ["克莱恩？哎呀！我的戒指！"] = "Klein? Oh my! My ring!",
