    ["关于未来"] = "About the future",
    ["关于本品：\n本品为针对灵体的专项封印器具，对怨灵、执念型恶灵及强负面灵性体均有显著效力。\n价格不菲。效果对得起价格。\n\n\n负面反应说明：\n购入者注视镜面时，可能出现以下感受：\n持续的\"吸引感\"，难以移开视线\n无由来的落泪冲动\n想要打破镜子的念头\n以上均属正常。\n\n\n使用方法\n封印步骤：\n对准目标\n确保对方身影被镜面完整照到\n保持照射，持续时间越长，封印效果越稳定\n目标被完全封入镜中空间后，其灵性将被持续消耗、削弱，无法自行逃逸\n\n\n终结步骤：\n以魔镐敲击镜面，恶灵将被削弱力量后勾出，使用者可自行选择割喉亦或砍下其头部，使之被永久消灭。\n\n\n静置与保管\n不使用时，建议镜面朝内、背面朝外放置，或以厚布完全遮盖。\n\n\n附：\n请勿将其在无遮蔽状态下过夜放置。\n若已如此放置，次日请检查镜框内侧银片。\n若发现划痕——请确认划痕的方向。\n若为由外向内，属正常磨损。\n若为由里向外，请将镜面立即翻转，背面朝外，随后自行做仪式驱魔、净化处理。"] = "About this item: \n This is a specialized sealing tool for spirits, highly effective against wraiths, obsession-type evil spirits, and strong negative spiritual entities. \n The price is not cheap. The effect is worth the price. \n\n\n Negative Reaction Description: \n When the purchaser gazes at the mirror surface, the following sensations may occur: \n A continuous 'sense of attraction', making it difficult to look away \n An inexplicable urge to weep \n A thought of wanting to break the mirror \n All of the above are normal. \n\n\n Usage Method \n Sealing Steps: \n Aim at the target \n Ensure the target's figure is fully reflected in the mirror \n Maintain the reflection; the longer the duration, the more stable the sealing effect \n Once the target is completely sealed into the mirror space, its spirituality will be continuously consumed and weakened, unable to escape on its own \n\n\n Finishing Steps: \n Strike the mirror surface with the magic pickaxe; the evil spirit will have its power weakened and be hooked out. The user can choose to slit its throat or decapitate it, causing it to be permanently eliminated. \n\n\n Storage and Maintenance \n When not in use, it is recommended to place it mirror-side in and back-side out, or cover it completely with a thick cloth. \n\n\n Appendix: \n Please do not leave it overnight in an uncovered state. \n If it has been left this way, please check the silver foil on the inside of the mirror frame the next day. \n If scratches are found - please confirm the direction of the scratches. \n If from outside to inside, it is normal wear and tear. \n If from inside to outside, please flip the mirror immediately, back-side out, and then perform a ritual exorcism and purification yourself.",
    ["关于格尔曼先生的冒险之旅，这是一本精彩绝伦的小说，涉及到很多超凡世界隐秘的小说。"] = "It's a brilliant novel about Mr. Gehrman's adventures, involving many secrets of the Beyonder world.",
