    ["关阅读"] = "Close reading",
    ["兴奋。光是想象您读信时的表情……我就浑身发热。"] = "Excited. Just imagining the expression on your face when you read the letter... makes me feel all hot and bothered.",
    ["兴奋地点头"] = "Nod excitedly",
    ["兴奋的宾客"] = "Excited Guest",
    ["兴奋的少女"] = "Excited Young Girl",
    ["兴奋的男子"] = "Excited man",
    ["兴奋的观众"] = "Excited audience",
    ["兴奋的观众-椅子"] = "Excited Audience - Chair",
    ["兴安盟"] = "Hinggan League",
    ["兴许是退伍军人，或者警察吧，我也看到过。不过，好像也有不少年轻人。说不准啊……"] = "Perhaps they are veterans or police; I've seen them too. However, there seem to be quite a few young people as well. It's hard to say...",
    ["兴趣小组？"] = "Interest groups?",
    ["兵器显威·始"] = "Weapon Might: Start",
    ["兵器显威·终"] = "Weapon Might: End",
    ["兵器相对·始"] = "Weapon Confrontation: Start",
    ["兵器相对·终"] = "Weapon Confrontation: End",
    ["兵戎相见"] = "Clash of Arms",
    ["其一，祈愿织线——通过冥冥之中的眷顾，为你寻找命运织线上的另一端——那个与你灵魂共鸣的人。 "] = "First, Prayer Weaving—through the favor from the unknown, I will find the other end of the thread of fate for you—the person whose soul resonates with yours.",
    ["其三，永恒之契——当你们确定了彼此真心后，我会为你们主持永恒之契——那是用誓言与火漆签下的庄重约定。 "] = "Third, Eternal Covenant—once you have confirmed each other's sincerity, I will preside over the Eternal Covenant for you—that is a solemn promise signed with vows and sealing wax.",
    ["其中一个是第三次被打回去的咖啡报销申请。"] = "One of them is a coffee reimbursement application that has been rejected for the third time.",
    ["其乐"] = "Qile",
    ["其二，七夜邂逅——每月的七夜邂逅，是命运赐予的相识之礼。在七日内，陌生人将成为旅伴，或许也会成为更多。 "] = "Second, Seven-Night Encounter—the Seven-Night Encounter each month is a gift of acquaintance bestowed by fate. Within seven days, a stranger will become a travel companion, and perhaps even more.",
    ["其他"] = "Other",
    ["其他Buff状态列表"] = "List of other Buff states.",
    ["其他_在战斗中复活"] = "Other_Revive in Combat",
    ["其他人可以选择不踏入非凡世界，但你是在神明的注视下降生的，你生来就背负非凡的命运。"] = "Others can choose not to step into the Beyonder world, but you were born under the gaze of the gods; you were born carrying a Beyonder destiny.",
    ["其他人呢，谁还有机会杀害霍克斯男爵？"] = "What about the others? Who else had the opportunity to murder Baron Hawkes?",
    ["其他人有没有什么异常？什么时候出门，什么时候回来？"] = "Is there anything unusual about the others? When do they go out and when do they come back?",
    ["其他人都藏在哪里？"] = "Where are the others hiding?",
    ["其他传送点还没放"] = "Other teleport points not yet placed",
    ["其他倒是没啥舍不得的。"] = "There's nothing else I'm particularly reluctant to leave behind.",
    ["其他倒是没啥舍不得的，就是以后再也没有这么大的图书馆了。"] = "There's nothing else I'm reluctant to part with, except that there won't be such a big library anymore.",
    ["其他地方"] = "Other places",
    ["其他奖励"] = "Other Rewards",
    ["其他孩子都只想玩游戏，你为什么这么想工作？"] = "Other children just want to play games, why do you want to work so much?",
    ["其他家族"] = "Other Families",
    ["其他家族成员正在更改展台，请等待其更改完成"] = "Other Family members are changing the display stand, please wait for them to finish.",
    ["其他掉落"] = "Other Drop",
    ["其他游戏的托"] = "Shill for other games",
    ["其他狱友修复了当前符文，并打乱了你的符文谜题."] = "Other inmates have repaired the current rune and scrambled your rune puzzle.",
    ["其他玩家"] = "Other players",
    ["其他玩家外观同模"] = "Use Same Model for Other Players' Appearance",
    ["其他玩家外观精简"] = "Simplify Other Players' Appearance",
    ["其他玩家特效强度"] = "Other Players' Effect Intensity",
    ["其他玩家特效等级不能高于自身。"] = "Other players' effect levels cannot be higher than your own.",
    ["其他玩家特效质量"] = "Other Players' Effect Quality",
    ["其他玩法"] = "Other Gameplay",
    ["其他的谜题，应该也和他的经历有关——"] = "The other puzzles should also be related to his experiences—",
    ["其他的路都被堵死了，先去大桥上看看吧。"] = "All other paths are blocked. Let's go to the bridge first.",
    ["其他细则："] = "Other Details:",
    ["其他职业对话"] = "Other class dialogue",
    ["其他设置"] = "Other Settings",
    ["其他说明"] = "Other Instructions",
    ["其他请求正在处理中。"] = "Other requests are being processed.",
    ["其他途径/本途径较低序列魔药"] = "Other Pathways/Lower Sequence Potions of this Pathway",
    ["其他途径魔药"] = "Other Pathway Potions",
    ["其他阵营"] = "Other Factions",
    ["其它"] = "Other",
    ["其它颜色调整"] = "Other Color Adjustments",
    ["其实——"] = "Actually—",
    ["其实……"] = "Actually...",
    ["其实……一直藏着秘密挺累的，每次都要假装抄小路。"] = "Actually... it's quite tiring to keep secrets all the time; I have to pretend to take a shortcut every single time.",
    ["其实……我也跟自己的父母失散了，现在只剩孤零零一个人。也不知道他们在哪里……"] = "Actually... I also lost my parents and am now all alone. I don't know where they are...",
    ["其实……我对你的感情……"] = "Actually... my feelings for you...",
    ["其实……我并不是来应聘的，我接到了市民对工厂古怪现象的举报，前来调查。"] = "Actually... I'm not here for the job application. I received reports from citizens about strange phenomena at the factory and came to investigate.",
    ["其实不是的。"] = "Actually, it wasn't.",
    ["其实也没怎么跑，只是演一演，嘿嘿。"] = "Actually, I didn't really run much, just acting, hehe.",
    ["其实作为剧作家，在创作时陷入情绪波动是很正常的，但是像老师这样严重的癔症，真是从未听说过。"] = "Actually, as a playwright, it's normal to experience emotional fluctuations while creating, but I've never heard of such severe hysteria as the teacher's.",
    ["其实像这样的布料还能卖给码头帮人修船帆的人，但您手上这一片是白色的，收集一批卖给造纸厂价格会更好。"] = "Actually, fabric like this can be sold to people at the docks who repair sails, but the piece in your hand is white, so collecting a batch to sell to a paper mill would fetch a better price.",
    ["其实到这一段后会进位面并冲出一堆狗来汪汪汪咬你，但因为功能还没好所以先写在这里看一下，看到这句话你就当作已经被狗咬死了吧！"] = "Actually, after this segment, you will enter a plane and a bunch of dogs will rush out to bark and bite you, but since the function isn't ready yet, I'm writing it here for now. If you see this sentence, just assume you've already been bitten to death by the dogs!",
    ["其实常见的款式妈妈都会做，大概说一下你想要的样子，妈妈都能做出来，只收布料钱和一些手工费！"] = "Actually, Mom can make most common styles. Just describe what you want, and Mom can make it. She only charges for the fabric and a bit of labor!",
    ["其实我也一样，只是我比较幸运罢了……"] = "Actually, I'm the same, I was just luckier...",
    ["其实我二十五岁之后才知道，原来我们家在贝克兰德有好几处房产，家里人从来不喝廉价咖啡，出门走两步就是秩序之钟。"] = "Actually, I only found out after I was twenty-five that our family has several properties in Backlund, and my family never drinks cheap coffee, and there is a Clock of Order just two steps away from home.",
    ["其实我们没有正式委托过他们，也付不起委托金……但他们都在我们需要的时候帮了大忙，我们只想表达一点心意。"] = "Actually, we haven't officially commissioned them, and we can't afford the commission fee... but they all helped a lot when we needed it, and we just want to express a little bit of our heart.",
    ["其实我们还有另外的招牌，鲁恩王国阿霍瓦郡警察厅特殊行动部第七小组。"] = "Actually, we have another sign: the Seventh Group of the Special Operations Department of the Loen Kingdom's Awwa County Police Department.",
    ["其实我只是路过"] = "Actually, I'm just passing by",
    ["其实我在找一个富商的女儿，她参加完你的茶会后，就再没回过家了。"] = "Actually, I'm looking for the daughter of a wealthy merchant. She never returned home after attending your tea party.",
    ["其实我是阿霍瓦郡警察厅的便衣警员，有人说这边出现了连环凶案的杀手，我来抓捕。"] = "Actually, I am an undercover detective from the Awwa County Police Department. Someone reported that a serial killer is in the area, and I am here to make an arrest.",
    ["其实我最近每天晚上都会做噩梦，早上起床的时候还发现枕头上掉了不少头发。"] = "Actually, I've been having nightmares every night recently, and I've noticed quite a bit of hair on my pillow when I wake up in the morning.",
    ["其实我有点恐高，但没办法。"] = "Actually, I'm a bit afraid of heights, but I have no choice.",
    ["其实我觉得这不是心理咨询，只是作为朋友，对她的关心。"] = "Actually, I don't think this is psychological counseling, just concern for her as a friend.",
    ["其实我还挺喜欢廷根，安静又漂亮，空气也很清新。"] = "Actually, I quite like Tingen. It's quiet and beautiful, and the air is very fresh.",
    ["其实我这趟旅程的目的，就是为了解开这个谜题。"] = "Actually, the purpose of my journey is to solve this mystery.",
    ["其实是个骑士_近战人型怪"] = "Actually a Knight_Melee Humanoid Monster",
    ["其实是在开小差。"] = "Actually, you're slacking off.",
    ["其实根本就没有什么守护灵吧？"] = "Actually, there isn't any guardian spirit at all, is there?",
    ["其实每年处理失控的事件中，有很大部分是我们的队友……"] = "In fact, a large portion of the loss-of-control cases we handle every year are our own teammates...",
    ["其实洋葱也不是不能挂，别总对着我的眼睛……"] = "Actually, it's not like the onions can't be hung, just don't point them at my eyes...",
    ["其实父亲是觉得亏欠他太多。至于我么，呵，看似被重视，其实只是当做工具而已！我才不关心遗产！"] = "Actually, Father felt he owed him too much. As for me, heh, I seem to be valued, but I'm actually just treated as a tool! I don't care about the inheritance at all!",
    ["其实童工保护法草案里……"] = "Actually, in the draft of the Child Labor Protection Act...",
    ["其实这也是“愚者”先生的启示，他总是考虑得如此周到。可能……因为我没有缺过钱，所以总是忘记钱对于一个新生非凡者有多么重要。"] = "Actually, this is also the revelation of Mr. Fool; He is always so thoughtful. Maybe... because I have never lacked money, I always forget how important money is to a new Beyonder.",
    ["其实这也是“愚者”先生的启示，祂总是考虑得如此周到。"] = "Actually, this was also a revelation from Mr. Fool; He is always so thoughtful.",
    ["其实这也是愚者先生的启示，他总是考虑得如此周到。"] = "Actually, this is also a revelation from Mr. Fool; he is always so thoughtful.",
    ["其实这也是表演的一部分。"] = "Actually, this is also part of the performance.",
    ["其实这是我第一次去钓鱼，我只是爱赌。"] = "Actually, this is my first time fishing, I just love to gamble.",
    ["其实这是旧时代淑女们在社交场合不便直言时，发展出的一套视觉暗语。比如将扇子缓缓划过脸颊，通常表示“我很无聊”。"] = "Actually, this is a set of visual secret codes developed by ladies of the old era when it was inconvenient to speak directly in social situations. For example, slowly sliding the fan across the cheek usually means 'I am very bored.'",
    ["其实那些“女神的礼物”，都是赛拉悄悄布置好的。"] = "In reality, those \"Goddess's gifts\" were all quietly arranged by Sarah.",
    ["其实，“倒吊人”先生是一位很好的导师。"] = "Actually, Mr. \"The Hanged Man\" is a very good instructor.",
    ["其实，你只是想她多陪陪你吧？"] = "Really, you just want her to spend more time with you, don't you?",
    ["其实，德维尔爵士也算是个好人，就是有些事他想不到。"] = "Actually, Sir Dervil is a good person, it's just that there are some things he doesn't think of.",
    ["其实，我丈夫去世后，我一度以为自己的心也死了。"] = "Actually, after my husband passed away, I once thought my heart had died too.",
    ["其实，我就是那个俱乐部的成员。"] = "Actually, I am a member of that club.",
    ["其实，我带来了一份见面礼，请问您愿意接受吗？"] = "Actually, I brought a gift for our meeting. Would you be willing to accept it?",
    ["其实，我是个<P_Yellow>男人</>……一个变成<P_Yellow>魔女</>的男人。"] = "Actually, I am a <P_Yellow>man</>... a man who has turned into a <P_Yellow>Witch</>.",
    ["其实，见到他我就会抑制不住去拥抱他。"] = "Actually, whenever I see him, I can't help but want to hug him.",
    ["其实，这条途径在后期同样会获得不输他人的攻击和防御能力。但大家总是不太相信这一点。"] = "In fact, this pathway will also gain attack and defense abilities that are no less than others in the later stages. But everyone doesn't quite believe this.",
    ["其核心只有三步："] = "Its core consists of only three steps:",
    ["其次，注意那些永远不碰特定食物的人。比如坚决不碰带血牛排的，可能是“吸血鬼”……抱歉，是血族。"] = "Secondly, pay attention to those who never touch specific foods. For example, those who firmly refuse to touch rare steak might be 'vampires'... sorry, I mean, the Sanguine.",
    ["其生效时，允许在战斗中进行坐骑行为"] = "When active, allow mount behavior in combat",
    ["其间计算着真理与疯狂的分别。"] = "Within it, the distinction between truth and madness is calculated.",
    ["具体回办公室讨论吧，{{PlayerName}}也一起。"] = "Let's discuss the details back at the Office, {{PlayerName}} can come too.",
    ["具体时间节点不算——你知道，塔罗占卜课没那么精确。"] = "Specific time nodes don't count—you know, Tarot divination classes aren't that precise.",
    ["具体的情况，我也不是太清楚。"] = "I don't know the specific details too well either.",
    ["具体细分状态（ABP里定义的枚举），区别于LocomotionState（归并状态）。客户端只能取到self的，服务端可以取到self和其他人的。\n只能玩家使用，npc和机器人不行，因为npc和机器人是服务器控制的，服务器不维护动画状态机。另外，受限于tick的频率限制，有些locostate变化过快可能监听不到。"] = "Specific sub-states (enums defined in ABP), distinct from LocomotionState (merged states). The client can only access 'self', while the server can access 'self' and others. \n can only be used by players, not NPCs or bots, because NPCs and bots are server-controlled and the server does not maintain the animation state machine. Additionally, limited by tick frequency, some rapid LocomotionState changes may not be detected.",
    ["具体解锁规则可在此处查看。"] = "Specific unlocking rules can be viewed here.",
    ["具体计划是什么？"] = "What is the specific plan?",
    ["具体需要我做什么呢？"] = "What exactly do you need me to do?",
    ["具备反射与扭曲现实能力的器官，危险度极高。"] = "An organ with the ability to reflect and distort reality, with an extremely high danger level.",
    ["具备强烈致幻效果的植物汁液，易引发精神偏移。"] = "Plant sap with strong hallucinogenic effects, easily causing mental deviation.",
    ["具备高速与穿透象征的深海血液。"] = "Deep-sea blood with symbols of high speed and penetration.",
    ["具备高速神经反应特性的脊髓液，常用于敏捷相关配方。"] = "Spinal fluid with high-speed neural reaction characteristics, often used in agility-related formulas.",
    ["具有流动性与剧毒的金属，常作为炼金术中转化与分离的媒介。"] = "A fluid and highly toxic metal, often used as a medium for transformation and separation in alchemy.",
    ["具有灵性的渔网，捕梦网？"] = "A fishing net with spirituality, a dream catcher?",
    ["具有防护与遮蔽象征的草本粉末。"] = "Herbal powder with symbols of Protection and concealment.",
    ["具有隐匿相关的权柄，能隐匿自身信息使其他神灵无法追踪定位。掌握“神秘知识”权柄，可赋予数字力量，将世界归于虚无。"] = "Possess authority related to concealment, capable of concealing your own information so that other gods cannot track or locate you. Master the 'Mystical Knowledge' authority, capable of endowing numbers with power and returning the world to nothingness.",
    ["典型的贝克兰德居民。"] = "A typical Backlund resident.",
    ["典型的贝克兰德通勤路线。"] = "A typical Backlund commute.",
