    ["内务大臣你听到了，{{先生|女士}}不擦皮鞋，你可以走开了。{{先生|女士}}，看报纸吗？"] = "Minister of Internal Affairs, you heard him, {{Mr.|Ms.}} doesn't want a shoe shine, you can go now. {{Mr.|Ms.}}, want to read a newspaper?",
