    ["再一次？"] = "Once again?",
    ["再不下来，今晚的豌豆炖羔羊肉就没你的份了！"] = "If you don't come down, there won't be any lamb stew with peas for you tonight!",
    ["再不回家吃饭，妈妈肯定要骂我了。但、但是……"] = "If I don't go home for dinner, Mom will definitely scold me. But, but...",
    ["再不安生，我发誓我会狠狠踢你的屁股！"] = "If you don't behave, I swear I will kick your butt hard!",
    ["再不滚，我把你这破扫帚折了。"] = "If you don't get lost, I'll break your broken broom.",
    ["再为我唱首歌吧，我的爱人。\n\n科恩黎·怀特"] = "Sing another song for me, my love.\n\nCornelius White",
    ["再也没有回来\r\n……"] = "Never returned\r\n...",
    ["再仔细想想呢，这次伤害对了吗？"] = "Think about it carefully, was this damage correct?",
    ["再仔细找找，谁知道这三年这个巴掌大的地方又埋了多少新人。"] = "Look carefully again. Who knows how many new people have been buried in this tiny place over the last three years.",
    ["再仔细看看别人跳的舞是什么舞！"] = "Look carefully at what kind of dance others are dancing!",
    ["再休息一会"] = "Rest a while longer",
    ["再会。"] = "Goodbye.",
    ["再决定是否引荐你加入我们的内部组织。"] = "Before deciding whether to recommend you for our internal organization.",
    ["再减去二十。"] = "Then subtract twenty.",
    ["再减去您原来的年龄！"] = "Then subtract your original age!",
    ["再出海一次，就能攒够钱给家里换套有盥洗室的小房子了……"] = "One more voyage, and I'll have enough money to get a small house with a washroom for the family...",
    ["再到前面看看情况"] = "Go ahead and check the situation",
    ["再劝一次"] = "Persuade Once More",
    ["再加一点姜"] = "Add a little more ginger",
    ["再加一点薄荷糖"] = "Add a little more peppermint candy",
    ["再加上“歌颂者”能力对本身的临时提升，我完全可以与序列7层次，近身战斗型的怪物对抗。"] = "Combined with the temporary boost to my own abilities from the Bard, I can fully contend with Sequence 7 level melee-type monsters.",
    ["再加上七。"] = "Add seven more.",
    ["再加上我画的幻想中的成年奥莉薇……哦，做母亲的总会把女儿幻想得比自己美。"] = "Plus the portrait I drew of an adult Olivia in my imagination... oh, mothers always imagine their daughters to be more beautiful than themselves.",
    ["再加入2茶匙的薄荷糖。嗯，独特的搭配。"] = "Add 2 teaspoons of mint candy. Hmm, a unique combination.",
    ["再加入2茶匙的鲜姜。嗯，独特的搭配。"] = "Add 2 teaspoons of fresh ginger. Hmm, a unique combination.",
    ["再加入2茶匙薄荷糖。"] = "Add 2 teaspoons of mint candy.",
    ["再加入2茶匙薄荷糖。嗯，独特的搭配。"] = "Add 2 teaspoons of mint candy. Hmm, a unique combination.",
    ["再加入2茶匙鲜姜。"] = "Add 2 teaspoons of fresh ginger.",
    ["再加入半杯弗萨克烈酒。嗯……看起来还可以。让我们继续。"] = "Add half a cup of Feysac strong liquor. Hmm... it looks okay. Let's continue.",
    ["再加入半杯弗萨克烈酒，喔，看起来真不错。让我们继续。"] = "Add half a cup of Feysac strong liquor. Whoa, it looks really good. Let's continue.",
    ["再加入半杯橙汁。嗯……看起来还可以。让我们继续。"] = "Add half a cup of orange juice. Hmm... it looks okay. Let's continue.",
    ["再加入半杯橙汁，喔，看起来真不错。让我们继续。"] = "Add half a cup of orange juice. Whoa, it looks really good. Let's continue.",
    ["再加把劲啊，我巴不得少付些工钱。"] = "Work harder, I'm dying to pay less wages.",
    ["再动一下"] = "Move again",
    ["再占卜一下周围有没有危险。"] = "Divining again to see if there is any danger around.",
    ["再去别处看看。"] = "Go look somewhere else.",
    ["再去找她吧。"] = "Go find her again.",
    ["再去收集些材料吧"] = "Go collect some more materials",
    ["再去看看<h>工人们</>"] = "Go see the <h> workers </> again",
    ["再吃一个番茄！"] = "Eat another tomato!",
    ["再吃一份迪西馅饼，我就打赏3便士！"] = "If he eats another Dicy pie, I'll tip him 3 pence!",
    ["再吃不到人，我就要饿疯了，后果很严重"] = "If I don't eat a human soon, I'll go starving. The consequences will be severe.",
    ["再后来开始忘记你，忘记这个家。只记得那块地。只记得要得到它。"] = "Then I started forgetting you, forgetting this home. I only remembered that land. Only remembered wanting to get it.",
    ["再向上追寻完整，我就会成为他的容器，我不愿意；而抽出灵魂，自行缝合，又会使我重新成为那个冷漠的“我”。"] = "If I pursue completeness further, I will become his vessel, which I am unwilling to do; and if I extract the soul and stitch it together myself, it will cause me to become that cold \"me\" again.",
    ["再听一会"] = "Listen a while longer",
    ["再听到“我的猫趴在打字机上不让我写作”这种糟糕的借口，我真的会忍不住给编辑发电报，举报她过去所有的拖稿理由。"] = "If I hear that terrible excuse 'my cat is lying on the typewriter and won't let me write' again, I really won't be able to help sending a telegram to the editor to report all her past excuses for missing deadlines.",
    ["再告诉您一个秘密。那晚吻了您之后，我一个人又喝了三杯温热的酒。"] = "Let me tell you another secret. After kissing you that night, I drank three more glasses of warm wine by myself.",
    ["再和<h>报童</>聊聊"] = "Chat with the <h>newsboy</> again",
    ["再和霹雳舞王谈谈"] = "Talk to the Breakdance King again",
