    ["再回大学看看"] = "Return to the university to take a look",
    ["再坚持一下，马上就到营地了……"] = "Just hold on a little longer, we'll be at the camp soon...",
    ["再好好想想，我到底是怎么穿越的。"] = "Think carefully again, how exactly did I transmigrate?",
    ["再好好观察一下吧。"] = "Observe carefully again.",
    ["再好的建议也帮不到找死的傻瓜。你走吧，别怪我没有提醒你。"] = "Even the best advice cannot help a fool seeking death. You should go; don't blame me for not warning you.",
    ["再娶一个家世清正、貌美贤惠的当地淑女……嘿嘿"] = "And marry a local lady with a clean family background, beautiful and virtuous... Hehe.",
    ["再展示一招！"] = "Show another move!",
    ["再开一瓶迪西香槟。"] = "Open another bottle of Dicy champagne.",
    ["再往前走走"] = "Walk Further Ahead",
    ["再往右转，向前走，就能看到了。"] = "Turn right again and keep walking forward, and you'll see it.",
    ["再往外是“心智体”，从这里开始与肉体有了结合。它涉及头脑、属于推理、思考、洞察和认识事物能力的综合呈现。"] = "Further out is the 'Mental Body', which begins to combine with the physical body from here. It involves the mind and is a comprehensive presentation of reasoning, thinking, insight, and the ability to understand things.",
    ["再快一点，再快一点，总有一天，我也能站上舞台。"] = "Faster, a little faster, one day, I will be able to stand on the stage too.",
    ["再悄悄告诉你一件事，虽然我是这里的店主，但是这家店的实际出资人是奥黛丽小姐哦。"] = "Let me tell you a secret: although I am the owner here, the actual investor of this shop is Miss Audrey.",
