    ["再拆开书页，发现图案和已知的占星解读一致，就大概猜到了。"] = "When I opened the book pages and found that the patterns matched the known astrological interpretations, I roughly guessed it.",
    ["再拿起那件蕴含非凡力量的武器，激发身体中被馈赠的非凡能力！"] = "Then, pick up that weapon imbued with Beyonder power and ignite the Beyonder abilities gifted to your body!",
