    ["再糊100盒火柴盒，就能和斯林太太换2磅黑麦面包。"] = "If I glue 100 more matchboxes, I can trade them with Mrs. Slin for 2 pounds of rye bread.",
    ["再糊100盒火柴盒，就能在斯林太太的面包房换2磅黑麦面包了。"] = "If I glue another 100 matchboxes, I can trade them for 2 pounds of rye bread at Mrs. Slin's bakery.",
    ["再给我一点！！再给我一点！！"] = "Give me more!! Give me more!!",
    ["再给我点时间，很快就成功了！"] = "Give me a little more time, it will be successful soon!",
    ["再者，救济院每年的拨款是有限的，抛开一些年纪大的，作为工作人员，是真的不想让普通人都来这里。"] = "Furthermore, the annual funding for the poorhouse is limited. Setting aside some of the elderly, as staff, we really don't want ordinary people to come here.",
