    ["写下名字"] = "Write down the name",
    ["写下契约，必定履行。战斗中施放职业技能会自动公证，累积的公证层数持续提升你的攻击与技能增强，满层后转化为额外伤害。但一旦伪证，该次技能威力大减。"] = "Write down a covenant, and it must be fulfilled. Casting a Class Skill during combat will automatically trigger a Notarization. Accumulated Notarization stacks continuously increase your Attack and Skill Enhancement, converting into additional damage once fully stacked. However, once a false testimony is made, the power of that skill is greatly reduced.",
