    ["冥想是在脑海内勾勒凭空想象出来的物品来转移注意，收束溢出力量的方法。"] = "Meditation is a method of diverting attention and containing overflowing power by visualizing objects in one's mind.",
    ["冥想香薰"] = "Meditation Incense",
    ["冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞。她身披霜色骨纱而来。"] = "By the River of Eternal Darkness, death and eternity dance together. She arrives draped in a veil of frost-colored bone.",
    ["冥河之畔，死亡与永恒共舞，黑灰的王冠在死寂中为他加冕。"] = "By the banks of the River of Eternal Darkness, death and eternity dance together, and the black-gray crown crowns him in the deathly silence.",
    ["冥河殿"] = "River Styx Temple",
    ["冥河的波涛声如永恒安眠的曲调，万物在这里临近终结。 欢迎来到——冥皇阵营。"] = "The sound of the Styx's waves is like a melody of eternal slumber, where all things approach their end. Welcome to the Underworld Emperor faction.",
