    ["冥皇集合点"] = "Underworld Emperor Gathering Point",
    ["冥皇，也就是“死神”萨林格尔。他预料到了自己的陨落，于是将我——他的血裔——的灵魂分割成两半。"] = "The Underworld Emperor, that is, the 'Death' Salinger. He foresaw his own fall, so he split my soul—his blood descendant—into two halves.",
    ["冬天就要来了，我不忍心看到她的光脚在雪地里冻出血淋淋的裂口。"] = "Winter is coming, and I cannot bear to see her bare feet frozen with bloody cracks in the snow.",
