    ["冰冷月光洒落河边，四下死寂。\n开膛手与同伴尾随少女至此，趁夜色抽出利刃，准备在转角痛下杀手。\n她踏入阴影，将面临什么？"] = "Cold moonlight spills over the riverside, and everything is deathly silent. \nThe Ripper and his companion followed the young girl here, taking advantage of the night to draw their blades, preparing to strike at the corner. \nShe steps into the shadows; what will she face?",
    ["冰冷的尸体"] = "Cold corpse",
    ["冰冷的月光洒在无人的江边，四周只剩下死一般的寂静。"] = "Cold moonlight spilled over the deserted riverside, leaving only deathly silence all around.",
    ["冰冷的月光洒在无人的江边，四周只剩下死一般的寂静。真是个绝佳的葬身之地，对吧？ "] = "Cold moonlight spilled over the deserted riverside, leaving only deathly silence all around. A perfect place to be buried, don't you think?",
    ["冰冷的焚烧炉，静静地在车间正中央。"] = "The cold incinerator, quietly in the center of the workshop.",
    ["冰冷的血液中，沉淀着原始的狩猎本能。"] = "In the cold blood, the primitive hunting instinct settles.",
