    ["冷硬的石材垒砌而成墙面，蓝色马赛克拼成的窗户增加些许活泼的生气。"] = "A wall surface built from cold and hard stone, with windows made of blue mosaic adding a touch of lively vitality.",
    ["冷硬的石材垒砌而成的墙面，从古老的城堡时代延续至今。"] = "A wall built of cold, hard stone, enduring from the ancient castle era to the present.",
    ["冷硬的石材垒砌而成的墙面，紫色马赛克拼成的窗户增加些许活泼的生气。"] = "A wall surface built from cold and hard stone, with windows made of purple mosaic adding a touch of lively vitality.",
