    ["凌"] = "Ling",
    ["凌乱的床铺"] = "Messy Bed",
    ["凌厉"] = "Sharp",
    ["凌宇"] = "Lingyu",
    ["凌晨一点结束"] = "Ends at 1:00 AM",
    ["凌晨三点半醒"] = "Waking Up at 3:30 AM",
    ["凌晨前要把这堆废料全部运走，我的老天，这要干多久？"] = "I have to move all this scrap before dawn, my god, how long will this take?",
    ["凌雪"] = "Lingxue",
    ["凌霄"] = "Lingxiao",
    ["凌霜"] = "Lingshuang",
    ["减"] = "Decrease",
    ["减价！半价！1便士卖我！——铁十字街的穷鬼们\n做梦吧你！——铁十字街的其他穷鬼们"] = "Discount! Half price! Sell it to me for 1 penny! — The poor wretches of Iron Cross Street\nKeep dreaming! — The other poor wretches of Iron Cross Street",
    ["减伤"] = "Damage Reduction",
    ["减伤10%"] = "10% Damage Reduction.",
    ["减伤30%"] = "Damage Reduction 30%",
    ["减伤90%并对灼烧到的敌人造成高额伤害，期间无法攻击、跳跃和闪避。"] = "Damage Reduction 90% and deal high damage to enemies burned. During this period, you cannot attack, jump, or dodge.",
    ["减伤提升"] = "Damage Reduction increased.",
    ["减伤提高*f**"] = "Damage Reduction increased by *f**",
    ["减伤提高2%，体力消耗速率降低20%。"] = "Damage Reduction increased by 2%, stamina consumption rate decreased by 20%.",
    ["减伤提高30%"] = "Damage Reduction increased by 30%",
    ["减伤提高<Yellow>*d**</>。"] = "Damage Reduction increased by <Yellow>*d**</>.",
    ["减伤能力·副本"] = "Damage Reduction · Dungeon",
    ["减伤能力·竞技"] = "Damage Reduction · Competition",
    ["减伤降低"] = "Damage Reduction Lowered",
    ["减伤降低*f**。"] = "Damage Reduction lowered by *f**.",
    ["减伤降低<Red>*f**</>。"] = "Damage reduction lowered by <Red>*f**</>.",
    ["减伤：自身30米范围的圆形区域"] = "Damage Reduction: Circular area within 30 meters of yourself",
    ["减免受到伤害的攻击基础值，无法减免伤害的技能基础值。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>，与对方<Highlight>破防</>、<Highlight>忽视防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Reduces the base Attack value of received damage; cannot reduce the base Skill value of damage. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Armor Break </> and <Highlight> Ignore Defense </> attributes.",
    ["减免受到物理伤害的攻击基础值，无法减免物理伤害的技能基础值。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>，与对方<Highlight>物理破防</>、<Highlight>忽视物理防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Reduces the base Attack value of received physical damage; cannot reduce the base Skill value of physical damage. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Physical Armor Break </> and <Highlight> Ignore Physical Defense </> attributes.",
    ["减免受到魔法伤害的攻击基础值，无法减免魔法伤害的技能基础值。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>，与对方<Highlight>魔法破防</>、<Highlight>忽视魔法防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Reduces the base Attack value of received magic damage; cannot reduce the base Skill value of magic damage. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Magic Armor Break </> and <Highlight> Ignore Magic Defense </> attributes.",
    ["减免所受伤害的技能基础值，抵消伤害来源的技能增强。\n技能基础值不受<Highlight>攻击</>和<Highlight>防御</>影响，取决于<Highlight>技能系数</>和<Highlight>技能等级</>。\n修正后的技能基础值存在<Highlight>250%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的技能抵挡超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>技能增强</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Reduces the base Skill value of received damage, offsetting the damage source's Skill Enhancement. \n The base Skill value is not affected by <Highlight> Attack </> and <Highlight> Defense </>, but depends on <Highlight> Skill Coefficient </> and <Highlight> Skill Level </>. \n The corrected base Skill value has an upper limit of <Highlight> 250% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 5% </>; if the increased Skill Block exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Skill Enhancement </> attribute.",
    ["减去……"] = "Subtract...",
