    ["凑过去"] = "Lean in",
    ["凑近"] = "Move closer",
    ["凑近<h>人群</>"] = "Get close to the <h> crowd </>",
    ["凑近<h>铁门</>"] = "Get close to the <h>iron door</>.",
    ["凑近一点"] = "Move closer",
    ["凑近了解"] = "Look closer to understand",
    ["凑近点……"] = "Come closer...",
    ["凑近看看"] = "Lean in to look",
    ["凑近能闻到极淡的石灰质气息，混着一丝禽蛋\n特有的、微腥的暖意。 "] = "Getting closer, one can smell a faint calcareous scent, mixed with a trace of warmth peculiar to poultry eggs\n, slightly fishy.",
    ["凑近能闻到极淡的石灰质气息，混着一丝禽蛋\n特有的、微腥的暖意。<P_Heart>（呃，味道一致。）</>"] = "Getting closer, one can smell a faint calcareous scent, mixed with a trace of warmth peculiar to poultry eggs\n, slightly fishy.<P_Heart> (Uh, the smell is the same.)</>",
    ["凑近观察"] = "Look closer",
    ["凑近观察“织梦黑匣”"] = "Lean in to observe the \"Dream-Weaving Black Box\"",
    ["凑近观察……"] = "Observing closely...",
    ["凑近门口"] = "Approach Door",
    ["凛冬黑兰德"] = "Winter Blackland",
    ["凝"] = "Ning",
    ["凝势"] = "Gathering Momentum",
    ["凝固的熔浆"] = "Solidified Magma",
    ["凝固的金泉"] = "Solidified Gold Spring",
    ["凝思"] = "Ningsi",
    ["凝星"] = "Ningxing",
    ["凝滞buff"] = "Stasis Buff",
    ["凝璐"] = "Ninglu",
    ["凝聚星光向敌人突刺，对其造成伤害和眩晕。施法后可施放连招回到初始位置。"] = "Condense starlight to thrust at enemies, dealing damage and stun. After casting, you can trigger a combo to return to the initial position.",
    ["凝聚朗基努斯之枪从天而降，对小范围内敌方进行三段刺击，获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）并附带减疗效果。"] = "Condense the Spear of Longinus to descend from the sky, performing three stabs on enemies in a small area, gaining mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) and applying healing reduction.",
    ["凝聚朗基努斯之枪掷向指定区域，对小范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害，并造成持续*f秒的mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>效果，有<HighLight>50%</>基础概率造成持续<HighLight>3</>秒的<HighLight>50%</>减速效果。同时获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Condense a Spear of Longinus and throw it at the designated area, dealing spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies in a small area, applying Healing Reduction <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"></> for *f seconds calculated as mul(*d**,*d), with a 50% <HighLight></> base probability of causing a 50% <HighLight></> Slow effect for 3 <HighLight></> seconds. Simultaneously gain 20 points of Mysterious Knowledge <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Mysterious Knowledge </>: Maximum of 100 points. Upon reaching 100 points, unlock the Finisher Skill Vortex of Knowledge <HighLight></>.",
    ["凝聚灵性"] = "Condense Spirituality",
    ["凝聚短斧在6秒内持续攻击周身敌方，每0.8秒造成*d点物理伤害和*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>，并有*f**的基础概率施加持续*f秒的滞涩；\n施法时获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得2点<HighLight>太阳能量</>），随后每攻击2次获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>太阳能量</>：最多持有5点，获取太阳能量以解锁与强化<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>。"] = "Condenses a short axe to continuously attack surrounding enemies for 6 seconds, dealing *d physical damage every 0.8 seconds and *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"> Healing Reduction </>, with a base probability of *f** to apply Stagnation for *f seconds; \n gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> when casting (gain 2 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state), then gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> every 2 attacks. \n\n<FaintYellow> Solar Energy </>: Hold up to 5 points. Obtain Solar Energy to unlock and strengthen <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>.",
    ["凝聚短斧在6秒内持续攻击周身敌方，每<HighLight>0.8</>秒造成*d点魔法伤害，并有*f**的基础概率施加持续*f秒的<HighLight>25%</>减速；"] = "Condense a short axe to continuously attack surrounding enemies for 6 seconds, dealing *d magic damage every <HighLight>0.8</> seconds, with an *f** base probability of applying <HighLight>25%</> Slow for *f seconds;",
    ["凝蝶"] = "Ningdie",
    ["凝视"] = "Gaze",
    ["凝视巨龙"] = "Gaze at Giant Dragon",
    ["凝视巨龙离去"] = "Gaze at the Giant Dragon leaving",
    ["凝视核心"] = "Gaze core",
    ["凝视深渊的人，终在深渊中看见自身。与恶龙缠斗太久，龙鳞早已覆上身躯。"] = "He who gazes into the abyss eventually sees himself within it. Having fought with evil dragons for too long, dragon scales have already covered the body.",
    ["凝视混沌的阴影，拥抱堕落与死亡！"] = "Gaze into the shadows of chaos, embrace corruption and death!",
    ["凝视的浮球"] = "Gazing Floating Orb",
    ["凝视秘密者，也将为秘密所凝视。"] = "He who gazes into secrets shall also be gazed upon by them.",
    ["凝视者的眼中，倒映出对方一览无余的心灵。"] = "In the eyes of the Spectator, the other party's mind is reflected, laid bare.",
    ["凝视芙拉绕圈"] = "Gaze Fula Circling",
    ["凝雪"] = "Ningxue",
    ["几个学生来到公告栏前……"] = "Several students came to the bulletin board...",
    ["几个月……那时候他应该把钱已经花光了。不行，梅高欧丝，我想你必须做出决定了。"] = "Several months... By then, he will have spent all the money. No, Megose, I think you must make a decision.",
    ["几人围坐打牌<h></>"] = "Several people sitting around playing cards <h></>",
    ["几十年前，我从我的老师那里学会了所有传统戏剧的技巧，现在，我也把这些教给我的学徒。"] = "Decades ago, I learned all the techniques of traditional drama from my teacher. Now, I also teach these to my Apprentice.",
    ["几千年的时光，它们依然在守护着什么？"] = "After thousands of years, what are they still guarding?",
    ["几千年过去，巨人们一直在寻找家乡。这条路，除非抵达终点，否则永不停止。"] = "Thousands of years have passed, and the giants have been looking for their hometown. This road will never stop unless it reaches the end.",
    ["几块羔羊肉"] = "A few pieces of lamb",
    ["几天前，他因病去世在别墅里，不久后，将有律师宣读他的遗嘱。"] = "A few days ago, he passed away due to illness in his villa. Soon, a lawyer will read his will.",
    ["几天前，我跟着朋友去古堡寻宝时，和一具盔甲对视了！回来后竟然发现恋人是我失散多年的亲哥哥！"] = "A few days ago, when I went treasure hunting in an old castle with a friend, I locked eyes with a suit of armor! When I came back, I discovered that my lover was my long-lost biological brother!",
    ["几天后"] = "A few days later.",
    ["几天后……"] = "A few days later...",
    ["几天后。"] = "A few days later.",
    ["几天过去……"] = "A few days passed...",
    ["几封信掉出来，来自金秋湖，一个月前寄出，落款是奥莉薇。"] = "Several letters fell out, sent from Golden Autumn Lake a month ago, signed by Olivia.",
    ["几封未寄的信"] = "Several Unsent Letters",
    ["几年了，还到处都是。早该扔掉的……早该。"] = "Years have passed, and they are still everywhere. They should have been thrown away long ago... should have.",
    ["几年前在边境，我误入过一个叫“新芽”的村子。"] = "A few years ago at the border, I accidentally entered a village called 'New Sprout'.",
    ["几年前我试着把他们从回忆里一点点复现出来，没想到附近的邻居也都挺喜欢的，就一并放在店里卖了。"] = "A few years ago, I tried to recreate them bit by bit from my memories. I didn't expect the neighbors nearby to like them too, so I put them in the shop to sell together.",
    ["几年前没有机会，也没有勇气来看他走过的这条路。"] = "A few years ago, I didn't have the opportunity or the courage to see the path he walked.",
    ["几年前，和弗萨克的战争摧毁了我们数年的成果。"] = "A few years ago, the war with Feysac destroyed years of our hard work.",
    ["几年前，这些紫藤花开得还没这般茂密，太阳就是最好的煤油灯，我在这里读完了很多很多本书。"] = "A few years ago, these wisteria flowers weren't as lush as they are now. The sun was the best kerosene lamp, and I finished many, many books here.",
    ["几年后，凯瑟琳病死在湖边的小屋里。乔安娜在表演中失误摔伤，再也站不起来。"] = "A few years later, Catherine died of illness in a cabin by the lake. Joanna fell and was injured during a performance and could never stand again.",
    ["几张折叠程度各不相同的纸页，用一根打了死结的细绳松垮地捆着，有几处还画了奇怪的小符号。"] = "Several pages folded to varying degrees, loosely tied with a knotted string, with strange little symbols drawn in some places.",
    ["几枚硬币就能换来的快乐，工人们劳碌一天后的最爱。"] = "Happiness that can be bought with a few coins, a favorite for workers after a long day of labor.",
    ["几根头发，我也不确定算不算“不好的事物”。"] = "A few strands of hair, I'm not sure if that counts as 'something bad'.",
    ["几片面包。"] = "A few pieces of bread.",
    ["几番忏悔，试用墨水凝结思绪。"] = "After several confessions, I try to use ink to condense my thoughts.",
    ["几磅胡萝卜"] = "A few pounds of carrots",
    ["几缕深红色的毛发，握在手里意外地温热。"] = "A few strands of deep red hair, surprisingly warm in the palm of your hand.",
    ["几道轻微的划痕，像是长期佩戴后与皮肤摩擦留下的痕迹，仿佛还残留着前任主人的……某种东西。"] = "A few slight scratches, like marks left by friction with the skin after long-term wear, as if some... kind of thing from the previous owner still remains.",
    ["几页文件表示了商会对铁路通行权的许可，商界大亨的梦想起点。"] = "A few pages of documents representing the Chamber of Commerce's permission for railway access, the starting point of a business tycoon's dream.",
    ["凡"] = "Fan",
    ["凡举起左手祈求隐秘者，她必以阴影遮蔽恶灵的眼目。"] = "Whoever raises their left hand to pray to the Hidden One, she shall shield them from the eyes of evil spirits with shadows.",
    ["凡人啊，天使的怜悯已到尽头。"] = "Mortal, the mercy of the Angel has reached its end.",
    ["凡器在手，皆为所用。"] = "Any weapon in hand can be used.",
    ["凡在枕边低语其尊名者，她必驱散梦魇中邪祟的踪迹。"] = "Whoever whispers her honorable name by their pillow, she shall dispel the traces of evil in their nightmares.",
    ["凡妮莎"] = "Vanessa",
    ["凡存在过的必留下痕迹"] = "Whatever has existed must leave a trace.",
    ["凡尔赛拼花的木地板，复杂而讲究的排列似乎是因蒂斯流传过来的风格。"] = "Versailles parquet wooden flooring; the complex and meticulous arrangement seems to be a style passed down from Intis.",
    ["凡心"] = "Mortal Heart",
    ["凡烙印者，必为光明之敌，承当百倍灼痛。"] = "Those who are branded shall be enemies of the light and bear a hundredfold burning pain.",
    ["凭什么……"] = "On what grounds...",
    ["凭你们，也想解除我的封印？"] = "Do you really think you can break my seal?",
    ["凭你？现在的非凡者都这么没礼貌吗？"] = "By you? Are all Beyonders so rude these days?",
