    ["凯尔文，西迦女士很喜欢你的礼物，不过她说自己现在可算不上什么“大作家”——她最近一篇稿子刚被《廷根日报》的编辑退了回来，正发愁呢。"] = "Kelvin, Ms. Xiga likes your gift very much, but she said she can't really be considered a \"great writer\" right now—her latest manuscript was just rejected by the editor of the Tingen Daily, and she's quite worried about it.",
    ["凯尔文？那个机灵但有点莽撞的小伙子。看来那个平安符咒派上用场了，没事就好，这是？"] = "Kelvin? That clever but somewhat reckless young man. It seems that safety charm came in handy. I'm glad he's okay. What is this?",
