    ["凶手为什么要这样做？"] = "Why would the murderer do that?",
    ["凶手在卧室做了什么？"] = "What did the murderer do in the bedroom?",
    ["凶手既然选择提刀向无辜者，就该做好被惩罚的准备。"] = "Since the killer chose to draw a knife against an innocent person, they should be prepared to be punished.",
    ["凶手是你！你冷眼旁观每一个人进出，却什么都没做。只有你，从来没有真正关心过男爵的死亡。"] = "The murderer is you! You watched everyone come and go with cold eyes, but did nothing. Only you never truly cared about the Baron's death.",
    ["凶手是你！你原本就对霍克斯男爵心有不满。下午，你再次因为那件古董，和他大吵一架，冲动之下，选择了结束霍克斯男爵的生命！"] = "The murderer is you! You were already dissatisfied with Baron Hawkes. This afternoon, you had another big argument with him over that antique, and in a fit of impulse, you chose to end Baron Hawkes' life!",
    ["凶手是你！霍克斯男爵在你敲门前就已经死亡，你不可能听到他的声音。你撒谎是因为你杀了霍克斯男爵，想用谎言掩盖真相！"] = "The murderer is you! Baron Hawkes was already dead before you knocked on the door; you couldn't have heard his voice. You lied because you killed Baron Hawkes and wanted to cover up the truth with lies!",
