    ["击败世界灾厄可获得灾厄残迹，达到一定进度值时获得奖励。灾厄残迹每周一8时重置。\n单场世界灾厄讨伐中获得的贡献值越高，最终取得的灾厄残迹数量越高，单场获取上限为700个。\n每日20:00到21:00之间参与讨伐世界灾厄可以获得双倍的灾厄残迹，同时获取上限提高为1200个"] = "Defeating World Calamity can yield Calamity Remnants, and rewards are obtained when reaching a certain progress value. Calamity Remnants reset at 8:00 every Monday. \nThe higher the contribution value obtained in a single World Calamity crusade, the higher the final number of Calamity Remnants obtained, with a single-run acquisition cap of 700. \nParticipating in the World Calamity crusade between 20:00 and 21:00 daily can earn double Calamity Remnants, and the acquisition cap is increased to 1200.",
