    ["切，你那算什么。上周她跳舞时朝我眨了下眼，我老婆问我“你傻笑什么”，我说“想到涨工资了”。"] = "Pfft, that's nothing. Last week she winked at me while dancing, and my wife asked, 'Why are you grinning like an idiot?' I said, 'I was thinking about a raise.'",
