    ["列奥德罗的闪电击杀了乌黯魔狼......吗"] = "Leodero's lightning killed the Dark Demonic Wolf...... or did it?",
    ["列奥纳多"] = "Leonardo",
    ["列奥纳多先生，请留步……你还好吗？无意冒犯，只是刚才在比赛中，你和鸡蛋说话的方式……让我有些担心。"] = "Mr. Leonardo, please wait... Are you alright? No offense intended, but during the match just now, the way you were talking to the egg... it made me a bit worried.",
