    ["刘洋"] = "Liu Yang",
    ["刘洋-测试位面用"] = "Liu Yang-For Test Plane",
    ["刘洋-黑荆棘3传送门"] = "Liu Yang - Black Thorn 3 Portal",
    ["刘英杰"] = "Liu Yingjie",
    ["刘颂菲"] = "Liu Songfei",
    ["刚上市的报纸、杂志，快来买咯！"] = "Newspapers and magazines just released, come and buy them!",
    ["刚下船的先生女士们！准备上船的老爷夫人们！走过路过不要错过！"] = "Gentlemen and ladies who just disembarked! Lords and ladies preparing to board! Don't miss out as you pass by!",
    ["刚下过雨，天气很好。祝您玩得愉快。"] = "It just rained, and the weather is lovely. Have a pleasant time.",
    ["刚买的东西有点瑕疵，心里怪不舒服的。"] = "The thing I just bought has a flaw, it feels quite uncomfortable.",
    ["刚入职就出任务？要小心点。"] = "Going on a mission right after joining? Be careful.",
    ["刚出炉的面包，香软美味。"] = "Freshly baked bread, fragrant and delicious.",
    ["刚刚"] = "Just now",
    ["刚刚“开门”的时候，我听到了狗叫一样的声音，原来是这头狒狒，可恶！"] = "When I used \"Open Door\" just now, I heard a sound like a dog barking; it turned out to be this baboon, damn it!",
    ["刚刚……做了一个梦吗？什么命运、扮演、面具……"] = "Just now... did I have a dream? What fate, Acting, masks...",
    ["刚刚不是还让我答应他？让我想想……"] = "Didn't you just ask me to agree to him? Let me think...",
    ["刚刚听他们说到那个姓劳维斯的工人，去码头那边找他问问情况吧。"] = "Just heard them mention that worker named Lawvis. Let's go to the dock and ask him about the situation.",
    ["刚刚在俱乐部里，一个叫菲利普的退伍军官听到枪声后，精神似乎崩溃了，落下了这块怀表。"] = "Just now in the club, a retired officer named Philip seemed to have a mental breakdown after hearing the gunshot and dropped this pocket watch.",
    ["刚刚我看到了……你也用占卜？"] = "I just saw... do you use divination too?",
    ["刚刚我看到了……你也用占卜？ "] = "I just saw... you use divination too?",
    ["刚刚是……一个女孩的哭声？听上去很虚弱，或许可以<P_Yellow>在周围调查一下</>。"] = "Was that... a girl's crying just now? It sounded very weak. Perhaps I should <P_Yellow>investigate the surroundings</>.",
    ["刚刚是我鲁莽了，今天吃得很开心，帮我谢谢库克！"] = "I was reckless just now. I enjoyed the meal today; please thank Cook for me!",
    ["刚刚是枪、枪击声吗？"] = "Was that a gun, a gunshot just now?",
    ["刚刚有个怪物，我差点就没命了！你事先可没说有这个！"] = "There was a monster just now, I almost lost my life! You didn't mention there would be one!",
    ["刚刚来的小姐还没有自我介绍呢，快让我们认识一下。"] = "The lady who just arrived hasn't introduced herself yet. Let us get to know her.",
    ["刚刚的一切……是梦……"] = "Everything just now... was a dream...",
    ["刚刚的占卜中看到了三个人……除了那个兜帽女子，其它两个人的形象感觉很熟悉，似乎在哪里见过。"] = "I saw three people in the divination just now... Apart from the hooded woman, the other two figures felt familiar, as if I had seen them somewhere before.",
    ["刚刚的学生，他在喊我过去？"] = "The student just now, was he calling me over?",
    ["刚刚的火腿太咸了……"] = "The ham from just now was too salty...",
    ["刚刚的绅士是不是在看我，我就知道，我今天光彩夺目！"] = "Was that gentleman looking at me just now? I knew it, I'm dazzling today!",
    ["刚刚的表演真是精彩。"] = "The performance just now was truly wonderful.",
    ["刚刚获得了一个<Highlight>秘晶</>，来提升下装备吧。"] = "You just obtained a <Highlight>Secret Crystal</>. Come and upgrade your equipment.",
    ["刚刚获得了新衣服，前往<Orange>换装</>。"] = "You just obtained new clothing; go to <Orange> Change Outfit </>.",
    ["刚刚调查时我也找到了一些东西，也许可以放在一起。看看这个旧钱夹。"] = "I also found some things while investigating just now. Maybe we can put them together. Look at this old wallet.",
    ["刚刚调配好的序列9魔药。"] = "A freshly prepared Sequence 9 potion.",
    ["刚刚邓肯提到，艾登会靠在窗边吹口风琴，要不我也试试？"] = "Duncan mentioned earlier that Aiden would lean against the window and play the harmonica. Should I try that too?",
    ["刚刚那是……<P_Heart>（有些迟疑）</>"] = "That was just... <P_Heart>(hesitantly)</>",
    ["刚到安全屋"] = "Just Arrived at the Safe House",
    ["刚到贝克兰德时"] = "Upon arriving in Backlund",
    ["刚到贝克兰德时AI"] = "Upon arriving in Backlund (AI)",
    ["刚听到的消息超惊喜，真想马上分享出去！"] = "The news I just heard is super surprising, really want to share it immediately!",
    ["刚喝完魔药可能还不适应，你也趁机缓缓。"] = "You might not be used to it after just drinking the potion; take this chance to relax.",
    ["刚好有个地方想去送一束花。"] = "I just happen to have a place where I want to deliver a bouquet of flowers.",
    ["刚好肚子有点饿了，给我一份吧。"] = "I happen to be a bit hungry, give me a portion.",
    ["刚好，你也可以趁这段时间休息一下。"] = "Coincidentally, you can also take this time to rest.",
    ["刚好，应该是伦纳德找你，快去地下室看看吧！"] = "As it happens, Leonard should be looking for you. Go to the basement and take a look!",
    ["刚开业的店，居然一点准备都没做……"] = "A newly opened shop, and they haven't made any preparations at all...",
    ["刚开始的时候很辛苦，每天要起得很早，最难受的还是吃不饱。"] = "It was very hard at the beginning; I had to get up very early every day, and the worst part was not having enough to eat.",
    ["刚开始，她和一位男士，共乘一辆马车，很开心、很天真……"] = "At the beginning, she and a gentleman were riding in a carriage together, very happy, very innocent...",
    ["刚得到的自行车，骑得还不熟练。"] = "I'm not yet skilled at riding this newly acquired bicycle.",
    ["刚才……"] = "Just now...",
    ["刚才……发生了什么？"] = "Just now... what happened?",
    ["刚才……怎么了？"] = "Just now... what happened?",
    ["刚才……？尤朵拉去哪里了？"] = "Just now...? Where did Yodora go?",
    ["刚才他们对你的态度可算不上美好。"] = "Their attitude toward you just now could hardly be called wonderful.",
    ["刚才他们提到“奇怪的事情”？是什么呢……"] = "They mentioned 'strange things' just now? What could that be...",
    ["刚才你拉琴的时候，乌鸦突然全飞走了。我们站在那片安静的花田里，看着风景，忽然觉得心情好了很多。话也说开了。"] = "Just now, when you played the violin, the crows suddenly flew away. We stood in that quiet flower field, looking at the scenery, and suddenly felt much better. We even opened up to each other.",
    ["刚才冲上去的时候，忽然就不怕了。以前我总是怕他们报复，怕妹妹受伤……"] = "When I rushed up just now, I suddenly wasn't afraid anymore. Before, I was always afraid they would retaliate, afraid my sister would get hurt...",
    ["刚才发生了什么，你为什么会昏迷在巷子里？"] = "What happened just now? Why were you unconscious in the alley?",
    ["刚才在门口明明听到了齿轮转动的声音，这时候却消失了……"] = "I clearly heard the sound of gears turning at the door just now, but it disappeared at this moment...",
    ["刚才封印物2-049好像发疯了一样……"] = "Just now, Sealed Artifact 2-049 seemed to have gone crazy...",
    ["刚才很危险，记住，保持曲臂伸展，对抗滞涩！"] = "That was dangerous just now, remember, keep your arms bent and stretched to resist stagnation!",
    ["刚才我买完菜，有个小家伙说帮我提袋子，只要1便士。现在的孩子们都这么鬼灵精了么？"] = "Just now after I finished grocery shopping, a little one said he would help me carry the bag for only 1 pence. Are children nowadays all this clever?",
    ["刚才我和她说的话，都是私下闲聊，请不要当真。"] = "What I said to her just now was private chatter, please don't take it seriously.",
    ["刚才我坐在沙发上时，随手翻了翻当下市场上流行的庸俗之作。"] = "While I was sitting on the sofa earlier, I idly flipped through some of the vulgar works currently popular on the market.",
    ["刚才我教你的，你都学会了没？"] = "Have you learned everything I just taught you?",
    ["刚才我的同伴，替换了那张危险的红月牌，去拿来吧。"] = "My companion just replaced that dangerous Red Moon card. Go and get it.",
    ["刚才我看到有人在混乱中逃走了，他们逃往的方向是——金秋湖。"] = "I just saw someone escape in the chaos; the direction they fled in was—Golden Autumn Lake.",
    ["刚才我遇到过一位猎人，或许他还没走远，一起去问问他吧。"] = "I met a hunter just now; perhaps he hasn't gone far, let's go ask him together.",
    ["刚才的事情，我都想起来了。 "] = "I remember everything that happened just now.",
    ["刚才的回忆散发出不祥的气息……这次得谨慎行事。"] = "The memory from just now gave off an ominous aura... I must proceed with caution this time.",
    ["刚才的是科恩黎 不久前从文职人员转为了正式的值夜者"] = "That was Kenley just now, he recently transferred from a clerical position to a formal Nighthawk.",
    ["刚才的是科恩黎，不久前从文职人员转为了正式的值夜者。"] = "That was Cohen, who recently transferred from a clerical position to a formal Nighthawk.",
    ["刚才的都是梦境？值夜者？非凡事件？"] = "Everything just now was a dream? Nighthawks? Beyonder incidents?",
    ["刚才真是千钧一发。"] = "That was a close call just now.",
    ["刚才罗珊就是用这些铃铛通知邓恩队长的，是有什么特殊的暗号？"] = "Rozanne was just using these bells to notify Captain Dunn. Is there some special secret code?",
    ["刚才老维德好像朝琳达走过去了，我们也跟过去吧。"] = "Old Wade seemed to walk toward Linda just now, let's follow them.",
    ["刚才街道上突然起了大雾，附近的人全都不见了。"] = "Just now, thick fog suddenly rose on the street, and everyone nearby disappeared.",
    ["刚才说的这些，都记住了吗？"] = "Did you remember everything I just said?",
    ["刚才这一轮还不够好……"] = "That last round wasn't good enough...",
    ["刚才那个小女孩呢？"] = "Where is that little girl from just now?",
    ["刚才那位太太。她的丈夫去年冬天死在这片湖里。"] = "That lady just now. Her husband died in this lake last winter.",
    ["刚才那家伙呢？还有那个臭丫头！"] = "What about that guy from before? And that brat!",
    ["刚才那是什么，差点要了我的命……"] = "What was that just now? It almost killed me...",
    ["刚才那是，“愚者”先生的一段历史？"] = "Was that just now a piece of Mr. Fool's history?",
    ["刚才那真的是侠盗黑皇帝？！就像一道幻影！"] = "Was that really the Phantom Thief Black Emperor just now?! It was like a phantom!",
    ["刚才那组，第三发你还是太急。呼吸，科尔，要像吻姑娘前那样，先沉住气。"] = "That last set, your third shot was still too rushed. Breathe, Cole, you have to stay calm, just like before kissing a girl.",
    ["刚打捞上岸的塔索克鱼和龙骨鱼，新鲜着呢！"] = "Tussock fish and dragonbone fish just salvaged from the water, they're fresh!",
    ["刚收到的礼物完全戳中心思，开心到想转圈圈！"] = "The gift I just received is exactly what I wanted, so happy I want to spin around!",
    ["刚来没多久"] = "Just arrived not long ago",
