    ["刚泡的咖啡。"] = "Freshly brewed coffee.",
    ["刚萌发的栗树孢子，象征生长与延续。"] = "Newly sprouted chestnut spores, symbolizing growth and continuation.",
    ["刚贴上的海报又不见了！"] = "The poster I just put up is gone again!",
