    ["初次见猎人进对话"] = "Enter dialogue upon first meeting hunter",
    ["初次见面，容我自我介绍一下，我是本校学术诚信办公室的萨姆，正在调查一起性质恶劣的<P_Yellow>考试舞弊案</>。"] = "Nice to meet you, let me introduce myself. I am Sam from the school's Office of Academic Integrity, and I am investigating a serious case of <P_Yellow> exam cheating </>.",
    ["初次见面，容我自我介绍一下，我是本校学术诚信办公室的萨姆，正在调查一起性质恶劣的考试舞弊案。"] = "Nice to meet you. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Sam from the school's Academic Integrity Office, and I am currently investigating a serious case of exam cheating.",
    ["初次见面，阿诺德"] = "Nice to meet you, Arnold",
    ["初次观察环境"] = "Observe Environment for the First Time",
    ["初次进入出生点"] = "First time entering spawn point",
    ["初步掌握“开门”能力，可穿墙、隔空取物、进行定位。很少被困住，能通过打开不属于现实的通道顺利逃脱困境，难以被阻隔。"] = "Initially master the ability to 'Open Door', allowing you to pass through walls, retrieve objects from a distance, and perform positioning. Rarely trapped, you can escape dilemmas by opening passages that do not belong to reality, making you difficult to block.",
    ["初步掌握太阳与光之权柄，可化光飞行穿梭天际，亦能散为光芒承受伤害后重组身体，追逐光明的轨迹，成为光的化身与使者。"] = "Initially masters the authority of the Sun and Light, can fly through the sky as light, and can also disperse into light to withstand damage before reforming the body, chasing the trajectory of light and becoming an incarnation and messenger of light.",
    ["初步掌握星象、星座、星辰的神秘学知识，可使用星之巨柱、星海穿梭、星光囚笼等能力，能看透许多非凡事物的本质。"] = "Initially master mysterious knowledge of astrology, constellations, and stars. Capable of using abilities such as Pillar of Stars, Voyage Through the Sea of Stars, and Starlight Cage, and can see through the essence of many Beyonder things.",
    ["初步获得与灵界沟通能力，灵感提升，掌握占星、卡牌、灵摆等占卜能力，能“看”到被挡事物，“听”到微弱脚步，但缺乏直接对敌手段。"] = "Initially gain the ability to communicate with the Spirit World, increase inspiration, and master divination skills such as astrology, cards, and pendulums. You can 'see' blocked objects and 'hear' faint footsteps, but lack direct means of combat.",
    ["初现格调"] = "Initial Style",
