    ["制作炸药"] = "Make Explosives",
    ["制作神话武器的关键材料。\n\n开启神话铸造仪式时，需要消耗1个<Highlight>神话织茧</>和60个<Highlight>织茧游丝</>，完成仪式后，获得神话武器<Highlight>【隐秘之拥】</>。\n若是缺少<Highlight>神话织茧</>，也可消耗30个<Highlight>织茧游丝</>，铸造武器<Highlight>【夜幕之颂】</>。<Highlight>【夜幕之颂】</>可通过补齐材料进一步铸造为<Highlight>【隐秘之拥】</>。\n随赛季进程，将开放【隐秘之拥】和【夜幕之颂】的装等提升，提升时消耗一定数量的<Highlight>织茧游丝</>。"] = "Key materials for crafting Mythical weapons.\n\nWhen initiating a Mythical Forging ritual, it consumes 1 <Highlight>Mythical Cocoon</Highlight> and 60 <Highlight>Cocoon Silk Strands</Highlight>. Upon completing the ritual, you will obtain the Mythical weapon <Highlight>[Secret Embrace]</Highlight>.\nIf you lack a <Highlight>Mythical Cocoon</Highlight>, you may instead consume 30 <Highlight>Cocoon Silk Strands</Highlight> to forge the weapon <Highlight>[Ode to Nightfall]</Highlight>. <Highlight>[Ode to Nightfall]</Highlight> can be further forged into <Highlight>[Secret Embrace]</Highlight> by providing the missing materials.\nAs the season progresses, the gear level cap for [Secret Embrace] and [Ode to Nightfall] will be increased, which will consume a certain amount of <Highlight>Cocoon Silk Strands</Highlight>.",
    ["制作神话武器的关键材料。需要消耗1个神话织茧和60个织茧游丝开启仪式，完成仪式后，获得神话武器。"] = "Key material for crafting Mythical weapons. You need to consume 1 Mythical Cocoon and 60 Cocoon Silk to start the ritual. After completing the ritual, you will obtain the Mythical weapon.",
    ["制作神话武器的核心材料。使用道具可接取任务【隐秘之拥】，探寻制作神话武器的方法。制作神话武器时，需要消耗1个神话织茧和60个织茧游丝开启仪式，完成仪式后，获得神话武器。"] = "Core material for crafting Mythical weapons. Use the item to accept the quest [Embrace of Concealment] to explore methods of crafting Mythical weapons. When crafting a Mythical weapon, you need to consume 1 Mythical Cocoon and 60 Cocoon Silk to start the ritual. After completing the ritual, you will obtain the Mythical weapon.",
