    ["制造空间牢笼，协同攻击牢笼范围内的敌人，并持续对其造成伤害，为自己提供霸体与减伤，随后牢笼坍塌对敌人造成追加伤害。空间牢笼会赋予自身研习效果，强化部分战斗技能。"] = "Create a Space Cage to coordinate attacks on enemies within the cage, dealing continuous damage while providing yourself with super armor and damage reduction. The cage then collapses, dealing additional damage to enemies. Space Cage grants you the Study effect, strengthening certain combat skills.",
