    ["刻意一点，可以摔断骨头，但是又有什么用呢？"] = "If I do it deliberately, I could break a bone, but what would be the point?",
    ["刻意隐瞒"] = "Conceal Deliberately",
    ["刻有异常纹路的黑豹脊髓液，象征速度与侵略性。"] = "Spinal fluid of a black panther engraved with abnormal patterns, symbolizing speed and aggression.",
