    ["前%d%%"] = "Top %d%%",
    ["前%s名投影"] = "Top %s Projections",
    ["前5"] = "Top 5",
    ["前一个目标给下一个目标加的buff；主要用来播放特效的"] = "Buff applied by the previous target to the next target; mainly used for playing VFX",
    ["前一级商队部件未达到最高等级"] = "The previous level caravan component has not reached the maximum level.",
    ["前一页的日期是1349年6月26日。"] = "The date on the previous page is June 26, 1349.",
    ["前三名投影"] = "Top three projections",
    ["前不久，有人在贝克兰德发现了他的踪迹，教区值夜者博尔吉亚立即带人追捕，一路到了廷根附近，向圣堂请求支援。"] = "Not long ago, someone discovered his tracks in Backlund. The diocesan Nighthawk Borgia immediately led people to pursue him, all the way to the vicinity of Tingen, and requested support from the Holy Cathedral.",
    ["前不久，有多位目击者在夜晚目击到疑似活尸的踪迹。"] = "Not long ago, multiple witnesses spotted traces of what is suspected to be a zombie at night.",
    ["前两周，我给新的话剧投稿了主题曲，但是他们最后选了一个和剧目完全不搭调的，那个作曲者也不知道从哪里冒出来的。"] = "Two weeks ago, I submitted a theme song for a new play, but they ended up choosing one that didn't fit the play at all. I don't even know where that composer popped out from.",
    ["前两幕戏已经结束了，第三幕戏会发生怎样的事情呢？快去看看吧。"] = "The first two acts are over. What will happen in the third act? Go take a look quickly.",
    ["前五名"] = "Top Five",
    ["前代巫师笔记"] = "Notes of a Previous Wizard",
    ["前任舞王"] = "Former Dance King",
    ["前值夜者小队成员，现任黑夜教会高级执事。性格散漫随性，有诗人一般的气质，被克莱恩称为“诗人同学”，身体里寄宿着“偷盗者”途径的天使帕列斯·索罗亚斯德。"] = "A former member of the Nighthawks squad, currently a high-ranking deacon of the Church of Evernight. He has a laid-back and casual personality with the temperament of a poet. Klein calls him 'Poet Classmate'. He hosts the angel Pallez Zoroast of the Marauder pathway within his body.",
    ["前冲连击"] = "Dash Combo",
    ["前几十年不敢买的东西，现在能随便买，可好吃的食物已经嚼不动，好喝的饮料已经咽不下，想做的事也没那个心力了。"] = "Things I didn't dare to buy for decades, I can buy casually now, but I can no longer chew delicious food, I can no longer swallow tasty drinks, and I don't have the heart or energy for the things I wanted to do.",
    ["前几天有个穿得很华丽的管家来带走了，可能被有钱人收藏了吧。"] = "A few days ago, a butler dressed very gorgeously came to take it away. It was probably collected by some rich person.",
    ["前几年的积累，加上这次的功勋，足够你兑换几个序列的魔药配方和材料了……"] = "The accumulation from the past few years, plus your merits this time, is enough for you to exchange for several Sequence potion formulas and materials...",
    ["前几年，一位朋友也和我一起回到过那里。我想，拉姆德的变化应该不会太大？"] = "A few years ago, a friend also returned there with me. I think Lamud shouldn't have changed too much?",
