    ["前往首都贝克兰德的“万都之都”号航班当前赛季暂未启航，请留意开船通知。"] = "The current season for the flight to the capital, Backlund, on the 'Capital of Capitals' has not yet begun. Please keep an eye out for departure notifications.",
