    ["前往黑荆棘安保公司"] = "Head to Blackthorn Security Company",
    ["前往黑荆棘安保公司<h>前台</>"] = "Head to the <h>reception desk</> of Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["前往黑荆棘安保公司入职 ，克莱恩成为了一名值夜者，也认识了公司许多友善有趣的新同事们。在这个过程中，克莱恩意外读到罗塞尔大帝的日记，发现他竟然也是一位穿越者！"] = "Heading to Blackthorn Security Company to start his job, Klein becomes a Nighthawk and also meets many friendly and interesting new colleagues at the company. In the process, Klein accidentally reads Emperor Roselle's diary and discovers that he is actually also a transmigrator!",
    ["前往黑荆棘安保公司门外？好古怪的留言，还没有署名……"] = "Go to the entrance of Blackthorn Security Company? What a strange message, and it's not even signed...",
    ["前往黑荆棘安保公司，按照计划向队长铺垫魔药消化的事情。"] = "Head to Blackthorn Security Company and, as planned, lay the groundwork with the Captain regarding the digestion of the potion.",
