    ["前有断崖，因此——后撤吧。"] = "There is a cliff ahead, therefore—retreat.",
    ["前期拾取神秘特性的玩家需要去场边<Highlight>清理长戟兵</>获取荣耀之证，其他玩家在内场谨慎输出；随后对决开始时，持有<Highlight>一级及以上荣耀之证</>的玩家前往对决点<Highlight>解锁对决技能</>，然后使用技能发起对决！其余玩家<Highlight>合力击破</>先祖铠甲的护盾帮助对决成功！"] = "Players who picked up mysterious characteristics in the early stage need to go to the edge of the field to <Highlight>clear the Halberdiers</> to obtain the Proof of Glory, while other players output cautiously in the inner field. Subsequently, when the duel begins, players holding <Highlight>Level 1 or higher Proof of Glory</> should go to the duel point <Highlight>to unlock the duel skill</>, then use the skill to initiate the duel! The remaining players should <Highlight>work together to break</> the Ancestor Armor's shield to help the duel succeed!",
    ["前期拾取神秘特性的玩家需要去场边<Highlight>清理长戟兵</>获取荣耀之证，其他玩家在内场谨慎输出；随后对决开始时，持有<Highlight>三级荣耀之证</>的玩家前往对决点<Highlight>解锁对决技能</>，然后使用技能发起对决！其余玩家<Highlight>合力击破</>先祖铠甲的护盾帮助对决成功！"] = "Players who picked up mysterious characteristics in the early stage need to go to the edge of the field to <Highlight>clear the Halberdiers</> to obtain the Proof of Glory, while other players output cautiously in the inner field. Subsequently, when the duel begins, players holding <Highlight>Level 3 Proof of Glory</> should go to the duel point <Highlight>to unlock the duel skill</>, then use the skill to initiate the duel! The remaining players should <Highlight>work together to break</> the Ancestor Armor's shield to help the duel succeed!",
