    ["前段时间太忙，一直没去看望阿诺德，据说他和卡萝队长的性格越来越像了，呵呵。"] = "I've been too busy lately to visit Arnold, they say his personality is becoming more and more like Captain Carol's, haha.",
    ["前段时间，韦尔奇得到了一本第四纪的笔记，找我一起解读。"] = "Some time ago, Welch obtained a notebook from the Fourth Epoch and asked me to help him decipher it.",
