    ["副会长"] = "Vice President",
    ["副会长是辅助会长的重要职位，拥有仅次于会长的高等权限，可代替会长行使部分内部管理权限和外交权利，由会长任命。"] = "The Vice President is an important position assisting the President, holding high-level authority second only to the President, and can exercise some internal management and diplomatic rights as appointed by the President.",
    ["副作用就是……<P_Heart>（认真思考）</> 有些人看到的东西太有趣了，所以不想醒过来。但这说明它效果好，不是吗？"] = "The side effects are... <P_Heart>(Thinking seriously)</> Some people see things that are too interesting, so they don't want to wake up. But this shows it's effective, doesn't it?",
    ["副作用是使用者进入循环空间后，每一次循环，手上会随机出现一个机关谜题，需要在限定时间内解开，否则会被吞噬、转化为一个全新的机关谜题。"] = "The side effect is that after the user enters the loop space, a random mechanical puzzle will appear on their hand with each cycle. It must be solved within a limited time, or the user will be devoured and transformed into a brand-new mechanical puzzle.",
