    ["加入俱乐部后可以体验"] = "Experience this after joining a club",
    ["加入值夜者小队，在廷根参与处理非凡案件……也许是一个不错的选择。"] = "Joining the Nighthawks squad and participating in handling Extraordinary cases in Tingen... perhaps that's a good choice.",
    ["加入共演"] = "Join co-performance",
    ["加入共舞"] = "Join dance",
    ["加入分组后才能邀请玩家进入自己的分组"] = "You must join a group before you can invite players to your own group.",
    ["加入哪个教团"] = "Which Order to join",
    ["加入塔罗学派前，似乎还有一项重要的考验在等着我。"] = "Before joining the Tarot Club, it seems there is still an important test waiting for me.",
    ["加入塔罗学派时，我们都曾面对屏障碎片宣誓——“以人性守护未来，于末日相互守望”，每个塔罗学派成员都明白这句话的意义。"] = "When joining the Tarot Club, we all swore before the fragments of the Barrier—\"Guard the future with humanity, and watch over each other at the end of the world.\" Every member of the Tarot Club understands the meaning of this sentence.",
    ["加入塔罗的解读"] = "Join the Tarot Interpretation",
    ["加入失败了"] = "Failed to join.",
    ["加入守护，直面非凡"] = "Join the Guardians and face the Extraordinary.",
    ["加入安魂诗社"] = "Join the Requiem Poetry Society",
    ["加入安魂诗社/春夜舞会"] = "Join the Requiem Poetry Society / Spring Night Ball",
    ["加入家族"] = "Join Family",
    ["加入家族可获得额外的副本加成，是否前往家族界面？"] = "Joining a Family can provide additional dungeon bonuses. Do you want to go to the Family interface?",
    ["加入家族有什么好处"] = "What are the benefits of joining a Family",
    ["加入家族自动获得，离开家族后失去"] = "Obtained automatically upon joining a Family, lost upon leaving",
    ["加入家族邮件id"] = "Join family email ID",
    ["加入巡游"] = "Join Parade",
    ["加入廷根市值夜者小队，成为非凡者？我可以吗？"] = "Join the Tingen Nighthawks squad and become a Beyonder? Can I?",
    ["加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。"] = "Join or create a club to participate in various club activities, earn generous activity rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.",
    ["加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部分为休闲俱乐部和战斗俱乐部，可在俱乐部信息修改处进行调整，休闲俱乐部不会在成员列表显示非凡评分。"] = "Join or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, earn rich rewards, and obtain Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop. \nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information settings. Leisure Clubs do not display Beyonder ratings in the member list.",
    ["加入战队"] = "Join Team",
    ["加入房间"] = "Join Room",
    ["加入教团"] = "Join cult",
    ["加入教团【安魂诗社】"] = "Join the organization [Requiem Poetry Society]",
    ["加入教团【安魂诗社】后生效，可通过灵视查看其他玩家的理智等级。"] = "Effective after joining the cult [Requiem Poetry Society], you can view the sanity levels of other players through spirit vision.",
    ["加入教团【春夜舞会】"] = "Join the cult [Spring Night Ball].",
    ["加入教团【春夜舞会】后生效，可对玩家发起魅惑。"] = "Effective after joining the cult [Spring Night Ball], you can initiate charm against players.",
    ["加入教团为什么不能确认"] = "Why can't I confirm joining a cult",
    ["加入教团后可自动获得该封印物能力。当通过灵视查看其他非凡者时，能对其施以安魂，帮助其恢复理智，远离疯狂。"] = "After joining the cult, you can automatically obtain this Sealed Artifact ability. When viewing other Beyonders through spirit vision, you can cast a requiem on them to help them restore sanity and stay away from madness.",
    ["加入教团后可自动获得该封印物能力。获得特殊技能【魅惑】，可对其他非凡者释放，发起魅惑邀约。"] = "After joining the cult, you can automatically obtain this Sealed Artifact ability. Obtain the special skill [Charm], which can be released on other Beyonders to initiate a charm invitation.",
    ["加入教团有什么用"] = "What is the use of joining an Order",
