    ["匿名频道会提供一个虚假身份，包含随机生成的名字和头像。在匿名频道发言有<Highlight>较低概率</>暴露发言者真实身份。"] = "The anonymous channel provides a fake identity, including a randomly generated name and avatar. Speaking in the anonymous channel has a <Highlight> low probability </> of exposing the speaker's true identity.",
    ["匿名频道说明"] = "Anonymous Channel Explanation",
    ["匿形刺击"] = "Stealth Stab",
