    ["十"] = "Ten",
    ["十、十一、十二……真可惜，不能一起玩了……"] = "Ten, eleven, twelve... what a pity, we can't play together anymore...",
    ["十一席"] = "Eleventh Seat",
    ["十一月十八日"] = "November 18th.",
    ["十七号晴天"] = "Sunny Day No. 17",
    ["十万"] = "One Hundred Thousand",
    ["十万片铁羽，每一片都是一则被实践证明的定理。"] = "One hundred thousand iron feathers, each one a theorem proven by practice.",
    ["十三席"] = "Thirteenth Seat",
    ["十个小时的历史讲座？这老头疯了吧？"] = "A ten-hour history lecture? Is this old man crazy?",
    ["十二个"] = "Twelve",
    ["十二人本城堡怎么打"] = "How to clear the 12-player Castle dungeon",
    ["十二人本花园怎么打"] = "How do I clear the 12-player Garden dungeon?",
    ["十二席"] = "Twelfth Seat",
    ["十二镑！我怎么就签了字？我根本没学会拒绝——每天晚上我都要懊悔我的头发和钱……我不想活了！"] = "Twelve pounds! Why did I sign it? I didn't learn how to refuse at all—every night I regret my hair and my money... I don't want to live anymore!",
    ["十亿"] = "One Billion",
    ["十几年了，还这么干劲十足啊。"] = "It's been over a decade, and he's still so full of energy.",
    ["十几年前她就在这条街上占卜了。"] = "She has been doing divination on this street for over a dozen years.",
    ["十几年容貌未变，能让动物亲近……"] = "Her appearance hasn't changed in more than a decade, and animals are drawn to her...",
    ["十几种蔬菜任您挑选！"] = "Over a dozen kinds of vegetables for you to choose from!",
    ["十分感谢，教会和我都会铭记你的帮助。你可以直呼我的名字，“烈焰”达尼兹——糟糕，狗屎，我还在通缉令上 ，你不会举报我吧？"] = "Thank you very much. Both the Church and I will remember your help. You can call me by my name, 'Flaming' Danitz—oh, crap, shit, I'm still on the wanted list. You won't report me, will you?",
    ["十分美丽……你知道得很清楚啊？"] = "Very beautiful... you know that quite clearly, don't you?",
    ["十分钟后……"] = "Ten minutes later...",
    ["十分钟后他还不出现，我会立刻离开。"] = "If he doesn't appear in ten minutes, I will leave immediately.",
    ["十四席"] = "Fourteenth Seat",
    ["十堰"] = "Shiyan",
    ["十字AOE"] = "Cross AOE",
    ["十字型"] = "Cross Shape",
    ["十字大厅"] = "Cross Hall",
    ["十字攻击"] = "Cross Attack",
    ["十字斩"] = "Cross Slash",
    ["十字架"] = "Cross",
    ["十字深巷"] = "Cross Alley",
    ["十字街上路触发器"] = "Cross Street Upper Road Trigger",
    ["十字路口划分出拥挤的街区，污水流淌在喧嚷的集市地面。"] = "The crossroads divide the crowded blocks, and sewage flows on the ground of the noisy market.",
    ["十席"] = "Tenth Seat",
    ["十年前，我还只是一个穷学生，谁能想到今天我能走到这个高度？哼……"] = "Ten years ago, I was just a poor student. Who could have imagined I'd reach this height today? Hmph...",
    ["十年没回去了，一切是不是都变样了？"] = "It's been ten years since I went back, has everything changed?",
    ["十息觉醒"] = "Ten-Breath Awakening",
    ["十战征途"] = "Journey of Ten Battles",
    ["十月九日"] = "October 9th",
    ["十月九日，\n他们竟然称呼我为#Space4#，\n我很喜欢。"] = "October 9th,\nThey actually call me #Space4#,\nI like it very much.",
    ["十月二日"] = "October 2nd",
    ["十月五日"] = "October 5th",
    ["十月六日"] = "October 6th",
    ["十束深眠花"] = "Ten bunches of Deep Sleep Flowers",
    ["十枚金币扔进去，赌一个未知。资本的规则，从来都是愿者上钩。"] = "Throw in ten gold coins and bet on the unknown. The rules of capital have always been that the willing take the bait.",
    ["十胜勋章"] = "Medal of Ten Victories",
    ["十赌十胜"] = "Ten bets, ten wins",
    ["十镑？二十镑？哈哈，你还真是贪心……给你五十镑，马上给我滚，永远不要出现在我的面前！"] = "Ten pounds? Twenty pounds? Haha, you're really greedy... I'll give you fifty pounds, get out immediately, and never appear in front of me again!",
    ["十镑？二十镑？小子，你还真贪心……给你五十金镑，马上给我滚，永远不要出现在我的面前！"] = "Ten pounds? Twenty pounds? Kid, you're really greedy... I'll give you fifty gold pounds, get out immediately, and never appear in front of me again!",
    ["千"] = "Thousand",
    ["千万"] = "Ten Million",
    ["千万不要低估这些小家伙的食欲，亲爱的，我们必须尽快捉到它们！"] = "Never underestimate the appetite of these little guys, my dear, we must catch them as soon as possible!",
    ["千万不要赊账给他。"] = "Whatever you do, don't let him run a tab.",
    ["千万别错过每日新闻！"] = "Don't miss the daily news!",
    ["千万别！"] = "Don't you dare!",
    ["千刃腰带"] = "Thousand-Blade Belt",
    ["千年的纹路被磨成粉末，时间的壁垒在指尖散开。"] = "Millennial patterns ground into powder, the barriers of time dissipate at the fingertips.",
    ["千百刀剑齐鸣，你是唯一的武器主宰。"] = "Thousands of swords ring out together; you are the only master of weapons.",
    ["千百年来的祈求终于有了回应，灰雾之上的伟大存在将目光投向了这片遗落之地。"] = "The prayers of thousands of years finally received a response, and the great existence above the gray fog cast his gaze upon this lost land.",
    ["千纸鹤"] = "Paper Crane",
    ["千钧"] = "Qianjun",
    ["千钧一发之际，伦纳德出现，暂停了时间，解除了镜雨。\n伦纳德：可以了老头，多谢。"] = "At the critical moment, Leonard appears, pauses time, and dispels the mirror rain. \n Leonard: That's enough, old man, thanks.",
