    ["午后咖啡"] = "Afternoon Coffee",
    ["午后影子慢慢拉长，时间过去了一些，又好像没有。"] = "The shadows lengthen slowly in the afternoon, time has passed, yet it feels like it hasn't.",
    ["午后的阳光倾洒进咖啡杯，惬意的心情和拉花一般缤纷。"] = "The afternoon sun spills into the coffee cup, and the cozy mood is as colorful as the latte art.",
    ["午后闲谈"] = "Afternoon Chat",
    ["午夜之约"] = "Midnight appointment",
    ["午夜俱乐部宣传传单"] = "Midnight Club Promotional Flyer",
    ["午夜俱乐部，排解你的午夜忧愁\n\n提供：歌舞、棋牌、台球、香醇美酒\n\n下午两时起接受当晚预订，会员包间需提前预约。"] = "Midnight Club, relieving your midnight sorrows \n\n Offers: Singing and dancing, chess and cards, billiards, and mellow wine \n\n Accepting reservations for the night from 2 PM; member rooms require advance booking.",
    ["午夜太阳-触发器"] = "Midnight Sun - Trigger",
    ["午夜梦回获得启示，就在解救人质的房间对面，出现了对那本《安提格努斯家族笔记》的感应，发现关键人物瑞尔比伯,但已无踪影，只能请求圣堂派人护送“2-049号封印物”过来......发现关键人物瑞尔比伯,但已无踪影，只能请求圣堂派人护送“2-049号封印物”过来......发现关键人物瑞尔比伯,但已无踪影，只能请求圣堂派人护送“2-049号封印物”过来......"] = "Received a revelation in a midnight dream. Right across from the room where the hostages were rescued, I sensed the presence of that \"Antigonus Family Notes\". I discovered the key figure, Ray Bieber, but he had already vanished. I had no choice but to request the Cathedral to send someone to escort \"Sealed Artifact 2-049\" over... I discovered the key figure, Ray Bieber, but he had already vanished. I had no choice but to request the Cathedral to send someone to escort \"Sealed Artifact 2-049\" over... I discovered the key figure, Ray Bieber, but he had already vanished. I had no choice but to request the Cathedral to send someone to escort \"Sealed Artifact 2-049\" over...",
    ["午夜焦点"] = "Midnight Focus",
    ["午夜玫瑰"] = "Midnight Rose",
    ["午夜礼赠"] = "Midnight Gift",
    ["午夜茶会"] = "Midnight tea party",
    ["午夜茶会入口"] = "Midnight Tea Party entrance",
    ["午夜茶会？"] = "Midnight Tea Party?",
    ["午夜诗人"] = "Midnight Poet",
    ["午夜诗篇"] = "Midnight Poem",
    ["午夜钟声响起"] = "Midnight Bell Tolls",
    ["午夜，书籍，失路人"] = "Midnight, Books, The Lost",
    ["午安，汤姆森先生。关于扣款明细，清单上每一项都有您入住时签字确认的现状记录作为对照。我们可以再一起核对一遍。"] = "Good afternoon, Mr. Thomson. Regarding the deduction details, every item on the list has a status record that you signed and confirmed upon check-in as a reference. We can check it together again.",
    ["午睡的时候他会站起来，从关着的窗户飘出去……呜呜。"] = "During his nap, he would stand up and float out through the closed window... wuu wuu.",
    ["午餐不愉快？"] = "Lunch wasn't pleasant?",
    ["午餐时如果移开视线，食物就会被幽灵带走。"] = "If you look away during lunch, the food will be taken away by a ghost.",
    ["午餐消失？"] = "Lunch disappeared?",
    ["午餐盒"] = "Lunch Box",
    ["午餐盒饭刚开始可是很丰盛的，慢慢地才变少了，肉也见不到了。"] = "The lunch boxes were very hearty at first, but they gradually became smaller, and meat was no longer to be seen.",
