    ["半块燕麦面包很棒，上面还沾着牛排汁就更好了。"] = "Half a loaf of oat bread is great, and it's even better if it's soaked in steak juice.",
    ["半块黑面包"] = "Half a piece of black bread",
    ["半块黑面包，味道可以想象，但这是橱柜里唯一的选择了。"] = "Half a loaf of black bread. One can imagine the taste, but it is the only choice in the cupboard.",
    ["半夜突发的刺眼强光让人误以为的时间是早晨"] = "The blinding light that suddenly appeared in the middle of the night made people mistake the time for morning",
