    ["半月前，湖面上传来了叹息声，可怜的女人失去了她的孩子。"] = "Half a month ago, a sigh came from the lake, and the poor woman lost her child.",
    ["半杯弗萨克烈酒，半杯柠檬汁，2茶匙薄荷糖，再加上一点柠檬瓣。接下来摇一摇……"] = "Half a cup of Feysac strong liquor, half a cup of lemon juice, 2 teaspoons of mint candy, plus a little lemon zest. Next, give it a shake...",
    ["半杯柠檬汁，半杯橙汁，2茶匙薄荷糖……接下来摇一摇。"] = "Half a cup of lemon juice, half a cup of orange juice, 2 teaspoons of mint candy... next, give it a shake.",
    ["半杯柠檬汁，半杯橙汁，2茶匙鲜姜……接下来摇一摇。"] = "Half a cup of lemon juice, half a cup of orange juice, 2 teaspoons of fresh ginger... next, give it a shake.",
    ["半杯牛奶，有股淡淡的鱼腥味。"] = "Half a cup of milk with a faint fishy smell.",
    ["半杯甜柠檬汁，半杯弗萨克烈酒，2茶匙鲜姜，一些冰块。接下来摇一摇……"] = "Half a cup of sweet lemon juice, half a cup of Feysac strong liquor, 2 teaspoons of fresh ginger, some ice cubes. Next, give it a shake...",
    ["半杯甜苹果汁，半杯橙汁，2茶匙薄荷糖，再加上一点柠檬瓣。接下来摇一摇……"] = "Half a cup of sweet apple juice, half a cup of orange juice, 2 teaspoons of mint candy, plus a little lemon zest. Next, give it a shake...",
    ["半杯甜苹果汁，半杯橙汁，2茶匙鲜姜，一些冰块。接下来摇一摇。"] = "Half a cup of sweet apple juice, half a cup of orange juice, 2 teaspoons of fresh ginger, some ice cubes. Next, give it a shake.",
    ["半杯苹果汁，半杯弗萨克烈酒，2茶匙薄荷糖，一些冰块。接下来摇一摇……"] = "Half a cup of apple juice, half a cup of Feysac strong liquor, 2 teaspoons of mint candy, some ice cubes. Next, give it a shake...",
