    ["占卜俱乐部位于豪尔斯街13号二楼。"] = "The Divination Club is located on the second floor of 13 Zoutland Street.",
    ["占卜俱乐部最近生意惨淡，占卜师们埋怨铁十字街的平民占卜师海莉用胡说八道抢走了他们的客人。海莉将代表厄运的逆位星币五解读成“两个人依偎着就能等到春天”，把宝剑十说成“剑不会再多了”。你前往铁十字街，却得知海莉去探访故人，已经很久没有回来。担心有非凡力量介入的你，一路追至霍纳奇斯雪山，得知了海莉与自己马戏团好友的占卜旧事。在故友女儿抗争命运的故事里，你体悟了“占卜家”的一条扮演法则——解读命运是为了让人走向命运，而非止步于命运。"] = "The Divination Club has been struggling lately, and the diviners complain that Haley, a civilian diviner on Iron Cross Street, is stealing their customers with nonsense. Haley interprets the reversed Five of Pentacles, which represents misfortune, as 'two people leaning on each other can wait for spring,' and calls the Ten of Swords 'the swords won't increase anymore.' You head to Iron Cross Street, only to learn that Haley went to visit an old friend and hasn't returned for a long time. Worried that Beyonder powers are involved, you track her all the way to the Hornacis Snowy Mountain and learn the old story of Haley and her circus friend's divination. In the story of her old friend's daughter fighting against fate, you realize an Acting principle of the 'Seer'—interpreting fate is to help people move toward their fate, not to stop at it.",
    ["占卜俱乐部氛围"] = "Divination Club Atmosphere",
    ["占卜俱乐部混入邪教徒和邪恶组织的成员，你作为值夜者小队标准的非凡者，加入他们，方便进行监控。这完全是工作需要。"] = "The Divination Club has cultists and members of evil organizations mixed in. As a standard Beyonder of the Nighthawks squad, joining them makes it easier to monitor them. This is entirely for work purposes.",
    ["占卜俱乐部的书架上，似乎有灵性波动……"] = "There seems to be spirituality fluctuations on the bookshelf of the Divination Club...",
    ["占卜俱乐部的海纳斯·凡森特？！他还在私下教授黑占卜……对了，你有听赛琳娜颂念过咒文吗？"] = "Haines Vincent from the Divination Club?! He is still teaching black divination in private... By the way, have you heard Selena chant any incantations?",
