    ["占卜家以熟练的技巧收集<HighLight>命运黄牌</>、<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>和<HighLight>卡牌能量</>，将<HighLight>终结技能</>在<HighLight>命运愚弄</>、<HighLight>灵性爆发</>和<HighLight>洗牌</>间切换，并可通过技能为敌方附加持续*f秒的<HighLight>愚弄标记</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>愚弄标记</>：叠加3层后引爆并移除愚弄标记，受到施加者造成的mul(*d,3)点物理伤害。"] = "The Seer uses skillful techniques to collect <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</>, <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</>, and <HighLight>Card Energy</>, switching the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> between <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</>, <HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>, and <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>, and can apply <HighLight>Fooling Mark</> to enemies for *f seconds via skills. \n\n<FaintYellow>Fooling Mark</>: After stacking 3 times, it detonates and is removed, dealing mul(*d,3) physical damage to the target from the caster.",
