    ["占卜家释放会根据卡牌层数造成额外效果\n可以叠加卡牌层数的技能：并非虚构、命运塔罗、花式飞牌\n根据卡牌层数获得额外影响效果的技能：奇迹牌雨、火焰跳跃、谢幕演出、纸牌飞刀、灵体之线、秘偶大师"] = "Seer skills cause additional effects based on the number of Card stacks. \nSkills that can stack Cards: Not Fiction, Fate Tarot, Fancy Card Throwing. \nSkills that gain additional effects based on Card stacks: Miracle Card Rain, Flame Jump, Curtain Call, Card Flying Dagger, spirit body threads, Marionettist.",
