    ["卡尔·埃德加"] = "Karl Edgar",
    ["卡尔·埃德加-1星"] = "Karl Edgar - 1 Star",
    ["卡尔·埃德加-2星"] = "Karl Edgar - 2 Star",
    ["卡尔·埃德加-3星"] = "Karl Edgar - 3 Star",
    ["卡尔·埃德加将自己窥探到无穷禁忌知识转化为实体能量，在每名玩家身边召唤出由禁忌知识凝聚而成的书架。玩家一旦<Disable>靠近书架就会受到诅咒</>，难以脱身。"] = "Karl Edgar converts the infinite Forbidden Knowledge he has pried into physical energy, summoning bookshelves condensed from Forbidden Knowledge around each player. Once a player <Disable>approaches a bookshelf, they will be cursed</> and find it difficult to escape.",
    ["卡尔·埃德加投影"] = "Karl Edgar Projection",
    ["卡尔·埃德加痴迷于收藏玩偶……"] = "Karl Edgar is obsessed with collecting dolls...",
    ["卡尔·埃德加碎片"] = "Karl Edgar Fragment",
    ["卡尔·埃德加翻阅典籍，持续汲取力量。在此期间<Disable>持续追踪一名玩家</>，在汲取力量结束时<Disable>将其秒杀</>。此外汲取力量的过程中受到的所有伤害大幅度减免，还能对全场造成持续伤害。\n<Disable>汲取力量的过程可以被“邪眼陷阱”打断</>。"] = "Karl Edgar flips through his codex, continuously absorbing power. During this time, he <Disable>continuously tracks one player</>, and <Disable>instantly kills them</> when the power absorption ends. Additionally, all damage taken while absorbing power is significantly reduced, and he can deal continuous damage to the entire field. \n<Disable>The power absorption process can be interrupted by \"Evil Eye Traps\"</>.",
    ["卡尔·埃德加踩到“邪眼陷阱”时会中断汲取力量的过程，被追踪的玩家应该<Highlight>引导怪物去踩陷阱</>。"] = "When Karl Edgar steps on the \"Evil Eye Trap,\" the process of absorbing power will be interrupted. The tracked player should <Highlight>lure the monster to step on the trap</>.",
    ["卡尔·埃德加释放灵性幻化出窥秘之眼，被窥秘之眼凝视的玩家无处可藏，会在短暂延时后受到来自卡尔·埃德加的锁定激光攻击。\n<Disable>书架可以抵挡激光攻击</>，并会被直接摧毁，转化为<Disable>“邪眼陷阱”</>。"] = "Karl Edgar releases his spirituality to manifest the Eyes of Mystery Prying. Players gazed upon by the Eyes of Mystery Prying have nowhere to hide and will be targeted by Karl Edgar's laser attack after a short delay. \n<Disable>Bookshelves can block the laser attack</>, and will be destroyed upon impact, transforming into <Disable>\"Evil Eye Traps\"</>.",
    ["卡尔文·"] = "Calvin ",
    ["卡尔肯定是遇到什么事了，我保证，他回来后会补齐的。"] = "Karl must have encountered something, I guarantee he will pay it back when he returns.",
