    ["卡拉尼·"] = "Kalani ",
    ["卡拉彭"] = "Karapen",
    ["卡拉彭有个信条：耗材不需要名字。\r\n枪声从来不是审判，只是屠宰场开工的哨子。\r\n这是条流水线，下一具尸体已经上了传送带。"] = "Kalapon has a creed: consumables don't need names.\r\nGunshots are never a judgment, just the whistle for the slaughterhouse to start working.\r\nThis is an assembly line, and the next corpse is already on the conveyor belt.",
    ["卡拉彭的狙击手：果然有漏网之鱼，今天谁也别想活着离开！"] = "Carapon's sniper: As expected, there were survivors. No one is leaving here alive today!",
    ["卡拉彭：代价？哈哈哈！"] = "Kalapon: Pay? Hahaha!",
    ["卡拉彭：作为代价，让你死得痛苦些吧。"] = "Kalapon: As the price, let me make your death more painful.",
    ["卡拉彭：你太弱了，救不了任何人。"] = "Kalapon: You are too weak to save anyone.",
    ["卡拉彭：去地狱告诉你的邻居们，这是整顿市容的，必要牺牲。"] = "Kalapon: Go to hell and tell your neighbors that this is a necessary sacrifice for urban renewal.",
    ["卡拉彭：嘁，原来只是一个序列九的小刺客，浪费我的时间。"] = "Carapon: Tch, turns out it's just a Sequence 9 assassin, a waste of my time.",
    ["卡拉彭：记住，这不是谋杀，这是……整顿市容。现在，跑吧，老鼠们，跑得越快越好——反正你们也跑不出我的手掌心。"] = "Kalapon: Remember, this isn't murder, this is... urban renewal. Now, run, rats, run as fast as you can—you won't escape my grasp anyway.",
    ["卡拉彭：铁十字街的渣滓们——你们这些耗子占了太久的窝，是时候清场了！"] = "Carapon: Scum of Iron Cross Street—you rats have occupied the nest for too long, it's time to clear the place!",
