    ["卡萝队长牺牲后，小阿诺德被两位虔诚的黑夜信徒收养。"] = "After Captain Karro sacrificed herself, little Arnold was adopted by two devout believers of the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["卡萝队长，如果你想与邓恩说话，我可以尝试一些办法。例如……让他感知到你的意识？"] = "Captain Cara, if you want to talk to Dunn, I can try some methods. For example... letting him perceive your consciousness?",
    ["卡萝队长，需不需要附身在我身上再与阿诺德再见一面，你还有很多话想对他说吧。"] = "Captain Caryl, do you need to possess me to see Arnold one more time? You must have a lot more you want to say to him.",
    ["卡萝队长，黑夜教会派遣我来，本来就是做了这样的打算。"] = "Captain Carol, the Church of the Evernight dispatched me with that intention in mind from the start.",
