    ["卡门全身"] = "Carmen full body",
    ["卡门恍然大悟，下一秒便从墙的另一面被“吐”了出来。"] = "Carmen suddenly realizes, and the next second he is \"spat\" out from the other side of the wall.",
    ["卡门把宝箱塞给你，火速离开了，背影充满了窘迫。"] = "Carmen shoves the treasure chest to you and leaves in a hurry, his back full of embarrassment.",
    ["卡门的下半身在他的惊叫中一闪而逝……"] = "Carmen's lower body flashes and vanishes amidst his screams...",
    ["卡门被“噗”地一声推了出来，一屁股坐在地上，浑身是灰。"] = "Carmen was pushed out with a \"pop\" sound, landing on his bottom on the ground, covered in dust.",
    ["卡门身形一闪，像褪色的影子般从墙里渗了出来。"] = "Carmen's figure flickers, seeping out from the wall like a faded shadow.",
    ["卡门（全身）"] = "Carmen (Full Body)",
    ["卡门（半身）"] = "Carmen (Half-body)",
    ["卡门，你试过带着活物穿墙吗？"] = "Carmen, have you tried walking through a wall while carrying a living creature?",
    ["卡门，其实我对你是有一些失望的，当初把你从墙里拔出来，是希望你能拼一把，快速成长起来……"] = "Carmen, actually I am a little disappointed in you. When I pulled you out of the wall, it was because I hoped you could give it your all and grow up quickly...",
    ["卡门，火车轨道上发“戏法大师”的晋升材料了！"] = "Carmen, the advancement materials for \"Trickmaster\" are on the train tracks!",
    ["卡门，这是第三次了，你还不能自己出来吗？"] = "Carmen, this is the third time. Can't you come out on your own yet?",
