    ["危机解除！感谢您！您真是个通情达理的大人！"] = "Crisis averted! Thank you! You really are a reasonable adult!",
    ["危险"] = "Dangerous",
    ["危险已经基本排除了，只是有人来过这里，我担心他们有可能将污染带了出去，所以目前暂时又重新封锁了这里，防止受影响的范围扩大。"] = "The danger has been basically eliminated, but someone has been here. I am worried that they might have brought the corruption out, so we have temporarily sealed this place again to prevent the scope of the influence from expanding.",
    ["危险感知"] = "Danger Perception",
    ["危险的冒险家"] = "Dangerous Adventurer",
    ["危险的地下拍卖行"] = "Dangerous underground auction house",
    ["危险的源头"] = "The source of danger.",
    ["危险等级"] = "Danger Level",
    ["危险等级1"] = "Danger Level 1",
    ["危险等级2"] = "Danger Level 2",
    ["危险等级2及以上"] = "Danger Level 2 and above",
    ["危险等级3"] = "Danger Level 3",
    ["危险等级3及以上"] = "Danger Level 3 and above",
    ["危险级"] = "Danger Level",
    ["危险阅读"] = "Dangerous Reading",
    ["危险预警"] = "Danger Warning",
    ["危险！"] = "Danger!",
    ["危险，到我身后来！"] = "It's dangerous, get behind me!",
    ["即buff表的buff id。该参数填写后，会免疫所有该buff id 的buff。"] = "The buff ID in the buff table. After filling in this parameter, it will be immune to all buffs with this buff ID.",
    ["即使……要经历冬天？"] = "Even if... we have to go through winter?",
    ["即使你也还是个孩子……"] = "Even if you are still just a child...",
    ["即使只是某个神秘封印物的仿品，也不要随便许愿哦？"] = "Even if it is just a replica of some mysterious Sealed Artifact, don't make wishes casually, okay?",
    ["即使只是站在远处，我也觉得周围的空气变得温暖了。"] = "Even just standing at a distance, I feel the surrounding air grow warm.",
    ["即使只是笑容的余光，也足够让我回味一整天。"] = "Even just a glimpse of your smile is enough for me to savor for the entire day.",
    ["即使后来开始回想故乡，但我至少有妻子、女儿、还有两个儿子。在这里也有许多牵挂和归属感。"] = "Even though I started to think about my hometown later, at least I had a wife, a daughter, and two sons. I also had many attachments and a sense of belonging here.",
    ["即使奥黛丽已经接受苏茜成为非凡动物的事实，但当她又一次看见金毛大狗蹲在阴影里观察人群的画面时，还是忍不住叹了口气。\n“苏茜，你这样不对，观众要在自己的位置上光明正大地观看。”奥黛丽对苏茜传授着自己的经验。\n苏茜摇了摇尾巴，张嘴辩解：“我不知道该怎么解释，毕竟我只是一条狗。”"] = "Even though Audrey has accepted the fact that Susie is an Extraordinary animal, she still couldn't help but sigh when she saw the golden retriever squatting in the shadows observing the crowd again. \n \"Susie, this is not right; a Spectator should observe openly from their own position,\" Audrey said, imparting her experience to Susie. \n Susie wagged her tail and opened her mouth to defend herself: \"I don't know how to explain it; after all, I am just a dog.\"",
    ["即使如此……你还是欺骗了我。"] = "Even so... you still deceived me.",
    ["即使我是因蒂斯人，也不得不承认鲁恩王国的强大。"] = "Even though I am an Intis person, I have to admit the strength of the Loen Kingdom.",
    ["即使没有这些传闻，下街也够糟糕了。偷盗抢劫，打架斗殴，一天都不得安宁。"] = "Even without these rumors, Lower Street is bad enough. Theft, robbery, fighting—not a moment of peace.",
    ["即使渺小如我，也留下了完整的作品……我从未后悔过……"] = "Even as insignificant as I am, I left behind a complete work... I have never regretted it...",
    ["即使爸爸妈妈不在，我也可以照顾好客人呀。"] = "Even if Mom and Dad aren't here, I can take good care of the guests.",
    ["即使要付出可怕的代价……"] = "Even if it means paying a terrible price...",
    ["即使身为政府官员，也会有深入坊间的时候，偶遇我不奇怪。"] = "Even as a government official, there are times to go deep into the streets, so it's not strange to run into me.",
    ["即使身处最深的黑暗，你依旧选择照亮他人的前路。"] = "Even in the deepest darkness, you still choose to light the way for others.",
    ["即使身居果壳之中，仍然自以为无限空间之王。"] = "Even if I live in a nutshell, I still consider myself the king of infinite space.",
    ["即便在命运的巨变到来之际，也别忘记嘴角上扬，嘲弄于它。"] = "Even when the great changes of fate arrive, don't forget to raise the corners of your mouth and mock it.",
    ["即便如此，上层的非凡者也不会让你继续调查下去 。"] = "Even so, the Beyonders in the upper echelons won't let you continue your investigation.",
    ["即便我们都老去了，那些约定依旧会以其他形式延续下去。 "] = "Even if we all grow old, those promises will continue in other forms.",
    ["即便早已深陷于血泊之中，披上它，你所行之事，一切都是为了主。"] = "Even if you are already deep in a pool of blood, by putting it on, everything you do is for the Lord.",
    ["即便是搬到了更富有的北区别墅，夫人还是会经常回来。"] = "Even after moving to the wealthier North Borough villas, the lady still comes back often.",
    ["即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白蕾丝的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "Even as an accidental visitor, please follow the dress code. Put on the playful blue-white lace dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝黑菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "Even as an accidental visitor, please follow the dress code. Put on the playful blue-black checkered dress and join the bizarre and wonderful tea party.",
    ["即便虚拟人格死去，也不会导致本体的陨落。"] = "Even if the virtual personality dies, it will not lead to the fall of the main body.",
    ["即便跪地匍匐，我也愿做您脚下的一粒沙！"] = "Even if I have to crawl on the ground, I am willing to be a grain of sand beneath your feet!",
    ["即便陷入黑暗，也要守望晨光的希望。"] = "Even when plunged into darkness, one must watch for the hope of the morning light.",
    ["即兴小调"] = "Improvised Tune",
    ["即刻获得18金币，并且每回合额外获得1金币。"] = "Gain 18 Gold Coins immediately and 1 additional Gold Coin per round.",
    ["即刻获得7金币，并且每回合额外获得1金币。"] = "Gain 7 Gold Coins immediately and 1 additional Gold Coin per round.",
    ["即将传送到下一关。"] = "Teleporting to the next stage.",
    ["即将传送回俱乐部场景领取分红，是否继续？"] = "You are about to teleport back to the Club scene to collect dividends. Do you want to continue?",
    ["即将在当前轮次召唤超过<Highlight>7</>名投影，是否继续（建议召唤投影数量在<Highlight>6</>名以下）？"] = "You are about to summon more than <Highlight> 7 </> projections in the current round. Do you want to continue? (It is recommended to summon fewer than <Highlight> 6 </> projections.)",
