    ["厌世冷淡"] = "Misanthropic and Cold",
    ["厌恶"] = "Disgusted",
    ["厕所"] = "Restroom",
    ["厕所2"] = "Restroom 2",
    ["厕所也许是一个不错的餐饮场所......"] = "A restroom might be a decent place for a meal...",
    ["厕所也许是一个不错的餐饮场所……"] = "A toilet might be a good place for dining...",
    ["厕所总是比餐厅受欢迎"] = "The restroom is always more popular than the restaurant",
    ["厕所门"] = "Restroom Door",
    ["厚切谷饲牛排|现磨黑胡椒粒|甄选白兰地|迷迭香"] = "Thick-Cut Grain-Fed Steak | Freshly Ground Black Pepper | Selected Brandy | Rosemary",
    ["厚厚一沓钞票"] = "A thick stack of banknotes",
    ["厚实的历史系专著，大部分是漂亮的精装版。"] = "Thick history monographs, most of them are beautiful hardcover editions.",
    ["厚度"] = "Thickness",
    ["厚重的金边方框眼镜，让人联想起大学图书馆严肃而规矩的档案管理员。"] = "Thick, gold-rimmed square glasses, reminiscent of a serious and orderly archivist in a university library.",
    ["厚重的雪常年笼罩着霍纳奇斯山脉，这里是一片没有四季的禁地。"] = "Heavy snow covers the Hornacis Mountain Range all year round; this is a forbidden land without seasons.",
    ["原BuffID"] = "Original Buff ID",
    ["原产自迪西海湾的咖啡，阿曼达女士佩服你将它作为睡前饮品的勇气。"] = "Coffee originating from the Bay of Disi, Ms. Amanda admires your courage to use it as a bedtime drink.",
    ["原作"] = "Original work",
    ["原作者: %s"] = "Original Author: %s",
    ["原创研究，保真保管用，室内二楼有售。"] = "Original research, guaranteed authentic and effective, for sale on the second floor indoors.",
    ["原创魔药，童叟无欺。"] = "Original potion, honest and reliable.",
    ["原初之仪"] = "Primal Ritual",
    ["原初魔女"] = "Primordial Demoness",
    ["原初魔女神像"] = "Statue of the Primordial Demoness",
    ["原初魔女魔药"] = "Primordial Demoness Potion",
    ["原因……有些复杂，在她心里，我一直都是夺走了她未来的那个人吧。"] = "The reason... is somewhat complicated. In her heart, I have always been the one who took away her future.",
    ["原地单人舞"] = "Stationary Solo Dance",
    ["原地双人舞"] = "Stationary Duo Dance",
    ["原地坐下"] = "Sit down on the spot",
    ["原地复活"] = "Resurrect in Place",
    ["原地复苏"] = "Resuscitate in Place",
    ["原地头疼"] = "Stationary Headache",
    ["原地头疼结束"] = "Stationary Headache End",
    ["原地群舞"] = "Stationary Group Dance",
    ["原地蓄力，对目标进行一次冲撞，冲撞后会跃起用大盾砸地，发出震荡波\n造成一次冲撞伤害，跃起前有预警，造成一次圆形范围伤害"] = "Charge in place to perform a dash against the target, then leap up to smash the ground with the great shield, emitting a shockwave.\n Deals dash damage; there is a warning before the leap, dealing circular area damage.",
    ["原地踏步"] = "Treading water",
    ["原地踏步文字板提示"] = "Treading Water Text Board Prompt",
    ["原型脚踏车"] = "Prototype Bicycle",
    ["原始"] = "Original",
    ["原始切片帧数"] = "Original slice frame count",
    ["原始嚎叫"] = "Primal Howl",
    ["原始数据类型"] = "Original data type",
    ["原始月亮"] = "Primordial Moon",
    ["原始月亮在月华庇护中不受伤害。"] = "The Primordial Moon is immune to damage while under the protection of moonlight.",
    ["原始爆发"] = "Primal Burst",
    ["原始的杀戮欲望，凝固在角质里。"] = "Primitive desire to kill, solidified in the keratin.",
    ["原始蛮力，凝固在骨骼里。"] = "Primitive brute force, solidified in the bones.",
    ["原始镜面"] = "Original Mirror Surface",
    ["原小龙战斗逻辑，已废弃"] = "Original Little Dragon combat logic, deprecated",
    ["原廷根市值夜者小队队员，是阿霍瓦郡最有名的通灵者，因自行总结出扮演法导致晋升极快而被圣堂注意，后调往贝克兰德。她与邓恩队长的关系似乎非同一般。"] = "A former member of the Tingen Nighthawks squad and the most famous Spirit Medium in Awwa County. Because she summarized the Acting Method herself, her advancement was extremely fast, which drew the attention of the Holy Cathedral. She was later transferred to Backlund. Her relationship with Captain Dunn seems to be quite unusual.",
    ["原技能ID"] = "Original skill ID.",
    ["原技能是否卸载"] = "Whether the original skill is uninstalled.",
    ["原文"] = "Original Text",
    ["原方案"] = "Original Plan",
    ["原木"] = "Raw Wood",
    ["原木构建的柱体，朴实的形制很是自然。"] = "A column body built from raw wood, with a plain design that is very natural.",
    ["原本是一个叫缇苏的女人的，她神秘失踪了，然后这家店莫名其妙就归了奈拉。"] = "It originally belonged to a woman named Tisu, but she disappeared mysteriously, and then the shop inexplicably ended up with Naila.",
    ["原来……"] = "So...",
    ["原来……他只是脱胎于痛苦的，一场幻梦……"] = "So... he was just a phantom dream born from pain...",
    ["原来……我也是猎物……"] = "So... I am also prey...",
    ["原来不是霍金斯教士呀……"] = "Oh, so it's not Father Hawkins...",
    ["原来事情竟然是这样……谢谢你，让我的母亲离开了囚笼——失败的婚姻和对外祖父的怀念都将她牢牢禁锢，现在她终于自由了。"] = "So that's how it was... Thank you for letting my mother leave her cage—a failed marriage and her longing for my grandfather had kept her tightly imprisoned, but now she is finally free.",
    ["原来他们不只是乞丐，还是逃出工厂的童工……他们会被打死的，不行，得去拦一下！"] = "So they aren't just beggars, they are child laborers who escaped from the Factory... They will be beaten to death. No, I have to go stop them!",
    ["原来你也上过战场。"] = "So you have been on the battlefield too.",
    ["原来你已经处理完这些“过分的要求”了。"] = "So you've already handled these 'excessive requests.'",
    ["原来你很早以前就认识他……为什么不告诉他？"] = "So you've known him for a long time... Why didn't you tell him?",
    ["原来你知道啊。"] = "So you do know.",
    ["原来你知道她在做什么。"] = "So you know what she's doing.",
    ["原来佩戴这条领带也会影响自我认知，我甚至感觉自己已经变成了侠盗黑皇帝。"] = "So wearing this tie also affects one's self-perception. I even feel like I've become the Phantom Thief Black Emperor.",
    ["原来大帝设计斯蒂姆宫，是为了登月……"] = "So the Emperor designed the Steam Palace to land on the moon...",
    ["原来奈拉小姐也有这样难以忘怀的人吗？我以为在她的眼里，所有人都像店里那些每天送来大把玫瑰的绅士和伯爵们，连让她多看一眼的资格都没有。"] = "So Miss Naila also has someone she can't forget? I thought in her eyes, everyone was like those gentlemen and counts who send her armfuls of roses every day, not even qualified for her to look at twice.",
    ["原来女孩的哥哥也是月亮仆从的成员，他的代号是“蒲公英”先生。"] = "So the girl's brother is also a member of the Moon Servant, and his code name is Mr. Dandelion.",
    ["原来如此"] = "I see",
    ["原来如此……"] = "So that's how it is...",
    ["原来如此……他们还希望拍一张您和这个木雕的合影，那孩子特别想看到您收到它时的样子。"] = "I see... They also hoped to take a photo of you with this wood carving; the child especially wanted to see your reaction when you received it.",
    ["原来如此……您弹得怎么样？"] = "I see... how well do you play?",
    ["原来如此……祝贺你能拥有新生活！"] = "I see... Congratulations on your new life!",
    ["原来如此……非凡特性和相关的神奇物品……看来，这应该是一张销售记录。"] = "So that's it... Beyonder characteristics and related mystical items... It seems this must be a sales record.",
    ["原来如此。"] = "I see.",
    ["原来如此。<P_Heart>（不知道我的职业病是不是看到什么可疑的人都想聊聊天呢……）</>"] = "I see. <P_Heart> (I wonder if my occupational disease is wanting to chat with anyone I see who looks suspicious...) </>",
    ["原来如此，不过……那种冷雨浸透白鸢尾的调子，哪怕是鲁恩王室用的香水也比不上！"] = "I see, but... that scent of cold rain soaking white irises is something even the perfume used by the Loen royal family can't compare to!",
    ["原来如此，矫健而有力的动作下，还隐藏了利爪，这就是——形意猫猫拳！"] = "I see, hidden beneath those agile and powerful movements are sharp claws. This is... the Xingyi Cat Fist!",
    ["原来如此，矫健而有力的动作下，还隐藏了利爪，这就是——猫猫大摆拳！"] = "I see, hidden beneath the agile and powerful movements are sharp claws; this is—the Cat's Great Swing!",
    ["原来如此，确实是警察先生。说到可疑……刚刚我似乎听到有尖叫从那边传来。"] = "I see. You really are a police officer. Speaking of suspicious... I think I just heard a scream coming from over there.",
    ["原来如此，赶快把<P_Yellow>真相记在剧本</>上。"] = "I see. Quickly, record the <P_Yellow>truth</> in the script.",
    ["原来如此，那今天有进展了吗？"] = "I see. Have you made any progress today?",
    ["原来如此，那您正看的这匹布料就很合适呀。"] = "I see, then the fabric you are looking at is very suitable.",
    ["原来就是你"] = "So it was you.",
    ["原来就是你，敢和猎龙帮作对的家伙。"] = "So it was you, the guy who dares to go against the Dragon Hunter Gang.",
    ["原来左右两端的椅子需要形成对称，这样才能恢复一定的秩序。"] = "So the chairs on the left and right ends need to form a symmetry to restore a certain order.",
    ["原来您要去贝克兰德旅行，那的确应该坐这艘船去，毕竟它的名字是“万都之都”号。"] = "Ah, so you are traveling to Backlund. In that case, you really should take this ship; after all, its name is the \"City of Cities\".",
    ["原来您醒来时收到的信，是克莱恩先生寄给您的！"] = "So the letter you received when you woke up was sent to you by Mr. Klein!",
    ["原来我是救世主"] = "So I Am the Savior",
    ["原来是一只猫……"] = "So it was a cat...",
    ["原来是个孩子。安全起见，还是用灵视观察一下吧。"] = "Turns out it's a child. For safety's sake, I'd better observe him with spirit vision.",
    ["原来是个玩具摊吗？"] = "So it's a toy stall?",
    ["原来是临期面包，还是原价买些更新鲜的吧。"] = "So it's nearly expired. I should buy fresher bread at the regular price.",
    ["原来是任务……需要帮忙吗？"] = "So it was a quest... Do you need any help?",
    ["原来是你……安眠吧，安德鲁。"] = "So it was you... Rest in peace, Andrew.",
    ["原来是在卖画……不用了谢谢。"] = "So you're selling paintings... No thanks.",
    ["原来是警官！配合您的工作是我的义务！"] = "Oh, so you're a police officer! It is my duty to cooperate with your work!",
    ["原来是这样……"] = "So that's how it is...",
    ["原来是这样……你也有自己的苦衷。请放心吧。"] = "So that's how it is... you have your own difficulties too. Please rest assured.",
    ["原来是这样……你这是在嘲笑我吗？"] = "So that's how it is... Are you mocking me?",
    ["原来是这样……安提哥努斯家族……"] = "So that's how it is... the Antigonus family...",
    ["原来是这样……我明白了！"] = "So that's how it is... I understand!",
    ["原来是这样……赞美女神，或许是女神注视着祂虔诚的信徒，在迷雾中引导了你。"] = "So that's how it is... Praise the Goddess. Perhaps the Goddess was watching over her devout believer and guided you in the fog.",
    ["原来是这样…将椅子按照一定的规律摆放似乎就能让封印物恢复了!"] = "So that's how it is... arranging the chairs according to a certain pattern seems to be able to restore the Sealed Artifact!",
    ["原来是这样啊……那我也拿一束吧。"] = "So that's it... Then I'll take a bouquet too.",
    ["原来是这样解决的吗？"] = "So that's how it was solved?",
    ["原来是这样，但你已经……嗯，我是说你早应该考虑婚姻和家庭了。虽然警察的工作忙碌又危险，但会有很多姑娘喜欢你这样温柔又可靠的绅士。"] = "So that's how it is. But you have already... well, I mean you should have considered marriage and a family long ago. Although police work is busy and dangerous, there are many girls who would like a gentle and reliable gentleman like you.",
    ["原来是这样，蜡烛不点燃就不会损耗，所以他们念祷的是“不毁的身躯”。"] = "So that's it. The candle won't be consumed if it's not lit, so they chant \"indestructible body\".",
    ["原来是这样，警官，请随我来。"] = "I see. Officer, please follow me.",
    ["原来是这样，那——"] = "So that's how it is, then—",
    ["原来是这样，那我们后援会定期有活动，您可以带女儿一起来啊！"] = "So that's it, our fan club has regular events, you can bring your daughter along!",
    ["原来是追稿的。"] = "So you're a manuscript chaser.",
    ["原来的场景布置"] = "Original Scene Layout",
    ["原来神明除了宠爱的植物，连金属都有所偏爱……"] = "So besides the plants they favor, the gods even have preferences for metals...",
    ["原来秩序大剑插入混乱的荆丛，正是“唯有秩序与混乱相交之时”……"] = "So, the Greatsword of Order being inserted into the thorny thicket of chaos is exactly what 'only when order and chaos intersect' means...",
    ["原来老爷那么不容易，他还要抵押商铺来给我们发工资。要不……盒饭的事情算了吧。"] = "So the master has it so hard; he even has to mortgage the shop to pay our wages. Maybe... let's forget about the boxed lunches.",
    ["原来落在那里了！多谢你。"] = "So that's where it fell! Thank you so much.",
    ["原来被你捡到了！多谢。"] = "So you found it! Thank you.",
    ["原来这个方向是老维尔餐厅的后门啊！我才发现。"] = "So this direction is the back door of Old Will's Restaurant! I just realized.",
    ["原来这里就是秩序之网的力量源头。切断它，或许可以取回大剑了。"] = "So this is the source of the Web of Order's power. Cutting it off might allow me to retrieve the great sword.",
    ["原来邓恩接了队长这个烂摊子，那我就放心了！"] = "So Dunn took over this mess of a captaincy, then I can rest easy!",
    ["原来那个叫奇异果……等等，你是谁？为什么会出现在这里？"] = "So that thing was called a strange fruit... Wait, who are you? Why are you here?",
    ["原来量尺寸要这么久吗？"] = "Does it really take this long to take measurements?",
    ["原来顾客是用来帮你消耗啤酒份额的啊！"] = "So customers are just here to help you consume your beer quota!",
    ["原来，\r\n你也有狂野的一面"] = "So, you have a wild side too",
    ["原来，那个“∞”代表无休无止的<P_Yellow>循环</>……"] = "So, that \"∞\" represents an endless <P_Yellow> cycle </>...",
    ["原比例"] = "Original Ratio",
    ["原点"] = "Origin Point",
    ["原理很简单，就是把动能通过齿轮传递，控制节奏让一跳一走的动作有规律。"] = "The principle is simple; it's just transmitting kinetic energy through gears to control the rhythm so the hopping and walking movements are regular.",
    ["原生"] = "Native",
    ["原神"] = "Original God",
    ["原籍：东拜朗\n信仰：疑似有东拜朗死神信仰\n人际关系：无亲属在鲁恩\n目前状态：根据占卜结果，已死亡。\n备注：乔治疑似逃逸拜朗奴隶，为在鲁恩获得伪造身份，欠下八十镑高利贷。在还款日前两天失踪。"] = "Origin: East Balam\nFaith: Suspected East Balam Death God faith\nInterpersonal relationships: No relatives in Loen\nCurrent status: According to the divination result, already dead.\nNote: George is suspected to be an escaped Balam slave who owed eighty pounds in usury to obtain a fake identity in Loen. Went missing two days before the repayment date.",
    ["原籍：廷根本地\n亲属：妻子艾琳，一女二子\n目前状态：根据占卜结果，尚未死亡。\n备注：被目击登上了前往拉姆德古堡的火车。"] = "Origin: Tingen local\nRelatives: Wife Eileen, one daughter, two sons\nCurrent status: According to the divination result, not yet dead.\nNote: Witnessed boarding a train to Lamud Castle.",
    ["原籍：廷根本地\n信仰：黑夜女神\n人际关系：独女艾薇（十三岁，火柴厂工人）\n目前状态：根据占卜结果，已死亡。\n备注：死前因伤病被工厂辞退，无力支付房租，父女已被房东勒令三日内搬离。女儿艾薇在父亲失踪后，目前由教会救济收容。"] = "Origin: Tingen local\nFaith: Evernight Goddess\nInterpersonal relationships: Only daughter Ivy (thirteen years old, match factory worker)\nCurrent status: According to the divination result, already dead.\nNote: Before his death, he was dismissed by the factory due to injury and illness and was unable to pay rent; the landlord had ordered the father and daughter to move out within three days. Daughter Ivy is currently being sheltered by the church relief after her father went missing.",
