    ["原著剧情持续更新中，关注\"诡秘之主游戏\"官方公众号，第一时间了解更新信息；绑定角色，领专属时装！"] = "The original story plot is continuously updating. Follow the official \"Lord of Mysteries Game\" WeChat account to get the latest update information first; bind your character to receive exclusive outfits!",
