    ["原著线·第七章·三兄妹赴宴1占位"] = "Original Work Arc · Chapter 7 · Three Siblings Attend Banquet 1 Placeholder",
    ["原著线·第七章·安洁莉卡介绍"] = "Original Work Arc · Chapter 7 · Angelica Introduction",
