    ["原著线第七章开头金币"] = "Gold coin at the beginning of Chapter 7 of the original work",
    ["原著线第三章"] = "Original Work Line Chapter 3",
    ["原著里那位夫人最后跳了河，剧本改成大团圆，还把三段铺垫全删了。没了那三段，前面所有的挣扎都站不住脚。"] = "In the original work, that lady jumped into the river at the end, but the script was changed to a happy ending, and all three segments of foreshadowing were deleted. Without those three segments, all the previous struggles don't hold up.",
    ["原装备拥有稀有词条，替换后将被覆盖消失，是否仍确认用新的结果替换原有？"] = "The original Equipment has a rare affix, which will be overwritten and Disappear upon replacement. Still confirm replacing with the new result?",
    ["原谅我急于动身，无法陪同您前往。所幸还有一位管家偶尔打理，只要把契约书给他，自然能证明您的所有者身份。"] = "Forgive me for being in a hurry to leave and unable to accompany you. Fortunately, there is a butler who occasionally takes care of things. As long as you give the contract to him, it will naturally prove your identity as the owner.",
    ["原谅我的不辞而别。\n今晚的吻已经让我失去了所有理智，\n如果继续待下去，我怕自己会做出更疯狂的事。\n但这样的相会太过草率，您值得更好的。\n三天后，午夜时分，郊外睡莲盛开的池塘边。\n届时，我会准备好一切……等您来品尝完整的我。"] = "Forgive me for leaving without saying goodbye. \nTonight's kiss has already made me lose all my reason, \nif I stay any longer, I fear I might do something even crazier. \nBut such a meeting was too hasty; you deserve better. \nThree days from now, at midnight, by the pond where the water lilies bloom in the suburbs. \nBy then, I will have everything ready... waiting for you to taste the complete me.",
    ["原谅我的失礼……请先进屋。"] = "Forgive my rudeness... please enter the room first.",
    ["原谅我的愚蠢和贪婪，再给我一次机会，我一定控制住那该死的好奇心。"] = "Forgive my stupidity and greed, give me one more chance, I will definitely control that damn curiosity.",
    ["原谅我的愚蠢和贪婪，再给我一次机会，我绝对不会从那个怪人的尸体上昧下那颗宝石！"] = "Forgive my stupidity and greed, give me another chance, I will never again steal that gemstone from that freak's corpse!",
