    ["去吧，把这里照亮一些，"] = "Go on, brighten this place up a little,",
    ["去吧，新家和退租的事都处理好了。今天我和梅丽莎会把东西全都搬到新家去。"] = "Go ahead, the new home and the lease termination are all handled. Melissa and I will move everything to the new place today.",
