    ["去对应的地点看看吧。"] = "Let's go check the corresponding locations.",
    ["去寻找呼救声的源头"] = "Go find the source of the cries for help",
    ["去小阿诺德家拜访一下吧，很久没去看望他了。"] = "Let's go visit little Arnold; it's been a long time since I checked on him.",
    ["去屏障碎片附近"] = "Go near the barrier fragment",
    ["去工厂区卖报，工人也需要了解新闻，跟上时代。"] = "Go to the factory district to sell newspapers; workers also need to understand the news and keep up with the times.",
    ["去帮我拿起那本安提哥努斯家族的笔记。"] = "Go help me pick up that Antigonus Family notebook.",
    ["去幕后转转"] = "Go backstage",
    ["去年我在那里度假时，每天醒来窗外都是不同的海岛。<P_Heart>（微笑）</>唯一的麻烦是——有次巨龟和它的女朋友私奔了，我们漂流了三天。"] = "When I vacationed there last year, I woke up to a different island outside my window every day. <P_Heart>(Smiles)</> The only trouble is—once the giant turtle eloped with its girlfriend, and we drifted for three days.",
    ["去年我给发烧患者配好的药剂里，被药剂科主任往里掺水——就为省下钱给他情妇买貂皮大衣。"] = "Last year, the head of the pharmacy department watered down the medicine I had prepared for fever patients—just to save money to buy his mistress a mink coat.",
    ["去年有人用金色火漆寄催债信，收信人以为发现了古代宝藏地图，带着挖掘工具去了约定地点。 "] = "Last year, someone sent a debt collection letter with a gold wax seal. The recipient thought they had discovered an ancient treasure map and went to the agreed location with digging tools.",
    ["去廷根"] = "Go to Tingen",
    ["去廷根的黑夜大教堂，祂的教宗——阿里安娜，在等你。"] = "Go to the Saint Selena Cathedral in Tingen; Her Pope, Arianna, is waiting for you.",
    ["去恶龙酒吧看看吧……"] = "Let's go take a look at the Evil Dragon Bar...",
    ["去打开那扇门吧 我想看一看外面的阳光是什么样子……"] = "Go and open that door. I want to see what the sunlight outside looks like...",
    ["去打扫<h>队长办公室</>"] = "Go clean the <h>Captain's Office</>",
    ["去打扫队长办公室"] = "Go clean the Captain's Office.",
    ["去找<P_Yellow>警官证</>吧，还有给你的惊喜！我们下次再见！"] = "Go find the <P_Yellow> police badge </>, and there's a surprise for you! See you next time!",
    ["去找<h>中央广场</>吧"] = "Go to <h>Central Plaza</>",
