    ["去旁边的街道看看"] = "Go check the street nearby",
    ["去更加僻静的地方，寻找道格的墓碑。"] = "Go to a more secluded place and look for Doug's tombstone.",
    ["去来山色"] = "Qu Lai Shan Se",
    ["去染色"] = "Go to Dye",
    ["去案发现场，韦尔奇先生的住所。“专家”在那里等着我们。"] = "Go to the crime scene, Mr. Welch's residence. The \"expert\" is waiting for us there.",
    ["去桥对岸寻找声音的来源"] = "Go to the other side of the bridge to find the source of the sound",
    ["去海上？太好啦！我要告诉玛里琳这个好消息！"] = "Go to the sea? That's great! I want to tell Marilyn this good news!",
    ["去湖心亭坐坐，在广阔的天地间也会让人的心情变得开阔。相信我，那儿会让你忘掉一切烦恼。"] = "Go sit in the lakeside pavilion; the vast expanse will broaden your mind. Trust me, it will make you forget all your troubles.",
    ["去烟囱口"] = "Go to the chimney opening",
    ["去猎龙酒吧看看吧……"] = "Let's go check out the Hunting Dragon Bar...",
    ["去相亲。阿德莱德先生去世后，我们一直作为家人在她身边，也会考察一下相亲对象。"] = "To go on a blind date. After Mr. Adelaide passed away, we have always been by her side as family, and we also vet her blind date candidates.",
    ["去看抓老鼠？我觉得那条新狗不错……"] = "Go watch rat catching? I think that new dog is pretty good...",
