    ["参与主宰争锋%d/50场。"] = "Participate in Dominator's Clash %d/50 times.",
    ["参与主宰争锋对局失败时，将自动消耗该道具，使得本次失败<Highlight>不会扣除胜点</>。\n<Highlight>该效果仅对“天使之王”以下段位生效</>。"] = "When failing a Dominator's Clash match, this item will be automatically consumed so that this failure <Highlight> will not deduct victory points </>. \n <Highlight> This effect only applies to ranks below \"King of Angels\" </>.",
    ["参与主宰争锋并获得胜利时，自动消耗并使本次获得<Highlight>胜点翻倍</>。"] = "When participating in the Dominator's Clash and winning, it is automatically consumed to double the <Highlight> victory points </> obtained this time.",
    ["参与主宰争锋玩法，并达到天使之王段位。"] = "Participate in the Dominator's Clash challenge and reach the King of Angels rank.",
    ["参与主宰争锋玩法，并达到征服皇帝段位。"] = "Participate in the Dominator's Clash challenge and reach the Conqueror Emperor rank.",
    ["参与主宰争锋玩法，并达到星辰之主段位。"] = "Participate in the Dominator's Clash challenge and reach the Lord of Stars rank.",
    ["参与主宰争锋玩法，并达到血色亲王段位。"] = "Participate in the Dominator's Clash challenge and reach the Bloody Prince rank.",
    ["参与主宰争锋，获得胜利且获得称号时，自动消耗并<Highlight>获得额外胜点</>。"] = "When participating in the Dominator's Clash, winning, and obtaining a title, it is automatically consumed to <Highlight> obtain extra victory points </>.",
    ["参与乌托邦剧院各难度获取舞台余韵，达到一定进度值时获得剧院回馈。舞台余韵每周一8时重置。\n根据完成的剧本难度与扮演进度，获得相应的舞台余韵：\n乌托邦剧院·普通，完成1/2/3/4层分别获得50/100/200/400/舞台余韵。\n乌托邦剧院·困难，完成1/2/3/4/5/6层分别获得75/150/300/600/900/1200舞台余韵。\n乌托邦剧院·噩梦，完成1/2/3/4/5/6层分别获得100/200/400/800/1200/1200舞台余韵。"] = "Participate in Utopia Theater at various difficulties to obtain Stage Resonance. Reach certain progress milestones to receive theater rewards. Stage Resonance resets every Monday at 8:00 AM. \nObtain Stage Resonance based on the completed script difficulty and Acting progress:\nUtopia Theater · Normal: Completing floors 1/2/3/4 grants 50/100/200/400 Stage Resonance respectively.\nUtopia Theater · Hard: Completing floors 1/2/3/4/5/6 grants 75/150/300/600/900/1200 Stage Resonance respectively.\nUtopia Theater · Nightmare: Completing floors 1/2/3/4/5/6 grants 100/200/400/800/1200/1200 Stage Resonance respectively.",
    ["参与乌托邦剧院各难度获取，达到一定进度值时获得奖励，每周重置。"] = "Participate in Utopia Theater at various difficulties to obtain rewards when reaching a certain progress value, resetting weekly.",
