    ["参与各种玩法均可获得，可在报销商店中使用兑换各种奖励。\n\n发票单据周上限10000，最多累积2周，每周一早上八点刷新发票单据获得上限。"] = "Can be obtained by participating in various gameplay modes, can be used in the Reimbursement Shop to redeem various rewards. \n\nThe weekly limit for invoice receipts is 10,000, which can be accumulated for up to 2 weeks. The acquisition limit for invoice receipts refreshes every Monday at 8:00 AM.",
