    ["参与歌剧魅影玩法，获得神话组第4~8名，参赛次数达到俱乐部前五名"] = "Participate in the Phantom of the Opera challenge, win 4th~8th place in the Mythical group, and reach the top five in club participation.",
    ["参与活动可瓜分礼金"] = "Participate in the event to share gift money",
    ["参与活动，获取热度，满%s可领取奖励，每周限领1次"] = "Participate in the event to gain popularity. Reach %s to claim rewards, limited to once per week.",
    ["参与活动，获取热度，满1500可领取奖励，每周限领1次"] = "Participate in the event to gain popularity. Reach 1500 to claim rewards, limited to once per week",
    ["参与猎城战或高原战%d/1次。"] = "Participate in the Hunting City Battle or Plateau Battle %d/1 time.",
    ["参与猎城战或高原战%d/2次。"] = "Participate in the Hunting City Battle or Plateau Battle %d/2 times.",
    ["参与猎城战演兵战场。"] = "Participate in the Hunting City drill battlefield.",
    ["参与猎城战演兵战场，并获得完胜。"] = "Participate in the Hunting City drill battlefield and achieve a complete victory.",
    ["参与玩法累积进度，进度满后可获得秘宝"] = "Participate in gameplay to accumulate progress; once full, you can obtain a Secret Treasure",
    ["参与神座之争%d/100场。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God %d/100 times.",
    ["参与神座之争%d/300场。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God %d/300 times.",
    ["参与神座之争%d/50场。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God %d/50 times.",
    ["参与神座之争对局失败时，将自动消耗该道具，使得本次失败<Highlight>不会扣除胜点</>。\n<Highlight>该效果仅对“天使之王”以下段位生效</>。"] = "When failing a Battle for the Throne of God match, this item will be automatically consumed so that this failure <Highlight> will not deduct victory points </>. \n <Highlight> This effect only applies to ranks below \"King of Angels\" </>.",
    ["参与神座之争并获得胜利时，自动消耗并使本次获得<Highlight>胜点翻倍</>。"] = "When participating in the Battle for the Throne of God and winning, it is automatically consumed to double the <Highlight> victory points </> obtained this time.",
    ["参与神座之争玩法，并达到天使之王段位。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God challenge and reach the King of Angels rank.",
    ["参与神座之争玩法，并达到征服皇帝段位。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God challenge and reach the Conqueror Emperor rank.",
    ["参与神座之争玩法，并达到星辰之主段位。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God challenge and reach the Lord of Stars rank.",
    ["参与神座之争玩法，并达到血色亲王段位。"] = "Participate in the Battle for the Throne of God challenge and reach the Bloody Prince rank.",
    ["参与神座之争，获得胜利且获得称号时，自动消耗并<Highlight>获得额外胜点</>。"] = "When participating in the Battle for the Throne of God, winning, and obtaining a title, it is automatically consumed to <Highlight> obtain extra victory points </>.",
    ["参与竞拍"] = "Participate in Auction",
    ["参与终末猎杀玩法，并达到天使之王段位。"] = "Participate in the Final Hunt challenge and reach the King of Angels rank.",
    ["参与终末猎杀玩法，并达到征服皇帝段位。"] = "Participate in the Final Hunt challenge and reach the Conqueror Emperor rank.",
    ["参与终末猎杀玩法，并达到星辰之主段位。"] = "Participate in the Final Hunt challenge and reach the Lord of Stars rank.",
    ["参与终末猎杀玩法，并达到血色亲王段位。"] = "Participate in the Final Hunt challenge and reach the Bloody Prince rank.",
    ["参与终末猎杀，提交500个猩红遗物"] = "Participate in the Final Hunt and submit 500 Scarlet Relics",
    ["参与趣斗玩法，并达到天使之王段位。"] = "Participate in the Fun Brawl challenge and reach the King of Angels rank.",
    ["参与趣斗玩法，并达到征服皇帝段位。"] = "Participate in the Fun Brawl challenge and reach the Conqueror Emperor rank.",
    ["参与趣斗玩法，并达到星辰之主段位。"] = "Participate in Fun Brawl mode and reach the Lord of Stars rank.",
    ["参与趣斗玩法，并达到血色亲王段位。"] = "Participate in Fun Brawl mode and reach the Blood Prince rank.",
    ["参与跑团前，非凡者必须选择一个教团加入，方可开启跑团之行。\n非凡者可根据个人兴趣自由选择心仪的教团加入。在任意教团等级达到4级前，非凡者可随意更换教团，在教团等级达到4级后，每次切换教团将进入7天的冷却时间。\n选定教团还可以自由调整探秘属性，每维属性最低为8点，最高为16点，共计可将12点属性点分配给4个维度的属性当中，建议按照推荐属性点进行加点，可使后续的探秘更加轻松。"] = "Before participating in a TRPG session, Beyonders must choose a sect to join to begin their journey. \nBeyonders can freely choose their preferred sect based on personal interest. Before any sect reaches level 4, Beyonders can change sects at will. After a sect reaches level 4, each change of sect will trigger a 7-day cooldown.\nAfter selecting a sect, you can also freely adjust your Exploration attributes. Each dimension of attributes has a minimum of 8 points and a maximum of 16 points. A total of 12 attribute points can be allocated among the 4 dimensions. It is recommended to allocate points according to the recommended attributes to make subsequent exploration easier.",
    ["参与跑团前，非凡者必须选择一个教团加入，方可开启跑团之行。\n非凡者可通过参与探秘秩序世界和城市暗面来提升总探索度，并通过跑团天赋提升探秘属性，提升探秘属性后提升投骰玩法的成功率。"] = "Before participating in a tabletop session, a Beyonder must join a cult to begin their journey. \nBeyonders can increase their Total Exploration by participating in Exploring the Orderly World and the City's Dark Side, and improve their exploration attributes through tabletop talents. Increasing exploration attributes improves the success rate of dice-rolling mechanics.",
    ["参与运营活动获取"] = "Obtained by participating in operational events.",
    ["参与风尚沙龙"] = "Participate in Fashion Salon.",
    ["参加一次教团-安魂玩法 "] = "Participate in one Cult-Requiem gameplay",
    ["参加一次教团-魅惑玩法 "] = "Participate in one Faction-Charm gameplay",
    ["参加乱斗"] = "Join the brawl",
    ["参加别墅派对可免费借穿别墅主人的时装，并参与派对互动领取奖励。"] = "Participate in a villa party to borrow the villa owner's outfit for free and participate in party interactions to claim rewards.",
    ["参加各种世界冒险玩法可获得，可在冒险商店中使用。"] = "Can be obtained by participating in various world adventure gameplay modes and used in the Adventure Shop.",
    ["参加各种同行组队玩法均可获得，可在同行商店中使用。"] = "Can be obtained by participating in various companion team gameplay modes and used in the Companion Shop.",
    ["参加各种竞技玩法均可获得，可在凯旋商店中使用。"] = "Can be obtained by participating in various competitive modes and used in the Triumph Shop.",
    ["参加恶龙争霸赛，迎接更美好的明天！"] = "Participate in the Dragon Fighting Championship and welcome a better tomorrow!",
