    ["又一个月，又一个月的出海结束了。"] = "Another month, another month of sailing is over.",
    ["又一封追求者的来信……嗯？这一封我没拆过吗？"] = "Another letter from a suitor... hmm? Haven't I opened this one?",
    ["又一群迷途的羔羊闯进了我的花园。"] = "Another group of lost lambs has wandered into my garden.",
    ["又不抓小偷了？还是先找到那个孩子吧。"] = "Giving up on catching the thief? Let's find that child first.",
    ["又不是我过生日，我认为钱还是最好存起来，或者先给班森准备一套。"] = "It's not my birthday. I think it's better to save the money, or prepare a set for Benson first.",
    ["又不是要参加舞会，素一点才合适嘛。"] = "It's not like I'm attending a Ball, something plain is more appropriate.",
    ["又临时有事？！多少次了，我要和你分手！"] = "Something came up again?! How many times has this been, I want to break up with you!",
    ["又做了个长长的梦，但不再是噩梦了。\n梦里好像见到了一位多年未见的朋友，\n你们一起聊了很久……"] = "You had another long dream, but it was no longer a nightmare.\n In the dream, you seemed to see a friend you hadn't met for many years,\n and you chatted together for a long time...",
    ["又偷偷学习。哼，世界上怎么会有你这样阴险的人？"] = "Studying in secret again. Hmph, how can there be such a devious person like you in the world?",
    ["又偷偷学习！说好了今天一起去休息室玩桌游的。"] = "Studying in secret again! We agreed to go to the lounge to play board games today.",
    ["又冒出许多文字"] = "Many more words pop up",
    ["又出现了……<P_Heart>（猛地摇头）</>一定是错觉，可这个月已经第三次了……"] = "It's happening again... <P_Heart>(shakes head violently)</> It must be an illusion, but this is the third time this month...",
    ["又出现了……这些字……"] = "It appeared again... these words...",
    ["又出现？"] = "Appear again?",
    ["又和之前一样……但幸好没事"] = "It's the same as before... but thankfully I'm okay.",
    ["又哭又哭，婚礼的时候你也要哭成这样吗？"] = "Crying again? Are you going to cry like this at our wedding too?",
    ["又回到了噩梦？"] = "Back in a nightmare again?",
    ["又回到了混乱之地……不过这里似乎位于池塘的上方，两个世界是互相黏连的？好神奇……"] = "Back in the Land of Chaos again... but this place seems to be above the pond. Are the two worlds connected? How amazing...",
    ["又回到了这里，中央广场，就逛到这里吧。"] = "Back here again, at the Central Square. I think that's enough wandering for now.",
    ["又回到这个房间了……导致黛丝死亡的法阵并不是邪恶仪式……"] = "Back in this room again... The ritual circle that caused Daisy's death wasn't an evil ritual...",
    ["又回来了？看来你还没尽兴。"] = "Back again? It seems you haven't had your fill yet.",
    ["又在斗邪恶？你们完全不工作吗？"] = "Fighting evil again? Do you guys not work at all?",
    ["又想我答应他吗？让我想想……"] = "Do you want me to agree to him again? Let me think...",
    ["又或者，您待会儿要坐吗？我这能预定马车，而且一口价，上车再讲价钱的那种我不干。"] = "Or, would you like to take a ride later? I can book a carriage, and it's a fixed price. I don't do the kind where you haggle after getting in.",
    ["又或许是某种邪恶的不可战胜的力量。我不倾向于最后这个选项，对于他的邻居和附近的房价来说这比空支票还糟糕。"] = "Or perhaps it was some evil, invincible power. I don't lean toward the latter option; for his neighbors and the nearby property values, that's even worse than a bounced check.",
    ["又是0级……非常危险，不可打听，不可外传，不可描述，不可窥探。"] = "Grade 0 again... Extremely dangerous, must not be inquired about, must not be spread, must not be described, must not be pried into.",
    ["又是一个梦……这里是谁的梦境？"] = "Another dream... Whose dream is this?",
    ["又是一个被命运愚弄的可怜虫。我在这里等你好久。"] = "Another poor soul fooled by fate. I've been waiting for you here for a long time.",
    ["又是一声钟响，灰白和青黑交错的时钟表面，多了一根斑驳的时针。"] = "Another bell rang, and on the gray-white and cyan-black clock face, there was one more mottled hour hand.",
    ["又是划船，这都第八次了。"] = "Boating again, this is the eighth time.",
    ["又是刚才的家伙！"] = "It's that guy from before again!",
    ["又是拼图……好像是一束雏菊？"] = "Another puzzle... seems to be a bouquet of daisies?",
    ["又是新生……<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>罗珊，你们先进安全屋，我拖住他。"] = "New life again... <P_Heart>(Lowering voice)</> Rozanne, you go into the Safe House first, I'll hold him off.",
    ["又是新生……（压低声音）罗珊，你们先进安全屋，我拖住他。"] = "Another newborn... (lowers voice) Rozanne, you guys head to the safe house first. I'll hold him off.",
    ["又是来要钱的？"] = "Here to ask for money again?",
    ["又是猎龙帮？他们又混迹街头，到处欺负人了？"] = "The Dragon-Hunting Gang again? Are they roaming the streets bullying people once more?",
    ["又是盥洗室？"] = "The washroom again?",
    ["又是这样……又是这样……说了多少次……"] = "Again... again... how many times have I said...",
    ["又是这种怪物？得赶紧解决 不能耽误太多时间"] = "This kind of monster again? Must solve it quickly, can't waste too much time.",
    ["又是这种感觉……动不了了，可恶！"] = "This feeling again... I can't move, damn it!",
    ["又有一张纸条？"] = "Another note?",
    ["又有人来了解……了解有什么用？人又不会活过来。"] = "Someone coming to understand again... what's the use of understanding? People won't come back to life.",
    ["又有人来了，或许应该找他问问。"] = "Someone else is coming, maybe we should ask him.",
    ["又有人来占卜"] = "Someone else is here for divination",
    ["又有倒霉蛋来喝茶了。"] = "Another unlucky soul has come to drink tea.",
    ["又有地方爆发了瘟疫，\r\n我却找不到源头。"] = "The plague has broken out in another place, but I cannot find the source.",
    ["又有新的客人过来了……呼呼……\n奇怪呀……村里说过，不能偷偷摸摸做事的……"] = "Another new guest is coming... *huff, huff*... \n Strange... the village said, you can't do things sneakily...",
    ["又有血族粉丝来了……"] = "Another Sanguine fan has arrived...",
    ["又来…这次还会是对称吗？"] = "Again... will it be symmetry this time too?",
    ["又来一个小丑？这才有点看头！"] = "Another Clown? Now that's something worth watching!",
    ["又来一个，你们不买花就赶快走，要不然我可要叫治安官了。"] = "Another one? If you're not buying flowers, leave quickly, or I'll call the constable.",
    ["又来了……声音……它又在叫我翻那一页……每次都是这句话……"] = "It's happening again... the voice... it's calling me to turn that page again... it's the same sentence every time...",
    ["又来了，破筐烂菜的……谁干的！"] = "Here we go again, broken baskets and rotten vegetables... who did this!",
    ["又来了？还在做着无谓的挣扎吗？就算领悟几条扮演守则，你也没法摆脱我。"] = "Here again? Still making futile struggles? Even if you understand a few acting principles, you can't get rid of me.",
    ["又来廷根出任务了？"] = "Are you here in Tingen for a quest again?",
    ["又来？我受够了，我们分手吧！"] = "Again? I've had enough, let's break up!",
    ["又热又鲜的牡蛎汤，早上喝一碗，精神一整天！"] = "Hot and fresh oyster soup, drink a bowl in the morning, and be energetic all day!",
    ["又称“无尽的迷途”。 特殊工艺打造的长方形金箔纸，一端扭转180度后，与另一端相接，形成只有一个平面的环形。"] = "Also known as the \"Endless Maze.\" A rectangular gold foil strip crafted with special techniques, with one end twisted 180 degrees and connected to the other, forming a ring with only one surface.",
    ["又称“猎魔人”，获得夸张力量和介于神与人之间的精神。能制作药剂应对复杂情况，掩盖行动干扰占卜，是恶魔和怪物的克星。"] = "Also known as a 'Demon Hunter', you gain exaggerated strength and a spirit between god and man. Capable of making potions to deal with complex situations and masking actions to interfere with divination, you are the nemesis of demons and monsters.",
    ["又称“盛夏”。一根暗金色的，做成太阳鸟形状的胸针。"] = "Also known as 'Midsummer'. A dark gold brooch shaped like a sunbird.",
    ["又称精神分析师，能治疗或引发狂乱，通过“震慑”、“心理暗示”、“安抚”等能力直接影响目标，把握最真实情绪与想法。"] = "Also known as a psychoanalyst, able to treat or induce madness, directly influencing targets through abilities like \"Deterrence,\" \"Psychological Suggestion,\" and \"Pacify,\" grasping the most real emotions and thoughts.",
    ["又给克利夫这家伙跑掉了！"] = "Cliff that guy got away again!",
    ["又缓缓垂下头来，让思绪飘向遥远的故乡。"] = "And slowly lowered his head, letting his thoughts drift toward his distant hometown.",
    ["又美了"] = "Beautiful again",
    ["又脏又破！……唉，找来的佣人总是逃走，有的还会偷家里的珠宝。"] = "It's dirty and broken! ...Sigh, the servants I hire always run away, and some even steal the family's jewelry.",
    ["又要拍摄吗？"] = "Filming again?",
    ["又见<h>猎人</>"] = "See the <h>hunter</> again",
    ["又见汤姆"] = "See Tom again",
    ["又见面了朋友，这里的曲子同样蕴藏着往日回响。"] = "We meet again, friend. The music here also contains echoes of the past.",
    ["又见面了，德洛塔小姐。"] = "We meet again, Miss Delota.",
    ["又遇见您了，俱乐部的风云人物！"] = "Met you again, the star of the Club!",
    ["又！到！黑！夜！"] = "It's! Night! Again!",
    ["叉出去！喂瑞尔比伯！"] = "Throw it out! Feed it to Riel Bieber!",
    ["叉子"] = "Fork",
    ["及时击杀星光守卫，拾取遗落星光！"] = "Kill the Starlight Guard in time to pick up the Fallen Starlight!",
    ["及时转火<Highlight>污秽幼兽</>，然后将幼兽推到咕噜<Highlight>身下</>供咕噜吞噬，从而控制饥饿值增长。"] = "Switch targets to <Highlight>Filthy Cub</> in time, then push the cub under Gulu <Highlight>to be devoured by Gulu</>, thereby controlling the growth of the Hunger Value.",
    ["及时释放群体治疗或减伤技能！！"] = "Timely release group healing or Damage Reduction skills!!",
