    ["友军<HighLight>15</>防御，铁卫额外<HighLight>55</>点防御，战斗开始前<HighLight>10</>秒，额外<HighLight>20%</>防御；"] = "Allies gain <HighLight>15</> Defense, Iron Guards gain an additional <HighLight>55</> Defense; for the first <HighLight>10</> seconds of battle, gain an additional <HighLight>20%</> Defense.",
