    ["双剑斩第三段、巨剑斩击、猎魔瞬斩、暮色连斩每次命中给敌人加的衰败时间延长12秒，并且持有衰败的敌方攻击力降低15%"] = "The third hit of Dual Sword Slash, Greatsword Slash, Demon Hunter Instant Slash, and Twilight Combo Slash extends the Decay duration on enemies by 12 seconds, and enemies afflicted with Decay have their Attack reduced by 15%.",
    ["双剑斩第三段、巨剑斩击、猎魔瞬斩、暮色连斩每次命中给敌人加的衰败时间延长12秒，并且持有衰败的敌方攻击力降低15%。"] = "The third hit of Dual Sword Slash, Greatsword Slash, Demon Hunter Instant Slash, and Twilight Combo Slash extends the duration of Decay applied to enemies by 12 seconds, and enemies affected by Decay have their Attack Power reduced by 15%.",
