    ["发"] = "Hair",
    ["发丝纷扬，犹如宣叙调演绎到至情之处，所有灯光为之聚焦。"] = "Hair fluttering, as if a recitative is being performed to its most emotional point, with all lights focused upon it.",
    ["发亮的花？"] = "A glowing flower?",
    ["发件人："] = "Sender:",
    ["发件箱"] = "Outbox",
    ["发光时长(默认0.5)，拖尾时长(默认0.4)"] = "Glow duration (default 0.5), trail duration (default 0.4).",
    ["发光雕像"] = "Glowing statue",
    ["发出一道圆环冲击波，对不死怪物造成伤害，被影响的玩家心智会受到影响"] = "Emit a ring-shaped shockwave to deal damage to undead monsters; players affected will have their minds impacted.",
    ["发出刺耳的警笛声。"] = "Emit a piercing siren.",
    ["发出嚎叫时，不再打断自身的技能。"] = "Using Scream no longer interrupts your own skills.",
    ["发出嚎叫时，不再打断自身移动和技能。"] = "When howling, it no longer interrupts your own movement and skills.",
    ["发出四次脉冲，每次造成<HighLight>25%</>攻击伤害；自身及1格内友军攻速提高<HighLight>25%</>，持续4秒。"] = "Emits four pulses, each dealing <HighLight> 25% </> attack damage; self and allies within 1 grid have their attack speed increased by <HighLight> 25% </>, lasting 4 seconds.",
    ["发出好友申请数量已达上限"] = "Friend request limit reached.",
    ["发出总数："] = "Total Amount Sent:",
    ["发出恐惧尖叫，对自身周围2格敌人造成<color=red>200%攻击力伤害</color>。"] = "Emit a fearful scream, dealing <color=red> 200% attack damage to enemies within 2 grids of yourself</color>.",
    ["发出惊人的怒吼，对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，附加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。随后召唤巨人虚影猛击地面，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害。"] = "Let out a stunning Roar, dealing *d physical damage to surrounding enemies and applying, for *f seconds, the effect of buffdisc(*id). Then, summon a giant phantom shadow to Slam the ground, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage.",
    ["发出惊人的怒吼，对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，附加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。随后召唤巨人虚影猛击地面，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害。\n使用后陷入<HighLight>力量真空</>状态。\n\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Let out a stunning roar, dealing *d physical damage to surrounding enemies and applying, for *f seconds, the buffdisc(*id) effect. Then, summon a giant phantom shadow to slam the ground, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage. \nAfter use, you enter the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state. \n\n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
    ["发出惊人的怒吼，对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，附加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。随后召唤巨人虚影猛击自身前方地面，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害，并且<HighLight>击倒</>中心范围内的怪物。\n<HighLight>防御形态</>下在猎魔瞬斩后使用可<HighLight>击倒</>中心范围的敌方玩家，在驱魔卫斩后使用没有<HighLight>击倒</>玩家的效果。\n使用后陷入<HighLight>力量真空</>状态。\n\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Let out a stunning roar, dealing *d physical damage to surrounding enemies and applying, for *f seconds, the buffdisc(*id) effect. Then, summon a giant phantom shadow to slam the ground in front of you, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage and <HighLight>knocking down</> monsters in the center range. \n<HighLight>In Defense Form</>, using this after Demon Hunter Instant Slash can <HighLight>knock down</> enemy players in the center range; using it after Exorcism Slash does not have the effect of <HighLight>knocking down</> players. \nAfter use, you enter the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state. \n\n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
    ["发出清脆的车铃声。"] = "Emit a crisp bell sound.",
    ["发出短促的鸣笛声。"] = "Emits a short honking sound.",
    ["发动2-049滞涩全体非凡者，<Reminder_Red>连续点击交互按钮加速解控</>。"] = "2-049 triggers Stagnation on all Beyonders, <Reminder_Red> rapidly tap the interaction button to accelerate cleansing </>.",
    ["发动冲锋盾击，随后借势跳砸，对敌人附加衰败（持续造成伤害）并造成伤害和控制，对敌方玩家额外造成减疗，对友方玩家接触弱控附加减伤，自身获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。使用后解锁王庭号令。"] = "Launch a charge shield bash at enemies, then use the momentum to jump smash, applying decay (continuous damage) to enemies while dealing damage and control. Applies additional healing reduction to enemy players, dispels soft crowd control and adds damage reduction to friendly players, and you gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use.",
    ["发动星界力量，穿梭环绕对身前敌人造成伤害。"] = "Activates Astral World power to dash and orbit, dealing damage to enemies in front.",
    ["发动星界力量，穿梭环绕对身前敌人造成伤害并附加减疗。"] = "Activate Astral World power to dash around, dealing damage to enemies in front and applying Healing Reduction.",
    ["发动星界力量，穿梭环绕对身前敌人造成伤害并附加减疗。释放空间牢笼后本技能效果得到强化并获得额外星空能量。"] = "Invoke astral power to weave around and deal damage to enemies in front, applying healing reduction. After releasing Space Cage, this skill's effects are strengthened and you gain additional starlight energy.",
