    ["发奖阶段"] = "Award Distribution Stage",
    ["发射ALS子弹"] = "Fire ALS bullet.",
    ["发射三枚星辉弹，分别造成<HighLight>60%/60%/90%</>攻击伤害；第三枚命中后恢复<HighLight>6</>法力。"] = "Fire three starlight missiles, each dealing <HighLight> 60%/60%/90% </> attack damage; recover <HighLight> 6 </> mana after the third one hits.",
    ["发射两枚机械眼弹，各造成<HighLight>80%</>攻击伤害；部署时附近友军获得<HighLight>8%</>最大生命护盾，持续<HighLight>4</>秒。"] = "Fires two mechanical eye projectiles, each dealing <HighLight>80%</> attack damage; when deployed, nearby allies gain an <HighLight>8%</> Max Health Shield, lasting <HighLight>4</> seconds.",
    ["发射子弹数量提升至5个。"] = "Number of fired bullets increased to 5.",
    ["发射子弹数量提升至6个。"] = "Number of fired bullets increased to 6.",
    ["发射星辉弹，对4格内当前目标造成<color=red>90%攻击力伤害</color>。"] = "Fire a starlight bullet, dealing <color=red>90% attack damage</color> to the current target within 4 grids.",
    ["发射炮弹，可对建筑造成高额伤害。"] = "Fires a cannonball, dealing high damage to buildings.",
    ["发射纸牌对目标进行四段式攻击，分别造成bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)点物理伤害并将敌方怪物<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>。每使用4次开牌造成伤害后获得一张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>；若上次获得为<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>，则改为获得一张<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>命运黄牌</>/<FaintYellow>灵性蓝牌</>：获得三张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>/<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>时消耗所有卡牌，使<HighLight>终结技能洗牌</>切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>/<HighLight>灵性爆发</>。"] = "Launches cards to perform a four-stage attack on the target, dealing bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) physical damage respectively and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy monsters. Every 4 times you Reveal Card and deal damage, you gain one <HighLight>Fate Yellow Card</>; if the last card obtained was a <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Card</>, you gain a <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Card</> instead. \n\n<FaintYellow>Fate Yellow Card</>/<FaintYellow>Spirituality Blue Card</>: When you obtain three <HighLight>Fate Yellow Cards</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</>, consume all cards to switch the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Shuffle Cards</> to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>.",
    ["发射纸牌对目标进行攻击。该技能每造成4次伤害后根据自身获取的前一张卡牌类型获得一张相同的卡牌（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Launch playing cards to attack the target. After this skill deals damage 4 times, obtain an identical card based on the type of the previous card obtained (used to unlock Finisher Skills).",
    ["发射连环炮弹，可对建筑造成高额伤害。"] = "Fires a chain of cannonballs, dealing high damage to buildings.",
