    ["受到5次*d点魔法伤害"] = "Take *d magic damage 5 times.",
    ["受到不明力量的侵蚀，海精灵坚信，只有创新是唯一的出路，大胆假设，勇敢求证，猛猛海精灵，不怕实验！"] = "Eroded by unknown forces, the Sea Spirit firmly believes that innovation is the only way out. Make bold assumptions, bravely verify them, fierce Sea Spirit, not afraid of experiments!",
