    ["受到伤害减少*f**。"] = "Damage taken reduced by *f**.",
    ["受到伤害前"] = "Before receiving damage",
    ["受到伤害后，若当前生命值低于50%且<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>未处于技能冷却中则自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>，未携带<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>时也可以生效。"] = "After taking damage, if current health is below 50% and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> is not on cooldown, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> is automatically released. This effect works even if <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> is not equipped.",
    ["受到伤害后，若当前生命值低于50%且<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>未处于技能冷却中则自动释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>，未携带<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">黎明铠甲</>时也可以生效。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">猎魔瞬斩</>获得新的分支<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">驱魔卫斩</>：防御形态下，对敌方释放时与原猎魔瞬斩效果一致，对友方释放时为友方解除弱控和减速，并附加20%的减伤和25%的移速增加，持续5秒。"] = "After taking damage, if current Health is below 50% and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> is not on Cooldown, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> will be automatically cast; this effect can trigger even if <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061040\" color=\"#f4a067\">Dawn Armor</> is not equipped. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Demon Hunter Instant Slash</> gains a new branch, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Exorcism Slash</>: When in Defense Form, casting it on an enemy has the same effect as the original Demon Hunter Instant Slash; when cast on an ally, it removes Soft Crowd Control and Slow effects from the ally, and grants 20% Damage Reduction and a 25% Movement Speed Increase for 5 seconds.",
