    ["受到伤害时恢复<HighLight>1</>点法力值。"] = "Restores <HighLight>1</> mana when taking damage.",
    ["受到伤害时，如果生命值低于50%，则消耗1枚生命之种，为自己固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。"] = "When taking damage, if health is below 50%, consume 1 Seed of Life to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of max health.",
    ["受到伤害时，如果生命值低于50%，则消耗1枚生命之种，为自己固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。在主宰争锋玩法中效果降低。"] = "When taking damage, if your HP is below 50%, consume 1 Seed of Life to restore a fixed amount of HP equal to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of your max HP. This effect is reduced in the Dominator's Clash mode.",
