    ["受到施法者的伤害时额外承受施法者*d伤害，每1.5秒只能触发一次，对怪物目标额外增加100%伤害。"] = "When taking damage from the caster, take additional damage equal to *d of the caster; can only trigger once every 1.5 seconds; additional 100% damage against monster targets.",
    ["受到施法者的伤害时额外承受施法者*d伤害，每1.5秒只能触发一次，对怪物目标额外增加75%伤害。"] = "When taking damage from the caster, take additional damage equal to *d of the caster; can only trigger once every 1.5 seconds; additional 75% damage against monster targets.",
    ["受到星光囚笼囚禁，无法行动"] = "Imprisoned by Starlight Cage, unable to move",
    ["受到普攻造成伤害。"] = "Deals damage upon Basic Attack.",
    ["受到普通怪物攻击时，抵消其{*.1f**,F1690001,CreepHurtDivi}压制。(最多将攻击方压制降为0)"] = "When receiving attacks from a normal monster, negates {*.1f**,F1690001,CreepHurtDivi} of their Suppression. (Reduces the attacker's Suppression to a maximum of 0)",
    ["受到普通怪物攻击时，抵消其专攻{*d,F1690001,CreepHurtReduce}点。(最多将攻击方专攻降为0)"] = "When receiving attacks from a normal monster, negates {*d,F1690001,CreepHurtReduce} points of their Special Attack. (Reduces the attacker's Special Attack to a maximum of 0)",
    ["受到暴击"] = "Received critical hit",
    ["受到来自施加者的伤害提高"] = "Damage taken from the caster is increased.",
    ["受到来自施加者的伤害提高<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?25%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?30%}</>。"] = "Damage taken from the caster increased by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?25%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?30%}</>.",
    ["受到来自目标的伤害提高，造成的伤害降低。"] = "Damage taken from the target increased, damage dealt reduced.",
    ["受到歌颂者途径的非凡者攻击时，抵消其{*.1f**,F1690001,SunHurtDivi}压制。(最多将攻击方压制降为0)"] = "When receiving attacks from a Bard Pathway Beyonder, negates {*.1f**,F1690001,SunHurtDivi} of their Suppression. (Reduces the attacker's Suppression to a maximum of 0)",
    ["受到歌颂者途径的非凡者攻击时，抵消其专攻{*d,F1690001,SunHurtReduce}点。(最多将攻击方专攻降为0)"] = "When receiving attacks from a Bard Pathway Beyonder, negates {*d,F1690001,SunHurtReduce} points of their Special Attack. (Reduces the attacker's Special Attack to a maximum of 0)",
    ["受到污染或异化的太阳花研磨物，光明中夹杂阴影。"] = "Ground material from contaminated or alienated sunflowers, with shadows mixed into the light.",
