    ["变怪特效"] = "Monster transformation effect",
    ["变成一只人畜无害的生物，立刻进入假死状态。"] = "Turn into a harmless creature and immediately enter a state of feigned death.",
    ["变成一只人畜无害的生物，立刻进入假死状态，持续30秒，所有敌人无法将你加入仇恨列表，但你的任何主动攻击会解除此状态"] = "Transforms into a harmless creature and immediately enters a feigned death state for 30 seconds. All enemies will not add you to their hate list, but any active attack will end this state.",
    ["变成字的告解很多很多，可告解室很小很小，装不下它们，它们就会悄悄跑掉……"] = "There are so, so many confessions that turned into words, but the confessional is very, very small. It can't hold them all, so they would quietly run away...",
