    ["变身ID"] = "Transform ID.",
    ["变身id"] = "Transform ID.",
    ["变身为巨人并获得短暂<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\">无敌</>，驱散最多3个<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"4\">负面状态</>，展开<HighLight>黄昏领域</>，对周身范围内敌方造成共计sum(*d,*d,*d,*d,*d)点伤害，变身结束后对范围内敌人造成*d点伤害。\n技能施法期间可以移动，自身buffdisc(*id)，buffdisc(*id)。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏领域</>\n对领域内的敌方持续施加减速。"] = "Transform into a giant and gain brief Invincibility <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\"></>, dispel up to 3 Negative Statuses <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"4\"></>, and expand the Twilight Domain <HighLight></>, dealing a total of sum(*d,*d,*d,*d,*d) damage to enemies in the surrounding area. After the transformation ends, deal *d damage to enemies within the area. \n You can move while casting this skill; gain buffdisc(*id) and buffdisc(*id). \n\n<FaintYellow> Twilight Domain </>\n: Continuously applies Slow to enemies within the domain.",
    ["变身前50%\n变身后60%"] = "50% before transformation\n 60% after transformation",
    ["变身前，必中子弹"] = "Before Transform, guaranteed hit Bullet",
    ["变身卷毛狒狒"] = "Transform into Curly-Haired Baboon",
    ["变身卷毛狒狒。"] = "Transform into a Curly-Haired Baboon.",
    ["变身后，必中子弹"] = "After Transform, guaranteed hit Bullet",
    ["变身小丑"] = "Transform into Clown",
    ["变身小象"] = "Transform into Little Elephant",
    ["变身小象。"] = "Transform into a Little Elephant.",
    ["变身幽影"] = "Transform into Shadow",
    ["变身幽影。"] = "Transform into a Shadow.",
    ["变身成巨人获得短暂无敌并驱散负面效果，随后边移动边进行附带减速的持续攻击，期间霸体、减伤。"] = "Transform into a giant to gain brief invincibility and dispel negative effects, then perform continuous attacks with slow while moving. Gain super armor and damage reduction during this time.",
    ["变身成河豚，短暂延迟后爆炸，并向四周发射<Highlight>4</>个子弹，每个造成*d点伤害。变身过程中全程<Highlight>霸体</>。"] = "Transform into a pufferfish, exploding after a short delay and firing <Highlight>4</> bullets in all directions, each dealing *d damage. You gain <Highlight>Super Armor</> for the entire duration of the transformation.",
    ["变身成河豚，短暂延迟后爆炸，并向四周发射多个子弹。变身过程中全程霸体"] = "Transform into a Pufferfish, exploding after a short delay and firing multiple bullets in all directions. You have Super Armor throughout the transformation.",
