    ["古堡……那是我曾经居住的地方。我的妻子曾向我抱怨过，城堡太阴冷，她更喜欢阳光与温暖。"] = "The ancient castle... that is where I once lived. My wife used to complain to me that the castle was too cold and gloomy; she preferred sunshine and warmth.",
    ["古堡主体结构保留第四纪末至第五纪初的建筑特色。"] = "The main structure of the castle retains the architectural features of the end of the Fourth Epoch to the beginning of the Fifth Epoch.",
