    ["古堡大厅高阔但采光昏暗，窗小而高，石柱支撑穹顶，地下室入口隐蔽。"] = "The castle hall is high and wide but dimly lit, with small, high windows, stone pillars supporting the dome, and a hidden basement entrance.",
