    ["古堡的初代主人被称为拉姆德男爵，其活跃年代被推断在第四纪末期——也就是大约一千三四百年前。"] = "The first owner of the castle was known as Baron Lamud, and his active period is estimated to be at the end of the Fourth Epoch—that is, about thirteen or fourteen hundred years ago.",
