    ["古堡，会动的盔甲，黑风衣的老爷们……听起来，这位先生是目睹过疑似非凡者之间的战斗。"] = "Ancient castle, moving armor, gentlemen in black trench coats... It sounds like this gentleman has witnessed a battle between suspected Beyonders.",
