    ["古树下的"] = "Under the ancient tree",
    ["古树化身"] = "Ancient Tree Avatar",
    ["古树旁的"] = "Beside the ancient tree",
    ["古称“童话作家”，掌握部分“空想”权柄。可将概念短暂拉入现实，书写的故事会变成现实，拥有“凡有言，必被知”的特质。"] = "Anciently known as 'Fairy Tale Author', masters part of the 'Fantasy' authority. Can briefly pull concepts into reality, the stories written will become reality, and possesses the trait of 'Whatever is spoken must be known'.",
    ["古称“角斗士”。格斗方面的专家，能凭借身体减弱某些超自然力量带来的影响。"] = "Anciently known as \"Gladiator.\" An expert in fighting, capable of weakening the influence of certain supernatural powers through the body.",
    ["古称“角斗士”，格斗方面的专家，能凭借身体减弱某些超自然力量带来的影响，近距离战斗无人能及，纯粹靠身体削弱非凡能力效果。"] = "Known in ancient times as a 'Gladiator', an expert in combat. You can rely on your body to weaken the effects brought by certain supernatural powers. Unrivaled in close-quarters combat, you purely rely on your body to weaken Beyonder ability effects.",
    ["古称“超凡战士”、“神血战士”。超越常人的力量，超越常人的敏捷。"] = "Anciently known as 'Beyonder Warrior' or 'God-Blood Warrior'. Strength beyond ordinary people, agility beyond ordinary people.",
    ["古称“超凡战士”，拥有超越常人的力量、敏捷，精通各种武器防具和格斗术，不存在无法使用的武器或无法掌握的格斗流派。"] = "Known in ancient times as an 'Extraordinary Warrior', possessing strength and agility beyond ordinary people. Proficient in various weapons, armor, and combat techniques; there is no weapon you cannot use or combat style you cannot master.",
    ["古米尼克"] = "Guminik",
    ["古老怨灵的诅咒物"] = "Cursed object of an ancient vengeful spirit",
    ["古老树木根部形成的结晶体，蕴含沉淀的岁月与大地生命力。"] = "Crystalline bodies formed at the roots of ancient trees, containing accumulated time and earth Health.",
    ["古老树木结出的果实，蕴含悠久记忆与时间气息。"] = "Fruit borne by ancient trees, containing long-standing memories and the aura of time.",
    ["古老的书本"] = "Ancient Book",
    ["古老的书本-mesh"] = "Ancient Book-mesh",
    ["古老的巨人石像……等等，它是不是动了？！"] = "Ancient giant stone statue... wait, did it move?!",
    ["古老的村庄中，沉睡着庞大的宝藏……"] = "A massive treasure lies sleeping in the ancient village...",
    ["古老的石棺"] = "Ancient stone coffin",
    ["古老的霍纳奇斯雪山"] = "The Ancient Hornacis Snowy Mountain",
    ["古董-旅客"] = "Antique - Traveler",
    ["古董交易"] = "Antique trading",
    ["古董左轮"] = "Antique Revolver",
    ["古董摊主"] = "Antique Stall Owner",
    ["古银戒环"] = "Antique Silver Ring",
    ["古镜中突然爆发出红色光芒，将她吞没。"] = "A red light suddenly erupted from the ancient mirror, swallowing her.",
    ["另一个值班人员"] = "Another person on duty",
    ["另一个包裹"] = "Another package",
    ["另一个狂热的声音"] = "Another fanatical voice",
    ["另一个男人"] = "Another man",
    ["另一个男声"] = "Another male voice",
    ["另一件编号“2-327”，名为“看见我”的封印物，灵性痕迹更清晰。我们经过反复占卜，确认它在廷根郊外的黑伍德庄园。"] = "The other one, numbered \"2-327,\" a Sealed Artifact named \"See Me,\" has a clearer spiritual trace. After repeated divination, we confirmed it is at Heywood Manor in the Tingen Suburbs.",
    ["另一位观众"] = "Another Spectator",
    ["另一扇，你往后走几步就能看到。"] = "The other one, you can see if you walk back a few steps.",
    ["另外，不要尝试撬开它，否则，我不得不考虑将你告上法庭！"] = "Also, do not try to pry it open, otherwise, I will have to consider taking you to court!",
    ["另外，你还需要每天出去走一走，尤其是韦尔奇家到你家的各种道路。"] = "In addition, you also need to go out for a walk every day, especially on the various roads from Welch's House to your home.",
    ["另外，加入俱乐部后就可以为顾客提供有偿占卜服务，我们只抽取很低比例的费用。最重要的是，您还能找到一群相同爱好的朋友。"] = "Additionally, after joining the club, you can provide paid divination services to customers, and we only take a very small percentage as a fee. Most importantly, you can find a group of friends with the same interests.",
    ["另外，您也可以使用蒸汽机组，升级即将上路的火车，这一定能进一步提升您的收益。"] = "In addition, you can also use steam units to upgrade the trains that are about to hit the road, which will certainly further increase your revenue.",
    ["另外，我为你的廷根之行，准备了一点小礼物。"] = "Also, I have prepared a small gift for your trip to Tingen.",
    ["另外，我们似乎搞砸了邓恩的生日呢，我还有最后一点力气……"] = "Besides, we seem to have ruined Dunn's birthday. I still have a little strength left...",
    ["另外，我会让警察局留意兜帽女子的线索。"] = "In addition, I will have the police department keep an eye out for clues about the hooded woman.",
    ["另外，请原谅我的冒昧，女士。陛下的原话是——“真正的金子，不怕火的锤炼”。"] = "Also, please forgive my presumption, my lady. The Emperor's original words were—'True gold does not fear the tempering of fire.'",
    ["另外，这张供货单给你，这是刚刚那个叫塔诺的倒霉蛋拿来的，上面写了订购人。"] = "Also, here is the delivery note for you. This was brought by that unlucky guy named Tano just now, and the person who ordered them is written on it.",
    ["另外，这里我已经调查过了，不是什么邪教组织，你可以放心在此活动。"] = "Besides, I have already investigated this place; it is not a cult organization, so you can rest assured to be active here.",
    ["另辟蹊径"] = "Find another way",
    ["只"] = "Piece",
    ["只……强了一点点"] = "Only... a little bit stronger.",
    ["只、只能算是勉强有些审美吧！下次一定不会让你赢了！"] = "I-I can only say you barely have some aesthetic sense! Next time I definitely won't let you win!",
    ["只不过——想要我出手，前提是看你的诚意足不足。"] = "However—if you want me to act, the prerequisite is to see if your sincerity is sufficient.",
    ["只为守护您的健康而存在。"] = "Exists only to guard your health.",
    ["只交不播"] = "Submit only, no play",
    ["只交不播参数版<h></>"] = "Submit only, no play parameter version <h></>",
    ["只会念诗可没什么用。"] = "Just reciting poetry is useless.",
    ["只会给指定ID的通用交互物发消息。\n可不填，不填默认任意ID"] = "Will only send messages to general interactive objects with the specified ID. \n Can be left blank; if left blank, it defaults to any ID.",
    ["只使用技能里配置的对象阵营、攻击效果等，不使用技能的筛选范围"] = "Use only the object faction, attack effects, etc., configured in the skill, without using the skill's filter range.",
    ["只免费提供开水给流浪儿。"] = "Only provide boiling water for free to homeless children.",
    ["只可选择一个区服的一名角色进行返还\n非凡者当前可领取【%s】\n是否确认使用当前角色进行领取？"] = "You can only choose one character from one server for the return. \n The Beyonder can currently claim [%s] \n. Are you sure you want to use the current character to claim it?",
    ["只因为我，并不会创作诗句。"] = "Only because I cannot compose poetry.",
    ["只因他为异党送了一封信，他那样正直的一个人，却落得那样的下场。"] = "Just because he delivered a letter for a dissident, a man as upright as him met such an end.",
    ["只因神言：你们叩问，便得答案；你们信仰，便得应允；你们奉献，便得赐予。"] = "For the divine word says: You ask, and you shall receive; you believe, and you shall be answered; you offer, and you shall be granted.",
    ["只在午夜举办的秘密茶会，今晚的特调是……"] = "A secret tea party held only at midnight; tonight's special blend is...",
    ["只在黑暗中绽放的香气。"] = "A fragrance that only blooms in the dark.",
    ["只好牺牲一些令人愉悦的气泡了……"] = "I'll have to sacrifice some of the pleasant bubbles...",
    ["只拿一点点，一点点就好……"] = "Just take a little bit, just a little bit is fine...",
    ["只攻击丑的"] = "Only Attack the Ugly",
    ["只是……很多人永远都回不来了，留在间海前线，留在明尔明斯克山脉上。"] = "It's just that... many people never came back, remaining on the Midseashire front, remaining on the Minminsk Mountains.",
    ["只是一条平平无奇的黑麦面包。"] = "Just a plain, ordinary loaf of rye bread.",
    ["只是一条狗"] = "Just a Dog",
    ["只是一点点灵性扰动"] = "Just a little bit of spiritual disturbance",
    ["只是不知道为什么，我的脑袋还完好，我活到了现在。"] = "I just don't know why my head is still intact, and I'm still alive.",
    ["只是主人家族的遗传病，要靠新鲜血液维持生命，和放血疗法差不多喵。"] = "It's just a hereditary disease of the Master's family; she needs fresh blood to sustain her life, it's about the same as bloodletting therapy, meow.",
    ["只是以为你们几个是我的熟人，看来是我认错了。"] = "I just thought you guys were acquaintances of mine. It seems I was mistaken.",
    ["只是例行的调查。一位马车夫证实，昨天你去过韦尔奇先生的住所，还是他帮你付的车钱。"] = "It's just a routine investigation. A carriage driver confirmed that you went to Mr. Welch's residence yesterday, and he even paid for your fare.",
    ["只是做一朵小花也要开心哦。"] = "Even if you're just a little flower, you should be happy.",
    ["只是别喝太多，梦境可能会变得太“真实”。 "] = "Just don't drink too much, the dreams might become too 'real'.",
    ["只是占位只是占位只是占位"] = "Just a placeholder, just a placeholder, just a placeholder.",
    ["只是反馈？"] = "Just feedback?",
    ["只是可惜，我不会创作诗句。"] = "It is just a pity that I cannot compose poetry.",
    ["只是向您问个好，警官。"] = "Just saying hello, Officer.",
    ["只是听人偶尔提起，说您的歌声……很有特色。"] = "I just heard someone mention it occasionally, saying your singing voice... is very unique.",
    ["只是因为一些意外与巧合，我需要尽快获得自保的能力。"] = "It's just due to some accidents and coincidences; I needed to gain the ability to protect myself as soon as possible.",
    ["只是坐坐吗？"] = "Just sit?",
    ["只是女人的直觉。告辞了，夫人小姐们，这店里的香水……太苦了，不适合我。"] = "Just a woman's intuition. Farewell, ladies, the perfume in this shop... is too bitter, not for me.",
    ["只是好奇，作为大作家的童年会是什么样的。"] = "Just curious, what the childhood of a great writer would be like.",
    ["只是字母而已，没什么特别的。您要是没事，就别在这儿站着了。"] = "Just letters, nothing special. If you don't have anything to do, please don't stand here.",
    ["只是尸体被发现的时候已经开始发臭腐烂了，警察草草处理就把尸体运走了。"] = "It's just that by the time the body was discovered, it had already started to stink and rot, so the police handled it perfunctorily and hauled it away.",
    ["只是工作……贴这儿能招揽更多客户。"] = "Just work... sticking them here can attract more customers.",
    ["只是您手里这把伞，款式和我前几天丢的那把一模一样，我就是随口问问，您的伞是在哪里买的？"] = "It's just that this umbrella in your hand is exactly the same style as the one I lost a few days ago. I was just asking, where did you buy your umbrella?",
    ["只是昨晚？"] = "Only last night?",
    ["只是普通的纸条，没什么特别的……"] = "Just ordinary notes, nothing special...",
    ["只是更有经验。占星往往要结合现实判断，才能更准确地解读。"] = "I just have more experience. Astrology often needs to be combined with reality to be interpreted more accurately.",
    ["只是比起在这里找，或许这样的爱人闯进你的生活更多要靠缘分。"] = "But rather than looking here, perhaps such a lover is more likely to enter your life by fate.",
    ["只是没想到，会有人愿意替一个扫地的出头。"] = "I just didn't expect that someone would be willing to stand up for a cleaner.",
    ["只是看看"] = "Just looking",
    ["只是看起来体面罢了，服装店的安迪和我抱怨好多次了，说他每天以各种理由去服装店退货。"] = "He just looks decent. Andy from the clothing store has complained to me many times, saying he goes to the store every day to return items for various reasons.",
    ["只是碰巧走过的地方多了点，见过的事怪了点。 "] = "I just happen to have traveled to more places and seen stranger things.",
    ["只是路过"] = "Just passing by",
    ["只是运气好罢了，需要我喂你喝药吗？"] = "I just got lucky. Do you need me to feed you the potion?",
    ["只是这布料实在太厚，感觉好热，快喘不上气了……"] = "It's just that this fabric is too thick, it feels so hot, I can barely breathe...",
    ["只是那时候的我，总觉得站在他身边，自己还差得远。他的干净，他的温柔，他那些永远不会弯折的东西——让我觉得我这样的人，远远不够格。"] = "It's just that back then, I always felt that standing beside him, I was still far from enough. His cleanliness, his gentleness, those things about him that would never bend—they made me feel that someone like me was far from qualified.",
    ["只是随便看看"] = "Just looking around",
    ["只是鞋底的一点污泥，它的颜色和咖啡粉的颜色差不多、差不多。"] = "Just a bit of mud from my shoe sole. Its color is about the same as the coffee powder, about the same.",
    ["只是黑荆棘的大家太过体贴，生怕触碰到我的伤心事，慢慢就没人提起想听曲子了。"] = "It's just that everyone at Blackthorn was too considerate, fearing they would touch upon my sad memories, so eventually, no one mentioned wanting to hear tunes anymore.",
    ["只是，布鲁斯不在的话，就没有人陪我捉迷藏了……"] = "It's just that if Bruce isn't here, no one will play hide-and-seek with me...",
    ["只显示可加入"] = "Show joinable only",
    ["只显示可加入房间"] = "Show only joinable rooms",
    ["只显示我的投影"] = "Show only my projections",
    ["只有#CanMove人类#可以通过。"] = "Only #CanMoveHumans# can pass through.",
    ["只有#CanMove猫#可以通过。"] = "Only #CanMoveCats# can pass through.",
    ["只有“混乱”和“秩序”大剑同时固于世界之庭，才能稳固两个世界。"] = "Only when the greatswords of \"Chaos\" and \"Order\" are both fixed in the Court of the World can the two worlds be stabilized.",
    ["只有一只机关怪物说的是真话，找到并击败它吧！"] = "Only one mechanical monster is telling the truth, find and defeat it!",
    ["只有人类才能通过"] = "Only humans can pass",
    ["只有你能救他们……但不论你怎么选择，我们都会跟着你。"] = "Only you can save them... but no matter what you choose, we will follow you.",
    ["只有俱乐部会长才能发起宣战！"] = "Only the Club President can initiate a declaration of war!",
    ["只有俱乐部会长才能响应宣战！"] = "Only the Club President can respond to a declaration of war!",
    ["只有俺才能带领大家走向胜利"] = "Only I can lead everyone to victory",
    ["只有借阅更高保密等级的资料，才需要老希罗多德、导师们甚至会长的批准。"] = "Only borrowing information with a higher confidentiality level requires the approval of old Herodotus, mentors, or even the president.",
    ["只有半块黑面包了……先凑合一下。"] = "Only half a piece of black bread left... Just make do with it.",
    ["只有卖出更多香水，我才能保住工作！"] = "Only by selling more perfume can I keep my job!",
    ["只有变得更便宜，才能被更多人买到，只要买的人足够多，我们就能定义什么是风尚——这可比原料贵重得多。"] = "Only by becoming cheaper can it be bought by more people. As long as enough people buy it, we can define what fashion is—this is much more valuable than the raw materials.",
    ["只有团长才能使用此功能"] = "Only the team leader can use this function",
    ["只有在上一个俱乐部求助任务完成或放弃后，才能领取当日的俱乐部求助任务，每日限领取一次。"] = "You can only collect the daily Club assistance quest after the previous one is completed or abandoned. It is limited to once per day.",
    ["只有在外面，我才能肆无忌惮地享受烟草与薄荷叶混合的味道。"] = "Only when I'm outside can I enjoy the scent of tobacco mixed with mint leaves without restraint.",
    ["只有在这儿，我才不会被赶出去。"] = "Only here will I not be kicked out.",
    ["只有在这儿，我才不会被赶出来。"] = "Only here will I not be kicked out.",
    ["只有天才中将……她能听懂我的话……"] = "Only the Genius Admiral... she can understand what I say...",
    ["只有成为真神，才能守护我想保护的东西。但无论是“窥秘人”还是“通识者”途径的成神之路都已经被堵死了。隔着遥远的时光，我突然理解那位“血皇帝”为什么会做出那样疯狂的选择，有机会可真想跟他喝上一杯。\n        我也是真的疯了，不是吗？"] = "Only by becoming a True God can I protect what I want to protect. But the paths to godhood for both the \"Mystery Pryer\" and \"Savant\" pathways have been blocked. Across the distant time, I suddenly understand why that \"Blood Emperor\" would make such a crazy choice. If I had the chance, I would really like to have a drink with him. \n I am also truly crazy, aren't I?",
    ["只有我知道舞池在哪！"] = "Only I know where the dance floor is!",
    ["只有我这个老古董，出生在这里，长大在这里，愿意把这一切记录下来，愿意把历史当个宝贝。"] = "Only an old antique like me, born here and raised here, is willing to record all of this and treat history as a treasure.",
    ["只有戴莉可以看到卡萝"] = "Only Daly can see Karlo",
    ["只有戴莉能看到卡萝队长"] = "Only Daly can see Captain Karlo",
    ["只有房主可以进行该操作。"] = "Only the room owner can perform this operation.",
    ["只有找到故事的真相，才能平安离开这个空间，这其实是你唯一的选择……"] = "Only by finding the truth of the story can you safely leave this space; this is actually your only choice...",
    ["只有投机的人才会花钱买这种毫无价值的东西。"] = "Only speculators would spend money to buy such worthless things.",
    ["只有最强壮的人，才有资格占有贝儿小姐。"] = "Only the strongest man is qualified to possess Miss Belle.",
    ["只有最漂亮最柔软的睡莲才像我亲爱的奥利维亚。"] = "Only the most beautiful and softest water lily is like my dear Olivia.",
    ["只有最聪明的人才能进入缝隙，撬开真相的一角！"] = "Only the smartest people can enter the gap and pry open a corner of the truth!",
    ["只有武器能重塑吗"] = "Can only weapons be reshaped?",
    ["只有残破不堪的记忆，在沉默地践行着守护的承诺。"] = "Only broken memories remain, silently fulfilling the promise of protection.",
    ["只有猫才能通过"] = "Only cats can pass",
    ["只有玩家（非机器人）可调用该Action"] = "Only players (non-bots) can invoke this Action.",
    ["只有痛快的死亡能够治愈你，把你从那充满野性的好奇心中释放出来。"] = "Only a swift death can cure you and release you from that wild curiosity.",
    ["只有真正的邦尼才会成功施放技能！"] = "Only the real Bonnie will successfully cast skills!",
    ["只有第十二个，出乎我的预料，所以实验结束了。"] = "Only the twelfth one exceeded my expectations, so the experiment is over.",
    ["只有群主可编辑"] = "Only the group leader can edit.",
    ["只有这一小块面包吗……"] = "Is this the only small piece of bread...",
    ["只有这个。"] = "Only this.",
    ["只有这样，那些不听课的学生为了应付考试，才会在“内部资料”中学到一点点历史知识。"] = "Only in this way will those students who don't listen in class learn a little bit of historical knowledge from the 'insider materials' in order to cope with the exams.",
    ["只有进入非凡的世界，才有可能得知穿越的真相，才能回家。"] = "Only by entering the Beyonder world can I possibly learn the truth of the transmigration and return home.",
    ["只有队长可以选择黄铜书挑战。"] = "Only the leader can select the Brass Book challenge.",
    ["只有队长才能发起誓约请求"] = "Only the party leader can initiate a Covenant request.",
    ["只有队长才能进行该操作。"] = "Only the party leader can perform this operation.",
    ["只有防守方能使用传送门"] = "Only the defending side can use the Portal.",
    ["只有靠着药剂，躺在灵界观测房的地面，我才能进入半梦半醒的状态。"] = "Only by relying on potions and lying on the floor of the Spirit World observation room can I enter a semi-dreaming, semi-awake state.",
    ["只有风知道花的心思。"] = "Only the wind knows the thoughts of the flowers.",
    ["只求她从教堂走过时能看我一眼！"] = "I only ask that she look at me once when she walks past the church!",
    ["只求您……赐我一个眼神！让我亲吻您的脚趾！"] = "I only ask you... to grant me a glance! Let me kiss your toes!",
    ["只用给我2苏勒，这个月的加班名额就让给你。"] = "Just give me 2 soli, and I'll let you have this month's overtime slot.",
    ["只由先祖铠甲特殊羁绊召唤，不参与羁绊统计。"] = "Only summoned by the special Ancestor Armor kinship; does not participate in kinship statistics.",
    ["只看帅哥"] = "Show only handsome men",
    ["只看美女"] = "Show only beautiful women",
    ["只给钥匙"] = "Give only key",
    ["只能<Highlight>相邻途径</>之间进行转换，不同源质的途径之间无法进行转换；"] = "Can only convert between <Highlight>adjacent pathways</>, conversion between pathways of different Sefirah is not possible;",
    ["只能上传图片"] = "Only images can be uploaded.",
    ["只能先出去看看了。"] = "I have no choice but to go out and take a look.",
    ["只能和OnBeforeControlAndHit搭配使用"] = "Can only be used in conjunction with OnBeforeControlAndHit.",
    ["只能在我家找到这么嫩的肉！"] = "You can only find meat this tender at my place!",
    ["只能对未被收藏的邮件进行收藏操作！"] = "You can only favorite mail that has not been favorited yet!",
    ["只能联系他们了。"] = "I can only contact them.",
    ["只能自己当服务员了……"] = "Looks like I'll have to wait tables myself...",
    ["只能邀请在线且互为好友的玩家"] = "Can only invite players who are online and mutual friends",
    ["只能配合OnBeforeSkillCast使用，修改黑板值技能实例的效果。\n增伤传到乘区：FDIn.ComboHurtMulti（skill_fix_extra_hurt_multi，对skillID做修改，包括该技能创建的子实体也有增伤）"] = "Can only be used with OnBeforeSkillCast to modify the effect of the blackboard value skill instance. \n Damage boost transmission to multiplier: FDIn.ComboHurtMulti (skill_fix_extra_hurt_multi, modifies the skillID, including damage boosts for sub-entities created by this skill).",
    ["只能领取一个赛事的奖励，领取后本周其他赛事奖励无法再领取，是否确认？"] = "You can only claim rewards for one event. After claiming, rewards for other events this week cannot be claimed. Are you sure?",
    ["只要……种子重新长成一颗鲜活的苹果"] = "As long as... the seed grows back into a fresh apple.",
    ["只要一苏勒，您就能无限次体验，想坐就坐。"] = "For just one sou, you can experience it unlimited times. Sit whenever you want.",
    ["只要不用再装那些告解，去装什么都行，怎么都行……<P_Heart>（怯生生）</> 女神……会宽恕我的想法吗？"] = "As long as I don't have to store those confessions anymore, I'll store anything, anything at all... <P_Heart> (Timidly) </> Will the Goddess... forgive my thoughts?",
    ["只要主人晋升成为炼金术士，我们就能获得一切！"] = "As long as the master advances to become an Alchemist, we can obtain everything!",
    ["只要伤势不严重，这枚戒指就会持续帮你恢复生命值。如果你生命饱满，它则会转而治疗血量最低的队友。它也招惹蚊虫，让你持有的护盾随时间消散。"] = "As long as the injury is not serious, this ring will continuously help you recover Health. If your Health is full, it will instead heal the teammate with the lowest Health. It also attracts mosquitoes, causing your Shield to dissipate over time.",
    ["只要你开口，哪怕脱掉全身的毛，变成一只下锅的鹌鹑，我也心甘情愿。"] = "As long as you ask, even if I have to shed all my fur and turn into a quail ready for the pot, I would do it willingly.",
    ["只要你能让他们对正门松懈，我就能抓住这个机会。"] = "As long as you can make them relax their guard at the front door, I can seize this opportunity.",
    ["只要你顺利挤进去，就能抵达……万物……之外……"] = "As long as you successfully squeeze in, you can reach... beyond... all things...",
    ["只要再进一步，我就能撕开他们的喉咙。"] = "Just one more step, and I can tear their throats out.",
    ["只要出了村，剑就又回到了身上……怎样才能把剑带进去呢？"] = "As soon as I leave the village, the sword returns to me... How can I bring the sword inside?",
    ["只要吃下苹果，我就能好起来……"] = "As long as I eat an apple, I can get better...",
    ["只要吹响它，就能召唤他的信使。我可以通过信使给他写信，他也会回信解答我的问题。"] = "As long as I blow it, I can summon his messenger. I can write letters to him through the messenger, and he will reply to answer my questions.",
    ["只要在晚上虔诚地跪拜祂，就能得到生命的“祝福”，再也不会挨饿了。"] = "As long as you kneel and pray to Him devoutly at night, you can receive the 'blessing' of life and never go hungry again.",
    ["只要在湖边虔诚地留下愿望，就能得到女神的赠礼。"] = "As long as you sincerely leave a wish by the lakeside, you can receive a gift from the Goddess.",
    ["只要多付五倍的苏勒，您就能体验这次伟大的航行了！"] = "As long as you pay five times the Sol, you can experience this great voyage!",
    ["只要尽快把那个藏在暗处的家伙抓出来，就没什么需要担心的。"] = "As long as we catch that guy hiding in the shadows as soon as possible, there will be nothing to worry about.",
    ["只要弄对了祈求的对象就不会，如果您想放下偏见找我占卜的话，随时恭候。"] = "It won't be if you get the object of prayer right. If you want to put aside your prejudice and have me perform a divination, I am always at your service.",
    ["只要您付得起价，我也能想办法。"] = "As long as you can afford the price, I can find a way.",
    ["只要您愿意付出几枚苏勒，我就能让它显灵——它能保佑您三个月内发大财！"] = "As long as you are willing to pay a few Sol, I can make it manifest—it can bless you to make a fortune within three months!",
    ["只要感受到安提哥努斯家族后裔的气息 2-049就会变得非常激动"] = "As long as it senses the aura of a Descendant of the Antigonus Family, 2-049 will become extremely agitated.",
    ["只要我还在黑荆棘，我就会守护这里，保护这些故事，和故事里的人。"] = "As long as I am still in the Blackthorn Security Company, I will guard this place, protect these stories, and the people within them.",
    ["只要技能扫过出存在振刀玩家，则所有玩家免伤"] = "If any player performs a deflect while the skill is sweeping, all players gain damage immunity.",
    ["只要按照配方上的顺序，将材料按分量依次加入，再搅拌一下就可以了。"] = "Just follow the order on the recipe, add the ingredients one by one according to the measurements, and then stir it a little.",
    ["只要无保护接触到它，所有活着的生物都会失去全部的欲望和情绪。他们会安静地待在原地，直到生命的尽头。"] = "As long as you touch it without protection, all living creatures will lose all desire and emotion. They will stay quietly in place until the end of their lives.",
    ["只要是阳光充沛的地方就好，我的后半生，只想在轻松与闲适中度过了。"] = "As long as it's a place with plenty of sunshine, I just want to spend the rest of my life in ease and comfort.",
    ["只要爸爸真的做到，我就不生爸爸的气了。"] = "As long as Dad really does it, I won't be angry with Dad anymore.",
    ["只要献上一朵睡莲，愿望就会被仙女倾听！大家都这么说！"] = "As long as you offer a water lily, your wish will be heard by the fairy! Everyone says so!",
    ["只要相信，一定可以。"] = "As long as you believe, it will definitely happen.",
    ["只要能够破坏掉椅子的对称性，就能很快解除封印了！"] = "As long as the symmetry of the chairs can be broken, the seal can be lifted very quickly!",
    ["只要能让庄园重获生机，我愿付出一切代价！"] = "As long as I can restore vitality to the manor, I am willing to pay any price!",
    ["只触发一次"] = "Trigger only once",
    ["只需抽取百分之三的费用，就能洗掉那些不那么体面的“故事”。"] = "By just taking a three percent fee, I can wash away those less-than-decent 'stories'.",
    ["只需要付出一到两周的利息，大约两三百镑，就能获得脚踏车公司10%的股份。"] = "You only need to pay one or two weeks of interest, about two or three hundred pounds, to obtain 10% of the bicycle company's shares.",
    ["只需要付出一到两周的利息，大约两三百镑，就能获得脚踏车公司百分之十的股份。"] = "You only need to pay one or two weeks of interest, about two or three hundred pounds, to acquire ten percent of the bicycle company's shares.",
    ["只需要在杜松子酒中加入一些特殊“秘方”，就能让酒液如星空般闪耀。"] = "You only need to add some special 'secret ingredients' to the gin to make the liquid shine like a starry sky.",
    ["只需要略施小计，战争的结果就可扭转！"] = "With just a small trick, the outcome of the war can be reversed!",
    ["只靠蛮力是打不中我的哦。"] = "You won't be able to hit me with brute force alone.",
    ["叫住<h>埃德温</>"] = "Call out to <h> Edwin </>",
    ["叫住他"] = "Call out to him",
    ["叫住埃德温"] = "Call out to Edwin",
    ["叫你多管闲事，我打死你！"] = "Told you to stop meddling, I'll beat you to death!",
    ["叫卖小孩路点"] = "Hawking Child Waypoint",
    ["叫卖桌子"] = "Hawking Table",
    ["叫号"] = "Call the number",
    ["叫吧，大声叫吧，就算叫破喉咙，也不会有人——"] = "Scream, scream as loud as you can. Even if you scream until your throat breaks, no one will—",
    ["叫声很大，能吓跑胆小鬼们。"] = "The bark is loud and can scare away cowards.",
    ["叫她回去吧。"] = "Tell her to go back.",
    ["叫好的观众"] = "Cheering audience",
    ["叫妈妈酒瓶空NPC"] = "Call mom empty wine bottle NPC",
    ["叫妈妈酒瓶采集物"] = "Call Mom Wine Bottle Collectible",
    ["叫小白。"] = "It's called Snowball.",
    ["叫我出来做什么？你终于对《机械制造技术基础》感兴趣了吗？"] = "What do you want me for? Are you finally interested in \"Fundamentals of Mechanical Manufacturing Technology\"?",
    ["叫我安娜就好，你能推荐一位吗？"] = "Just call me Anna. Can you recommend one?",
    ["叫我罗珊就行。再见，新同事！"] = "Just call me Rozanne. Goodbye, new colleague!",
    ["叫早委托"] = "Wake-up call commission",
    ["叫爵士怎么样，它看起来很高傲。"] = "How about Jazz? It looks very arrogant.",
    ["叫邪恶"] = "Call Evil",
    ["叫醒"] = "Wake up",
    ["叫醒<h>库克</>"] = "Wake up <h>Cook</>",
    ["叫醒中……"] = "Waking up...",
    ["叫醒他"] = "Wake him up",
    ["叫醒小艾略特"] = "Wake Little Elliot",
    ["叫醒库克"] = "Wake up Cook",
    ["叫醒科恩黎"] = "Wake up Cohen",
    ["叫！"] = "Bark!",
    ["召唤"] = "Summon",
    ["召唤%d次"] = "Summon %d times",
    ["召唤-外观抽卡"] = "Summon - Appearance Gacha",
    ["召唤2-049"] = "Summon 2-049",
    ["召唤2个机械之眼，分布在身体两侧，被两个光束同时命中的敌人伤害有衰减。"] = "Summons 2 Mechanical Eyes, distributed on both sides of the body. Enemies hit by both beams simultaneously take reduced damage.",
    ["召唤2个齿轮器械攻击目标，被两个光束同时命中的敌人受到的伤害总量为单光束的1.4倍。"] = "Summons 2 gear mechanisms to attack the target. Enemies hit by both beams simultaneously take 1.4 times the total damage of a single beam.",
    ["召唤2只<Disable>无法选中的猩红犬魂</>，分别锁定并持续追踪一名玩家。被猩红犬魂追上后，将受到一次<Disable>高额咬击伤害</>。"] = "Summons 2 <Disable>untargetable Scarlet Hound Souls</>, which lock onto and continuously track one player each. Once caught by a Scarlet Hound Soul, the player will take a <Disable>high bite damage</>.",
    ["召唤3个仆从，做好防御准备！"] = "Summon 3 servants and prepare for defense!",
    ["召唤3个藤蔓花"] = "Summon 3 vine flowers",
    ["召唤<HighLight>1</>个神的雕像；雕像周围<HighLight>1</>格友军最大生命值提升<HighLight>10%</>、伤害提升<HighLight>8%</>；【神弃之地】棋子额外获得<HighLight>50%</>效果。准备阶段离开范围立即失效；战斗开始后离开范围仍持续<HighLight>45</>秒，同类效果不叠加。"] = "Summon <HighLight>1</> God statue; allies within <HighLight>1</> tile of the statue gain <HighLight>10%</> maximum Health and <HighLight>8%</> Damage Increase; [Forsaken Land of the Gods] pieces gain an additional <HighLight>50%</> effect. The effect is lost immediately upon leaving the range during the preparation phase; after battle starts, the effect persists for <HighLight>45</> seconds after leaving the range. Similar effects do not stack.",
    ["召唤<HighLight>1</>星绯红意志"] = "Summon <HighLight>1</>-star Crimson Will.",
    ["召唤<HighLight>2</>个神的雕像；雕像周围<HighLight>1</>格友军最大生命值提升<HighLight>18%</>、伤害提升<HighLight>14%</>；【神弃之地】棋子额外获得<HighLight>50%</>效果。准备阶段离开范围立即失效；战斗开始后离开范围仍持续<HighLight>45</>秒，同类效果不叠加。"] = "Summon <HighLight>2</> God statues; allies within <HighLight>1</> tile of the statue gain <HighLight>18%</> maximum Health and <HighLight>14%</> Damage Increase; [Forsaken Land of the Gods] pieces gain an additional <HighLight>50%</> effect. The effect is lost immediately upon leaving the range during the preparation phase; after battle starts, the effect persists for <HighLight>45</> seconds after leaving the range. Similar effects do not stack.",
    ["召唤<HighLight>2</>个神的雕像；雕像周围<HighLight>1</>格友军最大生命值提升<HighLight>30%</>、伤害提升<HighLight>22%</>；【神弃之地】棋子额外获得<HighLight>50%</>效果。准备阶段离开范围立即失效；战斗开始后离开范围仍持续<HighLight>45</>秒，同类效果不叠加。"] = "Summon <HighLight>2</> God statues; allies within <HighLight>1</> tile of the statue gain <HighLight>30%</> maximum Health and <HighLight>22%</> Damage Increase; [Forsaken Land of the Gods] pieces gain an additional <HighLight>50%</> effect. The effect is lost immediately upon leaving the range during the preparation phase; after battle starts, the effect persists for <HighLight>45</> seconds after leaving the range. Similar effects do not stack.",
    ["召唤<HighLight>2</>星绯红意志"] = "Summon <HighLight>2</>-star Crimson Will.",
    ["召唤<HighLight>3</>星绯红意志"] = "Summon <HighLight>3</>-star Crimson Will.",
    ["召唤<Yellow>%d</>次内必出神眷"] = "Summoning within <Yellow>%d</> times will guarantee a Divine Favor",
    ["召唤<Yellow>182</>次内必出神赐"] = "Guaranteed Divine Gift within <Yellow>182</> summons",
    ["召唤NPC"] = "Summon NPC",
    ["召唤NPC，填SkillLvl NpcTid"] = "Summon NPC, fill SkillLvl NpcTid",
    ["召唤“头狼”鲁珀连续发动三次爪击，每次爪击造成*d点伤害，并有50%概率使目标僵直0.3秒。召唤的8秒内使自身buffdisc(*id)"] = "Summon Luper, the Alpha Wolf, to perform three consecutive Claw Strikes, each dealing *d damage and having a 50% chance to Stun the target for 0.3 seconds. Grants yourself buffdisc(*id) for the 8 seconds the wolf is summoned.",
    ["召唤“头狼”鲁珀，攻击敌人使其僵直，并为自身附加攻击增益。"] = "Summon Luper, the Alpha Wolf, to attack enemies, causing Stun and adding an Attack buff to yourself.",
    ["召唤一个无法被锁定和攻击的神秘幻象，持续<HighLight>10</>秒。施法后获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。幻象将持续释放<HighLight>巫术</>（普通攻击）攻击敌方，每段分别造成spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)点魔法伤害，循环3次。本技能在神秘幻象持续时间内可以释放连招，与幻象互换位置，单次技能最多触发一次位置互换。\n\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Summon a Mysterious Illusion that cannot be targeted or attacked for 10 <HighLight></> seconds. Gain 20 points of Mysterious Knowledge <HighLight></> after casting. The illusion will continuously perform Witchcraft <HighLight></> (Basic Attack) to attack enemies, dealing spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) magic damage per segment, cycling 3 times. You can cast a chain skill during the Mysterious Illusion's duration to swap positions with the illusion; this position swap can be triggered at most once per skill cast. \n\n<FaintYellow> Mysterious Knowledge </>: Maximum of 100 points. Upon reaching 100 points, unlock the Finisher Skill Vortex of Knowledge <HighLight></>.",
    ["召唤一个灵体附身，当玩家使用技能时，灵体会对目标造成伤害。"] = "Summon a spirit to possess you; when the player uses a skill, the spirit deals damage to the target.",
    ["召唤一号信徒·安西娅，为目标解除控制状态，并恢复目标*d点生命。受到控制时也可以使用。"] = "Summon Believer Number One, Anthea, to remove control effects from the target and restore *d Health. Can also be used while under control.",
    ["召唤一号信徒·安西娅，为目标解除控制，恢复生命。"] = "Summon Believer Number One, Anthea, to remove control from the target and restore Health.",
    ["召唤两个虚影共同斩击。"] = "Summon two phantom shadows to slash together.",
    ["召唤中…"] = "Summoning...",
    ["召唤乌洛琉斯残影，向前方15米释放黑色湍流冲击，随后6秒内可以手动释放第二段白色湍流冲击，效果如下。\n黑色湍流：只对敌人有效，击退敌人的同时附带8秒黑色命运效果，每秒对敌人造成一定伤害，若敌人在此期间死亡，则原地产生一次爆炸对范围内敌人造成额外伤害。\n白色湍流：只对友方有效，瞬间回复一定生命值，并在未来8秒内提升移动速度和免伤效果。"] = "Summon an Ouroboros Shadow to release a Black Turbulence impact 15 meters forward. Within the next 6 seconds, you can manually release a second-stage White Turbulence impact with the following effects: \nBlack Turbulence: Only effective against enemies, Knocking them back while applying an 8-second Black Fate effect, dealing damage every second. If the enemy dies during this period, an Explosion occurs on the spot, dealing additional damage to enemies in the area. \nWhite Turbulence: Only effective against allies, instantly restoring Health and increasing movement speed and damage reduction for the next 8 seconds.",
    ["召唤乌洛琉斯残影，向前方释放黑色湍流冲击，随后6秒内可以手动释放第二段白色湍流冲击。\n黑色湍流：只对敌人有效，击退敌人同时附带持续伤害，若敌人在此期间死亡，则原地产生一次爆炸伤害。\n白色湍流：只对友方有效，瞬间回复一定生命值，并在未来8秒内提升移动速度和免伤效果。"] = "Summon an Ouroboros Shadow to unleash a Black Turbulence shockwave forward, followed by the ability to manually trigger a second Black Turbulence shockwave within 6 seconds. \nBlack Turbulence: Only effective against enemies, knocking them back while applying Continuous Damage; if an enemy dies during this period, an Explosion occurs on the spot. \nWhite Turbulence: Only effective against friendly units, instantly restoring a certain amount of Health and increasing movement speed and damage reduction for the next 8 seconds.",
    ["召唤仆从"] = "Summon Minion",
    ["召唤仪式"] = "Summoning Ritual",
    ["召唤传送门"] = "Summon portal",
    ["召唤保镖"] = "Summon Bodyguard",
    ["召唤信使"] = "Summon Messenger",
    ["召唤先祖铠甲为自己添加法阵，范围内友方获得增强。"] = "Summon Ancestor Armor to add a magic circle to yourself, granting enhancements to friendly units within range.",
    ["召唤先祖铠甲，在自己脚下召唤一个半径30米，持续<Highlight>10</>秒的法阵，使得范围内的友方buffdisc(*id)。\n先祖庇护：自己每主动治疗友方3次，在自己脚下生成先祖庇护，半径5米，持续2.5秒，每4秒最多触发一次，使得范围内的友方buffdisc(*id)。\n法阵和先祖庇护不能同时存在且同时至多存在一个先祖庇护。"] = "Summon Ancestor Armor and create a magic circle with a 30-meter radius at your feet, lasting <Highlight>10</> seconds, causing allies within the range to buffdisc(*id). \nAncestral Protection: Every time you actively heal an ally 3 times, generate Ancestral Protection at your feet with a 5-meter radius, lasting 2.5 seconds. Can be triggered at most once every 4 seconds, causing allies within the range to buffdisc(*id). \nThe magic circle and Ancestral Protection cannot exist simultaneously, and at most one Ancestral Protection can exist at a time.",
    ["召唤先祖铠甲，在自己脚下召唤一个半径30米，持续<Highlight>10</>秒的法阵，使得范围内的友方buffdisc(*id)。\n先祖庇护：自己每主动治疗友方3次，在自己脚下生成先祖庇护，半径5米，持续2.5秒，每4秒最多触发一次，使得范围内的友方buffdisc(*id)。\n法阵和先祖庇护不能同时存在且同时至多存在一个先祖庇护。\n该技能有小队冷却时间<Highlight>30</>秒。"] = "Summon Ancestral Armor, summoning a magic circle with a radius of 30 meters at your feet that lasts for <Highlight>10</> seconds, granting allies within range buffdisc(*id).\nAncestral Protection: Every time you actively heal an ally 3 times, you generate Ancestral Protection at your feet with a radius of 5 meters, lasting for 2.5 seconds, triggering at most once every 4 seconds, granting allies within range buffdisc(*id).\nThe magic circle and Ancestral Protection cannot exist simultaneously, and at most one Ancestral Protection can exist at a time.\nThis skill has a party cooldown of <Highlight>30</> seconds.",
    ["召唤先祖铠甲，在自己脚下召唤一个半径30米，持续<Highlight>10</>秒的法阵，使得范围内的同小队友方buffdisc(*id)。\n先祖庇护：自己每主动治疗友方3次，在自己脚下生成先祖庇护，半径5米，持续2.5秒，每4秒最多触发一次，使得范围内的友方buffdisc(*id)。\n法阵和先祖庇护不能同时存在且同时至多存在一个先祖庇护。\n该技能有小队冷却时间<Highlight>30</>秒。"] = "Summon Ancestral Armor, summoning a magic circle with a radius of 30 meters at your feet that lasts for <Highlight>10</> seconds, granting party allies within range buffdisc(*id).\nAncestral Protection: Every time you actively heal an ally 3 times, you generate Ancestral Protection at your feet with a radius of 5 meters, lasting for 2.5 seconds, triggering at most once every 4 seconds, granting allies within range buffdisc(*id).\nThe magic circle and Ancestral Protection cannot exist simultaneously, and at most one Ancestral Protection can exist at a time.\nThis skill has a party cooldown of <Highlight>30</> seconds.",
    ["召唤出了信使"] = "Summoned the messenger.",
    ["召唤剥面人，发射弹射子弹，对友方和敌方造成不同的效果。"] = "Summon a Face-Ripper to fire ricocheting bullets, causing different effects on friendly and enemy units.",
    ["召唤剥面人，对范围内敌人发射弹射子弹，子弹会在附近的友方和敌方之间弹射，命中敌方时造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害，命中友方时buffdisc(*id)。"] = "Summon a Face-Ripper to fire ricocheting bullets at enemies in range. The bullets bounce between nearby friendly and enemy units, dealing bulletdisc(*id) damage when hitting enemies and applying buffdisc(*id) when hitting friendly units.",
    ["召唤友方木桩怪"] = "Summon friendly training dummy monster.",
    ["召唤叹息之种中…"] = "Summoning Seed of Sighs...",
    ["召唤圣光强化自身，施法时立刻获得2点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下立刻获得3点<HighLight>太阳能量</>），随后每秒获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>，持续5秒；自身物理增伤提高*d**，持续*f秒。\n\n<FaintYellow>太阳能量</>：最多持有5点，获取太阳能量以解锁与强化<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>。"] = "Summons Holy Light to strengthen yourself. Gain 2 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> immediately upon casting (gain 3 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> immediately in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state), then gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> per second for 5 seconds; your physical damage boost is increased by *d** for *f seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow> Solar Energy </>: Hold up to 5 points. Obtain Solar Energy to unlock and strengthen <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>.",
    ["召唤圣光强化自身，获得大量太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）和增伤效果。"] = "Summon Holy Light to strengthen oneself, gaining a large amount of Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear) and a Damage Boost effect.",
    ["召唤大师"] = "Summoning Master",
    ["召唤子爵夫人攻击目标。\n若目标为玩家：子爵夫人会对目标造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害并添加幽魂附身10秒，附身期间增加6%自身对目标的伤害。若10秒内该目标死亡，则幽魂会另外随机寻找15米内一个敌方玩家造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害并附身，最多额外附身1次。\n若目标为怪物：则幽魂会对怪物造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害2次，并附身15秒，附身期间增加6%自身对该怪物的伤害。"] = "Summon the Viscountess to attack the target. \nIf the target is a player: The Viscountess deals bulletdisc(*id) damage and applies Ghost Possession for 10 seconds, increasing your damage to the target by 6% during possession. If the target dies within 10 seconds, the ghost will randomly seek another enemy player within 15 meters to deal bulletdisc(*id) damage and possess them, up to 1 additional possession. \nIf the target is a monster: The ghost deals bulletdisc(*id) damage to the monster twice and possesses it for 15 seconds, increasing your damage to the monster by 6% during possession.",
    ["召唤子爵夫人攻击目标。\n若目标为玩家：对目标造成一次伤害并添加幽魂附身，期间自身对目标伤害提升。若一段时间内该目标死亡则幽魂会寻找附近另外一个敌方玩家附身。\n若目标为怪物：则幽魂会对怪物额外造成伤害并附身，期间增加自身对该怪物的伤害。"] = "Summon a Viscountess to attack the target. \nIf the target is a player: Deals damage once and applies Ghostly Soul Claim; during this time, your damage dealt to the target is increased. If the target dies within a certain period, the ghost will seek out another nearby enemy player to possess. \nIf the target is a monster: The ghost deals additional damage to the monster and possesses it, increasing your damage dealt to that monster during the duration.⟦",
    ["召唤封印物"] = "Summon Sealed Artifact",
    ["召唤小怪提示"] = "Summon Minion Prompt",
    ["召唤小矮人"] = "Summon Dwarf",
    ["召唤巨人分身猛击地面，造成范围伤害。"] = "Summon a giant projection to slam the ground, dealing area damage.",
    ["召唤巨人虚影对前方小范围内敌方造成共计sum(*d+*d)点物理伤害，对命中的敌方玩家附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。施法后自身获得4枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，同时每<HighLight>2</>秒获得<HighLight>1</>枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，持续6秒。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。"] = "Summon a giant phantom to deal a total of sum(*d+*d) physical damage to enemies in a small area in front, applying Healing Reduction <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"></> for *f seconds to hit enemy players, calculated as mul(*d**,*d). After casting, gain 4 Twilight Marks <HighLight></>, and gain 1 <HighLight></> Twilight Mark <HighLight></> every 2 <HighLight></> seconds for 6 seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow> Twilight Marks </>\n strengthen the Finisher Skill <HighLight></> and Angry Slam <HighLight></>, up to a maximum of 6.",
    ["召唤巨人虚影猛击地面，造成大量物理伤害。"] = "Summon a giant phantom shadow to slam the ground, dealing massive physical damage.",
    ["召唤幻影骑兵，随后向前进行冲锋，造成大量伤害。"] = "Summon phantom cavalry, then charge forward to deal massive damage.",
    ["召唤幽魂"] = "Summon Wraith",
    ["召唤异化猎犬，以锁定目标为基准点进行跃击，造成*d点伤害并击飞。"] = "Summon an Alienated Hound to leap at the locked target, dealing *d damage and Knockup.",
    ["召唤异化猎犬，向附近目标进行跃击造成高额伤害并击飞。"] = "Summon an Alienated Hound to leap at nearby targets, dealing high damage and Knockup.",
    ["召唤怪物"] = "Summon Monster",
    ["召唤手臂怪CS"] = "Summon arm monster CS",
    ["召唤旋风"] = "Summon Whirlwind",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶向前方直线区域随机释放火焰吐息或者冰霜吐息。\n火焰吐息：对路径上的敌方造成*d点伤害，并对敌方玩家附加*d秒<HighLight>68%</>的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"10\">重伤</>。\n冰霜吐息：对路径上的敌方造成*d点伤害，并有70%概率使敌方buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to randomly unleash either Ice Flame Breath or Frost Breath in a straight line ahead. \nIce Flame Breath: Deals *d damage to enemies in its path and inflicts <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"10\">Grievous Injury</> for <HighLight>68%</> of *d seconds. \nFrost Breath: Deals *d damage to enemies in its path and has a 70% chance to apply buffdisc(*id) to the enemy for *f seconds.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶来释放奇迹牌雨，对目标4.5米范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害，同时以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>范围中心的敌方0.8秒，最多<HighLight>眩晕</>2人。"] = "Summons a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release a Miracle Card Rain, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) damage to enemies within a 4.5-meter radius of the target, while simultaneously <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">stunning</> enemies at the center of the area for 0.8 seconds with a base probability of *f**, stunning up to <HighLight>2</> people.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放回旋斩击，对路径上的敌方造成伤害并<HighLight>击退</>。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash a Spinning Slash, dealing damage to enemies in its path and <HighLight>Knockback</>.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放回旋斩击，对路径上的敌方造成伤害并击退。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash a Spinning Slash, dealing damage to enemies in its path and Knockback.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放奇迹牌雨，对目标范围内敌方造成伤害，同时眩晕范围中心的敌方。"] = "Summon the marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release Miracle Card Rain, dealing damage to enemies within the target range while stunning those at the center.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放日冕裁决，挥出剑气对前方范围内的敌人造成*d点伤害，随后推出剑气对路径上的敌人造成*d点伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Corona Verdict, swinging a sword beam that deals *d damage to enemies in a range in front, followed by a thrusting sword beam that deals *d damage to enemies in its path.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放日冕裁决，挥出剑气对前方范围内的敌人造成伤害，随后推出剑气对路径上的敌人造成伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Corona Verdict, swinging a sword beam that deals damage to enemies in a range in front, followed by a thrusting sword beam that deals damage to enemies in its path.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放日暮飓风，持续打击秘偶周身敌方造成伤害和减速。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash a Sunset Hurricane, continuously striking enemies around the marionette to deal damage and apply Slow.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放星云斩击，对目标4米范围内敌方造成*d点伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Nebula Slash, dealing *d damage to enemies within a 4-meter radius of the target.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放星云斩击，对目标范围内敌方造成伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Nebula Slash, dealing damage to enemies within the target range.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放星痕技能，展开星门攻击自身前方范围内的敌人。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash the Star Trace skill, deploying a Star Gate to attack enemies in a range in front of it.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放星痕技能，展开星门攻击自身前方范围内的敌人。释放时若自身未拥有<HighLight>秘法能量</>，则获得<HighLight>秘法能量</>，持续70秒。若拥有<HighLight>秘法能量</>，则会额外展开一个星门并刷新<HighLight>秘法能量</>的持续时间。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash the Star Trace skill, deploying a Star Gate to attack enemies in a range in front of it. If you do not possess <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> upon casting, you gain <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> for 70 seconds. If you already possess <HighLight>Arcane Energy</>, an additional Star Gate is deployed and the duration of <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> is refreshed.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放烈阳颂歌，对自身12米范围内的敌方造成*d点伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Solar Anthem, dealing *d damage to enemies within a 12-meter radius of yourself.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放烈阳颂歌，造成范围伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Solar Anthem, dealing area damage.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放窥秘之眼，移除秘偶周身范围内敌方部分护盾，并造成伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Eyes of Mystery Prying, removing a portion of the Shields of enemies within the marionette's radius and dealing damage.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶随机释放火焰吐息或者冰霜吐息。\n火焰吐息：对路径上的敌方造成伤害并附加重伤。\n冰霜吐息：对路径上的敌方造成伤害并附加减速。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to randomly unleash either Flame Breath or Frost Breath. \nFlame Breath: Deals damage to enemies in its path and applies Grievous Injury. \nFrost Breath: Deals damage to enemies in its path and applies Slow.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放奇迹牌雨，对目标4.5米范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害，同时以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>范围中心的敌方0.8秒，最多<HighLight>眩晕</>2人。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release Miracle Card Rain, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) damage to enemies within 4.5 meters of the target, with a base probability of *f** to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">Stun</> enemies at the center of the area for 0.8 seconds, up to <HighLight>Stun</> 2 people.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放惩戒，对秘偶周身4米范围内的敌方造成*d点伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release Punishment, dealing *d damage to enemies within 4 meters of the marionette.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放惩戒，对秘偶周身范围内的敌方造成伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Punishment, dealing damage to enemies within the marionette's radius.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放放逐，对目标5米范围内敌方造成<HighLight>5</>次*d点伤害，随后<HighLight>终结一击</>造成*d点伤害。攻击怪物时，额外附加向中心的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\" color=\"#f4a067\">拖拽</>效果。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to cast Exile, dealing <HighLight>5</> instances of *d damage to enemies within a 5-meter radius of the target, followed by a <HighLight>Finish</> that deals *d damage. When attacking monsters, an additional <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\" color=\"#f4a067\">Pull</> effect towards the center is applied.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放放逐，对目标范围内敌人持续造成伤害。对怪物额外造成聚拢效果。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Exile, continuously dealing damage to enemies within the target range. Applies an additional gathering effect to monsters.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放日暮飓风，持续打击秘偶周身4.5米范围内敌方，每<Highlight>0.4</>秒对周身范围内敌方造成*d点伤害与1.2秒<Highlight>25%</>减速，持续<Highlight>5</>秒。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release a Sunset Hurricane, continuously striking enemies within 4.5 meters of the marionette. Every <Highlight>0.4</> seconds, it deals *d damage and applies a 1.2-second <Highlight>25%</> Slow to enemies in the area, lasting <Highlight>5</> seconds.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放梦境分析，创建半径6米的领域，持续治疗领域范围内友方，每秒回复友方*d点生命，持续<HighLight>6</>秒。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release Dream Analysis, creating a domain with a 6-meter radius that continuously heals allies within the domain, restoring *d Health per second for <HighLight>6</> seconds.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放梦境分析，创建祥和的梦境领域，持续回复领域中友方生命值。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash Dream Analysis, creating a peaceful Dream Realm that continuously restores the Health of friendly units within the area.",
    ["召唤星之虫幻化的秘偶来释放窥秘之眼，移除秘偶周身范围内敌方spellfielddisc(*id)点护盾，并造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Star Worm to release Eyes of Mystery Prying, removing spellfielddisc(*id) shield from enemies within the marionette's range and dealing spellfielddisc(*id) damage.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼对目标造成伤害和眩晕。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage to deal damage and stun the target.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼对目标造成伤害和眩晕并获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。可被技能知识逐人强化，控制变为范围控制。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage to deal damage and stun the target, gaining mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills). Can be strengthened by the Knowledge Pursuit skill, turning the control into area control.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼对锁定目标造成*d点魔法伤害和<HighLight>69%</>基础概率的<HighLight>1.71</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>。施法后获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。自身拥有<HighLight>知识灌注</>时，本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>：改为对锁定目标范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害、<HighLight>86%</>基础概率的<HighLight>1.71</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>和<HighLight>86%</>基础概率的<HighLight>50%</>的减速，对锁定目标额外施加<HighLight>69%</>基础概率的<HighLight>1.71</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>。\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage to deal *d magic damage to the locked target with a 69% <HighLight></> base probability of Stun <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\"></> for 1.71 <HighLight></> seconds. Gain 20 points of Mysterious Knowledge <HighLight></> after casting. When you possess Knowledge Infusion <HighLight></>, this skill gains Strengthening <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Strengthening </>: Instead deals spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies within the locked target's range, with an 86% <HighLight></> base probability of Imprisonment <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\"></> for 1.71 <HighLight></> seconds and an 86% <HighLight></> base probability of 50% <HighLight></> Slow, and applies an additional 69% <HighLight></> base probability of Stun <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\"></> for 1.71 <HighLight></> seconds to the locked target. \n<FaintYellow> Mysterious Knowledge </>: Maximum of 100 points. Upon reaching 100 points, unlock the Finisher Skill Vortex of Knowledge <HighLight></>.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼对锁定目标造成{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}点魔法伤害和<HighLight>100%</>基础概率的<HighLight>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?1.25}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?1.5}</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage to deal {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d} magic damage to the locked target and apply a <HighLight> 100% </> base chance of <HighLight>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?1.25}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?1.5}</> Stun for <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\"> seconds</>.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼攻击范围内目标并造成禁锢、减速，对锁定目标额外造成眩晕。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage to attack targets in range, causing Imprisonment and Slow, and additional Stun to locked targets.",
    ["召唤星光囚笼，对锁定目标范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害、<HighLight>44%</>基础概率的<HighLight>1.1</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>和<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">减速</>，对锁定目标额外施加<HighLight>69%</>基础概率的<HighLight>1.71</>秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>。"] = "Summon a Starlight Cage, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies within the locked target range, with a <HighLight>44%</> base probability of <HighLight>1.1</> seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Imprisonment</> and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Slow</>, and an additional <HighLight>69%</> base probability of <HighLight>1.71</> seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">Stun</> to the locked target.",
    ["召唤星辰动画"] = "Summon stars animation",
