    ["召唤物无法出售！"] = "Summoned creatures cannot be sold!",
    ["召唤物无法放置到备战区！"] = "Summoned creatures cannot be placed in the preparation area!",
    ["召唤物无法穿戴装备！"] = "Summoned creatures cannot wear equipment!",
    ["召唤物的表现，获得buff时创生光环"] = "Minion performance, creation aura when gaining buff",
    ["召唤特效1"] = "Summoning Effect 1",
    ["召唤特效2"] = "Summon Effect 2",
    ["召唤的幻影数量提升至6个。"] = "Number of summoned phantoms increased to 6.",
    ["召唤的超凡生物已被击杀。"] = "The summoned Beyonder creature has been killed.",
    ["召唤的通灵巨兽增加到3只，各额外造成50%伤害。"] = "The number of summoned Giant Dragons increases to 3, each dealing an additional 50% damage.",
    ["召唤神国降临。"] = "Summon the Descent of Divine Kingdom.",
    ["召唤秘偶"] = "Summon Marionette",
    ["召唤空想蝴蝶附身目标，buffdisc(*id)，持续6秒。"] = "Summon an Imaginary Butterfly to possess the target, granting buffdisc(*id) for 6 seconds.",
    ["召唤空想蝴蝶，持续治疗目标。"] = "Summon an Imaginary Butterfly to continuously heal the target.",
    ["召唤绯红意志·第<HighLight>4</>形态"] = "Summon Crimson Will, Form <HighLight>4</>",
    ["召唤者"] = "Summoner",
    ["召唤者："] = "Summoner:",
    ["召唤获得"] = "Obtained via Summoning",
    ["召唤西尔维娅灵体附身，持续30秒。附身期间，buffdisc(*id)造成bulletdisc(*id)伤害，每秒可触发1次，最多触发7次。"] = "Summon Sylvia's spirit to possess you, lasting 30 seconds. During possession, buffdisc(*id) deals bulletdisc(*id) damage, which can be triggered once per second, up to 7 times.",
    ["召唤诡秘之境的历史投影，操纵所有敌人的灵体之线，将敌人向中心牵引，并持续造成伤害，随后终结一击造成大量伤害并击飞敌人。自身根据获取的前一张卡牌类型获得一张相同的卡牌（用于解锁终结技能）和对应的额外效果。"] = "Summon a historical projection of the Realm of Mysteries to manipulate the spirit body threads of all enemies, pulling them toward the center while dealing continuous damage, followed by a finisher that deals massive damage and knockup. You gain a card identical to the one previously obtained (used to unlock Finisher Skills) along with corresponding additional effects.",
    ["召唤诡秘之境的历史投影，操纵目标敌人的灵体之线，将目标减速并滞涩范围内敌人，对范围内敌人持续造成伤害，随后终结一击造成大量伤害并击飞怪物目标，眩晕玩家目标。自身根据获取的前一张卡牌类型获得一张相同的卡牌（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Summon a historical projection of the Realm of Mysteries to manipulate the spirit body threads of target enemies. This slows and stagnates enemies within range, dealing continuous damage, followed by a finisher that deals massive damage and knockup to monster targets, or stuns player targets. You gain a card identical to the one previously obtained (used to unlock Finisher Skills).",
    ["召唤诡秘之境的历史投影，操纵目标敌人的灵体之线，滞涩范围内敌人，对范围内敌人持续造成伤害，随后终结一击造成大量伤害并击飞怪物目标，眩晕玩家目标。"] = "Summon a historical projection of the Realm of Mysteries, manipulate the spirit body threads of target enemies, stagnate enemies within range, continuously deal damage to them, and then deliver a finishing blow that deals massive damage and knocks up monster targets, while stunning player targets.",
    ["召唤钻头保护自己，期间获得霸体和buffdisc(*id)，受到攻击时对攻击者造成1秒20%减速，持续<Highlight>4</>秒。"] = "Summon a Drill to protect yourself, gaining Super Armor and buffdisc(*id) during the duration. When attacked, it inflicts a 20% Slow on the attacker for 1 second, lasting for <Highlight>4</> seconds.",
    ["召唤钻头保护自己，获得霸体和护盾，并使攻击者减速。"] = "Summon a Drill to protect yourself, gaining Super Armor and a Shield, and slowing attackers.",
    ["召唤铁壁骑士，使周围队友buffdisc(*id)，持续8秒。"] = "Summon an Iron Wall Knight to grant surrounding teammates buffdisc(*id) for 8 seconds.",
    ["召唤铁壁骑士，给周围队友添加护盾。"] = "Summon an Iron Wall Knight to add a Shield to surrounding teammates.",
    ["召唤随从"] = "Summon Minion",
    ["召唤魔法骑士祝福自身，buffdisc(*id)，持续10秒。"] = "Summon a Magic Knight to bless yourself with buffdisc(*id) for 10 seconds.",
    ["召唤魔法骑士，持续恢复自身生命并获得攻击和穿刺的提升效果。"] = "Summon a Magic Knight to continuously restore your own Health and gain Attack and Pierce bonuses.",
    ["召唤齿轮器械，对前方敌人造成范围伤害。"] = "Summon gear machinery to deal area damage to enemies in front.",
    ["召怪"] = "Summon monster",
    ["召怪触发区"] = "Monster Spawn Trigger Area",
    ["召集"] = "Rally",
    ["召集传送"] = "Summon Teleport",
    ["召集前往"] = "Summon to Go",
    ["召集团员集合到指挥附近"] = "Summon members to gather near the commander",
    ["召集处于冷却中，请%s秒后再操作。"] = "Summoning is on cooldown. Please wait %s seconds before attempting again.",
    ["召集我方全体成员传送至集结点"] = "Summon all friendly members to the rally point",
    ["召集跟随"] = "Summon to follow",
    ["叮叮叮，特别互动！轮到你们登台表演了！"] = "Ding ding ding, special interaction! It's your turn to take the stage!",
    ["叮叮叮，观众不开心的话，我不介意再加演一场！"] = "Ding ding ding, if the audience isn't happy, I don't mind putting on another show!",
    ["叮咚，叮咚，叮咚……"] = "Ding-dong, ding-dong, ding-dong...",
    ["叮铃铃——（风铃声渐响）"] = "Jingle-ling— (sound of wind chimes grows louder)",
    ["可"] = "Ke",
    ["可、可他是真心对我好……"] = "But, but he is genuinely good to me...",
    ["可、可是……那你怎么可能真的分辨出来？"] = "B-but... then how could you possibly tell the difference?",
    ["可、可是……那你怎么可能真的分辨出来？ "] = "B-but... then how could you really tell them apart?",
    ["可、可是，我总是梦到赛斯，他告诉我，斐乐不是好人，让我不要相信他……"] = "B-but, I always dream of Seth, he tells me that Phil is not a good person, and tells me not to trust him...",
    ["可一周前它丢了，有人看见它跑进了火车站。"] = "But it went missing a week ago, and someone saw it run into the train station.",
    ["可不。那一窝黄鼬我盯很久了，总在半夜溜出来吓唬人。当时我好不容易刨到它们的窝，你突然从背后出来，搞得和它们叫来的亲戚似的。"] = "You're telling me. I'd been eyeing that den of weasels for a long time; they were always sneaking out in the middle of the night to scare people. I'd just managed to dig out their nest when you suddenly appeared behind me, making it look like you were some relative they'd called over.",
    ["可不仅仅是场地，他也庇护着这里。"] = "It's not just the venue; he also provides shelter here.",
    ["可不会\r\n这么"] = "It won't be like this",
    ["可不填, 默认全部销毁"] = "Can be left blank; defaults to destroying all.",
    ["可不填，全屏筛选；大于0则销毁半径范围内的创生物"] = "Can be left blank for full-screen filtering; if greater than 0, destroy creatures within the radius.",
    ["可不是吗！她们又哭又笑地聊了一夜，我就听见斯嘉丽大喊了一声“那就让山姆见鬼去吧！”，和梅兰妮一起坐上马车离开了。"] = "You bet! They chatted all night, crying and laughing. I just heard Scarlett shout, 'Then let Sam go to hell!', and she left with Melanie in a carriage.",
    ["可不是吗，一起吃个饭吧"] = "Isn't that right? Let's have a meal together.",
    ["可不是吗，他现在啊越来越有队长样了。"] = "Isn't that so? He has more and more of a captain's demeanor now.",
    ["可不是吗？然后长大的年轻人们带着自己的伴侣，自己的孩子又来到我的面包房。"] = "Isn't that so? And then the young people who grew up bring their partners, and their children come to my bakery again.",
    ["可不是，编个笼子可难啦，笼子里还要放好迷鼠药，否则万一抓到了生性爆裂的老鼠给老爷们的狗咬坏了，我们可赔不起的！"] = "You're telling me, making a cage is hard work! And you have to put the right rat poison in it, otherwise, if you catch a particularly vicious rat and it bites the masters' dogs, we won't be able to afford the compensation!",
    ["可不是，见着板车都绕着走。"] = "Indeed, he even walks around the handcarts now.",
    ["可不是？比某些赖着不走的家伙懂规矩多啦。"] = "Aren't they? They know the rules better than some guys who refuse to leave.",
    ["可不止如此，{{先生|女士}}。拜亚姆可是以香料、妓院、赌场闻名于海。赌博这东西一旦碰了，就很难再脱身了。"] = "It's more than just that, {{ Mr. | Ms. } }. Bayam is famous across the sea for its spices, brothels, and casinos. Once you get involved in gambling, it's very hard to get out.",
    ["可不要觉得乐手沉默！他的小提琴总是代替他说话。"] = "Don't think the musician is silent! His violin always speaks for him.",
    ["可两张二等座车票要花整整三十镑！这和我两周的薪水一样多！"] = "But two second-class tickets cost a whole thirty pounds! That's as much as my salary for two weeks!",
    ["可为众神之巅淘汰赛中的队伍进行助力。"] = "Can be used to support teams in the Peak of the Gods tournament.",
    ["可乐果提取物"] = "Cola fruit extract",
