    ["可从常规卡池和定向卡池获得新的伙伴或封印物。"] = "New partners or Sealed Artifacts can be obtained from standard and rate-up banners.",
    ["可从当前传送点或复活点中，自行选择1个点位进行复活"] = "You can choose one point from the current teleportation point or resurrection point to resurrect",
    ["可他怎么变成这样了？这……还是人类吗？"] = "But how did he become like this? Is this... still human?",
    ["可他是个男人。"] = "But he is a man.",
    ["可他是残疾人，每天坐在桥头骂天上的鸟。"] = "But he is disabled, sitting at the bridgehead every day cursing the birds in the sky.",
    ["可以……帮我喝药吗？我起不来……"] = "Could you... help me drink the potion? I can't get up...",
    ["可以。"] = "Very well.",
    ["可以。接下来两天，你尽量不要跟其它人待在同一个房间。"] = "Very well. For the next two days, try not to stay in the same room as others.",
    ["可以不填，不填默认0.1s"] = "Can be left blank, defaults to 0.1s.",
    ["可以不填，不填默认不消耗，对应状态如果要消耗体力需要程序接入，否则不生效，需要与程序确认"] = "Can be left blank; if left blank, it defaults to no consumption. If the corresponding state requires stamina consumption, it needs to be connected by programming, otherwise it will not take effect; confirm with programming.",
    ["可以为负数"] = "Can be a negative number.",
    ["可以了老头 多谢"] = "That's enough, old man. Thanks.",
    ["可以了，但你想帮他们写更长的信，还需要再掌握一百个单词。"] = "You can, but if you want to help them write longer letters, you need to master another hundred words.",
    ["可以介绍一下衣帽店吗？"] = "Can you introduce the clothing store?",
    ["可以伪装成任何人，但只能是自己。"] = "Can disguise as anyone, but can only be oneself.",
    ["可以使用所选方案的所有配置来覆盖当前方案的配置，注意此操作不可逆，请确保要替换的方案是您希望被替换的方案。"] = "You can use all configurations of the selected scheme to overwrite the current scheme's configuration. Note that this operation is irreversible; please ensure that the scheme you want to replace is the one you intend to replace.",
    ["可以使用抽卡以及分解伙伴碎片获得的代币兑换商店中的商品。"] = "You can use tokens obtained from gacha and dismantling partner fragments to exchange for items in the shop.",
    ["可以便宜点吗？我需要更公道的价格。"] = "Can you make it cheaper? I need a fairer price.",
    ["可以修表吗"] = "Can you repair watches?",
    ["可以充值购买金镑。"] = "You can top up to purchase Pounds.",
    ["可以兑换PVP相关外观"] = "Can be used to redeem PVP-related cosmetics.",
    ["可以再次查看背包和场景的线索，做好准备就开始推理吧。"] = "You can check the clues in your Inventory and the scene again. Once you are prepared, start your deduction.",
    ["可以再试试他们家的柠檬布丁。"] = "You can try their lemon pudding again.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣1000金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 1,000 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣100金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 100 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣300金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 300 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣300金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。第一赛季内有效。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 300 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item. Valid within the first season.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣500金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 500 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭代金券在部分商城外观商品结算时抵扣60金镑，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used as a voucher to deduct 60 Pounds when settling certain Mall appearance items. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭本券在<Highlight>商城直售外观商品</>结算时抵扣10%单价，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "Can be used with this voucher to deduct 10% of the unit price when settling <Highlight>Mall direct-sale appearance items</>. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used per item.",
    ["可以凭本券在<Highlight>商城直售外观商品</>结算时抵扣25%单价，单件商品最多使用2张。"] = "This voucher can be used to deduct 25% of the unit price when settling <Highlight>direct-sale cosmetic items in the shop</>. A maximum of 2 vouchers can be used for a single item.",
    ["可以凭本券在<Highlight>商城直售外观商品</>结算时抵扣50%单价，单件商品最多使用1张。"] = "Can be used with this voucher to deduct 50% of the unit price when settling <Highlight>Mall direct-sale appearance items</>. A maximum of 1 voucher can be used per item.",
    ["可以删除"] = "Can be Deleted",
    ["可以利用铜镜或咒语，进入隐藏的“镜中国度”，找到并救出罗珊和失踪市民。"] = "You can use the bronze mirror or the incantation to enter the hidden \"Mirror Realm\" to find and rescue Rosanne and the missing citizens.",
    ["可以到达廷根的任何地方，还为您提供免费的讲解服务！"] = "It can take you anywhere in Tingen, and we also provide free guide services!",
    ["可以同时勾选多个想要粘贴的方案"] = "You can select multiple loadouts to paste at once",
    ["可以向您咨询一下这里的条件吗？"] = "Could I ask you about the conditions here?",
    ["可以吗？"] = "Is that okay?",
    ["可以吸收*d点伤害的护盾"] = "Gain a Shield that can absorb *d damage",
    ["可以吸收21%最大生命值伤害的护盾"] = "Shield that can absorb 21% of max health in damage",
    ["可以吸收30%最大生命值伤害的护盾"] = "Shield that can absorb 30% of max health in damage",
    ["可以吸收39%最大生命值伤害的护盾"] = "Shield that can absorb 39% of max health in damage",
    ["可以告诉我发生了什么吗？"] = "Can you tell me what happened?",
    ["可以告诉我是怎么一回事吗，女士？"] = "Can you tell me what happened, Madam?",
    ["可以在召唤-星灵奇装中使用，获得限定外观。"] = "Can be used in Summon-Star Spirit Costume to obtain limited appearances.",
    ["可以在召唤-灵界焕容中使用，获得限定外观。"] = "Can be used in Summon-Spirit World Transformation to obtain limited appearances.",
    ["可以在名流之殿中拍照留念。"] = "You can take photos as souvenirs in the Hall of Fame.",
    ["可以在墓园商人处购买"] = "Can be purchased from the Cemetery Merchant.",
    ["可以在此快捷购买未拥有的时装"] = "You can quickly purchase unowned outfits here.",
    ["可以填:LightHit,HitBack,HitDown,HitFloat,HitFly,HitStiff, HitDrag, "] = "Can fill in: LightHit, HitBack, HitDown, HitFloat, HitFly, HitStiff, HitDrag.",
    ["可以填充到攻击/特化封印物上，封印物装配时生效，为角色提供额外属性。"] = "Can be filled into attack/specialized Sealed Artifacts. Effective when the Sealed Artifact is equipped, providing additional attributes to the character.",
    ["可以填充到防御/特化封印物上，封印物装配时生效，为角色提供额外属性。"] = "Can be filled into defense/specialized Sealed Artifacts. Effective when the Sealed Artifact is equipped, providing additional attributes to the character.",
    ["可以对正在竞拍的物品出价或对等待竞拍的物品预出价，竞拍货币由其他成员平均分配。"] = "You can place bids on items currently up for auction or pre-bid on items waiting to be auctioned. Auction currency is distributed equally among other members.",
    ["可以将猎物碎片提交给我，我将提供给你丰厚的报酬。"] = "You can submit fragments of the prey to me, and I will provide you with a generous reward.",
    ["可以尝尝"] = "Can taste it",
    ["可以带宠物就餐吗？"] = "Are pets allowed to dine here?",
    ["可以帮我修表吗？"] = "Can you help me repair a watch?",
    ["可以帮我再加两个球吗？"] = "Can you help me add two more balls?",
    ["可以开始仪式了。"] = "The ritual can begin.",
    ["可以引诱狼人<Highlight>冲撞炸弹</>。"] = "You can lure the Werewolf to <Highlight>charge into the bomb</>.",
    ["可以彰显身份和力量的华丽战斧，可以用于处理那些滋长过头的敌人，也能顺便帮您保持庭院整洁。"] = "A gorgeous battle axe that can demonstrate status and strength; it can be used to deal with those overgrown enemies, and it can also help you keep your garden tidy.",
    ["可以打断"] = "Can Interrupt",
    ["可以把书给我吗？它会带来危险。"] = "Can you give me the book? It will bring danger.",
    ["可以把我送到列车站吗？我……快赶不上车了。"] = "Can you take me to the train station? I... I'm about to miss the train.",
    ["可以抵御少部分荒芜降临伤害"] = "Can resist a small amount of Desolation Descent damage",
    ["可以抵御部分荒芜降临伤害"] = "Can resist some Desolation Descent damage",
    ["可以接受"] = "Acceptable",
    ["可以提供乘骑的subtype参数来检查是否处于指定的乘骑，不处于任一指定的subtype乘骑，返回false。如果不填subtype，则只要处于任意乘骑状态就返回true"] = "You can provide a mount subtype parameter to check if you are on a specified mount; if not on any of the specified subtypes, it returns false. If no subtype is filled, it returns true as long as you are in any mount state.",
    ["可以提供乘骑的subtype参数来检查是否处于指定的乘骑，不处于任一指定的subtype乘骑，返回false。如果不填subtype，则只要处于任意乘骑状态就返回true，（subtype是 3C/Mount_坐骑表.xlsx 的 Mount_坐骑 sheet的subtype列）"] = "You can provide a mount subtype parameter to check if you are on a specified mount; if not on any of the specified subtypes, it returns false. If no subtype is filled, it returns true as long as you are in any mount state (subtype is the subtype column of the Mount sheet in 3C/Mount_MountTable.xlsx).",
    ["可以提供同乘的subtype参数来检查是否处于指定的同乘，不处于任一指定的subtype同乘，返回false。如果不填subtype，则只要处于任意同乘状态就返回true"] = "Can provide the subtype parameter of Ride Along to check if you are in the specified Ride Along; if not in any specified subtype Ride Along, return false. If subtype is not filled, return true as long as you are in any Ride Along state",
    ["可以提供同乘的subtype参数来检查是否处于指定的同乘，不处于任一指定的subtype同乘，返回false。如果不填subtype，则只要处于任意同乘状态就返回true，（subtype是 3C/Mount_坐骑表.xlsx 的 Mount_坐骑 sheet的subtype列）"] = "You can provide a Ride Along subtype parameter to check if you are in a specified Ride Along state; if not in any of the specified subtypes, it returns false. If no subtype is filled, it returns true as long as you are in any Ride Along state (subtype is the 'subtype' column in the 'Mount' sheet of 3C/Mount_Table.xlsx).",
    ["可以摆花"] = "Can place flowers",
    ["可以查看各目标玩法的队伍/团队，并选择快速加入"] = "You can view the teams/groups for each target mode and choose to join quickly.",
    ["可以根据占卜的道具，指引其主人的位置方向。"] = "Can guide the direction of its owner based on the divination tool.",
    ["可以点击一键聚合进行快速聚合。"] = "You can click One-Click Aggregation for rapid aggregation.",
    ["可以独自<TipsHighlight>开启“名流之殿”</>，邀请<TipsHighlight>好友</>参与聚会。或者定时<TipsHighlight>开启“名流盛宴”活动</>，邀请<TipsHighlight>全服玩家</>共同狂欢。"] = "You can open the \"Hall of Fame\" </> alone <TipsHighlight> and invite <TipsHighlight> friends </> to join the party. Or, schedule the \"Celebrity Feast\" event </> at <TipsHighlight> to invite <TipsHighlight> all-server players </> to revel together.",
    ["可以现在给我吗？"] = "Can you give it to me now?",
    ["可以的话希望您不要将这次的经历说出去……"] = "If possible, I hope you won't talk about this experience...",
    ["可以的话，请让我来为他善后……我想和他单独待一会儿……"] = "If possible, please let me handle the aftermath for him... I want to be alone with him for a while...",
    ["可以的，只要我还能当主角，今晚见。 "] = "It's okay, as long as I can still be the protagonist, see you tonight.",
    ["可以睁眼了。"] = "You can open your eyes now.",
    ["可以给我果子吗？"] = "Can you give me some fruit?",
    ["可以给我点提示吗？"] = "Can you give me some hints?",
    ["可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "Can remove one control effect; upon triggering, movement speed increases by 25% for 2 seconds.",
    ["可以让我的劳拉一起进去用餐吗？"] = "Can I let my Laura come in to dine with me?",
    ["可以让自身以及指定目标进入完美闪避时缓效果"] = "Allows self and specified targets to enter a perfect dodge slow-motion effect.",
    ["可以讲讲基础医学常识，让大家认清常见病的应对方法，避免恐慌和误判。 "] = "You could talk about basic medical common sense, let everyone understand how to deal with common illnesses, and avoid panic and misjudgment.",
    ["可以试试别的？"] = "Can you try something else?",
    ["可以试试柠檬蛋糕和小松饼，我想你会爱上它们的，只要你喜欢甜点。"] = "You can try the lemon cake and small muffins; I think you'll fall in love with them, as long as you like desserts.",
    ["可以返回了"] = "You can return now",
    ["可以这么说，我希望我足够强大，可以守护想守护的一切。但除此之外……我还有另一个理由。"] = "You could say that. I hope I am strong enough to protect everything I want to protect. But besides that... I have another reason.",
    ["可以这样随意进出城堡？"] = "Can one just enter and leave the castle as they please?",
    ["可以进行切换单人/多人模式，点击这里打开ESC菜单进入"] = "You can switch between single-player/multi-player modes. Click here to open the ESC menu and enter.",
    ["可以选择生成的内容包含哪些，有动作、语言、表情等。"] = "You can choose what content to generate, including actions, speech, expressions, etc.",
    ["可以通过长按普攻按键（默认E键）2秒来进入自动释放技能状态。"] = "You can enter the automatic skill release state by long-pressing the basic attack button (default E key) for 2 seconds.",
    ["可以释放王庭号令"] = "Can cast Royal Court Command",
    ["可以释放黄金树灵2段技能，释放一个超大子弹造成伤害"] = "Can release the 2nd stage of Golden Tree Spirit, firing a super-large bullet that deals damage",
    ["可以随时结束会议"] = "The meeting can be ended at any time",
    ["可以，但那只是本普通的书。"] = "Sure, but it's just an ordinary book.",
    ["可以，你说说看，是什么故事。"] = "Fine, tell me, what is the story?",
    ["可以，那就麻烦你记录下这个时刻。"] = "That's fine, then I'll trouble you to record this moment.",
    ["可作用途"] = "Usable purpose",
    ["可你不仅赚不到钱，还要每月给他上缴。"] = "But you not only can't earn money, you also have to pay him every month.",
    ["可你不是说，我们要调查码头势力分布，然后占据领地，最后成为最强黑帮吗？"] = "But didn't you say we were going to investigate the distribution of dock forces, then occupy the territory, and finally become the strongest gang?",
    ["可你们还这么小，生活一定很艰难吧？"] = "But you are still so young, life must be very difficult, right?",
    ["可你看见门口那些干蝙蝠了吗？还有那一罐罐奇怪的粉末……"] = "But did you see those dried bats at the door? And those jars of strange powders...",
    ["可你看起来很累。"] = "But you look very tired.",
    ["可你知道吗？最有趣的地方，从来不是看到真相。而是看着人们拼命寻找答案，怀疑别人，怀疑自己。再一步步走向错误的道路。"] = "But do you know? The most interesting part is never seeing the truth. It is watching people desperately search for answers, suspecting others, suspecting themselves, and then step by step walking down the wrong path.",
    ["可你知道吗？最有趣的地方，从来不是答案。而是看着人们拼命寻找答案，怀疑别人，怀疑自己。再一步步走进错误的方向。"] = "But do you know? The most interesting part is never the answer. It's watching people desperately search for the answer, doubting others, doubting themselves. Then, step by step, walking in the wrong direction.",
    ["可你知道，不会有新的帽子了。"] = "But you know, there won't be a new hat.",
    ["可你身上……没有人类的气息……"] = "But you... have no human scent...",
    ["可你这样做并不算绅士，即使是要拒绝她，和她当面说清楚会更好吧。"] = "But what you're doing isn't very gentlemanly. Even if you intend to reject her, it would be better to tell her clearly in person.",
    ["可使用<h>灵性之跃</>跳上房顶"] = "You can use <h>Leap of Spirituality</> to jump onto the roof",
