    ["可凡"] = "Kefan",
    ["可出售%s/%s"] = "Can sell %s/%s",
    ["可出售50/50"] = "Available for sale 50/50",
    ["可出售商品数量%s%d%%"] = "Available quantity to sell %s%d%%",
    ["可出售商品数量%s<Buff>%d%%</>"] = "Sellable Item Quantity %s<Buff>%d%%</>",
    ["可出售：%s"] = "Sellable: %s",
    ["可出售：无上限"] = "Sellable: No Limit",
    ["可删除资源"] = "Deletable Resources",
    ["可别告诉别人，来自南大陆的纯正木乃伊粉，足以让腰都直不起来的老家伙们……"] = "Don't tell anyone, but this pure mummy powder from the Southern Continent is enough to make old guys who can't even stand straight...",
    ["可别给我扣这么大一顶帽子！"] = "Don't pin such a big label on me!",
    ["可到快手/抖音等平台下载一个30秒以内的视频，确保人物清晰，全身尤佳。若视频过长，可使用快影/剪映等剪辑工具，将视频裁剪至30秒以内，再开始创作。"] = "You can download a video under 30 seconds from platforms like Kuaishou/Douyin, ensuring the character is clear, preferably full-body. If the video is too long, you can use editing tools like Kuaiying/Jianying to trim it to under 30 seconds before starting creation.",
    ["可前天也没船靠岸，我们还是鱼篓空空。"] = "But no ships docked the day before yesterday, and our fish basket was still empty.",
    ["可前往扮演系统处解锁当前身份"] = "You can go to the Acting system to unlock the current identity.",
    ["可前往灵界召唤获取"] = "Can be obtained by summoning in the Spirit World",
    ["可前往神眷牌商店兑换"] = "Can be exchanged at the Divine Blessed Card Store",
    ["可加倍次数"] = "Multiplier Count",
    ["可卖出站点"] = "Sellable Stations",
    ["可印刻"] = "Engravable",
    ["可取消连铺"] = "Can cancel continuous placement",
    ["可取消选中"] = "Can cancel selection",
    ["可叠加易伤10%"] = "Stackable Vulnerability 10%",
    ["可叠层攻击力"] = "Stackable Attack Power",
    ["可叠层攻击速度"] = "Stackable Attack Speed",
    ["可可"] = "Coco",
    ["可可奶酒"] = "Cocoa milk wine",
    ["可可应该接受邀请，但是艾丽不应该答应那位先生，黛比应该准备新的眼镜。"] = "Coco should accept the invitation, but Ellie should not agree to that gentleman, and Debbie should prepare a new pair of glasses.",
    ["可可爱爱"] = "Adorable",
    ["可合成"] = "Synthesizable",
    ["可合成%s，需要%s"] = "Can synthesize %s, requires %s",
    ["可后台静默下载。通知权限开启时，完成后将收到通知。"] = "Can download silently in the background. If notification permissions are enabled, you will receive a notification upon completion.",
    ["可回收"] = "Recyclable",
    ["可在<HighLight>旗帜</>持续时间内增加<HighLight>旗帜</>持续时间5秒，同时冷却时间增加15秒。"] = "Can be used during the <HighLight>Flag</>'s duration to extend the <HighLight>Flag</>'s duration by 5 seconds, while increasing the Cooldown by 15 seconds.",
    ["可在<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">躺赢</>中参与<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">秩序世界</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">城市暗面</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">竞技</>等活动获得认知经验提升扮演等级到47级"] = "You can participate in <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dungeon</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Order World</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dark Side of the City</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Arena</>, and other activities in <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Idle Win</> to gain Cognition EXP and raise your Acting Level to 47.",
    ["可在<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">躺赢</>中完成<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">任务</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">探索</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">竞技</>获得认知经验提升理智等级到63级"] = "You can complete <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Quests</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dungeons</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Exploration</>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Arena</> in <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Idle Win</> to gain Cognition EXP and raise your Sanity Level to 63.",
    ["可在【设置】-【画面】-【画面效果】中选择在进入剧情模式时隐藏某些外观部件。"] = "You can choose to hide certain cosmetic parts when entering story mode in [Settings] - [Graphics] - [Visual Effects].",
    ["可在商店中使用各类货币从系统或者玩家出售的商品中购买所需道具。"] = "You can use various currencies in the shop to purchase required items from goods sold by the system or players.",
    ["可在己方要塞乘坐<Highlight>蒸汽火车</>快速到达前方营地，攻击城门时可使用<Highlight>攻城车</>。\n<Highlight>战争巨龙</>受到非凡特性聚合定律影响，被血皇帝亚利斯塔·图铎的残余力量所吸引，来到该处战场，盘踞在战争核心的“中央王城”之上，将在战斗中现身，煽动战火。\n每个势力均拥有强大的指挥技能，可以在适当时机释放影响战局。"] = "You can take a <Highlight> Steam Train </> at your own fortress to quickly reach the forward camp, and you can use <Highlight> Siege Engines </> when attacking city gates. \n <Highlight> The War Dragon </>, influenced by the Law of Beyonder Characteristic Convergence and attracted by the Residual Power of the Blood Emperor Alista Tudor, has arrived at this battlefield. It perches above the 'Central Royal City' at the core of the war and will appear during the battle to incite the flames of war. \n Each faction possesses powerful Command skills that can be unleashed at the right moment to influence the course of the battle.",
    ["可在旗帜持续时间内增加旗帜持续时间，同时增加该技能冷却时间。"] = "Increases the duration of the Flag while it is active, while increasing the cooldown of this skill.",
    ["可在此处查询最近6个月内的抽卡记录。"] = "You can check your gacha records from the last 6 months here.",
    ["可在液态与固态间变化的宝石研磨物。"] = "Ground matter of a gemstone that can change between liquid and solid states.",
    ["可在灵视状态下对其他非凡者施以安魂"] = "You can perform Requiem on other Beyonders while in spirit vision.",
    ["可在灵视状态下对鲁恩市民施以安魂"] = "You can perform Requiem on Loen citizens while in spirit vision.",
    ["可在百货使用绑定苏勒、苏勒等直接购买商品。"] = "You can use Bound Sol and Sol to purchase items directly at the Department Store.",
    ["可在空中飞行。"] = "Can fly in the air.",
    ["可在背包-任务查看"] = "Can be viewed in Inventory - Quest.",
    ["可在语音房间内对指定玩家赠送，可以为对方增加200点名望值，并为该语音房间增加150点热度，持续60分钟。"] = "Can be gifted to a designated player in a voice room, increasing their Fame by 200 points and increasing the room's popularity by 150 points for 60 minutes.",
    ["可在语音房间内对指定玩家赠送，可以为对方增加20点名望值，并为该语音房间增加20点热度，持续15分钟。"] = "Can be gifted to a designated player in a voice room, increasing their Fame by 20 points and increasing the room's popularity by 20 points for 15 minutes.",
    ["可在语音房间内对指定玩家赠送，可以为对方增加60点名望值，并为该语音房间增加50点热度，持续30分钟。"] = "Can be gifted to a designated player in a voice room, increasing their Fame by 60 points and increasing the room's popularity by 50 points for 30 minutes.",
    ["可在转运商店中兑换<Highlight>圣杯·绑、星币、虹光染料</>等奖励。"] = "Can be used in the Fortune Shop to redeem rewards such as <Highlight>Holy Grail (Bound), Star Coins, Rainbow Dye</>, etc.",
    ["可在邓恩和戴莉之间切换主导角色"] = "Switch the leading character between Dunn and Daly.",
    ["可复制"] = "Copyable",
    ["可她拒绝了我，还把戒指朝我扔过来……我当时胸口一痛，回过神来戒指已经不见了！"] = "But she rejected me and threw the ring at me... I felt a pain in my chest at that moment, and when I came to, the ring was already gone!",
    ["可她是我的朋友，为什么不能见她？"] = "But she is my friend, why can't I see her?",
    ["可她看起来才二十几岁。"] = "But she looks like she's only in her twenties.",
    ["可如果就这样冒险回去，无法保证安全……万一又被“2-049”控制住了呢？"] = "But if I risk going back like this, there's no guarantee of safety... What if I get controlled by 2-049 again?",
    ["可妈妈现在也生病了，我不得不……"] = "But Mom is sick now too, I have to...",
    ["可妈妈说每天只能吃一个冰淇淋球……"] = "But Mom said I can only eat one scoop of ice cream a day...",
    ["可妮莉雅·"] = "Cornelia ",
    ["可学派的导师们建议我晋升到序列7“航海家”再外出，这样我就能对洋流风向等等都有把握了，而且有“航海家”的船只从来不会在大海上迷路。"] = "But the school's mentors suggested that I advance to Sequence 7 'Navigator' before going out, so that I can have a grasp of ocean currents, wind directions, and so on, and ships with a 'Navigator' never get lost on the high seas.",
    ["可完成序列晋升"] = "Sequence Advancement can be completed",
    ["可宣战"] = "Can Declare War",
    ["可对应提升其他建筑的等级到达5级可对应提升其他建筑可对应提升其他建筑的等级"] = "Can be used to upgrade other buildings to level 5.",
    ["可对应提升其他建筑的等级到达5级可对应提升其他建筑的等级可对应提升其他建筑的等级"] = "Can be used to upgrade other buildings to level 5.",
    ["可将战令豪华版升级为典藏版，并获得对应的奖励"] = "Can upgrade the Battle Pass Deluxe Edition to the Collector's Edition and obtain the corresponding rewards",
    ["可将目标筛选策略设置为优先血量最低，方便锁定残血目标。"] = "You can set the target filtering strategy to prioritize the lowest health, making it easier to lock onto targets with low HP.",
    ["可幻化"] = "Can be Transfigured",
    ["可库克买来章鱼后，我还是无法克服烹饪同类的心理障碍，只能用别的肉替代。"] = "But after Cook bought the octopus, I still couldn't overcome the psychological barrier of cooking a fellow creature, so I had to use other meat instead.",
    ["可应该怎么找到隐藏空间？为什么是这三个地方？难道是……三个入口？"] = "But how should we find the hidden space? Why these three places? Could they be... three entrances?",
    ["可引导"] = "Guideable",
    ["可强化"] = "Can be Strengthened",
    ["可当我把“报幕员”使用在其他人身上时，我渐渐发现它弥补了我的不足，它能为我收取人们的情绪。我又找回我了自己。"] = "But when I used \"Announcer\" on others, I gradually discovered that it made up for my shortcomings; it could collect people's emotions for me. I found myself again.",
    ["可微调穿戴"] = "Fine-tune Wear",
    ["可心"] = "Kexin",
    ["可怕的家伙，离我远一点！"] = "Terrifying creature, stay away from me!",
    ["可怕！他们看见老鼠，简直就像见到了仇人！"] = "Terrifying! They see a mouse as if they've seen a sworn enemy!",
    ["可怜可怜我吧！慈悲的玛蒂尔达！求你垂怜一个被爱情苦苦折磨的灵魂！"] = "Have pity on me! Merciful Matilda! I beg you to take pity on a soul tormented by love!",
    ["可怜的劳维斯，一夜之间头发全白了，不知道他现在这个状态，还能撑多久……"] = "Poor Lawis, his hair turned white overnight. I don't know how much longer he can hold on in this state...",
    ["可怜的孩子"] = "Poor Child",
    ["可怜的孩子……"] = "Poor child...",
    ["可怜的孩子。"] = "Poor child.",
    ["可怜的孩子，现在一定很饿吧，我们再去别处找找，话说，小猫还认得出我们这两个熟客吗？"] = "Poor child, it must be very hungry now, let's go look elsewhere. By the way, does the kitten still recognize us two regular customers?",
    ["可怜的小海莉叶，她可以休息了。\n\n海莉叶·沃克"] = "Poor little Harriet, she can rest now.\n\nHarriet Walker",
    ["可怜的小珍妮，每天都攥着这个火柴盒。可工厂拖欠工资太久，我们连填肚子都困难，更何况买火柴……"] = "Poor little Jenny, clutching this matchbox every day. But the factory has been behind on wages for so long that we can barely fill our stomachs, let alone buy matches...",
    ["可怜的水手，在自己的订婚仪式上被警察突然逮捕，扔进了不见天日的监牢……"] = "The poor sailor was suddenly arrested by the police during his own engagement ceremony and thrown into a dark, sunless prison...",
    ["可怜的玛蒂尔达！只不过随手给他拿了一本经书，就被他缠得连门也不敢出。"] = "Poor Matilda! She just handed him a scripture, and now he's pestering her so much she doesn't even dare to go out.",
    ["可怜的羔羊们！"] = "Poor lambs!",
    ["可怜的芙拉女士，希望她别出什么事……"] = "Poor Ms. Fula, I hope nothing happens to her...",
    ["可怜虫"] = "Poor wretches.",
    ["可怜虫过渡"] = "Poor Wretch Transition",
    ["可恶……"] = "Damn it...",
    ["可恶……下面应该怎么办……"] = "Damn it... what should I do now...",
    ["可恶……你们这些苍蝇真是太烦人了！破坏了伟大的仪式！"] = "Damn... you flies are really annoying! You ruined the great ritual!",
    ["可恶……给我等着！"] = "Damn it... just you wait!",
    ["可恶…你…罗塞尔大帝说过，失败是成功之母，我一定会成功发射的！"] = "Damn it... you... Emperor Roselle said that failure is the mother of success, I will definitely launch successfully!",
    ["可恶的值夜者……为什么总要破坏崇高伟大的仪式？！你们——罪无可恕！"] = "Damn Nighthawks... why do you always have to ruin the noble and great ritual?! You—are unforgivable!",
    ["可恶的开膛手杰斯，今晚我将为你的凶行画上句号！"] = "Damn Jack the Ripper, I will put an end to your crimes tonight!",
    ["可恶的罗伊德先生，只不过是吃了他几片面包，竟然要罚我拔光花园的杂草……呜呜呜……"] = "That wretched Mr. Lloyd, I only ate a few slices of his bread, and he actually wants to punish me by pulling all the weeds in the garden... Wuwuwu...",
    ["可恶的马丁，死了也不肯放过我！"] = "Damn Martin, he won't even let me go after he's dead!",
    ["可恶！我只是这周没钱交房租，弗兰奇就把我赶了出来！"] = "Damn it! I just didn't have money for rent this week, and Franky kicked me out!",
    ["可恶！我明明第一时间就交了选课申请表 为什么还会落选！"] = "Damn it! I submitted my course selection form the first moment it opened. Why was I rejected!",
    ["可恶！我明明第一时间就交了选课申请表，为什么还会落选！"] = "Damn it! I submitted my course selection form the very first second, why was I rejected!",
    ["可恶，你坏了我的好事！"] = "Damn it, you ruined my good deed!",
    ["可恶，你，你们给我等着！"] = "Damn it, you, you all just wait!",
    ["可恶，又没有跟上节奏！"] = "Damn it, I missed the rhythm again!",
    ["可恶，就差一点……"] = "Damn it, just a little bit off...",
    ["可恶，我为什么会相信你？完了，全完了！我可爱的苏勒！"] = "Damn it, why did I believe you? It's over, everything is over! My lovely Soles!",
    ["可恶，我的宝贝配枪，又跑哪儿去了？"] = "Damn it, where did my precious service pistol run off to again?",
    ["可恶，我马上就找到黄金树嫩芽了！"] = "Damn it, I'm about to find the Golden Tree sprout!",
    ["可恶，明明神秘歌声的源头近在眼前了……"] = "Damn it, the source of the mysterious singing is right in front of me...",
    ["可恶，那个小偷这次没有骗人？真不敢相信……"] = "Damn, that thief wasn't lying this time? I can't believe it...",
    ["可恶，难道真的是他……时间紧迫，我先去那边看看，谢谢你提供的消息！"] = "Damn it, could it really be him... Time is running out. I'll go check over there. Thank you for the information!",
    ["可您……"] = "But you...",
    ["可您拥有月光般的皮肤、宝石似的红瞳…… "] = "But you have skin like moonlight, red eyes like gemstones...",
    ["可惜 没办法再回头了……"] = "Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back...",
    ["可惜……但也幸运。"] = "Pity... but also fortunate.",
    ["可惜。"] = "What a pity.",
    ["可惜了，如果能重新调整一下细节，也许会是另一种结果。"] = "What a pity. If the details could be readjusted, perhaps the result would be different.",
    ["可惜今天被别人先搜过一遍了！"] = "It's a pity someone else already searched through it today!",
    ["可惜你的伤痕太诚实，而我要找的那位，更擅长说谎。"] = "It's a pity your scars are too honest, while the one I'm looking for is better at lying.",
    ["可惜啊，这家餐馆真的还不错……"] = "What a pity, this restaurant was actually quite good...",
    ["可惜她妈妈患了肺病，我们掏空了家产治疗，也还是没能治好，唉……"] = "It's a pity her mother had lung disease. We emptied our family fortune for treatment, but we still couldn't cure her, sigh...",
    ["可惜年纪大了，这种冒险的事儿还是少干比较好。"] = "It's a pity I'm old; it's better to do less of these adventurous things.",
    ["可惜我不是城里人，不能时常去剧院观摩，但好在有艺术学派，让我能学到一些剧目里的舞步。"] = "It's a pity I'm not a city dweller and cannot go to the theater often, but fortunately, there is the Art School, which allows me to learn some dance steps from the repertoire.",
    ["可惜我没在地图上找到“伦敦”的具体位置，可能是个不知名的小城。我猜，那也是一个，总是下雨的希望之城吧。"] = "It's a pity I couldn't find the specific location of \"London\" on the map; it might be an unknown small city. I guess it's also a city of hope that is always raining.",
    ["可惜的是，为了寻找记忆离开廷根后，我们就很少联系了。但我也会常常怀念起曾经作为教师的时候。"] = "It's a pity that after leaving Tingen to search for memories, we rarely kept in touch. But I often miss the time when I was a teacher.",
    ["可惜那家伙本人，到死都不知道。"] = "It's a pity that the guy himself didn't know until he died.",
    ["可惜，他去贝克兰德念大学被弗萨克的杂种们炸死了，不然还能介绍你们认识。"] = "It's a pity he was blown up by the bastards of Feynapotter when he went to Backlund to attend university, otherwise I could have introduced you.",
    ["可惜，你不是正式队员，大概只能拿到百分之十。"] = "Unfortunately, you aren't a formal member, so you'll probably only get ten percent.",
    ["可惜，这位警察先生依然缺乏时间观念。"] = "It's a pity that this police officer still lacks any sense of time.",
    ["可我不甘心……我们那么辛苦才凑齐了路费。"] = "But I'm not reconciled... We worked so hard to save up the travel expenses.",
    ["可我们……我们是被永暗蜡烛带下来的，冥河不收我们。"] = "But we... we were brought down by the Candle of Eternal Darkness, and the River of Death won't accept us.",
    ["可我们就是通过镜子进来的，那条路早就毁了……"] = "But we entered through the mirror, and that path was destroyed long ago...",
    ["可我只是想让牛肉变得更便宜，让更多人能吃饱饭。这不是母亲希望看到的吗？"] = "But I just wanted to make beef cheaper so more people could eat their fill. Isn't this what the Mother hopes to see?",
    ["可我只能在这里帮伯特鼓掌……"] = "But I can only help Bert applaud here...",
    ["可我听说这很难找到。"] = "But I heard these are hard to find.",
    ["可我听说那间仓库放满了去世的流浪汉的遗物。"] = "But I heard that warehouse was filled with the belongings of deceased vagrants.",
    ["可我已经找了好几个地方了……真的等不下去了！"] = "But I've already checked several places... I really can't wait any longer!",
    ["可我已经找了好几个地方了……都没有合适的占卜师……"] = "But I've already looked in several places... there are no suitable diviners...",
    ["可我患了绝症，生命即将结束……"] = "But I have a terminal illness, and my life is coming to an end...",
    ["可我无法忍受孤独。"] = "But I cannot bear the loneliness.",
    ["可我来自“明天”，明天的我很有钱，只是今天还没到账。"] = "But I'm from 'tomorrow'. The me of tomorrow is very rich, it's just that the money hasn't arrived today.",
    ["可我的花不一样！它们是自然的馈赠，是女神赐予的美丽！您不能把它们和人造花相提并论！"] = "But my flowers are different! They are a gift from nature, the beauty bestowed by the Goddess! You cannot compare them to artificial flowers!",
    ["可我还不太了解……"] = "But I don't know much yet...",
    ["可我还有份资料……有关各种正神教会典籍和公文的……"] = "But I still have a document... regarding the scriptures and official documents of various orthodox churches...",
    ["可我还没有车"] = "But I don't have a car yet",
    ["可我这儿明明是好的啊，怎么到他们手上就坏了……"] = "But it was clearly fine here, how did it break when it got to them...",
    ["可打开【背包】-【任务】分页查看相关物品"] = "You can open the [Inventory] - [Quest] tab to view relevant items.",
    ["可打开【背包】查看相关物品"] = "You can open your [Inventory] to view related items.",
