    ["可控制剧情模式时外观的显示和隐藏，若关闭，进入剧情模式将不再显示翅膀、环身、肩饰。"] = "Controls the display and hiding of appearances in story mode. If disabled, wings, body rings, and shoulder ornaments will no longer be displayed when entering story mode.",
