    ["可放入模型已达上限"] = "The number of models that can be placed has reached the limit.",
    ["可放置"] = "Placeable",
    ["可放置贴纸数量已达上限"] = "The number of stickers that can be placed has reached the limit.",
    ["可斗舞"] = "Can dance-battle",
    ["可旋转"] = "Rotatable",
    ["可是"] = "But",
    ["可是 好像有什么不对……"] = "But, something seems wrong...",
    ["可是……"] = "But...",
    ["可是……{{PlayerName}}，这毕竟是一件有风险的事。"] = "But... {{PlayerName}}, this is a risky matter after all.",
    ["可是……你们家的房租价钱也不低……"] = "But... the rent for your house isn't low either...",
    ["可是……哪里是北，哪里是东呢？我再研究一下吧。"] = "But... which way is north, and which way is east? I'll study it a bit more.",
    ["可是……在福音庇护下，我的政府雇员考试的确高分通过了……"] = "But... under the shelter of the Gospel, I did indeed pass my government employee exam with high marks...",
    ["可是……已经过去一年了，也许小巴特早已忘了，或者他已经……"] = "But... it's been a year, maybe little Bart has long forgotten, or he has already...",
    ["可是……已经过去三十年了……"] = "But... thirty years have passed...",
    ["可是……要怎样才能救他们？"] = "But... how can we save them?",
    ["可是你明明告诉我你是<P_Yellow>被困在塔罗牌里</>的，怎么回事？"] = "But you clearly told me you were <P_Yellow>trapped in a Tarot card</>, what is going on?",
    ["可是你知道罗塞尔大帝是在何时何地说出这句话的吗？这你就不知道了吧，我来告诉你，那天，罗塞尔走在路上……"] = "But do you know when and where Emperor Roselle said this? You don't know that, do you? Let me tell you, that day, Roselle was walking on the road...",
    ["可是你过不去。"] = "But you can't get over there.",
    ["可是叔叔已经摘了那个南瓜，去菜摊上卖了！"] = "But Uncle already picked that pumpkin and took it to the vegetable stall to sell!",
    ["可是只要能和伊万一起看一场演出，一切都是值得的！"] = "But as long as I can see a performance with Ivan, it's all worth it!",
    ["可是回家以后，玛丽安挠了我一爪子，跑到邻居家去了！"] = "But after I got home, Marian scratched me and ran off to the neighbor's house!",
    ["可是大海很危险……据说海上最可怕的，甚至不是狂风暴雨，而是那些看不见的东西。"] = "But the sea is dangerous... It is said that the most terrifying things on the sea aren't even the storms, but those unseen things.",
    ["可是大海很危险……据说海上最可怕的，甚至不是狂风暴雨，而是那些看不见的东西。 "] = "But the sea is dangerous... It is said that the most terrifying thing on the sea is not even the storms, but those invisible things.",
    ["可是好像有什么不对？"] = "But something seems wrong?",
    ["可是如果他们不准备参加面试，多少也要提前打个招呼。这种做法给我们添了很多麻烦。"] = "But if they aren't planning to attend the interview, they should at least give us a heads-up in advance. This kind of behavior causes us a lot of trouble.",
    ["可是如果我被发现了，妈妈会说我不像个绅士。"] = "But if I get caught, Mother will say I don't act like a gentleman.",
    ["可是妈妈说，是看分针……分针走过这么长，妈妈就从告解室回来了。"] = "But Mother said, look at the minute hand... when the minute hand moves this far, Mother will be back from the confessional.",
    ["可是它真的特别……"] = "But it's really special...",
    ["可是尼尔 我只是脚步快了一些"] = "But Neil, I just walked a little faster.",
    ["可是工厂门口排满了铁十字街来的新伙计，我们不努力的话，随时可能会失去这份工作。"] = "But the factory gate is full of new guys from Iron Cross Street. If we don't work hard, we might lose this job at any time.",
    ["可是幽灵怎么会有声音呢？"] = "But how can a ghost make sound?",
    ["可是应该怎么调配魔药呢……旁边好像有一张纸条？"] = "But how should I concoct the potion... is there a note nearby?",
    ["可是我一天到晚都见不到他……"] = "But I can't see him all day long...",
    ["可是我一点也不快乐，这种一眼望到头的日子太无趣了。"] = "But I'm not happy at all. This kind of life where you can see the end at a glance is too boring.",
    ["可是我也想听真话。"] = "But I want to hear the truth too.",
    ["可是我们没有鱼竿呀！"] = "But we don't have a fishing rod!",
    ["可是我听伦纳德先生说，您明明已经积攒很久了……"] = "But I heard Mr. Leonard say that you've clearly been accumulating it for a long time...",
    ["可是我和这位{{先生|女士}}一样，也想知道你能编出什么谎话来。"] = "But I, just like this {{Mr.|Ms.}}, also want to know what kind of lies you can make up.",
    ["可是我并没有……"] = "But I didn't...",
    ["可是我怎么面对她……我出海整整十年，被海盗弄瞎一只眼。等赚够了金镑，回来却发现我的爱人身患重病……我不敢告诉小莉迪，她的妈妈已经……"] = "But how can I face her... I went to sea for ten whole years and had an eye blinded by pirates. When I earned enough gold pounds and came back, I found my lover was seriously ill... I didn't dare tell little Liddy that her mother had already...",
    ["可是我用鼻子闻一闻，就能知道一个人昨晚有没有睡好，用耳朵听一听，就能分辨笑声是真的还是假的。"] = "But I can smell whether someone slept well last night with my nose, and I can distinguish whether a laugh is real or fake by listening with my ears.",
    ["可是我真的好饿。"] = "But I'm really hungry.",
    ["可是我被压在石头下太久了，十分虚弱，请你帮帮我，和我一起行动吧！"] = "But I have been pinned under the stones for too long and am very weak. Please help me and act together with me!",
    ["可是报纸上都登了，已经有不少人遇害了！ "] = "But it's been published in the newspapers that many people have already been harmed!",
    ["可是探索队为什么要考历史？"] = "But why does the exploration team test history?",
    ["可是昨天早上我醒来时，珍妮已经不见了。等再找到她时，她已经……"] = "But when I woke up yesterday morning, Jenny was gone. By the time I found her, she was already...",
    ["可是有一天，我和露米等啊等，\r\n爸爸妈妈却再也没有回来。"] = "But one day, Lumi and I waited and waited, but Mom and Dad never came back.",
    ["可是没人看见我。原来我也已经死了……"] = "But no one saw me. It turns out I was already dead too...",
    ["可是现在，我肿胀的手却再也拉不出音符。"] = "But now, my swollen hands can no longer play a single note.",
    ["可是老师，只有教会典籍中才更多记载了有关四皇之战的内容。从文献中找到具有共性的真相也许更有可能……"] = "But teacher, only church scriptures contain more records about the War of the Four Emperors. Finding common truths from literature might be more likely...",
    ["可是这和最强黑帮有什么关系……"] = "But what does this have to do with being the strongest gang...",
    ["可是这里好像很平静，您说的可怕的战斗，似乎没有影响到镇子上的人们。"] = "But it seems very peaceful here, the terrible battle you mentioned doesn't seem to have affected the people in town.",
    ["可是这里的确没有路牌，也许是被什么破坏了。"] = "But there really is no road sign here. Perhaps it was destroyed by something.",
    ["可是这里还有这么多信没送呢……"] = "But there are still so many letters here that haven't been delivered...",
    ["可是镇里的人没人见过这种硬币，也不肯给我吃的。一来一回大半天就过去了，现在已经饿的没力气抓鱼了"] = "But no one in town has ever seen this kind of coin, and they won't give me any food. Going back and forth took most of the day, and now I'm too hungry and weak to catch fish.",
    ["可是除了下街，我们也没有别的地方可以去了……"] = "But besides Lower Street, we have nowhere else to go...",
    ["可是，他看到您的伤一定会担心的。万一为了见他而伤势恶化……他会加倍难过自责的……"] = "But he will definitely be worried if he sees your injuries. If your condition worsens just to see him... he will feel twice as sad and blame himself...",
    ["可是，你们招牌上都写了！我只是想尝尝预言之酒……"] = "But, it's written on your sign! I just want to taste the wine of prophecy...",
    ["可是，可是……你们招牌上就这么写的！"] = "But, but... that's what it says on your sign!",
    ["可是，我应该怎么找到她呢？"] = "But how should I find her?",
    ["可是，我想当的是婚礼乐师，不是驱鸟师……"] = "But, I want to be a wedding musician, not a bird scarer...",
    ["可是，我的票转卖的话，至少价值7个金镑！"] = "But, if my ticket is resold, it's worth at least 7 gold pounds!",
    ["可是，我真的需要这份工作吗……"] = "But, do I really need this job...",
    ["可是，我记得你可是最喜欢看马戏的？"] = "But, I remember you like watching the circus the most?",
    ["可是，灰雾之上会不会有多个主宰？还是再加一重保险吧。"] = "However, could there be multiple masters above the gray fog? I had better add another layer of insurance.",
    ["可是，真不好意思……只有我才能享受看见他的幸福……"] = "But, I'm really sorry... Only I can enjoy the happiness of seeing him...",
    ["可是，老师是守知派最后的导师，他一定知道“最后一页”的代价。"] = "But, the teacher was the last mentor of the School of Truth; he must have known the price of the \"Last Page.\"",
    ["可是，老师，我……"] = "But, teacher, I...",
    ["可是，要怎样……"] = "But, how...",
    ["可是，还没等乐曲完成，艾登就要离开济贫院了。"] = "However, before the music was even finished, Aiden had to leave the poorhouse.",
    ["可是，这就是现实呀，难不成就像他们说的，一毕业就失业，或者是那些工人？"] = "But this is reality, isn't it? Could it be like what they say, unemployed upon graduation, or those workers?",
    ["可是，这是个、这是个洗手池。"] = "But, this is a, this is a washbasin.",
    ["可是，道歉应该不会太让人讨厌吧？嗯，就这么决定了，尼尔，拿出值夜者的勇气。"] = "But an apology shouldn't be too annoying, right? Yes, that's it. Neil, summon the courage of a Nighthawk.",
    ["可是，那些应该是几年前的事情了。"] = "But those things must have happened years ago.",
