    ["可用方案"] = "Available Builds",
    ["可略微预知命运，却对命运感到无奈。"] = "One can slightly foresee fate, yet feel helpless toward it.",
    ["可疑的人？说实话，很少有人半夜在这条路出现，你看起来很面生，倒不如说你更像是那种可疑的人。"] = "Suspicious people? To be honest, very few people appear on this road in the middle of the night. You look like a stranger; if anything, you look more like that kind of suspicious person.",
    ["可疑的盒子"] = "Suspicious Box",
    ["可直接进入游戏开始体验"] = "You can enter the game directly to start experiencing it",
    ["可竞拍获得当前最高品级的橙色装备。"] = "Can be auctioned to obtain the current highest grade orange Equipment.",
    ["可笑的是，他一点也不知道感恩。"] = "The ridiculous thing is, he didn't know how to be grateful at all.",
    ["可算活着回来了，今晚得好好找个“安慰”。 "] = "Finally made it back alive, need to find some 'comfort' tonight.",
    ["可米娅"] = "Comia",
    ["可结识人脉"] = "Can make connections",
    ["可绕目标闪现，配合“记录”的各种能力和一见不对立刻远离的警惕，拥有强大的战斗实力和机动性，来无影去无踪。"] = "Capable of flashing around targets. Combined with the various abilities 'Record' provides and the vigilance to immediately move away when things go wrong, you possess powerful combat strength and mobility, coming and going without a trace.",
    ["可缺省，缺省值为0.在buff中使用不要填写"] = "Can be omitted, default value is 0. Do not fill this in when using in a buff",
    ["可缺省，默认为false"] = "Can be omitted, default is false",
    ["可缺省，默认为false。"] = "Can be omitted, default is false.",
    ["可置换"] = "Replaceable",
    ["可老汤姆说他亲眼见过！黄金梦想号经过时，连汹涌的海浪都会静止！"] = "But Old Tom said he saw it with his own eyes! When the Golden Dream passed by, even the raging sea waves would go still!",
    ["可耐~"] = "Cutesy~",
    ["可能……因为我没有缺过钱，所以总是忘记钱对于一个新生非凡者有多么重要。"] = "Maybe... because I've never lacked money, I always forget how important money is to a new Beyonder.",
    ["可能他只是还没准备好面对你……"] = "Maybe he just isn't ready to face you yet...",
    ["可能他要很久才能回来。"] = "It might take a long time for him to come back.",
    ["可能因为……有一些品种的副作用比较大。比如那种会让人暂时失去行动能力的孢子，我最初只是想用来对付海盗而已！"] = "Maybe because... some varieties have significant side effects. Like those spores that make people temporarily lose the ability to move; I originally just wanted to use them to deal with pirates!",
    ["可能因为我十分迅速地又被卷入了一起危险的非凡事件。"] = "Perhaps because I was very quickly dragged into another dangerous Beyonder incident.",
    ["可能因为我很有天赋。"] = "Maybe it's because I'm very talented.",
    ["可能是因为这个物品吧，我想用它做一件新衣服。我见过你拥有很多精致的衣服，是在哪个高级时装店定制的吗？"] = "It might be because of this item. I want to use it to make a new piece of clothing. I've seen you own many exquisite clothes; were they custom-made at a high-end fashion boutique?",
    ["可能是因为这里阳光太好、书的味道很香，还有安洁莉卡泡的咖啡比别处好喝吧。"] = "Perhaps it's because the sunlight here is so pleasant, the books smell wonderful, and the coffee Angelica brews tastes better than anywhere else.",
    ["可能是廷根章鱼的产地和南方不同，所以味道不完全一样。"] = "Maybe the origin of Tingen octopus is different from the south, so the taste is not exactly the same.",
    ["可能是我一时疏忽，我这两天感冒了。"] = "Maybe it was a momentary oversight, I've had a cold for the past two days.",
    ["可能是我拿到魔法豌豆后太激动，掉在了地上……"] = "Maybe I was too excited after getting the magic beans and dropped them on the ground...",
    ["可能是海上的风浪太大，耽误了行程。我敢打赌，那些浪头一定比圣数教堂的尖顶还要高！"] = "Maybe the wind and waves at sea were too strong, delaying the trip. I bet those waves were higher than the spire of the Holy Number Cathedral!",
    ["可能是被水鸟吃掉了吧，这里的鱼儿没处可去。"] = "Maybe they were eaten by water birds. The fish here have nowhere to go.",
    ["可能是被污染影响了，我没办法集中精力冥想。"] = "Maybe it's affected by the corruption, I can't concentrate on meditation.",
    ["可能最近忙着准备生日宴会。"] = "Maybe it's because I've been busy preparing for the birthday party recently.",
    ["可能生成的异变词条："] = "Possible mutation traits to be generated:",
    ["可能自动采集-混乱剑b"] = "Possible auto-collection-Chaos Sword b",
    ["可能获得"] = "Possible Obtain",
    ["可能这也是促使我加入教会的原因吧，感觉这里是个很温暖的地方。"] = "Perhaps that's also why I joined the Church; it felt like a very warm place.",
    ["可能都是。"] = "Maybe it's all of them.",
    ["可获奖励"] = "Rewards Obtainable",
    ["可获得"] = "Obtainable",
    ["可获得<Highlight>35装等</>的<Highlight>金色品质装备</>。"] = "Can obtain <Highlight>Level 35</> <Highlight>Gold Quality Equipment</>.",
