    ["可获得随机道具奖励。"] = "Grants a random item reward.",
    ["可要是赚不到钱，杰姆会死的。{{先生|女士}}，他会死的，我该怎么办……"] = "But if I can't earn money, Jem will die. {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, he will die, what should I do...",
    ["可见范围"] = "Visibility Range",
    ["可解锁使用一次全域广播。"] = "Unlocks one use of a global broadcast.",
    ["可解锁使用一次心羽·神谕广播。<Highlight>使用后附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。</>"] = "Can unlock and use Heart Feather · Oracle Broadcast once. <Highlight> After use, it comes with a gift of bound Gold Pounds for the world channel worth half the value. </>",
    ["可解锁使用一次迅电·神谕广播。<Highlight>使用后附赠价值一半的世界频道绑定金镑礼金。</>"] = "Can unlock and use Swift Lightning · Oracle Broadcast once. <Highlight> After use, it comes with a gift of bound Gold Pounds for the world channel worth half the value. </>",
    ["可解除的火墙"] = "Dispellable Fire Wall",
    ["可设置<EquipTip>剔除词条</>"] = "Can set <EquipTip>Excluded Affixes</>",
    ["可试药_配置失败"] = "Can test medicine_configuration failed",
    ["可试药_配置成功"] = "Can test medicine_configuration successful",
    ["可贝克兰德太远了，哦……"] = "But Backlund is too far away, oh...",
    ["可购买商品数量%s%d%%"] = "Available quantity to buy %s%d%%",
    ["可购买商品数量%s<Buff>%d%%</>"] = "Purchasable Item Quantity %s<Buff>%d%%</>",
    ["可跳过按钮（临时）"] = "Skip button (temporary)",
    ["可这不会被人扔下来吗？"] = "But won't we be thrown off?",
    ["可这个人七十岁了。"] = "But this person is seventy years old.",
    ["可这也太……"] = "But this is just too...",
    ["可这些刚晾好的草药也需要尽快包起来……不然会变坏的……"] = "But these freshly dried herbs need to be packed up as soon as possible... otherwise, they'll go bad...",
    ["可这传说……难道真有什么神秘学上的意义吗？"] = "But this legend... could it really have some occult significance?",
    ["可这是末场啊！您不知道，末场的演出有多么激动人心，扮演格尔曼的演员会在场中引领观众……"] = "But this is the final show! You don't know how exciting the final show is. The actor playing Gehrman will lead the audience in the venue...",
    ["可这种天气上山很危险，而且积雪的路很不好走。"] = "But it's very dangerous to go up the mountain in this weather, and the snow-covered road is very difficult to walk on.",
    ["可这肉根本不能吃了吧？"] = "But this meat can't be eaten anymore, right?",
    ["可这话传着传着就走样了——先是说果子多，后来说这地能让人不死，现在倒好，成死而复生了。"] = "But as this story spread, it got distorted—first it was about the abundance of fruit, then it said this land could make people immortal, and now, it's become resurrection.",
    ["可进入资源下载界面选择下载相关资源"] = "You can enter the resource download interface to select and download relevant resources.",
    ["可进行词条继承，%s天后解锁重塑。"] = "Affix inheritance is available.\nRemolding unlocks in %s days.",
    ["可进行词条继承，重塑暂不开放。"] = "Affix inheritance is available.\nRemolding is currently unavailable.",
    ["可连段点偏移"] = "Combo Point Offset",
    ["可连续选中"] = "Continuously Selectable",
    ["可连铺"] = "Continuously Placeable",
    ["可选%d/%d"] = "Optional %d/%d",
    ["可选中"] = "Selectable",
    ["可选中其他非凡者释放魅惑技能"] = "You can select other Beyonders to cast the Charm skill.",
    ["可选择<Dungeon_Highlight>与警官交谈</>，暂时放弃任务。"] = "You can choose to <Dungeon_Highlight> talk to the police officer </> to temporarily abandon the quest.",
    ["可选择使用已解锁的待机动作，选择后，将会在待机时进行动作表演；多选时，会随机播放已选择的待机动作。"] = "You may choose to use unlocked idle animations. Once selected, the character will perform the animation while idle. If multiple are selected, the game will randomly play one of the chosen idle animations.",
    ["可选择使用已解锁的结算动画，选择后，将会在结算时进行动画表演；多选时，会随机播放已选择的结算动画。\n同时，结算动画可选择推荐穿搭或当前穿搭，选择推荐穿搭后，播放动画时将不会使用角色正在穿着的时装。"] = "You may choose to use unlocked settlement animations. Once selected, the character will perform the animation during the settlement phase. If multiple are selected, the game will randomly play one of the chosen settlement animations. \n Additionally, for settlement animations, you can choose between the recommended outfit or your current outfit. If you select the recommended outfit, the character's currently equipped fashion items will not be used while the animation plays.",
    ["可选资源"] = "Optional Resources",
    ["可通过<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">菜单-躺赢</>完成<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">竞技</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">秩序世界</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">城市暗面</>等活动获取大量认知经验提升扮演等级到40级"] = "You can complete <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dungeon</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Arena</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Order World</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dark Side of the City</>, and other activities via <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Menu-Idle Win</> to obtain a large amount of Cognition EXP and raise your Acting Level to 40.",
    ["可通过<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">菜单-躺赢</>完成<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">竞技</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">秩序世界</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">城市暗面</>等活动获得认知经验提升扮演等级到20级"] = "You can complete <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dungeon</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Arena</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Order World</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dark Side of the City</>, and other activities via <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Menu-Idle Win</> to gain Cognition EXP and raise your Acting Level to 20.",
    ["可通过各类玩法获取"] = "Can be obtained through various gameplay modes",
    ["可通过收集品味值，提高品味等级，到达对应等级后可以领取奖励"] = "You can increase your Taste Level by collecting Taste Points. Once you reach the corresponding level, you can claim rewards.",
    ["可邀请玩家"] = "Available Players",
    ["可那卑劣的投机商没告诉我他的货是从哪里来的！结果我又成了嫌疑人，被警察先生盘问了一个下午！"] = "But that despicable speculator didn't tell me where his goods came from! As a result, I became a suspect again and was interrogated by the police for an entire afternoon!",
