    ["可重复挑战"] = "Repeatable Challenge",
    ["可重复挑战获取奖励"] = "Repeatable challenge to obtain rewards",
    ["可长大就意味着钻不进那些小烟囱了。除了洗烟囱，我们什么都不会呀，雷克斯先生不会白养我们，长大了就意味着……没有用了。"] = "But growing up means we can't fit into those small chimneys anymore. We don't know how to do anything else besides cleaning chimneys. Mr. Rex won't support us for free, and growing up means... being useless.",
