    ["叹息之种与古战场的意志产生了共鸣，令前方出现了一只强大的非凡怪物，请狩猎它。（潮袭次数：3/3）"] = "The Seed of Sighs has resonated with the will of the ancient battlefield, causing a powerful Extraordinary monster to appear ahead; please hunt it. (Tide Attack count: 3/3)",
    ["叹息之种任务"] = "Seed of Sighs Quest",
    ["叹息之种任务限定在猎龙之城场景接取，是否前往该场景？"] = "The Seed of Sighs quest can only be accepted in the City of Dragon Hunting scene. Do you want to travel to that scene?",
    ["叹息之种吸引来一波怪物的窥伺，击退它们以鲜血平息低语。（潮袭次数：1/3）"] = "The Seed of Sighs has attracted a wave of monsters; repel them to calm the whispers with blood. (Tide Attack count: 1/3)",
    ["叹息之种大礼包"] = "Seed of Sighs Gift Pack",
    ["叹息之种带来的力量，猎杀敌对者便可掠夺其背包中的猩红遗物，离开场景自动移除。"] = "Power brought by the Seed of Sighs; hunt down enemies to plunder the Scarlet Relics in their inventory. Automatically removed upon leaving the scene.",
