    ["叹息之种的气息再次吸引了一波怪物前来抢掠，请狩猎它们。（潮袭次数：2/3）"] = "The aura of the Seed of Sighs has once again attracted a wave of monsters to plunder; please hunt them. (Tide Attack count: 2/3)",
    ["叹息之种道具需在<Highlight>猎龙之城场景使用</>，是否传送前往？"] = "The Seed of Sighs item must be used in the <Highlight> City of Dragon Hunting scene </>. Do you want to teleport there?",
    ["叹息之种（低级）"] = "Seed of Sigh (Low-Level)",
    ["叹息之种（高级）"] = "Seed of Sigh (High-Level)",
    ["叹息任务<HighLight>已完成</>，当前叹息之种的力量仍在<HighLight>激活中</>，可继续击杀其它玩家夺取<HighLight>猩红遗物</>。或使用新的叹息之种<HighLight>接取新的叹息任务</>。"] = "The <HighLight> Sighs quest has been completed </>. The power of the current Seed of Sighs is still <HighLight> activating </>; you can continue to kill other players to seize <HighLight> Scarlet Relics </>, or use a new Seed of Sighs <HighLight> to accept a new Sighs quest </>.",
