    ["吃瓜买瓜，新鲜的瓜，来一块？这瓜保熟吗？当然，不信你尝尝……唔，运气真好，还是个反转瓜！"] = "Melons for sale, fresh melons, want a slice? Is this melon ripe? Of course, don't believe me? Taste it... Hmm, lucky me, it's a reversed melon!",
