    ["吃饭班森"] = "Benson Eating",
    ["吃饭的话，面包店打烊前会打折处理当天的剩余面包，一袋黑麦面包2便士就能买到，配上1便士的豌豆汤，一顿饭只要3便士。"] = "As for meals, the bakery offers discounts on the remaining bread of the day before closing. You can buy a bag of rye bread for 2 pence, and with 1 pence of pea soup, a meal only costs 3 pence.",
    ["吃鸡次数"] = "Wins (Chicken Dinner)",
    ["各位俱乐部成员请注意：\n      <M_Default>首届四方俱乐部联赛</>将于明天（周日）<M_Default>20:00</>正式开战！<M_Default>240人</>同场厮杀，四方阵营合纵连横，这是智慧与武力的终极较量，更是为俱乐部赢得无上荣耀的巅峰战场！\n     赛区划分将于明天中午<M_Default>12:00</>进行，请务必在此之前完成以下备战工作：\n【赛前准备】\n    1. <M_Default>活跃要求确认</>：俱乐部需至少有<M_Default>5名</>活跃玩家，否则将无法获得赛区划分资格。\n    2. <M_Default>正式会员调整</>：只有<M_Default>正式会员</>可参与联赛，请会长/理事检查成员职位，将参战成员全部设为正式会员。\n    3. <M_Default>人数确认</>：每场对局最多派出<M_Default>60人</>，且单个途径最多可上场<M_Default>16人</>，请合理分配各途径人数，打造最强阵容！\n 【联赛规则】\n      可前往【俱乐部】-【活动】-【四方联赛】查看战场规则详情。"] = "Attention all club members: \n <M_Default>The First Four-Way League</> will officially begin tomorrow (Sunday) at <M_Default>20:00</>! <M_Default>240 people</> fighting on the same field, with four factions forming alliances and countering each other. This is the ultimate contest of wisdom and force, and the peak battlefield to win supreme glory for the club! \n Division will take place tomorrow at <M_Default>12:00 noon</>. Please be sure to complete the following preparations before then: \n[Pre-match Preparation]\n 1. <M_Default>Activity Requirement Confirmation</>: The club must have at least <M_Default>5</> active players, otherwise it will not be eligible for division. \n 2. <M_Default>Official Member Adjustment</>: Only <M_Default>official members</> can participate in the league. Please have the president/councilors check member positions and set all participating members as official members. \n 3. <M_Default>Number Confirmation</>: A maximum of <M_Default>60 people</> can be sent per match, and a single Pathway can have at most <M_Default>16 people</> on the field. Please allocate the number of people for each Pathway reasonably to build the strongest lineup! \n [League Rules]\n You can go to [Club] - [Activities] - [Four-Way League] to view the detailed battlefield rules.",
    ["各位先生们，今天盒饭出了些意外，这绝不是我的本意！请大家相信我！"] = "Gentlemen, there was an accident with the boxed lunches today; this was absolutely not my intention! Please believe me!",
    ["各位参赛选手，请做好准备，进入比赛区域，比赛即将开始！"] = "Contestants, please prepare yourselves and enter the competition area. The competition is about to begin!",
    ["各位市民请注意，近日廷根市内邪教分子日益猖狂，请不要轻信异教言论！发现任何可疑的人和事，务必及时向警局或教会检举。\n\n\n<Delete id=\"#158\">只有那位主才能真正体恤凡人</>\n<Delete id=\"#158\">予汝福地，护汝安眠</>"] = "Citizens, please be aware that cultists have become increasingly rampant in Tingen recently. Please do not easily believe in heretical rhetoric! If you discover any suspicious people or matters, be sure to report them to the police department or the Church in a timely manner. \n \n \n <Delete id=\"#158\"> Only that Lord can truly empathize with mortals </> \n <Delete id=\"#158\"> Grant you a blessed land, protect your slumber </>",
    ["各位放心，至少我不会让工人们流落街头的。"] = "Rest assured, everyone, at the very least, I will not let the workers end up homeless on the streets.",
    ["各位来宾，请容许我说几句话。"] = "Distinguished guests, please allow me to say a few words.",
    ["各位请先回去吧，盒饭的问题马上就会解决。"] = "Please head back for now, everyone; the issue with the boxed lunches will be resolved immediately.",
    ["各位辛苦啦，舞会的热烈氛围离不开大家的支持~"] = "Thank you all for your hard work; the lively atmosphere of the Ball would not be possible without your support~",
    ["各位都清楚，我们的业务非常特殊，但接下来这件东西，我保证谁也没有见过。"] = "Everyone knows that our business is very special, but I guarantee that no one has ever seen this next item.",
    ["各位非凡者可与自己的誓约组队参与以下活动，获得誓约值与同行纹章。\n①组队参与<Highlight>神座之争</>。\n②组队参与<Highlight>命运时刻</>。\n③组队参与<Highlight>主宰争锋</>。\n④组队参与<Highlight>日常副本</>。\n⑤组队参与<Highlight>队伍副本</>。\n⑥组队参与<Highlight>团队副本</>。\n⑦组队参与<Highlight>世界灾厄</>。\n⑧组队参与<Highlight>乌托邦剧院双人模式</>。与誓约组队参与该玩法可获得额外能力补偿。"] = "All Beyonders can team up with their Oath partner to participate in the following activities to earn Oath Points and Companion Emblems. \n ① Team up to participate in <Highlight> Throne War </>. \n ② Team up to participate in <Highlight> Fate Moment </>. \n ③ Team up to participate in <Highlight> Ruler's Clash </>. \n ④ Team up to participate in <Highlight> Daily Dungeons </>. \n ⑤ Team up to participate in <Highlight> Team Dungeons </>. \n ⑥ Team up to participate in <Highlight> Raid Dungeons </>. \n ⑦ Team up to participate in <Highlight> World Calamity </>. \n ⑧ Team up to participate in <Highlight> Utopia Theater Duo Mode </>. Teaming up with your Oath partner for this activity grants additional ability compensation.",
    ["各位非凡者可与自己的誓约组队参与以下活动，获得誓约值与同行纹章。\n①组队参与<Highlight>神座之争</>。\n②组队参与<Highlight>命运时刻</>。\n③组队参与<Highlight>主宰争锋</>。\n④组队参与<Highlight>日常副本</>。\n⑤组队参与<Highlight>队伍副本</>。\n⑥组队参与<Highlight>团队副本</>。\n⑦组队参与<Highlight>世界灾厄</>。\n⑧组队参与<Highlight>乌托邦剧院双人模式</>。双人模式下和誓约伙伴一起进入副本，可提升至副本达标评分。"] = "All Beyonders can team up with their covenant partner to participate in the following activities to earn Covenant Value and Companion Emblems. \n① Team up to participate in <Highlight>Battle for the Throne of God</>. \n② Team up to participate in <Highlight>Moment of Fate</>. \n③ Team up to participate in <Highlight>Dominator's Clash</>. \n④ Team up to participate in <Highlight>Daily Dungeon</>. \n⑤ Team up to participate in <Highlight>Team Dungeon</>. \n⑥ Team up to participate in <Highlight>Raid Dungeon</>. \n⑦ Team up to participate in <Highlight>World Calamity</>. \n⑧ Team up to participate in <Highlight>Utopia Theater Duo Mode</>. In Duo Mode, entering the dungeon with your covenant partner can increase your score to the dungeon's target rating.",
    ["各位非凡者可以报名参与七日誓约活动。\n报名结束后，会为各位非凡者随机匹配一位誓约对象（报名当天过去5天登录天数越高越容易匹配到哦）。\n匹配成功后，两位非凡者会组成为期7天的临时誓约。\n活动期间内，七日誓约对象享受额外20%的誓约值加成。\n活动期间，两位誓约者可直接发起与誓约对象的转正，转为正式誓约。\n活动期间，如果有人发起单人解契，需要缴纳少量绑定苏勒才可解契，如果双人解契，则不用缴纳绑定苏勒。\n活动结束3天后，如果非凡者没有转正，七日誓约会自动解散。"] = "Beyonders can sign up for the Seven-Day Covenant event.\nAfter registration ends, a Covenant partner will be randomly matched for each Beyonder (the higher your login days in the 5 days prior to registration, the easier it is to find a match).\nOnce matched, the two Beyonders will form a temporary Covenant for 7 days.\nDuring the event, Seven-Day Covenant partners enjoy an additional 20% Covenant Point bonus.\nDuring the event, the two partners can directly initiate a transition to a formal Covenant.\nDuring the event, if someone initiates a solo dissolution, a small amount of bound soli must be paid to dissolve the Covenant; if both parties dissolve it together, no bound soli is required.\n3 days after the event ends, if the Beyonders have not transitioned to a formal Covenant, the Seven-Day Covenant will automatically dissolve.",
    ["各位非凡者可以报名参与七日誓约活动。\n报名结束后，会为各位非凡者随机匹配一位誓约对象（报名当天过去5天登录天数越高越容易匹配到哦）。\n匹配成功后，两位非凡者会组成为期7天的临时誓约。\n活动期间内，七日誓约对象享受额外20%的誓约值加成。\n活动期间，两位誓约者可直接发起与誓约对象的转正，转为正式誓约。\n活动期间，如果有人发起单人解契，需要缴纳少量苏勒才可解契，如果双人解契，则不用缴纳苏勒。\n活动结束3天后，如果非凡者没有转正，七日誓约会自动解散。"] = "All Beyonders can sign up to participate in the Seven-Day Covenant event. \nAfter registration ends, a covenant partner will be randomly matched for you (the higher your login days in the 5 days prior to registration, the easier it is to match). \nAfter a successful match, the two Beyonders will form a temporary covenant for 7 days. \nDuring the event, Seven-Day Covenant partners enjoy an additional 20% Covenant Value bonus. \nDuring the event, the two covenant partners can directly initiate a transition to a formal covenant. \nDuring the event, if someone initiates a single-person contract dissolution, a small amount of Sol must be paid; if both parties dissolve the contract, no Sol is required. \n3 days after the event ends, if the Beyonders have not transitioned to a formal covenant, the Seven-Day Covenant will automatically dissolve.",
    ["各位！新朋友帮我们解决了难题，我们可以回王国过生日了！"] = "Everyone! Our new friend has solved the problem for us, we can go back to the kingdom to celebrate the birthday!",
    ["各位！昨天我在金烨树的断裂处，发现了红色汁液。见鬼，近来古怪的事情越来越多了。"] = "Everyone! Yesterday, I discovered red sap at the break of a Golden Leaf Tree. Damn it, strange things have been happening more and more lately.",
    ["各位，我现在要使用一些机密探案方式，请各位不要打扰。"] = "Everyone, I need to use some confidential investigative methods now. Please do not disturb me.",
    ["各位，这是我们的新朋友，今天救了我们。新朋友有问题要问，大家配合一下。"] = "Everyone, this is our new friend who saved us today. Our new friend has questions to ask, everyone please cooperate.",
