    ["同时选择三张策略卡（剩余次数<Orange>2/3</>）"] = "Select three strategy cards simultaneously (Remaining count <Orange> 2/3 </>)",
    ["同时，为魔药消化有困难的成员，安排社会实践项目，设计方便扮演的社会身份。"] = "At the same time, for members having difficulty with potion digestion, we arrange social practice projects and design social identities convenient for Acting.",
    ["同时，也是一个善良和慷慨的母亲"] = "At the same time, she was also a kind and generous mother.",
    ["同时，他的博学多识和风度翩翩也让因蒂斯的贵族们折服，结识了许多上流社会的大人物。"] = "At the same time, his erudition and graceful demeanor won over the nobles of Intis, allowing him to make acquaintances with many prominent figures in high society.",
    ["同时，有许多线索都指向了拉姆德小镇这个地方……"] = "At the same time, many clues point to this place, Lamud...",
    ["同时，这也能让我学习更多人类的说话艺术。"] = "At the same time, this also allows me to learn more of the human art of conversation.",
    ["同时，这样的身份让她避开了很多注视，在魔药消化上也非常有天赋。我们一起完成了很多“愚者”先生发布的任务。"] = "At the same time, this identity allowed her to avoid many gazes, and she is also very talented in potion digestion. We have completed many quests issued by Mr. Fool together.",
    ["同时，这样的身份让她避开了很多注视，在魔药消化上也非常有天赋。我们一起完成了很多愚者先生发布的任务。"] = "At the same time, this identity allowed her to avoid much scrutiny, and she was also very gifted at digesting potions. We completed many missions issued by Mr. Fool together.",
    ["同样的声音"] = "The same voice",
    ["同样的声音，是同一个人在制造死亡。"] = "The same voice; it is the same person causing these deaths.",
    ["同样的方式，也可以实现角色的退场，我就不展示了。"] = "The same method can also be used to achieve character exit, so I won't demonstrate that.",
    ["同样的法阵……这应该就是深入巨人王庭的路？"] = "The same magic circle... this should be the way deeper into the Giant King's Court?",
    ["同样的话别让我重复第二遍，重复同样的话是一件没用的事，我最讨厌这种没用的行为，没用，没用。"] = "Don't make me repeat the same thing twice. Repeating the same thing is a useless act. I hate such useless behavior the most. Useless, useless.",
    ["同样的，我也希望你用类似的态度看待我。"] = "Likewise, I hope you view me with a similar attitude.",
