    ["后处理库TemplateID %d 对应StateData的ClientTaskStartList必须仅存在一个Task"] = "The ClientTaskStartList of the StateData corresponding to Post-Processing Library TemplateID %d must contain only one Task",
    ["后处理库TemplateID %d 对应TaskMap[1]不存在"] = "TaskMap[1] corresponding to Post-Processing Library TemplateID %d does not exist",
    ["后处理库TemplateID %d 对应Task的TaskType必须为PostProcess类型"] = "The TaskType of the Task corresponding to Post-Processing Library TemplateID %d must be of the PostProcess type",
    ["后处理库TemplateID %d 对应Task的bUsePostProcessLibrary必须为false"] = "The bUsePostProcessLibrary of the Task corresponding to Post-Processing Library TemplateID %d must be false",
    ["后处理库TemplateID %d 对应的AbilityData不存在"] = "AbilityData corresponding to Post-Processing Library TemplateID %d does not exist",
    ["后处理技能"] = "Post-processing skill.",
    ["后天"] = "Day after tomorrow",
    ["后天，后天史丹尼喊我去钓鱼！我们打了赌谁钓得少谁请客吃饭！"] = "The day after tomorrow, Stanny is calling me to go fishing! We bet that whoever catches less treats the other to a meal!",
    ["后悔？我绝不后悔！"] = "Regret? I have no regrets!",
    ["后据点开启"] = "Rear Stronghold Opened",
    ["后排"] = "Back Row",
    ["后排赌火 I"] = "Backline Gamble I",
    ["后排赌火 II"] = "Backline Gamble II",
    ["后排赌火I"] = "Backline Gambling Fire I",
    ["后排赌火II"] = "Backline Gambling Fire II",
    ["后排赌火II：战斗开始时损失20%当前生命值，伤害增幅+30%。"] = "Backline Fire Gambling II: Lose 20% current Health at the start of combat, Damage Increase +30%.",
    ["后排赌火I：战斗开始时损失20%当前生命值，伤害增幅+17%。"] = "Backline Gamble I: Lose 20% current Health at the start of combat, Damage Boost +17%.",
    ["后排辅助"] = "Backline Support",
    ["后排输出"] = "Backline DPS",
    ["后摆"] = "Back Hem",
    ["后摇"] = "Backswing",
    ["后期处理"] = "Post-Processing",
    ["后期研修"] = "Advanced training",
    ["后期研修：最大生命值和攻击速度+12%。"] = "Advanced Training: Max Health and Attack Speed +12%.",
    ["后来……"] = "Later...",
    ["后来……后来就不接活了。"] = "Later... later I stopped taking jobs.",
    ["后来……我看着他处理每一个案子，安抚每一个失去亲人的人。他记得队里每个人的生日。"] = "Later... I watched him handle every case, comforting everyone who lost a loved one. He remembered everyone's birthday in the team.",
    ["后来为什么不弹了？"] = "Why did you stop playing later?",
    ["后来他说，有人给了他一根蜡烛，让他再也不用发抖了。"] = "Later, he said someone gave him a candle so he would never have to tremble again.",
    ["后来你们一起将杰斯送进了医院。好在他只是昏迷过去了，并没有受到严重伤害。\n布朗团长很欣赏你的演技，他认为你是未来剧团的璀璨明星，邀请你加入他们。\n但你拒绝了这番好意，毕竟，你只是一个路过的有正义感的普通市民。"] = "Later, you both sent Jess to the hospital. Fortunately, he was only stunned and did not suffer serious injury. \n Troupe Leader Brown admired your acting skills; he thought you were a shining star for the future of the troupe and invited you to join them. \n But you declined this kindness; after all, you are just an ordinary citizen with a sense of justice passing by.",
    ["后来听说贝克兰德要改革，用考试选拔工作人员。我就想……为什么不试试呢？克莱恩也这样劝我。"] = "Later, I heard that Backlund was going to reform and use exams to select staff. I thought... why not give it a try? Klein also advised me to do so.",
    ["后来呢"] = "What happened later?",
    ["后来呢？"] = "And then?",
    ["后来呢？他们为什么上岸？是不是想抢夺你们拜亚姆的资源？"] = "And then? Why did they come ashore? Were they trying to seize your resources in Bayam?",
    ["后来就再也没有见过他和那块表了，或许他和他夫人已经团聚了吧……"] = "Later, I never saw him or that watch again. Perhaps he and his wife have already reunited...",
    ["后来忘了战友的名字。记得要立碑，忘了他们是谁。"] = "Later, I forgot the names of my comrades. I remembered wanting to set up a monument, but forgot who they were.",
    ["后来怎么样？成功了吗？"] = "What happened later? Did you succeed?",
    ["后来我发现——我每卖出一颗，当天晚上她就会出现。"] = "Later I discovered—every time I sold one, she would appear that night.",
    ["后来我才明白，他没什么好怕的，他只是用自己的方式在照顾我们。"] = "Later I realized there was nothing to be afraid of; he was just taking care of us in his own way.",
    ["后来我的妻子过世，我因此消沉了很长一段时间。"] = "Later, my wife passed away, and I was depressed for a long time because of it.",
    ["后来搬了几次家。老爷渐渐就不来了。"] = "Later, we moved a few times. The master gradually stopped coming.",
    ["后来是什么改变了您的看法？"] = "What changed your mind later?",
    ["后来的一个冬天，有人从远方来，把一小块太阳放进她手心。"] = "Later, one winter, someone came from afar and placed a small piece of the sun into her palm.",
    ["后来被老维斯塔收养了，在工坊做学徒，帮维斯塔送货。"] = "Later, he was adopted by Old Vista and became an apprentice at the workshop, helping Vista with deliveries.",
    ["后来风暴教会严查了此事，毕竟这类现象极易暴露非凡存在，也可能波及无辜船只。"] = "Later, the Church of Storms strictly investigated this matter. After all, such phenomena easily expose Beyonder existence and could also affect innocent ships.",
    ["后来，他在临终前要我忘记这条领带，“勿要留恋回忆，要勇敢，要在明天迎接幸福”。所以我将它藏了起来，但没有想到，等来的却是曾经那个明朗绅士的原形毕露。"] = "Later, on his deathbed, he asked me to forget about this tie, saying, \"Do not linger on memories; be brave, and embrace happiness tomorrow.\" So I hid it away, but I never expected that what awaited me was the true colors of that once bright and cheerful gentleman.",
    ["后来，他真的要上战场了。哪怕我的力量来自于死亡的权柄，我也不希望他死亡。所以我为他制作了这根蜡烛。"] = "Later, he was really going to the battlefield. Even though my power comes from the authority of death, I didn't want him to die. So I made this candle for him.",
    ["后来，听说那个年轻人真的和收银姑娘在一起了。\n他逢人就说，那天有个奇怪的人给他唱了首歌，难听极了，但他确实不害怕了。"] = "Later, I heard that the young man really got together with the cashier girl. \n He tells everyone he meets that a strange person sang him a song that day; it was terrible, but he was truly no longer afraid.",
    ["后来，我从医学院毕业时，也是他帮我找了关系，送我到尤瑟夫诊所去工作。"] = "Later, when I graduated from medical school, he also used his connections to help me find a job at the Yusuf Clinic.",
    ["后来，我们就把他埋在山头，希望他能多看看自己喜欢的这片雪景。只是过去这么久，果然还是找不到了。"] = "Later, we buried him on the hilltop, hoping he could see more of the snowy scenery he loved. It's just that so much time has passed, and as expected, it couldn't be found.",
    ["后来，我的老师问我和卢卡斯——生命与真理，哪个更重要。"] = "Later, my teacher asked Lucas and me—which is more important, life or truth?",
    ["后来，镇上的每个孩子都开始讲他们自己的骑士与恶龙的故事。埃德蒙德，雷和露娜……那些故事都是从我这儿听去的。"] = "Later, every child in town began to tell their own stories of knights and dragons. Edmund, Ray, and Luna... those stories were all heard from me.",
    ["后枕链"] = "Back Head Chain",
    ["后果？当然会有后果。好的后果——大家都能吃饱。这就够了！"] = "Consequences? Of course there will be consequences. Good consequences—everyone can eat their fill. That's enough!",
    ["后续任务将在%d日后开启"] = "Subsequent quests will open in %d days.",
    ["后续任务将在%d时%d分后开启"] = "Subsequent quests will open in %d hours and %d minutes.",
    ["后续剧情将在%d天后开放"] = "Subsequent story content will unlock in %d days",
    ["后续剧情将在%d天后开放，可继续体验原著剧情，也可通过<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">菜单-躺赢</>完成<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">竞技</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">秩序世界</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\">城市暗面</>等活动获取大量认知经验"] = "Subsequent story content will unlock in %d days. You can continue to experience the original story, or use <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Menu-Idle Win</> to complete <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dungeons</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Arena</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Order World</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\">Dark Side of the City</>, and other activities to obtain a large amount of Cognition EXP.",
    ["后续参数省略"] = "Subsequent parameters omitted",
    ["后续处理"] = "Follow-up processing",
    ["后续完成任务%s可解锁"] = "Can be unlocked by completing subsequent quest %s.",
    ["后续尝试改成提交道具"] = "Try to change to submitting items later",
    ["后续的影响？"] = "Subsequent effects?",
    ["后续编辑器也会不断迭代和更新，而现在，我们要去吃饭了。"] = "The editor will continue to iterate and update in the future, but for now, we are going to eat.",
    ["后置氛围：占卜俱乐部新来了一位很灵的占卜师，神似曾经的【黛丝】小姐。"] = "Post-atmosphere: A new, very accurate diviner has arrived at the Divination Club, bearing a striking resemblance to the former Miss Daisy.",
    ["后置氛围：廷根报纸刊登一则新闻【近日，警方在廷根市郊的一处公寓内，发现一名不明原因身亡的年轻女子。经查，死者名为黛丝，早在半年前便已作为已故市民记录于廷根市档案。鉴于存在“死者曾死而复生”的复杂情节，案件真相目前仍在深入调查中。 】"] = "Post-atmosphere: The Tingen newspaper published a news item: [Recently, police discovered a young woman who died of unknown causes in an apartment on the outskirts of Tingen. Upon investigation, the deceased was named Daisy, who had been recorded as a deceased citizen in Tingen's archives half a year ago. Given the complex circumstances of the 'deceased having returned from the dead', the truth of the case is still under deep investigation.]",
