    ["后面是鲁恩语，“我越来越看不懂前面自己写了什么……大概是我这个天才创造的文字”……"] = "The back is in Loenese, \"I'm finding it harder and harder to understand what I wrote earlier... it's probably a language created by a genius like me\"...",
