    ["向克莱恩询问情况"] = "Ask Klein about the Situation",
    ["向凯旋冲锋！"] = "Charge toward triumph!",
    ["向前区域查看"] = "Check the area ahead",
    ["向前探索"] = "Explore forward",
    ["向前探索这个故事吧。（临时）"] = "Continue to explore this story. (Temporary)",
    ["向前方大面积高速射出巨量金币！"] = "Fire a massive amount of gold coins forward at high speed over a large area!",
    ["向前方对出多张卡牌向前方对出多张卡牌向前方对出多张卡牌向前方对出多张卡牌向前方对出多张卡牌向前方"] = "Play multiple cards forward.",
    ["向前方对出多张卡牌造成3844物理伤害， 共三段， 一段时间内没有使用则会进入冷却，第三段会将敌人击退并附加一个愚弄标记，自身获得一张命运牌。"] = "Throw multiple cards forward, dealing 3,844 Physical Damage over three stages. The skill enters cooldown if it is not used again within a certain period. The third stage knocks enemies back, applies a Fooling mark, and grants you a Fate Card.",
    ["向前方对出多张卡牌造成<Highlight>3844</>物理伤害共三段，一段时间内没有使用则会进入冷却第三段会将敌人击退并附加一个<Highlight>愚弄标记</>自身获得一张<Highlight>命运牌</>。"] = "Throw multiple cards forward, dealing <Highlight>3844</> physical damage over three hits. If the skill is not used again within a short time, it enters cooldown. The third hit knocks enemies back and applies a <Highlight>Fooling Mark</>. You gain one <Highlight>Fate Card</>.",
    ["向前方对出多张卡牌造成<Highlight>3844</>物理伤害，共三段，一段时间内没有使用则会进入冷却，第三段会将敌人击退并附加一个<Highlight>愚弄标记</>，自身获得一张<Highlight>命运牌</>。"] = "Throw multiple cards forward, dealing <Highlight>3844</> physical damage over three hits. If the skill is not used again within a short time, it enters cooldown. The third hit knocks enemies back and applies a <Highlight>Fooling Mark</>. You gain one <Highlight>Fate Card</>.",
    ["向前方扇形区域内的敌人造成伤害"] = "Deal damage to enemies in the sector area in front",
    ["向前方施放猛烈的心灵冲击，造成大量伤害和减速减疗。"] = "Launch a fierce Mind Shock forward, dealing massive damage, Slow, and Healing Reduction.",
    ["向前方连续发射两发空气炮，造成两次*d点伤害，只命中一个目标时单次伤害增加至*d点。"] = "Fire two Air Cannons in succession at the front, dealing two instances of *d damage; if only one target is hit, the single-hit damage increases to *d.",
    ["向前继续探索。"] = "Continue to explore forward.",
    ["向前走"] = "Move Forward",
    ["向前跨步进行斩击，对目标和其周围小范围内的敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\">净化</>消散状态的敌方，获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得2点<HighLight>太阳能量</>）。\n\n<FaintYellow>太阳能量</>：最多持有5点，获取太阳能量以解锁与强化<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>。"] = "Steps forward to slash, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage to the target and enemies in a small area around it, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"21\"> purifies </> enemies in a dissipated state. Gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> (gain 2 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state). \n\n<FaintYellow> Solar Energy </>: Hold up to 5 points. Obtain Solar Energy to unlock and strengthen <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>.",
    ["向前进行高速冲锋，造成大量伤害。"] = "Charge forward at high speed to deal massive damage.",
    ["向历史借取力量，立刻充满自身的卡牌能量，并且根据自身卡牌的拥有情况获得卡牌（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Borrow power from history, immediately filling the user's Card Energy, and obtain cards based on the cards currently held (used to unlock Finisher Skills).",
    ["向友方目标快速突进，解除终点区域内友方受到的弱控和减速，并为其提供15%的减伤和25%的加速，持续5秒。\n施法后若自身未处于<HighLight>力量真空</>状态，则<Highlight>3</>秒内本技能变为<HighLight>王庭号令</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Dash rapidly toward a friendly target, removing soft crowd control and slow effects from allies in the destination area, and providing them with 15% Damage Reduction and 25% Acceleration for 5 seconds. \nIf you are not in the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state after casting, this skill becomes <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> for <Highlight>3</> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times. \n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
    ["向右一些，看着镜头！"] = "A little to the right, look at the lens!",
    ["向右挥砍"] = "Right Swing",
    ["向唐格拉尔复仇"] = "Take revenge on Danglars.",
    ["向堕落母神献祭的密契仪式需要大量的血肉与灵魂，伴随着极致的疯狂和混乱。"] = "The secret ritual to sacrifice to the Mother Goddess of Depravity requires a massive amount of flesh and soul, accompanied by extreme madness and chaos.",
    ["向大地祈祷，撕开一道吞没一切的裂隙。引力如无形之手，将万物拖向虚无——那里曾是封印物“尤德拉”的囚笼，如今是你的武器。"] = "Pray to the earth and tear open a rift that swallows everything. Gravity, like an invisible hand, drags all things into nothingness—it was once the cage for the Sealed Artifact 'Yodra', and now it is your weapon.",
    ["向天鸣枪示警"] = "Fire a warning shot into the sky.",
    ["向奥黛丽询问"] = "Ask Audrey",
    ["向女士问清楚"] = "Ask the lady clearly",
    ["向女神献上肃穆清幽的深眠花，愿祂庇佑。"] = "Offer solemn and serene Deep Sleep Flowers to the Goddess, praying for Her protection.",
    ["向她们询问"] = "Ask them",
    ["向她叙述情况"] = "Describe the situation to her",
    ["向好友出售%d/10000个300%%+收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/10000 products with a 300%%+ yield rate to friends.",
    ["向好友出售%d/2000个300%%+收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/2000 products with a 300%%+ yield rate to friends.",
    ["向好友出售%d/200个300%%+收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/200 products with a 300%%+ yield rate to friends.",
    ["向好友出售%d/5000个最高收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/5000 highest-yield products to friends.",
    ["向好友出售%d/500个最高收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/500 highest-yield products to friends.",
    ["向好友出售%d/50个最高收益率物产。 "] = "Sell %d/50 highest-yield products to friends.",
    ["向它讲述笔记疑案"] = "Tell it about the notebook case",
    ["向宅邸的主人了解情况"] = "Understand the situation from the master of the mansion",
    ["向安魂诗社教团成员求助"] = "Seek help from Requiem Poetry Society members",
    ["向导"] = "Guide",
    ["向小男孩询问情况"] = "Ask the little boy about the situation",
    ["向居民打听戈多"] = "Ask the residents about Godot",
    ["向居民问问情况"] = "Ask the residents about the situation",
    ["向左"] = "Left",
    ["向左挥砍"] = "Left Swing",
    ["向希罗多德归还档案"] = "Return the Files to Herodotus",
    ["向希罗多德申请"] = "Apply to Herodotus",
    ["向希罗多德询问"] = "Ask Herodotus",
    ["向年轻人搭话"] = "Talk to the young man",
    ["向店员反馈"] = "Provide feedback to the clerk",
    ["向引力场中心牵引，单位cm/s"] = "Pull towards the center of the gravity field, unit cm/s.",
    ["向当前目标发射3枚飞弹，共造成<color=red>90%攻击力伤害</color>。"] = "Fires 3 missiles at the current target, dealing a total of <color=red>90% attack damage</color>.",
    ["向您发起键盘决斗"] = "Initiated a keyboard duel with you",
    ["向您的学习精神看齐！"] = "I will follow your spirit of learning!",
    ["向您解释一下，猫就是它的名字，我希望它能帮我抓住那些偷煎肉的老鼠！"] = "Let me explain to you, Cat is its name, I hope it can help me catch those mice that steal the fried meat!",
    ["向愚者先生祈祷。祂会指引你接下来的路。"] = "Pray to Mr. Fool. He will guide you on the path ahead.",
    ["向愚者祈祷"] = "Pray to the Fool",
    ["向愚者雕像请求"] = "Pray to the Fool Statue",
    ["向我证明，谁最值得我的奖赏。"] = "Prove to me who is most worthy of my reward.",
    ["向手镯集中绿叶宝石的灵性，启动封印物，抵挡子爵夫人的致命一击。"] = "Focus the spirituality of the green leaf gem into the bracelet to activate the Sealed Artifact and block the Viscountess's critical hit.",
    ["向指定敌方冲撞，将其持续<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击退</>并造成5次*d点物理伤害，撞开途经的其他敌方并造成*d点物理伤害；随后终结一击刺出长戟造成*d点范围物理伤害，将目标<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击退</>并附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>和*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\">滞涩</>，冲撞过程中自身<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>。当冲撞目标霸体时，自身将停止冲撞对其造成*d点物理伤害并附加终结一击的额外效果。\n施法时获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得2点<HighLight>太阳能量</>）。\n本技能可充能2次。\n\n<FaintYellow>太阳能量</>：最多持有5点，获取太阳能量以解锁与强化<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>。"] = "Charges at the designated enemy, continuously <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"> knocking back </> them and dealing 5 instances of *d physical damage, knocking aside other enemies in the path and dealing *d physical damage; then delivers a finishing strike with the halberd, dealing *d area physical damage, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"> knocking back </> the target and applying *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"> Healing Reduction </> and *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\"> Stagnation </>. You gain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> during the charge. When the charge target has Super Armor, you will stop charging, deal *d physical damage to them, and apply the additional effect of the finishing strike. \n Gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> when casting (gain 2 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state). \n This skill can be charged 2 times. \n\n<FaintYellow> Solar Energy </>: Hold up to 5 points. Obtain Solar Energy to unlock and strengthen <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>.",
    ["向指定方向突进，对路径范围内敌方造成*d点物理伤害。命中敌方后，获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。本技能可充能<HighLight>2</>次。\n若自身处于<HighLight>防御形态</>，命中敌方后，buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。\n若自身处于<HighLight>输出形态</>，命中敌方后，为其附加<HighLight>6</>秒<HighLight>衰败</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>衰败</>\nbuffdisc(*id)，多次附加时长叠加，最多持续20秒。"] = "Dash in a designated direction, dealing *d physical damage to enemies along the path. Upon hitting an enemy, gain 1 Twilight Mark <HighLight></>. This skill can be charged 2 <HighLight></> times. \n If in Defense Form <HighLight></>, hitting an enemy applies buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds. \n If in Offensive Stance <HighLight></>, hitting an enemy applies Decay <HighLight></> for 6 <HighLight></> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow> Twilight Marks </>\n strengthen the Finisher Skill <HighLight></> and Angry Slam <HighLight></>, up to a maximum of 6. \n<FaintYellow> Decay </>\n: buffdisc(*id), multiple applications stack duration, up to a maximum of 20 seconds.",
    ["向摩根说明真相"] = "Explain the truth to Morgan",
    ["向敌人丢出一张塔罗牌，展开塔罗牌阵持续造成伤害，终结时击飞怪物目标。自身根据获取的前一张卡牌类型获得一张相同的卡牌（用于解锁终结技能）和对应的额外效果。"] = "Throw a Tarot card at the enemy, unfolding a Tarot Array to continuously deal damage, and knock up monster targets upon finishing. The user obtains an identical card based on the type of the previous card obtained (used to unlock Finisher Skills) and the corresponding additional effect.",
    ["向敌人发动冲锋盾击，随后借势跳砸，对敌人附加衰败（持续造成伤害）并造成伤害和控制，对玩家额外造成减疗，自身获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。使用后解锁王庭号令。"] = "Launch a charge shield bash at enemies, then use the momentum to jump smash, applying decay (continuous damage) to enemies while dealing damage and control. Applies additional healing reduction to players, and you gain a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Unlocks Royal Court Command after use.",
    ["向敌人发射精神能量冲击，造成单体伤害。"] = "Launch a mental energy shock at the enemy, dealing single-target damage.",
    ["向敌方目标快速突进，以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>目标和其周围小范围内的敌方并造成*d点物理伤害，附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>和*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\">滞涩</>，突进过程中自身<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>。\n施法时获得1点<HighLight>太阳能量</>（<HighLight>烈阳</>状态下获得2点<HighLight>太阳能量</>）。\n本技能可充能2次。\n\n<FaintYellow>太阳能量</>：最多持有5点，获取太阳能量以解锁与强化<HighLight>惩戒</>和<HighLight>无暗之枪</>。"] = "Quickly dashes to the enemy target, with a base probability of *f** to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"> knock down </> the target and enemies in a small area around it, dealing *d physical damage and applying *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"> Healing Reduction </> and *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\"> Stagnation </>. You gain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> during the dash. \n Gain 1 point of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> when casting (gain 2 points of <HighLight> Solar Energy </> in the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state). \n This skill can be charged 2 times. \n\n<FaintYellow> Solar Energy </>: Hold up to 5 points. Obtain Solar Energy to unlock and strengthen <HighLight> Punishment </> and <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>.",
    ["向敌方目标快速突进，对终点区域内敌方造成*d点物理伤害，以*f**的基础概率施加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>，并对敌方玩家附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。随后下砸对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物，以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方玩家，同时自身获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。\n<HighLight>输出形态</>下每次命中敌方时将为其附加<Highlight>6</>秒<HighLight>衰败</>。\n施法后若自身未处于<HighLight>力量真空</>状态，则<Highlight>3</>秒内本技能变为<HighLight>王庭号令</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>衰败</>\nbuffdisc(*id)，多次附加时长叠加，最多持续20秒。\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Dash rapidly toward an enemy target, dealing *d physical damage to enemies in the destination area, with an *f** base probability of applying <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Imprisonment</> for *f seconds, and causing *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</> to enemy players. Then, slam down to deal *d physical damage to surrounding enemies, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">knocking down</> enemy monsters, with an *f** base probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy players, while gaining 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</>. \n<HighLight>In Offensive Stance</>, each hit on an enemy applies <Highlight>6</> seconds of <HighLight>Decay</>. \nIf you are not in the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state after casting, this skill becomes <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> for <Highlight>3</> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times. \n<FaintYellow>Decay</>\nbuffdisc(*id), duration stacks with multiple applications, lasting up to 20 seconds. \n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
    ["向旁边市民询问"] = "Ask the nearby citizens",
    ["向旁边的<h>市民</>询问"] = "Ask the <h> citizen </> nearby",
    ["向日葵"] = "Sunflower",
    ["向日葵盛放在鞋柜顶上，让出入之间多了一点明朗。"] = "Sunflowers bloom on top of the shoe cabinet, adding a touch of brightness to the entryway.",
    ["向日葵追随着光明绽放，你找到了生命的真谛。在这金色的祝福下，一切充满可能。 "] = "The sunflower blooms following the light; you have found the true meaning of life. Under this golden blessing, everything is possible.",
    ["向杰克解释"] = "Explain to Jack",
    ["向杰西小队长寻求帮助"] = "Seek help from Team Leader Jessie",
    ["向欲念使者证明你理解了蒙提霍尔悖论"] = "Prove to the Messenger of Desire that you understand the Monty Hall problem",
    ["向歌声的方向移动<h></>"] = "Move in the direction of the singing <h></>",
    ["向汉娜交代一下"] = "Brief Hannah",
    ["向混沌祈祷中"] = "Praying to Chaos...",
    ["向琳达招手"] = "Wave at Linda",
    ["向目标丢出塔罗牌并展开牌阵, 对牌阵内敌方造成4次spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方怪物, 随后牌阵爆炸造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害, 并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>范围内的敌方怪物目标，最多<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>2个目标。施法后获得一张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>，对爆炸命中的敌方附加一层<HighLight>愚弄标记</>；若上次获得为<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>，则改为获得一张<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>，且爆炸命中后获得一点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>命运黄牌</>/<FaintYellow>灵性蓝牌</>：获得三张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>/<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>时消耗所有卡牌，使<HighLight>终结技能洗牌</>切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>/<HighLight>灵性爆发</>。\n<FaintYellow>卡牌能量</>：最多持有5点，达到5点时<HighLight>终结技能</>切换并锁定为<HighLight>洗牌</>。\n<FaintYellow>愚弄标记</>：叠加3层后引爆并移除愚弄标记，受到施加者造成的mul(*d,3)点物理伤害。"] = "Throw tarot cards at the target and deploy a card formation, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage 4 times to enemy monsters within the formation and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> them. The formation then explodes, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launching</> enemy monsters within range, up to a maximum of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launching</> 2 targets. Upon casting, gain one <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Card</> and apply one stack of <HighLight>Fooling Mark</> to enemies hit by the explosion; if the last card obtained was a <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Card</>, gain a <HighLight>Spirituality Blue Card</> instead and gain one point of <HighLight>Card Energy</> upon the explosion hit. \n\n<FaintYellow>Fooling of Fate Yellow Card</>/<FaintYellow>Spirituality Blue Card</>: When three <HighLight>Fooling of Fate Yellow Cards</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Blue Cards</> are collected, consume all cards to switch the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Shuffle</> to <HighLight>Fooling of Fate</>/<HighLight>Spirituality Burst</>. \n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: Can hold up to 5 points. When reaching 5 points, the <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> switches and locks to <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>. \n<FaintYellow>Fooling Mark</>: After stacking 3 times, it detonates and is removed, dealing mul(*d,3) physical damage to the target from the caster.",
    ["向目标位置穿梭，获得0.8秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\">无敌</>和2秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，并对区域内的敌方造成4次*d点魔法伤害，随后引爆追加*d点魔法伤害，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物，并附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。"] = "Shuttle to the target location, gain 0.8 seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\">Invincibility</> and 2 seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</>, deal *d magic damage 4 times to enemies in the area, then detonate to deal an additional *d magic damage, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">knocking down</> enemy monsters and applying *f seconds of mul(*d%,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</>.",
    ["向目标快速突进，目标为敌方时，对终点区域内单位造成*d点物理伤害，以*f**的基础概率施加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>，并对敌方玩家附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。随后下砸对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物，以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方玩家，同时自身获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>；当自身是<HighLight>防御形态</>并且目标为友方时，为友方解除弱控、减速，并为其附加<HighLight>瞬援</>，使其buffdisc(*id)，持续5秒。\n<HighLight>输出形态</>下每次命中敌方时将为其附加<Highlight>6</>秒<HighLight>衰败</>。\n施法后若自身未处于<HighLight>力量真空</>状态，则<Highlight>3</>秒内本技能变为<HighLight>王庭号令</>，此时的王庭号令在防御形态下对敌方玩家没有击倒效果。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>衰败</>\nbuffdisc(*id)，多次附加时长叠加，最多持续20秒。\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Dash rapidly toward a target. If the target is an enemy, deal *d physical damage to units in the destination area, with an *f** base probability of applying <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Imprisonment</> for *f seconds, and causing *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</> to enemy players. Then, slam down to deal *d physical damage to surrounding enemies, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">knocking down</> enemy monsters, with an *f** base probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy players, while gaining 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</>; when you are in <HighLight>Defense Form</> and the target is an ally, remove soft crowd control and slow effects from the ally, and apply <HighLight>Instant Aid</>, buffdisc(*id) them for 5 seconds. \n<HighLight>In Offensive Stance</>, each hit on an enemy applies <Highlight>6</> seconds of <HighLight>Decay</>. \nIf you are not in the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state after casting, this skill becomes <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> for <Highlight>3</> seconds; in this state, Royal Court Command has no knock-down effect on enemy players in Defense Form. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times. \n<FaintYellow>Decay</>\nbuffdisc(*id), duration stacks with multiple applications, lasting up to 20 seconds. \n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
    ["向着城堡的明天"] = "Towards the tomorrow of the castle",
    ["向神明祈祷、求助学派可以解决你的一部分困难，但不要怠于提升自身实力。"] = "Praying to gods and seeking help from the school can solve some of your difficulties, but do not be lazy in improving your own strength.",
