    ["听“倒吊人”先生提过，他曾目睹两位中序列非凡者为争夺一件封印物在海上交战，余波竟让海面燃烧了十几分钟。"] = "I heard the 'Hanged Man' mention that he once witnessed two mid-sequence Beyonders fighting at sea over a Sealed Artifact, and the aftermath actually caused the sea surface to burn for over ten minutes.",
    ["听“报幕员”报幕"] = "Listen to the \"Announcer\" make an announcement.",
