    ["听上去您很了解这家俱乐部？"] = "It sounds like you know this Club very well?",
    ["听上去非常不错，不过我需要先回家仔细思考下再做决定。"] = "It sounds very good, but I need to go home and think about it carefully before making a decision.",
    ["听下去"] = "Keep listening",
    ["听不懂你在说什么，不过这只是一个空盒子，请带走它吧。对了，关于酬劳，我打算记在弗莱队长的账上，嘿嘿。"] = "I don't understand what you are talking about, but this is just an empty box. Please take it away. By the way, regarding the payment, I plan to put it on Captain Frye's tab, hehe.",
    ["听不懂，听不懂。"] = "Don't understand, don't understand.",
    ["听不懂，听不懂！"] = "Don't understand, don't understand!",
    ["听不见了？"] = "Can't hear it anymore?",
    ["听丽贝卡介绍案件"] = "Listen to Rebecca introduce the case",
    ["听他们聊"] = "Listen to them chat",
    ["听他们说了什么"] = "Listen to what they said",
    ["听他们说您是一位尊贵的骑士！"] = "I heard from them that you are a noble knight!",
    ["听他家人说，实在不行……只能把骨灰撒进下水道了。"] = "His family said if there's really no other way... they'll have to scatter his ashes into the sewer.",
