    ["听众纷纷沉默不语。"] = "The audience fell into Silence.",
    ["听伦纳德解释"] = "Listen to Leonard's explanation",
    ["听佐伊介绍"] = "Listen to Zoe's introduction",
    ["听你说说"] = "Let me hear you talk",
    ["听八卦有些可耻，但讲八卦只讲一半更可耻！"] = "It's shameful to listen to gossip, but it's even more shameful to only tell half of it!",
    ["听到不该听的呓语"] = "Heard whispers that shouldn't be heard",
    ["听到了吗，伊莎贝尔，一会儿我就带你去采买一些备考资料。"] = "Did you hear that, Isabelle? I will take you to buy some study materials in a while.",
    ["听到了吗？这个声音！"] = "Did you hear that? This sound!",
    ["听到你们玩得很开心 好奇来看看"] = "Heard you were having a great time, curious to come and see.",
    ["听到没！"] = "Did you hear that!",
    ["听到的乐声"] = "The music heard",
    ["听到皮特砍伐声位置"] = "Position where Pete's chopping sound is heard",
    ["听古德曼最后的交代"] = "Listen to Goodman's final words",
    ["听古德曼说出真相"] = "Listen to Goodman tell the truth",
    ["听同事姐姐说，女孩子一定要拥有自己的表，可她没说表卖得这么贵……"] = "My colleague said that a girl must have her own watch, but she didn't say they were this expensive...",
    ["听听"] = "Listen",
    ["听听<h>丽埃娜</>想说什么"] = "Listen to what <h>Liana</> wants to say",
    ["听听<h>伦纳德</>要说什么"] = "Listen to what <h>Leonard</> has to say",
    ["听听<h>女士</>的委托"] = "Listen to the <h>lady's</> request",
    ["听听<h>屋内</>的动静"] = "Listen to the movement <h>inside the house</>",
    ["听听<h>屋内的声音</>"] = "Listen to the <h> sound inside the house </>",
    ["听听<h>工人们</>的抱怨"] = "Listen to the <h> workers' </> complaints",
    ["听听“它”要说什么"] = "Listen to what \"it\" has to say",
    ["听听丽埃娜想说什么"] = "Listen to what Liana wants to say.",
    ["听听人们在说什么"] = "Listen to what people are saying",
    ["听听人们的议论"] = "Listen to people's discussions",
    ["听听介绍"] = "Listen to the introduction",
    ["听听他们在什么"] = "Listen to what they are saying",
    ["听听他们在聊什么"] = "Listen to what they are talking about",
    ["听听他们在说什么"] = "Listen to what they are saying",
    ["听听他们怎么看"] = "Listen to what they think",
    ["听听他们的交谈"] = "Listen to their conversation",
    ["听听动静"] = "Listen for Movement",
    ["听听发生了什么"] = "Listen to what happened",
    ["听听周围人在聊什么"] = "Listen to what the people around are talking about",
    ["听听大家在聊什么"] = "Listen to what everyone is talking about",
    ["听听女士的请求"] = "Listen to the lady's request",
    ["听听居民们的聊天"] = "Listen to the residents' chat",
    ["听听居民们聊天"] = "Listen to the residents chat",
    ["听听屋内的动静"] = "Listen to the Movement Inside the Room",
    ["听听工人的对话"] = "Listen to the workers' conversation",
    ["听听布兰登的想法"] = "Listen to Brandon's thoughts",
    ["听听弗莱与神秘女士的交谈"] = "Listen to the conversation between Frye and the mysterious lady",
    ["听听故事"] = "Listen to stories",
    ["听听杰德的想法"] = "Listen to Jade's thoughts",
    ["听听流水，洗去耳畔低语"] = "Listen to the flowing water, wash away the whispers in your ears.",
    ["听听看"] = "Listen in",
    ["听听看？"] = "Listen to it?",
    ["听听索菲娅在说什么"] = "Listen to What Sophia is Saying",
    ["听听职员们的对话"] = "Listen to the staff's conversation",
    ["听听职员们聊天"] = "Listen to the staff chat",
    ["听听蒙特利的回忆"] = "Listen to Monterey's memories",
    ["听听蒙特利的想法"] = "Listen to Monterey's thoughts",
    ["听听这个<h>学生</>要说什么"] = "Listen to what this <h>student</> has to say",
    ["听听里面的声音！不妙！很不妙！"] = "Listen to the sounds inside! It's bad! Very bad!",
    ["听听雾中的声音"] = "Listen to the Voices in the Fog",
    ["听听雾中的声音dia"] = "Listen to the Voices in the Fog dia",
    ["听大人说，他们在赚钱，替他们的哥哥治病。"] = "I heard from adults that they are making money to treat their brother's illness.",
    ["听她们聊天"] = "Listen to their chat",
    ["听她胡扯！考上大学的是马莉卡姊妹家的女婿的弟弟。"] = "Don't listen to her nonsense! The one who got into university is the younger brother of the son-in-law of Malika's sister.",
    ["听她说"] = "Listen to her",
    ["听好了，我们今天只做二等车厢的生意，那里的先生小姐虽不阔绰，但总不会付假钞票。"] = "Listen up, we only do business in the second-class carriages today. The gentlemen and ladies there aren't wealthy, but they won't pay with counterfeit bills.",
    ["听好了，本周的熔炉班，每天工作12小时，一天1苏勒，干不干？竞争的人有很多。"] = "Listen up. This week's furnace shift is 12 hours a day for 1 Sol. Want it? Plenty of people are competing for the job.",
    ["听好了，本周的熔炉班，每天工作12小时，一天1苏勒，谁想干？"] = "Listen up, the furnace shift this week is 12 hours a day, 1 soli a day, who wants to do it?",
    ["听好了，首先，讲一下<P_Yellow>工厂里恶劣的工作环境</>。"] = "Listen, first, let's talk about the <P_Yellow>harsh working conditions in the factory</>.",
    ["听学姐介绍题目"] = "Listen to the senior student introduce the topic",
    ["听对话镜头"] = "Listen to Dialogue Camera",
    ["听弗莱介绍情况"] = "Listen to Frye explain the situation",
    ["听您的吩咐，警官。"] = "As you command, officer.",
    ["听我的，投约瑟夫，大家都看好他！"] = "Listen to me, vote for Joseph, everyone is optimistic about him!",
    ["听我继续说，她还有一个卧病在床的母亲，现在药钱也很贵，济贫院也排不上号。"] = "Let me continue, she also has a mother bedridden with illness, and now medicine is very expensive, and the poorhouse doesn't have a spot for her either.",
    ["听我说。我们今天的行动是为了整点薯条。"] = "Listen to me. Our action today is to get some fries.",
    ["听我说本杰明，这个护身符拿好，是我和老托马斯走散前，他托我转交给你的。"] = "Listen to me, Benjamin, take this amulet. Old Thomas asked me to pass it to you before we got separated.",
    ["听我说，赛琳娜的魔镜占卜出了问题。"] = "Listen to me, Selena's Mirror Divination has gone wrong.",
    ["听明白了，只要<P_Yellow>把莉莉灌醉</>，她就会暂时失去意识。"] = "Understood. As long as I <P_Yellow>get Lily drunk</>, she will temporarily lose consciousness.",
    ["听汉娜说明情况"] = "Listen to Hannah Explain the Situation",
    ["听清楚了，学校北边有个废弃很久的<P_Yellow>报刊亭</>，窗户是用报纸糊住的。"] = "Listen carefully, there is a long-abandoned <P_Yellow> newsstand </> on the north side of the school, and the windows are covered with newspapers.",
    ["听清楚了，学校北边有个废弃很久的报刊亭，窗户是用报纸糊住的。"] = "Listen clearly, there's a long-abandoned newsstand north of the school, and its windows are covered with newspaper.",
    ["听男仆说，早上有修理工过来，他有诊断出故障理由吗？"] = "I heard from the valet that a repairman came this morning. Did he diagnose the reason for the malfunction?",
    ["听着……艾玛小姐被困在二楼！"] = "Listen... Miss Emma is trapped on the second floor!",
    ["听着伙计们，今天我们一定能赚够本周的饭钱，同意的举手！"] = "Listen up, guys, we'll definitely earn enough for this week's meals today. Raise your hand if you agree!",
    ["听着怪怪的，但是感觉很有道理。"] = "Sounds weird, but it feels very reasonable.",
    ["听着让人难过……"] = "That sounds sad...",
    ["听着，“罪恶廷根”是所有人憋在心里的烂摊子具象化出来的城市暗面，像不像见不得光的下水道？"] = "Listen, \"Sinful Tingen\" is the dark side of the city, a manifestation of the mess everyone keeps bottled up inside. Doesn't it look like a sewer that can't see the light?",
    ["听着，卢娜。我是罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，我征服过王国，改变过历史。 "] = "Listen, Luna. I am Roselle Gustav, I have conquered kingdoms and changed history.",
    ["听着，孩子。"] = "Listen, child.",
    ["听着，小伙子们！"] = "Listen up, lads!",
    ["听着，这间屋子不干净，‘它’就在外面。"] = "Listen, this room is not clean; 'it' is outside.",
    ["听着，这间屋子不干净，“它”就在外面。"] = "Listen, this room isn't clean. \"It\" is right outside.",
    ["听着，道奇，天黑之前没收拾完的话……给我等着！"] = "Listen, Dodge, if you haven't finished cleaning by dark... just you wait!",
    ["听着，风暴之主的唱诗班可不是过家家！在大海上，歌声就是水手们的武器。"] = "Listen, the choir of the Lord of Storms is not child's play! On the high seas, singing is the sailors' weapon.",
    ["听老大的！砸烂这马车！"] = "Listen to the boss! Smash this carriage!",
    ["听见了吗卢比先生？不招人，我就不干了！"] = "Did you hear that, Mr. Ruby? If you don't hire anyone, I'm quitting!",
    ["听见了谁的呼喊声……"] = "Heard someone's cry for help...",
    ["听见别人无法听见的声音，看见别人无法看见的事情，时时刻刻都受到神秘的引诱和虚幻的蛊惑。"] = "Hearing sounds that others cannot hear, seeing things that others cannot see, and being constantly subjected to mysterious temptations and illusory bewitchment.",
    ["听见莎莉的声音"] = "Hear Sally's voice",
    ["听觉  →"] = "Hearing →",
    ["听警官说，犯人入狱，钱财已到位，去看看吧！"] = "I heard from the police officer that the criminal is in jail and the money is ready. Let's go take a look!",
    ["听警官通知，犯人入狱，钱财已到位，去看看吧！"] = "Listen to the officer's notification; the criminal is in jail, the money is in place, go take a look!",
    ["听话的狗"] = "Obedient dog",
    ["听话，我下次一定给你买，我们先回家……"] = "Behave, I'll buy it for you next time. Let's go home first...",
    ["听说……"] = "I heard...",
    ["听说……去年埃斯科森岛那场风暴里，沉了二十条船……"] = "I heard... in that storm at Eskerson Island last year, twenty ships sank...",
    ["听说一颗梦境捕手的心脏，在黑市能卖五百金镑！"] = "I heard that a Dream Catcher's heart can sell for five hundred pounds on the black market!",
    ["听说下街最近又在流行风寒……女神庇佑，真希望不要染到这儿来。"] = "I heard that a cold has been going around Lower Street recently... May the Goddess protect us, I really hope it doesn't spread here.",
    ["听说了。南希上周被辞退，昨天就有人看见她在街角揽客。"] = "I heard. Nancy was fired last week, and yesterday someone saw her soliciting on the street corner.",
    ["听说了么……"] = "Have you heard...",
    ["听说了吗？恶龙酒吧出现了一位冒险家，还带着一件来自海上的神秘物品。"] = "Have you heard? An adventurer has appeared at the Evil Dragon Bar, and he's carrying a mysterious object from the sea.",
    ["听说了吗？那件事……"] = "Have you heard? That matter...",
    ["听说五月庄园的子爵夫人很慷慨，不会拖欠薪资的。"] = "I heard that the Viscountess of May Manor is very generous and won't delay wages.",
    ["听说他们在贝克兰德过得很好，我也为他们高兴。只是可惜了克莱恩先生……"] = "I heard they are doing very well in Backlund, and I am happy for them. It's just a pity about Mr. Klein...",
    ["听说他们感情不和？"] = "Heard they have a bad relationship?",
    ["听说他们把牛排煎得外皮焦香，内里嫩得很，肉汁锁得足足的， 酱汁也熬得浓郁醇厚。哪像食堂的汤水，寡淡得连个味道都没有。 "] = "I heard they sear the steak until the crust is charred and fragrant, while the inside is tender and juicy, with a rich and mellow sauce. Unlike the cafeteria's soup, which is so bland it doesn't even have a taste.",
    ["听说他回家探亲了，这一带的人都知道。"] = "I heard he went home to visit relatives; everyone in this area knows.",
    ["听说他好像很快就反悔了，声称自己没有做过这件事。但凯娜小姐在进行协议公证时就陪在他身边，是天然的证人。"] = "I heard he seemed to go back on his word very quickly, claiming he never did such a thing. But Miss Kena was by his side when the agreement was notarized, so she is a natural witness.",
    ["听说他整夜失眠，整个人都不太对劲。"] = "I heard he suffers from insomnia all night, and he hasn't been himself at all.",
    ["听说他离开济贫院后在码头附近找到了孩子，可是那已经是一具冰冷的尸体了。"] = "I heard that after he left the poorhouse, he found the child near the docks, but it was already a cold corpse.",
    ["听说伦纳德先生最近在<P_Yellow>俱乐部</>，或许我应该去问问他这些奇异的光球是什么……"] = "I heard Mr. Leonard is at the <P_Yellow>Club</> recently; perhaps I should go ask him what these strange light orbs are...",
    ["听说你们在找人试驾？（出示警徽）我想试试。"] = "I heard you are looking for people to test drive? (Showing police badge) I'd like to try.",
    ["听说你们管这里叫“安全屋”？"] = "I heard you call this place a \"Safe House\"?",
    ["听说你去了占卜俱乐部？测得准吗？"] = "I heard you went to the Divination Club? Was it accurate?",
    ["听说你在这里混得不错？"] = "I heard you're doing well here?",
    ["听说你已经成为非凡者了，真是令人称赞的速度。"] = "I heard you've already become a Beyonder. That's a truly commendable speed.",
    ["听说你最近缺钱？"] = "I heard you're short on money lately?",
    ["听说内部资料非常可靠。"] = "I heard the internal information is very reliable.",
    ["听说哈罗德百货又出新款了。"] = "I heard Harold Department Store has new arrivals again.",
    ["听说哈罗德百货开业后，会在第一周周五下午三点过后进行特惠活动。"] = "I heard that after Harold's Department Store opens, they will have a special discount event after 3:00 PM on the first Friday.",
    ["听说因蒂斯那边的人都很擅长从天上跳下来……"] = "I heard that people from Intis are very good at jumping down from the sky...",
    ["听说在盥洗室祈祷的效果格外好……"] = "I heard that prayer is especially effective in the washroom...",
    ["听说塔罗牌只是罗塞尔大帝发明出来的游戏，其实并不具备占卜的功能？"] = "I heard that Tarot cards were just a game invented by Emperor Roselle and don't actually have the function of divination?",
    ["听说多瓦尔也不再跑酷了……改在天台种花了，挺好。"] = "Heard Doval stopped parkouring too... started planting flowers on the rooftop, that's nice.",
    ["听说大剧院附近，有一本会说话的神奇故事书。"] = "Have you heard? There is a talking mystical storybook near the Grand Theater.",
    ["听说她去了因蒂斯和费内波特学习甜品制作，直到之前那场战争，才回到鲁恩。"] = "I heard she went to Intis and Feynapot to study dessert making, and only returned to Loen until that war.",
    ["听说她船上有个图书馆，里面的书会自己翻页！"] = "I heard there is a library on her ship, and the books inside turn pages by themselves!",
    ["听说廷根大剧院附近有一本神奇的故事书，去试着找找吧。"] = "I heard there is a magical storybook near the Tingen Grand Theater; go try to find it.",
    ["听说您打牌输过不少钱？"] = "I heard you've lost quite a bit of money playing cards?",
    ["听说您是位作家？"] = "I heard you are a writer?",
    ["听说您还属于风暴之主教会……这有多久了？"] = "I heard you also belong to the Church of the Lord of Storms... how long has it been?",
    ["听说您需要一笔钱扩大杂货店的规模？银行那些趾高气昂的业务员只会让您白跑一趟，不如……"] = "I heard you need a sum of money to expand your grocery store? Those arrogant bank clerks will only make you run for nothing, why not...",
    ["听说教堂地下关押着好多凶猛的邪兽，要不是大主教镇压着，它们早就跑出来吃人了！"] = "I heard that many ferocious evil beasts are locked in the cathedral's basement, and if it weren't for the Archbishop suppressing them, they would have run out to eat people long ago!",
    ["听说新出的面包很好吃，我一定要尝尝！"] = "I heard the new Bread is delicious; I must try it!",
    ["听说是一种奇异的怪病掏空了他的家产，也摧毁了他的精神。"] = "I heard it was a strange, mysterious illness that drained his family's fortune and destroyed his mind.",
    ["听说是受到极端情绪的影响，这位魔女爆发了对曾经爱人极其强烈的情感，导致状态很不稳定。"] = "I heard it was influenced by extreme emotions. This witch erupted with extremely intense feelings for her former lover, causing her state to be very unstable.",
    ["听说是有居民举报，在某处发现了神秘仪式的痕迹。"] = "I heard a resident reported finding traces of a mysterious ritual somewhere.",
    ["听说最近常有人用马桶藏匿物品，会不会是因为扔东西堵住了？"] = "I heard that people often use toilets to hide things recently. Could it be clogged because someone threw something in?",
    ["听说有些动物也受到了影响……"] = "I heard some animals were affected too...",
    ["听说有位伟大的生物学家曾经把小麦和牛杂交，这是一次巨大的物种基因进化！我一直很好奇为什么到处都找不到相关的文献？"] = "I heard a great biologist once crossbred wheat with beef tripe; that was a massive genetic evolution of species! I've always been curious why I can't find any relevant literature anywhere?",
    ["听说枪声响后，他的邻居立刻就赶到了现场，菲利普的确是开枪自杀的。"] = "I heard that after the gunshot, his neighbor arrived at the scene immediately; Philip did indeed commit suicide by shooting.",
    ["听说没，隔壁老瑞恩买了一辆脚踏车，用起来比马车方便多了。"] = "Have you heard? Old Ryan next door bought a bicycle; it's much more convenient to use than a carriage.",
    ["听说波拿巴餐厅的名称是那位罗塞尔大帝路过的时候起的……"] = "I heard that the name of Bonaparte Restaurant was given by that Emperor Roselle when he passed by...",
    ["听说海默教员又开了个20小时的演讲……"] = "Heard Instructor Haimer gave another 20-hour lecture...",
    ["听说温莎裁缝店新来了一批布料，过两天带夫人去看看。"] = "I heard Windsor Tailor Shop got a new batch of fabric; I'll take my wife to see it in a couple of days.",
    ["听说给它起这个名字的是奥黛丽小姐和伦纳德先生。"] = "I heard that Ms. Audrey and Mr. Leonard were the ones who named it.",
    ["听说老尼尔的人生中，曾有一个淡绿色的春天。"] = "I heard that in Old Neil's life, there was once a pale green spring.",
    ["听说老板你这里消息很灵通。"] = "I heard you're very well-informed, boss.",
    ["听说能欣赏雏菊香味的，都是富有同情心的人。"] = "I heard that those who can appreciate the fragrance of daisies are all compassionate people.",
    ["听说街角咖啡店推出了新款咖啡，去看看吧。"] = "I heard the corner cafe launched a new coffee. Let's go check it out.",
    ["听说西迦女士最近在写作，这些她应该用得到。"] = "I heard Ms. Xiga has been writing lately; she should be able to use these.",
    ["听说议员们要扩建霍伊河。"] = "I heard the councilors are going to expand the Hoy River.",
    ["听说贵族间的相亲宴规矩很多？"] = "I heard there are many rules for matchmaking banquets among nobles?",
    ["听说过"] = "I've heard of it",
    ["听说过一些，我记得他是个珠宝匠……"] = "I've heard of him. I remember he was a jeweler...",
    ["听说这内部资料卖的比印刷成本还便宜，我还以为是骗子，没想到竟然真的有用。"] = "I heard these insider materials were sold cheaper than the printing cost. I thought it was a scam, but I didn't expect them to actually be useful.",
    ["听说这只公鸡之前是斗鸡比赛的种子选手，难怪这么高产，不愧是“战斗鸡”！"] = "I heard this rooster was a top contender in cockfighting matches before. No wonder it's so productive; it truly is a 'fighting chicken'!",
    ["听说这只猫的名字是“甜冰茶”，而为它起名的人似乎正是奥黛丽小姐和伦纳德先生。"] = "I heard that the cat's name is \"Sweet Iced Tea,\" and the person who named it seems to be Miss Audrey and Mr. Leonard.",
    ["听说这家诊所药到病除。"] = "I heard this clinic is very effective.",
    ["听说这里刚刚解雇了一批孩子。"] = "I heard that a group of children were just fired here.",
    ["听说这里埋的都是以前战死的勇士，我的小猫肯定也和他们一样勇敢吧？"] = "I heard that the warriors who died in battle are buried here. My kitten must be as brave as them, right?",
    ["听说这里有人想看小丑？"] = "I heard someone here wants to see a Clown?",
    ["听说这里有喝了能梦见未来的酒？"] = "I heard there's wine here that lets you dream of the future?",
    ["听说那个瑞吉赌博赢了一大笔钱，才想着来做生意。"] = "I heard that Regi won a huge sum of money gambling, which is why he thought of doing business.",
    ["听说那架钢琴有灵性，只要坐在那里，什么都不用想，就可以弹出悠扬的旋律。"] = "I heard that piano has spirituality; as long as you sit there, you don't need to think about anything to play a melodious melody.",
    ["听说钢铁厂在招人呢？"] = "I heard the steel mill is hiring?",
    ["听说风寒……"] = "I heard that the cold...",
    ["听说马莉卡的小儿子考上贝克兰德大学了？"] = "Did you hear that Malika's youngest son got into Backlund University?",
    ["听说龙肉是辣味的，真的吗？"] = "I heard dragon meat is spicy, is that true?",
    ["听课采集1"] = "Listen to lecture collection 1",
    ["听课采集2"] = "Class Attendance Gathering 2",
    ["听起来……是一些属于孩子的东西。"] = "Sounds like... things that belong to children.",
    ["听起来不只是这种内容。"] = "That doesn't sound like just that.",
    ["听起来不太对劲，还是先用能力看看他隐瞒了什么吧。"] = "Something doesn't sound right. I should use my ability first to see what he's hiding.",
    ["听起来不是什么困难的事情。"] = "Doesn't sound like a difficult thing.",
    ["听起来不简单，能举一些例子吗？"] = "Sounds not simple, can you give some examples?",
