    ["听起来你过得很好？"] = "Sounds like you were doing well?",
    ["听起来像是策划想偷懒，不想再做一遍了。"] = "Sounds like the planner wants to be lazy and doesn't want to do it again.",
    ["听起来关系似乎没那么糟？"] = "It sounds like the relationship isn't that bad?",
    ["听起来十分虔诚"] = "Sounds very devout",
    ["听起来多奇怪，阁下，大量的针刺入皮肤就能缓解腰痛，这是什么道理！"] = "It sounds so strange, sir. A large number of needles inserted into the skin can relieve lower back pain—what kind of logic is that!",
    ["听起来太酷了，我也想试试，没想到这么高啊。"] = "Sounds cool, I want to try it too. I didn't expect it to be this high.",
    ["听起来好复杂……失踪，献祭，0级封印物，污染，还有罗塞尔大帝？"] = "That sounds so complicated... Disappearances, sacrifices, a Grade 0 Sealed Artifact, corruption, and Emperor Roselle?",
    ["听起来好熟悉……但总感觉哪里不太对劲。"] = "It sounds so familiar... but I always feel like something is not quite right.",
    ["听起来好神奇……这也是心理治疗的一部分？"] = "Sounds amazing... Is this also part of the psychotherapy?",
    ["听起来就像……春天来了"] = "It sounds like... spring has arrived.",
    ["听起来很不错。"] = "Sounds great.",
