    ["听起来还不错。"] = "That sounds pretty good.",
    ["听起来还挺有意思的，进去看看吧。"] = "Sounds quite interesting, let's go in and take a look.",
    ["听起来这怀表对他很重要，而且可能和雪莉有关。去看看能不能追上他吧。"] = "It sounds like this pocket watch is very important to him, and it might be related to Shirley. Go see if you can catch up with him.",
    ["听起来那时候很热闹……"] = "Sounds like it was very lively back then...",
    ["听起来都很好……"] = "They all sound good...",
    ["听起来都是很好的人，真想见见他们呀……"] = "They all sound like good people. I really want to meet them...",
