    ["吸附"] = "Adsorb",
    ["吹制于黑色玻璃中的密封小瓶，内壁刻有古弗萨克封印符文，据说以此压制着存放其中的、真正来自深渊的气息。当砸碎该瓶后，瓶中凝聚的回响骤然扩散，笼罩周围区域，令接触者神志剧烈动摇。仅能单次使用，无法复原瓶体。"] = "A sealed small bottle blown from black glass, with ancient Feynapotter sealing runes engraved on the inner wall, said to suppress the aura truly from the Abyss stored within. When the bottle is smashed, the echo condensed in the bottle suddenly spreads, shrouding the surrounding area and causing the minds of those who come into contact with it to shake violently. Can only be used once, cannot restore the bottle.",
