    ["吼？"] = "Roar?",
    ["吼？<P_Heart>（哦？你又来了。）</>"] = "Roar? <P_Heart>(Oh? You've come again.)</>",
    ["吾仍然感受到剑在两地的存在......但吾是雕像，无法亲自取回....."] = "I can still feel the sword's presence in both places... but I am a statue and cannot retrieve it myself...",
    ["吾盾坚不可摧。"] = "My shield is indestructible.",
    ["吾等……沉眠于夜……"] = "We... slumber in the night...",
    ["呀……他们都是流浪儿？挺不容易的。"] = "Oh... are they all homeless children? That's not easy.",
    ["呀我状态精神好挺的。"] = "My mental state is quite good.",
    ["呀！你们把队长吵醒了，明明打算给他一个惊喜的！"] = "Hey! You woke the Captain up! We were supposed to give him a surprise!",
    ["呀！蚂蚁要被吓跑了！"] = "Ah! The ants are going to be scared away!",
    ["呀，先生，您这几只鼠，好像不太行，我们不能收。"] = "Oh, sir, these rats of yours don't seem to be up to par; we cannot accept them.",
    ["呀，实在不凑巧，周二《伯爵归来》复排，我花好大力气才买的票。"] = "Oh, what a coincidence, the revival of \"The Return of the Count\" is on Tuesday, and I spent so much effort to buy a ticket.",
    ["呃"] = "Uh.",
    ["呃 头好痛……"] = "Ugh, my head hurts...",
    ["呃 这些声音……像是从湖心传来的？"] = "Ugh, these sounds... are they coming from the center of the lake?",
    ["呃——啊啊啊！"] = "Ugh—ahhhh!",
    ["呃……"] = "Uh...",
    ["呃……下次、下次一定！"] = "Uh... next time, definitely next time!",
    ["呃……事实上，我不是来抢生意的。"] = "Uh... actually, I'm not here to steal your business.",
    ["呃……他的上衣去哪了？"] = "Uh... where did his shirt go?",
    ["呃……其实我……"] = "Uh... actually I...",
    ["呃……其实我觉得很多东西不需要解释，但，再见。"] = "Uh... actually, I think many things don't need to be explained, but, goodbye.",
    ["呃……去年毕业的学生搬家时带不走的，我是在打包箱子里发现的。丢掉多浪费啊，你说是吧。"] = "Uh... it was something a student who graduated last year couldn't take with them when they moved. I found it in a packing box. It would be a waste to throw it away, don't you think?",
    ["呃……呼……"] = "Uh... phew...",
    ["呃……头好痛……斯卡纳呢？"] = "Uh... my head hurts... Where is Skana?",
    ["呃……对不起，我从小就很胆小。"] = "Uh... sorry, I've been timid since I was a child.",
    ["呃……当然读完了。您是怎么想到写这个故事的？"] = "Uh... of course I finished it. How did you come up with this story?",
    ["呃……当然，她和这场戏没关系。"] = "Uh... of course, she has nothing to do with this play.",
    ["呃……怎么会这样……（反应）"] = "Uh... how could this happen... (Reaction)",
    ["呃……我是文职人员。"] = "Uh... I am a civilian staff member.",
    ["呃……我相信小少爷，我在这里等等吧。"] = "Uh... I trust the young master, I'll just wait here.",
    ["呃……所以才是稀缺货，这可是我费了大功夫收来的！只要5镑，你很难找到更便宜的价格了。"] = "Uh... that's why they are rare goods. I spent a lot of effort to collect these! For just 5 pounds, you'll be hard-pressed to find a cheaper price.",
    ["呃……明明是我先问你的……"] = "Uh... I was the one who asked you first...",
    ["呃……是的，不像吗？"] = "Uh... yes. Don't I look like one?",
    ["呃……没……没什么……"] = "Uh... no... nothing...",
    ["呃……没有，那里很平静，路人平安无事，孩子在玩扮演摊主的游戏。"] = "Uh... no, it's very peaceful there. Passersby are safe and sound, and children are playing a game of pretending to be shopkeepers.",
    ["呃……特别是啤酒！恶龙酒吧的啤酒已经到了难以下咽的程度！"] = "Uh... especially beer! The beer at the Evil Dragon Bar has reached the point of being inedible!",
    ["呃……确实是鱼？"] = "Uh... is this really fish?",
    ["呃……等等，我翻一下《灵数手册》！"] = "Uh... wait, let me check the 'Numerology Handbook'!",
    ["呃……见鬼，那找你妈去！这总有吧！"] = "Uh... damn it, then go find your mom! You have one of those, right!",
    ["呃……贝克兰德？"] = "Uh... Backlund?",
    ["呃……这些旧衣服，实在是不够体面，不管失去中央广场逛逛，还是去教堂祷告……"] = "Uh... these old clothes are really not presentable enough, whether I'm going to stroll around the Central Square or go to the cathedral to pray...",
    ["呃……这些旧衣服，实在是不够体面，不管是去中央广场逛逛，还是去教堂祷告……"] = "Uh... these old clothes are really not decent enough, whether it's going to the Central Plaza for a stroll or going to the church to pray...",
    ["呃……这位先生，您在这里做什么？"] = "Uh... sir, what are you doing here?",
    ["呃……这场聚会还会有谁来吗？"] = "Uh... is anyone else coming to this party?",
    ["呃……这就……"] = "Uh... this is...",
    ["呃……这是哪，似乎不再是冥界的外围了……"] = "Uh... where is this, it doesn't seem to be the outskirts of the Underworld anymore...",
    ["呃……这要求好奇怪……"] = "Uh... this request is so strange...",
    ["呃……那要当成什么……"] = "Uh... then what should I treat them as...",
    ["呃……那门槛确实有问题，上次我差点被绊倒。"] = "Uh... that threshold really has a problem, I almost tripped over it last time.",
    ["呃……钢琴声？"] = "Uh... piano music?",
    ["呃……面板店的面包……太贵了，我们甚至买不起……缝衣针，还有别的什么……"] = "Uh... the bread from the panel shop... is too expensive, we can't even afford it... sewing needles, and what else...",
    ["呃、警官，请问这个镜子是赃物吗？还是其它什么原因？"] = "Uh, officer, may I ask if this mirror is stolen goods? Or is there some other reason?",
    ["呃不，他前几天被小少爷解除了雇佣，想回来继续工作。"] = "Uh, no, he was dismissed by the young master a few days ago and wants to come back to continue working.",
    ["呃啊——！"] = "Ugh ah—!",
    ["呃啊……噩梦来了……害怕么？"] = "Ugh... the nightmare is here... are you scared?",
    ["呃啊……头好疼啊……"] = "Ugh... my head hurts so much...",
    ["呃，不好意思，如果你要找陪练，还是去问问索多玛吧，或者像我一样找个木桩。"] = "Uh, sorry, if you are looking for a sparring partner, you should ask Sodom, or find a wooden dummy like I did.",
    ["呃，不好意思，如果你要找陪练，还是去问问索尼娅吧，或者像我一样找个木桩。"] = "Uh, sorry, if you are looking for a sparring partner, you'd better ask Sonya, or find a wooden dummy like I did.",
    ["呃，不用管它，只是一个仪式魔法的表征。"] = "Uh, don't worry about it, it's just a representation of Ritual Magic.",
    ["呃，亲爱的，我想我下不来了。"] = "Uh, my dear, I don't think I can get down.",
    ["呃，他们不是幻影吗？怎么会这样……"] = "Uh, aren't they phantoms? How could this happen...",
    ["呃，又是那位被称为“母亲”的邪神。"] = "Uh, it's that evil god known as the \"Mother\" again.",
    ["呃，可我只想买个狒狒背包……"] = "Uh, but I only wanted to buy a baboon backpack...",
    ["呃，头好痛……"] = "Ugh, my head hurts...",
    ["呃，头好痛……这些就是……“奇怪的呓语”？"] = "Uh, my head hurts... are these... \"strange whispers\"?",
    ["呃，头好痛。怎么都想不起来了，这里又是哪儿……"] = "Ugh, my head hurts. I can't remember anything. Where is this...",
    ["呃，好、好的。伦纳德先生和弗莱队长都帮过我，我会帮忙的。"] = "Uh, o-okay. Mr. Leonard and Captain Frye have both helped me, so I will help.",
    ["呃，好奇怪的名字……"] = "Uh, what a strange name...",
    ["呃，怎么回事……"] = "Uh, what's going on...",
    ["呃，怎么说呢，比起仰望绯月，更感觉像死不瞑目……"] = "Uh, how should I put this? Rather than gazing at the crimson moon, it feels more like they died with their eyes wide open...",
    ["呃，总之是很久前的事情，他从古堡里拿走了一副油画，上面据说是初代拉姆德男爵的肖像。"] = "Uh, anyway, it was a long time ago, he took an oil painting from the ancient castle, which was said to be a portrait of the first Baron Ramd.",
    ["呃，您好，转人工？"] = "Uh, hello, can I speak to a human?",
    ["呃，我当然是有所耳闻，但亲耳听您说出来，仍然令人心疼哪。亲爱的西……娜拉，您为何如此想不开呢？"] = "Uh, I had heard rumors, of course, but hearing it from you personally is still heartbreaking. My dear Se... Nala, why would you do something so self-destructive?",
    ["呃，我怎么记得，这里以前是个卷毛狒狒背包摊位？"] = "Uh, why do I remember this place used to be a Curly-Haired Baboon backpack stall?",
    ["呃，我想知道他爱喝锡伯红茶，还是伯爵红茶……"] = "Uh, I wonder whether he prefers Sibe black tea or Earl Grey...",
    ["呃，我选……"] = "Uh, I choose...",
    ["呃，是的。"] = "Uh, yes.",
    ["呃，是肥皂。"] = "Uh, it's soap.",
    ["呃，没有。"] = "Uh, no.",
    ["呃，没有，艾米丽小姐。我平时……嗯，没什么机会玩这种游戏。"] = "Uh, no, Miss Emily. I usually... well, don't have many opportunities to play this kind of game.",
    ["呃，没有，还在尝试……人总要有梦想的，不然和咸鱼有什么区别。"] = "Uh, no, still trying... People always have to have dreams, otherwise what's the difference between them and a salted fish.",
    ["呃，破铁盆，木头篮子，碎玻璃瓶，罐头盒，之类的？"] = "Uh, broken iron basins, wooden baskets, shattered glass bottles, tin cans, that sort of thing?",
    ["呃，确实就是个命案现场，只不过受害者还活着……"] = "Uh, it really is a crime scene, except the victim is still alive...",
    ["呃，算有吧……"] = "Uh, I suppose so...",
    ["呃，芙拉女士去见自己的丈夫……有什么问题吗？"] = "Uh, Mrs. Fula is going to see her husband... is there a problem with that?",
    ["呃，芥末咸奶油面包？可真是“创新”。"] = "Uh, mustard salted cream bread? That's truly 'innovative'.",
    ["呃，虽然他已经成为了净化之泉的信徒……"] = "Uh, although he has already become a believer of the Fountain of Purification...",
    ["呃，还有？！怎么没完没了……"] = "Uh, there's more?! Why is this endless...",
    ["呃，这位先生，我愿意听听你的“伟大见解”。"] = "Uh, sir, I am willing to listen to your \"great insight\".",
    ["呃，这又是什么……噩梦中污染的象征？"] = "Uh, what is this now... A symbol of corruption in a nightmare?",
    ["呃，这是怎么回事？！"] = "Uh, what is going on here?!",
    ["呃，那张照片是去年冬天拍的……"] = "Uh, that photo was taken last winter...",
    ["呃，那没事了……再见，再见。"] = "Uh, never mind then... Goodbye, goodbye.",
    ["呃，那还真是不幸……"] = "Uh, that's truly unfortunate...",
    ["呃，馊掉的味道！"] = "Ugh, it tastes sour!",
