    ["周围好像有灵性波动"] = "There seems to be a spiritual fluctuation nearby.",
    ["周围开始恍惚，摇摆，场景如同油画般散融化开，红的更红，蓝的更蓝。在梦幻般的画面中，戴莉走到了眼前，她艳丽地微笑着，声音似从四面八方传来——"] = "The surroundings begin to blur and sway; the scene melts like an oil painting, with reds becoming redder and blues becoming bluer. In the dreamlike scene, Daly walks before you, smiling enchantingly, her voice seeming to come from all directions—",
    ["周围有三块圆形区域……"] = "There are three circular areas around...",
    ["周围有危险！"] = "There is danger nearby!",
    ["周围突然全是大雾，他从雾里出现变成怪物，我只能往教堂的方向逃跑……"] = "Suddenly, everything around was filled with thick fog. He appeared from the fog and turned into a monster. I could only run toward the cathedral...",
    ["周围这些是……"] = "What are these things around here...",
