    ["周晨昊-高难谜题"] = "Zhou Chenhao - High Difficulty Puzzle",
    ["周末想睡个懒觉，结果大清早就被楼上的咚咚声硬生生吵醒。"] = "Wanted to sleep in on the weekend, but was woken up by the thumping from upstairs early in the morning.",
    ["周末？什么是周末？"] = "Weekend? What is a weekend?",
    ["周末？什么是周末？我们又不是开洗衣店的。"] = "Weekend? What is a weekend? We aren't running a laundry shop.",
