    ["呱——呱——呱——"] = "Quack—quack—quack—",
    ["味觉消失片刻，刚好抵消曼哈尔鱼的味道。"] = "The sense of taste disappears for a moment, just enough to offset the taste of Manhar fish.",
    ["味道不错。"] = "Tastes good.",
    ["味道不错，再吃一口……不过摊主为什么要说小心海鸥？"] = "The taste is not bad, have another bite... but why did the stall owner say to watch out for seagulls?",
    ["味道怎么样？"] = "How did it taste?",
    ["味道苦涩。汁液黏稠。可能含生物碱。需要进一步试验确认。暂定编号：A-447。"] = "The taste is bitter. The sap is viscous. It may contain alkaloids. Further testing is required to confirm. Tentative designation: A-447.",
    ["味道？我什么也没闻到啊？"] = "Smell? I didn't smell anything?",
    ["呵,那你也可以跟我们回警局确认一下。并且，你这样驱赶好心的客人，我这位朋友可是会伤心的。"] = "Heh, then you can come back to the police station with us to confirm that. Besides, my friend here will be quite sad if you drive away a well-meaning guest like this.",
    ["呵……"] = "Heh...",
    ["呵……呵呵……没有这赔偿！他女儿怎么可能治好病！"] = "Heh... hehe... without that compensation! How could his daughter have been cured!",
    ["呵……太文艺了朋友！"] = "Heh... that's too poetic, my friend!",
    ["呵……当然读完了。您是怎么想到写这个故事的？"] = "Heh... of course I finished reading it. What made you think of writing this story?",
    ["呵……您赢了。但您永远忘不了……昨晚的滋味。"] = "Heh... you win. But you will never forget... the taste of last night.",
    ["呵……旁边排水渠不是挺宽的么，从那儿过最快。"] = "Heh... isn't the drainage ditch on the side quite wide? It's fastest to go through there.",
    ["呵呵 我听到他们都睡着了 你后退一点"] = "Hehe, I heard them all fall asleep. You should step back a bit.",
    ["呵呵……什么都可以，我只想要一个未来的指引。"] = "Hehe... anything is fine. I just want a guide for the future.",
    ["呵呵……你杀了泰利之后 得到了他身上那些未能寄出的信件"] = "Heh... after you killed Terry, you obtained those unsent letters he had on him.",
    ["呵呵……只不过他们现在都变成了封印物。"] = "Hehe... it's just that they have all become Sealed Artifacts now.",
    ["呵呵……呵呵呵呵……"] = "Heh... hehehehe...",
    ["呵呵……如果对这款药剂好奇，我建议你直接去休息室找阿曼达女士要一杯伏特加。不过，它的味道大概要比伏特加好上那么一点……"] = "Hehe... If you are curious about this potion, I suggest you go directly to the lounge and ask Ms. Amanda for a glass of vodka. However, its taste is probably a little better than vodka...",
    ["呵呵……如果对这款药剂好奇，我建议你直接去休息室找阿曼达女士要一杯朗齐酒。不过，它的味道大概要朗齐酒加好上那么一点……"] = "Hehe... if you're curious about this potion, I suggest you go directly to the lounge and ask Ms. Amanda for a glass of Rancy wine. However, its taste is probably a bit better than Rancy wine...",
    ["呵呵……有我熟悉的人。"] = "Hehe... it has people I'm familiar with.",
    ["呵呵……等你沦落到我这个地步就明白了。"] = "Heh... you'll understand when you fall to my level.",
    ["呵呵……贵客，您这又是一张“特别”门票。"] = "Hehe... Honored guest, you have another \"special\" ticket.",
    ["呵呵……这样吗……我也很遗憾。"] = "Heh... is that so... I am very sorry as well.",
    ["呵呵……那需要我再努力一些……或者等茜茜成为政府雇员，会找到欢迎我们的地方生活的。"] = "Hehe... then I need to work harder... or when Cici becomes a government employee, we will find a place that welcomes us to live.",
    ["呵呵。"] = "Heh.",
    ["呵呵呵……谢谢你的夸奖，年轻人。"] = "Hehehe... thank you for the compliment, young person.",
    ["呵呵，不必紧张，只是一次友好的切磋。在你做好充分的心理准备前，我不会强人所难。"] = "Hehe, no need to be nervous, it's just a friendly sparring match. I won't force you until you are fully mentally prepared.",
    ["呵呵，今天的拍照结束了，让我们下次再见。"] = "Hehe, today's photography is over, let's meet again next time.",
    ["呵呵，他们最终会被送去圣堂。"] = "Heh, they will eventually be sent to the Holy Cathedral.",
    ["呵呵，他要是和邱琪成了情敌，说不定会当街决斗呢……"] = "Heh, if he and Qiuqi became rivals in love, he might even duel in the street...",
    ["呵呵，你不懂，你这种小喽啰根本不懂！"] = "Heh, you don't understand. A small fry like you wouldn't understand!",
    ["呵呵，你会出现在这里，一定有特别的理由。"] = "Hehe, you must have a special reason for appearing here.",
    ["呵呵，你会喜欢他们的。"] = "Hehe, you will like them.",
    ["呵呵，你再仔细想想……我怎么会是那个妄想愚弄命运的蠢女人？"] = "Heh, think about it carefully... how could I be that stupid woman who deludes herself into fooling fate?",
    ["呵呵，你可真不会安慰人呢。真正的绅士，现在应该将我揽进怀中，再说些甜蜜的情话。"] = "Hehe, you really don't know how to comfort people. A true gentleman should take me into his arms now and say some sweet words.",
    ["呵呵，你还是这么亲切，希望之前的案子没有给你们带来太多困扰。"] = "Hehe, you are still as kind as ever. I hope the previous case didn't cause you too much trouble.",
    ["呵呵，刚才有个人说8便士就可以干。"] = "Heh, someone just said they'd do it for 8 pence.",
    ["呵呵，别这么瞧我，就算住在墓地边，日子也是要过的。"] = "Hehe, don't look at me like that; even if you live by the cemetery, life still has to go on.",
    ["呵呵，双倍薪水？上次他也这么说，结果只多给了2便士，连买杯劣质啤酒都不够。"] = "Heh, double pay? He said that last time too, but only gave 2 extra pennies, not even enough to buy a cup of cheap beer.",
    ["呵呵，只是，你之后得小心被积雪里的什么绊倒……呵呵……"] = "Hehe, it's just that you have to be careful about tripping over something in the snow later... hehe...",
    ["呵呵，可别落后我太远啊，队长。"] = "Hehe, don't fall too far behind me, Captain.",
    ["呵呵，咱家四口人同一天生日，当然要多准备几道菜。"] = "Hehe, four of us in the family have birthdays on the same day, of course I have to prepare a few more dishes.",
    ["呵呵，好有什么用？没人演，没人听，没人……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>没人要。 "] = "Heh, what's the use of being good? No one performs it, no one listens, no one... <P_Heart>(Pauses)</> no one wants it.",
    ["呵呵，如果你临时缺钱，可以来找我。"] = "Hehe, if you are short on money, you can come to me.",
    ["呵呵，如果邓恩能听到这句话就好了。 "] = "Hehe, if only Dunn could hear those words.",
    ["呵呵，小戴莉，有些话，是需要尽快说出口的。"] = "Hehe, little Daly, some things need to be said as soon as possible.",
    ["呵呵，尽快消化魔药，提升实力吧，那样你才能与必将到来的沉重命运抗衡。"] = "Heh, digest your potion as soon as possible and improve your strength. Only then will you be able to contend with the heavy fate that is bound to come.",
    ["呵呵，希罗多德没准会吃惊呢。"] = "Heh, Herodotus might be surprised.",
    ["呵呵，恐怕监狱都比我们的日子过得好。"] = "Heh, I'm afraid even prison life is better than ours.",
    ["呵呵，您最好比较灵验……否则，忽视命运的代价，您纤细的——<P_Heart>（举起手比划了两下）</>想必无法承受。"] = "Heh, you'd better be accurate... otherwise, the price of ignoring fate, your slender—<P_Heart>(raised her hand and gestured twice)</> presumably cannot bear it.",
    ["呵呵，我们看起来很般配，对吗？"] = "Hehe, we look like a perfect match, don't we?",
    ["呵呵，我听到他们都睡着了，你后退一点。"] = "Hehe, I hear they've all fallen asleep, you step back a bit.",
    ["呵呵，我对你印象很深刻。"] = "Heh, I have a deep impression of you.",
    ["呵呵，我开玩笑的。学派里严肃的人太多了，我想偶尔也需要调节一下气氛。"] = "Hehe, I'm joking. There are too many serious people in the school, I think sometimes we need to adjust the atmosphere.",
    ["呵呵，我想你现在这个样子，会让他更加歉疚、并留下新的心理阴影。"] = "Hehe, I think the way you are now will only make him feel more guilty and leave him with new psychological trauma.",
    ["呵呵，我能够理解。不过好奇心总是伴随着一定的危险。"] = "Hehe, I can understand that. However, curiosity is always accompanied by certain dangers.",
    ["呵呵，是吗。我也很期待下次的内容呢，回头见。"] = "Heh, is that so? I'm looking forward to the next batch of content as well. See you later.",
    ["呵呵，有人在看他们？这句话倒没说错。"] = "Hehe, someone is watching them? That sentence is not wrong.",
    ["呵呵，有段时间，我认为自己只是普通的北大陆学者，直到找回了记忆。"] = "Haha, for a time, I considered myself just an ordinary scholar from the Northern Continent, until I recovered my memories.",
    ["呵呵，朋友吗……那跟我来吧，我带你们去找她。"] = "Heh, a friend, huh... then come with me, I'll take you to find her.",
    ["呵呵，杰克是这老家伙的乖孙子，在廷根的工厂当学徒呢。 "] = "Heh, Jack is the good grandson of this old guy, working as an apprentice in a Tingen factory.",
    ["呵呵，活到老，学到老——罗塞尔大帝说的嘛！"] = "Hehe, live and learn—that's what Emperor Roselle said!",
    ["呵呵，真让人怀念啊。它让我想起了我的黄金时代。"] = "Hehe, it really makes one nostalgic. It reminds me of my golden age.",
    ["呵呵，让我们一起期待这场戏剧吧，三个人一起去看的戏剧。"] = "Hehe, let's look forward to this play together, a play the three of us will watch together.",
    ["呵呵，说实在的，我觉得有不少“学徒”会冲着旅行的目的追求晋升。嗯，享受人生才是生活的真谛嘛。"] = "Hehe, honestly, I think quite a few \"Apprentices\" pursue advancement for the purpose of traveling. Hmm, enjoying life is the true meaning of life, after all.",
    ["呵呵，这三只鸽子从小被母鸡带大！"] = "Hehe, these three pigeons were raised by a hen since they were little!",
    ["呵呵，这两个人关系真不错。年轻真好，对吧邓恩？"] = "Heh, those two get along really well. It's good to be young, isn't it, Dunn?",
    ["呵呵，这个声音可就不那么好听了。"] = "Hehe, that sound isn't quite as pleasant.",
    ["呵呵，这些少爷，说些好话，就能把工厂里的女孩们骗得晕头转向。"] = "Hehe, these young masters, just by saying some nice words, can trick the girls in the factory until they are dizzy.",
    ["呵呵，这就是魔法的力量。"] = "Hehe, this is the power of magic.",
    ["呵呵，这里也有祂的灵性……这感觉，就仿佛是当年的那场神战还没有结束。"] = "Hehe, His spirituality is here too... This feeling is as if that divine war from back then hasn't ended yet.",
    ["呵呵，那是一定。杰温也会感激您的……"] = "Hehe, that's for sure. Jevon will be grateful to you as well...",
    ["呵呵，那确实很引人瞩目。"] = "Haha, that would certainly be eye-catching.",
    ["呵呵，队长，你的记性这不是挺好的嘛。"] = "Haha, Captain, your memory isn't bad at all.",
    ["呵呵，阿诺德长大了，我也老了，时间过得真快呢。"] = "Hehe, Arnold has grown up, and I have grown old. Time flies so fast.",
    ["呵呵，雨水是免费的灌溉，阳光是额外的奖赏。算起来还是我赚了。"] = "Heh, the rain is free irrigation, and the sunlight is an extra reward. All things considered, I'm the one profiting.",
    ["呵！心理医生？想赢还得再喝几年魔<P_Yellow>药</>！"] = "Heh! Psychologist? You need to drink a few more years of <P_Yellow>potion</> to win!",
    ["呵！鲁恩需要英雄，但我更想要陪在我身边的儿子呀！"] = "Hah! Loen needs heroes, but I'd rather have my son by my side!",
    ["呵，为什么那群人，会怀念那样一个地方？"] = "Heh, why would that group of people miss such a place?",
    ["呵，你们明白的，这件事也只能由我去做。"] = "Heh, you know, this is something only I can do.",
    ["呵，到那时候，一起出海狩猎吧，我准许你作为“烈焰”随侍我。"] = "Heh, when that time comes, let's go out to sea to hunt together. I permit you to serve me as \"The Fool\".",
    ["呵，卡萝队长，你真的睡了很久呢。"] = "Heh, Captain Carol, you really have slept for a long time.",
    ["呵，即使如此，黑麦啤酒也是消费最多，受众最广的……"] = "Heh, even so, rye beer is still the most consumed and widely accepted...",
    ["呵，可笑吗？笑吧，我也知道很可笑，一个弱者试图保护强者。"] = "Heh, is it ridiculous? Laugh then, I know it's ridiculous, a weakling trying to protect the strong.",
    ["呵，我们这种人，指不定明天就倒在哪了……不过还是谢谢你。"] = "Heh, people like us, who knows where we'll end up tomorrow... but thanks anyway.",
    ["呵，我家的黛比可是耕过十年地的，耐力没得说。"] = "Heh, my Debbie has been plowing fields for ten years; her stamina is beyond compare.",
    ["呵，或许你还没有真正认识到这场集会的意义……在“愚者”先生的注视下，我们都不敢撒谎或违反约定。"] = "Heh, perhaps you haven't truly realized the significance of this gathering... Under Mr. Fool's gaze, none of us would dare to lie or break an agreement.",
    ["呵，打算收集灵性逃出牢笼？别妄想了！"] = "Heh, planning to collect spirituality to escape the cage? Don't even think about it!",
    ["呵，猫狗？别想。光是猫毛狗爪印，他都能从“家具磨损费”算到“空气净化费”，连隔壁房间的婴儿哭泣都能算成你的宠物吓的。"] = "Ha, cats and dogs? Don't even think about it. He'd calculate everything from cat hair and paw prints to 'furniture wear and tear' and 'air purification fees.' He'd even blame your pet for the baby crying in the next room.",
    ["呵，现在什么人都敢妄谈艺术。"] = "Heh, nowadays anyone dares to talk nonsense about art.",
    ["呵，看来你无法领悟知识的奥秘！"] = "Heh, it seems you cannot comprehend the mysteries of knowledge!",
    ["呵，观众？那就好好看看——谎言，才是真正的爪牙。"] = "Heh, a Spectator? Then watch closely—lies are the real claws and fangs.",
    ["呵，这事情恐怕连小弟自己都不清楚。"] = "Heh, I'm afraid even the youngest doesn't know this himself.",
    ["呵，这女人真是难伺候！庄园里的宴会没见她这么有兴致。"] = "Hmph, this woman is truly difficult to please! She didn't seem this interested during the banquet at the manor.",
    ["呵，麻烦还没完呢！"] = "Heh, the trouble isn't over yet!",
    ["呸呸……你加了什么，好难喝，怎么有股子土腥味？"] = "Ptooey... what did you add to this? It's awful, why does it taste like wet dirt?",
    ["呸呸呸——哈哈，比我还倒霉的倒霉蛋！"] = "Ptooey, ptooey, ptooey—haha, a loser even more unlucky than me!",
    ["呸！打的什么玩意！"] = "Pah! What kind of fight was that!",
    ["呼——任务完成！可以离开这诡异的地方了。"] = "Phew—mission accomplished! I can finally leave this eerie place.",
    ["呼——呼——"] = "Hoo—hoo—",
    ["呼——好诡异的梦。"] = "Phew—what a bizarre dream.",
    ["呼——终于结束了！非常感谢你的帮忙，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Phew—finally finished! Thank you very much for your help, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["呼——舒服多了。"] = "Phew—much better.",
    ["呼——这太棒了，然后……请问我该怎么做才能成为非凡者，就像您一样？"] = "Phew—this is amazing, and then... may I ask what I should do to become a Beyonder, just like you?",
    ["呼——这次任务结束后，我一定要找个咖啡馆好好休息下……"] = "Phew—after this quest is over, I must find a cafe to get some good rest...",
    ["呼……"] = "Hoo...",
    ["呼……仪式完成了，灵性几乎耗尽，差点失控。"] = "Phew... the ritual is complete. My spirituality is nearly depleted; I almost lost control.",
    ["呼……刚才好险，前面也要小心了。"] = "Phew... that was close, be careful ahead too.",
    ["呼……吓我一跳。"] = "Phew... you scared me.",
    ["呼……嘘……"] = "Hoo... Shh...",
    ["呼……多亏了你。看来一次性摘太多果子是个错误决定。"] = "Phew... thanks to you. It seems that picking too many fruits at once was a wrong decision.",
    ["呼……好！"] = "Phew... okay!",
    ["呼……幸好……没事……"] = "Phew... fortunately... it's fine...",
    ["呼……接下来需要好好理一下思路，我隐隐觉得真相就在眼前了……"] = "Phew... next, I need to organize my thoughts properly. I vaguely feel that the truth is right before my eyes...",
    ["呼……看来，这位焦急的父亲并没有他说的那样爱孩子。"] = "Sigh... It seems this anxious father doesn't love his child as much as he claimed.",
    ["呼……真困啊……"] = "Phew... so sleepy...",
    ["呼……终于可以坐下野餐了。"] = "Phew... finally, I can sit down for a picnic.",
    ["呼……谢谢您，先生。夫人太过伤心了，我们会好好照顾她。"] = "Phew... thank you, sir. The lady was too heartbroken. We will take good care of her.",
    ["呼……还好有用 这个地方可真是神奇啊……"] = "Phew... thankfully it worked. This place is truly magical...",
    ["呼……还好有用，这个地方可真是神奇啊……"] = "Phew... glad it worked, this place is truly magical...",
    ["呼、呼——吸——"] = "Inhale, exhale—inhale—",
    ["呼、呼……"] = "Huff, huff...",
    ["呼、呼……呜呜……"] = "Huff, huff... wuwu...",
    ["呼伦贝尔"] = "Hulunbuir",
    ["呼叫伊琳"] = "Call Irene",
    ["呼叫火炮支援"] = "Call for artillery support",
    ["呼叫瞭望塔，海上突然起了大雾，遮住了幽灵船！"] = "Calling the Watchtower, a thick fog has suddenly risen at sea, obscuring the ghost ship!",
    ["呼吸和心跳是活着的象征，也许有别的东西能成为一个人的“呼吸”和“心跳”……"] = "Breathing and a heartbeat are symbols of being alive; perhaps there are other things that can become a person's \"breath\" and \"heartbeat\"...",
    ["呼吸和心跳是活着的象征，但有更珍贵的东西能成为一个人的“呼吸”和“心跳”。"] = "Breathing and a heartbeat are symbols of being alive, but there are more precious things that can become a person's \"breath\" and \"heartbeat\".",
    ["呼呼……哈！"] = "Hoo hoo... ha!",
    ["呼和浩特"] = "Hohhot",
    ["呼哈哈哈哈 笑一个吧 感谢你们帮我找到笔记"] = "Hahaha, smile! Thank you for helping me find the notebook.",
    ["呼唤"] = "Call Out",
    ["呼唤棕熊"] = "Call Brown Bear",
    ["呼唤阿诺德"] = "Call Arnold",
    ["呼喊"] = "Shout",
    ["呼噜……不、不是睡，是诅咒。"] = "Gulu... no, not sleep, it's a curse.",
    ["呼噜……呼噜……"] = "Snore... snore...",
    ["呼噜呼噜……"] = "Purr purr...",
    ["呼噜噜——"] = "Purr—",
    ["呼！来个猪油炸蔬菜、伊斯奥、两个猪肉馅饼、两杯甜冰茶。"] = "Phew! Give me the fried vegetables in lard, Isao, two pork pies, and two glasses of sweet iced tea.",
    ["呼，休息一下继续。"] = "Phew, let's rest for a bit and then continue.",
    ["呼，原来不是西尼。"] = "Phew, it wasn't Cini.",
    ["呼，又忽悠……不，又发展到了一个成员了。"] = "Phew, I bluffed... no, I developed another member.",
    ["呼，吓我一跳！"] = "Phew, you scared me!",
    ["呼，呼……得救了。谢、谢谢你啊……"] = "Phew, phew... I'm saved. Th-thank you...",
    ["呼，好噎的面包，难吃！昨天刚买了羔羊肉和菜，不如……"] = "Phew, such choking bread, it tastes terrible! I just bought lamb and vegetables yesterday, why not...",
    ["呼，好困……怎么回事？"] = "Phew, so sleepy... What's going on?",
    ["呼，好重……"] = "Phew, so heavy...",
    ["呼，很快就能开门了！一间只属于我的酒馆！"] = "Phew, I'll be able to open the door soon! A tavern that belongs only to me!",
    ["呼，得先处理掉这个怪物。"] = "Phew, I have to deal with this monster first.",
    ["呼，我们应该雇用一辆马车的，会让我们看着体面一些。"] = "Phew, we should have hired a carriage, it would make us look more decent.",
    ["呼，现在该去文献室调查了。"] = "Phew, now it's time to go to the archives to investigate.",
    ["呼，看来成功瞒过去了！"] = "Phew, looks like we successfully fooled her!",
    ["呼，真是尽兴……"] = "Phew, that was satisfying...",
    ["呼，还好我机灵跑得早。马丁那家伙，竟然想租弗兰奇的公寓。"] = "Phew, good thing I was smart and ran early. That guy Martin actually wanted to rent Frankie's apartment.",
    ["呼，还好没露馅，安多他……"] = "Phew, luckily I didn't give it away. Ando, he...",
    ["呼，这株长得真不错，还差一棵就够了。"] = "Phew, this one grew quite well. Just one more and I'll have enough.",
    ["呼，进来了……赶紧去翻翻壁炉吧。"] = "Phew, made it in... let's hurry and search the fireplace.",
