    ["命中玩家时，对其附加4.5秒67%的重伤效果。"] = "When hitting a player, applies a 67% Grievous Injury effect for 4.5 seconds.",
    ["命中的敌人有60%概率获得3秒66%重伤效果。"] = "Enemies hit have a 60% probability of receiving a 66% Grievous Injury effect for 3 seconds.",
