    ["命中监听ex空间牢笼"] = "Hit Listener ex Space Cage",
    ["命中目标后目标成为感电体，向周围最多4个目标传递电击造成伤害，若周围没有目标可以传递，则增加该次伤害35%。若目标为怪物，则造成的伤害提升75%。"] = "Upon hitting a target, the target becomes an Electrified Body, passing electric damage to up to 4 surrounding targets. If there are no targets to pass to, the damage of that instance increases by 35%. If the target is a monster, the damage dealt is increased by 75%.",
    ["命中目标后额外附加3段持续伤害。"] = "Applies 3 additional segments of Continuous Damage after hitting a target.",
