    ["命中目标时附加2秒滞涩和25%减速。"] = "Applies 2 seconds of Stagnation and a 25% Slow upon hitting a target.",
    ["命中目标时附加3秒25%减速效果。"] = "Applies a 3-second 25% Slow effect upon hitting the target.",
