    ["命中目标时额外附加3秒的持续伤害。"] = "Adds 3 seconds of continuous damage when hitting a target.",
    ["命中自杀"] = "Hit Suicide",
    ["命令冲锋"] = "Command Charge",
    ["命定之人%s已出现，等待对方回应……"] = "The fated person %s has appeared; waiting for their response...",
    ["命定时间到了，所有人必须配合一起参与盛大舞会。玩家需要<Disable>前往自己的舞台区域</>，并跟随场上<Disable>舞伴移动方向的提示</>，一起跳舞，朝着<Disable>错误方向移动会有对应惩罚</>。"] = "The fated time has arrived; everyone must participate in the grand ball together. Players must <Disable>head to their designated stage area</> and follow the <Disable>dance partner's movement direction prompts</> to dance together. Moving in the <Disable>wrong direction will result in corresponding penalties</>.",
    ["命宫正被阴影笼罩，近期需警惕口舌之争与计划外的破财，凡事三思而后行，切勿冲动决策。"] = "The Life Palace is being shrouded in shadows. Recently, you need to be wary of verbal disputes and unplanned loss of wealth. Think twice before acting in everything, and do not make impulsive decisions.",
