    ["咕噜不断使用巨手捶击地面，造成多段周身<Disable>随机圆形或环形</>范围伤害。"] = "Gulu continuously slams its giant hands into the ground, dealing multiple rounds of <Disable>random circular or ring-shaped</> area damage around it.",
    ["咕噜不断释放储存的<Disable>毒雾</>，造成多段全场范围伤害，同时自身饥饿值也会增加固定值。"] = "Gulu continuously releases stored <Disable>poison mist</>, dealing multiple rounds of field-wide damage, while its own Hunger Value increases by a fixed amount.",
