    ["咕噜进入战斗后，会随时间不断增加<Disable>饥饿值</>，饥饿值最多增加至100。当饥饿值增加至<Disable>100</>时，咕噜会释放<Disable>饥饿吞噬</>，将随机3名玩家拉至身前吞噬。"] = "After entering combat, Gulu will continuously increase its <Disable>Hunger Value</> over time, up to a maximum of 100. When the Hunger Value reaches <Disable>100</>, Gulu will release <Disable>Hunger Devour</>, pulling 3 random players to its front to devour them.",
    ["咕噜锁定<Disable>当前仇恨目标</>所在方向持续喷射胃液，造成高额范围伤害。"] = "Gulu locks onto the direction of the <Disable>current aggro target</> and continuously sprays gastric acid, dealing high area damage.",
