    ["咦……又来新的小孩了。"] = "Huh... new children have arrived again.",
    ["咦……我的手指间有颜色！"] = "Huh... there's color on my fingertips!",
    ["咦，会议室好像有声音？"] = "Huh, seems like there's a sound in the Conference Room?",
    ["咦，你好聪明，怎么这也能猜到？她还有个弟弟在上学，唉，一家四口重担都在她身上。"] = "Eh, you're so smart, how did you guess that? She does have a younger brother in school, sigh, the burden of a family of four is all on her.",
    ["咦，你知道他们的模样？但你们应该从来没有见过面吧？"] = "Eh, you know what they look like? But you should have never met, right?",
    ["咦，你知道我的名字，邓恩叔叔他们跟你提起过我吗？"] = "Eh, you know my name. Did Uncle Dunn and the others mention me to you?",
    ["咦，刚才数到多少了？不管了，从三百再开始吧……"] = "Huh, what number was I at just now? Never mind, let's start from three hundred again...",
    ["咦，大门好像没有完全合拢……不会出什么事吧？"] = "Huh, the door doesn't seem to be fully closed... could something have happened?",
