    ["咬击"] = "Bite",
    ["咬牙怒视"] = "Grit Teeth and Glare",
    ["咬破果皮的瞬间，虚幻的风铃声在脑中回荡。"] = "The moment you bite through the peel, the sound of illusory wind chimes echoes in your mind.",
    ["咯……"] = "Gurgle...",
    ["咱们也去买一辆？可是，哪来的钱啊。"] = "Shall we go buy one too? But where would we get the money?",
    ["咱们厂区正好今天组织街头竞速。一圈定胜负，没有赌注，就是比谁先把其他人甩在后视镜里。"] = "Our factory district is organizing a street race today. One lap decides the winner; no bets, just a race to see who can leave the others in their rearview mirror first.",
    ["咱们这儿就这样，骗子不少，小偷也不少。不过，我还是喜欢这地方。"] = "That's how it is around here, plenty of swindlers and plenty of thieves. But I still like this place.",
    ["咱们这把年纪，得学会对自己好一点。别总想着逞强，健康才是最重要的，明白吗？"] = "At our age, we have to learn to be good to ourselves. Don't always try to be tough, health is the most important thing, understand?",
    ["咱们这片领地盛产葡萄和大麦，都是上好的酿酒原料。不如先从最拿手的开始——建一座酿酒坊，您看怎么样？"] = "Our territory is rich in grapes and barley, both excellent raw materials for brewing. Why not start with what we're best at—building a winery, what do you think?",
    ["咳 祝你女儿早日康复"] = "Ahem, I hope your daughter recovers soon.",
