    ["咳……咳咳……"] = "Cough... cough cough...",
    ["咳……好好好，不讨厌，行了吧。"] = "Ahem... fine, fine, fine, I don't hate you, okay?",
    ["咳……成熟的杀手不需要煤气灯的指……嗯？不是这一页……稍等……"] = "Ahem... a mature assassin does not need the guidance of a gas lamp... hmm? Not this page... hold on...",
    ["咳……是不是我刚刚话说重了。"] = "Cough... was I too harsh just now?",
    ["咳……这是为了贴近角色而使用的称呼。"] = "Ahem... this is a form of address used to stay in character.",
    ["咳、咳咳——"] = "C-Cough—",
    ["咳、咳，来源不重要……总有一天，我要扬帆起航，去追寻海上的宝藏。悬赏我的赏金该是多少镑呢？哈哈哈……"] = "Cough, cough, the source isn't important... One day, I will set sail to pursue the treasures of the sea. How many pounds should my bounty be? Hahaha...",
