    ["咳咳……不过有一说一，香花女士确实很优雅……"] = "Ahem... but to be fair, Ms. Xianghua is indeed very elegant...",
    ["咳咳……休想让我们出卖兄弟！"] = "Cough, cough... Don't even think about making us betray our brothers!",
    ["咳咳……其实我有在女神面前起誓，不会将扮演法透露给其他无知者。"] = "Ahem... actually, I have sworn before the Goddess that I would not reveal the Acting Method to other ignorant people.",
    ["咳咳……出现了和之前一样的事……"] = "Cough, cough... The same thing as before happened...",
