    ["咳咳……您说得对！其实这只是……只是南大陆的安神草药。"] = "Ahem... you're right! Actually, this is just... just calming herbs from the Southern Continent.",
    ["咳咳……感觉空气里有不少灰尘……"] = "Ahem... I feel like there's a lot of dust in the air...",
    ["咳咳……我以为你再见到我，会骂我几句呢。"] = "Cough cough... I thought you would scold me a few times when you saw me again.",
    ["咳咳……我没事的！可是，刚刚我敲开堵死的煤灰的时候，烟就涌了出来，我只能赶紧往回……"] = "Cough, cough... I'm fine! But just now, when I knocked open the blocked soot, the smoke poured out, and I had to hurry back...",
    ["咳咳……拉里，实话说，你加入代罚者之前头顶也并不茂盛，或许这并不是非凡因素导致的。"] = "Ahem... Larry, to be honest, your head wasn't very lush before you joined the Mandated Punishers. Perhaps this isn't caused by Beyonder factors.",
    ["咳咳……没事，就是早上起来痰里有点黑渣滓。"] = "Cough, cough... it's nothing, just some black residue in my phlegm when I wake up in the morning.",
