    ["咳咳！不过我有点好奇，你为什么要在结业考试上捣乱？"] = "Ahem! But I'm a little curious, why did you want to cause trouble during the final exam?",
    ["咳咳！好重的血腥气……她躲在这里么？"] = "*Cough cough*! Such a heavy smell of blood... is she hiding here?",
