    ["咳咳，你刚来塔罗学派吧？"] = "Ahem, you're new to the Tarot Club, right?",
    ["咳咳，克莱恩，这件衣服看起来有点旧，还落了些尘土，你看这里……"] = "Ahem, Klein, this piece of clothing looks a bit old, and it has some dust on it, look here...",
    ["咳咳，咳咳……根本没到问答这一步啊，看来资料要补充一点，阿罗德斯大人不会助长投机取巧的行为……"] = "Cough, cough... It didn't even get to the Q&A stage. It seems the data needs to be supplemented; Lord Arrodes will not encourage opportunistic behavior...",
    ["咳咳，咳咳咳咳——我没事。"] = "*Cough*, *cough cough cough*—I'm fine.",
