    ["咳咳，差一点就——嗯，好在没弄丢我的烟斗。"] = "Cough, cough, that was close—well, at least I didn't lose my pipe.",
    ["咳咳，帮助老板收租，是我们的使命！"] = "Ahem, helping the boss collect rent is our mission!",
    ["咳咳，很荣幸地宣布，你们的最后一关——鬼屋！"] = "Ahem, it is my honor to announce your final stage—the Haunted House!",
    ["咳咳，怎么会这样……好诡异的花！"] = "Cough, cough, how did it come to this... What a bizarre flower!",
    ["咳咳，您就是新来的警官！可真年轻呀，年轻有为！"] = "Ahem, you must be the new police officer! You are so young; young and promising!",
    ["咳咳，我们是警察，来这里调查一起案件，请配合一下。"] = "Ahem, we are police officers, here to investigate a case. Please cooperate.",
    ["咳咳，我没说过。"] = "Cough cough, I never said that.",
    ["咳咳，我说……没事的话，离那边的营地远点。"] = "Ahem, I said... if there's nothing, stay away from that camp over there.",
    ["咳咳，我还是不要在大街上做这种莫名其妙的事吧。"] = "Ahem, I'd better not do such inexplicable things on the street.",
    ["咳咳，我，我先仔细看看！"] = "Ahem, I, I'll take a closer look first!",
    ["咳咳，抱歉，我的未婚妻有点过于活泼。我的腿——额，我的腿在几年前的战争中受了伤。"] = "Cough, cough, sorry, my fiancée is a bit too lively. My leg—uh, my leg was injured in the war a few years ago.",
    ["咳咳，来客人了？我问问你……老巴克的山羊叫什么？"] = "Ahem, a guest? Let me ask you... what is Old Buck's goat called?",
    ["咳咳，每个人的观念不同，兰格他总是教导我们不能偷窃，实际上我也明白身为孤儿有时偷窃是无奈之举。"] = "Ahem, everyone has different concepts. Lange always teaches us not to steal; in fact, I also understand that as an orphan, sometimes stealing is a last resort.",
    ["咳咳，没事。我昨天进入到<P_Yellow>海纳斯的梦境</>，发现了一些事情……"] = "Ahem, it's nothing. I entered <P_Yellow>Haines's dream</> yesterday and discovered some things...",
    ["咳咳，没事。我昨天进入到海纳斯的梦境，发现了一些事情……"] = "Ahem, it's nothing. I entered Haines's dream yesterday and discovered some things...",
    ["咳咳，没事的，母亲。"] = "Cough, I'm fine, Mother.",
    ["咳咳，没有，老实说，我的肝不太好，不该再喝啤酒了，但我毕竟在恶龙酒吧里做生意……"] = "Cough cough, no. To be honest, my liver isn't very good, I shouldn't be drinking beer anymore, but after all, I do business in the Evil Dragon Bar...",
    ["咳咳，维持压制！克莱恩把2-049引来铁箱这里！"] = "Captain, maintain the suppression! Klein, lure 2-049 to the iron box here!",
