    ["咳咳，被滞涩的感觉可真不怎么样，感觉自己成了一个任人摆布的木偶。"] = "Cough, cough, the feeling of stagnation really isn't great; I feel like I've become a puppet at the mercy of others.",
    ["咳咳，说是巡逻员……其实不过是我自己的消遣而已。"] = "Ahem, calling it a patrolman... actually, it's just my own pastime.",
    ["咳咳，请让我为我的鲁莽道歉。不管你是不是因为我张贴的委托而来，希望你可以帮我们看看老约翰。"] = "Ahem, please let me apologize for my recklessness. Regardless of whether you came because of the commission I posted, I hope you can help us check on Old John.",
