    ["咳，不重要……总有一天，我要扬帆起航，去追寻海上的宝藏。就算找不到宝藏，我也能在月光下使舵，喝着烈朗齐 ，唱着水手歌……"] = "Cough, not important... One day, I will set sail to pursue the treasures on the sea. Even if I don't find the treasure, I can still steer under the moonlight, drinking Ranzhi, singing sailor songs...",
    ["咳，前方是巴纳比先生的营地，我们在警戒四周，保障营地安全。"] = "Ahem, ahead is Mr. Barnaby's camp. We are guarding the surroundings to ensure the safety of the camp.",
