    ["哈哈哈……"] = "Hahaha...",
    ["哈哈哈……艺术……面包……"] = "Hahaha... art... bread...",
    ["哈哈哈哈——荣誉？穷鬼的荣誉，简直是第五纪以来最大的笑话！"] = "Hahahaha—honor? A poor man's honor is simply the biggest joke since the Fifth Epoch!",
    ["哈哈哈哈……主人……是啊……主人是谁呢？是我？还是你？哈哈哈哈……"] = "Hahahaha... Master... yes... who is the Master? Is it me? Or is it you? Hahahaha...",
    ["哈哈哈哈哈，不对，也许有一天，你到我这个年纪，就会理解这个笑话了！"] = "Hahahaha, no, maybe one day when you reach my age, you'll understand this joke!",
    ["哈哈哈哈哈，吓到您了吗？"] = "Hahahahaha, did I scare you?",
    ["哈哈哈哈！倒霉蛋！大倒霉蛋！"] = "Hahahaha! Loser! Big loser!",
    ["哈哈哈哈！倒霉蛋，倒霉蛋，全世界都是倒霉蛋！"] = "Hahahaha! Loser, loser, the whole world is full of losers!",
    ["哈哈哈！"] = "Hahaha!",
    ["哈哈哈！你别说，这还真是他能做出来的事。"] = "Hahaha! Don't say, this is really something he would do.",
    ["哈哈哈！繁衍，孕育，降生……永不停息！"] = "Hahaha! Procreation, gestation, birth... never-ending!",
    ["哈哈哈！随便逛逛而已。我偶尔也会祈祷，不过大部分时候都像这样，找一张椅子，看看周围的人。"] = "Hahaha! Just wandering around. I pray occasionally, but most of the time, I just find a chair and watch the people around me.",
    ["哈哈哈，并没有呢，您可真是个热心的家伙。"] = "Hahaha, not at all. You really are an enthusiastic person.",
    ["哈哈哈，当然，亲爱的，想当年我就是靠这个把你追到手的——那时你可是歌剧院最耀眼的一颗明星！"] = "Hahaha, of course, my dear, back in the day I relied on this to win you over—back then you were the brightest star in the opera house!",
    ["哈哈哈，您说的是事实，如您所见，我并不擅长打点花园，只是我不想尼尔先生的花园就这么荒废掉。"] = "Hahaha, what you said is a fact. As you can see, I'm not good at tending to gardens, I just don't want Mr. Neil's garden to be abandoned like this.",
    ["哈哈哈，我才不会面对你这个天使级别的怪物，我要带走{{他|她}}。"] = "Hahaha, I wouldn't dare face a monster of your Angel level, but I am taking {{him|her}} with me.",
    ["哈哈哈，没错，就是这样！震撼人心的逆转即将出现！"] = "Hahaha, that's right, exactly! A shocking reversal is about to appear!",
    ["哈哈哈，误会了，我们都结婚快十年了，我丈夫还非要拍这婚纱照。"] = "Hahaha, it's a misunderstanding. We've been married for almost ten years, and my husband still insists on taking these wedding photos.",
    ["哈哈对，摊位补货和大单运送都归我们管。西尼他们去盥洗室了，我们刚才在阴凉的地方打牌呢。"] = "Haha, yes, stall restocking and large order deliveries are our responsibility. Cini and the others went to the washroom; we were just playing cards in the shade.",
    ["哈哈！好心、热情的年轻人，陪老头子和这位远道而来的朋友喝一杯吧！"] = "Haha! Kind, enthusiastic young man, have a drink with this old man and this friend who came from afar!",
    ["哈哈！被你听到了，没错，两个港口，两个家，两个温柔的好女人！"] = "Haha! You heard me, that's right, two ports, two homes, two gentle, good women!",
    ["哈哈，《老实人报》一直走这个风格，是我们平民最喜欢的厕所读物！"] = "Haha, The Honest Man has always had this style; it's our favorite bathroom reading material as commoners!",
    ["哈哈，一想到这帮家伙的表情，我就要抑制不住激动的心。"] = "Haha, just thinking about the expressions on these guys' faces, I can't suppress my excitement.",
    ["哈哈，上当了吧！"] = "Haha, fell for it, didn't you!",
    ["哈哈，不客气。"] = "Haha, you're welcome.",
    ["哈哈，不有趣吗？简直像在剧院里看到的情节一样！"] = "Haha, isn't it interesting? It's just like a plot from a theater!",
    ["哈哈，不能。就像我再也看不到那封信一样……"] = "Haha, no. Just like I can never see that letter again...",
    ["哈哈，不过我的稿件常常被退回来，心里难免有些不安。"] = "Haha, but my manuscripts are often returned, so I can't help but feel a bit uneasy.",
    ["哈哈，也不用太担心。里面至少还有两位教会内部的看守者，以及数不清的陷阱。"] = "Haha, no need to worry too much. There are at least two internal church guards inside, as well as countless traps.",
    ["哈哈，什么话，我当然是真的市长候选人！"] = "Haha, what are you saying? Of course, I am a real mayoral candidate!",
    ["哈哈，他们三个都在跳舞，多热闹啊，我也要跳！"] = "Haha, all three of them are dancing, it's so lively, I want to dance too!",
    ["哈哈，他们能收获的比知识和分数更多！"] = "Haha, they can gain much more than just knowledge and grades!",
    ["哈哈，你们完了，你们惹到我外婆了！"] = "Haha, you're done for, you've provoked my grandma!",
    ["哈哈，你找对人了。在你面前的是二十年书报经验所有人，前邮报编辑，前老实人报编辑，现自由撰稿人。"] = "Haha, you've come to the right person. Before you stands a man with twenty years of experience in books and newspapers, former editor of the Post, former editor of the Tingen Honest Reporter, and current freelance writer.",
    ["哈哈，你的动作就像一只跛脚的鹌鹑。"] = "Haha, you move like a lame quail.",
    ["哈哈，你看它这张脸，多像一个小丑！"] = "Haha, look at this face, it looks so much like a Clown!",
    ["哈哈，你说得对。看来我也有自己的天赋！园丁先生，这个工作我接下了！"] = "Haha, you're right. It seems I have my own talent! Mr. Gardener, I'll take the job!",
    ["哈哈，别担心，我还不至于找不到回家的路。克莱恩，你的面试怎么样了？"] = "Haha, don't worry, I'm not so lost that I can't find my way home. Klein, how did your interview go?",
    ["哈哈，只是平时多看了一些报纸上的美食栏目罢了。"] = "Haha, I just read the food columns in the newspapers a bit more often.",
    ["哈哈，后来她为梦想去了贝克兰德，我们只会偶尔通信。"] = "Haha, later she went to Backlund for her dreams, and we only correspond occasionally.",
    ["哈哈，吓到了吗？有没有出冷汗？我跟“世界”先生学的语气！"] = "Haha, were you scared? Did you break into a cold sweat? I learned that tone from Mr. World!",
    ["哈哈，吓到了吗？有没有出冷汗？这是我跟“世界”先生学的语气！"] = "Haha, were you scared? Did you break into a cold sweat? That's the tone I learned from Mr. World!",
    ["哈哈，喜欢这样性格的人，恋爱可是有不少挑战！"] = "Haha, liking someone with that personality means love will have quite a few challenges!",
    ["哈哈，好样的！年轻的时候我想当个冒险家，但等啊等，这一生一事无成，就要到头了！"] = "Haha, well said! When I was young, I wanted to be an adventurer, but I waited and waited, and now my life is coming to an end with nothing to show for it!",
    ["哈哈，它答应了。"] = "Haha, it agreed.",
    ["哈哈，对，我们要上厕所。"] = "Haha, yes, we need to go to the bathroom.",
    ["哈哈，小戴莉，一定不要像我一样心存遗憾啊。"] = "Haha, little Daly, you must not have regrets like I did.",
    ["哈哈，尝起来很棒对吧？我家祖传的秘方，你在因蒂斯都找不到这么香的精酿。"] = "Haha, tastes great, right? It's my family's secret recipe; you won't find such fragrant craft brew anywhere else in Intis.",
    ["哈哈，开玩笑的，每个人都很期待廷根第一女拳手的表现！"] = "Haha, just kidding, everyone is looking forward to the performance of Tingen's number one female boxer!",
    ["哈哈，您别害怕。我是说身份证明上的索罗。"] = "Haha, don't be afraid. I mean Solo on the identification document.",
    ["哈哈，感谢你毫不吝啬的夸赞！这都是年轻时学到的道理了，却在年岁大了之后才懂得。"] = "Haha, thank you for your generous praise! These are principles I learned when I was young, but I only truly understood them after I got older.",
    ["哈哈，我一辈子也就这样了。"] = "Haha, this is how my life will be.",
    ["哈哈，我就勉强约他去紫藤花廊走走，看看我们是不是真的有话可说。"] = "Haha, I'll reluctantly ask him to take a walk in the Wisteria Corridor to see if we really have anything to talk about.",
    ["哈哈，我还在学习，写诗是一件复杂又深奥的事情。至于你的能力，我很清楚。"] = "Haha, I'm still learning; writing poetry is a complex and profound matter. As for your abilities, I am well aware of them.",
    ["哈哈，所以你承认你是卡住了？"] = "Haha, so you admit you are stuck?",
    ["哈哈，抱歉，我已经很久不给别人占卜了。"] = "Haha, sorry, I haven't performed divination for others for a long time.",
    ["哈哈，拉姆德小镇没有不认识他的。他原先是流浪儿，又瘦又笨。"] = "Haha, there's no one in Lamud who doesn't know him. He used to be a stray, thin and clumsy.",
    ["哈哈，是吗？"] = "Haha, really?",
    ["哈哈，是我的妹妹小萨拉寄回来的信。"] = "Haha, it's a letter sent back by my little sister, Sarah.",
    ["哈哈，有机会我也想见见这位先生！"] = "Haha, if I have the chance, I'd like to meet this gentleman too!",
    ["哈哈，杰温先生真是个有心的伴侣。"] = "Haha, Mr. Jevon is truly a thoughtful partner.",
    ["哈哈，满公司的卷毛狒狒……谢谢你，班森。睡吧睡吧，明天真的要正式上班了。"] = "Haha, a company full of curly-haired baboons... Thank you, Benson. Sleep, sleep, I'll officially start work tomorrow.",
    ["哈哈，等处理完这段时间的大批案件，我们就去休假！"] = "Haha, once we finish handling the pile of cases from this period, we're going on vacation!",
    ["哈哈，终于有人上当了！"] = "Haha, finally someone fell for it!",
    ["哈哈，老邻居们吃习惯了。你再看看，那张菜单可就有点区别了。"] = "Haha, the old neighbors are used to eating them. Take another look; that menu is a bit different.",
    ["哈哈，耍得这么好，你也是个能人！可惜我的钱都在这顿酒里了，抱歉伙计。"] = "Haha, you're so good at this, you're a talented person! It's a pity all my money is in this drink, sorry buddy.",
    ["哈哈，虽然从无到有很麻烦，但是听到这样的赞美果然还是很爽啊。"] = "Haha, although it is troublesome to create something from nothing, hearing such praise is still very satisfying.",
    ["哈哈，观众老爷们……这也是一种喜剧收尾！"] = "Haha, dear audience... this is also a kind of comedic ending!",
    ["哈哈，还是个痴情人，给自己来一杯 “一忘皆空”吧！柑橘和烈酒混合在一起，味道让人放松又让人沉醉。"] = "Haha, still a lovesick soul. Have a 'Forget It All' for yourself! Citrus and strong liquor mixed together—the taste is both relaxing and intoxicating.",
    ["哈哈，这可是勇敢者酒吧最烈的酒。"] = "Haha, this is the strongest liquor in the Bravehearts Bar.",
    ["哈哈，这手艺没有什么特殊的……前两天有个作家来取材，问我烘焙的秘方是什么，我说不出什么答案。"] = "Haha, there's nothing special about this craft... A writer came to gather material a couple of days ago and asked me what the secret recipe for baking is, and I couldn't give an answer.",
    ["哈哈，这里只是一堵墙哦！不过对面的“那张书页”，可不是这样，嘿嘿。"] = "Haha, this is just a wall! But the \"page\" on the other side is not like this, hehe.",
    ["哈哈，这里的都是无用之人，迟早有一天他们都会被斩杀"] = "Haha, everyone here is useless; sooner or later they will all be slaughtered",
    ["哈哈，那不如喝杯咖啡吧？"] = "Haha, then why not have a cup of coffee?",
    ["哈哈，阿德这个不幸的家伙，竟然被抓了。"] = "Haha, that unfortunate guy Ade actually got caught.",
    ["哈哈，风暴在上，我回来了！"] = "Haha, Storm above, I'm back!",
    ["哈啊？小戴莉，你怎么突然这么老了！"] = "Huh? Little Daly, why have you suddenly gotten so old!",
    ["哈基猿"] = "Haki-ape",
    ["哈基猿……虽然不知道是什么意思，但我喜欢这个名字。"] = "Haji-Ape... although I don't know what it means, I like this name.",
    ["哈基猿上台"] = "Haji-ape takes the stage",
    ["哈基猿不再多说，大口大口地吃完了桌上所有东西，吃得干干净净。"] = "The Haki-ape says no more, eating everything on the table in large mouthfuls until it is completely clean.",
    ["哈基猿中景正脸"] = "Haji-ape medium shot, full face",
    ["哈基猿挺身而出让贝儿热泪盈眶，这一刻，贝儿的心里忽然生出莫名的情愫……"] = "Haji-Ape's act of stepping forward brought tears to Belle's eyes. In that moment, an inexplicable affection suddenly grew in her heart...",
    ["哈基猿朝门"] = "Haji-ape facing the door",
    ["哈基猿过肩更近"] = "Haji-ape over-the-shoulder, closer",
    ["哈基猿这番话让贝儿热泪盈眶，两人心里也不知不觉生出了莫名的情愫……"] = "Haji-Ape's words brought tears to Belle's eyes, and unknowingly, an inexplicable affection began to grow between them...",
    ["哈基猿，为了我，你竟然愿意放弃自己的头发吗？"] = "Haji-Ape, for my sake, you would actually be willing to give up your hair?",
    ["哈基猿，你这家伙……"] = "Haji-Ape, you guy...",
    ["哈基猿，谢谢你……有你在，真的好有安全感！"] = "Haji-Ape, thank you... With you here, I feel so safe!",
    ["哈基猿，谢谢你，有你在，真的好有安全感。"] = "Haji-Ape, thank you. With you here, I really feel safe.",
