    ["哈森先生，你还好吗？这是队长要我给你们的药剂。"] = "Mr. Hassen, are you alright? This is the potion the captain asked me to give you.",
    ["哈洛·"] = "Harlow ",
    ["哈灵顿"] = "Harrington",
    ["哈灵顿先生，那个一掷千金的哈灵顿先生。上周给教会开了张支票，数字写得漂亮极了。人们都说他简直是又一个道恩·唐泰斯！"] = "Mr. Harrington, that Mr. Harrington who threw money around like water. He wrote a check to the church last week with a beautiful number on it. People were saying he was practically another Dwayne Dantes!",
    ["哈灵顿家那几位少爷擦眼泪扔下的鼻涕纸，怕是还没被清洁工扫走呢！"] = "The tissues the young masters of the Harrington family threw away while wiping their tears probably haven't even been swept away by the cleaners yet!",
    ["哈特"] = "Hart",
    ["哈特利"] = "Hartley",
    ["哈特夫人，您看……那两个伯爵又缠上奈拉小姐了。"] = "Mrs. Hart, look... those two counts are pestering Miss Naila again.",
    ["哈珀"] = "Harper",
    ["哈瑞"] = "Harry",
    ["哈瑞！你又不是不知道，执法队总是在事情结束来收尾，我们是要从根源杜绝这种现象。"] = "Harry! You know, the enforcement team always comes to clean up after things are over. We need to eradicate this phenomenon from the root.",
