    ["哈维兰-洗衣妇女"] = "Haviland-Laundress",
    ["哈维又没来上课？ 怎么回事？"] = "Harvey didn't come to class again? What's going on?",
    ["哈维哈维哈维——哈！哈！哈！维！维！维！哈维呀哈维呀——我的好儿子哈维呀——"] = "Harvey Harvey Harvey—Ha! Ha! Ha! vey! vey! vey! Harvey oh Harvey oh—my good son Harvey—",
    ["哈维，这两位是来找戒指的。"] = "Harvey, these two are here to look for a ring.",
