    ["唤醒阿诺德"] = "Wake Arnold",
    ["唤醒阿诺德后"] = "After Waking Arnold",
    ["唤醒黄昏巨人血脉中「力有其形」的特质，将体能与非凡蛮力凝于周身，提前锚定即将施展的攻击姿态，同时牵引脚下大地的微末土灵之力，为力量轨迹塑形。当下一次发力攻击时，凝练的力量轨迹会随本体动作具象化为厚重的攻击残影。\n吸收残影后使自己的魅力加3，直觉加1。"] = "Awaken the 'Form of Strength' trait within the Twilight Giant bloodline, condensing physical energy and extraordinary brute force around your body. Anchor the attack stance you are about to perform in advance, while drawing upon the faint earth spirit power beneath your feet to shape the trajectory of your strength. When you perform your next powerful attack, the condensed strength trajectory will materialize as a heavy attack phantom following your movements. \n Absorbing the phantom increases your Charm by 3 and Intuition by 1.",
    ["唤醒黄昏巨人血脉中对近战兵器的天然契合感，融合武器大师对大剑、双剑的千锤百炼之技，以非凡蛮力为引，凝出对应武器的实体形态。\n使自己的直觉加4，武力加2。"] = "Awaken the natural affinity for melee weapons within the Twilight Giant bloodline, merging the Weapon Master's refined skills with greatswords and dual swords. Using extraordinary brute force as a guide, condense the physical form of the corresponding weapon. \n Increases your Intuition by 4 and Might by 2.",
    ["唤醒黄昏巨人血脉中最本源的蛮力特质，将体能与微薄非凡之力尽数凝于左腿，重踏地面时将力量向下传导至大地肌理，引发局部地面的短促震荡，同时震起周遭尘土形成短暂的视觉遮蔽。\n使自己的武力加1。"] = "Awaken the most primal brute force trait of the Twilight Giant bloodline, concentrating all physical strength and meager Beyonder power into the left leg. When stomping the ground, the force is transmitted downward into the earth's texture, triggering a short, localized tremor while kicking up dust to create a brief visual obstruction. \nIncreases your Might by 1.",
