    ["唯有冰雪，亘古长存。万物在此凝止，时间至此失色。"] = "Only ice and snow endure through the ages. All things freeze here, and time loses its color.",
    ["唯有将那些至善至美的情感刻印下来，才能让它们和作品一起得到永生。"] = "Only by engraving those most beautiful and kind emotions can they achieve immortality along with the works.",
