    ["啊啊啊虫子！"] = "Ahhh, bugs!",
    ["啊啊啊！什么东西！"] = "Ahhh! What is that!",
    ["啊啊啊！救命啊！"] = "Ahhh! Help!",
    ["啊啊我的时间不多了！统统给我闪开！"] = "Ahhh, I don't have much time left! Get out of my way, all of you!",
    ["啊啊救命！别过来啊！"] = "Ahhh, help! Don't come over here!",
    ["啊我知道我知道，大人物总有些不能说的事情要做，是我没有想到这一点。"] = "Ah, I know, I know. Big shots always have things they can't talk about to do. It was my fault for not thinking of that.",
    ["啊！"] = "Ah!",
    ["啊！——\n一声尖叫让床上两个人完全惊醒。"] = "Ah!—\n A scream wakes the two people on the bed completely.",
    ["啊！你手上拿的是艾登的口风琴！还有我们一起创作的乐谱！"] = "Ah! What you're holding is Aiden's harmonica! And the sheet music we composed together!",
    ["啊！你看！差点掉下去！快回来，求你了！你需要梯子！"] = "Ah! Look! You almost fell! Come back, I beg you! You need a ladder!",
    ["啊！又是一块碎龟壳，这里不会住着一只很大的乌龟吧！"] = "Ah! Another piece of broken turtle shell. Could there be a very large turtle living here!",
    ["啊！吓我一跳。"] = "Ah! You startled me.",
    ["啊！啊……是啊，我忘记了。"] = "Ah! Ah... yes, I forgot.",
    ["啊！啊！就是这个！什么《银月公爵的爱欲》，银色饰品，散落的玫瑰，颈部微小的穿刺伤痕……"] = "Ah! Ah! That's it! Things like \"The Lust of the Silver Moon Duke\", silver ornaments, scattered roses, tiny puncture wounds on the neck...",
    ["啊！啊！有本事……你打死我！"] = "Ah! Ah! If you have the guts... kill me!",
    ["啊！您回来了！见到戈多了吗？"] = "Ah! You're back! Did you see Godot?",
    ["啊！我9苏勒的裙子！太可恶了！"] = "Ah! My 9-sol dress! How detestable!",
    ["啊！我并不是探听您的隐私……"] = "Ah! I wasn't prying into your privacy...",
    ["啊！我得回去补案件文档了，希望弗莱队长还没发现……"] = "Ah! I have to go back and finish the case documents. I hope Captain Frye hasn't noticed yet...",
    ["啊！我心爱的太阳——您的辉光照耀……"] = "Ah! My beloved sun—your radiance shines...",
    ["啊！没有佛尔思的小说看，我要坚持不下去了！"] = "Ah! Without Fors's novels to read, I can't hold on anymore!",
    ["啊！熔炉的温度又……"] = "Ah! The temperature of the furnace is...",
    ["啊！独家新闻！交通部长酒后肇事！并袭击一般市民！"] = "Ah! Exclusive news! The Minister of Transport caused an accident while drunk! And assaulted a regular citizen!",
    ["啊！真讨厌！我漂亮的爪子都弄湿了！"] = "Ah! How annoying! My beautiful paws are all wet!",
    ["啊！罗珊已经出发了，我得在她之前赶到餐厅做好准备才行！"] = "Ah! Rozanne has already left, I must arrive at the restaurant before her to prepare!",
    ["啊！过来了！"] = "Ah! He's coming over!",
    ["啊！这就是贝克兰德的水，和村里的井水完全不一样。"] = "Ah! This is the water of Backlund, it's completely different from the well water in the village.",
    ["啊！！"] = "Ah!!",
    ["啊！！啊！！！"] = "Ah!! Ah!!!",
    ["啊！！！！"] = "Ah!!!!",
    ["啊， 是你！多亏了你的帮助。我发现唱歌真的很有趣，现在我已经是唱诵会的领唱了。"] = "Ah, it's you! Thanks to your help. I found that singing is really interesting, and now I am the lead singer of the chanting group.",
    ["啊，{{先生|小姐}}，欢迎您去事务所里面的窗口排号，最近业务太多了，请谅解。"] = "Ah, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, please go to the window inside the office to get a number. We've been very busy lately, please understand.",
    ["啊，一不小心说多了，你别嫌我唠叨就好。"] = "Ah, I talked too much by accident. I hope you don't mind my nagging.",
    ["啊，一个没有失控的生物……在这里真是罕见。"] = "Ah, a creature that hasn't lost control... that's truly rare here.",
    ["啊，一位新朋友。您也对罗塞尔大帝的诗篇感兴趣吗？欢迎一起来交流。"] = "Ah, a new friend. Are you also interested in Emperor Roselle's poems? Welcome, let's discuss them together.",
    ["啊，不必拘谨。从码头区的卸货劳工，到贝克兰德王宫中的贵人们，风暴之主的教堂对所有人开放。"] = "Ah, no need to be reserved. From the unloading laborers in the dock area to the nobles in the Backlund palace, the Church of the Lord of Storms is open to everyone.",
    ["啊，不是的……我只是霍伊大学的文员，杰温才是讲师。"] = "Ah, no... I'm just a clerk at Hoey University. Jevon is the lecturer.",
    ["啊，丽贝卡！"] = "Ah, Rebecca!",
    ["啊，他竟然还在那里？"] = "Ah, he's actually still there?",
    ["啊，你好你好，我在看报纸，有什么事情随便问吧。"] = "Ah, hello, hello. I'm reading the newspaper, feel free to ask anything.",
    ["啊，你好，找我有什么事吗？"] = "Ah, hello, is there anything I can help you with?",
    ["啊，你是说……海上已经很久没有他的消息了，说不准这神秘力量就与他有关。"] = "Ah, you mean... there hasn't been any news of him from the sea for a long time. Perhaps this mysterious power is related to him.",
    ["啊，你有什么事吗？"] = "Ah, is there something you need?",
    ["啊，你来了——"] = "Ah, you're here—",
    ["啊，你说是修桥那事儿？"] = "Ah, you mean the bridge repair thing?",
    ["啊，先生，我简直不知道该如何感谢您……"] = "Ah, sir, I simply don't know how to thank you...",
    ["啊，别往我的脖子里扔雪！我再看一会儿。回了家，可能下半辈子都不会再看到了！"] = "Ah, don't throw snow down my neck! I'll watch for a while longer. Once I'm home, I probably won't see this for the rest of my life!",
    ["啊，别忘了带上那个。"] = "Ah, don't forget to take that.",
    ["啊，别说得那么不体面。"] = "Ah, don't put it so inelegantly.",
    ["啊，原来是火柴燃尽了，{{先生|女士}}，能否再划一根呢？"] = "Ah, it seems the match has burned out. {{Sir|Madam}}, could you strike another one?",
    ["啊，可我已经耽误好久了……我，我现在就想去见杰温！"] = "Ah, but I've already delayed for so long... I, I want to go see Gewen right now!",
    ["啊，太阳！你这永不疲倦的金马蹄，踏碎了我的庸碌。"] = "Ah, sun! You tireless golden horseshoe, you've trampled my mediocrity.",
    ["啊，女士，您是想买什么东西吗？"] = "Ah, lady, are you looking to buy something?",
    ["啊，她住在北区的豪尔斯街，就在十字路口那家咖啡店的隔壁。"] = "Ah, she lives on Howes Street in the North Borough, right next to that coffee shop at the intersection.",
    ["啊，妈妈真是的！赶快回来呀，我要忘记歌词啦。"] = "Ah, Mother is so annoying! Come back quickly, I'm going to forget the lyrics.",
    ["啊，希尔维娅夫人。您知道在我们教会学校，所有学生必须通过严格的专业考试才能申请就读。"] = "Ah, Lady Sylvia. You know that at our church school, all students must pass a rigorous professional examination to apply for admission.",
    ["啊，库尔斯先生！"] = "Ah, Mr. Cours!",
    ["啊，当然有的，若您感兴趣的话，可以了解一下我们的“静夜礼赞”项链，以黑夜和繁星为主题，代表着女神的庇佑，点缀着几十颗有着无与伦比切割工艺的——"] = "Ah, of course, if you are interested, you can learn about our \"Silent Night Praise\" necklace, themed around the night and the stars, representing the Goddess's protection, adorned with dozens of gems with unparalleled cutting craftsmanship—",
    ["啊，恐惧的威胁，绯红的希冀。"] = "Ah, the threat of fear, the crimson hope.",
    ["啊，恐惧的威胁，绯红的希冀！"] = "Ah, the threat of horror, the crimson hope!",
    ["啊，您不要抛弃我！"] = "Ah, please don't abandon me!",
    ["啊，您说什么？我怎么听到了我小女儿的名字……"] = "Ah, what did you say? Why did I hear my little daughter's name...",
    ["啊，我准备好迎接爱情了……"] = "Ah, I'm ready to welcome love...",
    ["啊，我在想念我的莉诺呢。"] = "Ah, I am missing my Lino.",
    ["啊，我得走了，杰温还在等——哎哟！"] = "Ah, I have to go, Gewen is still waiting—ouch!",
    ["啊，我想那应该是一个没有恶意的游魂。他已经完成了自己的愿望……"] = "Ah, I think that must have been a wandering soul without malice. He has fulfilled his wish...",
    ["啊，我懂了！"] = "Ah, I get it!",
    ["啊，我明白了……我失败了，我被祂放弃了，我要被骨笛吃掉了。"] = "Ah, I understand... I failed. I have been abandoned by Him, and I am going to be eaten by the bone flute.",
    ["啊，我明白了！"] = "Ah, I understand!",
    ["啊，我知道了，准是那个“孤儿帮”的成员。"] = "Ah, I know, it must be a member of that \"Orphan Gang\".",
    ["啊，我跪啦~"] = "Ah, I'm down~",
    ["啊，或许是同一位小女孩。{{先生|女士}}，请不必客气，我愿意免费给您一盒火柴。"] = "Ah, perhaps it's the same little girl. {{Sir|Madam}}, please don't be so formal; I'm happy to give you a box of matches for free.",
    ["啊，或许是同一位小女孩。请{{先生|女士}}不必客气，我愿意免费给您一盒火柴。"] = "Ah, perhaps it's the same little girl. Please, {{Mr.| Ms.}}, don't be so polite; I'm willing to give you a box of matches for free.",
    ["啊，找到了。沙曼在这里。"] = "Ah, found him. Shaman is here.",
    ["啊，是{{PlayerName}}！回来有什么事吗？"] = "Ah, it's {{PlayerName}}! Is there anything you need now that you're back?",
    ["啊，是之前的好心人……怎么了，您也想见见杰温吗？"] = "Ah, it's the kind person from before... What's wrong? Do you want to see Gewen too?",
    ["啊，是吗？我没有注意到……不过既然您这么有心……"] = "Ah, is that so? I didn't notice... but since you are so thoughtful...",
    ["啊，是弗莱队长的信。"] = "Ah, it's a letter from Captain Dunn.",
    ["啊，是第二次循环的谜题。"] = "Ah, it's the puzzle for the second cycle.",
    ["啊，是那个<P_Yellow>棕色的皮箱</>。"] = "Ah, it's that <P_Yellow> brown suitcase </>.",
    ["啊，是里奇的钱包！看这张照片，是他念念不忘的未婚妻。"] = "Ah, it's Rich's wallet! Look at this photo, it's his fiancée whom he couldn't stop thinking about.",
    ["啊，最近有人向会长信箱提建议，希望在学派内补充一些装饰……"] = "Ah, someone recently made a suggestion to the President's mailbox, hoping to add some decorations within the school...",
    ["啊，有一个我从未在公开场合讲过的，因为太过……诡异。"] = "Ah, there is one I have never told in public because it is too... eerie.",
    ["啊，有冒险精神的客人。 "] = "Ah, a guest with an adventurous spirit.",
    ["啊，有勇气的客人。 "] = "Ah, a courageous guest.",
    ["啊，没什么特殊的，只是路过，就来看看。"] = "Ah, nothing special. I was just passing by, so I came to take a look.",
    ["啊，理解理解！活动持续整月，欢迎随时来试！黄色结实，蓝色迅捷，棕色安静！ "] = "Ah, understood, understood! The event lasts all month, feel free to try it anytime! Yellow is sturdy, blue is swift, brown is quiet!",
    ["啊，芙拉女士！"] = "Ah, Ms. Fula!",
    ["啊，警官！黛西小姐怎样了？"] = "Ah, officer! How is Miss Daisy?",
    ["啊，警官，有什么可以帮您的吗？"] = "Ah, officer, is there anything I can help you with?",
    ["啊，达洛维夫人。您知道，本校所有学生须通过严格考试方可申请就读。"] = "Ah, Mrs. Dalov. You know, all students at this school must pass a rigorous examination to apply for admission.",
    ["啊，这不对称的美感，你不懂！"] = "Ah, this beauty of asymmetry, you don't understand!",
    ["啊，那个是从斯林面包房买的成品……"] = "Ah, that was a finished product bought from Slin's bakery...",
    ["啊，那是福戈！"] = "Ah, that's Fogo!",
    ["啊，那边说得也很对。"] = "Ah, that side is also very correct.",
    ["啊，雀斑先生。你把自己打扮得像星空，但今晚的幸运不需要这么多星星。"] = "Ah, Mr. Freckles. You've dressed yourself like the starry sky, but tonight's luck doesn't need so many stars.",
    ["啊？"] = "Huh?",
    ["啊？ 原来她也会被退稿？那我上次文法课没及格是不是也没那么丢人了！"] = "Ah? So she gets rejected too? Then maybe it's not so embarrassing that I failed my grammar class last time!",
    ["啊？<P_Heart>（“正义”女士给我2万苏勒，也用这笔钱做点好事吧。）</>"] = "Ah? <P_Heart> (Miss Justice gave me 20,000 gold pounds, I should use this money to do some good deeds too.) </>",
    ["啊？七个插在派上的鱼头？"] = "Huh? Seven fish heads stuck in a pie?",
    ["啊？但我真是这门课的老师啊，我就是海默·米勒。"] = "Huh? But I really am the teacher for this course; I am Haimer Miller.",
    ["啊？但这好像不是老师的风格，这么写能行吗？"] = "Ah? But that doesn't seem to be the teacher's style. Will writing like that work?",
    ["啊？你也想来打工？没门。"] = "Huh? You want to work here too? No way.",
    ["啊？你是怎么上来的？"] = "Huh? How did you get up here?",
    ["啊？可我的星相书，都是花大力气淘来的手写本……"] = "Huh? But my astrology books are all handwritten copies that I went to great lengths to acquire...",
    ["啊？呃，我在，呃……我在做什么？"] = "Huh? Uh, I am, uh... what am I doing?",
    ["啊？怎么在那里……我记得，那地方发生过很多类似的事。"] = "Ah? Why is it there... I remember, many similar things have happened in that place.",
    ["啊？我不想知道这么多……听起来很危险啊。"] = "Huh? I don't want to know so much... That sounds dangerous.",
    ["啊？我不是再复述之前阿罗德斯的问题吗……"] = "Ah? Wasn't I just repeating Arrodes' previous question...",
    ["啊？我吗？长官，这是意外……"] = "Ah? Me? Officer, this is an accident...",
    ["啊？我没打算坐上去……马桶怎么会放在这里？"] = "Huh? I didn't intend to sit on it... Why is there a toilet here?",
    ["啊？我的计划里没有这一条！"] = "Ah? That's not in my plan!",
    ["啊？我还没有开始工作啊。"] = "Huh? I haven't even started working yet.",
    ["啊？我？"] = "Ah? Me?",
    ["啊？看着挺好吃的啊。"] = "Huh? It looks quite delicious though.",
    ["啊？等等！弗兰奇给你什么好处你这么帮他！我把你当兄弟，你就这么对我！"] = "Ah? Wait! What benefits did Frank give you to help him like this! I treated you like a brother, and this is how you treat me!",
    ["啊？这个想法，也有一定道理。"] = "Ah? This idea also has some truth to it.",
    ["啊？这么大的箱子……怎么装进去的？"] = "Ah? Such a big box... how did it fit inside?",
    ["啊？这只小家伙是这样带路的？看起来很熟练。"] = "Huh? This little guy is leading the way like this? It looks very experienced.",
    ["啊？这是我能听的吗？"] = "Huh? Is this something I'm allowed to hear?",
    ["啊？那我虔诚地祈求您……快下雨！快打雷！"] = "Ah? Then I devoutly pray to you... hurry up and rain! Hurry up and thunder!",
    ["啊？！"] = "Ah?!",
    ["啊？！原来是……找工作？难怪在餐厅时你要问他的薪水！"] = "Ah?! So it was... looking for a job? No wonder you asked about his salary at the restaurant!",
    ["啊？？？"] = "Ah???",
    ["啤酒与布丁"] = "Beer and pudding",
    ["啤酒告示"] = "Beer Notice",
    ["啤酒商人"] = "Beer Merchant",
    ["啤酒的清香裹上浓郁黄油，温热甘醇，喝下满口柔滑。"] = "The refreshing fragrance of beer wrapped in rich butter; warm, mellow, and smooth with every sip.",
    ["啦啦~啦啦~啦~"] = "La-la~ la-la~ la~",
    ["啦啦啦啦啦——咳咳！咳咳！"] = "La la la la la—cough cough! Cough cough!",
    ["啧……这点边角肉，免费送你。"] = "Tsk... take these meat scraps, free of charge.",
    ["啧。"] = "Tsk.",
    ["啧啧啧，吐得这么惨。"] = "Tsk tsk tsk, vomiting so miserably.",
    ["啧啧啧，呦呦呦。"] = "Tsk tsk tsk, yo yo yo.",
    ["啧啧，听起来很不可思议，这样的案子你居然都能侦破。"] = "Tsk tsk, it sounds incredible that you could actually solve such a case.",
    ["啧啧，这些虽不是真品，拓下一模一样的面具也着实花了我不少时间。"] = "Tsk tsk, although these aren't the originals, it really took me quite some time to make an identical replica of the mask.",
    ["啧，占星占星，一天就知道占星。"] = "Tsk, astrology, astrology, all you know is astrology all day long.",
    ["啧，因蒂斯的贵族我也不怎么欣赏。呃，不欣赏其中一部分行事风格。有的也还可以。"] = "Tsk, I don't really appreciate the Intis nobles either. Uh, I don't appreciate some of their styles of doing things. Some are okay.",
    ["啧，忏悔了半天，就忏悔出一堆阴沟里的老鼠来。"] = "Tsk, after confessing for so long, all they could confess were a bunch of rats in the gutter.",
    ["啧，要我说，懒汉才天天闹腾！"] = "Tsk, if you ask me, only idlers make a fuss every day!",
    ["啧，谁叫你最便宜，我继续等！"] = "Tsk, since you're the cheapest, I'll keep waiting!",
    ["啧，谁知道他摇身一变，成了那个什么鲁伯特男爵的私生子？换做是你，你走路也得鼻孔朝天！"] = "Tsk, who knew he'd suddenly turn out to be the illegitimate son of that Baron Rupert? If it were you, you'd be walking with your nose in the air too!",
    ["啧，谁知道他摇身一变，成了那个什么鲁伯特男爵的私生子？换成是你，你走路也得鼻孔朝天！"] = "Tsk, who knew he would suddenly transform into the illegitimate son of some Baron Rupert? If it were you, you'd be walking around with your nose in the air too!",
    ["啧，走开，别人的事你少问。"] = "Tsk, get lost. Mind your own business.",
    ["啧，这些书不能堆在这啊……那个古板的塞巴斯蒂安先生也会写信谴责我的。"] = "Tsk, these books can't be piled up here... That stiff Mr. Sebastian will write a letter to condemn me too.",
    ["啧，这破池子连一般的鱼都不一定能养活…"] = "Tsk, this crappy pool can't even keep ordinary fish alive...",
    ["啰嗦什么，看打！"] = "Stop nagging, take this!",
    ["啾。"] = "Chirp.",
    ["啾啾啾。"] = "Chirp chirp chirp.",
    ["啾啾是多漂亮的小鸟啊，像天空一样蓝……它是最棒的玩偶。"] = "Chiu-Chiu was such a beautiful little bird, as blue as the sky... It was the best doll.",
    ["啾啾！啾！"] = "Chirp! Chirp!",
    ["啾啾，啾唧唧！"] = "Chirp, chirp-chirp!",
    ["啾啾？"] = "Chirp chirp?",
    ["喀什地区"] = "Kashgar Prefecture",
    ["喂<h>小猫</>喝汤"] = "Feed the <h>kitten</> some soup",
    ["喂——"] = "Hey—",
    ["喂——你们怎么在厕所门口跳舞呀！"] = "Hey—why are you dancing at the bathroom door!",
    ["喂——你俩还没订婚呢，就净说这样肉麻的话，真让人作呕！"] = "Hey—you two aren't even engaged yet, and you're already saying such mushy things, it's disgusting!",
    ["喂——回来吃饭啦——不然玛丽阿姨就没收你们的全部酥皮挞——还要罚你们下个礼拜都吃不到米布丁——"] = "Hey—come back for dinner—otherwise Aunt Mary will confiscate all your puff pastries—and punish you by not letting you have any rice pudding for the next week—",
    ["喂——那边的过客——"] = "Hey—you traveler over there—",
    ["喂……"] = "Hey...",
    ["喂……有……人……吗……"] = "Hey... is... there... anyone...",
    ["喂……那都过去了，我们换个话题——之前经常在餐馆里蹭吃的漂亮小白猫现在跑哪去了？"] = "Hey... that's all in the past, let's change the subject—where did the pretty little white cat that used to beg for food in the restaurant go?",
    ["喂亨特，管好你的狗，它吵得像刚出生的婴儿！"] = "Hey Hunter, control your dog, it's as noisy as a newborn baby!",
    ["喂它喝汤"] = "Feed it soup",
    ["喂小猫喝汤"] = "Feed the kitten soup",
    ["喂艾尔先生喝药"] = "Feed Mr. Aire the medicine",
    ["喂药"] = "Feed Medicine",
    ["喂药相关"] = "Medicine feeding related",
    ["喂那边的臭小孩，玩狗的时候安静一点！我不能再输了！"] = "Hey you brat over there, be quiet when playing with the dog! I can't lose anymore!",
    ["喂食"] = "Feed",
    ["喂食点1"] = "Feeding Spot 1",
    ["喂食点1位置暂时"] = "Feeding point 1 location temporary",
    ["喂食点2"] = "Feeding Spot 2",
