    ["喂食饲料"] = "Feed the feed",
    ["喂！你想对我的瓜做什么？"] = "Hey! What are you doing to my melon?",
    ["喂！你能不能走远点！我在玩捉迷藏呢！"] = "Hey! Can you go further away! I'm playing hide and seek!",
    ["喂！喂！你怎么又开始了！"] = "Hey! Hey! Why are you starting again!",
    ["喂！等等，现在该吃饭了！"] = "Hey! Wait, it's time to eat now!",
    ["喂，乔治，别再提这些无聊的事！不光是莉娜，我也要被你吓坏了！"] = "Hey, George, stop bringing up these boring things! It's not just Lina; you're going to scare me too!",
    ["喂，乔治，别再提这些无聊的事！我要被你吓坏了！"] = "Hey, George, stop bringing up these boring things! You're going to scare me to death!",
    ["喂，你一直在这偷听，是想干什么？"] = "Hey, you've been eavesdropping here, what do you want?",
    ["喂，你怎么又拖长音。"] = "Hey, why are you dragging out your words again?",
    ["喂，你注意到楼上那个怪人了吗？"] = "Hey, have you noticed that weirdo upstairs?",
    ["喂，你真的想买内部资料？"] = "Hey, do you really want to buy internal information?",
    ["喂，你这人怎么这么冷漠？我可是在生死边缘啊！"] = "Hey, why are you so cold-blooded? I'm on the edge of life and death!",
    ["喂，兄弟，你怎么总从教堂楼顶往下跳——已经持续整整两周了！小心点，别摔断了腿！"] = "Hey, brother, why do you always jump down from the roof of the church—it's been going on for two whole weeks! Be careful, don't break your leg!",
    ["喂，刚才让你喊动手已经很给你面子了，你现在还要反驳我？"] = "Hey, I already gave you face by shouting 'make a move' earlier, and now you're going to argue with me?",
    ["喂，别看不起人，不就是长得矮了点吗？"] = "Hey, don't look down on people, just because I'm a bit short?",
    ["喂，别碰我们的垃圾。"] = "Hey, don't touch our trash.",
    ["喂，哥们，手轻点！"] = "Hey, buddy, take it easy!",
    ["喂，对我的心血小心点！"] = "Hey, be careful with my hard work!",
    ["喂，我们只是来喝东西的，凭什么不让我们走？"] = "Hey, we're just here for a drink, why won't you let us leave?",
    ["喂，我们小时候去古堡里探险，是谁被吓得尿裤子？毕竟古堡属于一千多年前统治这里的领主，你害怕得不行吧？"] = "Hey, when we went exploring in the ancient castle as kids, who was the one scared enough to wet their pants? After all, the castle belonged to the lord who ruled here over a thousand years ago; you were terrified, weren't you?",
    ["喂，我是要成为拉姆德小镇第一吉他手的，这幸运给你，你要不要啊？"] = "Hey, I'm going to be the number one guitarist in Lamud Town. Do you want this luck, or not?",
    ["喂，汤米，还不去救公主吗？"] = "Hey, Tommy, aren't you going to save the princess yet?",
    ["喂，老兄，你可别想不开啊。 "] = "Hey, buddy, don't think about such dark things.",
    ["喂，这里在翻修新的道路，请绕路吧！"] = "Hey, they are renovating a new road here, please take a detour!",
    ["喂，醒醒！你在葡萄酒学院读了四年书，怎么喝两口就倒下了！"] = "Hey, wake up! You studied at the Wine Academy for four years, how did you fall down after just two sips!",
