    ["善良的"] = "Kind",
    ["善良的{{先生|女士}}，感谢您我唠叨了这么多。知道这个世界上还有人会记得珍妮，我就已经很欣慰了。"] = "Kind {{Mr.|Ms.}}, thank you for letting me ramble on so much. Knowing that there is still someone in this world who remembers Jenny is enough to comfort me.",
    ["善良的女士，能不能给我一根火柴，一根就好……"] = "Kind lady, can you give me a match, just one will do...",
    ["善良的孩子，我也会为你祈祷。"] = "Kind child, I will pray for you as well.",
    ["善良的客人，快打开剧本看看差了哪一位。"] = "Kind guest, hurry and open the script to see who is missing.",
    ["善良的少爷，我宣布你也通过调查了！"] = "Kind young master, I announce that you have also passed the investigation!",
    ["善良的工人，我宣布你被正式雇佣了！"] = "Kind worker, I announce that you have been officially hired!",
    ["善良的我帮他们都补上了邮票！"] = "Kind-hearted me helped them all put on stamps!",
    ["善良，只是留给死者的奢侈品。"] = "Kindness is just a luxury left for the dead.",
    ["善良？正直？亲爱的，这些品质在贵族圈里就像空气一样廉价——而且我们从不缺空气。 "] = "Kind? Honest? My dear, these qualities are as cheap as air in noble circles—and we are never short of air.",
    ["喇叭"] = "Megaphone",
    ["喊口号多帅啊，为什么塔芒先生总是拒绝我喊口号呢？"] = "Shouting slogans is so cool, why does Mr. Taman always refuse to let me shout slogans?",
