    ["喏 ，就是它们！还有谁比这些小家伙更懂鱼呢？要是连它们都能被吸引，那说明我这配方是真成功了！"] = "There, these are them! Who knows fish better than these little guys? If even they can be attracted, it means my formula is a true success!",
    ["喏 ，就是它们！还有谁比这些小家伙更懂鱼呢？要是连它们都能被吸引，那说明我这配方是真成功了！ "] = "There, those are them! Who knows fish better than these little guys? If even they can be attracted, it means my formula is truly a success!",
    ["喏 ，就是那些小猫们！还有谁比这些小家伙更懂鱼呢？要是连它们都能被吸引，那说明我这配方是真成功了！ "] = "There, it's those kittens! Who knows more about fish than these little guys? If even they can be attracted, it means my recipe is truly a success!",
    ["喏，二楼有个打扮得像侦探的，这周来了好几次了，每次都盯着我看。"] = "Well, there's someone on the second floor dressed like a detective. He's been here several times this week, and he stares at me every time.",
    ["喏，他就在前面呢！"] = "Look, he's right there!",
    ["喏，最大的那颗。不过今晚还得加点量，保证别人买回家一尝就“出状况”。"] = "Here, the biggest one. But we have to add more tonight to ensure that when others buy it home and taste it, they will 'have a situation'.",
    ["喏，玛丽，今天送你左脚靴子，配你去年收到的那只右脚的正合适！"] = "Here, Mary, today I'm giving you the left boot; it matches the right one you received last year perfectly!",
    ["喔~呜~喔~呜~呜~"] = "Ooh~ wu~ ooh~ wu~ wu~",
    ["喔——"] = "Woo—",
    ["喔……你想炼制什么药水或者符咒吗？还是想进行一些神秘学知识的学习？"] = "Oh... do you want to refine some potions or charms? Or do you want to learn some occult knowledge?",
    ["喔喔喔哇哇哇"] = "Ooh ooh ooh wah wah wah",
    ["喔！要长脑子了！"] = "Whoa! I'm going to grow a brain!",
    ["喔！这个仪式看起来真的有效！"] = "Wow! This ritual really seems to work!",
    ["喔，感觉这边很有道理呢。"] = "Oh, that side makes a lot of sense.",
    ["喔，抱歉埃德加，我想一定是我哪里弄错了！你拿去，这是新鲜的夜香草。"] = "Oh, sorry Edgar, I think I must have messed up somewhere! Here you go, this is fresh night-scented herb.",
    ["喔，经典的搭配，是我祖母小时候喜欢的口味。"] = "Whoa, a classic combination, it's the flavor my grandmother liked when she was a child.",
    ["喔，酒吧内还有恶犬，虽然我并不这样认为，但你最好也别碰它们。"] = "Oh, there are also vicious dogs in the bar. Although I don't think so, you'd better not touch them either.",
