    ["喜悦的情绪"] = "Joyful emotion",
    ["喜报！\n\n本季度已成功为廷根清除<Highlight>23,480</>只啮齿类公民！\n\n凡引荐五位邻居签约者，\n可额外获赠<Mark id=\"#159_R\">镀银捕鼠夹</>与《家庭防疫指南》烫金手册一册。\n\n切勿让这些长胡须的夜行盗贼继续玷污鲁恩王国的卫生荣光！"] = "Good News! \n\n This quarter, we have successfully cleared <Highlight>23,480</> rodent citizens for Tingen! \n\n Anyone who refers five neighbors to sign up \n can receive an extra <Mark id=\"#159_R\"> silver-plated mousetrap </> and a gold-stamped copy of the \"Family Epidemic Prevention Guide\". \n\n Do not let these whiskered nocturnal thieves continue to tarnish the sanitary glory of the Loen Kingdom!",
