    ["喜欢女生啊，我这儿好的小姑娘可不少！喜欢多大年纪的啊？"] = "You like women? I have plenty of fine young ladies here! What age range do you prefer?",
    ["喜欢玩点\r\n不一样的吗？"] = "Do you like to play something different?",
    ["喜欢男生啊，我这儿好的小伙子可不少！喜欢多大年纪的啊？"] = "You like men? I have plenty of fine young men here! What age range do you prefer?",
    ["喜欢的话，就让我这个魔法师为你再吹奏一曲吧。"] = "If you like it, let me, this magician, play another song for you.",
    ["喜欢，谁不会对过往发生的一切感兴趣呢。"] = "I do. Who wouldn't be interested in everything that has happened in the past?",
