    ["喽啰e"] = "Thug E",
    ["喽啰e占位"] = "Minion E Placeholder",
    ["喽啰f"] = "Minion f",
    ["喽啰f占位"] = "Minion F Placeholder",
    ["喽啰g"] = "Thug G",
    ["喽啰g占位"] = "Minion g placeholder",
    ["嗅"] = "Sniff",
    ["嗅花路人"] = "Passerby Smelling Flowers",
    ["嗅闻"] = "Sniff",
    ["嗜血之枪"] = "Bloodthirsty Spear",
    ["嗜血之牙"] = "Bloodthirsty Fang",
    ["嗜血之牙·神话"] = "Bloodthirsty Fang - Mythical",
    ["嗜血犀牛的心脏"] = "Heart of a Bloodthirsty Rhinoceros",
    ["嗜血犀牛的角"] = "Horn of a Bloodthirsty Rhinoceros",
    ["嗜龙君王"] = "Dragon-Addicted Monarch",
    ["嗝……<P_Heart>（喝得醉醺醺的。）</>"] = "Hic... <P_Heart> (Drunk) </>",
    ["嗝……嗯？什……嗝……么？……<P_Heart>（头都没抬。）</>"] = "Hic... Hm? Wha... hic... what? ... <P_Heart> (Didn't even lift his head.) </>",
    ["嗝……外乡人也知道维斯塔蜡烛工坊？老头要是知道自己的蜡烛这么出名，也不会那么着急去见死神了。"] = "Hic... Do outsiders also know about Vesta's candle workshop? If the old man knew his candles were so famous, he wouldn't have been in such a rush to meet the God of Death.",
    ["嗝……我才不……嗝……不那么怕呢！"] = "Hic... I'm not... hic... not that scared!",
    ["嗝……我，我还能吃！"] = "*Hic*... I, I can still eat!",
    ["嗝……鸽子小姐，你说我是不是连卷毛狒狒都不如？"] = "Hic... Miss Pigeon, do you think I'm not even as good as a Curly-Haired Baboon?",
    ["嗝，\r\n肚子饱了，赶紧逃命！"] = "Burp, my stomach is full, time to run for my life!",
    ["嗝，吃饱了，准备下一次狩猎。月城……他们还在等我。"] = "Burp, I'm full. Preparing for the next hunt. Moon City... they are still waiting for me.",
    ["嗝，这里怎么有个马桶，正好水喝多了要解决一下。"] = "Hiccup, why is there a toilet here? Just in time, I drank too much water and need to relieve myself.",
    ["嗡嗡嗡……"] = "Buzz buzz buzz...",
    ["嗡鸣和齿轮转动的声音……仔细听听，好像是从这里传出来的……"] = "The sound of humming and gears turning... Listen closely, it seems to be coming from here...",
    ["嗨呀，都怪我这手艺太好！ 前两天研究了一种鱼干的新做法，本想自己下酒，结果这香味可捅了马蜂窝了！ "] = "Sigh, it's all because my skills are too good! I researched a new way to make dried fish a few days ago, intending to drink with it myself, but the aroma poked a hornet's nest!",
    ["嗨氏"] = "Haisi",
    ["嗨！"] = "Hi!",
    ["嗨！名字都在酒里泡化了！反正是那种、能解决麻烦的地方，你懂吧！"] = "Hey! The names are all soaked in alcohol! Anyway, it's that kind of place where you can solve problems, you know!",
    ["嗨，卡罗拉。请原谅我最近一直在为慈善募捐的事情奔波，没有来得及登门拜访。"] = "Hi, Carola. Please forgive me for being busy with charity fundraising lately and not having time to visit.",
    ["嗨，小猫。\n　　一月不见，我猜你是陷入了那不知要花多久的“沉睡”。\n　　我马上会毕业离开霍伊大学，但作为一个信守诺言的男人，我亲手为你的苏醒准备了盛大的晚宴！我的父亲终于默许了我做饭的爱好，不管他认为这有多不体面。\n　　而这都要归功于你，我亲爱的朋友，在你挑剔舌头的点评后，我才终于敢把食物端给其他人。和你在一起的时光是那么纯粹，即使是纯粹的难吃，也让我无比想念。我父亲给我准备了精美厨具，但我还是更喜欢咱们破烂的简易灶台。\n　　等你苏醒！就直接来我家吧！\n　　我刚学会做新的因蒂斯酱烤小牛扒！迫不及待想让你尝尝味道了！\n　　期待你赶快醒来，我信赖的美食品鉴官。"] = "Hi, Kitten. \n A month has passed, I guess you've fallen into that 'slumber' that I don't know how long will take. \n I'll be graduating and leaving Hoy University soon, but as a man who keeps his promises, I've personally prepared a grand banquet for your awakening! My father finally tacitly approved of my hobby of cooking, regardless of how unseemly he thinks it is. \n And this is all thanks to you, my dear friend. It was only after your critical palate's comments that I finally dared to serve food to others. The time spent with you was so pure; even the pure terribleness of it makes me miss it immensely. My father prepared exquisite kitchenware for me, but I still prefer our shabby, simple stove. \n When you wake up! Just come straight to my place! \n I just learned how to make a new Intis-style grilled veal steak! I can't wait for you to taste it! \n Looking forward to you waking up soon, my trusted food critic.",
    ["嗨，看点什么？报纸？杂志？"] = "Hi, looking for something? A newspaper? A magazine?",
    ["嗨，要来点神秘配方吗？从实验器具到药方，应有尽有。"] = "Hey, want some mysterious formulas? From experimental equipment to prescriptions, we have everything.",
    ["嗨，这里是亨利侦探事务所。\n我们对工作业务进行了数字分类："] = "Hi, this is the Henry Detective Agency. \n We have categorized our services numerically:",
    ["嗯"] = "Hmm",
    ["嗯 我回来了"] = "Yeah, I'm back.",
    ["嗯……"] = "Hmm...",
    ["嗯……{{PlayerName}}你什么时候来的？喝酒吗，我请你。"] = "Hm... {{PlayerName}}, when did you come? Drinking? My treat.",
    ["嗯……不就是些小虫子吗？"] = "Hmm... aren't they just some little bugs?",
    ["嗯……不错的主意。"] = "Hmm... not a bad idea.",
    ["嗯……也许我等错了地方？对吗？"] = "Hmm... maybe I'm waiting in the wrong place? Right?",
    ["嗯……也许，也许是我听错了……不对！这正说明它不是一般的幽灵！"] = "Hmm... maybe, maybe I heard wrong... No! This just goes to show that it's not an ordinary ghost!",
    ["嗯……他也有一些迟钝，但这点只困扰着戴莉女士。"] = "Hmm... he was also a bit slow-witted, but that only bothered Ms. Daly.",
    ["嗯……你再转一圈，让我看看。"] = "Hmm... spin around again, let me see.",
    ["嗯……你有些越界，但摸摸头……也不赖。"] = "Hmm... you're overstepping a bit, but a head pat... isn't bad either.",
    ["嗯……你说得对，但是南威尔啤酒做梦以后会在豪尔斯街<P_Yellow>流通</>\n，伴随黑色的月亮一起度过春夏<P_Yellow>秋冬</>。"] = "Hmm... you're right, but after Southwell beer dreams, it will circulate in Howls Street <P_Yellow> </> \n, spending the spring, summer <P_Yellow>, and autumn </> with the black moon.",
    ["嗯……你说得没错。谢谢你的建议，希望我的小昂格能跟新朋友和平相处。"] = "Hmm... you're right. Thank you for your suggestion, I hope my little Ang can get along peacefully with his new friend.",
    ["嗯……克莱恩，其实你不用有太大压力，你肯定能通过大学讲师的面试的。"] = "Hmm... Klein, actually you don't have to be under too much pressure. You will definitely pass the university lecturer interview.",
    ["嗯……前往古堡可能会带来一定的危险。"] = "Hmm... going to the ancient castle might bring some danger.",
    ["嗯……前往金秋湖获得的不像是好结果。"] = "Hmm... going to Golden Autumn Lake doesn't seem to have a good result.",
    ["嗯……呃……"] = "Um... uh...",
    ["嗯……啊……诶？"] = "Um... ah... eh?",
    ["嗯……嗯。"] = "Mm... mm.",
    ["嗯……嗯，谢谢。"] = "Hmm... um, thank you.",
    ["嗯……埃姆林先生，我还有点担心，你说召唤这么强大的灵界生物时……会出问题吗？"] = "Hmm... Mr. Emlyn, I'm still a bit worried. You said that when summoning such a powerful Spirit World creature... will there be problems?",
    ["嗯……好香！今天的汤很成功！"] = "Hmm... smells so good! Today's soup is a success!",
    ["嗯……如果你实在慌张，就把所有人想象成卷毛狒狒。当然，其实很多人的智商还不如卷毛狒狒。"] = "Hmm... if you're really nervous, just imagine everyone as curly-haired baboons. Of course, in reality, many people's IQs aren't even as high as a curly-haired baboon's.",
    ["嗯……完美！就是这个香味！……嘿，朋友，你来得正好！"] = "Hmm... perfect! That's the aroma! ...Hey, friend, you've come at just the right time!",
    ["嗯……就叫<P_Yellow>《魔女与野兽》</>吧！"] = "Hmm... let's call it <P_Yellow>《The Witch and the Beast》</>!",
    ["嗯……就火腿吧！我正好知道一家火腿很好吃，小孩子也一定会喜欢的。"] = "Hmm... how about ham! I happen to know a place that sells delicious ham, and children are sure to love it.",
    ["嗯……平平无奇的搭配，还有些奇怪。"] = "Hmm... a mediocre combination, and a bit strange.",
    ["嗯……应该就快到了。"] = "Hmm... it should be just ahead.",
    ["嗯……廷根？"] = "Hmm... Tingen?",
    ["嗯……开得真不错……"] = "Hmm... it's blooming quite nicely...",
    ["嗯……很难形容。我第一次见到他，是在我最绝望的时候。"] = "Hmm... it's hard to describe. I first met him when I was at my most desperate.",
    ["嗯……您看起来终于找到状态了。"] = "Hmm... you look like you've finally found your state of mind.",
    ["嗯……我仔细观察了一下，您的这只宠物，毛发乌黑浓密有光泽，品质万里挑一，是完美的植发原料。"] = "Hmm... I've observed carefully. This pet of yours has thick, glossy, jet-black fur. Its quality is one in a million—the perfect material for hair transplants.",
    ["嗯……我们似乎总在不断道别，不论舍得，不论舍不得。"] = "Hmm... we seem to be constantly saying goodbye, whether we are willing or not.",
    ["嗯……我们听起来像是一群不讲理的流氓。"] = "Hmm... we sound like a bunch of unreasonable thugs.",
    ["嗯……我们有一个充满故事的八音盒。"] = "Hmm... we have a music box full of stories.",
    ["嗯……我们还有些事要聊，顺便叙叙旧。"] = "Hmm... We still have some things to talk about, and catch up on old times while we're at it.",
    ["嗯……我保证绝不会放它们逃出<P_Yellow>文献室</>，如果一楼已经找不到了，或许可以考虑到<P_Yellow>二楼</>看看？当然，千万别忘了“<P_Yellow>灵视</>”，这些小东西很会藏。"] = "Hmm... I promise I will never let them escape from the <P_Yellow> Archives </>. If you can't find them on the first floor, perhaps you can consider looking at the <P_Yellow> second floor </>? Of course, don't forget '<P_Yellow> spirit vision </>', these little things are very good at hiding.",
    ["嗯……我只是他的妻子，只要支持他就好。"] = "Um... I am just his wife, I just need to support him.",
    ["嗯……我推荐紫丁香和向日葵，它们都是在郊外新鲜采摘的，还有秋海棠，牵牛花……"] = "Hmm... I recommend the lilacs and sunflowers; they are all freshly picked from the suburbs. There are also begonias, morning glories...",
    ["嗯……我明白了，谢谢你，丽贝卡。"] = "Hmm... I understand, thank you, Rebecca.",
    ["嗯……我看你的衣服品味不是一般人，有兴趣参加我们时尚协会的交流么？\n当然，你得先完成我的考验。"] = "Hmm... I can see your taste in clothes is not that of an ordinary person. Are you interested in joining our Fashion Association exchange? \nOf course, you have to complete my test first.",
    ["嗯……我还是等会儿再来吧。"] = "Hmm... I'd better come back later.",
    ["嗯……或许你是对的，我去厨房找些剩面包拿给她。"] = "Hmm... perhaps you're right, I'll go to the kitchen and find some leftover bread for her.",
    ["嗯……把打探矿石消息的活分派给街头的混混好了。"] = "Mm... I'll just assign the job of scouting for ore news to the street thugs.",
    ["嗯……日记里有用鲁恩语和其他文字来记录，好在现在我都能流畅理解，不愧是历史系大学生……"] = "Hmm... the diary is recorded in Loenese and other languages. Fortunately, I can understand them fluently now; as expected of a history major...",
    ["嗯……日记里有用鲁恩语和其他文字来记录，好在现在的我都能流畅理解，不愧是历史系大学生……"] = "Hmm... the diary is recorded in Loenese and other languages. Fortunately, I can understand them fluently now. As expected of a history major...",
    ["嗯……是在某个地方学习。"] = "Mm... I am studying somewhere.",
    ["嗯……是我打扰到你了吗？"] = "Um... did I disturb you?",
    ["嗯……有意思。旧日文明一度覆灭，但人类存续后又重建繁荣的社会。秩序是文明稳定之兆？感谢你的回答。"] = "Hmm... interesting. The Great Old One civilization once perished, but after humanity survived, they rebuilt a prosperous society. Is order a sign of civilization's stability? Thank you for your answer.",
    ["嗯……有趣。凭借自认为的“正确性”构建秩序，也是一种失序？感谢你的回答。"] = "Hmm... interesting. Constructing order based on what one considers \"correctness\"—is that also a form of disorder? Thank you for your answer.",
    ["嗯……朋友！答应他吧！"] = "Mm... friend! Say yes to him!",
    ["嗯……格尔曼应该从这里出现，但是……<P_Heart>（小声呢喃着）</>"] = "Hmm... Gehrman should appear from here, but... <P_Heart>(whispering softly)</>",
    ["嗯……比如先从这些笔记本开始？"] = "Hmm... for example, start with these notebooks?",
    ["嗯……汤底清新，罗勒馥郁的香气和牛肉的味道融为一体了，像是春天推开窗子看到草地上的牛羊。"] = "Hmm... the broth is refreshing, and the rich aroma of basil blends perfectly with the flavor of the beef, like opening a window in spring and seeing cattle and sheep on the meadow.",
    ["嗯……热牛奶，就要一杯热牛奶吧。"] = "Hmm... hot milk, just a cup of hot milk.",
    ["嗯……现在很需要排查一下近期在这边活动的人，我们目前已经掌握了旁边区域活动的人的行踪，但这边还没来得及调查。"] = "Hmm... we really need to check on the people who have been active around here recently. We have already tracked the movements of those in the adjacent area, but we haven't had time to investigate this side yet.",
    ["嗯……目前在湖畔活动的人都排查好了，没有问题。但不能保证是否还有潜在的危险。"] = "Hmm... the people currently active at the lake have all been checked, there are no problems. But I can't guarantee if there are still potential dangers.",
    ["嗯……笔记的主人来自“<P_Yellow>安提哥努斯</>”家族，这个家族在第四纪有着显赫的地位，还有一些相关的历史……"] = "Hmm... the owner of the notebook comes from the '<P_Yellow>Antigonus</>' family. This family held a prominent status in the Fourth Epoch, and there is some related history...",
    ["嗯……等你恢复力气，可以去外面花圃里散散心，雏菊都开了。"] = "Hmm... when you regain your strength, you can go to the garden outside to relax; the daisies have all bloomed.",
    ["嗯……至少……没有人会再死在这里了……"] = "Yeah... at least... no one else will die here...",
    ["嗯……虽然银冠餐厅也值得一去，但葡萄酒并不是招牌。"] = "Hmm... although the Silver Crown Restaurant is worth a visit, wine isn't their specialty.",
    ["嗯……诡异事件很可能会再次发生，我需要有抗衡危险的能力……"] = "Hmm... bizarre events are likely to happen again. I need the ability to resist danger...",
    ["嗯……谢谢。"] = "Um... thanks.",
    ["嗯……还是去<P_Yellow>休息室</>细说吧——我们也占用这里够久了。"] = "Hmm... let's go to the <P_Yellow> lounge </> to discuss it in detail—we've occupied this place for long enough.",
    ["嗯……这个有点像她梳妆台上快用完的那瓶！"] = "Hmm... This one is a bit like the bottle on her vanity that is almost empty!",
    ["嗯……这也是个不错的寄托。"] = "Hmm... that's also a nice emotional anchor.",
    ["嗯……这几个卖相不错，明天带着几个去中央广场卖吧。"] = "Hmm... these look quite good. I'll take a few to the Central Plaza to sell tomorrow.",
    ["嗯……这样……"] = "Hmm... like this...",
    ["嗯……这样……酒保，结账！"] = "Hmm... in that case... Bartender, check please!",
    ["嗯……这身还是很适合我的……"] = "Hmm... this outfit still suits me quite well...",
    ["嗯……送的这一束，我想要这个捧花棒。"] = "Hmm... for the free bouquet, I would like this flower holder.",
    ["嗯……那个拳手确实有问题，他身上有非凡物品的痕迹。"] = "Hmm... that boxer does have a problem. There are traces of Beyonder items on him.",
    ["嗯……那我提醒你下次注意点？或者买个质量再好些的钓竿？"] = "Hmm... then should I remind you to be more careful next time? Or buy a better quality fishing rod?",
    ["嗯……那样另类的幽默，也能算是一种说话的艺术吧。"] = "Hmm... that kind of alternative humor could also be considered a form of conversational art.",
    ["嗯……酥软可口，甜味十足，不过分量有点少……"] = "Hmm... crispy and delicious, full of sweetness, but the portion is a bit small...",
    ["嗯……里面有些法术可以学习下，说不定对我有帮助。"] = "Hmm... there are some spells inside that I can learn; they might be helpful to me.",
    ["嗯……银是女神领域的金属，陶艺也不错，我该选哪个呢？"] = "Hmm... silver is a metal in the Goddess's domain, and pottery is not bad either. Which one should I choose?",
    ["嗯……非要说的话，我感觉老师的癔症发作是有规律的。"] = "Hmm... if I had to say, I feel that the teacher's hysterical episodes have a pattern.",
    ["嗯……预订要交订金的规矩。"] = "Um... the rule that you have to pay a deposit for reservations.",
    ["嗯……饿了。"] = "Hmm... I'm hungry.",
    ["嗯…谢谢你…小妹妹。但我的妈妈去了很远的地方，不会回来了……"] = "Hmm... thank you... little sister. But my mom went to a very far place and won't come back...",
    ["嗯。"] = "Mm.",
    ["嗯。但他从来不抱怨。所以我们也努力不让他费心，让他多一点时间休息。"] = "Yes. But he never complained. So we also tried not to let him worry and gave him more time to rest.",
    ["嗯。吃什么？这里还有什么好吃的吗？"] = "Hmm. What to eat? Is there anything good to eat around here?",
    ["嗯。如果是我，也会这么做。"] = "Hmm. If it were me, I would do the same.",
    ["嗯。就像你能认出今天和昨天见到的同一个人，虽然光线、表情可能不同。我只不过……认的是鸡蛋。"] = "Yes. Just like how you can recognize the same person you saw today and yesterday, even though the light and expressions might be different. I just... recognize eggs.",
    ["嗯。找到他的住处后，我会远程引导他入梦，梦境会呈现出更多相关的线索。"] = "Hmm. After finding his residence, I will remotely guide him to enter a dream. The dream will present more relevant clues.",
    ["嗯。每周都来，每周都醉。上周他差点把酒杯砸钢琴上。"] = "Yeah. Comes every week, gets drunk every week. Last week he almost smashed his glass on the piano.",
    ["嗯哼。传闻，罗塞尔是个不折不扣的……收藏家。他曾说过，“我能抗拒一切，除了美女的诱惑。 ”"] = "Uh-huh. Rumor has it that Roselle was an out-and-out... collector. He once said, 'I can resist everything except temptation from beautiful women.'",
    ["嗯哼，不可否认，贝克兰德是大都市，繁华、案件多样、教会资源也充足。但我不需要那些。廷根有河，有雾，有安静的街道。还有……"] = "Mmhmm, there's no denying that Backlund is a metropolis—bustling, full of diverse cases, and with plenty of Church resources. But I don't need those. Tingen has the river, the fog, and quiet streets. And also...",
    ["嗯嗯……当然了，亲爱的！"] = "Mm-hmm... of course, dear!",
    ["嗯嗯。"] = "Mm-hmm.",
    ["嗯嗯嗯，吃的很满足"] = "Mmm, ate very satisfactorily.",
    ["嗯嗯快去吧。"] = "Mm-hmm, go ahead.",
    ["嗯嗯，之前运送那个木偶，在瑞尔……"] = "Yeah, yeah, when we were transporting that puppet, in Riel...",
    ["嗯嗯，剪刀……然后呢？"] = "Mm-hmm, scissors... and then?",
    ["嗯！{{PlayerName}}，帕里克，恭喜你们完成“破晓之时”第一轮挑战。"] = "Yes! {{PlayerName}}, Parick, congratulations on completing the first round of the 'Dawn's Hour' challenge.",
    ["嗯！一言为定！"] = "Hmm! It's a deal!",
    ["嗯！不愧是{{PlayerName}}{{先生|姐姐}}，睡了这么久，脑袋还这么清楚。"] = "Hmm! As expected of {{PlayerName}} {{Sir|Sister}}, your mind is still so clear after sleeping for so long.",
    ["嗯！今天好开心，好久没出来玩了！"] = "Yes! I'm so happy today, it's been so long since I've been out to play!",
    ["嗯！我相信你们！"] = "Mm! I believe in you!",
    ["嗯！我自己攒钱，给哥哥一个惊喜。"] = "Yeah! I'm saving up money myself to give my brother a surprise.",
    ["嗯！我见过一次，而且月光也特别美丽。"] = "Hmm! I've seen it once, and the moonlight was especially beautiful.",
    ["嗯！是妈妈！"] = "Yes! It's Mom!",
    ["嗯！是时候对自己的胃好一点了！"] = "Yeah! It's time to treat my stomach better!",
    ["嗯！莉莉守护市民，我们来守护“闪电莉莉”！"] = "Hmm! Lily guards the citizens, and we will guard \"Lightning Lily\"!",
    ["嗯，一定会有那样一天的。"] = "Yes, there will definitely be such a day.",
    ["嗯，一杯甜冰茶，当然是甜冰茶。"] = "Hmm, a glass of sweet iced tea, of course it's sweet iced tea.",
    ["嗯，一路顺风顺水，值得来一杯苏尼亚血酒，干杯！"] = "Hmm, smooth sailing all the way, worth a glass of Sonia blood wine, cheers!",
    ["嗯，什么活动这么热闹？"] = "Hmm, what event is so lively?",
    ["嗯，今天就来上班吧。"] = "All right. Start work today.",
    ["嗯，他们也有非常易于辨认的口头禅，称赞彼此<P_Yellow> 幽默，风趣，会说笑</> 。"] = "Yes, they also have very recognizable catchphrases, praising each other as <P_Yellow> humorous, witty, and funny </>.",
    ["嗯，他来了吗？"] = "Yeah, is he here?",
    ["嗯，他的新工作就在码头附近，每天都能看到去贝克兰德的船。"] = "Well, his new job is near the docks, so he can see the ships heading to Backlund every day.",
    ["嗯，会一些，日常记录或者工作都会用到。"] = "Well, I know a little; I use it for daily records or work.",
    ["嗯，会员可以免费使用占卜房、占卜工具，免费享用我们的咖啡和茶水。"] = "Well, members can use the divination rooms and tools for free, and enjoy our coffee and tea for free.",
    ["嗯，作为值夜者，我们永远相信队友，黑荆棘的同伴永远是最好的。"] = "Well, as Nighthawks, we always trust our teammates. The companions of Blackthorn are always the best.",
    ["嗯，你们一定能行！"] = "Yes, you guys will definitely make it!",
    ["嗯，你对摄影艺术感兴趣吗？"] = "Hmm, are you interested in the art of photography?",
    ["嗯，你闯入了一场向邪神献祭和祈祷的邪恶仪式。"] = "Hmm, you broke into an evil ritual involving sacrifice and prayer to an evil god.",
    ["嗯，保守估计，一个月吧？"] = "Hmm, conservatively speaking, a month?",
    ["嗯，先找弗莱队长聊聊。"] = "Yeah, let's talk to Captain Frye first.",
    ["嗯，其实你自己知道就行了。"] = "Well, actually, you just need to know it yourself.",
    ["嗯，可以了。"] = "Hmm, that will do.",
    ["嗯，可是……外面这层红色是什么？好像很危险……"] = "Yeah, but... what is this red layer on the outside? It seems very dangerous...",
    ["嗯，后天我家所有人都过生日，一双新手套给老爸，一把新菜刀给老妈，还有一支新笔给老妹。"] = "Yeah, my whole family has their birthdays the day after tomorrow. A pair of new gloves for Dad, a new kitchen knife for Mom, and a new pen for my little sister.",
    ["嗯，后天我老婆孩子都过生日，我要给他们每人都扎一个玩偶。"] = "Yeah, my wife and kids have their birthdays the day after tomorrow. I'm going to make a doll for each of them.",
    ["嗯，回去休息吧，这里交给我们。"] = "Mm, go back and rest. Leave this to us.",
    ["嗯，回去好好享用晚餐。刚才消耗的沉眠符咒，我会找斯维因赔偿的，他可是个有钱人。当然，不是今天，我得考虑他的心情。"] = "Well, go back and enjoy your dinner. I will ask Swain to compensate for the Sleep Charm that was consumed just now; he is a rich man. Of course, not today; I have to consider his mood.",
    ["嗯，大家帮了我很多，我也要尽力承担自己的责任。"] = "Yes, everyone has helped me a lot, and I must do my best to fulfill my responsibilities.",
    ["嗯，她和伊丽莎白都是神秘学爱好者。对了，明天晚上你们有空吗？"] = "Yes, she and Elizabeth are both occult enthusiasts. By the way, are you free tomorrow night?",
    ["嗯，如果有家庭事务相关的咨询可以来找我。"] = "Well, if you have any consultations regarding family matters, you can come to me.",
    ["嗯，它叫做“知识皇冠”，外形就是个皇冠，能力和窥秘人途径有关。"] = "Yes, it is called the \"Crown of Knowledge.\" Its appearance is that of a crown, and its abilities are related to the Mystery Pryer pathway.",
    ["嗯，就这么写评价！"] = "Hmm, I'll write the review like that!",
    ["嗯，就这么办。但愿在真正的危机降临之前，完成晋升。先回去吧。"] = "Well, that's what I'll do. I hope to complete the advancement before the real crisis arrives. Let's go back first.",
    ["嗯，希望有一天你们能找到摆脱诅咒的办法。"] = "Well, I hope one day you can find a way to get rid of the curse.",
    ["嗯，希望能从劳维斯太太残留的灵性里获得点什么。"] = "Yes, I hope to gain something from the residual spirituality of Mrs. Lowis.",
    ["嗯，当时有无数塔罗牌摆在眼前，冒冒之中我选中的是“星星”。现在看来，命运的安排还真是奇妙啊。"] = "Hmm, at the time, there were countless Tarot cards laid out before me, and in a daze, I chose 'The Star'. Looking back now, fate's arrangements are truly wondrous.",
    ["嗯，当时有无数塔罗牌摆在眼前，冥冥之中我选中的是“星星”。现在看来，命运的安排还真是奇妙啊。"] = "Yeah, there were countless Tarot cards in front of me at the time, and in the dark, I chose 'The Star'. Now it seems, the arrangement of fate is truly wonderful.",
    ["嗯，很快就能好。"] = "Yes, it won't take long.",
    ["嗯，怎样才能找到其它的隐藏空间？"] = "Hmm, how can we find the other hidden spaces?",
    ["嗯，总之欢迎你来了解！"] = "Hmm, anyway, you're welcome to come and learn more!",
    ["嗯，恰好。"] = "Hmm, happened.",
    ["嗯，想起来就找找，结果捡了一堆别人的戒指。"] = "Hmm, I look for it when I think of it, but I ended up picking up a bunch of other people's rings.",
    ["嗯，感谢您的告诫，平常练习我会栓一根绳子在身上。"] = "Mm, thank you for your advice. I usually tie a rope to myself when I practice.",
    ["嗯，我也从塔罗牌里挑吧。"] = "Hmm, I'll pick from the Tarot cards too.",
    ["嗯，我会好好想想的。"] = "Hmm, I will think about it carefully.",
    ["嗯，我会尽快了解和适应这里，让自己帮得上忙的。"] = "Hmm, I will learn and adapt to this place as soon as possible so that I can be of help.",
    ["嗯，我会教你的，用正确的方法。"] = "Yes, I will teach you, the right way.",
    ["嗯，我去封锁中央广场，避免有人再带着铜镜靠近。"] = "Okay, I will go to blockade the Central Plaza to prevent anyone else from approaching with a copper mirror.",
    ["嗯，我听西迦说，你在黑市调查里表现得还不错。正好，又有一桩紧急案件要委托给你。"] = "Hmm, I heard from Xiga that you performed quite well in the black market investigation. As it happens, there is another urgent case I need to entrust to you.",
    ["嗯，我提前占卜到了这里有人需要帮助。"] = "Yes, I divined in advance that someone here needed help.",
    ["嗯，我明白了。"] = "Hmm, I understand.",
    ["嗯，我有一个哥哥和一个妹妹。哥哥在政府部门工作，妹妹还在上学。他们都是很好的人。"] = "Yes, I have an older brother and a younger sister. My brother works in a government department, and my sister is still in school. They are both very good people.",
    ["嗯，我正在排查廷根最近发生的案件。"] = "Yeah, I'm investigating the recent cases in Tingen.",
    ["嗯，我等着。"] = "Mm, I'll be waiting.",
    ["嗯，我试试。"] = "Hmm, I'll give it a try.",
    ["嗯，所以我们要好好待在这里，不要让妈妈担心。"] = "Mm, so we should stay here properly and not let Mother worry.",
    ["嗯，明天再一起试试看。"] = "Mmm, let's try it together again tomorrow.",
    ["嗯，是啊，可怜了那姑娘。里奇这家伙，再也不会四处借东西了。"] = "Yeah, you're right, I feel sorry for her. Rich, that guy, will never borrow things from people again.",
    ["嗯，是的。"] = "Um, yes.",
    ["嗯，晋升仪式失败了。但那个“主人”似乎另有其人……"] = "Hmm, the advancement ritual failed. But that \"master\" seems to be someone else...",
    ["嗯，最近我都会在。这次灾难的危机波及范围很大，也有不少伤亡情况，我会留下来处理相关善后工作。"] = "Yes, I'll be around lately. The scope of this disaster is quite large, and there are many casualties. I will stay behind to handle the aftermath.",
    ["嗯，有一些了解。吉瑞尔，你在海上接触到了非凡力量？"] = "Yes, I have some understanding. Jirel, did you encounter Beyonder powers at sea?",
    ["嗯，有桩紧急案件要委托给你。"] = "Hmm, there is an urgent case I need to entrust to you.",
    ["嗯，有线索可以随时来找我。"] = "Well, you can come to me anytime if you have clues.",
    ["嗯，欢迎。"] = "Yes, welcome.",
    ["嗯，死于那场大雾霾中，永远不回来了，但你看到了，他或许也从未离开。"] = "Mmm, he died in that Great Smog and will never return, but as you saw, perhaps he never left either.",
    ["嗯，没事。您再一次保护了我。"] = "Yes, I'm fine. You protected me once again.",
    ["嗯，没问题，但最大的危险来源于那7个未知的谜题……"] = "Hmm, no problem, but the greatest danger comes from those 7 unknown puzzles...",
    ["嗯，牛尾炖得也很嫩。"] = "Mhm, the oxtail is stewed very tenderly too.",
    ["嗯，班森在外上班，我和克莱恩就专心投入学业。不过他那段时间……有点奇怪。"] = "Yes, Benson worked outside, and Klein and I focused on our studies. But he was... a bit strange during that time.",
    ["嗯，百货商店出售的服饰虽然多，但缺乏量体裁衣的美感，高级定制的服饰必须要带有本人的特色……"] = "Hmm, although department stores sell many clothes, they lack the aesthetic of tailoring. High-end custom clothing must carry the wearer's own unique characteristics...",
    ["嗯，看来“戏法大师”的配方短时间也用不上了，我们一起看看吧。"] = "Hmm, it seems the 'Trickmaster' formula won't be of use for a while, let's take a look at it together.",
    ["嗯，看来你的灵性直觉给出了相当不错的引导，今天是个适合休息的日子！"] = "Hmm, it seems your spiritual intuition has provided quite good guidance. Today is a day suitable for rest!",
    ["嗯，真香……今晚应该能睡踏实了。"] = "Mmm, smells so good... should be able to sleep soundly tonight.",
    ["嗯，确实是魔女才有的能力。我需要仔细调查这幅画。"] = "Hmm, it is indeed an ability only a Witch would have. I need to investigate this painting carefully.",
    ["嗯，线索梳理得差不多了。"] = "Hmm, the clues are mostly sorted out.",
    ["嗯，老尼尔……你身体还好吗？有什么困扰都可以跟我商量。"] = "Hmm, Old Neil... how is your health? You can discuss any troubles with me.",
    ["嗯，背后就放心交给我吧。"] = "Yeah, you can leave your back to me.",
    ["嗯，艾丝黛拉女士的说法，似乎更值得探讨……"] = "Hmm, Miss Estella's perspective seems more worth exploring...",
    ["嗯，虽然危险程度不高，但是在特殊情况下仍有一定危险。不能把它留给伊琳……"] = "Hmm, although the danger level isn't high, it still poses a certain risk under special circumstances. I can't leave it for Irene...",
    ["嗯，谢谢提醒，我会多加注意的！"] = "Hmm, thanks for the reminder, I'll be more careful!",
    ["嗯，过去看看。"] = "Hmm, go over and take a look.",
    ["嗯，这也是她给我喝下魔药的原因。"] = "Yeah, that's also the reason she made me drink the potion.",
    ["嗯，这些信息在档案里有记录，但我们手上的线索并不多。"] = "Hmm, this information is recorded in the files, but we don't have many clues on hand.",
    ["嗯，这些是从警察厅移交过来的失踪案，有些信息需要核实。"] = "Hmm, these are the missing persons cases transferred from the police department; some information needs to be verified.",
    ["嗯，这就是最后一句了……"] = "Hmm, this is the last line...",
    ["嗯，这批失踪案有很多共性，所有献祭仪式都指向堕落母神。"] = "Yes, this batch of disappearance cases has many commonalities. All the sacrifice rituals point to the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
    ["嗯，这是它的名字。很久很久以前，美丽的村落被恶龙袭击，木马骑士在那场灾难里失去了他最爱的姐姐，于是他决定成为一名骑士，向恶龙复仇。"] = "Hmm, that is its name. A long, long time ago, a beautiful village was assaulted by a dragon. The Wooden Horse Knight lost his beloved sister in that disaster, so he decided to become a knight and take revenge on the dragon.",
    ["嗯，这里平和得很，倒是没什么特别的……"] = "Hmm, it's very peaceful here, there's nothing particularly special...",
    ["嗯，里埃尔还在等，对吗？那个笨蛋。"] = "Hmm, Riel is still waiting, right? That fool.",
    ["嗯，锁着。但我有一些……还在学习中的技巧。"] = "Yes, it was locked. But I have some... techniques I'm still learning.",
    ["嗯，非凡世界很残酷，我也处理过几件难以释怀的案件……"] = "Hmm, the Extraordinary World is very cruel. I have also handled a few cases that I couldn't let go of...",
    ["嗯，魔药配方和材料都准备好了？"] = "Hmm, are the potion formula and materials ready?",
    ["嗯？"] = "Hmm?",
    ["嗯？{{先生|姐姐}}你刚刚说头疼要休息，让我先过来的呀。"] = "Hmm? {{Sir|Sister}}, you were the one who said you had a headache and needed to rest, and asked me to come over first.",
    ["嗯？……但是话又说回来，年轻人，你对当<P_Yellow>主演</>有兴趣吗？"] = "Hmm? ...But then again, young man, are you interested in being the <P_Yellow> lead actor </>?",
    ["嗯？一张书签，看起来保存的很完好。"] = "Hmm? A bookmark, it looks very well preserved.",
    ["嗯？不见了……再开启灵视试试。"] = "Hmm? It's gone... Let me try activating spirit vision again.",
    ["嗯？什么掉出来了？"] = "Hmm? What fell out?",
    ["嗯？什么都没有。不对劲，开启灵视试试。"] = "Hmm? Nothing. Something's not right, let's try spirit vision.",
    ["嗯？你也跟过来了？不得不说，这个提议真不错。"] = "Hmm? You followed too? I have to say, this suggestion is really good.",
    ["嗯？你哪来的？走走走！"] = "Hmm? Where did you come from? Go away, go away!",
    ["嗯？你怎么还不走？"] = "Hm? Why haven't you left yet?",
    ["嗯？你是谁，你想干什么？如果你也要从这里跳下去，请给我几分钟时间。"] = "Hmm? Who are you, and what do you want? If you are also planning to jump off here, please give me a few minutes.",
    ["嗯？你要去哪？"] = "Hmm? Where are you going?",
    ["嗯？可是那是鸟巢……"] = "Hmm? But that's a bird's nest...",
    ["嗯？嗯！规定就是规定，先生，你必须要离开。"] = "Hmm? Hmm! Rules are rules, sir. You must leave.",
    ["嗯？在犹豫什么？"] = "Hmm? What are you hesitating for?",
    ["嗯？好甜，这个口感……像一群人在嘴巴里跳踢踏舞……好怪，再喝一口。"] = "Hmm? So sweet, this texture... it's like a group of people tap-dancing in my mouth... how strange, let me take another sip.",
    ["嗯？小新闻自然是上不了头版的，看看内页和末版。"] = "Hmm? Small news naturally won't make the front page; let's check the inner pages and the back page.",
    ["嗯？循环……要发生变化了吗？"] = "Hmm? The cycle... is it about to change?",
    ["嗯？怎么不接着说了？"] = "Hmm? Why did you stop?",
    ["嗯？怎么了？"] = "Hmm? What's wrong?",
    ["嗯？怎么有强大的灵界生物力量波动？你手上拿的是什么？"] = "Hmm? Why is there a powerful Spirit World creature power fluctuation? What are you holding?",
    ["嗯？我们可是非凡者！"] = "Huh? We are Beyonders!",
    ["嗯？我怎么又回到这里了？阿罗德斯？你在吗？"] = "Hmm? Why am I back here again? Arrodes? Are you there?",
    ["嗯？我怎么隐约感觉到了远超公爵级别的力量？"] = "Hmm? Why do I vaguely sense power far exceeding the Duke level?",
    ["嗯？抱歉，我将你认错成了客人。没错，需要擦鞋可以来铁十字街找我！又快又好！只要几个便士到一苏勒不等！"] = "Hm? Sorry, I mistook you for a customer. That's right, if you need a shoe shine, you can come to Iron Cross Street and find me! Fast and good! It only costs from a few pennies to a shilling!",
    ["嗯？有事找我？我在你身上感受到了某种不同寻常的伟大气息。"] = "Hmm? Need something? I sense an unusual and great aura on you.",
    ["嗯？有人在聊天……"] = "Hm? Someone is chatting...",
    ["嗯？有弗莱队长寄来的信？"] = "Hm? A letter from Captain Frye?",
    ["嗯？椅子上有张报纸，看一看有什么新闻……"] = "Hmm? There's a newspaper on the chair, let's see if there's any news...",
    ["嗯？用这种琐事去打扰主教先生吗？会不会太……"] = "Um? Should I bother the Bishop with such trivial matters? Wouldn't it be too...",
    ["嗯？看起来是……人的发丝？"] = "Hmm? It looks like... human hair?",
    ["嗯？看起来是猎犬身上一撮毛发。"] = "Hmm? It looks like a tuft of fur from a hound.",
    ["嗯？真巧，她和我名字一样。"] = "Hmm? What a coincidence, she has the same name as me.",
    ["嗯？祭坛里好像长出了什么东西……好奇怪。"] = "Huh? It looks like something has grown inside the altar... How strange.",
    ["嗯？糊弄我？走走走！"] = "Hmm? Trying to fool me? Go away, go away!",
    ["嗯？肮脏的木偶，你的表情像是嘲讽！"] = "Hmm? Dirty puppet, your expression looks like mockery!",
    ["嗯？还剩下一些柠檬汁和白醋，不能浪费，也加进去好了！"] = "Hm? There's still some lemon juice and white vinegar left, can't waste it, might as well add it in!",
    ["嗯？这个名字是……"] = "Hmm? This name is...",
    ["嗯？这么快就回来了？"] = "Hmm? Back so soon?",
    ["嗯？这只狗的脖子挂着狗牌，上面刻着……查理？"] = "Hmm? This dog has a tag hanging on its neck, engraved with... Charlie?",
    ["嗯？这是什么……"] = "Hmm? What is this...",
    ["嗯？这是？似乎能感受到一些情绪。"] = "Hmm? What is this? It seems I can feel some emotions.",
    ["嗯？那位美丽的女士呢？"] = "Hmm? Where is that beautiful lady?",
    ["嗯？那对母女呢？也许他知道。"] = "Hmm? What about that mother and daughter? Perhaps he knows.",
    ["嗯？那是……刚刚的学生？"] = "Hm? Is that... the student from just now?",
    ["嗯？那是什么？"] = "Hmm? What is that?",
    ["嗯？非凡灵性凝聚成了路标……"] = "Hm? Extraordinary spirituality has condensed into a signpost...",
    ["嗯？非凡者……有什么事？"] = "Hmm? Beyonder... is something the matter?",
    ["嗯？！"] = "Hmm?!",
    ["嗷"] = "Awoo",
    ["嘉义县"] = "Chiayi County",
    ["嘉义市"] = "Chiayi City",
    ["嘉兴"] = "Jiaxing",
    ["嘉奖令"] = "Commendation Order",
    ["嘉妮"] = "Janie",
    ["嘉宾"] = "Guest",
    ["嘉峪关"] = "Jiayuguan",
    ["嘉德丽雅"] = "Cattleya",
    ["嘉德丽雅·投影"] = "Cattleya Projection",
    ["嘎——嘎——"] = "Caw—caw—",
    ["嘎吱……先别管我。舞台上的时间是被这破剧本篡改过的……嘎吱……"] = "Creak... Never mind me. The time on the stage has been tampered with by this broken script... Creak...",
    ["嘎吱……我怀里这把枪你拿着，会用到的……"] = "Creak... take this gun in my arms, you'll need it...",
    ["嘘——不要打断诗歌的灵感。"] = "Shh—don't interrupt the inspiration for my poetry.",
    ["嘘——你们能听见指针转动的声音吗？"] = "Shh—can you hear the sound of the clock hand turning?",
    ["嘘——安静，反抗是徒劳的。"] = "Shh—quiet, resistance is futile.",
    ["嘘——小声点，低调，低调。……我是正经剧友！"] = "Shh—keep it down, be low-key, low-key. ...I'm a serious theater fan!",
    ["嘘——还是别乱说话，小心这句话传到斯维因耳朵里。"] = "Shh—better not talk nonsense, be careful that this reaches Swain's ears.",
    ["嘘……"] = "Shh...",
    ["嘘……你小点声。"] = "Shh... keep your voice down.",
    ["嘘……别影响到约翰发挥。"] = "Shh... don't distract John.",
    ["嘘……她回家了，从红色的烟囱回家了！"] = "Shh... she went home, she went home through the red chimney!",
    ["嘘……如您所见，天才中将正在休息，不要打扰她。"] = "Shh... as you can see, the Genius Admiral is resting, do not disturb her.",
    ["嘘……小声点。{{先生|女士}}，你要买画吗？那种开心的画，不贵。"] = "Shh... keep it down. {{Mr.|Ms.}}, do you want to buy a painting? That kind of happy painting, not expensive.",
    ["嘘……小声点！老大可耳朵灵着呢！据说她们教会就是喜欢文化人……"] = "Shh... keep it down! The boss has sharp ears! It's said that their church likes intellectuals...",
    ["嘘……小点声说。"] = "Shh... keep your voice down.",
    ["嘘……我正盯着呢……别吵。"] = "Shh... I'm watching... be quiet.",
    ["嘘……有人来了。"] = "Shh... Someone is coming.",
    ["嘘！"] = "Shh!",
    ["嘘！嘘……小声点，可以先还给我吗？我和佛尔思女士约定的时间马上就要到了……"] = "Shh! Shh... keep it down, can you give it back to me first? The time I agreed with Ms. Fors is almost up...",
    ["嘘！嘘……小声点，可以先还给我吗？我和佛尔思老师约定的时间马上就要到了……"] = "Shh! Shh... keep it down, can you return it to me first? The time I agreed with Teacher Fors is almost up...",
    ["嘘！嘘！不要和莉莉娅说话！"] = "Shh! Shh! Don't talk to Lilia!",
    ["嘘！嘘！嘘！别别别，我这就放回去……"] = "Shh! Shh! Shh! Don't, don't, I'll put it back right now...",
    ["嘘！嘘！我们在捉迷藏呢，你千万别把比利引来了。"] = "Shh! Shh! We're playing hide-and-seek, you must not lead Billy here.",
    ["嘘！声音小点，你还想让他听见吗？"] = "Shh! Keep your voice down, do you want him to hear you?",
    ["嘘！小声点！主人能听懂我们说话！"] = "Shh! Keep it down! The master can understand us!",
    ["嘘！小声点，这事可不能乱说。你是值夜者？我怎么不记得你，难道我的记性也变差了？"] = "Shh! Keep your voice down; you can't talk about this randomly. Are you a Nighthawk? Why don't I remember you? Has my memory gotten worse too?",
    ["嘘！爸你少说两句……好不容易有顾客！你先把药吃了！"] = "Shh! Dad, say less... It's not easy to get a customer! You take your medicine first!",
    ["嘘！请为一只每天只睡14个小时的猫猫着想一下吧。"] = "Shh! Please consider a kitten that only sleeps 14 hours a day.",
    ["嘘！这话你也敢说……"] = "Shh! You dare say that...",
    ["嘘，不要说话。"] = "Shh, don't speak.",
    ["嘘，主管都在二楼看着呢。"] = "Shh, the supervisors are all watching from the second floor.",
    ["嘘，你小点声。败坏我的名声！"] = "Shh, keep your voice down. You're ruining my reputation!",
    ["嘘，先等我们赞美完比星空更崇高，比永恒更久远的黑夜女神。"] = "Shh, wait until we finish praising the Evernight Goddess, who is more sublime than the starry sky and more eternal than eternity itself.",
    ["嘘，关于它的故事，你知道得不必太多。\n别急着摩挲它的表面，别急着说出你的愿望！\n这个故事从第一纪就已经开始。“0-05”的代号能证明它的危险，却无法将它的身份说清。\n那里封存着来自星空的低语。那是阴险狡诈的“灯神”，在等着扭曲这场交易。\n一、二……\n不要数到三。"] = "Shh, you don't need to know too much about its story. \n Don't be in a hurry to stroke its surface, don't be in a hurry to state your wish! \n This story began as early as the First Epoch. The codename \"0-05\" can prove its danger, but it cannot explain its identity. \n It seals whispers from the stars. That is the insidious and cunning \"God of Knowledge and Wisdom,\" waiting to distort this transaction. \n One, two... \n Do not count to three.",
    ["嘘，别告诉其他人，他们会吃醋的……"] = "Shh, don't tell anyone else, they'll be jealous...",
    ["嘘，嘘，怕什么。"] = "Shh, shh, what are you afraid of?",
    ["嘘，因为……那是缇苏小姐教奈拉小姐调制的第一支香。"] = "Shh, because... that was the first perfume Miss Tisu taught Miss Naila to blend.",
    ["嘘，对外称作银质子弹，新人。"] = "Shh, call them silver bullets in public, rookie.",
    ["嘘，小声些。"] = "Shh, keep your voice down.",
    ["嘘，小声点，别让街坊邻居听见了……"] = "Shh, keep it down, don't let the neighbors hear...",
    ["嘘，小点声，别被脑子有病的人听见！"] = "Shh, keep your voice down, don't let the mentally ill person hear you!",
    ["嘘，小点声，监工往这边看了。"] = "Shh, keep it down, the foreman is looking this way.",
    ["嘘，小点声，那个人看起来可不好惹，刚才被他盯着的时候，我全身的寒毛全都立起来了"] = "Shh, keep your voice down. That person doesn't look like someone to mess with. When he was staring at me just now, all the hair on my body stood up.",
    ["嘘，我只想安静地享用食物。餐厅老板哈利刚刚就在附近，我怕他认出我。"] = "Shh, I just want to enjoy the food quietly. The restaurant owner, Harry, was just nearby, I'm afraid he'll recognize me.",
    ["嘘，我就快邂逅我的爱人了！"] = "Shh, I'm about to encounter my lover!",
    ["嘘，我的面前有一名敌人。"] = "Shh, there is an enemy in front of me.",
    ["嘘，有人来了，我们小声点……"] = "Shh, someone's coming, let's be quiet...",
    ["嘘，活尸就在我们周围，小心他们靠近发动攻击。"] = "Shh, there are zombies all around us; be careful they don't get close and launch an attack.",
    ["嘤——"] = "Ehh—",
    ["嘤嘤！"] = "Whimper!",
    ["嘬鼠你！"] = "Suck you, rat!",
    ["嘲弄欢笑与哀伤，也嘲弄失败和胜利。\n它的主人已经离去，这是你荣誉的印记。"] = "Mocking laughter and sorrow, also mocking failure and victory. \n Its owner has departed; this is the mark of your honor.",
    ["嘲讽"] = "Taunt",
    ["嘲讽圣印"] = "Seal of Taunt",
    ["嘲讽圣印·神话"] = "Seal of Taunt - Mythical",
    ["嘴——火车站"] = "Mouth - Train Station",
    ["嘴角"] = "Corner of the mouth",
    ["嘴部"] = "Mouth",
    ["嘴部整体"] = "Overall mouth",
    ["嘶——咔——"] = "Hiss—click—",
    ["嘶——好痛，这也能削到手指。"] = "Hiss—that hurts, I even managed to cut my finger on this.",
    ["嘶……"] = "Hiss...",
    ["嘶……疼！你小心点！别碰坏了箱子！"] = "Hiss... it hurts! Be careful! Don't damage the crate!",
    ["嘶……谢谢。"] = "Hiss... thank you.",
    ["嘶……这石块地板真硬，为什么你们人类总喜欢干多余的事？"] = "Hiss... this stone floor is so hard. Why do you humans always like to do such unnecessary things?",
    ["嘶吼"] = "Roar",
    ["嘶吼声中，莫名夹杂着些痛苦的情绪，也似乎在苦苦哀求着什么。"] = "In the roar, there was inexplicably mixed with some painful emotions, and it also seemed to be begging for something.",
    ["嘶哑的声音"] = "A hoarse voice",
    ["嘶嘶嘶…"] = "Hiss hiss hiss...",
    ["嘶，我学过，但还真没试过。"] = "Hiss, I've studied it, but I've never actually tried it.",
    ["嘻哈哈\r\n哈哈哈哈哈...\r\n哈哈哈哈哈哈哈...\r\n哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈...！"] = "Hahaha \r\n Hahahaha... \r\n Hahahahahaha... \r\n Hahahahahahaha...! ",
    ["嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！"] = "Heeheeheeheeheehee!",
    ["嘻嘻嘻，哈哈哈……怎么丢下我，妈妈？\n长眠吧，安睡吧。纤弱的蝴蝶，不再流浪吧。"] = "Heeheehee, hahaha... Why did you leave me behind, Mother? \n Sleep now, rest peacefully. Fragile butterfly, wander no more.",
    ["嘻嘻！哈哈！别、别走开，精彩的还在后面！"] = "Hee hee! Haha! Don't, don't walk away, the best part is yet to come!",
    ["嘻嘻，塞西尔，别再逗我啦！你认真的样子……真让人分不清是玩笑还是真的了。 "] = "Hee hee, Cecil, stop teasing me! The way you look so serious... it really makes it hard to tell if it's a joke or real.",
    ["嘿{{先生|女士}}！尝尝会咬人舌头的饮料吗？只要1便士，比甜冰茶够劲，比姜汁啤酒清爽！"] = "Hey {{Mr.|Ms.}}! Want to try a drink that bites your tongue? Only 1 penny, punchier than sweet iced tea and more refreshing than ginger beer!",
    ["嘿伙计，放轻松，人休息是合法的。"] = "Hey buddy, relax. Resting is legal.",
    ["嘿你算是问对人了，我这还有两页罗塞尔大帝的笔记，这可是稀缺货！"] = "Hey, you've asked the right person. I also have two pages of Emperor Roselle's notes here. These are rare goods!",
    ["嘿兄弟，我按照约定穿着裙子来见你了。"] = "Hey brother, I came to see you wearing a skirt as promised.",
    ["嘿嘿……"] = "Hehe...",
    ["嘿嘿……比利肯定找不到我……"] = "Hehe... Billy definitely won't find me...",
    ["嘿嘿，一点点口水，我刷了牙的。"] = "Hehe, a little bit of saliva, I brushed my teeth.",
    ["嘿嘿，不知道啊，什么神？"] = "Hehe, I don't know, what god?",
    ["嘿嘿，其实你一直以来表现都很棒啦。刚刚开玩笑的啦，不用那么严肃。对啦，等会我们去哪吃饭想好了吗？"] = "Hehe, actually you've been doing great all along. I was just joking earlier, no need to be so serious. By the way, have you decided where we're going to eat later?",
    ["嘿嘿，咋样呀？"] = "Hehe, how was that?",
    ["嘿嘿，我乖乖的，爸爸回来的时候，就不会难过了。"] = "Hehe, I'll be a good girl, and when Dad comes back, he won't be sad.",
    ["嘿嘿，我会建议你先去队长办公室看看！"] = "Hehe, I suggest you go to the Captain's Office first!",
    ["嘿嘿，我觉得那边的海茵就不错，你看她的笑容，多么迷人！"] = "Hehe, I think Hein over there is not bad. Look at her smile, how charming!",
    ["嘿嘿，我还没想好。"] = "Hehe, I haven't thought about it yet.",
    ["嘿嘿，是我。你想买火柴吗？我们已经算是朋友了，我可以送你一根。"] = "Hehe, that's me. Do you want to buy matches? We're already friends, I can give you one.",
    ["嘿嘿，有新猎物上钩了……嗷呜！！！"] = "Hehe, a new prey has taken the bait... Awoo!!!",
    ["嘿嘿，被你听见啦……"] = "Hehe, you heard me...",
    ["嘿嘿，这可是我的秘密基地，谁都发现不了。"] = "Hehe, this is my secret base; no one will ever find it.",
    ["嘿嘿，这可是来自东拜朗的植物精油，能让你变成床上的蒸汽列车，深夜的连发火炮，你懂的，嘿嘿。"] = "Hehe, this is plant essential oil from East Balam. It can turn you into a steam train in bed, a rapid-fire cannon in the middle of the night, you know, hehe.",
    ["嘿嘿，那我就期待着下次值班了！"] = "Hehe, then I'll look forward to my next shift!",
    ["嘿小家伙……我不知道你在说什么暗号。"] = "Hey little one... I don't know what password you're talking about.",
    ["嘿小猫，快回来……"] = "Hey kitten, come back quickly...",
    ["嘿索恩，你最好别说瑞安娜坏话，她耳朵灵着呢。"] = "Hey Thorne, you'd better not speak ill of Ri'anna; she has sharp ears.",
    ["嘿！你有没有什么无法达成的愿望难以满足？有没有不能完成的夙愿耿耿于怀？来吧，我这儿有各种各样的游戏，能让你体验不一样的人生！"] = "Hey! Do you have any unfulfilled wishes that are hard to satisfy? Any regrets that weigh on your heart? Come on, I have all kinds of games here that can let you experience a different life!",
    ["嘿！你！别再往前走了！"] = "Hey! You! Don't walk any further!",
    ["嘿！别想跑！"] = "Hey! Don't think about running!",
    ["嘿！叫你呢，听我说——这里不许——"] = "Hey! I'm talking to you, listen to me—this is not allowed—",
    ["嘿！喝！我斩！"] = "Hey! Hah! I strike!",
    ["嘿！我的尖耳朵伙计，今天你也上岗？"] = "Hey! My sharp-eared pal, are you on duty today too?",
    ["嘿！朋友，是来这儿游玩的吧！"] = "Hey! Friend, you're here for a visit, aren't you?",
    ["嘿！看到里面那位相亲的男士吗？对面坐着一位女士的那个。"] = "Hey! See that man on a date inside? The one sitting across from a lady.",
    ["嘿！看看我，我有便宜票！"] = "Hey! Look at me, I have cheap tickets!",
    ["嘿！要来一双做工精良、耐磨耐热的皮鞋吗？"] = "Hey! Do you want a pair of well-made, wear-resistant, and heat-resistant leather shoes?",
    ["嘿！那边的登山者！请过来一下！"] = "Hey! You mountaineer over there! Please come over here!",
    ["嘿，{{先生|女士}}，别这么说！须知智慧也是赚取钱财的途径之一，当然，当然！它不一定道德。"] = "Hey, {{ Mr.| Ms.}}, don't say that! You must know that wisdom is also one of the ways to earn money. Of course, of course! It isn't necessarily moral.",
    ["嘿，{{先生|女士}}，欢迎光临西巷最好吃的集市！"] = "Hey, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, welcome to the best market in West Lane!",
    ["嘿，{{小伙子|小姑娘}}！你最好待一边儿去，货箱边上可危险了。"] = "Hey, {{young man|young lady}}! You'd better stay aside; it's dangerous by the cargo crates.",
    ["嘿，上面的！要跳就快点，别耽误大家时间！我还得去上班呢！"] = "Hey, you up there! If you're going to jump, do it quickly, don't waste everyone's time! I still have to go to work!",
    ["嘿，不知道这艘船要开去哪里。不过我想我的机遇来了……要画画吗，{{先生|女士}}？？"] = "Hey, I don't know where this ship is headed. But I think my opportunity has arrived... Would you like a painting, {{Mr.|Ms.}}??",
    ["嘿，今天来了一波新的非凡材料，来看看？"] = "Hey, a new batch of Beyonder materials arrived today. Want to take a look?",
    ["嘿，今天赢的钱够喝一整宿了……"] = "Heh, the money I won today is enough to drink all night...",
    ["嘿，会一些，日常记录或者工作都会用到。"] = "Hey, I know a bit. I use it for daily logs or work.",
    ["嘿，伯尔纳，再来一首！"] = "Hey, Bernard, play another one!",
    ["嘿，作为值夜者，我们永远相信队友，黑荆棘的同伴永远是最好的。"] = "Hey, as Nighthawks, we always trust our teammates. Our companions in the Blackthorn are always the best.",
    ["嘿，你借封印物的时候，尽量对他们好点……不要淋到雨。"] = "Hey, when you borrow Sealed Artifacts, try to be nice to them... don't let them get rained on.",
    ["嘿，你听说过“黄金梦想号”吗？他们说那艘船的船帆在月光下会变成水晶！"] = "Hey, have you heard of the \"Golden Dream\"? They say the sails of that ship turn into crystal under the moonlight!",
    ["嘿，你在听我说话吗？"] = "Hey, are you listening to me?",
    ["嘿，你来了！去告诉卡普顿，我们需要等到暴风雨之后出发！"] = "Hey, you're here! Go tell Capton we need to wait until after the storm to set off!",
    ["嘿，你来了！去告诉船长，我们需要等到暴风雨之后出发！"] = "Hey, you're here! Go tell the captain that we need to wait until after the storm to set sail!",
    ["嘿，你来得正好，我在设计金秋湖的印象服装，还差一点灵感。"] = "Hey, you came just in time. I'm designing an impressionist outfit for Golden Autumn Lake, and I'm still missing a bit of inspiration.",
    ["嘿，你看起来很年轻啊！还在上学吗？"] = "Hey, you look very young! Are you still in school?",
    ["嘿，你知道他是为什么被赶出来的吗？他记混了自己几位情人的名字！"] = "Hey, do you know why he was kicked out? He mixed up the names of his mistresses!",
    ["嘿，你这小子——什么交易？我听不懂，我就是个破卖报纸的！走开走开！"] = "Hey, you kid—what deal? I don't understand. I'm just a poor newspaper seller! Go away, go away!",
    ["嘿，先生，要来束鲜花吗？这与您美丽的妻子很相配。"] = "Hey, sir, want to buy a bouquet of flowers? It matches your beautiful wife perfectly.",
    ["嘿，先生，这里不允许睡觉！"] = "Hey, sir, sleeping is not allowed here!",
    ["嘿，准备来试试冲浪吗？今天湖上的浪很不错，我正要过去玩一圈。"] = "Hey, ready to try surfing? The waves on the lake are great today, I'm just about to go for a ride.",
    ["嘿，别踢我！"] = "Hey, don't kick me!",
    ["嘿，加布里你这样说可不好，也许利诺只是有自己的调子呢？"] = "Hey, Gabriel, it's not nice to say that. Maybe Lino just has his own tune?",
    ["嘿，小伙子，买点苹果吧，新鲜着呢！或者来点葡萄——今天早上才从藤上摘下来的！"] = "Hey, young man, buy some apples, they're fresh! Or get some grapes—picked from the vine just this morning!",
    ["嘿，小子，别想那些。我们都知道大海要收些代价，但她也会给予回报。"] = "Hey, kid, don't think about that. We all know the sea demands a price, but she also gives rewards.",
    ["嘿，小斯特莱德，你学到多少？"] = "Hey, little Stride, how much have you learned?",
    ["嘿，布莱特，你以前玩过槌球吗？这可是我们西区最流行的游戏……我猜你大概连见都没见过吧？"] = "Hey, Bright, have you ever played croquet before? This is the most popular game in our West End... I guess you probably haven't even seen it, right?",
    ["嘿，很快就能好。"] = "Hey, it will be better soon.",
    ["嘿，想不想快速赚钱！我教你"] = "Hey, want to make money fast! I'll teach you",
    ["嘿，想算算今天的运势吗？"] = "Hey, want to calculate today's fortune?",
    ["嘿，我们一定要这么不务正业吗？"] = "Hey, do we really have to be so unproductive?",
    ["嘿，我可不会为男人掏钱！"] = "Hey, I'm not paying for a man!",
    ["嘿，我听见了！"] = "Hey, I heard that!",
    ["嘿，我说，你这不算消极怠工？小心薪水扣光。"] = "Hey, I'm just saying, doesn't this count as slacking off? Be careful about getting your pay docked.",
    ["嘿，把宝箱给我"] = "Hey, give me the treasure chest",
    ["嘿，新人，往这儿走。"] = "Hey, newbie, come this way.",
    ["嘿，最好是带回来一位帅气的绅士，你说呢？"] = "Hey, it would be best to bring back a handsome gentleman, don't you think?",
    ["嘿，朋友，你听说过罗塞尔大帝的风流往事吗？"] = "Hey, friend, have you heard of the romantic affairs of Emperor Roselle?",
    ["嘿，朋友，麻烦推我一把，两边对称的椅子让我浑身难受……"] = "Hey, friend, trouble pushing me, the symmetrical chairs on both sides make me feel uncomfortable all over...",
    ["嘿，机会不等人，来得晚了名额可就会被抢了——别怪我没提醒你。"] = "Hey, opportunity waits for no one, if you come late, the slot will be snatched up—don't say I didn't warn you.",
    ["嘿，看你很着急，在找马车吧？"] = "Hey, you look like you're in a hurry, looking for a carriage?",
    ["嘿，瞧瞧这人满为患的盥洗室，我发财的机会来了……"] = "Hey, look at this crowded washroom; my chance to get rich has arrived...",
    ["嘿，要来一杯黑兰德吗！"] = "Hey, want a glass of Blackland?",
    ["嘿，这儿的龙骨鱼，可是出海的船刚刚带回来的。香煎味道好极了！"] = "Hey, the keel fish here was just brought back by a ship that went out to sea. Pan-fried, it tastes wonderful!",
    ["嘿，这又不是什么稀奇事！我们在对金秋湖的湖灵献祭。它脾气很怪，但愿祭品能让它安静一阵子。"] = "Hey, this isn't anything rare! We are making a sacrifice to the Lake Spirit of Golden Autumn Lake. It has a very strange temper, hopefully, the offering will keep it quiet for a while.",
    ["嘿，这可不能说。你要真想知道，不如去问问买过的人。我想想，你去找全学派最爱睡觉的那位吧，会得到中肯的评价的。"] = "Hey, I can't say. If you really want to know, why not ask someone who has bought it? Let me think, go find the one in the school who loves sleeping the most; you'll get an honest evaluation.",
    ["嘿，这可不能说。你要真想知道，不如去问问买过的人是什么体验。"] = "Hey, I can't say. If you really want to know, why not ask those who have bought them about their experience.",
    ["嘿，这家餐馆去哪了？"] = "Hey, where did this restaurant go?",
    ["嘿，这把有些人的裤衩都要赔掉了。"] = "Hey, this round could make some people lose their pants.",
    ["嘿，那是酒吗？我要喝。"] = "Hey, is that wine? I want to drink it.",
    ["嘿，都别急……还有一个条件——这份工作得先交3苏勒的“介绍费”。"] = "Hey, don't be so hasty... there is one more condition—this job requires a 3 soli \"introduction fee\" first.",
    ["嘿，需要“那种”药剂吗？"] = "Hey, do you need 'that kind' of potion?",
    ["噔噔噔噔噔？"] = "Deng deng deng deng deng?",
    ["噔，噔蹬蹬蹬"] = "Dum, dum-dum-dum-dum",
    ["噗嗤……看来您还是个孩子，茜茜曾经也这么可爱。"] = "Pfft... It seems you are still a child; Cici used to be this cute too.",
    ["噜噜"] = "Lulu",
    ["噜噜噜"] = "Lu-lu-lu",
    ["噜？"] = "Lu?",
    ["噢 黛西！"] = "Oh, Daisy!",
    ["噢……{{先生|女士}}，你知道吗，有两个流浪汉死在这里了。"] = "Oh... {{Mr.|Ms.}}, did you know two homeless people died here?",
    ["噢……你好，真希望我的屁股能和我一起到场……"] = "Oh... hello, I really wish my butt could have arrived with me...",
    ["噢……抱歉。"] = "Oh... sorry.",
    ["噢……抱歉。但我必须要坦诚地拒绝你。否则这可能给我们都带来困扰。"] = "Oh... sorry. But I must honestly refuse you. Otherwise, this might cause trouble for both of us.",
    ["噢……杰西，我会一直想念你。"] = "Oh... Jessie, I will miss you always.",
    ["噢不……小黛西……"] = "Oh no... little Daisy...",
    ["噢不，我们是文明人，不会做这种不文明的事情。"] = "Oh no, we are civilized people and wouldn't do such uncivilized things.",
    ["噢不，请等等……请你，请你至少……"] = "Oh no, please wait... please, please at least...",
    ["噢其实我没在钓鱼，在找东西呢。"] = "Oh, actually I'm not fishing; I'm looking for something.",
    ["噢噢！您说的对，少凑热闹，少凑热闹。"] = "Oh oh! You're right, don't join in the fun, don't join in the fun.",
    ["噢女神啊，这拳可真重！"] = "Oh Goddess, that Punch was really heavy!",
    ["噢我在戏剧节做兼职，想邀请你在罗塞尔大帝画像上签名。"] = "Oh, I'm working part-time at the drama festival and would like to invite you to sign on Emperor Roselle's portrait.",
    ["噢是的，就是那边。"] = "Oh yes, it was right over there.",
    ["噢是的，这一切都会过去。我为什么要如此哭泣？"] = "Oh yes, all of this will pass. Why was I crying so much?",
    ["噢混蛋，你快把我今天卖菜的钱都赢走了，最后一把了。"] = "Oh damn, you've almost won all the money I made selling vegetables today. This is the last round.",
    ["噢等等，这是哪里来的小可怜，瞧瞧你这身打扮……"] = "Oh wait, where did this poor little thing come from? Look at your outfit...",
    ["噢！你喜欢的话，到时候就尽管拿去喝。"] = "Oh! If you like it, feel free to take it and drink it then.",
    ["噢！吉瑞尔，你的确要好好教育阿尔伯特，他最近很不听话。"] = "Oh! Girel, you really need to discipline Albert properly. He has been very disobedient lately.",
    ["噢！是魔女"] = "Oh! It's a Witch",
    ["噢！谢谢您的评价，这给予了我莫大的信心。我时常因为过去的诗人们书写了太多的佳作而感到忧郁。"] = "Oh! Thank you for your evaluation; this gives me great confidence. I often feel melancholy because poets of the past have written too many masterpieces.",
    ["噢！这个还算有意思……"] = "Oh! This is actually quite interesting...",
    ["噢！这是卡斯伯特甜品俱乐部特供的柠檬蛋糕，是卡斯伯特女士的独家配方！"] = "Oh! This is a lemon cake specially provided by the Cuthbert Dessert Club, it's Ms. Cuthbert's exclusive recipe!",
    ["噢！这条河非常神奇，能从里面捞出很多崭新的物品！"] = "Oh! This river is truly magical; you can fish out many brand-new items from it!",
    ["噢！那请务必——务必买一束包扎精美的花送给她，庆祝你们的好日子！"] = "Oh! Then please—please buy a beautifully wrapped bouquet of flowers to give her, to celebrate your big day!",
    ["噢！黛比，可可，看样子我们不用自己翻书来解读了！"] = "Oh! Debbie, Coco, it looks like we don't have to flip through the books ourselves to interpret them!",
    ["噢，<P_Yellow>丽埃娜</>，我就知道，你一定能完全记住的。"] = "Oh, <P_Yellow>Liana</>, I knew you would be able to memorize them completely.",
    ["噢，{{先生|女士}}！你有工作要介绍给我吗？"] = "Oh, {{Mr.|Ms.}}! Do you have any work to introduce to me?",
    ["噢，不好意思，差点忘了，杂货摊的火柴应该是要按盒购买的。"] = "Oh, sorry, I almost forgot, matches at a grocery stall should be bought by the box.",
    ["噢，不是。这是我欠钱被打的。"] = "Oh, no. This is because I was beaten for owing money.",
    ["噢，不请自来的警察……你们的这种鲁莽，在我的账本上可不便宜。"] = "Oh, uninvited police... your recklessness is not cheap on my ledger.",
    ["噢，为什么，明明只是人群中的一人，但我却被你深深地吸引了。"] = "Oh, why, even though you are just one in a crowd, I am deeply attracted to you.",
    ["噢，亲爱的汤姆！我刚写完给霍华德的信。"] = "Oh, dear Tom! I just finished writing the letter to Howard.",
    ["噢，他比妓院里的老鸨都啰嗦！"] = "Oh, he's more long-winded than the madam at the brothel!",
    ["噢，你吓我一跳。"] = "Oh, you startled me.",
    ["噢，你好！我在这等我丈夫呢，他离开小镇去打工，应该这几天就回来。"] = "Oh, hello! I'm waiting for my husband here. He left the small town to work and should be back in these few days.",
    ["噢，你好，有什么需要？"] = "Oh, hello, what do you need?",
    ["噢，你是说小福戈给工人们提供的免费盒饭？"] = "Oh, you mean the free boxed lunches little Foga provides to the workers?",
    ["噢，别担心，是爱让我来到了这里。"] = "Oh, don't worry, it was love that brought me here.",
    ["噢，别担心，没人会发现你在和我说话。"] = "Oh, don't worry, no one will notice you talking to me.",
    ["噢，别这样。我最近手头确实有些紧……等这周的工钱一发，我立刻还给你，我发誓！"] = "Oh, don't do that. I'm really a bit tight on cash lately... As soon as this week's wages are paid, I'll pay you back immediately, I swear!",
    ["噢，原来是一个观众向琳达热情地招手。嘿，支持偶像没问题，可别影响比赛啊。"] = "Oh, it turns out a spectator was waving enthusiastically at Linda. Hey, supporting your idol is fine, but don't disrupt the match.",
    ["噢，又一位警官？但愿您能查清事情的真相。"] = "Oh, another police officer? I hope you can find out the truth.",
    ["噢，又来了又来了！"] = "Oh, here it comes again, here it comes again!",
    ["噢，嗨，你要来一杯吗？自己拿个杯子就行，酒桶一直是满的。"] = "Oh, hi, do you want a drink? Just grab a cup yourself; the barrel is always full.",
    ["噢，在塔罗学派内部，3级封印物的资料是接近公开的，你直接去<P_Yellow>二楼</>取阅就行。"] = "Oh, within the Tarot Club, the information on Grade 3 Sealed Artifacts is nearly public; you can just go to the <P_Yellow>second floor</> to read it.",
    ["噢，大家都是那样说他的。实际上斯帕罗先生只是看起来冷漠……他可是个真正的绅士，绅士里还带着一些霸道，霸道里又带着一些温柔……"] = "Oh, everyone says that about him. Actually, Mr. Sparrow just looks cold... He's a true gentleman, a gentleman with a bit of dominance, and within that dominance, a bit of tenderness...",
    ["噢，好的！"] = "Oh, okay!",
    ["噢，对小山羊放尊重点！不然我用拐杖敲烂你的屁股！"] = "Oh, show some respect for the little goat! Or I'll beat your backside with my cane!",
    ["噢，小姐，钻石、黄金、漂亮的丝线、精巧的鞋子……"] = "Oh, miss, diamonds, gold, beautiful silk threads, exquisite shoes...",
    ["噢，差点忘了。今天我只要5磅面包。"] = "Oh, almost forgot. I only need 5 pounds of bread today.",
    ["噢，年轻的警官。可怜的小珍妮，有进展了吗？"] = "Oh, young officer. Poor little Jenny, has there been any progress?",
    ["噢，当然。我是<P_Yellow>新管家——汉娜</>。请问您是？"] = "Oh, of course. I am the <P_Yellow>new butler—Hannah</>. May I ask who you are?",
    ["噢，当然没问题，这就为您进行面容调整——"] = "Oh, of course, no problem. I will perform a facial adjustment for you right now—",
    ["噢，很遗憾，我以为你一定能闻得到雏菊的香味。"] = "Oh, that's a pity. I thought you would definitely be able to smell the fragrance of the daisies.",
    ["噢，很难想象，一个珠宝店居然可以装下这么多人……"] = "Oh, it's hard to imagine that a jewelry store could hold so many people...",
    ["噢，您好！真抱歉，我现在无法停下来和您说话，火车快来了，我必须不停地跳！"] = "Oh, hello! I'm so sorry, I can't stop to talk to you right now. The train is coming, and I must keep jumping!",
    ["噢，您看着是生面孔，可能不知道这家店。"] = "Oh, you look like a new face, you might not know this shop.",
    ["噢，感谢世界上还有记得她的人。"] = "Oh, thank goodness there is someone in the world who remembers her.",
    ["噢，我亲爱的奥利维亚，我要怎么给你描述她的眼睛……"] = "Oh, my dear Olivia, how can I describe her eyes to you...",
    ["噢，我亲爱的孩子们！我这里有一份绝佳的工作机会，只需要你们每天工作12个小时，就能赚到……嗯，5个便士！"] = "Oh, my dear children! I have an excellent job opportunity here, you only need to work 12 hours a day, and you can earn... um, 5 pennies!",
    ["噢，我今天收拾柜子，发现几张珍妮的手稿。"] = "Oh, I was tidying up the cabinet today and found some of Jenny's manuscripts.",
    ["噢，我今天来想加入俱乐部，这是俱乐部会费。"] = "Oh, I'm here today to join the club, here is the membership fee.",
    ["噢，我们的好堂弟！他回来了？"] = "Oh, our good cousin! He's back?",
    ["噢，我的包！可千万别把东西摔坏了……"] = "Oh, my bag! I hope nothing inside got broken...",
    ["噢，我的小天使，你总是比我还要坚强。好吧，为了你和这个家，我豁出去了。"] = "Oh, my little angel, you are always stronger than me. Alright, for you and this family, I'll give it a shot.",
    ["噢，我突然觉得自己又充满了力量！"] = "Oh, I suddenly feel full of energy again!",
    ["噢，我过世的妻子很喜欢音乐，这也是我怀念她的一种方式。"] = "Oh, my late wife loved music, and this is also a way for me to miss her.",
    ["噢，我还记得三十多年前他说要给我送一枚戒指，只是要等一等，这一等，又等到了今天。"] = "Oh, I still remember more than thirty years ago he said he would give me a ring, but I had to wait a bit, and this wait has lasted until today.",
    ["噢，抱歉，我居然开始喜欢回忆过去了。"] = "Oh, sorry, I actually started to like reminiscing about the past.",
    ["噢，抱歉，我的眼睛不太中用了，我实在是太老了……"] = "Oh, sorry, my eyes aren't very good anymore, I'm just too old...",
    ["噢，是你呀！我正在理东西……"] = "Oh, it's you! I'm tidying things up...",
    ["噢，是吗？那太遗憾了。不过只要学校不放假，河水不结冰，我们都会在这里训练，欢迎你来观看！"] = "Oh, is that so? That's a pity. But as long as school isn't on break and the river isn't frozen, we will be training here. You are welcome to come and watch!",
    ["噢，是因为这个吗？我确实偶尔会喷一些香水。"] = "Oh, is it because of that? I do occasionally spray some perfume.",
    ["噢，是的！我的笔记本被风吹散了，书页飘得到处都是。 "] = "Oh, yes! My notebook was blown away by the wind, and the pages are fluttering everywhere.",
    ["噢，是的，先生，我们这里有叫做“未来梦”的高档白葡萄酒，如果您需要的话，欢迎进店品尝。"] = "Oh, yes, sir, we have a high-end white wine called \"Future Dream.\" If you need it, you are welcome to come in and have a taste.",
    ["噢，是魔女！"] = "Oh, it's a witch!",
    ["噢，有新的受害者？……"] = "Oh, a new victim? ...",
    ["噢，没关系，欢迎下次再来。"] = "Oh, that's alright, you're welcome to come again next time.",
    ["噢，真不好意思，我周三要去海边散步，我约好了为那些海鸥带去金黄的炸薯条。"] = "Oh, I'm so sorry, I'm going for a walk by the sea on Wednesday. I've promised to bring golden french fries for the seagulls.",
    ["噢，真不知道这些人在酒吧呆了多久才出来，醉醺醺的。"] = "Oh, I really don't know how long these people have been in the bar, they're drunk.",
    ["噢，真不知道这些人在酒吧待了多久才出来，醉醺醺的。"] = "Oh, I really don't know how long these people have been in the bar to come out so drunk.",
    ["噢，真令人生气，你们一个个简直像蔫巴的生菜叶！"] = "Oh, how infuriating, you guys are like wilted lettuce leaves!",
    ["噢，真遗憾，第一次以这种方式……结束演出。"] = "Oh, what a pity, to end the performance... in this way for the first time.",
    ["噢，真高兴在这里见到一个活人。您知道金秋湖车站在哪个方向吗?"] = "Oh, I'm so glad to see a living person here. Do you know which direction the Golden Autumn Lake station is in?",
    ["噢，蒸汽之主，这是真的吗？我现在就回去，如果是真的，我会回来感谢您的。"] = "Oh, Lord of Steam, is this true? I'm going back now. If it's true, I will come back to thank you.",
    ["噢，让我们为能镶嵌在她假发上的荣耀干杯！干杯！"] = "Oh, let us toast to the glory that can be embedded in her wig! Cheers!",
    ["噢，谢谢你，没关系的！"] = "Oh, thank you, it's okay!",
    ["噢，这么说吧，您会遇到不少人兜售古董之类的，这种……嗯，我就说这么多，您自己有判断就好。"] = "Oh, let's put it this way, you will meet quite a few people peddling antiques and such. This... well, I'll just say this much, you can judge for yourself.",
    ["噢，那他应该去贝克兰德法庭工作，而不是继承一个出版社。"] = "Oh, then he should work at the Backlund Court instead of inheriting a publishing house.",
    ["噢，那你是高兴。"] = "Oh, then you're happy.",
    ["噢，那是一阵阵曲不成调的口风琴声，听着令人脊梁骨发凉。"] = "Oh, that was a series of discordant harmonica notes that sent shivers down my spine.",
    ["噢，那顿饭可是我付的钱，你当时还是个穷小子呢，兄弟！"] = "Oh, I paid for that meal. You were just a poor kid back then, brother!",
    ["噢，风暴在上，快降下神罚，赶走这个疯子！"] = "Oh, Storms above, quickly send down divine punishment and drive away this madman!",
    ["噢，黛比，别光盯着星星，快告诉我们你看出了什么！"] = "Oh, Debbie, don't just stare at the stars, tell us what you see!",
    ["噢？"] = "Oh?",
    ["噤声"] = "Shush",
    ["噩梦"] = "Nightmare",
    ["噩梦吗……谢谢，我会小心的。"] = "Nightmares... Thanks, I'll be careful.",
    ["噩梦姿态"] = "Nightmare Stance",
    ["噩梦姿态下造成伤害时，自身回复量提升100%。"] = "In Nightmare Stance, when dealing damage, your self-healing is increased by 100%.",
    ["噩梦姿态下，治疗能力不再降低。"] = "In Nightmare Stance, healing ability is no longer reduced.",
    ["噩梦形态"] = "Nightmare Form",
    ["噩梦形态连招"] = "Nightmare Form Combo",
    ["噩梦有很多隐喻，或许在未来的旅程中，我们会找到答案。"] = "Nightmares have many metaphors; perhaps in our future journey, we will find the answers.",
    ["噩梦汲生"] = "Nightmare Life Drain",
    ["噩梦疗愈"] = "Nightmare Healing",
    ["噩梦还没有结束？"] = "The nightmare isn't over yet?",
    ["噩梦邪眼的脓液"] = "Pus of the Nightmare Evil Eye",
    ["噩梦邪眼的角膜"] = "Cornea of a Nightmare Evil Eye",
    ["噩梦？拒绝……逃离？像是在暗示什么？"] = "Nightmare? Refusal... escape? Is it implying something?",
    ["噫！好难听，“冲激”？！“赞美太阳”？！似乎因为同时受到风暴和太阳的影响而疯掉了……"] = "Ugh! That sounds terrible, \"Impact\"?! \"Praise the Sun\"?! It seems they went mad from being influenced by both the Storm and the Sun...",
    ["噬咬"] = "Bite",
    ["噬宝石虫"] = "Gem-Eating Insect",
    ["噬魂之影环"] = "Ring of Soul-Devouring Shadows",
    ["噬魂诅咒"] = "Soul-Devouring Curse",
    ["噼啪的口感"] = "Fizzy texture",
    ["嚎叫"] = "Howl",
    ["嚎叫的同时，回复自身最大生命值8%的血量。"] = "When using Scream, recover 8% of your maximum Health.",
    ["嚎叫触发的间隔时间缩短8秒。"] = "The interval between Howl triggers is reduced by 8 seconds.",
    ["嚎叫造成的伤害提高100%。"] = "Damage dealt by Scream increased by 100%.",
    ["嚯哈哈！杂耍开始！"] = "Ho-haha! Let the juggling begin!",
    ["嚯哈哈！杂耍继续！"] = "Ho-haha! The juggling continues!",
    ["嚯，还挺专……"] = "Whoa, quite professional...",
    ["嚷什么，不是还有动静吗？真要是死在里面，麻烦的可是我，哼……"] = "What are you shouting about? Isn't there still movement? If he really dies in there, I'm the one who'll have the trouble, hmph...",
    ["囚犯"] = "Prisoner",
    ["囚犯途径 | 序列8“疯子”"] = "Prisoner Pathway | Sequence 8 \"Madman\"",
