    ["四"] = "Four",
    ["四下无人的江边.....原本的<P_Yellow>地点</>就很完美了，我警告你不要轻举妄动！"] = "The deserted riverside... the original <P_Yellow>location</> was perfect enough. I warn you, don't do anything rash!",
    ["四个参数分别为：加速度的最小最大偏转角、触发冲浪方向调整的角度和最大角度"] = "The four parameters are: minimum and maximum deflection angles for acceleration, the angle to trigger surfing direction adjustment, and the maximum angle.",
    ["四个工坊等级达到2级"] = "Four workshops reach Level 2",
