    ["四人队伍"] = "Four-Person Team",
    ["四十岁的我，家庭美满、事业高升，只做了这一件事！"] = "At forty, I have a happy family and a rising career, and I only did this one thing!",
    ["四十年了,开这家店的时候我才二十岁，那可真是一个美好的年纪。"] = "Forty years. I was only twenty when I opened this shop. That was truly a wonderful age.",
    ["四十！四十！"] = "Forty! Forty!",
