    ["圣典《风暴之书》告诉我们，不要崇尚战斗，也不宣扬战争，但绝对要以风暴般的酷烈对待敌人！"] = "The scripture 'Book of Storms' tells us not to advocate fighting or preach war, but we must treat enemies with the cruelty of a storm!",
