    ["在第一章现实主线中，与骑车的邮差相遇"] = "In the Chapter 1 reality main quest, encounter the postman on a bicycle",
    ["在第一章现实主线中，签署合同并加入黑荆棘安保公司"] = "In the Chapter 1 main story, sign the contract and join the Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["在第一章现实主线中，领取属于黑荆棘新员工的脚踏车"] = "In the Chapter 1 reality main quest, collect the bicycle belonging to a new Blackthorn employee",
    ["在第三章现实主线中，危急时刻获得丽贝卡的及时援助"] = "In the Chapter 3 main story, receive timely assistance from Rebecca during a crisis.",
    ["在第三章现实主线中，进入恶龙酒吧地下市场"] = "In the Chapter 3 main story, enter the underground market of the Evil Dragon Bar.",
    ["在第二章现实主线中，在罗塞尔大帝的巨幅海报上签名"] = "In the Chapter 2 reality main quest, sign your name on the giant poster of Emperor Roselle",
    ["在第二章现实主线中，服用魔药成为序列9非凡者"] = "In the Chapter 2 main story, consume the potion to become a Sequence 9 Beyonder.",
    ["在第五章现实主线中，和黑荆棘同事一起拍新的合照"] = "In the Chapter 5 reality main quest, take a new group photo with your Blackthorn colleagues",
    ["在第五章现实主线排队买票（与让我先来互斥）"] = "Wait in line to buy tickets in the Chapter 5 reality main quest (mutually exclusive with Let Me Go First!)",
    ["在第五章现实主线插队买票（与守序市民互斥）"] = "Cut in line to buy tickets in the Chapter 5 reality main quest (mutually exclusive with Law-Abiding Citizen)",
    ["在第四章现实主线中，击退异变狼人进入安全屋"] = "In the Chapter 4 main story, repel the mutated werewolf and enter the Safe House.",
    ["在第四章现实主线中，和罗珊一起解决最后的谜题"] = "In the Chapter 4 reality main quest, solve the final puzzle together with Rozanne",
    ["在等我的朋友，真期待看见她！"] = "I'm waiting for my friend. I'm so looking forward to seeing her!",
    ["在等我那位姑娘。前前后后送了二十条项链，今天这条送出去，她总该点头陪我吃顿饭了吧？ "] = "Waiting for that lady of mine. I've given her twenty necklaces in total; with this one today, she should finally nod and agree to have a meal with me, right?",
    ["在等谁？"] = "Who are you waiting for?",
    ["在紫藤廊道指定位置进行拍照"] = "Take a photo at the designated location in the Wisteria Corridor",
    ["在紫藤花下散步"] = "Walk under the wisteria flowers",
    ["在纪念品商店卖至少2苏勒，平时我卖1苏勒6便士，您现在要，我算您1苏勒怎么样。"] = "They sell for at least 2 soli at the souvenir shop. I usually sell them for 1 soli and 6 pence. If you want one now, how about 1 soli?",
    ["在线"] = "Online",
    ["在线倾向"] = "Online Tendency",
    ["在线情况"] = "Online Status",
    ["在线时间"] = "Online Time",
    ["在练剑？"] = "Practicing swordsmanship?",
    ["在终末猎杀中召唤一次怪物"] = "Summon a monster in End-Time Hunt",
    ["在终末猎杀场地中，队伍、团队、同俱乐部成员将受到战斗保护，团队联盟不受战斗保护！"] = "In the Final Hunt arena, teams, groups, and fellow club members will receive combat protection; team alliances do not receive combat protection!",
    ["在经历了罪恶廷根的一系列事件之后，你已倍感疲惫，仿佛随时会被黑暗所吞噬。"] = "After the series of events in Sinful Tingen, you feel exhausted, as if you could be swallowed by the darkness at any moment.",
    ["在结伴而行的旅程与战斗中，不会再被菇毒所伤害。"] = "During journeys and battles taken together, you will no longer be harmed by mushroom toxins.",
    ["在结伴而行的旅程与战斗中，不会再被菇毒所伤害。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "During journeys and battles taken together, you will no longer be harmed by Mushroom Poison. \nDuplicate acquisitions will be automatically decomposed into Bound Pounds ×100.",
    ["在罗塞尔统治期间，“工匠之神”更名为“蒸汽与机械之神”。"] = "During Roselle's reign, the 'God of Craftsmanship' was renamed the God of Steam and Machinery.",
    ["在罗珊之前赶到<h>老维尔餐厅</>"] = "Arrive at <h>Old Will's Restaurant</> before Rozanne",
    ["在罪恶廷根1分35秒内完成“厂际竞速”事件"] = "Complete the \"Inter-factory Racing\" event in Sinful Tingen within 1 minute and 35 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根1分35秒内完成“厂际竞速”玩法"] = "Complete the Inter-factory Racing gameplay in Sinful Tingen within 1 minute and 35 seconds",
    ["在罪恶廷根1分35秒内完成“厂际竞速”玩法。 "] = "Complete the Inter-factory Racing gameplay in Sinful Tingen within 1 minute and 35 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根不超过140秒完成一次挑战“审判官”布莱克。 "] = "Challenge Blake, the Judge in Sinful Tingen within 140 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根不超过170秒完成一次挑战“剥面人”强尼。 "] = "Challenge Johnny, the Face-Peeler in Sinful Tingen within 170 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根不超过170秒完成一次挑战“头狼”鲁珀。 "] = "Challenge Luper, the Alpha Wolf in Sinful Tingen within 170 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根不超过170秒完成一次挑战“钻头”。 "] = "Challenge Drill in Sinful Tingen within 170 seconds.",
    ["在罪恶廷根以“极佳”成绩完成“激战邦尼”事件。 "] = "Complete the Fierce Battle with Bonnie event in Sinful Tingen with an Excellent rating.",
    ["在罪恶廷根以“极佳”成绩完成：“激战邦尼”事件"] = "Completed \"Fierce Battle with Bonnie\" event in Sinful Tingen with an \"Excellent\" rating",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成1次：挑战“剥面人”强尼"] = "Complete 1 challenge in Sinful Tingen: Challenge Johnny, the Face-Peeler",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成1次：挑战“头狼”鲁珀"] = "Complete 1 challenge in Sinful Tingen: Challenge Luper, the Alpha Wolf",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成1次：挑战“审判官”布莱克"] = "Complete 1 challenge in Sinful Tingen: Challenge Blake, the Judge",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成1次：挑战“钻头”"] = "Complete 1 challenge in Sinful Tingen: Challenge Drill",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成“血色谢幕”事件。 "] = "Complete the Blood Curtain Call event in Sinful Tingen.",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成一次：挑战“困难·剥面人”。"] = "Complete once in Sinful Tingen: Challenge \"Hard · Face-Peeler\".",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成一次：挑战“困难·头狼”。"] = "Complete once in Sinful Tingen: Challenge \"Hard · Alpha Wolf\".",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成一次：挑战“困难·审判官”。"] = "Complete once in Sinful Tingen: Challenge \"Hard · Inquisitor\".",
    ["在罪恶廷根完成一次：挑战“困难·钻头”。"] = "Complete once in Sinful Tingen: Challenge \"Hard · Drill\".",
    ["在罪恶廷根的街头，响应崔佛警官的实时呼叫，高效解决各类突发犯罪事件！"] = "On the streets of Sinful Tingen, respond to Officer Trevor's real-time calls and efficiently resolve various sudden criminal incidents!",
    ["在美好的午餐时间吵架，是发生什么了吗？"] = "Arguing during a lovely lunch time, did something happen?",
    ["在老尼尔的画像里，瑞尔·比伯好像也有个一样的。"] = "In Old Neil's portrait, Ray Bieber seems to have one just like it.",
    ["在脑海里想象一件常见的物品 将所有注意力都放在上面"] = "Imagine a common object in your mind and focus all your attention on it.",
    ["在自己的城堡内，累计出售%d/4000个高收益率（400%%+）物产"] = "Sell a total of %d/4000 high-yield (400%%+) products in your own castle.",
    ["在自身前方扇形区域内瞬间凝聚三头猩红犬影，一起发动一次咬击，造成*d点伤害。"] = "Instantly condense three Scarlet Hound Shadows in a fan-shaped area in front of you, launching a Bite together to deal *d damage.",
    ["在自身面前召唤一个狒狒，狒狒每间隔一段时间会给小队所有成员添加一个随机增益。\n随机增益：攻击增加、技能增强增加、怪物专攻增加。"] = "Summon a Baboon in front of you. The Baboon will periodically add a random buff to all members of the squad. \nRandom Buff: Attack Increase, Skill Enhancement Increase, Monster Specialization Increase.",
    ["在自身面前召唤一只狒狒，持续21秒。召唤时及之后每<Highlight>6</>秒，狒狒会为30米范围内的队友添加一个随机增益。\n随机增益：buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；"] = "Summon a baboon in front of you, lasting 21 seconds. Upon summoning and every <Highlight>6</> seconds thereafter, the baboon will apply a random buff to teammates within 30 meters. \nRandom buffs: buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds; buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds; buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds;",
    ["在自身面前召唤一只狒狒，持续21秒。召唤时及之后每<Highlight>6</>秒，狒狒会为30米范围内的队友添加一个随机增益。\n随机增益：buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；buffdisc(*id)，持续<Highlight>6</>秒；\n该技能有小队冷却时间<Highlight>30</>秒。"] = "Summon a baboon in front of you, lasting for 21 seconds. Upon summoning and every <Highlight>6</> seconds thereafter, the baboon will grant a random buff to allies within 30 meters.\nRandom buffs: buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds; buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds; buffdisc(*id), lasting <Highlight>6</> seconds;\nThis skill has a party cooldown of <Highlight>30</> seconds.",
    ["在舞者面前，跳出正确的舞蹈，帮助队友抵挡舞者的冲锋攻击！"] = "Perform the correct dance in front of the dancers to help teammates block the dancers' charge attacks!",
    ["在艺术学派生成%d/10次演出视频。"] = "Generate %d/10 performance videos in the Art School.",
    ["在艺术学派生成%d/20次演出视频。"] = "Generate %d/20 performance videos in the Art School.",
    ["在艺术学派生成%d/50次演出视频。"] = "Generate %d/50 performance videos in the Art School.",
    ["在艺术档案上传%d/10次视频。"] = "Upload %d/10 videos to the Art Archive.",
    ["在艺术档案上传%d/25次视频。"] = "Upload %d/25 videos to the Art Archive.",
    ["在艺术档案上传%d/5次视频。"] = "Upload %d/5 videos to the Art Archive.",
    ["在花丛形成之后<Highlight>快速远离花丛附近</>。"] = "After the flower cluster forms, <Highlight>quickly move away from the vicinity of the flower cluster</>.",
    ["在花海求婚成功能收获永恒的幸福，那求婚失败呢？"] = "A successful proposal in the sea of flowers brings eternal happiness, but what if the proposal fails?",
    ["在营地休息"] = "Rest at Camp",
    ["在蒸汽与齿轮的世界里，她找到了属于自己的节拍。"] = "In a world of steam and gears, she found her own rhythm.",
    ["在蜂蜜炖猪肠的见证下，美女与野兽最终走到了一起。"] = "Witnessed by the Honey-Stewed Pork Intestines, the beauty and the beast finally came together.",
    ["在被逼入绝境时会愤怒地嘶吼。"] = "And roar angrily when driven into a desperate situation.",
    ["在观众眼中，每个人都是不错的演员呢。"] = "In the eyes of a Spectator, everyone is a pretty good actor.",
    ["在规定时间内完成比赛！"] = "Complete the race within the specified time!",
    ["在角落等待马修"] = "Wait for Matthew in the corner",
    ["在警察来之前，这里很难恢复安静了，您要是想买花，还是去别处吧。"] = "It's hard for things to return to quiet here before the police arrive. If you want to buy flowers, you'd better go elsewhere.",
    ["在讨论什么？"] = "What are you discussing?",
    ["在记忆碎片查看界面中选择特定碎片进行<Highlight>记忆回溯</>，可将记忆碎片放置到地上，副本内的所有人都可以拾取该记忆碎片。"] = "In the memory fragment viewing interface, select a specific fragment to perform <Highlight>Retrace</> to place the memory fragment on the ground, allowing everyone in the dungeon to pick up that memory fragment.",
    ["在记忆连接平台等待传送"] = "Wait for teleportation at the memory connection platform.",
    ["在诊所随便看看\n<h>几封未寄的信</>"] = "Look around the clinic \n<h> a few unsent letters </>",
    ["在诊所随便看看\r\n<h>几封未寄的信</>"] = "Take a look around the clinic.\n<h>Several unsent letters</>",
    ["在诡秘圈动态中赠送，可以为该条诡秘圈动态增加100点热度。若双方为好友关系，可额外增加50点好友度。"] = "Gift on a Mystery Circle post to increase the post's popularity by 100 points. If both parties are friends, friendship increases by an additional 50 points.",
    ["在诡秘圈动态中赠送，可以为该条诡秘圈动态增加20点热度。若双方为好友关系，可额外增加10点好友度。"] = "Gift on a Mystery Circle post to increase the post's popularity by 20 points. If both parties are friends, friendship increases by an additional 10 points.",
    ["在诡秘圈动态中赠送，可以为该条诡秘圈动态增加666点热度。若双方为好友关系，可额外增加300点好友度。"] = "Gift on a Mystery Circle post to increase the post's popularity by 666 points. If both parties are friends, friendship increases by an additional 300 points.",
    ["在诡秘的世界里漫游，参与多种趣味任务。\n1、在今日推荐中，可以获得三个随机任务推荐，也可以自由选择“随便逛逛”或“尝试扮演”，进行刷新。\n2、在全部漫游中，可以查看各种不同的漫游任务，点击前往进行体验。\n3、扮演相关任务，需要先完成主线任务·时代的浪潮，成为非凡者之后解锁。\n4、部分漫游任务每日8时刷新，可以重复体验。"] = "Roam the mysterious world and participate in various fun quests. \n1. In Today's Recommendations, you can get three random quest recommendations, or choose to \"Wander Around\" or \"Try Acting\" to refresh them.\n2. In All Roaming, you can view various roaming quests and click to go and experience them.\n3. Acting-related quests require completing the main quest \"Tides of the Era\" and becoming a Beyonder first.\n4. Some roaming quests refresh daily at 8:00 AM and can be experienced repeatedly.",
    ["在贵族老爷们眼里，贫穷是一种天生的罪。"] = "In the eyes of the noble lords, poverty is an innate sin.",
    ["在赌桌前坐下"] = "Sit down at the gambling table",
    ["在跑团投骰中连续三次失败"] = "Fail three times in a row in TRPG dice rolls",
    ["在跑团投骰中连续两次掷出大失败"] = "Roll a critical failure twice in a row in TRPG dice rolls",
    ["在跑团投骰中连续两次掷出大成功"] = "Roll a critical success twice in a row in TRPG dice rolls",
    ["在跑团投骰中连续十次成功"] = "Succeed ten times in a row in TRPG dice rolls",
    ["在跑团投骰中首次掷出大失败"] = "Roll a critical failure in TRPG dice rolls for the first time",
    ["在跑团投骰中首次掷出大成功"] = "Roll a critical success in TRPG dice rolls for the first time",
    ["在跨服沙盘中幸存，证明你不只是棋子。沙盘开始记录你的名字，大帝的视线第一次扫过你的身影——存活，是被审视的前提。"] = "Surviving in the cross-server sandbox proves that you are more than just a chess piece. The sandbox begins to record your name, and the Emperor's gaze sweeps over you for the first time—survival is the prerequisite for being scrutinized.",
    ["在跨服环境下无法进行创建群组、邀请好友和解散群组的操作。"] = "Cannot perform group creation, friend invitation, or group dissolution operations in a cross-server environment.",
    ["在路口再次占卜"] = "Perform divination again at the intersection.",
    ["在身前位置召唤兔子玩偶用头震地，击倒前方扇形范围内敌人，同时附带减速余波。"] = "Summon a Rabbit Doll in front of you to slam its head into the ground, knocking down enemies in a fan-shaped area in front, while also applying a slowing aftershock.",
    ["在身前位置召唤兔子玩偶用头震地，对前方扇形范围内敌人造成*d伤害，同时附带余波，对周围敌人造成*d伤害。"] = "Summon a Rabbit Doll in front of you to slam its head into the ground, dealing *d damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area in front, while also creating an aftershock that deals *d damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["在身前位置召唤兔子玩偶用头震地，对前方扇形范围内敌人造成*d伤害，并有50%的基础概率击倒敌人。同时附带余波，对周围敌人造成*d伤害。"] = "Summon a rabbit doll in front of you to slam its head into the ground, dealing *d damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area in front, with a 50% base chance to knock them down. It also carries an aftershock, dealing *d damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["在身前位置召唤兔子玩偶用头震地，有概率击倒前方扇形范围内敌人，同时附带余波。"] = "Summon a rabbit doll in front of you to slam its head into the ground, with a chance to knock down enemies in a fan-shaped area in front, while also carrying an aftershock.",
    ["在身前和目标位置生成<HighLight>小队可用的旅行家之门</>，小队成员可以通过交互<HighLight>旅行家之门</>传送至目标位置并获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>和<HighLight>减伤</>（单向传送，至多传送1次）。"] = "Generate a <HighLight>Traveler's Door available to the team</> in front of you and at the target location. Team members can interact with the <HighLight>Traveler's Door</> to teleport to the target location and gain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> and <HighLight>Damage Reduction</> (one-way teleportation, can be used at most once).",
    ["在身边召唤骑兵法阵，对周围敌人造成持续伤害。"] = "Summon a Cavalry Magic Circle around you to deal continuous damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["在身边营造满月。近处的敌人伤到你时会被减速，并提升你的减伤；对敌人造成伤害时，获得伤害加成。若一段时间未造成伤害，血液渐冷，体力无法恢复。"] = "Create a full moon around you. Enemies nearby will be slowed when they hurt you, and your Damage Reduction will be increased; when dealing damage to enemies, you gain Damage Increase. If no damage is dealt for a period of time, the blood gradually cools, and stamina cannot be recovered.",
    ["在还未获得\"厄水巨龟\"这个名号前，巨龟只是湖底一只普通巨龟，有自己的房子——一只乌龟竟然有自己的房子，你没看错！也难怪它特立独行，从不与鱼虾当伙伴。在自己的房里睡到自然醒，这是最幸福的事。\n直到某个清晨，刺眼的阳光和惹人生厌的游鱼打破了它的美梦。“谁在我家吵闹！”巨龟暴躁地扭动，却发现自己被坍塌的碎石埋了起来。那曾经温馨的小屋（现在是残骸）被它一夜之间膨胀的身躯挤破，如今显得狭窄而可怜。\n巨龟当然不知道这是丰饶之力惹的祸，它只知道自己失去了最爱的小房。从此，它开始四处宣泄暴涨的怒火，就有了人们口中的“厄水巨龟”。"] = "Before obtaining the title of \"Misfortune Water Giant Turtle,\" the giant turtle was just an ordinary giant turtle at the bottom of the lake, with its own house—a turtle actually having its own house, you read that right! No wonder it was a maverick, never partnering with fish or shrimp. Sleeping in its own house until it woke up naturally was the happiest thing. \n Until one morning, the blinding sunlight and annoying fish broke its sweet dream. \"Who is making noise in my house!\" The giant turtle twisted irritably, only to find that it had been buried by collapsed rubble. The once cozy little house (now a ruin) was squeezed by its body, which had expanded overnight, and now looked narrow and pathetic. \n The giant turtle, of course, didn't know this was the trouble caused by the power of Harvest; it only knew that it had lost its favorite little house. From then on, it began to vent its surging anger everywhere, and thus became the \"Misfortune Water Giant Turtle\" in people's mouths.",
    ["在这个世界，我们要承担责任，也要寻找生命的意义。能看出来，你在坚守学派的理念，守望人间的正义，但同时又有人性中的细腻和同情心。"] = "In this world, we must shoulder responsibilities and also seek the meaning of life. I can see that you are upholding the philosophy of the club, watching over justice in the world, but at the same time, you have the delicacy and compassion of humanity.",
    ["在这个古老的城镇中，人们将要举行一场热闹的庆典，为了庆祝领主的伟大统治。"] = "In this ancient town, people are going to hold a lively festival to celebrate the lord's great rule.",
    ["在这个喧嚣的世界里，人和灵都被烦恼折磨，被恐惧束缚，被秘密困扰。"] = "In this noisy world, people and spirits are tormented by worries, bound by horror, and troubled by secrets.",
    ["在这个城市里，只有怪物能活下去。只有怪物，能保护还剩下的人。"] = "In this city, only monsters can survive. Only monsters can protect those who are left.",
    ["在这个市场里，我的鱼是最划算的！"] = "In this market, my fish is the best value!",
    ["在这个故事里，"] = "In this story,",
    ["在这个时代，能信任的人越来越少，但正因如此，那些值得托付的关系才更显珍贵。"] = "In this era, there are fewer and fewer people to trust, but precisely because of this, those relationships worthy of entrustment are even more precious.",
    ["在这个混乱的时代，更需要一件武器来保护自己。"] = "In this chaotic era, one needs a weapon even more to protect oneself.",
    ["在这个神秘匮乏的时代，许多非凡材料已很少再出现。"] = "In this era of scarcity of the mysterious, many Beyonder materials rarely appear anymore.",
    ["在这么暗的地方画画？为什么不去娱乐室，至少那里有灯。"] = "Drawing in such a dark place? Why not go to the recreation room? At least there's light there.",
    ["在这些巨兽的遗骸前……我是什么？"] = "In front of the remains of these giant beasts... what am I?",
    ["在这儿干久了，看一眼就知道谁是来找乐的，谁是来找事的。"] = "After working here for a long time, one look is enough to tell who's here for fun and who's here for trouble.",
    ["在这儿还是维尔餐厅的时候，我父母常常领着我来吃饭。"] = "When this place was still the Will Restaurant, my parents often brought me here to eat.",
    ["在这呢。"] = "Here it is.",
    ["在这场棋局里，"] = "In this game of chess,",
    ["在这场神明的博弈中，你对世界的未来非常重要。"] = "In this game of gods, you are very important to the future of the world.",
    ["在这座城市的表象之下，隐藏着无数秘密，而我们便是那些追寻美丽与真实的人。"] = "Beneath the surface of this city, countless secrets are hidden, and we are those who pursue beauty and truth.",
    ["在这座城市，每一天都有新的机会诞生。"] = "In this city, new opportunities are born every day.",
    ["在这找人？找被你们弗萨克人害死的人吗？"] = "Looking for someone here? Looking for those killed by you Feysacians?",
    ["在这条非凡之路上，愿共享荣耀，共担危险。因爱相伴，直至永恒。"] = "On this extraordinary path, may we share glory and bear dangers together. Accompanied by love, until eternity.",
    ["在这次非凡事件中，你独自活下来，一定有特别之处，比如幸运。"] = "In this Beyonder incident, you survived alone; there must be something special about you, such as luck.",
    ["在这片土地上，你是我最后的玫瑰。"] = "In this land, you are my last rose.",
    ["在这片被恶意浸染的土地上，你需要一个锚点来找回自我。"] = "In this land soaked in malice, you need an anchor to find yourself again.",
    ["在这类事件中，我们只能尽全力去协助你们……但我们的动作快一点，说不定你们就能救下更多人。"] = "In events like this, we can only do our best to assist you... but if we act a little faster, maybe you can save more people.",
    ["在这里休息总不会被发现吧……"] = "I won't be discovered if I rest here for a while...",
    ["在这里你们可以叫我斯莉可，其实，我的笔名热可可是我家小狗的名字。"] = "You can call me Silly here. Actually, my pen name Hot Cocoa is the name of my puppy.",
    ["在这里你甚至能见到跳舞的卷毛狒狒。"] = "Here you can even see dancing curly-haired baboons.",
    ["在这里可以查看并切换报名的<Highlight>比赛轮次</>"] = "Here you can view and switch the <Highlight>Competition Rounds</> you have signed up for.",
    ["在这里可以查看更多玩法详情"] = "You can view more gameplay details here.",
    ["在这里可以查看玩法更多详情"] = "Click here to view more details about the gameplay.",
    ["在这里安静一会，你知道对岸那边最高的房子是哪儿那？"] = "Stay here for a while, do you know which is the tallest house on the other side of the bank?",
    ["在这里完成的作品可以装裱起来带回家，送给你的家人朋友，心动的话就快走进来拿起画笔吧。"] = "Works completed here can be framed and taken home to give to your family and friends. If you are interested, hurry in and pick up a brush.",
    ["在这里拍一张，可以和我说说你的想法。"] = "Take a picture here, and you can tell me your thoughts.",
    ["在这里每天都有太多这样的事情发生，而我们要做的是，帮他们找出真相"] = "Too many things like this happen here every day, and what we need to do is help them find the truth.",
    ["在这里添加一些<Highlight>订单</>。"] = "Add some <Highlight>Orders</> here.",
    ["在这里立下永恒的誓言。"] = "Make an eternal vow here.",
    ["在这里蒸汽与机械之神教会、黑夜女神教会和风暴之主教会是信仰的主流，还允许着大地母神教会传教，我想，包容是生产力强盛的标志。"] = "Here, the Church of the God of Steam and Machinery, the Evernight Goddess Church, and the Lord of Storms Church are the mainstream faiths. It also allows the Earth Mother Church to preach. I think tolerance is a sign of strong productivity.",
    ["在这里选择该轮比赛上场的<Highlight>投影</>，此外也可以选择由系统随机挑选<Highlight>投影</>上场"] = "Select the <Highlight>Projection</> to participate in this round of the competition here. You can also choose to have the system randomly select a <Highlight>Projection</> to participate.",
    ["在这里！"] = "Over here!",
    ["在这里！我在这里！"] = "Here! I'm here!",
    ["在这里，#CanMove工作#永无止境。"] = "Here, #CanMove work # is never-ending.",
    ["在这里，从来没有一个人夸奖过我的画，说不定贝克兰德的艺术评论家们会欣赏我的风格。"] = "Here, no one has ever praised my paintings. Perhaps the art critics in Backlund will appreciate my style.",
    ["在这里，每一座雕像都一模一样，或许这就是艺术。"] = "Here, every statue is exactly the same; perhaps this is art.",
    ["在这间屋子里四处再看看值得留意的线索吧。"] = "Let's look around this room for more clues worth noting.",
    ["在这页纸上烙下不容违逆的约定，公证人的注视将短暂提升你的非凡能力。"] = "Imprint an inviolable agreement on this page, and the Notary's gaze will briefly enhance your Beyonder abilities.",
    ["在这！我刚把它们包好。"] = "Here! I just finished wrapping them up.",
    ["在进行“神降”仪式时，你可以收集周围同样是愚者信徒的人们力量，通过仪式，将这些信仰的力量传达给“愚者”先生，帮祂稳固锚。"] = "When performing the 'divine descent' ritual, you can collect the power of those around you who are also believers of the Fool, and through the ritual, convey this power of faith to Mr. Fool to help Him stabilize His Anchor.",
    ["在进行“神降”仪式时，你可以收集周围同样是愚者信徒的人们力量，通过仪式，将这些信仰的力量传达给愚者先生，帮祂稳固锚。"] = "When performing the \"God Descent\" ritual, you can gather the power of those around you who are also believers of The Fool. Through the ritual, transmit the power of this faith to Mr. Fool to help Him stabilize His anchor.",
    ["在退出语音房间或离线后仍可<Popup_Yellow_2>保留语音房间</>，房主仍可<Popup_Yellow_2>保留房主身份</>；\n每个角色最多仅可拥有<Popup_Yellow_2>1个常驻语音房间</>；\n常驻语音房间可由房主主动解散，解散后<Popup_Yellow_2>无法恢复</>；\n单个道具可续时%s天，连续续时<Popup_Yellow_2>上限为%s天</>；\n常驻语音房间<Popup_Yellow_2>无法转让房主</>。"] = "You can still <Popup_Yellow_2>retain the voice room</> after exiting or going offline, and the room owner can still <Popup_Yellow_2>retain their ownership status</>; \neach character can own a maximum of <Popup_Yellow_2>1 permanent voice room</>; \npermanent voice rooms can be actively disbanded by the owner, and once disbanded, they <Popup_Yellow_2>cannot be recovered</>; \na single item can extend the duration by %s days, with a maximum continuous extension limit of <Popup_Yellow_2> %s days</>; \npermanent voice room <Popup_Yellow_2>ownership cannot be transferred</>.",
    ["在逃封印物"] = "Escaped Sealed Artifact",
    ["在邓恩<h>对面</>坐下"] = "Sit <h>opposite</> Dunn",
    ["在那个方向——就在奥尔斯纳街！"] = "In that direction—it's on Olsna Street!",
    ["在那个梦里，我成为了梦想中的自己，我去上了学，然后成为了大学教授……"] = "In that dream, I became the person I dreamed of being. I went to school, and then I became a university professor...",
    ["在那之前，你大概已经鼻青脸肿了。要试试吗？"] = "Before that, you'll probably already be bruised and battered. Want to try?",
    ["在那之后又发生了很多故事吧，戴莉女士有没有把那句话说出口，邓恩先生是不是一直那么别扭……"] = "Many stories must have happened after that, right? Did Lady Daly say those words, was Mr. Dunn always so awkward...",
    ["在那些书籍面前，我感觉自己像只卷毛狒狒。"] = "In front of those books, I feel like a Curly-Haired Baboon.",
    ["在那些冒险小说里，这就叫两位主角相遇了，历史的车轮开始滚滚向前。"] = "In those adventure novels, this is called the two protagonists meeting, and the wheels of history begin to roll forward.",
    ["在那边"] = "Over there.",
    ["在那边要注意安全，莉莉丝。"] = "Be safe over there, Lilith.",
    ["在那里。"] = "It's over there.",
    ["在那里，你应该称呼他为“伦纳德”先生。"] = "There, you should address him as Mr. Leonard.",
    ["在那里，我遇到了一个海盗打扮的女士，她告诉我进入镜中廷根的方法，也告诉我罗珊在安全屋。"] = "There, I met a lady dressed as a pirate, who told me how to enter Tingen in the Mirror, and also told me that Rozanne was in the Safe House.",
    ["在邦尼身边的舞阵中，跳出正确的舞蹈！"] = "Perform the correct dance in the dance formation around Bonnie!",
    ["在酒吧内打听到相应线索"] = "Gather relevant clues in the bar",
    ["在酒吧内搜寻所需物品"] = "Search for required items in the bar",
    ["在酒吧外面，出去找找看！"] = "Outside the bar, go out and look for it!",
    ["在重启前所有抽卡动画将被跳过"] = "All gacha animations will be skipped until restart.",
    ["在野外待久了，我先找个舒服的地方坐一坐。"] = "I've been out in the wild for too long, I'm just looking for a comfortable place to sit for a while.",
    ["在金秋湖指定位置进行拍照"] = "Take a photo at the designated location at Golden Autumn Lake",
    ["在金秋湖这种地方随便寄生，说不定哪天就变成满脑袋长满蘑菇的怪物了。"] = "Parasitism in a place like Golden Autumn Lake might turn you into a monster with mushrooms growing all over your head one day.",
    ["在铁十字街下街，不过那里的地理位置不错，临近水仙花街和金梧桐大道，生活也便利。"] = "It's on Lower Iron Cross Street, but the location is good, close to Daffodil Street and Golden Indus Avenue, and life is convenient.",
    ["在铁十字街指定位置进行拍照"] = "Take a photo at the designated location on Iron Cross Street",
    ["在铁路大亨-变幻远征中单局达成“铁路大亨-5阶”"] = "Achieve \"Railroad Tycoon - Tier 5\" in a single round of Railroad Tycoon - Changing Expedition",
    ["在铁路大亨-抉择之旅中单局达成“区域主理-1阶”"] = "Achieve \"Regional Manager - Tier 1\" in a single round of Railroad Tycoon - Journey of Choice",
    ["在铁路大亨-新手上路中单局达成“流动商人-1阶”"] = "Achieve \"Mobile Merchant - Tier 1\" in a single round of Railroad Tycoon - Novice Path",
    ["在铁路大亨-稳步进阶中单局达成“站点新贵-1阶”"] = "Achieve \"Station Upstart - Tier 1\" in a single round of Railroad Tycoon - Steady Progress",
    ["在铁路大亨-风险博弈中单局达成“铁路大亨-1阶”"] = "Achieve \"Railroad Tycoon - Tier 1\" in a single round of Railroad Tycoon - Risk Gambling",
    ["在铁路大亨中累计获得500000城堡资产"] = "Accumulate 500,000 in Castle assets in Railway Tycoon.",
    ["在铁路征程中成为一名精通交易的大亨，低买高卖，活用策略，满载而归！"] = "Become a tycoon proficient in trading during the railway journey, buy low and sell high, make good use of strategies, and return fully loaded!",
    ["在银片正反面雕刻古赫密斯语的“黑夜”作为咒文，再向女神祈祷即可完成。"] = "Engrave the 'Night' spell in Ancient Hermes on both sides of a silver piece, then pray to the Goddess to complete it.",
    ["在锁定目标的位置召唤巨剑剑阵，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点物理伤害。施法时获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。\n若自身处于<HighLight>输出形态</>，命中敌方后，为其附加<HighLight>6</>秒<HighLight>衰败</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>衰败</>\nbuffdisc(*id)，多次附加时长叠加，最多持续20秒。"] = "Summon a giant sword formation at the locked target's location, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) physical damage. Gain 1 Twilight Mark <HighLight></> upon casting. \n If in Offensive Stance <HighLight></>, hitting an enemy applies Decay <HighLight></> for 6 <HighLight></> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow> Twilight Marks </>\n strengthen the Finisher Skill <HighLight></> and Angry Slam <HighLight></>, up to a maximum of 6. \n<FaintYellow> Decay </>\n: buffdisc(*id), multiple applications stack duration, up to a maximum of 20 seconds.",
    ["在镜中廷根，我们明明很努力了，却还是救不了所有人，只能眼睁睁看着他们变成一道道洪流……"] = "In Tingen in the Mirror, we clearly tried our best, yet we still couldn't save everyone. We could only watch helplessly as they turned into streams of information...",
    ["在镜中廷根，我又听到噩梦中的那些声音……"] = "In Tingen in the Mirror, I heard those voices from the nightmares again...",
    ["在门廊煤油灯下，伦纳德神情专注地翻看诗集。"] = "Under the porch kerosene lamp, Leonard is focused on reading a poetry collection.",
    ["在附近<h>逛逛</>"] = "Stroll <h> around </> nearby",
    ["在附近寻找<P_Yellow>旅行尖碑</>，那是“魔术师”小姐的杰作。"] = "Look for the <P_Yellow>Travel Obelisk</> nearby, that is a masterpiece of Miss Magician.",
    ["在附近寻找声音来源"] = "Search for the source of the sound nearby",
    ["在附近生成一个可唤醒的残存记忆，购买时立刻生效"] = "Generate a wakeable lingering memory nearby, effective immediately upon purchase.",
    ["在限定时间内存活"] = "Survive within the time limit",
    ["在限定时间内解开机械迷局"] = "Solve the Mechanical Mystery within the time limit",
    ["在限定时间内，与<Highlight>相反命运的队友接触</>。"] = "Within the limited time, make contact with a teammate of <Highlight>opposite fate</>.",
    ["在限时内完成谜题。"] = "Complete the puzzle within the time limit.",
    ["在限时内收集足够的碎片！"] = "Collect enough fragments within the time limit!",
    ["在陵园深处、在墓钟之上，夜莺在唱歌，夜莺在徘徊。"] = "Deep in the mausoleum, above the cemetery bell, the nightingale is singing, the nightingale is wandering.",
    ["在障碍物后躲避强风，趁着间隙继续前进"] = "Hide behind obstacles to avoid strong winds, and continue forward during the gaps",
    ["在集体潜意识世界中，你又见到了那个醉汉，他需要你的帮助。"] = "In the collective subconscious world, you see that drunkard again; he needs your help.",
    ["在雪伦夫人的保险箱中找到一件黑色兜帽"] = "Found a black hood in Mrs. Sharon's safe",
    ["在霍纳奇斯山脉指定位置进行拍照"] = "Take a photo at the designated location in the Hornacis Mountain Range",
    ["在霍纳奇斯花海指定位置进行拍照"] = "Take a photo at the designated location in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
    ["在非凡世界要时刻保持警惕，尤其是在魔药消化和晋升的时候。"] = "You must always remain vigilant in the Extraordinary World, especially during potion digestion and advancement.",
    ["在非凡世界里，从来不存在真正意义上的“意外”，而是一个个精心谋划的“巧合”。"] = "In the Extraordinary World, there is no such thing as a true 'accident', but rather a series of carefully planned 'coincidences'.",
    ["在非凡世界里，对你最重要的是："] = "In the Extraordinary World, what is most important to you:",
    ["在非凡世界里，干扰占卜的手段有很多，而且特莉丝应该序列不低，这个等级的非凡者并不那么容易抓到。"] = "In the Extraordinary World, there are many ways to interfere with divination, and Trissy should be of a high Sequence. It is not easy to catch an Extraordinary of this level.",
    ["在非凡世界，真正安全的决策，永远是经过多次验证、谨慎判断后，自己选择踏上的那条路。"] = "In the Extraordinary World, the truly safe decision is always the path you choose to step on after multiple verifications and cautious judgment.",
    ["在非凡世界，诵念陌生的尊名很有可能召唤出未知的危险。除了正神的尊名，以及塔罗会同伴的尊名，你不可诵念其他尊名。"] = "In the Extraordinary World, chanting an unknown honorific name is very likely to summon unknown dangers. Except for the honorific names of true gods and companions of the Tarot Club, you must not chant other honorific names.",
    ["在非凡世界，诵念陌生的尊名很有可能召唤出未知的危险。除了正神的尊名，以及塔罗会同伴的尊名，你不可诵念其它尊名。"] = "In the Beyonder world, chanting an unknown honorific name is very likely to summon unknown dangers. Except for the honorific names of true deities and your companions in the Tarot Club, you must not chant any other honorific names.",
    ["在非凡力量的影响下，人的思维是疯狂和混乱的，但他可能潜意识认为，工厂就是安全的地方。"] = "Under the influence of extraordinary power, human thinking is crazy and chaotic, but he might subconsciously think that the factory is a safe place.",
    ["在非凡知识领域，它近乎全知。"] = "In the field of Beyonder knowledge, it is nearly omniscient.",
    ["在韦尔奇宅邸中探索"] = "Explore Welch's House",
    ["在韦尔奇家中探索"] = "Explore Welch's house",
    ["在颈间系一朵沉默的修辞，将心事折成永不凋零的花。"] = "Tie a silent rhetoric around your neck and fold your worries into a flower that never withers.",
    ["在风中会发出低频共鸣的超凡植物，可增强精神共振与仪式稳定性。"] = "An extraordinary plant that emits low-frequency Resonance in the wind, which can enhance mental resonance and ritual stability.",
    ["在马桶和盥洗盆的见证下，美女与野兽最终走到了一起。"] = "Witnessed by the toilet and the washbasin, the beauty and the beast finally came together.",
    ["在高原战中获得一次完胜"] = "Achieve a perfect victory in a Plateau Battle",
    ["在魔法、巫术、占星术等神秘知识上有着全面但初步的了解与掌握，懂得不少仪式魔法。"] = "Has a comprehensive but preliminary understanding and mastery of mysterious knowledge such as magic, witchcraft, and astrology, and understands many ritual magics.",
    ["在鲁恩王国的上流社会，对时尚的品鉴是身份与教养的象征。\n绅士淑女们对服饰有着苛刻追求——根据场合、身份与季节，搭配得体的服装，方能在社交圈中赢得尊重。\n通过品鉴挑战，展现你的审美，在上流圈声名鹊起。"] = "In the upper society of the Loen Kingdom, the appreciation of fashion is a symbol of status and upbringing. \n Gentlemen and ladies have strict requirements for clothing—matching appropriate attire according to the occasion, status, and season is the only way to win respect in social circles. \n Show your aesthetic through appreciation challenges and become famous in the upper circles.",
    ["在鲁恩王国的上流社会，对时尚的品鉴是身份与教养的象征。绅士淑女们对服饰有着苛刻追求——根据场合、身份与季节，搭配得体的服装，方能在社交圈中赢得尊重。通过品鉴挑战，展现你的审美，在上流圈声名鹊起。"] = "In the upper-class society of the Loen Kingdom, the appreciation of fashion is a symbol of status and upbringing. Gentlemen and ladies have strict requirements for clothing—matching appropriate attire according to the occasion, status, and season is the only way to win respect in social circles. Show your aesthetic through appreciation challenges and make a name for yourself in the upper circles.",
    ["在黑夜与诗歌之间，安魂诗社向你发出了安宁的呼唤。"] = "Between the night and poetry, the Requiem Poetry Society has sent you a call for peace.",
    ["在黑夜女神的教义中，女性和男性拥有一样的社会地位。她们被鼓励走出家门，女性也可以当警察。"] = "In the teachings of the Evernight Goddess, women and men have the same social status. They are encouraged to step out of their homes, and women can also be police officers.",
    ["在黑夜女神的见证下，{{player.name}}赠予{{targetPlayer.name}}一份珍贵的礼物。<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},2891473802\">[前往见证]</>"] = "Under the witness of the Evernight Goddess, {{player.name}} is giving {{targetPlayer.name}} a precious gift. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},2891473802\">[Go to Witness]</>",
    ["在黑夜女神的见证下，一场神圣的赠予仪式将在教会广场举行。<HighLight_L>%s</>赠予<HighLight_L>%s</>一份珍贵的礼物，欢迎共同见证"] = "Under the witness of the Evernight Goddess, a sacred gifting ceremony will be held in the church square. <HighLight_L>%s</> is gifting <HighLight_L>%s</> a precious gift, welcome to witness it together",
    ["在黑夜女神的见证下，一场神圣的赠予仪式将在教会广场举行。{{player.name}}赠予{{targetPlayer.name}}一份珍贵的礼物，欢迎共同见证。<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},2891473802\">[前往见证]</>"] = "Under the witness of the Evernight Goddess, a sacred gift-giving ceremony will be held at the Church Plaza. {{player.name}} is giving {{targetPlayer.name}} a precious gift; everyone is welcome to witness it. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},2891473802\">[Go to Witness]</>",
    ["在黑暗中寻找解除封印需要的古赫密斯语对应机关！"] = "Search for the mechanisms corresponding to the Ancient Hermes words needed to lift the seal in the darkness!",
    ["在黑暗中滑翔，用翅膀标记每一寸它飞过的领地。"] = "Gliding in the darkness, using wings to Mark every inch of the territory it flies over.",
    ["在黑板上写下名字"] = "Write your name on the blackboard",
    ["在黑气的剪影中，一个人扭曲地往后翻折，变成了一个巨大的狼人"] = "Within the silhouette of black energy, a person twisted and folded backward, turning into a giant werewolf.",
    ["在黑荆棘安保公司的案件档案中，记录着廷根市大大小小的非凡事件。作为黑荆棘的好员工、廷根市的好市民，守护城市安宁、解决危机事件，是你的日常任务。\n在值夜模式中，每日黑荆棘安保公司会开放不同的待处理事件：\n窥秘的角落：周一开放\n哀嚎黑市：周二/五开放\n黄金之罪：周三/六开放\n亡者疑踪：周四/日开放"] = "In the case files of Blackthorn Security Company, various Beyonder incidents in Tingen are recorded. As a good employee of Blackthorn and a good citizen of Tingen, protecting the city's peace and resolving crisis events are your daily tasks. \n In Nighthawk Mode, Blackthorn Security Company opens different pending events every day: \n A Corner of Mysteries: Opens on Monday \n Wailing Black Market: Opens on Tuesday/Friday \n Sin of Gold: Opens on Wednesday/Saturday \n Traces of the Dead: Opens on Thursday/Sunday",
    ["在黑荆棘醒来"] = "Wake up at Blackthorn",
    ["地上到处是残留的血迹……你一直在拿人喂这些南瓜？"] = "There are traces of blood everywhere on the ground... have you been feeding these pumpkins with people?",
