    ["地面很平整，无论这个非凡物品是什么形态，它都跑进了很深的地方。"] = "The ground is very flat; no matter what form this Beyonder item is, it has run into a very deep place.",
    ["地面有一些花纹，是仪式魔法的法阵？"] = "There are some patterns on the ground, is it a ritual magic array?",
    ["地面污秽"] = "Ground Filth",
    ["地面烟花"] = "Ground Fireworks",
    ["地面的文字"] = "Writing on the ground",
    ["地面的茶水"] = "Tea on the floor",
    ["地面血迹"] = "Bloodstains on the Ground",
    ["地鼠游戏"] = "Whack-a-Mole",
    ["场上会不断出现<Disable>污秽幼兽</>，幼兽出生时会在场上随机游荡。将幼兽血条清空后，玩家可使用<Disable>推动</>技能将幼兽向前方推出一定距离。若幼兽被推至咕噜身下，幼兽会被咕噜<Disable>吞噬</>，每次吞噬成功咕噜饥饿值都会降低。"] = "<Disable>Filthy Cubs</> will continuously appear on the field, wandering randomly when they spawn. After emptying a cub's health bar, players can use the <Disable>Push</> skill to push the cub forward a certain distance. If a cub is pushed under Gulu, it will be <Disable>devoured</> by Gulu, and each successful devouring will reduce Gulu's Hunger Value.",
    ["场上剩余僵尸数量大于3个，未能通过机制，团灭"] = "The number of remaining zombies on the field is greater than 3; failed to pass the mechanic, team wiped",
    ["场上剩余僵尸数量少于等于3个，成功通过机制"] = "The number of remaining zombies on the field is less than or equal to 3; mechanic successfully passed",
    ["场上剩余投影%s/%s"] = "Remaining Projections on Field %s/%s",
    ["场上每有1名携带“流血”的角色，异化猎犬造成的伤害提高10%，可叠加。"] = "For every character carrying \"Bleed\" on the field, the Alienated Hound's damage increases by 10%, stackable.",
    ["场上生成气息相连的双生果核，需同时击破。"] = "Twin Fruit Cores connected by aura will spawn on the field; they must be destroyed simultaneously.",
    ["场上生成气息相连的双生果核，需快速连续击破。"] = "Twin Fruit Cores connected by aura are generated on the field; they must be destroyed in quick succession.",
    ["场上目前剩余投影 %s/%s"] = "Remaining projections on field: %s/%s",
    ["场上间歇生成数柄污秽长枪，持续范围攻击。"] = "Several Filthy Spears are generated intermittently on the field, dealing continuous area damage.",
    ["场中跃击"] = "Field Leap Strike",
    ["场内被点名非凡者靠边放置污染法术场！"] = "Beyonders targeted in the arena, move to the edge to place the corrupted spell field!",
    ["场地中开始落下金色的音符雨，落到地面上后，玩家触碰到金色音符即可积累舞力值，<Disable>倒计时结束前</>积累满舞力值，即可获得<Disable>音乐屏障</>，否则狒哥将对玩家<Disable>巨量伤害</>。"] = "A golden note rain begins to fall in the field. After landing on the ground, players can touch the golden notes to accumulate dance power. Accumulate full dance power <Disable> before the countdown ends </> to gain a <Disable> Music Barrier </>; otherwise, the Baboon Brother will deal <Disable> massive damage </> to the players.",
    ["场地中心定位空气怪"] = "Center Positioning Air Monster",
    ["场地划分为<Disable>9个区域</>，每个区域出现真假投影，头顶气泡暗藏线索。<Disable>其中只有一个是反诈宣传的善意投影</>。"] = "The field is divided into <Disable>9 areas</>, each containing real and fake projections with clues hidden in the speech bubbles above their heads. <Disable>Only one of them is a benevolent projection promoting anti-fraud awareness</>.",
    ["场地时间特效"] = "Field time effect",
    ["场地费的事，我再向主教大人请示一下，你们先回去好好准备吧。"] = "Regarding the venue fee, I will consult the Bishop again. You should head back and prepare well for now.",
    ["场地边缘即将被污染，非凡者快回场地中央！"] = "The edge of the arena is about to be corrupted; Beyonders, return to the center quickly!",
