    ["坐秋千"] = "Sit on Swing",
    ["坐船遇到两百个恶灵，占坑"] = "Met two hundred Evil Spirits while taking a boat, occupying the spot.",
    ["坐落于廷根东侧的大学城，廷根大学与霍伊大学并列于此，让这座城市拥有了深厚的文化底蕴。"] = "Located on the east side of Tingen, the University District houses both Tingen University and Hoy University, giving this city a profound cultural heritage.",
    ["坐落于廷根郊外的五月庄园种满高大的苹果树，每年五月苹果花盛开，总会飘散出馥郁清新的果香。\n然而1354年至今，果香始终没有到来，取而代之的是猩红的月色，高大的树木，诡异的污染……种种异象，似乎都与知识皇冠有着脱不开的关系。 "] = "May Manor, located in the suburbs of Tingen, is planted with tall apple trees. Every May, when the apple blossoms bloom, a rich and fresh fruity fragrance always drifts out. \nHowever, since 1354, the fruity fragrance has never arrived. Replacing it is the scarlet moonlight, tall trees, and eerie corruption... Various strange phenomena seem to be inextricably linked to the Knowledge Crown.",
    ["坐落于廷根郊外的五月庄园种满高大的苹果树，每年五月苹果花盛开，总会飘散出馥郁清新的果香。\n然而1354年至今，果香始终没有到来，取而代之的是猩红的月色，高大的树木，诡异的污染……种种异象，似乎都与知识皇冠有着脱不开的关系。 \n\n<Notice>组队模式下和</><Highlight>家族</><Notice>成员一起进入副本，若未达到推荐非凡评分，可获得属性增益补正。补正效果与团队同家族成员数目和家族等级相关。</>"] = "May Manor, located in the suburbs of Tingen, is filled with tall apple trees. Every May, when the apple blossoms bloom, a rich and fresh fruity fragrance drifts through the air. \n However, since 1354, the fragrance has never arrived, replaced instead by a scarlet moonlight, towering trees, and eerie corruption... All these strange phenomena seem inseparable from the Crown of Knowledge. \n\n<Notice> Enter the dungeon in team mode with </><Highlight> Family </><Notice> members. If the recommended Beyonder rating is not met, you can receive attribute bonus adjustments. The adjustment effect is related to the number of family members in the team and the family level. </>",
    ["坐起来很舒适。\r\n伟大的发明，不错的马桶！"] = "It's comfortable to sit on. A great invention, a nice toilet!",
