    ["坦率的"] = "Frank",
    ["坦白地讲，我对自己能活着回来依旧感觉梦幻，依旧不敢相信自己能从<P_Yellow>苜蓿号的惨案</>中幸存下来……"] = "Frankly speaking, I still feel like I'm dreaming that I was able to return alive, and I still can't believe I survived the tragedy of the <P_Yellow> Clover </>...",
