    ["埃姆林·怀特曾向你炫耀过他那些人偶的华美服饰——每一件都堪称艺术品，每一件都价值不菲。而当你问起这些服饰从何而来时，他露出了一个神秘的笑容。去找埃姆林·怀特，或许，你也可以拥有 。"] = "Emlyn White once boasted to you about the magnificent outfits of his dolls—each one is a work of art, and each one is worth a fortune. And when you asked where these outfits came from, he revealed a mysterious smile. Go find Emlyn White; perhaps you can have one too.",
