    ["埃文医生"] = "Dr. Evan",
    ["埃文医生与霍克斯男爵关系变化异常"] = "The relationship between Dr. Evan and Baron Howkes changed abnormally",
    ["埃文医生亲眼看到仆人三点十分端茶去了卧室，仆人应该是最后一个接触霍克斯男爵的人。"] = "Dr. Evan saw the servant take tea to the bedroom at 3:10; the servant was likely the last person to have contact with Baron Hawkes.",
    ["埃文医生对霍克斯男爵的死亡表现得异常平静，毫不关心。"] = "Dr. Evan appeared unusually calm regarding Baron Hawkes's death and showed no concern.",
    ["埃文医生异常冷漠"] = "Dr. Evan is unusually cold",
    ["埃文医生很关心霍克斯男爵，但霍克斯男爵似乎并不信任他。"] = "Dr. Evan is very concerned about Baron Howkes, but Baron Howkes doesn't seem to trust him.",
    ["埃文医生表示，自己下午<InvHighlight>一直在大厅等待。</>\n霍克斯男爵患有严重的心脏疾病，最近病情明显恶化，还出现了被害妄想的症状。\n埃文医生在大厅等待期间，看到男爵夫人、管家和仆人先后前往卧室。\n其中，仆人是<InvHighlight>最后接触男爵</>的人。"] = " Dr. Evan stated that he had been waiting in the <InvHighlight> hall </> all afternoon. \n Baron Hawkes suffered from a serious heart disease, and his condition had clearly worsened recently, and he even showed symptoms of persecutory delusion. \n While waiting in the hall, Dr. Evan saw the Baroness, the butler, and the servant go to the bedroom one after another. \n Among them, the servant was the <InvHighlight> last person to have contact with the Baron </>.",
    ["埃文医生过去十分关心霍克斯男爵的身体状况，如今却对男爵的死亡表现得异常冷漠。"] = "Dr. Evan used to be very concerned about Baron Hawkes's health, but now he appears unusually indifferent to the Baron's death.",
    ["埃文医生，案件发生前你在干什么？"] = "Dr. Evan, what were you doing before the incident occurred?",
