    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 以无瑕之姿击溃<Chat_Highlight>\"剥面人”强尼</>  ，在这场较量中未受到一丝伤害。这片罪恶的心灵都市，在黑暗中见证了一次完美的落幕。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has defeated <Chat_Highlight>\"Face-Peeler\" Johnny</> with flawless grace, without taking a single point of damage in this contest. This sinful city of the mind has witnessed a perfect curtain call in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 以无瑕之姿击溃<Chat_Highlight>\"头狼\"鲁珀</> ，在这场较量中未受到一丝伤害。这片罪恶的心灵都市，在黑暗中见证了一次完美的落幕。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has defeated <Chat_Highlight>\"Alpha Wolf\" Rupert</> with flawless grace, without taking a single point of damage in this contest. This sinful city of the mind has witnessed a perfect curtain call in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 以无瑕之姿击溃<Chat_Highlight>“审判官”布莱克</> ，在这场较量中未受到一丝伤害。这片罪恶的心灵都市，在黑暗中见证了一次完美的落幕。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has defeated <Chat_Highlight>\"Blake, the Judge\"</> with flawless grace, without taking a single point of damage in this contest. This sinful city of the mind has witnessed a perfect curtain call in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 以无瑕之姿击溃<Chat_Highlight>“钻头”</>  ，在这场较量中未受到一丝伤害。这片罪恶的心灵都市，在黑暗中见证了一次完美的落幕。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has defeated <Chat_Highlight>\"Drill\"</> with flawless grace, without taking a single point of damage in this contest. This sinful city of the mind has witnessed a perfect curtain call in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 已将<Chat_Highlight>\"剥面人”强尼</> 的意志击垮。 这座罪恶的心灵都市，仍在黑暗中等待着下一位挑战者。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has broken the will of <Chat_Highlight>\"Face-Ripper\" Johnny</>. This sinful city of the mind is still waiting in the darkness for the next challenger.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 已将<Chat_Highlight>\"头狼\"鲁珀</> 的意志击垮。 这座罪恶的心灵都市，仍在黑暗中等待着下一位挑战者。 "] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has broken the will of <Chat_Highlight>\"Wolf Head\" Rupert</>. This sinful city of the mind is still waiting in the darkness for the next challenger.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 已将<Chat_Highlight>“审判官”布莱克</> 的意志击垮。 这座罪恶的心灵都市，仍在黑暗中等待着下一位挑战者。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has crushed the will of <Chat_Highlight>\"Blake, the Judge\"</>. This sinful city of the mind is still waiting for the next challenger in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了一切：{{player.name}} 已将<Chat_Highlight>“钻头”</> 的意志击垮。 这座罪恶的心灵都市，仍在黑暗中等待着下一位挑战者。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed everything: {{player.name}} has crushed the will of <Chat_Highlight>\"Drill\"</>. This sinful city of the mind is still waiting for the next challenger in the darkness.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了新的传奇：{{player.name}} 挑战<Chat_Highlight>\"剥面人”强尼</> 的所用时长已跻身历史前十。时间为之折服，让我们恭喜新的传说就此诞生。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed a new legend: {{player.name}}'s time taken to challenge <Chat_Highlight>\"Face-Ripper\" Johnny</> has reached the historical top ten. Time itself bows to this; let us congratulate the birth of a new legend.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了新的传奇：{{player.name}} 挑战<Chat_Highlight>\"头狼\"鲁珀</> 的所用时长已跻身历史前十。时间为之折服，让我们恭喜新的传说就此诞生。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed a new legend: {{player.name}}'s time taken to challenge <Chat_Highlight>\"Wolf Head\" Rupert</> has reached the historical top ten. Time itself bows to this; let us congratulate the birth of a new legend.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了新的传奇：{{player.name}} 挑战<Chat_Highlight>“审判官”布莱克</>的所用时长已跻身历史前十。时间为之折服，让我们恭喜新的传说就此诞生。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed a new legend: {{player.name}}'s time taken to challenge <Chat_Highlight>\"Blake, the Judge\"</> has reached the top ten in history. Time has been conquered by it; let us congratulate the birth of a new legend.",
    ["城市的暗面见证了新的传奇：{{player.name}} 挑战<Chat_Highlight>“钻头”</> 的所用时长已跻身历史前十。时间为之折服，让我们恭喜新的传说就此诞生。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed a new legend: {{player.name}}'s time taken to challenge <Chat_Highlight>\"Drill\"</> has reached the top ten in history. Time has been conquered by it; let us congratulate the birth of a new legend.",
