    ["基于伤害类型，忽视目标的物理格挡或魔法格挡，从而降低攻击被格挡的概率。穿刺超过目标的同类型格挡后，在一定范围内可以进一步降低攻击被格挡的概率直至必定不触发格挡。\n\n角色物理穿刺：{*d,F1690001,pPierce}\n角色魔法穿刺：{*d,F1690001,mPierce}"] = "Based on the damage type, ignores the target's physical block or magic block, thereby reducing the probability of the attack being blocked. After Pierce exceeds the target's same-type block, it can further reduce the probability of the attack being blocked within a certain range until it is guaranteed not to trigger a block. \n \n Character Physical Pierce: {*d,F1690001,pPierce} \n Character Magic Pierce: {*d,F1690001,mPierce}",
    ["基于伤害类型，抵消攻击来源物理暴击或魔法暴击，降低角色受到相应类型暴击伤害的概率（命中后的暴击率不会低于5%）。\n\n角色抗物理暴击：{*d,F1690001,pCritAnti}\n角色抗魔法暴击：{*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}"] = "Based on the damage type, negates the attack source's physical critical hit or magic critical hit, reducing the probability of the character receiving the corresponding type of critical damage (the critical hit rate after hitting will not be lower than 5%). \n \n Character Physical Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,pCritAnti} \n Character Magic Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}",
