    ["基本信息：1336年12月被遗弃在济贫院门口的孤儿，十岁左右自己从济贫院中离开，后行踪不明。"] = "Basic information: An orphan abandoned at the door of the poorhouse in December 1336, left the poorhouse on their own around the age of ten, whereabouts unknown afterwards.",
    ["基本操作"] = "Basic Operations",
    ["基本操作说明：\n· <Highlight>组件复制</>——选中组件后，点击鼠标中键。\n· 组件回收——将鼠标悬浮于组件上，按下F键。\n· 组件移动——将鼠标移动到组件上，点击左键开始移动。\n· 组件旋转——选中组件后，按下Q/E键。\n· <Highlight>连铺（地板/墙）</>——选中地板/墙后，按下鼠标左键并拖拽。"] = "Basic operation instructions: \n · <Highlight> Component Copy </> — After selecting a component, click the middle mouse button. \n · Component Recycle — Hover the mouse over the component and press the F key. \n · Component Move — Move the mouse to the component and click the left button to start moving. \n · Component Rotate — After selecting a component, press the Q/E keys. \n · <Highlight> Continuous Paving (Floor/Wall) </> — After selecting a floor/wall, press the left mouse button and drag.",
