    ["基础颜色8"] = "Base Color 8",
    ["基酒：\n● 冰原黑麦酒（弗萨克北境特产） —— 3份\n● 高纯度雪岭蒸馏烈酒 —— 2份\n香料与药草：\n● 冻原杜松子 —— 一小把（约12颗）\n● 极北苔藓浸液 —— 数滴\n● 冰霜薄荷叶 —— 3片\n● 熏烤橡木炭片 —— 少许\n秘制添加：\n● 蜂蜜糖浆（用于中和烈性） —— 半匙\n● 雪水融化液 —— 适量\n\n金秋湖，我的家乡。\n那里有老查克的酒馆， 有小柯莱的菜园， 有我熟悉的每一条路。\n以此旅行途中所得配方，献给老查克，实现我们的约定。\n——记于1284年秋天 帕利诺"] = "Base Liquor: \n● Icefield Rye Whiskey (Specialty of the Northern Feynapotter) — 3 parts\n● High-purity Snow Ridge Distilled Spirit — 2 parts\nSpices and Herbs:\n● Tundra Juniper Berries — A small handful (approx. 12)\n● Far North Moss Infusion — A few drops\n● Frost Mint Leaves — 3 leaves\n● Smoked Oak Charcoal Chips — A pinch\nSecret Additions:\n● Honey Syrup (to neutralize the harshness) — Half a spoonful\n● Melted Snow Water — Appropriate amount\n\nGolden Autumn Lake, my hometown.\nThere is Old Chuck's tavern, Little Cole's vegetable garden, and every road I am familiar with.\nI dedicate this recipe, obtained during my travels, to Old Chuck to fulfill our promise.\n—Written in the autumn of 1284, Palino",
    ["基酒：\n● 冰原黑麦酒（弗萨克特产） —— 3份\n● 高纯度雪岭蒸馏烈酒 —— 2份\n香料与药草：\n● 冻原杜松子 —— 一小把（约12颗）\n● 极北苔藓浸液 —— 数滴\n● 冰霜薄荷叶 —— 3片\n● 熏烤橡木炭片 —— 少许\n秘制添加：\n● 蜂蜜糖浆（用于中和烈性） —— 半匙\n● 雪水融化液 —— 适量"] = "Base Liquor: \n● Icefield Rye Whiskey (Feysac Specialty) — 3 parts \n● High-Purity Snow Ridge Distilled Spirit — 2 parts \nSpices and Herbs: \n● Tundra Juniper Berries — A small handful (approx. 12 berries) \n● Far North Moss Infusion — A few drops \n● Frost Mint Leaves — 3 leaves \n● Smoked Oak Charcoal Chips — A pinch \nSecret Additions: \n● Honey Syrup (to neutralize the harshness) — Half a spoonful \n● Melted Snow Water — A moderate amount",
    ["基里安"] = "Gillian",
