    ["塔索克鱼肉质鲜嫩，鱼刺又少，最适合高温油炸，再撒些孜然、迷迭香，外脆里嫩，焦黄可口，绝对好吃！"] = "Tussock fish is tender and has few bones, perfect for deep-frying. Sprinkle some cumin and rosemary, and it's crispy on the outside, tender on the inside, and golden brown—absolutely delicious!",
    ["塔索克鱼肉质鲜嫩，鱼刺又少，最适合高温油炸，再洒些孜然、迷迭香，外脆里嫩，焦黄可口，绝对好吃！"] = "Tussock fish is tender and has few bones, making it perfect for deep-frying. Sprinkle some cumin and rosemary on it, and it's crispy on the outside and tender on the inside, golden and delicious. Absolutely tasty!",
