    ["塔罗会居然有吸……有血族？！但“月亮”先生既然是塔罗会的成员，应该不会做出出格的行为吧？"] = "The Tarot Club actually has a vam... a Sanguine?! But since Mr. Moon is a member of the Tarot Club, he shouldn't do anything out of line, right?",
