    ["塔罗会讨论黑屏"] = "Tarot Club discussion black screen",
    ["塔罗会：每上阵<HighLight>1</>个塔罗会棋子，为全队提供独特属性，塔罗会可以获得额外增益。"] = "Tarot Club: For every <HighLight>1</> Tarot Club piece deployed, provide unique attributes to the entire team; Tarot Club units can gain additional buffs.",
