    ["塔罗学派"] = "Tarot Club.",
    ["塔罗学派1号BOSS"] = "Tarot Club Boss 1",
    ["塔罗学派2号BOSS"] = "Tarot Club Boss 2",
    ["塔罗学派3号BOSS"] = "Tarot Club Boss 3",
    ["塔罗学派“小灵通”，很高兴为您服务。"] = "Tarot Club 'Little Informant', happy to serve you.",
    ["塔罗学派中被“愚者”用灰雾封印的“屏障碎片”，蕴藏着“原初”造物主残留的力量——即九种不同领域的非凡力量。\n\n塔罗学派成员可以通过“密契仪式”，调整自己身心灵的状态，提升与“屏障碎片”中不同领域能力的契合程度，形成自己的“密契非凡觉醒”，增强自身各项非凡能力。\n\n但这种方式也蕴含着污染和风险。除了与自身非凡途径原本就契合的一个“密契领域”之外，每位非凡者还最多可以额外密契另一个领域。选择发展不同的“密契非凡天赋”，对相应领域能力的掌握也会有所不同。"] = "The \"Barrier Fragments\" sealed by \"The Fool\" with the gray fog in the Tarot Club contain the residual power of the \"Original\" Creator—that is, Beyonder powers from nine different domains. \n\n Tarot Club members can use the \"Mystic Rite\" to adjust their body, mind, and spirit, increasing their compatibility with the different domain powers in the \"Barrier Fragments\" to form their own \"Mystic Beyonder Awakening\" and enhance their various Beyonder abilities. \n\n However, this method also carries corruption and risks. In addition to the one \"Mystic Domain\" that is naturally compatible with their own Beyonder pathway, each Beyonder can additionally mysticize at most one other domain. Choosing to develop different \"Mystic Beyonder Talents\" will result in different levels of mastery over the corresponding domain's abilities.",
    ["塔罗学派会长"] = "President of the Tarot Club",
    ["塔罗学派学生"] = "Tarot Club student",
    ["塔罗学派屏障-愚者"] = "Tarot Club Barrier - The Fool",
    ["塔罗学派是一个尝试。我和我的同伴在某次航程中偶然发现了这个新的可能性。"] = "The Tarot Club is an attempt. My companions and I accidentally discovered this new possibility during a voyage.",
    ["塔罗学派是什么"] = "What is the Tarot Club?",
    ["塔罗学派是贝尔纳黛创建的用以学习进步的地方"] = "The Tarot Club is a place founded by Bernadette for learning and progress.",
    ["塔罗学派毫无疑问是个奇迹，我们的学员总是对探寻它的源头表现出浓厚的兴趣。"] = "The Tarot Club is undoubtedly a miracle, and our students always show a keen interest in exploring its origins.",
    ["塔罗学派的前身，就是在那艘船上建立的。"] = "The predecessor of the Tarot Club was established on that ship.",
    ["塔罗学派试炼区"] = "Tarot Club Trial Area",
    ["塔罗学院-戴里克-扇形点名-优先点T"] = "Tarot Academy-Derrick-Fan-shaped Targeting-Prioritize Tank",
    ["塔罗学院-戴里克-扇形点名-退化点任意敌人"] = "Tarot Academy-Derrick-Fan-shaped Targeting-Degraded Target Any Enemy",
    ["塔罗学院屏障-愚者"] = "Tarot Academy Barrier - The Fool",
    ["塔罗学院早就为你准备了晋升序列9的魔药，但是你梦境中的预兆还没有完全解密，我们不能让你贸然服食魔药。"] = "The Tarot Academy has long prepared the Sequence 9 potion for your advancement, but the omens in your dreams have not yet been fully deciphered. We cannot let you consume the potion rashly.",
    ["塔罗学院是什么"] = "What is the Tarot Academy?",
    ["塔罗学院是贝尔纳黛创建的用以学习进步的地方"] = "The Tarot Academy is a place founded by Bernadette for learning and progress.",
    ["塔罗学院的前身，就是在那艘船上建立的。"] = "The predecessor of the Tarot Academy was established on that very ship.",
    ["塔罗学院的学生，或多或少在自己的生活范畴内了解过非凡知识。"] = "Students of the Tarot Academy have, to varying degrees, learned about Beyonder knowledge within their own spheres of life.",
