    ["塔罗牌的第一张，象征新的开始和无限可能。"] = "The first Tarot card, symbolizing new beginnings and infinite possibilities.",
    ["塔罗牌阵"] = "Tarot Array",
    ["塔罗牌阵每次造成伤害时都会额外触发彩带爆炸，造成范围伤害。"] = "Every time Tarot Array deals damage, it additionally triggers a ribbon explosion, dealing area damage.",
    ["塔罗牌阵每次造成伤害时都会额外触发彩带爆炸，造成范围伤害。塔罗牌阵最后一击会击晕敌人。"] = "Each time Tarot Array deals damage, it additionally triggers a Ribbon Explosion, dealing area damage. The final hit of Tarot Array stuns enemies.",
    ["塔罗牌阵爆发伤害命中目标时召唤巨型塔罗牌从天而降，造成高额范围伤害，并在场地中存在1分钟。同一时间最多存在3张巨型塔罗牌。"] = "When Tarot Array burst damage hits a target, it summons a giant Tarot card to fall from the sky, dealing high area damage and remaining on the field for 1 minute. A maximum of 3 giant Tarot cards can exist at the same time.",
    ["塔罗牌阵爆发伤害命中目标时召唤巨型塔罗牌从天而降，造成高额范围伤害，并在场地中存在2分钟。同一时间最多存在3张巨型塔罗牌。"] = "When Tarot Array's burst damage hits a target, it summons a Giant Tarot Card to fall from the sky, dealing high area damage and remaining on the field for 2 minutes. A maximum of 3 Giant Tarot Cards can exist at the same time.",
    ["塔罗牌阵造成伤害时给目标附加一层愚弄标记。"] = "When Tarot Array deals damage, it applies one stack of Fooling Mark to the target.",
    ["塔罗玩法"] = "Tarot Gameplay",
    ["塔罗铸牌"] = "Tarot Card Casting",
    ["塔罗？<P_Heart>（塔罗牌好像也是那位罗塞尔大帝发明的，不知道跟地球的塔罗占卜有什么不同……）</>"] = "Tarot? <P_Heart>(Tarot cards seem to have been invented by that Emperor Roselle as well. I wonder how it differs from the Tarot divination on Earth...)</>",
