    ["填0代表所有"] = "Filling 0 means all.",
    ["填0时表示移除所有Tags符合的，大于0时表示从结果中随机移除指定数目。"] = "Filling 0 means removing all that match the Tags; greater than 0 means randomly removing the specified number from the results.",
    ["填1则无法被tab锁定。填0则不生效"] = "If set to 1, it cannot be locked by tab. If set to 0, it has no effect",
    ["填1则无法被攻击。填0则不生效"] = "Enter 1 to be unable to be attacked. Enter 0 for no effect.",
    ["填1拿最早的某类子实体；填0拿最晚的某类子实体\n\n更具体地：1、2、3；4 ....分别是最早的、第 2 早创建的实体、第 3 早创建的实体；最早创建....\n0、-1、-2；-3 ....；分别是最晚创建的实体、第 2 晚创建、第 3 晚；最晚创建…"] = "Fill in 1 to get the earliest sub-entity of a certain type; fill in 0 to get the latest sub-entity of a certain type \n \n More specifically: 1, 2, 3; 4... are the earliest, 2nd earliest, 3rd earliest created entities; earliest created... \n 0, -1, -2; -3...; are the latest created entity, 2nd latest, 3rd latest; latest created...",
    ["填1拿最早的某类子实体；填0拿最晚的某类子实体。\n更具体地：1、2、3；4 ....分别是最早的、第 2 早创建的实体、第 3 早创建的实体；最早创建....\n0、-1、-2；-3 ....；分别是最晚创建的实体、第 2 晚创建、第 3 晚；最晚创建…"] = "Fill 1 to get the earliest sub-entity of a certain type; fill 0 to get the latest sub-entity of a certain type. \n More specifically: 1, 2, 3; 4... are the earliest, 2nd earliest, 3rd earliest created entities; earliest created... \n 0, -1, -2; -3... are the latest, 2nd latest, 3rd latest created entities; latest created...",
