    ["士气等级分布：\n\n士气等级1：需要获得<Highlight>720资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>5%建筑压制、2%移动速度</>。\n\n士气等级2：需要获得<Highlight>1440资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>10%建筑压制、4%移动速度</>。\n\n士气等级3：需要获得<Highlight>2160资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>15%建筑压制、6%移动速度</>。\n\n士气等级4：需要获得<Highlight>2880资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>20%建筑压制、8%移动速度</>。\n\n士气等级5：需要获得<Highlight>3600资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>25%建筑压制、10%移动速度、1.5%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级6：需要获得<Highlight>5280资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>30%建筑压制、12%移动速度、3%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级7：需要获得<Highlight>6960资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>35%建筑压制、14%移动速度、4.5%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级8：需要获得<Highlight>8640资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>40%建筑压制、16%移动速度、6%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级9：需要获得<Highlight>10320资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>45%建筑压制、18%移动速度、7.5%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级10：需要获得<Highlight>12000资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>50%建筑压制、20%移动速度、9%途径压制与抵御</>。\n"] = "Morale level distribution: \n\nMorale Level 1: Requires <Highlight>720 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>5% building suppression, 2% movement speed</>. \n\nMorale Level 2: Requires <Highlight>1440 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>10% building suppression, 4% movement speed</>. \n\nMorale Level 3: Requires <Highlight>2160 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>15% building suppression, 6% movement speed</>. \n\nMorale Level 4: Requires <Highlight>2880 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>20% building suppression, 8% movement speed</>. \n\nMorale Level 5: Requires <Highlight>3600 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>25% building suppression, 10% movement speed, 1.5% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n\nMorale Level 6: Requires <Highlight>5280 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>30% building suppression, 12% movement speed, 3% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n\nMorale Level 7: Requires <Highlight>6960 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>35% building suppression, 14% movement speed, 4.5% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n\nMorale Level 8: Requires <Highlight>8640 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>40% building suppression, 16% movement speed, 6% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n\nMorale Level 9: Requires <Highlight>10320 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>45% building suppression, 18% movement speed, 7.5% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n\nMorale Level 10: Requires <Highlight>12000 resource points</>, increases all members of your faction by <Highlight>50% building suppression, 20% movement speed, 9% pathway suppression and resistance</>. \n",
    ["士气等级分布：\n\n士气等级1：需要获得<Highlight>725资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>2%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级2：需要获得<Highlight>1450资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>4%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级3：需要获得<Highlight>2175资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>6%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级4：需要获得<Highlight>2900资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>8%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级5：需要获得<Highlight>3625资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>10%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级6：需要获得<Highlight>4350资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>12%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级7：需要获得<Highlight>5075资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>14%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级8：需要获得<Highlight>5800资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>16%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级9：需要获得<Highlight>6525资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>18%途径压制与抵御</>。\n\n士气等级10：需要获得<Highlight>7250资源点</>，提升己方阵营全部成员<Highlight>20%途径压制与抵御</>。\n"] = "Morale Level Distribution: \n \n Morale Level 1: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 725 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 2% </>. \n \n Morale Level 2: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 1450 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 4% </>. \n \n Morale Level 3: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 2175 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 6% </>. \n \n Morale Level 4: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 2900 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 8% </>. \n \n Morale Level 5: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 3625 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 10% </>. \n \n Morale Level 6: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 4350 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 12% </>. \n \n Morale Level 7: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 5075 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 14% </>. \n \n Morale Level 8: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 5800 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 16% </>. \n \n Morale Level 9: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 6525 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 18% </>. \n \n Morale Level 10: Requires obtaining <Highlight> 7250 Resource Points </>, increases the Pathway Suppression and Resistance of all members in your faction by <Highlight> 20% </>. \n",
