    ["壳"] = "Shell",
    ["壳中的宇宙"] = "Universe in a Shell",
    ["处于<HighLight>输出形态</>时，buffdisc(*id)。\n处于<HighLight>防御形态</>时，buffdisc(*id)。\n在<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"26\">指定竞技玩法</>中使用防御形态时，减伤和伤害降低两个属性的数值会进行调整，并与周围敌方玩家数量动态相关：减伤最低2%，最高15%，伤害降低最低15%，最高25%，当敌方玩家数量越多时，自身减伤越高，同时伤害降低越高；其他被动属性不变。"] = "When in Offensive Stance <HighLight></>, buffdisc(*id). \n When in Defense Form <HighLight></>, buffdisc(*id). \n When using Defense Form in designated Competition <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"26\"></> modes, the values for Damage Reduction and Damage Increased are adjusted and dynamically related to the number of surrounding enemy players: Damage Reduction ranges from 2% to 15%, and Damage Increased ranges from 15% to 25%. The more enemy players there are, the higher your Damage Reduction and Damage Increased become; other passive attributes remain unchanged.",
    ["处于[金钱盾障]保护中， 减伤99%。需使用“乾坤一掷”打空虚弱条以击碎壁垒。"] = "Protected by [Money Shield], damage reduction 99%. Need to use \"Heaven and Earth Throw\" to empty the Weakness bar to break the barrier.",
