    ["夏绿蒂，1349年离世。\n照片上的年轻女孩穿着制铅厂的女工制服，笑得十分灿烂。很难想象，这样的孩子会得上歇斯底里症。"] = "Charlotte, passed away in 1349.\nThe young girl in the photo is wearing the uniform of a female worker at the lead factory, smiling very brightly. It is hard to imagine that such a child would suffer from hysteria.",
