    ["够了安杰拉，别再说了。那种经历我这辈子都不想再有了！"] = "Enough Angela, don't say any more. I don't want to have that kind of experience ever again in my life!",
    ["够了！你们两个合起伙来羞辱我！"] = "Enough! You two are colluding to humiliate me!",
    ["够了！你们两个废物！我要回间海郡娘家！"] = "Enough! You two losers! I'm going back to my mother's house in Midseashire!",
    ["够了！别再哭了！"] = "Enough! Stop crying!",
    ["够了！真的够了！黑暗够了，腐烂够了，被人当棋子使唤——也够了！"] = "Enough! That's really enough! Enough of the Darkness, enough of the rot, and enough of being used as a pawn!",
