    ["大世界中分布着奇异的石板。\n踏入踏板基座，向其持续注入并稳定自身的灵性。\n封印便会应声瓦解。"] = "Strange stone slabs are distributed throughout the world. \n Step onto the base of the slab and continuously inject and stabilize your own spirituality into it. \n The seal will then crumble.",
