    ["大多数人来这里是为了忘记……"] = "Most people come here to forget...",
    ["大多是值夜班的时候画的，他们喜欢打牌，我喜欢画画。"] = "Most of them were drawn while on the night shift. They like to play cards, and I like to draw.",
