    ["大学区教学楼"] = "University District Teaching Building",
    ["大学区教学楼入口"] = "University district teaching building entrance",
    ["大学区昆汀·科恩"] = "University District Quentin Cohen",
    ["大学区有午餐凭空消失的传闻，你调查后发现，犯事的是一只有非凡力量的小猫。它力量强大，但丢失了大部分记忆，只记得一抹果酸味。你答应帮它寻找记忆中的食物，在几位学生的帮助下，做出了它记忆中的果子汤。你追着记忆恢复的小猫，来到韦尔奇宅邸，听它叙述自己身为“不死者”的命运，与韦尔奇的相遇。无论如何，它会记得在大学城的过往，记得曾有过一名叫韦尔奇的友人。"] = "There are rumors in the University District of lunches vanishing into thin air. After investigating, you discover the culprit is a kitten with Beyonder powers. It is powerful but has lost most of its memories, remembering only a hint of fruit acidity. You agree to help it find the food from its memories, and with the help of several students, you recreate the fruit soup it remembers. You follow the kitten, whose memory is returning, to the Welch residence and listen to it recount its fate as an 'Undying' and its meeting with Welch. Regardless, it will remember its past in the University District and that it once had a friend named Welch.",
    ["大学区楼入口"] = "University District building entrance",
    ["大学区氛围"] = "University District Atmosphere",
    ["大学区氛围昆汀·科恩"] = "University District atmosphere Quentin Cohen",
    ["大学区谈恋爱"] = "University District dating",
    ["大学区赛艇队"] = "University District rowing team",
    ["大学和技术学校在此集聚，教育的光辉闪耀，知识的殿堂敞开。"] = "Universities and technical schools gather here; the brilliance of education shines, and the halls of knowledge are open.",
    ["大学城"] = "University District",
    ["大学城有片著名的野餐地，去那吃午餐吧。"] = "There is a famous picnic spot in the University District; go have lunch there.",
    ["大学城桥头脚踏车棕"] = "University District Bridgehead Bicycle (Brown)",
    ["大学城桥头脚踏车蓝"] = "University District Bridgehead Bicycle (Blue)",
    ["大学城桥头脚踏车黄"] = "University District Bridgehead Bicycle (Yellow)",
    ["大学城氛围增补"] = "University District Atmosphere Supplement",
    ["大学城的"] = "of the University District",
    ["大学城的观景拍照留念：\n坐落于廷根东侧的大学城，廷根大学与霍伊大学并列于此，让这座城市拥有了深厚的文化底蕴。\n年轻的学子们追求知识，汲取进步的时代理念。\n无尽的青春热情，催生出了无数飞扬的故事。"] = "University District Sightseeing Photo: \nLocated on the east side of Tingen, Tingen University and Hoy University stand side by side here, giving the city a profound cultural foundation. \nYoung students pursue knowledge and absorb the progressive ideas of the era. \nEndless youthful passion has given birth to countless soaring stories.",
    ["大学城站牌"] = "University District station sign",
    ["大学城至中央广场"] = "University District to Central Plaza",
    ["大学城跳舞"] = "University District dance",
    ["大学城门口"] = "University District Entrance",
    ["大学城马车夫"] = "University District Coachman",
    ["大学生"] = "University Student",
    ["大学生家教真划算。"] = "University student tutors are a real bargain.",
    ["大学的女孩子们正在进行占星……"] = "The girls from the university are performing astrology...",
    ["大学的宁静午后，被一声哀嚎打破——“我午饭呢？”"] = "The quiet afternoon at the university is broken by a wail—\"Where's my lunch?\"",
    ["大学面试"] = "University Interview",
    ["大家……小心……"] = "Everyone... be careful...",
    ["大家不能就这样躺在这里……我想把这里修成一座墓地，安葬大家，也安葬我自己。"] = "Everyone can't just lie here like this... I want to turn this place into a cemetery to bury everyone, and myself as well.",
    ["大家不要急，买丝瓜就可送丝瓜汤食谱，都来看看吧！"] = "Everyone, don't rush. Buy loofahs and you can get a loofah soup recipe, come and take a look!",
    ["大家伙，你叫什么名字？"] = "Big guy, what's your name?",
    ["大家停一停手上的活"] = "Everyone, stop what you are doing",
    ["大家在做什么呢"] = "What is everyone doing?",
    ["大家在做什么？"] = "What is everyone doing?",
    ["大家好~"] = "Hello everyone~",
    ["大家应该都去参加比赛了……"] = "Everyone should have gone to participate in the match...",
    ["大家快不行了，我去求救，然后我遇到了您，您带我找回了营地……啊，营地！我想起来了……"] = "Everyone was dying, so I went to get help. Then I met you, and you brought me back to the camp... Ah, the camp! I remember now...",
    ["大家是否有注意到，广场上的艺术家和巡警有很多女性，这在其他区域是不常见的。"] = "Has everyone noticed that there are many women among the artists and patrol officers in the square? This is not common in other areas.",
    ["大家生日快乐！我以国王的身份承诺 我们的王国会永远像今天一样"] = "Happy birthday, everyone! I promise as your King that our kingdom will always be like today.",
    ["大家生日快乐！我以国王的身份承诺 我们的王国会永远像今天一样 "] = "Happy birthday, everyone! I promise as your King that our kingdom will always be like today.",
