    ["大家都来我家玩吧，我家里还蛮大的。"] = "Everyone come to my house to play, my place is quite big.",
    ["大家都没事吧？"] = "Is everyone alright?",
    ["大家都知道，抽水马桶是罗塞尔大帝发明的，这种优雅的器具很快就取代了便壶，推广到整个世界。但弗兰奇公寓的盥洗室依旧恶臭拥挤，让人有呕吐的冲动，“拥有自己的盥洗室”是莫雷蒂家迫切想要搬家的原因之一。\n\n“而现在，我们拥有了自己的马桶！”莫雷蒂兄妹三人高兴地在水仙街2号里搬进搬出，四处欣赏。\n\n即使家具简陋，马桶上还有些细微的裂纹，但这是他们明亮温暖的新家。"] = "Everyone knows that the flush toilet was invented by Emperor Roselle, and this elegant appliance quickly replaced the chamber pot and was promoted throughout the world. However, the washroom in the Frankie Apartment remains foul-smelling and crowded, making one want to vomit; \"having our own washroom\" is one of the reasons the Moretti family is desperate to move. \n\n \"And now, we have our own toilet!\" The three Moretti siblings move in and out of 2 Daffodil Street happily, admiring everything. \n\n Even though the furniture is simple and there are fine cracks on the toilet, this is their bright and warm new home.",
    ["大家都站好 该拍照了！"] = "Everyone stand still, it's time for a photo!",
