    ["大概<P_Yellow>三点十分</>吧，仆人端着茶往卧室走，我还跟他打了招呼，他应该就是<P_Yellow>最后接触男爵</>的人。"] = "At about <P_Yellow> 3:10 </>, the servant went to the bedroom with tea. I even greeted him; he should be the <P_Yellow> last person to have contact with the Baron </>.",
    ["大概<P_Yellow>两分钟</>。我看着他<P_Yellow>吃下药</>，呼吸平稳了，才放心离开。他让我别打扰他，说等他好些了再来叫他。"] = "About <P_Yellow>two minutes</>. I watched him <P_Yellow>take the medicine</>, and his breathing stabilized before I felt relieved to leave. He told me not to disturb him and said he would call me when he felt better.",
    ["大概<P_Yellow>十分钟</>后，我去卧室送茶，那时埃文医生已经在客厅了，还跟我打了声招呼。"] = "About <P_Yellow>ten minutes</> later, I went to the bedroom to deliver tea. Dr. Evan was already in the living room and greeted me.",
    ["大概情况我已经清楚了，死者是凯蒂·斯蒂芬娜·比伯，55岁到60岁之间，寡妇。"] = "I have a general idea of the situation. The deceased is Katy Stephana Bieber, between 55 and 60 years old, a widow.",
    ["大概率废弃"] = "High probability of being discarded",
    ["大概率当场死亡，如果它们撑过去了，应该就能成为超凡生物，甚至还会变聪明。"] = "In all likelihood, it would die on the spot. If it managed to survive, it should become an extraordinary creature and might even become smarter.",
    ["大概等你有自己房子的时候吧。"] = "Probably when you have your own house.",
    ["大概要排多长时间才能轮到我呢？"] = "About how long will I have to wait for my turn?",
    ["大段不堪入目的文字"] = "A long passage of unspeakable text",
    ["大气污染治理法颁布以来，大批工厂倒闭，我们的日子越来越难过了。"] = "Since the promulgation of the Air Pollution Control Act, a large number of factories have closed down, and our lives have become increasingly difficult.",
    ["大气污染治理法颁布后，大批工厂倒闭，日子越来越难过。"] = "After the Air Pollution Control Act was promulgated, a large number of factories closed down, and life has become increasingly difficult.",
    ["大流士·"] = "Darius ",
    ["大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "A mad existence above the sea, strange lives are born under leather gloves. Every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in his experiments.",
    ["大海比陆地更危险，但也更……自由。"] = "The sea is more dangerous than the land, but it is also more... free.",
    ["大海真辽阔啊……"] = "The sea is so vast...",
