    ["大部分人只会向正神教会祈求……就算得不到启示，应该也不会有危险。"] = "Most people only pray to the Orthodox Churches... even if they don't receive a revelation, there shouldn't be any danger.",
    ["大部分狼人是危险的，至于吸血鬼，他们不喜欢被称作吸血鬼。"] = "Most werewolves are dangerous, and as for vampires, they don't like being called vampires.",
    ["大部分精神出了问题，还是习惯去教会，找教士们来解决。还有些他们解决不了的就来我们这了，当然还有一些只是疯癫就不用来我们这。"] = "Most people with mental issues are used to going to the Church to find priests to solve them. Others that they cannot solve come to us. Of course, some are just insane and don't need to come to us.",
