    ["失去的一切……我懂了，我体会到观众心里熊熊燃烧的激情和渴望了，这才是戏剧的真谛！"] = "Everything lost... I understand, I have experienced the burning passion and desire in the hearts of the audience. This is the true meaning of drama!",
