    ["失落的小丑"] = "Lost Clown",
    ["失落的技术、知识的呓语与精密的造物，理智与疯狂交织于此，穿过这扇门，直面那座斯蒂姆宫中强大的存在。"] = "Lost technology, the babbling of knowledge, and precise creations; reason and madness intertwine here. Pass through this door and face the powerful existence in that Steam Palace.",
