    ["夸张的肢体语言，戏剧性的情感表达。真相往往比戏剧更加荒诞。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "Exaggerated body language, dramatic emotional expression. The truth is often more absurd than drama. \nDuplicate acquisitions will be automatically decomposed into Bound Pounds ×100.",
