    ["奇怪的食人花"] = "Strange Man-Eating Flower",
    ["奇怪的鸟，它们聚在这里做什么？"] = "Strange birds, what are they doing gathered here?",
    ["奇怪，你最近运气不错，事业上还会有人帮忙。"] = "Strange, your luck has been quite good lately, and someone will even help you in your career.",
    ["奇怪，刚才我为什么这么焦虑？"] = "Strange, why was I so anxious just now?",
    ["奇怪，占卜的指引到这里就结束了？"] = "Strange, does the divination guidance end here?",
    ["奇怪，塔罗里没有这种牌，可能是谁把其他牌混杂进来了，稍后我们可以重新抽一张……"] = "Strange, this card isn't in the Tarot deck. Perhaps someone mixed in other cards. We can draw another one later...",
    ["奇怪，妈妈明明说了不会有人拒绝我的……"] = "Strange, Mom clearly said no one would refuse me...",
    ["奇怪，库克为什么看起来心神不定，用灵视看看吧。"] = "Strange, why does Cook look restless? Let's take a look with spirit vision.",
    ["奇怪，怎么没人？"] = "Strange, why is no one here?",
    ["奇怪，怎么突然不接受支票了？"] = "Strange, why did they suddenly stop accepting checks?",
    ["奇怪，我刚刚为什么还在工作，现在明明是休息时间。"] = "Strange, why was I working just now when it's clearly rest time?",
    ["奇怪，我记得原来节目单上一直有狒狒表演……这次怎么没了？"] = "Strange, I remember there was always a baboon performance on the program... Why is it gone this time?",
    ["奇怪，明明之前聊这些能提神的，怎么现在越聊越困……"] = "Strange, I used to be refreshed by chatting about these things, but why am I getting sleepier the more we talk...",
    ["奇怪，明明放口袋里的……"] = "Strange, I could have sworn I put it in my pocket...",
    ["奇怪，照片里的地方好像都变了样……"] = "Strange, the places in the photos all seem to have changed...",
    ["奇怪，照片里的地方好像都变了样儿……"] = "Strange, the places in the photos all seem to have changed...",
    ["奇怪，猎物的气息……消失了……"] = "Strange, the prey's scent... has disappeared...",
    ["奇怪，现在正是这种果子成熟的季节……是谁告诉我的？"] = "Strange, this is the season for these fruits to ripen... who told me that?",
    ["奇怪，这个时候了，还有谁在文献室？"] = "Strange, at this hour, who is still in the archives?",
    ["奇怪，这些信封都好旧啊，看起来像被丢在这里很久了。"] = "Strange, these envelopes are all so old; they look like they've been left here for a long time.",
    ["奇怪，这里为什么……"] = "Strange, why is this place...",
