    ["奇迹牌雨"] = "Miracle Card Rain",
    ["奇迹牌雨80%概率可再次使用，该效果2秒内无法触发第二次。"] = "Miracle Card Rain has an 80% chance to be used again; this effect cannot trigger a second time within 2 seconds.",
    ["奇迹牌雨80%概率可再次使用，该效果2秒内无法触发第二次。奇迹牌雨击晕能力强化。"] = "Miracle Card Rain has an 80% chance to be used again; this effect cannot trigger a second time within 2 seconds. Miracle Card Rain stun ability strengthened.",
    ["奇迹牌雨命中目标时召唤巨型塔罗牌从天而降，造成高额范围伤害，并在场地中存在1分钟。同一时间最多存在3张巨型塔罗牌。"] = "When Miracle Card Rain hits a target, it summons a giant Tarot card to fall from the sky, dealing high area damage and remaining on the field for 1 minute. A maximum of 3 giant Tarot cards can exist at the same time.",
    ["奇迹牌雨命中目标时召唤巨型塔罗牌从天而降，造成高额范围伤害，并在场地中存在2分钟。同一时间最多存在3张巨型塔罗牌。"] = "When Miracle Card Rain hits a target, it summons a Giant Tarot Card to fall from the sky, dealing high area damage and remaining on the field for 2 minutes. A maximum of 3 Giant Tarot Cards can exist at the same time.",
    ["奇迹的城堡"] = "Miraculous Castle",
    ["奇迹的寓所"] = "Miracle Dwelling",
    ["奇迹真的发生了！之前的实验数据怎么都不合格，这次一下就成功了！"] = "A miracle has really happened! The previous experimental data was never qualified, but this time it succeeded all at once!",
