    ["奈拉"] = "Naira",
    ["奈拉小姐揉眉心是因为里特恩太烦人，不是我。 "] = "Miss Naila rubbing her brow is because Ritten is annoying, not me.",
    ["奈拉小姐曾亲口说过“这座奢靡城市的一切气味都可以被明码标价，供那些俗人攀比取乐，唯独我与她的那一支不行“。"] = "Miss Naila once said, 'Every scent in this extravagant city can be priced and used by those vulgar people to compare and amuse themselves, except for that one of hers and mine.'",
    ["奈拉小姐的调香手艺究竟是跟谁学的呢？"] = "Who exactly did Miss Naila learn her perfumery skills from?",
    ["奈拉小姐私人起居室里的那种香气可真好闻，为何她不把那种香水摆上店里的橱窗呢？"] = "The scent in Miss Naila's private living quarters is so good, why doesn't she put that perfume in the shop's display window?",
    ["奈拉小姐说，\"他只是来闻一闻旧事\"……这位先生一定有难以忘却的记忆吧。"] = "Miss Naila says, \"He is just here to smell the past\"... This gentleman must have some unforgettable memories.",
    ["奈拉小姐身上的香气可真好闻，她为何不把那种香水摆上橱窗出售呢？"] = "The fragrance on Miss Naila is so pleasant, why doesn't she put that kind of perfume on the shelf for sale?",
    ["奈拉小姐，您的香水只有我新购入的联排别墅才配得上！只要您点点头，香水价格随您开。"] = "Miss Naila, your perfume is only worthy of the townhouse I just purchased! As long as you nod, you can name your price for the perfume.",
    ["奈拉小姐，我全要了——这整间店里的香水。"] = "Miss Naila, I'll take them all—every perfume in this shop.",
    ["奈拉，白鸢尾在开春时最香，那封信应该已经送到你手上了吧？"] = "Naira, the white irises are at their most fragrant in early spring. That letter should have reached your hands by now, right?",
    ["奈特"] = "Knight",
    ["奈特喜欢偷东西，他不缺钱，他是心理因素没法管住手，不过他承诺偷到手玩几天再给人送回去……"] = "Knight likes to steal things. He's not short of money; it's a psychological issue where he can't control his hands, but he promises to steal it, play with it for a few days, and then send it back...",
    ["奈特移动路径"] = "Knight Movement Path",
