    ["奉献碑解锁_黑夜"] = "Unlock Monument of Devotion_Night",
    ["奉献至少%d（<Orange>%d</>/%d）组材料，花费<Orange>%d</>%s领取奉献赠礼。提交全部%s组物资可以获得额外奖励。"] = "Offer at least %d (<Orange>%d</>/%d) sets of materials, spend <Orange>%d</>%s to claim the offering gift. Submit all %s sets of supplies to receive extra rewards.",
    ["奉献至少%d（<Orange>%d</>/%d）组材料，花费<Orange>10</>活力领取奉献赠礼。\n提交全部4组物资可以获得额外奖励。"] = "Contribute at least %d (<Orange>%d</>/%d) sets of materials and spend <Orange>10</> Vitality to claim the contribution gift. \nSubmit all 4 sets of supplies to receive extra rewards.",
    ["奉献赠礼"] = "Offer Gift",
    ["奉行我主的意志，将魔狼驱逐！"] = "Carrying out the will of my Lord, drive away the Demon Wolf!",
    ["奋力挥出铁壁，清理前方的障碍物。"] = "Swing the Iron Wall with force to clear obstacles in front.",
    ["奋勇当先的人， 为俱乐部默默奔走的人， 在关键时刻挺身而出的人——\n贡献足够，名字便会出现在这里。 贡献不再，也可能悄然离去。\n光晕公平，一如灰雾之上的目光。"] = "Those who forge ahead, those who work silently for the Club, those who step up at critical moments—\n if the contribution is sufficient, the name will appear here. If the contribution is no longer there, it may quietly leave. \n The radiance is fair, just like the gaze above the gray fog.",
