    ["奏响吧！巨人的战歌响彻王庭！"] = "Sound the call! Let the giants' war song echo through the King's Court!",
    ["契灵鸟的尾羽"] = "Tail Feather of a Spirit-Contract Bird",
    ["契约在这儿，两个都在，别再让我看到你们了！"] = "The contract is here, both of them are here, don't let me see you two again!",
    ["契约灵界后生长的特殊果实，蕴含光与灵界之间的稳定联系。"] = "A special fruit grown after contracting with the Spirit World, containing a stable connection between light and the Spirit World.",
