    ["奥赛库斯集中烈阳之力，在场地上召唤两个法阵积蓄光能。如果让法阵充分蓄能会<Disable>对全团造成巨额伤害</>，如果有人在法阵中阻止蓄能，则会<Disable>使灭团伤害削弱为分摊伤害</>。"] = "Alista concentrates the power of the Blazing Sun and summons two magic circles on the field to accumulate light energy. If the magic circles are allowed to fully charge, they will <Disable>deal massive damage to the entire raid</>. If someone stands in the magic circle to stop the charging, it will <Disable>reduce the wipe-out damage to shared damage</>.",
    ["奥起身"] = "Ao stands up",
    ["奥黛丽"] = "Audrey",
    ["奥黛丽-1星"] = "Audrey - 1 Star",
    ["奥黛丽-2星"] = "Audrey - 2 Star",
    ["奥黛丽-3星"] = "Audrey - 3 Star",
    ["奥黛丽1"] = "Audrey 1",
    ["奥黛丽2"] = "Audrey 2",
    ["奥黛丽4"] = "Audrey 4",
    ["奥黛丽·投影"] = "Audrey Projection",
    ["奥黛丽·接任务"] = "Audrey·Accept Quest",
    ["奥黛丽·霍尔"] = "Audrey Hall",
    ["奥黛丽·霍尔的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Audrey Hall, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["奥黛丽·霍尔的忠实伙伴，本来只是普通的金毛猎犬，因意外误食魔药成为非凡生物。"] = "A loyal partner of Audrey Hall. Originally just an ordinary golden retriever, it became a Beyonder creature after accidentally consuming a potion.",
    ["奥黛丽·霍尔的来信"] = "A Letter from Audrey Hall",
    ["奥黛丽·霍尔，一颗足以照亮整个时代的宝石。\n她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。\n\n善良，于她而言，从不意味着一腔热泪的挥洒，而是洞察之后清醒的选择。运用贵族的影响力，她在错综复杂的世界棋盘中，为一枚枚卒子争取喘息之机。\n正义，于她而言，并非手持天秤的冰冷女神，而是诊断社会病灶的敏锐，开具疗愈处方的智慧，是她在末日来临前狂风巨浪中，为心灵提供一方稳定甲板的勇敢。\n\n她的善良，是看清生活本质后，依旧热爱自己的家人。她的正义，是深知黑暗后，依旧织补人性的梦网。以凡人之心灵，驾驭神明之权柄；以不泯的善意，锚定观众的视角。\n\n“我凝视深渊，亦凝视深渊中每一种心灵。\n不使自己坠落，亦不使凝视沦为冷漠。\n我是观众，亦在剧中——\n在命运的舞台灯光之外，\n为所有应当美好的情节，\n守住一盏永不挪移的、温暖而清醒的灯。”"] = "Audrey Hall, a gem capable of illuminating an entire era. \n Her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable. \n\n Kindness, to her, never meant the shedding of hot tears, but a clear choice after insight. Using the influence of the nobility, she strives for breathing room for every pawn on the complex chessboard of the world. \n Justice, to her, is not a cold goddess holding scales, but the keenness to diagnose social ills, the wisdom to prescribe healing, and the courage to provide a stable deck for the soul amidst the raging storms before the apocalypse. \n\n Her kindness is to still love her family after seeing the essence of life. Her justice is to still weave the dream net of humanity after knowing the darkness. With a mortal heart, she wields the authority of a god; with unextinguished goodwill, she anchors the perspective of a Spectator. \n\n \"I gaze into the abyss, and I also gaze into every kind of soul within the abyss. \n Not letting myself fall, nor letting the gaze turn into indifference. \n I am a Spectator, and I am also in the play—\n Outside the stage lights of fate, \n For all the plots that should be beautiful, \n Guarding a warm and clear lamp that never moves.\"",
    ["奥黛丽下午茶"] = "Audrey's Afternoon Tea",
    ["奥黛丽为目标友方回复*d点生命值，并为目标友方附加<FaintYellow>审视</>效果，持续<HighLight>4</>秒，记录<HighLight>4</>秒内受到的伤害，在效果结束时，根据效果期间所受的伤害的<HighLight>40%</>回复生命值。"] = "Audrey restores *d health to the target ally and applies a <FaintYellow> Scrutiny </> effect for <HighLight> 4 </> seconds, recording damage taken within <HighLight> 4 </> seconds and restoring health based on <HighLight> 40% </> of the damage taken during the effect when it ends.",
    ["奥黛丽为目标友方附加<FaintYellow>审视</>效果，一定时间内记录伤害，时间结束后按照一定比例回复生命值。"] = "Audrey applies the <FaintYellow>Scrutiny</> effect to the target ally, recording damage for a certain period and restoring Health based on a percentage after the time ends.",
    ["奥黛丽为目标友方附加<FaintYellow>审视</>效果，持续4秒，记录<HighLight>4</>秒内受到的伤害，在效果结束时，根据效果期间所受的伤害的<HighLight>40%</>回复生命值。"] = "Audrey applies a <FaintYellow> Scrutiny </> effect to the target ally for 4 seconds, recording damage taken within <HighLight> 4 </> seconds and restoring health based on <HighLight> 40% </> of the damage taken during the effect when it ends.",
    ["奥黛丽低头"] = "Audrey lowers her head",
    ["奥黛丽写的纸"] = "Paper written by Audrey",
    ["奥黛丽出场CS触发区域"] = "Audrey Entrance CS Trigger Area",
    ["奥黛丽前往通道"] = "Audrey heads to the passage",
    ["奥黛丽向前"] = "Audrey moves forward",
    ["奥黛丽坐椅子"] = "Audrey sits on chair",
    ["奥黛丽复活点"] = "Audrey Resurrection Point",
    ["奥黛丽大门"] = "Audrey gate",
    ["奥黛丽小姐每隔一段时间会去命运咖啡厅享用下午茶，现在去咖啡厅，也许能偶遇她。"] = "Miss Audrey goes to the Fate Café for afternoon tea every so often; if you go there now, you might run into her.",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，为什么苏茜女士会说话呢？它……是神奇生物吗？"] = "Miss Audrey, why can Ms. Susie talk? Is she... a Beyonder creature?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，听说您是鲁恩慈善助学基金会的创始人？您是如何走上慈善事业的呢？"] = "Miss Audrey, I heard you are the founder of the Loen Charity Scholarship Foundation? How did you embark on the path of charity?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，听说非凡世界里存在狼人、吸血鬼？"] = "Ms. Audrey, I heard that werewolves and vampires exist in the Extraordinary World?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，您在现实世界的身份是一位心理医生？"] = "Miss Audrey, is your identity in the real world a psychologist?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，您最喜欢吃什么，有推荐吗？"] = "Miss Audrey, what do you like to eat most? Do you have any recommendations?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，您有尊名吗？如果我想向您祈求帮助，应该诵念什么呢？"] = "Miss Audrey, do you have a title? If I want to pray to you for help, what should I chant?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，您能讲讲扇语的具体含义吗？我在报纸上读到，很感兴趣。"] = "Ms. Audrey, can you tell me the specific meanings of fan language? I read about it in the newspaper and am very interested.",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，我听说你还是鲁恩慈善助学基金的理事。"] = "Miss Audrey, I heard that you are also a director of the Loen Charity Fund.",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，我知道您是贵族，您对鲁恩的历史一定很了解吧？"] = "Ms. Audrey, I know you are a noble, you must know a lot about Loen's history, right?",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，谢谢你之前赠予我的钱。"] = "Miss Audrey, thank you for the money you gave me before.",
    ["奥黛丽小姐，除了家族财产，你还自己投资吗？"] = "Miss Audrey, besides family property, do you invest yourself?",
