    ["奥黛丽（客）"] = "Audrey (Guest)",
    ["奥黛丽：不是邦尼的副手，而是她为了成为女巫，亲手抛弃的“人性”。"] = "Audrey: Not Bonnie's deputy, but the 'humanity' she discarded herself in order to become a Witch.",
    ["奥黛丽：伟大的“愚者”先生，也曾在这里生活。\n-小资咖啡\n窗外阳光正好，临街咖啡桌几对、情侣正在交谈。\n佛尔思和休坐一起，盯着眼前一块蛋糕，桌上放红酒。"] = "Audrey: The great Mr. Fool also lived here once. \n-Bourgeois Cafe \nThe sun is shining brightly outside the window; several couples are chatting at cafe tables by the street. \nFors and Xio sit together, staring at a piece of cake in front of them, with red wine on the table.",
    ["奥黛丽：她的善良……她的软弱……她的曾经。"] = "Audrey: Her kindness... her weakness... her past.",
    ["奥黛丽：守护莉莉，便可削弱邦尼和镜子之间的连接。"] = "Audrey: Protecting Lily will weaken the connection between Bonnie and the mirror.",
    ["奥黛丽：看，那就是莉莉。"] = "Audrey: Look, that is Lily.",
    ["奥黛丽：那份“保护”意志……那枚徽章的力量……现在回应你了。"] = "Audrey: That will to \"protect\"... the power of that badge... is responding to you now.",
    ["奥？你也想加入这场疯狂的抢夺吗？"] = "Oh? Do you also want to join this crazy scramble?",
    ["女"] = "Female",
    ["女主人"] = "Mistress",
    ["女主人离开后，有一个人进入房间，给男爵续了茶。这个人，恐怕就是制造密室的凶手。"] = "After the hostess left, someone entered the room and refilled the Baron's tea. This person is likely the culprit who created the locked-room mystery.",
    ["女主人离开后，谁有可能作案?"] = "After the hostess left, who could have committed the crime?",
    ["女主演蒙巴顿小姐的崇拜者或许没钱买三等票，但能偷一张孤零零的海报？他们的敏捷能让市政厅卫兵都自愧不如！"] = "The admirers of the lead actress, Miss Mountbatten, might not have the money to buy a third-class ticket, but to steal a lonely poster? Their agility would make the City Hall guards feel inferior!",
    ["女乘客"] = "Female passenger",
    ["女人"] = "Woman",
    ["女人的声音"] = "Woman's Voice",
    ["女人的雕像，技艺高超，栩栩如生。"] = "A statue of a woman, highly skilled, lifelike.",
    ["女仆"] = "Maid",
    ["女仆(已废弃）"] = "Maid (Deprecated)",
    ["女仆--贝拉"] = "Maid - Bella",
