    ["女孩向你道谢后，安静地转身离去。"] = "After thanking you, the girl turns and walks away quietly.",
    ["女孩吹着古怪的笛子，像是白骨做的，灵们听见声音就会迷失……"] = "The girl was blowing a strange flute, it looked like it was made of bone, spirits would get lost upon hearing the sound...",
    ["女孩捧着那块太阳，感受它的温度，记住它的模样。"] = "The girl held the piece of the sun, felt its warmth, and remembered its appearance.",
    ["女孩服下了宁静药剂，身体仍痛苦地颤抖着。"] = "The girl took the Tranquility Draught, her body still trembling in pain.",
