    ["好友列表"] = "Friend List",
    ["好友同框"] = "Friend Photo Frame",
    ["好友同框：\n与好友的好感度达到「灵性触碰」后，可邀请其进入展台。\n初始可邀请4名好友进入展台。\n随着风尚度提升，可邀请人数上限将逐步增加：\n风尚度达到20000时，上限提升至5名；\n风尚度达到50000时，上限提升至6名；\n风尚度达到100000时，上限提升至8名。\n\n挚友特权：\n与好友的好感度达到「结伴同行」后，即可解锁挚友特权。挚友特权将不占用邀请好友的数量，最多可有4名玩家同时享有挚友特权。"] = "Friend Frame: \nOnce your favorability with a friend reaches \"Spirituality Touch,\" you can invite them to the display stand. \nInitially, you can invite 4 friends to the display stand. \nAs your Fashion Level increases, the limit on the number of people you can invite will gradually increase: \nWhen Fashion Level reaches 20,000, the limit increases to 5; \nWhen Fashion Level reaches 50,000, the limit increases to 6; \nWhen Fashion Level reaches 100,000, the limit increases to 8. \n\nBest Friend Privilege: \nOnce your favorability with a friend reaches \"Companionship,\" you can unlock the Best Friend Privilege. Best Friend Privilege does not occupy the number of invited friends, and up to 4 players can enjoy the Best Friend Privilege at the same time.",
    ["好友和俱乐部成员查看配装"] = "View Equipment of Friends and Club Members",
    ["好友已离线，语音通话自动结束"] = "Friend is offline; voice call automatically ended.",
    ["好友度"] = "Friendship Level",
    ["好友弹条"] = "Friend Pop-up",
    ["好友成双"] = "Friends in Pairs",
    ["好友成双+"] = "Friends in Pairs+",
    ["好友成双+：攻击速度+25%、防御+25%"] = "Friends in Pairs+: Attack Speed +25%, Defense +25%",
    ["好友成双：攻击速度+15%、防御+15%"] = "Friends in Pairs: Attack Speed +15%, Defense +15%",
    ["好友或俱乐部成员"] = "Friends or Club Members",
    ["好友推荐"] = "Friend Recommendation",
    ["好友推荐功能故障，暂不可用，请您耐心等待片刻。"] = "Friend recommendation function malfunction; temporarily unavailable. Please wait a moment.",
    ["好友数量不足，无法修炼该技能"] = "Insufficient number of friends to cultivate this skill.",
