    ["好友管理功能故障，暂不可用，请您耐心等待片刻。"] = "Friend management function malfunction; temporarily unavailable. Please wait a moment.",
    ["好友系统"] = "Friend System",
    ["好友系统可进行好友的添加、聊天、赠礼等操作。"] = "The friend system allows for adding friends, chatting, gifting, and other operations.",
    ["好友群组语音"] = "Friend Group Voice Chat",
    ["好友群聊"] = "Friend Group Chat",
    ["好友群聊功能故障，暂不可用，请您耐心等待片刻。"] = "Friend group chat function malfunction; temporarily unavailable. Please wait a moment.",
    ["好友聊天"] = "Friend Chat",
    ["好友赠礼"] = "Friend Gift",
    ["好友赠礼道具，本版本不进行投放和使用。"] = "A gift item for friends; this version is not available for distribution or use.",
    ["好友需解锁誓约系统，且好友度达到"] = "Friend needs to unlock the covenant system, and friendship level must reach",
    ["好友需解锁誓约系统，且好感度达到"] = "Friends need to unlock the Covenant system and reach a favorability of",
    ["好可怕……不过曾经涉及非凡的人，是会有更高概率再被非凡事件影响……"] = "How terrifying... But those who have been involved with Beyonders have a higher probability of being affected by Beyonder incidents again...",
    ["好可怕的灵性波动……那个人到底想做什么？"] = "What terrifying spirituality fluctuations... What exactly is that person trying to do?",
    ["好可怕！我的皮肤和我的秀发一样珍贵，绝对不容有失！"] = "How terrifying! My skin is as precious as my hair, it absolutely must not be lost!",
    ["好可怜的小女孩，她瘦得像一根即将被风吹折的秸秆。"] = "Such a pitiful little girl, she is as thin as a stalk of straw about to be broken by the wind.",
    ["好可怜，你以后就跟着我吧，我带你出门。"] = "How pitiful, you should follow me from now on, I will take you out.",
    ["好可爱的狗狗。"] = "What a cute dog.",
    ["好吃 赞美女神！"] = "Delicious, praise the Goddess!",
    ["好吃的——"] = "Delicious—",
    ["好吧"] = "Alright",
    ["好吧......既然你们自寻死路"] = "Fine... since you are seeking your own death",
    ["好吧……"] = "Alright...",
    ["好吧……<P_Heart>（他刚才说木桩？这里没有什么木桩？）</>"] = "Alright... <P_Heart>(He mentioned a wooden post just now? There are no wooden posts here?)</>",
    ["好吧……但你得快点儿，它看起来挺害怕的。"] = "Alright... but you have to be quick, it looks quite scared.",
    ["好吧……你最好能做到！"] = "Fine... you'd better be able to do it!",
    ["好吧……劳烦你去帮我打探一下，听听观众都怎么说，拜托了。"] = "Alright... Please go and help me find out, listen to what the audience says, please.",
    ["好吧……我们现在要去哪里？ "] = "Alright... where are we going now?",
    ["好吧……我好像确实没什么钱。"] = "Well... I suppose I really don't have much money.",
    ["好吧……我给妹妹留张纸条。"] = "Alright... I'll leave a note for my sister.",
    ["好吧……或许值得被登在最末版，或者中缝。"] = "Alright... maybe it's worth being published on the very last page, or in the gutter.",
    ["好吧……现在的年轻人真是缺乏进取精神。唉，末日可怎么办……"] = "Alright... young people nowadays really lack a spirit of enterprise. Sigh, what will happen to the apocalypse...",
    ["好吧……那边有个路标，要不要先看看路？"] = "All right... there's a signpost over there. Should we check the route first?",
    ["好吧……那这只猫，呃，我是说可敬的露娜女士，它要怎么为我们验证非凡材料的真伪呢？"] = "Alright... then how does this cat, er, I mean the respectable Ms. Luna, verify the authenticity of the Beyonder material for us?",
    ["好吧、好吧！我承认！我是在给这些雕像做旧……先埋进土里几天，再挖出来，沾点潮气和泥腥味，贝克兰德的买家就肯出高价…… "] = "Fine, fine! I admit it! I'm aging these statues... bury them in the soil for a few days, then dig them up, get them damp and muddy, and buyers in Backlund will pay a high price...",
    ["好吧。"] = "Fine.",
    ["好吧。如果我有好好保存那些笔记就好了，怪想她的。"] = "Alright. If only I had kept those notes properly, I miss her so much.",
    ["好吧。明天一定会来，他说过的。"] = "Fine. He will definitely come tomorrow, he promised.",
    ["好吧。除了那场噩梦，我还是什么都想不起来了，我是谁，为什么在这里……"] = "Alright. Aside from that nightmare, I still can't remember anything. Who am I, and why am I here...",
    ["好吧好吧，女士您有手帕吗，先把自己弄干净……嘿，我好像见过你！"] = "Alright, alright, ma'am, do you have a handkerchief? Clean yourself up first... Hey, I think I've seen you before!",
    ["好吧好吧，小镇建立时，有一位睡莲仙女……"] = "Alright, alright, when the Small Town was founded, there was a Water Lily Fairy...",
    ["好吧我承认，我就是想炫一下技，没想到……咳咳、我还有急事！再见！"] = "Fine, I admit it, I just wanted to show off my skills, I didn't expect... cough cough, I have an urgent matter! Goodbye!",
    ["好吧这是美化的说辞，实际上是说：“简直笨手笨脚。”所以我开始到艺术学派学习，跳舞肯定是很好的协调训练！"] = "Well, that's the beautified version. In reality, they said: 'Simply clumsy.' So I started learning at the Art School; dancing must be great coordination training!",
    ["好吧（寻猫解锁）"] = "Alright (unlocked by finding the cat)",
    ["好吧，不过我还是建议你买条咸鱼，毕竟它有着很神奇的寓意，罗塞尔大帝一直都说咸鱼翻身！"] = "Alright, but I still suggest you buy a salted fish. After all, it has a very magical meaning; Emperor Roselle always said, 'A salted fish can flip over!'",
    ["好吧，也许我可以，我可是廷根日报的忠实读者。"] = "Well, maybe I could; I am a loyal reader of the Tingen Daily, after all.",
    ["好吧，你要是回心转意了就再来找我。"] = "Alright, come back to me if you change your mind.",
    ["好吧，其实我……是官方非凡者……"] = "Fine, actually I... am an official Beyonder...",
    ["好吧，原来是扶老奶奶过马路的好心人。辛苦了。"] = "Alright, so it was a kind person helping an old lady across the street. Thank you for your hard work.",
    ["好吧，听你这么一说……我还真有点想试试了。"] = "Alright, now that you mention it... I really want to try it.",
    ["好吧，大帝保佑你，祝我们都能早日下班。"] = "Alright, may the Emperor bless you. I hope we can both get off work early.",
    ["好吧，好吧，我听你们的。"] = "Alright, alright, I'll listen to you.",
    ["好吧，就是骗子。"] = "Fine, it's a scammer.",
    ["好吧，我们已经比那些工厂里的工人好很多了。"] = "Well, we're already much better off than the workers in those factories.",
    ["好吧，我去拿纸和笔，我们来签署“中止合约”。"] = "Alright, I'll go get paper and pen, and we'll sign the \"Contract Termination\".",
    ["好吧，我尊重你的想法，这个问题就此打住吧。"] = "Alright, I respect your thoughts, let's stop this topic here.",
    ["好吧，我就知道没人会答应，真是一个失败的尝试。"] = "Alright, I knew no one would agree, what a failed attempt.",
    ["好吧，我想我需要您的帮助。"] = "Very well, I think I need your help.",
    ["好吧，我承认你有坐在这里的资格了。"] = "Fine, I admit you have the qualifications to sit here.",
    ["好吧，我承认我培育的一些品种……确实有那么一点点副作用。"] = "Well, I admit that some of the varieties I cultivated... do indeed have a little bit of side effects.",
    ["好吧，我明白了，你就是不想上班。奇了怪了，你怎么还没被开除？"] = "Alright, I understand, you just don't want to work. It's strange, how haven't you been fired yet?",
    ["好吧，我明白，但……大人，我从来没有做过任何称得上不好的事。"] = "Alright, I understand, but... sir, I have never done anything that could be called bad.",
    ["好吧，我有一些小宝藏的线索，比如桥下那个宝箱……但不是免费的，懂吧？"] = "Alright, I have some clues about small treasures, like that treasure chest under the bridge... but it's not free, you understand?",
    ["好吧，我现在就上台去。"] = "Alright, I'll go on stage now.",
    ["好吧，我这就回去。奇怪……阿廖莎的病情之前不是一直在好转吗？"] = "Fine, I'll go back now. Strange... wasn't Alyosha's condition improving all this time?",
    ["好吧，抱歉……我的父亲曾经是值夜者正式队员，五年前牺牲在了一次非凡事件里。"] = "Alright, sorry... My father was once a formal member of the Nighthawks; he sacrificed himself in a Beyonder incident five years ago.",
    ["好吧，明天我会在餐厅等你。你也要早点回到你的避风港，小心生病。"] = "Alright, I'll wait for you at the restaurant tomorrow. You should also return to your safe haven early and take care not to get sick.",
    ["好吧，查理是个好人，从贫民窟混血儿，到金梧桐区大富翁……"] = "Alright, Charlie is a good man, from a slum half-breed to a tycoon in the Golden Phoenix District...",
    ["好吧，梅丽莎，你偶尔可以……"] = "Alright, Melissa, you can occasionally...",
    ["好吧，死后也有阶层差距。"] = "Well, it seems there's a class divide even after death.",
    ["好吧，真是遗憾。"] = "Alright, what a pity.",
    ["好吧，祝你安全，小家伙。愿女神庇佑你！"] = "Alright, stay safe, little one. May the Evernight Goddess protect you!",
    ["好吧，还说和你比上一局。"] = "Alright, I was hoping to have a match with you.",
    ["好吧，这么快就走远了……"] = "Well, they went far away so quickly...",
    ["好吧，这挽救了我对餐厅的评价……"] = "Well, that saves my rating of the restaurant...",
    ["好吧，这是最后一杯了！"] = "Alright, this is the last one!",
    ["好吧，这次放过你，下次别这样了，偷东西总归是不好的。"] = "Fine, I'll let you go this time. Don't do it again; stealing is never a good thing.",
    ["好吧，那12苏勒……10苏勒也行，喂，别急着走啊！"] = "Alright, then 12 soli... 10 soli is fine, hey, don't be in such a hurry to leave!",
    ["好吧，那——小绅士，买一份今天的报纸。"] = "Alright then—little gentleman, I'll buy today's newspaper.",
    ["好吧，那我先去核实失踪案信息，等有更多线索再调查那对兄妹的事。"] = "Alright, then I'll go verify the missing persons information first, and investigate the siblings' matter when there are more clues.",
    ["好吧，那我再回去优化一下，希望下次能再请你体验。"] = "Alright, then I'll go back and optimize it. I hope to invite you to experience it again next time.",
    ["好吧，那我是不是应该称呼你……前辈？"] = "Alright, then should I call you... senior?",
    ["好呀，不过今天它们都睡着啦，改天，改天{{大哥哥|大姐姐}}我带你和它们认识认识！"] = "Sure, but they are all asleep today. Some other day, some other day, {{big brother|big sister}}, I will introduce you to them!",
    ["好呀，不过今天它们都睡着啦，改天，改天我带{{大哥哥|大姐姐}}和它们认识认识！"] = "Sure, but they're all asleep today. Another time, another time I'll bring {{big brother|big sister}} to meet them!",
    ["好呀，我们拉钩，一言为定！"] = "Alright, let's pinky swear, it's a deal!",
    ["好呀，没问题。"] = "Sure, no problem.",
    ["好哇，你们两个小崽子，敢耍我？你们等着！"] = "Oh, you two little brats, daring to play tricks on me? Just you wait!",
    ["好啊"] = "Okay",
    ["好啊。"] = "Sure.",
    ["好啊，一起加班去咯！"] = "Alright, let's go work overtime together!",
    ["好啊，我已经迫不及待想骑它了。"] = "Alright, I can't wait to ride it.",
    ["好啊，我该怎么做呢？"] = "Sure, what should I do?",
    ["好啊，看来真是马丁在闹鬼，我跟你没完！"] = "Alright, it seems Martin really is haunting this place. I'm not done with you!",
    ["好啦！别吵了，谁想尝尝我做的汤？"] = "Alright! Stop arguing. Who wants to taste my soup?",
    ["好啦！都吵什么呢，我们都是一家人！"] = "Alright! What are you all arguing about? We are all one family!",
    ["好啦，其实看着你们乱放的扑克、墙上泛黄的合照和这一杯杯咖啡，我早就不生气了。"] = "Alright, actually, looking at the poker cards you left in a mess, the yellowed group photo on the wall, and these cups of coffee, I stopped being angry a long time ago.",
    ["好啦，那这次的紧急会议就结束了，我们等你们的好消息，国王、外交大臣。"] = "Alright, then this emergency meeting is over. We will wait for your good news, King, Minister of Foreign Affairs.",
    ["好喔。"] = "Alright.",
    ["好喜欢橱窗里那些精致漂亮的玩偶。"] = "I really like those exquisite and beautiful dolls in the display window.",
    ["好喝！"] = "Delicious!",
    ["好嘞先生，您拿好！"] = "Alright sir, here you go!",
    ["好嘞！请您稍后，精彩的比赛即将开始！"] = "Alright! Please wait a moment, the exciting race is about to begin!",
    ["好嘞，先生，您赶紧把笼子放下吧，只管让我们来弄好了。"] = "Alright, sir, you should put the cage down; just leave it to us to handle.",
    ["好嘞，您看这块怎么样？新鲜又肥美！"] = "Alright! How about this piece? Fresh and fatty!",
    ["好嘞，谢谢惠顾！"] = "Alright, thanks for your patronage!",
    ["好困……"] = "So sleepy...",
    ["好困……回去休息吧。"] = "So sleepy... let's go back and rest.",
    ["好困……好累……我要休息了……"] = "So sleepy... so tired... I'm going to rest...",
    ["好困，反正也没人买菜，眯一会。"] = "So sleepy. No one's buying vegetables anyway, I'll take a nap.",
    ["好在你们也救出了很多人，廷根的守护者们又一次证明了——黑暗永远无法完全吞噬光明。"] = "Fortunately, you also saved many people. The guardians of Tingen have once again proven that darkness can never completely swallow the light.",
    ["好在大帝从不欠薪水……"] = "At least the Emperor never owed anyone their wages...",
    ["好在我总是能在祂的灌输下"] = "Fortunately, I can always, under His infusion",
    ["好在我总是能在祂的灌输下坚持下来……"] = "Fortunately, I can always persist under His indoctrination...",
    ["好在有“隐者”女士的帮助，庞大而神秘的知识才能如此安全地呈现出来。"] = "Fortunately, with the help of Miss Hermit, such vast and mysterious knowledge can be presented so safely.",
    ["好在祂的灌输多少也有些有用的知识，嗯……需要整理整理……"] = "Fortunately, His indoctrination does contain some useful knowledge. Hmm... I need to organize it...",
    ["好坚固的宝箱！看来没法直接撬开了。"] = "What a sturdy treasure chest! It seems it can't be pried open directly.",
    ["好复杂的触感……"] = "Such a complex touch...",
    ["好多……好多告解……"] = "So many... so many confessions...",
    ["好多东西！这是一套新衣服，还有一把……钥匙？"] = "So many things! This is a set of new clothes, and also a... key?",
    ["好多了 谢谢"] = "Much better, thank you.",
    ["好多人 我去卖东西了 {{先生|女士}}"] = "So many people, I'm going to sell my goods, {{ Mr.| Ms.}}.",
    ["好多人……那边的侍者好像在介绍茶会的规矩？也许有线索，去听听看吧。"] = "So many people... The waiter over there seems to be explaining the rules of the tea party? Maybe there's a clue, let's go listen.",
    ["好多复杂的细节数据……"] = "So many complex detail data...",
    ["好多小丑！"] = "So many Clowns!",
    ["好多报纸，各种各样、不同时间的报纸……"] = "So many newspapers, all kinds of newspapers from different times...",
    ["好多文字和知识，涌进了我的大脑……"] = "So much text and knowledge, flooding into my brain...",
    ["好多死老鼠！奇怪，为什么会死在这种地方？"] = "So many dead rats! Strange, why would they die in a place like this?",
    ["好多知识钻进了我的大脑！"] = "So much knowledge drilled into my brain!",
