    ["好的服装一定要规避顾客的劣势，而张扬其身材和气质的优势与特殊性。在这一点上，我们服装店是全廷根做得最好的。<P_Heart>（自豪）</>"] = "Good clothing must avoid the customer's disadvantages while highlighting the advantages and uniqueness of their figure and temperament. In this regard, our clothing store is the best in all of Tingen. <P_Heart> (Proud) </>",
