    ["好神奇"] = "How amazing",
    ["好神奇的感觉……我是非凡者了！"] = "What a magical feeling... I'm a Beyonder!",
    ["好神奇，我好像感受艾登就在我的身边……真期待我们重逢的那一天啊！"] = "How amazing, I feel like Aiden is right by my side... I really look forward to the day we reunite!",
    ["好神奇，我好像感觉艾登就在我的身边……真期待我们重逢的那一天啊！"] = "How amazing, I feel like Aiden is by my side... I really look forward to the day we reunite!",
    ["好离奇的案件，廷根果然笼罩在危机中……"] = "What a bizarre case, Tingen is indeed shrouded in crisis...",
    ["好端端的，大半夜的，怎么会突然头疼？不会是脑溢血吧！"] = "Why would I suddenly have a headache in the middle of the night for no reason? It couldn't be a cerebral hemorrhage, could it!",
    ["好累……"] = "So tired...",
    ["好累……想要什么鱼自己挑吧。"] = "So tired... Pick whatever fish you want.",
    ["好累……感觉灵性被抽空了……天都黑了……"] = "So tired... I feel like my spirituality has been drained... it's already dark...",
    ["好累哦。"] = "So tired.",
    ["好累，怎么还没到下班时间……"] = "I'm so tired. Why isn't it time to get off work yet...?",
    ["好聒噪的灵……我的意思是，强大的、与众不同的气息？"] = "What a noisy spirit... I mean, a powerful, unusual aura?",
    ["好臭......"] = "It stinks...",
    ["好臭……"] = "So smelly...",
    ["好臭！好恶心的粘液，像是什么尸体上留下的……"] = "It stinks! Such disgusting slime, it looks like something left on a corpse...",
    ["好臭，和那孩子说的一样。但我的灵性直觉没有警告，应该没有危险。"] = "It stinks, just like that child said. But my spiritual intuition isn't warning me, so there shouldn't be any danger.",
    ["好花酿好酒！全镇最清新的口感！"] = "Good flowers make good wine! The freshest taste in town!",
    ["好萌"] = "So cute",
    ["好计策，感谢您帮我抓到了它，这是一点谢礼，请笑纳"] = "Good strategy, thank you for helping me catch it. Here is a small token of gratitude, please accept it",
    ["好诡异……这里怎么也有血月？"] = "How strange... why is there a blood moon here too?",
    ["好诡异的声音……是笛声？"] = "What an eerie sound... is that flute music?",
    ["好货？早就被搜刮干净了！现在去，连块完整的砖头都捡不着！"] = "Good goods? They were scavenged clean long ago! If you go now, you won't even find a whole brick!",
    ["好贵！"] = "So expensive!",
    ["好软的肚子……嗯，小狗，把钱收好。"] = "Such a soft belly... Hmm, little puppy, put the money away.",
    ["好运"] = "Good luck",
    ["好运\n顺利\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Good luck \n Smooth sailing \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["好运之触"] = "Touch of Good Luck",
    ["好运由你决定：选择一项幸运任务，或立即领取奖励。"] = "Good luck is up to you: Choose a lucky quest or claim the reward immediately.",
    ["好运眷顾"] = "Favored by Good Luck",
    ["好运，来自黄黑之王"] = "Good luck, from the King of Yellow and Black",
    ["好酒量！来，我们几个好好喝一顿！"] = "Great tolerance for alcohol! Come, let's have a good drink!",
    ["好重的雾气……这里不会真有亡灵吧？"] = "Such heavy fog... there wouldn't really be spirits here, would there?",
    ["好重！"] = "So heavy!",
    ["好铁经得起敲打，多去工厂看看吧小子！"] = "Good iron can withstand the hammer, go visit the factory more often, kid!",
    ["好长好长的时间，好冷好冷的冬天，我只能抱着露米，可是后来露米也不见了。"] = "Such a long, long time, such a cold, cold winter, I could only hold Lumi, but later, Lumi disappeared too.",
    ["好陌生的地方，我怎么什么都不记得了？"] = "Such a strange place, why can't I remember anything?",
    ["好险……门终于打开了。"] = "That was close... the door finally opened.",
    ["好难过、好痛苦、好孤独……"] = "So sad, so painful, so lonely...",
    ["好饿……"] = "So hungry...",
    ["好饿……\r\n再不吃点东西，好像要晕过去了。"] = "So hungry...\r\nIf I don't eat something soon, I feel like I'm going to faint.",
    ["好饿……今天也只能吃黑面包吗？想吃肉啊。"] = "So hungry... can I only eat black bread today? I want to eat meat.",
    ["好饿……好困……"] = "So hungry... so sleepy...",
    ["好饿。"] = "So hungry.",
    ["好饿啊……呜呜呜"] = "I'm so hungry... wuwuwu",
    ["好饿！我想活下去，和月城一起活下去！"] = "So hungry! I want to live, to live on with Moon City!",
    ["好饿！门票！门票！"] = "So hungry! Ticket! Ticket!",
    ["好饿，爸爸最近很晚才回家，房东先生又来催房租了。"] = "I'm so hungry. Dad has been coming home very late lately, and the landlord is here to press for rent again.",
    ["好香……"] = "So fragrant...",
    ["好香……马上就煮好了……"] = "Smells so good... it'll be ready soon...",
    ["好香的咖啡……"] = "Such fragrant coffee...",
    ["好香的咖啡味……这里的福利这么好？"] = "Such a fragrant coffee aroma... Are the benefits here this good?",
    ["好香的茶……"] = "Such fragrant tea...",
    ["好香！猪油炸蔬菜居然一点也不油腻。"] = "So fragrant! The fried vegetables in lard aren't greasy at all.",
    ["好香！珍妮闻到了蛋糕的味道"] = "So fragrant! Jenny smells the scent of cake",
    ["好高……没有松鼠，试试把窝打下来。"] = "It's so high... No squirrel, I'll try to knock the nest down.",
    ["好黑……狩猎时得呆在光里，才不会被怪物袭击。"] = "It's so dark... I must stay in the light while hunting so I won't be attacked by monsters.",
    ["好齐全！水刃草、夜香草、蜂后草、《高级药剂大全》……"] = "How complete! Water Blade Grass, Night Fragrance Herb, Queen Bee Grass, \"Advanced Potion Compendium\"...",
    ["好！交给我吧！"] = "Alright! Leave it to me!",
    ["好！唱得好！这是你要的花！愿你邂逅甜蜜与浪漫！"] = "Good! Well sung! This is the flower you wanted! May you encounter sweetness and romance!",
    ["好！开始吧！"] = "Good! Let's start!",
    ["好！我们……赌一次！"] = "Alright! Let's... take a gamble!",
    ["好！我们回去重新开始，不到成功那一刻，猎龙的火焰不会熄灭！"] = "Good! We'll go back and start over. Until the moment of success, the flame of dragon hunting will not be extinguished!",
    ["好！琳达的注意力回到了拳台上，比赛马上开始！"] = "Good! Linda's attention is back on the boxing ring, the match is about to start!",
    ["好！看完这份报纸就去消化魔药！"] = "Great! I'll go digest the potion after reading this newspaper!",
    ["好！绕后！拍尾巴！"] = "Good! Circle behind! Tail slap!",
    ["好！谢谢你，弗莱先生！"] = "Great! Thank you, Mr. Frye!",
    ["好！那就去吧！夺回你失去的一切！"] = "Good! Then go! Take back everything you lost!",
    ["好，一定要小心，避开中央广场，我们安全屋见。"] = "Good, be very careful. Avoid the Central Plaza, and I'll see you at the safe house.",
    ["好，下一位！"] = "Alright, next!",
    ["好，不要留下后患。我们现在就赶过去。"] = "Good, don't leave any future trouble. Let's head there now.",
    ["好，但你要给我点吃的作酬劳，我的午餐半小时前不见了。"] = "Fine, but you have to give me some food as payment. My lunch disappeared half an hour ago.",
    ["好，你们先在这里等我消息。"] = "Fine, you wait here for my news.",
    ["好，你先忙。"] = "Okay, you go ahead.",
    ["好，你说服我了。"] = "Fine, you have convinced me.",
    ["好，克莱恩，帮我个忙，把这些粉末洒在四周。"] = "Alright, Klein, do me a favor and sprinkle this powder all around.",
    ["好，再来一遍!"] = "Good, let's do it again!",
    ["好，就在这里吧"] = "Okay, let's do it here",
    ["好，就深蓝色吧。"] = "Alright, let's go with dark blue.",
    ["好，成交！"] = "Okay, deal!",
    ["好，我一早就来！"] = "Good, I'll come first thing in the morning!",
    ["好，我们回去吧。"] = "Alright, let's head back.",
    ["好，我们回去！"] = "Alright, let's head back!",
    ["好，我们进去吧……"] = "Alright, let's go in...",
    ["好，我去找找看。"] = "Alright, I'll go look for it.",
    ["好，我和伦纳德也会很快出发的。"] = "Good, Leonard and I will also set off soon.",
    ["好，我多采一点。"] = "Alright, I'll pick a few more.",
