    ["好，我给你一个来自国王的承诺。"] = "Good, I give you a promise from the King.",
    ["好，我自己看看。"] = "Okay, I'll look around myself.",
    ["好，我记住了，我一定平安带回“2-327”。"] = "Alright, I've noted that. I will definitely bring back '2-327' safely.",
    ["好，我试试"] = "Okay, I'll try",
