    ["如你所愿第一环"] = "As You Wish First Ring",
    ["如你所见，我前面有一些蜡烛，我现在就要用意念点燃它们！"] = "As you can see, I have some candles in front of me, and I am about to light them with my mind!",
    ["如你所见，我正在为艺术学派创作我的新舞蹈。"] = "As you can see, I am creating my new dance for the Art School.",
    ["如你所见，这子弹是警局专用的。我现在根本不敢相信内部的人。"] = "As you can see, this bullet is exclusive to the police department. I can't trust anyone inside right now.",
    ["如你所见，这里刚发生了一起命案。我们想跟目击证人问问情况，但她就是在这里哭个不停。"] = "As you can see, a murder just happened here. We want to ask the eyewitness about the situation, but she just keeps crying here.",
    ["如午夜星幕般深邃的紫色战马，少量银色战甲点缀，宛如夜色中的暗影。"] = "A warhorse as deep purple as the midnight star-curtain, adorned with a small amount of silver armor, like a shadow in the night.",
    ["如同守护秘密的女祭司，你的直觉将指引正确方向。相信那些无法言说的预感。 "] = "Like a High Priestess guarding secrets, your intuition will guide you in the right direction. Trust those unspeakable premonitions.",
    ["如同手持利剑的裁决者，你看穿了虚伪的面具。坚守你的原则，正义与你同在。 "] = "Like a judge holding a sharp sword, you see through the mask of hypocrisy. Stick to your principles; justice is with you.",
    ["如同手持灯盏的隐者，你在黑暗中寻找真理的碎片。继续你的探索，智慧就在迷雾深处。"] = "Like a Hermit holding a lamp, you search for fragments of truth in the darkness. Continue your exploration; wisdom lies deep in the fog.",
    ["如同掌管丰收的女皇，你的努力即将开花结果。温柔的力量胜过千军万马。"] = "Like an Empress governing the harvest, your efforts are about to bear fruit. Gentle power overcomes thousands of troops.",
    ["如同操纵命运的魔术师，万事俱备只待行动。施展你的天赋，奇迹即将发生。 "] = "Like a magician manipulating fate, everything is ready, waiting only for action. Unleash your talent; a miracle is about to happen.",
    ["如同月光织就的十四行诗，每个转身都在续写未完的华美乐章。 "] = "Like a sonnet woven from moonlight, every turn continues to write an unfinished, magnificent movement.",
    ["如同月光织就的十四行诗，每个转身都在续写未完的华美乐章。 </>"] = "Like a sonnet woven from moonlight, every turn continues to write a magnificent, unfinished movement. </>",
    ["如同死者聆听天使的号角，你终于准备好面对真实的自己。这是审判的时刻，也是重生的开始。 "] = "Like the dead listening to the angel's trumpet, you are finally ready to face your true self. This is the moment of judgment and the beginning of rebirth.",
    ["如同熟悉的身影在清晨的雾气中缓缓浮现，为所有旅人带回那些泛着微光的独家记忆。"] = "Like a familiar figure slowly emerging in the morning mist, bringing back those shimmering exclusive memories for all travelers.",
    ["如同群鸦的羽翼掠过午夜的钟塔，将水晶碎片般的小恶作剧藏进无数人的梦中。"] = "Like the wings of a flock of crows sweeping across the midnight clock tower, hiding crystal-shard-like pranks in the dreams of countless people.",
    ["如同驯服猛兽一般，你以温柔征服了内心的狂暴。真正的强大不在毁灭对方，而在掌控。 "] = "Like taming a wild beast, you have conquered the madness within with gentleness. True strength lies not in destroying the opponent, but in control.",
    ["如它名字一样，在这里每杯酒都来自恶龙的馈赠。"] = "Just like its name, every glass of wine here is a gift from the dragon.",
    ["如实告知"] = "Tell the truth",
    ["如您所见，我的主人是一名议员，怎么会和马桶有关……嗯。"] = "As you can see, my master is a councilor. How could he be related to a toilet... hmm.",
    ["如您所见，结局并不圆满……所以他委托我用姑娘的遗物和他准备的婚戒做成了一枚全新的戒指，永远纪念他早逝的爱人。"] = "As you can see, the ending wasn't perfect... so he entrusted me to use the girl's mementos and the wedding ring he prepared to make a brand new ring, to forever commemorate his late lover.",
    ["如您所见，老师的精神状态……不是很正常。"] = "As you can see, the teacher's mental state... is not very normal.",
    ["如您所见，这片土地虽然充满潜力，却因为长久缺少人管理，一直处于荒废状态。"] = "As you can see, although this land is full of potential, it has been in a state of neglect due to a long-term lack of management.",
    ["如您需要交易，请领取文件并安排公证服务。"] = "If you need to trade, please collect the documents and arrange for Notarization services.",
    ["如愿以偿的那一刻，一个声音让溃散的我们重新变成了我。"] = "At the moment of getting what I wanted, a voice turned us, who were collapsing, back into me.",
    ["如星暮疾驰般华美的礼物，承载着观众最热烈的赞叹，在魅影长廊中闪耀登场。"] = "A gift as magnificent as a galloping star at dusk, carrying the most enthusiastic praise of the Spectator, making a dazzling appearance in the Phantom Corridor.",
    ["如果 如果我在历史迷雾中能做些什么的话 是不是能改变你们的结局呢"] = "If, if I could do something in the fog of history, could I change your ending?",
    ["如果poslist有多个点，则取第一个"] = "If poslist has multiple points, take the first one.",
    ["如果、如果我在历史迷雾中能做些什么的话，是不是能改变你们的结局呢？"] = "If, if I could do something in the fog of history, could I change your ending?",
    ["如果一串项链能让她好受些，我愿意奢侈这一次。"] = "If a necklace can make her feel better, I'm willing to be extravagant this once.",
    ["如果一定要在车厢里被挤得像沙丁鱼罐头一样，我也希望我是一只坐着的鱼。"] = "If I have to be squeezed like a sardine in a carriage, I hope I'm at least a sitting fish.",
    ["如果下一站<LightHighlight>不是【商行】</>，本局<LightHighlight>艺术品、食品</>卖出价<LightHighlight>永久+15%</>"] = "If the next stop <LightHighlight> is not a [Trading Firm] </>, the selling price <LightHighlight> of artworks and food </> for this round <LightHighlight> will be permanently increased by 15% </>.",
