    ["如果下一站<LightHighlight>是【食铺】</>,获得自身<LightHighlight>50%</>的<HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"trainTradeItem=30503\">【铜雕烛台】</>"] = "If the next stop <LightHighlight> is the [Food Shop] </>, obtain an amount of <HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"trainTradeItem=30503\"> [Bronze Candlestick] </> equal to <LightHighlight> 50% </> of what you currently possess.",
    ["如果下一站<LightHighlight>是【食铺】</>,获得自身<LightHighlight>50%</>的<HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"trainTradeItem=30506\">【镀金妆镜】</>"] = "If the next stop <LightHighlight> is the [Food Shop] </>, obtain an amount of <HyperLink stylename=\"Underline\" u=\"trainTradeItem=30506\"> [Gilded Vanity Mirror] </> equal to <LightHighlight> 50% </> of what you currently possess.",
    ["如果下一站<LightHighlight>是【食铺】</>，当前持有的金色物品数量均增加<LightHighlight>60%</>"] = "If the next stop <LightHighlight> is 【Food Shop】 </>, the quantity of Golden items currently held increases by <LightHighlight> 60% </>",
    ["如果下一站<LightHighlight>是【食铺】</>，本局<LightHighlight>酒类、艺术品</>卖出价+25%，但下一站卖出价-60%"] = "If the next stop <LightHighlight> is the [Food Shop] </>, the selling price of <LightHighlight> Alcohol and Artworks </> for this session is +25%, but the selling price at the next stop is -60%.",
    ["如果不想变成木偶，就别被它追到！"] = "If you don't want to become a puppet, don't let it catch you!",
    ["如果不想突然被酒瓶砸到头的话，劝你离这里远一点。"] = "If you don't want to suddenly get hit in the head by a wine bottle, I advise you to stay away from here.",
    ["如果不找回那些碎片复原记忆，谁都无法从这里离开……"] = "If we don't find those fragments and restore her memories, no one will be able to leave this place...",
    ["如果不是为了家族，弗洛伦斯小姐或许早就嫁给了自己心爱的军官，而不必整日在名利场上流连。"] = "If it weren't for the family, Miss Florence might have married the officer she loved long ago, instead of having to linger in the vanity fair every day.",
    ["如果不是为了帮我去采买办公用品，也许她并不会卷入这场灾难。"] = "If it weren't for helping me buy office supplies, perhaps she wouldn't have been caught up in this disaster.",
    ["如果不是他，我简直不敢想象霍克斯会怎么样。"] = "If it weren't for him, I can't imagine what would have happened to Hawkes.",
    ["如果不是伦纳德突然扑过来，我应该来得及扶住架子，更不会吵醒队长。"] = "If Leonard hadn't suddenly lunged over, I would have had time to steady the shelf, and I certainly wouldn't have woken the Captain.",
    ["如果不是你将我粗暴地拖进廷根值夜者小队，我应该早就沉眠在墓园里了。"] = "If you hadn't roughly dragged me into the Tingen Nighthawks squad, I should have been slumbering in the cemetery long ago.",
    ["如果不是你！他也不会被砸断脚趾，不会在煤灰里咳出血！你这头猪一样的混蛋！"] = "If it weren't for you! He wouldn't have had his toes crushed, he wouldn't have coughed up blood in the coal dust! You pig-like bastard!",
    ["如果不是值夜者们及时赶到，我就是第六位受害者了。"] = "If the Nighthawks hadn't arrived in time, I would have been the sixth victim.",
    ["如果不是刚好来霍伊大学办事，恐怕都不知道这次又有人要放弃名额了。唉……"] = "If I hadn't happened to come to Hoy University for business, I probably wouldn't have known that someone was giving up their spot again. Sigh...",
    ["如果不是因为我想攒钱给珍妮弗一个婚礼，我也不会租这里的。"] = "If it weren't for the fact that I want to save money for Jennifer's wedding, I wouldn't be renting here.",
    ["如果不是有这个考高分的捷径，他们哪里肯看那么多资料！"] = "If it weren't for this shortcut to get high scores, they wouldn't be willing to read so much material!",
    ["如果不是爱国卫生运动，我的奶奶恐怕早就死于鼠疫，更别说生下我的父母了。"] = "If it weren't for the Patriotic Hygiene Campaign, my grandmother would have likely died of the plague, let alone given birth to my parents.",
    ["如果不是王国被警察们“占领”了……这只是迫于无奈，暂时落脚的地方。"] = "If the kingdom hadn't been \"occupied\" by the police... this is just a place we're forced to stay temporarily.",
    ["如果不是生计困难，我不会让茜安帮忙。"] = "If it weren't for the financial difficulties, I wouldn't have let Cian help.",
    ["如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。\n\n尼尔"] = "If I cannot save her, then I will accompany her.\n\nNeil",
    ["如果为0，则只造成一个一次性的伤害"] = "If 0, it only causes a one-time damage.",
    ["如果为true，且检查的buff本身为区分来源的buff，则只会检查自己添加的buff"] = "If true, and the checked buff itself is a source-distinguishing buff, it will only check buffs added by yourself.",
    ["如果主人能听家族的话，就不用来这乡下地方了。"] = "If Master would just listen to the Family, she wouldn't have to come to this countryside place.",
    ["如果产生任何失控的预兆——比如呓语、头痛、灵性动荡——随时来找我。"] = "If any signs of loss of control appear—such as gibberish, headaches, or spiritual instability—come find me at any time.",
    ["如果人类能停止新陈代谢就好了，如果我能停止存在就好了。"] = "If only humans could stop metabolizing, if only I could stop existing.",
    ["如果他能停止以那副高高在上的好市民姿态对我的成员说教，就更好了。"] = "It would be even better if he could stop lecturing my members with that high-and-mighty \"good citizen\" attitude.",
    ["如果他被逼无奈呢？"] = "What if he was forced to?",
    ["如果你一定要坐在这里，请证明给我们看吧。"] = "If you must sit here, please prove it to us.",
    ["如果你不介意的话，我可以把你塞进热烘烘的馅饼里，让你被喜欢的美食包裹。"] = "If you don't mind, I can stuff you into a hot pie so you can be wrapped in your favorite food.",
    ["如果你不忙的话，能帮我找找亮晶晶的戒指吗？"] = "If you're not busy, could you help me look for the shiny ring?",
    ["如果你临时缺钱，可以来找我。"] = "If you are short of money, you can come to me.",
    ["如果你也在追寻，像我一样耗尽了生命——"] = "If you are also searching, having exhausted your life just like me—",
    ["如果你们一直回不去怎么办？"] = "What if you can never go back?",
    ["如果你们能找到绑匪藏身的地方，我们愿意付100镑的报酬。"] = "If you can find where the kidnappers are hiding, we are willing to pay a reward of 100 pounds.",
    ["如果你偶遇一只保险柜式生物，请捎它一程，我会给予报酬的。"] = "If you happen to come across a safe-like creature, please give it a ride, and I will provide a reward.",
    ["如果你单独面对祂紧张的话，我愿意陪你一起去的！"] = "If you are nervous about facing Him alone, I am willing to go with you!",
    ["如果你去了贝克兰德，选择会更多。拉波瑞餐厅的水果焦糖布丁、奶油酥饼和胡萝卜蛋糕都很不错。"] = "If you go to Backlund, there will be more choices. The fruit caramel pudding, butter shortbread, and carrot cake at the Laporte Restaurant are all very good.",
    ["如果你去南大陆，记得两件事：别喝会自己冒泡的泉水，更别和戴彩纹面具的人玩骰子——他们用的骰子，可能是浸过百年执念的旧骨。 "] = "If you go to the Southern Continent, remember two things: don't drink spring water that bubbles on its own, and definitely don't play dice with people wearing colorful masks—the dice they use might be old bones soaked in a century of obsession.",
    ["如果你可以给我一些吃的东西，我就把硬币给你"] = "If you can give me something to eat, I'll give you the coin.",
    ["如果你同时对以上三者感兴趣，那我拒绝替你锻造武器。"] = "If you are interested in all three of the above, then I refuse to forge weapons for you.",
    ["如果你和班森也乘坐马车，每天就要花费24便士……"] = "If you and Benson also take the carriage, it would cost 24 pence every day...",
    ["如果你哪天像他一样，呃，厌倦了生活，记得去找个“心理医生”。"] = "If one day you, uh, get tired of life like him, remember to find a 'Psychiatrist'.",
    ["如果你哪天像他一样，呃，记得去找个“心理医生”。"] = "If you ever become like him, uh, remember to find a \"Psychiatrist\".",
    ["如果你在东区附近上班的话，斯蒂芬街那边也有几套供您选择。"] = "If you work near the East District, there are also a few options on Stephen Street for you to choose from.",
    ["如果你在地下室，可以拉动绳索，摇晃铃铛来联系我。"] = "If you are in the basement, you can pull the rope and ring the bell to contact me.",
    ["如果你在地下层，可以通过绳索摇晃铃铛来联系我。"] = "If you are on the underground level, you can contact me by shaking the bell with the rope.",
    ["如果你在灵界偶遇一只白骨堆叠而成的保险柜式生物，请务必捎它一程。"] = "If you happen to run into a safe-like creature made of piled-up white bones in the Spirit World, please be sure to give it a ride.",
    ["如果你坚持，那么可以留下，亲眼见证这次实验，我相信你会改变想法。"] = "If you insist, then you can stay and witness this experiment with your own eyes. I believe you will change your mind.",
    ["如果你怕了，可以回头，这毕竟是我自己的案子。"] = "If you're afraid, you can turn back. After all, this is my own case.",
    ["如果你恨一个人，送他去贝克兰德，因为那里是地狱。"] = "If you hate someone, send them to Backlund, for it is hell.",
    ["如果你想了解大冒险家格尔曼真正的内心世界，就去看看《我与格尔曼·斯帕罗二三事》吧，那里面有你想知道的一切！"] = "If you want to understand the true inner world of the great adventurer Gehrman, go read 'Things Between Me and Gehrman Sparrow'. It has everything you want to know!",
    ["如果你想向治安官举报一个失去一切的女人，也请随意。"] = "If you want to report a woman who has lost everything to the Sheriff, feel free to do so.",
    ["如果你想继续值班，我也可以让给你，我还有案子需要分析。"] = "If you want to continue your shift, I can let you have it. I still have a case to analyze.",
    ["如果你想起了这熟悉的原因，就读出纸条上的句子吧。"] = "If you remember the reason for this familiarity, read the sentence on the note aloud.",
    ["如果你想追寻更多真相，“红手套”随时欢迎你。"] = "If you want to pursue more of the truth, the Red Gloves are always welcoming.",
    ["如果你感兴趣的话，我可以多带几本借给你。"] = "If you are interested, I can bring a few more to lend you.",
    ["如果你感觉紧张的话。"] = "If you are feeling nervous.",
    ["如果你愿意，可以用完它们。"] = "If you like, you can use them all.",
    ["如果你愿意，我们今后还可以一起研读这本书，亲身体会其中的真谛。"] = "If you are willing, we can study this book together in the future and personally experience the true meaning within it.",
    ["如果你成为了政府处理具体事务的雇员，我们的家庭收入会增加多少？"] = "If you become a government employee handling specific affairs, how much will our family income increase?",
    ["如果你打算光看不买，请不要打扰我的生意。"] = "If you intend to just look and not buy, please don't disturb my business.",
    ["如果你找到了相关线索，请一定、一定要告诉我。当然，我会支付丰厚的报酬。"] = "If you find any relevant clues, please, you must tell me. Of course, I will pay a generous reward.",
    ["如果你找到了，一定要告诉他们——这个规则一点也不公平……下次要改成只数八十，不，五十！ "] = "If you find them, you must tell them—this rule isn't fair at all... next time we have to change it to counting to eighty, no, fifty!",
    ["如果你是平常孩子，我会蒙住你的眼睛，让你忘记这一切。"] = "If you were an ordinary child, I would cover your eyes and make you forget all of this.",
    ["如果你是来买花的，把钱丢在那个小盒子里。"] = "If you're here to buy flowers, throw the money into that small box.",
    ["如果你是这门课的老师，你想看到有人卖自己的考题吗？"] = "If you were the teacher for this course, would you want to see someone selling their own exam questions?",
    ["如果你是迪西来的，一口下去包你尝到家的味道！"] = "If you're from Dicy, one bite and I guarantee you'll taste the flavor of home!",
    ["如果你更喜爱酥软的口感，我们也有黄油饼干。"] = "If you prefer a crumbly texture, we also have butter cookies.",
    ["如果你有6个召唤物，2个依次销毁，那么第一次触发时该值为5，第二次触发时为4"] = "If you have 6 Summons and 2 are destroyed in sequence, this value is 5 when triggered the first time, and 4 when triggered the second time",
    ["如果你有任何疑问或困惑，阿罗德斯就在这里，回答你的一切问题。"] = "If you have any questions or confusion, Arrodes is here to answer all your questions.",
    ["如果你有兴趣的话，就去问邓恩吧。"] = "If you are interested, go ask Dunn.",
    ["如果你有听说周边海域打捞石像的消息，请告知我，那很可能是伟大雕刻家苏丹的遗作。"] = "If you hear any news about the salvage of stone statues in the surrounding waters, please let me know; they are likely the posthumous works of the great sculptor Sudan.",
    ["如果你有机会……首先，你会游泳吗？"] = "If you have the chance... first of all, can you swim?",
    ["如果你有遇到涉及超凡的事件，一定要注意保护自己的安全，附近的任何一个教堂都可以求助。"] = "If you encounter incidents involving the supernatural, you must pay attention to protecting your own safety. You can seek help from any church nearby.",
    ["如果你有麻烦要解决，也可以来找我们。"] = "If you have trouble that needs solving, you can come to us too.",
    ["如果你爱一个人，送他去贝克兰德，因为那里是天堂。"] = "If you love someone, send them to Backlund, for it is heaven.",
    ["如果你留下来，这里是不是就不会那么冷？"] = "If you stayed, would it not be so cold here?",
    ["如果你的意图是吐露某些不礼貌的话，还请放弃吧。"] = "If your intention is to utter some impolite words, please give it up.",
    ["如果你的钱不够，可以去向斯维因借。"] = "If you don't have enough money, you can go borrow from Swain.",
    ["如果你看到一只疯狂的红色眼睛在窥视着你……请一定小心！"] = "If you see a crazy red eye peeking at you... please be careful!",
    ["如果你看到他，请告诉他我很想他。"] = "If you see him, please tell him I miss him very much.",
    ["如果你真的不介意，就吃完这道菜，向我证明你的心意吧。"] = "If you truly don't mind, finish this dish to prove your heart to me.",
    ["如果你真的为她考虑，就该删掉她脑中那些记忆！"] = "If you truly care about her, you should erase those memories from her mind!",
    ["如果你真的闲不住，刚才警署送来了最近廷根儿童失踪案的报告。你可以去提醒小阿诺德的养父母，注意孩子的安全。"] = "If you really can't sit still, the police station just sent over a report on the recent Tingen child disappearance cases. You can go remind little Arnold's foster parents to pay attention to the child's safety.",
    ["如果你知道我在斗邪恶赢了一张船票，你也会觉得我运气好……"] = "If you knew I won a ship ticket in Fight Evil, you'd also think I have good luck...",
    ["如果你知道接下来演什么了，就去你的位置，摆出开演的动作。"] = "If you know what is going to be performed next, go to your position and strike the pose for the start of the performance.",
    ["如果你能立刻买下我所有的花，我保证笑得比对面丢球那个傻子还灿烂。"] = "If you can buy all my flowers right now, I promise to smile brighter than that fool throwing balls across the street.",
    ["如果你要去，请帮我带一枝花给莉奥娜小姐可以吗？谢谢她上周的款待。"] = "If you go, could you please take a flower to Miss Leona for me? Thank her for her hospitality last week.",
    ["如果你觉得无聊，就陪我可爱的大宠物玩玩吧！"] = "If you feel bored, go play with my cute big pet!",
    ["如果你觉得老身是邪神，也可以转告附近的教会。当然，馈赠也就归他们了。"] = "If you think I am an Evil God, you can also report it to the nearby church. Of course, the gift will then belong to them.",
    ["如果你还有时间去研究那朵该死的云，那就去把我们的水手们从酒吧里拖回来！"] = "If you still have time to study that damn cloud, then go drag our sailors back from the bar!",
    ["如果你遇到困难，不要恐惧向朋友伸手求助，正是靠着守望互助，我们才能战胜仅凭个人难以面对的困难。"] = "If you encounter difficulties, do not fear reaching out to friends for help. It is by watching over and helping each other that we can overcome challenges that are difficult to face alone.",
    ["如果像男爵夫人所说，仆人胆小且诚实，那回应他的人到底是谁？"] = "If, as the Baroness said, the servant is timid and honest, then who was the one who responded to him?",
    ["如果再没有进展，我就去“魔匙学会”找阿尔菲女士帮帮忙吧。"] = "If there is no progress, I will go to the \"Magic Key Association\" and ask Ms. Alfie for help.",
    ["如果再耽误下去，恐怕我今晚就要躺在停尸房了。"] = "If we delay any longer, I'm afraid I'll be lying in the morgue tonight.",
    ["如果再遇到意外的污染，你可能会被祂的意志完全操控，陷入永恒的疯狂。"] = "If you encounter accidental corruption again, you may be completely controlled by His will and fall into eternal madness.",
    ["如果冒犯了她，她就会半夜溜进你家，往你脑子里塞些恐怖的东西。"] = "If you offend her, she will sneak into your house in the middle of the night and stuff terrifying things into your brain.",
    ["如果出行的距离不远，你也可以多走走，不坐公共马车。虽然每天只能省下一两个便士，但加在一起是很大一笔钱。"] = "If the distance isn't far, you can walk more instead of taking the public carriage. Although you can only save one or two pennies a day, it adds up to a large sum of money.",
    ["如果加入值夜者不顺利的话，还可以直接去大学面试！"] = "If joining the Nighthawks doesn't go well, I can still go directly to the university for the interview!",
    ["如果包含击杀，则击杀、助攻均触发该Event，默认不包含"] = "If kills are included, both kills and assists trigger this Event; defaults to not included",
    ["如果去古堡里面走走，也请您务必注意安全。毕竟，那里是一片无人看管的废墟，谁也不能保证意外和明天哪个先到来。"] = "If you go for a walk inside the castle, please be sure to pay attention to your safety. After all, it is an abandoned ruin with no one in charge, and no one can guarantee whether an accident or tomorrow will come first.",
    ["如果去学习的钱攒不够，那就再等等。或者先去小一点的工厂做学徒，边做边学。我觉得，只要努力，一定可以过上比现在更美好一点的生活的。"] = "If you haven't saved enough money for school, then wait a bit longer. Or go to a smaller factory to be an apprentice and learn while you work. I think as long as you work hard, you can definitely live a life a little better than now.",
    ["如果只有你，你还扛得住吗？我看，就算是艾里克向你再打一拳，你都会摔倒在地。"] = "If it were only you, could you still hold up? I think that even if Eric hit you one more time, you would fall to the ground.",
    ["如果可以的话……能不能拍一张弗莱队长收到礼物时的照片？不用特意摆什么姿势，平常的样子就好。他不说话站在那里时，有种让人特别安心的感觉。"] = "If possible... could you take a photo of Captain Frye when he receives the gift? No need to pose, just his usual self. When he stands there without speaking, he has a feeling that makes people feel particularly at ease.",
    ["如果可以的话，希望你对乔治保密，我想给他一个惊喜。"] = "If possible, I hope you keep it a secret from George; I want to give him a surprise.",
    ["如果可以的话，希望你对其他人保密。"] = "If possible, I hope you keep it a secret from others.",
    ["如果喜欢，我可以送你一些。"] = "If you like any, I can give you some.",
    ["如果因为害怕失控就不去研究，那饥饿、贫穷、疾病这些问题就永远解决不了。"] = "If I didn't do research because I was afraid of losing control, then problems like hunger, poverty, and disease would never be solved.",
    ["如果在buff中使用，不要配置该项"] = "Do not configure this item if used in a buff",
    ["如果在buff中使用，不要配置这一栏"] = "Do not configure this field if used in a buff",
    ["如果在告白前喝下它，你会充满勇气，无往不利！"] = "If you drink it before a confession, you will be full of courage and nothing will stand in your way!",
    ["如果在春天，一对恋人"] = "If in spring, a pair of lovers",
    ["如果在申请之前做一定的铺垫来应对调查，这个选项显然更安全。保险起见，最好还是做一次占卜。"] = "If I lay some groundwork before applying to deal with the investigation, this option is clearly safer. To be safe, it's best to perform a divination.",
    ["如果在这山中见到他，请您一定劝他回来……"] = "If you see him in these mountains, please, you must persuade him to come back...",
    ["如果坏人都死了，这个世界就会更美好吧……"] = "If all the bad people were dead, the world would be a better place...",
    ["如果女神不愿赐予我馅饼，又为什么让我闻到馅饼的味道？"] = "If the Goddess is unwilling to grant me a pie, why did she let me smell the pie?",
    ["如果她能放下，这项链在哪也无所谓了吧……"] = "If she could let go, it wouldn't matter where the necklace is...",
    ["如果妈妈也在这里就好了……珍妮会送给妈妈漂亮的项链，妈妈会把最肥美的鹅腿，拿给珍妮吃……"] = "If only Mother were here too... Jenny would give Mother a beautiful necklace, and Mother would give the fattest goose leg to Jenny to eat...",
    ["如果它是逆位——逆位塔的含义是“在毁灭后重建”。"] = "If it's reversed—the meaning of the reversed Tower is 'rebuilding after destruction'.",
    ["如果实在没有想法，不如参考一下其他人的建议？"] = "If you really have no ideas, why not refer to other people's suggestions?",
    ["如果实在缺乏一点勇气迈出第一步，我可以轻轻推你一把。"] = "If you truly lack the courage to take the first step, I can give you a gentle push.",
    ["如果客人给小费，鞠躬说谢谢；如果不给，也绷住你们的面皮！"] = "If a guest gives a tip, bow and say thank you; if they don't, keep a straight face!",
    ["如果少出一点场地费，节省下来的钱，就能实现她的心愿了。所以……真的不能再少一点吗？我们真的没有更多的了……"] = "If the venue fee were a little lower, the money saved would be enough to fulfill her wish. So... can it really not be any lower? We really don't have any more...",
    ["如果带走了美丽的蔬菜，请把您的便士放在这里。\n因为我勤劳地侍弄着田地，所以无法分身前来。\n祝您有快乐的一餐。"] = "If you take these beautiful vegetables, please leave your pennies here.\nBecause I am busy tending to the fields, I cannot come to collect them myself.\nI wish you a happy meal.",
    ["如果强行摧毁，不仅会被污染侵蚀，还可能直接被信息洪流吞没。"] = "If we try to destroy it by force, we will not only be eroded by corruption but also potentially swallowed whole by the Torrent of Information.",
    ["如果当年我没有走上这条歪路，也许今天在某个地方喝茶吧……"] = "If I hadn't gone down this crooked path back then, perhaps I'd be drinking tea somewhere today...",
    ["如果您一定要去，请等警署清理完毕，<P_Heart>（看向达克西）</>你们会驱逐那个鬼魂的，对吧？"] = "If you must go, please wait until the police station has finished clearing it. <P_Heart>(Looks at Daksy)</> You guys will exorcise that ghost, right?",
    ["如果您不介意的话，用这顶帽子为我母亲表演吧。"] = "If you don't mind, please use this hat to perform for my mother.",
    ["如果您只是想临时换点酒钱，可以拿走那边的猪膀胱，下街那边的外来酒贩很乐意收散货。"] = "If you are just looking to earn some quick pocket money for drinks, you can take that pig bladder over there; the foreign liquor vendors on Lower Street are quite happy to buy bulk goods.",
    ["如果您只有一个小箱子，1便士就够了。"] = "If you only have a small suitcase, 1 penny is enough.",
    ["如果您周末再来一趟的话，就不会这么想了。"] = "If you came back on the weekend, you wouldn't think so.",
    ["如果您喜欢《诡秘之主》，欢迎为我们评分。您的支持将帮助我们做得更好！"] = "If you enjoy \"Lord of Mysteries\", please rate us. Your support will help us do better!",
    ["如果您喜欢柔软细腻的甜点，不要错过新推出的焦糖布丁。"] = "If you prefer soft and delicate desserts, don't miss our newly launched crème brûlée.",
    ["如果您喜欢，我们也可以进去看看，我想老板很高兴见到美丽的女士试戴珠宝。"] = "If you like, we can go in and take a look. I think the owner would be happy to see a beautiful lady trying on jewelry.",
    ["如果您在漫游时对某个地点感到困惑，不妨随时回想我在地图上为您指出的方位，清晰的记忆是最好的路标。 "] = "If you feel confused about a location while roaming, you might as well recall the directions I pointed out for you on the map at any time; clear memory is the best road sign.",
    ["如果您对这艘邮轮有什么好奇的地方，请允许我为您解答。"] = "If you have any questions about this cruise ship, please allow me to answer them for you.",
    ["如果您想补充体力，新鲜的肉鱼，外皮煎得金黄酥脆，内里鲜嫩多汁，咬一口仿佛能尝到铁十字街海风的咸香，绝对是您的不二之选！"] = "If you want to replenish your energy, fresh meat and fish, with the skin fried golden and crispy, and the inside tender and juicy, one bite and you can almost taste the salty fragrance of the Iron Cross Street sea breeze, it is definitely your best choice!",
    ["如果您想要比较特别的款式，我也很乐意替您设计。"] = "If you want a more special style, I would be happy to design one for you.",
    ["如果您愿意的话，我可以为伊莎贝尔小姐安排入学考试。"] = "If you are willing, I can arrange an entrance examination for Miss Isabelle.",
    ["如果您愿意补偿三天工钱 我们会感激您的慷慨"] = "If you are willing to compensate them with three days' wages, we would be grateful for your generosity.",
    ["如果您愿意，我可以为伊莎贝尔小姐安排入学考试。"] = "If you are willing, I can arrange an entrance exam for Miss Isabelle.",
    ["如果您愿意，请多与他说说话吧，即使他不能用声音回应您。"] = "If you are willing, please talk to him more, even if he cannot respond to you with his voice.",
    ["如果您愿意，请支持我们少爷所在的红色队伍！"] = "If you are willing, please support the red team where our young master is!",
    ["如果您手头拮据，也可以像某些常客一样，用美味的自制烤面包或漂亮的珍藏版书籍换取一晚的住宿。"] = "If you are short on cash, you can also, like some regular customers, exchange a night's stay for delicious homemade bread or beautiful collector's edition books.",
    ["如果您手里有“特殊来源”的货品，也可以交给我寄售。"] = "If you have goods with a 'special origin' in your hands, you can also entrust them to me for consignment.",
    ["如果您是一位年轻的学生或政府职员，每个周末还可以到这里借用安静的房间作为自习室。"] = "If you are a young student or a government clerk, you can also come here every weekend to borrow a quiet room as a study.",
    ["如果您是来等待主教先生的，很抱歉，我们可能会占用他接下来的时间。"] = "If you are here to wait for the Bishop, I'm sorry, we might take up the rest of his time.",
    ["如果您有选票的话，请投一票给德维尔老爷，他一定不会辜负您的期望的。"] = "If you have a vote, please cast it for Sir Derval; he will certainly not let you down.",
    ["如果您真想招人，还是拿出点诚意吧。"] = "If you really want to hire someone, show some sincerity.",
    ["如果您要举办茶会或沙龙，还可以获得优惠的定价。"] = "If you are hosting a tea party or salon, you can also get discounted pricing.",
    ["如果您见到他……请告诉他，他的母亲夏琳夫人一直在山脚祈祷，祈祷女神保佑他……"] = "If you see him... please tell him that his mother, Lady Charlene, has been praying at the foot of the mountain, praying for the Goddess to protect him...",
    ["如果您见到他，告诉他我们在等他。"] = "If you see him, tell him we are waiting for him.",
    ["如果您认为合适的话，或许我可以接手。您提一个合适的价格吧。"] = "If you think it is appropriate, perhaps I could take it over. Please name a fair price.",
    ["如果想买早餐的话，我会推荐饱腹感强的黑麦面包。"] = "If you want to buy breakfast, I would recommend rye bread, which is very filling.",
    ["如果想找个安静点的地方，可以去屏障碎片旁边的灵界观测房。"] = "If you want to find a quieter place, you can go to the Spirit World observation room next to the Barrier fragment.",
    ["如果想要量身定制的衣服，欢迎找我来量尺寸。"] = "If you want custom-made clothes, you are welcome to find me to take your measurements.",
    ["如果成功的话，仅仅需要对应的坐标点，就能实现“传送”了。"] = "If successful, you only need the corresponding coordinate points to achieve 'Teleport'.",
    ["如果我们没有及时赶到，这些被诅咒的人……"] = "If we don't arrive in time, these cursed people...",
    ["如果我们身处梦中，或更令人欣慰。没有危险与疯狂，没有流血与牺牲……"] = "If we are in a dream, or even more comforting. No danger and madness, no Bleed and sacrifice...",
    ["如果我像弃置醋栗一样弃置黑夜，那我以后又要向谁祷告？又有谁来倾听我的迷惘与罪孽？"] = "If I discard the Evernight as I discarded the gooseberries, then to whom shall I pray in the future? And who will listen to my confusion and sins?",
    ["如果我出了什么事，希望大家能帮忙照顾我的女儿，守护她的幸福。"] = "If anything happens to me, I hope you can help take care of my daughter and guard her happiness.",
    ["如果我和他们一样，那就是落入了圈套！"] = "If I were like them, I would have fallen into the trap!",
    ["如果我当时也能及时救下老师……算了，不说这个了 。您喜欢什么味道，我也帮您做一个香味蜡烛。"] = "If I could have saved the teacher in time back then... Never mind, let's not talk about that. What scent do you like? I'll help you make a scented candle too.",
    ["如果我打得过他，我会和你一起去的，只是……我会在这等你好消息！"] = "If I could beat him, I would go with you, but... I will wait here for your good news!",
    ["如果我是安东尼神父，一定会拿权杖狠狠地敲他，像驱赶一条咬人的疯狗那样把他赶走！"] = "If I were Father Anthony, I would definitely hit him hard with a scepter and drive him away like chasing a biting mad dog!",
    ["如果我有好好保存其他笔记就好了，怪想她的。"] = "If only I had kept the other notes well; I miss her.",
    ["如果我死了，会有人在这些长椅上纪念我吗？"] = "If I die, will anyone commemorate me on these benches?",
    ["如果我没有看见你放下包裹，我一定会相信的。"] = "If I hadn't seen you put down the package, I would definitely have believed it.",
    ["如果我没猜错，连接琴弦的调音钉在打斗中松动了。"] = "If I am not mistaken, the tuning pins connected to the strings have loosened during the scuffle.",
    ["如果我没记错的话，这里是黛西小姐的住宅？"] = "If I remember correctly, is this Miss Daisy's residence?",
    ["如果我注定要死去，没有见过她美丽的容颜将成为我最大的遗憾！"] = "If I am destined to die, not seeing her beautiful face will be my greatest regret!",
    ["如果我的主人能像您一样有效率，我将原谅她上次拿我当借口拖稿的事情。"] = "If my master were as efficient as you, I would forgive her for using me as an excuse to delay her manuscript last time.",
    ["如果我能像佛尔思女士一样有才气，新作就能在贝克兰德大剧院长期驻演了吧……"] = "If I had the talent like Miss Fors, my new work could have been performed at the Backlund Grand Theater for a long time...",
    ["如果我能加入启明小队，我会帮你了解菲丽丝的事。"] = "If I can join the Dawn Squad, I will help you find out about Phyllis.",
    ["如果我能拿到，应该怎么给你？又怎么保证配方的真实性？"] = "If I can get it, how should I give it to you? And how can I ensure the authenticity of the formula?",
    ["如果我能拿到，应该怎么给你？又怎么保证魔药配方的真实性？"] = "If I can get them, how should I give them to you? And how can I ensure the authenticity of the potion formulas?",
    ["如果我被别的客人缠住了，哥哥可要来把我救走哦！"] = "If I get pestered by other guests, you have to come and rescue me, brother!",
    ["如果我被带走关起来，那些人怎么办？"] = "If I'm taken away and locked up, what will happen to those people?",
    ["如果我迷路了……我会敲敲头顶的砖块，这样您就能判断我的位置。"] = "If I get lost... I will knock on the bricks above my head so you can determine my location.",
    ["如果我骗了你，我就是卷毛狒狒！"] = "If I lied to you, I'm a Curly-Haired Baboon!",
    ["如果所有计划都实现了，那才叫意外。 "] = "If every plan went exactly as intended, that would be the real surprise.",
    ["如果提前察觉，或许能避免不必要的牺牲。"] = "If we detect it early, perhaps we can avoid unnecessary sacrifices.",
    ["如果政府真的决定通过考试来选拔官员，这些付出都是值得的。"] = "If the government really decides to select officials through examinations, these efforts will be worth it.",
    ["如果是“月亮”先生的话，他听到你说吸血鬼，可能会很生气，然后告诉你他很生气，应该不会再做什么了。"] = "If it's Mr. Moon, he might get very angry when he hears you say vampire, and then tell you he is very angry, but he probably won't do anything else.",
    ["如果是前者你可以放心尝试，就算出现了些小意外，我应该都能挽救得回来。"] = "If it's the former, you can try it with confidence. Even if there are some small Accidents, I should be able to save it.",
    ["如果是后者，书架上的书应该能满足你这个时期的需要，我推荐你从左到右开始阅读。"] = "If it's the latter, the books on the shelf should meet your needs at this stage. I recommend you start reading from left to right.",
    ["如果是已经诞生的孩子，我确实有办法占卜。不过目前的情况来看，还需要等好几个月。"] = "If it is a child that has already been born, I do have a way to divine it. However, given the current situation, it will take several more months.",
    ["如果是罗塞尔大帝，此时他会怎么做？"] = "If it were Emperor Roselle, what would he do at this moment?",
    ["如果有不稳定的征兆——噩梦、幻痛、过度敏锐——随时回来找我。赞美女神。"] = "If there are any signs of instability—nightmares, phantom pain, or hypersensitivity—come back to see me at any time. Praise the Goddess.",
    ["如果有个方便去那个俱乐部的人就好了。"] = "If only there were someone who could easily go to that Club.",
    ["如果有人翻至最后一页，会讶异地发现一则叛逆的《魔女与野兽》，那是你曾一时兴起书写的戏仿之作。"] = "If someone flips to the last page, they would be surprised to find a rebellious 'Witch and the Beast', a parody you wrote on a whim.",
    ["如果有兴趣，您可以直接试试看。"] = "If you're interested, you can try them on directly.",
    ["如果有其他尺寸的需要，您可以到旁边登记。等货做好了，我会通知您来领取的。"] = "If you have other size requirements, you can register next door. When the goods are ready, I will notify you to come and pick them up.",
    ["如果有其他需要我们协助的地方，请随时联系我。"] = "If there is anything else you need our assistance with, please contact me at any time.",
    ["如果有善良又能干的人能从林子里帮我抓几只兔子就好了……"] = "If only there were a kind and capable person who could help me catch a few rabbits from the woods...",
    ["如果有机会，我还会再来闻闻雏菊的芳香，再见。"] = "If there is a chance, I will come back to smell the fragrance of the daisies again. Goodbye.",
    ["如果有玩家锁定了Owner，则把该玩家的锁定目标更改为本Actor"] = "If a player has locked onto the Owner, change that player's locked target to this Actor",
    ["如果本站没有进行任何操作，下一站所有买入价格降低<LightHighlight>80%</>，卖出价提升<LightHighlight>80%</>"] = "If no operations are performed at this station, all purchase prices at the next station are reduced by <LightHighlight> 80% </>, and selling prices are increased by <LightHighlight> 80% </>",
    ["如果桶里的酒喝不完，我是不是也长不大？"] = "If I can't finish the wine in the barrel, will I not grow up either?",
    ["如果每个人再减少一点工资，工厂成本就能再少一点……我就能早点环游世界了。"] = "If everyone's wages were reduced a little more, the factory's costs could be lower... and I could travel the world sooner.",
    ["如果每个人再少发点工资，工厂成本就能再少些……"] = "If everyone's wages were cut a little more, factory costs could be reduced even further...",
    ["如果每位小绅士都像您这么悠闲……"] = "If every little gentleman were as leisurely as you...",
    ["如果没什么新的进展，应该很快就能回去了……"] = "If there is no new progress, I should be able to go back soon...",
    ["如果没有人再提出反对，就请新郎新娘在这份婚书上签字，缔结正式婚约。"] = "If no one has any further objections, please have the bride and groom sign this marriage contract to conclude the formal engagement.",
    ["如果没有他，我可能也和那些水手和下甲板的乘客一样，葬身大海。"] = "If it weren't for him, I might have ended up like those sailors and passengers on the lower deck, buried at sea.",
    ["如果没有其他的事情，今天的聚会就到这里吧。<P_Heart>（头有些痛，感觉快撑不住了……）</>"] = "If there is nothing else, let's end today's gathering here. <P_Heart>(My head hurts a bit, I feel like I can't hold on much longer...)</>",
    ["如果没有别的问题，我就要去做些更有意义的事情了。"] = "If there are no other questions, I'm going to go do something more meaningful.",
    ["如果没有合适队友，单人参赛也是很好的锻炼。"] = "If there is no suitable teammate, participating alone is also a good exercise.",
    ["如果没有弟弟妹妹，我会失去很多生活和工作的动力……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>算了，不说这些了。"] = "If it weren't for my younger brother and sister, I would have lost a lot of motivation for life and work... <P_Heart>(Pauses)</> Forget it, let's not talk about this.",
    ["如果没有想法，不如问问其他人的看法？"] = "If you have no ideas, why not ask for others' opinions?",
    ["如果没有随之而来的催稿信，那世界上再不会有比它更完美的事了。"] = "If it weren't for the follow-up letters urging me to finish my manuscript, there would be nothing more perfect in the world.",
    ["如果海里也有座椅，我想它们会进化出合适的部位的。"] = "If there were seats in the ocean, I think they would evolve the appropriate parts.",
    ["如果清除的层数小于当前已有层数，则Buff会有剩余层数存留，未完全移除。填0或不填代表完全清除。"] = "If the number of layers cleared is less than the current number of layers, the Buff will have remaining layers and will not be completely removed. Filling 0 or leaving it blank means complete removal.",
    ["如果盖错了呢？"] = "What if you use the wrong one?",
    ["如果目标为负面情绪和中立[-2,-1,0]时,在BUFF持续期\n内将其变成1或者2(随机)"] = "If the target is in a negative emotion or neutral state [-2, -1, 0], change it to 1 or 2 (random) during the BUFF duration \n.",
    ["如果目标是已经被分裂攻击过的，伤害衰减系数"] = "Damage attenuation coefficient if the target has already been hit by a split attack.",
    ["如果目标身上有标记buff，表示是已被攻击过的；然后标记buff的时长，用来控制多长事件内被重复攻击，才有伤害衰减；buff时间叠加规则为重置时长（区分来源）"] = "If a target has a mark buff, it means it has already been attacked; the duration of the mark buff is used to control how long it takes for repeated attacks to have damage decay; the buff time stacking rule is to reset the duration (distinguishing by source).",
    ["如果直接服用高品阶、超常规的魔药，很容易得到悲剧的下场。"] = "If one directly consumes a high-sequence, unconventional potion, it is very easy to meet a tragic end.",
    ["如果看见这张照片，小猫说不定能想起来。"] = "If the kitten sees this photo, it might remember something.",
    ["如果真是这个原因，{{先生|女士}}，能否请你帮忙照看下这位老先生。"] = "If that is truly the reason, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, could I ask you to help look after this old gentleman?",
    ["如果真的有幽灵，这可不是我能处理的事……还是让专业的人来管吧。"] = "If there really are ghosts, this isn't something I can handle... better let the professionals take care of it.",
    ["如果睡莲仙女会出现的“正午的午夜”指的不是一个具体的时间……"] = "If the 'Midnight of Noon' when the Water Lily Fairy appears doesn't refer to a specific time...",
    ["如果等到他的话！"] = "If we wait for him!",
    ["如果能和其他东西结合起来的话，事情应该就明朗了……\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：神奇物品订购信）</>"] = "If this could be combined with other things, things should become clear... \n<P_Yellow>(Obtained a clue and placed it in the Inventory: Mystical Item Order Letter)</>",
    ["如果能和其他东西结合起来的话，事情应该就明朗了……\\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：神奇物品订购信）</>"] = "If this could be combined with other things, things should become clear...\\n<P_Yellow>(Obtained clue and added to inventory: Magical Item Order Letter)</>",
    ["如果能够获知详细的操作步骤，那么我有一个大胆的想法……"] = "If I could learn the detailed operating steps, then I have a bold idea...",
    ["如果能完成这件事，我还会给你额外的报酬，我知道你是“占卜家”，密修会可以给你序列8的配方。"] = "If you can complete this, I will give you extra rewards. I know you are a Seer; the Rose School of Thought can give you the Sequence 8 formula.",
    ["如果能找到并进入那些隐藏空间，解开由他的执念形成的谜题，就能唤醒一部分……"] = "If we can find and enter those hidden spaces and solve the puzzles formed by his obsessions, we can awaken a portion of it...",
    ["如果能搞到《所罗门皇帝》的票，珍妮斯一定会答应我的邀约的！"] = "If I can get a ticket for \"Emperor Solomon,\" Janice will definitely accept my invitation!",
    ["如果能活着，也许现在也能是个圣者了。"] = "If I could have lived, perhaps I could have been a Saint by now.",
    ["如果能确认那里没有危险，我也许有办法……等我消息。"] = "If I can confirm there is no danger there, I might have a way... Wait for my news.",
    ["如果能联系到弗莱先生，或许就有办法带孩子们回去过生日了。"] = "If I can contact Mr. Frye, perhaps there's a way to take the children back for their birthday.",
    ["如果能自动生成建筑就好了……"] = "It would be great if buildings could be generated automatically...",
    ["如果见不到明天的夜晚，请女神眷顾我的家人一切平安。"] = "If I don't see tomorrow's night, please let the Goddess bless my family with peace.",
    ["如果警察找上门，我就说你是我养的宠物，怎么样？"] = "If the police come to the door, I'll just say you're my pet, how about that?",
    ["如果说，你很珍重的，挚爱的亲人离世了……"] = "If, say, a very precious, beloved family member of yours passed away...",
    ["如果身边出现过多巧合，不要忽略它们，那可能出自某位高序列的“观众”之手。"] = "If too many coincidences appear around you, do not ignore them; they might be the work of a high-sequence \"Spectator\".",
    ["如果近期的失踪者都还活着，只要找到他们在哪里，就能把他们救出来？"] = "If the recently missing people are all still alive, can we save them as long as we find where they are?",
    ["如果这两年您住在廷根，一定听说过<P_Yellow>乔纳尔医生</>的名字。"] = "If you have lived in Tingen for the past two years, you must have heard the name of <P_Yellow>Dr. Jonar</>.",
    ["如果这个女巫是真的？我一定要把腐烂三天的鱼从她鼻孔里塞进去！"] = "If this witch is real, I'm going to shove a fish that's been rotting for three days right up her nostrils!",
    ["如果送给朋友的话，我推荐紫罗兰或者雏菊。"] = "If it's a gift for a friend, I recommend violets or daisies.",
    ["如果需要我，就用力地吹响我。"] = "If you need me, blow me hard.",
    ["如果需要画肖像画，可以来找我。不过我很快就要出发了，真是令人期待。"] = "If you need a portrait, you can come find me. But I'll be leaving soon; it's truly exciting.",
    ["如果需要的话，可以再找“正义”女士做一次心理治疗。"] = "If needed, you can seek Psychotherapy from Ms. Justice again.",
    ["如果需要，也可以找我特别定制。"] = "If you need to, you can also have me customize one for you.",
    ["如果，如果可以，我还希望我的父母能够复活。​"] = "If, if it is possible, I also hope my parents can be resurrected.",
    ["如果，我们保护的，是整个廷根市的安全呢？"] = "What if the safety we are protecting is the safety of the entire Tingen city?",
    ["如果，我们背后的力量，是黑夜女神教会呢？"] = "What if the power behind us is the Church of the Evernight Goddess?",
    ["如此崇高，如此纯净，如此神圣。"] = "So noble, so pure, so holy.",
    ["如此恐慌"] = "Such Panic",
    ["如此阴暗的地下室，还能有什么光呢？"] = "In such a dark basement, what light could there be?",
    ["如沐爱河"] = "Bathed in Love",
    ["如火山般喷涌芝士面包"] = "Volcanic Cheese Bread",
    ["如画的"] = "Picturesque",
    ["如茵"] = "Ruyin",
    ["如遇到危险，请及时求助，守卫们将尽全力保障您的安全。"] = "If you encounter danger, please ask for help in time, and the guards will do their best to ensure your safety.",
    ["如银月光华的战马，点缀白金战甲，金色光纹如流光溢彩于皮毛间游走。"] = "A warhorse like silver moonlight, adorned with platinum armor, with golden light patterns flowing across its fur like shimmering light.",
    ["如雪"] = "Ruxue",
    ["如需提前解冻请缴纳保证金%s%s，细节描述待策划补充。EXCHANGE_MARKET_PENALTY_DETAIL_UNFREEZE_TEXT"] = "To unfreeze early, please pay a security deposit of %s%s. Details to be provided by planning. EXCHANGE_MARKET_PENALTY_DETAIL_UNFREEZE_TEXT",
    ["如需提前解冻，请缴纳保证金%s%s。缴纳后，将解除冻结状态，并进入7天观察期。\n7天内如没有其他异常行为，会返还保证金等额的绑定金镑。"] = "If you need to unfreeze early, please pay a deposit of %s %s. After payment, the frozen state will be lifted, and you will enter a 7-day observation period. \n If there is no other abnormal behavior within 7 days, the equivalent amount of bound pounds will be returned as the deposit.",
    ["妆容"] = "Makeup",
    ["妆容参数"] = "Makeup Parameters",
    ["妆容方案"] = "Makeup Scheme",
    ["妆容资源"] = "Makeup Resources",
    ["妆色面积"] = "Makeup area",
