    ["姐姐"] = "Big sister",
    ["姐姐……可是我见不到爸爸和妈妈了……"] = "Sister... but I can't see Mom and Dad anymore...",
    ["姐姐今晚这身，比上次那套还要好看。"] = "You look even better tonight than you did last time.",
    ["姐姐凯瑟琳"] = "Sister Catherine",
    ["姐姐和爸爸正在唱歌，珍妮爬上积成小山的礼物堆，把放在最上面的星星摘了下来送给他们。"] = "Sister and Father are singing. Jenny climbed up the pile of gifts that had formed a small hill and took the star from the very top to give to them.",
    ["姐姐看起来伤得很重……"] = "Sister looks like she's hurt badly...",
    ["姐姐睡着了？"] = "Is Big Sis asleep?",
    ["姐姐说，多亏了你劝她去学拳击。虽然每天训练很辛苦，但她很开心。"] = "Sister said, thanks to you persuading her to learn boxing. Although training is hard every day, she is very happy.",
    ["姐姐送给我的小熊掉到池塘里，再也拿不回来了……"] = "The teddy bear my sister gave me fell into the pond and I can't get it back...",
    ["姐姐！"] = "Big sister!",
    ["姐姐，加油！"] = "Sister, go for it!",
    ["姐姐，这个消息，我只跟你说，你别外传。"] = "Sister, I'm only telling you this news, don't spread it around.",
    ["姐姐，那我先回家了。"] = "Sister, then I'll go home first.",
    ["姓名"] = "Name",
    ["姓名：哈利·弗尔德\n性别：男\n年龄：11\n现居住地：<InvHighlight>廷根市香槟街57号</>\n家庭成员：父亲-布莱克·弗尔德\n基本信息：据调查，哈利的父亲布莱克无业多年，经常出没于赌场附近。周围邻居讲述经常听到他们家中传出叫骂声与孩子的哭声，疑似有家暴的情况。"] = "Name: Harry Field \n Gender: Male \n Age: 11 \n Current Residence: <InvHighlight> 57 Champagne Street, Tingen </> \n Family Members: Father - Blake Field \n Basic Information: According to the investigation, Harry's father, Blake, has been unemployed for many years and often hangs around casinos. Neighbors often report hearing shouting and a child's crying coming from their home, suggesting possible domestic violence.",
    ["姓名：艾恩·布朗\n性别：女\n年龄：13\n现居住地：<InvHighlight>廷根市贝西克街32号</>\n家庭成员：父亲-托马斯·布朗  \n　　　　　母亲-艾米丽·布朗\n基本信息：布朗父母亲均是船运工厂的普通员工，工厂其他员工对布朗夫妻评价较好。艾恩是布朗家唯一的女儿。据邻居讲述，布朗家境虽普通，但支持女儿去了昂贵的伊沃斯公学初等部读书，生活其他方面都比较拮据。"] = "Name: Ian Brown \n Gender: Female \n Age: 13 \n Current Residence: <InvHighlight> 32 Besik Street, Tingen </> \n Family Members: Father - Thomas Brown \n Mother - Emily Brown \n Basic Information: Both of Ian's parents are ordinary employees at a shipping factory, and other employees at the factory have a good opinion of the Brown couple. Ian is the only daughter of the Brown family. According to neighbors, although the Brown family's financial situation is ordinary, they supported their daughter in attending the expensive Eaves Public School primary department, and they are quite frugal in other aspects of life.",
