    ["嫩豌豆、土豆和打折的羔羊肉……嗯，今晚会是一顿丰盛的晚餐。"] = "Tender peas, potatoes, and discounted lamb... hmm, it will be a hearty dinner tonight.",
    ["嫩豌豆炖羔羊肉，真好吃。"] = "Lamb stew with young peas, so delicious.",
    ["嬉皮"] = "Hippie",
    ["嬉笑同行"] = "Laughing Together",
    ["子"] = "Zi",
    ["子倩"] = "Ziqian",
    ["子关卡"] = "Sub-level",
    ["子函"] = "Zihan",
    ["子博"] = "Zibo",
    ["子嗣会获得炼金能量，用来发动特殊技能炼金武装。"] = "The offspring will gain alchemical energy, which is used to trigger the special skill Alchemical Armament.",
    ["子嗣会获得炼金能量，用来发动特殊技能角斗仪式。"] = "The offspring will gain alchemical energy, which is used to trigger the special skill Gladiator Ritual.",
    ["子嗣守护"] = "Offspring Protection",
    ["子嗣守护-1星"] = "Offspring Protection - 1 Star",
    ["子嗣守护-2星"] = "Offspring Protection - 2 Star",
    ["子嗣守护-3星"] = "Offspring Protection - 3 Star",
    ["子嗣守护<Disable>锁定2名玩家</>，并且<Disable>依次</>发动跃斩攻击。"] = "Offspring Protection <Disable> locks onto 2 players </> and launches <Disable> sequential </> Leaping Slash attacks.",
    ["子嗣守护_先圆后环"] = "Offspring Protection_Circle First Then Ring",
    ["子嗣守护_地脉共鸣A1"] = "Offspring Protection_Ley Line Resonance A1",
    ["子嗣守护_地脉共鸣A2"] = "Offspring Protection_Ley Line Resonance A2",
    ["子嗣守护_矩形贴花8s_跟随目标"] = "Offspring Protection_Rectangular Decal 8s_Follow Target",
    ["子嗣守护_脱手旋转斩击"] = "Offspring Protection_Off-hand Spinning Slash",
    ["子嗣守护在<Disable>50%血量</>时，会陷入失控状态，期间会造成魔像暴走，频繁发动<Disable>大地震颤和地脉共鸣</>。"] = "When Offspring Protection is at <Disable> 50% Health </>, it will fall into a state of loss of control, during which the Golem will go berserk, frequently launching <Disable> Earth Tremor and Ley Line Resonance </>.",
    ["子嗣守护战斗"] = "Offspring Protection Combat",
    ["子嗣守护持剑发动范围攻击时，命中不低于3名敌人，即对被命中对象添加一层灵性侵蚀。累积3层后，会被发动一次压制攻击。"] = "When Offspring Protection attacks in an area while wielding a sword, hitting no fewer than 3 enemies adds one layer of Spirituality Erosion to the targets. After accumulating 3 layers, a Suppression Attack will be triggered.",
    ["子嗣守护汲取果园地脉的力量，引爆后造成<Disable>圆形范围</>或<Disable>环形范围</>伤害。"] = "Offspring Protection draws power from the orchard's ley lines, detonating to deal <Disable> circular area </> or <Disable> ring area </> damage.",
    ["子嗣守护炼制出土魔像，土魔像会复现<Disable>大地震颤</>或<Disable>地脉共鸣</>。"] = "Offspring Protection refines an Earth Golem, which will replicate <Disable> Earth Tremor </> or <Disable> Ley Line Resonance </>.",
    ["子嗣守护用连接线特效表现"] = "Offspring Protection connection line effect display",
    ["子嗣守护的力量失控了"] = "The power of Offspring Protection has lost control",
    ["子嗣守护的炼金大剑具备邪恶的力量。当它<Highlight>持剑发动范围攻击</>时，若一次性命中<Highlight>不低于3名</>非凡者，则会对被命中的非凡者施加一层灵性侵蚀。当非凡者灵性侵蚀累积达到3层时，它会额外发动一次<Highlight>压制攻击</>，降低攻击对象的伤害能力，且对象会持续损失生命。"] = "The Alchemical Greatsword of Offspring Protection possesses evil power. When it <Highlight>launches an area attack while wielding the sword</>, if it hits <Highlight>no fewer than 3</> Beyonders at once, it will apply a layer of Spirituality Erosion to the hit Beyonders. When a Beyonder's Spirituality Erosion accumulates to 3 layers, it will additionally launch a <Highlight>Suppression Attack</>, reducing the target's damage-dealing ability, and the target will continuously lose health.",
    ["子嗣守护紧盯着你"] = "Offspring Protection is staring at you",
    ["子嗣守护进入战斗后，会获得炼金能量。随战斗时间流逝，或特定技能命中玩家时会增长能量。能量计数达到100%后，子嗣守护会进入失控状态，发动“炼金武装”，且失控状态下受到攻击会削减能量计数，当计数为0后，子嗣守护会进入破防状态。"] = "Upon entering combat, the Offspring Protection gains alchemical energy. Energy increases over time or when specific skills hit players. Once the energy count reaches 100%, the Offspring Protection enters a state of loss of control and initiates \"Alchemical Armament\". Attacking it while in this state reduces the energy count; when the count reaches 0, the Offspring Protection enters an Armor Break state.",
    ["子嗣守护进入战斗后，会获得炼金能量。随战斗时间流逝，或特定技能命中玩家时会增长能量。能量计数达到100%后，子嗣守护会进入失控状态，发动“角斗仪式”，且失控状态下受到攻击会削减能量计数，当计数归0后，子嗣守护会进入破防状态。"] = "Upon entering combat, the Offspring Protection gains alchemical energy. Energy increases over time or when specific skills hit players. Once the energy count reaches 100%, the Offspring Protection enters a state of loss of control and initiates the \"Gladiator Ritual\". Attacking it while in this state reduces the energy count; when the count reaches 0, the Offspring Protection enters an Armor Break state.",
    ["子嗣守护通过<Disable>紫色灵性视线锁定玩家</>时，使用大剑发动蓄力斩击，造成<Disable>矩形范围</>伤害。"] = "When Offspring Protection locks onto a player via <Disable> purple spirituality vision </>, it uses a greatsword to launch a charged Slash, dealing <Disable> rectangular area </> damage.",
    ["子嗣守护通过炼金法阵引出地脉的力量，频繁炼制土魔像并发动<Disable>大地震颤</>时。"] = "Offspring Protection draws out the power of the ley lines through an alchemy circle, frequently refining Earth Golems and launching <Disable> Earth Tremor </>.",
    ["子嗣怨念"] = "Offspring Resentment",
    ["子嗣？！"] = "Offspring?!",
