    ["子爵夫人Buff挂可移动攻击盒"] = "Viscountess Buff - Hang Movable Attack Box",
    ["子爵夫人boss战，黑荆棘成员并肩作战"] = "Viscountess boss fight, Nighthawks fight side by side",
    ["子爵夫人idle时环身特效"] = "Viscountess idle body effect",
    ["子爵夫人·五月庄园（普通）"] = "Viscountess · May Manor (Normal)",
    ["子爵夫人二阶段-空气墙"] = "Viscountess Phase 2 - Air wall",
    ["子爵夫人二阶段召唤的所有的镜子都会高亮，玩家不能直接看出哪个镜子是正确的镜子，只有主动进入尝试，才能找到正确的镜子。"] = "All mirrors summoned by the Viscountess in the second phase will be highlighted. Players cannot tell which mirror is the correct one; they must actively enter them to find the right one.",
    ["子爵夫人亡者之花监听buff"] = "Viscountess Flower of the Dead monitor buff",
    ["子爵夫人作为“收尸人途径序列4”，具备主持高阶死亡与新生仪式的能力。"] = "As a Sequence 4 of the Corpse Collector Pathway, the Viscountess possesses the ability to preside over high-level rituals of death and rebirth.",
    ["子爵夫人切阶段无敌"] = "Viscountess phase change invincibility",
    ["子爵夫人占位"] = "Viscountess positioning",
    ["子爵夫人即将挟持距离她最远的队员，请小心！"] = "The Viscountess is about to take the teammate furthest from her hostage; please be careful!",
    ["子爵夫人受伤上限"] = "Viscountess Damage Cap",
    ["子爵夫人在场上召唤出1个<Disable>管家的执念体</>和1个<Disable>小子爵的执念体</>。触碰管家执念体的玩家会被捆绑，并<Disable>持续掉血</>。若执念体无人触碰或管家未被击杀，则会给子爵夫人提供增伤增益。"] = "The Viscountess summons 1 <Disable> Butler's Obsession body </> and 1 <Disable> Little Viscount's Obsession body </> on the field. Players who touch the Butler's Obsession body will be bound and <Disable> suffer continuous HP loss </>. If the obsession body is not touched by anyone or the Butler is not killed, it will provide a damage boost to the Viscountess.",
    ["子爵夫人在场上召唤出2个<Disable>管家的执念体</>和1个<Disable>小子爵的执念体</>。触碰管家执念体的玩家会被捆绑，并<Disable>持续掉血</>。若执念体无人触碰或管家未被击杀，则会给子爵夫人提供增伤增益。"] = "Viscountess summons 2 <Disable> Butler's Obsession bodies </> and 1 <Disable> Little Viscount's Obsession body </> on the field. Players who touch the Butler's Obsession body will be bound and <Disable> suffer continuous HP loss </>. If the obsession body is not touched by anyone or the Butler is not killed, it will provide a damage boost to the Viscountess.",
    ["子爵夫人她就站在那里，等着苹果树开花，等着果实成熟，等着她一直在等的人。"] = "The Viscountess just stood there, waiting for the apple tree to bloom, waiting for the fruit to ripen, waiting for the person she had always been waiting for.",
    ["子爵夫人将场地划分为4个区域，每个区域会有3面不同颜色的镜子。每过一段时间，随机3个区域会被污染覆盖，玩家需要找到<Disable>正确的镜子</>，通过灵性穿梭，到达安全的区域。进入错误的镜子，则会收到灵性污染，持续掉血。"] = "The Viscountess divides the field into 4 areas, each with 3 mirrors of different colors. Every period of time, 3 random areas will be covered by corruption. Players need to find the <Disable> correct mirror </> to travel through spirituality and reach a safe area. Entering the wrong mirror will result in spiritual corruption and continuous HP loss.",
    ["子爵夫人将攻击带有忠诚的队员，至多3次！超过3次，子爵夫人将会无差别攻击！"] = "The Viscountess will attack teammates with loyalty, up to 3 times! After more than 3 times, the Viscountess will attack indiscriminately!",
    ["子爵夫人幻化出亡者之花，快帮助小子爵显形，子爵夫人会避免他受伤！"] = "The Viscountess has manifested the Flower of the Dead; quickly help the young Viscount materialize; the Viscountess will prevent him from being hurt!",
    ["子爵夫人开启<Disable>黑暗场景</>，所有人会进入黑暗，黑暗将持续对玩家造成伤害。子爵夫人同时会对持有忠诚标记的玩家，进行大范围斩杀，并清除一层忠诚标记。若子爵夫人总斩杀次数<Disable>超过3次</>，仍未清除完所有忠诚标记，则子爵夫人耐心将会消失，并对所有人造成无差别斩杀。黑暗中，会出现<Disable>小子爵的引导</>，跟随引导，寻找到小子爵，可以解除黑暗。"] = "Viscountess activates <Disable> Dark Scene </>, and everyone enters darkness, which continuously deals damage to players. Viscountess will simultaneously launch a wide-range Slash at players holding a Loyalty Mark and clear one layer of the Loyalty Mark. If the Viscountess's total number of slashes <Disable> exceeds 3 times </> and all Loyalty Marks have not been cleared, the Viscountess's patience will vanish, and she will deal indiscriminate slashes to everyone. In the darkness, <Disable> Little Viscount's guidance </> will appear; follow the guidance to find the Little Viscount to dispel the darkness.",
    ["子爵夫人战斗区域"] = "Viscountess Combat Area",
    ["子爵夫人打开了冥界之门，小心地面挣扎的恶灵！"] = "The Viscountess has opened the Gate of the Underworld; watch out for the evil spirits struggling on the ground!",
    ["子爵夫人未发现可祭献的灵魂，会进入狂暴"] = "The Viscountess has not found a soul to sacrifice and will enter a berserk state",
    ["子爵夫人机制"] = "Viscountess Mechanism",
    ["子爵夫人的执念，强化自身"] = "Viscountess's obsession, self-strengthening",
    ["子爵夫人碎片"] = "Viscountess Fragment",
    ["子爵夫人蓄力一段时间后，会对全场造成不可躲避的伤害。玩家可以集合破碎的四叶手镯的力量，阻挡子爵夫人的死亡裁决"] = "After charging for a period of time, the Viscountess will deal unavoidable damage to the entire field. Players can gather the power of the shattered Four-Leaf Bracelet to block the Viscountess's Death Verdict.",
    ["子爵夫人蓄积能量形成护盾,需要尽快击碎"] = "Viscountess accumulates energy to form a shield, needs to be broken as soon as possible",
    ["子爵夫人超过三次进行斩杀，陷入疯狂"] = "The Viscountess has performed a killing blow more than three times and has fallen into madness",
    ["子爵夫人进行蓄力，同时小子爵和管家执念体会出现，小子爵会试图劝说子爵夫人放弃执念，但遭到管家执念体的阻碍。玩家需要<Disable>击杀所有管家执念体，并给与小子爵一定的帮助</>，让小子爵帮助玩家阻挡子爵夫人的必杀一击。"] = "The Viscountess charges up, while the Little Viscount and Butler's Obsession body appear. The Little Viscount will attempt to persuade the Viscountess to give up her obsession, but is hindered by the Butler's Obsession body. Players need to <Disable> kill all Butler's Obsession bodies and provide some help to the Little Viscount </>, allowing the Little Viscount to help players block the Viscountess's fatal blow.",
    ["子爵夫人逃走"] = "Viscountess escapes",
