    ["存在"] = "Exists",
    ["存在于此，却不存在于任何记录；知晓一切，却不被任何知识知晓。"] = "Existing here, yet existing in no records; knowing everything, yet known by no knowledge.",
    ["存在带有异变词条的非凡物质未选择，该词条非常稀有，是否确认本次选择？本次操作不可逆，如需确认，请手动输入“我同意”，并点击确认。"] = "There are Extraordinary materials with mutation affixes that have not been selected. This affix is very rare. Confirm this selection? This operation is irreversible. If you need to confirm, please manually enter \"I agree\" and click confirm.",
    ["存在带有异变词条的非凡物质，该词条非常稀有，是否确认分解？本次操作不可逆，如需确认，请手动输入“我同意”，并点击确认。"] = "There are Extraordinary materials with mutation affixes. This affix is very rare. Confirm dismantling? This operation is irreversible. If you need to confirm, please manually enter \"I agree\" and click confirm.",
