    ["学习技巧"] = "Learning Technique",
    ["学习技巧中"] = "Learning Technique...",
    ["学习的时候，没有些声音我不习惯。"] = "I'm not used to studying without some noise.",
    ["学会禁锢秘偶技能，使你获得将大范围内敌人秘偶化的能力：定身40米内的所有普通敌人，每层只能施放一次。"] = "Learned the Imprisoned Marionette skill, giving you the ability to turn enemies in a large area into marionettes: Immobilize all normal enemies within 40 meters, can be cast once per floor.",
    ["学会禁锢秘偶技能，使你获得将大范围内敌人秘偶化的能力：永久定身40码内的所有敌人，每层只能施放一次。"] = "Learned the Imprisoned Marionette skill, giving you the ability to marionettize enemies in a large area: permanently immobilizing all enemies within 40 yards, can only be cast once per floor.",
