    ["学徒途径：我来到，我看见，我记录。"] = "Apprentice Pathway: I came, I saw, I recorded.",
    ["学徒释放位移技能时进入灵体形态，移速提高并获得护盾，护盾消失后解除灵体形态。"] = "Apprentice enters spirit form when using a Displacement Skill, increasing movement speed and gaining a Shield; spirit form ends when the Shield disappears.",
