    ["学拳问道"] = "Learning Martial Arts",
    ["学校就不能给我们没中签的发租房补贴吗？我哪有时间去打工赚钱……"] = "Can't the school give us rent subsidies if we didn't win the lottery? Where would I find the time to work and earn money...",
    ["学校还在缩减历史系的研究预算，现在我的学生数量还没有五年前的一半多。"] = "The school is still cutting the research budget for the history department, and now the number of my students is not even half of what it was five years ago.",
    ["学派一楼愚者大厅附近是魔药房、休息室、文献室，远一点的地方是试炼区。"] = "Near the Fool's Hall on the first floor of the school are the Potion Room, lounge, and literature room; further away is the trial area.",
    ["学派内有发生任何不当行为都可以告知我，放心，消息来源会严格保密。"] = "Any misconduct within the school can be reported to me, rest assured, the source of the information will be kept strictly confidential.",
    ["学派守卫"] = "School Guard",
    ["学派徽章"] = "School Badge",
    ["学派掌握了几条途径的完整序列，付出足够的代价可以换取对应的配方和材料。"] = "The school has mastered the complete Sequences of several Pathways; by paying a sufficient price, one can exchange for the corresponding formulas and materials.",
    ["学派是个非常特别的场所。某种程度上，你可以认为这是“愚者”先生神国的一角。"] = "The school is a very special place. To some extent, you can consider this a corner of Mr. Fool's divine kingdom.",
