    ["学生4"] = "Student 4",
    ["学生们开始举行仪式"] = "The students begin to perform the ritual",
    ["学生布置仪式的东南角落，打算放置什么物品？"] = "What item do you intend to place in the southeast corner of the student's ritual setup?",
    ["学生布置仪式的北边角落，打算放置什么物品？"] = "What item do you intend to place in the north corner of the student's ritual setup?",
    ["学生布置仪式的西边角落，打算放置什么物品？"] = "What item do you intend to place in the west corner of the student's ritual setup?",
    ["学生的车"] = "Student's carriage",
    ["学生社团时常在此练舞，这次他们带来了全新的融合舞……\n持续参与，将获得某些神秘存在的馈赠。"] = "Student clubs often practice dancing here. This time, they have brought a brand new fusion dance... \n Continue participating to receive gifts from certain mysterious existences.",
    ["学生逃跑路点"] = "Student Escape Path Point",
    ["学生野餐"] = "Student Picnic",
    ["学生野餐书"] = "Student picnic book",
    ["学生镜头"] = "Student Camera",
    ["学生陆续进入"] = "Students Enter One After Another",
    ["学者"] = "Scholar",
    ["学者出招·始"] = "Scholar's Move: Start",
    ["学者出招·终"] = "Scholar's Move: End",
    ["学者天赋的窥秘人推荐携带知识逐人、光之折射、星沙、岁月的棋局进行战斗。"] = "For a Mystery Pryer with the Scholar talent, it is recommended to carry Knowledge Pursuit, Refraction of Light, Star Sand, and Gambit of the Ages for combat.",
    ["学者雕像"] = "Scholar Statue",
    ["学识"] = "Knowledge",
    ["学识大增加，武力小增加"] = "Knowledge Greatly Increased, Strength Slightly Increased",
    ["学识大增加，直觉小增加"] = "Knowledge Greatly Increased, Intuition Slightly Increased",
    ["学识大增加，魅力小增加"] = "Knowledge Greatly Increased, Charm Slightly Increased",
    ["学识大提升，魅力小提升"] = "Knowledge Greatly Increased, Charm Slightly Increased",
    ["学识提升"] = "Knowledge Increased",
    ["学费还是有点贵啊。"] = "The tuition is still a bit expensive.",
    ["学院区域"] = "Academy Area",
    ["学院大道"] = "College Avenue",
    ["学院大道\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Academy Avenue</>"] = "College Avenue\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Academy Avenue</>",
    ["学院大道-斯蒂芬斯街交叉"] = "College Avenue - Stephens Street intersection",
    ["学院服采集"] = "Academy Uniform Collection",
    ["学院的围墙上，青苔与泥土在方砖的缝隙里交替生长，一格青绿，一格棕黄。"] = "On the academy wall, moss and soil grow alternately in the gaps of the square bricks, one grid of green, one grid of brownish-yellow.",
    ["孩子"] = "Child",
    ["孩子们,知道今天为什么要带你们来拜访牺牲的战士吗？"] = "Children, do you know why I brought you here today to visit the fallen warriors?",
    ["孩子们已经离开了，找找瓦莱莉的愿望在哪里。"] = "The children have left. Let's find where Valerie's wish is.",
    ["孩子们望向夜空，试图分辨每个星星的名字。"] = "The children look up at the night sky, trying to distinguish the names of each star.",
    ["孩子们正在气头上，先去问问旁边的老妇人发生了什么吧。"] = "The children are furious. Let's go ask the old woman nearby what happened.",
    ["孩子们的进货单"] = "Children's order list",
    ["孩子们被辞退了？他们明明缺人，雇佣孩子在这个时代并不少见……他们为什么要这样做？"] = "The children were dismissed? They clearly lack manpower, and hiring children is not uncommon in this era... Why would they do this?",
    ["孩子们！休息一会儿！本杰明，你的生日面包来了，最大的那块！"] = "Children! Rest for a while! Benjamin, your birthday bread is here, the biggest piece!",
    ["孩子们，声音大一点、再大一点，让女神听到你们的歌声……"] = "Children, louder, a little louder, let the Goddess hear your singing...",
    ["孩子们，没有永恒的安全。"] = "Children, there is no eternal safety.",
    ["孩子们，背对终点的下一步是拥抱胜利。"] = "Children, the step after turning your back on the finish line is to embrace Victory.",
    ["孩子们，让爸爸一个人呆会儿吧。"] = "Children, let Dad stay alone for a while.",
    ["孩子们，记住，现在我们虽然吃不起这样的饭菜，但总有一天会坐在那儿。"] = "Children, remember, although we can't afford such meals now, one day we will be sitting there.",
    ["孩子停止哭泣，开始欢呼<h></>"] = "The child stops crying and starts cheering <h> </>",
    ["孩子呢？我孩子呢？"] = "Where is my child? Where is my child?",
    ["孩子和大人眼里的东西是不一样的，可能您真的需要找厂主谈谈了。"] = "Children and adults see things differently; perhaps you really need to talk to the factory owner.",
    ["孩子妈妈是谁？"] = "Who is the child's mother?",
    ["孩子走的时候，我还有布丁。"] = "When the child left, I still had Pudding.",
    ["孩子，不管你的队伍有没有获得冠军，妈妈都支持你！"] = "Child, no matter if your team wins the championship or not, Mom supports you!",
    ["孩子，来买蛋糕吗？"] = "Child, here to buy a cake?",
    ["孩子，殿下很忙碌，教会会照顾你。"] = "Child, Her Highness is very busy. The Church will take care of you.",
    ["孩子，母亲早已为你安排好了未来……"] = "Child, Mother has already arranged your future...",
    ["孩子，看到了吗，这就是廷根的知识雕塑。"] = "Child, do you see? This is Tingen's Sculpture of Knowledge.",
    ["孩童雕像"] = "Child Statue",
    ["孱弱的人类，也可以新生为传奇。"] = "Weak humans can also be reborn as legends.",
    ["宁夏"] = "Ningxia",
    ["宁夏回族自治区"] = "Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region",
    ["宁德"] = "Ningde",
    ["宁波"] = "Ningbo",
    ["宁芙"] = "Nymph",
    ["宁芙镜头"] = "Nymph Lens",
    ["宁静圣徽"] = "Serenity Badge",
    ["宁静的"] = "Serene",
    ["宁静的乡村"] = "Quiet countryside",
    ["宁静舒适的典范。避震柔和，骑起来几乎没什么声音。黑夜教会提倡的安宁理念，特别适合夜间与住宅区使用。"] = "A model of peace and comfort. The shock absorption is soft, and it makes almost no sound when ridden. The concept of tranquility advocated by the Church of the Night is especially suitable for use at night and in residential areas.",
    ["宁静药剂"] = "Calming Potion",
    ["它 它就是火苗？"] = "It... it is the flame?",
    ["它——弗拉德的蒙塔古四世，国王的第四子，最年幼的雄狮……"] = "He—Vlad's Montague IV, the King's fourth son, the youngest lion...",
    ["它……"] = "It...",
    ["它……它真的很温暖。就像冬天的壁炉，像爸爸的手。"] = "It... it's really warm. Like a fireplace in winter, like Dad's hand.",
    ["它、它回来了？！"] = "It, it's back?!",
    ["它一直不睡觉，所以叫睡不着。"] = "It never sleeps, so it's called 'Can't Sleep.'",
    ["它一走，早上醒来，床边毯子空空的……"] = "Once it was gone, I'd wake up in the morning, and the blanket by the bed would be empty...",
    ["它不仅代表着资源，更是每个俱乐部成员共同努力、建设俱乐部的有力证明。俱乐部将与所有成员命运与共。"] = "It not only represents resources but is also powerful proof of every club member's joint efforts in building the club. The club will share the same fate as all its members.",
    ["它不会理你的。"] = "It won't pay attention to you.",
    ["它不理你，是不喜欢这个名字吗？"] = "It's ignoring you, does it not like the name?",
    ["它不能干点别的了吗？"] = "Can't it do something else?",
    ["它不诠释神秘，它即是神秘本身。"] = "It does not interpret mystery; it is mystery itself.",
    ["它不说话，却让厄运如影随形。苔丝老太太用它换来了终结，也留下了诅咒。"] = "It does not speak, yet it makes misfortune follow like a shadow. Old Lady Tess used it to bring about an end, but also left behind a curse.",
    ["它不适合继续留在这里，等等会有同事过来处理。"] = "It's not suitable to remain here. Colleagues will come to handle it shortly.",
    ["它书写规则，利用规则，禁锢它的敌人，把他们逼进绝路。"] = "It writes the rules, utilizes the rules, imprisons its enemies, and drives them into a dead end.",
    ["它什么时候到石头上……不管了，先抓住它！"] = "When did it get onto the rock... never mind, catch it first!",
    ["它从少女的血肉中诞生。\n那位因蒂斯大使一如既往，以品鉴奥尔米尔葡萄酒为由，向少女递去了邀约。夜色漫入房间，烛光暧昧，一切如常地向着他所期待的方向流淌——直到巨变骤然降临。\n火焰无声腾起。少女的腹部从内部撕裂，一道成年男子大小的身影从那娇小的躯壳中走出。血肉如潮水般涌动，攀附上身影，与不断滑落的液体交融，凝结成一件颜色深重的血色长袍。\n大使的瞳孔在惊恐中急剧收缩。长袍之下，那道身影的面貌倒映进他的眼睛：漂亮，妖异，宛若女性。火光跳动，血色长袍在摇曳中舒展开来，如同一朵正在盛开的蔷薇。\n兜帽之下，美人勾起一个令人魂飞魄散的笑容。\n而少女死前最后留在房间里的声音，此刻也与那笑容重叠，融为一体：\n“为了主。”"] = "It was born from the flesh and blood of the girl. \n That Intis ambassador, as usual, extended an invitation to the girl under the pretext of tasting Ormir wine. Night seeped into the room, candlelight was ambiguous, and everything flowed in the direction he expected—until a sudden, violent change descended. \n Flames rose silently. The girl's abdomen tore open from within, and a figure the size of an adult man stepped out from that petite shell. Flesh and blood surged like a tide, clinging to the figure, merging with the constantly sliding liquid, and condensing into a deep-colored blood-red robe. \n The ambassador's pupils contracted sharply in terror. Beneath the robe, the face of that figure was reflected in his eyes: beautiful, eerie, like a woman. The firelight danced, and the blood-red robe unfurled in the swaying, like a rose in bloom. \n Beneath the hood, the beauty curled her lips into a soul-shattering smile. \n And the last sound the girl left in the room before she died now overlapped with that smile, merging into one: \n \"For the Lord.\"",
    ["它们一定陪伴了你很久……振作一点！"] = "They must have kept you company for a long time... cheer up!",
    ["它们代表？"] = "What do they represent?",
    ["它们俯瞰大地的时候……可曾想过自己也会成为桥梁？"] = "When they looked down at the earth... did they ever think they would also become a bridge?",
    ["它们可能来源于我们的探索，我们的收集，也有可能是我们的敌人……和同伴。"] = "They might come from our explorations, our collections, or they could be our enemies... and our companions.",
    ["它们同时散发着晾晒过的香气、酒液的味道、眼泪和口水交织的生活气息。"] = "They simultaneously exude the scent of sun-dried laundry, the smell of alcohol, and the atmosphere of life intertwined with tears and saliva.",
    ["它们在撕咬猎物时会兴奋地嘶吼，"] = "They roar excitedly when tearing at their prey,",
    ["它们好像……是打不死的？"] = "They seem... impossible to kill?",
    ["它们好像要打起来了……或许能学到一些格斗技巧。"] = "They seem to be about to fight... perhaps I can learn some combat techniques.",
    ["它们富含油脂，通常我会建议大家回家再煎炸一番，不过，这取决于个人喜好！"] = "They are rich in oil, so I usually suggest that everyone fry them again when they get home, but that depends on personal preference!",
    ["它们对你真好"] = "They are so good to you",
    ["它们更多地运用了时兴复杂的工艺，造型也更加尖锐别致，齿轮、几何、星芒会让您显得个性又时髦，价格也很友好。"] = "They make more use of fashionable and complex craftsmanship, and their designs are sharper and more unique. Gears, geometric shapes, and starbursts will make you look individualistic and stylish, and the prices are quite friendly as well.",
    ["它们更多地运用了时兴复杂的工艺，造型也更加尖锐别致，齿轮、几何、星芒会让您显得高贵又潮流，价格也很友好。"] = "They make more use of trendy and complex craftsmanship, and the shapes are sharper and more unique. Gears, geometry, and starbursts will make you look noble and trendy, and the price is also very friendly.",
    ["它们曾经是什么？我……又是什么？"] = "What were they once? And... what am I?",
    ["它们的叫声很有特色。"] = "Their cooing is very unique.",
    ["它们的每片羽毛都闪烁着自由的光辉！"] = "Every one of their feathers shines with the brilliance of freedom!",
    ["它们的身上长满毛发，是否能起到迷惑敌人的作用？"] = "They are covered in fur; can it serve to confuse enemies?",
    ["它们肉垫里藏着利爪，可以趁其不备造成数道伤害。"] = "They hide sharp claws in their paw pads, which can be used to deal multiple wounds when caught off guard.",
    ["它们被划分为不同的危险等级，需要被严格看管或封印起来。"] = "They are classified into different danger levels and need to be strictly guarded or sealed.",
    ["它们被薄荷、玫瑰和柠檬簇拥着，精心包装成一束又一束——正好适合抱着走去黑夜教堂的大小。"] = "They are surrounded by mint, roses, and lemons, carefully wrapped into bouquets—just the right size to carry to the Nighthawks' church.",
    ["它们设计简洁，材料丰富。您可以根据颜色、样式和价格的分类挑选。"] = "They have simple designs and rich materials. You can choose based on color, style, and price categories.",
    ["它们跑哪去了？"] = "Where did they run off to?",
    ["它们都是古典华丽的风格，黄金、珍珠与钻石组成花束、蝴蝶与代表永恒的衔尾蛇，是非常有存在感的体面首饰。"] = "They are all in a classic, ornate style, with gold, pearls, and diamonds forming bouquets, butterflies, and the Ouroboros representing eternity. They are very decent pieces of jewelry with a strong sense of presence.",
    ["它会从礼帽里拉出人类吗？"] = "Will it pull a human out of the top hat?",
    ["它会让人看到平时看不见的东西，建议您小口啜饮。 "] = "It will make people see things they don't usually see. I suggest you sip it slowly.",
    ["它伫立于失序的权能之上，嘲弄与颠覆一切既有的秩序。"] = "It stands above the power of disorder, mocking and subverting all established order.",
    ["它似乎喜欢——上——你——了——"] = "It seems to have taken—a—liking—to—you—",
    ["它刚刚说晋升？看来背后真的有非凡者在搞鬼。"] = "Did it just say advancement? It seems there really is a Beyonder behind this causing trouble.",
    ["它又在撞门了！"] = "It's ramming the door again!",
    ["它只是晕倒了……你是自愿被它控制的？那你怎么会失去神智呢？"] = "It just fainted... were you controlled by it voluntarily? Then how could you lose your sanity?",
    ["它可以是任何人的惊喜。最珍贵的不是盒子里的东西，而是在屋顶上诞生的无数个奇妙世界。"] = "It can be a surprise for anyone. The most precious thing isn't what's in the box, but the countless wonderful worlds born on the rooftops.",
    ["它喜欢甜牛奶，也许一点甜食可以帮助你找到它……"] = "It likes sweet milk; perhaps a little treat can help you find it...",
    ["它回来了"] = "It's Back",
    ["它回来了-寻找摩根"] = "It's Back-Searching for Morgan",
    ["它回来了-怀表"] = "It's Back - Pocket Watch",
    ["它回来了-打听信息"] = "It's Back-Inquiring for Information",
    ["它回来了-找到失主"] = "It's Back-Finding the Owner",
    ["它回来了-摩根梦游"] = "It's Back-Morgan's Sleepwalking",
    ["它回来了-放回原位"] = "It's Back - Put Back in Place",
    ["它回来了-查看"] = "It's Back - View",
    ["它回来了-等待"] = "It's Back - Wait",
    ["它回来了-观察摩根"] = "It's Back-Observing Morgan",
    ["它回来了-说明真相"] = "It's Back-Explaining the Truth",
    ["它回来了触发"] = "It's back trigger",
    ["它回来了！"] = "It's back!",
    ["它在哪？"] = "Where is it?",
    ["它在找，它一直在找。"] = "It is searching, it has always been searching.",
    ["它在睡觉呢！"] = "It's sleeping!",
    ["它在这里起到什么作用？"] = "What purpose does it serve here?",
    ["它好像在偷看那群同类……"] = "It seems to be peeking at that group of its own kind...",
    ["它好像在盯着那只首领。"] = "It seems to be staring at that leader.",
    ["它好像对名字不太满意啊。"] = "It seems it's not very satisfied with its name.",
    ["它害怕？我比你们都害怕！"] = "It's scared? I'm more scared than both of you!",
    ["它封存着一声没有说出口的告别。"] = "It seals an unspoken farewell.",
    ["它将守护你，直至黎明到来。"] = "It will guard you until the dawn arrives.",
    ["它将随时准备盖下新的裁定。"] = "It is ready at any time to impose a new ruling.",
    ["它就喜欢这些东西！给了之后，它半夜都不会大叫了。要是实在凑不出来，丢点石头和破木板也行。"] = "It just loves these things! Once given, it won't scream in the middle of the night. If you really can't scrape anything together, throwing in some stones and broken wooden planks works too.",
    ["它就在这块地正下方，等它自己出来吧。"] = "It's right under this piece of land, let it come out by itself.",
    ["它就算变成了怪物，什么都不记得了，也不曾忘记守护的心。"] = "Even if it turned into a monster and forgot everything, it never forgot the heart of a guardian.",
    ["它属于因蒂斯的蒸汽与机械之神教会，近期因污染活化而出逃到鲁恩。"] = "It belongs to the Church of the God of Steam and Machinery in Intis, and it recently escaped to Loen due to the activation of the corruption.",
    ["它已经在了。"] = "It already is.",
    ["它已经离开了。"] = "It has already left.",
    ["它并不直接预示死亡。"] = "It does not directly predict death.",
    ["它快死了。\n有个女人把它救活了，那是\"妈妈\"。\n它学会了观察其他生物的战斗方式——猴子如何摇荡树枝借力，蛇如何预判猎物闪避。它将这些都融入自己的舞蹈中。\n保护家园，它愤而起舞。"] = "It was dying. \n A woman saved it; that was \"Mother.\" \n It learned to observe the fighting styles of other creatures—how monkeys swing from branches to gain leverage, and how snakes predict prey to dodge. It incorporated all of this into its own dance. \n To protect its home, it danced in anger.",
    ["它怎么像是在关心库克……先去看看库克的情况吧。"] = "Why does it seem like it's worried about Cook... I should go check on Cook first.",
    ["它总会回来。"] = "It will always come back.",
    ["它意味着：我会用我的方式，做我能做的事。"] = "It means: I will do what I can do in my own way.",
    ["它手忙脚乱地关了灶台，触手又伸向库克。"] = "It clumsily turns off the stove, and its tentacles reach toward Cook again.",
    ["它扬起时，脚下道路交错；它垂落时，所有旅途都是归途。"] = "When it is raised, the paths underfoot intersect; when it falls, all journeys are journeys home.",
    ["它把光收进怀里，等夜色邀约。"] = "It gathers light into its embrace, waiting for the night's invitation.",
    ["它提到的使命究竟是什么……过段时间再回来看看吧。"] = "What exactly is the mission it mentioned... I'll come back to check after a while.",
    ["它无名无姓，却知晓所有秘密；它愚笑他人，却难掩自悲。"] = "It has no name, yet it knows all secrets; it mocks others, yet can hardly hide its own sorrow.",
    ["它是“火种”的仿制品，效果非常接近。"] = "It is a replica of \"Kindling\", and the effect is very close.",
    ["它是人偶。"] = "It's a doll.",
    ["它是什么？"] = "What is it?",
    ["它是从因蒂斯进口、现在最潮流的款式，马甲边缘用了金线点缀，领口也用了真正的宝石来装饰。"] = "It's the trendiest style imported from Intis. The edges of the vest are decorated with gold thread, and the collar is decorated with real gemstones.",
    ["它是你生命能量和肉体状态的表现"] = "It is a manifestation of your life energy and physical state.",
    ["它是你生命能量和肉体状态的表现。"] = "It is the manifestation of your Life Energy and physical state.",
    ["它是当年罗塞尔大帝被刺杀后的遗物，其中有堕落母神污染的残留。"] = "It is a relic from when Emperor Roselle was assassinated, and it contains residual corruption from the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
    ["它是我们家族仅剩的东西了，承载的记忆比任何东西都宝贵。"] = "It is the only thing left of our family; the memories it carries are more precious than anything else.",
    ["它是我朋友的契约信使，现在正在运送一些……微不足道的信件。不对，是见证我们友情的交换日记，千万不能遗失。"] = "It is a contracted messenger for a friend of mine, currently delivering some... insignificant letters. No, it's a diary we exchange to witness our friendship, it must not be lost.",
    ["它是活的？"] = "Is it alive?",
    ["它是湖里一只安静的巨龟。\n它看过很多年风吹过湖面，也看过很多人来来去去。 \n岸边来了会流血的人，会祈祷的人，会变成石像的人，湖水变得越来越暖，暖得发胀，暖得发痛，每一寸血肉都在疯长， 连呼吸都像要裂开。\n它开始在水面上旋转、跳跃、咆哮， 挡住每一个想靠近湖心的人。 它分不清自己是在驱赶别人， 还是在向谁求救。"] = "It is a quiet giant turtle in the lake. \n It has watched the wind blow across the lake for many years, and it has watched many people come and go. \n People who bleed, people who pray, and people who turn into stone statues have come to the shore. The lake water has become warmer and warmer, warm to the point of swelling, warm to the point of pain. Every inch of flesh is growing wildly, and even breathing feels like it is about to tear apart. \n It begins to spin, jump, and roar on the surface of the water, blocking everyone who tries to approach the center of the lake. It cannot tell if it is driving others away or calling for help from someone.",
    ["它是精神体与灵界、星空沟通的方式，属于精神体的外在表现，与人本身的意志和当前的情绪直接相关"] = "It is the way the spirit body communicates with the Spirit World and the starry sky. It is an external manifestation of the spirit body and is directly related to a person's own will and current emotions.",
    ["它是精神体与灵界、星空沟通的方式，属于精神体的外在表现，与人本身的意志和当前的情绪直接相关。"] = "It is the way the spirit body communicates with the Spirit World and the starry sky. It belongs to the external manifestation of the spirit body and is directly related to a person's own will and current emotions.",
    ["它是能改变生命本质的魔法药剂 喝下吧"] = "It is a magical concoction that can alter the essence of life. Drink it.",
    ["它是能改变生命本质的魔法药剂，喝下吧。"] = "It is a magical potion that can change the essence of life. Drink it.",
    ["它曾帮我对抗过高序列的恶灵。但是，它必须守护我，无法全力对敌。"] = "It once helped me fight against high-Sequence evil spirits. However, it must guard me and cannot fight with full strength.",
    ["它曾看见深海最黑暗的秘密。"] = "It once saw the darkest secrets of the deep sea.",
    ["它曾经是守知派的圣物。起初只帮人整理记忆、归纳学过的知识。但它会和人交流，交流得越多，它给出得越深。从总结，变成推导，变成揭示。"] = "It was once a holy object of the School of Truth. At first, it only helped people organize memories and summarize learned knowledge. But it would communicate with people; the more it communicated, the deeper it gave. From summarizing, it became deducing, and then revealing.",
    ["它替无数个夜晚守过夜，现在轮到别人替它守了。"] = "It has stood guard for countless nights; now it is someone else's turn to stand guard for it.",
    ["它最后出现地点就是这里，一家制铅厂。"] = "Its last known location was here, a lead factory.",
    ["它最后的气息，是从站台方向传来的……"] = "Its last aura came from the direction of the platform...",
    ["它有什么用呢？"] = "What is it used for?",
    ["它有活着的特性，掌控着每件事情的概率。当封印物的反噬袭来时，它会替你掷一次骰子，只有六分之一的可能真正落到你身上。"] = "It possesses the characteristics of a living being, controlling the probability of every event. When the backlash of a Sealed Artifact strikes, it will roll a die for you; there is only a one-in-six chance that it will truly fall upon you.",
    ["它有点跛足，身上可能带着一股酒味。"] = "It has a slight limp and might smell like alcohol.",
    ["它来自\"秘偶大师\"罗萨戈的遗物。那个死去的人曾用它约束过多少秘密？\n莎伦苍白的手指抚过橘黄的纸面。把它递给了克莱恩，在煤气灯坏掉的僻静街道上，让明亮的光芒见证一个新的誓言。\n符号次第亮起，暖流一闪而逝。\n\"我好了。\"克莱恩将公证书递还了回去。\n莎伦平静颔首，淡漠的身影消失在车厢内。\n而那张空白的纸页，会继续等待一个新的约定——那是太阳永不熄灭的见证。"] = "It came from the relics of the \"Marionettist\" Rosago. How many secrets had that dead man constrained with it? \n Sharron's pale fingers brushed over the orange paper surface. She handed it to Klein, and in the quiet street where the gas lamp was broken, let the bright light witness a new vow. \n The symbols lit up one by one, and a warm current flashed and vanished. \n \"I'm done,\" Klein handed the notarization document back. \n Sharron nodded calmly, and her indifferent figure disappeared into the carriage. \n And that blank page would continue to wait for a new agreement—that is the witness of the sun that never goes out.",
    ["它每次只会用力撞一扇门，每次会撞击<P_Yellow>不一样</>的门，上次，是<P_Yellow>壁炉</>旁边的那扇门……"] = "It only bangs on one door at a time, and every time it will bang on a <P_Yellow> different </> door. Last time, it was the door next to the <P_Yellow> fireplace </>...",
    ["它每次只会用力撞一扇门，每次会撞击不一样的门，上次，是离植物最近的那扇门……"] = "It only crashes into one door with force each time, and it crashes into a different door each time. Last time, it was the one closest to the plants...",
    ["它永远朝着光，除非光本身就是假的，或是它本身是假的。"] = "It always faces the light, unless the light itself is fake, or it itself is fake.",
    ["它没有名字，却通向万千旅途的起点。"] = "It has no name, yet it leads to the starting point of a thousand journeys.",
    ["它没有忘记，它去了韦尔奇遗骨所在的地方，一直陪伴着他。"] = "It didn't forget. It went to the place where Welch's remains were and has been accompanying him.",
    ["它没有眉毛没有眼睛没有鼻子，只有一张嘴，舌头鲜红长满尖牙，顶端还长着五根手指……"] = "It has no eyebrows, no eyes, no nose, only a mouth, a bright red tongue covered in fangs, and five fingers growing at the tip...",
    ["它源自一个隐秘的地方——廷根的<P_Yellow>集体潜意识世界</>。"] = "It originates from a hidden place—Tingen's <P_Yellow> collective subconscious world </>.",
    ["它生长在现实与灵界的夹缝中。"] = "It grows in the crevice between reality and the Spirit World.",
    ["它用排水渠漂移过了五连发夹弯。"] = "It drifted through the five consecutive hairpins using the drainage ditch.",
    ["它用雕纹伪装成古典绅士，却把一肚子粉色小心机顶在头顶，等着路人多看一眼就露出狡黠的笑。"] = "It uses carvings to disguise itself as a classical gentleman, but keeps a belly full of pink little schemes on its head, waiting for passersby to take another look before revealing a cunning smile.",
    ["它由值夜者正式成员轮换看守，里面至少还有两位教会内部的“看守者”，以及数不清的陷阱。"] = "It is guarded by rotating official members of the Nighthawks, and there are at least two 'Keepers' inside the church, as well as countless traps.",
    ["它由值夜者正式成员轮换看守，里面至少还有两位教会内部的看守者，以及数不清的陷阱，千万不要随意靠近它，否则会沾染厄运。"] = "It is guarded by rotating official Nighthawk members, and there are at least two internal church guards inside, as well as countless traps. Do not approach it casually, or you will be tainted with bad luck.",
    ["它留下了……一封信？"] = "It left behind... a letter?",
    ["它的刺囊好适合用来擦鞋……等等，是不是在哪见过它？"] = "Its thorn sac is perfect for polishing shoes... Wait, have I seen this somewhere before?",
    ["它的力量在没有封印的情况下，足以毁灭一个国家、甚至整个世界。"] = "Without being sealed, its power is enough to destroy a country, or even the entire world.",
    ["它的力量在灵性中展开，复述着罗塞尔日记里被涂黑的那行秘密。"] = "Its power unfolds within spirituality, reciting the line of secrets blacked out in Roselle's diary.",
    ["它的历史可一点都不比鲁恩存在的时间短。"] = "Its history is no shorter than the time Loen has existed.",
    ["它的存在，只为成就一场狂欢盛宴，不论遮掩之下是怎样的表情。"] = "Its existence is only to achieve a carnival feast, regardless of what expression is beneath the mask.",
    ["它的每一缕丝线都见证着炼药之路上的各色非凡。"] = "Every thread of it has witnessed the various Beyonder paths on the road of alchemy.",
    ["它的负面效果能够让佩戴者一点点死去。压制周围敌人的封印物使其正面效果有概率失效，并间歇重伤、石化附近的怪物。代价是你自己的封印物同样被压制，生命持续流逝。"] = "Its negative effect causes the wearer to die bit by bit. The Sealed Artifact suppresses nearby enemies, causing its positive effects to have a chance of failing, while intermittently inflicting grievous injury and petrifying nearby monsters. The cost is that your own Sealed Artifacts are also suppressed, and your health continuously drains.",
    ["它的速度很快，我只看到车后面写着哈罗德百货。"] = "It was very fast; I only saw 'Harold Department Store' written on the back.",
    ["它看向你时，你看见的是谁？"] = "When it looks at you, who do you see?",
    ["它看得见你不愿意被别人看见的东西。"] = "It can see things you don't want others to see.",
    ["它竟然是封印物？我还以为是装饰品！"] = "It's actually a Sealed Artifact? I thought it was just a decoration!",
    ["它竟然有这种背景？"] = "He actually has that kind of background?",
    ["它给整个金秋湖带来丰饶，但同时也伴随着疯狂。"] = "It brings abundance to the entire Golden Autumn Lake, but it is also accompanied by madness.",
    ["它能利用学徒的力量，创造一个隐秘的空间，并帮您在这个空间和现实中切换，找到通路。"] = "It can use the power of an Apprentice to create a hidden space and help you switch between this space and reality to find a path.",
    ["它能唤醒一切，也能吞噬一切。当它的双眼长齐，便是主人的末日。"] = "It can awaken everything, and it can also devour everything. When its eyes are fully grown, it will be the end of its master.",
    ["它能让你提神醒脑一整夜，绝对不会在文献室睡着。效果是咖啡的，嗯，大概十倍吧。"] = "It can keep you refreshed all night, and you definitely won't fall asleep in the archives. The effect is, um, probably ten times that of coffee.",
    ["它能让你提神醒脑一整夜，绝对不会在文献室睡着，是考试周前学员们的最爱。"] = "It can keep you refreshed all night, ensuring you won't fall asleep in the literature room; it's a favorite among students before exam week.",
    ["它能让你的心灵不再紧绷，进入半梦半醒的状态，这种状态最容易沟通弥漫的灵。"] = "It can make your mind no longer tense and enter a state between sleeping and waking. This state is the easiest for communicating with the pervasive spirits.",
    ["它能让它能让它能"] = "It can let it can let it can",
    ["它能随机制造不同的毒素，只要打开，毒素就会逐渐向四周弥漫。四分钟后，如果还在范围之内，等待你的或许只剩下死亡。"] = "It can randomly create different toxins; once opened, the toxins will gradually spread to the surroundings. Four minutes later, if you are still within range, perhaps only death awaits you.",
    ["它落下时，罪与罚在落地前互换身份。"] = "When it falls, crime and punishment swap identities before hitting the ground.",
    ["它蕴含污染，待会儿处理下。"] = "It contains corruption; we'll deal with it later.",
    ["它被切割磨制，嵌进了眼镜框里。"] = "It was cut and polished, and embedded into the spectacle frame.",
    ["它被污染了，却还是为管家战斗，虔诚的信念，安德鲁值得尊重。"] = "It was corrupted, yet it still fought for the butler. With such pious faith, Andrew deserves respect.",
    ["它被造出来的那个晚上，主人兴奋地把它捧在手上，仿佛它是全世界最完美的造物。\n“以后，你就叫‘钻头’了！”主人说着，把一枚戒指塞进它的胸腔，“这是我最宝贵的东西，你要帮我守好。”\n它记住了，记了很久，久到主人把它身上的零件换了一轮又一轮，久到它不再只是一个镶嵌了普通钻头的人偶，久到……主人的造物越来越完美，却再也不提起那枚戒指。\n它还是那样站在主人身边，想着主人好像给过自己什么东西，但是，是什么呢？"] = "The night it was created, its master held it up excitedly, as if it were the most perfect creation in the world. \n \"From now on, you shall be called 'Drill'!\" the master said, stuffing a ring into its chest cavity. \"This is my most precious possession; you must guard it well for me.\" \n It remembered, and it remembered for a long time—long enough for the master to replace its parts over and over, long enough for it to be more than just a puppet embedded with an ordinary drill, long enough that... the master's creations became increasingly perfect, yet he never mentioned that ring again. \n It still stands by the master's side, wondering if the master once gave it something, but what could it be?",
    ["它见证与记录了每一次成功转化的刻度。"] = "It witnesses and records the scale of every successful transformation.",
    ["它让你觉得自己可以超越一切，然后你就真的会去尝试超越一切——包括死亡。我见过太多人了，都是这么走进去的。"] = "It makes you feel like you can transcend everything, and then you will truly try to transcend everything—including death. I have seen too many people who walked in just like that.",
    ["它记录着时间的流动，每一秒都同等珍贵。"] = "It records the flow of time, and every second is equally precious.",
    ["它记得每一句未被回应的怨念。"] = "It remembers every unrequited resentment.",
    ["它诞生于知识诞生之前，因而无名；它记载着所有真知，因而无姓。"] = "It was born before knowledge itself, hence it is nameless; it records all true knowledge, hence it has no surname.",
    ["它说……是的。"] = "It said... yes.",
    ["它说，三十便士。"] = "It says thirty pence.",
    ["它跑进了这栋宅子……敲个门试试吧？"] = "It ran into this house... Should I try knocking on the door?",
    ["它跑那么慢，就叫它跑不快了！"] = "Since it runs so slowly, let's call it 'Can't Run Fast'!",
    ["它还能修好吗？"] = "Can it still be fixed?",
    ["它都没有嘴，要怎么说话？"] = "It doesn't even have a mouth, how can it speak?",
    ["它里面分为几个区域，保存着一定序列的魔药配方和各种神奇材料，临时关押着异端、异种、邪教徒和隐秘组织成员……"] = "It is divided into several areas, storing potion formulas of certain Sequences and various magical materials, and temporarily detaining heretics, xenomorphs, cultists, and members of secret organizations...",
    ["它里面分为几个区域，保存着一定序列的魔药配方和各种神奇材料，临时关押着异端、异种、邪教徒和隐秘组织成员。"] = "It is divided into several areas, preserving potion formulas of certain sequences and various magical materials, and temporarily detaining heretics, mutants, cultists, and members of secret organizations.",
    ["它非常独特，是罗塞尔大帝发明的黄金抽水马桶。"] = "It's very unique; it's the golden flush toilet invented by Emperor Roselle.",
    ["它？撞门？"] = "It? Banging on the door?",
    ["宅子怎么了？"] = "What's wrong with the house?",
