    ["守护力量-螺"] = "Guardian Power-Screw",
    ["守护力量化成坚固华丽、却没有重量的银色全身盔甲，能抵挡强大攻击，是守护之道的极致体现，在战场上如不可逾越的壁垒。"] = "Guardian Power transforms into solid, gorgeous, yet weightless silver full-body armor, capable of blocking powerful attacks. It is the ultimate embodiment of the path of guardianship, acting as an insurmountable barrier on the battlefield.",
    ["守护印记"] = "Guard Mark",
