    ["守桥骑士？看来只能先打败他了。"] = "Bridge-guarding knight? Looks like I have to defeat him first.",
    ["守着摊子挺无聊的……"] = "Watching the stall is quite boring...",
    ["守知派最后一点东西。窥秘人的冥想方法，灵性感知的进阶技巧，还有一些关于隐匿贤者的研究。我用不上了。"] = "The last bit of the Knowledge-Seeking School. Meditation methods for Mystery Pryers, advanced techniques for spiritual perception, and some research on the Hidden Sage. I have no use for them anymore.",
    ["守知者"] = "Keeper of Knowledge",
    ["守秘之姿"] = "Posture of Secrecy",
    ["守秘才能活得长久。"] = "Only by keeping secrets can one live long.",
