    ["安德鲁·"] = "Andrew ",
    ["安德鲁斯"] = "Andrews",
    ["安德鲁是一条乖狗狗，很喜欢苹果。\n管家爷爷教会了安德鲁很多事：起立、坐下、握手、转圈……每次安德鲁做对了，都会得到一个鲜红的大苹果。\n管家爷爷教过的指令里，最重要的一条是“守护家园”。\n接到这个指令后，安德鲁开始发生一些变化。\n“汪！汪汪！”\n——人，安德鲁会守护好家园的！\n“呜……呜汪！汪……”\n——人，安德鲁不喜欢那些藤蔓，好奇怪的力量……安德鲁好难受，安德鲁想被摸头……\n“嗷呜——嗷呜——”\n——人，你看起来好小啊……原来安德鲁、安德鲁变大了。这样就能守护家园了……对么……"] = "Andrew is a good dog who loves apples very much. \n Grandpa Butler taught Andrew many things: stand up, sit down, shake hands, roll over... Every time Andrew did it right, he would get a bright red apple. \n Among the commands Grandpa Butler taught, the most important one was \"Guard the home.\" \n After receiving this command, Andrew began to undergo some changes. \n \"Woof! Woof woof!\" \n —Human, Andrew will guard the home well! \n \"Woo... woo woof! Woof...\" \n —Human, Andrew doesn't like those vines, such strange power... Andrew feels so uncomfortable, Andrew wants to be petted... \n \"Awoo—awoo—\" \n —Human, you look so small... So Andrew, Andrew has grown bigger. This way, I can guard the home... right...",
