    ["安提哥努斯"] = "Antigonus",
    ["安提哥努斯……"] = "Antigonus...",
    ["安提哥努斯……这比我想的还要复杂。"] = "Antigonus... This is even more complicated than I thought.",
    ["安提哥努斯后裔"] = "Antigonus descendant",
    ["安提哥努斯家族后裔"] = "Descendant of the Antigonus Family",
    ["安提哥努斯家族在第四纪的所罗门帝国有着显赫地位，但这段历史却被迷雾笼罩着……"] = "The Antigonus family had a prominent status in the Solomon Empire of the Fourth Epoch, but this history is shrouded in mist...",
    ["安提哥努斯家族木偶的历史投影，继承了部分能够操控灵体之线的能力，由于某些隐秘原因，和真正历史中的2-049外观并不完全一致。\n一个长相怪异的木偶，巴掌大小，可以自主移动，但动作充满了艰涩感，就像一台年久生锈且忘了加润滑油的蒸汽机械。要小心，别让它长久地注视到了。"] = "A historical projection of an Antigonus family puppet, inheriting part of the ability to control spirit body threads. Due to certain hidden reasons, its appearance is not exactly the same as the 2-049 in true history. \n A strange-looking puppet, the size of a palm, capable of moving autonomously, but its movements are full of stiffness, like a steam machine that has been rusted for years and forgotten to be lubricated. Be careful, don't let it stare at you for too long.",
    ["安提哥努斯家族的遗物……到底是忠诚，还是背叛？"] = "Relics of the Antigonus Family... is it loyalty, or betrayal?",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记"] = "Antigonus Family Notes",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记案件暂告一段落，但穿越的真相、霍纳奇斯山脉这些谜题都还没解开……"] = "The Antigonus Family Notebook case has come to a temporary end, but the truth behind my transmigration, the Hornacis Mountain Range, and other mysteries remain unsolved...",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记的仿制品，但除了会吸引持有者写上“所有人都不会死，包括我”之外，没有别的非凡效果了。"] = "A replica of the Antigonus Family Notebook, but other than attracting the holder to write \"Everyone will not die, including me,\" it has no other Beyonder effects.",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记终于找回来了，被队长带走封印起来了。"] = "The Antigonus Family notebook has finally been retrieved and taken away by the Captain to be sealed.",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记补充对白"] = "Antigonus Family Notes Supplementary Dialogue",
    ["安提哥努斯家族笔记，曾由密修会持有，因为一次意外而遗失。"] = "The Antigonus family notes were once held by the Abraham family, but were lost due to an accident.",
