    ["安曼达纯露快用完了，还要再买些铁筷子草、槲寄生粉末……"] = "The Amandine hydrosol is almost out, need to buy more Hellebore and Mistletoe powder...",
    ["安曼达纯露，赫密斯语里宁静的意思。只需要几滴，就能在通灵者的引导下获得真正的宁静。但一旦被打开潜意识的海洋，是选择理智的反抗还是安静的顺从？"] = "Amanda dew, which means tranquility in Hermes. Just a few drops are enough to achieve true tranquility under the guidance of a Spirit Medium. But once the ocean of the subconscious is opened, will you choose rational resistance or quiet submission?",
