    ["安西娅……我在……"] = "Anthea... I am here...",
    ["安西娅不高兴……安西娅要玩更厉害的游戏！"] = "Anthea is unhappy... Anthea wants to play a more powerful game!",
    ["安西娅会召唤巴尼先生向多名玩家释放<Disable>需要分摊</>的下砸伤害"] = "Anthea will summon Mr. Barney to unleash a <Disable>shareable</> slam attack on multiple players.",
    ["安西娅会召唤巴尼先生向多名玩家释放<Disable>需要分摊</>的下砸伤害，分摊后会<Disable>随机选择一名玩家</>与被分摊玩家<Disable>绑定连线</>，该<Disable>连线扯断</>后会对双方造成大量伤害。"] = "Anthea will Summon Mr. Barney to unleash <Disable> on multiple players, which requires sharing the slam damage </>. After sharing, she will <Disable> randomly select one player </> to be linked with the player who shared the damage <Disable> </>. Once this <Disable> link is broken </>, it will deal massive damage to both parties.",
    ["安西娅会召唤蓝色蝴蝶，<Disable>蓝色蝴蝶</>对周围持续造成伤害。"] = "Anthea will summon blue butterflies; the <Disable> blue butterflies </> continuously deal damage to the surroundings.",
    ["安西娅会召唤蝴蝶，<Disable>蓝色蝴蝶</>对周围持续造成伤害，<Disable>金色蝴蝶</>可以吸收，吸收后获得<Disable>自身伤害和移动速度</>加成，但<Disable>受到的伤害</>也会增加。"] = "Anthea will summon butterflies; <Disable> blue butterflies </> continuously deal damage to the surroundings, while <Disable> golden butterflies </> can be absorbed. Absorbing them grants a <Disable> personal damage and movement speed </> bonus, but <Disable> damage taken </> will also increase.",
    ["安西娅会将所有玩家变身成玩偶进行木头人游戏，需要玩家移动到安西娅身边才可以解除变身，期间安西娅会背对玩家倒数，倒数结束后转身面向玩家，会将还在移动的玩家石化。在数轮游戏结束后，若无人到达，对全场造成高额伤害。"] = "Anthea will transform all players into dolls for a game of Red Light, Green Light. Players must move to Anthea's side to break the transformation. During this, Anthea will turn her back to the players and count down; after the countdown, she will turn around to face the players, petrifying any who are still moving. If no one reaches her after several rounds of the game, she will deal massive damage to the entire field.",
    ["安西娅会将所有玩家变身成玩偶进行木头人游戏，需要玩家移动到安西娅身边才可以解除变身，期间安西娅会背对玩家倒数，并召唤玩偶在场中冲刺，倒数结束后转身面向玩家，会将还在移动的玩家石化。在数轮游戏结束后，若无人到达，对全场造成高额伤害。"] = "Anthea will transform all players into dolls for a game of Red Light, Green Light. Players must move to Anthea's side to break the transformation. During this, Anthea will turn her back to the players and count down, summoning dolls to charge across the field. After the countdown, she will turn around to face the players, petrifying any who are still moving. If no one reaches her after several rounds of the game, she will deal massive damage to the entire field.",
    ["安西娅会点名玩家连线，连线存在时持续造成伤害。"] = "Anthea will mark players with a tether, which continuously deals damage while active.",
    ["安西娅即将陷入恐惧，注意治疗防护！"] = "Anthea is about to fall into fear; pay attention to healing and protection!",
    ["安西娅和巴尼先生的距离太近了，他们的伤害获得提升！"] = "Anthea and Mr. Barney are too close; their damage has increased!",
    ["安西娅在二阶段会持续召唤巴尼先生冲锋。"] = "Anthea will continuously summon Mr. Barney to charge during the second phase.",
    ["安西娅在木头人期间需要3人到达终点才会停止游戏，蝴蝶会自动追寻目标，玩家注视的目光可以阻挡蝴蝶接近。"] = "During the Red Light, Green Light phase with Anthea, 3 players must reach the finish line to stop the game. Butterflies will automatically track targets, and players can block the butterflies' approach by looking at them.",
    ["安西娅在第二阶段将持续召唤多个巴尼先生幻影向中央冲锋。"] = "In the second phase, Anthea will continuously summon multiple Mr. Barney phantoms that charge toward the center.",
    ["安西娅是个孤儿，出生起就在街头流浪，有过很多个妈妈。\n第一个妈妈生下了她，自己的生命也走到了尽头。\n第二个妈妈养育过她，又因贫穷和饥饿扔下了她。\n第三个妈妈抱起过她，获取进入济贫院的资格后，很快放开了手。\n第四个……第五个……\n为什么这些妈妈都不爱安西娅？\n为什么这些妈妈都要抛下安西娅？\n安西娅不想流浪，安西娅想回家……\n伟大的母亲温柔地抱起了蜷缩在街角的安西娅，给她戴上了一顶兜帽。\n你是……你是新的妈妈么……\n“母亲会眷顾你。”祂降下恩赐，给予安西娅一场新生。\n安西娅第一次感受到发自内心的幸福和满足，她睁开眼睛，毫不犹豫地成为了最疯狂的信徒。\n只要新妈妈不会抛下安西娅……安西娅会永远……永远留在母亲身边！"] = "Anthea was an orphan, wandering the streets since birth, and had many mothers. \n The first mother gave birth to her, and her own life came to an end. \n The second mother raised her, then abandoned her due to poverty and hunger. \n The third mother picked her up, and after obtaining the qualifications to enter the poorhouse, she quickly let go. \n The fourth... the fifth... \n Why didn't these mothers love Anthea? \n Why did these mothers all want to abandon Anthea? \n Anthea didn't want to wander; Anthea wanted to go home... \n The Great Mother gently picked up Anthea, who was curled up in the street corner, and put a hood on her. \n Are you... are you the new mother... \n \"Mother will favor you.\" She bestowed a gift, giving Anthea a new life. \n Anthea felt happiness and satisfaction from the bottom of her heart for the first time. She opened her eyes and became the most fanatical believer without hesitation. \n As long as the new mother doesn't abandon Anthea... Anthea will stay... stay by Mother's side forever!",
    ["安西娅是个孤儿，被一个又一个妈妈抛弃，病倒在街头。濒死之际，她梦见红月下，母亲抱起她，给她新生与一只兔子玩偶。醒来后，她成为了“木偶”，玩偶巴尼先生陪着她，帮她找到那些妈妈，把她们的灵魂变成漂亮的蝴蝶。她笑着流泪。太好了，谁都不能抛下她了。她还要更多妈妈。\n“闪闪的妈妈，都留在安西娅身边。”"] = "Anthea is an orphan, abandoned by one mother after another, and fell ill on the street. At the brink of death, she dreamed that under the crimson moon, her mother picked her up, giving her a new life and a rabbit doll. After waking up, she became a 'puppet,' and the doll, Mr. Barney, accompanied her, helping her find those mothers and turning their souls into beautiful butterflies. She smiled while crying. That's great, no one can leave her behind anymore. She wants even more mothers. \n \"Shiny mothers, all stay by Anthea's side.\"",
    ["安西娅最大最大的心愿是：和母亲永远永远在一起。"] = "Anthea's biggest, biggest wish is: to be with mother forever and ever.",
    ["安西娅登场时，召唤与安西娅星级相同的巴尼先生作为召唤物上阵。"] = "When Anthea enters the field, summon Mr. Barney of the same star level as Anthea as a summon to join the battle.",
    ["安西娅的“妈妈”，是子爵夫人吗？还是……"] = "Is Anthea's \"Mother\" the Viscountess? Or...",
    ["安西娅的第四个玩偶，名叫巴尼先生。母亲在红月下入梦，为她祛除病痛，给她新生。醒来时，崭新的巴尼先生就在她怀里。它很厉害，陪着她，还把妈妈们变成了漂亮的蝴蝶。母亲指引她前往种满苹果树的庄园，那里有温柔的子爵夫人和生病的小子爵。女孩不想再失去朋友。她最清楚——吃下妈妈的苹果，朋友就不会再痛了。\n“安西娅……好孩子……”"] = "Anthea's fourth doll, named Mr. Barney. Her mother entered her dream under the crimson moon, removing her illness and giving her a new life. When she woke up, a brand-new Mr. Barney was in her arms. It is very powerful, accompanying her and turning the mothers into beautiful butterflies. Her mother guided her to the manor filled with apple trees, where the gentle Viscountess and the sick young Viscount lived. The girl did not want to lose any more friends. She knows best—if you eat mother's apple, your friend will no longer be in pain. \n \"Anthea... good child...\"",
    ["安西娅碎片"] = "Anthea Fragment",
