    ["安魂诗社教团警告邮件"] = "Requiem Poetry Society Order Warning Email",
    ["安魂诗社是由黑夜女神的虔诚信徒组成的隐秘教团，他们相信诗歌是灵魂的语言，能在黑暗中点亮希望。"] = "The Requiem Poetry Society is a secret cult composed of devout believers of the Evernight Goddess, who believe that poetry is the language of the soul and can light up hope in the darkness.",
    ["安魂诗社是由黑夜女神的虔诚信徒组成的隐秘教团，他们相信诗歌是灵魂的语言，能在黑暗中点亮希望。成员以吟诵诗篇的方式，用韵律与节奏编织安魂的力量，为人们恢复理智。"] = "The Requiem Poetry Society is a secret cult composed of devout believers of the Evernight Goddess. They believe that poetry is the language of the soul and can light up hope in the darkness. Members weave the power of requiem through rhythm and rhyme by reciting poems, helping people restore their sanity.",
    ["安魂诗社的秘物。一缕发丝轻触额前，安宁便可取代疯狂的归位。\n当发丝触及灵性的一瞬，躁动便自认疲倦，在无人察觉的间隙中，退入那开满夜香草和深眠花的国度，就此沉眠。"] = "A mystical item of the Requiem Poetry Society. A strand of hair touches the forehead, and peace can replace the return of madness. \n The moment the hair touches spirituality, the restlessness admits its fatigue, and in a gap that no one notices, it retreats into the kingdom full of night-scented grass and deep-sleep flowers, falling into a slumber there.",
    ["安魂诗社等级奖励"] = "Requiem Poetry Society level reward",
