    ["完成家族任务可以获得默契值，提升家族等级，并获得以下增益：\n<Highlight>强化副本增益：</>家族等级越高，组队参与时的副本属性加成效果越高。\n<Highlight>解锁购买权限：</>家族等级达到特定等级后，可解锁同行商店对应等级商品的购买权限。\n<Highlight>场景使用权限：</>家族等级达到<Highlight>2级、6级</>后，将在家族展台中解锁该展台专属场景的使用权限。"] = "Completing Family Quests can earn Rapport, increase Family level, and obtain the following buffs: \n<Highlight>Strengthening Dungeon Buff: </>The higher the Family level, the higher the dungeon attribute bonus effect when participating in a team. \n<Highlight>Unlock Purchase Permissions: </>After the Family reaches a specific level, you can unlock the purchase permissions for corresponding level items in the Companion Shop. \n<Highlight>Scene Usage Permissions: </>After the Family reaches <Highlight>Level 2 or Level 6</>, the usage permissions for the exhibition stand's exclusive scenes will be unlocked in the Family exhibition stand.",
