    ["宏大的树木矗立在湖中央，异常美丽的金色树皮下，掩盖着危险的非凡本质。你的理智告诉你：远离它。可另一个声音却时刻蛊惑着你：<P_Heart>触摸它。触摸它。</>"] = "A magnificent tree stands in the center of the lake. Beneath the unusually beautiful golden bark lies a dangerous Beyonder essence. Your reason tells you: stay away from it. But another voice is constantly bewitching you: <P_Heart> Touch it. Touch it. </>",
