    ["宝贝别哭了，你哭得我心都要碎了……"] = "Don't cry, baby. Your crying is breaking my heart...",
    ["宝贝，声音小一点，在女神的教堂里要安静。"] = "Honey, keep your voice down. You have to be quiet in the Goddess's cathedral.",
    ["宝贝，想不想坐这样的车去兜风？"] = "Baby, want to go for a ride in a car like this?",
    ["宝贝，爸爸妈妈去工厂了。\r\n和露米一起等我们回来，别害怕。"] = "Baby, Mommy and Daddy are going to the factory.\r\nWait for us to come back with Lumi, don't be afraid.",
    ["宝贝，这样可以拍了吗？"] = "Darling, can we take the photo now?",
    ["宝鸡"] = "Baoji",
    ["实不相瞒，我想在下次唱诵会上赢得大家的惊讶与喝彩。这里很安静，不是吗？"] = "To be honest, I want to win everyone's surprise and applause at the next recital. It's very quiet here, isn't it?",
