    ["实力"] = "Strength",
    ["实名认证活动奖励"] = "Real-name Authentication Event Rewards",
    ["实在不好意思，还需要麻烦你另一件事，帮我把怀表还给……菲利普吧。"] = "I'm really sorry, but I need to trouble you with one more thing: please help me return the pocket watch to... Philip.",
    ["实在不行……就把……"] = "If there's really no other way... then just...",
    ["实在分不出心想这些。请大家让一让，我得去市里补点药。"] = "I really can't spare the time to think about these things. Please make way, I need to go to the city to restock some medicine.",
    ["实在想掺和的话……我看您这么有兴趣，您和那些警察有交情？去找他们吧，可别拉我下水。"] = "If you really want to get involved... I see you are so interested, do you have connections with those police? Go find them, but don't drag me into it.",
    ["实在抱歉，我总是不合时宜地在周四周五胸闷头疼，需要去郊外踏青才能缓解。"] = "I'm truly sorry, I always get chest tightness and headaches at the most inconvenient times on Thursdays and Fridays, and I need to go to the countryside to relieve it.",
    ["实在是太不要脸了！"] = "That is truly shameless!",
