    ["实时汇率"] = "Real-time Exchange Rate",
    ["实时语音：<Green>%s</>人"] = "Real-time Voice: <Green>%s</> people",
    ["实木抛光打磨制成的门廊，圆拱形的弧度优美和谐。"] = "A doorway made of polished solid wood, with a beautiful and harmonious arched curve.",
    ["实用的"] = "Practical",
    ["实话说，我明天就要出发去贝克兰德了——斗邪恶的时候碰巧赢到了一张船票，这或许是女神的引导吧。"] = "To be honest, I'm leaving for Backlund tomorrow—I happened to win a boat ticket while fighting evil, perhaps this is the guidance of the Goddess.",
    ["实际上……"] = "In reality...",
    ["实际上……前几次他都感到十分遗憾。我反复宽慰他，他才接受了呢。"] = "Actually... he felt very regretful the last few times. I comforted him repeatedly before he accepted it.",
    ["实际上它并不贵，因为最初只是半成品，我仿照之前见过的文物，雕刻了祝福的咒语和漂亮的花纹上去。"] = "Actually, it wasn't expensive, because it was just a semi-finished product at first. I imitated the artifacts I had seen before and carved a blessing incantation and beautiful patterns onto it.",
    ["实际上，即使真正的“占卜家”，也只能窥得命运模糊的一角。"] = "In fact, even a true 'Seer' can only glimpse a blurred corner of fate.",
    ["实际上，只有真神才能使用三段式尊名。我和塔罗会其他同伴的尊名，是借助了“愚者”先生的真神位格。"] = "In fact, only a True God can use a three-part honorific name. The honorific names of myself and other companions in the Tarot Club rely on Mr. Fool's True God status.",
    ["实际上，只有真神才能使用三段式尊名。我和塔罗会其他同伴的尊名，是借助了愚者先生的真神位格。"] = "Actually, only true deities can use three-part honorific names. The honorific names used by me and the other members of the Tarot Club rely on Mr. Fool's status as a true deity.",
    ["实际上，我们在研究某种……炼金仪式，准确来说，是复现《赫密斯文典》记载的灵数映射仪式。"] = "In fact, we are researching a certain... alchemical ritual. To be precise, it is a replication of the spiritual number mapping ritual recorded in the 'Hermes Codex'.",
    ["实际上，我们获得的好处很多——安静、安全的环境、向往市政厅工作的氛围……"] = "In fact, we have gained a lot—a quiet, safe environment, an atmosphere that aspires to work at City Hall...",
    ["实际上，这已经是最优惠的价格，赞美“愚者”先生！"] = "Actually, this is already the most favorable price. Praise Mr. Fool!",
    ["实际上，那是诅咒。那串手链属于亚伯拉罕家族，而我……因为使用了它，继承了那个家族的血脉诅咒。"] = "In fact, it was a curse. That bracelet belonged to the Abraham family, and I... because I used it, inherited that family's bloodline curse.",
    ["实际恢复量=基础回复量*（1+属性影响系数*d.MpReg）"] = "Actual recovery amount = Basic recovery amount * (1 + attribute influence coefficient * d.MpReg).",
