    ["室内宴会，俱乐部室内，贵族举行奢侈的宴会，舞蹈社交等。\n一张桌子上，苍白的手酒杯旁留下“节制”塔罗牌。\n（可以从室内玻璃光照，看出来外面雨停天晴了。）"] = "Indoor banquet, inside the club, nobles hold luxurious banquets, dancing, socializing, etc. \nOn a table, a pale hand leaves a \"Temperance\" Tarot card next to a wine glass. \n(You can tell from the indoor glass lighting that the rain has stopped and the sky has cleared outside.)",
