    ["宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "When the gates of the royal racecourse open again, the pace and demeanor remain as sharp as ever.",
    ["害怕"] = "Scared",
    ["害怕父亲不是正常的吗？"] = "Isn't it normal to be afraid of one's father?",
    ["害怕？为什么要害怕？失控只是过程的一部分。就像孩子学走路会摔倒一样，研究者也会犯错。"] = "Fear? Why be afraid? Loss of control is just part of the process. Just like a child learning to walk will fall, researchers will also make mistakes.",
