    ["家具解锁——3种解锁方式：初始解锁、达到等级自动解锁、消耗城堡资产/绑定金镑解锁。\n评分与价格——不同家具评分不同，消耗货币才能解锁的家具，评分往往更高。\n家具状态——选中家具后查看状态（红色不可回收、蓝色可建造、黄色可回收）。"] = "Furniture Unlocking—3 ways to unlock: initial unlock, automatic unlock upon reaching a certain level, or consuming Castle assets/bound Pounds to unlock. \n Rating and Price—Different furniture has different ratings; furniture that requires consuming currency to unlock often has a higher rating. \n Furniture Status—Select furniture to view its status (red: cannot be recycled, blue: can be built, yellow: can be recycled).",
