    ["家庭开支计划的前提是尊重男主人的意见。"] = "The premise of a family budget plan is to respect the master's opinion.",
    ["家庭成员：父亲-布莱克·弗尔德\n基本信息：据调查，哈利的父亲布莱克无业多年，经常出没于赌场附近。\n周围邻居讲述经常听到他们家中传出叫骂声与孩子的哭声，疑似有家暴的情况。"] = "Family members: Father - Blake Fould\nBasic information: According to investigations, Harry's father, Blake, has been unemployed for many years and often hangs around near casinos.\nNeighbors often report hearing shouting and a child's crying coming from their home, suggesting possible domestic abuse.",
    ["家庭成员：父亲-托马斯·布朗  \n　　　　　母亲-艾米丽·布朗\n基本信息：布朗父母亲均是船运工厂的普通员工，工厂其他员工对布朗夫妻评价较好。艾恩是布朗家唯一的女儿。据邻居讲述，布朗家境虽普通，但支持女儿去了昂贵的伊沃斯公学初等部读书，生活其他方面都比较拮据。"] = "Family members: Father - Thomas Brown \n　　　　　Mother - Emily Brown\nBasic information: Both Brown parents are ordinary employees at a shipping factory, and other factory employees have a good opinion of the Brown couple. Aen is the only daughter of the Brown family. According to neighbors, although the Brown family's financial situation is ordinary, they supported their daughter in attending the expensive Eworth Academy primary division, and they were quite frugal in other aspects of life.",
