    ["家道中落才……"] = "Only after her family fell into ruin...",
    ["家里人第一次来大城市，兴奋和好奇是难免的，估计他们自己玩去了。"] = "It's their first time in a big city, so excitement and curiosity are inevitable. I guess they went off to play on their own.",
    ["家里变得黑漆漆的。八音盒坏了，房间好冷，肚子好饿……我好寂寞，好难过。"] = "The house has become pitch black. The music box is broken, the room is so cold, and I'm so hungry... I'm so lonely, so sad.",
    ["家里实在是……"] = "Home is really...",
    ["家里有一个意料之外的人——班森。看见克莱恩后，他笑着打了个招呼。"] = "There is an unexpected person at home—Benson. Seeing Klein, he greets him with a smile.",
    ["家里现在全靠做文员工作的班森维持，要同时养着两个还在读书的弟弟妹妹，真是辛苦啊……"] = "The family now relies entirely on Benson, who works as a clerk, to support us. It's really hard to support two younger siblings who are still in school at the same time...",
