    ["对所有敌人造成<HighLight>180%</>攻击伤害；随机获得攻击、减伤或恢复<HighLight>15</>法力，持续6秒。"] = "Deals <HighLight>180%</> attack damage to all enemies; randomly gain Attack, Damage Reduction, or restore <HighLight>15</> Mana, lasting for 6 seconds.",
    ["对所有敌人造成<HighLight>360%</>攻击伤害；随机获得攻击、减伤或恢复<HighLight>15</>法力，持续6秒。"] = "Deals <HighLight>360%</> attack damage to all enemies; randomly gains Attack, Damage Reduction, or recovers <HighLight>15</> mana, lasting for 6 seconds.",
