    ["对敌方玩家单体目标使用误导性暗示，使其精神错乱。"] = "Use misleading suggestions on a single enemy player target, causing Mental Derangement.",
    ["对敌方玩家单体目标使用，看穿他们的内心，并做下误导性<Highlight>暗示</>，持续<Highlight>3</>秒。\n被暗示的目标使用技能时造成的伤害会被转移到其友方上去，造成的治疗会被转移到其敌方上去。\n因精神错乱对友方造成的伤害无法直接击败友方。"] = "Used on a single enemy player target to see through their heart and plant a misleading <Highlight> Suggestion </>, lasting <Highlight> 3 </> seconds. \n When the suggested target uses a skill, the damage dealt is transferred to their teammates, and the healing caused is transferred to their enemies. \n Damage caused to teammates due to Mental Derangement cannot directly defeat them.",
    ["对敌方目标造成*d点物理伤害，同时有附加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">眩晕</>和*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。"] = "Deals *d physical damage to the enemy target, while applying <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">Stun</> for *f seconds and, for *f seconds, the effect of buffdisc(*id).",
