    ["对象距离过远，无法附身"] = "The target is too far away to possess.",
    ["对象附近使用道具1"] = "Use item 1 near object",
    ["对路径上的敌方目标造成*d伤害"] = "Deals *d damage to enemy targets in the path.",
    ["对身前圆形范围内敌方造成*d点魔法伤害。\n拥有<HighLight>研习</>（施放战斗技能<HighLight>空间牢笼</>以进入<HighLight>研习</>状态）时获得<HighLight>强化</>，施法后召唤残影再次对范围内敌方进行攻击，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害并在命中后获得1点<HighLight>星空能量</>。"] = "Deal *d magic damage to enemies in a circular range in front of you. \nWhen you possess <HighLight>Study</> (enter the <HighLight>Study</> state by casting the combat skill <HighLight>Space Cage</>), you gain <HighLight>Strengthening</>; after casting, summon a phantom shadow to attack enemies in range again, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage and gaining 1 point of <HighLight>Starlight Energy</> upon hit.",
    ["对身前圆形范围内敌方造成*d点魔法伤害，并附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。\n拥有<HighLight>研习</>（施放战斗技能<HighLight>空间牢笼</>以进入<HighLight>研习</>状态）时获得<HighLight>强化</>，施法后召唤残影再次对范围内敌方进行攻击，造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害并在命中后获得1点<HighLight>星空能量</>。"] = "Deal *d magic damage to enemies in a circular range in front, and apply *f seconds of mul(*d%,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</>. \nWhen possessing <HighLight>Study</> (cast combat skill <HighLight>Space Cage</> to enter <HighLight>Study</> state), gain <HighLight>Strengthening</>. After casting, summon a remnant to attack enemies in range again, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage and gaining 1 point of <HighLight>Nebula Energy</> upon hit.",
    ["对身前圆形范围内敌方造成{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}点魔法伤害，并附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。"] = "Deal {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d} Magic Damage to enemies within a circular area in front of you and apply <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</> for *f seconds, reducing healing by mul(*d**,*d).",
    ["对较大范围敌人造成大量伤害。"] = "Deal massive damage to enemies in a large area.",
    ["对较大范围敌人造成大量伤害，命中后减少所有技能冷却时间1秒。"] = "Deal massive damage to enemies in a large area; hitting reduces all skill cooldowns by 1 second.",
    ["对近身的敌方单位缓慢施加影响，使其陷入迷失，动作迟缓、肢体无法移动。如果他们竟敢攻击你，这一厄运会更快降临。作为持有者，你也会间歇性地陷入迷失。"] = "Slowly exert influence on nearby enemy units, causing them to fall into a Lost state, with slow movements and immobile limbs. If they dare to attack you, this misfortune will descend faster. As the holder, you will also intermittently fall into a Lost state.",
    ["对这种有计划有目的的犯罪者来说，最开始挑选的目标肯定会远离祭台所在的区域，这源于追求安全的本能。"] = "For a criminal who plans and acts with purpose, the targets chosen at the beginning would definitely be far from the area where the altar is located, stemming from the instinct to seek safety.",
    ["对野怪伤害"] = "Damage to wild monsters",
    ["对锁定目标及其周围敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害，并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>处于<HighLight>瘟疫</>状态的敌方怪物。"] = "Deals spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to the locked target and surrounding enemies, and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">floats</> enemy monsters in the <HighLight>Plague</> state.",
    ["对锁定目标方向矩形范围内的敌方造成*d点物理伤害，同时将其<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">拖拽</>至身前并对敌方玩家附加<HighLight>2秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\">滞涩</>，随后下劈对周身范围内敌方造成*d点物理伤害，有*f**的基础概率给敌方玩家附加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>，并对敌方玩家造成*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。命中敌方后，自身获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。\n自身处于<HighLight>防御形态</>时，若技能的锁定目标为怪物，对其附加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">嘲讽</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。"] = "Deal *d physical damage to enemies in a rectangular range in the direction of the locked target, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">dragging</> them to your front and applying <HighLight>2 seconds</> of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"9\">Stagnation</> to enemy players. Then, perform a downward strike to deal *d physical damage to enemies in range around you, with an *f** base probability of applying <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Imprisonment</> for *f seconds to enemy players, and causing *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</>. Upon hitting an enemy, you gain 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</>. \nWhen in <HighLight>Defense Form</>, if the locked target is a monster, apply <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">Taunt</> for *f seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times.",
    ["对锁定目标造成*d点魔法伤害，自身获得<HighLight>知识灌注</>，并且buffdisc(*id)持续*d秒。施法后获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>知识灌注</>：使下一次<HighLight>巫术</>（普通攻击）得到<HighLight>强化</>。使下两次释放的<HighLight>光之折射</>、<HighLight>星沙</>或<HighLight>星光囚笼</>得到<HighLight>强化</>，一次<HighLight>知识灌注</>只能强化同一技能最多一次。\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Deal *d Magic Damage to the locked target, gain <HighLight>Knowledge Infusion</>, and trigger buffdisc(*id) for *d seconds. Gain 20 points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</> after casting. \n\n<FaintYellow>Knowledge Infusion</>: Causes the next <HighLight>Witchcraft</> (Normal Attack) to be <HighLight>Strengthened</>. Causes the next two casts of <HighLight>Refraction of Light</>, <HighLight>Star Sand</>, or <HighLight>Starlight Cage</> to be <HighLight>Strengthened</>; one <HighLight>Knowledge Infusion</> can only strengthen the same skill once. \n<FaintYellow>Mystic Knowledge</>: Maximum capacity is 100 points. Reaching 100 points unlocks the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Torrent of Information</>.",
    ["对锁定目标造成伤害"] = "Deal damage to the locked target.",
    ["对锁定目标造成伤害A以及加buff，对其周围5米内目标造成伤害B"] = "Deals damage A and applies a buff to the locked target, and deals damage B to targets within 5 meters of it.",
    ["对锁定目标造成伤害A，并在其位置释放法术场"] = "Deals damage A to the locked target and releases a spell field at its location.",
    ["对阵信息"] = "Matchup information",
    ["对阵舆图"] = "Matchup map",
    ["对非凡者施以安魂"] = "Perform Requiem on Beyonders.",
    ["对面坐着的男人"] = "The man sitting opposite",
    ["对面房间"] = "Opposite Room",
    ["对面房间2"] = "Opposite Room 2",
    ["对面的两个痴人也<h>察觉</>到了你"] = "The two fools opposite have also <h> noticed </> you",
    ["对面的第二棵树下有个树洞，你把钱放进去，再回来找我。"] = "There is a tree hole under the second tree opposite, put the money in, and then come back to find me.",
    ["对面端坐优雅的贵族少女奥黛丽，身旁趴一只金毛大狗。\n少女手旁桌上，静静放一张愚者牌。"] = "Opposite you sits the elegant noble lady Audrey, with a large golden retriever lying beside her. \n On the table next to the girl, a Fool card rests quietly.",
    ["对面那位明显出身高贵的小姐和我也有各自的资源和人脉。或许有一天，我们也可以帮您处理一些小事。"] = "The lady opposite who is clearly of noble birth and I also have our own resources and connections. Perhaps one day, we can also help you handle some small matters.",
    ["对马车造成一次伤害"] = "Deal damage to the Carriage once",
    ["对魔女使用\"共感手铐\""] = "Use \"Empathy Handcuffs\" on the Witch",
    ["对鲁恩市民施以安魂"] = "Perform Requiem on Loen citizens.",
    ["对！"] = "Yes!",
    ["对！<P_Heart>（有些神经质）</>我发现只要火车开过来，上面就会突然出现玩闹的小孩子，可变完道再去检查，又什么都没有……等等火车又要来了，你帮我一起看看，到底是我累出了幻觉，还是见了鬼……"] = "Yes! <P_Heart>(somewhat nervously)</> I've discovered that whenever the train comes, children suddenly appear on it playing around, but when I check after switching tracks, there's nothing there... Wait, the train is coming again. Help me take a look and see if I'm just hallucinating from exhaustion, or if I've seen a ghost...",
    ["对！吃了之后会看到很多有趣的东西，然后就忘记自己睡不着这件事了。很合理吧？"] = "Yes! After eating it, you see many interesting things, and then you forget that you can't sleep. Very reasonable, right?",
    ["对！对！您说得对！"] = "Yes! Yes! You are right!",
    ["对！就是这个角度！"] = "Yes! That's the angle!",
    ["对！就是这样！"] = "Yes! That's it!",
    ["对！就是霍纳奇斯山脉！这里的遗迹能追溯到至少一千五百年前。"] = "Yes! It's the Hornacis Mountain Range! The ruins here can be traced back to at least 1,500 years ago.",
    ["对！想让我接着干，得加钱！否则我就罢工！"] = "Right! If you want me to keep working, you have to pay more! Otherwise, I'm going on strike!",
    ["对！我夸大自己的美丽，谎称手握着丈夫的大量资产，就为了诱惑他、引他来——"] = "Yes! I exaggerated my beauty and lied about holding a large amount of my husband's assets, just to lure him and draw him here—",
    ["对！我记得！我只是……只是……"] = "Right! I remember! I just... I just...",
    ["对！我需要给战友们更大的墓地！"] = "Yes! I need a bigger cemetery for my comrades!",
    ["对！是哥哥给我买的！"] = "Yes! My brother bought it for me!",
    ["对！有神秘学联系！"] = "Yes! There is a mystical connection!",
    ["对！海上的新鲜蔬菜很难保存嘛，我就想，如果蔬菜能像鱼一样适应海洋环境，那不就能在海面上种菜了吗？"] = "Yes! Fresh vegetables are hard to preserve at sea, so I thought, if vegetables could adapt to the marine environment like fish, wouldn't we be able to grow them on the sea surface?",
    ["对！阁下，请您做我们交易的见证。"] = "Yes! Your Excellency, please be the witness to our transaction.",
    ["对，“不要紧张，我们是在守护廷根”。"] = "Yes, 'Don't be nervous, we are guarding Tingen'.",
    ["对，今天天气真不错，哈哈……"] = "Yes, the weather is really nice today, haha...",
    ["对，会陪聊、会哄人、长得还好看的。你点一个，让他叫你两声“姐姐”，保你心情好一礼拜。"] = "Yes, someone who can chat, coax you, and is good-looking. Pick one, have him call you \"sister\" a couple of times, and I guarantee you'll be in a good mood for a week.",
    ["对，但你看起来并不惊讶，我之前的当事人哪怕刚做完梦，也不相信会有非凡之力，宁愿认为自己还没醒来。"] = "Yes, but you don't look surprised. My previous clients, even just after having a dream, wouldn't believe in the existence of Beyonder powers, preferring to think they hadn't woken up yet.",
    ["对，但你知道弗洛这三年什么样吗？"] = "Yes, but do you know what Flo has been like for the past three years?",
    ["对，但需要你来提供对应的非凡材料。"] = "Yes, but you need to provide the corresponding Beyonder material.",
    ["对，你有什么事？"] = "Yes, what do you need?",
    ["对，你猜的很对，非常准确。"] = "Yes, you guessed right, very accurate.",
    ["对，再往右边站点！完美的姿势！"] = "Yes, stand a bit more to the right! Perfect pose!",
    ["对，努力变强，从头再来！"] = "That's right, work hard to become stronger and start over!",
    ["对，史密斯太太这次车祸可不轻啊。我听说赔了一大笔保险？"] = "Yes, Mrs. Smith's car accident this time was quite serious. I heard she received a large insurance payout?",
    ["对，她在引导特莉丝晋升和制造这些惨案。"] = "Yes, she is guiding Trissy's advancement and creating these tragedies.",
    ["对，她在引导特莉丝的晋升，以及制造这些惨案。"] = "Yes, she is guiding Trissy's advancement and orchestrating these tragedies.",
    ["对，它之前只是周日免费学校，黑夜女神教会为了鼓励更多的女性信徒工作，开设了绘画、写作、陶艺和银饰等课程。"] = "Yes, it used to be just a free Sunday school. To encourage more female believers to work, the Church of the Evernight Goddess opened courses in painting, writing, pottery, and silver jewelry.",
    ["对，它们很有趣吧？"] = "Yes, they are interesting, aren't they?",
    ["对，对，嗯，没错，城市由人组成，我能医治人，当然也能医治城市，这很好理解，对吧。"] = "Yes, yes, hmm, that's right. A city is made up of people. I can heal people, so of course I can heal a city. That's easy to understand, right?",
    ["对，就是你！"] = "Yes, you!",
    ["对，就是你！别往前走了！"] = "Yes, that's you! Don't go any further!",
    ["对，就是工整，没以前那么繁复华丽了，简约、合体是现在人们的普遍需求，而这正是我所擅长的。"] = "Yes, that's it—neat. Not as complicated and gorgeous as before. Simplicity and fit are the common needs of people now, and this is exactly what I am good at.",
    ["对，库克可是现在廷根最受欢迎的主厨！"] = "Yes, Cook is the most popular head chef in Tingen right now!",
    ["对，当英雄，保护爸爸妈妈，保护老师和同学！"] = "Yes, be a hero, protect Mom and Dad, protect my teachers and classmates!",
    ["对，我也想看看你和海莉夫人谁算得准。"] = "Yes, I also want to see who is more accurate, you or Madam Haley.",
    ["对，我们绝不会说出他跟老大去了猎龙城的！"] = "That's right, we will never tell you that he went to Dragon Hunting City with the boss!",
    ["对，我们这是最甜的西红柿！你要尝尝吗？"] = "Yes, we have the sweetest tomatoes here! Would you like to try some?",
    ["对，我担心<P_Yellow>密修会</>不肯放弃，一直在盯着瑞尔·比伯的家，然后跟着我们过来，准备在关键时刻捣乱。"] = "Yes, I'm worried that the <P_Yellow>Rose School of Thought Member</> won't give up, has been watching Ray Bieber's home, and followed us here, preparing to cause trouble at the critical moment.",
    ["对，我是来买学术期刊的。"] = "Right, I'm here to buy academic journals.",
    ["对，我最爱你了。"] = "Right, I love you the most.",
    ["对，我的钱包又被……哎哟……"] = "Yes, my wallet was taken again... Ouch...",
    ["对，是它，黄水晶，晶莹剔透的预言，不被外力扭曲的征兆，很多人曾从中听到过神秘存在的低语。"] = "Yes, it's this: yellow crystal, a crystal-clear prophecy, a sign not distorted by external forces. Many have heard the whispers of mysterious existences from it.",
    ["对，是有这么个地方。不过，他们给的“启示”有时候可比车费还让人琢磨不透。说到车费，车夫，我们这趟怎么算？ "] = "Yes, there is such a place. However, the \"revelations\" they give are sometimes more puzzling than the fare. Speaking of fare, driver, how do we calculate this trip?",
    ["对，有事没事多去教堂祷告！"] = "Yes, go to the cathedral to pray often!",
    ["对，有些无烟煤的生意要谈。"] = "Yes, we have some anthracite business to discuss.",
    ["对，直击灵魂，直面每个人最私密最不想谈论的话题……"] = "Yes, strike directly at the soul, facing everyone's most private and unwanted topics...",
    ["对，等你很久了。我就是开膛手杰斯，该开工了。"] = "Yes, I've been waiting for you for a long time. I am Jack the Ripper. It's time to get to work.",
    ["对，让他明白你有心意，但不要让他觉得太贵重。"] = "Yes, let him know you care, but don't make him feel like it's too expensive.",
    ["对，这是我第二次遇见了！"] = "Yes, this is the second time I've encountered it!",
    ["对，那是我曾经工作的地方。"] = "Yes, that's where I used to work.",
    ["对，黛西小姐……不能耽误太多时间，我们快去唤醒她吧。"] = "Right, Miss Daisy... we shouldn't delay too long, let's go wake her up.",
