    ["寻找通体褐色，遍布花纹，背部有花瓣形斑纹的狸花猫“毛球”\n\n如有线索，请送至<Mark id=\"#159\">豪尔斯街35号</>\n\n线索酬金：<Letter_Highlight_HW>1金镑</>\n寻回酬金：<Letter_Highlight_HW>10金镑</>"] = "Looking for a brown tabby cat named \"Furball\" with patterns all over and petal-shaped spots on its back \n\n If there are clues, please send to <Mark id=\"#159\"> 35 Howls Street </> \n \n Clue Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 1 Pound </> \n Retrieval Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 10 Pounds </>",
    ["寻找道格的墓碑"] = "Find Doug's tombstone",
