    ["寻求<h>伊丽莎白</>的帮助"] = "Seek help from <h>Elizabeth</>",
    ["寻求<h>同学</>的帮助"] = "Seek help from the <h>classmate</>",
    ["寻求【%s】，有好心人愿意伸出援手吗？"] = "Seeking 【%s】, is there any kind soul willing to lend a hand?",
    ["寻求事物背后的秘密，格斗也属于事物的一种。"] = "Seeking the secrets behind things, and fighting is also a kind of thing.",
    ["寻求事物背后的秘密，而格斗也属于事物的一种。掌握许多流派格斗术，身体素质提升，能凭借身体减弱某些超自然力量带来的影响。"] = "Seeks the secrets behind things, and combat is one such thing. Masters many styles of combat, has improved physical fitness, and can use their body to weaken the effects of certain supernatural powers.",
    ["寻求同学的帮助"] = "Seek help from the classmate",
