    ["寻求深红月冕的庇护！并在其中躲避怨魂的掠袭！"] = "Seek the shelter of the Crimson Moon Crown! Hide within it to avoid the Wraith's raids!",
    ["寻猫"] = "Cat Seeking",
    ["寻猫之遇·始"] = "Cat-Seeking Adventure: Start",
    ["寻猫之遇·终"] = "Cat-Seeking Adventure: End",
