    ["寻猫启事3"] = "Cat Search Notice 3",
    ["寻猫奇遇"] = "Cat-Seeking Adventure",
    ["寻猫奇遇记"] = "Cat-Seeking Adventure",
    ["寻猫奇遇记-灵视"] = "Cat-Seeking Adventure - spirit vision",
    ["寻猫：米莎\n灰色条纹，四脚雪白，左耳有一小缺口。性格胆小。于佐特兰街附近走失。若有线索，请联络磨坊街17号布兰登家，有重金酬谢。\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>您可以去佐特兰街36号2楼的黑荆棘安保公司，上次我的小狗泡芙走丢了两个月，他们半天就找回来了！</>"] = "Cat Search: Misha \n Gray stripes, four white paws, a small notch in the left ear. Timid personality. Lost near Zoutland Street. If you have any clues, please contact the Brandon family at 17 Mill Street, there is a generous reward. \n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> You can go to Blackthorn Security Company on the 2nd floor of 36 Zoutland Street. Last time my puppy Puff was lost for two months, they found it in half a day! </>",
    ["寻猫：米莎\n灰色条纹，四脚雪白，左耳有一小缺口。性格胆小。于佐特兰街附近走失。若有线索，请联络磨坊街17号布兰登家，有重金酬谢。\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>米莎！好可爱的名字！我前天在花廊最靠外面的长椅下看到过一只灰色的小猫影子，但没看清。它会不会喜欢这里的花香？祝你早点找到它！0w0</>\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>—— 一个爱猫的路人</>"] = "Cat Search: Misha \n Gray stripes, four white paws, small notch in the left ear. Timid personality. Lost near Zoutland Street. If you have any clues, please contact the Brandon family at 17 Mill Street. Generous reward. \n \n <Letter_Highlight_HW> Misha! What a cute name! I saw a gray kitten's shadow under the outermost bench in the flower gallery the day before yesterday, but I didn't see it clearly. Would it like the scent of the flowers here? Hope you find it soon! 0w0 </> \n <Letter_Highlight_HW> —— A cat-loving passerby </>",
    ["寻猫：米莎\n灰色条纹，四脚雪白，左耳有一小缺口。性格胆小。于佐特兰街附近走失。若有线索，请联络磨坊街17号布兰登家，有重金酬谢。\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>重金？有多重？（我开玩笑的！）</>\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>说真的，去问问这附近有个什么能找东西的公司。他们上次帮我找回了钥匙，快得邪门。就说是奥利安娜太太的朋友介绍的，没准儿给你折扣。</>"] = "Cat Search: Misha \n Gray stripes, four white paws, small notch in left ear. Timid personality. Lost near Zoutland Street. If you have any clues, please contact the Brandon family at 17 Mill Street, there is a heavy reward. \n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> Heavy reward? How heavy? (I'm joking!) </>\n<Letter_Highlight_HW> Seriously, go ask if there's a company nearby that can find things. They helped me find my keys last time, fast as hell. Just say it was introduced by a friend of Mrs. Orianna, maybe they'll give you a discount. </>",
