    ["封印物……是什么意思？"] = "Sealed Artifact... what does that mean?",
    ["封印物一键辅助"] = "Sealed Artifact One-Tap Support",
    ["封印物中蕴含的非凡气息可以通过特殊材料进行调整，调整后的气息将会获得新的类型和稀有度；相同类型气息的强度会受到稀有度的影响，稀有度越高，气息初始强度越高，在进行共鸣改造时会获得更高的增益；气息洗练将逐条进行调整，并可对调整结果进行重置，本次调整的气息变化不生效，并累积祝福值，祝福值会提高下一次调整时的气息稀有度"] = "The Beyonder aura contained in a Sealed Artifact can be adjusted using special materials. The adjusted aura will gain new types and rarities. The intensity of the same type of aura will be affected by its rarity; the higher the rarity, the higher the initial intensity of the aura, and you will gain higher bonuses during resonance modification. Aura refinement will be adjusted one by one, and you can reset the adjustment results. The aura changes from this adjustment will not take effect, and blessing points will be accumulated. Blessing points will increase the rarity of the aura in the next adjustment.",
