    ["封印物简介"] = "Sealed Artifact Introduction",
    ["封印物系统"] = "Sealed Artifact System",
    ["封印物系统介绍"] = "Sealed Artifact System Introduction",
    ["封印物系统已解锁，点击前往查看。"] = "The Sealed Artifact system is unlocked. Click to view it.",
    ["封印物系统提供的非凡评分总加成由各封印物提供非凡评分之和与领域激活效果提供非凡评分之和组成。\n封印物提供非凡评分由封印物固有非凡评分、封印物升级提升非凡评分及封印物突破提升非凡评分组成。\n领域提供非凡评分由核心共鸣阶段性解锁的各项加成的非凡评分提供。"] = "The total Beyonder rating bonus provided by the Sealed Artifact system consists of the sum of Beyonder ratings provided by individual Sealed Artifacts and the sum of Beyonder ratings provided by domain activation effects. \nThe Beyonder rating provided by Sealed Artifacts consists of their inherent Beyonder rating, Beyonder rating increases from upgrades, and Beyonder rating increases from breakthroughs. \nThe Beyonder rating provided by the domain is provided by the Beyonder rating of various bonuses unlocked stage-by-stage through core resonance.",
    ["封印物聚合"] = "Sealed Artifact Aggregation",
    ["封印物聚合熟练度"] = "Sealed Artifact Aggregation Proficiency.",
    ["封印物聚合素材"] = "Sealed Artifact Synthesis Material",
    ["封印物自身会遗留一定的非凡者气息，可以通过共鸣强化这些气息等级，最终按比例对原有气息进行强度增幅；非凡气息之间会相互干扰，当气息等级高于最低气息等级一定值时，高等级气息会受到影响并衰减；气息的数量由危险等级决定，危险等级1的封印物将拥有4条非凡气息，危险等级每变化1级，则气息上限减少1条"] = "Sealed Artifacts retain a certain amount of Beyonder aura, which can be strengthened through resonance to ultimately increase the intensity of the original aura proportionally. Beyonder auras interfere with each other; when the aura level exceeds the lowest aura level by a certain value, the higher-level aura will be affected and decay. The number of auras is determined by the danger level; a Sealed Artifact with a danger level of 1 will have 4 Beyonder auras, and for every 1-level change in danger level, the aura limit decreases by 1.",
