    ["小丑的尸体让弗莱做后续处理，看能不能辨认出他原本的长相，找到有关的线索。"] = "Have Frye handle the Clown's corpse to see if he can identify his original appearance and find relevant clues.",
    ["小丑的情绪波动被梦境放大了，尽快击败悲伤的小丑！"] = "The Clown's emotional fluctuations have been amplified by the dream; defeat the Sad Clown as soon as possible!",
