    ["小时候她就爱问，这些钢铁到底是怎么炼成的。"] = "When she was little, she loved to ask how this steel was refined.",
    ["小时候我总是让父亲变成一个个书里的人物，邪恶的海盗、马戏团的小丑……即便是混在人群里，我也能一眼就把他认出来，因为我知道——"] = "When I was a child, I always asked my father to turn into one of the characters from the books—an evil pirate, a circus clown... Even when he was lost in a crowd, I could recognize him at a glance, because I knew—",
    ["小时候我成绩还不错，但家里人说，让我等一等，等弟弟上完学再去。"] = "When I was young, my grades were pretty good, but my family said, let me wait, wait until my younger brother finished school.",
    ["小时候，别的孩子喜欢玩布娃娃，她却在拆房间里的座钟。"] = "When she was a child, other children liked playing with dolls, but she was busy taking apart the grandfather clock in the room.",
