    ["少做梦了！喝酒吧，明天还得搬货呢。"] = "Stop dreaming! Drink up, we have to move cargo tomorrow.",
    ["少做梦了！金子铺的街道？那还不把人硌死！不过……要是真能去贝克兰德，我也想去看看。"] = "Stop dreaming! Streets paved with gold? That would hurt your feet! But... if I could really go to Backlund, I'd want to see it too.",
    ["少加一点没什么问题，魔药里还有呢，也没听说有人喝魔药毒死……"] = "Adding a little bit is no problem; it's already in the potion, and I haven't heard of anyone dying from drinking a potion...",
    ["少女"] = "Girly",
    ["少女于退潮时消失在海边。她遗留在沙滩的其中一个脚印中，盛放着这枚蔚蓝的戒指。\n少女曾描述过她最后的梦境，她梦见自己是一个精灵，在碧海之上的宫殿中高歌。银白的雷霆在华美的王座上闪耀穿梭，所有人都感到安全、幸福与自豪。\n少女向来红剧场收尸的老者讲了这个故事，向同为舞女的姐姐讲了这个故事，向对她的恶疾爱莫能助的医生也讲了这个故事。\n随后在某个潮湿的、退潮的清晨，少女消失在海边。"] = "The girl disappeared by the sea at low tide. In one of the footprints she left on the beach, this azure ring was blooming. \n The girl had described her final dream: she dreamt she was an elf, singing in a palace above the blue sea. Silver lightning flashed and wove through the magnificent throne, and everyone felt safe, happy, and proud. \n The girl told this story to the old man who collected corpses at the Red Theater, to her sister who was also a dancer, and to the doctor who was helpless against her terminal illness. \n Then, on a damp morning at low tide, the girl disappeared by the sea.",
    ["少女从河边开始被跟踪，之后一路逃向了某处"] = "The girl was followed from the riverside and then fled all the way to a certain place",
    ["少女尸体"] = "Girl's corpse",
    ["少女慌不择路地逃向的主干道"] = "The main road the girl fled toward in a panic",
    ["少女故意将开膛手一路引诱到的警局总部"] = "The girl intentionally lured the Ripper all the way to the police headquarters",
    ["少女灵体"] = "Young Girl Spirit",
    ["少女的花篮"] = "Maiden's Flower Basket",
    ["少女被拯救的时间是？"] = "When is the girl saved?",
    ["少女被拯救的时间正是黄昏"] = "The time the girl was saved was indeed dusk",
    ["少女走入转角。迎面而来的不是死路，而是手持长枪的警察。"] = "The young girl walks into the corner. What she meets is not a dead end, but police officers holding rifles.",
    ["少女走入转角。迎面而来的不是死路，而是持枪警戒的警察。"] = "The girl walked into the corner. What she faced was not a dead end, but police officers on guard with guns.",
    ["少女顺利逃脱前，是某人缠住了开膛手"] = "Before the girl successfully escaped, someone entangled the Ripper",
    ["少年"] = "Youth",
    ["少年——不，应该说少年的灵，呆滞地望着眼前的一切，仿佛失去所有的力气。\n线索汇集起来，他终于理解了眼前发生的一切。"] = "The boy—or rather, the boy's spirit—stared blankly at the scene before him, as if all his strength had left him.\nAs the clues came together, he finally understood what had happened.",
    ["少年人啊！\n莫让智慧之火熄灭于指间！\n\n凡获得学校通知书却无力支付学费者，\n鲁恩慈善助学基金会将助您求学。\n\n申请资格：\n须持教区推荐信或学校录取通知书、家庭工薪证明\n\n申请方式：\n将自荐信投递于<Highlight>当地黑夜教堂</>处"] = "Young people! \n Do not let the fire of wisdom be extinguished between your fingers! \n\n Those who have received a school admission letter but cannot afford the tuition, \n the Loen Charity Scholarship Foundation will help you pursue your studies. \n\n Eligibility: \n Must hold a parish recommendation letter or school admission letter, and family income proof \n\n Application method: \n Submit your self-recommendation letter to the <Highlight> local Night Church </>",
    ["少废话！把头抬起来！"] = "Cut the crap! Lift your head up!",
    ["少废话！拿来！"] = "Stop the nonsense! Hand it over!",
    ["少废话！看招！<P_Heart>（又挥空）</> "] = "Stop talking nonsense! Take this! <P_Heart>(Swings and misses again)</>",
    ["少废话，把钱给我——"] = "Cut the crap, give me the money—",
    ["少打听，生意而已。你要是没有活老鼠，就别挡道。"] = "Don't ask, it's just business. If you don't have live rats, don't get in the way.",
    ["少来烦我。"] = "Stop bothering me.",
    ["少来这套格纳，你这样干也不是一两天了。我要把这件事告诉斯维因！"] = "Cut the crap, Gner, you haven't been doing this for just a day or two. I'm going to tell Swain about this!",
    ["少来这套，不如来比比昨天的营业额！"] = "Spare me that, why don't we compare yesterday's turnover!",
