    ["尤其是她的爱好——她经常沉迷于齿轮、轴承和其他机械设备。"] = "Especially her hobby—she is often obsessed with gears, bearings, and other mechanical equipment.",
    ["尤其是我可爱的小昂格，一听见猫叫声就往门外跑。"] = "Especially my cute little Ang, he runs out the door as soon as he hears a cat meow.",
