    ["尤德拉"] = "Yodra",
    ["尤德拉。我的名字是尤德拉……是守护这里的屏障，从接触大地的那一刻开始……"] = "Yodra. My name is Yodra... I am the barrier that guards this place, from the moment I touched the earth...",
    ["尤德拉？"] = "Eudora?",
    ["尤德拉？尤德拉！"] = "Yodra? Yodra!",
    ["尤德拉？那不是大地教会的……"] = "Yodra? Isn't that the Church of Earth's...",
