    ["尤朵拉4"] = "Yodora 4",
    ["尤朵拉·"] = "Yodora ",
    ["尤朵拉·拉维"] = "Yodora Lavey",
    ["尤朵拉……哦，那个坏孩子。"] = "Yodora... Oh, that bad child.",
    ["尤朵拉下到上1"] = "Yodra moves from bottom to top 1",
    ["尤朵拉下到上2"] = "Yodra moves from bottom to top 2",
    ["尤朵拉下半身特写"] = "Close-up of Yodra's lower body.",
    ["尤朵拉不是怪物……"] = "Yodora is not a monster...",
    ["尤朵拉估计在序列九左右，但有失控的危险，我们尤其要小心那支笛子。"] = "Yodora is likely around Sequence 9, but there is a risk of loss of control. We must be especially careful with that flute.",
    ["尤朵拉做得好……他夸我了……他是第一个夸我的人……"] = "Yodora did well... He praised me... He is the first person to praise me...",
    ["尤朵拉已经完全失控了"] = "Yodora has completely lost control",
    ["尤朵拉想和大家一起……回家……"] = "Yodora wants to go... home... with everyone.",
    ["尤朵拉拉远"] = "Yodra zooms out.",
    ["尤朵拉是你的朋友？她是什么人？你们怎么认识的？"] = "Yodora is your friend? Who is she? How did you meet?",
    ["尤朵拉是孤儿，追随真实造物主的天生非凡者，她厌恶这个糟糕的时代。"] = "Yodora is an orphan, a natural Beyonder who follows the True Creator; she is disgusted by this terrible era.",
    ["尤朵拉是我的朋友……奇怪，我们是怎么认识的？"] = "Yodora is my friend... Strange, how did we meet?",
    ["尤朵拉是我的朋友，她有一点胆小，总是躲在角落里偷偷看我。"] = "Yodora is my friend. She is a little timid and always hides in the corner to secretly watch me.",
    ["尤朵拉是谁？"] = "Who is Yodora?",
    ["尤朵拉灵体"] = "Eudora's Spirit Body",
    ["尤朵拉的声音"] = "Yodora's voice.",
    ["尤朵拉碎片"] = "Yodora Fragment",
    ["尤朵拉移动终点"] = "Yodra movement destination.",
    ["尤朵拉终点"] = "Yodora Endpoint",
    ["尤朵拉能听到奇怪的呓语，她可能是一个天生的非凡者，但那诡异的笛声是什么能力……"] = "Yodora can hear strange whispers; she might be a natural-born Beyonder, but what kind of ability is that eerie flute sound...",
    ["尤朵拉选中你，作为骨笛的祭品"] = "Yodora has chosen you as a sacrifice for the bone flute.",
    ["尤朵拉，痛苦的命运并不能作为你害死其他孩子的借口。"] = "Yodora, a painful fate cannot be an excuse for you to kill other children.",
    ["尤朵拉？好的，这里是失踪儿童们的档案资料，或许对你们有帮助。"] = "Yodora? Alright, here are the files on the missing children; perhaps they will be helpful to you.",
    ["尤瑟夫诊所怎么还关着门？"] = "Why is the Yusef Clinic still closed?",
    ["尤瑟纳尔"] = "Yusenar",
    ["尤瑟纳尔是个很要强的新人。"] = "Yousner is a very competitive newcomer.",
    ["尤莉安"] = "Julian",
    ["尤菲米娅"] = "Euphemia",
    ["尤西"] = "Yusi",
    ["尤里卡"] = "Eureka",
    ["尤里安"] = "Yulian",
    ["尤里尔·"] = "Uriel ",
    ["尤金"] = "Eugene",
    ["尤金·"] = "Eugene ",
    ["尬舞"] = "Awkward Dance",
    ["就……仅此而已？"] = "Just... that's it?",
    ["就……只是聊天？"] = "Just... just chatting?",
    ["就……这样？"] = "Just... that?",
    ["就一支。"] = "Just one.",
    ["就不能把启示说得明白点吗！什么叫“东侧摇篮的时光”？"] = "Can't you make the revelation clearer! What does \"time of the cradle on the east side\" mean?",
    ["就为了一晚上舞会的花儿？女神啊……她们晚上能睡着觉？"] = "Just for the flowers of one night's ball? Goddess... can they sleep at night?",
    ["就以他为主人公，写一本《落魄拳王复仇记》怎么样？"] = "How about writing a book called 'The Revenge of the Down-and-Out Boxer' with him as the protagonist?",
    ["就以地段和朝向采光而言，确实不错。房租、水、煤气怎么付呢？"] = "In terms of location and orientation/lighting, it is indeed good. How are the rent, water, and gas paid?",
    ["就位"] = "Ready",
    ["就位中"] = "Getting Ready",
    ["就位准备"] = "Ready",
    ["就位确认"] = "Positioning Confirmation",
    ["就你叫戈多啊"] = "So you're the one called Godot",
    ["就你这点钱，连给我的盥洗室翻修都不够用。"] = "This pittance of yours isn't even enough to renovate my washroom.",
    ["就像{{PlayerName}}说的，即使今天是相亲，你们也不应该安排这么多离谱的考验。"] = "Just like {{PlayerName}} said, even if it were a blind date today, you shouldn't have arranged so many absurd tests.",
    ["就像《风暴山庄》里描绘的那样！我十分向往茜茜女士，自信、慵懒、机智。"] = "Just like what was depicted in \"Storm Manor\"! I really admire Ms. Sissi—confident, lazy, and witty.",
    ["就像一场永远不会落幕的歌剧，很美妙，对吧？这得感谢学生们给我的灵感。"] = "Like an opera that will never reach its Curtain Call, it's wonderful, right? I have the students to thank for the inspiration.",
    ["就像二十多年前，我们阿霍瓦骑士团不惧一切，冲向因蒂斯共和国那群侵略者。"] = "Just like more than twenty years ago, our Ahowe Knights feared nothing and charged at those invaders from the Intis Republic.",
    ["就像以前那样！"] = "Just like before!",
    ["就像在贝克兰德疗养院，皮特在妹妹伊妮德的病床边唱的那样——\n“痛痛飞，痛痛飞，小熊把病痛吓跑，伊妮德美美睡一觉……”"] = "Just like in the Backlund sanatorium, as Pete sang by his sister Enid's hospital bed—\n 'Pain pain fly away, the little bear scares the pain away, Enid sleeps beautifully...'",
    ["就像我和雷吵架后总会和好一样！"] = "Just like how Ray and I always make up after we argue!",
    ["就像有烟火在里面绽放，红橙黄绿等颜色不断外散。"] = "It is as if fireworks are blooming inside, with red, orange, yellow, green, and other colors constantly dispersing.",
    ["就像桌上的留言中写的那样，我们为您提供醇香的红茶与柔软的枕头。"] = "Just as the note on the table says, we provide you with mellow black tea and soft pillows.",
    ["就像混杂了血液的稀薄蜂蜜，它口感甜润，但非常容易喝醉。"] = "Like thin honey mixed with blood, it tastes sweet and smooth, but it is very easy to get drunk.",
    ["就像罗塞尔大帝说过的——“所有罪恶的行为总有一天会发现，即使地上所有的泥土把它们遮掩！”"] = "Just as Emperor Roselle said—'All evil deeds will be discovered one day, even if all the soil on earth covers them!'",
    ["就像罗塞尔大帝说过的那样——"] = "Just as Emperor Roselle said—",
    ["就像这样，\r\n我决定先忘记我的婚姻……"] = "Just like this,\r\nI decided to forget my marriage first...",
    ["就像这样，\r\n我决定拆散他们的婚姻……"] = "Just like this,\r\nI decided to break up their marriage...",
    ["就像韦尔奇和娜娅那样。"] = "Just like Welch and Naya.",
    ["就像鱼贩的儿子十有八九也会成为鱼贩，可怜的小蒙巴顿也想成为警察。"] = "Just like a fishmonger's son is nine times out of ten going to become a fishmonger, poor little Mountbatten also wants to be a police officer.",
    ["就先逛到这里吧"] = "Let's stop exploring for now",
    ["就决定是你了"] = "I Choose You",
    ["就到这里了吗？再试试看。"] = "Is this as far as it goes? Let's try again.",
    ["就到这里吧"] = "Let's stop here",
    ["就到这里吧。"] = "Let's stop here.",
    ["就到这里吧，再说就危险了。"] = "Let's stop here; it'll be dangerous if we say any more.",
    ["就前面那条街，专门找路窄的地方躺着。你要去？小心点，别被他沾上。 "] = "Just on the street ahead, he specifically looks for narrow places to lie down. You want to go? Be careful, don't get entangled by him.",
    ["就喜欢区"] = "Just like the district",
    ["就因为他年轻英俊？咱以前抢过那么多小白脸，也没见她手软过。"] = "Just because he's young and handsome? We've robbed so many pretty boys before, and I've never seen her go soft.",
    ["就在<P_Yellow>办公室</>，我带你去见她。"] = "Right in the <P_Yellow> Office </>, I'll take you to see her.",
    ["就在今天，全廷根最最劲爆的消息将被我蹲守出来！！！"] = "Just today, the most explosive news in all of Tingen will be uncovered by me!!!",
    ["就在前面不远的拐角处……"] = "Just around the corner up ahead...",
    ["就在前面街区，红色的门前！有鬼魂在追杀我！"] = "Just in the block ahead, in front of the red door! There's a ghost chasing me!",
    ["就在前面！"] = "It's right ahead!",
    ["就在此处，将织茧与灰雾尘埃融合。我会为你打开历史的帷幕。"] = "Right here, fuse the cocoon with the gray fog dust. I will open the curtain of history for you.",
    ["就在这个时候，她眼前所见霍然破碎，幻觉一样的破碎了。她站在祭坛中，玻璃窗破碎，天空是一轮红月。\n特莉丝瞳孔一缩：我被拖入了梦中？！"] = "Just at this moment, everything she sees before her shatters abruptly, like a hallucination. She stands within an altar, the glass windows broken, and the sky reveals a red moon. \nTrissy's pupils constrict: I've been dragged into a dream?!",
    ["就在这儿再待一会儿吧。"] = "Just stay here a little longer.",
    ["就在这里，我记得……不，我不记得了，我记错了吗？"] = "It's right here, I remember... No, I don't remember. Did I remember it wrong?",
    ["就好像卖面包的人会说面包是一顿午饭的基石。"] = "It's like someone selling bread would say that bread is the cornerstone of a lunch.",
    ["就好像卖面包的人会说面包是一顿午饭的基石，但其实在南方，人们吃的是米饭……呵呵。"] = "It's like how people who sell bread say bread is the cornerstone of a lunch, but actually in the south, people eat rice... hehe.",
    ["就当做见面礼吧，送给这位新朋友，虽然这份礼物有些不太常见。"] = "Consider it a greeting gift for this new friend, although this gift is a bit unusual.",
    ["就当我是今天的特别摄影师。听说前面十三天都是别人给你拍照，最后一天，换个角度，给自己也拍一张？"] = "Just consider me today's special photographer. I heard others have been taking photos for you for the past thirteen days. On the last day, why not change the angle and take one for yourself?",
    ["就当我是今天的特别摄影师。听说前面十三天都是别人给你拍照，最后一天，换个角度？"] = "Just consider me today's special photographer. I heard that for the first thirteen days, others were taking photos for you; on the last day, how about a different perspective?",
    ["就快到了……"] = "Almost there...",
    ["就快到了，我带过十几个人，全部安全下山。"] = "We're almost there. I've led more than a dozen people down the mountain, all of them safely.",
    ["就快好了。只要能跨过这一步……"] = "Almost there. As long as I can take this step...",
    ["就想象一下？"] = "Just imagine it?",
    ["就我旁边这位吗？每次来，不超过三杯就醉了。"] = "The one next to me? Every time they come, they get drunk in under three glasses.",
    ["就把它留在这里吧，说不定还会有人写出更精彩的故事！"] = "Let's leave it here. Perhaps someone else will write an even more brilliant story!",
    ["就把金梧桐区的那间商铺也抵押掉吧，至少保证工人们的薪水按时发放。"] = "Just mortgage that shop in the Golden Indus District as well; at least ensure the workers' wages are paid on time.",
    ["就擦破点皮。"] = "Just a few scrapes.",
    ["就放在这里吧……"] = "Just leave it here...",
    ["就是……送朋友。"] = "It's just... for a friend.",
    ["就是一个住在这个村子里的混蛋疯子罢了。"] = "Just a bastard madman living in this village.",
    ["就是一切的源头——安提哥努斯家族笔记。"] = "is the source of everything—the Antigonus Family notebook.",
    ["就是他可爱的朋友，那只黄金松鼠。最后，格尔曼需要在朋友和财富之间做出艰难的抉择。"] = "It's his cute friend, that golden squirrel. In the end, Gehrman needs to make a difficult choice between his friend and the wealth.",
    ["就是他提醒我中了诅咒，谢谢。请问，我真可以走了吗？"] = "He was the one who reminded me that I was cursed, thank you. May I ask, can I really leave now?",
    ["就是他，一星期带了三位不同的女士来我们咖啡厅，更夸张的是，每次都是女士付钱。"] = "It's him. He brought three different ladies to our cafe in one week. What's even more exaggerated is that the ladies paid every time.",
    ["就是以后再也没有这么大的图书馆了……"] = "It's just that there won't be such a large library anymore...",
    ["就是会吱吱叫的动物，要还会吱吱叫的那种！花钱收！"] = "Animals that squeak, the kind that can still squeak! I'm paying for them!",
    ["就是会慢一点，一天，两天，消息总会传达到。"] = "It's just a bit slower; one day, two days, the news will always get through.",
    ["就是你了……"] = "You're the one...",
    ["就是你们总部被袭击那件！邓恩队长他们阻止了邪神降临，守护了我们这群可怜的羊羔。"] = "It's the one where your headquarters was attacked! Captain Dunn and the others prevented the descent of an evil god and protected us poor lambs.",
    ["就是你吃了我种的奇异果吧。难怪刚才感受到，有一部分力量被分走了。"] = "So you're the one who ate the strange fruit I planted. No wonder I felt a portion of my power being drained away just now.",
    ["就是偶尔太严肃了，得有人帮他松松弦。"] = "It's just that he's too serious occasionally; someone needs to help him loosen up.",
    ["就是坐下吗？"] = "Just sit down?",
    ["就是它了"] = "That's the one",
    ["就是它了！"] = "That's it!",
    ["就是它！谢谢！我能用完美的姿态迎接他了！ "] = "That's it! Thank you! I can greet him in the perfect state!",
    ["就是就是，而且，要是瑞娜成功竞选上了市长，那就会是我们廷根有史以来第一位女市长了！"] = "Exactly, exactly! And if Rina successfully gets elected as mayor, she will be the first female mayor in Tingen's history!",
    ["就是悠闲的午后，找个安静的地方坐一会，放空自己的内心。"] = "Just a leisurely afternoon, finding a quiet place to sit for a while and empty my mind.",
    ["就是把咸鱼放在派上烤！"] = "It's just baking the salted fish on the pie!",
    ["就是这个味道——是从北边传来的！"] = "This is the smell—it's coming from the north!",
    ["就是这个！多谢……愿大地保佑你。"] = "That's it! Thank you... May the earth bless you.",
    ["就是这个，少爷喜欢的红茶。"] = "This is it, the black tea that the young master likes.",
    ["就是这儿有新品试吃？"] = "Is this where the new product tasting is?",
    ["就是这张面具——"] = "It was this mask—",
    ["就是这样。我没有钱，当然我也不想还这笔钱。"] = "That's it. I don't have money, and of course, I don't want to pay this debt.",
    ["就是这辆车，快跟上去！"] = "It's this carriage, hurry and follow it!",
    ["就是这里 怎么没人？哪里出问题了？"] = "This is the place. Why is no one here? What went wrong?",
    ["就是这里了"] = "This is the place",
    ["就是这里了<P_Heart>（道路被封锁了，是因为劫案事件？）</>。"] = "This is the place <P_Heart>(The road is blocked, is it because of the robbery?)</>.",
    ["就是这里了……"] = "This is the place...",
    ["就是这里了。"] = "This is the place.",
    ["就是这里了！"] = "This is it!",
    ["就是这里了，他给自己选了个最大的舞台。"] = "This is the place, he chose the biggest stage for himself.",
    ["就是这里了，卢娜应该在等着我。"] = "This is the place; Luna should be waiting for me.",
    ["就是这里，进去吧。"] = "This is the place, let's go in.",
    ["就是这间。老威廉一个人住，死了三个月了。每天晚上都能听见翻东西的声音，窸窸窣窣的，像有人在找什么。吓死人了，现在房子也租不出去！"] = "It's this room. Old William lived here alone and has been dead for three months. Every night, you can hear the sound of things being rummaged through, rustling, as if someone is looking for something. It's terrifying, and now the house can't even be rented out!",
    ["就是那个新的可能性。"] = "are that new possibility.",
    ["就是那场事故之后，有些东西再也回不来了。"] = "It's just that after that accident, some things could never come back.",
    ["就是那场发生于二十年战争后，背誓之战前的战争。它让鲁恩击败因蒂斯，重新变得强势！"] = "It was the war that happened after the Twenty Years' War and before the War of the Oathbreakers. It allowed Loen to defeat Intis and become strong again!",
    ["就是那次，我的那些小家伙们开始繁殖之后，它们钻进了甲板里，然后“未来号”就开始产奶了！"] = "That was the time when those little guys of mine started breeding, they burrowed into the deck, and then the \"Future\" started producing milk!",
    ["就是那边那个冒险家样子的人。被他选到的……"] = "Just that adventurer-looking person over there. Whoever he picks...",
    ["就是！你看你这袍子，领口都磨白了！哪个体面姑娘不能帮你打理得妥妥帖帖？"] = "Exactly! Look at your robe, the collar is worn white! Which decent girl couldn't help you keep it tidy?",
    ["就是，我怎么能随随便便就答应。但是……"] = "Exactly, how could I just agree so easily? But...",
    ["就是，约瑟夫！生活费本来就不够花，现在还要全部拿去租房！"] = "Exactly, Joseph! Living expenses aren't enough as it is, and now we have to spend it all on rent!",
    ["就是，这次可一根手指头都没碰你。 "] = "Exactly, this time I didn't even touch you with a single finger.",
    ["就此作罢"] = "Leave it at that",
    ["就没有两全其美的办法吗？！"] = "Is there no way to have the best of both worlds?!",
    ["就炸你"] = "Explode You",
    ["就现在这粮价……够咱这一巷子人，顿顿吃饱……吃上……女神在上，好几年都吃不完！"] = "With the current grain prices... it's enough for everyone in our alley to eat their fill, every meal... for... by the Goddess, we wouldn't finish it in years!",
    ["就知道说那些没用的……"] = "I knew you'd just say those useless things...",
    ["就站在这等一会儿，也不觉得无聊。"] = "Just standing here waiting for a while, doesn't feel boring.",
    ["就算不能，我是说如果，你肯定也能找到更好的工作！"] = "Even if you can't, I mean if, you will definitely be able to find a better job!",
    ["就算您是警察，也不能在破坏餐厅秩序后潇洒离开。"] = "Even if you are a police officer, you cannot just walk away after disrupting the order of a restaurant.",
    ["就算想到了……他那么胆小，肯定也不敢找过来，嘻嘻。"] = "Even if he did guess... he's so timid, he definitely wouldn't dare come looking, hee hee.",
    ["就算我站在他们面前，他们也绝对想不到，我就是他们要找的人。"] = "Even if I stood right in front of them, they would never guess that I am the person they are looking for.",
    ["就算我站在面前，他们也想不到，我就是他们在找的人。"] = "Even if I were standing right in front of them, they wouldn't guess that I'm the person they're looking for.",
    ["就算打不过……来都来了！"] = "Even if I can't win... I'm already here!",
    ["就算找不到宝藏，在月光下使舵，喝着烈朗齐 ，唱着水手歌，想想也美滋滋的……"] = "Even if I can't find treasure, steering under the moonlight, drinking Lerali, and singing sailor songs, just thinking about it is wonderful...",
    ["就算摘走一两朵，隔天睡莲也会长出来，这都是仙女的庇佑啊！"] = "Even if you pick one or two, the water lilies will grow back the next day. This is all the fairy's blessing!",
    ["就算是垃圾也有高下之分，你的慧眼迅速地给它们打着标价。"] = "Even trash has its hierarchy, and your discerning eye quickly put price tags on them.",
    ["就算有新种又怎样？你记录了三千七百种植物，谁在乎再多一种？"] = "So what if there's a new species? You've recorded three thousand seven hundred species of plants; who cares about one more?",
    ["就算没有意义，有些事情还是得去做。"] = "Even if it's meaningless, some things still have to be done.",
    ["就算没有那身鲜红的衣裙和金光闪闪的皮囊，我也能一眼认出她来。"] = "Even without that bright red dress and the glittering skin, I would be able to recognize her at a glance.",
    ["就算离开了这里，我们又能去哪儿呢？我们什么都不会，长得又瘦又小，没有工厂想要这样的孩子。"] = "Even if we leave here, where can we go? We don't know how to do anything, we're thin and small, and no factory wants children like this.",
    ["就算精心制定计划，你父亲也会找到下一件事要求你。 "] = "Even if you make a meticulous plan, your father will just find the next thing to demand of you.",
    ["就算输给了隐匿贤者，我也没有停下脚步。"] = "Even if I lost to the Hidden Sage, I didn't stop my steps.",
    ["就算这时候，她嘴角也带着笑的，真是个像小太阳一样的人。"] = "Even then, there is a smile on the corner of her mouth. She really is a person like a little sun.",
    ["就算那些故事是假的……至少我为了解她，实实在在地试过了。"] = "Even if those stories are fake... at least I truly tried to understand her.",
    ["就绪"] = "Ready",
    ["就绪_结束后删除"] = "Ready_Delete after completion",
    ["就能获得保护一切的力量。"] = "And gain the power to protect everything.",
    ["就装作被通灵了的样子"] = "Just pretend to be spirit-mediumized.",
    ["就要还了，我是想让他知道，不是要找的戒指都能找回来。"] = "I was about to return them; I just wanted him to know that not every ring you look for can be found.",
    ["就让大学之母见证这一切！珍妮，看见我对你的真心吧！"] = "Let the Mother of Universities witness all this! Jenny, see my sincerity for you!",
    ["就让恶龙酒吧的老板来判断对错吧！"] = "Let the owner of the Evil Dragon Bar decide who is right!",
    ["就诊记录"] = "Medical Record",
    ["就诊记录单"] = "Medical Record",
    ["就该多招人！"] = "You should definitely hire more people!",
    ["就近复活"] = "Resurrect Nearby",
    ["就近复苏"] = "Resuscitate Nearby",
    ["就这一句。那些在外面奔波了一整天、满心烦躁的人，来这儿坐一晚，听她叫几声“哥哥”，走的时候脸上都是带着笑的。"] = "Just that. Those who have been running around all day, full of irritation, come here to sit for a night, hear her call them \"brother\" a few times, and they leave with smiles on their faces.",
    ["就这一句，多少人愿意在她身边坐一整晚，把这辈子没对人说过的都倒出来。"] = "Just that one phrase, and so many people are willing to sit by her side all night, pouring out everything they've never told anyone else in their lives.",
    ["就这么决定。那么，该先去黑荆棘公司了。"] = "That's decided. Now, I should head to the Blackthorn Company first.",
    ["就这么坐着歇会儿，什么事都不急。"] = "Just sitting here resting for a while, nothing is urgent.",
    ["就这么慢慢地 把对方引去教堂附近……"] = "Just like this, slowly lead the other party near the church...",
    ["就这么认为吧。只能从别的途径来寻找<P_Yellow>那本笔记</>了。"] = "Let's just assume that. We can only look for <P_Yellow>that notebook</> through other channels.",
    ["就这么走了？"] = "Just leaving like that?",
    ["就这些。"] = "That is all.",
    ["就这些了。还有一个书上的《死亡与复生》没来得及提问……"] = "That's all. There was also the book 'Death and Rebirth' that I didn't have time to ask about...",
    ["就这些了，祝你好运，再见！"] = "That's all, good luck, goodbye!",
    ["就这些，还是……你想知道些别的？"] = "That's all, or... do you want to know something else?",
    ["就这几张，或许圣堂还有一些，另外就是那些黑市和隐秘组织里可能会有。你以为这很容易搞到？"] = "Just these few pages. Perhaps the Cathedral still has some. Besides that, they might be found in black markets and secret organizations. Did you think this was easy to get?",
    ["就这样吧"] = "That's it for now",
    ["就这样吧……"] = "Let's leave it at that...",
    ["就这样吧。能说的，也就是这些了。"] = "Let's leave it at that. That's all there is to say.",
    ["就这样喝下去吗？不需要另外的准备？比如仪式或者祈祷？"] = "Should I just drink it like this? No other preparations needed? Like a ritual or prayer?",
    ["就这样喝下去？有什么风险吗？"] = "Just drink it like this? Are there any risks?",
    ["就这样，先休息吧。等睡醒了我就去……找邓恩先生……"] = "That's it, let's rest first. When I wake up, I'll go... find Mr. Dunn...",
    ["就这样，我们每天幽会……"] = "Just like that, we met in secret every day...",
    ["就这点水平还打什么拳击赛！"] = "With this level of skill, why are you even in a Punch competition!",
    ["就这里吧。"] = "Let's do it here.",
    ["就连格尔曼·斯帕罗都无法长时间忍耐我的歌声，我该怎么扮演“海洋歌者”……"] = "Even Gehrman Sparrow cannot endure my singing for a long time. How am I supposed to act as a “Sea God Bard”...",
    ["就那家，奈拉小姐那里。那可不是谁都能进去做事的，她的眼光高着呢。"] = "That's the one, Miss Naila's place. Not just anyone can work there; she has very high standards.",
    ["就随便这个画商处置吧，反正我是不会给钱的！"] = "Just let this art dealer deal with me however he wants, I'm not paying anyway!",
    ["尴尬"] = "Awkward",
