    ["尼克"] = "Nick",
    ["尼克斯"] = "Nyx",
    ["尼克，不准哭！奶奶说了，她最不想别人的眼泪落在她的碑前，她要我们高高兴兴的！"] = "Nick, no crying! Grandma said she hates it most when others' tears fall before her tombstone. She wants us to be happy!",
    ["尼古拉"] = "Nicola",
    ["尼古拉斯·"] = "Nicholas ",
    ["尼古拉，你都多大了，还相信这种东西。"] = "Nikola, how old are you, and you still believe in such things.",
    ["尼奥"] = "Neo",
    ["尼奥-水下信徒"] = "Neo-Underwater Believer",
    ["尼娅·"] = "Nia ",
    ["尼娜"] = "Nina",
    ["尼娜·"] = "Nina ",
    ["尼安"] = "Nian",
    ["尼尔"] = "Neil",
    ["尼尔\n9月1日"] = "Neil \nSeptember 1st",
    ["尼尔\n9月20日"] = "Neil \nSeptember 20th",
    ["尼尔lookat"] = "Neil lookat",
    ["尼尔·"] = "Neil ",
    ["尼尔先生……果然都是他的报销单。"] = "Mr. Neil... As expected, they're all his reimbursement forms.",
    ["尼尔先生一定会很感谢你的。"] = "Mr. Neil would definitely be very grateful to you.",
    ["尼尔先生是一位很好的人，我以前是他的邻居，这是他为他爱人莎莉丝特建造的花园，她就长眠在这里，尼尔先生一定很爱她吧。"] = "Mr. Neil was a very good person. I used to be his neighbor. This is the garden he built for his beloved Celeste. She rests here. Mr. Neil must have loved her very much.",
    ["尼尔先生的回信，今天该到了吧？"] = "Mr. Neil's reply should arrive today, right?",
    ["尼尔先生，“窥秘人”有什么特别的能力吗？"] = "Mr. Neil, does the 'Mystery Pryer' have any special abilities?",
    ["尼尔先生，你也需要钱吗？"] = "Mr. Neil, do you need money too?",
    ["尼尔先生，你今天的行动很敏捷，而且比我想象的更为冷静。"] = "Mr. Neil, your actions today were very agile, and you were calmer than I imagined.",
    ["尼尔先生，你到得真早。"] = "Mr. Neil, you arrived very early.",
    ["尼尔先生，做个交易吧？"] = "Mr. Neil, shall we make a deal?",
    ["尼尔先生，听说您会弹钢琴？"] = "Mr. Neil, I heard you can play the piano?",
    ["尼尔先生，您了解代罚者吗？"] = "Mr. Neil, do you know about the Mandated Punishers?",
    ["尼尔先生，您在黑夜教会工作多久了？"] = "Mr. Neil, how long have you worked for the Church of the Night?",
    ["尼尔先生，您觉得邓恩队长是个什么样的人？"] = "Mr. Neil, what kind of person do you think Captain Dunn is?",
    ["尼尔先生，感谢您还能想起这次见面，请您跟我来。"] = "Mr. Neil, thank you for remembering this meeting. Please, come with me.",
    ["尼尔先生，我真没想到你还会弹钢琴。我的意思是，弹得相当不错。"] = "Mr. Neil, I really didn't expect you to play the piano. I mean, you play quite well.",
    ["尼尔先生，我记得材料可以申请，对吧？"] = "Mr. Neil, I remember we can apply for materials, right?",
    ["尼尔先生，那你需要借钱吗？"] = "Mr. Neil, then do you need to borrow money?",
    ["尼尔先生："] = "Mr. Neil:",
    ["尼尔先生？"] = "Mr. Neil?",
    ["尼尔同意修钢琴定点"] = "Neil Agrees to Repair Piano Waypoint",
    ["尼尔回信mesh"] = "Neil's Reply Mesh",
    ["尼尔家"] = "Neil's House",
    ["尼尔已经在等待"] = "Neil is already waiting",
    ["尼尔总是向我展示他新获得的琥珀，他还说琥珀里面有一只虫子，我也看到了。那只虫子蜷缩着，就像初生的婴儿一样。\n真是幸运的尼尔，希望他的好运，能一直持续到我们整个绿城。"] = "Neil always shows me the amber he just acquired, and he says there is a bug inside it. I saw it too. The bug is curled up, just like a newborn baby.\nLucky Neil, I hope his good fortune lasts until it reaches our entire Green City.",
    ["尼尔意外现身"] = "Neil appears unexpectedly",
    ["尼尔接受交易"] = "Neil accepts the deal",
    ["尼尔森·"] = "Nielsen ",
    ["尼尔的登山日志"] = "Neil's Mountaineering Log",
    ["尼尔的礼物"] = "Neil's Gift",
    ["尼尔离开路径"] = "Neil's Departure Path",
    ["尼尔第一封信mesh"] = "Neil's first letter mesh",
    ["尼尔说这条路他走过七次。\n一路上，他说了三遍。我不信——如果他真的走过七次，为什么连帐篷都不会搭？我蹲在他身后，看他第三次把帐篷布穿反，雪水渗进手套，冷得像在舔我的骨头。\n万幸，我们在天黑前支起了帐篷。\n\n剩余物资：\n面包6份      佩姬给我们准备了18磅，分成了8份\n肉干和肉肠5份\n糖1罐\n黄油4块\n酒3瓶        晚上庆祝，消耗1瓶\n水5瓶        暂时充足，不过路上可以留意水源\n\n\n我想起来，在上山的路上我和尼尔还碰到一个奇怪的人——一个什么装备都没有带，穿着整齐西装的男子，看样子四十来岁，很有气质，眼睛是深蓝色的，很好看。\n我很少会注意一个人的眼睛，但从见到他开始，我就一直盯着他眼睛看，我从他的瞳孔中看到了我的影子。\n他友好地向我们询问下山的路，我指给他我们来时的路。"] = "Neil said he had walked this road seven times.\n Along the way, he said it three times. I don't believe it—if he had really walked it seven times, why couldn't he even set up a tent? I crouched behind him, watching him put the tent fabric on backward for the third time, snow water seeping into my gloves, cold as if licking my bones.\n Fortunately, we set up the tent before dark.\n\n Remaining supplies:\n Bread 6 portions      Peggy prepared 18 pounds for us, divided into 8 portions\n Jerky and sausage 5 portions\n Sugar 1 can\n Butter 4 blocks\n Wine 3 bottles        Celebrate in the evening, consume 1 bottle\n Water 5 bottles        Temporarily sufficient, but can keep an eye out for water sources on the way\n\n\n I remember, on the way up the mountain, Neil and I met a strange person—a man in a neat suit without any equipment, looking to be in his forties, very charismatic, with deep blue eyes, very beautiful.\n I rarely pay attention to a person's eyes, but from the moment I saw him, I kept staring at his eyes, and I saw my own reflection in his pupils.\n He asked us for the way down the mountain in a friendly manner, and I pointed him to the path we came from.",
    ["尼尔走1"] = "Neil walks 1",
    ["尼尔郑重起誓"] = "Neil makes a solemn vow",
    ["尼尔，你在听吗？"] = "Neil, are you listening?",
    ["尼尔，你在哪里？"] = "Neil, where are you?",
    ["尼尔，你就这样对待同事？不眠者也不能一直不睡觉。诶——"] = "Neil, is that how you treat your colleagues? Even a Sleepless can't go without sleep forever. Hey—",
    ["尼尔，回来了？听说你今天抓到了一个偷盗者，厉害啊！"] = "Neil, you're back? I heard you caught a thief today. That's impressive!",
    ["尼尔，尼尔，醒醒！"] = "Neil, Neil, wake up!",
    ["尼尔？你回来了吗？"] = "Neil? Are you back?",
    ["尼希米·"] = "Nehemiah ",
    ["尼拉·"] = "Nila ",
    ["尼曼"] = "Niemann",
    ["尼欧·"] = "Neo ",
    ["尼波斯"] = "Nepos",
    ["尼科·"] = "Nico ",
    ["尼科尔·"] = "Nicole ",
    ["尼莫"] = "Nemo",
    ["尼诺"] = "Nino",
    ["尼诺？等着瞧吧，你等下吃起来，嗝，至少也要解开三颗扣子。"] = "Nino? Just you wait, when you eat later, *hic*, you'll have to undo at least three buttons.",
    ["尽力赢得观众的喝彩赞许。"] = "Strive to win the applause and praise of the audience.",
    ["尽可能抢夺更多灵性！"] = "Seize as much spirituality as possible!",
    ["尽快<Dungeon_Disable>分成2组</>靠近被点名单位，帮助分摊伤害！！！"] = "Quickly <Dungeon_Disable> split into 2 groups </> and get close to the targeted units to help share the damage!!!",
    ["尽快<Dungeon_Disable>分成3组</>靠近被点名单位，帮助分摊伤害！！！"] = "Quickly <Dungeon_Disable> split into 3 groups </> and get close to the targeted units to help share the damage!!!",
    ["尽快击杀虚影，阻止剥面人恢复"] = "Kill the phantom shadow as soon as possible to prevent the Faceless from recovering.",
    ["尽快分散站位！"] = "Spread out as soon as possible!",
    ["尽快前往邓恩所在位置，躲避梅高欧丝的诅咒伤害"] = "Go to Dunn's location as soon as possible to avoid the curse damage from Megose.",
    ["尽快把碎片都找回来吧！"] = "Let's find all the fragments as soon as possible!",
    ["尽快摆脱困境！"] = "Get out of this predicament quickly!",
    ["尽快消化占卜家魔药、获得晋升，才能应对后续的危机。"] = "I must digest the Seer potion and achieve advancement as soon as possible to deal with the subsequent crises.",
    ["尽快消灭场上畸变幼体并<Dungeon_Disable>投喂</>咕噜，避免饥饿值过高！！！"] = "Eliminate the Aberrant Larvae on the field as soon as possible and <Dungeon_Disable>feed</> Gulu to prevent the hunger value from getting too high!!!",
    ["尽快穿过迷宫，击破瑞尔·比伯的护盾！"] = "Navigate the maze as soon as possible and break Ray Bieber's shield!",
    ["尽快走位躲避！"] = "Dodge as soon as possible!",
    ["尽快赶往<h>中央广场</>"] = "Rush to <h>Central Plaza</> as soon as possible",
    ["尽快转火，攻击脐带藤蔓！"] = "Switch targets and attack the umbilical vine as soon as possible!",
    ["尽快靠近被点名单位，帮助分摊伤害！！！"] = "Get close to the targeted unit as soon as possible to help share the damage!!!",
    ["尽情彼此争斗吧。我只对赢家感兴趣。"] = "Fight each other to your heart's content. I'm only interested in the winner.",
    ["尽管、尽管只能作为一个旁观者……"] = "Although, although we can only be observers...",
    ["尽管你比月亮花更活泼、更可爱。"] = "Even though you are more lively and lovely than a moonflower.",
    ["尽管你狭长的眼里透出的并非高兴。"] = "Even though your long, narrow eyes do not reveal joy.",
    ["尽管克莱恩认为这小家伙更像一只乌龟，但他还是很给面子地解释：“仔细一看，确实是人偶！材料的问题，还是太简陋了。”\n班森笑眯眯地补充：“瞧瞧，多漂亮的人偶！”"] = "Although Klein thinks this little guy looks more like a turtle, he still gives face and explains: \"Looking closely, it is indeed a doll! It's a matter of the materials, they are still too crude.\"\n Benson adds with a smile: \"Look, what a beautiful doll!\"",
    ["尽管如此，我们还是付不起房租，马上就要被房东赶出去了……女神啊，祈求您快让我找到工作吧！"] = "Even so, we still can't afford the rent and are about to be kicked out by the landlord... Goddess, I pray that you let me find work soon!",
    ["尽管我们只能发出微小的光芒，但只要数量足够多，总能照亮黑夜的一角。"] = "Although we can only emit a tiny light, as long as there are enough of us, we can always illuminate a corner of the dark night.",
    ["尽管我的鸟脑子现在不怎么灵活，连记忆都零散破碎……"] = "Although my bird brain isn't very flexible right now, and even my memories are fragmented and scattered...",
