    ["尾弹"] = "Tail Shot",
    ["尾灯消失在巷口。后视镜里只剩路灯——还有你的不甘心。"] = "The taillights disappear at the end of the alley. Only the streetlights remain in the rearview mirror—along with your unwillingness to let go.",
