    ["局里追查的一个私酒贩子流窜到炼钢厂附近了，我想他应该躲在僻静的角落里，就过来这边搜查，刚好遇到这位先生倒在地上，幸好发现得还不算晚。"] = "A bootlegger the bureau has been tracking has fled near the steel mill. I think he must be hiding in a quiet corner, so I came here to search. I happened to find this gentleman lying on the ground. Fortunately, it wasn't too late.",
    ["层叠之门"] = "Layered Gate",
