    ["层叠印记Modifier"] = "Stacked Mark Modifier",
    ["层叠印记持续时间提升至10秒，最大层数提升至10层"] = "Stacked Mark duration increased to 10 seconds, and maximum stacks increased to 10.",
    ["层叠印记的层数上限提升至10层，持续时间提升至10秒。"] = "Stacked Mark stack limit increased to 10, duration increased to 10 seconds.",
    ["层叠发旋，似乎传达着塔罗之中最深奥的秘密。"] = "Cascading hair whorls, seemingly conveying the most profound secrets of the Tarot.",
    ["层叠的金属枝臂托起数十支蜡形灯泡，宴客时点亮，足以让整座厅堂明亮如昼。"] = "Layered metal branches support dozens of candle-shaped bulbs; when lit for guests, it is enough to make the entire hall as bright as day.",
