    ["岁月几番沉浮，持着阔剑站立的骑士却始终忠诚。"] = "Through the ups and downs of time, the knight standing with a broadsword remains loyal.",
    ["岁月棋局"] = "Chess Game of Time",
    ["岁月洗礼的古堡"] = "The Ancient Castle Washed by Time",
    ["岁月的棋局"] = "Gambit of the Ages",
    ["岁月的棋局也会强化下一次普攻，使其变为朗基努斯之枪。"] = "Gambit of the Ages will also strengthen the next Basic Attack, turning it into Spear of Longinus.",
    ["岁月的棋局也会强化下一次普攻，使其变为朗基努斯之枪；朗基努斯之枪的伤害提高100%。"] = "Gambit of the Ages will also strengthen the next Basic Attack, turning it into Spear of Longinus; Spear of Longinus damage increased by 100%.",
    ["岁月的棋局会把范围内的敌人拉向自己；岁月的棋局伤害提高100%。"] = "Gambit of the Ages pulls enemies within range toward you; Gambit of the Ages damage increased by 100%.",
    ["岁月的棋局伤害提高25%。"] = "Gambit of the Ages Damage Increased by 25%.",
    ["岁月的棋局展开后每1.5秒生成一次真理波浪，生成3次。"] = "After Gambit of the Ages is deployed, it generates a Truth Wave every 1.5 seconds, for a total of 3 times.",
    ["岁月的棋局给1次长枪，是否确认选择这项能力？选择后其他2个会消失"] = "Gambit of the Ages grants 1 spear. Confirm this ability? Choosing it will cause the other 2 to disappear.",
    ["岁月的棋局迎来了一个疯狂的开局。"] = "the Gambit of the Ages has ushered in a mad opening.",
    ["岁月的棋局降低技能冷却时间额外加3秒。"] = "Gambit of the Ages skill Cooldown reduction increased by an additional 3 seconds.",
    ["岁月长枪"] = "Spear of Time",
    ["岂止认识。我们是从同一个窝里爬出来的，只不过他爬进了金窝，我……我还在码头区的鱼腥窝里翻滚。"] = "More than just acquaintances. We crawled out of the same nest, only he crawled into a golden nest, and I... I am still rolling in the fishy nest of the dock area.",
    ["岗位："] = "Post:",
