    ["岩甲"] = "Rock Armor",
    ["岩甲：巨龟的沉重甲壳，可以抵挡一场猛烈的攻击。"] = "Rock Armor: The heavy shell of a giant turtle that can withstand a fierce attack.",
    ["岩石上的"] = "On the Rock",
