    ["峻宇"] = "Junyu",
    ["崇左"] = "Chongzuo",
    ["崇敬着“梦”的小镇吗……说不定是哪位老熟人的“杰作”？"] = "A town that reveres \"dreams\"... perhaps it's the \"masterpiece\" of some old acquaintance?",
    ["崇敬睡莲的小镇，小镇中有种别样的安宁。"] = "A town that reveres water lilies; there is a unique peace in the town.",
    ["崔佛"] = "Trevor",
    ["崔佛\r\n酒桶上放了什么！"] = "Trevor\r\nWhat did you put on the barrel!",
    ["崔佛1"] = "Trevor 1",
    ["崔佛2"] = "Trevor 2",
    ["崔佛Fake"] = "Trevor Fake",
    ["崔佛Real"] = "Trevor Real",
    ["崔佛·墨菲"] = "Trevor Murphy",
    ["崔佛……你还会改装枪支？"] = "Trevor... you can also modify firearms?",
    ["崔佛似乎非常地焦急"] = "Trevor seems extremely anxious",
    ["崔佛和你查到卧底的祖宅，那里藏着一个疯狂的非凡者，似乎来自三大黑帮之一的“黑手套”。"] = "Trevor and you investigated the mole's ancestral home, where a mad Beyonder, seemingly from the \"Black Gloves,\" one of the three major gangs, is hiding.",
    ["崔佛在记录着什么"] = "Trevor is recording something",
    ["崔佛来查炼钢工厂的货，这里有一个强大的机械造物守卫。机械教会的非凡者也牵扯其中吗？"] = "Trevor came to check the cargo at the steel mill, which is guarded by a powerful mechanical construct. Are the Beyonders of the Church of Steam and Machinery involved too?",
    ["崔佛正在老地方等你碰头，似乎有什么重要的事情要讲。"] = "Trevor is waiting for you at the usual spot; he seems to have something important to say.",
    ["崔佛的“绩效冲刺”"] = "Trevor's \"Performance Sprint\"",
    ["崔佛的影子"] = "Trevor's Shadow",
    ["崔佛移动终点"] = "Trevor movement endpoint",
    ["崔佛约你在墓园见面，但那里似乎徘徊着一个异常强大的敌人。 "] = "Trevor asked to meet you at the cemetery, but an exceptionally powerful enemy seems to be wandering there.",
    ["崔佛警官授予的好市民凭证，可以兑换丰厚奖励。"] = "A Good Citizen Certificate awarded by Officer Trevor, which can be exchanged for generous rewards.",
    ["崔佛让我去墓园找他，在那里我们能找到什么？"] = "Trevor asked me to find him at the cemetery. What could we possibly find there?",
    ["崔佛说他会在墓园，但你来到这里并没有见到他，只发现一封他写给你的信。"] = "Trevor said he would be at the cemetery, but you didn't see him when you arrived; you only found a letter he wrote to you.",
    ["崔佛说的接头地点应该就是这里，可是人呢？"] = "The meeting spot Trevor mentioned should be here, but where is he?",
    ["崔佛驾车触发点"] = "Trevor Driving Trigger Point",
    ["崔佛驾驶路点"] = "Trevor Driving Waypoint",
    ["崔佛：……你这个，魔女！"] = "Trevor: ...You witch!",
    ["崔佛：你亲手……结束了这一切。"] = "Trevor: You ended all of this with your own hands.",
    ["崔佛：别进去！那是她的领域——"] = "Trevor: Don't go in! That's her domain—",
    ["崔佛：只要破坏这个，就能切断她的……"] = "Trevor: As long as I destroy this, I can cut off her...",
    ["崔佛：可恶，快放开我！"] = "Trevor: Damn it, let me go!",
    ["崔佛：呃啊——"] = "Trevor: Ugh, ah—",
    ["崔佛：对她来说，这可能是最好的结局。"] = "Trevor: For her, this might be the best ending.",
    ["崔佛：死在复仇的路上……总比变成自己憎恨的那种怪物要强。"] = "Trevor: Dying on the path of revenge... is better than becoming the kind of monster she hated.",
    ["崔佛：走吧。我们得，完成她没做完的事……"] = "Trevor: Let's go. We have to finish what she didn't...",
    ["崔佛：还剩下——卡拉彭。廷根的烂肉，还没挖干净。"] = "Trevor: There's still—Carapon left. The rot of Tingen hasn't been dug out completely yet.",
    ["崔佛：这就是——原始镜面。"] = "Trevor: This is it—the Primal Mirror.",
