    ["工人之家，铁十字街最实惠的住处！"] = "Workers' Home, the most affordable place on Iron Cross Street!",
    ["工人们下班后会不定期在厂区附近自发组织街头竞速，你的出现引起了他们的注意。来一场？跑赢他们，证明谁是真正的廷根车神。"] = "After getting off work, workers spontaneously organize street races near the factory area. Your appearance has caught their attention. Want to race? Beat them and prove who the true Tingen racing god is.",
    ["工人们似乎相信了厂主的话。也可能害怕情况变得更糟，只能妥协。"] = "The workers seem to believe the owner's words. Or perhaps they are afraid the situation will get worse and have no choice but to compromise.",
    ["工人们被你的杂耍吸引"] = "The workers are attracted by your juggling",
    ["工人们，我知道，大家都很累。机器轰隆响了一天，你们的胳膊早就酸了、麻了。"] = "Workers, I know everyone is very tired. The machines have been roaring all day, and your arms are already sore and numb.",
    ["工人灵体1"] = "Worker Spirit 1",
    ["工人灵体2"] = "Worker Spirit 2",
