    ["工人采集"] = "Worker Collection",
    ["工会场景"] = "Guild Scene",
    ["工伤和下岗对这儿的普通人来说是家常便饭，可是贝朵兰女士工作了整整四十年，总能避开这些不幸。她甚至从来没有迟到和缺席过！"] = "Workplace injuries and layoffs are common for ordinary people here, but Ms. Bertran has worked for forty whole years and has always managed to avoid such misfortunes. She has never even been late or absent!",
    ["工作"] = "Work",
    ["工作、外出、宴会……不同场合的外套都挂在这里，任由主人挑选。"] = "Work, outings, banquets... coats for different occasions are hung here, waiting for the owner to choose.",
    ["工作上的事情，让你很不好受吧？"] = "Things at work have been making you feel quite uncomfortable, haven't they?",
    ["工作人员"] = "Staff member",
    ["工作内容待世界观包装，工作内容待世界观包装，工作内容待世界观包装。"] = "Job content pending world-building, job content pending world-building, job content pending world-building.",
    ["工作内容："] = "Job Content:",
    ["工作可不能迟到，快去吧。"] = "Don't be late for work, go on.",
    ["工作太久，我好像真的有点头晕眼花了，休息会吧。"] = "I've been working too long. I'm really starting to feel dizzy. Time for a break.",
    ["工作室"] = "Studio",
    ["工作室俱乐部"] = "Studio Club",
    ["工作永远忙不完！你就是太操心！找个妻子正好照顾你饮食起居！"] = "Work is never finished! You just worry too much! Finding a wife would be perfect to take care of your daily life!",
    ["工作的事情总算搞定了。"] = "The work matter is finally settled.",
    ["工作的事情总算搞定了，带梅丽莎吃顿好的庆祝一下吧！"] = "Work is finally settled. Let's treat Melissa to a good meal to celebrate!",
