    ["工作辛苦了"] = "Thank you for your hard work.",
    ["工作！工作！"] = "Work! Work!",
    ["工作，拿钱。不工作，没钱……我的规矩就这么简单，简单到……连你这种塞满煤灰的小脑袋瓜都听得懂！"] = "Work, get money. Don't work, no money... my rules are that simple, so simple that... even a little head like yours filled with coal dust can understand!",
    ["工作？这不算工作哈哈，我这人比较喜欢聊天，和大家聊的多了，知道的就多了，他们就喜欢叫我“小灵通”。"] = "Work? This doesn't count as work, haha. I'm a person who likes to chat. The more I chat with everyone, the more I know, so they like to call me 'Little Know-It-All'.",
