    ["工匠打造的无线电奇物，能将使用者的声音传播到五海之外。"] = "A radio curiosity crafted by an artisan, capable of transmitting the user's voice beyond the Five Seas.",
    ["工厂"] = "Factory",
    ["工厂……真的遇到困难了吗？还是因为……"] = "The factory... is it really in trouble? Or is it because...",
    ["工厂一隅"] = "Corner of the Factory",
    ["工厂主"] = "Factory Owner",
    ["工厂主似乎还没有完全异化……"] = "The factory owner doesn't seem to have fully alienated yet...",
    ["工厂主正在发言"] = "The factory owner is speaking",
    ["工厂区"] = "Factory District",
    ["工厂区\n买肉的女佣抬头望向远处的黑烟囱：“这雨下起来没完。”\n黑烟囱下，工人们抹了抹脸上的雨，继续劳作。\n街上的行人纷纷打起了伞。"] = "Factory District \n A maid buying meat looks up at the distant black chimneys: \"This rain just won't stop.\" \n Under the black chimneys, workers wipe the rain from their faces and continue to toil. \n Pedestrians on the street open their umbrellas one after another.",
    ["工厂区·出生点"] = "Factory District · Spawn point",
    ["工厂区·定位·卡萝"] = "Factory District · Positioning · Carrol",
    ["工厂区·定位·戴莉"] = "Factory District·Location·Daly",
    ["工厂区·定位·邓恩"] = "Factory District·Location·Dunn",
    ["工厂区传来醉汉雷克斯责骂洗烟囱童工道奇的声音。你上前制止，得知道奇的哥哥杰姆病重住院，他急需今日工钱治病。你协助道奇完成工作，途中雇主点火催工，道奇险些葬身浓烟。你扑灭火源救出道奇，他却仍被雷克斯以“扫得不干净”为由克扣工钱。道奇终于看清了雷克斯的嘴脸，随你离开。黑心的老板永远不会停下剥削，还有无数个道奇，正在工厂的烟雾里挣扎求生。"] = "In the factory district, you hear the drunkard Rex scolding the chimney sweep boy, Dodge. You step in to stop him and learn that Dodge's brother, Jem, is hospitalized with a serious illness, and he desperately needs today's wages for treatment. You assist Dodge in finishing his work, but the employer lights a fire to rush him, and Dodge nearly dies in the thick smoke. You extinguish the fire and save Dodge, but Rex still withholds his pay, claiming he 'didn't sweep it clean'. Dodge finally sees Rex's true face and leaves with you. Heartless bosses will never stop exploiting, and countless other Dodges are struggling to survive in the factory smoke.",
    ["工厂区似乎又有一场命案……"] = "There seems to be another murder in the factory district...",
    ["工厂区又一次发生了命案……"] = "A murder has occurred in the factory district again...",
    ["工厂区夜晚，温妮正在和一位穿着优雅的男人交谈，男人只有背影，并看不清脸。"] = "In the factory district at night, Winnie is talking to an elegantly dressed man. The man is only seen from behind, and his face cannot be clearly seen.",
    ["工厂区怎么了？只要两个人在一起，日子总能过出点滋味来。"] = "What's wrong with the factory district? As long as two people are together, life can always have some flavor.",
    ["工厂区环境差，工人们多半染了肺病，工伤率也高得很。 "] = "The factory area has a poor environment, and most workers have lung diseases, and the industrial injury rate is also very high.",
    ["工厂区调查报告"] = "Factory District Investigation Report",
    ["工厂区这个月已经失踪了三个人，我怀疑是非凡事件。根据占卜结果，前两个工人已经去世，第三个失踪者亚瑟还活着。"] = "Three people have already gone missing in the factory district this month; I suspect it is an Extraordinary event. According to the divination result, the first two workers have already passed away, but the third missing person, Arthur, is still alive.",
    ["工厂区这个月已经失踪了三个工人，我怀疑是非凡事件。根据占卜结果，前两个工人已经去世，第三个失踪者亚瑟还活着。"] = "Three workers have gone missing in the factory district this month; I suspect it's a Beyonder incident. According to the divination results, the first two workers have passed away, but the third missing person, Arthur, is still alive.",
    ["工厂区，女佣抬头望向远处黑烟，骂骂咧咧。\n女佣：糟糕的天气总是没完没了。\n镜头从黑烟冲下移，是许多劳作的工人。"] = "Factory district, a maid looks up at the black smoke in the distance, cursing. \nMaid: The terrible weather is always endless. \nThe camera pans down from the black smoke to many workers laboring.",
    ["工厂后街棚户区"] = "Shantytown, Factory Back Street",
    ["工厂外，一个工人似乎在咒骂什么……"] = "Outside the factory, a worker seems to be cursing something...",
