    ["工厂灵体躁动不安"] = "The factory spirit is restless",
    ["工厂的工人们最近在抱怨些什么……"] = "What are the factory workers complaining about recently...",
    ["工厂的效益……工厂遇到了什么困难？"] = "The factory's efficiency... what kind of trouble has the factory encountered?",
    ["工厂的浓烟"] = "Factory Smoke",
    ["工厂的灵体们被不祥的气息触动，纷纷躁动着现身。"] = "The spirits in the factory were touched by the ominous aura and appeared one after another in agitation.",
    ["工厂的炉子总是在一刻不停地燃烧，生命在时代面前不过其中的一粒灰烬。"] = "The furnace of the factory is always burning non-stop; life is nothing but a grain of ash in front of the era.",
