    ["工厂诗人"] = "Factory poet",
    ["工厂跳舞"] = "Factory Dance",
    ["工厂里传来呼救声"] = "Cries for help come from the factory",
    ["工厂里最近运了几批货。每次数量不多，送到了廷根各处。"] = "Several shipments have arrived at the factory recently. The quantity each time wasn't large, and they were sent all over Tingen.",
    ["工厂里的活儿，一站就是十几个小时，没有点提神的东西，谁能扛得住呢？"] = "Work in the factory, standing for more than ten hours at a time, who can handle it without something to refresh themselves?",
    ["工厂里的粉尘在伤害我们的肺，夺走我们的生命，但那些工厂主呢？他们只关心我们请病假会不会影响工期！"] = "The dust in the factory is hurting our lungs and taking our lives, but what about those factory owners? They only care about whether our sick leave will affect the construction period!",
    ["工厂防线"] = "Factory Defense Line",
    ["工厂附近传来醉汉的责骂声和孩子的哭声，发生了什么事？"] = "The sound of a drunkard's scolding and a child's crying comes from near the factory; what happened?",
    ["工厂，总是被称为时代的脊梁。"] = "The Factory is always called the backbone of the era.",
