    ["左？哦不右边！"] = "Left? Oh no, the right side!",
    ["巧了太太，它对我们也很重要——好不容易蹲到只肥羊，兄弟们可不能白干啊！"] = "What a coincidence, ma'am, it's very important to us too—it wasn't easy to corner a fat sheep, so we brothers can't let our efforts go to waste!",
    ["巧克力布丁"] = "Chocolate pudding",
