    ["巧妇难为无米之炊，我先随便调用一个动作。通用对话动作的需求已经提了，资源到位后，整体视感会好一些。"] = "A clever housewife cannot cook without rice. I'll just call an action at random first. The requirements for general dialogue actions have already been submitted; once the resources are in place, the overall visual effect will be better.",
