    ["巴尼先生与安西娅<Disable>距离过近</>时，会为自己和安西娅<Disable>增加伤害</>。"] = "When Mr. Barney and Anthea are <Disable> too close </>, they will <Disable> grant themselves and each other a Damage Boost </>.",
