    ["巴尼先生连续震击地面，并获得高额<img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>伤害减免。"] = "Mr. Barney continuously shocks the ground and gains high <img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/> Damage Reduction.",
