    ["巴甫洛夫将剩余的小鱼干分给了猫猫们，猫猫满意地吃完离开了。"] = "Pavlov shared the remaining dried fish with the cats, and the cats finished them contentedly and left.",
    ["巴甫洛夫身上总是有一股异香，听说从旁经过的人，身后总会悄然缀上一串毛茸茸的“尾巴”。"] = "Pavlov always has a strange fragrance about him; it is said that those who pass by him find a string of fluffy \"tails\" quietly trailing behind them.",
    ["巴纳巴斯·布莱克"] = "Barnabas Blake",
    ["巴纳比"] = "Barnaby",
    ["巴纳比-葬花人笔友"] = "Barnaby - Gravekeeper pen pal",
    ["巴纳比先生看起来很生气的样子。"] = "Mr. Barnaby looks very angry.",
    ["巴纳比，横行霸道的团长。\n死在营地里，被烈火烤焦。"] = "Barnaby, the overbearing gang leader.\nDied in the camp, scorched by fire.",
