    ["巷口Trigger"] = "Alley Entrance Trigger",
    ["巷口的石墩子下，藏着一只小蜗牛，总在傍晚才爬出来。"] = "Under the stone pillar at the corner of the alley, a little snail hides, only crawling out at dusk.",
    ["巷口那车本来就是诱饵。现在被破坏，他们肯定以为咱们没跑远。还好我留了一手——快，上这辆！"] = "That carriage at the alley entrance was just a decoy. Now that it's destroyed, they must think we haven't gone far. Good thing I had a backup plan—quick, get in this one!",
    ["巷子入口"] = "Alley Entrance",
    ["巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。"] = "A commotion came from the alley. A large tabby cat cornered a small mouse, and the mouse was shivering in the corner.",
    ["巷子里？昏迷？哦，小阿诺德要回家，所以我送他回去……"] = "In the alley? Unconscious? Oh, little Arnold wanted to go home, so I was taking him back...",
    ["巷尾的邮差，总把信件举高些，怕被路边的狗勾扒拉。"] = "The postman at the end of the alley always holds the letters high, afraid they might be snatched by the dogs on the street.",
    ["市场"] = "Market",
