    ["市场的波动就是这样迷人，您已经完全掌握了。"] = "The volatility of the market is just so fascinating; you have completely mastered it.",
    ["市场真复杂啊……"] = "The market is really complicated...",
    ["市场角落，梧桐树下空无一人的摊位……"] = "In the corner of the market, under the plane tree, an empty stall...",
    ["市政公园"] = "Municipal Park",
    ["市政厅考试培训班宣"] = "City Hall Exam Training Class Promotion",
    ["市政厅颁发的最高荣誉勋章。这枚勋章，不仅是探索的终局，也是一种纪念——你亲手挽回的，让廷根再次伟大的一切。以你自己的方式。"] = "The highest honor medal awarded by the City Hall. This medal is not only the end of exploration but also a commemoration—of everything you personally saved to make Tingen great again. In your own way.",
    ["市政厅颁发的银质勋章。它见证着你走过的每一处地方——铁十字街的热闹、潮湿码头的汽笛、住宅背后的故事。廷根，此刻就在你的脚下。"] = "A silver medal issued by City Hall. It bears witness to every place you have walked—the bustle of Iron Cross Street, the whistles at the damp docks, and the stories behind the residences. Tingen is at your feet right now.",
    ["市政大楼路点"] = "Municipal Building Road Point",
    ["市政广场比平时还热闹，是在举办什么活动吗？"] = "The Municipal Square is even livelier than usual. Is there some event happening?",
