    ["布丁尾巴上也有一撮白毛……可它脸是尖的，布丁的脸是圆的。像布丁，又不是。但它找上我了。"] = "Pudding also had a tuft of white hair on its tail... but its face is pointed, and Pudding's face was round. It looks like Pudding, but it isn't. But it came to me.",
