    ["布兰登先生自己买了一块新黑板，教我力量那天……"] = "Mr. Brandon bought a new blackboard himself, the day he taught me the power...",
    ["布兰登写下最后一笔，黑板出现裂痕，布兰登的身影重新佝偻了下去，他虚弱的声音将你们拉回现实。\n布兰登：不、不……别摧毁我们的希望……"] = "Brandon wrote the final stroke, and cracks appeared on the blackboard. Brandon's figure slumped once more, and his Weakness-filled voice pulled you back to reality. \n Brandon: No, no... don't destroy our Hope...",
    ["布兰登去买黑板"] = "Brandon Goes to Buy a Blackboard",
    ["布兰登向学生们伸出了手，在触碰到彼此的指尖之前，布兰登和学生们的轮廓都消散在了空气之中，化作无形。"] = "Brandon reached out to the students, and before their fingertips touched, the outlines of Brandon and the students dissipated into the air, turning into nothingness.",
