    ["希望"] = "Hope",
    ["希望不用再一天跑十次盥洗室。"] = "I hope I don't have to run to the restroom ten times a day anymore.",
    ["希望之光"] = "Light of Hope",
    ["希望之星在甘泉上空闪耀，指引你走向黎明。跟随这道光芒，最黑的夜即将过去。"] = "The Star of Hope shines above the sweet spring, guiding you toward the dawn. Follow this light; the darkest night is about to pass.",
    ["希望乔纳尔医生能找到治疗的办法……"] = "I hope Dr. Jonar can find a way to treat this...",
    ["希望事件能在下午六点前结束……不然就租一辆马车去接班森！"] = "I hope the incident ends before six in the afternoon... otherwise I'll have to rent a carriage to pick up Benson!",
    ["希望事情不会糟糕到那个地步。"] = "I hope things won't get that bad.",
    ["希望今天也有老爷能雇佣我。"] = "Hope some gentleman will hire me today.",
    ["希望今天能找到些灵感。"] = "I hope to find some Inspiration today.",
    ["希望今晚能睡个好觉……"] = "I hope I can sleep well tonight...",
    ["希望他不会觉得这份礼物幼稚。"] = "I hope he won't think this gift is childish.",
    ["希望他之后一切顺利。"] = "Hope everything goes well for him later.",
    ["希望他们能帮帮博尔吉亚，别再出什么岔子了"] = "I hope they can help Borgia and that nothing else goes wrong.",
    ["希望他能顺利毕业，不用再重做实验数据了。"] = "I hope he can graduate smoothly without having to redo his experimental data.",
    ["希望你一直能这么幸福……"] = "I hope you can always be this happy...",
    ["希望你们至少能在团圆之中，感受到幸福。"] = "I hope you can at least feel happiness in the reunion.",
    ["希望你喜欢"] = "Hope you like it",
    ["希望你在学派之外不要忘记谨慎行事，某些未知存在的恶意可能比你想象得还要浓厚。"] = "I hope you don't forget to act with caution outside the club; the malice of certain Unknown Existences can be far more intense than you imagine.",
    ["希望你带来新的旋律，重新凝聚回响之匣。作为回报，我的酬谢亦将通过回响之匣交付于你。"] = "I hope you bring back new melodies to re-condense the Echo Box. In return, my reward will also be delivered to you through the Echo Box.",
    ["希望你能在温暖的火光旁 与妈妈团聚"] = "I hope you can reunite with your mother by the warm firelight",
    ["希望你能在温暖的火光旁，与妈妈团聚。"] = "I hope you can be reunited with your mother by the warm firelight.",
    ["希望保险公司能多给些钱\r\n用来抚养我的孩子……"] = "I hope the insurance company can give more money\r\nso I can raise my children...",
    ["希望别扔进垃圾桶。"] = "I hope it wasn't thrown in the trash can.",
    ["希望卖出去的每一朵花都能被它们的主人珍惜。"] = "I hope every flower sold can be cherished by its owner.",
    ["希望卡斯伯特女士能早点回来开发新品，我真是等不及了！"] = "I hope Ms. Cuthbert returns soon to develop new products, I really can't wait!",
    ["希望吧，假如他还会回廷根的话。"] = "I hope so, if he ever returns to Tingen.",
    ["希望吧，这次老特勒从墓地里爬出来有点久了。"] = "I hope so; Old Teller has been crawling out of the cemetery for a bit too long this time.",
    ["希望女神保佑我这次作弊别被发现……"] = "Hope the Goddess blesses me so I don't get caught cheating this time...",
    ["希望女神保佑，今晚不会有巡警把我赶走……"] = "I hope the Goddess blesses me, that the patrolman won't chase me away tonight...",
    ["希望女神保佑，我能一夜好梦……"] = "I hope the Goddess blesses me, that I can have a good night's Slumber...",
    ["希望女神能听到。"] = "I hope the Goddess can hear it.",
    ["希望女神能接受可怜信徒的祈求，能最后给予我一次好运。"] = "I hope the Goddess can accept the prayers of a poor believer and grant me good luck one last time.",
    ["希望女神能赐予我智慧和财富，让我能想办法为姐姐找到一双合脚的鞋。"] = "I hope the Goddess can grant me wisdom and wealth so that I can find a way to get my sister a pair of well-fitting shoes.",
    ["希望如此"] = "Hope so",
    ["希望如此。玛莎的家人肯定也期盼着与你早日团聚。"] = "I hope so. Martha's family must also be looking forward to reuniting with you soon.",
    ["希望小查兹多吃点，长高高！"] = "I hope little Chaz eats more and grows tall!",
    ["希望小猫能过得好吧……"] = "Hope the kitten is doing well...",
    ["希望您喝下果子汤后能想起一切。"] = "I hope you can remember everything after drinking the fruit soup.",
    ["希望您能喜欢……"] = "I hope you like it...",
    ["希望我不会溺死在知识的海洋里……"] = "I hope I won't drown in the ocean of knowledge...",
    ["希望我们的基地一直都是最安全的！"] = "I hope our base will always be the safest!",
    ["希望我们的婚礼能美好而顺利……"] = "I hope our wedding will be beautiful and smooth...",
    ["希望我们能在更多人遇害前阻止这场灾祸……愿女神指引我们方向。"] = "I hope we can stop this catastrophe before more people are killed... May the Goddess guide our way.",
    ["希望我的失误不要迎来惩罚。"] = "I hope my mistakes do not bring punishment.",
    ["希望我那女徒弟也能早日回来。"] = "I hope my female apprentice can return soon.",
    ["希望时代的黎明能够早点到来。"] = "I hope the dawn of the era can arrive sooner.",
    ["希望有一天，我能骑车路过贝克兰德每一条街道。 "] = "I hope one day, I can ride a bike through every street in Backlund.",
    ["希望检票能快些。"] = "I hope they check the tickets faster.",
    ["希望比赛结束时，你们都能明白这句话的含义。"] = "I hope that when the competition ends, you will all understand the meaning of this sentence.",
    ["希望生活也像鲜花一样美好！"] = "I hope life is as beautiful as flowers!",
    ["希望能存下多余的钱，给妈妈带一块她喜欢的燕麦面包。"] = "I hope to save some extra money to bring Mom the oat bread she likes.",
    ["希望能有这个荣幸 但还得看邓恩先生的决定"] = "I hope to have the honor, but it still depends on Mr. Dunn's decision.",
    ["希望能有这个荣幸，但还得看邓恩先生的决定。"] = "I hope to have this honor, but it depends on Mr. Dunn's decision.",
    ["希望莱纳老爷不会怪罪我……这都是为了调查。"] = "I hope Mr. Leiner won't blame me... this is all for the investigation.",
    ["希望这个仓库能开出好东西，到时候卖出去应该能还得起斯维因的高利贷了。"] = "I hope this warehouse has something good; if I can sell it, I should be able to pay off Swain's usury.",
    ["希望这周的薪水能按时发下来……"] = "Hope this week's salary arrives on time...",
    ["希望这场表演值得你的打赏。"] = "I hope this performance is worth your tip.",
    ["希望这场雨没有给您带来不便"] = "I hope this rain hasn't caused you any inconvenience.",
    ["希望这次约会没有恼人的事让布拉德利突然离开"] = "I hope there won't be any annoying matters that force Bradley to leave suddenly during this date.",
    ["希望这次见面她还认得出我……"] = "I hope she still recognizes me when we meet...",
    ["希望邓恩队长别等急了。"] = "I hope Captain Dunn isn't waiting impatiently.",
    ["希望那个小女孩可以如愿看到演出。"] = "I hope that little girl can see the performance as she wished.",
    ["希望那只小猫还会出现在附近……"] = "I hope that little kitten will still appear nearby...",
    ["希望重新降临在白银城上。"] = "Hope descended upon the City of Silver again.",
    ["希望队长的发际线\n能越长越低"] = "I hope the Captain's hairline\nkeeps growing lower.",
    ["希望鲜花比球还要多！"] = "I hope there are more flowers than balls!",
    ["希望鸽子被做成菜之后不会变成怨灵吧……"] = "I hope the pigeon doesn't turn into a vengeful spirit after being cooked into a dish...",
    ["希望黛丝能因此脱离危险……命运，这次就站在自救者这边吧。"] = "I hope Daisy can escape danger because of this... Fate, stand on the side of those who save themselves this time.",
