    ["帕里克，他在借的书上<P_Yellow>乱涂乱画</>！"] = "Palik, he is <P_Yellow>scribbling</> on the books he borrowed!",
    ["帕里克，你为什么也要阻止我？"] = "Parick, why are you trying to stop me too?",
