    ["帕里克，你来得挺早。"] = "Parick, you came quite early.",
    ["帕里克，你猜我这周卖掉多少香水？上周的三倍！"] = "Parick, guess how much perfume I sold this week? Three times last week's!",
    ["帕里克，你的笔记本，还有一页信。"] = "Parick, your notebook, and a page of a letter.",
    ["帕里克，太尴尬了，快停下你的节奏！"] = "Parick, it's too embarrassing, stop your rhythm!",
    ["帕里克，快丢掉手套！"] = "Parick, throw away the gloves!",
    ["帕里克：\n\n　　你还好吗？前几天我和菲丽丝一起，回了趟科诺桑小镇。\n布兰登先生还是老样子，在镍币书店教孩子们读书，和当时教我们识字一样。\n　　你最近怎么样？什么时候回来看看？我们很想你。"] = "Parick: \n \n    Are you okay? A few days ago, Phyllis and I went back to Konoson Small Town. \n Mr. Brandon is still the same, teaching children to read at the Nickel Bookstore, just like he taught us to read back then. \n    How are you lately? When will you come back to visit? We miss you very much.",
    ["帕里克？他睡得很沉……"] = "Parick? He's sleeping very soundly...",
    ["帕里克？还有什么事吗？"] = "Parick? Is there anything else?",
