    ["带我去俱乐部"] = "Take me to the club",
    ["带我去看看廷根现在的样子吧，看看这座我们守护的城市。"] = "Take me to see what Tingen looks like now, to see this city we protected.",
    ["带我去看看廷根现在的样子吧，看看这座我们守护的城市。 "] = "Take me to see what Tingen looks like now, to see this city we guard.",
    ["带我看看房子吧"] = "Show me the house",
    ["带我过去，我会给他一个吻。"] = "Take me over there, I'm going to give him a kiss.",
    ["带有半扇拱形玻璃窗的墙体，阳光温柔洒下。"] = "A wall with a half-arched glass window, where sunlight gently spills in.",
    ["带有微弱破除黑暗与恐惧效果的超凡生物血液。"] = "Extraordinary creature blood with a faint effect of breaking through darkness and horror.",
    ["带有忠诚残留的队员，子爵夫人将对你们开启斩杀，接受死亡的洗礼吧！"] = "Teammates with lingering loyalty, the Viscountess will initiate an execution on you; accept the baptism of death!",
    ["带有快速反应的野性脉动，灵性感知极为敏锐。"] = "Possessing a wild pulse of rapid reaction, with extremely keen spiritual perception.",
    ["带有思念·二的队员，根据脚下的循声，找到小子爵来劝说子爵夫人放弃执念！"] = "Teammates with Longing · Two, follow the sound at your feet to find the young Viscount and persuade the Viscountess to give up her obsession!",
    ["带有本效果的技能,在满足使用条件时会为歌颂者回复光能\n回复光能的技能：沐光之击、聚能审判、光明赞歌、逐光挥击、光辉庇佑、光能冲锋"] = "Skills with this effect will restore Light Energy to the Bard when usage conditions are met. \nSkills that restore Light Energy: Light-Bathed Strike, Concentrated Judgment, Hymn of Light, Light-Chasing Swing, Radiant Protection, Light Energy Charge",
    ["带有梦境污染的特质。"] = "Possesses the trait of dream corruption.",
    ["带有深海灵性与魅惑特性的发丝，常用于操控水流或精神诱导。"] = "Hair with deep-sea spirituality and Charm characteristics, often used for controlling water flow or mental Induction.",
    ["带有灵体麻痹效果，触之可迅速阻滞精神流动。"] = "Possessing a spiritual body Paralysis effect, touching it can quickly block mental flow.",
    ["带有灵性的生物？你出现在这里，难道是非凡特性聚合的性质在发挥作用……"] = "A creature with spirituality? You appearing here, could it be that the nature of Beyonder characteristic convergence is at work...",
    ["带有缠绕与连接象征的精油，用于增强人际关系或契约稳定性。"] = "An essential oil with symbols of entanglement and connection, used to strengthen interpersonal relationships or the stability of contracts.",
    ["带有衰败的目标死亡时，会造成一次范围伤害；被命中的敌人若自身也带有衰败，则根据其剩余衰败时间额外受到伤害加深。"] = "When a target with Decay dies, it deals area damage; if hit enemies are also afflicted with Decay, they take additional Vulnerability based on their remaining Decay duration.",
    ["带有装饰花纹的炉灶，在实用之外也增添了几分美观。"] = "A stove with decorative patterns, adding a touch of beauty beyond its practicality.",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><催眠师></>：“控制命中提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An Attack <Highlight>mutated material</> with the entry <Highlight><Hypnotist></>: \"Control hit rate increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><天灾化身></>：“所有技能等级+1，暴击提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An Attack <Highlight>mutated material</> with the entry <Highlight><Disaster Avatar></>: \"All skill levels +1, Crit rate increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><守护者></>：“体质提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "A defensive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Guardian></>: \"Physique increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><恐惧主教></>：“所有技能等级+1，技能增强提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An attack <Highlight> with the entry <Highlight>< Bishop of Horror ></>: \"All skill levels +1, Skill Enhancement increased.\" </> anomalous substance.",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><愚者></>：“使封印物负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害减免提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><The Fool></>: \"Negates Sealed Artifact negative effects, all Skill levels +1, Damage Reduction increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><愚者></>：“使封印物负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害加深提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><The Fool></>: \"Negates Sealed Artifact negative effects, all Skill levels +1, Damage Deepening increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><战争主教></>：“所有技能等级+1，攻击提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An Attack <Highlight>mutated material</> with the entry <Highlight><War Bishop></>: \"All skill levels +1, Attack Boost.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><收割者></>：“力量/智慧提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Reaper></>: \"Strength/Wisdom increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><教唆者></>：“控制闪避提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "A Defensive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Instigator></>: \"Control Dodge increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><无暗者></>：“意志提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "A defensive<Highlight> mutated material</> with the entry <Highlight><The Unshadowed></>: \"Increased Willpower.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><格斗家></>：“格挡提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "A defensive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Fighter></>: \"Block increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><沉默门徒></>：“所有技能等级+1，抗暴击提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Silent Disciple></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Anti-Critical Hit increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><混乱行者></>：“所有技能等级+1，生命提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Defensive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the <Highlight><Chaos Walker></> entry: \"All skill levels +1, Health increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><神明之手></>：“所有技能等级+1，破防提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Hand of God></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Armor Break increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><荒芜主母></>：“所有技能等级+1，防御提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Matriarch of Desolation></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Defense increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><通灵者></>：“穿刺提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An attack <Highlight>mutated material</> with the tag <Highlight><Spirit Medium></>: \"Piercing increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><隐秘之仆></>：“所有技能等级+1，技能抵挡提升。”的防守<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Secret Servant></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Skill Block increased.\"",
    ["带有词条<Highlight><风眷者></>：“敏捷提升。”的攻击<Highlight>异变物质</>。"] = "An attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the entry <Highlight><Wind Blessed></>: \"Agility increased.\"",
