    ["帮助队友分摊受到伤害的40%，你的生命值低于20%不生效。"] = "Help teammates share 40% of the damage they receive; this does not take effect if your Health is below 20%.",
    ["帮助队友分摊受到伤害的50%，你的生命值低于20%时不生效。"] = "Help teammates share 50% of the damage received. Does not take effect when your Health is below 20%.",
