    ["帮我一个小忙吧，在这里颂念那位的尊名，为那场神战的残留画上句点。"] = "Do me a small favor: chant His honorific name here to put an end to the remnants of that divine war.",
    ["帮我个忙，拿着它去街上走一圈，帮我看看大家——特别是那些最挑剔的美食家们——对它是什么反应？"] = "Do me a favor, take this for a walk around the street, and help me see how everyone—especially those most critical foodies—reacts to it?",
    ["帮我个忙，拿着它去街上走一圈，帮我看看大家——特别是那些最挑剔的美食家们——对它是什么反应？ "] = "Do me a favor, take it for a walk on the street, and help me see how everyone—especially those pickiest gourmets—reacts to it?",
    ["帮我打破管家的灵性束缚！"] = "Help me break the butler's spirituality binding!",
    ["帮我收集这里的灵性痕迹碎片，我需要分辨和拼凑出目标真实的行踪。"] = "Help me collect the fragments of spirituality traces here; I need to distinguish and piece together the target's true movements.",
    ["帮我烧了这封信吧，她都收不到了。"] = "Help me burn this letter; she won't be able to receive it anyway.",
    ["帮我转达库克，两个人做菜的确比一个人做菜要更快更稳，味道也的确没受影响。"] = "Tell Cook that two people cooking is indeed faster and more stable than one, and the taste really wasn't affected.",
    ["帮我？为什么，你甚至不认识菲丽丝？"] = "Help me? Why, you don't even know Phyllis?",
