    ["平铺海虾，晒出美味晒出鲜，再炭烤出琥珀色泽，海的味道我知道，琥珀虾干！"] = "Spread out sea shrimp, sun-dried for deliciousness and freshness, then charcoal-grilled to an amber color. I know the taste of the sea—amber dried shrimp!",
