    ["平顶山"] = "Pingdingshan",
    ["平：波澜不惊"] = "Neutral: Calm Waters",
    ["年少的情愫天真纯洁，如春天，如甜美的春天，生机盎然。"] = "Young affection is innocent and pure, like spring, like a sweet spring, full of vitality.",
    ["年幼威廉"] = "Young William",
    ["年轮之期环"] = "Ring of Annual Rings",
    ["年轮刻下的每一圈，都是自然答应的期限。"] = "Every ring carved by the years is a deadline promised by nature.",
    ["年轻……我年轻时来过这里，还遇到三个人。"] = "Young... I came here when I was young and met three people.",
    ["年轻人"] = "Young man",
    ["年轻人不喜欢挨着死气沉沉的墓地，都去大城市寻找机会了。只有我们这帮老骨头还留在这里……"] = "Young people don't like being next to a lifeless cemetery and have all gone to big cities to find opportunities. Only us old bones are left here...",
    ["年轻人不要这么悲观，我这不就带着方法来了？带你去个好地方。"] = "Young man, don't be so pessimistic. Didn't I come here with a solution? Let me take you to a good place.",
    ["年轻人嘛，信仰不同，总有不认输的时候。但说到底，都是在暗处守护廷根的人。"] = "Young people, different faiths, there's always a time when they don't want to admit defeat. But in the end, we are all people guarding Tingen in the shadows.",
    ["年轻人忙，忙是好事……"] = "Young people are busy, being busy is a good thing...",
    ["年轻人，不要犹豫，越犹豫就越紧张，越紧张就越影响魔药的吸收。"] = "Young man, don't hesitate. The more you hesitate, the more nervous you will be, and the more nervous you are, the more it will affect the absorption of the potion.",
    ["年轻人，以前来过河与海教堂吗？"] = "Young man, have you been to the Church of the River and Sea before?",
    ["年轻人，你为什么一直盯着我？"] = "Young man, why do you keep staring at me?",
    ["年轻人，你可不要学那桥上的老头子啊。"] = "Young man, you shouldn't be like that old man on the bridge.",
    ["年轻人，你帮我<P_Yellow>去布告栏撕一张报纸</>来可以吗？我女儿只看爱情小说，根本不信那些新闻……"] = "Young man, could you help me <P_Yellow> tear a newspaper from the bulletin board </> for me? My daughter only reads romance novels and doesn't believe those news reports at all...",
    ["年轻人，你帮我去布告栏撕一张报纸来可以吗？我女儿只看爱情小说，根本不信那些新闻……"] = "Young man, could you help me tear a newspaper from the bulletin board? My daughter only reads romance novels and doesn't believe those news reports at all...",
    ["年轻人，你想加入祷告吗？"] = "Young man, would you like to join the prayer?",
    ["年轻人，你想加入祷告的队伍吗？"] = "Young person, would you like to join the prayer group?",
    ["年轻人，你想知道为什么它叫哈罗德百货吗？"] = "Young man, do you want to know why it's called Harold Department Store?",
    ["年轻人，你是不知道哈罗德百货意味着什么吗？"] = "Young man, do you not know what Harold Department Store means?",
    ["年轻人，你有问题想问？"] = "Young man, do you have questions you want to ask?",
    ["年轻人，你眼睛是不是有问题？什么都看不见。"] = "Young man, is there something wrong with your eyes? You can't see anything.",
    ["年轻人，你走路很稳当，踩雪的声音很踏实。"] = "Young man, your steps are steady. The sound of your footsteps in the snow is reassuring.",
    ["年轻人，你还不错。我就告诉你一个重要信息吧。"] = "Young man, you're not bad. Let me tell you an important piece of information.",
    ["年轻人，你还好吗？"] = "Young man, are you okay?",
    ["年轻人，别挡到我的光。"] = "Young man, don't block my light.",
    ["年轻人，别这么想。生活虽然苦，但总得有点盼头。"] = "Young man, don't think like that. Life is bitter, but there's always something to look forward to.",
    ["年轻人，去证券交易所附近走走看看吧！"] = "Young person, go walk around the stock exchange and see for yourself!",
    ["年轻人，恭喜你，摆脱了过去的阴影，即将迎来充满阳光的新旅程！"] = "Young man, congratulations on shedding the shadows of the past and embarking on a new journey full of sunshine!",
    ["年轻人，我们说这个诗歌啊，就是说，哎呀，我们啊，诗歌它本身就是非常具有……不是说一个诗歌我们一定要怎么样，但是……"] = "Young man, when we talk about this poetry, it means, oh, we, poetry itself is very... it's not that we must do something with a poem, but...",
    ["年轻人，我还要陪戴维一整天，谢谢你陪我到这里。"] = "Young man, I still have to accompany David for the whole day. Thank you for accompanying me here.",
    ["年轻人，或许你听说过南大陆？"] = "Young man, perhaps you've heard of the Southern Continent?",
    ["年轻人，睁大你的眼睛看看，这个地段，这个朝向采光，我们还有公共卫浴，你还能在附近找到比这更好的公寓吗？"] = "Young man, open your eyes and look. This location, this orientation and lighting, we even have public bathrooms. Can you find a better apartment than this nearby?",
    ["年轻人，要来我这买点菜吗，都是我和我家老太太种的。"] = "Young man, would you like to buy some vegetables from me? They were all grown by me and my old lady.",
    ["年轻人，要来我这买点菜吗，都是我和我老伴种的。"] = "Young man, would you like to buy some vegetables from me? My wife and I grew them ourselves.",
    ["年轻人，记住没到手的金镑，永远不是你的。必须捍卫自己的合法收入。"] = "Young man, remember that money not in your hands is never yours. You must defend your legal income.",
    ["年轻人，请等一下。"] = "Young man, please wait a moment.",
    ["年轻人，谢谢你陪我走过这段路。"] = "Young man, thank you for accompanying me on this journey.",
    ["年轻人，趁着好时光，稳稳当当地走吧。"] = "Young man, take advantage of the good times and walk steadily.",
    ["年轻人，身手不错。不过……其实你不必出手的。"] = "Young man, nice moves. However... actually, you didn't have to intervene.",
    ["年轻人，还好吗？"] = "Young man, are you alright?",
    ["年轻女"] = "Young Woman",
    ["年轻女子"] = "Young Woman",
    ["年轻女工的影子在宿舍门前闪过，她敲着门，恳求舍友为她开门，这似乎是谁的记忆段落。"] = "The shadow of a young female worker flashed in front of the dormitory door. She knocked on the door, begging her roommate to open it for her. This seemed to be someone's memory segment.",
    ["年轻威廉"] = "Young William",
    ["年轻就是好啊……"] = "It's great to be young...",
    ["年轻情侣女"] = "Young Couple Girl",
    ["年轻情侣点位"] = "Young Couple Point",
    ["年轻情侣男"] = "Young Couple Male",
    ["年轻时，你也喜欢带我来这种地方。"] = "When you were young, you also liked to bring me to places like this.",
    ["年轻男"] = "Young Man",
    ["年轻男子"] = "Young man",
    ["年轻男性，短发，探险队成员。见过？"] = "Young male, short hair, member of the expedition team. Seen him?",
    ["年轻的{{先生|女士}}，吓到你了吧？我好几天都没敢照镜子，脸色怕是早就像魔鬼一样惨白了！"] = "Young {{Mr.|Ms.}}, I scared you, didn't I? I haven't dared to look in a mirror for days; my face is probably as pale as a devil's by now!",
    ["年轻的值夜者尼尔与钢琴调音师莎莉丝特因相亲结识。从咖啡店的尴尬再会到紫藤花廊的悠闲散步，两颗心逐渐靠近。然而疾病夺走了莎莉丝特的生命，留尼尔独自面对寒冬。许多年过去，老尼尔依旧试图找回那个淡绿色的春天，哪怕付出生命的代价。最终，陈旧的信件与木雕钢琴令春天降临。在那场幻梦中的婚礼，相爱的人从此不再分离。"] = "Young Nighthawk Neil and piano tuner Celeste meet through a blind date. From the awkward reunion at the coffee shop to the leisurely strolls through the wisteria corridor, their hearts gradually draw closer. However, illness takes Celeste's life, leaving Neil to face the winter alone. Many years later, old Neil still tries to find that pale green spring, even at the cost of his life. In the end, old letters and a wooden piano bring spring back. In that illusory wedding, the lovers are never to be separated again.",
    ["年轻的学子们追求知识，汲取进步的时代理念。"] = "Young students pursue knowledge and absorb the progressive ideas of the era.",
    ["年轻的时候冒险惯了，现在年纪大了，不如就当个园丁吧。"] = "I was used to adventuring when I was young, but now that I'm older, I might as well be a gardener.",
    ["年轻的时候守护市民，年纪大了能守护这些传承下来的知识，都挺不错。"] = "Protecting citizens when young, and guarding these inherited pieces of knowledge when older—both are quite good.",
    ["年轻的自己前"] = "Before the Younger Self",
    ["年轻的诗人"] = "Young poet",
    ["年轻的非凡者，\n　　我已到达间海郡，决定暂时在韦尔奇老宅安顿下来。\n　　韦尔奇的离世还萦绕在他父亲身上，与这老家伙一起看着壁炉的火光发呆时，我才终于又有了些时间开始流动的实感。\n　　我路上总是在想，如果当时我没有沉睡，就能帮一把他......但说到底，成为半神的我和其他流浪猫好像也没什么不同，只是活得更久一点。对一只猫来说，这或许有点太久了，我记不清这是第多少次发现朋友离我而去。\n　　无论如何，睡吧，韦尔奇。这次我会记得。谢谢你，年轻的非凡者，这对我意义非凡。"] = "Young Beyonder, \n I have arrived in Midseashire and decided to settle down in the old Welch residence for the time being. \n Welch's passing still weighs heavily on his father. It was only while staring at the fireplace embers with the old man that I finally felt the sensation of time beginning to flow again. \n On the way here, I kept thinking that if I hadn't been asleep, I could have helped him... But in the end, a Demigod like me is no different from any other stray cat, just living a bit longer. For a cat, perhaps it's a bit too long; I can't remember how many times I've watched friends leave me behind. \n Regardless, sleep now, Welch. This time, I will remember. Thank you, young Beyonder, this means a lot to me.",
    ["年轻真好啊。"] = "It's good to be young.",
    ["年轻诗人"] = "Young Poet",
    ["并不会让非凡特性析出的高级仿制品。请放心佩戴。"] = "High-end imitations that will not cause Beyonder characteristic precipitation. Please wear with confidence.",
    ["并不太贵……"] = "It's not too expensive...",
    ["并不是真正的太阳圣徽，也不是真正的变异太阳圣徽，请停止用其窥视永恒烈阳的尝试。"] = "This is not the real Sun Holy Emblem, nor is it a mutated one. Please stop trying to use it to peer at the Eternal Blazing Sun.",
    ["并不是，您觉得廷根哪所大学更好！"] = "Not at all, which university in Tingen do you think is better!",
    ["并不紧张，更不刺激。悬疑惊悚，灵异爱情，你想看的，这里都没有！"] = "Not tense, and definitely not exciting. Suspense, thriller, supernatural romance, everything you want to see is not here!",
    ["并不，亲爱的，珠宝需要更便宜。"] = "Not at all, my dear, jewelry needs to be cheaper.",
    ["并且听到了奇怪的声音？"] = "And you heard strange voices?",
    ["并且，它每隔一段时间就会试图撞门进来！"] = "And it tries to ram the door to get in every once in a while!",
    ["并决意向命运复仇"] = "And is determined to take revenge on fate.",
    ["并持续对敌人发射多发空气弹，造成5次bulletdisc(*id)点魔法伤害并<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方怪物。"] = "Continuously fire multiple Air Bullets at enemies, dealing 5 instances of bulletdisc(*id) magic damage and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy monsters.",
    ["并握在祂温柔的右手里"] = "And hold it in Her gentle right hand",
    ["并没有，我只是在看廷根的风景。"] = "Not at all, I'm just looking at the scenery of Tingen.",
    ["并等间隔增加职业资源"] = "And increase career resources at regular intervals.",
