    ["并肩前行的同伴啊，铭记彼此同行的誓约吧！"] = "Companions walking side by side, remember the Covenant of walking together!",
    ["并肩密语"] = "Side-by-Side Whisper",
    ["并肩执守命运"] = "Guard fate side by side",
    ["并肩而战，是比铁更坚固的誓言。"] = "Fighting side by side is an oath stronger than iron.",
    ["并行技能 SkillID 的释放等级取自 LevelByOtherSkill 的技能等级（可不填）"] = "The release level of the parallel skill SkillID is taken from the skill level of LevelByOtherSkill (can be left blank).",
    ["并非“秘偶熊”，而是秘偶“熊背包”。整个背包都是秘偶，所以不要乱丢哦！"] = "Not a \"marionette bear\", but a marionette \"bear backpack\". The whole backpack is a marionette, so don't throw it around!",
    ["并非全部的神话力量都会凝结为完整的织茧，有些力量不够强，只能成为零散的游丝。"] = "Not all mythical powers condense into complete cocoons; some powers are not strong enough and can only become scattered filaments.",
    ["并非如此"] = "Not really",
    ["并非所有真相都写在卷宗上，有时它藏在受害者的余温里。"] = "Not all truths are written in the files; sometimes, they are hidden in the lingering warmth of the victims.",
    ["并非虚构高级货"] = "Not a Fictional High-End Item",
    ["幸亏{{PlayerName}} 你及时赶到才对！一开始，没有这么多怪物，我们聚在一起寻找逃出去的办法。"] = "It's a good thing you arrived in time, {{PlayerName}}! At first, there weren't this many monsters, and we gathered together to find a way to escape.",
    ["幸亏{{PlayerName}}你及时赶到才对！一开始，没有这么多怪物，我们聚在一起寻找逃出去的办法。"] = "It's thanks to {{PlayerName}} arriving in time! At first, there weren't this many monsters; we gathered together to find a way to escape.",
    ["幸好他已经决定放弃，总算结束了！"] = "Luckily he has decided to give up. It's finally over!",
    ["幸好刚才没有行动。观众……需要继续观察，看到这场戏的真正结局。"] = "Good thing I didn't act just now. A Spectator... needs to continue observing to see the true ending of this play.",
    ["幸好女神没有抛弃我。路过的清洁工伸出了援手，教会的修女又为我介绍了新工作。"] = "Fortunately, the Goddess did not abandon me. A passing cleaner lent a helping hand, and a nun from the church introduced me to a new job.",
    ["幸好我已经向主管请辞，马上就要离开这里了。"] = "Fortunately, I've already resigned to my supervisor and will be leaving here soon.",
    ["幸好我已经跟主管说我不干了，马上就能离开这破地方了。"] = "Fortunately, I've already told the supervisor that I'm quitting. I'll be able to leave this dump soon.",
    ["幸好有您这样比她们更时尚的人存在，不然她们会在门口吵上一整天的。"] = "It's fortunate that someone more fashionable than them exists, otherwise they would have argued at the door all day.",
    ["幸好有材料"] = "Fortunately, there are materials",
    ["幸好没有太多人受影响……"] = "Thankfully, not too many people were affected...",
    ["幸好还有你陪着我…"] = "Luckily I still have you with me...",
    ["幸运"] = "Luck",
    ["幸运之盾"] = "Shield of Luck",
    ["幸运也不代表适合成为值夜者，但他是一个很有天赋的年轻人，聪明、谨慎。"] = "Being lucky doesn't mean being suitable to be a Nighthawk, but he is a very talented young man—smart and cautious.",
    ["幸运值"] = "Luck Value",
    ["幸运值已满，下一次刷新必定出现橙色秘偶"] = "Luck is full, the next refresh will definitely produce an Orange Marionette",
    ["幸运值满时，下次刷新必出橙色秘偶。\n每消耗1根金纺线，获得1点幸运值，最高80点。"] = "When Luck is full, the next refresh is guaranteed to yield an Orange marionette. \n Each Gold Spinning Thread consumed grants 1 point of Luck, up to a maximum of 80 points.",
    ["幸运儿"] = "Lucky One",
    ["幸运儿会重获新生——"] = "The lucky ones will be reborn—",
    ["幸运儿幸运值追踪器"] = "Lucky One Luck Tracker",
