    ["广场、交易所、修炼场等级上限提升至%s级"] = "Square, Exchange, and Training Ground level limits increased to %s",
    ["广场上举办“百里挑蛋”挑战赛，支付1苏勒即可参与，从100枚鸡蛋中找出“幸运蛋”即获10000苏勒奖励。你仔细观察蛋壳的裂纹与斑点，却一无所获。最终依靠灵摆占卜锁定目标，与神秘的画家达文西并列获胜。而这位能记住几千颗鸡蛋每一处细节的画家，却只是一个热爱观察的普通人。"] = "A \"Pick One of a Hundred Eggs\" challenge is being held in the square. Pay 1 Soule to participate, and if you find the \"Lucky Egg\" among the 100, you win a 10,000 Soule prize. You carefully observe the cracks and spots on the shells but find nothing. Finally, you rely on pendulum divination to lock onto the target, tying for the win with the mysterious painter Da Vinci. Yet, this painter, who can remember every detail of thousands of eggs, is just an ordinary person who loves to observe.",
    ["广场上人头攒动，似乎在举办什么热闹的活动。"] = "The square is bustling with people; it seems a lively event is being held.",
    ["广场中央的这尊雕塑是象征廷根精神的大学之父。"] = "This statue in the center of the square is the Father of the University, symbolizing the Tingen spirit.",
