    ["库克"] = "Cook",
    ["库克1"] = "Cook 1",
    ["库克2"] = "Cook 2",
    ["库克3"] = "Cook 3",
    ["库克不对劲，他的气场看起来并不健康，但做菜又极快；身上一点做饭痕迹都没有，却在灶台留下了鼻涕？"] = "Cook is acting strange. His aura doesn't look healthy, yet he cooks extremely fast; there isn't a single trace of cooking on him, yet he left snot on the stove?",
    ["库克不对劲，他的气场看起来并不健康；身上一点做饭痕迹都没有，却在灶台留下了鼻涕？"] = "Cook is not right, his aura doesn't look healthy; there's no trace of cooking on him, yet he left snot on the stove?",
    ["库克似乎有点退缩"] = "Cook seems a bit hesitant",
    ["库克先生！"] = "Mr. Cook!",
    ["库克先生，我是慕名而来，想请您做一道芥末章鱼。"] = "Mr. Cook, I came here by reputation, I would like to ask you to make a mustard octopus.",
    ["库克回来了"] = "Cook is back",
    ["库克将你们请出了厨房……"] = "Cook asked you to leave the kitchen...",
    ["库克开始退缩"] = "Cook starts to shrink back",
    ["库克总会在章鱼完全熟透之前分五次浸泡冰水，这会让肉有种奇妙的韧劲。但这道芥末章鱼……肉的韧劲消失了，肉质也很奇怪……"] = "Cook always soaks the octopus in ice water five times before it is fully cooked, which gives the meat a wonderful chewiness. But this mustard octopus... the chewiness of the meat is gone, and the texture is also very strange...",
    ["库克无意识地跌落在地。"] = "Cook falls to the ground unconsciously.",
    ["库克状态有点……"] = "Cook's state is a bit...",
    ["库克的气场呈现出暗红色，口喉部尤其灰暗……他的健康状况不好，真的能做好这么多菜吗？"] = "Cook's aura appears dark red, especially around his mouth and throat... His health is poor. Can he really cook so many dishes?",
    ["库克肯定有些本事，不然怎么来海岸线餐厅不久就成了主厨呢！"] = "Cook must have some skills, otherwise how could he become the head chef shortly after arriving at the Coastline Restaurant!",
    ["库克非常尊重食物，绝不可能让厨房不干净，可能有什么误会？"] = "Cook respects food very much and would never let the kitchen be unclean. Could there be some misunderstanding?",
    ["库克！“厨王之王”！居然能碰到你本人！"] = "Cook! \"King of Chefs\"! I actually got to meet you in person!",
    ["库克，你等一下。"] = "Cook, wait a moment.",
    ["库克，再做一道芥末“章鱼”！刚刚有客人举报你卫生情况不好，我们解释说那是处理食物的痕迹，客人才同意再给你一次机会的，好好做啊！"] = "Cook, make another mustard \"octopus\"! A customer just reported your poor hygiene. We explained that those were traces from food preparation, and the customer agreed to give you another chance. Do it well!",
    ["库克，好久不见。"] = "Cook, long time no see.",
    ["库克，重新做一道芥末章鱼！马西莫女士的报道如果发出去，我们都得完蛋！拿出你的水平来，只有满足了马西莫的味蕾，她才可能会放过我们！"] = "Cook, make another serving of wasabi octopus! If Ms. Massimo's report gets published, we're finished! Give it your best; only by satisfying Massimo's taste buds will she potentially let us off!",
    ["库克？我是马西莫，门口那篇文章，是我写给你的，你看了吗？"] = "Cook? I'm Massimo. That article at the door, I wrote it for you. Have you read it?",
