    ["库尔斯原本严于律己，但当他告诫所有人不要触碰黛西小姐后，自己却被一个偏执的念头控制——触碰黛西小姐，到底会发生什么？"] = "Cours was originally strict with himself, but after he warned everyone not to touch Miss Daisy, he himself was controlled by a paranoid thought—what would happen if I touched Miss Daisy?",
