    ["应该……没有？"] = "Should... not be?",
    ["应该不存在这个机会。她很恐惧与外界的接触，明明是那么害怕寂寞的人……"] = "That opportunity probably doesn't exist. She is very afraid of contact with the outside world, even though she is such a lonely person...",
    ["应该不是……地上这是，<P_Yellow>破碎的玫瑰花瓣</>？"] = "Probably not... What's this on the ground, <P_Yellow> broken rose petals </>?",
    ["应该不是那样的理由，但现在这些都不重要。"] = "It probably isn't that reason, but none of that matters now.",
    ["应该会来的吧。"] = "They should be coming.",
    ["应该在四个角上洒一些就可以了……"] = "It should be enough to sprinkle some at the four corners...",
    ["应该多招人"] = "Should recruit more people",
    ["应该就在里面了，我看看……"] = "It should be inside. Let me see...",
    ["应该就在里面，进去吧，接下来要更加小心。"] = "He should be inside, let's go in, be more careful from now on.",
    ["应该就在附近…<P_Yellow> 这东西</>又躲到哪里去了？"] = "It should be nearby... <P_Yellow> Where did this </> thing hide again?",
    ["应该就是这个水池。"] = "It should be this fountain.",
    ["应该就是这个水池。它都没有嘴，要怎么说话？"] = "It should be this fountain. It doesn't even have a mouth, so how is it supposed to talk?",
    ["应该就是这里——这些就是魔药材料吗？"] = "This must be the place—are these the potion ingredients?",
    ["应该就是这里。"] = "This should be the place.",
    ["应该就是这里，把2-049重新封印。准备进入仓库，大家小心！"] = "This must be it. Seal 2-049 back up. Prepare to enter the warehouse, everyone be careful!",
    ["应该就这几天了，真是一次漫长又辛苦的出差。"] = "It should be these few days, what a long and hard business trip.",
    ["应该是……"] = "It should be...",
    ["应该是吃喝拉撒都在这里解决了。"] = "It should be that they eat, drink, and relieve themselves all here.",
    ["应该是女神的神国"] = "It should be the Goddess's Kingdom of God",
    ["应该是很远的地方"] = "Should be a very far place",
    ["应该没有走太远，在附近找找看。"] = "They shouldn't have gone too far, let's look around nearby.",
    ["应该没问题。"] = "It should be fine.",
    ["应该经历了很多事吧？"] = "You must have been through a lot, right?",
    ["应该能晋升下个序列了，回黑荆棘看看吧。"] = "I should be able to advance to the next Sequence. Let's go back to Blackthorn to take a look.",
    ["应该藏在了上铺床垫的下面……这几天的生活费。"] = "It should be hidden under the mattress of the upper bunk... my living expenses for the next few days.",
    ["应该走了吧？我还要继续我的计划呢！"] = "They should be gone, right? I still need to continue my plan!",
    ["应该还能再撑几天……"] = "It should be able to hold on for a few more days...",
    ["应该选哪条途径？"] = "Which pathway should I choose?",
    ["应该降低学习门槛"] = "Should lower the learning threshold",
    ["底下还刻着族徽呢。80镑，比那骗子手里的真多了吧？"] = "There's even a family crest engraved on the bottom. 80 pounds, much more authentic than what that scammer had, right?",
