    ["店主也没在？"] = "Is the shopkeeper not there either?",
    ["店主先生，还有其他颜色的裙子吗？"] = "Mr. Shopkeeper, are there any other colors for this dress?",
    ["店主又去打猎……我是说去进货了，她说这次要去一个什么花田？哎，记不清了！"] = "The shopkeeper went hunting again... I mean, went to restock. She said she was going to some flower field this time? Sigh, I can't remember!",
    ["店主复刻的皇家柠檬布丁，少了点工业糖精的齁甜，多了份手工的细腻。"] = "The shopkeeper's recreation of royal lemon pudding, with less of the cloying sweetness of industrial sugar and more of the delicacy of handmade work.",
    ["店主外出卖伞，今天停止营业！\n半路碰见下雨，可以进来躲躲。\n另：如果实在想买，到火车站大门口找我。"] = "The shopkeeper is out selling umbrellas, closed today!\nIf you get caught in the rain on your way, feel free to come in and hide.\nAlso: If you really want to buy one, find me at the main entrance of the train station.",
    ["店主是只鸽子？"] = "The shopkeeper is a pigeon?",
    ["店主说知道这盆花叫什么对我不好，那我就当它是黑色郁金香好了！ "] = "The shopkeeper said it's not good for me to know what this pot of flowers is called, so I'll just pretend it's a black tulip!",
    ["店主雇佣我们装修，这里不开业。"] = "The owner hired us to renovate; we aren't open for business here.",
