    ["店里只卖新表，我要的是遗物——死人身上的表。"] = "The shop only sells new watches, I want relics—watches from dead people.",
    ["店里怎么有这么多人？进去看看。"] = "Why are there so many people in the shop? Let's go in and see.",
    ["店里的东西随便用，有什么需要就尽管找我。"] = "Use whatever you need in the shop, just let me know if you need anything.",
    ["店里的气味有问题，我一进店就忍不住想买！"] = "There's something wrong with the scent in the shop, I couldn't help but buy it the moment I walked in!",
    ["店里的清醒梦，能让我忘记自己还在呼吸——这次我要买十瓶！不……一百瓶！"] = "The Lucid Dream in the shop lets me forget that I'm still breathing—this time I'm buying ten bottles! No... one hundred bottles!",
