    ["廷"] = "Tingen",
    ["廷、廷根市老实人报，1便士一份……"] = "Tingen City Honest Newspaper, 1 penny a copy……",
    ["廷根"] = "Tingen",
    ["廷根\"交换生活\"计划第一期：首富之子与街头艺人！"] = "Tingen 'Life Exchange' Program Phase 1: The son of the richest man and the street performer!",
    ["廷根-俱乐部"] = "Tingen - Club",
    ["廷根·第七章开头用"] = "Tingen - Used for Chapter 7 Opening",
    ["廷根“交换生活”计划第一期：首富之子与街头艺人！"] = "Tingen 'Life Swap' Program Phase 1: The son of the richest man and the street performer!",
    ["廷根……"] = "Tingen...",
    ["廷根……廷根只是一座大学之城，没有希望，也没有爱。"] = "Tingen... Tingen is just a university city, with no hope and no love.",
    ["廷根……您会跟我一起去吗？"] = "Tingen... will you go with me?",
    ["廷根一角"] = "A Corner of Tingen",
    ["廷根下水道"] = "Tingen Sewers",
    ["廷根下街传来虚弱呼喊，女孩珍妮向路人寻求一根火柴，但人们却对她视而不见。你买来火柴后，珍妮欣喜不已。划亮火柴后，你在火光中看见珍妮的渴望之物：舒适的衣物、丰盛的菜肴和死去的妈妈。回到现实，路人称你一直自言自语，透露珍妮早已饿死街头。原来珍妮是亡魂，那火光中的一切不过是幻象。"] = "A weak cry comes from Lower Street in Tingen; a girl named Jenny asks passersby for a match, but people turn a blind eye to her. After you buy her a match, Jenny is overjoyed. After lighting the match, you see in the firelight what Jenny longs for: comfortable clothes, a sumptuous meal, and her deceased mother. Back in reality, passersby say you have been talking to yourself, revealing that Jenny died of starvation on the street long ago. It turns out Jenny is a ghost, and everything in the firelight was just an illusion.",
    ["廷根不会有比我们更时尚的人了！"] = "There won't be anyone more fashionable than us in Tingen!",
    ["廷根东侧只有些大学而已！……难道在那？"] = "There are only some universities on the east side of Tingen! ...Could it be there?",
    ["廷根东北角氛围-肉摊"] = "Tingen Northeast Corner Atmosphere - Meat Stall",
    ["廷根东区氛围-墙头马修特"] = "Tingen East District Atmosphere - Wall-Sitting Matthew",
    ["廷根东区氛围-演员SD"] = "Tingen East District Atmosphere - Actor SD",
    ["廷根东站特产文化产品"] = "Tingen East Station specialty cultural product",
    ["廷根东站特产精密仪器"] = "Tingen East Station specialty precision instruments",
    ["廷根东站特产高档酒"] = "High-end Liquor, Specialty of Tingen East Station",
    ["廷根中央广场"] = "Tingen Central Plaza",
    ["廷根中央广场氛围"] = "Tingen Central Square Atmosphere",
    ["廷根中央广场，金币如雨。接住馈赠，避开陷阱，资本的诱惑，从不免费。"] = "Tingen Central Plaza, gold coins like rain. Catch the gifts, avoid the traps; the temptation of capital is never free.",
    ["廷根中年"] = "Tingen Middle-Aged Man",
    ["廷根中年 - 灵体"] = "Tingen Middle-Aged Man - Spirit Body",
    ["廷根之巅"] = "Peak of Tingen",
    ["廷根之星"] = "Star of Tingen",
    ["廷根也被称为“大学之城”，自从王国推行雇员考试之后，居住和旅游观光的人是越来越多了。"] = "Tingen is also known as the 'City of Universities.' Since the kingdom implemented the employee examinations, the number of people living here and visiting for tourism has been increasing.",
    ["廷根交通噩梦"] = "Tingen Traffic Nightmare",
    ["廷根人喜欢在日常对话中加入“鲁恩式幽默”的元素，某只具有非凡能力的小猫正在想办法收集这些对话。去廷根的铁十字街找找这只小猫吧！"] = "Tingen people like to add elements of \"Loen-style humor\" to their daily conversations, and a certain kitten with extraordinary abilities is trying to collect these conversations. Go to Iron Cross Street in Tingen and find this kitten!",
    ["廷根人的骄傲，学子们的守护者，孩子们的崇拜对象！"] = "The pride of Tingen, the guardian of students, the object of worship for children!",
    ["廷根人都认识的东西，知识雕塑的纪念品。"] = "Something everyone in Tingen knows: a souvenir of the Sculpture of Knowledge.",
    ["廷根代罚者队长"] = "Captain of the Tingen Mandated Punishers",
    ["廷根似乎笼罩在一百多年前的时代浪潮中，到处都是罗塞尔的报道和信息。"] = "Tingen seems to be shrouded in the tides of an era from over a hundred years ago, with reports and information about Roselle everywhere.",
    ["廷根位于鲁恩王国北方，属于阿霍瓦郡。"] = "Tingen is located in the north of the Loen Kingdom, belonging to Awwa County.",
    ["廷根值夜者小队队长"] = "Captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad",
    ["廷根值夜者队长"] = "Captain of the Tingen Nighthawks",
    ["廷根偶遇"] = "Tingen Encounter",
    ["廷根入口1"] = "Tingen entrance 1",
    ["廷根入口2"] = "Tingen Entrance 2",
    ["廷根全景\n镜头拉升，展示廷根全景。\n场景特效字：鲁恩王国 廷根市"] = "Tingen Panorama \nThe camera zooms out to show the panorama of Tingen. \nScene effect text: Loen Kingdom, Tingen City",
    ["廷根公寓"] = "Tingen Apartment",
    ["廷根公爵护卫"] = "Tingen Duke Guard",
    ["廷根再度面临危机，值夜者将使用封印物筑起最后的壁垒。"] = "Tingen faces crisis once again; the Nighthawks will use Sealed Artifacts to build the final barrier.",
    ["廷根再次伟大！"] = "Make Tingen Great Again!",
    ["廷根出现一位传奇送货员——“闪电莉莉”，速度快得超乎常理，半小时内送达市内任何角落。她用学徒途径的短距离传送能力默默帮助市民，却因善良中了黑帮圈套——一封加急文件将她引向猎杀学徒非凡者的陷阱。你出手相助后，莉莉的野生非凡者身份暴露，但她守护他人的初心打动了你们。你们选择不带走她，让她继续奔跑在廷根街头——莉莉守护市民，而你们守护闪电莉莉。"] = "A legendary delivery person appears in Tingen—'Lightning Lily', whose speed is beyond reason, delivering to any corner of the city within half an hour. She uses the Apprentice pathway's short-range teleportation ability to silently help citizens, but because of her kindness, she falls into a gang trap—an urgent document leads her into a trap set to hunt Apprentice Beyonders. After you help her, Lily's status as a wild Beyonder is exposed, but her original intention of protecting others moves you. You choose not to take her away and let her continue running on the streets of Tingen—Lily protects the citizens, and you protect Lightning Lily.",
    ["廷根出现一位传奇送货员——闪电莉莉，速度快到难以想象！"] = "A legendary delivery person has appeared in Tingen—Lightning Lily, with unimaginably fast speed!",
    ["廷根出现大量有关“罗塞尔大帝”的异常知识，造成了污染。廷根警察局向值夜者小队转交了部分异常案件。"] = "A large amount of abnormal knowledge regarding \"Emperor Roselle\" appeared in Tingen, causing corruption. The Tingen Police Department transferred some of the abnormal cases to the Nighthawks squad.",
    ["廷根出现失控非凡者，协同值夜者，在疯狂彻底降临前解决危机！"] = "A Beyonder has lost control in Tingen. Coordinate with the Nighthawks and resolve the crisis before madness descends completely!",
    ["廷根制造局推出的首款硬顶车，第一次让乘客不用在雨雾中带伞乘车。"] = "The first hard-top vehicle launched by the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau, allowing passengers to ride without needing an umbrella in rain or fog for the first time.",
    ["廷根制造局生产的第一辆四轮车，是这座城市第一次听见机械代替马蹄的声音。"] = "The first four-wheeled vehicle produced by the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau; it was the first time this city heard the sound of machinery replacing horse hooves.",
    ["廷根制造局的代表作，把实用与体面装进了同一辆车，也让廷根的名字传遍鲁恩。"] = "A masterpiece of the Tingen Manufacturing Bureau, packing practicality and decency into one vehicle, and spreading the name of Tingen throughout Loen.",
    ["廷根剧院海报"] = "Tingen Theater Poster",
    ["廷根劳工阶层住房改善协会"] = "Tingen Labor Class Housing Improvement Association",
    ["廷根北区"] = "Tingen North District",
    ["廷根北区-市政厅-机械失灵"] = "Tingen North District - City Hall - Mechanical Failure",
    ["廷根医院值班表"] = "Tingen Hospital Duty Roster",
    ["廷根医院管理办公室"] = "Tingen Hospital Management Office.",
    ["廷根卫生合作公司宣"] = "Tingen Hygiene Cooperative announcement",
    ["廷根印象"] = "Tingen Impressions",
    ["廷根危机报告"] = "Tingen Crisis Report",
    ["廷根厂际竞速"] = "Tingen Inter-factory Racing",
    ["廷根号称“大学之城”，其中的廷根大学、霍伊大学是鲁恩知名高校。"] = "Tingen is known as the 'City of Universities,' with Tingen University and Hoy University being well-known higher education institutions in Loen.",
    ["廷根呢绒换季打折"] = "Tingen woolen seasonal discount",
    ["廷根商会负责人"] = "Tingen Chamber of Commerce Representative",
    ["廷根图书馆附近有扇很隐蔽的窗户......敲窗说<P_Yellow>知识指引我至此</>，听说卖家是个老头。"] = "There is a very hidden window near the Tingen Library... Knock on the window and say <P_Yellow>Knowledge guided me here</>. I heard the seller is an old man.",
    ["廷根地下黑市劫案打破了近几个月来的脆弱平衡，失控的灵性材料若流入市井，将孕育新的疯狂。黑荆棘安保公司派遣出一批非凡者参与调查。你们必须在痕迹被雨水冲刷殆尽前，循着危险的灵性残留，踏上追捕犯人的道路。"] = "The robbery at the Tingen underground black market has broken the fragile balance of the past few months. If the out-of-control spiritual materials flow into the streets, they will breed new madness. Blackthorn Security Company has dispatched a group of Beyonders to participate in the investigation. You must follow the dangerous spiritual residues before the traces are washed away by the rain and embark on the path of hunting down the criminals.",
    ["廷根地区探索度达到150"] = "Tingen regional exploration progress reaches 150",
    ["廷根地区秩序世界完成度达到1000"] = "Reach 1000 completion in the Tingen Order World",
    ["廷根地区秩序世界完成度达到1100"] = "Reach 1100 completion in the Tingen Order World",
    ["廷根地区秩序世界完成度达到1200"] = "Reach 1200 completion in the Tingen Order World",
    ["廷根地区秩序世界完成度达到200"] = "Reach 200 completion in the Tingen Order World",
