    ["廷根壹号"] = "Tingen Number One",
    ["廷根大剧院"] = "Tingen Grand Theater.",
    ["廷根大剧院前人声鼎沸，人们在讨论即将上演的戏剧《伯爵归来》，去看看吧。"] = "The Tingen Grand Theater is bustling with people discussing the upcoming play, \"The Earl's Return.\" Let's go take a look.",
    ["廷根大剧院宣传册"] = "Tingen Grand Theater Brochure",
    ["廷根大剧院新剧公演"] = "Tingen Grand Theater New Play Premiere",
    ["廷根大剧院的优惠通告"] = "Tingen Grand Theater Discount Notice",
    ["廷根大剧院的供货服装店，质量款式包您满意！"] = "The clothing store that supplies Tingen Grand Theater, we guarantee you'll be satisfied with the quality and style!",
    ["廷根大学"] = "Tingen University",
    ["廷根大学区"] = "Tingen University District",
    ["廷根大学城"] = "Tingen University Town",
    ["廷根大学教员"] = "Tingen University faculty",
    ["廷根大学是否会录取我。应该最近几天就会来邮件了，我根本不敢呆在家里！"] = "Whether Tingen University will admit me. The email should arrive in the next few days; I don't dare to stay at home at all!",
    ["廷根大学的讲师面试就在今天，虽然已经决定加入值夜者，但还是要去一趟学校，取消面试。"] = "The interview for a lecturer at Tingen University is today. Although I have decided to join the Nighthawks, I still need to go to the university to cancel the interview.",
    ["廷根大学行政办公室"] = "Tingen University Administrative Office",
    ["廷根大学？那可是我们最大的对手！"] = "Tingen University? That's our biggest rival!",
    ["廷根大桥"] = "Tingen Bridge",
    ["廷根好市民"] = "Good Citizen of Tingen",
    ["廷根守卫"] = "Tingen Guard",
    ["廷根守墓人"] = "Tingen Gravekeeper",
    ["廷根守护者"] = "Tingen Guardian",
    ["廷根富人区"] = "Tingen Rich District",
    ["廷根对你来说还太陌生，黑荆棘是你暂时的避风港。"] = "Tingen is still too strange to you, Blackthorn is your temporary safe haven.",
    ["廷根小报"] = "Tingen Gazette",
    ["廷根小，小到藏不住秘密，也小到……走几步就能见到想见的人。"] = "Tingen is small—small enough that secrets can't be hidden, and small enough that... you can see the people you want to see just by walking a few steps.",
    ["廷根少年 - 灵体"] = "Tingen Youth - Spirit Body",
    ["廷根居民"] = "Tingen resident",
    ["廷根居民--肖德太太"] = "Tingen Resident - Mrs. Shaud",
    ["廷根工人区，七岁的伊琳、父亲、母亲上场。"] = "Tingen Worker District, seven-year-old Irene, father, and mother enter the scene.",
    ["廷根工厂"] = "Tingen Factory",
    ["廷根工厂区"] = "Tingen Factory District",
    ["廷根工厂区氛围"] = "Tingen Factory District Atmosphere",
    ["廷根工厂区特产"] = "Tingen Factory District Specialty",
    ["廷根工厂码头氛围-水手"] = "Tingen Factory Wharf Atmosphere - Sailor",
    ["廷根市不需要那么多音乐家……"] = "Tingen doesn't need that many musicians...",
    ["廷根市位于鲁恩王国北方，属于阿霍瓦郡，这里有贯穿城市的、诗人们歌颂的霍伊河，也有北区静谧庄严的正神教堂与南区热闹喧哗的码头市场。"] = "Tingen City is located in the north of the Loen Kingdom, belonging to Awwa County. Here, there is the Hoy River that runs through the city and is praised by poets, as well as the quiet and solemn Orthodox Church in the North District and the bustling and noisy dock market in the South District.",
    ["廷根市值夜者小队现任队长。"] = "Current captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad.",
    ["廷根市值夜者小队资深队员，负责神秘学资料管理与仪式指导。因长期试图通过禁忌仪式复活未婚妻而失控成为怪物，最终由队长邓恩结束了他的生命。"] = "A veteran member of the Tingen Nighthawks squad, responsible for occult document management and ritual guidance. Because he had long been trying to resurrect his fiancée through forbidden rituals, he lost control and became a monster, ultimately having his life ended by Captain Dunn.",
    ["廷根市全景\n雨沥沥落下，报时的钟声回荡着。"] = "Panoramic view of Tingen City \n The rain falls steadily, and the tolling of the clock echoes.",
    ["廷根市图书馆"] = "Tingen City Library.",
    ["廷根市外的一块静谧之地，不知为何总有种熟悉的感觉。"] = "A quiet place outside Tingen City; for some reason, there is always a sense of familiarity.",
    ["廷根市改善住房公司"] = "Tingen City Housing Improvement Company",
    ["廷根市济贫院"] = "Tingen Poorhouse",
    ["廷根市的值夜者们死后大多会葬在一起，就在墓园的中心。"] = "Most Nighthawks in Tingen are buried together after they die, right in the center of the cemetery.",
    ["廷根市老实人十字报纸"] = "Tingen Honest Man's Cross Gazette",
    ["廷根市老实人报"] = "Tingen Honest Newspaper",
    ["廷根市自6月起陆续发生多起市民失踪事件， 部分市民曾参与五月庄园的高薪短工招募。"] = "Since June, multiple missing person cases have occurred in Tingen City, and some citizens had participated in the high-wage temporary worker recruitment at May Manor.",
    ["廷根市西北方向，半日马车可达的荒丘上，拉姆德古堡静静伫立。"] = "On the barren hills half a day's carriage ride northwest of Tingen, Lamud Castle stands quietly.",
    ["廷根市议员"] = "Tingen City Councilor",
    ["廷根市议员选举公告"] = "Tingen City Council Election Notice",
    ["廷根市设定为工业革命初期的北大陆城市，其隶属于鲁恩王国阿霍瓦郡"] = "Tingen is set as a Northern Continent city during the early Industrial Revolution, belonging to Ahoava County of the Loen Kingdom.",
    ["廷根市贝克西街32号"] = "32 Baker Street, Tingen",
    ["廷根市香槟街57号"] = "57 Champagne Street, Tingen",
    ["廷根广场"] = "Tingen Square",
    ["廷根广场举行的“神降”仪式正在请求“愚者”先生的注视，前往协助，贡献出自己的信仰之力，或许也能收获好运。"] = "The \"Divine Descent\" ritual held in Tingen Square is requesting the gaze of Mr. Fool. Go assist and contribute your power of faith; perhaps you'll reap good fortune.",
    ["廷根广场举行的“神降”仪式正在请求黑夜女神的注视，前往协助，贡献出自己的信仰之力，或许也能收获好运。"] = "The \"Divine Descent\" ritual held in Tingen Square is requesting the gaze of the Evernight Goddess. Go assist and contribute your power of faith; perhaps you'll reap good fortune.",
    ["廷根建筑师最爱设计的喷泉，经典，划算，所有人都会认可。"] = "The fountain most loved by Tingen architects; classic, cost-effective, and everyone will approve of it.",
    ["廷根异常案件"] = "Tingen anomaly cases",
    ["廷根总是下雨……"] = "It's always raining in Tingen...",
    ["廷根房价最便宜的在西区，铁十字街附近有一些公寓，如果你能接受挑剔的房东的话，或许可以看看弗兰奇公寓。"] = "The cheapest housing in Tingen is in the West District. There are some apartments near Iron Cross Street. If you can accept a picky landlord, perhaps you can check out Frankie Apartment.",
    ["廷根才不可能，不然我们肯定知道——我想起来了，萨拉姐姐说过，这和王子殿下有关！王子好像叫……埃德披萨？"] = "Tingen is impossible, otherwise we would definitely know—I remember now, Sister Sarah said this has something to do with His Highness the Prince! The prince seems to be called... Ede-pizza?",
    ["廷根技术学校蒸汽与机械系"] = "Tingen Technical School, Steam and Machinery Department",
    ["廷根报刊"] = "Tingen Newspaper",
    ["廷根探秘者"] = "Tingen Explorer",
    ["廷根探索度奖励"] = "Tingen exploration reward",
    ["廷根探索度达到100%奖励"] = "Reward for reaching 100% exploration in Tingen",
    ["廷根探索度达到60%后解锁。"] = "Unlocked after reaching 60% exploration in Tingen.",
    ["廷根教堂被占用，无法赠礼"] = "Tingen Church is occupied, cannot give gifts.",
    ["廷根新“打卡”文化"] = "New Tingen \"check-in\" culture",
    ["廷根旅游，就选特好玩旅店！\n\n店内特供廷根旅行指南\n免费看中央广场精彩马戏表演\n凭旅店消费享受美味餐馆八折优惠！\n\n另：特好玩旅店同样欢迎口袋拮据的旅行家们，\n只要您愿意付出一些时间或能力。\n\n有意者请前往：\n学院大道西侧，廷根图书馆对面“特好玩旅店”！"] = "For Tingen travel, choose the Super Fun Hotel! \n\n We provide a complimentary Tingen Travel Guide at the hotel. \n Watch the spectacular circus performance at Central Plaza for free. \n Enjoy a delicious meal at our restaurant and pay eight-tenths of the regular price with your hotel receipt! \n\n Additionally, the Super Fun Hotel also welcomes travelers on a budget, \n provided you are willing to offer some of your time or skills. \n\n Those interested, please head to: \n The Super Fun Hotel, located on the west side of College Avenue, opposite the Tingen Library!",
    ["廷根日报"] = "Tingen Daily",
    ["廷根日报，新闻早知道！"] = "Tingen Daily, get the news early!",
    ["廷根旧梦"] = "Tingen Dreams",
    ["廷根时光"] = "Tingen Times",
    ["廷根时尚协会"] = "Tingen Fashion Association",
    ["廷根时尚协会？"] = "Tingen Fashion Association?",
    ["廷根是大学之都，霍伊大学更是其中的佼佼者，您在历史系的生活，一定过得很愉快。"] = "Tingen is a city of universities, and Hoy University is the best among them. Your life in the history department must have been very pleasant.",
    ["廷根晚安"] = "Goodnight, Tingen",
    ["廷根晨报"] = "Tingen Morning Post",
    ["廷根最好冰淇淋！"] = "The best ice cream in Tingen!",
    ["廷根最好冰淇淋！口感绝佳，细腻爽滑！"] = "The best ice cream in Tingen! Excellent taste, delicate and smooth!",
    ["廷根最虔诚的祈祷，发生在街角那间盥洗室。"] = "The most devout prayer in Tingen takes place in the washroom at the street corner.",
    ["廷根本地报社里，《晨报》，《晚报》和《老实人报》这三家发行量最大，我给他们都投了稿。"] = "In Tingen, the local newspapers, the \"Morning Post,\" \"Evening Post,\" and \"Honest Man,\" have the largest circulation. I've submitted articles to all of them.",
    ["廷根机械坊走下的第一辆蒸汽座驾，是这座城市第一次听见机械代替马蹄的声音。它不快，也不华丽，但廷根所有驰骋街头的座驾，都是它的后辈"] = "The first steam vehicle to roll out of the Tingen mechanical workshop was the first time the city heard the sound of machinery replacing horse hooves. It is neither fast nor flashy, but every vehicle galloping through the streets of Tingen is its descendant.",
    ["廷根来的亚瑟？我这次来拉姆德，就是寻找廷根的失踪工人亚瑟！"] = "Arthur from Tingen? I came to Lamud this time specifically to find the missing worker from Tingen, Arthur!",
    ["廷根正在酝酿危机，这种感觉很不好。"] = "A crisis is brewing in Tingen, and this feeling is very bad.",
    ["廷根正文最廷根正文最廷正文多廷廷根正文最根正文最廷根正文最多字符正文多字符正文最多字符正文最多最多字符正文最多最多字正文最多最多字符正文最多最多字符正文最多126字符正文最多最多字符正文最多最多字符正文最多126字符正文9最多字符正文最多最多字符<HighLight>最多126</>"] = "Tingen text max Tingen text max Tingen text more Tingen Tingen text max Tingen text max Tingen text max characters text more characters text max characters text max max characters text max max characters text max max characters text max max characters text max 126 characters text max max characters text max max characters text max 126 characters text 9 max characters text max max characters <HighLight>max 126</>",
