    ["廷根火车"] = "Tingen train",
    ["廷根火车站"] = "Tingen Train Station",
    ["廷根火车站好像有一位惆怅的旅客……不知道是为了什么，去看看吧。"] = "There seems to be a melancholy traveler at the Tingen train station... I wonder what for. Let's go take a look.",
    ["廷根火车站正发生着令人欣喜的改变……"] = "Tingen Train Station is undergoing some delightful changes...",
