    ["廷根灵跃争锋"] = "Tingen Leap of Spirituality Clash",
    ["廷根灾难、献祭案、堕落造物主、魔女教派……谁能操控这么多事件和势力？"] = "The Tingen disaster, the sacrifice cases, the True Creator, the Demoness Sect... who could control so many events and forces?",
