    ["廷根甜玉米|自烤薄饼|费内波特特质烟熏猪颈肉"] = "Tingen Sweet Corn | Homemade Flatbread | Feynapotter Smoked Pork Neck",
    ["廷根疯人院医生"] = "Doctor at the Tingen Asylum",
    ["廷根百事通。"] = "Tingen know-it-all.",
    ["廷根百态"] = "Life in Tingen",
    ["廷根的"] = "of Tingen",
    ["廷根的中央广场，下起了金雨。有人说是神明的恩赐，有人说是恶魔的诱饵。"] = "Golden rain fell on the Central Plaza of Tingen. Some say it is a gift from the gods, while others say it is a lure from the devil.",
    ["廷根的乞丐都归你管吗？"] = "Are all the beggars in Tingen under your control?",
    ["廷根的大街小巷，都充满着“愚者”先生的往日回忆——欢迎回到那些记忆中的老地方。"] = "The streets and alleys of Tingen are filled with memories of Mr. \"Fool\"—welcome back to those old places in your memories.",
    ["廷根的失踪和献祭等离奇案件，或许和失踪的知识皇冠有关？"] = "Could the bizarre cases of disappearances and sacrifices in Tingen be related to the missing Crown of Knowledge?",
    ["廷根的射击俱乐部位于佐特兰街，有一块区域专属于值夜者。"] = "The shooting club in Tingen is located on Zoutland Street, with an area dedicated to the Nighthawks.",
    ["廷根的将来，该由廷根的人说了算！"] = "The future of Tingen should be decided by the people of Tingen!",
    ["廷根的废弃监狱藏着一些不可告人的秘密，前往调查并逃离出来！"] = "The abandoned prison in Tingen hides some unspeakable secrets. Go investigate and escape!",
    ["廷根的开始"] = "The beginning in Tingen.",
    ["廷根的拉斐尔墓园深处传来一阵啜泣声，不知发生了什么？"] = "Sobbing sounds are coming from deep within Tingen's Raphael Cemetery; I wonder what happened?",
    ["廷根的救赎"] = "Tingen's Redemption",
    ["廷根的教会……"] = "The churches of Tingen...",
    ["廷根的某位小丑发来邀请——这是一局要命的扑克。"] = "A Clown in Tingen has sent an invitation—this is a deadly game of poker.",
    ["廷根的每一条街，我从小走到大。你们有多苦，我比谁都清楚。"] = "I've walked every street in Tingen since I was a child. I know better than anyone how much you've suffered.",
    ["廷根的济贫院？那里对于孤儿来说，可算不上什么好地方。"] = "Tingen's workhouse? That's hardly a good place for an orphan.",
    ["廷根的空气又干爽了一分。"] = "The air in Tingen is a bit fresher now.",
    ["廷根的街头，偶尔能遇到一只正在收集充满趣味的“鲁恩式幽默”对话的灵猫。"] = "On the streets of Tingen, you can occasionally encounter a spirit cat collecting interesting \"Loen-style humor\" dialogues.",
    ["廷根的霍伊大学、廷根大学都不错，你将来想上哪一所？"] = "Tingen's Hoy University and Tingen University are both good. Which one do you want to attend in the future?",
    ["廷根皮革厂倒闭了！老板甩卖古董！"] = "Tingen Leather Factory has gone bankrupt! The boss is selling off antiques!",
    ["廷根码头最近来了一些性格暴躁的漂亮小猫！"] = "Some grumpy, pretty kittens have recently come to the Tingen docks!",
