    ["廷根老实人！邻里大新闻！"] = "Tingen Honest Reporter! Neighborhood big news!",
    ["廷根老爷"] = "Tingen Gentleman",
    ["廷根舞王"] = "Tingen Dancing King",
    ["廷根街头， 病重的青年艾德请你帮忙买一枚戒指、一束百合，前往书店替他回绝笔友。你购物后来到书店，藏在书柜旁等待，却看见一个糙汉大叔取走了礼物。惊讶之时，警察突然出现，揭露装病行骗是诈骗团伙的惯用伎俩。最讽刺的是，艾德装病许久，入狱体检时才发现自己真的身患重疾。骗子终将落网，而命运从不开玩笑。"] = "On the streets of Tingen, a seriously ill young man named Ed asks you to help him buy a ring and a bouquet of lilies to go to the bookstore and reject a pen pal on his behalf. After shopping, you arrive at the bookstore and hide beside the bookshelf to wait, but you see a rough-looking man take the gifts. Just as you are surprised, the police appear, revealing that faking illness is a common tactic used by fraud gangs. The most ironic thing is that Ed had been faking illness for a long time, and it was only during the prison medical examination that he discovered he was truly suffering from a serious illness. The scammers will eventually be caught, and fate never jokes.",
    ["廷根街头，一个老人慢悠悠地扫着地。两个混混朝他走过去，似乎要找他的麻烦……"] = "On the streets of Tingen, an old man is sweeping the ground slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking to cause him trouble...",
    ["廷根街头，有人正在激烈地争论……"] = "On the streets of Tingen, people are arguing fiercely...",
    ["廷根街角"] = "Tingen Street Corner",
    ["廷根西区"] = "Tingen West District",
    ["廷根西区氛围-叫妈妈酒瓶sequence"] = "Tingen West District Atmosphere - 'Call Mama' Wine Bottle Sequence",
    ["廷根警察局向值夜者小队转交了部分异常案件，作为值夜者小队的新人，你正在展开调查。 "] = "The Tingen Police Department has transferred several anomalous cases to the Nighthawks squad. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks, you are currently conducting an investigation.",
    ["廷根警察的配枪，弹夹已空，它的主人应该经历了一场鏖战。"] = "A Tingen police officer's service weapon, the magazine is empty; its owner must have experienced a fierce battle.",
    ["廷根贵妇氛围——失败可怜"] = "Tingen Noblewoman Atmosphere - Failed and Pitiful",
    ["廷根贵妇氛围——成功破防"] = "Tingen Noblewoman Atmosphere - Successfully Broken",
    ["廷根贵妇氛围——数值鉴定成功"] = "Tingen Noblewoman Atmosphere - Numerical Appraisal Success",
    ["廷根近期出现大量的异常案件，到底与哪件事情有关呢？"] = "Tingen has had a large number of abnormal cases recently. Which one is it related to?",
    ["廷根近期的献祭和邪神案件，都和这个组织的活动有关。"] = "The recent sacrifices and evil god cases in Tingen are all related to the activities of this organization.",
    ["廷根近期离奇案件频发"] = "Bizarre Cases Frequently Occur in Tingen Recently",
    ["廷根那么多地方，偏偏进来这里看看，说明你眼光不错。"] = "With so many places in Tingen, the fact that you chose to come in here shows you have good taste.",
    ["廷根郊外"] = "Tingen Suburbs",
    ["廷根郊外怪事不断"] = "Strange events in Tingen Suburbs",
    ["廷根郊外的遗迹中，邪教徒的仪式唤醒了不该存在之物。夜晚的街道开始出现行尸，值夜者小队奉命调查，却一步步落入亡者的陷阱。逃亡、阻击、守卫、决战——在亚巴顿的亡者国度里，生者唯一的优势，是他们曾见过黎明的样子。"] = "In the ruins on the outskirts of Tingen, the rituals of cultists have awakened things that should not exist. Walking corpses have begun to appear on the streets at night. The Nighthawk squad was ordered to investigate, but they fell into the trap of the dead step by step. Escape, interception, defense, decisive battle—in Abaddon's kingdom of the dead, the only advantage the living have is that they have seen what the dawn looks like.",
    ["廷根铁十字街"] = "Tingen Iron Cross Street",
    ["廷根铁十字街-轮渡码头-谈论落魄堂弟"] = "Tingen Iron Cross Street - Ferry Terminal - Discussing the Down-and-Out Cousin",
    ["廷根铁十字街下街传来虚弱的呼喊，似乎是个女孩的声音。"] = "A weak cry comes from Lower Street on Iron Cross Street in Tingen; it sounds like a girl's voice.",
