    ["开启可以获得一件<Highlight>绑定</>的<Highlight>60装等</>橙色品质套装装备（随机获得冒险或竞技倾向），装备至少带有<Highlight>1条非凡词条</>，有小概率带有<Highlight>2条非凡词条</>。\n该装备箱必定优先开出<Highlight>当前未开放重塑的装备部位</>。"] = "Opening this grants one <Highlight>bound</> <Highlight>Level 60</> orange-quality set piece (randomly adventure or competition oriented). The equipment will have at least <Highlight>1 Beyonder Affix</>, with a small chance of having <Highlight>2 Beyonder Affixes</>.\nThis chest will prioritize dropping <Highlight>equipment slots that are not currently open for Remolding</>.",
