    ["开启可以获得一件<Highlight>绑定</>的<Highlight>68装等</>橙色品质套装装备（随机获得冒险或竞技倾向），装备至少带有<Highlight>1条非凡词条</>，有小概率带有<Highlight>2条非凡词条</>。\n该装备箱必定优先开出<Highlight>当前未开放重塑的装备部位</>。"] = "Opening this grants one <Highlight>bound</> <Highlight>Level 68</> orange-quality set piece (randomly adventure or competition oriented). The equipment will have at least <Highlight>1 Beyonder Affix</>, with a small chance of having <Highlight>2 Beyonder Affixes</>.\nThis chest will prioritize dropping <Highlight>equipment slots that are not currently open for Remolding</>.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>25装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>level 25</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> purple-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Secret Treasures; progress exceeding this will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and will be <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> once the new level's Secret Treasures are unlocked.",
