    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>或<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>level 66</> or <Highlight>level 68</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal (used to upgrade level 64 or higher competition brooches to Mythical quality). You can obtain at most 3 per week; unobtained amounts can be accumulated to the following week.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Open to randomly receive one piece of <Highlight>Item Level 66</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 66</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>或<Highlight>69装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> or <Highlight>Level 69</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>或<Highlight>69装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> or <Highlight>Level 69</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Open to randomly receive one piece of <Highlight>Item Level 68</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>当前开启装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>current level</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol.",
    ["开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>当前开启装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>current level</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol.",
    ["开启同Boss风尚决斗"] = "Start duel with Boss style",
    ["开启同Npc风尚决斗"] = "Start fashion duel with NPC",
    ["开启同Player风尚决斗"] = "Start duel with player fashion",
    ["开启后将自动优化玩家在<Highlight>大型多人对战</>玩法体验，优先保证玩家在体验该玩法时的画面流畅度。\n相关调整仅在玩家进入<Highlight>猎城战</>、<Highlight>高原战</>以及<Highlight>四方联赛</>等大型多人对战玩法时生效，退出玩法后不会对其它设置选项进行改动。"] = "Once enabled, it will automatically optimize the player's experience in <Highlight>Large-scale Multiplayer Battle</> gameplay, prioritizing the smoothness of the visuals when experiencing this gameplay.\nThe relevant adjustments only take effect when the player enters large-scale multiplayer battle modes such as <Highlight>Hunting City War</>, <Highlight>Plateau War</>, and <Highlight>Four-Way League</>. After exiting the gameplay, other setting options will not be changed.",
    ["开启后方的舞台机关"] = "Activate the stage mechanism at the back",
    ["开启后无法主动攻击同俱乐部的非凡者。"] = "When enabled, you cannot actively attack Beyonders from the same Club.",
    ["开启后无法主动攻击绿名非凡者。"] = "When enabled, you cannot actively attack green-named Beyonders.",
    ["开启后无法主动攻击非敌对俱乐部的非凡者。"] = "When enabled, you cannot actively attack Beyonders from non-hostile Clubs.",
    ["开启后有相机虚化效果"] = "Enables camera blur effect when active",
    ["开启后点击地图任意地方即可立即传送到指定位置"] = "After enabling, click anywhere on the map to immediately teleport to the specified location",
    ["开启后视角自动调整"] = "Automatically adjusts perspective when enabled",
    ["开启后视角自动调整到最优自动调整到最优"] = "After enabling, the perspective will automatically adjust to the optimal view, automatically adjust to the optimal view",
    ["开启后高层及屋顶会自动隐藏"] = "Automatically hides upper floors and roofs when enabled",
    ["开启后，10秒内伤害加深提高30%。记录期间你对敌人造成的总伤害，在效果结束时对范围内目标造成一次性伤害，伤害量等于记录总伤害。"] = "After activating, Damage Boost increases by 30% for 10 seconds. Records the total damage you deal to enemies during this period, and upon the effect's end, deals one-time damage to targets within range equal to the total recorded damage.",
    ["开启后，DPS职业候选只会对敌方生效，治疗职业候选只会对友方生效，若关闭则不做限制。"] = "When enabled, DPS class candidates will only take effect on enemies, and Healing class candidates will only take effect on allies. If disabled, there are no restrictions.",
    ["开启后，DPS职业鼠标悬停智能锁敌只会对敌方生效，治疗职业鼠标悬停智能锁敌只会对友方生效，若关闭则不做限制。"] = "When enabled, DPS class mouse-hover smart targeting will only take effect on enemies, and Healing class mouse-hover smart targeting will only take effect on allies. If disabled, there are no restrictions.",
    ["开启后，以下交易相关行为需要进行密码锁的二次确认：交易所道具上架、下架、购买，拍卖出价，可交易道具的消耗，其他任意金镑和苏勒的消耗等。"] = "When enabled, the following trading-related actions require secondary confirmation via a password lock: listing, delisting, or purchasing items on the Exchange, bidding in auctions, consuming tradable items, and any other consumption of Pounds and Soles.",
    ["开启后，以下外观相关行为需要进行密码锁的二次确认：外观染色，神铸改装等。"] = "Once enabled, the following cosmetic-related actions will require secondary confirmation via a password lock: cosmetic dyeing, Divine Forging modifications, etc.",
    ["开启后，以下社交相关行为需要进行密码锁的二次确认：添加好友、删除好友、拉黑玩家、退出俱乐部、退出家族等。"] = "When enabled, the following social-related actions require secondary confirmation via a password lock: adding friends, deleting friends, blocking players, leaving a Club, leaving a Family, etc.",
    ["开启后，以下赠礼相关行为需要进行密码锁的二次确认：商城外观、神眷外观、神降外观的赠送等。"] = "Once enabled, the following gift-related actions will require secondary confirmation via a password lock: gifting of Mall cosmetics, Divine Favor cosmetics, Divine Descent cosmetics, etc.",
    ["开启后，以下道具相关行为需要进行密码锁的二次确认：锁定道具的解除锁定、高品质道具的消耗、分解、兑换、丢弃等。"] = "When enabled, the following item-related actions require secondary confirmation via a password lock: unlocking items, consuming high-quality items, decomposing, exchanging, discarding, etc.",
    ["开启后，场景内的玩家将会显示为同一模型，从而提高战斗流畅度。目前仅在<Highlight>猎城战</>、<Highlight>高原战</>以及<Highlight>四方联赛</>等大型多人对战玩法中可以体验同模效果。"] = "When enabled, players in the scene will be displayed using the same model to improve combat fluidity. Currently, this effect can only be experienced in large-scale multiplayer modes such as <Highlight>City of Dragon Hunting</>, <Highlight>Star Plateau Battle</>, and <Highlight>Four-Way League</>.",
    ["开启后，将鼠标悬停于目标上将会高亮该目标，技能会优先选择该目标作为施法目标。"] = "When enabled, hovering the mouse over a target will highlight it, and skills will prioritize this target as the casting target.",
    ["开启后，技能会优先选择鼠标悬停位置进行释放。"] = "When enabled, skills will prioritize the mouse hover position for casting.",
    ["开启后，放置地板和墙时会自动进入连铺状态"] = "Automatically enters continuous placement mode when placing floors and walls",
    ["开启后，玩家可以感受到角色与场景中的<Highlight>水体</>、<Highlight>雪地</>以及<Highlight>风场</>的形变效果。"] = "Once enabled, players can experience deformation effects on <Highlight> water bodies </>, <Highlight> snow </>, and <Highlight> wind fields </> within the scene.",
    ["开启后，玩家角色的<Highlight>发型</>与<Highlight>服饰</>将表现出拟真的物理效果。"] = "Once enabled, your character's <Highlight>Hairstyle</> and <Highlight>Outfit</> will exhibit realistic physics effects.",
