    ["开启灵视查探异常"] = "Activate Spirit Vision to investigate the anomaly",
    ["开启灵视检查"] = "Activate Spirit Vision to inspect",
    ["开启灵视检查南瓜"] = "Activate Spirit Vision to inspect the pumpkin",
    ["开启灵视检查四周"] = "Activate spirit vision to check surroundings",
    ["开启灵视观察"] = "Activate spirit vision to observe",
    ["开启灵视观察一下……"] = "Open spirit vision to observe...",
    ["开启灵视，寻找周围是否有破局的隐藏因素"] = "Activate spirit vision to look for hidden factors in the surroundings to break the deadlock",
    ["开启灵视，检查一下马桶的异常。"] = "Activate spirit vision to check the anomaly of the toilet.",
    ["开启特效管理器调试日志"] = "Enable effect manager debug log",
    ["开启玩法Trigger"] = "Enable Gameplay Trigger",
    ["开启玩法需队内玩家少于2名"] = "To start the gameplay, there must be fewer than 2 players in the team.",
    ["开启的不是一扇门，而是一个坠落中的世界；踏入的并非房间，而是一片正在死去的星空。"] = "What opens is not a door, but a falling world; what you step into is not a room, but a dying starry sky.",
    ["开启真理之门，以灵魂作等价交换。"] = "Open the Door of Truth, using your soul as an equivalent exchange.",
    ["开启社交弹幕"] = "Enable Social Barrage",
    ["开启秘宝需要的活力不足"] = "Insufficient vitality to open the secret treasure.",
    ["开启移动推进器"] = "Enable movement thruster",
    ["开启窥秘"] = "Activate Secret Peeking",
    ["开启窥秘之眼"] = "Activate Eyes of Mystery Prying",
    ["开启窥秘之眼检查伊琳"] = "Activate Eyes of Mystery Prying to examine Irene",
    ["开启窥秘之眼检查房间"] = "Activate Eyes of Mystery Prying to check the room",
    ["开启窥秘之眼看破假象，以自己为中心造成范围伤害并击退敌人，移除敌方的护盾，造成减疗效果；二段可快速后撤位移。释放后获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Open the Eyes of Mystery Prying to see through illusions, dealing area damage centered on yourself and knocking back enemies, removing enemy shields and applying healing reduction. The second stage allows for a quick backward displacement. Gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) after release.",
    ["开启窥秘之眼观察剧院"] = "Activate Eyes of Mystery Prying to observe the theater",
    ["开启自定义优化项"] = "Enable custom optimization items",
    ["开启自定义优化项 填数字"] = "Enable custom optimization; enter number.",
    ["开启舞台"] = "Open stage",
    ["开启舞台机关"] = "Activate the stage mechanism",
    ["开启获得1个<Highlight>绑定</>的织茧游丝。每周可开启<Highlight>6</>次，未开启的次数将累计至下一周，至多累计至<Highlight>30</>次。\n\n<Highlight>织茧游丝</>：制作神话武器的关键材料。\n\n开启神话铸造仪式时，需要消耗1个<Highlight>神话织茧</>和60个<Highlight>织茧游丝</>，完成仪式后，获得神话武器<Highlight>【隐秘之拥】</>。\n若是缺少<Highlight>神话织茧</>，也可消耗30个<Highlight>织茧游丝</>，铸造武器<Highlight>【夜幕之颂】</>。<Highlight>【夜幕之颂】</>可通过补齐材料进一步铸造为<Highlight>【隐秘之拥】</>。\n随赛季进程，将开放【隐秘之拥】和【夜幕之颂】的装等提升，提升时消耗一定数量的<Highlight>织茧游丝</>。"] = "Opening this grants 1 <Highlight>Bound</> Silk of Cocooning. You can open it <Highlight>6</> times per week. Unused attempts will accumulate to the next week, up to a maximum of <Highlight>30</> times.\n\n<Highlight>Silk of Cocooning</>: A key material for crafting Mythical Weapons.\n\nWhen initiating the Mythical Forging Ritual, it requires 1 <Highlight>Mythical Cocoon</> and 60 <Highlight>Silk of Cocooning</>. Upon completing the ritual, you will obtain the Mythical Weapon <Highlight>【Embrace of Secrecy】</>.\nIf you lack a <Highlight>Mythical Cocoon</>, you can also consume 30 <Highlight>Silk of Cocooning</> to forge the weapon <Highlight>【Ode to Nightfall】</>. <Highlight>【Ode to Nightfall】</> can be further forged into <Highlight>【Embrace of Secrecy】</> by providing the missing materials.\nAs the season progresses, the item level of 【Embrace of Secrecy】 and 【Ode to Nightfall】 can be upgraded, which will consume a certain amount of <Highlight>Silk of Cocooning</>.",
    ["开启获得1个灰雾尘埃。每周可开启3次，未开启的次数将累计至下一周。\n\n铸造神话品质胸针（冒险）的关键材料。以64/66/68装等橙色品质胸针（冒险）为基础，消耗15/25/35个灰雾尘埃，可将胸针铸造为神话品质，并附加神话词条。铸造后可进行还原，退还装备和材料。"] = "Open to obtain 1 Gray Fog Dust. Can be opened 3 times per week; unopened attempts will accumulate to the next week. \n\n Key material for forging Mythical quality brooches (Adventure). Based on orange quality brooches (Adventure) with gear level 64/66/68, consuming 15/25/35 Gray Fog Dust can forge the brooch into Mythical quality and add a Mythical affix. After forging, it can be restored, returning the equipment and materials.",
    ["开启获得1个灰雾晶砾。每周可开启3次，未开启的次数将累计至下一周。\n\n铸造神话品质胸针（竞技）的关键材料。以64/66/68装等橙色品质胸针（竞技）为基础，消耗15/25/35个灰雾晶砾，可将胸针铸造为神话品质，并附加神话词条。铸造后可进行还原，退还装备和材料。"] = "Open to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal. Can be opened 3 times per week; unopened attempts will accumulate to the next week. \n\n Key material for forging Mythical quality brooches (Competition). Based on orange quality brooches (Competition) with gear level 64/66/68, consuming 15/25/35 Gray Fog Crystals can forge the brooch into Mythical quality and add a Mythical affix. After forging, it can be restored, returning the equipment and materials.",
    ["开启获得1个织茧游丝。每周可开启6次，未开启的次数将累计至下一周。\n\n制作神话武器的关键材料。需要消耗1个神话织茧和60个织茧游丝开启仪式，完成仪式后，获得神话武器。"] = "Open to obtain 1 Cocoon Silk. Can be opened 6 times per week; unopened attempts will accumulate to the next week. \n\n Key material for crafting Mythical weapons. You need to consume 1 Mythical Cocoon and 60 Cocoon Silk to start the ritual. After completing the ritual, you will obtain the Mythical weapon.",
