    ["开启铁路大亨需要消耗一定数量的经销许可证，路线等级越高，消耗越多。\n经销许可证每日自动回复2张，最多可存储6张，当持有数量超过上限时，不会进行自动回复。\n可在俱乐部商店获得经销许可证补充，每周恢复4张可购买量。\n经销许可证回复时间：服务器时间每日 %d 点。"] = "Starting a Railway Tycoon session consumes a certain number of Distribution Licenses. The higher the route level, the higher the consumption.\n Distribution Licenses replenish by 2 per day automatically, up to a maximum of 6. If your current holdings exceed the limit, they will not replenish automatically.\n You can obtain additional Distribution Licenses in the Club Shop, with a purchase limit of 4 per week.\n Distribution License replenishment time: %d o'clock daily, server time.",
