    ["开战时使敌方全体防御降低<HighLight>10%</>，持续<HighLight>10</>秒；每回合随机从上一场战斗击杀的敌方棋子中获得<HighLight>1</>个<HighLight>1</>星棋子。"] = "At the start of battle, reduce the Defense of all enemies by <HighLight>10%</> for <HighLight>10</> seconds; each round, randomly obtain <HighLight>1</> <HighLight>1</>-star piece from enemy pieces killed in the previous battle.",
    ["开战时使敌方全体防御降低<HighLight>15%</>，持续<HighLight>15</>秒；每回合随机从上一场战斗击杀的敌方棋子中获得<HighLight>1</>个<HighLight>1</>星棋子。"] = "At the start of battle, reduce the Defense of all enemies by <HighLight>15%</> for <HighLight>15</> seconds; each round, randomly obtain <HighLight>1</> <HighLight>1</>-star piece from enemy pieces killed in the previous battle.",
    ["开战时使敌方全体防御降低<HighLight>30%</>，持续<HighLight>30</>秒；每回合随机从上一场战斗击杀的敌方棋子中获得<HighLight>1</>个<HighLight>1</>星棋子。"] = "At the start of battle, reduce the Defense of all enemies by <HighLight>30%</> for <HighLight>30</> seconds; each round, randomly obtain <HighLight>1</> <HighLight>1</>-star piece from enemy pieces killed in the previous battle.",
    ["开战时，按羁绊人数使敌方全体降低防御；每回合随机从上一场战斗击杀的敌方棋子中获得<HighLight>1</>个<HighLight>1</>星棋子。"] = "At the start of battle, reduce the Defense of all enemies based on the number of kinship members; each round, randomly obtain <HighLight>1</> <HighLight>1</>-star piece from the enemy pieces killed in the previous battle.",
    ["开战状态"] = "Battle Status",
    ["开放其他部件等级上限至1->2级"] = "Open other component level caps from 1->2",
    ["开放其他部件等级上限至2->3级"] = "Open other component level caps from 2->3",
    ["开放报名时，玩法将从俱乐部成员中随机挑选<Highlight>16</>名玩家作为<Highlight>幻象投影</>供参与者使用。所有的参与者使用的投影种类<Highlight>相同</>。\n比赛分为多轮，玩家可以挑选投影投入<Highlight>任意轮次</>参与比赛，已经投入的投影不可<Highlight>重复使用</>。\n当指定的轮次开战时，该轮次的投影将被召唤并<Highlight>自动战斗</>，参与者可以前往俱乐部驻地进行<Highlight>观战</>。"] = "When registration is open, the gameplay will randomly select <Highlight> 16 </> players from club members as <Highlight> phantom projections </> for participants to use. All participants use the <Highlight> same </> types of projections. \n The competition is divided into multiple rounds, and players can choose projections to invest in <Highlight> any round </> to participate in the competition. Once invested, a projection cannot be <Highlight> reused </>. \n When the designated round begins, the projections for that round will be summoned and <Highlight> fight automatically </>, and participants can go to the club residence to <Highlight> watch the battle </>.",
    ["开放报名时，玩法将从帮会成员中随机挑选<Highlight>16</>名玩家作为<Highlight>幻象投影</>供参与者使用。所有的参与者使用的投影种类<Highlight>相同</>。\n比赛分为多轮，玩家可以挑选投影投入<Highlight>任意轮次</>参与比赛，已经投入的投影不可<Highlight>重复使用</>。\n当指定的轮次开战时，该轮次的投影将被召唤并<Highlight>自动战斗</>，参与者可以前往俱乐部驻地进行<Highlight>观战</>。"] = "When registration opens, the activity will randomly select <Highlight> 16 </> players from the guild members as <Highlight> phantom projections </> for participants to use. All participants use the <Highlight> same </> types of projections. \n The competition is divided into multiple rounds. Players can choose projections to commit to <Highlight> any round </> to participate in the competition. Projections that have already been committed cannot be <Highlight> reused </>. \n When the designated round begins, the projections for that round will be summoned and <Highlight> fight automatically </>. Participants can go to the club residence to <Highlight> watch the battle </>.",
