    ["弃牌，今天运气太差。"] = "Fold. My luck is too bad today.",
    ["弄丢了？那就再扣一半。"] = "Lost it? Then deduct another half.",
    ["弄好了？"] = "Done?",
    ["弄得一团乱，最后还得我来收拾。前几天，他还把抽屉里的蜡烛都拿走了……"] = "He makes a mess, and I'm the one who has to clean it up. A few days ago, he even took all the candles from the drawer...",
    ["弄清真相"] = "Find out the truth",
    ["弄臣之谑"] = "Jester's Mockery",
    ["弄臣之谑·污染"] = "Jester's Jest - Corruption",
    ["弈子累计参与4场PVP且当前携带至少1件装备时，永久获得12攻击和12防御。每名弈子限1次。"] = "Pieces permanently gain 12 Attack and 12 Defense after participating in 4 PVP rounds while carrying at least 1 piece of equipment. Limit once per piece.",
    ["弊端是？"] = "What are the downsides?",
