    ["弓骑士"] = "Bow Knight",
    ["引入海纳斯梦境"] = "Introduce Hynas's Dream",
    ["引出伊丽莎白"] = "Bring Out Elizabeth",
    ["引力场2阶段拖拽眩晕"] = "Gravity Field Phase 2 Drag Stun",
    ["引力场中心位置相对光环位置偏移（cm）"] = "Offset of the gravity field center relative to the aura position (cm).",
    ["引力场的作用时长，填0以表格内部的光环时长"] = "Duration of the gravity field; fill in 0 to use the aura duration inside the table.",
    ["引动体内微薄的巨人血脉之力灌注左腿，抬脚后重重践踏地面，直接引发周身地面轻微震动，同时震起漫天尘土，是战士撬动自身巨力、贴合「力融大地」特性的基础能力。"] = "Channel the meager giant bloodline power within into your left leg, lift your foot, and stomp the ground heavily, triggering a slight tremor in the surrounding ground and kicking up dust. This is a basic ability for a Warrior to leverage their giant strength, aligning with the 'Force Melts into the Earth' characteristic.",
    ["引动巨龙吐息，覆盖前方大范围敌人。"] = "Trigger Dragon Breath to cover a wide area of enemies in front.",
    ["引动窥秘人序列赋予的基础信息感知力，牵引周身游离的微末信息流，凝出一张覆有淡微光纹的隐秘纸条。\n使自身获得学识加1。"] = "Draw upon the basic information perception granted by the Mystery Pryer Sequence, pulling in the faint information streams drifting around you to condense a Secret Note covered with faint light patterns. \n Increases your Knowledge by 1.",
    ["引动窥秘灵性举行专属窥秘仪式，伴随一套标准繁复的巫师仪式动作与具象化魔法阵召唤，流程完整、仪式感拉满，是巫师对窥秘仪式流程与形式的极致锤炼，贴合 “重仪轨、研秘理” 的巫师特性。"] = "Invoke your Mystery Pryer spirituality to conduct an exclusive Mystery Ritual, accompanied by a set of standard, complex wizard ritual movements and a materialized magic circle. The process is complete and full of ritualistic flair, representing the wizard's ultimate refinement of the Mystery Ritual's flow and form, fitting the wizard characteristic of \"Emphasizing ritual and studying secret principles.\"",
    ["引动观众序列基础的情绪感知力，在目标周身凝出一枚对应其当日核心心情的色点，以颜色直观呈现情绪状态：\n ▸红为热情\n ▸黄为和平\n ▸白为中立\n ▸灰为郁闷\n ▸黑为悲伤"] = "Invoke the basic emotional perception of the Spectator sequence, condensing a color dot around the target corresponding to their core mood of the day, visually presenting the emotional state with colors: \n ▸ Red for Passion \n ▸ Yellow for Peace \n ▸ White for Neutral \n ▸ Gray for Gloom \n ▸ Black for Sadness.",
    ["引动观众序列的观心灵性施展心理疗愈，将目标的负面 / 中立情绪随机转化为正面情绪，新情绪会以对应色点呈现并持续一段时间，是心理医生 “以观绪之能，行情绪疏导” 的核心能力。"] = "Invoke the mind-observing spirituality of the Spectator sequence to perform Psychotherapy, randomly converting the target's negative/neutral emotions into positive emotions. The new emotion will be presented as a corresponding color dot and last for a period of time. This is the core ability of the Psychologist: 'Using the power of observing emotions to conduct emotional guidance'.",
    ["引动观众序列进阶的观心灵性，对已识别出情绪光谱的目标读取其表层具象想法，是从 “情绪识别” 到 “心言浅探” 的核心进阶，贴合格读心者 “观绪及心，浅探表层念” 的特性。"] = "Invoke the advanced mind-observing spirituality of the Spectator sequence to read the surface concrete thoughts of a target whose emotional spectrum has been identified. This is the core advancement from 'Emotional Recognition' to 'Mind Reading', fitting the characteristic of the Mind Reader: 'Observe emotions and reach the heart, probing the surface layer'.",
    ["引动黄昏巨人血脉之力凝练战姿，将力量轨迹与自身攻击姿态绑定，使下一次攻击时，同步浮现与本体完全一致的厚重攻击残影。"] = "Channel the Dusk Giant bloodline power to condense a battle stance, binding the trajectory of your power to your attack stance, causing a heavy attack phantom shadow identical to your main body to appear simultaneously during your next attack.",
    ["引动黄昏巨人血脉的兵器契合之力，结合武器大师的全械掌控技巧，随机唤出大剑、双剑其一的实体形态，施展出该武器专属的粗犷持械架势，无实际攻击效果，核心是彰显人器相融的掌控力，贴合武器大师 “万兵皆为我用” 的特性。"] = "Channel the weapon-attunement power of the Dusk Giant, combined with the Weapon Master's full-weapon control technique, to randomly summon the physical form of either a greatsword or dual swords. Perform the rugged, weapon-specific stance; while it has no actual attack effect, it serves to manifest the control of 'man and weapon as one,' aligning with the Weapon Master's 'all weapons are for my use' characteristic.",
