    ["弗兰克·李的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Frank Lee, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["弗兰克先生真是太厉害了，居然能研究出公鸡下蛋的方法。"] = "Mr. Frank is truly amazing. He actually managed to research a way to make roosters lay eggs.",
    ["弗兰克先生，在“未来号”上生活是什么感觉？"] = "Mr. Frank, what does it feel like to live on the \"Future\"?",
    ["弗兰克先生，您平时除了研究，还有什么爱好吗？"] = "Mr. Frank, besides research, do you have any other hobbies?",
    ["弗兰克先生，您有没有想过，您的研究可能会带来一些后果？"] = "Mr. Frank, have you ever thought that your research might have some consequences?",
    ["弗兰克先生，您能跟我讲讲您的能力吗？比如“毒素专家”这个称号到底怎么来的？"] = "Mr. Frank, could you tell me about your abilities? For example, how did you get the title of \"Toxin Expert\"?",
    ["弗兰克先生，您觉得嘉德丽雅船长是个什么样的人？"] = "Mr. Frank, what kind of person do you think Captain Cattleya is?",
    ["弗兰克先生，我听说您以前和大地母神教会有过一些……分歧？"] = "Mr. Frank, I heard you once had some... disagreements with the Church of the Earth Mother?",
    ["弗兰克先生，有没有人说过您的想象力太丰富了？"] = "Mr. Frank, has anyone ever told you that your imagination is too rich?",
    ["弗兰克先生，能跟我讲讲您的故事吗？您是怎么成为“未来号”的大副的？"] = "Mr. Frank, can you tell me your story? How did you become the First mate of the 'Future'?",
    ["弗兰克克先生，能跟我讲讲您的故事吗？您是怎么成为“未来号”的大副的？"] = "Mr. Frank, could you tell me your story? How did you become the first mate of the Future?",
