    ["弗兰克在目标敌方位置召唤一个特制蘑菇，蘑菇引爆造成一定范围伤害。"] = "Frank summons a special mushroom at the target enemy's location, which explodes to deal area damage.",
    ["弗兰克庆祝开服"] = "Frank celebrates the server launch",
    ["弗兰克特制蘑菇引爆后留下菌丝区域，处在菌丝区域内持续受到伤害。"] = "After Frank's special mushrooms explode, they leave behind a mycelium area, dealing continuous damage to those within it.",
