    ["弗兰奇先生家的邮筒……"] = "Mr. Franky's mailbox...",
    ["弗兰奇先生很容易被说服，毕竟——"] = "Mr. Franky is easy to persuade, after all—",
    ["弗兰奇先生把我家门给踹开了，让我向女神发誓我不会再找人半夜斗邪恶。可恶！"] = "Mr. Frankie kicked my door open and made me swear to the Goddess that I wouldn't find anyone to fight evil in the middle of the night again. Damn it!",
    ["弗兰奇先生的智商还不如卷毛狒狒，没办法分辨太复杂的事情。"] = "Mr. Frank’s IQ is not even as good as a Curly-Haired Baboon, and he can’t distinguish between too complicated things.",
    ["弗兰奇先生的智商还是要比卷毛狒狒高一点的，如果他状态良好的话。"] = "Mr. Franky's intelligence is still a bit higher than a Curly-Haired Baboon's, if he is in good condition.",
    ["弗兰奇先生精明得很，每一便士都要计较。但好在他……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>智商还不如卷毛狒狒，算不清太复杂的账。"] = "Mr. Frank is very shrewd, counting every penny. But fortunately, he... <P_Heart> (Pauses) </> his intelligence is not even as good as a Curly-Haired Baboon, so he can't calculate overly complex accounts.",
