    ["弗莱会叮嘱我们少放些莴笋，伦纳德不爱吃花椰菜，给邓恩的黑胡椒酱汁最好浓郁一点。"] = "Frye will remind us to use less lettuce, Leonard doesn't like broccoli, and the black pepper sauce for Dunn should be richer.",
