    ["当"] = "When",
    ["当<Highlight>狼人眩晕</>时，靠近狼人可以<Highlight>转移伤势</>。"] = "When the <Highlight>Werewolf is stunned</>, approaching it allows you to <Highlight>transfer the injuries</>.",
    ["当OverrideGravityScale大于等于0时，将以他替换角色的OverrideGravityScale"] = "When OverrideGravityScale is greater than or equal to 0, it will replace the character's OverrideGravityScale with it.",
    ["当Pos=\"tar\"时生效，当目标近于此距离时，放在目标Root点，当目标远于此距离时，放在自身到目标连线方向上此距离位置。此处距离不包含碰撞半径，且按XOY平面投影距离算，最终点位会贴地处理"] = "Effective when Pos=\"tar\". If the target is closer than this distance, it is placed at the target's root; if further, it is placed at this distance along the line connecting the self to the target. This distance excludes the collision radius and is calculated based on XOY plane projection; the final position will be snapped to the ground.",
    ["当Pos=\"tar\"时生效，当目标近于此距离时，放在目标Root点，当目标远于此距离时，放在自身到目标连线方向上此距离位置。此处距离不包含碰撞半径，且按XOY平面投影距离算，最终点位会贴地处理。"] = "Effective when Pos=\"tar\". If the target is closer than this distance, it is placed at the target's root; if further, it is placed at this distance along the line connecting the self to the target. This distance excludes the collision radius and is calculated based on XOY plane projection; the final position will be snapped to the ground.",
    ["当“基础位置”为LockTargetPos/BlackBoardPos时生效，当目标近于此距离时，放在目标处，当目标远于此距离时，放在自身到目标连线方向上此距离位置。此距离不包含碰撞半径，且按XOY平面投影距离算，最终点位会贴地处理"] = "Effective when 'Base Position' is set to LockTargetPos/BlackBoardPos. If the target is closer than this distance, it is placed at the target's location; if further, it is placed at this distance along the line connecting the self to the target. This distance excludes the collision radius and is calculated based on XOY plane projection; the final position will be snapped to the ground.",
    ["当“放置位置模式”为1时生效，当目标近于此距离时，放在目标Root点，当目标远于此距离时，放在自身到目标连线方向上此距离位置。此处距离不包含碰撞半径，且按XOY平面投影距离算，最终点位会贴地处理。"] = "Effective when \"Placement Position Mode\" is 1. If the target is closer than this distance, it is placed at the target's root; if further, it is placed at this distance along the line connecting the self to the target. This distance excludes the collision radius and is calculated based on XOY plane projection; the final position will be snapped to the ground.",
    ["当一个东西你观察了几千遍，它自然会在你心里留下声音。这不是疯狂，{{先生|女士}}，这只是一种……熟悉。"] = "When you observe something thousands of times, it naturally leaves a voice in your heart. This isn't madness, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, this is just... familiarity.",
    ["当一位剧作家接触到了罗塞尔所写的《基督山伯爵》手稿……"] = "When a playwright comes into contact with the manuscript of 'The Count of Monte Cristo' written by Roselle...",
    ["当下的心情？"] = "How are you feeling right now?",
    ["当与2名及以上家族成员同处于当前副本团队中时，属性低于标准的玩家会根据家族等级和同副本团队家族人员数量，获得一定程度的攻击与防御的属性增益。前往创建家族"] = "When in the same dungeon team with 2 or more family members, players with attributes below the standard will receive a certain degree of attack and defense attribute bonuses based on the family level and the number of family members in the same dungeon team. Go to create a family.",
    ["当且仅当bRandom为True生效"] = "Takes effect if and only if bRandom is True.",
    ["当且仅当配置了 HitNum 和 Sign 才会进行比较"] = "Comparison is performed if and only if HitNum and Sign are configured",
    ["当两个灵魂在命运的轨迹上并肩而行，灰雾深处便会凝结出这枚微光。它不记录誓言的内容，只铭刻共同走过的路。"] = "When two souls walk side by side on the trajectory of fate, this glimmer will condense in the depths of the gray fog. It does not record the content of the covenant, only the path walked together.",
    ["当个绅士可真无趣。"] = "Being a gentleman is so boring.",
    ["当事人全部死掉是常态"] = "It's normal for all parties involved to die",
    ["当五颜六色的鸟雀默然栖息，"] = "When the colorful birds silently perch,",
    ["当亲手为东区的孩子分发面包时，记得自己不仅是织梦者，更是奥黛丽·霍尔。"] = "When distributing bread to the children of the East District with my own hands, I remember that I am not just a Dream Weaver, but Audrey Hall.",
    ["当会议室里的一切恢复整齐的时候，一只海精灵悄无声息地出现在了椅子旁，试图再次扰乱秩序，被一举擒获。"] = "When everything in the conference room returned to order, a Sea Spirit appeared silently beside a chair, attempting to disrupt the order again, only to be captured in one fell swoop.",
    ["当你不再和任何东西产生联系时，这就会变成唯一的感觉。"] = "When you no longer have any connection to anything, this becomes the only feeling.",
    ["当你享受不知名的恩惠时，可曾想过它究竟来自神明，还是魔鬼？"] = "When you enjoy an unknown favor, have you ever wondered if it comes from a God or a devil?",
    ["当你从高空俯视这片草原时，可以看到爱心形状的公路。"] = "When you look down at this grassland from high above, you can see a heart-shaped road.",
    ["当你使用直接攻击造成暴击时，风暴之主会回应你的祈求，一道闪电也会击中你的目标，造成若干伤害。"] = "When you land a critical hit with a direct attack, the Lord of Storms will respond to your prayer, and a lightning bolt will also strike your target, dealing a certain amount of damage.",
    ["当你使用直接攻击造成暴击时，风暴之主会回应你的祈求，一道闪电也会击中你的目标，造成若干伤害，此效果对同一目标每秒最多触发1次。"] = "When you deal a Critical Hit with a direct attack, the Lord of Storms will respond to your prayer, and a lightning bolt will also strike your target, dealing damage. This effect can trigger at most once per second on the same target.",
    ["当你凝望神秘时，神秘也正凝望着你。"] = "When you gaze into mystery, mystery is also gazing into you.",
    ["当你发现集火难以击杀敌方时，保护队友进行拆火，依靠伤害量取胜或许是个不错的办法。"] = "When you find that it is difficult to kill an enemy by focusing fire, protecting your teammates to peel for them and winning based on damage output might be a good strategy.",
    ["当你回到现实，你会看到她最不愿意让你看到的，真相。"] = "When you return to reality, you will see the truth she least wants you to see.",
    ["当你回到终点线时，人群早已散去……"] = "When you returned to the finish line, the crowd had long since dispersed...",
    ["当你拥有5点太阳能量时，伤害加深提升20%，持续10秒；当你拥有0点太阳能量时，伤害减免提升20%，持续10秒。"] = "When you have 5 points of Solar Energy, damage boost is increased by 20% for 10 seconds; when you have 0 points of Solar Energy, damage reduction is increased by 20% for 10 seconds.",
    ["当你接近这些回响的源头，往昔的记忆会与之共鸣，凝结成具象的回响之匣。那些散落的音符，藏着命运本身的韵律——正是我谱写诗篇所需的残章。"] = "When you approach the source of these echoes, memories of the past will resonate with them, condensing into a concrete Echo Box. Those scattered notes hide the rhythm of fate itself—the very fragments I need to compose my poem.",
    ["当你攻击感染的普通怪物时，有10%概率击晕1.5秒。"] = "When you attack an infected normal monster, there is a 10% chance to stun it for 1.5 seconds.",
    ["当你攻击感染的普通怪物时，有10%概率眩晕1秒。"] = "When you attack an infected normal monster, there is a 10% chance to Stun for 1 second.",
    ["当你的足迹足以编织属于自己的隐秘篇章时，你将获得命运的短暂“垂青”，在至关重要的任何时刻拥有重写一次骰运的资格，<Talent>【重投】次数+1</>。"] = "When your footprints are enough to weave your own secret chapter, you will receive a brief \"favor\" from fate, possessing the qualification to rewrite your dice luck once at any crucial moment, <Talent>【Reroll】 count +1</>.",
    ["当你窥视命运，命运也在窥视着你。"] = "When you peek at fate, fate is also peeking at you.",
    ["当你第一次攻击一个从未交战过的目标时，灵界会回应你的渴望，恢复15%生命值。"] = "When you attack a target you have never engaged with for the first time, the Spirit World will respond to your desire, recovering 15% Health.",
    ["当你第一次攻击一个从未交战过的目标时，灵界会回应你的渴望，恢复相当于最大生命值一定倍率的生命值。"] = "When you attack a target you have never engaged with for the first time, the Spirit World will respond to your desire, recovering Health equivalent to a certain multiplier of your maximum Health.",
    ["当你锁定矛盾，就必须以无可辩驳的“证据”，直面你的目标。"] = "When you lock onto a contradiction, you must confront your target with irrefutable \"evidence\".",
    ["当你需要暗号的时候，说“醉汉”准没错！当然了，暗号这种东西，可能不久之后就会改变……但管他呢，到那时再说！"] = "When you need the password, saying \"Drunkard\" is always right! Of course, passwords like that might change before long... but who cares, we'll deal with that when the time comes!",
    ["当写下对方名字的瞬间，一段独属于你们的时光，由此诞生。"] = "The moment you write down the other person's name, a period of time belonging solely to you is born.",
    ["当初我们可花了不少心思才把学派建造成现在这样舒适宜人的场所。酒窖、沙发、壁炉、书籍、柔软的床铺，应有尽有，伸手可得……"] = "We spent quite a lot of effort to build the school into the comfortable and pleasant place it is now. Wine cellar, sofas, fireplace, books, soft beds—everything is available and within reach...",
    ["当初的选择还是太草率了 现在看来不管是学徒还是占卜家 或者偷盗者 都更加好"] = "My choice back then was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it was Apprentice, Seer, or Marauder, all would have been better.",
    ["当初连续两个月，每次都在坐第三排正中央，看得不知道有多认真。就那么喜欢狮子吗？"] = "Back then, for two consecutive months, you sat in the middle of the third row every time, watching so intently. Do you like lions that much?",
    ["当初选择研究历史的时候，我还没有意识到自己的特殊性。只是有一种想要探究过去的、模糊的冲动。"] = "When I first chose to study history, I had not yet realized my own uniqueness. There was just a vague impulse to explore the past.",
