    ["当前装备不是最佳恩赐方案，可以应用已保存的最佳恩赐方案，是否直接应用？\n<BrickRedLight>应用后，装备上当前的词条将消失。</>"] = "The current equipment is not the optimal blessing setup. You can apply the saved optimal blessing setup. Do you want to apply it directly? \n<BrickRedLight>After applying, the current entries on the equipment will disappear. </>",
