    ["当前额外消化累计进度：%d"] = "Current additional digestion cumulative progress: %d",
    ["当前魔女已经拥有仆从，不可以哦~"] = "This Witch already has a servant; it's not allowed~",
    ["当前默契值"] = "Current Rapport Value",
    ["当发现自己形单影只时，不妨打开地图寻找己方势力成员位置。"] = "When you find yourself alone, you might want to open the map to find the locations of your faction members.",
    ["当大家准备散场的时候，有人大喊——戈登失踪了。\n是戴维的声音，据他所说，他们本来在一起喝酒的，戈登突然就不见了。\n曼斯教授让所有人都帮忙找，我们从营地找到营地外，都没有找到。\n正当所有人都回到营地后，戴维也不见了。\n戈登和戴维是最先发现山顶遗迹的人，也是最早失踪的。营地里去过山顶遗迹的人，都担心下一个失踪的是自己。\n尽管接下来的几天里没有人失踪，但曼斯教授和几位研究员先生都提议先暂时撤离，我们只好收拾东西，准备离开。"] = "When everyone was preparing to disperse, someone shouted—Gordon is missing. \n It was David's voice. According to him, they were originally drinking together, and Gordon suddenly disappeared. \n Professor Mans asked everyone to help look, but we searched from the camp to outside the camp and couldn't find him. \n Just as everyone returned to the camp, David also disappeared. \n Gordon and David were the first to discover the mountain top ruins and were also the first to go missing. Everyone in the camp who had been to the mountain top ruins was worried that they would be the next to go missing. \n Although no one went missing in the following days, Professor Mans and several researchers suggested evacuating first, so we had to pack our things and prepare to leave.",
    ["当大帝的画像在空中展开 廷根将迎来最狂热的时刻！"] = "When the Emperor's portrait is unfurled in the air, Tingen will welcome its most fanatical moment!",
    ["当太阳从天空消失，当云朵被撕出了缝隙，当闪电和雷霆成为主宰，藏在黑暗深处的怪物们突然出现，白银之国的城市一个又一个被毁灭……"] = "When the sun disappeared from the sky, when the clouds were torn apart, when lightning and thunder became the masters, the monsters hidden in the depths of the darkness suddenly appeared, and the cities of the Silver Kingdom were destroyed one after another...",
    ["当妈妈拿出两张钢琴大师的音乐会门票，谁会拒绝呢？"] = "When Mom took out two tickets to a piano master's concert, who could refuse?",
    ["当季新品“未来梦”，梦中窥见后日谈\n\n招牌特调“火烧玫瑰”，坠入花海温柔乡\n\n更多精品美酒，尊贵人士的首选\n\n邀请您前来品尝！"] = "Seasonal new release \"Future Dream\", a glimpse of the epilogue in a dream \n\n Signature special \"Burning Rose\", fall into a gentle land of flowers \n\n More premium fine wines, the choice of distinguished guests \n\n Inviting you to come and taste!",
    ["当完成一定数量的乐章后，吟游诗人可能邀请你去一个神秘的地点，观看一段过往的故事。"] = "After completing a certain number of movements, the Bard may invite you to a mysterious location to watch a story from the past.",
    ["当届比赛已全部结束"] = "The current tournament has concluded",
    ["当巨剑与大地相连，守护之力将难以撼动。"] = "When the greatsword connects with the earth, the Guardian Power will be hard to shake.",
    ["当巨剑与大地相连，衰败之力将难以抵抗。"] = "When the greatsword connects with the earth, the power of decay will be hard to resist.",
    ["当年为了嫁给你，连嫁妆我都没要，被骂了那么久倒贴货……"] = "Back then, to marry you, I didn't even ask for a dowry, and I was scolded for so long for being a 'freebie'...",
    ["当年他还只是个小军官的时候就有许多贵族情妇，为他神魂颠倒的美人更是不计其数，你知道为什么吗？"] = "When he was just a low-ranking officer, he had many noble mistresses, and countless beauties were infatuated with him. Do you know why?",
    ["当年在廷根和西蒙托特一起画画的时光，可真令人怀念啊。"] = "The time spent painting with Simon Toth in Tingen back then is truly nostalgic.",
    ["当年，我也在舞池的灯光下。只是现在……那盏灯照不到我了。"] = "Back in the day, I was also under the lights of the dance floor. It's just that now... that light doesn't reach me anymore.",
    ["当年，新党议员梅纳德先生在市长选举前被残酷暗杀，多亏值夜者的邓恩队长和他的队员，事情才得以解决。"] = "Back then, New Party member Mr. Maynard was brutally assassinated before the mayoral election. Thanks to Captain Dunn and his team of Nighthawks, the matter was resolved.",
    ["当廷根的居民都进入梦乡，必须有人保持清醒，对抗疯狂。"] = "When the residents of Tingen fall into a dream, someone must remain awake to fight against madness.",
    ["当开启\"记忆的传承\"仪式时通往记忆世界的大门将为你开启——那里沉淀着你的过去，你曾经历过的惊心动魄的战斗时刻。\n\n这些记忆中的强敌将以当年的姿态重现，等待着新的挑战者。当你踏入记忆世界，便可以与这些历史中的对手交锋，再度证明自己。\n\n征服它们，是对自身力量的证明，若你与家族成员并肩作战，这也将是对家族记忆的致敬。当家族成员齐聚共同进入记忆世界时，家族羁绊将化为实质的力量，获得【誓火共燃】与【血脉盟约】两大增益效果，让荣光铭刻进家徽之中，成为家族的永久传承。"] = "When the \"Inheritance of Memory\" ritual is activated, the door to the memory world will open for you—a place where your past is deposited, containing the thrilling combat moments you have experienced. \n\n These formidable enemies from your memories will reappear in their former states, waiting for new challengers. Once you step into the memory world, you can clash with these historical opponents and prove yourself once again. \n\n Conquering them is a testament to your own strength; if you fight side-by-side with family members, it will also be a tribute to the family's memories. When family members gather to enter the memory world together, the family bond will manifest as tangible power, granting the two buff effects [Burning Vow of Fire] and [Bloodline Covenant], engraving glory into the family crest and becoming a permanent inheritance for the family.",
    ["当开启“记忆的传承”仪式时通往记忆世界的大门将为你开启——那里沉淀着你的过去，你曾经历过的惊心动魄的战斗时刻。\n\n这些记忆中的强敌将以当年的姿态重现，等待着新的挑战者。当你踏入记忆世界，便可以与这些历史中的对手交锋，再度证明自己。\n\n征服它们，是对自身力量的证明，若你与家族成员并肩作战，这也将是对家族记忆的致敬。当家族成员齐聚共同进入记忆世界时，家族羁绊将化为实质的力量，获得【誓火共燃】与【血脉盟约】两大增益效果，让荣光铭刻进家徽之中，成为家族的永久传承。"] = "When the 'Inheritance of Memory' ritual is activated, the door to the memory world will open for you—a place where your past is deposited, containing the thrilling combat moments you have experienced. \n\n These formidable enemies from your memories will reappear in their former states, waiting for new challengers. Once you step into the memory world, you can clash with these historical opponents and prove yourself once again. \n\n Conquering them is a testament to your own strength; if you fight side-by-side with family members, it will also be a tribute to the family's memories. When family members gather to enter the memory world together, the family bond will manifest as tangible power, granting the two buff effects [Burning Vow of Fire] and [Bloodline Covenant], engraving glory into the family crest and becoming a permanent inheritance for the family.",
    ["当心理治疗可用时，噩梦姿态使用序列技能时自动释放心理治疗——肉鸽"] = "When Psychotherapy is available, it is automatically cast when using a Sequence skill in Nightmare Stance — Roguelike",
    ["当心！别被黑暗吞噬了"] = "Watch out! Don't let the Darkness devour you.",
    ["当心！封印物2-049好像感应到什么，进入狂暴状态，负面效果的影响范围变大了！"] = "Watch out! Sealed Artifact 2-049 seems to have sensed something and entered a berserk state, the range of its negative effects has increased!",
    ["当心，又有非凡怪物冲过来了！"] = "Watch out, more Beyonder monsters are rushing over!",
    ["当成旅途结束的人，他们只是比我们先到达了终点，可以休息了。"] = "Think of them as people who have finished their journey; they just reached the destination before us and can now rest.",
    ["当我去找他要个说法时，他却当着我的面被马车撞了！"] = "When I went to ask him for an explanation, he was hit by a carriage right in front of me!",
    ["当我在……那个梦里，我按照自己的意愿改变了过去，可是那样的话你没有用到我设计的飞机道具，你就会因此从空中坠落、死亡。"] = "When I was in... that dream, I changed the past according to my own will, but in that case, you didn't use the airplane prop I designed, and you would have fallen from the sky and died because of it.",
    ["当我没说………等等、那又是什么？"] = "Never mind what I said... Wait, what is that?",
    ["当我看见云雀，张开翅膀欢喜地飞向阳光。"] = "When I see the skylark, spreading its wings and flying joyfully toward the sun.",
    ["当战意攀升至顶点，古老的石碑将唤回那场决定时代的战争。占领后可给己方增加减伤，占领相邻两个即可攻击王城大门。"] = "When battle intent climbs to its peak, the ancient stele will summon back the war that decided the era. After occupying, you can increase damage reduction for your side; occupy two adjacent ones to attack the Royal City Gate.",
    ["当所有条件满足时，点击此处升级城堡。"] = "When all conditions are met, click here to upgrade the castle.",
    ["当执行该condition的客户端,满足和该condition配置的地表类型一致时，为true"] = "When the client executing this condition matches the surface type configured for this condition, it is true.",
    ["当执行该condition的客户端，即P1玩家，满足和该condition的所属技能始作俑者或者buff拥有者的阵营关系为Self关系（即目标就是自己）时，为true"] = "When the client executing this condition, i.e., P1 player, satisfies the faction relationship with the originator of the Skill or the owner of the buff to which this condition belongs as Self relationship (i.e., the target is yourself), it is true",
    ["当执行该condition的客户端，即P1玩家，满足和该condition的所属技能始作俑者或者buff拥有者的阵营关系为enemy关系时，为true"] = "When the client executing this condition, i.e., P1 player, satisfies the faction relationship with the originator of the Skill or the owner of the buff to which this condition belongs as enemy relationship, it is true",
    ["当执行该condition的客户端，即P1玩家，满足和该condition的所属技能始作俑者或者buff拥有者的阵营关系为（目标为友方（不包含自己））时，为true"] = "When the client executing this condition, i.e., P1 player, satisfies the faction relationship with the originator of the Skill or the owner of the buff to which this condition belongs as (target is friendly (excluding yourself)), it is true",
    ["当携带猩红遗物时，你可能已经成为其他猎人的目标，速去寻找猎杀管家提交！"] = "When carrying a scarlet relic, you may have become a target for other hunters; hurry to find the Hunting Butler to submit it!",
    ["当日个人猎杀榜"] = "Daily Personal Hunt Ranking",
    ["当日俱乐部猎杀榜"] = "Daily Club Hunt Ranking",
    ["当日俱乐部邮件总发送次数："] = "Total club emails sent today:",
    ["当日剩余可对他人安魂次数: d%"] = "Remaining times to soothe others today: d%",
    ["当日更换封面次数到达上限"] = "Daily cover change limit reached.",
    ["当日未能完成俱乐部求助任务时，会继续保留，直到完成任务或者放弃。"] = "If the Club assistance quest is not completed on the day, it will be retained until the quest is completed or abandoned.",
    ["当日鲜花，买二赠一！您要买花吗？"] = "Fresh flowers of the day, buy two get one free! Do you want to buy flowers?",
    ["当时他认为我被2-049控制，于是用解救我并给予“占卜家”途径对应的序列8“小丑”来引诱我，让我去拿安提哥努斯笔记。"] = "At the time, he thought I was controlled by 2-049, so he tried to lure me by rescuing me and offering the Sequence 8 Clown of the Seer pathway, making me go get the Antigonus notebook.",
    ["当时如果不是执事们及时赶到，遏制了失控，他差点就变成怪物了……"] = "If the deacons hadn't arrived in time to contain the loss of control, he would have almost turned into a monster...",
    ["当时我只是个新兵，在战场上与一名敌军相遇，我们对峙了很久。"] = "I was just a new recruit back then, and I encountered an enemy soldier on the battlefield. We stood in a standoff for a long time.",
    ["当时没来得及对她进行调查！"] = "I didn't have time to investigate her back then!",
    ["当时，我的女儿跟我说，在满月夜里把南瓜埋在后院，就能让生病的孩子好转。我的小儿子咳嗽确实好了，我就……"] = "At the time, my daughter told me that burying a pumpkin in the backyard on a full moon night would make a sick child get better. My little son's cough did get better, so I...",
    ["当时，龙从天上冲下来，张开血盆大口……"] = "At that time, the dragon swooped down from the sky, opened its bloody mouth...",
    ["当时，龙从天上冲下来，张开血盆大口，喷出的火焰能把钢铁熔化！"] = "At that time, the dragon rushed down from the sky, opened its bloody mouth, and the fire it sprayed could melt steel!",
    ["当时，龙从天上冲下来，张开血盆大口，喷出的火焰能把钢铁融化！"] = "At that time, the dragon swooped down from the sky, opened its bloody mouth, and the flames it spat could melt steel!",
    ["当映射为A→B时，如果通过CastAttack来调用A，改为调用CastAttack(B)；如果是正经施放技能A，则将技能A里范围筛选相关列，替换成B里的相关列（时间点、增伤除外）。"] = "When mapped as A→B, if A is called via CastAttack, it is changed to call CastAttack(B); if it is a standard cast of skill A, the range filtering-related columns in skill A are replaced with the corresponding columns in B (excluding time points and damage boosts).",
    ["当最后的谜底揭示，我们或许才能回答那个问题——罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，你究竟是谁？"] = "Only when the final mystery is revealed can we perhaps answer that question—Roselle Gustav, who exactly are you?",
    ["当最深的黑夜即将过去，锋刃最先染上晨光；为未至的和平，持剑至最后一刻。"] = "When the deepest night is about to pass, the blade is the first to be stained with the morning light; hold the sword until the very last moment for a peace that has yet to arrive.",
    ["当期大奖"] = "Current grand prize",
    ["当本俱乐部玩家在终末猎杀地图被其他俱乐部玩家击败时，将会增加对该俱乐部的血仇值。"] = "When players of this club are defeated by players of other clubs in the Final Hunt map, the Blood Feud value against that club will increase.",
    ["当歌剧魅影落下帷幕，你收到了自幕后送出的小小礼盒，登台者与观众都可获得。拆开后概率获得<Highlight>焕彩纯露</>；小概率盒内附有<Highlight>泡沫染膏</>、<Highlight>珊瑚染料</>或<Highlight>星币</>。"] = "When the Phantom of the Opera falls, you receive a small gift box sent from behind the scenes, which can be obtained by both performers and audience members. Opening it gives a chance to receive <Highlight>Radiant Dew</>; there is a small probability that the box contains <Highlight>Foam Dye Cream</>, <Highlight>Coral Dye</>, or <Highlight>Star Coins</>.",
    ["当死灵导师是什么感觉？"] = "What does it feel like to be a Spirit Medium?",
    ["当每段文字浮现后走到其前方，即可跟随文字前进，窥探告解者的内心。"] = "After each paragraph of text appears, walk in front of it to follow the text forward and peek into the confessor's heart.",
    ["当海纳斯在占卜俱乐部中初次登场，一切似乎已有预兆。\n这一片历史的迷雾背后，会是什么？"] = "When Haines first appeared in the Divination Club, everything seemed to have been foreshadowed. \n What could be behind this mist of history?",
    ["当满足<Highlight>城堡升级条件</>、<Highlight>消耗</>一定数量的城堡资产即可升级城堡。"] = "When you meet the <Highlight>Castle Upgrade Conditions</> and <Highlight>consume</> a certain amount of castle assets, you can upgrade the castle.",
    ["当灰雾翻涌，当黄水晶灵摆倒映出彼此的面孔，异乡人，此刻不再是孤身一人。"] = "When the gray fog surges, and the yellow crystal pendulum reflects each other's faces, stranger, you are no longer alone at this moment.",
    ["当灰雾翻涌，当黄水晶球映出异乡的倒影，总有些人能辨认出彼此眼中那抹不属于这个时代的光——那是来自同一个故乡的默契。"] = "When the gray fog surges, and the yellow crystal ball reflects the shadows of a foreign land, there are always some who can recognize the light in each other's eyes that does not belong to this era—that is the tacit understanding from the same hometown.",
    ["当然"] = "Of course",
    ["当然 我淋不到一滴雨"] = "Of course, I don't get a single drop of rain on me.",
    ["当然……现在不是说这个的时候，我得赶紧找到阿尔伯特！"] = "Of course... Now is not the time for this. I must find Albert immediately!",
    ["当然……造纸厂那边会要求您多收集一些。<P_Heart>（她侧身挡住了背后的袋子）</>"] = "Of course... the paper mill will require you to collect a bit more. <P_Heart> (She turned sideways to block the bag behind her) </>",
    ["当然。"] = "Of course.",
    ["当然。不努力干活，就要受惩罚，这对其他人才公平。"] = "Of course. If you don't work hard, you have to be punished; that's only fair to the others.",
    ["当然。不努力干活，就要受惩罚，这对其他人才公平。尤其是这个带头的，我今天肯定要让他付出点代价！"] = "Of course. If you don't work hard, you have to be punished. That's fair to the others. Especially this ringleader, I am definitely going to make him pay a price today!",
    ["当然。你不喜欢少爷吗？"] = "Of course. Don't you like the young master?",
    ["当然。总比在这儿……挑战狼鱼罐头强。"] = "Of course. It's better than... challenging wolf-fish canned food here.",
    ["当然。恐惧和感谢并不矛盾，敬畏和好奇也可以共存。总之……我很庆幸自己那天诵念了那个尊名。"] = "Of course. Fear and gratitude are not contradictory, and awe and curiosity can coexist. In short... I am very glad I chanted that honorific name that day.",
    ["当然不是……其实，我也是人类。"] = "Of course not... actually, I am also a human.",
    ["当然不是！<P_Heart>(小声)</>要不是猎犬酒馆给的多，我才不折腾这个……"] = "Of course not! <P_Heart> (Whispering) </> If it weren't for the Hound Bar paying more, I wouldn't bother with this...",
    ["当然不是！公司规定只能在娱乐室里打牌。我们在聊——你这个幸运儿！"] = "Of course not! Company rules state we can only play cards in the recreation room. We were talking about—you, you lucky guy!",
    ["当然不是！其实，我也是人类……至少曾经是。"] = "Of course not! Actually, I am also a human... at least I used to be.",
    ["当然不知道，我们只是普通的病人和医生关系。"] = "Of course not, we are just ordinary patients and a doctor.",
    ["当然也怕。但更多的是……好奇。那张青铜长桌，那片灰雾之上的宫殿，还有他展现出的种种手段——那是超越我想象的力量。"] = "Of course I was afraid. But more than that... curiosity. That bronze long table, that palace above the gray fog, and the various means he displayed—that was power beyond my imagination.",
    ["当然了亲爱的，只要我们在一起，没有什么困难是不能解决的。"] = "Of course, my dear. As long as we're together, there's no difficulty we can't overcome.",
    ["当然了，去远一点的地方的时候，勉为其难……不得不……"] = "Of course, when going to a place further away, I'll reluctantly... have to...",
    ["当然了，您要有什么重要的信息也可以和我说一声。"] = "Of course, if you have any important information, you can also let me know.",
    ["当然了，我只给哥哥一个人捏。"] = "Of course, I only massage you, brother.",
    ["当然会记得，你们也要与我分享霍伊大学有趣的事。"] = "Of course I will remember, you must also share interesting things about Hoy University with me.",
    ["当然会，但是我有一个好的前辈让我学习。"] = "Of course I was, but I had a good senior to learn from.",
    ["当然可以。"] = "Of course.",
    ["当然可以。我叫{{PlayerName}}。"] = "Of course. My name is {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["当然可以。来，就像这样……"] = "Of course you can. Come, just like this...",
    ["当然可以！你是艾登的朋友，也就是我的朋友！"] = "Of course I can! You are Aiden's friend, which means you are my friend too!",
    ["当然可以！叔叔阿姨告诉我，只要我向女神祈祷一百天，噢不，是一千天，布鲁斯的病就会好起来的。你愿意和我一起来祈祷吗？"] = "Of course! My aunt and uncle told me that as long as I pray to the Goddess for a hundred days, oh no, a thousand days, Bruce's illness will get better. Are you willing to pray with me?",
    ["当然可以！来，就像这样……"] = "Of course! Come, like this...",
    ["当然可以！跟我来！"] = "Of course! Follow me!",
    ["当然可以，乐意效劳。"] = "Of course, I'd be happy to help.",
    ["当然可以，但有点远，而且我一般都步行过去。"] = "Of course, but it's a bit far, and I usually walk there.",
    ["当然可以，我很荣幸。"] = "Of course, I would be honored.",
    ["当然可以，我还想和你借一点魔法！"] = "Of course you can, I even wanted to borrow some magic from you!",
    ["当然啦 妈妈会带你去一个永远明亮 不会寒冷的地方……"] = "Of course, Mom will take you to a place that is always bright and never cold...",
    ["当然啦！我听说码头那边的工人，一天能挣好几个便士呢！要是省着点花，说不定还能买条新裙子！"] = "Of course! I heard that workers at the dock can earn several pennies a day! If I save a little, maybe I can buy a new dress!",
    ["当然啦！我都躲好多次了！"] = "Of course! I've hidden here many times!",
    ["当然啦！这可是给女神的赞美诗。"] = "Of course! This is a hymn to the Goddess.",
    ["当然啦，恋情、运势、健康状况，丢了猫猫狗狗也可以找占卜师占卜哦。"] = "Of course, for romance, fortune, health status, or even if you lose your cat or dog, you can find a diviner for a reading.",
    ["当然啦，我这破衣破布不体面，怎么去富人区挖坟地呀，不体面。"] = "Of course. With my tattered clothes, how could I go to the rich section to dig graves? It wouldn't be proper.",
    ["当然好奇。我是一条狗，好奇心是我们的天性。"] = "Of course I'm curious. I'm a dog, and curiosity is our nature.",
    ["当然想过"] = "Of course I have",
    ["当然是《大冒险家》啊，真希望我也能写出这样的畅销书！"] = "Of course it's \"The Great Adventurer\"! I really hope I can write such a bestseller too!",
    ["当然是一个月之前！"] = "Of course, a month ago!",
    ["当然是世界越来越混乱了。再这样下去，廷根需要第二所精神病院。愿女神庇佑我们……教会应该加强力量，保护我们这些可怜的羔羊。"] = "Of course, the world is becoming more and more chaotic. If this continues, Tingen will need a second mental hospital. May the Goddess protect us... The Church should strengthen its power to protect us poor lambs.",
    ["当然是你"] = "Of course it's you",
    ["当然是偷——买面包啦！我爸爸因为……买一块面包被抓了，要关很久很久。"] = "Of course it's stealing—buying bread! My dad was caught for... buying a loaf of bread, and he'll be locked up for a very, very long time.",
    ["当然是因为……"] = "Of course it's because...",
    ["当然是因为市议员休伯特涉嫌贪污，而证据极有可能就藏匿在下水道中！"] = "Of course, it's because City Councilor Hubert is suspected of corruption, and the evidence is very likely hidden in the sewers!",
    ["当然是因为这位贪婪的先生，伪装成泰利再一次给我写信了啊。"] = "Of course it's because this greedy gentleman pretended to be Terry and wrote to me again.",
    ["当然是在你眼前最活跃的那位——伯特，我的理想丈夫啦。"] = "Of course, the one most active in front of you—Bert, my ideal husband.",
    ["当然是学习怎样利用非凡能力，并领悟“扮演”的意义！"] = "Of course, it's learning how to utilize Extraordinary abilities and realizing the meaning of \"Acting\"!",
    ["当然是寻宝了！"] = "Treasure hunting, of course!",
    ["当然是小镇上庆祝丰收，感恩大地的节日。看我家门口满地金黄的南瓜，多么甜美的果实，多么伟大的丰饶之力！"] = "Of course, it's the festival in the small town to celebrate the harvest and thank the earth. Look at the golden pumpkins all over my doorstep, what sweet fruits, what great power of harvest!",
    ["当然是廷根。"] = "Tingen, of course.",
    ["当然是您，没有人比您更美丽。"] = "It is certainly you; no one is more beautiful than you.",
    ["当然是我自己做的，我可是天生的……这不关您的事。蒸汽在上，如果您没别的事，就请离开吧。"] = "Of course I made it myself, I'm a natural... That's none of your business. Steam above, if you have nothing else, please leave.",
    ["当然是我自己抓的。为了吃肉，我抓空了好几个街区的老鼠！"] = "Of course I caught it myself. To eat meat, I've cleared out the rats in several blocks!",
    ["当然是投到20点了！"] = "Of course, it means rolling a 20!",
    ["当然是煎烤！鱼皮焦脆、鱼肉雪白，煎完再淋点柠檬汁——河岸边餐厅的招牌菜，即便在家也能复刻！"] = "Of course, pan-seared! The fish skin is crispy, the meat is snow-white, and after searing, you drizzle a bit of lemon juice over it—it's the signature dish of the riverside restaurant, and you can replicate it even at home!",
    ["当然是真的啦，等我有空了来请教你，我也想开出漂亮的小花来。"] = "Of course it's true, when I have time I'll come to learn from you, I also want to bloom beautiful little flowers.",
    ["当然是那些热情过头的学生和读者！从家门口到教学楼，他们无处不在。甚至在盥洗室，都有人敲门向我请教第四纪的历史。"] = "Of course, it's those overly enthusiastic students and readers! From my doorstep to the teaching building, they are everywhere. Even in the restroom, someone knocks on the door to ask me about Fourth Epoch history.",
    ["当然有，你从楼梯上滚了下来。"] = "Of course there is, you rolled down the stairs.",
    ["当然有，而且一箩筐。"] = "Of course I do, and a whole basket full of them.",
    ["当然有，而且一箩筐！"] = "Of course I do, and a whole basket full of them!",
    ["当然正常！我本来就是个普通的研究者。"] = "Of course it's normal! I'm just an ordinary researcher, after all.",
    ["当然没有"] = "Of course not",
    ["当然没有！我只送拿得动的订单，我可背不动你。"] = "Of course not! I only deliver orders I can carry, I can't carry you on my back.",
    ["当然没问题，尊敬的{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Of course, no problem, respected {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["当然没问题，我还有些别的小吃，一起给你作为谢礼吧。"] = "Of course, no problem. I have some other snacks, I'll give them to you as a thank-you gift too.",
    ["当然记得。姐姐每次来，我都记得。只是……姐姐不常找我。"] = "Of course I remember. Every time you come, I remember. It's just... you don't come to see me very often.",
    ["当然记得。那个孩子和我并肩作战过很多次。"] = "Of course I remember. That child and I fought side by side many times.",
    ["当然这不算什么大事，拉斐尔墓园从建立开始就时有发生。"] = "Of course, this is not a big deal; it has happened from time to time since Raphael Cemetery was established.",
    ["当然这也算不上什么新鲜事了。"] = "Of course, that's not really news either.",
    ["当然！"] = "Of course!",
    ["当然！<P_Heart>（鞠躬）</>廷根最好的小丑，即将为你带来最盛大的表演！"] = "Of course! <P_Heart> (Bowing) </> The best Clown in Tingen is about to bring you the grandest performance!",
    ["当然！{{PlayerName}}，快去把这件事告诉佐伊。"] = "Of course! {{PlayerName}}, go tell Zoe about this immediately.",
    ["当然！吸血鬼大人和我一定会冲破世俗的桎梏，谱写血与禁忌的爱恋之歌！"] = "Of course! Lord Vampire and I will definitely break through the shackles of the world and compose a song of blood and forbidden love!",
    ["当然！实在是太刺激了，没想到传闻只喜欢钱和美人的老富翁身手这么矫健，居然能躲过警察追捕！"] = "Of course! It was so exciting. I didn't expect the old rich man, who is rumored to only like money and beauties, to be so agile that he could escape the police!",
    ["当然！您有什么冤屈？被厂里克扣工钱？房东不退押金？"] = "Of course! What grievances do you have? Wages withheld by the factory? Landlord refusing to return your deposit?",
    ["当然！您请进。"] = "Of course! Please come in.",
    ["当然！我们之前就是队友了，走！"] = "Of course! We were teammates before, let's go!",
    ["当然！我的祖父就是因蒂斯人，后来因为爱情才来到鲁恩。波尓颂家族一直和鱼打交道。"] = "Of course! My grandfather was Intisian, and he only came to Loen because of love. The Polson family has always dealt with fish.",
    ["当然！据说这酿出的酒里，还有仙女对我们的祝福呢！"] = "Of course! It is said that in this brewed wine, there is also the fairy's blessing for us!",
    ["当然！玛莎魔法师。"] = "Of course! Magician Martha.",
    ["当然！谁……小时候，没有好奇过所有东西的味道？"] = "Of course! Who... hasn't been curious about the taste of everything when they were a child?",
    ["当然！谁会拒绝一艘能自己思考、自己航行、自己养活自己的船呢？"] = "Of course! Who would refuse a ship that can think for itself, sail for itself, and feed itself?",
    ["当然！谢谢你！"] = "Of course! Thank you!",
    ["当然！还赢过几个官司，帮人拿到过该拿的钱。"] = "Of course! I even won a few cases and helped people get the money they were owed.",
    ["当然！这可是塔罗学派建校的基石，我们有充分的理由认为，“愚者”先生是塔罗学派的后台……<P_Heart>（滔滔不绝）</>"] = "Of course! This is the cornerstone of the Tarot Club's school. We have sufficient reason to believe that Mr. Fool is the backer of the Tarot Club... <P_Heart> (Talking incessantly) </>",
    ["当然！这可是塔罗学派建校的基石，我有充分的理由怀疑，“愚者”先生和会长是叔侄关系……"] = "Of course! This is the cornerstone of the Tarot Club's founding. I have sufficient reason to suspect that Mr. Fool and the President are uncle and nephew...",
    ["当然！那可是神秘学大师给我的配方。"] = "Of course! That was a formula given to me by a master of mysticism.",
    ["当然，一家人可不能分开太久！我们正在努力！"] = "Of course, a family shouldn't be separated for too long! We are working hard!",
    ["当然，不是说你服下魔药，就会立即了解并掌握力量，魔药只是让你具备学习这些能力的资格。"] = "Of course, it doesn't mean that once you consume the potion, you will immediately understand and master the power. The potion only gives you the qualification to learn these abilities.",
    ["当然，不过我需要观察下你的学习情况。"] = "Of course, but I need to observe your learning progress.",
    ["当然，不过我需要观察下你的学习情况，再决定是否引荐你加入我们的内部组织。"] = "Of course, but I need to observe your learning progress before deciding whether to recommend you to join our internal organization.",
    ["当然，也不是所有工人家庭都能承担得起手术费，这也是当下最让人无奈的地方。我们能做的，就是把每一台手术都做扎实，不辜负患者们的信任。 "] = "Of course, not all worker families can afford the surgery fees, which is the most helpless part right now. All we can do is perform every surgery solidly and not let down the patients' trust.",
    ["当然，也不要因为这份预言给自己太大压力，命运的推进往往发生在你没有预料到的时刻。"] = "Of course, don't put too much pressure on yourself because of this prophecy; the progression of fate often happens at moments you least expect.",
    ["当然，也有很多人遇到了更好的选择而放弃这条路。"] = "Of course, many people also give up on this path after finding better options.",
    ["当然，也要记得偶尔放松一下。休息好了，才能走得更远。"] = "Of course, remember to relax occasionally. Only when you are well-rested can you go further.",
    ["当然，也顺便接受一些考验。"] = "Of course, and also to accept some tests along the way.",
    ["当然，仍然有待评估<P_Heart>（嚼嚼嚼）</>，不过<P_Heart>（嚼嚼嚼）</>，的确是……"] = "Of course, it still needs evaluation <P_Heart> (chew chew chew) </>, but <P_Heart> (chew chew chew) </>, it is indeed...",
    ["当然，仍然有待评估（嚼嚼嚼），不过（嚼嚼嚼），的确是……"] = "Of course, it still remains to be evaluated (chew chew chew), but (chew chew chew), it is indeed...",
    ["当然，他应该像我一样成为木匠。毕竟木头总能做成点什么，而下街已经无可救药了。"] = "Of course, he should become a carpenter like me. After all, wood can always be made into something, whereas Lower Street is already beyond saving.",
    ["当然，但也不仅仅只有我们。好了，今天的拍照就到此为止吧。"] = "Of course, but not just us. Alright, today's photography ends here.",
    ["当然，你也可以选择一直做文职人员，毕竟你已经见到了非凡世界有多危险。"] = "Of course, you can also choose to remain a clerk. After all, you've already seen how dangerous the extraordinary world is.",
    ["当然，你也可以选择继续积攒功劳，等到它足以让你成为“不眠者”，黑夜教会掌握着它的完整序列。"] = "Of course, you can also choose to continue accumulating merit until it's enough for you to become a 'Nighthawk'. The Evernight Church holds its complete sequence.",
    ["当然，你做什么都很美味。"] = "Of course, everything you make is delicious.",
    ["当然，你想不到的我们也有。"] = "Of course, we also have things you can't think of.",
    ["当然，你能不可思议地出现在这里，我就能不可思议地看到你，抓住你。"] = "Of course. Since you can appear here in such an incredible way, I can see you and catch you in an incredible way.",
    ["当然，再去听听他们的叹息声——缅怀那些战争的日子。"] = "Of course, and listen to their sighs again—to remember those days of war.",
    ["当然，前提是获得它的认可，你要不要试试？"] = "Of course, the premise is to gain its approval. Do you want to try?",
    ["当然，又轮到我提问了——你认为生和死的界限是什么？"] = "Of course, it's my turn to ask again—what do you think is the boundary between life and death?",
    ["当然，只是我希望你永远不需要请自己爱的人喝这杯饮品。"] = "Of course, I just hope you never need to treat the person you love to this drink.",
    ["当然，如果他同意的话。"] = "Of course, if he agrees.",
    ["当然，如果你对占卜感兴趣的话也可以去那里试试……"] = "Of course, if you are interested in divination, you can also try it there...",
    ["当然，如果你有空，随时可以回来看看。"] = "Of course, if you have time, you can come back to visit anytime.",
    ["当然，如果你正式提出，我现在就能让你回去。"] = "Of course, if you formally request it, I can let you go back now.",
    ["当然，如果她同意的话。"] = "Of course, if she agrees.",
    ["当然，如果您需要的不仅仅是“游览”，我也有一些特别的“漫游”。毕竟，这座城市光鲜的砖石之下，总有一些角落……需要额外的脚步去丈量。"] = "Of course, if you need more than just \"sightseeing\", I also have some special \"roaming\". After all, beneath the shiny bricks of this city, there are always some corners... that need extra footsteps to measure.",
    ["当然，安全。跟我走，别犹豫，不会有事。"] = "Of course it's safe. Follow me, don't hesitate. Nothing will happen.",
    ["当然，就概率而言。"] = "Of course, in terms of probability.",
    ["当然，希望下次不要在凶案现场了。"] = "Of course, I hope it won't be at a crime scene next time.",
    ["当然，当然！您付出了金钱，但收获了智慧！"] = "Of course, of course! You paid money, but gained wisdom!",
    ["当然，当然，亲爱的，我想吃你做的烤苹果芝士面包。"] = "Of course, of course, dear, I want to eat the baked apple cheese bread you make.",
    ["当然，当然，只要您严肃地告知他！唉，那位先生总是对我很严格，只有在为您拍摄的时候能宽容一些。"] = "Of course, of course, as long as you tell him seriously! Sigh, that gentleman is always very strict with me, and only lenient when shooting for you.",
    ["当然，当然，这是本店最精巧而令人敬畏的武器，帮助您用最优雅的方式解决那些不优雅的问题。"] = "Of course, of course, this is the most exquisite and formidable weapon in our shop, helping you solve those inelegant problems in the most elegant way.",
    ["当然，得在我们的能力范围内。"] = "Of course, within our capabilities.",
    ["当然，您一定是一位下午茶爱好者，我们有最棒的奶油蛋糕和不同风味的精致饼干。"] = "Of course, you must be an afternoon tea enthusiast. We have the best cream cakes and exquisite cookies of various flavors.",
    ["当然，想成名就得写这些。"] = "Of course, you have to write about these things if you want to be famous.",
    ["当然，我也喜欢公道的价格。那么你愿意出多少钱呢？"] = "Certainly, I also appreciate a fair price. So, how much are you willing to pay?",
    ["当然，我们不欢迎没钱的普通人。"] = "Of course, we don't welcome ordinary people without money.",
    ["当然，我们也在进步，贝克兰德的老爷们都要来找我进货呢！"] = "Of course, we are also making progress. The masters in Backlund all come to me to stock up!",
    ["当然，我们是一个小队。"] = "Of course, we are a team.",
    ["当然，我会成为一位体恤民众的好市长。"] = "Of course, I will be a good mayor who cares for the people.",
    ["当然，我会收取必要的利息。"] = "Of course, I will charge the necessary interest.",
    ["当然，我压根没打算再回到这里。"] = "Of course, I never intended to come back here at all.",
    ["当然，我只是想不起来他家在哪，但我想起了遇见他的时候。"] = "Of course. I just can't remember where his house was, but I remember the time I met him.",
    ["当然，我可是在这里工作了二十几年。"] = "Of course, I've worked here for over twenty years.",
    ["当然，我和家人都住这里面。"] = "Of course, my family and I live inside this.",
    ["当然，我愿意！"] = "Of course, I am willing!",
    ["当然，我最初的序列“通识者”也给了很大的帮助——那简直是给穿越者量身定做的魔药。"] = "Of course, my initial Sequence 'Savant' also gave a lot of help—that was a potion tailor-made for a transmigrator.",
    ["当然，我此生的挚爱，我的生命似乎就是因为她才得以存在。"] = "Of course, the love of my life; my existence seems to be because of her.",
    ["当然，我的大臣都很厉害。我们甚至会帮助其他流浪儿。"] = "Of course, my ministers are all very capable. We even help other orphans.",
    ["当然，我确实是一条狗。"] = "Of course, I am indeed a dog.",
    ["当然，我这是在践行罗塞尔大帝的话。三十年足以让命运的河道从东到西，不要轻视贫穷的年轻人！"] = "Of course, I am practicing the words of Emperor Roselle. Thirty years is enough for the river of fate to flow from east to west; do not underestimate poor young people!",
    ["当然，托马斯。看见没有，这不是普通的静止，这是一种预兆。"] = "Of course, Thomas. See? This isn't just a normal stillness; it's an omen.",
    ["当然，教会的某些作风……<P_Heart>（压低声音）</>比如说代罚者们处理事情的方式，有时候过于简单直接。"] = "Of course, certain styles of the Church... <P_Heart>(Lowers voice)</> for example, the way the Mandated Punishers handle things is sometimes too simple and direct.",
    ["当然，晋升的下个序列是——女巫。"] = "Of course, the next Sequence for your advancement is—Witch.",
    ["当然，最有意思的还是因蒂斯邮报，可惜廷根不怎么有。唉，真想念退休前的时光，一切都那么有趣……"] = "Of course, the most interesting one is the Intis Post, but unfortunately, Tingen doesn't have many. Sigh, I really miss the days before retirement, everything was so interesting...",
    ["当然，有什么事？"] = "Of course, what is it?",
    ["当然，有很多现象支持您的死亡判决。但也有很多迹象表明，黛西小姐没有死亡。这或许算是……某种意义上的活着？"] = "Of course, there are many phenomena that support your verdict of death. But there are also many signs indicating that Miss Daisy is not dead. Perhaps this can be considered... alive in a certain sense?",
    ["当然，本能的直觉。"] = "Of course, it's an instinctive intuition.",
    ["当然，毕竟《晚报》就是以小说专栏和文学评论见长，廷根写作爱好者的梦想就是能在《晚报》开设自己的连载。"] = "Of course, after all, the Evening News is known for its novel columns and literary criticism. It is the dream of every writing enthusiast in Tingen to have their own serial published in the Evening News.",
    ["当然，生活艰难，就应该盼点好事。"] = "Of course, life is hard, so one should look forward to good things.",
    ["当然，看我棕色的皮肤，听我古老的发音。"] = "Of course, look at my brown skin, listen to my ancient accent.",
    ["当然，眼见为实。看对眼了就去聊几句，不必拘束。这里没那么多规矩。 "] = "Of course, seeing is believing. If you like what you see, go chat for a bit, no need to be restrained. There aren't that many rules here.",
    ["当然，给你打折！不对……"] = "Of course, I'll give you a discount! No, wait...",
    ["当然，绝不会错，我们已经在黛西小姐身上验证过了。"] = "Of course, there's no mistake; we have already verified it with Miss Daisy.",
    ["当然，至少比你们几个有意思。"] = "Of course. At least it’s more interesting than you lot.",
    ["当然，西奥多，我们是最好的朋友。"] = "Of course, Theodore, we are best friends.",
    ["当然，要我说，谁看到这张名为“私人物品采买清单”，实则是“私人物品愿望清单”的都会感到头疼的。"] = "Of course. If you ask me, anyone who sees this 'Personal Item Purchase List,' which is actually a 'Personal Item Wish List,' would get a headache.",
    ["当然，要记得每次加适量的水，然后确保水温升到足够热度。"] = "Of course, remember to add the right amount of water each time and ensure the water temperature gets hot enough.",
    ["当然，谁不想出生在庄园中，外面的世界可没那么容易。"] = "Of course, who wouldn't want to be born in a manor? The outside world is not that easy.",
    ["当然，足够的实力是享受的基础。不论是想要遨游星空，还是游历大陆，这都是低序列难以做到的。"] = "Of course, sufficient strength is the foundation of enjoyment. Whether you want to roam the starry sky or travel across the continents, this is difficult to achieve at low sequences.",
    ["当然，这一切都取决于您的需求。我们“帽子帮”的宗旨是——只要价格合适，没有什么是我们办不到的。"] = "Of course, it all depends on your needs. The motto of our \"Hat Gang\" is—as long as the price is right, there is nothing we can't do.",
    ["当然，这么多年，我们多少有点默契，但是……"] = "Of course, for so many years, we've had some tacit understanding, but...",
    ["当然，这也因为我们规模足够精简，对加入的成员也有严格的要求。毕竟，每一位成员都是在“愚者”先生的注视下进入学派的。"] = "Of course, this is also because our scale is sufficiently streamlined, and we have strict requirements for members who join. After all, every member enters the school under the gaze of Mr. Fool.",
    ["当然，这也要感谢小克莱恩的支持——他是最早品尝甜冰茶的客人之一，可惜，死亡过早地带走了他。莫雷蒂一家也早早搬到了贝克兰德。"] = "Of course, this is also thanks to the support of little Klein—he was one of the first guests to taste the sweet iced tea. Unfortunately, death took him too early. The Moretti family also moved to Backlund early on.",
    ["当然，这关系到生死。你呢，丽埃娜？"] = "Of course, this is a matter of life and death. What about you, Liana?",
    ["当然，这是一种不错的放松方式——毕竟值夜者工作之外总得有些消遣。你要不要来一局？我可以教你。"] = "Of course, it's a good way to relax—after all, a Nighthawk needs some diversions outside of work. Would you like to play a round? I can teach you.",
    ["当然，这是您的权利。"] = "Of course, that is your right.",
    ["当然，这样的事，在我还是牧师时也做过不少。"] = "Of course, I did plenty of things like this when I was still a priest.",
    ["当然，这样的气势才足以吸引到人们口袋中的金镑。"] = "Of course, only such momentum is enough to attract the gold pounds from people's pockets.",
    ["当然，这种事情最好还是不要告诉上面的人，那些家伙都古板而保守，总认为我们这种特殊的人必然会受到邪神恶魔的引诱而堕落。"] = "Of course, it is best not to tell the higher-ups about such things. Those guys are rigid and conservative, always believing that special people like us will inevitably be lured by evil gods and demons into falling.",
    ["当然，阁下，否则我为什么要出租我的老伙计？"] = "Of course, my lord, otherwise why would I rent out my old buddy?",
    ["当煤气路灯的光芒穿透雨水照耀车身，每个人都将从此处领略到金属的美感。"] = "When the light of the gas street lamp pierces through the rain and shines on the carriage body, everyone will appreciate the beauty of metal from this.",
    ["当玩家触发社交动作时"] = "When player triggers a social action",
    ["当玩家身上的<Disable>邪恶印记</>腐蚀程度累加至100%时，会转化为<Disable>黑暗侵蚀</>状态，玩家变身成为<Disable>幽魂</>持续一段时间，此状态下不可跳跃、不可释放技能。"] = "When the corruption level of the <Disable>Evil Mark</> on a player accumulates to 100%, it transforms into a <Disable>Dark Erosion</> state. The player transforms into a <Disable>Ghost</> for a period of time, during which they cannot jump or use skills.",
    ["当生命值低于 30% 时，受到的所有伤害降低50%，自身移动速度降低 25%。"] = "When Health is below 30%, all damage taken is reduced by 50%, and your movement speed is reduced by 25%.",
    ["当生命值超过70%，扣除50%生命"] = "When Health exceeds 70%, deduct 50% Health",
    ["当目标死亡时，调用该目标筛选ID来获取新的跟随目标（如果Search目标超过1个，则取列表首位为目标），如果Search不到目标，则走默认逻辑，大概是沿此前面向向前移动"] = "When the target dies, call this target filtering ID to get a new follow target (if there are more than 1 Search target, take the first one in the list as the target). If no target can be found, follow the default logic, which is roughly to move forward along the current orientation.",
    ["当目标玩家的理智值<Highlight>低于一定值</>时，即可对其发起安魂。\n\n安魂的<Highlight>治疗成功率</>取决于两个因素：安魂者所在<Highlight>社团的等级</>，以及被安魂者当前的<Highlight>理智值高低</>。社团等级越高、对方理智值越高，安魂成功的概率也越高。\n\n需要注意的是，安魂并非没有风险——<Highlight>若安魂失败</>，参与双方的理智值均有概率受到波动，产生一定损耗。"] = "When the target player's Sanity <Highlight>is below a certain value</>, you can initiate Purification on them. \n\nThe <Highlight>healing success rate</> of Purification depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight>Club</> the Purifier belongs to, and the current <Highlight>Sanity</> level of the person being purified. The higher the Club level and the higher the other person's Sanity, the higher the probability of a successful Purification. \n\nIt should be noted that Purification is not without risk—<Highlight>if Purification fails</>, both participating parties have a chance to experience Sanity fluctuations, resulting in a certain loss.",
    ["当第四纪的历史重现，曾经的四皇之战再度开启，共同争夺神秘年代的秘宝。"] = "As the history of the Fourth Epoch reappears, the War of the Four Emperors begins once again. Compete together for the treasures of that mysterious era.",
    ["当红月再度轮转为一个饱满的圆，“囚犯”途径的诅咒便也如影随形。\n马里奇在苦苦挣扎。作为“活尸”的他，正压抑着那渴求温热血液与鲜活血肉的欲望。冷汗从额头上一滴滴坠下，就如同曾经的无数个满月时分。\n节制，抑或是放纵——\n放纵容易，可放纵之后的他是否还是真正的他？\n好在还有深红月冕的帮助，那件不断散发着绯红清辉的饰品，使佩戴者得以免除满月的影响……理智最终还是在摇摇欲坠中站稳了脚跟。\n今夜的月色依旧是缥缈的红纱，今夜的自我依旧是那个马里奇。 "] = "When the red moon turns into a full circle once again, the curse of the Prisoner pathway follows like a shadow. \n Maric was struggling bitterly. As a Zombie, he was suppressing the desire for warm blood and fresh flesh. Cold sweat dripped from his forehead, just like on countless previous full moons. \n Temperance, or indulgence— \n Indulgence is easy, but after indulging, would he still be the true him? \n Fortunately, there was the help of the Crimson Moon Crown, an accessory that constantly emitted a crimson radiance, allowing the wearer to be spared from the influence of the full moon... Reason finally stood firm amidst the precariousness. \n Tonight's moonlight is still a hazy red veil, and tonight's self is still that same Maric.",
    ["当红月牌化作愚者牌，恭喜你终于逃离噩梦。欢迎来到——非凡世界。"] = "When the Moon card transforms into The Fool card, congratulations on finally escaping the nightmare. Welcome to the—Extraordinary World.",
    ["当纸人散去，肉身亦如戏影，唯有看客的惊叹回荡。"] = "When the paper figure scatters, the flesh is like a shadow in a play; only the audience's exclamation echoes.",
    ["当绯红降临，这里的所有人都会成为生命的养料。"] = "When the crimson descends, everyone here will become nourishment for life.",
    ["当自身获得护盾时触发该效果"] = "Trigger this effect when gaining a Shield",
    ["当超过阈值时输出ObjectList"] = "Output ObjectList when threshold is exceeded.",
    ["当这些可笑的警察反应过来时只留下一具尸体......"] = "By the time these ridiculous police officers reacted, only a corpse was left...",
    ["当这些可笑的警察反应过来时，只看见现场的一具尸体……"] = "When these ridiculous police finally reacted, they only saw a corpse at the scene...",
    ["当迷雾散去时，旅人会发现脚下的路比想象中更柔软，原来绿野不只存在于传说里。"] = "When the fog clears, the traveler will find the road under their feet softer than imagined; it turns out the green fields don't just exist in legends.",
    ["当通灵仪式范围内的友方生命值低于50% 时，对其的治疗量额外提高30%；当范围内的敌方生命值高于50% 时，对其的伤害额外提高30%。"] = "When friendly units within the Spirit Mediumship Ritual range have Health below 50%, healing on them is additionally increased by 30%; when enemy units within range have Health above 50%, damage to them is additionally increased by 30%.",
    ["当面具赋予人偶新生，万物皆可登台，为你揭幕。"] = "When the mask gives the doll new life, everything can take the stage to unveil the curtain for you.",
    ["当面对古老谜题或禁忌仪式的核心时，庞杂的知识网络在你意识中瞬间点亮，浮现出通往真理的路径。<Talent>基于【学识】的检定时，获得优势</>。"] = "When facing the core of ancient puzzles or taboo rituals, the complex knowledge network in your consciousness lights up instantly, revealing the path to the truth. <Talent>When performing a check based on 【Knowledge】, gain Advantage</>.",
    ["当黑暗即将吞噬我，当厄运……咳咳……即将笼罩我，您就是我唯一的曙光……"] = "When darkness is about to swallow me, when misfortune... *cough*... is about to shroud me, you are my only dawn...",
