    ["待会儿你先去找<P_Yellow>老尼尔</>，让他给你安排文献阅读的工作，毕竟你是历史方面的专业人士。"] = "Later, go find <P_Yellow>Old Neil</> and have him arrange some literature reading work for you. After all, you are a professional in history.",
    ["待会儿你看准机会也冲上去，看能不能发现什么。"] = "Wait for an opportunity to rush in later and see if you can discover anything.",
    ["待会我从右边过去，你和羊毛吸引他注意力。"] = "I'll go from the right in a moment; you and Wool distract him.",
    ["待你们再次相遇的那天，用琴声，告诉他你的喜悦与成长。"] = "On the day you meet again, use your music to tell him about your Joy and growth.",
    ["待分配（<Tips_THighlight>%s</>）"] = "Pending Distribution (<Tips_THighlight>%s</>)",
    ["待删除reminder。"] = "Reminder to be deleted.",
    ["待在光芒中，怪物将不敢靠近和攻击。"] = "Stay in the light, and monsters will not dare to approach or attack.",
    ["待复苏的精神体出现后，治疗玩家要<Highlight>优先治疗待复苏的精神体</>，其余玩家保持输出。"] = "After the spirit bodies waiting to be revived appear, healing players must <Highlight>prioritize healing the spirit bodies waiting to be revived</>, while the other players maintain their output.",
    ["待定"] = "TBD",
    ["待宰羔羊"] = "Lamb to the Slaughter",
    ["待开启"] = "Pending",
    ["待开战"] = "Pending Battle",
    ["待拍"] = "Pending Auction",
    ["待机"] = "Idle",
    ["待机个性动作_03"] = "Idle personality action_03",
    ["待遇确实不错，周围的工人们精神状态看起来也很好。如果这就是奇怪声音背后的秘密，也不是什么坏事啊！"] = "The treatment is indeed quite good, and the workers around seem to be in good spirits. If this is the secret behind the strange sounds, it's not a bad thing!",
    ["待队长开启"] = "Waiting for Captain to open",
    ["待领取任务"] = "Pending Quests",
    ["很不幸，你的最后一张牌名叫——“死亡”。"] = "Unfortunately, your final card is named—\"Death\".",
    ["很不幸，她晋升失败了，而失败的后果……"] = "Unfortunately, she failed her advancement, and the consequences of that failure...",
    ["很不错！"] = "Very good!",
    ["很不错，你做到了。赞美愚者。"] = "Very good, you did it. Praise the Fool.",
    ["很不错，我感觉清醒了一些。"] = "Very good, I feel a bit clearer now.",
    ["很久之前倒是有个家伙总和我争得面红耳赤……真是久远的记忆了啊。"] = "A long time ago, there was a guy who always argued with me until his face turned red... That is truly a distant memory.",
    ["很久很久以前，丰饶之树还只是一粒小小的种子。\n\n它沉眠于大地母神教会中，由圣者精心保管。圣者知晓它身负生机与荒芜两种强大的力量，不能被轻易种下。\n\n直到那场背弃誓言的战争降临。大地化为焦土，生机纷纷湮灭，圣者站在同伴和敌人的尸体间，落下了一滴泪。 \n\n至少，要让这片大地重生。 \n\n种子进入泥土后迅速生长，生机怦然降临之时，荒芜也伸出爪牙——于是圣者挺身而出，将无尽的荒芜统统纳入身躯。\n\n变动终于平息，丰饶之树睁开了眼睛。\n\n她化为人形的灵体，懵懂如婴孩，裹着一袭金色的披风。 \n\n一个遥远的声音在她心头回荡： \n\n这是大地的礼物。\n\n这是丰饶的呼唤。"] = "A long, long time ago, the Tree of Abundance was just a tiny seed. \n\n It slept in the Church of the Earth Mother, carefully guarded by a Saint. The Saint knew it carried two powerful forces, vitality and desolation, and could not be easily planted. \n\n Until the war of broken oaths arrived. The earth turned to scorched soil, vitality was annihilated one after another, and the Saint stood among the corpses of companions and enemies, shedding a tear. \n\n At the very least, let this land be reborn. \n\n After the seed entered the soil, it grew rapidly. When vitality suddenly arrived, desolation also stretched out its claws—so the Saint stepped forward, taking all the endless desolation into their own body. \n\n The turmoil finally subsided, and the Tree of Abundance opened its eyes. \n\n She turned into a humanoid spirit, ignorant as a baby, wrapped in a golden cloak. \n\n A distant voice echoed in her heart: \n\n This is the gift of the earth. \n\n This is the call of abundance.",
    ["很久很久以前，在东方的东方，生活着一群巨人。"] = "A long, long time ago, in the far, far east, lived a group of giants.",
    ["很乐意为您效劳。"] = "Happy to be of service.",
    ["很令人不安啊，队长。"] = "It's very unsettling, Captain.",
    ["很像中医"] = "Very much like Traditional Chinese Medicine",
    ["很像学徒途径的能力，但还只能短距离传送……"] = "It's very similar to an Apprentice pathway ability, but it can only teleport short distances for now...",
    ["很像，就是觉得……有点太像了？"] = "You do, it's just that I feel... a bit too much like one?",
    ["很公道的价格。我想我非常乐意支付这笔费用。"] = "A very fair price. I think I am very happy to pay this fee.",
    ["很划算，我愿意出"] = "It's a good deal, I'm willing to pay",
    ["很危险"] = "Very Dangerous",
    ["很危险吧？如果太危险，逃走也没关系，我、我绝不笑话您。"] = "Is it very dangerous? If it's too dangerous, it's okay to run away. I, I definitely won't laugh at you.",
    ["很危险，很诱人"] = "Very dangerous, very tempting",
    ["很厉害啊，我的呢？"] = "That's amazing. Where's mine?",
    ["很及时的解救，帮大忙了，谢谢。"] = "A very timely rescue, it helped a lot, thank you.",
    ["很可惜什么？"] = "A pity what?",
    ["很可惜只有零星的碎片还在眷顾我的记忆。我依稀记得我是在一片漆黑中做试题。一份接着一份。"] = "Unfortunately, only scattered fragments remain in my memory. I vaguely remember taking a test in total darkness. One after another.",
    ["很可惜，我们没有找到最关键的问题，无法还原真相。"] = "It's a pity that we didn't find the most critical question and cannot reconstruct the truth.",
    ["很可惜？"] = "A pity?",
    ["很吓人"] = "Very scary",
    ["很复杂的味道，像在吃夹杂着页岩的泥巴，加上这个很特别的造型，怎么说呢，感觉人生阅历增加了。"] = "It's a very complex flavor, like eating mud mixed with shale. Combined with this very unique presentation, how should I say... I feel like my life experience has increased.",
    ["很多书籍似乎都借出了，并不在架上……"] = "Many books seem to be checked out and are not on the shelves...",
    ["很多人生活很艰难，我想试试能不能争取一点补偿。"] = "Many people are having a hard time, and I want to see if I can fight for some compensation.",
    ["很多人都回不来了，永远留在间海前线，留在明尔明斯克山脉上。"] = "Many people couldn't come back and remained forever on the Midseashire front, on the Minminsk Mountains.",
    ["很多其他东西也可以免费……咳，我是说，报销。"] = "Many other things can also be free... ahem, I mean, reimbursed.",
    ["很多年前库克说过，人们至少要在美食面前保持诚实，我希望他没有忘记自己说的话。"] = "Many years ago, Cook said that people should at least be honest in front of good food. I hope he hasn't forgotten what he said.",
    ["很多年前库克说过，人们至少要在美食面前保持诚实，我希望他没有忘记自己说过的话。"] = "Many years ago, Cook said that people should at least be honest in front of food. I hope he hasn't forgotten what he said.",
    ["很多很多！比如那种能自己移动的蘑菇，还有会长出鱼鳞的蔬菜，还有——"] = "Many, many! For example, mushrooms that can move on their own, vegetables that grow fish scales, and—",
    ["很多故事里都有类似的勇敢角色。"] = "Many stories have similar brave characters.",
    ["很多时候，我以为结束了，但过了几天，科恩又会找到我。"] = "Many times, I thought it was over, but a few days later, Cohen would find me again.",
    ["很多时候，我们都没办法完美地解决问题，都会面临抉择。"] = "Often, we cannot solve problems perfectly and will all face difficult choices.",
    ["很多研究，用了无尽的时间，得到的可能是一个永远无法抵达的真相。"] = "Many studies, after endless time, might only lead to a truth that can never be reached.",
    ["很多酸酸甜甜的果子，可以做出很美味的汤。"] = "Many sweet and sour fruits that can be made into a very delicious soup.",
    ["很奇怪……试试这瓶“显形墨水”。"] = "It's very strange... let's try this bottle of 'Revealing Ink'.",
    ["很好 不愧是“占卜家” 进入冥想很顺利 只比我当初差一点 一点点"] = "Very good, worthy of a 'Seer'. Entering meditation went smoothly, only a little bit worse than I was back then, just a little bit.",
    ["很好……感觉有很多力量从体内涌出来，我似乎又变强不少。"] = "Very good... I feel a lot of power surging from within my body; I seem to have become much stronger again.",
    ["很好。"] = "Very good.",
    ["很好。如果战斗需要用到符咒，只要诵念咒文，灌注灵性后在三秒内丢向目标就可以了。"] = "Very good. If you need to use a charm in battle, just chant the incantation, infuse it with spirituality, and throw it at the target within three seconds.",
    ["很好。接下来是最关键的一步：建立灵性之墙。这堵无形的墙，将隔绝内外，保护仪式不受干扰，也防止内部力量无谓逸散。"] = "Very good. Next is the most critical step: establishing a Wall of Spirituality. This invisible wall will isolate the inside from the outside, protecting the ritual from interference and preventing the unnecessary dissipation of internal power.",
    ["很好。时间差不多了，该前往灰雾之上了。"] = "Very well. It is about time; I should head above the gray fog.",
    ["很好吃！老维尔先生，下次我们订餐，一定会订这个。"] = "It's delicious! Mr. Old Will, next time we order food, we will definitely order this.",
    ["很好啊！船长给了我很大的自由。我可以做自己的实验，虽然地方小了点，但已经够用了！"] = "It's great! The captain gives me a lot of freedom. I can do my own experiments, and although the space is a bit small, it's enough!",
    ["很好学嘛，不错。"] = "Very eager to learn, not bad.",
    ["很好很好，给你两分钟！然后我们就开始！"] = "Very good, very good. You have two minutes! Then we start!",
    ["很好的商业头脑……"] = "Good business sense...",
    ["很好笑，达尔。"] = "Very funny, Dal.",
    ["很好！三、二、一——非常完美！"] = "Great! Three, two, one—perfect!",
    ["很好！你已经学会了叹息之种的使用，下面尝试下进阶挑战！"] = "Very good! You have learned how to use the Seed of Sighs; now, try the advanced challenge!",
    ["很好！有这样的干劲我们做什么都会成功的！"] = "Great! With this kind of drive, we will succeed in everything we do!",
    ["很好！看来你已经成功开启旅行尖碑。"] = "Very good! It seems you have successfully activated the Travel Stele.",
    ["很好，不过学校现在查的这么严，不知道那个神秘卖家还在不在那里，你可以去碰碰运气。"] = "Very good, but the school is checking so strictly now, I don't know if that mysterious seller is still there. You can go try your luck.",
    ["很好，亲爱的，你又胖了。"] = "Very good, darling, you've gotten fat again.",
    ["很好，你学会自己应对简单的危机了。"] = "Very good, you have learned to deal with simple crises on your own.",
    ["很好，你真是一个善良的{{小伙|姑娘}}。"] = "Very good, you are truly a kind young {{man/woman|}}.",
    ["很好，你能看穿密室是伪造的，现场被改动过，推理出了嫁祸仆人的手法，比那些只会盯着表面证据的家伙强得多。"] = "Very good. You were able to see through that the locked room was faked, the scene had been altered, and you deduced the method of framing the servant. You are much better than those guys who only stare at surface evidence.",
    ["很好，你足够执着，我允许你了解我的身份。"] = "Very well, you are persistent enough; I allow you to know my identity.",
    ["很好，准备完成，可以开演了。"] = "Very good, preparations complete. We can begin the performance.",
    ["很好，在这里，清醒反而是一种罪过……"] = "Very good, here, being sober is actually a sin...",
    ["很好，就这样继续保持！"] = "Very good, keep it up!",
    ["很好，我已经通知代罚者了。东区和西区由他们负责。"] = "Very good, I have already notified the Mandated Punishers. They are responsible for the East and West Districts.",
    ["很好，接下来要布置道具。"] = "Very good. Next, let's set up the props.",
    ["很好，等圣堂批复下来，你就是我们的一员了，咳咳。"] = "Very good. Once the Holy Cathedral approves, you will be one of us. *Cough, cough.*",
    ["很好，罗塞尔大帝在成为执政官后，开始推广讲卫生，预防、减少以至消灭疾病，提高健康水平的运动。"] = "Very well. After becoming Consul, Emperor Roselle began promoting a campaign to emphasize hygiene, prevent, reduce, and even eradicate diseases, and improve health standards.",
    ["很好，让我来解决这区区黄金马桶。"] = "Very well, let me handle this mere golden toilet.",
    ["很好，除了老实人报，其他都快卖完了。"] = "Very well, except for the Honest Newspaper, everything else is almost sold out.",
    ["很容易听见不该听的，甚至看见不该看的。"] = "It's easy to hear things you shouldn't, or even see things you shouldn't.",
    ["很对劲，这是罗塞尔大帝最著名的诗歌！"] = "It's very right; this is Emperor Roselle's most famous poem!",
    ["很少被困住，也很难被阻隔，总是有办法逃脱和通过，法师流派的初始，追寻自由的足迹。"] = "Rarely trapped, and difficult to be blocked, always having a way to escape and pass through; the beginning of the mage school, chasing the footprints of freedom.",
    ["很少，感谢查尼斯门不像我这样喜欢聊天。但我知道有人遇到过里面的封印物跑出来打招呼的情况。"] = "Rarely. I'm grateful that the Chanis Gate doesn't like to chat like I do. But I know of cases where someone encountered a Sealed Artifact that escaped from inside to say hello.",
    ["很平常的故事。那时候我和大多数人一样，只是想在廷根找个安稳的工作。"] = "It's a very ordinary story. At that time, like most people, I just wanted to find a stable job in Tingen.",
    ["很快……就能结束了吧……<P_Heart>（声音渐息）</>"] = "Soon... it will be over, right... <P_Heart> (voice fades) </>",
    ["很快就……好了！"] = "It will be... fixed soon!",
    ["很快就能——"] = "Soon, I will be able to—",
    ["很快就能见到伊琳了吧。"] = "I'll be able to see Irene soon.",
    ["很快我也可以回家了……"] = "Soon I can go home too...",
    ["很快这里的生活设施就能跟市区里一样了。"] = "Soon, the living facilities here will be just as good as those in the city center.",
    ["很快，很快我也可以回家了……"] = "Soon, very soon I can go home too...",
    ["很想和你再聊一会，但我要去替换队长值班了，再见。"] = "I would love to chat with you more, but I have to go replace the captain on duty. Goodbye.",
    ["很抱歉 但感谢你的帮助"] = "I'm very sorry, but thank you for your help",
    ["很抱歉，%s取消了%s俱乐部的创建，诸位冒险家可在俱乐部列表中选择其它俱乐部加入"] = "We are sorry, %s has canceled the creation of the %s Club. Adventurers, please select another club from the list to join.",
    ["很抱歉，七日誓约活动报名已经结束。"] = "Sorry, registration for the seven-day covenant event has ended.",
    ["很抱歉，主教阁下现在并不在教堂内，如果您需要，可以向教堂里任何一位牧师寻求帮助。"] = "I'm sorry, the Bishop is not in the church right now. If you need anything, you can seek help from any priest in the church.",
    ["很抱歉，丽埃娜，乔纳尔医生……"] = "I am very sorry, Liana, Dr. Jonar...",
    ["很抱歉，但感谢你的帮助。"] = "I'm very sorry, but thank you for your help.",
    ["很抱歉，如果我们来得更早些，就不会发生这样的事。"] = "I'm very sorry. If we had arrived earlier, this wouldn't have happened.",
    ["很抱歉，市场不接待陌生人。"] = "I'm very sorry, the market does not accept strangers.",
    ["很抱歉，我一次次失去了以往的记忆，正在寻回它们的途中。"] = "I’m sorry, I have lost my past memories time and time again, and I am in the process of recovering them.",
    ["很抱歉，我不该提这个的。"] = "I'm very sorry, I shouldn't have brought that up.",
    ["很抱歉，我也同情小黛西的遭遇，但你们不能永远活在危险的假象中。"] = "I am very sorry. I also sympathize with little Daisy's plight, but you cannot live forever in a dangerous illusion.",
    ["很抱歉，我还在海上，还未返回陆地。"] = "I’m sorry, I’m still at sea and haven’t returned to land yet.",
    ["很抱歉，未能查询到该俱乐部"] = "Sorry, could not find this club.",
    ["很抱歉，未能查询到该玩家。"] = "Sorry, could not find that player.",
    ["很抱歉，本次活动没有合适你的契约"] = "Sorry, there are no suitable Oaths for you in this event",
    ["很抱歉，让你坐在这有违我们的时尚标准。"] = "I'm sorry, letting you sit here violates our fashion standards.",
    ["很抱歉，这匹马跑不动了。"] = "I'm sorry, this horse can't run anymore.",
    ["很抱歉，韦尔奇昨天过世了，娜娅女士也是。"] = "I'm very sorry, Welch passed away yesterday, and so did Ms. Naya.",
    ["很接近之前的味道，但还是不太对……"] = "It's very close to the previous taste, but it's still not quite right...",
    ["很旧的海报1"] = "Very Old Poster 1",
    ["很旧的海报2"] = "Very Old Poster 2",
    ["很有力量的观点。不过，总觉得其中似乎少了一丝……韵味？"] = "A very powerful point of view. However, I feel like it's missing a touch of... charm?",
    ["很有天赋的小朋友，给你点奖励，继续陪我跳一会！"] = "Very talented little one, here's a reward, keep dancing with me for a while!",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，咖啡的芬芳，被唇齿歌唱着，苦和甜又相对……"] = "A very interesting poem. The fragrance of coffee, sung by lips and teeth, with bitterness and sweetness in contrast...",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，少女歌声当中唱的究竟是怎样的光明呢。"] = "A very interesting poem. What kind of light is the girl singing about in her song?",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，少女的心灵是最美丽的事物了。歌声一定很悦耳吧。"] = "A very interesting poem. A girl's heart is the most beautiful thing. The singing must be very pleasant.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，就算咖啡苦涩，壁炉也会一直燃烧的……"] = "A very interesting poem. Even if the coffee is bitter, the fireplace will keep burning...",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，心灵一定是感受到了歌声的悦耳……"] = "A very interesting poem. The heart must have felt the sweetness of the singing...",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，感觉少女有着熊熊燃烧的心灵和血液呢。"] = "A very interesting poem. It feels like the girl has a burning heart and blood.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，柔软的心灵也会被火光所振奋吧……咖啡也不再苦涩了。"] = "A very interesting poem. A soft heart would be stirred by the firelight, wouldn't it? The coffee is no longer bitter either.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，柔软的心灵在歌颂美味的咖啡呢。"] = "A very interesting poem. A soft heart is praising the delicious coffee.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，歌咏咖啡的芬芳，应该贴在咖啡馆里。"] = "Very interesting verses. Singing the praises of the fragrance of coffee, it should be posted in the cafe.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，火光是来自咖啡馆里的壁炉吧……"] = "Very interesting verses. The firelight must be from the fireplace in the cafe...",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，用柔软的内心来赞美青春吧。"] = "A very interesting poem. Use a soft heart to praise youth.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，绿裙少女在歌唱着永恒的太阳呢。"] = "A very interesting poem. The girl in the green dress is singing of the eternal sun.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，芬芳的是绿裙少女的花样年华吧。"] = "A very interesting poem. The fragrance must be the flowery prime of the girl in the green dress.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，芬芳的青春当然是值得赞颂的。"] = "A very interesting poem. Fragrant youth is certainly worth praising.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，赞美壁炉边的热咖啡吗？感觉心里暖暖的。"] = "A very interesting poem. Praising the hot coffee by the fireplace? It feels warm in my heart.",
    ["很有意思的诗句啊，赞美太阳的绿裙女孩吗？感觉很是动人呢。"] = "Very interesting verses. Is it the girl in the green dress praising the sun? It feels very moving.",
    ["很有趣"] = "Very interesting",
    ["很有道理……人体是一种立体的艺术，关注服饰的每一个角度，这样的美丽才是无懈可击的。"] = "That makes a lot of sense... The human body is a three-dimensional art form. Only by paying attention to every angle of the clothing can such beauty be flawless.",
    ["很流畅，先生。您不应该感到紧张，我没见过更好的发挥了。"] = "Very fluent, sir. You shouldn't feel nervous; I haven't seen a better performance.",
    ["很浓郁的香草味，按美食栏目的评论风格，就像是……"] = "A very rich herbal scent. Following the style of a food critic's review, it's like...",
    ["很满意"] = "Very satisfied",
    ["很漂亮啊"] = "Very pretty",
    ["很特别的非凡者，如果将来有机会见到她……"] = "A very special Beyonder, if there's a chance to see her in the future...",
    ["很痛， 但要，战斗。\n失败了，痛，没能守住。\n——痛苦，在消散？\n该，休息了。再见，主人。"] = "Very painful, but must, fight. \n Failed, pain, failed to protect. \n ——Pain, is it dissipating? \n Time, to rest. Goodbye, Master.",
    ["很简单的构造，很快就能修好。"] = "A very simple structure, it will be fixed soon.",
    ["很简单，却也是很珍贵的童话。"] = "A very simple, yet very precious fairy tale.",
    ["很简单，我教你，握紧这把银质匕首。"] = "It's very simple, I'll teach you, hold this silver dagger tightly.",
    ["很简单，我的朋友，随便说一个词就好，最好和工厂有关。"] = "It's simple, my friend, just say any word, preferably related to the factory.",
    ["很简单，站在那里就可以。"] = "It's very simple, just stand there.",
    ["很简单，这个海盗杀了我那可怜的丈夫，得到了我们的家信。"] = "It's simple, this pirate killed my poor husband and got our family letters.",
    ["很精神，来，转两圈给我看看。"] = "Very spirited. Come on, spin around and let me see.",
    ["很精致的帽子。你父母一定很珍惜它。 "] = "A very exquisite hat. Your parents must have cherished it.",
    ["很美妙的气息"] = "A wonderful scent",
    ["很美妙的气息 不是吗"] = "A wonderful scent, isn't it?",
    ["很美妙的气息，不是吗？"] = "A wonderful scent, isn't it?",
    ["很聪明。他在跟踪你的过程中突然失控，精神发狂，身体也异变成了怪物。"] = "Very smart. He suddenly lost control while tracking you, his mind went mad, and his body mutated into a monster.",
    ["很赚对不对？我们也想赚，所以才要买你的票。"] = "Very profitable, right? We also want to make money, which is why we want to buy your ticket.",
    ["很远的地方？那是哪里呀，是贝克兰德以外的城市吗？"] = "A very far place? Where is that, is it a city outside of Backlund?",
    ["很适合它！爵士，爵士——"] = "It suits it perfectly! Jazz, Jazz—",
    ["很遗憾"] = "It's a pity",
    ["很遗憾……库尔斯一个小时前去世了。我是库尔斯的副手，现在临时接替他。"] = "I'm sorry... Cours passed away an hour ago. I am Cours's deputy, and I am temporarily taking his place.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第一轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the first round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第三轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the third round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第二轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the second round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第五轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the fifth round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第六轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the sixth round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您在小组赛第四轮中落败，奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that you lost in the fourth round of the group stage. The reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾您的战队晋级失败，结算奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "We regret that your team failed to advance. The settlement reward has been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["很遗憾！活动已结束，您所在的分线首领未被击杀，无法获得奖励，祝您下次获得好成绩！"] = "Unfortunately, the event has ended. The boss in your sub-channel was not defeated, so you cannot receive rewards. We wish you better luck next time!",
    ["很遗憾，您的舞伴解除了配对关系"] = "Unfortunately, your dance partner has dissolved the pairing relationship.",
    ["很遗憾，敌方阵营已成功<PVPHighlight>占领祭坛</>"] = "Unfortunately, the enemy camp has successfully <PVPHighlight> occupied the altar </>.",
    ["很遗憾，还是没有你的稿件。"] = "I'm sorry, there is still no manuscript from you.",
    ["很难准备好"] = "Hard to be prepared",
    ["很香，希望小黛西也能闻到"] = "It smells good, I hope little Daisy can smell it too",
    ["很高兴你做出了这样的决定。对这个年纪的孩子来说，缺少陪伴也是一种危险。"] = "I'm glad you made this decision. For a child of this age, a lack of companionship is also a kind of danger.",
    ["很高兴你的理解，年轻人，有空来霍伊大学听我的演讲吧！"] = "I'm glad you understand, young man. Come to Hoy University to attend my lecture when you have time!",
    ["很高兴你能加入塔罗学派，这里都是你的同伴。"] = "I am very glad you could join the Tarot Club; everyone here is your partner.",
    ["很高兴听到你这么说……你果然有颗温柔的心。"] = "I'm very happy to hear you say that... you really do have a gentle heart.",
    ["很高兴听到你这么说。"] = "I'm glad to hear you say that.",
    ["很高兴听到你这样说，真的，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "I'm very happy to hear you say that, really, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["很高兴告诉大家，著名的“大胃王”洛罗被廷根和谐安宁的氛围吸引，决定暂时定居在此！\n\n他曾在1小时内吃掉100个迪西馅饼！126块小羊排！\n\n他将随时于西大道表演自己超乎常人的胃口！欢迎各位前来欣赏！"] = "I am happy to tell everyone that the famous \"Big Eater\" Loro has been attracted by the harmonious and peaceful atmosphere of Tingen and has decided to settle here temporarily! \n\n He once ate 100 Dicy pies in 1 hour! 126 small lamb chops! \n\n He will perform his extraordinary appetite on West Avenue at any time! Everyone is welcome to come and enjoy!",
    ["很高兴我们达成共识。"] = "I'm glad we've reached a consensus.",
    ["很高兴见到你，茶会主人。"] = "It's a pleasure to meet you, host of the tea party.",
    ["很高兴见到您，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "It is a pleasure to see you, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["很高兴认识你，你叫什么名字？"] = "It's a pleasure to meet you. What is your name?",
    ["很高兴认识你，我叫艾登。"] = "Nice to meet you, my name is Aiden.",
    ["律令法师"] = "Imperative Mage",
    ["律令法师魔药"] = "Law Magician Potion",
    ["律令营北"] = "Law Camp North",
    ["律令营北交互物"] = "Law Camp north interactive object",
    ["律令营北站牌"] = "Lüling Camp North bus stop",
    ["律令营南"] = "Law Camp South",
    ["律令营南交互物"] = "Law Camp South interaction object",
    ["律令营南站牌"] = "Lüling Camp South Bus Stop",
    ["律令裁决"] = "Law Judgment",
    ["律令裁决-眩晕"] = "Law Judgment - Stun",
    ["律冕"] = "Crown of Law",
    ["律动节拍"] = "Rhythmic Beat",
    ["律师"] = "Lawyer",
    ["律法的双刃"] = "Dual Blades of Legislation",
    ["律法裁决"] = "Judgment of Law",
    ["律象探知者"] = "Law Phenomenon Explorer",
    ["徐一清"] = "Xu Yiqing",
    ["徐凯明-家园障碍物1"] = "Xu Kaiming-Homestead Obstacle 1",
    ["徐州"] = "Xuzhou",
    ["徐心怡-日常本玩偶-开始"] = "Xu Xinyi - Daily Quest Doll - Start",
    ["徐心怡-日常本玩偶-结束"] = "Xu Xinyi - Daily Quest Doll - End",
    ["徐梓源"] = "Xu Ziyuan",
    ["徒劳的祈愿，是无望者的墓志铭。"] = "Futile prayers are the epitaphs of the hopeless.",
    ["徒步者"] = "Hiker",
    ["徒步追赶皮特"] = "Chase Pete on foot",
    ["徕卡"] = "Leica",
    ["得了吧！你昨晚边用积水照脑袋边哭的时候可不是这么说的。不就是买点草药吗？"] = "Give it a rest! You weren't saying that last night when you were crying while looking at your reflection in a puddle. Isn't it just buying some herbs?",
    ["得了吧！几百年都过去了，出事还轮得到我们头上吗？不去就别耽误我玩牌。"] = "Come on! Hundreds of years have passed, would it be our turn to have something happen? If you're not going, don't stop me from playing cards.",
    ["得了吧，先生！您不就是想让我们互相压价吗？"] = "Forget it, sir! You just want us to undercut each other, don't you?",
    ["得了吧，厂里哪有钱搞这些，能按时发工资就不错了。"] = "Forget it, the factory doesn't have the money for that. We're lucky if we get paid on time.",
    ["得了吧，她是黑比尔的人，谁敢动？"] = "Forget it, she's one of Black Bill's people, who would dare touch her?",
    ["得了吧，我宁愿多欣赏欣赏这些艺术品。"] = "Forget it, I'd rather admire these artworks more.",
    ["得了吧，老兄！你这戏码演了三次了！每次都是为了骗我请客喝酒！赶紧给我滚回来！"] = "Give it a rest, brother! You've performed this act three times already! Every time it's just to trick me into treating you to drinks! Hurry up and get back here!",
    ["得了吧，谁祖上没风光过，现在呢，你当你的珠宝匠，我当我的码头工……"] = "Forget it, whose ancestors weren't glorious? Now, you're your jeweler, and I'm my dock worker...",
    ["得了吧，顶着大风大雨大太阳还得推磨一样干一整天？"] = "Come on, having to grind like a millstone all day under the wind, rain, and sun?",
    ["得了得了，小心吹牛吹太大，圆不回来了啊。"] = "Alright, alright, be careful not to brag too much and fail to back it up.",
    ["得先给小姐准备点吃的……"] = "Must prepare some food for the young lady first...",
    ["得再占卜一次。问清楚她究竟去了哪里，要去做什么。"] = "I need another divination. I must find out exactly where she went and why.",
    ["得再试试那个仪式，说不定就能回去了，我记得……需要食物作为仪式的媒介。"] = "I have to try that ritual again. Maybe I can go back. I remember... it needs food as a medium for the ritual.",
    ["得出结论"] = "Reach a conclusion",
    ["得分"] = "Score",
    ["得分规则"] = "Scoring Rules",
    ["得分：%s"] = "Score: %s",
    ["得到了肯定的答案。回去先在队长那里做一些铺垫，比如说每次去占卜俱乐部后都感受灵性活泼，再随意描述从占卜中总结出来的守则……"] = "I received a positive answer. I'll go back and lay some groundwork with the Captain, such as describing how my spirituality feels lively after each visit to the Divination Club, and then casually describing the rules summarized from divination...",
    ["得到了肯定的答案。回去先在队长那里做一些铺垫，比如说每次去占卜家俱乐部后都感受灵性活泼，再随意描述从占卜中总结出来的守则……"] = "Received a positive answer. Go back and lay some groundwork with the Captain first, for example, by mentioning that I feel my spirituality is more active every time I visit the Tarot Club, and then casually describe the rules summarized from divination...",
    ["得到的回答越是强烈，转动的速度也就越快。"] = "The stronger the answer, the faster it rotates.",
    ["得去找第二个物品了，“一物收存，新生之种，葬于石像之旁……”？"] = "I need to go find the second item, \"One item stored, a seed of rebirth, buried beside the stone statue...\"?",
    ["得去把门堵住！"] = "I have to go block the door!",
    ["得小心点，不能被他发现。"] = "I have to be careful not to be discovered by him.",
    ["得尽快把它们存放在查尼斯门后，并把情况通报给贝克兰德总部。"] = "We must store them behind the Chanis Gate as soon as possible and report the situation to the Backlund headquarters.",
    ["得尽快控制住局面，防止更多人受到失控力量的污染。"] = "We must control the situation as soon as possible to prevent more people from being corrupted by the out-of-control power.",
    ["得快点找到芬恩。"] = "Must find Finn quickly.",
    ["得想办法先让白莉夫人离开，以免她受到伤害。"] = "I must find a way to get Lady Beryl to leave first, so she doesn't get hurt.",
    ["得想办法追上她……试试灵性之跃吧。"] = "I must find a way to catch up to her... I'll try a Leap of Spirituality.",
    ["得想想办法恢复到原来的秩序…"] = "Must think of a way to restore it to the original order...",
    ["得想想办法，被困住就太危险了。"] = "I must think of a way; it's too dangerous to be trapped.",
    ["得手后不补刀，直接退走。似乎不是刺杀，是表演。"] = "She retreated immediately after the strike without delivering a finishing blow. It doesn't seem like an assassination; it's a performance.",
    ["得找一位看着足够和蔼的客人……"] = "Need to find a guest who looks kind enough...",
    ["得看你要问什么问题，才能挑合适的占卜师。 "] = "It depends on what question you want to ask to choose the right diviner.",
    ["得赶紧堵住正确的门！阻止它进来！"] = "Must hurry and block the right door! Stop it from coming in!",
    ["得跟上去看看，他到底要做什么……"] = "I have to follow him and see what he is actually going to do...",
