    ["快 快出去！离开这里"] = "Quick, quick, get out! Leave this place.",
    ["快 送我去城外码头 立刻出发！"] = "Quick, send me to the dock outside the city, leave immediately!",
    ["快……走……"] = "Quickly... leave...",
    ["快一个星期没吃东西了……"] = "I haven't eaten for almost a week...",
    ["快一点，快要跟丢了！"] = "Hurry, we're about to lose them!",
    ["快一点，要跟丢了。"] = "Hurry up, we're going to lose them.",
    ["快上车！别让他跑了！"] = "Get in! Don't let him run away!",
    ["快下车，别堵在车门口。"] = "Get off the carriage quickly; don't block the door.",
    ["快两年了，终于成功了，“愚者”先生允诺的奇迹终于实现了！"] = "It's been almost two years, and it's finally a success. The miracle promised by Mr. Fool has finally been realized!",
    ["快为“蓝领结”约瑟夫投上你宝贵的一票！"] = "Quickly cast your precious vote for \"Blue Tie\" Joseph!",
    ["快乐"] = "Happiness",
    ["快乐永驻。与好友赠礼功能绑定，本版本不进行投放和使用。"] = "Eternal Happiness. Bound to the friend gifting function; not released or usable in this version.",
    ["快乐的小丑梦到了<Disable>一个大转盘，会随机分配多种花色给玩家</>，一段时间后没有站到转盘对应花色区域的玩家，会受到小丑的惩罚。需要注意，<Disable>哭泣的小丑</>会欺骗玩家！"] = "The Happy Clown dreams of <Disable> a Big Wheel, which will randomly assign various suits to players </>. After a period of time, players who are not standing in the area corresponding to their suit on the wheel will be punished by the Clown. Note that the <Disable> Weeping Clown </> will deceive players!",
    ["快乐的小丑梦到了<Disable>一个大转盘，会随机分配花色给玩家</>，一段时间后没有站到转盘对应花色区域的玩家，会受到小丑的惩罚。"] = "The Happy Clown dreams of <Disable>a big wheel, which will randomly assign suits to players</>. After a period of time, players who are not standing in the area corresponding to their suit on the wheel will be punished by the Clown.",
    ["快了……就要成功了……这些都是必要的牺牲……"] = "Almost there... it's about to succeed... these are all necessary sacrifices...",
    ["快五年了，伦纳德，我们多少都有些改变。"] = "It's been almost five years, Leonard. We've all changed a bit.",
    ["快击碎所有的诱惑水晶，清除迷惑效果。"] = "Quickly shatter all Seduction Crystals to clear the confusion effect.",
    ["快分别站到菇毒前，聚集水滴的力量！"] = "Quickly stand in front of the mushroom poison separately and gather the power of the water drops!",
    ["快别说了……"] = "Stop talking...",
    ["快到了，前面有座很漂亮的雕像。"] = "We're almost there. There's a beautiful statue ahead.",
    ["快到我了吗……"] = "Is it almost my turn...",
    ["快去堵住正确的门！上次是壁炉旁边的！"] = "Hurry and block the right door! Last time it was the one by the fireplace!",
    ["快去指导下一幕戏吧。"] = "Go and direct the next scene.",
