    ["快去！呃……不，您不要去，那边实在是太可怕了！"] = "Go quickly! Uh... no, don't go, it's truly terrifying over there!",
    ["快和我说说，你都测了什么？这么神奇吗？"] = "Tell me quickly, what did you test? Is it that magical?",
