    ["快速发力！腿部发力！膝盖放低！"] = "Power up quickly! Use your legs! Keep your knees low!",
    ["快速发动两次攻击，只命中一个目标时伤害提升。"] = "Quickly launch two Attacks; Damage is increased if only one target is hit.",
    ["快速后跳，与敌人拉开距离，3秒内再次点击可以使用左轮手枪，对前方敌人造成2次连续的射击伤害。\n\n一把泛着黄铜光泽的左轮，来自一位旧友，手枪的威力与外表一样漂亮。"] = "Quickly backflip to create distance from the enemy. Clicking again within 3 seconds allows the use of a revolver to deal 2 consecutive shots to enemies in front.\n\n A revolver with a brass luster, from an old friend. The power of the pistol is as beautiful as its appearance.",
    ["快速射击"] = "Rapid Shoot",
