    ["忻州"] = "Xinzhou",
    ["忻语"] = "Xinyu",
    ["忽然一辆马车疾驰而过，小女孩被马车撞倒，雏菊也被碾碎。\n女士（画外音）：噢，黛西！"] = "Suddenly a carriage sped by, the little girl was knocked down by the carriage, and the daisies were crushed. \nLady (voiceover): Oh, Daisy!",
    ["忽然一道道深红光芒落下，在不同座位上腾起，变成了一个个面目模糊的人。"] = "Suddenly, beams of crimson light descend, rising from different seats and turning into people with blurred faces.",
    ["忽然有字了！这本书会自己写字？！"] = "Suddenly there's text! This book can write by itself?!",
    ["忽然，管家脸上的痛苦消失得无影无踪，嘴角勾起一个不该属于他的弧度。"] = "Suddenly, the pain on the butler's face vanished without a trace, and the corners of his mouth curled into an arc that shouldn't have belonged to him.",
    ["忽略"] = "Ignore",
    ["忽略宣战时间区间检查（客户端）"] = "Ignore declaration of war time interval check (client)",
    ["忽略并继续装配"] = "Ignore and continue assembly",
    ["忽略并覆盖"] = "Ignore and Overwrite",
    ["忽略掉废稿上的无数的“狗屎”"] = "Ignoring the countless \"bullshit\" on the discarded drafts.",
    ["忽视物理防御"] = "Ignore Physical Defense",
    ["忽视物理防御_数值"] = "Ignore Physical Defense_Value",
    ["忽视物理防御_百分比加成"] = "Ignore Physical Defense_Percentage Bonus",
    ["忽视目标{*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi}的魔法防御（百分比效果后于固定值效果生效），降低目标魔法防御对魔法攻击基础值的减免。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的忽视防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。"] = "Ignores {*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi} of the target's Magic Defense (percentage effects take effect after fixed value effects), reducing the target's Magic Defense reduction against base Magic Attack values. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Ignore Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability.",
    ["忽视目标{*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi}的物理防御（百分比效果后于固定值效果生效），降低目标物理防御对物理攻击基础值的减免。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的忽视防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。"] = "Ignores {*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi} of the target's Physical Defense (percentage effects take effect after fixed value effects), reducing the target's Physical Defense reduction against base Physical Attack values. \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Ignore Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability.",
    ["忽视目标{*d,F1690001,mDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi}的魔法防御，降低目标魔法防御对魔法攻击基础值的减免。（百分比效果后于数值效果生效）\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的破防超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>魔法防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores {*d,F1690001,mDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi} of the target's magic defense, reducing the target's magic defense reduction on the base magic Attack value. (Percentage effects take effect after numerical effects) \nThe reduced base Attack value has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>20%</>. If the increased Armor Break exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage boost capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Magic Defense</> attribute.",
    ["忽视目标{*d,F1690001,mDefReduce}点魔法防御，降低目标魔法防御对魔法攻击基础值的减免。（百分比效果后于数值效果生效）\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的破防超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>魔法防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores {*d,F1690001,mDefReduce} points of the target's Magic Defense, reducing the target's Magic Defense reduction against base Magic Attack values. (Percentage effects take effect after numerical effects) \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Armor Break exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Magic Defense </> attribute.",
    ["忽视目标{*d,F1690001,pDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi}的物理防御，降低目标物理防御对物理攻击基础值的减免。（百分比效果后于数值效果生效）\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的破防超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>物理防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores {*d,F1690001,pDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi} of the target's physical defense, reducing the target's physical defense reduction on the base physical Attack value. (Percentage effects take effect after numerical effects) \nThe reduced base Attack value has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>20%</>. If the increased Armor Break exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage boost capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Physical Defense</> attribute.",
    ["忽视目标{*d,F1690001,pDefReduce}点物理防御，降低目标物理防御对物理攻击基础值的减免。（百分比效果后于数值效果生效）\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的破防超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>物理防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores {*d,F1690001,pDefReduce} points of the target's Physical Defense, reducing the target's Physical Defense reduction against base Physical Attack values. (Percentage effects take effect after numerical effects) \n The base Attack value after reduction has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 20% </>; if the increased Armor Break exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Physical Defense </> attribute.",
    ["忽视目标的护甲，降低目标对物理或魔法攻击的抵抗。破甲超过目标的护甲时，超出部分每3点转换为1点攻击。\n\n角色破甲：{*d,F1690001,ShieldBreak}"] = "Ignores the target's Armor, reducing the target's resistance to physical or magic attacks. When Armor Break exceeds the target's Armor, every 3 points of excess are converted into 1 point of Attack. \n \n Character Armor Break: {*d,F1690001,ShieldBreak}",
    ["忽视目标的格挡，从而降低伤害被目标格挡的概率。穿刺超过目标的格挡后，可以进一步降低自身伤害被格挡的概率（最多将被格挡的概率降至0）。"] = "Ignores the target's Block, thereby reducing the probability of damage being blocked by the target. After Piercing exceeds the target's Block, it can further reduce the probability of your own damage being blocked (the probability of being blocked can be reduced to 0 at most).",
    ["忽视目标的物理格挡，在基础穿刺率<Highlight>75%</>的基础上，提高物理伤害穿刺（未被格挡）的概率。\n穿刺率存在<Highlight>100%</>的上限和<Highlight>25%</>的下限，提升的穿刺超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>物理格挡</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores the target's Physical Block. Based on the base Pierce rate of <Highlight> 75% </>, it increases the probability of physical damage piercing (not being blocked). \n The Pierce rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 100% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 25% </>; if the increased Pierce exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Physical Block </> attribute.",
    ["忽视目标的物理防御或魔法防御（百分比效果后于固定值效果生效），基于攻击伤害类型。\n\n角色物理破防：{*d,F1690001,pDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi}\n角色魔法破防：{*d,F1690001,mDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi}"] = "Ignores the target's physical defense or magic defense (percentage effects take effect after fixed value effects), based on the attack damage type. \n \n Character Physical Armor Break: {*d,F1690001,pDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,pDefDivi} \n Character Magic Armor Break: {*d,F1690001,mDefReduce}+{*.1f**,F1690001,mDefDivi}",
    ["忽视目标的特殊防御{*d,F1690001,AdditionalIgnore}点，降低目标对特殊攻击的抵抗。特殊破防超过目标的特殊防御后，可以进一步增强特殊攻击的伤害提高效果。\n\n角色特殊破防：{*d,F1690001,AdditionalIgnore}"] = "Ignores {*d,F1690001,AdditionalIgnore} points of the target's Special Defense, reducing the target's resistance to Special Attack. After Special Armor Break exceeds the target's Special Defense, it can further enhance the damage increase effect of Special Attack. \n \n Character Special Armor Break: {*d,F1690001,AdditionalIgnore}",
    ["忽视目标的防御（百分比效果后于固定值效果生效），降低目标防御对攻击基础值的减免。"] = "Ignores the target's Defense (percentage effects take effect after fixed value effects), reducing the target's Defense reduction against base Attack values.",
    ["忽视目标的魔法格挡，在基础穿刺率<Highlight>75%</>的基础上，提高魔法伤害穿刺（未被格挡）的概率。\n穿刺率存在<Highlight>100%</>的上限和<Highlight>25%</>的下限，提升的穿刺超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>魔法格挡</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Ignores the target's Magic Block. Based on the base Pierce rate of <Highlight> 75% </>, it increases the probability of magic damage piercing (not being blocked). \n The Pierce rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 100% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 25% </>; if the increased Pierce exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Magic Block </> attribute.",
    ["忽视防御"] = "Ignore Defense",
