    ["怀尔德教授"] = "Professor Wilder",
    ["怀念在巴伐特银行做见习生的日子。"] = "I miss the days when I was an apprentice at the Bavard Bank.",
    ["怀斯曼"] = "Wiseman",
    ["怀旧怀旧"] = "Nostalgic, nostalgic",
    ["怀特"] = "White",
    ["怀疑主义、形而上学、社会罗塞尔主义……"] = "Skepticism, metaphysics, social Roselleism...",
    ["怀表"] = "Pocket watch",
    ["怀表mesh"] = "Pocket Watch Mesh",
    ["怀表前置"] = "Pocket watch prerequisite",
    ["怀表坏了"] = "The pocket watch is broken",
    ["怀表里有一张照片……这女人好像年轻版的雪莉。"] = "There is a photo inside the pocket watch... this woman looks like a young version of Shirley.",
    ["怀表？还是坏的，好像……这是父亲留下的最值钱的东西。"] = "A pocket watch? It's broken too. It seems... this is the most valuable thing my father left behind.",
    ["怎……怎么可能！我们说好的，还要一起完成这首乐曲……"] = "H-how is that possible! We promised to finish this piece of music together...",
    ["怎、怎么可能！"] = "Ho, how is that possible!",
    ["怎、怎么样？"] = "H-how is it?",
    ["怎么……回事……昨天还……好好的……"] = "What... is going on... it was... fine yesterday...",
    ["怎么一个人都没有？"] = "Why is there no one here?",
    ["怎么不在？人去哪儿了呢……"] = "Why isn't he here? Where could he have gone...",
    ["怎么不早告诉我，你养了一只鹦鹉？我还以为你……我担心死了！"] = "Why didn't you tell me sooner that you were keeping a parrot? I thought you were... I was worried to death!",
    ["怎么不知不觉就说出了这句话……"] = "How did I say that without realizing it...",
    ["怎么不能自己出发？"] = "Why can't you set off on your own?",
    ["怎么了"] = "What's wrong?",
    ["怎么了 这么着急？"] = "What's wrong, in such a hurry?",
    ["怎么了先生，茉莉有什么问题吗？"] = "Is something wrong, sir? Is there a problem with the jasmine?",
    ["怎么了吗？"] = "What's wrong?",
    ["怎么了梅丽莎？"] = "What's wrong, Melissa?",
    ["怎么了罗珊女士——"] = "What's wrong, Ms. Rozanne—",
    ["怎么了，先生？"] = "What's wrong, sir?",
    ["怎么了，克莱恩？"] = "What's wrong, Klein?",
    ["怎么了，哥哥？"] = "What's wrong, brother?",
    ["怎么了，安洁莉卡。"] = "What's wrong, Angelica?",
    ["怎么了，我的陛下？"] = "What is wrong, my Majesty?",
    ["怎么了，神使大人？"] = "What's wrong, Lord Messenger?",
    ["怎么了，陛下？爱情是不分性别的，昨晚您不是很享受吗？"] = "What is wrong, Majesty? Love knows no gender. Didn't you enjoy yourself last night?",
    ["怎么了，难道我刚刚那句骂得很难听？"] = "What's wrong? Was what I just said that offensive?",
    ["怎么了，顾问{{先生|女士}}？想要放弃追踪？"] = "What's wrong, Consultant {{ Mr.| Ms.}}? Want to give up on the tracking?",
    ["怎么了？"] = "What's wrong?",
    ["怎么了？往这边走。"] = "What's wrong? Go this way.",
    ["怎么了？我脸上的妆花了吗？"] = "What's wrong? Is my makeup ruined?",
    ["怎么了？担心即将到来的工作？"] = "What's wrong? Worried about the upcoming work?",
    ["怎么了？觉得哪里不好吃吗？"] = "What's wrong? Do you think it doesn't taste good?",
    ["怎么了？这边走。"] = "What's wrong? This way.",
    ["怎么会"] = "How could this be",
    ["怎么会……"] = "How could this be...",
    ["怎么会……阿廖莎……里奇呢？"] = "How could... Alyosha... where is Richie?",
    ["怎么会呢，可以放在笔记本里，做成标本。"] = "How can that be? You can put it in a notebook and make a specimen.",
    ["怎么会呢？你再看看，上面写着“追风雪的人”。"] = "How could that be? Look again, it says 'The One Who Chases the Wind and Snow.'",
    ["怎么会有人宁愿把钱丢进水里也不拿来犒赏自己呢？"] = "How could anyone prefer throwing money into the water over treating themselves?",
    ["怎么会没教过？我虽然上了年纪，但头脑还是很清醒的。"] = "How could I have not taught you? Although I am getting on in years, my mind is still very clear.",
    ["怎么会没有？它从崖壁伸出来，上面还有许愿涂鸦。"] = "How could there not be? It sticks out from the cliff, and there's wish-making graffiti on it.",
    ["怎么会这样……"] = "How can this be...",
    ["怎么会这样呢？是学习压力太大了吗？"] = "How could it be like this? Is the academic pressure too high?",
    ["怎么会这样！再过几天就是我们王国的生日聚会了——"] = "How could this happen! In a few days, it will be our kingdom's birthday party—",
    ["怎么会这样，我明明已经补上了台词，演出应该继续才对！"] = "How can this be? I clearly filled in the lines, the performance should continue!",
    ["怎么会这样？"] = "How could this happen?",
    ["怎么会这样？好端端的，狒狒为什么就发狂了？我记得，这里的狒狒一直都被训练得很好……"] = "How could that happen? Everything was fine, why did the baboon go crazy? I remember the baboons here were always well-trained...",
    ["怎么会！你需要定制人偶吗？我把自己关起来是为了体验产品的心理。"] = "How could I! Do you need a custom doll? I locked myself up to experience the psychology of the product.",
    ["怎么会，没人瞧得见我，瞧见了也会觉得是自己看错了。"] = "How could it? No one can see me, and even if they did, they'd think they were seeing things.",
    ["怎么伤害这么高"] = "Why is the damage so high?",
    ["怎么偏心了？"] = "How was he biased?",
    ["怎么全倒了……"] = "How did everyone collapse...",
    ["怎么切换教团"] = "How to switch cults",
    ["怎么切换方案"] = "How to switch schemes",
    ["怎么办呢"] = "What should I do?",
    ["怎么办啊？写不完了！你怎么一点都不着急啊？"] = "What should I do? I can't finish writing! Why aren't you anxious at all?",
    ["怎么办怎么办 要上车吗？"] = "What to do, what to do, should I get on the carriage?",
    ["怎么办怎么办怎么办怎么办……"] = "What do I do, what do I do, what do I do...",
    ["怎么办怎么办！"] = "What do I do, what do I do!",
    ["怎么办怎么办，如果被叔叔发现，你就完了！"] = "What do I do, what do I do? If Uncle finds out, you're finished!",
    ["怎么办才好？我要不要回家看看？"] = "What should I do? Should I go home and check?",
    ["怎么办！？演出马上就要开始了，竟然发生了这种事情……"] = "What should I do!? The performance is about to start, and this kind of thing actually happened...",
    ["怎么办！？演出马上就要开始了，竟然发生了这种事情了……"] = "What should I do!? The performance is about to start, and something like this actually happened...",
    ["怎么办，怎么办……店里的桌子还在清理，但等位的客人要不耐烦了……"] = "What to do, what to do... The tables in the shop are still being cleaned, but the waiting customers are getting impatient...",
    ["怎么办，被，被拒绝了……"] = "What should I do, I was, I was rejected...",
    ["怎么办？当然是硬着头皮办完了！"] = "What to do? Of course, I'll bite the bullet and get it done!",
    ["怎么办？我总不能一直呆在这里吧，队长他们还在现实，不知道那个小丑还会做什么。"] = "What should I do? I can't just stay here forever. The Captain and the others are still in reality, and I don't know what that Clown will do next.",
    ["怎么办？我总不能一直待在这里吧，队长他们还在现实，不知道那个小丑还会做什么。"] = "What should I do? I can't stay here forever. The Captain and the others are still in reality, and I don't know what that Clown will do next.",
