    ["怨魂"] = "Wraith",
    ["怨魂即将再次压缩战场，将战场边缘变为怨魂区域。"] = "The Wraith is about to compress the battlefield again, turning the edges into a Wraith area.",
    ["怨魂即将压缩战场，将场地边缘变为怨魂区域。"] = "The Wraith is about to compress the battlefield, turning the edges into a Wraith area.",
    ["怨魂即将进行连续爪击，记忆预警范围并躲避。"] = "The Wraith is about to perform consecutive claw strikes; memorize the warning range and dodge.",
    ["怨魂即将连续释放<Reminder_Red>怨魂冲击</>，注意预警并躲避。"] = "The Wraith is about to continuously cast <Reminder_Red> Wraith Impact </>. Pay attention to the warning and dodge.",
    ["怨魂即将释放<Reminder_Red>怨魂冲击</>，前往场边躲避。"] = "The Wraith is about to release <Reminder_Red> Wraith Impact </>, head to the edge of the field to dodge.",
    ["怨魂召唤能量球，朝向怨魂移动。当怨魂吸收到任一能量球，<Disable>立刻对全体玩家造成巨额伤害</>。"] = "The Wraith summons energy balls that move toward it. When the Wraith absorbs any energy ball, it <Disable>immediately deals massive damage to all players</>.",
    ["怨魂合体"] = "Wraith Fusion",
    ["怨魂对一名非凡者设置炸弹，靠近分摊伤害。"] = "The Wraith has placed a bomb on a Beyonder; move close to share the damage.",
    ["怨魂对部分非凡者施加<Reminder_Red>诅咒点名</>尽快前往场地边缘"] = "The Wraith applies <Reminder_Red> Curse Targeting </> to some Beyonders, head to the edge of the field immediately.",
    ["怨魂将对指定非凡者展开必中攻击，注意走位"] = "The Wraith will launch an unavoidable attack on the designated Beyonder; pay attention to your positioning.",
    ["怨魂索命"] = "Resentful Spirit Soul-Taking",
    ["怨魂被“青铜大门”束缚在场边，无法自由移动。"] = "The Wraith is bound to the edge of the field by the \"Bronze Gate\" and cannot move freely.",
    ["怨魂闪现场景中心，朝四周大范围释放<Disable>毒素瓶</>。"] = "The Wraith flashes to the center of the scene and releases <Disable>toxin bottles</> over a large area in all directions.",
    ["怨魂附着在一名队员身上，快分散站位，以免遭受范围伤害！"] = "A Wraith is attached to a teammate; quickly disperse your positions to avoid area damage!",
