    ["怪2"] = "Monster 2",
    ["怪不得。“愚者”先生还真是重视你啊，居然赐予你这样贵重的东西……那么接下来你要做的就是准备仪式材料了。"] = "No wonder. Mr. Fool really values you, to actually bestow such a precious thing upon you... Then, what you need to do next is prepare the ritual materials.",
    ["怪不得。愚者先生还真是重视你啊，居然赐予你这样贵重的东西……那么接下来你要做的就是准备仪式材料了。"] = "No wonder. Mr. Fool really values you, to actually bestow such a precious item upon you... So, your next step is to prepare the ritual materials.",
    ["怪不得。我看的时候就觉得，第三幕那段戏，和前面完全接不上，像硬塞进来的。"] = "No wonder. When I was watching it, I felt that the third act didn't connect with the rest at all, like it was forced in.",
    ["怪不得不爱说话，那边的人好像都这样。"] = "No wonder she doesn't like to talk, people from over there seem to be like that.",
    ["怪不得人们称他为“大帝”……可都是一百多年前的事了。"] = "No wonder people call him the \"Emperor\"... but that was all over a hundred years ago.",
    ["怪不得菲利普精神崩溃时一直在重复“海水”。"] = "No wonder Philip kept repeating \"seawater\" when he had a mental breakdown.",
    ["怪不得这里被称为“<P_Yellow>廷根最难以下咽的餐厅</>”！"] = "No wonder this place is called '<P_Yellow> the most inedible restaurant in Tingen </>'!",
    ["怪不得风暴老哥们都在水里"] = "No wonder the Storm brothers are all in the water.",
    ["怪不得！和我表弟气质一模一样！"] = "No wonder! You have the exact same temperament as my cousin!",
    ["怪不得，看起来有些……"] = "No wonder, it looks a bit...",
    ["怪墙空镜头"] = "Empty shot of the strange wall",
    ["怪异的南瓜"] = "Weird Pumpkin",
    ["怪我平时太严格？快冲我出出气，这可是最后的机会。"] = "Blaming me for being too strict? Go ahead and vent on me, this is your last chance.",
