    ["怪物：为所有友军提供<HighLight>5%</>生命值加成，【怪物】获得额外的最大生命值加成。"] = "Monster: Provides <HighLight>5%</> Health bonus to all allies; [Monster] units gain an additional maximum Health bonus.",
