    ["怪猎"] = "Monster Hunter",
    ["怪鱼"] = "Strange Fish",
    ["怯懦？不，我杀过人，我杀过人……"] = "Cowardice? No, I have killed people, I have killed people...",
    ["总不能让他骑到我们头上吧老大！"] = "We can't let him ride on our heads, Boss!",
    ["总之 先不要暴露我的异常"] = "Anyway, don't expose my abnormality first.",
    ["总之……很抱歉，错了就是错了。钢琴已经损坏，我会向上级申请赔偿，无需麻烦您。"] = "In any case... I am very sorry. A mistake is a mistake. The piano is damaged, and I will apply to my superiors for compensation. There is no need to trouble you.",
    ["总之！你以后如果缺钱了，可以来找我。"] = "Anyway! If you are short of money in the future, you can come to me.",
    ["总之，{{先生|女士}}，您愿意为了这个八音盒出多少钱？"] = "In short, {{Mr.| Ms.}}, how much are you willing to pay for this music box?",
    ["总之，不如舒舒服服补个觉。"] = "Anyway, it's better to get a comfortable nap.",
    ["总之，你能找到我的身体后，然后想办法把它弄出来吗？"] = "Anyway, once you find my body, can you find a way to get it out?",
    ["总之，依据我的职责，你们要对自己犯下的罪负责。"] = "In short, according to my duties, you must take responsibility for the crimes you have committed.",
    ["总之，免费试骑，欢迎体验！"] = "In any case, free trial rides, you are welcome to experience them!",
    ["总之，带上它能感觉到知识涌入脑海。"] = "In short, wearing it makes you feel knowledge flooding into your mind.",
    ["总之，廷根市不仅是教育的中心，更是文化的圣地。"] = "In short, Tingen is not only a center of education but also a cultural mecca.",
    ["总之，接受福音，完成我的任务。"] = "In short, accept the Gospel and complete my quest.",
    ["总之，无论如何你答应了，美丽的歌者，爱德华娜小姐，现在是萨里斯夫人，今天可以与我共进晚餐吗？"] = "Anyway, regardless, you agreed, beautiful singer, Miss Edwina, now Mrs. Saris, can you have dinner with me today?",
    ["总之，是英雄救美的桥段。不过贝克兰德哪来的海盗？我也遇不上什么贵族小姐。就算遇上，凭我这身板……也打不过。"] = "In short, it's a hero saving the beauty trope. But where would pirates come from in Backlund? And I can't run into any noble ladies. Even if I did, with my physique... I couldn't win.",
    ["总之，省钱的核心就是——能不花的钱坚决不花。"] = "In short, the core of saving money is—if you don't have to spend it, absolutely don't spend it.",
    ["总之，要小心一点。"] = "Anyway, be careful.",
    ["总之，请去看看他，看看怎么样可以让他看起来……正常一点。"] = "Anyway, please go take a look at him and see how you can make him look... a bit more normal.",
    ["总之，谢谢你！下周六我们第一次约会，你要不要来当见证人？"] = "Anyway, thank you! Next Saturday is our first date, do you want to come as a witness?",
    ["总之，首次免费，欢迎体验！"] = "In any case, the first time is free, welcome to try it out!",
    ["总人气"] = "Total Popularity",
    ["总价"] = "Total Price",
