    ["总是由你邀请我，会显得我缺乏主动性。"] = "It's always you inviting me, which makes me seem lacking in initiative.",
    ["总是装备装备，知识也很重要啊！"] = "Always equipment, equipment! Knowledge is also very important!",
    ["总有一天我会看见她站起来，跑过来抱抱我，对吗？"] = "One day I'll see her stand up, run over, and give me a hug, right?",
    ["总有一天，她会接受的霍华德的遗书的……总有一天。"] = "One day, she will accept Howard's suicide note... one day.",
    ["总有一天，当你找到家人，当你再次吹响这口风琴……"] = "Someday, when you find your family, when you play this harmonica again...",
    ["总有一天，我要让所有人都知道我的名字——安妮·伯尼！像艾德雯娜女士那样，成为海上传奇的一部分！"] = "One day, I will make everyone know my name—Annie Bonney! Like Ms. Edwina, I will become part of the legends of the sea!",
    ["总有一天，我要让所有人都知道我的名字——艾玛·莱克汉姆！像艾德雯娜女士那样，成为海上传奇的一部分！"] = "One day, I will let everyone know my name—Emma Larcham! Like Ms. Edwina, I will become a part of the legends of the sea!",
    ["总有些事情，高于其他。"] = "There are always some things that are higher than others.",
    ["总有些事，高于其他。"] = "There are always some things that are higher than others.",
    ["总有人在旁边吵，根本静不下心来。"] = "There's always someone making noise nearby, I can't calm down at all.",
    ["总有办法……父亲说过，这四个字不能放在计划里。"] = "There's always a way... Father said those four words should never be part of a plan.",
    ["总有明天"] = "There is Always Tomorrow",
    ["总有那么几个笨蛋……"] = "There are always a few idiots...",
    ["总有那么几个蠢蛋会半夜沿着脚手架梯子爬上去。"] = "There are always a few idiots who climb up the scaffolding ladders in the middle of the night.",
