    ["总评分"] = "Total Rating",
    ["总评分 = （结束时持有的商会票券 + 剩余物产兑换的商会票券）x 失败惩罚\n赚取的城堡资产 = 总评分 × 评级对应的转化倍率\n\n结束时持有的商会票券：结算时，当前持有的商会票券数量。\n剩余物产兑换的商会票券：结算时，未售出的物产将按照标准买入价的100%（该值会随车轮升级进一步提高）兑换为商会票券（推荐物品会额外获得约20%的加成），由于标准卖出价比买入价更高，尽量出售物产可以获取更高收益。\n评级：总评分将决定评级，评级越高，获取的城堡资产越多。\n失败损失：未完成协议或放弃协议时，商会会扣除总业绩的20%，选择合适的协议签署也是大亨的必备技能。"] = "Total Score = (Chamber of Commerce Tickets held at the end + Chamber of Commerce Tickets exchanged from remaining goods) x Failure Penalty.\n Castle Assets earned = Total Score × Conversion Multiplier corresponding to the rating.\n\n Chamber of Commerce Tickets held at the end: The number of Chamber of Commerce Tickets currently held at the time of settlement.\n Chamber of Commerce Tickets exchanged from remaining goods: At settlement, unsold goods will be exchanged for Chamber of Commerce Tickets at 100% of the standard purchase price (this value increases as the wheels are upgraded). Recommended items receive an additional ~20% bonus. Since the standard selling price is higher than the purchase price, try to sell as many goods as possible to maximize profit.\n Rating: The total score determines the rating; the higher the rating, the more Castle Assets obtained.\n Failure Loss: If an agreement is not completed or is abandoned, the Chamber of Commerce will deduct 20% of the total performance. Choosing the right agreement to sign is an essential skill for a tycoon.",
    ["总评分：已拥有城堡组件的评分总和（包括仓库中和已建造的组件）；\n建造评分：已建造的城堡组件的评分总和；"] = "Total Rating: The sum of the ratings of all owned Castle components (including those in the warehouse and those already built); \n Construction Rating: The sum of the ratings of all built Castle components;",
