    ["恋爱的时候，话不多，但你说过的每一句都能被记住。和这样的人谈大概会有很不错的恋爱体验。"] = "When in love, they don't talk much, but they remember every word you've said. Dating someone like that would likely be a very good experience.",
    ["恋爱结果不算——我知道这是大家最关心的问题，但我连自己的问题都没解决，更不要提给别人占卜啦。"] = "Love results don't count—I know this is what everyone is most concerned about, but I haven't even solved my own problems, let alone perform divination for others.",
