    ["恐怖如斯……居然能在灵界开辟一方天地，建造这样宏伟的建筑，我越来越崇拜背后的大人物了。"] = "Terrifying... To be able to open up a world in the Spirit World and build such a magnificent structure, I admire the big shot behind it more and more.",
