    ["恐怖的威胁，绯红的希冀！起码一事是真：此生飞逝。一事是真啊，其余皆谎，花开一度后将与世长辞……"] = "Terrifying threats, crimson hopes! At least one thing is true: this life flies by. One thing is true, the rest is lies, the flower that once has bloomed forever dies...",
