    ["您"] = "You",
    ["您……"] = "You...",
    ["您……不是喜欢……呃。"] = "You... didn't like... uh.",
    ["您……什么意思？"] = "What... do you mean?",
    ["您……您好，需要什么帮助吗？"] = "H-hello, do you need any help?",
    ["您……您是蜡烛的主人？"] = "Are... are you the owner of the candle?",
    ["您……您说的对，也许我从一开始就不该指望雷克斯。一旦我们没了用，他就会头也不回地抛弃我们……"] = "You... you're right. Maybe I shouldn't have counted on Rex from the start. Once we were no longer useful, he would have abandoned us without a second thought...",
    ["您……您说的对，也许我从一开始，就不该指望雷克斯……"] = "You... you are right. Perhaps I shouldn't have counted on Rex from the very beginning...",
    ["您……真的很爱黑荆棘。"] = "You... really love Blackthorn.",
    ["您……需要钢琴课吗？我的价格很公道。"] = "Do you... need piano lessons? My price is very fair.",
    ["您。只要您。您的手好烫……还是我太烫了？"] = "You. Only you. Your hands are so hot... or am I too hot?",
    ["您一共进来过三次，我想我应该没猜错。"] = "You've come in three times in total, so I don't think I guessed wrong.",
    ["您一定就是{{PlayerName}}吧。我收到消息，在这里等候您，并为您提前准备了一份契约。"] = "You must be {{PlayerName}}. I received word to wait for you here and have prepared a contract for you in advance.",
    ["您一定很想念他们。"] = "You must miss them very much.",
    ["您一定很爱您的女儿，祝您能挑选到心仪的衣料，也祝您女儿生日快乐。"] = "You must love your daughter very much. I hope you can pick out the fabric you like, and I wish your daughter a happy birthday.",
    ["您一定很珍视那段时光……"] = "You must have cherished that time very much...",
    ["您一直住在这儿？"] = "Have you always lived here?",
    ["您一直都在这儿卖面包和糕点？"] = "Have you always been selling bread and pastries here?",
    ["您不可对拥有更高权限的玩家进行此操作"] = "You cannot perform this action on a player with higher permissions.",
    ["您不害怕吗？"] = "Aren't you afraid?",
    ["您不必费心一瓶瓶地介绍，待会我就让仆人们来打包，送去我郊外新庄园。 "] = "You don't need to bother introducing them bottle by bottle. I'll have my servants come pack them up later and send them to my new manor in the suburbs.",
    ["您不想来点吗？"] = "Don't you want some?",
    ["您不打算搬到市区吗？那里离警察局近些，办事也方便。"] = "Do you not plan to move to the city? It would be closer to the police station and more convenient for handling matters.",
    ["您不是俱乐部会长、副会长、理事，无法发起集结。"] = "You are not the club president, vice president, or director and cannot initiate an assembly.",
    ["您不是发起方，无法取消解除誓约。"] = "You are not the initiator, cannot cancel the Covenant dissolution.",
    ["您不是团长，无法进行此操作"] = "You are not the team leader; cannot perform this operation.",
    ["您不是家族首席或该申请已失效，无法进行当前操作。"] = "You are not the head of the family, or this application has expired, so the current operation cannot be performed.",
    ["您不是家族首席，无法进行当前操作。"] = "You are not the Family Chief, cannot perform this operation.",
    ["您不是对我想做出的变化都十分认可吗？您还称赞过我的笔记！"] = "Don't you approve of all the changes I wanted to make? You even praised my notes!",
    ["您不是队长，无法进行此操作"] = "You are not the captain; cannot perform this operation.",
    ["您不是队长，需由队长发起双方解除誓约申请。"] = "You are not the leader; the leader must initiate the application for mutual Covenant dissolution.",
    ["您不知道吧？教会那帮人前天刚把用缝衣针钓鱼的瘸子拖走，上次用雨伞钓鱼的人现在还躺在医院数闪电！"] = "You don't know? The church people dragged away the cripple who was fishing with a sewing needle the day before yesterday, and the person who was fishing with an umbrella last time is still lying in the hospital counting lightning!",
    ["您不符合队伍非凡评分要求，无法加入"] = "You do not meet the Beyonder rating requirement for the party; unable to join.",
    ["您不能在街上这样拦人。什么鸽子，我可以帮您找。 "] = "You can't stop people on the street like this. Whatever pigeons, I can help you find them.",
    ["您不觉得床底存在未知的恐怖吗？正因如此，我才不想轻易打扫。"] = "Don't you think there is unknown horror under the bed? That's exactly why I don't want to clean it easily.",
    ["您与%s互发消息连续超过15天获得小火苗印记。"] = "You and %s have exchanged messages for 15 consecutive days and earned the Little Flame badge.",
    ["您与%s的好友度增加了%s"] = "Your friendship level with %s increased by %s.",
    ["您与%s的好感度已达上限"] = "Your favorability with %s has reached the limit.",
    ["您与%s的好感度提升了%d点。"] = "Your favorability with %s has increased by %d points.",
    ["您与服务器已经断开连接"] = "You have been disconnected from the server",
    ["您与服务器已经断开连接。"] = "You have been disconnected from the server.",
    ["您与马儿亲近的最佳机会，喂马1便士，拍照2便士，骑马3便士。"] = "The best chance to get close to the horses: 1 penny to feed, 2 pennies to take a photo, 3 pennies to ride.",
    ["您中断了领袖转让流程"] = "You interrupted the leadership transfer process.",
    ["您为什么不亲自告诉他？"] = "Why don't you tell him yourself?",
    ["您为什么要拦着火车往里开？"] = "Why are you stopping the train from going in?",
    ["您之前说的非凡者和非凡能力是什么？"] = "What were the Beyonders and Beyonder powers you mentioned earlier?",
    ["您也不赖。"] = "You're not bad yourself.",
    ["您也别太往心里去。至少……这份心意是好的。"] = "Don't take it to heart. At least... the intention was good.",
    ["您也可以拜访您信仰的宗教的教堂。"] = "You can also visit the church of the religion you believe in.",
    ["您也可以自行装修城堡，点击此处打开<Highlight>装修</>界面"] = "You can also decorate the castle yourself. Click here to open the <Highlight>Decoration</> interface.",
    ["您也可以选择为廷根大学助威，但胜利必将属于霍伊大学。"] = "You can also choose to cheer for Tingen University, but victory will surely belong to Hoy University.",
    ["您也快点离开这里吧，期待我们还有再见的机会。"] = "You should leave here quickly too. I look forward to us meeting again.",
    ["您也是过来处理那件事情的吗？"] = "Are you also here to handle that matter?",
    ["您也来这儿坐坐？他们家的烘焙双人餐似乎有特价。"] = "Are you here to sit for a while too? Their baked meal for two seems to have a special discount.",
    ["您也知道了啊，自杀的事传得好快。"] = "You know about that too? News of the suicides spreads so fast.",
    ["您也觉得……我是个轻浮的女人？ "] = "Do you also think... I am a frivolous woman?",
    ["您也负责处理这类非凡事件吗？"] = "Are you also responsible for handling these types of Mystic World events?",
    ["您亲爱的\n瓦莱莉"] = "Your dear \nValerie",
    ["您今天的发型很漂亮。"] = "Your hairstyle today is very beautiful.",
    ["您会变魔术？请跟我来。"] = "You know how to do magic? Please come with me.",
    ["您位于团队中，无法申请参与。"] = "You are in a team, cannot apply to participate.",
    ["您位于团队中，无法获得额外机制积分，建议切换为小队参与"] = "You are in a team and cannot earn extra mechanic points. It is recommended to switch to a squad to participate.",
    ["您位于迷雾残影区域内且已有队伍积分贡献，该状态仅队长可切换分线，如需切换请先退队后继续"] = "You are in the Mist Shadow area and already have party point contributions. Only the party leader can switch channels in this state. If you need to switch, please leave the party first and then continue.",
    ["您位于队伍中，且不是队长，无法申请参与。"] = "You are in a team and are not the leader, cannot apply to participate.",
    ["您何尝不是呢，像我们这样善良的人可真不多了。"] = "Aren't you the same? There aren't many kind people like us left.",
    ["您使用的纸张是警局专用纸，音符形状别扭，乐谱格式奇特，就像一份报告书？"] = "The paper you used is official police station paper, the notes are awkwardly shaped, and the musical format is strange—it looks like a report?",
    ["您修过最特别的表是什么？"] = "What is the most special watch you have ever repaired?",
    ["您倒也不必表现得如毫不知情一样。"] = "You don't have to act as if you knew nothing about it.",
    ["您做得很好，这份谢礼，请务必收下。"] = "You did very well. Please be sure to accept this token of gratitude.",
    ["您儿子，他住得远吗？"] = "Your son, does he live far away?",
    ["您先离开让他冷静一下。我在这里守着，万一有事我马上叫您。而且……<P_Heart>（低声）</>有些话，可能不方便当着父母的面说。"] = "Please leave first and let him calm down. I'll stay here, and if anything happens, I'll call you immediately. Besides... <P_Heart> (Whispering) </> some things might not be convenient to say in front of parents.",
    ["您再看看这剪裁和布料，看看这位先生穿上后多有风度。这样吧，我再给您一个折扣，8镑！"] = "Look at the tailoring and fabric, look at how graceful this gentleman looks wearing it. How about this, I'll give you a discount, 8 pounds!",
    ["您再看看这金黄透亮的煎蛋，边缘微焦，内里流心，简单却充满家的味道，吃一口就能让您感受到温暖与满足，买五送一！"] = "Look at these golden and translucent fried eggs, slightly charred at the edges, runny inside, simple but full of the taste of home, one bite will make you feel warm and satisfied, buy five get one free!",
    ["您冻得不轻，先跟我到营地里去吧，那里有火。"] = "You're badly chilled. Come to the camp first; there's a fire there.",
    ["您出价的%s有更高出价，已退还竞拍的%d%s"] = "There is a higher bid for %s. Your bid of %d %s has been refunded.",
    ["您刚刚在其他设备登录过，请稍后再试。"] = "You have just logged in on another device, please try again later.",
    ["您刚才的善举，守护了一位罗塞尔大帝的崇拜者。"] = "Your kind act just now protected an admirer of Emperor Roselle.",
    ["您刚才说……“愚者”先生也曾生活在廷根市？"] = "You just said... Mr. Fool also lived in Tingen?",
    ["您刚提到“金秋湖的神秘预言”是什么？"] = "What is the 'Mysterious Prophecy of Golden Autumn Lake' you just mentioned?",
    ["您刚搬来这里？有些不习惯是正常的。"] = "Did you just move here? It's normal to be a bit unaccustomed.",
    ["您创建的俱乐部正处于响应状态，在此期间无法再响应其它俱乐部"] = "The club you created is in the response phase; you cannot respond to other clubs during this time.",
    ["您创建的俱乐部正处于响应状态，在此期间无法重复创建"] = "The club you created is currently in the response phase; you cannot create another one during this time.",
    ["您别介意，她从踏进这家店开始就没说过一句正经话。"] = "Don't mind her; she hasn't said a single serious word since she stepped into this shop.",
    ["您别担心，我会找到海莉女士的。"] = "Don't worry. I'll find Ms. Hayley.",
    ["您别生气，那是试阅书籍。虽然《大冒险家》卖光了，但我手里这本《罗塞尔诗选》也非常受大家喜欢。"] = "Please don't be angry, that is a sample book. Although \"The Great Adventurer\" is sold out, this \"Roselle's Poetry Collection\" in my hand is also very popular with everyone.",
    ["您别这么说……"] = "Please don't say that...",
    ["您加购的%s已下架，已从购物车中移除。"] = "The %s you added to your cart has been delisted and removed from your shopping cart.",
    ["您即将发起单人解契，发起后将进入24小时冷静期，确定发起吗？"] = "You are about to initiate a solo contract dissolution. A 24-hour cooling-off period will begin after initiation. Confirm?",
    ["您即将发起双人解契，发起后将进入24小时冷静期，确定发起吗？"] = "You are about to initiate a duo contract dissolution. A 24-hour cooling-off period will begin after initiation. Confirm?",
    ["您即将退出七日誓约活动，确认吗？"] = "You are about to exit the Seven-Day Covenant event. Are you sure?",
    ["您即将退出誓约流程，退出后需要再从头开始流程，确定退出吗？"] = "You are about to exit the Covenant process. After exiting, you will need to start the process from the beginning. Are you sure you want to exit?",
    ["您参与拍卖的%s未抽中，已退还竞拍的%d%s"] = "You did not win %s. Your bid of %d %s has been refunded.",
    ["您参与的名流盛宴竞拍，出价已被其他玩家超越，金镑已退还"] = "Your bid in the Celebrity Feast auction has been surpassed by another player, and the gold coins have been refunded.",
    ["您又是要给家里那樽雕像买首饰？"] = "Are you buying jewelry for that statue at home again?",
    ["您叫我娜拉就可以，我同哈利·西摩斯先生已经不再存续婚姻关系。"] = "You can just call me Nala. I am no longer in a marital relationship with Mr. Harry Seamus.",
    ["您可以叫我老维克多，与佛尔思女士同属于学徒途径。"] = "You can call me Old Victor. I belong to the Apprentice Pathway, just like Ms. Fors.",
    ["您可以在大厅休息，等待下一位需要占卜的顾客。我会为您准备一杯锡伯红茶。"] = "You can rest in the hall and wait for the next customer who needs a divination. I will prepare a cup of Sibe black tea for you.",
    ["您可以多在一楼逛逛，等您知道自己想要什么了，自然就明白了。"] = "You can wander around the first floor more. Once you know what you want, you'll naturally understand.",
    ["您可以找那边的列车引导员，乘坐火车前往城堡领地。"] = "You can find the train conductor over there and take the train to the castle territory.",
    ["您可以拿走这个铜镜"] = "You can take this copper mirror.",
    ["您可以按一下铃铛吗？我想听听车铃声。"] = "Could you ring the bell? I want to hear the sound of the carriage bell.",
    ["您可以看一下旁边的图册，上面有愿意帮忙占卜的会员的信息和价格。"] = "You can take a look at the brochure next to you; it contains information and prices for members who are willing to help with divinations.",
    ["您可以看看这边的名册，上边有占卜师的介绍和价格，我可以给您介绍一下。"] = "You can look at the roster here. It contains the introductions and prices of the diviners. I can introduce them to you.",
    ["您可以称呼我为“波洛”。"] = "You may call me \"Poirot\".",
    ["您可以通过合理的买卖策略，在各个站点间进行商贸交易。交易能积累商会票券，最终转换为城堡资产。"] = "You can conduct commercial trade between various stations through reasonable buying and selling strategies. Trading can accumulate Chamber of Commerce tickets, which will eventually be converted into castle assets.",
    ["您可挑对了，这塔索克河边上，最应该吃的可不是塔索克鱼吗？我敢打赌，廷根人没有不喜欢它的。"] = "You've chosen well. By the Tussock River, shouldn't you be eating Tussock fish? I bet there isn't a Tingen resident who doesn't like it.",
    ["您吃薯条的时候，请务必小心这些可恶的海鸥！"] = "When you eat fries, please be careful of these hateful seagulls!",
    ["您同意了%s的申请"] = "You have accepted %s's application.",
    ["您后悔过吗？用这种方式获取力量？"] = "Have you ever regretted it? Obtaining power in this way?",
    ["您后悔过没有晋升吗？"] = "Have you ever regretted not advancing?",
    ["您听说过这本笔记吗？"] = "Have you heard of this notebook?",
    ["您听，一只快乐的云雀，陷入了对一名女士的单恋……多么美丽伤感的爱情故事啊。"] = "Listen, a happy skylark, fallen into an unrequited love for a lady... what a beautiful and sad love story.",
    ["您和人脉正处于同乘状态，人脉暂时无法播放社交动作。"] = "You and the connection character are currently in a ride-along state; the connection character cannot play social actions for now.",
    ["您和他现在还有联系吗？"] = "Are you still in contact with him now?",
    ["您和对方的好友度不足200，可以和对方一起参与组队活动增加好友度。"] = "Your friendship level with the other person is below 200. You can participate in team activities together to increase your friendship level.",
    ["您和您的队友距离太远，请在30米内再试试吧。"] = "You and your teammate are too far apart; please try again within 30 meters.",
    ["您和该誓约发起的是单人解契，请在单人解契界面确定解契。"] = "You and this Covenant partner are initiating a single-player dissolution, please confirm the dissolution in the single-player dissolution interface.",
    ["您和该誓约发起的是双人解契，请在双人解契界面确定解契。"] = "You and this Covenant partner are initiating a two-player dissolution, please confirm the dissolution in the two-player dissolution interface.",
    ["您喜欢看书？"] = "Do you enjoy reading?",
    ["您喜欢这种风格吗？"] = "Do you like this style?",
    ["您因此决定招募他？"] = "Did you decide to recruit him because of that?",
    ["您在%s俱乐部的%s一职已被%s变更为%s，还望齐心协力，助力俱乐部大放异彩"] = "Your %s position in Club %s has been changed to %s by %s; may you work together to help the club shine.",
    ["您在%s频道发送的信息已达上限%d条，无法继续发送"] = "You have reached the limit of %d messages in the %s channel; cannot continue sending.",
    ["您在别的迷雾残影区域有贡献积分，进入新boss区域战斗需要退出原来队伍重新参与，是否参与？"] = "You have contribution points in another Mist Shadow area. Entering the new boss area for battle requires leaving the original party and re-participating. Participate?",
    ["您在哪儿跳？"] = "Where are you dancing?",
    ["您在团队中的身份已发生变化"] = "Your status in the team has changed.",
    ["您在干什么？"] = "What are you doing?",
    ["您在所有服中的预创角数量已达到上限，无法继续创建。"] = "You have reached the limit for pre-created characters across all servers and cannot create more.",
    ["您在本服的角色删除数量已达上限。"] = "You have reached the maximum number of character deletions on this server.",
    ["您在本服的预创角数量已达到上限，无法继续创建。"] = "You have reached the limit for pre-created characters on this server and cannot create more.",
    ["您在狩猎乌鸦吗？这还真是少见。"] = "Are you hunting crows? That is really rare.",
    ["您在现在的年纪依然拥有强健的体魄，真是令人赞叹。"] = "It is truly admirable that you still possess such a robust physique at your age.",
    ["您在等人吗？"] = "Are you waiting for someone?",
    ["您在这儿钓鱼？"] = "Are you fishing here?",
    ["您在这里干什么？"] = "What are you doing here?",
    ["您处于世界灾厄玩法中，无法进行该操作"] = "You are in the World Calamity gameplay and cannot perform this operation.",
    ["您处于位面中，当前不可开启快速匹配"] = "You are in a plane; quick matching cannot be started currently.",
    ["您大人有大量，这一次就放过我吧……"] = "You are a generous person, please let me go this time...",
    ["您大概也发现了，天使降临世间的时候，似乎受了点伤，是吗？"] = "You probably noticed that when the angel descended into the world, she seemed to be a little injured, right?",
    ["您太客气了。等见到杰温先生，请您代我问个好。"] = "You are too kind. When you see Mr. Gewen, please give him my regards.",
    ["您夫人和孩子生日是同一天？"] = "Your wife and children have the same birthday?",
    ["您好 罗珊小姐"] = "Hello, Miss Rozanne.",
    ["您好 请问您是……"] = "Hello, may I ask who you are...",
    ["您好{{先生|女士}}，您是想占卜，还是想加入我们俱乐部？"] = "Hello {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, are you looking for a divination, or do you want to join our club?",
    ["您好……"] = "Hello...",
    ["您好。"] = "Hello.",
    ["您好啊，{{年轻的先生|年轻的女士}}，面包的香气总是令人愉悦，真好。"] = "Hello there, {{young sir|young madam}}. The aroma of bread is always pleasant; it's truly wonderful.",
    ["您好啊，订购香水吗？真抱歉，今天是周一，香水店闭店休息。"] = "Hello there, ordering perfume? I'm so sorry, today is Monday, and the perfume shop is closed.",
    ["您好女士，需要我帮您参谋一下吗？"] = "Hello, Madam, would you like me to help you pick something out?",
    ["您好！您好！我和我的相机都在翘首期盼与您的相遇呀！"] = "Hello! Hello! Both my camera and I have been eagerly looking forward to meeting you!",
    ["您好！我是奥利弗，俱乐部事务的联络人。不知道您是否已经加入了某个俱乐部？有些东西只有成员才能接触到，如果还没有的话，现在加入也不迟。"] = "Hello! I am Oliver, the liaison for club affairs. I wonder if you have joined a club yet? Some things are only accessible to members; if you haven't, it's not too late to join now.",
    ["您好！能占用一下您的时间吗！我想给您讲一讲我们的道标和救主！愚者先……愚者喵先生！"] = "Hello! Can I take a moment of your time? I want to tell you about our beacon and savior! The Fool fir... Mr. Fool Meow!",
    ["您好！蒸汽在上，这次的相遇一定是神明的指引……"] = "Hello! Steam above, this encounter must be the guidance of the gods...",
    ["您好，{{PlayerName}}{{先生|女士}}，乐意为您效劳。"] = "Hello, {{PlayerName}}{ { Mr. | Ms. } }, happy to be of service.",
    ["您好，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Hello, Mr./Ms. {{|}}.",
    ["您好，{{先生|女士}}！您要买车票吗？"] = "Hello, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}! Would you like to buy a ticket?",
    ["您好，{{先生|女士}}，很高兴能见到您。想吃点什么？"] = "Hello, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, it is a pleasure to see you. What would you like to eat?",
    ["您好，{{先生|女士}}，欢迎来到俱乐部。"] = "Hello, {{sir|madam}}, welcome to the Club.",
    ["您好，{{先生|女士}}，特好玩旅店欢迎您！"] = "Hello, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, welcome to the Super Fun Hotel!",
    ["您好，“倒吊人”先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Hanged Man!",
    ["您好，“正义”小姐……"] = "Hello, Miss 'Justice'...",
    ["您好，“魔女师”女士！"] = "Hello, Ms. Magician!",
    ["您好，“魔术师”女士！"] = "Hello, Ms. Magician!",
    ["您好，两位选购报刊吗？《晨报》《晚报》《老实人报》《贝克兰德日报》《家庭杂志》《故事评论》，应有尽有！"] = "Hello, would you two like to buy some newspapers? The Morning Post, The Evening Post, The Honest Man, The Backlund Daily, Family Magazine, Story Review—we have everything!",
    ["您好，乔纳尔医生。我很少看医生，所以……"] = "Hello, Dr. Jonar. I rarely see a doctor, so...",
    ["您好，亚伦上士，您一定很了解这里，愿意讲讲吗？"] = "Hello, Sergeant Aaron, you must know this place very well, would you be willing to tell me about it?",
    ["您好，伦纳德先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Leonard!",
    ["您好，佐伊学姐。"] = "Hello, Senior Zoe.",
    ["您好，先生。今天想要占卜些什么呢？"] = "Hello, sir. What would you like to divine today?",
    ["您好，先生，请问您有没有——或者这附近哪里有食物和保暖物品？"] = "Hello, sir, do you have—or is there anywhere nearby with food and warm items?",
    ["您好，克莱恩先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Klein!",
    ["您好，准备送给什么人？"] = "Hello, who are you planning to give it to?",
    ["您好，勤劳的园丁，镇上的花都是您照料的吗？"] = "Hello, hardworking gardener, do you take care of all the flowers in town?",
    ["您好，园丁。总是见到您在这里照料花朵，真是风雨无阻啊。"] = "Hello, gardener. I always see you here taking care of the flowers, through wind and rain.",
    ["您好，夫人。您知道孩子们在争论什么吗？"] = "Hello, Madam. Do you know what the children are arguing about?",
    ["您好，奥黛丽小姐！"] = "Hello, Miss Audrey!",
    ["您好，尊敬的阿罗德斯大人。"] = "Hello, respected Mr. Arrodes.",
    ["您好，尼尔先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Neil!",
    ["您好，弗兰克先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Frank!",
    ["您好，弗莱队长！"] = "Hello, Captain Frye!",
    ["您好，您想要到哪去？"] = "Hello, where would you like to go?",
    ["您好，您有什么需要吗？"] = "Hello, is there anything you need?",
    ["您好，您看见芬恩了吗？"] = "Hello, have you seen Finn?",
    ["您好，想要点什么呢？项链？胸针？也欢迎您随便看看。"] = "Hello, what would you like? A necklace? A brooch? You are also welcome to just look around.",
    ["您好，愿女神庇佑您，有什么事吗？"] = "Hello, may the Goddess protect you, is there anything I can help with?",
    ["您好，我只是路过这里，听到你们的争论，感觉很有意思。"] = "Hello. I was just passing by and heard your debate; it sounded very interesting.",
    ["您好，我找保罗，他是个退休军官。"] = "Hello, I'm looking for Paul. He is a retired officer.",
    ["您好，我是乞丐。"] = "Hello, I am a beggar.",
    ["您好，我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，霍伊大学科恩资深副教授的学生。"] = "Hello, I am Klein Moretti, a student of Senior Associate Professor Cohen of Hoy University.",
    ["您好，我是受雇来表演的小丑，请问……"] = "Hello, I am a Clown hired to perform, may I ask...",
    ["您好，我是奥利弗，专门负责俱乐部事务的联络人。看来您已经是某个俱乐部的成员了——很好，这里的东西您都可以使用。需要看看有什么，或者想回俱乐部坐坐，都可以找我。"] = "Hello, I am Oliver, the liaison responsible for club affairs. It seems you are already a member of a club—very good, you can use everything here. If you need to see what's available or want to sit back at the club, you can find me.",
    ["您好，我是工人代表，想请您看看今天的盒饭。"] = "Hello, I'm a workers' representative, I'd like you to take a look at today's boxed lunch.",
    ["您好，我是约瑟夫，约瑟夫就是我，我是地下市场书商。您想要的书，我为您寻找。"] = "Hello, I am Joseph. Joseph is me, and I am a bookseller in the Underground Market. The books you want, I will find for you.",
    ["您好，我是这里的主理人玛里琳，需要我为您推荐菜品吗？"] = "Hello, I am Marilyn, the manager here. Would you like me to recommend some dishes?",
    ["您好，我是马蒂尼，是这儿的调酒师。"] = "Hello, I am Martini, the bartender here.",
    ["您好，我请这位先生一杯酒。"] = "Hello, I'd like to buy this gentleman a drink.",
    ["您好，戴莉女士！"] = "Hello, Ms. Daly!",
    ["您好，找我有什么事吗？"] = "Hello, is there something you need?",
    ["您好，斯林太太，我来调查珍妮失踪案。"] = "Hello, Mrs. Slin, I'm here to investigate the Jenny disappearance case.",
    ["您好，新客人，如您所见我正在为“命运”劳作……"] = "Hello, new guest, as you can see, I am working for 'Fate'...",
    ["您好，是给我女儿挑选的，她下个月就满十六了，成年礼嘛，总得有一套像样的裙子。"] = "Hello, I'm picking it for my daughter. She turns sixteen next month, and for her coming-of-age ceremony, she needs a decent dress.",
    ["您好，有什么事吗？"] = "Hello, is something the matter?",
    ["您好，有什么事？"] = "Hello, what is it?",
    ["您好，来买票吗？我可以替您排队。"] = "Hello, are you here to buy tickets? I can wait in line for you.",
    ["您好，梅丽莎小姐！"] = "Hello, Miss Melissa!",
    ["您好，洛薇雅长老！"] = "Hello, Elder Lovia!",
    ["您好，班森先生！"] = "Hello, Mr. Benson!",
    ["您好，看看想吃点什么？"] = "Hello, what would you like to eat?",
    ["您好，美好的一天从香喷喷的煎肉开始！您想来点什么？"] = "Hello, a wonderful day starts with fragrant fried meat! What would you like?",
    ["您好，苏茜女士！"] = "Hello, Ms. Susie!",
    ["您好，薇尔莉特为您服务。"] = "Hello, Violet is at your service.",
    ["您好，要乘坐观光马车吗？"] = "Hello, would you like to take a sightseeing carriage?",
    ["您好，要来一束鲜花吗？"] = "Hello, would you like a bouquet of flowers?",
    ["您好，请允许我为您介绍香水版的廷根地图！"] = "Hello, please allow me to introduce you to the perfume version of the Tingen map!",
    ["您好，请问发生了什么事？"] = "Hello, may I ask what happened?",
    ["您好，请问您想来点什么呢？"] = "Hello, what would you like to have?",
    ["您好，请问您是……"] = "Hello, may I ask who you are...",
    ["您好，请问您是劳维斯先生吗？"] = "Hello, are you Mr. Lawis?",
    ["您好，请问您是劳维斯先生吗？您有一位叫珍妮的女儿吗？"] = "Hello, are you Mr. Lawis? Do you have a daughter named Jenny?",
    ["您好，请问您看到芬恩了吗？"] = "Hello, may I ask if you have seen Finn?",
    ["您好，请问是有射击练习需要吗？无论是求生、决斗、自保还是打猎，良好的射击技巧都必不可少。"] = "Hello, do you have a need for shooting practice? Whether it's for survival, dueling, self-defense, or hunting, good shooting skills are essential.",
    ["您好，请问有什么事吗？"] = "Hello, is there something I can help you with?",
    ["您好，请问有古井里的水吗？"] = "Hello, do you have any water from the ancient well?",
    ["您好，这位女士，您在给谁挑衣料？"] = "Hello, Madam, who are you picking fabric for?",
    ["您好，这里是交易公证处。公证人索罗·卡特为您服务。"] = "Hello, this is the Notarization office. Notary Solo Carter at your service.",
    ["您好，这里是慈善医院，请问有什么可以帮您的？"] = "Hello, this is the Charity Hospital, how can I help you?",
    ["您好，邓恩队长！"] = "Hello, Captain Dunn!",
    ["您好，阁下，希望没有妨碍到您。"] = "Hello, sir, I hope I haven't disturbed you.",
    ["您好，陌生的朋友。今天真是浇花的好天气，不是吗？"] = "Hello, strange friend. It's a great day for watering flowers, isn't it?",
    ["您好，黑荆棘安保公司的。关于史蒂芬公爵的案件，我需要了解一些情况。"] = "Hello, I'm from Blackthorn Security Company. I need to understand some details regarding the case of Duke St. Claire.",
    ["您好？抱歉，打断一下，你找我是有什么事吗？"] = "Hello? Sorry to interrupt, is there something you need from me?",
    ["您好？闪电速递，加急文件！"] = "Hello? Lightning Express, urgent document!",
    ["您如果想帮忙，可以去她家喊她女儿过来。广场后面第二条巷子，门口种着月桂树的那家。 "] = "If you want to help, you can go to her house and call her daughter over. It's the house in the second alley behind the square with a laurel tree planted at the entrance.",
    ["您如果愿意，可以留下地址，我闲暇时会登门拜访。"] = "If you are willing, you can leave your address, and I will visit when I have free time.",
    ["您婉拒了%s的加入邀请"] = "You declined %s's invitation to join.",
    ["您守护了我们。"] = "You protected us.",
    ["您对%s成功出价，竞拍价格%d%s"] = "You have successfully bid on %s. Bid price: %d %s.",
    ["您对%s的预出价被超过。"] = "Your pre-bid for %s has been exceeded.",
    ["您对绘画有研究吗？"] = "Do you have any research on painting?",
    ["您将对%s进行宣战，开战时间%s，是否确认？"] = "You are about to declare war on %s. The war start time is %s. Are you sure?",
    ["您将对<Highlight>[%s]</>进行宣战，开战时间<Highlight>%s</>，发起宣战需消耗俱乐部资金<Img tex2d=\"%s\"/>%s，是否确认？"] = "You are about to declare war on <Highlight> [%s] </>. The war start time is <Highlight> %s </>. Initiating a declaration of war requires consuming Club funds <Img tex2d=\"%s\"/> %s. Are you sure?",
    ["您将随机匹配加入其中一个势力"] = "You will be randomly matched to join one of the factions",
    ["您尚未解锁誓约系统，请达到30级解锁誓约系统再参与七日誓约吧。"] = "You have not unlocked the Covenant system, please reach level 30 to unlock the Covenant system before participating in the Seven-Day Covenant.",
    ["您尚未设置本期俱乐部英雄，点击前往设置"] = "You have not set this season's Club Hero. Click to go and set it.",
    ["您就是伦纳德先生等的那位客人吧。"] = "You must be the guest Mr. Leonard is waiting for.",
    ["您居然……哦！怎么能劳动俱乐部的成员做这种事，我真是羞愧。我不是派了塔诺那个年轻人去吗，他人呢？"] = "You actually... oh! How can I trouble a club member to do such a thing, I am truly ashamed. Didn't I send that young man Tano? Where is he?",
    ["您已"] = "You are already",
