    ["您是温柔有礼的人，会过上好生活的。"] = "You are a gentle and polite person, you will live a good life.",
    ["您是游客？听不懂鲁恩语吗？我说——我，是，乞，丐。"] = "Are you a tourist? Don't understand Loen language? I said—I, am, a, beg, gar.",
