    ["您是看着他成长的？"] = "You watched him grow up?",
    ["您是神灵？"] = "Are you a god?",
    ["您是第一个愿意停下脚步的，我不知道该怎么感谢您！"] = "You're the first person who was willing to stop. I don't know how to thank you!",
