    ["您的单人解契冷静期结束，缴纳50000苏勒后可以正式解除誓约，确定解契吗？"] = "Your single-player contract termination cooling-off period has ended. You can officially terminate the Covenant after paying 50,000 Sule. Are you sure you want to terminate the contract?",
