    ["您的身姿比花儿更美，我们再拍一张！"] = "Your posture is more beautiful than the flowers, let's take another one!",
    ["您的身影，总是让我不由自主地多看几眼，却又不敢让目光停留太久。"] = "Your figure always makes me steal a few extra glances involuntarily, yet I dare not let my gaze linger for too long.",
    ["您的邀约已被应允，%s的历史投影正穿越时光而来。静候片刻，一场独属于二人的漫步即将启程。"] = "Your invitation has been accepted, and the historical projection of %s is traveling through time. Wait a moment; a stroll belonging only to the two of you is about to begin.",
    ["您的邀请人已离开当前俱乐部，本次操作无效"] = "Your inviter has left the current club; this operation is invalid.",
    ["您的邀请人无批准加入权限，已向目标俱乐部发送加入申请"] = "Your inviter does not have approval authority; a join application has been sent to the target club.",
    ["您的队伍平均非凡评分未达到推荐非凡评分，已经自动取消当前匹配，建议和人机进行战斗或单独匹配"] = "Your team's average Beyonder rating does not meet the recommended rating. Current matchmaking has been automatically canceled. It is recommended to fight against AI or match alone.",
    ["您的队伍有成员未满足该副本的等级需求，已经自动取消当前匹配，建议和人机进行战斗或单独匹配"] = "A member of your team does not meet the level requirements for this dungeon. Current matchmaking has been automatically canceled. It is recommended to fight against AI or match alone.",
    ["您的陪伴令我不甚荣幸！本来我有约好人一道，但他在半路突然有事，先走了。"] = "Your company is my honor! I had originally arranged to come with someone, but he suddenly had something come up halfway and left first.",
    ["您的非凡评分低于当前副本的推荐评分，是否查看装配方案？"] = "Your Beyonder rating is lower than the recommended rating for the current dungeon. Do you want to view the equipment setup?",
    ["您的预期是？"] = "What is your expectation?",
    ["您看了半天，总不能就这么走了吧？"] = "You've been looking for a long time, you can't just leave like this, right?",
    ["您看到一位少年没有？他刚刚还在这儿和我家小姐说话。"] = "Have you seen a young boy? He was just here talking to my young mistress.",
    ["您看到了吗？是餐桌上的烛火！"] = "Did you see that? It's the candlelight on the dining table!",
    ["您看看这本！"] = "Take a look at this one!",
    ["您看看，有什么喜欢的？"] = "Take a look, is there anything you like?",
    ["您看起来并不太愉快。"] = "You don't look very happy.",
    ["您看起来，太清醒了，不太像是属于这里的人呢……"] = "You look... too sober; you don't seem like someone who belongs here...",
    ["您看这天，多热啊！是吧？<P_Heart>（眼神飘忽，闪烁其词。）</>"] = "Look at this weather, it's so hot! Isn't it? <P_Heart> (Eyes drifting, evasive.) </>",
    ["您看这幅画。笔触大胆，色彩浓烈……尤其是这个腰身的曲线，简直是大师手笔。"] = "Look at this painting. The brushstrokes are bold, the colors are intense... especially the curve of the waist, it's truly the work of a master.",
    ["您看这首情诗：“当你老了，头发花白……”多么浪漫！不愧出自大帝笔下！"] = "Look at this love poem: \"When you are old, and gray-haired...\" How romantic! It's worthy of being written by the Emperor!",
    ["您看，大家不是都热热闹闹地在买东西吗？"] = "Look, aren't everyone buying things busily?",
    ["您看，当地人不是都热热闹闹地在买东西吗？"] = "Look, aren't the locals all buying things busily?",
    ["您看，这些正装基本上都采用了羊毛混纺材料，比起纯羊毛更耐用、更容易养护，价格也便宜了三分之二。"] = "Look, these formal suits basically use wool-blend materials, which are more durable and easier to maintain than pure wool, and the price is two-thirds cheaper.",
    ["您看，这件和首饰盒里的有点重复了……"] = "You see, this piece is a bit repetitive with what's in the jewelry box...",
    ["您看，这地面我可是打扫了一遍又一遍。"] = "You see, I have cleaned this floor over and over again.",
    ["您看，这是非常神秘的一步，考虑到您当然没告诉我您的年龄是多少。"] = "You see, this is a very mysterious step, considering you certainly haven't told me your age.",
    ["您真不会后悔？若您才是爵士夫人，那可就享福啦！"] = "You really won't regret it? If you were still Lady Seamus, you'd be living in luxury!",
    ["您真会挑！鲑鱼得吃冷切的，新鲜的鲑鱼最肥美滑嫩。非得在我这儿买才行。"] = "You really know how to pick! Salmon should be eaten cold-cut; fresh salmon is the fattiest and most tender. You have to buy it from me.",
    ["您真是……太善良了！如果可以，您能先替我代付购物的钱吗？出来得匆忙，我必须回去取钱包……我会在这里等您！"] = "You are truly... too kind! If possible, could you pay for the shopping for me first? I came out in a hurry and must go back to get my wallet... I will wait for you here!",
    ["您真是一位严谨的绅士，期待我们下次见面。"] = "You are truly a prudent gentleman. I look forward to our next meeting.",
    ["您真是一位温柔的人，克莱恩先生。守护就是当初您想要变强的理由吗？"] = "You are truly a gentle person, Mr. Klein. Was protection the reason you wanted to become stronger in the first place?",
    ["您真是一位独具慧眼的小姐。"] = "You truly are a young lady with a discerning eye.",
    ["您真是个好人，愿女神庇佑您！"] = "You are truly a good person, may the Goddess Protection be with you!",
    ["您真是个有智慧的好人，让少女看到真实的血，比报纸上的凶杀报道更有用。"] = "You are truly a wise and kind person. Letting a young girl see real blood is more effective than murder reports in the newspaper.",
    ["您真是位善良的女士。谢谢您的好意，愿您今日顺利。"] = "You are truly a kind lady. Thank you for your kindness, may your day go smoothly.",
    ["您真是太善良了！如果可以，您能先替我代付购物的钱吗？出来得匆忙，我必须回去取钱包……我会在这里等您！"] = "You are truly too kind! If possible, could you pay for the shopping for me first? I came out in a hurry and must go back to get my wallet... I will wait for you here!",
    ["您真是太神奇了！我刚刚也感觉到小莉莉在心里呼唤我……我马上就去找她！"] = "You are truly amazing! I just felt little Lily calling me in my heart... I'll go find her right away!",
    ["您真是把省钱研究透了啊……这些都是非常有用的建议！我感觉自己又能多撑一段时间了。"] = "You really have studied saving money thoroughly... These are all very useful suggestions! I feel like I can hold on for a while longer.",
    ["您真有热情"] = "You are truly enthusiastic",
    ["您真有眼光，先生！总共只要6便士，还有一束赠送的花，您想要哪束？"] = "You have a great eye, sir! It's only 6 pence in total, and there is a free bouquet. Which one would you like?",
    ["您真的……很有热情。"] = "You are really... very passionate.",
    ["您真的是一位慷慨的先生、尊贵的存在。"] = "You are truly a generous gentleman and a noble existence.",
    ["您真的是市长候选人？"] = "Are you really a mayoral candidate?",
    ["您真的让我离开？我以为，为了保密，您会……"] = "Are you really letting me leave? I thought, for the sake of secrecy, you would...",
    ["您瞧，运营方式都一样，投币开锁，随处可还，但车各有千秋。"] = "You see, the operating method is the same: insert a coin to unlock, return anywhere, but each bike has its own merits.",
    ["您瞧，这个锁被雨淋的不成样子，我才说它看起来很好打开，并不是我要打开。"] = "You see, this lock is in such a bad state from the rain that I just said it looks easy to open; I didn't mean I was going to open it.",
    ["您知道吗，考古发现，霍纳奇斯山脉曾有人类活动的痕迹，明显已形成文明，存在一个古老的国度！"] = "Do you know, archaeological discoveries show that there were traces of human activity in the Hornacis Mountain Range, clearly having formed a civilization, with an ancient kingdom existing!",
    ["您知道吗？有灵魂的人可以在诗中找到知己……"] = "Do you know? People with souls can find a kindred spirit in poetry...",
    ["您知道吗？有灵魂的人可以在诗中找到知己……这一定是诗人说的话。"] = "Do you know? People with souls can find soulmates in poetry... This must be what poets say.",
    ["您知道如何唤醒大帝在这里的意志吗？"] = "Do you know how to awaken the Emperor's will here?",
    ["您知道如何摧毁这面屏障吗？我们想摧毁镜子，阻止献祭。"] = "Do you know how to destroy this barrier? We want to destroy the mirror and stop the sacrifice.",
    ["您知道演讲已经取消了吗？"] = "Do you know that the lecture has been canceled?",
    ["您知道班西港是个什么样的地方吗？"] = "Do you know what kind of place Bansy Harbor is?",
    ["您知道的，上一周班总是让人劳累不堪。周六周日恐怕……"] = "You know, working a whole week is always exhausting. Saturday and Sunday, I'm afraid...",
    ["您知道的，我可是……"] = "You know, I am...",
    ["您知道的，我喜欢探索历史，而不是总结历史。"] = "You know, I like to explore history, not summarize it.",
    ["您知道的，我最近都在拉斐尔墓园闲逛……"] = "You know, I've been hanging around Raphael Cemetery lately...",
    ["您知道的，我还是关注着自己的名声，并不想让人觉得我实在不体恤下层百姓，是吗？"] = "You know, I still care about my reputation, and I don't want people to think I'm truly uncompassionate toward the lower classes, do I?",
    ["您知道的，经济不景气的时候，流行的服饰就比较质朴实用。"] = "You know, when the economy is bad, popular clothing is more simple and practical.",
    ["您知道码头最近那起案件吗？啧……最近晚上最好别一个人去那边转悠。"] = "Do you know about that case at the dock recently? Tsk... it's best not to wander around there alone at night lately.",
    ["您知道福斯特和赛肯德这两个名字吗？总觉得他们和您……"] = "Do you know the names Foster and Second? I always feel like they are... with you.",
    ["您知道莫雷蒂先生吗，安洁莉卡小姐说您和他挺熟的。"] = "Do you know Mr. Moretti? Miss Angelica said you were quite close to him.",
    ["您知道那家酒馆的暗号吗？就是那边那家，有个老太婆把门的那家——"] = "Do you know the password for that tavern? The one over there, the one with the old woman guarding the door—",
    ["您知道，鲁恩的大学又毕业生不直接留校的传统，因此每年都有学生得到导师的推荐去其他大学面试讲师职位。"] = "You know, Loen's universities have a tradition where graduates are not directly retained, so every year students receive recommendations from their mentors to interview for lecturer positions at other universities.",
    ["您知道，鲁恩的大学有毕业生不直接留校的传统，因此每年都有学生得到导师的推荐去其他大学面试讲师职位。"] = "You know, Loen's universities have a tradition where graduates don't stay directly at the school, so every year students get recommendations from their mentors to interview for lecturer positions at other universities.",
    ["您竟然愿意见他第二次！"] = "To think you would actually agree to see him a second time!",
    ["您竟然是脚踏车公司的股东！"] = "You are actually a shareholder of the bicycle company!",
    ["您等等！我带您逛了半天，总也有个辛苦费吧？"] = "Wait! I've been showing you around for a long time, surely there's a service fee?",
    ["您终于来了，侦探{{先生|女士}}……"] = "You've finally come, Detective {{ Mr. | Ms. } }...",
    ["您经常参加慈善拍卖吗？"] = "Do you often attend charity auctions?",
    ["您经常向阿兹克先生请教问题吗？"] = "Do you often ask Mr. Azik for advice?",
    ["您经常来教堂这边祈祷吗？"] = "Do you often come to the cathedral to pray?",
    ["您绝对没见过这么脆嫩的卷心菜！"] = "You've definitely never seen such crisp and tender cabbage!",
    ["您耳朵红了。"] = "Your ears are red.",
    ["您能帮我偷偷试探一下那位赫伯特先生吗……"] = "Could you help me discreetly sound out that Mr. Herbert...?",
    ["您能给我介绍一下廷根的情况吗？"] = "Can you introduce the situation in Tingen to me?",
    ["您能预知天气？"] = "Can you predict the weather?",
    ["您脸色看起来不太好，有什么事吗？"] = "You don't look well, is something the matter?",
    ["您若质疑，我们可以现在请第三方匠人估价，或按章程申请仲裁。请进来看单据吧。站在街上讨论具体数字，对解决问题没有帮助。"] = "If you have doubts, we can ask a third-party craftsman to estimate the price now, or apply for arbitration according to the regulations. Please come in and look at the receipts. Standing on the street discussing specific numbers will not help solve the problem.",
    ["您被%s任命为%s"] = "You have been appointed as %s by %s.",
    ["您被移交队长权限，原个人积分将清零，重新以队伍积分累积。"] = "You have been granted leadership. Your original personal points will be cleared, and you will start accumulating team points again.",
    ["您要不先看看报纸吧。"] = "Perhaps you should read the newspaper first.",
    ["您要买到哪儿的火车票？"] = "Where do you need a train ticket to?",
    ["您要买点尝尝吗？只要1苏勒，买一个送十个！不，买一个送二十个！"] = "Would you like to buy some to try? Only 1 soli, buy one get ten free! No, buy one get twenty free!",
    ["您要去哪里呢？如果愿意尝试的话，这里新开了很多条新线路。"] = "Where are you heading? If you're willing to try, there are many new routes that have just opened up here.",
    ["您要哪家的报纸？都是1便士。"] = "Which newspaper do you want? They are all 1 penny.",
    ["您要是今天不去，明天更没法解释了！再说了，咱们还得交房租呢，您不上班，咱们连面包都买不起了。"] = "If you don't go today, you won't be able to explain it tomorrow! Besides, we still have to pay the rent. If you don't go to work, we won't even be able to afford bread.",
    ["您要是哪天碰巧见了，一定告诉他——就说别忘了凯瑟琳娜！他房间窗台上的薄荷草，再不来浇水就该枯啦。"] = "If you happen to see him one day, you must tell him—tell him not to forget Catherine! The mint on his windowsill will wither if he doesn't come to water it soon.",
    ["您要是想找更好品质的香料，可以去水仙花街，或者北区的文德尔街、豪尔斯街……"] = "If you want to find better quality spices, you can go to Daffodil Street, or Wendel Street and Howls Street in the North District...",
    ["您要是现在显灵帮我下去，我保证天天去码头帮流浪猫骂退野狗！就像那个……您座下的疯狂冒险家一样！"] = "If you manifest now to help me down, I promise to go to the docks every day to help stray cats chase away wild dogs! Just like that... crazy adventurer under your seat!",
    ["您要移交队长权限的玩家和您在不同分线，移交后原队伍积分清零，是否移交？"] = "The player you are transferring leadership to is in a different sub-channel. After the transfer, the original team points will be cleared. Do you want to transfer?",
    ["您要进银行？请，我不挡着您。"] = "Are you going into the bank? Please, I won't block your way.",
    ["您见过她吗？我文静、乖巧的女儿，或许现在正躲在哪里看小说。"] = "Have you seen her? My quiet, well-behaved daughter, perhaps she is hiding somewhere reading a novel right now.",
    ["您见过相关的例子吗？"] = "Have you seen relevant examples?",
    ["您觉得怎么样？"] = "What do you think?",
    ["您觉得，对于一件时装来说，最应当注意的特性是什么？"] = "In your opinion, what is the most important characteristic to consider for a piece of fashion?",
    ["您认识他们？多亏了在莫雷蒂家做女仆的那段日子，我才能成为男爵家的厨师！"] = "You know them? Thanks to the time I spent as a maid at the Moretti house, I was able to become a chef for a baron!",
    ["您认识她？"] = "You know her?",
    ["您认识我？"] = "You know me?",
    ["您认识罗珊？她可是我们这儿最开心的客人啦！没见人先听到她声音——“早上好呀！今天有什么太阳一样的花吗？” "] = "You know Roselle? She is our happiest customer! You hear her voice before you see her—'Good morning! Do you have any flowers like sunshine today?'",
    ["您让我知道，我的心还活着。"] = "You made me realize that my heart is still alive.",
    ["您说"] = "You speak",
    ["您说丽兹？哦，那是我妹妹。世界上最可爱的小天使。"] = "You mean Liz? Oh, that's my sister. The cutest little angel in the world.",
    ["您说什么？听懂动物说话的魔药没有存在价值？"] = "What did you say? A potion that lets you understand animals is worthless?",
    ["您说得也有道理。乔纳尔医生，黛西小姐的情况怎么样？"] = "You have a point. Dr. Jonar, how is Miss Daisy's condition?",
    ["您说得对"] = "You're right",
    ["您说得对……那么，请送我去弗拉德街的“罗森的民俗草药店”吧。我想，那边治伤会更快……"] = "You are right... Then, please take me to 'Rosson's Folk Herbalist Shop' on Vlad Street. I think my injuries will heal faster there...",
    ["您说得对！可是、可是我穷得快要吃不起面包了……我会在演出开始前因饥饿而晕倒吗？"] = "You're right! But, but I'm so poor I can barely afford bread... will I faint from hunger before the show starts?",
    ["您说得对，伯爵把照看小姐的重任交给我，我应该保持镇定。"] = "You are right. The Earl entrusted me with the important task of looking after the young lady, so I should remain calm.",
    ["您说得对，这里的东西品质确实不是太好。"] = "You're right, the quality of the things here is indeed not very good.",
    ["您说得对，那这块怎么样，价格多少？"] = "You're right. How about this one? What's the price?",
    ["您说得很对，她穿这个一定也好看。"] = "You are quite right, she would definitely look good in this too.",
    ["您说的\"不可知力量\"是什么意思？"] = "What do you mean by \"unknowable power\"?",
    ["您说的屋子是哪间？动静又是什么？"] = "Which room are you talking about? And what kind of commotion?",
    ["您说的是哪一件？"] = "Which one are you referring to?",
    ["您说鲁恩什么时候才能回到以前那样？"] = "When do you think Loen will return to how it was before?",
    ["您赠送给%s的%s道具超时未被领取，已返还您购买时消耗的货币。"] = "The %s item you gifted to %s was not claimed within the time limit. The currency consumed during your purchase has been returned to you.",
    ["您走得太突然了，孩子一直都希望来廷根和您一起过暑假。"] = "You left so suddenly. The child had always hoped to come to Tingen to spend the summer vacation with you.",
    ["您走得太突然了，孩子们一直希望来廷根和您一起过暑假。"] = "You left so suddenly; the children have always hoped to come to Tingen to spend the summer vacation with you.",
    ["您身上的香味是哪瓶呢？"] = "Which bottle is the scent you are wearing?",
    ["您身上的香水是哪瓶呢？"] = "Which perfume are you wearing?",
    ["您身后的这一位正是象征财富的守护灵，它身披金甲，手持——"] = "The one behind you is the guardian spirit symbolizing wealth; it is clad in golden armor, holding—",
    ["您辛苦了"] = "Thank you for your hard work",
    ["您辞去了%s一职"] = "You resigned from the position of %s.",
    ["您过奖了！做学问嘛，就得有这种敏锐的眼光才行。"] = "You flatter me! In academic work, one must have such a keen eye.",
    ["您过奖了，还要跟前辈们多学经验。"] = "You are too kind; I still need to learn more experience from my seniors.",
    ["您还好吗？"] = "Are you alright?",
    ["您还好吗？刚才那是——"] = "Are you alright? That just now was—",
    ["您还是冷静一下吧……"] = "You should calm down...",
    ["您还有什么想了解的吗？"] = "Is there anything else you would like to know?",
    ["您还有什么需要吗？"] = "Is there anything else you require?",
    ["您还有优惠券可以使用，是否<Highlight>不使用任何优惠券</>继续购买？"] = "You have coupons available. <Highlight> Do not use any coupons </> and continue purchasing?",
    ["您还有别的需要吗？"] = "Do you have any other needs?",
    ["您还有需要了解的内容吗？"] = "Is there anything else you need to know?",
    ["您还未加入俱乐部"] = "You have not joined a club yet.",
    ["您还未有成员寻访权限，可以先邀请自己的好友哦"] = "You do not have member recruitment permissions yet; you can invite your friends first.",
    ["您还没有俱乐部，无法邀请"] = "You do not have a club and cannot send invitations.",
    ["您还没有进行穿搭，要直接进入魅惑对决吗？"] = "You haven't dressed up yet. Do you want to enter the Charm Duel directly?",
    ["您还真是个作家，连这种事都觉得是素材？"] = "You really are a writer, even thinking of this kind of thing as material?",
    ["您还记得什么吗？"] = "Do you remember anything else?",
    ["您还记得她的特征吗？"] = "Do you still remember her features?",
    ["您这就要走了么，戈多先生？"] = "Are you leaving now, Mr. Godot?",
    ["您这是在做手工？"] = "Are you making handicrafts?",
    ["您这是在唱什么呀？"] = "What are you singing?",
    ["您这的房子有什么优势吗？"] = "What are the advantages of your place?",
    ["您这的租客"] = "The tenants you have here",
    ["您这的租客怎么样？"] = "How are the tenants here?",
    ["您这算是夸赞吗？我的老师说过，真相只有一个，存在过必然留有痕迹。我只是一直都遵循他的教诲罢了。"] = "Is that a compliment? My teacher once said that there is only one truth, and if something existed, it must have left traces. I have just always followed his teachings.",
