    ["惨案之后，我一直在做同样的噩梦，梦到苜蓿号前一秒还是正常的，突然爆发了冲突，就像恶魔附身一般。莫雷蒂先生，您可以解梦吗？"] = "Ever since the tragedy, I have been having the same nightmare. I dream that the Clover was normal one second, and then a conflict suddenly erupted, as if they were possessed by demons. Mr. Moretti, can you interpret this dream?",
