    ["惩戒"] = "Punishment",
    ["惩戒一"] = "Punishment I",
    ["惩戒伤害提升30%，且施放后有30%几率返还1点太阳能量，烈阳状态下该几率提升至100%。"] = "Punishment damage is increased by 30%, and there is a 30% chance to refund 1 point of Solar Energy after casting. This chance increases to 100% while in the Blazing Sun state.",
