    ["惩戒施放后有30%几率返还1点太阳能量，烈阳状态下该几率提升至100%。"] = "Casting Punishment has a 30% chance to return 1 point of Solar Energy; this chance increases to 100% in the Blazing Sun state.",
    ["惩戒灼烧"] = "Punishment Burn",
    ["惩戒额外凝聚2把巨锤，各造成50%的伤害。"] = "Punishment condenses 2 additional giant hammers, each dealing 50% damage.",
