    ["惩罚眩晕"] = "Punishment Stun",
    ["想不到小芬恩还有朋友呢，我以为他只会淌眼泪，除了维斯塔，没人喜欢他呢。"] = "I didn't think little Finn had friends. I thought he only knew how to shed tears; except for Vista, no one liked him.",
    ["想不想听听我的专业判断？你这件外套，肩太宽了，回头到我店里来一趟，我给你改一改。"] = "Want to hear my professional judgment? This coat of yours, the shoulders are too wide. Come to my shop later, and I'll alter it for you.",
    ["想不想开这样的车去拉姆德小镇？"] = "Do you want to drive a car like this to Lamud Town?",
    ["想不想给妈妈买一辆？"] = "Want to buy one for Mom?",
    ["想为谁献上一束花呢？女神会祝福你的。"] = "Who would you like to offer a bouquet of flowers to? The Goddess will bless you.",
    ["想为谁献上一束花呢？女神会祝福你的。       "] = "Who do you want to offer a bouquet of flowers to? The Goddess will bless you.",
