    ["想了解一下店里的珠宝吗？"] = "Would you like to learn about the jewelry in the shop?",
    ["想了解什么？"] = "What would you like to know?",
    ["想了解甜品"] = "Want to learn about desserts",
    ["想交朋友"] = "Want to make friends",
    ["想什么呢！学习！二人学习世界！"] = "What are you thinking! Studying! A study session for two!",
    ["想你的风牌子"] = "Missing You Wind Sign",
    ["想你的风还是吹到了塔罗学派"] = "The wind that misses you has finally reached the Tarot Club",
    ["想你，玛丽。爱你的，内特。"] = "Thinking of you, Mary. Love, Nate.",
    ["想借点金币周转吗？利息十分公道。"] = "Want to borrow some gold coins for turnover? The interest is very fair.",
    ["想出门，撞上桌角！买苹果，切开居然有虫洞！"] = "Want to go out, bump into a table corner! Buy an apple, cut it open and there's a wormhole!",
    ["想到了我的小伊琳"] = "Thought of My Little Irene",
    ["想到了我的小伊琳AI"] = "Thought of My Little Irene AI",
    ["想办法<h>安慰马勃</>"] = "Find a way to <h>comfort Mabo</>",
    ["想办法<h>补充台词</>越狱"] = "Find a way to <h>add lines</> to escape from prison",
    ["想办法打开“门”"] = "Find a way to open the \"Door\"",
    ["想办法解除火墙"] = "Find a way to dispel the wall of fire",
    ["想办法进入房间"] = "Find a way to enter the room",
    ["想办法进入私密区（提示：需要融入他们）"] = "Find a way to enter the private area (Hint: Need to blend in with them)",
    ["想办法追上<h>莉莉</>"] = "Find a way to catch up to <h> Lily </>",
    ["想办法逃离监狱下水道！"] = "Find a way to escape the prison sewers!",
    ["想办法靠近<h>绝望魔镜</>"] = "Find a way to get closer to the <h>Magic Mirror of Despair</>",
    ["想办法靠近绝望魔镜"] = "Find a way to get close to the Mirror of Despair",
    ["想办法驱赶藤蔓，救下无辜的路人"] = "Find a way to drive away the vines and save the innocent passerby.",
    ["想去舞蹈社，不过划艇社也挺有意思……"] = "I want to join the dance club, but the rowing club is also quite interesting...",
    ["想吃点什么？我们的厨师来自迪西海湾，拿手菜是海鲜饭。"] = "Want to eat something? Our chef is from Dixi Bay, and his specialty is seafood rice.",
    ["想听即兴演奏"] = "Want to hear improvisation",
    ["想听欢快的曲子"] = "Want to hear cheerful music",
    ["想听沉静的曲子"] = "Want to hear calm music",
    ["想和你成为好友"] = "Want to be friends with you",
    ["想喝一点特别的"] = "Want to drink something special",
    ["想喝点什么吗？阿曼达女士的手艺很好，会长……贝尔纳黛殿下，也会很乐意见到您的。"] = "Would you like something to drink? Ms. Amanda's skills are very good, and the President... Her Highness Bernadette, will also be very happy to see you.",
    ["想喝点什么吗？阿曼达女士的手艺很好，院长……贝尔纳黛殿下，也会很乐意见到您的。"] = "Would you like to drink something? Ms. Amanda's skills are excellent, and the Dean... Her Highness Bernadette, would also be very happy to see you.",
    ["想四处转转"] = "Want to walk around",
    ["想回到俱乐部吗。"] = "Want to go back to the club?",
    ["想妈妈的时候我就会来这里……"] = "When I miss my mom, I come here...",
    ["想对你命运进行占卜"] = "Wants to perform divination on your fate",
    ["想尝试新品？迪西雨露、苏尼亚风情，还是芋圆波波？"] = "Want to try something new? Dixi Dew, Sonia Style, or Taro Boba?",
    ["想当年……想当年我盥洗室里的马桶，都是镶着金子和钻石的，现在……嗝。"] = "Back in the day... back in the day, the toilet in my washroom was inlaid with gold and diamonds, now... *hic*.",
    ["想当年我也和罗莎是一样的地位……这才过了几年，就没人要了。"] = "Back in the day, I had the same status as Rosa... only a few years have passed, and now no one wants me.",
    ["想当年我盥洗室里的马桶，都是镶着金子和钻石的，现在……"] = "Back in the day, the toilets in my washroom were inlaid with gold and diamonds, now...",
    ["想得美，还有两车呢！"] = "Dream on, there are two more carts!",
    ["想必他们现在已经成家立业了吧，也可能早就把我忘了。"] = "Presumably they have started families by now, or perhaps they have long forgotten me.",
    ["想必女神也更喜欢休息日。"] = "Presumably, the Goddess also prefers the weekend.",
    ["想必那位先生应该不会失约的。"] = "Surely that gentleman wouldn't break his promise.",
    ["想快速了解廷根？去找中央广场的雅各布问问吧！"] = "Want to quickly understand Tingen? Go ask Jacob at Central Plaza!",
    ["想念你的\nJ"] = "Missing you \nJ",
    ["想念的东西……我想吃迪西馅饼，很想吃。"] = "Things I miss... I want to eat a Deisi pie, I really want to.",
    ["想恋爱来这里，这儿什么样的都有！"] = "Want to fall in love? Come here, we have all kinds of people here!",
    ["想想办法"] = "Think of a way",
    ["想想怎么带他们去圣塞琳娜教堂广场，接受剩下的考验吧。"] = "Think about how to take them to the Saint Selena Cathedral square to undergo the remaining trials.",
    ["想想怎么带他们去圣赛琳娜教堂广场，接受剩下的考验吧。"] = "Think about how to take them to the Saint Selena Cathedral square and accept the remaining tests.",
    ["想想那些体面人的生活，坐在办公室里，每个月领固定的薪水，不用总是为下一顿饭发愁。"] = "Think about the lives of those decent people, sitting in an office, receiving a fixed salary every month, without having to worry about the next meal.",
    ["想我了吗？嗯？"] = "Did you miss me? Hmm?",
    ["想打开这个宝箱，你得和我玩个游戏。"] = "To open this treasure chest, you have to play a game with me.",
    ["想拿工资？先报名“分红炸弹”——赢了分钱，输了算你运气不好。"] = "Want to get paid? First sign up for the 'Dividend Bomb'—if you win, you split the money; if you lose, it's just your bad luck.",
    ["想更换菜品随时找我，不打扰你执行任务啦。"] = "If you want to change the dishes, find me anytime. I won't disturb you from carrying out your mission.",
    ["想杀我……你们还不够资格！"] = "You want to kill me... you're not qualified enough!",
    ["想来想去，这辈子也没有什么办法。"] = "Thinking about it, there's no way around it in this life.",
    ["想来杯经典口味吗？还是试试新花样？"] = "Want a classic flavor? Or try something new?",
    ["想来点什么？"] = "What would you like?",
    ["想添加您为好友"] = "wants to add you as a friend",
    ["想清楚了"] = "Thought it through",
    ["想独占\r\n我的美貌吗？"] = "Do you want to monopolize\nmy beauty?",
    ["想玩火吗？动次打次——抱歉，你节奏错了！"] = "Want to play with fire? One, two, three—sorry, your rhythm is wrong!",
    ["想玩跳房子吗？"] = "Want to play hopscotch?",
    ["想给廷根大学的家伙们点颜色瞧瞧吗？请支持我们霍伊大学赛艇队吧！"] = "Want to show those guys from Tingen University a thing or two? Please support our Hoy University rowing team!",
    ["想被唤醒吗？只要你答应我一件事情，你就可以得到解放。"] = "Do you want to be awakened? As long as you agree to one thing, you can be liberated.",
    ["想要"] = "Want",
    ["想要一夜暴富吗，那就来恶龙争霸赛，想要一夜成名吗……"] = "Want to get rich overnight, then come to the Dragon Fighting Championship, want to become famous overnight...",
    ["想要一张回家的车票。\n        但我知道，我回不去了。即使成为真神，即使拥有改变一切的力量，我也回不去那个有网络、有外卖、有平凡幸福的家了。\n        所以，我只能把这里当成我的家，把这个世界当成我另一个的家乡。\n        我留下了蒸汽机，留下了法律，留下了航道，留下了故事和诗歌……我希望这个世界能变得更好，希望后来的人能少受一些苦，希望他们能记住——曾经有一个人，从很远的地方来，把这里当成了自己的家。\n        贝尔纳黛，如果你能看到这份日记，我想告诉你：爸爸不是一个好皇帝，也"] = "want a ticket home.\n        But I know I can't go back. Even if I become a True God, even if I possess the power to change everything, I can't go back to that home with the internet, food delivery, and ordinary happiness.\n        So, I can only treat this place as my home and this world as my other homeland.\n        I left behind the steam engine, the laws, the shipping lanes, the stories, and the poems... I hope this world can become better, I hope those who come after can suffer a little less, and I hope they remember—there was once a person who came from very far away and treated this place as his own home.\n        Bernadette, if you can see this diary, I want to tell you: Dad was not a good Emperor, nor",
    ["想要与你一起躺下"] = "Wants to lie down with you",
    ["想要些什么？"] = "What would you like?",
    ["想要什么自己拿。"] = "Take whatever you want.",
    ["想要听一曲，来感受这美好的一天吗？"] = "Would you like to listen to a tune and feel this wonderful day?",
    ["想要和太阳一般明媚的爱人，这样的要求我可是经常听。"] = "Wanting a lover as bright as the sun—I hear that request quite often.",
    ["想要对你进行安魂"] = "Wants to perform Soul Requiem on you",
    ["想要得到更准确的结果，付出一定的精力是应该的，迪亚戈先生，或许您可以单纯使用星座来解读？"] = "To get a more accurate result, it is worth putting in some effort. Mr. Diego, perhaps you could simply use constellations for interpretation?",
    ["想要您身上的香味"] = "Want the scent you are wearing",
    ["想要成为黑夜女神的信徒吗？"] = "Do you want to become a believer of the Evernight Goddess?",
    ["想要找个地段好一点的。"] = "I want to find something in a better location.",
    ["想要掷点"] = "Want roll",
    ["想要查看你的配装信息"] = "Wants to view your equipment info",
    ["想要活下去，总要付出点代价，不是吗？"] = "To survive, one must always pay a price, right?",
    ["想要的话，你要自己来拿。"] = "If you want it, you have to come and get it yourself.",
    ["想要瞻仰睡莲之美的人，去湖边就好啦！"] = "Those who want to admire the beauty of water lilies can just go to the lakeside!",
    ["想要窥视你的命运吗？"] = "Do you wish to peek into your fate?",
    ["想要自己拿"] = "I want to get it myself",
    ["想象一个淡绿色的春天"] = "Imagine a pale green spring,",
    ["想起一些事情，还是当面交代比较好。"] = "Remembered some things, it's better to explain them in person.",
    ["想起以前的事，心里总堵得慌。"] = "Thinking about the past always makes my heart feel heavy.",
    ["想起记忆"] = "Recall memories",
    ["想躺就继续躺吧"] = "If you want to lie down, just keep lying down",
    ["想通过考验，这种程度可不够。"] = "To pass the test, this level isn't enough.",
    ["想钓什么鱼？"] = "What kind of fish do you want to catch?",
    ["想！"] = "Yes!",
    ["想！它看起来太酷了！"] = "Yes! It looks so cool!",
    ["想！我想摆脱污染，找到一切的答案！"] = "Yes! I want to get rid of the corruption and find the answer to everything!",
    ["想！等等，我只有八岁啊妈妈……"] = "Yes! Wait, I'm only eight years old, Mom...",
    ["想！那边可太适合开车了！"] = "Yes! That place is perfect for driving!",
    ["想，当然想。可她不只是我的妈妈，有些事情比见面更重要。"] = "I do, of course I do. But she is not just my mother; some things are more important than meeting.",
    ["想，我很想"] = "Yes, I really want to",
    ["惹到我了"] = "You've provoked me",
    ["愈发清晰的哭声传来"] = "An increasingly clear crying sound comes",
    ["愈心"] = "Heart Healing",
    ["愉"] = "Yu",
    ["愉快"] = "Cheerful",
    ["愉快的散步时间"] = "Pleasant walking time",
    ["意外"] = "Accident",
    ["意外……是像噩梦中的疯狂吗？"] = "Accident... is it like the madness in a nightmare?",
    ["意外地不错。他说自己已经偷吃了几口——“作为厨师的特权”——但我知道那是谎话，他肯定没怎么吃。"] = "Surprisingly good. He said he had already stolen a few bites—'the privilege of a chef'—but I know that's a lie; he definitely didn't eat much.",
    ["意外的收获 一起献给“母亲”吧"] = "An unexpected harvest, let's offer it to the 'Mother' together.",
    ["意外的访客"] = "Unexpected Visitor",
    ["意外频发路段"] = "Accident-prone section",
    ["意志"] = "Willpower",
