    ["愚"] = "Fool",
    ["愚人狂欢还有%s秒开始，完成击杀可获得双倍积分！"] = "The Fool's Carnival begins in %s seconds; complete kills to earn double points!",
    ["愚弄命运"] = "Fooling Fate",
    ["愚弄塔罗"] = "Fooling Tarot",
    ["愚弄时间，历史，或是命运。"] = "Fooling time, history, or fate.",
    ["愚弄标记"] = "Fooling Mark",
    ["愚弄标记爆炸"] = "Fooling Mark Explosion",
    ["愚弄标记爆炸时会为自身增加一层命运效果，命运：增加自身愚弄标记的伤害50%，最多叠加4层，若选择了愚弄爆炸则也会影响愚弄爆炸的范围伤害。"] = "When Fooling Mark detonates, it grants you one stack of fate; fate: increases your Fooling Mark damage by 50%, stacking up to 4 times. If Fooling Explosion is selected, it will also affect the area damage of Fooling Explosion.",
    ["愚弄标记爆炸时自身少量回血。"] = "When Fooling Mark detonates, you recover a small amount of Health.",
    ["愚弄标记爆炸时造成范围伤害。"] = "When Fooling Mark detonates, it deals area damage.",
    ["愚弄标记的伤害增加50%，最多叠加4层。"] = "Fooling Mark damage increased by 50%, stacking up to 4 times.",
    ["愚弄爆炸"] = "Fooling Explosion",
    ["愚昧的人，看看他可怜的样子，一看就是中风了。"] = "Ignorant man, look at his pitiful state; it's obvious he's had a stroke.",
    ["愚昧的人，看看他现在那个可怜的样子。一看就是中风了。"] = "Ignorant man, look at his pathetic state now. It's clear at a glance that he's had a stroke.",
    ["愚爆自愈"] = "Fool's Explosion Self-Healing",
    ["愚者"] = "The Fool",
    ["愚者 塔罗的零号牌？"] = "The Fool, the zero card of the Tarot?",
    ["愚者-正位"] = "The Fool - Upright",
    ["愚者-逆位"] = "The Fool - Reversed",
    ["愚者1中"] = "Fool 1 medium shot",
    ["愚者3过肩"] = "Fool 3 over-the-shoulder shot",
    ["愚者……<P_Heart>（从未听说过的名号，但似乎隐含着可怕的隐秘与力量……不能再试探了，这太危险！）</>"] = "The Fool... <P_Heart>(A title I've never heard of, but it seems to imply terrifying secrets and power... I can't probe any further, it's too dangerous!)</>",
    ["愚者……所有可能的开始，所有未知的集合，所有旅程的起点。"] = "The Fool... the beginning of all possibilities, the collection of all unknowns, the starting point of all journeys.",
    ["愚者。"] = "The Fool.",
    ["愚者之梦-失控窥秘人-找到所有书架召唤衍生怪"] = "Fool's Dream-Out-of-control Seer-Find All Bookshelves to Summon Derivative Monster",
    ["愚者之梦-失控窥秘人-清除无用书架"] = "Fool's Dream-Out-of-control Seer-Clear Useless Bookshelf",
    ["愚者之梦-失控窥秘人-激光扫射书架和人"] = "Fool's Dream-Out-of-control Seer-Laser Sweep Bookshelf and People",
    ["愚者之梦-失控窥秘人-点名N个人召书架"] = "Fool's Dream-Out-of-control Seer-Mark N People to Summon Bookshelf",
    ["愚者之梦-玩家变身视线"] = "Fool's Dream - Player Transform Sight",
    ["愚者之梦-现场救援-找到玩家按z时位置"] = "Fool's Dream - On-site Rescue - Find Player Position when pressing Z",
    ["愚者之梦-窥秘人单点远程激光"] = "Fool's Dream - Mystery Pryer Single Point Ranged Laser",
    ["愚者之梦-窥秘人投影-反向视线"] = "Fool's Dream - Mystery Pryer Projection - Reverse Sight",
    ["愚者之梦-窥秘人投影-正向视线"] = "Fool's Dream - Mystery Pryer Projection - Forward Sight",
    ["愚者之梦-迷宫逃生-检测附近玩家"] = "Fool's Dream - Maze Escape - Detect Nearby Players",
    ["愚者之梦-迷宫逃生-检测隐身怪"] = "Fool's Dream-Maze Escape-Detect Invisibility Monster",
    ["愚者之梦·第1天"] = "Fool's Dream - Day 1",
    ["愚者之梦·第2天"] = "Fool's Dream - Day 2",
    ["愚者之梦日常模式已解锁"] = "Fool's Dream Daily Mode unlocked.",
    ["愚者之梦随机模式已解锁"] = "Fool's Dream Random Mode unlocked.",
    ["愚者之礼"] = "Gift of the Fool",
    ["愚者之礼-飞升计时"] = "Fool's Gift - Ascension Timer",
    ["愚者之茧"] = "Cocoon of the Fool",
    ["愚者信仰虽然算正神信仰，在水手群体里也很流行。但身为学生，不应该靠神明来解决课业问题，跟我去风纪处写检查！"] = "Although the faith of the Fool is considered a faith in a true deity and is quite popular among sailors, as a student, you shouldn't rely on gods to solve your academic problems. Come with me to the Disciplinary Office to write a self-reflection!",
    ["愚者先生的力量果然深不可测……您一定很感激他。"] = "Mr. Fool's power is indeed unfathomable... You must be very grateful to him.",
    ["愚者先生给了我们两年时间成长，也许就是为了这最后一次，秉承他的人性。"] = "Mr. Fool gave us two years to grow; perhaps it was for this final moment, to uphold his humanity.",
    ["愚者先生，倒吊人先生，我有个问题想要请教。<P_Yellow>扮演</>究竟是什么意思？"] = "Mr. Fool, Mr. Hanged Man, I have a question I would like to ask. What exactly does <P_Yellow>Acting</> mean?",
    ["愚者先生，您不觉得这种“聚会”很有意思吗？"] = "Mr. Fool, don't you think this kind of \"gathering\" is quite interesting?",
    ["愚者先生，您介意多几次现在这样的“尝试”吗？"] = "Mr. Fool, would you mind having a few more \"attempts\" like this?",
    ["愚者先生，我觉得这是一个很好的提议，只要“聚会”变成定期，有的事情如果您不方便出面，完全可以转交给我们。"] = "Mr. Fool, I think this is a great suggestion. As long as the \"gathering\" becomes regular, if there are matters inconvenient for you to handle personally, you can absolutely delegate them to us.",
    ["愚者利用屏障碎片的力量，制作神奇物品“祝福石板”，塔罗学派成员在“愚者”先生的祝福下，能有限度地获得石板上纪录的其他序列的部分能力。提前扮演到一定程度之后，便可以相对安全地获得这些跨序列的能力。"] = "Using the power of barrier fragments, Mr. Fool created the mystical item \"Blessing Tablet.\" Under the blessing of Mr. Fool, Tarot Club members can obtain a limited amount of some abilities of other Sequences recorded on the tablet. After reaching a certain degree of Pre-Acting, they can relatively safely obtain these cross-Sequence abilities.",
    ["愚者卡牌攒豆Action"] = "Fool Card bean accumulation Action.",
    ["愚者塑像"] = "Fool Statue",
    ["愚者塑像2"] = "Fool Statue 2",
    ["愚者大厅"] = "Fool's Hall",
    ["愚者庇佑"] = "Blessing of the Fool",
    ["愚者庇护"] = "Fool's Shelter",
    ["愚者彩带"] = "Fool's Ribbon",
    ["愚者教会"] = "Church of the Fool",
    ["愚者教会中年男性"] = "Church of the Fool Middle-aged Man",
    ["愚者教会信徒创设的福利制度。感谢各界人士对愚者教会的支持。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！"] = "Welfare system created by believers of the Fool Church. Thank you to all walks of life for your support of the Fool Church. \n Listen to the \"Fool's Scripture\", praise the Fool! May the grace of my Lord be with you day and night, becoming the light that never goes out on your path forward!",
    ["愚者教会信徒创设的福利制度。感谢各界人士对愚者教会的支持。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！\n购买立即获得<Highlight>300</>金镑以及<Highlight>2个</>活力方糖，并获得持续<Highlight>30</>天的福音券运势解读，以及解锁如下特权：\n<Highlight>※人脉快速互动次数增加：</>每日可额外获得<Highlight>5次快速互动次数</>，消耗道具可以直接获得与对应人脉的好感度。\n<Highlight>※玩法货币获取效率提升：</>获得<Highlight>冒险勋章</>、<Highlight>凯旋徽章</>以及<Highlight>同行纹章</>时，效率提升<Highlight>20%</>。\n<Highlight>※自定义传送信标：</>可在公共场景地图中记录<Highlight>福音尖碑坐标</>，记录完成后可随时传送到对应的<Highlight>福音尖碑</>处。\n<Highlight>※活力上限增加：</>活力累计上限增加<Highlight>1000</>点。\n此外，每日登录可获得<Highlight>100</>绑定金镑，累积登录还可额外获得更多<Highlight>活力方糖</>。\n愚者福音最多可持续<Highlight>180</>天，达上限后再次获得愚者福音将会转化为等额金镑。"] = "A welfare system created by the believers of the Church of The Fool. Thank you to all walks of life for your support of the Church of The Fool. \nListen to the 'Scripture of The Fool', praise The Fool! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward! \nPurchase to immediately receive <Highlight>300</> pounds and <Highlight>2</> Vitality Sugar Cubes, and receive continuous <Highlight>30</> days of Gospel Ticket fortune readings, as well as unlocking the following privileges: \n<Highlight>※ Increased rapid interaction frequency with connections: </>Receive an additional <Highlight>5 rapid interaction attempts per day</>; consuming items can directly increase favorability with corresponding connections. \n<Highlight>※ Increased efficiency in obtaining gameplay currency: </>Efficiency increased by <Highlight>20%</> when obtaining <Highlight>Adventure Medals</>, <Highlight>Triumph Badges</>, and <Highlight>Companion Emblems</>. \n<Highlight>※ Custom Teleport Beacons: </>You can record <Highlight>Gospel Obelisk</> coordinates on public scene maps; once recorded, you can teleport to the corresponding <Highlight>Gospel Obelisk</> at any time. \n<Highlight>※ Increased Vitality cap: </>Cumulative Vitality cap increased by <Highlight>1000</> points. \nIn addition, you can receive <Highlight>100</> Bound Pounds by logging in daily, and accumulate logins to receive even more <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cubes</>. \nThe Gospel of The Fool can last for a maximum of <Highlight>180</> days; once the limit is reached, obtaining the Gospel of The Fool again will be converted into an equivalent amount of pounds.",
    ["愚者教会女性"] = "Church of the Fool Woman",
    ["愚者教会带帽男性"] = "Church of the Fool Hooded Man",
    ["愚者教会的福音宣传……为什么会出现在大学城？"] = "Gospel propaganda from the Church of the Fool... why would it appear in the University District?",
    ["愚者教会的福音宣传居然出现在大学城……"] = "To think that gospel propaganda from the Church of the Fool has appeared in the University District...",
