    ["愿那里不再有贫穷与饥饿 只有舒缓的安眠曲落入你的梦里"] = "May there be no more poverty and hunger there, only a soothing lullaby falling into your dreams",
    ["愿风暴与你同在。"] = "May the Storm be with you.",
    ["愿风暴守护远航……"] = "May the Lord of Storms guard the voyage...",
    ["愿风暴庇佑你！"] = "May the Storm protect you!",
    ["愿黑夜女神庇佑你。"] = "May the Evernight Goddess guard you.",
    ["愿黑夜女神护佑你。"] = "May the Evernight Goddess protect you.",
    ["愿黑夜庇佑你！"] = "May the Night protect you!",
    ["愿黑夜庇护你。"] = "May the Evernight Goddess guard you.",
    ["愿黑夜庇护你。迷途的灵魂，终会在这里找到归宿。"] = "May the Evernight protect you. Lost souls will eventually find their resting place here.",
    ["慈善医疗虽然是免费的……但要花费一天时间……算了，今天不干活，明天就没饭吃了……"] = "Although charity medical care is free... it takes a whole day... forget it, if I don't work today, I won't have food tomorrow...",
    ["慈善家"] = "Philanthropist",
    ["慈善干事的伪善面具下，是压榨的深渊。解救劳工，让斩杀线在此终结。"] = "Beneath the hypocritical mask of the charity officer lies an abyss of exploitation. Rescue the laborers and let the execution line end here.",
    ["慈善性改善住房公司，让您住得安心，住得幸福！"] = "Charitable Housing Improvement Company, letting you live with peace of mind and happiness!",
    ["慈善是我最划算的买卖。拿去吧！"] = "Charity is my most cost-effective business. Take it!",
    ["慈悲的天平"] = "Scales of Mercy",
    ["慈悲的女神啊！昨晚试喝了新药，妈妈看起来已经有好转了......."] = "Merciful Goddess! After trying the new medicine last night, Mother seems to have improved...",
    ["慈悲的女神啊！昨晚试喝了新药，妈妈看起来已经有好转了……"] = "Merciful Goddess! After trying the new medicine last night, Mother seems to have improved...",
    ["慈悲的女神！求您......求您为我降临神迹，宽恕我的无知之罪！"] = "Merciful Goddess! I beg you... I beg you to perform a miracle for me and forgive my sin of ignorance!",
    ["慈悲的女神！求您……求您为我降临神迹，宽恕我的无知之罪！"] = "Merciful Goddess! I beg you... I beg you to perform a miracle for me and forgive my sin of ignorance!",
    ["慈爱……天之母亲……"] = "Benevolence... Mother of Heaven...",
    ["慈爱涟漪"] = "Ripple of Compassion",
    ["慑势碾压"] = "Intimidating Pressure",
    ["慢悠悠走回去就好，不用赶时间，挺舒服。"] = "Just walking back slowly is fine, no need to rush, quite comfortable.",
    ["慢慢地，我感觉身周温暖了起来。"] = "Slowly, I felt the warmth around me.",
    ["慢慢欣赏"] = "Enjoy slowly",
    ["慢脚"] = "Slow foot",
    ["慢走/奔跑切换"] = "Walk/Run Toggle",
    ["慢走！您在镇上遇到什么问题，报我马修的名字就行！"] = "Take care! If you run into any trouble in town, just mention the name Matthew!",
