    ["慧眼如炬！这枚宝石产自南大陆血钻矿，现在只需要五百金镑！而且我们也接受饰品外观的定制，您可以把它改造为喜欢的款式。"] = "Sharp-eyed! This gemstone is from the Southern Continent's blood diamond mine, and now it only costs five hundred gold pounds! And we also accept customization of the jewelry's appearance; you can transform it into the style you like.",
