    ["懂一点。但比起画布上的……我更喜欢观察……动态的美。"] = "A little. But compared to what's on the canvas... I prefer to observe... dynamic beauty.",
    ["懂事的小珍妮，一定是怕我看到后伤心，才拖着虚弱的身体跑到了这么远的地方……"] = "Sensible little Jenny must have been afraid that I would be sad if I saw her, so she dragged her weak body so far away...",
    ["懂，这种事情我见多了。"] = "I know, I've seen plenty of things like this.",
    ["懂，这种事情我见多了，有关信息基本都被清理掉了，懂得太多也不是好事。"] = "I know, I've seen this kind of thing many times; relevant information has basically been cleaned up, knowing too much isn't a good thing.",
