    ["戏剧节开幕当天 巨幅画像会被悬挂在飞艇上"] = "On the opening day of the drama festival, a massive portrait will be hung from the airship.",
    ["戏剧节散发铜镜，幕后有人操纵，我让洛耀和西迦去搜集和销毁这批铜镜了。"] = "The copper mirrors were distributed at the drama festival, and someone was manipulating it behind the scenes. I have asked Luo Yao and Xiga to collect and destroy this batch of copper mirrors.",
    ["戏剧节纪念品意外走俏 二手市场价格翻十倍"] = "Drama Festival Souvenirs Unexpectedly Popular, Second-hand Market Prices Rise Tenfold",
    ["戏剧节赞助商赠送的一枚小铜镜，外形小巧，崭新精致。"] = "A small copper mirror gifted by a theater festival sponsor; it is compact, brand new, and exquisite.",
    ["戏剧还有用鼻子看的？"] = "Do people watch plays with their noses?",
