    ["成衣"] = "Ready-to-wear",
    ["成都"] = "Chengdu",
    ["成长"] = "Growth",
    ["我"] = "Me",
    ["我\r\n喜\r\n欢"] = "I\nlike\nit",
    ["我\r\n很\r\n期\r\n待"] = "I \r\n am \r\n looking \r\n forward to it",
    ["我 明白了"] = "I understand.",
    ["我 真正的通灵者"] = "I, a true Spirit Medium.",
    ["我... 这俩小崽子耍我，我给他们卖了老鼠来，他们又不收。"] = "I... those two brats are playing me. I brought them rats to sell, and now they won't take them.",
    ["我......我会去尝试的！谢谢你！"] = "I... I will try! Thank you!",
    ["我......我实在不知道自己能做什么。"] = "I... I really don't know what I can do.",
    ["我...是...恶...灵..."] = "I... am... an... Evil Spirit...",
    ["我——"] = "I—",
    ["我——一位伟大的艺术家，坐在墙头，是为了感受艺术的微风，迎接浪漫的雨露。"] = "I—a great artist, sitting on this wall, am here to feel the breeze of art and welcome the romantic dew.",
    ["我……"] = "I...",
    ["我……不……能……输……给……老……人……"] = "I... can't... lose... to... an... old... man...",
    ["我……不知道这些。"] = "I... didn't know that.",
    ["我……不，我们承受了千万次的知识灌输，为了那个答案，不断地死去。"] = "I... no, we endured thousands of knowledge infusions, constantly dying for that answer.",
    ["我……不，我们，承受了千万次的知识灌输，不断孕育，不断诞生，不断死去。"] = "I... no, we, have endured thousands of knowledge indoctrinations, constantly gestating, constantly being born, constantly dying.",
    ["我……也是守护者？"] = "Am I... also a Guardian?",
    ["我……人类就是话多！"] = "I... Humans talk too much!",
    ["我……只记得我的名字了。"] = "I... I only remember my name.",
    ["我……回家了？"] = "I... am home?",
    ["我……好像做了一个梦，在梦里见证了尼尔先生与莎莉丝特小姐的过往。"] = "I... I think I had a dream, and in the dream, I witnessed the past of Mr. Neil and Miss Celeste.",
    ["我……就在你眼前……年轻人，可否帮老身一个忙——"] = "I am... right before your eyes... young man, could you do an old woman a favor—",
    ["我……忘记了。"] = "I... forgot.",
    ["我……想起来了……"] = "I... I remember now...",
    ["我……我一直忘不了我的家。"] = "I... I have never been able to forget my home.",
    ["我……我不知道"] = "I... I don't know",
    ["我……我不知道。但叔叔阿姨告诉我，只要我向女神祈祷一百天，噢不，是一千天，布鲁斯的病就会好起来的。"] = "I... I don't know. But my aunt and uncle told me that as long as I pray to the Goddess for a hundred days, oh no, a thousand days, Bruce's illness will get better.",
    ["我……我不知道。酒精确实给了我勇气，让我做了这辈子最疯狂的事。当着所有人的面吻您，然后像个懦夫一样逃走。"] = "I... I don't know. Alcohol did give me the courage to do the craziest thing in my life. Kissing you in front of everyone, and then running away like a coward.",
    ["我……我不知道啊。"] = "I... I don't know.",
    ["我……我不能就在这里倒下，啊！太阳——我赞美你！"] = "I... I cannot fall here, ah! Sun—I praise you!",
    ["我……我也来！"] = "I... I'm coming too!",
    ["我……我了解孩子们的脾气，也许我能帮忙。"] = "I... I understand children's temperaments; perhaps I can help.",
    ["我……我们也有自己的游戏，只是和你们的不太一样。"] = "I... we have our own games too, just not quite the same as yours.",
    ["我……我们会开王国会议讨论。"] = "I... we will hold a kingdom meeting to discuss it.",
    ["我……我们在玩捉迷藏……要数到一百之后，我才能去找他们。可是，他们早就跑得不知道多远了！"] = "I... we were playing hide-and-seek... I can only go look for them after counting to one hundred. But they ran off who knows how far away long ago!",
    ["我……我会去尝试的！谢谢你！"] = "I... I will try! Thank you!",
    ["我……我会认真考虑大家的建议。现在请让我先去工作吧，病人还在等。"] = "I... I will seriously consider everyone's suggestions. Now please let me go to work, the patients are still waiting.",
    ["我……我刚刚怎么了？"] = "I... what just happened to me?",
    ["我……我只是听说有家诊所药到病除。"] = "I... I just heard that there is a clinic that cures diseases instantly.",
    ["我……我可以吗？"] = "I... can I?",
    ["我……我后悔没听你们的 ，第一次就遇上他…… "] = "I... I regret not listening to you, I ran into him the first time...",
    ["我……我听您的，我愿意相信您。"] = "I... I'll listen to you. I'm willing to trust you.",
    ["我……我在这里。听着，我们得离开这儿，回孤儿院。玛莎……玛莎女士可能已经在那里等我们了。"] = "I... I'm here. Listen, we have to get out of here and go back to the orphanage. Ms. Martha... Ms. Martha might already be waiting for us there.",
    ["我……我实在不知道自己能做什么。"] = "I... I really don't know what I can do.",
    ["我……我应该开心吗？我是不是离当婚礼乐师越来越远了……"] = "I... should I be happy? Am I getting further and further away from being a wedding musician...",
    ["我……我很痛苦，我愧对两个孩子和亡夫……但是，我实在是无法拒绝斐乐的示好。"] = "I... I am in great pain, I have failed my two children and my late husband... but I really cannot refuse Phil's advances.",
    ["我……我怎么在这？"] = "I... why am I here?",
    ["我……我愿意！"] = "I... I do!",
    ["我……我把我的女儿小艾琳弄丢了。你能帮帮我吗？"] = "I... I lost my daughter, little Irene. Can you help me?",
    ["我……我是用了些特别的方法。你是纯粹的观察？"] = "I... I used some special methods. Are you purely observing?",
    ["我……我来评理吗？"] = "I... am I supposed to judge?",
    ["我……我梦游？我白天骂它是废品，晚上把它捡回来？！"] = "I... I sleepwalk? I call it junk during the day, and retrieve it at night?!",
    ["我……我欣赏我的表，可它不被认可……"] = "I... I appreciate my watch, but it isn't recognized...",
    ["我……我每天早上会给住在那间屋子的<P_Yellow>贝茨太太</>送报纸，可是今天她家门窗缝里渗出来一些闪闪发光、特别臭的水。"] = "I... I deliver newspapers to <P_Yellow>Mrs. Bates</> who lives in that room every morning, but today, some shimmering, foul-smelling liquid was seeping out from the cracks of her doors and windows.",
    ["我……我没醉……呕！"] = "I... I'm not drunk... Ugh!",
    ["我……我看见了。他是——<P_Yellow>特里斯</>。"] = "I... I saw it. He is—<P_Yellow> Triss </>.",
    ["我……我等会要去和莱丝莉约会，您有什么推荐的吗？"] = "I... I'm going on a date with Leslie later, do you have any recommendations?",
    ["我……我绝对不会忘记……你提过的东大陆！一定存在的西大陆！"] = "I... I will never forget... the Eastern Continent you mentioned! The Western Continent that must exist!",
    ["我……我觉得他好像注意到我们了。他的眼神好可怕，像妈妈说的那些客人一样……"] = "I... I think he noticed us. His eyes are so scary, just like those guests Mom talked about...",
    ["我……我还是有点害怕……"] = "I... I'm still a little scared...",
    ["我……我还要忏悔最后一件事……<P_Heart>（顿了顿）</> 我有时候会想，我能不能不当告解室，去当别的什么东西……"] = "I... I have one last thing to repent... <P_Heart> (Pauses) </> Sometimes I wonder, can I not be a confessional, and be something else instead...",
    ["我……我这一时半会出不去！村里多的是能借厕所的地方，你记好了——"] = "I... I can't get out for a while! There are plenty of places in the village to borrow a toilet, remember this—",
    ["我……拥有了一座城堡的所有权？<P_Heart>（这就是“正义”小姐说的，“找个地方落脚”？）</>可是……"] = "I... have ownership of a castle? <P_Heart>(Is this what Miss \"Justice\" said, \"find a place to stay\"?)</> But...",
    ["我……明白了！"] = "I... understand!",
    ["我……有做得像你一样好吗？"] = "Did I... do as well as you?",
    ["我……真的可以吗？"] = "I... can I really?",
    ["我……谢谢你，守了这么久。"] = "I... thank you for guarding it for so long.",
    ["我……还不确定。"] = "I... am not sure yet.",
    ["我、我……可现在免费的饭我也不一定能提供了……这里真的好陌生，我甚至不知道为什么有这种感觉！"] = "I, I... but now I might not even be able to provide free meals anymore... This place is so unfamiliar, I don't even know why I have this feeling!",
    ["我、我不想卖，我真的想看罗塞尔大帝的戏剧。"] = "I, I don't want to sell it. I really want to see Emperor Roselle's play.",
    ["我、我不是要饭的！"] = "I, I'm not a beggar!",
    ["我、我不是！什么资料！？"] = "I, I'm not! What materials!?",
    ["我、我不知道……"] = "I, I don't know...",
    ["我、我不确定，我想先跟警官确认一下。"] = "I, I'm not sure, I want to confirm with the officer first.",
    ["我、我也还有力气！"] = "I, I also still have strength!",
    ["我、我做到了……我杀了他。"] = "I, I did it... I killed him.",
    ["我、我再去收集一些材料，这是之前为了克莱恩的面试……"] = "I, I'll go collect some more materials. This was for Klein's interview earlier...",
    ["我、我再待一会儿就回去。"] = "I, I'll stay a little longer and then go back.",
    ["我、我只是来帮忙的，我不知道……"] = "I, I'm just here to help, I don't know...",
    ["我、我叫迈尔斯，他是卡兰，我们是附近的学生……"] = "I, I'm Miles, he's Kalan, we're students from nearby...",
    ["我、我可是尊贵的贝克兰德证券交易所交易员……"] = "I, I am a distinguished trader at the Backlund Stock Exchange...",
    ["我、我吗？<P_Yellow>三点</>的时候，我在准备下午茶……因为老爷最近几乎不吃东西，但吩咐茶一定要按时送。"] = "M-me? At <P_Yellow>three o'clock</>, I was preparing afternoon tea... because the Master hasn't eaten much lately, but he ordered the tea to be delivered on time.",
    ["我、我听见有人喊救命……"] = "I, I heard someone calling for help...",
    ["我、我就是想尝尝……书上说格尔曼最怕这个，我想要赢……"] = "I, I just wanted to try it... the book said Gehrman fears this the most, I wanted to win...",
    ["我、我就没必要了……我想先升职加薪，让我们过上更好的生活。"] = "I—I don't need to... I want to get a promotion and a raise first, so we can live a better life.",
    ["我、我居然还活着……"] = "I, I'm actually still alive...",
    ["我、我想过短暂热烈的一生，而不是漫长无聊的一生。"] = "I, I want to live a short and passionate life, not a long and boring one.",
    ["我、我明白了女士……我什么都愿意做！"] = "I, I understand, ma'am... I'm willing to do anything!",
    ["我、我是来道别的。"] = "I, I came to say goodbye.",
    ["我、我是谁……侠盗黑皇帝？不，我是凯娜，我是凯娜……"] = "I, who am I... the Phantom Thief Black Emperor? No, I am Kena, I am Kena...",
    ["我、我的手该往哪里放？"] = "Where, where should I put my hands?",
    ["我、我看到一双手救了我，但最后又突然笑着松开，我看不清他的样子，然后整个人开始急速坠落。"] = "I, I saw a pair of hands save me, but finally, they suddenly let go with a smile. I couldn't see his face clearly, and then my whole body started falling rapidly.",
    ["我、我看到有一双手救了我，但最后又突然笑着松开，我看不清他的样子，然后整个人开始急速坠落。"] = "I, I saw a pair of hands save me, but in the end, they suddenly let go with a smile. I couldn't see his face, and then my whole body began to fall rapidly.",
    ["我、我真的想买内部资料？"] = "I, do I really want to buy internal information?",
    ["我、我等他回家！"] = "I, I'll wait for him to come home!",
    ["我、我能做点什么吗？要不要把他们移到隐蔽些的地方……"] = "I, I can do something, right? Should I move them to a more secluded place...",
    ["我、我行吗？"] = "Am, am I capable?",
    ["我、我还有个问题。如果，我是说如果，一只普通动物喝了序列9的魔药，会发生什么事？"] = "I, I have another question. If, and I mean if, an ordinary animal drank a Sequence 9 potion, what would happen?",
    ["我一切都好，这个月，莫蒙特教授甚至亲自夸奖了我的作品。"] = "I am doing well. This month, Professor Momont even personally praised my work.",
    ["我一定会……找到你……"] = "I will definitely... find you...",
    ["我一定会去拜读的。"] = "I will definitely read it.",
    ["我一定会把她带回来的。"] = "I will definitely bring her back.",
    ["我一定会追到您的！"] = "I will definitely catch up to you!",
    ["我一定忽略了什么……再回后厨看看。"] = "I must have missed something... I'll go back to the kitchen and take another look.",
    ["我一定忽略了什么……再回后厨看看。马西莫，你……待会儿在餐厅等我。"] = "I must have overlooked something... I'll check the kitchen again. Massimo, you... wait for me in the dining room later.",
    ["我一定能做到的！"] = "I can definitely do it!",
    ["我一定要仔细观赏，否则和没来过廷根有什么区别？"] = "I must take a good look, otherwise what's the point of coming to Tingen?",
    ["我一定要拿回它！"] = "I must get it back!",
    ["我一生向善，自认为做事无愧于心，但我却未想到，大副和法官合谋将我送到了这里。"] = "I have been kind my whole life and believed I had a clear conscience, but I never expected the first mate and the judge to conspire to send me here.",
    ["我一生的恐惧都来自战争，我无法接受自己和一个弗萨克人相爱，我会永远活在恐惧和阴影里。"] = "All the fear in my life has come from war. I cannot accept falling in love with a Feysacian; I will live in fear and shadows forever.",
    ["我一直四处寻找他。这首曲子，是我写给他的，他从小就听我吹奏。"] = "I have been searching everywhere for him. This song is what I wrote for him; he has listened to me play it since he was little.",
    ["我一直在争取增加藏书预算，也在联系一些愿意捐书的上等人。希望总有一天，这里会有看不完的书。"] = "I have been striving to increase the book budget and am also contacting some high-class people willing to donate books. I hope that one day, there will be endless books to read here.",
    ["我一直在等你开口。但你太固执了。你说，一个仆人没资格提要求。"] = "I was always waiting for you to ask. But you were too stubborn. You said a servant had no right to make requests.",
    ["我一直在这里，我只是进入了你的<P_Yellow>梦</>，然后做了必要的引导。"] = "I have always been here. I just entered your <P_Yellow>dream</> and provided the necessary guidance.",
    ["我一直希望我能陪他从痛苦中走出来。但他的恐惧超过了一切。"] = "I have always hoped I could accompany him as he walked out of his pain. But his fear outweighed everything else.",
    ["我一直带在身上。你是说……用警官身份介入调查？"] = "I have it with me. You mean... intervene in the investigation as a police officer?",
    ["我一直想——我选了生命，是不是让老师失望了？我不是合格的求知者，不是合格的窥秘人。我害怕失去，害怕未知，害怕翻过这一页。"] = "I have always wondered—did I disappoint my teacher by choosing life? I am not a qualified seeker of knowledge, not a qualified Mystery Pryer. I am afraid of loss, afraid of the unknown, afraid of turning this page.",
    ["我一直想当家庭女教师，但现在工作的薪水也很不错。"] = "I always wanted to be a governess, but the pay for my current job is also quite good.",
    ["我一直无法对抗那恐怖的呓语，但你！你能隔绝那声音，也许你能带我进去。"] = "I have never been able to resist those terrifying whispers, but you! You can isolate that voice, perhaps you can take me in.",
    ["我一直是个好人"] = "I have always been a good person.",
    ["我一直都有点怕队长 虽然他很和蔼 给我父亲的感觉 但不知为什么就是害怕"] = "I've always been a little afraid of the Captain. Although he is very kind and gives me the feeling of a father, for some reason, I'm just afraid.",
    ["我一直都有点怕队长，虽然他很和蔼，给我父亲的感觉，但不知为什么就是害怕。"] = "I've always been a bit afraid of the Captain. Even though he's very kind and gives me a fatherly feeling, for some reason, I'm just scared.",
    ["我一辈子都不可能像那些小姐一样，住大房子，穿亮晶晶的衣服，吃漂亮点心，是不是？"] = "I will never be like those ladies, living in big houses, wearing shiny clothes, eating fancy desserts, right?",
    ["我丈夫已经失踪两天了，他肯定出事了……"] = "My husband has been missing for two days; something must have happened to him...",
    ["我上个月丢的怀表真的在三天后出现在餐桌上！"] = "The pocket watch I lost last month really appeared on the dining table three days later!",
    ["我上个月买了条会随心情变色的珍珠项链——来自“命运”途径的某位兼职珠宝商。<P_Heart>（俏皮眨眼）</>这在舞会上可帮了大忙。"] = "I bought a pearl necklace last month that changes color with my mood—it came from a part-time jeweler of the 'Fate' pathway. <P_Heart>(Winking playfully)</> This was a huge help at the ball.",
    ["我上了年纪后喜欢从世界各地收集戏剧面具，早就看习惯这些东西了。"] = "After I got older, I liked collecting theatrical masks from all over the world, so I've long been used to these things.",
    ["我上去和他搭话。"] = "I went up to strike up a conversation with him.",
    ["我上我也行！"] = "I could do better than that!",
    ["我下次一定好好复习少出去玩，下次一定！"] = "I will definitely study hard and go out less next time. I promise!",
    ["我不……不是……呕……"] = "I'm not... not... ugh...",
    ["我不一样，他们都是笨蛋！"] = "I'm different; they're all idiots!",
    ["我不上当"] = "I won't be fooled",
    ["我不中了"] = "I can't take it anymore",
    ["我不仅要价公道，而且还会帮客人把东西搬到家里。"] = "Not only are my prices fair, but I'll also help the customer carry their things into their home.",
    ["我不会举报你"] = "I won't report you",
    ["我不会在这里倒下！"] = "I will not fall here!",
    ["我不会忘记"] = "I will not forget.",
    ["我不会检举你"] = "I won't report you",
    ["我不会粗暴地对待你，毕竟你不是敌人，那会让你不太舒服、感觉疼痛，甚至留下后遗症。"] = "I won't treat you roughly. After all, you are not an enemy. That would make you uncomfortable, cause pain, and even leave sequelae.",
    ["我不会让覆灭的悲剧重演！"] = "I will not let the tragedy of destruction repeat itself!",
    ["我不会错过任何一次他们的纪念日。"] = "I will never miss any of their anniversaries.",
    ["我不信"] = "I don't believe it",
    ["我不信你。"] = "I don't believe you.",
    ["我不做人啦！"] = "I'm done being human!",
    ["我不做因蒂斯皇帝，在海岛上待了这么久后，还要问我这种引战的问题吗？"] = "I am not the Emperor of Intis. After staying on the island for so long, do you still have to ask me such provocative questions?",
    ["我不允许你说姐姐！"] = "I won't allow you to talk about my sister!",
    ["我不再感到迷茫和缺失，这比灵魂的完整更加充实。"] = "I no longer feel lost and incomplete; this is more fulfilling than the completeness of the soul.",
    ["我不听我不听……"] = "I'm not listening, I'm not listening...",
    ["我不喜欢那群小孩。"] = "I don't like those kids.",
    ["我不在乎这些。但扣除风险费，我只能出2000便士，海上的客人也不都是傻子。"] = "I don't care about that. But after deducting the risk fee, I can only offer 2000 pennies. Guests from the sea aren't all fools.",
    ["我不在乎这些。但扣除风险费，我只能出2000里纳尔，海上的客人也不都是傻子。"] = "I don't care about that. But after deducting the risk fee, I can only offer 2,000 gold pounds. Guests on the sea aren't all fools, either.",
    ["我不坐船，先生。不过看起来你是要乘坐那艘叫“慷慨号”的船吗？"] = "I'm not taking a ship, sir. But it looks like you are going to take that ship called the \"Generosity\"?",
    ["我不太擅长找人，如果克莱恩在这里会方便很多。"] = "I'm not very good at finding people. It would be much easier if Klein were here.",
    ["我不害怕，妈妈曾告诉过我，她会成为星星守护我的。"] = "I am not afraid. Mom once told me that she would become a star to protect me.",
    ["我不希望再过五年，我的周薪还在2镑以下，家里经济支出全靠我的弟弟妹妹。"] = "I don't want to still be earning less than 2 pounds a week five years from now, with the family's expenses relying entirely on my younger brother and sister.",
    ["我不得不举办舞会，引出幕后的凶手。"] = "I had no choice but to host a ball to lure out the mastermind behind it.",
    ["我不怕等，但我怕你进去之后后悔。"] = "I'm not afraid of waiting, but I'm afraid you'll regret it after you go in.",
    ["我不想伤害任何人……我只想生活得更好。"] = "I don't want to hurt anyone... I just want to live better.",
    ["我不想伤害你。"] = "I don't want to hurt you.",
    ["我不想再睡在街道和公园的长椅上……"] = "I don't want to sleep on street and park benches anymore...",
    ["我不想出门，我不想上班……"] = "I don't want to go out, I don't want to go to work...",
    ["我不想和尤斯塔斯一块打牌，他打牌的技术太糟糕了，他还可能随时睡着。"] = "I don't want to play cards with Eustace. He's terrible at it, and he might fall asleep at any moment.",
    ["我不想和杰尼玩了，他总跑这么慢。"] = "I don't want to play with Janny anymore, he always runs so slowly.",
    ["我不想死！"] = "I don't want to die!",
    ["我不想每一次和你独处都要这样躲躲藏藏……"] = "I don't want to have to hide like this every time I'm alone with you...",
    ["我不感兴趣"] = "I'm not interested",
    ["我不提倡沉溺于酒精，但是辛苦一天后来这里喝一杯，放松一下，还是很需要的。"] = "I don't advocate indulging in alcohol, but after a hard day, coming here for a drink to relax is still very necessary.",
    ["我不擅长做饭"] = "I'm not good at cooking",
    ["我不敢。我在这坐了俩小时了，腿都是软的。"] = "I don't dare to. I've been sitting here for two hours, and my legs are jelly.",
    ["我不敢去赌那种可能性。我是说，万一证实真的是我……"] = "I don't dare to gamble on that possibility. I mean, what if it's confirmed that it really is me...",
    ["我不明白你的意思"] = "I don't understand what you mean",
    ["我不明白，为什么我的梦里会反复出现他们？"] = "I don't understand, why do they appear repeatedly in my dreams?",
    ["我不明白，难道城里的教育，会让我获得比善良更好的品质吗？"] = "I don't understand. Could it be that education in the city will give me better qualities than kindness?",
    ["我不是……"] = "I am not...",
    ["我不是保罗。"] = "I am not Paul.",
    ["我不是小孩子了，关于婚姻我也想过很多，你们可以多问问我的想法呀，我很愿意和大家聊天。"] = "I'm not a child anymore. I've thought a lot about marriage too. You can ask for my thoughts more often; I'm very willing to chat with everyone.",
    ["我不是小家伙，我叫玛莎，艾登是我的朋友。"] = "I'm not a little one. My name is Martha, and Aiden is my friend.",
    ["我不是怪物！<P_Yellow>贝尔纳黛殿下</>……我不是怪物……我不是怪物！"] = "I am not a monster! <P_Yellow> Her Highness Bernadette </>... I am not a monster... I am not a monster!",
    ["我不是愚人号吗？"] = "Isn't it the Fool's Ship?",
    ["我不是我没有！"] = "It wasn't me, I didn't do it!",
    ["我不是我没有，我一点都不疯！"] = "I am not, I don't have it, I'm not crazy at all!",
    ["我不是找官方来处理了吗？柯莱特还赔了一大笔钱。"] = "Didn't I find the official authorities to handle it? Collet even paid a large sum of money.",
    ["我不是文职人员，我应该算是……值夜者？"] = "I am not a civilian staff member. I suppose I should be considered... a Nighthawk?",
    ["我不是有意……"] = "I didn't mean to...",
    ["我不是水手"] = "I am not a sailor",
    ["我不是神灵，我只是一个对漫长历史感兴趣的愚者。"] = "I am not a god; I am just a Fool who is interested in long history.",
    ["我不是要争对错，我是要确认我是对的。"] = "I'm not trying to argue about right or wrong; I'm trying to confirm that I am right.",
    ["我不是赌神"] = "I am not the God of Gamblers",
    ["我不是这个意思，只是想知道真相。"] = "That's not what I meant, I just wanted to know the truth.",
    ["我不是邪神的子嗣！"] = "I am not the offspring of an Evil God!",
    ["我不是非常懂服装，能聊聊量身定制吗？"] = "I don't know much about clothing, can we talk about custom tailoring?",
    ["我不死，你们死！"] = "I will not die, you will die!",
    ["我不清楚姐姐身上到底发生了什么，但她真的消失了，而那些人都在说谎！他们说她不存在，那是我的姐姐，她怎么可能不存在！！"] = "I don't know what happened to my sister, but she really disappeared, and those people are all lying! They say she doesn't exist, but she is my sister, how could she not exist!!",
    ["我不理解"] = "I don't understand",
    ["我不相信"] = "I don't believe it",
    ["我不相信……"] = "I don't believe it...",
    ["我不相信你"] = "I don't believe you",
    ["我不相信你们这些穷老鼠，更何况是只酗酒的老年鼠。"] = "I don't trust you poor rats, let alone an alcoholic old rat.",
    ["我不知道"] = "I don't know",
    ["我不知道……不知道……"] = "I don't know... I don't know...",
    ["我不知道……我昨天收摊很早……"] = "I don't know... I closed the stall very early yesterday...",
    ["我不知道。"] = "I don't know.",
    ["我不知道你是否有同样的感觉。我通常愿意为了乘上一辆有空座的地铁而多等上半个小时。"] = "I don't know if you have the same feeling. I am usually willing to wait an extra half hour just to get a seat on the subway.",
    ["我不知道它之前是什么味道，但这一道非常美味！"] = "I don't know what it tasted like before, but this is delicious!",
    ["我不知道该怎么解释，毕竟我只是一条狗。"] = "I don’t know how to explain it, after all, I am just a dog.",
    ["我不知道，他最近老说些我不懂的事情，什么控制风、召唤雨之类的。"] = "I don't know. He's been saying things I don't understand lately, like controlling the wind, summoning rain, and so on.",
    ["我不知道，但你的确很特别。在某种程度上，你更接近一个灵……"] = "I don't know, but you are indeed very special. In a sense, you are closer to a spirit...",
    ["我不知道，妈妈好几天没回家。早上我还没醒，突然有人闯进家里，把我赶出来了。"] = "I don't know, Mom hasn't been home for days. I hadn't woken up this morning when someone suddenly broke into the house and kicked me out.",
    ["我不确定"] = "I'm not sure",
    ["我不禁问起自己，生命有限，怎样才能让自己的作品永恒？"] = "I couldn't help but ask myself: life is finite, so how can I make my work eternal?",
    ["我不租了"] = "I'm not renting anymore",
    ["我不紧张……我不紧张……"] = "I'm not nervous... I'm not nervous...",
    ["我不缺钱，她想要什么我都能给她！"] = "I'm not short on money, I can give her whatever she wants!",
    ["我不羡慕真的"] = "I'm not envious, really",
    ["我不能……不能让你害了小黛西！"] = "I cannot... I cannot let you harm little Daisy!",
    ["我不能再失去……任何人了"] = "I cannot lose... anyone else.",
    ["我不能去"] = "I cannot go",
    ["我不能对失控者视而不见……抱歉，我必须动手了。"] = "I cannot turn a blind eye to those who have lost control... I'm sorry, I must act.",
    ["我不能死……死太可怕了……我在战场上见到那么多死人，死得都很残忍……"] = "I cannot die... death is too terrifying... I saw so many dead people on the battlefield, they all died so cruelly...",
    ["我不能每次都直接赠予你一笔钱，但我可以告诉你如何投资。罗塞尔大帝说过，送给人一条鱼，不如送他钓鱼的本领！"] = "I cannot give you a sum of money every time, but I can tell you how to invest. Emperor Roselle once said, giving a man a fish is not as good as teaching him how to fish!",
    ["我不能让别人也变成这样……求你别进去，千万别进去！"] = "I can't let others end up like this... please don't go in, absolutely don't go in!",
    ["我不能陪着我的小孙女去贝克兰德了，愿女神保佑丽娃。"] = "I can't accompany my little granddaughter to Backlund anymore. May the Goddess bless Riva.",
    ["我不行了"] = "I'm done for",
    ["我不要多，就两瓶，卖给我嘛！"] = "I don't want much, just two bottles, sell them to me!",
    ["我不要打架啊！根本赢不了……"] = "I don't want to fight! I can't win at all...",
    ["我不要走，也不能走。"] = "I will not leave, and I cannot leave.",
    ["我不要钱"] = "I don't want money",
    ["我不记得了，嘿嘿，脑子里乱七八糟的。"] = "I don't remember, hehe, my mind is a mess.",
    ["我不记得在韦尔奇家做过什么，也不记得有没有直接造成他和娜娅的死亡。"] = "I don't remember what I did at Welch's house, nor do I remember if I directly caused his and Naya's deaths.",
    ["我不记得过去，我遗忘了那些发誓要铭记的人和事……"] = "I don't remember the past, I have forgotten those people and things I swore to remember...",
    ["我不走！我自己的儿子，我自己……"] = "I'm not leaving! My own son, I...",
    ["我不这么觉得，这会破坏它们的风味……"] = "I don't think so, this will ruin their flavor...",
    ["我不问你的，你也别问我的。这样比较……安全。"] = "I won't ask about yours, and you don't ask about mine. That's safer... that way.",
    ["我不需要“善良”。善良救不了托马斯，善良救不了艾玛。善良只会，让我再次失去一切……"] = "I don't need 'kindness'. Kindness couldn't save Thomas, and it couldn't save Emma. Kindness will only make me lose everything again...",
    ["我不需要变成人来证明自己的价值，也不需要假装自己只是一条普通的狗来逃避责任。"] = "I don't need to become a human to prove my value, nor do I need to pretend to be just an ordinary dog to shirk responsibility.",
    ["我不！"] = "I won't!",
    ["我与星辉，共享自由。"] = "I share freedom with the starlight.",
    ["我与那位非凡者见过，他的气息诡异又古怪，但序列似乎并不高，估计在序列九或八左右。"] = "I have met that Beyonder. Their aura is eerie and strange, but their Sequence doesn't seem high—likely around Sequence 9 or 8.",
    ["我为了多赚些钱给杰姆治病，只能一个人出来工作。但我一个人应付不来……就像刚才，差点摔死在烟囱里……"] = "To earn more money for Jem's treatment, I have to work alone. But I can't handle it by myself... just like earlier, I almost fell to my death in the chimney...",
    ["我为什么……好像今天才第一次吃出它们的差别？！"] = "Why... does it feel like today is the first time I've been able to taste the difference between them?!",
    ["我为什么不能是鸽子？"] = "Why can't I be a pigeon?",
    ["我为什么不走？风暴在上，我希望你能好好使用你那双美丽的眼睛。"] = "Why wouldn't I leave? Storm above, I hope you can make good use of those beautiful eyes of yours.",
    ["我为什么在这里？"] = "Why am I here?",
    ["我为什么要帮助你？"] = "Why should I help you?",
    ["我为她们每个人送上来自因蒂斯的黄水仙，祈求那些美丽小姐的垂怜。"] = "I present each of them with yellow narcissus from Intis, praying for the favor of those beautiful ladies.",
    ["我为秩序的化身，他们称我为“秩序天平”……对，就是圆桌上的那个。"] = "I am the incarnation of order, they call me the \"Order Scale\"... Yes, the one on the round table.",
    ["我为自己感到惊讶，我的心居然没有因欲望而立刻融化。"] = "I am surprised at myself; my heart did not melt immediately due to desire.",
    ["我主不会强迫人们改信，也不介意信仰是否纯粹，简单来说，他不介意人们在信仰其他神灵的时候信仰他。"] = "My Lord does not force people to convert, nor does he mind if the faith is pure. Simply put, he doesn't mind if people believe in him while believing in other gods.",
    ["我主居于现实和灵界之上，仁慈洒满了天国和大地，他的座旁共有六位天使侍立……"] = "My Lord dwells above reality and the Spirit World, mercy fills the heavens and the earth, and six angels stand by His side...",
    ["我主拯救了被众神遗弃的失落城邦，带领那片大陆的幸存者走出“神弃之地”，在海岛上重建了家园……"] = "My Lord saved the lost city-state abandoned by the gods, led the survivors of that continent out of the \"Forsaken Land of the Gods\", and rebuilt their home on the island...",
    ["我主曾目睹数千年来，一代代人的守护，一次次的抵抗和牺牲。"] = "My Lord has witnessed thousands of years of guarding by generations, and repeated resistance and sacrifice.",
    ["我主自称“愚者”，在过去，在现在，也在未来，他是支配灵界的伟大主宰，也是执掌好运的黄黑之王，更是每个生灵追求永恒的道标。"] = "My Lord calls himself \"The Fool\". In the past, in the present, and in the future, he is the great ruler who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living being pursuing eternity.",
    ["我主要治疗孩子们生长发育时会遇到的种种问题……"] = "I mainly treat the various problems children encounter during their growth and development...",
    ["我之前攒的钱，也都拿出来给哥哥看病了。"] = "The money I saved up before was all spent on my brother's medical treatment.",
    ["我乘上了前往南大陆的船只，驶入了险流无数的狂暴海。"] = "I boarded a ship to the Southern Continent and sailed into the Berserk Sea, which has countless dangerous currents.",
    ["我九年没买过香水了，我从来不需要它！"] = "I haven't bought perfume in nine years, I never need it!",
    ["我也一样。我的身后，是那些需要被守护的人。"] = "I am the same. Behind me are those who need to be guarded.",
    ["我也一直这么认为的，在活着的时候去做想做的事，不要临死前有所遗憾！"] = "I have always thought so too. Do what you want to do while you are alive, and don't have any regrets before you die!",
    ["我也不会再去骗人了，不然良心会遭受谴责……"] = "I won't go around lying to people anymore either, or my conscience will be condemned...",
    ["我也不太清楚……{{尊敬的先生|尊敬的女士}}，如果你愿意的话，就帮我找找具体的地址吧!"] = "I'm not quite sure either... {{Respected Mr.|Respected Ms.}}, if you are willing, please help me find the specific address!",
    ["我也不知道……"] = "I don't know either...",
    ["我也不知道……为什么一定要把笔记给瑞尔·比伯？"] = "I don't know either... why did it have to be given to Ray Bieber?",
    ["我也不知道……是那些字，越来越多，挤在一起就会变成那样。"] = "I don't know either... it's those words, there are more and more of them, and when they get squeezed together, they become like that.",
    ["我也不知道为什么，但我突然感觉……平静了不少。"] = "I don't know why, but I suddenly feel... much calmer.",
    ["我也不知道，只是听她说是有人吃了那样美食，癫痫就好了。"] = "I don't know either, I just heard her say that someone ate that delicacy and their epilepsy was cured.",
    ["我也不知道，我一直在盯着烤炉里的面包胚……"] = "I don't know either, I was just staring at the bread dough in the oven...",
    ["我也不知道，或许只是这样远远看着她就够了……"] = "I don't know either, perhaps just watching her from afar is enough...",
    ["我也不记得以前了，我也感受过被人帮助的温暖。我理解你的感受，但是……"] = "I don't remember the past either, and I have also felt the warmth of being helped. I understand how you feel, but...",
    ["我也做好进入的准备，这样才有机会救出罗珊小姐和失踪者。"] = "I am also ready to enter; that way, we'll have a chance to save Miss Rozanne and the missing people.",
    ["我也刚知道布置的“鬼屋”旁有非凡事件，把大家都叫来了。"] = "I just found out there was a Beyonder incident near the \"Haunted House\" setup, so I called everyone over.",
    ["我也到后面排队买一个吧！"] = "I'll go to the back of the line to buy one too!",
    ["我也去……"] = "I'll go too...",
    ["我也去！"] = "I'll go too!",
    ["我也只是顾客。"] = "I'm just a customer too.",
    ["我也可以主宰"] = "I can also master it.",
    ["我也可以来等人。你在等谁？"] = "I can be here to wait for someone too. Who are you waiting for?",
    ["我也同样没想着放你离开。既然今夜这一幕被你瞧见了，那就把命也留下来吧！"] = "I didn't intend to let you leave either. Since you saw this scene tonight, you might as well leave your life here!",
    ["我也听说了，而且中心广场下了几次金镑雨，接触金雨的普通人很多都出了问题。"] = "I heard about that too. Plus, there was a rain of gold pounds in the central square, and many ordinary people who came into contact with the golden rain have developed problems.",
    ["我也在家里练习了很久，天天对着鸡蛋仔细观察。"] = "I've also been practicing at home, observing eggs carefully every day.",
    ["我也在尝试。月亮仆从为了更好地控制镜中廷根，利用绝望魔镜封印了我父亲残留的意志，其中最强烈的部分被分割成许多块，封在不同的隐藏空间中。"] = "I am trying as well. To better control Tingen in the Mirror, the Moon Servant used the Magic Mirror of Despair to seal the remnants of my father's will. The most intense parts were split into many pieces and sealed in different hidden spaces.",
    ["我也在想这种可能性，但关于“镜中国度”，我们还一无所知。"] = "I am also thinking about this possibility, but we still know nothing about the \"Mirror Realm.\"",
    ["我也在梦里掌控过这股力量。"] = "I have also controlled this power in my dreams.",
    ["我也完全理解你即将做出的决定。但在这之前，我想邀请你再闻闻雏菊的芬芳。"] = "I also fully understand the decision you are about to make. But before that, I would like to invite you to smell the fragrance of the daisies again.",
    ["我也希望，小黛西能特殊地“活下去”。但按照我们对封印物的管理守则，我必须带回3-888。"] = "I also hope that little Daisy can \"live\" in a special way. But according to our management rules for Sealed Artifacts, I must bring back 3-888.",
    ["我也很想和你们一起！哎，世界上会有把歌声变得美妙的魔法吗？"] = "I really want to join you all too! Sigh, is there any magic in the world that can make singing beautiful?",
    ["我也很抱歉，罗珊，即便你是来相亲的，我们也不应该过多干涉，更别说只是误会……"] = "I'm also very sorry, Rozanne. Even if you were on a blind date, we shouldn't have interfered so much, let alone when it was just a misunderstanding...",
    ["我也很难想象，她会就这样离开。"] = "I also find it hard to imagine she would just leave like that.",
    ["我也很难过……但我不得不带回封印物，让他们接受应有的惩罚。"] = "I am also very sad... But I had to bring back the Sealed Artifact and let them accept the punishment they deserve.",
    ["我也很难过……我虽然带回了封印物，却不忍心浇灭丽埃娜最后的希望。"] = "I am also very sad... Although I brought back the Sealed Artifact, I couldn't bear to extinguish Liana's last hope.",
    ["我也很难过，丽贝卡……我把封印物3-888留给丽埃娜也是暂时的决定。"] = "I am also very sad, Rebecca... Leaving Sealed Artifact 3-888 with Liana is also a temporary decision.",
    ["我也得去完成自己的任务，调查一个和刺客途径有关的封印物。"] = "I also have to complete my own task, which is to investigate a Sealed Artifact related to the Assassin pathway.",
    ["我也想去大剧院看看，你方便带我一起去吗？"] = "I also want to go to the Grand Theater to take a look. Is it convenient for you to take me with you?",
    ["我也想和米兰达聊聊天呢，她们总是在一块儿……"] = "I also want to chat with Miranda, they are always together...",
    ["我也想学习魔镜占卜。"] = "I also want to learn magic mirror divination.",
    ["我也想学作诗……"] = "I want to learn how to write poetry too...",
    ["我也想寻宝！"] = "I want to treasure hunt too!",
    ["我也想成为你们的一员"] = "I also want to become one of you",
    ["我也想拥有薪水！"] = "I want to have a salary too!",
    ["我也想给老婆置件新大衣，她那件旧的呢子都打了三年补丁了……"] = "I also want to get my wife a new coat; her old woolen one has had patches for three years...",
    ["我也想见证那场，没能举办的婚礼……"] = "I also want to witness that wedding that never happened...",
    ["我也想认识它们"] = "I want to know them too",
    ["我也想试试寻宝，也许您能给我些建议？"] = "I'd like to try treasure hunting too. Perhaps you could give me some advice?",
    ["我也想起来了，哼哼。而且，我还记得王子不叫埃德披萨，叫埃哟萨克！"] = "I remember now too, hum hum. And I also remember the prince isn't named Ed-pizza, he's named Ed-yo-sak!",
    ["我也懂一点占卜，如果您不介意，我可以帮您看看，完全免费。"] = "I also know a little bit about divination. If you don't mind, I can help you take a look, completely free of charge.",
    ["我也才加入俱乐部不久，但听说她正在周游世界寻找新的甜品灵感呢！"] = "I haven't been in the club for long, but I heard she is traveling the world looking for new dessert inspiration!",
    ["我也拿不出一分钱……"] = "I don't have a single penny either...",
    ["我也撞见了，顺着它们跑来的方向过去看，没抓到野兽，倒是在草丛里捡到了一张情报贩子的名片。"] = "I ran into it too. I followed the direction they came from to take a look, but I didn't catch any beasts. Instead, I found an intelligence broker's business card in the grass.",
    ["我也是"] = "Me too",
    ["我也是几天没吃东西，饿得迷了眼，才会做这种事……"] = "I haven't eaten for days either, and I was so hungry I couldn't see straight, which is why I did this...",
    ["我也是占卜师，我可以看看您抽到的牌吗？"] = "I am also a diviner. May I take a look at the card you drew?",
    ["我也是听别人讲的，信不信由你。"] = "I'm just telling you what I heard from others, believe it or not.",
    ["我也是外乡人"] = "I am an outsider too",
    ["我也是菇"] = "I am a mushroom too",
    ["我也是这么希望的，我也要成为高空杂技演员，去莱斯马戏团，让我老爸看到。"] = "I hope so too. I also want to become a high-altitude acrobat and go to the Reis Circus so my dad can see me.",
    ["我也是这样的。"] = "I am the same.",
    ["我也是这样的态度。"] = "I share that same attitude.",
    ["我也是！"] = "Me too!",
    ["我也是！而且，我才入睡没多久。睡着前的外面多安静啊，连马车声都听不到。"] = "Me too! And I hadn't been asleep for long. It was so quiet outside before I fell asleep; I couldn't even hear the sound of carriages.",
    ["我也曾是“窥秘人”，我知道你在忍受什么，所以，我能帮你。"] = "I was also a Mystery Pryer once. I know what you are enduring, so I can help you.",
    ["我也有个朋友"] = "I also have a friend",
    ["我也有个朋友……"] = "I also have a friend...",
    ["我也有个朋友，急需一份内部资料！"] = "I also have a friend who urgently needs a copy of the insider materials!",
    ["我也来一杯"] = "I'll have a cup too",
    ["我也来帮忙找找线索。"] = "I'll help look for clues as well.",
    ["我也欣赏你，兔子"] = "I admire you too, rabbit",
    ["我也没什么事情可做，就每天出来站站，说不定他哪天就回来了。"] = "I don't have anything else to do, so I come out and stand here every day. Maybe he'll come back one of these days.",
    ["我也没想那么多，看到有人被欺负，就冲上去了。"] = "I didn't think much either. When I saw someone being bullied, I just rushed up.",
    ["我也真喜欢区"] = "I really like the district too",
    ["我也知道，他向其他神明祈祷。"] = "I also know that he prays to other gods.",
    ["我也被鲁本枪杀了——因为目击了他的罪行。我们的墓碑是连在一起的。"] = "I was also shot to death by Reuben—because I witnessed his crimes. Our tombstones are right next to each other.",
    ["我也要努力！不能再给爸爸添麻烦了！"] = "I have to work hard too! I can't cause any more trouble for my father!",
    ["我也要去吗？"] = "Do I have to go too?",
    ["我也要回去了。"] = "I should head back too.",
    ["我也要学着布鲁斯的样子赞美女神！"] = "I also want to learn to praise the Goddess like Bruce!",
    ["我也要学，妈妈教我！"] = "I want to learn too, Mom, teach me!",
    ["我也要死吗？\n持续参与，将获得某些神秘存在的馈赠。"] = "Am I going to die too? \n Continue participating to receive gifts from certain mysterious existences.",
    ["我也要等到老特勒被找到才能回到圣赛琳娜教堂。"] = "I also have to wait until Old Teller is found before I can return to Saint Selena Cathedral.",
    ["我也觉得我足够幸运。"] = "I also think I am lucky enough.",
    ["我也觉得拉姆德古堡的风让人沉醉。"] = "I also think the breeze at Lamud Castle is intoxicating.",
    ["我也觉得，真没劲……"] = "I feel the same way, it's so boring...",
    ["我也觉得，要不还是快点走吧"] = "I think so too. Maybe we should just leave quickly.",
    ["我也许能从他身上发现点什么，准备好了吗？"] = "Maybe I can discover something from him. Are you ready?",
    ["我也许能帮上忙，不如让我试试？"] = "Maybe I can help. Why don't you let me try?",
    ["我也试试"] = "I'll try too",
    ["我也这么觉得，也许那些童话传说都是从这个时空传到我们的世界中的。"] = "I think so too. Perhaps those fairy tales and legends were all transmitted from this time and space to our world.",
    ["我也这么觉得，这里的每一个设计我都很喜欢！"] = "I think so too, I love every design here!",
    ["我也这样跟邓恩说过，但他似乎听不进去。"] = "I've told Dunn the same thing, but he doesn't seem to listen.",
    ["我书包里还有三块奶油硬糖！都给您！其实妹妹打碎花瓶那次……是我干的！还有小狗哈尼，它没有偷吃土豆……"] = "I still have three cream hard candies in my schoolbag! They're all for you! Actually, the time my sister broke the vase... it was me! And the puppy Honey, it didn't steal the potatoes...",
    ["我买一支送你，你和我回家好不好呀？"] = "If I buy one for you, will you come home with me?",
    ["我买到票了 我买到前区的票了！"] = "I got a ticket! I got a ticket for the front section!",
    ["我了解了，接下来我要对施佩尔先生展开非常私密的心理诊疗，请你暂时回避，并且保证不让任何人进入这个房间。"] = "I understand. Next, I will conduct a very private psychological consultation for Mr. Speer. Please step aside for a moment and ensure that no one enters this room.",
    ["我了解你们的难处，只是....."] = "I understand your difficulties, it's just...",
    ["我了解你们的难处，只是……"] = "I understand your difficulties, it's just...",
    ["我事先向公司申请了封印物旅行指南。"] = "I applied for the Sealed Artifact, Travel Guide, from the company beforehand.",
    ["我亏欠了孩子"] = "I owe the child.",
    ["我亲手开启的工业革命，亲手铸就的蒸汽与机械时代，将成为邪神降生的温床？"] = "The Industrial Revolution I started with my own hands, the Age of Steam and Machinery I forged myself, will become a hotbed for the birth of an Evil God?",
    ["我亲爱的……老比尔……您……"] = "My dear... Old Bill... you...",
    ["我亲爱的女儿，听说你爱上了一个费内波特的平民？这可真是令人“惊喜”。 "] = "My dear daughter, I heard you fell in love with a commoner from Feysac? This is truly a \"surprise.\"",
    ["我亲爱的朋友，早安，午安，晚安。"] = "My dear friend, good morning, good afternoon, good evening.",
    ["我亲爱的陛下："] = "My dear Majesty:",
    ["我亲眼看到了幽灵，就在古堡旁边！"] = "I saw a ghost with my own eyes, right next to the old castle!",
    ["我什么时候才能成为一名合格的占卜师呢……"] = "When will I be able to become a qualified divinationist...",
    ["我今天来是为了复诊，所以<P_Yellow>一直在客厅</>等霍克斯男爵。"] = "I came today for a follow-up visit, so <P_Yellow> I have been waiting for Baron Hawkes in the living room </>.",
    ["我今天涂了新的口红，好看吗？"] = "I'm wearing new lipstick today. Does it look good?",
    ["我今天的计划——九点，热气球升空。九点一刻，到达花海最佳求婚位置。九点半，求婚，海蒂感动落泪。九点四十五，为海蒂戴上戒指……"] = "My plan for today—9:00, hot air balloon takes off. 9:15, arrive at the best proposal spot in the flower sea. 9:30, propose, Heidi is moved to tears. 9:45, put the ring on Heidi...",
    ["我今天联系商会的时候，他们表示，如果我们城堡的物产储备合适，可以借用商会的铁轨去做相关贸易。"] = "When I contacted the Chamber of Commerce today, they indicated that if our castle's product reserves are suitable, we can borrow the Chamber's rails for related trade.",
    ["我今天跑了三十多单，腿都跑断了——"] = "I ran over thirty orders today, my legs are broken—",
    ["我今天轮休，先回房间休息一会。"] = "I'm on my day off today, I'll go back to my room and rest for a while.",
    ["我今年二十岁，爱上了一个脾气暴躁的人，我有罪。"] = "I am twenty years old and I fell in love with a bad-tempered person. I am guilty.",
    ["我今年四十五岁，二十三年的青春都奉献给了公司。"] = "I am forty-five years old this year, and I have dedicated twenty-three years of my youth to the company.",
    ["我今晚就要露宿街头了！"] = "I'm going to be sleeping on the streets tonight!",
    ["我仍然能想起莎莉把它摆在显眼位置时，露出\n的狡黠笑容。"] = "I can still remember the sly smile Sally wore when she placed it in a prominent spot \n.",
    ["我从一个富人身上“拿”了一条情报。我的天呢，我真的不能再提到这一切。"] = "I 'took' a piece of intelligence from a rich man. My god, I really can't mention all of this again.",
    ["我从上面学到了不少。"] = "I learned quite a bit from it.",
    ["我从不当逃兵。如果你也在南大陆打过仗，见过那里的饥饿和痛苦，你就不会把一切推脱给运气，因为你<P_Yellow>（鲁恩粗口）</> 已经是这个时代的幸运儿了。"] = "I never desert. If you had fought in the Southern Continent and seen the hunger and suffering there, you wouldn't blame everything on luck, because you <P_Yellow>(Loen profanity)</> are already the lucky ones of this era.",
    ["我从她身边路过时闻到了香水味！你说她不会是在香水店做事的吧？"] = "I smelled perfume when I passed by her! Do you think she works at a perfume shop?",
    ["我从小就不知道他是谁，\r\n只知道我和妈妈需要非常努力才能生活下去。"] = "I never knew who he was since I was little,\nI only knew that my mother and I had to work very hard to survive.",
    ["我从小就在大地母神的信仰中长大。仁慈的母亲教导我们：万物共生，生命循环。我只是一直在思考——怎样才能更好地实践她的意志？"] = "I grew up in the faith of the Earth Mother. The merciful Mother taught us: all things coexist, life cycles. I have just been thinking—how can I better practice her will?",
    ["我从廷根市过来。拉姆德小镇倒是个热闹的地方。"] = "I came from Tingen. Lamud Town is quite a lively place.",
    ["我从文献库借阅了资料，发现窥秘人途径序列4神秘学家的核心能力是神秘再现。"] = "I borrowed materials from the literature library and discovered that the core ability of the Mystery Pryer Pathway Sequence 4 Mysteryologist is Mystical Re-enactment.",
    ["我从未感到过如此恐慌"] = "I have never felt such panic.",
    ["我从来没告诉过任何人，包括我的家人……"] = "I've never told anyone, not even my family...",
    ["我从来没有背叛"] = "I Never Betrayed You",
    ["我从来没见过阿罗德斯大人这样！我从来没见过那样的表情，出现在它的镜面上！"] = "I've never seen Mr. Arrodes like this! I've never seen such an expression appear on its mirror surface!",
    ["我从没停止学习，试图理解这个非凡世界的规则……尽管这是相当危险的。但很有趣，不是吗？"] = "I have never stopped learning, trying to understand the rules of this Extraordinary world... although this is quite dangerous. But it's interesting, isn't it?",
    ["我从马桶穿越到了下水道消灭老鼠解开谜题最后击败了垃圾之主找到了黄金马桶见到罗塞尔大帝找到贪污证据从马桶里穿越了回来。"] = "I traveled from the toilet to the sewers, eliminated the rats, solved the puzzles, finally defeated the Lord of Trash, found the golden toilet, met Emperor Roselle, found the evidence of corruption, and traveled back through the toilet.",
    ["我仔细考察过他们的人品与背景，他们都是很好的人，可以给予阿诺德最好的照顾。"] = "I have carefully examined their character and background. They are both very good people and can provide Arnold with the best care.",
    ["我以为他只是在外面玩得晚了一点！他会回来！"] = "I thought he was just playing out late! He will come back!",
    ["我以为你更擅长的是魔镜占卜？或许你能教教可怜的小默里，他翻书都要翻出火星了。"] = "I thought you were better at Magic Mirror divination? Perhaps you can teach poor little Murray; he's about to flip through his books until sparks fly.",
    ["我以为你讨厌——等等，那撞桌角和苹果有虫呢？"] = "I thought you hated—wait, then what about bumping into the table corner and the worm in the apple?",
    ["我以为是你不好意思，所以用“朋友找我”这种借口来掩盖……"] = "I thought you were just shy, so you used \"a friend is looking for me\" as an excuse to cover it up...",
    ["我以为这只是小孩一时的爱好，可他哪怕摔破了腿，磕伤了脑袋，依旧不放弃练习。"] = "I thought it was just a passing hobby for a child, but even when he broke his leg or bruised his head, he never gave up practicing.",
    ["我以前……我以前可是在金梧桐区数得上的有钱人，海岸线餐厅老板得请我进去吃饭！"] = "I used to... I used to be a wealthy person of note in the Empress Borough. The owner of the Coastline Restaurant had to invite me in for dinner!",
    ["我以前就是“占卜家”。"] = "I used to be a Seer.",
    ["我以前想当家庭教师，但现在工作的薪水我也很满意。"] = "I used to want to be a tutor, but I'm quite satisfied with my current salary.",
    ["我以同意加入，请首席同意申请。"] = "I have agreed to join, please have the Chief approve the application.",
    ["我以后也在这里上班了，请多多指教。"] = "I will be working here from now on. Please look after me.",
    ["我以后也要像他们一样当英雄，守卫国家，保护家人。"] = "When I grow up, I want to be a hero like them, to defend the country and protect my family.",
    ["我以女神的名义发誓！我绝对是在清醒的状态下写的！"] = "I swear in the name of the Goddess! I was absolutely sober when I wrote it!",
    ["我以女神的名义起誓，将付出一切维护此交易的合法与公平。"] = "I swear in the name of the Goddess to give everything to uphold the legality and fairness of this transaction.",
    ["我以我身，沐浴烈阳。"] = "I bathe in the Blazing Sun with my own body.",
    ["我们一周都未必遇上一次委托，而大部分委托的价值在20镑以下。"] = "We don't even get a commission once a week, and most commissions are worth less than 20 pounds.",
    ["我们一定会回来的！"] = "We will definitely be back!",
    ["我们一步一步 走过草坪 走到亲友之间"] = "We walk step by step across the lawn, to the side of our friends and family.",
    ["我们一直希望学派在教授非凡能力之外，也成为所有人在这个世界不变的归所。"] = "We have always hoped that in addition to teaching extraordinary abilities, the school will also become a permanent home for everyone in this world.",
    ["我们一起……回家……"] = "We will go... home... together...",
    ["我们一起记？万一到时候有意外，我也许能帮上忙。"] = "Shall we record it together? In case there is an accident, I might be able to help.",
    ["我们不仅仅是在做一份工作，更是在缔造一个时代！"] = "We are not just doing a job; we are creating an era!",
    ["我们不会用太多地方的。届时只会有几位至亲，还有几个最要好的朋友到场。"] = "We won't take up much space. There will only be a few close relatives and a few best friends present.",
    ["我们不像那些政治或商业俱乐部，需要正式成员的推荐才能加入，只要填写详细资料，缴纳会员年费。初次是150镑，之后每年50镑。"] = "Unlike those political or commercial clubs that require recommendations from formal members, you only need to fill out detailed information and pay the annual membership fee. It's 150 pounds for the first time, and 50 pounds every year thereafter.",
    ["我们不是说好了？再看一次薰衣草，我们就彻底分开。"] = "Didn't we agree? Once we see the lavender one last time, we will part ways for good.",
    ["我们不畏惧命运的捉弄，因为每一次不幸，都是一场华丽的变身。"] = "We do not fear the mockery of fate, because every misfortune is a magnificent transformation.",
    ["我们不能。"] = "We cannot.",
    ["我们不能放任柯莱特这样下去了……上次他研发的什么药剂，直接在廷根造成了鼠患，那一只只老鼠长得比我的头都大。"] = "We cannot let Collette continue like this... The potion he developed last time caused a rat infestation directly in Tingen; those rats grew larger than my head.",
    ["我们两个也打不过。好了，你能说服柯莱特放弃药剂研发吗？"] = "The two of us can't either. Alright, can you convince Collet to give up potion research?",
    ["我们两个多么幸运，能看到如今的金秋湖——哪怕是以灵体的方式。噢，这得感谢格温尼女士。"] = "How lucky we are to see Golden Autumn Lake as it is today—even if it is in the form of spirit bodies. Oh, we must thank Ms. Gwenny for this.",
    ["我们为什么要在教堂旁边交易？你疯了吗？！"] = "Why are we trading next to the church? Are you crazy?!",
    ["我们举办活动前会在学派内发布预告，期待你的加入！"] = "We will release announcements within the school before holding activities, looking forward to your participation!",
    ["我们之前在工厂里遇到了危险，是她让我们往外逃的。但我走出来没多久，就遇到了怪物……"] = "We encountered danger in the factory before, and she let us escape. But not long after I came out, I encountered a monster...",
    ["我们之后请顾客品尝一下，顺势卖出丝瓜，购买者可以获得食谱怎么样！"] = "How about we invite customers to taste it later, and then sell the loofahs while we're at it? Buyers can get the recipe!",
    ["我们也会玩捉迷藏，还有打弹珠……这些游戏也挺有趣的。"] = "We also play hide-and-seek, and marbles... these games are quite fun too.",
    ["我们也必须遵从“愚者”先生的意志，反复与之对抗，才有成功的机会。"] = "We must also follow the will of Mr. Fool and repeatedly confront it to have a chance of success.",
    ["我们也是可怜虫，看着队友们牺牲，直到最后自己也走进黑夜。"] = "We are also poor wretches, watching our teammates sacrifice themselves until we eventually walk into the darkness ourselves.",
    ["我们也该趁年轻，拼一把！"] = "We should also seize the day while we're young and give it a shot!",
    ["我们五个就是因为这本书结缘，写信约定在这里见面——有位笔名叫鱿鱼的先生还没到。"] = "The five of us became friends because of this book and agreed by letter to meet here—a gentleman with the pen name Squid hasn't arrived yet.",
    ["我们什么时候溜进去玩吧？"] = "When should we sneak in and play?",
    ["我们从佐特兰街到圣赛琳娜教堂，再沿豪尔斯街……"] = "We go from Zoutland Street to Saint Selena Cathedral, then along Howls Street...",
    ["我们从贝克兰德出发，特意选了内陆路线。但对方对我们的路线和人员配置非常清楚，在途中设下了埋伏。"] = "We set off from Backlund and specifically chose an inland route. But the other party was very clear about our route and personnel configuration, and they set an ambush along the way.",
    ["我们以“救赎蔷薇”为名…"] = "We act in the name of the 'Rose Redemption'...",
    ["我们以前观念不合，我总说她在一些不必要的细节上浪费了太多的时间。"] = "We didn't see eye to eye in the past; I always said she wasted too much time on unnecessary details.",
    ["我们以美为名，在暗影中编织自己的网络。"] = "We weave our own network in the shadows in the name of beauty.",
    ["我们以苍白灾难为开始，东拜朗海战结尾……"] = "We start with the Pale Disaster and end with the East Balam Naval Battle...",
    ["我们企图在混沌的世界里建立起秩序，如同行走于空中钢缆。如今人类所作所为，是必要的改变，还是无意义的自我约束？"] = "We attempt to establish order in a chaotic world, like walking on a steel cable in the air. Is what humanity is doing now a necessary change, or meaningless self-restraint?",
    ["我们会……夜空……"] = "We will... night sky...",
    ["我们会一直在红月亮街为你提供咖啡、茶与宁静的心灵，欢迎你回来休息。"] = "We will always provide you with coffee, tea, and a peaceful mind on Red Moon Street. You are welcome to come back and rest.",
    ["我们会去向这些人查证。现在，你需要停止售卖这些玫瑰，并告诉我们你的玫瑰是从哪里采摘的。"] = "We will go and verify with these people. For now, you need to stop selling these roses and tell us where they were picked.",
    ["我们会在这里等你的好消息。"] = "We will wait here for your good news.",
    ["我们会定期举办历史文化讲座，进行时代常识科普。"] = "We regularly hold history and culture lectures to popularize common knowledge of the era.",
    ["我们会把这些明亮的东西储存在记忆里，形成我们人性的基石。"] = "We will store these bright things in our memories, forming the cornerstone of our humanity.",
    ["我们会抬头仰望那片夜空"] = "We will look up at that night sky",
    ["我们会抬头仰望那片夜空，"] = "We will look up at that night sky,",
    ["我们会的！"] = "We will!",
    ["我们会继续调查，菲丽丝交给我们吧。"] = "We will continue to investigate, leave Phyllis to us.",
    ["我们伟大的拉斯廷伯爵牺牲在了这场战争里，他的名字就是哈罗德。"] = "Our great Earl of Lasting sacrificed his life in this war, and his name was Harold.",
    ["我们保证安静得像墙角的老鼠！每天天不亮就出门找活，绝不弄出动静……"] = "We guarantee to be as quiet as mice in the corner! We leave to find work before dawn every day and will never make a sound...",
    ["我们值夜者属于<P_Yellow>黑夜女神教会</>，负责调查和解决廷根市的非凡事件。比如说，这件诡异的自杀案。"] = "We Nighthawks belong to the <P_Yellow>Evernight Goddess Church</>, responsible for investigating and resolving extraordinary incidents in Tingen. For example, this bizarre suicide case.",
    ["我们做这个行当还是需要“大人物们”照拂的。"] = "We still need the protection of \"big shots\" to operate in this business.",
    ["我们偶尔也会接点额外的委托，不管是找人还是当保镖，也是有可能涉及到超凡力量的。"] = "We occasionally take some extra commissions, whether it's finding people or acting as bodyguards, it's also possible that they involve supernatural powers.",
    ["我们先去找亚瑟。"] = "Let's go find Arthur first.",
    ["我们先找线索，别惊动这里的人。"] = "Let's find clues first, don't alert the people here.",
    ["我们先点菜吧？我姐姐说这家餐厅的柠檬布丁很不错，你有什么忌口吗？"] = "Shall we order first? My sister said the lemon pudding at this restaurant is very good. Do you have any dietary restrictions?",
    ["我们先进行第一次的小测验。码头工人布拉迪失踪了，这是现场遗留的证物，记得仔细查看。"] = "Let's start with the first small test. The dock worker Brady has disappeared. This is the evidence left at the scene; remember to check it carefully.",
    ["我们公司的招牌十分特殊，偶尔还会有额外经费。"] = "Our company's sign is very special, and occasionally there are extra funds.",
    ["我们再去旁边的济贫院看看，看看两起案件有没有共同之处。"] = "Let's go check the poorhouse next door and see if there are any commonalities between the two cases.",
    ["我们几个是朋友，都有些心理上的……困扰。"] = "We are friends, and all have some psychological... troubles.",
    ["我们几个立刻带着遗留物、封印物和安提哥努斯家族笔记返回，并让弗莱、洛耀和警察过来。"] = "We will immediately take the remains, Sealed Artifacts, and the Antigonus Family notebook back, and have Frye, Luo Yao, and the police come over.",
    ["我们出发吧，尽快结束，然后将2-049重新封印起来。"] = "Let's go, finish this as soon as possible, and then reseal 2-049.",
    ["我们刚准备继续追查，他就死了？"] = "He died just as we were about to continue the investigation?",
    ["我们刚租他房子的时候，他只想签三个月，说怕我们交不起租金。我费了好大劲，才争取到一年租期。"] = "When we first rented his house, he only wanted to sign for three months, saying he was afraid we couldn't afford the rent. I spent a lot of effort to secure a one-year lease.",
    ["我们到了，还记得这里吗？"] = "We're here. Do you remember this place?",
    ["我们努力尝试过，但无法拯救她、也不忍心毁灭她。去送她最后一程吧，她理应在黑夜的神国里获得长眠。"] = "We tried hard, but we couldn't save her, nor could we bear to destroy her. Go and see her off on her final journey; she deserves to find slumber in the Kingdom of the Night.",
    ["我们医院院长想让我去廷根大学做医疗讲座，普及一下医疗知识，顺便给医院做一个宣传。"] = "Our hospital director wants me to go to Tingen University to give a medical lecture, popularize some medical knowledge, and promote the hospital by the way.",
    ["我们十分心动，答应了一同旅行。"] = "We were very tempted and agreed to travel together.",
    ["我们单独都解决不了它……我同意你的建议。"] = "Neither of us can handle it alone... I agree to your suggestion.",
    ["我们卖很便宜的，质量很好的。"] = "We sell them very cheaply, and the quality is excellent.",
    ["我们原本的症状被治愈，却都染上<P_Yellow>更邪异的病症</>……"] = "Our original symptoms were cured, but we all contracted <P_Yellow>more evil symptoms</>...",
    ["我们去找弗兰奇先生的时候，他坐在沙发上，很有气势地宣称“你们应该知道我的原则，绝对不允许拖欠租金！”"] = "When we went to find Mr. Frank, he sat on the sofa and declared with great momentum, 'You should know my principles, absolutely no late rent payments allowed!'",
    ["我们去看看。"] = "Let's go take a look.",
    ["我们去看看吧。"] = "Let's go take a look.",
    ["我们去碰碰运气，看他有没有留下些什么线索。"] = "Let's try our luck and see if he left any clues behind.",
    ["我们去碰碰运气，看安迪有没有留下些什么线索。"] = "Let's try our luck and see if Andy left any clues behind.",
    ["我们去索菲亚姐姐那买冰淇淋好吗？"] = "Shall we go to Sister Sophia's to buy ice cream?",
    ["我们去问问其他人的价格。"] = "Let's go ask others for their prices.",
    ["我们又一次拯救了廷根"] = "We have saved Tingen once again.",
    ["我们又没买过，怎么可能知道！？"] = "We didn't buy them, how would we know!?",
    ["我们发现你正在售卖一些危险物品，黑夜协会现在正式介入对你的调查，黛西小姐。"] = "We have discovered that you are selling dangerous items. The Nighthawks are now officially intervening in the investigation against you, Miss Daisy.",
    ["我们只能从模糊的象征中，引导事情向着好的方向发展，你先想想……"] = "We can only guide things toward a good direction from vague symbols. You think about it first...",
    ["我们可以去找警察！"] = "We can go find the police!",
    ["我们可以去火车站，坐火车离开这里。"] = "We can go to the Train Station and take a train to leave here.",
    ["我们可以把你刚刚吹奏的这段旋律记录下来，共同创作一首乐曲。"] = "We can Record the melody you just played and create a piece of music together.",
    ["我们可以现在就开始，你把材料拿过来吧，就在那边的柜子里。"] = "We can start now. Bring the ingredients over; they're in the cabinet over there.",
    ["我们可是自营农场，不像隔壁的某个摊主，伪装自己信仰大地母神，结果满口谎话！您可得小心点，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "We run our own farm, unlike that stall owner next door who pretends to believe in the Earth Mother but is full of lies! You'd better be careful, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["我们可没有多余的钱。<P_Heart>（小声笑）</>要什么大智慧？雇主太太心情好才是要紧事。"] = "We don't have extra money. <P_Heart> (Laughs softly) </> What kind of great wisdom? Keeping the mistress in a good mood is what matters.",
    ["我们可能不在铸造厂，但我们的工作同样重要！优质零件是一个顺畅运作的必备条件。"] = "We may not be in the foundry, but our work is just as important! High-quality parts are a prerequisite for smooth operation.",
    ["我们向队长承诺过，会照顾您的，就像自己的母亲一样！"] = "We promised the Captain that we would take care of you, just like our own mother!",
    ["我们吗？"] = "Us?",
    ["我们四兄弟，大哥精神状况不好，二哥身体不好，父亲从不苛待他们。而小弟芬尼安，是父亲与其他女人的私生子，父亲却对外谎称是贫民窟收养的孩子。"] = "We are four brothers. The eldest has poor mental health, the second has poor physical health, and our father never mistreated them. But the youngest, Finnian, is an illegitimate child father had with another woman, yet father lied to the public, claiming he was a child adopted from the slums.",
    ["我们在一起耳语\n寂静而毫无意义\n如风掠过干草\n或老鼠的脚踩过碎玻璃\n在我们的干地窖\n\n有态而无形，有影而无色\n瘫痪的力，没有动作的手势；\n那些直视的眼睛\n跨过死亡的另一王国的人\n记得我们——如果记得——不是迷失的"] = "We whisper together\nQuiet and meaningless\nAs wind over dry grass\nOr rat's feet over broken glass\nIn our dry cellar\n\nShape without form, shade without color,\nParalyzed force, gesture without motion;\nThose who have crossed\nWith direct eyes, to death's other Kingdom\nRemember us—if at all—not as lost",
    ["我们在一起耳语\n寂静而毫无意义\n如风掠过干草\n或老鼠的脚踩过碎玻璃\n在我们的干地窖\n\n有态而无形，有影而无色\n瘫痪的力，没有动作的手势；\n那些直视的眼睛\n跨过死亡的另一王国的人\n记得我们——如果记得——不是迷失的\n\n狂暴的灵魂，而只是\n填塞起来的人\n我们围着沼泽转圈\n睡莲，睡莲\n我们围着沼泽转圈\n在清晨五点\n\n在观念与现实之间\n在动作与行为之间\n落下阴影\n所属之地\n\n世界就这样告终\n世界就这样告终\n世界就这样告终\n不是一声巨响，而是一声呜咽"] = "We whisper together \n Quiet and meaningless \n Like wind blowing over dry grass \n Or rats' feet over broken glass \n In our dry cellar \n\n Shape without form, shade without color \n Paralyzed force, gesture without motion; \n Those who have crossed \n With direct eyes, to death's other Kingdom \n Remember us—if at all—not as lost \n\n Violent souls, but only \n As the hollow men \n We grope together \n And avoid speech \n Gathered on this beach of this tumid river \n At five o'clock in the morning \n\n Between the idea \n And the reality \n Between the motion \n And the act \n Falls the Shadow \n This is the way the world ends \n This is the way the world ends \n This is the way the world ends \n Not with a bang but a whimper",
    ["我们在为今晚的谷仓舞会做准备！"] = "We are preparing for tonight's barn dance!",
    ["我们在咖啡厅见过？你竟然是位厉害的非凡者！"] = "Have we met at the cafe? You are actually a powerful Beyonder!",
    ["我们在廷根也算幸运，躲过了这一切。"] = "We in Tingen are lucky to have escaped all of this.",
    ["我们在此聆听：丧钟即将鸣响！"] = "We listen here: The Death Knell is about to ring!",
    ["我们在玩魔镜占卜，赛琳娜懂得很多。"] = "We are playing Mirror Divination, Selena knows a lot.",
    ["我们在研究某种……炼金仪式，准确来说，是复现《赫密斯文典》记载的灵数映射仪式。"] = "We are researching a certain... alchemical ritual. To be precise, it is a reproduction of the spiritual number mapping ritual recorded in the Hermes Codex.",
    ["我们在等待戈多。"] = "We are waiting for Godot.",
    ["我们在红石头上刻过愿望，还画过丑陋的涂鸦……"] = "We carved our wishes on the red stone and even drew ugly graffiti...",
    ["我们在迪西过的很好，孩子们很听话，您不用挂念。"] = "We're doing very well in Disi, the children are very obedient, you don't need to worry.",
    ["我们在追查到这里时，品鉴会已经开始了，增援还在赶来的路上。"] = "When we tracked them here, the tasting party had already begun, and reinforcements are still on their way.",
    ["我们坐在长凳上，\r\n倾诉了好一会儿衷情！"] = "We sat on the bench\nand poured our hearts out for quite a while!",
    ["我们多久没休假了？"] = "How long has it been since we had a vacation?",
    ["我们多么贫穷，穷到只剩下钱了！"] = "How poor we are, so poor that we only have money left!",
    ["我们好不容易攒够了这些钱！为什么不能省着点用……"] = "We worked so hard to save up this money! Why can't we be more frugal...",
    ["我们家乡也有对传统草药的研究。"] = "Our hometown also has research on traditional herbs.",
    ["我们对铁十字街很熟悉，能帮您找人和送信，需要吗？"] = "We are very familiar with Iron Cross Street and can help you find people or deliver letters. Do you need that?",
    ["我们将蒂亚开除的那天晚上，看不见的怪物就出现了。"] = "The night we fired Tia, an invisible monster appeared.",
    ["我们就能看到真的了。不是画里的，不是池子里的，是属于整个海洋的动物！"] = "We'll be able to see the real ones. Not in pictures, not in pools, but animals that belong to the entire ocean!",
    ["我们就要等待戈多。"] = "We must wait for Godot.",
    ["我们工厂成立了夜校，我报名了。明年……也许后年，我就可以去谋求一份打字员的工作。"] = "Our factory has set up a night school, and I signed up. Next year... maybe the year after, I can look for a job as a typist.",
    ["我们已经抓捕了嫌疑人，是他的同事班克，现在，你可以直接去质询他。"] = "We have already captured the suspect, his colleague Bank. Now, you can go directly to interrogate him.",
    ["我们已经知道失踪原因，救出罗珊和失踪者很重要，阻止其他市民失踪也很重要。"] = "We already know the reason for the disappearances. Rescuing Rozanne and the missing people is important, and preventing other citizens from going missing is also important.",
    ["我们应该不会再见面了。"] = "We probably won't see each other again.",
    ["我们当然可以偶尔点其他餐厅的食物，但是也许有些东西……是没办法替代的。"] = "We can certainly order food from other restaurants occasionally, but perhaps some things... cannot be replaced.",
    ["我们很想念您，就带着孩子一起过来看您了。"] = "We missed you very much, so we brought the children to see you.",
    ["我们很理解您的心情……"] = "We fully understand how you feel...",
    ["我们很高兴 也很幸运地看到你还活着"] = "We are very happy and very lucky to see that you are still alive",
    ["我们得尽快清理下现场。你会布置灵性之墙吗？"] = "We need to clean up the scene as soon as possible. Do you know how to set up a Wall of Spirituality?",
    ["我们得快点找到那只猫，给它点食物吃。"] = "We have to find that cat quickly and give it something to eat.",
    ["我们得来的钱，有几便士是能留给自己的呢？"] = "Of the money we earn, how many pennies can we keep for ourselves?",
    ["我们得让廷根重新伟大起来！"] = "We must make Tingen great again!",
    ["我们必须“扮演”成邀请函上描述的样子，才能潜入城堡内，解决敌人，成为城堡的主人。"] = "We must \"act\" in the way described on the invitation letter to sneak into the castle, eliminate the enemies, and become the master of the castle.",
    ["我们快支撑不住了，快引开这些怪物！"] = "We can't hold on much longer, lure these monsters away!",
    ["我们快转换意识！"] = "Let's switch consciousness quickly!",
    ["我们怀疑你当时带着它离开，但在回家途中将笔记隐藏，所以我们才没能在你身上找到线索。"] = "We suspect that you left with it but hid the notebook on your way home, which is why we couldn't find any clues on you.",
    ["我们想了解一些情况。"] = "We want to understand some things.",
    ["我们想结婚，但不知道未来会怎样。"] = "We want to get married, but we don't know what the future holds.",
    ["我们想，既然这么厉害的人都在用这根蜡烛……那一定就是对的。"] = "We thought, since such a powerful person is using this candle... then it must be right.",
    ["我们愿意让小黛西以特殊的方式“活着”，你一定也认同这种做法？"] = "We are willing to let Little Daisy \"live\" in a special way. You must agree with this approach, right?",
    ["我们成功了！我可以回到她的身边了！"] = "We did it! I can go back to her side!",
    ["我们成功地破坏了仪式，但是特莉丝逃走了。"] = "We successfully disrupted the ritual, but Trissy escaped.",
    ["我们打算在圣塞琳娜教堂广场，给她的相亲对象一点考验。"] = "We plan to give her blind date a little test at the St. Selena Cathedral square.",
    ["我们打算在圣赛琳娜教堂广场，给她的相亲对象一点考验。"] = "We plan to give her blind date a test at the Saint Selena Cathedral square.",
    ["我们找不到母亲的墓碑了！"] = "We can't find our mother's tombstone!",
    ["我们把奖杯叫“菠菜杯”，因为它的纹理和形状像菠菜。丢失前它就放在这里。"] = "We call the trophy the 'Spinach Cup' because its texture and shape resemble spinach. It was placed here before it went missing.",
    ["我们把诚信看得比什么都重要，胜过兄弟、钱，还有手上的酒。"] = "We value integrity above all else—more than brothers, money, or the drink in our hands.",
    ["我们把那东西一路逼到这，凯蒂妮她们在里面收尾。"] = "We chased that thing all the way here, and Katie and the others are inside cleaning up.",
    ["我们投票决定，下周由你代表小组进行课程汇报！"] = "We voted for you to represent the group for the course presentation next week!",
    ["我们拯救了廷根。"] = "We saved Tingen.",
    ["我们拼了命地工作，却只能拿到少得可怜的薪水。那些可怜的苏勒，甚至无法让我们支付房租，买一点点食物！"] = "We work ourselves to death, but we only get a pitifully small salary. Those poor soli aren't even enough for us to pay rent and buy a little food!",
    ["我们拼了命地工作，缺只能拿到少得可怜的薪水。那些可怜的苏勒，甚至无法让我们支付房租，买一点点食物！"] = "We work ourselves to the bone, yet we only get a pitiful salary. Those miserable soli aren't even enough to pay the rent or buy a little bit of food!",
    ["我们掘墓人是世袭的，当然会知道这些事情，有什么好害怕的，反正迟早都要躺到墓穴里。"] = "We gravediggers are hereditary, so of course we know about these things. What's there to be afraid of? We'll all end up in a grave sooner or later anyway.",
    ["我们提供各式咖啡，现在更推荐费尔默咖啡，它来自南大陆帕斯河谷。当然，如果你喜欢，我们还有好喝的红茶和甜冰茶。"] = "We offer various coffees, and we currently recommend the Fermo coffee, which comes from the Pas Valley in the Southern Continent. Of course, if you like, we also have delicious black tea and sweet iced tea.",
    ["我们提供：最香醇的费尔默咖啡，最热心的神秘学顾问，最干净明亮的盥洗室，还有——最快报销的经费清单！"] = "We provide: The most fragrant Feysac coffee, the most enthusiastic occult consultants, the cleanest and brightest washrooms, and—the fastest expense reimbursement list!",
    ["我们搬运沉重的货物，踩着肮脏的水，可这才每周2苏勒。"] = "We carry heavy cargo and trudge through filthy water, yet we only get 2 soli a week for this.",
    ["我们收到可靠情报，金梧桐连环杀人案的凶手出没在恶龙酒吧附近，务必要对酒吧内的人进行重新排查。"] = "We have received reliable intelligence that the perpetrator of the Golden Elm serial murders is lurking near the Evil Dragon Bar. It is imperative to re-screen everyone inside the bar.",
    ["我们无法生活！除非……除非铁十字街的那些蔬菜可以更便宜点……"] = "We can't live! Unless... unless the vegetables on Iron Cross Street can be cheaper...",
    ["我们早就布置好了，专门捕猎学徒的！"] = "We've already set it up; it's specifically for hunting Apprentices!",
    ["我们明明是“黑夜四兄妹”！让我们一起歌颂女神！"] = "We are clearly the 'Four Siblings of the Night'! Let us sing praises to the Goddess together!",
    ["我们是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫，也是廷根的守护者。"] = "We are a group of wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness, and we are also the guardians of Tingen.",
    ["我们是不是忘了什么？"] = "Did we forget something?",
    ["我们是从廷根市值夜者小队成长起来的同伴……这是一个很长的故事。"] = "We are companions who grew up in the Tingen Nighthawks squad... This is a long story.",
    ["我们是会员年费制度，第一年是100苏勒，之后每年20苏勒。"] = "We have an annual membership fee system: 100 soli for the first year, and 20 soli for each subsequent year.",
    ["我们是伪装成安保公司的值夜者小队，专门处理超凡事件，这是你已经知道的。"] = "We are a Nighthawk squad disguised as a security company, specializing in handling supernatural events. This is something you already know.",
    ["我们是你父亲请的安保人员，是来救你的，没事了。"] = "We are security personnel hired by your father, here to save you, it's okay now.",
    ["我们是和弗萨克作战的一支小队，和大部队走散后，吃光了补给，又迷了路……"] = "We were part of a squad fighting Feysac. After becoming separated from the main force, we ran out of supplies and got lost...",
    ["我们是在向盥洗室之主祈祷，祂很厉害的！经常腹泻的朋友都知道，祂能让肠胃恢复健康！"] = "We are praying to the Lord of the Restroom; He is very powerful! Friends who often have diarrhea know that He can restore the health of the digestive tract!",
    ["我们是大学同学，一起跟随科恩资深副教授学习，都是历史系的学生。"] = "We were university classmates, both studying under Senior Associate Professor Cohen in the History Department.",
    ["我们是守护者"] = "We are Guardians",
    ["我们是守护者\n也是一群 时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的\n可怜虫"] = "We are Guardians \n and also a group of \n poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness.",
    ["我们是守护者，也是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。"] = "We are guardians, but also a bunch of poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness.",
    ["我们是守护者，守护廷根市民每一个宁静的夜晚。"] = "We are Guardians, protecting every peaceful night for the citizens of Tingen.",
    ["我们是安保公司，不是冒险者公会。"] = "We are a security company, not an adventurer's guild.",
    ["我们是廷根的老牌餐厅，味道和价格都是没得说。"] = "We are a long-standing restaurant in Tingen; the taste and price are impeccable.",
    ["我们是弗萨克的士兵，我们要消散了，能不能请求你……"] = "We are soldiers of Feysac, and we are about to dissipate. Could we ask you to...",
    ["我们是新成立的乐队“黑夜四姐弟”，请多多支持！"] = "We are the newly formed band \"Four Night Siblings\", please support us!",
    ["我们是水仙花街上最好的餐厅。"] = "We are the best restaurant on Daffodil Street.",
    ["我们是流浪儿。内务大臣是我们之中唯一知道自己生日的人，她的妈妈死前把生日缝在了襁褓里。"] = "We are homeless children. The Minister of Internal Affairs is the only one among us who knows her birthday; her mother sewed the birthday into her swaddling clothes before she died.",
    ["我们是警察，来调查小艾恩失踪的事，请问他的家人呢？"] = "We are police officers here to investigate the disappearance of little Aen. May I ask where his family is?",
    ["我们是警察，这里曾收留过一个叫尤朵拉的孤儿，对吗？"] = "We are police officers. An orphan named Yodora once stayed here, right?",
    ["我们是非凡者，\n我们是可怜虫，\n我们也是#Space3#。"] = "We are Beyonders,\nWe are wretches,\nWe are also #Space3#.",
    ["我们曾经有两位具备特殊报销技巧的同事。可惜你不认识他们，否则他们可以教你不少东西。"] = "We once had two colleagues with special reimbursement skills. It's a pity you don't know them, otherwise they could have taught you quite a lot.",
    ["我们曾经非常亲近……她每天都会来找我聊天，就像现在这样……"] = "We used to be very close... she would come to talk to me every day, just like this...",
    ["我们最终会在黑夜的神国里相聚。"] = "We will eventually meet in the Kingdom of the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["我们最软萌、最可爱的俱乐部之星%s上线啦！"] = "Our softest and cutest Club Star, %s, is now online!",
    ["我们有一些误会，呜呜……"] = "We had some misunderstandings, sob...",
    ["我们有些延续了好多年的传统，比如有新的正式成员加入时，会一起去老维尔餐厅吃一顿……"] = "We have some traditions that have continued for many years, such as when a new official member joins, we will go to Old Will's restaurant for a meal together...",
    ["我们有四位姑娘，人称“四颗宝石”。您想先从哪颗开始？ "] = "We have four ladies, known as the \"Four Gems.\" Which one would you like to start with?",
    ["我们有好几种路线可供选择，您可以仔细看看。"] = "We have several routes for you to choose from. You can take a careful look.",
    ["我们有新鲜出炉的泥馅饼、泥蘑菇汤和泥冰茶！"] = "We have freshly baked mud pies, mud mushroom soup, and mud iced tea!",
    ["我们本来可以在湖畔过个好生日的，现在只能在垃圾堆里庆祝了。"] = "We could have had a good birthday by the lake, but now we can only celebrate in a pile of trash.",
    ["我们本来可以直接抢，但却愿意付你一便士。"] = "We could have just robbed you, but we were willing to pay you a penny.",
    ["我们本来就在一个疯狂的世界，像邓恩、戴莉这些强者也都回归女神的拥抱了。"] = "We are already in a crazy world. Even powerhouses like Dunn and Daly have returned to the Goddess's embrace.",
    ["我们本来就有矛盾，又被这些乌鸦骚扰得越来越烦躁，看什么都不顺眼。"] = "We were already at odds, and being constantly irritated by these crows made us find everything displeasing.",
    ["我们来协助你。"] = "We will assist you.",
    ["我们来向神忏悔，祈求祂宽恕我们的罪孽。"] = "We come to repent to God and pray for Him to forgive our sins.",
    ["我们正企图在混沌的世界里建立起秩序，如同行走于空中钢缆。如今人类所作所为，是必要的改变，还是无意义的自我约束？"] = "We are trying to establish order in a chaotic world, like walking on a steel cable in the air. Is what humanity is doing now a necessary change, or meaningless self-restraint?",
    ["我们正在创造奇迹！艺术学派里，肯定还没有人在雪山上做过演出。"] = "We are creating a miracle! Surely no one in the School of Art has ever performed on a Snowy Mountain before.",
    ["我们正在帮助你抵抗污染，终结噩梦，在现实中醒来。"] = "We are helping you resist the corruption, end the nightmare, and wake up in reality.",
    ["我们正在清理卫生，公司里到处都是灰尘和杂物，大家怎么也学不会将东西放在它们应该在的位置上！"] = "We are cleaning up; there is dust and clutter everywhere in the company, and everyone just can't seem to learn to put things where they belong!",
    ["我们每个月至少会请一位有名的占卜者来讲课，来解答疑难。"] = "Every month, we invite at least one famous diviner to give a lecture and answer difficult questions.",
    ["我们每个月都会请一些有名的占卜者来讲课，帮助大家更好地学习占卜。"] = "Every month, we invite some famous diviners to give lectures to help everyone learn divination better.",
    ["我们永远在刀尖上跳舞，却没发现脚下的幸运早就飘走啦。"] = "We are always dancing on the edge of a knife, never realizing that the luck under our feet has long since drifted away.",
    ["我们没办法让她苏醒，只能靠一些仪式来维持微弱的生命。"] = "We have no way to wake her up and can only rely on some rituals to maintain her faint life.",
    ["我们没多少时间了，一定要赶在他们之前查清楚。"] = "We don't have much time. We must find out the truth before they do.",
    ["我们没时间了，快看外面！"] = "We don't have time, look outside!",
    ["我们消灭了失控的安提哥努斯家族后裔，也挫败了密修会的阴谋。在这个过程中，你表现得非常出色。"] = "We eliminated the out-of-control descendant of the Antigonus Family and also thwarted the conspiracy of the Rose School of Thought. In this process, you performed very well.",
    ["我们热爱工作！"] = "We love working!",
    ["我们特地给他买了一副，他特别喜欢，从来不离手。"] = "We bought him a deck specially; he loves it and never lets it leave his hands.",
    ["我们现在出发吧，关于失踪案，你还有其他的线索吗？"] = "Let's set off now. Do you have any other clues regarding the abduction case?",
    ["我们现在只交了定金，需要尽快把钱补上，难得老店主给了我们一个很不错的价格。"] = "We have only paid the deposit, we need to make up the money as soon as possible. It's rare that the old shop owner gave us such a good price.",
    ["我们现在能跳得更高了！"] = "We can jump higher now!",
    ["我们现在还能到哪里去呢？"] = "Where can we go now?",
    ["我们申请调用了<P_Yellow>封印物2-049</>，这是曾经属于安提哥努斯家族的一件危险物品，能帮助我们定位瑞尔·比伯的位置，只要他是这个家族的后裔。"] = "We applied to use <P_Yellow>Sealed Artifact 2-049</>, which is a dangerous item that once belonged to the Antigonus Family. It can help us locate Ray Bieber, provided he is a descendant of this family.",
    ["我们留在战争里，却消失在和平中。"] = "We remained in the war, but disappeared in peace.",
    ["我们留在这里……变成这样……只为了阻止尤德拉的荒芜……"] = "We stay here... and become like this... just to stop Yodra's desolation...",
    ["我们的世界，可不是看上去那么简单。"] = "Our world is not as simple as it seems.",
    ["我们的会员可以免费使用俱乐部内的工具为人占卜。"] = "Our members can use the tools in the Club to perform divinations for others for free.",
    ["我们的内务大臣，梅，生日快乐！我的礼物是一个水杯。"] = "Our Minister of Internal Affairs, May, happy birthday! My gift is a water cup.",
    ["我们的命必须都是工厂的！"] = "Our lives must belong to the factory!",
    ["我们的哭声在旋转的轮轴间回响……"] = "Our cries echo between the rotating wheels...",
    ["我们的安保人员都出任务去了，如果您的事情不紧急的话，可以等他们回来。"] = "Our security personnel have all gone out on missions. If your matter isn't urgent, you can wait for them to return.",
    ["我们的小弟弟，虽然不太懂规则，但很爱玩扑克牌。"] = "Our little brother. Although he doesn't quite understand the rules, he loves playing poker.",
    ["我们的工作是为各位会员留下精彩的影像，尤其是您这种风云人物。"] = "Our job is to capture wonderful images for all the members, especially for a man of the hour like you.",
    ["我们的战友……唉，他们是永远的英雄。"] = "Our comrades... sigh, they are heroes forever.",
    ["我们的游览路线自北向南覆盖了诸如河与海教堂、大学城和铁十字街等关键交通节点，为您省下脚力的同时还能带您领略廷根市内百般风情。"] = "Our tour route covers key transportation nodes from north to south, such as the Church of the River and Sea, the University District, and Iron Cross Street, saving you legwork while allowing you to enjoy the various charms of Tingen city.",
    ["我们的田地就在附近，甚至可以带您去地里亲自采摘！"] = "Our fields are nearby; we can even take you to the fields to pick them yourself!",
    ["我们的目标，就是带领真理号冲出冰山，驶向远方！"] = "Our goal is to lead the Truth out of the iceberg and sail toward the distance!",
    ["我们的藏书太少了……"] = "Our collection of books is too small...",
    ["我们的途径不同，应该不能这么比。"] = "Our pathways are different, so we shouldn't compare like that.",
    ["我们的钱不够，没法将你带回家，只能来教堂为您祷告……对不起……"] = "We don't have enough money to bring you home, so we can only come to the church to pray for you... I'm sorry...",
    ["我们目前的站位和镜头机位，都是基于剧情模板的基础上，根据具体的需要，进行直接的调用。"] = "Our current positioning and camera angles are all based on plot templates, called directly according to specific needs.",
    ["我们相信的是生命的无限，泥土知道答案。"] = "We believe in the infinity of life; the soil knows the answer.",
    ["我们相信，死亡不是终结，而是另一种安宁的开始。"] = "We believe that death is not the end, but the beginning of another kind of peace.",
    ["我们知道黑荆棘的各位平时很忙，直接上门可能太打扰了……而且我们准备的都不是什么贵重东西，怕反而显得失礼……"] = "We know that everyone at Blackthorn is usually very busy, and visiting directly might be too disturbing... and what we prepared are not valuable things, so we are afraid it will seem rude instead...",
    ["我们社团刚创立一年，就有两位序列5的强者了！"] = "Our club has only been founded for a year, and we already have two Sequence 5 powerhouses!",
    ["我们祈求您的眷顾，祈求您庇护您忠实的信徒。"] = "We pray for your favor, we pray for you to shelter your loyal believers.",
    ["我们离他越来越近了"] = "We are getting closer and closer to him.",
    ["我们约着玩斗邪恶，输家喝酒。结果两个人合起伙来出老千，把我灌醉，逼着我签下不合理的契约！"] = "We agreed to play 'Fight the Evil,' with the loser drinking. As a result, the two of them teamed up to cheat, got me drunk, and forced me to sign an unreasonable contract!",
    ["我们经常一起玩，但她总是突然就消失了。"] = "We often play together, but she always disappears suddenly.",
    ["我们结婚了吗？好像没有……你认识了阿斯兰……"] = "Are we married? It seems not... You met Aslan...",
    ["我们结婚这么多年，我从来都没有问你要过什么……"] = "We've been married for so many years, and I've never asked you for anything...",
    ["我们绝不会说出老大最重要的猎龙计划的！"] = "We will never tell you about the boss's most important dragon hunting plan!",
    ["我们绝不可能在一起……我没办法再当面拒绝她……"] = "We can never be together... I can't bring myself to reject her to her face again...",
    ["我们老大说了，被猎龙帮征用，是马车的荣幸。"] = "Our boss said, being requisitioned by the Dragon Hunter Gang is the carriage's honor.",
    ["我们考古队的营地得从这条道往左拐。"] = "Our archaeological team's camp requires turning left from this path.",
    ["我们能帮到您这样的大人物？"] = "We can help a big shot like you?",
    ["我们能拥有一个愉快且完美的湖边约会！"] = "We can have a pleasant and perfect lakeside date!",
    ["我们脱离梦境了？"] = "Have we left the dream?",
    ["我们脱离梦境了？这只灵鸟是……卡萝队长？"] = "We're out of the dream? This spirit bird is... Captain Carol?",
    ["我们艺术团就要做挑战不可能的第一人！你要不要也加入我们？"] = "Our art troupe is going to be the first to challenge the impossible! Do you want to join us?",
    ["我们营地里有个该死的小偷！"] = "There's a damn thief in our camp!",
    ["我们行走在生与死的边界，为失眠者带来安宁，为亡者吟唱诗歌，为秘密守口如瓶。"] = "We walk on the boundary between life and death, bringing peace to the sleepless, singing poems for the dead, and keeping secrets silent.",
    ["我们要不要告诉警察叔叔？"] = "Should we tell the police officer?",
    ["我们要做一辈子的好朋友，永远、永远！"] = "We're going to be best friends for life, forever and ever!",
    ["我们要偷渡上船吗？老大，好刺激！"] = "Are we going to stow away on the ship? Boss, so exciting!",
    ["我们要去哪里"] = "Where are we going?",
    ["我们要回去吗？"] = "Should we go back?",
    ["我们要快一些上去拿到记忆碎片！"] = "We need to go up quickly and get the memory fragment!",
    ["我们要新制服！"] = "We want new uniforms!",
    ["我们要罢工！"] = "We want to strike!",
    ["我们要罢工！我们值得更好！值得更多！"] = "We must strike! We deserve better! We deserve more!",
    ["我们要罢工！没有良心的工厂主配不上我们这些勤劳的工人！"] = "We want to strike! Unscrupulous factory owners are not worthy of us hardworking workers!",
    ["我们要阻止皮特进入法阵中心，献祭自己召唤邪神。"] = "We must stop Pete from entering the center of the ritual circle and sacrificing himself to summon an evil god.",
    ["我们计划了很多有意义、有特点的场所，但不用担心，我会逐步开展拍摄！"] = "We have planned many meaningful and unique locations, but don't worry, I will carry out the shooting gradually!",
    ["我们该怎么处理……"] = "How should we deal with...",
    ["我们说的话，只是在担心房子的安危！"] = "What we said was just out of concern for the safety of the house!",
    ["我们调查到有个罪犯可能藏在你这里"] = "We investigated and found a criminal might be hiding here",
    ["我们调查发现，失踪的人除了进入镜中世界，还去了五月庄园。"] = "Our investigation found that besides entering the mirror world, the missing people also went to May Manor.",
    ["我们走……不对，亲爱的，这包裹怎么提着这么轻松？"] = "Let's go... wait, dear, why is this package so light?",
    ["我们走吧 还得下几层楼梯"] = "Let's go, we still have to go down a few flights of stairs.",
    ["我们走吧。"] = "Let's go.",
    ["我们走吧。我们不能。我们在等待戈多。"] = "Let’s go. We can’t. We are waiting for Godot.",
    ["我们走吧，还得下几层楼梯。"] = "Let's go, we still have to go down a few flights of stairs.",
    ["我们趁讲座堵住海默教授吧 我一定要他在我的书上签名！"] = "Let's block Professor Haimer after the lecture. I must get him to sign my book!",
    ["我们趁讲座堵住海默教授吧，我一定要他在我的书上签名！"] = "Let's ambush Professor Hamer during the lecture, I must get him to sign my book!",
    ["我们还一起战斗过，算是朋友？"] = "We also fought together, does that count as friends?",
    ["我们还会再回来的！（临时）"] = "We will be back! (Temporary)",
    ["我们还会再见面的。"] = "We will meet again.",
    ["我们还会再见，在塔罗学派……或者其他地方。"] = "We will meet again, at the Tarot Club... or somewhere else.",
    ["我们还会见面的"] = "We will meet again.",
    ["我们还在前面做了个路牌。"] = "We even made a signpost up ahead.",
    ["我们还是尝试一下普通一点的菜品吧……"] = "Let's try something more ordinary instead...",
    ["我们还是警察？"] = "Are we still police?",
    ["我们这些人就算从早干到晚，周薪也不过是20苏勒。"] = "Even if we work from morning till night, our weekly wage is only 20 soli.",
    ["我们这些哪能和他们在做的研究相比！"] = "How could we possibly compare to the research they're doing!",
    ["我们这些普通人，没什么技能和才识，只能卖些力气，当工人了。"] = "We ordinary people have no skills or knowledge, so we can only sell our strength and become workers.",
    ["我们这就去咖啡馆吧，今天露拉太太带来的红茶和点心真是不错……"] = "Let's go to the cafe. The black tea and snacks Mrs. Lula brought today are truly wonderful...",
    ["我们这座小镇位于廷根西北，是周边乡村唯一的商贸集散地。你看这些建筑风格，几乎没有受到蒸汽时代的侵染，还保持着更早的样貌。"] = "Our town is located northwest of Tingen and is the only commercial hub for the surrounding villages. Look at these architectural styles; they have hardly been touched by the Steam Age and still retain their earlier appearance.",
    ["我们这提供全廷根最正宗的因蒂斯美食。"] = "We offer the most authentic Intis cuisine in all of Tingen.",
    ["我们这条街的人都认识她——米莉安太太。以前挺和善的一个老太太，这几年越来越糊涂了，看见戴帽子的就说人家帽子里藏了鸽子，非让人家放出来。"] = "Everyone on this street knows her—Mrs. Miriam. She used to be a very kind old lady, but she's become more and more confused in recent years. Whenever she sees someone wearing a hat, she says they're hiding pigeons in it and insists they let them out.",
    ["我们这种老家伙，能安安稳稳地活着，有几瓶酒喝，就算走狗屎运了，不是吗？"] = "For old guys like us, being able to live safely and have a few bottles of wine is considered lucky, isn't it?",
    ["我们这里是考古队的营地，成员大多是历史系的师生。"] = "This is the archaeological team's camp. Most of the members are teachers and students from the history department.",
    ["我们这里有好几位侦探，每个人擅长的领域也不一样，比如我，从小就在廷根生活，对廷根的历史、街区、居民都很了解。"] = "We have several detectives here, and everyone has different areas of expertise. For example, I have lived in Tingen since I was a child and know Tingen's history, streets, and residents very well.",
    ["我们通过占卜窥见了未来命运的碎片，却被碎片恐吓，失去了完整命运的可能性。"] = "We glimpsed fragments of future fate through divination, but were intimidated by the fragments, losing the possibility of a complete fate.",
    ["我们遭遇了海盗后，又突然发生了内杠，所有人像野兽一样，在船上相互厮杀，我的视野里全是血……幸好船上还有一位英雄——"] = "After we encountered pirates, an internal conflict suddenly broke out. Everyone started slaughtering each other on the ship like wild beasts. My vision was filled with blood... Fortunately, there was a hero on the ship—",
    ["我们遭遇了海盗后，又突然发生了内讧，所有人像野兽一样，在船上互相厮杀，我的视野里全是血……幸好船上还有一位英雄——"] = "After we encountered pirates, there was a sudden infighting. Everyone was like a beast, killing each other on the ship. My vision was full of blood... Fortunately, there was a hero on the ship—",
    ["我们那把投资股市的普通居民称作“韭菜”。"] = "We call ordinary residents who invest in the stock market \"leeks\".",
    ["我们都不是龙的对手，刚才没被它杀掉已经很走运了。"] = "We are no match for the dragon. It's already lucky that we weren't killed by it just now.",
    ["我们都会受到惩罚的！我们都会死！我们都会死！"] = "We will all be punished! We will all die! We will all die!",
    ["我们都可以向永暗蜡烛祈求吗？"] = "Can we all pray to the Candle of Eternal Darkness?",
    ["我们都将开启新的人生，真是令人期待！"] = "We are all about to start new lives, it's really exciting!",
    ["我们都很想念他。"] = "We all miss him very much.",
    ["我们都心疼她，但又能说什么呢？她高兴就好。"] = "We all feel sorry for her, but what can we say? As long as she's happy.",
    ["我们都是时代的囚徒，但总有人试图在牢笼里起舞。"] = "We are all prisoners of the era, but there is always someone trying to dance within the cage.",
    ["我们都生日快乐！"] = "Happy birthday to us all!",
    ["我们都看见了，这么多天，这个屋子里根本没人住。"] = "We've all seen it; for so many days, no one has lived in this house at all.",
    ["我们都老了，风景却没有变化。当年咱们就是在这里逃的课。"] = "We've both grown old, but the scenery hasn't changed. This is where we used to skip class back then.",
    ["我们配备了一百一十名训练有素的船员，他们熟知礼仪规范，能用多种语言为您提供周到细致的服务。"] = "We are equipped with one hundred and ten well-trained crew members who are familiar with etiquette and can provide you with thoughtful and meticulous service in multiple languages.",
    ["我们需要……呃……新的酒吧，否则就没法工作！因为口渴……或者是别的什么……"] = "We need... uh... a new bar, otherwise we can't work! Because of thirst... or something else...",
    ["我们需要仔细擦拭镜子，必须是镀银的镜子，将它摆在家里象征月亮的位置……"] = "We need to wipe the mirror carefully. It must be a silver-plated mirror, and it should be placed in the home in a position that symbolizes the moon...",
    ["我们需要仔细研究那本《谜题破解法》，借助书里的内容破解谜题、打破循环。"] = "We need to study that book, \"Puzzle-Solving Methods,\" carefully and use its contents to solve the puzzles and break the loop.",
    ["我们需要先进入房间，阻止献祭仪式。"] = "We need to enter the room first to stop the Sacrifice Ritual.",
    ["我们需要其他能力的介入帮忙，我会向贝克兰德申请协助，这需要一些时间。"] = "We need the intervention of other abilities to help. I will apply for assistance from Backlund, which will take some time.",
    ["我们需要对尸体做检查，麻烦你先出去等待几分钟。我们会对尸体做一个深入的检查，我想你不会希望看到接下来的画面。"] = "We need to examine the body, so please wait outside for a few minutes. We will be performing an in-depth examination of the corpse, and I don't think you would want to see what follows.",
    ["我们需要尽快解决隐患，找到管家和知识皇冠。"] = "We need to resolve the hidden danger as soon as possible and find the butler and the Crown of Knowledge.",
    ["我们需要战胜她，这是一切的前提，也是你命运的开端。"] = "We need to defeat her; this is the prerequisite for everything, and the beginning of your fate.",
    ["我们需要新衣服……也许可以来点不一样的颜色，最好是能在阳光下闪闪发光的那些！"] = "We need new clothes... maybe something with a different color, preferably ones that sparkle in the sun!",
    ["我们面对的存在，其真相往往隐藏在层层谎言与灵性误导之下。因此，在某些……“特殊”的案件中，圣堂认可了一种更为“戏剧化”的取证程序。"] = "The truth behind the existences we face is often hidden under layers of lies and spiritual misdirection. Therefore, in certain... \"special\" cases, the Cathedral recognizes a more \"dramatic\" evidence-gathering procedure.",
    ["我仿佛……也看到了满天星辰。"] = "I feel as if... I have also seen the starry sky.",
    ["我会。封印物需要回收。这是一场对失窃封印物的合法回收行动。幕后黑手已被击毙。"] = "I will. The Sealed Artifact needs to be recovered. This is a legitimate recovery operation for a stolen Sealed Artifact. The mastermind has been eliminated.",
    ["我会一直守着你，不用太过担心。"] = "I will watch over you, don't worry too much.",
    ["我会一直想你的……"] = "I will always miss you...",
    ["我会不断拆离此处杂乱的灵性碎片。"] = "I will continuously dismantle the messy spiritual fragments here.",
    ["我会保证这里的安全。"] = "I will ensure the safety of this place.",
    ["我会修好琴弦，让音乐再度响起，这样才能平息他们的愤怒。"] = "I will fix the strings and let the music ring out again; only then can their anger be appeased.",
    ["我会全程陪在他们身边，保证安全。"] = "I will accompany them the whole time to ensure their safety.",
    ["我会再见到“愚者”先生？"] = "Will I see Mr. Fool again?",
    ["我会努力不辜负您的期待，“正义”女士。"] = "I will strive to live up to your expectations, Miss Justice.",
    ["我会努力的，成为廷根最有钱的人，然后把这个村子也建的很豪华。"] = "I will work hard to become the richest person in Tingen and then build this village to be very luxurious as well.",
    ["我会努力训练的，“正义”女士。"] = "I will train hard, Miss Justice.",
    ["我会去间海郡，他出生和埋葬的地方。"] = "I will go to Midseashire, the place where he was born and buried.",
    ["我会发射触手，离我远点"] = "I can shoot tentacles, stay away from me",
    ["我会听到的。"] = "I will hear it.",
    ["我会听话……我会努力……我会做最好的孩子……"] = "I will be obedient... I will work hard... I will be the best child...",
    ["我会在哪里遇到您？"] = "Where will I meet you?",
    ["我会在这个站点时刻准备为您发车，或进行火车的维修保养工作。"] = "I will be ready at this station at all times to dispatch trains for you or perform maintenance work on the trains.",
    ["我会在这里呆到天亮……"] = "I will stay here until dawn...",
    ["我会处理好一切，你只需要说“愿意”。"] = "I will handle everything, you only need to say 'I will'.",
    ["我会奉献我的灵魂，我会用鲜血取悦您。"] = "I will offer my soul, and I will use blood to please you.",
    ["我会好好保存的。再见，斯林太太。"] = "I will keep them safe. Goodbye, Mrs. Slin.",
    ["我会好好珍藏。"] = "I will treasure it well.",
    ["我会好好记得的。再见，阿兹克先生！"] = "I will remember it well. Goodbye, Mr. Azik!",
    ["我会好好读完大学，毕业后我打算从黑荆棘安保公司的文员开始努力，最终成为一名能守护廷根的值夜者。"] = "I will finish university properly. After graduation, I plan to start working hard as a clerk at Blackthorn Security Company and eventually become a Nighthawk who can protect Tingen.",
    ["我会如实描述的。"] = "I will describe it truthfully.",
    ["我会将今天的事情报告给圣堂，对特莉丝进行通缉，至少她后续无法再光明正大进行祭祀仪式。"] = "I will report today's events to the Holy Cathedral and issue a warrant for Trissy. At the very least, she won't be able to openly conduct sacrifice rituals anymore.",
    ["我会尽快带他们去安全屋避难的，我熟悉廷根的每一条路，不用担心我们。"] = "I will take them to the safe house for refuge as soon as possible. I am familiar with every road in Tingen, so don't worry about us.",
    ["我会尽我所能守护这份光。"] = "I will do my best to guard this light.",
    ["我会尽我所能，为您打造一个宁静整洁的环境。"] = "I will do my best to create a quiet and tidy environment for you.",
    ["我会尽量克制地，为你展示更强大而神秘的非凡力量！"] = "I will try my best to restrain myself and show you more powerful and mysterious Extraordinary powers!",
    ["我会带你去一些熟悉的地方，或许这会让你想起什么。"] = "I will take you to some familiar places; perhaps that will help you remember something.",
    ["我会带着最饱满的热情完成工作！"] = "I will complete my work with the greatest enthusiasm!",
    ["我会带给她自由，不惜一切！"] = "I will bring her freedom, at any cost!",
    ["我会帮你的，不会让你伤害别人、变成真正的怪物。"] = "I will help you; I won't let you hurt others or turn into a real monster.",
    ["我会帮你记录这个故事，你想让它叫什么名字呢？"] = "I will help you record this story, what would you like to call it?",
    ["我会常来看小熊的，你要离水远一点哦！"] = "I will come to see the teddy bear often, you should stay away from the water!",
    ["我会想念你们的，我的朋友！"] = "I will miss you all, my friends!",
    ["我会成为伟大的猎龙人·凯文，成就伟大的荣耀！"] = "I will become the great Dragon Hunter Kevin, achieving great glory!",
    ["我会把他逮捕回警局，请各位继续用餐！"] = "I will arrest him and take him to the station. Please, everyone, continue your meal!",
    ["我会把你们全部变成分身，然后等着看他醒来后的表情！"] = "I will turn all of you into clones, and then wait to see the expression on his face when he wakes up!",
    ["我会把全部情况都汇报给会长。阿罗德斯，我想重新回答你的问题。"] = "I will report the entire situation to the President. Arrodes, I would like to answer your question again.",
    ["我会把敲下来的煤灰装进袋子，系上绳子，您来帮忙把它拉出来。"] = "I will put the knocked-off coal ash into a bag and tie it with a rope; you can help pull it out.",
    ["我会把每一枚金币都铸成复仇的子弹，让陷害我的恶棍付出代价！"] = "I will cast every gold coin into a bullet of revenge and make the villains who framed me pay the price!",
    ["我会把证据交给警察厅，把你这贪污渎职、冤枉好人的检察官扔进大牢，让你在那里度过你的下半辈子！"] = "I will hand the evidence over to the police department, throw you, a corrupt and derelict prosecutor who framed the innocent, into prison, and let you spend the rest of your life there!",
    ["我会把那些伤害你、弄脏你甚至想砍掉你的人都赶走……"] = "I will drive away anyone who hurts you, dirties you, or even wants to cut you...",
    ["我会把那些硬得像石头的煤灰敲下来。没有他，我担心自己找不到出路……"] = "I knock down the soot that's as hard as stone. Without him, I'm afraid I won't be able to find my way out...",
    ["我会拥有自己的办公室，有怀表，有丝绸马甲……"] = "I will have my own office, a pocket watch, and a silk vest...",
    ["我会掉毛，会追尾巴，会趴着晒太阳，会在听到“出门”两个字的时候兴奋地转圈。"] = "I will shed hair, chase my tail, lie down to sunbathe, and spin around excitedly when I hear the word 'go out'.",
    ["我会掌控这个梦境，接下来专心对付小丑吧。"] = "I will control this dream, let's focus on dealing with the Clown next.",
    ["我会教你的，准备好了吗？"] = "I'll teach you. Are you ready?",
    ["我会替你转达的。"] = "I will convey it for you.",
    ["我会汇报全部真相，以及自己的看法，你们还需要等待处置结果。"] = "I will report the whole truth, as well as my own views. You still need to wait for the final decision.",
    ["我会注意的。"] = "I will keep that in mind.",
    ["我会派人安抚和守护他们的家人，给予一笔抚恤金，让他们好好活下去。"] = "I will send people to comfort and guard their families and provide a pension so that they can live well.",
    ["我会派人追踪丽埃娜一家的情况，避免有意外发生。当然，他们也要为所犯的罪接受对等的惩罚。"] = "I will send people to track the situation of Liana's family to avoid any accidents. Of course, they must also accept equal punishment for the crimes they have committed.",
    ["我会派人追踪丽埃娜和封印物的情况，避免再有发生意外。当然，他们也要为所犯的罪接受对等的惩罚。"] = "I will send people to track the situation of Liana and the Sealed Artifact to avoid any further accidents. Of course, they must also accept equal punishment for the crimes they have committed.",
    ["我会用它……再度开启循环。"] = "I will use it... to restart the cycle again.",
    ["我会留意的。"] = "I will keep an eye on it.",
    ["我会的"] = "I will",
    ["我会的，我也会告诉其他学员的。"] = "I will, and I will tell the other students too.",
    ["我会的，谢谢您。"] = "I will, thank you.",
    ["我会等待那个 必然的春天"] = "I will wait for that inevitable spring.",
    ["我会给你一个地址。至于保证，我想如果有这位神秘阁下的见证，你和我都会足够放心。"] = "I will give you an address. As for the guarantee, I think if we have the witness of this mysterious Excellency, both you and I will be sufficiently reassured.",
    ["我会给你一些香味、足够的温柔和引导，让你一点点放开自己，真正沉浸入那种感受。"] = "I will give you some fragrance, enough gentleness, and guidance to let you open up little by little and truly immerse yourself in that feeling.",
    ["我会给你一些香味，给你足够的温柔和润滑，让你一点点放开自己，真正沉浸入那种感受。"] = "I will give you some fragrance, give you enough gentleness and lubrication, so you can let yourself go little by little and truly immerse yourself in that feeling.",
    ["我会给你崔佛给不了的东西：永恒的沉醉，永恒的欢愉，永恒的……归属。"] = "I will give you what Trevor cannot: eternal intoxication, eternal pleasure, eternal... belonging.",
    ["我会让灵使包裹住封印物3-116，它可以隔绝封印物的作用，也能让你自由地跟在我的身边。"] = "I will have the Spirit Messenger wrap around Sealed Artifact 3-116. It can isolate the artifact's effects and also allow you to follow me freely.",
    ["我会记住的。"] = "I will remember that.",
    ["我会记得每一个名字。我会完成……你做不到的事。"] = "I will remember every name. I will finish... what you couldn't do.",
    ["我会进一步调查失踪案，并留意它们是否和知识皇冠有关系。"] = "I will further investigate the missing persons cases and keep an eye on whether they are related to the Crown of Knowledge.",
    ["我会送珍妮一程。"] = "I will see Jenny off.",
    ["我会配合的，什么都交代，只要别抓我。"] = "I'll cooperate, I'll tell you everything, just don't arrest me.",
    ["我会配合的，我要搞清楚到底发生了什么。"] = "I will cooperate. I need to figure out what exactly happened.",
    ["我会配合调查的，我要弄清发生了什么。"] = "I will cooperate with the investigation. I want to find out what happened.",
    ["我会隐匿行踪，慢慢筹划……待我归来之时，便是真相大白、罪恶覆灭之日！"] = "I will hide my tracks and plan slowly... When I return, it will be the day the truth is revealed and evil is destroyed!",
    ["我似乎发现我多了些什么能力……难道，就像那座拔地而起的小镇……许个愿试试。"] = "I seem to have discovered that I have gained some abilities... Could it be, just like that town that rose from the ground... Let me try making a wish.",
    ["我似乎的确听说过“波拿巴”这个名字，难道是真的吗？"] = "I seem to have indeed heard the name 'Bonaparte', could it be true?",
    ["我住了四十年，这镇上没什么我不知道的。我就是看不惯这些骗子坑人。什么破东西能要40镑！"] = "I've lived here for forty years, there's nothing in this town I don't know. I just can't stand these scammers ripping people off. What kind of junk is worth 40 pounds!",
    ["我住了许久院，失去了工作、失去了财富，更失去了家庭……"] = "I was hospitalized for a long time, lost my job, lost my wealth, and even lost my family...",
    ["我作为一名医生，应该按照医学的原则来判断生死。"] = "As a doctor, I should judge life and death according to medical principles.",
    ["我侄女玛莎下周就到镇上来，那姑娘又壮实又勤快，一顿饭能吃掉两条黑面包！你一定要见见！"] = "My niece Martha is coming to town next week. That girl is strong and diligent; she can eat two loaves of black bread in one meal! You must meet her!",
    ["我依稀记得有什么事情一定要去做，那我必须要去做，不然我死也不甘心……嗯，现在已经是某种意义上的死也不甘心了。"] = "I vaguely remember there's something I must do, so I have to do it. Otherwise, I won't be able to rest in peace even in death... Hmm, in a sense, I'm already unable to rest in peace even in death.",
    ["我保证给你全廷根最公道的价格。"] = "I guarantee you the fairest price in all of Tingen.",
    ["我保证这次绝对美味，让你再醒来时也能第一时间想起来！"] = "I guarantee this will be absolutely delicious, so delicious that you'll think of it the moment you wake up again!",
    ["我倒不觉得她值得同情。前两天我见她买菜，挑挑拣拣地翻了八百多遍，然后你猜怎么着？"] = "I don't think she's worth sympathizing with. I saw her buying groceries a couple of days ago, picking and choosing over eight hundred times, and then guess what?",
    ["我倒希望有人可以帮我呀……"] = "I wish someone could help me...",
    ["我倒是不介意赚这种钱……但我年纪大了，身上一堆病，老乞丐也不会来找我做这最后一单。"] = "I wouldn't mind earning this kind of money... but I'm old and full of ailments. An old beggar wouldn't come to me for this last job either.",
    ["我倒觉得，您爱这些胖乎乎的面团，也爱您的生活，也爱周围的邻居们，所以您的面包格外好吃。"] = "I think it's because you love these chubby doughs, you love your life, and you love the neighbors around you, so your bread is exceptionally delicious.",
    ["我假装答应他，并抓住机会把他逼近2-049的影响范围内，然后开枪把他击杀。"] = "I pretended to agree, seized the opportunity to force him into the range of 2-049's influence, and then shot and killed him.",
    ["我做不到……我的大约翰，他才……才刚获得一份工作……哦不！"] = "I can't... My Big John, he just... just got a job... Oh no!",
    ["我做不到，揭开超自然现象的真相，是我的毕生的追求 。"] = "I can't do that. Uncovering the truth behind supernatural phenomena is my life's pursuit.",
    ["我做不到，萨拉。"] = "I can't do it, Sarah.",
    ["我做了一个梦……"] = "I had a dream...",
    ["我做到啦！"] = "I did it!",
    ["我做梦都想成为她那样的人，她是我的偶像和榜样。"] = "I dream of becoming someone like her; she is my idol and role model.",
    ["我做的求婚计划没有用！我做的找戒指计划没有用！上学做的学习计划没有用，锻炼计划没有用……"] = "The proposal plan I made was useless! The plan to find the ring was useless! The study plan I made for school was useless, the exercise plan was useless...",
    ["我偶尔会想，如果我的长孙没有死去，应该也像他一样大了……"] = "I occasionally think that if my eldest grandson hadn't died, he would probably be as old as him...",
    ["我偶尔会想，您是不是真的知道，您带来的那份存在感有多令人安心。"] = "I occasionally wonder if you truly know how reassuring the presence you bring is.",
    ["我偷偷回去过一次，但东西都不见了。妈妈的水杯、衣服，还有我的啾啾……"] = "I snuck back once, but everything was gone. Mom's water cup, her clothes, and my Chiu-Chiu...",
    ["我儿子也上过战场，他说，蜡烛的使命就是被点燃。"] = "My son also went to the battlefield; he said that the mission of a candle is to be lit.",
    ["我儿子在乡下念书，老师让写作文，题目是“谁是你心中最伟大的国王”。 "] = "My son is studying in the countryside, and the teacher asked him to write an essay titled 'Who is the greatest king in your heart?'",
    ["我先上去了，前台不能太久没人。"] = "I'm going up now; the front desk can't be left unattended for too long.",
    ["我先去和她聊聊看。"] = "I'll go talk to her first.",
    ["我先去拉姆德古堡安抚吉娜，然后和吉娜借钱去看莉莉，她一向会满足我的所有请求。"] = "I'll go to Lamud Castle to pacify Gina first, then borrow money from her to see Lily; she always grants all my requests.",
    ["我先喝！"] = "I'll drink first!",
    ["我先回去了，前台不能太久没人。"] = "I'm going back now. The front desk can't be left unattended for too long.",
    ["我先带您看看小姐的情况。我理解，这是必要流程。"] = "I will take you to see the young lady's situation first. I understand, this is a necessary procedure.",
    ["我先自己看看。"] = "I'll look around myself first.",
    ["我先自己看看吧。"] = "I'll look around by myself first.",
    ["我先走了"] = "I'm leaving now",
    ["我先走了，帮我善后一下！拜托！"] = "I'm leaving first, help me clean up the mess! Please!",
    ["我全都清楚了"] = "I understand everything now",
    ["我全都要了！"] = "I want them all!",
    ["我其实对富人区比较感兴趣！"] = "I'm actually quite interested in the wealthy district!",
    ["我养的猎犬都比他耍得好！"] = "The Hound I keep plays better than him!",
    ["我再也不要过这种被谎言和赌债填满的生活了！"] = "I never want to live a life filled with lies and gambling debts again!",
    ["我再努力一些……或者等茜茜成为政府雇员，会找到欢迎我们的地方生活的。"] = "I will work harder... or when Cici becomes a government employee, we will find a place that welcomes us to live.",
    ["我再想想。"] = "Let me think about it.",
    ["我再来一次，下次一定是成功的！"] = "I'll try again. The next time will definitely be a success!",
    ["我再看看"] = "Let me look again",
    ["我再看看，打扰了"] = "I'll take another look, excuse me",
    ["我再试试去和他谈谈吧。如果他坚持不松口，你有什么打算？"] = "Let me try talking to him again. If he refuses to budge, what are your plans?",
    ["我再逛逛"] = "I'll look around some more",
    ["我再问一次——为、什、么、冲、着、我、吐、痰？"] = "I'll ask one more time—wh-y, a-re, y-ou, sp-itt-ing, at, me?",
    ["我写不出来……一点灵感都没有……一个疯狂的冒险家到底该怎么写才够疯狂？"] = "I can't write... I have no inspiration at all... How exactly should a crazy adventurer be written to be crazy enough?",
    ["我写了遗书，如果今晚您还不回应我，我就追随您到画中的世界！"] = "I have written a suicide note. If you don't respond to me tonight, I will follow you into the world of the painting!",
    ["我写封信给队长，请他多留意你的安全。"] = "I'll write a letter to the captain and ask him to keep an eye on your safety.",
    ["我军队出身的父亲也会为我与会员们的交往感到自豪……"] = "My father, who was in the military, would also be proud of my association with the members...",
    ["我决定不理彼得了，他竟然说我的穿搭奇怪，我明明模仿的是会长，而她可是全学派时尚风潮的引领者！"] = "I've decided to ignore Peter. He actually said my outfit was strange, when I was clearly imitating the president, and she is the leader of the entire school's fashion trend!",
    ["我决定今天一整天都不理彼得了，他竟然说我的穿搭奇怪，我明明模仿的是会长，而她毋庸置疑是全学派时尚风潮的引领者！"] = "I've decided to ignore Peter all day today. He actually said my outfit was strange, when I was clearly imitating the President, and she is undoubtedly the leader of the entire school's fashion trend!",
    ["我准备了两张《伯爵归来》的票，非常期待与您的下次相遇。"] = "I have prepared two tickets for \"The Count's Return,\" looking forward to our next meeting.",
    ["我准备参加这一届的廷根市长选举，现在的廷根实在太糟糕了。"] = "I am preparing to participate in this Tingen mayoral election. Tingen is just too terrible right now.",
    ["我准备在你身上尝试一个新的仪式魔法了，你这个恶心的小家伙！"] = "I am preparing to try a new Ritual Magic on you, you disgusting little guy!",
    ["我准备好了"] = "I'm ready",
    ["我准备好了。不错，梅丽莎，这条裙子很适合你。"] = "I'm ready. Not bad, Melissa, this dress suits you very well.",
    ["我准备好了！"] = "I'm ready!",
    ["我准备好了，再次进入历史迷雾。"] = "I am ready to enter the fog of history again.",
    ["我准备好了，章鱼焯水过程中要浸泡五次冰水……从前我就是这么做这道菜的。"] = "I'm ready. During the blanching process, the octopus needs to be soaked in ice water five times... That's how I used to make this dish.",
    ["我准备当个送货员，把它还给它真正的主人。"] = "I plan to be a delivery person and return it to its rightful owner.",
    ["我出5000金镑。"] = "I bid 5,000 gold pounds.",
    ["我出600金镑！"] = "I bid 600 gold pounds!",
    ["我出650金镑！"] = "I bid 650 gold pounds!",
    ["我出生在廷根，成长在廷根，我想守护这里。"] = "I was born in Tingen, grew up in Tingen, and I want to guard this place.",
    ["我分享了我的一键辅助方案%s！点击%s"] = "I have shared my one-click support scheme %s! Click %s",
    ["我分享了我的非凡方案%s！点击%s"] = "I shared my Beyonder build %s! Click %s",
    ["我分享了我的非凡方案%s！点击<HyperLink stylename=\\"] = "I shared my Beyonder scheme %s! Click <HyperLink stylename=\\",
    ["我刚从那里过来"] = "I just came from there",
    ["我刚从霍伊大学历史系毕业，在努力准备廷根大学讲师的面试，想尽快工作缓解家里拮据的生活。"] = "I just graduated from the History Department at Hoy University and am working hard to prepare for an interview for a lecturer position at Tingen University, hoping to start working soon to ease our family's financial strain.",
    ["我刚刚一瞬突然感到钻心的头痛……"] = "I suddenly felt a piercing headache for a split second...",
    ["我刚刚似乎听到了什么论文，什么代写，也许我应该考虑一下举报……"] = "I seem to have just heard something about a thesis, something about ghostwriting. Maybe I should consider reporting it...",
    ["我刚刚听到“0”级封印物出逃……廷根会有危险吗？"] = "I just heard that a Sequence 0 Sealed Artifact has escaped... Will Tingen be in danger?",
    ["我刚刚在树上对地面使用了我们学徒的“开门”，结果卡住了。现在还有一个不知名的东西在戳我的屁股……"] = "I just used our Apprentice's \"Open Door\" on the ground while in a tree, and I got stuck. Now there is an unknown thing poking my butt...",
    ["我刚刚就是在思考这个问题。现在，我想好了，这周我就收拾东西离开鲁恩……"] = "I was just thinking about this question. Now, I have made up my mind. I will pack my things and leave Loen this week...",
    ["我刚刚补了些提示，你看完就知道如何调查了。"] = "I just added some hints; you'll know how to investigate once you've finished reading them.",
    ["我刚刚说话的声音是不是太大了？对不起，我有点兴奋过头了，嘿嘿。"] = "Was my voice too loud just now? Sorry, I was a bit too excited, hehe.",
    ["我刚刚过来还看到一个靠在门前不敢进教堂的人……"] = "I just saw someone leaning against the door who didn't dare to enter the church...",
    ["我刚刚透过门缝已经看到了全部的做菜过程，你们配合得不错。"] = "I just saw the whole cooking process through the crack in the door, you two cooperated well.",
    ["我刚到廷根，您能给我透露一下这边的状况吗？"] = "I just arrived in Tingen. Can you reveal the situation here to me?",
    ["我刚吃下了一片神秘卷心菜，感觉自己体内充满了隐秘的力量。"] = "I just ate a piece of mysterious cabbage and felt my body filled with hidden power.",
    ["我刚失业，总不能闲着，不如去五月庄园打份短工。"] = "I just lost my job and can't just sit around. I might as well go to May Manor for a short-term job.",
    ["我刚才已经看见你被噩梦折磨的心灵。"] = "I have already seen your heart tormented by nightmares just now.",
    ["我刚才路过的时候，听见他又是自言自语，又是发出怪笑声，挺瘆人的……"] = "When I passed by just now, I heard him talking to himself and making weird laughing sounds. It was quite creepy...",
    ["我刚才追踪管家，拿回了这个。"] = "I was tracking the Butler earlier and retrieved this.",
    ["我刚睡醒，至少还有足够的力气回答你的提问。"] = "I just woke up, but I still have enough strength to answer your questions.",
    ["我刚进门看到海纳斯不在，顺手占卜了下他的情况，没想到得到了遗憾的结果。"] = "I saw Haines wasn't here when I walked in, so I did a quick divination on his situation, but I didn't expect to get such a regrettable result.",
    ["我到了！"] = "I've arrived!",
    ["我前世是个厨师？拿手菜是烤乳鸽？所以我被惩罚不能变成鸽子，而是在这里喂鸽子？！"] = "I was a chef in my past life? My specialty was roast squab? So I'm being punished by not being able to turn into a pigeon, but instead feeding pigeons here?!",
    ["我劝你别在我眼前转身，小心我狠狠踢你的屁股！"] = "I advise you not to turn your back on me, or I'll kick your ass hard!",
    ["我劝你最好不要去劳德家买海鲜，他卖的都是些臭鱼烂虾！"] = "I advise you not to buy seafood at the Louds' place; everything he sells is rotten fish and shrimp!",
    ["我办事，你还不放心？那能让狒狒发狂的药粉无色无味，谁都察觉不了，只会觉得是这个畜生自己发了疯。"] = "Don't you trust me to handle things? That powder that makes the baboon go crazy is colorless and odorless. No one will notice; they'll just think the beast went mad on its own.",
    ["我加入了探索小队"] = "I joined the Exploration team.",
    ["我加入了探索队"] = "I joined the exploration team",
    ["我加入俱乐部的原因吗？嗯……如果赛艇成绩优异的话，也是可以申请奖学金的。"] = "The reason I joined the club? Hmm... if my rowing results are excellent, I can also apply for a scholarship.",
    ["我加入好几年了，现在只是偶尔会来坐坐。"] = "I've been a member for several years, though now I only come to sit for a while occasionally.",
    ["我努力过了，但还是出不去，唉。总卡在墙上，我都怀疑我不是做“学徒”的料……"] = "I've tried, but I still can't get out, sigh. Always getting stuck in the wall, I even doubt if I'm cut out to be an \"Apprentice\"...",
    ["我努力过了，唉。总卡在墙上，我都怀疑我不是做“学徒”的料……"] = "I tried my best, sigh. I keep getting stuck in the wall; I'm starting to doubt if I'm cut out to be an Apprentice...",
    ["我占卜出你有危险！"] = "I divined that you were in danger!",
    ["我即是大帝"] = "I Am the Emperor",
    ["我即烈阳，永不坠落。"] = "I am the Blazing Sun, never falling.",
    ["我即神话！"] = "I am the Myth!",
    ["我原以为“堕落母神”对廷根的影响还十分微弱。现在看来，祂的仆从设计了许多拙劣的巧合。"] = "I originally thought the influence of the Mother Tree of Desire on Tingen was still very weak. Now it seems her servants have designed many clumsy coincidences.",
    ["我原本不打算给陌生人留下时尚会员的位置……直到看见你从花径间走来。不过想拿到邀请函的话，还是得先通过我的品鉴。"] = "I originally didn't intend to leave a fashion membership spot for a stranger... until I saw you walking through the flower path. However, if you want to get an invitation, you still have to pass my appreciation test first.",
    ["我原本也很怀疑，但感谢上次的相遇，你让我深受启发。"] = "I was also very skeptical, but thanks to our last encounter, you inspired me deeply.",
    ["我原本是个还不错的工人，有个妻子和两个可爱的孩子，直到几年前的一场传染性疾病……"] = "I used to be a decent worker with a wife and two lovely children, until an infectious disease a few years ago...",
    ["我原本是怀着愧疚想弥补他的家庭，但是没想到和雪莉成为了朋友。"] = "I originally intended to make amends to his family out of guilt, but I didn't expect to become friends with Shirley.",
    ["我厨艺很好"] = "I'm a good cook",
    ["我去了几次后忙着工作的事就没再去了，昨天警察也来找我调查过。"] = "I went a few times, but then I got busy with work and stopped going. The police also came to investigate me yesterday.",
    ["我去吧。"] = "I'll go.",
    ["我去和弗里尔聊聊，请先随便看看吧。"] = "I'm going to go chat with Freer; please feel free to look around.",
    ["我去帮你问问吧。"] = "I'll go ask for you.",
    ["我去得太晚了，她已经吃了青蛙……我只好把她，把她……"] = "I went too late, she had already eaten the frog... I had no choice but to, to...",
    ["我去找老板请辞。"] = "I'll go ask the boss to resign.",
    ["我去探望躺在床上的他……可他醒来时却忘记了我是谁……这一定是盔甲之神的诅咒……"] = "I went to visit him lying in bed... but when he woke up, he forgot who I was... This must be the curse of the God of Armor...",
    ["我去看看。 "] = "I'll go take a look.",
    ["我去看看残留的情况。克莱恩，你把这些药剂带给大家。"] = "I'll go check the remnants. Klein, take these potions to everyone.",
    ["我去看看马西莫的反应。"] = "I'll go check Massimo's reaction.",
    ["我去说她嫁的就是我了。"] = "If I went to say it, she would be marrying me instead.",
    ["我去调查一下"] = "I'll go investigate",
    ["我去过了，警局里没有人……"] = "I've already been there. There's no one at the police station...",
    ["我去通知他们，你和队长先出发吧。"] = "I'll go notify them; you and the Captain should head out first.",
    ["我去附近找找看。"] = "I'll go look around nearby.",
    ["我又写了一首诗。"] = "I wrote another poem.",
    ["我又怎么会沦落到做政府雇员，在下水道搜查？这不符合罗塞尔大帝的美学！"] = "How did I end up as a government employee, searching in the sewers? This does not conform to Emperor Roselle's aesthetics!",
    ["我又没做错什么，只是……算了，还是去道歉吧。"] = "I didn't do anything wrong, it's just... forget it, I'd better go apologize.",
    ["我又没管住嘴……\r\n奈特又要说我天天背后传别人闲话啦！ "] = "I couldn't keep my mouth shut again...\nKnight is going to say I'm gossiping behind people's backs every day again!",
    ["我又没管住手！\r\n丹老是告诉我，\r\n溜门撬锁，迟早有一天要被发现……"] = "I couldn't keep my hands to myself again!\nDan is always telling me that if I keep picking locks,\nI'll be caught sooner or later...",
    ["我又没靠这个赚钱！"] = "I'm not doing this for money!",
    ["我又清醒了，我感觉自己变得很轻！于是我跑了起来……我一直跑啊跑啊，直到感觉不到时间的流逝，直到听不见炮声，直到我看到有人出没。"] = "I woke up again, and I felt very light! So I started running... I kept running and running, until I couldn't feel the passage of time, until I couldn't hear the shelling, until I saw people.",
    ["我又看到了那个“我”……"] = "I saw that 'me' again...",
    ["我反对！"] = "I object!",
    ["我发一个"] = "Send One",
    ["我发了一个%s%s"] = "I sent a %s%s",
    ["我发出的"] = "Sent by Me",
    ["我发放了一个礼金，前往领取！"] = "I sent a gift, go claim it!",
    ["我发现了两页罗塞尔大帝的日记。"] = "I found two pages of Emperor Roselle's diary.",
    ["我发现了主教贪图信徒的钱财，那是无可容忍的脏污。"] = "I discovered that the bishop was coveting the believers' money; that was an intolerable filth.",
    ["我发现了，规则的漏洞，现实的错误。"] = "I have discovered it, the loopholes in the rules, the errors in reality.",
    ["我发现你的命运有不协调的地方。"] = "I have discovered that there are inconsistencies in your fate.",
    ["我发现全世界的知识都活了过来……"] = "I discovered that all the knowledge in the world had come to life...",
    ["我发誓以后再也不接所谓的“特殊服务”了，气得我皱纹都出来了！"] = "I swear I'll never take on so-called \"special services\" again. It made me so angry that I've even developed wrinkles!",
    ["我发誓，我从未做过这些事情。"] = "I swear, I have never done these things.",
    ["我发起的"] = "Initiated by Me",
    ["我受够了！无论是新鲜的牡蛎、变成钱的牡蛎还是散发着牡蛎味的丈夫！"] = "I've had enough! Whether it's fresh oysters, oysters turned into money, or a husband who reeks of oysters!",
    ["我受够你了！"] = "I've had enough of you!",
    ["我变成这样……不能再回月城了，对不起。"] = "I've become like this... I can't go back to Moon City anymore, I'm sorry.",
    ["我只会用那些不着边际的话去逗他，说他没胆量，说他古板……好像这样，就能把自己心里的那点念想藏好一些。"] = "I would only use those nonsensical words to tease him, calling him gutless, calling him old-fashioned... as if that way, I could hide the little thoughts in my heart a bit better.",
    ["我只传小八卦，\r\n大事情我哪敢听呀……"] = "I only spread small gossip,\nI wouldn't dare listen to big matters...",
    ["我只好假装绕一大圈，从狗洞钻过去，说是秘密通道。"] = "I had to pretend to take a long detour and crawl through a dog hole, claiming it was a secret passage.",
    ["我只好又求助于女神。我捐掉了金表、马车、别墅，祂的指示却仍没有到来。"] = "I had to turn to the Goddess again. I donated my gold watch, carriage, and villa, but His instructions still haven't arrived.",
    ["我只好向另一位绅士求助，他指给我一个截然相反的地址，然后略带同情地告诉我：“去那里吧，那才能称得上是真正的贝克兰德，南面那一块并不值得一去。”"] = "I had to ask another gentleman for help. He pointed me to a completely opposite address and then told me with a hint of sympathy: 'Go there, that can be called the real Backlund; the southern part is not worth visiting.'",
    ["我只希望他能安稳长大，读完大学。"] = "I only hope he can grow up safely and finish university.",
    ["我只希望阿尔伯特离危险远一点，在远离我和海洋的地方平安长大。"] = "I only hope Albert stays far away from danger and grows up safely away from me and the ocean.",
    ["我只想再找一次……还想最后一次……"] = "I just want to find it one more time... just one last time...",
    ["我只想永远和我的木桩朋友待着。"] = "I just want to stay with my wooden dummy friend forever.",
    ["我只想留在廷根，保护好这里。"] = "I just want to stay in Tingen and protect this place.",
    ["我只想祝你开心"] = "I just want to wish you happiness",
    ["我只想要一个出行便利的贝克兰德，是假的也无妨！"] = "I just want a Backlund with convenient transportation, even if it's fake, I don't mind!",
    ["我只想要一瓶喷上去能让我更有勇气求婚的东西……"] = "I just want a bottle that will give me more courage to propose...",
    ["我只想让他们多学点！"] = "I just want them to learn a little more!",
    ["我只愿面朝大海，春暖花开……"] = "I only wish to face the sea, with spring flowers blossoming...",
    ["我只是......想帮他们多学点罢了。"] = "I just... wanted to help them learn a little more.",
    ["我只是……忽然有些不明白……"] = "I just... suddenly don't understand...",
    ["我只是……想继续和他……在一起……"] = "I just... wanted to continue... being with him...",
    ["我只是一个凶手。"] = "I am just a murderer.",
    ["我只是一个路人"] = "I'm just a passerby",
    ["我只是一只鹦鹉，嘎。"] = "I'm just a parrot, caw.",
    ["我只是一条狗"] = "I Am Just a Dog.",
    ["我只是一条狗——这句话是真相，不是借口。"] = "I am just a dog—this sentence is the truth, not an excuse.",
    ["我只是一条狗，为什么要和人切磋？"] = "I am just a dog, why would I spar with a human?",
    ["我只是一面镜子，陛下。人是不能要求镜子分辨美丑的，除非你会和小动物说话，并且有红润的嘴唇、媲美白雪的肌肤，还有7个矮仆从……"] = "I am just a mirror, Your Majesty. People cannot ask a mirror to distinguish between beauty and ugliness, unless you can talk to small animals and have rosy lips, skin comparable to snow, and 7 dwarf servants...",
    ["我只是不想做玫瑰夫人的柔弱女儿。我必须是强大而自由的侠盗黑皇帝，像英雄一样登场，才能带她离开牢笼，去大海，去自由的地方。"] = "I just don't want to be Lady Rose's fragile daughter. I must be the powerful and free Black Emperor, appearing like a hero, so I can take her away from this cage, to the sea, to a place of freedom.",
    ["我只是个路人，对字母和知识有些兴趣罢了。"] = "I'm just a passerby with some interest in letters and knowledge.",
    ["我只是为了不待在家里，女神鼓励她的女性信徒外出工作，寻找更多自我的价值。"] = "I just do it so I don't have to stay at home. The Goddess encourages her female believers to work outside and find more self-worth.",
    ["我只是偷两具尸体卖给诊所，这是造福医学发展啊！"] = "I was just stealing two corpses to sell to the clinic; this is for the benefit of medical progress!",
    ["我只是去买了个冰激凌，回来路上就看到凶手倒在路边了。"] = "I just went to buy an ice cream, and on the way back, I saw the murderer lying on the side of the road.",
    ["我只是图克莱拉的金镑，你放心，我绝对不会背弃我们的小家！"] = "I was just after Clara's pounds. Don't worry, I will absolutely never betray our little home!",
    ["我只是在思考你刚刚说的话，似乎得到了一些感悟。"] = "I was just thinking about what you said earlier, and it seems I've gained some insights.",
    ["我只是在正常诊疗。作为一名医生，观察病人是职责所在。"] = "I was just performing a normal diagnosis. As a doctor, observing the patient is my duty.",
    ["我只是在陈述事实，奶奶。"] = "I'm just stating facts, Grandma.",
    ["我只是多喝了一点酒，我对她没有感情的！"] = "I just drank a little too much; I have no feelings for her!",
    ["我只是将看到的命运告诉她。"] = "I am simply telling her the fate I have seen.",
    ["我只是帮你排队，不用这么麻烦。"] = "I just helped you queue, no need for such trouble.",
    ["我只是恰好想亲手触摸几幅画……"] = "I just happened to want to touch a few paintings with my own hands...",
    ["我只是想……再有一个家。"] = "I just wanted... to have a home again.",
    ["我只是想去见我的弗洛拉和小艾米，但是连湖都在拒绝我。"] = "I just wanted to see my Flora and little Amy, but even the lake is rejecting me.",
    ["我只是想和大帝一样做个英雄，如果我不想做这个英雄，就不会接下这份工作，如果我不接下这份工作……"] = "I just wanted to be a hero like the Emperor. If I didn't want to be this hero, I wouldn't have taken this job. If I didn't take this job...",
    ["我只是想帮你们，雪莉在等你。"] = "I just want to help you; Shirley is waiting for you.",
    ["我只是想拥有一条自己的项链！！！"] = "I just want to have a necklace of my own!!!",
    ["我只是想来找一个人。"] = "I'm just here to find someone.",
    ["我只是想欣赏下不对称之美，这能有什么错呢？"] = "I just wanted to appreciate the beauty of asymmetry, what could be wrong with that?",
    ["我只是想知道真相"] = "I just want to know the truth",
    ["我只是想知道真相。"] = "I just wanted to know the truth.",
    ["我只是想给我的小阿诺德 唱完那首歌"] = "I just wanted to finish singing that song for my little Arnold.",
    ["我只是想让他好好看看现实，而不是整天盯着星星。"] = "I just want him to look at reality properly, instead of staring at the stars all day.",
    ["我只是想让你陪陪我。"] = "I just wanted you to keep me company.",
    ["我只是想送快递而已，我只是想帮助别人……"] = "I just want to deliver packages, I just want to help others...",
    ["我只是愚蠢地想要证明一次。"] = "I was just foolishly wanting to prove it once.",
    ["我只是感慨他们竟然能克制住赌场的诱惑。"] = "I'm just lamenting that they were actually able to resist the temptation of the casino.",
    ["我只是最近胸口有点闷，喘不过气来，其实完全不影响我工作！可主管说我迟早会给他惹麻烦……"] = "I just have a bit of tightness in my chest lately and can't catch my breath, but it doesn't affect my work at all! But the supervisor said I'll cause him trouble sooner or later...",
    ["我只是有时候很想念他们……真的很想念他们……"] = "I just miss them sometimes... I really miss them...",
    ["我只是有点想妈妈。"] = "I just miss Mom a little.",
    ["我只是留不住那笔横财。"] = "I just couldn't hold onto that windfall.",
    ["我只是看一眼。用我自己的钱……"] = "I'm just taking a look. With my own money...",
    ["我只是经过，刚刚你是怎么了？"] = "I was just passing by. What happened to you just now?",
    ["我只是翻译了你的菜单而已啊！"] = "I only translated your menu!",
    ["我只是路过"] = "I'm just passing by",
    ["我只是路过看到一阵白光闪过，因为好奇过来看看！"] = "I was just passing by and saw a flash of white light, so I came over out of curiosity!",
    ["我只是路过，再见"] = "I'm just passing by, goodbye",
    ["我只是路过，没打算吃东西。"] = "I'm just passing by, I don't intend to eat.",
    ["我只是随便一说，你还当真了。"] = "I was just saying that, you actually took it seriously.",
    ["我只知道家族遭到过一次沉重的打击，死了不少人。"] = "I only know that the family suffered a heavy blow once, and many people died.",
    ["我只知道，我在等待一个结果，一个<P_Yellow>必须完成的使命</>。"] = "I only know that I am waiting for a result, a <P_Yellow>mission that must be completed</>.",
    ["我只能从过去的故事里认识他们，也只能在梦里见到他们生动的样子，这真遗憾。"] = "I can only know them from past stories, and I can only see their vivid appearances in dreams. It's a real pity.",
    ["我只能出5便士……"] = "I can only offer 5 pennies...",
    ["我只能引导大家先逃去安全屋。"] = "I can only guide everyone to escape to the Safe House first.",
    ["我只能故意撞上马车……"] = "I had no choice but to intentionally crash into the carriage...",
    ["我只能暂时压制2-049，快封印它！"] = "I can only temporarily suppress 2-049, seal it quickly!",
    ["我只能涉血前进，向着地狱，去听那些魔鬼的话，从不相信所谓的“良心”。"] = "I can only wade through blood toward hell, listening to the words of demons, never believing in so-called 'conscience'.",
    ["我只能看出一点不协调，其他什么也发现不了。"] = "I can only see a little inconsistency, I can't discover anything else.",
    ["我只能给你非处方药，处方药需要我叔叔问诊后才能买哦。"] = "I can only give you over-the-counter medicine. Prescription medicine can only be bought after my uncle's consultation.",
    ["我只能认为这个人是被诅咒，或者被控制了，总之这不合常理。"] = "I can only think that this person is cursed or controlled. In short, this is unreasonable.",
    ["我只负责管理霍克斯男爵的身体状况，至于他的家庭关系和那些争执……夫人会比我更了解。"] = "I am only responsible for managing Baron Hawkes's physical condition. As for his family relationships and those disputes... the Madam would know better than me.",
    ["我叫<Hide id=\"#165\"> {{NickName}} </>"] = "My name is <Hide id=\"#165\"> {{NickName}} </>",
    ["我叫{{PlayerName}} 。你还有东西要买吗？我可以帮你提购物袋。"] = "My name is {{PlayerName}}. Do you have anything else to buy? I can help you carry your shopping bags.",
    ["我叫{{PlayerName}} ，克莱恩·莫雷蒂先生指引了我。"] = "My name is {{PlayerName}}, Mr. Klein Moretti guided me.",
    ["我叫{{PlayerName}}。"] = "My name is {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["我叫{{PlayerName}}，在黑荆棘安保公司工作。"] = "My name is {{PlayerName}}, and I work at the Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["我叫……克莱恩·莫雷蒂，生活在北大陆鲁恩王国廷根市，我真的穿越了……"] = "My name is... Klein Moretti, living in Tingen, Loen Kingdom, Northern Continent. I really have transmigrated...",
    ["我叫……我叫{{PlayerName}}。"] = "My name is... my name is {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["我叫丹尼斯。我很急！快帮我算算！<P_Heart>（把猫举高）</>我和玛丽安能不能结婚？"] = "My name is Dennis. I'm in a hurry! Quickly, help me calculate! <P_Heart> (Holds the cat up high) </> Can Mary Ann and I get married?",
    ["我叫乌莎，是大地教会的修士，因为一些原因被分配来这里负责后勤。"] = "My name is Usha, a monk of the Church of the Evernight, assigned here to be in charge of logistics for certain reasons.",
    ["我叫亚伦，从普利兹港来拜访泰利·里斯本的遗孀奥莉薇，告知她丈夫的死讯。"] = "My name is Aaron, I came from Pritz Harbor to visit Terry Lisbon's widow, Olivia, to inform her of her husband's death.",
    ["我叫伊迪丝，你要是先学成了，别忘了教我——"] = "My name is Edith, if you learn it first, don't forget to teach me—",
    ["我叫佛尔思 你也可以称呼我的代号——“魔术师”"] = "My name is Fors. You can also call me by my codename—'Magician'.",
    ["我叫佛尔思，你也可以称呼我的代号——“魔术师”。"] = "My name is Fors, you can also call me by my codename—\"Magician\".",
    ["我叫凯娜……<P_Yellow>凯娜·安提科</>。"] = "My name is Kena... <P_Yellow>Kena Antigonus</>.",
    ["我叫刻利，是烟草商维克罗尔先生的管家。"] = "My name is Keli, and I am the butler for the tobacco merchant, Mr. Vickor.",
    ["我叫吉尔达，是一名专门报道超自然现象的自由记者。"] = "My name is Gilda, and I am a freelance journalist specializing in reporting on supernatural phenomena.",
    ["我叫奥黛丽，你可以称呼我的代号——“正义”。"] = "My name is Audrey, you can call me by my codename—'Justice'.",
    ["我叫安东尼，行政大臣。我们是个严谨，独立的国家。"] = "My name is Anthony, the Minister of Administration. We are a rigorous, independent nation.",
    ["我叫安娜，在富人家做女仆。他是彼得，在印刷厂做工。"] = "My name is Anna, and I work as a maid for a wealthy family. He is Peter, and he works at a printing factory.",
    ["我叫康修娜，我想我叫康修娜，大家叫我康修娜。\n嗨，我是书店的店员，有什么我能帮你的吗？\n不对，我要离开！离开！我要喝有温度的汤！看能翻开的书！\n……康修娜。\n我叫康修娜，是书店的店员。\n康修娜。\n……你是谁？"] = "My name is Conshuna, I think my name is Conshuna, everyone calls me Conshuna. \n Hi, I'm the bookstore clerk, is there anything I can help you with? \n No, I want to leave! Leave! I want to drink warm soup! Read books that can be opened! \n ...Conshuna. \n My name is Conshuna, I'm the bookstore clerk. \n Conshuna. \n ...Who are you?",
    ["我叫康修娜，是书店的店员，我的工作是站在门口朝大家微笑。\n\n我的脸有点笑僵了，所以我决定写点东西。\n\n今天英森特还是那副懒样子，只会抱怨书店生意不好。\n\n唉，快点到吃午饭的时间吧……午饭？我吃过……午饭吗？"] = "My name is Conshuna, I'm the bookstore clerk, my job is to stand at the door and smile at everyone. \n \n My face is a bit stiff from smiling, so I decided to write something. \n \n Today Ensent is still that lazy self, only complaining that the bookstore business is bad. \n \n Sigh, let it be lunchtime soon... Lunch? Have I eaten... lunch?",
    ["我叫梅，你这样与众不同的小姐说不定先学会呢！到时候也别忘了教我！"] = "My name is May, a lady as unique as you might learn it first! Don't forget to teach me then!",
    ["我叫汤姆。该怎么称呼您呢，{{先生|女士}}？"] = "My name is Tom. How should I address you, {{Sir|Madam}}?",
    ["我叫爱丽丝给医生做件新衬衫！"] = "I'll have Alice make a new shirt for the doctor!",
    ["我叫玛莎。"] = "My name is Martha.",
    ["我叫福斯特，很高兴认识您。"] = "My name is Foster, nice to meet you.",
    ["我叫艾迪·瓦伦丁，去年毕业于贝克兰德商业学校会计夜班，结业排名第七，今年二十二岁，出身于贝克兰德。"] = "My name is Eddie Valentine. I graduated from the Backlund Business School night accounting class last year, ranked seventh in the class. I am twenty-two years old this year and was born in Backlund.",
    ["我叫芬恩，是……以前是蜡烛工坊的学徒。"] = "My name is Finn, and I am... I used to be an Apprentice at the candle workshop.",
    ["我叫苏茜，是“正义”小姐的助手。"] = "My name is Susie, I am Miss Justice's assistant.",
    ["我叫赛肯德。祝您拥有美好的一天！"] = "My name is Second. Have a wonderful day!",
    ["我可不关心那些。你看这里，有《睡莲仙女异闻录》连载。"] = "I don't care about those things. Look here, there's a serialization of 'The Water Lily Fairy Chronicles'.",
    ["我可不想输了这场赌局,所以稍稍改了一下时间......"] = "I don't want to lose this bet, so I changed the time a little bit...",
    ["我可不想输了这场赌局，所以我稍稍改了一下时间……"] = "I don't want to lose this bet, so I changed the time slightly...",
    ["我可不是去当游客，我要在那里立足，成为上等人。"] = "I'm not going there as a tourist. I want to establish myself there and become a member of the upper class.",
    ["我可不是猜的，这是占卜里的<P_Yellow>灵摆法</>，依靠本身星灵体与灵界、星空的联系，借助自然材质与灵性的沟通，来占卜事物的好坏。"] = "I didn't guess it, this is the <P_Yellow>pendulum method</> in divination, relying on the connection between one's own astral body and the spirit world and starry sky, and using the communication between natural materials and spirituality to divine the good or bad of things.",
    ["我可不真偷东西，\r\n玩两天都送回去……"] = "I don't actually steal things,\nI return them after playing with them for two days...",
    ["我可以"] = "I can",
    ["我可以仔细看看吗？"] = "May I take a closer look?",
    ["我可以作为代表，谁能给我一份今天的盒饭带去？"] = "I can act as a representative. Who can get me a lunch box for today to take with me?",
    ["我可以向你展示世界的真相……不需要任何代价。"] = "I can show you the truth of the world... without any cost.",
    ["我可以和你一起进入知识领域。"] = "I can enter the Domain of Knowledge with you.",
    ["我可以和您一起调查。"] = "I can investigate with you.",
    ["我可以帮你买戒指和花束，替你回绝笔友。"] = "I can help you buy the ring and the bouquet, and turn down your pen pal for you.",
    ["我可以帮你，是什么事情？"] = "I can help you. What is it?",
    ["我可以帮助你。"] = "I can help you.",
    ["我可以帮忙。"] = "I can help.",
    ["我可以帮您留意。需要我带个话吗？"] = "I can keep an eye out for you. Do you need me to pass on a message?",
    ["我可以感知到阿诺德现在的大致位置，我也不知道为什么，但可以隐约感觉到！"] = "I can sense Arnold's general location now. I don't know why, but I can vaguely feel it!",
    ["我可以把臭鸡蛋拿来抛吗？"] = "Can I use rotten eggs to juggle?",
    ["我可以把这个盒子带走吗？"] = "Can I take this box away?",
    ["我可以拒绝吗？如果失去腿的话，我们要怎么一起去买冰淇淋？"] = "Can I refuse? If I lose my legs, how are we going to go buy ice cream together?",
    ["我可以指引{{他|她}}"] = "I can guide {{him/her|}}",
    ["我可以替您去联系当地商会，这样，您之后在城堡产出的更多物产，就有合适的销售渠道了。"] = "I can contact the local Chamber of Commerce for you, so that more products produced in the castle later will have suitable sales channels.",
    ["我可以有幸知道你的名字吗？"] = "May I have the honor of knowing your name?",
    ["我可以的！我未来还想和爷爷您一样，去周日免费学校教大家学习呢。"] = "I can do it! In the future, I want to be like you, Grandpa, and go to the Sunday free school to teach everyone.",
    ["我可以看看你的作品吗？"] = "Can I see your work?",
    ["我可以看看吗？"] = "May I take a look?",
    ["我可以看看这些书吗？"] = "Can I look at these books?",
    ["我可以给你一个机会。你想要什么？"] = "I can give you a chance. What do you want?",
    ["我可以胜任很多工作，我本该是个好工人……"] = "I can handle many jobs. I should have been a good worker...",
    ["我可以证明，“门”没有启用过，帕里克一直在学派内。"] = "I can prove that the 'Door' was never activated; Parick has been within the school the whole time.",
    ["我可以试试看操控老鼠，从餐厅侧门潜入，在里面制造点混乱。等你们听到骚乱声，就可以开展行动。"] = "I can try to control the mice, sneak in through the side door of the restaurant, and create some chaos inside. Once you hear the commotion, you can take action.",
    ["我可以跟你们走，治安官先生，但请找到我的姐姐，这是你们的职责，不是吗？"] = "I can go with you, Mr. Constable, but please find my sister. That is your duty, isn't it?",
    ["我可怜的欧洛斯，她去午夜茶会后，就再没回过家了。"] = "My poor Oros, she never returned home after going to the Midnight Tea Party.",
    ["我可怜的黛西，不能再让你受到伤害了。"] = "My poor Daisy, I cannot let you be hurt anymore.",
    ["我可是很开心能看到你这么成熟靠谱的样子。"] = "I am very happy to see you looking so mature and reliable.",
    ["我可是拍到了！"] = "I got it on camera!",
    ["我可是有后台的，他们马上到！"] = "I have backing, you know; they'll be here soon!",
    ["我可是聪明的瓦莱莉。"] = "I am the clever Valerie, after all.",
    ["我可是资深的值夜者，以前也处理过很多非凡事件，只是现在老了。"] = "I am a veteran Nighthawk; I've handled many Beyonder incidents in the past, I'm just old now.",
    ["我可是这里的灌酒大师！老板次次都夸我能让客人多喝几杯 ，但是在他这里，我一点成就感都没有。"] = "I am the master of pouring drinks here! The boss always praises me for getting customers to drink a few more, but with him, I don't feel any sense of accomplishment at all.",
    ["我可没疯！全是血！血流从黑雾中流得满地都是！"] = "I'm not crazy! It's all blood! Blood flowed all over the ground from the black fog!",
    ["我可爱的N："] = "My lovely N:",
    ["我可管不了他了！吉瑞尔，你一会儿见到他，一定要好好说说他。"] = "I can't control him anymore! Jirel, you must have a good talk with him when you see him later.",
    ["我可能这辈子也见不到他啦，但他们总不能把小狗也关起来吧？"] = "I might never see him again in my life, but they can't lock up a puppy, right?",
    ["我吃了二十年，也不觉得腻！"] = "I've been eating them for twenty years and I never get tired of them!",
    ["我同意"] = "I agree",
    ["我向他们讨要食物。那些人说，食物是祂的恩赐。"] = "I asked them for food. Those people said that food is His gift.",
    ["我向偶遇的朋友们分享了几杯奥尔米尔葡萄酒，其中有几位路过的小信使醉得几乎要分不清前后左右了。"] = "I shared a few glasses of Oulmier wine with the friends I encountered by chance, and a few of the passing little messengers were so drunk they could barely tell front from back.",
    ["我向女神祈求安宁……祈求原谅……"] = "I pray to the Goddess for peace... for forgiveness...",
    ["我向女神起誓，我会逮捕凶手！"] = "I swear to the Goddess, I will arrest the murderer!",
    ["我向您祈求旅行的自由 我向您祈求穿梭的许可"] = "I pray to you for the freedom to travel, I pray to you for the permission to traverse.",
    ["我向您祈求旅行的自由，我向您祈求穿梭的许可。"] = "I pray to you for the freedom to travel, I pray to you for permission to traverse.",
    ["我向请教您关于如何正确地执行它们，并确保其有效性和……安全性？"] = "I would like to ask you how to perform them correctly and ensure their effectiveness and... safety?",
    ["我吗……咳，我不太会写。"] = "Me... cough, I'm not very good at writing.",
    ["我吗？乐意为您效劳，不过请你等我长大一些，至少要拿得动剪刀和熨斗。"] = "Me? I'd be happy to serve you, but please wait until I'm a bit older—at least until I can handle the scissors and the iron.",
    ["我吗？噢……我的故事并不好玩，我大概会在这里过无聊的一生。"] = "Me? Oh... my story isn't very interesting; I'll probably spend my boring life here.",
    ["我听亚特先生说，他今年打算把大部分葡萄都发酵成酒，还托我来问你需不需要……"] = "I heard from Mr. Art that he plans to ferment most of the grapes into wine this year, and he even asked me to ask you if you need...",
    ["我听从建议，每天都去教堂做弥撒，梦里为什么还是会出现麦穗？"] = "I followed the advice and go to church for mass every day, why do wheat ears still appear in my dreams?",
    ["我听伦纳德先生提到过，但还没有尝试。"] = "I've heard Mr. Leonard mention it, but I haven't tried it yet.",
    ["我听伦纳德先生说过，你在集体潜意识中稳定了所有人的状态。"] = "I heard from Mr. Leonard that you stabilized everyone's state in the collective subconscious.",
    ["我听到了……丰饶的呼唤！"] = "I heard... the call of abundance!",
    ["我听到了……笛子的声音，很诡异的调子，然后就……！！！"] = "I heard... the sound of a flute, a very eerie tune, and then...!!!",
    ["我听到了什么？亲爱的，请不要伤害它们！"] = "What did I hear? My dear, please don't hurt them!",
    ["我听到什么老女人？"] = "Did I hear something about an old woman?",
    ["我听到斯嘉丽说她根本不喜欢山姆，她只是想让梅兰妮甩掉那个讨厌的男人……"] = "I heard Scarlett say she doesn't like Sam at all, she just wanted Melanie to dump that annoying man...",
    ["我听到疯狂呓语的频率也增加了，风暴在上，我抓掉了好多头发。"] = "The frequency of me hearing crazy whispers has also increased. Storm above, I've pulled out so much hair.",
    ["我听到脚步声了，请别管我，让我睡吧……"] = "I heard footsteps, please don't mind me, let me sleep...",
    ["我听到脚步声了，请别管我，让我睡吧……我不会打扰到任何人。离灵界越近，就能捕捉到更多信息……包括已逝的梦境……"] = "I heard footsteps, please leave me alone, let me sleep... I won't bother anyone. The closer I am to the Spirit World, the more information I can capture... including the dreams of the departed...",
    ["我听完了"] = "I've finished listening",
    ["我听建议，每天都去教堂做弥撒，怎么还会梦见麦穗？"] = "I followed the advice and went to church for mass every day, so why do I still dream of wheat ears?",
    ["我听有些人说，两个国家最终协议休战，回到了以前的相处状态。"] = "I heard some people say that the two countries finally agreed to a truce and returned to their previous state of relations.",
    ["我听泰瑞说，你又欺负他了？他的钱包……"] = "I heard from Terry that you bullied him again? His wallet...",
    ["我听父亲提到过这一点，他也曾参加过赛艇俱乐部，他总说大学的灵魂在河边而非图书馆。"] = "I heard my father mention this. He also participated in the rowing club. He always said that the soul of the university is by the river, not in the library.",
    ["我听见了"] = "I heard it",
    ["我听见他们说的是鲁恩语！我拼命地招手！我以为能救下大家，一起回家……"] = "I heard them speaking Loen! I waved my hands desperately! I thought I could save everyone and go home together...",
    ["我听见你们在说，午餐凭空消失了？"] = "I heard you saying that lunch disappeared into thin air?",
    ["我听见它的呓语，让我打开它，证明文学、证明戏剧和感性的伟大。"] = "I heard its whispers, telling me to open it, to prove the greatness of literature, drama, and sensibility.",
    ["我听说……"] = "I heard...",
    ["我听说了，拜亚姆的天气就像天堂一样！"] = "I heard that the weather in Bayam is like heaven!",
    ["我听说了，策划的文案被偷了！"] = "I heard about it, the planning document was stolen!",
    ["我听说你甚至不肯加装工厂防护设备……"] = "You know, I haven't even been willing to install factory protection equipment...",
    ["我听说几年前，有一群特别的人来过？"] = "I heard that a few years ago, a group of special people came here?",
    ["我听说埋在地下的，是很多被诅咒的法宝。它们的力量要是释放出来，足以摧毁整个贝克兰德！"] = "I heard that many cursed magical artifacts are buried underground. If their power were released, it would be enough to destroy all of Backlund!",
    ["我听说您和休·迪尔查小姐是很好的朋友？"] = "I heard that you and Miss Xio Derecha are very good friends?",
    ["我听说的好像也是这个版本......"] = "That seems to be the version I heard as well...",
    ["我听说的好像也是这个版本……"] = "That seems to be the version I heard as well...",
    ["我听说的版本怎么跟你的不一样啊？"] = "Why is the version I heard different from yours?",
    ["我听说贝克兰德的马车以胡乱要价闻名。"] = "I heard that carriages in Backlund are famous for their arbitrary pricing.",
    ["我听说过，有些人被带走了，就再也没有回来。"] = "I've heard that some people who were taken away never came back.",
    ["我听说隔壁厂子引进了新设备，效率翻倍呢。"] = "I heard the factory next door introduced new equipment, and their efficiency doubled.",
    ["我听说，梅丽莎是个很特别的妹妹？"] = "I heard that Melissa is a very special sister?",
    ["我听说，运气爆棚的人能在这喷泉里获得非凡的奖励呢！"] = "I heard that people with explosive luck can get extraordinary rewards from this fountain!",
    ["我听闻霍华德伯爵，豢养了一只非凡的宠物。看来就是你了，序列8，欺诈师？"] = "I've heard that Earl Howard keeps a Beyonder pet. It seems it's you, a Sequence 8, Trickster?",
    ["我告诉他，这酒馆是咱们一砖一瓦垒起来的，是你亲手打的柜台，我亲手刷的墙。"] = "I told him this tavern was built brick by brick by us, you built the counter with your own hands, and I painted the walls myself.",
    ["我告诉你"] = "I'll tell you",
    ["我和……哥哥中午约定在这里吃饭。"] = "I have an appointment to have lunch here with my... brother at noon.",
    ["我和他是彼此唯一的挚友，我是把他和人世间维系在一起的纽带。"] = "He and I are each other's only true friends; I am the bond that keeps him tethered to the human world.",
    ["我和你一样，也不知道比迷雾海更西的地方是哪里，或许，还没有人知道。"] = "Like you, I don't know where the place further west than the Fog Sea is. Perhaps no one knows yet.",
    ["我和你一起去"] = "I'll go with you",
    ["我和你一起去，我也掌握一些信息，也许能帮到你。"] = "I'll go with you. I also possess some information that might be helpful to you.",
    ["我和你吻别，在无人的港……让风嘲笑我不能改写……"] = "I kiss you goodbye at the deserted port... let the wind mock me for being unable to rewrite...",
    ["我和你吻别，在晦暗的夜……我的心哭着迎接悲伤……"] = "I kiss you goodbye in the dim night... My heart cries as it welcomes the sadness...",
    ["我和你在一起，就是“最佳搭档”。"] = "Being with you makes us the \"Best Partners\".",
    ["我和几个学员从昨晚开始就在收拾东西，很快就能离开这诡异的地方了。\n昨晚，有两位研究员先生消失了，还有几个人因为害怕而跑出了营地，我认为这并不是理智的选择，因为野外的环境更加恶劣。\n我能看得出来曼斯教授也十分不安，但他是我们一行人的主心骨。他今天看起来是强撑着下达的指示，毕竟对于人类而言——未知是最古老最强烈的恐惧，就连曼斯教授也不例外。\n稍后，我们将消耗一部分带来的食物（这将减少我们行李的重量），然后我们就会启程。\n\n我决定一路记录下目前所见的一切，因为就在刚才，我看见一个活生生的人，从我眼前消失。我已经做好最坏的打算，或许这本日记将是我留在这个世界上的最后一抹痕迹。\n\n一旁的学员转过头对我说，曼斯教授也不见了，下一个会（日记戛然而止）"] = "A few students and I have been packing since last night, and we will soon be able to leave this eerie place. \n Last night, two researchers disappeared, and several others ran out of the camp out of fear. I don't think this is a rational choice, as the environment in the wild is even harsher. \n I can tell that Professor Mans is also very uneasy, but he is the backbone of our group. He seems to be forcing himself to give instructions today; after all, for humans—the unknown is the oldest and most intense fear, and Professor Mans is no exception. \n Later, we will consume some of the food we brought (which will reduce the weight of our luggage), and then we will set off. \n \n I have decided to record everything I see along the way, because just a moment ago, I saw a living person disappear right before my eyes. I have prepared for the worst; perhaps this diary will be the last trace I leave in this world. \n \n The student beside me turned to me and said that Professor Mans is also gone, and the next one will be (diary ends abruptly)",
    ["我和卡兰最近沉迷一种神圣的毒药……这种液体味道甜蜜，口感就像三千朵烟花在嘴里炸开，让人忍不住喝了又喝，喝了又喝，喝了又喝……"] = "Kalan and I have recently become addicted to a sacred poison... this liquid tastes sweet, and the texture is like three thousand fireworks exploding in the mouth, making one unable to stop drinking it, and drinking it, and drinking it...",
    ["我和同事们已经着手调查处置了，但线索还很少。"] = "My colleagues and I have already begun investigating and handling it, but there are still very few clues.",
    ["我和帕里克一起，捕获了梦境捕手的心脏。"] = "Parick and I captured the Dream Catcher's heart together.",
    ["我和我哥哥杰姆为雷克斯先生工作，就是清洗烟囱。"] = "My brother Jem and I work for Mr. Rex, cleaning chimneys.",
    ["我和我的同伴一直有这方面的争论，他是蒸汽的信徒，认为数字是一切的真理。"] = "My companion and I have always had arguments about this; he is a believer in Steam, believing that numbers are the truth of everything.",
    ["我和我的未婚夫曾经梦想着去开一家自己的珠宝店。你看，我做到了，我的店是不是很漂亮？"] = "My fiancé and I once dreamed of opening our own jewelry store. Look, I did it. Isn't my shop beautiful?",
    ["我和戴维，这条路不知走了多少遍。"] = "David and I have walked this path more times than I can count.",
    ["我和木马骑士呆在一起。这里很安静。"] = "I'm staying with the Wooden Horse Knight. It's very quiet here.",
    ["我和梅丽莎都不着急，但你正需要这些。"] = "Melissa and I are not in a hurry, but you really need these.",
    ["我和母亲一直相信，无论何时何地，只要仰望同一片夜空，我们就从未分离。"] = "My mother and I have always believed that no matter when or where, as long as we look up at the same night sky, we are never separated.",
    ["我和洛耀会先去调查工厂和他们的住所，辛苦你去<P_Yellow>拉姆德小镇</>寻回亚瑟。"] = "Luo Yao and I will go to investigate the factory and their residences first. I'll have to trouble you to go to <P_Yellow>Lamud Small Town</> to retrieve Arthur.",
    ["我和海因茨在为明天的比赛训练，我们同隔壁系的艺术团组织了一场投球友谊赛。"] = "Heinz and I are training for tomorrow's competition; we organized a friendly pitching match with the art troupe from the department next door.",
    ["我和爸爸妈妈哥哥同一天生日，每年生日聚会，我都在写作业，让他们在那里忙……"] = "My dad, mom, brother, and I all have the same birthday. Every year at the birthday party, I'm stuck doing homework while they're busy...",
    ["我和班森身材差不多，他可以穿我的燕尾服。梅丽莎，你应该买一套新衣服，如果不追求布料和最新的设计并不会太贵。"] = "Benson and I are about the same size, he can wear my tuxedo. Melissa, you should buy a new dress. If you don't look for expensive fabrics or the latest designs, it won't be too expensive.",
    ["我和瑞科的约会被破坏，难道是我们的错？！"] = "My date with Riko was ruined—is that our fault?!",
    ["我和贝尔纳黛女士有过几面之缘，她确实给我留下了很深的印象。您的日记里也记载了您和孩子们的事……"] = "I have met Bernadette a few times, and she indeed left a deep impression on me. Your diary also recorded things about you and your children...",
    ["我和那些大老板的关系很好，但那些说我们有私下交易的，全都是假新闻！"] = "I have a great relationship with those big bosses, but those who say we have private deals are all fake news!",
    ["我和里德尔是小有名气的艺术学派创作者，总有一天我们会变得大有名气！"] = "Riddle and I are somewhat well-known creators of the Art School, and one day we will become very famous!",
    ["我和阿兹克来参加一个会议，你找到了什么工作？"] = "Azik and I are here to attend a meeting. What kind of job did you find?",
    ["我和露西从小就是彼此最好的朋友。从我决定出海到现在，她已经等了我五年。"] = "Lucy and I have been each other's best friends since we were kids. From the moment I decided to set sail until now, she has waited for me for five years.",
    ["我哥哥，他天天就往这俱乐部跑！说能看清运势！"] = "My brother, he runs to this club every day! He says he can see his fortune!",
    ["我哥，哥哥。"] = "My bro, brother.",
    ["我哪会这个！饮料都是由东区那家罗森的民俗草药店供货。喏，店长正好来送货了，就是这位谢尔敏先生，伟大的药剂师！"] = "How would I know how to do that! The drinks are all supplied by that Lawson's folk herbal shop in the East District. Look, the shopkeeper just came to deliver the goods; this is Mr. Shermin, the great pharmacist!",
    ["我哪有那么多钱！再说了，老爸老妈身体健康，老妹懂事又会读书，每年这个时候还能一起吃饭，没有比这更好的礼物了。"] = "Where would I get that much money! Besides, Dad and Mom are healthy, and my little sister is sensible and good at her studies. Being able to eat together at this time every year—there's no better gift than that.",
    ["我哪有钱参与你们？我就看看。"] = "How could I have the money to join you guys? I'll just watch.",
    ["我唯一的遗憾……就是没有把世界……各处的……睡前故事……"] = "My only regret... is that I didn't bring the bedtime stories... from all over the world...",
    ["我喊她的名字，没人答应。我……我透过玻璃门往里看，我看见星星，星星爆炸，喷出好多血。"] = "I called her name, but no one answered. I... I looked inside through the glass door and saw stars—stars exploding and spraying out so much blood.",
    ["我喜欢你！请你成为我的恋人！"] = "I like you! Please be my lover!",
    ["我喜欢你！请你答应我吧！"] = "I like you! Please say yes!",
    ["我喜欢能和我认真辩论历史观点的人。"] = "I like people who can seriously debate historical viewpoints with me.",
    ["我喜欢自己行动……就算赢了，他们也会怀疑我作弊。"] = "I like to act on my own... even if I win, they will suspect I cheated.",
    ["我喜欢诚实面对自己欲望的人。"] = "I like people who are honest about their desires.",
    ["我喜欢这个广场的氛围，也喜欢女神的教堂，选择在这里当一名画家而已。"] = "I like the atmosphere of this square, and I like the Goddess's church; I just chose to be a painter here.",
    ["我喜欢酸梅糖，酸得眼泪都要流出来……但是吃完之后，嘴里会甜甜的，像先苦后甜的人生！"] = "I like sour plum candy; it's so sour that it makes my eyes water... but after eating it, my mouth feels sweet, just like a life that is bitter first and sweet later!",
    ["我喜欢阳光，温暖，让人感到内心平静。"] = "I like the sunlight, it's warm and makes one feel at peace inside.",
    ["我喜欢阴冷和靠近尸体的感觉，总是徘徊于墓园、在坟墓前睡觉。那时候，他们畏惧我、厌恶我……"] = "I liked the cold and the feeling of being close to corpses, always wandering in cemeteries and sleeping in front of graves. Back then, they feared me, they were disgusted by me...",
    ["我回去就没命了！"] = "I'll be dead if I go back!",
    ["我回家了"] = "I'm home",
    ["我回家了，班森和梅丽莎还在等我。"] = "I'm heading home. Benson and Melissa are still waiting for me.",
    ["我回来了"] = "I'm Back",
    ["我回来了……"] = "I'm back...",
    ["我回来了。"] = "I'm back.",
    ["我回来了称号怎么得"] = "How to get the 'I'm Back' title",
    ["我回来啦！"] = "I'm back!",
    ["我因思念过度导致塔索克河逆流。\n如果今夜无法吻你甜美的嘴唇。\n我的灵魂，我的爱，将消失在月色中！"] = "My longing has caused the Tussock River to flow backward.\nIf I cannot kiss your sweet lips tonight,\nMy soul, my love, will vanish into the moonlight!",
    ["我在%s%s<Chat_Highlight>%s</>中，大家快来一起玩吧！%s"] = "I am in %s%s<Chat_Highlight>%s</>, everyone come and play together! %s",
    ["我在。"] = "I am here.",
    ["我在下水道击败了垃圾之主，见证了爱国卫生运动，取得了珍贵的黄金马桶！"] = "I defeated the Lord of Trash in the sewers, witnessed the Patriotic Health Campaign, and obtained the precious golden toilet!",
    ["我在乎。"] = "I care.",
    ["我在五月庄园时，见过管家对铜镜念出咒语后消失——以时代的洪流，叩开镜中的国度。"] = "When I was at May Manor, I saw the butler disappear after chanting an incantation to the mirror—\"With the torrent of the era, knock open the kingdom in the mirror.\"",
    ["我在他身上留了追踪坐标，利用封印物【旅行指南】可以快速传送到附近。"] = "I left a tracking coordinate on him; we can use the mystical item [Travel Guide] to teleport nearby quickly.",
    ["我在你的意识岛屿上，种下了一颗名为“传染性疯狂”的种子。"] = "I have planted a seed called 'Infectious Madness' on your Island of Consciousness.",
    ["我在倾听你的心声。"] = "I am listening to your heart.",
    ["我在光明中起舞，我是你的烛火。"] = "I dance in the light; I am your candle flame.",
    ["我在听。"] = "I am listening.",
    ["我在和比利玩捉迷藏呢！他肯定想不到，我能在他数一百下的时间里跑这么远。"] = "I'm playing hide-and-seek with Billy! He definitely wouldn't guess that I could run this far in the time it takes him to count to one hundred.",
    ["我在循环空间中，只是旁观者，能看到雏菊开得很好，但却没有嗅觉。"] = "In the loop space, I was just an observer. I could see the daisies blooming beautifully, but I had no sense of smell.",
    ["我在恶龙酒馆的通道入口等你，我会给你报酬，以及免费演出。相信我，你一定会想听。"] = "I'll wait for you at the entrance of the passage in the Bravehearts Bar. I will give you a reward, as well as a free performance. Believe me, you will definitely want to hear it.",
    ["我在想……西奥多抓老鼠干什么？"] = "I'm wondering... what is Theodore catching mice for?",
    ["我在想，下次是不是可以试试加点水果风味……菠萝烤鱼怎么样？"] = "I'm thinking, maybe I should try adding some fruit flavor next time... how about pineapple roasted fish?",
    ["我在想，是否要写信给我的好朋友。"] = "I'm thinking about whether to write a letter to my good friend.",
    ["我在找光！"] = "I'm looking for light!",
    ["我在找格兰杰，我的爱人。她今天要被求婚了，我想去阻止这一切的发生……"] = "I'm looking for Granger, my lover. She is going to be proposed to today, and I want to stop all of this from happening...",
    ["我在找猫"] = "I'm looking for a cat",
    ["我在拉斐尔墓园看到他的墓碑了，上边有他的照片。1327年3月-1349年9月，最好的哥哥；最好的弟弟；最好的同事。"] = "I saw his tombstone at Raphael Cemetery with his photo on it. March 1327 - September 1349, the best brother; the best younger brother; the best colleague.",
    ["我在捉迷藏呢！霍金斯教士最讨厌我们在教堂玩闹，所以这里既是最危险的地方， 也是最安全的地方。"] = "I'm playing hide-and-seek! Father Hawkins hates us playing in the church, so this is the most dangerous place, and also the safest place.",
    ["我在改造这只怀表！听说下个月贝克兰德又有比赛……"] = "I'm modifying this pocket watch! I heard there's another competition in Backlund next month...",
    ["我在旁边都听到了！"] = "I heard it from the side!",
    ["我在梦里见过这座古堡。"] = "I have seen this castle in my dreams.",
    ["我在梦里见过这座古堡。 "] = "I have seen this ancient castle in my dreams.",
    ["我在棕熊的对手身上下了注，需要一些，简单的保障。"] = "I placed a bet on the Brown Bear's opponent, and I need some, simple guarantees.",
    ["我在模仿爸爸。"] = "I'm imitating Dad.",
    ["我在河岸街卖了10年鱼了，大家都认识我。"] = "I've been selling fish on Riverside Street for 10 years; everyone knows me.",
    ["我在海上执行任务时，偶然间遇到一些奇怪的现象……然后就被拉入了那片灰雾之上。"] = "When I was performing a mission at sea, I accidentally encountered some strange phenomena... and then I was pulled above that gray fog.",
    ["我在海上混了二十年，就没见过哪条船敢这么吹牛。要我说，可别首航就沉了！"] = "I've been at sea for twenty years, and I've never seen a ship brag like that. If you ask me, I hope it doesn't sink on its maiden voyage!",
    ["我在画莱茵的猫，她是对面花店的主人，她和她的猫一样可爱，对吗？"] = "I'm painting Rhine's cat, she is the owner of the flower shop across the street, she is as cute as her cat, right?",
    ["我在神弃之地游荡千年，寄生过很多像你们这样的人。"] = "I have wandered the Forsaken Land of the Gods for a thousand years, parasitizing many people like you.",
    ["我在等人，倒是你，不像是这家的人，你来做什么？"] = "I'm waiting for someone. As for you, you don't look like you're from this household. What are you doing here?",
    ["我在等她给我唱完那首摇篮曲，那首歌真的太好听了，可惜她唱到一半又跑走了。"] = "I am waiting for her to finish singing that lullaby for me. That song is really beautiful, but it's a pity she ran away halfway through.",
    ["我在等待“慷慨号”，驶向拜亚姆的船只！"] = "I'm waiting for the 'Generosity', the ship bound for Bayam!",
    ["我在等，戴里克导师，感到疲惫的瞬间。"] = "I am waiting, Mentor Derrick, for the moment you feel exhausted.",
    ["我在红月下厮杀，我是你的影子。"] = "I fight under the red moon, I am your shadow.",
    ["我在维纳的碗里放了它最爱吃的肉骨头……"] = "I put its favorite meat bone in Vina's bowl...",
    ["我在艺术学派参与过好多次演出，肯定跳得比他们都好。"] = "I have participated in many performances at the Art School, and I am sure I dance better than all of them.",
    ["我在调查“五月庄园”的过程中，发现庄园的主人子爵夫人有问题。追踪夫人和她的管家，来到了这里。"] = "In the process of investigating \"May Manor\", I found that the owner of the manor, the Viscountess, had problems. I tracked the Viscountess and her butler and came here.",
    ["我在调查一起奇怪的工厂事件过程中见到他了。"] = "I met him while I was investigating a strange incident at a factory.",
    ["我在贝克兰德、廷根都认识不少这样的绅士、夫人……"] = "I know quite a few such gentlemen and ladies in Backlund and Tingen...",
    ["我在贝克兰德待了那么久，从来没见过出了案子警察迟迟不来维持秩序的情况！"] = "I've stayed in Backlund for so long, and I've never seen a situation where the police didn't come to maintain order after a case occurred!",
    ["我在贝克兰德醒来时，随身携带了一个铜哨。"] = "When I woke up in Backlund, I had a copper whistle with me.",
    ["我在贝克兰德长大。那场袭击中，我失去了所有的家人。小队是我的第二个家，现在他们也离去了……"] = "I grew up in Backlund. In that attack, I lost all my family. The squad was my second home, and now they have left too...",
    ["我在这荒郊野外花了二十年，找到些破铜烂铁又有什么意义呢。"] = "I've spent twenty years in this wilderness; what's the point of finding some scrap metal?",
    ["我在这里生活了这么久，却一点也不厌倦。"] = "I have lived here for so long, yet I never grow tired of it.",
    ["我在这里等他。"] = "I'll wait for him here.",
    ["我在这里等妈妈来找我就好了，她应该正在路上呢。"] = "I'll just wait here for Mom to find me; she should be on her way.",
    ["我在这里长大，从没见过这种事，也不相信。"] = "I grew up here, I've never seen such a thing, and I don't believe it.",
    ["我在这里长大，留下很多记忆。"] = "I grew up here, and left many memories.",
    ["我在这里！快来抓我啊！"] = "I'm here! Come and catch me!",
    ["我在那里上大学，在那里成为值夜者，在那里……经历了很多。"] = "I went to university there, became a Nighthawk there, and there... I experienced a lot.",
    ["我在附近已经扫了很久了！都是我一个人。"] = "I've been sweeping around here for a long time! I'm always alone.",
    ["我在附近找到了这个油漆桶。"] = "I found this paint bucket nearby.",
    ["我在附近散步的时候，有时也能听见其他信众的唱诵，有一些唱得相当好呢！"] = "When I'm walking nearby, I can sometimes hear the chanting of other believers, and some of them sing quite well!",
    ["我在雾中听见了女神的颂歌，而我曾看到唱诗班们在教堂附近练习这首歌。"] = "I heard the Goddess's hymn in the fog, and I had seen the choir practicing this song near the church.",
    ["我在静待某位钢琴家的到来。"] = "I am waiting for a certain pianist to arrive.",
    ["我在飞？！"] = "Am I flying?!",
    ["我在骑士们剑尖所指的方向都埋了宝藏，也许它们到现在都没被发现。"] = "I buried treasures in the direction the knights' swords were pointing. Perhaps they haven't been found to this day.",
    ["我坐了三小时的马车，可不是为了看这些野花。"] = "I sat in a carriage for three hours, not to look at these wildflowers.",
    ["我堵错门了吗……他、他怎么了？"] = "Did I go to the wrong door... What, what happened to him?",
    ["我多希望能亲眼见证她获得幸福，遇见一个陪伴她的人，一个值得共度一生的伴侣。"] = "I wish so much to witness her happiness with my own eyes, to see her meet someone who will accompany her—a partner worth spending a lifetime with.",
    ["我多希望能亲眼见证她获得幸福，遇见一个陪伴她的人，一个值得共度一生的伴侣，最重要的是，和他在一起，能让罗珊期待新一天的到来。"] = "I hope so much to witness her finding happiness with my own eyes, meeting someone who accompanies her, a partner worth spending a lifetime with, and most importantly, being with him can make Rozanne look forward to the arrival of a new day.",
    ["我多想买下最昂贵的戒指，最鲜艳的花朵赴约……可这太不负责任了，我必须让她忘了我！"] = "I want so much to buy the most expensive ring and the brightest flowers for the date... but that would be too irresponsible. I must make her forget me!",
    ["我多用蜡纸包几层，保证一点味都透不出去，总行了吧？ "] = "I'll wrap it in a few more layers of wax paper, I guarantee not a bit of smell will leak out, that's fine, right?",
    ["我大概明白了，第一步……先按照指示调配魔药吧。"] = "I think I understand. First step... let's concoct the potion according to the instructions.",
    ["我太思念我的爱人布拉德利了，如果他能立刻出现在我面前就好了…"] = "I miss my lover Bradley so much, if only he could appear in front of me right now...",
    ["我太想去探索下一个地方了！"] = "I really want to go and explore the next place!",
    ["我太着急，把铲子掉在里面了，剩下的煤灰也没来得及铲出来……对不起……"] = "I was in such a hurry that I dropped my shovel inside, and I didn't have time to shovel out the rest of the soot... I'm sorry...",
    ["我夺取珍贵马桶"] = "I seize the precious toilet",
    ["我女儿。她嫁到南方去了，我说要写信告诉她一件事。信写好了，没寄出去她就没了。"] = "My daughter. She married and moved to the south. I said I would write to tell her something. The letter was written, but she passed away before I could send it.",
    ["我女儿在学校里听来的，她说同学家的女佣亲眼见过。"] = "My daughter heard it at school. She said the maid at her classmate's house saw it with her own eyes.",
    ["我女儿她……该不会也……"] = "My daughter... could she also be...",
    ["我女儿整天格尔曼长格尔曼短的，我就想做点他做过的事，跟她搭上话。"] = "My daughter talks about Gehrman all day, I just wanted to do some things he did to strike up a conversation with her.",
    ["我女儿的下午茶会，如果衣服的品味不够上流，她会被那些贵族小姐嘲笑的！"] = "For my daughter's afternoon tea party, if the taste of her clothes isn't high-class enough, she'll be mocked by those noble ladies!",
    ["我女儿赛琳娜，一位美丽的淑女，我的小甜心，最近闹着要去贝克兰德旅行，一点也不顾我这个老父亲的心情。"] = "My daughter Selena, a beautiful lady, my little sweetheart, has recently been making a fuss about traveling to Backlund, not caring about the feelings of this old father at all.",
    ["我女儿，十四了。以前什么都跟我说，现在我说什么她都嫌烦。"] = "My daughter, she's fourteen. She used to tell me everything, but now she finds everything I say annoying.",
    ["我女朋友觉得我做饭很好吃，就建议我开一家餐厅，做些日常菜色。"] = "My girlfriend thought my cooking was delicious, so she suggested I open a restaurant and make some everyday dishes.",
    ["我好不容易给他们留下了见面的空档，可是这孩子听见声音就忽地不见了。到现在，我也不知道那男孩长什么样。"] = "I finally managed to leave them a window of time to meet, but the moment the boy heard a sound, he suddenly vanished. To this day, I still don't know what that boy looks like.",
    ["我好像……也没那么怕把自己写的诗拿给别人看了。下次，我想把我新写的那首诗也一起送给伦纳德先生！"] = "I seem to... not be so afraid of showing the poems I wrote to others anymore. Next time, I want to give the poem I just wrote to Mr. Leonard too!",
    ["我好像……忘了很多事。我记得要一块地……给战友们……但我忘了他们的名字……"] = "I seem to have... forgotten many things. I remember wanting a piece of land... for my comrades... but I forgot their names...",
    ["我好像……忘记了。"] = "I seem to have... forgotten.",
    ["我好像做了一个很长很长的梦……"] = "I feel like I had a very, very long dream...",
    ["我好像做了个很长的梦…… "] = "I feel like I had a very long dream...",
    ["我好像听懂了……"] = "I think I understood...",
    ["我好像忘记了什么事情……终究是上了年纪了。"] = "I seem to have forgotten something... I suppose I'm getting old.",
    ["我好像感觉不到我的双手了……救救我！"] = "I don't seem to be able to feel my hands... save me!",
    ["我好像来过这里……"] = "I feel like I've been here before...",
    ["我好像没看见啊？"] = "I don't seem to see anyone?",
    ["我好像看见了很多肝。"] = "I seem to see a lot of livers.",
    ["我好像知道是谁制造了这个梦境了……"] = "I think I know who created this dream...",
    ["我好像穿越了？"] = "Did I transmigrate?",
    ["我好像迷路了……这里的积雪比我来时要厚得多，干净得多。"] = "I think I'm lost... The snow here is much thicker and cleaner than when I first arrived.",
    ["我好精神挺状态的呀。"] = "My mental state is quite good.",
    ["我妈妈说过，只要心诚，风暴之主就会听见，所以，为了治好妈妈的咳嗽病，我每天都对着喷泉祈祷！"] = "My mother said that as long as your heart is sincere, the Lord of Storms will hear you. So, to cure my mother's cough, I pray to the fountain every day!",
    ["我妻子才刚怀孕，恐怕还是稳妥行事比较好。"] = "My wife is just pregnant, I'm afraid it's better to play it safe.",
    ["我妻子还在家等我，没时间陪你耗下去了啊。"] = "My wife is still waiting for me at home, I don't have time to waste with you anymore.",
    ["我始终相信，医生称量的是心跳，不是钱袋里的纸币。但有些人不明白，我也不愿与他们同流合污。"] = "I have always believed that a doctor weighs heartbeats, not the banknotes in a purse. But some people don't understand that, and I am unwilling to wallow in the mire with them.",
    ["我姐姐卖完花就会回来做饭！要先喝点甜冰茶吗？"] = "My sister will come back to cook after selling flowers! Would you like some sweet iced tea first?",
    ["我姐姐是拳击手！这下信了吧！"] = "My sister is a boxer! Believe me now!",
    ["我学到了很多……关于罗塞尔大帝的“知识”。"] = "I learned a lot... about the \"knowledge\" of Emperor Roselle.",
    ["我宁愿去刷马桶，也不想去他那儿。"] = "I'd rather go scrub toilets than go to him.",
    ["我完了！我完了！"] = "I'm done for! I'm done for!",
    ["我完了，又睡过了……"] = "I'm done for, I overslept again...",
    ["我完全不记得过去了，这曾让我不知道自己是谁。"] = "I don't remember the past at all, which once made me not know who I was.",
    ["我完全相信“愚者”先生的公正与强大，我会去寻找鬼鲨的血的。"] = "I fully trust Mr. Fool's fairness and power. I will go look for the Ghost Shark blood.",
    ["我实在不知道，该怎么让孩子听进《愚者圣典》。我真不是一位合格的牧师！"] = "I really don't know how to make children listen to the 'Sacred Scripture of the Fool'. I am truly not a qualified pastor!",
    ["我实在害怕，您愿意帮帮忙吗？"] = "I'm really scared, would you be willing to help?",
    ["我实在是应付不了这么多人的大场面啊，我宁愿多做几台手术！我现在连演讲大纲都还没头绪。 "] = "I really can't handle such a big crowd. I'd rather perform a few more surgeries! I don't even have a clue for the lecture outline yet.",
    ["我实在是看不懂现在的物价了，为什么现在的钱越来越难赚，却越来越不值钱。"] = "I really can't understand the current prices. Why is money getting harder and harder to earn, yet worth less and less?",
    ["我实在舍不得伊莎贝尔错过在贵校就读的大好机会。"] = "I really cannot bear for Isabelle to miss the great opportunity to study at your school.",
    ["我实在舍不得伊莎贝尔错过贵校的大好机会。"] = "I really can't bear to let Isabelle miss out on such a great opportunity at your school.",
    ["我宣告——你的命运，在此终结！"] = "I declare—your fate ends here!",
    ["我宣布——将黑伍德庄园东侧土地，无偿赠予我的管家阿尔伯特先生。"] = "I hereby announce—the land on the east side of Heywood Manor is to be gifted unconditionally to my butler, Mr. Albert.",
    ["我宣布个事"] = "I have an announcement to make",
    ["我家三代人都是宫廷乐师，爷爷是首席，父亲给皇后演出过，到了我这代……"] = "Three generations of my family have been court musicians; my grandfather was the concertmaster, and my father performed for the Queen. By my generation...",
    ["我家世代都是钟表匠，镇上谁的钟表坏了都找我。"] = "My family has been watchmakers for generations. Everyone in town comes to me when their clocks break.",
    ["我家主人说，30镑是诚实者应得的报酬。"] = "My master says that 30 pounds is the reward an honest person deserves.",
    ["我家小姐最近喜欢上了一个男孩，可是这两个孩子总是躲着我们所有人。"] = "My young mistress has recently taken a liking to a boy, but these two children are always hiding from all of us.",
    ["我家的瓜与别家不同。它能让你心想事成、所梦成真——你买了就知道了。"] = "My pumpkins are different from others. They can make your wishes come true and your dreams a reality—you'll know once you buy one.",
    ["我家老约翰虽然胖，但跑起来可快了！上次偷吃燕麦，追都追不上！"] = "My old John might be fat, but he's fast when he runs! Last time he stole some oats, I couldn't even catch him!",
    ["我家里的老人从城堡里淘出过真货……带暗纹的银餐具，金子做的怀表，这都是祖传的宝贝！"] = "The old folks in my family once dug up real treasures from the castle... silver tableware with dark patterns, gold pocket watches—these are all ancestral heirlooms!",
    ["我家雪球可不是一般兔子！"] = "My Snowball is no ordinary rabbit!",
    ["我对不起他，也害怕未来……在这廷根，一个学文学的，出路究竟在哪？ "] = "I let him down, and I'm afraid of the future... In this Tingen, for someone studying literature, where is the way out?",
    ["我对你印象很深刻。你有种特别的气质。"] = "I have a deep impression of you. You have a special temperament.",
    ["我对你没什么印象"] = "I don't have much of an impression of you",
    ["我对凡人的鲜血和灵魂没有兴趣。不过——"] = "I have no interest in the blood and souls of mortals. However—",
    ["我对庄园很熟悉，可以带你前往想去的地方……"] = "I am very familiar with the manor and can take you to wherever you want to go...",
    ["我对心理学确实有些了解……"] = "I do know a bit about psychology...",
    ["我对新党那些激进的工厂改革提议感到担忧。"] = "I am worried about the radical factory reform proposals from the New Party.",
    ["我对最近失踪的人进行通灵，都没有成功。我怀疑，近期失踪的人都还活着。"] = "I tried to perform Spirit Mediumship on the people who went missing recently, but none of them succeeded. I suspect that the people who went missing recently are still alive.",
    ["我对未来的一切都充满希望，相信很快我们就能在贝克兰德见面。"] = "I am full of hope for everything in the future, and I believe we will be able to meet in Backlund soon.",
    ["我对死掉的那天没什么印象了，一切都还顺利吗？"] = "I don't have any impression of the day I died. Did everything go smoothly?",
    ["我对自己的记忆力还算有信心，记住谜题的答案应该不难。"] = "I have some confidence in my memory; it shouldn't be difficult to remember the answers to the puzzles.",
    ["我对这个故事感到十分的困惑，可是她讲完后再也没有出现……我去过贝克兰德，她们说在埃德萨克的宴会曾见过类似的人，但王子早已经死了。"] = "I am very confused about this story, but she never appeared again after she finished telling it... I have been to Backlund, and they said they had seen someone similar at Eder's banquet, but the prince had already died long ago.",
    ["我对这件事很感兴趣，你可以收集情报和我交换！"] = "I am very interested in this matter; you can collect information and trade it with me!",
    ["我对这则预言并不感兴趣。再见了，朋友。"] = "I am not interested in this prophecy. Goodbye, friend.",
    ["我对那远低于印刷成本的价格感到好奇。"] = "I am curious about that price, which is far lower than the cost of printing.",
    ["我对韦尔奇他们的事感到悲痛和遗憾……"] = "I feel sorrow and regret for what happened to Welch and the others...",
    ["我将一次又一次地死去，以知道生命的无穷无尽。"] = "I will die again and again to know the endlessness of life.",
    ["我将一生忠于你、尊敬你、陪伴你"] = "I will be loyal to you, respect you, and accompany you for a lifetime.",
    ["我将一直注视着你……"] = "I will always be watching you...",
    ["我将为你赐予祝福、驱除邪灵、降下奇迹，相应的，你要付出一定的报偿。"] = "I will bestow blessings, drive away evil spirits, and bring down miracles for you. In return, you must pay a certain reward.",
    ["我将为您奉上独特的变奏，您永远不知道下一个音符是什么。 "] = "I will offer you a unique variation; you will never know what the next note will be.",
    ["我将以献祭的方式将这封信寄给你。"] = "I will send this letter to you by way of sacrifice.",
    ["我将会很期待你的到来，{{PlayerName}}。"] = "I will look forward to your arrival, {{PlayerName}}.",
    ["我将拥有一切"] = "I will possess everything.",
    ["我将永恒等待，等待青春逝去，肉体腐朽，等待与你重逢的春天。"] = "I will wait eternally, waiting for youth to pass, for the flesh to decay, waiting for the spring when I reunite with you.",
    ["我将祈祷"] = "I Shall Pray",
    ["我将进入这片历史的权限赐予你，请帮助我，用他们的眼睛去见证他们的故事。"] = "I grant you the authority to enter this piece of history. Please help me witness their story through their own eyes.",
    ["我少管？晚上回家喊疼的时候是谁照顾您！为了给您热敷膝盖，烧水壶都快罢工了！"] = "I mind my own? Who takes care of you when you cry in pain at night? To give you a hot compress for your knees, the kettle is almost on strike!",
    ["我尝试了很多种方法都没有考到第一名。"] = "I've tried many methods but haven't been able to get first place.",
    ["我就不一样，每当我想让自己冷静的时候，我就会给自己讲个笑话。"] = "I'm different. Whenever I want to calm myself down, I tell myself a joke.",
    ["我就不了 我要先送新人去入职 队长还等着呢"] = "I'll pass, I need to take the newcomer to get onboarded first, the Captain is still waiting.",
    ["我就不了，我要先送新人去入职，队长还等着呢。"] = "I'll pass, I need to take the newcomer to report for duty first, the Captain is still waiting.",
    ["我就不该送她那面镜子……呜呜……都是我的错。"] = "I shouldn't have given her that mirror... sob... it's all my fault.",
    ["我就是一个小偷，我永远都不可能成为一个真正的拳击手……"] = "I'm just a thief, I could never become a real boxer...",
    ["我就是个人渣……呜呕……"] = "I'm just a piece of trash... *hic*...",
    ["我就是个送货的，能有什么坏心思？"] = "I'm just a delivery person, what bad intentions could I have?",
    ["我就是你的未婚妻！"] = "I am your fiancée!",
    ["我就是想要一串自己的项链，有什么错！！！"] = "I just want a necklace of my own. What's wrong with that!!!",
    ["我就是想让他知道……不是什么锁都应该被打开的。"] = "I just want him to know... that not every lock should be opened.",
    ["我就是来告诉您这些的。等下次我会给您带一束向日葵。"] = "I just came to tell you this. Next time, I'll bring you a bouquet of sunflowers.",
    ["我就是来工作的。你知道的，我们值夜……咳咳，不，安保公司，平时值班都是点老维尔餐厅的外送。"] = "I am here for work. You know, our Nighthawks... ahem, no, security company, usually orders delivery from Old Will's restaurant for our shifts.",
    ["我就是看看——克洛，救命啊！！"] = "I'm just looking - Crow, help me!!",
    ["我就是蒙特利。我正要回剧院，一起过去吧。"] = "I am Monterey. I was just about to head back to the theater; let's go together.",
    ["我就是要加入“家庭仆人协会”！我就要工作！"] = "I just want to join the 'Domestic Servant Association'! I just want to work!",
    ["我就是试试大小，试试大小……哎呀卡住了！"] = "I'm just testing the size, testing the size... Oops, it's stuck!",
    ["我就是这个意思"] = "That's exactly what I meant",
    ["我就是黑夜中的魅影——侠盗黑皇帝！"] = "I am the phantom in the dark—the Phantom Thief Black Emperor!",
    ["我就看上这个南瓜！又大又黄，肯定好吃！"] = "I've got my eye on this pumpkin! It's big and yellow, it must be delicious!",
    ["我就看看……妈妈昨晚又咳嗽了，说、说她想喝肉汤……"] = "I'm just looking... Mom coughed again last night and said, said she wanted to drink meat soup...",
    ["我就看看。"] = "I'm just looking.",
    ["我就知道。尼克老头，你有纽扣吗？"] = "I knew it. Old Nick, do you have any buttons?",
    ["我就知道你会理解我的！要不要去看看我最新培育的蘑菇？它能模仿人的声音说话！虽然目前只会说“救命”……"] = "I knew you would understand me! Do you want to see the mushroom I just cultivated? It can imitate human voices! Although it can only say \"help\" for now...",
    ["我就知道你能扒出这张纸，这里不安全了，有东西在盯我。\n工厂见！小心行事。"] = "I knew you would be able to dig out this paper. It's not safe here anymore; something is watching me.\nSee you at the factory! Be careful.",
    ["我就知道，{{先生|女士}}您看起来就是那种很注重健康的人，自然会介意那些用工业废水浇灌的蔬菜。"] = "I knew it, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you look like the type of person who cares about their health, so naturally, you would mind vegetables watered with industrial wastewater.",
    ["我就知道，阿尔伯特这小子迟早会变得和他父亲一样惹人嫌弃。一棵烂了的苹果树，结不出好果子！"] = "I knew it, that brat Albert would sooner or later become as annoying as his father. A rotten apple tree cannot bear good fruit!",
    ["我就能早日坐上私人马车，也能尽情环游世界了。"] = "Then I could afford a private carriage sooner and travel the world to my heart's content.",
    ["我就能触及更高的权柄……"] = "I can reach a higher authority...",
    ["我就要成为明星了！"] = "I'm going to be a star!",
    ["我就说别来这种乡下地方待一周！太无聊了！"] = "I told you not to come to this countryside place for a week! Too boring!",
    ["我就说说。只吃得起免费餐的人，有一双能走的腿就够了！"] = "I'm just saying. For someone who can only afford free meals, a pair of legs that can walk is enough!",
    ["我就说！怎么样？你是猪你是猪你是鲁恩小花猪——"] = "I told you! How about it? You're a pig, you're a pig, you're a little Loenese piglet—",
    ["我就那样吃了一整天。那天后我不再想要醋栗，不再想要任何东西。"] = "I ate like that for an entire day. After that day, I no longer wanted gooseberries, nor did I want anything else.",
    ["我就顺手腌了两条。反正我也吃不完，喂猫可惜了。 "] = "So I just pickled two. Anyway, I can't finish them, it'd be a waste to feed them to the cat.",
    ["我尽量避开了怪物……不、他们其实是失踪的市民……但怪物越来越多……"] = "I tried my best to avoid the monsters... No, they are actually missing citizens... but there are more and more monsters...",
    ["我工作后，家里的经济情况也会变好，可以考虑搬家的事情了。"] = "After I start working, the family's financial situation will improve, and I can consider moving.",
    ["我差点以为又要失去一位队长了……"] = "I almost thought I was going to lose another captain...",
    ["我差点忘记了一件很重要的事情。"] = "I almost forgot something very important.",
    ["我已\r\n化为\r\n黑影......！"] = "I have\nturned into\na shadow...!",
    ["我已上场"] = "I have deployed",
    ["我已发出求援信息，正在召集非凡者，大家可以看看攻略，<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Recruit\" u=\"rescueJump=%s\">点击查看攻略与奖励</>"] = "I have sent a distress signal and am gathering Beyonders. Everyone can check the guide; <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Recruit\" u=\"rescueJump=%s\"> click to view guide and rewards </>",
    ["我已有了面对一切的觉悟。啊，赞美愚者！"] = "I am prepared to face everything. Ah, praise the Fool!",
    ["我已步入非凡！"] = "I Have Stepped Into the Extraordinary!",
    ["我已知晓"] = "I Understand",
    ["我已经三天三夜没有合眼，只为多看您一眼！"] = "I haven't closed my eyes for three days and three nights, just to see you for one more moment!",
    ["我已经不再是我了。"] = "I am no longer who I was.",
    ["我已经不知道自己的苟活，究竟是一种幸运，还是一种耻辱。"] = "I no longer know if my survival is a stroke of luck or a disgrace.",
    ["我已经全押在豪斯身上了，听说它有凛冬郡猎犬的血脉！"] = "I've bet everything on House; I heard it has the bloodline of a Winter County hound!",
    ["我已经决定好了，我选……"] = "I have already decided. I choose...",
    ["我已经努力了两年，还是没有成功通过文法学校的考试，马上、马上是我最后一次机会。"] = "I have worked hard for two years, but I still haven't managed to pass the grammar school exam. Soon, soon is my last chance.",
    ["我已经卖报一年了，对廷根大事小事都很熟悉！"] = "I've been selling newspapers for a year, and I'm very familiar with all the big and small events in Tingen!",
    ["我已经告诉你们，朋友有事找我，需要请一天假，还给弗莱写了假条呢！"] = "I have already told you, a friend has something to find me for, I need to ask for a day off, and I even wrote a leave note for Frye!",
    ["我已经喝了很多很多杯，可为什么还是忘不掉？"] = "I've already drunk many, many cups, so why can't I still forget?",
    ["我已经回答了你的问题，接下来轮到我提问了。"] = "I have already answered your question. Now it is my turn to ask.",
    ["我已经在附近找过了，没看见哪怕一根猫毛。"] = "I've already looked around, I didn't see even a single cat hair.",
    ["我已经完成任务，你答应过我，会给我晋升的材料。"] = "I have completed the mission. You promised me the materials for my advancement.",
    ["我已经对这个环节迫不及待了。"] = "I can't wait for this part.",
    ["我已经将接下来要做的事，在潜意识中告诉你了。"] = "I have already told you what to do next in your subconscious.",
    ["我已经尽力为穷苦的人们创造了更好的工作和生活环境。"] = "I have tried my best to create a better working and living environment for the poor.",
    ["我已经引导一些人去安全屋了，应该没有问题。"] = "I have already guided some people to the Safe House, there should be no problem.",
    ["我已经很久没……奥罗拉……她忘记我了吗？"] = "It's been a long time since I... Aurora... has she forgotten me?",
    ["我已经很用力了！"] = "I'm already trying as hard as I can!",
    ["我已经得到了其他的工作，所以来取消今天的面试。"] = "I have already obtained another job, so I am here to cancel today's interview.",
    ["我已经得到了女神的启示，祂将赐福于你，许可你使用祂存于历史中的力量。"] = "I have already received the revelation of the Goddess; She will bestow Her blessing upon you and permit you to use the power She holds in history.",
    ["我已经快一周没合眼了，耳朵里止不住嗡嗡的响，走路也像是踩在棉花上！"] = "I haven't closed my eyes for almost a week, there's a constant buzzing in my ears, and walking feels like stepping on cotton!",
    ["我已经想好下一个故事要怎么写了。"] = "I've already thought about how to write the next story.",
    ["我已经想好了开头。"] = "I've already thought of the opening.",
    ["我已经成为了廷根大学机械学院的教授，我现在过的日子正是我梦寐以求的生活。"] = "I have become a professor at the Tingen University School of Engineering, and the life I am living now is exactly the life I have always dreamed of.",
    ["我已经找到了一份工作，所以来取消今天的面试。"] = "I have already found a job, so I am here to cancel today's interview.",
    ["我已经撑不住了，白天做工晚上学习的日子快要毁掉我了。"] = "I can't take it anymore; the days of working during the day and studying at night are about to destroy me.",
    ["我已经收集到了很多异象之物，伦纳德先生似乎提起过，我可以去<P_Yellow>俱乐部</>找他换取奖励。"] = "I have collected many Objects of Phenomenon; Mr. Leonard seemed to mention that I could go to the <P_Yellow>Club</> to exchange them for rewards with him.",
    ["我已经救了他无数次，尽到了医生的职责。"] = "I have saved him countless times and fulfilled my duties as a doctor.",
    ["我已经是个没有激情的老人了，客人肯定更喜欢他那样热情洋溢的摊主。"] = "I'm already an old man without passion; customers must prefer a stall owner as enthusiastic as him.",
    ["我已经死去了……"] = "I have already died...",
    ["我已经没脸在恶龙酒吧混了，可能之后会去某个码头工作吧。"] = "I have no face left to show at the Evil Dragon Bar. I might go work at some dock later.",
    ["我已经看到赢钱的画面了，只差你的投资！"] = "I have already seen the scene of winning money; it only lacks your investment!",
    ["我已经看累了。<P_Heart>（大喊）</>喂！如果你打算跳下来，那就跳！我们都在等着呢！"] = "I'm tired of watching. <P_Heart>(Shouting)</> Hey! If you're planning to jump, then jump! We're all waiting!",
    ["我已经睡了很久，但这抹意识应该不是为了睡觉而存在的。"] = "I have slept for a long time, but this trace of consciousness shouldn't exist just for the sake of sleeping.",
    ["我已经纠正了她魔镜占卜的错误，事情解决了。"] = "I have corrected the error in her Mirror Divination, the matter is resolved.",
    ["我已经给你们打上印记，你们……逃不掉的……"] = "I have already marked you, you... cannot escape...",
    ["我已经能预见弗兰奇先生找你收精神赔偿费的场景了。"] = "I can already foresee the scene where Mr. Franky comes to collect mental damages from you.",
    ["我已经解除了隔离。 "] = "I have lifted the quarantine.",
    ["我已经调查清楚了，那个人在这片卖的炸鱼薯条最美味。"] = "I have already investigated clearly; that person sells the most delicious fish and chips in this area.",
    ["我已经道歉了三个小时了，能见见我吗，骂我一句也好啊！"] = "I've been apologizing for three hours, can you see me? Even if you just scold me!",
    ["我巴不得几个月见不着他……那才叫清净呢！"] = "I'd rather not see him for a few months... that's what you call peace and quiet!",
    ["我希望……这里出现一座城堡……"] = "I hope... a castle appears here...",
    ["我希望他好好冲洗照片就好。"] = "I hope he just develops the photos properly.",
    ["我希望他就正常地冲洗照片。"] = "I hope he develops the photos normally.",
    ["我希望你为我选一个拍照的姿势。"] = "I want you to choose a pose for me to take a photo.",
    ["我希望你们获得不仅是骑士的技艺，更能继承骑士的精神，成为混乱时代中的一盏明灯，用你们的力量照亮身边的人。"] = "I hope you gain not only the skills of a knight but also inherit the spirit of a knight, becoming a beacon in this chaotic era, using your strength to illuminate those around you.",
    ["我希望您能帮我发掘这座城市里更多的幽默，我会给您相应的报酬。"] = "I hope you can help me discover more humor in this city, and I will give you the corresponding reward.",
    ["我希望用当时历史事件的日期，与对应日期的日记做对比，从而解读出更多的符号。"] = "I hope to compare the dates of historical events at that time with the diary entries of the corresponding dates, so as to decipher more symbols.",
    ["我希望能成为一位正式的值夜者。"] = "I hope to become an official Nighthawk.",
    ["我希望茜茜能有一个安静的环境学习，文法、数学和法律……<P_Heart>（叹了一口气）</>每一个都很困难，而市场真的太吵了。"] = "I hope Cici can have a quiet environment to study grammar, mathematics, and law... <P_Heart> (Sighs) </> Each one is very difficult, and the market is really too noisy.",
    ["我希望记录下您在某些场合下的风采，非常期待您能配合！"] = "I hope to record your demeanor on certain occasions, I look forward to your cooperation!",
    ["我带他去看了我付过订金的公寓，结果他对着房子骂了一声转身就走，说他不租了。"] = "I took him to see the apartment I had paid a deposit for, but he cursed at the house and turned around to leave, saying he wouldn't rent it.",
    ["我带你过去，跟紧我。"] = "I'll take you there, follow me closely.",
    ["我帮你"] = "I'll help you",
    ["我帮你 我记得它的位置"] = "I'll help you, I remember where it is.",
    ["我帮你们问问吧。"] = "Let me ask for you.",
    ["我帮你去找，你快回家吃饭吧。"] = "I'll help you look for them, you go home and eat.",
    ["我帮你打听打听"] = "I'll help you ask around",
    ["我帮你找"] = "I'll help you look for it",
    ["我帮你抢回来！"] = "I'll help you grab it back!",
    ["我帮你捡上来吧。"] = "I'll help you pick it up.",
    ["我帮你看看"] = "Let me take a look for you",
    ["我帮你，我记得它的位置。"] = "I'll help you, I remember its location.",
    ["我帮您解决闹剧，修好钢琴。作为回报，请您回去告诉我母亲，您对我不感兴趣。"] = "I will help you resolve this farce and fix the piano. In return, please go back and tell my mother that you are not interested in me.",
    ["我常常感觉自己像一个木偶，一切的结局都是被安排好的。"] = "I often feel like a puppet, with every outcome already arranged.",
    ["我常常觉得，自己就要见不到明天的太阳了。"] = "I often feel like I won't live to see tomorrow's sun.",
    ["我干嘛要去杀人呢？虽然我很想离开，但也不能杀人啊。"] = "Why would I want to kill someone? Even though I really want to leave, I can't just kill people.",
    ["我干扰他 你继续控制"] = "I'll distract him, you keep controlling.",
    ["我平时没机会和老爷说话。关于老爷的事情……您还是去问夫人和约翰先生吧。"] = "I don't usually have the opportunity to talk to the Master. Regarding the Master's affairs... you should ask the Madam and Mr. John.",
    ["我年轻时早早滑入了诱惑的泥潭，可小伊芙，你还有重来的机会。"] = "I slid into the quagmire of temptation early when I was young, but Little Eve, you still have a chance to start over.",
    ["我并不喜欢所谓的日光浴，你看我的肤色，很容易就被晒黑。"] = "I don’t like so-called sunbathing. Look at my skin tone, it’s very easy to get tanned.",
    ["我并不是真正的玩偶露米，而是她想要逃离的痛苦现实。"] = "I am not the real doll Lumi, but the painful reality she wants to escape from.",
    ["我并不觉得"] = "I don't think so",
    ["我并不认为藏着秘密的非凡者就一定是坏蛋，只要你的行为没有危害到我和值夜者，那你就还是我的队友。"] = "I don't believe that an Extraordinary who hides secrets is necessarily a bad person. As long as your actions do not harm me or the Nighthawks, you are still my teammate.",
    ["我应该完全记住了。"] = "I believe I have memorized them completely.",
    ["我应该怎么再次进入历史迷雾？"] = "How should I enter the fog of history again?",
    ["我应该是付出了某些代价，才获得了漫长的生命，从第四纪的尾声一直活到现在，就像一个游荡于大陆各处的幽灵……"] = "I must have paid some price to have obtained such a long life, living from the end of the Fourth Epoch until now, like a ghost wandering across the continent...",
    ["我店里所有加急订单，她总能提前送达！"] = "All the urgent orders in my shop, she always manages to deliver them ahead of time!",
    ["我建议你不如先来吃块蛋糕，让脑子放松下。"] = "I suggest you eat a piece of cake first to let your brain relax.",
    ["我建议你寻求主教和牧师的帮助"] = "I suggest you seek help from the Bishop and priests",
    ["我引证的是知情人爆料！"] = "I'm citing an insider's scoop!",
    ["我弟弟被弗莱队长从失控的马车前救下。为了表达感谢，他用攒下的木料做了个木雕，他说队长就像故事里的英雄。"] = "My brother was saved by Captain Frye from an out-of-control carriage. To express his gratitude, he made a wood carving with the wood he saved, saying that the captain is like a hero in a story.",
    ["我当前排名%s，当前总积分%s"] = "My current rank is %s, current total points %s",
    ["我当时骂了自己很久，怎么就选了这么个弱鸡途径。不过，发展科技树确实离不开它。"] = "I cursed myself for a long time back then, wondering why I chose such a weak pathway. However, developing the technology tree really couldn't do without it.",
    ["我当然会的！我们的风云人物，谢谢您，我们有机会下次见！"] = "I certainly will! Our man of the hour, thank you, we'll have a chance to meet again next time!",
    ["我当然得陪着她。虽然我只是个“纤细敏感”的作家，但让她一个人去送死？"] = "Of course I had to accompany her. Although I am just a 'delicate and sensitive' writer, let her go to her death alone?",
    ["我当然收了，但他把烛台放回来了！"] = "Of course I collected it, but he put the candlestick back!",
    ["我当然知道，不用担心。不久后我就遇到了卡萝队长和你……如果能再早一点就好了。"] = "I know, of course. Don't worry. Not long after, I met Captain Cara and you... If only it could have been sooner.",
    ["我当然能分得清莱利叔叔有没有喝醉，就像分得清那是蓝星还是褐星！那就是蓝星，我保证！"] = "Of course I can tell if Uncle Riley is drunk or not, just like I can tell if that's the Blue Star or the Brown Star! That is the Blue Star, I guarantee it!",
    ["我当然要去！汤姆，我们去看看。"] = "Of course I'm going! Tom, let's go take a look.",
    ["我当然，记得。"] = "Of course, I remember.",
    ["我彻底相信，你可以顺利地唤醒黛西小姐。"] = "I fully believe that you can successfully wake Miss Daisy.",
    ["我待会去趟廷根市改善住房公司，新家的事情就交给我和梅丽莎吧。"] = "I'll go to the Tingen Housing Company later. I'll leave the new home matters to me and Melissa.",
    ["我很乐意。具体是什么案件？有什么线索吗？"] = "I'd be happy to. What specific case is it? Are there any clues?",
    ["我很冷静，从这里跳下去，就这个高度无非是软组织挫伤。"] = "I'm very calm. Jumping from here, at this height, it's nothing more than a soft tissue contusion.",
    ["我很同情被他点到的姐妹们。"] = "I really sympathize with the sisters he picks.",
    ["我很喜欢戴莉女士那些夸张的、令人害羞的玩笑，她被调去贝克兰德教区后，我们都很想念她。"] = "I really liked Ms. Daly's exaggerated and embarrassing jokes. We all missed her after she was transferred to the Backlund Diocese.",
    ["我很喜欢的一位侦探小说家说过，元凶通常隐藏于最不起眼之处！"] = "A detective novelist I really like once said that the culprit is usually hidden in the most inconspicuous place!",
    ["我很喜欢这首曲子，也很喜欢教堂的彩色花窗。"] = "I really like this piece of music, and I also like the church's stained glass windows.",
    ["我很好……哈哈，我想起了一些重要的事，先走了。"] = "I'm fine... Haha, I just remembered something important. I'll be going now.",
    ["我很好、很健康！放心吧队长。"] = "I'm fine, very healthy! Don't worry, Captain.",
    ["我很好奇，你们在讨论什么？"] = "I'm curious, what are you discussing?",
    ["我很好，不用担心，很多人死了，但活着的人还要继续活着。"] = "I am fine, don't worry. Many people died, but those who are alive must continue to live.",
    ["我很好，布兰登先生会为我高兴的。"] = "I'm fine, Mr. Brandon will be happy for me.",
    ["我很好，还新学了几句玩笑。"] = "I'm fine, I even learned a few new jokes.",
    ["我很崇拜他的！但是一直当学徒也有怨气嘛，就小小抱怨几句，就几句……你就当我没说过。"] = "I admire him very much! But I've been an apprentice for so long that I have some resentment, so I'm just complaining a little, just a little... just pretend I didn't say anything.",
    ["我很希望，它不会忘记"] = "I really hope it won't forget",
    ["我很感谢曾经的某位雇主，他允许我在工作后自由安排时间，阅读报纸。"] = "I am very grateful to a former employer who allowed me to arrange my time freely after work to read the newspaper.",
    ["我很感谢曾经的雇主，他让我自由安排业余时间。"] = "I am very grateful to my former employer; he let me arrange my spare time freely.",
    ["我很愿意。"] = "I would be very happy to.",
    ["我很抱歉听到这个故事。"] = "I am very sorry to hear this story.",
    ["我很擅长打架！"] = "I'm very good at fighting!",
    ["我很有品"] = "I have great taste",
    ["我很期待你的表演"] = "I look forward to your performance",
    ["我很清醒，我想清楚了。我已经很老了，病得连羊都喂不了。如果没有我，我的孩子能多吃一个面包。"] = "I am very clear-headed, and I have thought it through. I am already very old and so sick that I can't even feed the sheep. If I were gone, my children could eat one more piece of bread.",
    ["我很理解他们的心情，也羡慕他们还能找到重要的人的遗物。"] = "I understand their feelings, and I envy them for still being able to find the relics of someone important.",
    ["我很荣幸。看来女神也支持我们的选择，为我们送来了帮手。"] = "I am honored. It seems that the Goddess also supports our choice and has sent us a helper.",
    ["我很荣幸，能遇到一位懂得欣赏的听众。"] = "I am honored to meet a listener who knows how to appreciate it.",
    ["我很遗憾……他一定是位细心而温柔的人。"] = "I'm sorry... He must have been a careful and gentle person.",
    ["我很遗憾。"] = "I am very sorry to hear that.",
    ["我很遗憾这个世界上反对诗歌的人又多了一位。"] = "I regret that there is one more person in this world who opposes poetry.",
    ["我很难过……不对，我很高兴。"] = "I'm so sad... no, I'm so happy.",
    ["我很高兴看到琳达获胜，老维德吃了一个大亏，说不定现在正躲在厕所里哭呢。 "] = "I'm happy to see Linda win. Old Wade suffered a big loss; he might be hiding in the restroom crying right now.",
    ["我得保护好门票，它是我活下去的勇气。"] = "I must protect this ticket well; it is the courage that keeps me going.",
    ["我得先压制住她，然后再完成中断仪式……"] = "I need to suppress her first, then finish interrupting the ritual...",
    ["我得先去银冠餐厅狠狠消费一顿！"] = "I have to go to the Silver Crown Restaurant and spend a fortune first!",
    ["我得先找个地方藏起来……要是偷偷喝药通宵学习的事被发现就糟了。"] = "I have to find a place to hide first... It would be terrible if it were discovered that I secretly drank a potion to study all night.",
    ["我得先把这些涂鸦清理掉——当然，如果你愿意帮我的话，现在就可以拿去。"] = "I have to clean up these graffiti first—of course, if you are willing to help me, you can take them now.",
    ["我得到了一件礼物，一份来自家族的遗产，现在需要全力研究。"] = "I received a gift, an inheritance from my family, and now I need to study it with all my might.",
    ["我得到了这个。你知道这是什么吗？"] = "I obtained this. Do you know what this is?",
    ["我得去公司了，工作上有些急事。"] = "I have to go to the company, there's something urgent at work.",
    ["我得去大剧院了。罗塞尔戏剧节正在售票，一定很热闹。"] = "I have to go to the Grand Theater. The Roselle Drama Festival is selling tickets; it must be very lively.",
    ["我得去看看那群人有没有浪费我的水了。"] = "I have to go check if that group of people wasted my water.",
    ["我得想想，有没有比格尔曼更吓人的家伙……"] = "I have to think, is there anyone scarier than Gehrman...",
    ["我得找个借口请个假，你们觉得头痛这个理由怎么样？"] = "I need to find an excuse to ask for leave. What do you think of the 'headache' excuse?",
    ["我得把这两个孩子带走。"] = "I'm taking these two children with me.",
    ["我得留下，守着家里，保护夫人和少爷，等他回来。"] = "I must stay, guard the house, protect the mistress and the young master, and wait for him to return.",
    ["我得知您喜欢音乐，尤其是这首钢琴曲，所以趁值班间隙，抄下了这份琴谱，希望能证明我并非蔑视艺术的人。"] = "I learned that you like music, especially this piano piece, so I copied this sheet music during my shift break, hoping to prove that I am not someone who despises art.",
    ["我得赶紧收拾！他们真是阴魂不散！"] = "I need to pack up, quickly! They just won't leave me alone!",
    ["我得重新开始攒钱，也许要几个月，最多半年……"] = "I have to start saving money again. Maybe it will take a few months, six months at most...",
    ["我循着灰雾的气息而来，遵循伟大主人的嘱托来帮你。"] = "I came following the scent of the gray fog, following the instructions of the great master to help you.",
    ["我必将如飓风般到来。"] = "I shall arrive like a hurricane.",
    ["我必须去追踪“知识皇冠”，防止他进一步活化。摧毁“绝望魔镜”的任务，我想交给你和弗莱。"] = "I must track down the \"Crown of Knowledge\" to prevent it from further animating. I would like to entrust the task of destroying the \"Magic Mirror of Despair\" to you and Frye.",
    ["我必须实现这些约定，但我不记得把东西放哪了，或许……那些东西已经随着我的记忆一起遗失了。 "] = "I must fulfill these promises, but I don't remember where I put the things. Perhaps... those things have been lost along with my memories.",
    ["我必须找到它们，那是我唯一的记忆。"] = "I must find them; they are my only memories.",
    ["我必须找回力量，让大家永远爱上香水。"] = "I must regain the power to make everyone fall in love with the perfume forever.",
    ["我必须确认他的力量是真实的，确认他对我们没有恶意，确认这一切不是某种陷阱。"] = "I had to confirm that his power was real, confirm that he had no malice toward us, and confirm that all this was not some kind of trap.",
    ["我必须要坚持下去，绝不会放弃——"] = "I must persist, I will never give up—",
    ["我必须让他知道我的厉害！"] = "I must let him know how tough I am!",
    ["我忍无可忍，向报社举报了他们，当然结果是——我被吊销医生执照。"] = "I couldn't stand it anymore and reported them to the newspaper. Of course, the result was—my medical license was revoked.",
    ["我忍无可忍，就开口骂了他，但他却来得更勤了。"] = "I couldn't take it anymore and scolded him, but that only made him visit more often.",
    ["我忏悔"] = "I repent.",
    ["我忏悔……"] = "I repent...",
    ["我忏悔！"] = "I repent!",
    ["我忏悔，我一直非常憎恨我的父亲……"] = "I repent; I have always hated my father very much...",
    ["我忘了你的生日……忘了你小时候怕黑，每晚都要我点着蜡烛陪你……"] = "I forgot your birthday... forgot that you were afraid of the dark when you were little, and every night you needed me to light a candle to accompany you...",
    ["我忘了你的生日……忘了你小时候怕黑，每晚都要我点着蜡烛陪你……我甚至忘了你母亲的样子……"] = "I forgot your birthday... forgot that you were afraid of the dark when you were little and needed me to light a candle to stay with you every night... I even forgot what your mother looked like...",
    ["我忘记了……"] = "I forgot...",
    ["我忘记了什么？梦在提醒我什么？"] = "What have I forgotten? What is this dream trying to warn me about?",
    ["我忠实的，仆从。"] = "My loyal, servant.",
    ["我快三天没吃东西了……没有一份工作，我就要饿死了……"] = "I haven't eaten for three days... without a job, I'm going to starve to death...",
    ["我快疯了"] = "I'm going crazy",
    ["我快要控制不住我自己了！！！"] = "I can't control myself anymore!!!",
    ["我怀疑他们受到笔记内超凡力量的污染，疯狂后感应到了\"2-049\"的存在，想要阻止我们去找到笔记。"] = "I suspect they were corrupted by the extraordinary power within the notes. After going mad, they sensed the existence of \"2-049\" and wanted to stop us from finding the notes.",
    ["我怀疑他们受到笔记内超凡力量的污染，疯狂后感应到了2-049的存在。"] = "I suspect they were corrupted by the Extraordinary power within the notebook, and after going mad, they sensed the existence of 2-049.",
    ["我怀疑他来自异世界，就像通俗小说里写的那样！"] = "I suspect he came from another world, just like what is written in popular novels!",
    ["我怀疑他身上有什么重要证据，治安队和警局在联合灭口！"] = "I suspect he has some important evidence on him. The Security Force and the police are working together to silence him!",
    ["我怀疑他达到了序列7，你是怎么办到的？我简直无法相信。"] = "I suspect he reached Sequence 7. How did you manage it? I simply can't believe it.",
    ["我怀疑你在骂人……"] = "I suspect you're insulting me...",
    ["我怀疑是代表当事人去工厂检查时，受到了一些惊吓。真是惭愧，一位律师居然如此怯弱。"] = "I suspect I was frightened while inspecting the factory on behalf of the client. It's truly shameful for a lawyer to be so timid.",
    ["我怀疑这些蜡烛，是某个<P_Yellow>神奇物品的分身</>，它能放大人对死亡的渴望。"] = "I suspect these candles are a manifestation of some <P_Yellow> mystical item </>; it can amplify one's desire for death.",
    ["我怀疑这本笔记是具备一定生命和智慧的邪恶物品。"] = "I suspect this notebook is an evil item possessing a certain degree of life and intelligence.",
    ["我怀疑这本笔记是具备一定生命和智慧的邪恶物品，留在我们手上太危险了。"] = "I suspect this notebook is an evil item with a certain degree of life and intelligence. It's too dangerous to keep it in our hands.",
    ["我怀疑这起儿童失踪案与非凡者有关，我准备去调查一下。"] = "I suspect this child abduction case is related to a Beyonder, and I am preparing to investigate.",
    ["我怎么什么都没看懂？ "] = "Why didn't I understand any of that?",
    ["我怎么会在这里……"] = "How did I end up here...",
    ["我怎么会想杀他？不、不对......"] = "How could I want to kill him? No, that's not right...",
    ["我怎么会想杀他？不、不对……"] = "How could I want to kill him? No, that's not right...",
    ["我怎么会知道！我以为这东西缠上我了！我以为它阴魂不散！"] = "How would I know! I thought this thing was haunting me! I thought it was a persistent spirit!",
    ["我怎么动不了了？"] = "Why can't I move?",
    ["我怎么可能会杀了他？我最疼爱的主人，我怎么会……不、不对……"] = "How could I possibly kill him? My most beloved master, how could I... no, that's not right...",
    ["我怎么在这里休息？！我应该忙碌起来，为了家人，为了明天！"] = "Why am I resting here?! I should be busy, for my family, for tomorrow!",
    ["我怎么沦落到要和这些下等民一起挤那东西了？"] = "How did I end up having to squeeze into that thing with these lower-class people?",
    ["我怎么知道，它又不是我的信使……不过，它好像在研制某种药剂，桌子上的那个是我听到的药剂配方，说不定你把药剂做出来它就会出现。"] = "How would I know? It's not my messenger... However, it seems to be developing some kind of potion. The one on the table is the potion formula I heard. Maybe if you make the potion, it will appear.",
    ["我怎么进入副本"] = "How do I enter a dungeon",
    ["我怎么隐约觉得……埃姆林先生他今晚恐怕要熬夜了。"] = "Why do I vaguely feel... that Mr. Emlyn is probably going to stay up all night tonight.",
    ["我怕你不要它……也怕你骂我……"] = "I was afraid you wouldn't let me keep it... and afraid you'd scold me...",
    ["我怕真的与我有关，我不敢赌这个，不如逃跑、去开始新的人生。"] = "I'm afraid it really has something to do with me. I don't dare to gamble on this. It's better to run away and start a new life.",
    ["我思故我在"] = "I Think, Therefore I Am",
    ["我总想开口，却又害怕打破这份安静的美好。"] = "I always want to speak, yet I fear breaking this quiet beauty.",
    ["我总是听到一些温柔的说话声，但周围却空无一人。"] = "I always hear some gentle voices, but there is no one around.",
    ["我总觉得股市就是政府公开的赌博，最起码鲁恩的股市是这样的，有钱千万别炒股。"] = "I always feel that the stock market is a public gamble by the government. At the very least, Loen's stock market is like this. If you have money, definitely don't speculate in stocks.",
    ["我总觉得，亲人的死亡就像步入冬天，带来连绵的寒冷。"] = "I always feel that the death of a loved one is like stepping into winter, bringing a lingering chill.",
    ["我恨历史，那都是一团又一团的迷雾，像隐匿贤者的灌输一样让人头痛！"] = "I hate history. It's all a mass of fog, as headache-inducing as the indoctrination of the Hidden Sage!",
    ["我恳求知识降下审判……颤抖吧，愚昧的灵魂！"] = "I implore knowledge to bring down judgment... tremble, ignorant soul!",
    ["我悄悄告诉你，你不要告诉别人。梅是……流浪王国的大臣！"] = "I'll tell you quietly, don't tell anyone else. May is... a minister of the Wandering Kingdom!",
    ["我悟了，大师！"] = "I understand, Master!",
    ["我患有间歇性失忆症，每天醒来都会忘记昨天的事。 "] = "I suffer from intermittent amnesia, every day I wake up I forget what happened yesterday.",
    ["我情愿我的孩子有更多的人性，而非虔诚的信徒。"] = "I would rather my child have more humanity than be a devout believer.",
    ["我想"] = "I want",
    ["我想……"] = "I think...",
    ["我想不是。"] = "I don't think so.",
    ["我想也是，所以才回来找你们商量一下。"] = "I think so too, that's why I came back to discuss it with you.",
    ["我想买一束花"] = "I want to buy a bouquet of flowers",
    ["我想买一束花。"] = "I want to buy a bouquet of flowers.",
    ["我想买些茉莉放在家里，这样也许能使心情好一些。"] = "I'd like to buy some jasmine to keep at home; perhaps it will help improve my mood.",
    ["我想买票"] = "I want to buy a ticket",
    ["我想了解一下公司的福利。"] = "I would like to know about the company's benefits.",
    ["我想了解关于占卜俱乐部的情况。"] = "I would like to know about the Divination Club.",
    ["我想了解关于占卜家俱乐部的情况。"] = "I would like to learn about the Divination Club.",
    ["我想了解更多"] = "I want to know more",
    ["我想了解码头的事情。"] = "I want to know about the dock.",
    ["我想享用一顿安静的美食……"] = "I want to enjoy a quiet meal...",
    ["我想他不会介意这点，毕竟这个错误同您一样美丽。"] = "I don't think he would mind that, after all, this error is as beautiful as you are.",
    ["我想他们并没有触犯任何一条律法，恐怕也没有一条名为“贫穷”的罪名。"] = "I don't think they have broken any laws, and I'm afraid there is no such crime as 'poverty'.",
    ["我想你应该知道，神弃之地在“愚者”的庇佑下得以结束持续千年的苦难。"] = "I think you should know that the Forsaken Land of the Gods was able to end its millennium-long suffering under the protection of the \"Fool\".",
    ["我想你来找我肯定不只是想和我闲聊这么简单。"] = "I don't think you came to find me just for a simple chat.",
    ["我想你说的是柠檬蛋糕，孩子们都喜欢这种蛋糕。"] = "I think you mean lemon cake. All the children like this kind of cake.",
    ["我想修好那边的简易锅，你可以帮帮我吗？"] = "I want to fix that simple pot over there. Can you help me?",
    ["我想做义工。听说格尔曼·斯帕罗曾在这里做过义工。"] = "I want to volunteer. I heard Gehrman Sparrow once volunteered here.",
    ["我想先了解一下。"] = "I'd like to learn more first.",
    ["我想再去查查镍币书店，找找布兰登。"] = "I want to go check the Nickel Bookstore again and look for Brandon.",
    ["我想到了！"] = "I've got it!",
    ["我想到了！我要继续去画设计稿了，谢谢你！"] = "I've got it! I'm going to continue working on the design draft, thank you!",
    ["我想占卜。"] = "I want a divination.",
    ["我想占卜我未婚夫的状况，他为了一桩生意出海了，至今没有回来。"] = "I want to divine the situation of my fiancé. He went out to sea for a business deal and hasn't returned yet.",
    ["我想去中央广场"] = "I want to go to Central Plaza",
    ["我想去廷根火车站"] = "I want to go to Tingen Train Station",
    ["我想去黑荆棘安保公司"] = "I want to go to Blackthorn Security Company",
    ["我想向您请教一下，刚刚那段对话在人类的语言范畴内，是否能算有趣？"] = "I would like to ask you, within the scope of human language, can that conversation just now be considered interesting?",
    ["我想听听有关镇子和古堡的来历。"] = "I'd like to hear about the origins of the town and the castle.",
    ["我想和人分享这个发现很久了！你知道蔷薇战争吗？"] = "I've wanted to share this discovery with someone for a long time! Do you know about the War of the Roses?",
    ["我想回到真正的故乡。那里没有非凡，没有魔药，没有会让人失控疯狂的知识。"] = "I want to return to my true home. There, there is no Extraordinary, no potions, and no knowledge that makes one lose control and go mad.",
    ["我想在任何一个城市的这种调研都能让我们收获良多……"] = "I think this kind of research in any city can yield a lot...",
    ["我想夫人戴上什么都值得赞美声。"] = "I think anything my lady wears is worthy of praise.",
    ["我想好了，先聊天气，再聊上次的音乐会，然后慢慢引入……"] = "I've decided, first talk about the weather, then talk about the last concert, and then slowly introduce...",
    ["我想好了，我愿意加入黑荆棘安保公司。"] = "I've decided, I'm willing to join Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["我想好要买去哪的蒸汽列车票了！"] = "I've decided which Steam Train ticket to buy!",
    ["我想它是在回复我的疑问，我那时很困惑……"] = "I think it was replying to my question. I was very confused at that time...",
    ["我想带着我的房子飞上天！年轻人，你觉得我能做到吗？"] = "I want to take my house and fly into the sky! Young man, do you think I can do it?",
    ["我想念在壁炉下看着玛丽缝东西的日子，昏黄的灯光映着她美丽的脸庞，可那是十年前了。"] = "I miss the days of watching Mary sew by the fireplace, the dim light reflecting off her beautiful face, but that was ten years ago.",
    ["我想您对这个提议一定很感兴趣。不过，这需要一些准备时间，等城堡达到<Highlight>2级</>，一切就绪的时候，您随时可以来找我。"] = "I think you will be very interested in this proposal. However, this requires some preparation time. When the castle reaches <Highlight>Level 2</> and everything is ready, you can come to me at any time.",
    ["我想您愿意用一点点金钱来交换获取这个伟大智慧的机会，当然，当然！"] = "I think you would be willing to exchange a little money for the opportunity to acquire this great wisdom, of course, of course!",
    ["我想想……"] = "Let me think...",
    ["我想想……1350年战争爆发时，他比我大三岁，今年，我比他大一岁……"] = "Let me think... when the war broke out in 1350, he was three years older than me. This year, I am one year older than him...",
    ["我想想……好像有<P_Yellow>“徘徊”、“英灵”、“造物主”、“眷属”</>这几个单词。"] = "Let me think... there seem to be words like <P_Yellow>\"Wander\", \"Spirit\", \"Creator\", \"Attendant\"</>.",
    ["我想想，你去找全学派最爱睡觉的那位吧，她会给你中肯的商品评价。"] = "Let me think, you should go find the person in the school who loves sleeping the most; she will give you an honest product review.",
    ["我想想，肯最爱偷懒，多半在休息室，萨拉应该在帮忙打扫会长办公室……"] = "Let me think, Ken loves to slack off the most, he's probably in the lounge, and Sarah should be helping to clean the President's office...",
    ["我想成为“太阳”，想从您这里得到初始序列的魔药配方。"] = "I want to become a 'Sun' and get the initial Sequence potion formula from you.",
    ["我想我今晚睡不着了……"] = "I don't think I can sleep tonight...",
    ["我想我快疯了"] = "I think I'm going crazy",
    ["我想我快疯了！"] = "I think I'm going crazy!",
    ["我想我知道该画些什么了，你愿意与我一起吗？"] = "I think I know what to paint now. Would you like to join me?",
    ["我想找您占卜。"] = "I want to ask you for a divination.",
    ["我想找这里的学徒，芬恩。您认识他吗？"] = "I'm looking for the apprentice here, Finn. Do you know him?",
    ["我想找队长。"] = "I want to find the Captain.",
    ["我想把这幅画送给你们，希望你们别介意。"] = "I'd like you two to have this painting. I hope you don't mind.",
    ["我想攒钱买一辆，送给哥哥作礼物。"] = "I want to save up to buy one as a gift for my brother.",
    ["我想放弃了……"] = "I want to give up...",
    ["我想明天应该去乔西亚太太的居所做一次半正式的拜访，刚好我有一件新的散步服。"] = "I think I should pay a semi-formal visit to Mrs. Josiah's residence tomorrow; I happen to have a new walking suit.",
    ["我想是的，而且你……"] = "I think so, and you...",
    ["我想没错！"] = "I think that's right!",
    ["我想留在黑荆棘，一直保护这里。"] = "I want to stay in Blackthorn and protect this place forever.",
    ["我想看到完美的滑行，所有桨叶离开水面！"] = "I want to see perfect gliding, all oars leaving the water!",
    ["我想看机械飞船！"] = "I want to see mechanical airships!",
    ["我想看看有什么"] = "I want to see what's available",
    ["我想看看有什么物资"] = "I want to see what supplies are available",
    ["我想看看能不能找到舍伍德的坟墓。"] = "I want to see if I can find Sherwood's grave.",
    ["我想着，不能让你一个人上去，我也要做点什么。"] = "I thought, I can't let you go up alone, I have to do something too.",
    ["我想知道……"] = "I want to know...",
    ["我想知道这片美丽花园的主人叫什么名字。"] = "I would like to know the name of the owner of this beautiful garden.",
    ["我想知道，查理最近有没有接触过神秘学物品？"] = "I want to know, has Charlie been in contact with any occult items recently?",
    ["我想确认一件事。不过放心，如果我有恶意，刚刚就不会救你们。"] = "I want to confirm one thing. But don't worry, if I had malicious intent, I wouldn't have saved you just now.",
    ["我想给二位讲一讲我们大学的特色活动，赛艇……"] = "I would like to tell you about our university's signature event, rowing...",
    ["我想统治世界。"] = "I want to rule the world.",
    ["我想获得一双翅膀。"] = "I wanted to obtain a pair of wings.",
    ["我想要……"] = "I would like...",
    ["我想要……向格尔曼致敬！"] = "I wanted to... pay tribute to Gehrman!",
    ["我想要谢谢你，为我和我的女儿做的一切。"] = "I want to thank you for everything you have done for me and my daughter.",
    ["我想要钓的未必是鱼。"] = "What I want to catch might not be a fish.",
    ["我想见的人就在门后，但出于一些原因，我没法进去。"] = "The person I want to see is behind that door, but for some reason, I cannot go in.",
    ["我想让他做回那个有点粗鲁，又笑得很温和的男人。"] = "I want him to go back to being that man who was a bit rough but had a gentle smile.",
    ["我想让她知道，我正在努力成为和她一样厉害的人。"] = "I want her to know that I am working hard to become someone as amazing as she is.",
    ["我想让爸爸陪我玩了……"] = "I want Dad to play with me...",
    ["我想让那些不愿意认真学习的学生，通过内部资料的途径多学一些。"] = "I want to let those students who are unwilling to study seriously learn a bit more through internal materials.",
    ["我想试试，拍张照片，也许能短暂成全他们……"] = "I want to try taking a photo; perhaps I can briefly fulfill their wish...",
    ["我想请你帮一个小忙，跟我到办公室来吧。"] = "I would like to ask you for a small favor; please come with me to my office.",
    ["我想请假"] = "I want to ask for leave",
    ["我想请教您关于如何正确地执行它们，并确保其有效性和……安全性？"] = "I would like to ask you about how to perform them correctly and ensure their effectiveness and... safety?",
    ["我想谢谢您和阿兹克先生救了老罗德。医生帮老罗德处理了伤口，但他昨天夜里做了很多噩梦。"] = "I want to thank you and Mr. Azik for saving Old Rod. The doctor treated his wounds, but he had many nightmares last night.",
    ["我想起一些以前的事情，呵，这个世界对待孤儿并不友好。"] = "I remembered some things from the past. Heh, this world is not friendly to orphans.",
    ["我想起了我的孩子。"] = "I remembered my child.",
    ["我想起了那个血肉魔法，让灵界谜虫吞吃了我的身体。"] = "I remembered that Flesh Magic, letting the Spirit World Mystery Worm devour my body.",
    ["我想起来了"] = "I remember now.",
    ["我想起来了 你是梦里……"] = "I remember now, you are in the dream...",
    ["我想起来了！他现在已经搬家啦，你可以去村口的稻草房子里找他。"] = "I remember now! He has moved away; you can go find him at the straw house at the entrance of the village.",
    ["我想起来了，你是上次那个……动手的……"] = "I remember now, you're that one from last time... the one who fought...",
    ["我想起来了，刚才的敌人，是特里斯案件期间，在黑荆棘门口公共马车站点遇见过的少女。"] = "I remember now; the enemy from just a moment ago is the young girl I met at the public carriage stop in front of Blackthorn Security during the Trissy case.",
    ["我想起来了，我之前在黑荆棘门口公共马车站点遇见过的特莉丝。"] = "I remember now, I met Trissy at the public carriage stop in front of Blackthorn before.",
    ["我想这一定也是解开这座屋子谜团的关键……"] = "I think this must also be the key to solving the mystery of this house...",
    ["我想这个八音盒应该符合您的描述。"] = "I think this music box should match your description.",
    ["我想这种零食会大卖吧……"] = "I think this snack will sell well...",
    ["我想进一步调查时，梦中出现了隐秘的祷告声……"] = "When I tried to investigate further, a secret prayer sounded in my dream...",
    ["我想邀请梅丽莎回来参加我的生日宴会，但我不知道她是否有空。"] = "I want to invite Melissa back for my birthday party, but I don't know if she's free.",
    ["我想问个问题，这些细长的船，一百多年都没变过吗？"] = "I have a question: have these slender boats remained unchanged for over a hundred years?",
    ["我想除了用于铁路贸易，把这些美酒销售到更近的地方或许也是不错的选择！"] = "I think, besides using it for railway trade, selling these fine wines to closer places might also be a good choice!",
    ["我想陪他，但我说不出什么安慰的话……"] = "I want to keep him company, but I don't know what words of comfort to say...",
    ["我想鲁恩人和因蒂斯人也没什么不同……过早地成为小有名气的戏剧演员就会有这样的困扰，但我只想安静地完成学业。"] = "I don't think Loenese are any different from Intisians... becoming a somewhat famous stage actor too early brings such troubles, but I just want to finish my studies in peace.",
    ["我想，也许我只是在等待过去。"] = "I think, perhaps, I am just waiting for the past.",
    ["我想，他一定也希望看到这片领地重新焕发生机的样子。"] = "I think he must also hope to see this territory regain its vitality.",
    ["我想，女神不会让一对虔诚的爱侣失望的。"] = "I think the Goddess will not let a pair of devout lovers down.",
    ["我想，我们之后需要好好调查一下这里……不止因为失踪案。"] = "I think we need to investigate this place thoroughly later... and not just because of the missing persons case.",
    ["我想，我可以独自应对这件事。"] = "I think I can handle this matter alone.",
    ["我想，我应该有点清楚这间屋子的谜团了……"] = "I think I have a bit of an understanding of the mystery of this room...",
    ["我想，我很期待和您在不同的地方见面，谈论音乐、书籍、或者其他。"] = "I think I look forward to meeting you in different places to talk about music, books, or other things.",
    ["我想，我是愿意的……"] = "I think... I am willing...",
    ["我想，这或许不是一个能令你开心的话题。"] = "I think this might not be a topic that will make you happy.",
    ["我想，那段记载的本质是，一个体质特殊的人服食了不完整的“收尸人”魔药，结果侥幸存活，误打误撞成为了非凡者。"] = "I think the essence of that record is that a person with a special constitution consumed an incomplete 'Corpse Collector' potion, survived by sheer luck, and stumbled into becoming a Beyonder.",
    ["我感兴趣"] = "I am interested",
    ["我感受到一些熟悉气息的异动，就过来看看。这是对命运的干涉太多了吗……"] = "I felt some fluctuations in familiar auras, so I came to take a look. Is this interfering with fate too much...",
    ["我感受到了力量的加持，波特，剩下的就交给我吧！"] = "I felt the blessing of power, Porter, leave the rest to me!",
    ["我感觉下面凉飕飕的，不知道你那边是不是也这样。"] = "I feel a chill down there, I wonder if it's the same for you.",
    ["我感觉到有某种存在降临了！"] = "I feel like some kind of existence has descended!",
    ["我感觉好多了，母亲，我们现在就过去吧。"] = "I feel much better, Mother, let's go now.",
    ["我感觉很不错，而且脑袋里似乎多了一些“占卜家”的知识。接下来应该做什么？"] = "I feel pretty good, and it seems like some \"Seer\" knowledge has appeared in my head. What should I do next?",
    ["我感觉我一直活在罗塞尔大帝的影子里。"] = "I feel like I've always lived in the shadow of Emperor Roselle.",
    ["我感觉我有点喜欢上拍照了。"] = "I feel like I'm starting to enjoy photography.",
    ["我感觉现在状态不错，我还想学得更多些！"] = "I feel in good condition now, I want to learn more!",
    ["我感觉自己像只……<P_Heart>（停顿）</>在书籍面前的卷毛狒狒。"] = "I feel like a... <P_Heart> (Pauses) </> Curly-Haired Baboon in front of books.",
    ["我感觉自己的力量在消散……也许我很快要消失了。"] = "I feel my strength dissipating... maybe I will disappear soon.",
    ["我感觉自己睡了一觉……"] = "I feel like I took a nap...",
    ["我感觉距离与父母团聚的那一天又近了一步 ！"] = "I feel like I am one step closer to the day I reunite with my parents!",
    ["我感觉距离与父母团聚的那一天又近了一步！"] = "I feel like I'm one step closer to the day I reunite with my parents!",
    ["我感觉还好，我现在就去。"] = "I feel fine, I'll go now.",
    ["我感觉这里的灵性有些躁动。"] = "I feel that the spirituality here is somewhat restless.",
    ["我感觉，我的心脏即将处于爆炸的边缘，我的血液现在就像是沸腾的开水！手、胳膊、腿、脚，全在抖！我待会儿还有手术，我现在这样连手术刀都握不住了！"] = "I feel like my heart is on the verge of exploding, and my blood is like boiling water right now! My hands, arms, legs, feet, everything is shaking! I have a surgery later, and I can't even hold the scalpel like this!",
    ["我愿为你供奉世界上最贵重的珍宝，为你一字一句抄写最冗长的经书！"] = "I am willing to offer you the most precious treasures in the world, and transcribe the longest scriptures for you word by word!",
    ["我愿为你奉献一切"] = "I am willing to sacrifice everything for you.",
    ["我愿为您化作一朵花，盛开在您经过的每一个清晨！"] = "I wish to transform into a flower for you, blooming every morning as you pass by!",
    ["我愿以我的一切作为交换，求您为我免除最后的惩罚。"] = "I am willing to give everything I have in exchange, I beg you to exempt me from the final punishment.",
    ["我愿以我的一切作为交换，求您为我取出它！……#$&$&**&@%……"] = "I am willing to exchange everything I have, please take it out for me! ...#$&$&**&@%...",
    ["我愿将我的心掏出来，只为换您一个浅浅的微笑！"] = "I would gladly tear out my heart just to exchange it for a faint smile from you!",
    ["我愿意"] = "I am willing",
    ["我愿意……我愿意！"] = "I will... I will!",
    ["我愿意一天只要10便士，求求您给我这个工作机会吧！"] = "I'll work for just 10 pence a day! Please, give me the job!",
    ["我愿意一天只要10便士，求求您给我这个工作机会吧，我父亲病了，得靠这些钱买药……"] = "I'm willing to work for 10 pennies a day, please give me this job opportunity, my father is sick and I need this money to buy medicine...",
    ["我愿意为您吞下一千根银针，只乞求您的垂怜。"] = "I am willing to swallow a thousand silver needles for you, just begging for your pity.",
    ["我愿意将我毕生所知的神秘学知识，都教给你。"] = "I am willing to teach you all the occult knowledge I have learned in my life.",
    ["我愿意成为您的仆从"] = "I am willing to become your servant",
    ["我愿意投资你们！投资传统比投资新兴股票更优雅。"] = "I am willing to invest in you! Investing in tradition is more elegant than investing in emerging stocks.",
    ["我愿意捐款！写支票！或者我付现金！不不，我已经没有钱了！"] = "I'm willing to donate! Write a check! Or I'll pay cash! No, no, I have no money left!",
    ["我愿意赞同温暖带来的好处，但我并不喜欢所谓的日光浴，你看我的肤色，很容易就被晒黑。"] = "I am willing to acknowledge the benefits that warmth brings, but I do not like so-called sunbathing. Look at my skin tone; it tans very easily.",
    ["我愿意！"] = "I am willing!",
    ["我慷慨送你猎人的火焰烤一<P_Yellow>烤</>！"] = "I'll generously give you a Hunter's flame to <P_Yellow>roast</>!",
    ["我懂一点占星知识，能帮你看看。"] = "I know a little bit about astrology; I can take a look for you.",
    ["我懂了。"] = "I understand.",
    ["我懂了，我其实已经死了，现在的我只是一缕偏执的意识、一片残破的灵体。"] = "I understand. I'm actually already dead. The current me is just a strand of obsessive consciousness, a broken spirit body.",
    ["我懂你，兄弟！压力需要像气球一样被释放！"] = "I understand you, brother! Stress needs to be released like a balloon!",
    ["我成为了“占卜家”，也拥有了一些神奇的能力，能在任务中起到一定作用。"] = "I became a Seer and also possess some magical abilities, which can play a certain role in missions.",
    ["我成为了“占卜家”，也拥有了一些神奇的能力，能在任务中起到一定作用了。"] = "I became a Seer and also possess some magical abilities, which can play a certain role in missions now.",
    ["我成为值夜者的时候，邓恩还是个孩子！"] = "When I became a Nighthawk, Dunn was still a child!",
    ["我成为医生四十年了，有自己的诊所和病人，但我也需要帮助。"] = "I have been a doctor for forty years, with my own clinic and patients, but I also need help.",
    ["我成为非凡者，是为了保护他们，不是……为了变成怪物。"] = "I became a Beyonder to protect them, not... to become a monster.",
    ["我成功了！罗珊女士！我成功了！"] = "I did it! Ms. Rozanne! I did it!",
    ["我我我，我要听风暴之主的神话！"] = "Me me me, I want to hear the myths of the Lord of Storms!",
    ["我所做的，无非是把这些传说与砖石的年代勉强拼接，而真相……恐怕早已沉没在历史的长河里了。"] = "All I've done is barely piece together these legends with the age of the bricks and stones, and the truth... I'm afraid it has long since sunk into the long river of history.",
    ["我所窥见的隐秘，会烧毁你们的心智！"] = "The secrets I have glimpsed will burn your minds to ash!",
    ["我手上就是一张小牌，哦不，是小王吧！哎呀，我怎么会为了赢你用这种下三滥手段呢……"] = "I have a small card in my hand, oh no, it's a small Joker! Oh my, how could I use such low-down methods to win against you...",
    ["我才不会被这张牌吓到。"] = "I won't be scared by this card.",
    ["我才是廷根最时尚的人！"] = "I am the most fashionable person in Tingen!",
    ["我才是您最忠诚的奴仆！"] = "I am your most loyal servant!",
    ["我才是您最忠诚的奴仆！我已经三天三夜没有合眼，只为多看您一眼！"] = "I am your most loyal servant! I haven't closed my eyes for three days and three nights, just to look at you one more time!",
    ["我打算……"] = "I plan to...",
    ["我打算做一个经典招牌，当当当当！“想你的风还是吹到了塔罗学派”，怎么样？"] = "I plan to make a classic sign, da-da-da-da! \"The wind that misses you still blew to the Tarot Club\", how about it?",
    ["我打算找一堆侦探帮我查查是怎么回事……"] = "I plan to find a bunch of detectives to help me investigate what's going on...",
    ["我打算把这些葡萄做成酒，只需要把它们放进木桶，再等待发酵……这一定是小镇上最好喝的葡萄酒！"] = "I plan to turn these grapes into wine; I just need to put them in a barrel and wait for them to ferment... This will surely be the best-tasting wine in town!",
    ["我打算让{{他|她}}再去廷根逛逛，多了解一下这里。"] = "I plan to let {{him|her}} go explore Tingen again and learn more about this place.",
    ["我打算问阿罗德斯一些难以回答的问题。"] = "I plan to ask Arrodes some difficult questions.",
    ["我扮演的是勇者，勇者要每天勤奋练习，收集木棍，成为合格的勇者，才能……"] = "I am acting as a hero. A hero must practice diligently every day, collect wooden sticks, and become a qualified hero, only then can I...",
    ["我找不到他们的灵魂了……"] = "I can no longer find their souls...",
    ["我找不到它们"] = "I can't find them",
    ["我找到了让他不得不同意的理由，最后只赔偿了3苏勒押金，就顺利退租了。"] = "I found a reason that forced him to agree, and in the end, I only paid a 3 soli deposit penalty to successfully terminate the lease.",
    ["我找到正常的食物了！快来吃，不会变成我这样的……"] = "I found normal food! Come and eat, you won't become like me...",
    ["我找遍了集市、花园、还有河边……哪里都没有……"] = "I've searched the market, the garden, and the riverside... they're nowhere...",
    ["我承认……是我动的手，谋害了老爷。"] = "I admit... it was me who did it, who murdered the master.",
    ["我承认他们在艺术学派的演出中比我们更受欢迎，但是在比赛里肯定是我们更出色！"] = "I admit they are more popular than us in the Art School's performances, but we are definitely better in the competition!",
    ["我把东西放在了xxx的一个保险箱里，你想知道的东西都在里面了。"] = "I put the things in a safe in xxx, and everything you want to know is inside.",
    ["我把剩下的火柴一根根点亮 为你引路"] = "I light the remaining matches one by one to guide your way",
    ["我把剩下的火柴一根根点亮，为你引路。"] = "I will light the remaining matches one by one to guide your way.",
    ["我把孩子送去了周日免费学校，希望他将来能和我不一样。"] = "I sent my child to the free Sunday school, hoping he'll be different from me in the future.",
    ["我把它们都做了标记，放在了这缕信息中。"] = "I have marked them all and placed them within this information.",
    ["我把愿望写下来，就像在跟她说话一样。"] = "I write down my wishes, and it's like I'm talking to her.",
    ["我把表扔进垃圾桶，第二天它回到桌上。我把它埋土里，扔树上，带到隔壁镇子，它都回来了！"] = "I threw the watch into the trash can, and the next day it was back on the table. I buried it in the dirt, threw it in a tree, took it to the next town, and it always came back!",
    ["我把这件事和奥兰德也说了，那小子不是家里很有钱吗，扬言要把所有的占卜都试一遍。"] = "I told Orland about this too. Isn't his family very rich? He threatened to try all the divinations.",
    ["我把这种冲动判断成爱好和职业兴趣，最终走上了这条道路。"] = "I judged this impulse to be a hobby and a professional interest, and eventually, I embarked on this path.",
    ["我投资修建的一栋房子塌了，我以为已经够倒霉了。"] = "A building I invested in collapsed; I thought that was bad luck enough.",
    ["我报考了历史系——廷根历史系是鲁恩最好的。"] = "I applied for the History Department—the Tingen History Department is the best in Loen.",
    ["我报销的单子去哪——啊，{{PlayerName}}？你也来练习射击吗？"] = "Where did my reimbursement form go—ah, {{PlayerName}}? Are you here to practice shooting too?",
    ["我担心是我造成了这场灾难，我想要阻止它。"] = "I am worried that I caused this disaster, and I want to stop it.",
    ["我担心这里的情况。"] = "I'm worried about the situation here.",
    ["我拉你上来！"] = "I'll pull you up!",
    ["我拉着她的手走开了，\r\n她也没有拒绝。"] = "I took her hand and walked away,\r\nand she did not refuse.",
    ["我拍到了……！"] = "I photographed...! ",
    ["我拒绝"] = "I refuse",
    ["我拒绝回答。"] = "I refuse to answer.",
    ["我拒绝回答这个问题。"] = "I refuse to answer this question.",
    ["我拒绝，像你这种自以为是的家伙，我才没兴趣呢。"] = "I refuse. I have no interest in someone as self-righteous as you.",
    ["我拥有"] = "Owned",
    ["我拿错牌了？这张牌是怎么回事？"] = "Did I take the wrong card? What's going on with this card?",
    ["我指着桌面上的划痕和污渍，跟老板磨了二十分钟，最后砍到原价的三成。"] = "I pointed at the scratches and stains on the tabletop and haggled with the boss for twenty minutes, finally cutting it down to 30% of the original price.",
    ["我接受"] = "I accept",
    ["我推荐你在花海里多走走，不一会儿就能遇见呢。"] = "I recommend you walk around the sea of flowers more; you might just run into them soon.",
    ["我推荐苏尼亚海的珊瑚岛，那里有位“水手”途径的民宿老板，他的房子建在会移动的巨龟背上。"] = "I recommend the Coral Island in the Sonia Sea. There is a homestay owner of the 'Sailor' pathway there, and his house is built on the back of a giant moving turtle.",
    ["我揣在身上，越来越冷，越来越觉得活着没意思……我们这样的人，哪个没想过死呢……"] = "I kept them on me, and I felt colder and colder, feeling more and more that life was meaningless... Which of us people hasn't thought about death...",
    ["我摸过了石墙的粗糙、雨的冰凉、花瓣的柔软……但是光是什么样的呢，我怎么也摸不到。"] = "I've touched the roughness of stone walls, the coldness of rain, the softness of petals... but what is light like? I can't touch it no matter what.",
    ["我撒谎说公司给我们放半天假，然后假装出门。可是走到这里，突然就不会走了。"] = "I lied and said the company gave us a half-day off, then pretended to go out. But when I walked here, I suddenly didn't know how to continue.",
    ["我擅长格斗、射击、攀爬、感应和一些辅助工作，也擅长用诗篇对敌人造成影响。"] = "I specialize in combat, marksmanship, climbing, sensing, and some support work, and I am also skilled at using poems to influence enemies.",
    ["我擦、我擦……"] = "Wiping, wiping...",
    ["我支持你！查理！"] = "I support you! Charlie!",
    ["我支持你，约瑟夫！等你当上学生会长了，能不能要求学校把那栋高级宿舍分给我们住？"] = "I support you, Joseph! When you become student body president, can you demand the school allocate that high-end dorm for us to live in?",
    ["我收到了一封详实而可靠的<P_Yellow>举报信</>，控诉你在南大陆秘密加入了邪神教派，还参与了邪恶的献祭仪式，组织了针对平民的恐怖袭击！"] = "I have received a detailed and reliable <P_Yellow> denunciation letter </>, accusing you of secretly joining an evil god cult in the Southern Continent, participating in an evil Sacrifice Ritual, and organizing terrorist attacks against civilians!",
    ["我收藏了些很有趣的作品。比如那幅《梦见星空的羔羊》，盯着看久了会发现云朵在缓慢流动。"] = "I have collected some very interesting works. For example, that painting 'Lamb Dreaming of the Starry Sky'; if you stare at it for a long time, you will find the clouds moving slowly.",
    ["我放弃！"] = "I give up!",
    ["我救了人，永暗蜡烛缺少了足够的亡魂……"] = "I saved people, so the Candle of Eternal Darkness lacks enough souls...",
    ["我救了其中六个人，但不找到幕后之人，受害者还会增加。"] = "I saved six of them, but if I don't find the person behind the scenes, the number of victims will continue to increase.",
    ["我敢保证没人能学会弹奏乐器！"] = "I guarantee no one would ever learn to play an instrument!",
    ["我敢保证，这杯一定会引发你肚子的风暴。"] = "I guarantee this will definitely cause a storm in your stomach.",
    ["我敢出1便士打赌，二副不会为他出这笔钱。"] = "I bet 1 penny that the second mate won't pay this money for him.",
    ["我敢肯定她的眼里只有那些街景。"] = "I'm sure she only has eyes for those street views.",
    ["我敢说它一定会震撼你！"] = "I dare say it will shock you!",
    ["我整天就……嗝，在这里喝酒。把年幼的女儿晾在店里……她还那么小，我却……嗝，没能承担起，作为父亲的责任……"] = "I spend all day... *hic*, drinking here. Leaving my young daughter in the shop... She's still so small, but I... *hic*, failed to fulfill my responsibility as a father...",
    ["我方"] = "Our Side",
    ["我方%s击败首领，获得额外伤害贡献。"] = "Our %s defeated the boss, gaining extra damage contribution.",
    ["我方%s职业对局可参与人数已达上限，无法进入。"] = "The number of participants for our %s profession has reached the limit; cannot enter.",
    ["我方上场"] = "Our participation",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>传送召集</>，己方<PVPHighlight>可从己方出生点快速传送至目标传送点</>"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Teleportation Rally </>. Our faction <PVPHighlight> can quickly teleport from our spawn point to the target teleport point </>.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>克敌宣言</>，己方阵营<PVPHighlight>全体成员增加15%全途径压制</>，持续20秒"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>. All members of our faction <PVPHighlight> gain 15% suppression across all pathways </> for 20 seconds.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>召集传送</>，<PVPHighlight>召集我方全体成员传送至集结点</>"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Rally Teleport </>, <PVPHighlight> summoning all our members to teleport to the rally point </>.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>圣域庇佑</>，<PVPHighlight>己方全部守卫恢复50%最大生命值</>"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Sanctuary Protection </>, <PVPHighlight> restoring 50% of the maximum Health of all our guards </>.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>归零敕令</>，移除我方全体成员<PVPHighlight>当前复活出战等待时间，包括5秒内阵亡的队友</>"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Zeroing Edict </>, removing the current resurrection wait time for all our members <PVPHighlight>, including teammates who died within the last 5 seconds </>.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>急行进军</>，全员<PVPHighlight>移动速度提升60%</>，持续10秒"] = "Our side used the skill <PVPHighlight> Forced March </>, increasing the movement speed of all members <PVPHighlight> by 60% </> for 10 seconds.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>攻城械助</>，己方<PVPHighlight>基地召唤出1辆炮车，炮车可对敌方防御塔造成高额伤害</>"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Siege Equipment Assistance </>. A Cannon Carriage is summoned at our base <PVPHighlight>, which can deal high damage to enemy defensive towers </>.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>破城号角</>，己方阵营<PVPHighlight>全体成员增加30%建筑压制</>，持续20秒"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> City-Breaking Horn </>. All members of our faction <PVPHighlight> gain 30% building suppression </> for 20 seconds.",
    ["我方使用技能<PVPHighlight>祝佑高塔</>，己方阵营<PVPHighlight>目标防御塔获得高额防御护盾</>，持续10秒"] = "We used the skill <PVPHighlight> Blessing of the High Tower </>. Target defensive towers of our faction <PVPHighlight> gain a high-value defensive shield </> for 10 seconds.",
    ["我方俱乐部分数已低于对方俱乐部%s分，宣战失败！"] = "Our club's score is %s points lower than the opposing club; we have lost the war!",
    ["我方俱乐部分数已超过对方俱乐部%s分，宣战获胜！"] = "Our club's score has exceeded the opposing club by %s points; we have won the war!",
    ["我方俱乐部向<Highlight_L>[%s]</>发起宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[今天%s]</>，等待对方俱乐部响应。"] = "Our club has declared war on <Highlight_L>[%s]</>. The start time is <Highlight_L>[Today %s]</>. Waiting for the opposing club to respond.",
    ["我方俱乐部向<Highlight_L>[%s]</>发起宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[明天%s]</>，等待对方俱乐部响应。"] = "Our club has declared war on <Highlight_L>[%s]</>. The start time is <Highlight_L>[Tomorrow %s]</>. Waiting for the opposing club to respond.",
    ["我方俱乐部成功占领了%s，占领进度获得100点提升。"] = "Our club successfully occupied %s, and the occupation progress increased by 100 points.",
    ["我方俱乐部的<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>将旗帜立在了<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[霍纳奇斯山脉(%d,%d)分线%s]</>，点击前往守护！旗帜持续时间结束或旗帜被抢占后将轮换立旗权！"] = "Our club's <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has planted the flag at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[Hornacis Mountain Range (%d, %d) Sub-channel %s]</>. Click to go and guard it! The flag planting right will rotate after the duration ends or the flag is captured!",
    ["我方俱乐部的发起集结正在冷却中，请%s秒后再试！"] = "Our club's assembly is on cooldown; please try again in %s seconds!",
    ["我方势力护盾"] = "Allied Faction Shield",
    ["我方势力标记"] = "Allied Faction Mark",
    ["我方占领的 <PVPHighlight>%s号</> 幻影守卫已刷新 。"] = "The <PVPHighlight> %s-numbered </> Phantom Guardian captured by our faction has refreshed.",
    ["我方参与投影数 %s"] = "Our participating projections: %s",
    ["我方发起了撤退信号"] = "We have initiated a retreat signal.",
    ["我方发起了警示信号"] = "We have initiated a warning signal.",
    ["我方发起了进攻信号"] = "We have initiated an attack signal.",
    ["我方发起了集合信号"] = "We have initiated a gather signal.",
    ["我方复活点"] = "Our respawn point",
    ["我方已击毁<PVPHighlight>敌方一级塔</>，获得<PVPHighlight>1400点资源点</>"] = "We have destroyed <PVPHighlight> enemy Tier 1 Tower </>, gaining <PVPHighlight>1400 resource points</>.",
    ["我方已击毁<PVPHighlight>敌方三级塔</>，获得<PVPHighlight>2800点资源点</>"] = "We have destroyed <PVPHighlight> enemy Tier 3 Tower </>, gaining <PVPHighlight>2800 resource points</>.",
    ["我方已击毁<PVPHighlight>敌方二级塔</>，获得<PVPHighlight>2100点资源点</>"] = "We have destroyed <PVPHighlight> enemy Tier 2 Tower </>, gaining <PVPHighlight>2100 resource points</>.",
    ["我方已成功占领据点！"] = "We have successfully captured the stronghold!",
    ["我方接受了<Highlight_L>[%s]</>发起的宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[今天%s]</>！"] = "We have accepted the declaration of war from <Highlight_L>[%s]</>. The war starts at <Highlight_L>[Today %s]</>!",
    ["我方接受了<Highlight_L>[%s]</>发起的宣战，开战时间为<Highlight_L>[明天%s]</>！"] = "We have accepted the declaration of war from <Highlight_L>[%s]</>. The war starts at <Highlight_L>[Tomorrow %s]</>!",
    ["我方汇集锚点已出现，请前往激活"] = "Our gathering anchor has appeared. Please go and activate it.",
    ["我方率先攻占<PVPHighlight>%s</>，获得<PVPHighlight>50点积分</>。"] = "We were the first to capture <PVPHighlight> %s </>, gaining <PVPHighlight> 50 points </>.",
    ["我方阵营成功<PVPHighlight>占领祭坛</>，<PVPHighlight>于己方基地召唤超级载具</>，可前往使用"] = "Our faction successfully <PVPHighlight> captured the altar </>, <PVPHighlight> summoning a super vehicle at our base </>. You may go and use it.",
    ["我旁边的这位吗，她是我奶奶。别看她现在年纪大了有点健忘，年轻时是一位优秀的医生。"] = "The one next to me? She is my grandmother. Don't look at her as being a bit forgetful now that she's old; she was an excellent doctor when she was young.",
    ["我无法停下探索未知的脚步。"] = "I cannot stop my steps in exploring the unknown.",
    ["我无法停下追逐未知的脚步"] = "I cannot stop my pursuit of the unknown.",
    ["我无法再在你的身上看到人性，过去的你至少偶尔会让我感到温暖，但现在的你，才是一个真正的怪物。"] = "I can no longer see any humanity in you. The you from the past would at least occasionally make me feel warmth, but the you now is a true monster.",
    ["我无法回答这个问题，我只能告诉你不变的真理。"] = "I cannot answer that question, I can only tell you the unchanging truth.",
    ["我无法思考，只能用所有的时间去绘制南大陆的地图……"] = "I can't think, I can only use all my time to draw the map of the Southern Continent...",
    ["我无法抗拒嗜血冲动，忍不住到处咬鸭脖子。"] = "I cannot resist the urge for blood, and can't help but bite duck necks everywhere.",
    ["我无法控制……"] = "I cannot control it...",
    ["我早上查了你这个月的材料额度，很遗憾，已经用完了。"] = "I checked your material quota for this month this morning; unfortunately, it has already been used up.",
    ["我早就不怕了……这里真的很不错，克莱恩，欢迎你的加入。"] = "I haven't been afraid for a long time... It's really nice here, Klein. Welcome to the team.",
    ["我早就不怕了，从商业学校毕业后我就来这里工作了，很高兴能遇到这样的一群人。"] = "I haven't been afraid for a long time. After graduating from business school, I came here to work. I'm very happy to have met such a group of people.",
    ["我早就习惯了死亡，可是从今以后，我真的一无所有了。"] = "I have long been accustomed to death, but from now on, I really have nothing left.",
    ["我早就注意到这位“学徒”了，也和弗莱队长商量了。"] = "I had already noticed this \"Apprentice\" and discussed it with Captain Frye.",
    ["我早就说过嘛！教会迟早会拒绝支票捐款的。"] = "I told you! The church would refuse check donations sooner or later.",
    ["我早就说过，多加几场戏不就好了？"] = "I said it before, wouldn't it be better to just add a few more scenes?",
    ["我早就购置了一年的啤酒份额，好东西就是要用来分享啊！"] = "I already purchased a year's worth of beer; good things are meant to be shared!",
    ["我早已分不清疯狂和清醒的边界。但我知道，只要我还活着，就不会让白银城陷入黑暗。"] = "I have long since been unable to distinguish the boundary between madness and sobriety. But I know that as long as I am alive, I will not let the City of Silver fall into darkness.",
    ["我早已双手染血，两足深陷于血泊中。"] = "My hands have long been stained with blood, and my feet are deep in a pool of gore.",
    ["我早年意外成为非凡者后，为了获得更多创作的灵感，我违背了很多原则。我过于深入别人的生活，窥探人们最隐秘的情感。也正因如此，我写下了无数杰作。"] = "After I accidentally became a Beyonder in my early years, I violated many principles to gain more creative inspiration. I delved too deeply into other people's lives and pried into their most secret emotions. It is precisely because of this that I have written countless masterpieces.",
    ["我早晚也能造出铁甲舰那样精巧的庞然大物！"] = "Sooner or later, I will also be able to build such an exquisite, massive ironclad warship!",
    ["我早该料到这个结果的……伊琳在二十几年前就断绝了和我的联系。"] = "I should have expected this result... Irene cut off all contact with me over twenty years ago.",
    ["我早该知道是这样。可还是想亲自看看……"] = "I should have known it was like that. But I still wanted to see for myself...",
    ["我早起……去码头……"] = "I get up early... to go to the dock...",
    ["我时刻期盼着乐曲完成的那一天。\n可是，还没等乐曲完成，艾登就要离开济贫院了。"] = "I am constantly looking forward to the day the music is finished. \n However, before the music could be completed, Aiden had to leave the poorhouse.",
    ["我明天带照片来诊所！"] = "I'll bring a photo to the clinic tomorrow!",
    ["我明明在树上刻了箭头……但我怎么还被困在森林迷宫中……"] = "I clearly carved arrows on the trees... But why am I still trapped in the forest maze...",
    ["我明明是一个人！你侮辱我人格！接招！ "] = "I'm clearly just one person! You're insulting my character! Take this!",
    ["我明明没见过你，可是你一直出现在我的梦里。"] = "I clearly haven't met you before, yet you keep appearing in my dreams.",
    ["我明明记得许多贵族都常以家族名义开具支票捐款的呀…… "] = "I clearly remember that many nobles often issued checks in the name of their families to make donations...",
    ["我明白……"] = "I understand...",
    ["我明白……乔纳尔，请让我和{{他|她}}<P_Yellow>单独</>谈谈。"] = "I understand... Jonar, please let me speak with {{him|her}}<P_Yellow> alone</>.",
    ["我明白。"] = "I understand.",
    ["我明白。但末日将近，我必须足够强大，才能走向我的命运。"] = "I understand. But the apocalypse is near; I must be strong enough to walk toward my fate.",
    ["我明白。我这次回廷根，就是要和你一起查清真相，守护廷根。"] = "I understand. My return to Tingen this time is to uncover the truth with you and guard Tingen.",
    ["我明白了"] = "I understand",
    ["我明白了……"] = "I understand...",
    ["我明白了。"] = "I understand.",
    ["我明白了。“星星”先生……我该去哪里找他呢？"] = "I understand. Mr. Star... where should I go to find him?",
    ["我明白了。可现在他们不愿意让你进去……"] = "I understand. But now they won't let you in...",
    ["我明白了。汉娜女士，请不要让任何人进入卧室，直到我们出去。"] = "I understand. Ms. Hannah, please do not let anyone enter the bedroom until we come out.",
    ["我明白了。让我在外面帮你吧，我可以为你指路，你也可以指挥我帮忙。"] = "I understand. Let me help you from the outside; I can guide you, and you can command me to help.",
    ["我明白了。谢谢您的朋友，也赞美“愚者”先生。"] = "I understand. Thank you to your friend, and praise Mr. Fool.",
    ["我明白了。这就是我今晚在这里的意义——见证这一切。"] = "I understand. This is the meaning of me being here tonight—to witness all of this.",
    ["我明白了。都有什么可以点的？我想试试看。"] = "I understand. What can I order? I'd like to try it.",
    ["我明白了。需要我做什么？"] = "I understand. What do you need me to do?",
    ["我明白了！他们其实是最好的朋友！"] = "I get it! They're actually best friends!",
    ["我明白了！我明白了！"] = "I understand! I understand!",
    ["我明白了！我有灵感了！应该这么写！"] = "I understand! I have inspiration! I should write it like this!",
    ["我明白了，你们是想让我帮忙转交这些礼物，对吗？ 他们最近任务确实排得很满……不过我大概知道谁现在有空。"] = "I understand, you want me to help pass on these gifts, right? They have indeed been very busy with tasks recently... but I probably know who is free now.",
    ["我明白了，你继续去询问附近的住户，要详细询问。"] = "I understand. Continue questioning the nearby residents, and be thorough.",
    ["我明白了，你要靠自己卖报攒钱吗？"] = "I see. Are you planning to save money by selling newspapers on your own?",
    ["我明白了，变化是阿兹克先生您救下的那六个自杀者！"] = "I understand, the change is the six suicide victims you saved, Mr. Azik!",
    ["我明白了，怪不得刚才这扇门看起来很危险……"] = "I understand, no wonder this door looked so dangerous just now...",
    ["我明白了，我来同幸存者交涉。"] = "I understand. I will go and negotiate with the survivor.",
    ["我明白了，是那个非凡的八音盒，将她的记忆和执念化作了城堡。"] = "I understand, it was that extraordinary music box that turned her memories and obsessions into a castle.",
    ["我明白了，是邮差骑的那种脚踏车吗？"] = "I understand, is it the kind of bicycle the postman rides?",
    ["我明白了，晋升可以让我变得更强大……"] = "I understand, advancement can make me stronger...",
    ["我明白了，请随我来。"] = "I understand, please follow me.",
    ["我明白了，谢谢您。"] = "I understand, thank you.",
    ["我明白了，谢谢您的提醒。"] = "I understand, thank you for the reminder.",
    ["我明白了，谢谢您，伦纳德先生。"] = "I understand, thank you, Mr. Leonard.",
    ["我明白了，还有其他信息吗？"] = "I understand, is there any other information?",
    ["我明白了，那唤醒大帝残存意志的事就让我们来试试吧。"] = "I understand. Then let us try to awaken the Emperor's residual will.",
    ["我明白了，那您可以试试这一套。"] = "I understand, then you can try this set.",
    ["我明白你的意思"] = "I understand what you mean",
    ["我明白的，克莱恩，不用给自己太大压力。"] = "I understand, Klein, don't put too much pressure on yourself.",
    ["我明白的，我只是有些……不知道该怎么办了。"] = "I understand, I just... I don't know what to do.",
    ["我明白，只要我保守秘密，就不会有其他问题了，对吧？"] = "I understand. As long as I keep the secret, there won't be any other problems, right?",
    ["我明白，可“正义”女士说，您会指引我加入非凡者组织？"] = "I understand, but Miss Justice said you would guide me to join a Beyonder organization?",
    ["我明白，弗莱队长，我会小心处理的。"] = "I understand, Captain Frye. I will handle it carefully.",
    ["我明白，总有一天会攒够的。接下来你要去哪里？"] = "I understand, one day you will save enough. Where are you going next?",
    ["我明白，我曾是个护士，知道战争有多残酷，你们受到的伤害是无法抹平的。"] = "I understand. I used to be a nurse and know how cruel war is; the trauma you have suffered cannot be erased.",
    ["我明白，毕竟你连我的生日都会忘记。如果你能记住自己的生日，那我们都需要提高警惕了。"] = "I understand. After all, you would even forget my birthday. If you could remember your own birthday, we would all need to be on high alert.",
    ["我明白，独处也是一项能力。"] = "I understand, being alone is also a skill.",
    ["我明白，茉莉安……明天，我们去石像旁看看那些勇敢的人们吧。"] = "I understand, Morian... Tomorrow, let's go to the statues and see those brave people.",
    ["我明白，跟这群孩子们呆在一起，我都感觉自己年轻了不少。"] = "I understand. Staying with this group of children makes me feel much younger.",
    ["我明白，迎接完新人，我也加入调查。"] = "I understand. After welcoming the newcomer, I will join the investigation.",
    ["我明白，这些问题对任何人来说都很重要，但你身上蕴藏巨大的谜团和危险。"] = "I understand. These questions are very important to anyone, but you are shrouded in huge mysteries and dangers.",
    ["我昨天在老实人报上看到了一篇关于灵能现象的报道，魔法一定是存在的！"] = "I saw a report on psychic phenomena in the Honest Newspaper yesterday. Magic must exist!",
    ["我昨天晚上心情不好，一不小心就喝多了，所以才头晕眼花的，走错了门。"] = "I was in a bad mood last night and accidentally drank too much, so I was dizzy and went to the wrong door.",
    ["我昨天来了，前天来了，前五个月每天都来。"] = "I came yesterday, I came the day before, I've come every day for the past five months.",
    ["我昨晚梦见自己变成了贝克兰德那个霍尔家的孩子。"] = "I dreamed last night that I became a child of the Hall family in Backlund.",
    ["我昨晚看见队长装好枪就走了出去，据说，开膛手也是昨晚被击毙的……"] = "I saw the Captain load his gun and head out last night. It is said that the Ripper was also shot dead last night...",
    ["我昨晚远远看见，附近有个黑影活动，鬼鬼祟祟的……"] = "I saw a black shadow moving nearby from afar last night, acting sneakily...",
    ["我是#CanMove愚者#，也是克莱恩"] = "I am #CanMove The Fool #, and also Klein",
    ["我是“学徒”途径的卡门，刚刚在树上对地面使用了“开门”……结果卡住了。现在还有一个不知名的东西在戳我的屁股……"] = "I am Carmen of the 'Apprentice' pathway. I just used 'Door Opening' on the ground while up in a tree... and ended up getting stuck. Now there is some unknown thing poking my butt...",
    ["我是“学徒”途径的卡门，本想用点“特别的方式”穿墙取宝箱，结果……如你所见，我把自己卡住了。 帮我出来，宝箱和钥匙都归你！"] = "I am Carmen of the 'Apprentice' pathway. I intended to use a 'special method' to pass through the wall and get the treasure chest, but... as you can see, I got myself stuck. Help me out, and the treasure chest and the key are all yours!",
    ["我是“愚者”先生最忠实的仆从魔镜阿罗德斯，你所见到的只是一个分身，我的本体还陪伴在主人的身边。"] = "I am the most loyal servant of Mr. Fool, the Magic Mirror Arrodes. What you see is only an avatar; my true body is still by my master's side.",
    ["我是“通灵者”戴莉，住在恩马特港，这次来协助邓恩的工作。"] = "I am the \"Spirit Medium\" Daly, I live in Enmat Port, and I am here to assist Dunn's work this time.",
    ["我是……"] = "I am...",
    ["我是……嗝，我是个失败的父亲……"] = "I am... *hic*, I am a failed father...",
    ["我是。"] = "I am.",
    ["我是一个\r\n不负责的母亲"] = "I am an\r\nirresponsible mother.",
    ["我是一个喜欢等价交换的人，不会让你们无条件帮忙。"] = "I am a person who likes equivalent exchange and will not let you help unconditionally.",
    ["我是一个心理医生。希望你能睡个好觉。"] = "I am a psychologist. I hope you can have a good sleep.",
    ["我是一位四处贸易的行商。我听说不同城堡之间的行情有所差异，正准备来看看这儿的情况。"] = "I am a traveling merchant. I heard that market conditions vary between different castles, so I'm preparing to see the situation here.",
    ["我是一名警察，官方的猎犬，你不能和我说话。"] = "I am a police officer, a hound of the authorities; you cannot speak to me.",
    ["我是一朵蘑菇。"] = "I am a mushroom.",
    ["我是一朵蘑菇，我不会饿……"] = "I am a mushroom, I do not get hungry...",
    ["我是不是太贪心了？以为它会变成点什么。"] = "Was I too greedy? Thinking it would turn into something.",
    ["我是不是就不会那么孤单？"] = "Would I not be less lonely then?",
    ["我是不是很棒很棒的孩子，嘿嘿。"] = "Am I a very, very good child? Hehe.",
    ["我是不是很糟糕？你、你告诉我……呜呕……呜，我的女儿，我懂事的可怜的小莉迪……"] = "Am I terrible? You, you tell me... *hic*... Wuwu, my daughter, my sensible, poor little Liddy...",
    ["我是不是该去换一个发型？"] = "Should I go change my hairstyle?",
    ["我是个占星术爱好者，大家叫我观星的弗洛，你也许听说过我？"] = "I am an astrology enthusiast. Everyone calls me Star-Gazing Flo. Perhaps you have heard of me?",
    ["我是个慷慨的赌徒，只是需要一位……可靠的协助者。"] = "I am a generous Gambler, I just need a... reliable assistant.",
    ["我是个流浪汉……我的猫可不是流浪猫……"] = "I am a homeless person... my cat is not a stray cat...",
    ["我是个美食家，其他事和我无关。这道菜告诉我，库克值得再拥有一次机会。"] = "I am a gourmet, other things have nothing to do with me. This dish tells me that Cook deserves another chance.",
    ["我是个退伍军士，身上老毛病不少，只能回家养病。可偏偏闲不下来，不如给自己安排点事做。"] = "I'm a retired sergeant with quite a few old ailments, so I can only go home to recuperate. But I can't stay idle, so I might as well arrange something to do.",
    ["我是亚伦，来告知奥莉薇女士她丈夫泰利的死讯。请问你是？"] = "I am Aaron, here to inform Ms. Olivia of the death of her husband, Terry. May I ask who you are?",
    ["我是从乡下来城里找工作的，急需住处，您看您能不能帮忙介绍一下……"] = "I came to the city from the countryside to find work and am in urgent need of a place to stay. Could you please help me introduce it...",
    ["我是从外省来的，替病愈的父亲来圣赛缪尔教堂还愿。女神保佑，现在想想我是凭着多大的运气竟然自己摸索到了这里！"] = "I came from the provinces to fulfill a vow at Saint Samuel Cathedral for my father who has recovered from illness. Goddess bless, now that I think about it, what luck I had to actually find my way here on my own!",
    ["我是伊妮德啊 {{先生|姐姐}}睡迷糊了 不会连自己叫什么都忘了吧？"] = "I'm Enid. {{Mr.|Sister}}, are you so sleepy that you've forgotten your own name?",
    ["我是伊妮德啊，{{先生|姐姐}}睡迷糊了，你不会连自己叫什么都忘了吧？"] = "I'm Enid. You must be sleepy, {{Sir|Miss}}; you wouldn't have forgotten your own name, would you?",
    ["我是伊妮德，这里是廷根湖。"] = "I am Enid, and this is Tingen Lake.",
    ["我是你二大爷"] = "I am your great-uncle.",
    ["我是你二大爷啊"] = "I am your great-uncle, really.",
    ["我是你妈妈，妈妈总会站在你这边。"] = "I am your mother, and a mother will always be on your side.",
    ["我是你的心理医生，你可以叫我“正义”女士。恭喜你，这次的心理治疗很成功。"] = "I am your psychologist; you may call me Ms. Justice. Congratulations, this therapy session was a success.",
    ["我是供品？"] = "Am I an offering?",
    ["我是俱乐部的驻场交易员艾伯特，很高兴为您服务。"] = "I am Albert, the resident trader of the Club, happy to serve you.",
    ["我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，就住在附近。"] = "I am Klein Moretti, I live nearby.",
    ["我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，来找邓恩先生入职的。"] = "I am Klein Moretti, here to find Mr. Dunn to start my job.",
    ["我是克莱恩，今天来入职成为文职人员，罗珊小姐让我下楼去找邓恩先生。"] = "I am Klein. I came today to start my job as a clerical staff member. Miss Rozanne told me to go downstairs to find Mr. Dunn.",
    ["我是公主啊！我的勇者们说好会打败恶龙，拯救我们的国家！结果，结果……"] = "I'm a princess! My heroes promised they would defeat the evil dragon and save our kingdom! But, but...",
    ["我是区"] = "I am the district",
    ["我是发广告的,求法飞<img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/>"] = "I'm posting an ad, looking for a flight<img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/><img id=\"#136\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" valign=\"0.5\"/>",
    ["我是吉斯达，今年33岁，住在水仙花街，未婚，我只是一个想过平静生活的普通上班族。"] = "I am Gista, 33 years old this year, living on Daffodil Street, unmarried. I am just an ordinary office worker who wants to live a peaceful life.",
    ["我是哪一类"] = "Which category am I in?",
    ["我是喝咖啡，还是喝甜冰茶呢？"] = "Should I have coffee, or sweet iced tea?",
    ["我是在酒馆听铁匠说的，他说这比向女神祈祷还灵验……哦不，女神啊，我没那个意思！"] = "I heard it from the blacksmith at the tavern; he said it's even more effective than praying to the Goddess... Oh no, Goddess, I didn't mean it like that!",
    ["我是夏洛特·多诺万，顶层客房的服务领班，登船期间将竭诚为您效劳。"] = "I am Charlotte Donovan, the service lead for the top-floor guest rooms. I will do my utmost to serve you during your voyage.",
    ["我是女人，我上女厕，我坐着尿尿。"] = "I am a woman, I use the women's restroom, and I sit to pee.",
    ["我是好孩子，我要帮上姐姐的忙，让她吃上新鲜的面包！"] = "I am a good child, I want to help my sister so she can eat fresh bread!",
    ["我是如此怀念我的私人马车！"] = "I miss my private carriage so much!",
    ["我是工厂的负责人，哪位先生能解释一下情况？"] = "I am the person in charge of the factory. Which gentleman can explain the situation?",
    ["我是废物……我什么都写不出来……"] = "I'm trash... I can't write anything...",
    ["我是廷根之王！"] = "I am the King of Tingen!",
    ["我是怎么穿越的？我只是个生活在21世纪的普通人，最近除了倒霉点，也没什么特殊啊。"] = "How did I transmigrate? I'm just an ordinary person living in the 21st century. Recently, besides being a bit unlucky, there's nothing special.",
    ["我是您的忠实读者"] = "I am your loyal reader",
    ["我是想来问问你，为什么芥末章鱼的肉没了以前的嚼劲？"] = "I wanted to ask you, why does the mustard octopus meat lack its previous chewiness?",
    ["我是无辜的……放我出去……"] = "I am innocent... let me out...",
    ["我是无辜的！放我出去！"] = "I am innocent! Let me out!",
    ["我是春夜舞会的接引人，莉丝·埃文斯。"] = "I am the guide for the Spring Night Ball, Lise Evans.",
    ["我是有点恐高，我很感激你。"] = "I am a bit afraid of heights, but I appreciate it.",
    ["我是来帮梅丽莎取东西的，伦纳德替她找到了毕业论文需要的钟表图纸。"] = "I'm here to pick up some things for Melissa. Leonard found the clock blueprints she needed for her graduation thesis.",
    ["我是来报丧的，你知道住在这里的奥莉薇女士去哪里了吗？"] = "I am here to report a death. Do you know where Ms. Olivia, who lives here, has gone?",
    ["我是格雷，负责本俱乐部的日常接待。"] = "I am Gray, responsible for the daily reception of this Club.",
    ["我是正直的诊所医生，畅销小说作者！"] = "I am an honest clinic doctor and a best-selling novelist!",
    ["我是流浪汉，但我的狗不是流浪狗。"] = "I am a homeless man, but my dog is not a stray dog.",
    ["我是激动，对，激动。"] = "I'm excited, right, excited.",
    ["我是狒狒"] = "I am a baboon",
    ["我是玛丽，就住在隔壁，有什么能帮上忙的吗？"] = "I am Mary, I live right next door. Is there anything I can help with?",
    ["我是生气，气你瞒着我。"] = "I am angry, angry that you kept it from me.",
    ["我是男的"] = "I am a man",
    ["我是科恩黎，她是西迦，欢迎你加入我们。"] = "I am Cohen, she is Xiga, welcome to join us.",
    ["我是第一次来，这里……有什么可看的？ "] = "I'm here for the first time, is there... anything to see here?",
    ["我是第十二个，只有找个替死鬼，才能摆脱诅咒。"] = "I am the twelfth; only by finding a scapegoat can I get rid of the curse.",
    ["我是罗珊 以后我们就是同事了！"] = "I am Rozanne, we will be colleagues from now on!",
    ["我是罗珊，以后我们就是同事了！"] = "I am Rozanne, we will be colleagues from now on!",
    ["我是蘑菇"] = "I am a Mushroom",
    ["我是西比尔，您是今天第一位来占卜的人，免费。"] = "I am Sybil. You are the first person to come for a divination today, so it's free.",
    ["我是说……理论上，您比他强？"] = "I mean... theoretically, you are stronger than him?",
    ["我是说他的结局吧。"] = "I mean his ending.",
    ["我是说可米娅，您身边那位可爱的小淑女。"] = "I mean Comia, the cute little lady beside you.",
    ["我是说，什么都好，只要能和您一起。"] = "I mean, anything is fine, as long as I can be with you.",
    ["我是说，我的意思是说，我有一个从来都勤勤恳恳、老实本分的朋友，但有一次鬼迷心窍犯了错……"] = "I mean, what I mean is, I have a friend who has always been diligent and honest, but once, in a moment of weakness, he made a mistake...",
    ["我是说，这能让我一直想着你。"] = "I mean, this will let me keep thinking of you.",
    ["我是说，邀请你看看小黛西短暂人生中，最快乐的时候。"] = "I mean, I invite you to see the happiest time in Little Daisy's short life.",
    ["我是谁"] = "Who am I?",
    ["我是谁……我是侠盗黑皇帝……带你走……"] = "Who am I... I am the Phantom Thief Black Emperor... take you away...",
    ["我是负责廷根大学招聘事务的教员。"] = "I am a faculty member responsible for recruitment at Tingen University.",
    ["我是负责这起案件的警察。发生这种事，我真的很抱歉。"] = "I am the police officer in charge of this case. I am truly sorry that this happened.",
    ["我是这的掘墓人，你需要挖坟，还是来调查老特勒的？"] = "I am the gravedigger here. Do you need a grave dug, or are you here to investigate Old Trelle?",
    ["我是邓恩·史密斯 廷根市值夜者小队队长"] = "I am Dunn Smith, captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad.",
    ["我是郡警察厅的心理学专家，见习督查。"] = "I am a psychology expert from the County Police Department, a probationary inspector.",
    ["我是铁十字街之王！"] = "I am the King of Iron Cross Street!",
    ["我是问你，好不好看！"] = "I'm asking you, does it look good or not!",
    ["我是鲁伯特男爵的私生子！"] = "I am the illegitimate son of Baron Rupert!",
    ["我是鲁恩的士兵，我所在的小队和大部队走散了……"] = "I am a soldier of Loen, and the squad I was in got separated from the main force...",
    ["我是黑荆棘安保公司前台 罗珊"] = "I am Rozanne, the receptionist at Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["我暂时不会带走3-888。但你们在黛西小姐身上的尝试，间接害死两位仆人和一位管家……"] = "I will not take 3-888 away for the time being. But your attempts on Miss Daisy indirectly caused the deaths of two servants and a butler...",
    ["我暂时不需要买狗"] = "I don't need to buy a dog for now",
    ["我更喜欢“通灵者”这个称号。"] = "I prefer the title 'Spirit Medium'.",
    ["我曾...白塔...秘术..."] = "I once... White Tower... mysticism...",
    ["我曾向祂许愿财富，凭借祂给的好运和胆识，我得到了那座庄园。"] = "I once prayed to Him for wealth, and with the good luck and courage He bestowed, I obtained that manor.",
    ["我曾在一次占卜后，<P_Yellow>得知了错误的结论</>，与我的命运擦肩而过——如今我在等的那个真相，就是<P_Yellow>命运给我新的指引</>。"] = "I once <P_Yellow>obtained an incorrect conclusion</> after a divination, and missed my fate—the truth I am waiting for now is <P_Yellow>the new guidance fate has given me</>.",
    ["我曾在南大陆看过拳赛，他们在台上就像相互撕咬的鬣狗。"] = "I once watched a boxing match in the Southern Continent; they were like hyenas biting each other on the stage.",
    ["我曾在过去的很长一段时间里，将人生中那些不得志、不顺意的东西归结到你身上。"] = "For a long time in the past, I blamed you for all the frustrations and setbacks in my life.",
    ["我曾想，如果我人生中每一个关键节点都没有蒙特利捣乱，那我一定早早过上了我想要的生活。"] = "I used to think that if Monterey hadn't messed with every key turning point in my life, I would have lived the life I wanted long ago.",
    ["我曾成为阴谋的祭品，而这次的祭品，是你。"] = "I was once a sacrifice to a conspiracy, and this time, the sacrifice is you.",
    ["我曾把十几个人带到悬崖边，可我良心难安，不忍心害人。"] = "I have brought over a dozen people to the edge of the cliff, but my conscience won't allow it; I can't bear to hurt anyone.",
    ["我曾经也是一个老师，一位父亲。我想，我能体会维斯塔的心情。"] = "I was once a teacher, a father. I think I can understand how Vista felt.",
    ["我曾经也被叫做怪胎，在失去家人又误食魔药成为“收尸人”之后。"] = "I was also called a freak once, after I lost my family and accidentally consumed a potion to become a Corpse Collector.",
    ["我曾经也觉得这里有些阴森，有些寒冷。"] = "I used to think this place was a bit eerie and cold.",
    ["我曾经亲眼看着前一天还跟我喝酒、聊家乡樱桃树的战友，被弗萨克人击中头颅沉进了间海，到死都还睁着眼睛！"] = "I once watched with my own eyes as a comrade who had been drinking and talking to me about the cherry trees in his hometown just the day before had his head struck by the Feysacians and sank into the Bay of Disquiet, his eyes still wide open even in death!",
    ["我曾经去过贝克兰德的繁星教堂和圣赛缪尔教堂，确实是这样。"] = "I have been to the Starry Church and Saint Samuel Cathedral in Backlund, and it is indeed like that.",
    ["我曾经多次安顿同事们的家属，黑夜教会会尽最大的努力去对待我们的家人。"] = "I have settled the families of my colleagues many times. The Church of the Evernight Goddess will do its utmost to treat our families well.",
    ["我曾经对你说过，这个世界上有很多特殊的人，比如说你，也比如说我。"] = "I once told you that there are many special people in this world, such as you, and also such as me.",
    ["我曾经尝试给自己医治，却没有任何效果，但我的病人说，这里新来了一名医生，用银针缓解了他的腰痛。"] = "I once tried to treat myself, but it had no effect. However, my patients say that a new doctor has arrived here who uses silver needles to relieve their lower back pain.",
    ["我曾经遇到过一位非常、非常、非常神奇的占卜家……"] = "I once met a very, very, very magical Seer...",
    ["我曾见过失去了半边身体的妇人抚摸着身旁干枯的孩子，她竟然在微笑！"] = "I once saw a woman who had lost half her body stroking the withered child beside her, and she was actually smiling!",
    ["我曾认为 死亡就像步入冬天"] = "I once thought that death was like stepping into winter.",
    ["我替他们向你表示感谢。"] = "I express my gratitude to you on their behalf.",
    ["我替他赔了"] = "I'll pay for him",
    ["我最后再问一句——你这瓜，保真吗？"] = "I'll ask one last time—is this pumpkin of yours authentic?",
    ["我最后的执念 我微不足道的私心……"] = "My final obsession, my insignificant selfishness...",
    ["我最喜欢凑热闹"] = "I love joining the crowd",
    ["我最喜欢小阿卡纳的宝剑骑士，"] = "My favorite is the Sword Knight of the Minor Arcana,",
    ["我最喜欢热闹！空气里炖汤香极了，叫卖声也好听。莴苣叶子滴着水，马铃薯圆滚滚的，多可爱！"] = "I love the hustle and bustle! The smell of stew in the air is wonderful, and the hawking sounds are pleasant too. The lettuce leaves are dripping with water, and the potatoes are so round and cute!",
    ["我最喜欢臭臭的臭豆腐"] = "I like stinky tofu the most",
    ["我最喜欢躲猫猫了！追上我，才有资格打探我的秘密。"] = "I love hide-and-seek the most! Only if you catch me will you be qualified to pry into my secrets.",
    ["我最大的爱好是研究土壤、作物和品种杂交技术，相信我，这才是人类的未来。"] = "My greatest hobby is studying soil, crops, and cross-breeding technology. Believe me, this is the future of humanity.",
    ["我最好的朋友也总这样告诉我。"] = "My best friend always told me that too.",
    ["我最近一直被各种各样的噩梦缠绕，有的是面目扭曲的工人，有的是凶恶狂暴的机器……"] = "I've been plagued by all kinds of nightmares recently. Some are workers with twisted faces, others are vicious and berserk machines...",
    ["我最近在考虑申请一把费内波特琴 吟唱诗歌怎么能没有伴奏呢？"] = "I've been thinking about applying for a Feynapotter lute recently. How can a poem recitation be without accompaniment?",
    ["我最近在考虑申请一把费内波特琴，吟唱怎么能没有伴奏呢？"] = "I've been considering applying for a Feynapotter lute recently. How can a recitation be without accompaniment?",
    ["我最近捐赠了廷根市的铁路建设，这里现在新开了几条通往鲁恩其他城市的列车。"] = "I recently donated to the railway construction in Tingen, and there are now several new trains leading to other cities in Loen.",
    ["我最近每天脑子里都是斗邪恶。上班想着，躺在公寓里也想着。"] = "I've been thinking about fighting evil every day recently. I think about it at work, and I think about it while lying in the apartment.",
    ["我最近琢磨出一种新的鱼干配方，用了点特别的香草和烟熏手法。我是满意得不得了，但光我一个人说好可不行。"] = "I recently figured out a new recipe for dried fish using some special herbs and a smoking technique. I am incredibly satisfied with it, but it's not enough for just me to say it's good.",
    ["我最近琢磨出一种新的鱼干配方，用了点特别的香草和烟熏手法。我是满意得不得了，但光我一个人说好可不行。 "] = "I recently figured out a new recipe for dried fish, using some special herbs and a smoking technique. I'm extremely satisfied with it, but it's not enough for just me to say it's good.",
    ["我有一个困扰许久的问题，希望借助占卜的力量。但最好要快。我的助手一来就跑走，不知道要出什么事。"] = "I have a problem that has troubled me for a long time, and I hope to use the power of divination. But it's best to be quick. My assistant ran off as soon as they arrived, I don't know what's going to happen.",
    ["我有一个大胆的想法。"] = "I have a bold idea.",
    ["我有一个想法"] = "I have an idea",
    ["我有一个朋友托我来这看看。"] = "A friend of mine entrusted me to come here and check it out.",
    ["我有一件非凡物品，能将我的存在从那些不怀好意的人脑中抹去 。"] = "I have a Beyonder item that can erase my existence from the minds of those with ill intentions.",
    ["我有一段时间没能睡好觉了，一闭眼就是旋律诡异的声音在耳边回荡……"] = "I haven't been able to sleep well for a while. As soon as I close my eyes, strange melodies echo in my ears...",
    ["我有一页。"] = "I have one page.",
    ["我有两个名字，一个这具身体的名字。"] = "I have two names, one is the name of this body.",
    ["我有个大胆的想法。"] = "I have a bold idea.",
    ["我有个提议，如果你能说服伊琳来看《伯爵归来》，我就把这两张特票送给你。"] = "I have a proposal. If you can persuade Irene to come see 'The Count's Return', I will give you these two special tickets.",
    ["我有个问题"] = "I have a question",
    ["我有主意了！如果能搞到《所罗门皇帝》的票 珍妮斯一定会答应我的邀约的！"] = "I have an idea! If I can get tickets for \"Emperor Solomon,\" Janice will definitely agree to my invitation!",
    ["我有五位叫赛琳娜的同学，她们家都是女神的信徒！"] = "I have five classmates named Selena, and their families are all believers of the Goddess!",
    ["我有些后悔……一天的旅行好像不足以让我戒断这场三年的恋爱……"] = "I have some regrets... a one-day trip doesn't seem enough to let me quit this three-year relationship...",
    ["我有些大胆的想法，为何不尝试更强烈的用色？"] = "I have some bold ideas. Why not try more intense colors?",
    ["我有些想家了……朋友和亲人都离我那么遥远，我再难回到故乡，却也无法融入这里。"] = "I'm a bit homesick... My friends and family are so far away. It's hard for me to return to my hometown, yet I cannot integrate here.",
    ["我有些想念那群老家伙们……阿德莱德怎么样了？那个家伙笑起来还是那么吵吗？"] = "I miss those old folks... How is Adelaide? Is that guy still as noisy when he laughs?",
    ["我有些担心，如果暴雪来临，我们躲在哪里？"] = "I'm a little worried. Where will we shelter if a blizzard hits?",
    ["我有些毛骨悚然了……"] = "I'm getting goosebumps...",
    ["我有件事情想要委托。"] = "I have a matter I would like to commission.",
    ["我有件事，需要你们的配合。"] = "I have something that requires your cooperation.",
    ["我有关于我女儿的急事需要占卜——"] = "I have an urgent matter regarding my daughter that needs divination—",
    ["我有关于我女儿的急事需要占卜！"] = "I have an urgent matter regarding my daughter that needs divination!",
    ["我有十年向导经验，知道条小路，半小时下山。"] = "I have ten years of experience as a guide, I know a small path, we can get down the mountain in half an hour.",
    ["我有好好吃饭，比去年又高了些。"] = "I've been eating well, and I've grown a bit taller than last year.",
    ["我有我有。我记得第一句，“龙啸将至”……"] = "I have one, I have one. I remember the first sentence, 'The Dragon's Roar is Coming'...",
    ["我有所预感"] = "I have a premonition",
    ["我有携带小艾略特少爷的画像，还有他经常佩戴的风暴护符，可以吗？"] = "I have a portrait of Young Master Elliot, and the Storm Amulet he often wears, is that okay?",
    ["我有教会的好宝贝！便宜卖给你！"] = "I have good treasures from the Church! Selling them to you cheap!",
    ["我有新杯子了！下个月拿了工钱，我要喝整整一大杯汽水！"] = "I have a new cup! When I get my wages next month, I'm going to drink a whole big cup of soda!",
    ["我有时会怀疑，眼前的光景是否只是一场绚烂而易逝的梦？"] = "I sometimes wonder if the scene before my eyes is just a brilliant and fleeting dream?",
    ["我有点事先走了，你也早点出来吧，在厕所待太久对身体不好。"] = "I have something to do, so I'm leaving. You should come out early too; staying in the toilet for too long is not good for your health.",
    ["我有点厌倦绿松石了，毕竟他们总说这和我的皮肤相配，但人得尝试新事物。"] = "I'm a bit tired of turquoise. After all, they always say it matches my skin, but one must try new things.",
    ["我有礼帽"] = "I Have a Top Hat",
    ["我有种奇怪的感觉，像以前也和谁一起做过果子汤。"] = "I have a strange feeling, as if I've made fruit soup with someone before.",
    ["我有种预感，有了你的帮助，这瓶一定是完美的“焦糖炸弹”！"] = "I have a premonition that with your help, this bottle will definitely be the perfect 'Caramel Bomb'!",
    ["我有线索了。"] = "I have a clue.",
    ["我有警察厅的薪水，这里还有我过去买下的土地，所以现在也有固定地租收入，这种消费对我来说还好。至少，这些开销是值得的。"] = "I have my salary from the police department, and I also own land I bought in the past, so I have a steady rental income. This level of spending is fine for me. At the very least, these expenses are worth it.",
    ["我有非凡材料需要出售，尤里卡说你这里有门路……"] = "I have Beyonder material to sell. Eureka said you have connections here...",
    ["我有非凡材料需要出售，尤里卡说你这里有门路。"] = "I have Beyonder material to sell; Eureka said you have connections here.",
    ["我有预感，这次回去一定能翻盘。"] = "I have a premonition that I will definitely be able to turn things around this time.",
    ["我朋友买了幅《午夜舞会》，结果每天凌晨三点画中人都会消失一位。<P_Heart>（无奈）</>现在那幅画挂在“隐者”女士的船舱里。"] = "A friend of mine bought a painting called 'Midnight Ball,' and as a result, one person in the painting disappears every day at 3:00 AM. <P_Heart>(Helplessly)</> Now that painting is hanging in the cabin of the 'Hermit' lady.",
    ["我服了你了"] = "I give up on you",
    ["我服侍了一位神明的眷者？！领主大人，您放心我绝对守口如瓶！请您允许我，一辈子都侍奉您！"] = "I served a Blessed of a god?! My Lord, please rest assured, I will definitely keep my mouth shut! Please allow me to serve you for the rest of my life!",
    ["我服侍少爷已经很久了。他是家族最年轻的孩子，总想着脱离家族的荫蔽，自己出来闯荡。几年前，我陪同他来到廷根。可惜……"] = "I have served the young master for a long time. He is the youngest child of the Family and always wants to break away from the Family's shelter and venture out on his own. A few years ago, I accompanied him to Tingen. Unfortunately...",
    ["我期盼了许久的孩子……"] = "The child I have longed for so long...",
    ["我期盼已久的客人们——"] = "My long-awaited guests—",
    ["我未婚夫让出版社的审核文员加上的。"] = "My fiancé had the publishing house's review clerk add them.",
    ["我未能尽到\r\n一个母亲的责任……"] = "I have failed to fulfill\r\nmy duties as a mother...",
    ["我本以为，不管多隐秘的地方，只要能“开门”，都能任我来去。"] = "I thought that no matter how secret a place was, as long as I could \"Open Door,\" I could come and go as I pleased.",
    ["我本想呼唤你的出现，你看，这里就正对着你的窗户。"] = "I wanted to call out for your appearance; look, this is right across from your window.",
    ["我本想用占卜定位她逃跑的位置，但是占卜受到了干扰。"] = "I wanted to use divination to locate where she escaped to, but the divination was interfered with.",
    ["我本打算把手里这两张特等票送给我妹妹的，却被她一口回绝。"] = "I had intended to give these two premium tickets in my hand to my sister, but she flatly refused them.",
    ["我本是圣赛琳娜广场舞组织的领舞者，但是一场繁忙的期末考试让我失去了这个位置……"] = "I was the lead dancer for the Saint Selena square dance organization, but a busy final exam period made me lose this position...",
    ["我本来就是……守护这里的……"] = "I was originally... the one guarding this place...",
    ["我本来要去诊所给一个小女孩表演的，但是我从梯子上摔下来，把手摔到了。我现在什么都拿不稳。"] = "I was supposed to go to the clinic to perform for a little girl, but I fell off a ladder and hurt my hand. I can't hold anything steady now.",
    ["我杀过人……"] = "I have killed people...",
    ["我杀过人！"] = "I have killed people!",
    ["我来——嘿嘿，下雪了！"] = "I will—hehe, it's snowing!",
    ["我来为我丈夫注销俱乐部名单……"] = "I'm here to remove my husband from the Club list...",
    ["我来了！"] = "Here I come!",
    ["我来了？"] = "I'm here?",
    ["我来到心安之所，我看见未知期待，我记录惊喜瞬间。"] = "I came to a place of peace, I saw unknown expectations, and I recorded moments of surprise.",
    ["我来到，我看见，我记录。"] = "I came, I saw, I recorded.",
    ["我来叫醒他。"] = "I'll wake him up.",
    ["我来和你共舞一曲！\""] = "I'll dance a piece with you!",
    ["我来带路！"] = "I'll lead the way!",
    ["我来帮你"] = "I'll help you",
    ["我来帮你……咦，你要去哪？"] = "I'll help you... wait, where are you going?",
    ["我来帮你寻找旋律"] = "I'll help you find the melody",
    ["我来帮您查看一下……"] = "Let me help you take a look...",
    ["我来拉大家入梦 "] = "I'll pull everyone into the dream",
    ["我来换班了，你说呢？手上拿的什么？"] = "I'm here to take over the shift, what do you say? What are you holding in your hand?",
    ["我来猜猜看……死亡的气息浓郁，以祭坛为中心，周围气温比正常要低至少5摄氏度，有阴冷的风……"] = "Let me guess... the scent of death is thick, and centered around the altar, the surrounding temperature is at least 5 degrees Celsius lower than normal, and there is a cold, chilling wind...",
    ["我来用仪式法阵召唤灵界生物，用它们对抗敌人！"] = "I'll use the ritual array to summon Spirit World creatures to fight the enemy!",
    ["我来的第一天他们这么说，第二天第三天第四天……"] = "They said this on the first day I arrived, and the second, third, fourth day...",
    ["我来的第一天他们这么说，第二天第三天第四天……还是这么说。"] = "They said this on the first day I arrived, and the second, third, fourth day... they still say the same thing.",
    ["我来给你来点感觉！"] = "I'll give you a feel for it!",
    ["我来给你算一次塔罗吧！保证准！"] = "Let me do a tarot reading for you! Guaranteed to be accurate!",
    ["我来自安魂诗社，这是信仰黑夜女神的虔诚信徒们组成的团体。"] = "I come from the Requiem Poetry Society; this is a group formed by devout believers of the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["我来自廷根，小时候和母亲一起住在圣赛琳娜教堂附近，从我卧室的窗户望出去，可以看到教堂尖尖的塔顶。"] = "I am from Tingen. When I was a child, I lived near Saint Selena Cathedral with my mother. Looking out from my bedroom window, I could see the cathedral's pointed tower.",
    ["我来见你"] = "I'm here to see you",
    ["我来让她入梦，不然甩不掉这些眼睛！"] = "I'll make her enter a dream, otherwise we won't be able to shake off these eyes!",
    ["我来负责揭晓第二届“破晓之时”第一轮比赛的命题——"] = "I am responsible for revealing the topic of the first round of the 2nd \"Dawn's Hour\"—",
    ["我来过，我见证，我征服！"] = "I came, I saw, I conquered!",
    ["我果然与众不同！哈哈！"] = "I am indeed different! Haha!",
    ["我查阅过教会的内部报告，那里的情况比表面复杂得多。"] = "I have checked the internal reports of the Church; the situation there is much more complex than it appears on the surface.",
    ["我根据你描绘的星图判断，你最近和家人的关系不太好。"] = "Based on the star chart you described, I judge that your relationship with your family has not been very good lately.",
    ["我根本尝不出味道……完蛋了！"] = "I can't taste anything at all... It's over!",
    ["我根本没碰到他！他自己倒的！"] = "I didn't even touch him! He fell on his own!",
    ["我梦到你死了，你的菜摊我买下来改成了肉摊。"] = "I dreamed that you died, and I bought your vegetable stall and turned it into a meat stall.",
    ["我正在努力。"] = "I'm trying.",
    ["我正在完成家族任务<Chat_Highlight>【%s】</>，快来和我一起参与吧!"] = "I am completing the Family Quest <Chat_Highlight>【%s】</>, come join me!",
    ["我正在完成家族任务【%s】,快来一起参与吧~"] = "I'm completing the family quest 【%s】, come join me~",
    ["我正在完成家族任务【<Chat_Highlight>%s</>】，快来和我一起组队吧!【点击组队】"] = "I am completing the Family quest [<Chat_Highlight>%s</>], come and join my party! [Click to Party]",
    ["我正在思考一个问题，金融，数字，它们对我的意义是什么？我的一生难道就为了和账务打交道吗？"] = "I am thinking about a question: finance, numbers, what is their meaning to me? Is my whole life just for dealing with accounts?",
    ["我正在执行任务，碰巧需要来廷根。"] = "I am currently on a quest and happened to need to come to Tingen.",
    ["我正在研究把柠檬也加进去！这样它自己就是一道菜了，不需要额外调味！"] = "I'm currently researching adding lemons to it! That way, it'll be a dish in itself, with no extra seasoning required!",
    ["我正在经历我的第二个三十五岁。时间在我的指尖穿过，我却怎样都抓不住它。"] = "I am currently experiencing my second thirty-five years. Time slips through my fingertips, yet I cannot grasp it no matter how I try.",
    ["我正在调查黛西小姐昏迷案，想查阅封印物3-888的资料。"] = "I am investigating the Miss Daisy coma case and want to look up the information on Sealed Artifact 3-888.",
    ["我正在追寻一位“守护者”的往日回响，他的命运乐章，碎裂成了三个片段，遗失在廷根各处。"] = "I am tracing the past echoes of a 'Guardian'. His movement of fate has shattered into three fragments, lost throughout Tingen.",
    ["我正在追寻一位“老师”的往日回响，他的命运乐章，碎裂成了三个片段，遗失在廷根各处。"] = "I am tracing the past echoes of a 'Teacher'. His movement of fate has shattered into three fragments, lost throughout Tingen.",
    ["我正在追寻一位“魔女”的往日回响，她的命运乐章，碎裂成了三个片段，遗失在廷根各处。"] = "I am currently tracing the echoes of a past 'Witch.' Her symphony of fate has shattered into three fragments, lost throughout Tingen.",
    ["我正打算写篇文章，用这套理论分析仙后对驴头的迷恋——那才是这出戏剧最精彩的部分——实则是对工业文明异化人性的控诉。"] = "I'm planning to write an article using this theory to analyze the Fairy Queen's obsession with the donkey head—that's the most brilliant part of the play—which is actually an indictment of the alienation of humanity by industrial civilization.",
    ["我正打算进剧院，我扶您进去休息一下吧。"] = "I am just about to enter the theater; let me help you inside to rest.",
    ["我正要赶去上课，真的没时间……嗯？原来是你，吓我一跳。"] = "I'm rushing to class, I really don't have time... hmm? So it's you, you scared me.",
    ["我死了。准确地说，我被第十一个被诅咒害死的人害死了！"] = "I am dead. To be precise, I was killed by the person who was killed by the curse after the tenth victim!",
    ["我死了，你找我同事吧。"] = "I'm dead, go find my colleague.",
    ["我每天卖啤酒，没见过什么戈多。"] = "I sell beer every day, I haven't seen any Godot.",
    ["我每天吃煎蛋，没见过什么戈多。"] = "I eat fried eggs every day, I haven't seen any Godot.",
    ["我每天唱歌，没见过什么戈多。"] = "I sing every day, I haven't seen any Godot.",
    ["我每天都在这等，想用最漂亮的样子迎接他，但我今天把帽子忘在家里了。"] = "I wait here every day, wanting to greet him in my most beautiful appearance, but I forgot my hat at home today.",
    ["我每天都好饿，我也想像你一样总是能吃饱肚子……"] = "I'm so hungry every day, and I want to be able to eat my fill like you...",
    ["我每天都来这里等待，但是已经很久没有看见他了。"] = "I come here every day to wait, but I haven't seen him for a long time.",
    ["我每晚躺上床，总能听见来自四面八方邪恶的呓语，令人害怕得无法入睡！"] = "Every night when I lie in bed, I can hear evil whispers from all directions, making me too scared to sleep!",
    ["我每次都害怕再也钻不出来……"] = "Every time, I'm afraid I'll never be able to crawl back out...",
    ["我比玫瑰夫人要幸运，因为我有你和女儿的帮助。你不是那个一见钟情然后从天而降的英雄，而是给予我帮助的、带我回到现实的、真正的朋友。"] = "I am luckier than Madame Rose, because I have the help of you and your daughter. You are not some hero who fell from the sky after love at first sight, but a true friend who has given me help and brought me back to reality.",
    ["我永远不完成任务，就不会再有人受到伤害了。"] = "If I never complete the quest, no one else will ever be hurt again.",
    ["我永远怀念那个美妙的午夜——我与香花女士发生的一切。"] = "I will always miss that wonderful midnight—everything that happened between Ms. Xianghua and me.",
    ["我没买过！但你要是感兴趣，我可以问问我朋友。"] = "I haven't bought any! But if you're interested, I can ask my friend.",
    ["我没事……但我刚刚遇到了堕落……"] = "I'm fine... but I just encountered the Fallen...",
    ["我没事……您别客气，叫我芙拉就好。"] = "I'm fine... please don't be so formal, just call me Fela.",
    ["我没事。"] = "I'm fine.",
    ["我没事了，你也小心些。"] = "I'm fine now. You be careful too.",
    ["我没事，刚刚这是？"] = "I'm fine. What was that just now?",
    ["我没什么大伤，只是手腕有点痛。"] = "I don't have any major injuries, just my wrist hurts a little.",
    ["我没什么好说的！废物警察，我要投诉你们！"] = "I have nothing to say! Useless police, I'm going to file a complaint against you!",
    ["我没兴趣看你的面具。而且你也最没有资格在这里大谈人性。"] = "I have no interest in looking at your mask. Besides, you are the least qualified person here to talk about human nature.",
    ["我没办法摆脱祂了吗？"] = "Is there no way for me to get rid of Him?",
    ["我没多想"] = "I didn't think much of it",
    ["我没想到居然是这么破破烂烂的地方，连个像样的屋子都没有……"] = "I didn't expect it to be such a dilapidated place, without even a decent room...",
    ["我没有事，只是小罗珊现在也还没有回来……"] = "I'm fine, it's just that little Rozanne hasn't come back yet either...",
    ["我没有偷苏珊娜女士的项链！这是她给我的！"] = "I didn't steal Mrs. Susanna's necklace! She gave it to me!",
    ["我没有印象，或许……"] = "I have no impression of it, perhaps...",
    ["我没有坏心思。"] = "I have no bad intentions.",
    ["我没有家了……"] = "I have no home anymore...",
    ["我没有恶意。但我需要确定，你会不会对市民造成伤害？"] = "I have no malice. But I need to be sure, will you cause harm to the citizens?",
    ["我没有找到任何神奇物品遗留，销售记录上的每一行也都已经划去了。极大可能屋内所有神奇物品都真的已经被出售。"] = "I didn't find any mystical items left behind, and every line on the sales record has been crossed out. It is highly likely that all mystical items in the house have truly been sold.",
    ["我没有爸爸！他跑了！"] = "I don't have a dad! He ran away!",
    ["我没有背叛白银城……"] = "I did not betray the City of Silver...",
    ["我没有背叛白银城…… "] = "I did not betray Silver City…",
    ["我没有过去，更不了解你曾经的传说。"] = "I have no past, and I know nothing of your former legends.",
    ["我没有这么说"] = "I didn't say that",
    ["我没有进去，真的没有！我完全不知道发生了什么……"] = "I didn't go in, I really didn't! I have no idea what happened...",
    ["我没有那么多钱……攒一攒吧！至少买张《傲慢者》。"] = "I don't have that much money... I'll save up! At least buy a ticket for \"The Arrogant One\".",
    ["我没有钱"] = "I don't have money",
    ["我没有骗您，这路上的一切，都和您说的不一样。"] = "I am not lying to you; everything on this road is different from what you described.",
    ["我没看见，他当时往树林里跑，很快就没影了。"] = "I didn't see. He ran into the woods, and he was gone in a flash.",
    ["我没看错吧 章鱼在做菜？"] = "Am I seeing things? Is an octopus cooking?",
    ["我没看错吧，章鱼在做菜？"] = "Am I seeing things, is an octopus cooking?",
    ["我没能战胜那些肮脏的污染……"] = "I failed to overcome those filthy corruptions...",
    ["我没醉……真的没醉……只是晕……你帮我看着它……我的宝贝……"] = "I'm not drunk... really not drunk... just dizzy... help me watch it... my treasure...",
    ["我没钱。"] = "I don't have any money.",
    ["我没问题。不过我们应该给梅丽莎准备一件新衣服。"] = "I'm fine with it. But we should prepare a new dress for Melissa.",
    ["我流的汗都够给市长老爷的香槟塔续杯了！"] = "The sweat I've shed is enough to refill the Mayor's champagne tower!",
    ["我浸泡在南大陆的空气里，发现自己像溺水一般，逐渐失去了所有力气。"] = "I was immersed in the air of the Southern Continent and found myself drowning, gradually losing all my strength.",
    ["我渡过了狂暴海，我走遍了大陆，我绘成了世界地图，亲爱的，我做到了所能做到的一切……"] = "I crossed the Berserk Sea, I traveled across the continent, I drew a world map. My dear, I did everything I could...",
    ["我热爱创作，并因此结交了许多热爱人文艺术的小姐。"] = "I love creating, and because of that, I have made friends with many young ladies who love humanities and arts.",
    ["我照顾了他这么多年。他的每一次发烧、每一次心悸、每一次从噩梦里惊醒……我都在。"] = "I've taken care of him for so many years. Every fever, every palpitation, every time he woke up from a nightmare... I was there.",
    ["我熟悉这片空间，还能听见那些碎片、和它们共鸣。"] = "I am familiar with this space, and I can still hear those fragments and resonate with them.",
    ["我爱你！"] = "I love you!",
    ["我父亲不会允许我嫁给一个只能租房的男人……"] = "My father won't allow me to marry a man who can only rent a house...",
    ["我父亲以前也是这家公司的，听说是他认为这么做能增进大家的感情。"] = "My father used to work at this company too. I heard he thought doing this could improve everyone's relationship.",
    ["我父亲去世的前两年，我哪怕只是经过黑荆棘的路口，都会觉得胸口闷。梅丽莎比我坚强……"] = "The first two years after my father passed away, even just passing by the intersection of Blackthorn made my chest feel tight. Melissa is stronger than me...",
    ["我父亲在几年前的战争去世了，颅骨粉碎性骨折。不过还好，父亲当场身亡，没有经历太多痛苦。"] = "My father died in the war a few years ago from a comminuted skull fracture. But fortunately, my father died on the spot and didn't suffer too much.",
    ["我父亲死了。"] = "My father is dead.",
    ["我父亲生前是这附近的街头艺人，最拿手的就是帽子魔术。 他每年纪念日都要为母亲从帽子里变一次鸽子。"] = "My father was a street performer in this area before he passed away, and his best trick was the hat magic. Every anniversary, he would conjure a pigeon from his hat for my mother.",
    ["我爸爸妈妈上周……自杀了……呜呜……这是高兴的事……我不能哭……呜呜……可是我再也看不到他们了，我好难过……"] = "My mom and dad... committed suicide last week... boo hoo... this is a happy thing... I can't cry... boo hoo... but I can never see them again, I'm so sad...",
    ["我特地准备了这样一套服饰，用拜亚姆当地人的话来说，这就是文明人的标志！"] = "I specially prepared such an outfit; in the words of the locals in Bayam, this is the symbol of a civilized person!",
    ["我猜中了！女神啊，一位高贵又深情的王子，爱上了一位圆脸的少女，还为她写这么好听的情歌……这真是一个美好的故事，他们一定会很幸福。"] = "I guessed it! Goddess, a noble and affectionate prince fell in love with a round-faced girl and wrote such a nice love song for her... This is really a beautiful story, they will definitely be very happy.",
    ["我猜你知道"] = "I guess you know",
    ["我猜到了。其实我猜到了。进来的人，没有一个回来过。"] = "I guessed it. Actually, I guessed it. No one who went in ever came back.",
    ["我猜是去向坎柏莉小姐求爱了。"] = "I guess he went to woo Miss Campbell.",
    ["我猜是学术诚信办公室派你来的，走吧，我跟你回去自首。 <P_Yellow>（不同选择将会影响剧情走向）</>"] = "I guess the Office of Academic Integrity sent you. Let's go, I'll go back with you to surrender. <P_Yellow> (Different choices will affect the plot direction) </>",
    ["我猜是爱丽儿小姐。"] = "I guess it was Miss Ariel.",
    ["我猜测，之前是因为夜莺银哨在无意识地保护阿诺德。"] = "I suspect it's because the Silver Nightingale Whistle was unconsciously protecting Arnold previously.",
    ["我猜测，你跟你的朋友们一样，也经历了一次诡异的自杀。只是因为一些特殊原因，你活了下来。"] = "I suspect that, like your friends, you also experienced a bizarre suicide. It's just that for some special reason, you survived.",
    ["我猜马丁在外面，要是你看到他，帮我转告一句：如果想要晋升，就要直面恐惧。"] = "I guess Martin is outside. If you see him, help me pass on a message: if you want to advance, you must face your fear.",
    ["我现在也勉强才能挤进去。我和杰姆一样，有时候希望自己快点长大，做得更好，又害怕长大……"] = "I can barely squeeze in now. Like Jem, sometimes I hope I can grow up quickly and do better, but I'm also afraid of growing up...",
    ["我现在也是黑荆棘安保公司的职员。"] = "I am also an employee of the Blackthorn Security Company now.",
    ["我现在只会修修怀表，做做小玩具。但以后……我想设计大型的蒸汽机，用在工厂里，或者火车上，或者更厉害的地方。"] = "I can only fix pocket watches and make small toys now. But later... I want to design large steam engines to be used in factories, or on trains, or in even more amazing places.",
    ["我现在只想，和玛丽在傍晚再喝一杯最劣质的黑麦啤酒。"] = "Now I just want to have one more glass of the cheapest rye beer with Mary in the evening.",
    ["我现在只想，和玛丽在星期日傍晚再喝一杯最劣质的黑麦啤酒。"] = "Right now, I just want to have one more glass of the cheapest rye beer with Mary on a Sunday evening.",
    ["我现在只能在三条不完整的途径中选择，其中“占卜家”途径他们只有序列9的配方。"] = "I can only choose from three incomplete pathways right now, and the [Seer] pathway only has the Sequence 9 formula.",
    ["我现在可是序列五的淑女！"] = "I am a lady of Sequence 5 now!",
    ["我现在就去找父亲询问盒饭的事情。如果你们不放心，可以派代表跟我一起去。"] = "I'll go find my father right now to ask about the boxed meals. If you are worried, you can send a representative to go with me.",
    ["我现在就去找！"] = "I'm going to find it now!",
    ["我现在就是……参与了那些人的冒犯……受到了惩罚……"] = "I am now... participating in the offenses of those people... and have been punished...",
    ["我现在就过去。"] = "I'll go over right now.",
    ["我现在想睡都睡不着……"] = "I can't even sleep now if I want to...",
    ["我现在报考大学还来得及吗？知识果然就等于财富。"] = "Is it too late for me to apply for university now? Knowledge is indeed wealth.",
    ["我现在教你冥想 按我说的做"] = "I will teach you meditation now. Do as I say.",
    ["我现在教你冥想，按我说的做。"] = "I'll teach you meditation now. Do as I say.",
    ["我现在有钱了，坐马车去！"] = "I have money now, I'll take a carriage!",
    ["我现在能从哪些“序列9”里挑选？"] = "Which 'Sequence 9's can I choose from now?",
    ["我现在这样子，这下可怎么办……"] = "In my current state, what am I supposed to do now...",
    ["我现在需要去调查这起案子，警局送来的案件报告在哪里？"] = "I need to investigate this case now. Where is the case report sent by the police station?",
    ["我理解他，剧院的工作总是忙碌的，他作为经理工作就更多了。"] = "I understand him. Theater work is always busy, and as a manager, he has even more work.",
    ["我甚至幻想我养的宠物能变身为人……成为家里的一份子……"] = "I even fantasize about my pet transforming into a human... becoming a part of the family...",
    ["我生活的年代"] = "The era I lived in",
    ["我用一个形象的事例来说明吧。序列魔药的核心力量是一座城堡，而我们有一张城堡主人给予的邀请函。"] = "Let me use a vivid example to explain. The core power of a Sequence potion is like a castle, and we have an invitation letter given by the owner of the castle.",
    ["我用了一些小技巧，来获得我们想知道的答案。但因为一些无聊又严肃的保密协议，我不能告诉你更多。"] = "I used some little tricks to get the answers we wanted. But because of some boring and serious non-disclosure agreements, I can't tell you more.",
    ["我用了半辈子收集了这一墙的面具，每一张面具都凝聚了数十年人生中最激烈、最极端的情绪。"] = "I have spent half my life collecting the masks on this wall; each one encapsulates the most intense and extreme emotions from decades of life.",
    ["我用学校不要的材料和路上捡到的东西做的，前两天才做好。"] = "I made it using materials the school didn't want and things I picked up on the road. I finished it just two days ago.",
    ["我用序列四“不死者”的非凡特性制作了永暗蜡烛，只要不点燃蜡烛，蜡烛的主人就永远不会死亡。"] = "I used the Beyonder characteristic of a Sequence 4 'Undying' to create the Candle of Eternal Darkness; as long as the candle is not lit, its owner will never be Dead.",
    ["我申请了封印物“幸运悖论”。在危急关头，愿它能带来足够的幸运。"] = "I requested the Sealed Artifact \"Paradox of Luck\". In a crisis, I hope it brings enough luck.",
    ["我疯了吗？！"] = "Am I crazy?!",
    ["我白天一上工，就得先看看要不要救人。"] = "As soon as I start work in the morning, I have to check if I need to save anyone.",
    ["我的"] = "Mine",
    ["我的%s"] = "My %s",
    ["我的一磅钱或许比西摩斯先生的十磅钱轻上一些，但我的虔诚和底气并不比他的轻。"] = "My one pound might be lighter than Mr. Seamus's ten pounds, but my piety and conviction are no lighter than his.",
    ["我的丈夫基拉，去教堂后的池塘边摘睡莲了，这是我们镇子上的习俗。"] = "My husband, Kira, went to the pond behind the church to pick water lilies. This is a custom in our town.",
    ["我的丈夫布拉德利总是不着家，就算回来也是披星戴月。"] = "My husband Bradley is never home, and even when he returns, it's late at night.",
    ["我的丈夫霍克斯男爵离奇死亡，我认为这件事情另有内情，所以才请您过来。"] = "My husband, Baron Hawkes, died mysteriously. I believe there is more to this matter, which is why I invited you here.",
    ["我的上一出戏在王国大剧院公演时，就连国王陛下和诸位大臣都对我的台词赞不绝口，怎么会有人不喜欢呢？"] = "When my last play premiered at the Royal Theater, even His Majesty the King and the ministers praised my lines. How could anyone not like them?",
    ["我的上司出现了一些异常情况……"] = "My superior has had some abnormal situations...",
    ["我的下半身还卡在墙里，必须先找到它。你能帮我找找吗？它应该就在这附近。"] = "My lower body is still stuck in the wall, I must find it first. Can you help me look for it? It should be around here.",
    ["我的专业催缴团队……会确保每一笔都应收尽收。"] = "My professional collection team... will ensure every penny is collected.",
    ["我的业绩"] = "My Performance",
    ["我的业绩: %d"] = "My Performance: %d",
    ["我的主人是优雅的绅士，绝不会将垃圾丢入马桶，您的猜测令人感到冒犯！"] = "My master is an elegant gentleman and would never throw trash into the toilet. Your speculation is offensive!",
    ["我的书呆子哥哥"] = "My Bookworm Brother",
    ["我的代号是——“正义”！"] = "My codename is—Justice!",
    ["我的任务是增援发出信号的值夜者小队，但我也是有自由时间的。"] = "My task is to reinforce the Nighthawk squad that sent the signal, but I also have free time.",
    ["我的伞到底去哪了呢……"] = "Where on earth did my umbrella go...",
    ["我的作品"] = "My Works",
    ["我的信息"] = "My Information",
    ["我的偶像是罗塞尔大帝，他是个实干家，以一己之力改变了整个因蒂斯。"] = "My idol is Emperor Roselle. He was a man of action who changed the entire Intis with his own strength.",
    ["我的出价"] = "My Bid",
    ["我的出价："] = "My Bid:",
    ["我的出售"] = "My Listings",
    ["我的刀盾"] = "My blade and shield",
    ["我的剑放在这里，神祝福它永远锋利。"] = "My sword is placed here; God blesses it to be forever sharp.",
    ["我的卷心菜！是谁铲除它们把这些花移栽过来的！"] = "My cabbages! Who cleared them out to transplant these flowers!",
    ["我的原则是，绝对不允许拖欠租金！"] = "My principle is that I absolutely do not allow rent arrears!",
    ["我的吉他被松鼠啃烂了，没法练习。"] = "My guitar was chewed up by a squirrel, so I can't practice.",
    ["我的同事会重新彻查一次湖畔，这之后带他们来吧。"] = "My colleagues will conduct a thorough re-inspection of the lake, after that, bring them over.",
    ["我的同僚“星星”先生已经在咖啡厅等你了，他会为你提供帮助。\\n（书籍通道打开，美术配置前替代表现）"] = "My colleague, Mr. Star, is already waiting for you at the cafe; he will provide you with assistance.\n(Book passage opened, art configuration placeholder representation)",
    ["我的名字"] = "My Name",
    ["我的名字是……"] = "My name is...",
    ["我的名字是乔琳，我女儿佐伊不太对劲！"] = "My name is Jolene, and my daughter Zoe is acting strange!",
    ["我的周薪刚刚翻倍到6镑，加上班森的薪水，完全负担得起偶尔看一场戏剧。"] = "My weekly salary just doubled to 6 pounds, plus Benson's salary, we can totally afford to see a play occasionally.",
    ["我的咸鱼……我的猫……到底跑哪去了……"] = "My salted fish... my cat... where on earth did they run off to...",
    ["我的哥哥"] = "My older brother",
    ["我的哥哥，一个活泼开朗，热爱运动的好青年。"] = "My brother, a lively, cheerful, and sports-loving young man.",
    ["我的商业投资计划可不能交到这种人手上。"] = "I can't entrust my business investment plan to someone like that.",
    ["我的商队"] = "My Caravan",
    ["我的嗓音是个人特色！"] = "My voice is my personal trademark!",
    ["我的团队"] = "My Group",
    ["我的图纸呢？我的图纸！"] = "Where are my blueprints? My blueprints!",
    ["我的塔罗占卜很准的。"] = "My Tarot divination is very accurate.",
    ["我的增益效果"] = "My Buffs",
    ["我的复活技能冷却时间还有%s秒"] = "My resurrection skill cooldown is %s seconds",
    ["我的天啊大家都怎么回事！\n\n永远只说那几句话，斐琳一刻不停地站在桥上钓了一辈子鱼！\n\n没人觉得奇怪吗？\n\n……不，为什么我之前不觉得奇怪？"] = "My god, what is wrong with everyone! \n\n Always saying the same few things, and Feline has been standing on the bridge fishing for a lifetime without a moment's rest! \n\n Doesn't anyone find it strange? \n\n ...No, why didn't I find it strange before?",
    ["我的天，我的肺都要变成灰色的了。"] = "My god, my lungs are about to turn gray.",
    ["我的夫人只有你！只会是你！"] = "My wife is only you! It will only ever be you!",
    ["我的头好痛"] = "My head hurts so much",
    ["我的头好痛……我好像忘记了什么……"] = "My head hurts so much... I feel like I've forgotten something...",
    ["我的奖励"] = "My Rewards",
    ["我的女儿……我要出海找到我的女儿……"] = "My daughter... I must go to sea to find my daughter...",
    ["我的女儿，她有最正直，善良的品格。这让她很难接受我后期做出的那些事。当然，这也怪“原始月亮”——你明白被污染的感觉吧？"] = "My daughter, she has the most upright and kind character. This made it hard for her to accept the things I did in my later years. Of course, this is also the fault of the 'Primordial Moon'—you understand the feeling of being corrupted, right?",
    ["我的女神……杰斯醒醒！快来救人啊！！！"] = "My Goddess... Jess, wake up! Come and save someone!!!",
    ["我的女神啊，你的读者快把出版社的门槛踏破了……"] = "My Goddess, your readers are about to trample the publisher's threshold...",
    ["我的女神！我唯一的爱！我愿意把我的全部财产都献给您！"] = "My Goddess! My only love! I am willing to offer all my wealth to you!",
    ["我的女神！阿比倒下了！阿比倒下了！出现了新的冠军！让我们欢呼！"] = "My Goddess! Abby has fallen! Abby has fallen! A new champion has appeared! Let's cheer!",
    ["我的女神，你是从哪里冒出来的？噢，难道说你使用了巫术，你是一位巫师吗？"] = "My Goddess, where did you pop out from? Oh, could it be that you used witchcraft? Are you a witch?",
    ["我的女神，我都要开始怀疑他转不眠者途径了……熬夜可不是什么好习惯，发际线会上移、皮肤松弛，还会健……"] = "My Goddess, I'm starting to suspect he switched to the Sleepless pathway... staying up late is not a good habit; your hairline will recede, your skin will sag, and you'll become...",
    ["我的好友"] = "My Friends",
    ["我的好妹妹，你想起了多少？"] = "My dear sister, how much have you remembered?",
    ["我的妈妈曾经是邓恩叔叔他们的同事，而现在，他们一起安眠在这里。"] = "My mother used to be a colleague of Uncle Dunn and the others, and now, they are all resting here together.",
    ["我的妹妹"] = "My Little Sister",
    ["我的妻子总是抱怨城堡里太阴暗，她喜欢阳光，喜欢温暖的感觉…… "] = "My wife always complained that the castle was too gloomy; she liked the sunshine, liked the feeling of warmth...",
    ["我的妻子曾说，钢琴是带来美好的乐器。"] = "My wife once said that the piano is an instrument that brings beauty.",
    ["我的存在，你的出现，一切都像串成线的水珠一样落下来……可怜的羔羊们，谁能拒绝一场暴雨呢？"] = "My existence, your appearance, everything falls like water droplets strung into a line... Poor lambs, who can refuse a rainstorm?",
    ["我的学生很好，贝克兰德的一切都很好。"] = "My students are fine, and everything in Backlund is fine.",
    ["我的孩子……别怕，妈妈会一直在你身边……"] = "My child... don't be afraid, Mommy will always be by your side...",
    ["我的孩子即将迎来新生——让我们赞颂“母亲”赐予的一切！"] = "My child is about to be reborn—let us praise everything bestowed by the 'Mother'!",
    ["我的家在廷根。想回贝克兰德是因为上次去那边参加学术会议的时候……"] = "My home is in Tingen. I want to go back to Backlund because last time I went there to attend an academic conference...",
    ["我的家里，有着纸和油墨的味道，那是爸爸妈妈身上的味道，也是幸福的味道。"] = "My home has the scent of paper and ink; it is the scent of my father and mother, and it is the scent of happiness.",
    ["我的寄售"] = "My Consignment",
    ["我的尊名是——洞察一切的圣灵，黄黑之王的眷者，梦境与心灵的旅者。"] = "My honorific name is—The Holy Spirit who sees all, the Blessed of the King of Yellow and Black, the Traveler of Dreams and Minds.",
    ["我的小丽兹！"] = "My little Liz!",
    ["我的小包包，也是个封印物。"] = "My little bag is also a Sealed Artifact.",
    ["我的小巴特，他也跟你差不多大。"] = "My little Bart, he was about your age.",
    ["我的小熊！呜……完蛋啦。"] = "My little bear! Woo... it's all over.",
    ["我的小狗，它整整陪了我十五年。"] = "My little dog. It stayed with me for fifteen years.",
    ["我的帽子可装不下臭鸡蛋。"] = "My hat can't hold rotten eggs.",
    ["我的年龄是……"] = "My age is...",
    ["我的库存"] = "My Inventory",
    ["我的建议是，你可以把这两份面包都买回去。"] = "My suggestion is that you can buy both of these breads.",
    ["我的强运，不属于这个时代！"] = "My good luck does not belong to this era!",
    ["我的当前方案"] = "My Current Setup",
    ["我的心中有一根钓竿，它正在水中游弋。"] = "There is a fishing rod in my heart, and it is swimming in the water.",
    ["我的心愿女神有名字，她的名字是赛拉。"] = "My Goddess of Wishes has a name, and her name is Sarah.",
    ["我的心？您真的不明白吗，陛下……"] = "My heart? Do you really not understand, Your Majesty...",
    ["我的心？您真的不明白吗？陛下……"] = "My heart? Do you really not understand? Your Majesty...",
    ["我的总排名"] = "My Total Ranking",
    ["我的想法没有变过，也没有继续晋升序列的打算。"] = "My thoughts have not changed, and I have no intention of continuing to advance in Sequence.",
    ["我的意思是——观众没死光的话，演出就会一直继续！"] = "I mean—as long as the audience isn't all dead, the performance will continue!",
    ["我的意思是……"] = "I mean...",
    ["我的意思是，总感觉有更好的选择。"] = "I mean, I just feel like there are better choices.",
    ["我的意思是，这个任务由我和你一起完成。我的序列并不擅长找人，但这是“占卜家”的专长。"] = "I mean, we will complete this quest together. My Sequence isn't good at finding people, but that is the specialty of a Seer.",
    ["我的意识被困在这里，只有找到一个<P_Yellow>故事的真相</>才能出去。"] = "My consciousness is trapped here, and I can only leave by finding the <P_Yellow>truth of the story</>.",
    ["我的愿望是我们能一直一直在一起——"] = "My wish is that we can always, always be together—",
    ["我的愿望是，擅闯者的力量消散！"] = "My wish is for the power of the intruders to dissipate!",
    ["我的战友们……是为了黑伍德家族，为了鲁恩。"] = "My comrades... they did it for the Heywood Family, for Loen.",
    ["我的战友们被困在山里，没有食物和衣服，快要不行了。求您帮帮忙，救救我的战友们，我实在不知道该怎么办了……"] = "My comrades are trapped in the mountains, without food or clothes, and they are about to die. Please help me, save my comrades, I really don't know what to do...",
    ["我的战绩"] = "My Achievements",
    ["我的房间"] = "My Room",
    ["我的手上全是那个渣滓的血，我不想泰利的遗物被这种东西弄脏。"] = "My hands are covered in that scum's blood. I don't want Terry's belongings stained with it.",
    ["我的投影"] = "My Projections",
    ["我的指南针和我的脑袋，就像在跳弗朗明戈一样，旋转不停。"] = "My compass and my head are like they're dancing the flamenco, spinning non-stop.",
    ["我的排名详情"] = "My Ranking Details",
    ["我的故事说完了。<P_Heart>（眨眼）</>你呢？有没有什么更离奇的故事？"] = "My story is finished. <P_Heart> (Winking) </> What about you? Do you have any more bizarre stories?",
    ["我的数据"] = "My Data",
    ["我的新同事 你差点被绑架了？"] = "My new colleague, you were almost kidnapped?",
    ["我的日子够满足啦"] = "My life is satisfying enough.",
    ["我的日记！不许看！"] = "My Diary! Do Not Read!",
    ["我的日记，我的抽屉，他都要打开。他说这是他的技艺，他骄傲得很呢。"] = "My diary, my drawers, he has to open them all. He says it's his craft, and he's quite proud of it.",
    ["我的旧人，已经很少很少了。"] = "My old friends are very, very few now.",
    ["我的朋友……我们……"] = "My friend... we...",
    ["我的朋友琼，她刚结束一段旅程，我们早就写信约好，去霍伊大学拜访从前的老师。"] = "My friend Joan just finished a journey. We wrote to each other long ago to visit our former teacher at Hoy University.",
    ["我的朋友科恩，是一个怜惜才华，专注学术的人，我们的观点常常冲突，从而导致无数场小型辩论。"] = "My friend Cohen was a person who cherished talent and was focused on academics. Our viewpoints often clashed, leading to countless small debates.",
    ["我的未婚妻是这个世界上最美丽的雕塑，下周我们就要举办婚礼了。"] = "My fiancée is the most beautiful Sculpture in the world, we are holding our wedding next week.",
    ["我的来处"] = "My origin",
    ["我的梦……好像不只是梦……"] = "My dream... it doesn't seem to be just a dream...",
    ["我的梦境？"] = "My Dream?",
    ["我的模板七个字"] = "My Template Seven Characters",
    ["我的火焰连查拉图的胡须都能炭<P_Yellow>烤</>！"] = "My flames can even charcoal-<P_Yellow>grill</> Zaratul's beard!",
    ["我的火腿呢？培根呢？秘制烤香肠呢？"] = "Where is my ham? My bacon? My secret roasted sausages?",
    ["我的灵使能让你的状态在短时间内保持稳定，普通人无法看见你，但一定不要离我太远。"] = "My Spirit Messenger can keep your state stable for a short time. Ordinary people cannot see you, but you must not stray too far from me.",
    ["我的灵性屏障有些坚持不住了，得尽快解决这些怪物！"] = "My spirituality barrier can't hold on much longer; I must solve these monsters quickly!",
    ["我的灵性还没有完全恢复，接下来的事情就要拜托你了！请一定要说服我的母亲！"] = "My spirituality hasn't fully recovered; I'll have to leave the rest to you! Please, you must persuade my mother!",
    ["我的热度：<Highlight>%s</>/%s"] = "My Popularity: <Highlight>%s</>/%s",
    ["我的爱人死了，我的孩子还需要我，我必须出门了……"] = "My lover is dead, my child still needs me, I must go out...",
    ["我的爱情什么时候来呢……"] = "When will my love come...",
    ["我的爱，我来了！"] = "My love, I'm coming!",
    ["我的父亲和母亲在很遥远的地方，那些无人陪伴的日子里，我开始幻想小骑士和恶龙的故事，讲给镇上的孩子们听……"] = "My father and mother are in a very distant place. In those days without company, I began to imagine the story of the little knight and the wicked dragon, and told it to the children in town...",
    ["我的猫……会去哪呢？"] = "My cat... where could it go?",
    ["我的玫瑰……"] = "My rose...",
    ["我的玫瑰，看来我们的约会要留到明天了。"] = "My rose, it seems our date will have to wait until tomorrow.",
    ["我的理智过低，请求<Chat_Highlight>安魂诗社</>成员协助我恢复宁静。"] = "My sanity is too low, requesting <Chat_Highlight> Requiem Poetry Society </> members to assist me in restoring tranquility.",
    ["我的生活又多了一份希望，时刻期盼着乐曲完成的那一天。"] = "My life has gained another glimmer of hope, constantly looking forward to the day the music is completed.",
    ["我的画室欢迎一切想要交朋友的人！如果你是一位活泼开朗的顾客，那么整个画室的大画家们都会很喜欢你！"] = "My studio welcomes everyone who wants to make friends! If you are a lively and cheerful customer, then all the great painters in the studio will like you!",
    ["我的画是空白的。我还在等，等风把那片云吹到合适的位置，等一只蝴蝶停在一朵花上。"] = "My painting is blank. I am still waiting, waiting for the wind to blow that cloud to the right position, waiting for a butterfly to land on a flower.",
    ["我的直觉告诉我，还没有结束。"] = "My intuition tells me this isn't over yet.",
    ["我的眼睛看不见了，肚子也好痛……"] = "My eyes can't see, and my stomach hurts so much...",
    ["我的确恨那件东西，恨我丈夫看我的眼神越来越像看一个陌生人！"] = "I do hate that thing, and I hate that my husband's eyes look more and more like he's looking at a stranger!",
    ["我的礼物是一顶帽子，送给亲爱的行政大臣安东尼的，生日快乐！"] = "My gift is a hat, for dear Minister of Administration Anthony, happy birthday!",
    ["我的积分"] = "My points",
    ["我的称号"] = "My Title",
    ["我的穿越很可能是因为那个转运仪式……不管怎么样，我都要试一试！"] = "My transmigration was most likely due to that Fortune-Turning Ritual... regardless, I have to give it a try!",
    ["我的笔友，也是我的爱人。"] = "My pen pal, and also my lover.",
    ["我的经历让我没有祖国的归属感，但这不算遗憾，毕竟，比起一个概念，我的人生里有着更多更具体的人。"] = "My experiences left me without a sense of belonging to a homeland, but that is not a regret. After all, compared to a concept, my life has had many more concrete people in it.",
    ["我的给你。我可以在外面等你们，为你们作证。"] = "You can have mine. I can wait outside for you and act as a witness.",
    ["我的老师告诉我，要想弹奏好《夜访》，我必须相信爱情与牺牲，相信痛苦与谎言。"] = "My teacher told me that to play 'Night Visit' well, I must believe in love and sacrifice, believe in pain and lies.",
    ["我的考验很简单，吟诵后续的诗句，并选择对应的花束，由向导交给我。"] = "My test is simple: recite the subsequent lines of the poem and choose the corresponding bouquet, then have the guide hand it to me.",
    ["我的胳膊，好痛……"] = "My arm, it hurts so much...",
    ["我的能力，确实适合这种任务。"] = "My abilities are indeed suited for this kind of mission.",
    ["我的脑和我的心，我全身上下的每一个器官！都在说着——我喜欢你！"] = "My brain and my heart, every organ in my body! They are all saying—I love you!",
    ["我的腿好痛……"] = "My leg hurts so much...",
    ["我的舞会，从不邀请活人。但你可以成为镜厅里永不融化的冰雕！"] = "My ball never invites the living. But you can become an ice sculpture in the Mirror Hall that never melts!",
    ["我的艾拉！世上再没有第二个艾拉！"] = "My Ayla! There is no second Ayla in this world!",
    ["我的苏勒"] = "My Sols",
    ["我的荣幸。"] = "My pleasure.",
    ["我的药剂研发陷入了瓶颈……"] = "My potion research has hit a bottleneck...",
    ["我的菇毒"] = "My Mushroom Poison",
    ["我的蔬菜是用爱培育的。"] = "My vegetables are grown with love.",
    ["我的蛋糕也许不是最精致的，但一定会让你终身怀念。"] = "My cake might not be the most exquisite, but it will definitely make you remember it for a lifetime.",
    ["我的裤子真破了！我要赶快回去，越快越好！再见！"] = "My pants really are torn! I have to go back quickly, as fast as I can! Goodbye!",
    ["我的观众们！欢笑吧！哀恸吧！在这名为命运的舞台上！"] = "My audience! Laugh! Weep! On this stage called fate!",
    ["我的诗，好像只肯生在这里的灯光下。换个地方，我怕就写不出来了。 "] = "My poetry seems to only want to be born under the lights here. If I change places, I'm afraid I won't be able to write it.",
    ["我的贡献"] = "My Contribution",
    ["我的货物"] = "My Cargo",
    ["我的购买"] = "My Purchases",
    ["我的身体……好像正在发生变化……"] = "My body... it seems to be changing...",
    ["我的身体就在附近……嗯？从刚才开始，我的衣服一直凉凉的，像是泡在冷水里？"] = "My body is nearby... hmm? Since just now, my clothes have been feeling cold, like they're soaked in cold water?",
    ["我的身体，我的身体不受控制！快推我一把！"] = "My body, my body is out of control! Push me!",
    ["我的车技就像鲜花一样完美。"] = "My driving skills are as perfect as flowers.",
    ["我的迪尼特，我不知道要如何面对以后没你的日子，我将时刻思念你，日夜向女神祈祷，祈求祂庇佑你的航程。"] = "My Dinit, I don't know how to face the days ahead without you. I will miss you every moment, praying to the Goddess day and night, begging Her to protect your voyage.",
    ["我的通灵日记"] = "My Spirit Mediumship Diary",
    ["我的金镑怎么还没有到……"] = "Why hasn't my gold pound arrived yet...",
    ["我的钢琴！就连因蒂斯的大炮都懂得避开钢琴！"] = "My piano! Even the Intis cannons know to avoid hitting a piano!",
    ["我的钱包……"] = "My wallet...",
    ["我的钱啊——天底下有这样的老师吗！"] = "My money—is there any teacher like this in the world!",
    ["我的长子也遗传了这一点。在其他很多事情上，他也与我相似。有些是遗传，有些是对父亲的崇拜。"] = "My eldest son inherited this as well. In many other things, he was also similar to me. Some were inherited, and some were out of admiration for his father.",
    ["我的队伍"] = "My Team",
    ["我的阵营"] = "My Faction",
    ["我的雕像不见了……小小的一个……长眠前我经过河道，它掉了进去……"] = "My statue is gone... a tiny one... I passed by the riverbed before I fell into a long sleep, and it fell in...",
    ["我的面容"] = "My Appearance",
    ["我的领结！！"] = "My bowtie!!",
    ["我的马车，什么时候成你们的了！"] = "My carriage! Since when did it belong to you?!",
    ["我的，眼瞳，\r\n到底是什么颜色？"] = "What color,\r\nexactly, are my eyes?",
    ["我相信你"] = "I believe you",
    ["我相信你。"] = "I believe in you.",
    ["我相信你可以的。"] = "I believe you can do it.",
    ["我相信你肯定不愿意错过这次赚钱的好机会，拳王阿比对战下一个倒霉蛋，赔率一比三十！"] = "I believe you wouldn't want to miss this great opportunity to make money. Champion Abi versus the next unlucky guy, the odds are one to thirty!",
    ["我相信你，一定可以顺利唤醒黛西小姐。"] = "I believe in you; you will definitely be able to wake Miss Daisy successfully.",
    ["我相信你，亲爱的……"] = "I believe in you, my dear...",
    ["我相信您"] = "I believe in you",
    ["我相信您。"] = "I believe you.",
    ["我相信无序"] = "I believe in disorder",
    ["我相信秩序"] = "I believe in order",
    ["我相信这一定是真实发生的事情，这样的作品不可能凭空想象创造出来，一切都太真实了。"] = "I believe this must have actually happened. Such a work could not have been imagined out of thin air; everything is too real.",
    ["我相信，丈夫一定会回来的。"] = "I believe my husband will definitely come back.",
    ["我相信，如果他在附近听到这首曲子，就一定会出现在我眼前。"] = "I believe that if he hears this song nearby, he will definitely appear before me.",
    ["我相信，小巴特肯定也是这么想的！"] = "I believe little Bart must be thinking the same thing!",
    ["我相信，那些谣言都是假的，他一定会回来的……"] = "I believe those rumors are all fake, he will definitely come back...",
    ["我看了二十年，每次都告诉他修不好。他每次都说\"那就再等等\"，然后又把表带回去。"] = "I looked at it for twenty years and told him it couldn't be fixed every time. He would say 'Then let's wait a bit longer' and take the watch back.",
    ["我看了，风车背面，还有更恐怖的东西……"] = "I looked, behind the windmill, there are even more terrifying things...",
    ["我看你还不如咸鱼，咸鱼还能吃！你除了能给我增加工作量还能干些什么！"] = "I think you're worse than a salted fish, at least a salted fish can be eaten! What can you do besides increasing my workload!",
    ["我看你面善，帮朋友个忙。你拿一包去，走一圈，帮我验证验证，是不是全天下的猫都一样馋？我有预感， 这将成为一门好生意！"] = "I see you have a kind face, do me a favor as a friend. Take a bag, walk around, and help me verify if all the cats in the world are this greedy? I have a feeling this will become a good business!",
    ["我看到了一双纤细白嫩的手，似乎属于一位女士。"] = "I saw a pair of slender, fair hands, which seem to belong to a lady.",
    ["我看到了一条河流，西北面有一个二层的灰蓝色房屋，前面有一个破败的花园……"] = "I saw a river, a two-story gray-blue house to the northwest, and a dilapidated garden in front...",
    ["我看到了奇怪的画面 还听到了奇怪的呓语"] = "I saw strange images and heard strange whispers.",
    ["我看到了，在这里！"] = "I see it, it's here!",
    ["我看到员工手册上写了哀嚎黑市的案件追踪，我可以参与吗？"] = "I saw the case tracking for the Wailing Black Market in the employee handbook; can I participate?",
    ["我看到宣传画上有说这里有神秘海洋动物表演，真的吗？"] = "I saw on the promotional poster that there is a mysterious marine animal show here, is that true?",
    ["我看到您已经收成了一些美酒！真是完美的商品——它们一定能有一个同样完美的成交价。"] = "I see you have already harvested some fine wine! Truly perfect merchandise—they must be able to fetch an equally perfect price.",
    ["我看到您这儿好像有两张菜单，这都是您店里的招牌美食？"] = "I see you seem to have two menus here. Are these the signature delicacies of your shop?",
    ["我看到我穿着一身暖和又干净的衣服 就是商店橱窗里的那件"] = "I see myself wearing a set of warm and clean clothes, just like the one in the shop window",
    ["我看到，我看到了大家的尸体……为什么……"] = "I saw it, I saw everyone's bodies... why...",
    ["我看她们是把金子当花瓣撒吧？"] = "I think they are scattering gold like petals?",
    ["我看得出来，你还是不信我。为了向你展示足够的诚意，我邀请你明天中午来剧院和我共进午餐。"] = "I can tell that you still don't trust me. To show you enough sincerity, I invite you to come to the theater tomorrow at noon to have lunch with me.",
    ["我看得出，这是你内心的渴望。我愿意给好学的人一些优惠。只要五便士，我就带你整个廷根看一圈。"] = "I can see that this is your inner desire. I am willing to give some discounts to those who are eager to learn. For just five pence, I will take you on a tour of the whole of Tingen.",
    ["我看您穿得不差，还是租好一点的地方吧。"] = "You look like you're dressed well, you should rent a better place.",
    ["我看是你迂腐的脑子被书虫给蛀空了，才不懂得欣赏大自然的美丽！"] = "I think your pedantic brain has been eaten away by bookworms, that's why you don't know how to appreciate the beauty of nature!",
    ["我看看……"] = "Let me see...",
    ["我看看……“格尔曼唯一惧怕之物——码头摊贩的狼鱼罐头…… ”"] = "Let me see... 'Gehrman's only fear—the wolf fish canned food from the dock vendors...'",
    ["我看看……有效治疗耳部疾病？！"] = "Let me see... Effective treatment for ear diseases?!",
    ["我看看配料……"] = "Let me check the ingredients...",
    ["我看着他从普通队员，一步步成长起来。"] = "I watched him grow up step by step from an ordinary member.",
    ["我看见一个工人，他从头到脚被吞了！被黑雾！"] = "I saw a worker, he was swallowed from head to toe! By black fog!",
    ["我看见了……不祥的红月……巨龙……"] = "I saw it... the ominous red moon... the giant dragon...",
    ["我看见了……我看见了！"] = "I saw it... I saw it!",
    ["我看见了……那盔甲，古老的、沾满泥的盔甲，自己动了起来，里面是空的，却是活的！"] = "I saw it... that armor, ancient, mud-stained armor, it moved on its own. It was empty inside, yet it was alive!",
    ["我看见了他的脸，我在通缉令上见过他——兰尔乌斯。"] = "I saw his face, I've seen him on a wanted poster—Lanevus.",
    ["我看见了！你要偷东西！"] = "I saw it! You were going to steal something!",
    ["我看见了！金色的灵在您的肩头！"] = "I saw it! A golden spirit on your shoulder!",
    ["我看见云雀高飞"] = "I See the Skylark Flying High",
    ["我看见他跑上来了！"] = "I saw him run up!",
    ["我看见你有金子一般的心。"] = "I see you have a heart of gold.",
    ["我看还是算——"] = "I think I'd better—",
    ["我真不敢相信……"] = "I really can't believe it...",
    ["我真会为此痛苦而死……"] = "I could truly die of agony because of this...",
    ["我真希望有人把那些废弃的公共垃圾桶当作垃圾丢在这里。"] = "I really wish someone would treat those abandoned public trash cans as trash and dump them here.",
    ["我真想能有一张十镑的钞票，好向你们展示那位“立国者”——威廉一世！ "] = "I really wish I had a ten-pound note so I could show you that 'Founder of the Nation' — William I!",
    ["我真是……蠢透了！"] = "I am really... so stupid!",
    ["我真是个不错的邮差。"] = "I really am a good postman.",
    ["我真是个笨蛋！居然相信这和餐厅毫无关系的活动能免单！"] = "I'm such an idiot! I actually believed that an event unrelated to the restaurant could offer a free meal!",
    ["我真是个胆小鬼，现在她要被人抢走了……"] = "I'm such a coward, and now she's going to be snatched away...",
    ["我真是去"] = "I really went to the district",
    ["我真正喜欢的是杂技！我想学抛球，学到能和那些演员一样灵活，抛起东西来让人挪不开眼！"] = "What I really like is acrobatics! I want to learn to juggle, to be as agile as those performers, making people unable to look away when I toss things!",
    ["我真的……舍不得她。"] = "I really... can't bear to let her go.",
    ["我真的可以做到吗……"] = "Can I really do it...",
    ["我真的听见了，周围全是奇怪的声音，谁来救救我，请救救我……老师……他们都回家了，我的家呢？"] = "I really heard it, the surroundings were full of strange sounds. Someone save me, please save me... Teacher... they all went home, where is my home?",
    ["我真的听见他说话了！那个声音就是从他房间里传出来的！侦探{{先生|女士}}，您相信我啊！"] = "I really heard him speak! That voice came from his room! Detective {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you have to believe me!",
    ["我真的很准的！虽然我是一位驯兽师，但是一点不比俱乐部里的占卜师们差。"] = "I'm really accurate! Although I am a Beast Tamer, I am no worse than the diviners in the club.",
    ["我真的没有多想，真的。只是听起来怎么这么、这么……"] = "I really didn't think too much, really. It just sounds so, so...",
    ["我真的特别能干！您看我的手！全是搬货磨出的茧子！"] = "I'm really very capable! Look at my hands! They're full of calluses from moving cargo!",
    ["我真的看见他了！"] = "I really saw him!",
    ["我真的等不下去了！"] = "I really can't wait any longer!",
    ["我真的要迟到了，晚上见，克莱恩！"] = "I really am going to be late! See you tonight, Klein!",
    ["我真的见到了艾德蒙，而且……而且还见了他千千万万遍。"] = "I really did see Edmund, and... and I saw him thousands upon thousands of times.",
    ["我真笨！竟然连路都不认识了！"] = "I'm so stupid! I can't even recognize the path anymore!",
    ["我真能听懂猫说话了？是那杯茶的效果？"] = "Can I really understand what cats are saying? Is that the effect of the tea?",
    ["我真诚地许下心愿，请睡莲庇佑。"] = "I sincerely make a wish, please let the water lily bless me.",
    ["我睡了很长的一觉，现在对所有东西的记忆都很模糊。"] = "I slept for a very long time, and now my memory of everything is very blurry.",
    ["我睡前做了个<P_Yellow>转运仪式</>，从一本地摊上淘来的书里学来的，或许就是因为这个！"] = "I performed a <P_Yellow>Fortune-Turning Ritual.</> before bed, learned from a book I picked up at a street stall. Maybe that's why!",
    ["我睡觉的时候，感觉有东西压在我身上，不论我怎么挣扎，都没办法坐起来！"] = "When I'm sleeping, I feel like something is pressing down on me. No matter how I struggle, I can't sit up!",
    ["我瞧瞧……来些豌豆、卷心菜、洋葱……再来几个土豆！"] = "Let me see... Give me some peas, cabbage, onions... and a few potatoes!",
    ["我瞧瞧……齐了，低序列魔药的配置很简单，不需要特别的火焰或咒语。至少序列7以下是这样的。"] = "Let me see... it's all here. The preparation of low-sequence potions is very simple, it doesn't require special flames or incantations. At least that's the case below Sequence 7.",
    ["我知道"] = "I know",
    ["我知道……所以第一堂课我不收钱。我只是想证明，我能教好。总得……总得有个开始。"] = "I know... so I don't charge for the first lesson. I just want to prove that I can teach well. There has to be... there has to be a start.",
    ["我知道。但我忘不掉。"] = "I know. But I can't forget.",
    ["我知道。你比我预想的，成长得更快。"] = "I know. You have grown faster than I expected.",
    ["我知道。所以我说你不是一个好的占卜师。"] = "I know. That's why I said you are not a good diviner.",
    ["我知道不对劲，但我只是……呕！不要让我回想那个画面！呕！"] = "I know something's wrong, but I just... Ugh! Don't make me recall that scene! Ugh!",
    ["我知道了"] = "I understand",
    ["我知道了。"] = "I understand.",
    ["我知道了！你就是伦纳德先生在信中提到的那位——“很有天赋的新同事”。"] = "I know! You must be the one Mr. Leonard mentioned in his letter—the 'very talented new colleague'.",
    ["我知道了，你没看见是因为哈兰德百货商店制造的月亮花经过烹饪以后能在廷根大学参加第三十三届世界博览会。"] = "I see. You didn't see it because the moon flowers produced by Harland Department Store can be used at the 33rd World Expo at Tingen University after being cooked.",
    ["我知道了，所以……你在庆典上分发的不是托马斯神父带来的蜡烛，而是<P_Yellow>维斯塔的手工蜡烛</>！"] = "I get it, so... what you distributed at the celebration wasn't the candle Father Thomas brought, but <P_Yellow> Vista's handmade candle </>!",
    ["我知道了，谢谢您……"] = "I understand, thank you...",
    ["我知道他们说的是对的，但“暴怒之民”扮演起来真的很难……"] = "I know what they say is right, but 'Barbarian' is really hard to act out...",
    ["我知道他会过得很好，在某些方面……"] = "I know he will be fine, in some aspects...",
    ["我知道他在哪了，我们走吧。"] = "I know where he is now, let's go.",
    ["我知道他封爵了，我现在是一名打字员，上周他雇我去府上，替他回复了授勋的邀请函。"] = "I know he was knighted. I am a typist now; he hired me last week to go to his manor to reply to his invitation for the knighting ceremony.",
    ["我知道你不是警察，但我信得过你。这张通行证可以让你直接进去。"] = "I know you are not a policeman, but I trust you. This pass will allow you to enter directly.",
    ["我知道你也是非凡者。你出现在<P_Yellow>扭曲领带</>影响范围的时候，我的灵性几乎瞬间被抽干……事实上如果不是你忽然出现，我也许不会失控得这么快。"] = "I know you are also a Beyonder. When you appeared within the range of the <P_Yellow>Twisted Tie</>, my spirituality was almost drained in an instant... In fact, if you hadn't suddenly appeared, I might not have lost control so quickly.",
    ["我知道你们关心我，可生活有时并不需要“团队合作”，你们不能替我做决定呀。"] = "I know you care about me, but life sometimes doesn't need \"teamwork\"; you can't make decisions for me.",
    ["我知道你会想到什么——蒸汽与机械之神，是吧？"] = "I know what you're thinking—God of Steam and Machinery, right?",
    ["我知道你喜欢小朋友，所以我有一个六岁的儿子！"] = "I know you like children, so I have a six-year-old son!",
    ["我知道你在等谁，他不会来的！"] = "I know who you are waiting for, he won't come!",
    ["我知道你想问什么……"] = "I know what you want to ask...",
    ["我知道你是一位好心人，但请你将领带还给我。"] = "I know you are a kind person, but please return the tie to me.",
    ["我知道你能听见，杰克！"] = "I know you can hear me, Jack!",
    ["我知道单纯的语言很难让你相信，你等下进去看到赛琳娜的魔镜就明白了。如果你想拯救你的朋友，需要帮我做一件事。"] = "I know it's hard to believe just by words, you'll understand once you go in and see Selina's magic mirror. If you want to save your friend, you need to do one thing for me.",
    ["我知道圣赛缪尔不是圣赛琳娜，贝克兰德不是廷根，我也不再是以前的我。"] = "I know Saint Samuel is not Saint Selena, Backlund is not Tingen, and I am no longer the person I used to be.",
    ["我知道她想读机械专业，我先看看她的手稿。"] = "I know she wants to study mechanical engineering, let me look at her manuscripts first.",
    ["我知道您一直愧疚。您觉得是您的占卜，害死了我母亲。"] = "I know you've always felt guilty. You think it was your divination that killed my mother.",
    ["我知道您，和警察有关系的年轻人。"] = "I know you, the young man who has connections with the police.",
    ["我知道我正与死亡同行，我知道我正与生命同行。"] = "I know I am walking with death, I know I am walking with life.",
    ["我知道我的研究看起来很疯狂。但在这个世界上，最伟大的发明在最开始的时候，看起来都是疯狂的。不是吗？"] = "I know my research looks crazy. But in this world, the greatest inventions look crazy at the beginning. Don't they?",
    ["我知道我错了，我再也不迟到了……"] = "I know I was wrong, I won't be late again...",
    ["我知道有一家面包店做的蛋糕很好吃，我带你去！"] = "I know a bakery that makes delicious cakes. I'll take you there!",
    ["我知道有些冒昧，但我已经没别的办法了，拜托了！"] = "I know this is a bit presumptuous, but I have no other choice, please!",
    ["我知道湖畔对你们很重要，但一定要是那吗？"] = "I know the lake is very important to you, but does it have to be there?",
    ["我知道瓜里的东西会吞噬买家。每一个来买瓜的，都死了。"] = "I know that the thing inside the pumpkin devours the buyer. Everyone who came to buy a pumpkin died.",
    ["我知道的就这些了，我和管家会在外面等您，以免打扰您的调查。"] = "That's all I know. The butler and I will wait outside so as not to disturb your investigation.",
    ["我知道的，我也信仰“愚者”先生，是他的信徒。"] = "I know, I also believe in Mr. Fool, I am his believer.",
    ["我知道的，我也信仰愚者先生，是他的信徒。"] = "I know, I also believe in Mr. Fool; I am his believer.",
    ["我知道这很艰难，但请保重身体，我……随时都在。"] = "I know this is difficult, but please take care of yourself. I... am always here.",
    ["我知道这很难，但是……我们必须快点做出决定。"] = "I know it's hard, but... we have to make a decision quickly.",
    ["我知道这让你听来有些匪夷所思，我也想克制，只是……"] = "I know this sounds unbelievable to you, and I wanted to restrain myself, but...",
    ["我知道！艾米的秘密基地在客运站！黛西说古堡里有个好地方，我可不敢跟去，太远了……"] = "I know! Amy's secret base is at the Passenger Station! Daisy said there's a good place in the ancient castle, but I didn't dare follow, it's too far...",
    ["我知道，五年前“0-08”也只有简单的描述。"] = "I know, five years ago, \"0-08\" only had a simple description as well.",
    ["我知道，他是为了保护廷根而牺牲的。"] = "I know, he sacrificed himself to protect Tingen.",
    ["我知道，但成为值夜者、代罚者或机械之心就会失去自由……没有别的办法了吗？"] = "I know, but becoming a Nighthawk, Mandated Punisher, or Machine Hivemind means losing my freedom... Is there no other way?",
    ["我知道，但成为官方非凡者就会失去自由……没有别的办法了吗？"] = "I know, but becoming an official Beyonder means losing my freedom... Is there no other way?",
    ["我知道，但我尊重内心的声音。"] = "I know, but I respect the voice within.",
    ["我知道，在贝克兰德这种大城市里，随便搭讪落单女孩的人，估计不是什么善心的夫人。"] = "I know that in a big city like Backlund, anyone who casually strikes up a conversation with a girl alone is probably not a kind-hearted gentleman.",
    ["我知道，夫人，是火车站。"] = "I know, ma'am, it's the train station.",
    ["我知道，小甜心，你爱我的对吧！我也爱你！"] = "I know, sweetheart, you love me, right! I love you too!",
    ["我知道，我很滑稽，观众嘲笑我，像笑一条转圈追自己尾巴的笨狗。"] = "I know, I'm ridiculous. The audience laughs at me like they're laughing at a stupid dog chasing its own tail.",
    ["我知道，我知道，他就爱说傻话……"] = "I know, I know, he just loved to say silly things...",
    ["我知道，这块既可以在表格中直接填写，也可以在编辑器中直接调用，且两端可以互相影响。"] = "I know, this can be filled in directly in the table or called directly in the editor, and the two sides can influence each other.",
    ["我研究星相三年了，但这几天，它们的位置全乱了！我也开始倒霉！"] = "I've been studying astrology for three years, but these past few days, the positions of the stars have all gone haywire! And I've started having bad luck too!",
    ["我研究的是死的历史，他们……他们和杰克经历的，是活过来的历史。这部分的真相，恐怕永远埋在城堡的地基下了。"] = "I study dead history, but they... what they and Jack experienced is history that has come alive. The truth of this part will probably be buried under the foundation of the castle forever.",
    ["我确定……我熟悉老爷的声音，那音色就是他的，我服侍老爷好几年了，不会记错的……"] = "I'm sure... I'm familiar with the Master's voice. The tone was his. I've served the Master for several years, I wouldn't remember it wrong...",
    ["我确实什么都不记得了，戴莉女士的能力也没发现什么。"] = "I really don't remember anything, and Ms. Daly's abilities didn't discover anything either.",
    ["我确实挺想去的……那你说我是什么时候去呢？"] = "I really want to go... so when do you think I should go?",
    ["我确认过了，你中的那一枪，不是普通的铅弹。"] = "I've confirmed it; the bullet you took wasn't an ordinary lead bullet.",
    ["我祈求光明的指引，为忠诚者献上迟来的祝福。"] = "I pray for the guidance of light, offering a belated blessing to the loyal.",
    ["我祈求女神的庇佑……"] = "I pray for the Goddess's protection...",
    ["我祈求女神的眷顾；"] = "I pray for the Goddess's favor;",
    ["我祈求您——"] = "I pray to you—",
    ["我祈求您庇佑一位忠实的信徒"] = "I pray for your protection for a loyal believer",
    ["我祈求您的帮助"] = "I pray for your help",
    ["我祈求您的注视"] = "I pray for your gaze",
    ["我祈求您的眷顾"] = "I pray for your favor",
    ["我祈求您的眷顾，祈求您净化此处的污染！"] = "I pray for your favor, I pray for you to purify the corruption here!",
    ["我祈求您的眷顾，祈求您让此地的物品解开封印！"] = "I pray for your favor, I pray for you to unseal the items here!",
    ["我祈求您的眷顾，祈求您赐予我，进入历史迷雾的许可与祝福……"] = "I pray for your favor, I pray for you to grant me permission and blessings to enter the fog of history...",
    ["我祈求您降下眷顾，眷顾您迷失的羔羊阿尔伯特·奥姆！"] = "I pray for Your favor, favor for Your lost lamb, Albert Orm!",
    ["我祈求隐秘的力量；"] = "I pray to the power of Secrecy;",
    ["我祈求黑夜的力量，祈求绯红的力量；"] = "I pray for the power of the night, I pray for the power of the crimson;",
    ["我祈求黑夜的力量；"] = "I pray to the power of the Night;",
    ["我祈祷的时候被人听见了，那个男人教了我一种仪式。"] = "I was heard when I was praying, and that man taught me a ritual.",
    ["我祖父说，当风暴之主回应时，天上就会开始刮风下雨打雷！"] = "My grandfather said that when the Lord of Storms responds, it will start to wind, rain, and thunder in the sky!",
    ["我神精状态好挺的呀。"] = "My mental state is quite good.",
    ["我离开时，他还坐在桌边喝茶。一边喝，一边盯着门口，应该是在等埃文医生，他患有心脏病，那时正好是他的复诊时间。"] = "When I left, he was still sitting at the table drinking tea. While drinking, he was staring at the door, likely waiting for Dr. Evan. He suffered from heart disease, and it was time for his follow-up visit.",
    ["我租它能干什么呢？"] = "What can I do if I rent it?",
    ["我穿一身宁静药水打怪像话吗？？？"] = "Is it appropriate for me to fight monsters wearing a Tranquility Potion???",
    ["我穿一身药水打怪像话吗？？？"] = "Is it appropriate for me to wear a suit of potions to fight monsters???",
    ["我穿越下水道"] = "I traverse the sewers",
    ["我穿越了……"] = "I've transmigrated...",
    ["我穿越到这个世界的原因还不清楚，但应该跟非凡有关。"] = "The reason I transmigrated to this world is still unclear, but it should be related to the Beyonder world.",
    ["我突然想起来我也有点事，得先走了。"] = "I suddenly remembered I have something to do, I have to go first.",
    ["我突然想起来，为了庆祝，我们还需要梅丽莎喜欢的柠檬蛋糕，当然也少不了姜汁啤酒！"] = "I suddenly remembered that to celebrate, we also need the lemon cake Melissa likes, and of course, ginger beer!",
    ["我突然记起来了！我的执念是看到每个人获得真正的幸福，例如你跟邓恩快快乐乐地在一起。"] = "I suddenly remembered! My obsession is to see everyone achieve true happiness, for example, you and Dunn happily together.",
    ["我站在街边，弹奏这首普通的歌曲。"] = "I stand by the street, playing this ordinary song.",
    ["我站在街边，弹奏这首，普通的歌曲~"] = "I stand by the street, playing this, ordinary song~",
    ["我竟然在跟一面镜子交流……"] = "I am actually communicating with a mirror...",
    ["我第一次经历的时候，以为自己要死了。"] = "When I experienced it for the first time, I thought I was going to die.",
    ["我第一次见他说那么多话……后来，他被炮弹炸毁了右手，再也没法拿笔了。"] = "That was the first time I heard him talk so much... Later, his right hand was blown off by a shell, and he could never hold a pen again.",
    ["我第一笔成功投资是脚踏车公司的股票，我当时并没有足够的钱购买股票，但我父亲教了我一种投资技巧。"] = "My first successful investment was in bicycle company stocks. I didn't have enough money to buy stocks at the time, but my father taught me an investment technique.",
    ["我等了好久，下一份应该是我的吧？"] = "I've been waiting for a long time, the next one should be mine, right?",
    ["我等你很久了"] = "I've been waiting for you for a long time",
    ["我答应你。"] = "I promise you.",
    ["我答应你！"] = "I promise you!",
    ["我答应带他们旅行，想着行程安排，兴奋地多走了两步，不小心离开了。"] = "I promised to take them on a trip, and thinking about the itinerary, I excitedly walked a few extra steps and accidentally left.",
    ["我答应过她，要一直陪着她。\n所以，这扇门我来替你打开。\n这一次……换你先走。"] = "I promised her I would always stay with her. \nSo, I will open this door for you.\n This time... it's your turn to go first.",
    ["我答应过教你神秘学知识。"] = "I promised to teach you occult knowledge.",
    ["我简直为这些鲜润、红艳的小果实着了魔，恨不得夜夜半跪下去，亲吻每一片叶子。"] = "I was simply obsessed with these fresh, bright red little fruits, wishing I could kneel down every night and kiss every single leaf.",
    ["我算一算……有半年了吧。"] = "Let me calculate... it's been half a year.",
    ["我精神状态挺好的。"] = "My mental state is quite good.",
    ["我累了，你也回去休息吧。"] = "I'm tired, you go back and rest too.",
    ["我终于……成了真正的尸体……"] = "I have finally... become a true corpse...",
    ["我经常会想……我已经无法改变结局，但他们是否还留有遗憾……我还能为他们做些什么……"] = "I often think... I can no longer change the ending, but do they still have regrets? Is there anything else I can do for them...",
    ["我经常假装抄小路啊，我的演技这么差吗？"] = "I often pretend to take shortcuts, is my acting that bad?",
    ["我结婚的帽子，我孩子的第一顶帽子，我父亲的最后一顶帽子，都是在汉特家买的……"] = "The hat I wore to my wedding, the first hat for my child, the last hat for my father, were all bought at the Hunt family's shop...",
    ["我给了他们工作，给了饭吃，他们却反过来骂我？"] = "I gave them work, gave them food, yet they turn around and curse me?",
    ["我给了您极致的欢愉，您却要杀我？"] = "I gave you the ultimate pleasure, yet you want to kill me?",
    ["我给他刻的墓志铭——“戴维，追风雪的人。”"] = "The epitaph I carved for him—'David, the one who chases the wind and snow.'",
    ["我给他算了一笔账，出了一个赚到更多房租的主意。在更多的租金面前，他爽快地同意了。"] = "I calculated an account for him and came up with an idea to earn more rent. In the face of more rent, he readily agreed.",
    ["我给你三倍的报酬，你只为我一个人写。今晚就跟我走吧。 "] = "I'll pay you triple the reward if you write only for me. Come with me tonight.",
    ["我给你开一些药方吧，价格就按照医院的五分之一来。"] = "I will write you a prescription, and the price will be one-fifth of what it costs at the hospital.",
    ["我给你的建议是，凡事谨慎，保护好自己。"] = "My advice to you is to be cautious in everything and protect yourself well.",
    ["我给母亲带了补剂……"] = "I brought supplements for Mother...",
    ["我给过你机会了，但是现在，你只能留下自己灵魂的悲鸣……"] = "I gave you a chance, but now, you can only leave behind the wails of your own soul...",
    ["我绝对不会因为一场精彩的拳击赛而毁坏誓言……"] = "I will absolutely not break my oath because of a wonderful boxing match...",
    ["我绝对是绘画天才！等着看我出名吧！"] = "I am definitely a painting genius! Just wait until I become famous!",
    ["我缴完年费后就立刻申请报销。"] = "I will apply for reimbursement immediately after I pay the annual fee.",
    ["我缺少“水”给他"] = "I lack 'water' to give him",
    ["我缺少“药物”给他"] = "I am missing 'Medicine' to give him",
    ["我缺少“面包”给他"] = "I am missing 'Bread' to give him",
    ["我翻……我翻……"] = "Flipping... flipping...",
    ["我老了。不清楚。不是我。我教你，你向前走两条街，再左转，再右转，再直走，去那里投诉……"] = "I'm old. I don't know. It wasn't me. I'll teach you, go forward two streets, then turn left, then turn right, then go straight, go there to file a complaint...",
    ["我老爸他又喝多了，我怕他打我，就躲到这里了。"] = "My dad got drunk again, I was afraid he would hit me, so I hid here.",
    ["我考虑一下"] = "I'll think about it",
    ["我耳背，新来的小家伙都嚷了些啥？"] = "I'm hard of hearing. What was that new kid shouting about?",
    ["我联系了医生过来照看伊琳。我会照顾好她。"] = "I have contacted a doctor to come and look after Irene. I will take good care of her.",
    ["我肯定发誓。最近好像老有人跟踪我……"] = "I swear. Recently, it seems like someone is always following me...",
    ["我能不能约……"] = "Could I ask...",
    ["我能为他做点什么吗？"] = "Is there anything I can do for him?",
    ["我能为你提供三种帮助。"] = "I can provide you with three types of help.",
    ["我能为您辨认和评判一切材料的价值，保证您做一笔划算的买卖。"] = "I can identify and judge the value of all materials for you, ensuring you make a profitable deal.",
    ["我能做个什么大臣呢？"] = "What kind of minister could I be?",
    ["我能做些什么？"] = "What can I do?",
    ["我能分多少？"] = "How much do I get?",
    ["我能加入猎龙帮吗？我也想猎龙！凯文老大在哪里，我想找他签个名！"] = "Can I join the Dragon Hunter Gang? I want to hunt dragons too! Where is Boss Kevin? I want to get his autograph!",
    ["我能听见你。"] = "I can hear you.",
    ["我能听见！"] = "I can hear you!",
    ["我能够帮助那些新成立的家庭规划好相互间需要承担的责任和义务，如何安排家庭开支，均衡收入和花销……"] = "I can help newly established families plan the responsibilities and obligations they need to bear toward each other, how to arrange household expenses, and how to balance income and spending...",
    ["我能帮你吗？"] = "Can I help you?",
    ["我能帮助你清醒"] = "I can help you clear your mind",
    ["我能感受到一股迟钝又漫长的情绪……"] = "I can feel a dull and lingering emotion...",
    ["我能感觉到你就在这儿……就在我身边。所以我们哪儿也不去，这店永远是咱们的。"] = "I can feel you right here... right by my side. So we aren't going anywhere, this shop will always be ours.",
    ["我能感觉到你的状态。如果你愿意，我可以给你一点帮助。"] = "I can feel your state. If you are willing, I can give you some help.",
    ["我能把你比作月亮花吗？"] = "Can I compare you to a moonflower?",
    ["我能拿到“心脏”，还得谢谢你的涂鸦和牛奶……"] = "I was able to get the 'heart', I have to thank your scribbles and milk...",
    ["我能理解......但您考虑过那些平时努力学习的学生吗？"] = "I can understand... but have you considered those students who study hard every day?",
    ["我能理解。"] = "I can understand.",
    ["我能理解您。"] = "I can understand you.",
    ["我能看出你内心的疑惑和不安。"] = "I can see the doubts and anxiety in your heart.",
    ["我能看见你心中的疑问，它们像一团乱糟糟的毛线球。"] = "I can see the questions in your heart; they are like a tangled ball of yarn.",
    ["我能确定莫雷蒂先生是出色的占卜师，他刚刚占卜了一位先生的情况，结果非常准确。"] = "I can confirm that Mr. Moretti is an excellent diviner. He just performed a divination for a gentleman, and the result was very accurate.",
    ["我能走到这一步，多亏了一个人，那就是——"] = "I owe my success to one person, and that is—",
    ["我脑子很乱，我看到了另外一个自己……"] = "My mind is a mess, I saw another version of myself...",
    ["我脑袋呢"] = "Where is my head",
    ["我腿软了，我走不动……"] = "My legs have gone weak, I can't walk...",
    ["我自己的东西，想怎么卖就怎么卖。"] = "It's my own stuff, I can sell it however I want.",
    ["我花了很长时间观察、试探，才逐渐理解……那位存在的伟大。"] = "I spent a long time observing and testing before I gradually understood... the greatness of that existence.",
    ["我花了整整两年时间研究这个课题。结果呢？教会的人把我送上了审判庭！"] = "I spent two whole years researching this topic. And the result? The people from the Church sent me to the Inquisition!",
    ["我虽然只是旁观者，没有嗅觉，但我能想象出它的清香。"] = "Although I was just an observer and had no sense of smell, I could imagine its fragrance.",
    ["我衷心地祝福你们，祝你们今后再也不分离……"] = "I sincerely wish you both well, may you never be separated again...",
    ["我被……滞……涩……"] = "I am... being... sluggish...",
    ["我被一个疯子戏剧家盯上了！崔佛说会有人来帮我。"] = "I'm being targeted by a mad dramatist! Trevor said someone would come to help me.",
    ["我被卷入一起诡异的事件里，相关的人都离奇自杀，我却死而复活了……真是恐怖。"] = "I was involved in a bizarre incident where everyone involved committed suicide in a strange way, yet I died and was resurrected... It's truly terrifying.",
    ["我被委托收集一些有趣的人类对话，为某位作家提供写作灵感。"] = "I have been commissioned to collect some interesting human conversations to provide writing inspiration for a certain author.",
    ["我被挂科了……"] = "I failed the course...",
    ["我被诅咒了！没法从地上起来，只有真爱之吻才能解除！"] = "I've been cursed! I can't get up from the ground; only a true love's kiss can break it!",
    ["我被鲁本枪杀……子弹贯穿心脏。这太具体了，像是已经发生过一样。"] = "I was shot by Ruben... the bullet pierced my heart. This is too specific, as if it had already happened.",
    ["我要。成为。小说家。然后。开了领导。"] = "I want to. Become. A novelist. And then. Fire the boss.",
    ["我要上山，找我的妻子戴维。每月我都来，几十年了。"] = "I'm going up the mountain to find my wife, David. I come every month, for decades now.",
    ["我要为难得的客人，准备一壶好茶。"] = "I must prepare a pot of good tea for my rare guest.",
    ["我要举报你！"] = "I'm going to report you!",
    ["我要乞讨到很多很多的钱 给大家买汽水喝！"] = "I want to beg for lots and lots of money to buy soda for everyone!",
    ["我要买车票"] = "I want to buy a ticket",
    ["我要亲自惩戒贪污官员和污染环境的人！"] = "I will personally punish corrupt officials and those who cause pollution!",
    ["我要休息了，天还没亮，还来得及打个盹。"] = "I'm going to rest. It's not dawn yet, there's still time for a nap.",
    ["我要佛尔思的签名……签名！签名！"] = "I want Fors's autograph... autograph! Autograph!",
    ["我要你鼠"] = "I Want You, Rat",
    ["我要你鼠-Step1"] = "I Want You, Rat - Step 1",
    ["我要你鼠-Step2"] = "I Want You, Rat - Step 2",
    ["我要你鼠-Step3"] = "I Want You, Rat - Step 3",
    ["我要你鼠-step1"] = "I Want You to Rat-step 1",
    ["我要你鼠-step2"] = "I Want You to Rat-step 2",
    ["我要你鼠-step3"] = "I Want You to Rat-step 3",
    ["我要你鼠-结束"] = "I Want You to Rat-end",
    ["我要你鼠前置"] = "I Want You to Rat Prerequisite",
    ["我要你鼠！"] = "I Want You to Die!",
    ["我要先去找妹妹了，再见！"] = "I'm going to find my sister now, goodbye!",
    ["我要写一本军事巨著！论证因蒂斯应该趁鲁恩和弗萨克开战，轻取霍纳奇斯攻入鲁恩！"] = "I'm going to write a military masterpiece! Arguing that Intis should take advantage of the war between Loen and Feysac to easily capture Hornacis and invade Loen!",
    ["我要办点事，想进入地下市场。"] = "I have some business to attend to, I want to enter the underground market.",
    ["我要加入你们"] = "I want to join you",
    ["我要占卜！"] = "I want a divination!",
    ["我要去上学了，走去学校要五十分钟。克莱恩，今天只买八磅面包就好。天气热，买太多容易坏掉。"] = "I'm going to school; it takes fifty minutes to walk there. Klein, just buy eight pounds of bread today. It's hot, and it spoils easily if we buy too much.",
    ["我要去找小爱丽丝，找她好好哭一场……"] = "I'm going to find little Alice and have a good cry with her...",
    ["我要去拜亚姆发财了！"] = "I'm going to Bayam to make a fortune!",
    ["我要去那里……那里比南大陆更南，比北大陆更北，比苏尼亚海更东，比迷雾海更西……"] = "I want to go there... it is further south than the Southern Continent, further north than the Northern Continent, further east than the Sonia Sea, further west than the Fog Sea...",
    ["我要变帅。不，等一下，我要无任何副作用无代价家庭和睦身体健康版变帅。"] = "I want to become handsome. No, wait, I want the version where I become handsome with no side effects, no cost, a harmonious family, and good health.",
    ["我要变得富有了！"] = "I am going to be rich!",
    ["我要变有钱！"] = "I want to be rich!",
    ["我要听罗塞尔的故事！"] = "I want to hear the story of Roselle!",
    ["我要回去监督她写作了。"] = "I need to go back and supervise her writing.",
    ["我要如何加入俱乐部？"] = "How do I join the club?",
    ["我要工作多少年才能买得起这样一条项链……"] = "How many years do I have to work to afford a necklace like this...",
    ["我要带他们回廷根湖畔。"] = "I am going to take them back to Tingen Lake.",
    ["我要带他们回警局了。你因受骗购买的商品，我们会联系店主，协商退货退款，到时候再通知你来取回自己的钱。"] = "I'm taking them back to the police station. We will contact the shop owner regarding the goods you bought after being deceived to negotiate returns and refunds. We will notify you to come and get your money back then.",
    ["我要当全廷根最有钱！"] = "I want to be the richest person in all of Tingen!",
    ["我要快点晋升，尽量帮上弗莱先生的忙！"] = "I need to advance quickly and try my best to help Mr. Frye!",
    ["我要怎么做？"] = "What should I do?",
    ["我要我觉得"] = "I want what I think",
    ["我要找三个杂活女仆，干事麻利，安静话少的就行。"] = "I'm looking for three housemaids who are quick and quiet.",
    ["我要找个椅子休息会……"] = "I need to find a chair to rest for a while...",
    ["我要找到自己的家乡。\n我和家乡的他们约定好了： \n要把去弗萨克买到的烈酒给老查克喝， 要把去费内波特买到的特制南瓜种子给小柯莱种， 她一直很想要一个美丽的南瓜园。"] = "I must find my hometown.\nI made a promise to them back home:\nTo give the strong liquor bought in Feysac to Old Chuck, and to give the special pumpkin seeds bought in Feynapot to Little Colley to plant. She has always wanted a beautiful pumpkin garden.",
    ["我要找的人会是他们吗？他们跑远了，追上去看看。"] = "Could the people I'm looking for be them? They ran far away, let's chase after them and see.",
    ["我要把小萨拉的消息告诉母亲，她一定会高兴的。"] = "I want to tell Mother about little Sarah's news; she will definitely be happy.",
    ["我要把整个廷根，不，整个鲁恩都种上拜朗长荽叶。"] = "I want to plant Balam coriander all over Tingen, no, all over Loen.",
    ["我要报警了！"] = "I'm calling the police!",
    ["我要报警了！我要报警了！"] = "I'm calling the police! I'm calling the police!",
    ["我要拍到你的铁证……把照片丢在你面前……"] = "I will capture your ironclad evidence... and throw the photos in front of you...",
    ["我要是有钱，就每天坐最贵的公共马车！"] = "If I were rich, I'd ride the most expensive public carriage every day!",
    ["我要是梅兰妮，我和山姆相亲相爱还来不及呢。"] = "If I were Melanie, I'd be all over Sam, loving him to bits.",
    ["我要晋升为女巫？开什么玩笑？"] = "I am to advance to a Witch? Are you joking?",
    ["我要朗诵第二段了：冰湖！你像一面白色的镜！干干净净！"] = "I'm going to recite the second stanza: Icy lake! You are like a white mirror! Clean and pure!",
    ["我要欣赏一个“民族舞”！"] = "I want to enjoy a \"Folk Dance\"!",
    ["我要欣赏一个“鼓掌舞”！"] = "I want to enjoy a \"Clapping Dance\"!",
    ["我要求不高，能在婚礼上演奏就行。您愿意听我的演奏，然后给点建议吗？"] = "I don't have high demands; I just want to be able to perform at weddings. Would you be willing to listen to my performance and give me some advice?",
    ["我要点单"] = "I want to order",
    ["我要狠狠踢你的屁股！"] = "I'm going to kick your ass hard!",
    ["我要用塔罗算今晚管家做什么晚饭——别再是那些菜叶子了！再用灵摆问明天翘课会不会被我妈发现！"] = "I want to use Tarot to calculate what the butler is making for dinner tonight—don't let it be those vegetable leaves again! Then use the pendulum to ask if my mom will find out if I skip class tomorrow!",
    ["我要看佛尔思的新作！我要看佛尔思的新作……我要佛尔思的签名！"] = "I want to see Fors's new work! I want to see Fors's new work... I want Fors's autograph!",
    ["我要纠正居民的错误习惯，\r\n搭建完整的下水道系统！"] = "I will correct the residents' bad habits and build a complete sewer system!",
    ["我要解契"] = "I want to dissolve the contract",
    ["我要让每一条街都有路灯，让每一个孩子都上得起学，让劳工的薪水不再被克扣！"] = "I will make sure every street has streetlamps, every child can afford to go to school, and that the wages of laborers are no longer withheld!",
    ["我要输了。但我仍然认为数字远比文字更为深奥、迷人。\n\n蒙特不认同。所以我们各自打开一本隐秘的书，冒着死去或变成木偶的风险，从这两件封印物中寻找证明。\n\n不幸读到这里的人——你可能和我有着相同的命运。这本书吞噬了数字和信息。而<InvHighlight>三个水晶球是再次封印它的唯一方式 </>。三，几何学里最小的封闭结构。在数字本身被隐去后，你所能依靠的只有数字之间的关系，这是你唯一的希望。\n\n请记住：<InvHighlight>α等于“失序之书”书名的字数 </>，是第一个内藏关系的数字，在它之前的数字都是不可被分割的整体。\n\n<InvHighlight> α</>等于<InvHighlight>4</> \n<InvHighlight> β</>等于<InvHighlight>3</> \n<InvHighlight> ω</>等于<InvHighlight>2</> "] = "I am going to lose. But I still believe that numbers are far more profound and fascinating than words. \n\nMonte disagrees. So we each opened a secret book, risking death or becoming a puppet, to find proof from these two Sealed Artifacts. \n\nWhoever reads this by misfortune—you might share the same fate as me. This book devours numbers and information. And <InvHighlight>the three crystal balls are the only way to seal it again </>. Three, the smallest closed structure in geometry. After the numbers themselves are hidden, all you can rely on is the relationship between the numbers; this is your only hope. \n\nPlease remember: <InvHighlight>α equals the number of characters in the title of the \"Book of Disorder\" </>, it is the first number that contains a relationship, and all numbers before it are indivisible wholes. \n\n<InvHighlight> α</> equals <InvHighlight>4</> \n<InvHighlight> β</> equals <InvHighlight>3</> \n<InvHighlight> ω</> equals <InvHighlight>2</> ",
    ["我要输了。但我仍然认为数字远比文字更为深奥、迷人。\n\n蒙特不认同。所以我们各自打开一本隐秘的书，冒着死去或变成木偶的风险，从这两件封印物中寻找证明。\n\n不幸读到这里的人——你可能和我有着相同的命运。这本书吞噬了数字和信息。而<InvHighlight>三个水晶球是再次封印它的唯一方式 </>。三，几何学里最小的封闭结构。在数字本身被隐去后，你所能依靠的只有数字之间的关系，这是你唯一的希望。\n\n请记住：<InvHighlight>α等于“失序之书”书名的字数 </>，是第一个内藏关系的数字，在它之前的数字都是不可被分割的整体。\n\n<InvHighlight> α</>等于<InvHighlight>4</> \n<InvHighlight> β</>等于<InvHighlight>3</> \n<InvHighlight> ω</>等于<InvHighlight>？</> "] = " I am going to lose. But I still think numbers are far more profound and fascinating than words. \n \n Monte disagrees. So we each opened a secret book, risking death or becoming a puppet, to look for proof from these two Sealed Artifacts. \n \n Those who unfortunately read this far—you might have the same fate as me. This book devours numbers and information. And <InvHighlight> three crystal balls are the only way to seal it again </>. Three, the smallest closed structure in geometry. After the numbers themselves are hidden, all you can rely on is the relationship between the numbers; this is your only hope. \n \n Please remember: <InvHighlight> α equals the number of characters in the title of the \"Book of Disorder\" </>, which is the first number containing an internal relationship; the numbers before it are all indivisible wholes. \n \n <InvHighlight> α </> equals <InvHighlight> 4 </> \n <InvHighlight> β </> equals <InvHighlight> 3 </> \n <InvHighlight> ω </> equals <InvHighlight> ? </>",
    ["我要输了。但我仍然认为数字远比文字更为深奥、迷人。\n\n蒙特不认同。所以我们各自打开一本隐秘的书，冒着死去或变成木偶的风险，从这两件封印物中寻找证明。\n\n不幸读到这里的人——你可能和我有着相同的命运。这本书吞噬了数字和信息。而<InvHighlight>三个水晶球是再次封印它的唯一方式 </>。三，几何学里最小的封闭结构。在数字本身被隐去后，你所能依靠的只有数字之间的关系，这是你唯一的希望。\n\n请记住：<InvHighlight>α等于“失序之书”书名的字数 </>，是第一个内藏关系的数字，在它之前的数字都是不可被分割的整体。\n\n<InvHighlight> α</>等于<InvHighlight>4</> \n<InvHighlight> β</>等于<InvHighlight>？</> \n<InvHighlight> ω</>等于<InvHighlight>？</> "] = " I am going to lose. But I still think numbers are far more profound and fascinating than words. \n \n Monte disagrees. So we each opened a secret book, risking death or becoming a puppet, to look for proof from these two Sealed Artifacts. \n \n Those who unfortunately read this far—you might have the same fate as me. This book devours numbers and information. And <InvHighlight> three crystal balls are the only way to seal it again </>. Three, the smallest closed structure in geometry. After the numbers themselves are hidden, all you can rely on is the relationship between the numbers; this is your only hope. \n \n Please remember: <InvHighlight> α equals the number of characters in the title of the \"Book of Disorder\" </>, which is the first number containing an internal relationship; the numbers before it are all indivisible wholes. \n \n <InvHighlight> α </> equals <InvHighlight> 4 </> \n <InvHighlight> β </> equals <InvHighlight> ? </> \n <InvHighlight> ω </> equals <InvHighlight> ? </>",
    ["我要这样问：魔镜魔镜，学派里最美丽的人是谁？——怎么样？"] = "I'm going to ask this: Mirror, mirror, who is the most beautiful person in the school? —How about that?",
    ["我要迟到了！"] = "I'm going to be late!",
    ["我要迟到了！记得买面包，再买一些羔羊肉和豌豆。"] = "I'm going to be late! Remember to buy bread, and get some lamb and peas too.",
    ["我要追随达尼兹，那位鼎鼎有名的海盗！"] = "I'm going to follow Danitz, that famous pirate!",
    ["我要遵循女神所宣扬的平等……"] = "I must follow the equality preached by the Goddess...",
    ["我要！"] = "I want it!",
    ["我见到了到午夜都不会落下的太阳"] = "I saw the sun that never sets until midnight",
    ["我见到了午夜都不会落下的太阳"] = "I have seen the sun that never sets at midnight.",
    ["我见工匠，如见理性的辉光。——罗塞尔·古斯塔夫"] = "To see a craftsman is to see the radiance of reason. — Roselle Gustav",
    ["我见过你……你是怎么进来的？"] = "I've seen you... how did you get in?",
    ["我见过太多死亡，而我也会一直战斗，最后死于某次任务里，每个值夜者队长都逃不过这样的命运。"] = "I have seen too much death, and I will keep fighting until I eventually die in some mission. Every Nighthawk captain cannot escape such a fate.",
    ["我觉得……"] = "I think...",
    ["我觉得他在……"] = "I think he is at...",
    ["我觉得他说得对"] = "I think he's right",
    ["我觉得像是86，你呢？"] = "I think it's like 86, what about you?",
    ["我觉得很赞"] = "I think it's great",
    ["我觉得得看反省的诚意。"] = "I think it depends on the sincerity of the repentance.",
    ["我觉得我脖子上光秃秃的……对吗，玛莎？"] = "I feel like my neck is bare... right, Martha?",
    ["我觉得挺正确的，至少符合我所看见所接触的一些事情……"] = "I think it's quite correct, at least it aligns with some of the things I've seen and encountered...",
    ["我觉得数学太理性了。但文字，文字不一样。它记录人的爱恨，生死，一切的故事……"] = "I think mathematics is too rational. But words, words are different. They record people's love and hate, life and death, all stories...",
    ["我觉得自己像个邮戳，区别是邮戳还能寄出去！"] = "I feel like a postmark, the difference is that a postmark can be sent out!",
    ["我觉得这位{{先生|女士}}的审美还不赖，如果你考虑加入廷根时尚协会的话……"] = "I think this {{sir|madam}}'s sense of style isn't bad. If you are considering joining the Tingen Fashion Association...",
    ["我觉得都很好！"] = "I think they're all great!",
    ["我认为你的遗忘是循环的，或许你每隔几十年，就会死亡一次，清空掉之前的记忆。"] = "I think your oblivion is cyclical. Perhaps you die once every few decades, clearing away your previous memories.",
    ["我认为可以普及一下常见急救方法，应对一些日常的突发情况。"] = "I think we can popularize some common first aid methods to deal with some daily emergencies.",
    ["我认为有必要对海纳斯展开调查。"] = "I think it is necessary to launch an investigation into Haines.",
    ["我认为留下这个孩子，会让你以后的人生变得艰难，毕竟他父亲是个诈骗犯。"] = "I believe keeping this child will make your future life difficult; after all, his father is a swindler.",
    ["我认为纯麦芽酿的朗齐是酒馆最重要的招牌，对吧？"] = "I think pure malt Langzi is the tavern's most important signature, right?",
    ["我认为，你的妆容和气色，都和她们没区别。"] = "I think your makeup and complexion are no different from theirs.",
    ["我认为，这是他看到了星空中的秘密。“唯恐惊扰”说明他看到了不该看的东西……"] = "I think this is him seeing the secrets in the starry sky. 'For fear of disturbing' shows that he saw something he shouldn't have seen...",
    ["我认为，这表达的是一种“敬畏”。"] = "I believe this expresses a kind of 'awe'.",
    ["我认为，这表达的是一种“敬畏”。 "] = "I believe this expresses a kind of \"awe.\"",
    ["我认识他！他是那个赞助商的管家！"] = "I know him! He is the butler of that sponsor!",
    ["我认识它，它没有忘记"] = "I know it, it hasn't forgotten",
    ["我认识这个代罚者，他跟随斯维因多年，曾经清理过水鬼、也抓捕过逃走的邪恶非凡者……可如今……"] = "I know this Punisher. He followed Swain for many years and has cleared out water ghosts and captured escaped evil Beyonders... but now...",
    ["我认识这个曲调！"] = "I recognize this tune!",
    ["我讨厌你们！我不要跟你们一起玩了！"] = "I hate you all! I don't want to play with you anymore!",
    ["我讨厌抽烟的家伙！"] = "I hate people who smoke!",
    ["我让他们在门口等着我，我上去拿攻略。但一回来就找不见人了！"] = "I told them to wait for me at the entrance while I went up to get the guide. But when I came back, they were gone!",
    ["我让那个骗走我工厂、伤害我家人的混蛋永远沉入了间海……一切，都结束了。"] = "I made that bastard who swindled my factory and hurt my family sink into the Midseashire forever... Everything is over.",
    ["我记不清了……<P_Heart>（嘟囔）</>他，他昨天夜里溜到我家后院里，隔着窗户告诉我，他攒了一笔钱，想正式邀请我约会……"] = "I can't remember clearly... <P_Heart> (muttering) </> He, he snuck into my backyard last night and told me through the window that he had saved up some money and wanted to formally invite me on a date...",
    ["我记住你了，你给我等着！"] = "I'll remember you, you just wait!",
    ["我记住你了，出来！"] = "I've remembered you, come out!",
    ["我记得<P_Yellow>阿罗德斯</>在屏障大厅那边……"] = "I remember <P_Yellow>Arrodes</> was over by the barrier hall...",
    ["我记得“共感手铐”要这样这样才能安全解开……"] = "I remember that the 'Empathy Handcuffs' need to be done this way and that to be safely unlocked...",
    ["我记得……这是一百多年前因蒂斯共和国执政官罗塞尔·古斯塔夫发明的。"] = "I remember... this was invented by Roselle Gustav, the Consul of the Intis Republic, over a hundred years ago.",
    ["我记得。其他报纸呢，《塔索克报》《故事评论》？"] = "I remember. What about other newspapers, like the Tussock Times or Story Reviews?",
    ["我记得三年前过来的时候，就在这边！"] = "I remember when we came here three years ago, it was right here!",
    ["我记得不远，就在铁十字街。"] = "I remember it's not far, right on Iron Cross Street.",
    ["我记得他的名字和所有罪行，我不会放过他的。"] = "I remember his name and all his crimes, I won't let him go.",
    ["我记得你今天休假吧，怎么有空来公司？你可不要像弗莱那样，从不下班，永不休假，几乎把公司当成家了！"] = "I remember you're on leave today, why do you have time to come to the company? Don't be like Frye, who never gets off work, never takes a break, and almost treats the company as his home!",
    ["我记得你提到过……邓恩他们沉睡在拉斐尔墓园，对吗？"] = "I remember you mentioned... Dunn and the others are sleeping in Raphael Cemetery, right?",
    ["我记得你是刚刚被工头打伤的孩子，你还好吗？"] = "I remember you are the child who was just beaten by the foreman. Are you okay?",
    ["我记得你的母亲眼睛不好，她经常以为莱利叔叔有两个。"] = "I remember your mother has bad eyesight, she often thinks Uncle Riley is two people.",
    ["我记得你，我看过你的推荐信。但有什么事吗？我并不负责面试。"] = "I remember you, I've seen your recommendation letter. But is there something the matter? I'm not in charge of the interviews.",
    ["我记得刚成为值夜者的样子，记得第一次独立办案子，第一次领薪水，以及第一次打牌输掉半个月的餐费……"] = "I remember what it was like when I first became a Nighthawk, my first solo case, my first paycheck, and the first time I lost half a month's meal money playing cards...",
    ["我记得在另一边……看到过一个巨大的雕像，还有一个奇怪的机关……可以封存大剑……唔，好困……"] = "I remember on the other side... seeing a huge statue, and a strange mechanism... that could seal a greatsword... *yawn*, so sleepy...",
    ["我记得夜莺银哨的副作用是令携带者感到疲倦，以及特别招鸟类的喜爱。"] = "I remember the side effect of the Nightingale Silver Whistle is to make the bearer feel tired, and it is particularly attractive to birds.",
    ["我记得她第一次吃过你做的菜后，非常亢奋，满餐厅大喊，自己以后一定要成为一个美食家。"] = "I remember after she ate your cooking for the first time, she was very excited, shouting across the restaurant that she would definitely become a gourmet in the future.",
    ["我记得我放在这里的……"] = "I remember I put it here...",
    ["我记得火的温热和带有香味的雾气……跟我来！"] = "I remember the warmth of the fire and the fragrant mist... follow me!",
    ["我记得祂曾说过这样一句话。"] = "I remember He once said this sentence.",
    ["我记得答应过你们的事情，我不会食言的……我们在<P_Yellow>拉斐尔公墓</>见面吧，我会带你们去玫瑰生长的地方。"] = "I remember what I promised you, I won't go back on my word... Let's meet at <P_Yellow>Raphael Cemetery</>, and I will take you to where the roses grow.",
    ["我记得这些树的形状，泥土的触感，还有果子。"] = "I remember the shape of these trees, the feel of the soil, and the fruits.",
    ["我记得这家伙，“黑手套”的打手，属于三大黑帮里最暴力的那群人，不过他之前可没有这么疯。"] = "I remember this guy. He's a thug for the 'Black Gloves,' one of the most violent groups among the three major gangs. But he wasn't this crazy before.",
    ["我记得这束花……塞维亚菊，象征着快乐。"] = "I remember this bouquet... Sevia Chrysanthemums, symbolizing happiness.",
    ["我记得这附近有公共盥洗室，赶紧找找！"] = "I remember there is a public restroom nearby, I must find it quickly!",
    ["我记得那里是马厩，那里是水井，那里是士兵的营房，那里开辟出了一片田地，用来种植土豆和红薯…… "] = "I remember that was the stable, that was the well, that was the soldiers' barracks, and that was a field cleared for planting potatoes and sweet potatoes...",
    ["我记得那里有片练习场，我的孩子，他是个男孩，才七八岁就喜欢拖着一把比他高的阔剑跑来跑去，说将来要成为骑士…… "] = "I remember there was a practice field there. My child, he was a boy, only seven or eight years old, and he liked to drag a broadsword taller than himself around, saying he wanted to be a knight in the future...",
    ["我记得阿诺德的养父母提到过，他好像特别喜欢哪一种面包？"] = "I remember Arnold's foster parents mentioned he seemed to particularly like a certain kind of bread?",
    ["我记得，不属于这个时代的愚者，灰雾之上的神秘主宰，执掌好运的黄黑之王。"] = "I remember: The Fool that doesn't belong to this era, the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck.",
    ["我记得，之前在瑞尔·比伯案件中，燕尾服小丑曾经提过“占卜家”对应的序列8是“小丑”。"] = "I remember that in the Ray Bieber case, the Clown in the tuxedo mentioned that the Sequence 8 corresponding to 'Seer' is 'Clown'.",
    ["我记得，你和阿斯兰……阿斯兰，那个男人……"] = "I remember, you and Aslan... Aslan, that man...",
    ["我记得，几十年了，这个地方，你的坟墓，就在这里。"] = "I remember, for decades, this place, your grave, has been right here.",
    ["我记得，罗塞尔大帝在他的日记里写：“不管是学徒，还是占卜家、偷盗者，都更加好”，难不成……"] = "I remember Emperor Roselle wrote in his diary: 'Whether it's Apprentice, Seer, or Marauder, they are all better.' Could it be...",
    ["我记得，这可不是什么安全的占卜方法，请求未知的存在直接给予答案，占卜者很容易被邪恶力量侵蚀。"] = "I remember, this is not a safe divination method. By asking an unknown existence to provide an answer directly, the diviner is easily eroded by evil forces.",
    ["我记得，韦尔奇之前是不是养过一只猫？"] = "I remember, didn't Welch keep a cat before?",
    ["我讲了这么多，居然给出这么敷衍的答案。"] = "I've said so much, and yet you give such a perfunctory answer.",
    ["我讲完啦！"] = "I'm done telling it!",
    ["我许愿……新的一年大家都有干净的新衣服穿"] = "I wish... that in the new year, everyone will have clean new clothes to wear.",
    ["我许诺会在银行给他找个一官半职，这才脱身。"] = "I promised to find him a position at the bank, and that's how I got away.",
    ["我试一试能不能用卜杖寻物法找到他。"] = "I'll try to see if I can find him using Dowsing.",
    ["我试着给自己找些事情做。扫了几年地，灰尘起来又落下。奇怪的是，心反而慢慢静了。"] = "I try to find things to do for myself. After sweeping the floor for years, the dust rises and falls. Strangely, my heart has slowly calmed down.",
    ["我试试"] = "I'll try",
    ["我试试。"] = "I'll try.",
    ["我试过去教堂祈祷，可一闭上眼，就能看见那可怕的战斗。那绝对不是人类之间的战斗……绝对不是！"] = "I tried to pray at the church, but as soon as I closed my eyes, I could see that terrible battle. That was definitely not a battle between humans... definitely not!",
    ["我试过，但那位绅士似乎对浪漫过敏。"] = "I've tried, but that gentleman seems to be allergic to romance.",
    ["我该不该报告呢……"] = "Should I report it...",
    ["我该不该让她注意到，她的项链在这里呢？"] = "Should I let her notice that her necklace is here?",
    ["我该不该选择留在这里？"] = "Should I choose to stay here?",
    ["我该做些什么？"] = "What should I do?",
    ["我该去哪……"] = "Where should I go...",
    ["我该回家了……也许他的父亲还会回来，给他留下一笔财富。"] = "I should go home... perhaps his father will come back and leave him a fortune.",
    ["我该如何告诉她……"] = "How should I tell her...",
    ["我该怎么做？"] = "What should I do?",
    ["我该怎么办？父亲他还会继续支持我吗？我解雇那些孩子是对的吗？不、不，他们肯定不会在工厂，老师说孩子就应该——啊！"] = "What should I do? Will Father continue to support me? Was I right to fire those children? No, no, they definitely wouldn't be in the factory, the teacher said children should—ah!",
    ["我该怎么及时通知您？"] = "How should I notify you in time?",
    ["我该检查其他地方了……不，我不想……我该检查其他地方了……不，我必须多看几眼……"] = "I should check other places... No, I don't want to... I should check other places... No, I must take a few more looks...",
    ["我该走了。谢谢你，看到了我，也看到了那封信。"] = "I should go. Thank you for seeing me, and for seeing that letter.",
    ["我该走了，帮我把这张纸条转交给{{PlayerName}} 。进入历史迷雾消耗了太多灵性，今晚让{{他|她}}在黑荆棘好好休息。"] = "I should go. Help me pass this note to {{PlayerName}}. Entering the Fog of History consumed too much spirituality; let {{him|her}} rest well at Blackthorn tonight.",
    ["我说——这难道就是它扩建后的样子吗？那些铁路匠究竟是怎么工作的！"] = "I said—is this really what it looks like after the expansion? How on earth do those railway workers work!",
    ["我说……你到底发生了什么？为什么要不停地喝酒？"] = "I say... what exactly happened to you? Why do you keep drinking?",
    ["我说……快点吧，我总感觉这地方有人在看我们。"] = "I say... hurry up, I keep feeling like someone is watching us here.",
    ["我说了我们现在只要钱！"] = "I said we only want money now!",
    ["我说了，拿远点！"] = "I said, take it away!",
    ["我说你们和我父亲一样，都是大笨蛋！"] = "I'm telling you, you're all big idiots, just like my father!",
    ["我说得没错吧？一颗子弹，就能吓破菲利普的胆子。你们再不信，不如亲自试试！"] = "I was right, wasn't I? A single bullet is enough to scare the wits out of Philip. If you still don't believe it, why not try it yourself!",
    ["我说的这些报纸和杂志，都值得一看。朋友，时间就是知识啊！"] = "The newspapers and magazines I mentioned are all worth reading. Friend, time is knowledge!",
    ["我说过一万遍了 魔药的关键不是掌握和挖掘 而是消化和扮演！"] = "I've said it ten thousand times: the key to a potion is not mastery or excavation, but digestion and acting!",
    ["我说过的，这家甜品店很不错的吧！"] = "I told you, this dessert shop is really good!",
    ["我说马丁，你今天可真古怪，怎么一句话也不说？"] = "I say Martin, you're really strange today, why aren't you saying a word?",
    ["我说，我们还是回去吧。听说这家店的老板会给人下咒……"] = "I say, let's just go back. I heard the owner of this shop will cast curses on people...",
    ["我诵念祂的尊名，但我从未忘记自己是谁。我是白银城的长老，是六人议事团的成员，是……想要在黑暗中为族人找一条出路的人。"] = "I chant His honorific name, but I have never forgotten who I am. I am an Elder of the City of Silver, a member of the Council of Six, and... someone who wants to find a way out for my people in the darkness.",
    ["我请“魔术师”小姐，找到了最初的手稿，上面还残留着凶手的灵性痕迹。 "] = "I asked Ms. Magician to find the original manuscript, and the murderer's spiritual traces still remained on it.",
    ["我请您喝瓶酒！啊……"] = "I'll buy you a drink! Ah...",
    ["我请求他们跳下去，可没人愿意，他们都跑了。"] = "I asked them to jump, but no one was willing, they all ran away.",
    ["我调整了药物的剂量，只要剂量出错，他的心脏随时都会停下。也是我，锁住房门，伪造成反锁的密室。"] = "I adjusted the dosage of the medicine; as long as the dosage was wrong, his heart would stop at any time. It was also me who locked the door, creating a locked-room mystery.",
    ["我调整了药物的剂量，只要剂量出错，他的心脏随时都会停下。也是我，锁住房门，把卧室布置成反锁的密室。"] = "I adjusted the dosage of the medicine; as long as the dosage was wrong, his heart would stop at any time. It was also me who locked the bedroom door and set up the bedroom as a locked-room mystery.",
    ["我谢幕时竟没有一点掌声……我的戏结束了……"] = "There wasn't even a single round of applause when I took my bow... My play is over...",
    ["我负责环村河流的清理工作，但河里每天都有新的生活垃圾堆积，我每天干到半夜，但河流永远也干净不了。"] = "I'm responsible for cleaning the river around the village, but new household waste piles up in the river every day. I work until midnight every day, but the river never gets clean.",
    ["我负责调查查理失踪案，今天不查违禁物品交易。"] = "I am responsible for investigating the Charlie disappearance case, I'm not checking for contraband trading today.",
    ["我赌20便士，女神的神国会收留酒鬼！各位走着瞧。"] = "I bet 20 pennies that the Goddess's Kingdom will take in a drunkard! Just you wait and see.",
    ["我赌三个苏勒！囤囤的宝藏藏在最粗的树后面！"] = "I bet three soli! The hoarder's treasure is hidden behind the thickest tree!",
    ["我赌了一把，向他祈求。他不仅回应了，还帮我清除了那个呓语，就像……拂去灰尘一样简单。"] = "I took a gamble and prayed to him. He not only responded but also helped me clear away those whispers, as simple as... brushing away dust.",
    ["我赌赢了，十便士，占卜家先生也会有占卜失误的时候呢。"] = "I won the bet, ten pence. Even Mr. Seer has times when his divination fails.",
    ["我赞同小姐的想法，她有权选择自己的人生。"] = "I agree with the young lady's idea; she has the right to choose her own life.",
    ["我赢了，斯维因先生，是不是可以……"] = "I won, Mr. Swain, can I...",
    ["我赢过的官司，比铁十字街的石头还多！"] = "I've won more lawsuits than there are stones on Iron Cross Street!",
    ["我走了很长的路才到廷根，没找到他之前，我不会回去的……"] = "I walked a long way to get to Tingen; I won't go back until I find him...",
    ["我走向你。"] = "I walk toward you.",
    ["我走错地方了。"] = "I'm in the wrong place.",
    ["我跑到门口的时候差点被你的高音震回去。"] = "I was almost shocked back by your high pitch when I ran to the door.",
    ["我跑的远洋航线，在群岛一呆就是几个月，不少人就在停靠的港口找当地女人成了第二个家。"] = "I run the ocean routes, staying in the archipelago for months at a time. Many people find local women at the ports they dock at and make a second home.",
    ["我跟你一起。"] = "I'll go with you.",
    ["我跟你不是同行，你是来参加庆典的?"] = "I'm not in the same line of work as you. Are you here to attend the celebration?",
    ["我跟你讲，这位贝朵兰女士可是被女神选中的传奇工人。"] = "Let me tell you, this Ms. Bedolan is a legendary worker chosen by the Goddess.",
    ["我跟你说，他身上绝对有古怪。他来了东区之后，那儿就老出血案，没有尸体，只有一滩滩血。"] = "Let me tell you, there is definitely something strange about him. Ever since he arrived in the East District, there have been constant bloody incidents there—no bodies, just pools of blood.",
    ["我跟同学韦尔奇、娜娅在一起研究一本第四纪的古老笔记，这很有趣。"] = "I am studying an ancient notebook from the Fourth Epoch with my classmates Welch and Naya. This is very interesting.",
    ["我跟哥哥班森、妹妹梅丽莎一起租住在这间公寓里，这里……是我们的家。"] = "I live in this apartment with my older brother Benson and younger sister Melissa; this... is our home.",
    ["我跟这帮畜生耗太久了，早被盯上了。不能在此地久留，等你狙击完事后，我在远处接应。"] = "I've spent too long dealing with these animals and have already been targeted. I can't stay here long; after you finish sniping, I'll provide cover from a distance.",
    ["我跳的时候，眼睛会看人——我看到了谁，谁今晚就别想忘了我。 "] = "When I dance, my eyes watch people—whoever I look at won't be able to forget me tonight.",
    ["我跳舞的时候不小心把同行刷到了"] = "I accidentally brushed against a peer while I was dancing",
    ["我身上太臭了，一股尸体和苔藓的味道。"] = "I smell too bad, like corpses and moss.",
    ["我身上的香味……抱歉，那瓶不卖。"] = "The scent I'm wearing... sorry, that bottle is not for sale.",
    ["我身上脏脏的，会弄脏你的裙子。"] = "I'm all dirty; I'll stain your dress.",
    ["我身体还不错，也没什么困扰，倒是你今天有些古怪。"] = "My health is quite good, and I have no troubles. You, on the other hand, are acting a bit strange today.",
    ["我身后？"] = "Behind me?",
    ["我输了，斯维因先生，但是……"] = "I lost, Mr. Swain, but...",
    ["我输给你？不可能！"] = "I lose to you? Impossible!",
    ["我过世的妻子非常喜欢音乐，弹琴就是她教我的。"] = "My late wife loved music very much, and she was the one who taught me how to play.",
    ["我还不是呢，你真讨厌……"] = "I'm not yet, you're so annoying...",
    ["我还不知道你的名字。"] = "I still don't know your name.",
    ["我还不知道发生了什么，但乔纳尔医生是个好人，他没有骗我。"] = "I still don't know what happened, but Dr. Jonar is a good person; he didn't lie to me.",
    ["我还从集市换了枚旧护符<P_Heart>（从颈间取出半片银叶）</>，后来发现上面附着强烈的情感印记，现在把它当灵性安抚器用。"] = "I also exchanged an old charm at the market <P_Heart>(Taking out half a silver leaf from my neck)</>, and later found that it was attached with a strong emotional imprint. I now use it as a spirituality pacifier.",
    ["我还以为她一直都会那样冷冰冰的……那我真会心碎的。"] = "I thought she would always be that cold... I would truly be heartbroken if that were the case.",
    ["我还会告诉你很多事，神奇的力量、甲板上的奇遇、五海的强者……去海上前，我会给你介绍这些事情。"] = "I will tell you many more things: magical powers, adventures on the deck, the powerhouses of the Five Seas... Before going to sea, I will introduce these things to you.",
    ["我还做了好几种新的药剂！你帮我试试效果吧！"] = "I've also made several new potions! Help me test their effects!",
    ["我还发现了一点很奇怪。"] = "I also discovered something quite strange.",
    ["我还听说，昨晚队长去的路上，遇到了几个黑帮混混，是来接应杀手的呢！"] = "I also heard that on the way there last night, the Captain encountered a few gangsters who were there to meet the killer!",
    ["我还希望回到人类还是卷毛狒狒的时代呢！"] = "I'd rather go back to the era when humans were still Curly-Haired Baboon!",
    ["我还带了这次拍的新合照，看。"] = "I also brought the new group photo we took this time, look.",
    ["我还得把它还给佛尔思女士。"] = "I still have to return it to Ms. Fors.",
    ["我还想他"] = "I still miss him",
    ["我还想体验一次……那种感觉。"] = "I still want to experience it once more... that feeling.",
    ["我还想再多陪陪戴维。"] = "I still want to accompany David a little longer.",
    ["我还想在这里走走，我们稍后见，务必小心！"] = "I still want to walk around here. We'll see each other later. Be careful!",
    ["我还找到了一个日记本。"] = "I also found a diary.",
    ["我还教历史呢！"] = "I even teach history!",
    ["我还是不太想承认你的时尚品味。"] = "I still don't really want to acknowledge your fashion taste.",
    ["我还是不明白……"] = "I still don't understand...",
    ["我还是再看看吧。"] = "I'd better take another look.",
    ["我还是去五月庄园，调查更多线索，救出那批工人。"] = "I will still go to May Manor to investigate more clues and rescue that group of workers.",
    ["我还是愿意呆在这里。乡下安静、简单……最重要的是，我曾经的战友们也在这墓园里。"] = "I still prefer to stay here. The countryside is quiet and simple... most importantly, my former comrades-in-arms are also in this cemetery.",
    ["我还是苏茜的好朋友，是……还有些暂时不便透露。"] = "I'm also a good friend of Susie, and... there are some things that are inconvenient to disclose for now.",
    ["我还有一个重要猜想需要验证。"] = "I still have an important hypothesis that needs to be verified.",
    ["我还有一个问题……封印物3-888是什么？"] = "I have one more question... what is Sealed Artifact 3-888?",
    ["我还有事"] = "I have other things to do",
    ["我还有事，先走了"] = "I have other things to do, I'm leaving first.",
    ["我还有些工作没处理完，先走一步，期待你的好消息。"] = "I still have some work to finish, I'll be going first, looking forward to your good news.",
    ["我还有别的事，等待你的好消息。"] = "I have other things to do, waiting for your good news.",
    ["我还没有……赞……"] = "I haven't... Pra...",
    ["我还没考虑过红宝石呢，或许不错……"] = "I haven't considered rubies yet, maybe they're nice...",
    ["我还看见有一对男女从中这边走过去，那个男人的打扮真让我想起曾经轰动了整个廷根市的连环杀手案！"] = "I also saw a man and a woman walk past from this side. That man's attire really reminded me of the serial killer case that once shocked the entire city of Tingen!",
    ["我还看见有一对男女从这边走过去，那个男人的打扮真让我想起曾经轰动了整个廷根市的连环杀手案！"] = "I also saw a man and a woman walking by here. That man's attire really reminds me of the serial killer case that once shocked the entire Tingen City!",
    ["我还真有点同情她了。"] = "I actually feel a bit of sympathy for her now.",
    ["我还知道一件事！"] = "I know one more thing!",
    ["我还知道你是非凡者，被一个胡说八道的残影蛊惑到了这里。"] = "I also know you are a Beyonder, lured here by a nonsensical remnant shadow.",
    ["我还知道，这里是回忆构成的空间，我们现在都被困在了这里。"] = "I also know that this is a space composed of memories, and we are all trapped here now.",
    ["我还等着付房租，阁下，哪怕我现在就坐在劳工阶层住房改善协会门口，没有钱他们也会让我睡大街的！"] = "I am still waiting to pay the rent, sir. Even if I were sitting at the door of the Laboring Class Housing Improvement Association right now, they would still make me sleep on the street if I didn't have the money!",
    ["我还给你留了个大的，在被围殴的时候会自动解锁，好好期待下吧"] = "I've also left a big one for you; it will automatically unlock when you're being ganged up on. Look forward to it.",
    ["我还给你留了个大的，在被围殴的时候会自动解锁，好好期待下吧。"] = "I also left a big one for you, it will automatically unlock when you are surrounded, look forward to it.",
    ["我还给她买了苹果，你也一块带过去吧。"] = "I also bought her some apples, you should take them with you too.",
    ["我还能再见到你吗？"] = "Will I be able to see you again?",
    ["我还要出摊去卖东西，哪有时间照顾他们？"] = "I still have to go out and sell things; where would I find the time to take care of them?",
    ["我还要继续寻找封印物3-888的去向，时间越久，它越危险。"] = "I still need to continue searching for the whereabouts of Sealed Artifact 3-888; the longer it takes, the more dangerous it becomes.",
    ["我还要走得更远……远到……传说中的东大陆、西大陆、远到地心、远到星空。"] = "I must go further... far to... the legendary Eastern Continent, Western Continent, far to the center of the earth, far to the starry sky.",
    ["我还要赶回去做实验呢！你随便给我点什么吃的吧！"] = "I have to rush back to conduct my experiment! Just give me whatever you have to eat!",
    ["我还记得它饿极了吃老鼠的样子，真是可怜的小流浪狗……"] = "I still remember how it looked when it was starving and eating mice; what a poor little stray dog...",
    ["我还遇到了一件更可怕的事。我、我最近总听到，湖上传来叹息的声音！"] = "I also encountered something even more terrifying. I, I have been hearing sighs coming from the lake recently!",
    ["我还遇到梦中的皮特兄妹。皮特是月亮仆从的成员，可能在准备仪式。"] = "I also met the Pete siblings from my dream. Pete is a member of the Moon Servant and may be preparing for a ritual.",
    ["我还闻到了佛手柑和……迷迭香？"] = "I also smelled bergamot and... rosemary?",
    ["我还需要再考虑一下构图。"] = "I still need to think about the composition.",
    ["我还需要呆一会，嗯……格尔曼应该从这里出现，但是……"] = "I still need to stay for a while, hmm... Gehrman should appear from here, but...",
    ["我这两天就会用剩余的功勋雇佣帮手，去获取迷雾树人的真实根茎和汁液，我很快就能完成交易。"] = "I will use my remaining merit to hire helpers in the next two days to obtain the true roots and sap of the Fog Tree, and I will be able to complete the transaction soon.",
    ["我这也许没有最漂亮的装修，但你一定能找到最上头的酒！"] = "I may not have the most beautiful decor here, but you will definitely find the most intoxicating wine!",
    ["我这儿每天都有活老鼠的大量需求，雇主靠谱！"] = "I have a huge demand for live rats every day here, the employer is reliable!",
    ["我这卖的都是好东西。"] = "Everything I sell here is good stuff.",
    ["我这合同一月一签，一周一付，一月一付也可以，水按人头付，煤气用多少付多少直接给燃气公司。"] = "My contract is signed monthly and paid weekly, though monthly payment is also fine. Water is paid per person, and gas is paid directly to the gas company based on usage.",
    ["我这就去找食材和厨具。"] = "I'll go find the ingredients and cookware right now.",
    ["我这就用灵摆占卜验证一下！"] = "I'll verify it with Pendulum Divination right away!",
    ["我这就走，感谢您的帮助和宽容！"] = "I'll leave now. Thank you for your help and tolerance!",
    ["我这店刚刚开业，如果没给客人留下好印象，我拿什么开店啊……"] = "My shop just opened, if I don't leave a good impression on the customers, how can I run this shop...",
    ["我这是……怎么……不要……不能！"] = "What is this... how... no... I can't!",
    ["我这是怎么了……"] = "What's happening to me...",
    ["我这是，\r\n因为知识的力量变成了老鼠？"] = "Have I turned into a mouse\r\nbecause of the power of knowledge?",
    ["我这有不少神奇的药品。"] = "I have quite a few magical medicines here.",
    ["我这有个钢铁厂加班名额，我们近期要搬家，这个名额便宜点卖给你，怎么样？"] = "I have an overtime slot at the steel mill, we're moving soon, I'll sell this slot to you for cheap, how about it?",
    ["我这有大帝的金条！一折甩卖！"] = "I have the Emperor's gold bars! Selling at 10% off!",
    ["我这有张示意图，随手画的，你看看吧。"] = "I have a diagram here, I drew it casually, take a look.",
    ["我这样的人……祈求没有厄运已经是最大的心愿。"] = "For someone like me... praying for no misfortune is already the greatest wish.",
    ["我这次一定能进入上流社会！"] = "I will definitely enter high society this time!",
    ["我这次前来，是想打听一位名叫艾登的贫民。"] = "I have come this time to inquire about a commoner named Aiden.",
    ["我这次回廷根，是为我的毕业论文寻找一种因蒂斯钟表的图纸。"] = "I returned to Tingen this time to find the blueprints for an Intis clock for my graduation thesis.",
    ["我这毛病拖了两个星期了……"] = "This ailment of mine has been dragging on for two weeks...",
    ["我这的东西，都是市政专供。它们都是来自同一个供货商。"] = "The things I have here are all supplied by the municipality. They all come from the same supplier.",
    ["我这的水果都是最新鲜的，你随便拿就好了。"] = "The fruit here is the freshest, just take whatever you want.",
    ["我这种文史专业的学生，过得可是一眼望不到头的日子，毕业直接失业！"] = "Students like me in the liberal arts are living a life where we can't see the end, and we're unemployed the moment we graduate!",
    ["我这花店哪还有人愿意光顾！"] = "Who would even want to visit my flower shop now!",
    ["我这记性……"] = "There goes my memory again...",
    ["我这趟回去以后，下次来廷根就不知道什么时候喽。"] = "After I go back this time, I don't know when I'll be coming to Tingen next.",
    ["我这趟旅程的目的，就是为了解开这个谜题。"] = "The purpose of my journey is to solve this mystery.",
    ["我这身家，全靠从古堡里挖的宝贝，一个小雕像就抵得上我爹的磨坊！"] = "My wealth depends entirely on the treasures I dig from the castle; a single small statue is worth my dad's mill!",
    ["我这辈子最讨厌的就是鱼和蘑菇，还有耕种者途径的疯子！"] = "The things I hate most in my life are fish and mushrooms, and those madmen from the Planter pathway!",
    ["我这都是最地道的廷根本地菜。"] = "These are all the most authentic local Tingen dishes.",
    ["我这里出售各种咸鱼美食。要试试我新研发的咸鱼派吗？"] = "I sell all kinds of salted fish delicacies here. Do you want to try my newly developed salted fish pie?",
    ["我这里是廷根佣兵小队的活动中心，你需要的话我可以介绍其他的雇佣兵小队给你认识。"] = "This is the activity center for Tingen's mercenary squads. If you need, I can introduce other mercenary squads to you.",
    ["我这里是有档次的公寓，这在铁十字街可不多见。"] = "I have a high-class apartment here, which is rare on Iron Cross Street.",
    ["我这里最不缺的就是故事。让我想想。"] = "The thing I don't lack here is stories. Let me think.",
    ["我这里有《伯爵归来》的前排好位，价格实惠！"] = "I've got great front-row seats for The Count Returns, at a very reasonable price!",
    ["我这里还有一些特别的药剂，能让你变得理智，或是疯狂……想试试吗？"] = "I have some special potions here that can make you rational, or insane... want to try one?",
    ["我这阳台只漏了个小洞，随便补补就行。包人工2苏勒，怎么样？"] = "My balcony only has a small hole, just patch it up. 2 soli including labor, how about it?",
    ["我远远见过一次。她脚边趴着好几只野猫，桌上还蹲着老鼠。那些畜生在她面前乖得像宠物。"] = "I saw her once from afar. She had several stray cats lying at her feet, and a rat squatting on her table. Those beasts were as obedient as pets in front of her.",
    ["我连婚礼计划和孩子的教育计划都准备好了，风暴在上，还有很多计划没做，双方父母的养老计划，度假计划，攒钱计划……"] = "I even prepared the wedding plan and the children's education plan. Storms above, there are still so many plans I haven't made—the retirement plan for both our parents, the vacation plan, the savings plan...",
    ["我迫不及待地接下了扩充航道的工作，我要亲身渡海，我要亲眼看到世界另一面的模样，我要亲手绘制南大陆的地图。"] = "I couldn't wait to take on the job of expanding the shipping lanes. I want to cross the sea myself, I want to see the other side of the world with my own eyes, and I want to draw the map of the Southern Continent with my own hands.",
    ["我迫不及待要去下探索下一个地方了……"] = "I can't wait to explore the next place...",
    ["我选……“倒吊人”。"] = "I choose... 'The Hanged Man'.",
    ["我选择了“占卜家”。"] = "I chose \"Seer\".",
    ["我选择了“占卜家”，成为了一个非凡者。"] = "I chose \"Seer\" and became a Beyonder.",
    ["我选择，“占卜家”！"] = "I choose, \"Seer\"!",
    ["我通过占卜找到中央广场，没看到叫珍妮的纺织女工。"] = "I found the Central Plaza through divination, but I didn't see the textile worker named Jenny.",
    ["我通过梦境占卜，看见它被西奥多从书店偷走了。"] = "I saw through dream divination that it was stolen from the bookstore by Theodore.",
    ["我造了无数人偶，却救不回一个人。"] = "I have created countless puppets, yet I cannot save a single person.",
    ["我遇到一位海盗打扮的女士，是她告诉我的……"] = "I met a lady dressed as a pirate; she was the one who told me...",
    ["我那个偏执狂兄弟，到底在你们无谓的“牺牲”中，看到了什么可取之处？"] = "My paranoid brother, what exactly did he see in your pointless 'sacrifices' that was worth taking?",
    ["我那么大一包钞票啊，全都被偷走了！"] = "My huge bag of banknotes, it was all stolen!",
    ["我都不愿回想，都怪那群该死的弗萨克人！"] = "I don't even want to think back; it's all the fault of those damn Feysacs!",
    ["我都了解了"] = "I understand everything",
    ["我都信！我全信！只要能让那颗宝石从我的脑子里取出来，我都信！"] = "I believe in all of them! I believe in them all! As long as you can get that gemstone out of my head, I'll believe in anything!",
    ["我都想起来了……我已经不需要消化魔药了，我……已经死了。"] = "I remember everything now... I don't need to digest the potion anymore, I... am already dead.",
    ["我都找到了，快出来！"] = "I've found them all, come out quickly!",
    ["我都收拾好了，你也快收摊吧。"] = "I've finished packing up, you should close your stall soon too.",
    ["我都滑了三回了！闭上眼睛就下去了！"] = "I've already slid three times! I just close my eyes and go down!",
    ["我都献给您，只求您高抬贵手。我保证马上滚回老家，再也不会出现在您面前……"] = "I offer it all to you, I only ask that you show mercy. I promise to crawl back to my hometown immediately and never appear before you again...",
    ["我都要被你弄混了。"] = "You're confusing me.",
    ["我都记下了，有什么异常情况，及时向警方报告。"] = "I've noted it all down, if there are any unusual circumstances, report them to the police in time.",
    ["我都跟他学习了三年了！放在别的咖啡店早就是独当一面的咖啡师了，而我，现在还是个学徒……"] = "I've been learning from him for three years! In any other cafe, I would have been a barista capable of working alone, but I'm still an apprentice...",
    ["我都问过了，他们跟公爵府的人一样，什么都不肯说。"] = "I've asked them all. Just like the people at the Duke's residence, they refuse to say anything.",
    ["我重生了……"] = "I Have Been Reborn...",
    ["我钦佩你对历史学的热诚。"] = "I admire your passion for history.",
    ["我错了……"] = "I was wrong...",
    ["我错了！我不该骂您！"] = "I was wrong! I shouldn't have scolded you!",
    ["我长大了，花儿们也更繁茂了。这里变成了一个市集，再也不适合阅读。"] = "I grew up, and the flowers became more lush. This place has turned into a market and is no longer suitable for reading.",
    ["我问他为什么要在十来岁的年纪就要做这样的选择。他回答我，因为我是他的偶像和榜样……"] = "I asked him why he wanted to make such a choice at the age of ten or so. He answered me, because I was his idol and role model...",
    ["我问他为什么，他说……雪花会融化，但雕塑不会老。"] = "I asked him why, and he said... snowflakes will melt, but the sculpture will not grow old.",
    ["我问他博诺瓦将来会有什么成就，他只是笑了笑，什么也没说！可恶的占卜家！他早就知道了！"] = "I asked him what achievements Bonova would have in the future, and he just smiled and said nothing! Damn Seer! He knew it all along!",
    ["我问的是我的历史考试能不能通过。你知道的，我虽然很想认真听，但是这门课实在是催眠啊。"] = "I asked if I could pass my history exam. You know, although I really want to listen carefully, this course is really hypnotic.",
    ["我问的是我的历史考试能不能通过。虽然我对历史挺感兴趣的，但是我一背书就头疼啊。"] = "I asked if I would pass my history exam. Although I'm quite interested in history, I get a headache as soon as I start memorizing.",
    ["我问问附近的小家伙们……"] = "Let me ask the little ones nearby...",
    ["我闻到了，罪恶、猥琐、瘟疫的气息……"] = "I smell it, the scent of sin, lewdness, and plague...",
    ["我陪你"] = "I'll keep you company",
    ["我陪你当一会儿蘑菇。"] = "I'll keep you company as a mushroom for a while.",
    ["我随便看看……还是麻烦您……帮我挑一束花。"] = "I'm just looking around... Actually, could you... help me pick a bouquet of flowers?",
    ["我随便逛逛"] = "Just wandering around",
    ["我随时都准备着倾听。"] = "I am ready to listen at any time.",
    ["我隐约记得，“永暗蜡烛”跟我有关系。但我不记得细节了……"] = "I vaguely remember that the \"Candle of Eternal Darkness\" has something to do with me. But I don't remember the details...",
    ["我难道听错了？什么奇怪的要求！我不是马车夫。"] = "Did I hear that wrong? What a strange request! I'm not a carriage driver.",
    ["我雇佣的厨师、杂活女仆，和一个定期过来的浆洗女工可以解放我的时间。"] = "The cook, the maid for chores, and a laundress who comes regularly help free up my time.",
    ["我需要……仲夏草……七月酒汁液……精灵暗叶……"] = "I need... Midsummer Grass... July Wine sap... Elf Dark Leaf...",
    ["我需要你们的帮忙。有个代罚者小队的成员在附近失控了。"] = "I need your help. A member of the Punishers squad has lost control nearby.",
    ["我需要你帮个忙：带我去见你们组织里所有去过廷根湖的人。"] = "I need you to do me a favor: take me to see everyone in your organization who has been to Tingen Lake.",
    ["我需要做得更好、更稳妥一些……能代替卡萝，能做得像她一样好。"] = "I need to do better, to be more steady... to be able to replace Cara and do as well as she did.",
    ["我需要做得更好、更稳妥一些……能代替卡萝，能做的像她一样好。"] = "I need to do better, to be more reliable... to be able to replace Carol and do as well as she did.",
    ["我需要和米拉、埃文追查另一件封印物，必须尽快定位。所以想把带回“2-327”的任务交给你。"] = "I need to track down the other Sealed Artifact with Mira and Evan, so I must locate it as soon as possible. Therefore, I want to entrust the mission of bringing back \"2-327\" to you.",
    ["我需要在塔罗学院解决一些事，而且有人比我更熟悉廷根。"] = "I need to resolve some matters at the Tarot Academy, and there is someone more familiar with Tingen than I am.",
    ["我需要小艾略特贴身的某个东西。"] = "I need something personal belonging to Little Elliot.",
    ["我需要帮你保管一下，不然它持续抽取你的灵性，你一定会彻底失控的。"] = "I need to keep it for you; otherwise, it will continue to drain your spirituality, and you will definitely lose control completely.",
    ["我需要怎么做？"] = "What do I need to do?",
    ["我需要找回笔记、也需要足够的自保能力，所以我接受邀请加入了黑荆棘安保公司，然后成为了一位非凡者。"] = "I need to find the notebook, and I also need enough self-protection ability, so I accepted the invitation to join the Blackthorn Security Company, and then became a Beyonder.",
    ["我需要把受伤的同伴送回圣堂，追捕的任务只能麻烦你们了。"] = "I need to send my injured companion back to the cathedral; I'll have to trouble you with the pursuit mission.",
    ["我需要暂时移交这个案子。"] = "I need to temporarily hand over this case.",
    ["我需要的诊金很少，祝我快乐！"] = "The consultation fee I need is very small, wish me happiness!",
    ["我需要考虑一下再做决定。"] = "I need to think about it before making a decision.",
    ["我需要选择一条能帮我更好地研究、理解、掌握神秘学知识的非凡途径。"] = "I need to choose a Beyonder pathway that can help me better research, understand, and master mysticism knowledge.",
    ["我非常无辜，我只不过在某个夜晚，恰好路过了这家画廊……"] = "I am very innocent, I just happened to pass by this gallery one night...",
    ["我非常能够理解这片领地的主人的心情……"] = "I can very much understand the feelings of the owner of this land...",
    ["我饿了要不我们直接去吃饭吧"] = "I'm hungry. Why don't we just go eat?",
    ["我马上会让厨房准备新的午饭！这件事会得到妥善的解决！"] = "I will have the kitchen prepare a new lunch immediately! This matter will be properly resolved!",
    ["我马上到。"] = "I'll be right there.",
    ["我马上就回来，伊妮德乖乖在这里采花等我好不好？"] = "I'll be right back. Enid, be a good girl and stay here picking flowers while you wait for me, okay?",
    ["我马上就要到了！我没有疯！"] = "I'm almost there! I'm not crazy!",
    ["我骑得很熟练了，都骑到雪山上来了！"] = "I'm very skilled at riding now; I even rode all the way to the Snowy Mountain!",
    ["我魔药的能力与占卜有关，必须为大量的人占卜，才能加速掌握。所以我打算加入俱乐部，做一个真正的占卜家。"] = "My potion's abilities are related to divination, and I must perform divinations for a large number of people to accelerate my mastery. So I plan to join the club and become a real Seer.",
    ["我，以我的名义召唤。"] = "I, in my name, summon.",
    ["我，克莱恩·莫雷蒂，已经是一位正式的值夜者了。但还有太多的事情要去了解、去学习。"] = "I, Klein Moretti, am now an official Nighthawk. But there is still so much to understand and learn.",
    ["我，克莱恩·莫雷蒂，已经是一位正式的值夜者了。我有太多的事情要去了解、去学习。"] = "I, Klein Moretti, am now an official Nighthawk. I have too much to understand and learn.",
    ["我，咳咳……你是谁？"] = "I, cough cough... who are you?",
    ["我，嘿嘿……随口说的，想吓唬他们。"] = "I, hehe... I just said it randomly, trying to scare them.",
    ["我，我……"] = "I, I...",
    ["我，我不能辜负大家……"] = "I, I cannot let everyone down...",
    ["我，我们不能像那边的人一样，先休息一会儿吗？"] = "I, can't we take a break for a while like the people over there?",
    ["我，我吗？"] = "Me, me?",
    ["我，我在练，练习，要去，去面试。"] = "I, I am prac, practicing, to go, go to an interview.",
    ["我，我想先把，把话能顺，顺利地说，说完。"] = "I, I want to be able to, to speak, speak smoothly first.",
    ["我，我想攒些钱，等妈妈病好后继续回学校读书。"] = "I, I want to save some money so I can return to school after my mother's illness gets better.",
    ["我，我承诺，给你双……不，三倍的报酬！"] = "I, I promise, double... no, triple the reward for you!",
    ["我，我杀了他。我是谁？我是阿瑟……他是谁？他是霍普……我杀了谁？谁杀了我？"] = "I, I killed him. Who am I? I am Arthur... Who is he? He is Hope... Whom did I kill? Who killed me?",
    ["我，我没有，我只是……仰慕她。"] = "I, I didn't, I just... admire her.",
    ["我，我睡不着，我想妈妈……"] = "I, I can't sleep, I miss my mom...",
    ["我，是时代的主角。我，是不朽的传奇！"] = "I am the protagonist of the era. I am an immortal legend!",
    ["我，是皇帝，亦是……绯红的信徒！"] = "I am the Emperor, and also... a believer of the crimson!",
    ["我，瑞奇·纽曼带来了廷根的新财路，诚邀有意者与我搭伙开店。"] = "I, Ricky Newman, have brought a new way to make money in Tingen, and I sincerely invite those interested to partner with me to open a shop.",
    ["我，瞭望塔，是个疯子！"] = "I, Watchtower, am a madman!",
    ["我，黑夜信徒，风暴信徒，大地信徒，吟游诗人、小镇画师、旅馆主理人、黄金右脸……在此祈祷。"] = "I, a believer of the Night, a believer of the Storm, a believer of the Earth, a Bard, a town painter, a hotel manager, Golden Right Cheek... am praying here.",
    ["我？"] = "Me?",
    ["我？不，我只是普通的学生。"] = "Me? No, I'm just an ordinary student.",
    ["我？你？"] = "Me? You?",
    ["我？当然是这里的店主了。"] = "Me? I am, of course, the owner of this shop.",
    ["我？怎么可能！"] = "Me? How is that possible!",
    ["我？我好像是被马桶冲进来的……"] = "Me? I think I was flushed in through the toilet...",
    ["我？我宁愿做一只狼鱼罐头。"] = "Me? I'd rather be a can of wolf fish.",
    ["我？我的衣服是用布条拴住的。你自己想办法去。"] = "Me? My clothes are tied with cloth strips. Find a way yourself.",
    ["我？我的衣服是用布条栓住的。你自己想办法去。"] = "Me? My clothes are tied together with cloth strips. Find a way yourself.",
    ["我？抱歉……我已经有正式工作了。"] = "Me? Sorry... I already have a formal job.",
    ["我？！"] = "Me?!",
    ["戒指"] = "Ring",
    ["戒指……你不会是说从天而降的浪漫戒指吧！"] = "The ring... you don't mean the romantic ring that fell from the sky!",
    ["戒指一"] = "Ring 1",
    ["戒指二"] = "Ring 2",
    ["戒指交互特效"] = "Ring Interaction Effect",
    ["戒指啊。"] = "The ring.",
    ["戒指夺回计划"] = "Ring Retrieval Plan",
    ["戒指就在那位女士附近，去问问她。"] = "The ring is near that lady; go ask her.",
    ["戒指应该掉下来不久，先问问附近的人。"] = "The ring shouldn't have fallen off long ago. Let's ask the people nearby first.",
    ["戒指找不回来也没关系，重要的是您曾经拥有过。"] = "It doesn't matter if the ring can't be found; what's important is that you once had it.",
    ["戒指有机关……是暗器？她在找机会下手？为什么迟迟不动手？"] = "The ring has a mechanism... is it a hidden weapon? Is she looking for a chance to strike? Why hasn't she acted yet?",
    ["戒指盒"] = "Ring Box",
    ["戒指被梅格夫人带走了！她多么幸运，能接受花海的祝福！"] = "The ring was taken by Mrs. Meg! How lucky she is to receive the blessing of the flower sea!",
    ["戒指视线点"] = "Ring Sight Point",
    ["戒指？来我这找戒指的，你们不是第一个。"] = "Ring? You're not the first to come to me looking for a ring.",
    ["戒烟很难，面对妻子的怒火也很难……"] = "Quitting smoking is hard, and facing my wife's fury is even harder...",
    ["戒面之下的空隙，才是真正的容器。"] = "The gap beneath the ring face is the true container.",
    ["或"] = "Or",
    ["或是被魔药里蕴含的力量瞬间改变人格，变得冷酷，敏感，易怒，残忍，漠视一切。"] = "Or have your personality instantly altered by the power contained within the potion, becoming cold, sensitive, irritable, cruel, and indifferent to everything.",
    ["或者也可以先付一便士，体验黑夜奉献碑讲解。再加一便士还能获得照相服务，怎么样，多么合算的买卖，你想要哪个？"] = "Or you can pay one penny first to experience the explanation of the Night Memorial Monument. Add another penny and you can get photo services. How about it, what a cost-effective deal, which one do you want?",
    ["或者你想来点不一样的？"] = "Or would you like something different?",
    ["或者你愿不愿意尝试把台上那座肉山推下擂台？不要小瞧自己的实力！"] = "Or would you like to try pushing that mountain of meat on the stage off the ring? Don't underestimate your own strength!",
    ["或者像邻居家的夏洛特姐姐一样，成为一名厉害的领班！"] = "Or like Sister Charlotte from next door, become an amazing lead!",
    ["或者收集雷电灵性晶体"] = "Or collect lightning spirituality crystals",
    ["或者直接成为非凡者，毕竟我们不是你的保姆，不能整日整夜地看着你。"] = "Or they might become a Beyonder directly. After all, we aren't your babysitters; we can't watch you day and night.",
    ["或者试试金朗齐？它的口感比那群水手的爱好更加柔和！"] = "Or maybe try some Gold Langqi? Its taste is much smoother than what those sailors prefer!",
    ["或许……"] = "Perhaps...",
    ["或许……他还没有布置那场诡异的仪式？"] = "Perhaps... he hasn't set up that strange ritual yet?",
    ["或许……我可以将愚者先生的尊名告诉福戈吗？就用他笔记本上的这种文字。"] = "Perhaps... could I tell Fogo the honorific name of Mr. Fool? Using the same script as in his notebook.",
    ["或许他也在保佑着你。"] = "Perhaps he is also watching over you.",
    ["或许他的出生灵数符合要求，也或许他是安提哥努斯家族仅存的后裔，这有太多的可能……"] = "Perhaps his birth spirituality met the requirements, or perhaps he is the last descendant of the Antigonus Family. There are too many possibilities...",
    ["或许你也听过他的名字。"] = "Perhaps you've heard his name too.",
    ["或许你们该换副新牌，这些牌的花色已经看不清了。"] = "Perhaps you should get a new deck, the suits on these cards are already hard to see.",
    ["或许你可以先带走蛋糕，明天来我这，以工抵钱。"] = "Perhaps you can take the cake first, come to me tomorrow and work to pay it off.",
    ["或许你可以尝试看看。"] = "Perhaps you could try watching.",
    ["或许你在找：\n"] = "Perhaps you are looking for: \n",
    ["或许你该取个更好听的名字。"] = "Perhaps you should come up with a better name.",
    ["或许你说得对。但这次……还是请你为我转达吧。就当做一个太少和亲人相处的老人的请求。"] = "Perhaps you are right. But this time... please convey it for me. Just consider it the request of an old man who has too little time to spend with his loved ones.",
    ["或许做出特别申请，光明正大地成为“小丑”是更好的选择。"] = "Perhaps making a special application and becoming a 'Clown' openly is a better choice.",
    ["或许可以从工厂实际利益的角度出发，莱纳工厂的工人精神和健康状况得到了保障，他们能更好地投入工作，长远来看不是坏事。"] = "Perhaps we can start from the perspective of the factory's actual interests; the mental and physical health of the workers at the Leiner factory has been guaranteed, allowing them to work better, which is not a bad thing in the long run.",
    ["或许可以去<P_Yellow>街对面墙后</>隐蔽的角落<P_Yellow>用怀表占卜</>菲利普的下落……"] = "Perhaps I can go to the hidden corner <P_Yellow>behind the wall across the street</> and <P_Yellow>use my pocket watch to divine</> Philip's whereabouts...",
    ["或许可以通过旁边的仪式桌执行仪式魔法解除封印。"] = "Perhaps the seal can be broken by performing ritual magic at the ritual table nearby.",
    ["或许可以通过镜子占卜出它曾经映照过的人或事情？"] = "Perhaps we can divine the people or events it once reflected through the mirror?",
    ["或许吧……但现实只会给每个人一次构图机会，只要有一张照片抓住某个瞬间……"] = "Perhaps... but reality only gives everyone one chance to compose a shot. As long as one photo captures a certain moment...",
    ["或许吧。因为那时候，我也很难控制住自己的手。"] = "Perhaps. Because back then, it was also hard for me to control my hands.",
    ["或许吧，但最终领主会成为格尔曼的小弟，就像“烈焰”达尼兹一样。"] = "Perhaps, but in the end, the lord will become Gehrman's underling, just like \"Blazing\" Danitz.",
    ["或许和皇室有关系，或许是一位拉斯廷伯爵的崇拜者，你觉得呢？"] = "Perhaps it has something to do with the royal family, or perhaps an admirer of a Count Lasting, what do you think?",
    ["或许因为你身上有被封印的污染，熟悉的气息让知识皇冠把你当成“自己人”。"] = "Perhaps because you have sealed corruption on you, the familiar aura made the Crown of Knowledge treat you as \"one of its own.\"",
    ["或许在未来的旅程中，你会找到答案。"] = "Perhaps you will find the answer in your future journey.",
    ["或许在知识皇冠出现前，这里就已经遭遇了未知的灾难。"] = "Perhaps before the Crown of Knowledge appeared, this place had already suffered an unknown disaster.",
    ["或许她已经想好要回来了，为了给你一个惊喜？"] = "Perhaps she has already decided to come back to give you a surprise?",
    ["或许它能带给你一些不一样的惊喜。"] = "Perhaps it can bring you some unexpected surprises.",
    ["或许您可以来一杯纯麦芽酿的朗齐，听说海盗也喜欢这种酒，虽然我没见过任何活海盗。"] = "Perhaps you could have a glass of pure malt-brewed Ranzhi. I've heard pirates like this drink too, though I've never seen any living pirates.",
    ["或许您可以进来喝杯茶，他应该很快就会回家。"] = "Perhaps you can come in and have a cup of tea. He should be home soon.",
    ["或许您需要去看看医生……"] = "Perhaps you need to see a doctor...",
    ["或许我们确实是时代的弃儿，但是我希望骑士的精神能被继承下去，坚持公平，真诚勇敢，保护弱者，捍卫国家。"] = "Perhaps we are indeed the abandoned children of the era, but I hope the spirit of the knight can be inherited—insisting on fairness, being sincere and brave, protecting the weak, and defending the country.",
    ["或许我们都只是一缕信息流……"] = "Perhaps we are all just a stream of information...",
    ["或许我可以为他献上一束花。"] = "Perhaps I can offer a bouquet of flowers for him.",
    ["或许我可以试试劝他下来见一面。"] = "Perhaps I can try to persuade him to come down and meet.",
    ["或许我成为“收尸人”，冥冥中也是注定的。"] = "Perhaps my becoming a \"Corpse Collector\" was destined in the dark.",
    ["或许我能帮得上忙"] = "Maybe I can help",
    ["或许我该想办法说清楚一些，或者，我该多解释一些……"] = "Perhaps I should find a way to make it clearer, or, I should explain more...",
    ["或许我该认清现实，不再挣扎，在这里安静地等待死亡降临吧。"] = "Perhaps I should recognize reality, stop struggling, and wait quietly here for Death's Arrival.",
    ["或许是……"] = "Perhaps it is...",
    ["或许是从其它门走的，我可以帮你想想办法。"] = "Perhaps they left through another door; I can help you think of a way.",
    ["或许是他行商时从南大陆带回的不治之症，或许是暴富衍生的不加节制的享乐谋杀了他的健康。"] = "Perhaps it was an incurable disease he brought back from the South Continent while trading, or perhaps the unbridled indulgence that came with sudden wealth murdered his health.",
    ["或许是受大地力量的影响，这里物产丰富，常年丰收不断，镇上的人时常举行丰收庆典，赞美大地的恩赐。"] = "Perhaps influenced by the power of the Earth, this place is rich in products and has constant harvests all year round. The people in the town often hold harvest festivals to praise the gifts of the Earth.",
    ["或许是因为……"] = "Perhaps because...",
    ["或许是来源于当地的一个古老的童话——讲的是一个被大地母神赐予了生命的小木偶。"] = "Perhaps it comes from an ancient local fairy tale—it tells of a wooden puppet given life by the Earth Mother.",
    ["或许是那个人的肉味呢？你能不能让我咬一口？"] = "Perhaps it was the taste of that person's meat? Can you let me take a bite?",
    ["或许是那群绑匪太不幸运，他们只是普通人，却要同时面对两个非凡者。"] = "Perhaps that group of kidnappers was just too unlucky. They were ordinary people, yet they had to face two Beyonders at once.",
    ["或许有一天，你会成为除我之外最像他的人。"] = "Perhaps one day, you will be the person most like him besides me.",
    ["或许缺少开膛手也缺一位雪中送炭的贵人。"] = "Perhaps the Ripper also lacks a noble person to provide charcoal in snowy weather.",
    ["或许能帮忙……"] = "Maybe I can help...",
    ["或许蒸汽与机械系的同学能修好？"] = "Perhaps a student from the Steam and Machinery department could fix it?",
    ["或许让对方看不懂，也是格斗的一种境界吧？他们刚才是什么招数来着…… "] = "Perhaps making the opponent unable to understand is also a realm of combat? What move was that they just used...",
    ["或许跟他的工匠手艺一样，这套工具也是从他父亲那里继承来的吧。"] = "Perhaps, just like his craftsmanship, these tools were inherited from his father.",
    ["或许还坐不满两排长椅呢，宾客稀少，收拾起来也没那么麻烦。"] = "Perhaps it wouldn't even fill two rows of benches; with few guests, cleaning up isn't that troublesome.",
    ["或许还是蓝宝石更漂亮……"] = "Perhaps sapphires are prettier...",
    ["或许还需要一点时间，但没什么可担心的了。"] = "Perhaps it will take a little more time, but there's nothing to worry about now.",
    ["或许这个更适合……"] = "Perhaps this one is more suitable...",
    ["或许这个花房除了贩卖鲜花，也贩卖着虔诚。"] = "Perhaps this flower shop sells not only fresh flowers but also piety.",
    ["或许这就是犯人盯上他们的理由。"] = "Perhaps that is the reason the culprit targeted them.",
    ["或许远没有结束。小心，笔记我来处理。"] = "Perhaps it is far from over. Be careful, I will handle the notebook.",
    ["或许，下一次应该邀请你和我在训练场演练？"] = "Perhaps, next time I should invite you to practice with me in the Training Ground?",
    ["或许，下次去拉斐尔墓园看望邓恩队长他们时，我会记得把这些咖啡豆带给他。"] = "Perhaps, next time I visit Captain Dunn and the others at Raphael Cemetery, I'll remember to bring these coffee beans for him.",
    ["或许，也包含着一丝对神国的好奇与宁静的向往？"] = "Perhaps, it also contains a trace of curiosity about the Kingdom of God and a longing for tranquility?",
    ["或许，可以写信……"] = "Perhaps, I could write a letter...",
    ["或许，唯有这里曾经的主人，与被命运指引至此的迷途者，才能在这片寂静里听见往日的回响。"] = "Perhaps only the former master of this place and the lost souls guided here by fate can hear the echoes of the past in this silence.",
    ["或许，小黛西这次很幸运……"] = "Perhaps, little Daisy is lucky this time...",
    ["或许，我们应该先去看望一下小阿诺德？"] = "Perhaps we should go visit little Arnold first?",
    ["或许，我是有什么吸引非凡存在的体质吧……"] = "Perhaps I have a constitution that attracts Beyonder entities...",
    ["或许，有机会你可以像曾经某个人一样，去报社投稿。"] = "Perhaps, if you have the chance, you could submit to a newspaper like someone once did.",
    ["战"] = "Battle",
    ["战中可上坐骑，每层仅生效一次，持续30秒"] = "Can mount in battle, effective once per floor, lasting 30 seconds",
    ["战中每秒0.3%治疗"] = "0.3% Healing per second in battle",
    ["战中每秒0.4%治疗"] = "0.4% Healing per second in battle",
    ["战中每秒0.6%治疗"] = "0.6% Healing per second in battle",
    ["战中每秒0.8%治疗"] = "0.8% Healing per second in battle",
    ["战中每秒1%治疗"] = "1% Healing per second in battle",
    ["战争。"] = "War.",
    ["战争主教"] = "Bishop of War",
    ["战争主教的恩眷"] = "Favor of the War Bishop",
    ["战争之门指引"] = "Gate of War Guide",
    ["战争使者"] = "War Bringer",
    ["战争可以在几分钟内夺去几百名战友的生命……可更残酷的是，我甚至永远无法替他们报仇，替他们完成心愿。"] = "War can take the lives of hundreds of comrades in a few minutes... but what's more cruel is that I can never even avenge them or fulfill their wishes for them.",
    ["战争后，很多教会里的大人物都离开了，我们再也不能像以前那样传教了。"] = "After the war, many big figures in the church left, and we can no longer preach like we used to.",
    ["战争巨龙"] = "War Dragon",
    ["战争巨龙煽动战火，带来纷争的火雨！"] = "The War Dragon fans the flames of war, bringing a rain of fire of strife!",
    ["战争巨龙腾空后将绕场飞行，在场地中留下烈焰并持续蓄力。非凡者需要在限定时间内借助场地中的<Disable> 6 枚符文</>完成祈祷仪式，将战争巨龙击落。"] = "After taking flight, the War Dragon will circle the field, leaving flames behind and continuously charging up. Beyonders must complete a prayer ritual using the <Disable>6 runes</> on the field within a limited time to knock the War Dragon down.",
    ["战争巨龙腾空后将绕场飞行，在场地中留下烈焰并持续蓄力。非凡者需要在限定时间内借助场地中的<Disable> 6 枚符文</>完成祈祷仪式，将战争巨龙击落。\n非凡者进入符文范围即可激活对应符文。第二轮仪式开始后，符文必须按照 <Disable> 指定顺序依次</>激活，否则仪式将无法生效。"] = "After taking flight, the War Dragon will circle the field, leaving flames behind and continuously charging up. Beyonders must complete a prayer ritual using the <Disable>6 runes</> on the field within a limited time to knock the War Dragon down. \nBeyonders can activate the corresponding rune by entering its range. After the second ritual begins, the runes must be activated in the <Disable>specified sequence</>, otherwise the ritual will not take effect.",
    ["战争巨龙腾空后开始蓄力，非凡者需要在限定时间内 <Disable> 击破战火残片，收集征服能量，并与对应符文交互完成祈祷</>。待 <Disable>  6 位非凡者</>全部完成祈祷后，汇聚的征服能量将化作强大力量，将战争巨龙从空中击落。"] = "After taking flight, the War Dragon begins to charge up. Beyonders must <Disable>destroy the war fragments within a limited time, collect Conquest Energy, and interact with the corresponding runes to complete the prayer</>. Once <Disable>6 Beyonders</> have all completed their prayers, the gathered Conquest Energy will transform into a powerful force that knocks the War Dragon out of the sky.",
    ["战争巨龙锁定 <Disable> 1 名非凡者</>发起冲锋，冲锋过程中，战士可使用 <Disable> 终结技能</>成功拦截并打断战争巨龙的冲锋。"] = "The War Dragon locks onto <Disable>1 Beyonder</> and initiates a charge. During the charge, a Warrior can use a <Disable>Finisher Skill</> to successfully intercept and interrupt the War Dragon's charge.",
    ["战争巨龙锁定 <Disable>1 名非凡者</>喷吐火球，火球落地后发生爆炸，并在地面留下<Disable>短暂持续燃烧</>的烈焰区域。"] = "The War Dragon locks onto <Disable>1 Beyonder</> and spits a fireball. After the fireball lands, it explodes and leaves a <Disable>briefly burning</> flame zone on the ground.",
    ["战争巨龙锁定 <Disable>3 名非凡者</>喷吐火球，火球落地后发生爆炸，并在地面留下<Disable>持续燃烧</>的烈焰区域。"] = "The War Dragon locks onto <Disable>3 Beyonders</> and spits fireballs. After the fireballs land, they explode and leave <Disable>continuously burning</> flame zones on the ground.",
    ["战争巨龙（最终位置版本）"] = "War Dragon (final position version)",
    ["战争已经……结束了？我不明白……可我为什么会在这里？难道我一路走了三年？"] = "The war has... ended? I don't understand... but why am I here? Have I been walking for three years?",
    ["战争灾害的主宰者"] = "Master of War Disaster",
    ["战争的具现，征服的化身，纷争与战火的绝对主宰欢迎加入【%s】势力，诸君，该开启战争了！"] = "The embodiment of war, the avatar of conquest, the absolute master of strife and flames. Welcome to the [%s] faction. Gentlemen, it is time to start the war!",
    ["战争的具现，征服的化身，纷争与战火的绝对主宰欢迎加入【血皇】势力，诸君，该开启战争了！"] = "The embodiment of war, the avatar of conquest, the absolute master of strife and flames. Welcome to the [Blood Emperor] faction. Gentlemen, it is time to start the war!",
    ["战争的旗帜之下，你率众夺取荣耀。你的名字镌刻于沙盘的胜利之墙，与四皇之战的历史并列。此时的你，已无限接近\"征服者\"之名。"] = "Under the banner of war, you lead the masses to seize glory. Your name is engraved on the Wall of Victory in the sand table, alongside the history of the War of the Four Emperors. At this moment, you are infinitely close to the title of \"Conqueror\".",
    ["战争的艺术，在精准打击！ "] = "The art of war lies in precision strikes!",
