    ["战区筛选"] = "War Zone Filtering",
    ["战区筛选积分仅在<Highlight>战区筛选期间</>的四方联赛中获取。筛选期间，俱乐部参与四方联赛并累计战区筛选积分；筛选结束后，将按本赛区累计积分进行排名，<Highlight>前4名俱乐部晋级战略服</>。"] = "Warzone Screening Points are only obtained in the Four-Way League during the <Highlight>Warzone Screening Period</>. During the screening period, Clubs participate in the Four-Way League and accumulate Warzone Screening Points; after the screening ends, rankings will be based on the accumulated points in this competition zone, and the <Highlight>top 4 Clubs will advance to the Strategic Server</>.",
    ["战区筛选积分仅在<Highlight>战区筛选期间</>的四方联赛中获取。筛选期间，俱乐部参与四方联赛并累计积分；筛选结束后，将按本赛区累计积分排名，<Highlight>前4名俱乐部晋级战略服</>。\n四方联赛每场第一、二名进入胜者组，第三、四名进入败者组；第二场结束后，按比赛结果确定本轮第1至第8名。\n战区筛选积分由<Highlight>单场名次积分</>与<Highlight>每轮最终排名积分</>累计组成：\n<Highlight>单场名次积分：</>第1名30分，第2名15分，第3名10分，第4名5分。\n<Highlight>第一轮最终排名积分：</>第1名60分，第2名50分，第3名45分，第4名40分，第5至第8名各10分。\n<Highlight>第二轮最终排名积分：</>第1名200分，第2名100分，第3名70分，第4名50分，第5至第8名各15分。\n<Highlight>同分排序规则：</>战区筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战区筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n<Highlight>额外神选席位：</>战略服结算时，筛选时的赛区前三名俱乐部可额外获得神选席位：<Highlight>第1名10个，第2名5个，第3名5个</>。"] = "Warzone screening points are only obtained during the Four-Way League <Highlight> during the warzone screening period </>. During the screening period, clubs participate in the Four-Way League and accumulate points; after the screening ends, they will be ranked according to the accumulated points in this region, and the <Highlight> top 4 clubs will be promoted to the strategic server </>. \n The first and second place in each Four-Way League match enter the winner's bracket, and the third and fourth place enter the loser's bracket; after the second match, the 1st to 8th place for the round are determined based on the match results. \n Warzone screening points are composed of the accumulation of <Highlight> single-match ranking points </> and <Highlight> final round ranking points </>: \n <Highlight> Single-match ranking points: </> 1st place 30 points, 2nd place 15 points, 3rd place 10 points, 4th place 5 points. \n <Highlight> First round final ranking points: </> 1st place 60 points, 2nd place 50 points, 3rd place 45 points, 4th place 40 points, 5th to 8th place 10 points each. \n <Highlight> Second round final ranking points: </> 1st place 200 points, 2nd place 100 points, 3rd place 70 points, 4th place 50 points, 5th to 8th place 15 points each. \n <Highlight> Tie-breaking rules: </> Warzone screening rankings are prioritized by <Highlight> total warzone screening points </> from high to low. When total points are the same: After the first or second round of the league, sort according to the club's <Highlight> final ranking </> in this round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, the final ranking for this round has not yet been generated, so clubs with the same points are not distinguished by ranking, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking of this round. \n <Highlight> Extra God-Chosen Seats: </> When the strategic server is settled, the top three clubs in the region during screening can obtain additional God-Chosen seats: <Highlight> 1st place 10, 2nd place 5, 3rd place 5 </>.",
    ["战区筛选结束后，本赛区积分排名前4名的俱乐部晋级战略服。战略服结算时，筛选阶段赛区前三名俱乐部可额外获得神选席位：<Highlight>第1名10个，第2名5个，第3名5个</>。"] = "After the war zone selection ends, the top 4 Clubs in this competition zone by points will advance to the Strategic Server. When the Strategic Server settles, the top three Clubs from the selection phase will receive additional God-chosen seats: <Highlight>1st place gets 10, 2nd place gets 5, and 3rd place gets 5</>.",
    ["战友"] = "Comrade-in-Arms",
    ["战友……墓地……战友……墓地……把土地献给我主……"] = "Comrades... cemetery... comrades... cemetery... offer the land to my Lord...",
    ["战友……墓地？老鼠在重复这些词，是什么意思？"] = "Comrades... cemetery? The mouse is repeating these words, what does it mean?",
    ["战友们的名字——汤姆、老约翰、红头发的小比利……队长叫赫尔曼，总说打完仗要回去开面包店……"] = "The names of my comrades—Tom, Old John, little red-haired Billy... the captain was named Herman, who always said he'd go back to open a bakery after the war...",
    ["战友保护"] = "Comrade Protection",
    ["战友拜访"] = "Comrade Visit",
    ["战吼\n造成一次自身中心的圆形范围伤害。展开决斗领域，同时封闭战斗场地"] = "Battle Cry \n deals circular area damage centered on self. Open a duel field and seal the combat arena simultaneously",
    ["战团迅捷"] = "Battle Group Swiftness",
    ["战场"] = "Battlefield",
    ["战场上击败敌方会长超过10次，他人的黄昏，由你亲自降临。"] = "Defeat the enemy president more than 10 times on the battlefield. The twilight of others is brought by you personally.",
    ["战场上击败敌方会长超过2次，精准破敌，动摇根基。"] = "Defeated the enemy guild leader more than 2 times on the battlefield. Precise enemy destruction, shaking the foundation.",
    ["战场上击败敌方会长超过5次，核心打击，群龙无首。"] = "Defeated the enemy guild leader more than 5 times on the battlefield. Core strike, leaving them leaderless.",
    ["战场上存在六座<Disable>守护雕像</>，雕像初始处于无敌状态，在二阶段米尔贡根释放四象守护时，雕像会按顺序解除无敌状态。每存在一座雕像，米尔贡根获得一定<Disable>锁血</>效果，需要摧毁全部雕像，米尔贡根才能被击杀。"] = "There are six <Disable>Guardian Statues</> on the battlefield. The statues are initially invincible. During the second phase when Milgongen releases Four Symbols Protection, the statues will lose their invincibility in sequence. For every statue that exists, Milgongen gains a certain <Disable>health-lock</> effect. All statues must be destroyed before Milgongen can be killed.",
    ["战场不允许请离队友"] = "Cannot remove teammates while on the battlefield.",
    ["战场中不允许退出团队"] = "Cannot exit the team while on the battlefield.",
    ["战场中心表演"] = "Battlefield Center Performance",
    ["战场中心顶部表演"] = "Battlefield center top performance",
    ["战场之上，将由它来协助你，成为最锋利的剑刃。"] = "On the battlefield, it will assist you and become the sharpest blade.",
    ["战场之上，将由它来守护你，成为最坚硬的壁垒。"] = "On the battlefield, it will guard you and become the hardest barrier.",
    ["战场之上，将由它来疗愈你，成为最可靠的后盾。"] = "On the battlefield, it will heal you and become the most reliable support.",
    ["战场之光"] = "Light of the Battlefield",
