    ["战场挖掘出的箭头"] = "Arrowhead Excavated from a Battlefield",
    ["战场暂未开启无法进入"] = "Battlefield not yet open; cannot enter.",
    ["战场木桩怪"] = "Battlefield Dummy Monster",
