    ["战场背景"] = "Battlefield Background",
    ["战场规则"] = "Battlefield Rules",
    ["战场载具"] = "Battlefield Vehicle",
    ["战场遗迹中央，伫立着一尊被污染的雕像……"] = "In the center of the battlefield ruins stands a corrupted statue...",
