    ["战斗中, 无法踢出队员"] = "Cannot kick party members during combat.",
    ["战斗中不能更换装备或装备方案。"] = "Cannot change equipment or equipment plans during combat.",
    ["战斗中与武器合一，使攻防如呼吸自然。"] = "Become one with your weapon in battle, making offense and defense as natural as breathing.",
