    ["战斗中显示怪物方位"] = "Show Monster Direction in Combat",
    ["战斗中每20秒，你在移动时双脚会短暂显现“歌颂者”途径的灼热特性，经过的地表会留下短期的圆形烈阳地带，持续10秒。"] = "Every 20 seconds in battle, your feet will briefly manifest the scorching characteristic of the Bard Pathway while moving, leaving a short-term circular Blazing Sun zone on the ground for 10 seconds.",
    ["战斗中禁止上座驾"] = "Mounting vehicles is prohibited during combat.",
