    ["战马"] = "Warhorse",
    ["战魂残影"] = "War Soul Afterimage",
    ["戟尖划过，将坚固的意志熔成流动的迟疑。"] = "The halberd tip sweeps past, melting firm will into flowing hesitation.",
    ["戟杆的齿轮咬合声，知识拒绝被遗忘。"] = "The sound of gears meshing on the halberd shaft; knowledge refuses to be forgotten.",
    ["戟柄微微颤动，像渴血的脉搏。"] = "The halberd handle trembles slightly, like a blood-thirsty pulse.",
    ["戟身流转的符文是尚未执行的判决。"] = "The runes flowing on the halberd body are judgments yet to be executed.",
    ["戟锋所指，律法被弯成它不该有的形状。"] = "Where the halberd tip points, the law is bent into a shape it should not have.",
