    ["戴上倒是感觉没什么特别的。"] = "It doesn't feel like anything special when wearing it.",
    ["戴上它们，就算是在贝克兰德的社交场合中，您也会是足够耀眼的一位。"] = "Wearing them, even in social occasions in Backlund, you will be quite dazzling.",
    ["戴上它的瞬间，听见来自先知的告解。"] = "The moment you put it on, you hear the confession from the prophet.",
    ["戴上它，冥界的尖啸会撕裂耳畔，大幅提升所有战斗技能的攻速与冷却返还，击杀还能延长承受的时间。但摘下面具后若仍在战斗，你会陷入虚弱。"] = "Put it on, and the Scream of the underworld will tear at your ears, significantly increasing the Attack Speed and Cooldown return of all battle skills, and kills can extend the duration. But if you are still in battle after taking off the mask, you will fall into Weakness.",
    ["戴上它，无形威压将替对方回答“是”。"] = "Put it on, and the invisible Pressure will answer \"Yes\" for the other party.",
    ["戴上死者的头骨，你将拥有死亡的凝视和黄昏的权柄。但超过五分钟，你也将成为面具的一部分。"] = "Wearing the skull of the dead, you will possess the Gaze of Death and the authority of dusk. But after five minutes, you will also become part of the mask.",
    ["戴上那刻起，对方抗拒的念头将自行消解。"] = "From the moment you put it on, the other party's thoughts of resistance will dissolve on their own.",
    ["戴上面具"] = "Put on mask",
