    ["戴维……"] = "David...",
    ["戴维以前总说，雪落在头上像白发。"] = "David used to say that snow falling on one's head looks like white hair.",
    ["戴维斯·"] = "Davis ",
    ["戴维曾说，人生最浪漫的事，就是追逐风和雪。"] = "David once said that the most romantic thing in life is to chase the wind and snow.",
