    ["戴莉"] = "Daly",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮"] = "Daly Simone",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮-1星"] = "Daly Simone - 1 Star",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮-2星"] = "Daly Simone - 2 Star",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮-3星"] = "Daly Simone - 3 Star",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮女士……"] = "Ms. Daly Simone...",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Daly Simone, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮的眼眸碧绿如宝石，却总涂抹着妖异的蓝眼影和腮红，手腕缠绕着挂有白水晶的银链。她是值夜者最年轻的“天才”，三年从序列9走到序列6，自行摸索出扮演法，前途无量。\n可每次面对那个温柔的男人，她就变成了最笨拙的学徒。邓恩·史密斯，廷根的值夜者队长，总是把队员护在身后，总是笑着说“没关系”。她那么强，强到能让灵界生物缔结契约，强到能让亡者开口说话，却连一句“我喜欢你”都说不出口。\n她被调到贝克兰德教区，离廷根越来越远。本以为自己会忘记，却在每次路过廷根时心跳加速。本以为自己足够强大，却在听到他死讯的那一刻，如同被抽走灵魂。\n最后那一战，面对因斯·赞格威尔，她强行与强大的灵界生物缔结契约，濒临失控。她本该逃的，像那些“聪明”人一样。但她没有。\n她要——为他报仇。\n克莱恩变成邓恩的样子，陪她跳了最后一支舞。她明明知道是假的，却还是笑了。那是她这辈子最幸福的一刻。"] = "Daly Simone's eyes were as green as emeralds, yet she always wore eerie blue eyeshadow and blush, and a silver chain with white crystals wrapped around her wrist. She was the youngest \"genius\" of the Nighthawks, going from Sequence 9 to Sequence 6 in three years, discovering the Acting method on her own, with a limitless future.\n Yet, every time she faced that gentle man, she became the clumsiest apprentice. Dunn Smith, the captain of the Tingen Nighthawks, always kept his teammates behind him, always smiling and saying \"It's okay.\" She was so strong—strong enough to make contracts with Spirit World creatures, strong enough to make the dead speak—yet she couldn't even say \"I like you.\"\n She was transferred to the Backlund Diocese, further and further away from Tingen. She thought she would forget, but her heart would race every time she passed through Tingen. She thought she was strong enough, but the moment she heard the news of his death, it was as if her soul had been ripped away.\n In that final battle, facing Ince Zangwill, she forcibly made a contract with a powerful Spirit World creature, nearing loss of control. She should have run, like those \"smart\" people. But she didn't.\n She wanted—to avenge him.\n Klein turned into Dunn's appearance and accompanied her in one last dance. She knew it was fake, but she still smiled. That was the happiest moment of her life.",
    ["戴莉·西蒙妮，你愿意接受这个任务吗？"] = "Daly Simone, are you willing to accept this mission?",
