    ["所以……你需要我做什么？"] = "So... what do you need me to do?",
    ["所以……必须有人去排查这些定时炸弹，才能保护普通人的安全。"] = "So... someone must go and investigate these ticking time bombs to protect the safety of ordinary people.",
    ["所以……我也是……你"] = "So... I am also... you.",
    ["所以……我也能试试？"] = "So... can I try it too?",
    ["所以……我想请你先看看小黛西，再做决定。"] = "So... I would like to ask you to see Little Daisy first before making a decision.",
    ["所以……看了这么多，你也想成为我们的一部分吗？"] = "So... after seeing so much, do you also want to become a part of us?",
    ["所以……这个教派到底崇拜什么？满月还是日出？"] = "So... what does this cult worship? The full moon or the sunrise?",
    ["所以他决定仔细研究手稿，从中学习创作经验……没想到会变成这副模样。"] = "So he decided to study the manuscript carefully to learn from his creative experience... I didn't expect him to end up like this.",
    ["所以他决定仔细研究手稿，从中学习创作经验……没想到会变成这幅模样。"] = "So he decided to study the manuscript carefully and learn from its creative experience... He didn't expect it to turn out like this.",
    ["所以住在这里的贝茨太太是……"] = "So Mrs. Bates, who lives here, is...",
    ["所以佛尔思女士托我交给您这个。"] = "So Ms. Fors entrusted me to give you this.",
    ["所以你们按照书里的偏方，用火为菲丽丝驱邪？"] = "So you followed the folk remedies in the book and used fire to exorcise evil from Phyllis?",
    ["所以你们被困在了这里？"] = "So you are trapped here?",
    ["所以你偷走布兰登先生的书，想解决麻烦？"] = "So you stole Mr. Brandon's book to solve the trouble?",
    ["所以你决定了？"] = "So, have you decided?",
    ["所以你在？"] = "So you are?",
    ["所以你将计就计，回信迷惑他，让你有机会报仇？"] = "So you played along, writing back to confuse him, giving you a chance to take revenge?",
    ["所以你待会问什么？……诶，镜子背后的眼睛好像正在看着你？"] = "So what are you going to ask later? ...Eh, does the eye behind the mirror seem to be looking at you?",
    ["所以你想……"] = "So you want to...",
    ["所以你才让我帮你排队啊。"] = "So that's why you asked me to queue for you.",
    ["所以你打算……"] = "So you intend to...",
    ["所以你是要赴约了？"] = "So you're going to keep the appointment?",
    ["所以你有什么事？没事的话别来打扰我。成为合格学徒的第一步是学着自己使用熔炉。"] = "So what do you want? If there's nothing, don't bother me. The first step to becoming a qualified Apprentice is learning how to use the furnace yourself.",
    ["所以你的力量 也来源于我"] = "So your power also comes from me.",
    ["所以你真的是自愿的？"] = "So you really were a willing participant?",
    ["所以你知道哪个占卜师最准吗？我让他先给我算晚饭的事，我急着知道！ "] = "So do you know which diviner is the most accurate? I'll let him calculate the dinner thing for me first, I'm in a hurry to know!",
    ["所以你觉得真正有需要的人不在诊所里？"] = "So you think the people who really need help aren't in the clinic?",
    ["所以你这脸色苍白，不是因为紧张，是吃鸡蛋吃的？……话说回来，达文西看起来一点都不紧张。"] = "So your pale complexion isn't because of nerves, but from eating eggs? ...Speaking of which, Da Vinci doesn't look nervous at all.",
    ["所以你需要我做什么？"] = "So what do you need me to do?",
    ["所以你需要我帮你做什么？"] = "So what do you need me to do for you?",
    ["所以占卜怎么说？"] = "So what does the divination say?",
    ["所以只有一个法子——砰！远程，一枪毙命。不给他们反应的空档。"] = "So there's only one way—Bang! Ranged, one shot to kill. Don't give them a chance to react.",
    ["所以啊，这一定是神意，要我好好珍惜家人。我发誓，只要我还做得动，每年的生日礼物都不会迟到！"] = "So, this must be God's will, wanting me to cherish my family. I swear, as long as I can still work, my annual birthday gifts will never be late!",
    ["所以她从廷根回来，我们都想让她帮我们看病。"] = "So when she returned from Tingen, we all wanted her to treat our illnesses.",
    ["所以她会在……"] = "So she would be in...",
    ["所以她会选择西南区。"] = "So she would choose the Southwest District.",
    ["所以她派我来交给你。毕竟，我只是一条狗。"] = "So she sent me to give it to you. After all, I am just a dog.",
    ["所以它喷火是在照明？乌云是它难过的样子？"] = "So it was breathing fire to provide light? And the dark clouds were it feeling sad?",
    ["所以富商的女儿……"] = "So the wealthy merchant's daughter...",
    ["所以您一直没说？"] = "So you never said anything?",
    ["所以您刚刚在这……"] = "So you were just here...",
    ["所以您到底帮不帮我算呀，快帮我先算晚饭的事，我急着知道！ "] = "So are you going to help me calculate or not? Hurry up and calculate the dinner thing first, I'm in a rush to know!",
    ["所以您学心理学是为了什么？"] = "So why do you study psychology?",
    ["所以您就试图把公牛和小麦杂交？"] = "So you tried to crossbreed a bull and wheat?",
    ["所以您很擅长调查？"] = "So you are very good at investigations?",
    ["所以您的第二段尊名是黄黑之王的眷者。"] = "So your second honorific is Blessed of the Yellow and Black King.",
    ["所以我一个人来，圣赛缪尔教堂八点打开大门，所以我每周日六点起床。"] = "That's why I come alone. Saint Samuel Cathedral opens its doors at eight, so I wake up at six every Sunday.",
    ["所以我也在帮他留意相关的线索。如果能帮阿兹克先生找回记忆，我也会很高兴。"] = "So I am also keeping an eye out for relevant clues for him. If I can help Mr. Azik recover his memories, I would also be very happy.",
    ["所以我从来不让人拖欠房租，兴许你早上出门好好的，晚上就躺在墓地里了。"] = "That's why I never let people fall behind on rent. Perhaps you leave the house fine in the morning, and by night, you're lying in the cemetery.",
    ["所以我们至少拯救了四十多个人的生命？"] = "So we have saved at least forty lives?",
    ["所以我会在咖啡厅坐坐。"] = "That's why I sit in the cafe.",
    ["所以我决定换一种方式，我要打败第一名的弗朗切斯科！"] = "So I decided to change my approach; I'm going to defeat the first-place Francesco!",
    ["所以我去了厨房，让仆人准备好下午茶点心。大概<P_Yellow>三点二十分</>，我想问问老爷是否还记得复诊预约，但怎么敲门都没人应。"] = "So I went to the Kitchen and had the servants prepare afternoon tea snacks. At about <P_Yellow> 3:20 PM </>, I wanted to ask if the master remembered his follow-up appointment, but no matter how I knocked, there was no response.",
    ["所以我反悔了，因为恐惧。我恐惧我对信仰的狂热会像我对金钱的狂热一样熄灭。"] = "So I went back on my word, out of fear. I fear that my fanaticism for faith will extinguish just like my fanaticism for money.",
    ["所以我叫上公寓里相熟的人一起打牌，兴致上来大吼了几声，结果……"] = "So I called some familiar people in the apartment to play cards, and when the mood hit, I roared a few times, and as a result...",
    ["所以我建议你们不要进去，毕竟这么做有不小的风险。"] = "So I suggest you do not go in; after all, doing so carries significant risks.",
    ["所以我必须要猎龙，我要完成我们的理想，我要让他的名字被人记住！"] = "So I must hunt a dragon. I must complete our ideal, I must make his name remembered!",
    ["所以我想回来看看，有没有可以协助处理的事情？"] = "So I wanted to come back and see if there is anything I can assist with?",
    ["所以我才要到这该死的集市调查！要是被我发现是谁干的，他就完蛋了！"] = "That's why I have to investigate this damn market! If I find out who did it, they're finished!",
    ["所以我才说要用配重块！但教授说必须用“生物动态质量”！"] = "That's why I said we should use counterweights! But the professor said we must use 'biological dynamic mass'!",
    ["所以我找了个钱多事少的活。"] = "So I found a job with good pay and little work.",
    ["所以我把所有事情都记录下来，可现在……它们全散了……"] = "So I recorded everything, but now... they are all scattered...",
    ["所以我昨晚是和……<P_Heart>（罗塞尔！！！你的品味也太……）</>"] = "So last night I was with... <P_Heart> (Roselle!!! Your taste is just too...!) </>",
    ["所以我连夜收拾行李搬走了，看他还怎么用手杖捶门……喂，你为什么不说话？"] = "So I packed my luggage overnight and moved out. Let's see how he can use his cane to pound on the door... Hey, why aren't you talking?",
    ["所以托马斯的计划失败了，最终失控！"] = "So Thomas's plan failed, leading to a final loss of control!",
    ["所以昨天当侠盗出现，我又怎么能不跟他走呢？那一刻，一切就像从前一样，书里的人物在陪我玩游戏——戴着父亲的领带。"] = "So when the Thief appeared yesterday, how could I not go with him? At that moment, everything was just like before, the characters in the book were playing games with me—wearing my father's tie.",
    ["所以是合金的延展性，导致它在受力之后……"] = "So it's the ductility of the alloy that causes it to, after being subjected to force...",
    ["所以是我们误会了？还帮你设计了这么多考验……"] = "So we misunderstood? And we even designed so many tests for you...",
    ["所以最后确认了吗？"] = "So, did you confirm it in the end?",
    ["所以最好不要轻易尝试，还是来一本《第二纪十大未解之谜》吧，这可是《我与格尔曼斯帕罗二三事》作者的最新力作！"] = "So it's best not to try it lightly. Better to get a copy of 'The Ten Unsolved Mysteries of the Second Epoch'. This is the latest masterpiece by the author of 'Things Between Me and Gehrman Sparrow'!",
    ["所以消化魔药的关键是——"] = "So the key to digesting the potion is—",
    ["所以现在看起来，你们对“愚者”先生都很尊敬？"] = "So it seems that you all respect Mr. Fool very much now?",
    ["所以现在看起来，你们对愚者先生都很尊敬？"] = "So it seems that you all respect Mr. Fool very much?",
    ["所以由什么组成？"] = "So what is it composed of?",
    ["所以答案是廷根。简单、直接，真是令人怀念。"] = "So the answer is Tingen. Simple, direct—it really makes one nostalgic.",
    ["所以罗珊刚刚才着急出门，是……？"] = "So is that why Rozanne was in such a hurry to go out just now...?",
    ["所以罗珊刚才着急出门，是……？"] = "So Rozanne was in such a hurry to go out just now, is it...?",
    ["所以蜡烛工坊是因为后继无人倒闭了吗？"] = "So the candle workshop closed down because there was no successor?",
    ["所以要会挑。捏一捏，太软的不要，有虫眼的不要。回家把磕碰的地方切掉，剩下的能吃三天。"] = "That's why you have to know how to pick. Squeeze them; don't take the ones that are too soft, and don't take the ones with wormholes. When you get home, cut off the bruised parts, and the rest can be eaten for three days.",
    ["所以要找到最近来过这的人，排查他们的状态？"] = "So we need to find the people who were here recently and check their condition?",
    ["所以观察有结果吗？"] = "So, are there any results from your observation?",
    ["所以警局戒严，准备拘捕他？"] = "So the police station is under martial law, preparing to arrest him?",
    ["所以说，抓住人们内心深处最原始、最朴素、最浓烈的感情，才是一部作品成功的关键。"] = "Therefore, grasping the most primitive, simple, and intense emotions deep in people's hearts is the key to a work's success.",
    ["所以请告诉我"] = "So please tell me.",
    ["所以这一切，都是血族内部的问题？"] = "So all of this was just an internal issue within the Sanguine?",
    ["所以这些天，你衣服上的是……"] = "So, all these days, the things on your clothes were...",
    ["所以这到底是什么怪物？"] = "So what exactly is this monster?",
    ["所以这是我们所有人的生日，我身为国王，一定会带他们回家过。"] = "So this is everyone's birthday. As King, I will definitely take them home to celebrate.",
    ["所以这里也有菲丽丝的记忆？可梦境空间这么大，怎么找？"] = "So Phyllis's memories are here too? But the Dream Space is so huge, how are we supposed to find them?",
    ["所以这里是我的梦境……或者潜意识？"] = "So this is my dream... or my subconscious?",
    ["所以那晚的吻，只是为了摆脱他们？"] = "So that kiss that night was just to get rid of them?",
    ["所以，<P_Heart>（严肃）</>在非凡世界一定要——“小心观众”。"] = "Therefore, <P_Heart>(Serious)</> in the Extraordinary world, you must always—'Beware of Spectators'.",
    ["所以，<P_Heart>（点头）</>值得。"] = "So, <P_Heart>(Nods)</> it's worth it.",
    ["所以，他会理解的……我相信他会理解的。"] = "So, he will understand... I believe he will understand.",
    ["所以，你……不讨厌我？"] = "So, you... don't hate me?",
    ["所以，你们不眠者的糟糕记性，连死后也无法摆脱？"] = "So, you Sleepless can't even escape your terrible memory after death?",
    ["所以，你听得到它们说话？"] = "So, you can hear them talking?",
    ["所以，你在咖啡里放了什么？"] = "So, what did you put in the coffee?",
    ["所以，你是他们的国王？"] = "So, you are their King?",
    ["所以，你是来看病的。"] = "So, you're here to see a doctor.",
    ["所以，你有吗？"] = "So, do you have any?",
    ["所以，你要不要一起进来，士兵？"] = "So, do you want to come in with us, soldier?",
    ["所以，关于出口……"] = "So, about the exit...",
    ["所以，在非凡世界一定要——“小心观众”。"] = "Therefore, in the Extraordinary World, you must always—'Beware of Spectators.'",
    ["所以，安息吧……让我来，成为那个怪物。"] = "So, rest in peace... let me be the one to become that monster.",
    ["所以，我从不停止创作。我想只要我写的够多，总会有人欣赏我的诗歌！"] = "So, I never stop creating. I think as long as I write enough, someone will eventually appreciate my poetry!",
    ["所以，我们后来去了南方，那里的天气很惬意，海边的日晒让我们重新开启了一段美好的时光。"] = "So, we later went to the south, where the weather was very pleasant, and the sunshine by the sea allowed us to start a wonderful time again.",
    ["所以，我向你开放了我的历史。重历我的过去，会帮助你对抗污染，稳定你的记忆与人性。"] = "Therefore, I have opened my history to you. Reliving my past will help you resist corruption and stabilize your memory and humanity.",
    ["所以，我这一生都在做对的事情，我在为伟大的艺术创造永恒。"] = "So, I have been doing the right thing all my life; I am creating eternity for great art.",
    ["所以，拜托您替我保守这个秘密。拜托您了！"] = "So, please keep this secret for me. Please!",
    ["所以，是我把安提哥努斯家族的笔记送到了这里？"] = "So, I was the one who brought the Antigonus Family notebook here?",
    ["所以，没有人看到小偷？嗯……那有可能……"] = "So, no one saw the thief? Hmm... that's possible...",
    ["所以，要怎么拍？"] = "So, how should I pose?",
    ["所以，要来点美味的香料吗？"] = "So, would you like some delicious spices?",
    ["所以，请您……放过我。"] = "So, please... let me go.",
    ["所以，这么看来……"] = "So, looking at it this way...",
    ["所以？"] = "Therefore?",
    ["所保存数值超出保留位数，已做四舍五入处理。"] = "The saved value exceeded the decimal limit and has been rounded.",
    ["所信即为所见。心象所及，皆铸真实。 "] = "What is believed is what is seen. Where the mind's image reaches, all is cast into reality.",
    ["所受暴击伤害的伤害倍率减少，抵消伤害来源的暴伤。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。"] = "Reduces the damage multiplier of received critical hits, offsetting the critical damage of the damage source. The final multiplier for critical damage will not exceed 250% or be lower than 125%.",
    ["所受物理暴击伤害的伤害倍率减少{*.1f**,F1690001,pCritDef}，抵消伤害来源的物理暴伤。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。\n提升的暴伤减免超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。"] = "Reduces the damage multiplier of physical critical damage received {*.1f**,F1690001,pCritDef}, negating the physical critical damage of the damage source. The final multiplier of critical damage will not exceed 250% or fall below 125%. \nIf the increased critical damage reduction exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved.",
    ["所受魔法暴击伤害的伤害倍率减少{*.1f**,F1690001,mCritDef}，抵消伤害来源的魔法暴伤。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。\n提升的暴伤减免超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。"] = "Reduces the damage multiplier of magic critical damage received {*.1f**,F1690001,mCritDef}, negating the magic critical damage of the damage source. The final multiplier of critical damage will not exceed 250% or fall below 125%. \nIf the increased critical damage reduction exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved.",
    ["所向披靡，无往不利！<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在<Highlight_L>%s</>中获得<Highlight_L>%s连胜</>，战场之上，新的神话已在书写！"] = "Unstoppable and invincible! <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has achieved a <Highlight_L>%s-win streak in <Highlight_L>%s</>; on the battlefield, a new legend is being written!</>",
    ["所向披靡，无往不利！{{player.name}}在<Chat_Highlight>{{gameMode.name}}</>中获得<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.curWinStreak}}连胜</>，战场之上，新的神话已在书写！"] = "Invincible and unstoppable! {{player.name}} has achieved a <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.curWinStreak}} win streak in <Chat_Highlight>{{gameMode.name}}</>! On the battlefield, a new legend is being written!</>",
    ["所在市"] = "City",
    ["所在省"] = "Province",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到1级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 1",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到2级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 2",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到3级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 3",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到4级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 4",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到5级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 5",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到6级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 6",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到7级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 7",
    ["所属俱乐部图书馆等级达到8级"] = "Affiliated Club Library level reaches 8",
    ["所属界面UID"] = "UI UID of the belonging interface",
    ["所属途径"] = "Affiliated Pathway",
    ["所得知识不可随意外传他人。"] = "Acquired knowledge must not be casually spread to others.",
    ["所想象的物品必将具现，所幻想的国度必将降临，所宣称的未来必将上演。掌握完整“空想”权柄，让虚幻与现实交织。"] = "What is imagined shall be manifested, the kingdom that is fantasized shall descend, and the future that is proclaimed shall be staged. Master the complete authority of 'Visionary' to interweave the illusory with reality.",
    ["所捍卫的，比钢铁更坚硬，比生命更沉重。"] = "What is defended is harder than steel and heavier than life.",
    ["所有"] = "All",
    ["所有%s技能等级同时提升"] = "All %s skill levels increase simultaneously",
    ["所有%s技能等级同时提升，可通过【序列晋升】获得额外技能点。"] = "All %s skills level up together. Gain extra Skill Points through [Sequence Advancement].",
    ["所有东西打组（方便统一移动）"] = "Group everything (for unified movement)",
    ["所有人"] = "Everyone",
    ["所有人<Highlight>灵活走位</>躲避同时安排指定玩家<Highlight>挡线</>，其余玩家及时<Highlight>转火输出</>解除无敌状态的雕像从而使米尔贡根进入破防状态。"] = "Everyone must <Highlight>move flexibly</> to dodge while assigning specific players to <Highlight>block the line</>. The remaining players must promptly <Highlight>switch targets to attack</> and destroy the statue that has lost its invincibility to force Milgongen into an Armor Break state.",
    ["所有人分散站位并使用<Disable>以菇制蔓</>净化距离自己最近的<Disable>荒芜之藤</>，期间无法受到治疗，请避开污染区域。"] = "Everyone should disperse and use <Disable>Mushroom-based Vine Purification</> to purify the <Disable>Withered Vine of Desolation</> closest to them. During this period, you cannot be healed, so please avoid the polluted area.",
    ["所有人及时<Highlight>跳跃</>躲避震荡波。"] = "Everyone should <Highlight>jump</> in time to avoid the shockwave.",
    ["所有人可发言"] = "Everyone can speak",
    ["所有人可见"] = "Visible to Everyone",
    ["所有人搭配评分均为0，请装配带有评分的服装再进行决斗"] = "Everyone's combination score is 0. Please equip clothing with scores before dueling.",
    ["所有人注意<Highlight>灵活走位</>躲避。"] = "Everyone, pay attention to <Highlight>moving flexibly</> to dodge.",
    ["所有人石化了话，执行团灭attack可以配置团灭的一些攻击效果"] = "If everyone is petrified, execute a wipe-out attack; you can configure various attack effects for the wipe-out.",
    ["所有人离开副本，副本已关闭。"] = "Everyone leave the dungeon; the dungeon has been closed.",
    ["所有人都为此惊叹，并表示这是他们听过最神奇的占卜。"] = "Everyone is amazed by it and says it's the most magical divination they've ever heard of.",
    ["所有人都会……死？"] = "Everyone will... die?",
    ["所有人都会死 包括我"] = "Everyone will die, including me",
    ["所有人都会死，包括我。"] = "Everyone will die, including me.",
    ["所有人都在离我而去，只有我还在坚持……嗝，我已经感到疲惫了。"] = "Everyone is leaving me, only I am still persisting... *hic*, I'm already feeling exhausted.",
    ["所有人都在等待，只有你在主动出击。恭喜你——卷赢了这场金雨！"] = "Everyone is waiting, only you are taking the initiative. Congratulations—you've won this golden rain!",
    ["所有人都知道。您的名字被刻在新白银城的纪念碑上，和科林首席在一起。"] = "Everyone knows. Your name is engraved on the monument of the New City of Silver, together with Chief Colin.",
    ["所有人，都得死！"] = "Everyone, must die!",
    ["所有人，靠近我！"] = "Everyone, get close to me!",
    ["所有人？"] = "Everyone?",
    ["所有伙伴数量+7"] = "All partner quantities +7",
    ["所有伙伴的数量+7"] = "All partner quantities +7",
    ["所有信众都可以来这里寻求女神的指引。"] = "All believers can come here to seek the Goddess's guidance.",
    ["所有关卡挑战成功"] = "All stages cleared",
    ["所有友军获 <HighLight>10%</> 攻击力，法师额外再获 <HighLight>15%</> 攻击力；"] = "All allies gain <HighLight>10%</> Attack, Mages gain an additional <HighLight>15%</> Attack.",
    ["所有友军获 <HighLight>10%</> 攻击力，法师额外再获 <HighLight>35%</> 攻击力；"] = "All allies gain <HighLight>10%</> Attack, Mages gain an additional <HighLight>35%</> Attack.",
    ["所有友军获 <HighLight>10%</> 攻击力，法师额外再获 <HighLight>55%</> 攻击力；"] = "All allies gain <HighLight>10%</> Attack, Mages gain an additional <HighLight>55%</> Attack.",
    ["所有友军获 <HighLight>10%</> 攻击力，法师额外再获 <HighLight>75%</> 攻击力；"] = "All allies gain <HighLight>10%</> Attack, Mages gain an additional <HighLight>75%</> Attack.",
    ["所有可能的开始 所有未知的集合 所有旅程的起点"] = "All possible beginnings, all collections of the unknown, the starting point of all journeys",
    ["所有命运的馈赠，早已在暗中标注好了价格。"] = "All gifts of fate have already had their prices marked in the dark.",
    ["所有命运的馈赠，早已在暗中标注好了价格。\n<Highlight>1、活动时间</>\n本期活动时间为<Quality_5>2026年8月21日8时至2026年10月15日8时</>\n<Highlight>2、活动规则</>\n完成活动任务，可以获得经验值，积累经验值后提升等级，可领取对应等级的奖励。购买<Quality_5>时代恩典（豪华版战令）</>可以解锁额外奖励并获得对应特权。购买<Quality_5>命运馈赠（典藏版战令）</>，除了可获得<Quality_5>豪华版战令</>的所有额外奖励与特权外，还将立即获得更多珍稀奖励与<Quality_5>等级直升15级</>等超值典藏权益。\n<Highlight>3、活动任务</>\n任务分为周任务和赛季任务，周任务每周可完成多轮，获得的经验将会计入周经验上限，周经验上限在当期活动时间内可逐周累计；赛季任务只能完成一次，获得的经验不会计入周上限。"] = "All gifts of fate have already had their prices marked in the dark. \n<Highlight>1. Event Duration</>\nThis event runs from <Quality_5>August 21, 2026, at 8:00 AM to October 15, 2026, at 8:00 AM.</>\n<Highlight>2. Event Rules</>\nComplete event quests to earn EXP. Accumulate EXP to level up and claim corresponding level rewards. Purchase <Quality_5>Era's Grace (Deluxe Battle Pass)</> to unlock additional rewards and gain corresponding privileges. Purchase <Quality_5>Fate's Gift (Collector's Battle Pass)</> to receive all additional rewards and privileges from the <Quality_5>Deluxe Battle Pass</>, plus immediate access to more rare rewards and exclusive collector's benefits such as <Quality_5>a 15-level instant boost</>.\n<Highlight>3. Event Quests</>\nQuests are divided into Weekly Quests and Season Quests. Weekly Quests can be completed multiple times per week, and the EXP earned will count toward the weekly EXP cap, which accumulates week by week during the event. Season Quests can only be completed once, and the EXP earned does not count toward the weekly cap.",
    ["所有命运的馈赠，都在暗处标注好了价格。"] = "All gifts of fate have their prices marked in the dark.",
    ["所有成员必须与首席互为好友"] = "All members must be friends with the Chief",
