    ["所有死亡的归宿，深藏灵界的地狱，万物终朽的见证，独属于死神的国度。"] = "The final destination of all who die, the hell hidden deep within the Spirit World, the witness to the decay of all things—the kingdom belonging solely to the God of Death.",
    ["所有法阵已修复，法阵开启中。消灭前来阻拦的通缉犯！"] = "All magic circles have been repaired and are now activating. Eliminate the wanted criminals trying to stop you!",
    ["所有灵性力量的母亲……"] = "The mother of all spiritual powers...",
    ["所有灾难的源头"] = "The source of all disasters",
    ["所有灾难的源头，毁灭与末日的象征，执掌混沌的魔女。"] = "The source of all disasters, the symbol of destruction and the apocalypse, the Witch who wields chaos.",
    ["所有玩家<Disable>脚下出现跟随玩家移动的矩形魔法条带</>，短暂延迟后爆发奥术能量，对范围内所有玩家造成伤害。"] = "Rectangular magic strips that follow the players appear under <Disable>all players' feet</>. After a short delay, they erupt with arcane energy, dealing damage to all players within range.",
    ["所有玩家死亡或离开副本"] = "All players dead or left dungeon",
    ["所有玩家都需要穿过迷宫来到瑞尔比伯身边，<Highlight>解除木偶化</>。"] = "All players need to pass through the maze to reach Riel Bieber and <Highlight>remove the puppet transformation</>.",
    ["所有的叶子。每一种叶脉走向。每一层细胞结构。从古至今，从现在到未来。所有的叶子。"] = "All the leaves. Every vein pattern. Every cellular structure. From ancient times to the present, from now to the future. All the leaves.",
    ["所有的叶子？"] = "All the leaves?",
    ["所有的路都将通向属于自己的终点。我们的路虽然交织纠缠在一起，可只有自己才能决定自己走向哪里。"] = "All paths will lead to their own destinations. Although our paths are intertwined, only we can decide where we are going.",
    ["所有的问题似乎都围绕黛丝死亡的真实原因……我很好奇，你为什么执着于得到这个真相？"] = "All the questions seem to revolve around the real reason for Daisy's death... I'm curious, why are you so obsessed with getting this truth?",
