    ["所有线索汇聚到这里——城东的废弃教堂。唤醒被蛊惑的信众，斩断金狼的狂信之线。"] = "All clues converge here—the abandoned cathedral in the east of the city. Awaken the bewitched believers and sever the Golden Wolf's Thread of Fanaticism.",
