    ["所有规则都处在不断完善和修正的过程之中。这个过程需要每个人的参与，而我会不遗余力地帮助你们。"] = "All rules are in a process of constant improvement and revision. This process requires everyone's participation, and I will spare no effort to help you all.",
    ["所有通缉犯已被消灭！法阵重启成功，该区域已被收复！"] = "All wanted criminals have been eliminated! Magic circle restarted successfully; this area has been reclaimed!",
    ["所有部件升至满级后解锁"] = "Unlocked after all components reach max level.",
    ["所有都将毁灭，一切……同归红月！"] = "Everything shall be destroyed, all... return to the Red Moon!",
    ["所有队员暂离副本，副本将在%s秒后销毁。"] = "All party members have left the dungeon, it will be destroyed in %s seconds.",
    ["所有雕像将同时释放增幅射线，抵挡射线同时走位躲避预警！"] = "All statues will release Amplification Rays simultaneously; block the rays while moving to dodge the warnings!",
    ["所有鲁恩风格的珠宝，都是由来自首都的大师级工匠亲手打造。"] = "All Loen-style jewelry is handcrafted by master craftsmen from the capital.",
    ["所罗门"] = "Solomon",
    ["所罗门·"] = "Solomon ",
    ["所谓“扮演法”的精髓，就是“做出符合魔药名称的行为，明悟暗藏的规律，并以此严格要求自己”。"] = "The essence of the so-called \"Acting Method\" is to \"perform actions that align with the potion's name, comprehend the hidden laws, and strictly hold yourself to them.\"",
    ["所谓真相，只存在于你所想看到的视角。"] = "So-called truth only exists in the perspective you wish to see.",
