    ["手册上介绍了很多新员工可以做的事……"] = "The manual introduces many things new employees can do...",
    ["手写的原版星相书，因翻看太多次而边角卷翘。"] = "A handwritten original astrology book with curled corners from being read too many times.",
    ["手写的原版星相书，因翻看太多次而边角卷翘，有几页摸起来厚度不同，像黏住了。"] = "A handwritten original astrology book; the corners are curled from being flipped through too many times, and some pages feel different in thickness, as if they are stuck together.",
    ["手写的字？这是……笔记本？"] = "Handwritten words? Is this... a notebook?",
