    ["手腕"] = "Wrist",
    ["手腕和项间空空荡荡的贫穷女郎、目光游荡在他人钱包上的混混、眼神锐利的陌生面孔，嗯？我怎么记不清他的长相？"] = "A poor lady with empty wrists and neck, a thug with eyes wandering over others' wallets, a stranger with sharp eyes—hmm? Why can't I remember his face?",
