    ["才9便士？前两天还要11便士，面包降价了？"] = "Only 9 pence? It was 11 pence two days ago. Did the price of bread go down?",
    ["才不会，我们可以藏在煤仓里，等船开远了再出来。那些船员会需要我们帮忙擦甲板的，然后就可以顺理成章地留下了去！"] = "Not at all, we can hide in the coal bunker and come out after the ship is far away. The crew will need our help scrubbing the deck, and then we can stay on board logically!",
