    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的<Highlight>55装等金色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a <Highlight>Item Level 55 gold quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的竞技向<Highlight>60装等橙色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a Competition-oriented <Highlight>Item Level 60 orange quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的竞技向<Highlight>62装等橙色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a Competition-oriented <Highlight>Item Level 62 orange quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的竞技向<Highlight>64装等橙色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a Competition-oriented <Highlight>Item Level 64 orange quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的竞技向<Highlight>66装等橙色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a Competition-oriented <Highlight>Item Level 66 orange quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可获得自身途径对应的竞技向<Highlight>68装等橙色品质武器</>。"] = "Open to receive a Competition-oriented <Highlight>Item Level 68 orange quality weapon</> corresponding to your own Pathway.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>25装等</>的紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>level 25</> purple-quality equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Secret Treasures; progress exceeding this will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and will be <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> once the new level's Secret Treasures are unlocked.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的装备。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>level 35</> equipment.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>level 35</> gold and purple-quality equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Secret Treasures; progress exceeding this will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and will be <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> once the new level's Secret Treasures are unlocked.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>45装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly receive one piece of gold or purple quality Equipment with <Highlight>Item Level 45</>, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>55品</>或<Highlight>60品</>的<Highlight>金色品质装备</>。"] = "Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>gold-quality equipment</> of <Highlight>level 55</> or <Highlight>level 60</>.",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>55装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly receive one piece of gold or purple quality Equipment with <Highlight>Item Level 55</>, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
