    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>40</>个聚合因子，一定概率获得<Highlight>50</>个聚合因子，较低概率获得<Highlight>150</>个聚合因子，极低概率获得<Highlight>250</>个聚合因子。"] = "Opening has a high probability of granting <Highlight>40</> Aggregation Factors, a certain probability of <Highlight>50</>, a lower probability of <Highlight>150</>, and an extremely low probability of <Highlight>250</>.",
    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>40</>个蓝山晶石，一定概率获得<Highlight>100</>个蓝山晶石，较低概率获得<Highlight>330</>个蓝山晶石，极低概率获得<Highlight>990</>个蓝山晶石。"] = "Open to have a high probability of obtaining <Highlight>40</> Blue Mountain Crystals, a certain probability of obtaining <Highlight>100</> Blue Mountain Crystals, a lower probability of obtaining <Highlight>330</> Blue Mountain Crystals, and an extremely low probability of obtaining <Highlight>990</> Blue Mountain Crystals.",
    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>40</>个金纺线，一定概率获得<Highlight>100</>个金纺线，较低概率获得<Highlight>330</>个金纺线，极低概率获得<Highlight>990</>个金纺线。"] = "Opening has a high probability of granting <Highlight>40</> Gold Threads, a certain probability of <Highlight>100</>, a lower probability of <Highlight>330</>, and an extremely low probability of <Highlight>990</>.",
    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>80</>个聚合因子，一定概率获得<Highlight>100</>个聚合因子，较低概率获得<Highlight>300</>个聚合因子，极低概率获得<Highlight>500</>个聚合因子。"] = "Open to have a high probability of obtaining <Highlight>80</> Polymerization Factors, a certain probability of obtaining <Highlight>100</> Polymerization Factors, a lower probability of obtaining <Highlight>300</> Polymerization Factors, and an extremely low probability of obtaining <Highlight>500</> Polymerization Factors.",
    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>80</>个蓝山晶石，一定概率获得<Highlight>200</>个蓝山晶石，较低概率获得<Highlight>660</>个蓝山晶石，极低概率获得<Highlight>1980</>个蓝山晶石。"] = "Opening has a high probability of granting <Highlight>80</> Blue Mountain Crystals, a certain probability of <Highlight>200</>, a lower probability of <Highlight>660</>, and an extremely low probability of <Highlight>1980</>.",
    ["打开后有较高概率获得<Highlight>8</>个金纺线，一定概率获得<Highlight>20</>个金纺线，较低概率获得<Highlight>66</>个金纺线，极低概率获得<Highlight>199</>个金纺线。"] = "Opening has a high probability of granting <Highlight>8</> Gold Threads, a certain probability of <Highlight>20</>, a lower probability of <Highlight>66</>, and an extremely low probability of <Highlight>199</>.",
