    ["打开后随机获得1个词条数量为1-2条的<Highlight>不可交易</>的金色非凡物质，必定为珍品词条。"] = "Open to randomly receive 1 <Highlight>non-tradable</> gold Extraordinary material with 1-2 affixes, guaranteed to be Rare affixes.",
