    ["打打杀杀，三年之后又三年，唉……想金盆洗手了……"] = "All this fighting and killing, three years after another three years, sigh... I want to wash my hands of this life...",
    ["打扫……得尽快完成打扫"] = "Cleaning... must finish cleaning as soon as possible",
    ["打扫完毕"] = "Cleaning Finished",
    ["打扫结束……"] = "Cleaning finished...",
    ["打扫，整理一下……其实学派里需要学员们干的工作很少啦，很多时候都是我自己找点活干。"] = "Cleaning, tidying up... actually, there is very little work for students to do in the school. Most of the time, I just find some work for myself.",
    ["打扰一下……你在葡萄架附近见过一个头发很长的人吗？"] = "Excuse me... have you seen a person with very long hair near the grape trellis?",
    ["打扰一下，请问你了解乔的“那些”药剂都有什么效果？"] = "Excuse me, may I ask what effects 'those' potions of Joe's have?",
    ["打扰一下，请问刚才那个女孩……"] = "Excuse me, may I ask about that girl just now...",
    ["打扰了"] = "Excuse me",
    ["打扰了。"] = "Excuse me.",
    ["打扰了。我刚刚在教堂后面的花圃里采了些花，想着或许有人用得上。"] = "Excuse me. I just picked some flowers in the flowerbed behind the church, thinking someone might find them useful.",
    ["打扰了，为什么在灵界观测房休息呢？"] = "Excuse me, why are you resting in the Spirit World observation room?",
    ["打扰了，你们看起来很忙……看来我来得不是时候。"] = "Sorry to bother you, you look very busy... it seems I came at a bad time.",
    ["打扰了，你们经常在这跳舞吧？"] = "Excuse me. You dance here often, don't you?",
    ["打扰了，再见"] = "Excuse me, goodbye",
    ["打扰了，我继续"] = "Excuse me, I'll continue",
    ["打扰了，请问你们知道茶会的主人在哪吗？"] = "Excuse me, do you know where the host of the tea party is?",
    ["打扰二位，本店有个活动，全部通过了可以免去本次用餐的费用。"] = "Excuse me, the two of you. Our shop has an event; if you pass all of it, you can have the cost of this meal waived.",
    ["打扰到您了吗？我的名字叫艾德。我的笔友，我的宝贝，我的甜心，我的小百合，想要与我见面……"] = "Did I disturb you? My name is Ed. My pen pal, my treasure, my sweetheart, my little lily, wants to meet me...",
    ["打扰您了，我去那边看看。"] = "Sorry to bother you, I'll go check over there.",
    ["打扰，我叫丹尼，廷根技术学校机械系大二学生。"] = "Excuse me, my name is Danny, a sophomore in the Mechanical Engineering Department at Tingen Technical School.",
    ["打扰，请问是蒸汽与机械系的同学吗？"] = "Excuse me, are you a student from the Steam and Machinery department?",
