    ["打起来！打起来！……怎么停手了？啊，就这？唔……为了防止被联手揍一顿，海精灵及时捂住了自己的嘴。"] = "Fight! Fight! ...Why did you stop? Ah, that's it? Hmm... To avoid being beaten up by everyone, the Sea Spirit covered its mouth in time.",
    ["打起精神。这里很危险。"] = "Stay alert. It's very dangerous here.",
    ["打起精神来，汤米，好，深呼吸，想想怎么和税务局来的人说话。"] = "Cheer up, Tommy. Good, take a deep breath, and think about how to talk to the people from the Tax Bureau.",
    ["打过蜡的木架结实而富有光泽，瓶身上的标签写着只有厨师本人能看懂的简笔。"] = "The waxed wooden rack is sturdy and shiny, and the labels on the bottles are written in shorthand that only the chef can understand.",
