    ["扔了就扔了，明天想起来就找，找不到就算了，总有办法。"] = "If they're thrown away, they're thrown away. If you remember tomorrow, look for them; if you can't find them, so be it. There's always a way.",
    ["扔出去！狠狠地砸他们的屁股！"] = "Throw it! Hit them right in the backside!",
    ["扔垃圾？哕，我就知道，我就知道休伯特先生每天晚上准时进入盥洗室很奇怪！"] = "Throwing trash? Ugh, I knew it, I knew it was strange that Mr. Hubert enters the washroom on time every night!",
    ["扔进垃圾桶也正常……"] = "It would be normal if it were thrown in the trash...",
