    ["托尼，我是廷根最慷慨的房东，允许你们6人合租一间。"] = "Tony, I am the most generous landlord in Tingen, I allow the six of you to rent one room together.",
    ["托德"] = "Todd",
    ["托您的福，我的孩子康复啦。从死神手上走过，也不赌了，现在琢磨着重振家业呐！"] = "Thanks to you, my child has recovered. Having walked past the God of Death, he doesn't gamble anymore, and now he is thinking about revitalizing the family business!",
