    ["托马斯·"] = "Thomas ",
    ["托马斯……"] = "Thomas...",
    ["托马斯点头离开了"] = "Thomas nods and leaves",
    ["托马斯爱说笑话，埃莉诺就在柜台后面笑，手里的杯子都端不稳……啧啧，那个时候，多好啊。"] = "Thomas loved telling jokes, Eleanor would laugh behind the counter, unable to even hold her cup steady... Tsk tsk, those were good times.",
    ["托马斯爷爷……他、他快撑不住了……但是，但是艾玛也……"] = "Grandpa Thomas... he, he can't hold on much longer... but, but Emma is also...",
    ["托马斯爷爷，你看！这是给露西的小鸟！翅膀还能动！"] = "Grandpa Thomas, look! This is a little bird for Lucy! Its wings can even move!",
    ["托马斯神父值得怀疑，他在整个事件里出现得太巧合，过分热心。"] = "Father Thomas is suspicious; he appeared too coincidentally throughout the whole event and was overly enthusiastic.",
    ["托马斯神父在整个事件里出现得太巧合，过分热心。"] = "Father Thomas's appearance throughout the entire incident was too coincidental and overly enthusiastic.",
    ["托马斯神父忽然出现在拉姆德小镇，而且对受害者们格外关心。"] = "Father Thomas suddenly appeared in Lamud Town and was exceptionally concerned about the victims.",
    ["托马斯神父最初并不是帮忙找人，他是要把我引到古堡，寻找谁破坏了他的计划！"] = "Father Thomas wasn't helping to find people at all; he was trying to lure me to the ancient castle to find out who had ruined his plans!",
    ["托马斯神父最初并不是帮忙找人，他是要把我引到古堡，寻找谁破坏了他的计划！这样就全解释得通了！"] = "Father Thomas wasn't helping to find people at first; he wanted to lure me to the castle to find out who was ruining his plans! That explains everything!",
    ["托马斯神父，您怎么来了这里？"] = "Father Thomas, why are you here?",
    ["托马斯陷入疯狂"] = "Thomas falls into madness",
    ["扛？再扛下去，我怕我这肚子真要炸了。算了，我还是去碰碰运气吧，大不了赊账。"] = "Tough it out? If I keep toughing it out, I'm afraid my stomach is really going to explode. Forget it, I'll go try my luck, at worst I'll ask for credit.",
