    ["抗物理暴击：{*d,F1690001,pCritAnti}\n抗魔法暴击：{*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}\n抵消伤害来源的暴击，在基础暴击率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，降低所受伤害暴击的概率。\n暴击率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的抗暴击超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>暴击</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Physical Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,pCritAnti}\n Magic Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}\n Negates the critical hit of the damage source. Based on the base critical hit rate of <Highlight>25%</>, it reduces the probability of receiving critical damage. \nThe critical hit rate has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>5%</>. If the increased critical resistance exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Critical Hit</> attribute.",
