    ["报纸上写的……很残忍。"] = "What was written in the newspaper... it was very cruel.",
    ["报纸上写的是……"] = "What's written in the newspaper is...",
    ["报纸上的新闻引导你前往铁十字街的一间神秘小屋，这里的一切看似尘封却又暗中低语。当你串联一切线索，推理出不可置信的真相，那座活化的机械屋已经用谜题将一切逼入死角。在紧张的气氛中解除三道随机的剪线谜题，这是一场与时间的赛跑。"] = "The news in the newspaper leads you to a mysterious hut on Iron Cross Street, where everything seems sealed yet whispers in the dark. When you connect all the clues and deduce the unbelievable truth, the animated mechanical house has already forced everything into a corner with its puzzles. Solve three random wire-cutting puzzles in a tense atmosphere; this is a race against time.",
    ["报纸上说快走才能锻炼身体！"] = "The newspaper says walking fast is good for your health!",
    ["报纸上说，普利滋港是王国最大的港口，数不清的人通过这里去南大陆和那些殖民岛屿寻找机会，又带着无数的宝物回到这里。"] = "The newspaper says Pritz Harbor is the largest port in the kingdom. Countless people pass through here to seek opportunities in the Southern Continent and those colonial islands, and return with countless treasures.",
    ["报纸什么时候才能到啊……"] = "When will the newspaper arrive...",
    ["报纸是这样写的：令人惊叹！上上周，金梧桐区的怀特女士向该团伙“敞开”自己的钱包，七天恋爱，共被骗100镑。"] = "The newspaper says: Amazing! The week before last, Ms. White from the Gold Oak District \"opened\" her wallet to the gang. Seven days of dating, and she was defrauded of a total of 100 pounds.",
    ["报纸箱子"] = "Newspaper Box",
    ["报纸罗珊"] = "Newspaper Rozanne",
    ["报纸都说杜比是“常胜将军”。"] = "The newspapers all say Dobby is an 'ever-victorious general'.",
    ["报纸采集"] = "Newspaper Collection",
    ["报纸！杂志！卡通画！"] = "Newspapers! Magazines! Cartoons!",
