    ["报销啊……<P_Heart>（太好了，这套洗一洗补一补，等报销费下来，我还能再买一套……）</>"] = "Reimbursable... <P_Heart>(Great, if I wash and patch this up, I can buy another one once the reimbursement comes through...)</>",
