    ["抬棺人"] = "Coffin Carrier",
    ["抱、抱歉……我，我只是太紧张、太难过了。"] = "S-sorry... I, I'm just too nervous, too sad.",
    ["抱、抱歉。您是？"] = "I-I'm sorry. Who are you?",
