    ["抱头痛哭"] = "Cry Bitterly",
    ["抱歉"] = "Sorry",
    ["抱歉 撞到你了吗？"] = "Sorry, did I bump into you?",
    ["抱歉……"] = "Sorry...",
    ["抱歉……<P_Heart>（他们也像这身体的原主一样死掉了？这太恐怖了……）</>"] = "Sorry... <P_Heart>(Did they die just like the original owner of this body? This is too terrifying...)</>",
    ["抱歉……<P_Heart>（好难过，即使只记得一些残缺的片段……我们是很好的朋友，他们都是很好的人……）</>"] = "Sorry... <P_Heart>(It's so sad, even though I only remember some broken fragments... we were good friends, they were all very good people...)</>",
    ["抱歉……又给你添麻烦了……"] = "Sorry... I've caused you trouble again...",
    ["抱歉……听到那些话让我有些激动了。"] = "Sorry... hearing those words made me a bit emotional.",
    ["抱歉……我……"] = "Sorry... I...",
    ["抱歉……我必须守护小黛西！"] = "I'm sorry... I must protect little Daisy!",
    ["抱歉……我现在没空"] = "Sorry... I'm busy right now",
    ["抱歉……打扰到您了。我只是……只是有点不太适应现在的生活。"] = "Sorry... for bothering you. I just... just can't quite adapt to my current life.",
    ["抱歉……抱歉，我这就给您包起来。"] = "Sorry... sorry, I'll wrap it up for you right away.",
    ["抱歉……说到了您的伤心事。"] = "I'm sorry... I brought up a painful subject for you.",
    ["抱歉……那款并不外售，是一名先生的定制款。"] = "Sorry... that one is not for sale; it is a custom piece for a gentleman.",
    ["抱歉。"] = "I'm sorry.",
    ["抱歉。今天……有些累了。"] = "Sorry. Today... I'm a bit tired.",
    ["抱歉亲爱的，没能买到今天《伯爵归来》的票。"] = "I'm sorry, dear, I couldn't get tickets for \"The Count's Return\" today.",
    ["抱歉先生，我们还在调查中，需要你这边的配合。"] = "Sorry sir, we are still investigating and need your cooperation.",
    ["抱歉各位，我之前家里有点事，现在才赶过来，我们开拍吧……等下，你们这是已经拍完了吗？"] = "Sorry everyone, I had something come up at home, so I just arrived. Let's start filming... wait, have you already finished?",
    ["抱歉女士，我没有，票太难买了。"] = "Sorry, Madam, I don't have any; the tickets are too hard to buy.",
    ["抱歉我不太方便给您取书报……如果您有感兴趣的，可以找我姐姐替您拿一下。谢谢您。"] = "I'm sorry, it's not very convenient for me to get books or newspapers for you... If there's anything you're interested in, you can ask my sister to get it for you. Thank you.",
    ["抱歉我不知道……"] = "Sorry, I didn't know...",
    ["抱歉打扰你"] = "Sorry to bother you",
    ["抱歉打扰你工作了。"] = "Sorry to disturb your work.",
    ["抱歉抱歉！听我解释……"] = "Sorry sorry! Let me explain...",
    ["抱歉抱歉！路上我遇见了一个很可怜的孩子，就施舍了他一枚硬币……"] = "Sorry, sorry! On the way here, I met a very pitiful child and gave him a coin...",
    ["抱歉抱歉，真是抱歉！"] = "Sorry, sorry, I'm really sorry!",
    ["抱歉用借口喊您过来，我怕别人听到。这件事只能告诉阿兹克先生和他信任的人……"] = "Sorry for using an excuse to call you over; I was afraid others would hear. This matter can only be told to Mr. Azik and those he trusts...",
    ["抱歉罗珊，是我们做得不对，搅乱了你的相亲。"] = "Sorry Rozanne, we were in the wrong for disrupting your blind date.",
    ["抱歉非凡者，您暂无可领取的福利"] = "Sorry Beyonder, you have no benefits to claim at the moment.",
    ["抱歉！只是好奇您的看法……"] = "Sorry! Just curious about your opinion...",
    ["抱歉，{{先生|女士}}。我女儿……她看不见。"] = "Sorry, {sir|madam}. My daughter... she can't see.",
    ["抱歉，{{先生|女士}}。我需要尽快完成出航准备，你可以找我的副手……"] = "Sorry, {{Mr.|Ms.}}. I need to finish my departure preparations as soon as possible; you can find my deputy...",
    ["抱歉，{{先生|女士}}。我需要尽快完成出航准备，你可以找我的瑞尼……"] = "Sorry, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. I need to finish my departure preparations as soon as possible. You can find my Rennie...",
    ["抱歉，{{先生|女士}}，我实在是太开心了！"] = "Sorry, {{Mr.| Ms.}}, I am just so happy!",
    ["抱歉，今天没有。"] = "Sorry, not today.",
    ["抱歉，以后我们一定会先询问你的意见。这次可以原谅我们吗？"] = "Sorry, we will definitely ask for your opinion first in the future. Can you forgive us this time?",
    ["抱歉，但我想您不会和流浪汉抢椅子坐的。"] = "Sorry, but I don't think you would fight a homeless person for a chair to sit on.",
    ["抱歉，保护民众是警察的职责。"] = "Sorry, protecting the public is the duty of the police.",
    ["抱歉，先生，我只是有些感兴趣您在看些什么。"] = "Sorry, sir, I was just a bit interested in what you were looking at.",
    ["抱歉，其实我是警察，办案时意外来到这里，请问你了解附近的情况吗？"] = "Sorry, I'm actually a police officer. I accidentally came here while investigating a case. Do you know anything about the situation nearby?",
    ["抱歉，只是路过。"] = "Sorry, just passing by.",
    ["抱歉，只有切断污染，你们才能获得宁静。"] = "Sorry, only by cutting off the corruption can you find peace.",
    ["抱歉，女士，为了维护用餐环境，本店不允许宠物入内。"] = "I'm sorry, Madam, but to maintain the dining environment, pets are not allowed in the shop.",
    ["抱歉，实在没有这种能力，截稿日？您是一位作家？"] = "I'm sorry, I truly don't have that ability. A deadline? Are you a writer?",
    ["抱歉，富人区目前暂不对普通人开放，需要你有一定的身份后才会开放。"] = "Sorry, the wealthy district is currently not open to ordinary people. It will only be accessible once you have attained a certain status.",
    ["抱歉，富人区目前暂不对普通人，需要你有一定的身份后才会开放。"] = "Sorry, the wealthy district is currently closed to ordinary people; it will only open once you have a certain status.",
    ["抱歉，小家伙，我还有事，帮不了你。"] = "Sorry, little one, I have things to do and can't help you.",
    ["抱歉，就是我手上这本，还没有读完。你很着急吗？"] = "Sorry, this is the book I have in my hand, I haven't finished reading it yet. Are you in a hurry?",
    ["抱歉，当前存在未拥有时装，无法上传，请购买或脱下后重试"] = "Sorry, you currently do not own the outfit, so you cannot upload. Please purchase it or unequip it and try again.",
    ["抱歉，当前您不具备登录资格。"] = "Sorry, you do not have login eligibility at this time.",
    ["抱歉，您不能与自己私聊"] = "Sorry, you cannot chat privately with yourself.",
    ["抱歉，您无法与黑名单中的玩家私聊。"] = "Sorry, you cannot private chat with players on your blacklist.",
    ["抱歉，您未达成本次经销协议的目标"] = "Sorry, you did not meet the target for this distribution agreement.",
    ["抱歉，您未达成本经销协议目标"] = "Sorry, you did not meet the distribution agreement target",
    ["抱歉，我……"] = "I'm sorry, I...",
    ["抱歉，我上次临时被叫去蹲守逃犯，这次……"] = "I'm sorry, I was called away at the last minute to stake out a fugitive, and this time...",
    ["抱歉，我不太懂得该怎么向你介绍这些漂亮的小东西，请随意看看吧，希望你能喜欢它们。"] = "Sorry, I don't really know how to introduce these pretty little things to you, please feel free to take a look, I hope you like them.",
    ["抱歉，我不是有意……"] = "Sorry, I didn't mean to...",
    ["抱歉，我专注于处理头发，忘记要适配您的头了……"] = "Sorry, I was focused on styling the hair and forgot to fit it to your head...",
    ["抱歉，我也不卖票。"] = "Sorry, I'm not selling tickets either.",
    ["抱歉，我今天不卖票。您去找对面的莱蒂斯吧。"] = "Sorry, I'm not selling tickets today. Go find Lettis across the street.",
    ["抱歉，我以为这是别人不要的垃圾。"] = "Sorry, I thought this was trash that someone didn't want.",
    ["抱歉，我们其实是伙伴……我跟伊森他们以前一起在工厂里工作。"] = "Sorry, we are actually partners... Ethan and I used to work together in the factory.",
    ["抱歉，我们打扰到你了？"] = "Sorry, are we bothering you?",
    ["抱歉，我们现在有更重要的工作，恕我真的不能参与您的冒险。"] = "Sorry, we have more important work now. Please forgive me, I really cannot participate in your adventure.",
    ["抱歉，我刚刚从舞会上偷溜出来。身上一苏勒都没有，就随便坐了一个空位。"] = "Sorry, I just snuck out of the ball. I don't have a single sou on me, so I just sat in an empty seat.",
    ["抱歉，我刚才想到前几天有个小女孩在向别的摊主讨要火柴，但等我追上去的时候，小女孩已经不见了……"] = "Sorry, I just remembered a little girl asking other stall owners for matches a few days ago, but by the time I chased after her, she was already gone...",
    ["抱歉，我只是突然感觉有点累……"] = "Sorry, I just suddenly feel a bit tired...",
    ["抱歉，我只能帮你们这些，我有自己的职责。"] = "I am sorry, this is all I can do for you. I have my own duties.",
    ["抱歉，我喜欢自言自语。"] = "Sorry, I like talking to myself.",
    ["抱歉，我在追一只猫，请问您有看见吗？"] = "Sorry, I'm chasing a cat. Have you seen it?",
    ["抱歉，我并不能帮助你彻底摆脱头痛，我仍受到隐匿贤者的灌输。"] = "I'm sorry, I cannot help you completely get rid of the headache. I am still receiving the indoctrination of the Hidden Sage.",
    ["抱歉，我很遗憾。"] = "Sorry, I'm very sorry to hear that.",
    ["抱歉，我没注意到有人。"] = "Sorry, I didn't notice anyone there.",
    ["抱歉，我的重感冒还没有完全好——咳，再见，我去下一场宣讲了。"] = "Sorry, my severe cold hasn't fully recovered yet—*cough*, goodbye, I'm off to the next lecture.",
    ["抱歉，我走神了。"] = "Sorry, I was distracted.",
    ["抱歉，我还在想你看到的画面……除了美好的记忆，没看到别的事吗？"] = "Sorry, I'm still thinking about the scenes you saw... besides the beautiful memories, did you see anything else?",
    ["抱歉，我随便看看，不买票。"] = "Sorry, I'm just looking, not buying a ticket.",
    ["抱歉，手抖得厉害……掉到哪里去了？不好，外壳摔碎了……"] = "Sorry, my hands are shaking so much... Where did it fall? Oh no, the shell is broken...",
    ["抱歉，打扰下。"] = "Sorry, excuse me.",
    ["抱歉，撞到你了吗？"] = "Sorry, did I bump into you?",
    ["抱歉，文字审核未通过，请重新输入"] = "Sorry, text review failed; please re-enter.",
    ["抱歉，是我打扰你了吗？你吹的曲子实在太好听了！"] = "Sorry, did I disturb you? The tune you played was just too beautiful!",
    ["抱歉，朋友，原谅我们刚才没把你当回事。"] = "Sorry, friend, forgive us for not taking you seriously just now.",
    ["抱歉，正在审核中的作品已达上限，请等待审核完毕后再上传"] = "Sorry, the limit for works under review has been reached; please wait for the review to finish before uploading.",
    ["抱歉，汤姆，时间不早了，我还有点事，得回去了。"] = "Sorry, Tom, it's getting late, I have something else to do, I have to go back.",
    ["抱歉，没想到惊扰了您。"] = "Sorry, I didn't mean to disturb you.",
    ["抱歉，没有印象。"] = "Sorry, I don't have any impression of him.",
    ["抱歉，现在还不能帮助你"] = "Sorry, I cannot help you right now",
    ["抱歉，目前并不需要！"] = "Sorry, I don't need one at the moment!",
    ["抱歉，看得入迷了。"] = "Sorry, I was engrossed in reading.",
    ["抱歉，确实得麻烦您跑一趟，柯达先生需要留下您的授权许可。"] = "Sorry, I really have to trouble you to make a trip; Mr. Kodak needs to keep your authorization permit.",
    ["抱歉，罗珊女士，看来我今天的运气不够好。"] = "Sorry, Ms. Rozanne, it seems my luck isn't good enough today.",
    ["抱歉，能够安静地回忆过去，或许也是一种……奢侈的幸福。"] = "Sorry, being able to quietly recall the past is perhaps also a... luxurious happiness.",
    ["抱歉，让您回忆起了不好的事情。"] = "Sorry, I made you recall bad things.",
    ["抱歉，请继续。"] = "Sorry, please continue.",
    ["抱歉，身为队长，我应该像调查非凡事件那样严谨些，先弄清楚真相。"] = "Sorry, as the Captain, I should have been as rigorous as investigating a Beyonder incident and clarified the truth first.",
    ["抱歉，这份头版上也没看到你的稿件。"] = "Sorry, I didn't see your submission on this front page either.",
    ["抱歉，这是你们的家事……"] = "Sorry, this is your family matter...",
    ["抱歉，这里仅供教会人员出入。"] = "Sorry, this area is only for church personnel.",
    ["抱歉，那应该是我的信。"] = "Sorry, that should be my letter.",
    ["抱胸"] = "Cross Arms",
    ["抱胸坐姿"] = "Sit with Crossed Arms",
    ["抱胸莉娜"] = "Lina with arms crossed",
    ["抵制诱惑，帮助魔女！"] = "Resist the temptation and help the Witch!",
    ["抵在头顶的指尖，将爱意轻灵地诉说。"] = "Fingertips pressed against the top of the head, telling of love lightly.",
    ["抵御住最后的冲击"] = "Withstand the final impact",
    ["抵御光环"] = "Resistance Aura",
    ["抵御最后的浪潮"] = "Resist the final wave.",
    ["抵御浪潮"] = "Resist the tide",
    ["抵扣"] = "Deduction",
    ["抵抗·首领"] = "Resistance · Boss",
    ["抵挡"] = "Block",
    ["抵挡<h>巨龙</>"] = "Block the <h>Giant Dragon</>",
    ["抵消伤害来源的暴击，在基础暴击率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，降低所受伤害暴击的概率。\n暴击率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的抗暴击超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>暴击</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Offsets the damage source's Critical Hit. Based on the base Critical Hit rate of <Highlight> 25% </>, it reduces the probability of received damage landing a critical hit. \n The Critical Hit rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 5% </>; if the increased Anti-Critical Hit exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Critical Hit </> attribute.",
    ["抵消伤害来源的物理暴击，在基础暴击率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，降低所受伤害暴击的概率。\n暴击率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的抗暴击超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>物理暴击</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Offsets the damage source's Physical Critical Hit. Based on the base Critical Hit rate of <Highlight> 25% </>, it reduces the probability of received damage landing a critical hit. \n The Critical Hit rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 5% </>; if the increased Anti-Critical Hit exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Physical Critical Hit </> attribute.",
    ["抵消伤害来源的物理穿刺，在基础格挡率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，提高格挡所受伤害的几率。格挡时，受到30%伤害且不会触发暴击。\n格挡率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>0%</>的下限，提升的格挡超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>物理穿刺</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Offsets the damage source's Physical Pierce. Based on the base Block rate of <Highlight> 25% </>, it increases the probability of blocking received damage. When blocking, you take 30% damage and will not trigger a critical hit. \n The Block rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 0% </>; if the increased Block exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Physical Pierce </> attribute.",
    ["抵消伤害来源的穿刺，在基础格挡率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，提高格挡所受伤害的几率。格挡时，受到30%伤害且不会触发暴击。\n格挡率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>0%</>的下限，提升的格挡超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>穿刺</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Offsets the damage source's Pierce. Based on the base Block rate of <Highlight> 25% </>, it increases the probability of blocking received damage. When blocking, you take 30% damage and will not trigger a critical hit. \n The Block rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 0% </>; if the increased Block exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Pierce </> attribute.",
    ["抵消伤害来源的魔法暴击，在基础暴击率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，降低所受伤害暴击的概率。\n暴击率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的抗暴击超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>魔法暴击</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Negates the magic critical hit of the damage source. Based on the base critical hit rate of <Highlight>25%</>, it reduces the probability of receiving critical damage. \nThe critical hit rate has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>5%</>. If the increased critical resistance exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Magic Critical Hit</> attribute.",
    ["抵消伤害来源的魔法穿刺，在基础格挡率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，提高格挡所受伤害的几率。格挡时，受到30%伤害且不会触发暴击。\n格挡率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>0%</>的下限，提升的格挡超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>魔法穿刺</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Offsets the damage source's Magic Pierce. Based on the base Block rate of <Highlight> 25% </>, it increases the probability of blocking received damage. When blocking, you take 30% damage and will not trigger a critical hit. \n The Block rate has an upper limit of <Highlight> 75% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 0% </>; if the increased Block exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage reduction capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Magic Pierce </> attribute.",
    ["抵消攻击来源的物理或魔法攻击，每3点护甲抵消攻击来源2点攻击。护甲超过攻击来源破甲的四倍时，超出部分每1点抵消1点攻击。\n\n角色护甲：{*d,F1690001,AirShield}"] = "Negates the physical or magic attack of the attack source, with every 3 points of Armor negating 2 points of the attack source's Attack. When Armor exceeds four times the attack source's Armor Break, every 1 point of excess negates 1 point of Attack. \n \n Character Armor: {*d,F1690001,AirShield}",
