    ["拉姆德古堡"] = "Lamud Castle",
    ["拉姆德古堡-风暴竞逐-载具"] = "Lamud Castle - Storm Chase - Vehicle",
    ["拉姆德古堡坐落于杂草丛生的山丘上，周围灌木密布。"] = "Lamud Castle sits on a grassy hill, surrounded by dense shrubs.",
    ["拉姆德古堡探险开放"] = "Lamud Castle exploration opened",
    ["拉姆德古堡是个不错的选择。"] = "Lamud Castle is a good choice.",
    ["拉姆德古堡的入口，附近的一草一木都仿佛在讲述消逝的历史。"] = "The entrance to Lamud Castle; every blade of grass and tree nearby seems to be telling the history of what has passed.",
    ["拉姆德古堡的观景拍照留念：\n廷根市西北方向，半日马车可达的荒丘上，拉姆德古堡静静伫立。\n新生的藤蔓攀上古老的石砖，老旧的城堡早已无人到访。\n岁月几番沉浮，持着阔剑站立的骑士却始终忠诚。"] = "Lamud Castle Sightseeing Photo: \nOn a barren hill half a day's carriage ride northwest of Tingen, Lamud Castle stands quietly. \nNew vines climb up the ancient bricks, and the old castle has long been unvisited. \nThrough the ups and downs of time, the knight standing with a broadsword remains loyal.",
    ["拉姆德古堡秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Lamud Castle Order World completion reached 100%.",
    ["拉姆德古堡秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Lamud Castle Order World completion reaches 100%%",
    ["拉姆德古堡秩序世界完成度达到20%%"] = "Lamud Castle Order World completion reaches 20%%",
    ["拉姆德古堡秩序世界完成度达到50%%"] = "Lamud Castle Order World completion reaches 50%%",
    ["拉姆德古堡秩序世界完成度达到80%%"] = "Lamud Castle Order World completion reaches 80%%",
    ["拉姆德小镇"] = "Lamud Town",
    ["拉姆德小镇大世界氛围"] = "Lamud Town open world atmosphere",
    ["拉姆德小镇最好的纪念品！{{先生|女士}}，这里是给您的家人和朋友挑礼物的不二之选！"] = "The best souvenirs in Lamud Town! {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, this is the best choice for picking gifts for your family and friends!",
    ["拉姆德小镇有对老夫妻，每天都要和东区的孙女通信……"] = "There's an old couple in Lamd Town who write to their granddaughter in the East District every day...",
    ["拉姆德小镇的一切都很美妙——除了跟古董贩子做生意。"] = "Everything in Lamud Castle is wonderful—except for doing business with antique dealers.",
    ["拉姆德小镇的牧师上报了此事。"] = "The priest of Lamud reported this matter.",
    ["拉姆德小镇的车站上有人叫卖，会捡到好东西吗？"] = "Someone is peddling at the Lamud Town station; will you find anything good?",
    ["拉姆德小镇的邪异庆典上，有人扭曲了黑夜女神的教义。"] = "At the evil celebration in Lamud Town, someone twisted the teachings of the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["拉姆德男爵画像"] = "Baron Lamud Portrait",
    ["拉姆齐擅长用破碎的笔触营造雾气的流动感。 但是您看……这幅画下笔规整。像是在模仿记忆中的印象，而非捕捉瞬间的朦胧。"] = "Ramsey excels at using broken brushstrokes to create a sense of flowing mist. But look... the brushwork here is orderly. It's like imitating an impression from memory rather than capturing a fleeting moment of haze.",
    ["拉姆齐擅长用破碎的笔触营造雾气的流动感。 但是您看……这幅画下笔规整，像是在模仿记忆中的印象，而非捕捉瞬间的朦胧。 "] = "Ramsay is skilled at using fragmented brushstrokes to create a sense of flowing mist. But look... this painting's brushwork is regular, as if imitating an impression from memory rather than capturing a momentary haziness.",
