    ["拉文德"] = "Lavender",
    ["拉斐尔·"] = "Raphael ",
    ["拉斐尔作为子爵夫人的弟弟，死于数年前威瑟尔庄园覆灭的夜晚。作为母亲的弱小仆从，诞生于数年前威瑟尔庄园覆灭的夜晚。\n他是姐姐复活的副产物，心智不全，容貌丑陋，力量强悍，时刻面临失控风险。他不记得生前的事，唯一的本能是保护那个模糊的影子，保护那个需要他的人。他被留在化为“茧”的小子爵身边，沉默守护。哪怕他忘了他要保护的人是谁。\n——姐姐。"] = "Raphael, as the younger brother of the Viscountess, died on the night the Wetherell Manor was destroyed years ago. As a weak servant of the mother, he was born on the night the Wetherell Manor was destroyed years ago. \n He is a byproduct of his sister's resurrection; his mind is incomplete, his appearance is ugly, his power is formidable, and he constantly faces the risk of a loss of control. He does not remember his life before death, and his only instinct is to protect that blurred shadow, to protect the person who needs him. He was left beside the young Viscount who had turned into a 'cocoon,' keeping a silent vigil. Even if he has forgotten who it is he is meant to protect. \n ——Sister.",
    ["拉斐尔作为子爵夫人的弟弟，死于数年前家族覆灭的夜晚。\n他生前是个强壮的孩子，以拳头和力气为傲，是姐姐忠诚的跟班和守护者。\n他在伟大母亲的注视下复生后，变得更加强悍勇猛，代价是失去了人的智力，记不清任何生前的事——除了一件事：他要守护一个人。\n是谁呢……在哪里……要保护的人……不能忘记……\n“好好留在这儿，完成对子嗣的守护吧。”不知过去了多少年，有个声音同他说。\n拉斐尔靠在巨大的茧下，感受到一种特殊的悸动，仿佛是来自血脉的呼唤，让他从浑噩中苏醒。他本能地张嘴，去呼唤一个深埋在记忆中的词语：姐姐……姐姐……\n我终于找到你了……姐姐……\n绯色指环的亮光一闪而过。\n他从未遗忘过幼年的承诺。\n就算变成了可怖的样子，他也必会用尽全力，守护珍视的一切。"] = "Raphael, as the younger brother of the Viscountess, died on the night of the family's destruction years ago. \n He was a strong child in his lifetime, proud of his fists and strength, and was his sister's loyal follower and Guardian. \n After he was reborn under the gaze of the Great Mother, he became even more powerful and fierce, at the cost of losing human intelligence and forgetting everything from his past life—except for one thing: he had to guard someone. \n Who was it... where... the person to protect... must not forget... \n \"Stay here well and complete the guardianship of the offspring.\" After many years had passed, a voice said to him. \n Raphael leaned against the giant cocoon, feeling a special throb, as if it were a call from his bloodline, waking him from his stupor. He instinctively opened his mouth to call out a word buried deep in his memory: Sister... Sister... \n I finally found you... Sister... \n The light of the crimson ring flashed by. \n He had never forgotten the promise of his childhood. \n Even if he had become a terrifying sight, he would surely use all his strength to guard everything he cherished.",
    ["拉斐尔墓园"] = "Raphael Cemetery",
    ["拉斐尔墓园卖墓地"] = "Selling cemetery plots at Raphael Cemetery",
    ["拉斐尔墓园找墓碑"] = "Finding a tombstone at Raphael Cemetery",
    ["拉斐尔墓园探望母亲"] = "Visiting mother at Raphael Cemetery",
    ["拉斐尔墓园是我们的专属园区，这里埋葬着的都是信仰女神的信徒。"] = "Raphael Cemetery is our exclusive park, and those buried here are all believers who worship the Goddess.",
    ["拉斐尔墓园氛围高文"] = "Raphael Cemetery atmosphere Gawain",
    ["拉斐尔墓园管理员"] = "Administrator of Raphael Cemetery",
    ["拉斐尔墓园隶属于黑夜教会，所以你想要埋在这边先得是女神的信徒，其中的一半费用会捐献给教会。你是要穷人区，富人区，还是普通区。"] = "Raphael Cemetery belongs to the Church of the Evernight, so if you want to be buried here, you must first be a believer of the Goddess. Half of the cost will be donated to the Church. Do you want the poor district, the rich district, or the ordinary district?",
