    ["拜亚姆听上去是个能发财的地方，但来坐船的人却很少。"] = "Bayam sounds like a place where one can get rich, but very few people come to take the ship.",
    ["拜亚姆的"] = "of Bayam",
    ["拜伦"] = "Byron",
    ["拜托了——你能找到我的身体，然后想办法把它救出来吗？"] = "Please—can you find my body and find a way to rescue it?",
    ["拜托你、别生气，我可以去学些新曲子，你喜欢听什么呢？"] = "Please, don't be angry. I can learn some new songs. What would you like to hear?",
    ["拜托你了，带我们找到阿诺德吧，夜莺银哨。"] = "Please, take us to find Arnold, Silver Nightingale Whistle.",
    ["拜托稍微拿远一点……不是我的，我猜，这是前任租客的遗留物。"] = "Please take it a bit further away... it's not mine. I guess it's something left behind by the previous tenant.",
    ["拜托，你不能把卡尔的行李扔到大街上，弗兰奇先生。"] = "Please, you can't throw Karl's luggage onto the street, Mr. Franky.",
    ["拜托，我可不想弄脏指甲！"] = "Please, I don't want to dirty my claws!",
    ["拜托，我的朋友，没文化就只能去当海盗，你还想不想考上贝克兰德大学？"] = "Come on, my friend, if you're uneducated, you can only be a pirate. Don't you want to get into Backlund University?",
    ["拜托，还没结束吗？"] = "Please, isn't it over yet?",
