    ["拥有"] = "Owned",
    ["拥有%s"] = "Possess %s",
    ["拥有/存储上限"] = "Owned/Storage Limit",
    ["拥有100点<HighLight>神秘知识</>时可以使用。使自身buffdisc(*id)，持续*d秒，在锁定目标的位置召唤信息洪流，信息洪流会以一定速度追击敌方目标，每秒最多对范围内的4名敌方目标造成*d点魔法伤害，每次攻击消耗20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>，<HighLight>神秘知识</>不足时会自动停止。\n信息洪流开启5秒后，每次攻击消耗的<HighLight>神秘知识</>递增10点，消耗<HighLight>30</>/<HighLight>40</>/<HighLight>50</>/<HighLight>60</>/<HighLight>70</>点<HighLight>神秘知识</>时，造成的伤害提升至spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)点；\n信息洪流自动停止前的攻击次数为\n<HighLight>7</>/<HighLight>8</>/<HighLight>9</>次时，将在结束时对范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害并有<HighLight>91%</>的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>范围内最多两名敌方。"] = "Usable when possessing 100 points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</>. Trigger buffdisc(*id) for *d seconds and summon a Torrent of Information at the locked target's location. The Torrent of Information will pursue enemy targets at a certain speed, dealing up to *d Magic Damage per second to 4 enemy targets within range. Each attack consumes 20 points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</>; it will automatically stop when <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</> is insufficient. \n5 seconds after the Torrent of Information starts, the <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</> consumed per attack increases by 10 points. When consuming <HighLight>30</>/<HighLight>40</>/<HighLight>50</>/<HighLight>60</>/<HighLight>70</> points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</>, the damage dealt increases to spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id) points. \nWhen the number of attacks before the Torrent of Information automatically stops is \n<HighLight>7</>/<HighLight>8</>/<HighLight>9</>, it will deal spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id) Magic Damage to enemies within range upon ending and has a <HighLight>91%</> base chance to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">Launch</> up to two enemies within range.",
    ["拥有10个橙色秘偶"] = "Own 10 Orange marionettes",
