    ["拥有5个橙色秘偶"] = "Own 5 Orange marionettes",
    ["拥有5点星空能量时，获得5层旅者铭刻。"] = "Gain 5 stacks of Traveler's Inscription when possessing 5 Star Energy.",
    ["拥有5点星空能量时，获得5层漫游者铭刻"] = "When possessing 5 points of Star Energy, gain 5 stacks of Wanderer Inscription.",
    ["拥有6个不同途径的好友"] = "Have 6 friends of different Pathways",
    ["拥有: "] = "Owned: ",
    ["拥有<HighLight>星空能量</>不小于3点时可以施放。消耗所有<HighLight>星空能量</>，刺击区域内敌方，造成2次*d点魔法伤害，随后召唤数个残影打击敌人，造成4次*d点魔法伤害，最终引爆星空能量造成*d点魔法伤害。消耗超过3点星空能量时，每多消耗1点星空能量，本技能造成的伤害提高*f**。"] = "Can be cast when you have at least 3 points of <HighLight>Starlight Energy</>. Consume all <HighLight>Starlight Energy</> to stab enemies in the area, dealing 2 instances of *d magic damage, followed by summoning several phantom shadows to strike enemies, dealing 4 instances of *d magic damage, and finally detonating the Starlight Energy to deal *d magic damage. When consuming more than 3 points of Starlight Energy, each additional point consumed increases the damage of this skill by *f**.",
    ["拥有“守秘”能力屏蔽感应，具备空间隐藏、通过虚幻之门放逐目标、闪现等与门和空间相关的非凡能力，操控空间法则。"] = "Possess the 'Secret Keeper' ability to block sensing, as well as Beyonder abilities related to doors and space such as spatial concealment, banishing targets through illusory doors, and flashing, allowing you to manipulate spatial laws.",
    ["拥有【君临·圣辉】后获得"] = "Obtained after owning [Monarch: Holy Radiance]",
    ["拥有【君临·深渊】后可兑换"] = "Exchangeable after owning [Monarch: Abyss]",
    ["拥有【君临·火焰】后可兑换"] = "Exchangeable after owning [Monarch: Flame]",
    ["拥有借助头脑和知识解析、研究、学习乃至创建法术的能力，可使用各种法术如照明术、驱邪术、闪电术等，知识越全面越厉害。"] = "Possess the ability to analyze, study, learn, and even create spells using your brain and knowledge. Capable of using various spells such as illumination, exorcism, and lightning. The more comprehensive your knowledge, the more powerful you are.",
    ["拥有光之律动期间，技能造成伤害时，附加额外伤害，最多生效10次。"] = "While under the effect of Rhythm of Light, skills deal additional damage, stacking up to 10 times.",
    ["拥有出众的精神和敏锐的观察力，像旁观者一样，审视世俗社会里的“演员”。"] = "Possesses outstanding spirit and keen observation, like a spectator, scrutinizing the 'actors' in secular society.",
    ["拥有出众的精神和敏锐观察力，像旁观者审视世俗社会的“演员”，从表情举止窥见真实想法，巧妙影响、暗中引导，让事情往希望的方向发展。"] = "Possesses outstanding spirit and keen observation, like an \"actor\" observing secular society from the sidelines, peeking at true thoughts from expressions and behavior, cleverly influencing and secretly guiding things to develop in the direction of hope.",
    ["拥有君临·深渊"] = "Own Monarch·Abyss",
    ["拥有君临·火焰"] = "Own Monarch·Flame",
    ["拥有和收藏"] = "Owned and Collected",
    ["拥有巨人般的力量，可召唤明净圣洁的晨曦布满周围，破除幻觉、驱散怨魂，凝聚晨曦之剑与黎明铠甲，施展光之风暴摧毁邪恶。"] = "Possess giant-like strength, capable of summoning clear and holy dawn to fill the surroundings, breaking illusions, exorcising evil spirits, condensing the Sword of Dawn and Dawn Armor, and unleashing a Hurricane of Light to destroy evil.",
    ["拥有异端的目标，受到歌颂者的伤害增加"] = "Targets with Heresy take increased damage from Bards.",
    ["拥有星空能量不小于3点时可以施放，消耗所有星空能量，首先对敌人发动斩击，随后召唤数个残影打击敌人，最终引爆星空能量造成大量伤害，消耗的星空能量越多，伤害越高。"] = "Can be cast when starlight energy is at least 3 points. Consumes all starlight energy to first launch a slash at enemies, then summon several phantom shadows to strike them, finally detonating the starlight energy to deal massive damage. The more starlight energy consumed, the higher the damage.",
    ["拥有灵体之线视野，能通过操纵目标的灵体之线来直接影响、控制目标，制造秘偶。是令人胆颤的傀儡师，于幕后操控一切。"] = "Possess the vision of spirit body threads, capable of directly influencing and controlling targets by manipulating their spirit body threads to create a marionette. A terrifying Puppeteer who controls everything from behind the scenes.",
    ["拥有炽热光辉的晶石，使用这种晶石能够焕发装备曾拥有过的最高潜力。"] = "A crystal with a scorching radiance; using this crystal can revitalize the highest potential the equipment once possessed.",
    ["拥有的材料数量不足"] = "Insufficient quantity of materials owned.",
    ["拥有质变心理暗示能力，接近权柄程度，相信自己强大便是强大。能洞悉心灵漏洞、命运因果，制造“梦境迷宫”。"] = "Possesses qualitative psychological suggestion ability, approaching the level of authority, believing that one is powerful means one is powerful. Can see through mental loopholes and fate causality, creating \"Dream Labyrinths\".",
    ["拥有贸易站点"] = "Own Trade Site",
    ["拥有超强力量、夸张龙鳞防御和极快速度。可让心智体进入他人心灵岛屿，直接篡改潜意识，无声无息驱使目标。"] = "Possesses super strength, exaggerated dragon scale defense, and extremely fast speed. Can let the mental body enter others' islands of the mind, directly tampering with the subconscious, and driving targets silently.",
    ["拥有超强的力量、体质和敏捷，只要是武器就能以大师级水准使用，包括非凡武器和神奇物品，并有效降低负面影响带来的伤害。"] = "Possess super strength, physique, and agility. Any weapon can be used at a master level, including Beyonder weapons and mystical items, effectively reducing the damage caused by negative effects.",
    ["拥有超能力？"] = "Possess superpowers?",
    ["拥有较强灵性直觉和危险预感，能借此询问灵性进行占卜，同时具备干扰占卜的能力，洞察命运轨迹，预知吉凶祸福。"] = "Possess strong spiritual intuition and premonitions of danger, which can be used to inquire of your spirituality for divination. Simultaneously possess the ability to interfere with divination, gain insight into the trajectory of fate, and foresee good or bad fortune.",
    ["拥有：%d"] = "Owned: %d",
