    ["拧个瓶盖半天拧不开，最后溅了一手，心情都跟着黏糊糊的。"] = "Tried to unscrew a bottle cap for ages, ended up splashing it all over my hand, my mood feels sticky too.",
    ["拧动发条"] = "Wind Clockwork",
    ["拧转之时，记录的律令再度显现。"] = "When twisted, the decree of the Record appears once more.",
    ["拧转它，机械星图开始破译沉默的宇宙。"] = "Twist it, and the mechanical star map begins to decipher the silent universe.",
    ["拧转时听见心跳骤然加速，像唤醒最疯狂的自我。"] = "Twisting it makes your heartbeat accelerate suddenly, as if awakening the craziest self.",
