    ["拨开迷雾"] = "Dispel the Fog",
    ["拨弄时光的指针，遨游命运的影子，欺诈与恶作剧的化身——这些和鸦有什么关系呢？\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定苏勒×10000。"] = "Fiddling with the hands of time, wandering in the shadows of fate, the avatar of deception and pranks—what does this have to do with a crow? \nRepeated acquisition will automatically decompose into Bound Sol ×10000.",
