    ["拾取此牌会将其立刻消耗掉，并让你变成一只人畜无害的生物/立刻进入假死状态，持续30秒，所有敌人无法将你加入仇恨列表，但你的任何主动攻击会解除此状态"] = "Picking up this card will immediately consume it, turning you into a harmless creature/immediately entering a state of feigned death for 30 seconds. All enemies will be unable to add you to their aggro list, but any active attack by you will end this state.",
