    ["拿上了，先生。这个数字真令人吃惊，之前一直都没发现吗？"] = "I have them, sir. This number is truly shocking. Was it never discovered before?",
    ["拿了就走"] = "Take it and leave",
    ["拿了点心，还要缠着我问天问地，想着在贝克兰德找份体面的工作。"] = "After taking the snacks, he still pestered me with endless questions, thinking about finding a decent job in Backlund.",
    ["拿出%s绑定苏勒"] = "Take out %s and bind it to Soule.",
    ["拿出2000便士"] = "Take out 2000 pennies",
