    ["拿出<h>铜镜</>，诵念咒语"] = "Take out the <h>bronze mirror</> and chant the incantation",
    ["拿出伟大主人赠与你的“祝福茧晶”，向伟大主人祈祷，祈求进入历史迷雾的许可。"] = "Take out the Blessing Cocoon Crystal given to you by the great master, pray to the great master, and beg for permission to enter the fog of history.",
