    ["拿钱奥利安娜"] = "Orianna Taking Money",
    ["持2049"] = "Holding 2049",
    ["持剑向前高速突进斩击，攻击途经单位并获得黄昏印记（用于强化怒意猛击和终结技能）。攻击形态下附加衰败（持续造成伤害），防御形态下提升自身格挡。"] = "Dash forward with the sword at high speed to slash, attacking units along the path and gaining a Dusk Mark (used to strengthen Angry Slam and finisher skills). Applies decay (continuous damage) in Offensive Stance, and increases your block in Defense Form.",
    ["持印的徽记"] = "Insignia of the Seal-Bearer",
    ["持有%s"] = "Holding %s",
    ["持有:"] = "Held:",
    ["持有<Highlight>四叶手镯</>的玩家，在子爵夫人蓄力即将结束时，开启<Highlight>幸运之盾</>，阻挡子爵夫人的死亡裁决"] = "Players holding the <Highlight>Four-Leaf Bracelet</> should activate the <Highlight>Shield of Luck</> when the Viscountess's charging is about to end to block the Viscountess's Death Verdict.",
    ["持有<Highlight>绿叶宝石</>的玩家，通过临时技能，将宝石中的能量传递给持有四叶手镯的玩家，能量传递达到3层时，持有<Highlight>四叶手镯</>的玩家，在子爵夫人蓄力即将结束时，开启<Highlight>幸运之盾</>，阻挡子爵夫人的死亡裁决"] = "Players holding the <Highlight>Green Leaf Gem</> should use the temporary skill to transfer the energy in the gem to the player holding the Four-Leaf Bracelet. When the energy transfer reaches 3 layers, the player holding the <Highlight>Four-Leaf Bracelet</> should activate the <Highlight>Shield of Luck</> when the Viscountess's charging is about to end to block the Viscountess's Death Verdict.",
    ["持有太阳圣徽的非凡者离开了副本，太阳圣徽已掉落"] = "The Beyonder holding the Sun Holy Emblem has left the dungeon; the Sun Holy Emblem has been dropped",
    ["持有忠诚标记的玩家，<Highlight>集合在一起</>。并远离其他玩家，等待子爵夫人的斩杀。持有<Highlight>2层小子爵思念</>的玩家，将在自身周围开启一圈光明区域，其他玩家，跟随拥有2层小子爵思念增益的玩家一起，<Highlight>寻找小子爵执念体</>，解除黑暗。"] = "Players holding the Loyalty Mark should <Highlight>gather together</> and stay away from other players, waiting for the Viscountess's execution. Players holding <Highlight>2 layers of Little Viscount's Longing</> will create a circle of light around themselves. Other players should follow the player with the 2-layer Little Viscount's Longing buff to <Highlight>find the Little Viscount's obsession</> and dispel the darkness.",
    ["持有指定Buff的对象忽略该无敌效果"] = "Objects holding the specified buff ignore this invincibility effect.",
    ["持有数量"] = "Quantity Held",
    ["持有清水"] = "Holding Clear Water",
    ["持有物产"] = "Owned Products",
    ["持有秘偶精粹："] = "Possess Marionette Essence:",
    ["持有至少10个初级持续回复食品才可继续使用"] = "Must hold at least 10 basic continuous recovery food items to continue using.",
    ["持有草药"] = "Holding Herbs",
    ["持有这把武器，会让你拥有风和电的力量。移动速度与普攻攻速提高，普攻命中时有概率对目标劈下闪电，造成伤害和滞涩效果。但若不慎，闪电也会劈到自己。"] = "Holding this weapon will give you the power of wind and electricity. Movement speed and Basic Attack Attack Speed are increased; when a Basic Attack hits, there is a probability of striking the target with lightning, causing damage and Stagnation. But if you are not careful, the lightning will also strike yourself.",
    ["持有面包"] = "Holding Bread",
    ["持有："] = "Holding:",
    ["持有：%d"] = "Holding: %d",
    ["持本店保修卡可享受免费保养，不涵盖因不明原因导致的武器整体变为铁皮的情况。"] = "With this shop's warranty card, you can enjoy free maintenance, not covering cases where the weapon turns into tin plate for unknown reasons.",
    ["持枪姿态"] = "Gun Stance",
    ["持枪姿态-迷雾关卡专用"] = "Gun Stance - Mist Level Exclusive",
    ["持枪状态"] = "Gun-Holding State",
    ["持枪状态-迷雾关卡专用"] = "Gun-Holding State - Mist Level Exclusive",
    ["持火"] = "Hold Fire",
    ["持盾"] = "Hold Shield",
    ["持续"] = "Continuous",
    ["持续*d,主动释放技能、使用物品移除"] = "Continuous *d, removed upon active skill cast or item use",
    ["持续*d,主动释放技能移除"] = "Continuous *d, removed upon active skill cast",
    ["持续<Highlight>霸体</>,移动速度降低*f**"] = "Continuous <Highlight> Super Armor </>, movement speed reduced by *f**",
    ["持续<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，蓄力并持续对周身敌方造成物理伤害，共计<Highlight>4</>次，每次*d点，蓄力结束后对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害。首次攻击引爆并移除目标身上被附加的<HighLight>衰败</>，剩余时长每多1秒伤害增加*d点。\n施法时消耗所有<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，使本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>\n每消耗1点<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，本技能的伤害提高<HighLight>10%</>。"] = "Continuously gain Super Armor <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"></>, charging up and continuously dealing physical damage to surrounding enemies for a total of 4 <Highlight></> hits, each dealing *d damage. After charging ends, deal *d physical damage to surrounding enemies. The first attack detonates and removes the Decay <HighLight></> applied to the target, increasing damage by *d for every 1 second of remaining duration. \n Consumes all Twilight Marks <HighLight></> upon casting to grant this skill Strengthening <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Strengthening </>\n: For every Twilight Mark <HighLight></> consumed, this skill's damage is increased by 10% <HighLight></>.",
    ["持续上升风场"] = "Continuous Upward Wind Field",
    ["持续为周身范围内友方提供心理治疗，为其回复生命值。"] = "Continuously provide Psychotherapy to surrounding allies, restoring their health.",
    ["持续伤害"] = "Continuous Damage",
    ["持续伤害,6秒后形成腐蚀液体"] = "Continuous damage, forms corrosive liquid after 6 seconds",
    ["持续伤害提升90%。"] = "Continuous damage increased by 90%.",
    ["持续伤害额外提升80%。"] = "Continuous Damage increased by an additional 80%.",
    ["持续修改挂接武器"] = "Continuously modify attached weapons.",
    ["持续免疫特定控制/受击"] = "Continuously immune to specific control/hit effects.",
    ["持续受到伤害"] = "Taking continuous damage",
    ["持续受到灼烧伤害"] = "Taking continuous burn damage",
    ["持续受到魔法伤害"] = "Continuously take magic damage.",
    ["持续回血"] = "Continuous Healing",
    ["持续圆形AOE"] = "Continuous Circular AOE",
    ["持续多久了？"] = "How long has it been going on?",
    ["持续对敌人发射多发空气弹。"] = "Continuously fire multiple Air Bullets at the enemy.",
    ["持续对自己和队友的潜意识进行积极的暗示，获得减伤、霸体并持续治疗周身友方。"] = "Continuously provide positive suggestions to the subconscious of oneself and teammates, gaining Damage Reduction, Super Armor, and continuous healing for surrounding allies.",
    ["持续性action，放在buff里面，action触发后，buff持有者和buff始作俑者为链接的两个对象，buff持有者会在不致死的公式结算后调整两者的hp，让两者的hp/hp_max 比例相等。任意一方死亡不处理。"] = "A continuous action placed within a buff. After the action triggers, the buff holder and the buff originator become two linked objects. The buff holder will adjust the HP of both after non-lethal formula calculation so that their HP/HP_max ratios are equal. If either party dies, it is not processed.",
    ["持续性地使用银白细剑袭杀敌人"] = "Continuously use the Silver Rapier to assault enemies",
    ["持续恢复血量"] = "Continuous HP Recovery",
    ["持续打击周身敌方，每<Highlight>0.4</>秒对周身范围内敌方造成*d点物理伤害，持续<Highlight>5</>秒，并将敌方怪物<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">拖拽</>向自身，使敌方玩家buffdisc(*id)。施法时每秒获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。\n日暮飓风技能持续期间获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>（受到最大生命值50%以上伤害时移除），技能施法期间可以移动，施法1.5秒后可以再次点击以打断施法，并返还部分技能冷却时间。\n若自身处于<HighLight>防御形态</>，打击将对敌方怪物附加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">嘲讽</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。"] = "Continuously strike surrounding enemies, dealing *d physical damage to enemies in range every <Highlight>0.4</> seconds for <Highlight>5</> seconds, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">dragging</> enemy monsters toward you and applying buffdisc(*id) to enemy players. Gain 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</> per second while casting. \nGain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> for the duration of Sunset Hurricane (removed when taking damage exceeding 50% of your maximum health); you can move while casting, and can click again after 1.5 seconds of casting to interrupt the skill and refund a portion of the cooldown. \nIf you are in <HighLight>Defense Form</>, the strikes will apply <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">Taunt</> to enemy monsters for *f seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times.",
    ["持续打击周身敌方，每<Highlight>0.4</>秒对周身范围内敌方造成*d点物理伤害，持续<Highlight>5</>秒，并将敌方怪物<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">拖拽</>向自身，使敌方玩家buffdisc(*id)。施法时每秒获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>。\n日暮飓风技能持续期间获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，技能施法期间可以移动，施法1秒后可以释放连招以打断施法，并返还部分技能冷却时间。\n若自身处于<HighLight>防御形态</>，打击将对敌方怪物附加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">嘲讽</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。"] = "Continuously strike surrounding enemies, dealing *d physical damage to enemies in range every <Highlight>0.4</> seconds for <Highlight>5</> seconds, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">dragging</> enemy monsters toward you and applying buffdisc(*id) to enemy players. Gain 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</> per second while casting. \nGain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> for the duration of Sunset Hurricane; you can move while casting, and can perform a combo after 1 second of casting to interrupt the skill and refund a portion of the cooldown. \nIf you are in <HighLight>Defense Form</>, the strikes will apply <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"12\">Taunt</> to enemy monsters for *f seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times.",
