    ["持续治疗"] = "Continuous healing",
    ["持续治疗周身范围内友方，每1.5秒回复友方*d点生命，上限7次。技能生效期间自身可以移动、释放其它技能。"] = "Continuously heals allies within range, restoring *d Health to allies every 1.5 seconds, up to 7 times. You can move and cast other skills while this skill is active.",
    ["持续治疗周身范围内友方，每1.5秒回复范围内友方*d点生命，上限7次。技能生效期间自身可以移动、释放其它技能。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>心灵之火</>。"] = "Continuously heals allies within range, restoring *d Health to allies within range every 1.5 seconds, up to 7 times. You can move and cast other skills while this skill is active. \n Only available in <HighLight> Imagination Stance </>; switches to <HighLight> Mind Fire </> in <HighLight> Nightmare Stance </>.",
