    ["按钮高亮（哪些槽位被支持可参见文档https://docs.corp.kuaishou.com/s/home/fcACBLkzMeANRYSjc6F8yZqGP）"] = "Button highlight (which slots are supported can be found in documentation https://docs.corp.kuaishou.com/s/home/fcACBLkzMeANRYSjc6F8yZqGP)",
