    ["捡到一只保养良好的怀表，它的主人会在哪里？"] = "Found a well-maintained pocket watch. Where could its owner be?",
    ["捡到了猎龙帮的昏睡迷药，你的攻击有几率在目标附近产生一团持续12秒的昏睡毒雾。处于毒雾范围内的敌人造成的伤害降低40%。"] = "You found the Dragon Hunter Gang's sleeping potion; your attacks have a chance to create a cloud of sleeping poison mist near the target that lasts for 12 seconds. Enemies within the mist's range have their damage dealt reduced by 40%.",
    ["捡到了猎龙帮的昏睡迷药，攻击时有5%概率产生持续12秒的毒雾，范围内敌人增伤降低20%，此效果每5秒最多触发一次。"] = "Picked up the sleeping potion of the Dragon Hunter Gang. Attacks have a 5% chance to create a poison mist lasting 12 seconds, reducing the damage boost of enemies within the range by 20%. This effect can trigger at most once every 5 seconds.",
    ["捡到了猎龙帮的昏睡迷药，攻击时有5%概率产生持续12秒的毒雾，范围内敌人造成的伤害加深降低20%，此效果每5秒最多触发一次。"] = "Picked up the Dragon Hunting Gang's sleeping potion. Attacks have a 5% chance to generate a toxic mist lasting 12 seconds, reducing damage taken by enemies within the area by 20%. This effect can trigger at most once every 5 seconds.",
