    ["换位请求已过期。"] = "Position swap request has expired.",
    ["换做是我，一定也会想念您温暖的手艺。"] = "If it were me, I would definitely miss your warm craftsmanship too.",
    ["换在以前，这些东西放在盥洗室，放在鞋子里除臭都不行……风暴在上，这真是太折磨人了……<P_Heart>（捂住心口）</>"] = "In the past, these things couldn't even be used for deodorizing in the washroom or in shoes... Storm is above, this is truly tormenting... <P_Heart> (clutches chest) </>",
    ["换座"] = "Change Seat",
