    ["换教团有什么影响"] = "What is the impact of changing factions?",
    ["换班时间到了，三号炉的废渣还没清完！"] = "Shift change time, the slag from furnace number three hasn't been cleared yet!",
    ["换班时间到了，三号炉的废渣还没清完！谁想替班？每小时多给1便士！ "] = "Shift change time, the slag from furnace number three hasn't been cleared yet! Who wants to cover the shift? An extra 1 penny per hour!",
