    ["捣蛋时刻"] = "Prank Time",
    ["捣鼓机械的海精灵"] = "Sea Spirit who tinkers with machines",
    ["捧起中……"] = "Cupping...",
    ["捧起奖杯"] = "Hold Up Trophy",
    ["据仆人的证词，他在下午三点十分左右送茶时，曾听见男爵回应“别进来”。"] = "According to the servant's testimony, when he delivered tea around 3:10 PM, he heard the Baron respond with 'Don't come in'.",
    ["据我了解，他过得还不错。"] = "From what I understand, he is doing quite well.",
    ["据我了解，这里并没有什么事情需要警察出场。"] = "As far as I know, there is nothing here that requires the police to get involved.",
    ["据我所知，不幸去世的是服侍黛西小姐的两位女士？"] = "As far as I know, the unfortunate ones who passed away were the two ladies serving Miss Daisy?",
    ["据我所知，人造死神派已经遭受了重创，那您的灵魂有找回来吗？"] = "As far as I know, the Artificial Death sect has already suffered heavy losses. Have you found your soul back?",
    ["据我所知，有一个摊主会找菜贩购置些二手货，还有一个花低价买入了一块田来做自家农场，而低价正是因为那块田的前身是一块工业用地！"] = "As far as I know, there is a stall owner who buys second-hand goods from vegetable vendors, and another who bought a piece of land at a low price to be their own farm, and the low price was precisely because the land's predecessor was an industrial site!",
    ["据我所知，至少有5种谜题未被收录，再加上那两位女仆……"] = "As far as I know, at least 5 puzzles have not been recorded, and then there are those two maids...",
    ["据点1"] = "Stronghold 1",
    ["据点2"] = "Stronghold 2",
    ["据点3"] = "Stronghold 3",
    ["据点4"] = "Stronghold 4",
    ["据点主宰"] = "Master of the Stronghold",
    ["据点争夺中"] = "Stronghold being contested",
    ["据点保护"] = "Stronghold Protection",
    ["据点减疗"] = "Stronghold healing reduction",
    ["据点分"] = "Stronghold Points",
    ["据点加固"] = "Stronghold Reinforcement",
    ["据点已激活，占领后可以获得积分！"] = "Stronghold activated; capture it to earn points!",
    ["据点已生成，占领后可以获得积分！"] = "The stronghold has been generated. Occupy it to earn points!",
    ["据点怪减伤光环"] = "Stronghold Monster Damage Reduction Aura",
    ["据点是这孩子的？"] = "Is this base this child's?",
    ["据点积分结算倒计时 <Highlight>%s秒</>"] = "Countdown to stronghold point settlement <Highlight>%s seconds </>",
    ["据点脱战回血"] = "Stronghold Out-of-Combat Heal",
    ["据点重生无敌"] = "Stronghold Respawn Invincibility",
    ["据热心市民反映，近期常有来自霍伊大学的学生在墓地做奇怪的事情。 "] = "According to concerned citizens, students from Hoy University have recently been doing strange things in the cemetery.",
    ["据睡在他旁边的人讲，索尔斯破产后充满怨恨的情绪。但谁都没有想到，他竟然打算趁大家睡着，打碎所有煤油灯……"] = "According to the person sleeping next to him, Sols was full of resentment after going bankrupt. But no one expected that he intended to break all the kerosene lamps while everyone was asleep...",
    ["据管家的证词，他在三点左右给霍克斯男爵送药，并在两分钟后离开。"] = "According to the butler's testimony, he delivered medicine to Baron Hawkes around three o'clock and left two minutes later.",
    ["据罗塞尔大帝身边的人记载，大帝对咸鱼这一美食十分欣赏，有许多相关语录。"] = "According to those close to Emperor Roselle, the Emperor greatly appreciated the delicacy of salted fish and had many famous quotes about it.",
    ["据说为了这次演讲，议院治安队甚至派出了一名超凡能力者，我需要你先去大闹一番，打探清楚这名超凡者的能力。"] = "It is said that for this speech, the City Council Security Team even dispatched a Beyonder. I need you to go and cause a scene first to find out the ability of this Beyonder.",
    ["据说他还有个变态的爱好，每次行凶后都会给人的肠子带走。"] = "It is said that he also has a perverted hobby: every time he commits a crime, he takes away people's intestines.",
    ["据说划开表皮会流出雪白的牛奶，尝起来像嫩滑的鱼肉。"] = "It is said that if you cut the skin, snow-white milk will flow out, and it tastes like tender fish meat.",
    ["据说划开表皮会流出雪白的牛奶，尝起来口感像滑嫩的鱼肉。"] = "It is said that if you slice the skin, snow-white milk will flow out, and it tastes like tender, smooth fish.",
    ["据说卖家是一个神秘收藏家，交接完就销声匿迹了。"] = "It is said that the seller is a mysterious collector who disappeared after the handover.",
    ["据说卡尔·埃德加窥探到的禁忌知识，能够奴役和控制其他生物的心智。"] = "It is said that the forbidden knowledge that Karl Edgar peeked into can enslave and control the minds of other creatures.",
    ["据说她饿死在街头的时候，手里紧紧地攥着一个空的火柴盒……"] = "They say when she starved to death on the street, she was clutching an empty matchbox tightly in her hand...",
    ["据说始祖曾亲吻过这枚戒指，赐予祝福和期望。"] = "It is said that the Progenitor once kissed this ring, bestowing blessings and expectations.",
    ["据说它曾经在警局工作过，不知道怎么着被恶龙酒吧领养了。"] = "It is said that it used to work at the police station; I don't know how it ended up being adopted by the Evil Dragon Bar.",
    ["据说是小圆框眼镜的进阶产物，佩戴后专注力更上一层楼。"] = "Said to be an advanced product of small round glasses, wearing them improves concentration even further.",
    ["据说是某位值夜者实验新能力留下的。"] = "It is said to have been left by a Nighthawk experimenting with a new ability.",
    ["据说是精灵喜爱的酒，由金色泉周围区域特产的甜木汁酿造。"] = "It is said to be a wine loved by elves, brewed from the sweet wood sap unique to the area around the Golden Spring.",
    ["据说有人能从这些曲子里，听到额外的音符。"] = "It is said that some people can hear extra notes in these pieces.",
    ["据说有人违反规定，偷偷下去过，再也没上来。"] = "It is said that someone violated the rules and snuck down there, and they never came back up.",
    ["据说秘密藏在湖对岸的森林，想不想去看看？"] = "It's said that the secrets are hidden in the forest on the other side of the lake. Do you want to go take a look?",
    ["据说能同时看见多个角度。"] = "Said to be able to see multiple angles at once.",
    ["据说还叫“维尔餐厅”的时候就有这习惯了呢。"] = "It's said that they've had this habit since it was still called \"Will's Restaurant\".",
    ["据说鲁恩国国王心有百姓，"] = "It is said that the King of Loen has the people in his heart,",
    ["据说，中央广场的水池会跟幸运路人玩问答游戏……"] = "It is said that the fountain in the Central Plaza plays trivia games with lucky passersby...",
    ["据说，前几日有一位纵火犯在这里烧死了自己？"] = "It is said that an arsonist burned himself to death here a few days ago?",
    ["据说，只有<P_Yellow>被邀请之人</>才能看见入口。但我不知道具体是哪扇门，得靠你自己找。"] = "It is said that only <P_Yellow> those who are invited </> can see the entrance. But I don't know which specific door it is; you'll have to find it yourself.",
    ["据说，非常的迷人。啧啧啧……"] = "It is said to be incredibly charming. Tsk, tsk, tsk...",
    ["捶地"] = "Hammer Ground",
    ["捶地三连"] = "Triple Ground Pound",
    ["捶地：半径4.5米的圆形"] = "Hammer Ground: Circular area with a radius of 4.5 meters",
    ["掀开"] = "Lift",
    ["掀开帷幕"] = "Lift the curtain",
    ["掀起烈阳风暴，以手中之斧降下裁决。 "] = "Unleash the Blazing Sun storm and bring down judgment with the axe in hand.",
    ["掀起的海浪令主目标100%基础概率获得滞涩效果，效果持续2.5秒。"] = "The Sea Wave raised has a 100% base probability of inflicting a Stagnation effect on the main target, lasting 2.5 seconds.",
    ["掀起的海浪在目标区域形成一个半径6米大海漩涡，漩涡会吸引周围目标向中心靠拢，并且减少目标移动速度15%，漩涡持续时间3秒。"] = "The Sea Wave raised forms a sea vortex with a 6-meter radius in the target area. The vortex attracts surrounding targets toward the center and reduces their movement speed by 15%. The vortex lasts for 3 seconds.",
    ["授权声明"] = "Authorization Statement",
    ["授权官方"] = "Authorize Official",
    ["掉出来的包"] = "Dropped Bag",
    ["掉脑袋切切"] = "Head-Chopping Slice",
    ["掉落奖励"] = "Drop Reward",
    ["掉落物即将出现，请注意拾取"] = "Drops will appear soon; please be ready to pick them up.",
    ["掉落的文件"] = "Dropped Document",
    ["掉落的物资"] = "Dropped Supplies",
    ["掉落的神秘特性，交互后的非凡者指定阶段变身。"] = "Dropped mystical characteristic; Beyonders who interact with it will transform into the designated stage.",
    ["掉落的红茶"] = "Dropped black tea",
    ["掌声和欢呼，为这出荒诞戏画上休止符！"] = "Applause and cheers, put a full stop to this absurd play!",
    ["掌声在哪！"] = "Where's the applause?!",
    ["掌控五感，感知一切"] = "Control your five senses, perceive everything.",
    ["掌控伤害转移的能力，短时间内受到重创后，可将接下来的大部分伤害嫁祸他人，对危险的直觉能避开控制。然而虚妄终会散去，放大的情绪带来敏感与痛苦，短暂陷入易伤。"] = "Master the ability to transfer damage. After being hit hard in a short time, you can Frame others for most of the subsequent damage, and intuition about danger can avoid control. However, the illusion will eventually dissipate, and amplified emotions bring sensitivity and pain, briefly falling into Vulnerability.",
    ["掌控你的力量，而非被力量操控。"] = "Control your power, rather than being controlled by it.",
    ["掌控晋升带来的力量"] = "Mastering the power brought by advancement",
    ["掌握"] = "Mastery",
    ["掌握“定位”权柄，自身永不迷失位置，敌人无法定位，是开启一切封印的钥匙，也是关闭所有门户的锁。"] = "Master the 'Positioning' authority; you never lose your own location, and enemies cannot locate you. You are the key to opening all seals and the lock that closes all portals.",
    ["掌握了这些信息，或许可以占卜她的去向。"] = "With this information, perhaps I can use divination to find where she went.",
    ["掌握心灵，就是掌握巧合。"] = "To master the mind is to master coincidence.",
    ["掌握更多的非凡知识，才能更好地发挥出封印物的作用"] = "Mastering more Beyonder knowledge is the only way to better utilize the power of a Sealed Artifact.",
    ["掌握着各种各样奇怪的法术、类法术，如同马戏团里表演戏法的成员。"] = "Masters various strange spells and spell-like abilities, like a member performing tricks in a circus.",
    ["掌握神圣光芒与太阳之力，净化大范围污秽与死灵，当黑暗降临时化身光的代言人，以太阳之名裁决邪恶，驱散一切阴影。"] = "Masters sacred light and the power of the Sun, purifies large areas of filth and spirits, becomes the spokesperson of light when darkness descends, judges evil in the name of the Sun, and dispels all shadows.",
    ["掌握闪光、黑幕、冰冻、电击、造雾、刮风、点火、摔倒术等各种奇怪但不强力的法术，更像是用来表演戏法，而不是战胜敌人。"] = "Master various strange but weak spells such as flash, black curtain, freezing, electric shock, fog creation, wind blowing, ignition, and tripping. These are more like tricks for performance rather than means to defeat enemies.",
    ["掌握隐秘者"] = "Mastering Secrets",
    ["掌握魔法、巫术、占星术等神秘知识，懂得不少仪式魔法。拥有“窥秘之眼”，能看到更多不该看到的东西，因此必须对非凡力量保持敬畏。"] = "Master mysterious knowledge such as magic, witchcraft, and astrology, and understand quite a bit of Ritual Magic. Possess 'Eyes of Mystery Prying', capable of seeing more things that should not be seen; therefore, you must maintain awe for Beyonder power.",
    ["掌权者坐于高台，手执权杖，哪怕太阳的起落也要听其号令。"] = "The ruler sits on a high platform, holding a scepter, commanding even the rising and setting of the sun.",
    ["掌管安眠与寂静的仁慈神明啊，祂将这殊荣赐予你——从此你的姓名，落于一切喧嚣之外。"] = "O merciful deity who governs slumber and silence, You have bestowed this honor upon you—from now on, your name shall fall beyond all clamor.",
