    ["掘墓人，当然就是给人挖墓的。不过，我只负责穷人墓园，另外两块墓园需要找对应的人，他们就住在旁边的村子里。"] = "A gravedigger, of course, is someone who digs graves. However, I am only responsible for the poor cemetery. You need to find the corresponding people for the other two cemeteries; they live in the village next door.",
