    ["探索时虫宝藏与操控灵体之线的经历，使你的灵性成为一面敏锐的镜子。它能映照出环境中细微的恶意、线索与即将到来的危机轨迹。<Talent>基于【直觉】的检定时，投骰结果+1</>。"] = "The experience of exploring Worm of Time Treasures and controlling spirit body threads makes your spirituality a keen mirror. It can reflect subtle malice, clues, and the trajectories of upcoming crises in the environment. <Talent>When performing a check based on 【Intuition】, dice result +1</>.",
