    ["接\r\n下\r\n来"] = "Next\r\n",
    ["接下寻人任务"] = "Accept the missing person quest",
    ["接下来做点什么，继续往……嗬！"] = "What should I do next, keep going... Hah!",
    ["接下来几天慢慢适应，很快就能好了。"] = "Take it slow and adapt over the next few days; you'll be fine soon.",
    ["接下来又能见证什么历史呢？有些期待了。"] = "What history will we be able to witness next? I'm looking forward to it.",
    ["接下来只需要用侠盗黑皇帝的身份，劝白莉夫人留下生活就好了。"] = "Next, I just need to use the identity of the Phantom Thief Black Emperor to persuade Lady Beryl to stay and live.",
    ["接下来将是一场苦战，我准备了一批封印物。你们挑选合适的使用。"] = "The next part will be a bitter battle; I have prepared a batch of Sealed Artifacts. Choose the ones that suit you.",
    ["接下来就交给你了，我们的大占卜家。"] = "I'll leave it to you from here on, our great Seer.",
    ["接下来就交给那位警官先生吧，希望他们可以长记性。"] = "Let's leave it to that police officer for now; I hope they can learn their lesson.",
    ["接下来就是我的表演了 让我给他们吟唱一首诗歌吧"] = "Next is my performance. Let me recite a poem for them.",
    ["接下来就是我的表演了，让我给他们吟唱一首诗歌吧。"] = "Next is my performance, let me recite a poem for them.",
    ["接下来展示淡入淡出功能，这个功能很常见。"] = "Next, I will demonstrate the fade-in and fade-out function; this function is very common.",
    ["接下来应该……？"] = "What should I do next...?",
    ["接下来怎么做"] = "What to do next",
    ["接下来我们\r\n再大胆一点"] = "Let's be a little bolder\r\nnext.",
    ["接下来我们就可以购买货物，开始致富之旅"] = "Next, we can buy goods and start the journey to wealth.",
    ["接下来我会为您祷告，愿女神赐予你安宁。"] = "Next, I will pray for you. May the Goddess grant you peace.",
    ["接下来的安排"] = "Plans for the next steps",
    ["接下来的环节是，对抗邪神的污染。别担心，我们会帮你。"] = "The next step is to resist the corruption of the evil god. Don't worry, we will help you.",
    ["接下来该做什么呢……"] = "What should I do next...",
    ["接下来还有什么？"] = "What's next?",
    ["接下来还有件很重要的事，我要先去准备一段时间。"] = "There is another very important matter, I need to go prepare for a while first.",
    ["接下来，"] = "Next,",
    ["接下来，“正义”女士的指引会是什么呢？"] = "What will Miss Justice's guidance be next?",
    ["接下来，从失踪儿童的家庭开始调查吗？"] = "Shall we start the investigation from the families of the missing children?",
    ["接下来，去佐特兰街36号找“星星”先生。"] = "Next, go to 36 Zoutland Street to find Mr. Star.",
    ["接下来，就交给你们了。"] = "From here on, I leave it to you.",
    ["接下来，您就可以在这里进行各种酒类的产出了。黑麦啤酒是廷根人民餐桌上常见的饮料，我们不妨从这里开始试试。"] = "Next, you can produce various types of alcohol here. Rye beer is a common drink on the tables of the people of Tingen; we might as well start by trying that.",
    ["接下来，我们……"] = "Next, we...",
    ["接下来，我们会先去这位卧底的祖宅看看，也许那里还藏着些什么。"] = "Next, we will first visit the ancestral home of this undercover agent; perhaps something is still hidden there.",
    ["接下来，我会遵循“愚者”先生的启示，指引你喝下序列9魔药。"] = "Next, I will follow the revelation of Mr. Fool and guide you to drink the Sequence 9 potion.",
    ["接下来，把年龄这个数加上十三。"] = "Next, add thirteen to your age.",
    ["接下来，把我带到记忆印记旁边，我会唤醒那些沉睡已久的玩具和机关"] = "Next, bring me to the memory imprint, and I will awaken those long-dormant toys and mechanisms.",
    ["接下来，要重历的是哪段历史呢？"] = "Next, which piece of history are we going to relive?",
    ["接下来，该找金狼算账了。"] = "Next, it's time to settle the score with the Golden Wolf.",
    ["接任务trigger"] = "Accept quest trigger",
    ["接住这个，封印物3-0782【变异的太阳圣徽】，能净化亡灵和死尸！"] = "Catch this, Sealed Artifact 3-0782 [Mutated Sun Holy Emblem], it can purify the undead and corpses!",
    ["接住金币，收拾现场"] = "Catch the Gold Coin and clean up the scene",
    ["接初见奥黛丽CS"] = "Connect First Meeting Audrey CS",
    ["接取<HighLight>叹息之种</>任务，击败怪物获得<HighLight>猩红遗物</>，交予<HighLight>猎杀管家</>提升猎杀进度，获取奖励！"] = "Accept the <HighLight> Seed of Sighs </> quest, defeat monsters to obtain <HighLight> Scarlet Relics </>, and hand them to the <HighLight> Hunting Butler </> to increase hunting progress and earn rewards!",
    ["接取【叹息之种】任务，将收集到的猩红遗物提交给我，你将获得对等的奖赏。"] = "Accept the [Seed of Sighs] quest, submit the scarlet relics you've collected to me, and you shall receive a commensurate reward.",
    ["接取任务"] = "Accept Quest",
