    ["接取任务溶解"] = "Dissolve Upon Accepting Quest",
    ["接取任务，前往指定区域击败试炼怪物。"] = "Accept the quest to go to the designated area and defeat the trial monsters.",
    ["接取任务，寻找并击败猎龙之城中游荡的骑士。"] = "Accept the quest to find and defeat the knights wandering in the City of Dragon Hunting.",
