    ["提前准备了 我去拿"] = "Prepared in advance, I'll go get it.",
    ["提前完成所有火车玩法准备"] = "Complete all train gameplay preparations in advance",
    ["提前祝你生日快乐，亲爱的瓦莱莉。"] = "Happy early birthday, dear Valerie.",
    ["提前解冻"] = "Thaw Early",
    ["提前让他们死亡，是为了在短时间内收割大量生命，进行献祭？不过目前我们才调查了两件案子，现在样本还不够。"] = "Is it to harvest a large amount of life in a short time to perform a Sacrifice? However, we have only investigated two cases so far, and the sample size is not enough.",
    ["提前让他们死亡，是为了在短时间内收割大量生命，进行献祭？不过目前我们才调查了二件案子，现在样本还不够。"] = "Causing them to die prematurely, is it to harvest a large amount of life in a short time for a sacrifice? However, we have only investigated two cases so far, and the sample size is not enough yet.",
    ["提前退出将错过对决过程，奖励发放可能有延迟"] = "Exiting early will cause you to miss the duel process, and there may be a delay in the distribution of rewards.",
