    ["提升<Hightlight_2>任意</>人脉好感度"] = "Increase <Hightlight_2> any </> connection favorability",
    ["提升<Yellow>*f**</>生命值上限，并恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=3?*f**}</>已损失生命值。"] = "Increase <Yellow>*f**</> maximum Health, and restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=3?*f**}</> lost Health.",
