    ["揭开案件的第二点矛盾。"] = "Uncover the second contradiction in the case.",
    ["揭开真相"] = "Uncover the truth",
    ["揭开谜团"] = "Uncover the mystery",
    ["揭示"] = "Reveal",
    ["揭阳"] = "Jieyang",
    ["揭露敌人的弱点，层层累积后扣下扳机，造成伤害、重伤与眩晕。代价是每次射击都要灌注灵性消耗体力，并短暂暴露自己的弱点。"] = "Expose the enemy's weakness, pull the trigger after stacking layers, causing damage, Grievous Injury, and Stun. The cost is that every shot requires infusing spirituality and consuming stamina, while briefly exposing your own weakness.",
    ["援助者已加入队伍，现在可以继续挑战了！"] = "The helper has joined the party; you can now continue the challenge!",
