    ["摘要：\n今晨九时接获报案，一位名叫黛西·埃尔顿的青年女性陷入了异常<Mark id=\"#159\">昏迷</>状态。该名女性现居于<Letter_Highlight>廷根市北郊的别墅</>，由家中的管家和仆役看顾……\n\n标注：\n疑似<Mark id=\"#159\">非凡事件</>。"] = "Summary: \n Received a report at nine this morning that a young woman named Daisy Elton has fallen into an abnormal <Mark id=\"#159\">coma</> state. The woman currently lives in a <Letter_Highlight>villa in the northern suburbs of Tingen City</>, and is being looked after by the butler and servants in the house... \n\n Note: \nSuspected<Mark id=\"#159\"> Extraordinary event</>.",
