    ["擅入者！做好觉悟吧！"] = "Trespassers! Prepare yourselves!",
    ["擅长战斗的噩梦姿态，使用战斗技能造成伤害时，将治疗自身，但自身施加的治疗大幅降低。"] = "A Nightmare Stance specialized in combat. When using combat skills to deal damage, the user heals themselves, but the healing applied by the user is significantly reduced.",
