    ["操作上后面可以优化，流程先跑起来。"] = "The operation can be optimized later; let's get the workflow running first.",
    ["操作台"] = "Console",
    ["操作命运和灵性，并以卡牌的形式具象和愚弄敌人，收集命运黄牌和灵性蓝牌以解锁终结技能命运愚弄和灵性爆发，收集卡牌能量以解锁终结技能洗牌。"] = "Manipulate fate and spirituality, manifesting them in the form of cards to fool enemies. Collect Fate Yellow Cards and Spirituality Blue Cards to unlock the finisher skills Fooling of Fate and Spirituality Burst, and collect card energy to unlock the finisher skill Shuffle Cards.",
