    ["攻击提高<Mark>300</>，防御降低<Mark>25</>。进入战斗时，若队伍中有异性队友，攻击额外提高<Mark>45</>。"] = "Attack increased by <Mark>300</>, Defense decreased by <Mark>25</>. Upon entering combat, if there is a teammate of the opposite gender in the squad, Attack is additionally increased by <Mark>45</>.",
    ["攻击提高<Mark>75</>。"] = "Attack increased by <Mark> 75 </>.",
    ["攻击提高<Mark>80</>。"] = "Attack increased by <Mark>80</>.",
    ["攻击提高固定值20000"] = "Attack increased by a fixed value of 20000",
    ["攻击提高固定值2500"] = "Attack increased by a fixed value of 2500",
    ["攻击提高固定值8000"] = "Attack increased by a fixed value of 8000",
    ["攻击提高角色造成的伤害，提升幅度取决于技能倍率，且基于伤害类型，受到目标物理防御或魔法防御影响。\n\n角色物理攻击：{*d,F1690001,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690001,pAtkMax}\n角色魔法攻击：{*d,F1690001,mAtkMin}-{*d,F1690001,mAtkMax}"] = "Attack increases the damage caused by the character. The improvement magnitude depends on the Skill multiplier and, based on the damage type, is influenced by the target's Physical Defense or Magic Defense. \n \n Character Physical Attack: {*d,F1690001,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690001,pAtkMax} \n Character Magic Attack: {*d,F1690001,mAtkMin}-{*d,F1690001,mAtkMax}",
    ["攻击方的攻击会根据双方的破甲-护甲对抗进行数值修正。\n自身护甲超过伤害来源破甲的4倍时，每1点护甲降低伤害来源1点攻击。\n自身护甲超过伤害来源破甲，但低于伤害来源破甲的4倍时，每3点护甲降低伤害来源2点攻击。\n自身护甲低于伤害来源破甲时，每3点护甲降低伤害来源1点攻击。"] = "The attacker's attack will be numerically adjusted based on the Armor Break vs. Armor confrontation between both parties. \n When your own Armor exceeds 4 times the damage source's Armor Break, every 1 point of Armor reduces the damage source's attack by 1 point. \n When your own Armor exceeds the damage source's Armor Break but is less than 4 times the damage source's Armor Break, every 3 points of Armor reduces the damage source's attack by 2 points. \n When your own Armor is less than the damage source's Armor Break, every 3 points of Armor reduces the damage source's attack by 1 point.",
    ["攻击方的攻击会根据双方的破甲-护甲对抗进行数值修正。\n自身破甲低于目标护甲的¼时，每1点破甲提升自身2点攻击。\n自身破甲超过目标护甲¼但小于目标护甲时，每3点破甲提升自身2点攻击。\n自身破甲超过目标护甲时，每3点破甲提升自身1点攻击。"] = "The attacker's attack will be numerically adjusted based on the Armor Break vs. Armor confrontation between both parties. \n When your own Armor Break is less than ¼ of the target's Armor, every 1 point of Armor Break increases your own attack by 2 points. \n When your own Armor Break exceeds ¼ of the target's Armor but is less than the target's Armor, every 3 points of Armor Break increases your own attack by 2 points. \n When your own Armor Break exceeds the target's Armor, every 3 points of Armor Break increases your own attack by 1 point.",
    ["攻击方的攻击会根据攻防双方的破甲-护甲对抗进行数值修正。\n自身护甲超过伤害来源破甲的4倍时，每1点护甲降低伤害来源1点攻击。\n自身护甲超过伤害来源破甲，但低于伤害来源破甲的4倍时，每3点护甲降低伤害来源2点攻击。\n自身护甲低于伤害来源破甲时，每3点护甲降低伤害来源1点攻击。"] = "The attacker's Attack will be numerically adjusted based on the Armor Break-Armor confrontation between the attacker and defender. \nWhen own Armor exceeds 4 times the damage source's Armor Break, every 1 point of Armor reduces the damage source's Attack by 1 point. \nWhen own Armor exceeds the damage source's Armor Break but is less than 4 times the damage source's Armor Break, every 3 points of Armor reduces the damage source's Attack by 2 points. \nWhen own Armor is lower than the damage source's Armor Break, every 3 points of Armor reduces the damage source's Attack by 1 point.",
    ["攻击方的攻击会根据攻防双方的破甲-护甲对抗进行数值修正。\n自身破甲低于目标护甲的¼时，每1点破甲提升自身2点攻击。\n自身破甲超过目标护甲¼但小于目标护甲时，每3点破甲提升自身2点攻击。\n自身破甲超过目标护甲时，每3点破甲提升自身1点攻击。"] = "The attacker's Attack will be numerically adjusted based on the Armor Break-Armor confrontation between the attacker and defender. \nWhen own Armor Break is lower than ¼ of the target's Armor, every 1 point of Armor Break increases own Attack by 2 points. \nWhen own Armor Break exceeds ¼ of the target's Armor but is less than the target's Armor, every 3 points of Armor Break increases own Attack by 2 points. \nWhen own Armor Break exceeds the target's Armor, every 3 points of Armor Break increases own Attack by 1 point.",
    ["攻击时叠加攻击力"] = "Stack attack power when attacking",
    ["攻击时自身周围产生恶魔果实，3秒后自动爆炸，对友方造成伤害；主动踩到恶魔果实会引爆它，对附近敌方造成伤害并强化友方。"] = "Attacking generates Devil Fruits around you, which automatically explode after 3 seconds, dealing damage to allies. Stepping on a Devil Fruit manually detonates it, dealing damage to nearby enemies and strengthening allies.",
    ["攻击普通怪物时，伤害提高{*.1f**,F1690001,CreepHurtMulti}。"] = "Damage is increased by {*.1f**,F1690001,CreepHurtMulti} when attacking Normal Monsters.",
    ["攻击普通怪物时，提高自身的攻击{*d,F1690001,CreepHurtPlus}点。"] = "Increases your own Attack by {*d,F1690001,CreepHurtPlus} points when attacking Normal Monsters.",
