    ["放弃那些痛苦的记忆，成为永恒的……完美的……"] = "Give up those painful memories, become eternal... perfect...",
    ["放弃？"] = "Give up?",
    ["放徽章的盒子"] = "Box for badges",
    ["放心 它是2级封印物里相对不那么危险的一个"] = "Don't worry, it is relatively less dangerous among the Grade 2 Sealed Artifacts.",
    ["放心 能让你直接来这里 说明队长同意了"] = "Don't worry, the fact that you were brought here directly means the Captain agreed.",
    ["放心……这次之后，想不被处理也难啊……"] = "Don't worry... after this time, it'll be hard for it not to be dealt with...",
    ["放心交给我吧"] = "Leave it to me",
    ["放心吧"] = "Don't worry",
    ["放心吧。对了，你叫什么名字？"] = "Don't worry. By the way, what's your name?",
    ["放心吧罗珊女士，那都是人和装置假扮的。"] = "Don't worry, Ms. Rozanne, those are all people and props in disguise.",
    ["放心吧，亲爱的铁针，我们可是铁十字街最厉害的组合！"] = "Don't worry, dear Iron Needle, we are the best team on Iron Cross Street!",
    ["放心吧，姐姐。我想女神已经收到我们的祈祷了。"] = "Don't worry, sister. I think the Goddess has already received our prayers.",
    ["放心吧，就算你什么也不知道，我们也不会孤立你的，哈哈哈！"] = "Don't worry, even if you don't know anything, we won't isolate you, hahaha!",
    ["放心吧，这次的救援行动小队绝对靠谱。"] = "Don't worry. This rescue team is completely reliable.",
    ["放心，只是拍张照而已。这是我给自己留的一份纪念，也是那只乌鸦想给你的谢礼。"] = "Don't worry, it's just taking a photo. This is a memento I'm keeping for myself, and also a thank-you gift that crow wanted to give you.",
    ["放心，很快就会被找到的。"] = "Don't worry, he will be found soon.",
    ["放心，我们只是要饭的，不是吃素的。"] = "Don't worry, we are just beggars, not vegetarians.",
    ["放心，我已经为你准备好了戏票。明天中午期待你的到来。"] = "Rest assured, I have already prepared a ticket for you. I look forward to your arrival tomorrow at noon.",
    ["放心，我带过十几个人，没有出事的。"] = "Don't worry, I've led over a dozen people, nothing has ever gone wrong.",
    ["放心，我猜，这款饮料的配方里有令人腹泻的成分。你们在门口等等，我说不定能帮助这款饮料升级！"] = "Don't worry, I suspect this drink's recipe contains ingredients that cause diarrhea. You wait at the door; I might be able to help upgrade this drink!",
    ["放心，我这的鱼绝对新鲜。"] = "Don't worry, the fish here is absolutely fresh.",
    ["放心，戴莉一般很少这么做，她只是想通过这种方式让你平静和放松下来，她其实更喜欢尸体。"] = "Don't worry, Daly rarely does this. She just wants to calm you down and relax you in this way. She actually prefers corpses.",
    ["放心，没人敢在这儿闹事，斯维因可不是好惹的。"] = "Don't worry, no one dares to cause trouble here; Swain is not someone to be trifled with.",
    ["放心，罗珊是个外向的姑娘，她不会孤单的。"] = "Don't worry, Rozanne is an outgoing girl; she won't be lonely.",
    ["放心，能让你直接来这里，说明队长同意了。"] = "Don't worry, the fact that you were allowed to come here directly means the Captain has agreed.",
    ["放慢脚步，在煤气灯与雾气间穿行。这个城市的街道自有它的节奏，等你去聆听、去感受。"] = "Slow down and walk between the gas lamps and the fog. The streets of this city have their own rhythm, waiting for you to listen and feel.",
    ["放我走，否则我就把这个小家伙困死在冥界！"] = "Let me go, or I will trap this little guy in the Underworld!",
    ["放手 可恶 你放手！"] = "Let go, damn it, let go!",
    ["放技能时将自动移动到技能施法范围内再释放技能。"] = "When casting a skill, the character will automatically move into the skill's casting range before releasing it.",
    ["放松，艾萨克。我们不是有“培根”吗？它最近胖了不少。"] = "Relax, Isaac. Don't we have \"Bacon\"? It's gotten quite fat lately.",
    ["放松，艾萨克。我们不是有培根吗？它最近胖了不少。"] = "Relax, Isaac. Don't we have Bacon? It's gained quite a bit of weight recently.",
