    ["故事主角是一位叫做道恩的富翁，正在全鲁恩的报纸上连载呢。"] = "The protagonist of the story is a rich man named Dawn, and it is being serialized in newspapers all over Loen.",
    ["故事事件"] = "Story Event",
    ["故事始于狂暴海……"] = "The story begins in the Berserk Sea...",
    ["故事始于狂暴海上的一艘商船，有一个年轻的水手，受到老船长的青睐，马上就要升任船长，但<P_Yellow>船上的会计</>却嫉妒不已，于是编造出一封恶毒的举报信。"] = "The story begins on a merchant ship on the Berserk Sea. There is a young sailor who is favored by the old captain and is about to be promoted to captain, but the <P_Yellow> accountant on the ship </> is jealous, so he fabricates a vicious denunciation letter.",
    ["故事开启了新的篇章。"] = "The story has opened a new chapter.",
    ["故事开始于一场热闹非凡的订婚仪式，新郎唐泰斯刚刚从南大陆回来，他是商船“法老号”的大副，一个经历过大风大浪的水手。"] = "The story begins with a lively engagement ceremony. The groom, Dantès, has just returned from the Southern Continent. He is the first mate of the merchant ship 'Pharaon,' a sailor who has experienced great storms.",
    ["故事残页"] = "Story Scrap",
    ["故事片段"] = "Story Fragment",
    ["故事的开始总是源自巧合——\r\n一片静谧的城堡领地，正悄然等待着新的主人。"] = "The story always begins with a coincidence—\nA quiet castle estate is silently awaiting its new master.",
    ["故事的意义"] = "The meaning of the story",
