    ["教会带走了博诺瓦，我的小儿子。我们父子的关系或许不算那么亲密，但他终究是我的孩子。"] = "The Church took away Benoit, my youngest son. Our relationship as father and son might not be that close, but he is my child after all.",
    ["教会执事"] = "Church Deacon",
    ["教会活动上，主教送给我们蜡烛。那蜡烛不用点燃就能发光，惨白惨白的，省下一大笔蜡烛钱……可用久了，心里总是发冷。 "] = "At a church event, the bishop gave us candles. The candles glowed without being lit, pale and white, saving a lot of candle money... but after using them for a long time, my heart always felt cold.",
    ["教会的书上说，众神带领人类走过了<P_Yellow>所罗门王朝</>、<P_Yellow>图铎-特伦索斯特联合帝国</>、<P_Yellow>四皇时期</>……"] = "The church books say that the gods led humanity through the <P_Yellow> Solomon Empire </>, <P_Yellow> Tudor-Trunsoest United Empire </>, <P_Yellow> Four Emperors period </>...",
