    ["散发出来的光芒温暖你和附近的队友，提升你们的攻击和技能增强。但贴身的热度也会灼伤持有者，施放本源技能后，会持续损失生命值。"] = "The light emitted warms you and nearby teammates, increasing your Attack and Skill Enhancement. But the close heat will also burn the holder; after casting a source skill, you will continuously lose Health.",
    ["散发着不详气息的宝箱。"] = "A treasure chest exuding an ominous aura.",
