    ["文森"] = "Vincent",
    ["文森特"] = "Vincent",
    ["文森特·"] = "Vincent ",
    ["文森特是世代服务于威瑟尔家族的管家，每一任都会使用这个名字，至今已是第三十七任。\n这一任文森特是窥秘人途径，习惯随身带书，保持阅读和思考的习惯。\n他虔心阅读时，一个声音悄悄钻入他的脑海：\n“知识就是力量……只要拥有力量……就能拥有一切……”\n不知何时，书上的字变形扭曲，化为一个神秘的图案。\n“知识组成的……皇冠……”\n“知识能守护庄园……能避免当年的悲剧重演……”\n文森特怔怔地合上书，心中迅速出现了一个计划。\n他要找到知识组成的皇冠，他要获得知识的梦乡。\n他要拼尽一切力量守护庄园，直到天穹倒转、群星坠落，无穷的知识走向尽头。"] = "Vincent is the butler who has served the Wetherell family for generations; every successor uses this name, and he is now the thirty-seventh. \n This Vincent is of the Mystery Pryer pathway, accustomed to carrying books with him and maintaining the habit of reading and thinking. \n When he was reading devoutly, a voice quietly crept into his mind: \n \"Knowledge is Power... As long as you have power... you can have everything...\" \n At some point, the words on the book deformed and twisted, turning into a mysterious pattern. \n \"A crown... made of knowledge...\" \n \"Knowledge can guard the manor... can prevent the tragedy of that year from repeating...\" \n Vincent closed the book in a daze, and a plan quickly appeared in his heart. \n He wanted to find the crown made of knowledge; he wanted to obtain the dreamland of knowledge. \n He wanted to use all his power to guard the manor until the sky turned upside down, the stars fell, and the infinite knowledge came to an end.",
    ["文法和古典文学还没背完，数学和逻辑题也只刷了一半，听说今年还要加一门“行测”，我要疯了！"] = "I haven't finished memorizing grammar and classical literature, and I've only brushed through half of the math and logic problems. I heard that an \"Administrative Aptitude Test\" will be added this year, I'm going crazy!",
    ["文灬昊"] = "Wen Hao",
