    ["文献室向学派的每位成员开放。整个文献室一共分两层，一楼存放了各种文艺社科书籍，二楼则收藏了非凡能力相关的书籍。"] = "The literature room is open to every member of the school. It is divided into two floors: the first floor houses various literature and social science books, while the second floor contains books related to Beyonder abilities.",
    ["文献室欢迎每个向往知识的人。"] = "The library welcomes everyone who yearns for knowledge.",
