    ["斯嘉丽和梅兰妮花房即日起转让。\n我们在这里为每一朵鲜花奉上自由，请随意拿取。\n愿获得鲜花的你，能享有同样美好自由的人生。"] = "Scarlett and Melanie's flower shop is transferring ownership effective today.\nWe offer freedom to every flower here; please feel free to take them.\nMay you who receive these flowers enjoy an equally beautiful and free life.",
    ["斯嘉丽根本没有什么未婚夫等他回来只是她不结婚的借口！她和梅兰妮在战争时就认识了还一起对付过上门抢劫的混混！"] = "Scarlett doesn't have a fiancé waiting for her to return; that's just an excuse she uses to avoid marriage! She and Melanie have known each other since the war and even teamed up to deal with a thug who tried to rob them!",
    ["斯嘉丽？就是那个号称梅兰妮好姐妹的斯嘉丽？"] = "Scarlett? You mean Scarlett, who claims to be Melanie's best friend?",
