    ["斯蒂姆宫在轰鸣，一座蒸汽之城挣脱图纸、获得生命后，那枚永不停歇的核心，至今仍为百年前的登月之梦跳动。"] = "The Steam Palace is roaring. After a city of steam broke free from the blueprints and gained life, that never-stopping core still beats for the dream of landing on the moon from a hundred years ago.",
