    ["方桌·质朴"] = "Square Table: Rustic",
    ["方正的小桌可坐两人对饮，配上一壶红茶就是一个安静而闲适的下午。"] = "A square table for two to drink together; paired with a pot of black tea, it makes for a quiet and leisurely afternoon.",
    ["方正的木格嵌着透明玻璃，是大多数庄园主厅最常用的那一款。"] = "A square wooden grid embedded with transparent glass, the most commonly used style for the main halls of most manors.",
    ["方正的机关小盒子"] = "A small, square mechanical box",
    ["方芯独脚桌"] = "Square Pedestal Table",
    ["施以援手"] = "Lend a Hand",
    ["施佩尔"] = "Spear",
    ["施佩尔-椅子"] = "Spear-Chair",
    ["施佩尔先生把写好的剧本交给了你，你回到舞台上继续表演。"] = "Mr. Speer handed the written script to you, and you returned to the stage to continue the performance.",
    ["施佩尔先生是文艺界的名人，警察厅非常重视，所以特派我来调查此事。"] = "Mr. Speer is a celebrity in the literary world, and the Police Department takes this matter very seriously, so I was specially sent to investigate.",
    ["施佩尔先生的……灵感剧院？"] = "Mr. Speer's... Theater of Inspiration?",
    ["施佩尔先生说不定也被传到了这里，去前面找找看吧。"] = "Mr. Speer might have been transported here as well. Let's go ahead and look for him.",
    ["施佩尔先生，我刚才了解到……"] = "Mr. Speer, I just learned that...",
    ["施佩尔先生，演出为什么停下了？"] = "Mr. Speer, why did the performance stop?",
    ["施佩尔先生？"] = "Mr. Speer?",
    ["施佩尔坐下"] = "Spear Sits Down",
    ["施佩尔座位侧面点"] = "Side point of Speer's seat",
    ["施佩尔灵视走点"] = "Spear Spirit Vision Path",
    ["施佩尔跑过来点"] = "Spear Running Over Point",
    ["施佩尔路径"] = "Spear Path",
    ["施佩尔路点"] = "Spear Waypoint",
    ["施佩尔镜头"] = "Speer Shot",
    ["施加方受到的部分伤害会转移到你身上。"] = "A portion of the damage taken by the caster will be transferred to you.",
    ["施展巫术对小范围内敌方进行三段式攻击，分别造成spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)点魔法伤害并将敌方怪物<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>，命中时获得<HighLight>6</>/<HighLight>5</>/<HighLight>13</>点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。自身拥有<HighLight>知识灌注</>时，本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>：凝聚三柄朗基努斯之枪掷向指定区域，对小范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害，并附加持续*f秒的mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>，有<HighLight>50%</>基础概率造成持续<HighLight>3</>秒的<HighLight>50%</>减速效果。同时获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Perform Witchcraft to execute a three-stage attack on enemies in a small area, dealing spellfielddisc(*id)/spellfielddisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) Magic Damage respectively and <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">Interrupting</> enemy monsters. Gain <HighLight>6</>/<HighLight>5</>/<HighLight>13</> points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</> upon hit. When you possess <HighLight>Knowledge Infusion</>, this skill is <HighLight>Strengthened</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Strengthening</>: Condense three Spears of Longinus and throw them at the designated area, dealing spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id)+spellfielddisc(*id) Magic Damage to enemies in a small area, applying a mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</> effect lasting *f seconds, with a <HighLight>50%</> base chance to cause a <HighLight>50%</> Slow effect for <HighLight>3</> seconds. Simultaneously gain 20 points of <HighLight>Mystic Knowledge</>. \n<FaintYellow>Mystic Knowledge</>: Maximum capacity is 100 points. Reaching 100 points unlocks the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Torrent of Information</>.",
    ["施展巫术，对目标进行攻击并获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）；释放知识逐人后强化为朗基努斯之枪，伤害与神秘知识获取量提高并附加减疗。"] = "Perform witchcraft to attack the target and gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills). After releasing Knowledge Pursuit, it is strengthened into Spear of Longinus, increasing damage and mysterious knowledge gain while adding healing reduction.",
    ["施展法术，并非没有任何代价。"] = "Casting spells is not without its price.",
    ["施展童话魔法，以神秘力量保护自身，获得护盾、霸体和神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Perform fairy tale magic, using mysterious power to protect yourself, gaining a shield, super armor, and mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills).",
    ["施展童话魔法，展开岁月的棋局加速自身的时间流逝，获得霸体，短暂延迟后造成范围伤害和击飞，同时降低自身技能的冷却时间。释放后获得神秘知识（用于解锁终结技能）。"] = "Perform fairy tale magic to unfold the Gambit of the Ages, accelerating your own time flow and gaining super armor. After a brief delay, deal area damage and knockup, while reducing your own skill cooldowns. Gain mysterious knowledge (used to unlock finisher skills) after release.",
    ["施展龙威震慑范围内的敌人，造成大量伤害，并击飞处于瘟疫状态的怪物。"] = "Exert Dragon Might to deter enemies within range, dealing massive damage and knocking up monsters in a plague state.",
    ["施工中"] = "Under Construction",
    ["施放卜杖寻路技能寻找指定InstanceID对象"] = "Cast Dowsing Rod Navigation skill to find specified InstanceID object",
    ["施放卜杖寻路技能寻找指定坐标位置"] = "Cast Dowsing Rod Navigation skill to find specified coordinate location",
    ["施放技能“赞美太阳”"] = "Cast the skill 'Praise the Sun'",
    ["施放技能“赞颂烈阳”"] = "Cast the skill \"Praise the Sun\"",
    ["施放技能时，有概率提升200点怪物专攻和3%攻击，持续8秒。冷却20秒。"] = "When casting a skill, there is a chance to increase Monster Specialization by 200 and Attack by 3% for 8 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["施放技能时，有概率提升200点途径专攻和3%攻击，持续8秒。冷却20秒。"] = "When casting a skill, there is a chance to increase Pathway Specialization by 200 and Attack by 3% for 8 seconds. Cooldown: 20 seconds.",
    ["施放指定技能"] = "Cast specified skill",
    ["施放指定技能  "] = "Cast specified skill",
    ["施放指定技能  对象同场景传送  "] = "Cast specified skill, object teleports within the same scene",
    ["施放指定技能  玩家高亮显示技能栏里的指定技能  "] = "Cast specified skill, player highlights specified skill in skill bar",
    ["施放指定技能  玩家高亮显示技能栏里的指定技能  延迟执行  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  "] = "Cast specified skill, player highlights specified skill in skill bar, delayed execution, player plays dialogue text visible only to themselves",
    ["施放指定技能  玩家高亮显示技能栏里的指定技能  玩家播放CutScene  "] = "Cast specified skill, player highlights specified skill in skill bar, player plays CutScene",
    ["施放指定技能  玩家高亮显示技能栏里的指定技能  玩家播放仅自己可见的说话文本  "] = "Cast specified skill, player highlights specified skill in skill bar, player plays dialogue text visible only to themselves",
    ["施放指定技能攻击指定InstanceID的怪物"] = "Cast specified skill to attack monster with specified InstanceID",
    ["施放指定技能攻击指定TemplateID的怪物"] = "Cast specified skill to attack monster with specified TemplateID",
    ["施放星云咏叹、戏法演绎、放逐时强化其效果。"] = "Strengthens the effects of Nebula Aria, Trick Performance, and Exile when cast.",
    ["施放普攻与技能后，有概率获得幸运，提升移速、暴击与技能增强，可多次叠加，未触发则概率持续累积。但幸运结束时会陷入枯竭，移速与体力恢复降低。"] = "After casting Basic Attack and skills, there is a probability of gaining luck, increasing movement speed, critical hits, and Skill Enhancement, which can be stacked multiple times; if not triggered, the probability continues to accumulate. But when luck ends, you will fall into exhaustion, and movement speed and stamina recovery will decrease.",
    ["施放某技能之前"] = "Before casting a certain Skill",
    ["施放除普攻外的战斗技能后，会获得1层持续*f秒的<HighLight>足迹</>。\n施放除普攻与终结技能外的战斗技能后，会获得1点<HighLight>星空能量</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>星空能量</>\n<HighLight>星空能量</>最多拥有5点。拥有3点<HighLight>星空能量</>时解锁<HighLight>终结技能层叠之门</>。施放<HighLight>层叠之门</>时会消耗<HighLight>星空能量</>，使其效果获得强化。\n<FaintYellow>足迹</>\n<HighLight>足迹</>最多叠加3层。施放普通攻击<HighLight>闪击</>时消耗所有<HighLight>足迹</>，使其效果获得强化。（若未命中则不会消耗<HighLight>足迹</>。）"] = "After casting a combat skill other than a Basic Attack, you gain 1 stack of <HighLight>Footprints</> lasting *f seconds. \nAfter casting a combat skill other than a Basic Attack or Finisher Skill, you gain 1 point of <HighLight>Starlight Energy</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Starlight Energy</>\n<HighLight>Starlight Energy</> can stack up to 5 points. When you have 3 points of <HighLight>Starlight Energy</>, you unlock the <HighLight>Finisher Skill Layered Gate</>. Casting <HighLight>Layered Gate</> consumes <HighLight>Starlight Energy</>, strengthening its effect. \n<FaintYellow>Footprints</>\n<HighLight>Footprints</> can stack up to 3 times. Casting the Basic Attack <HighLight>Flash Strike</> consumes all <HighLight>Footprints</>, strengthening its effect. (If it does not hit, <HighLight>Footprints</> will not be consumed.)",
    ["施法后4秒 +20%攻击 +5%减伤"] = "After casting +20% Attack +5% Damage Reduction for 4 seconds",
    ["施法后4秒+15%攻击+5%减伤；技能击杀恢复20法力值"] = "After casting +15% Attack +5% Damage Reduction for 4 seconds; skill kills restore 20 Mana",
    ["施法后4秒+30%攻击+10%减伤；技能击杀恢复20法力值"] = "After casting +30% Attack +10% Damage Reduction for 4 seconds; skill kills restore 20 Mana",
