    ["无瞳的将军：筛无仇敌的目标"] = "General Without Pupils: Filter targets without Enemy",
    ["无瞳的将军：筛有仇敌的目标"] = "General Without Pupils: Filter targets with Enemy",
    ["无瞳的将军：负面标记（可被怨灵命中）"] = "General without Pupils: Negative mark (can be hit by Wraith)",
    ["无知之人，竟敢打扰萨斯利尔大人的沉睡！"] = "Ignorant mortal, how dare you disturb the slumber of Lord Sasrir!",
    ["无知的凡人，成为知识与真理的祭品吧！"] = "Ignorant mortals, become sacrifices to knowledge and truth!",
    ["无知者……在知识的注视下，你将无处遁藏！"] = "Ignorant one... under the gaze of knowledge, you will have nowhere to hide!",
    ["无知者才能无畏啊。"] = "Only the ignorant can be fearless.",
    ["无知！那你就去给那个愚蠢的占卜师陪葬吧！"] = "Ignorant! Then go and be buried with that stupid diviner!",
    ["无礼之徒，郊外村庄，木风车旁，审判之日。"] = "The impudent fellow, the village in the suburbs, by the wooden Windmill, the Day of Judgment.",
    ["无礼，我是愚者教会座下的神使，你应当称呼我神使大人。"] = "How rude, I am a divine messenger under the Church of the Fool; you should address me as Lord Messenger.",
    ["无穷的信息流穿梭而出，像无穷的呓语。它们化成陆地，它们化成大海，大海变成陆地，陆地又变成大海，人诞生又消失，时间前进又倒转。"] = "Endless streams of information surged forth like ceaseless whispers. They became land, then sea; sea turned into land, and land into sea again. People were born and vanished as time moved forward and backward.",
    ["无缝黑盒"] = "Seamless Black Box",
    ["无聊"] = "Boring",
    ["无舞伴玩家请跟随连线寻找：%s秒"] = "Players without a dance partner, please follow the line to find one: %s seconds",
    ["无良老板"] = "Unscrupulous boss",
    ["无良老板雷克斯"] = "Unscrupulous Boss Rex",
    ["无表现标记"] = "No Effect Mark",
    ["无表现眩晕"] = "Stun without effect",
    ["无表现眩晕，带无敌"] = "Stun Without Performance, Includes Invincibility",
    ["无装甲练习 I"] = "Unarmored Practice I",
    ["无装甲练习 II"] = "Unarmored Practice II",
    ["无装甲练习II：防御+50。"] = "Unarmored Practice II: Defense +50.",
    ["无装甲练习I：防御+30。"] = "Unarmored Practice I: Defense +30.",
    ["无视"] = "Ignore",
    ["无视世界boss开放时间"] = "Ignore world boss opening time.",
    ["无论上下，无论贫富，都将在路中汇聚。"] = "Regardless of status, regardless of wealth, all will converge on the road.",
    ["无论什么时代，都需要提灯者照亮黑暗，引领光明。"] = "No matter the era, there is a need for lantern-bearers to illuminate the darkness and lead the light.",
    ["无论何时，只需一个呼唤，我们的侍者就会立刻到达。"] = "At any time, with just a call, our attendants will arrive immediately.",
    ["无论何时，若你需要帮助，我都在这里。女神会眷顾每一份真挚的约定。"] = "No matter when, if you need help, I am here. The Goddess will favor every sincere promise.",
    ["无论你是否听过这句告诫，我都要再次提醒：“小心观众”。"] = "Regardless of whether you have heard this warning, I must remind you again: \"Beware of Spectators\".",
    ["无论你有没有名字，我想我都会记住你的，可爱的毛毛草。"] = "Regardless of whether you have a name or not, I think I will remember you, cute Mao Mao Cao.",
    ["无论你来自何处，永远记得，你可以回到这里。"] = "No matter where you come from, always remember that you can return here.",
    ["无论便装、骑马服还是燕尾服……"] = "Whether it's casual wear, a riding habit, or a tailcoat...",
    ["无论前方是什么，队长永远站在最前面。"] = "No matter what lies ahead, the Captain always stands at the very front.",
    ["无论在哪个时代、哪个世界，“善有善报，恶有恶报”永远是所有人都认同的正义观。"] = "No matter the era or the world, 'good is rewarded with good, and evil is rewarded with evil' is a concept of justice that everyone will always agree with.",
    ["无论在哪儿，平民的生活都是平凡的。至于能不能把日子过成美酒——年轻人，还得看你们自己的本事。"] = "No matter where you are, the life of a commoner is ordinary. As for whether you can turn life into fine wine—young man, that depends on your own abilities.",
    ["无论在地下酒馆，还是南大陆的码头，赏金猎手都会获得人们充分的尊敬。毕竟谁也不想成为猎物，不是吗？"] = "Whether in an underground tavern or at the docks of the Southern Continent, bounty hunters are always treated with full respect. After all, no one wants to become the prey, right?",
    ["无论如何，我先入梦调查。"] = "Regardless, I will enter the dream to investigate first.",
    ["无论如何，我必须战胜它，不能向邪神屈服。"] = "No matter what, I must defeat it; I cannot submit to the evil god.",
    ["无论如何，提升序列、不断变强，是你现在最好的抵御方式。"] = "In any case, increasing your Sequence and constantly becoming stronger is your best way to resist right now.",
    ["无论如何，现在你有很高的嫌疑，你必须跟我走一趟。"] = "In any case, you are now a high-level suspect, and you must come with me.",
    ["无论怎样，你已获得你想要的——"] = "Regardless, you have obtained what you wanted—",
    ["无论是哪里，保证让您舒舒服服准时到达！"] = "No matter where it is, I guarantee you'll arrive comfortably and on time!",
    ["无论是拮据的家庭情况，还是现在面临的危险，我都得需要维持塔罗会，加入值夜者。"] = "Whether it's the financial situation of my family or the danger I'm currently facing, I need to maintain the Tarot Club and join the Nighthawks.",
    ["无论是拯救世界的勇者还是打猎的好手\n一把趁手的武器都必不可少\n劳格拉斯武器店静候您的光临\n\n热卖推荐\n<Letter_Highlight>绅士左轮</>\n<Letter_Highlight>黄铜雕花燧发枪</>\n<Letter_Highlight>双筒猎枪</>\n\n\n<Delete id=\"#158\">办全类武器使用证请联系</><Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">老杰克</>\n\n廷根市警察局<Mark id=\"#159\">特别提醒</>：\n请合法取得武器使用证，违法办证人员已被缉拿"] = "Whether you are a hero saving the world or a skilled hunter \n a handy weapon is essential \n Laugras Weapon Shop awaits your visit \n\n Hot Sale Recommendations \n<Letter_Highlight> Gentleman's Revolver </>\n<Letter_Highlight> Brass Engraved Flintlock </>\n<Letter_Highlight> Double-barreled Shotgun </>\n\n\n<Delete id=\"#158\"> To apply for a full weapon license, please contact </><Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Old Jack </>\n\n Tingen City Police Department <Mark id=\"#159\"> Special Reminder </>: \n Please obtain a weapon license legally, illegal applicants have been apprehended",
    ["无论是拯救世界的勇者还是打猎的好手，一把趁手的武器都必不可少。静候您的光临。"] = "Whether you are a hero saving the world or a good hunter, a handy weapon is essential. We look forward to your visit.",
    ["无论曾击碎过什么，此刻都已成为久远的回响。"] = "Whatever has been shattered, at this moment, has become a distant echo.",
    ["无论正确与否，现在可以验证一下这个猜想了。"] = "Regardless of whether it is correct or not, I can verify this hypothesis now.",
    ["无论祂守候多久，祂的王，和巨人统治下的荣光都回不来了。"] = "No matter how long He waits, His King and the glory under the giants' rule will never return.",
    ["无论这里发生过什么，只有前进才能找到答案。"] = "No matter what happened here, only by moving forward can we find the answer.",
    ["无调整记录"] = "No adjustment records",
    ["无谓的坚持让你陷入泥潭，执念成了你的绞索。放手吧，有些东西注定要失去。 "] = "Pointless persistence traps you in a quagmire; obsession has become your noose. Let go; some things are destined to be lost.",
    ["无购买次数限制"] = "No Purchase Limit",
    ["无赖汉"] = "Rogue",
    ["无赖汉冲向路径点"] = "Rogue Rushing to Waypoint",
    ["无赖汉激动镜头"] = "Rogue Excited Shot",
    ["无赖汉被摔镜头"] = "Rogue Being Thrown Shot",
    ["无赖连滚带爬地跑了，隐约还能听见“扑通”一声——他又摔了一跤。"] = "The scoundrel scrambles away, and you can faintly hear a \"thump\"—he tripped again.",
    ["无趣"] = "Uninteresting",
    ["无路可退了！大家躲在障碍物后面，避开冲击！"] = "There's no way back! Everyone hide behind the obstacles and avoid the impact!",
    ["无辜的人在非凡事件中遇难，总是令人惋惜，但事情已经无法挽回。"] = "It is always regrettable when innocent people meet with disaster in Beyonder incidents, but what is done cannot be undone.",
    ["无辜的祭品"] = "Innocent Sacrifice",
    ["无辜的祭品会被强尼定期召唤出现在场景内，当祭品被强尼击杀后，会释放全范围的冲击波。"] = "Innocent sacrifices will be periodically summoned by Johnny to appear in the scene. When a sacrifice is killed by Johnny, it will release a field-wide shockwave.",
    ["无遮挡景观位！顶级餐饮位！温馨家庭位！各式各样的船票！"] = "Unobstructed view seats! Top-tier dining seats! Cozy family seats! All kinds of tickets!",
