    ["无需多言，让我找找，水银、黄金、红宝石、黄铁矿，不，这都不与你崎岖的命运匹配。"] = "No need to say more. Let me see: mercury, gold, ruby, pyrite... no, none of these match your rugged fate.",
    ["无需引导"] = "No Need for Guidance",
