    ["无需输入"] = "No input required.",
    ["无非凡评分限制"] = "No Beyonder Rating limit",
    ["无非是让他们没日没夜的工作、鞭打、不给饭吃……毕竟他们没有父母。"] = "Nothing more than making them work day and night, whipping them, not feeding them... after all, they have no parents.",
