    ["无韵诗·下装"] = "Blank Verse · Bottom",
    ["既然《大冒险家》巡演难得来廷根一次，还是买票吧。"] = "Since 'The Great Adventurer' tour rarely comes to Tingen, I should buy a ticket.",
    ["既然他们的命这么轻……为什么不能换我的永生？我是在帮他们解脱！"] = "Since their lives are so light... why can't they be exchanged for my eternal life? I am helping them find release!",
    ["既然他向你开放了历史迷雾，你应该也能看到我们从这里——从霍伊大学历史系开始的过去。"] = "Since he opened the fog of history to you, you should also be able to see our past, starting from here—from the History Department of Hoy University.",
    ["既然你已经加入值夜者小队，一起看看最近发生的案件。"] = "Since you have joined the Nighthawks, let's take a look at the recent cases together.",
    ["既然你看出来了——那就亲自试试，什么叫保真。"] = "Since you've figured it out—then try for yourself what it means to be authentic.",
    ["既然你这么想知道，我愿意给好学的人一些优惠。只要五便士，我就带你整个廷根看一圈。"] = "Since you want to know so much, I am willing to give some discounts to those who are eager to learn. For just five pence, I will take you on a tour of the whole of Tingen.",
    ["既然决定了，就不再犹豫。"] = "Since I've decided, I won't hesitate anymore.",
    ["既然口碑这么差，我们干嘛要来这里？"] = "Since the reputation is so bad, why did we come here?",
    ["既然喜欢\r\n追求刺激"] = "Since you like\nchasing thrills",
    ["既然如此就只剩下最后一个问题，能够一直陪伴着奥斯瓦尔德，却没有被我找到的“它”，究竟是……"] = "Since that's the case, only one last question remains: what exactly is \"it\" that could always accompany Oswald but wasn't found by me...",
    ["既然如此，让我来教训教训你们！"] = "Since that's the case, let me teach you a lesson!",
    ["既然如此，那张<P_Yellow>显示第二题的书桌</>也值得回去再检查下了。"] = "Since that's the case, that <P_Yellow>desk showing the second question</> is also worth going back to check.",
    ["既然戒指对您这么重要——我必须找到！第一步，排查花海每个角落；第二步，翻土；第三步，筛土……"] = "Since the ring is so important to you—I must find it! First step, check every corner of the flower sea; second step, turn the soil; third step, sift the soil...",
    ["既然是为了罗珊的相亲，有什么我能帮忙的吗？"] = "Since it's for Rozanne's blind date, is there anything I can help with?",
    ["既然是免费，尝尝！"] = "Since it's free, I'll try it!",
    ["既然是全家的生日，你自己那份呢？"] = "Since it's the whole family's birthday, what about your own gift?",
    ["既然来了，就都留下来吧！"] = "Since you've come, stay here!",
    ["既然泽维尔先生鼓足勇气才第一次发出正式邀请，或许会选择更有特色的……"] = "Since Mr. Xavier mustered up the courage to make his first formal invitation, perhaps he would choose somewhere more distinctive...",
    ["既然线索的思路是对的……那破解故事的关键或许就是书上的两个仪式之一。"] = "Since the line of reasoning for the clues is correct... then the key to cracking the story might be one of the two rituals in the book.",
    ["既然要增加精确性，就需要足够稀有的特征。"] = "Since I need to increase precision, I need sufficiently rare characteristics.",
    ["既然这个世界只要怪物，那我就成为怪物！"] = "Since this world only wants monsters, then I will become a monster!",
    ["既然这么痛苦，为什么不试着勇敢一次？现在追她还来得及。"] = "Since it is so painful, why not try to be brave for once? It is not too late to go after her now.",
    ["既然这样，我教你神秘领域最简单常用，后续也最有前途的能力——<P_Yellow>灵视</>！"] = "Since that's the case, I'll teach you the simplest and most commonly used ability in the mysterious field, which also has the most potential for the future—<P_Yellow>spirit vision</>!",
    ["既然院长想让你宣传医院，不如讲讲医院的优势？ "] = "Since the director wants you to promote the hospital, why not talk about the hospital's strengths?",
