    ["日暮飓风持续期间，会交替向外发射六次扇形冲击波伤害，并且给冲击波命中的敌方附加一层衰败，持续6秒"] = "During the Sunset Hurricane duration, it will alternately fire six fan-shaped Shockwave attacks outward and apply one stack of Decay to enemies hit by the Shockwave, lasting 6 seconds.",
