    ["日记只记到了26号？下一页用赫密斯文写着“所有人都会死，包括我”，书页上还沾着血迹……"] = "The diary only records up to the 26th? The next page is written in Hermes: \"Everyone will die, including me,\" and there are bloodstains on the page...",
    ["日记本"] = "Diary",
    ["日记本似乎也是在这里找到的……应该是这位士兵的东西吧。"] = "The diary seems to have been found here too... It must belong to this soldier.",
