    ["旧城区的小巷四处都被垃圾堵塞，无法落脚。\r\n只有变成【】才能自由穿梭吧！"] = "The alleys in the Old City are blocked everywhere by trash, with nowhere to set foot.\nOnly by becoming 【】 can one move about freely!",
