    ["旧皮衣，煤油灯，还有一些面包和鹿肉……来自老猎人乔纳的慷慨馈赠，希望这些能帮上布雷登和他的战友们。"] = "Old leather jacket, kerosene lamp, and some bread and venison... A generous gift from the old hunter Jonah, hoping these will help Braden and his comrades.",
    ["旧皮衣，煤油灯，还有一些面包和鹿肉。"] = "An old leather jacket, a kerosene lamp, and some bread and venison.",
    ["旧相册"] = "Old Photo Album",
    ["旧观众"] = "Old audience",
    ["旧钱夹"] = "Old Wallet",
    ["旧钱夹里不论是零钱还是照片都破旧得有些脆弱，似乎许久没有人碰过；日记也只记录到三年前失去补给的绝境。"] = "The old wallet, whether it's the change or the photos, is worn out and somewhat fragile, as if no one has touched it for a long time; the diary only records the desperate situation of losing supplies three years ago.",
