    ["早上"] = "Morning",
    ["早上卖完这些，晚上还得去酒馆卖点坚果……"] = "After selling these in the morning, I still have to go to the tavern to sell nuts in the evening...",
    ["早上好"] = "Good morning",
    ["早上好 克莱恩"] = "Good morning, Klein",
    ["早上好，你看起来很急切？"] = "Good morning. You look quite anxious?",
    ["早上好，先生们，想买点什么？"] = "Good morning, gentlemen. Would you like to buy something?",
    ["早上好，奥利安娜太太，你每天都是这样美丽。"] = "Good morning, Mrs. Orianna, you are as beautiful as ever every day.",
    ["早上好，小克莱恩，班森回来了吗？"] = "Good morning, little Klein, is Benson back?",
    ["早上好，弗兰奇先生。"] = "Good morning, Mr. Franky.",
    ["早上好，斯林太太，我来买面包。"] = "Good morning, Mrs. Stin, I'm here to buy bread.",
    ["早上好，梅丽莎"] = "Good morning, Melissa",
    ["早上好，罗珊女士！你在看什么？"] = "Good morning, Ms. Rozanne! What are you reading?",
    ["早上好，莫雷蒂先生，您终于来俱乐部了。"] = "Good morning, Mr. Moretti. You've finally come to the club.",
    ["早上我和姐姐已经前来教堂许下了生日愿望，但我还有一个小小的请求！"] = "My sister and I already came to the church this morning to make our birthday wishes, but I have one more small request!",
    ["早上抓鱼的时候，捡到了一枚奇怪的硬币，我跑去镇里想要换些吃的。"] = "I found a strange coin while catching fish this morning, so I ran to town hoping to trade it for some food.",
    ["早上海纳斯提到，借助仪式魔法可以向不同的存在祈求帮助。"] = "Haines mentioned this morning that one can pray for help from different entities with the aid of Ritual Magic.",
    ["早安！南威尔咖啡今天第二杯半价！"] = "Good morning! The second cup of South Wales coffee is half price today!",
    ["早安！南威尔咖啡今天第二杯半价！虽然没迪西咖啡那么香，但提神效果一样好~"] = "Good morning! The second cup of Southwell Cafe is half price today! Although it's not as fragrant as Dici Cafe, the refreshing effect is just as good~",
    ["早安，莎莉丝特小姐，请不要调侃我。"] = "Good morning, Miss Celeste. Please don't tease me.",
    ["早就建议麦克斯在脖子上佩戴几枚泻根薄片预防中风。"] = "I suggested long ago that Max wear a few purgative root flakes around his neck to prevent a stroke.",
    ["早就建议麦克斯在脖子上佩戴几枚泻根薄片预防中风，他时常抽搐的手就是前兆。"] = "I suggested long ago that Max wear a few slices of hellebore root around his neck to prevent a stroke; his frequently twitching hands were a warning sign.",
    ["早就预订好了，今晚我们去老维尔餐厅，听说那边的老板很热情，一把年纪了还站在门口招待客人，我今天刚发了工资，这顿我请！"] = "It's already booked. Tonight we're going to Old Will's Restaurant. I heard the boss there is very enthusiastic; he's quite old but still stands at the door to greet guests. I just got my salary today, so this meal is on me!",
    ["早晚有一天，你们要倒霉！"] = "Sooner or later, you're going to be in trouble!",
    ["早晨%s点解锁升级"] = "Upgrade unlocks at %s AM",
    ["早晨祈祷的弟弟"] = "Brother Praying in the Morning",
    ["早点睡吧……"] = "Get some sleep early...",
    ["早知道你想问这个，我就不……唉……"] = "If I had known you wanted to ask this, I wouldn't have... sigh...",
    ["早知道就不在家多喝那杯咖啡了。"] = "I shouldn't have had that extra cup of coffee at home.",
    ["早知道这么多人，就带把椅子来。"] = "If I had known there were so many people, I would have brought a chair.",
    ["早知道那东西会把他害死，我就该打破砂锅问到底……或者干脆把他绑在猎龙帮。"] = "If I had known that thing would kill him, I should have gotten to the bottom of it... or just tied him to the Dragon Hunter Gang.",
    ["早说了别选他的课！"] = "I told you not to take his class!",
    ["早跟你说了，包赢的。"] = "I told you, it's a guaranteed win.",
