    ["时任白银城首席的科林.伊利亚特在戴里克·伯格的帮助下举行祈祷仪式，俯视着灰雾俯视着灵界的那古老宫殿内，“愚者”回应了祈求，降下了恩赐。"] = "Colin Iliad, the then-Chief of the City of Silver, held a prayer ritual with the help of Derrick Berg. Inside that ancient palace overlooking the gray fog and the spirit world, 'The Fool' responded to the plea and bestowed a gift.",
    ["时任白银城首席的科林·伊利亚特在戴里克·伯格的帮助下举行祈祷仪式，俯视着灰雾俯视着灵界的那古老宫殿内，“愚者”回应了祈求，降下了恩赐。"] = "The then-Chief of the City of Silver, Colin Iliad, held a prayer ceremony with the help of Derrick Berg. Inside that ancient palace overlooking the gray fog and the Spirit World, the 'Fool' responded to the prayer and bestowed a blessing.",
