    ["明天"] = "Tomorrow",
    ["明天……明天会来信的。"] = "Tomorrow... there will be a letter tomorrow.",
    ["明天下午。还有其他货的话，尽快送过来。"] = "Tomorrow afternoon. If you have any other goods, send them over as soon as possible.",
    ["明天也过来吧……"] = "Come by again tomorrow...",
    ["明天会有一些新的材料，可以到时候再来看看。"] = "There will be some new materials tomorrow; you can come back and take a look then.",
    ["明天你会来的，对吧？"] = "You'll come tomorrow, right?",
    ["明天后半夜，来墓园找我。记住，不要告诉任何人！"] = "Meet me at the cemetery in the second half of tomorrow night. Remember, don't tell anyone!",
    ["明天就是我的婚礼了，艾米莉亚，我美丽的女巫肯定又要生气——"] = "Tomorrow is my wedding day, Emilia, my beautiful witch will surely be angry again—",
    ["明天就要离开济贫院了，可我还没找到工作……"] = "I'm leaving the poorhouse tomorrow, but I haven't found a job yet...",
    ["明天我们也会像这样，把心意好好送出去的。"] = "Tomorrow we will send our feelings properly like this too.",
    ["明天我们还会一起来的，直到每份心意都送出去。希望他们收到时，能感到一点点开心。善良的{{先生|女士}}，愿女神保佑您。"] = "We will come back together tomorrow, until every gift has been delivered. I hope they feel a little bit of happiness when they receive them. Kind {{sir|madam}}, may the Goddess bless you.",
    ["明天我们还会一起来的，直到每份心意都送出去。希望他们收到时，能感到一点点开心。善良的{{先生|女士}}，愿女神保佑您。 "] = "We will come together again tomorrow until every gift is delivered. I hope they feel a little bit happy when they receive them. Kind {{Mr.|Ms.}}, may the Goddess bless you.",
    ["明天的呼唤"] = "Tomorrow's call",
    ["明天的我，会开出鹅黄色还是粉红色的小花呢？"] = "Will I bloom into a goose-yellow or pink flower tomorrow?",
    ["明天的选修课，要不要跟嘉妮一起讨论呢？"] = "Should I discuss tomorrow's elective course with Gani?",
    ["明天要见面的人超合拍，光想想就忍不住嘴角上扬！"] = "The person I'm meeting tomorrow is super compatible, just thinking about it makes the corners of my mouth lift!",
    ["明天见"] = "See you tomorrow",
    ["明天还要参加赛琳娜的生日宴会……"] = "I still have to attend Selena's birthday party tomorrow...",
    ["明天还要参加赛琳娜的生日宴会。"] = "I have to attend Selena's birthday party tomorrow.",
    ["明天醒来，我可能又会忘记，但没关系，南瓜田还在这里，老查克的烈酒还在卖，柯莱的孙女还在奔跑。 "] = "When I wake up tomorrow, I might forget again, but that's okay. The pumpkin field is still here, Old Chuck's liquor is still being sold, and Colley's granddaughter is still running.",
    ["明天，我感觉我明天的牌运会特别好！"] = "Tomorrow, I feel like my luck at cards tomorrow will be especially good!",
    ["明尔明斯克山脉"] = "Minminsk Mountains",
    ["明度"] = "Brightness",
    ["明心"] = "Clear Mind",
    ["明日的传奇，国王的幼子被异族驱赶，还面临缺少食粮的危机。"] = "The legend of tomorrow, the King's youngest son, is being driven away by aliens and faces a food shortage crisis.",
    ["明早校刊上头条：纵火家惨变哭包<P_Yellow>菜</>！"] = "Headline in tomorrow's school paper: Arsonist turns into a crybaby <P_Yellow>wimp</>!",
    ["明明今天截止！这不是重点，你是不是写书的时候又喝酒了？"] = "The deadline is today! That's not the point. Did you drink again while writing?",
    ["明明你才是新人，但我躺着，你站着，这显得我很弱。"] = "Even though you're the newcomer, the fact that I'm lying down while you're standing makes me look weak.",
    ["明明外面春光明媚，为何我却面如死灰，在不幸的阴影下徘徊？黑暗张开巨口，把可怜的唐泰斯吞噬。"] = "Why is it that even though the spring sun is shining brightly outside, I feel ashen-faced, wandering in the shadow of misfortune? The darkness opens its giant maw and swallows poor Dantès.",
    ["明明我们都来自同一个地方，一个遥远的故乡……"] = "Even though we both come from the same place, a distant hometown...",
    ["明明我家里有她最喜欢的童话绘本，还有甜甜的小饼干啊……"] = "I clearly have her favorite fairy tale picture book at home, and sweet little cookies too...",
    ["明明是你哭着喊着叫妈妈！"] = "It was clearly you who cried and called for your mommy!",
    ["明明空无一人，却总有一种被人盯着的感觉……"] = "Even though there's no one here, I always have the feeling of being watched...",
    ["明显不悦，耐心值可见地滑向低谷。"] = "Obviously displeased, patience is visibly sliding toward a low point.",
    ["明晚%02d:%02d"] = "Tomorrow night %02d:%02d",
    ["明智的选择。我会为您准备一杯这里的招牌。不必急着落座——四处走走，看看今晚的演出，回来时酒刚好醒到最佳状态。"] = "A wise choice. I'll prepare a signature drink for you. No need to rush to take a seat—walk around, watch the performance tonight, and by the time you return, the wine will have breathed to its best state.",
    ["明智，看来这案子已经超出你的范围了。"] = "Wise, it seems this case is already beyond your scope.",
    ["明灯增益"] = "Beacon Buff",
    ["明灯标记"] = "Beacon Mark",
    ["明牌"] = "Reveal Cards",
    ["明白了"] = "Understood",
    ["明白了。可以以这种规则试算平衡。"] = "Understood. We can try to balance the calculation using this rule.",
    ["明白了。米勒先生，表格填好后，请随格莱特先生过去，他会安排您的工作。"] = "Understood. Mr. Miller, after filling out the form, please go with Mr. Glet, he will arrange your work.",
    ["明白了，我来同幸存者交涉。"] = "Understood, I will negotiate with the survivor.",
    ["明白了，我来实现您的心愿！"] = "Understood, I will make your wish come true!",
