    ["昔日“王庭追猎者”的首领，誓死守卫王庭！"] = "The former leader of the \"Royal Court Hunter\", sworn to guard the Royal Court!",
    ["昔日的王庭追猎者，将自己的灵和巨人王宫殿的活化雕像绑定在了一起，如今依旧在门前忠诚地戍卫"] = "The former Royal Court Hunter bound his own spirit to the animated statues of the Giant King's palace, and he still faithfully guards the door today.",
