    ["星光"] = "Starlight",
    ["星光之力"] = "Starlight Power",
    ["星光之触"] = "Touch of Starlight",
    ["星光低垂，夜色铺展，它在城市的夜幕下悄然启程。流线般的车身映照着城市的轮廓，风声与灯影在身后交错成河，向道路的尽头疾驰而去。"] = "Starlight hangs low, the night spreads out, and it sets off quietly under the city's night veil. The streamlined body reflects the city's silhouette, with wind and lamplight intertwining into a river behind it, racing toward the end of the road.",
    ["星光凝聚一"] = "Starlight Condensation 1",
    ["星光凝聚二"] = "Starlight Condensation 2",
