    ["星光囚笼-法术代理"] = "Starlight Cage - Spell Proxy",
    ["星光守卫"] = "Starlight Guard",
    ["星光守卫与星象仪者距离过近！开始辐射"] = "The Starlight Guard and the Astrolabe User are too close! Radiation has begun",
    ["星光守卫降落产生的<Highlight>爆炸波</>可以通过<Highlight>跳跃</>躲避，并及时<Highlight>吸引仇恨</>远离星象仪者。"] = "The <Highlight>Explosion wave</> generated by the Starlight Guard's descent can be avoided by <Highlight>jumping</>. Promptly <Highlight>attract aggro</> and move away from the Astrolabe User.",
    ["星光守卫降落产生的<Highlight>爆炸波</>可以通过<Highlight>跳跃</>躲避，并及时转火，注意由<Highlight>战士</>吸引星光守卫的仇恨。击败后快速运送星光至星光烛台保存。"] = "The <Highlight>Explosion wave</> generated by the Starlight Guard's descent can be avoided by <Highlight>jumping</>. Promptly switch targets to attack, and ensure the <Highlight>Warrior</> attracts the Starlight Guard's aggro. After defeating it, quickly transport the Starlight to the Starlight Candlestick for safekeeping.",
    ["星光暗淡，希望变成了虚妄的幻想。切莫好高骛远，奇迹始于足下。"] = "The starlight is dim, and hope has become a delusional fantasy. Do not aim too high; miracles start from your feet.",
