    ["星痕的旅途"] = "Journey of Star Marks",
    ["星盘占卜真是繁琐复杂，就没有更好的推算办法吗？"] = "Astrolabe divination is so tedious and complex; isn't there a better way to calculate?",
    ["星盘的启迪"] = "Enlightenment of the Star Chart",
    ["星盘的裁断"] = "Judgment of the Star Chart",
    ["星盘的辉光在步履下徐徐展开，无人知晓你的前路通往何处，但星辰永远在细数你的步伐。"] = "The glow of the astrolabe unfolds slowly beneath your steps; no one knows where your path leads, but the stars are always counting your footsteps.",
