    ["星空"] = "Starry Sky",
    ["星空为被，大地为床，篝火旁藏着冒险的梦想。"] = "The starry sky as a quilt, the earth as a bed; dreams of adventure hide beside the campfire.",
    ["星空俯视者"] = "Starry Sky Observer",
    ["星空洪流"] = "Starry Sky Torrent",
    ["星空派"] = "Starry Sky Pie",
    ["星空派（大）"] = "Starry Sky Pie (Large)",
    ["星空派（小）"] = "Starry Sky Pie (Small)",
    ["星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "The starry sky is vast, and all doors lead to it. May the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "The starry sky is vast, and all doors lead to it. Wearing this body, may the starlight of the journey guide you to never be lost.",
    ["星空爆破"] = "Starry Blast",
    ["星空能量"] = "Starry Sky Energy",
