    ["星落"] = "Starfall",
    ["星落爆炸"] = "Starfall Explosion",
    ["星象之杖"] = "Astrological Staff",
    ["星象仪者"] = "Astrolabe User",
    ["星象仪者-1星"] = "Astrolabe User - 1 Star",
    ["星象仪者-2星"] = "Astrolabe User - 2 Star",
    ["星象仪者-3星"] = "Astrolabe User - 3 Star",
    ["星象仪者召唤陨石，<Disable>每位玩家</>会吸引一颗陨石，陨石落地后造成爆炸伤害。"] = "The Astrolabe User summons meteorites; <Disable> each player </> will attract one, which deals Explosion damage upon landing.",
    ["星象仪者吸收星光之力，攻击力提升"] = "The Astrolabe User absorbs Starlight Power, increasing attack power",
    ["星象仪者在<Disable>每位玩家</>身后召唤一枚飞弹，对飞行路径上的角色造成伤害。"] = "The Astrolabe User summons a missile behind <Disable> each player </>, dealing damage to characters along the flight path.",
    ["星象仪者在血量降低至<Disable>10%</>时，若<Disable>未集齐9枚</>星光之力，将无法打断星象仪者汇聚群星力量，完成引导后对全场造成巨额伤害。<Disable>狂暴时</>无法打断。"] = "When the Astrolabe User's Health drops to <Disable> 10% </>, if <Disable> 9 pieces of Starlight Power have not been collected </>, it will be impossible to interrupt the Astrolabe User as they gather the power of the stars. After completing the channeling, they will deal massive damage to the entire field. This cannot be interrupted while <Disable> Berserk </>.",
    ["星象仪者在进入二阶段时，会召唤巨大陨石砸向场中，生成持续的风压和扩散波，碰到扩散波时会被击退，若接触到场地边缘会立即死亡。"] = "When the Astrolabe User enters the second phase, they will summon a giant meteorite to crash into the field, generating continuous wind pressure and diffusion waves. Touching a diffusion wave will knock the player back; if they touch the edge of the field, they will die instantly.",
    ["星象仪者庞大的身躯缓缓倒地，力量也开始消弭，知识皇冠的影子浮现在半空，随后一同溃散。紧接着庄园深处躁动不止，依稀露出了几个人影。"] = "The Astrolabe User's massive body slowly falls to the ground, and its power begins to dissipate. The shadow of a crown of knowledge appears in mid-air, then collapses along with it. Immediately after, the depths of the manor become restless, faintly revealing a few figures.",
    ["星象仪者强制将所有人拉拽至身前并召唤陨石，<Disable>每位玩家</>会吸引一颗陨石，陨石落地后造成爆炸伤害。"] = "The Astrolabe User forcibly pulls everyone toward them and summons meteorites; <Disable> each player </> will attract one, which deals Explosion damage upon landing.",
    ["星象仪者碎片"] = "Astrolabe User Fragment",
    ["星象仪者血量在60%以下时进入<Disable>阶段二</>，星象仪者持续吸引星光守卫降落。击杀星光守卫后会<Disable>掉落星光</>，<Disable>触碰后</>可暂时吸收星光，期间无法使用技能，可以运送至星光烛台进行<Disable>保存</>，完成运送后获得伤害提升。若<Disable>限定时间</>内星光未由星光烛台保存，则会<Disable>被星象仪者吸收</>，提升伤害。"] = "When the Astrolabe User's Health drops below 60%, they enter <Disable> Phase 2 </>, continuously attracting Starlight Guards to descend. After killing a Starlight Guard, it will <Disable> drop Starlight </>. <Disable> Touching it </> allows for temporary absorption of Starlight; during this time, skills cannot be used, and it can be transported to a Starlight Candelabra for <Disable> storage </>. Completing the delivery grants a Damage Increase. If the Starlight is not stored in the Starlight Candelabra within the <Disable> time limit </>, it will <Disable> be absorbed by the Astrolabe User </>, increasing their damage.",
    ["星象仪者通过<Disable>知识禁制</>囚禁一名玩家并辐射周围造成伤害，若未在限定时间内<Disable>击破</>禁制，该玩家将会<Disable>死亡</>。"] = "The Astrolabe User imprisons a player via <Disable> Knowledge Restriction </> and radiates damage to the surroundings. If the restriction is not <Disable> broken </> within the time limit, the player will <Disable> die </>.",
    ["星象仪者通过<Disable>知识禁制</>囚禁两名玩家，若未在限定时间内<Disable>击破</>禁制，该玩家将会<Disable>死亡</>。"] = "The Astrolabe User imprisons two players via <Disable> Knowledge Restriction </>. If the restriction is not <Disable> broken </> within the time limit, the players will <Disable> die </>.",
    ["星象仪者释放流星飞弹时对全场玩家追加一枚飞弹。"] = "When the Astrolabe User releases Meteor Missile, an additional missile is added for all players on the field.",
    ["星象仪者释放流星飞弹时，会在场边向所有玩家额外发射一枚流星飞弹。"] = "When the Astrolabe User casts Meteor Missile, they will fire an additional Meteor Missile at all players from the edge of the field.",
    ["星象占卜一般结果"] = "Astrological divination general result",
    ["星象占卜坏结果"] = "Astrology Divination Bad Result",
