    ["星象师"] = "Constellations Master",
    ["星象师魔药"] = "Astrologist Potion",
    ["星象平稳，无明显噩兆，亦无强烈指引。命运未曾阻拦，前方之路交予你来决定去向。"] = "The astrology is stable, with no obvious omens or strong guidance. Fate has not blocked your path; the way forward is yours to decide.",
    ["星象明朗，命运之轮正朝着你期望的方向转动。此刻出发，一切顺利。"] = "The astrology is clear, and the Wheel of Fortune is turning in the direction you desire. Set off now, and everything will go smoothly.",
    ["星象晦暗，群星偏移。命运发出了不容忽视的警示。此时行事，需格外谨慎。"] = "The astrology is dim, and the stars are misaligned. Fate has issued a warning that cannot be ignored. Proceed with extreme caution at this time.",
