    ["星辰早已写下答案，只看你是否愿意倾听。"] = "The stars have long since written the answer; it only depends on whether you are willing to listen.",
    ["星辰此刻正为我排列成一道璀璨的桥梁，近日将有一个期盼已久的契机悄然降临，记得大胆伸手迎接。"] = "The stars are currently aligning into a brilliant bridge for me. A long-awaited opportunity will quietly arrive in the coming days; remember to reach out boldly to welcome it.",
