    ["春夜沙龙"] = "Spring Night Salon",
    ["春夜沙龙……一个贵族死在那里，死因还这么\"特别\"。"] = "Spring Night Salon... A noble died there, and the cause of death was so 'special'.",
    ["春夜沙龙……一个贵族死在那里，死因还这么特别。"] = "Spring Night Salon... A noble died there, and the cause of death was so special.",
    ["春夜沙龙中，神秘女士的画像引得众人神魂颠倒。为了调查画像，你意外进入了画中世界、化身成罗塞尔大帝，还在其间邂逅了仰慕大帝的佳人卢娜。在一连串的引逗与追逐后，你惊奇地发现了卢娜的另一面，揭开了她惹人怜爱的身世和苦恼，更得到了与她共度良宵的机会。谁知，良宵过后，镜中的卢娜竟然展露了男性的脸庞——他其实是一名男人变成的魔女！最终，你清醒过来，击败了卢娜，也烧毁了那幅危险的画像。"] = "In the Spring Night Salon, the portrait of a mysterious lady leaves everyone infatuated. To investigate the portrait, you accidentally enter the world within the painting, transforming into Emperor Roselle, and encounter Luna, a beauty who admires the Emperor. After a series of teases and chases, you are surprised to discover another side of Luna, uncovering her pitiful background and troubles, and even gaining the opportunity to spend a night with her. Who would have thought that after the night, the Luna in the mirror would reveal a man's face—he was actually a Witch transformed from a man! In the end, you wake up, defeat Luna, and burn the dangerous portrait.",
    ["春夜沙龙点位"] = "Spring Night Salon location",
    ["春夜沙龙的主人，你可以叫我维拉夫人。"] = "I am the owner of the Spring Night Salon; you may call me Madam Vera.",
    ["春夜沙龙门-终点-防穿帮"] = "Spring Night Salon Door - Destination - Anti-Clipping",
    ["春夜沙龙门口重生点"] = "Respawn point at the entrance of Spring Night Salon",
    ["春夜的舞者正在寻找同伴，一份芬芳的邀请函等待着你。"] = "The dancer of the spring night is looking for a companion; a fragrant invitation is waiting for you.",
    ["春夜舞会"] = "Spring Night Ball",
    ["春夜舞会· 正式邀请函"] = "Spring Night Ball Official Invitation",
    ["春夜舞会侍奉着不幸与美丽的化身，我们相信，唯有经历过灾厄的洗礼，才能绽放出最璀璨的花朵。"] = "The Spring Night Ball serves the avatar of misfortune and beauty. We believe that only by being baptized through disaster can the most brilliant flowers bloom.",
    ["春夜舞会光环怪"] = "Spring Night Ball Aura Monster",
    ["春夜舞会在哪"] = "Where is the Spring Night Ball",
    ["春夜舞会引导trigger"] = "Spring Night Ball Guide Trigger",
    ["春夜舞会拒绝魅惑"] = "Spring Night Ball refuse Charm",
    ["春夜舞会教团等级奖励"] = "Spring Night Ball faction level reward",
    ["春夜舞会教团获取"] = "Obtained from Spring Night Ball",
    ["春夜舞会教团警告邮件"] = "Spring Night Ball Order Warning Email",
    ["春夜舞会斗舞失败"] = "Spring Night Ball dance battle failure",
    ["春夜舞会斗舞成功"] = "Spring Night Ball dance battle success",
    ["春夜舞会是由原初魔女的追随者组建的教团，他们相信真正的力量源于无可抵挡的魅力。"] = "The Spring Night Ball is a cult formed by followers of the Primordial Demoness, who believe that true power stems from irresistible charm.",
    ["春夜舞会是由原初魔女的追随者组建的教团，他们相信真正的力量源于无可抵挡的魅力。教团成员穿梭于各界宴会，以容貌为武器，在眼神中令他人沉沦，将倾倒的目光化作为最痴迷的锋刃。"] = "The Spring Night Ball is a cult founded by followers of the Primordial Demoness. They believe that true power stems from irresistible charm. Cult members shuttle through banquets of all circles, using their appearance as a weapon, making others fall into their eyes, and turning the captivated gazes into the most obsessive blades.",
    ["春夜舞会等级奖励"] = "Spring Night Ball level reward",
    ["春夜舞会等级达到10级"] = "Spring Night Ball reaches level 10",
    ["春夜舞会等级达到5级"] = "Spring Night Ball reaches level 5",
    ["春夜舞会等级达到7级"] = "Spring Night Ball reaches level 7",
    ["春夜舞会获取"] = "Obtained from Spring Night Ball",
    ["春夜舞会？"] = "Spring Night Ball?",
    ["春天"] = "Spring",
    ["春天的婚礼"] = "Spring Wedding",
    ["春天的婚礼cs预加载"] = "Spring Wedding cs preload",
    ["春天的婚礼dialog预加载"] = "Spring Wedding dialog pre-load",
    ["春天见"] = "See You in Spring",
    ["春天？"] = "Spring?",
    ["春日一角"] = "A Corner of Spring",
    ["春日之约1"] = "Spring Appointment 1",
    ["春日便利店"] = "Spring Convenience Store",
    ["春羽"] = "Chunyu",
    ["昨夜的对话"] = "Last night's conversation",
    ["昨天"] = "Yesterday",
    ["昨天人被捞起来的时候已经肿得看不出身份了。"] = "When the body was fished out yesterday, it was already too bloated to be identified.",
    ["昨天刚扔了玫瑰花进来，今天没有花，明天再给你带！"] = "I just threw a rose in yesterday; there are no flowers today, I'll bring you some tomorrow!",
    ["昨天在山上看到的人，一定是幻觉吧？"] = "The person I saw on the mountain yesterday must have been a hallucination, right?",
    ["昨天我去踩了点，枪架好了，改装货，带瞄准镜。"] = "I scouted the location yesterday, the rifle is set up, a modified piece with a scope.",
    ["昨天我和伦纳德解救小艾略特的地方，就在绑匪房间的对面，但当时我并没有察觉。"] = "The place where Leonard and I rescued little Elliott yesterday was right across from the kidnappers' room, but I didn't notice it at the time.",
    ["昨天我在水池前虔诚祷告的时候，水池竟然说话了！"] = "Yesterday, when I was praying devoutly in front of the fountain, the fountain actually spoke!",
    ["昨天我就没有排到，今天不知道有没有您这样的口福。"] = "I didn't get in line yesterday, I don't know if I'll have the good fortune like you today.",
    ["昨天我离开韦尔奇家后，就直接回了公寓，然后一直在准备讲师工作的面试……"] = "After I left Welch's house yesterday, I went straight back to the apartment and have been preparing for my lecturer interview ever since...",
    ["昨天我读完有关她的三部曲，据说秘密都藏在湖对岸的森林，想不想去看看？"] = "Yesterday I finished reading the trilogy about her. It's said that the secrets are all hidden in the forest on the other side of the lake. Do you want to go take a look?",
    ["昨天我躺在床上时，你说的那些话我都听到了。"] = "I heard everything you said while I was lying in bed yesterday.",
    ["昨天我还是一粒种子，今天我就要发芽啦。"] = "Yesterday I was a seed, today I am going to sprout.",
    ["昨天捞到了一捧玫瑰花，今天能捞出什么呢？"] = "I fished out a bouquet of roses yesterday; what can I fish out today?",
    ["昨天旅馆有警察来搜查房间，深夜还有人潜入转了一圈。"] = "Police came to search the rooms at the hotel yesterday, and someone snuck in to look around late at night.",
    ["昨天早上在占卜俱乐部遇到海纳斯时，他给我的名片上有地址。"] = "When I met Haines at the Divination Club yesterday morning, his business card had his address on it.",
    ["昨天晚上又闷又热，那架风车居然在转动，奇怪吧？明明一丝风都没有。"] = "It was stuffy and hot last night, and that windmill was actually turning, strange right? Even though there wasn't a breath of wind.",
    ["昨天比赛睡太久，晚上失眠了。"] = "I slept too long after yesterday's competition, and had insomnia last night.",
    ["昨天琳达在这里上用一击绝杀击倒了布雷德，今天面对贝尔，她又将有什么样的表现？"] = "Yesterday Linda knocked out Blade with a single finishing blow here; today, facing Bell, what kind of performance will she have?",
    ["昨天的金梧桐区可热闹了……"] = "Golden Treetop District was so lively yesterday...",
    ["昨天的金梧桐区可热闹了，有位贵族老爷被他的情人赶出了家门，全身上下就只有一条毛巾！"] = "Golden Tindle Borough was very lively yesterday; a noble gentleman was kicked out of his house by his lover, with only a towel on his whole body!",
    ["昨天管家告诉我物色到了新的花园别墅，我想先租住一年看看……"] = "The butler told me yesterday that he found a new garden villa. I think I'll rent it for a year to see...",
    ["昨天被雷劈了三个，然后社会性死亡了一二三四……数不过来了。"] = "Yesterday, three people were struck by lightning, and then social death occurred for one, two, three, four... I've lost count.",
    ["昨天讲那个鬼故事太可怕了，我晚上好久都没睡着…… "] = "The ghost story told yesterday was so scary, I couldn't fall asleep for a long time last night...",
    ["昨天还清醒健康的人，也反复确认过没有任何邪灵的遗留，过段时间就有可能把自己掐死在家里。"] = "Someone who was sober and healthy yesterday, and who we repeatedly confirmed had no remnants of evil spirits, could potentially strangle themselves at home after some time.",
    ["昨天？昨天我留在旅馆读书，没有出门呀。"] = "Yesterday? I stayed at the hotel reading yesterday and didn't go out.",
    ["昨日南瓜"] = "Yesterday's Pumpkins",
    ["昨晚他搂着南威尔士啤酒喊了十七次“宝贝”，对我就一句“晚安”！"] = "Last night he hugged a South Wales beer and shouted 'Baby' seventeen times, but for me, he only said 'Goodnight' once!",
    ["昨晚他搂着威士忌喊了十七次“宝贝”，对我就一句“晚安”！"] = "Last night, he hugged his whiskey and shouted 'baby' seventeen times, but for me, it was just a 'good night'!",
    ["昨晚发生了什么？"] = "What happened last night?",
    ["昨晚回家的路上，有陌生人一直跟踪我……"] = "On my way home last night, a stranger kept following me...",
    ["昨晚好几道聚光灯“唰”地打过来，把晚上照得跟白天一样。紧接着，我听到“砰”的一声巨大枪响！"] = "Several spotlights flashed on last night, lighting up the night like day. Immediately after, I heard a loud gunshot!",
    ["昨晚我半夜醒来发现自己在家里，但书桌上有手枪、屋里有血迹，看起来像是经历了一场……自杀。"] = "I woke up in the middle of last night and found myself at home, but there was a pistol on my desk and blood in the room. It looked like I had experienced a... suicide.",
    ["昨晚我接了个新活，给工地搬砖头搬到半夜才回家，但心里还是只有斗邪恶。"] = "Last night I took a new job, moving bricks at the construction site until midnight before going home, but my heart was still only on fighting evil.",
    ["昨晚我睡到半夜，被窗外亮得刺眼的光照醒，还以为天亮了……"] = "I was sleeping in the middle of the night last night when I was woken up by a blinding light outside the window. I thought it was dawn...",
    ["昨晚那辆警车把主路堵得死死的，你居然能在五连发夹弯超过去！"] = "That police car blocked the main road last night, and you still managed to overtake it through five consecutive hairpin turns!",
    ["昨晚那辆警车把主路堵得死死的，你居然能在五连发夹弯超过去！ "] = "That police car blocked the main road completely last night, yet you managed to overtake it at the five consecutive hairpins!",
    ["昨晚，你真美。"] = "Last night, you were truly beautiful.",
    ["昨晚，我把它扔在古堡，以为终于摆脱了它……可它……"] = "Last night, I threw it in the old castle, thinking I had finally gotten rid of it... but it...",
    ["昭示着“死亡”本身的临近，将东线的敌人引向死亡的怀抱。占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "Signifying the approach of \"Death\" itself, leading enemies on the eastern front into the embrace of death. After occupying, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp and gain 20 resources per minute.",
    ["昭示着“死亡”本身的临近，将西线的敌人引向死亡的怀抱。占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "Signifying the approach of \"Death\" itself, leading enemies on the western front into the embrace of death. After occupying, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp and gain 20 resources per minute.",
    ["昭通"] = "Zhaotong",
    ["是"] = "Yes",
    ["是 我会尽力的"] = "Yes, I will try my best.",
    ["是#CanMove 猫 #。"] = "It is #CanMove a cat #.",
    ["是<P_Yellow>那个人</>为了让白莉夫人相信自己就是书中的“侠盗黑皇帝”。这是一个骗局！"] = "Is for <P_Yellow> that person </> to make Lady Beryl believe that he is the \"Phantom Thief Black Emperor\" from the book. This is a scam!",
    ["是<h>老维尔</>先生！"] = "It's Mr. <h>Old Neil</>!",
    ["是{{PlayerName}}{{哥哥|姐姐}}！我姐姐去训练了，她给你留了一封信。"] = "It's {{PlayerName}}{{Brother|Sister}}! My sister went to train, and she left a letter for you.",
    ["是{{PlayerName}}……？怎么这时候过来了？"] = "Is it {{PlayerName}}...? Why did you come over at this time?",
    ["是“愚者”先生救了我？还是要小心一点。"] = "Did Mr. Fool save me? Still, I should be careful.",
    ["是“最后一页”，那个封印物又在叫我了。"] = "It's the \"Last Page,\" that Sealed Artifact is calling to me again.",
    ["是……一家做古物寻找、收集和安保的公司，他们需要专业的顾问。"] = "It's... a company that handles the searching, collection, and security of antiques. They need professional consultants.",
    ["是……乔纳尔医生，他来为我治疗高烧。他让所有人都出去，说有一种特殊的办法，可以让我梦见艾德蒙。我同意他的提议，将食指伸进那个环里……"] = "It's... Dr. Jonar, he came to treat my high fever. He asked everyone to leave, saying there was a special way to make me dream of Edmund. I agreed to his proposal and put my index finger into that ring...",
    ["是……尸体？！"] = "Is that... a corpse?!",
    ["是……是……抱歉先生……我们会抓紧时间……"] = "Yes... yes... sorry, sir... we will hurry...",
    ["是……是爸爸错了。不该什么都想打开。"] = "It's... it's Dad's fault. I shouldn't have wanted to open everything.",
    ["是……是谁在说话？"] = "Who... who is speaking?",
    ["是……煤气灯？"] = "Is that... a gas lamp?",
    ["是……霍伊大学文学系，但是我这大学上的啊，<P_Heart>（自嘲一笑）</>越上越想退学……"] = "Yes... Department of Literature at Hoey University, but this university life of mine... <P_Heart> (Self-deprecating smile) </> the more I go, the more I want to drop out...",
    ["是、是、老爷。要不…要不咱们回马车上等夫人？"] = "Y-yes, sir. How about... how about we go back to the carriage and wait for the lady?",
    ["是、是吗……我会考虑的！谢谢您的建议，也愿女神庇佑您！"] = "Is, is that so... I'll consider it! Thank you for your advice, and may the Goddess protect you too!",
    ["是、是的！店主先生是个好人……他说，有声音总比沉默强，对生意，对我……都是。"] = "Y-yes! The shopkeeper is a good man... He said that having sound is better than silence; for the business, and for me... it's better.",
    ["是。"] = "Yes.",
    ["是一个小孩……原来只是被窗口挡住了。"] = "It's a child... so it was just blocked by the window.",
    ["是一份乐谱"] = "It's a musical score",
    ["是一名叫阿兹克的教员，我和他关系很好。这么久没联系，不知道那家伙怎么样了。"] = "It's an instructor named Azik, I have a good relationship with him. It's been so long since we contacted, I wonder how that guy is doing.",
    ["是一块怀表！"] = "It's a pocket watch!",
    ["是一扇大铁门.......非常巨大，有整个教堂那么大，里面黑洞洞、阴森森的，风一吹就吱嘎吱嘎响。我当时吓呆了，事后甚至怀疑那是幻觉！"] = "It was a large iron gate... It was huge, as big as the entire church. Inside, it was pitch black and eerie, creaking whenever the wind blew. I was terrified at the time, and later I even suspected it was a hallucination!",
    ["是一扇大铁门…….非常巨大，有整个教堂那么大，里面黑洞洞、阴森森的，风一吹就吱嘎吱嘎响。我当时吓呆了，事后甚至怀疑那是幻觉！"] = "It was a large iron door... very huge, as big as the entire church, pitch black and eerie inside, creaking whenever the wind blew. I was terrified at the time, and afterwards, I even suspected it was a hallucination!",
    ["是一扇大铁门……非常巨大，有整个教堂那么大，里面黑洞洞、阴森森的，风一吹就吱嘎吱嘎响。我当时吓呆了，事后甚至怀疑那是幻觉！"] = "It's a large iron door... very huge, as big as the entire cathedral. Inside, it's pitch black and eerie, and it creaks whenever the wind blows. I was terrified at the time, and afterwards, I even suspected it was a hallucination!",
    ["是一支用金属做成的烟斗。看到那东西的人会立刻陷入幻觉，听见晦涩难懂的呓语，传闻与罗塞尔大帝笔记里的文字有关。"] = "It's a pipe made of metal. Anyone who sees it immediately falls into hallucinations and hears obscure, unintelligible whispers. Rumor has it that it's related to the text in Emperor Roselle's diary.",
    ["是一条小蛇！"] = "It's a little snake!",
    ["是不是应该在场景表加列支持"] = "Should a column be added to the scene table for support?",
    ["是不是感觉好一点了？"] = "Do you feel a bit better?",
    ["是不是我们这种命苦的人，一生就注定要过那种辛苦的生活，就应该腐烂在工厂里？"] = "Is it that people like us, who have such bitter fates, are destined to live such hard lives, and are meant to rot in the factory?",
    ["是不是我们这种命苦的人，一生就注定过要过那种辛苦的生活，就应该腐烂在工厂里？"] = "Are people like us, who have such hard lives, destined to live such difficult lives forever, and should we just rot in the factory?",
    ["是个不错的选择。"] = "That's a good choice.",
    ["是个人都能看出来这不合理，分手吧！"] = "Anyone can see this is unreasonable. Break up!",
    ["是个可靠的人。"] = "He is a reliable person.",
    ["是个喜欢给人开膛破肚的变态。"] = "A pervert who likes to disembowel people.",
    ["是个好主意，先生。放心，猫和狗之间应该不会发生您不愿看到的事情。"] = "That's a good idea, sir. Don't worry, nothing you wouldn't want to see should happen between a cat and a dog.",
    ["是个笨蛋，错把运气当实力，送新财路来了。"] = "He's an idiot who mistook luck for skill and brought us a new way to make money.",
    ["是为了赞美，不普通的大帝。"] = "It is to praise the extraordinary Emperor.",
    ["是么，那就好办了。"] = "Is that so? Then that makes things easier.",
    ["是乌云！你根本没好好听故事！"] = "It was dark clouds! You weren't listening to the story properly at all!",
    ["是乌龟"] = "It's a turtle",
    ["是九百三十七便士……"] = "It's nine hundred and thirty-seven pence...",
    ["是人偶"] = "It's a doll",
    ["是什么人！报告姓名！"] = "Who goes there! State your name!",
    ["是什么发出的声音？"] = "What made that sound?",
    ["是什么鸟？"] = "What kind of bird is it?",
    ["是什么？"] = "What is it?",
    ["是他们打伤的？"] = "Did they cause the injuries?",
    ["是他们？！梦里的那对兄妹？"] = "Is it them?! That pair of siblings from the dream?",
    ["是他把讲卫生的观念植入居民心中，让贫民窟的居民，也能相对洁净地生活。"] = "It was he who implanted the concept of hygiene into the minds of the residents, allowing even those in the slums to live relatively cleanly.",
    ["是他的记忆……"] = "It's his memory...",
    ["是他逝去的未婚妻的发丝，那个勇敢的姑娘在弗萨克战争中去世了，我的客户先生寻找了她很多年。"] = "It is the hair of his late fiancée. That brave girl died in the Feysac war, and my client has been searching for her for many years.",
    ["是他？！"] = "Is it him?!",
    ["是他？！梦里那个小女孩的哥哥？"] = "Is it him?! The older brother of the little girl from the dream?",
    ["是伦纳德先生特意为你准备的。"] = "It was prepared especially for you by Mr. Leonard.",
    ["是位不认识的女士……？"] = "A lady I don't recognize...?",
    ["是你们啊……想要夺走家人……坏蛋……"] = "It's you... wanting to take away my family... bad people...",
    ["是你制造了梦境？不眠者途径？难不成是教会的神职人员？"] = "Did you create the dream? Sleepless pathway? Could it be a member of the church?",
    ["是你吗？你来见我了吗？"] = "Is it you? Have you come to see me?",
    ["是你呀！终于有人能来和我聊天了！"] = "It's you! Finally someone can come and chat with me!",
    ["是你告诉我 冬天过后 将会迎来春天"] = "It was you who told me that after winter, spring would come.",
    ["是你喜欢的姑娘吗？"] = "Is she a girl you like?",
    ["是你在夜晚梦游，捡回了这只怀表。"] = "It was you who sleepwalked at night and retrieved this pocket watch.",
    ["是你在说话？一只说话的……狗？！"] = "Are you the one talking? A talking... dog?!",
    ["是你在这……拉琴？"] = "Are you the one... playing the violin here?",
    ["是你手抄的那首曲子"] = "It's the piece you hand-copied.",
    ["是你把我召唤出来的吗？"] = "Did you summon me?",
    ["是你杀了他！"] = "You killed him!",
    ["是你杀了贾斯汀！"] = "You killed Justin!",
    ["是你！猎龙帮的人！"] = "It's you! Someone from the Dragon Hunter Gang!",
    ["是你，就是你，除去耀眼的你，我还能呼唤谁？"] = "It's you, it's you, besides the dazzling you, who else can I call?",
    ["是你，我找到了一些线索，可能廷根湖那居住的人来到了这附近。"] = "It's you. I found some clues; it's possible that the people living at Tingen Lake have come to this vicinity.",
    ["是你，我的孩子……"] = "It is you, my child...",
    ["是你？为什么冲着我吐痰？"] = "It's you? Why are you spitting at me?",
    ["是保罗……"] = "It's Paul...",
    ["是信息洪流造成的攻击，看来月亮仆从发现我们的行动了，正在阻止我们！"] = "It's an attack caused by a Torrent of Information. It seems the Moon Servant has discovered our actions and is trying to stop us!",
    ["是倒霉蛋"] = "Is a loser",
    ["是兄弟来帮我"] = "Brothers, come help me",
    ["是先去豪尔斯街的时尚沙龙……"] = "Should I go to the fashion salon on Howls Street first...",
    ["是克莱恩·莫雷蒂先生吗？"] = "Is this Mr. Klein Moretti?",
    ["是刚刚那个邮差放在这里的？"] = "Did the postman from earlier leave it here?",
    ["是刚才那个人留下的？他一个人在会议室里做什么？"] = "Was it left by that person just now? What was he doing alone in the Conference Room?",
    ["是刚才那位女士留下的，帕子上还残留着她的玫瑰香气。"] = "It was left behind by the lady from earlier, and her rose scent still lingers on the handkerchief.",
    ["是占坑，看到快提醒鸦师傅去改"] = "Placeholder, remind Master Crow to change it when you see it.",
    ["是卡萝队长的遗物，它怎么会在这里……这就是你的任务？"] = "It's Captain Carol's relic. How could it be here... Is this your quest?",
    ["是口琴！我绝不会听错！四处都回荡着口琴声，却见不到吹琴的人……"] = "It's a harmonica! I couldn't have misheard! The sound of the harmonica echoes everywhere, yet I cannot see the person playing it...",
    ["是右边啦。"] = "It's the right side.",
    ["是吗……"] = "Is that so...",
    ["是吗……他还是没来见我。"] = "Is that so... He still didn't come to see me.",
    ["是吗……你得发誓……"] = "Is that so... you have to swear...",
    ["是吗……？"] = "Is that so...?",
    ["是吗，你可以准备好在未来付出对等的的代价了……呵呵，我开玩笑的。"] = "Is that so? You can prepare to pay an equivalent price in the future... hehe, I'm just joking.",
    ["是吗，我还以为是副队长呢！他还发过誓，要亲手击毙那个残忍的杀手。"] = "Is that so? I thought it was the Vice-Captain! He even swore he would personally shoot that cruel killer.",
    ["是吗？"] = "Is that so?",
    ["是吗？你的表情可不是这么说的。"] = "Is that so? Your expression says otherwise.",
    ["是吗？我也从来不劈人。"] = "Is that so? I also never strike people with lightning.",
    ["是吗？我倒要看看，大名鼎鼎的侦探阁下能把我怎么样？"] = "Is that so? I'd like to see what the famous detective can do to me.",
    ["是吗？我去看看"] = "Really? I'll go take a look",
    ["是吗？我的确很同情黛西小姐的遭遇。"] = "Is that so? I do sympathize with Miss Daisy's plight.",
    ["是吗？谢谢，谢谢，我这就去看看小姐。"] = "Really? Thank you, thank you, I'll go see the young lady right now.",
    ["是吗？这样啊……你的家人来接你了……我做错事了对吗？我不知道，没有人告诉过我……"] = "Is that so? I see... Your family has come to pick you up... I did something wrong, right? I don't know, no one ever told me...",
    ["是吗？那你在此处不要走动。"] = "Is that so? Then don't move from there.",
