    ["是否重置%s数据？"] = "Are you sure you want to reset the %s data?",
    ["是否重置为官方推荐方案，该操作将立刻生效"] = "Reset to the official recommended scheme? This operation will take effect immediately.",
    ["是否重置当前节点进度，此节点之后的所有节点也会被同时重置"] = "Do you want to reset the progress of the current node? All nodes after this one will also be reset simultaneously.",
    ["是否重置当前设置？"] = "Are you sure you want to reset the current settings?",
