    ["是否重置本页选项？"] = "Do you want to reset the options on this page?",
    ["是否随机一次buff后分配给所有目标"] = "Randomize buff once and assign to all targets",
    ["是否随机生效"] = "Random Activation",
    ["是否隐藏头顶信息"] = "Hide Overhead Info",
    ["是否隐藏所有地图Tag"] = "Whether to hide all map Tags",
    ["是否隐藏职业挂件"] = "Hide class accessory",
    ["是否额外判断layer刷新的buff ins的始作俑者id是否和当前在监听的实体ctx的始作俑者id一致， bool默认值是false"] = "Whether to additionally judge if the instigator ID of the Buff instance refreshed by the layer is consistent with the instigator ID of the entity ctx currently being listened to; bool default is false",
    ["是否验证角色名字的长度以及是否重复"] = "Whether to verify the length of the character name and whether it is a duplicate",
    ["是呀 妈妈怎么会丢下我的宝贝小珍妮呢"] = "Yes, how could Mom leave my precious little Jenny behind?",
    ["是呀 说明我们都在罗塞尔的画像上签了名"] = "Yes, it means we both signed Roselle's portrait.",
    ["是呀！不景气，股市也跟着大跌，我先生的收入也锐减了，现在只能雇一下临时仆人了。"] = "Yes! A downturn, the stock market has also plummeted, and my husband's income has shrunk sharply. Now we can only hire temporary servants.",
    ["是呀，最近人人都在谈论罗塞尔，我的东西也很好卖。"] = "Yes, everyone is talking about Roselle lately, and my things are selling very well.",
    ["是呀，查理还非常谨慎，他从来不亲自接触那些危险的东西。"] = "Yes, Charlie is also very cautious; he never personally touches those dangerous things.",
    ["是呀，特别是我的好朋友们都开启各自的生活后，准确的说，是从学校毕业后，梅丽莎去了贝克兰德，伊丽莎白在廷根大学……"] = "Yes, especially after my good friends started their own lives. To be precise, after graduating from school, Melissa went to Backlund, and Elizabeth is at Tingen University...",
    ["是呀，说明我们都在罗塞尔的画像上签了名。"] = "Yes, it means we both signed our names on Roselle's portrait.",
    ["是呢，所以自从认识了这些好朋友以后，芙拉再也没有感觉到孤单过！"] = "Yes, so ever since I met these good friends, Fula has never felt lonely again!",
    ["是哈罗德。"] = "It's Harold.",
    ["是哪位蒸汽与机械系同学的期末作业吗？"] = "Is this a final project from a student of the Church of Steam and Machinery?",
    ["是哪来的？从哪打的？"] = "Where did that come from? Where was it fired from?",
    ["是啊"] = "Yeah",
    ["是啊……在梦里，我时常回忆起他们。"] = "Yes... In my dreams, I often recall them.",
    ["是啊……正像您看到的这样。\n不过也别太难过，也许有一天会好的，是吗？也许有一天我能跑步呢。"] = "Yeah... just as you see. \n But don't be too sad, maybe one day it will get better, right? Maybe one day I'll be able to run.",
    ["是啊……那梦里的怪物是怎么回事？"] = "Yeah... what about the monsters in the dream?",
    ["是啊。我以为手刃仇人之后会痛快，但现在只觉得心里很空，好像留在这世界最后的理由也没有了。"] = "Yeah. I thought I'd feel relieved after killing my enemy, but now I just feel empty inside, as if the last reason to stay in this world is gone.",
    ["是啊。男人、女人、老人、小孩……"] = "Yes. Men, women, old people, children...",
    ["是啊。这些东西放在黑荆棘的话，会让人感觉那些热闹还在。"] = "Yes. If these things are kept in Blackthorn, it makes people feel like that liveliness is still there.",
    ["是啊是啊，我们说这个演讲啊，它呢不是讲演，也不是背书，那么它是什么呢？哎，这个演讲本身啊就是需要注意，哎，真的是，我跟你说啊，我有以下六点要说……"] = "Yes, yes, when we talk about this oratory, it's not lecturing, nor is it reciting, so what is it? Hey, this oratory itself needs attention, hey, really, let me tell you, I have the following six points to say...",
    ["是啊是啊，真讨厌，我要一个人孤立他们两个！"] = "Yeah, yeah, so annoying, I'm going to isolate the two of them alone!",
    ["是啊！他们第一次来廷根，我特意提前做好了一份“廷根旅游攻略”，想带他们好好逛逛。"] = "Yes! They are coming to Tingen for the first time, so I specially prepared a 'Tingen Travel Guide' in advance, wanting to take them around properly.",
    ["是啊！可我的上司，这位卢比先生完全没有为我请个帮手的意思。"] = "It is! But my boss, Mr. Ruby here, has no intention of hiring a helper for me.",
    ["是啊，“慷慨号”！通向“慷慨之城”拜亚姆！"] = "That's right, the \"Generosity\"! Leading to the \"City of Generosity,\" Bayam!",
    ["是啊，不用什么秘方，靠四十年的习惯，再加上一点温柔，就足够成就一间好面包店。"] = "Yes, you don't need any secret recipe. Relying on forty years of habit, plus a little tenderness, is enough to make a good bakery.",
    ["是啊，为什么……为什么我会这么做?"] = "Yeah, why... why did I do this?",
    ["是啊，亲手做的，我们约好要一起做新的。 "] = "Yes, he made it himself, and we promised to make a new one together.",
    ["是啊，亲爱的先生，您这价格可真是“慷慨”得让人感动呢！"] = "Yeah, dear sir, your price is truly \"generous\" enough to be moving!",
    ["是啊，他也喜欢晴天……再见好孩子，我先回家了。"] = "Indeed, he liked sunny days too... Goodbye, dear child, I'm heading home now.",
    ["是啊，他们说你是个很好的孩子。"] = "Yes, they said you are a very good child.",
    ["是啊，他改变了整个时代。不过《廷根市老实人报》为什么会突然开始报道罗塞尔大帝的事迹？"] = "Yeah, he changed the whole era. But why would the 'Tingen Honest Man's Newspaper' suddenly start reporting on Emperor Roselle's deeds?",
    ["是啊，他改变了整个时代。不过《廷根老实人报》为什么会突然开始报道罗塞尔大帝的事迹？"] = "Yes, he changed an entire era. But why did the 'Tingen Honest Reporter' suddenly start reporting on the deeds of Emperor Roselle?",
    ["是啊，仿佛就在昨天一样。"] = "Yes, it feels like it was just yesterday.",
    ["是啊，你听伊萨索说了吗？我们厂月底好像要裁一半的人。"] = "Yeah, did you hear what Isaso said? It seems like our factory is going to lay off half the people by the end of the month.",
    ["是啊，你看那边的演讲家一直在宣传女神，我听了很开心，咱们队伍又要壮大了！"] = "Yes, look at the orator over there who keeps promoting the Goddess; I felt very happy listening to it, our team is growing again!",
    ["是啊，你瞧这张。"] = "Yes, look at this one.",
    ["是啊，你都不知道值班有多无聊，我必须一直在这里守着查尼斯门……"] = "Yeah, you have no idea how boring being on duty is. I have to stay here guarding the Chanis Gate all the time...",
    ["是啊，几年前的那天，这里变成了一片废墟。我恰好不在，但我唯一的儿子就没那么幸运了……"] = "Yes, that day a few years ago, this place turned into ruins. I happened to be away, but my only son wasn't so lucky...",
    ["是啊，培根可是我们的“生物质量基准单位”——手册上说它标准体重是20公斤。"] = "Yeah, Bacon is our 'biological mass reference unit'—the manual says its standard weight is 20 kilograms.",
    ["是啊，培根可是我们的“生物质量基准单位”——手册上说它标准体重是40磅。"] = "Yeah, Bacon is our \"biological mass benchmark unit\"—the manual says his standard weight is 40 pounds.",
    ["是啊，多亏了教会的牺牲，才能控制住它的负面效果。"] = "Yes, it's thanks to the Church's sacrifice that its negative effects could be controlled.",
    ["是啊，大概人总得找个办法活下去，靠这样的抱团取暖努力生活着也是一条出路。"] = "Yes, I suppose people always have to find a way to survive. Relying on huddling together like this to live hard is also a way out.",
    ["是啊，好些年了。老邻居一个一个搬走了，紫藤花倒是越开越好……"] = "Yes, for many years. The old neighbors moved away one by one, but the wisteria flowers bloom better and better...",
    ["是啊，它们对我可好呢，想晒太阳了大海就让我到太阳最好的地方去，想休息了沙滩就让我去乘凉。"] = "Yes, they are so good to me. When I want to sunbathe, Ocean lets me go to the place with the best sun, and when I want to rest, Beach lets me go to the shade.",
    ["是啊，年轻人，我也这样想着。我年轻的时候，总是被要求什么好的都让给弟弟，再后来是让给儿子。"] = "Yes, young man, I think so too. When I was young, I was always asked to give up everything good to my younger brother, and later to my son.",
    ["是啊，广场上都在讨论赞美女神的诗歌，我听了感觉很激动。"] = "Yes, everyone in the square is discussing poems praising the Goddess, and I felt very moved after listening to them.",
    ["是啊，序列9学徒，开门，短距离传送。"] = "Yeah, Sequence 9 Apprentice, Open Door, short-distance Teleport.",
    ["是啊，当然要快快吸收养分，才能快点开出我自己的花来。"] = "Yes, of course I have to absorb nutrients quickly so I can bloom my own flowers soon.",
    ["是啊，我为了印资料的钱，差点想去揭自己的悬赏！"] = "Yeah, I almost wanted to turn myself in for the bounty just to pay for printing the materials!",
    ["是啊，我也觉得这事儿有点蹊跷。这汤闻着是挺香，可是……谁知道里面有没有什么猫腻？这年头，哪有白给的好处！"] = "Yeah, I also think this is a bit suspicious. The soup smells fragrant, but... who knows if there's any trick to it? These days, there's no such thing as a free lunch!",
    ["是啊，我们总在和未知的危险对抗……"] = "Yes, we are always fighting against unknown dangers...",
    ["是啊，我听说了，不过刚刚和他交流下来，感觉……咳咳。"] = "Yeah, I heard, but after talking to him just now, I feel... cough cough.",
    ["是啊，我敢保证，他们一定会幸福地厮守终生，成为街坊邻里间传颂的一段佳话。"] = "Yes, I guarantee they will surely live happily ever after and become a story passed down among the neighbors.",
    ["是啊，时代的齿轮压过他们，听不到声音。"] = "Indeed, the gears of the era roll over them, and no sound is heard.",
    ["是啊，是啊，唉……"] = "Yes, yes, sigh...",
    ["是啊，最爱妻子的市长候选人呀！"] = "Yeah, the mayoral candidate who loves his wife the most!",
    ["是啊，最近廷根的餐厅都在开发新菜品，我们也不能落伍。"] = "Yeah, restaurants in Tingen are all developing new dishes lately, and we can't fall behind.",
    ["是啊，有一天我们也将在女神的神国，与他们团聚……"] = "Yes, one day we will also be reunited with them in the Goddess's Kingdom...",
    ["是啊，有时候我想，干嘛要一个接一个传递诅咒呢？"] = "Yes, sometimes I think, why pass the curse on one by one?",
    ["是啊，本以为家里能出一个大学教授呢！"] = "Yeah, I thought our family could have a university professor!",
    ["是啊，每到这时候我就会开始怀念那位道恩·唐泰斯先生，虽然我从未有幸见过他。"] = "Yes, whenever this happens, I start to miss that Mr. Dwayne Dantès, although I have never had the honor of meeting him.",
    ["是啊，毕竟收来的租金\r\n都流进他的口袋！"] = "That's right, after all, the rent collected\nall flows into his pocket!",
    ["是啊，煤炭曾带来辉煌，放在几年前，拥有煤炭，就等同于拥有了潮水般的金镑。"] = "Indeed, coal once brought glory. A few years ago, owning coal was equivalent to having a tidal wave of gold pounds.",
    ["是啊，真是一家很漂亮的店。"] = "Yes, it really is a very beautiful shop.",
    ["是啊，睡不着的时候来走走，比吃药还管用。"] = "Yeah, when I can't sleep, coming for a walk is more effective than taking medicine.",
    ["是啊，虽然有很多地方都有点过于自我发挥了，但整体还是很出彩的。"] = "Indeed, although there were many parts that were a bit too improvised, the overall performance was quite brilliant.",
    ["是啊，赞美莱纳老爷！你注意到没有，老爷说他抵押了一个商铺，那得是多少钱！"] = "Yeah, praise Mr. Laine! Did you notice? The master said he mortgaged a shop—that must be a lot of money!",
    ["是啊，还好有你。"] = "Yes, it's a good thing I have you.",
    ["是啊，这个人鬼鬼祟祟的。"] = "Yeah, this person is acting all sneaky.",
    ["是啊，这对我们的新品牌有很大帮助，城市之间的时尚差异也是个很值得讨论的命题。"] = "Indeed, this will be a great help to our new brand. The differences in fashion between cities is also a topic worth discussing.",
    ["是啊，这里可不安全，快回家去吧。"] = "Yeah, it's not safe here, go home quickly.",
    ["是啊，这里永远晴朗，不像贝克兰德总是被阴雨和浓雾覆盖。"] = "Yeah, it's always sunny here, unlike Backlund, which is always covered in rain and thick fog.",
    ["是啊，那可是让我再度见到杰温的恩赐……他马上，马上就能继续陪着我了……"] = "Yes, that was the gift that allowed me to see Jevon again... He will be able to stay with me again, very soon...",
    ["是啊，那段骨架，是从因蒂斯一位作家的旧作里挪过来的，只不过把人名换了而已。"] = "Yes, that skeleton was lifted from an old work by an Intis writer, they just changed the names.",
    ["是噩梦，但这只是邪神的污染在廷根造成的危险之一。"] = "It was a nightmare, but this is just one of the dangers caused by the evil god's corruption in Tingen.",
    ["是因为太紧张才来这里练习？"] = "Are you here to practice because you're too nervous?",
    ["是因为小阿诺德被卷进了这起事件吗？"] = "Is it because little Arnold was involved in this incident?",
    ["是因为弹得好？"] = "Is it because she plays well?",
    ["是因为过去的生活很好吗？"] = "Is it because your past life was very good?",
    ["是圣堂派你们来支援的吗？当心，变异的怪物又来了！"] = "Did the Cathedral send you to support us? Watch out, the mutated monsters are coming again!",
    ["是在这儿吗……天呐……"] = "Is it here... Oh my god...",
    ["是塔罗学院的象征和力量源泉，也是正式加入学院的非凡者与塔罗学院签订契约的见证。"] = "It is the symbol and source of power for the Tarot Academy, and also the witness to the contract signed by Beyonders who officially join the academy.",
    ["是奥利安娜太太吗？我是新来的克莱恩·莫雷蒂，邓恩队长让我来预支4周的薪水。"] = "Is this Mrs. Orianna? I am the new guy, Klein Moretti. Captain Dunn asked me to come and draw an advance of 4 weeks' salary.",
    ["是她所有残酷真实的记忆，也就是……我。"] = "It is all her cruel, real memories, which is... me.",
    ["是姐姐教我的，我不会跟她走。但说不定，她会买下我一朵玫瑰呢！"] = "My sister taught me; I won't go with her. But who knows, maybe she'll buy a rose from me!",
    ["是委托我们寻人吗？有什么我可以帮忙的吗？"] = "Are you commissioning us to find someone? Is there anything I can help with?",
    ["是它自己消失的！"] = "It disappeared on its own!",
    ["是它！但我没办法拆信了。你帮我看看，信上写了什么？我记不清了。我什么都记不清了。"] = "It's it! But I can't open the letter anymore. Can you help me see what's written on it? I can't remember. I can't remember anything.",
    ["是守护者！"] = "It's a Guardian!",
    ["是安提哥努斯笔记！它就在绑匪对面的房间内！"] = "It's the Antigonus Notebook! It's in the room opposite the kidnappers!",
    ["是安眠药……看来芙拉女士真的很难熬……"] = "It's sleeping pills... It seems Ms. Fula is really having a hard time...",
    ["是实验事故造成的致命伤……芙拉女士找遍了各种医生和偏方，都没能把他救回来……"] = "It was a fatal wound caused by a laboratory accident... Ms. Fura tried every doctor and folk remedy, but she couldn't save him...",
    ["是对应权柄的化身，包含历史、时间、命运、变化和隐秘的部分权柄，还是心灵领域里“盲目痴愚”的象征。擅长愚弄万物，展现不可思议的神迹。"] = "An avatar of the corresponding authority, containing partial authority over history, time, fate, change, and concealment, as well as being a symbol of 'blind stupidity' in the mental domain. Adept at fooling all things and demonstrating incredible miracles.",
    ["是已经摆放好了？非常感谢，让我去检查下。"] = "Is it already set up? Thank you very much, let me go check it.",
    ["是巷子里传来的！你快去看看，我来把守着路口。"] = "It came from the alley! Go take a look, I'll guard the entrance.",
    ["是弗莱……"] = "It's Frye...",
    ["是弗莱队长寄来的信……还有一份报纸？"] = "It's a letter sent by Captain Frye... and a newspaper?",
    ["是很危险，我们冒着危险来，就是为了毕业……呃，冒险……"] = "It is dangerous, but we risked the danger to come here just for graduation... uh, adventure...",
    ["是很奇怪……难道背后有什么力量在推动这一切？"] = "It is very strange... Could there be some power behind the scenes pushing all of this?",
    ["是必争的营地，也是给敌人带来混乱的温床。占领后可攻击战争石碑，固定每分钟获得30点资源。"] = "A contested camp and a hotbed for bringing chaos to the enemy. After occupying, you can attack the War Stele to gain a fixed 30 resources per minute.",
    ["是您 女士！"] = "It's you, Madam!",
    ["是您健忘忘记了。"] = "It's you who are forgetful and forgot.",
    ["是您的曲子作得好。"] = "It's because your composition is good.",
    ["是您！ 好心的{{先生|女士}}"] = "It's you! The kind {{ Mr.| Ms.}}.",
    ["是您，点燃我的世界，让我永远活在炽热的爱中！"] = "It is you who ignited my world, allowing me to live forever in the warmth of burning love!",
    ["是想家了吗？"] = "Are you homesick?",
    ["是我……"] = "It's me...",
    ["是我……你是从哪里拿到这怀表的？"] = "It's me... Where did you get this pocket watch?",
    ["是我。"] = "It's me.",
    ["是我。<P_Heart>（低笑）</>那是一段美好的日子……某种程度上说，是我离开拜朗帝国后的新生。"] = "It is me. <P_Heart>(Chuckling)</> That was a wonderful time... in a way, it was my rebirth after leaving the Balam Empire.",
    ["是我。欢迎你，克莱恩。你真幸运，今天有足够的现金。"] = "It's me. Welcome, Klein. You are very lucky; there is enough cash today.",
    ["是我们爱的一周年，也是你初次登场的一周年，我当然要陪在你的身边！"] = "It's our one-year anniversary of love, and also the one-year anniversary of your debut, of course I have to be by your side!",
    ["是我们的故乡"] = "It is our hometown",
    ["是我养的狗——事实上，他正处于求偶期。这实在是太可怕了，我决不允许尊贵的昂格家族与外来者结合，更何况那是一只猫！"] = "It's the dog I keep—in fact, he is in his mating period. This is truly terrible; I will never allow the noble Ang family to associate with outsiders, let alone a cat!",
    ["是我在说话。"] = "It was me speaking.",
    ["是我家有几百年历史的宅子，那地方太破了，我打算卖点钱补贴家用。"] = "It's my family's house with hundreds of years of history. That place is too dilapidated, I plan to sell it for some money to subsidize the family.",
    ["是我小时候和父母的合照。"] = "It's a photo of me and my parents when I was a child.",
    ["是我感冒不小心留下的鼻涕。"] = "It's the snot I accidentally left behind because of my cold.",
    ["是我找到了真相，但我不会给你去伤害其他人的机会。"] = "I found the truth, but I won't give you the chance to hurt anyone else.",
    ["是我新研制的黑胡椒咖啡！听说其他地区的青椒咖啡卖得不错，我学习一下……"] = "It's my newly developed black pepper coffee! I heard that green pepper coffee sells well in other regions, so I'm learning from it...",
    ["是我杀了他，我杀了他！我杀了父亲！"] = "I killed him, I killed him! I killed my father!",
    ["是我激活了邪恶仪式？我以为找齐三件物品，就能逃出去。"] = "Was it me who activated the evil ritual? I thought that if I found all three items, I could escape.",
    ["是我的历史，我的过去。不过，你能看到这些？"] = "This is my history—my past. But... you can see all this?",
    ["是我的同事，是会保护你的人。"] = "He is my colleague, the one who will protect you.",
    ["是我的，但不是我开的。"] = "It's mine, but I didn't open it.",
    ["是我过于冒昧，但是我想问，是否十镑会有十镑的注视，五镑会有五镑的……"] = "It is too presumptuous of me, but I would like to ask, will ten pounds bring ten pounds of gaze, and five pounds bring five pounds of...",
    ["是我鲁莽了。"] = "It was my recklessness.",
    ["是拂晓之星，亦是黑夜尽头的第一道光。播散祂神恩的天使，降临于此。"] = "It is the star of dawn, and also the first light at the end of the night. The Angel who spreads His divine grace has descended here.",
    ["是挺像，但不是我的戒指。"] = "It looks similar, but it's not my ring.",
    ["是摩根的怀表！它回来了？"] = "It's Morgan's pocket watch! It's back?",
    ["是故意的还是不小心的"] = "Was It Intentional or Accidental",
    ["是教堂的钟声。真是奇怪，当它没有被敲响的时候，我能感到它在我的脑子翻滚，吵得我不得安宁。可现在，它明明响着，我却觉得从未如此宁静。"] = "It's the church bell. It's strange, when it's not ringing, I can feel it rolling around in my head, making so much noise I can't find peace. But now, even though it's ringing, I feel more peaceful than ever.",
    ["是教堂的钟声，好多年过去了，这声音还在我脑子里经久不息。"] = "It's the church bell; many years have passed, and this sound still lingers in my mind.",
    ["是时候加入一些神秘的东方力量了！"] = "It's time to add some mysterious Eastern power!",
    ["是时候去廷根的拉斐尔墓园了，波特应该已经到了。"] = "It's time to go to Raphael Cemetery in Tingen. Potter should have arrived already.",
    ["是时候告别这该死的雾天了！"] = "It's time to say goodbye to this damn foggy weather!",
    ["是时候和金狼做个了断了。"] = "It's time to put an end to the Golden Wolf.",
    ["是时候展示真正的战斗了！"] = "It's time to show real combat!",
    ["是时候拥有属于自己的工坊了——亲手制造的货物，会让这趟旅程走得更远。 "] = "It's time to have a workshop of my own—goods made by hand will make this journey go further.",
    ["是时候说再见了。走吧，给你找个新的去处。"] = "It's time to say goodbye. Go on, let's find you a new home.",
    ["是时候雇佣一个帮手了。"] = "It's time to hire a helper.",
    ["是有点……但你喜欢的话，可以都定下来。"] = "That is true... but if you like them, you can order both.",
    ["是木雕和一封信"] = "It's a wood carving and a letter",
    ["是机关怪物——这也算一种机关谜题？！"] = "It's a mechanism monster—does this count as a type of mechanism puzzle?!",
    ["是机关怪物！这也算一种机关谜题？！"] = "It's a mechanism monster! Does this count as a mechanism puzzle too?!",
    ["是来不及了，如果我是一个真正的非凡者就好了。"] = "It's too late, if only I were a real Beyonder.",
    ["是档案里记载的谜题……需要转动圆环拼好图案。"] = "It's the puzzle recorded in the files... I need to rotate the rings to complete the pattern.",
    ["是死亡的味道……"] = "It is the smell of death...",
    ["是水！水被污染了！"] = "It's the water! The water is suffering from corruption!",
    ["是泥土，还是风，还是黄金树听见了我的话……"] = "Was it the soil, the wind, or the Golden Tree that heard my words...",
    ["是海水……这里……枪……"] = "It's seawater... here... gun...",
    ["是海莉夫人那番话让我下决心的。她说得对，只要站起来，剑就留在地上了。"] = "It was Madam Haley's words that made me make up my mind. She was right, as long as you stand up, the swords stay on the ground.",
    ["是混混"] = "Is a thug",
    ["是满级大佬"] = "Is a max-level expert",
    ["是熟人介绍的吗？"] = "Were you introduced by an acquaintance?",
    ["是父亲曾经的伟大构想，存在于知识皇冠中，如今也被母神污染了。"] = "It was my father's great vision, existing within the Crown of Knowledge, and now it has also been corrupted by the Mother Goddess.",
    ["是猎物的气息……我找到你了！"] = "It's the scent of prey... I've found you!",
    ["是的"] = "Yes",
    ["是的 衷心且真诚的感谢"] = "Yes, heartfelt and sincere thanks",
    ["是的……他每周都会在夜晚帮我备好食物和鲜花，但却从来不见我，不说一句话。"] = "Yes... Every week at night, he prepares food and flowers for me, but he never sees me and never says a word.",
    ["是的……有什么问题吗？斐乐……斐乐将我从悲伤中拯救出来，我很感激他……"] = "Yes... is there a problem? Fela... Fela saved me from sadness, and I am very grateful to him...",
    ["是的。"] = "Yes.",
    ["是的。<P_Heart>（微笑）</>或许这就是为什么我父亲总让我别窝在自己的世界，多和别人相处。"] = "Yes. <P_Heart> (Smiles) </> Perhaps this is why my father always told me not to hole up in my own world and to spend more time with others.",
    ["是的。丽贝卡让我去了解更多，我以警官身份进行调查，也发现封印物的印记。"] = "Yes. Rebecca asked me to find out more, and I investigated as a police officer and also discovered the mark of the Sealed Artifact.",
    ["是的。但……以另一种形式。"] = "Yes. But... in a different form.",
    ["是的。但那不是“不像狗”，那是“狗也可以”。"] = "Yes. But that's not \"not like a dog,\" that's \"a dog can also do that.\"",
    ["是的。你是……"] = "Yes. You are...",
    ["是的。关于这个世界的真相……以及即将到来的<P_Yellow>末日</>。"] = "Yes. About the truth of this world... and the impending <P_Yellow>Apocalypse</>.",
    ["是的。另一个就是刚刚救老罗德的<P_Yellow>亚瑟</>，他是“自杀”的幸存者，也是“自杀”案件变严重的标志。"] = "Yes. The other is <P_Yellow> Arthur </>, who just saved Old Rhode. He is a survivor of a \"suicide\" attempt and a sign that the \"suicide\" cases are becoming more serious.",
    ["是的。另一个就是刚刚来找我们的<P_Yellow>亚瑟</>，他是“自杀”的幸存者，也是“自杀”案件变严重的标志。"] = "Yes. The other one is <P_Yellow>Arthur</>, who just came to see us. He is a survivor of the 'suicides' and a sign that the 'suicide' cases are becoming more serious.",
    ["是的。奥黛丽说书是好东西，要多读书。"] = "Yes. Audrey says books are good things, and one should read more.",
    ["是的。奥黛丽说我进步得很快。"] = "Yes. Audrey says I'm progressing very quickly.",
    ["是的。我希望他回来的时候是英雄归来，有鲜花和掌声。"] = "Yes. I hope that when he returns, it will be a hero's welcome, with flowers and applause.",
    ["是的。我的同门卢卡斯选择了真理，老师带着卢卡斯走向了知识领域的深处，再也没有回来。"] = "Yes. My fellow student Lucas chose truth. The teacher took Lucas into the depths of the Domain of Knowledge, and they never returned.",
    ["是的。阿兹克先生就像我的长辈，虽然他正在寻找自己失去的记忆，但他对我的帮助从未减少。"] = "Yes. Mr. Azik is like an elder to me. Although he is searching for his lost memories, his help to me has never diminished.",
    ["是的太太，这是我第一次来贝克兰德。"] = "Yes, ma'am, this is my first time in Backlund.",
    ["是的没错。不过偶尔我会错觉，从安眠中醒来时，睁眼看到的塔顶归属于遥远的故乡。"] = "Yes, that's right. But occasionally I have the illusion that when I wake up from slumber, the tower I see belongs to my distant hometown.",
    ["是的！"] = "Yes!",
    ["是的！上次为您拍摄的照片好评如潮！这次我计划了新的场所，为您拍摄具有冲击力的影像！"] = "Yes! The photos taken for you last time were well-received! This time I have planned a new location to film impactful footage of you!",
    ["是的！上次为您拍摄的照片好评如潮！这次我计划了新的场所，为您拍摄具有特别风味的影像！"] = "Yes! The photos taken of you last time were highly acclaimed! This time I have planned a new location to capture images with a special flavor for you!",
    ["是的！我们马上就要在女神的注视下步入婚姻了！"] = "Yes! We are about to enter into marriage under the Goddess's gaze!",
    ["是的！是的！我在里面！"] = "Yes! Yes! I'm inside!",
    ["是的，27个人。"] = "Yes, 27 people.",
    ["是的，{{先生|女士}}。你是有什么问题想问我吗？"] = "Yes, {{ Mr. | Ms. } }. Do you have any questions you'd like to ask me?",
    ["是的，{{先生|女士}}。总有人出于嫉妒或是什么，对其他竞争者出言诋毁，这很常见。"] = "Yes, {{Mr.|Ms.}}. There are always people who, out of jealousy or something else, disparage other competitors; this is very common.",
    ["是的，{{先生|女士}}，在这里，饿死几个流浪汉不是新鲜事儿。只不过……"] = "Yes, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, here, a few homeless people starving to death is nothing new. It's just that...",
    ["是的，{{先生|女士}}，您看，这是她妈妈给她的火柴盒，原本这个火柴盒是她妈妈用来装工资条的。"] = "Yes, {{Mr.|Ms.}}, look, this is the matchbox her mother gave her. Originally, her mother used this matchbox to store her pay stubs.",
    ["是的，一个相对独立于现实、灵性更为活跃的层面。在这里进行仪式魔法的学习和实践，能更清晰地感知能量的流动，也相对……安全一些。"] = "Yes, a plane relatively independent of reality where spirituality is more active. Learning and practicing Ritual Magic here allows for a clearer perception of the flow of energy, and it is also relatively... safer.",
    ["是的，不用担心，好好休息吧。"] = "Yes, don't worry. Get some good rest.",
    ["是的，不过和以前比，数量并不算多。"] = "Yes, but compared to before, the number isn't that high.",
    ["是的，不需要做什么，只是点一杯费尔默咖啡，听周围人聊天。"] = "Yes, there's no need to do anything, just order a cup of Filmer coffee and listen to the people around me chatting.",
    ["是的，两周前，花了全部的积蓄，从“莴苣与肉类市场”搬来这里。"] = "Yes, two weeks ago, I spent all my savings to move here from the 'Lettuce and Meat Market'.",
    ["是的，也可以用来展示大场景…..."] = "Yes, it can also be used to show large scenes...",
    ["是的，从早到晚，不吃不喝，一直像疯了一样自言自语。"] = "Yes, from morning till night, he doesn't eat or drink, just muttering to himself like a madman.",
    ["是的，他一直是。"] = "Yes, he always has been.",
    ["是的，他之前杀的人还有很多，那次他在准备一个邪异的仪式，所以才会被值夜者抓到。"] = "Yes, he had killed many people before that. That time, he was preparing an evil ritual, which is why he was caught by the Nighthawks.",
    ["是的，他之前杀的人还有很多，那次他在准备一个邪异的恶魔仪式，所以才被值夜者抓到。"] = "Yes, he had killed many people before. That time, he was preparing a sinister demonic ritual, which is why he was caught by the Nighthawks.",
    ["是的，他们以纺织相关的物品做名字，只有他们的首领有一个像样的名字，叫做亨特。"] = "Yes, they use textile-related items as names. Only their leader has a decent name, called Hunter.",
    ["是的，他和莫雷蒂先生算是同期加入俱乐部的，如今也成了廷根小有名气的占卜家了，他们挺熟的。"] = "Yes, he and Mr. Moretti joined the club around the same time, and now he has become a well-known Seer in Tingen. They are quite close.",
    ["是的，他很和蔼，给我父亲的感觉，但不知道为什么，以前我总会有点怕他。"] = "Yes, he was very kind, he felt like a father to me, but I don't know why, I used to be a little afraid of him.",
    ["是的，他是很好的领路人，他教会了我们很多。"] = "Yes, he was a great guide. He taught us a lot.",
    ["是的，但不用太担心，只要使用和封印得当，它们在特定情况下能发挥极大的作用。"] = "Yes, but don't worry too much. As long as they are used and sealed properly, they can play a huge role in specific situations.",
    ["是的，但是请你直接叫我的名字，而不是糟糕的“安提科小姐”。"] = "Yes, but please call me by my name directly, instead of that terrible 'Miss Antigonus'.",
    ["是的，但谁能确定灾祸不会降临到自己头上？"] = "Yes, but who can be sure that disaster won't descend upon them?",
    ["是的，但这只是我的解读，占卜往往都是模糊的。"] = "Yes, but this is only my interpretation; divination is often vague.",
    ["是的，但这同样需要一些智慧和眼力……我想，是时候在这里成立一片可以自由贸易的市场了！请您跟我来。"] = "Yes, but that also requires some wisdom and a keen eye... I think it's time to establish a free trade market here! Please follow me.",
    ["是的，佛尔思女士预见了此处的污染有扩散风险，委托我在这里监视。"] = "Yes, Ms. Fors foresaw that the corruption here has a risk of spreading and entrusted me to monitor it here.",
    ["是的，你也是来看望他们的？"] = "Yes, are you here to visit them too?",
    ["是的，你是来找主人的吧？"] = "Yes, you're here to find the master, right?",
    ["是的，你的直觉很准。"] = "Yes, your intuition is very accurate.",
    ["是的，你看这边。"] = "Yes, look over here.",
    ["是的，例如这种对着我的脸推进的镜头，通常用来表达震惊的情绪。"] = "Yes, for example, this camera pushing in towards my face is usually used to express shock.",
    ["是的，先生。"] = "Yes, sir.",
    ["是的，先生，您虽然并非军人出身，无法成为正式会员……"] = "Yes, sir, although you are not from a military background and cannot become a full member...",
    ["是的，几年前的一段时间，古堡变得很奇怪，去过的人都觉得隐隐约约不对劲。就在那段时间，一群穿黑色风衣的人来到这里，径直往古堡里去了。"] = "Yes, a few years ago, for a period of time, the castle became very strange, and everyone who went there felt something was vaguely wrong. During that time, a group of people in black trench coats came here and headed straight into the castle.",
    ["是的，前屋主的身份应该就是一位名叫奥斯瓦尔德的“工匠”，替人制作神奇物品。"] = "Yes, the previous owner's identity should be an 'Artisan' named Oswald, who made mystical items for others.",
    ["是的，原话。"] = "Yes, those were the exact words.",
    ["是的，后天就是截稿日了……但我写不出来……一点灵感都没有……"] = "Yes, the deadline is the day after tomorrow... but I can't write anything... I have absolutely no inspiration...",
    ["是的，听说还是他曾经的梦想。不知道有没有画家这条非凡途径？一定很适合弗莱队长。"] = "Yes, I heard it was his dream once. I wonder if there is a Beyonder Pathway for painters? It would definitely suit Captain Frye.",
    ["是的，呜呜，我爸爸只会打发我去扫烟囱。"] = "Yes, wuwu, my dad only sends me to sweep chimneys.",
    ["是的，和家人团聚……是我们在这个世界活下去的意义。"] = "Yes, reuniting with family... is the meaning of our existence in this world.",
    ["是的，大约发作两到三个小时会暂停一小会儿，然后重新开始……恰好是一部<P_Yellow>戏剧表演的时长</>。"] = "Yes, it pauses for a short while after about two to three hours of episodes, and then starts again... which happens to be the duration of a <P_Yellow> theatrical performance </>.",
    ["是的，太不对劲了。我居然为存在严重卫生问题的餐厅撰写文章！这件事必须要老板给个答复！"] = "Yes, it's just not right. I actually wrote an article for a restaurant with serious hygiene problems! The boss must give an explanation for this!",
    ["是的，女士。一点点咖啡并不会影响睡眠。"] = "Yes, ma'am. A little bit of coffee won't affect sleep.",
    ["是的，她一开门就会被催稿的信件淹没，只有我能从窗户出来，替她收集些素材。"] = "Yes, she gets flooded with letters urging her to write as soon as she opens the door. Only I can come out through the window to collect some materials for her.",
    ["是的，她一打开门就会被催稿的信件淹没，只有我能从窗户出来，替她收集些素材。"] = "Yes, as soon as she opens the door, she gets flooded with letters demanding manuscripts. Only I can get out through the window to collect some material for her.",
    ["是的，她今天应该也会来，也许你可以和她聊聊？"] = "Yes, she should be coming today, perhaps you can chat with her?",
    ["是的，她是一个天才，而且值夜者必须无条件相信队友。在非凡事件中，信任是一件非常重要的事。"] = "Yes, she is a genius, and Nighthawks must trust their teammates unconditionally. In Beyonder incidents, trust is a very important thing.",
    ["是的，她是我们的女儿，被那辆马车压断了脊柱。"] = "Yes, she is our daughter, and her spine was crushed by that carriage.",
    ["是的，如果你有空的话，可以找他一起玩。"] = "Yes, if you are free, you can find him and play together.",
    ["是的，它会导致严重的脱发……"] = "Yes, it will cause severe hair loss...",
    ["是的，安魂诗社。在黑夜女神的注视下，我们是祂最忠诚的歌者。"] = "Yes, the Requiem Poetry Society. Under the gaze of the Evernight Goddess, we are Her most loyal singers.",
    ["是的，尊敬的先生/女士。"] = "Yes, respected sir/madam.",
    ["是的，小家伙还好吗？感谢你一直以来对他的照顾。"] = "Yes, is the little guy doing well? Thank you for taking care of him all this time.",
    ["是的，就是那位让我呆坐两小时的警察先生。"] = "Yes, that is the police officer who made me sit there for two hours.",
    ["是的，已经处理完毕。"] = "Yes, it has been dealt with.",
    ["是的，当然。"] = "Yes, of course.",
    ["是的，很感谢您为退伍军官福利事业所作出的努力，他度过了一段短暂但快乐的退休生涯。"] = "Yes, thank you very much for your efforts for the retired officers' welfare cause; he had a short but happy retirement.",
    ["是的，您坐到贝克兰德的火车就会路过那处花海。"] = "Yes, you will pass by that sea of flowers when you take the train to Backlund.",
    ["是的，我们不仅有浪漫主义，也谈论了生活的难处。这越发让我觉得我应该有男子汉的担当。"] = "Yes, we not only have romanticism but also talked about the difficulties of life. This makes me feel even more that I should have the responsibility of a man.",
    ["是的，我们也可以进入小黛西的循环空间，和她团聚。"] = "Yes, we can also enter Little Daisy's loop space and reunite with her.",
    ["是的，我们十几年前见过一面，成了朋友，之后一直通信，但再也没有见过。我这次来，只想再见他一次。"] = "Yes, we met more than a decade ago and became friends. We have been writing to each other ever since, but we haven't met again. I only came this time to see him one more time.",
    ["是的，我们得先离开这里，墓园里有太多嘈杂的灵。"] = "Yes, we must leave here first. There are too many noisy spirits in the cemetery.",
    ["是的，我们负责廷根市黑夜女神信徒相关的事件，类似的组织还有风暴教会的代罚者、蒸汽与机械教会的机械之心。"] = "Yes, we are responsible for events related to the Evernight Goddess believers in Tingen. Similar organizations include the Mandated Punishers of the Storm Church and the Machinery Hivemind of the Steam and Machinery Church.",
    ["是的，我住在东区，周末都会过来照顾一下花园。"] = "Yes, I live in the East District, and I come over on weekends to take care of the garden.",
    ["是的，我分离出的那个身份一直留在贝克兰德处理基金会的事情，以及陪伴我的家人。"] = "Yes, the identity I separated has remained in Backlund to handle the foundation's affairs and accompany my family.",
    ["是的，我只是一只狗——这正是非凡世界的非凡之处。\\n<P_Yellow>（苏茜女士优雅地向你伸出了手。）</>"] = "Yes, I am just a dog—that is exactly the extraordinary nature of the Beyonder world.\n<P_Yellow>(Ms. Susie gracefully extended her hand to you.)</>",
    ["是的，我和她有过一些交情。"] = "Yes, I had some acquaintance with her.",
    ["是的，我姐姐叫罗莎琳，她是<P_Yellow>尼根公爵府的女仆</>。但她却在不久前失踪了，我到处都找不到她。只能在这里一边卖花一边继续找她。"] = "Yes, my sister's name is Rosalind, and she is a <P_Yellow>maid at the Duke of Negan's residence</>. But she went missing not long ago, and I can't find her anywhere. I can only sell flowers here while I continue to look for her.",
    ["是的，我当时犹豫了很久。但她最后说“我们需要愿意守护这座城市的人。”"] = "Yes, I hesitated for a long time. But she finally said, 'We need people who are willing to guard this city.'",
    ["是的，我得找到一朵适合我妻子的睡莲，才能娶她回家呢。"] = "Yes, I have to find a water lily suitable for my wife before I can marry her and bring her home.",
    ["是的，我想一直守在这里，保护这里的一切。"] = "Yes, I want to stay here forever and protect everything here.",
    ["是的，我找一位商人买了些兔子和小鸟，但他的供应链出了问题。"] = "Yes, I bought some rabbits and birds from a merchant, but his supply chain ran into problems.",
    ["是的，我接到了调查任务。"] = "Yes, I have received an investigation mission.",
    ["是的，我控制了它的力量。但我的儿子并没有能力控制它，却为了救他的战友，点燃了这支蜡烛。"] = "Yes, I have controlled its power. But my son did not have the ability to control it, yet he lit this candle to save his comrades.",
    ["是的，我是管家库尔斯。请问您是？"] = "Yes, I am the butler, Cours. May I ask who you are?",
    ["是的，我是这里的管家弗雷德。宅邸被马桶散发的味道腌渍，休伯特先生不得不临时搬去其他住所。"] = "Yes, I am the butler here, Fred. The mansion has been pickled by the smell emanating from the toilet, and Mr. Hubert had to temporarily move to another residence.",
    ["是的，我来是来这里参观的。这里的环境很不错。"] = "Yes, I'm here to visit. The environment here is quite nice.",
    ["是的，我正在思考怎么结尾。或许你可以给我提供一些灵感——如果你愿意的话。"] = "Yes, I am thinking about how to end it. Perhaps you can provide me with some inspiration—if you are willing.",
    ["是的，我的父亲、邓恩队长与戴莉女士他们，都在那里。"] = "Yes, my father, Captain Dunn, and Lady Daly are all there.",
    ["是的，我记得我们的这位老乡后面还说：等我成为高序列强者，看到一个“占卜家”就揍一个！"] = "Yes, I remember our fellow countryman also said later: Once I become a high-Sequence powerhouse, I'll beat up every \"Seer\" I see!",
    ["是的，我闻到了。雏菊开得很好，香气也十分浓郁。"] = "Yes, I smelled it. The daisies bloomed beautifully, and the fragrance was very rich.",
    ["是的，我需要磨砺技艺"] = "Yes, I need to hone my skills",
    ["是的，拥抱"] = "Yes, a hug",
    ["是的，拿出那枚金币、向我祈祷吧。"] = "Yes, take out that gold coin and pray to me.",
    ["是的，据说他们提供的茶都有神奇的效果，能让你操控梦境、掌心生火，有的甚至能让人看见幽灵。"] = "Yes, it is said that the tea they provide has magical effects, allowing you to control dreams, produce fire in your palms, and some even allow you to see ghosts.",
    ["是的，是的，我明白你们会担心，但我们相信，只有亲自尝试才能获得属于自己的知识。"] = "Yes, yes, I understand you are worried, but we believe that only by trying it yourself can you gain knowledge of your own.",
    ["是的，是的，我明白你们的担心，但我们相信，只有亲自尝试才能获得属于自己的知识。"] = "Yes, yes, I understand your concerns, but we believe that only by trying it yourself can you gain knowledge that belongs to you.",
    ["是的，是的，我知道的……"] = "Yes, yes, I know...",
    ["是的，是索尔斯。幸好及时发现，否则济贫院里的人都要死于这场火灾了。"] = "Yes, it was Sols. Fortunately, it was discovered in time, otherwise everyone in the poorhouse would have died in the fire.",
    ["是的，有人看到在码头附近，有个小孩很像我的小巴特，这次我一定能找到他！"] = "Yes, someone saw a child near the Dock who looked very much like my little Bart. This time I will definitely find him!",
    ["是的，有什么线索吗？"] = "Yes, do you have any clues?",
    ["是的，梦里的画面有些古怪。"] = "Yes, the images in the dream were a bit strange.",
    ["是的，水晶逆时针转动为坏，顺时针为好，不动就是不好也不坏。"] = "Yes, the crystal rotating counterclockwise is bad, clockwise is good, and not moving means it's neither good nor bad.",
    ["是的，没错！这首曲子是《婚礼进行曲》。"] = "Yes, that's right! This piece is the 'Wedding March'.",
    ["是的，灵界生物的习性各异，我路过的正是一个热爱品酒的生物聚落。"] = "Yes, the habits of Spirit World creatures vary. What I passed by was exactly a cluster of creatures that love wine.",
    ["是的，真是漂亮的房子……"] = "Yes, it really is a beautiful house...",
    ["是的，编辑器还支持根据文本调用动作和语音资源。"] = "Yes, the editor also supports calling actions and voice resources based on text.",
    ["是的，罗塞尔陛下。今天是举办国家艺术沙龙的日子，展品们都在等待您的鉴赏。"] = "Yes, Emperor Roselle. Today is the day of the National Art Salon, and the exhibits are waiting for your appreciation.",
    ["是的，罗塞尔陛下。今天是国家艺术沙龙的日子，展品们都在等待您的鉴赏。"] = "Yes, Your Majesty Roselle. Today is the day of the National Art Salon, and the exhibits are all waiting for your appreciation.",
    ["是的，美丽而伟大的艾德雯娜.爱德华兹女士！循循善诱的智者，博学多能的导师！"] = "Yes, the beautiful and great Ms. Edwina Edwards! The wise mentor who guides us, the erudite and versatile teacher!",
    ["是的，美丽而伟大的艾德雯娜·爱德华兹女士！循循善诱的智者，博学多能的导师！"] = "Yes, the beautiful and great Ms. Edwina Edwards! A wise mentor who guides with skill, a learned and capable teacher!",
    ["是的，老爷要去打仗，他出征时把宅子交给我管理，说我是他最信任的仆人。"] = "Yes, Master had to go to war. When he left for the campaign, he entrusted the house to me, saying I was the servant he trusted most.",
    ["是的，而且要先学会一件事——别把他们当成尸体。"] = "Yes, and you must first learn one thing—don't treat them as corpses.",
    ["是的，茱莉亚太太，要买些蛋糕吗？我推荐今天的柠檬薄荷蛋糕。"] = "Yes, Mrs. Julia. Would you like to buy some cake? I recommend today's lemon mint cake.",
    ["是的，莫雷蒂先生是位让人倍感亲切的人，他帮助过很多来这里寻求帮助的人，要是感兴趣的话，你可以西格拉斯先生聊聊。"] = "Yes, Mr. Moretti was a person who made people feel very kind. He helped many people who came here seeking help. If you are interested, you can chat with Mr. Seaglass.",
    ["是的，虫子，成群结队的、吞吃一切“谜团”的虫子，而书籍正是谜团的尸骸。"] = "Yes, bugs, swarms of bugs that devour all 'mysteries,' and books are the corpses of mysteries.",
    ["是的，街上可租赁的脚踏车，就是我之前提供的想法。"] = "Yes, the bicycles available for rent on the street were an idea I provided earlier.",
    ["是的，衷心且真诚的感谢。"] = "Yes, heartfelt and sincere thanks.",
    ["是的，让贵族们从人群中脱颖而出，这不是简单堆叠花边可以实现的……需要特殊的创新点。谢谢您。"] = "Yes, making nobles stand out from the crowd isn't something that can be achieved by simply piling on lace... It requires a special touch of innovation. Thank you.",
    ["是的，请问怎么了？"] = "Yes, may I ask what's the matter?",
    ["是的，谢谢你，好心的{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Yes, thank you, kind {{sir|madam}}.",
    ["是的，谢谢您！"] = "Yes, thank you!",
    ["是的，还有什么比天使更值得形容动人的爱情？"] = "Yes, and what is more worthy of describing moving love than an Angel?",
    ["是的，这个织茧……很神奇。它指引我来到了这里，让我来这里寻求答案。"] = "Yes, this cocoon... is very magical. It guided me here, letting me come here to seek answers.",
    ["是的，这些对成年人来说，总是很稀缺。"] = "Yes, these are always scarce for adults.",
    ["是的，这位{{先生|女士}}。我即将和少爷一起返回贝克兰德……"] = "Yes, this {{Mr.|Ms.}}. I am about to return to Backlund with the young master...",
    ["是的，这对你的任务、你的职责……都没有影响。"] = "Yes, this does not affect your mission, your duty...",
    ["是的，这是光，也是太阳。伸出手，它就会落在你的掌心里。"] = "Yes, this is light, and it is also the sun. Reach out your hand, and it will land in your palm.",
    ["是的，这是我们用来包裹的纸张。但我没见过这个乐谱。"] = "Yes, this is the paper we use for wrapping. But I haven't seen this musical score before.",
    ["是的，这次格尔曼放下了手枪和暴力，他来到了大学，想要得到一个学位。"] = "Yes, this time Gehrman put down his pistol and violence, and he came to the university, wanting to get a degree.",
    ["是的，这里是冥界的入口。"] = "Yes, this is the entrance to the Underworld.",
    ["是的，那是我的一段人生。一段重要的人生。"] = "Yes, that was a part of my life. An important part of my life.",
    ["是的，那是我的家乡。一个宁静的小城市，生活节奏很慢，人们都很友善。"] = "Yes, that is my hometown. A quiet little city with a slow pace of life, and the people are very friendly.",
    ["是的，酒精给的勇气。不然我怎么敢……这样看着您？"] = "Yes, courage given by alcohol. Otherwise, how would I dare... to look at you like this?",
    ["是的，镇上能看到许多依托旅游发展的产业。有很多喜爱拉姆德的自然风光和古堡历史的游客。"] = "Yes, you can see many industries in town that rely on tourism. There are many tourists who love Lamud's natural scenery and the history of the old castle.",
    ["是的，阅读信件时，我好像真的参加了一场婚礼。有白鸽、有鲜花、过去的朋友都在，我们也都在，所有人都在。"] = "Yes, while reading the letter, I felt like I really attended a wedding. There were white doves, flowers, friends from the past were all there, we were all there, everyone was there.",
    ["是的，阿曼达女士。咖啡可以提神，一点点甜有益于思考。"] = "Yes, Ms. Amanda. Coffee can refresh the mind, and a little sweetness is good for thinking.",
    ["是的，黄黑之王指向了“愚者”先生。"] = "Yes, the King of Yellow and Black points to Mr. Fool.",
    ["是的，黄黑之王指向了愚者先生。"] = "Yes, the King of Yellow and Black pointed toward Mr. Fool.",
    ["是的？"] = "Yes?",
    ["是相信了之后，就再也没有往前走。"] = "It was that after she believed, she never moved forward again.",
    ["是真的。“愚者”先生打开了通往外界的通道，白银城的居民已经迁移到了拜朗帝国附近的富饶土地上。"] = "It's true. Mr. Fool opened the passage to the outside world, and the residents of the City of Silver have migrated to the fertile land near the Balam Empire.",
    ["是真的。愚者先生打开了通往外界的通道，白银城的居民已经迁移到了拜朗帝国附近的富饶土地上。"] = "It is true. Mr. Fool opened a passage to the outside world, and the residents of the City of Silver have already migrated to the fertile lands near the Balam Empire.",
    ["是真的是真的！我悄悄告诉你们，之前有一次月圆夜，我偷溜进教堂，看到了很不寻常的东西！"] = "It's true, it's true! I'll tell you guys quietly, there was a full moon night before where I snuck into the church and saw something very unusual!",
    ["是真的！水池和我说话了，它还用闪电劈我！"] = "It's true! The fountain talked to me, and it even struck me with lightning!",
    ["是知识扮演了我，还是我扮演了知识？"] = "Is it knowledge that acts as me, or am I acting as knowledge?",
    ["是知识皇冠带来的星光之力！拾取星光点亮九支蜡烛，或许是击败星象仪者的关键！"] = "It's the Starlight Power from the Crown of Knowledge! Picking up the starlight to light the nine candles might be the key to defeating the Astrolabe User!",
    ["是礼貌吗"] = "Is It Politeness?",
    ["是神奇物品！"] = "It is a mystical item!",
    ["是神明驱逐了灾难……还是灾难驱逐了神明呢……"] = "Did the gods expel the disaster... or did the disaster expel the gods...",
    ["是禁忌之美的实体，也是古老契约的脉动。"] = "It is the embodiment of taboo beauty and the pulse of an ancient contract.",
    ["是科恩黎！"] = "It's Kenley!",
    ["是科考队要的食物和仪器。别问了，这不是我们该知道的。"] = "It's food and instruments for the scientific expedition team. Don't ask; this isn't something we should know.",
    ["是租！出——租——不是卖！"] = "It's for rent! Rent—not for sale!",
    ["是稿费。"] = "It's payment for my work.",
    ["是稿费，贝克兰德邮报的。我把给你们画的画寄了过去，他们给了我稿费，数额不少——如果不是在山里花不了钱，我一定请你们大吃一顿！"] = "It's the manuscript fee from the Backlund Post. I sent the drawings I made for you, and they gave me a manuscript fee, a significant amount—if it weren't for the fact that I can't spend money in the mountains, I would definitely treat you to a big meal!",
    ["是空的……刚才不是被烧了吗……"] = "It's empty... wasn't it burned just now...",
    ["是童话的故乡"] = "It is the hometown of fairy tales",
    ["是笛声！我在阿诺德的梦中听到过，尤朵拉可能就在附近！"] = "It's the flute sound! I heard it in Arnold's dream. Yodora might be nearby!",
    ["是罗塞尔大帝。"] = "It's Emperor Roselle.",
    ["是罗塞尔大帝在指引我们！"] = "It's Emperor Roselle guiding us!",
    ["是罗塞尔！是伟大的罗塞尔大帝！你知道吗？罗塞尔发明了蒸汽机，是他带领世界前进……"] = "It's Roselle! It's the great Emperor Roselle! Do you know? Roselle invented the steam engine; he led the world forward...",
    ["是罗珊小姐"] = "It's Miss Rozanne",
    ["是老板的声音！"] = "That's the boss's voice!",
    ["是芬恩！是芬恩！芬恩要追寻维斯塔而去！"] = "It's Finn! It's Finn! Finn is going to chase after Vesta!",
    ["是萨拉姐姐教我们的，叫《夜访》，嘿嘿。"] = "Sister Sarah taught it to us, it's called 'Night Visit,' hehe.",
    ["是被邓恩叔叔吓跑了吗？"] = "Were they scared away by Uncle Dunn?",
    ["是警察"] = "Is a police officer",
    ["是记忆里的其他人？"] = "Is it someone else from the memories?",
    ["是请求复活还是直接复活"] = "Whether to request resurrection or resurrect directly.",
    ["是谁       了仆人？"] = "Who       the servant?",
    ["是谁伤了我同伴！我要你们不得好死！"] = "Who hurt my companion! I will make you die a horrible death!",
    ["是谁偷走一只乌龟的小小房？\n喔，丰饶，丰饶的力量！"] = "Who stole the little house of a turtle? \n Oh, Abundance, the power of Abundance!",
    ["是谁呢？"] = "Who is it?",
    ["是谁在        这一切？"] = "Who is behind        all of this?",
    ["是谁如此大方，把自己的作品直接摆在桌面上？"] = "Who is so generous to put their work directly on the table?",
    ["是谁将你变成了怪物。"] = "Who turned you into a monster?",
    ["是谁擅闯桥头？有我在，你们一个都过不去！"] = "Who is trespassing on the bridge head? With me here, none of you are getting past!",
    ["是谁？"] = "Who is it?",
    ["是调查时不小心遗落了吗？"] = "Was it accidentally left behind during the investigation?",
    ["是贝克？"] = "Is it Baker?",
    ["是赛琳娜寄来的邀请函，对吗？她说过要邀请我们一家人去参加晚宴，还说学习了新占卜要展示给我看。"] = "It's an invitation from Selina, right? She said she wanted to invite our whole family to a dinner party, and she also said she had learned some new divination to show me.",
    ["是这个吗？"] = "Is this it?",
    ["是这个女孩的声音？"] = "Is this the girl's voice?",
    ["是这几页吗？"] = "Are these the pages?",
    ["是这扇门吗？"] = "Is it this door?",
    ["是这杯，好像有非凡力量……真的要喝吗。"] = "This is the one. It seems to contain Beyonder power... Do I really have to drink it?",
    ["是这样吗……为什么？"] = "Is it like this... Why?",
    ["是这样吗？可是……哥哥，我觉得妈妈好难过。"] = "Is that so? But... Brother, I think Mother is very sad.",
    ["是这样啊。那小芙拉，你为什么想要变成一朵花呢？"] = "Is that so. Then little Fula, why do you want to become a flower?",
    ["是这样的……"] = "It's like this...",
    ["是这样的，我今早去巡逻时，发现我们的王国被封锁了。我尝试钻空子，但还是没能返回基地。"] = "It's like this, when I went on patrol this morning, I found our kingdom was blocked. I tried to find a loophole, but I still couldn't return to the base.",
    ["是这次的谜题——我记得，要把4盆雏菊都转到“太阳”下面……"] = "It's the puzzle for this time—I remember, I need to turn all 4 pots of daisies under the \"sun\"...",
    ["是迷雾中的一盏灯，但记住——提灯的手，永远应该是清醒的你自己。"] = "It is a lamp in the fog, but remember—the hand holding the lamp should always be your own sober self.",
    ["是道奇在敲击砖块？他迷路了，得去声音传出的位置，用占卜的办法为他找到出路。"] = "Is it Dodge knocking on the bricks? He must be lost. I need to go to where the sound is coming from and use divination to find a way out for him.",
    ["是邓恩·史密斯先生邀请我来的"] = "Mr. Dunn Smith invited me here.",
    ["是那个“伟大母亲”？梦里有人喊独一无二的红月……"] = "Is it that 'Mother Tree of Desire'? Someone in my dream was shouting about the unique red moon...",
    ["是那个女孩的声音……再确认一下方向吧。"] = "That's the girl's voice... Let me confirm the direction again.",
    ["是那个熟悉的声音……是“愚者”先生？"] = "It's that familiar voice... is it Mr. \"Fool\"?",
    ["是那个转运仪式把我送到了这里，不如加一点和它有关的描述。"] = "It was that Fortune-Turning Ritual that sent me here; I might as well add a bit of description related to it.",
    ["是那场碎尸案，女神庇佑……克莱恩，你快点去找邓恩队长吧，我担心他等急了。"] = "It's that dismemberment case, may the Goddess protect us... Klein, hurry and go find Captain Dunn; I'm worried he's been waiting anxiously.",
    ["是那种……看完回去睡不着觉的舞。 "] = "They're the kind... that keep you awake at night after you've seen them.",
    ["是那种事件吧……"] = "It's that kind of incident, isn't it...",
    ["是那种可以动来动去的镜头，对吧。"] = "It's that kind of camera that can move around, right?",
    ["是错觉吗？"] = "Is it an illusion?",
    ["是阿兹克先生您告诉我的，蜡烛是关键，所以我才想到用老师的蜡烛换掉永暗蜡烛。"] = "It was you, Mr. Azik, who told me that the candle was the key, which is why I thought of using my teacher's candles to replace the Candle of Eternal Darkness.",
    ["是霍纳奇斯！你们知道吗，最最有趣的是，遗迹内没有发现这个国家的墓葬！这是为什么呢？"] = "It's Hornacis! Do you know what the most interesting part is? No burials from this country have been found in the ruins! Why is that?",
    ["是鞋泥！皮革和泥土的芬芳，多么令人陶醉啊……"] = "It's shoe mud! The fragrance of leather and earth, how intoxicating...",
    ["是风动，是衣袍在翻飞，也是新时代的开端。"] = "It is the wind moving, the robe fluttering, and the beginning of a new era.",
    ["是黑夜协会的启示录，只是版本老了点……看来他们是女神的信徒啊。"] = "It's the Apocalypse of the Church of the Night, just an older version... It seems they are believers of the Goddess.",
    ["是龙。"] = "It's a dragon.",
    ["是龙吗？真的有龙？龙果然会飞……"] = "Is it a dragon? Is there really a dragon? Dragons can really fly...",
    ["是！不……不对 这和你又有什么关系？"] = "Yes! No... wait, what does that have to do with you?",
    ["是！公主殿下！"] = "Yes! Your Highness!",
    ["是，一开始我只是想要找救我妻子的方法，失败之后，却发现非凡将我引向了难以脱身的漩涡。"] = "Yes. At first, I just wanted to find a way to save my wife. After failing, I discovered that the Beyonder world had led me into a whirlpool from which I couldn't escape.",
    ["是，但留在这里的只是一具躯壳，她的灵躲起来了。"] = "Yes, but what's left here is just a shell; her spirit has hidden away.",
    ["是，我们谁也别怪谁，就让两个同样爱对方的人，一起看两场表演吧！"] = "Yes, let's not blame each other. Let two people who love each other just as much watch two performances together!",
    ["是，我在想……把这束花送给<P_Yellow>对面咖啡馆的收银员</>。"] = "Yes, I'm thinking... of giving this bouquet to the <P_Yellow> cashier at the cafe across the street </>.",
    ["是，是……"] = "Yes, yes...",
    ["是，是的。是我，太、太害怕了，老师让我，缓、缓一下。"] = "Yes, yes. It's me, I'm too, too scared, the teacher told me to, take, take a break.",
    ["是，灵界之上的伟大存在。"] = "Yes, great existence above the Spirit World.",
    ["昵称不雅"] = "Inappropriate Nickname",
    ["昵称包含非法内容，请更换后重试。"] = "Nickname contains illegal content. Please change it and try again.",
    ["昵称长度超过限制，请缩短后重试。"] = "Nickname length exceeds the limit. Please shorten it and try again.",
    ["昼"] = "Day",
    ["显形"] = "Manifest",
    ["显形墨水"] = "Revealing Ink",
    ["显然某台聚光灯过于晃眼了。"] = "Apparently, a certain spotlight was too blinding.",
    ["显然，事情的发展超出了预期。"] = "Clearly, the development of events has exceeded expectations.",
    ["显然，奥斯瓦尔德有一个重要的执念，应该是一件神奇物品。据说永不会被卖掉，也不会遗失……这是怎么回事呢。"] = "Apparently, Oswald had an important obsession, which should be a mystical item. It is said that it will never be sold or lost... what is going on here?",
