    ["晋城"] = "Jincheng",
    ["晋级军备"] = "Advanced Armament",
    ["晋级天启组的俱乐部将获得战略服参与资格，并不再参与本赛季后续联赛"] = "Clubs that advance to the Apocalypse Group will gain eligibility for the Strategic Server and will no longer participate in the remainder of this season's league.",
    ["晋级至亚军，奖励可进阶到下列内容，基础奖励将在淘汰赛结算时发放。"] = "Advance to Runner-up; rewards can be upgraded to the following content. Basic rewards will be distributed when the tournament concludes.",
    ["晋级至八强，奖励可进阶到下列内容，基础奖励将在淘汰赛结算时发放。"] = "Advance to the Top 8; rewards can be upgraded to the following content. Basic rewards will be distributed when the tournament concludes.",
    ["晋级至冠军，奖励可进阶到下列内容，基础奖励将在淘汰赛结算时发放。"] = "Advance to Champion; rewards can be upgraded to the following content. Basic rewards will be distributed when the tournament concludes.",
    ["晋级至十六强，奖励可进阶到下列内容，基础奖励将在淘汰赛结算时发放。"] = "Advance to the Top 16; rewards can be upgraded to the following content. Basic rewards will be distributed when the tournament concludes.",
    ["晋级至四强，奖励可进阶到下列内容，基础奖励将在淘汰赛结算时发放。"] = "Advance to the Top 4; rewards can be upgraded to the following content. Basic rewards will be distributed when the tournament concludes.",
    ["晋阶赠礼"] = "Promotion Gift",
    ["晒太阳老人"] = "Old Man Sunbathing",
    ["晒干研磨后的金手柑，具有提振精神与增强仪式清醒度的作用。"] = "Dried and ground bergamot, which has the effect of uplifting the spirit and enhancing ritual clarity.",
    ["晒着暖阳发发呆，什么都不想最惬意了。"] = "Dazing in the warm sun, it's most comfortable to think of nothing.",
    ["晕厥苏醒后"] = "After Waking Up from Fainting",
    ["晕染面积渐弱"] = "Blending fade",
    ["晕眩木桩"] = "Dizzy Dummy",
    ["晚上九点，卡拉去给小姐<P_Yellow>擦手</>，却忽然昏倒在地，没多久呼吸和心跳都消失了。我们先让女仆艾琳接手照顾小姐，没想到她也以同样的方式去世了。"] = "At nine o'clock in the evening, Kara went to <P_Yellow>wipe the young lady's hands</>, but suddenly collapsed to the ground, and soon her breathing and heartbeat disappeared. We first let the maid Irene take over caring for the young lady, but unexpectedly, she passed away in the same way.",
    ["晚上在线"] = "Online at night",
    ["晚上好，先生。今晚想从一杯酒开始，还是想先熟悉一下这里？"] = "Good evening, sir. Would you like to start with a glass of wine, or would you like to get familiar with the place first?",
    ["晚上好，女士。今晚想从一杯酒开始，还是想先熟悉一下这里？"] = "Good evening, madam. Would you like to start with a glass of wine, or would you like to get familiar with the place first?",
    ["晚上好，我刚刚下班。"] = "Good evening, I just got off work.",
    ["晚上好，我是“特殊案件咨询办公室”的顾问，这里的情况可能需要“特别视角”的评估。"] = "Good evening, I am a consultant for the \"Special Case Consultation Office.\" The situation here may require an assessment from a \"special perspective.\"",
    ["晚上好，我正在找你。"] = "Good evening, I'm looking for you.",
    ["晚上好，邓恩叔叔！"] = "Good evening, Uncle Dunn!",
    ["晚上打烊的时候，老维尔还会把没卖完的食物留给住在后门的流浪汉。"] = "When closing at night, Old Will also leaves the unsold food for the homeless living at the back door.",
    ["晚上有12个居民在9点喝了4杯酒，\r\n5月7日才肯睡去"] = "At night, 12 residents drank 4 cups of wine at 9 o'clock,\nand didn't go to sleep until May 7th",
    ["晚上有2个人在3点吃了4块肉，\r\n5点12分9秒才睡去，\r\n13点14分16秒才醒来"] = "At night, 2 people ate 4 pieces of meat at 3 o'clock,\ndidn't go to sleep until 5:12:09,\nand didn't wake up until 13:14:16",
    ["晚上见。"] = "See you tonight.",
    ["晚上还要靠它取暖呢！"] = "I still rely on it for warmth at night!",
    ["晚了！它们被扔到教堂旁边的<P_Yellow>小溪</>里了！这会已经不知道漂到哪里去了，哈哈哈哈！"] = "Too late! They were thrown into the <P_Yellow> creek </> next to the church! By now, who knows where they've drifted off to, hahahaha!",
    ["晚安。"] = "Good night.",
    ["晚安，克莱恩·莫雷蒂。"] = "Good night, Klein Moretti.",
    ["晚安，克莱恩。"] = "Good night, Klein.",
    ["晚安，小艾伦……爸爸这停在过去的钟，也该……再次走动了。"] = "Goodnight, little Alan... Dad's clock, which stopped in the past, should also... start moving again.",
    ["晚安，廷根市的大家。"] = "Goodnight, everyone in Tingen.",
    ["晚宴还没有开始"] = "The banquet hasn't started yet.",
    ["晚宴长裙"] = "Evening Gown",
    ["晚霞干红"] = "Sunset Dry Red",
    ["晚风中"] = "In the Evening Breeze",
    ["晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "In the evening breeze, steps are lighter due to comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["晚风借我半糖"] = "Evening Breeze Lends Me Half-Sugar",
    ["晚餐"] = "Dinner",
    ["晚餐-穷人需求物资"] = "Dinner - Poor person's supply request",
    ["晚餐过后"] = "After dinner",
    ["晚饭时间到了，没时间和你们闹了，受死吧！"] = "Dinner time has arrived, no time to mess around with you lot, prepare to die!",
    ["晦暗庄园"] = "Gloomy Manor",
    ["晨"] = "Dawn",
    ["晨光"] = "Morning light",
    ["晨光中的"] = "In the Morning Light",
    ["晨光涌动·始"] = "Morning Light Surge: Start",
    ["晨光涌动·终"] = "Morning Light Surge: End",
    ["晨光穿透窗帘时刻，美人依稀变幻模样。\n流连滋味，沁人芳香。惊魂未定，大梦一场。"] = "As the morning light pierces through the curtains, the beauty's appearance subtly shifts. \n Lingering flavors, intoxicating fragrance. Still shaken from the shock, it was all a grand dream.",
    ["晨光穿透窗帘时刻，美人依稀变换模样。\n流连滋味，沁人芳香。惊魂未定，大梦一场。"] = "When the morning light pierces through the curtains, the beauty seems to change her appearance. \n Lingering taste, refreshing fragrance. Still shaken, a big dream.",
    ["晨星天使"] = "Morning Star Angel",
    ["晨曦"] = "Dawn",
    ["晨曦中的"] = "In the Dawn",
    ["晨曦之剑，可以净化黑暗。银白细剑，能绕过屏障直接攻击。"] = "The Sword of Dawn can purify darkness. The Silver Rapier can bypass barriers to attack directly.",
    ["晨曦之锋"] = "Blade of Dawn",
    ["晨曦之露"] = "Dew of Dawn",
    ["晨曦之骰"] = "Dice of the Dawn",
    ["晨曦在脚下升起，照亮光辉之境。"] = "The dawn rises beneath our feet, illuminating the realm of brilliance.",
    ["晨曦天赋的战士推荐携带猎魔瞬斩，荣耀之斩，暮色连斩，巨剑斩击进行战斗。"] = "For a Warrior with the Dawn talent, it is recommended to carry Demon Hunter Instant Slash, Slash of Glory, Twilight Combo Slash, and Greatsword Slash for combat.",
    ["晨曦微光"] = "Dawn Glimmer",
    ["晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "The morning prayer-goer's hem is stained with dew and light; every step falls on the tail end of the hymn, chanting the sanctuary's tranquility into a walking poem.",
    ["晨辉之羽"] = "Morning Glow Feather",
