    ["暴雨夜,阿芬公爵遇刺,城堡聚当钟声敲响第八下,刺位继承人。神秘的情妇协信物现身,寻找魔女神像。当钟声敲响第八下,刺客藏身暗处,神像诅咒悄然苏醒....像诅咒悄然苏醒。\n暴雨夜,阿芬公爵遇刺,城堡聚当钟声敲响第八下,刺位继承人。神秘的情妇协信物现身,寻找魔女神像。当钟声敲响第八下,刺客藏身暗处,神像诅咒悄然苏醒....像诅咒悄然苏醒。\n暴雨夜,阿芬公爵遇刺,城堡聚当钟声敲响第八下,刺位继承人。神秘的情妇协信物现身,寻找魔女神像。当钟声敲响第八下,刺客藏身暗处,神像诅咒悄然苏醒....像诅咒悄然苏醒。"] = "On a stormy night, Duke Arfin was assassinated. As the bell in the Castle tolled for the eighth time, the heir was stabbed. A mysterious mistress appeared with a token, searching for the Goddess statue. As the bell tolled for the eighth time, the assassin hid in the shadows, and the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.... the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.\nOn a stormy night, Duke Arfin was assassinated. As the bell in the Castle tolled for the eighth time, the heir was stabbed. A mysterious mistress appeared with a token, searching for the Goddess statue. As the bell tolled for the eighth time, the assassin hid in the shadows, and the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.... the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.\nOn a stormy night, Duke Arfin was assassinated. As the bell in the Castle tolled for the eighth time, the heir was stabbed. A mysterious mistress appeared with a token, searching for the Goddess statue. As the bell tolled for the eighth time, the assassin hid in the shadows, and the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.... the Curse of the statue quietly awakened.",
