    ["更何况鲁恩已经出台法律禁止了这些事情。"] = "Besides, Loen has already passed laws prohibiting these things.",
    ["更何况，你的广播体操也让工人们得到了锻炼，健康是最珍贵的东西。"] = "Furthermore, your radio gymnastics have also helped the workers get exercise. Health is the most precious thing.",
    ["更何况，黑夜教会每月都会给我们一大笔养育资金。说真的，我们都觉得这对养育一个孩子来说有些太多了……"] = "What's more, the Church of the Evernight gives us a large sum of money for his upbringing every month. Honestly, we all feel it's a bit too much for raising one child...",
    ["更具体的细节我不能详述，因为涉及到一些位格很高的存在，涉及到星空。"] = "I cannot elaborate on the specific details because it involves some existences of very high status, and it involves the starry sky.",
    ["更具体的细节我不能详述，因为这里面涉及到位格很高的存在——星空。"] = "I cannot elaborate on more specific details because this involves an existence of a very high sequence—the Cosmos.",
    ["更准确的说法是——占卜展示的是概率最高的可能性河流。"] = "A more accurate statement is—divination shows the river of possibilities with the highest probability.",
    ["更加工整了。"] = "More neat.",
    ["更危险？为什么？"] = "More dangerous? Why?",
    ["更古怪的是，你提前梦到了案件中的女孩。"] = "What's even stranger is that you dreamed of the girl in the case beforehand.",
    ["更名布告"] = "Name Change Notice",
    ["更多"] = "More",
    ["更多……把你所有的都给我！"] = "More... Give me everything you have!",
    ["更多任务"] = "More quests",
    ["更多封印物系统信息，可以点击说明书查看。"] = "For more information on the Sealed Artifact system, click the manual to view it.",
    ["更多改装规则，可查看说明。"] = "For more modification rules, you can view the instructions.",
    ["更多数据部分的计算规则：\n<Highlight>暴击率（输出）</>：造成暴击伤害段数/总伤害段数\n<Highlight>穿刺率</>：造成未格挡伤害段数/总伤害段数\n<Highlight>单体率</>：技能标签带有“单体”的技能伤害占比\n<Highlight>群体率</>：技能标签带有“群体”的技能伤害占比\n<Highlight>爆发率</>：技能标签带有“爆发”的技能伤害占比\n<Highlight>持续率</>：技能标签带有“持续”的技能伤害占比\n<Highlight>强控时间（输出）</>：造成的实际强控控制时长（同时控制多目标会增加大量时间）\n<Highlight>弱控时间（输出）</>：造成的实际弱控控制时长（同时控制多目标会增加大量时间）\n<Highlight>暴击率（承伤）</>：受到暴击伤害段数/总伤害段数\n<Highlight>格挡率</>：格挡伤害段数/总承受伤害段数\n<Highlight>强控时间（承伤）</>：受到的实际强控控制时长\n<Highlight>弱控时间（承伤）</>：受到的实际弱控控制时长"] = "Calculation rules for additional data sections: \n<Highlight>Crit Rate (Output)</>: Number of crit damage instances / Total damage instances\n<Highlight>Pierce Rate</>: Number of non-blocked damage instances / Total damage instances\n<Highlight>Single Target Rate</>: Damage proportion of skills with the \"Single Target\" tag\n<Highlight>Group Rate</>: Damage proportion of skills with the \"Group\" tag\n<Highlight>Burst Rate</>: Damage proportion of skills with the \"Burst\" tag\n<Highlight>Continuous Rate</>: Damage proportion of skills with the \"Continuous\" tag\n<Highlight>Hard Crowd Control Duration (Output)</>: Actual duration of hard crowd control inflicted (controlling multiple targets simultaneously increases duration significantly)\n<Highlight>Soft Crowd Control Duration (Output)</>: Actual duration of soft crowd control inflicted (controlling multiple targets simultaneously increases duration significantly)\n<Highlight>Crit Rate (Damage Taken)</>: Number of crit damage instances received / Total damage instances received\n<Highlight>Block Rate</>: Number of blocked damage instances / Total damage instances received\n<Highlight>Hard Crowd Control Duration (Damage Taken)</>: Actual duration of hard crowd control received\n<Highlight>Soft Crowd Control Duration (Damage Taken)</>: Actual duration of soft crowd control received",
    ["更多时段"] = "More Time Slots",
    ["更多条件"] = "More Conditions",
    ["更多款式，可以到街边“半路有雨”店铺选购！"] = "For more styles, you can go to the \"Rain Halfway\" shop on the street to choose!",
    ["更多活尸正在袭来！"] = "More zombies are attacking!",
    ["更多灵性碎片涌现出来了。"] = "More spirit fragments are emerging.",
    ["更多的文字喷发出来"] = "More words erupt",
    ["更多的爱？那……那应该要我怎么做？"] = "More love? Then... then what should I do?",
    ["更多策略卡在此登场，每次判断带来全新结果。"] = "More strategy cards appear here; each judgment brings brand-new results.",
    ["更多设置可联系家族首席修改"] = "For more settings, contact the family chief to modify",
    ["更大的考验？"] = "Greater tests?",
    ["更好的明天"] = "A Better Tomorrow",
    ["更妙的是，哪怕被冲进下水道，它也会伴着水流一路高歌，带给所有享用它的人极致的歌唱体验。"] = "What's even better is that even if it's flushed into the sewer, it will continue to sing along with the water, bringing an ultimate singing experience to everyone who consumes it.",
    ["更家用普遍的窗框款式，木质外框显得更平淡日常。"] = "A more common household window frame style; the wooden exterior frame appears more plain and daily.",
    ["更换"] = "Change",
    ["更换关系"] = "Change Relationship",
    ["更换后原来教团的行动值将保留，任一教团等级达到4级后更换教团将有7×24小时冷静期"] = "After switching, the action points of the previous Order will be retained. There is a 7×24 hour cooldown period after switching Orders once any Order reaches level 4.",
    ["更换家族属性加成间隔时间（秒）"] = "Interval time for changing family attribute bonuses (in seconds)",
