    ["更换教团在哪里"] = "Where can I change factions?",
    ["更换教团有什么损失"] = "What are the losses when changing Orders",
    ["更换时段会取消之前的竞拍，且不返还竞拍金镑，是否确认参与新的竞拍？"] = "Changing the time slot will cancel your previous auction and the bid in pounds will not be refunded. Are you sure you want to participate in the new auction?",
