    ["更改某技能下一次触发时的CD"] = "Change the cooldown of a skill for its next trigger.",
    ["更改竞拍提醒"] = "Auction Change Notification",
    ["更改非当前技能CD（指未进入CD的技能）"] = "Change the cooldown of a skill not currently in Cooldown (i.e., a skill not on cooldown).",
    ["更新"] = "Update",
    ["更新职业资源值上限"] = "Update career resource value cap",
    ["更离谱的是，有人说，连续三次投中，就能够回家……"] = "What's even more outrageous is that some say if you hit the target three times in a row, you can go home...",
    ["更简单的曲子"] = "Simpler tune",
    ["更近一点，是多近？"] = "How much closer?",
    ["更近的地方？"] = "Somewhere closer?",
    ["更远"] = "Further",
    ["更重要的工作？啊我明白了，放心吧亲爱的布莱特，报酬从来不是问题，我也能付得起重要的价码。"] = "More important work? Ah, I understand. Don't worry, dear Bright, the reward is never a problem, and I can afford a significant price.",
    ["更重要的是，身为观众，是旁观者，也是见证者。"] = "More importantly, as a Spectator, one is a bystander and also a witness.",
    ["曼"] = "Mann",
    ["曼努埃尔·"] = "Manuel ",
    ["曼妮"] = "Manny",
    ["曼妮凑热闹路径"] = "Manny joining in the fun path",
    ["曼妮端来了咖啡"] = "Manny brings the coffee",
    ["曼妮莎"] = "Manissa",
    ["曼妮莎小姐已经在这等了很久了……从她的描述来看泽维尔先生并不会真的如此无礼，睡过了约会时间，一定是在别的地方……"] = "Miss Manisha has been waiting here for a long time... Judging by her description, Mr. Xavier wouldn't be so rude as to sleep past the date time. He must be somewhere else...",
    ["曼妮莎小姐，我有个大胆的猜测，或许你该去老维尔餐厅找一找，我相信若泽维尔先生没有失约，那他应该还在那儿痴痴等候呢。"] = "Miss Manisha, I have a bold guess. Perhaps you should go to the Old Will Restaurant and look. I believe if Mr. Xavier hasn't broken his promise, he should still be waiting there foolishly.",
    ["曼妮送咖啡路线"] = "Manny's coffee delivery route",
    ["曼宁"] = "Manning",
    ["曼尼"] = "Manny",
    ["曼德"] = "Mand",
    ["曼德的椅子"] = "Mand's chair",
    ["曼森"] = "Manson",
    ["曼波"] = "Mambo",
    ["曼蒂"] = "Mandy",
    ["曼蒂·"] = "Mandy ",
    ["曼陀罗汁液"] = "Mandragora Sap",
    ["曼陀罗的变种，致幻性与精神污染更强，极度危险。"] = "A variant of datura with stronger hallucinogenic and Mental Corruption properties, extremely dangerous.",
    ["曼顿追迹猎枪"] = "Manton Tracking Shotgun",
    ["曾在这里生存的家伙留下了大量壁画，从壁画上看，他们的外形几乎与我们一模一样，可以当作人类看待！"] = "The guys who lived here left behind a large number of murals. Judging from the murals, their appearance was almost identical to ours; they can be considered human!",
    ["曾在迷雾海、狂暴海和苏尼亚海上指引过方向，如今已作为陈设，纪念那些美好的回忆。"] = "It once pointed the way on the Fog Sea, Berserk Sea, and Sonia Sea, and now it serves as a display to commemorate those beautiful memories.",
    ["曾是天外陨铁，如今散发腐朽气息。攻击有概率射出腐蚀毒丸，让目标持续溃烂，再次攻击则毒液向周围溅射。星空的污染也会回到你身上，持续腐蚀自己。"] = "Once extraterrestrial meteorite iron, it now exudes a decaying aura. Attacks have a probability of shooting corrosive venom balls, causing the target to continuously Wither; attacking again causes the Venom to splash around. The corruption of the starry sky will also return to you, continuously corroding yourself.",
    ["曾有人为霍克斯男爵续茶"] = "Someone had refilled Baron Howkes's tea",
    ["曾有人说，死而复生便是奇迹。你觉得什么才是真正的奇迹？ "] = "Someone once said that resurrection is a miracle. What do you think is a true miracle?",
    ["曾有人这样呼唤过我，你们可以称我为——"] = "Some have called me this before. You may call me—",
    ["曾有高位存在，渡过大海，在这里建立了一个隐秘的国度：夜之国。"] = "There was once a high-level existence who crossed the sea and established a secret kingdom here: the Night Kingdom.",
    ["曾用名："] = "Previous Name:",
    ["曾经也是值夜者？你是说……"] = "Was also a Nighthawk once? You mean...",
    ["曾经只有贵族才能定义优秀的设计，哪怕那些都太过累赘单调——大量的黄金、珍珠、珊瑚……昂贵材料的手工堆砌。"] = "Once, only nobles could define excellent design, even if those were too cumbersome and monotonous—the manual piling of large amounts of gold, pearls, and coral... expensive materials.",
    ["曾经安静的墓地变得十分躁动"] = "The once-quiet cemetery has become very restless",
    ["曾经我也是个大人物……"] = "I used to be a big shot too...",
    ["曾经我也是个大人物，直到前两年发生了一场意外。"] = "I used to be a big shot, too, until an accident happened two years ago.",
    ["曾经我也是个逃避训练的战士，直到……"] = "I used to be a Warrior who avoided training, until...",
    ["曾经是，现在也还是。"] = "I used to be, and I still am.",
    ["曾经有一个年轻的水手……"] = "There once was a young sailor...",
    ["曾经有些小插曲，不过这是我的私事。为了流浪王国的未来，外交大臣我跟你一起去找他们谈判。"] = "There were some minor episodes, but that is my private business. For the future of the Wandering Kingdom, as the Minister of Foreign Affairs, I will go with you to negotiate with them.",
    ["曾经有些小插曲，不过这是我的私事。为了流浪王国的未来，外交大臣，我跟你一起去谈判。"] = "There were some small episodes, but this is my private matter. For the future of the Wandering Kingdom, Minister of Foreign Affairs, I will go negotiate with you.",
    ["曾经村里没有湖……更没有混乱……水阀在秩序的控制下……只会关得更紧实……"] = "There was no lake in the village before... and certainly no chaos... the water valve was under the control of order... it would only be closed tighter...",
    ["曾经的……夜之国。"] = "The former... Kingdom of Night.",
    ["曾经的你数值养成非常令人遗憾，可以说一败涂地。这次，你打算怎么做？"] = "Your past stat management was very regrettable; one could say it was a total failure. This time, what do you intend to do?",
    ["曾经的我服务于永恒烈阳教会，那时人还年轻，误以为太阳的荣光能照亮一切黑暗。"] = "I once served the Church of the Eternal Blazing Sun; I was young then, mistakenly believing that the glory of the sun could illuminate all darkness.",
    ["曾经？"] = "Once?",
    ["曾隶属于“议院治安队”的杀手，喜欢杀死目标，并将对方的脸皮撕下来收藏。"] = "A killer who once belonged to the 'Parliament Security Team', who likes to kill targets and tear off their facial skin to collect.",
    ["替人占卜真的很好赚—— 大部分人只是想要个人帮他们壮胆。 \n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n今天给人占卜，明明显示的结果是这样的，但竟然错了。 怎么可能，占卜不会有错， 也许是看错了。\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n（中间几页被血迹沾染了，读不太清）\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n 我见过太多人把启示当成天命， 然后死亡。"] = "Divining for others is really profitable—most people just want someone to help them build up their courage. \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n Divined for someone today, the result clearly showed this, but it was wrong. How is it possible, divination cannot be wrong, perhaps I misread it. \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n (The middle pages are stained with blood, hard to read) \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n I have seen too many people take revelations as destiny, and then die.",
    ["替他们问问"] = "Ask on their behalf",
    ["替他们问问<h>老人</>"] = "Ask the <h> old man </> for them",
    ["替代"] = "Substitute",
    ["替代剧编10040706"] = "Substitute script 10040706",
    ["替换"] = "Replace",
