    ["最大生命提高*d。"] = "Max Health increased *d.",
    ["最大生命提高*d，抵抗·首领提高*d。"] = "Max HP increased by *d, Boss Resistance increased by *d.",
    ["最大申请数"] = "Maximum number of applications",
    ["最大的风险？我觉得是，停止尝试。"] = "The biggest risk? I think it's stopping the attempt.",
    ["最大移动距离"] = "Maximum Movement Distance",
    ["最大获取"] = "Max Acquisition",
    ["最大角速度"] = "Maximum Angular Velocity",
    ["最大距离"] = "Maximum Distance",
    ["最大连胜"] = "Max Win Streak",
    ["最大选择标签数"] = "Maximum number of selected tags",
    ["最大队伍规模+1，并获得1个随机4费弈子。"] = "Max team size +1, and gain 1 random 4-cost chess piece.",
    ["最大队伍规模+1，并获得2个随机4费弈子。"] = "Max team size +1, and gain 2 random 4-cost chess pieces.",
    ["最大魔法攻击"] = "Maximum Magic Attack",
    ["最大魔法攻击_数值"] = "Maximum Magic Attack_Value",
    ["最大魔法攻击_百分比加成"] = "Maximum Magic Attack_Percentage Bonus",
    ["最大魔法攻击_额外加成"] = "Maximum Magic Attack_Extra Bonus",
    ["最好<P_Yellow>开启灵视</>调查下。"] = "It's best to <P_Yellow> activate spirit vision </> to investigate.",
    ["最好再用梦境占卜验证下。"] = "It's best to verify it with dream divination as well.",
    ["最好别打开它。"] = "Better not open it.",
    ["最好的哥哥；最好的弟弟；最好的同事。\n\n克莱恩·莫雷蒂"] = "The best brother; the best younger brother; the best colleague.\n\nKlein Moretti",
    ["最好的早餐"] = "The Best Breakfast",
    ["最好的时代"] = "The Best Era",
    ["最好的时代-提交盒饭对话"] = "The Best Era - Submit Bento Dialogue",
    ["最好的时代_近战人型怪"] = "Best Era_Melee Humanoid Monster",
    ["最好的时代位面入口"] = "Best Era Plane Entrance",
    ["最好的朋友"] = "Best Friend",
    ["最好的朋友！"] = "Best friend!",
    ["最好的武器"] = "Best Weapon",
    ["最好的武器-挑枪结束"] = "The Best Weapon - Finish Choosing Gun",
    ["最好的武器-试枪结束"] = "The Best Weapon - Finish Testing Gun",
    ["最好的武器替换"] = "Best Weapon Replacement",
    ["最好的结局"] = "The best ending",
    ["最好的苏尼亚金色泉髓质结晶——胜利者从弗萨克士兵的尸体上将它拾获。"] = "The best Sonia golden spring marrow crystal—the victor picked it up from the corpse of a Feysac soldier.",
    ["最妙的是，大学生总是装作一副体面人的样子。你瞧，他们穿着补丁摞补丁的外套，却还要挺直腰板，假装自己是个绅士。"] = "The best part is that college students always pretend to be decent people. Look, they wear coats patched over patches, yet they still have to straighten their backs, pretending to be gentlemen.",
    ["最小"] = "Min",
    ["最小攻击"] = "Minimum Attack",
    ["最小物理攻击"] = "Minimum Physical Attack",
    ["最小物理攻击_数值"] = "Minimum Physical Attack_Value",
    ["最小物理攻击_百分比加成"] = "Minimum Physical Attack_Percentage Bonus",
    ["最小物理攻击_额外加成"] = "Minimum Physical Attack_Extra Bonus",
    ["最小物理攻击：{*d,F1690008,pAtkMin}\n最大物理攻击：{*d,F1690010,pAtkMax}\n提高物理伤害的攻击基础值{*d,F1690008,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690010,pAtkMax}点和物理途径的治疗基础值{*d,F1690033,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690035,pAtkMax}点，实际效果受技能倍率影响，与技能等级无关。\n物理途径包括：占卜家、歌颂者、战士。"] = "Minimum Physical Attack: {*d,F1690008,pAtkMin}\n Maximum Physical Attack: {*d,F1690010,pAtkMax}\n Increases the base Attack value of physical damage by {*d,F1690008,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690010,pAtkMax} points and the base Healing value of physical Pathways by {*d,F1690033,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690035,pAtkMax} points. The actual effect is influenced by the Skill multiplier and is independent of the Skill level. \nPhysical Pathways include: Seer, Bard, Warrior.",
    ["最小的弟弟瓦尔多，整天沉迷哲学，也不知道以后能干嘛……"] = "The youngest brother, Waldo, is obsessed with philosophy all day, and I don't know what he'll be able to do in the future...",
    ["最小触发距离"] = "Minimum trigger distance",
    ["最小触发距离（≤0表示有位移就触发）"] = "Minimum trigger distance (≤0 means trigger if there is Displacement)",
    ["最小魔法攻击"] = "Minimum Magic Attack",
    ["最小魔法攻击_数值"] = "Minimum Magic Attack_Value",
    ["最小魔法攻击_百分比加成"] = "Minimum Magic Attack_Percentage Bonus",
    ["最小魔法攻击_额外加成"] = "Minimum Magic Attack_Extra Bonus",
    ["最小魔法攻击：{*d,F1690009,mAtkMin}\n最大魔法攻击：{*d,F1690011,mAtkMax}\n提高魔法伤害的攻击基础值{*d,F1690009,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690011,pAtkMax}点和魔法途径的治疗基础值{*d,F1690034,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690036,pAtkMax}点，实际效果受技能倍率影响，与技能等级无关。\n魔法途径包括：学徒、观众、窥秘人。"] = "Minimum Magic Attack: {*d,F1690009,mAtkMin}\n Maximum Magic Attack: {*d,F1690011,mAtkMax}\n Increases the base Attack value of magic damage by {*d,F1690009,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690011,pAtkMax} points and the base Healing value of magic Pathways by {*d,F1690034,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690036,pAtkMax} points. The actual effect is influenced by the Skill multiplier and is independent of the Skill level. \nMagic Pathways include: Apprentice, Spectator, Mystery Pryer.",
    ["最尴尬的是，那位小姐不小心把茶泼在了查尔斯勋爵的白色西装上——而那是他为了这场见面会特意从因蒂斯定制的。"] = "The most embarrassing thing was that the young lady accidentally spilled tea on Lord Charles's white suit—and that was something he had specially customized from Intis for this meeting.",
    ["最常见的方框双开窗，简洁实用，适合各种风格的房屋外立面。"] = "The most common square double-casement window, simple and practical, suitable for the facades of various styles of houses.",
    ["最底下还有几张1349年的，不知道什么原因还留着。"] = "At the very bottom, there are a few from 1349; I don't know why they are still kept.",
    ["最廷根的餐厅"] = "The Most Tingen-esque Restaurant",
    ["最快的票要三天后，甲板票3苏勒，客舱票6苏勒。"] = "The fastest ticket is in three days; deck tickets are 3 soli, cabin tickets are 6 soli.",
    ["最擅长正面战斗的序列2天使，掌握简化的“黄昏”、“战斗”和“神圣”权柄，是战士途径的荣耀象征，威能惊天动地。"] = "The Sequence 2 Angel most adept at frontal combat, mastering simplified authorities of 'Twilight', 'Combat', and 'Sacred'. You are the glorious symbol of the Warrior pathway, with earth-shattering power.",
    ["最新"] = "Latest",
    ["最新一期廷根晨报！"] = "The latest issue of the Tingen Morning Post!",
    ["最新款的化妆品，艾拉花了很多时间打扮自己。"] = "The latest cosmetics; Ella spent a lot of time dressing herself up.",
    ["最新马车"] = "Latest Carriage",
    ["最早提到拉姆德小镇的人是托马斯神父，他声称亲眼看到亚瑟坐火车前往拉姆德小镇。"] = "The first person to mention Lamud Town was Father Thomas, who claimed to have seen Arthur board a train to Lamud Town with his own eyes.",
    ["最普通的、常见的、便宜的食材，表皮有些干裂，但还是一颗很好的土豆。"] = "The most ordinary, common, and cheap ingredient; the skin is a bit dry, but it is still a very good potato.",
    ["最普通的笔记本，纸张粗糙泛黄。硬壳纸的封面上写着“克莱恩·莫雷蒂”的名字，字迹认真整齐。"] = "The most ordinary notebook, with rough, yellowed paper. The name 'Klein Moretti' is written on the hard cardboard cover in neat, earnest handwriting.",
    ["最最可怕的是，它会让人上吐下泻……即便如此，我们依旧喝了又喝，喝了又喝，喝了又喝……"] = "The most terrifying thing is that it makes you vomit and have diarrhea... even so, we still drank it again, and again, and again...",
    ["最核心叫“精神体”，是每个人最根本的灵性。对于窥秘人来说，冥想和提升力量的方式都指向它。"] = "The core is called the 'Spirit Body', which is everyone's most fundamental spirituality. For a Mystery Pryer, the ways of meditation and increasing power all point to it.",
    ["最深的棕黄色。呵，廷根市的雾气已经够黄了，家里还要刷成黄的。"] = "The deepest brownish-yellow. Heh, the fog in Tingen is already yellow enough, and now I have to paint my house yellow too.",
    ["最深的羁绊，始于最微小的确信。而所有确信，都值得被珍藏。"] = "The deepest bonds begin with the smallest certainty. And all certainty is worth cherishing.",
    ["最烈的朗齐端上桌面，最快的火焰射出枪膛。以非凡力量与未知对抗，我们的名字铸就不灭荣光！"] = "The strongest Rum is served on the table, the fastest flame shoots out of the barrel. Confronting the unknown with Beyonder powers, our names forge an immortal glory!",
    ["最热"] = "Hottest",
    ["最爱你的，罗莎琳"] = "Loving you the most, Rosalind",
    ["最特别的表"] = "The most special watch",
    ["最珍贵的配方，是拒绝被调制的勇气。"] = "The most precious formula is the courage to refuse to be concocted.",
    ["最甜美的鸩酒，最蚀骨的蜜糖。你是浅尝辄止，还是欲罢不能？"] = "The sweetest hemlock, the most bone-eroding honey. Will you just take a sip, or are you unable to stop?",
    ["最累的是哪部分？"] = "What is the most tiring part?",
