    ["最终生效灵敏度 Yaw:%.4f Pitch:%.4f"] = "Final effective sensitivity Yaw:%.4f Pitch:%.4f",
    ["最终留在纷争漩涡内的人，将平分所有积分"] = "Those who remain in the Vortex of Strife at the end will split all points equally.",
    ["最终留在纷争漩涡内的人，平分所有积分"] = "The person who remains in the vortex of strife until the end will split all points equally",
    ["最终确定声音方向<h></>"] = "Finally determine the direction of the sound <h></>",
    ["最终裂隙"] = "Final Rift",
    ["最终要的是，我们的会员可以自由地在俱乐部帮人占卜，并自己确定价格，我们只抽取很低比例的费用，您可以看看其他会员的介绍和定价。"] = "Most importantly, our members are free to help others with divination at the club and set their own prices. We only take a very low percentage as a fee. You can take a look at the introductions and pricing of other members.",
    ["最终触发区"] = "Final Trigger Area",
    ["最经典吃法，就连富人区老爷们的女仆都常来光顾呢！{{先生|女士}}来一块吗？"] = "The most classic way to eat it; even the maids of the gentlemen in the wealthy district often come to patronize us! {{ Mr. | Ms. } }, would you like a piece?",
    ["最美的玫瑰，总在暗夜绽放，总在触碰后留下无法愈合的刺痕。 "] = "The most beautiful rose always blooms in the dark night, always leaving unhealable thorn marks after being touched.",
    ["最耀眼的她"] = "The Most Dazzling Her",
    ["最起码在文史方面，我们是全方位碾压廷根大学的，这一点毋庸置疑。"] = "At the very least, in terms of literature and history, we completely crush Tingen University. There is no doubt about this.",
    ["最近"] = "Recent",
    ["最近10条"] = "Last 10 items",
    ["最近1个月"] = "Last 1 month",
    ["最近……她应该都在灵界观测房，外面对她而言太吵了。"] = "Recently... she should be in the Spirit World observation room; the outside is too noisy for her.",
    ["最近买完以后又来退货的人好多啊……理由还都一样。"] = "There have been so many people coming back to return goods after buying them recently... and the reasons are all the same.",
    ["最近事情太多，可以慢慢告诉她。对了，乔纳尔医生住哪里？"] = "There have been too many things lately; I can tell her slowly. By the way, where does Dr. Jonar live?",
    ["最近你有没有发现什么奇怪的事情？"] = "Have you noticed anything strange recently?",
    ["最近使用"] = "Recently used",
    ["最近凛冬郡的天气好，教授带她们外出勘探 。"] = "The weather in Winter County is good recently, the professor took them out for exploration.",
    ["最近刚调一批安神的香，您要试试吗？"] = "I just got a batch of incense for calming the mind; would you like to try it?",
    ["最近刚调了一批安神的香，您要试试吗？"] = "I just got a batch of incense for calming the mind; would you like to try it?",
    ["最近半年"] = "Last 6 months",
    ["最近半年已经发生不下七起工厂机械失灵事故了。"] = "There have been no fewer than seven factory mechanical failure accidents in the last six months.",
    ["最近发生了不少事情，终于有机会好好想下后续的晋升了。"] = "A lot has happened recently, and I finally have the opportunity to think properly about my subsequent advancement.",
    ["最近发生的事件诡异又危险，我需要尽快有能自保的能力。"] = "The recent events are eerie and dangerous. I need to have the ability to protect myself as soon as possible.",
    ["最近发生的事情，让你很不好受吧？"] = "The things that happened recently have been very hard on you, haven't they?",
    ["最近在这里经历了不少事情，虽然大多是在历史迷雾里……"] = "I've experienced quite a few things here recently, although most were in the Fog of History...",
    ["最近塔索克河沿岸的水鬼越来越多了，上次我差点被拖下塔索克河。"] = "There are more and more water ghosts along the Tussock River lately; I was almost dragged into the Tussock River last time.",
    ["最近塔罗牌很流行呢。"] = "Tarot cards are very popular recently.",
    ["最近大家想尝尝不同的口味，所以弗莱队长派我来探索新的餐厅，丰富大家的伙食种类。"] = "Everyone wants to try different flavors lately, so Captain Frye sent me to explore new restaurants to enrich our meal options.",
    ["最近失踪和献祭案件频发，郊外五月庄园也有异常迹象。"] = "Recently, there have been frequent cases of disappearances and sacrifices, and there are also signs of abnormalities at May Manor in the suburbs.",
    ["最近她整天念叨一个叫“格尔曼”的人，特别崇拜他。我想，不如从她的偶像入手，多了解她一些——所以买了这个。"] = "Recently, she's been talking about someone named \"Gehrman\" all day, she really admires him. I thought, why not start from her idol to understand her better— so I bought this.",
    ["最近学校里出现了一个<P_Yellow>神秘卖家</>，在期末考试前，向学生们兜售所谓的“内部资料”。"] = "Recently, a <P_Yellow> mysterious seller </> has appeared in the school, peddling so-called 'insider information' to students before the final exams.",
    ["最近学校里出现了一个神秘卖家，在期末考试前，向学生们兜售所谓的“内部资料”。"] = "A mysterious seller has appeared at school recently, peddling so-called 'insider information' to students before the final exams.",
    ["最近完成"] = "Recently Completed",
    ["最近小镇发生了什么新鲜事吗？"] = "Has anything new happened in the small town recently?",
    ["最近廷根一段废弃的下水道中经常传来令人毛骨悚然的声音……"] = "Recently, hair-raising sounds have often been heard in an abandoned sewer in Tingen...",
    ["最近廷根降温了，晚上的地面还是很冷的，刚刚差点把我冻得提前爬起来。"] = "It has cooled down in Tingen recently, and the ground is still very cold at night. I almost froze and crawled up early just now.",
    ["最近开销不小，不知道有没有什么省钱的办法……"] = "Expenses have been high lately, I wonder if there are any ways to save money...",
    ["最近弗莱队长看起来压力很大，像有什么要发生似的，搞得我们也很紧张。"] = "Captain Frye has seemed very stressed lately, as if something is about to happen, which has made us all very nervous.",
    ["最近很有名的那首诗？只抄了一半……难道不小心把草稿纸寄过来了？"] = "That poem that's been very popular lately? He only copied half of it... did he accidentally send the draft paper?",
    ["最近总睡不安稳……你们这儿有合适的推荐吗？"] = "I haven't been able to sleep well lately... do you have any suitable recommendations here?",
    ["最近我从塔罗学派获得很多指引和帮助——“正义”女士、“星星”先生……"] = "Recently, I have received a lot of guidance and help from the Tarot Club—Ms. Justice, Mr. Star...",
    ["最近我应该经常来，对这里还有些模糊的印象。"] = "I must have come here often recently; I still have some vague impressions of this place.",
    ["最近我的记性是不是更差了。"] = "Has my memory gotten worse lately?",
    ["最近我经常听见奇怪的声音、像笛子……吹得很糟糕，然后会感觉很困……但最后我会被鸟儿们唤醒。"] = "Recently, I often hear strange sounds, like a flute... played very poorly, and then I feel very sleepy... but in the end, I am woken up by the birds.",
    ["最近无可邀请玩家"] = "No recent players to invite",
    ["最近有什么新鲜事吗？"] = "Is there any news recently?",
    ["最近有发生和马桶相关的事件吗？"] = "Have there been any events related to the toilet recently?",
    ["最近有多起类似的失控事件,源头似乎都指向同一个地方......玫瑰天堂。我会把情报转告崔佛,你们心里有数就行。"] = "There have been several similar loss of control incidents recently, and the source seems to point to the same place... Rose Paradise. I will pass this intelligence on to Trevor; you all just need to keep it in mind.",
    ["最近有多起类似的失控事件，源头似乎都指向同一个地方……“玫瑰天堂”。我会把情报转告崔佛，你们心里有数就行。"] = "There have been many similar cases of loss of control recently, and the source seems to point to the same place... \"Rose Paradise.\" I will pass the information to Trevor; you just need to be aware of it.",
    ["最近有很多仆人在找工作。"] = "There are many servants looking for work lately.",
    ["最近有没有在附近感受到一些陌生的气息？"] = "Have you felt any strange auras nearby lately?",
    ["最近来食堂吃饭的人肉眼可见地减少了，后厨剩的菜堆得老高， 好多老面孔再也见不到了。我仔细想了好几天，也没想通食堂到底哪里出问题了！"] = "The number of people coming to the cafeteria has visibly decreased recently. The leftovers in the kitchen are piled high, and I haven't seen many familiar faces in a long time. I've been thinking about it for days, but I can't figure out what's wrong with the cafeteria!",
    ["最近比较特殊的是……"] = "Something special recently is...",
    ["最近河边的水鬼越来越多了，甚至连不少普通市民都亲眼看到了……"] = "There have been more and more water ghosts by the river lately, even many ordinary citizens have seen them with their own eyes...",
    ["最近海上流传着，海盗中风靡一种奶白色的蘑菇。"] = "Recently, there's a rumor at sea that a milky-white mushroom is popular among pirates.",
    ["最近海上流传着，海盗中风靡一种奶白色的蘑菇，划开表皮会流出雪白的牛奶，尝起来口感像滑嫩的鱼肉。"] = "Recently, it has been circulating at sea that there is a milky-white mushroom popular among pirates. If you slice the skin, snow-white milk will flow out, and it tastes like tender fish meat.",
    ["最近炼钢厂设备升级，我和十几个工友都被解雇了。"] = "The steel mill recently upgraded its equipment, and a dozen of my coworkers and I were laid off.",
    ["最近物价又涨了，我的房租也可以跟着涨一涨了。"] = "Prices have risen again recently, I can raise my rent accordingly.",
    ["最近班森要回家了……记得之前答应他要去接他回家，然后一起吃顿好的！"] = "Benson is coming home soon... Remember I promised to pick him up and have a good meal together!",
    ["最近生意很好，店里的客人越来越多了。"] = "Business has been very good lately, there are more and more customers in the shop.",
    ["最近的一班航线就在三天后。"] = "The nearest flight is in three days.",
    ["最近的事件"] = "Recent events",
    ["最近的事情"] = "Recent events",
    ["最近的异常"] = "Recent anomalies",
    ["最近的报纸上都这么说，我已经能背下来了。"] = "The recent newspapers all say so; I can already recite it by heart.",
    ["最近的物价真是越来越贵了，上个月的价格还没这么离谱。"] = "The cost of living has been getting more and more expensive lately; last month's prices weren't this outrageous.",
    ["最近的状况"] = "Recent situation",
    ["最近的票不好卖啊……"] = "Tickets haven't been selling well lately...",
    ["最近的酒总感觉不够烈啊。"] = "The wine lately doesn't feel strong enough.",
    ["最近组队"] = "Recent Team-up",
    ["最近裤腰带又变松了……"] = "My waistband has gotten loose again lately...",
    ["最近警察厅倒是安排了不少新人过来学习格斗。"] = "Recently, the police department has sent quite a few newcomers over to learn combat.",
    ["最近还没有和陌生人组过队"] = "No recent teams with strangers",
    ["最近这些日子，喜爱甜冰茶的人越来越多了。<P_Heart>（自豪）</>我想我在传播南方美食的过程中提供了不少的贡献。"] = "In recent days, more and more people love sweet iced tea. <P_Heart> (Proudly) </> I think I have contributed quite a bit in spreading southern cuisine.",
    ["最近那出新话剧，你去看过了吗？ "] = "Have you seen that new play recently?",
    ["最近那娘们越来越过分了，从洗衣店回家也不做晚饭，真不知道我做错了什么。"] = "That woman has been getting more and more excessive lately. She doesn't even cook dinner after coming home from the laundry, I really don't know what I did wrong.",
    ["最近镇上那些年轻人，还有外乡来的探险队，像发疯似的往古堡跑。"] = "Recently, those young people in town, and the expedition teams from out of town, have been running to the castle like crazy.",
    ["最近食堂每天剩的菜都快堆成山了，这可怎么办……"] = "Recently, the leftovers in the cafeteria are piling up like a mountain every day, what should we do...",
    ["最近魔药房里来了个小东西，挺能折腾的……不过它看待药剂的角度，还是有趣的。"] = "A little something came to the Potion Room recently, quite the troublemaker... but its perspective on potions is still interesting.",
    ["最近黑荆棘人手紧张，这位新员工……"] = "Blackthorn is short-handed recently, this new employee...",
    ["最近？"] = "Recently?",
    ["最重要的是，他有颗善良的心。"] = "Most importantly, he has a kind heart.",
    ["最重要的是，你说过你们在和弗萨克军队作战？"] = "Most importantly, you said you were fighting the Feysac army?",
    ["最重要的是，和他在一起，能让罗珊期待新一天的到来。"] = "Most importantly, being with him should make Rozanne look forward to the arrival of a new day.",
    ["最重要的是，等一个愿意停下来看画的人。"] = "Most importantly, waiting for someone willing to stop and look at the painting.",
    ["最重要的，你已经接触到非凡领域，我不会有向普通人泄密的风险。"] = "Most importantly, you have already come into contact with the Beyonder domain, so I won't run the risk of leaking secrets to an ordinary person.",
    ["最难的不是远航，是记住谁喜欢吃鱼，谁讨厌海鲜……<P_Heart>（打寒颤）</>我再也不会搞错了！"] = "The hardest part isn't the long voyage, it's remembering who likes fish and who hates seafood... <P_Heart> (Shudders) </> I'll never make that mistake again!",
    ["最需要的途径能力是……"] = "The most needed pathway ability is...",
    ["最顶上还放着一个白水晶吊坠。"] = "There is also a white crystal pendant placed on the very top.",
