    ["朝前方扇形区域飞出数张塔罗牌化为飞刀，对命中的敌人造成伤害。可以连续使用三次，第三次可以击退敌人。超过一定时间没有使用则会进入冷却。\n\n一沓普通的塔罗牌，占卜里常见的道具，也是最出乎意料的武器。"] = "Throw several Tarot cards forward that transform into flying daggers, dealing damage to enemies hit. Can be used three times in a row, with the third hit knocking back enemies. If not used within a certain time, it will enter cooldown.\n\n A deck of ordinary Tarot cards, common props in divination, and also the most unexpected weapon.",
