    ["木偶愤怒不已：“破坏仪式的人，破坏仪式的人！”\n喊叫声中，水中的红花突然孕育长大，变成了一只诡异的怪物。"] = "The puppet was furious: \"The one who ruined the ritual, the one who ruined the ritual!\" \n Amidst the screaming, the red flowers in the water suddenly grew and transformed into a bizarre monster.",
