    ["木偶演出"] = "Puppet Show",
    ["木偶点名buff"] = "Puppet roll call buff",
    ["木偶生来就是没有灵魂的，它被切割，被打磨，被拼凑。\n细长而锋利的鱼线穿过木偶的胸腔和四肢，它感受不到疼痛。\n破旧的棕色油渍布条裹住木偶的身体，它没有选择美或丑的权利。\n工匠用鲜艳的红黄色油彩涂在木偶脸上，它像马戏团的小丑，悲和喜都只能张开嘴大笑。\n木偶曾被许多手掌提着线，灵活地摆出动作，保持微笑，得到许多人的掌声和赞叹。\n一只木偶的生命有多长？几个月后鱼线断裂，布条腐烂，油彩褪色，它被新的木偶取代，被遗忘在无人的角落。\n在潮湿幽暗的地方，木偶缓缓咧开僵硬的嘴角，露出小丑般滑稽的笑容，于是谁的灵魂也成为提线木偶，被凿出许多孔洞，穿上无形的细线，关节开始滞涩……\n“来变成我的同类吧。”木偶一字一顿，声音如同腐烂的木头，“这样我就永远不会被丢下了……”"] = "A puppet is born without a soul; it is cut, polished, and assembled. \n Thin, sharp fishing lines pass through the puppet's chest and limbs; it cannot feel pain. \n Worn-out brown oily cloth wraps the puppet's body; it has no right to choose beauty or ugliness. \n The craftsman paints the puppet's face with bright red and yellow oil paint; like a circus clown, it can only open its mouth to laugh, whether in sorrow or joy. \n The puppet has been held by many palms, nimbly posing, keeping a smile, and receiving applause and admiration from many. \n How long is the life of a puppet? A few months later, the fishing line breaks, the cloth rots, the paint fades, and it is replaced by a new puppet, forgotten in a deserted corner. \n In a damp and gloomy place, the puppet slowly grins its stiff mouth, revealing a clown-like, comical smile. Thus, someone's soul also becomes a marionette, chiseled with many holes, threaded with invisible lines, and the joints begin to show stagnation... \n \"Come and become my kind.\" The puppet spoke word by word, its voice like rotting wood, \"That way, I will never be left behind again...\"",
    ["木偶自带特效"] = "Marionette built-in effect",
    ["木偶蔑视"] = "Puppet Contempt",
    ["木偶身下，压着一张泛黄的羊皮纸，上面露出\n几行晦涩的字迹。"] = "Underneath the puppet lies a yellowed piece of parchment, revealing\n a few lines of obscure handwriting.",
    ["木偶：拥抱“伟大母亲”！获得“新生与拯救”！"] = "Puppet: Hug the \"Great Mother\"! Obtain \"Rebirth and Salvation\"!",
