    ["末尾石头"] = "End Stone",
    ["末日"] = "Doomsday",
    ["末日再次迎来了新的希望，很高兴能看到你挣脱噩梦，也祝愿你以后的旅途一路顺遂。如果你需要一位可靠的倾听者，又或是需要一笔足够体面的旅费，欢迎再来找我。"] = "The apocalypse has ushered in new hope once again. I am glad to see you break free from the nightmare, and I wish you a smooth journey ahead. If you need a reliable listener, or perhaps enough decent travel funds, you are welcome to come to me again.",
    ["末日即将来临，我也要尽快消化魔药，平衡体内的污染。"] = "The apocalypse is coming, I also need to digest the potion as soon as possible and balance the corruption in my body.",
    ["末日将至？"] = "Is the apocalypse coming?",
    ["末日将近，你离高序列仍有距离，“愚者”先生从历史中借来神明的神话形态，将其投影于织茧之中，以此为你铸就超越自身的力量。 "] = "The apocalypse is near, and you are still some distance from high Sequences. Mr. \"The Fool\" borrowed the mythical form of a deity from history and projected it into the cocoon, thereby forging power for you that transcends your own.",
    ["末日将近，你离高序列仍有距离，愚者先生从历史中借来神明的神话形态，将其投影于织茧之中，以此为你铸就超越自身的力量。 "] = "The apocalypse is drawing near, and you are still far from a high sequence. Mr. Fool has borrowed the mythical form of a deity from history and projected it into the cocoon, forging power for you that transcends your own.",
    ["末日将降临廷根……他们究竟要做什么？"] = "The apocalypse will descend upon Tingen... what exactly are they trying to do?",
    ["末日巨人降临"] = "Descent of the Doomsday Giant",
    ["末日战车"] = "Doomsday Chariot",
    ["末日的希望真的能寄托在这颗染上血色的光茧之中吗？我们如何能看清神明的棋盘，更何况还是支柱级的博弈。"] = "Can the hope of the apocalypse really be pinned on this blood-stained cocoon of light? How can we see through the chessboard of the gods, let alone a game played by the Pillars?",
    ["末日越近，越能感到混乱和纷争正在成为这个时代的基调。像学派这样秩序井然的地方几乎两只手就能数得过来。"] = "The closer the apocalypse, the more one can feel that chaos and strife are becoming the keynote of this era. Places as orderly as the school can almost be counted on two hands.",
    ["末日魔女"] = "Witch of Doom",
    ["末日魔女魔药"] = "Doom Witch Potion",
    ["末日？！"] = "Apocalypse?!",
    ["本"] = "Dungeon",
    ["本%s"] = "This %s",
    ["本%s%02d:%02d"] = "This %s%02d:%02d",
    ["本%s开启"] = "This %s is open",
    ["本Condition依赖于有目标，当没有目标时，按角度差为0°来处理"] = "This Condition depends on having a target; when there is no target, it is handled as an angle difference of 0°.",
    ["本Condition依赖于有目标，当没有目标时，距离返回值为-1来处理"] = "This Condition depends on having a target; when there is no target, the distance return value is handled as -1.",
    ["本buff层数小于5时,能量球伤害将会降低,只降低一次"] = "When this buff stack is less than 5, Energy Ball damage will be reduced, only once",
    ["本·"] = "Ben ",
    ["本世纪最精彩的戏法表演，头身分离术！欢迎前来帮助……不，观看！"] = "The most spectacular magic trick of the century, the separation of head and body! Come and help... no, watch!",
    ["本人拥有强健的体魄与意志力，同时具备良好的职业素养，能够承受工作压力，并具有强劲的自我驱动与学习能力……"] = "I possess a strong physique and willpower, as well as good professional ethics. I can withstand work pressure and have strong self-motivation and learning ability...",
    ["本会所奉行严格的谨慎原则与选择性接待制度，恕不接待未持有邀请函的客人。"] = "This club adheres to a strict principle of caution and a selective reception system; we apologize for not being able to receive guests without an invitation letter.",
    ["本体表现"] = "Main body appearance",
    ["本俱乐部与<HighLight_L>[%s]</>的宣战将在今日<HighLight_L>%s</>开战，整装待发，准备开战！"] = "The war between our club and <HighLight_L>[%s]</> will begin today at <HighLight_L>%s</>. Get ready and prepare for battle!",
    ["本俱乐部与<Highlight_L>[%s]</>的宣战已在霍纳奇斯山脉开始！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【点击前往俱乐部宣战】</>"] = "The war between our club and <Highlight_L>[%s]</> has begun in the Hornacis Mountain Range! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【Click to go to club war】</>",
    ["本俱乐部在与<HighLight_L>[%s]</>的宣战决斗中遗憾落败，愿重振自身，来日再战。"] = "This Club unfortunately lost the war duel against <HighLight_L>[%s]</>. We hope to regroup and fight again another day.",
    ["本俱乐部在与<HighLight_L>[%s]</>的宣战决斗中遗憾落败，愿重振自身，来日再战。扣除<HighLight_L>[俱乐部资金%s]</>。"] = "This Club unfortunately lost the war duel against <HighLight_L>[%s]</>. We hope to regroup and fight again another day. <HighLight_L>[Club funds %s]</> deducted.",
    ["本俱乐部处于四方联赛分组中，暂时无法解散。"] = "This club is currently in a Four-Way League group and cannot be disbanded at this time.",
    ["本俱乐部处于当前势力战轮次中，暂时无法解散。"] = "This club is currently in a faction war round and cannot be disbanded temporarily.",
    ["本俱乐部已在宣战决斗中击败<HighLight_L>[%s]</>，荣耀归于旗下每一位成员。返还<HighLight_L>[俱乐部资金%s]</>。"] = "This Club has defeated <HighLight_L>[%s]</> in the war duel; glory belongs to every member. <HighLight_L>[Club funds %s]</> returned.",
    ["本俱乐部已在宣战决斗中击败<HighLight_L>[%s]</>，荣耀归于旗下每一位成员！"] = "This Club has defeated <HighLight_L>[%s]</> in the war duel; glory belongs to every member!",
    ["本俱乐部战略服积分排名：<Ranking>第%d名</>，共可授予俱乐部英雄称号：<Ranking>%d</>人"] = "This club's Strategic Server points ranking: <Ranking> No. %d </>, total club hero titles that can be granted: <Ranking> %d </> people",
    ["本俱乐部最可爱的小宝贝上麦啦！"] = "The cutest little treasure of this club is now on the mic!",
    ["本俱乐部该时段已有宣战！"] = "This club has already declared war during this period!",
    ["本公司决定"] = "Our company has decided",
    ["本公司决定将你辞退"] = "This company has decided to dismiss you.",
    ["本区域剩余站点"] = "Remaining stations in this region",
    ["本卡池今日剩余结交次数<T_2>%s次</>"] = "Remaining connection attempts for this card pool today <T_2>%s times </>",
    ["本名周明瑞，1349年穿越成为克莱恩·莫雷蒂，穿越后卷入神秘学事件，并因此加入廷根值夜者小队，成为“占卜家”序列非凡者。机缘巧合下创立了塔罗会，代号“愚者”。在穿越后一直以“回家”为初心，但在卷入阴谋死而复生后，克莱恩义无反顾地走上复仇之路。"] = "Originally named Zhou Mingrui, he transmigrated in 1349 to become Klein Moretti. After transmigrating, he became involved in occult events and thus joined the Tingen Nighthawks squad, becoming a 'Seer' Sequence Beyonder. By chance, he founded the Tarot Club with the codename 'The Fool'. After transmigrating, his original intention was always to 'go home', but after being involved in a conspiracy and dying only to be resurrected, Klein embarked on a path of revenge without hesitation.",
    ["本名周明瑞，穿越到1349年成为克莱恩·莫雷蒂，穿越后卷入神秘学事件，并因此加入廷根值夜者小队，成为“占卜家”序列非凡者。机缘巧合下创立了塔罗会，代号“愚者”。在穿越后一直以“回家”为初心，但在被卷入阴谋死而复生后，义无反顾地走上了复仇之路。"] = "His original name is Zhou Mingrui, who traveled to 1349 and became Klein Moretti. After traveling, he was involved in occult events and thus joined the Tingen Nighthawks squad, becoming a “Seer” Sequence Beyonder. By chance, he founded the Tarot Club with the codename “The Fool.” After traveling, he has always kept “going home” as his original intention, but after being involved in a conspiracy and dying and resurrecting, he embarked on the path of revenge without hesitation.",
    ["本告示栏供公众使用。风暴教会对张贴之商业内容概不负责。"] = "This notice board is for public use. The Church of Storms is not responsible for the commercial content posted.",
