    ["本姿态下，自身造成的伤害大幅降低，但治疗能力增强且进攻属性可以提升自身的治疗量（提升幅度由属性类别和技能倍率决定）。\n本姿态下，自身受到<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>时，buffdisc(*id)，持续passivedisc(*id)秒，此效果内置15秒冷却时间。"] = "In this stance, your damage dealt is significantly reduced, but your healing ability is enhanced, and offensive attributes can increase your healing amount (the increase depends on attribute type and skill multiplier). \n In this stance, when you are affected by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> Crowd Control </>, you gain buffdisc(*id) for passivedisc(*id) seconds; this effect has an internal 15-second cooldown.",
