    ["本层已完成，和奥黛丽对话深入愚者梦境"] = "This layer is complete; talk to Audrey to go deeper into the Fool's dream",
    ["本层梦境已完成"] = "This layer of the dream has been completed",
    ["本届乱斗中，<PVPHighlight>%s</>幻象投影的总得分最高，表现优异；<PVPHighlight>%s</>击败其他幻象投影最多，无人能敌！"] = "In this brawl, <PVPHighlight>%s</>'s phantom projection had the highest total score, performing excellently; <PVPHighlight>%s</> defeated the most other phantom projections, invincible!",
    ["本届乱斗报名尚未开启，请稍作等待"] = "Registration for this brawl has not started yet; please wait a moment.",
    ["本届众神之巅已经结束，助力奖励已自动发送到您邮箱内。"] = "This Peak of the Gods has ended, and the support rewards have been automatically sent to your mailbox.",
    ["本届优秀投影大赏"] = "This Season's Excellent Projection Awards",
    ["本届优秀选手大赏"] = "Outstanding Players of the Tournament",
    ["本届时间"] = "Current Season Duration",
    ["本届比赛幻象投影"] = "This season's phantom projections",
    ["本工具支持上传视频，智能提取人物动作并生成可保存的自定义动作资源，方便构建专属动作库。\n建议上传单人、画面稳定且人物与背景区分明显的视频，以获得更精准的动作捕捉效果。\n生成的动作支持命名并保存，可随时调用，满足个性化动作创作需求。"] = "This tool supports uploading videos, intelligently extracting character movements, and generating saveable custom action resources, making it easy to build an exclusive action library. \nIt is recommended to upload videos that are solo, have stable footage, and have a clear distinction between the character and the background to obtain more accurate motion capture effects. \nGenerated actions can be named and saved, and can be called at any time to meet personalized action creation needs.",
    ["本应该是我把你推下去，但我不想害人……麻烦了。"] = "It should have been me pushing you down, but I don't want to hurt anyone... it's troublesome.",
    ["本店上新了茉莉拿铁，要试试吗？"] = "Our shop has a new jasmine latte, would you like to try it?",
    ["本店并不出售钢琴……但我想您听到的声音应该来自我们的一个八音盒。"] = "This shop does not sell pianos... but I think the sound you heard must have come from one of our music boxes.",
    ["本店所有香水均由伯爵臻选级纯天然原料精制而成——您的优雅，无需谎言。"] = "All perfumes in this shop are refined from Earl-grade pure natural ingredients—your elegance needs no lies.",
    ["本店最近新来了一批黑色料子，请容许我带您看看。"] = "Our shop has recently received a new batch of black fabric; please allow me to show it to you.",
    ["本想故作低调，呵——算了，这是穿越者都想做的事吧？再说这里的基础设施真的很落后。"] = "I wanted to act low-key, heh—forget it, this is what every transmigrator wants to do, right? Besides, the infrastructure here is really backward.",
    ["本技能可充能3次，拥有三种剑法，每次施法后剑法自动变换，不同剑法可相互衔接，分别造成*d、sum(*d+*d)、sum(*d+*d)点物理伤害。\n施法时每段消耗至多2枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，使本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>\n消耗1/2枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，本技能每次的伤害基础值提高*d/*d点。"] = "This skill can be charged 3 times and possesses three sword techniques. The techniques automatically cycle after each cast, and different techniques can be chained together, dealing *d, sum(*d+*d), and sum(*d+*d) physical damage respectively. \n Each segment consumes up to 2 Twilight Marks <HighLight></> upon casting to grant this skill Strengthening <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Strengthening </>\n: Consuming 1/2 Twilight Marks <HighLight></> increases the base damage of each hit of this skill by *d/*d.",
    ["本技能实例增伤"] = "Damage Boost for this skill instance.",
    ["本技能实例治疗增幅"] = "Healing boost for this skill instance.",
    ["本技能是否造成过击杀"] = "Has this Skill caused a kill",
    ["本日上限："] = "Daily Limit:",
    ["本日可使用次数"] = "Daily usage limit",
    ["本月"] = "This month",
    ["本月不再弹出"] = "Do not show again this month",
    ["本月第%d个%s"] = "The %d %s of this month",
    ["本月阅读活动主题为“艺术熏陶”。\n\n推荐阅读书目：《鲁恩早期古典诗歌集》《罗塞尔诗选》\n推荐戏剧欣赏：《伯爵归来》《傲慢者》《背叛者指环》"] = "The theme for this month's reading event is \"Artistic Cultivation\". \n\n Recommended reading list: \"Collection of Early Loen Classical Poetry\", \"Roselle's Poetry Selection\". \n Recommended drama appreciation: \"The Return of the Count\", \"The Arrogant\", \"The Traitor's Ring\".",
    ["本月需要补充的材料"] = "Materials Needed This Month",
    ["本服"] = "Current Server",
    ["本服俱乐部宣战"] = "Current Server Club War Declaration",
    ["本服俱乐部宣战旗帜"] = "Club war banner for this server.",
    ["本服排名"] = "Server Ranking",
    ["本服查找"] = "Search Server",
    ["本期剩余:%d分钟"] = "Remaining this period: %d minutes",
    ["本期剩余:%d天"] = "Remaining this period: %d days",
    ["本期剩余:%d小时"] = "Remaining this period: %d hours",
    ["本期剩余:%d秒"] = "Remaining this period: %d seconds",
    ["本期排名：%s"] = "Current Season Ranking: %s",
    ["本期活动倒计时：%s"] = "Event countdown: %s",
    ["本期活动已结束"] = "This event has ended",
    ["本期获得 <Yellow>%d</>/%d"] = "Obtained this period <Yellow>%d</>/%d",
    ["本来想先放在这，一点点搬去集市卖，没想到老鼠来得这么快。"] = "I originally wanted to leave them here and move them to the market bit by bit, but I didn't expect the mice to come so quickly.",
    ["本来是，最近东区来了个叫<P_Yellow>卡莱布</>的，抢走了另外一半。"] = "They used to be, but recently someone named <P_Yellow>Caleb</> came to the East District and snatched away the other half.",
    ["本杰明"] = "Benjamin",
    ["本杰明·"] = "Benjamin ",
    ["本杰明·克劳德"] = "Benjamin Cloud",
    ["本杰明哥哥……我害怕……我想回家……"] = "Brother Benjamin... I'm scared... I want to go home...",
    ["本杰明哥哥，生日快乐！"] = "Brother Benjamin, happy birthday!",
    ["本杰明接过它，感受到的却是铁十字街的温度：老人在灯下打磨的每一道刻痕，都藏着守护家人的执念。本杰明握紧它，徽章突然泛起淡紫色的微光，一道温暖的力量流入你的血脉——这是托马斯爷爷的祝福，也是铁十字街最后的守护。"] = "Benjamin took it, but what he felt was the warmth of Iron Cross Street: every mark the old man polished under the lamp held the obsession to protect his family. Benjamin gripped it tightly, and the badge suddenly glowed with a pale purple light, a warm power flowing into your blood—this is Grandpa Thomas's blessing, and also the last protection of Iron Cross Street.",
    ["本杰明！你……你刚才去哪了？外面……到处都是枪声，还有火。托马斯爷爷的房子也着火了！"] = "Benjamin! You... where did you go just now? Outside... there was gunfire everywhere, and fire. Old Thomas's house is on fire too!",
    ["本杰明！谢天谢地！"] = "Benjamin! Thank goodness!",
    ["本杰明，你的护盾，能同时罩住两边吗？"] = "Benjamin, can your Shield cover both sides at the same time?",
    ["本杰明，你脸上怎么伤成这样了？"] = "Benjamin, how did you get such injuries on your face?",
    ["本杰明，孩子们……幸好你们都还活着。"] = "Benjamin, children... thank goodness you are all still alive.",
    ["本杰明：不！玛莎！快趴下！"] = "Benjamin: No! Martha! Get down!",
    ["本杰明：你会，为此付出代价……卡拉彭！"] = "Benjamin: You will pay for this... Kalapon!",
    ["本杰明：卡……卡拉彭……"] = "Benjamin: Ka... Kalapon...",
    ["本杰明：天哪……他们在……他们在杀人……"] = "Benjamin: My god... they are... they are killing people...",
    ["本杰明：安妮别过去！危险！"] = "Benjamin: Annie, don't go over there! It's dangerous!",
    ["本杰明：艾玛小姐……太好了你没事。"] = "Benjamin: Miss Emma... thank goodness you're okay.",
    ["本杰明：铁十字街，请替我保护好他们……"] = "Benjamin: Iron Cross Street, please protect them for me...",
    ["本案目前有三点矛盾无法解释。"] = "There are currently three unexplainable contradictions in this case.",
    ["本次“幸运蛋”的数字编号是88，获胜者，就是……"] = "The 'Lucky Egg' number is 88. The winner is...",
    ["本次「灰雾测试」为计费删档测试，非凡者在测试期间累计充值的金额，将在公测开启后按照以下规则进行返还，请仔细阅读。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>金镑/绑定金镑</>\n测试期间累计充值金额（包括购买金镑、愚者福音、时代恩典、命运馈赠及其他现金付费商品），公测后我们将根据充值额度，按照【1元=10金镑】的标准进行倍率返还。具体返还规则如下：\n● 本次测试中累计充值金额在<Highlight>0-4000元人民币（含4000元）</>时：获得<Highlight>120%金镑</>和<Highlight>50%绑定金镑</>的返还。\n● 本次测试中累计充值金额<Highlight>超过4000元人民币</>时：0~4000元（含4000元）部分获得<Highlight>120%金镑</>和<Highlight>50%绑定金镑</>的返还，超过4000元部分将获得<Highlight>120%金镑</>的返还，不额外赠送绑定金镑。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>愚者福音</>\n测试期间购买【愚者福音】的充值金额，均可计入累计充值。公测后，购买【愚者福音】的金额<Highlight>不仅会根据【金镑】返还规则进行返还，同时还将获得【愚者福音】返还</>。具体返还规则如下：\n● 购买【愚者福音】的非凡者，将根据购买数量获得对应份数的<Highlight>【愚者福音】道具返还</>，最多返还<Highlight>2份</>。\n● 超过2份的部分，其购买金额仍会计入累计充值总额，但不会额外返还【愚者福音】道具。\n● 领取后，愚者福音将保存至您的背包，该道具需要非凡者主动使用后激活，使用前不会失效。\n请注意，购买【愚者福音】时的付费金额，将通过上述【金镑】返还规则计入返还总额。使用愚者福音道具，<Highlight>仅可获得30天权益</>，不会再次获得购买时赠送的【金镑】。多个【愚者福音】道具的使用、叠加或续期规则以公测游戏内实际规则为准。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>时代恩典/命运馈赠</>\n在测试期间购买【时代恩典】或【命运馈赠】的充值金额，均可计入累计充值。购买【时代恩典】或【命运馈赠】的金额，在公测时<Highlight>不仅会根据【金镑】返还规则进行返还，同时还将获得【时代恩典】或【命运馈赠】返还</>。具体返还规则如下：\n● 购买【时代恩典】的非凡者，公测时将获得<Highlight>【时代恩典】道具返还</>，使用后可解锁当期【时代恩典】战令。\n● 购买【命运馈赠】或通过【命运馈赠升级礼】升级到【命运馈赠】的非凡者，公测时将获得<Highlight>【命运馈赠】道具返还</>，使用后可解锁当期【命运馈赠】战令。\n● 若创建多个角色购买了多份战令，<Highlight>最多返还1份战令道具</>；若购买了不同档位的战令，优先返还更高档位的<Highlight>【命运馈赠】道具</>。\n● 其余战令的购买金额仍会计入累计充值总额，但不会额外返还对应的战令道具。\n● 领取后，对应道具将保存至您的背包，该道具需要非凡者主动使用后激活，使用前不会失效。\n请注意，购买战令时的付费金额，将通过上述【金镑】返还规则计入返还总额。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>举例说明</>\n为了便于非凡者理解，进行举例说明 ▼\n如果您在测试期间累计充值了<Highlight>5218元</>，其中5000元用于购买金镑和其他现金付费商品，90元用于购买3张愚者福音，128元用于购买1份命运馈赠，游戏公测后可获得的充值返还内容如下：\n\n金镑返还总额为：\n● 4000元部分：4000 × 10 × 120% = <Highlight>48000</>\n● 1218元部分：1218 × 10 × 120% = <Highlight>14616</>\n● 金镑合计：<Highlight>62616</>\n\n绑定金镑赠送总额为：\n● 4000元部分：4000 × 10 × 50% = <Highlight>20000</>\n● 绑定金镑合计：<Highlight>20000</>\n\n道具返还：\n● <Highlight>【愚者福音】× 2</>\n● <Highlight>【命运馈赠】× 1</>\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>领取方式</>\n非凡者在公测开启后，使用「灰雾测试」期间的充值账号登录对应渠道的游戏，选择任意服务器创建角色，<Highlight>完成第一章主线任务后</>，即可收到返利解锁邮件通知，前往指定地点与返利领取NPC对话，领取相应的充值返还。\n该活动有效期为<Highlight>公测后6个月</>，过期后将不再支持领取，请非凡者务必在有效期内进行领取。在有效期内成功领取的返还道具，领取后将保存至背包，使用前不会失效。\n※同一账号下的返利仅可由<Highlight>一名角色进行一次领取</>，领取前请仔细确认领取角色。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>查询方式</>\n「灰雾测试」充值返还查询小程序将在「灰雾测试」结束后上线。上线后，非凡者可前往小程序查询「灰雾测试」期间的充值总金额和可获得的返还内容。\n测试过程中，非凡者可在<Highlight>【商城】-【充值】</>页面查看账号当前的充值总额。\n※小程序具体上线时间以后续官方公告为准。小程序仅支持查询官服的充值数据，通过其他渠道参与测试的非凡者，可以咨询对应渠道的客服。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>注意事项</>\n「灰雾测试」期间，同一渠道、同账号下所有角色的充值金额将合并计算。PC端、移动端及充值中心等各充值方式支付的金额，均可计入累计充值金额。不同渠道的充值金额各自独立累计，不会合并统计。\n「灰雾测试」期间在<Highlight>官服</>充值的金额，公测后仅支持在<Highlight>官服</>进行返还领取；在<Highlight>渠道服</>充值的金额，公测时仅支持在<Highlight>渠道服</>进行返还。\n「灰雾测试」的返还内容仅针对使用现金支付的金额，其他通过活动赠送的资源，或使用商品后可额外领取的道具（包括但不限于：充值额外赠送的金镑、月卡赠送的金镑、豪华版战令赠送的道具、战令及月卡中包含的道具、系统赠送、运营邮件等）<Highlight>不计入返还内容</>。\n「灰雾测试」的返还内容仅支持在《诡秘之主》正式公测后，使用「灰雾测试」期间进行充值的同一账号领取，<Highlight>无法跨账号领取</>，或将返还内容转移给其他账号。\n最终领取奖励只能由<Highlight>一名角色进行一次领取</>，请谨慎选择领取角色。领取后，该账号下的其他角色将无法再次领取返利。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Q&A</>\nQ1 「灰雾测试」支持哪些充值方式？\n本次测试支持<Highlight>支付宝、微信支付</>等主流付款方式。\n\nQ2 我充钱之后，没有收到商品（金镑、愚者福音等）怎么办？\n如遇充值后长时间不到账的问题，请通过<Highlight>游戏内客服中心</>进行反馈。\n\nQ3 不同平台的设备间（如PC或手机），我的充值互通吗？\n本次测试期间，同一账号下，所有充值方式（PC端、移动端、充值中心）的充值金额<Highlight>将合并计算</>。\n\nQ4 充值返利是否支持跨账号领取？\n<Highlight>不支持</>。游戏公测后非凡者需登录「灰雾测试」进行过充值的同一账号方可领取充值返利，无法进行跨账号操作。\n\nQ5 我在「灰雾测试」测试中付费充值了，什么时间可以领取到充值返利？\n非凡者可以在<Highlight>游戏公测后</>，与游戏中指定NPC对话，领取相应的返利。请使用参与「灰雾测试」的同一账号进行领取。\n\nQ6 返还内容有领取期限吗？\n有。返还内容需在<Highlight>公测后6个月内</>完成领取，过期后将不再支持领取。\n\nQ7 我通过taptap或bilibili进行了测试，并充值了一定金额，如何进行返还？\n● 通过<Highlight>taptap</>测试的非凡者，可在游戏公测后，使用曾经参与「灰雾测试」的<Highlight>弹指宇宙通行证账号</>登录游戏，领取对应返还奖励。\n● 通过<Highlight>bilibili</>测试的非凡者，需要在游戏公测后，通过<Highlight>bilibili游戏中心</>下载对应客户端，并登录进行充值的bilibili账号，领取对应返还奖励。"] = "This \"Gray Fog Test\" is a paid, data-wiping test. The total amount topped up by Beyonders during the test will be returned after the official launch according to the following rules. Please read carefully. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gold Pounds/Bound Gold Pounds</>\nFor the total amount topped up during the test (including purchases of Gold Pounds, Fool's Gospel, Era's Grace, Fate's Gift, and other cash-paid items), we will provide a return based on the top-up amount at a rate of [1 Yuan = 10 Gold Pounds] after the official launch. The specific return rules are as follows: \n● For a total top-up amount during this test of <Highlight>0-4000 RMB (inclusive)</>: You will receive a return of <Highlight>120% Gold Pounds</> and <Highlight>50% Bound Gold Pounds</>. \n● For a total top-up amount during this test <Highlight>exceeding 4000 RMB</>: The portion from 0-4000 RMB (inclusive) will receive a return of <Highlight>120% Gold Pounds</> and <Highlight>50% Bound Gold Pounds</>, while the portion exceeding 4000 RMB will receive a return of <Highlight>120% Gold Pounds</>, with no additional Bound Gold Pounds. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Fool's Gospel</>\nAll top-up amounts used to purchase [Fool's Gospel] during the test will count toward your total top-up. After the official launch, the amount spent on [Fool's Gospel] <Highlight>will not only be returned according to the [Gold Pound] return rules, but you will also receive a [Fool's Gospel] return</>. The specific return rules are as follows: \n● Beyonders who purchased [Fool's Gospel] will receive a corresponding number of <Highlight>[Fool's Gospel] item returns</> based on the quantity purchased, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2 copies</>. \n● For any amount exceeding 2 copies, the purchase amount will still count toward the total top-up, but no additional [Fool's Gospel] items will be returned. \n● After claiming, the Fool's Gospel will be saved to your Inventory. This item must be manually activated by the Beyonder and will not expire before use. \nPlease note that the cash amount paid when purchasing [Fool's Gospel] will be included in the total return amount via the [Gold Pound] return rules mentioned above. Using the Fool's Gospel item <Highlight>only grants 30 days of benefits</> and will not grant the [Gold Pounds] gifted at the time of purchase again. Rules regarding the use, stacking, or renewal of multiple [Fool's Gospel] items will be subject to the actual rules in the official game. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Era's Grace/Fate's Gift </>\nAll top-up amounts used to purchase [Era's Grace] or [Fate's Gift] during the test will count toward your total top-up. After the official launch, the amount spent on [Era's Grace] or [Fate's Gift] <Highlight>will not only be returned according to the [Gold Pound] return rules, but you will also receive an [Era's Grace] or [Fate's Gift] return</>. The specific return rules are as follows: \n● Beyonders who purchased [Era's Grace] will receive an <Highlight>[Era's Grace] item return</> at the official launch, which can be used to unlock the current [Era's Grace] Battle Pass. \n● Beyonders who purchased [Fate's Gift] or upgraded to [Fate's Gift] via the [Fate's Gift Upgrade Pack] will receive a <Highlight>[Fate's Gift] item return</> at the official launch, which can be used to unlock the current [Fate's Gift] Battle Pass. \n● If you created multiple characters and purchased multiple Battle Passes, <Highlight>a maximum of 1 Battle Pass item will be returned</>; if you purchased different tiers of Battle Passes, the higher-tier <Highlight>[Fate's Gift] item</> will be returned first. \n● The purchase amount of the remaining Battle Passes will still count toward the total top-up, but no additional corresponding Battle Pass items will be returned. \n● After claiming, the corresponding item will be saved to your Inventory. This item must be manually activated by the Beyonder and will not expire before use. \nPlease note that the cash amount paid when purchasing a Battle Pass will be included in the total return amount via the [Gold Pound] return rules mentioned above. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Example Illustration </>\nTo help Beyonders understand, here is an example ▼ \nIf you topped up a total of <Highlight>5218 RMB</> during the test, of which 5000 RMB was used to purchase Gold Pounds and other cash-paid items, 90 RMB was used to purchase 3 Fool's Gospels, and 128 RMB was used to purchase 1 Fate's Gift, the top-up return content you can receive after the official launch is as follows: \n\nTotal Gold Pound return: \n● 4000 RMB portion: 4000 × 10 × 120% = <Highlight>48000</>\n● 1218 RMB portion: 1218 × 10 × 120% = <Highlight>14616</>\n● Total Gold Pounds: <Highlight>62616</>\n\nTotal Bound Gold Pound gift: \n● 4000 RMB portion: 4000 × 10 × 50% = <Highlight>20000</>\n● Total Bound Gold Pounds: <Highlight>20000</>\n\nItem Return: \n● <Highlight>[Fool's Gospel] × 2</>\n● <Highlight>[Fate's Gift] × 1</>\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>How to Claim </>\nAfter the official launch, Beyonders should log in to the game on the corresponding platform using the same account used during the \"Gray Fog Test\", create a character on any server, and <Highlight>after completing the first chapter's main Quest</>, you will receive a notification email for the rebate unlock. Go to the designated location and speak with the rebate-claiming NPC to receive your corresponding top-up return. \nThis event is valid for <Highlight>6 months after the official launch</>. After this period, claims will no longer be supported, so please ensure you claim your rewards within the validity period. Successfully claimed return items will be saved to your Inventory and will not expire before use. \n※The rebate for the same account can only be claimed once by <Highlight>one character</>. Please confirm your choice of character carefully before claiming. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>How to Check </>\nThe \"Gray Fog Test\" top-up return inquiry mini-program will be launched after the \"Gray Fog Test\" ends. Once launched, Beyonders can visit the mini-program to check the total top-up amount during the \"Gray Fog Test\" and the return content they are eligible for. \nDuring the test, Beyonders can view their account's current total top-up amount on the <Highlight>[Shop]-[Top-up]</> page. \n※The specific launch time of the mini-program will be subject to subsequent official announcements. The mini-program only supports checking top-up data for the official server. Beyonders who participated in the test through other channels can consult the customer service of the corresponding channel. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Important Notes </>\nDuring the \"Gray Fog Test\", the top-up amounts of all characters under the same account and channel will be combined. Amounts paid via PC, mobile, and the Top-up Center will all count toward the total top-up amount. Top-up amounts from different channels are calculated independently and will not be combined. \nAmounts topped up on the <Highlight>official server</> during the \"Gray Fog Test\" can only be claimed on the <Highlight>official server</> after the official launch; amounts topped up on <Highlight>channel servers</> can only be claimed on <Highlight>channel servers</> after the official launch. \nThe return content for the \"Gray Fog Test\" only applies to amounts paid in cash. Other resources gifted through events, or items that can be additionally claimed after using a product (including but not limited to: extra Gold Pounds gifted with top-ups, Gold Pounds gifted with monthly cards, items gifted with the Deluxe Battle Pass, items included in Battle Passes and monthly cards, system gifts, operational emails, etc.) <Highlight>are not included in the return content</>. \nThe return content for the \"Gray Fog Test\" can only be claimed after the official launch of \"Lord of Mysteries\" using the same account used to top up during the \"Gray Fog Test\". <Highlight>It cannot be claimed across accounts</> or transferred to other accounts. \nThe final reward can only be claimed once by <Highlight>one character</>. Please choose your character carefully. After claiming, other characters under the same account will not be able to claim the rebate again. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Q&A </>\nQ1 Which top-up methods are supported for the \"Gray Fog Test\"? \nThis test supports mainstream payment methods such as <Highlight>Alipay and WeChat Pay</>. \n\nQ2 What should I do if I don't receive my items (Gold Pounds, Fool's Gospel, etc.) after topping up? \nIf you encounter issues where your top-up is not received for a long time, please provide Feedback via the <Highlight>in-game Customer Service Center</>. \n\nQ3 Is my top-up shared across devices on different platforms (e.g., PC or mobile)? \nDuring this test, all top-up amounts from all payment methods (PC, mobile, Top-up Center) under the same account <Highlight>will be combined</>. \n\nQ4 Can top-up rebates be claimed across accounts? \n<Highlight>No, it is not supported</>. After the official launch, Beyonders must log in with the same account used to top up during the \"Gray Fog Test\" to claim the rebate; cross-account operations are not possible. \n\nQ5 When can I claim my top-up rebate after paying during the \"Gray Fog Test\"? \nBeyonders can claim their corresponding rebate by speaking with the designated NPC in the game <Highlight>after the official launch</>. Please use the same account that participated in the \"Gray Fog Test\" to claim. \n\nQ6 Is there a time limit for claiming the return content? \nYes. The return content must be claimed within <Highlight>6 months after the official launch</>. After this period, claims will no longer be supported. \n\nQ7 I participated in the test via TapTap or Bilibili and topped up a certain amount. How do I get my return? \n● Beyonders who participated in the test via <Highlight>TapTap</> can log in to the game after the official launch using the <Highlight>Tanji Universe Passport account</> used during the \"Gray Fog Test\" to claim the corresponding return rewards. \n● Beyonders who participated in the test via <Highlight>Bilibili</> must download the corresponding client via the <Highlight>Bilibili Game Center</> after the official launch and log in with the Bilibili account used for the top-up to claim the corresponding return rewards.",
