    ["本次气息共鸣后当前选中气息与最低强度气息差距已超过5级，若继续强化会衰减本条气息的共鸣度和属性值提升，是否继续？"] = "After this aura Resonance, the gap between the currently selected aura and the lowest intensity aura has exceeded 5 levels. If you continue to strengthen, the Resonance and attribute value increase of this aura will decay. Continue?",
