    ["本次洗练新特质共鸣度较低，确认替换当前特质？"] = "The new trait Resonance from this purification is lower. Confirm replacing the current trait?",
    ["本次测试为保密测试，不代表游戏最终品质。请勿直播、截图、录屏。"] = "This test is confidential and does not represent the final quality of the game. Please do not stream, take screenshots, or record the screen.",
    ["本次测试为保密测试，禁止使用手机进行直播。"] = "This test is confidential. Live streaming via mobile phone is prohibited.",
    ["本次测试期间，一个账号仅能绑定1台设备，点击绑定后将绑定本设备，如需更换请点击拒绝。"] = "During this test, one account can only be bound to 1 device. Clicking bind will bind this device. If you wish to change, please click decline.",
    ["本次测试期间，每个账号最多可绑定 1 台 PC 和 1 台移动设备。点击【绑定】将把当前设备绑定至您的账号。如需绑定其他设备，请点击【取消】。"] = "During this test, each account can bind a maximum of 1 PC and 1 mobile device. Click [Bind] to bind the current device to your account. To bind a different device, please click [Cancel].",
    ["本次测试，预览的时装和发型仅为试穿效果"] = "For this test, the previewed outfits and hairstyles are for trial purposes only.",
    ["本次漫步的时光已步入尾声，%s的历史投影缓缓消散。短暂的相聚终将回归历史长河，期待下次重逢。"] = "The time for this stroll has come to an end, and the historical projection of %s is slowly dissipating. A brief gathering will eventually return to the river of history; looking forward to the next reunion.",
    ["本次百里挑蛋挑战赛，我们的获胜者究竟是谁？看得出这边的女士非常有信心啊，那边的先生也已经激动地跳起来了！"] = "Who will be the winner of this 'One in a Hundred Eggs' challenge? I can see the lady here is very confident, and the gentleman over there is already jumping with excitement!",
