    ["本次购买消耗绑定金镑，当前绑定金镑不足，\n是否使用金镑代替？\n\n花费：<Img tex2d=\"%s\"/>%s<Img tex2d=\"%s\"/>%s"] = "This purchase consumes Bound Gold Pounds. Current Bound Gold Pounds are insufficient. \n Use Gold Pounds instead? \n\n Cost: <Img tex2d=\"%s\"/>%s<Img tex2d=\"%s\"/>%s",
