    ["本玩法中无法切换途径非凡天赋。"] = "Switching Beyonder pathway talents is not supported in this gameplay.",
    ["本盛典与联赛同轨，每季四轮八周。每轮的第一周会进行一场比赛，每轮的第二周则会进行两场比赛，每场比赛都会提前两天开启搭配，并在比赛开始前给会长与副会长调整出战顺序的机会。"] = "This festival runs parallel to the league, with four rounds and eight weeks per season. The first week of each round will have one match, and the second week of each round will have two matches. Each match will have its lineup set two days in advance, and the president and vice-president will be given the opportunity to adjust the battle order before the match begins.",
    ["本站委托"] = "Station Commissions",
    ["本站无委托"] = "No commissions at this station",
    ["本系统非凡评分值由封印物改造、领域升级提供的非凡评分总和；其中封印物改造的非凡评分提升主要来自非凡气息的品质和等级；领域等级由已穿戴封印物的共鸣度总和累积计算，每次等级提升都会提供一次性非凡评分成长"] = "The Beyonder rating in this system is the sum of the Beyonder ratings provided by Sealed Artifact modifications and domain upgrades. The Beyonder rating increase from Sealed Artifact modifications mainly comes from the quality and level of the Beyonder aura. The domain level is calculated based on the accumulated total resonance of equipped Sealed Artifacts, and each level increase provides a one-time Beyonder rating growth.",
    ["本级奖励"] = "Level Reward",
    ["本该死亡的克莱恩 又一次让人无法理解地干掉了序列7的密修会成员……"] = "Klein, who should have died, once again incomprehensibly took down a Sequence 7 member of the Rose School of Thought...",
    ["本账号因为低理智值被删除后被愚者拯救"] = "Account was deleted due to low sanity and saved by The Fool",
    ["本身相当沉重，外形如同巨锤，表面幽蓝深邃，缠绕着银白的电光，握柄疑似生灵的腿骨。"] = "It is quite heavy, shaped like a giant hammer, with a deep blue surface entwined with silvery-white lightning, and the handle is suspected to be the leg bone of a living creature.",
