    ["村口的<P_Yellow>破木头房子</>，还有两间<P_Yellow>挨在一起</>的稻草房子，体验感特别好，快去吧！"] = "The <P_Yellow> broken wooden house </> at the entrance of the village, and the two <P_Yellow> adjacent </> straw houses, the experience is particularly good, go quickly!",
    ["村外的湖已然干涸，这里已经不需要任何水了。"] = "The lake outside the village has dried up; no water is needed here anymore.",
    ["村外的湖水干涸，你利用了湖水的魔力，再次回到了封存石棺旁。"] = "The lake outside the village has dried up. Utilizing the magic of the lake water, you have returned to the side of the sealed stone coffin.",
