    ["村庄里的无赖汉以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……"] = "A scoundrel in the village makes a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are too afraid to speak up, but this time...",
