    ["村里的湖看上去干涸很久了，怎么才能让它重新注满水呢？"] = "The lake in the village looks like it has been dry for a long time. How can it be refilled with water?",
    ["村门·秩序之网"] = "Village Gate · Web of Order",
    ["杖击"] = "Cane Strike",
    ["杖尖点过之处，规则书写新的注解。"] = "Wherever the tip of the staff touches, the rules are rewritten with new annotations.",
    ["杖尖轻点，越界的代价由它重新定义。"] = "With a light tap of the staff's tip, the price of overstepping is redefined.",
    ["杖端划过之时，命运的枝桠便已分岔。"] = "When the tip of the staff sweeps across, the branches of fate have already diverged.",
    ["杖身布满倒刺，仿佛曾饮过主人的血。"] = "The staff is covered in barbs, as if it has tasted its master's blood.",
    ["杖身所经之处，无知将自行退避。"] = "Wherever the staff passes, ignorance retreats on its own.",
    ["杖顶的结晶愈发剔透，离未完成的配方又近了一步。"] = "The crystal at the top of the staff becomes increasingly transparent, one step closer to the unfinished formula.",
    ["杖顶的结晶浸透血色，每一次施法都带来疯狂。"] = "The crystal at the top of the staff is soaked in blood; every casting brings madness.",
    ["杖顶轻敲，被禁锢的知识便呼啸而出。"] = "A light tap on the staff top, and the imprisoned knowledge roars out.",
    ["杜"] = "Du",
    ["杜伦"] = "Duren",
