    ["杜比是我的好伙计，它乖巧又强大，是个好猎手。"] = "Dolby is my good buddy, it's obedient and strong, a good hunter.",
    ["杜比是最敏捷的小狗，它甚至能轻松打败野猫。"] = "Dobby is the most agile puppy; he can even easily defeat wild cats.",
