    ["条件组内条件需要同时满足"] = "Conditions within the group must be met simultaneously",
    ["条及以上"] = "Strips and above",
    ["条带"] = "Strip",
    ["条条大路通非凡，完成全部3项推荐任务与其他任意5项任务即可领满当日奖励。"] = "All roads lead to the Extraordinary. Complete all 3 recommended quests and any 5 other quests to claim the full daily reward.",
    ["条条大路通非凡，完成全部4项推荐任务与其他任意4项任务即可领满当日奖励。"] = "All roads lead to the Extraordinary. Complete all 4 recommended quests and any 4 other quests to claim the full daily reward.",
    ["条条大路通非凡，完成全部4项推荐任务与其他任意5项任务即可领满当日奖励。"] = "All roads lead to the Extraordinary. Complete all 4 recommended quests and any 5 other quests to claim the full daily reward.",
    ["条条大路通非凡，完成全部4项推荐任务与其他任意6项任务即可领满当日奖励。"] = "All roads lead to the Extraordinary. Complete all 4 recommended quests and any 6 other quests to claim the full daily reward.",
    ["条条大路通非凡，非凡者只要选对了路，进对了门，一条咸鱼也可以躺着赢得胜利。——非凡手册·序言"] = "All roads lead to the Extraordinary. As long as a Beyonder chooses the right path and the right door, even a salted fish can win while lying down. — Beyonder Manual · Preface",
    ["条穗"] = "Tassel",
    ["条纹蝴蝶"] = "Striped Butterfly",
    ["来"] = "Come.",
    ["来 伊妮德 快过来 大鱼马上就出现了"] = "Come, Enid, come over here. The big fish is about to appear.",
    ["来 庆祝克莱恩找到不错的工作！"] = "Come, let's celebrate Klein finding a good job!",
    ["来 拉住我的手"] = "Come, take my hand.",
    ["来%s"] = "Come %s",
    ["来T"] = "Looking for Tank",
    ["来……吃吧。"] = "Come... eat.",
    ["来一小杯甜冰茶？许多年轻人都喜欢这个口味。"] = "How about a small glass of sweet iced tea? Many young people like this flavor.",
    ["来一束"] = "Give me a bunch",
    ["来一杯"] = "Have a drink",
    ["来一片吗？只要20便士！"] = "Want a piece? Only 20 pence!",
    ["来一瓶？"] = "Want a bottle?",
    ["来一颗"] = "Give me one",
    ["来不及了。"] = "It's too late.",
    ["来不及了！不要打扰我学习！"] = "No time! Don't disturb my studies!",
    ["来不及了，救人要紧"] = "No time, saving people is more important",
    ["来买墓地的吗？最近墓地可不太够用了，要买趁早！"] = "Are you here to buy a burial plot? Burial plots are in short supply lately, so buy one early if you need it!",
    ["来了 又怎样……"] = "You came, so what...",
    ["来了一位<h>新客人</>"] = "A <h>new customer</> has arrived",
    ["来了个糙汉大叔，大叔也穿着约定配色的衣服！大叔走过去了！大叔和奶奶交涉了一番！"] = "A rough-looking uncle came, the uncle is also wearing the clothes of the agreed color! The uncle walked over! The uncle negotiated with the grandma!",
    ["来了个美丽奶奶……奶奶穿着约定配色的衣服！走过去了！把花拿起来了！"] = "A beautiful grandma came... the grandma is wearing the clothes of the agreed color! She walked over! She picked up the flowers!",
    ["来了个美丽少女，不是。"] = "A beautiful young girl came, no, that's not it.",
    ["来了个美丽阿姨，不是。"] = "A beautiful aunt came, no, that's not it.",
    ["来了啊。"] = "You're here.",
    ["来了！"] = "Coming!",
    ["来了，杰斯。我等会是死在左边还是右边好一点？"] = "Here I am, Jack. Would it be better for me to die on the left or the right later?",
    ["来了？你确定要和邦尼的阴影一战么？"] = "You're here? Are you sure you want to battle the shadow of Bonnie?",
    ["来了？我就知道你能扒出那张纸。"] = "You're here? I knew you'd be able to dig out that piece of paper.",
    ["来人"] = "Looking for people",
    ["来份家庭小杂志，祝您没有烦心事！"] = "Get a family magazine, wishing you a worry-free day!",
    ["来份廷根市老实人报吧。"] = "Get a copy of the Tingen Honest Man's Newspaper.",
    ["来份廷根晨报吧。"] = "Get a copy of the Tingen Morning Post.",
    ["来份贝克兰德日报吧。"] = "Get a copy of the Backlund Daily.",
    ["来做什么？上一个来挑衅我的人，现在只剩这颗牙了...你要不要也留个纪念？"] = "What are you here for? The last person who came to provoke me is now left with only this tooth... Do you want to keep a souvenir too?",
    ["来做什么？上一个来挑衅我的人，现在只剩这颗牙了……你要不要也留个纪念？"] = "What are you here for? The last person who came to provoke me only has this tooth left... do you want to leave a souvenir too?",
    ["来到了一个新的空间"] = "Arrived in a new space",
    ["来到了前台，准备填写寄件单……"] = "Arrived at the front desk, preparing to fill out the shipping form...",
    ["来到了员工手册提到的地点"] = "Arrived at the location mentioned in the employee handbook",
    ["来到剧院"] = "Arrive at the theater",
    ["来到查尼斯门"] = "Arrive at Chanis Gate",
    ["来到灰雾空间"] = "Arrive at gray fog Space",
    ["来到烟囱旁"] = "Arrive by the chimney",
    ["来到花摊"] = "Arrive at the flower stall",
    ["来历不明的廷根小报。"] = "A Tingen tabloid of unknown origin.",
    ["来吧 休息吧 安眠吧"] = "Come, rest, slumber",
    ["来吧……"] = "Come...",
    ["来吧……投入玫瑰的怀抱。只要，再走一步。"] = "Come... embrace the roses. Just take one more step.",
    ["来吧孩子，女神的怀抱永远向所有虔诚的信徒敞开。"] = "Come, child, the embrace of the Goddess is always open to all devout believers.",
    ["来吧！"] = "Come!",
    ["来吧！感受我们永不分离的联结！"] = "Come! Feel the connection that we will never sever!",
    ["来吧，中低序列魔药配方档案都在这里。"] = "Come on, the files for low and mid-sequence potion formulas are all here.",
    ["来吧，丽埃娜，我该杀你了。"] = "Come on, Liana, I should kill you.",
    ["来吧，亲爱的伙伴，快翻开尘封的扉页。\n\n任北风吹乱发梢，看恶龙在头顶盘旋。\n\n慷慨的战歌已然奏响，壮烈的决战即将来到。\n\n无畏的巨人劈开前路的荆棘，机敏的猎人清剿暗处的仇敌。\n\n虔诚的修士祷颂庇佑的咒语，美丽的精灵轻吟古老的旋律。\n\n来啊！亲爱的伙伴，我们渴求你的助力，热盼与你团聚。\n\n来啊！亲爱的伙伴，这是你的故事，这是你的传奇。"] = "Come, dear partner, quickly turn the dusty pages. \n \n Let the north wind mess up your hair, and watch the giant dragon circle overhead. \n \n The generous war song has already sounded, and the heroic final battle is about to arrive. \n \n The fearless giant cleaves the thorns on the path ahead, and the agile hunter clears out the enemies in the shadows. \n \n The pious monk chants the prayer of protection, and the beautiful elf hums the ancient melody. \n \n Come! Dear partner, we crave your help and look forward to reuniting with you. \n \n Come! Dear partner, this is your story, this is your legend.",
    ["来吧，休息吧，安眠吧"] = "Come, rest, slumber",
    ["来吧，休息吧，安眠吧……"] = "Come, rest, Slumber...",
    ["来吧，休息吧，安眠吧，我的孩子们！"] = "Come, rest, Slumber, my children!",
    ["来吧，再听一首曲子，咳咳，希望它依然能给你带来力量。"] = "Come, listen to another piece. Cough, cough... I hope it can still give you strength.",
    ["来吧，加入我们一起跳舞吧！"] = "Come on, join us and dance!",
    ["来吧，向祂虔诚地忏悔，让永恒的星空去洗涤你的灵魂。"] = "Come, repent piously to Him, and let the eternal starry sky cleanse your soul.",
    ["来吧，回归死亡的本质，拥抱永恒的宁静"] = "Come, return to the essence of death and embrace eternal tranquility.",
    ["来吧，在其中一杯里放入不好的事物，但不要告诉我。"] = "Come on, put something bad in one of the cups, but don't tell me.",
    ["来吧，安眠吧，我的孩子们"] = "Come, slumber, my children",
    ["来吧，将卤鹅王国发展为最强盛的王国，令你成为名垂青史的大帝！"] = "Come, develop the Goose Kingdom into the most prosperous kingdom and make yourself an emperor whose name will go down in history!",
    ["来吧，库克的手艺你绝对不会失望！下一个就是我了，只要在这里站一会，你会成为今天最快享受到美食的人！"] = "Come on, you won't be disappointed by Cook's skills! I'm next, just stand here for a while and you'll be the person who gets to enjoy the food the fastest today!",
    ["来吧，快告诉我们。我应该接受那场旅游邀请吗？艾丽该不该答应那位先生？"] = "Come on, tell us quickly. Should I accept that travel invitation? Should Ellie say yes to that gentleman?",
    ["来吧，想要什么属性随便填，逆天改命的机会就在你面前。"] = "Come on, fill in whatever attributes you want. The opportunity to defy the heavens and change your fate is right in front of you.",
    ["来吧，我亲爱的孩子，向祂虔诚地忏悔，让永恒的星空洗涤你的灵魂。"] = "Come, my dear child, repent piously to Him, and let the eternal starry sky cleanse your soul.",
    ["来吧，来参加我的婚礼。鼓掌、吟诗、痛痛快快地道别。"] = "Come, come to my wedding. Applaud, recite poems, and say goodbye properly.",
    ["来吧，精灵球，向我开炮！热血男儿绝不退缩！"] = "Come on, Poké Ball, fire at me! A hot-blooded man never retreats!",
    ["来吧，让我们继续！"] = "Come on, let's continue!",
    ["来吧，跳吧！我的孩子们，我的延伸！"] = "Come on, dance! My children, my extensions!",
    ["来吧，这次我们一定能成功！"] = "Come on, we'll definitely succeed this time!",
    ["来呀，陛下，今夜一起享乐吧。"] = "Come, Your Majesty, let us enjoy ourselves tonight.",
    ["来啦来啦，都来看看最时兴的新鲜货！"] = "Come, come, come and see the trendiest fresh goods!",
    ["来喝酒的？还没开张，但可以先给你尝尝。"] = "Here for a drink? We're not open yet, but I can let you have a taste first.",
    ["来处未知的眼睛，持有看穿人心的力量。"] = "An eye of unknown origin, possessing the power to see through the human heart.",
    ["来奶妈"] = "Looking for Healer",
    ["来宾"] = "Laibin",
    ["来尝尝毒雾的滋味吧"] = "Come and taste the flavor of the poisonous mist.",
    ["来展示你的舞蹈技艺吧！"] = "Come and show off your dancing skills!",
    ["来帮忙看看我是不是画歪了吧。"] = "Come help me see if my painting is crooked.",
    ["来廷根打了十多年工……"] = "I've been working in Tingen for over a decade...",
    ["来廷根打了十多年工，没成想现在因为年纪大了，没人要我了。"] = "I've been working in Tingen for over ten years, but I didn't expect that now that I'm older, no one wants me.",
    ["来得正好！你们将是这份杰作，最后的见证与养料！"] = "You've come at the right time! You will be the final witnesses and nourishment for this masterpiece!",
    ["来得这么早？"] = "You're here this early?",
    ["来成为……尤朵拉的家人……爸爸……妈妈……"] = "Come become... Yodora's family... Daddy... Mommy...",
    ["来我这玩一把填字游戏，证明一下你有多聪明。"] = "Come play a crossword puzzle with me and prove how smart you are.",
    ["来找工作的人不少啊。"] = "Quite a few people looking for work.",
    ["来换身行头吧，人靠衣装！"] = "Come change your outfit; people rely on clothes!",
    ["来来来这边，这几位是“老鼠”吉米、“酒瓶”山姆、“毒蛇”西恩和“疤脸”威利。"] = "Come, come over here. These are 'Rat' Jimmy, 'Bottle' Sam, 'Viper' Sean, and 'Scarface' Willy.",
    ["来来来，好吃的香煎肉鱼！"] = "Come, come, delicious pan-fried fish!",
    ["来来来，这是你的跑腿费，还有这个——我用同样配方做的香料，烤肉的时候撒一点，香极了！"] = "Come, come, here is your errand fee, and this—it's a spice I made using the same recipe. Sprinkle a little when you're roasting meat; it's absolutely delicious!",
    ["来根烟，再配杯茶，日子也就这么过下去了，对吧？"] = "Have a cigarette, pair it with a cup of tea, and life just goes on like this, right?",
    ["来治疗"] = "Come for Healing",
    ["来源"] = "Source",
    ["来源于“愚者”先生的金币，上面隐约沾染着神秘的灰雾气息。"] = "A gold coin originating from Mr. Fool, faintly stained with the mysterious aura of the gray fog.",
    ["来源于旧日时代的文字，以神秘亚金烫印，映现出独属于诡秘之主的徽记。"] = "Characters from the era of the Great Old One, hot-stamped in mysterious sub-gold, reflecting the emblem unique to the Lord of Mysteries.",
    ["来源于现代值夜者体系的创立者，查尼斯大主教的名字，在每个大城市的黑夜女神教会的中央教堂地下，都有一扇。"] = "Named after Archbishop Chanis, the founder of the modern Nighthawks system. There is one in the basement of the central cathedral of the Church of the Evernight Goddess in every major city.",
    ["来源于现代值夜者体系的创立者，查尼斯大主教的名字，在每个大城市的黑夜女神教会的中央教堂地下，都有一扇。 "] = "Derived from the name of Archbishop Chanis, the founder of the modern Nighthawk system, there is one in the basement of the central cathedral of the Evernight Goddess church in every major city.",
    ["来源于罗塞尔戏剧节签名活动的赠品，也可能有其他来源途径，市民应该很容易获取。"] = "A gift from the Roselle Drama Festival autograph session; it may also have other sources, and it should be easy for citizens to obtain.",
    ["来点新鲜出炉的面包吧！"] = "Come get some freshly baked bread!",
    ["来看病的，自然都是有需要的，只是有的人更需要帮助。"] = "Those who come to see a doctor are naturally in need, but some people need help more.",
    ["来看看他寄给我的信吧。"] = "Let's take a look at the letter he sent me.",
    ["来看看吗？"] = "Want to come take a look?",
    ["来看看吧！"] = "Come and take a look!",
    ["来看看吧，都是今天现烤的面包！"] = "Come and take a look, it's all bread baked today!",
    ["来看看廷根大学和医院联合举办的医疗知识讲座！参与送家用医疗包一份哦！"] = "Come and check out the medical knowledge lecture co-hosted by Tingen University and the hospital! Participate and get a free home medical kit!",
    ["来看看我们旅行社的一日游吧！用最短的时间带您感受大学之城的风光！"] = "Come and check out our travel agency's one-day tour! We'll take you to experience the scenery of the City of Universities in the shortest time!",
    ["来看看甘蓝，用它做的甘蓝汤鲜甜可口。"] = "Come look at the kale; the kale soup made with it is fresh and delicious.",
    ["来看看美丽的鲜花吧，上面还沾着露珠呢！"] = "Come and see the beautiful flowers, they still have dew on them!",
    ["来自<Share>%s</>的推荐方案"] = "Recommended scheme from <Share>%s</>",
    ["来自“矿藏上的城市”拉克雷，那里曾经是弗萨克最大的殖民地之一，战后已深受鲁恩王国和黑暗女神信仰影响。亡灵节面具是当地死神崇拜民俗的体现。"] = "From Lacre, the \"City on the Mines,\" which was once one of the largest colonies of Feysac and has been deeply influenced by the Loen Kingdom and the faith of the Evernight Goddess since the war. The All Souls' Day mask is a manifestation of local death-worship folklore.",
    ["来自“黑手套”的打手，在廷根的地下世界也是个令人闻风丧胆的存在。"] = "A thug from the \"Black Gloves,\" also a fearsome presence in the underground world of Tingen.",
    ["来自“黑手套”的打手，彻底激发了内心的疯狂。"] = "A thug from the \"Black Glove\", completely ignited the madness within.",
    ["来自分享"] = "From Share",
    ["来自厄水的力量，能让菇毒溶于水。\n龟的世界将被摧毁，也许菇毒面对。"] = "Power from the Disaster Water, capable of dissolving mushroom poison in water. \n The world of the turtle will be destroyed, perhaps the mushroom poison must face it.",
    ["来自受超凡污染的黑熊，象征野性、力量与异常进化。"] = "From a black bear contaminated by extraordinary power, symbolizing wildness, power, and abnormal evolution.",
    ["来自命运的回声"] = "Echoes from Fate",
    ["来自嗜血犀牛生命核心，极度危险的生命核心材料。"] = "From the core of a bloodthirsty rhinoceros, an extremely dangerous core material for Health.",
    ["来自城市暗面的特殊采购凭证，凭证可<Highlight>免费兑换任意商城直售外观</>。"] = "A special procurement voucher from the dark side of the city, which can be used to <Highlight>redeem any direct-sale cosmetic item in the shop for free</>.",
    ["来自太阳信仰的物品"] = "Item from the Sun Faith",
    ["来自巨型黑熊体内，象征压倒性的力量与生命力。"] = "From a giant black bear, symbolizing overwhelming power and Health.",
    ["来自巨黑熊体内，蕴含高浓缩生命胆汁。"] = "From a giant black bear, containing highly concentrated Health bile.",
    ["来自异世界的愚者"] = "The Fool from another world",
    ["来自强大掠食者的脊髓液，蕴含追踪、潜伏与致命一击的特性。"] = "Spinal fluid from powerful predators, containing the characteristics of tracking, lurking, and Critical Hit.",
    ["来自愚者的回应，缓慢回复生命值，将为濒死者延续命运。"] = "A response from The Fool, slowly recovering Health, will extend the fate of those near death.",
    ["来自愚者的祝福，非战斗状态下持续恢复生命值。"] = "A blessing from The Fool; continuously recovers Health when out of combat.",
    ["来自愚者的祝福，非战斗状态下每2秒恢复10%生命值。"] = "Blessing from The Fool; restores 10% of Health every 2 seconds when out of combat.",
    ["来自愚者的馈赠"] = "A gift from The Fool",
    ["来自戏剧大师蒙特利的信件。"] = "A letter from the drama master Monterey.",
    ["来自星空的阴性力量，足以同化、吞噬一切弱小的生命，看着这些可憎的面孔陷入无尽恐惧吧。"] = "Yin energy from the stars, enough to assimilate and devour all weak life. Watch as these hateful faces fall into endless fear.",
    ["来自春夜舞会的馈赠。镜面映照目标时，一场邀约已在倒影中备好。\n若你应约，魔女的脚步会从镜框边缘踏出——若你胜出，镜中便只留下魔女一人的倒影，沦为你的镜中之物。"] = "A gift from the Spring Night Ball. When the mirror reflects the target, an invitation is already prepared in the reflection. \n If you accept the invitation, the witch's footsteps will step out from the edge of the mirror frame—if you win, only the witch's reflection will remain in the mirror, and she will become your object in the mirror.",
    ["来自深海拉瓦章鱼的血液，带有强烈深海与压迫属性。"] = "Blood from a deep-sea Lava Octopus, carrying strong deep-sea and oppressive attributes.",
    ["来自潜意识海洋的食梦花怪，常常能招致空想蝴蝶的到来。"] = "A dream-eating flower monster from the Subconscious Ocean, often capable of summoning the arrival of Imaginary Butterflies.",
    ["来自灰雾之上的神秘药水，可以在乌托邦剧院内恢复50%最大生命值。购买后请在背包的【玩法背包】页签查看和使用，建议进行快捷装配。"] = "A mysterious potion from above the gray fog that can restore 50% of maximum Health within the Utopia Theater. After purchasing, please view and use it in the [Gameplay Inventory] tab of your inventory. Quick equipment is recommended.",
    ["来自白银城的木质手杖，杖头绿得像巨人王庭台阶上终年不减的苔藓。\n“左臂被污染了。”那天，长老说，“要么截肢，要么……”\n他看向角落里的手杖。\n伤者是个年轻的战士，才十六岁。截肢意味着再也无法战斗，在白银城，这比死更可怕。\n“用吧。”少年说。\n手杖轻触伤口，血肉瞬间愈合。代价在三天后显现——他的左臂长出了变异的藤蔓，但他能继续握剑。\n“至少，”他对哭泣的母亲说，“我还是个战士。” "] = "A wooden cane from the City of Silver, its head as green as the moss that grows year-round on the steps of the Giant King's Court. \n \"The left arm is corrupted,\" the Elder said that day. \"Either amputate it, or...\" \n He looked at the cane in the corner. \n The wounded was a young warrior, only sixteen years old. Amputation meant he could never fight again; in the City of Silver, that was worse than death. \n \"Use it,\" the boy said. \n The cane touched the wound, and the flesh healed instantly. The price manifested three days later—mutated vines grew from his left arm, but he could continue to hold his sword. \n \"At least,\" he said to his weeping mother, \"I am still a warrior.\"",
    ["来自盥洗室的回声"] = "Echoes from the Restroom",
    ["来自禁区阴影下的生死狩猎，每一笔都是猎人生存权的沉重烙印。"] = "A life-and-death hunt from the shadows of the forbidden zone; every stroke is a heavy brand of the hunter's right to survive.",
    ["来自科恩黎的增益效果，那是关于守护与牺牲的歌谣。"] = "A buff from Kenley, a ballad about guardianship and sacrifice.",
    ["来自老尼尔的增益效果，为你驱散未知的迷雾。"] = "A buff from Old Neil that dispels unknown mists for you.",
    ["来自苏尼亚岛的泉水，曾是精灵们的喜爱之物，性质温和，常用于各类药剂的调配。"] = "Spring water from Sonia Island, once a favorite of the elves. It has a mild nature and is often used in the preparation of various potions.",
    ["来自萨默尔太太的邀请"] = "An Invitation from Mrs. Sammer",
    ["来自被自身击败之人，用于确认因果、战胜与支配关系的仪式材料。"] = "From a person defeated by oneself, ritual material used to confirm causality, victory, and dominance relationships.",
    ["来自警局的案件报告"] = "Case Report from the Police Department",
    ["来自警局的调查建议"] = "Investigation Suggestions from the Police Department",
    ["来自警局的调查资料"] = "Investigation Materials from the Police Department",
    ["来自贝克兰德大剧院，热演数百场，《伯爵归来》重返廷根！"] = "From the Backlund Grand Theater, running for hundreds of shows, \"The Earl's Return\" is back in Tingen!",
    ["来自贝克兰德的美味！"] = "Delicacies from Backlund!",
    ["来自遥远王庭的回响，将黄昏永续至今。"] = "The echo from the distant royal court will make the dusk last forever.",
    ["来自邓恩的增益效果，记住值夜者永不独行。"] = "Buff effect from Dunn, remembering that Nighthawks never walk alone.",
    ["来自钢铁巨熊体内，兼具金属与生命特性的异常血液。"] = "From a steel giant bear, abnormal blood possessing both metal and Health characteristics.",
    ["来自魔女的邀请"] = "Invitation from the Witch",
    ["来自："] = "From:",
    ["来艺术学派支持我的演出，帮我夺回我的一切！"] = "Come to the Art School to support my performance and help me take back everything that's mine!",
    ["来访者，继续巧妙运用湖水和两地的机关，把它们带回来吧。"] = "Visitor, continue to cleverly utilize the lake water and the mechanisms in both places to bring them back.",
    ["来访者，请听吾讲述......"] = "Visitor, please listen to me speak...",
    ["来访记录"] = "Visitor Log",
    ["来试试吧"] = "Let's try it",
    ["来谈一场恋爱吧！"] = "Let's fall in love!",
    ["来谈一谈恋爱吧！"] = "Let's fall in love!",
    ["来赌一把！金镑翻十倍！"] = "Let's gamble! Multiply the gold pounds by ten!",
    ["来跟我一起祈求 这样才能获得许可"] = "Come, pray with me. Only then can we obtain permission.",
    ["来跟我一起祈求，这样才能获得许可……"] = "Come pray with me, only then can you obtain permission...",
    ["来跳舞吧！舞起来就不冷了！"] = "Let's Dance! You won't be cold once you start moving!",
    ["来输出"] = "Come output",
    ["来过"] = "Have been here",
    ["来过。他们说可能是老鼠。但老鼠不会翻抽屉。"] = "They have. They said it might be rats. But rats don't rummage through drawers.",
    ["来这边，一起扛下这次攻击！"] = "Come here, let's withstand this attack together!",
    ["来这里共舞！"] = "Come dance here!",
    ["来这里的客人，十个里有九个不懂宝石，只看大小。"] = "Nine out of ten customers who come here don't understand gemstones; they only look at the size.",
    ["来这里的很多客人都是这样，明明挺穷酸的，也要硬装高贵。"] = "Many guests who come here are like that; they're clearly quite poor and shabby, yet they insist on acting noble.",
    ["来追我呀！"] = "Come and catch me!",
    ["来都来了"] = "Since You're Here",
    ["来都来了。朋友，劳烦帮我拍一张。拿给我女儿瞧瞧——让她知道，她爸为了她，连这种东西都敢碰。"] = "Since we're here. Friend, could you help me take a picture? I'll show it to my daughter— let her know her dad dared to touch this stuff for her sake.",
    ["来都来了，今天体验一下二人世界？不告诉肯和萨拉他们。"] = "Since you're already here, why not experience some time for two today? Let's not tell Ken and Sarah.",
    ["来都来了，随便拿点"] = "Since I'm here, I'll take something",
    ["来防御"] = "Come to Defense",
    ["来面试的啊，去那边排队。"] = "Here for the interview? Go line up over there.",
    ["来面试的工人们，请在侧面排成一队！"] = "Workers here for the interview, please line up on the side!",
    ["来！再喝一杯吧！丢掉一切的忧愁，今天是值得庆祝的日子！"] = "Come! Let's have another drink! Throw away all your worries, today is a day worth celebrating!",
    ["来，东西还您。"] = "Here, returning your item.",
    ["来，再走近一点，让我帮你摘掉那副累人的面具。在这里，你不需要是谁的救世主。"] = "Come, step a little closer and let me help you remove that tiresome mask. Here, you don't need to be anyone's savior.",
    ["来，咱们干杯！为了琳达！"] = "Come on, let's toast! To Linda!",
    ["来，帮我试一试我新制作的甜冰茶，我不知道它是否适合本地人的口味。"] = "Come, help me try the sweet iced tea I just made. I'm not sure if it suits the local taste.",
    ["来，我们还剩最后一步，回俱乐部将胶片交给柯达先生。"] = "Come, we have the last step left, return to the club and hand the film to Mr. Kodak.",
    ["来，我先把钥匙分给你们。"] = "Come, let me distribute the keys to you first.",
    ["来，我给你演示演示。 "] = "Come, let me demonstrate it for you.",
    ["来，牵着我的手，我带你去我的城堡。"] = "Come, take my hand, and I will take you to my castle.",
    ["来，看看今天会拍到什么有趣的事情。"] = "Come, let's see what interesting things we'll capture today.",
    ["来，看看我最新的成果，这绝对是大海上最受欢迎的事物！"] = "Come, take a look at my latest achievement, this is definitely the most popular thing on the sea!",
    ["来，试试。"] = "Come on, give it a try.",
    ["来，请您举起面前的酒杯。"] = "Come, please raise the wine glass in front of you.",
    ["来，请您拿起我给您的斧子，向这堆瓦砾轰击！"] = "Come, please pick up the axe I gave you and strike this pile of rubble!",
    ["来，请您面向喷泉……让水滴洒在你的面颊……"] = "Come, please face the fountain... let the water drops fall on your cheeks...",
    ["来，这样，我来教你怎样战斗吧！"] = "Come, like this, let me teach you how to fight!",
    ["来，面包给你。"] = "Here, have some Bread.",
