    ["杰瑞米不是我弟弟了……呜呜……"] = "Jeremy is not my brother anymore... wuu wuu...",
    ["杰瑞米肯定是被怨灵附体了，我在故事书上看过的！"] = "Jeremy must have been possessed by a vengeful spirit; I've read about it in storybooks!",
