    ["板车的侧面刻着“黑荆棘安保公司”几个字。"] = "The side of the cart is engraved with the words \"Blackthorn Security Company\".",
    ["极不稳定的超凡血液，能短暂影响感知与现实结构。"] = "Extremely unstable extraordinary blood that can briefly affect perception and the structure of reality.",
    ["极佳"] = "Excellent",
    ["极光会"] = "Aurora Order",
    ["极光会二十二位神使之一，容貌漂亮妖异，宛若女性。为完成“真实造物主的降临仪式参与了贝克兰德大雾霾，是该事件的幕后黑手之一。"] = "One of the twenty-two divine messengers of the Aurora Order, with a beautiful and eerie appearance, resembling a woman. To complete the 'Descent Ritual of the True Creator', he participated in the Backlund Smog and was one of the masterminds behind the incident.",
