    ["果然……"] = "As expected...",
    ["果然……<P_Heart>（很兴奋）</>你和我们一样！"] = "As expected... <P_Heart> (Excitedly) </> You are just like us!",
    ["果然……是不能说的词……"] = "As expected... it's a word that cannot be spoken...",
    ["果然……还是没法丢下你不管啊。"] = "As expected... I still can't just leave you behind.",
    ["果然出事了！"] = "It really did go wrong!",
    ["果然和传说一样，风经过石像附近，会发出类似叹息的声音……"] = "It's just as the legends say, the wind makes a sound like sighing when it passes near the statue...",
    ["果然啊，是你不配拥有家人、不配有自己的家。"] = "As expected, you don't deserve to have family, you don't deserve to have a home of your own.",
    ["果然打一顿才能想起来，上次那个……贝克呢？"] = "As expected, it takes a beating to remember. Where is that... Baker from last time?",
    ["果然拦住了！原来那件事是真的，学长已经消失一周了……"] = "It really was blocked! So that matter was true; the senior has been missing for a week...",
    ["果然搬走了啊……"] = "So they really moved away...",
    ["果然是偷盗者途径的小偷，希望下次见面不会是在监狱里……等等！"] = "As expected of a thief from the Marauder pathway. I hope the next time we meet won't be in prison... Wait!",
    ["果然是罗塞尔推广的爱国卫生运动！运动的具体情况是怎样的？"] = "So it really was the Patriotic Health Campaign promoted by Roselle! What were the specifics of the campaign?",
    ["果然是这样。"] = "So that's how it is.",
    ["果然是非凡者！"] = "As expected, a Beyonder!",
    ["果然是魔女吗？看样子要加强警备了"] = "Is it really a Witch? Looks like we need to strengthen security",
    ["果然是魔女的丝线作祟，尝试用火焰净化它们！"] = "It really is the Witch's spider web at work; try using flames to purify them!",
    ["果然是魔女的丝线作祟，用【火焰】净化它们！"] = "As expected, it's the work of a Witch's silk threads. Purify them with [Flame]!",
    ["果然有东西，这些都是什么？！"] = "There really is something here. What are all these things?!",
    ["果然有灵存在。"] = "There is indeed a spirit present.",
    ["果然有用。这些残留的画面，是小女孩和她的哥哥？"] = "It was useful after all. Are these residual images of the little girl and her brother?",
    ["果然能想起来……先找到中央广场，再寻找旅行尖碑。"] = "I really can remember... First find the Central Plaza, then look for the Travel Obelisk.",
    ["果然还是要回家过生日啊！"] = "It really is better to go home for a birthday!",
    ["果然还是要少加一些糖。"] = "It really is better to add less sugar.",
    ["果然！我就知道你们根本不懂什么叫高雅的游戏。你们平时都在泥地里打滚吧？"] = "As expected! I knew you guys didn't understand what an elegant game is at all. You usually roll around in the mud, right?",
    ["果然！黛丝<P_Yellow>借助匕首启动仪式魔法</>，制造了自己的<P_Yellow>假死</>。但这是为了什么，已经没有提问机会了……"] = "As expected! Daisy <P_Yellow>used the dagger to start the Ritual Magic</>, creating her own <P_Yellow>fake death</>. But what was this for? There are no more chances to ask questions...",
    ["果然，<P_Yellow>黛丝是一位占卜师</>！"] = "As expected, <P_Yellow>Daisy is a diviner</>!",
    ["果然，他并没有什么特殊……"] = "As expected, he doesn't have anything special...",
    ["果然，您一看就是位有见识的人。"] = "As expected, you look like a person of insight.",
    ["果然，看起来警局的内鬼和黑帮也搭上了线……走！继续查！"] = "As expected, it seems the mole in the police department has also made contact with the gangs... Let's go! Keep investigating!",
    ["果然，菲利普已经离开了……"] = "Sure enough, Philip has already left...",
    ["果然，这不是普通的油画，这是——"] = "As expected, this is no ordinary oil painting, this is—",
    ["果然，这里有强烈的灵性波动，他们来过这里。"] = "Sure enough, there is a strong spiritual fluctuation here; they have been here.",
