    ["某个不长眼的东西扣了该给我们的报酬。"] = "Some blind fool withheld the payment that was owed to us.",
    ["某个角落里，传来猫咪的尖叫声。"] = "From a corner, the screeching of a kitten can be heard.",
    ["某些伤害结算，不直接取攻击者的攻击力，而是通过外部传入指定的伤害值作为伤害公式的伤害值"] = "Some damage calculations do not directly take the attacker's attack power, but use a specified damage value passed in externally as the damage value for the damage formula.",
    ["某些场合具体是指？"] = "What specifically do you mean by certain occasions?",
    ["某些弹射想用子弹表达链式效果，可以放一个必中表现子弹"] = "For some bounces, if you want to express chain effects using bullets, you can place a guaranteed-hit visual bullet.",
    ["某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "Some mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["某些非凡材料开始以“复古面料”的名义进入上层社会。比如“工匠”途径制造的恒温丝绸，现在被称作“罗塞尔时期的失落工艺”。"] = "Some Beyonder materials are starting to enter high society under the name of 'vintage fabrics.' For example, the temperature-regulating silk made by the 'Artisan' pathway is now called 'lost craftsmanship of the Roselle era.'",
    ["某人写的日记1"] = "Someone's Diary 1",
    ["某人写的日记2"] = "Someone's Diary 2",
    ["某人写的日记3"] = "Someone's Diary 3",
