    ["某人的日记1"] = "Someone's Diary 1",
    ["某人的日记2"] = "Someone's Diary 2",
    ["某人的日记3"] = "Someone's Diary 3",
    ["某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨。经过长久的品鉴，想必这份风味已深入你的身心。"] = "A certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in their diary. After long contemplation, this flavor must have deeply permeated your body and mind.",
    ["某位帝王曾在日记里留下一句未完的感慨，现下品鉴确实别有风味。"] = "A certain emperor once left an unfinished sentiment in his diary, and tasting it now indeed has a unique flavor.",
    ["某只具有非凡能力的小猫正在想办法收集“鲁恩式幽默”的对话。"] = "A kitten with extraordinary abilities is trying to find a way to collect dialogue with 'Loen-style humor'.",
    ["某天黛丝在俱乐部当值，来了一位偏执相信命运的顾客。黛丝为其占卜，发现命运预示未来某天自己将被顾客杀死。她为了活下去，在预示的那一天紧锁房门，提前用仪式魔法制造了自己的假死，从而暂时欺骗了命运。"] = "One day, when Daisy was on duty at the club, a customer who was paranoid about fate arrived. Daisy performed a divination for her and discovered that fate foretold she would be killed by this customer one day in the future. To survive, she locked her door on the predicted day and used Ritual Magic to fake her own death in advance, thereby temporarily deceiving fate.",
    ["某天，来自贵族的报复摧毁了一切，唯有海伦娜小姐一人生还。"] = "One day, revenge from the nobility destroyed everything, and only Miss Helena survived.",
    ["某日在大学校园，意外发现了一张愚者福音宣传单……"] = "One day on the university campus, I accidentally discovered a Fool's Gospel flyer...",
    ["某日雨雪大寒，国王令人给孤寡穷患大批赠与木炭。"] = "One day when it was snowy and cold, the King ordered a large amount of charcoal to be given to the orphans and the poor.",
