    ["柔软的小羊玩偶，身体用粗糙的纱线紧密缝合，摇晃时似乎有微弱的<Hide id=\"#165\"> 铃铛 </>声。"] = "A soft little lamb doll, its body tightly stitched with coarse yarn. When shaken, it seems to make a faint <Hide id=\"#165\"> bell </> sound.",
