    ["查尼斯门后传出异动，请非凡者前往黑荆棘安保公司传出异动"] = "An anomaly has been reported behind the Chanis Gate. Please have a Beyonder head to the Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["查尼斯门后就有一些封印物，以后你会逐渐见到的。"] = "There are some Sealed Artifacts behind the Chanis Gate, which you will gradually see in the future.",
    ["查尼斯门来源于现代值夜者体系的创立者，查尼斯大主教的名字，在每个大城市的中央教堂地下，都有一扇。"] = "The Chanis Gate comes from the name of Archbishop Chanis, the founder of the modern Nighthawk system. There is one in the basement of the central church in every major city.",
    ["查尼斯门背后是哪里？地下室竟然有这么大的门，很不寻常。"] = "What is behind the Chanis Gate? It's very unusual for a basement to have such a large door.",
