    ["格拉西斯"] = "Grassis",
    ["格拉西斯先生是我们这最亲民的占卜家，擅长塔罗占卜。每次收费2便士。"] = "Mr. Grassis is our most approachable Seer, specializing in Tarot divination. He charges 2 pence per session.",
    ["格拉西斯：\n　　擅长塔罗占卜，每次收费20便士。\n\n爱德华·斯蒂夫：\n　　擅长塔罗和扑克占卜，每次收费40便士。\n\n瑞安娜：\n　　新晋著名占卜师，擅长各种占卜方式，每次收费200便士。\n\n莫莉娜·弗里曼：\n　　新人占卜者，擅长塔罗占卜，每次收费15便士。\n\n　　后面夹着被撕下的两页，整齐地保存在图册中："] = "Grassis: \n Skilled in Tarot divination, 20 pence per session. \n \n Edward Stiff: \n Skilled in Tarot and poker divination, 40 pence per session. \n \n Riana: \n A newly famous diviner, skilled in various divination methods, 200 pence per session. \n \n Molina Freeman: \n A novice diviner, skilled in Tarot divination, 15 pence per session. \n \n Behind it are two torn-out pages, neatly preserved in the album:",
