    ["案件报告"] = "Case Report",
    ["案件记录"] = "Case Records",
    ["案发前，霍克斯男爵与夫人发生过争吵，男爵夫人认为一件古董影响了霍克斯男爵的精神状态。"] = "Before the incident, Baron Hawkes had an argument with his wife, and the Baroness believed that an antique was affecting the Baron's mental state.",
    ["案发现场与证词的矛盾该如何解释？"] = "How should the contradiction between the crime scene and the testimony be explained?",
    ["桌上有一封信件，是写给“奥斯瓦尔德”的。信件的内容是订购神奇物品。这是前屋主的东西吗？"] = "There is a letter on the table addressed to 'Oswald'. The content of the letter is an order for a mystical item. Is this something from the previous owner?",
    ["桌上有一张写满了姓名和联系方式的销售记录，有人在向外出售神奇物品。不过每一行都已经划去，想必都钱货两清了。"] = "On the table is a sales record filled with names and contact information; someone is selling mystical items. However, every line has been crossed out, so the money and goods must have been exchanged.",
