    ["梅兰妮知道斯嘉丽的未婚夫是个借口却一直没说，因为她不想斯嘉丽离开廷根，只留下她一个人……"] = "Melanie knew Scarlett's fiancé was an excuse but never said anything because she didn't want Scarlett to leave Tingen and leave her all alone...",
