    ["梅林先生现在本人在哪里呢？"] = "Where is Mr. Merlin himself right now?",
    ["梅林先生？您怎么来了？"] = "Mr. Merlin? Why are you here?",
    ["梅林和休在训练室等待着学员们的到来，身经百战、经验丰富的他们将会在此地给学员们开展入学第一课——实战。"] = "Merlin and Xio are waiting for the students in the training room. Experienced and battle-hardened, they will conduct the first lesson of enrollment here: actual combat.",
