    ["梅格夫人丢失的戒指在这个方向。"] = "Mrs. Maige's lost ring is in this direction.",
    ["梅格夫人就在那！她总坐在那边华丽的长椅上！"] = "Mrs. Meg is right there! She always sits on that ornate bench over there!",
    ["梅格！你突然说要晒太阳，都没说几点回来吃饭……怎么这么多人？"] = "Maige! You suddenly said you wanted to sunbathe, and you didn't even say what time you'd be back for dinner... Why are there so many people?",
