    ["梅迪奇-军团士兵追踪标记"] = "Medici - Legion Soldier tracking mark",
    ["梅迪奇-长矛散射标记"] = "Medici - Spear Scatter mark",
    ["梅迪奇与奥赛库斯的命运被联结了起来，玩家如果不能同时击杀他们，那么乌洛琉斯的回溯之力将让他们一次次<Disable>重新复活</>。"] = "The fates of Medici and Alista are linked. If players cannot kill them at the same time, Ouroboros's power of Retrace will cause them to <Disable>resurrect</> again and again.",
    ["梅迪奇与奥赛库斯的组合技，双方同时跳到场地中央，展示天使之威开始角力，持续回荡出冲击波毁灭一切。玩家通过<Disable>跳跃</>可以规避冲击波造成的伤害。"] = "Medici and Alista's combo skill: Both jump to the center of the field, displaying the might of Angels and beginning to struggle, continuously echoing shockwaves that destroy everything. Players can avoid the damage caused by the shockwaves by <Disable>jumping</>.",
    ["梅迪奇与奥赛库斯的组合技，奥赛库斯在场地上召唤多颗阳炎火球，<Disable>持续炙烤大地</>；梅迪奇蓄力对玩家发射长矛，<Disable>贯穿沿途的敌人</>。玩家需要<Disable>引导长矛射击阳炎火球</>。"] = "Medici and Alista's combo skill: Alista summons multiple Solar Fireballs on the field, <Disable>continuously roasting the earth</>; Medici charges and fires spears at players, <Disable>piercing enemies along the path</>. Players need to <Disable>guide the spears to shoot the Solar Fireballs</>.",
    ["梅迪奇在场地上召唤受自己赐福的军团士兵，它们<Disable>不会受到玩家伤害</>，需要<Disable>引导军团士兵相互冲撞</>，才能使它们两败俱伤。"] = "Medici summons legion soldiers blessed by him on the field. They <Disable>cannot be damaged by players</> and need to be <Disable>guided to collide with each other</> to make them suffer mutual destruction.",
    ["梅迪奇正在回溯命运！"] = "Medici is retracing fate!",
