    ["梦一样……那灰雾世界到底是什么玩意？"] = "Like a dream... what exactly is that gray fog world?",
    ["梦中之人"] = "Person in the dream",
    ["梦中可怜的女孩……或许还有机会阻止那一切。"] = "The poor girl in the dream... perhaps there is still a chance to stop it all.",
