    ["检测到加载资源时大量等待下载，是否重启游戏下载所有资源？点击取消继续边玩边下，点击确认重启游戏，后续不再提示"] = "Detected a large amount of waiting for download when loading resources. Restart the game to download all resources? Click Cancel to continue playing while downloading, click Confirm to restart the game, and you will not be prompted again later.",
    ["检测到当前系统可用虚拟内存过低，可能影响游戏体验，请尝试关闭其他应用或根据教程设置虚拟内存。"] = "Detected that the current system's available virtual memory is too low, which may affect the gaming experience. Please try closing other applications or setting up virtual memory according to the tutorial.",
    ["检测到当前系统虚拟内存空间不足，容易引发崩溃等问题，建议您根据教程设置虚拟内存。"] = "Detected that the current system's virtual memory space is insufficient, which easily leads to crashes and other issues. It is recommended that you set up virtual memory according to the tutorial.",
    ["检测到您与团长所属非相同俱乐部，是否确认退出当前团队进入四方联赛场景？"] = "Detected that you and the team leader do not belong to the same Club. Confirm exiting the current team to enter the Four-Way League scene?",
    ["检测到您与队长所属非相同俱乐部，是否确认退出当前队伍进入四方联赛场景？"] = "Detected that you and the party leader do not belong to the same Club. Confirm exiting the current party to enter the Four-Way League scene?",
    ["检测到您在对局中存在消极行为，现处于禁赛中，%s秒后可以继续开启对局匹配。"] = "Passive behavior detected during the match. You are currently suspended. You can resume matchmaking in %s seconds.",
    ["检测到您当前正在使用英特尔处理器，该处理器可能会导致游戏崩溃，我们推荐调整系统电源计划，可降低崩溃概率。是否自动设置？"] = "Detected that you are currently using an Intel processor, which may cause the game to crash. We recommend adjusting the system power plan to reduce the probability of crashes. Do you want to set it automatically?",
    ["检测到您当前的设备性能不满足最低标准，继续游戏可能会导致设备发烫、卡顿、掉帧、闪退等情况。"] = "It is detected that your current device performance does not meet the minimum standards. Continuing to play may cause the device to overheat, lag, drop frames, or crash.",
    ["检测到您是队长，且身边有可以一起跳舞的队友，点确定可进入多人模式，点取消则进入单人模式。"] = "Detected that you are the party leader and have teammates nearby who can Dance with you. Click confirm to enter multiplayer mode, click cancel to enter single-player mode.",
    ["检测到您疑似挂机，此次游戏将不再发放奖励。"] = "You are suspected of being AFK; no rewards will be issued for this game.",
    ["检测到您的AMD系列显卡驱动版本存在兼容性问题，可能引起游戏画面异常或者崩溃，为了您的游戏体验，我们建议您更新您的显卡驱动。"] = "Compatibility issues detected with your AMD graphics driver, which may cause abnormal visuals or crashes. For a better experience, we recommend updating your graphics driver.",
    ["检测到您的Intel系列显卡驱动版本存在兼容性问题，可能引起游戏画面异常或者崩溃，为了您的游戏体验，我们建议您更新您的显卡驱动。"] = "Compatibility issues detected with your Intel graphics driver, which may cause abnormal visuals or crashes. For a better experience, we recommend updating your graphics driver.",
    ["检测到您的NVIDIA系列显卡驱动版本存在兼容性问题，可能引起游戏画面异常或者崩溃，为了您的游戏体验，我们建议您更新您的显卡驱动。"] = "It is detected that your NVIDIA series graphics card driver version has compatibility issues, which may cause abnormal game graphics or crashes. For your gaming experience, we recommend that you update your graphics card driver.",
    ["检测到您的队伍成员%s在对局中存在消极行为，现处于禁赛中，%s秒后可以继续开启对局匹配。"] = "Your team member %s was detected exhibiting passive behavior. They are currently suspended. You can resume matchmaking in %s seconds.",
    ["检测到您目前是移动网络，继续下载将消耗流量，是否继续？"] = "You are currently on a mobile network. Continuing the download will consume data. Continue?",
    ["检测到有未完成的捏脸数据，是否接着上次的继续？"] = "Unfinished character creation data detected. Continue from last time?",
    ["检测到本地文件损坏，点击确认将重新校验文件并下载，如果再次遇到该问题，可尝试修复本地客户端。（错误码1009）"] = "Local file corruption detected. Click Confirm to re-verify files and download. If this issue persists, you can try to Repair the local client. (Error Code 1009)",
