    ["欢乐的女人"] = "Happy woman",
    ["欢乐的气氛中，人们排成长队，或许可以在人群聚集的地方使用【动作表情-四处观察】。"] = "In the joyful atmosphere, people are lining up. Perhaps you could use [Action/Emote - Look Around] where the crowd is gathered.",
    ["欢乐调和剂"] = "Joy Harmonizer",
    ["欢乐调和剂配方"] = "Joy Harmonizer Formula",
    ["欢乐调和剂，可提交给魔药房一楼的老师用于吸引海精灵。看上去很诱人。"] = "Joy conditioner, can be submitted to the teacher on the first floor of the potion room to attract Sea Spirits. It looks very tempting.",
