    ["欢喜"] = "Joy",
    ["欢宴的回响"] = "Echoes of the Feast",
    ["欢宴的回响（流程版）"] = "Echoes of the Feast (Flowchart version)",
    ["欢庆星座"] = "Constellation of Celebration",
    ["欢快的音乐打断了前进的步伐，前面出现了一群跳舞的……狒狒？领头的那个活力满满——热情，释放心中的热情吧！"] = "Cheerful music interrupts the advance, and a group of dancing... baboons appears in front? The leader is full of energy—enthusiasm, release the enthusiasm in your heart!",
