    ["欢迎"] = "Welcome.",
    ["欢迎<h>班森</>回家"] = "Welcome <h>Benson</> home",
    ["欢迎下次光临！"] = "Welcome back next time!",
    ["欢迎下次光临，期待与您再次相逢。"] = "Welcome back next time; I look forward to meeting you again.",
    ["欢迎乘坐金秋号跨湖列车。一等座15特里尔，金秋风光一览无遗。先生/女士，要坐车吗？"] = "Welcome to the Golden Autumn cross-lake train. First class is 15 Trier, with a panoramic view of the golden autumn scenery. Sir/Madam, would you like a ticket?",
    ["欢迎体验公共脚踏车！推广月期间，免费试骑，畅游廷根！"] = "Welcome to experience public bicycles! During the promotion month, free trial rides, travel around Tingen!",
    ["欢迎你 克莱恩"] = "Welcome, Klein",
    ["欢迎你常来面包店。"] = "Welcome to visit the bakery often.",
    ["欢迎你成为塔罗学院的一员。"] = "Welcome to the Tarot Academy.",
    ["欢迎你的加入，克莱恩。"] = "Welcome to the team, Klein.",
    ["欢迎你，{{先生|女士}}。我是萨默尔太太，很高兴你能来。"] = "Welcome, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}. I am Mrs. Sammer, I am very glad you could come.",
    ["欢迎你，孩子！"] = "Welcome, child!",
    ["欢迎你，我有急事要调查，没来得及迎接你入职。"] = "Welcome. I had an urgent matter to investigate and didn't have time to welcome you to the job.",
    ["欢迎你，非凡者！\n祝你今天的魔药消化顺利。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Welcome, Beyonder! \n Wishing you a smooth digestion of your potion today. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["欢迎光临——咦，是芙拉女士！您这是怎么了？"] = "Welcome—oh, it's Ms. Fela! What happened to you?",
    ["欢迎光临服装店，很抱歉，如您所见……我现在不是很能脱开身，您可以先自己随便看看。"] = "Welcome to the clothing store. I'm very sorry, as you can see... I'm not very free right now, you can look around by yourself first.",
    ["欢迎光临波拿巴餐厅！"] = "Welcome to Bonaparte Restaurant!",
    ["欢迎光临温莎裁缝店，全贝克兰德最懂您心思的店～"] = "Welcome to Windsor Tailor Shop, the shop in all of Backlund that understands your heart best~",
    ["欢迎光临温莎裁缝店，全贝克兰德最精致的服装定制~"] = "Welcome to Windsor Tailor Shop, the most exquisite custom clothing in all of Backlund~",
    ["欢迎光临珠宝店，随便看看。"] = "Welcome to the jewelry store, feel free to look around.",
    ["欢迎光临街角咖啡厅，{{先生|女士}}，您需要什么吗？"] = "Welcome to the Street Corner Cafe, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. Is there anything you need?",
    ["欢迎光临黑伍德庄园，{{PlayerName}}{{先生|女士}}。请进，舞会即将开始。"] = "Welcome to Heywood Manor, {{PlayerName}}{{Mr.|Ms.}}. Please come in, the ball is about to begin.",
    ["欢迎光临！"] = "Welcome!",
    ["欢迎光临！不用四处张望，我就是这家店的老板。"] = "Welcome! No need to look around, I am the owner of this shop.",
    ["欢迎光临！啊，您也发现了吧？我们这儿的花，开得就是比别处旺，连叶子都绿得格外精神，像被谁特别照顾着似的！"] = "Welcome! Ah, you noticed it too, right? Our flowers bloom more vigorously than anywhere else, even the leaves are exceptionally green, as if they are being specially taken care of by someone!",
    ["欢迎光临！您来得正好，现在不需要排队！"] = "Welcome! You've come just in time, no need to queue now!",
    ["欢迎光临！抱歉，我在查账本……您可以坐坐或是看看，我们的衣服都用了最好的料子。"] = "Welcome! Sorry, I'm checking the ledger... You can sit down or look around, our clothes are made with the best materials.",
    ["欢迎光临！请先选个喜欢的位置坐下吧！"] = "Welcome! Please choose a seat you like first!",
    ["欢迎光临，很高兴为您效劳。"] = "Welcome, it's a pleasure to be of service.",
    ["欢迎光临，您有看中的香水么？"] = "Welcome, is there any perfume you like?",
    ["欢迎光临，想喝点什么吗？"] = "Welcome, would you like something to drink?",
    ["欢迎光临，慢慢看，不着急，香水这种艺术品一定要找到最喜欢的才行。"] = "Welcome, take your time, there is no rush. Perfume is a work of art, you must find the one you like best.",
    ["欢迎光临，慢慢看，有需要叫我。"] = "Welcome, take your time looking around, call me if you need anything.",
    ["欢迎光临，有您看中的香水么？"] = "Welcome, is there any perfume you have your eye on?",
    ["欢迎光临，祝您拥有愉快的一天。"] = "Welcome, have a pleasant day.",
    ["欢迎光临，需要帮您介绍一下吗？"] = "Welcome, would you like me to introduce them to you?",
    ["欢迎光临，项链、耳环、胸针配饰都有新款上架。"] = "Welcome, we have new arrivals of necklaces, earrings, and brooch accessories.",
    ["欢迎光顾，请随意挑选，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Welcome, please feel free to browse, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["欢迎前往“万都之都号”航程的终点……"] = "Welcome to the end of the 'City of Cities' voyage...",
    ["欢迎加入“好市民”俱乐部，恭喜你，正式成为廷根阴影里最高效的“清道夫”。"] = "Welcome to the \"Good Citizen\" Club. Congratulations on officially becoming the most efficient \"cleaner\" in the shadows of Tingen.",
    ["欢迎加入俱乐部"] = "Welcome to the Club",
    ["欢迎加入俱乐部！\n<M_Default>首届四方俱乐部联赛</>将于<M_Default>本周日20:00</>正式开战——<M_Default>240人</>同场对抗，四方阵营相互制衡，是考验团队配合与临场应变的竞技舞台。以下准备可帮助您的俱乐部取得更好的成绩：\n    1. <M_Default>赛区划分时间</>：本周日<M_Default>中午12:00</>将进行赛区划分，届时将根据俱乐部活跃度等条件确定参赛资格。\n    2. <M_Default>赛区公示时间</>：本周日晚<M_Default>18:00</>将公示赛区以及分组。\n    3. <M_Default>活跃要求</>：俱乐部需至少有<M_Default>5名</>活跃玩家，方可获得赛区划分资格。\n    4. <M_Default>参赛资格</>：只有<M_Default>正式会员</>可参与联赛，请会长/理事及时调整成员职位，确保参战成员均为正式会员。\n    5. <M_Default>人数要求</>：每场对局最多派出<M_Default>60人</>，请尽可能组织足够多的成员出战，且单个途径最多可上场<M_Default>16人</>，请合理分配各途径人数，打造最强阵容！\n    请立即招揽成员、调整职位，确保<M_Default>周日20:00</>全员就位，为俱乐部荣耀而战！"] = "Welcome to the Club! \n<M_Default>The First Four-Way League</> will officially begin on <M_Default>this Sunday at 20:00</>— <M_Default>240 people</> competing on the same field, with four factions checking and balancing each other. It is a competitive stage that tests team cooperation and on-the-spot adaptability. The following preparations can help your club achieve better results: \n 1. <M_Default>Division Time</>: Division will take place this Sunday at <M_Default>12:00 noon</>, at which time eligibility will be determined based on club activity and other conditions. \n 2. <M_Default>Division Announcement Time</>: Divisions and groupings will be announced this Sunday evening at <M_Default>18:00</>. \n 3. <M_Default>Activity Requirement</>: A club must have at least <M_Default>5</> active players to qualify for division. \n 4. <M_Default>Eligibility</>: Only <M_Default>official members</> can participate in the league. Please have the president/councilors adjust member positions in time to ensure all participating members are official members. \n 5. <M_Default>Number Requirement</>: A maximum of <M_Default>60 people</> can be sent per match. Please organize as many members as possible to fight, and a single Pathway can have at most <M_Default>16 people</> on the field. Please allocate the number of people for each Pathway reasonably to build the strongest lineup! \n Please recruit members and adjust positions immediately to ensure everyone is ready by <M_Default>Sunday at 20:00</> and fight for the glory of the club!",
    ["欢迎加入家族"] = "Welcome to the Family",
    ["欢迎参与歌剧魅影比赛，搭配好<Highlight>外观</>即可领取奖励，参与华丽对决！"] = "Welcome to the Phantom of the Opera competition. Coordinate your <Highlight>Appearance</> to claim rewards and participate in the gorgeous duel!",
    ["欢迎各位参赛选手来到我们“百里挑蛋”挑战赛的现场，我是你们的最最亲爱的主持人芬利，我想死你们了！"] = "Welcome, contestants, to our 'One in a Hundred Eggs' challenge! I am your dearest host, Finley, I've missed you all so much!",
    ["欢迎品尝诅咒的味道！"] = "Welcome to taste the flavor of a curse!",
    ["欢迎品尝！"] = "Please, have a taste!",
    ["欢迎回到您的领地！我看到了您在商业上的深刻潜力，也许在不久的将来，鲁恩将诞生一位新的铁路大亨。"] = "Welcome back to your territory! I see your profound potential in business; perhaps in the near future, a new railway tycoon will be born in Loen.",
    ["欢迎回来，领主大人！您可以自由地建设和装修城堡，进行工坊生产和市场交易，或是发起铁路贸易。在您的带领下，城堡正在被建设得越来越好。"] = "Welcome back, Lord! You can freely build and decorate the castle, engage in workshop production and market trading, or initiate railway trade. Under your leadership, the castle is being built better and better.",
    ["欢迎廷根新市民"] = "Welcome new Tingen citizens",
    ["欢迎您下次光临。"] = "We look forward to your next visit.",
    ["欢迎您回到俱乐部！"] = "Welcome back to the Club!",
    ["欢迎您来到俱乐部，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Welcome to the Club, {{ Mr.| Ms.}}.",
    ["欢迎您，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Welcome, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["欢迎您，尊敬的{{先生|小姐}}。我们随时准备装载物产发车，或者您是想保养一下车厢和引擎？"] = "Welcome, respected {{ Mr. | Ms. } }. We are ready to load goods and depart at any time, or would you like to maintain the carriage and engine?",
    ["欢迎新人文字太少，多写一点吧！"] = "The welcome message is too short. Write a bit more!",
    ["欢迎新伙伴加入~"] = "Welcome new partners!",
    ["欢迎来了解廷根大学赛艇队！"] = "Welcome to learn about the Tingen University rowing team!",
    ["欢迎来到——塔罗学院。这里是“愚者”先生为新生非凡者开辟的庇护之地。"] = "Welcome to the Tarot Academy. This is a sanctuary established by Mr. Fool for new Beyonders.",
    ["欢迎来到五月庄园，“尊贵”的客人。"] = "Welcome to May Manor, \"distinguished\" guest.",
    ["欢迎来到众神之巅，你将在众神的注目下亮起刀兵，争夺荣光，见证力量。"] = "Welcome to the Peak of the Gods, where you will take up arms under the gaze of the gods, compete for glory, and witness power.",
    ["欢迎来到俱乐部乱斗场。"] = "Welcome to the Club brawl arena.",
    ["欢迎来到债务清偿现场。在这里，衣食住行不是权利，而是需要偿付的负债。"] = "Welcome to the debt liquidation site. Here, food, clothing, housing, and transportation are not rights, but debts that need to be repaid.",
    ["欢迎来到午夜茶会，这次似乎有一些新面孔。"] = "Welcome to the Midnight Tea Party. It seems there are some new faces this time.",
    ["欢迎来到占卜俱乐部！"] = "Welcome to the Divination Club!",
    ["欢迎来到占卜家协会！"] = "Welcome to the Seer Association!",
    ["欢迎来到占卜家协会，您是想占卜，还是加入我们俱乐部？"] = "Welcome to the Divination Club. Would you like a divination, or do you wish to join our club?",
    ["欢迎来到哈罗德百货，最近又来了不少新品，要来看看吗！"] = "Welcome to Harold Department Store. We've had quite a few new arrivals recently. Would you like to take a look?",
    ["欢迎来到塔罗学派"] = "Welcome to the Tarot Club",
    ["欢迎来到塔罗学派！崭新的水手。"] = "Welcome to the Tarot Club! New sailor.",
    ["欢迎来到塔罗试炼，你准备好了吗？"] = "Welcome to the Tarot Trial. Are you ready?",
    ["欢迎来到廷根市参观！"] = "Welcome to Tingen City!",
    ["欢迎来到廷根，{{先生|女士}}！要乘马车吗？可以到达廷根的任何地方，还为您提供免费的讲解服务！"] = "Welcome to Tingen, {Mr.{ Ms.|}}! Would you like to take a carriage? It can reach anywhere in Tingen, and we even provide free guide services!",
    ["欢迎来到廷根，先生小姐们！要乘马车吗？"] = "Welcome to Tingen, ladies and gentlemen! Would you like a carriage?",
    ["欢迎来到我的世界，征服者。"] = "Welcome to my world, Conqueror.",
    ["欢迎来到我的世界，征服者。    "] = "Welcome to my world, Conqueror.",
    ["欢迎来到我的地盘！"] = "Welcome to my turf!",
    ["欢迎来到我的裁缝铺，需要定制衣服吗？"] = "Welcome to my tailor shop. Do you need custom-made clothes?",
    ["欢迎来到斩杀线。底层的人每天都在线上挣扎，往前一步活一天；往后一步就掉下去。"] = "Welcome to the execution line. The people at the bottom struggle on the line every day; one step forward and they live for a day; one step back and they fall.",
    ["欢迎来到波拿巴餐厅！"] = "Welcome to Bonaparte Restaurant!",
    ["欢迎来到玫瑰天堂——"] = "Welcome to Rose Paradise—",
    ["欢迎来到玫瑰天堂的沙盘游戏~亲爱的们"] = "Welcome to the sandbox game of Rose Paradise~ my dears.",
    ["欢迎来到真实的世界"] = "Welcome to the real world",
    ["欢迎来到神许诺的光明世界"] = "Welcome to the world of light promised by God.",
    ["欢迎来到神许诺的光明世界！"] = "Welcome to the world of light promised by God!",
    ["欢迎来到罗塞尔大帝的奇妙童话世界！（临时）"] = "Welcome to Emperor Roselle's wonderful fairy tale world! (Temporary)",
    ["欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试，请您查收。欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试，请您查收。欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试，请您查收。欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试欢迎来到诡秘时间，我们为您准备了专属外观礼包奖励用于版本测试"] = "Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test. Please check it. Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test. Please check it. Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test. Please check it. Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test. Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test. Welcome to the Mystery Time. We have prepared an exclusive appearance gift pack reward for you for the version test.",
