    ["欢迎骑士到我家"] = "Welcome Knight to My Home",
    ["欢迎！欢迎！虽然你错过了拳王阿比的上一场比赛，噢，可怜的比利被打得满地找牙，但下一场很快就要开始了！"] = "Welcome! Welcome! Although you missed the last match of Champion Abi—oh, poor Billy got his teeth kicked in—the next one is starting soon!",
    ["欢迎，{{PlayerName}}，你正式成为我们的一员了。"] = "Welcome, {{PlayerName}}, you have officially become one of us.",
    ["欢迎，喝点什么？甜冰茶、啤酒、鸡尾酒……你想得到的饮料，我们这都有。"] = "Welcome, what would you like to drink? Sweet iced tea, beer, cocktails... any drink you can think of, we have it here.",
