    ["歌剧魅影/风尚沙龙总加成：<Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\n直售/神眷加成：<Highlight>%.2f%%x%.2f%%=%.2f%%</>\n本期直售收集率：<Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n本期神眷收集率：<Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\n本期独家定制：<Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\n规则说明：\n本期风格分总加成=直售/神眷加成+独家定制加成\n- 直售外观类/神眷外观类两者中收集度更高的类别，会根据收集度提供最高<Highlight>%.2f%%</>的加成\n- 拥有独家定制类目下的外观，可额外获得<Highlight>%.2f%%</>风格分加成"] = "Phantom of the Opera/Fashion Salon Total Bonus: <Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\nDirect Purchase/God's Favor Bonus: <Highlight>%.2f%%x%.2f%%=%.2f%%</>\nCurrent Period Direct Purchase Collection Rate: <Highlight>%.2f%%</>\nCurrent Period God's Favor Collection Rate: <Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\nCurrent Period Exclusive Customization: <Highlight>%.2f%%</>\n\nRule Explanation: \nCurrent Period Style Score Total Bonus = Direct Purchase/God's Favor Bonus + Exclusive Customization Bonus \n- The category with the higher collection degree between Direct Purchase Appearance/God's Favor Appearance will provide a maximum bonus of <Highlight>%.2f%%</> based on the collection degree \n- Owning appearances under the Exclusive Customization category can obtain an additional <Highlight>%.2f%%</> style score bonus",
    ["歌剧魅影中的各式动作，购买后可以用于歌剧魅影内的表演"] = "Various movements from the Phantom of the Opera; after purchase, they can be used for performances within the Phantom of the Opera.",
