    ["歌剧魅影怎么选参赛选手"] = "How to choose contestants for Phantom of the Opera",
    ["歌剧魅影搭配"] = "Phantom of the Opera Outfit",
    ["歌剧魅影搭配即将结束，请各位前往俱乐部活动界面进行参与~"] = "The Phantom of the Opera collaboration is about to end, please go to the Club activity interface to participate~",
    ["歌剧魅影搭配阶段已经开始，请各位及时参与~"] = "The Phantom of the Opera matching phase has begun; please participate in time~",
    ["歌剧魅影是俱乐部之间比拼时装搭配的大型比赛活动，每周准时举行。\n歌剧魅影共分为四个阶段。\n搭配阶段：每周指定时间后，公布本周的时装搭配主题，需要根据对应主题，搭配高分的时装搭配组合\n调整阶段：搭配阶段结束后，俱乐部搭配总评前五名会被选入比赛，会长/副会长可以调整出战顺序，利用策略击败对手\n比赛阶段：调整阶段结束后，比赛将会在歌剧魅影舞台开始，场地内会开启一场盛大的表演，决出俱乐部的胜负\n休整阶段：比赛结束后，直到下次搭配阶段开始前，歌剧魅影会处于休整阶段\n\n每一轮歌剧魅影分为三小场，决出小组内的最强俱乐部，三场均完成后会进行升降级。\n歌剧魅影使用的赛区会和四方联赛保持一致，但进行独立的升降级\n\n具体开赛时间（除开服首场外）：\n第一场：\n搭配开启：周四 10：00\n调整开启：周五 19：30\n比赛开启：周五 20：00\n第二场：\n搭配开启：周一 10：00\n调整开启：周三 19：30\n比赛开启：周三 20：00\n第三场：\n搭配开启：周四 10：00\n调整开启：周五 19：30\n比赛开启：周五 20：00"] = "Phantom of the Opera is a large-scale competition event where Clubs compete in fashion coordination, held punctually every week. \nPhantom of the Opera is divided into four stages.\nCoordination Stage: After the designated time each week, the fashion coordination theme for the week is announced. You need to coordinate a high-scoring fashion combination based on the corresponding theme.\nAdjustment Stage: After the coordination stage ends, the top five Club coordination overall rankings will be selected for the competition. The President/Vice-President can adjust the battle order to use strategy to defeat opponents.\nCompetition Stage: After the adjustment stage ends, the competition will begin on the Phantom of the Opera stage. A grand performance will take place in the venue to determine the Club's victory or defeat.\nRest Stage: After the competition ends, until the next coordination stage begins, Phantom of the Opera will be in the rest stage.\n\nEach round of Phantom of the Opera is divided into three sub-matches to determine the strongest Club in the group. After all three matches are completed, promotions and relegations will occur.\nThe competition zones used for Phantom of the Opera will be consistent with the Four-Way League, but will have independent promotion and relegation.\n\nSpecific competition times (excluding the first match after server launch):\nFirst Match:\nCoordination Opens: Thursday 10:00\nAdjustment Opens: Friday 19:30\nCompetition Opens: Friday 20:00\nSecond Match:\nCoordination Opens: Monday 10:00\nAdjustment Opens: Wednesday 19:30\nCompetition Opens: Wednesday 20:00\nThird Match:\nCoordination Opens: Thursday 10:00\nAdjustment Opens: Friday 19:30\nCompetition Opens: Friday 20:00",
    ["歌剧魅影正在准备中，尚未开启"] = "Phantom of the Opera is preparing and has not yet started.",
    ["歌剧魅影比赛"] = "Phantom of the Opera Competition",
    ["歌剧魅影比赛中可以选择拥有的各种外观进行搭配"] = "In the Phantom of the Opera competition, you can choose from various appearances you own to coordinate.",
    ["歌剧魅影比赛怎么赢"] = "How to win the Phantom of the Opera competition",
    ["歌剧魅影比赛阶段已经开始，欢迎各位前来观看俱乐部成员的盛装表演，参与搭配或观赛达到足够时长即可领取奖励！"] = "The Phantom of the Opera competition stage has begun. Everyone is welcome to come and watch the club members' grand performances. Participate in matching or watch for a sufficient duration to receive rewards!",
    ["歌剧魅影比赛阶段已结束，搭配或参赛的玩家可以前往邮箱领取奖励！"] = "The Phantom of the Opera competition phase has ended. Players who matched or participated can go to their mailbox to claim rewards!",
    ["歌剧魅影活动即将开启，是否前往参与？"] = "The Phantom of the Opera event is about to begin. Do you want to go and participate?",
    ["歌剧魅影点赞有什么用"] = "What is the use of likes in Phantom of the Opera",
    ["歌剧魅影玩法中可获得四种奖励：\n搭配奖励：完成搭配，达到一定的搭配总评后，根据对应的搭配总评，进入调整阶段时会获得奖励，通过邮件发放。\n比赛奖励：参与比赛（观战或被选入参赛阵容），并在结算时仍处于俱乐部即可领取奖励，根据本轮累计的胜场和当前场次的胜负情况，奖励的数量会有不同。\n观战奖励：比赛进行时，玩家在魅影长廊每停留1分钟，就能获得一定的同行纹章等道具奖励。\n赛季奖励：每个赛季结束时，俱乐部内参赛场次前五名的玩家会获得称号奖励"] = "Four types of rewards can be obtained in the Phantom Corridor mode:\n Matching Reward: After completing a match and reaching a certain total score, you will receive rewards during the adjustment phase based on your score, sent via mail.\n Competition Reward: Participate in the competition (spectating or being selected for the lineup) and remain in the club at the time of settlement to claim rewards. The quantity depends on the total wins in the current round and the outcome of the current match.\n Spectator Reward: While the competition is ongoing, players receive rewards like Companion Emblems for every minute spent in the Phantom Corridor.\n Season Reward: At the end of each season, the top five players in the club based on competition participation will receive title rewards.",
    ["歌剧魅影的邀请函"] = "Invitation to the Phantom of the Opera",
    ["歌剧魅影礼物"] = "Phantom of the Opera Gift",
