    ["正是。仿佛连偶然吹来的风，都带着某种……宁静的诗意。该回去了，愿女神赐你一夜安眠。"] = "Exactly. It's as if even the wind blowing by chance carries a certain... poetic sense of peace. Time to go back, may the Goddess grant you a night of slumber.",
    ["正是因为这样，3-888的危险等级暂时只是3级。"] = "It is precisely because of this that the danger level of 3-888 is currently only Level 3.",
    ["正是对你的思念，才让我战胜了狂暴海上的惊涛骇浪，回来与你重逢。"] = "It is precisely the longing for you that allowed me to overcome the raging waves of the Berserk Sea and return to reunite with you.",
    ["正是！啊——伟大的存在！我感受到了它的呼吸！"] = "Exactly! Ah—great existence! I can feel its breath!",
    ["正是！比起祈祷本身，观察这些来来往往祈祷的人，更有意思。"] = "Exactly! Compared to the prayer itself, observing the people coming and going to pray is more interesting.",
    ["正有此意"] = "That's exactly what I intended",
