    ["正面！这次一定是正面了……哎，女神啊！"] = "Heads! It must be heads this time... Oh, Goddess!",
    ["此为学员约翰（化名）偷渡到灵界的脚踏车。\n该学员与另一学员皮埃尔（化名）的信使举行竞速比赛，皮埃尔（化名）的信使从魔药房一楼飞上了二楼，约翰骑着脚踏车撞到了生命之脉上，脚踏车损坏，约翰（化名）受伤，在床上修养了半年。\n特此警示，以此为戒。"] = "This is the bicycle that student John (pseudonym) used to smuggle himself into the Spirit World.\nThis student held a racing competition with the messenger of another student, Pierre (pseudonym). Pierre's (pseudonym) messenger flew from the first floor of the potion room to the second, while John rode his bicycle and crashed into the Pulse of Life. The bicycle was damaged, and John (pseudonym) was injured, spending half a year recovering in bed.\nThis serves as a warning; let this be a lesson.",
    ["此为战场的叹息遗音，亦是命运的必然回响。 "] = "This is the sighing echo of the battlefield, and also the inevitable resonance of fate.",
    ["此事必有蹊跷……"] = "There must be something fishy about this...",
