    ["此处茶点由卡斯伯特女士免费提供，请随意取用。\n\n若柠檬蛋糕的清新能勾起您的兴趣，\n\n巧克力奶贝的甜蜜能为您带来幸福。\n\n欢迎前往佐兰特街的卡斯伯特甜品俱乐部，我们期待像您这样有品味的人加入。"] = "Refreshments here are provided free of charge by Ms. Cuthbert, please help yourself. \n\n If the freshness of lemon cake piques your interest, \n\n the sweetness of chocolate cream puffs can bring you happiness. \n\n Welcome to Cuthbert's Dessert Club on Zoutland Street, we look forward to having someone with your taste join us.",
