    ["死灵印记的额外伤害和回复生命值提高10%。"] = "Necrotic Mark additional damage and Health recovery increased by 10%.",
    ["死灵印记结束时会发生爆炸，造成小范围伤害，伤害与持续期间承受的额外伤害次数相关，承受的额外伤害次数越多伤害越高，对怪物目标额外增加75%伤害。"] = "When Necrotic Mark ends, it explodes, dealing small-area damage. The damage is related to the number of times additional damage was taken during the duration; the more times additional damage was taken, the higher the damage. Additional 75% damage is dealt to monster targets.",
    ["死灵导师"] = "Spirit Guide",
    ["死灵导师的工作，就是和亡者沟通。不仅是招魂问卜，还要聆听他们在灵界的回响，送他们彻底安息。"] = "The job of a Necromancy Mentor is to communicate with the dead. It's not just about summoning souls and divination, but also listening to their echoes in the Spirit World and sending them to complete rest.",
