    ["死神镰刀属性"] = "Death Scythe Attribute",
    ["死神陨落后，各地的反抗浪潮接连而起，帝国就此瓦解。 如今的东西拜朗，并不能算是我的祖国。"] = "After the Death fell, waves of resistance rose everywhere, and the empire collapsed. Today's East and West Balam cannot really be considered my homeland.",
