    ["死者的儿子叫瑞尔·比伯，大概30岁，继承了他去世父亲的手艺，也是个珠宝匠人。"] = "The deceased's son is named Ray Bieber, about 30 years old. He inherited his late father's craft and is also a jeweler.",
