    ["每0.5秒tick一次,移动方向为当前帧与上一tick的位置之差的角度。\n当当前移动方向与基准之差大于允许的最大偏差角度，则会触发事件。"] = "Ticks every 0.5 seconds; movement direction is the angle of the difference between the current frame and the previous tick's position. \n When the difference between the current movement direction and the baseline is greater than the maximum allowed deviation angle, an event is triggered.",
    ["每1.5秒3.5%HP"] = "3.5%HP every 1.5 seconds",
    ["每1.5秒为法阵内的友方恢复*d点生命值"] = "Restores *d Health every 1.5 seconds to friendly units within the magic circle.",
    ["每1s检查特效是否要隐藏"] = "Check if effect needs to be hidden every 1s",
    ["每2秒为周身4米范围法阵内的友方恢复*d点生命值"] = "Restores *d Health every 2 seconds to friendly units within the 4-meter radius magic circle.",
    ["每2秒为法阵内的友方恢复*d点生命值"] = "Restores *d Health every 2 seconds to friendly units within the magic circle.",
    ["每2秒受到1次伤害。"] = "Take damage once every 2 seconds.",
    ["每2秒自动获得1点太阳能量。"] = "Automatically gain 1 Solar Energy every 2 seconds.",
    ["每2秒获得1枚黄昏印记"] = "Gain 1 Dusk Mark every 2 seconds.",
    ["每2秒触发一次减速，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger slow every 2 seconds, 5-meter radius",
    ["每2秒触发一次恐惧，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger horror every 2 seconds, radius 5 meters",
    ["每2秒触发一次晕眩，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger stun every 2 seconds, 5-meter radius",
    ["每2秒触发一次沉默，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger silence every 2 seconds, radius 5 meters",
    ["每2秒触发一次滞涩，半径范围5米"] = "Triggers Stagnation every 2 seconds, 5-meter radius",
    ["每2秒触发一次睡眠，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger sleep every 2 seconds, 5-meter radius",
    ["每2秒触发一次禁锢，半径范围5米"] = "Trigger Imprisonment every 2 seconds, 5-meter radius",
    ["每2秒释放一次僵直"] = "Release stun every 2 seconds",
