    ["每2秒释放一次浮空"] = "Release levitation every 2 seconds",
    ["每2秒释放一次轻受击"] = "Trigger Light Hit Every 2 Seconds",
    ["每2秒降低4点防御。"] = "Decrease 4 Defense every 2 seconds.",
    ["每30分钟地图上的猎杀管家将会随机\n刷新位置；战斗激烈时就会\n增加管家刷新数量"] = "The Hunting Butler on the map will randomly \n refresh its position every 30 minutes; when combat intensifies, the number of Butlers refreshed will \n increase.",
    ["每30分钟，猎杀管家随机变更位置。\n并会根据战况动态额外刷新。"] = "Every 30 minutes, the Hunting Butler changes location randomly. \n It will also refresh additionally based on the combat situation.",
    ["每3秒释放全屏AoE"] = "Release screen-wide AoE every 3s",
    ["每4秒回复5%最大生命值。"] = "Restore 5% Max Health every 4 seconds.",
    ["每5秒获得一层债务，上限4层，消耗所有债务对目标造成伤害，消耗的债务越多造成的伤害越高。"] = "Gain one stack of Debt every 5 seconds, up to 4 stacks. Consume all Debt to deal damage to the target; the more Debt consumed, the higher the damage.",
    ["每60秒出现一个抱头痛哭状态。"] = "Enter a state of holding head and crying every 60 seconds.",
    ["每8秒永久获得1%攻击，最多10层"] = "Permanently gain 1% Attack every 8 seconds, max 10 stacks",
    ["每<Highlight>10进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>25装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>10 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 25</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>10进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>25装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>10 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 25</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>10进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>25装等</>的紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>10 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 25</> purple quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 35</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 35</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>45装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 45</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>45装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 45</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>55装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 55</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>55装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>金色和紫色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 55</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> gold and purple quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. There is a certain probability of obtaining 1 Gray Fog Crystal Shard (used to upgrade Competition Brooches of Item Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality); you can obtain at most 3 per week, and any unobtained amount can be accumulated to the following week. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>60装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 60</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
