    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>62装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 62</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
