    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>65装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 64</> or <Highlight>Item Level 65</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>65装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 64</> or <Highlight>Level 65</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 64</> or <Highlight>Item Level 66</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 64</> or <Highlight>Item Level 66</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. There is a certain probability of obtaining 1 Gray Fog Crystal Shard (used to upgrade Competition Brooches of Item Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality); you can obtain at most 3 per week, and any unobtained amount can be accumulated to the following week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 64</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 64</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>或<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 66</> or <Highlight>Item Level 68</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>或<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 66</> or <Highlight>Item Level 68</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule. There is a certain probability of obtaining 1 Gray Fog Crystal Shard (used to upgrade Competition Brooches of Item Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality); you can obtain at most 3 per week, and any unobtained amount can be accumulated to the following week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 66</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, and Bound Soule.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 66</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>或<Highlight>69装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> or <Highlight>Level 69</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>或<Highlight>69装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> or <Highlight>Level 69</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。有一定概率可获得1个灰雾晶砾（用于将64装等或以上装等竞技胸针升级至神话品质），每周至多获得3个，未获得的数量可累计至下周。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold quality Equipment, Beyonder materials, polymerization factors, and bound Soles. There is a certain chance to obtain 1 Gray Fog Crystal Fragment (used to upgrade Competition brooches of Level 64 or higher to Mythical quality). A maximum of 3 can be obtained per week, and unobtained amounts can be carried over to the next week.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>当前开启装等</>的<Highlight>冒险倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress</>, obtain 1 growth resource chest. Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>current level</> <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> orange or gold-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，开启可随机获得一件<Highlight>当前开启装等</>的<Highlight>竞技倾向</>橙色或金色品质装备，非凡物质、聚合因子、绑定苏勒。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress</>, obtain 1 growth resource chest. Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>current level</> <Highlight>Competition-oriented</> orange or gold-quality equipment, Beyonder materials, Aggregation Factors, or bound Sol.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>35装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 35</> gold and purple quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>45装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 45</> gold and purple quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>55装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 55</> gold and purple quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>60装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 60</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>62装等</>或<Highlight>64装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 62</> or <Highlight>Item Level 64</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>62装等</>或<Highlight>64装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>非凡橙色装备箱、灰雾尘埃匣、灰雾晶砾匣、金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress</> grants 1 Growth Resource Chest. Opening it randomly grants one piece of <Highlight>62 Gear Level</> or <Highlight>64 Gear Level</> orange or gold quality equipment, as well as a Contract of Trade that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Bazaar</> for <Highlight>Tradable Gear Level</> items, <Highlight>Tradable</> Orange Beyonder Equipment Chests, Gray Fog Dust Boxes, Gray Fog Crystal Boxes, Gold Thread, Beyonder material, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>62装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 62</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>62装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>非凡橙色装备箱、灰雾尘埃匣、灰雾晶砾匣、金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress</> grants 1 Growth Resource Chest. Opening it randomly grants one piece of <Highlight>62 Gear Level</> orange or gold quality equipment, as well as a Contract of Trade that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Bazaar</> for <Highlight>Tradable Gear Level</> items, <Highlight>Tradable</> Orange Beyonder Equipment Chests, Gray Fog Dust Boxes, Gray Fog Crystal Boxes, Gold Thread, Beyonder material, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>65装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 64</> or <Highlight>Level 65</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>或<Highlight>66装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 64</> or <Highlight>Item Level 66</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>64装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 64</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>或<Highlight>68装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Receive 1 Development Resource Box every <Highlight>20 progress</>. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Item Level 66</> or <Highlight>Item Level 68</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 66</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>或<Highlight>69装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> or <Highlight>Level 69</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>68装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 68</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>当前开启装等</>的<Highlight>可交易</>橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress</>, obtain 1 growth resource chest. Open to randomly obtain one piece of <Highlight>current level</> <Highlight>tradable</> orange or gold-quality equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
    ["每一个诺言都拥有效力，每一笔交换都基于信任。"] = "Every promise has validity, and every exchange is based on trust.",
    ["每一件封印物，都是非凡之路上的墓碑。"] = "Every Sealed Artifact is a tombstone on the path of the Extraordinary.",
    ["每一件封印物，都是非凡之路上的墓碑。\n它们可能来源于我们的探索，我们的收集，也有可能是我们的敌人……和同伴。"] = "Every Sealed Artifact is a tombstone on the path of the Extraordinary. \n They may come from our explorations, our collections, or they may be our enemies... and our companions.",
    ["每一位愿意走向末日的人，都该有与末日对峙的资格。"] = "Everyone willing to walk toward the apocalypse should have the qualifications to confront it.",
    ["每一位病者、亡者，每一种劳苦、忧困，"] = "Every sick person, every dead person, every kind of toil and distress,",
    ["每一口都是百年的时间。"] = "Every sip is a hundred years of time.",
    ["每一场战争都有由来，而我，为你们打开通往它们的大门。"] = "Every war has its origins, and I am the one who opens the door for you to reach them.",
    ["每一家报纸都有它们的特色，这真的很难抉择。晨报可以第一时间读到大新闻，比起来，老实人报更休闲一些。"] = "Every newspaper has its own characteristics, it's really hard to choose. You can read big news immediately in the Morning Post; by comparison, the Honest Man is more for leisure.",
    ["每一批子弹的发射数量"] = "Number of bullets fired per batch.",
    ["每一枚金币都代表着一次委托的达成、一次共同的守护、一次荣誉的共享，凝结着俱乐部成员的共同誓约与集体贡献。"] = "Every gold coin represents the fulfillment of a commission, a shared protection, and a shared honor, condensing the common covenant and collective contribution of the club members.",
    ["每一根手指的弯曲都在校准灵性与机械的间隙。"] = "The bending of every finger calibrates the gap between spirituality and machinery.",
    ["每一次凋落，都是必然到来的衰败。"] = "Every withering is the inevitable arrival of Decay.",
    ["每一次出海，都可能遇到意想不到的事情。风暴、海盗、怪物……甚至是更古老的存在。"] = "Every time you go to sea, you might encounter unexpected things. Storms, pirates, monsters... or even more ancient existences.",
    ["每一次告别，都是另一种重逢。"] = "Every farewell is just another form of reunion.",
    ["每一次报销，都从好好贴发票开始。"] = "Every reimbursement starts with properly attaching the receipts.",
    ["每一次挥斩，都是对败者命运的无声宣判。"] = "Every slash is a silent verdict on the loser's fate.",
    ["每一次接触，都会让佩戴者更接近知识本身。"] = "Every contact brings the wearer closer to knowledge itself.",
    ["每一次揭示，都会让被隐匿起来的知识，回归现实。"] = "Every revelation brings hidden knowledge back to reality.",
    ["每一次摇摆，都是命运给出的隐秘答案。"] = "Every sway is a secret answer given by fate.",
    ["每一次更名，都是一次隐秘的重塑，意味着俱乐部将以全新的面貌，重新宣告存在。"] = "Every renaming is a secret reshaping, meaning the club will announce its existence anew with a brand-new look.",
    ["每一次跳动都像是战鼓轰鸣。"] = "Every beat is like the roar of war drums.",
    ["每一步都将地面的犹豫踩碎，只留下向前的印记。"] = "Every step crushes the hesitation on the ground, leaving only the mark of moving forward.",
    ["每一步都开出轻盈的小花，每一爪都按下软乎乎的承诺，世界因你变得毛绒绒。"] = "Every step blooms with light flowers, every paw leaves a soft promise, the world becomes fluffy because of you.",
    ["每一步都是力量的宣告，大地将因你的巨力而颤抖。"] = "Every step is a declaration of power; the earth will tremble because of your great strength.",
    ["每一步都踩碎一条旧有定律，每一步都踩出一条新型公式。"] = "Every step crushes an old law, and every step treads out a new formula.",
    ["每一段旅行都有终点。"] = "Every journey has an end.",
    ["每一点星光，都是一个待开启的章节。"] = "Every bit of starlight is a chapter waiting to be opened.",
    ["每一片浪花都是前任"] = "Every wave is a predecessor",
    ["每一行的数据都已经划去，多半早已钱货两清了。\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：陈旧的销售记录）</>"] = "The data in every row has been crossed out; most likely, the money and goods have long since changed hands. \n<P_Yellow>(Obtained a clue and placed it in the Inventory: Old Sales Record)</>",
    ["每一行的数据都已经划去，多半早已钱货两清了。\\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索并放入背包：陈旧的销售记录）</>"] = "Every line of data has been crossed out; it seems the payment and goods were settled long ago.\n<P_Yellow>（Obtained clue and added to backpack: Old Sales Record）</>",
    ["每一颗铆钉都是被征服的学识。"] = "Every rivet is a piece of conquered knowledge.",
    ["每个PVP回合结束后，从上场阵容中人数最多的羁绊里随机获得1个棋子。"] = "After each PVP round, randomly gain 1 chess piece from the bond with the most members in your current lineup.",
    ["每个PVP失败回合获得2经验；若处于连败，额外获得1经验。"] = "Gain 2 EXP for each PVP loss; if on a losing streak, gain an additional 1 EXP.",
    ["每个人最根本的灵性，万物有灵派认为，凡是生物都有灵性，都有精神体"] = "The most fundamental spirituality of every person. The School of Thought of All Things Have Spirits believes that all living things have spirituality and possess a spirit body.",
    ["每个人最根本的灵性，万物有灵派认为，凡是生物都有灵性，都有精神体。"] = "Everyone's fundamental spirituality; the School of Thought of All Things Having Spirits believes that all living beings possess spirituality and a spirit body.",
    ["每个人的命运属于他们自己，只有“你”才是答案，我们开始吧。"] = "Everyone's fate belongs to themselves; only \"you\" are the answer. Let's begin.",
    ["每个人都有自己的秘密，但在这个聚会上，我们可以交换情报、交易材料，甚至得到他的指点。"] = "Everyone has their own secrets, but at this gathering, we can exchange intelligence, trade materials, and even get his guidance.",
    ["每个人都有自己的选择，你能记得来大学通知他们，而不是直接缺席，我很满意。"] = "Everyone has their own choices. I am satisfied that you remembered to come to the university to notify them instead of just being absent.",
    ["每个周一，下午三点，我会定期召唤你们来这里集会，尽量独处。"] = "Every Monday at three in the afternoon, I will regularly summon you here for a gathering. Try to be alone.",
    ["每个套房都安装了最新的传动联络装置。"] = "Each suite is equipped with the latest transmission communication device.",
    ["每个季度我会把这些单子整理好交给弗莱队长，他会拿去圣堂报销并申请下一季度的单费。"] = "Every quarter, I organize these bills and hand them to Captain Frye. He will take them to the Holy Cathedral for reimbursement and to apply for the next quarter's funds.",
    ["每个小矮人安全区<Highlight>只能庇护一个人</>，需要玩家<Highlight>提前规划站位</>，有序进圈。"] = "Each Dwarf safe area <Highlight>can only shelter one person</>. Players need to <Highlight>plan their positions in advance</> and enter the circle in an orderly manner.",
    ["每个序列同时有且仅拥有2种可供自由切换的领域类型，不同领域触发时的领域专属效果不同；切换领域后玩家所有技能的伤害类型将会与领域类型保持一致；在与非凡怪物战斗时，玩家造成的伤害将根据怪物自身对特定种类领域抗性进行结算"] = "Each Sequence has exactly two domain types that can be switched freely, with different exclusive effects triggered by each domain. After switching domains, the damage type of all the player's skills will align with the domain type. When battling extraordinary monsters, the damage dealt by the player will be calculated based on the monster's specific resistance to that domain type.",
    ["每个恩赐方案最多置换1次，是否继续"] = "Each blessing scheme can be replaced at most once. Do you want to continue?",
    ["每个战争纪念日，我们都会来感谢伟大的风暴之主！"] = "Every War Memorial Day, we come to thank the great Lord of Storms!",
    ["每个日光强烈的午后，栏杆的阴影都像刀子一样一丝不苟地切开地板。"] = "Every afternoon when the sunlight was strong, the shadows of the railings would cut across the floor like knives, meticulously.",
    ["每个月最后一个周日14:00开始比赛，当周周一8:00开启报名，玩家需要组成6人战队多轮角逐晋级淘汰赛，最后冲击冠军！\n参赛即可获得丰厚奖励，冠军队伍还有赛琳娜教堂处的专属自定义雕像！"] = "The competition starts at 14:00 on the last Sunday of each month, and registration opens at 8:00 on the Monday of that week. Players need to form a 6-person team to compete in multiple rounds to advance to the knockout stage, and finally compete for the championship! \n Participating will earn generous rewards, and the championship team will have an exclusive custom statue at the Selena Cathedral!",
    ["每个溺水的人都会挣扎。"] = "Every drowning person will struggle.",
    ["每个物品为3x3的数据，中心位置为物品类型，@表示水泵，A表示鲜花，BCD分别为直线、直角、三通水管，中心位置的上下左右为1表示可连通"] = "Each item is 3x3 data; center is item type, @ is water pump, A is flower, BCD are straight, right-angle, and T-junction pipes; 1 indicates connectable at center's top, bottom, left, right.",
    ["每个玩家战斗回合额外获得2经验。你的5费弈子获得12%最大生命值和12%攻击速度。"] = "Gain 2 extra XP per player combat round. Your 5-cost pieces gain 12% Max Health and 12% Attack Speed.",
    ["每个秘偶都能提升<Highlight>角色属性</>，并有独特的<Highlight>技能</>。<Highlight>培养</>秘偶可以强化属性和技能效果。"] = "Each marionette can improve <Highlight>Character Attributes</> and has unique <Highlight>Skills</>. <Highlight>Cultivating</> marionettes can strengthen attributes and skill effects.",
    ["每个站点每日刷新1个委托"] = "1 commission refreshes daily at each station",
    ["每个部位当前没装备的就会从背包里面找一下能不能装备"] = "If a slot is currently unequipped, it will search the inventory to see if it can be equipped.",
    ["每个部位的灵质空间内含属性类型不同，调整也仅限于当前部位。\n每类属性中都可以单独调整某一条的权重，将其提升50%或者降低25%，调整后，所有灵质的概率都将相应发生变化。"] = "The spiritual quality space of each part contains different attribute types, and adjustments are limited to the current part. \nIn each attribute category, you can individually adjust the weight of a specific one, increasing it by 50% or decreasing it by 25%. After adjustment, the probabilities of all spiritual qualities will change accordingly.",
    ["每个非凡序列都会拥有其专属的神奇能力，在战斗中会随机触发领域效果来为非凡者提供更强的战斗能力"] = "Every Beyonder sequence possesses its own unique magical abilities. During combat, domain effects will trigger randomly to provide the Beyonder with stronger combat capabilities.",
    ["每产生一张巨型塔罗牌，会额外获得2张灵性牌。"] = "Each time a Giant Tarot Card is created, you gain 2 additional Spirit Cards.",
    ["每产生一张巨型塔罗牌，会额外获得2张灵性牌。灵性爆发伤害提高100%。"] = "Each giant Tarot card generated grants 2 additional Spirituality cards. Spirituality Burst damage increased by 100%.",
    ["每件外观均拥有基础风尚度，玩家可通过消耗染色材料，染色并保存方案获得额外风尚度加成，方案中每消耗<Highlight>1</>个珊瑚染料获得<Highlight>10</>风尚度，每消耗<Highlight>1</>个虹光染料获得<Highlight>40</>风尚度，每消耗<Highlight>1</>个泡沫染膏获得<Highlight>20</>风尚度，每消耗一个神眷牌获得<Highlight>4000</>风尚度。系统将从该外观已保存的全部染色方案中，选取额外风尚度最高的<Highlight> 3 </>套，累加至基础风尚度之上，作为该外观的最终风尚度。\n\n举例：\n某件外观装备的基础风尚度为 <Highlight>800</>，玩家已在该外观下保存了 <Highlight>4 </>套染色方案，四套方案所提供的额外风尚度分别为 <Highlight>150、280、420、360</>。\n系统将从这<Highlight> 4 </>套方案中选取额外风尚度最高的 <Highlight>3 </>套（即 420、360、280）结算，其余方案不参与计算。\n因此，该外观的染色累计加成为 420 + 360 + 280 = 1060，最终总风尚度为基础风尚度 800 与染色累计加成 1060 相加，即 1860。\n\n补充说明：\n1. 新增或修改染色方案后，系统将自动选取最高的<Highlight> 3 </>套参与结算，更新此外观的风尚度。\n2. 删除某套染色方案将同步移出结算队列，若删除的方案原本参与结算，则由剩余方案中次高者递补。\n3. 若玩家未保存任何染色方案，则该外观仅显示基础风尚度。"] = "Every cosmetic has a base Fashion Value. Players can consume dyeing materials to dye and save schemes to obtain additional Fashion Value bonuses. Each <Highlight>1</> Coral Dye consumed in a scheme grants <Highlight>10</> Fashion Value, each <Highlight>1</> Rainbow Dye grants <Highlight>40</> Fashion Value, each <Highlight>1</> Foam Dye grants <Highlight>20</> Fashion Value, and each Divine Favor Card consumed grants <Highlight>4000</> Fashion Value. The system will select the <Highlight> 3 </> schemes with the highest additional Fashion Value from all saved dyeing schemes for this cosmetic and add them to the base Fashion Value as the final Fashion Value of the cosmetic. \n\nExample: \nThe base Fashion Value of a certain cosmetic equipment is <Highlight>800</>. The player has saved <Highlight>4 </> dyeing schemes for this cosmetic, and the additional Fashion Value provided by the four schemes are <Highlight>150, 280, 420, 360</>. \nThe system will select the <Highlight> 3 </> schemes with the highest additional Fashion Value from these <Highlight> 4 </> schemes (i.e., 420, 360, 280) for settlement; the remaining schemes will not participate in the calculation. \nTherefore, the cumulative dyeing bonus for this cosmetic is 420 + 360 + 280 = 1060, and the final total Fashion Value is the base Fashion Value of 800 plus the cumulative dyeing bonus of 1060, which is 1860. \n\nSupplementary Notes: \n1. After adding or modifying a dyeing scheme, the system will automatically select the highest <Highlight> 3 </> schemes to participate in the settlement and update the Fashion Value of this cosmetic. \n2. Deleting a dyeing scheme will simultaneously remove it from the settlement queue. If the deleted scheme was originally participating in the settlement, it will be replaced by the next highest remaining scheme. \n3. If the player has not saved any dyeing schemes, the cosmetic will only display the base Fashion Value.",
    ["每件封印物的能力不同，它们能带来力量，也会带来一定的负面效果。"] = "Each Sealed Artifact has different abilities; they bring power but also certain negative effects.",
    ["每件装备只能拥有<EquipHighLight>1条</>圣膏词条，且涂抹效果<EquipHighLight>不可回退</>"] = "Each piece of equipment can only possess <EquipHighLight>1</> Holy Ointment affix, and the application effect <EquipHighLight> cannot be reversed </>",
    ["每件装备均有基础灵质，由于部位和装备类型的不同，基础灵质的类型也有不同。\n每件装备的基础灵质本身为固定值，同类型装备的等级越高，基础灵质也越多；同时装备随机灵质的数量会提升基础灵质的数量。"] = "Every piece of Equipment has base Spirit Quality. Due to differences in slots and equipment types, the types of base Spirit Quality also vary. \n The base Spirit Quality of each piece of Equipment is a fixed value; the higher the level of the same type of equipment, the higher the base Spirit Quality. At the same time, the number of random Spirit Qualities on the equipment will increase the amount of base Spirit Quality.",
    ["每位非凡者还最多可以额外密契另一个领域。选择发展不同的“密契非凡觉醒”，对相应领域能力的掌握也会有所不同。"] = "Each Beyonder can additionally mysticize at most one other domain. Choosing to develop different \"Mystic Beyonder Awakening\" will result in different levels of mastery over the corresponding domain's abilities.",
    ["每到工厂的发薪日，账单和洛克手下的讨债者们总会如期而至。"] = "Every payday at the factory, the bills and the debt collectors under Locke always arrive right on schedule.",
    ["每叠加1层，每1.5秒受到3%最大生命值的持续伤害，至多可叠加10层。"] = "Each stack adds 3% of max Health as continuous damage every 1.5 seconds, stackable up to 10 layers.",
    ["每名弈子每场战斗的第6次普攻后，获得12%攻击速度和6%伤害增幅，持续本场战斗。"] = "After the 6th basic attack in each combat, each piece gains 12% Attack Speed and 6% Damage Increase for the duration of the combat.",
    ["每名弈子每场战斗的第6次普攻后，获得20%攻击速度和10%伤害增幅，持续本场战斗。"] = "After the 6th basic attack in each combat, each piece gains 20% Attack Speed and 10% Damage Increase for the duration of the combat.",
    ["每名弈子每场战斗的第6次普攻后，获得32%攻击速度和15%伤害增幅，持续本场战斗。"] = "After the 6th basic attack in each combat, each piece gains 32% Attack Speed and 15% Damage Increase for the duration of the combat.",
    ["每周"] = "Weekly",
    ["每周%s早上%s点刷新"] = "Refreshes every %s at %s:00",
    ["每周一8:00根据排名发放奖励，随后重置榜单。"] = "Rewards are distributed based on rankings every Monday at 8:00, after which the leaderboard is reset.",
    ["每周一8点刷新"] = "Refreshes every Monday at 8:00",
    ["每周一会刷新物产收购价格，请注意及时检查，生产高价值物产。"] = "The purchase price of produce is refreshed every Monday. Please remember to check in time and produce high-value goods.",
    ["每周一凌晨五点刷新，成员完成个人目标、俱乐部达成俱乐部目标都可为俱乐部积累奖章，奖章积累到一定数量可解锁阶段奖励。"] = "Refreshes every Monday at 5:00 AM. Members can accumulate medals for the club by completing personal goals, and the club can accumulate medals by reaching club goals. Once a certain number of medals are accumulated, stage rewards can be unlocked.",
    ["每周一凌晨五点刷新，达成目标可获得奖励，同时为俱乐部增加奖章。"] = "Refreshes every Monday at 5:00 AM. Achieving goals grants rewards and adds medals to the Club.",
    ["每周一重置"] = "Resets every Monday",
    ["每周三 15:30"] = "Every Wednesday 15:30",
    ["每周二、周四中午12:00开放报名，晚间19:00~20:30乱斗正式开启。场次安排以上一届参与人数而定（首届以俱乐部人数）。"] = "Registration opens every Tuesday and Thursday at 12:00 PM, and the brawl officially starts at 19:00~20:30 in the evening. The schedule is determined by the number of participants in the previous session (the first session is based on the number of club members).",
    ["每周任务"] = "Weekly Quests",
    ["每周六%s开启宣战，本周宣战时间已结束"] = "War declaration opens every Saturday at %s; the declaration period for this week has ended",
    ["每周六%s开启宣战，本期宣战倒计时:%s"] = "War declaration opens every Saturday at %s; countdown to this period: %s",
    ["每周六12:00-19:30开启宣战，本期宣战倒计时：<Tips>%s</>"] = "War declaration opens every Saturday from 12:00 to 19:30. Countdown to this period's war declaration: <Tips>%s</>",
    ["每周六15：00刷新"] = "Refreshes every Saturday at 15:00",
    ["每周六20:45"] = "Every Saturday 20:45",
    ["每周六、周日晚间19:30~21:00，该增益强化为【闪耀的结社之辉】：基于魅力、直觉的检定投骰结果+3;参与教团玩法后，获得战斗属性增益。"] = "Every Saturday and Sunday from 19:30 to 21:00, this buff is strengthened to [Shining Glory of the Society]: +3 to dice rolls based on Charisma and Intuition; after participating in the cult gameplay, you gain combat attribute bonuses.",
    ["每周分红"] = "Weekly Dividend",
    ["每周副本宝箱"] = "Weekly Dungeon Chest",
    ["每周参加赛事，可从以下奖励2选1"] = "Participate in the competition every week to choose 1 of 2 rewards from the following",
    ["每周可领取一次俱乐部分红奖励。\n俱乐部分红奖励受到俱乐部活跃度等级和个人上周在当前俱乐部的活跃影响。\n俱乐部分红奖励将会在每周一8:00刷新，请及时领取奖励。"] = "You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week. \nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00. Please claim your rewards in time.",
    ["每周四20:45"] = "Every Thursday 20:45",
    ["每周奖励"] = "Weekly Rewards",
    ["每周工资计算公式id"] = "Weekly salary calculation formula ID",
    ["每周我都在这里。您若过来坐坐，我便再为您写一首。只给您一个人。 "] = "I'm here every week. If you come and sit for a while, I'll write another one for you. Only for you.",
    ["每周扮演任务"] = "Weekly Acting Quest",
    ["每周旅程"] = "Weekly Journey",
    ["每周日 19:00"] = "Every Sunday 19:00",
    ["每周日 19:30"] = "Every Sunday 19:30",
    ["每周日%s开启宣战"] = "Declarations open every Sunday at %s",
    ["每周日%s开启宣战，本期宣战倒计时:%s"] = "Declarations open every Sunday at %s. Countdown to current declaration: %s",
    ["每周日20:00"] = "Every Sunday 20:00",
    ["每周日23:59根据排名发放奖励，赛季结束重置榜单。"] = "Rewards are distributed based on rankings every Sunday at 23:59, and the leaderboard is reset at the end of the season.",
    ["每周日23:59根据排名发放奖励，随后重置榜单。"] = "Rewards are distributed based on rankings every Sunday at 23:59, after which the leaderboard is reset.",
    ["每周获取默契值上限"] = "Weekly maximum rapport value",
    ["每周遗留未满默契值上限"] = "Weekly remaining unfilled rapport value limit",
    ["每周里程"] = "Weekly Milestones",
    ["每周需要遵循教团规章，完成指定任务来证明自身行迹。"] = "Every week, you need to follow the cult's rules and complete designated tasks to prove your actions.",
    ["每回合获得1次免费的商店刷新。获得4金币。"] = "Gain 1 free shop refresh per round. Gain 4 Gold Coins.",
    ["每场乱斗共有32个幻象投影参与，时长5分钟。击杀、存活皆可赚取积分。4分30秒时若未分胜负，将结算最终排名积分。 "] = "Each brawl has 32 phantom projections participating and lasts 5 minutes. You can earn points by killing and surviving. If there is no winner at 4 minutes and 30 seconds, the final ranking points will be settled.",
    ["每场战斗首次施法后，获得<HighLight>5</>点法力恢复，持续<HighLight>4</>秒。"] = "After the first spell cast in each combat, gain <HighLight>5</> Mana recovery for <HighLight>4</> seconds.",
    ["每场比赛会有不同的<Highlight>风格主题</>，对应主题的外观可获得更好成绩"] = "Each competition will have different <Highlight>Style Themes</>; appearances matching the theme can achieve better results.",
    ["每场玩家战斗开始回复<HighLight>2</>点生命。"] = "Recover <HighLight>2</> Health at the start of each player battle.",
    ["每场玩家战斗开始回复<HighLight>2</>点生命；玩家战斗胜利后获得<HighLight>50</>幸运积分。"] = "Recover <HighLight>2</> Health at the start of each player battle; gain <HighLight>50</> lucky points after winning a player battle.",
    ["每场首次施法后+5法力恢复，持续4秒"] = "+5 Mana recovery after the first spell cast per battle, lasting 4 seconds",
    ["每块肉上有不同的屠宰场钢印，刻着不同的日期。它们是从不同肉铺收购来的过期货。"] = "Each piece of meat has different slaughterhouse steel stamps, engraved with different dates. They are expired goods purchased from different butcher shops.",
    ["每天"] = "Daily",
    ["每天12：00~24：00 开放"] = "Open daily from 12:00 to 24:00",
    ["每天从早到晚，店里挤满了人，笑声能从这头传到那头。 "] = "Every day from morning to night, the shop was packed with people, and the laughter could be heard from one end to the other.",
    ["每天出门买菜，和你说说闲话，是我最高兴的时候。"] = "Going out to buy groceries every day and chatting with you is when I am happiest.",
    ["每天只能结成1次誓约，请明日再来吧"] = "You can only form a Covenant once a day, please come back tomorrow.",
    ["每天对着窗户外的马车愁眉苦脸……她肯定在幻想一次郊游呢。"] = "Staring at the carriage outside the window with a gloomy face every day... She must be dreaming of an outing.",
    ["每天提供一点材料。"] = "Provides a bit of material every day.",
    ["每天搬着砖，啃着黑面包……哎！说这个干什么，{{先生|女士}}，感谢您听我唠叨。"] = "Carrying bricks every day, gnawing on black bread... Sigh! Why am I saying this? {{Mr.|Ms.}}, thank you for listening to my rambling.",
    ["每天早上清洗蔬菜的水太冷了……希望快点暖和起来。"] = "The water for washing vegetables every morning is too cold... I hope it warms up soon.",
    ["每天早上，你会看到市民排队买面包，小孩在街上跑，商人在讨价还价，情侣在河边散步……"] = "Every morning, you see citizens queuing for bread, children running on the street, merchants bargaining, couples walking by the river...",
    ["每天来一杯咖啡，能让人精神抖擞呢！"] = "A cup of coffee every day makes one feel refreshed!",
    ["每天洗十次澡还是不够，必须用香水，大量的香水！"] = "Bathing ten times a day isn't enough, I must use perfume, lots of perfume!",
    ["每天的工作就是盖章、盖章、再盖章。"] = "My daily work is stamping, stamping, and more stamping.",
    ["每天跳上车筐，就已经耗尽我全部的力气了。"] = "Just jumping into the basket every day has already exhausted all my strength.",
    ["每天都出差，这个班不上也罢！"] = "Business trips every day, this job isn't worth doing!",
    ["每天都是这么呛，这些烧煤的烟雾已经熏黄了我们的皮肤和牙齿，不知道还要熏黄什么。"] = "It's this smoky every day; these coal fumes have already stained our skin and teeth yellow, I don't know what else they'll stain.",
    ["每天都这么难受，这些烧煤产生的烟雾已经把我们的皮肤和牙齿熏得发黄了，不知道还会熏成什么样。"] = "It's so miserable every day. The smoke from burning coal has already stained our skin and teeth yellow. I don't know what else it will stain them into.",
    ["每天都这样！这工作做不了了！"] = "Every single day! I can't do this job anymore!",
    ["每天首次私聊"] = "First private chat of the day",
    ["每层+1%攻击，最多15层"] = "+1% Attack per stack, max 15 stacks",
    ["每层+10攻击和防御，最多5层"] = "+10 Attack and Defense per stack, up to 5 stacks",
    ["每层+2%攻击，最多15层"] = "+2% Attack per stack, max 15 stacks",
    ["每层你可以获得一次变成玩具象的机会，30秒内所有敌人无法将你加入仇恨列表，但你的任何主动攻击会解除此状态。"] = "Each floor you can gain one chance to transform into a toy elephant. For 30 seconds, all enemies cannot add you to their hate list, but any active attack from you will end this state.",
    ["每层你可以获得一次在战斗中使用坐骑的机会（不可积累叠加），持续15秒，上坐骑时你对撞到的敌人造成高额伤害"] = "Each floor, you can gain one opportunity to use a mount in combat (cannot be stacked), lasting 15 seconds. When mounting, you deal high damage to enemies you collide with.",
    ["每层你可以获得一次在战斗中使用坐骑的机会，持续30秒，上坐骑时你对撞到的敌人造成高额伤害。"] = "Each floor you can gain one chance to use a mount in battle, lasting 30 seconds. When mounting, you deal high damage to enemies you collide with.",
    ["每层你可以获得一次在战斗中变身成烈焰的机会，持续15秒，对灼烧到的敌人造成高额伤害，期间无法跳跃和闪避"] = "Each floor, you can gain one opportunity to transform into a Blazing Flame in combat, lasting 15 seconds, dealing high damage to enemies burned. You cannot jump or dodge during this period.",
    ["每层你可以获得一次在战斗中变身成烈焰的机会，持续15秒，自身减伤90%并对灼烧到的敌人造成高额伤害，期间无法攻击、跳跃和闪避。"] = "Each floor you can gain one chance to transform into a Flame in battle, lasting 15 seconds. Damage Reduction 90% and deal high damage to enemies burned. During this period, you cannot attack, jump, or dodge.",
    ["每层使体力恢复速度降低<Yellow>25%</>。"] = "Each stack reduces stamina recovery speed by <Yellow>25%</>.",
    ["每层使受到伤害提升10%"] = "Each stack increases damage taken by 10%",
    ["每层使受到治疗降低*f**"] = "Healing Received Reduced per stack *f**",
    ["每层使移动速度降低*f**"] = "Each layer reduces movement speed by *f**.",
    ["每层使造成治疗降低*f**"] = "Healing Dealt Reduced per stack *f**",
    ["每层受到伤害降低10%"] = "Damage taken reduced by 10% per stack",
    ["每层增伤提高*f**"] = "Damage Boost per stack increased by *f**.",
    ["每层扣5%最大生命值"] = "5% Max HP Loss Per Stack",
    ["每层提升*f**伤害"] = "Each layer increases *f** damage",
    ["每层提升*f**攻击力，上限1000层"] = "Each stack increases Attack Power by *f**, up to a maximum of 1000 stacks",
    ["每层提升2%增伤，最多提升10%"] = "Each stack increases Damage Boost by 2%, up to a maximum of 10%.",
    ["每层提高*f**伤害"] = "Each layer increases damage by *f**.",
    ["每层提高*f**减伤"] = "Each stack increases Damage Reduction by *f**",
    ["每层提高1%伤害"] = "Each stack increases damage by 1%",
    ["每层提高20%伤害"] = "Each stack increases damage by 20%",
    ["每层提高<Yellow>*f</>点攻击、<Yellow>*f</>点技能增强。"] = "Each stack increases <Yellow>*f</> attack and <Yellow>*f</> skill enhancement.",
    ["每层攻击增加<Yellow>*d</>。"] = "Attack increased per stack <Yellow>*d</>.",
    ["每层攻速提高6%，最多4层"] = "Attack Speed increased by 6% per stack, up to 4 stacks",
    ["每层暴击增加<Yellow>*d</>。"] = "Critical hit increased by <Yellow>*d</> per stack.",
    ["每层正义审判会为自身的惩戒和无暗之枪提供5%伤害加成"] = "Each stack of Judgment of Justice provides a 5% Damage Increase to your Punishment and Unshadowed Spear.",
    ["每层获得*d护盾"] = "Gain *d Shield per stack",
    ["每层获得0.8%攻击力提升,至多可叠加100层。"] = "Each stack grants 0.8% attack power increase, up to 100 stacks.",
    ["每层获得1%攻击力提升,至多可叠加100层。"] = "Each stack grants 1% attack power increase, up to 100 stacks.",
    ["每层获得2%攻击力提升，减少2%受到的伤害，至多可叠加10层。"] = "Each stack grants 2% attack power increase and reduces damage taken by 2%, up to 10 stacks.",
    ["每层获得20%攻击力提升。"] = "Gain 20% Attack Power increase per layer.",
    ["每层获得移速提高<Yellow>*f**</>、暴击提高<Yellow>*d</>、技能增强提高<Yellow>*d</>。"] = "Each stack grants movement speed increase <Yellow>*f**</>, crit rate increased <Yellow>*d</>, and skill enhancement increased <Yellow>*d</>.",
    ["每层足迹增加自身暴击"] = "Each stack of Footprints increases your own critical hit rate.",
    ["每层足迹增加自身暴击, 足迹再现变更为脱手释放。"] = "Each layer of Footprints increases your Critical Hit; Footprint Reappearance is changed to cast without being held.",
    ["每层造成*f**减速效果，层数越高减速效果越强"] = "Each stack causes a *f** Slow effect; the higher the stacks, the stronger the Slow",
    ["每层降低生命值上限<Red>*f**</>。"] = "Each stack lowers max health by <Red>*f**</>.",
    ["每届俱乐部乱斗结束当日结算积分，邮件发放奖励"] = "Points are settled on the day each Club Brawl ends, and rewards are distributed via mail",
    ["每年五月，种满苹果树的庄园都花香四溢。"] = "Every May, the manor filled with apple trees is full of fragrance.",
    ["每年的今天 我们都要一起过生日"] = "Every year on this day, we will celebrate our birthdays together.",
    ["每年的今天 我们都要一起过生日 "] = "Every year on this day, we will celebrate our birthdays together.",
    ["每年都要举行仪式，用活人献祭，分享他的血液和肉块……"] = "Every year, they held a ritual, sacrificing living people and sharing their blood and flesh...",
    ["每当你进入新楼层时，获得额外10%的伤害和治疗效果，最大生命值降低5%。"] = "Whenever you enter a new floor, gain an additional 10% damage and healing effect, with maximum Health reduced by 5%.",
    ["每当你进入新楼层时，获得额外12%的伤害和治疗效果，最大生命值降低5%。"] = "Every time you enter a new floor, gain an additional 12% damage and healing effect, Max Health decreased by 5%.",
    ["每当口风琴声响起，仿佛艾登就在我的身边……"] = "Whenever the harmonica music plays, it feels as if Aiden is right by my side...",
    ["每当太阳在西方下沉，露珠……"] = "Whenever the sun sets in the west, the dew...",
    ["每当我弹起这首普通的歌曲。"] = "Whenever I play this ordinary song.",
    ["每当目标因死灵印记额外承受伤害时，施法者回复一次生命值。"] = "Whenever the target takes additional damage from Necrotic Mark, the caster recovers Health once.",
    ["每当遇到不懂的非凡知识，或者危险的情况，我都会写信向他请教或是求助。"] = "Whenever I encounter Beyonder knowledge I don't understand or dangerous situations, I write to him for advice or help.",
    ["每日"] = "Daily",
    ["每日12:00-24:00开放"] = "Open Daily 12:00-24:00",
    ["每日6人本在哪"] = "Where is the daily 6-player dungeon?",
    ["每日8点刷新"] = "Refreshes daily at 8:00",
    ["每日事件"] = "Daily Event",
    ["每日任务"] = "Daily Quest",
    ["每日副本怎么打"] = "How to clear daily dungeons",
    ["每日占卜奖励"] = "Daily Divination Reward",
    ["每日可以通过卢卡领取任务，领取后随机刷新当日的俱乐部求助任务。"] = "You can collect quests from Luca daily. After collecting, the daily Club assistance quest will be randomly refreshed.",
    ["每日启示"] = "Daily Revelation",
    ["每日奖励"] = "Daily Rewards",
    ["每日委托"] = "Daily commission",
    ["每日安排：7点起床，8点到达愚者教堂做祈祷，8点15到8点45早餐，12点到3点午餐及锻炼。\n周一上午代数学，下午高等几何；周二上午物理学，下午机械科学；周三导师会谈，周四周五实践课程。周六周日休息。\n\n\n啊啊啊上学真的好累，但我要好好努力，以后争取到贝克兰德生活！"] = "Daily Schedule: Wake up at 7, arrive at Fool Church for prayer at 8, breakfast from 8:15 to 8:45, lunch and exercise from 12 to 3. \n Monday morning Algebra, afternoon Advanced Geometry; Tuesday morning Physics, afternoon Mechanical Science; Wednesday mentor meeting, Thursday and Friday practical courses. Saturday and Sunday rest. \n\n\n Ahhh, school is really tiring, but I must work hard and strive to live in Backlund in the future!",
    ["每日开放"] = "Open Daily",
    ["每日开放： 19:00-20:00\n额外时段：周六、周日14:00-15:00。"] = "Daily open: 19:00-20:00 \n Extra periods: Sat, Sun 14:00-15:00.",
    ["每日开放： 19:00-21:00\n额外时段：周六、周日14:00-16:00"] = "Daily: 19:00-21:00 \n Extra: Sat, Sun 14:00-16:00",
    ["每日开放：19:00-20:00；额外时段：周六、周日14:00-15:00。"] = "Daily: 19:00-20:00; Extra hours: Saturday, Sunday 14:00-15:00.",
    ["每日恢复经销许可证"] = "Daily Restore Distribution License",
    ["每日手动刷新次数达到上限。"] = "Daily manual refresh limit reached.",
    ["每日新闻"] = "Daily News",
    ["每日新闻说明"] = "Daily News Explanation",
    ["每日早上%s点刷新"] = "Refreshes daily at %s:00",
    ["每日礼包"] = "Daily Gift Pack",
    ["每日踢人上限"] = "Daily kick limit",
    ["每日运势"] = "Daily Fortune",
    ["每日首次免费"] = "First time free daily",
    ["每日，俱乐部的管理员塞巴斯蒂安都会发布四份奉献清单，每份清单均可获得奖励；若在当天完成全部清单，还能获得额外的赠礼。"] = "Every day, the club administrator Sebastian releases four contribution lists, each offering rewards upon completion. Completing all lists on the same day grants an additional gift.",
    ["每晚。我就像个思春的少女。"] = "Every night. I'm like a young girl in love.",
    ["每晚晚宴时刻，都有现场管弦乐队演奏，让您的旅程充满优雅情调。"] = "Every evening at dinner time, there is a live orchestra performance to fill your journey with an elegant atmosphere.",
    ["每晚都在？"] = "Every night?",
    ["每月1号早上%s点刷新"] = "Refreshes on the 1st of every month at %s:00",
    ["每月1日8点刷新"] = "Refreshes on the 1st of every month at 8:00",
    ["每月月底开放"] = "Opens at the End of Each Month",
    ["每月来一次，我都快成你们这儿的常客了。"] = "Coming here once a month, I've almost become a regular of yours.",
    ["每月验证可获得"] = "Obtain upon monthly verification",
    ["每有1名携带”流血“的角色死亡，异化猎犬造成的伤害提高30%，可叠加"] = "For every character carrying \"Bleed\" that dies, the Alienated Hound's damage increases by 30%, stackable",
    ["每有<HighLight>1</>名敌方棋子阵亡，【生命教派】棋子永久获得<HighLight>12</>点最大生命。"] = "For every <HighLight>1</> enemy piece that falls, [Life Sect] pieces permanently gain <HighLight>12</> maximum Health.",
    ["每有<HighLight>1</>名敌方棋子阵亡，【生命教派】棋子永久获得<HighLight>4</>点最大生命。"] = "For every <HighLight>1</> enemy piece that falls, [Life Sect] pieces permanently gain <HighLight>4</> maximum Health.",
    ["每有<HighLight>1</>名敌方棋子阵亡，【生命教派】棋子永久获得<HighLight>8</>点最大生命。"] = "For every <HighLight>1</> enemy piece that falls, [Life Sect] pieces permanently gain <HighLight>8</> maximum Health.",
    ["每有<HighLight>1</>名敌方棋子阵亡，亚巴顿获得<HighLight>3%</>攻击和<HighLight>3%</>攻速，最多叠加<HighLight>5</>层。"] = "For every <HighLight>1</> enemy piece that falls, Abaddon gains <HighLight>3%</> Attack and <HighLight>3%</> Attack Speed, stacking up to <HighLight>5</> times.",
    ["每条分线的BOSS伤害积分统计中，队伍伤害积分排名前三的参战队伍成员都会同等获得一份的奖励。\n每名参战的玩家不论个人伤害积分排名，都可以获得个人参与奖励。"] = "In the BOSS damage point statistics for each branch, members of the top three teams will each receive an equal share of the reward. \n Every participating player, regardless of individual damage ranking, can receive an individual participation reward.",
    ["每条途径均有序列9到序列0共10个序列。同一途径正常情况下只能有一位序列0或三位序列1，不同途径的序列2在数量上有所不同，如：当序列1满额时，序列2只能有六位。"] = "Each pathway has 10 sequences, from Sequence 9 to Sequence 0. Under normal circumstances, there can only be one Sequence 0 or three Sequence 1s in the same pathway. The number of Sequence 2s varies by pathway; for example, when the quota for Sequence 1 is full, there can only be six Sequence 2s.",
    ["每条途径都从序列9开始 分为不同序列 数字越小 序列越高"] = "Each pathway starts from Sequence 9 and is divided into different sequences. The smaller the number, the higher the sequence.",
    ["每条面包的重量在0.5磅左右，不过也会有一些不可避免的误差，你可以按需购买。"] = "Each loaf of bread weighs about 0.5 pounds, but there will be some unavoidable errors, so you can buy as needed.",
    ["每根丝上都粘着一个被遗忘的记忆。"] = "Every thread is stuck with a forgotten memory.",
    ["每次优先拉取下列未拥有的任一奖励"] = "Prioritize pulling any unowned reward below",
    ["每次优先拉取下列未拥有的任一奖励，且额外大奖励进度+1"] = "Prioritize pulling any unowned reward below, and Extra Grand Reward Progress +1",
    ["每次参与击杀使携带者的攻击和防御提升<HighLight>10</>，最多叠加<HighLight>5</>层。"] = "Each participation in a kill increases the wearer's Attack and Defense by <HighLight>10</>, stacking up to <HighLight>5</> times.",
    ["每次受到伤害前获得持续8秒的<HighLight>护盾</>效果和持续4秒的50%加速效果，该效果冷却时长20秒。"] = "Before taking damage, gain a <HighLight>Shield</> effect lasting 8 seconds and a 50% acceleration effect lasting 4 seconds. This effect has a 20-second cooldown.",
    ["每次弹射的伤害衰减系数"] = "Damage Decay Coefficient per Bounce",
    ["每次改装会增加<Highlight>改装值</>，当<Highlight>改装值</>累积到一定数量时，会解锁新的部位。"] = "Each modification increases the <Highlight>Modification Value</>. When the <Highlight>Modification Value</> accumulates to a certain amount, new parts will be unlocked.",
    ["每次攻击叠加 <HighLight>15%</> 攻速；"] = "Stack <HighLight>15%</> Attack Speed with each attack.",
    ["每次攻击叠加 <HighLight>8%</> 攻速；"] = "Stack <HighLight>8%</> Attack Speed with each attack.",
    ["每次攻击增加5%攻击力"] = "Each attack increases Attack by 5%",
    ["每次普攻+10%攻速 上限10层"] = "+10% Attack Speed per Basic Attack, max 10 stacks",
    ["每次普攻+7%攻速 上限10层"] = "+7% Attack Speed per Basic Attack, max 10 stacks",
    ["每次普攻立即恢复5法力"] = "Recover 5 Mana immediately per Basic Attack",
    ["每次普攻获得<HighLight>10%</>攻速，最多叠加<HighLight>10</>次。"] = "Each basic attack grants <HighLight>10%</> Attack Speed, stacking up to <HighLight>10</> times.",
    ["每次普攻获得<HighLight>7%</>攻速，最多叠加<HighLight>10</>次。"] = "Each basic attack grants <HighLight>7%</> Attack Speed, stacking up to <HighLight>10</> times.",
    ["每次暴击可让随机一个正在冷却的技能cd缩短2s，如果这次暴击击杀了敌人，则额外缩短1秒"] = "Each critical hit reduces the Cooldown of a random skill currently on Cooldown by 2s; if this critical hit kills an enemy, reduce it by an additional 1 second.",
    ["每次暴击可让随机一个正在冷却的技能缩短2秒冷却时间，如果这次暴击击杀了敌人，则额外缩短1秒。"] = "Each critical hit reduces the cooldown of a random skill currently on cooldown by 2 seconds. If this critical hit kills an enemy, reduce it by an additional 1 second.",
    ["每次暴击时叠加1层巨人怒火，15层时巨人登场造成大范围伤害并清空层数"] = "Each critical hit adds 1 stack of Giant's Fury; at 15 stacks, a Giant appears, dealing large-area damage and clearing the stacks.",
    ["每次暴击时叠加1层巨人怒火，15层时巨人登场造成大范围伤害并清空层数。"] = "Each critical hit stacks 1 layer of Giant's Fury. At 15 stacks, the Giant appears, dealing wide-area damage and clearing the stacks.",
    ["每次来到这儿，总让人想起当年跑酷时候的自己……"] = "Every time I come here, it reminds me of myself back when I was doing parkour...",
    ["每次来，他都要摘几朵。"] = "Whenever he came, he would pick a few.",
    ["每次气息重置时，根据气息的不同品质会提高下次气息调整时的幸运值，幸运值会在每次生成气息时有概率将低品质气息直接升阶成为高品质气息；由幸运祝福生成的气息品质最低为紫色品质"] = "Each time an aura is reset, the luck value for the next aura adjustment increases based on the quality of the aura. Luck value provides a probability to directly upgrade low-quality auras to high-quality auras each time an aura is generated. The minimum quality for auras generated by luck blessings is purple.",
    ["每次看到像您这样的人出现，我都觉得……嗯，这里还没那么糟。我也想成为这样的人。"] = "Every time I see someone like you appear, I feel... well, this place isn't that bad yet. I want to be someone like that too.",
    ["每次绝对50%HP"] = "Absolute 50%HP each time",
    ["每次跃斩都需要<Highlight>至少4人聚集</>抵御分摊伤害，且分摊第1次伤害的玩家短期内<Highlight>不能参与第2次分摊</>。"] = "Each Leaping Slash requires <Highlight>at least 4 people to gather</> to share the damage. Furthermore, players who share the first instance of damage <Highlight>cannot participate in the second sharing instance</> in the short term.",
    ["每次送货时，他都喜欢大声地喊——这是“老师”让我送来的！"] = "Every time he delivered goods, he liked to shout loudly—this was sent by my \"teacher\"!",
    ["每次途径转换需要间隔<Highlight>30天</>；"] = "Each pathway conversion requires an interval of <Highlight>30 days</>;",
    ["每次释放技能都会增加技能攻击速度7%，最多叠加5层。"] = "Each time a skill is cast, skill attack speed increases by 7%, stacking up to 5 times.",
    ["每次释放普通攻击有<HighLight>5%</>几率、释放战斗技能有<HighLight>15%</>几率向自身面向方向发射知识漩涡，对路径上的敌方造成*d点魔法伤害，并对其造成持续*f秒的mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。\n释放普攻或技能后如果没有触发知识漩涡，则概率累计。"] = "Each Basic Attack has a 5% <HighLight></> chance, and each combat skill has a 15% <HighLight></> chance to fire a Vortex of Knowledge in the direction you are facing, dealing *d magic damage to enemies along the path and applying Healing Reduction <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\"></> for *f seconds calculated as mul(*d**,*d). \n If a Vortex of Knowledge is not triggered after a Basic Attack or skill, the probability accumulates.",
    ["每死亡一个化身，Boss获得一层buff"] = "Boss gains one stack of buff for every avatar that dies",
    ["每死承伤值"] = "Damage Taken Per Death",
    ["每段旅途，皆有终点。"] = "Every journey has an end.",
    ["每消耗1层足迹，获得1层旅者铭刻，强化普攻对生命值高于50%的目标造成100%额外伤害。"] = "Gain 1 stack of Traveler's Inscription for each Footprint consumed; Basic Attacks deal 100% additional damage to targets with Health above 50%.",
    ["每消耗1层足迹，获得1层漫游者铭刻，强化普攻对生命值高于50%的目标造成100%额外伤害"] = "Each stack of Footprints consumed grants 1 stack of Wanderer Inscription; Basic Attack deals 100% extra damage to targets with Health above 50%.",
    ["每消耗一个印记，回复自身最大生命值的2.5%"] = "Each mark consumed restores 2.5% of your Max Health.",
    ["每清洗一次，Boss获得一层buff"] = "Boss gains one stack of buff for every cleansing",
    ["每激活1个不同羁绊，你的弈子们获得1.5%攻击和0.75%伤害增幅，最多按20个羁绊计算。"] = "For each different bond activated, your pieces gain 1.5% Attack and 0.75% Damage Increase, calculated up to 20 bonds.",
    ["每点<HighLight>星空能量</>使自身增伤提高<HighLight>1.5%</>（施放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">层叠之门</>后2秒内仍维持效果）。"] = "Each point of <HighLight>Star Sand</> energy increases your damage boost by <HighLight>1.5%</> (the effect is maintained for 2 seconds after casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Layered Gate</>).",
    ["每点<HighLight>星空能量</>使自身获得<HighLight>1.5%伤害加深</>（施放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">层叠之门</>后2秒内仍维持效果）。"] = "Each point of <HighLight>Starry Sky Energy</> grants <HighLight>1.5% damage amplification</> (effect maintained for 2 seconds after casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Layered Gate</>).",
    ["每生成一个真理之眼，会使岁月的棋局的冷却时间降低3秒。"] = "Each Eye of Truth generated reduces the Cooldown of Gambit of the Ages by 3 seconds.",
    ["每磅旧书旧报纸只卖6便士！"] = "Every pound of old books and newspapers for only 6 pence!",
    ["每磅面包又涨了四分之一便士……"] = "The price of bread per pound has gone up by another quarter of a penny…",
