    ["每秒线性处理特效溶解值，需要特效资产开放Dissolve用户参数"] = "Process the effect dissolve value linearly per second; requires the effect asset to expose the Dissolve user parameter.",
    ["每秒获得1点能量，持续5秒"] = "Gain 1 Energy per second for 5 seconds.",
    ["每秒获得2%攻击，10层后获得12%伤害增幅。"] = "Gain 2% Attack per second, gain 12% Damage Boost after 10 stacks.",
    ["每秒进入大世界的人数"] = "Number of people entering the big world per second",
    ["每站结束时，我们都可以使用策略卡来提升收益"] = "At the end of each station, we can use strategy cards to increase revenue.",
    ["每等级对应锁血百分比"] = "HP lock percentage corresponding to each level",
    ["每类药剂一周限试用10次"] = "Each type of potion is limited to 10 trials per week",
    ["每贡献1组材料可获得奖励。"] = "You can receive rewards for every set of materials contributed.",
    ["每贡献一组材料可获得奖励。"] = "You can receive rewards for each set of materials contributed.",
    ["每进入一个区域，每个策略卡槽位增加1->2刷新次数"] = "Each time you enter a region, each strategy card slot gains 1->2 refreshes",
    ["每进入一个区域，每个策略卡槽位增加2->3刷新次数"] = "Each time you enter a region, each strategy card slot gains 2->3 refreshes",
    ["每进入一个区域，每个策略卡槽位增加3刷新次数"] = "Each time you enter a region, each strategy card slot gains 3 refreshes",
    ["每通关下列任一关卡，基础额外奖励进度+1"] = "For each of the following levels cleared, the base additional reward progress +1",
    ["每通满月，我会听到呓语。不是幻听，是直接在我脑子里响起的声音，说着听不懂的语言……伴随着疯狂和失控的边缘。"] = "Every full moon, I hear whispers. It's not an auditory hallucination; it's a voice ringing directly in my mind, speaking a language I don't understand... accompanied by madness and the edge of losing control.",
    ["每逢满月，我会听到呓语。不是幻听，是直接在我脑子里响起的声音，说着听不懂的语言……伴随着疯狂和失控的边缘。"] = "Every full moon, I hear whispers. Not auditory hallucinations, but voices ringing directly in my brain, speaking a language I don't understand... accompanied by the edge of madness and loss of control.",
    ["每间隔一段时间，先祖铠甲会召唤出数柄“污秽长枪”，持续对周围造成伤害，需要分出人手清理长枪。"] = "At fixed intervals, the Ancestor Armor will summon several \"Filthy Spears\" that continuously deal damage to the surrounding area; players must be assigned to clear these spears.",
    ["每隔1秒受到1次灼烧伤害。"] = "Take Burn damage once every 1 second.",
    ["每隔20秒，你的双脚会短暂显现“太阳”途径的灼热特性，经过的地表会留下短期的圆形烈阳地带，持续10秒"] = "Every 20 seconds, your feet will briefly manifest the scorching characteristics of the \"Blazing Sun\" pathway, leaving short-term circular Blazing Sun zones on the ground for 10 seconds.",
    ["每隔45秒获得灵性预警，可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "Gain Spirituality Warning every 45 seconds, which can dispel one control effect. After triggering, movement speed increases by 25% for 2 seconds.",
    ["每隔一段时间对范围内的敌人造成一次魔法伤害"] = "Deals magic damage to enemies within range at regular intervals.",
    ["每隔一段时间，场上的固定位置会生成两个“双生果核”。两个果核彼此气息相连，需要在其自爆前连续击破。若两次击破的时间间隔超过3秒，则尚未被击破的果核会立即自爆，并对全场造成致命伤害。"] = "At fixed intervals, two \"Twin Fruit Cores\" will spawn at fixed locations on the field. The two cores are linked by their aura and must be destroyed consecutively before they self-destruct. If the interval between the two destructions exceeds 3 seconds, the remaining core will immediately self-destruct, dealing lethal damage to the entire field.",
    ["每项戏法必须事先演练，熟练至臻。"] = "Every trick must be practiced in advance until it is perfected.",
