    ["毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "Poison ivy entwines silence, deadly elegance hidden in the dark green depths.",
    ["毒藤缠绕着沉默，至美存于更加致命之处。"] = "Poison ivy entwines silence, and ultimate beauty exists in the most fatal places.",
    ["毒蘑菇圈"] = "Poison Mushroom Circle",
    ["毒蘑菇标记buff-AI里搜寻单位并删除"] = "Poison mushroom mark buff - search for units in AI and delete",
    ["毒蛇缠绕之心，似乎是某种秘仪的仪式用品。"] = "Heart of the entwined viper, seems to be some kind of ritual item for a secret ceremony.",
    ["毒雾喷发"] = "Poison Mist Eruption",
