    ["比"] = "Compare",
    ["比丽斯"] = "Billis",
    ["比丽斯夫人在餐厅告诉过我，在这里有钱不算什么，有品位才是重要的。"] = "Lady Billis told me at the restaurant that having money doesn't count for much here; having taste is what's important.",
    ["比亚"] = "Bia",
    ["比你挖空脑袋想不出一句新诗好多了！我在说正经的！"] = "It's much better than you racking your brains and not being able to come up with a new poem! I'm talking seriously!",
    ["比利"] = "Billy",
    ["比利➡️托马斯Trigger"] = "Billy ➡️ Thomas Trigger",
    ["比利➡️艾玛Trigger"] = "Billy ➡️ Emma Trigger",
    ["比利安全区Trigger"] = "Billy Safe Zone Trigger",
    ["比利尔斯"] = "Billiers",
    ["比利推开了障碍物……"] = "Billy pushed the obstacle away...",
    ["比利的轮椅"] = "Billy's wheelchair",
    ["比利，还好你没事。你知道……"] = "Billy, I'm glad you're okay. You know...",
    ["比印刷成本还低的内部资料居然是真的......"] = "To think that internal documents cheaper than printing costs are actually real...",
    ["比奇·蒙巴顿"] = "Beach Mountbatten",
    ["比如……深夜会自己转动的雕像？或者继承了远方的神秘遗产？我新书正好缺个灵感。"] = "For example... statues that move by themselves at midnight? Or inheriting a mysterious legacy from afar? My new book just happens to be missing some inspiration.",
    ["比如一个书柜，一个邮筒，一个垃圾桶……"] = "Like a bookcase, a mailbox, a trash can...",
    ["比如什么呢？捡垃圾比赛？还是谁能在工厂里干更多的活？"] = "Like what? A trash-picking competition? Or who can do more work in the factory?",
    ["比如他突然半夜出去跑步锻炼，比如他放弃了准备很久的廷根大学讲师面试，找了份收入不错的工作……他应该是想让我们过得更好些吧。"] = "For example, he would suddenly go out for a run in the middle of the night, or he gave up the Tingen University lecturer interview he had prepared for a long time to find a well-paying job... He must have wanted us to live better.",
    ["比如伦纳德，一个不像诗人的午夜诗人，他作诗的水平比邓恩还糟糕，让人很担心他要怎么从午夜诗人晋升。"] = "For example, Leonard, a Midnight Poet who doesn't act like a poet. His poetry skills are even worse than Dunn's, which makes one worry about how he will advance from Midnight Poet.",
    ["比如农夫暴毙，凶手是一只鸭子。"] = "For example, a farmer died suddenly, and the murderer was a duck.",
    ["比如呢？"] = "For example?",
    ["比如品尝美味的豌豆炖羔羊肉。"] = "Such as tasting delicious lamb stew with peas.",
    ["比如安装煤气灯那次……我先说服房东出钱改造管道，说这样能提高房屋档次，提高租金。"] = "For example, the time we installed gas lamps... I first convinced the landlord to pay for the pipe renovation, saying it would increase the house's grade and raise the rent.",
    ["比如建议廷根工程委员会在排污口装黄铜滤网，为了拦截淑女们丢失的珍珠耳环。"] = "For example, suggesting that the Tingen Engineering Committee install brass filters at the sewage outlets to intercept the pearl earrings lost by ladies.",
    ["比如弗兰克精品蘑菇研究小组，巨龙和巨人研究小组……兴趣自由，选择自由！"] = "For example, Frank's Boutique Mushroom Research Group, the Giant Dragon and Giant Research Group... freedom of interest, freedom of choice!",
    ["比如我手上的这些，就需要更加详细的历史记载和解读来推断具体内容。"] = "For example, these in my hand require more detailed historical records and interpretation to infer their specific content.",
    ["比如按照蓄力时长，动态计算攻击盒大小"] = "For example, dynamically calculating attack box size based on charge duration.",
    ["比如推波、震荡波、海浪、扫射激光等"] = "Such as Push Wave, Shockwave, Sea Wave, strafing laser, etc.",
    ["比如海纳斯·凡森特先生，当年找他占卜的人得从廷根排到贝克兰德！"] = "For example, Mr. Haines Vincent; back then, the people lining up to ask him for a divination could stretch from Tingen to Backlund!",
    ["比如灵视，各种形式的占卜，灵性之跃，灵性之墙……"] = "For example, Spirit Vision, various forms of divination, Leap of Spirituality, Wall of Spirituality...",
    ["比如现在，你想聊聊去世的莎莉丝特小姐吗？"] = "For example, right now, would you like to talk about the late Miss Celeste?",
    ["比如该拧希罗多德的左耳朵，还是右耳朵？"] = "For example, whether I should twist Herodotus's left ear or his right ear?",
    ["比如说，解读出命运的轨迹，一字不漏的告诉来占卜的客人？可我感觉占卜命运这种事情，本就玄之又玄。"] = "For instance, interpreting the trajectory of fate and telling the client exactly what you see? But I feel that divining fate is inherently mysterious and profound.",
    ["比如这个。"] = "Like this one.",
    ["比如这样，“窗外盛开的紫藤，像一串串风干的葡萄，半夜值班想起时，总觉得很饿。”"] = "For example, like this: 'The wisteria blooming outside the window, like clusters of dried grapes; when I think of it while on duty at midnight, I always feel very hungry.'",
    ["比如那种会让接触者产生幻觉的蘑菇，我只是想用它来治疗失眠！"] = "For example, that kind of mushroom that causes hallucinations in those who touch it—I just wanted to use it to treat insomnia!",
    ["比如那种能让伤口快速愈合的蘑菇，还有能净化水源的海藻——这些都是有用的东西！"] = "For example, that kind of mushroom that makes wounds heal quickly, and the seaweed that can purify water—these are all useful things!",
    ["比如陪在奥黛丽身边，比如守护她珍视的一切，比如在这个世界里，保持一颗简单的心。"] = "For example, staying by Audrey's side, guarding everything she cherishes, and keeping a simple heart in this world.",
    ["比如，“离开对未来生活的憧憬，公民将与咸鱼无异”，“人不读书和咸鱼有什么区别”。"] = "For example, \"Without a longing for a future life, a citizen is no different from a salted fish,\" and \"What is the difference between a person who doesn't read and a salted fish?\"",
    ["比如，你现在看不到苏茜，但她确实趴在你的脚边享受午睡时光。"] = "For example, you can't see Susie right now, but she is indeed lying at your feet enjoying her nap.",
    ["比如，将人强行拉入梦境，看透对方的内心。"] = "For example, forcibly pulling people into a dream and seeing through their inner hearts.",
