    ["比弗利"] = "Beverly",
    ["比弗萨克人还高！第一次见到那群新白银城的人，渔民们惊得差点吞下鲨鱼！"] = "Taller than the Feysacians! The first time the fishermen saw that group of people from New Silver City, they were so shocked they almost swallowed a shark!",
