    ["比起不学，总是学了些的，不是吗？"] = "Compared to not learning, at least you learned something, didn't you?",
    ["比起工厂区、铁十字街那些葬身大海的水手，我们已经算幸运的了。"] = "Compared to the sailors in the Factory District and Iron Cross Street who were buried at sea, we are already considered lucky.",
    ["比起您那15%的月息，恐怕我更愿意相信银行。"] = "Compared to your 15% monthly interest, I'm afraid I'd rather trust the bank.",
    ["比起满足要求，她更需要能理解她的人陪在身边。"] = "Rather than meeting requirements, she needs someone who understands her to be by her side.",
    ["比起自己生前的姿态，艾拉更想念你的笑容，里埃尔先生。"] = "Compared to how you looked when you were alive, Ella misses your smile more, Mr. Riel.",
    ["比起赎身，再招一个水手好像更划算……"] = "Compared to redeeming him, it seems more cost-effective to hire another sailor...",
