    ["比那高级多了，她是天生的疯子，太令人羡慕了！"] = "Much higher than that, she is a natural-born madman, it's so enviable!",
    ["毕业后你想做什么？"] = "What do you want to do after graduation?",
    ["毕竟3-116是廷根值夜者前任队长卡萝·比舍普的“遗物”，由我这个曾追随她的队员去回收，是最好的选择。"] = "After all, 3-116 is the \"relic\" of the former Tingen Nighthawks captain, Carro Bishop. It is the best choice for me, a team member who once followed her, to recover it.",
    ["毕竟一条金毛犬对你摇尾巴的时候，谁能真的生气呢？"] = "After all, when a golden retriever wags its tail at you, who can really be angry?",
    ["毕竟今夜这一幕都被你瞧见了，就把命也留下来吧！"] = "Since you saw this scene tonight, you might as well leave your life here too!",
    ["毕竟你们年轻人和学生们打交道会更方便些。此外，我们还会付你一笔可观的酬劳。"] = "After all, it's easier for you young people to deal with students. Besides, we will pay you a handsome reward.",
    ["毕竟在逼仄的生活中，我们要先享受灵魂的自由。"] = "After all, in this cramped life, we must first enjoy the freedom of the soul.",
    ["毕竟她只是个普通人……我想，我能处理好的。"] = "After all, she is just an ordinary person... I think I can handle it.",
    ["毕竟已经冷透了，不是么？"] = "After all, they are already cold, aren't they?",
    ["毕竟我是个已经死去的人。"] = "After all, I am a person who has already died.",
    ["毕竟我是她妈妈，阁下。"] = "After all, I am her mother, Your Excellency.",
    ["毕竟晋升不是小事，非凡道路上总是与疯狂相伴，我担心你一个人会应付不来。"] = "After all, advancement is no small matter; the Beyonder path is always accompanied by madness, and I am worried you won't be able to handle it alone.",
    ["毕竟查尼斯门后面什么都有……"] = "After all, there is everything behind the Chanis Gate...",
    ["毕竟现在可还是夏天，穿这种衣服出门，没走几步可能就要中暑倒下了。"] = "After all, it's still summer. If you go out wearing clothes like this, you might collapse from heatstroke before you've even walked a few steps.",
    ["毕竟这是我们廷根值夜者的重点关注区域。"] = "After all, this is a key area of concern for our Tingen Nighthawks.",
    ["毕竟，失控的仪式在现实中可能造成难以预料的后果。"] = "After all, a ritual that leads to a loss of control could have unpredictable consequences in reality.",
    ["毕竟，对历史系来说，亲身经历者的访谈并不多见……呵呵，一个玩笑。"] = "After all, for the history department, interviews with someone who experienced it firsthand are not common... Haha, a joke.",
    ["毕竟，我们的未来取决于图书馆、阅读和白日梦。"] = "After all, our future depends on libraries, reading, and daydreaming.",
    ["毕竟，我只是一条狗。而这，恰恰是我最擅长的事。"] = "After all, I am just a dog. And this is exactly what I am best at.",
    ["毕竟，知识是多么美好的事物！"] = "After all, knowledge is such a wonderful thing!",
    ["毕竟，那可是充满机会的地方！"] = "After all, that is a place full of opportunities!",
    ["毕竟，黑荆棘不止一次守护过廷根。"] = "After all, the Nighthawks have guarded Tingen more than once.",
    ["毕节"] = "Bijie",
    ["毛发乌黑的夏尔马。鲁恩王国最常见的役用马匹，它稳重、可靠，负载能力极强，无论出行货运皆为优选。"] = "A black-haired Shire horse. The most common draft horse in the Loen Kingdom. It is steady, reliable, and has an extremely high load capacity, making it an excellent choice for both travel and cargo.",
    ["毛发同色"] = "Same Hair Color",
    ["毛发尾部"] = "Hair Tip",
    ["毛发栗金的夏尔马。鲁恩王国最常见的役用马匹，它稳重、可靠，负载能力极强，无论出行货运皆为优选。"] = "Chestnut-gold Shire horse. The most common draft horse in the Loen Kingdom. It is steady, reliable, and has a very strong load-bearing capacity, making it the best choice for both travel and freight.",
    ["毛发根部"] = "Hair Root",
    ["毛发纯白的夏尔马。鲁恩王国最常见的役用马匹，它稳重、可靠，负载能力极强，无论出行货运皆为优选。"] = "Pure white Shire horse. The most common draft horse in the Loen Kingdom. It is steady, reliable, and has extremely strong load-bearing capacity, making it the best choice for both travel and freight.",
    ["毛地黄精油"] = "Foxglove Essential Oil",
    ["毛毛草"] = "Fuzzy Grass",
    ["毛湿哒哒的，真恶心，呕。"] = "The fur is all wet and soggy, it's disgusting, ugh.",
    ["毛球，我可怜的毛球……"] = "Furball, my poor Furball...",
    ["毛绒"] = "Fluff",
    ["毛绒填充得鼓鼓的小熊，是儿童房永远不会被嫌弃的那位老朋友。"] = "A teddy bear stuffed plump with plush, the old friend in the children's room who will never be disliked.",
    ["毛绒真谛"] = "The Essence of Fluffiness",
    ["毛绒真谛——获取猫猫拳理论"] = "The Truth of Fluff - Acquiring the Cat-Punch Theory",
    ["毛绒绒的不对称兔耳，随着行动轻轻晃动。"] = "Fluffy asymmetrical rabbit ears that sway gently with movement.",
    ["毛绒绒的兔耳装饰，带来与众不同的灵动与可爱。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定苏勒×10000。"] = "Fluffy rabbit ear decoration, bringing a unique agility and cuteness. \n Duplicate acquisition will be automatically decomposed into Bound Soule x10000.",
    ["毛绒绒的对称兔耳，当然也可以随着行动轻轻晃动。"] = "Fluffy symmetrical rabbit ears, which can also sway gently with movement.",
    ["毛绒绒的猫耳装饰，带来令人卸下心防的活泼与俏皮。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定苏勒×10000。"] = "Fluffy Cat ear decorations, bringing a liveliness and playfulness that makes one let down their guard. \nRepeated acquisition will automatically decompose into Bound Sol ×10000.",
