    ["气冲冲的观众-椅子"] = "Furious Spectator - Chair",
    ["气势磅礴的"] = "Magnificent",
    ["气味、颜色、形状……关于这颗蛋的一切，我已明了！"] = "The smell, the color, the shape... I have figured out everything about this egg!",
    ["气味从东边传来……过去看看！"] = "The smell is coming from the east... let's go check it out!",
    ["气味变浓了……她就在北边不远处！"] = "The smell is getting stronger... she is not far to the north!",
    ["气场呈现暗色，陌生的{{先生|女士}}，你因为什么而悲伤？"] = "Your aura appears dark, strange {{Mr.|Ms.}}, what are you sad about?",
    ["气息共鸣会为封印物增加额外的共鸣值，气息等级越高提供的共鸣值也越多，但当最高等级气息超过最低气息等级时会出现气息紊乱，使高等级气息强化时的共鸣度逐渐降低；当最低气息等级提升时，气息紊乱带来的衰减也会变弱，直到气息强度差低于5级时，停止紊乱"] = "Aura resonance adds extra resonance value to Sealed Artifacts. Higher aura levels provide more resonance value, but when the highest-level aura exceeds the lowest-level aura, aura instability occurs, causing the resonance gained from high-level aura strengthening to gradually decrease. As the lowest aura level increases, the decay caused by aura instability weakens until the difference in aura strength is less than 5, at which point the instability stops.",
    ["气息共鸣时提高最弱气息等级时，会减少气息紊乱带来的衰减效果，此效果对所有受到衰减的气息都有效，本次强化将会额外提供共鸣值"] = "Increasing the lowest aura level during aura resonance reduces the decay caused by aura instability. This effect applies to all auras suffering from decay, and this strengthening will provide additional resonance value.",
    ["气息加成"] = "Aura Bonus",
    ["气息即将消散，您忠诚的谦卑的阿罗德斯等待着再次为您效劳。（挥手简笔画）"] = "The aura is about to dissipate. Your loyal and humble Arrodes awaits to serve you again. (Stick figure waving)",
    ["气息强度回溯"] = "Retrace Aura Intensity",
    ["气息调整时会提供不同类型的属性气息，相同品质下领域类气息会强于基础属性类气息。气息基础共鸣度越高时，在受到共鸣影响时也会获得更多的共鸣度加成"] = "Aura adjustment provides different types of attribute auras. At the same quality, domain-type auras are stronger than basic attribute-type auras. Higher base resonance of an aura results in more resonance value bonuses when affected by resonance.",
    ["气息调整确认"] = "Confirm Aura Adjustment",
