    ["水阀纹丝不动。你抬头看了一眼旁边的告示板，上面嫣然写着：“秩序之渠，城内不可漫水。唯有混乱之物扰动秩序之网时，方可运作。”"] = "The water valve won't budge. You look up at the notice board next to it, which clearly states: 'Canal of Order, no flooding allowed within the city. It shall only operate when an object of chaos disturbs the Web of Order.'",
