    ["永不沉没之船？哼！"] = "The unsinkable ship? Hmph!",
    ["永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "The never-flowing dusk lingers on the pauldrons; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there remains the will to awaken the dawn.",
    ["永不流动的黄昏凝结于发梢，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "The never-flowing sunset condenses on the tips of the hair; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["永不缺少酒精和欢呼，秘密的地下市场赋予这间酒吧特殊地位。"] = "There is never a shortage of alcohol and cheers; the secret underground market gives this bar a special status.",
    ["永不谢幕"] = "Never Curtain Call",
    ["永不过时的选择！最纯粹的武器，以理服人的绝佳方式！您对哪件钝器感兴趣？"] = "A timeless choice! The purest weapon, an excellent way to convince people with reason! Which blunt weapon are you interested in?",
    ["永不遗失的神奇物品"] = "A mystical item that is never lost",
