    ["永恒月华·占卜家套装（永久）"] = "Eternal Moon: Seer Set (Permanent)",
    ["永恒烈阳"] = "Eternal Blazing Sun",
    ["永恒烈阳教会的标志性礼器之一，以特殊工艺将少量太阳途径的神圣灵性封存于镀金徽章之中。哪怕身处黑暗，但从勋章传来的那一缕光辉依然真实：佩戴者周围的人会感受到无声的温暖与秩序感，使精神的动荡趋于平稳，让神志从纷乱中重新安定下来。 "] = "One of the iconic ritual vessels of the Church of the Eternal Blazing Sun, using a special process to seal a small amount of the sacred spirituality of the Sun Pathway into a gold-plated badge. Even in the darkness, the ray of light coming from the medal remains real: those around the wearer will feel a silent warmth and sense of order, making mental turmoil tend to stabilize and allowing the mind to settle again from the chaos.",
    ["永恒烈阳炙烤大地！"] = "The Eternal Blazing Sun roasts the earth!",
    ["永恒烈阳，焚尽黑暗。"] = "Eternal Blazing Sun, burn away the darkness.",
    ["永恒的……金秋……结束了……"] = "The eternal... golden autumn... has ended...",
    ["永恒的挑战"] = "Eternal Challenge",
    ["永恒的美丽还是无尽的孤独，只在你一念之间。"] = "Eternal beauty or endless loneliness, it all depends on your choice.",
