    ["永暗的蜡烛，不毁的身躯，我将进入死亡的队列。"] = "The candle of eternal darkness, the indestructible body, I will join the ranks of the dead.",
    ["永暗蜡烛"] = "Candle of Eternal Darkness",
    ["永暗蜡烛最初为阿兹克所制作，后被人利用，成为操纵村民献祭生命的工具。"] = "The Candle of Eternal Darkness was originally created by Azik, but was later exploited by others to become a tool for manipulating villagers into sacrificing their lives.",
    ["永暗蜡烛真正的——主人"] = "The true—master of the Candle of Eternal Darkness.",
    ["永暗蜡烛需要亡魂封印，保持它的死亡温度。"] = "The candle of eternal darkness requires the sealing of souls to maintain its temperature of death.",
