    ["求你了妈妈！"] = "Please, Mom!",
    ["求你帮我找找吧，就在旁边的树上！"] = "Please help me look for it, it's right on the tree next to me!",
    ["求你放过库克……带他离开海岸线餐厅，不要被其他人发现……"] = "Please let Cook go... take him away from the Coastline Restaurant, don't let others find out...",
    ["求助"] = "Help",
