    ["求助委托"] = "Request for Help",
    ["求助已被完成。"] = "Request for help has been completed.",
    ["求助斯维因"] = "Ask Swain for Help",
    ["求助者"] = "Seeker",
    ["求婚也是。有天我说结婚吧，梅格说行，就结完了。之后来花海度假，她喜欢这里的花朵，我们就住下，当了花匠。"] = "It was the same with the proposal. One day I said, 'Let's get married,' and Meg said, 'Sure,' so we just did. Later, we came to the flower field for a vacation. She liked the flowers here, so we stayed and became gardeners.",
    ["求婚？"] = "A proposal?",
    ["求婚？！你没说要求婚……不许哭！我又没有拒绝你！"] = "A proposal?! You didn't say you were going to propose... stop crying! I didn't reject you!",
    ["求您……求您……"] = "I beg you... I beg you...",
    ["求援"] = "Call for Help",
    ["求援奖励说明"] = "Assistance Reward Explanation",
    ["求救"] = "Call for Help",
    ["求救！"] = "Help!",
    ["求求你们不要再打了啦！"] = "Please, stop fighting!",
    ["求求你们了，我真的很需要这份工作！"] = "I beg you, I really need this job!",
    ["求求你，有人陷害我丈夫，他急需文件证明清白。"] = "Please, someone framed my husband, he urgently needs the document to prove his innocence.",
    ["求求你，自己跳下去，我就解脱了。"] = "Please, jump down yourself, and I will be liberated.",
    ["求求您了，千万别说出去……我分您一成，不，两成利润？要是传出去，我就全完了！ "] = "I beg you, please don't tell anyone... I'll give you ten percent, no, twenty percent of the profit? If this gets out, I'm finished!",
    ["求求您，母亲，带我离开这个痛苦之地！"] = "Please, Mother, take me away from this place of suffering!",
