    ["沟通灵体协助设下恢复法阵。在法阵中可持续恢复并获得元素抗性。"] = "Communicate with spirits to assist in setting up a recovery magic circle. Within the circle, you can continuously recover and gain elemental resistance.",
    ["沟通灵体协助设下法阵。在法阵中可持续恢复并获得少许攻击增益。借助灵体的力量可省去部分能力的吟唱环节。"] = "Communicate with spirits to assist in setting up a magic circle. Within the circle, you can continuously recover and gain a small attack boost. With the help of spirits, you can skip the chanting phase of some abilities.",
    ["沟通灵界的超凡鸟类尾羽，可作为灵性指引或沟通仪式的媒介。"] = "The tail feathers of extraordinary birds that communicate with the Spirit World, which can be used as a medium for spiritual guidance or communication rituals.",
    ["没、没什么……我先去煮一杯咖啡给队长，你找他的话可以直接去宁静室。"] = "N-nothing... I'll go make a cup of coffee for the Captain first. If you're looking for him, you can go straight to the sleep room.",
    ["没、没什么！我们在讨论……讨论天气！"] = "N-nothing! We were discussing... discussing the weather!",
    ["没、没什么！我就看看款式……"] = "N-nothing! I'm just looking at the style...",
    ["没、没关系，先买吧。一顿不吃不会饿死，但末场不看，我会遗憾而死！"] = "It, it doesn't matter, buy it first. Skipping one meal won't kill me, but if I don't see the final show, I'll die with regret!",
    ["没事"] = "It's fine",
    ["没事……谢谢你……"] = "I'm fine... thank you...",
    ["没事。那我就先走了，我们待会见。"] = "It's nothing. I'll be going now, see you later.",
    ["没事不可以和你说话吗？"] = "Can't I talk to you if there's nothing going on?",
    ["没事了"] = "It's fine now",
    ["没事了 克莱恩 先回公司"] = "It's alright, Klein. Let's head back to the company first.",
    ["没事了。"] = "Never mind.",
    ["没事了，去吧。"] = "Nothing else, go ahead.",
    ["没事了，谢谢"] = "It's fine, thank you",
    ["没事的"] = "It's okay",
    ["没事的夫人，只是许久不吃饭应当吃的慢一些……"] = "It's okay, Madam, just eat slowly since you haven't eaten for a long time...",
    ["没事的，好好休息吧。"] = "It's alright, get some good rest.",
    ["没事的，我已经祈祷兔子之神宽恕我的罪过了！"] = "It's okay, I've already prayed to the God of Rabbits to forgive my sins!",
    ["没事的，艾里克，我帮你把封面粘好，又会像新的一样了。"] = "It's okay, Eric, I'll help you glue the cover back on, it will be like new again.",
    ["没事，下次不要迟到就好。"] = "It's fine, just don't be late next time.",
    ["没事，他谨慎地做好了充分准备。"] = "It's fine, he was Cautious and made full preparations.",
    ["没事，只是有点晕。担心？啊……很多人这么说过。我的老师，我的房东太太，甚至卖鸡蛋给我的农妇，这只是我与它们相处的方式。"] = "I'm fine, just a little dizzy. Worried? Ah... many people have said that. My teacher, my landlady, even the farm woman who sells me eggs, this is just how I get along with them.",
    ["没事，听我的。"] = "It's fine, listen to me.",
    ["没事，听我的！有弟怪弟，无弟怪狗，无弟无狗，离家出走！"] = "It's okay, listen to me! Blame the younger brother if you have one, blame the dog if you don't, and if you have neither, just run away from home!",
    ["没事，快吃吧，没吃饱我这里还有。"] = "It's okay, eat up, I have more if you're not full.",
    ["没事，我也在找机会精进我的魔术表演。我们现在就去找米莉安太太吧。"] = "It's nothing, I'm also looking for opportunities to improve my magic performance. Let's go find Mrs. Miriam now.",
    ["没事，我们在附近散散步。你病才好，多走走有助于身体的恢复。"] = "It's okay, let's take a walk nearby. You've just recovered from your illness, walking more will help your recovery.",
    ["没事，我再想别的办法，多少钱？"] = "It's okay, I'll think of another way. How much?",
    ["没事，我听说这家不歧视东区人。"] = "It's fine, I heard they don't discriminate against people from the East District.",
    ["没事，我的工作就是安保。刚才是怎么回事？"] = "I'm fine, my job is security. What happened just now?",
    ["没事，我胆子比较大，我去看看。"] = "It's okay, I'm quite brave, I'll go take a look.",
    ["没事，打扰了"] = "It's okay, sorry to bother you",
    ["没事，打扰了。"] = "It's fine, sorry to bother you.",
    ["没事，来，披上妈妈的衣服……"] = "It's okay, come here, put on Mommy's clothes...",
    ["没事，第一次会紧张是正常的，之后习惯就好。"] = "It's okay, it's normal to be nervous the first time. You'll get used to it later.",
    ["没事，跟姐姐走。"] = "It's okay, come with sister.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合占卜家穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for a Seer, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合学徒穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for an Apprentice, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合战士穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for a Warrior, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合歌颂者穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for a Bard, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合窥秘人穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for a Mystery Pryer, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的铜制箱子。使用后获得适合观众穿戴的装备，能够应付有些难度的场合。"] = "A copper chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for a Spectator, capable of handling somewhat difficult situations.",
    ["没人不喜欢的银制箱子。使用后获得适合在副本中穿戴的装备，能够应付比较困难的场合......应该吧。"] = "A silver chest that no one dislikes. Using it grants equipment suitable for wearing in dungeons, capable of handling more difficult situations... probably.",
    ["没人喜欢天天上班，是吧？"] = "Nobody likes working every day, right?",
    ["没人在家吗，真不巧。"] = "No one home? How unfortunate.",
    ["没人应门……"] = "No one answered the door...",
    ["没人想看到报纸上出现伤亡消息。"] = "No one wants to see news of casualties in the papers.",
    ["没人看清你的车影，只有钢铁与沥青摩擦的尖啸在烟囱间回荡。你从不在后视镜里留下活口——因为他们根本追不上。"] = "No one could see your car's shadow, only the scream of steel rubbing against asphalt echoed among the chimneys. You never leave survivors in the rearview mirror—because they can't catch up at all.",
    ["没人知道曲作者是谁，是女人还是男人，平民还是贵族。但甚至有人在海上听船员弹过，只是船只当天就遭受了袭击。"] = "No one knows who the composer is, whether it's a woman or a man, a commoner or a noble. But some people have even heard sailors play it on the sea, only for the ship to be attacked that very day.",
    ["没人知道这双靴子从哪里来，至少年轻女孩从古董店里偷来时不知道。\n“能卖个好价钱。”买她的男人把这句话和黑面包一起丢给她。\n但靴子的花纹实在太漂亮，她偷偷把靴子留下，在大家都入睡后拿出来穿，自此她夜夜好梦：行走在汹涌的波涛之上，在无人驻足的沙漠起舞，飞跃上一望无际的雪山。\n她一直讨厌又脏又小的床铺和十几个孩子齐鸣的呼噜，但好在她也一直长不高，靴子一直合脚。\n这天她挨了打，不顾男人的叫嚷冲回房间套上靴子。\n白光刺得她睁不开眼，往日的美景，在白天尤为炫目。\n“都是真的！”她兴奋地跳起来，和风一起融化在雪中。"] = "No one knew where these boots came from, at least not the young girl who stole them from an antique shop. \n \"They'll fetch a good price.\" The man who bought her threw this sentence at her along with a piece of black bread. \n But the patterns on the boots were so beautiful that she secretly kept them, taking them out to wear after everyone had fallen asleep. From then on, she had wonderful dreams every night: walking upon surging waves, dancing in a desert where no one ever stopped, and leaping onto endless snowy mountains. \n She had always hated the dirty, cramped bed and the snoring of a dozen children, but fortunately, she never grew tall, and the boots always fit. \n One day, she was beaten and, ignoring the man's shouting, rushed back to her room to put on the boots. \n The white light was so piercing she couldn't open her eyes; the familiar beautiful scenery was even more dazzling in the daylight. \n \"It's all real!\" She jumped up excitedly and melted into the snow along with the wind.",
    ["没人能明白……"] = "No one can understand...",
    ["没人能让我提起兴趣了。"] = "No one can pique my interest anymore.",
    ["没什么"] = "Nothing",
    ["没什么。<P_Heart>（他是不是犯了厨房大忌……灵机一动？）</>"] = "It's nothing. <P_Heart> (Did he commit a kitchen taboo... a sudden flash of inspiration?) </>",
    ["没什么了"] = "Nothing else.",
    ["没什么事"] = "Nothing in particular",
    ["没什么事的话，我先走了。"] = "If there's nothing else, I'll be going.",
    ["没什么值得刊登的……"] = "Nothing worth publishing...",
    ["没什么兴趣"] = "Not interested",
    ["没什么变化嘛……"] = "Nothing has changed...",
    ["没什么好隐瞒的，我刚刚完成了一场复仇。"] = "There's nothing to hide; I just finished a revenge.",
    ["没什么思路了……已知线索太少了，回酒馆再问问他们吧。"] = "I have no more ideas... there are too few known clues. Let's go back to the tavern and ask them again.",
    ["没什么想知道的了"] = "Nothing else I want to know",
    ["没什么想要了解了"] = "Nothing else to learn",
    ["没什么想要的"] = "Nothing I want",
    ["没什么想问的了"] = "Nothing else to ask",
    ["没什么有效的线索，再用能力调查一下吧。"] = "No useful clues. I should investigate again with my ability.",
    ["没什么比健康和知识更重要。"] = "Nothing is more important than health and knowledge.",
    ["没什么没什么……您听错了吧……"] = "Nothing, nothing... you must have misheard...",
    ["没什么灰尘，弗莱应该是个很爱干净的人。"] = "There's no dust; Frye must be a very clean person.",
    ["没什么灰尘，看来弗莱是个很爱干净的人。"] = "There isn't much dust; it seems Frye is a very clean person.",
    ["没什么设计的灵感啊……"] = "No inspiration for design...",
    ["没什么需要的"] = "Nothing needed",
    ["没什么！只是随便画画……您有什么事吗？"] = "It's nothing! Just doodling... Is there something you need?",
    ["没什么，再见。"] = "Nothing, goodbye.",
    ["没什么，只是想到了之前的一些事情。"] = "Nothing, just thinking about some things from before.",
    ["没什么，只是战斗有些激烈。"] = "Nothing, the battle was just a bit intense.",
    ["没什么，只是记录一些开支。"] = "It's nothing, just recording some expenses.",
    ["没什么，就是想起家里那位……结婚纪念日，他连日子都记错了。"] = "Nothing, just thinking about the one at home... wedding anniversary, he even forgot the date.",
    ["没什么，快去找你需要的东西吧。"] = "It's nothing. Go quickly and find what you need.",
    ["没什么，我先前遇见了一个自称财政大臣的孩子，他向我要了一些钱，他也是你的臣民？"] = "Nothing, I previously met a child who claimed to be the Minister of Finance, he asked me for some money, is he also your subject?",
    ["没什么，最近一切还顺利吗？"] = "Nothing much. Has everything been going smoothly lately?",
    ["没什么，这小子来买学术期刊。"] = "Nothing, this kid is here to buy academic journals.",
    ["没什么，那我这就走，感谢您的帮助和宽容！"] = "It's nothing, then I'll be going now. Thank you for your help and tolerance!",
    ["没任务不能来廷根吗？虽然这里的咖啡比不上贝克兰德，但是女仆……咳咳，还是不错的。"] = "Can't I come to Tingen without a quest? Although the coffee here isn't as good as in Backlund, the maids... ahem, are still quite nice.",
    ["没关系{{先生|女士}}，感谢您的热心。"] = "It's alright, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, thank you for your kindness.",
    ["没关系。{{先生|女士}}，只要您记着我就好啦。"] = "It's alright. {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, as long as you remember me, that's enough.",
    ["没关系。我都记得。"] = "It's okay. I remember everything.",
    ["没关系亲爱的，和你待在一起就很开心了。"] = "It's alright, dear, I'm just happy to be with you.",
    ["没关系的克莱恩，不用着急。我们可以再看看其他机会！"] = "It's okay Klein, no need to rush. We can look for other opportunities!",
    ["没关系的朋友，微小的善意也可以改变世界，希望在未来的活动中与你相遇。"] = "It's okay, friend; tiny acts of kindness can also change the world. I hope to meet you in future activities.",
    ["没关系的老大，回去后，我们还能继续努力！"] = "It's okay, boss. After we go back, we can continue to work hard!",
    ["没关系！比赛一年才举办一次，就当是一次体验。"] = "It doesn't matter! The match is only held once a year, just treat it as an experience.",
    ["没关系， 我可以再等等，旅行嘛，也不急于一时。"] = "It's okay, I can wait a bit longer. Travel, after all, isn't something to rush.",
    ["没关系，也许这次，奇迹终将发生。"] = "It's okay, perhaps this time, a miracle will finally happen.",
    ["没关系，今天真是个好天气啊，明天也会是的。我会好好活的，带着瑞尔的那份一起。"] = "It's okay. It's such a nice day today, and tomorrow will be too. I will live well, carrying Ray's share as well.",
    ["没关系，伊妮德，哥哥一点也不痛。"] = "It's okay, Enid, brother doesn't feel any pain.",
    ["没关系，伦纳德先生和罗珊小姐一直在帮助我。"] = "It's okay, Mr. Leonard and Miss Rozanne have been helping me.",
    ["没关系，你再研究研究，一定能成功调配出媲美你老师水准的饮料！"] = "It's okay, keep researching, you will definitely succeed in concocting a drink that rivals your teacher's level!",
    ["没关系，你很努力，坚强的女孩，愿女神庇佑你。"] = "It's okay, you are very hardworking, strong girl. May the Goddess bless you.",
    ["没关系，你没事就好。"] = "It's alright, as long as you're okay.",
    ["没关系，你还有时间考虑。"] = "It's okay, you still have time to consider.",
    ["没关系，卡萝队长会帮我的。"] = "It's alright, Captain Caryl will help me.",
    ["没关系，反正现在那都一样，活人可比死人难缠多了。回归女神的怀抱，说不定才是最好的选择。"] = "It doesn't matter, it's all the same now anyway. The living are much more troublesome than the dead. Returning to the embrace of the Goddess might be the best choice.",
    ["没关系，可以理解。如果需要的话，那边好像是盥洗室。"] = "It's okay, I understand. If you need it, the washroom seems to be over there.",
    ["没关系，可以理解，我为他们的遭遇感到遗憾。"] = "It's okay, I understand. I feel sorry for what happened to them.",
    ["没关系，女神会原谅你的。"] = "It's okay, the Evernight Goddess will forgive you.",
    ["没关系，如果下次有机会，欢迎再同我交流诗歌。"] = "No problem, if there's a chance next time, you're welcome to discuss poetry with me again.",
    ["没关系，如果想念母亲，就回家看看吧。"] = "It's okay. If you miss your mother, go home and visit her.",
    ["没关系，很快就能……再见到我了……"] = "It's okay, you'll be able to... see me again very soon...",
    ["没关系，慢慢来"] = "It's okay, take your time",
    ["没关系，我会等到来找我的客人。"] = "It's fine, I will wait for the customer who comes for me.",
    ["没关系，我想这并不重要，还是让我听听看你们的歌，怎么样？"] = "It's okay, I don't think that's important. Why don't you let me hear your song, how about that?",
    ["没关系，我有办法。跟我去见一位“专家”吧，或许她能看见被隐藏的真相。"] = "It's okay, I have a way. Come with me to see an \"expert\"; perhaps she can see the hidden truth.",
    ["没关系，我有脚踏车。我骑车带你，你替我指路。"] = "It's okay, I have a bicycle. I'll ride you there, and you can give me directions.",
    ["没关系，我来付钱，你选喜欢的就好。"] = "It's okay, I'll pay for it, just pick the one you like.",
    ["没关系，我每天都沿固定路线卖报，我们还会遇到的。"] = "It's fine, I sell newspapers along a fixed route every day, we'll meet again.",
    ["没关系，我看到了你的勇气。"] = "It's okay, I saw your courage.",
    ["没关系，我还可以，尽快解决吧。"] = "It's fine, I'm still okay. Let's finish this as soon as possible.",
    ["没关系，无论什么时候，我都愿意为你介绍我主，伟大的“愚者”先生。"] = "It's okay, no matter when, I am willing to introduce my Lord, the great Mr. Fool, to you.",
    ["没关系，柯达先生不会违背您的要求的，只要是您指定！"] = "It doesn't matter, Mr. Kodak will not go against your requests as long as you specify them!",
    ["没关系，还有希望。第二十一次尝试，重新开始！"] = "It's okay, there is still hope. Twenty-first attempt, starting over!",
    ["没关系，这个就已经足够了。"] = "It's fine, this is enough.",
    ["没关系，这个时代有很多机会，我很快就能再找到工作。"] = "It's okay, there are many opportunities in this era, and I will be able to find another job soon.",
    ["没关系，这也是我的工作。"] = "It's alright, this is my job too.",
    ["没关系，这附近没什么别的人，不会被听到的。"] = "It's okay, there's no one else around here, it won't be heard.",
    ["没关系，都很久以前的事了，当时整条街被卷入非凡事件，值夜者赶来时，只有我还活着……"] = "It's alright, it was a long time ago. The whole street was caught in a Beyonder incident, and when the Nighthawks arrived, I was the only one left alive...",
    ["没关系，顾问{{先生|女士}}，接下来就交给我们。"] = "It's okay, Consultant {{Mr.|Ms.}}, leave the rest to us.",
    ["没兴趣"] = "Not interested",
    ["没兴趣……"] = "Not interested...",
    ["没兴趣，再见"] = "Not interested, goodbye",
    ["没兴趣，再见。"] = "Not interested, goodbye.",
    ["没写完的信"] = "Unfinished Letter",
    ["没办法 只能继续逃跑了 "] = "No choice, have to keep running.",
    ["没办法了，卡门，我帮你找值夜者吧。"] = "There's no other way, Carmen, I'll find the Nighthawks for you.",
    ["没办法，大家都想听八卦新闻，不然日子太无聊了。"] = "Can't help it, everyone wants to hear gossip, otherwise life is too boring.",
    ["没去过"] = "Haven't been there",
    ["没反应，的确是普通的书。"] = "No reaction, it is indeed an ordinary book.",
    ["没发现什么特殊的地方（医药检定失败）。"] = "Found nothing special (Medicine check failed).",
    ["没吃完的食物，就这么放在外面？"] = "Unfinished food, just left out like this?",
    ["没听清吗？我是说，我是乞丐。"] = "Didn't you hear clearly? I said, I am a beggar.",
    ["没听说过"] = "Never heard of it",
    ["没咖啡的杯子"] = "Cup without Coffee",
    ["没喝完的牛奶？"] = "Unfinished milk?",
    ["没喝药就醒了，体质不错嘛。"] = "You woke up without drinking the potion; you have a good constitution.",
    ["没喝酒怎么会醉呢？也许醉了就好了……"] = "How could I be drunk without drinking? Maybe it would be better if I were drunk...",
    ["没开门吗？"] = "Is it not open?",
    ["没必要和东区那个混蛋起冲突，我总觉得他有点诡异。"] = "There's no need to conflict with that bastard in the East District, I always feel he's a bit strange.",
    ["没想到事情竟然是这样……白莉夫人是因为怀念过世的父亲才会轻信于人。"] = "I didn't expect things to turn out like this... Lady Beryl only trusted others because she missed her late father.",
    ["没想到你是扑克专家。对了，我需要回公司一趟，有点急事要处理。"] = "I didn't expect you to be a poker expert. Right, I need to go back to the company, I have some urgent matters to handle.",
    ["没想到你还真懂历史呢。"] = "I didn't expect you to really know history.",
    ["没想到值夜者会用安保公司的招牌来遮掩，如果真有人上门委托任务怎么办？"] = "I didn't expect the Nighthawks to use a security company's sign to cover up. What if someone really comes to entrust a quest?",
    ["没想到只用了两根。"] = "I didn't expect to only use two.",
    ["没想到吧，这个精灵就由我本人亲自扮演！"] = "Didn't expect that, did you? I'm playing this elf myself!",
    ["没想到吧，这个精灵就由我罗塞尔本人亲自扮演！"] = "Didn't expect it, did you? This elf is played by me, Roselle, in person!",
    ["没想到在这也遇见了你。你是有了什么新发现吗？"] = "I didn't expect to meet you here too. Did you have any new discoveries?",
    ["没想到它还能迎来合适的主人，真是太好了……"] = "I didn't expect it to find a suitable owner after all; that is truly wonderful...",
    ["没想到我的邻居竟然是一只会说话的猩猩，你是从马戏团里偷跑出来的吗？"] = "I didn't expect my neighbor to be a talking gorilla. Did you sneak out of a circus?",
    ["没想到这里竟然住着一只会说话的猩猩，你是从马戏团里偷跑出来的吗？"] = "I didn't expect a talking gorilla to live here. Did you sneak out of a circus?",
    ["没意思"] = "Boring",
    ["没成想现在因为年纪大了，没人要我了。"] = "I never expected that now, because of my age, no one wants me anymore.",
    ["没找到封印物资料，找到了全套的《不上班如何赚大钱》……咳，下次来看。"] = "I didn't find the information on the Sealed Artifact, but I did find the complete set of \"How to Make Big Money Without Working\"... Ahem, I'll check it out next time.",
    ["没找到神奇物品"] = "No mystical item found",
    ["没撞到你吧？我骑得还不熟练。"] = "I didn't bump into you, did I? I'm not very skilled at riding yet.",
    ["没效果？那包草药需要空腹服用，你用之前没吃东西吧？"] = "No effect? That pack of herbs needs to be taken on an empty stomach. You didn't eat anything before using it, right?",
    ["没时间解释了，快上车！"] = "No time to explain, get in the car!",
    ["没有"] = "None",
    ["没有……我翻了一圈，这间屋子里，没有任何神奇物品。\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索：没找到神奇物品）</>"] = "Nothing... I searched everywhere, and there are no mystical items in this room. \n<P_Yellow>(Obtained a clue: No mystical item found)</>",
    ["没有……我翻了一圈，这间屋子里，没有任何神奇物品。\\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索：没找到神奇物品）</>"] = "Nothing... I searched everywhere, there are no Beyonder items in this room.\n<P_Yellow>（Obtained clue: No Beyonder items found）</>",
    ["没有……我记不起来了……"] = "Nothing... I can't remember...",
    ["没有……还是没有。没有给你的，也没有给我的。"] = "No... still nothing. Nothing for you, and nothing for me.",
    ["没有。"] = "None.",
    ["没有一个廷根的孩子小时候不被母亲拿这件事吓唬过！"] = "There isn't a child in Tingen who wasn't scared by their mother with this story when they were young!",
    ["没有万能的灵药，但是有对症的药方。"] = "There is no panacea, but there are prescriptions for specific symptoms.",
    ["没有也能帮您淘来。"] = "Even if I don't, I can help you hunt it down.",
    ["没有了"] = "Gone",
    ["没有了……没有了……\n哪怕往前一步的方向，都没有了……"] = "It's gone... it's all gone... \n There isn't even a direction to take a step forward anymore...",
    ["没有人会忘记他们的，他们守护了廷根。"] = "No one will forget them; they guarded Tingen.",
    ["没有人比我更懂舞池"] = "No one understands the dance floor better than me",
    ["没有人能阻止廷根！"] = "No one can stop Tingen!",
    ["没有什么万一！兰登，别怕，你是最勇敢的。"] = "There are no 'what ifs'! Landon, don't be afraid, you are the bravest.",
    ["没有什么可是，再过两年你就能去做工了，到时候就可以天天吃饱饭了。"] = "There are no 'buts'. In two years, you'll be able to work, and then you'll be able to eat your fill every day.",
    ["没有任何参赛人员"] = "No participants",
    ["没有任何条件，只要你热爱这项运动！这是哈德森，这是迪兰，他们来自完全不同的家庭，但是我们赛艇队一视同仁！"] = "No conditions at all, as long as you love this sport! This is Hudson, this is Dylan. They come from completely different backgrounds, but our rowing team treats everyone equally!",
    ["没有任命精英的权限"] = "No permission to appoint elites.",
    ["没有传奇的姓名，却浸染过无数传奇的血；不被史册记载，却贯穿了整场战争。"] = "It has no legendary name, yet it has been soaked in the blood of countless legends; it is not recorded in history books, yet it has run through the entire war.",
    ["没有佛尔思的小说看，我就要活不下去了……"] = "I won't be able to go on without reading Fors's novels...",
    ["没有你的稿件，看看下一份。"] = "No manuscript from you, let's look at the next one.",
    ["没有兴趣"] = "Not interested",
    ["没有准信，邻居说快了，但也没说哪天。"] = "No definite word, the neighbors say soon, but they didn't say which day.",
    ["没有别的问题"] = "No other questions",
    ["没有动作在释放中"] = "No action is currently being released.",
    ["没有危险"] = "No Danger",
    ["没有受伤的痕迹……看来这位“侠盗”是在针对白莉夫人做戏了。"] = "No signs of injury... looks like this \"Phantom Thief\" is putting on a show targeting Lady Beryl.",
    ["没有可出售的物产"] = "No products available for sale.",
    ["没有可领取的充值返还奖励"] = "No recharge rebate rewards available to claim.",
    ["没有可领取的积分奖励"] = "No point rewards available to collect.",
    ["没有可领取的邮件。"] = "No mail to collect.",
    ["没有合适的目标。"] = "No suitable target.",
    ["没有合适目标，无法执行该操作"] = "No suitable target; this operation cannot be performed.",
    ["没有同名封印物。"] = "No Sealed Artifact of the same name.",
    ["没有品味的家伙，扰乱了舞池节奏！"] = "A tasteless fellow, disrupting the rhythm of the dance floor!",
    ["没有哪位经验丰富的探索者，会轻易相信一份毫无来由的财富。\n它们有的早已失去主人，有的仍处于守护之下，有的只是岁月的痕迹。\n对于非凡者而言，每一次尝试，都意味着一次选择。\n这一切的谜题，都等着你来揭晓。"] = "No experienced explorer would easily trust wealth that comes from nowhere. \n Some have long lost their owners, some are still under protection, and some are just traces of time. \n For a Beyonder, every attempt means a choice. \n All these puzzles are waiting for you to reveal them.",
    ["没有啊。也许是小兔子跑过去的声音？"] = "No, I didn't. Maybe it was the sound of a little rabbit running by?",
    ["没有啊。我既没有吃面包也没有吃炖菜，我只喝了点牛奶，吃了一口香蕉！"] = "No. I didn't eat bread or stew, I only drank some milk and ate a bite of banana!",
    ["没有啊，他说要做有文化的屠夫，回家编写《雌性家猪的产后生理调护》去啦！"] = "No, he said he wanted to be a cultured butcher and went home to write 'Postpartum Physiological Care for Female Domestic Pigs'!",
    ["没有回应……"] = "No response...",
    ["没有回应……难道她没有回家？"] = "No response... Could it be that she didn't go home?",
    ["没有太大危险了，不用特别在意。"] = "There is no major danger anymore; no need to pay special attention to it.",
    ["没有妨碍"] = "No interference",
    ["没有宣战权限"] = "No permission to declare war",
    ["没有对应的时装"] = "No corresponding outfit",
    ["没有对应的标签"] = "No corresponding tag",
    ["没有小伙伴愿意和我玩……他们都说我很奇怪，但花花草草不一样，它们都是我的好朋友。"] = "No friends want to play with me... they all say I'm very strange, but flowers and plants are different; they are all my good friends.",
    ["没有尽头？"] = "No end?",
    ["没有工作啦……"] = "No work left...",
    ["没有巴尼先生，游戏也不会结束！"] = "Without Mr. Barney, the game won't end!",
    ["没有希望了……对不起，伊妮德。"] = "There is no hope left... I'm sorry, Enid.",
    ["没有异常。"] = "No abnormalities.",
    ["没有心思细看，把书稍微摆得整齐一些。"] = "I didn't have the heart to look closely, so I just straightened the books a little.",
    ["没有恶灵。"] = "There is no Evil Spirit.",
    ["没有您的鼓励和指引，我觉得自己无法完成这件事。"] = "Without your encouragement and guidance, I don't think I could have accomplished this.",
    ["没有感兴趣的"] = "Nothing I'm interested in",
    ["没有感觉吗？这可是天降甘霖！在烈日的树荫下，神灵的赐福……"] = "Do you not feel it? This is the rain from heaven! Under the shade of the scorching sun, the blessing of the God...",
    ["没有我想要的材料，还有别的吗"] = "No materials I want, anything else?",
    ["没有找到合适的目标"] = "No suitable target found.",
    ["没有找到目标分线。"] = "Target channel not found.",
    ["没有掌声、鲜花、或是硬币。"] = "No applause, flowers, or coins.",
    ["没有时间了……没有时间了……我是非凡者，我必须尝试新的仪式魔法……"] = "There is no time... there is no time... I am a Beyonder, I must try new Ritual Magic...",
    ["没有更多数据啦~"] = "No more data~",
    ["没有更多的金镑了"] = "No more Pounds left.",
    ["没有朱莉鼓励我，我连出门都很害怕。她对我很好，我不知道该怎么报答她……"] = "Without Julie's encouragement, I would be afraid to even go out. She is very good to me; I don't know how to repay her...",
    ["没有机械结构，没有能源供应，净化之泉的水能持续流动，这就是神秘学吗……"] = "No mechanical structure, no energy supply, yet the water in the Fountain of Purification flows continuously; is this what mysticism is...",
    ["没有没有"] = "No, no",
    ["没有没有，谈不上伟大……"] = "No, no, I wouldn't call myself great...",
    ["没有灵性反应的瓷杯，海报，以及钢笔。"] = "A porcelain cup with no spiritual reaction, a poster, and a fountain pen.",
    ["没有特定的对象……看，注意到河对岸光影的变化了吗？画笔就很难再现瞬间的变化。"] = "There's no specific subject... Look, have you noticed the change in light and shadow on the other side of the river? It's hard for a paintbrush to reproduce such instantaneous changes.",
    ["没有疑问了"] = "No more questions",
    ["没有的事！我和马修吵架之后没多久就散了，您看，我现在一个人老老实实地卖纪念品，也是……是正当的生意嘛！"] = "Not at all! I parted ways with Matthew shortly after we argued. Look, I'm honestly selling souvenirs by myself now, it's... it's a legitimate business!",
    ["没有相关记录。"] = "No relevant records.",
    ["没有符合条件可配置的药品。"] = "No eligible medicine available for configuration.",
    ["没有脉搏……"] = "No pulse...",
    ["没有计划就行动，效率会降低百分之四十以上。"] = "Acting without a plan reduces efficiency by more than forty percent.",
    ["没有误会！父亲他和我想的永远不一样！我所坚持和努力的在他的眼里一文不值……这里又要变回我陌生的样子了……"] = "It's not a misunderstanding! My father and I will never see eye to eye! Everything I persist in and strive for is worthless in his eyes... I'm going to have to go back to being the person I don't recognize here...",
    ["没有调整资格，请和会长沟通获取"] = "No adjustment qualifications; please communicate with the president to obtain them.",
    ["没有足够的赠礼额度"] = "Insufficient gift quota.",
    ["没有输入任何值"] = "No value entered",
    ["没有选中时输出玩家身上信息"] = "Output player info when nothing is selected.",
    ["没有采集到音频数据，请检查麦克风设备是否正常"] = "No audio data captured; please check if your microphone is working properly.",
    ["没有需要学习的法术，被知识冲昏了头脑！"] = "No spells to learn; you've been overwhelmed by knowledge!",
    ["没有鼻息……"] = "No breathing...",
    ["没有鼻息，也没有脉搏，的确很符合死亡的标准。"] = "No breathing, no pulse; it certainly meets the criteria for death.",
    ["没有！这家伙能躲过我们的巡逻，丢的东西越来越多了！！"] = "None! This guy can evade our patrols, and more and more things are going missing!!",
    ["没有，也许是接触神奇物品，被负面效果影响。"] = "No, perhaps she came into contact with a mystical item and was affected by its negative effects.",
    ["没有，他，他在湖边写诗，很，很好的诗！"] = "No, he, he is writing poems by the lakeside, very, very good poems!",
    ["没有，你们不能被假象迷惑"] = "No, you cannot be deceived by appearances",
    ["没有，你画得很好。"] = "No, you painted it very well.",
    ["没有，女士，请别担心。"] = "No, ma'am, please don't worry.",
    ["没有，她已经两年没回来了……"] = "No, she hasn't been back for two years...",
    ["没有，如果是他，我一定能认出来的！"] = "No, if it were him, I would definitely be able to recognize him!",
    ["没有，我从来不流鼻涕。"] = "No, I never have a runny nose.",
    ["没有，我们很少会买这种不实用的装饰品。"] = "No, we rarely buy such impractical decorative items.",
    ["没有，我去看看"] = "No, I'll go take a look",
    ["没有，我对传统草药很感兴趣，能和我说说吗？"] = "No, I am very interested in traditional herbs, can you tell me about them?",
    ["没有，我当时只是个旁观者"] = "No, I was just a bystander at the time",
    ["没有，我没有。吉米，你在吗？"] = "No, I'm not. Jimmy, are you there?",
    ["没有，我没有哭。姐姐说这是高兴的事，我不会哭的，我不是不懂事的小孩。"] = "No, I'm not crying. Sister said this is a happy thing, I won't cry, I'm not an ignorant child.",
    ["没有，最早的安迪凌晨五点出门，最晚的迪伦半夜一点回来。"] = "No, the earliest, Andy, goes out at five in the morning, and the latest, Dylan, comes back at one in the morning.",
    ["没有，没有家人……你还是离我远点吧，他们说不幸是会传染的，是最难解决的瘟疫。"] = "No, no family... You'd better stay away from me. They say misfortune is contagious, the most difficult plague to solve.",
    ["没有，船长知道会生气的……我只是让他们找点资料，减轻我的工作。"] = "No, the Captain will be angry if he finds out... I just asked them to find some information to lighten my workload.",
    ["没有？连坟墓也没有吗？我……你没有骗我？"] = "No? Not even a grave? I... you're not lying to me, are you?",
    ["没来得及用灵视检查。算了，先回黑荆棘。"] = "I didn't have time to check with spirit vision. Forget it, I'll head back to Blackthorn first.",
    ["没来得及用灵视检查下。算了，先回黑荆棘。"] = "Didn't have time to use Spirit Vision to check. Forget it, let's head back to Blackthorn first.",
    ["没来过"] = "Never been here",
    ["没注意"] = "Didn't notice",
    ["没爹妈的"] = "Orphaned",
    ["没用的家伙！看谁会信你！"] = "Useless guy! Let's see who believes you!",
    ["没用的废物，没用的废物！"] = "Useless trash, useless trash!",
    ["没用的，你逃不开......命运"] = "It's useless, you cannot escape... fate.",
    ["没礼貌的家伙，你应该称呼我为——"] = "Rude fellow, you should address me as—",
    ["没礼貌，我可是尊贵的<P_Yellow>超级属性加点精灵</>。"] = "How rude, I am the noble <P_Yellow> Super Attribute Point Elf </>.",
    ["没绷住"] = "Couldn't hold it in",
    ["没落骑士"] = "Fallen knight",
    ["没见过"] = "Never seen it",
    ["没见过的面孔，你不是本地人吧？要不要尝尝我做的睡莲啤酒？"] = "A face I haven't seen before, you're not a local, are you? Would you like to try the water lily beer I made?",
    ["没见过，谁也没见过。不过据说她为了等那个男人，和家里决裂搬了出来……啧啧，看样子这回是不用等咯。"] = "Never seen him, nobody has. But it's said that to wait for that man, she broke ties with her family and moved out... Tsk tsk, looks like she doesn't have to wait anymore.",
    ["没计划，也能找到戒指？！"] = "You can find the ring even without a plan?!",
    ["没车的话，厂子里还有辆老车可以借你使使。可别给磕坏咯。"] = "If you don't have a car, there's an old one in the factory you can borrow. Just don't wreck it.",
    ["没这个必要，证据齐全，事实无疑。我以国王和法律的名义，判处你终身监禁！"] = "There is no need. The evidence is complete, and the facts are indisputable. In the name of the King and the law, I sentence you to life imprisonment!",
    ["没这种事，先生，那只是一个名字。"] = "There's no such thing, sir, that's just a name.",
    ["没那么简单，要演出主角唐泰斯的风采，这个人不仅要形象俊朗、身手敏捷，最重要的还要能表现出坚毅不屈、正直果敢的英雄本色。"] = "It's not that simple. To perform the charisma of the protagonist Dantes, this person must not only be handsome and agile, but most importantly, must be able to display the heroic qualities of perseverance and integrity.",
    ["没钱？那就别在这儿扫了！这把老骨头该进救济院了。"] = "No money? Then stop sweeping here! These old bones should be in the poorhouse.",
    ["没错"] = "That's right",
    ["没错 我是你的主宰"] = "That's right, I am your master.",
    ["没错 我是你的主宰！"] = "That's right, I am your master!",
    ["没错 搬完这件就再也不用见到你了 真让人开心 "] = "That's right. Once this is moved, I'll never have to see you again. How delightful.",
    ["没错……你也是……我"] = "That's right... you are also... me.",
    ["没错……没错……"] = "That's right... that's right...",
    ["没错……这是我与香花女士之间的珍贵的信物。"] = "That's right... this is a precious token between Ms. Xianghua and me.",
    ["没错。一位叫做奥斯瓦尔德的“工匠”。他擅长制作神奇物品，有许多客户向他求购。"] = "That's right. An 'Artisan' named Oswald. He was skilled at making mystical items, and many clients sought to purchase them from him.",
    ["没错。他是小丑……难道是密修会成员？"] = "That's right. He is a Clown... could he be a Rose School of Thought member?",
    ["没错。但我也想知道，他拿“心脏”去做什么？"] = "That's right. But I also want to know, what is he going to do with the 'heart'?",
    ["没错。你们这是……"] = "That's right. You two are...",
    ["没错。你陷入噩梦，被反复折磨，差点被邪神彻底污染。"] = "That's right. You fell into a nightmare, were repeatedly tormented, and were almost completely corrupted by an evil god.",
    ["没错。其他人都有任务，丽贝卡还在查另一件封印物，只好我们三个分工了。"] = "That's right. Everyone else has tasks, and Rebecca is still investigating another Sealed Artifact, so we have to divide the work among the three of us.",
    ["没错。另外海纳斯提到的<P_Yellow>内部组织</>，大概率是一个隐秘组织。"] = "That's right. Also, the <P_Yellow>internal organization</> mentioned by Haines is most likely a secret organization.",
    ["没错。只要循环还在继续，符号就会发出流光，而黛西小姐也不会真正死去。"] = "That's right. As long as the loop continues, the symbol will emit a flowing light, and Miss Daisy will not truly die.",
    ["没错。孩子们面临的困难比我们当年还要多。"] = "That's right. The children face more difficulties than we did back then.",
    ["没错。它看上去像瓜果，但吃起来却有鳟鱼和牛奶混合的味道。"] = "Exactly. They look like melons, but they taste like a mixture of trout and milk.",
    ["没错。愿意进去吗？或者等你想好了再来找我。"] = "That's right. Willing to go in? Or come back to me when you've made up your mind.",
    ["没错。我就是塔罗学院的奠基者之一，新生入学考核官，无所不知的全知教授——魔镜阿罗德斯。"] = "That's right. I am one of the founders of the Tarot Academy, the freshman entrance examiner, the all-knowing Professor of Omniscience—the Magic Mirror, Arrodes.",
    ["没错。每天上午十点半和下午三点，老维尔餐厅会派服务生到黑荆棘去。"] = "That's right. Every day at 10:30 AM and 3:00 PM, Old Will's Restaurant will send a waiter to Blackthorn.",
    ["没错。这是一个可怕的诅咒仪式，幸运的是， 它已经被破坏了。"] = "That's right. This was a terrifying curse ritual, but fortunately, it has been disrupted.",
    ["没错年轻人，我在等我的儿子，卢卡。"] = "That's right, young man. I'm waiting for my son, Luca.",
    ["没错我不敢！请你让她回去吧。"] = "Yes, I don't dare! Please, let her go back.",
    ["没错！{{先生|女士}}，你也明白其中的奥妙吗？"] = "That's right! {{ Mr. | Ms. } }, do you also understand the mystery behind it?",
    ["没错！上面记载了罗塞尔大帝创造的神秘符文，里面藏着神秘的力量！"] = "That's right! It records the mysterious runes created by Emperor Roselle, which contain mysterious power!",
    ["没错！价格实惠，数量有限，先到先得！"] = "That's right! Affordable prices, limited quantity, first come, first served!",
    ["没错！大概就是这样！"] = "Exactly! That's about it!",
    ["没错！她是贝克兰德夜总会里最不同的舞女，她的舞姿优美，歌声也动人！"] = "That's right! She is the most unique dancer in the Backlund nightclub; her dance moves are graceful, and her singing voice is moving!",
    ["没错！就是这个角度，就是这个姿势！"] = "That's right! That's the angle, that's the pose!",
    ["没错！就算不能成为首富，但在拜亚姆，生活至少不会比现在差！"] = "That's right! Even if I can't become the richest person, in Bayam, life at least won't be worse than it is now!",
    ["没错！我调查过，这似乎和睡莲仙女有关。"] = "Exactly! I've investigated, and it seems to be related to the Water Lily Fairy.",
    ["没错！还敢说贵族的荣誉呢，他的脸面比踩在猪圈里的靴子还肮脏！"] = "Exactly! And he still dares to speak of noble honor? His face is dirtier than a boot stepped in a pigsty!",
    ["没错！这位{{先生|女士}}，你一定也想登上宏伟神秘的“黄金梦想号”吧！"] = "That's right! This {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, you must also want to board the magnificent and mysterious \"Golden Dream\"!",
    ["没错！这位先生/女士，你一定也想登上宏伟神秘的“黄金梦想号”吧！"] = "That's right! Sir/Madam, you must also want to board the magnificent and mysterious 'Golden Dream', right!",
    ["没错！那就是月见草了！"] = "That's right! That is the moonflower!",
    ["没错！马西莫提到过，肉要在煮熟之前，过几次冰。"] = "That's right! Massimo mentioned that the meat should be passed through ice several times before it's fully cooked.",
    ["没错，他为了这件事赶回了“红手套”。"] = "That's right, he rushed back to the Red Gloves because of this.",
    ["没错，他很奇怪。厨师在灶台工作，难免会沾油烟，而库克身上没有一点气味"] = "That's right, he is very strange. A chef works at the stove, so it's inevitable they would be stained with cooking fumes, yet there isn't a single scent on Cook.",
    ["没错，他很奇怪。厨师在灶台工作，难免会沾油烟，而库克身上没有一点气味。"] = "That's right, he's very strange. Chefs work at the stove, it's inevitable to get oily smoke, but there's no smell on Cook at all.",
    ["没错，休息是合法的。他已经工作得太久了。"] = "Exactly, resting is legal. He has worked for too long.",
    ["没错，但只是两个小提示。雨停了，准备好就出门试试吧。"] = "Exactly, but these are just two small tips. The rain has stopped, get ready and go out to try it.",
    ["没错，你不是。记住你现在的想法，永远不要动摇。"] = "That's right, you are not. Remember your current thoughts and never waver.",
    ["没错，你当年为了仕途而追求贵族小姐，掐死了你前妻刚刚诞下的婴儿，埋在了门前的大树下，我已经挖出了那个箱子！"] = "That's right, you pursued a noble lady for the sake of your career back then, strangled the baby your ex-wife had just given birth to, and buried it under the tree in front of the door. I have already dug up that box!",
    ["没错，你的问题我已经听到了。湖畔封锁前我们都盯着，帽子帮的亨特和下街牵马的老马丁都去过。警察封锁湖畔后，就再没人了。"] = "That's right, I have heard your question. We kept an eye on the lake before it was sealed. Hunter from the Hat Gang and old Martin who leads horses on Lower Street have both been there. After the police sealed the lake, no one else has been there.",
    ["没错，倒霉的事。有个俱乐部在我这里订了一批书。"] = "That's right, bad luck. A club ordered a batch of books from me.",
    ["没错，出去走走，找个咖啡厅，喝杯咖啡放松一下。"] = "That's right, let's go out for a walk, find a cafe, and have a cup of coffee to relax.",
    ["没错，加上“灰雾之上的神秘主宰”，就能把灰雾空间和我绑定在一起了。"] = "That's right, by adding \"the mysterious ruler above the gray fog,\" I can bind the gray fog space to myself.",
    ["没错，可这个斯嘉丽——"] = "Exactly, but this Scarlett—",
    ["没错，命运就像一团迷雾，你可以通过占卜照亮自己脚下的方寸之地，却不能完整地洞悉全部。所以——"] = "That's right, fate is like a thick fog. You can illuminate the small area beneath your feet through divination, but you cannot fully perceive everything. Therefore—",
    ["没错，和这个一模一样。我看见它就有些眩晕……"] = "That's right, it's exactly the same as this one. I feel a bit dizzy just looking at it...",
    ["没错，哥哥是世界上最厉害的炼钢工人！"] = "That's right, my brother is the best steelworker in the world!",
    ["没错，因蒂斯的最西边是迷雾海。"] = "That's right, the far west of Intis is the Fog Sea.",
    ["没错，它会成为老大荣耀的见证，成为光辉的勋章！"] = "That's right, it will become a witness to the boss's glory and a glorious medal!",
    ["没错，守护不是一时的热血，而是无数次的奋战与坚持。"] = "That's right, guarding is not a momentary burst of passion, but countless battles and persistence.",
    ["没错，就是这样！"] = "That's right, exactly like this!",
    ["没错，就是这种表情！"] = "Yes, that's exactly the expression!",
    ["没错，弗萨克帝国空袭贝克兰德，他们的一支队伍潜入了郊外，我们一路追击到雪山……"] = "That's right, the Feysac Empire launched an air raid on Backlund, and one of their teams infiltrated the suburbs; we chased them all the way to the snowy mountain...",
    ["没错，快出来！"] = "That's right, come out quickly!",
    ["没错，我也会在那段时间里想办法说服父亲，让他明白我做的事情是有意义的，也能给工厂的未来带来利益！"] = "That's right, I will also find a way to persuade my father during that time, to make him understand that what I am doing is meaningful and can bring benefits to the future of the factory!",
    ["没错，我们不该互相伤害。无论过去发生了什么，斯嘉丽，你永远都是我的姐妹。"] = "That's right, we shouldn't have hurt each other. No matter what happened in the past, Scarlett, you will always be my sister.",
    ["没错，我在查这里的货。"] = "That's right. I'm investigating the goods here.",
    ["没错，我已经有序列3的实力，不过像是这种强大的灵界生物，没有相应的指向，即便是试上千千万万遍，也会失败。"] = "That's right, I already have the strength of a Sequence 3. However, for powerful Spirit World creatures like this, without the corresponding guidance, even if you try thousands and thousands of times, you will fail.",
    ["没错，我既没有找到，销售记录上的内容也已经全部被划去了，神奇物品应该真的已经都被出售。"] = "That's right, I didn't find any, and the content on the sales record has all been crossed out. The mystical items should really have all been sold.",
    ["没错，我是一朵正在生长的小花。"] = "That's right, I am a little flower that is growing.",
    ["没错，我是她可怜的老父亲。你见过她了吗？是不是很好的一个孩子？"] = "That's right, I am her poor old father. Have you met her? Isn't she a very good child?",
    ["没错，我曾经是迷途的羔羊，无数个夜晚被可怕的挂科噩梦纠缠。"] = "That's right, I was once a lost lamb, plagued by terrifying nightmares of failing exams for countless nights.",
    ["没错，我的同伴也都以塔罗牌为代号，我们的组织叫塔罗会。"] = "That's right, my companions also use Tarot cards as code names, and our organization is called the Tarot Club.",
    ["没错，找到那本诡异的书，查清背后原因。"] = "That's right, find that strange book and find out the reason behind it.",
    ["没错，末日终于有了新的希望。"] = "That's right, there is finally new hope for the apocalypse.",
    ["没错，来，请坐下，然后将您的目光投向这群山……"] = "That's right, come, please sit down, and then cast your gaze toward these mountains...",
    ["没错，砍价不是耍赖，而是使用一些技巧进行谈判，最终达成交易。"] = "That's right, bargaining isn't being unreasonable, but using some techniques to negotiate and finally reach a deal.",
    ["没错，船上的东西味道不错，但个个没什么特色。"] = "That's right, the food on the ship tastes okay, but nothing is particularly special.",
    ["没错，警官，现在我们可以干干净净下班了！"] = "That's right, Officer, now we can get off work clean and tidy!",
    ["没错，贝儿小姐是属于我们所有人的女神，岂能容你染指。"] = "That's right, Miss Belle is the goddess who belongs to all of us, how can we allow you to lay a finger on her.",
    ["没错，越打越上瘾！来，切牌！"] = "That's right, the more you play, the more addicted you get! Come on, cut the cards!",
    ["没错，这就是我想要的人生，平平淡淡才是真。"] = "That's right, this is the life I want. A plain and simple life is the real deal.",
    ["没错，这是廷根的老牌餐厅了，不少周围的邻居都常常过来。走这儿也挺方便的。"] = "That's right, this is a long-established restaurant in Tingen, and many neighbors around often come here. It's quite convenient to walk this way.",
    ["没错，这正是非凡世界的非凡之处。"] = "That's right, this is the extraordinary nature of the Extraordinary World.",
    ["没错，那位摊主被女儿接去享受了，摊位连带着三只猫都转让给我。"] = "That's right, that stall owner was taken away by his daughter to enjoy life, and the stall along with three cats were transferred to me.",
    ["没错，那和之前一样，我骑车带你去。"] = "That's right, then just like before, I'll ride you there.",
    ["没错，邪神子嗣并没有停止孕育。"] = "That's right, the gestation of the evil god's offspring has not stopped.",
    ["没错，霍纳奇斯！你们知道吗，最最有趣的是，遗迹内没有发现这个国家的墓葬！这是为什么呢？"] = "Exactly, Hornacis! Do you know what the most interesting part is? No burials from this country have been found in the ruins! Why is that?",
    ["没问题"] = "No problem",
    ["没问题……可别拉得太好听了！"] = "No problem... just don't play too well!",
    ["没问题。"] = "No problem.",
    ["没问题。心理治疗还需要些时间，唤醒{{他|她}}之前，我会通知大家的。"] = "No problem. Psychotherapy will take some time. I will notify everyone before waking {{him|her}} up.",
    ["没问题。那可以允许我看看您的脚踏车吗？"] = "No problem. Can you allow me to look at your bicycle?",
    ["没问题！"] = "No problem!",
    ["没问题！我这就回去写报告！"] = "No problem! I'll go back and write the report right now!",
    ["没问题！算我们临时组队比赛怎么样？"] = "No problem! How about we form a temporary team for the competition?",
    ["没问题，也许你能有新发现。"] = "No problem, maybe you can have new discoveries.",
    ["没问题，交给我吧。"] = "No problem, leave it to me.",
    ["没问题，包在我身上。"] = "No problem, leave it to me.",
    ["没问题，喜欢您再来！"] = "No problem, come again if you like!",
    ["没问题，弗莱队长，我也许能发现一些新线索。"] = "No problem, Captain Frye. I might be able to find some new clues.",
    ["没问题，弗莱队长，我们现在就出发吧！"] = "No problem, Captain Frye, let's set off now!",
    ["没问题，我找找。"] = "No problem, let me look.",
    ["没问题，毕竟罗塞尔大帝说过——"] = "No problem. After all, Emperor Roselle once said—",
    ["没问题，玩得开心！"] = "No problem, have fun!",
    ["没问题，茱莉亚太太。"] = "No problem, Mrs. Julia.",
    ["没问题，请带路吧。"] = "No problem, please lead the way.",
    ["没问题，请问是什么场合用？"] = "No problem. May I ask what the occasion is?",
    ["没问题，距离很近，免费，五分钟回来，等我！"] = "No problem, it's very close, free of charge, back in five minutes, wait for me!",
    ["没问题，那么开始吧。"] = "No problem, then let's begin.",
