    ["河与海教堂的观景拍照留念：\n鲁恩最古老的教会之一在廷根的总部，风暴之主的信徒在此祷告。\n神明掌控着海洋与风暴，信徒推崇着勇气。\n唱诗班的歌颂声中，归来的水手们再度离去。"] = "Church of the River and Sea Sightseeing Photo: \nThe Tingen headquarters of one of the oldest churches in Loen, where followers of the Lord of Storms pray. \nThe God governs the sea and storms, and the believers revere courage. \nAmidst the hymns of the choir, the returning sailors depart once more.",
