    ["治疗形态释放战斗技能时，对治疗目标造成<Mark>6</>秒持续治疗，冷却<Mark>30</>秒。"] = "When releasing a combat skill in healing form, apply continuous healing to the target for <Mark>6</> seconds. Cooldown <Mark>30</> seconds.",
    ["治疗形态释放战斗技能时，神话生物有概率向周围目标发动持续治疗，治疗可扩散至多个目标，且效果期间受到的治疗效果增加<Mark>10%</>，效果持续<Mark>8</>秒。冷却<Mark>20</>秒。\n\n受神性影响，穿戴该装备时，<Mark>重塑出现的词条数上限增加1</>。"] = "When releasing combat skills in healing form, the Mythical Creature has a chance to launch continuous healing on nearby targets. The healing can spread to multiple targets, and healing effects received during the duration are increased by <Mark>10%</> for <Mark>8</> seconds. Cooldown <Mark>20</> seconds. \n\n Affected by divinity, when wearing this equipment, the upper limit of affixes appearing during <Mark>Reshaping increases by 1</>.",
    ["治疗形态释放战斗技能时，神话生物有概率向周围目标发动持续治疗，治疗可扩散至多个目标，且效果期间受到的治疗效果增加，效果持续<Mark>8</>秒。冷却<Mark>20</>秒。\n\n受神性影响，穿戴该装备时，<Mark>重塑出现的词条数上限增加1</>。"] = "When releasing a combat skill in healing form, the Mythical Creature has a chance to launch continuous healing on surrounding targets. The healing can spread to multiple targets, and the healing effect received is increased during the duration. Effect lasts <Mark>8</> seconds. Cooldown <Mark>20</> seconds. \n\n Affected by divinity, when wearing this equipment, <Mark>the maximum number of entries that can appear through reshaping increases by 1</>.",
