    ["沿两侧线路推进并攻占两侧石碑即可激活城门"] = "Advance along both lines and capture the stone tablets on both sides to activate the city gate",
    ["沿着声音寻找"] = "Follow the Sound to Search",
    ["沿着小路探索，找到神秘人的藏身之地"] = "Explore along the path to find the mysterious person's hideout",
    ["沿着房子顶上一路往前走，掉到水里就算输哦。"] = "Walk all the way along the roof of the house; if you fall into the water, you lose.",
    ["沿着楼梯下去，<P_Yellow>直走</>到尽头就是查尼斯门。中间十字路口<P_Yellow>左拐</>通向圣赛琳娜教堂和炼金室，<P_Yellow>往右</>是武器、材料和文献库，别走错了。"] = "Go down the stairs, <P_Yellow>go straight</> to the end and you will reach Chanis Gate. The intersection in the middle <P_Yellow>turn left</> leads to Saint Selena Cathedral and the Alchemy Room, <P_Yellow>to the right</> is the weapons, materials, and archives room, don't go the wrong way.",
    ["沿着玫瑰花瓣找找看吧。"] = "Let's follow the rose petals and look.",
    ["沿着路继续前进"] = "Continue along the path",
    ["沿路寻找猎人"] = "Search for hunters along the road",
    ["沿路径移动开始"] = "Start moving along the path",
    ["沿这条路<P_Yellow>直走</>就是查尼斯门，中间十字路口<P_Yellow>左拐</>通向圣赛琳娜教堂和炼金室，<P_Yellow>往右</>是武器、材料和文献库，别走错了。"] = "Go <P_Yellow>straight</> along this road to reach the Chanis Gate. At the intersection in the middle, <P_Yellow>turn left</> to reach Saint Selena Cathedral and the Alchemy Room, and <P_Yellow>to the right</> is the weapons, materials, and archives library. Don't go the wrong way.",
    ["沿这条路直走就是查尼斯门 希望邓恩队长别等急了"] = "Walk straight along this road to reach Chanis Gate. I hope Captain Dunn isn't waiting impatiently.",
    ["沿这条路直走就是查尼斯门。"] = "Go straight along this road and you'll be at Chanis Gate.",
    ["沿这条路直走就是查尼斯门，中间十字路口左拐通向圣赛琳娜教堂和炼金室，往右是武器、材料和文献库，别走错了。"] = "Go straight along this road and you'll reach the Chanis Gate. Turning left at the intersection in the middle leads to Saint Selena Cathedral and the alchemy room, while to the right are the weapons, materials, and archives. Don't go the wrong way.",
    ["沿这条路直走就是查尼斯门，希望邓恩队长别等急了。"] = "Walk straight along this road to reach Chanis Gate.",
