    ["波特一个人很难对付怨魂，快过去帮他吧！"] = "It's hard for Porter to deal with the wraith alone, hurry over and help him!",
    ["波特又躲到哪里去了？"] = "Where did Potter hide again?",
    ["波特总喜欢躲起来唱歌。"] = "Porter always likes to hide and sing.",
    ["波特总是喜欢躲起来唱歌。"] = "Porter always likes to hide away to sing.",
    ["波特的问题有些棘手，去问问戴里克导师吧，他经验丰富，应该知道如何处理。"] = "Porter's problem is a bit tricky; let's go ask Mentor Derrick. He is experienced and should know how to handle it.",
    ["波纹涌动，明快的金橙色破开滚滚热浪。水花绽放，夏日登场！"] = "Ripples surge, bright golden-orange breaks through the rolling heat. Splashes bloom, summer is here!",
