    ["注意"] = "Attention",
    ["注意!"] = "Attention!",
    ["注意事项"] = "Notes",
    ["注意事项是，<P_Yellow>保持好距离不要拉断灵性形成的连线</>，还有……"] = "The precautions are: <P_Yellow> keep a good distance and do not break the connection formed by spirituality </>, and also...",
    ["注意他转桨的动作——水花溅落半径永远控制在15寸内，我愿称之为“杰尼波纹”。"] = "Notice his oar-turning motion—the splash radius is always controlled within 15 inches. I would like to call it the 'Jeni Ripple'.",
    ["注意保持与失控者的距离！"] = "Be careful to maintain distance from the Out-of-Control person!",
    ["注意分散躲避毒爆！"] = "Pay attention to dispersing to dodge the poison bursts!",
    ["注意到3-888铁盒推镜头"] = "Notice 3-888 iron box push camera",
    ["注意到boss镜头"] = "Notice boss camera",
    ["注意到了"] = "Noticed",
    ["注意到休息室踩点"] = "Notice the checkpoint at the lounge",
    ["注意到保管箱镜头"] = "Notice the safe box camera",
    ["注意及时驱散暗光效果！"] = "Be sure to dispel the dark light effect in time!",
    ["注意右舷拍岸浪！"] = "Watch out for the surf on the starboard side!",
    ["注意唐尼"] = "Watch out for Donnie",
    ["注意安全！这位诗人……你使过铁锤吗？"] = "Be careful! This poet... have you ever used a hammer?",
    ["注意安抚"] = "Pay attention to Pacify",
    ["注意宾客的微表情，注意环境里的异常，注意所有“看起来不太对”的东西。"] = "Pay attention to the guests' micro-expressions, notice anomalies in the environment, and watch for anything that 'doesn't look quite right'.",
    ["注意射线旋转方向，及时跳跃躲避。"] = "Pay attention to the rotation direction of the ray and jump in time to avoid it.",
    ["注意戴着单片眼镜的邮差，他们或许都来自同一家邮递公司——黑鸦邮递。"] = "Beware of postmen wearing monocles; they might all come from the same delivery company—Black Raven Delivery.",
    ["注意拍子，一、二、三……"] = "Watch the beat, one, two, three...",
    ["注意更换承担伤害的队员！"] = "Remember to rotate the team members taking the damage!",
    ["注意杰森脚下生成的冰霜领域，"] = "Be careful of the Frost Area generated at Jason's feet.",
    ["注意根据小丑的表情辨别真假！"] = "Pay attention to the Clown's expression to distinguish the real from the fake!",
    ["注意治疗！"] = "Pay attention to healing!",
    ["注意洗脑光束污染！不要传递给其他人！"] = "Beware of the Brainwashing Beam corruption! Do not pass it to others!",
    ["注意猫猫"] = "Watch out for the cat",
    ["注意看，这个男人正在#Space3#。"] = "Watch closely, this man is #Space3#.",
    ["注意看，这里面困着一小片宇宙。"] = "Look closely, there is a small piece of the universe trapped inside.",
    ["注意自身邪恶印记<Highlight>腐蚀程度</>，避免累积至100%。"] = "Pay attention to your own Evil Mark <Highlight>corrosion level</> and avoid letting it accumulate to 100%.",
    ["注意观察安西娅的<Highlight>倒数计数</>，及时停止移动，并躲避场上蓝色蝴蝶。"] = "Pay attention to Anthea's <Highlight>countdown</>, stop moving in time, and dodge the blue butterflies on the field.",
    ["注意观察安西娅的<Highlight>倒数计数</>，及时停止移动，并躲避场上蓝色蝴蝶和玩偶冲刺路径，善用金色蝴蝶加速。"] = "Pay attention to Anthea's <Highlight>countdown</>, stop moving in time, and dodge the blue butterflies and the doll's dash path on the field. Make good use of the golden butterflies for acceleration.",
    ["注意观察真身所在位置，快速击破！"] = "Pay attention to observing the location of the true body and break it quickly!",
    ["注意观察领头狒狒的<Dungeon_Highlight>指令和舞步</>，做出正确的反应！"] = "Pay attention to the lead baboon's <Dungeon_Highlight> instructions and dance steps </>, and react correctly!",
    ["注意躲避2-049的视线之墙！"] = "Be careful to dodge 2-049's Wall of Sight!",
    ["注意躲避杰森发射的寒冰激流"] = "Be careful to dodge the Ice Torrent launched by Jason.",
    ["注意躲避连续追踪的<Reminder_Red>能量预警</>。"] = "Be careful to dodge the continuously tracking <Reminder_Red> energy warning </>.",
    ["注意躲避雪伦发射的蛛丝"] = "Be careful to dodge the spider silk fired by Sharon",
    ["注意躲避飞驰的列车!"] = "Be careful to dodge the speeding train!",
    ["注意连续躲避伤害。"] = "Pay attention to dodging damage continuously.",
    ["注意黛西手部灵性推镜头"] = "Pay attention to Daisy's hand spirituality zoom in",
    ["注意！冻结层数满10层后会无法行动！"] = "Attention! Once the Freeze stacks reach 10, you will be unable to move!",
    ["注意！快躲到场地中间处规避伤害！"] = "Attention! Quickly hide in the middle of the field to avoid damage!",
    ["注意！拥有雷电灵性时只能通过击败他人获得灵性！"] = "Attention! When possessing lightning spirituality, you can only obtain more spirituality by defeating others!",
    ["注意，不要跟丢了"] = "Pay attention, don't lose track.",
    ["注意，它有点跛足，身上可能带着一股酒味。"] = "Note, it has a slight limp and might smell of alcohol.",
    ["注意，这不是社交场合谈论天气的敷衍——"] = "Note, this is not a perfunctory social occasion talk about the weather—",
    ["注意，这里不仅有金币的馈赠，也有洛克埋藏得更深的陷阱。小心躲避。"] = "Note that there is not only the gift of gold coins here, but also traps buried deeper by Rock. Be careful to avoid them.",
    ["注意：区别与另外一个字段Delay（action开始之后，过了delay才开始攻击）"] = "Note: This is different from the other field Delay (the attack starts only after the delay following the action start).",
    ["注意：封印物需要靠近目标才能生效。"] = "Note: Sealed Artifacts need to be close to the target to take effect.",
    ["注意：脚下的音波指示了声音传来的方向。"] = "Note: The sound waves at your feet indicate the direction from which the sound is coming.",
    ["注意：该字段仅在初始和终止基准点一致的情况下生效"] = "Note: This field only takes effect when the initial and terminal benchmark points are the same.",
    ["注意：请做好准备再前往，循环空间一旦进入，中途退出将视为放弃，需从头开始。"] = "Note: Please be prepared before entering. Once you enter the loop space, exiting midway will be considered giving up, and you will have to start from the beginning.",
    ["注视"] = "Gaze",
    ["注视……存在盲点……"] = "Gaze... blind spot exists...",
    ["注视中"] = "Watching",
    ["注视从星空投来，大地将四分五裂，世间的一切都会不复存在。"] = "The gaze is cast from the starry sky, the earth will be torn apart, and everything in the world will cease to exist.",
    ["注视从星空投来，大地将四分五裂，为了集众人之力抵抗末日，塔罗学派成立。"] = "The gaze is cast from the starry sky, and the earth will be torn apart. In order to gather the strength of everyone to resist the apocalypse, the Tarot Club was established.",
    ["注视从星空投来，大地将四分五裂，为了集众人之力抵抗末日，塔罗学院成立。"] = "A gaze descends from the starry sky, and the earth will be torn asunder. To gather the strength of all to resist the apocalypse, the Tarot Academy was established.",
    ["注视标记buff"] = "Gaze Mark Buff",
    ["注视池塘"] = "Gaze at the Pond",
    ["注视消失了，只留下了一个……玩偶？"] = "The gaze has disappeared, leaving behind only... a doll?",
    ["注视着目标，握紧水晶，晶体内部会浮现出对方的面孔与身形。随着水晶的融化，渗入掌心，你便成了那个人。只是借来的面孔终究会消散，这层幻相不会陪你太久。"] = "Gazing at the target and gripping the crystal, the other person's face and figure will emerge inside the crystal. As the crystal melts and seeps into your palm, you become that person. But a borrowed face will eventually dissipate; this illusion will not stay with you for long.",
    ["注视表现buff"] = "Gaze Expression buff",
    ["注视视线"] = "Gaze line of sight",
    ["注：两种赛事奖励二选一"] = "Note: Choose one of the two tournament rewards",
    ["注：两者比赛奖励二选一"] = "Note: Choose one of two rewards for the competition",
    ["注：持续Action，不与Event搭配使用"] = "Note: Continuous Action, not used in combination with Event.",
    ["泪水与羊水有何不同？\n笑声与哭声有何区分？\n我的朋友，这位是梦想，也是悔恨，\n那里是前路，那里也是答案，\n备好墓志铭，再度启程之时已至。"] = "What is the difference between tears and amniotic fluid? \nWhat distinguishes laughter from crying? \nMy friend, this is a dream, and also a regret. \nThere is the path ahead, and there is also the answer. \nPrepare your epitaph; the time to set off again has arrived.",
