    ["洛克·金散播罪恶金币蛊惑大量<Disable>贫苦人</>，贫苦人受到蛊惑后<Disable>移速与攻击力大幅提升</>，疯狂追袭玩家。"] = "Rock King spreads sinful Gold Coins to bewitch a large number of <Disable>impoverished people</>. Once bewitched, the impoverished people's <Disable>movement speed and attack power increase significantly</>, and they will crazily chase the players.",
    ["洛克·金构筑<Disable>债务之护</>，若未及时击破将引发<Disable>全场爆炸</>，于此同时场边出现<Disable>金钱炮台</>。"] = "Rock King constructs a <Disable>Protection of Debt</>; if not destroyed in time, it will trigger a <Disable>field-wide explosion</>. At the same time, <Disable>Money Turrets</> will appear on the sidelines.",
    ["洛克·金跑了，但他留下的那套“斩杀线”还在运作。"] = "Rock King has run away, but the \"execution line\" system he left behind is still operating.",
    ["洛克工厂的工人，大多数住在这里。"] = "Most of the workers at the Rock factory live here.",
    ["洛克金氏资本集团 · 财务部 \n债务人：工厂区第7批安置人员\n\n住房租赁费：3镑12苏勒\n饮食供应费：2镑8苏勒\n通勤运输费 ：1镑4苏勒\n\n附加费用：\n滞纳金(累计89天)：2镑3苏勒\n行政管理费：15苏勒\n强制保险税：8苏勒\n\n应付总额：9镑10苏勒\n注：根据《底层劳动者债务清偿条例》，逾期未付者，将启动\"强制清退程序\"。"] = "Loen Gold Capital Group · Finance Department \n Debtor: Factory District 7th Batch Resettlement Personnel \n \n Housing Rental Fee: 3 pounds 12 shillings \n Food Supply Fee: 2 pounds 8 shillings \n Commuting Transport Fee: 1 pound 4 shillings \n \n Additional Fees: \n Late Fee (Accumulated 89 days): 2 pounds 3 shillings \n Administrative Management Fee: 15 shillings \n Compulsory Insurance Tax: 8 shillings \n \n Total Payable: 9 pounds 10 shillings \n Note: According to the \"Regulations on Debt Repayment for Low-Level Laborers,\" those who fail to pay on time will be subject to the \"Forced Eviction Procedure.\"",
