    ["洛耀、西迦、丽贝卡……不会都是靠得住吧……"] = "Luo Yao, Xiga, Rebecca... are they all reliable...",
    ["洛耀他们又把斗邪恶的纸牌带出了娱乐室！"] = "Luo Yao and the others brought the Evil-Fighting cards out of the recreation room again!",
    ["洛耀出镜"] = "Luo Yao appears on screen",
    ["洛耀在里面睡觉，她刚值完夜，需要休息。"] = "Luo Yao is sleeping inside; she just finished her night shift and needs to rest.",
    ["洛耀西迦丽贝卡……不会都是靠得住吧……"] = "Luo Yao, Xijia, Rebecca... can they really be relied upon...",
