    ["洛耀那个家伙真是的，从来不声不响，闷声发大财。"] = "That guy Luo Yao is really something, always quiet and making a fortune in silence.",
    ["洛耀，凯里，这里发生了什么？"] = "Luo Yao, Carey, what happened here?",
    ["洛耀：斗邪恶吗？二缺一。"] = "Luo Yao: Fighting evil? Two short of three.",
    ["洛葛仙妮·"] = "Roxanne ",
