    ["洛蒂蒂"] = "Lotiti",
    ["洛薇娅隐秘羁绊"] = "Lovia Secret Bond",
    ["洛薇雅"] = "Lovia",
    ["洛薇雅·蒂芙尼"] = "Lovia Tiffany",
    ["洛薇雅·蒂芙尼-1星"] = "Lovia Tiffany - 1 Star",
    ["洛薇雅·蒂芙尼-2星"] = "Lovia Tiffany - 2 Star",
    ["洛薇雅·蒂芙尼-3星"] = "Lovia Tiffany - 3 Star",
    ["洛薇雅·蒂芙尼的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Lovia Tiffany, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["洛薇雅不是一个喜欢解释的人。\n她有一头银灰的卷发，一双淡灰的眼眸，眉眼大气艳丽，却常年沉默。她是六人议事团最年轻的长老，本该前途无量，却选择了一条所有人都不理解的路——成为“牧羊人”，信仰那个被称为邪神的真实造物主。\n族人说她疯了，说她背叛了白银城，说她与黑暗为伍。她从不辩解，只是每次探索神弃之地时，依然冲在最前面；每次黑暗深处的危险降临，依然挡在队友身前。\n她很少说话，但每次议事团做出危险的决定，她总是第一个点头。每次需要有人深入黑暗探路，她总是第一个起身。\n在极光会的帮助下，她晋升为黑骑士。更强的力量，也意味着更深的误解。有人说她彻底堕落了，有人说她早已不是原来的洛薇雅。\n直到巨人王庭那一战。神圣的火光从天而降，灼烧她的血肉，泯灭她的灵魂。\n“我没有背叛白银城。”\n这是她留下的最后一句话。\n在永恒的黑暗里，不是每个人都能被阳光照耀。有的人只是用自己的方式寻找光，哪怕那光在别人眼里是罪恶。"] = "Lovia is not a person who likes to explain. \n She has a head of silver-gray curly hair, a pair of light gray eyes, and grand, beautiful features, yet she is often silent. She is the youngest elder of the Six-Member Council and should have had a bright future, but she chose a path that no one understood—becoming a \"Shepherd\" and believing in the True Creator, who is called an evil god. \n Her clansmen say she is crazy, that she betrayed the City of Silver, and that she walks with darkness. She never defends herself, but every time she explores the Forsaken Land of the Gods, she is still at the forefront; every time danger from the depths of darkness descends, she still stands in front of her teammates. \n She rarely speaks, but every time the Council makes a dangerous decision, she is always the first to nod. Every time someone needs to go deep into the darkness to scout, she is always the first to stand up. \n With the help of the Aurora Order, she was promoted to a Black Knight. Greater power also meant deeper misunderstanding. Some say she has completely fallen, and some say she is no longer the original Lovia. \n Until that battle at the Giant King's Court. Holy fire descended from the sky, burning her flesh and extinguishing her soul. \n \"I did not betray the City of Silver.\" \n This was the last sentence she left behind. \n In the eternal darkness, not everyone can be illuminated by the sun. Some people just find light in their own way, even if that light is seen as sin by others.",
    ["洛薇雅为施法者加持血肉阴影，5.5秒内对敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害。"] = "Loviya blesses the caster with Flesh Shadow, dealing spellfielddisc(*id) damage to enemies within 5.5 seconds.",
    ["洛薇雅为施法者加持血肉阴影，持续对敌方造成一定伤害。"] = "Loewe buffs the caster with Flesh Shadow, continuously dealing damage to enemies.",
    ["洛薇雅占位"] = "Lovia Placeholder",
    ["洛薇雅庆祝开服"] = "Lovia celebrates the server launch",
    ["洛薇雅的灵帮助玩家，提供一段爆发性移速加成"] = "Lovia's spirit assists the player, providing a burst of movement speed.",
    ["洛薇雅长老，听说您曾信仰真实造物主？"] = "Elder Lovia, I heard you once worshipped the True Creator?",
    ["洛薇雅长老，如果……能离开神弃之地，您最想做什么？"] = "Elder Lovia, if... you could leave the Forsaken Land of the Gods, what would you most want to do?",
    ["洛薇雅长老，您放牧的那个银骑士……能讲讲吗？"] = "Elder Lovia, that Silver Knight you herd... can you tell me about it?",
    ["洛薇雅长老，您还记得戴里克吗？"] = "Elder Lovia, do you still remember Derrick?",
    ["洛薇雅长老，白银城已经走出神弃之地了。现在的新白银城，阳光可以照进来了。"] = "Elder Lovia, the City of Silver has already left the Forsaken Land of the Gods. Now, in the New City of Silver, sunlight can shine in.",
    ["洛薇雅隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Lovia secret bond reward.",
