    ["活动暂未开启"] = "Event not yet started",
    ["活动期间内，七日誓约享受额外20%的誓约值加成。\n活动期间，两位誓约者可直接发起与誓约对象的转正，转为正式誓约。"] = "During the event, the seven-day covenant enjoys an additional 20% covenant value bonus. \n During the event, two covenant partners can directly initiate a formalization with their covenant partner to convert to a formal covenant.",
    ["活动未开启"] = "Event not active.",
    ["活动框架"] = "Event Framework",
    ["活动规则：\n1. 支付<Letter_Highlight>1苏勒</>即可获得挑战资格。\n2. 主办方将展示一枚<Letter_Highlight>“幸运蛋” </>，请仔细观察它的纹路、色泽与形态。\n3. 在规定时间内，从100枚鸡蛋中找出它——你就是赢家！\n\n最终胜者奖励：<Letter_Highlight>10000苏勒</>！\n比赛可以重复参与！下一个“万镑户”就是你！\n\n（每位参与者离场时均可获赠<Letter_Highlight>新鲜鸡蛋</>一枚，愿大地母神赐福于你。） "] = "Event Rules: \n1. Pay <Letter_Highlight>1 Soule</> to qualify for the challenge.\n2. The organizer will display a <Letter_Highlight>\"Lucky Egg\"</>; please observe its patterns, color, and shape carefully.\n3. Find it among 100 eggs within the allotted time—and you are the winner!\n\nFinal Winner's Reward: <Letter_Highlight>10,000 Soules</>!\nThe competition can be entered repeatedly! The next \"ten-thousand-pounder\" could be you!\n\n(Every participant will receive a <Letter_Highlight>fresh egg</> upon leaving. May the Earth Mother bless you.)",
    ["活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明活动说明"] = "Event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description event description",
    ["活动通知"] = "Event Notification",
    ["活动预告"] = "Event Preview",
    ["活化之力"] = "Activation Force",
    ["活化出逃？如果没有封印，它的力量足以毁灭一个国家，甚至整个世界。"] = "Activated and escaped? Without a seal, its power is enough to destroy a country, or even the entire world.",
    ["活化工坊"] = "Living Workshop",
    ["活化权杖"] = "Animated Scepter",
    ["活化权杖-普通"] = "Animated Scepter - Normal",
    ["活尸"] = "Zombie",
    ["活尸在周围召唤<Disable>随从</>。"] = "The Corpse summons <Disable>minions</> around it.",
    ["活尸数量更多了……稳住，我们身后是整个廷根市。"] = "The number of zombies is increasing... Hold steady; behind us is the entire city of Tingen.",
    ["活尸汲取月冕能量，进入狂暴阶段。"] = "The zombie absorbs the Moon Crown energy and enters a berserk phase.",
    ["活尸的气息涌过来了……我们先撤出去再说！"] = "The aura of living corpses is surging over... let's retreat first!",
    ["活尸突破了防线，廷根失守了……"] = "The zombies broke through the defense line; Tingen has fallen...",
    ["活尸还在不停地涌出……我们没法硬拼，只能跑！"] = "Zombies are still pouring out... We can't fight them head-on; we have to run!",
    ["活尸闪现到战场中心，持续点名<Disable>所有玩家</>，点名结束会从每个玩家头顶<Disable>掉落冰柱</>。"] = "The Corpse flashes to the center of the battlefield and continuously targets <Disable>all players</>. When the targeting ends, <Disable>ice pillars will fall</> from above each player's head.",
    ["活尸？在廷根？"] = "A zombie? In Tingen?",
    ["活着就不错了！"] = "Just being alive is good enough!",
    ["活着的传奇——罗塞尔大帝"] = "A Living Legend—Emperor Roselle",
    ["活着的意识也可以偷走？你真的只是邮差？"] = "You can even steal the consciousness of being alive? Are you really just a postman?",
    ["活着的时候它们能够游经王都，一路进入苏尼亚海浅水区繁衍生存……当然，这些朋友现在肯定不会那么有活力了，哈哈。"] = "When they were alive, they could swim through the royal capital and all the way into the shallow waters of the Sonia Sea to breed and survive... Of course, these friends definitely aren't that energetic now, haha.",
    ["活着的时候，我的样貌极其丑陋，不得不躲在钟楼里，生怕一露面就吓着别人。"] = "When I was alive, my appearance was extremely ugly, and I had to hide in the bell tower, afraid that I would scare others if I showed my face.",
