    ["海上有什么新消息？"] = "Any new news from the sea?",
    ["海上没有蘑菇，但这不妨碍他成为最执着的采集者。"] = "There are no mushrooms on the sea, but that does not stop him from being the most persistent collector.",
    ["海上的"] = "of the Sea",
    ["海上的事，要看风暴之主的心情！"] = "Matters at sea depend on the mood of the Lord of Storms!",
    ["海东"] = "Haidong",
