    ["海伍德"] = "Haywood",
    ["海伦"] = "Helen",
    ["海伦·"] = "Helen ",
    ["海伦……娜……"] = "Helena...",
    ["海伦娜"] = "Helena",
    ["海伦娜·"] = "Helena ",
    ["海伦娜·威瑟尔有许多身份和过往。\n在她短暂的一生中，曾是热爱泥土的“怪”小姐、可怜的孤女、无情的死神、成功复仇的传奇……\n在她短暂成为善良和慷慨的母亲后，命运依旧热衷于戏耍她，短暂赐予她幸福，又永恒地剥夺。\n最终，看到儿子身染重病、即将丧命时，她终于下定决心。\n“我不能再失去……任何人了。”\n她要向命运复仇。\n哪怕为此牺牲一切，她的爱，她的血，她曾引以为傲的理智。\n只要种子重新长成鲜活的苹果。\n命运，就无法完全吞没她。"] = "Helena Wetherell had many identities and pasts. \n In her short life, she had been a \"strange\" lady who loved the soil, a poor orphan, a ruthless Death, a legendary figure who successfully took revenge... \n After she briefly became a kind and generous mother, fate still loved to tease her, briefly bestowing happiness upon her, only to take it away eternally. \n Finally, seeing her son suffering from a serious illness and about to die, she finally made up her mind. \n \"I cannot lose... anyone else.\" \n She wanted to take revenge on fate. \n Even if she had to sacrifice everything, her love, her blood, the reason she was once proud of. \n As long as the seed grew into a fresh apple again. \n Fate would not be able to swallow her completely.",
    ["海伦娜·威瑟尔，没落的小贵族长女。"] = "Helena Wetherell, the eldest daughter of a fallen minor noble family.",
    ["海伦娜·威瑟尔，没落贵族之女，苹果庄园里的泥土小姐。政敌血洗家族那天，苹果落了一地，弟弟倒在血泊里。她在濒死之际向未知存在呼救，获得了回应与新生。此后，她挥舞镰刀，将仇敌一一收割。复仇耗尽了她的心神，濒临失控时，她遇见了艾弗利子爵。他们相爱，结婚，在废墟上重建了五月庄园，可好景不长，子爵与小子爵相继患病……\n“我的孩子，别怕……母亲会带来新生……”"] = "Helena Wetherell, daughter of a fallen noble family, the 'Lady of the Soil' in Apple Manor. On the day political enemies bloodied her family, apples fell all over the ground, and her younger brother fell in a pool of blood. At the brink of death, she called out to an unknown existence for help, receiving a response and a new life. Since then, she has wielded a scythe, harvesting her enemies one by one. Revenge exhausted her spirit, and as she neared a loss of control, she met Viscount Avery. They fell in love, married, and rebuilt May Manor on the ruins, but it did not last long; the Viscount and the young Viscount fell ill one after another... \n \"My child, do not be afraid... Mother will bring new life...\"",
    ["海切尔"] = "Hatcher",
