    ["海岸线餐厅位于金梧桐区，主营南方风味菜，是经常上报纸的知名餐厅。"] = "Coastline Restaurant is located in the Golden Indus District, specializing in southern-style dishes, and is a well-known restaurant that often appears in newspapers.",
