    ["消耗3点太阳能量凝聚巨锤，以千钧之力向前方砸下，对范围内的敌人造成大量伤害。烈阳状态下得到强化，攻击范围和伤害提升。"] = "Consume 3 points of Solar Energy to condense a giant hammer, smashing it down with immense force to deal massive damage to enemies in the area. Strengthened in the Blazing Sun state, with increased attack range and damage.",
