    ["淡紫色的花朵搭配甜面包和咖啡，太有生活了。"] = "Light purple flowers paired with sweet bread and coffee—this is the life.",
    ["淡金色的发丝编成花朵，簇拥着一颗浑圆温润的珍珠，犹如送给情人的表白花束。"] = "Pale golden hair woven into flowers, surrounding a round and warm pearl, like a bouquet of confession given to a lover.",
    ["淡金色的酒液气泡绵密，香气迷人。只有高级晚宴的水晶杯配得上它。"] = "The pale golden liquor has dense bubbles and a charming aroma. Only a crystal glass from a high-end banquet is worthy of it.",
