    ["深入廷根"] = "Deep into Tingen",
    ["深入潜意识，见人之最真实的恐惧、最本能的欲望。"] = "Delve deep into the subconscious to see one's truest fears and most instinctive desires.",
    ["深入藏在廷根的罪恶"] = "Delve deep into the sins hidden in Tingen.",
    ["深入超凡"] = "Deep into the Extraordinary",
    ["深入遗迹"] = "Go deep into the ruins",
    ["深入非凡世界，探索时代浪潮下人物的背后故事，感受命运与神秘的交织。"] = "Delve into the Extraordinary World, explore the backstories of characters caught in the tides of the era, and feel the intertwining of fate and mystery.",
    ["深切之爱。与好友赠礼功能绑定，本版本不进行投放和使用。"] = "Deep Love. Bound to the friend gifting function; not released or usable in this version.",
    ["深受成功人士的喜爱。卸下一天的疲惫后，开着它在街头漫行，是他们犒赏自己的方式。"] = "Deeply loved by successful individuals. After shedding the fatigue of the day, driving it through the streets is their way of rewarding themselves.",
    ["深吸口气"] = "Take a deep breath",
    ["深吸口气，平静安宁。（一次仅可携带3朵）"] = "Take a deep breath, calm and peaceful. (Can only carry 3 at a time)",
    ["深呼吸做好准备"] = "Take a deep breath and prepare",
    ["深呼吸，深呼吸！这世界根本没有鬼，都是骗人的。"] = "Deep breath, deep breath! There are no ghosts in this world, it's all a lie.",
    ["深圳"] = "Shenzhen",
    ["深夜"] = "Late Night",
    ["深夜折返拿地图又遇开膛手的巡员"] = "The patrol officer who returned late at night to get a map and encountered the Ripper",
    ["深夜的街道上，一个年轻人坐在路灯下，眼神空洞，显然已经很久没有好好睡过一觉了。"] = "On the street in the dead of night, a young man sat under a streetlight with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["深寿龟类核心器官，脉动中凝聚着耐性与多角感知。"] = "A core organ of a long-lived turtle, with patience and multi-angle perception condensed in its pulsation.",
