    ["源自浩瀚星空"] = "Originating from the vast starry sky",
    ["源自灵界生物的蜕皮，在月光下闪耀着淡淡的辉光。"] = "Molted skin from a Spirit World creature, shining with a faint glow under the moonlight.",
    ["源自第四纪古战场的历史投影<Highlight>猎龙之城</>。\n当<Highlight>黑皇帝</>再度归来时，<Highlight>夜皇</>在神灵帮助下转为审判者，<Highlight>血皇帝</>以半疯的代价强行转为红祭司，远在南大陆积积蓄力量的<Highlight>冥皇</>也发起了死神的号角。四皇齐聚，只有一人能够成为最后的赢家，一场足以改变世界局势的战争开始了。\n虽然第四纪的四皇之战已淹没在历史中，但强大的能量依旧残留在那片古战场上，于特定时间整个战场将被短暂活化。每次激活战场都将经历一次全新洗牌，俱乐部将被随机分配为四皇中的一个势力，参与这场来自遥远第四纪的战役。"] = "A historical projection of the ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch, the <Highlight>City of Dragon Hunting</>.\n When the <Highlight>Black Emperor</> returned, the <Highlight>Night Emperor</> turned into a Justiciar with the help of a god, the <Highlight>Blood Emperor</> forcibly turned into a Red Priest at the cost of becoming half-mad, and the <Highlight>Underworld Emperor</>, who had been accumulating power in the Southern Continent, also sounded the horn of the Death god. With the four emperors gathered, only one could be the final winner, and a war capable of changing the world's situation began.\n Although the War of the Four Emperors of the Fourth Epoch has been buried in history, powerful energy remains on that ancient battlefield, and the entire battlefield is briefly reactivated at specific times. Each activation of the battlefield triggers a new shuffle, and clubs are randomly assigned to one of the four imperial factions to participate in this battle from the distant Fourth Epoch.",
