    ["漂亮的"] = "Beautiful",
    ["漂亮的小姐，老维托能帮你做些什么？"] = "Beautiful lady, what can old Vito do for you?",
    ["漂亮的狸花猫，眼睛像晴朗的夜空一样纯粹。"] = "A beautiful tabby cat with eyes as pure as the clear night sky.",
    ["漂亮的裙子、新鲜的花朵、好用的擀面杖……带给妈妈，妈妈很喜欢。"] = "Beautiful dresses, fresh flowers, useful rolling pins... I bring them to Mom, and Mom likes them very much.",
    ["漂亮的颜色和神奇的名字能让酒卖得更贵，我们老板就是靠包装吸引有钱人过来的。"] = "Beautiful colors and magical names make wine sell for more; our boss relies on packaging to attract wealthy people.",
    ["漂亮的鲜花！早上刚采摘的鲜花！"] = "Beautiful flowers! Flowers picked this morning!",
    ["漂亮的鸟儿们，会来给我唱好听的歌，把我叫醒……今天约好要介绍尤朵拉认识它们，但鸟儿们没有来。"] = "Pretty birds will come to sing me beautiful songs and wake me up... I had an appointment today to introduce Yodora to them, but the birds didn't come.",
    ["漂泊的旅人会寻到归处，真诚的心灵将彼此为伴。"] = "Wandering travelers will find a home, and sincere hearts will accompany each other.",
