    ["演出谢幕后，丽贝卡走到了台前"] = "After the curtain call, Rebecca walked to the front of the stage",
    ["演出还有几分钟就要开场了，没有主演可怎么办？愤怒的观众一定不会放过我的。"] = "The performance is about to start in a few minutes. What should I do without a lead actor? The angry audience will definitely not let me off.",
