    ["漕"] = "Cao",
    ["漫山的雪，也许今天是第二天，也许是第三天？\n我找不到尼尔了，营地也不见了。\n东西都没了，还好我在身上放了些食物……\n\n物资\n面包大约三分之一份\n糖3颗\n水半瓶"] = "Snow-covered mountains, perhaps today is the second day, or maybe the third? \n I cannot find Neil, and the camp is gone. \n Everything is gone, fortunately I kept some food on me... \n \n Supplies \n Bread about one-third portion \n Sugar 3 pieces \n Water half bottle",
    ["漫忆请柬"] = "Memory Invitation",
    ["漫步"] = "Stroll",
    ["漫游"] = "Roaming",
    ["漫游·恢复"] = "Roaming - Recovery",
    ["漫游与猫的眷顾，让你的话语似乎总能牵动命运的丝线。当你尝试说服、安抚或引导时，言辞间自然附着一份令人信服的命运质感。<Talent>基于【魅力】的检定时，投骰结果+1</>。"] = "Roaming and the favor of cats make your words seem to always be able to pull the threads of fate. When you try to persuade, pacify, or guide, your words naturally carry a convincing quality of fate. <Talent>When performing a check based on 【Charm】, dice result +1</>.",
    ["漫游之匙"] = "Key of Roaming",
