    ["漫游星空的旅行者 黄黑之王的眷属 记录世界的法师"] = "Traveler of the starry sky, attendant of the King of Yellow and Black, mage who records the world.",
    ["漫游星空的旅行者，黄黑之王的眷属，记录世界的法师。"] = "A traveler roaming the stars, a retainer of the King of Yellow and Black, a mage recording the world.",
    ["漫游星空的旅行者，黄黑之王的眷者，记录世界的法师。"] = "Traveler of the starry sky, attendant of the King of Yellow and Black, mage who records the world.",
    ["漫游期间，所有技能冷却时间恢复速度加快100%，每秒回复20%生命值。"] = "During Roaming, the cooldown recovery speed of all skills is increased by 100%, and 20% of your HP is restored per second.",
    ["漫游期间，所有技能冷却时间速度恢复加快百分之100%，每秒回复百分之10%生命值。"] = "During Roaming, all skill Cooldown recovery speed is increased by 100%, and 10% of Health is restored per second.",
    ["漫游的契机遍布廷根，若想节省心力，您也可以<P_Yellow>每日</>在我这里领取<P_Yellow>三项随机的漫游</>任务，领取后在任务栏的<P_Yellow>漫游分页</>查看。"] = "Opportunities for roaming are all over Tingen. If you want to save effort, you can also <P_Yellow>daily</> receive <P_Yellow>three random roaming</> Quests from me. After receiving them, check the <P_Yellow>Roaming tab</> in the Quest menu.",
