    ["漫游者铭刻大于200层后，会周期性对范围内目标落下闪电，并附加1层层叠印记。"] = "When Wanderer Inscription exceeds 200 stacks, lightning will periodically strike targets in range and apply 1 stack of Stacked Mark.",
