    ["激动？幸福？紧张？我无法用任何语言和文字描述我现在的心情。\n我和尼尔登顶了！\n幸运的尼尔找到了一颗琥珀，这将作为他的登顶纪念物。\n我也学着他在山上找，不过没什么特别的东西，我将山顶的雪混杂了一些土装到了瓶子里。\n\n下山物资：\n面包2份\n肉干和肉肠1份\n糖1罐\n黄油1块\n水2瓶"] = "Excited? Happy? Nervous? I cannot describe my current mood in any language or words. \nNeil and I reached the summit!\n Lucky Neil found an amber, which will serve as his summit souvenir. \n I tried to find something on the mountain like him, but there was nothing special, so I mixed some soil with the snow from the summit and put it in a bottle. \n\n Supplies for the descent: \n Bread 2 portions \n Jerky and sausage 1 portion \n Sugar 1 jar \n Butter 1 block \n Water 2 bottles",
