    ["火柴盒上有微弱的灵性波动，难道是普通人卷入了非凡事件？"] = "There is a faint trace of spirituality on the matchbox. Could it be that an ordinary person was dragged into an Extraordinary event?",
    ["火柴？您去旁边的杂货摊问问吧。"] = "Matches? Go ask at the grocery stall next door.",
    ["火柴？没有。新鲜的牛肉，买两块吧？"] = "Matches? No. Fresh beef, want to buy two pieces?",
    ["火法轰炸"] = "Fire Bombardment",
    ["火法轰炸-脱手结算"] = "Fire Bombardment - Auto-Resolve",
    ["火漆印章的颜色代表紧急程度，红色是日常问候，黑色是重要事务，紫色……通常意味着婚礼请柬或讣告。"] = "The color of the wax seal represents the urgency. Red is for daily greetings, black is for important matters, and purple... usually means a wedding invitation or an obituary.",
    ["火炉"] = "Fireplace",
    ["火炉发出劈里啪啦的声音，燃得可旺盛哩！"] = "The stove crackled, burning so vigorously!",
    ["火炉火焰"] = "Stove flame",
    ["火炬燃烧的圣庭中，晨曦逐渐吞噬阴霾——光就是一切的意义。"] = "In the sanctuary where torches burn, the dawn gradually swallows the haze—light is the meaning of everything.",
    ["火炮支援buff1"] = "Artillery Support buff 1",
    ["火炮支援buff2"] = "Artillery Support buff 2",
