    ["火焰2"] = "Flame 2",
    ["火焰2Trigger"] = "Flame 2 Trigger",
    ["火焰3"] = "Flame 3",
    ["火焰buff"] = "Fire buff",
    ["火焰吞没镜厅，邦尼的残影来不及留下任何诅咒。她的笑声在空气中戛然而止——仿佛从未存在过。但你记得，她还会回来的。"] = "Flames engulfed the Mirror Hall, Bonnie's afterimage had no time to leave any curse. Her laughter stopped abruptly in the air—as if it had never existed. But you remember, she will come back.",
    ["火焰在寂夜中无声燃烧，虽然身为火焰，但那种冷冽却透入灵魂深处。它用沉默与速度，书写着自己独特的宣言。"] = "Flame burns silently in the quiet night; though it is fire, its coldness penetrates deep into the soul. It writes its own unique manifesto with silence and speed.",
    ["火焰在引擎中发出阵阵低鸣，划破夜色，如同一道蓄意出现的幻影。廷根夜晚中流传着这样一句话：雾天，大雨，无人的街头，魅夜幽灵将出现于此。"] = "Flames emit low hums in the engine, cutting through the night like a deliberate phantom. A saying circulates in Tingen's nights: On foggy days, in heavy rain, on deserted streets, the Phantom of the Night will appear.",
    ["火焰无需追随纷争，祂降临，纷争便随祂而来。铁与血自此有了名字。"] = "The flame does not need to follow strife; He descends, and strife follows Him. Iron and blood have had a name ever since.",
    ["火焰条带"] = "Flame Strip",
    ["火焰瓶"] = "Molotov Cocktail",
    ["火焰跳动的节奏肯定有某种寓意，为什么没人写过解读的专著呢？"] = "The rhythm of the dancing flames must have some meaning, why has no one written a monograph interpreting it?",
    ["火焰跳跃"] = "Flame Jump",
    ["火焰跳跃一"] = "Flame Jump 1",
    ["火焰跳跃也会获得3张命运牌，并且获得一点卡牌能量。"] = "Using Flame Jump also grants 3 fate cards and one point of Card Energy.",
    ["火焰跳跃的伤害半径增加5米，伤害基础值增加400%。"] = "Flame Jump's damage radius increased by 5 meters, and base damage increased by 400%.",
    ["火焰跳跃的冷却时间降低18秒，可对锁定目标进行释放，且不再具有二段。"] = "Flame Jump Cooldown reduced by 18 seconds, can be cast on locked targets, and no longer has a second stage.",
