    ["灯光下，镜片折射出异样的光泽——那不是普通玻璃，而是一种特殊水晶磨制而成，内部似乎有极细微的灵性流转。"] = "Under the light, the lenses refracted an unusual luster—they were not ordinary glass, but ground from a special crystal, with extremely subtle spirituality flowing inside.",
    ["灯光亮起，演出恢复正常。"] = "The lights come on, and the performance returns to normal.",
