    ["灯光熄灭，演出再次停下。"] = "The lights go out, and the performance stops again.",
    ["灯光熄灭，演出再次停止，台下出现填词的句子。"] = "The lights go out, the performance stops again, and the lyrics appear below the stage.",
    ["灯光突然熄灭，其他演员们一动不动。"] = "The lights suddenly went out, and the other actors remained motionless.",
    ["灯光颜色"] = "Light Color",
    ["灯光（桌子）"] = "Light (Table)",
    ["灯具"] = "Lighting",
    ["灯灭了，演员也不动了……"] = "The light is out, and the actor is not moving either...",
    ["灯神并非慷慨无私，当愿望达成后，他也会拿走相应的代价：\n<Red>年华骤逝</>：青春永驻结束时，扣除*f**剩余生命值。\n<Red>情义透支</>：同心之援返还冷却的普通技能，再度进入冷却时，额外触发3秒冷却时间。\n<Red>强弩之末</>：背水一击结束后的30秒内，buffdisc(*id)\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "The Genie is not generous or selfless; once a wish is fulfilled, he will also take a corresponding price: \n<Red>Fleeting Youth</>: When Eternal Youth ends, deduct *f** of your remaining Health. \n<Red>Overdrawn Bonds</>: When a basic skill whose Cooldown was refunded by Concentric Aid enters Cooldown again, it triggers an additional 3-second Cooldown. \n<Red>End of the Tether</>: Within 30 seconds after Last Stand ends, buffdisc(*id). \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["灯神并非慷慨无私，当愿望达成后，他也会拿走相应的代价：\n<Red>年华骤逝</>：青春永驻结束时，扣除*f**剩余生命值。\n<Red>情义透支</>：同心之援返还冷却的职业战斗技能，再度进入冷却时，额外触发3秒冷却时间。\n<Red>强弩之末</>：背水一击结束后的30秒内，buffdisc(*id)\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "The Genie is not generous or selfless; once a wish is granted, he will also take the corresponding price: \n<Red>Fleeting Youth</>: When Eternal Youth ends, deduct *f** of remaining HP. \n<Red>Overdrawn Affection</>: Class combat skills whose cooldowns were refunded by Heartfelt Aid will trigger an additional 3-second cooldown when they enter cooldown again. \n<Red>Last Stand</>: Within 30 seconds after Last Stand ends, buffdisc(*id)\n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
