    ["灵性击退"] = "Spirituality Knockback",
    ["灵性可以通过完成每日占卜和自然恢复获得，可用于扮演玩法中获取奖励。\n灵性达到上限后将不再自然恢复，但仍可通过每日占卜获取。\n神秘学的主流领域将每个人非肉体的部分分为四层，最核心叫‘精神体’，也就是每个人最根本的灵性，万物有灵派认为，凡是生物都有灵性，都有精神体。"] = "Spirituality can be obtained by completing daily divination and natural recovery, and can be used to earn rewards in Acting gameplay. \n Once spirituality reaches its limit, it will no longer recover naturally, but can still be obtained through daily divination. \n The mainstream field of mysticism divides the non-physical part of everyone into four layers. The most core is called the 'Spirit Body,' which is the fundamental spirituality of everyone. The School of All Things Have Spirits believes that all living beings have spirituality and a spirit body.",
