    ["灵摆占卜ID"] = "Pendulum Divination ID",
    ["灵摆占卜中"] = "Pendulum Divination in Progress",
    ["灵摆占卜她的下落时，除了金秋湖，还有一个地方有强烈反应。"] = "When I used Pendulum Divination to find her whereabouts, besides Golden Autumn Lake, there was another place that had a strong reaction.",
