    ["灵摆占卜，但我需要你未婚夫的名字、出发时间。"] = "Pendulum divination, but I need your fiancé's name and departure time.",
    ["灵摆呈顺时针转动……房间内存在<P_Yellow>超凡因素导致的危险</>！"] = "The pendulum is rotating clockwise... there is danger caused by <P_Yellow>extraordinary factors</> in the room!",
    ["灵摆在金秋湖和霍纳奇斯雪山上都有强烈反应……"] = "The pendulum reacts strongly to both Golden Autumn Lake and Hornacis Snowy Mountain...",
    ["灵摆在顺时针旋转……看来我猜得没错。"] = "The pendulum is rotating clockwise... it seems my guess was correct.",
    ["灵摆朝逆时针转动，表示错误。"] = "A counterclockwise rotation indicates an incorrect answer.",
    ["灵摆朝顺时针转动，表示正确。"] = "A clockwise rotation indicates a correct answer.",
    ["灵摆模型"] = "Pendulum Model",
    ["灵摆法和梦境占卜。灵摆适合快速判断是非，梦境占卜则能提供更详细的信息。"] = "Pendulum dowsing and dream divination. The pendulum is suitable for quick judgments of right and wrong, while dream divination can provide more detailed information.",
    ["灵摆纹丝不动，命运此刻以沉默回应%s——或是时机未至，或是有所干扰，答案尚未浮现。"] = "The pendulum remains motionless; fate responds with silence to %s at this moment—either the time is not yet ripe, or there is some interference, and the answer has yet to emerge.",
    ["灵摆转动的幅度越来越大，应该不远了。"] = "The pendulum is swinging with increasing amplitude; it shouldn't be far now.",
    ["灵摆逆时针快速"] = "Pendulum Counter-Clockwise Fast",
    ["灵摆逆时针快速转动，命运向%s发出了清晰的警示。前方暗流涌动，务必多加留意！"] = "The pendulum rotates rapidly counter-clockwise; fate has issued a clear warning to %s. There are undercurrents ahead, so be sure to stay vigilant!",
    ["灵摆逆时针慢速"] = "Pendulum Counter-Clockwise Slow",
    ["灵摆逆时针缓缓转动，命运隐约向%s透露出潜在的阻力。尚在可控范围之内，但不可掉以轻心。"] = "The pendulum rotates slowly counter-clockwise; fate vaguely reveals potential resistance to %s. It is still within a controllable range, but do not let your guard down.",
    ["灵摆逆时针转动，不是右面，看起来在左面的桌子上。"] = "The pendulum rotates counter-clockwise, not on the right, it looks like it's on the table on the left.",
    ["灵摆逆时针转动，不是左面，看起来在右面的桌子上。"] = "The pendulum rotates counter-clockwise, not on the left, it looks like it's on the table on the right.",
    ["灵摆逆时针转动，不是左面，看起来就在右面的桌子上了。"] = "The pendulum rotates counter-clockwise, not on the left, it looks like it's on the table on the right.",
    ["灵摆镜头"] = "Pendulum Camera",
    ["灵摆顺时针快速"] = "Pendulum Clockwise Fast",
    ["灵摆顺时针快速转动，命运为%s揭示了极为肯定的答案。愿此行顺利！"] = "The pendulum rotates rapidly clockwise; fate reveals a very definite answer for %s. May your journey be smooth!",
    ["灵摆顺时针慢速"] = "Pendulum Clockwise Slow",
    ["灵摆顺时针缓缓转动，命运示意%s前路平稳，趋势向好，但仍需警惕变数。"] = "The pendulum rotates slowly clockwise; fate indicates that the path ahead for %s is stable and the trend is positive, but one must still be wary of variables.",
    ["灵摆顺时针转动，在左面的桌子上！"] = "The pendulum rotates clockwise, it's on the table on the left!",
    ["灵摆顺时针转动，旋转幅度较大，看来左边是正确的。去烟囱口告诉道奇吧。"] = "The pendulum is rotating clockwise with a wide swing. It seems the left side is correct. I should go to the chimney opening and tell Dodge.",
    ["灵摆顺时针转动，是右面的桌子！"] = "The pendulum rotates clockwise, it's the table on the right!",
    ["灵摆顺时针转动，是右面！就在这个桌子上了。"] = "The pendulum rotates clockwise, it's the right side! It's on this table.",
    ["灵摆顺行徐缓，%s趋势向好，仍藏变数。"] = "The pendulum swings forward slowly; the %s trend is favorable, yet variables remain hidden.",
