    ["炽热如焰，恒久如石，指间方寸，诺言永恒。%s为%s赠送了%s×%d，镌刻岁月的誓言，相伴每一个朝暮。"] = "Burning like flame, enduring like stone, within the square inch of fingertips, the promise is eternal. %s gifted %s with %s×%d, engraving the vows of time, accompanying every dawn and dusk.",
    ["炽热如焰，恒久如石，指间方寸，诺言永恒。{{player.name}}为{{targetPlayer.name}}赠送了{{item.count}}枚{{item.name}}，镌刻岁月的誓言，相伴每一个朝暮。"] = "Hot as flame, constant as stone, a square inch between fingers, a promise eternal. {{player.name}} gifted {{targetPlayer.name}} {{item.count}} {{item.name}}, an oath engraved in time, to accompany every dawn and dusk.",
