    ["烈阳状态期间，无暗之枪必定对敌方触发无暗，无暗触发时伤害基础值的提高量增长至50%。"] = "During the Blazing Sun state, Unshadowed Spear is guaranteed to trigger Unshadowed against enemies, and the base damage increase upon triggering Unshadowed grows to 50%.",
    ["烈阳状态期间，自身伤害加深和伤害减免提升20%。"] = "During the Blazing Sun state, your Damage Boost and Damage Reduction are increased by 20%.",
