    ["烈阳：\n  - 期间能量获取效率提升\n  - 期间移动速度加快"] = "Blazing Sun: \n - Energy acquisition efficiency increased during duration \n - Movement speed increased during duration",
    ["烈阳：\n  - 烈阳斩、无暗之枪和惩戒得到强化\n  - 期间能量获取效率提升\n  - 期间移动速度加快"] = "Blazing Sun: \n - Blazing Sun Slash, Unshadowed Spear, and Punishment are strengthened \n - Energy acquisition efficiency increased during duration \n - Movement speed increased during duration",
    ["烈阳：半径4.5米的扇形区域"] = "Blazing Sun: Fan-shaped area with a radius of 4.5 meters",
