    ["烙印装备"] = "Brand equipment",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将35装等金色品质烙印鞋靴<Highlight>温暖的皮靴</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个往昔碎片。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 35 Gear Level gold quality brand footwear <Highlight>Warm Leather Boots</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>1</> Fragment of the Past upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将45装等金色品质烙印指环<Highlight>机械的核心</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个时光沙砾。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 45 Gear Level gold quality brand ring <Highlight>Core of the Machine</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>1</> Time Sand upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将55装等金色品质烙印指环<Highlight>滞涩之戒</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个灵性鸣石。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 55 Gear Level gold quality brand ring <Highlight>Ring of Stagnation</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>3</> Spirituality Resonance Stones upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将60装等金色品质烙印帽子<Highlight>躁动之刺</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个历史锚点。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 60 Gear Level gold quality brand hat <Highlight>Thorn of Restlessness</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>3</> Historical Anchors upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将60装等金色品质烙印护符<Highlight>鲜红余烬</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个记忆结晶。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 60 Gear Level gold quality brand amulet <Highlight>Bright Red Ember</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>1</> Memory Crystal upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将60装等金色品质烙印披风<Highlight>弄臣之谑</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个非凡烙印。\n需先拥有升级前的烙印装备，拥有后点击<Highlight>装等提升</>按钮进行升级。使用该道具可快捷跳转至升级前的烙印装备。"] = "Brand Equipment upgrade item.\nCan upgrade the 60 Gear Level gold quality brand cloak <Highlight>Jester's Mockery</> to <Highlight>62 Gear Level orange quality</>, consuming <Highlight>3</> Beyonder Brands upon upgrade.\nYou must first possess the pre-upgrade brand equipment; once possessed, click the <Highlight>Gear Level Increase</> button to upgrade. Using this item allows for a quick jump to the pre-upgrade brand equipment.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>弄臣之谑</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个非凡烙印。"] = "Imprint equipment upgrade item. \nCan upgrade <Highlight>Jester's Jest</> to <Highlight>Level 62 orange quality</>. Consumes <Highlight>3</> Beyonder Imprints when upgrading.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>温暖的皮靴</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个往昔碎片。"] = "Imprint equipment upgrade item. \nCan upgrade <Highlight>Warm Leather Boots</> to <Highlight>Level 62 orange quality</>. Consumes <Highlight>1</> Fragment of the Past when upgrading.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>滞涩之戒</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个灵性鸣石。"] = "Imprint equipment upgrade item. \nCan upgrade <Highlight>Ring of Stagnation</> to <Highlight>Level 62 orange quality</>. Consumes <Highlight>3</> Spirituality Resonance Stones when upgrading.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>躁动之刺</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>3</>个历史锚点。"] = "Imprint equipment upgrade item. \nCan upgrade <Highlight>Restless Thorn</> to <Highlight>Level 62 orange quality</>. Consumes <Highlight>3</> Historical Anchors when upgrading.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>鲜红余烬</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个记忆结晶。"] = "Brand equipment upgrade item. \n can upgrade <Highlight> Crimson Ember </> to <Highlight> Level 62 Orange Quality </>, consuming <Highlight> 1 </> Memory Crystal upon upgrade.",
    ["烙印装备升级道具。\n可将<Highlight>龙辉指环</>提升至<Highlight>62装等橙色品质</>，提升时消耗<Highlight>1</>个时光沙砾。"] = "Imprint equipment upgrade item. \nCan upgrade <Highlight>Dragon Glory Ring</> to <Highlight>Level 62 orange quality</>. Consumes <Highlight>1</> Time Sand when upgrading.",
