    ["然后 然后他就变成了车轮 哈哈 想想就好笑"] = "And then, and then he turned into a wheel. Haha, it's funny just thinking about it.",
    ["然后……买本正版的《大冒险家》重新看看。总不能一直拿着盗版书误导自己。"] = "Then... buy a genuine copy of \"The Great Adventurer\" and read it again. I can't keep misleading myself with a pirated book.",
    ["然后不小心把它们弄坏了。"] = "And then accidentally broke them.",
    ["然后他们就能说“嘿，这就是你妈妈二十年前最喜欢的味道！”“爸爸当年也是吃着小松饼长大的！”"] = "And then they can say, \"Hey, this is the flavor your mom liked best twenty years ago!\" \"Dad also grew up eating these little muffins!\"",
    ["然后他说，先生这一切我可以给您打包成\"贵族套餐\"。年费12镑，每月免费来一次。"] = "Then he said, 'Sir, I can package all of this into a \"Noble Package.\" Annual fee 12 pounds, free visit once a month.'",
    ["然后伸出手来，水晶会告诉你答案。"] = "Then extend your hand, and the crystal will tell you the answer.",
    ["然后你就邀请我共进晚餐，噢，答应你的表白时我一定喝醉了！"] = "And then you invited me to dinner, oh, I must have been drunk when I accepted your confession!",
    ["然后再把它替换成一个世界上不存在的东西"] = "Then replace it with something that does not exist in the world.",
    ["然后再次向我祈祷，祈求进入历史迷雾的许可。"] = "Then pray to me again, asking for permission to enter the fog of history.",
    ["然后出来再坐三站无轨马车，下车向左转……还是右？"] = "Then get out and take three stops of the trackless Carriage, turn left after getting off... or right?",
    ["然后呢 我能回去了吗？怎么回事……"] = "And then? Can I go back? What's going on...",
    ["然后呢？"] = "And then?",
    ["然后呢？格尔曼与死亡领主展开了一场精彩的决斗？"] = "And then? Did Gehrman engage in a spectacular duel with the Death Lord?",
    ["然后哼一段悠扬的旋律，跳一支轻快的宫廷舞——你喜欢踢踏舞也可以。最后，再来局昆特牌……"] = "Then hum a melodious tune and dance a light court dance—you can do tap dance if you like. Finally, play a game of Gwent...",
    ["然后啊……就看着它们，看阳光照在羊毛上，变成金色的。"] = "And then... just watch them, watch the sunlight shine on the wool, turning it golden.",
    ["然后她把光揉成很多很多小球，送给其他怕冷的人、迷路的人、伤心的人。"] = "Then she kneaded the light into many, many small balls and gave them to other people who were afraid of the cold, lost, or sad.",
    ["然后将勾勒出的物品用一件世界上不存在的 凭空想象出来的物品替换掉"] = "Then replace the outlined object with something that does not exist in the world, something imagined out of thin air.",
    ["然后就再找不到镇子了，整整过去三十年，才终于回来……"] = "Then I couldn't find the town again. A full thirty years passed before I finally returned...",
    ["然后我们全体冲上去，和龙大战了三百回合！"] = "Then we all rushed up and fought the dragon for three hundred rounds!",
    ["然后我利用在进出口公司的关系，以成本价拿到了灯具。"] = "Then I used my connections at the import-export company to get the lamps at cost price.",
    ["然后我发现，只要我握住那串手链，就能穿墙而过，能打开锁住的门……我以为是好运，是命运的馈赠。"] = "Then I discovered that as long as I held that bracelet, I could pass through walls and open locked doors... I thought it was good luck, a gift of fate.",
    ["然后我就明白了。我走出去，趴在门口，竖起耳朵。"] = "And then I understood. I walked out, lay down at the door, and pricked up my ears.",
    ["然后我就花了点零花钱做硬币占卜，结果说能过——最后真过了，分数还不低！下次我打算去占卜毕业后能不能去贝克兰德发展。 "] = "Then I spent some pocket money to do a coin divination, and it said I could pass—in the end, I really did, and the score wasn't low! Next time I plan to go and divine whether I can go to Backlund to develop after graduation.",
    ["然后我昨晚做了一个梦，在梦中得到了线索！"] = "Then I had a dream last night and received a clue!",
    ["然后是……"] = "And then...",
    ["然后看张开双臂……露出沉醉的神情……好，就是这样！"] = "Then look with your arms spread wide... show an intoxicated expression... good, that's it!",
    ["然后看镜头……好，就是这样！"] = "Then look at the lens... Good, that's it!",
    ["然后神父拿着支票去了银行，又回来了。他们都怎么说来着？哦对，“只有女神本人才能从那张支票里取出钱来。”"] = "Then the priest took the check to the bank and came back. What did they all say again? Oh right, 'Only the Goddess herself can withdraw money from that check.'",
    ["然后等他走过去了，我再悄悄溜走。"] = "And then, after he walked past, I would quietly slip away.",
    ["然后等我离开就又能听见他那“别具一格”的琴声。"] = "And then as soon as I leave, I can hear their 'unique' piano playing again.",
    ["然后要说暗号……"] = "Then I need to say the code word...",
    ["然后趁头发还没掉，先下手为强，提前剪光所有头发，从此就再也没有脱发的焦虑了！"] = "Then, before the hair falls out, take the initiative! Shave it all off in advance, and you'll never have to worry about hair loss again!",
    ["然后还有个弟弟？"] = "And then there's a younger brother?",
    ["然后门出现了，好多门，一开一关、一开一关……"] = "Then doors appeared, so many doors, opening and closing, opening and closing...",
    ["然后，在酒馆里和他们父亲再聊一会儿。"] = "Then, chat with their fathers in the tavern for a while.",
    ["然后，我一抬头……"] = "Then, I looked up...",
    ["然后，我的日程表就越来越满了！"] = "Then, my schedule became fuller and fuller!",
    ["然后，然后他就变成了车轮。哈哈，想想就好笑。"] = "Then, then he turned into a wheel. Haha, just thinking about it is funny.",
    ["然后，然后我的钱包就丢了！我花了很长时间才找回它！"] = "And then, and then my wallet was stolen! It took me a long time to find it!",
    ["然后，讲一下<P_Yellow>工厂主人克扣工人的薪水</>。"] = "Then, let's talk about the <P_Yellow>factory owner withholding the workers' wages</>.",
    ["然后，赢两把试试水。"] = "Then, win a couple of rounds to test the waters.",
    ["然后，过段时间我们可以再来找小阿诺德。"] = "Then, after a while, we can come back to find little Arnold.",
    ["然太阳也有终焉之时，若那执掌权杖之人心智清明，应当洞悉，无上的意志才是唯一神迹。"] = "However, even the sun has a time of ending. If the person holding the scepter is clear-minded, they should realize that the supreme will is the only divine miracle.",
    ["然而忘记，我不会创作诗句。"] = "Yet I forget that I cannot compose poetry.",
    ["然而我也有些大胆的想法，为何不尝试更强烈的用色？"] = "However, I also have some bold ideas. Why not try more intense colors?",
    ["然而突然现身的开膛手却打破了这美好的一刻……"] = "However, the sudden appearance of the Ripper broke this beautiful moment...",
    ["然而见证之环的展示容量有限，每周符合标准的名字将在此交替显现。"] = "However, the display capacity of the Ring of Witness is limited, and the names that meet the criteria each week will appear alternately here.",
    ["然而，在我达到戏剧巅峰后，我突然无法感动、共情，我丧失了人类最基本的情绪。"] = "However, after reaching the peak of drama, I suddenly became unable to be moved or empathize; I lost the most basic human emotions.",
    ["然而，我并没有亲妹妹……抱歉，梅丽莎，我真的想<P_Yellow>回家</>。"] = "However, I don't have a real younger sister... Sorry, Melissa, I really want to <P_Yellow>go home</>.",
    ["然而，规定就是规定。"] = "However, rules are rules.",
