    ["煤油灯晃在窄巷口，它蹲在排水沟，啃着昨夜的炸鱼骨，胡须沾满黑油。"] = "The kerosene lamp sways at the narrow alley entrance, it crouches in the gutter, gnawing on last night's fried fish bones, its whiskers stained with black oil.",
