    ["煤灰猫，煤灰猫……"] = "Coal-ash cat, coal-ash cat...",
    ["煤灰猫，煤灰猫，破帽当窝也乐陶陶！煤灰猫，煤灰猫，<P_Heart>（破音）</>这不是你的——错！"] = "Coal-ash cat, coal-ash cat, you are happy even with a broken hat for a nest! Coal-ash cat, coal-ash cat, <P_Heart> (Voice crack) </> this is not your—fault!",
    ["煤灰猫，煤灰猫，铁十字街你最横！教堂剩饭偷个遍，还挠过巡警的臀！"] = "Coal-ash cat, coal-ash cat, you are the most arrogant on Iron Cross Street! You steal all the leftovers from the church and have even scratched the patrolman's butt!",
    ["煤灰猫，瞧啊，又来了一位自以为是的鉴赏家。"] = "Coal-ash cat, look, another self-righteous connoisseur has arrived.",
