    ["照片"] = "Photograph",
    ["照片上的年轻女孩穿着制铅厂的女工制服，笑得十分灿烂。很难想象，这样的孩子会得上歇斯底里症。"] = "The young girl in the photo is wearing the uniform of a lead factory worker, smiling brightly. It's hard to imagine such a child would suffer from hysteria.",
    ["照片右上角被烧毁，那位先生的上半身也被烧掉了。"] = "The upper right corner of the photo is burned, and the upper body of that gentleman is also burned away.",
    ["照片啊……说实话，我一般都会拒绝这种请求。不过——如果是你帮忙拍照的话，我会同意的。"] = "A photo... to be honest, I usually refuse such requests. However—if you are the one helping to take the photo, I will agree.",
    ["照片正面是一对模糊的人影在一棵苹果树下的合影。\n照片背面似乎写着几行字，笔画很重。\n照片正面的脸已经被泥土和干涸的血水彻底模糊了。他早就忘了自己是谁。\n\n翻过来后能看到照片后模糊的文字：“丰收节，和姐姐在农场的苹果树下。”"] = "On the front of the photo is a blurry picture of a pair of figures under an apple tree. \n The back of the photo seems to have a few lines of text written on it, with heavy strokes. \n The faces on the front of the photo have been completely blurred by dirt and dried blood. He had long forgotten who he was. \n \n After flipping it over, one can see the blurry text on the back: \"Harvest Festival, with my sister under the apple tree on the farm.\"",
    ["照片里的很多人已经牺牲了，这张照片也是我们偶然找到的，这已经足够幸运了。"] = "Many people in this photo have already sacrificed themselves. We found this photo by chance, and that is already lucky enough.",
    ["照耀这里吧，怨魂晶石的光芒！"] = "Shine here, light of the Wraith Crystal!",
