    ["爱德华·斯蒂夫"] = "Edward Stiff",
    ["爱德华·斯蒂夫是有很天赋的占卜家，擅长塔罗牌占卜，扑克占卜。每次收费3便士。"] = "Edward Stiff is a very talented Seer, specializing in Tarot card divination and poker divination. He charges 3 pence per session.",
    ["爱德华先生，我知道……教堂的场地费是有定例的。只是……您看能不能再商量一下？哪怕减免一点点也好。"] = "Mr. Edward, I know... the venue fee for the church has a set rule. It's just... could you please reconsider? Even a small reduction would help.",
    ["爱德华先生，诺拉她......想在婚礼上多摆些铃兰花。就是那种——白色的，一簇一簇的，闻起来很清香的那种。"] = "Mr. Edward, Nora... she wants to have more lilies of the valley at the wedding. You know, the white ones, in clusters, with that very fragrant scent.",
    ["爱德华先生，诺拉她……想在婚礼上多摆些铃兰花。就是那种——白色的，一簇一簇的，闻起来很清香的那种。"] = "Mr. Edward, Nora... she wants to have more lilies of the valley at the wedding. You know, the white ones, in clusters, that smell so fresh.",
    ["爱德华兹"] = "Edwards",
    ["爱德华娜"] = "Edwina",
    ["爱德华极度焦虑，布雷尔畏惧黑暗，我无法忍受打开的门。"] = "Edward is extremely anxious, Brel is afraid of the dark, and I cannot stand an open door.",
    ["爱德华的病症"] = "Edward's symptoms",
    ["爱情啊，是这世界上最危险的东西。而春夜沙龙，一直在贩卖这种“危险”。"] = "Love is the most dangerous thing in this world. And the Spring Night Salon has always been selling this kind of 'danger'.",
    ["爱情属于勇敢者，我相信你会成功的！"] = "Love belongs to the brave; I believe you will succeed!",
    ["爱情总是伴随伤痛，\r\n你更希望受伤的是？"] = "Love is always accompanied by pain,\r\nwho would you rather see get hurt?",
    ["爱情的花束"] = "Bouquet of Love",
    ["爱情盛宴：吸血鬼小说又掀浪潮"] = "Feast of Love: Vampire Novels Spark Another Wave",
    ["爱情让我凋零，母神让我重生。你们懂什么叫“破碎”吗？"] = "Love makes me wither, the Mother Goddess makes me reborn. Do you know what \"shattered\" means?",
    ["爱情！当然是爱情！就像街上那些吟游诗人唱的一样，爱情降临了。"] = "Love! Of course it's love! Just like the bards on the street sing, love has descended.",
    ["爱是迷恋的影子，还是真实的獠牙？"] = "Is love the shadow of obsession, or a real fang?",
