    ["爵士大人让那些穷人坚持工作，不会因为懒惰而更加贫穷。"] = "The Earl tells those poor people to keep working so they won't become even poorer due to laziness.",
    ["爵士降临"] = "Jazz Descent",
    ["父亲"] = "Father",
    ["父亲——母亲——姐姐——你们在哪啊？ "] = "Father—Mother—Sister—where are you?",
    ["父亲……他是一名底层军官，为了追逐权势和财富前往了东拜朗，并且组建了新的家庭。"] = "Father... he was a low-level officer who went to East Balam to chase power and wealth and started a new family.",
    ["父亲会……把我赶出家门……"] = "Father will... kick me out of the house...",
    ["父亲六年前去世了，今年……本来是他们第五十年的纪念日。 "] = "Father passed away six years ago, and this year... was supposed to be their fiftieth anniversary.",
    ["父亲决定……"] = "Father decided...",
    ["父亲决定去迪西海湾，医生建议他在那里休养一段时间。"] = "Father decided to go to Desi Bay; the doctor suggested he recuperate there for a period of time.",
    ["父亲灵体"] = "Father's spirit",
    ["父亲留给三兄妹的遗物。表壳上雕饰着藤蔓枝叶花纹，看起来颇为体面。"] = "A keepsake left by the father to the three siblings. The watch case is decorated with vine and leaf patterns, looking quite decent.",
    ["父亲！"] = "Father!",
    ["父亲，他们又要来催债了，求您……"] = "Father, they are coming to collect debts again, please...",
    ["父亲，你还记得吗，这棵树，是您种下的。"] = "Father, do you remember? This tree was planted by you.",
    ["父亲，我真是太爱您了！"] = "Father, I love you so much!",
    ["父亲，我记得那个商铺明明是您作为礼物送出去的！"] = "Father, I remember that shop was clearly a gift you gave away!",
    ["父亲，我都说到这份上了，随你信不信。"] = "Father, I've said all I can, believe it or not.",
    ["父亲？我呸，他从来没把我当亲儿子看过！看他只培养老三埃德加的样子就知道了！"] = "Father? Pfft, he never treated me like his own son! Just look at how he only groomed the third one, Edgar, and you'll know!",
    ["父子点位"] = "Father and son point",
    ["父母去世后，她一度很沉默。我以为她会哭，会闹，但她只是把自己关在房间里，摆弄那些机械。"] = "After our parents passed away, she was very silent for a while. I thought she would cry or throw a tantrum, but she just locked herself in her room, tinkering with those machines.",
    ["爷爷以前经常来这里祈祷，我也要为爷爷祈祷。"] = "Grandpa used to come here to pray often, so I must pray for him too.",
    ["爷爷！爷爷在下面！本杰明哥哥！救爷爷！求求你……救救爷爷好不好？"] = "Grandpa! Grandpa is downstairs! Brother Benjamin! Save Grandpa! Please... please save Grandpa, okay?",
    ["爷爷！谢谢你，本杰明哥哥！"] = "Grandpa! Thank you, Brother Benjamin!",
    ["爸爸 妈妈……"] = "Dad, Mom...",
    ["爸爸——啊——"] = "Dad—ah—",
    ["爸爸……"] = "Father...",
    ["爸爸……妈妈……救救我……我再也不任性了……"] = "Dad... Mom... save me... I won't be willful anymore...",
    ["爸爸……妈妈……露米……你们都丢下我了吗？"] = "Dad... Mom... Lumian... Have you all abandoned me?",
    ["爸爸也是这样。他说锁匠就是要打开一切，没有什么锁是他打不开的。"] = "Dad is like that too. He says a locksmith's job is to open everything, and there is no lock he cannot open.",
    ["爸爸什么时候下班？"] = "When does Daddy get off work?",
    ["爸爸去世后，我也生病了，每天只能躺在床上……"] = "After Dad passed away, I got sick too, I can only lie in bed every day...",
    ["爸爸妈妈很忙，但他们给了我玩偶露米。有露米陪我等他们回家，就一点也不孤单了。"] = "Mom and Dad are very busy, but they gave me a doll named Lumian. With Lumian keeping me company while I wait for them to come home, I don't feel lonely at all.",
    ["爸爸妈妈都消失了吗……"] = "Have Mom and Dad disappeared too...",
    ["爸爸妈妈都生病了，幸好我还能帮忙卖东西。"] = "Mom and Dad are both sick, luckily I can still help sell things.",
    ["爸爸妈妈，我想买一个冰淇淋吃，可以吗？"] = "Mom and Dad, I want to buy an ice cream, can I?",
    ["爸爸妈妈，我想买一个冰淇淋吃，可以嘛？"] = "Mom and Dad, I want to buy an ice cream, can I?",
    ["爸爸对我很不好，对妈妈也很不好。妈妈走的时候，还是高德弗主教帮忙，才把妈妈埋到这里的……"] = "Dad is very bad to me, and very bad to Mom. When Mom left, it was Bishop Godfrey who helped bury her here...",
    ["爸爸已经七年没有回来了……好希望明天爸爸就出现在家门口。"] = "Dad hasn't been back for seven years... I really hope Dad appears at our doorstep tomorrow.",
    ["爸爸怎么还不下来？我长高好多，是不是不认识我了？"] = "Why isn't Dad coming down yet? I've grown so much, will he not recognize me?",
    ["爸爸每天傍晚都会坐在床边，听我讲故事，然后一字一句记在本子上。"] = "Dad sits by the bed every evening, listening to me tell stories, and then writes them down word by word in a notebook.",
    ["爸爸离开了，但我们的生活还得接着过下去。"] = "Dad is gone, but our lives have to go on.",
    ["爸爸被工厂辞退后，每天买醉，我只能辍学给人洗衣服。"] = "After Dad was fired by the factory, he bought drinks every day, and I had to drop out of school to do laundry for others.",
    ["爸爸被工厂辞退后，每天喝酒买醉，我不得不从教会的周日学校辍学，帮妈妈给人洗衣服。"] = "After my father was laid off by the factory, he drank himself into a stupor every day. I had to drop out of the church's Sunday school to help my mother wash clothes for others.",
    ["爸爸被工厂辞退后，每天喝酒买醉，我不得不从教会的周日学校辍学，帮妈妈给人洗衣服，可妈妈现在也生病了，我不得不......"] = "After Dad was laid off from the factory, he started drinking his sorrows away every day. I had to drop out of the church's Sunday school to help Mom wash clothes, but now Mom is sick too, and I have to...",
    ["爸爸被工厂辞退后，每天喝酒买醉，我不得不从教会的周日学校辍学，帮妈妈给人洗衣服，可妈妈现在也生病了，我不得不……"] = "After Dad was laid off by the factory, he started drinking his sorrows away every day. I had to drop out of the church's Sunday school to help Mom wash clothes for others, but now Mom is sick too, and I have to...",
    ["爸爸说它不能和家里人葬在一起……我只能把它带到这来。"] = "Dad said it couldn't be buried with the family... I could only bring it here.",
    ["爸爸说这棵梧桐树会在我长大后醒来，是真的吗？"] = "Dad said this plane tree will wake up after I grow up. Is that true?",
    ["爸爸！"] = "Daddy!",
    ["爸爸！我想讲个新故事！"] = "Dad! I want to tell a new story!",
    ["爸爸！那里亮闪闪的，是女神在看我们吗？"] = "Daddy! It's shining over there, is the Goddess watching us?",
    ["爸爸，刚刚那是什么？那个恐怖的怪物……是我带来的吗？"] = "Dad, what was that just now? That Terrifying Monster... did I bring it here?",
    ["爸爸，别这么说！您不是常告诉我，迟到总比不到好吗？这可是您说的！"] = "Dad, don't say that! Didn't you often tell me that better late than never? You said that yourself!",
    ["爸爸，妈妈，发生了什么事？"] = "Dad, Mom, what happened?",
    ["爸爸，快点！"] = "Daddy, hurry up!",
    ["爸爸，我不怕痛！"] = "Dad, I'm not afraid of pain!",
    ["爸爸，我们为什么每天都来看别人吃饭？"] = "Dad, why do we come to watch others eat every day?",
    ["爸爸，我的日记……"] = "Dad, my diary...",
    ["爸爸，这是在干什么呀？"] = "Dad, what are you doing?",
    ["爸爸？你、你回来了！仪式……生效了？"] = "Dad? You, you're back! The ritual... did it work?",
    ["爸爸？难道你爸爸是……"] = "Father? Could your father be...",
    ["爸！您怎么还在和弗雷尔叔叔较量谁蹲得更久！还看报纸，您看得进去吗！"] = "Dad! Why are you still competing with Uncle Freyr to see who can squat longer! And reading the newspaper, can you even focus on it!",
    ["爸，你今天又忘记吃药了？"] = "Dad, did you forget to take your medicine again today?",
    ["爸，还要挖多深呀？"] = "Dad, how much deeper do we need to dig?",
