    ["物理最小、物理最大、魔法最小、魔法最大【四个数字以空格连接，例如10 100 10 100】"] = "Physical min, physical max, magic min, magic max [four numbers separated by spaces, e.g., 10 100 10 100]",
    ["物理格挡"] = "Physical Block",
    ["物理格挡_数值"] = "Physical Block_Value",
    ["物理格挡_百分比加成"] = "Physical Block_Percentage Bonus",
    ["物理格挡：{*d,F1690001,pBlock}\n魔法格挡：{*d,F1690001,mBlock}\n抵消伤害来源的穿刺，在基础格挡率<Highlight>25%</>的基础上，提高格挡所受伤害的几率。格挡时，受到30%伤害且不会触发暴击。\n格挡率存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>0%</>的下限，提升的格挡超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>穿刺</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Physical Block: {*d,F1690001,pBlock}\n Magic Block: {*d,F1690001,mBlock}\n Negates the Pierce of the damage source. Based on the base block rate of <Highlight>25%</>, it increases the probability of blocking received damage. When blocking, 30% damage is received and no critical hit is triggered. \nThe block rate has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>0%</>. If the increased Block exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Pierce</> attribute.",
    ["物理破防"] = "Physical Defense Break",
