    ["物理防御_N"] = "Physical Defense_N",
    ["物理防御_数值"] = "Physical Defense_Value",
    ["物理防御_百分比加成"] = "Physical Defense_Percentage Bonus",
    ["物理防御_额外加成"] = "Physical Defense_Extra Bonus",
    ["物理防御：{*d,F1690001,pDef}\n魔法防御：{*d,F1690001,mDef}\n减免受到伤害的攻击基础值，无法减免伤害的技能基础值。\n减免后的攻击基础值存在<Highlight>75%</>的上限和<Highlight>20%</>的下限，提升的防御超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升减伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>，与对方<Highlight>破防</>、<Highlight>忽视防御</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Physical Defense: {*d,F1690001,pDef}\n Magic Defense: {*d,F1690001,mDef}\n Reduces the base Attack value of received damage, but cannot reduce the base Skill value of damage. \nThe reduced base Attack value has an upper limit of <Highlight>75%</> and a lower limit of <Highlight>20%</>. If the increased Defense exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, the damage reduction capability cannot be improved. \nThe actual effect and thresholds depend on the confrontation calculation between the attacker and defender's <Highlight>Level</>, and the opponent's <Highlight>Armor Break</> and <Highlight>Ignore Defense</> attributes.",
