    ["特伦索斯特"] = "Trunsoest",
    ["特伦索斯特黄铜书的能力属于哪条途径？"] = "Which Pathway does the ability of the Trunsoest Brass Book belong to?",
    ["特伦索斯特黄铜书，一本由薄薄黄铜组成的书册。参与并完成副本、竞技、冒险挑战任务，即可获取对应的挑战积分和代币，领取和兑换丰富奖励与限定外观。黄铜书副本挑战需要在副本内与NPC交互对话开启挑战。"] = "Tudor Brass Book, a book made of thin brass sheets. Participate in and complete dungeon, competitive, and adventure challenge quests to obtain corresponding challenge points and tokens to claim and exchange for rich rewards and limited appearances. Brass Book dungeon challenges require interacting with NPCs within the dungeon to initiate the challenge.",
    ["特伦索斯特黄铜书，一本由薄薄黄铜组成的书册。参与并完成副本、竞技、冒险挑战任务，即可获取对应的挑战积分和代币，领取和兑换丰富奖励与限定外观。黄铜书副本挑战需要在组队模式副本内与NPC交互对话开启。"] = "Tudor Brass Book, a book made of thin brass. Participate in and complete dungeons, competitions, and adventure challenge quests to obtain corresponding challenge points and tokens to claim and exchange for rich rewards and limited appearances. The Brass Book dungeon challenge needs to be opened by interacting with NPCs within the team-mode dungeon.",
