    ["特别是《美女与野兽》，堪称全世界最深刻最感人的爱情小说，男人看了沉默！女人看了流泪！"] = "Especially 'Beauty and the Beast', which can be called the most profound and moving love novel in the world; men are silent after reading it! Women shed tears after reading it!",
