    ["特莉丝召唤出的幽魂被消灭3个时，会获得该buff，在流程图中判定打打断祈祷"] = "When 3 ghosts summoned by Trissy are destroyed, she gains this buff, which is judged in the flowchart to interrupt prayer",
    ["特莉丝向祭坛祈祷时获得该buff，免疫伤害"] = "Gains this buff when Trissy prays to the altar, immune to damage",
    ["特莉丝向祭坛祈祷时，会释放一次大范围攻击给我方增加该buff，触发击退技能"] = "When Trissy prays to the altar, she will release a large-range attack to add this buff to our side, triggering a knockback skill",
    ["特莉丝就是特里斯，这也可以完美解释特里斯突然失踪的谜题。"] = "Trissy is Trissy; this perfectly explains the mystery of Trissy's sudden disappearance.",
    ["特莉丝流程图添加buff，每秒增加一层攻击资源"] = "Trissy flowchart adds buff, increases one layer of attack resources per second",
    ["特莉丝流程图添加buff，每秒增加一层移动资源"] = "Trissy flowchart adds buff, increases one layer of movement resources per second",
    ["特莉丝登场时，战斗开始使敌方全体的法力恢复降低<HighLight>2</>点，持续<HighLight>10</>秒。"] = "When Trissy enters the field, reduce the mana recovery of all enemies by <HighLight>2</> points at the start of battle, lasting for <HighLight>10</> seconds.",
    ["特莉丝的个人档案"] = "Trissy's Personal File",
