    ["特雷莎·"] = "Teresa ",
    ["特鲁曼"] = "Truman",
    ["牺牲的孩子们，只会被当做是“劳工损耗”！"] = "The sacrificed children are only treated as \"labor attrition\"!",
    ["犀利的鹦鹉"] = "Sharp-tongued Parrot",
    ["犬吠-西北"] = "Dog barking - Northwest",
    ["犬语"] = "Dog Language",
    ["犬魂跃击"] = "Hound Soul Leap",
    ["犯下劫案的通缉犯就躲在金秋湖畔的某处地下遗迹中，迎接最后的战斗吧！"] = "The wanted criminal who committed the robbery is hiding in an underground ruin by Golden Autumn Lake. Prepare for the final battle!",
    ["犯下廷根黑市抢劫案，妄图通过仪式晋升序列。"] = "Committed a robbery at the Tingen black market, attempting to advance in Sequence through a ritual.",
    ["犯人很狡猾，除了诡异的笛声外，没留下任何线索。"] = "The culprit is very cunning. Apart from the eerie flute sound, they haven't left any clues.",
    ["犯人经常半夜惨叫，狱警巡逻时会莫名迷路，走着走着就回到原点。更邪门的是，有个被关了一年的家伙，前天晚上突然在牢房里哭喊“一分钟又到了”……问他什么意思，他只抱着头，头疼欲裂。"] = "Prisoners often scream in the middle of the night, and prison guards inexplicably get lost while patrolling, returning to the starting point as they walk. Even weirder, a guy who had been locked up for a year suddenly cried out in his cell the night before last, 'The minute is up again'... When asked what he meant, he just held his head, his head splitting with pain.",
    ["犯人肖像……尸体报告……罗珊打盹……洛耀打牌……"] = "Criminal portraits... autopsy reports... Rozanne napping... Luo Yao playing cards...",
    ["犯罪事件-禁锢+头晕"] = "Crime Event - Imprisonment + Dizziness",
    ["犯罪事件-追车-加速光圈"] = "Crime Event - Car Chase - Acceleration Ring",
    ["犯罪嫌疑人"] = "Criminal Suspect",
