    ["犯罪现场-追车玩法-光圈加速"] = "Crime Scene - Car Chase Gameplay - Halo Speed Boost",
    ["犯罪现场-追车玩法-范围标记"] = "Crime Scene - Car Chase Gameplay - Range Marker",
    ["犯罪现场那堆杂物里伸出来的绝对是人手，它们还在动！"] = "That was definitely a human hand sticking out of the pile of debris at the crime scene, and it was still moving!",
    ["犯罪证据"] = "Evidence of Crime",
    ["犯错的人，失控的人，邪教徒……统统一视同仁，用雷霆和闪电解除威胁。"] = "Those who commit crimes, those who lose control, cultists... all are treated equally, using thunder and lightning to eliminate threats.",
    ["状况怎样，还不是一样，普通人的世界外一切都是乱糟糟的。"] = "What's the situation? It's the same as always; everything outside the world of ordinary people is a mess.",
