    ["狂暴处决"] = "Berserk Execution",
    ["狂暴海"] = "Berserk Sea",
    ["狂暴海航线的开启，对这片大陆的人到底意味着什么？对我到底意味着什么？"] = "What does the opening of the Berserk Sea route really mean to the people of this continent? What does it mean to me?",
    ["狂暴状态下，伤害得到大幅提升。"] = "In berserk state, damage is significantly increased.",
    ["狂暴状态下，各项能力得到大幅提升。"] = "In berserk state, all abilities are significantly enhanced.",
    ["狂暴狒狒"] = "Berserk Baboon",
    ["狂暴猎杀"] = "Berserk Hunt",
    ["狂暴的大海上，一艘巨大的帆船正冲破海浪，向前航行。\n罗塞尔大帝站在甲板上，瞭望远方，左右各有四门火炮。"] = "On the raging sea, a huge sailing ship is breaking through the waves and sailing forward. \n Emperor Roselle stands on the deck, looking into the distance, with four cannons on each side.",
    ["狂暴的灵魂，而只是\n填塞起来的人\n我们围着沼泽转圈\n睡莲，睡莲\n我们围着沼泽转圈\n在清晨五点\n\n在观念与现实之间\n在动作与行为之间\n落下阴影\n所属之地"] = "Violent souls, but only\nThe stuffed men\nWe circle round the swamp\nWater Lily, Water Lily\nWe circle round the swamp\nAt five o'clock in the morning\n\nBetween the idea and the reality\nBetween the motion and the act\nFalls the Shadow\nWhere it belongs",
    ["狂欢"] = "Carnival",
    ["狂欢吧，抢夺光球获得更多金币！"] = "Carnival! Grab the light orbs to get more Gold Coins!",
    ["狂欢夜的入门手艺——本来是后裤兜里的，看起来够喝几杯。"] = "An entry-level craft for the Carnival night—originally in the back pocket, looks like enough for a few drinks.",
    ["狂欢夜的街头，从不缺惊喜。今夜，整座城市都是你的购物车。"] = "The streets on Carnival night never lack surprises. Tonight, the entire city is your shopping cart.",
    ["狂热信徒"] = "Fanatic Believer",
    ["狂热爱慕者"] = "Fanatical Admirer",
    ["狂热的声音"] = "Fanatical voice",
    ["狂热的虔诚"] = "Fanatical Devotion",
