    ["狂袭式"] = "Frenzied Assault",
    ["狂野之心老板"] = "Wild Heart Owner",
    ["狂风与雷霆的标志散播着风暴之主的威严。"] = "The symbol of wind and thunder spreads the majesty of the Lord of Storms.",
    ["狄奥多拉·"] = "Theodora ",
    ["狄安娜"] = "Diana",
    ["狄龙"] = "Dillon",
    ["狐毛绵软，蓬松厚实，赤足走过也能纵享绒滑。"] = "Fox fur, soft, fluffy, and thick; you can enjoy the velvet smoothness even when walking barefoot.",
    ["狒哥的金色毛发"] = "Golden Hair of the Baboon Brother",
    ["狒小弟"] = "Baboon Minion",
    ["狒朗明哥时间到！"] = "It's Baboon-flamenco time!",
    ["狒狒"] = "Baboon",
    ["狒狒-表演1"] = "Baboon - Performance 1",
    ["狒狒-表演2"] = "Baboon - Performance 2",
    ["狒狒-表演3"] = "Baboon - Performance 3",
    ["狒狒boss火焰陷阱"] = "Baboon Boss Flame Trap",
    ["狒狒之友"] = "Friend of the Baboons",
    ["狒狒们把乐谱藏起来了，别让它们逃走！"] = "The baboons have hidden the sheet music; don't let them escape!",
    ["狒狒们捡来粗心人类弄丢的材料，七弯八扭出头环形状，当做舞王冠冕。"] = "The baboons picked up materials lost by careless humans, twisting them into a headband shape to use as a dance king's crown.",
    ["狒狒初始点位"] = "Baboon Initial Position",
    ["狒狒助阵"] = "Baboon Assistance",
    ["狒狒对卡门的下半身恋恋不舍，好在它不再攻击卡门了。\n恢复自由的卡门很快挣脱……"] = "The baboon is reluctant to part with Carmen's lower body, but fortunately, it no longer attacks Carmen. \n Carmen, having regained his freedom, quickly breaks free...",
    ["狒狒小礼"] = "Baboon's Small Gift",
    ["狒狒拉近"] = "Baboon zoom in",
    ["狒狒最初只是一只狒狒，每日望天、挠痒、抓虱子。\n丰收时节，总有人类对着金黄的大树晃胳膊踢腿，摆出奇怪动作。\n狒狒不关心，狒狒只关心人类留下的面包。\n后来，在丰饶之树浸染下，狒狒成为了非凡狒狒，才明白那种行为叫做跳舞。\n森林里红发绿裙的人类也会跳舞，她脚步轻盈，腰肢柔韧，会温柔地抚摸狒狒的卷毛。\n狒狒开始模仿人类跳舞，并逐渐体会到其中乐趣。\n它成了丰饶之树舞王，每天率领狒子狒孙摇摆身躯，邀请路过的人类共舞。\n四季轮转，人类来了又往，狒狒还是狒狒，热情永不减退。"] = "The baboon was initially just a baboon, looking at the sky, scratching, and catching lice every day. \n During the harvest season, humans would always wave their arms and kick their legs at the golden tree, performing strange movements. \n The baboon didn't care; the baboon only cared about the bread left by humans. \n Later, under the influence of the Tree of Abundance, the baboon became a Beyonder baboon and finally understood that this behavior was called dancing. \n The human with red hair and a green dress in the forest would also dance; she had light steps, a flexible waist, and would gently stroke the baboon's curly hair. \n The baboon began to imitate the human's dance and gradually realized the fun in it. \n It became the dance king of the Tree of Abundance, leading its baboon descendants to sway their bodies every day, inviting passing humans to dance together. \n As the seasons turned, humans came and went, but the baboon was still a baboon, and its enthusiasm never faded.",
    ["狒狒机制3表演期间特效buff"] = "Baboon Mechanism 3 Performance Effect Buff",
    ["狒狒机制3龙卷风buff"] = "Baboon mechanism 3 Tornado buff",
    ["狒狒正面"] = "Baboon Front View",
    ["狒狒火焰"] = "Baboon Fire",
    ["狒狒点名砸地后，砸点留下持续30秒的龙卷风。"] = "After the baboon marks a spot for a ground smash, it leaves behind a tornado that lasts for 30 seconds.",
    ["狒狒的步伐"] = "Baboon's Pace",
