    ["狼人的失控感包围着你，战斗中移动时，每20秒会发出不受控制的嚎叫，打断你当前的移动和技能，并对半径10米内敌人造成高额伤害。"] = "The loss of control of a Werewolf surrounds you. While moving in battle, you will emit an uncontrollable howl every 20 seconds, interrupting your current movement and skills, and dealing high damage to enemies within a 10-meter radius.",
