    ["猎人纹章"] = "Hunter Emblem",
    ["猎人：【猎人】获得额外暴击机率；命中敌方时施加<HighLight>3</>秒流血，持续造成伤害。"] = "Hunter: [Hunter] units gain additional Critical Hit chance; applying Bleed for <HighLight>3</> seconds upon hitting enemies, dealing continuous damage.",
    ["猎击"] = "Hunt Strike",
    ["猎刺占位"] = "Hunter Thorn Placeholder",
    ["猎场女仆一"] = "Hunting Ground Maid One",
    ["猎场女仆二"] = "Hunting Ground Maid 2",
    ["猎场战报：<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.guildName}}</>俱乐部今日已在<Chat_Highlight>猎龙之城</>猎杀<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.killCount}}</>名玩家，王城战线因他们而震动！"] = "Hunting Ground Report: <Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.guildName}} </> Club has hunted <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.killCount}}</> players in <Chat_Highlight>City of Dragon Hunting</> today, and the Royal City front line is shaking because of them!",
    ["猎场战报：{{player.name}}今日已在<Chat_Highlight>猎龙之城</>猎杀<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.killCount}}</>名玩家，血色名声正在王城暗巷间扩散。"] = "Hunting Ground Report: {{player.name}} has hunted <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.killCount}}</> players in <Chat_Highlight>City of Dragon Hunting</> today, and their bloody reputation is spreading through the dark alleys of the Royal City.",
    ["猎城之争再燃！无需占领石碑，王城城门已均可直接被攻击！"] = "The battle for the City of Hunting reignites! There is no need to occupy the stele; the royal city gates can now be attacked directly!",
    ["猎城之战即将开始"] = "The Battle of Hunting City is about to begin",
    ["猎城战"] = "Hunting City Battle",
    ["猎城战中累计承受30万伤害"] = "Sustain a total of 300,000 damage in Hunting City Battle",
    ["猎城战中累计造成30万伤害"] = "Deal a total of 300,000 damage in Hunting City Battle",
    ["猎城战局外阶段切换"] = "Hunt City Battle Outside Phase Switch",
    ["猎城战怎么玩"] = "How to play Hunt City Battle",
    ["猎城战怎么获胜"] = "How to win Hunt City Battle",
    ["猎城战最后的王者。属于你的旌旗立于最高城壁，俯视众生。战争之门为你开启，知识皇冠承认你的价值，罗塞尔亦予以赞赏。"] = "The final king of the Hunting City battle. Your banner stands on the highest city wall, looking down upon all living things. The Gate of War opens for you, the Crown of Knowledge acknowledges your worth, and Roselle also grants his praise.",
    ["猎城战正式开启，谁将登上最后的王座？"] = "The Hunter City Battle has officially begun; who will ascend to the final throne?",
    ["猎城战第一阶段，各位非凡者需要从己方<Highlight>要塞</>出发，沿着<Highlight>前哨、营地</>稳步推进，占领营地后即可攻击相连接的<Highlight>战争石碑</>，需占领和己方营地相连的两处石碑，方可攻击<Highlight>王城城门</>，己方石碑被敌方攻占后则失去攻击城门的资格。\n猎城战第二阶段，王城城门攻破后，可前往中央平台<Highlight>占领王城</>，平台上人数最多的势力将积累<Highlight>占领值</>，同时在中央平台击杀敌方势力的非凡者亦可为己方势力增加<Highlight>占领值</>，达到100%时即占领王城。"] = "In the first stage of the City Hunt, all Beyonders must set out from their own <Highlight> Fortress </>, steadily advance along the <Highlight> Outposts and Camps </>, and after occupying a camp, they can attack the connected <Highlight> War Stele </>. You must occupy two steles connected to your camp to attack the <Highlight> Royal City Gate </>. If your steles are captured by the enemy, you lose the qualification to attack the gate. \n In the second stage of the City Hunt, after the Royal City Gate is breached, you can head to the central platform <Highlight> to occupy the Royal City </>. The faction with the most people on the platform will accumulate <Highlight> Occupation Value </>. At the same time, killing Beyonders of enemy factions on the central platform can also increase the <Highlight> Occupation Value </> for your faction. When it reaches 100%, the Royal City is occupied.",
    ["猎手训练"] = "Hunter Training",
    ["猎杀"] = "Hunt",
    ["猎杀什么时候开"] = "When does the Hunt open",
