    ["猎犬捕兽夹buff判定光环"] = "Hound Bear Trap Buff Detection Aura",
    ["猎犬摇晃尾巴持续<Disable>盯紧敌人</>，随后从尾部甩出捕兽夹，被捕兽夹范围命中的玩家会<Disable>无法行动且持续百分比掉血</>。"] = "The Hound wags its tail, continuously <Disable> staring at an enemy </>, then flings Bear Traps from its tail. Players hit by the Bear Trap's range will be <Disable> unable to act and suffer continuous percentage-based HP loss </>.",
