    ["玛丽，我这一生，从看过你的表演后，就再也没有遗憾了。现在只希望，我们能再多走过几个这样温暖的午后。"] = "Mary, in this life, ever since I saw your performance, I have had no more regrets. Now I only hope we can walk through a few more warm afternoons like this.",
