    ["玛尔塔婶婶带我们排练了艺术学派的时下最热门的舞蹈，听说这只舞连挑剔的贝克兰德人都非常追捧呢。"] = "Aunt Marta took us to rehearse the most popular dance from the School of Art. I heard that even the picky people of Backlund are very fond of this dance.",
