    ["玛尔莎，弗莱队长很感谢你们的礼物，不过从马车下救下你们的，并非他一人，而是一个团队。"] = "Marsha, Captain Frye is very grateful for your gifts, but he was not the only one who saved you from the carriage; it was a team effort.",
