    ["玛格达"] = "Magda",
    ["玛格，我最近挺好的，别担心。 帮里上周多给了三苏勒，我留着给托马斯交学费。 这边的工作说出去不体面，但总比在纺织厂门口排队强， 那队我排过三次，没一次排进去的。 头儿这边管得严，规矩不少，但起码饿不着。 等攒够了，我就回去。"] = "Marge, I'm doing quite well lately, don't worry. The gang gave me three extra soli last week, which I'm saving for Thomas's tuition. The work here isn't exactly respectable, but it's better than queuing up at the textile factory gate. I've queued there three times and never once got in. The boss is strict and there are many rules, but at least I won't go hungry. Once I've saved enough, I'll come back.",
