    ["玩偶的制作和设计上都用了心思，边缘处打磨得光滑，身侧还有一个小巧的发条。\n克莱恩笑着问：“这是只乌龟吧？”\n梅丽莎的声音悠悠响起：“它是人偶。”"] = "The doll's production and design were done with care; the edges are polished smooth, and there is a small clockwork mechanism on its side.\n Klein asks with a smile: \"This is a turtle, right?\"\n Melissa's voice rings out leisurely: \"It's a doll.\"",
