    ["玩家击杀所有管家，等小子爵身上出现<Highlight>灵性灌输</>按钮后，集合帮助小子爵，开启护盾，阻挡子爵夫人。"] = "Players should kill all the Butlers. Once the <Highlight>Spirituality Infusion</> button appears on the Little Viscount, gather to help the Little Viscount activate the shield to block the Viscountess.",
