    ["玩家发送任务道具  玩家移除任务道具（全部删除）  "] = "Player Send Quest Item; Player Remove Quest Item (Delete All)",
    ["玩家发送语音音量"] = "Outgoing Voice Volume",
    ["玩家取名成功"] = "Player naming successful",
    ["玩家变成即将爆炸的苹果后，场上会生成两个<Highlight>小矮人安全区</>，变成苹果的玩家应尽快<Highlight>躲进安全区</>，避免误伤队友。"] = "After players turn into apples that are about to explode, two <Highlight>Dwarf safe areas</> will be generated on the field. Players who have turned into apples should quickly <Highlight>hide in the safe area</> to avoid accidentally injuring teammates.",
    ["玩家古怪仪式传送定点"] = "Player strange ritual teleport fixed point",
    ["玩家可以利用菇毒溶于水，让<Highlight>厄水落在菇毒之上，消除菇毒</>。瑰堡落下，可填充厄水，<Highlight>利用瑰堡消除厄水</>。"] = "Players can use the fact that mushroom poison dissolves in water to let <Highlight>Calamity Water fall onto the mushroom poison to eliminate it</>. When the Rose Castle falls, it can fill with Calamity Water; <Highlight>use the Rose Castle to eliminate the Calamity Water</>.",
    ["玩家可以在伙伴界面查看伙伴信息。"] = "Players can view partner information in the Partner interface.",
    ["玩家可以选择固定的时段开启名流盛宴活动，且同一时间仅能开启一场。\n开启时段需要竞价获得，在正式开启前30分钟时，会锁定资格。\n玩家只能竞价一个时间段，如果已有一个时间段出价最高，更换时间段不会返还之前出价的金镑。"] = "Players can choose a fixed time slot to start the Celebrity Feast event, and only one can be held at a time. \nThe opening time slot needs to be obtained through bidding, and the eligibility will be locked 30 minutes before the official start. \nPlayers can only bid for one time slot. If you already have the highest bid for a time slot, changing the time slot will not refund the Pounds previously bid.",
    ["玩家可以选择好友设置的出战伙伴作为支援伙伴来应对残酷的试炼。"] = "Players can choose a partner set by a friend as a support partner to face cruel trials.",
    ["玩家可以选择有限数量的秘偶进行上阵。已上阵的秘偶，角色属性100%生效，剩余未上阵的秘偶，角色属性35%生效。"] = "Players can choose a limited number of marionettes to deploy. For deployed marionettes, character attributes take effect at 100%; for remaining undeployed marionettes, character attributes take effect at 35%.",
    ["玩家名字"] = "Player Name",
    ["玩家名称"] = "Player Name",
    ["玩家后退"] = "Player Stepping Back",
    ["玩家和弗莱来到街头抬头望向天空。\n一轮绯红的满月降临，天空也变成了诡异的绯红色。\n街上的市民陆续化为了绯色信息洪流。"] = "The player and Frye arrive on the street and look up at the sky. \nA crimson full moon descends, and the sky turns an eerie crimson.\n The citizens on the street turn into a crimson torrent of information one after another.",
    ["玩家和弗莱转过巷子，一条巨大的藤蔓突然出现，向玩家和弗莱的方向涌来。\n玩家和弗莱被迫分开。"] = "The player and Frye turn the corner, and a giant vine suddenly appears, surging toward the player and Frye. \nThe player and Frye are forced to separate.",
    ["玩家和毒菇站在一起，利用<Highlight>水球可以消灭毒菇</>的能力，将毒菇消灭。"] = "Players should stand with the Poison Mushroom and use the <Highlight>water ball's ability to eliminate the Poison Mushroom</> to destroy it.",
    ["玩家喝咖啡"] = "Player Drinking Coffee",
    ["玩家喝咖啡2"] = "Player Drinking Coffee 2",
    ["玩家回来"] = "Player Returns",
    ["玩家回血"] = "Player Heal",
    ["玩家固定视角"] = "Player Fixed Perspective",
    ["玩家在客户端发起技能"] = "Player initiates skill on client.",
    ["玩家在木头人阶段移动，会加该buff，然后玩家变成石头，不能移动"] = "If the player moves during the wooden dummy stage, this buff will be added, and then the player turns into stone and cannot move.",
    ["玩家在聊天频道发送指定文本"] = "Player sends specified text in chat channel",
    ["玩家在聊天频道发送指定文本  "] = "Player sends specified text in the chat channel",
    ["玩家在被选中为凝视目标后，应找到最近的书架并躲在书架背后，<Highlight>让书架帮自己抵挡锁定激光攻击</>。"] = "After being selected as the Gaze target, players should find the nearest bookshelf and hide behind it, <Highlight>letting the bookshelf help them block the locked laser attack</>.",
    ["玩家在该阶段，需要在倒计时结束前，转火并击杀<Disable>至少两只小狒狒</>获取全部音符，并根据乐谱提示，按<Disable>顺序拾取</>音符，即可完成机制。"] = "During this phase, players must switch targets and kill <Disable>at least two small baboons</> before the countdown ends to obtain all musical notes. Then, follow the sheet music prompts to <Disable>pick up the notes in order</> to complete the mechanic.",
