    ["玩家定点"] = "Player Fixed Point",
    ["玩家定点位置"] = "Player Fixed Position",
    ["玩家将根据投影在战场上的表现而累计得分：\n按照存活的排名，前三名投影依次获得<Highlight>60,40,30</>分，\n每有其他投影阵亡，自身投影获得<Highlight>3</>分，\n击杀其他投影获得<Highlight>5</>分。\n玩家需投入<Highlight>8</>名以上的投影以获得奖励。比赛结束后，总分优秀者与对应投影数据突出者将额外获得<Highlight>称号</>奖励。"] = "Players will accumulate points based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield: \nBased on survival ranking, the top three projections receive <Highlight>60, 40, 30</> points respectively, \nfor every other projection that falls, your own projection gains <Highlight>3</> points, \nand killing other projections grants <Highlight>5</> points. \nPlayers must deploy at least <Highlight>8</> projections to be eligible for rewards. After the match ends, those with excellent total scores and those with outstanding projection data will receive additional <Highlight>Title</> rewards.",
