    ["玩家需要<Highlight>控制好彼此之间的距离</>，在连连看的状态下规避各种范围伤害。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>control the distance between each other well</> and avoid various area-of-effect damage while in the linked state.",
    ["玩家需要<Highlight>灵活走位</>，规避冰柱。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>move flexibly</> to avoid the ice pillars.",
    ["玩家需要<Highlight>牵引绯红意志远离月华</>。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>lead the Crimson Will away from the moonlight</>.",
    ["玩家需要<Highlight>观察技能预警</>，做好提前规避。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>observe skill warnings</> and prepare to evade in advance.",
    ["玩家需要一边躲避舞王狒哥的攻击，一边拾取音符获取舞力值。"] = "Players need to dodge the Dancing King Baboon Brother's attacks while picking up musical notes to gain Dance Power.",
    ["玩家需要在<Highlight>10秒内同时打败</>梅迪奇和乌洛琉斯。"] = "Players need to defeat Medici and Ouroboros simultaneously within <Highlight>10 seconds</>.",
    ["玩家需要在瑞尔比伯阅读完成前，尽快<Highlight>击破护盾</>。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>break the shield</> as soon as possible before Riel Bieber finishes reading.",
    ["玩家需要在队友被冲锋时<Highlight>主动前往路径</>，分摊伤害。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>actively move into the path</> when a teammate is being charged to share the damage.",
    ["玩家需要尽快<Highlight>击毁能量球</>。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>destroy the energy ball</> as soon as possible.",
    ["玩家需要尽快<Highlight>分散站位</>，避免受到<Highlight>多次诅咒伤害</>。"] = "Players need to <Highlight>spread out</> as soon as possible to avoid taking <Highlight>multiple curse damage instances</>.",
    ["玩家需要尽快<Highlight>消灭幽影</>，被消灭的幽影会产生<Highlight>安全区域。</>"] = "Players need to <Highlight>eliminate the Shadow</> as soon as possible; the eliminated Shadow will create a <Highlight>safe zone</>.",
    ["玩家需要快速<Highlight>集火服务员</>，然后<Highlight>靠近餐车</>，拾取蛋糕后，<Highlight>投掷蛋糕攻击</>青蛙王子，或者<Highlight>推车撞击</>青蛙王子。"] = "Players need to quickly <Highlight>concentrate fire on the waiter</>, then <Highlight>approach the food cart</>. After picking up the cake, <Highlight>throw the cake to attack</> the Frog Prince, or <Highlight>push the cart to impact</> the Frog Prince.",
    ["玩家需解锁伙伴后，才可使用套路功能。"] = "Players must unlock partners before they can use the combo function.",
