    ["玫瑰残党"] = "Rose Survivor",
    ["玫瑰的附近围绕着丝丝缕缕的黑气，是怨念灵性的残留。"] = "The roses are surrounded by wisps of black energy, the remnants of lingering resentment and spirituality.",
