    ["环线左轨滑"] = "Loop Line Left Rail Slide",
    ["环绕的光辉，像一圈缓慢流转的星河。它会将最耀眼的名字铭刻于上。因此，人们称它为「见证之环」。"] = "The surrounding radiance is like a slowly flowing galaxy. It will engrave the most dazzling names upon it. Therefore, people call it the \"Ring of Witness.\"",
    ["环绕着拉姆德小镇的山路，常常有游客在这里休憩。"] = "The mountain road surrounding Lamud Town, where tourists often rest.",
    ["环绕着拉姆德小镇的山路，距离小镇距离不远，镇民们也常常来这里游玩。"] = "The mountain road surrounding Lamud Town; it is not far from the town, and the townspeople often come here to play.",
    ["环节1-1-前往触发器，推进副本阶段"] = "Phase 1-1 - Head to the trigger to advance the dungeon stage",
