    ["现在"] = "Present",
    ["现在……向我提问……"] = "Now... ask me a question...",
    ["现在……是什么时间了？"] = "What... time is it now?",
    ["现在……该做出选择了。"] = "Now... it's time to make a choice.",
    ["现在……该征服我的全部了。"] = "Now... it's time to conquer all of me.",
    ["现在《夜访》成了我弹得最好的一首曲子。"] = "Now 'Night Visit' has become the piece I play best.",
    ["现在下结论还为时过早。"] = "It's too early to draw conclusions now.",
    ["现在不是哭的时候，要振作啊爱丽丝！"] = "Now is not the time to cry, pull yourself together, Alice!",
    ["现在也喜欢。"] = "I still like it now.",
    ["现在从廷根就可以直接去往北面山脉和南面海港，驶向贝克兰德的列车数量变成了之前的两倍。"] = "Now, you can travel directly from Tingen to the northern mountains and the southern harbor, and the number of trains heading to Backlund has doubled.",
    ["现在他委托我，遵循命运的指引，把金币转交给你。"] = "Now he has entrusted me to follow the guidance of fate and pass the gold coin to you.",
    ["现在以及每个阶段开始时，获得4经验值和2次免费商店刷新。"] = "Now and at the start of each stage, gain 4 EXP and 2 free shop refreshes.",
    ["现在以及每个阶段开始时，获得8经验值和2次免费商店刷新。"] = "Now and at the start of each stage, gain 8 EXP and 2 free shop refreshes.",
    ["现在仪式都结束了，你成功获得了想要之物，我也该离开了。"] = "Now that the ritual is over and you have successfully obtained what you wanted, I should leave as well.",
    ["现在你是导演，可以随意布置<P_Yellow>场景</>和<P_Yellow>道具</>，演员们也会听从你的安排。"] = "Now you are the director. You can arrange the <P_Yellow>scene</> and <P_Yellow>props</> as you wish, and the actors will follow your instructions.",
    ["现在卤鹅王国暂时<P_Yellow>风调雨顺</>，今天还可以进行<P_Yellow>一</>项事务，你打算做什么？"] = "Currently, the Goose Kingdom is temporarily <P_Yellow>enjoying favorable weather</>. You can perform <P_Yellow>one</> task today. What do you intend to do?",
    ["现在卤鹅王国暂时<P_Yellow>风调雨顺</>，今天还可以进行<P_Yellow>三</>项事务，你打算做什么？"] = "Currently, the Goose Kingdom is temporarily <P_Yellow>enjoying favorable weather</>. You can perform <P_Yellow>three</> tasks today. What do you intend to do?",
    ["现在卤鹅王国暂时<P_Yellow>风调雨顺</>，今天还可以进行<P_Yellow>两</>项事务，你打算做什么？"] = "Currently, the Goose Kingdom is temporarily <P_Yellow>enjoying favorable weather</>. You can perform <P_Yellow>two</> tasks today. What do you intend to do?",
    ["现在危机解除，还是解下领带，回去告诉凯娜吧。"] = "Now that the crisis is resolved, I'd better take off the tie and go back to tell Kena.",
    ["现在去直接调查还是有危险，不过放心，他们的行动一直在监视中。"] = "It is still dangerous to go and investigate directly now, but don't worry, their actions are under constant surveillance.",
    ["现在取号，预计等待时间两个月！"] = "Taking a number now, the estimated waiting time is two months!",
    ["现在可以填充非凡物质了！"] = "You can now fill in Beyonder materials!",
    ["现在可以清除这些涂鸦了！"] = "Now I can clear these scribbles!",
    ["现在可以进行非凡物质聚合了！"] = "You can now perform Beyonder material aggregation!",
    ["现在可以进行非凡物质装配了！"] = "You can now perform Beyonder material assembly!",
    ["现在吹响我 戴莉！"] = "Blow me now, Daly!",
    ["现在呢？洗火车头的清洁工？也许早死在了下水道里。"] = "And now? A cleaner washing locomotives? Maybe he died in the sewers long ago.",
    ["现在在本店办卡，可以享受七折优惠。"] = "Apply for a card at our shop now and you can enjoy a 70% Discount.",
    ["现在她总说托马斯还在，就在她旁边坐着。有时还给空座位倒酒，说托马斯爱喝这口……"] = "Now she always says Thomas is still here, sitting right next to her. Sometimes she even pours a drink for the empty seat, saying Thomas loves this stuff...",
    ["现在她来了，我无法阻止，无法面对，就像又一次站在战场上！我知道…我知道……"] = "Now she is here, I cannot stop her, I cannot face her, it is just like standing on the battlefield once again! I know… I know……",
    ["现在她走了，我还精心维护着花丛，等着她有一天能回来。"] = "Now that she's gone, I still meticulously maintain the flowers, waiting for the day she might return.",
    ["现在好了！裘德都撕破脸皮向他讨债了，他还以为人家是好人!"] = "Now look! Jude has dropped the mask and is demanding debt from him, and he still thinks the guy is a good person!",
    ["现在好了，听说好几个都在古堡撞见了不干净的东西！"] = "Now look, I heard several of them encountered something unclean at the castle!",
    ["现在好多了！蒂尔达一定会喜欢的。嘿嘿。"] = "Much better now! Tilda will definitely like it. Hehe.",
    ["现在实验结束，我把这个意识还给他们了。"] = "Now that the experiment is over, I have returned this consciousness to them.",
    ["现在就他们能帮我们找到那只肮脏的老鼠了！"] = "Right now, they're the only ones who can help us find that filthy rat!",
    ["现在就去！"] = "Go now!",
    ["现在就只需要藏起来等待笔友小姐了。"] = "Now I just need to hide it and wait for Miss Pen Pal.",
    ["现在就是仪式的开始！"] = "Now is the start of the ritual!",
    ["现在就来试试搭配吧"] = "Try coordinating now.",
    ["现在就算没什么特别的事，我也喜欢过来坐一坐，点杯喝的，看会儿报纸。"] = "Even if there's nothing special going on, I like to come over, sit for a while, order a drink, and read the newspaper.",
    ["现在市面上的花价跌得厉害，那些工厂女工都去买人造花了，谁还愿意花大价钱买真花？"] = "The price of flowers on the market has fallen sharply. Those factory girls are all buying artificial flowers; who would be willing to spend a lot of money on real ones?",
    ["现在年轻人，都不爱结婚了，我觉得这是一个很严重的问题！"] = "Young people these days don't like to get married; I think this is a very serious problem!",
    ["现在应该做的是……"] = "What we should do now is...",
    ["现在开始"] = "Start Now",
    ["现在开始领取号码牌！"] = "Now starting to distribute number tags!",
    ["现在开始！"] = "Starting now!",
    ["现在弗萨克人还敢跑到我们的大门口挑衅！"] = "The Feynapotters still dare to run to our doorstep and provoke us!",
    ["现在很危险，还不能过去。"] = "It's dangerous now, you can't go over yet.",
    ["现在总算没人再让我来等一等了，可好像很多东西……我都已经错过了。"] = "Now finally no one is asking me to wait anymore, but it seems many things... I have already missed.",
    ["现在想想，罗塞尔一开始只是个不起眼的小贵族，靠自己的努力才成了大帝。"] = "Thinking about it now, Roselle was just an inconspicuous minor noble at first, and he only became Emperor through his own efforts.",
    ["现在想想，要是能再陪她挑一次就好了……"] = "Now that I think about it, if only I could accompany her to pick one out again...",
    ["现在想来，那真是一段美好的时光……虽然工厂老板很吝啬、工作也很繁重……"] = "Thinking back now, that was truly a wonderful time... although the factory owner was stingy and the work was heavy...",
    ["现在感受到战斗属性增强的感觉了吧。"] = "Now you can feel the enhancement of your combat attributes.",
    ["现在感觉怎么样？"] = "How are you feeling now?",
    ["现在我也不能完全解答你的疑惑，但以后我会尽力帮助你，揭开自身的谜团。"] = "I cannot fully answer your doubts right now, but I will try my best to help you uncover the mysteries of yourself in the future.",
    ["现在我们为了提前规避灾厄，选择在某处村庄休眠......"] = "Now, in order to avoid disaster in advance, we have chosen to sleep in a certain village...",
    ["现在我们呼吸同一片空气，这就很幸福了。"] = "Now we breathe the same air, and that is happiness enough.",
    ["现在我在伯克伦德街做住家教师，在那幢房子里也能眺望到圣赛缪尔大教堂。"] = "Now I work as a live-in tutor on Berklund Street, and from that house, I can also gaze upon St. Samuel Cathedral.",
    ["现在我弄明白了，你就得把那些手脚发软，脸色发白的东西放在上面晾一会儿，别老让他们妨碍公共建设事业。"] = "I've figured it out now; you just have to leave those weak-kneed, pale-faced things up there to air out for a while, and don't let them keep getting in the way of public construction projects.",
    ["现在我摆脱了那副躯壳，轻松多了。至少我能大大方方站在阳光下，飘在空气里四处走走。"] = "Now that I have shed that shell, I feel much lighter. At least I can stand openly in the sunlight and drift around in the air.",
    ["现在我终于摆脱了那副躯壳，能在阳光下，听一会渺远的钟声。"] = "Now I have finally escaped that shell, and I can listen to the distant bell in the sunlight for a while.",
    ["现在我还有什么？哈哈，我还有三根卷烟……"] = "What do I have now? Haha, I still have three cigarettes...",
    ["现在我需要……第五纪正神教会典籍与神谕汇编资料。"] = "Now I need... the compilation of scriptures and oracles of the orthodox churches of the Fifth Epoch.",
    ["现在明白，也不算太晚。"] = "It is not too late to understand now.",
    ["现在是什么时候，看来我又喝多了，昨天我看到老特勒了，那该死的混蛋居然想要抢我的酒。"] = "What time is it now? It seems I drank too much again. I saw Old Trelle yesterday. That damn bastard actually wanted to snatch my wine.",
    ["现在是寻找戒指时间，请您也加入我的计划。"] = "Now it's ring-finding time; please join my plan.",
    ["现在是茶点时间，请往远处站一些，你挡住阳光了。"] = "It's tea time now, please stand further away, you're blocking the sunlight.",
    ["现在更美。让我看看晨光中的你……"] = "You are even more beautiful now. Let me look at you in the morning light...",
    ["现在最应该关注的是……"] = "What we should focus on right now is...",
    ["现在最重要的是找到<P_Yellow>亚瑟</>。艾琳，你先冷静。"] = "The most important thing now is to find <P_Yellow> Arthur </>. Irene, calm down first.",
    ["现在最重要的还是确保她的安全……先以这本书为媒介，用<P_Yellow>灵卜</>找到她的踪迹吧。"] = "The most important thing now is to ensure her safety... Let's use this book as a medium and use <P_Yellow> Spirit Divination </> to find her tracks.",
    ["现在最重要的，是唤醒黛西小姐，避免类似的事情再次发生。"] = "The most important thing now is to wake Miss Daisy and prevent similar things from happening again.",
    ["现在有两个关键人物，一个是蜡烛工坊的<P_Yellow>学徒芬恩</>，但他已经有一年多不做蜡烛了，而且，他的老师维斯塔也自杀了。"] = "There are two key figures now. One is the <P_Yellow>Apprentice Finn</> from the candle workshop, but he hasn't made candles for over a year, and his teacher, Vesta, also committed suicide.",
    ["现在有请会长，贝尔纳黛女士，宣布比赛开始！"] = "Now, let's invite the President, Ms. Bernadette, to announce the start of the match!",
    ["现在每次来学派，我都会找一个人磨练棋艺。以后若是还能和我父亲对局，一定——按你们的说法——杀得他片甲不留。"] = "Now every time I come to the school, I find someone to hone my chess skills. If I can play against my father again in the future, I will definitely—as you say—leave him without a single piece left.",
    ["现在流行什么"] = "What's popular now?",
    ["现在的人为了利益，指不定要干出什么违背良心的事。愿大地母神庇佑你健康，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "People these days, for the sake of profit, who knows what kind of things they'll do against their conscience. May the Earth Mother bless you with health, Mr./Ms. {{|}}.",
    ["现在的学生，真没规矩。"] = "Students these days really have no manners.",
    ["现在的工作可不好找，如果你们愿意接受5便士的价格，我可以考虑多招一个人。"] = "Jobs are hard to find now, if you are willing to accept the price of 5 pennies, I can consider hiring one more person.",
    ["现在的年轻人哟，听得风就是雨……"] = "Young people these days, they believe whatever they hear...",
    ["现在的年轻人啊……哎，真是缺乏进取精神啊，你要是能有罗塞尔一半的努力……"] = "Young people these days... sigh, really lacking in enterprising spirit. If you could have half of Roselle's effort...",
    ["现在的廷根"] = "Tingen now",
    ["现在的廷根，怪事越来越多了。真不知道，我们这些小市民要如何生存。"] = "In Tingen nowadays, there are more and more strange things. I really don't know how we ordinary citizens are going to survive.",
    ["现在的开膛手又是扮演怎样的角色？一切到底是怎么一回事……"] = "What kind of role is the Ripper playing now? What is everything really about...",
    ["现在的我——是一个顶着人头的恶魔。"] = "The person I am now—is a devil wearing a human head.",
    ["现在的我不是完全的它……只是一部分，更多的力量被封印在其他的地方了，我能感受到。"] = "I am not the complete version of it right now… just a part. More of its power is sealed away in other places; I can feel it.",
    ["现在的我是索罗·卡特。"] = "Now I am Solo Carter.",
    ["现在的我能为你做些什么呢"] = "What can I do for you now?",
    ["现在的非凡者也更容易晋升，失控，风险和机遇并存。"] = "Beyonders are also easier to advance now, but there is a risk of losing control. Risks and opportunities coexist.",
    ["现在看来，这个决定是正确的。"] = "Now it seems that this decision was correct.",
    ["现在结算获取城堡资材会触达上限，无法获取全量城堡资材，是否确认获取？"] = "Settling now will reach the cap for obtaining castle resources, and you will not be able to receive the full amount. Are you sure you want to proceed with the collection?",
    ["现在能在廷根码头搬运货物，对我来说已经很不错了。"] = "Being able to move cargo at the Tingen docks now is already quite good for me.",
    ["现在能坐火车了都"] = "We can even take the train now.",
    ["现在蒸汽列车只要四小时——但我强烈推荐你坐船去，可以欣赏塔索克河的沿途风光，绝对是难忘的体验，你也需要放松一下了！"] = "The steam train only takes four hours now—but I strongly recommend you go by ship. You can enjoy the scenery along the Tussock River; it is definitely an unforgettable experience, and you need to relax too!",
    ["现在裤子也湿了，有人在用凉水浇我！求你快帮帮我吧，我只有一条裤子啊！"] = "Now my pants are wet too, someone is pouring cold water on me! Please help me quickly, I only have one pair of pants!",
    ["现在让我们揭晓谜底，“幸运蛋”的数字编号是……它的第一位数字是8！"] = "Now let's reveal the answer. The 'Lucky Egg' number is... its first digit is 8!",
    ["现在该怎么办"] = "What should I do now?",
    ["现在该把你送回去了。记住，碰上事——干就完了！"] = "Now it's time to send you back. Remember, when you run into trouble—just go for it!",
    ["现在该试试<P_Yellow>特别的调查方法</>了。"] = "Now it's time to try the <P_Yellow> special investigation method </>.",
    ["现在谁还学历史啊？老掉牙又没意思的东西……"] = "Who studies history nowadays? Such an old-fashioned and boring thing...",
    ["现在谁还用手工做的蜡烛啊，大工厂做的蜡烛又细腻又便宜，还没怪味。"] = "Who uses handmade candles anymore? Candles made in big factories are delicate, cheap, and don't have a weird smell.",
    ["现在购买还可以获得装饰雕花服务，无论家族纹章还是名字缩写都可以定制！"] = "Purchase now and you can also get decorative engraving services; whether it's a family crest or initials, it can be customized!",
    ["现在购买还可以附赠品质上好的擦枪绸布——也可以定制为决斗白手套。"] = "Purchasing now also comes with a high-quality gun-cleaning cloth—which can also be customized into a dueling glove.",
    ["现在赶紧找主演"] = "Hurry and find the lead actor now",
    ["现在跟我一起，重历救赎之路，传播我主光辉。"] = "Now follow me, re-experience the path of salvation, and spread the glory of my Lord.",
    ["现在还不确定呢，别担心了，先想想今晚吃什么？"] = "It's not certain yet, don't worry. Why don't you think about what to have for dinner tonight instead?",
    ["现在还没法确定其中的含义……需要了解更多情况。"] = "It's impossible to determine the meaning for now... I need to learn more about the situation.",
    ["现在这个世道，穷人都活得不长久。"] = "In this day and age, the poor don't live long.",
    ["现在这个时代，具备自嘲精神的绅士越来越少了，幸运的是，我们今天又遇到一位。"] = "In this era, there are fewer and fewer gentlemen with a spirit of self-deprecation. Fortunately, we met another one today.",
    ["现在这样就很好，我可以一直留在廷根，一直守护这里。"] = "It's fine as it is now. I can stay in Tingen forever and keep guarding this place.",
    ["现在这样足够了。"] = "This is enough for now.",
    ["现在那幅画的价格已经涨到一千五百镑了。"] = "Now the price of that painting has risen to fifteen hundred pounds.",
    ["现在都什么年代了，还撞冰山！而且海报贴在教堂，肯定有风暴教会的庇佑。"] = "What era is this, still talking about hitting icebergs! Besides, the posters are posted at the church, so it must have the blessing of the Church of Storms.",
    ["现在镇上的人怎么看待那座古堡？"] = "How do the people in town view the castle now?",
    ["现在，一切准备就绪，伯爵已然归来！"] = "Now, everything is ready; the Count has returned!",
    ["现在，你前往仪式台布置一下仪式魔法吧。"] = "Now, go to the ritual altar and set up the Ritual Magic.",
    ["现在，你可以走出门去，向我提问了。"] = "Now, you can walk out the door and ask me questions.",
    ["现在，光就在我面前，可能熄灭，也可能燃烧——这取决于我们所有人的选择。"] = "Now, the light is right in front of me; it may be extinguished, or it may burn—this depends on the choices of all of us.",
    ["现在，入梦吧。"] = "Now, enter the dream.",
    ["现在，可以探索记忆的更多角落了。"] = "Now, I can explore more corners of the memory.",
    ["现在，各位可以自由漫步。"] = "Now, everyone is free to wander around.",
    ["现在，它是你的了，“愚者”先生亲自为这件服饰赋予了神降的奇迹，好好珍藏它。"] = "Now, it is yours. Mr. Fool personally bestowed the miracle of divine descent upon this garment. Treasure it well.",
    ["现在，它是你的了，愚者先生亲自为这件服饰赋予了神降的奇迹，好好珍藏它。"] = "Now, it is yours. Mr. Fool personally bestowed the miracle of divine descent upon this garment. Treasure it well.",
    ["现在，我就要带着他的那份好奇继续努力鼓捣了！"] = "Now, I'm going to continue tinkering with his share of curiosity!",
    ["现在，我要大声对他们说：“你们被解雇了！”"] = "Now, I want to say loudly to them: 'You're fired!'",
    ["现在，我要将你们这些人，全部，斩杀！！！"] = "Now, I am going to execute all of you!!!",
    ["现在，政客们握手言和，一切恢复如常。可那些为此去世的人呢？"] = "Now, the politicians have shaken hands and made peace, and everything is back to normal. But what about those who died for it?",
    ["现在，狩猎！"] = "Now, hunt!",
    ["现在，用灵视追溯怨念源头吧。"] = "Now, use spirit vision to trace the source of the resentment.",
    ["现在，神灵们不再以具体的形象示人，只用象征符号代替自身。"] = "Now, the gods no longer appear in concrete images, but use symbolic signs to represent themselves.",
    ["现在，让我来成为……"] = "Now, let me become...",
    ["现在，试着把它扭成环……"] = "Now, try twisting it into a loop...",
    ["现在，该你上场了。为了廷根的未来，开始一场大清扫吧！"] = "Now, it's your turn. For the future of Tingen, start a great cleanup!",
    ["现在，走出门，看看黑荆棘安保公司门外。"] = "Now, walk out the door and look outside the Blackthorn Security Company.",
    ["现在，跟我来做些准备——带上封印物。"] = "Now, come with me to make some preparations—bring the Sealed Artifact.",
    ["现在，这里只有两个“同病相怜”的人了。"] = "Now, there are only two \"fellow sufferers\" here.",
    ["现在，阿兹克苏醒后开始旅行追寻过往，也书写着给克莱恩的回信。"] = "Now, after Azik wakes up, he begins to travel in search of the past and also writes reply letters to Klein.",
    ["现场没有那本第四纪遗留的笔记，整栋房屋里都没有，而其他相关人员都死了。"] = "The notebook left over from the Fourth Epoch is not at the scene; it's not in the entire house, and everyone else involved is dead.",
    ["现场留下了大片尚未干透的茶渍。茶杯翻倒在尸体附近，茶壶和托盘则被摆放在书桌上。"] = "A large patch of tea stains that hadn't dried yet was left at the scene. The teacup was overturned near the body, while the teapot and tray were placed on the desk.",
    ["现场茶水状态与霍克斯男爵死前的情况不符，说明有人为霍克斯男爵重新添过茶。"] = "The state of the tea at the scene is inconsistent with the situation before Baron Howkes's death, indicating that someone had refilled the tea for Baron Howkes.",
    ["现实主线"] = "Reality Main Quest",
