    ["珠宝的耀眼会被飞雪遮掩，但得体的搭配永不会黯淡，来吧！让我看看你的品鉴方式。"] = "The dazzle of jewelry will be obscured by flying snow, but appropriate attire will never fade. Come on! Let me see your way of appreciation.",
