    ["班森2走近桌旁定位点"] = "Benson 2 Approach Table Anchor Point",
    ["班森·莫雷蒂"] = "Benson Moretti",
    ["班森·莫雷蒂的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Benson Moretti, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["班森·莫雷蒂，莫雷蒂家的长兄，一个用幽默包裹责任感的顶梁柱。\n\n他永远记得父母离世后，自己是如何扛起这个家的。他省吃俭用供克莱恩读大学，支持梅丽莎去技术学校学机械。他在进出口公司忍受裁员和加班，后来通过考试成为贝克兰德财政部的政府雇员，只为给弟妹更好的生活。\n他嘴硬心软，从不说“我担心你”，只会吐槽“卷毛狒狒都比你强”；他敏感精明，对物价和房租斤斤计较，但只为让家人过得更好；他擅长用“卷毛狒狒”抨击社会不公，却从不对弟弟和妹妹发火。\n当克莱恩找到工作时，他说“有种看见孩子长大的感觉”；当空袭警报响起时，他在混乱中寻找梅丽莎，确认她“没事就好”。\n他最终成为了财政部的公务人员，还有了自己的家庭……但他永远是那个在煤气灯下计算房租、在餐桌前讲笑话的班森。\n\n他是普通人中的“非凡者”，用自己的方式，在时代的洪流中守护最珍贵的东西——家人。"] = "Benson Moretti, the eldest brother of the Moretti family, a pillar who wraps his sense of responsibility in humor. \n \n He always remembers how he shouldered the burden of this family after his parents passed away. He lived frugally to support Klein through university and supported Melissa to go to technical school to learn mechanics. He endured layoffs and overtime at the import and export company, and later became a government employee in the Backlund Ministry of Finance after passing an exam, just to give his younger brother and sister a better life. \n He is tough-mouthed but soft-hearted, never saying “I’m worried about you,” only complaining that “even a Curly-Haired Baboon is better than you”; he is sensitive and shrewd, haggling over prices and rent, but only to let his family live better; he is good at using “Curly-Haired Baboon” to criticize social injustice, but never gets angry at his brother and sister. \n When Klein found a job, he said, “I have a feeling of watching a child grow up”; when the air raid siren sounded, he searched for Melissa in the chaos, confirming that she was “fine.” \n He eventually became a civil servant in the Ministry of Finance and had his own family… but he will always be the Benson who calculates rent under the gas lamp and tells jokes at the dinner table. \n \n He is a “Beyonder” among ordinary people, using his own way to guard the most precious things in the torrent of the era—his family.",
    ["班森中点"] = "Benson midpoint",
    ["班森先生，听说您很擅长……砍价？"] = "Mr. Benson, I heard you are very good at... bargaining?",
    ["班森先生，您好像经常提起弗兰奇先生？"] = "Mr. Benson, you seem to mention Mr. Frank often?",
    ["班森先生，莫雷蒂家平时是什么样的？"] = "Mr. Benson, what is the Moretti family usually like?",
    ["班森出场路点"] = "Benson entrance waypoint",
    ["班森出门"] = "Benson leaves",
    ["班森回来了？！"] = "Benson is back?!",
    ["班森在和弗兰奇对话"] = "Benson is talking to Franky",
