    ["班森进行讨价还价，随机掷出1-5枚硬币，根据硬币数量决定折扣力度，根据折扣力度获得增益。"] = "Benson bargains, randomly rolling 1-5 coins. The discount is determined by the number of coins, and he gains a buff based on the discount.",
    ["班森进行讨价还价，随机掷出<FaintYellow>1-5</>枚硬币，根据硬币数量决定折扣力度，根据折扣力度获得增益。"] = "Benson bargains, randomly rolling <FaintYellow>1-5</> coins. The discount is determined by the number of coins, and he gains a buff based on the discount.",
    ["班森进行讨价还价，随机掷出<HighLight>1-5</>枚，根据硬币数量决定折扣力度，根据折扣力度令自身获得增益，持续<HighLight>9</>秒。\n<HighLight>1</>枚九折：buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>2</>枚八折：buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>3</>枚七折：buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>4</>枚六折：buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>5</>枚五折：buffdisc(*id)"] = "Benson bargains, randomly rolling <HighLight>1-5</> coins. The discount is determined by the number of coins, and he gains a buff based on the discount, lasting <HighLight>9</> seconds. \n<HighLight>1</> coin: 90% Discount: buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>2</> coins: 80% Discount: buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>3</> coins: 70% Discount: buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>4</> coins: 60% Discount: buffdisc(*id)\n<HighLight>5</> coins: 50% Discount: buffdisc(*id)",
    ["班森镜头"] = "Benson Shot",
    ["班森镜头2"] = "Benson Shot 2",
    ["班森隐秘羁绊"] = "Benson Secret Bond",
    ["班森隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Benson secret bond reward.",
    ["班森，你也很适合这么穿。"] = "Benson, you look very good in that too.",
    ["班森，你真是一个有良心，做事诚实的年轻人！"] = "Benson, you really are a conscientious and honest young man!",
    ["班森，你觉得呢？"] = "Benson, what do you think?",
    ["班森，你错了。"] = "Benson, you're wrong.",
    ["班森，欢迎回家。怎么不提前说一声，我们可以去车站接你。"] = "Benson, welcome home. Why didn't you say anything in advance? We could have picked you up at the station.",
    ["班森：“哈，姜汁啤酒！我可太想念这个味道了。”"] = "Benson: \"Ha, ginger beer! I've missed this taste so much.\"",
    ["班森：下雨了……我去雇一辆马车。"] = "Benson: It's raining... I'll go hire a carriage.",
    ["班森：不论如何，我们都要开始更好的新生活了。"] = "Benson: Regardless, we are all going to start a better new life.",
    ["班森：也是最好的弟弟……我最好的弟弟……"] = "Benson: And the best younger brother... my best younger brother...",
    ["班森：克莱恩，这些会不会太多了？"] = "Benson: Klein, won't these be too many?",
    ["班森：呵呵，让我们一起期待这场戏剧吧，三个人一起去看的戏剧。"] = "Benson: Hehe, let's look forward to this play together, a play the three of us will watch together.",
    ["班森：噢，我突然觉得自己又充满了力量！\n梅丽莎：我、我也还有力气！"] = "Benson: Oh, I suddenly feel full of strength again!\n Melissa: I, I still have energy too!",
    ["班森：好吧，好吧，我听你们的。"] = "Benson: Alright, alright, I'll listen to you two.",
    ["班森：如果政府真的决定通过考试来选拔官员，这些付出都是值得的。"] = "Benson: If the government really decides to select officials through examinations, all this effort will be worth it.",
    ["班森：希望我不会溺死在知识的海洋里……"] = "Benson: I hope I won't drown in the ocean of knowledge...",
    ["班森：搬家真是太累了……"] = "Benson: Moving is just so tiring...",
    ["班森：来，我先把钥匙分给你们。"] = "Benson: Come, let me hand out the keys to you both.",
    ["班森：梅丽莎……"] = "Benson: Melissa...",
    ["班森：算啦，梅丽莎对开支的计算一直是这样精细的。"] = "Benson: Never mind, Melissa has always been this meticulous with calculating expenses.",
    ["班森：还全都是文法方面的书籍……在这些书籍面前，我感觉自己像只卷毛狒狒。"] = "Benson: And they are all grammar books... In front of these books, I feel like a curly-haired baboon.",
    ["班森？他以前在一家进出口公司工作，周薪1鎊10苏勒。"] = "Benson? He used to work at an import-export company with a weekly salary of 1 pound and 10 soli.",
    ["班森？他以前在一家进出口公司工作，周薪1镑10苏勒。"] = "Benson? He used to work at an import and export company with a weekly salary of 1 pound and 10 shillings.",
    ["班纳"] = "Banner",
    ["班西港位于苏尼亚海深处，名义上属于风暴之主教会的辖区，实际上却藏着很多秘密。"] = "Bansi Harbor is located deep within the Sonia Sea. Nominally, it falls under the jurisdiction of the Church of the Lord of Storms, but in reality, it hides many secrets.",
    ["班西特供活贻贝|鲁恩白葡萄酒|迷迭香"] = "Bansi Specialty Live Mussels | Loen White Wine | Rosemary",
    ["球内暗红涌动，倒映着一双不属于自己的瞳孔。"] = "Dark red surges within the sphere, reflecting a pair of pupils that do not belong to oneself.",
    ["球心悬浮着从对手灵性中析出的弱点，尚未凝固。"] = "Suspended at the center of the sphere are the weaknesses extracted from the opponent's spirituality, not yet solidified.",
    ["球状灌木被修剪成柱形，正是富人庭院里最受欢迎的款式。"] = "Spherical shrubs are trimmed into columns, which is the most popular style in the gardens of the wealthy.",
