    ["理智的观众"] = "Rational audience",
    ["理智等级达到60级开启后续剧情，可前往<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250015\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250008\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250331\">探秘</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250093\">竞技</>以及<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">躺赢</>中参与各项活动，获得认知经验。"] = "Reach Sanity Level 60 to unlock subsequent story content. You can participate in various activities in <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250015\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250008\">Dungeon</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250331\">Exploration</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250093\">Competition</>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">Idle Rewards</> to gain cognitive experience.",
    ["理智等级达到60级开启后续剧情，可前往<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">剧情</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250131\">副本</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250331\">探秘</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250093\">竞技</>以及<HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">躺赢</>中参与各项活动，获得认知经验。"] = "Subsequent story unlocks at sanity level 60. You can go to <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">Story</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250131\">Dungeon</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250331\">Exploration</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250093\">Competitive</>, and <HyperLink stylename=\"h\" u=\"1250163\">Idle Win</> to participate in various activities and gain cognition experience.",
