    ["理查"] = "Richard",
    ["理查德"] = "Richard",
    ["理清当前做法（直觉不合理），然后改名"] = "Clarify current approach (intuitively unreasonable), then rename.",
    ["理解什么？"] = "Understand what?",
    ["理解加深，离完全消化就差一点……"] = "Understanding deepened, just a little bit away from full digestion...",
    ["理解您的心情。这样，我们进去，我把所有原始单据、您的签字记录、成本合约一一拿给您看。布莱克，我记得这些物品的整理你做得很好，对吧？"] = "I understand how you feel. How about this: we go inside, and I will show you all the original receipts, your signed records, and the cost contracts one by one. Blake, I remember you did a great job organizing these items, right?",
    ["理论上是这样，但是……"] = "Theoretically, yes, but...",
