    ["瑞安"] = "Ryan",
    ["瑞安·"] = "Ryan ",
    ["瑞安娜"] = "Riana",
    ["瑞安娜……还是不要去烦她了，这女人麻烦得很。"] = "Riana... better not bother her; that woman is extremely troublesome.",
    ["瑞安娜女士是我们这的常驻占卜大师，擅长塔罗占卜，梦境占卜，星盘占卜。每次1苏勒。"] = "Ms. Riana is our resident divination master, specializing in Tarot divination, dream divination, and astrology. She charges 1 sol per session.",
    ["瑞尔"] = "Riel",
    ["瑞尔·比伯"] = "Ray Bieber",
    ["瑞尔·比伯……"] = "Ray Bieber...",
    ["瑞尔·比伯之死"] = "The death of Ray Bieber",
    ["瑞尔·比伯发动<Reminder_Red>跳压</>，躲避多段预警区域！"] = "Ray Bieber triggers <Reminder_Red> Jump Stomp </>, dodge the multi-stage warning areas!",
    ["瑞尔·比伯只是个普通人，但在非凡力量的诱惑之下，他的理智完全被吞噬了。那不是一般人类可以抵抗的诱惑。"] = "Ray Bieber was just an ordinary person, but under the temptation of extraordinary power, his sanity was completely swallowed. That is a temptation no ordinary human can resist.",
    ["瑞尔·比伯召唤了封印物2-049！小心其产生的滞涩区域！"] = "Ray Bieber has summoned Sealed Artifact 2-049! Beware of the Stagnant Area it creates!",
    ["瑞尔·比伯坠入梦境，陷入虚弱状态！"] = "Ray Bieber has fallen into a dream and is in a weakened state!",
    ["瑞尔·比伯对指定非凡者发动“吞噬”。"] = "Ray Bieber uses \"Devour\" on a designated Beyonder.",
    ["瑞尔·比伯就在附近？"] = "Is Riel Bieber nearby?",
    ["瑞尔·比伯是一个廷根珠宝匠人，周薪1镑15苏勒左右。"] = "Ray Bieber is a Tingen jeweler with a weekly salary of about 1 pound and 15 shillings.",
    ["瑞尔·比伯是个珠宝匠人，那这些都是加工珠宝的工具？很专业啊。"] = "Ray Bieber was a jeweler, so are these tools for processing jewelry? Very professional.",
    ["瑞尔·比伯渴望着洗心革面，渴望着平静的生活。可他身上的血脉却一刻不歇地鼓噪着：\n“安提哥努斯的后裔……你的身体里流淌着非凡的血脉，接近神明的力量！”\n“接触笔记……拥抱力量，掌控一切的力量。”\n未知的低语，日夜蛊惑着，一步步引导着可怜的人在拥抱阳光的前一刻，永远堕入了深渊。\n笔记的力量灌入身躯，侵蚀着他的四肢和躯干，吞噬着他的大脑与心脏，仅剩的血肉与骨骼被捆绑、重组。\n“家族……力量……属于我的……”\n瑞尔·比伯喘息着睁开眼，可是眼眶早已扭曲变形。无尽的悔意席卷，想要发出的恸哭，也被挤压的骨骼声淹没。\n“我……是谁？”\n身体与世界一同崩裂，最后只留下一团灰白。\n他，不再是他。"] = "Ray Bieber longed to turn over a new leaf, longing for a peaceful life. But the bloodline in his body clamored without a moment's rest: \n \"Descendant of Antigonus... The Beyonder characteristic flows in your body, the power approaching that of a God!\" \n \"Touch the notebook... Embrace the power, the power to control everything.\" \n Unknown whispers seduced him day and night, step by step guiding the poor man to fall into the abyss forever, just before he could embrace the sunlight. \n The power of the notebook poured into his body, eroding his limbs and torso, devouring his brain and heart; the remaining flesh and bones were bound and reorganized. \n \"Family... Power... Belonging to me...\" \n Ray Bieber gasped and opened his eyes, but his eye sockets were already twisted and deformed. Endless regret swept over him; the wail he wanted to let out was drowned out by the sound of crushing bones. \n \"Who... am I?\" \n His body collapsed along with the world, leaving only a mass of gray and white. \n He was no longer himself.",
    ["瑞尔·比伯狂暴，尽快击破护盾！"] = "Ray Bieber is berserk; break the shield as soon as possible!",
    ["瑞尔·比伯被非凡事件牵扯，死于诡异和混乱。韦尔奇和娜娅也是这样死的……"] = "Ray Bieber was involved in an extraordinary event and died due to strangeness and chaos. Welch and Naya died the same way...",
    ["瑞尔·比伯（精英）"] = "Riel Bieber (Elite)",
    ["瑞尔·比伯，安提哥努斯家族后裔。他偶然获得某本家族笔记，受其神秘力量侵蚀，在半清醒状态下亲手结束了母亲的生命。因笔记带来的污染持续恶化，他最终在失控中彻底沦为怪物。\n“妈妈……”"] = "Ray Bieber, a descendant of the Antigonus family. He accidentally obtained a family notebook and, eroded by its mysterious power, ended his mother's life in a semi-conscious state. Due to the worsening corruption brought by the notebook, he eventually completely devolved into a monster while out of control. \n \"Mom...\"",
    ["瑞尔……什么都没留下。"] = "Riel... didn't leave anything behind.",
    ["瑞尔不是坏人，如果你能见到他的话……"] = "Ray is not a bad person, if you can see him...",
    ["瑞尔工厂"] = "Riel Factory",
    ["瑞尔执意要走，没办法，我只能接替他带领猎龙帮，谁知道……"] = "Ray insisted on leaving. There was no choice, I had to take over leading the Dragon Hunter Gang. Who knew...",
    ["瑞尔比伯"] = "Riel Bieber",
    ["瑞尔比伯-1星"] = "Riel Bieber - 1 Star",
    ["瑞尔比伯-2星"] = "Riel Bieber - 2 Star",
    ["瑞尔比伯-3星"] = "Riel Bieber - 3 Star",
    ["瑞尔比伯<Disable>召唤记忆中的夜之城将玩家困住并变成木偶</>，然后开始释放技能<Disable>失控之盾</>。"] = "Riel Bieber <Disable>summons the City of Night from his memory to trap players and turn them into puppets</>, then begins to release the skill <Disable>Shield of Loss of Control</>.",
    ["瑞尔比伯<Disable>蓄力3秒</>后跃起并冲向地面，对附近玩家造成<Disable>大量伤害</>。"] = "Riel Bieber <Disable>charges for 3 seconds</> before leaping and slamming into the ground, dealing <Disable>massive damage</> to nearby players.",
    ["瑞尔比伯BOSS"] = "Riel Bieber BOSS",
    ["瑞尔比伯boss"] = "Riel Bieber Boss",
    ["瑞尔比伯之死"] = "Death of Riel Bieber",
    ["瑞尔比伯会<Disable>召唤2-049</>，2-049周围会产生滞涩区域，在滞涩区域停留时间过长将陷入<Disable>滞涩</>。"] = "Riel Bieber will <Disable>summon 2-049</>. A Stagnant Area will be generated around 2-049. Staying in the Stagnant Area for too long will cause players to fall into <Disable>Stagnation</>.",
    ["瑞尔比伯会<Disable>突然瞄准随机玩家冲锋</>，如果被瑞尔比伯撞到，就会被<Disable>狠狠地抱摔</>。"] = "Riel Bieber will <Disable>suddenly aim and charge at a random player</>. If hit by Riel Bieber, the player will be <Disable>violently slammed</>.",
    ["瑞尔比伯冲刺抱摔_根据buff筛选"] = "Riel Bieber Dash Slam_Filter by buff",
    ["瑞尔比伯出场"] = "Riel Bieber appears",
    ["瑞尔比伯副本"] = "Riel Bieber Dungeon",
    ["瑞尔比伯副本ID段末尾"] = "Riel Bieber Dungeon ID Segment End",
    ["瑞尔比伯副本小丑奥术暴击技能加给玩家的buff"] = "Buff given to players by Riel Bieber dungeon Clown Arcane Crit skill",
    ["瑞尔比伯单人版副本ID段末尾"] = "Riel Bieber Solo Dungeon ID Segment End",
    ["瑞尔比伯召唤笔记中的力量，向前方射出持续造成伤害的能量射线，射线会对<Disable>第一个命中的玩家</>造成伤害并被阻挡。"] = "Riel Bieber summons the power from his notes, firing a continuous energy ray that deals damage forward. The ray deals damage to the <Disable>first player it hits</> and is blocked by them.",
    ["瑞尔比伯召唤笔记中的力量，向前方射出持续造成伤害的能量射线，射线会对<Disable>第一个命中的玩家</>造成伤害并被阻挡，随着技能持续，射线造成的<Disable>伤害会逐渐提高</>。"] = "Riel Bieber summons the power from his notes, firing a continuous energy ray that deals damage forward. The ray deals damage to the <Disable>first player it hits</> and is blocked by them. As the skill continues, the <Disable>damage dealt by the ray will gradually increase</>.",
    ["瑞尔比伯吼叫镜头"] = "Riel Bieber Howl Camera",
    ["瑞尔比伯宅入口"] = "Riel Bieber residence entrance",
    ["瑞尔比伯开始阅读安提哥努斯家族笔记并<Disable>给自己套上高额护盾，一段时间</>后对全场范围造成巨量伤害，"] = "Riel Bieber begins reading the Antigonus Family Notes and <Disable>applies a high-value shield to himself</>, dealing massive damage to the entire field after a period of time.",
    ["瑞尔比伯投技(Boss)"] = "Riel Bieber throw (Boss)",
    ["瑞尔比伯投技(Player)"] = "Riel Bieber throw (Player)",
    ["瑞尔比伯死亡"] = "Riel Bieber Death",
    ["瑞尔比伯死亡造成的爆炸导致值夜者们受伤昏迷，燕尾服小丑返回，以小丑魔药引诱克莱恩交出安提哥努斯笔记。"] = "The explosion caused by Riel Bieber's death left the Nighthawks injured and unconscious. The tailcoated Clown returned, using the Clown potion to lure Klein into handing over the Antigonus Notebook.",
    ["瑞尔比伯狂暴"] = "Riel Bieber Berserk",
    ["瑞尔比伯跳砸-快速"] = "Riel Bieber Jump Smash-Fast",
    ["瑞尔比伯选择<Disable>距离最近</>的玩家作为目标，抓取进行吞噬。"] = "Riel Bieber selects the <Disable>closest</> player as a target and grabs them to devour.",
    ["瑞尔比伯遗留的珠宝盒，里面装着他手工制作的戒指。"] = "The jewelry box left behind by Riel Bieber, containing rings he made by hand.",
    ["瑞尔比伯释放2-049，使周围玩家进入<Disable>滞涩状态10秒</>。"] = "Riel Bieber releases 2-049, causing nearby players to enter a <Disable>Stagnant state for 10 seconds</>.",
    ["瑞尔码头"] = "Riel Dock",
    ["瑞尔继承了他父亲的珠宝匠人手艺，我对经营店铺也有兴趣。我们想要摆脱吝啬的工厂主，也给自己谋点别的生计。"] = "Ray inherited his father's jewelry craftsmanship, and I am also interested in running a shop. We wanted to get rid of the stingy factory owner and find another way to make a living for ourselves.",
    ["瑞尔说“猎龙”意味着勇气和团结，于是我们就一直这么称呼自己。"] = "Riel said \"Dragon Hunter\" means courage and unity, so we've always called ourselves that.",
