    ["瓶"] = "Bottle",
    ["瓶中突然爆发出红色的光芒，将他吞没。"] = "A red light suddenly erupted from the bottle, swallowing him.",
    ["瓶子"] = "Bottle",
    ["瓶身"] = "Bottle Body",
    ["瓶身侧面贴着泛黄的标签，用端正的鲁恩语写下：“每日一次，不可过量。”"] = "A yellowed label is stuck to the side of the bottle, with \"Take once daily, do not exceed the dose\" written in neat Loenese.",
    ["瓷地板·细格"] = "Tile Floor · Fine Grid",
    ["瓷碗、木筐、铁盒……人们的日常用品被安置在湖水深处，像是谁的珍藏。 "] = "Porcelain bowls, wooden crates, iron boxes... People's daily necessities are placed in the depths of the lake, as if they were someone's collection.",
