    ["甚至还看见了我。"] = "You even saw me.",
    ["甚至还编了个碰到溪水就会被住在源头沼泽里的女巫诅咒的故事！哈！"] = "They even made up a story that if you touch the creek water, you'll be cursed by the witch living in the swamp at the source! Ha!",
    ["甜"] = "Sweet",
    ["甜冰茶"] = "Sweet Iced Tea",
    ["甜冰茶、烤薄饼、土豆面包……咦，这似乎是南方的食物风格？让人想起炸蔬菜和烤肉，或者猪肉香肠……"] = "Sweet iced tea, pancakes, potato bread... huh, this seems to be a southern style of food? It reminds people of fried vegetables and roast meat, or pork sausages...",
    ["甜冰茶小猫(已废弃）"] = "Sweet Iced Tea Kitten (Deprecated)",
    ["甜冰茶真好喝，可惜太冰啦……喝了一口胃就受不了了。"] = "The sweet iced tea is so good, but it's a pity it's too cold... My stomach couldn't take it after one sip.",
    ["甜冰茶（临时）"] = "Sweet Iced Tea (Temporary)",
    ["甜品俱乐部宣传"] = "Dessert Club Promotion",
    ["甜品布丁"] = "Dessert pudding",
    ["甜品推荐“海洋之甜风”。我们没有用狼鱼罐头，而是坚持自制狼鱼肉泥，将之与牛乳、芝士、砂糖混合，烘烤成糕点……"] = "For dessert, I recommend the 'Sweet Breeze of the Ocean.' We don't use canned wolf fish; instead, we insist on making our own wolf fish paste, mixing it with milk, cheese, and sugar, and baking it into a pastry...",
    ["甜品架子"] = "Dessert Shelf",
    ["甜品：蓝莓汁冰淇淋"] = "Dessert: Blueberry Ice Cream",
    ["甜品：香浓焦糖布丁/柠檬奶油挞"] = "Dessert: Rich Caramel Pudding / Lemon Cream Tart",
    ["甜奶茶（临时）"] = "Sweet Milk Tea (Temporary)",
    ["甜柠檬鸡尾酒好了。风暴在上，这让我想起那些在奥拉维岛的日子。"] = "Sweet Lemon Cocktail is ready. Storm above, this reminds me of those days on Oravi Island.",
    ["甜樱桃"] = "Sweet Cherry",
    ["甜点：香草蛋奶糕吉事果拼盘"] = "Dessert: Vanilla Custard Churro Platter",
    ["甜狒萌意"] = "Sweet Baboon Cuteness",
    ["甜美"] = "Sweet",
    ["甜美的唇齿啊；"] = "Sweet lips and teeth;",
    ["甜美的梦境……"] = "Sweet dreams...",
    ["甜腻的气息顺着毛茸茸的脑袋散开，令所有严阵以待的非凡者，都忍不住心中柔软。"] = "The sweet scent spread from the fluffy head, making all the Beyonders standing by unable to help but feel a softness in their hearts.",
    ["甜苹果汁"] = "Sweet apple juice",
    ["甜苹果汁，很好的选择。让我们继续往里面加点什么。"] = "Sweet apple juice, a great choice. Let's continue adding something to it.",
    ["甜蜜回应"] = "Sweet response",
    ["甜蜜的静默……摘取……"] = "Sweet silence... picking...",
    ["甜蜜？那叫甜腻！喝一口能让人踢正步踢到贝克兰德！"] = "Sweet? That's cloying! Drinking one sip can make someone march in step all the way to Backlund!",
