    ["生命教派(2) 每阵亡1名敌方棋子，永久获得4点最大生命。"] = "Life Sect (2) Each time an enemy piece dies, permanently gain 4 Max Health.",
    ["生命教派(4) 20% 攻击力"] = "Life Sect (4) 20% Attack Power",
    ["生命教派(4) 每阵亡1名敌方棋子，永久获得8点最大生命。"] = "Life Sect (4) Each time an enemy piece dies, permanently gain 8 Max Health.",
    ["生命教派(6) 30%攻击力"] = "Life Sect (6) 30% Attack Power",
    ["生命教派(6) 每阵亡1名敌方棋子，永久获得12点最大生命。"] = "Life Sect (6) Each time an enemy piece dies, permanently gain 12 Max Health.",
    ["生命教派棋子除获得基础<HighLight>攻击</>和<HighLight>攻速</>外<HighLight>吸血能力最强</>的非生命教派棋子获得相同增益。教派秘仪加持时，全队法术增伤、暴击率提升，获得黑暗视野，小幅缩减技能冷却时间。"] = "Life School of Thought pieces, in addition to obtaining base <HighLight>Attack</> and <HighLight>Attack Speed</>, also gain the strongest <HighLight>Life Steal ability</> for non-Life School of Thought pieces that gain the same buff. When blessed by the School of Thought ritual, the entire team's spell damage and critical hit rate are increased, Dark Vision is gained, and skill cooldowns are slightly reduced.",
    ["生命教派：敌方棋子阵亡时，【生命教派】棋子获得永久生命值。"] = "Life Sect: When enemy pieces fall, [Life Sect] pieces gain permanent Health.",
