    ["男爵夫人"] = "Baroness",
    ["男爵夫人的补充证词"] = "Baroness's Supplementary Testimony",
    ["男爵夫人的证词"] = "The Baroness's Testimony",
    ["男爵夫人离开后，有一个人进入房间，给男爵续了茶。这个人，恐怕就是制造密室的凶手。"] = "After the Baroness left, someone entered the room and refilled the Baron's tea. This person is likely the murderer who created the locked-room scenario.",
    ["男爵夫人表示自己在下午<InvHighlight>三点前</>进入过书房。\n霍克斯男爵最近精神越来越异常，坚持研究那件可疑的古董。　\n夫妇二人为古董爆发了激烈的争吵，男爵夫人愤而离开。\n离开时，霍克斯男爵还坐在书桌旁喝茶，应该在等埃文医生来复诊。 "] = " The Baroness stated that she had entered the study before <InvHighlight> three o'clock </> in the afternoon. \n Baron Hawkes has been increasingly abnormal mentally recently, insisting on studying that suspicious antique. \n The couple had a fierce argument over the antique, and the Baroness left in anger. \n When she left, Baron Hawkes was still sitting at the desk drinking tea, likely waiting for Dr. Evan to come for a follow-up visit.",
    ["男爵夫人？"] = "Baroness?",
    ["男爵威廉"] = "Baron William",
    ["男爵宣布捐赠土地。宾客们说威廉最近行为异常。"] = "The Baron announced the donation of land. Guests say William has been behaving abnormally recently.",
    ["男爵怀疑医生有问题"] = "The Baron suspects there is something wrong with the doctor",
    ["男爵最近遭遇了什么事?"] = "What has the Baron encountered recently?",
    ["男爵死前，这杯茶已经快喝完了，可现在却留下了这么多水渍，甚至还是温热的。"] = "Before the Baron died, this cup of tea was almost finished, but now there are so many water stains left, and it's even still warm.",
    ["男爵的尸体"] = "Baron's corpse",
    ["男爵的表情太平静了。被刺杀的人，哪怕再有修养也该有惊讶和愤怒。"] = "The Baron's expression is too calm. Someone being assassinated, no matter how refined, should show surprise and anger.",
    ["男爵的表现有些僵硬……不是紧张，像在“表演”。"] = "The Baron's performance is a bit stiff... not nervous, like he is \"acting.\"",
    ["男爵的视线"] = "Baron's Gaze",
    ["男爵视线空白"] = "Baron Blank Stare",
    ["男爵阁下，您早就知道我是教会的人？也早知道阿尔伯特带着封印物？"] = "Baron, did you know I was from the Church all along? And that Albert had the Sealed Artifact?",
