    ["疤痕"] = "Scar",
    ["疯了吧！弗兰奇！就算公寓水管吱嘎作响、墙壁泛潮生霉、门窗关不严实，只要不影响基本居住和收取租金，他就绝不处理！"] = "He's crazy! Frankie! Even if the apartment pipes creak, the walls are damp and moldy, and the doors and windows don't close tightly, as long as it doesn't affect basic living and rent collection, he will never deal with it!",
    ["疯女人 你在干什么！"] = "Crazy woman, what are you doing!",
    ["疯女人对你蓄势待发"] = "The madwoman is poised to strike at you.",
    ["疯女工"] = "Mad female worker",
    ["疯女工听见了年轻女工的声音，面露惊恐，转身向雾中逃去。"] = "The mad female worker hears the young worker's voice, her face filled with terror, and she turns to flee into the fog.",
    ["疯女工被怪物拖走"] = "The crazy female worker is dragged away by a monster",
    ["疯子"] = "Madman",
    ["疯子女士"] = "Madman Lady",
    ["疯子真是越来越多了！"] = "There are really more and more madmen!",
    ["疯子！都是疯子！我劝你离他们远点，不然迟早你也会被变成蘑菇。"] = "Madman! They are all Madman! I advise you to stay away from them, or sooner or later you will be turned into a mushroom too.",
    ["疯抢之夜"] = "Night of Frenzied Grabbing",
    ["疯抢之夜1/3"] = "Night of Frenzied Grabbing 1/3",
    ["疯抢之夜2/3"] = "Night of Frenzied Grabbing 2/3",
    ["疯抢之夜3/3"] = "Night of Frenzied Grabbing 3/3",
    ["疯抢之夜的惊喜奖励，打开可随机获得一定数量的绑定苏勒，还有概率获得<Highlight>零元购凭证</>，凭证可<Highlight>免费兑换任意商城直售外观</>。\n每周最多开启<Highlight>10</>次。"] = "A surprise reward from the Night of Frenzied Grabbing. Open to randomly receive a certain amount of Bound Soule, with a chance to obtain a <Highlight>Zero-Yuan Purchase Voucher</>, which can be used to <Highlight>redeem any direct-sale cosmetic from the shop for free</>. \nCan be opened at most <Highlight>10</> times per week.",
    ["疯抢之夜的烟尘未落，{{player.name}}从一片狼藉中摸出一只神秘宝箱，在<Chat_Highlight>城市暗面惊喜宝箱</>里翻出了{{item.name}}——疯子的运气，从不讲道理。"] = "The smoke of the Night of Frenzied Grabbing has not yet settled. {{player.name}} pulled a mysterious treasure chest out of the mess and found {{item.name}} in the <Chat_Highlight>City Dark Side Surprise Treasure Chest</>—a madman's luck never makes sense.",
