    ["病人：霍克斯男爵\t\n诊断：心悸症，伴有胸闷、夜间端坐呼吸。失眠，多疑发作时伴心率失常。\t\n复诊时间：下周四 下午三时整"] = "Patient: Baron Hawkes\nDiagnosis: Palpitations, accompanied by chest tightness and orthopnea at night. Insomnia, with arrhythmias during bouts of paranoia.\nFollow-up appointment: Next Thursday at 3:00 PM sharp",
