    ["白天做这么重的体力活，晚上当然要犒劳下自己。"] = "After doing such heavy physical labor during the day, one must naturally reward oneself at night.",
    ["白天卖牡蛎，傍晚清理牡蛎，晚上运送牡蛎，牡蛎，牡蛎，全是牡蛎！"] = "Selling oysters during the day, cleaning oysters in the evening, transporting oysters at night, oysters, oysters, it's all oysters!",
    ["白天在拉姆德当秘术师"] = "Working as a Mystery Pryer in Rylbir during the day",
    ["白天在线"] = "Daytime online",
    ["白天工作，晚上还工作？老兄，早知道你是这样的工作狂，我就不和麦基拼床位了，直接睡你的不就好了！"] = "Working during the day and working at night? Buddy, if I'd known you were such a workaholic, I wouldn't have shared a bunk with Mackey, I should've just slept in yours!",
    ["白天有11位秘术导师在1点传送到古堡6处，\n第2天8点10分3秒才回到小镇。\n\n白天在拉姆德当秘术师。"] = "During the day, 11 mysticism tutors teleported to 6 locations in the ancient castle at 1:00, \n and didn't return to the Small Town until 8:10:03 the next day. \n\n Working as a mysticism tutor in Ramde during the day.",
    ["白天有11位秘术导师在1点传送到古堡6处，\r\n第2天8点10分3秒才回到小镇"] = "During the day, 11 Mystery Pryers teleported to location 6 of the ancient castle at 1:00,\nand only returned to the Small Town at 8:10:03 on the 2nd day",
    ["白天有8只恶灵在7点1分飘到古堡的6处,\r\n11点10分15秒才回到小镇"] = "During the day, 8 Evil Spirits drifted to location 6 of the ancient castle at 7:01,\nand only returned to the Small Town at 11:10:15",
    ["白天有8只恶灵在7点1分飘到古堡的6处，\n11点10分15秒才回到小镇"] = "During the day, 8 evil spirits float to 6 locations in the castle at 7:01, \n and only return to the small town at 11:10:15.",
    ["白天有8只恶灵在7点1分飘到古堡的6处，\n11点10分15秒才回到小镇。\n\n恶灵竟于白天浮现。"] = "During the day, 8 Evil Spirits drifted to 6 locations in the ancient castle at 7:01, \n and didn't return to the Small Town until 11:10:15. \n\n The Evil Spirits actually appeared during the day.",
