    ["白羊座·"] = "Aries ",
    ["白色大理石框边比木框更显庄重，是会客厅与图书室的常驻款。"] = "The white marble frame is more solemn than a wooden one and is a staple for parlors and libraries.",
    ["白色湍流"] = "White Turbulence",
    ["白色火光"] = "White firelight",
    ["白色瓷器，美丽简洁。"] = "White porcelain, beautiful and simple.",
    ["白花"] = "White Flower",
    ["白莉夫人"] = "Lady White",
    ["白莉夫人就这样跟着那个不知真假的侠盗走了，天呐，真让人担心！"] = "Lady Bailey just followed that phantom thief, whether he's real or fake. Heavens, it's so worrying!",
    ["白莉夫人被自称侠盗黑皇帝的人带走了，或许正面临危险，我得想想办法。"] = "Lady Beryl was taken away by someone calling himself the Phantom Thief Black Emperor. She might be in danger; I have to think of a way.",
    ["白蔷薇夫人"] = "Lady of the White Rose",
    ["白衣普通老男"] = "Ordinary Old Man in White",
    ["白裙卢娜"] = "Luna in White Dress",
    ["白边太阳花"] = "White-Edged Sunflower",
    ["白送给一个老管家？威廉男爵最近是怎么了？"] = "Giving it away to an old butler? What has happened to Baron William recently?",
    ["白银"] = "Baiyin",
    ["白银之城"] = "City of Silver",
    ["白银之城的探索副本"] = "City of Silver exploration dungeon.",
    ["白银之成的探索副本"] = "City of Silver exploration dungeon",
    ["白银城"] = "City of Silver",
    ["白银城六人议事团"] = "Silver City Six-Member Council",
    ["白银城六人议事团长老。\n秘祈人途径序列5“牧羊人”，后在极光会帮助下晋升序列4“黑骑士”。信仰真实造物主，被族人视为叛徒，却从未停止为白银城探索神弃之地的出路。巨人王庭一战中，为对抗暗天使萨斯利尔而战死。"] = "An elder of the Six-Member Council of the City of Silver. \n A Sequence 5 \"Shepherd\" of the Secrets Supplicant Pathway, he later advanced to Sequence 4 \"Black Knight\" with the help of the Aurora Order. A believer in the True Creator, he was regarded as a traitor by his people, yet he never ceased exploring ways out of the Forsaken Land of the Gods for the City of Silver. During the battle at the Giant King's Court, he died fighting against the Dark Angel Sasrir.",
    ["白银城六人议事团长老，为了白银城的未来献出了自己的一生。"] = "An elder of the City of Silver's Council of Six, who dedicated his life to the future of the City of Silver.",
    ["白银城前任首席科林，曾向“愚者”先生祈求，我主派我以“救赎”之名降临。"] = "The former Chief of the City of Silver, Colin, once prayed to Mr. \"Fool\", and my Lord sent me to descend in the name of \"Salvation\".",
    ["白银城居民"] = "City of Silver resident",
    ["白银城旧事（一）"] = "Silver City Chronicles (I)",
    ["白银城旧事（三）"] = "Silver City Chronicles (III)",
    ["白银城旧事（二）"] = "Silver City Chronicles (II)",
    ["白银城旧事（四）"] = "Silver City Chronicles (IV)",
    ["白银城的前任首席曾是最强大的半神之一。\n为了守护这座永夜中的城市，为了寻找通往光明的道路，他选择了转换途径，在陵寝中闭关，试图晋升。\n那是一条未被验证的道路，没人知道结果。但有人必须尝试。\n他失败了。\n当科林·伊利亚特率队打开陵寝时，看见的是一具头骨和一堆散落的非凡特性——它们融合在一起，化为了这张面具。\n“首席……”队员们低下头。\n科林沉默地走上前，将面具封存。回到白银城后，他在议事会上说：\n“前任首席证明了这条路走不通。他用自己的失败，为我们排除了一个错误的方向。”\n有人不解：“那这张面具……”\n科林看向封印容器中的黄昏面具。空洞的眼眶，苍白的头骨，那是探索者留下的最后遗物。\n“它提醒着我们，在黑暗中寻找光明，每一次尝试都有代价。但正是这些失败，让我们知道哪些路不该走，哪些路还有希望。”\n科林将面具郑重地封存在圆塔之内处。\n“他没有白白牺牲。他为白银城的未来，探明了一条死路，让后来者可以选择其他方向。”\n圆塔的门缓缓关上。此路不通，但探索不止。"] = "The former Chief of the City of Silver was once one of the most powerful Demigods. \n To protect this city in eternal night and to find the path to the light, he chose to switch pathways and went into seclusion in the mausoleum, attempting an advancement. \n It was an unverified path; no one knew the outcome. But someone had to try. \n He failed. \n When Colin Iliad led a team to open the mausoleum, what they saw was a skull and a pile of scattered Beyonder characteristics—they had fused together, turning into this mask. \n \"Chief...\" the team members lowered their heads. \n Colin walked forward in silence and sealed the mask. After returning to the City of Silver, he said at the council meeting: \n \"The former Chief proved that this path is impassable. With his failure, he eliminated an incorrect direction for us.\" \n Someone was puzzled: \"Then this mask...\" \n Colin looked at the Twilight Mask in the sealed container. The hollow eye sockets and the pale skull were the last relics left by the explorer. \n \"It reminds us that searching for light in the darkness has a price for every attempt. But it is precisely these failures that let us know which paths should not be taken and which paths still hold hope.\" \n Colin solemnly sealed the mask inside the Round Tower. \n \"He did not sacrifice himself in vain. He explored a dead end for the future of the City of Silver, allowing those who come after to choose other directions.\" \n The door of the Round Tower slowly closed. This path is impassable, but the exploration continues.",
    ["白银城的力量跟随着你，快去给庇护区域充能"] = "The power of the City of Silver follows you; go charge the shelter area",
    ["白银城的居民曾世代被隔绝在这里，遭受惨烈的诅咒，艰难探索两千多年。"] = "The residents of City of Silver have been isolated here for generations, suffering from a brutal curse, struggling to explore for over two thousand years.",
    ["白银城的居民曾在神弃之地的永夜中坚守千年，我们以信念驱散阴翳，依靠着彼此度过长夜漫漫。"] = "The residents of the City of Silver once held their ground for a thousand years in the eternal night of the Forsaken Land of the Gods. We dispel the gloom with our faith and rely on each other to survive the long night.",
    ["白银城的庇护"] = "Protection of Silver City",
    ["白银城英灵的力量护佑着你，免受一切伤害"] = "The power of the Silver City heroes protects you, shielding you from all damage",
    ["白银城起源于巨人王庭统治下的白银之国，信仰巨人王后“丰收女神”欧弥贝拉。"] = "The City of Silver originated from the Kingdom of Silver under the rule of the Giant King's Court, and they believed in the Giant Queen, 'Harvest Goddess' Omebella.",
