    ["百货商店出售的服饰虽然多，但缺乏量体裁衣的美感，高级定制的服饰必须要带有本人的特色……"] = "Although department stores sell many clothes, they lack the beauty of tailoring. High-end custom clothing must carry the individual's own characteristics...",
    ["百货商店里出售的木板应该能修复这张桌子。"] = "The wooden boards sold at the department store should be able to repair this table.",
    ["百里挑蛋"] = "One in a Hundred Eggs",
