    ["的团队"] = "'s Team",
    ["的城堡"] = "'s Castle",
    ["的家园"] = "'s Homestead",
    ["的确……下水道失去了灭鼠投入，老鼠肆虐。工厂废水因为管道无人维护而无法排出，不断发酵出臭气……甚至影响了居民家中的马桶。"] = "Indeed... The sewers have lost their rodent control funding, and rats are running rampant. Factory wastewater cannot be drained because the pipes are unmaintained, constantly fermenting into a foul odor... It has even affected the toilets in residents' homes.",
    ["的确。但对我而言，有了他的帮助，我才能发现真相，摆脱失去人性的命运。"] = "Indeed. But for me, it was only with his help that I could discover the truth and escape the fate of losing my humanity.",
    ["的确不好受，我替那个女人感到不好受。她站在西摩斯旁边，就像从前的我。"] = "It is indeed unpleasant, but I feel unpleasant for that woman. She stands next to Seamus just like I used to.",
    ["的确如此，但急需帮助也可能会使一个人不敢再贸然求助。"] = "Indeed, but being in urgent need of help can also make a person afraid to ask for it rashly.",
    ["的确常有女仆把女主人的项链拿出来卖，可没几个人敢收啊。"] = "It's true that maids often take their mistress's necklaces to sell, but not many people dare to accept them.",
    ["的确有人存在偏见，但也有很多人相信你。"] = "Indeed some people have prejudices, but there are also many who believe in you.",
    ["的确没什么异常，都是日常物品……"] = "Indeed, there is nothing unusual; these are all everyday items...",
    ["的确没有，这条路虽然不好走，但也没什么石头挡路。"] = "There really isn't one. Although this road is difficult to walk, there are no rocks blocking the way.",
    ["的确，他的慷慨将一直在教会闻名。"] = "Indeed, his generosity will always be famous in the Church.",
    ["的确，又不能填饱肚子……去看看。"] = "Indeed, it can't fill his stomach either... let's go take a look.",
    ["的确，抛开研究带来的亲切与满足感，历史系的学生和同事都有一种特有的气质，和他们交谈，是一件令人愉快的事。"] = "Indeed, setting aside the intimacy and satisfaction brought by research, the students and colleagues in the history department all had a unique temperament. Conversing with them was a pleasant thing.",
    ["的确，暂时还没有明显恢复的迹象。"] = "Indeed, there are no obvious signs of recovery for the time being.",
    ["的确，没人比您这样的人更了解这座古堡了。"] = "Indeed, no one knows this castle better than someone like you.",
    ["的确，这样之后再参与案件调查，也更熟悉和安全些。"] = "Indeed, that way it will be more familiar and safer when participating in case investigations later.",
