    ["皮特不认识我，刚才在这里购买蜡烛……"] = "Pete doesn't recognize me, he was buying candles here just now...",
    ["皮特与芙拉交流trigger"] = "Pete and Fela interaction trigger",
    ["皮特从地里挖出了一个木偶。\n片刻后，一动不动的木偶突然活了过来！"] = "Pete dug a puppet out of the ground. \n A moment later, the motionless puppet suddenly came to life!",
    ["皮特从野餐营地采摘的浆果。"] = "Berries picked by Pete from the picnic campsite.",
    ["皮特代号“蒲公英”\r\n是信仰堕落母神的月亮仆从成员\r\n噩梦似乎是他举行仪式的预示"] = "Pete, codenamed \"Dandelion\",\nis a Moon Servant who believes in the Mother Goddess of Depravity.\nThe Nightmare seems to be a premonition of the ritual he is performing.",
    ["皮特代号“蒲公英”，是信仰堕落母神的月亮仆从成员，噩梦似乎是他举行仪式的预兆。"] = "Pete, codenamed 'Dandelion', is a member of the Moon Servant who believes in the Mother Tree of Desire. The nightmare seems to be a precursor to the ritual he is performing.",
    ["皮特凝视点"] = "Pete gaze point",
