    ["目之所及，帽檐之下，是非被揉碎后重新拼贴。"] = "As far as the eye can see, beneath the brim, right and wrong are crumbled and reassembled.",
    ["目光"] = "Gaze",
    ["目前仅对Mode=0生效，代表给每个对象加的Buff数上限"] = "Currently only takes effect for Mode=0, representing the upper limit of Buffs added to each object.",
    ["目前仅支持模型隐藏功能"] = "Currently only supports model hiding function",
    ["目前你还不是1号麦，请等待"] = "You are not currently on microphone #1; please wait.",
    ["目前包括：秘偶星级、伙伴稀有度、伙伴羁绊稀有度、封印物品阶"] = "Currently includes: marionette star level, Partner rarity, Partner bond rarity, Sealed Artifact tier",
    ["目前已知线索比较少，需要前往报案地点进行调查。"] = "Currently, the known clues are few, and we need to go to the reported location to investigate.",
    ["目前已经进行过三轮选择，每次提问后答案都会出现在截然不同的地方，这似乎不是随机的……"] = "Three rounds of choices have been made so far, and the answers appear in completely different places after each question. This doesn't seem random...",
    ["目前我能选择的途径只有三种，不同途径有不同的非凡能力，序列数字越小，序列能力越强。"] = "There are only three pathways I can choose from right now. Different pathways have different Beyonder abilities. The lower the sequence number, the stronger the sequence ability.",
    ["目前接口不支持，速度倍率,该时间窗口内，角色的移动速度是正常移动速度的多少倍，默认1.0代表不降速。该移速倍率与属性导致的增减速度进行乘算"] = "Currently, the interface does not support speed multipliers. Within this time window, the character's movement speed is how many times the normal movement speed; default 1.0 means no speed reduction. This movement speed multiplier is multiplied by the speed increase/decrease caused by attributes.",
    ["目前支持以下参数：\n法术场：\nMaxNum\nDuration\nDeployTime\nDelayRunTime\nTickInterval\nTargets\nMaxTickCount\n\n陷阱：\nMaxNum\nDuration\nDeployTime\nTriggerTime\nChargeTime\nMaxTriggerCount\nSingleTriggerCount\n\n光环：\nMaxNum\nDuration\nDeployTime\nTargetsNum\n\n脱手技能：\nMaxNum\n\n子弹：\nDelayTime\nMaxLifeTime"] = "Currently supports the following parameters: \n Spell Field: \n MaxNum \n Duration \n DeployTime \n DelayRunTime \n TickInterval \n Targets \n MaxTickCount \n \n Trap: \n MaxNum \n Duration \n DeployTime \n TriggerTime \n ChargeTime \n MaxTriggerCount \n SingleTriggerCount \n \n Aura: \n MaxNum \n Duration \n DeployTime \n TargetsNum \n \n Off-hand Skill: \n MaxNum \n \n Bullet: \n DelayTime \n MaxLifeTime.",
    ["目前最紧要的，就是为我们今晚找个落脚处。外交大臣，你熟悉廷根市场这片区域，你有什么好点子吗？"] = "The most pressing matter right now is to find a place for us to stay tonight. Minister of Foreign Affairs, you are familiar with this area of the Tingen market; do you have any good ideas?",
    ["目前有一些阶段: 0:空白，1:匹配中，2:匹配完成，3:第一场比赛，5:第二场比赛，7表彰大会"] = "Stages: 0: blank, 1: matching, 2: match complete, 3: first match, 5: second match, 7: awards ceremony.",
    ["目前有两种选择，一是效仿戴莉女士向值夜者组织提出晋升“小丑”的特别申请，但可能要面对晋升过快带来的调查。"] = "There are currently two options: one is to follow Ms. Daly's example and submit a special application to the Nighthawks for advancement to 'Clown', but I might have to face an investigation due to the rapid advancement.",
    ["目前根据线索来看，五月庄园似乎在准备一场指向“堕落母神”的献祭仪式。"] = "Currently, according to the clues, May Manor seems to be preparing a Sacrifice Ritual directed at the \"Mother Goddess of Depravity\".",
