    ["盲眼的孤女向病重的玩伴递上苹果：别怕，下一场游戏就要开始了。"] = "The blind orphan girl hands an apple to her sick playmate: Don't be afraid, the next game is about to begin.",
    ["直击灵魂！"] = "Strike directly at the soul!",
    ["直到……"] = "Until...",
    ["直到一次舞台事故，道具在高空卡死，我从她留下的逃生舱里顺利逃了出来。"] = "Until a stage accident occurred where the prop got stuck high up, and I successfully escaped using the escape pod she left behind.",
    ["直到今天，把气球拴在屋顶，我又感受到了久违的快乐，至于究竟能不能飞，已经不重要了啊。"] = "Until today, tying balloons to the roof, I felt a long-lost joy. As for whether it can actually fly, that's not important anymore.",
    ["直到在庄园捐赠契约上画押的那一天。签字前，我跪下来在胸前胡乱地划着四个点，突然幸福得泪流满面。"] = "Until the day I signed the deed of donation for the manor. Before signing, I knelt down and haphazardly made the four points on my chest, suddenly bursting into tears of happiness.",
    ["直到尖叫渐息，她在一片寂静中狼狈爬起。"] = "Until the screaming subsides, she crawls up in a mess in the silence.",
    ["直到我也成为故事的一部分。"] = "Until I also become a part of the story.",
    ["直到我念出了那个尊名——“愚者”先生的尊名。"] = "Until I recited that honorific name—the honorific name of Mr. Fool.",
    ["直到我念出了那个尊名——愚者先生的尊名。"] = "Until I recited that honorific name—the honorific name of Mr. Fool.",
    ["直到最后，尼尔先生也没想过伤害任何人。"] = "Until the very end, Mr. Neil never thought of hurting anyone.",
    ["直到有一天！那个该死的猎人比尔特，他发现我能够感受到环境里的不安和危险。"] = "Until one day! That damn Hunter, Bilt, he discovered that I could feel the unease and danger in the environment.",
    ["直到有一天，我开始对“价值”特别敏感。"] = "Until one day, I became particularly sensitive to 'value'.",
    ["直到有人问出了那个问题：“真理的尽头是什么？”"] = "Until someone asked that question: \"What is the end of truth?\"",
    ["直到深夜"] = "Until late at night",
    ["直到现在，邓恩他一直对您非常地感激与……愧疚。"] = "Even now, Dunn has always been very grateful and... guilty toward you.",
    ["直到被卷入一场非凡事件。"] = "Until I was drawn into a Beyonder incident.",
