    ["直接拧他的鼻子，就没有左右的问题了！"] = "Just twist his nose directly, then there won't be a left or right issue!",
    ["直接用之前拿到的《大冒险家》平装本，也是一个不错的选择？"] = "Using the paperback copy of \"The Great Adventurer\" I got earlier is also a good choice, right?",
    ["直接离开"] = "Leave directly",
