    ["直觉告诉我，他的遗骨能唤起我过去的记忆。"] = "My intuition tells me that his remains can awaken my past memories.",
    ["直觉大增加，学识小增加"] = "Intuition Greatly Increased, Knowledge Slightly Increased",
    ["直觉大增加，武力小增加"] = "Intuition Greatly Increased, Strength Slightly Increased",
