    ["直觉等级:%s"] = "Intuition Level: %s",
    ["直走那边是另外的营地，老师让我们注意别走到私人的营地里了。"] = "Straight ahead is another camp. The teacher told us to be careful not to wander into private camps.",
    ["直踢伤害提升效果翻倍。"] = "Straight kick damage increase effect doubled.",
    ["直通康斯顿城的蒸汽列车“飞翔号”今日开通……"] = "The steam train \"Flying\" to Coniston City opens today...",
    ["直面灼热的阳光，不如从手指的缝隙后眺望远方。"] = "Facing the scorching sun, it is better to look into the distance from behind the gaps of your fingers.",
    ["直面灾厄"] = "Face the disaster",
    ["相"] = "Phase",
    ["相亲？等等，我父亲到底留下了什么信！这次必须给我看看！"] = "Blind date? Wait, what kind of letter did my father leave behind! I must see it this time!",
    ["相伴入画"] = "Accompany into Painting",
    ["相伴归途者"] = "Companion on the Journey Home",
    ["相似的艺术，稳定的艺术，简洁的艺术，这就是艺术！"] = "Similar art, stable art, simple art, this is art!",
    ["相信你经过了充分的训练和调教，也会懂得这一切，懂得这门艺术的。"] = "I believe that after sufficient training and coaching, you will also understand all of this and understand this art.",
    ["相信您一定能让这片土地重新焕发生机，我已经准备好为它惊叹了！"] = "I believe you will definitely be able to bring this land back to life; I am already prepared to be amazed by it!",
    ["相信您的工坊一定能产出更多的优质物产，并在市场上一路畅销。"] = "I believe your workshop will definitely produce more high-quality goods and be a bestseller in the market.",
    ["相信我们，到时候你想去哪里，我和加布里都会背着你去的。"] = "Trust us, when the time comes, Gabriel and I will carry you wherever you want to go.",
    ["相信我们，我们会成功的。"] = "Believe in us, we will succeed.",
    ["相信我，之后我会跟你解释。"] = "Trust me, I will explain it to you later.",
    ["相信我，你迟早还会来问的。"] = "Believe me, you'll come to ask sooner or later.",
    ["相信我，只需要一口，就能胜过千万口。买一份浓缩咸鱼汤，带回去能让一家人喝上一周。"] = "Believe me, just one bite is worth a thousand. Buy a portion of concentrated salted fish soup, and it can last a family a whole week if you take it home.",
    ["相信我，如果结果你不喜欢，就再抛几次，至少会让你心情好起来！"] = "Believe me, if you don't like the result, just flip it a few more times; it will at least make you feel better!",
    ["相信我，就碰一下，你会获得足够多的报酬。"] = "Believe me, just touch it, and you will receive enough reward.",
    ["相信我，我看到了！真的看到了！"] = "Believe me, I saw it! I really saw it!",
    ["相信我，搬来这里前我是家乡镇子里最有名的占卜师。"] = "Believe me, before moving here, I was the most famous divination master in my hometown.",
    ["相信我，文献室太可口了，如果不尽快将那些逃窜的小家伙们捉出来，这知识的宝库很快就会变成密密麻麻的虫巢！"] = "Believe me, the archives are too delicious. If we don't catch those fleeing little guys soon, this treasury of knowledge will soon become a dense nest of bugs!",
    ["相信我，记者女士，这将是罗塞尔戏剧节上最受欢迎的项目！"] = "Believe me, Ms. Reporter, this will be the most popular project at the Roselle Drama Festival!",
    ["相信我，这是女神给予的预兆，你需要黑夜的安抚和教会的帮助。"] = "Believe me, this is a sign from the Goddess; you need the comfort of the night and the help of the Church.",
    ["相信我，这杯酒会让你在特里尔被所有酒吧轰出去的。"] = "Believe me, this drink will get you kicked out of every bar in Trier.",
    ["相信接下来就算没有我的提醒，你也一样行呢……祝你好运……"] = "I believe that even without my reminder, you will do just fine... Good luck...",
    ["相信接下来没有我也一样行呢......祝你好运......贵客"] = "I believe you will be fine without me from here on out... Good luck... honored guest.",
    ["相信无序"] = "Believe in Disorder",
    ["相信本书作者与文献室管理员希罗多德先生都会感谢你。"] = "I believe the author of this book and the document room administrator, Mr. Herodotus, will both thank you.",
    ["相信秩序"] = "Believe in Order",
    ["相信经过了这场拳赛，会有更多的人因为琳达光顾恶龙酒吧，真是幸福的烦恼。"] = "I believe that after this boxing match, more people will patronize the Evil Dragon Bar because of Linda. It's truly a happy problem.",
    ["相信自己，你能打败他！"] = "Believe in yourself, you can beat him!",
