    ["相册已满，请及时清理"] = "Album is full; please clear some space.",
    ["相册空间已满，本次拍照将无法保存至诡秘相册，请进行清理，释放空间后继续"] = "The album space is full. This photo cannot be saved to the Mystery Album. Please clean up and free up space before continuing.",
    ["相同的概率累计组，共享概率累计"] = "Same probability accumulation group shares probability accumulation",
    ["相同职业不能超过2人，无法开启匹配。"] = "Cannot have more than 2 players of the same profession; cannot start matchmaking.",
    ["相对于《NewBullet》表内部起点偏移量的额外位置偏移。"] = "Additional position offset relative to the starting point offset inside the \"NewBullet\" table.",
    ["相对于选出的BasePosition的偏移量（x、y、z），单位cm；偏移量所依赖的坐标系方向：基础位置=0时为角色坐标系方向，其他情况下是自身到目标连线坐标系方向。"] = "Offset (x, y, z) relative to the selected Base Position, in cm. The coordinate system for the offset depends on the base position: if Base Position = 0, it uses the character's coordinate system; otherwise, it uses the coordinate system of the line connecting the self to the target.",
    ["相当于给目标AddRandomBuff，然后从自己身上删掉指定Buff（如果身上没有，也不影响添加，但影响删除）"] = "Equivalent to performing AddRandomBuff on the target, then removing the specified Buff from oneself (if not present on oneself, it does not affect addition, but it does affect removal).",
    ["相当划算的价格，煮汤应该不错。"] = "A very reasonable price, should be good for making soup.",
