    ["相机方向与角色面向一致时，Yaw为0°，角色不动的情况下，相机朝向逆时针旋转为负，顺时针为正，范围为[-180°,180°]"] = "When the camera direction is consistent with the character's orientation, Yaw is 0°. When the character is stationary, rotating the camera counter-clockwise is negative, and clockwise is positive, with a range of [-180°, 180°].",
