    ["相比起贝克兰德，作为“大学之城”的廷根在服饰的流行风向上，似乎有一些微妙的差异。"] = "Compared to Backlund, Tingen, as a \"City of Universities,\" seems to have some subtle differences in fashion trends.",
    ["相爱的人们聚在一起，共赴一个春天。"] = "People who love each other gathered together to head toward a spring.",
    ["相较于另一家面包店的产品来说，这里的饼干性价比低了一点。"] = "Compared to the products of another bakery, the cost-performance ratio of the cookies here is a bit lower.",
    ["相较于柔顺光亮的缎面材质，我觉得硬挺的刺绣和蕾丝的运用在这里更加常见。"] = "Compared to smooth and shiny satin materials, I think the use of stiff embroidery and lace is more common here.",
    ["相邻两次弹射之间的间隔"] = "The interval between two adjacent bounces.",
    ["相邻点位同时占领会相连，相连点位每次获得积分的值翻倍，相连的点位越多倍数越高"] = "Occupying adjacent points simultaneously will connect them. The points earned for connected points are doubled each time. The more connected points, the higher the multiplier.",
