    ["省时省力，畅行廷根——脚踏车，您的出行新选择！\n\n快速便捷：告别拥挤的马车和漫长的步行，脚踏车让您轻松穿梭于大街小巷\n锻炼身体：骑行有助于锻炼身体，让您更健康\n经济实惠：一次购买，长久使用\n特别优惠：现在购买，立享8折优惠！数量有限，先到先得！"] = "Save time and effort, travel through Tingen with ease—the bicycle, your new choice for getting around! \n\nFast and convenient: Say goodbye to crowded carriages and long walks; the bicycle lets you easily weave through streets and alleys. \nExercise your body: Cycling helps exercise your body, making you healthier. \nEconomical and affordable: Buy it once, use it for a long time. \nSpecial offer: Buy now and pay eight-tenths of the regular price! Quantities are limited, first come, first served!",
