    ["看上去是一位老者……愿他安息。"] = "Looks like an old man... May he rest in peace.",
    ["看上去是不错的纪念品……"] = "It looks like a nice souvenir...",
    ["看上去是泰利·里斯本给妻子准备的礼物，怎么在他手里？稍后交给戴娜吧。"] = "It looks like a gift Terry Lisbon prepared for his wife. Why is it in his hands? I'll give it to Dana later.",
    ["看上去有些年头了。"] = "It looks like it's been around for quite a few years.",
    ["看上去有些年头了，写信的人是……阿德莱德？"] = "It looks like it's been a few years. The person who wrote the letter is... Adelaide?",
    ["看上去有些年头的信件，保存完好。"] = "Letter that looks quite old, well preserved.",
    ["看下有些什么材料"] = "See what materials are available",
    ["看不出来吗？经常有人说，我看起来更擅长球类运动。"] = "Can't you tell? People often say I look better suited to ball games.",
    ["看不出来啊……"] = "I can't tell...",
    ["看不见我……看不见我……"] = "Can't see me... can't see me...",
    ["看不见的东西……或许可以用【灵视】看一下"] = "Things that are invisible... perhaps I can take a look with [Spirit Vision].",
    ["看不见的东西…可以用[灵视]试一下。"] = "Things you can't see... you can try using [spirit vision].",
    ["看久了，会忘记自己是谁。"] = "Look at it for too long, and you will forget who you are.",
    ["看书02_书02"] = "Read book 02_Book 02",
    ["看书的客人"] = "Customer Reading a Book",
    ["看书相机"] = "Reading Camera",
    ["看书镜头"] = "Reading book camera angle",
    ["看了这么多鲁恩作品，还是我们因蒂斯的艺术更前卫。"] = "After seeing so many Loen works, our Intis art is still more avant-garde.",
    ["看什么看！不要看我！呜……不要再看我了……"] = "What are you looking at! Don't look at me! Wuu... don't look at me anymore...",
    ["看什么看！没礼貌，再看我找猫弄你！"] = "What are you looking at! How rude, keep looking and I'll get a cat to deal with you!",
    ["看什么看，你对我有意见吗？"] = "What are you looking at? Do you have a problem with me?",
    ["看什么看？画你的画！"] = "What are you looking at? Paint your painting!",
    ["看什么？一群书呆子。"] = "What are you looking at? A bunch of bookworms.",
    ["看他怎么解释"] = "See how he explains himself",
    ["看众人"] = "Look at everyone",
    ["看众人2"] = "Look at everyone 2",
    ["看似无人看守的宝箱，往往意味着危险。谨慎判断，才能带走属于你的战利品。"] = "A treasure chest that appears to be unguarded often implies danger. Judge carefully to take away the loot that belongs to you.",
    ["看似空无一物，却又不像全然空着。"] = "Seemingly empty, yet not entirely so.",
    ["看你徘徊许久了，需要一瓶“安曼达”纯露吗？"] = "I see you've been wandering for a long time. Do you need a bottle of 'Amanda' floral water?",
    ["看你的指甲和牙龈颜色，是受到了铅的影响……必须离开有害的环境。"] = "Looking at the color of your fingernails and gums, you have been affected by lead... you must leave this hazardous environment.",
    ["看你的样子，刚来廷根？想去哪儿？我熟悉廷根所有地址，包括拉斐尔墓园的墓碑编号。"] = "Looking at you, you just arrived in Tingen? Where do you want to go? I am familiar with every address in Tingen, including the tombstone numbers at Raphael Cemetery.",
    ["看你的表情，有什么疑问吗？"] = "Looking at your expression, do you have any questions?",
    ["看你还是一副疲劳的样子……想聊聊吗？"] = "You still look exhausted... want to talk about it?",
    ["看你这副样子……想聊聊吗？"] = "Look at you... want to talk about it?",
    ["看你迷茫的眼神，这么快就不记得我了？"] = "Looking at your confused eyes, you don't remember me so soon?",
    ["看信封"] = "Look at the envelope",
    ["看修车的路人"] = "Passerby Watching Car Repair",
    ["看光球点"] = "Look at Orb Point",
    ["看冒泡的镜头"] = "Look at the bubbling camera",
    ["看准时机！跳跃躲避射线！"] = "Time it right! Jump to dodge the rays!",
    ["看到了"] = "Saw it",
    ["看到了。"] = "I see him.",
    ["看到了伊琳"] = "Saw Irene",
    ["看到并非全部，冷静分析才是关键。"] = "Seeing is not everything; calm analysis is the key.",
    ["看到弗兰奇踩点"] = "See Frankie scouting",
    ["看到报童"] = "See the Newsboy",
    ["看到掉落的书本"] = "See the dropped book",
    ["看到旁边的这个木雕小骑士吗？你能在镇子上的许多房顶上找到它们。"] = "Do you see this small wooden knight carving next to me? You can find them on many roofs in town.",
    ["看到琳达获得冠军，我实在太兴奋了，今晚可能都睡不着了，不如留下来再找找乐子。"] = "Seeing Linda win the championship, I'm just too excited. I might not be able to sleep tonight. Why not stay and find some more fun?",
    ["看到的从来不保证是真的，舍不得的一定是真的。"] = "What you see is never guaranteed to be true, but what you are reluctant to part with must be true.",
    ["看到皮特的相机"] = "Camera seeing Pete",
    ["看到科尔沁了。"] = "I see Korchin.",
    ["看到笔记相机"] = "See Note Camera",
    ["看到芙拉的位置"] = "See Fura's Location",
    ["看到花架位置"] = "See Flower Stand Position",
    ["看到莎莉的日记"] = "See Sally's diary",
    ["看到这个路牌了吗？我们要顺着它的指向前行。"] = "Do you see this road sign? We need to follow its direction.",
    ["看到那座雕塑了吗？颜色鲜艳，周围是一片鲜花。"] = "See that sculpture? The colors are bright, and it's surrounded by fresh flowers.",
    ["看到那艘船了吗？那是开往拜亚姆的。"] = "See that ship? That's the one heading to Bayam.",
    ["看医生的钱，我来出吧。你需要多少？"] = "I'll pay for the doctor. How much do you need?",
    ["看卢娜娇羞反应相机"] = "Camera to watch Luna's shy reaction",
    ["看向spawner"] = "Look at spawner",
    ["看向“倒吊人”"] = "Look at \"The Hanged Man\"",
    ["看向“正义”"] = "Look at \"Justice\"",
    ["看向伊森定位点"] = "Look at Ethan's location point",
    ["看向克莱恩"] = "Look at Klein",
    ["看向公爵测量用"] = "Looking at Duke for Measurement",
    ["看向坐标"] = "Look at coordinates",
    ["看向定位"] = "Look towards location",
    ["看向尤朵拉"] = "Look at Eudora",
    ["看向尤朵拉变焦"] = "Look at Eudora zoom",
    ["看向帕里克"] = "Look at Parick",
    ["看向桌下"] = "Look under the table",
    ["看向梦境捕手"] = "Look at Dream Catcher",
    ["看向湖面视线点2"] = "Viewpoint 2 looking at the lake",
    ["看向点"] = "Look at point",
    ["看向玛丽"] = "Look at Mary",
    ["看向珍妮"] = "Look at Jenny",
    ["看向目标"] = "Look at target",
    ["看向相机"] = "Look at camera",
    ["看向相机2"] = "Look at camera 2",
    ["看向离开的帕里克"] = "Look at the leaving Patrick",
    ["看向窗内"] = "Look inside the window",
    ["看向窗外"] = "Look out the window",
    ["看向线索"] = "Look at clue",
    ["看向舞台"] = "Look at the stage",
    ["看向警官"] = "Look at the police officer",
    ["看啊{{先生|女士}}，多漂亮的雪山，有兴趣来一次刺激的雪山悬崖飙车吗？"] = "Look {{sir|madam}}, what a beautiful snowy mountain. Interested in a thrilling cliff-side race on the snowy mountain?",
    ["看啊，朋友！这就是我们的精神面貌。欢迎你持续关注赛艇俱乐部，我们会在今年的比赛中战胜廷根大学的队伍！"] = "Look, friend! This is our spirit. You are welcome to keep following the Rowing Club; we will defeat the Tingen University team in this year's competition!",
    ["看在你人不错的份上，我带你过去吧！好好跟上我灵巧的身姿。"] = "Since you're a decent person, I'll take you there! Keep up with my agile figure.",
    ["看在你帮我排除一个错误答案的份上，这次不追究你的鲁莽。"] = "Considering that you helped me rule out a wrong answer, I won't hold your recklessness against you this time.",
    ["看在你敢于挑战的份上，奖励保留，但难度不会降低，怎么样？"] = "Since you have the courage to challenge, the reward will be kept, but the difficulty won't be lowered. How about it?",
    ["看在你这么诚心的份上，我就告诉你吧。"] = "Since you're so sincere, I'll tell you.",
    ["看在你陪我说话的份上，就帮你挑一款吧。喏，拿去。"] = "Since you've kept me company, I'll help you pick one. Here, take it.",
    ["看在跟您聊得来的份上，愿意跟我走一趟看看？您是识货的人，我一眼就看得出来！"] = "Since we've had a good chat, are you willing to come with me and take a look? You're someone who knows quality, I can tell at a glance!",
    ["看地下"] = "Look at the ground",
    ["看场保镖"] = "Venue Bodyguard",
    ["看墓碑"] = "Look at tombstone",
    ["看墓碑2"] = "Look at tombstone 2",
    ["看大树相机"] = "Look at Big Tree Camera",
    ["看天"] = "Look at the sky",
    ["看天丽贝卡"] = "Look at Rebecca",
    ["看奥黛丽"] = "Look at Audrey",
    ["看奥黛丽变焦"] = "Look at Audrey (Zoom)",
    ["看好了，这就是“廷根五星好市民”，别管市政厅那群蠢货颁发的镀金垃圾，他们懂个屁。"] = "Look closely, this is a 'Tingen Five-Star Good Citizen'. Don't mind the gold-plated trash awarded by those idiots at City Hall; they don't know a damn thing.",
    ["看好那些人！"] = "Keep an eye on those people!",
    ["看守也是一种守护，是一件有意义的事。"] = "Guarding is also a form of protection; it is a meaningful thing.",
    ["看守可是很无聊的。"] = "Being a guard is very boring.",
    ["看守者"] = "Guardian",
    ["看完了，学到很多知识。嗯……买一张邮票吧。"] = "Finished looking, learned a lot of knowledge. Hmm... I'll buy a stamp.",
    ["看完牌后阿罗德斯位置"] = "Arrodes location after reading cards",
    ["看宣传单"] = "Look at the flyer",
    ["看小猫"] = "Watch kitten",
    ["看店"] = "Look at the shop",
    ["看开点，马戏团又推了一个新节目 “小猪跳圈”，说不定也很有意思呢。"] = "Look on the bright side, the circus has launched a new program, 'Piggy Jumping Hoops,' maybe that will be interesting too.",
    ["看影子"] = "Look at the shadow",
    ["看得出来，大家都很期待了，那么让我来揭晓最终答案！"] = "I can see everyone is looking forward to it, so let me reveal the final answer!",
    ["看得出来，您的朋友们擅长胡说。"] = "I can tell your friends are good at talking nonsense.",
    ["看得我太憋屈了，退票！我要求退票！"] = "It was so frustrating to watch, refund! I demand a refund!",
    ["看怀表"] = "Look at the pocket watch",
    ["看您收拾的这些行李，似乎是要离开廷根了？看起来有些不舍。"] = "Looking at the luggage you've packed, it seems you are leaving Tingen? You look a bit reluctant.",
    ["看您是生面孔，现在买书，我还自掏腰包请您喝黑啤酒。"] = "Seeing that you're a new face, if you buy a book now, I'll pay out of my own pocket to treat you to a black beer.",
    ["看您的样子，是第一次踏足廷根的夜？那您找对地方了。这里是这座城里唯一能让时间慢下来的角落。酒是上等的，人……更是。"] = "Looking at you, it's your first time stepping into the night of Tingen? Then you've found the right place. This is the only corner in this city where time slows down. The wine is top-notch, and the people... even more so.",
    ["看情况……但成为值夜者，你会失去很多，比如自由。"] = "It depends... but becoming a Nighthawk means you will lose a lot, such as freedom.",
    ["看我炸烂这架马车！"] = "Watch me blow up this carriage!",
    ["看我的袖钉。"] = "Look at my cufflinks.",
    ["看我的！"] = "Watch me!",
    ["看我！求求你看我一眼！我已经写了一千首情诗，每一首都在歌颂您的美！ "] = "Look at me! Please, look at me! I have written a thousand love poems, each one praising your beauty!",
    ["看房间"] = "Look at the room",
    ["看打架路人1"] = "Passerby Watching Fight 1",
    ["看打架路人2"] = "Passerby Watching Fight 2",
    ["看打架路人3"] = "Passerby Watching Fight 3",
    ["看打架路人4（已废弃）"] = "Passerby Watching Fight 4 (Deprecated)",
    ["看报"] = "Read newspaper",
    ["看报旅客手提箱"] = "Passenger Suitcase reading newspaper",
    ["看报的值夜者"] = "Nighthawk Reading a Newspaper",
    ["看报纸"] = "Read the newspaper",
    ["看报纸乘客"] = "Passenger Reading a Newspaper",
    ["看招！"] = "Take this!",
    ["看拳赛喝南威尔才带劲，{{PlayerName}}，你也来一杯？"] = "Watching a boxing match while drinking Southwell is the best, {{PlayerName}}, want a glass too?",
    ["看挨揍小猫"] = "Watch Beaten Kitten",
    ["看文字板相机"] = "Look at text board camera",
    ["看新人的反应 像被你骗来的？"] = "Looking at the newcomer's reaction, it's like you tricked him into coming?",
    ["看日出"] = "Watch the sunrise",
    ["看日记"] = "Look at the diary",
    ["看时间"] = "Check the Time",
    ["看来“火种二号”也光荣牺牲了。"] = "It seems 'Fire Seed No. 2' also sacrificed itself gloriously.",
    ["看来“魔术师”小姐已经沉浸在创作中了，暂时不去打扰她了。"] = "It seems Miss Magician is already immersed in her creation, so I won't disturb her for now.",
    ["看来……看来我们之前都想错了……"] = "It seems... it seems we were all wrong before...",
    ["看来……该做出选择了。"] = "It seems... it's time to make a choice.",
    ["看来不行……"] = "It seems it won't work...",
    ["看来他们是有意要蹲守值钱货的买家啊……幸好这次没得逞。"] = "It seems they were intentionally lying in wait for buyers of valuable goods... Fortunately, they didn't succeed this time.",
    ["看来他们正在讨论的是蓝星，告诉孩子们吧。"] = "It seems they are discussing the Blue Star; let's tell the children.",
    ["看来他们集中埋伏在这里，要先歼灭他们！"] = "It seems they are concentrated in an ambush here, we must annihilate them first!",
    ["看来他在找回家的路，还有未完成的约定。"] = "It seems he's trying to find his way home and fulfill an unfinished promise.",
    ["看来仪式并非完全安全，希望他们可以长记性吧。"] = "It seems the ritual isn't entirely safe. I hope they learn their lesson.",
    ["看来你们并非对隐秘一无所知，接下来，就让我亲眼见识一番吧。"] = "It seems you are not entirely ignorant of the hidden. Next, let me see for myself.",
    ["看来你发现了不对劲的地方。"] = "It seems you have discovered something wrong.",
    ["看来你喜欢将命运掌握在自己手中，虽然缺乏一些刺激，但是个稳妥的选择。"] = "It seems you like to keep your fate in your own hands. While it lacks some excitement, it is a safe choice.",
    ["看来你已经尝到了它的苦头，所以才说它是诅咒。"] = "It seems you have already tasted its bitterness, which is why you call it a curse.",
    ["看来你已经把中级时尚评鉴全都完成了。不错，时尚协会已经认可你的品味，现在可以去和高级评委聊聊真正的搭配了。"] = "It seems you have completed all the intermediate fashion appraisals. Not bad, the Fashion Association has recognized your taste. Now you can go and talk to senior judges about real matching.",
    ["看来你并不喜欢安提科勋爵……我听说他们似乎感情不和。"] = "It seems you don't like Lord Antigonus... I heard they don't seem to have a good relationship.",
    ["看来你很满意啊。"] = "It seems you're quite satisfied.",
    ["看来你来的正是时候。"] = "It seems you've come at just the right time.",
    ["看来你的品味也不过如此。"] = "It seems your taste is nothing more than this.",
    ["看来你知道的不少！"] = "It seems you know quite a lot!",
    ["看来你讨厌他"] = "Seems you hate him",
    ["看来你误会了什么，他只是走了，离开廷根而已。该死的，我每个月还要上交大半收入给他。"] = "It seems you misunderstood something. He just left, left Tingen, that's all. Damn it, I still have to hand over most of my income to him every month.",
    ["看来卡门的身体在<h>花丛</>里"] = "It seems Carmen's body is in the <h>flower bed</>",
    ["看来又是平静的一天……"] = "Looks like another peaceful day...",
    ["看来只能先把他送去附近的教会了……"] = "It seems I can only send him to the nearby church first...",
    ["看来噩梦的确是某种预兆。我得抓紧时间找到他，阻止他。"] = "It seems that the nightmare is indeed some kind of omen. I must hurry to find him and stop him.",
    ["看来她这次还是回不来。你不想见她吗？"] = "It seems she can't come back this time either. Don't you want to see her?",
    ["看来它们不喜欢我。可惜，我也不喜欢现在的它们。"] = "It seems they don't like me. Pity, I don't like them as they are now either.",
    ["看来小猫已经不在这里了，我也收好东西离开吧。"] = "It seems the kitten is no longer here; I should pack my things and leave as well.",
    ["看来店主还挺用心的，再排会吧。"] = "It seems the shopkeeper is quite diligent; let's wait a bit longer.",
    ["看来得驱散才能看清"] = "Looks like I need to Dispel it to see clearly.",
    ["看来您已经从事这个行业很久了。"] = "It seems you have been in this industry for a long time.",
    ["看来您已经开始用自己的节奏感受这座城市了。廷根的每个角落都值得花时间品味，尤其是在不同的光线之下……总会发现新的细节。 "] = "It seems you have started to feel this city at your own pace. Every corner of Tingen is worth taking the time to savor, especially under different lighting... you will always discover new details.",
    ["看来您是一位和合格的女仆，相信很快就会有雇主来找您的。"] = "It seems you are a qualified maid. I believe an employer will come looking for you soon.",
    ["看来您是个明白人。"] = "It seems you are a sensible person.",
    ["看来您误会了，这是尼尔先生的花园，他已经去世了。"] = "It seems you've misunderstood, this is Mr. Neil's garden, he has already passed away.",
    ["看来您说的是真的。呵呵，我们雪山的猎人，直觉一向准得可怕。"] = "It seems what you said is true. Hehe, the intuition of us hunters on the snowy mountain has always been terrifyingly accurate.",
    ["看来您运气不错，老特勒已经死了，晚上的时候最好还是找个安全的地方，为了您的安全。"] = "It seems you are lucky. Old Trelle is already dead. It's best to find a safe place at night, for your own safety.",
    ["看来我对风暴信徒的想法也该改变了。"] = "It seems I should change my opinion of the followers of the Storm.",
    ["看来我已经狼狈到引起了一位好心人的注意，唉，都是那该死的噩梦。"] = "It seems I've become so disheveled that I've attracted the attention of a kind person. Sigh, it's all that damn nightmare.",
    ["看来我昨天错过了一个非常大的功劳。"] = "It seems I missed out on a huge credit yesterday.",
    ["看来昨天的努力没有白费，事情总算往好的方向发展了。"] = "It seems yesterday's efforts weren't in vain; things are finally moving in a good direction.",
    ["看来是一盏路灯照亮了这位美丽的小姐，也照亮了这场悲剧的凶杀。"] = "It seems a streetlamp has illuminated this beautiful young lady, and also illuminated this tragic murder.",
    ["看来是他急于汲取力量，导致笔记内蕴藏的超凡力量失控了！"] = "It seems he was eager to absorb power, causing the Extraordinary power contained in the notebook to lose control!",
    ["看来是躲到了书中……或许那是她认为最安全的地方。"] = "It seems she hid in a book... perhaps that's the place she considers safest.",
    ["看来有必要了解医生的态度。"] = "It seems necessary to understand the doctor's attitude.",
    ["看来杜伦被变卖商铺这件事打动到了啊……其他人会不会也是呢。"] = "It seems Duren was moved by the matter of selling the shop... I wonder if the others feel the same.",
    ["看来物品遗失并非偶然，而是一场预谋……继续调查，一定要追回失物。"] = "It seems the loss of the items was not accidental, but a premeditated act... continue the investigation, we must recover the lost items.",
    ["看来现在廷根的骑士很少，反而更好锁定了，说明只要找到骑士……就很可能是那个人。"] = "It seems there are very few knights in Tingen now, which actually makes it easier to lock onto them. It means that as long as we find the knight... it's very likely to be that person.",
    ["看来短时间内是不能回家了……从现在开始，我就是克莱恩了。"] = "It seems I won't be able to go home for a while... From now on, I am Klein.",
    ["看来福戈很在意孩子们的学业……沙曼好像也谅解了老莱纳的难处……"] = "It seems Fogo cares a lot about the children's education... Shaman also seems to have forgiven Old Laine's difficulties...",
    ["看来种地也是一门学问。"] = "It seems that farming is also a science.",
    ["看来答案就在第三题中了。"] = "It seems the answer lies within the third question.",
    ["看来要击杀这些乌鸦，才可以打断丧尸的恢复后，造成伤害"] = "It seems I need to kill these crows to interrupt the zombie's recovery and deal damage.",
    ["看来要对海纳斯展开更深入的调查，才能找出他背后组织的阴谋。"] = "It seems a more in-depth investigation into Haines is needed to uncover the conspiracy of the organization behind him.",
    ["看来要速战速决……现在就前往<P_Yellow>海岸线餐厅</>吧！"] = "It seems we need to act fast... Let's head to the <P_Yellow> Coastline Restaurant </> now!",
    ["看来还不错，我再想想！"] = "Seems not bad, I'll think about it!",
    ["看来还是韵脚押得不够多，我来试试三押！"] = "It seems there aren't enough rhymes; let me try a triple rhyme!",
    ["看来还需要些心理治疗，我会告诉“正义”女士的。"] = "It seems that some psychotherapy is still needed, I will tell Miss Justice.",
    ["看来这不是一个轻松的任务。"] = "It seems this is not an easy Quest.",
    ["看来这位{{先生|女士}}听我们讨论很久了，您也是佛尔思小姐的忠实读者吗？"] = "It seems this {{ Mr.| Ms.}} has been listening to our discussion for a long time. Are you also a loyal reader of Miss Fors?",
    ["看来这就是那头猎犬的主人了，果然，他也异变成为了怪物。"] = "It seems this is the master of that hound. As expected, he has also mutated into a monster.",
    ["看来这次的任务没那么简单……河岸好像有怨魂的气息残留，去前面搜寻一下吧。"] = "It seems this mission isn't that simple... there's a lingering aura of a Wraith on the riverbank. Let's go ahead and search.",
    ["看来这里就是那个邪神神使的藏身地了。"] = "It seems this is the hideout of that Evil God's Messenger.",
    ["看来这间屋子的前主人有一个重要的执念。“它”……究竟是什么？\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索：黑板上的字迹）</>"] = "It seems the previous owner of this room had an important obsession. What... exactly is \"it\"? \n<P_Yellow>(Obtained clue: Handwriting on the blackboard)</>",
    ["看来这间屋子的前主人有一个重要的执念。“它”……究竟是什么？\\n<P_Yellow>（获得了线索：黑板上的字迹）</>"] = "It seems the previous owner of this room had an important obsession. What... exactly is 'it'?\n<P_Yellow>(Obtained clue: Handwriting on the blackboard)</>",
    ["看来那两个人只是“英雄救美”中的劫匪演员，而这场戏的真实目的……"] = "It seems those two are just robber actors in a \"hero saves the beauty\" act, and the real purpose of this play...",
    ["看来那家伙破产了。这些金币，就当是这次调查的额外津贴吧。"] = "Looks like that guy went bankrupt. Consider these gold coins an extra allowance for this investigation.",
    ["看来都结束了 绝望魔镜被毁 献祭仪式也被打断……"] = "It seems it's all over. The Magic Mirror of Despair has been destroyed, and the sacrifice ritual has been interrupted...",
    ["看来魔法师也比不上邓肯。"] = "It seems even a magician is no match for Duncan.",
    ["看来，“成为”罗塞尔大帝之后，我获得了一些他的学识。"] = "It seems that after 'becoming' Emperor Roselle, I have acquired some of his knowledge.",
    ["看来，临时演员还挺专业的。布朗团长，你说呢？"] = "It seems the temporary actors are quite professional. Captain Brown, what do you think?",
    ["看来，他也只是个运气不好的匠人学徒。"] = "It seems he was just an unlucky apprentice craftsman.",
    ["看来，你帮助了不少人……闪电莉莉？"] = "It seems you have helped quite a few people... Lightning Lily?",
    ["看来，只有打败它才能破解这道“题”。"] = "It seems that only by defeating it can we solve this \"puzzle\".",
    ["看来，只要破解机关谜题，就能打破循环。"] = "It seems that as long as the mechanism puzzle is solved, the cycle can be broken.",
    ["看来，和你有关？"] = "It seems, it has something to do with you?",
    ["看来，大帝那些关于“纯白精灵”的谜语，也有望解开了。"] = "It seems the Emperor's riddles about the 'Pure White Elf' also have a chance of being solved.",
    ["看来，小镇留下了我的很多画像……"] = "It seems the small town has left behind many portraits of me...",
    ["看来，您并不怎么欣赏鲁恩贵族的行事风格？"] = "It seems you don't appreciate the style of Loen nobles?",
    ["看来，我的推论是正确的……这位“工匠”奥斯瓦尔德，将所有的心血都灌注在这座机械小屋上。为了让它获得生命不惜一切。"] = "It seems my deduction is correct... This 'Artisan' Oswald poured all his heart and soul into this Mechanical Hut. He spared nothing to make it come alive.",
    ["看来，替换塔罗牌引起了“堕落母神”的注视。"] = "It seems that replacing the Tarot card has drawn the gaze of the \"Mother Tree of Desire\".",
    ["看来，有必要跑一趟奥尔斯纳街。"] = "It seems necessary to make a trip to Olsna Street.",
    ["看来，梦境也放大了他的表演欲。"] = "It seems the dream has also amplified his desire to perform.",
    ["看来，需要把所有雏菊都转动到光亮之下。"] = "It seems I need to rotate all the daisies into the light.",
