    ["看见了吗？子弹都穿不透信仰！这就是廷根需要的力量——加入我，让廷根再次伟大！"] = "Do you see? Even a Bullet cannot pierce faith! This is the power Tingen needs—join me, and Make Tingen Great Again!",
