    ["看起来……更像是遗弃的废品。"] = "It looks... more like discarded trash.",
    ["看起来业务不是很熟练"] = "Doesn't look very skilled",
    ["看起来他已经疯了。"] = "Looks like he's already gone mad.",
    ["看起来像一层屏障，试试看能不能摧毁它。"] = "It looks like a barrier; let's see if we can destroy it.",
    ["看起来危险程度不高。{{PlayerName}}，我们站在你身后，你来尝试解决它。"] = "It doesn't look very dangerous. {{PlayerName}}, we are standing behind you, you try to solve it.",
    ["看起来只是一些寻常的记录…先收起来吧"] = "These look like ordinary records... I should put them away first.",
    ["看起来和其他鸡蛋也没什么差别……但是，大大提高了鸡蛋产量啊！希望能尽快推广，这样就不会有人饿肚子了……"] = "It doesn't look any different from other eggs... but it greatly increases egg production! I hope it can be promoted soon so that no one will go hungry...",
    ["看起来太成熟了，成熟到我想喊你一声哥哥。"] = "It looks too mature, so mature that I want to call you brother.",
    ["看起来好得没话说。"] = "It looks impeccable.",
    ["看起来好精致，怎么做的？"] = "It looks so exquisite, how did you make it?",
    ["看起来它不太喜欢被打扰。"] = "It looks like it doesn't like being disturbed.",
    ["看起来它们还没开始改造文献室。"] = "It looks like they haven't started renovating the document room yet.",
    ["看起来工厂确实有些情况……这和被举报的奇怪声音会有联系吗？"] = "It looks like there really is something going on at the factory... Could this be related to the strange noises reported?",
    ["看起来很不错！"] = "Looks great!",
    ["看起来很凶，看来是一只烈性犬。"] = "Looks very fierce; it seems to be a vicious dog.",
    ["看起来很疼……"] = "That looks painful...",
    ["看起来我们有了一位挑战者，能辛苦你当裁判吗，向导？"] = "It looks like we have a challenger. Could you trouble yourself to be the judge, Guide?",
    ["看起来我有点低俗，其实这才叫艺术。"] = "It looks like I'm a bit vulgar, but actually, this is called art.",
    ["看起来挺凶的，不知道算不算烈性犬。"] = "Looks quite fierce; I don't know if it counts as a vicious dog.",
    ["看起来方方的，尝起来甜甜的，吃完后干劲满满的！"] = "It looks square, tastes sweet, and after eating it, you'll be full of energy!",
    ["看起来是屋主的日记的一部分，记录的是让“它”活过来的强烈执念。"] = "It looks like part of the owner's diary, recording an intense obsession to bring 'it' to life.",
    ["看起来是报销单。他们活着的时候没见过这东西，不过……现在你可以替他们用了。"] = "Looks like reimbursement forms. They never saw these things while they were alive, but... now you can use them on their behalf.",
    ["看起来是机械教会的造物，奇怪，教会怎么会扯进来？"] = "Looks like a creation of the Church of Steam. Strange, how did the Church get involved?",
    ["看起来是珍妮画的机械图纸，对了——"] = "It looks like mechanical drawings drawn by Jenny, by the way—",
    ["看起来皮特吸收了过多的力量，已经失控成为非人的怪物"] = "It seems Pete absorbed too much power and has lost control, becoming an inhuman monster.",
    ["看起来目的达成了"] = "Looks like the goal has been achieved",
    ["看起来肯在俱乐部的地位很高。他可能知道更多信息……不过还是<P_Yellow>先让菲利普清醒过来吧。</>"] = "It seems Ken has a high status in the club. He might know more information... But let's <P_Yellow>get Philip to sober up first.</>",
    ["看起来脾气很不好的河豚，实际上也确实火爆。"] = "A pufferfish that looks like it has a bad temper; in reality, it is indeed hot-tempered.",
    ["看起来菲利普就住在附近……"] = "It looks like Philip lives nearby...",
    ["看起来詹姆斯不是安东尼的对手。"] = "It looks like James is no match for Anthony.",
    ["看起来还挺有意思的，队伍都排这么长了，我也去试试。"] = "It looks quite interesting, the line is so long, I'll go try it too.",
    ["看起来还行，但人总会在相亲时有意无意地伪装自己，得再观察下！"] = "He seems okay, but people always intentionally or unintentionally disguise themselves on blind dates. I need to observe more!",
    ["看起来这只猫也是非凡生物，即将要陷入沉眠了。"] = "It seems this cat is also a Beyonder creature, about to fall into a deep sleep.",
    ["看起来这里都是些普通的生活用品，还算整齐干净，主人应该刚离开不久。"] = "It looks like these are just ordinary daily necessities, and it's quite neat and clean. The owner must have left not long ago.",
    ["看起来，你即将踏上一次新的旅途呢，呵呵。"] = "It seems you are about to embark on a new journey, hehe.",
    ["看起来，你已经做好充分准备了！"] = "It looks like you are fully prepared!",
    ["看起来，你是一个很深情的人。"] = "It seems you are a very affectionate person.",
    ["看起来，应该就是这个？试试有没有反应吧！"] = "It looks like this is the one? Let's see if there's a reaction!",
    ["看起来，白莉夫人或许是对现实太过失望才会主动跟侠盗黑皇帝离开，但这也将她置于未知的危险之中。"] = "It seems Lady Beryl might have been too disappointed with reality to leave with the Phantom Thief Black Emperor voluntarily, but this also put her in unknown danger.",
    ["看起来，这只狒狒对华丽的东西很有兴趣啊……"] = "It seems this baboon is very interested in flashy things...",
