    ["看过我！？"] = "Have you seen me!?",
    ["看过的书籍"] = "Read Books",
    ["看过那么多人的命运，却等不到一个人来看她。"] = "Having seen so many people's fates, yet waiting for no one to come see her.",
    ["看这个烛台，是从古堡里流传出来的。"] = "Look at this candlestick, it was passed down from the castle.",
    ["看这肋排的光泽就知道，我这卖的猪肉很新鲜。"] = "Just look at the sheen on these ribs; the pork I sell here is very fresh.",
    ["看这里，我们的世界由四块大陆和五片海洋一起构成。而我所涉足过的地方，只有那么一点点，我很想走出去，成为一个像格尔曼·斯帕罗一样伟大的冒险家。"] = "Look here, our world is composed of four continents and five oceans. And the places I have set foot in are only a tiny bit. I really want to go out and become a great adventurer like Gehrman Sparrow.",
    ["看那曲线！他拉桨时的背阔肌展开角度，简直是艺术品。"] = "Look at that curve! The way his latissimus dorsi expands when he pulls the oar is simply a work of art.",
    ["看那边。"] = "Look over there.",
    ["看那边拥挤的候车区，我仿佛能闻见东区小伙子们恶心的汗臭味！"] = "Look at that crowded waiting area, I feel like I can smell the disgusting sweat of the boys from the East District!",
    ["看那边的脚踏车事故，这个月第三起了吧？"] = "Look at that bicycle accident over there, that's the third one this month, right?",
    ["看钢琴莉娜"] = "Watch piano Lena",
    ["看错了？"] = "Did I see that wrong?",
    ["看镜子"] = "Look at the mirror",
    ["看镜子对话预加载"] = "Mirror Dialogue Preload",
    ["看镜子相机"] = "Look at Mirror Camera",
    ["看镜子相机1"] = "Look at the mirror (Camera 1)",
    ["看门人"] = "Gatekeeper",
    ["看门看守者"] = "Gatekeeper",
    ["看马车"] = "Look at the carriage",
    ["看！在那里！"] = "Look! Over there!",
    ["看！这就是奶奶种的南瓜！ "] = "Look! These are the pumpkins Grandma grew!",
    ["看！连你们自己人都说了，就是个“印子”！哪值得三苏勒？什么百分之五的慈善，就是这么搜刮出来的吧？"] = "Look! Even your own people said it's just a 'mark'! How is it worth three soli? Is this how that 'five percent charity' is scraped together?",
    ["看，从天而降的金雨就是这次的任务，接住这些金币。我们需要收拾现场。"] = "Look, the golden rain falling from the sky is the quest this time; catch these gold coins. We need to clean up the scene.",
    ["看，又给那公司送货了。"] = "Look, another delivery to that company.",
    ["看，多么棒的一片集市！有商人已经驻扎在这里了。"] = "Look, what a wonderful market! Merchants have already set up shop here.",
    ["看，封印解除了。你做得非常出色，第一次尝试就如此成功，你的灵性感知力和控制力都很优秀。"] = "Look, the seal is broken. You did an excellent job. Being this successful on your first attempt shows that your spiritual perception and control are both outstanding.",
    ["看，这么多年过去，尤德拉之树依旧在庇佑这里。"] = "Look, after all these years, the Tree of Yodra is still protecting this place.",
    ["看，这里链条松了……"] = "Look, the chain is loose here...",
    ["看，那两个小朋友很可爱吧。那是玛丽阿姨的小孩哦。"] = "Look, those two little ones are cute, aren't they? Those are Aunt Mary's children.",
    ["看，那就是需要共鸣的封印！每一段快乐陪伴，都会留下情绪回响，而我最擅长倾听它们！"] = "Look, that is the seal that requires resonance! Every moment of happy companionship leaves behind an emotional echo, and I am best at listening to them!",
    ["看，那盒戒指都是花海捡的。每个被恋人扔掉戒指的人都觉得这辈子完了，但似乎后来都好好的。计划得再好，最后也不一定成。这些就是先例。"] = "Look, that box of rings was all picked up in the flower sea. Everyone who has their ring thrown away by a lover thinks their life is over, but it seems they all turn out fine later. No matter how good the plan is, it doesn't always work out in the end. These are the precedents.",
    ["真"] = "True",
    ["真\r\n贪\r\n心"] = "So\nGreedy",
    ["真·乱斗无双"] = "True Brawl Musou",
    ["真·侦探"] = "Real Detective",
    ["真·大世界遭遇对镜头用"] = "True - Open World Encounter Camera Use",
    ["真·离开黑荆棘踩点"] = "True - Leave Blackthorn spot",
    ["真……真的吗？我……不，不行，不能白拿别人的东西。而且……"] = "R-really? I... no, I can't, I can't take things for free. And...",
    ["真、真的？那我得赶紧跑了。"] = "R-really? Then I have to run quickly.",
    ["真不去喝一杯？"] = "Are you really not going for a drink?",
    ["真不容易。"] = "That's not easy.",
    ["真不敢相信，我们居然和他们在同一条船上。"] = "I can't believe we're actually on the same ship as them.",
    ["真不明白他哪里来的钱修金马桶，我在另一位议员家工作的妹妹说，她的主人过得很朴素。"] = "I really don't understand where he got the money to install a gold toilet. My sister, who works at another councilor's house, says her master lives very simply.",
    ["真不来一局？好吧……什么时候想乱斗了，记得来找我！"] = "Really not coming for a round? Fine... whenever you feel like a brawl, remember to come find me!",
    ["真不甘心……给我一点力量或者财富吧……"] = "I'm really not reconciled... Give me some power or wealth...",
    ["真不知道温德姆太太是怎么打理这么多花的！"] = "I really don't know how Mrs. Wyndham manages to take care of so many flowers!",
    ["真不知道这个没人光顾的店有什么……咳，欢迎光临！"] = "I really don't know what this shop that no one visits has... ahem, welcome!",
    ["真不错，不过你回家这么晚……刚工作就要加班？那些可恶的老板！"] = "That's great, but you're home so late... Working overtime right after starting? Those hateful bosses!",
    ["真不错，看起来是个靠谱又帅气的好家伙。"] = "Not bad, you look like a reliable and handsome guy.",
    ["真不错，福利待遇都很丰厚，同事们看起来也很友善。"] = "It's quite good; the benefits are generous, and the colleagues seem very friendly.",
    ["真与假投影"] = "True and False Projection",
    ["真令人感叹。这样一位杀过不少怪物的“守卫”，最后自己失控变成了怪物……"] = "It's truly lamentable. Such a 'guard' who has killed many monsters has finally lost control and become a monster himself...",
    ["真令人羡慕。如果以后再遇上类似的委托，请一定记得通知我。"] = "How enviable. If you encounter similar commissions in the future, please remember to notify me.",
    ["真倒霉，邮局的自行车坏了，从国王大道走到这儿，我的靴子都要磨穿了……奈拉小姐收到的信，永远是这片区最沉的！ "] = "So unlucky, the post office bicycle is broken. Walking here from King's Avenue, my boots are about to wear through... The letters Miss Naila receives are always the heaviest in this district!",
    ["真切接触“窥秘”权柄，能窥探隐藏的秘密、知识和命运。可以预言选择带来的后果，预见未来，但涉及高位存在反噬越大。"] = "Truly touch the 'Secret Peeking' authority, capable of peeking into hidden secrets, knowledge, and fate. You can predict the consequences of choices and foresee the future, but the backlash is greater when involving high-level existences.",
    ["真厉害。"] = "That's impressive.",
    ["真厉害啊，听上去你对自己的未来很有规划。"] = "That's amazing, it sounds like you have a very good plan for your future.",
    ["真可怜，待会分点给他吧……嗯，得小心引导让他接受。"] = "How pitiful. I'll share some with him later... Hmm, I must guide him carefully so he accepts it.",
    ["真可惜……昨晚的您，可比清醒时有趣多了。"] = "What a pity... You were much more interesting last night than you are when you're sober.",
    ["真可惜呀，那我就只能将就用你填填肚子了！"] = "What a pity, then I'll just have to make do with filling my stomach with you!",
    ["真可惜，\r\n快乐的时光总是短暂的"] = "What a pity,\nhappy times are always short-lived",
    ["真可惜，再接再厉"] = "What a pity, keep trying",
    ["真可惜，我平时工作忙得很，到时候恐怕抽不出身来为你们作见证。"] = "What a pity, I am very busy with work usually, I'm afraid I won't be able to spare time to witness for you then.",
    ["真可爱，还在犹豫？算了，游戏该结束了。"] = "How cute, still hesitating? Forget it, the game should end here.",
    ["真困啊……"] = "So sleepy...",
    ["真困啊！"] = "I'm so sleepy!",
    ["真复杂"] = "So complicated",
    ["真够种！"] = "Got guts!",
    ["真奇怪，谁会在水里建一座拱形的房子呢？ "] = "How strange. Who would build an arched house in the water?",
    ["真奇怪，这本书似乎总是自己翻到这一章。莫非是我某次阅读时，不经意折损了书脊？"] = "How strange, this book seems to always flip to this chapter by itself. Could it be that I accidentally damaged the spine during one of my readings?",
    ["真好 很幸运"] = "That's good, very lucky",
    ["真好啊，如果我儿子也能像你这样，有一份正经的、体面的工作，那我做梦都能笑醒……"] = "That's great. If my son could be like you and have a proper, decent job, I'd wake up smiling in my dreams...",
    ["真好心啊……"] = "How kind-hearted...",
    ["真好，我也想认识认识这些朋友！"] = "That's great, I also want to meet these friends!",
    ["真安静，没有香槟杯碰撞的声音，没有虚伪的恭维。"] = "So quiet, no sound of champagne glasses clinking, no hypocritical flattery.",
    ["真实与虚幻，只在一念之间。"] = "Reality and illusion are but a single thought apart.",
    ["真实之眼"] = "Eye of True Perception",
    ["真实之眼初始"] = "Eye of True Perception Initial",
    ["真实之眼持续放大"] = "Eye of True Perception Continuous Zoom",
    ["真实之眼放大"] = "Eye of True Perception Zoom In",
    ["真实之镜"] = "Mirror of Truth",
    ["真实伤害值和血量上限的比值"] = "Ratio of true damage value to max HP",
    ["真实凝视"] = "True Gaze",
    ["真实属性"] = "True Stats",
    ["真实视野"] = "True Vision",
    ["真实造物主"] = "True Creator",
    ["真实造物主……"] = "True Creator...",
    ["真实造物主的追随者？那群疯子什么都干的出来。哼，真应该把他们丢进墓穴里，用腐肉塞满他们的每一个孔隙。"] = "Followers of the True Creator? Those madmen are capable of anything. Hmph, they should really be thrown into a tomb and have every pore stuffed with rotting flesh.",
    ["真巧，蒙特利也邀请了我一起去用餐。"] = "What a coincidence, Monterey also invited me to dine together.",
    ["真希望我们带了自己的咖啡桌。"] = "I really wish we had brought our own coffee table.",
    ["真希望我在贝克兰德大学能经历一段奇遇。"] = "I really hope I can have an adventure at Backlund University.",
    ["真希望我的猫能快点回家！"] = "I really hope my cat comes home soon!",
    ["真希望有机会能见到这样的“大人物”，或许我应该在车站再等等。"] = "I really hope to have the chance to meet such a \"big shot.\" Perhaps I should wait a bit longer at the station.",
    ["真希望珍妮能实现愿望，考上廷根技术学校。"] = "I really hope Jenny can realize her wish and get into Tingen Technical School.",
    ["真希望见到一个美满的……尼尔先生当年的物品还在吗？"] = "I really hope to see a happy ending... are Mr. Neil's items from back then still around?",
    ["真希望这一切早点结束……"] = "I really hope all of this ends soon...",
    ["真希望这样的日子能永远持续下去。"] = "I really hope days like this can continue forever.",
    ["真心交付"] = "Heartfelt Delivery",
    ["真心要！很急！"] = "I really need it! It's urgent!",
    ["真心？哦，那真是稀有品——比我们家的古董银器还稀有。"] = "Genuine? Oh, that's a rarity—rarer than our family's antique silverware.",
    ["真怀念以前的日子……"] = "I really miss the old days...",
    ["真怀念在巴伐特银行做见习生的日子。"] = "I really miss the days when I was an intern at Bavart Bank.",
    ["真情实感吗？那这张面具对于我来说，更是无比宝贵了。"] = "Genuine feelings? Then this mask is even more precious to me.",
    ["真想就这么跳下去……"] = "I really want to just jump down like this...",
    ["真想念贝克兰德的克拉格俱乐部，布置的都是些有品位的花。"] = "I really miss the Cragg Club in Backlund, it's decorated with tasteful flowers.",
    ["真想打你一顿"] = "I really want to beat you up",
    ["真想拉他来我们美食社，说不定比两个序列5还有面子。"] = "I really want to pull him into our Gourmet Society; he might even have more prestige than two Sequence 5s.",
    ["真想要一把新的猎枪啊……"] = "I really want a new hunting rifle...",
    ["真抱歉，我光顾着悲伤了，忘了招待您。您今天来是要占卜，还是加入俱乐部？"] = "I'm so sorry, I was too busy being sad and forgot to entertain you. Are you here today for a divination, or to join the club?",
    ["真是“完美替身”——气味、斑点都像，可裂纹偏了。"] = "Truly a 'perfect substitute'—the smell, the spots are all similar, but the crack is off.",
    ["真是一个悲伤的故事。"] = "What a sad story.",
    ["真是一位好人，愿女神庇佑她。"] = "What a kind person, may the Goddess protect her.",
    ["真是一出伟大的戏剧，这两个小时让我仿佛度过了一生。"] = "What a great play. These two hours felt as if I had lived a whole lifetime.",
    ["真是一出伟大的戏剧，这两个小时让我仿佛渡过了一生。"] = "What a magnificent play; these two hours felt like I had lived a whole lifetime.",
    ["真是一场厄难，所幸你们获得了平安。"] = "What a disaster, fortunately, you all obtained safety.",
    ["真是一场灾难……"] = "What a disaster...",
    ["真是一场精彩的比赛……"] = "What a wonderful match...",
    ["真是一座漂亮的酒舍。"] = "What a beautiful winery.",
    ["真是一座漂亮的酒舍。您看这葡萄架，爬满了诱人的葡萄。"] = "What a beautiful tavern. Look at this grape trellis, covered in tempting grapes.",
    ["真是一次仓促的交接，但感谢女神庇佑，让这片领地有了一位合适的主人。"] = "What a hasty handover, but thank the Goddess for Her protection, allowing this territory to have a suitable owner.",
    ["真是一次成功的<h>【铁路大亨】</>"] = "What a successful <h>[Railroad Tycoon]</h>",
    ["真是一派祥和……"] = "What a peaceful scene...",
    ["真是不巧。看来只能期待下次见面再聊了。"] = "What a pity. It seems we'll have to wait until next time to talk.",
    ["真是不错"] = "That's really nice",
    ["真是个不错的朋友，不是吗？"] = "A pretty good friend, isn't he?",
    ["真是个可怜的男人。不过，他说的，是真的吗？"] = "What a pathetic man. However, is what he said true?",
    ["真是个好天气，太阳和铜便士一样闪耀。"] = "What a nice day, the sun is as bright as a copper penny.",
    ["真是个好差事"] = "What a good job",
    ["真是个特别的孩子……愿她一切顺利。"] = "What a special child... May everything go well for her.",
    ["真是个狡猾的女人……"] = "What a cunning woman...",
    ["真是个节省的好孩子啊！"] = "What a thrifty and good child!",
    ["真是令人动容的芬芳……"] = "What a moving fragrance...",
    ["真是令人难过，但这就是艺术不是吗？"] = "It's truly sad, but that is art, isn't it?",
    ["真是佩服居住在这座城市的人！早些时候我询问了一位女士，她像念绕口令般迅速地解答了我的疑惑，迅速到我的耳朵根本没有追上她念出的第二个站名。"] = "I truly admire the people who live in this city! Earlier, I asked a lady, and she answered my questions as quickly as if she were reciting a tongue twister—so fast that my ears couldn't even catch the second station name she mentioned.",
    ["真是冒失……"] = "How reckless...",
    ["真是十分抱歉，诺里斯先生。请问招生名额目前还有空缺吗？"] = "I am truly sorry, Mr. Norris. Are there any vacancies for enrollment at the moment?",
    ["真是十分抱歉，诺里斯先生，请问招生名额目前还有空缺吗？"] = "I am truly sorry, Mr. Norris. May I ask if there are still any vacancies for enrollment?",
    ["真是厉害，看来还得善于观察才行。"] = "Truly amazing, it seems one must be good at observing as well.",
    ["真是可怕的尝试，看起来像苹果潘趣酒变质了。"] = "What a terrible attempt, it looks like the Apple Punch has gone bad.",
    ["真是可惜，这家餐馆是我和奥杰里克先生友谊的见证，我们就是在一张餐桌上认识的！"] = "It's a pity; this restaurant is a testament to the friendship between Mr. Ojerik and me. We met at a dining table!",
    ["真是可笑，这些蠢货还在发印着肖像画的通缉令。"] = "It's ridiculous, these idiots are still issuing wanted posters with portraits on them.",
    ["真是吹牛不用交税"] = "Bragging really doesn't require taxes",
    ["真是和平而悠闲的一天……祝你也能回到廷根拥有这样的一天。"] = "What a peaceful and leisurely day... I hope you can also return to Tingen and have such a day.",
    ["真是多谢你了！来，请拿好！"] = "Thank you so much! Here, please take them!",
    ["真是天才！他给了那首诗灵魂！"] = "What a genius! He gave that poem a soul!",
    ["真是太感谢了，善良的{{先生|女士}}，如果你见到它，请一定告诉我。"] = "Thank you so much, kind {{Mr.|Ms.}}, if you see it, please be sure to tell me.",
    ["真是太感谢了，请稍等，果子汤煮好后分给你。"] = "Thank you so much. Please wait a moment; I'll share some fruit soup with you once it's ready.",
    ["真是太感谢您了，{{先生|女士}}，廷根时尚协会的成员真是这条街上最难接待的客人！"] = "Thank you so much, {{ Mr. | Ms. }}. The members of the Tingen Fashion Association are truly the most difficult guests to host on this street!",
    ["真是奇怪，目前毫无线索，只遇上了几个互称大臣的小孩。"] = "How strange, there are no clues at all, just met a few kids calling each other Ministers.",
    ["真是好人啊……"] = "What a good person...",
    ["真是好孩子，不过我想笔是不会自己写作业的哦。"] = "What a good child, but I'm afraid pens don't do homework on their own.",
    ["真是好消息。"] = "That's good news.",
    ["真是小甜心。"] = "What a little sweetheart.",
    ["真是年轻人啊，我也曾以为自己是最特殊的人。但很多人研究一辈子，也只能看懂上面几个单词。"] = "What a young man. I also once thought I was the most special person. But many people study for a lifetime and can only understand a few words on them.",
    ["真是库克先生！"] = "It really is Mr. Cook!",
    ["真是想念我壁炉旁的猫窝啊，还有我的小鱼玩具。"] = "I really miss my cat bed by the fireplace, and my little fish toy.",
    ["真是收获满满……"] = "What a fruitful experience...",
    ["真是无礼！这群记者满嘴都是谎话。"] = "How rude! These reporters are full of lies.",
    ["真是有个性的名字，希望味道也能给我带来惊喜！"] = "What a unique name, I hope the taste will also bring me a surprise!",
    ["真是有趣。进去看看吧，不会让你感到无聊的。"] = "How interesting. Go in and take a look, it won't bore you.",
    ["真是本神奇的故事书。"] = "What a magical storybook.",
    ["真是没有丝毫攻击性的封印物"] = "What a completely non-aggressive Sealed Artifact",
    ["真是没素质！好端端的花圃都被污染了！"] = "How uncivilized! A perfectly good flower bed has been corrupted!",
    ["真是烦人啊！吵得我耳朵都要起茧子了。"] = "How annoying! It's so noisy my ears are going to develop calluses.",
    ["真是热闹的舞会……先观察，看看有什么异常。"] = "What a lively ball... I'll observe first and see if there are any anomalies.",
    ["真是的，什么时候才能直达迪西海湾？我可不想再坐船去了，太难受了！"] = "Really, when will there be a direct route to Desi Bay? I don't want to take a boat anymore, it's too uncomfortable!",
    ["真是神奇的疯子友谊啊……"] = "What a magical friendship between madmen...",
    ["真是糟糕的表演……"] = "What a terrible performance...",
    ["真是累坏我了。等下吃什么？"] = "I'm really exhausted. What should we eat later?",
    ["真是细致的观察。"] = "What a detailed observation.",
    ["真是美丽的项链啊……"] = "What a beautiful necklace...",
    ["真是聪明的小灵鼠。可惜主人到底是一回到家就在客厅踩中杀人秘术，还是在起居室被恶灵重伤，逃向厨房时踩中秘术而亡的呢——已经无从知晓了。"] = "What a clever little spirit mouse. It's a pity that whether the master stepped on a lethal mystical trap the moment he returned to the living room, or was grievously injured by an Evil Spirit and died after stepping on the trap while fleeing to the kitchen—is something we will never know.",
    ["真是聪明细致的小灵鼠。可惜主人到底是从大门踩中了杀人秘术，还是在起居室被恶灵重伤，再尔逃向厨房被秘术彻底杀害呢？这就不得而知了。"] = "What a clever and meticulous little spirit mouse. It's a pity that it's unknown whether the owner stepped on the killing ritual at the front door, or was severely injured by an evil spirit in the living room before fleeing to the kitchen and being completely killed by the ritual.",
    ["真是舒服的日子啊……"] = "What a comfortable day...",
    ["真是讨厌！等会儿回去，又要面对那个满口工作的老女人……"] = "So annoying! When I go back later, I have to face that old woman who only talks about work...",
    ["真是让人意犹未尽……"] = "It really leaves one wanting more...",
    ["真是谢谢您……从酒吧后面出来之后，那帮人就一直缠着我不放……"] = "Thank you so much... Ever since I came out from behind the bar, those people have been pestering me non-stop...",
    ["真是部长！抱歉长官，刚才没认出您！"] = "It really is the Minister! Sorry sir, I didn't recognize you just now!",
    ["真是长大了啊……"] = "You really have grown up...",
    ["真是麻烦……"] = "What a nuisance...",
    ["真是麻烦，现在来这的病人越来越多了！"] = "It's such a hassle, there are more and more patients coming here now!",
    ["真有这种好事？会不会有危险……"] = "Is there really such a good thing? Will there be danger...",
    ["真有这种酒？"] = "Does such a drink really exist?",
    ["真正有病的人可走不进这里。他们付不起。"] = "People who are truly sick can't walk in here. They can't afford it.",
    ["真正的凶手……是管家?可是，这与女主人的话完全矛盾。"] = "The real murderer... is the butler? But this completely contradicts what the mistress said.",
    ["真正的凶手另有其人"] = "The real murderer is someone else",
    ["真正的占卜家会明白自身的渺小，命运的伟大。"] = "A true Seer will understand their own insignificance and the greatness of fate.",
    ["真正的占卜师"] = "True Seer",
    ["真正的危险 还在仓库里"] = "The real danger is still in the warehouse.",
    ["真正的厨王之王"] = "The True King of Chefs",
    ["真正的守护者，最值得信赖的同伴，永远的队长。"] = "A true guardian, the most trustworthy companion, and a captain forever.",
    ["真正的守护者；最值得信赖的同伴；永远的队长……"] = "A true guardian; the most trustworthy companion; forever the captain...",
    ["真正的守护者；最值得信赖的同伴；永远的队长。\n\n邓恩·史密斯"] = "A true guardian; the most trustworthy companion; our captain forever.\n\nDunn Smith",
    ["真正的守护，就是让光明里的人永远不知道黑暗的存在。"] = "True protection is letting people in the light never know of the existence of darkness.",
    ["真正的宝藏，一棵由黄金筑成的巨树。"] = "The true treasure, a giant tree made of gold.",
    ["真正的小镇，其实隐藏和封印在了这片睡莲池之下，跟那位梦中女孩一起……"] = "The real town was actually hidden and sealed beneath this water lily pond, along with that girl from his dream...",
    ["真正的店主？"] = "The real shopkeeper?",
    ["真正的神迹！没想到如此高层次的事物就这样摆在最显眼的地方。"] = "A true miracle! I didn't expect such a high-level object to be placed in the most conspicuous place.",
    ["真正的通灵者"] = "A true Spirit Medium",
    ["真正的非凡者"] = "True Beyonder",
    ["真正的风尚，是能在花香与微风之间，恰到好处地展现自己的气质；既然你已经站在花的世界里，不如接受这场属于花海的品鉴挑战。"] = "True fashion is the ability to show one's temperament just right between the fragrance of flowers and the breeze; since you are already in the world of flowers, why not accept this appreciation challenge belonging to the sea of flowers.",
    ["真正的风景可都在屋顶上面！跟我一起飞一圈怎么样？"] = "The real scenery is all on the rooftops! How about flying a lap with me?",
    ["真正自然的柔顺，无需多余的粉饰，仅需剪影即可动人。"] = "Truly natural suppleness, no need for extra embellishment, just a silhouette is moving.",
    ["真水晶球的坐标为                 (α,ω加1)"] = "The coordinates of the real Crystal ball are (α, ω plus 1)",
    ["真水晶球的坐标为                 (β减2,α减2)"] = "The coordinates of the real Crystal ball are (β minus 2, α minus 2)",
    ["真没想到……那是两个很有想法的哥们，可惜了。"] = "I really didn't expect... those were two guys with a lot of ideas, what a pity.",
    ["真没想到，这么多年过去，她现在已经是一位勇敢的冒险家了，而我还从没走出过廷根。"] = "I never expected that after all these years, she has become a brave adventurer, while I have never even stepped out of Tingen.",
    ["真漂亮……"] = "So beautiful……",
    ["真爱之吻能让我忘却所有烦恼！"] = "A kiss of true love can make me forget all my troubles!",
    ["真理"] = "Truth",
    ["真理之眼"] = "Eye of Truth",
    ["真理之门在静默中，等待着唯一开启它的钥匙。"] = "The Door of Truth waits in silence for the only key that can open it.",
    ["真理啃食我，知识追逐我，我必须献上……痛苦的代价……"] = "Truth gnaws at me, knowledge chases me; I must offer... the price of pain...",
    ["真理射线"] = "Ray of Truth",
    ["真理射线射线表现"] = "Truth Ray Visual",
    ["真理射线的表现。"] = "Visual effect of Truth Ray.",
    ["真理射线表现"] = "Rift of Truth Ray Effect",
    ["真理总在你的生命终点之后。"] = "Truth always lies beyond the end of your life.",
    ["真理棋局"] = "Truth Chess Game",
    ["真理波浪"] = "Wave of Truth",
    ["真理洪流"] = "Torrent of Truth",
    ["真理裂隙"] = "Rift of Truth",
    ["真理裂隙计数器"] = "Rift of Truth Counter",
    ["真痴情啊！"] = "How truly devoted!",
    ["真的、真的……都是真的！"] = "Real, real... it's all real!",
    ["真的、真的还要触碰它吗？你的理智即将崩溃，这对非凡者来说太过危险。"] = "Really, do you really have to touch it? Your sanity is about to collapse; this is too dangerous for a Beyonder.",
    ["真的一点影响都没有吗？"] = "Is there really no impact at all?",
    ["真的不再试试了吗？你们距离见面只差一步了。我可以带你上去。"] = "Are you really not going to try again? You are only one step away from meeting. I can take you up there.",
    ["真的不用钱吗……"] = "Are you sure it's really free...",
    ["真的不能再便宜点吗……"] = "Can you really not make it any cheaper...",
    ["真的不行吗？可我想要婚礼当天可以直接从袖子里滑出去逃跑……"] = "Is it really impossible? But I want to be able to slide out of the sleeves and run away on the wedding day...",
    ["真的假的"] = "For real?",
    ["真的假的？龙头在哪里，能不能让我们看看？"] = "Is it true or false? Where is the dragon head? Can you show us?",
    ["真的出现了一个洞！"] = "A hole really appeared!",
    ["真的可以吗？{{先生|女士}}，你为什么要这样帮我？"] = "Is it really okay? {{Mr.|Ms.}}, why would you help me like this?",
    ["真的吗……"] = "Really...",
    ["真的吗……那太好了。<P_Heart>（略显歉疚）</>那片领地一直都缺少打理，也没有正式开始什么建设。您出1000苏勒，我想就已经很合适了。"] = "Really? That would be wonderful. <P_Heart> (looking slightly apologetic) </> That land has always lacked maintenance, and no formal construction has started. I think 1000 soli would be quite appropriate.",
    ["真的吗！但我听说，这里的待遇非常好？"] = "Really! But I heard that the treatment here is very good?",
    ["真的吗！？太好了！"] = "Really!? That's great!",
    ["真的吗，{{大哥哥|大姐姐}}，我在这儿好久了，你是第一个愿意这么说我的人。"] = "Really, {{Big Brother|Big Sister}}? I've been here for a long time, and you are the first person willing to say that to me.",
    ["真的吗，我好像是在做梦。要是梦醒了……我和杰姆，还能去哪儿呢？我们已经……回不去了。"] = "Really? I feel like I'm dreaming. If I wake up... where else can Jem and I go? We... we can't go back.",
    ["真的吗，我马上出来……不对，谁信啊！"] = "Really? I'm coming out right away... wait, who would believe that!",
    ["真的吗？"] = "Really?",
    ["真的吗？但我不觉得是我看走眼了，看那朵云……"] = "Really? But I don't think I saw it wrong. Look at that cloud...",
    ["真的吗？但是……像我这样的工人写的诗，会有人看吗？"] = "Really? But... will anyone read poems written by a worker like me?",
    ["真的吗？但是总不能无缘无故没人来吧。"] = "Really? But people wouldn't just stop coming for no reason.",
    ["真的吗？太好了！我欠你一个人情！"] = "Really? That's great! I owe you a favor!",
    ["真的吗？对，我好像有点印象……他是说了那家餐厅的名字吗？他应该说了……！"] = "Really? Yes, I seem to have a vague memory... Did he say the name of that restaurant? He must have said it...!",
    ["真的吗？我得救了？"] = "Really? I'm saved?",
    ["真的吗？这是我们的荣幸，我为您登记会员情况。"] = "Really? This is our honor. I will register your membership information.",
    ["真的吗？那不是你瞎编的神吗？兔子之神真能管偷吃？！"] = "Really? Isn't that a god you made up? Can the God of Rabbits really handle stealing food?!",
    ["真的吗？那故事里，他们为什么肚子都圆滚滚的？"] = "Really? Then in the story, why were their bellies all round and bulging?",
    ["真的很抱歉。"] = "I'm really very sorry.",
    ["真的很需要"] = "Really need it",
    ["真的是你想要的，还是只是遵从父母的指示？"] = "Is it really what you want, or are you just following your parents' instructions?",
    ["真的是阿兹克先生！不过……我也不算认识您。但我知道您之前是霍伊大学的教员，有一个学生叫克莱恩·莫雷蒂。"] = "It really is Mr. Azik! Although... I don't really know you. But I know you were previously an instructor at Khoy University and had a student named Klein Moretti.",
    ["真的有啊！那应该叫他们什么？"] = "They really exist! Then what should I call them?",
    ["真的有这个东西吗？"] = "Does this thing really exist?",
    ["真的没什么！我要去上学了！"] = "There's really nothing! I'm going to school!",
    ["真的确定还要触碰它吗？你的理智将下降到较为危险的范围。"] = "Are you really sure you want to touch it? Your sanity will drop to a relatively dangerous range.",
    ["真的确定还要触碰它吗？你的理智正在摇摇欲坠，不如及时收手。"] = "Are you really sure you want to touch it? Your sanity is teetering; it's better to stop now.",
    ["真的要放在这里吗？会不会有点奇怪？"] = "Do we really have to put it here? Won't it be a bit strange?",
    ["真的！我天天侍弄它们，最清楚了。尤其是玫瑰，刺都比别处的尖。常来的罗珊小姐也总这么说！"] = "It's true! I tend to them every day, so I know best. Especially the roses; even their thorns are sharper than others. Miss Roselle, who comes often, always says so too!",
    ["真的，如果你对邱琪有意思，我们肯定愿意为你侧面敲打敲打他……"] = "Really, if you're interested in Qiuqi, we'd definitely be willing to drop some hints for you...",
    ["真的？"] = "Really?",
    ["真的？无论如何，先谢谢你。"] = "Really? Regardless, thank you first.",
    ["真的？是哪两份？"] = "Really? Which two?",
    ["真的？看在脚踏车的份上，为您效劳，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Really? For the sake of the bicycle, I'll be at your service, {{sir|madam}}.",
    ["真的？谢谢您！{{先生|女士}}。愿女神眷顾您。祝您也生活顺利！"] = "Really? Thank you! {sir|madam}. May the Goddess bless you. I wish you a smooth life as well!",
    ["真的？这么神奇的事情，你怎么也不教教我？"] = "Really? Such a magical thing, why don't you teach me?",
    ["真的？那戏我可盼了好久了。 "] = "Really? I've been looking forward to that play for a long time.",
    ["真的？！您是一位真正的勇士。"] = "Really?! You are a true warrior.",
    ["真相在哪个方向"] = "Which direction is the truth in",
    ["真相就写在纸面上，但还需要我们拂去灰尘。"] = "The truth is written on the paper, but we still need to brush away the dust.",
    ["真相就是……我是个寡妇，陛下。我的丈夫三年前去世了。从那之后，男人们都觉得我是容易得手的猎物。 "] = "The truth is... I am a widow, Your Majesty. My husband passed away three years ago. Since then, men have felt that I am easy prey.",
    ["真相总会浮出水面，恐惧会蒙蔽我们的双眼，库尔斯先生。"] = "The truth will always surface; fear will blind our eyes, Mr. Cours.",
    ["真相比性命重要？"] = "Is the truth more important than life?",
    ["真相的视角"] = "Perspective of Truth",
    ["真相究竟在哪个方向……"] = "In which direction does the truth lie...",
    ["真知之熔杖"] = "Molten Staff of True Knowledge",
    ["真知灯塔"] = "Beacon of True Knowledge",
    ["真知灼见，折射真理。"] = "True insight reflects the truth.",
    ["真知的吟杖"] = "Chanting Staff of True Knowledge",
    ["真移动平台"] = "True Moving Platform",
    ["真空气墙"] = "Vacuum wall",
    ["真美……"] = "So beautiful...",
    ["真羡慕你有这种手艺，从技术学院出来直接就能就业。"] = "I really envy you for having such a trade; you can get a job right after graduating from technical college.",
    ["真羡慕啊……"] = "I'm so envious...",
    ["真羡慕天生就有房产、田地、矿藏和珠宝的贵族们啊。"] = "I really envy the nobles who are born with property, land, mines, and jewelry.",
    ["真聪明！"] = "So smart!",
    ["真舍不得看花蔫掉……"] = "I really hate to see the flowers wither...",
    ["真视"] = "True Sight",
    ["真视水晶球"] = "True Sight Crystal Ball",
    ["真诚的"] = "sincere",
    ["真话"] = "Truth",
    ["真该死！他原本是我的上司，没想到内鬼竟然是他。"] = "Damn it! He was originally my superior. I never expected the mole to be him.",
    ["真说话了！"] = "It really spoke!",
    ["真贴心！"] = "So thoughtful!",
    ["真身击破，首领进入虚弱！时针倒转两格！"] = "The true body is broken; the boss enters a weakened state! The hour hand reverses two ticks!",
    ["真身，不可直视不可仰望的志高序列真身，不可直视不可仰望的志高序列真身，不可直视不可仰望的志高序列真身，不可直视不可仰望的"] = "True form, Cannot Be Looked At Directly, Cannot Be Looked Up To, high-sequence true form, Cannot Be Looked At Directly, Cannot Be Looked Up To, high-sequence true form, Cannot Be Looked At Directly, Cannot Be Looked Up To, high-sequence true form, Cannot Be Looked At Directly, Cannot Be Looked Up To",
    ["真远景"] = "True Long Shot",
    ["真遗憾……接着散步吧。"] = "What a pity... Let's continue our walk.",
    ["真遗憾，你现在出去排票的话，怕是连视野最差的票都买不到吧。"] = "What a pity. If you went out to queue for tickets now, I'm afraid you wouldn't even be able to buy the ones with the worst view.",
    ["真铁路大亨"] = "True Railroad Magnate",
    ["真难受，我一定要写首诗来记下这种感觉……"] = "It's so uncomfortable. I must write a poem to record this feeling...",
    ["真青春啊。"] = "How youthful.",
    ["真高兴收到礼物……"] = "So happy to receive a gift...",
    ["真高兴看到一位对咸鱼充满兴趣的人！"] = "It's so nice to see someone interested in salted fish!",
    ["真高兴看到像您这样优秀的年轻人，铁十字街可能稍微乱了点儿……但总是生机勃勃的，不是吗？"] = "It's so nice to see an excellent young person like you. Iron Cross Street might be a bit chaotic... but it's always full of vitality, isn't it?",
    ["真高兴见到你！我听说金秋湖发生了一些怪事，一株黄金树苗一夜之间生根发芽，成长大树。"] = "So glad to see you! I heard that some strange things happened at Golden Autumn Lake; a Golden Tree seedling took root and sprouted overnight, growing into a large tree.",
