    ["眼前一大片雏菊花田，黛西在里面蹦蹦跳跳，十分快乐。\n小黛西微笑着看了一眼这边，就继续跑到几个地方去摘雏菊花。"] = "Before your eyes is a large field of daisies, and Daisy is jumping around in it, very happy. \nLittle Daisy smiles and looks over here, then continues to run to several places to pick daisies.",
