    ["睡莲……沉睡了……保护睡莲……"] = "Water lily... sleeping... protect the water lily...",
    ["睡莲仙女三部曲！经典再版！\n《睡莲仙女的诞生》\n她在夜色中诞生，湖水织就她的衣袍，小镇的传说，就此开始。\n《睡莲仙女的奉献》\n为了的欢乐与幸福，她用一切换取永恒的白昼。\n《睡莲仙女的沉睡》\n她沉入湖心，在深眠中等待下一段故事的开启……"] = "Water Lily Fairy Trilogy! Classic Reissue! \n 'The Birth of the Water Lily Fairy' \n She was born in the night, the lake water wove her robes, and the town's legend began here. \n 'The Dedication of the Water Lily Fairy' \n For joy and happiness, she exchanged everything for eternal daylight. \n 'The Slumber of the Water Lily Fairy' \n She sank into the heart of the lake, waiting in deep sleep for the next story to begin...",
    ["睡莲仙女手记"] = "Water Lily Fairy Notes",
    ["睡莲啤酒？是用莲花酿的吗？"] = "Water lily beer? Is it brewed with lotus flowers?",
    ["睡莲对我们来说是很神圣的，怎么能卖呢？"] = "Water lilies are very sacred to us, how could we sell them?",
    ["睡莲小镇"] = "Water Lily Town",
    ["睡莲小镇传送点"] = "Water Lily Town teleport point",
    ["睡莲小镇开放探索"] = "Water Lily Town exploration opened",
    ["睡莲小镇欢迎你。"] = "Water Lily Town welcomes you.",
    ["睡莲小镇氛围-妮莎安妮塔"] = "Water Lily Town Atmosphere - Nissa Anita",
    ["睡莲小镇特产"] = "Water Lily Town Specialty",
    ["睡莲小镇现已开放探索，前往小镇，让心灵沉醉于沁人的绿意。"] = "Water Lily Town is now open for exploration. Head to the town and let your soul be intoxicated by the refreshing greenery.",
    ["睡莲小镇的观景拍照留念：\n远离廷根的喧嚣，睡莲小镇隐匿在群山的褶皱中。\n睡莲的芬芳牵引着每一位居民，人们在钟声里苏醒，在祷告中入睡。\n小镇生活每日如一，像永不落幕的戏剧。 "] = "Water Lily Town Sightseeing Photo: \nFar from the hustle and bustle of Tingen, Water Lily Town is hidden in the folds of the mountains. \nThe fragrance of water lilies draws every resident; people wake up to the sound of bells and fall asleep in prayer. \nLife in the small town is the same every day, like a play that never ends.",
    ["睡莲小镇秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Water Lily Town Order World completion reached 100%.",
    ["睡莲小镇秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Water Lily Town Order World completion reaches 100%%",
