    ["睡莲小镇脚踏车组-教堂尖碑"] = "Water Lily Town Bicycle Set - Church Stele",
    ["睡莲小镇脚踏车组-睡莲小镇尖碑"] = "Water Lily Town Bicycle Set - Water Lily Town Stele",
    ["睡莲小镇？那是郊外啊，只剩二十五分钟了……"] = "Water Lily Town? That's in the suburbs, and there are only twenty-five minutes left...",
    ["睡莲的芬芳牵引着每一位居民，人们在钟声里苏醒，在祷告中入睡。"] = "The fragrance of water lilies guides every resident; people wake up to the sound of bells and fall asleep in prayer.",
