    ["瞄准"] = "Aim",
    ["瞄准大锅，投入其中！"] = "Aim at the big pot and throw it in!",
    ["瞄准射击"] = "Aiming Shot",
    ["瞄准敌人5秒，造成更高射击伤害。"] = "Aim at the enemy for 5 seconds to deal higher shooting damage.",
    ["瞄准敌人射击，造成更高射击伤害。"] = "Aim and shoot at enemies, dealing higher shooting damage.",
    ["瞄准检测距离(厘米)"] = "Aim Detection Distance (cm)",
    ["瞄准目标，锁定弱点，扣动扳机，一枪致命。不过，在注视他人的同时，不要暴露自己。"] = "Aim at the target, lock onto the weakness, pull the trigger, and kill with one shot. However, while watching others, do not expose yourself.",
    ["瞄准，狙击！"] = "Aim and snipe!",
    ["瞧一瞧看一看！大胃王洛罗！"] = "Take a look! Lolo the Big Eater!",
    ["瞧一瞧看一看，全小镇仪式材料最全的商店！"] = "Take a look, come and see, the shop with the most complete ritual materials in the whole Small Town!",
    ["瞧一瞧！看一看！格尔曼的同款帽子！"] = "Take a look! Come and see! The same hat as Gehrman's!",
    ["瞧一瞧，看一看，拉姆德小镇最好的纪念品！"] = "Take a look, come and see, the best souvenirs from Lamud Town!",
    ["瞧你这点出息，就算再有钱，最重要的还是查清楚当年的真相！"] = "Look at your lack of ambition, even with all that money, the most important thing is to find out the truth of that year!",
    ["瞧好了，这样的蛋糕我能一口一个！"] = "Look closely, I can eat these cakes one by one!",
    ["瞧我，这么快就把路忘了。"] = "Look at me, I forgot the way so quickly.",
    ["瞧瞧<h>黄金马桶</>"] = "Take a look at the <h>golden toilet</>",
    ["瞧瞧我们，和这里的贵族相比，脸色是那么的暗淡，皮肤是那么粗糙。"] = "Look at us, compared to the nobles here, our complexions are so dull, and our skin is so rough.",
    ["瞧瞧我这花，今早刚浇了从南大陆商人那里买的花肥，开得比教堂的彩窗还鲜艳！"] = "Look at my flowers, I just watered them this morning with fertilizer bought from a merchant from the Southern Continent, they bloom more vividly than the church's stained glass!",
    ["瞧瞧这些个头饱满，身姿圆润的土豆！"] = "Look at these plump, round potatoes!",
    ["瞧瞧这些路上的小可怜们，可能永远都无法理解时尚是什么。"] = "Look at these poor things on the road, they might never understand what fashion is.",
    ["瞧瞧这天气，看上去像晴天吗？卡普顿还在那检查货物是否在船上，我敢说，出航两小时后我们都会在海底。"] = "Look at this weather, does it look like a sunny day? Capton is still there checking if the cargo is on the ship. I bet we'll all be at the bottom of the sea two hours after setting sail.",
    ["瞧瞧这天气，看上去像晴天吗？船长还在那检查货物是否在船上，我敢说，出航两小时后我们都会在海底。"] = "Look at this weather, does it look like a sunny day? The captain is still there checking if the cargo is on the ship. I bet that two hours after setting sail, we will all be at the bottom of the sea.",
    ["瞧瞧这拥有专利的减震锤柄，可以保证连续粉碎敌人的阴谋之后，也不会影响您手握下午茶茶杯的优雅！"] = "Look at this patented shock-absorbing hammer handle; it ensures that after continuously crushing the enemy's conspiracies, it won't affect the elegance of you holding your afternoon tea cup!",
    ["瞧瞧那边，多热闹的景象，你可以把它拍下来。放心，我暂时偷走了你的存在，他们感知不到你。"] = "Look over there, what a lively scene; you can take a picture of it. Don't worry, I've temporarily stolen your existence, they can't perceive you.",
    ["瞧瞧，你现在简直像刚从水沟里爬出来，并且被马车来回碾过三四遍。"] = "Look at you, you look like you just crawled out of a ditch and were run over by a carriage three or four times.",
    ["瞧瞧，墙上一个指甲盖大的印子，扣我三苏勒！窗钩生锈，又两苏勒！这破地板我搬进来就是旧的，现在跟我说磨损过度？！"] = "Look, a fingernail-sized mark on the wall, and you deduct three soli from me! The window hook is rusty, that's another two soli! This broken floor was already old when I moved in, and now you tell me it's excessively worn?!",
    ["瞧瞧，多漂亮的人偶！"] = "Look, what a beautiful doll!",
    ["瞧瞧，水灵灵的萝卜！"] = "Look, juicy radishes!",
    ["瞧瞧，这不是巴顿的鱼钩吗！"] = "Look, isn't this Barton's fishhook!",
    ["瞧瞧，这些吵闹的人，愚蠢地交出自己所剩不多的钱，还自以为能大捞一笔！"] = "Look at these noisy people, foolishly handing over what little money they have left, thinking they can make a big score!",
    ["瞧这货的工艺，真正的复古，真正的贵族审美！"] = "Look at the craftsmanship of this piece—true retro, true aristocratic aesthetic!",
    ["瞧那小脸，都吐成白的了。"] = "Look at that little face, it's turned white from all the vomiting.",
    ["瞧，东边最闪亮的三颗星星的上面，那就是蓝星。莱利叔叔告诉我的。"] = "Look, above the three brightest stars in the east, that's the Blue Star. Uncle Riley told me.",
    ["瞧，这里在玩斗邪恶，一起来一把？"] = "Look, they're playing Fight Evil here. Want to join in?",
    ["瞧，那边就有一处历史的回忆。拿出相机，让底片替他们记住这一刻。 "] = "Look, there is a memory of history over there. Take out your camera and let the film remember this moment for them.",
    ["瞬发效果，改完就一直生效了（下线重置、离开场景重置）"] = "Instant effect; it remains active once modified (resets upon logging out or leaving the scene).",
    ["瞬息之旅"] = "Instant Journey",
    ["瞬息之际，跨越空间，向面朝方向瞬移并对途经敌人造成伤害和滞涩。可以充能两次。"] = "In an instant, traverse space to teleport in the facing direction, dealing damage and stagnation to enemies along the path. Can be charged twice.",
    ["瞬援"] = "Instant Aid",
    ["瞬斩"] = "Instant Slash",
    ["瞬时隐藏模型（不恢复）"] = "Instant hide model (no restore)",
    ["瞬步"] = "Flash Step",
    ["瞬移"] = "Teleport",
    ["瞬移至目标身前，对周围的敌人附加律令，使其buffdisc(*id)*f秒"] = "Teleport in front of the target and apply Law Judgment to surrounding enemies, causing them to be buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds.",
    ["瞬移至目标身前，眩晕周围的敌人并且施展多段斩击，期间自身获得减伤。"] = "Teleport in front of the target, Stun nearby enemies, and perform multiple Slashes, gaining Damage Reduction during the process.",
    ["瞬身"] = "Flash Body",
    ["瞬间化身为猎犬，向前方冲刺20米，期间对路径上的敌方造成*d点伤害。"] = "Instantly transform into a hound and dash 20 meters forward, dealing *d damage to enemies in the path.",
    ["瞬间化身为猎犬，向前方发起长距离冲刺，期间对路径上的敌方造成伤害。"] = "Instantly transform into a Hound and dash a long distance forward, dealing damage to enemies in your path.",
    ["瞬间回血"] = "Instant Heal",
    ["瞬间回血2"] = "Instant Heal 2",
    ["瞬间，二人瘫倒在地上。"] = "In an instant, the two collapsed to the ground.",
    ["瞭望塔准许出发！"] = "The watchtower grants permission to depart!",
    ["瞭望塔！之前的计算错误，我要修正航路，重新起航！"] = "Watchtower! The previous calculation was wrong, I need to correct the course and set sail again!",
    ["瞭望塔，始终为你照亮航路！"] = "The Watchtower will always illuminate the path for you!",
