    ["瞳孔转动时，黑暗中的鸦瞳将替你铭记所有。"] = "When the pupils turn, the crow's eyes in the darkness will remember everything for you.",
    ["瞳孔锁边"] = "Pupil border",
    ["瞳色"] = "Eye Color",
