    ["瞳色琥珀，眉骨高，气质冷静"] = "Amber eyes, high brow bone, calm temperament",
    ["矗立于进军要冲的哨塔，是北伐的起点。 占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "An outpost standing at the strategic point of the march, the starting point of the northern expedition. After occupying it, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp, gaining a fixed 20 resources per minute.",
    ["矗立于进军要冲的哨塔，是南征的起点。占领后即可前往占领前方营地，可每分钟固定获得20点资源。"] = "An outpost standing at the strategic point of the march, the starting point of the southern expedition. After occupying it, you can proceed to occupy the forward camp, gaining a fixed 20 resources per minute.",
