    ["知萌"] = "Zhimeng",
    ["知识……世界……都是囚笼！"] = "Knowledge... the world... are all cages!",
    ["知识……哼，爷爷说知识很重要，但也说有些人会用知识做坏事。您最好别打什么主意。"] = "Knowledge... Hmph, Grandpa says knowledge is important, but he also says some people use it to do bad things. You'd better not be up to anything.",
    ["知识……指引我……"] = "Knowledge... guides me...",
    ["知识……无穷的知识！接受知识的恩赐，接受伟大的眷顾！"] = "Knowledge... endless knowledge! Accept the gift of knowledge, accept the great favor!",
    ["知识……是指文献库的那些资料？"] = "Knowledge... do you mean the materials in the archives?",
    ["知识不能抵达的地方，胜利也不能。"] = "Where knowledge cannot reach, neither can victory.",
    ["知识与智慧之神"] = "God of Knowledge and Wisdom",
    ["知识之乡"] = "Land of Knowledge",
    ["知识之乡·污染"] = "Land of Knowledge - Corruption",
    ["知识之书采集"] = "Knowledge Book Collection",
    ["知识之预言"] = "Prophecy of Knowledge",
    ["知识传出了低语……"] = "Whispers emanate from the knowledge...",
    ["知识光芒落到贝尔纳黛手中，她静静地看着那知识光芒，直到它暗淡，消散……良久，她垂下了眼睛。"] = "The light of knowledge falls into Bernadette's hands. She watches the light of knowledge quietly until it dims and dissipates... For a long time, she lowers her eyes.",
    ["知识冲击"] = "Knowledge Shock",
    ["知识凝聚……守护激活……巨龙……出击！"] = "Knowledge condensing... Guard activating... Giant Dragon... Attack!",
    ["知识化身"] = "Avatar of Knowledge",
    ["知识召唤你……绯红召唤你！"] = "Knowledge summons you... Crimson summons you!",
    ["知识启迪"] = "Knowledge Enlightenment",
    ["知识咒语"] = "Knowledge incantation",
    ["知识啊，赐予我守护的力量！"] = "Knowledge, grant me the power to guard!",
    ["知识在火焰中升华，窥探者终将被真理焚毁。"] = "Knowledge sublimates in the flames; the observer will eventually be consumed by the truth.",
    ["知识在褶皱间沉淀，岁月在衣摆上流连。\n这是属于旧时代的优雅，亦是属于守护者的沉默。"] = "Knowledge settles in the folds, time lingers on the hem. \n This is the elegance belonging to the old era, and also the silence belonging to the Guardian.",
    ["知识失控者"] = "Out-of-Control Knowledge",
    ["知识导师"] = "Knowledge Mentor",
    ["知识封印"] = "Knowledge Seal",
    ["知识封印初始状态"] = "Knowledge Seal Initial State",
    ["知识就是力量"] = "Knowledge is Power",
    ["知识就是力量，而配方是力量的钥匙。"] = "Knowledge is Power, and the formula is the key to power.",
    ["知识巨擘 "] = "Knowledge Giant",
    ["知识巨浪"] = "Giant Wave of Knowledge",
    ["知识已暴露她的秘密，她是痛苦的容器，是绝望的倒影，是加害者，也是受害者……"] = "Knowledge has exposed her secrets; she is a vessel of pain, a reflection of despair, both the perpetrator and the victim...",
    ["知识弹"] = "Knowledge Bullet",
    ["知识所"] = "Knowledge Institute",
    ["知识所扮演的"] = "What Knowledge Plays",
    ["知识所扮演的-店主"] = "Knowledge's Disguise - Shopkeeper",
    ["知识所扮演的前置"] = "Prerequisite for Knowledge acting",
    ["知识护盾"] = "Knowledge Shield",
    ["知识护符"] = "Amulet of Knowledge",
    ["知识抽取"] = "Knowledge Extraction",
    ["知识指引我至此"] = "Knowledge guided me here",
    ["知识教会的人追得很紧，我的时间不够了，你能帮帮我吗？"] = "The people from the Church of Knowledge are in hot pursuit, and I'm running out of time. Can you help me?",
    ["知识是力量"] = "Knowledge is power",
    ["知识是力量？你这样想，它就会变成诅咒。"] = "Knowledge is power? If you think that way, it will turn into a curse.",
    ["知识是诅咒"] = "Knowledge is a Curse",
    ["知识权杖"] = "Scepter of Knowledge",
    ["知识残影"] = "Knowledge Afterimage",
    ["知识污染者"] = "Knowledge Corruptor",
    ["知识沉淀"] = "Knowledge Sedimentation",
    ["知识洗礼"] = "Baptism of Knowledge",
    ["知识洪流"] = "Torrent of Knowledge",
    ["知识洪流1"] = "Torrent of Knowledge 1",
    ["知识洪流2"] = "Torrent of Knowledge 2",
    ["知识洪流3"] = "Torrent of Knowledge 3",
    ["知识洪流4"] = "Torrent of Knowledge 4",
    ["知识洪流5"] = "Torrent of Knowledge 5",
    ["知识洪流席卷斯蒂姆的每一个齿轮，于轰鸣中奏响了独特旋律——是登上月亮的渴望，是战斗胜利的乐章。"] = "The Torrent of Knowledge swept through every gear of Steam, playing a unique melody amidst the roar—it was the longing to land on the moon, the anthem of victory in battle.",
    ["知识洪流来袭"] = "A torrent of knowledge strikes",
    ["知识洪流触发器"] = "Torrent of Knowledge Trigger",
    ["知识浪潮"] = "Tide of Knowledge",
    ["知识漩涡"] = "Vortex of Knowledge",
    ["知识灌输"] = "Knowledge Imbuement",
    ["知识王冠"] = "Crown of Knowledge",
    ["知识的小憩"] = "Knowledge Break",
    ["知识的指引"] = "Guidance of knowledge",
    ["知识的洗礼"] = "Baptism of Knowledge",
    ["知识皇冠"] = "Crown of Knowledge",
    ["知识皇冠不见了，但污染并没有消失……"] = "The Crown of Knowledge is gone, but the corruption hasn't disappeared...",
    ["知识皇冠因污染而活化出逃……幕后的力量或许是堕落母神？"] = "The Crown of Knowledge activated and escaped due to corruption... Could the power behind the scenes be the Mother Goddess of Depravity?",
    ["知识皇冠的消失并未带走庄园的污染，反而让深处的某种存在更加蓬勃地发育。 来自圣堂的指引更是触目惊心：“最深处的污染来自红月……将在此处诞生新的子嗣…… ”\n守护廷根的值夜者小队，必将阻止这一切！"] = "The disappearance of the Knowledge Crown did not take away the manor's corruption; instead, it allowed some existence in the depths to grow more vigorously. The guidance from the Cathedral is even more shocking: \"The deepest corruption comes from the Red Moon... A new offspring will be born here...\" \nThe Nighthawks squad guarding Tingen will surely stop all of this!",
    ["知识皇冠的消失并未带走庄园的污染，反而让深处的某种存在更加蓬勃地发育。 来自圣堂的指引更是触目惊心：“最深处的污染来自红月……将在此处诞生新的子嗣…… ”\n守护廷根的值夜者小队，必将阻止这一切！\n\n<Notice>组队模式下和</><Highlight>家族</><Notice>成员一起进入副本，若未达到推荐非凡评分，可获得属性增益补正。补正效果与团队同家族成员数目和家族等级相关。</>"] = "The disappearance of the Crown of Knowledge did not take away the manor's corruption; instead, it allowed something deep within to grow even more vigorously. The guidance from the Cathedral is even more shocking: \"The deepest corruption comes from the Red Moon... a new offspring will be born here...\" \n The Nighthawks guarding Tingen will surely stop all of this! \n\n<Notice> Enter the dungeon in team mode with </><Highlight> Family </><Notice> members. If the recommended Beyonder rating is not met, you can receive attribute bonus adjustments. The adjustment effect is related to the number of family members in the team and the family level. </>",
    ["知识皇冠的能力"] = "Abilities of the Crown of Knowledge",
    ["知识皇冠的能力可以将具体事物瓦解为知识洪流\r\n而它的失踪地点很可能就在廷根"] = "The ability of the Crown of Knowledge can disintegrate concrete objects into a Torrent of Knowledge,\nand its place of disappearance is very likely in Tingen",
    ["知识皇冠的能力可以将具体事物瓦解为知识洪流，而它的失踪地点很可能就在廷根。"] = "The ability of the Crown of Knowledge can dissolve specific things into a Torrent of Knowledge, and the location where it went missing is likely in Tingen.",
    ["知识皇帝"] = "Knowledge Emperor",
