    ["短信验证功能"] = "SMS Verification Function",
    ["短信验证功能未开启"] = "SMS verification feature is not enabled.",
    ["短按TAB切换锁定目标，长按TAB键取消锁定目标。"] = "Short press TAB to switch locked targets, long press TAB to cancel target lock.",
    ["短时间内你就遇到了多次危险，但我们不可能时刻保护你，你需要有自保的能力。"] = "You have encountered danger multiple times in a short period, but we cannot protect you at all times. You need the ability to protect yourself.",
    ["短时间内分析并保护全体队友的心智，对其进行大量额外治疗，并提供伤害减免。"] = "Analyze and protect the minds of all teammates for a short time, providing massive additional healing and Damage Reduction.",
    ["短时间内无法再次触发烈阳之魂"] = "Cannot trigger Soul of the Blazing Sun again for a short time.",
    ["短时间获得伤害减免。"] = "Gain Damage Reduction for a short time.",
    ["短时间获得伤害加深和伤害减免。"] = "Gain Damage Increased and Damage Reduction for a short time.",
    ["短暂到极致，便是永恒。"] = "To be brief to the extreme is to be eternal.",
    ["短暂的停顿。像是在思考，至于想到了什么，只有沉默知道。"] = "A brief pause. As if thinking; as for what was thought of, only silence knows.",
    ["短暂盛放的花朵，象征爆发性生命力。"] = "Flowers that bloom briefly, symbolizing explosive Health.",
    ["短暂禁用二段"] = "Briefly disable second stage",
    ["短暂赐予她幸福，又永恒地剥夺"] = "Briefly granting her happiness, only to take it away forever.",
    ["短暂进入现实和冥界的交接处，在无休止的尖啸刺激下，强化所有战斗技能和终结技，提升{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}攻击速度，每秒返还{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32}秒的冷却时间，持续20秒。\n强化效果期间如果造成任意击杀或助攻，则延长状态时间5秒，延长效果最多触发2次。"] = "Briefly enter the intersection of reality and the underworld. Under the stimulation of endless screeching, strengthen all combat skills and finishers, increase attack speed by {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}, and refund {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32} seconds of cooldown every second for 20 seconds. \n If any kill or assist is made during the strengthening effect, the state duration is extended by 5 seconds, up to 2 times.",
    ["短暂进入现实和冥界的交接处，在无休止的尖啸刺激下，强化所有战斗技能，提升{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}攻击速度，每秒返还{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32}秒的冷却时间，持续20秒。\n强化效果期间如果造成任意击杀或助攻，则延长状态时间5秒，延长效果最多触发2次。"] = "Briefly enter the intersection between reality and the Underworld. Stimulated by endless shrieking, strengthen all combat skills, increase attack speed by {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}, and refund {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32} seconds of cooldown per second, lasting for 20 seconds.\nIf any kill or assist is achieved during the enhancement effect, the status duration is extended by 5 seconds, up to 2 times.",
    ["短期工也行！零工也行！求求您……我没脸回家了。"] = "Short-term work is fine! Odd jobs are fine too! Please... I have no face to go home.",
