    ["石材框出一方光线，马赛克所制成的彩窗在阳光下让人目眩。"] = "Stone frames a square of light; the mosaic stained-glass window is dazzling under the sunlight.",
    ["石材被雕琢成柔和的线条，沉默的雕像有着什么心声？"] = "The stone has been carved into soft lines. What inner voice does this silent statue have?",
