    ["石柱铁门互相支撑，厚重且沉默，装饰性的花纹为它们增加些许典雅。"] = "Stone pillars and iron gates support each other, heavy and silent, with decorative patterns adding a touch of elegance to them.",
    ["石桥上的"] = "On the Stone Bridge",
    ["石棺"] = "Stone Coffin",
    ["石棺中露出了一颗扭曲的球状物，由光秃秃的\n褐色藤蔓盘绕而成，像内核已经腐败的怪异种\n子。"] = "A twisted spherical object is exposed in the stone coffin, coiled by bare brown vines, like a strange seed with a rotten core.\n\n",
    ["石棺中露出了一颗扭曲的球状物，由光秃秃的褐色藤蔓盘绕而成，像内核已经腐败的怪异种子。"] = "A twisted spherical object is revealed in the stone coffin, formed by coiled, bare brown vines, like a strange seed with a rotted core.",
