    ["石河子"] = "Shihezi",
    ["石砌的主楼依原野而建，宽阔的庭院向远处草坡自然延伸，干净从容的态度，亦是主人的生活写照。"] = "The stone main building is built along the wilderness, and the wide courtyard extends naturally to the grassy slopes in the distance. Its clean and composed attitude is a reflection of the owner's life.",
    ["石碑守护"] = "Stele Guard",
    ["石缝里的苔藓……比锅炉房的煤灰温柔多了……"] = "The moss in the stone crevices... is much gentler than the coal ash in the boiler room...",
    ["石膏塑像"] = "Plaster Statue",
