    ["码头的工人——你们在给谁卖命？集市的摊贩——你们在给谁交钱？那些豪宅里的人，什么时候正眼看过你们？"] = "Dock workers—who are you slaving away for? Market vendors—who are you paying your money to? Those people in the mansions, when have they ever looked at you with respect?",
