    ["码头给猫钓鱼中，\n钓上了就回来。"] = "Fishing for cats at the docks,\nwill return once I've caught some.",
    ["码头美食家"] = "Dock gourmet",
    ["码头这块可是个肥差啊……每天来来往往那么多人。"] = "The docks are a lucrative spot... so many people coming and going every day.",
