    ["砍价的核心是信息和谈判，你得大概知道商品的成本价，知道商家的利润空间，知道他的竞争对手是谁，再掌握一些谈判技巧……"] = "The core of bargaining is information and negotiation. You have to roughly know the cost price of the product, know the merchant's profit margin, know who his competitors are, and then master some negotiation techniques...",
