    ["研习"] = "Study",
    ["研习加速"] = "Study Acceleration",
    ["研习期间，攻击空间牢笼内的目标将施加协同攻击，且在研习期间再次释放空间牢笼将扩大领域范围，增加协同攻击次数（至多2次）。"] = "During Study, attacking targets within Space Cage will apply a synergistic attack, and releasing Space Cage again during Study will expand the domain range and increase the number of synergistic attacks (up to 2 times).",
    ["研习期间，攻击空间牢笼内的目标将施加协同斩击，且在研习期间再次释放空间牢笼，协同斩击的次数将增加（至多增加3次）"] = "During Study, attacking targets within the Space Cage will apply a Coordinated Slash, and casting Space Cage again during Study will increase the number of Coordinated Slashes (up to 3 additional times).",
    ["研习期间，每次足迹再现（根据层数）可减少空间牢笼1秒冷却时间"] = "During Study, each Footprint Reappearance (based on stacks) can reduce the cooldown of Space Cage by 1 second.",
    ["研习期间，每次足迹再现（根据层数）可减少空间牢笼1秒冷却时间。"] = "During Study, each Footprint Reappearance (based on stacks) can reduce Space Cage Cooldown by 1 second.",
    ["研学掌握"] = "Academic Mastery",
    ["研磨后可散发迷惑心智的粉尘，用于制作屏障或精神陷阱。"] = "Dust that can emit mind-confusing properties after grinding, used to create Barriers or mental traps.",
