    ["破旧的兔子巴尼是安西娅最最重要的家人，它的纽扣眼睛总好像活物一般凝视着什么。"] = "The worn-out rabbit Barney is Anthea's most important family member, its button eyes always seem to be staring at something as if they were alive.",
