    ["破旧的小羊玩偶，缝合处的<P_Yellow>纱线</>似乎一道未开\n启的封印，静待<P_Yellow>利刃</>来剖开真相 。"] = "A worn-out lamb doll. The <P_Yellow>yarn</> at the seams seems like an un\nopened seal, waiting for a <P_Yellow>sharp blade</> to cut open the truth.",
    ["破旧的小羊玩偶，缝合处的<P_Yellow>纱线</>似乎一道未开\n启的封印，静待<P_Yellow>利刃</>来剖开真相 。\n\n小羊的腹部被切开，露出了一点金属的光泽。"] = "A worn-out lamb doll. The <P_Yellow>yarn</> at the seams seems like an un\nopened seal, waiting for a <P_Yellow>sharp blade</> to cut open the truth. \n\nThe lamb's belly has been sliced open, revealing a glint of metal.",
