    ["破防提高<Mark>40</>。释放技能和普攻会引来2-049的注视，注视叠加三层后造成额外伤害，每<Mark>4</>秒最多触发一次。"] = "Armor Break increased by <Mark>40</>. Using skills and Basic Attacks draws the Gaze of 2-049. After stacking three layers of the gaze, it deals additional damage, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>4</> seconds.",
