    ["确定"] = "Confirm",
    ["确定。生命有限，知识无限。用有限换无限，值得。"] = "I am sure. Life is limited, knowledge is infinite. Trading the limited for the infinite is worth it.",
    ["确定修改"] = "Confirm Changes",
    ["确定后，替代人格将为你顶替一次死亡，可自行选择复活方式。是否使用这项愚者赐予的恩赐，脱离困境？"] = "Upon confirmation, your substitute personality will take your place in death, and you may choose your method of Resurrection. Will you use this gift bestowed by The Fool to escape your predicament?",
    ["确定声音传来的方向<h></>"] = "Determine the direction the sound came from <h></>",
    ["确定房屋的位置"] = "Determine the location of the house",
