    ["确定移除%s？"] = "Are you sure you want to remove %s?",
    ["确定要进行游戏修复吗？（确定修复后，游戏将会退出，再次打开时将会执行修复流程。所需时间较长，请耐心等待。）"] = "Are you sure you want to perform a game repair? (After confirming the repair, the game will exit, and the repair process will be executed when opened again. This takes a long time, please wait patiently.)",
    ["确定解契"] = "Confirm contract dissolution",
    ["确定连接"] = "Confirm connection",
    ["确定退出"] = "Confirm Exit",
    ["确定预存"] = "Confirm Pre-storage",
    ["确实"] = "Indeed",
    ["确实。"] = "Indeed.",
    ["确实如此。"] = "That is indeed the case.",
    ["确实如此。上周卡洛琳夫人的茶会，名义上是品鉴新到的锡兰红茶，实际上是为她侄女物色对象。"] = "Indeed. At Lady Caroline's tea party last week, it was nominally for tasting the newly arrived Ceylon black tea, but in reality, it was to scout for a partner for her niece.",
    ["确实如此，只有最顶尖的那部分人决定历史的走向，他们又是为了各自的目的，普通人只是被迫随波逐流罢了。"] = "Indeed. Only the top-tier people decide the direction of history, and they do so for their own purposes; ordinary people are just forced to go with the flow.",
    ["确实很可惜。"] = "It is indeed a pity.",
    ["确实很累，作为战斗力不强的途径，本来很少有学员邀请我一起出任务的……"] = "I am indeed very tired. As a Pathway that isn't strong in combat, few students invite me to go on quests with them...",
    ["确实很适合，特别是一个人的时候。"] = "It's indeed very suitable, especially when you're alone.",
    ["确实有一定可能……也许这就是他们，不，她们序列魔药的特点，在某个序列会从男性变为女性。"] = "There is indeed a certain possibility... Perhaps this is a characteristic of their, no, their Sequence Beyonder potions, where at a certain Sequence, one changes from male to female.",
    ["确实有些想念……这样跟你一起战斗的感觉。"] = "I really did miss this... the feeling of fighting alongside you.",
    ["确实有种成熟、值得信赖的感觉了。"] = "It really does have a mature, trustworthy feel.",
    ["确实比穷人区好一些。"] = "It is indeed better than the poor district.",
    ["确实没人——等等，这是？！"] = "There really is no one—wait, this is?!",
    ["确实没有什么秘方"] = "There really is no secret recipe",
    ["确实美得令人窒息，它的……"] = "It is indeed breathtakingly beautiful, its...",
    ["确实需要你的帮助。"] = "I do need your help.",
    ["确实！"] = "Indeed!",
    ["确实，他经常和卷毛狒狒一样，只在乎摆在眼前的几根香蕉。"] = "Indeed, he is often like a Curly-Haired Baboon, only caring about the few bananas placed right in front of him.",
    ["确实，又垒高了不少，墓碑可能被其他的填土埋掉了。"] = "Indeed, it has piled up quite a bit more; the tombstone might have been buried by other fill dirt.",
    ["确实，我之前在公告板上看过你的讲座海报，但因为报名人数太少被取消了。"] = "Indeed, I saw your lecture poster on the bulletin board before, but it was canceled because there were too few sign-ups.",
    ["确实，我们的营生有些小众，但我们都是体面人。"] = "Indeed, our line of work is a bit niche, but we are all decent people.",
    ["确实，这么花哨的衣服，可不适合穿去公司工作，毕竟雇主们往往更喜欢稳重一些的员工。"] = "Indeed, such flashy clothes aren't suitable for work at the company. After all, employers often prefer more steady employees.",
    ["确立了内心的正义准则，与自身、神灵、世界达成神圣契约，以秩序之名引导光明，审判世间邪恶，建立符合太阳途径的正义秩序。"] = "Establishes an inner standard of justice, reaches a sacred contract with oneself, the gods, and the world, guides light in the name of order, judges evil in the world, and establishes a just order consistent with the Sun Pathway.",
