    ["祂……那个“隐匿贤者”，在我头痛的时候，说……因蒂斯的最西边是迷雾海。"] = "He... that \"Hidden Sage,\" when I had a headache, said... the far west of Intis is the Fog Sea.",
    ["祂、祂是……隐匿贤者！"] = "He, He is... the Hidden Sage!",
    ["祂两臂张开，双脚在上，头部如同吊坠般垂下。\n邓恩：不可直视神！"] = "His arms were spread wide, feet above, and his head hung down like a pendant. \n Dunn: Do not look directly at God!",
    ["祂也曾这样温和地指引我们，带领我们在混沌中前行了很远。"] = "He also once guided us so gently, leading us forward through the chaos for a long way.",
    ["祂代表远古太阳神的暗面，被恶意、怨恨和堕落充满。"] = "He represents the dark side of the Ancient Sun God, filled with malice, resentment, and corruption.",
    ["祂想让我知道不要一直回头看，前面的路更美好。"] = "She wants me to know not to keep looking back, as the path ahead is even more beautiful.",
    ["祂所宣称的未来，必将上演，成为现实。"] = "The future He proclaims shall surely unfold and become reality.",
    ["祂所幻想的国度，必将降临于物质世界。"] = "The kingdom He imagines shall descend upon the material world.",
    ["祂是主的号角，以救赎为名，为白银城带来了新的食物，带来了外界的消息，带领白银城众人一起走向了迈出“深暗时代”的路。"] = "He is the horn of the Lord, in the name of redemption, bringing new food to the City of Silver, bringing news from the outside world, and leading the people of the City of Silver to walk the path out of the 'Dark Era.'",
    ["祂是比星空更崇高，比永恒更久远的黑夜女神。"] = "She is the Evernight Goddess, who is more noble than the starry sky and more eternal than eternity.",
    ["祂是统治天空的王者，主宰大海的皇帝，伟大的风暴之神！"] = "He is the King who rules the sky, the Emperor who dominates the sea, the great God of Storms!",
    ["祂派来使者 为我们照亮前路"] = "He sent messengers to light the way for us.",
    ["祂的灌输结束了，我们离开这里。"] = "His indoctrination has ended, let's leave this place.",
    ["祂笑了。与此同时，医生的嘴角也缓缓扬起。女主人露出了同样的笑容。仆人的呜咽戛然而止。"] = "He smiled. At the same time, the doctor's mouth also slowly curled upward. The hostess revealed the same smile. The servant's whimpering stopped abruptly.",
    ["祂试图用无限的死亡摧残和污染你的意志，迫使你承认是祂的子嗣。"] = "She is trying to use infinite death to ravage and corrupt your will, forcing you to admit that you are Her offspring.",
    ["祂说黑暗将至，于是黑夜以静默将万物收拢于唇齿之间。\n祂说至此安眠，于是夜幕以安宁将众生裹入未醒的国度。\n夜色将一切锋芒收敛，只因你的到来而闪烁，如苏醒于天穹的繁星。"] = "He said that darkness would descend, and so the night gathered all things within its lips in silence.\nHe said that here there shall be Slumber, and so the night veil wrapped all living beings into a kingdom that would not wake.\nThe night color draws in all sharpness, only to Blink at your arrival, like stars awakening in the firmament.",
    ["祂说，宣称我名。"] = "She said, proclaim my name.",
    ["祂说，散布恩典。"] = "She said, spread grace.",
    ["祂？祂是谁？"] = "Him? Who is He?",
