    ["祈求您的眷顾；"] = "I pray for your favor;",
    ["祈求您能让我有收入能带着女儿去看病。"] = "I pray that you allow me to have the income to take my daughter to see a doctor.",
    ["祈求您让我找到新的需要浆洗的家庭。"] = "I pray that you help me find a new family that needs laundry done.",
    ["祈求愚者的祝福，抵御隐匿贤者的灌输"] = "Pray for the Fool's blessing to resist the Hidden Sage's indoctrination",
    ["祈求这面镜子获得短暂的还原，祈求它呈现出过去一个月映照过的所有人。"] = "I pray for this mirror to be briefly restored, and I pray for it to reveal everyone it has reflected over the past month.",
    ["祈求？“愚者”先生会帮助我打造它吗？"] = "Pray? Will Mr. Fool help me craft it?",
