    ["祝佑高塔"] = "Blessed Tower",
    ["祝你今天的前途也无比灿烂！就当是一个陌生人的小小祝愿。"] = "I wish you a brilliant future today! Just a small wish from a stranger.",
    ["祝你们好运，相信你们能摧毁魔镜，拯救大家。"] = "Good luck. I believe you can destroy the Mirror of Despair and save everyone.",
    ["祝你们母女幸福"] = "I wish you and your daughter happiness",
