    ["祝你有美好的一天，再见，小克莱恩。"] = "Have a wonderful day, goodbye, little Klein.",
    ["祝你的战斗一切顺利。"] = "I wish your battle goes smoothly.",
    ["祝君无忧。与好友赠礼功能绑定，本版本不进行投放和使用。"] = "Wishing You Carefree Days. Bound to the friend gifting function; not released or usable in this version.",
    ["祝您在这里收获一段愉悦的时光。"] = "I wish you a pleasant time here.",
    ["祝您好运。"] = "Good luck to you.",
    ["祝您好运，警官。"] = "Good luck, officer.",
    ["祝您度过一个美妙的夜晚。"] = "I wish you a wonderful evening.",
    ["祝您找到愿意为5便士卖命的傻瓜。"] = "I hope you find a fool willing to die for 5 pennies.",
    ["祝您拥有愉快的一天！"] = "Have a pleasant day!",
    ["祝您放松身心，自由自在……"] = "I wish you relaxation and freedom...",
    ["祝您生活愉快"] = "Have a nice life",
