    ["祝您顺利，警察先生。"] = "I wish you the best, Officer.",
    ["祝福"] = "Blessing",
    ["祝福你 珍妮……你不必再遭受这世间的苦难了"] = "Bless you, Jenny... you don't have to suffer the hardships of this world anymore",
