    ["神圣盔甲回血标记"] = "Holy Armor Heal Mark.",
    ["神圣盔甲持续期间，自身生命上限提升50%，每当受到伤害后，对周身范围敌方发动反击，此效果每0.2秒最多触发一次。"] = "While Holy Armor is active, your Maximum Health is increased by 50%. Whenever you take damage, you launch a counterattack against surrounding enemies; this effect can trigger at most once every 0.2 seconds.",
    ["神圣盔甲持续期间，自身获得40%伤害加深，且在施法后进入持续6秒的烈阳状态，可与其它效果施加的烈阳状态互相叠加时长。"] = "While Holy Armor is active, you gain 40% Damage Increase and enter the Blazing Sun state for 6 seconds after casting, which can stack duration with Blazing Sun states applied by other effects.",
    ["神圣盔甲期间，自身生命上限提升50%，每当受到伤害后，对周身范围敌方发动反击，此效果每0.2秒最多触发一次。"] = "During Holy Armor, maximum Health is increased by 50%. Whenever you take damage, launch a counterattack against enemies in your surrounding range. This effect can trigger at most once every 0.2 seconds.",
    ["神圣盔甲期间，自身获得40%伤害加深，且在施法后进入持续6秒的烈阳状态，可与其它效果施加的烈阳状态互相叠加时长。"] = "During Holy Armor, gain 40% damage boost, and enter a Blazing Sun state for 6 seconds after casting, which can stack duration with Blazing Sun states applied by other effects.",
