    ["科林"] = "Colin",
    ["科林·伊利亚特记得很清楚，自己第一次知道这个秘密时的感受。\n那是他刚成为白银城首席的那天，前任首席带他来到最深的密室，指着那具掩埋在地底的巨大尸骸说：\n“这就是大地的恩赐。它让黑面草生长，也让我们背负诅咒。”\n科林当时无法理解。直到第一个亲人死去，他才明白那句话的含义。\n父亲倒在他面前，身体开始异变，眼中的神智正在消失。科林握紧剑柄，一剑刺穿了父亲的心脏。\n然后是母亲，是哥哥，是妹妹。\n然后是长子，幼子，女儿，长孙。\n每一次挥剑，他都在心中重复那句话：“‘丰饶’，是有代价的。”\n黑面草在白银城周围生长，一年又一年，养活着这座被神遗弃的城市。而每一株草，每一粒粮食，都沾染着血亲的鲜血。\n当戴里克听到这个秘密时，科林看见那双年轻的眼睛里充满了绝望。\n“我努力探索和战斗，”科林疲惫地说，“就是希望之后的人不用再承受这种痛苦。”\n地底深处，那具巨大的尸骸依然沉睡，继续赐予大地丰饶，也继续赐予白银城最残酷的诅咒。\n这就是生存的代价。"] = "Colin Iliad remembered very clearly how he felt when he first learned this secret. \n That was the day he had just become the Chief of the City of Silver. The former Chief brought him to the deepest secret chamber and pointed to the huge corpse buried underground, saying: \n \"This is the gift of the earth. It makes the black-faced grass grow, and it also makes us bear the curse.\" \n Colin couldn't understand it at the time. It wasn't until his first relative died that he understood the meaning of those words. \n His father fell before him, his body began to mutate, and the sanity in his eyes was disappearing. Colin gripped his sword hilt and pierced his father's heart with one strike. \n Then it was his mother, his brother, and his sister. \n Then it was his eldest son, his youngest son, his daughter, and his eldest grandson. \n Every time he swung his sword, he repeated that sentence in his heart: \"'Abundance' has a price.\" \n The black-faced grass grew around the City of Silver, year after year, feeding this city abandoned by the gods. And every blade of grass, every grain of food, was stained with the blood of kin. \n When Derrick heard this secret, Colin saw that those young eyes were filled with despair. \n \"I strive to explore and fight,\" Colin said wearily, \"just in the hope that those who come after won't have to endure this pain again.\" \n Deep underground, that huge corpse remained asleep, continuing to grant abundance to the earth, and continuing to grant the City of Silver its most cruel curse. \n This is the price of survival.",
    ["科林·伊利亚特首席……他战死在巨人王庭了。但白银城的所有人都记得他，也记得您。"] = "Chief Colin Iliad... he died in battle at the Giant King's Court. But everyone in the City of Silver remembers him, and they remember you too.",
    ["科林·投影"] = "Colin Projection",
    ["科林先生？这里就是他牺牲的地方?那位女士是……"] = "Mr. Colin? Is this where he sacrificed himself? Who is that lady...",
    ["科林导师似乎是所有导师中最特殊的一位。"] = "Instructor Colin seems to be the most special one among all the instructors.",
    ["科林斯"] = "Collins",
    ["科林的灵"] = "Colin's spirit",
    ["科林的灵保护玩家，提供短时间的高额减伤护盾"] = "Colin's spirit protects the player, providing a short-term high-value damage reduction shield.",
    ["科林说话"] = "Colin Speaking",
