    ["科迪莉亚垂着眼翻书的样子也太温柔了吧…… 她刚才是不是往这边看了？糟了糟了，不能让她看见！"] = "The way Cordelia looks down while flipping through the book is just too gentle... Did she look over here just now? Oh no, oh no, can't let her see!",
    ["科迪莉亚垂着眼翻书的样子也太温柔了吧…… 她刚才是不是往这边看了？糟了糟了，不能让她看见！ "] = "The way Cordelia looks down while flipping through the book is just too gentle... Did she just look this way? Oh no, oh no, I can't let her see me!",
