    ["穿长裙的少女惊慌逃窜，残忍的开膛手正如阴影般死死跟踪…… "] = "The girl in the long dress fled in panic, the cruel Ripper tracking her like a shadow...",
    ["穿黑风衣的老爷们？"] = "Gentlemen in black trench coats?",
    ["突入近身后用血玫绽放造成范围伤害。"] = "Dash into melee range and use Blood Rose Bloom to deal area damage.",
