    ["突发事件"] = "Emergency Event",
    ["突发刺杀"] = "Sudden Assassination",
    ["突发刺杀！"] = "Sudden assassination!",
    ["突发心脏病，没发现其他异常。"] = "Sudden heart attack, no other abnormalities were found.",
    ["突发心脏病，没发现其它异常。"] = "Sudden heart attack, no other abnormalities found.",
    ["突然出现的另一个男孩"] = "Another boy who suddenly appeared",
    ["突然出现许多文字"] = "Many words suddenly appear",
    ["突然失去工作 很多人会吃不上饭 租不起床位"] = "Suddenly losing their jobs, many people won't be able to afford food or a bed.",
    ["突然收到这么多礼物……感谢大家的馈赠。"] = "Suddenly receiving so many gifts... thank you all for your generosity.",
    ["突然有种被工作掏空灵魂的感觉……"] = "Suddenly, I feel like my soul has been hollowed out by work...",
    ["突然灵光一闪想到好点子，恨不得立刻行动起来！"] = "Suddenly had a flash of inspiration for a good idea, can't wait to act on it immediately!",
    ["突然，塔罗牌飞旋出现，切断你和伊妮德身上的藤蔓。\n烛火熄灭，皮特怒：什么人？\n一团灰雾包裹着莹莹亮光，从空中落下。\n灰雾逐渐消散，雾后的男子脱下礼帽，微微躬身。"] = "Suddenly, Tarot cards flew out, cutting the vines on you and Enid. \n The candle flame went out, and Pete said angrily: Who is it? \n A mass of gray fog wrapped in shimmering light fell from the aerial. \n The gray fog gradually dissipated, and the man behind the mist took off his top hat and bowed slightly.",
    ["突然，塔罗牌飞旋出现，解救了你和伊妮德，也熄灭了仪式的烛火。它的主人是——\n“一个路过的，值夜者”。"] = "Suddenly, Tarot cards flew out, rescuing you and Enid and extinguishing the ritual candles. Their owner was—\n \"A passing Nighthawk\".",
    ["突然，梦境剧烈震动起来……"] = "Suddenly, the dream began to shake violently...",
    ["突然，浓雾四起，飞速将街道和视野遮掩。克莱恩在雾里有点慌张，开始四处观察：“这，也是非凡能力吗？”"] = "Suddenly, thick fog rises, rapidly obscuring the street and his vision. Klein is a bit panicked in the fog and begins to observe his surroundings: \"Is this also a Beyonder ability?\"",
