    ["突袭生命最低的敌人，三击合计造成<HighLight>400%</>攻击伤害；留下黑焰，三次合计造成<HighLight>200%</>攻击伤害。"] = "Raids the enemy with the lowest health, dealing a total of <HighLight>400%</> attack damage over three hits; leaves behind Black Flame, dealing a total of <HighLight>200%</> attack damage over three hits.",
