    ["简单"] = "Simple",
    ["简单AI测试Boss"] = "Simple AI Test Boss",
    ["简单AI测试小怪2"] = "Simple AI Test Minion 2",
    ["简单些就好，黑外套、白衬衣那种，再搭顶丝绸礼帽。"] = "Simple is fine, like a black coat and white shirt, paired with a silk top hat.",
    ["简单介绍一下家里的情况就行，最好写简单点。"] = "Just give a simple introduction to your family situation; it's best to keep it brief.",
    ["简单定型，利落干净，效率至上。"] = "Simple styling, neat and clean, efficiency first.",
    ["简单来说，封印物就是有不同非凡能力并附带负面效果的物品。"] = "Simply put, a Sealed Artifact is an item that possesses various Extraordinary abilities but also comes with negative effects.",
    ["简单来说，就是能够通过一些神秘学知识创造魔法，而这些神秘学知识知道的人越少，效果越好。"] = "Simply put, it is the ability to create magic through some occult knowledge, and the fewer people who know this occult knowledge, the better the effect.",
    ["简单来说，这个世界存在许多超越现实的能力，就是非凡力量。"] = "Simply put, there are many abilities in this world that transcend reality; those are Beyonder powers.",
    ["简单的指引"] = "Simple guidance",
    ["简单的梦"] = "A simple dream",
    ["简单的花艺陈设，常见于讲究却不过分张扬的居所。"] = "A simple floral arrangement, common in homes that are tasteful but not overly ostentatious.",
    ["简单的，先生，我们这有特制的笼子，您只要把笼子放到桥下啊，码头啊，这些老鼠多的地方，放一小会再回去看看，老鼠自己就会钻到笼子来了！"] = "It's simple, sir. We have special cages. You just need to place the cage under a bridge, at a wharf, or any place with many rats. Leave it for a short while and go back to check; the rats will crawl into the cage themselves!",
    ["简单直接？"] = "Simple and direct?",
    ["简单相机"] = "Simple camera",
    ["简单相机画像"] = "Simple Camera Portrait",
    ["简单相机看打斗"] = "Simple camera view for combat",
    ["简单试探下<h>莉莉</>"] = "Test <h> Lily </> briefly",
    ["简单试探下莉莉"] = "Test Lily briefly",
    ["简单镜头"] = "Simple camera",
    ["简单镜头+画外音"] = "Simple camera + voiceover",
    ["简单镜头-弗莱"] = "Simple Camera-Frye",
    ["简单镜头-洛琳"] = "Simple Shot - Lorin",
    ["简单镜头移动开始"] = "Start simple camera movement",
    ["简单镜头移动结束"] = "End simple camera movement",
    ["简妮"] = "Jeanne",
    ["简易"] = "Simple",
    ["简易创角流程"] = "Simple Character Creation Flow",
    ["简易属性"] = "Simple Attributes",
    ["简易的火把"] = "Simple Torch",
    ["简易相机模式"] = "Simple Camera Mode",
    ["简直不把我们当人看！问？问也是白费功夫！"] = "They don't treat us like human beings at all! Ask? Asking is just a waste of effort!",
    ["简直像凭空消失了一样……"] = "It's as if they disappeared into thin air...",
    ["简直哪里都比廷根好！那毕竟是鲁恩的首都，繁华富饶的希望之地啊！您说，我怎么才能留住我的小甜心？"] = "It's simply better than Tingen in every way! After all, it's the capital of Loen, a prosperous and wealthy land of hope! Tell me, how can I keep my little sweetheart?",
    ["简直是个无赖！"] = "He's simply a scoundrel!",
    ["简直是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉，实话告诉你吧，我在来之前已经说服了家族长辈，决定正式取消这桩婚事。"] = "It's simply a toad wanting to eat swan meat. To tell you the truth, before I came, I had already persuaded the elders of the family and decided to formally cancel this engagement.",
    ["简直难以相信，这是一个人真实的一生吗？"] = "It's hard to believe, is this really the life of a person?",
    ["简直？"] = "Simply?",
    ["简约"] = "Minimalist",
    ["简约的"] = "Simple",
    ["简约的黑边眼镜，让佩戴者显得更加博学。"] = "Simple black-rimmed glasses that make the wearer look more scholarly.",
    ["算。但有钱就能摆平。<P_Heart>（叹气）</>剧院要的是叫座的名字，谁在乎剧本是谁写的？"] = "It is. But money can smooth anything over. <P_Heart>(Sighs)</> The theater wants a name that sells tickets; who cares who actually wrote the script?",
    ["算了"] = "Forget it",
    ["算了吧"] = "Forget it",
    ["算了吧。"] = "Forget it.",
    ["算了算了，灵感这种东西强求不得。"] = "Forget it, forget it, Inspiration is not something you can force.",
    ["算了！等我说服她陪我办戏剧俱乐部，你可以来进修一下！"] = "Forget it! When I persuade her to accompany me to run a drama club, you can come and take some advanced courses!",
    ["算了，先买票吧，至于活着，我再想想办法。"] = "Forget it, I'll buy the ticket first. As for staying alive, I'll think of another way.",
    ["算了，先休息会儿，反正我送得快。"] = "Forget it, I'll rest for a while, I deliver fast anyway.",
    ["算了，先回去向弗莱队长汇报吧。"] = "Forget it, let's go back and report to Captain Frye first.",
    ["算了，先看鸡蛋吧，怎么都长得差不多……"] = "Forget it, let me look at the eggs first. Why do they all look the same...",
    ["算了，再等最后十分钟。"] = "Forget it, I'll wait another ten minutes.",
    ["算了，就骑上它逛逛廷根吧，总比步行方便多了。"] = "Forget it, I'll just ride it around Tingen; it's much more convenient than walking.",
    ["算了，尼尔，算了，迟到两次也太过分了，莎莉丝特小姐已经足够礼貌了，你要反省。"] = "Forget it, Neil, forget it. Being late twice is too much. Miss Celeste has been polite enough; you need to reflect on yourself.",
    ["算了，待会还是问问贝茜吧……"] = "Forget it, I'll ask Bessie later...",
    ["算了，我还是去排队吧"] = "Forget it, I'll go queue up instead",
    ["算了，我还是去排队吧。"] = "Forget it, I'll go queue up.",
    ["算了，有干劲是好事，一起撸起袖子加油干！"] = "Never mind, having drive is a good thing. Let's roll up our sleeves and work hard together!",
    ["算了，用灵性追溯一下吧。"] = "Forget it, I'll use spirituality to trace it.",
    ["算了，看您是个实在人。60镑，您就当可怜可怜我，可怜一个贫穷的老头子……"] = "Forget it, you seem like an honest person. 60 pounds, just take it as pitying me, pitying a poor old man...",
    ["算了，祝你发财"] = "Forget it, I wish you wealth",
    ["算了，请你离开。山里危险，不要乱逛。"] = "Never mind, please leave. The mountains are dangerous, don't wander around.",
    ["算了，还是一会儿问问贝茜吧……她今天有点沉默，谁惹她生气了？"] = "Forget it, I'll ask Bessie in a while... She's a bit Silence today, who made her angry?",
    ["算了，还是走吧"] = "Forget it, let's go",
    ["算了，那男的看着就不好惹。"] = "Forget it. That man looks like trouble.",
    ["算你小子识相！"] = "Good for you, kid, you're sensible!",
    ["算你走运，居然能把我找出来......"] = "You're lucky to have been able to find me...",
    ["算你走运，居然能把我找出来……"] = "Consider yourself lucky, to actually be able to find me...",
    ["算啦，我一会就回去找他，再帮他找找其他人。"] = "Forget it, I'll go back to find him in a while and help him look for others.",
    ["算啦，梅丽莎对开支的计算一直是这样精细的。"] = "Never mind, Melissa's calculation of expenses has always been this precise.",
    ["算是"] = "Sort of",
    ["算是吧，一个杂草坛子，被我仔细锄了一遍，种了一圈水灵灵的卷心菜。"] = "You could say that. It was a patch of weeds that I carefully hoed and planted with a circle of lush cabbages.",
    ["算是吧，不过这次是个私人委托。"] = "You could say that, but this is a private commission.",
    ["算是吧，他帮过了，或许吧……"] = "I suppose so, he helped me, perhaps...",
    ["算是吧，我们之前在码头干活，想找一份稳定的工作。"] = "I suppose so. We used to work at the docks and wanted to find a stable job.",
    ["算是有一点烦恼吧。"] = "I suppose I have a little bit of trouble.",
    ["算是，我的公司会给每位员工都发一辆脚踏车。"] = "You could say that. My company gives every employee a bicycle.",
    ["算是，阿兹克先生是我在霍伊大学历史系的讲师。他是一位非常博学的学者，也是一位强大的非凡者。"] = "In a way, Mr. Azik was my lecturer in the History Department at Khoy University. He is a very learned scholar and also a powerful Beyonder.",
    ["管不了你了，我先回去烤烤火。"] = "I can't deal with you anymore. I'm going back to warm up by the fire.",
    ["管他是谁掉的。不过我刚才在林子深处追踪足迹时，看见那个穿长风衣的开膛手就在空地那儿，正焦急地原地转圈，好像在等待某人。可能与这有关呢。"] = "Who cares who dropped it? But just now, while I was tracking footprints deep in the woods, I saw that Ripper in the long trench coat in the clearing, anxiously pacing in circles as if waiting for someone. Maybe it's related to that.",
    ["管他的，快跑！"] = "Screw it, run!",
    ["管她们呢，这些最终还不是丢给我们搓！"] = "Forget them, don't these end up being scrubbed by us anyway!",
