    ["精神体之外是“星灵体”，他是前者与灵界、星界沟通的方式，也与意志和情绪有关。占卜和别的许多魔法，都是通过星灵体来施展的。"] = "Outside the Spirit Body is the 'Astral World Body'. It is the way the former communicates with the Spirit World and the Astral World, and it is also related to will and emotions. Divination and many other magics are performed through the Astral World Body.",
