    ["糟了！是陷阱——我们的非凡能力被封印了！"] = "Oh no! It's a trap—our Beyonder abilities have been sealed!",
    ["糟了，联想得太远了……"] = "Oh no, I let my imagination run too far...",
    ["糟了，要跟丢了……应该是这个方向。"] = "Oh no, I'm about to lose him... it should be this direction.",
    ["糟了，这次闹大了，以后恐怕再也买不到内部资料了。"] = "Oh no, this has blown up. I'm afraid I'll never be able to buy insider materials again.",
    ["糟糕"] = "Terrible",
    ["糟糕 他有些发狂了 要先控制住他"] = "Terrible, he's going a bit mad, must control him first",
    ["糟糕……字都看不清了，谁带笔了？"] = "Oh no... I can't even see the words clearly. Who brought a pen?",
    ["糟糕火力不足……这豌豆炖羔羊肉做不熟啊。"] = "Too bad there's not enough firepower... this pea stewed lamb can't be cooked.",
    ["糟糕的天气总是没完没了！"] = "The terrible weather is endless!",
    ["糟糕！"] = "Oh no!",
    ["糟糕！小阿诺德呢？他刚才还跟我在一起！"] = "Oh no! What about little Arnold? He was just with me!",
    ["糟糕！梦境崩塌了！"] = "Oh no! The dream is collapsing!",
    ["糟糕！这些日记正在靠近碎片！我们要快点追上去！"] = "Oh no! These diaries are getting close to the fragments! We need to hurry and catch up!",
    ["糟糕，2-049逃出来了！大家小心！"] = "Oh no, 2-049 has escaped! Everyone, be careful!",
    ["糟糕，不能跑太快……我是小乖猫，我是小乖猫。"] = "Oh no, I can't run too fast... I'm a good little kitty. I'm a good little kitty.",
    ["糟糕，他吓晕了。趁现在把他送去黑荆棘接受净化吧。"] = "Oh no, he fainted from fear. Take this chance to send him to the Black Thorn to receive purification.",
    ["糟糕，他有些发狂了，要先控制住他！"] = "Oh no, he's losing control. I must restrain him first!",
    ["糟糕，但愿不会有臭鸡蛋……"] = "Oh no, I hope there won't be any rotten eggs...",
    ["糟糕，但愿不会有臭鸡蛋。"] = "Oh no, hopefully there won't be any rotten eggs.",
    ["糟糕，我们被发现了！他们想销毁证据！敌人太多了，怎么办？！"] = "Oh no, we've been discovered! They want to destroy the evidence! There are too many enemies, what should we do?!",
    ["糟糕，我经常和同事来这吃饭，已经习惯性提前点餐了！你呢？有什么不能吃的吗？"] = "Oh no, I often come here to eat with colleagues, so I'm used to ordering in advance! How about you? Is there anything you can't eat?",
    ["糟糕，是我大意了……"] = "Damn, I was careless...",
    ["糟糕，真的失控——"] = "Oh no, I'm really losing control—",
    ["糟糕，这是海妖的幻术，要尽快离开！"] = "Oh no, this is a siren's illusion, we must leave immediately!",
