    ["紧急救援"] = "Emergency Rescue",
    ["紧接着，门外传来新的敲门声，声音比先前略显急促。敲门的人似乎迟疑了片刻，又抬起手，接连敲了几下。"] = "Immediately after, a new knock came from outside the door, sounding slightly more urgent than before. The person knocking seemed to hesitate for a moment, then raised their hand and knocked a few more times.",
    ["紧握长戟，旋身连续向身前挥斩，随后奋力将长戟向前刺出，造成伤害并获得太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）。\n烈阳状态下，将跃至敌人身前，随后向前全力劈斩造成伤害并获得太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）。"] = "Grip the long halberd, spin and slash continuously in front, then thrust the halberd forward with force to deal damage and gain Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear). \n In the Blazing Sun state, leap in front of the enemy, then slash forward with full force to deal damage and gain Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear).",
