    ["红宝石罗莎，可以说是我们这里最好的舞者。她往台上一站，底下就安静了。"] = "Ruby Rosa, arguably our best dancer. Once she stands on stage, the audience goes quiet.",
    ["红宝石里封存着她这辈子唯一一次痛恨，余烬般烧了这么多年。"] = "The ruby seals the only hatred of her life, burning like embers for so many years.",
