    ["组织分成两个小队，<Highlight>分别帮两个被点名的玩家分摊伤害</>，已经参与第一次分摊的玩家避免再次参与分摊。"] = "Organize into two teams to <Highlight>help the two targeted players share damage respectively</>; players who have already participated in the first sharing should avoid participating again.",
