    ["组长"] = "Group Leader",
    ["组长是俱乐部活动的核心管理，负责组内会员的任免、联赛组团等玩法活动组织。\n每个俱乐部下有4个分组，每个分组最多30人，分组内的成员自动获得联赛的参赛资格。"] = "Group Leaders are the core management for Club activities, responsible for the appointment and removal of group members, organizing league teams, and other activities. \n Each Club has 4 groups, each with a maximum of 30 people. Members within a group automatically gain eligibility for league participation.",
