    ["组队模式参与副本<Highlight>五月庄园·花园（困难）</>，完成阶段<Highlight>异化猎犬</>后，可以参与公共掉落的分配与拍卖。有概率获得下列外观。"] = "Participating in the dungeon <Highlight>May Manor · Garden (Hard)</> in party mode and completing the stage <Highlight>Alienated Hound</> allows you to participate in the distribution and auction of public drops. There is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["组队模式参加副本<Highlight>丰饶之树（困难）</>，击败<Highlight>厄水巨龟</>后，可以参与公共掉落的分配与拍卖。有概率获得可交易的道具。"] = "Participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Tree of Abundance (Hard)</> in party mode. After defeating <Highlight>Misfortune Water Giant Turtle</>, you can participate in the distribution and auction of public drops. There is a chance to obtain tradable items.",
    ["组队模式参加副本<Highlight>丰饶之树（困难）</>，击败<Highlight>舞王狒哥</>后，可以参与公共掉落的分配与拍卖。有概率获得下列外观。"] = "Participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Tree of Abundance (Hard)</> in party mode. After defeating <Highlight>Dancing King Baboon Brother</>, you can participate in the distribution and auction of public drops. There is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
