    ["结合各个神之途径的非凡特性的物品统称为神奇物品，其中被正神教会搜集封印的那些有强大的负面效果的统称为封印物。不含有非凡特性，但具备一定的超凡表现的物品统称非凡之物。"] = "Items that combine Beyonder characteristics from various pathways are collectively known as Sealed Artifacts. Those collected and sealed by the Churches of the Orthodox Deities that possess powerful negative effects are collectively known as Sealed Artifacts. Items that do not contain Beyonder characteristics but possess certain extraordinary properties are collectively known as Beyonder items.",
