    ["美酒、劲舞、无尽的欢愉！\n\n本酒馆开业只做三件事：激情、激情、还是<Hide id=\"#157_R\">***</>激情！\n\n每<Highlight>周四</>更有全场美酒<Highlight>激情半价</>！\n\n爱酒之人，勿失良机！\n\n◆酒馆内禁止赌博、斗殴、诈骗客人与侍者，\n凡有以上冲动者请自行移步至店门外解决。"] = "Fine wine, energetic dancing, and endless pleasure! \n\n This tavern only does three things: passion, passion, and more <Hide id=\"#157_R\">***</> passion! \n\n Every <Highlight>Thursday</>, all drinks are <Highlight>half-price with passion</>! \n\n Wine lovers, don't miss this opportunity! \n\n ◆ Gambling, fighting, and defrauding guests or waiters are prohibited in the tavern. \n Anyone with such impulses, please resolve them outside the shop door.",
