    ["耀眼光芒"] = "Dazzling Light",
    ["耀眼的光芒闪过，你看见“愚者”先生站在你的面前，等待着你清醒过来……"] = "A dazzling light flashes, and you see Mr. Fool standing before you, waiting for you to wake up...",
    ["老……什么老爷？女神啊，我要尿裤子了……"] = "Old... what old master? Goddess, I'm going to wet my pants...",
    ["老、老维尔先生，没想到他也在……"] = "Old, Old Mr. Will, I didn't expect him to be here too...",
    ["老东西？"] = "Old fogies?",
    ["老乔尼，你的怀表显示才三点？我流的汗都够给市长老爷的香槟塔续杯了！"] = "Old Johnny, your pocket watch says it's only three o'clock? The sweat I've shed is enough to refill the Mayor's champagne tower!",
    ["老乔治一天见不到就念得紧，嘴上却硬得像块石头！ "] = "Old George misses him if he doesn't see him for a day, but his mouth is as hard as a rock!",
    ["老乔治，这真不行！腌鱼的味道这么大，客人全被熏跑了。"] = "Old George, that really won't do! The smell of pickled fish is so strong, all the customers will be driven away.",
    ["老乞丐"] = "Old Beggar",
    ["老人"] = "Old Man",
    ["老人家，你们没事吧？"] = "Old man, are you two alright?",
    ["老人家，你在找什么吗？ "] = "Old man, are you looking for something?",
    ["老人家，您刚才唱诵的是哪部经文呀？真好听！"] = "Old man, which scripture were you chanting just now? It sounds so nice!",
    ["老人家，您干嘛一直走来走去？"] = "Old man, why do you keep walking back and forth?",
    ["老人随手一指，一旁的木桩应声而断。"] = "The old man points casually, and the wooden stake beside him snaps in response.",
    ["老伍德"] = "Old Wood",
    ["老伍德-剧场"] = "Old Wood-Theater",
    ["老伙计，三十年了。"] = "Old friend, it's been thirty years.",
    ["老伙计，这几天怎么没见你？不会是又被你那该死的风湿病缠上了吧？"] = "Old pal, why haven't I seen you these past few days? Don't tell me you've been plagued by that damn rheumatism again?",
    ["老会计"] = "Old Accountant",
    ["老兄，下次“狗抓老鼠”比赛你一定要押豪斯。我听说它有着凛冬郡猎犬的血脉！"] = "Mate, you must bet on House in the next 'dog catching mouse' race. I heard it has the bloodline of a Winter County hound!",
    ["老兄，下次“狗抓老鼠”比赛你一定要押豪斯，我听说它有着凛冬郡猎犬的血脉，肯定能抓到最多的老鼠！"] = "Buddy, you must bet on House in the next 'Dog Catches Mouse' race. I heard it has the bloodline of a Winter County hound; it will definitely catch the most mice!",
    ["老兄，下次“狗抓老鼠”比赛你想好要在谁身上押注了吗？"] = "Old man, have you decided who you're betting on for the next \"Dog Catching Mouse\" race?",
    ["老兄，下次“狗抓老鼠”比赛，你想好要给谁下注了吗？"] = "Mate, have you decided who to bet on for the next 'Dog Catches Mouse' race?",
    ["老兄，他那公寓臭名远扬，连水龙头都不让你多开！要是不怕客人再也不来买你的东西，你就尽管替他宣传吧！"] = "Buddy, his apartment is notorious; he won't even let you turn the faucet on too much! If you aren't afraid of customers never coming to buy your goods again, go ahead and advertise for him!",
    ["老兄，你在这蹲着，肯定什么都见过！给点提示……"] = "Buddy, you've been squatting here, you must have seen everything! Give me a hint...",
    ["老兄，你还不从水里上来？"] = "Buddy, aren't you coming out of the water yet?",
    ["老兄，愿你再次遇见它。"] = "Buddy, I hope you meet it again.",
    ["老兄，我们该走了吧！"] = "Buddy, we should go, right?",
    ["老兄，新警车速度怎么样？"] = "Buddy, how's the new police car?",
    ["老兄，祝你好运！"] = "Buddy, good luck!",
    ["老兄，聪明些吧，拿上这个，晚些再回来。"] = "Buddy, be smart. Take this and come back later.",
    ["老先生"] = "Old gentleman",
    ["老先生1"] = "Old Gentleman 1",
    ["老先生……这里没有路牌，会不会被风雪吹倒了？"] = "Sir... there is no road sign here. Could it have been blown down by the wind and snow?",
    ["老先生空白"] = "Old Gentleman Blank",
    ["老先生，你一定很思念戴维，但这里没有坟墓。"] = "Sir, you must miss David very much, but there is no grave here.",
    ["老先生，您还好吗？"] = "Are you alright, sir?",
    ["老先生，这里风雪很大，您怎么一个人在这儿？"] = "Old gentleman, the wind and snow are very heavy here, why are you here alone?",
    ["老公，我感觉好像变暖和了很多！"] = "Honey, I feel like it's gotten much warmer!",
    ["老兵"] = "Veteran",
    ["老加里"] = "Old Gary",
    ["老司机"] = "Veteran",
    ["老司机持续时间增加15秒。"] = "Veteran duration increased by 15 seconds.",
    ["老司机期间，骑乘状态下，自身减伤50%。"] = "During Veteran, while mounted, damage taken is reduced by 50%.",
    ["老吃家"] = "Old Foodie",
    ["老哥，你这班岗站了挺久吧？这一晚林子里有什么动静吗？"] = "Brother, you've been on guard duty for quite a while, haven't you? Has there been any movement in the woods tonight?",
    ["老地方，猎犬酒吧，不分胜负别想走！ "] = "The usual spot, Hounds Pub, don't even think about leaving until we've settled the score!",
    ["老大一直有个梦想是猎龙我们准备了好久今天终于能出发因为路费不够所以他们先走留我们找车赶过去这是计划和地图都写在纸上了！"] = "The boss has always had a dream of hunting dragons. We prepared for a long time and finally set off today. Because the travel expenses weren't enough, they left first and left us to find a carriage to catch up. This is the plan and the map, all written on paper!",
    ["老大不好了！瑞、瑞尔大哥出事了！"] = "Boss, it's bad! R-Riel brother is in trouble!",
    ["老大你死的好惨啊！"] = "Boss, you died such a miserable death!",
    ["老大小心……盾被击穿了……"] = "Boss, be careful... the shield was pierced...",
    ["老大想要学徒非凡特性，我得给他搞到手！"] = "The boss wants an Apprentice Beyonder characteristic, I have to get it for him!",
    ["老大最近似乎很紧张……"] = "The boss seems very nervous lately...",
    ["老大非要让我在这巡逻！我就不巡逻！这不挺安全的！"] = "The boss insists on me patrolling here! I'm not doing it! It's safe enough as it is!",
    ["老天，看来刚刚那几下真是够重的。琳达在说什么？是打算放弃吗？"] = "Good heavens, it seems those last few hits were really heavy. What is Linda saying? Is she planning to give up?",
