    ["老尼尔隐秘羁绊"] = "Old Neil Secret Bond",
    ["老尼尔隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Old Neil secret bond reward.",
    ["老尼尔面向"] = "Old Neil faces",
    ["老尼尔，接下来就交给你了。"] = "Old Neil, I'll leave the rest to you.",
    ["老尼尔，老尼尔！你老了好多呀！"] = "Old Neil, Old Neil! You've aged so much!",
    ["老尼尔，麻烦过来一下。"] = "Old Neil, please come over here for a moment.",
    ["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of Blackthorn. He would teach you meditation and spirit vision, and he would also teach you how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on expense reports. When he owed thirty pounds, he could also leave a three-hundred-pound wallet he found untouched. \n \"Do what you will, but do no harm\" was the motto he upheld his whole life. \n He was once an official Nighthawk, but he was always one step away from promotion. As he grew older, the Church asked him to become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire at home, but he refused. He only wished to stay at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone. \n In their usual humorous interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, trying to resurrect his late wife with the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Next to the formula that required blood materials, he wrote: \"Can consider extracting mine.\"—He would rather use his own blood than hurt anyone. \n Until the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates sent him off with their own hands... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I will accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence. \n He wanted to illuminate a short path for the young people with the rest of his life, and then use his life to practice a vow that no one knew.",
    ["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。但他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of the Blackthorn Security Company. He would teach you meditation, spirit vision, and how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on reimbursement forms. Yet, when he owed thirty pounds, he could remain unmoved by a wallet containing three hundred pounds he had found.\n\"Do what thou wilt, but harm none\" was the motto he upheld his entire life.\nHe was once a formal Nighthawk, but he was always just one step away from advancement. As he grew older, the Church suggested he become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire home, but he refused. He only wished to remain at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone.\nAmidst the usual humor and lighthearted interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, attempting to resurrect his late wife using the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Beside the formula requiring blood materials, he wrote: \"Consider drawing mine.\"—he would rather use his own blood than harm anyone.\nUntil the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates had to personally bid him farewell... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I shall accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence.\nHe wanted to light up a short path for the young ones with the rest of his life, and then, with his life, fulfill a vow no one knew.",
    ["老尼尔：呵呵，这就是魔法的力量。"] = "Old Neil: Hehe, this is the power of magic.",
    ["老尼尔：女神啊，是一个钱包！"] = "Old Neil: Goddess, it's a wallet!",
    ["老尼尔：感谢这位善良慷慨的爵士。"] = "Old Neil: Thank you to this kind and generous gentleman.",
    ["老尼尔：我们又不会试图占有这些不属于我们的金钱，在这里等一下吧。"] = "Old Neil: We aren't going to try to keep money that doesn't belong to us, let's wait here for a bit.",
    ["老尼尔：我们是可怜虫"] = "Old Neil: We are wretches.",
    ["老尼尔？"] = "Old Neil?",
    ["老巴克的山羊比他胡子还黑！下一个！"] = "Old Buck's goat is blacker than his beard! Next!",
    ["老布莱克教士就不一样了，有时候还会给我们分蛋糕。但要是比利来教堂捉我，他肯定也会笑呵呵地把我供出来……"] = "Old Father Blake is different; sometimes he even shares cake with us. But if Billy came to the church to catch me, he would definitely laugh and give me away...",
    ["老师"] = "Teacher",
    ["老师不是说过了桥直走吗？"] = "Didn't the teacher say to go straight after crossing the bridge?",
    ["老师们暴跳如雷，学生们议论纷纷……一桩未解的悬案让霍伊大学陷入了骚动。"] = "The teachers are furious, the students are gossiping... An unsolved case has thrown Hoy University into a frenzy.",
    ["老师你工作六年了还是助教啊？"] = "Teacher, you've been working for six years and you're still a teaching assistant?",
    ["老师只是最近精神上出了点问题，我们联系的是心理诊所，为什么警察会来？"] = "The teacher just had some mental problems recently. We contacted a psychological clinic, so why did the police come?",
    ["老师比我聪明得多，他早就预感到了蜡烛工坊的倒闭，提前把我送进了糖厂学手艺。"] = "My teacher was much smarter than me. He had long sensed the closure of the candle workshop and sent me to the sugar factory to learn a trade in advance.",
    ["老师生前发现集市上除了工厂的便宜蜡烛，还出现了一种点不着的蜡烛。"] = "Before my teacher passed away, he discovered that besides the cheap factory candles, a type of candle that wouldn't light had appeared at the market.",
    ["老师追查那些蜡烛，最后发现是有人举办诡异的<P_Yellow>“死亡”庆典</>，在庆典上分发了这些蜡烛。"] = "My teacher investigated those candles and eventually discovered that someone was holding a bizarre <P_Yellow> \"Death\" celebration </> and distributing these candles there.",
    ["老师，你什么时候回来啊！"] = "Teacher, when will you come back!",
    ["老师，我是隔壁大学来旁听的，不是本班学生。"] = "Teacher, I am auditing from the university next door; I am not a student in this class.",
    ["老师，我是隔壁廷根大学来旁听的，不是本班学生。"] = "Teacher, I am from Tingen University next door to audit, not a student in this class.",
    ["老年女性"] = "Elderly Woman",
    ["老年普通棕色男"] = "Elderly ordinary brown-haired man",
    ["老年男性"] = "Elderly Man",
    ["老廷根市民"] = "Old Tingen Citizen",
    ["老弟，来，喝一杯，哈加提草原的苦酒，后劲爽得像被金镑投怀送抱！"] = "Brother, come, have a drink, bitter wine from the Hagati Grasslands, the aftertaste is as refreshing as being embraced by gold pounds!",
    ["老强尼"] = "Old Johnny",
    ["老托马斯"] = "Old Thomas",
    ["老托马斯的“护身符”"] = "Old Thomas's \"Amulet\"",
    ["老托马斯重物"] = "Old Thomas Heavy Object",
    ["老托马斯：<P_Heart>（用力）</>可恶……根本搬不动……"] = "Old Thomas: <P_Heart>(Straining)</> Damn it... I can't move it at all...",
    ["老托马斯：不——不——"] = "Old Thomas: No—no—",
    ["老托马斯：好孩子……谢谢你们。"] = "Old Thomas: Good children... thank you.",
    ["老旧手枪"] = "Old pistol",
    ["老旧的帽子"] = "Old Hat",
    ["老旧的铠甲感受到了侵袭，从漫长的沉眠中醒来，为了守护家族，它将不惜一切代价。"] = "The old armor senses the intrusion and wakes from its long slumber; to guard the family, it will stop at nothing.",
    ["老旧蒸汽锅"] = "Old Steam Boiler",
    ["老早没人管了，这是废墟，{{先生|女士}}！没有治安官，没有警察。只有我这样的向导保证你的安全——我是从小在这儿长大的，里里外外不知道转过多少回了。"] = "No one has cared about this place for a long time; it's a ruin, {{Mr.|Ms.}}! There are no magistrates, no police. Only a guide like me can ensure your safety—I grew up here and have walked through every corner more times than I can count.",
    ["老是受你照顾，真不好意思。"] = "I'm so embarrassed to always be taken care of by you.",
    ["老杰克"] = "Old Jack",
    ["老板"] = "Owner",
    ["老板 再来杯黑麦啤酒 不 要烈朗齐！"] = "Boss, another rye beer, no, not the strong one!",
    ["老板们不在……我再睡一会……"] = "The bosses aren't here... I'll sleep a little longer...",
    ["老板前"] = "Before the Boss",
    ["老板常常把这作为谈资，和顾客分享呢，呵呵。"] = "The boss often uses this as a topic of conversation to share with customers, hehe.",
    ["老板总说公司是我们老员工的家，说我们的经验就是财富。"] = "The boss always says the company is home to us veteran employees, and that our experience is wealth.",
    ["老板总说对我有点失望，他招我做店员，其实是看中我面试时表现的潜力。他希望我入职后能够拼一把，快速成长为销冠……不行，累，太累了。"] = "The boss always says he is a bit disappointed in me. He hired me as a clerk because he saw the potential I showed during the interview. He hopes that after I join, I can work hard and quickly grow into a top salesperson... No, it's tiring, too tiring.",
    ["老板来了！这是最后的机会了……"] = "The boss is here! This is the last chance...",
    ["老板的光"] = "Boss's Light",
    ["老板的光0"] = "Boss's light 0",
    ["老板，你上次给我的助眠草药好像没有效果啊？"] = "Boss, the sleep-aid herbs you gave me last time didn't seem to have any effect?",
    ["老板，你这上面写着“格尔曼同款”，下面又写“与《大冒险家》无关”？"] = "Boss, it says \"Gehrman's favorite\" on this, but below it says \"Unrelated to 'The Great Adventurer'\"?",
    ["老板，您知道最近总有人自杀的事吗？"] = "Boss, do you know about the recent suicides?",
    ["老板，我想要一点那个。"] = "Boss, I want a little of that.",
    ["老板，跟您打听一下——金秋湖农场最近是不是出了什么事？"] = "Boss, let me ask you—has something happened at the Golden Autumn Lake farm recently?",
    ["老板，需不需要保镖？能帮你收租的！"] = "Boss, do you need a bodyguard? I can help you collect rent!",
    ["老查克不在了，但他的酒还在。小柯莱不在了，她的南瓜还在。我还在。"] = "Old Chuck is gone, but his wine is still here. Little Colley is gone, but her pumpkin is still here. I am still here.",
    ["老柯尔"] = "Old Cole",
    ["老比尔"] = "Old Bill",
    ["老毛病又犯了……唉。"] = "The old problem is acting up again... sigh.",
    ["老毛病，心口很闷，您再帮我看看？"] = "The usual, my chest feels very tight, could you take another look for me?",
    ["老水手们"] = "Old sailors",
    ["老水手波恩"] = "Old Sailor Bone",
    ["老汤姆"] = "Old Tom",
    ["老汤姆，你就帮帮我吧！"] = "Old Tom, please just help me out!",
    ["老汤姆，看在咱们二十年交情的份上，就帮我这一回！ "] = "Old Tom, for the sake of our twenty-year friendship, just help me this once!",
    ["老爷……老爷当时就倒在书桌旁，茶撒了一地。我冲过去，碰了碰他的手——"] = "The Master... the Master was lying by the desk at that time, and the tea was spilled all over the floor. I rushed over and touched his hand—",
    ["老爷……让我在这里等……"] = "Master... told me to wait here...",
    ["老爷卧室的<P_Yellow>门锁着</>。我敲了很久，里面一直没人回应。过了几秒，老爷突然开口说……"] = "The <P_Yellow> door </> to the master's bedroom was locked. I knocked for a long time, but there was no response from inside. After a few seconds, the master suddenly said...",
    ["老爷和夫人从来没过想责备小姐和那男孩，只是希望我来把把关……如果您见到他，请帮忙转达这份心意吧。谢谢您。"] = "The master and mistress never intended to blame the young lady and that boy; they just wanted me to check on things... If you see him, please help convey this sentiment. Thank you.",
    ["老爷夫人们行行好吧！"] = "Have mercy, my lords and ladies!",
    ["老爷如果去反复承诺、推翻一件事，长远看更不利于工厂的发展。"] = "Sir, if you keep making and breaking promises, it will be detrimental to the factory's development in the long run.",
    ["老爷对我们也太诚恳了，竟然直接告诉了我们工厂的困境……"] = "Sir is too sincere with us; he even told us directly about the factory's predicament...",
    ["老爷对盒饭的解释，你能接受吗？"] = "Can you accept Sir's explanation regarding the boxed meals?",
    ["老爷爷"] = "Old Grandpa",
    ["老爷让我守着宅子等他回来，我就一直等……"] = "Master told me to guard the house and wait for his return, so I've been waiting...",
    ["老爷说工厂遇到了困难，你之前有听到过什么传言吗？"] = "Sir said the factory is facing difficulties; have you heard any rumors about that before?",
    ["老爷车"] = "Vintage car",
    ["老爷车同骑"] = "Old Car Co-riding",
    ["老爷车喇叭"] = "Old Car Horn",
    ["老爷车喇叭旧"] = "Old Car Horn",
    ["老爷车展"] = "Vintage car show",
    ["老爷车满5万镑减5镑代金券……呃，没有捡起的欲望。"] = "A 5-pound voucher for a 50,000-pound vintage car... Uh, I have no desire to pick it up.",
    ["老爷车竞速"] = "Vintage car racing",
    ["老爷车车灯"] = "Vintage Car Headlights",
    ["老爷车车载音乐"] = "Old Car Music",
    ["老爷车，竞速排名，多圈"] = "Vintage car, racing ranking, multi-lap",
    ["老爷车，竞速计时，有分级"] = "Vintage car, racing time trial, ranked",
    ["老爷都一把年纪了，去贝克兰德上议院当个议员不好吗，非要竞选廷根市长。"] = "The old gentleman is already at such an age; wouldn't it be better to be a member of the House of Lords in Backlund? Why must he run for mayor of Tingen?",
    ["老爷，可老爷说要我等的。"] = "Master, but Master said I should wait.",
    ["老爷，请容我提醒，工厂的效益再差下去，我们甚至无法提供这样的盒饭。"] = "Sir, if I may remind you, if the factory's performance continues to decline, we won't even be able to provide these boxed meals.",
    ["老爹"] = "Old Dad",
    ["老特勒"] = "Old Tiller",
    ["老特勒从墓地里爬出来了，该死的，小科勒又把这个墓地卖给别人了。"] = "Old Trelle crawled out of the cemetery. Damn it, Little Kohler sold this plot to someone else again.",
    ["老特勒呀，就是个住在村里的混蛋罢了，前几天死了。"] = "Old Tuller, he's just a bastard who lived in the village, he died a few days ago.",
    ["老特勒是谁？"] = "Who is Old Trelle?",
    ["老特勒活着的时候是个老混蛋，死了以后也不让人消停，死了还出来蹦跶，还没有没找到。"] = "Old Trelle was an old bastard when he was alive, and he doesn't let people rest after he's dead. He crawled out after dying, and he still hasn't been found.",
    ["老特勒，没啥好说的，他就是个混蛋罢了，住在这村子里。"] = "Old Tuller, nothing to say, he's just a bastard, lived in this village.",
    ["老特勒？看起来很有名的样子。"] = "Old Tuller? He seems quite famous.",
    ["老理查德近景镜头"] = "Old Richard close-up shot",
    ["老电影"] = "Old Film",
    ["老科勒：不，也许睡一觉就好了，盖上我的被子睡一觉就好了！"] = "Old Kohler: No, maybe I'll be fine after a sleep, just cover myself with my blanket and sleep!",
    ["老科勒：为什么？"] = "Old Kohler: Why?",
    ["老科勒：今天的雾气怎么这么难闻？"] = "Old Kohler: Why is the fog so foul today?",
    ["老科勒：我们这样的人……是秸秆……风一吹，就会倒下……"] = "Old Kohler: People like us... are straw... when the wind blows, we fall...",
    ["老科勒：每一顿都能有两片，三片，不，至少五片的火腿肉，我还能切一些下来，和土豆一起炖汤，甚至不用放盐……"] = "Old Kohler: Every meal can have two, three, no, at least five slices of ham. I can even cut some off to stew with potatoes, and I won't even need to add salt...",
    ["老科勒：生病了吗？该死，我还想过个美好的新年，现在只能把积蓄送到诊所送到医院了……"] = "Old Kohler: Sick? Damn it, I wanted to have a nice New Year, now I can only send my savings to the clinic and the hospital...",
    ["老科勒：荷，荷，荷……"] = "Old Kohler: Hah, hah, hah...",
    ["老科勒：还是太贵太大了，只能和人合伙买一条，锯成几份……这足够我新年假期吃了。"] = "Old Kohler: Still too expensive and too big. I can only buy one with someone else and saw it into several pieces... This will be enough for me to eat during the New Year holiday.",
    ["老管家"] = "Old Butler",
    ["老管家出于本能保护男爵，怎么会用封印物操控他？"] = "The old butler is protecting the Baron out of instinct; how could he be using a Sealed Artifact to control him?",
    ["老管家戴着“看见我”……是他用封印物操控了男爵？"] = "The old butler is wearing \"See Me\"... is he the one using the Sealed Artifact to control the Baron?",
    ["老管家：莫里亚蒂侦探，王子殿下在街口的马车上等你，希望了解调查的进度。"] = "Old Butler: Detective Moriarty, His Highness the Prince is waiting for you in the carriage at the corner of the street, hoping to understand the progress of the investigation.",
    ["老约翰"] = "Old John",
    ["老约翰又动了！女神啊我们该怎么办？"] = "Old John is moving again! Goddess, what should we do?",
    ["老约翰终于出门喝酒了……"] = "Old John finally went out to drink...",
    ["老约翰，就在那边，那具尸体，说实话我们也不知道发生了什么，也不知道谁能帮得上忙……"] = "Old John, right over there, that corpse. To be honest, we don't know what happened either, and we don't know who can help...",
    ["老绅士"] = "Old gentleman",
    ["老维克多"] = "Old Victor",
    ["老维克多……佛尔思女士……"] = "Old Victor... Miss Fors...",
    ["老维克多的怀表"] = "Old Victor's Pocket Watch",
    ["老维克多的怀表能力，可以在空间的“稳定态”与“侵蚀态”间切换。"] = "Old Victor's pocket watch ability, which can switch between the \"Stable State\" and \"Erosion State\" of space.",
    ["老维尔"] = "Old Will",
    ["老维尔先生，<P_Heart>（有些局促）</>没想到你们也参加了这次活动。"] = "Mr. Old Will, <P_Heart>(A bit awkward)</> I didn't expect you to participate in this event too.",
    ["老维尔先生，你记得我喜欢香草？"] = "Mr. Old Will, you remember I like herbs?",
    ["老维尔先生，我是黑荆棘安保公司的{{PlayerName}} ，有些事——"] = "Old Mr. Will, I am {{PlayerName}} from the Blackthorn Security Company, there are some things—",
    ["老维尔告示"] = "Old Will Notice",
    ["老维尔告示牌"] = "Old Will's Notice Board",
    ["老维尔食物"] = "Old Will food",
    ["老维尔餐厅"] = "Old Will's Restaurant",
    ["老维尔餐厅--斯迈尔斯"] = "Old Will Restaurant - Smiles",
    ["老维尔餐厅侍者"] = "Old Will Restaurant waiter",
    ["老维尔餐厅在黑荆棘安保公司附近，提供香肠、土豆泥、牛肉布丁、乳蛋羹等经典美食。"] = "Old Will Restaurant is near the Blackthorn Security Company and provides classic delicacies such as sausages, mashed potatoes, beef pudding, and custard.",
    ["老维尔餐厅菜单"] = "Old Will Restaurant Menu",
    ["老维德"] = "Old Wade",
    ["老维德-第三环开头对话"] = "Old Wade - Third ring opening dialogue",
    ["老维德手下位置1"] = "Old Wade's subordinate position 1",
    ["老维德手下位置2"] = "Old Wade's subordinate position 2",
    ["老维德手下位置3"] = "Old Wade's Subordinate Position 3",
    ["老维德手下位置4"] = "Old Wade's Subordinate Position 4",
    ["老维德手下位置5"] = "Old Vied's Subordinate Position 5",
    ["老维斯塔临死前，给这条街上的店，送了好些蜡烛。大半个月了，我还没用完呢。"] = "Before old Vista died, he gave many candles to the shops on this street. It's been over half a month, and I haven't finished using them yet.",
    ["老罗德"] = "Old Rhodes",
    ["老罗德trigger"] = "Old Rhode trigger",
    ["老罗德昨天还念叨着要晒太阳，说晒硬朗了好去背柴。 "] = "Old Rhode was still talking about wanting to bask in the Sun yesterday, saying that once he got stronger from the sun, he'd go back to carrying firewood.",
    ["老罗德经常来蜡烛工坊，找老师聊天。老师死后，他就没人说话了……"] = "Old Rhode often came to the candle workshop to chat with my teacher. After the teacher died, he had no one left to talk to...",
    ["老罗德蜡烛"] = "Old Rhode's candle",
    ["老罗德迷糊了，举着蜡烛说要回归死亡！我喊不住他！"] = "Old Rhode is confused; he's holding a candle and saying he wants to return to death! I can't stop him!",
    ["老罗德！住手！"] = "Old Rhode! Stop!",
    ["老罗德，你醒醒。"] = "Old Rhode, wake up.",
    ["老老老大！就是{{他|她}}！之前总坏咱们好事的那个！"] = "Bo-boss! It's {{him| her}}! The one who always ruins our plans!",
    ["老者"] = "Elder",
    ["老莱纳"] = "Old Leiner",
    ["老虎机1"] = "Slot Machine 1",
    ["老虎机2"] = "Slot Machine 2",
    ["老虎机3"] = "Slot Machine 3",
    ["老虎机4"] = "Slot Machine 4",
    ["老街小屋"] = "Old Street Hut",
    ["老裘德"] = "Old Jude",
    ["老规矩，你懂的……嗯？你是谁？"] = "The usual rules, you know... Hmm? Who are you?",
    ["老贾吉"] = "Old Judge",
    ["老资历医生"] = "Veteran Doctor",
    ["老资历医生宣"] = "Veteran doctor's declaration",
    ["老身感受到了，从大地深处传来的启示……多谢你，这里还有最后一份馈赠。"] = "I feel it, the revelation from the depths of the earth... Thank you, here is the final gift.",
    ["老鼠"] = "Rat",
    ["老鼠-翻找食物"] = "Rat - rummage for food",
    ["老鼠——追逐"] = "Mouse—Chase",
    ["老鼠入口路点"] = "Mouse Entrance Waypoint",
    ["老鼠到底是怎么回事？"] = "What is going on with the mice?",
    ["老鼠尸体"] = "Rat Corpse",
    ["老鼠尸体（采集）"] = "Rat Corpse (Collect)",
    ["老鼠屋"] = "Mouse House",
    ["老鼠惧怕圣光，受到光照会向光照中心反方向逃窜"] = "Rats fear Holy Light; they will flee in the opposite direction of the light source.",
    ["老鼠现身"] = "Rat appears",
    ["老鼠真是太可怕了……"] = "Rats are truly terrifying...",
    ["老鼠空白"] = "Blank Rat",
    ["老鼠空白2"] = "Blank Rat 2",
    ["老鼠笼子"] = "Rat Cage",
    ["老鼠肉？哪里来的？"] = "Rat meat? Where did you get it?",
    ["老鼠过街"] = "Mouse Crossing the Street",
    ["老鼠还没放"] = "The rat hasn't been placed yet",
    ["老鼠逃命文字"] = "Mouse Escape Text",
    ["老鼠逃离点"] = "Rat escape point",
    ["老鼠钥匙-圣赛琳娜"] = "Rat Key: Saint Selena",
    ["老鼠钥匙-廷根火车站"] = "Mouse Key-Tingen Train Station",
    ["老鼠钥匙-铁十字街"] = "Mouse key - Iron Cross Street",
    ["老鼠钥匙交付点"] = "Mouse key delivery point",
    ["老鼠镜头"] = "Rat Camera",
    ["老鼠镜头lookat"] = "Rat Camera LookAt",
    ["老鼠食物"] = "Rat Food",
    ["老鼠食物采集"] = "Rat food collection",
    ["老鼠！滚出！我的！房子！"] = "Mice! Get! Out! Of! My! House!",
    ["老鼠？"] = "Mouse?",
    ["老，老师……"] = "Tea, teacher...",
    ["考克斯"] = "Cox",
    ["考公培训"] = "Civil Service Training",
    ["考公班宣传"] = "Civil Service Exam Class Promotion",
    ["考利"] = "Colley",
    ["考古学家"] = "Archaeologist",
    ["考古营地检查"] = "Archaeological camp inspection",
    ["考古队后勤"] = "Archaeological Team Logistics",
    ["考古队杂役"] = "Archaeological Team Handyman",
    ["考察什么？"] = "Researching what?",
    ["考尔"] = "Cole",
    ["考尔德伦"] = "Cauldron",
    ["考文"] = "Cowen",
    ["考生"] = "Examinee",
    ["考虑一下"] = "Consider it",
    ["考虑到灵感提高后对寻找笔记的帮助，以及可能的、潜藏的危险……"] = "Considering how increased Inspiration helps in finding the notebook, as well as the potential, hidden dangers...",
    ["考虑好了？要加入还是要拒绝？"] = "Have you thought it over? Will you join or refuse?",
    ["考虑我的建议吗？我们临时组队，战利品共有？"] = "Considering my suggestion? We form a temporary team, and share the loot?",
    ["考虑途径光点"] = "Consider pathway light spot",
    ["考试培训班"] = "Exam training class",
    ["考试大纲\n史前时代、混沌纪元、黑暗纪元、灾变纪元、众神纪元、黑铁纪元。"] = "Exam Syllabus \n Prehistoric Era, Chaos Era, Dark Era, Cataclysm Era, Era of Gods, Black Iron Era.",
    ["考试成绩不算——不论我算得高还是低，对你的心态一定会产生影响。"] = "Exam results are not included—no matter if I predict high or low, it will definitely affect your mindset.",
    ["考试范围？"] = "Exam scope?",
    ["考辛斯"] = "Cousins",
    ["考验？"] = "A test?",
    ["而且……上面的游戏比下面危险得多。你现在这样，上去了也活不过第一夜。"] = "Besides... the games upstairs are much more dangerous than the ones below. The way you are now, you wouldn't survive the first night even if you went up.",
    ["而且……说不定我们还来得及去参加你今晚的生日聚会。"] = "And... maybe we can still make it to your birthday party tonight.",
    ["而且一定要在红月的时候体验！"] = "And you must experience it during the Red Moon!",
    ["而且他们……似乎永远年轻，永远无法离开。"] = "And they... seem to be forever young, forever unable to leave.",
    ["而且他有了新名字，你可以叫他“毛毛草”"] = "And he has a new name; you can call him 'Fuzzy Grass'.",
    ["而且他真的出手相助，用一种很平淡的方式，就像只是顺手拂去灰尘。"] = "And he really reached out to help, in a very plain way, as if he were just brushing off dust.",
    ["而且你不觉得吗？这是真正的奇遇。像我小说里写的那样，神秘、危险，但充满可能。"] = "And don't you think? This is a true adventure. Just like what I write in my novels, mysterious, dangerous, but full of possibilities.",
    ["而且你们在黛西小姐身上的尝试，害死两位仆人和一位管家……"] = "And your attempts on Miss Daisy caused the deaths of two servants and a butler...",
    ["而且你和班森都还没成家，现在家里每便士的开支都得做好计划。"] = "And neither you nor Benson are married yet. Every penny of the family's expenses must be planned carefully.",
    ["而且你的钱不是还要去占卜俱乐部交年费。对了，你去那做什么？"] = "And isn't your money for the annual fee of the Divination Club? By the way, what are you doing there?",
    ["而且你的钱不是还要去占卜家俱乐部交年费。对了，你去那做什么？"] = "Besides, don't you still need money to pay the annual fee for the Divination Club? By the way, what do you do there?",
    ["而且即使妈妈不能和我见面，我也知道她爱我。"] = "And even if Mom can't see me, I know she loves me.",
    ["而且在我饿的时候，还拿出面包跟我分享！"] = "And when I was hungry, you even took out Bread to share with me!",
    ["而且外祖父也没有进行“财产赠予保护”，这在法庭上会对我们很不利。"] = "Furthermore, Grandfather didn't set up a \"property gift protection,\" which will be very disadvantageous for us in court.",
    ["而且奥黛丽说过，观众途径最厉害的不是打架，是让对手根本不想和你打。我觉得这说得很有道理。"] = "Besides, Audrey said that the most powerful thing about the Spectator pathway isn't fighting, but making the opponent not want to fight you at all. I think that makes a lot of sense.",
    ["而且她看起来很是纤弱。或许是文职人员？"] = "And she looks very frail. Perhaps a clerical worker?",
    ["而且她还买了只青蛙……不妙，赶紧找找关于青蛙的记载！"] = "And she even bought a frog... This is bad, I need to quickly find records about frogs!",
    ["而且它只要12镑！只要12镑，您就会成为社交场合里最亮眼的那位绅士！"] = "And it's only 12 pounds! For just 12 pounds, you will be the most eye-catching gentleman in any social occasion!",
    ["而且它好像很安静……我还以为它一路上会说个不停。"] = "And it seems very quiet... I thought it would talk non-stop along the way.",
    ["而且弗莱队长他们刚才被突发任务叫走了，现在只剩我们继续这件庞大的工作。{{PlayerName}}……或许你刚好有时间帮帮我？"] = "And Captain Frye and the others were called away by a sudden mission just now, so only we are left to continue this massive task. {{PlayerName}}... perhaps you happen to have time to help me?",
    ["而且很多时候死人比活人好相处，因为从不用担心他们会突然冷场。"] = "Besides, dead people are often easier to get along with than living ones, because you never have to worry about them suddenly making things awkward.",
    ["而且我们已经委托侦探寻找它了，肯定很快就会有结果的。"] = "And we have already commissioned a detective to find it, so there will definitely be results soon.",
    ["而且我只是个……普通的、跑得快一点的送货员！"] = "And I'm just a... normal delivery person who runs a bit fast!",
    ["而且我有了自己的新名字，我不再是一只让人记不住的小猫了！"] = "And I have a new name of my own; I am no longer a kitten that people can't remember!",
    ["而且我相信，我们会在黑夜的国度里，再次相聚……"] = "And I believe that we will reunite in the Kingdom of the Evernight...",
    ["而且我能被知识皇冠误认为是“自己人”，也许我更安全一些。"] = "Besides, I can be mistaken for 'one of our own' by the Crown of Knowledge, so perhaps I am safer.",
    ["而且按照规则，只要有一个人代表小队报名即可。"] = "And according to the rules, as long as one person signs up on behalf of the team, it counts.",
    ["而且斯林太太一直挂念着你，刚好你可以顺路去买些东西，陪她聊几句。"] = "And Mrs. Stiller has been thinking about you. You can stop by to buy some things and chat with her for a bit.",
    ["而且是完美的引路者和投资人！"] = "And a perfect guide and investor!",
    ["而且有戴莉女士的案例在先，从中得到启发更进一步完成扮演法，还是挺合理的。"] = "And with Ms. Daly's case as a precedent, it is quite reasonable to be inspired by it to further complete the Acting method.",
    ["而且杰姆怎么办？我跑了，雷克斯一定会把气撒在他身上。他跑不动的……"] = "And what about Jem? If I run away, Rex will definitely take his anger out on him. He can't run...",
    ["而且脑海中出现另一个人，一个强大又陌生的人……"] = "And another person appeared in my mind, a powerful and strange person...",
    ["而且脑海中分裂出另一个我，一个很陌生的我……"] = "And another me has split off in my mind, a very unfamiliar me...",
    ["而且说到天才，我觉得你也是一个天才。真正的天才。"] = "And speaking of geniuses, I think you are one too. A real genius.",
    ["而且还很健康，一般炸物都会增加人体负担，而库克用的猪油都是……"] = "And it's healthy too. Generally, fried food increases the burden on the human body, but the lard Cook uses is...",
    ["而且这副牌已经用了很多年，我想他们会更习惯这些“老朋友”。"] = "And this deck has been used for many years, I think they are more accustomed to these \"old friends\".",
    ["而且这次得救了，下次呢？哥哥的病不是一天两天了，我们……我们总不能一直指望陌生人的善心。"] = "And even if I'm saved this time, what about next time? My brother's illness isn't a one-day thing, we... we can't always rely on the kindness of strangers.",
    ["而且这里离安布罗斯学长的书摊……不对，单纯是我习惯在这里了！"] = "Besides, this is near Senior Ambrose's book stall... no, wait, it's just that I'm used to being here!",
    ["而且这里还闹过鬼！蒸汽在上，教会的人来看了之后就留下一盏煤油灯，也不知道有没有用。"] = "And this place is haunted! Steam above, the Church people came to look and left a kerosene lamp, but I don't know if it's useful.",
    ["而且那位不是银月公爵，而是大地母神教会的高级执事。"] = "And that person is not the Duke of Silver Moon, but a high-ranking deacon of the Church of the Earth Mother.",
    ["而且，你做得比我想象中更好。黑荆棘的委托，你从没让人失望过。魔药材料都准备好了吗？"] = "Besides, you have done better than I imagined. You have never disappointed anyone with the Blackthorn's commissions. Are the potion materials ready?",
    ["而且，你的状态并不稳定，我需要尽快将你带回贝克兰德教会重新封印。"] = "And your state is not stable. I need to take you back to the Backlund Church as soon as possible to be resealed.",
    ["而且，听说老头的三个亲生儿子都不是他的……看来他这私生子可要大赚一笔了。唉，这小子的好日子还在后头呢。"] = "Besides, I heard the old man's three biological sons aren't actually his... Looks like this illegitimate son is going to make a fortune. Sigh, the good days for this kid are still ahead.",
    ["而且，如果缴满二十年年限，公司届时将退您四成保费。被保人的长寿，也是我们不吝于祝福的事。"] = "Moreover, if you pay for the full twenty-year term, the company will refund you 40% of the premiums at that time. The longevity of the insured is also something we are happy to bless.",
    ["而且，尊敬的先生，如果您需要一些……嗯，不那么正式的情报，我们也有办法弄到。毕竟，在这片街区，孩子们的耳朵总是最灵的。"] = "And, respected sir, if you need some... well, less formal information, we have ways to get it. After all, in this neighborhood, children's ears are always the sharpest.",
    ["而且，我也没有占据主要的道路。"] = "Besides, I am not blocking the main road.",
    ["而且，我更想加强对神秘学的了解和掌握，收尸人途径并不适合我。"] = "Besides, I want to strengthen my understanding and mastery of the occult more; the Corpse Collector pathway is not suitable for me.",
    ["而且，我的小阿诺德很像我，我相信他。"] = "Besides, my little Arnold is very much like me. I believe in him.",
    ["而且，我积攒的功勋也不够换取配方和魔药。"] = "Besides, the merit I've accumulated isn't enough to exchange for formulas and potions.",
    ["而且，本案已经有三点矛盾无法解释了。"] = "Moreover, there are already three points of contradiction in this case that cannot be explained.",
    ["而且，说到守护者的职责……我们还有不少该做的事。"] = "Besides, speaking of the duties of a Guardian... we still have quite a few things we ought to do.",
    ["而且，这样打扮有个好处——没人敢随便搭讪我。那些自以为是的绅士，看到蓝眼影和黑袍就绕道走，省了我很多麻烦。"] = "Besides, there's a benefit to dressing this way—no one dares to hit on me casually. Those self-righteous gentlemen see the blue eyeshadow and black robes and take a detour, saving me a lot of trouble.",
    ["而且，那边有个失恋的醉鬼。钱包都等着了，你还等什么？"] = "Besides, there's a heartbroken drunk over there. The wallet is just waiting; what are you waiting for?",
    ["而且，那边的孩子手里不就是《大冒险家》？"] = "And isn't that child over there holding \"The Great Adventurer\"?",
    ["而为了这不合常理的爱，男女主角都自愿走向死亡，这让我更加不理解……如果不能共度余生，那么爱情的意义又是什么？"] = "And for this unreasonable love, the male and female protagonists voluntarily walk toward death, which makes me understand even less... If you can't spend the rest of your life together, then what is the meaning of love?",
    ["而他……他是一个孤独的人。我能感觉得出他从骨子里透出来的孤独。"] = "And he... he is a lonely person. I can feel the loneliness that permeates from his bones.",
    ["而他不在的话，你会怎么选呢……"] = "And if he weren't here, how would you choose...",
    ["而他们的故事，才刚刚开始……"] = "And their story has only just begun...",
    ["而他唯一给你留下的东西不见了，你会怎么做？"] = "And the only thing they left you went missing, what would you do?",
    ["而你"] = "And you,",
    ["而你……有这样的觉悟吗？"] = "And you... do you have such resolve?",
    ["而你……犹豫片刻，选择了拒绝（至少这次，是的）。"] = "And you... hesitate for a moment, then choose to refuse (at least this time, yes).",
    ["而你出现在我的意识里，难道……"] = "And you appearing in my consciousness, could it be...",
    ["而你，只需要运用自己现有的非凡能力，尝试打败我。"] = "And you, just use your existing Beyonder abilities to try and defeat me.",
    ["而促成这一切的我，高高在上，傲慢，冷漠。有时我会想，帝国时期的我，到底算不算我。"] = "And I, who facilitated all this, was high and mighty, arrogant, and cold. Sometimes I wonder, was the me of the imperial era really me?",
    ["而到了夜晚，整个教堂都会在女神的庇佑下陷入静谧。"] = "And at night, the entire cathedral falls into tranquility under the Goddess's protection.",
    ["而到最后，如果你真的达到那个高度，那么，你能与之并肩战斗的，就会是他。"] = "And in the end, if you truly reach that height, then the one you will be able to fight side-by-side with will be him.",
    ["而吸血鬼，多数是服食了“药师”途径某些特定魔药后发生可悲异变的人类怪物，它们只是渴血的奴隶。"] = "And vampires are mostly human monsters who have undergone tragic mutations after consuming certain specific potions of the 'Apothecary' pathway; they are just slaves thirsty for blood.",
    ["而大地……"] = "And the earth...",
    ["而她绝对不会允许我在家里碰一根烟叶，你懂吗？"] = "And she absolutely won't allow me to touch a single tobacco leaf at home, you understand?",
    ["而娜娅女士将自己淹死在了一个水盆里，嗯，用来洗脸的那种。"] = "And Ms. Naya drowned herself in a washbasin, um, the kind used for washing one's face.",
    ["而它的对手，那只黑白大狗看着就很愚蠢……"] = "And its opponent, that big black and white dog, looks so stupid...",
    ["而它的对手，那只黑白大狗看着就很愚蠢，有几次它甚至兴奋地和耗子玩了起来！"] = "And its opponent, that big black and white dog, looks so stupid. A few times it even excitedly started playing with the mice!",
    ["而封锁前，帽子帮的亨特和下街牵马的老马丁也来过湖畔。"] = "And before the blockade, Hunter from the Hat Gang and old Martin who leads horses on Lower Street also came to the lake.",
    ["而就算侥幸赢得了大笔财富，又会很快变成整日流连在“红剧场”中的蛆虫，哦——“红剧场”就是那儿最大的妓院名字。"] = "And even if you are lucky enough to win a large fortune, you will quickly become a maggot lingering in the 'Red Theater' all day—oh, 'Red Theater' is the name of the biggest brothel there.",
    ["而您躲闪时溅起来的泥点，恰好弄脏了我的裙子。"] = "And the mud you splashed when you dodged just happened to dirty my skirt.",
    ["而您，我们的弗兰奇先生，您真是一位优雅高尚的绅士。"] = "And you, our Mr. Franky, you really are an elegant and noble gentleman.",
    ["而我也该走向我的春天，继续我的相会与离别了。"] = "And I should also head toward my spring, to continue my meetings and partings.",
    ["而我以为您是想进行一场正经的学术讨论，看来是我弄错了。"] = "And I thought you wanted to have a serious academic discussion. It seems I was mistaken.",
    ["而我们用诗歌抚慰他们，用黑夜包容他们，用安宁解放他们。"] = "And we comfort them with poetry, embrace them with the night, and liberate them with peace.",
    ["而我们，每天能盼到的最好的事情，就是你这样的人肯把手伸进口袋，丢给我们一点什么，叫我们帮忙拎行李或者牵马、送信。"] = "And for us, the best thing we can hope for every day is that someone like you is willing to reach into their pocket and toss us something, asking us to help carry luggage, lead a horse, or deliver a letter.",
    ["而我剩下的这一半灵魂，也在分割时被他用非凡物品结合。我开始死而复生，就像“不死者”一样。"] = "And the remaining half of my soul was combined with a Sealed Artifact by him during the splitting. I began to undergo resurrection, just like an 'Undying'.",
    ["而我却被遗忘在原地……"] = "And yet I was forgotten where I stood...",
    ["而我和我孩子的体面衣服，\r\n都已经是半年前买的……"] = "And the decent clothes for me and my child\r\nwere all bought half a year ago...",
    ["而我已经在这个世界，找到生命中最珍贵的东西——亲人之间的感情。小黛西的纯真快乐，乔纳尔的善良温柔感染着我，我才逐渐融入和接纳这个世界。"] = "And I have found the most precious thing in life in this world—the affection between relatives. Little Daisy's innocence and joy, and Jonar's kindness and gentleness have infected me, and I have gradually integrated into and accepted this world.",
    ["而我相信，每一位顾客都拥有明亮的眼睛。"] = "And I believe that every customer has bright eyes.",
    ["而我，伙计们相信我，没有人比我更懂赚钱。"] = "And me, folks, believe me, no one knows how to make money better than I do.",
    ["而掌握这种非凡力量的人……或者动物，就是非凡者。"] = "And those who master this Extraordinary power... or animals, are Beyonders.",
    ["而推断条件最重要的是参考站点信息，通过推理提升你的成功率"] = "The most important thing for inferring conditions is to refer to station information and improve your success rate through deduction.",
    ["而收尸人的职责，就是护送他们体面地走完最后一程。"] = "And the duty of a Corpse Collector is to escort them through their final journey with dignity.",
    ["而最后一步，也是关键所在——"] = "And the final step, which is also the key—",
    ["而现在，你需要确定你的代号。愚者、正义、倒吊人除外。"] = "And now, you need to determine your codename. Except for The Fool, Justice, and The Hanged Man.",
    ["而现在，我只想征服你的心。 "] = "And now, I just want to conquer your heart.",
    ["而现在，我有能力让你们都处于烈焰之中。"] = "And now, I have the ability to place you all in the flames.",
    ["而现在，我要去加入值夜者了，这真是奇妙啊……"] = "And now, I'm going to join the Nighthawks. This is truly wonderful...",
    ["而这一切——都只是因为我轻轻推了一下。"] = "And all of this—was just because I gave it a gentle push.",
    ["而这些保留了人性的底片，将成为那位存在在沉睡中保持人性的助力。"] = "And these negatives that preserve humanity will become the help for that existence to maintain humanity while in deep sleep.",
    ["而这些纸……记录了所有谜题的答案。原来你也全都记住了？"] = "And these papers... record the answers to all the puzzles. So you remembered everything too?",
    ["而这本书里"] = "And within this book",
    ["而这种涉及非凡力量又不够严谨的东西，往往会造成更严重的危害。"] = "And things that involve Beyonder powers but lack rigor often lead to even more serious harm.",
    ["而这里的先生女士们并不十分欢迎我们……这也是应该的，我们没有好衣服，家里杂物很多，也没有多余的钱购买会客的糕点。"] = "And the gentlemen and ladies here don't really welcome us... This is also to be expected. We don't have good clothes, there is a lot of clutter in the house, and we don't have extra money to buy pastries for guests.",
    ["而这里，都是会长创造的魔法，像桃花源，杰克与豌豆……"] = "And here, all the magic is created by the president, like Peach Blossom Spring, Jack and the Beanstalk...",
    ["而这间公寓每周的租金才5苏勒6便士。"] = "And the weekly rent for this apartment is only 5 soli and 6 pence.",
    ["而那个可怜虫，眼里只有命运的赌桌，失去了身边的一切……"] = "And that poor wretch, his eyes only see the gambling table of fate, losing everything around him...",
    ["而那座古堡，是这里最为出名的地标，可以说拉姆德小镇的名字，正来源于拉姆德古堡。"] = "And that ancient castle is the most famous landmark here. You could say that the name of Lamud Town comes from Lamud Castle.",
