    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得红色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>子爵夫人</>。"] = "A specific marionette that can activate the Utopia Theater effect and connect to the Marionette Small Town. After use, you can obtain a red-quality marionette, <Highlight> Viscountess </>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>卡尔·埃德加</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Karl Edgar</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>尤朵拉</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Yodora</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>星之虫·咏</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Worm of Star - Chant</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>星之虫·斩</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Worm of Star - Slash</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>星之虫·术</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Worm of Star - Art</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>疗愈骑士</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Healing Knight</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>重斧骑士</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Heavy Axe Knight</>.",
    ["能够激活乌托邦剧院效果，连接秘偶小镇的特定秘偶。使用后可以获得金色品质的秘偶，<Highlight>铁壁骑士</>。"] = "Activates the Utopia Theater effect, connecting to a specific marionette from the Marionette Small Town. Upon use, you will obtain a gold-quality marionette: <Highlight>Iron Wall Knight</>.",
    ["能够精准调整蒸汽车的每一个齿轮与阀门，重塑载具的运行状态。掌握此印者，方为真正的驭械大师。"] = "Capable of precisely adjusting every gear and valve of a steam car, reshaping the vehicle's operating state. Only those who master this seal are true masters of machinery.",
    ["能对敌人造成极大的难以遏制的精神伤害，除此之外，只是加强了对各类武器的掌握。"] = "It can cause great, uncontrollable mental damage to enemies. Other than that, it only strengthens the mastery of various weapons.",
    ["能将实质的力量赋予抽象的知识，把力量赋予知识纳入信息流中获得其他序列能力。能利用灵界信息，影响七光，窥见众神秘密。"] = "Capable of endowing abstract knowledge with substantial power, and incorporating power into knowledge within the information stream to gain other sequence abilities. Capable of utilizing Spirit World information, influencing the Seven Lights, and peeking into the secrets of the gods.",
    ["能带我们去看看吗？ "] = "Can you take us to see it?",
    ["能帮多少，就帮多少。我们该行动了。"] = "Help as many as we can. We should act now.",
    ["能异常准确地掌握人心，似乎可以读到对方的念头。在读心者的面前，很难有秘密。"] = "Can grasp the human heart with unusual accuracy, seemingly able to read the other party's thoughts. In front of a Mind Reader, it is difficult to have secrets.",
    ["能引导、修改梦境，日积月累影响目标。可虚化身体藏入梦境，在梦境间跳跃，借此完成物理意义上的闪现穿梭。"] = "Able to guide and modify dreams, influencing targets over time. Can etherealize the body to hide in dreams, jump between dreams, and use this to complete physical flashes and shuttles.",
    ["能当面交易吗？"] = "Can we trade in person?",
    ["能想象出清香"] = "Can imagine the fragrance",
    ["能感受到身体内的<P_Yellow>非凡力量</>吗？尝试掌控它！"] = "Can you feel the <P_Yellow> Beyonder power </> inside your body? Try to control it!",
    ["能打开或关上所有与“门”概念相关的事物，使封印在一定时间内破除或加强，掌控空间与封印的完整权柄。"] = "Capable of opening or closing all things related to the concept of a 'door', causing seals to be broken or strengthened within a certain period of time. You control the complete authority of space and sealing.",
    ["能打跑那些坏蛋，让这里变得安全一点。"] = "To be able to drive those bad guys away and make this place a little safer.",
    ["能找到工作吗 ？"] = "Will I be able to find work?",
    ["能找回来就行，这件事结束了。"] = "As long as it's recovered, this matter is over.",
    ["能拜托你帮我打开另一个包裹吗？"] = "Could you please help me open the other package?",
    ["能捕捉未散的思绪片段。"] = "Can capture lingering fragments of thought.",
    ["能捕捉记忆与近未来的影像。"] = "Can capture images of memories and the near future.",
    ["能提升威严和体质，得到“扭曲”目标语言、行动和意图的能力，可以通过象征意义上的“贿赂”，让目标产生强烈的好感，使锁定的目标或周围一定区域出现“混乱”。"] = "It can enhance dignity and physique, granting the ability to \"Distort\" the target's language, actions, and intentions. Through symbolic \"bribery,\" one can make the target develop strong goodwill and cause \"chaos\" in the locked target or the surrounding area.",
    ["能撕裂黑暗与虚幻的利爪，象征破晓时分的决断与攻击性。"] = "Sharp Claws capable of tearing through darkness and illusion, symbolizing the decisiveness and aggression at dawn.",
    ["能撕裂黑暗，象征破晓的决断。"] = "Capable of tearing through darkness, symbolizing the determination of dawn.",
    ["能收到这份名流的邀约，今晚你就是最幸运的人之一。"] = "Being able to receive this invitation from the elite, you are one of the luckiest people tonight.",
    ["能放大诅咒源的频率。"] = "Can amplify the frequency of the Curse source.",
    ["能施展一些太阳领域内的法术和仪式，非常克制死尸和鬼魂。"] = "Can cast some spells and rituals within the Sun domain, which are very effective against corpses and ghosts.",
    ["能有你这样的学生，他会骄傲的。"] = "To have a student like you, he would be proud.",
    ["能有效的防御大多数进攻，并降低伤害，若能在敌人攻击命中时刚好释放防御，则能将敌人反制推开。"] = "Can effectively defend against most attacks and reduce damage. If released exactly when the enemy's attack hits, you can counter and push the enemy away.",
    ["能理解…… "] = "I can understand...",
    ["能理解，如果是我，我也会这样。"] = "I can understand, if it were me, I would do the same.",
    ["能直接影响目标，治疗对方的狂乱等问题，或是让对方变得狂乱，丧失理智。"] = "Can directly influence the target, treating the other party's frenzy and other problems, or making the other party become frenzied and lose their sanity.",
    ["能看得出来，你有一颗细腻又温柔的心。"] = "It's clear that you have a delicate and gentle heart.",
    ["能看穿伪装，或制造幻象。"] = "Can see through disguises or create illusions.",
    ["能站起来吗？我带你离开。"] = "Can you stand up? I'll take you away.",
    ["能给我介绍一下吗？"] = "Can you introduce it to me?",
    ["能给我说说这位卡斯伯特女士吗？"] = "Could you tell me about this Ms. Cuthbert?",
    ["能继续活下来，真是件好事，不是么？"] = "Being able to continue living is a good thing, isn't it?",
    ["能编织梦境并将目标拉入，精准把控自身心理使敌人难以预判。可分离身份变成真实之人，深入掌握“心理学隐身”与“瘟疫风暴”。"] = "Able to weave dreams and pull targets in, precisely controlling one's own psychology so that enemies are difficult to predict. Can separate identities to become a real person, deeply mastering \"Psychological Invisibility\" and \"Plague Storm\".",
    ["能自然投射幻觉的晶体。"] = "Crystals that can naturally project illusions.",
    ["能让人宁静，便于使用者植入暗示的安魂符咒.，黑夜教会的常见低阶符咒。"] = "Requiem charm that can make people calm and facilitate the user to implant suggestions. A common low-sequence charm of the Church of the Evernight.",
    ["能让你吃瘪，这倒是难得有趣的场景。"] = "Seeing you speechless is a rare and amusing sight.",
    ["能让你打起精神，继续传递“愚者”先生的教义，是我的荣幸。"] = "It is my honor to be able to cheer you up and continue to spread the teachings of Mr. Fool.",
    ["能让名字留在此处的，可以是在联赛的战火中挺身而出之人，也可以是将自身养成修炼到极致之人——当然，条条大路通非凡，方式并非唯一……"] = "Those who can leave their names here can be those who stepped forward in the flames of the league, or those who have cultivated themselves to the extreme—of course, all paths lead to the Mystic World, and the methods are not unique...",
    ["能让物质、意志乃至虚空衰败、崩溃、消亡，散发出黄昏来临万物衰败的气息，仅是存在本身就能让周围事物开始衰败。"] = "Capable of causing matter, will, and even the void to decay, collapse, and perish, emitting an aura of twilight and the decay of all things. Your mere existence is enough to cause surrounding things to begin to decay.",
    ["能让自己转化为象征符号，利用星界前往不同星球和世界，在维度间自由旅行，是穿梭于各界的行者。"] = "Capable of transforming yourself into symbols, utilizing the Astral World to travel to different planets and worlds, and moving freely between dimensions. You are a traveler who shuttles between various realms.",
    ["能讲述下死亡的过程吗？"] = "Can you describe the process of the deaths?",
    ["能请您帮我在海报上签名吗？"] = "Could you please help me sign the poster?",
    ["能起得来吗？我来晚了。"] = "Can you get up? I'm late.",
    ["能趴在这里休息一会儿想来比蜷缩在角落舒服多了……"] = "Lying here to rest for a while must be much more comfortable than curling up in a corner...",
    ["能辨认的就只有这么多了，剩下的只有一些非凡物品制作相关的笔记。"] = "That's all that can be identified; the rest are just notes related to the creation of Beyonder items.",
    ["能透过灵魂残影，捕捉未散的思绪片段。"] = "Capable of capturing lingering thought fragments through soul afterimages.",
    ["能量"] = "Energy",
    ["能量之源"] = "Source of Energy",
    ["能量充盈，一段时间后将会变身。"] = "Energy is full; it will transform after a period of time.",
    ["能量充盈，可以交互符文开始祈祷"] = "Energy full; you may interact with the runes to begin praying.",
    ["能量召唤"] = "Energy Summon",
    ["能量回复"] = "Energy Recovery",
    ["能量屏障"] = "Energy Barrier",
    ["能量数值"] = "Energy value",
    ["能量数值%s%s"] = "Energy value %s%s",
    ["能量无限，自身伤害提高10%，周围敌人数量每增加1名敌人，伤害额外提升10%，最大提升100%"] = "Energy is infinite, your own damage is increased by 10%. For every additional enemy nearby, damage is further increased by 10%, up to a maximum of 100%.",
    ["能量注入太多，蒸汽机就会#CanMove过载#。"] = "If too much energy is injected, the steam engine will #CanMove overload #.",
    ["能量流通#CanMove无#阻。"] = "Energy flows #CanMove without # obstruction.",
    ["能量涌动"] = "Energy Surge",
    ["能量源特效1"] = "Energy Source Effect 1",
    ["能量特效"] = "Energy Effect",
    ["能量球"] = "Energy Ball",
    ["能量球伤害调整buff"] = "Energy ball damage adjustment buff",
    ["能量球提示"] = "Energy Orb Hint",
    ["能量球范围伤害"] = "Energy ball area damage",
    ["能量球触碰到马车会造成高额伤害，全队玩家都要尽力<Highlight>阻挡能量球</>。"] = "Energy balls hitting the carriage will cause high damage; all team players must try their best to <Highlight>block the energy balls</>.",
    ["能量线查看提示-1-一样"] = "Energy line view prompt - 1 - Same",
    ["能量线查看提示-2-一样"] = "Energy Line View Hint - 2 - Same",
    ["能量过载"] = "Energy Overload",
    ["能量过载中"] = "Energy Overload in progress.",
    ["能量返还"] = "Energy Return",
    ["能闻到甜甜的香味，有些熟悉。"] = "I can smell a sweet fragrance, somewhat familiar.",
    ["能麻烦你帮我尝尝，这两样蔬菜吃起来有什么不同吗？"] = "Could you trouble yourself to taste these two vegetables and tell me what the difference is?",
    ["能，有时候是风，有时候是雨，有时候是阳光晒在背上那一阵温暖。您觉得是它，那就是它。"] = "Yes. Sometimes it's the wind, sometimes it's the rain, sometimes it's the warmth of the sun on your back. If you feel it's him, then it is him.",
    ["脆弱"] = "Fragile",
    ["脆弱的禁忌"] = "Fragile Taboo",
    ["脆弱的纸张，却能承载一次逃离致命伤害的机会——只有一次，也已足够。"] = "Fragile paper, yet it can carry a chance to escape fatal damage—only once, but that is enough.",
    ["脉动中凝聚着耐性与多角感知。"] = "Patience and multi-angle perception condensed in the pulse.",
    ["脉动频率极高，充满原始力量。"] = "Pulse frequency is extremely high, full of primitive power.",
    ["脏水"] = "Dirty Water",
    ["脏污遮罩"] = "Dirt Mask",
    ["脏词ACE审核"] = "Profanity ACE Review",
