    ["自身骨骼追踪其他单位"] = "Self skeleton tracks another unit.",
    ["自迷雾树人体内流出的液体，带有遮蔽与迷惑效果。"] = "Liquid flowing from inside a Mist Treant, with shielding and confusing effects.",
