    ["自选获得"] = "Selectable Obtain",
    ["自邪视器官溃裂处渗出，带有极强侵蚀性与梦境污染特质。"] = "Exuding from the ruptured evil eye organ, with extremely strong Erosion and dream corruption characteristics.",
    ["臭"] = "Stinky",
    ["臭**的***"] = "You son of a...",
    ["臭丫头，再啰嗦别怪我不客气！"] = "Stinky girl, don't blame me for being impolite if you keep nagging!",
    ["臭小子！呜呜……"] = "You brat! Sob...",
    ["臭小子，别不服气……嗝！"] = "You brat, don't be stubborn... *hic*!",
    ["臭死了！你有没有常识啊！"] = "It stinks! Do you have any common sense at all?!",
    ["臭死了！我真受够了这帮酒鬼！"] = "It stinks! I'm really fed up with these drunks!",
    ["臭老鼠快滚开！别碰我的果子！救命！谁来救救我！"] = "Stinky rat, get away! Don't touch my fruit! Help! Someone save me!",
    ["臭鸡蛋可不会影响我的心态。"] = "Rotten eggs won't affect my mood.",
    ["至于你，我们蒙泰格家族会给你一笔补偿，说吧，你要多少钱才愿意离开我美丽的表妹？"] = "As for you, our Montego Family will give you a sum of compensation. Tell me, how much money do you want to leave my beautiful cousin?",
    ["至于俱乐部年费……你可以报销。"] = "As for the club's annual fee... you can get it reimbursed.",
    ["至于关键台词，不妨致敬一下传奇场面……"] = "As for the key lines, why not pay tribute to a legendary scene...",
    ["至于其他的，我只能说，他对廷根的值夜者小队有非常深厚的感情。"] = "As for the rest, I can only say that he has very deep feelings for the Tingen Nighthawk squad.",
    ["至于她为什么会说话，这源于……一个小失误，一个所有养狗人都会犯的小错误：忘记自己的狗会开门。"] = "As for why she can talk, this stems from... a small mistake, a small mistake that all dog owners make: forgetting that their dog can open doors.",
    ["至于我……我会到恶龙酒吧去喝上两杯，为你送行。"] = "As for me... I'll go to the Evil Dragon Bar to have a couple of drinks to see you off.",
    ["至于我，整天和地下的伙伴打交道，早就习惯了。"] = "As for me, I deal with partners underground all day, so I'm used to it.",
    ["至于狂暴海的险流与风暴……有我在，船就不会迷失方向。"] = "As for the dangerous currents and storms of the Berserk Sea... with me here, the ship will not lose its way.",
    ["至于蘑菇，呕……那是邪恶的化身！早晚有一天，我要把所有蘑菇都毁掉！"] = "As for mushrooms, ugh... those are the avatar of evil! Sooner or later, I will destroy all mushrooms!",
    ["至于这位先生……别担心，我们会按照警署的规定安排好的。"] = "As for this gentleman... don't worry, we will arrange things according to the police station's regulations.",
    ["至于这位叫海纳斯的占卜者，很可能是某个<P_Yellow>隐秘组织</>成员。"] = "As for this diviner named Haines, he is likely a member of some <P_Yellow>secret organization</>.",
    ["至于这和黑夜女神有什么关系……我父亲和我还需要继续考古。"] = "As for what this has to do with the Evernight Goddess... my father and I still need to continue our archaeology.",
    ["至今没人见过犯人，但我觉得这只是某个学生的恶作剧罢了。"] = "No one has seen the culprit yet, but I think it's just a prank by some student.",
    ["至尊冕王"] = "Supreme Monarch",
    ["至尊小萝卜"] = "Supreme Little Radish",
    ["至尊小萝卜-交互按钮挂载"] = "Supreme Radish - Interaction Button Mounted",
    ["至尊小萝卜-赶快丢出去！"] = "Supreme Radish - Throw it away quickly!",
    ["至尊小萝卜个数"] = "Supreme Radish Count",
    ["至尊推拉刀法"] = "Supreme Push-Pull Blade Technique",
    ["至尊霹雳舞王"] = "Supreme Breakdance King",
    ["至少%d种其他建筑达到%d级"] = "At least %d other buildings have reached level %d",
    ["至少2种建筑物达到4级"] = "At least 2 types of buildings have reached level 4",
    ["至少……他刚才妥协了。换以前，他可能会撬门进来吧？"] = "At least... he compromised just now. In the past, he might have pried the door open, right?",
    ["至少一千五百年！"] = "At least 1,500 years!",
    ["至少一名非凡者靠近马车，马车才会移动。"] = "At least one Beyonder must be near the carriage for it to move.",
    ["至少不比现在差？"] = "At least it's not worse than now?",
    ["至少他们不用像咱这样，连养只老鼠都得算计面包屑。"] = "At least they don't have to be like us, having to count breadcrumbs even to raise a mouse.",
    ["至少他没有倒在战场上，我们有机会共度这段日子。"] = "At least he didn't fall on the battlefield, and we have a chance to spend this time together.",
    ["至少保留%s个防御/治疗型“投影”队友"] = "Keep at least %s defensive/healing \"projection\" teammates.",
    ["至少保留显示一类技能"] = "Keep at least one category of skills displayed.",
    ["至少击破一只心绪碎片，阻止卢娜吸收全部心绪"] = "Break at least one emotion fragment to prevent Luna from absorbing all emotions.",
    ["至少它让我知道……谁才真正有问题。"] = "At least it let me know... who is truly the problem.",
    ["至少我们还有那2便士。"] = "At least we still have those 2 pennies.",
    ["至少我给了钱。倒是你，你能为他们做什么？养他们一辈子？"] = "At least I gave them money. What about you? What can you do for them? Raise them for the rest of their lives?",
    ["至少我给了钱。倒是你，善心大发的{{先生|女士}}，你又能为他们做些什么呢？"] = "At least I paid. As for you, you benevolent {{Sir|Madam}}, what can you actually do for them?",
    ["至少我能和自己喜欢的事物朝夕相处，这也算是一种幸运吧！"] = "At least I can spend my days with the things I love; that's a kind of luck in itself!",
    ["至少比上次好。"] = "At least it's better than last time.",
    ["至少现在我们拥有了和平。"] = "At least now we have peace.",
    ["至少输入%d个字符！"] = "Please enter at least %d characters!",
    ["至少选择一项"] = "Select at least one item",
    ["至少，他绝非现在的您。"] = "At the very least, he is definitely not the you of today.",
    ["至少，你已经完全排除危险，不会有人再因此受到伤害，对吧？"] = "At least you have completely eliminated the danger, and no one else will be harmed because of this, right?",
    ["至少，你已经查明真相，不会有人再莫名死去，对吧？"] = "At least you have uncovered the truth, and no one else will die inexplicably, right?",
    ["至少，沉睡时我还会有许多美梦，醒来之后，也能看到寄给我的信件，告诉我发生过什么。"] = "At least, I still have many beautiful dreams when I sleep, and after I wake up, I can see the letters sent to me, telling me what has happened.",
    ["至此，你已站在沙盘之巅。罗塞尔不再俯视你，知识皇冠末页镌刻的历史，将是你的姓名。征服者与创造者，终已平等。"] = "Thus, you have reached the pinnacle of the sand table. Roselle no longer looks down upon you; the history engraved on the final page of the Crown of Knowledge will be your name. The Conqueror and the Creator are finally equal.",
    ["至臻"] = "Ultimate",
    ["至臻至美"] = "Ultimate Perfection",
    ["至诚至纯的灵魂，将如日光般神圣，赤心颂唱时，太阳也为你首肯。"] = "The most sincere and pure soul shall be as sacred as the sunlight; when the red heart chants, the sun also gives its consent for you.",
    ["至高守护印记"] = "Supreme Guard Mark",
    ["至高守护印记：获得330护盾。"] = "Supreme Guard Mark: Gain 330 Shield.",
    ["至高无上的女神，厄难与恐惧的女皇，安眠和寂静的领主。"] = "Supreme Goddess, Empress of Calamity and Horror, Lady of Slumber and Silence.",
    ["至高无上的黑夜女神！请原谅我的贪心！"] = "Supreme Evernight Goddess! Please forgive my greed!",
    ["致%s：\n      不必灰心，成长路上总是会出现像密修会小丑这样的强敌，只要没人因此牺牲，一切都还来得及。教会的档案中，对密修会有不少记载，或许能帮到你：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302102\">密修会小丑的记载</>\n      相信身边的队友，在充满疯狂的非凡道路上，他们是你足以信赖的后背，而你也要尽早成长起来，成为一名出色的值夜者。 不过也别那么有压力，我看得出，你有很多特别之处，就像是曾经的我，只是需要一些小小的方式激发出来。教会这里有一套非常适合你的方案，有助于实力的快速提升，我一并附在信末了，记得查阅。\n      去吧，新时代的主角，我看好你。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查阅</>"] = "To %s: \n Do not be discouraged. Strong enemies like the Clown of the Rose School of Thought will always appear on the path of growth. As long as no one sacrifices themselves because of this, everything is still in time. There are many records of the Rose School of Thought in the Church's archives, which might help you: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302102\">Records of the Clown of the Rose School of Thought</>\n Trust your teammates. On the path of the Extraordinary filled with madness, they are the backs you can rely on, and you also need to grow up as soon as possible to become an outstanding Nighthawk. But don't be under so much pressure. I can see that you have many special qualities, just like the old me, you just need some small ways to stimulate them. The Church has a plan that is very suitable for you, which will help you improve your strength quickly. I have attached it to the end of the letter, remember to check it. \n Go, protagonist of the new era, I believe in you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["致%s：\n      不必灰心，成长路上总是会出现像密修会小丑这样的强敌，只要没人因此牺牲，一切都还来得及。教会的档案中，对密修会有不少记载，或许能帮到你：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302105\">密修会小丑的记载</>\n      相信身边的队友，在充满疯狂的非凡道路上，他们是你足以信赖的后背，而你也要尽早成长起来，成为一名出色的值夜者。 不过也别那么有压力，我看得出，你有很多特别之处，就像是曾经的我，只是需要一些小小的方式激发出来。教会这里有一套非常适合你的方案，有助于实力的快速提升，我一并附在信末了，记得查阅。\n      去吧，新时代的主角，我看好你。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查阅</>"] = "To %s:\n      Do not be discouraged; strong enemies like the Clown of the Secret Order will always appear on the path of growth. As long as no one sacrifices themselves because of it, there is still time for everything. In the Church's archives, there are many records about the Secret Order that might help you: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302105\">Records of the Secret Order Clown</>\n      Trust your teammates; on the Beyonder path filled with madness, they are the backs you can rely on, and you must also grow up as soon as possible to become an outstanding Nighthawk. But do not feel too much pressure; I can see that you have many special qualities, just like I once did, and you just need a little way to stimulate them. The Church has a plan here that is very suitable for you and will help you improve your strength quickly. I have attached it to the end of the letter; remember to read it. \n      Go, protagonist of the new era; I believe in you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to read</>",
    ["致%s：\n      不必灰心，成长路上总是会出现像瑞尔·比伯这样的强敌，只要没人因此牺牲，一切都还来得及。教会的档案中，对瑞尔·比伯有不少记载，或许能帮到你：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302101\">瑞尔·比伯的记载</>\n      相信身边的队友，在充满疯狂的非凡道路上，他们是你足以信赖的后背，而你也要尽早成长起来，成为一名出色的值夜者。 不过也别那么有压力，我看得出，你有很多特别之处，就像是曾经的我，只是需要一些小小的方式激发出来。教会这里有一套非常适合你的方案，有助于实力的快速提升，我一并附在信末了，记得查阅。\n      去吧，新时代的主角，我看好你。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查阅</>"] = "To %s: \n Do not be discouraged. Strong enemies like Ray Bieber will always appear on the path of growth. As long as no one sacrifices themselves because of this, everything is still in time. There are many records of Ray Bieber in the Church's archives, which might help you: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302101\">Records of Ray Bieber</>\n Trust your teammates. On the path of the Extraordinary filled with madness, they are the backs you can rely on, and you also need to grow up as soon as possible to become an outstanding Nighthawk. But don't be under so much pressure. I can see that you have many special qualities, just like the old me, you just need some small ways to stimulate them. The Church has a plan that is very suitable for you, which will help you improve your strength quickly. I have attached it to the end of the letter, remember to check it. \n Go, protagonist of the new era, I believe in you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["致%s：\n      不必灰心，成长路上总是会出现像瑞尔·比伯这样的强敌，只要没人因此牺牲，一切都还来得及。教会的档案中，对瑞尔·比伯有不少记载，或许能帮到你：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302104\">瑞尔·比伯的记载</>\n      相信身边的队友，在充满疯狂的非凡道路上，他们是你足以信赖的后背，而你也要尽早成长起来，成为一名出色的值夜者。 不过也别那么有压力，我看得出，你有很多特别之处，就像是曾经的我，只是需要一些小小的方式激发出来。教会这里有一套非常适合你的方案，有助于实力的快速提升，我一并附在信末了，记得查阅。\n      去吧，新时代的主角，我看好你。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查阅</>"] = "To %s:\n      Do not be discouraged; strong enemies like Ray Bieber will always appear on the path of growth. As long as no one sacrifices themselves because of it, there is still time for everything. In the Church's archives, there are many records about Ray Bieber that might help you: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302104\">Records of Ray Bieber</>\n      Trust your teammates; on the Beyonder path filled with madness, they are the backs you can rely on, and you must also grow up as soon as possible to become an outstanding Nighthawk. But do not feel too much pressure; I can see that you have many special qualities, just like I once did, and you just need a little way to stimulate them. The Church has a plan here that is very suitable for you and will help you improve your strength quickly. I have attached it to the end of the letter; remember to read it. \n      Go, protagonist of the new era; I believe in you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to read</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被乌黯魔狼屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302126\">乌黯魔狼的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by the Dark Demonic Wolf, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302126\">Records of the Dark Demonic Wolf</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被分身屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302125\">阿蒙分身的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by the Avatar, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302125\">Records of the Amon Avatar</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被咕噜屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302124\">咕噜的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by Gulu, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302124\">Records of Gulu</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被梅迪奇和奥赛库斯屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生就和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302127\">救赎蔷薇的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by Medici and Ausecus, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302127\">Records of the Rose Redemption</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被米尔贡根屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302128\">米尔贡根的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by Milgongen, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302128\">Records of Milgongen</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被萨斯利尔屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302129\">萨斯利尔的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by Sasrir, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302129\">Records of Sasrir</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
    ["致亲爱的顾客：\n当你看到这行字的时候，我已经登上了前往贝克兰德的列车，原谅我的不辞而别。虽然我也很喜欢在廷根生活的日子，但是新的生活总要开始。"] = "To my dear customer:\nBy the time you see this, I will have already boarded the train to Backlund. Forgive me for leaving without saying goodbye. Although I enjoyed my time living in Tingen, a new life must begin.",
