    ["舞王狒哥-PVE BOSS"] = "Dancing King Baboon Brother - PVE BOSS",
    ["舞王狒哥传送到舞池中央舞蹈，给每名玩家挂上<Disable>不同颜色的</>音符能量，同时在场地召唤出<Disable>三种不同颜色的舞池</>，<Disable>计时结束后</>会释放出闪电能量攻击所有玩家，并对走错的玩家造成巨量伤害。"] = "The Dancing King Baboon Brother teleports to the center of the dance floor to dance, hanging <Disable> different colored </> note energy on each player, while summoning <Disable> three different colored dance floors </> on the field. <Disable> After the timer ends </>, it will release lightning energy to attack all players, dealing massive damage to those who walked to the wrong floor.",
    ["舞王狒哥传送到舞池中央，举臂高呼，渴求更强劲的音乐，并召唤自己的狒狒舞团，玩家需要<Disable>击杀小狒狒</>获取<Disable>音符掉落物</>，并根据<Disable>乐谱顺序</>拾取音符。"] = "The Dancing King Baboon Brother teleports to the center of the dance floor, raises his arms and shouts, craving more powerful music, and summons his baboon dance troupe. Players need to <Disable> kill the small baboons </> to obtain <Disable> note drops </> and pick up the notes according to the <Disable> musical score sequence </>.",
    ["舞王狒哥将玩家传送到舞池中央，一边跳舞一边<Disable>做出不同动作</>，玩家需要根据动作提示，跳起不同的舞蹈，整个阶段一旦<Disable>所有人累计跳错3次</>，狒哥将会懊恼气愤，对玩家造成<Disable>巨量伤害</>。"] = "The Dancing King Baboon Brother teleports the players to the center of the dance floor. While dancing, he <Disable>performs various actions</>. Players must follow the prompts to perform the corresponding dances. Once <Disable>the group makes a total of 3 mistakes</> during this phase, the Baboon Brother will become frustrated and angry, dealing <Disable>massive damage</> to the players.",
    ["舞王狒哥狂暴"] = "Dancing King Baboon Brother Berserk",
    ["舞王狒哥碎片"] = "Dancing King Baboon Brother Fragment",
    ["舞王狒哥逐渐变得亢奋，连续点名不同玩家冲锋，每次冲锋都对路径上的玩家<Disable>造成控制伤害</>，并在身后留下一条会造成持续伤害的<Disable>火焰路径</>。"] = "The Dancing King Baboon Brother gradually becomes excited, continuously targeting different players to charge. Each charge <Disable> deals control damage </> to players in the path and leaves behind a <Disable> fire path </> that deals continuous damage.",
    ["舞王狒哥释放三色舞池时在场上召唤两个小狒狒，需要各派一个玩家与之交互，交互后玩家会变成小狒狒，每个变成小狒狒的玩家都能够看见一种颜色的舞池，两个小狒狒需要互相交流找出三种颜色舞池的分布并告诉其他玩家。"] = "When the Dancing King Baboon Brother releases the Three-Color Dance Floor, he summons two small baboons on the field. One player must be sent to interact with each. After interaction, the players will turn into small baboons. Each player who turns into a small baboon can see one color of the dance floor. The two small baboons need to communicate with each other to find the distribution of the three colors of the dance floor and tell the other players.",
