    ["船上有一个#Space2#"] = "There is a #Space2# on the ship",
    ["船上的会计成了<P_Yellow>银行经理</>，港口的检察官被提拔成了<P_Yellow>王室检察官</>，而贵族青年不仅迎娶了自己美丽的表妹，还当上了王国<P_Yellow>议员</>。"] = "The ship's accountant became a <P_Yellow>bank manager</>, the port's prosecutor was promoted to <P_Yellow>Royal Prosecutor</>, and the young nobleman not only married his beautiful cousin but also became a <P_Yellow>member of parliament</> for the kingdom.",
    ["船上的会计成了银行经理，港口的检察官被提拔成了王室检察官，而贵族青年不仅迎娶了自己美丽的表妹，还当上了王国议员。"] = "The accountant on the ship became a bank manager, the port inspector was promoted to a royal inspector, and the young nobleman not only married his beautiful cousin but also became a member of the kingdom's parliament.",
