    ["艾比·"] = "Abby ",
    ["艾比从小就喜欢跟着你在这跑来跑去的，原来是喜欢研究这些。"] = "Abby has loved following you around here since she was a child; it turns out she likes studying these things.",
    ["艾比信上有没有说她什么时候回来？"] = "Did Abby say in her letter when she's coming back?",
    ["艾比昨晚来信了！"] = "Abby wrote a letter last night!",
    ["艾比昨晚来信，最近凛冬郡的天气好，教授带她们外出勘探，说是……为了康斯顿煤钢联合体去勘探地质。"] = "Abby wrote last night that the weather in Winter County has been good lately, and the professor took them out for exploration, saying it was... to explore the geology for the Coniston Coal and Steel Syndicate.",
