    ["艾玛，对不起……对不起。我们会……我们会回来救你的，一定……"] = "Emma, I'm sorry... I'm sorry. We will... we will come back to save you, definitely...",
    ["艾玛，我们来了！撑住！"] = "Emma, we're coming! Hold on!",
    ["艾玛：<P_Heart>（剧烈咳嗽）</>咳……咳……有人吗，救救我……"] = "Emma: <P_Heart>(coughing violently)</> Cough... cough... is anyone there, save me...",
