    ["艾米丽想讲个新故事"] = "Emily wants to tell a new story",
    ["艾米丽是个小作家，她想通过触摸这个世界，把感受到的样子写下来，讲给那些同样看不见的人听。"] = "Emily is a little writer. She wants to touch the world, write down how it feels, and tell it to those who also cannot see.",
