    ["苜蓿号的事情代罚者和值夜者已经介入调查，怀疑特里斯是序列8“教唆者”，已经发布了通缉令。"] = "The Punishers and Nighthawks have already intervened in the investigation of the Clover incident. They suspect Trissy is a Sequence 8 'Instigator' and have already issued a warrant.",
