    ["若"] = "Ruo",
    ["若 bIDInBBV 为 true, 则调用黑板值 skillid\n注意：技能相关监听（OnSkillCast、OnSkillTriggerCD）会写黑板值"] = "If bIDInBBV is true, call the blackboard value skillid\n Note: Skill-related listeners (OnSkillCast, OnSkillTriggerCD) will write to the blackboard",
    ["若%s内响应的玩家数量未达要求，则俱乐部创建失败，将返还部分创建费用。"] = "If the number of responding players does not meet the requirements within %s, the Club creation fails, and a portion of the creation fee will be refunded.",
    ["若两条线索关联可推理出新的线索"] = "If two clues are related, a new clue can be deduced.",
    ["若为 true，则是装载数据重载；若为 false 为热替换.。\n若为重载，则原技能被认为卸载，同时替换装配界面描述；\n若为热替换，原技能不被认为卸载，不会替换描述"] = "If true, it is a data reload; if false, it is a hot swap. \n If it is a reload, the original skill is considered uninstalled, and the assembly interface description is replaced; \n if it is a hot swap, the original skill is not considered uninstalled, and the description is not replaced.",
    ["若为true，前面4个参数无效，但白名单优先级高于全部禁用"] = "If true, the first 4 parameters are invalid, but the whitelist priority is higher than disabling all.",
    ["若云"] = "Ruoyun",
    ["若仅命中了单个敌人，则会额外对其进行一次伤害为60%的斩击。"] = "If only a single enemy is hit, an additional slash dealing 60% damage is performed on them.",
    ["若伊·"] = "Ruoyi ",
    ["若你准备好加入我们了，欢迎再来找我，春夜舞会的大门随时为你敞开。"] = "If you are ready to join us, you are welcome to come back to me; the doors of the Spring Night Ball are always open to you.",
    ["若你的心已做好准备，欢迎再来此处，安魂诗社随时欢迎你的加入。"] = "If your heart is prepared, you are welcome to return here; the Requiem Poetry Society is always open to your joining.",
    ["若兮"] = "Ruoxi",
    ["若再次被首领吞噬,会承受极高的消化伤害。"] = "If swallowed by the boss again, you will suffer extremely high digestion damage.",
    ["若冰"] = "Ruobing",
    ["若冲刺方向<Highlight>靠近</>安西娅，需吸引安西娅<Highlight>远离</>该位置。"] = "If the dash direction <Highlight>brings you close to</> Anthea, you must lure Anthea <Highlight>away from</> that position.",
    ["若君"] = "Ruojun",
    ["若含"] = "Ruohan",
    ["若墨"] = "Ruomo",
    ["若多年以后再相聚，我该如何见你？以眼泪，以沉默。"] = "If we meet again many years from now, how should I greet you? With tears, with silence.",
    ["若娜·"] = "Ruona ",
    ["若宇"] = "Ruoyu",
    ["若宸"] = "Ruochen",
    ["若对折扣力度不满意，3秒内可以再次释放技能重新讨价还价。"] = "If you are not satisfied with the discount, you can cast the skill again within 3 seconds to bargain again.",
    ["若尘"] = "Ruochen",
    ["若尝过她唇间的酒，谁还愿意清醒着回归！"] = "If one has tasted the wine from her lips, who would still be willing to return sober!",
