    ["若彤"] = "Ruotong",
    ["若征服旌旗被攻占，夺得尾刀方将获得更多神选积分。"] = "If the Banner of Conquest is captured, the side that lands the final blow will receive more God-Chosen points.",
    ["若忘记题面，可查看背包内的纸条。"] = "If you forget the question, you can check the note in your Inventory.",
    ["若思"] = "Ruosi",
    ["若怡"] = "Ruoyi",
    ["若您喜欢浪漫，可以看看右手边的那些项链与发冠。"] = "If you prefer romance, you can take a look at the necklaces and tiaras on the right.",
    ["若您是个浪漫的人，可以看看右手边的那些项链与头梳。"] = "If you are a romantic person, you can take a look at the necklaces and hair combs on the right.",
    ["若您是个潮流的人，可以看看左手边的珠宝们。"] = "If you are a trendy person, you can take a look at the jewelry on the left.",
    ["若您更在意潮流，可以看看左手边的珠宝们。"] = "If you care more about trends, you can take a look at the jewelry on the left.",
    ["若您渴望成为政府雇员，请选择我们的夜间学堂！\n识字就能来，结业保送市政厅考试！\n\n<Highlight>开课详情</>\n◆每逢二四六夜间授课\n◆学费1磅12苏勒\n\n月月准点发金镑，刮风下雨不下岗。\n高薪体面又轻松，码头扛包百倍强！\n\n<Highlight>水仙花街6号\"金笔杆\"商行</>报名，名额只收<Mark id=\"#159_R\"> 30人 </>，手慢明年挤破头！"] = "If you aspire to become a government employee, please choose our night school! \n If you can read, you can come. Graduation guarantees a recommendation for the City Hall exam! \n \n <Highlight> Course Details </> \n ◆ Classes held on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday nights \n ◆ Tuition: 1 pound 12 soli \n \n Receive gold pounds on time every month, no layoffs regardless of wind or rain. \n High-paying, decent, and easy; a hundred times better than carrying bags at the docks! \n \n <Highlight> 6 Daffodil Street, \"Golden Pen\" Firm </> Registration, only <Mark id=\"#159_R\"> 30 spots </>, sign up fast or you'll be squeezed out next year!",
    ["若想单人使用视频创作，可退出团队"] = "If you wish to use video creation solo, you may exit the team.",
    ["若拉·"] = "Ruola ",
    ["若持有防御力增加效果将获得防罩效果，若持有防御力增加效果将获得防护罩效果，吸收相当于体力上<HighLight>20.0%</>的伤害持续<HighLight>15</>秒"] = "If you have a defense increase effect, you will gain a Protective Shield effect. If you have a defense increase effect, you will gain a Protective Shield effect, absorbing damage equivalent to <HighLight> 20.0% </> of your health for <HighLight> 15 </> seconds.",
