    ["苹果骑士-冲锋光环"] = "Apple Knight - Charge Aura",
    ["苹果骑士<Disable>先后朝两名玩家</>发动冲锋，对路径上的所有人造成<Disable>巨额可分摊伤害</>。"] = "The Apple Knight <Disable>successively charges at two players</>, dealing <Disable>massive shareable damage</> to everyone in his path.",
    ["苹果骑士冲锋表现"] = "Apple Knight Charge Performance",
    ["苹果骑士即将爆发，快分散寻找矮人救援区！"] = "Apple Knight is about to explode; disperse quickly to find the dwarf rescue area!",
    ["苹果骑士召唤大量的苹果炸弹，准备<Disable>轰炸全场</>。小矮人们会从四面八方赶来支援，在<Disable>不同位置生成小矮人安全区</>。"] = "The Apple Knight summons a large number of Apple Bombs, preparing to <Disable>bomb the entire field</>. Dwarves will arrive from all directions to provide support, generating Dwarf Safe Zones at <Disable>different locations</>.",
    ["苹果骑士往全场抛洒毒药，倒计时结束后<Disable>秒杀全场玩家</>。与此同时每个玩家身上都种下毒种，倒计时结束后会引发<Disable>小范围爆炸</>。"] = "The Apple Knight scatters poison across the field; after the countdown ends, he <Disable>instantly kills all players</>. At the same time, a poison seed is planted on each player, which will trigger a <Disable>small-range explosion</> after the countdown ends.",
    ["苹果骑士武器交互按钮"] = "Apple Knight Weapon Interaction Button",
    ["苹果骑士狂暴"] = "Apple Knight Berserk",
    ["苹果骑士破防了，趁机输出！"] = "Apple Knight is armor-broken; take the opportunity to deal damage!",
    ["苹果骑士筛选buff"] = "Apple Knight Filter Buff",
    ["苹果骑士踩中陷阱计数"] = "Apple Knight Trap Trigger Count",
    ["苹果骑士踩到陷阱了，还差1个！"] = "Apple Knight stepped on a trap; 1 more to go!",
    ["苹果骑士踩到陷阱了，还差2个！"] = "Apple Knight stepped on a trap; 2 more to go!",
    ["苹果骑士选中两名玩家，在短暂延迟后产生范围伤害，并且<Disable>朝十字方向弹射再次造成范围伤害</>。被选中的两个玩家会变成<Disable>即将爆炸的苹果</>，倒计时结束后引爆全场。"] = "The Apple Knight selects two players, dealing area damage after a short delay, and <Disable>bounces in a cross pattern to deal area damage again</>. The two selected players will turn into <Disable>exploding apples</>, which will detonate and hit the entire field after the countdown ends.",
    ["苹果骑士释放旋风斩，<Disable>持续追杀玩家</>。场地上会出现多个捕兽夹，诱导苹果骑士<Disable>踩到3个捕兽夹后可以将其绊倒</>，并使用苹果骑士的<Disable>大锤对它造成致命打击</>。"] = "The Apple Knight releases a Whirlwind Slash, <Disable>continuously chasing players</>. Multiple bear traps will appear on the field; luring the Apple Knight to <Disable>step on 3 bear traps will trip him</>, allowing players to use the Apple Knight's <Disable>warhammer</> to deal a fatal blow.",
