    ["莉莉，你是我最好的朋友，我就喜欢和你一起玩。"] = "Lily, you're my best friend, and I just love playing with you.",
    ["莉莉，快点！帮我……救救我的丈夫！"] = "Lily, hurry! Help me... save my husband!",
    ["莉莉：{{他|她}}看到了！{{他|她}}看到了红线的事！不能让{{他|她}}活着离开！"] = "Lily: {{ He | She }} saw it! {{ He | She }} saw the red thread! We can't let {{ him | her }} leave alive!",
    ["莉莉：但……他的律令护盾几乎无敌，连子弹都能弹开……"] = "Lily: But... his Shield of Order is almost invincible; it can even deflect bullets...",
    ["莉莉：再见了……守护者……"] = "Lily: Goodbye... Guardian...",
    ["莉莉：别为我难过。这是我，想要的结局。作为“莉莉”……而不是“邦尼的碎片”。"] = "Lily: Don't be sad for me. This is the ending I wanted. As 'Lily'... not as 'a fragment of Bonnie'.",
    ["莉莉：她走了，我也要，归于虚无了……"] = "Lily: She is gone, and I, too, must return to nothingness...",
    ["莉莉：这是解脱，邦尼……或者说，本杰明。你终于可以停下来了。"] = "Lily: This is a release, Bonnie... or should I say, Benjamin. You can finally stop.",
    ["莉莉：金狼的势力扩张得太快了。再这样下去，他迟早会吞并我们的地盘。"] = "Lily: The Golden Wolf's influence is expanding too quickly. If this continues, he will swallow our territory sooner or later.",
