    ["莫比乌斯环"] = "Mobius Strip",
    ["莫比乌斯环，又称“无尽的迷途”。 特殊工艺打造的长方形金箔纸，一端扭转180度后，与另一端相接，形成只有一个平面的环形。"] = "Mobius strip, also known as the \"Endless Lost Path.\" A rectangular gold foil paper made with special craftsmanship, one end is twisted 180 degrees and then connected to the other end, forming a ring with only one plane.",
