    ["莫蒂先生"] = "Mr. Morti",
    ["莫蒂夫人"] = "Mrs. Morti",
    ["莫蒂默"] = "Mortimer",
    ["莫蒙特校长在课上讲的图和布置的课后习题，他说这部分知识点是必考。"] = "The diagrams Principal Momont talked about in class and the homework he assigned. He said this part of the knowledge is definitely on the exam.",
    ["莫逆之交"] = "Kindred Spirits",
    ["莫里"] = "Mori",
    ["莫里1"] = "Mori 1",
    ["莫里2"] = "Mori 2",
    ["莫里先生……似乎……"] = "Mr. Mori... seems...",
    ["莫里先生，您在干什么？"] = "Mr. Mori, what are you doing?",
    ["莫里和马丁是一对邻居，莫里开肉摊，马丁卖蔬菜，他们相看两厌，吵了二十年。"] = "Mori and Martin were neighbors. Mori ran a meat stall, Martin sold vegetables. They couldn't stand the sight of each other and had been arguing for twenty years.",
    ["莫里斯"] = "Morris",
    ["莫里斯·"] = "Maurice ",
    ["莫里斯交谈采集物"] = "Morris Conversation Collectible",
    ["莫里森"] = "Morrison",
    ["莫里森先生，您的好意我心领了。但现在不同了，哥温顿二世陛下下令让银行对小商人友善多了。"] = "Mr. Morrison, I appreciate your kindness. But things are different now; His Majesty Covington II has ordered banks to be much friendlier to small merchants.",
    ["莫雅"] = "Moya",
    ["莫雷"] = "Morey",
    ["莫雷的锅"] = "Moretti's Pot",
    ["莫雷蒂一家……"] = "The Moretti family...",
    ["莫雷蒂一家决定搬到水仙花街2号，\n一趟又一趟地来回水仙花街和铁十字街，\n他们看着彼此脸上的灰色尘埃和肮脏污迹发笑。"] = "The Moretti family decides to move to 2 Daffodil Street, \ntraveling back and forth between Daffodil Street and Iron Cross Street time and time again, \nthey laugh at the gray dust and dirty smudges on each other's faces.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生 请跟我来"] = "Mr. Moretti, please follow me.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，你好。我叫克里斯蒂娜，这位是我的外甥女——"] = "Mr. Moretti, hello. My name is Christina, and this is my niece—",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，你这么快就听说了？"] = "Mr. Moretti, you heard about it so quickly?",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，刚刚那一局很精彩啊。"] = "Mr. Moretti, that last game was brilliant.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，太感谢您了！这、这真是我见过最神奇的占卜！"] = "Mr. Moretti, thank you so much! This, this is truly the most magical divination I have ever seen!",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，您是想占卜，还是加入我们俱乐部？"] = "Mr. Moretti, are you here for a divination, or to join our club?",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，我们想占卜一个人的下落。名字是兰尔乌斯，他卷走了超过1万镑的金钱。"] = "Mr. Moretti, we want to divine the whereabouts of someone. His name is Ince Zangwill, and he has swindled over 10,000 pounds.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，有一封寄给你们的<P_Yellow>邀请函</>。"] = "Mr. Moretti, there is an <P_Yellow>invitation letter</> addressed to you.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，请坐下聊吧。"] = "Mr. Moretti, please sit down and let's talk.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，请跟我来，队长今天值守<P_Yellow>查尼斯门</>，不能离开。"] = "Mr. Moretti, please come with me. The captain is guarding the <P_Yellow>Chanis Gate</> today and cannot leave.",
    ["莫雷蒂先生，请跟我来，队长今天值守查尼斯门，不能离开。"] = "Mr. Moretti, please come with me. The Captain is on duty at the Chanis Gate today and cannot leave.",
    ["莫雷蒂家最近的生活费，总额并不算多……"] = "The Moretti family's recent living expenses, the total amount is not much...",
    ["莫雷蒂家的账本"] = "Moretti Family Ledger",
    ["莫雷蒂家的长兄，克莱恩与梅丽莎的哥哥。原为廷根市进出口公司文员，后通过考试成为贝克兰德财政部政府雇员。务实、幽默、嘴硬心软，是撑起家庭的顶梁柱，喜欢用\"卷毛狒狒\"调侃社会现象，对物价和房租格外敏感"] = "The eldest brother of the Moretti family, Klein and Melissa’s brother. Originally a clerk at a Tingen import and export company, he later became a government employee in the Backlund Ministry of Finance after passing an exam. Pragmatic, humorous, and tough-mouthed but soft-hearted, he is the pillar of the family. He likes to use “Curly-Haired Baboon” to ridicule social phenomena and is particularly sensitive to prices and rent.",
    ["莫雷蒂家（一）"] = "The Moretti Family (I)",
    ["莫雷蒂家（三）"] = "The Moretti Family (III)",
    ["莫雷蒂家（二）"] = "The Moretti Family (II)",
    ["莫雷蒂家（四）"] = "The Moretti Family (IV)",
    ["莫雷蒂家？"] = "The Moretti family?",
