    ["获得装备%s"] = "Obtained Equipment %s",
    ["获得角色的简略信息，填AvatarActorID"] = "Get brief character info; enter AvatarActorID.",
    ["获得角色的详细信息，填AvatarActorID"] = "Get detailed character info; enter AvatarActorID.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得占卜家序列的扮演技能。\n一条银质链子，末端悬挂着磨圆的陨铁碎片，中间镶嵌一颗从古代遗迹中取出的水晶。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Seer Sequence. \n A silver chain with a rounded meteorite fragment hanging at the end, embedded with a crystal taken from ancient ruins in the middle.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得占星人序列的扮演技能。\n一颗暗蓝色的水晶球，其内部漂浮着不断运动的星光与微弱云雾。即使闭眼也能感受到它的微弱脉动，像在呼吸。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Astrologer Sequence. \n A dark blue crystal ball with starlight and faint mist moving inside. Even with eyes closed, one can feel its faint pulse, as if it were breathing.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得太阳神官序列的扮演技能。\n刻印太阳徽记的金片，可在祈祷中释放圣焰。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Sun Priest Sequence. \n A gold piece engraved with the sun emblem, which can release holy flames during prayer.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得学徒序列的扮演技能。\n一把古铜钥匙，插入任何门锁时，门另一侧会通往随机位置。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Apprentice Sequence. \n An antique bronze key; when inserted into any door lock, the other side of the door will lead to a random location.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得小丑序列的扮演技能。\n一只由深紫与金色布料拼接而成的奇形圆篓，表面绣着歪曲的笑脸与象征混乱的螺旋纹。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Clown Sequence. \n A strange round basket made of dark purple and gold fabric, with a crooked smiley face and a spiral pattern symbolizing chaos embroidered on the surface.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得巫师序列的扮演技能。\n刻有繁复符文的圆盘，可用于进行仪式。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Wizard Sequence. \n A disc engraved with complex runes, which can be used to perform rituals.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得心理医生序列的扮演技能。\n一支细长金属笔，书写在空气中的符号会进入目标精神，调整其情绪状态。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Psychologist Sequence. \n A slender metal pen; symbols written in the air will enter the target's mind, adjusting their emotional state.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得戏法大师序列的扮演技能。\n看似普通的黑木方盒，却带有半透明的光泽，盒面镶嵌着七颗细小的彩色宝石。从盒中取出的物品总是带着不真实的感觉，偶尔会在空气中化为幻象。盒子整体散发淡淡香气，但有时香气会变为令人困惑的金属味。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Trickmaster Sequence. \n A seemingly ordinary black wooden box with a translucent luster, inlaid with seven tiny colored gemstones. Items taken from the box always carry a sense of unreality and occasionally turn into illusions in the air. The box emits a faint fragrance, but sometimes the scent turns into a confusing metallic smell.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得战士序列的扮演技能。\n一双厚重铁靴，踩击地面时可制造震动与裂纹。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Warrior Sequence. \n A pair of heavy iron boots that can create vibrations and cracks when stomping on the ground.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得格斗学者序列的扮演技能。\n一副古铜色眼镜，镜片呈淡金色，边框刻有猎隼和锋利爪子的浮雕。佩戴时视野会略微缩窄，但所有人影似乎被分割成不同色块与流动线条。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Fighting Scholar Sequence. \n A pair of antique bronze glasses with pale gold lenses and frames engraved with reliefs of a hunting falcon and sharp claws. When worn, the field of vision narrows slightly, but all silhouettes appear to be divided into different color blocks and flowing lines.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得格斗家序列的扮演技能。\n能增加力量与爆发的护腕。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Fighter Sequence. \n Bracers that can increase strength and burst.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得歌颂者序列的扮演技能。\n金色鸟羽，握在手中时会散发温暖光辉。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Bard Sequence. \n A golden bird feather that emits a warm glow when held in the hand.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得武器大师序列的扮演技能。\n腰带上有微型符文，可在表演时幻化出各种武器。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Weapon Master Sequence. \n The belt has micro-runes that can manifest various weapons during a performance.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得祈光人序列的扮演技能。\n一个古老手灯，可将目标身上覆盖淡金光辉。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Light Seeker Sequence. \n An ancient hand lamp that can cover the target in a pale golden glow.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得窥秘人序列的扮演技能。\n折叠的小纸片，在手中会显示隐秘信息。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Mystery Pryer Sequence. \n A small folded piece of paper that reveals hidden information in one's hand.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得观众序列的扮演技能。\n一面小巧铜镜，映照出的不是人的外貌，而是其心情对应的色彩与光晕形态。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Spectator Sequence. \n A small copper mirror that reflects not a person's appearance, but the colors and light halos corresponding to their mood.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得读心者序列的扮演技能。\n暗色戒指，佩戴时，可听到目标心中正在想的情绪内容。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Mind Reader Sequence. \n A dark ring that, when worn, allows you to hear the emotional content the target is thinking about.",
    ["获得该神奇物品后，将获得魔术师序列的扮演技能。\n细长的纸片折叠成的人形，眼部用墨水画出漩涡符号。"] = "After obtaining this mystical item, you will gain the Acting Skill of the Magician Sequence. \n A humanoid figure folded from a slender strip of paper, with vortex symbols drawn in ink on the eyes.",
