    ["蒙巴顿木工坊匠人"] = "Mountbatten Woodworking Shop Craftsman",
    ["蒙特利"] = "Monterey",
    ["蒙特利20位移"] = "Monterey 20 displacement",
    ["蒙特利4"] = "Monterey 4",
    ["蒙特利——"] = "Monterey—",
    ["蒙特利不可置信地瘫倒在地，然后爬向了光点坠下的地方，试图把它们都收集起来。"] = "Monterey collapsed to the ground in disbelief, then crawled toward where the points of light had fallen, attempting to collect them all.",
    ["蒙特利似乎清醒了……"] = "Monterey seems to have sobered up...",
    ["蒙特利大师的妹妹伊琳住在弗拉德街13号，去拜访一下她吧。"] = "Master Monterey's sister, Irene, lives at 13 Vlad Street. Let's go pay her a visit.",
    ["蒙特利失控了，他已经不再是你哥哥了。"] = "Monterey has lost control; he is no longer your brother.",
    ["蒙特利机械师1"] = "Monterey Mechanic 1",
    ["蒙特利激动位移"] = "Monterey excited displacement",
    ["蒙特利留下的面具"] = "The mask left behind by Monterey",
    ["蒙特利的来信"] = "Letter from Monterey",
    ["蒙特利突然从怀中里拿出了真正的报幕员，说着就往伊琳脸上扣去。然而报幕员从他手中挣脱开，啪的一下裂成了无数光点。"] = "Monterey suddenly pulled the real Announcer from his bosom and, as he spoke, moved to press it onto Irene's face. However, the Announcer broke free from his grasp and shattered into countless specks of light with a snap.",
    ["蒙特利老年"] = "Monterey Elderly",
    ["蒙特利走位"] = "Monterey Movement",
    ["蒙特利起身"] = "Monterey stands up",
    ["蒙特利还是离开了廷根。第三幕就要开启了，有点担心这对兄妹……"] = "Monterey still left Tingen. The third act is about to begin; I'm a bit worried about those two siblings...",
    ["蒙特利青年"] = "Monterey Youth",
    ["蒙特利青年2"] = "Monterey youth 2",
    ["蒙特利，你以为我看不出来吗？！最中间那张面具，和——和她当时的表情一模一样！"] = "Monterey, do you think I can't tell?! That mask right in the middle—it looks exactly like the expression she had back then!",
    ["蒙特利，我永远也无法原谅你了。"] = "Monterey, I can never forgive you.",
    ["蒙特利，离那些光点远点，你承受不住那些析出的非凡特性！"] = "Monterey, stay away from those specks of light! You can't withstand those precipitated Beyonder characteristics!",
    ["蒙特利？"] = "Monterey?",
    ["蒙面劫匪"] = "Masked Robber",
    ["蒙面杀手"] = "Masked Killer",
    ["蒙香如"] = "Meng Xiangru",
    ["蒙黑夜女神庇佑，本教堂自成立以来，仰赖诸位信众慷慨捐赠，得以维系圣工、扶助贫弱。\n　　为便于统一计数、提升管理效率，自即日起，本教堂所设之慈善奉献箱，统一只接受现金捐赠，不再收取任何形式的支票。\n　　凡此前已开具支票者，仍可于本公告发布之日起七日内，于教堂办公处办理退还或更换手续。由此给您带来的不便，我们深表歉意，恳请诸位信众予以理解与配合。\n　　愿信徒永沐星月柔辉，得女神指引安然前行。\n\n　　赞美女神。"] = "Under the protection of the Evernight Goddess, since the establishment of this church, we have relied on the generous donations of all believers to maintain holy work and support the poor and weak. \n　　To facilitate unified counting and improve management efficiency, starting from today, the charity donation boxes set up by this church will only accept cash donations and will no longer accept checks in any form. \n　　Those who have previously issued checks can still go to the church office within seven days from the date of this announcement to handle refunds or exchanges. We deeply apologize for the inconvenience this may cause and ask for the understanding and cooperation of all believers. \n　　May believers forever bathe in the soft radiance of the stars and moon, and be guided by the Goddess to move forward safely. \n\n　　Praise the Goddess.",
    ["蒲公英"] = "Dandelion",
    ["蒲宸"] = "Pu Chen",
    ["蒸南瓜"] = "Steamed Pumpkin",
    ["蒸汽一号"] = "Steam No. 1",
    ["蒸汽一号的改进版，为替代拉客马车而生，橡木车架与皮革旅行箱仍残留着马车时代的味道。"] = "An improved version of Steam Number One, created to replace passenger carriages; the oak frame and leather travel trunks still retain the flavor of the carriage era.",
    ["蒸汽与工业"] = "Steam and Industry",
    ["蒸汽与机械"] = "Steam and Machinery",
    ["蒸汽与机械之神"] = "God of Steam and Machinery",
    ["蒸汽与机械之神教会"] = "Church of the God of Steam and Machinery",
    ["蒸汽与机械之神教会的守卫，跟随自己的主人叛离了教会，隐入了黑暗之中。"] = "A guard of the Church of the God of Steam and Machinery, who followed his master in rebelling against the church and hid in the darkness.",
    ["蒸汽与机械之神见证：{{player.name}}在神铸改装中，将座驾风尚度铸就<Chat_Highlight>50000</>分，令技术的光辉再度照耀大地。"] = "Witnessed by the God of Steam and Machinery: {{player.name}} In the Divine Casting modification, the vehicle's Fashion Rating reached <Chat_Highlight>50000</> points, letting the brilliance of technology shine upon the earth once more.",
    ["蒸汽与机械的浪潮中 谁能触及非凡 历史和<CS_Yellow>母神</>的迷雾里 又是谁在<CS_Green>耳语</> "] = "In the tide of steam and machinery, who can touch the extraordinary? In the mists of history and the Mother of <CS_Yellow> </>, who is it whispering in <CS_Green>'s ear </>?",
    ["蒸汽与机械的浪潮中，谁能触及非凡。历史和<CS_Yellow>母神</>的迷雾里，又是谁在<CS_Green>耳语</>。"] = "In the tide of steam and machinery, who can touch the extraordinary? In the mists of history and the <CS_Yellow>Mother Goddess</>, who is it that <CS_Green>whispers</>?",
    ["蒸汽与机械的浪潮中，谁能触及非凡。历史和黑暗的迷雾里，又是谁在耳语。"] = "In the tide of steam and machinery, who can touch the extraordinary? In the mists of history and darkness, who is it that whispers?",
    ["蒸汽与机械的浪潮中，谁能触及非凡？历史和黑暗的迷雾里，又是谁在耳语？"] = "In the tide of steam and machinery, who can touch the extraordinary? In the mist of history and darkness, who is whispering?",
    ["蒸汽与机械系学生"] = "Steam and Machinery Department Student",
    ["蒸汽与机械系展品"] = "Steam and Machinery Exhibits",
    ["蒸汽与超凡交织的时代，总有些不寻常的事在暗处发生。驻足倾听，你将窥见这个世界隐秘的一角。"] = "In an era where steam and the extraordinary are intertwined, there are always some unusual things happening in the dark. Stop and listen, and you will catch a glimpse of a hidden corner of this world.",
    ["蒸汽之子"] = "Child of Steam",
    ["蒸汽列车"] = "Steam Train",
    ["蒸汽列车什么时候才到……"] = "When will the Steam Train arrive...",
    ["蒸汽列车模型"] = "Steam Train Model",
    ["蒸汽列车清洗工"] = "Steam Train Cleaner",
    ["蒸汽列车能带你到达鲁恩的每个角落，这是鲁恩实力的体现。"] = "The Steam Train can take you to every corner of Loen; this is a manifestation of Loen's strength.",
    ["蒸汽列车还没有准备好，请各位旅客耐心等待。"] = "The steam train is not ready yet, please wait patiently, passengers.",
    ["蒸汽在上！"] = "Steam Above!",
    ["蒸汽在上，我会赌上我的毕生所学完成一场完美的冲印！"] = "Steam above, I will bet my life's learning on completing a perfect development!",
    ["蒸汽在上，我可怜的乔伊斯，你一定吓坏了吧，我们先回家。"] = "Steam above, my poor Joyce, you must have been terrified, let's go home first.",
    ["蒸汽在上，这也是传播技术的一种嘛。"] = "Steam above, this is also a way of spreading technology.",
    ["蒸汽奉献之灵"] = "Spirit of Steam Devotion",
    ["蒸汽学院学生"] = "Steam Academy Student",
    ["蒸汽文明的火漆印章，罗塞尔大帝改革中法律文书与蒸汽技术并重，这枚火漆印章就是最好的凭证。"] = "A wax seal of the steam civilization. During Emperor Roselle's reforms, legal documents were treated with as much importance as steam technology, and this wax seal is the best proof of that.",
    ["蒸汽机的发明，\n#Space2#了一个新时代。"] = "The invention of the steam engine,\n#Space2# a new era.",
    ["蒸汽机的发明，#Space5#了一个新的时代。"] = "The invention of the steam engine, #Space5# a new era.",
    ["蒸汽机轰鸣了这么些年，没有石油，这里的车马永远追不上旧日的速度。"] = "The steam engine has been roaring for so many years. Without oil, the carriages here will never catch up to the speed of the Great Old Ones.",
