    ["蓝色，迅捷与力量之选！轻便省力，轴承顺滑，由风暴之主教会推动，在码头区与沿海道路特别受欢迎，一路畅行， 最是迅猛。 "] = "Blue, the choice of speed and power! Lightweight and labor-saving, the bearings are smooth, promoted by the Lord of Storms church, especially popular in the dock area and coastal roads, smooth all the way, most swift.",
