    ["蕊妮，时代变了，穷人连面包都买不起，哪还有闲钱买花？生意难做啊！"] = "Renee, times have changed. The poor can't even afford bread, so where would they have spare money for flowers? Business is hard!",
    ["蕙"] = "Hui",
    ["蕙茹"] = "Hui Ru",
    ["蕴含“太阳”力量的药剂，可以净化一部分“月亮”造成的污染。"] = "A potion containing the power of the \"Sun,\" which can purify some of the corruption caused by the \"Moon.\"",
    ["蕴含一定灵质的矿石，可用于置换装备历史词条。"] = "Ore containing a certain amount of spirituality, can be used to replace equipment history affixes.",
    ["蕴含不同特性的自然之水，用于对应不同属性的仪式基底。"] = "Natural water containing different characteristics, used as a base for rituals corresponding to different attributes.",
    ["蕴含光辉与灵界力量的树木汁液，用于净化或构建灵性通道。"] = "Tree sap containing light and Spirit World power, used for Purification or constructing spiritual channels.",
    ["蕴含冷血与狩猎本能的超凡血液，能增强仪式的侵略性与隐匿性。"] = "Extraordinary blood containing cold-blooded and hunting instincts, which can enhance the aggression and concealment of rituals.",
    ["蕴含多重伪装信息的超凡血液，能短暂改变自身或物品的气息。"] = "Extraordinary blood containing multiple camouflage messages, which can briefly change one's own or an object's aura.",
    ["蕴含月光之力与强大撕扯能力的超凡肢体，兼具神圣与狂暴。"] = "Extraordinary limbs containing moonlight power and strong tearing ability, possessing both divinity and Berserk.",
    ["蕴含海量知识与疯狂呓语的超凡大脑，是智慧与失控的结合体。"] = "An extraordinary brain containing massive knowledge and crazy whispers, a combination of wisdom and loss of control.",
    ["蕴含着其他途径能力的光球，\n触碰后可运用不同途径的非凡能力，寻获隐蔽宝藏。"] = "Light orbs containing the abilities of other Pathways. \n Touch them to use Beyonder abilities of different Pathways and find hidden treasures.",
    ["蕴含着大地能量的药剂，轻微摇晃，似地脉在瓶中涌动。"] = "A potion containing the Energy of the earth; a slight shake makes it seem like earth veins are surging in the bottle.",
    ["蕴含着旺盛生命力与自然亲和力的液体，是极佳的治疗与催生媒介。"] = "A liquid containing vigorous Health and natural affinity, an excellent medium for Healing and growth.",
    ["蕴含着神奇力量的物品。瑞尔比伯疯狂失控、变成怪物，也就意味着它并没有完全吸收笔记提供的非凡力量。"] = "An item containing magical power. Riel Bieber went mad and lost control, turning into a monster, which means he didn't fully absorb the Beyonder power provided by the notebook.",
    ["蕴含神明仁慈的治疗药剂，来自生命本源的馈赠。"] = "A healing potion containing the mercy of a God, a gift from the source of life.",
    ["蕴含神明启迪的特殊药剂，来自灵性本源的馈赠。"] = "A special potion containing the enlightenment of a God, a gift from the source of spirituality.",
    ["蕴含神明愤怒的狂暴药剂，来自力量本源的馈赠。"] = "A Berserk potion containing the Anger of a God, a gift from the source of power.",
    ["蕴含神秘力量的灯，点亮后可叩开历史回廊的大门。"] = "A lamp containing mysterious power; once lit, it can knock open the door to the corridor of history.",
