    ["虹膜闪点"] = "Iris sparkle",
    ["虹膜闪点亮度"] = "Iris sparkle brightness",
    ["虹膜闪点尺寸"] = "Iris sparkle size",
    ["虹膜闪点速度"] = "Iris sparkle speed",
    ["虽湮没于历史，仍化作不灭的微光，令黑暗退避。"] = "Though buried in history, it still turns into an undying glimmer, making the darkness retreat.",
    ["虽然……我们已经倒在了和平到来的黎明之前。"] = "Although... we already fell before the dawn of peace arrived.",
    ["虽然一直知道卡萝队长是个很麻烦的人，但究竟是什么执念能在封印物里沉睡五年不消散？"] = "Although I've always known Captain Kar is a troublesome person, what kind of obsession could remain dormant in a Sealed Artifact for five years without dissipating?",
    ["虽然不在一起了，但我们都还健康幸福，过着自己想要的人生。"] = "Although we are no longer together, we are both healthy and happy, living the lives we wanted.",
    ["虽然不是第一次前往灰雾之上，但还是消耗了大量灵性，最好先休息下。"] = "Although this isn't my first time going above the gray fog, it still consumed a large amount of spirituality. It is best to rest for a while.",
    ["虽然不清楚发生了什么，但我本来也只是躲在厕所不被人笑话。现在就让我在这里待着吧，让我看看自己的笑话。"] = "Though I don't know what happened, I was just hiding in the restroom to avoid being laughed at anyway. Let me stay here for now; let me be my own joke.",
    ["虽然什么？"] = "Although what?",
    ["虽然他们搬走的时候看起来并不快乐……我想，每一个离开水仙花街的人都会感到不舍的。"] = "Although they didn't look happy when they moved away... I think everyone who leaves Daffodil Street feels reluctant.",
    ["虽然作为一个鲁恩人，但每次读到大帝的生平，还是忍不住感叹——罗塞尔大帝真是史无前例的天才！"] = "Although I am a Loenese, every time I read about the Emperor's life, I can't help but sigh—Emperor Roselle is truly an unprecedented genius!",
    ["虽然你确实像街景一样让人着迷！"] = "Although you are indeed as fascinating as the street view!",
    ["虽然你被未知力量影响，完全遗忘了这段记忆，但人的灵和大脑很奇妙，也许还有些痕迹残留。"] = "Although you were influenced by an unknown force and completely forgot this memory, the human spirit and brain are very wonderful; perhaps there are still some traces left behind.",
    ["虽然偶尔可以拉铃铛看小罗珊跑来跑去的样子，但普通人还是少靠近这里比较好。"] = "Although I can occasionally pull the bell and watch little Rozanne run around, it's better for ordinary people not to get too close to here.",
    ["虽然受限于一些传统观念，她们的工作以文员为主，晋升也有隐形的天花板……"] = "Although limited by some traditional concepts, their work is mainly clerical, and there is an invisible ceiling for promotion...",
    ["虽然可惜，但若你们都已想清楚，我会尊重你们的决定。有些人，只能陪着走一段人生的旅程。愿女神仍眷顾你们各自的前路。"] = "Although it's a pity, if you have both thought it through, I will respect your decision. Some people can only accompany you for a part of life's journey. May the Goddess still favor your respective paths ahead.",
    ["虽然和梅兰妮结婚之后，\r\n我真的非常爱她……"] = "Although after marrying Melanie,\r\nI truly loved her very much...",
    ["虽然夜莺银哨基本无害，但还是会对周围产生影响。"] = "Although the Nightingale Silver Whistle is basically harmless, it will still have an impact on its surroundings.",
    ["虽然她已经是神秘世界的大人物了，但我还是放心不下。既然都是老乡，等你成长起来，也要记得照看一下她啊。"] = "Although she is already a big shot in the mystic world, I still can't help but worry. Since we are both from the same hometown, remember to look after her when you grow up.",
    ["虽然她有时候看到我的成果会脸色发白，但她从来不阻止我……呃有时候也会阻止一下吧。"] = "Although she sometimes turns pale when she sees my results, she never stops me... uh, sometimes she stops me a little, I guess.",
    ["虽然学习了基础的能力知识，但非凡的道路是神秘和危险的，我还是要谨慎些。"] = "Although I have learned basic ability knowledge, the path of the Beyonder is mysterious and dangerous, so I still have to be cautious.",
    ["虽然尝尝其他餐厅的菜品也没关系，不过总感觉有点尴尬……"] = "Although it's fine to try dishes at other restaurants, it just feels a bit awkward...",
    ["虽然工作很累，但我还是很喜欢这个俱乐部。"] = "Although the work is tiring, I still really like this club.",
    ["虽然工厂主给了补偿，但家里要用钱的地方太多了。"] = "Although the factory owner gave compensation, there are too many places in the family that need money.",
    ["虽然已经结案 但我隐约觉得遗漏了什么 想继续调查看看"] = "Although the case is closed, I vaguely feel that something was missed, so I want to continue investigating.",
    ["虽然已经结案，但我隐约觉得遗漏了什么，想继续调查看看。"] = "Although the case is closed, I vaguely feel that something was missed and want to continue investigating.",
    ["虽然很想知道答案，但也很怕听到一些不愿听的东西……"] = "Although I really want to know the answer, I'm also very afraid of hearing things I don't want to hear...",
    ["虽然很有气势，但实在是太难听了。"] = "Although it's very imposing, it's really terrible to listen to.",
    ["虽然您的力量超越了我们的想象，但世界上总有您不了解不擅长的领域。"] = "Although your power exceeds our imagination, there are always areas in the world that you do not understand or are not good at.",
    ["虽然情有可原，但毕竟违背了法律和校规，你该接受应有的惩罚。"] = "Although there are extenuating circumstances, you have violated the law and school rules after all, and you should accept the punishment you deserve.",
    ["虽然我不懂小猫的语言，但感觉这位成员的集会态度很不端正呢。"] = "Although I don't understand the language of kittens, I feel that this member's attitude toward the assembly is very improper.",
    ["虽然我们尚且弱小，但是我们也有各自的资源与人脉。或许有一天，我们也可以帮您处理一些小事。"] = "Although we are still weak, we have our own resources and connections. Perhaps one day, we can also help you handle some small matters.",
    ["虽然我们摧毁了镜中廷根，但危机似乎没有完全消除。"] = "Although we destroyed Tingen in the Mirror, the crisis doesn't seem to have been completely eliminated.",
    ["虽然我们的藏书比不上德维尔爵士捐赠的图书馆，也没有大学图书馆那么多珍本，但这里是城里唯一对所有人开放的图书馆。"] = "Although our collection cannot compare to the library donated by Sir Dervish, nor does it have as many rare books as the university library, this is the only library in the city open to everyone.",
    ["虽然我们阻止了仪式，但是看起来危机还没有解除。"] = "Although we stopped the ritual, it seems the crisis hasn't been resolved yet.",
    ["虽然我的灵魂能在这些书里得到自由，但我更想去逛街。"] = "Although my soul can find freedom in these books, I would rather go shopping.",
    ["虽然我真的很好奇下面有什么，但还是活着比较重要。"] = "Although I am really curious about what's down there, staying alive is more important.",
    ["虽然战斗力和体能非常强大，但性格很温顺，非常听话。"] = "Although his combat power and physical strength are very high, his personality is very gentle and obedient.",
    ["虽然挣的苏勒变多了，但是总有种被当缉毒犬的感觉……"] = "Although I earn more gold soli, I always feel like I'm being treated like a drug-sniffing dog...",
    ["虽然方法有问题，但你是个好老师，我不会向学校举报你。"] = "Although the method is problematic, you are a good teacher, and I will not report you to the school.",
    ["虽然是作为文职人员，但也有不错的薪水，令人心动……"] = "Although it's as a civilian staff member, there is a good salary, which is tempting...",
    ["虽然有点像开玩笑，但毕竟非凡世界里什么都有可能发生，就这么办吧。"] = "Although it sounds a bit like a joke, anything can happen in the Extraordinary World, so let's do it.",
    ["虽然有防身的手枪，里面却没装子弹。情急之下才躲进了这里，然后就晕过去了……"] = "Although I have a pistol for self-defense, it doesn't have any bullets in it. I hid here in a panic, and then I fainted...",
    ["虽然条件简陋一些，但干净安全可以保障。"] = "Although the conditions are a bit simple, cleanliness and safety can be guaranteed.",
    ["虽然没听懂……"] = "Although I didn't understand...",
    ["虽然甜冰茶是南方的饮料，但它也很适合廷根本地人的口味。"] = "Although sweet iced tea is a drink from the south, it also suits the tastes of the locals in Tingen.",
    ["虽然看到你第一眼，我就知道崔佛那混蛋不是诚心的。"] = "Although the moment I saw you, I knew that bastard Trevor wasn't sincere.",
    ["虽然看见它们变成现实还是蛮有趣的……"] = "Although it's quite interesting to see them become reality...",
    ["虽然纵火犯的动机和行为符合，但最好还是再做一次占卜。"] = "Although the motive and behavior match that of an arsonist, it is best to perform another divination.",
    ["虽然船长当时很生气，但我看得出来她其实也很惊讶。一艘能自己产奶的船，这在全世界都是独一无二的！"] = "Although the captain was very angry at the time, I could tell she was actually very surprised. A ship that can produce milk itself—this is unique in the whole world!",
    ["虽然要再挨几天饿，但我还是再去找找工作吧！"] = "Although I'll have to go hungry for a few more days, I'll go look for work again!",
    ["虽然身材娇小，却拥有敏捷灵动的身姿，想跟上它们的行动可不容易。"] = "Although they are petite, they possess an agile and nimble posture. It's not easy to keep up with their movements.",
    ["虽然还没有完全肯定，但已经有了一定的想法。"] = "Although not yet completely certain, I already have some ideas.",
    ["虽然这不是什么过分的请求，但你现在要用哪里吃？"] = "Although that's not an excessive request, what are you going to eat it with now?",
    ["虽然这次自杀的事件有封印物的诱导，但村民的痛苦是真实的。"] = "Although this suicide incident was induced by a Sealed Artifact, the villagers' pain is real.",
    ["虽然迟到了太久，但它终于送到邓恩先生这里了。"] = "Although it's too late, it has finally been delivered to Mr. Dunn.",
    ["虽然需要忍受一些难以克制的冲动，但生活安稳，家庭和睦。"] = "Although I need to endure some uncontrollable impulses, life is stable and the family is harmonious.",
    ["虽然，偶尔会有些羡慕。"] = "Although, I do feel a little envious sometimes.",
    ["虽说是你努力的结果啦，但是听上去还是很神奇！我也想去测一下有关我以后的人生大事，婚姻啊，事业啊什么的。"] = "Although it's the result of your hard work, it still sounds very magical! I also want to go and test some major life events, like marriage, career, and so on.",
