    ["表示从养成中直接获得的治疗增强。"] = "Represents the Healing Enhancement obtained directly from progression.",
    ["表示伤害触发暴击时的伤害倍率，受到目标暴伤减免的抵消。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。"] = "Indicates the damage multiplier when damage triggers a critical hit, offset by the target's critical damage reduction. The final multiplier for critical damage will not exceed 250% or be lower than 125%.",
    ["表示体力的恢复速度为基础恢复速度的{*.1f**,F1690001,StaminaRecoverRate}。"] = "Indicates that the stamina recovery speed is {*.1f**,F1690001,StaminaRecoverRate} of the base recovery speed.",
    ["表示体力的消耗速度为基础消耗速度的{*.1f**,F1690001,StaminaConsumeRate}。"] = "Indicates that the stamina consumption speed is {*.1f**,F1690001,StaminaConsumeRate} of the base consumption speed.",
    ["表示反对"] = "Express opposition",
    ["表示同意"] = "Express agreement",
    ["表示好奇"] = "Show curiosity",
    ["表示当前状态下角色移动的速度，包括走动、跑步和闪避速度。"] = "Indicates the character's current movement speed, including walking, running, and dodging speed.",
    ["表示支持"] = "Express support",
    ["表示物理伤害触发暴击时的伤害倍率为{*.1f**,F1690001,pCritHurt}，受到目标物理暴伤减免的抵消。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。\n提升的暴伤超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。"] = "Indicates that the damage multiplier when physical damage triggers a critical hit is {*.1f**,F1690001,pCritHurt}, offset by the target's Physical Critical Damage Reduction. The final multiplier for critical damage will not exceed 250% or be lower than 125%. \n If the increased Critical Damage exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability.",
    ["表示理解"] = "Express understanding",
    ["表示疑惑"] = "Express confusion",
    ["表示空想姿态观众从其它属性转化得到的治疗增强。空想姿态观众的以下属性会按比例转化：魔法破防、忽视魔法防御、破甲、技能增强、魔法穿刺、魔法暴击、魔法暴伤、伤害加深、最终伤害增强、途径专攻、途径压制、首领专攻、首领压制、控制命中、控制增强。（魔法攻击会提高治疗量，但不会转化为治疗增强。）"] = "Represents the Healing Enhancement converted from other attributes for the Imagination Stance Spectator. The following attributes of an Imagination Stance Spectator are converted proportionally: Magic Armor Break, Ignore Magic Defense, Armor Break, Skill Enhancement, Magic Pierce, Magic Critical Hit, Magic Critical Damage, Damage Deepening, Final Damage Boost, Pathway Specialty, Pathway Suppression, Boss Specialty, Boss Suppression, Control Hit, Control Enhancement. (Magic Attack increases the amount of healing but is not converted into Healing Enhancement.)",
    ["表示骑乘状态下角色移动的速度。"] = "Indicates the character's movement speed while mounted.",
    ["表示魔法伤害触发暴击时的伤害倍率为{*.1f**,F1690001,mCritHurt}，受到目标魔法暴伤减免的抵消。暴击伤害的最终倍率不会超过250%或低于125%。\n提升的暴伤超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。"] = "Indicates that the damage multiplier when magic damage triggers a critical hit is {*.1f**,F1690001,mCritHurt}, offset by the target's Magic Critical Damage Reduction. The final multiplier for critical damage will not exceed 250% or be lower than 125%. \n If the increased Critical Damage exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability.",
    ["表芯早就坏透了，修不好。但那位先生每年都拿来一次，让我看看有没有办法。"] = "The movement was completely broken and couldn't be fixed. But that gentleman brought it in once every year, asking me if there was any way.",
    ["表达你的主张"] = "Express your stance",
    ["表达歉意，也是一个绅士应该做的。没错，这不算打扰，莎莉丝特小姐会理解的。"] = "Expressing an apology is what a gentleman should do. That's right, this doesn't count as bothering her. Miss Celeste will understand.",
    ["表达真情实感"] = "Express true feelings",
    ["表配置灵敏度 Yaw:%s Pitch:%s"] = "Table configuration sensitivity Yaw:%s Pitch:%s",
    ["表？我身上没有。"] = "Watch? I don't have one on me.",
