    ["裂缝特效"] = "Crack Effect",
    ["裂金之战刃"] = "Gold-Splitting Battle Blade",
    ["裂隙吞没视野，亦是君临世界的起点。\n\n改变自身所在大世界场景的天空，持续5分钟，并召唤<HighLight>“名流之殿”</>入口，持续30分钟。"] = "The rift swallows the field of vision, and it is also the starting point for ruling the world. \n \n Change the sky of the current world scene, lasting for 5 minutes, and summon the entrance to the <HighLight> 'Hall of Fame' </>, lasting for 30 minutes.",
    ["裂隙引力"] = "Rift Gravity",
    ["裂隙火焰"] = "Rift Fire",
    ["装了全部身家的钱包，小心翼翼放在衣物夹层的兜里。"] = "Wallet containing all his savings, carefully placed in the pocket of the clothing interlayer.",
