    ["装备技能后：每<FaintYellow>5</>秒获得一层债务，上限<FaintYellow>4</>层。\n使用技能：老尼尔消耗所有债务对目标造成伤害，消耗的债务越多造成的伤害越高。"] = "After equipping this skill: Gain one stack of Debt every <FaintYellow>5</> seconds, up to a maximum of <FaintYellow>4</> stacks. \nUsing the skill: Old Neil consumes all Debt to deal damage to the target. The more Debt consumed, the higher the damage.",
    ["装备技能后：每<FaintYellow>5</>秒获得一层债务，上限<FaintYellow>4</>层。\n使用技能：老尼尔消耗所有债务对目标造成伤害，消耗的债务越多造成的伤害越高，对怪物伤害提高100%。"] = "After equipping this skill: Gain one stack of Debt every <FaintYellow>5</> seconds, up to a maximum of <FaintYellow>4</> stacks. \nUsing the skill: Old Neil consumes all Debt to deal damage to the target. The more Debt consumed, the higher the damage. Damage to monsters increased by 100%.",
    ["装备技能后：每<HighLight>5</>秒获得一层债务，上限<HighLight>4</>层。\n使用技能：老尼尔消耗所有债务对目标造成<HighLight>3</>次伤害，消耗的债务越多造成的伤害越高，第1次skilldisc(*id)，第2次skilldisc(*id)，第3次skilldisc(*id)。"] = "After equipping this skill: Gain one stack of Debt every <HighLight>5</> seconds, up to a maximum of <HighLight>4</> stacks. \nUsing the skill: Old Neil consumes all Debt to deal <HighLight>3</> instances of damage to the target. The more Debt consumed, the higher the damage. 1st instance: skilldisc(*id), 2nd instance: skilldisc(*id), 3rd instance: skilldisc(*id).",
    ["装备技能后：每<HighLight>5</>秒获得一层债务，上限<HighLight>4</>层。\n使用技能：老尼尔消耗所有债务对目标造成<HighLight>3</>次伤害，消耗的债务越多造成的伤害越高，第1次skilldisc(*id)，第2次skilldisc(*id)，第3次skilldisc(*id)，目标个数最多为6个，对怪物伤害提高100%。"] = "After equipping this skill: Gain one stack of Debt every <HighLight>5</> seconds, up to a maximum of <HighLight>4</> stacks. \nUsing the skill: Old Neil consumes all Debt to deal <HighLight>3</> instances of damage to the target. The more Debt consumed, the higher the damage. 1st instance: skilldisc(*id), 2nd instance: skilldisc(*id), 3rd instance: skilldisc(*id). Targets up to 6, damage to monsters increased by 100%.",
