    ["观众产生治疗时，对周身大范围内的敌人造成一次伤害，此效果有2秒内置冷却。"] = "When Spectator generates healing, it deals damage to enemies in a large area around you; this effect has a 2-second internal Cooldown.",
    ["观众从不登台。一旦登台，就成了戏剧的一部分，再也看不见真相。"] = "A Spectator never takes the stage. Once you take the stage, you become part of the drama and can no longer see the truth.",
