    ["观众可以唤醒消散状态的友方，使其于观众施法地点复苏并回复一定生命。"] = "Spectators can awaken dissipated allies, causing them to revive at the spectator's casting location and restore a certain amount of health.",
    ["观众和战士在剧院中只能使用输出形态和非凡天赋，请搭配好技能"] = "Spectators and Warriors can only use Offensive Stance and Beyonder talents in the theater; please configure your skills accordingly.",
