    ["观众攻击精神瘟疫目标时，产生的协同攻击变成范围伤害，且协同伤害基础值提高150%"] = "When Spectator attacks a target with Mental Plague, the resulting coordinated attack becomes area damage, and the base value of the coordinated damage is increased by 150%.",
