    ["观众最重要的就是观察。当你在观看我时，我也在观察你。"] = "The most important thing for a Spectator is to observe. When you were watching me, I was also observing you.",
    ["观众有输出和治疗两种形态可以切换。"] = "Spectators have two forms, output and healing, that can be switched.",
