    ["观众达到序列9"] = "Spectator reaches Sequence 9",
    ["观众途径 | 序列3“织梦人”"] = "Spectator Pathway | Sequence 3 \"Dream Weaver\"",
    ["观众途径导师"] = "Spectator pathway tutor",
    ["观众途径导师奥黛丽为塔罗学派成员制定的短期成长扮演计划。周游世界的学徒途径导师佛尔思为这一计划筹备了丰富的馈赠。每位成员完成以领悟扮演守则为核心的各类活动和挑战，即可获得馈赠和奖励。\n一位神秘的命运访客还为表现出色的成员带来了特殊的“命运馈赠”。"] = "A short-term growth and acting plan formulated by Spectator Pathway mentor Audrey for members of the Tarot Club. Fors, an Apprentice Pathway mentor who has traveled the world, has prepared generous gifts for this plan. Each member can receive gifts and rewards by completing various activities and challenges centered on comprehending the Acting rules. \n A mysterious visitor of fate has also brought special \"Gifts of Fate\" for members who perform exceptionally well.",
    ["观众途径有催眠能力，她成为非凡者了？"] = "The Spectator Pathway has hypnosis abilities; did she become a Beyonder?",
    ["观众途径的序列0的名称是？"] = "What is the name of the Sequence 0 of the Spectator Pathway?",
    ["观众途径非凡者不仅可以心理治疗，也可以利用精神控制，让非凡者走向崩溃。"] = "Spectator pathway Beyonders can not only perform psychotherapy but also use Mind Control to drive Beyonders to collapse.",
    ["观众途径，序列5——“梦境行者”。"] = "Spectator Pathway, Sequence 5—Dream Walker.",
    ["观众途径：凡有言，必被知。"] = "Spectator Pathway: All that is spoken will be known.",
