    ["角色状态异常。"] = "Character status abnormal.",
    ["角色生命为零时会陷入消散状态，\n需要自己或他人协助复苏才能重新返回正常状态。\n\n角色最大生命：{*d,F1690001,MaxHp}"] = "When the character's Health reaches zero, they will enter a dissipated state, \n and require assistance from themselves or others to recover and return to a normal state. \n \n Character Maximum Health: {*d,F1690001,MaxHp}",
    ["角色生命为零时会陷入消散状态，部分技能效果可以净化消散状态的敌方，使其强制于默认点位复苏并附加虚弱效果，大幅降低其攻击力一段时间。"] = "When a character's health reaches zero, they enter a dissipated state. Certain skill effects can purify dissipated enemies, forcing them to revive at a default location and applying a Weakness effect, significantly reducing their attack power for a period.",
    ["角色生命为零时会陷入消散状态，需要自己或他人协助复苏才能继续战斗。"] = "When a character's Health reaches zero, they will enter a dissipated state and require assistance from themselves or others to revive before they can continue fighting.",
    ["角色生命为零时会陷入消散状态，需要自己或他人协助复苏才能重新返回正常状态。"] = "When the character's Health reaches zero, they will enter a dissipated state and require assistance from themselves or others to recover and return to a normal state.",
    ["角色的五维会按比例转换为生命、生命恢复、防御、暴击、抗暴击、穿刺、格挡、技能增强、技能抵挡、破防。"] = "The character's five dimensions are proportionally converted into Health, Health Recovery, Defense, Critical Hit, Anti-Critical Hit, Pierce, Block, Skill Enhancement, Skill Block, and Armor Break.",
