    ["解除控制效果，留下一个纸人替身迷惑敌人，自身则向目标位置位移。"] = "Remove control effects, leave behind a Paper Figurine Substitute to confuse enemies, and displace oneself to the target location.",
    ["解除支援"] = "Remove Support",
