    ["解除禁制，解救受困队员！注意团队血量！"] = "Remove the restriction and rescue the trapped team members! Pay attention to the team's health!",
    ["解除绑定"] = "Unbind",
    ["解除绑定成功"] = "Unbinding successful.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">控制效果</>，并在4秒内获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">霸体</>和50%减伤，将每次受到伤害里不超过生命值上限10%的部分，按{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}倍反弹给攻击者（对8米外的目标，反弹伤害额外衰减，最多衰减至8米内的20%）。\n效果结束时，震碎牢笼，对周身8米内的最多6名敌对目标造成伤害，并对其施加持续10秒的眩目效果，使其攻击降低。"] = "Removes <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">crowd control effects</> from yourself, and grants <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">Super Armor</> and 50% damage reduction for 4 seconds. For every instance of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum HP, it reflects {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9} times that amount back to the attacker (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters).\nWhen the effect ends, shatter the cage, dealing damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a Dazzle effect for 10 seconds, reducing their attack.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">控制效果</>，并在4秒内获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\">霸体</>和承受伤害降低50%效果，将每次受到伤害里不超过生命值上限10%的部分，按{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}倍反弹给攻击者（对8米外的目标，反弹伤害额外衰减，最多衰减至8米内的20%）。\n效果结束时，震碎牢笼，对周身8米内的最多6名敌对目标造成伤害，并对其施加持续10秒的眩目效果，使其攻击降低。"] = "Remove <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\"> crowd control effects</> from yourself, gain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Super Armor </> and 50% damage reduction for 4 seconds. Reflect a portion of each instance of damage taken (up to 10% of your max health) back to the attacker at {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9} times the value (reflected damage is further reduced for targets beyond 8 meters, down to 20% of the value within 8 meters). \n When the effect ends, shatter the cage, dealing damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters and applying a 10-second blinding effect that reduces their attack.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>。回复自身*f**生命，并获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，*f秒buffdisc(*id)，同时对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Removes <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> Crowd Control </> effects from yourself. Restores *f** Health, grants *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> and *f seconds of buffdisc(*id), while dealing *d physical damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>并获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，在自身当前位置放置一个火焰信标，然后向目标位置闪现。在自身消失位置和目标位置周围小范围内造成*d点物理伤害。\n施法后3秒内可以释放连招，连招释放时获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，闪回火焰信标所在的位置，在自身消失位置和火焰信标位置周围小范围内再次造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Cleanse yourself of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">control effects</> and gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</>. Place a flame beacon at your current position, then flash to the target location. Deal *d physical damage in a small area around your disappearance point and the target location. \nA combo can be released within 3 seconds after casting. Upon releasing the combo, gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> and flash back to the flame beacon's location, dealing *d physical damage again in a small area around your disappearance point and the flame beacon's location.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"16\">固定回复</>自身已损失生命值*f**的生命，对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，并获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，3秒<HighLight>20%</>移速提升，*f秒<HighLight>破幻</>。\n \n<FaintYellow>破幻</>\nbuffdisc(*id)。"] = "Removes <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">control effects</> from yourself, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"16\">restores a fixed amount of </> your lost Health equal to *f**, deals *d physical damage to surrounding enemies, and grants <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> for *f seconds, a <HighLight>20%</> movement speed boost for 3 seconds, and <HighLight>Illusion Breaking</> for *f seconds. \n \n<FaintYellow>Illusion Breaking</>\nbuffdisc(*id).",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，在自身位置留下一个纸人替身继承自身的锁定标记，同时自身向摇杆方向（不输入方向时默认向角色后方）跃出，释放时获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>和*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。纸人替身会自行对敌方进行三次普攻，分别造成bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)点物理伤害, 然后爆炸对周围敌方造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Cleanse yourself of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">control effects</>, leave a Paper Figurine Substitute at your position that inherits your locked marks, and leap in the direction of the joystick (or backwards by default). Gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> and, for *f seconds, the effect of buffdisc(*id) upon release. The Paper Figurine Substitute will automatically perform three basic attacks on enemies, dealing bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id)/bulletdisc(*id) physical damage respectively, then explode to deal *d physical damage to surrounding enemies.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，并在释放时获得<HighLight>0.5</>秒的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>效果和<HighLight>4</>秒的15%<HighLight>减伤</>效果，在自身当前位置放置一个火焰信标，然后向目标位置闪现。在自身消失位置和目标位置周围小范围内造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Cleanse yourself of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">control effects</>, gain <HighLight>0.5</> seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> and <HighLight>4</> seconds of 15% <HighLight>Damage Reduction</>, place a flame beacon at your current position, then flash to the target location. Deal *d physical damage in a small area around your disappearance point and the target location.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>并获得*f秒15%<HighLight>减伤</>效果，在自身当前位置放置一个火焰信标，然后向目标位置闪现。在自身消失位置和目标位置周围小范围内造成*d点物理伤害。\n施法后3秒内可以释放连招，连招释放时获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，闪回火焰信标所在的位置，在自身消失位置和火焰信标位置周围小范围内再次造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Cleanse yourself of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">control effects</>, gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</>, and gain a 15% <HighLight>Damage Reduction</> effect for *f seconds. Place a flame beacon at your current position, then flash to the target location. Deal *d physical damage in a small area around your disappearance point and the target location. \nA combo can be released within 3 seconds after casting. Upon releasing the combo, gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> and flash back to the flame beacon's location, dealing *d physical damage again in a small area around your disappearance point and the flame beacon's location.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，获得<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>，buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒；对周身敌方造成*d点魔法伤害，并有<HighLight>100%</>的基础概率附加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果。技能施放后可以连招施法，突进至敌方目标身边，造成*d点魔法伤害并有<HighLight>100%</>的基础概率将其<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>。"] = "Remove <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">Crowd Control effects</> from yourself, gain <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</>, and buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds; deal *d magic damage to surrounding enemies with a <HighLight>100%</> base probability of applying, for *f seconds, the buffdisc(*id) effect. After casting, you can perform a combo to dash to the enemy target, dealing *d magic damage with a <HighLight>100%</> base probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launching</> them into the air.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，获得buffdisc(*id)和<HighLight>4</>秒的buffdisc(*id)的效果，并进入持续<HighLight>4</>秒的<HighLight>星光状态</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>星光状态</>：buffdisc(*id)，移动时留下星辉路径，处于星辉路径上的敌方buffdisc(*id)。自身主动使用技能会退出<HighLight>星光状态</>。当因持续时间结束或使用技能退出<HighLight>星光状态</>时，对周身范围内敌方造成spellfielddisc(*id)点魔法伤害并将其<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击退</>。"] = "Remove Control Effects <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"></> from yourself, gain buffdisc(*id) and the effect of buffdisc(*id) for 4 <HighLight></> seconds, and enter the Starlight <HighLight></> state for 4 <HighLight></> seconds. \n\n<FaintYellow> Starlight </>: buffdisc(*id), leaving a starlight path when moving, and enemies on the starlight path are affected by buffdisc(*id). Actively using a skill will exit the Starlight <HighLight></> state. When exiting the Starlight <HighLight></> state due to duration ending or using a skill, deal spellfielddisc(*id) magic damage to enemies in the surrounding area and knock them back <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\"></>.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>，进入<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>状态并获得buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒。"] = "Removes <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> Crowd Control </> effects from yourself, enters <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> state, and gains buffdisc(*id) for *f seconds.",
    ["解除自身受到的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果，并在释放时获得<HighLight>0.5</>秒的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>效果，在自身当前位置放置一个火焰信标，然后向目标位置闪现。在自身消失位置和目标位置周围小范围内造成*d点物理伤害。"] = "Removes all <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> crowd control effects from yourself, and upon activation, grants <HighLight>0.5</> seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</>. Places a flame beacon at your current location, then flashes to the target location. Deals *d physical damage in a small area around both your original position where you ⟦Disappear⟧ and the target location.",
    ["解除自身受到的控制状态，并获得霸体、减伤、反弹伤害效果。效果结束后，对附近敌对目标造成伤害，并对其施加攻击降低效果。"] = "Remove crowd control states from yourself and gain Super Armor, damage reduction, and damage reflection effects. After the effect ends, deal damage to nearby hostile targets and apply an attack reduction effect.",
    ["解除自身受到的部分<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果，创建领域，持续治疗范围内友方，每秒回复spellfielddisc(*id)点生命，持续<Highlight>9</>秒。"] = "Removes some <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> control effects from yourself and creates a field that provides continuous healing to allies within range, restoring spellfielddisc(*id) Health per second for <Highlight>9</> seconds.",
