    ["触碰万物相连的灵体之线，就能与其建立连接，接管其意识，使其成为你的秘偶，被你控制的单位将听从你的指令。"] = "Touch the spirit body threads that connect all things to establish a connection with them, take over their consciousness, and make them your marionette. The units you control will follow your commands.",
