    ["触碰管家执念体的玩家会被捆绑，需要队友及时<Highlight>转火管家</>，该玩家被解救后，会获得<Highlight>忠诚标记</>，标记最多3层，达到3层时会爆炸，后续子爵夫人会对持有标记的玩家进行<Highlight>幽灵猎杀</>。触碰小子爵执念体的玩家，会获得<Highlight>小子爵的思念</>，达到2层时，会在黑暗场景中，带来一丝光明，并能在黑暗中听到小子爵的呼唤，帮助玩家驱散黑暗。"] = "Players who touch the Butler's obsession will be bound. Teammates need to promptly <Highlight>switch targets to attack the Butler</>. After being rescued, the player will gain a <Highlight>Loyalty Mark</>. The mark stacks up to 3 layers; when it reaches 3 layers, it will explode. Subsequently, the Viscountess will perform a <Highlight>Ghost Hunt</> on players holding the mark. Players who touch the Little Viscount's obsession will gain <Highlight>Little Viscount's Longing</>. When it reaches 2 layers, it will bring a glimmer of light in the dark scene, and you will be able to hear the Little Viscount's call in the darkness, helping players dispel the darkness.",
