    ["警察3"] = "Police Officer 3",
    ["警察4"] = "Police Officer 4",
    ["警察……罗塞尔大帝说过，国家的兴盛与衰败，每个人都有责任。如果不是体能测试无法通过，我们就是同事了。"] = "Police... Emperor Roselle said that everyone is responsible for the rise and fall of the country. If it weren't for failing the physical fitness test, we would be colleagues.",
    ["警察不需要替罪犯的行为道歉。"] = "The police don't need to apologize for the actions of a criminal.",
    ["警察也是一伙的……该死，警局的这帮混蛋到底想干什么！"] = "The police are in on it too... Damn it, what on earth are these bastards at the station trying to do!",
    ["警察先生，你该不会不知道，求婚在人生中有多重要吧？"] = "Officer, surely you realize how important a marriage proposal is in one's life?",
    ["警察先生，她是一个疯子、一个孤儿。说真的，像她这样活着，不如痛快死掉算了。"] = "Officer, she is a madman, an orphan. Honestly, living like her, it would be better to just die quickly.",
    ["警察先生，我们济贫院一直都坚持平等温柔地对待每一个可怜的孤儿，直到他们12岁为止。"] = "Officer, our poorhouse has always insisted on treating every poor orphan equally and gently until they are 12 years old.",
    ["警察办案，请保持距离！"] = "Police investigation, please keep your distance!",
    ["警察办案，这个人是惯偷！"] = "Police business! This man is a habitual thief!",
