    ["警局已经烂透了，我也不知道该怎么办。"] = "The police station is rotten to the core. I don't know what to do either.",
    ["警局总部外"] = "Outside police headquarters",
    ["警局新购入了一批最新款蒸汽警车，麦克警官正在寻找同事一同试驾。"] = "The police station has purchased a new batch of the latest steam-powered police cars, and Officer Mike is looking for a colleague to test drive them.",
    ["警局这边有什么新进展吗？"] = "Are there any new developments at the police station?",
    ["警局门口在戒严，三大黑帮之一的“议院治安队”正在围捕一个连环杀手。警局难道真的和黑帮有联系？"] = "The police station is under martial law; the \"Council Security Team,\" one of the three major gangs, is hunting down a serial killer. Does the police station really have ties to the gangs?",
