    ["订单玩法商人"] = "Order Gameplay Merchant",
    ["订立正义准则，依据正义行事，能量获取途径增加，施展惩戒和无暗之枪时，自身叠加正义审判，提高惩戒和无暗之枪的伤害。烈阳状态下施放战斗技能也会为自身叠加正义审判。击败、净化和参与助攻击败敌方玩家时都会获得太阳能量。"] = "Establish the principles of Justice and act accordingly; energy acquisition paths increase. When performing Punishment and Unshadowed Spear, the user stacks Judgment of Justice, increasing the damage of Punishment and Unshadowed Spear. In the Blazing Sun state, casting combat skills will also stack Judgment of Justice for the user. Defeating, purifying, and participating in assists to defeat enemy players will all grant Solar Energy.",
    ["订立正义准则，惩戒背誓异端，惩戒和无暗之枪命中敌人时，向目标施加异端标记，使其受到歌颂者的伤害增加。烈阳状态下战斗技能命中后也会为目标施加异端标记。"] = "Establish the principles of Justice to punish heretical oath-breakers. When Punishment and Unshadowed Spear hit an enemy, apply a Heresy mark to the target, increasing the damage taken from the Bard. In the Blazing Sun state, hitting with combat skills will also apply a Heresy mark to the target.",
