    ["讨论剧情"] = "Discuss Plot",
    ["讨论地段"] = "Discuss the location",
    ["讨论报告"] = "Discuss the report",
    ["讨论游戏"] = "Discuss Game",
    ["讨论经营"] = "Discuss business",
    ["讨论结果呢？"] = "What was the result of the discussion?",
    ["讨论这些有意义么……"] = "Is there any point in discussing this...",
    ["讨论？讨论被瑞克忽悠的倒霉新人……"] = "Discussing? Discussing the unlucky newcomer who was fooled by Rick...",
    ["让"] = "Ren",
    ["让<h>疯女人</>冷静一下"] = "Let the <h>mad woman</> calm down",
    ["让<h>菲利普</>清醒过来"] = "Make <h>Philip</> sober up",
    ["让{{他|她}}进去吧。"] = "Let {{him|her}} in.",
    ["让“棕熊”喝下加药的酒"] = "Let \"Brown Bear\" drink the spiked alcohol",
    ["让“棕熊”安静"] = "Quiet the Brown Bear",
    ["让一位像您这样优雅的小姐在街头焦急地等待，而不是亲自上门邀请，一定是这位先生的失礼。"] = "To let an elegant lady like you wait anxiously on the street instead of inviting you in person must be this gentleman's rudeness.",
    ["让一切回到过去——回到当年老爷大肆举办聚会，宴请贵族那时候。"] = "Let everything return to the past—back to the days when the master held grand parties and entertained the nobility.",
    ["让万物在理性的凝视下，显露出最初的符号。"] = "Let all things reveal their original symbols under the gaze of reason.",
    ["让人机定位解机制用"] = "For AI Positioning Mechanism Solving",
    ["让他们找吧，就说我在检查绳索，反正这个时候没人会查。"] = "Let them look for me; I'll just say I'm checking the ropes. No one checks at this time anyway.",
    ["让他们钻进管道清理煤灰。"] = "They make them crawl into pipes to clear out coal ash.",
    ["让他念下去吧！我们聚在这里就是为了这个。"] = "Let him continue! We gathered here for this.",
    ["让他看清现实"] = "Make him see reality",
    ["让他看看实力！"] = "Show him your strength!",
    ["让他继续等待"] = "Make him continue waiting",
    ["让你们自己骄傲，让霍伊大学的家伙们难受。"] = "Make yourselves proud, and make those guys from Hoey University miserable.",
    ["让你回去多做点家务，别老让我一个人做！"] = "Told me to go back and do more housework, don't always leave it for me to do alone!",
    ["让你意外吗？不是只有水手、海盗才信仰风暴之主。奥古斯都家族从鲁恩立国开始一直信仰“风暴之主”，我的家族亦是因航海而崛起。"] = "Does it surprise you? It's not just sailors and pirates who believe in the Lord of Storms. The Augustus family has believed in the \"Lord of Storms\" since the founding of Loen, and my family also rose because of navigation.",
    ["让你背诵的《罗塞尔诗选》怎样了？毕竟，“午夜诗人”需要使用不同风格的诗篇，才能对周围生灵产生不同的影响。"] = "How is your memorization of the \"Roselle Poetry Collection\" coming along? After all, a Midnight Poet needs to use different styles of poetry to exert different influences on the surrounding living beings.",
    ["让你自己去黑荆棘找我，还是有点太冒险了。"] = "Letting you find me at Blackthorn by yourself is still a bit too risky.",
    ["让吉尔达离开"] = "Let Gilda leave",
    ["让天平左右两端的椅子保持对称，以维持封印！"] = "Keep the chairs on both sides of the scale symmetrical to maintain the seal!",
    ["让奥尔米尔葡萄酒重新注满高脚的水晶杯。"] = "Refill the tall Crystal glass with Olmier wine.",
    ["让她和我这样的人结婚，然后永远在工厂区和码头区过重复的生活，这种事不用庆祝。"] = "Letting her marry someone like me and then living a repetitive life in the factory area and the dock area forever—this kind of thing doesn't need to be celebrated.",
    ["让她和我这样的人结婚，然后永远在工厂区过重复的生活，这种事……用不着庆祝。"] = "Letting her marry someone like me and live a repetitive life in the factory district forever, this kind of thing... is nothing to celebrate.",
    ["让屋内重新暖起来吧"] = "Make the house warm again",
    ["让工人们更积极工作"] = "Make the workers work more actively",
    ["让廷根伟大"] = "Make Tingen Great",
    ["让廷根再次伟大"] = "Make Tingen Great Again",
    ["让开点，小鬼！小心我的刀砍到你！"] = "Move aside, kid! Watch out, or my knife might cut you!",
    ["让思绪飘向遥远的故乡……天哪！这简直就是大帝本想表达却未能落笔的句子！"] = "Letting his thoughts drift toward his distant hometown... My god! This is exactly the line the Emperor wanted to express but failed to write down!",
    ["让您见笑了，诺里斯先生。这孩子在跟我闹小脾气。"] = "Forgive me, Mr. Norris. This child is throwing a little tantrum.",
    ["让您见笑了，诺里斯先生。这孩子在跟我闹小脾气呢，她平时其实很听话的。"] = "Please excuse her, Mr. Norris. This child is throwing a little tantrum with me; she is usually very obedient.",
    ["让我一个人静静吧。"] = "Just let me be alone.",
    ["让我仔细看看。"] = "Let me take a closer look.",
    ["让我们一起庆祝小查理的入学！"] = "Let's celebrate little Charlie's enrollment together!",
    ["让我们一起收割胜利！"] = "Let's reap victory together!",
    ["让我们从最基础的开始。"] = "Let's start with the basics.",
    ["让我们先开始这场铁路大亨体验吧"] = "Let's start this Railway Tycoon experience first.",
    ["让我们庆祝幸运儿的死亡！"] = "Let us celebrate the death of the lucky one!",
    ["让我们开始这场风尚决斗吧"] = "Let us begin this duel of fashion.",
    ["让我们忽略这些细节，开始我们的游戏——"] = "Let us ignore these details and start our game—",
    ["让我们把目光回到擂台！看啊,又有新人在挑战拳王阿比！"] = "Let's turn our attention back to the ring! Look, another newcomer is challenging the boxing champion, Abby!",
    ["让我们期待下次的聚会吧。"] = "Let us look forward to the next gathering.",
    ["让我们来找个好朋友吧！"] = "Let's find a good friend!",
    ["让我们欢迎新加入的正式成员，克莱恩·莫雷蒂，干杯！"] = "Let's welcome our new official member, Klein Moretti, cheers!",
    ["让我们这些真正的赢家再喊一次，“让廷根再次伟大！”"] = "Let us true winners shout it one more time, 'Make Tingen Great Again!'",
    ["让我们高呼他的名字——拳王亨利！"] = "Let us shout his name—Boxing Champion Henry!",
    ["让我假装品一品酒。"] = "Let me pretend to savor the wine.",
    ["让我做点什么吧？会长。"] = "Let me do something? President.",
    ["让我做点什么吧？院长。"] = "Let me do something, shall I? Director.",
    ["让我先来！"] = "Let Me Go First!",
    ["让我再看一眼你斗篷下碧绿如翡翠的瞳孔，听一听你低声念诵时温柔悦耳的嗓音！"] = "Let me take another look at your emerald-like pupils under the cloak, and listen to your gentle and pleasant voice as you whisper!",
    ["让我化作尘埃，永远追随您裙摆的风姿！"] = "Let me turn into dust and forever follow the grace of your skirt!",
    ["让我化作能量消失吧，我会补全你缺少的力量……"] = "Let me turn into energy and disappear; I will complete the power you are missing...",
    ["让我发现了一位迷失于黑暗深处的可怜家伙"] = "Let me discover a poor guy lost in the depths of darkness",
    ["让我听听"] = "Let me listen",
    ["让我在大家面前做菜？真的能有那一天吗？"] = "Let me cook in front of everyone? Can that day really come?",
    ["让我帮你一起找吧。 "] = "Let me help you look for it together.",
    ["让我帮忙传送回廷根？好吧……不过我没什么信心，可能会有点痛……"] = "You want me to help teleport you back to Tingen? Alright... but I don't have much confidence, it might hurt a little...",
    ["让我当猎龙帮老大，为什么？你要放弃猎龙？"] = "Let me be the boss of the Dragon Hunter Gang, why? Are you giving up dragon hunting?",
    ["让我想一下，今天应该……"] = "Let me think, today I should...",
    ["让我想想"] = "Let me think",
    ["让我想想……"] = "Let me think...",
    ["让我想想……一切应该从那个晚上说起……"] = "Let me think... everything should start from that night...",
    ["让我想想……先去圣赛琳娜教堂看看吧，至少可以为杰姆找到医生。"] = "Let me think... let's go to Saint Selena Cathedral first; at least we can find a doctor for Jem.",
    ["让我想想……对了，精妙的比喻、优雅的言辞、崇高的精神……遵循伟大的戏剧法则，我能轻松写出完美的台词。"] = "Let me think... Right, exquisite metaphors, elegant rhetoric, noble spirit... Following the great laws of drama, I can easily write perfect lines.",
    ["让我想想……这束红玫瑰送给塔莎，白色的给黛娜。"] = "Let me think... this bouquet of red roses is for Tasha, and the white ones are for Dana.",
    ["让我想想我的工具箱里有什么……嗯！有灵感了——"] = "Let me think about what's in my toolbox... Hmm! I have inspiration—",
    ["让我想想！"] = "Let me think!",
    ["让我想想，卡丽亚那里有一批火腿，味道很好，你可以去试试，据说是海外进口的。"] = "Let me think, Kalia has a batch of ham that tastes very good; you can try it. It's said to be imported from overseas.",
    ["让我想想，就从……定制梅格夫人的戒指找回计划开始吧！"] = "Let me think. Let's start with... the Mrs. Meg's Ring Retrieval Plan!",
    ["让我想想，罗塞尔大帝在小说里是怎么形容它来着——"] = "Let me think, how did Emperor Roselle describe it in his novels—",
    ["让我改变自己的命运，改变大家的命运，改变——所有人的命运！"] = "Let me change my own fate, change everyone's fate, change—everyone's fate!",
    ["让我来。"] = "Let me.",
    ["让我来分析一下……"] = "Let me analyze...",
    ["让我来听听……你们的哀嚎！"] = "Let me hear... your wails!",
    ["让我来，我能看到善意的灵光。"] = "Let me handle this; I can see the aura of goodwill.",
    ["让我猜猜它叫什么名字！"] = "Let me guess its name!",
    ["让我看看"] = "Let me see",
    ["让我看看……《如何与灵界生物和平共处——从入门到放弃》？"] = "Let me see... \"How to Coexist Peacefully with Spirit World Creatures—From Beginner to Giving Up\"?",
    ["让我看看……你曾经是谁，又为何在这里。"] = "Let me see... who you once were, and why you are here.",
    ["让我看看……糟糕，这是脱臼了，必须马上接回去！"] = "Let me see... oh no, it's dislocated, it must be set back immediately!",
    ["让我看看。"] = "Let me see.",
    ["让我看看是什么人……"] = "Let me see who it is...",
    ["让我看看！"] = "Let me see!",
    ["让我看看，或许我能对这把锁做点什么……"] = "Let me see, perhaps I can do something about this lock...",
    ["让我看看，是哪个呀？"] = "Let me see, which one is it?",
    ["让我看看，该为您这位贵客挑哪一出戏呢……"] = "Let me see, which play should I choose for a distinguished guest like you...",
    ["让我看看，该为您这位贵客挑选哪一出戏呢……"] = "Let me see, which play should I choose for such an honored guest...",
    ["让我瞧瞧……"] = "Let me see...",
    ["让我瞧瞧，嗯……"] = "Let me see, hmm...",
    ["让我瞧瞧，是哪个不长眼的胆敢赖账不还！"] = "Let me see, which blind person dares to default on their debt!",
    ["让我等迈入你的光辉，你的国度，"] = "Let us enter your glory, your kingdom,",
    ["让我给咖啡加点料……鞋底好脏，得洗洗了……"] = "Let me add something to the coffee... The sole of my shoe is so dirty, I need to wash it...",
    ["让我考虑考虑……"] = "Let me consider it...",
    ["让我试试。"] = "Let me try.",
    ["让我进去吧……"] = "Let me in...",
    ["让我送你一个礼物作为补偿怎么样？一个美梦怎么样……祝你美梦成真……"] = "How about I give you a gift as compensation? How about a sweet dream... I wish you sweet dreams come true...",
    ["让我问问……"] = "Let me ask...",
    ["让我领教领教你的实力！"] = "Let me taste your strength!",
    ["让指定技能槽的技能进入cd ，  IDs 不填，bAllSkills为FALSE时才生效，"] = "Put the skill in the specified skill slot into CD; IDs left blank, only effective when bAllSkills is FALSE.",
    ["让指定技能槽的技能进入cd，  填了后，优先获取指定技能槽的技能进入cd，优先级大于SkillID参数"] = "Put the skill in the specified skill slot into CD; after filling, prioritize getting the skill in the specified skill slot into CD; priority is higher than the SkillID parameter.",
    ["让旅行社为您导览吧！"] = "Let the travel agency guide you!",
    ["让柯莱特研发出药剂可不是什么好事，你，你们忘了上次长出鳃和鱼尾的小白鼠了吗？"] = "Letting Collette develop a potion is not a good thing. You, have you forgotten the white mouse that grew gills and a fish tail last time?",
    ["让炖豌豆作为您今天餐桌上的黄金配角吧！"] = "Let stewed peas be the golden supporting role on your dining table today!",
    ["让特定技能退出ComboWindow，填0或者不填，代表本技能"] = "Let a specific skill exit the ComboWindow. Entering 0 or leaving blank represents the current skill.",
    ["让科恩黎替换老尼尔看守武器库，通知老尼尔、弗莱准备出任务。克莱恩、伦纳德，我也和你们一起去。"] = "Have Cohen replace Old Neil to guard the Armory, and notify Old Neil and Frye to prepare for a mission. Klein, Leonard, I'll go with you too.",
    ["让美和我们轻信的歌互相躲闪"] = "Let beauty and our gullible songs dodge each other",
    ["让老先生自己待会儿"] = "Let the old gentleman have some time to himself",
    ["让菲利普喝点水"] = "Let Philip drink some water",
    ["让菲利普喝点水吧。"] = "Let Philip have some water.",
    ["让蒙特利“清醒清醒”"] = "Tell Monterey to \"sober up\"",
    ["让蒙特利“清醒清醒”（AI）"] = "Tell Monterey to \"sober up\" (AI)",
    ["让蓝帽子制裁你们"] = "Let the Blue Hats sanction you",
    ["让路人来评评理，谁的爱人一周只能分一天给你？"] = "Let a passerby judge this. Whose lover can only spare one day a week for you?",
    ["让这位野生非凡者，继续做她的“闪电莉莉”吧！"] = "Let this wild Beyonder continue to be her \"Lightning Lily\"!",
    ["让醉汉离开天台"] = "Get the drunkard to leave the rooftop",
    ["让长桌上鎏金的烛台重新燃起不熄的火光。"] = "Let the gilded candelabra on the long table reignite with an inextinguishable flame.",
    ["训练场"] = "Training Ground",
    ["训练场木桩"] = "Training Ground Dummy",
    ["训练场木桩设置"] = "Training Ground Dummy Settings",
    ["训练师"] = "Trainer",
    ["训练设置"] = "Training Settings",
    ["训练？！"] = "Training?!",
    ["议事厅"] = "Council Hall",
    ["议事厅升级可提升俱乐部等级，从而提升其它建筑等级上限。"] = "Upgrading the Council Hall can increase the Club level, thereby increasing the level caps of other buildings.",
    ["议事厅升级可提升俱乐部等级，提升其它建筑等级上限，建议优先升级。"] = "Upgrading the Council Chamber can increase the Club level and raise the level caps of other buildings; it is recommended to upgrade it first.",
    ["议事厅正在升级中，升级成功后才可升级该建筑"] = "The Council Hall is upgrading; this building can only be upgraded after the upgrade is successful.",
    ["议价·商行"] = "Bargain · Trading Firm",
    ["议价·商行失效，本站不是【商行】"] = "Bargain: Trading House failed, this station is not [Trading House]",
    ["议价·商行生效，本站出售价格+40%"] = "Bargaining · Trading Firm effective, selling price at this station +40%",
    ["议价·酒庄"] = "Bargain · Winery",
    ["议价·酒庄失效，本站不是【酒庄】"] = "Bargain: Winery failed, this station is not [Winery]",
    ["议价·酒庄生效，本站购买价格-40%"] = "Bargaining · Winery effective, purchase price at this station -40%",
    ["议价·食铺"] = "Bargain · Food Shop",
    ["议价·食铺失效，本站不是【食铺】"] = "Bargain: Shop failed, this station is not [Shop]",
    ["议价·食铺生效，本站出售价格+40%"] = "Bargaining · Food Shop effective, selling price at this station +40%",
    ["议员"] = "Councilor",
    ["议员先生，您和纺织厂老板的私人会面频率有点高啊。"] = "Councilor, the frequency of your private meetings with the textile mill owner is a bit high.",
    ["议员曼德"] = "Councilor Mande",
    ["议院治安队·查理，嘴上喊着法律与秩序，可他不光杀人——还洗脑。"] = "Charlie from the Parliament Security Team—he talks about law and order, but he doesn't just kill people—he brainwashes them too.",
    ["议院治安队首领"] = "Council Security Team Leader",
    ["议院治安队首领\r\n金狼·查理"] = "Chief of the Council Security Force\r\nGolden Wolf Charlie",
    ["记下真相"] = "Record the truth",
    ["记下线索"] = "Note down the clue",
    ["记住 这次是猎龙帮惹到我了"] = "Remember, this time it was the Dragon Hunter Gang that provoked me.",
    ["记住了"] = "Remembered",
    ["记住你只是在扮演"] = "Remember you are only Acting",
    ["记住你的选择，它会伴随你一生。"] = "Remember your choice; it will accompany you for the rest of your life.",
    ["记住她的名字吧——卡萝·比舍普，一位伟大的值夜者队长。"] = "Remember her name—Carol Bishop, a great Nighthawk captain.",
    ["记住朋友，在廷根……当你拿到这个的时候，你就已经不是“好市民”，而是我们的一员了。欢迎来到真实的秩序世界，现在，来领赏，或者滚蛋。"] = "Remember friend, in Tingen... when you get this, you are no longer a \"good citizen,\" but one of us. Welcome to the world of true order. Now, come collect your reward, or get out.",
    ["记住每场宴会不同主人的禁忌。威尔逊家不能提海鲜，因为长子对贝类过敏；卡洛斯家忌讳谈天气，他们家族的商船曾在暴风雨中损失惨重。 "] = "Remember the taboos of different hosts at every banquet. You cannot mention seafood at the Wilson family's because the eldest son is allergic to shellfish; the Carlos family avoids talking about the weather because their family's merchant ships suffered heavy losses in a storm.",
    ["记住这份守护的决心，祂的蛊惑就不会成功。"] = "Remember this determination to guard, and His bewitchment will not succeed.",
    ["记住，与某些神秘的危险存在沟通，是要付出昂贵的代价的。"] = "Remember, communicating with certain mysterious and dangerous existences comes at a high price.",
    ["记住，你不是邪神子嗣，不要忘记，不要屈服。"] = "Remember, you are not the offspring of an Evil God. Do not forget, do not yield.",
    ["记住，你只是在扮演。"] = "Remember, you are only Acting.",
    ["记住，你只有<P_Yellow>5次</>提问的机会，而我只能用<P_Yellow>“是”与“否”</>来回答你。"] = "Remember, you only have <P_Yellow>5</> chances to ask questions, and I can only answer you with <P_Yellow>\"Yes\" or \"No\"</>.",
    ["记住，占卜家是命运的见证者，不是审判者。"] = "Remember, a Seer is a witness to fate, not a judge.",
    ["记住，只要你信仰女神，在这里任何东西都无法伤害你。"] = "Remember, as long as you believe in the Goddess, nothing here can harm you.",
    ["记住，因为你的物品位格过高，这或许将是一场“神降”仪式。"] = "Remember, because the level of your item is too high, this might be a 'divine descent' ritual.",
    ["记住，在这项程序中，你的武器并非只有左轮与符咒，更是敏锐的观察、严密的逻辑与无畏的勇气。"] = "Remember, in this procedure, your weapons are not just revolvers and charms, but also keen observation, rigorous logic, and fearless courage.",
    ["记住，如果你发现任何王冠形状的物品或者异常事件，不要惊动，不要打扰，立刻回来禀报。"] = "Remember, if you discover any crown-shaped objects or abnormal events, do not alert them, do not disturb them, and report back immediately.",
    ["记住，崔佛还在等你！"] = "Remember, Trevor is still waiting for you!",
    ["记住，永无不可怀疑之真理。"] = "Remember, there is no truth that cannot be doubted.",
    ["记住，注意力集中，找准时机，快、准、狠！"] = "Remember, focus your attention, find the right timing, and be fast, accurate, and ruthless!",
    ["记住，注意力集中，找准时机，快、准、狠！不要让对手看懂你的招数！"] = "Remember, focus your attention, find the right timing, and be fast, accurate, and ruthless! Don't let your opponent understand your moves!",
    ["记住，注意力集中，找准时机，快、准、狠！不要让对手看懂你的招数！大不了，你还有爪子不是嘛！"] = "Remember, focus your attention, find the right timing, and be fast, accurate, and ruthless! Don't let your opponent understand your moves! If all else fails, you still have your claws, don't you!",
    ["记住，注意力集中，找准时机，快、准、狠！大不了，你还有爪子不是嘛！"] = "Remember, focus your attention, find the right timing, and be fast, accurate, and ruthless! If all else fails, you still have your claws, don't you!",
    ["记住，绝对不能停，这关系到你的安全！"] = "Remember, absolutely do not stop. This concerns your safety!",
    ["记住，美丽总是需要代价的……但你会发现，这代价是如此值得。"] = "Remember, beauty always comes with a price... but you will find that the price is so worth it.",
    ["记住，这次猎龙帮又惹到我了！"] = "Remember, the Dragon Hunter Gang has provoked me again this time!",
    ["记录"] = "Record",
    ["记录InSights文件到本地"] = "Record InSights File Locally",
    ["记录·惩戒"] = "Record: Punishment",
    ["记录·放逐"] = "Record: Banishment",
    ["记录·梦境"] = "Record: Dream",
    ["记录·牌雨"] = "Record: Card Rain",
    ["记录·窥秘"] = "Record: Mystery Pry",
    ["记录·飓风"] = "Record: Hurricane",
    ["记录一下"] = "Just recording",
    ["记录世界的法师，漫游星空的旅行者，打开黑暗宇宙的钥匙，黄黑之王的眷者，掌管道路与行动的魔术师。"] = "The mage who records the world, the traveler who roams the starry sky, the key that opens the dark universe, the Blessed of the Lord of the Mysteries, and the Magician who governs paths and actions.",
    ["记录之愿-普通"] = "Record of Wishes - Normal",
    ["记录之愿-普通难度"] = "Record of Wishes-Normal Difficulty",
    ["记录之愿-英雄"] = "Record of Wishes - Hero",
    ["记录之愿-英雄难度"] = "Record of Wishes-Heroic Difficulty",
    ["记录了元素法术能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded elemental spell abilities.",
    ["记录了其他非凡者成长经验的特殊能量魔水，使用后可快速经历其他强大非凡者的成长之路，让自己迅速度过弱小期，获得10000点经验"] = "A special energy potion that records the growth experience of other Beyonders. After use, one can quickly experience the growth path of other powerful Beyonders, allowing oneself to quickly pass through the weak period and gain 10,000 experience points.",
    ["记录了占卜家途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Seer pathway.",
    ["记录了学徒途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Apprentice pathway.",
    ["记录了战士途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Warrior pathway.",
    ["记录了战歌增幅能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded war song amplification abilities.",
    ["记录了歌颂者途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Bard pathway.",
    ["记录了破阵斩击能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded battle-breaking slash abilities.",
    ["记录了窥秘人途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Mystery Pryer pathway.",
    ["记录了观众途径能力的星之虫。"] = "A Star of Stars that has recorded the abilities of the Spectator pathway.",
    ["记录失败，当前场景不支持记录福音尖碑"] = "Recording failed; the current scene does not support recording the Gospel Stele.",
    ["记录官"] = "Scribe",
    ["记录官魔药"] = "Recorder Potion",
    ["记录并查看出现过的符文"] = "Record and view runes that have appeared.",
    ["记录持续时间内受到的伤害，在效果结束时，回复记录伤害一定比例的生命值。"] = "Record the damage taken during the duration, and restore a certain percentage of Health based on the recorded damage when the effect ends.",
    ["记录救助人数"] = "Record number of rescues",
    ["记录有效值，溢出部分不计算"] = "Record effective value; overflow portion is not calculated.",
    ["记录未知植物"] = "Record unknown plants",
    ["记录查询过于频繁。"] = "Record query is too frequent.",
    ["记录目标途径的<HighLight>非凡能力</>（记录非玩家目标则随机获得本途径的非凡能力）。技能释放后可连招施法，召唤投影使用被记录的<HighLight>非凡能力</>（非本途径的非凡能力只保留基础效果）。\n\n<FaintYellow>可被记录的能力</>：\n歌颂者：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054010\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>\n观众：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054020\" color=\"#f4a067\">心理暗示</>\n占卜家：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054030\" color=\"#f4a067\">空气弹</>\n学徒：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054050\" color=\"#f4a067\">星云咏叹</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054052\" color=\"#f4a067\">戏法演绎</>、<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054054\" color=\"#f4a067\">放逐</>\n战士：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054060\" color=\"#f4a067\">王庭号令</>\n窥秘人：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054070\" color=\"#f4a067\">星光囚笼</>"] = "Record the <HighLight>Beyonder ability</> of the target pathway (if recording a non-player target, a random Beyonder ability from that pathway is obtained). After casting, you can perform a combo to summon a projection to use the recorded <HighLight>Beyonder ability</> (Beyonder abilities not of your own pathway only retain their basic effects). \n\n<FaintYellow>Recordable abilities</>: \nBard: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Hurricane Axe</>\nSpectator: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054020\" color=\"#f4a067\">Psychological Suggestion</>\nSeer: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054030\" color=\"#f4a067\">Air Bullet</>\nApprentice: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Nebula Aria</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054052\" color=\"#f4a067\">Trick Performance</>, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054054\" color=\"#f4a067\">Exile</>\nWarrior: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Royal Court Command</>\nMystery Pryer: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86054070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Starlight Cage</>",
    ["记录目标途径的非凡能力。技能释放后可连招施法，召唤投影使用被记录的非凡能力。"] = "Record the Beyonder ability of a target pathway. After the skill is released, you can trigger a combo to summon a projection that uses the recorded Beyonder ability.",
    ["记录着他人不愿被知晓的记忆。"] = "Recording memories that others do not wish to be known.",
    ["记录着晋升至序列3的魔药配方的羊皮纸，消化进度达到一定程度后由黑荆棘安保公司提供给活跃成员。"] = "A parchment recording the potion formula for advancement to Sequence 3, provided by the Blackthorn Security Company to active members after reaching a certain level of digestion progress.",
    ["记录着晋升至序列4的魔药配方的羊皮纸，消化进度达到一定程度后由黑荆棘安保公司提供给活跃成员。"] = "A parchment recording the potion formula for advancement to Sequence 4, provided by the Blackthorn Security Company to active members after reaching a certain level of digestion progress.",
    ["记录着晋升至序列5的魔药配方的羊皮纸，消化进度达到一定程度后由黑荆棘安保公司提供给活跃成员。"] = "A parchment recording the potion formula for advancement to Sequence 5, provided by the Blackthorn Security Company to active members after reaching a certain level of digestion progress.",
