    ["讲座宣传单"] = "Lecture Flyer",
    ["讲服装、讲搭配的杂志，不知道是哪位女士带来的。"] = "A magazine about clothing and styling; I wonder which lady brought it.",
    ["讲起来比较复杂。时间紧迫，还需要去救其他人，你先跟着我。"] = "It's complicated to explain. Time is tight, and we still need to save others, you follow me first.",
