    ["该如何描摹你，\n用目光，用声音。\n像忽明忽灭的焰火，\n湖中雪絮。\n我听见你。"] = "How should I describe you, \n with eyes, with voice. \n Like flickering flame fire, \n snow flurries in the lake. \n I hear you.",
    ["该如何记住你，用乐曲，用回忆。\r\n月色朦胧，琴音静谧，\r\n今夜悄无声息。"] = "How should I remember you? With music, with memories.\nThe moonlight is hazy, the piano notes are quiet,\nTonight, everything is silent.",
