    ["该槽位暂未使用"] = "This slot is currently unused",
    ["该模式中，最多可设置8个座位。设置完成后，仅房主与1号座位玩家可开麦，1号玩家发言完毕后，需点击下麦按钮，将开麦位置传给2号玩家。"] = "In this mode, up to 8 seats can be set. Once set, only the host and the player in seat #1 can unmute. After player #1 finishes speaking, they must click the \"Step Down\" button to pass the microphone to player #2.",
    ["该模板已经上传装扮广场，删除该模板也会<Highlight>同步删除</>装扮广场的模板，是否继续？"] = "This template has been uploaded to the Dress-up Plaza. Deleting this template will also <Highlight>simultaneously delete</> it from the Dress-up Plaza. Do you wish to continue?",
    ["该模板已被作者删除，暂时无法使用。"] = "This template has been deleted by the author and cannot be used for now.",
    ["该模板暂时无法使用"] = "This template is currently unavailable.",
    ["该模板解锁条件不足"] = "Unlock conditions for this template not met.",
    ["该模板需要<Highlight>%s</>级使用，当前保存后无法直接使用，是否继续保存？"] = "This template requires <Highlight>%s level </> to use. It cannot be used directly after saving. Continue saving?",
    ["该步骤不要设成存档节点"] = "Do not set this step as a save node",
    ["该步骤无法完成"] = "This step cannot be completed",
    ["该死……哈罗德百货的股票又跌了！"] = "Damn it... Harold Department Store's stock has fallen again!",
    ["该死……托马斯爷爷，对不起。"] = "Damn it... Grandpa Thomas, I'm sorry.",
    ["该死的世道，逼得我们干这种活儿……"] = "This damn world, forcing us to do this kind of work...",
    ["该死的亵渎者，你在做什么......"] = "Damn blasphemer, what are you doing...",
    ["该死的厂长已经拖欠了一个月的薪水，他的老婆才得病去世没多久，小女儿又因为没钱吃饭，活活饿死了。"] = "The damn factory manager has been withholding wages for a month. His wife just died of illness not long ago, and his little daughter starved to death because they had no money for food.",
    ["该死的弗萨克人，他们在四年前偷袭贝克兰德引起的战争。赞美女神，我们还是赢了。"] = "Damn Feynapotters, they launched a sneak attack on Backlund four years ago, causing the war. Praise the Goddess, we still won.",
    ["该死的税金小偷！就在刚才！它还在追杀我！"] = "Damn tax thieves! Just now! It was still chasing me!",
    ["该死的老鼠！滚！滚！"] = "Damn rats! Get out! Get out!",
    ["该死的！怎么抽中我出外勤了！"] = "Damn it! How did I get picked for field duty!",
    ["该死的！菲尔！怎么会是你！这个案子不是你叫我查的吗……"] = "Damn it! Phil! How could it be you! Didn't you ask me to investigate this case...",
    ["该死的，他以为这条街上的住客都是绵羊吗？不揍一顿根本不会老实！"] = "Damn it, does he think the residents on this street are all sheep? They won't be obedient without a beating!",
    ["该死的，他要是不死，有人可是要睡不着觉了。"] = "Damn it, if he doesn't die, someone won't be able to sleep at night.",
    ["该死的，你怎么就这么走了！"] = "Damn it, how could you just leave like that!",
    ["该死的，我感觉我一直活在罗塞尔大帝的影子里。为什么我的灵感永远会被他早一步想到！"] = "Damn it, I feel like I've been living in the shadow of Emperor Roselle. Why is it that my inspiration is always one step behind his thoughts!",
    ["该死的，琳达居然赢了，我的钱，我攒了半辈子的钱都没了……"] = "Damn it, Linda actually won, my money, the money I saved for half my life is gone...",
    ["该死的，该死的，为了这条丝巾，我被当成变态，让警察先生狠狠地盘问了十分钟！"] = "Damn it, damn it. For this silk scarf, I was treated like a pervert and interrogated fiercely by the police for ten minutes!",
    ["该死的，这丫头怎么也这么凶了？快走！"] = "Damn it, why is this girl so fierce too? Run!",
    ["该死的，这种闹鬼的祖宅，怎么可能卖得出去？"] = "Damn it, how could such a haunted ancestral home be sold?",
    ["该死！你们觉得这合理吗！"] = "Damn it! Do you guys think this is reasonable?!",
    ["该死！你又把午餐弄不见了？！"] = "Damn it! You made your lunch disappear again?!",
    ["该死！偏偏是集市这个地方，这么多人我该从哪里开始呢？"] = "Damn it! Of all places, it had to be the market. With so many people, where should I start?",
    ["该死！我们都该死！"] = "Damn it! We're all going to die!",
    ["该死！无论如何我都得去看看。它刚才说教堂，我大概知道在哪里了。"] = "Damn it! No matter what, I have to go see. It mentioned a church just now, and I think I know where it is.",
    ["该死！演出又停下了，是在故意戏弄我们吗？"] = "Damn it! The performance stopped again. Are they teasing us on purpose?",
    ["该死！要是被混蛋伊尼戈捡到，他又得讹我一笔！"] = "Damn it! If that jerk Inigo finds it, he'll try to extort me again!",
    ["该死！这鞋子是我最心爱的！你这小鬼真是该死！"] = "Damn it! These shoes are my favorite! You little brat, you're really asking for it!",
    ["该死，两边都是狙击手……"] = "Damn it, there are snipers on both sides...",
    ["该死，书页一定就在附近……"] = "Damn it, the page must be nearby...",
    ["该死，你又来这一套！"] = "Damn it, you're doing this again!",
    ["该死，你怎么在棺材里？"] = "Damn it, why are you in a coffin?",
    ["该死，你惹到了<P_Yellow>猎龙帮</>！"] = "Damn it, you've provoked the <P_Yellow>Dragon Hunter Gang</>!",
    ["该死，再这样我们就分手吧！"] = "Damn it, if this continues, let's just break up!",
    ["该死，又输了！"] = "Damn it, lost again!",
    ["该死，头好晕……几杯差点把我也搭进去。"] = "Damn, I'm so dizzy... Those few drinks almost did me in too.",
    ["该死，安迪的死，那些人的死，都是为了这所谓的晋升？"] = "Damn it, Andy's death, the deaths of those people, were they all for this so-called advancement?",
    ["该死，我就知道，又是这子弹！警局内部肯定有问题！"] = "Damn it, I knew it, this bullet again! There must be a problem within the police department!",
    ["该死，我最终心软了，哪只耳朵也没有拧。"] = "Damn it, I ended up softening my heart and didn't twist either ear.",
    ["该死，托尼，你真报警了？会影响租房的！"] = "Damn it, Tony, you really called the police? It will affect the renting!",
    ["该死，没想到他们这么快就追来了，嘶，我中了一枪，顶不住了。这回看你的了。"] = "Damn it, I didn't expect them to catch up so fast. Hiss, I've been shot, I can't hold on. It's up to you now.",
    ["该死，竟然中了圈套，坏人怎么这么多！"] = "Damn it, I actually fell into a trap. Why are there so many bad people!",
