    ["读了这本《走上人生巅峰的一百种方法》，你就可以知道！"] = "Read this \"100 Ways to Reach the Peak of Life,\" and you will know!",
    ["读信"] = "Read the letter",
    ["读信女子"] = "Woman reading letter",
    ["读取分析并持续保护目标的心智，对其进行额外治疗，并在低生命时提供护盾。"] = "Read, analyze, and continuously protect the target's mind, providing additional healing and a shield when health is low.",
    ["读取场景配置的复活数据，调用复活"] = "Read resurrection data configured in the scene and call resurrection.",
    ["读取档案"] = "Read the file",
    ["读完剩余<h>资料</>"] = "Finish reading the remaining <h>documents</>",
    ["读完剩余资料"] = "Finish Reading the Remaining Documents",
    ["读得多了，自然就记得住。 至于我没记住的……不如玩个游戏？你问，我答。答错了——你罚我一杯，还是……我罚你一杯？"] = "Read enough, and you naturally remember. As for what I haven't remembered... how about a game? You ask, I answer. If I get it wrong—you penalize me a drink, or... should I penalize you a drink?",
    ["读心"] = "Mind Reading",
    ["读心护盾"] = "Mind Reading Shield",
