    ["读心？狂乱？或者用心理暗示找人单<P_Yellow>挑</>？"] = "Mind Reading? Frenzy? Or using Psychological Suggestion to challenge someone to a duel<P_Yellow></>?",
    ["读懂目标渴望，理解对方最真实的欲求。"] = "Read the target's desires and understand their truest cravings.",
    ["读日记及答疑"] = "Read Diary and Q&A",
