    ["调整时间"] = "Adjust Time",
    ["调整朝向避开队友"] = "Adjust orientation to avoid teammates",
    ["调整滑块，恰好看清人类形象，但看不清神明符号时，体验最佳"] = "Adjust the slider until you can just clearly see the human image, but cannot clearly see the divine symbols; this provides the best experience.",
    ["调整灯光"] = "Adjust Lighting",
    ["调整矩形点名面向冲击<Disable>丰饶之藤</>，将其弱化为绿色藤蔓。靠近绿色藤蔓会被其束缚，规避<Disable>丰饶恩赐</>的击退效果。"] = "Adjust the rectangular targeting orientation to impact the <Disable>Vine of Abundance</>, weakening it into green vines. Approaching the green vines will cause you to be bound, avoiding the knockback effect of <Disable>Bounty of Abundance</>.",
    ["调整角色闪避距离倍率，参数：倍率（大于等于0生效，小于0清除）"] = "Adjust character dodge distance multiplier, parameter: multiplier (effective if >= 0, cleared if < 0).",
