    ["豆角有一股青草的香味，嚼着很有韧劲；而竹笋水分更足，吃起来脆嫩鲜甜。"] = "The green beans have a grassy fragrance and are chewy, while the bamboo shoots are juicier, tasting crisp, tender, and sweet.",
    ["豌豆也指不定是放了多少天的，又瘪又老，难吃。"] = "The peas have probably been sitting there for days; they're shriveled and old. It's awful.",
