    ["豪尔斯街\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Howes Street</>"] = "Howls Street\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Howes Street</>",
    ["豪尔斯街……那里是不是有个挺有名的占卜俱乐部？"] = "Howls Street... is there a quite famous Divination Club there?",
