    ["贝克·"] = "Baker ",
    ["贝克兰德"] = "Backlund",
    ["贝克兰德……东区的人想当西区人，西区的人想当贵族，贵族想当……什么呢？"] = "Backlund... people in the East District want to be like those in the West District, people in the West District want to be nobles, and nobles want to be... what?",
    ["贝克兰德……看来去那里的人依旧很多。"] = "Backlund... it seems there are still many people going there.",
    ["贝克兰德、拜亚姆、班西港……不过今天只有一艘前往拜亚姆的航班。"] = "Backlund, Bayam, Bansy Harbor... but today there is only one flight to Bayam.",
    ["贝克兰德七"] = "Backlund Seven",
    ["贝克兰德七月平均最高气温28摄氏度，冬季最低则在2摄氏度左右。"] = "The average maximum temperature in Backlund in July is 28 degrees Celsius, while the minimum in winter is around 2 degrees Celsius.",
    ["贝克兰德东北特产"] = "Backlund Northeast Specialty",
    ["贝克兰德中产家庭出身，家住圣乔治区。\n气质慵懒，原诊所外科医生，现为畅销作家，以拖稿闻名。\n\"塔罗会\"创始成员，代号\"魔术师\"，帮助亚伯拉罕家族拜托满月诅咒的重要人物。"] = "Born into a middle-class family in Backlund, living in the Saint George District.\n She has a lazy temperament, was originally a clinic surgeon, and is now a bestselling author known for missing deadlines.\n A founding member of the \"Tarot Club\" with the codename \"The Magician,\" she is an important figure in helping the Abraham Family get rid of the full moon curse.",
    ["贝克兰德中产家庭出身，家住圣乔治区。\n气质慵懒，原诊所外科医生，现为畅销作家，以拖稿闻名。\n\"塔罗会\"创始成员，代号\"魔术师\"，帮助亚伯拉罕家族摆脱满月诅咒的重要人物。"] = "Born into a middle-class Family in Backlund, residing in the Saint George District.\nPossessing a languid temperament, formerly a clinic surgeon, now a bestselling author known for missing deadlines.\nA founding member of the Tarot Club, codenamed \"Magician,\" and a key figure in helping the Abraham Family escape the Full Moon Curse.",
    ["贝克兰德也有好人吧？"] = "There are good people in Backlund too, right?",
    ["贝克兰德五"] = "Backlund Five",
    ["贝克兰德今日多云，局部地区精神状况电闪雷鸣……"] = "Backlund is cloudy today, with localized mental thunder and lightning...",
    ["贝克兰德六字"] = "Backlund Six Characters",
    ["贝克兰德博物馆里那件，和您眼前这件是孪生兄弟。"] = "The one in the Backlund Museum is a twin to the one in front of you.",
    ["贝克兰德啊，这里藏着太多秘密，太多谎言，太多自以为藏得很好的东西。"] = "Backlund, it hides too many secrets, too many lies, and too many things that people think are well hidden.",
    ["贝克兰德四"] = "Backlund Four",
    ["贝克兰德城区"] = "Backlund City Area",
    ["贝克兰德大学……会是什么样的呢？"] = "Backlund University... what would it be like?",
    ["贝克兰德大道"] = "Backlund Avenue",
    ["贝克兰德大道站，贝克兰德大道从皇后区御前花园穿过乔伍德区、希尔斯顿区，联通到贝克兰德桥区，是代表皇家威仪的大道。"] = "Backlund Avenue Station. Backlund Avenue runs from the Imperial Garden in the Empress Borough through the Cherwood Borough and Hillston Borough, connecting to the Backlund Bridge Borough. It is an avenue that represents royal majesty.",
    ["贝克兰德大雾霾事件过后，王国开始治理空气污染，现在明显好转。"] = "After the Great Smog of Backlund, the kingdom began to manage air pollution, and it has now significantly improved.",
    ["贝克兰德宠物饼干的治疗量提升10%。"] = "Backlund pet biscuit healing increased by 10%.",
    ["贝克兰德拥有超过五百万人口，是南北大陆最繁华的城市。"] = "Backlund has a population of over five million and is the most prosperous city on the northern and southern continents.",
    ["贝克兰德探索提升至16%，解开了32的谜题"] = "Backlund exploration increased to 16%, solved 32 puzzles",
    ["贝克兰德教区值夜者执事。\n收尸人途径序列6\"死灵导师\"。十九岁误服魔药成为非凡者，三年内从序列9晋升至序列6，自行摸索扮演法，被称为值夜者中的\"天才\"。\n与廷根值夜者队长邓恩·史密斯互相爱慕却从未告白。1350年6月于南大陆战死，临终前与克莱恩化成的邓恩跳完最后一支舞。"] = "Deacon of the Backlund Diocese Nighthawks.\n Sequence 6 \"Spirit Guide\" of the Corpse Collector Pathway. She accidentally consumed a potion at nineteen to become a Beyonder, advanced from Sequence 9 to Sequence 6 within three years, and explored the Acting method on her own, known as a \"genius\" among the Nighthawks.\n She and Tingen Nighthawk captain Dunn Smith shared mutual affection but never confessed. She died in battle in the Southern Continent in June 1350, dancing one last dance with Klein, who had taken on Dunn's appearance, before she passed away.",
    ["贝克兰德时常下雨，该地区拥有先进的下水道系统。"] = "It rains often in Backlund, and the area has an advanced sewage system.",
    ["贝克兰德是鲁恩王国的首都，是万都之都、希望之地、尘埃之都。"] = "Backlund is the capital of the Loen Kingdom, the City of Cities, the Land of Hope, and the City of Dust.",
    ["贝克兰德是鲁恩的首都，被誉为“万都之都”。"] = "Backlund is the capital of Loen, known as the \"City of Cities\".",
    ["贝克兰德曾是图铎-特伦索斯特联合帝国的首都。"] = "Backlund was once the capital of the Tudor-Trunsoest United Empire.",
    ["贝克兰德最璀璨的钻石"] = "The brightest diamond in Backlund",
    ["贝克兰德最近流行什么服饰？"] = "What fashion is popular in Backlund recently?",
    ["贝克兰德有什么好？除了大点，简直……简直……"] = "What's so good about Backlund? Besides being big, it's simply... simply...",
    ["贝克兰德有着众多隐秘组织，拥有强大的工业和经济基础。"] = "Backlund has numerous secret organizations and possesses a strong industrial and economic foundation.",
    ["贝克兰德的医生都对此束手无策？"] = "The doctors in Backlund are helpless against this?",
    ["贝克兰德的天气总是阴沉、起雾、连绵不断的雨，能够在这样的好天气遇见您，我很愉快。嗯，也祝您快乐。"] = "The weather in Backlund is always gloomy, foggy, and rainy; I am very happy to meet you in such good weather. Well, I wish you happiness too.",
    ["贝克兰德的斯内克大主教，人称“神之歌者”，一首《风暴之心》据说能让整个贝克兰德港的海水为之共鸣！而你们连调都找不到，唉！"] = "Archbishop Snake of Backlund, known as the \"God's Singer,\" a song of \"Heart of the Storm\" is said to be able to make the seawater of the entire Backlund port resonate! And you guys can't even find the key, sigh!",
    ["贝克兰德的标志性建筑为“秩序之钟”和索德拉克宫。"] = "The iconic buildings of Backlund are the 'Clock of Order' and the Sodrak Palace.",
    ["贝克兰德皇后区，一栋豪华别墅内。奥黛丽坐在梳妆台前，摩挲着手上的一面镜子：“魔镜魔镜快苏醒，我以霍尔家族之名，命令你苏醒！”"] = "In a luxurious villa in the Backlund Empress District, Audrey sat in front of her vanity, stroking a mirror in her hand: \"Magic mirror, magic mirror, wake up! In the name of the Hall family, I command you to wake up!\"",
    ["贝克兰德舞会之星的忠告：记住，亲爱的，邀请函比情书更有分量。"] = "Advice from the Star of the Backlund Ball: Remember, my dear, an invitation is weightier than a love letter.",
    ["贝克兰德被塔索克河分成了两个部分，由贝克兰德桥连接。"] = "Backlund is divided into two parts by the Tussock River, connected by the Backlund Bridge.",
    ["贝克兰德贵族霍尔伯爵之女，出身高贵，生活富裕。\n金发碧眼，容貌美若天使，心地善良，有“贝克兰德最耀眼的宝石”的美誉。\n“塔罗会”创始成员之一，代号“正义”，同时也是心理炼金会评议团委员，代号“傲慢”。"] = "Daughter of Earl Hall, a noble of Backlund, born into nobility and living in wealth. \n With golden hair and green eyes, her appearance is as beautiful as an angel, and she is kind-hearted, known as \"Backlund's most dazzling gem.\" \n One of the founding members of the \"Tarot Club,\" codenamed \"Justice,\" and also a member of the Psychology Alchemists' Council, codenamed \"Arrogance.\"",
    ["贝克兰德贵族霍尔伯爵之女，容貌绝美，心地善良，被称为“贝克兰德最耀眼的宝石”。“塔罗会”创始成员之一，代号“正义”，同时也是心理炼金会评议团委员，代号“傲慢”。"] = "Daughter of Count Hall, a noble of Backlund. She is beautiful and kind-hearted, known as 'Backlund's Brightest Gem'. A founding member of the Tarot Club, codenamed 'Justice', and also a member of the Council of the Psychology Alchemists, codenamed 'Pride'.",
