    ["贝尔纳黛挥舞手臂，半透明的“破晓勋章”像烟花一样绽放开来，散成无数小星星落向四方。\n学派的天花板上浮现了许多闪烁的星星。\n学员纷纷欢呼鼓掌，跃跃欲试。"] = "Bernadette waved her arm, and the translucent \"Medal of Dawn\" bloomed like fireworks, scattering into countless little stars falling in all directions. \n Many twinkling stars appeared on the ceiling of the school. \n The students cheered and applauded, eager to try.",
