    ["贝茨太太……她是不是……"] = "Mrs. Bates... is she...",
    ["贝茨太太事件完结，我也要开始追踪新的超自然现象了。揭露真相，这是记者的使命，再见！"] = "The Mrs. Bates incident is over, and I must start tracking new supernatural phenomena. Uncovering the truth is a reporter's mission. Goodbye!",
    ["贝茨太太前几天到处求购奇怪的材料：深海鱼血液、怪物胃袋……这引起了我的注意。我怀疑她正在准备某种神秘学仪式，跟踪了她。"] = "A few days ago, Mrs. Bates was going around trying to buy strange materials: deep-sea fish blood, monster stomachs... This caught my attention. I suspect she is preparing some kind of occult ritual, so I followed her.",
    ["贝茨太太失控怪"] = "Mrs. Bates Loss of Control Monster",
