    ["负面"] = "Negative",
    ["负面冻结层数"] = "Negative Freezing Stacks",
    ["负面效果"] = "Negative Effect",
    ["负面效果冻结的层数"] = "Negative effect Freeze stacks",
    ["负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害减免"] = "Negative effects nullified, all skill levels +1, Damage Reduction",
    ["负面效果失效，所有技能等级+1，伤害加深"] = "Negative effects nullified, all skill levels +1, Damage Deepening",
    ["负面效果是会让使用者一点点累积暴躁的情绪，这个只要定期发泄，就不存在问题，不过，它还有一个负面效果，那就是持有它的人，在无光的环境下，被黑暗深处恐怖怪物袭击的概率是百分之百！"] = "The negative effect is that it will cause the user to accumulate irritable emotions bit by bit. This isn't a problem as long as it's vented regularly, but it has another negative effect: the person holding it has a 100% probability of being attacked by terrifying monsters in the depths of the darkness when in a lightless environment!",
    ["负面效果是会让携带者心理逐渐阴暗，总是希望走捷径，用阴谋，靠不光彩的手段做事。此外，佩戴超过3分钟后，使用者自身也会陷入混乱的状态。"] = "The negative effect is that it will cause the bearer's psychology to gradually become dark, always hoping to take shortcuts, use conspiracies, and rely on dishonorable means to do things. In addition, after wearing it for more than 3 minutes, the user themselves will fall into a state of chaos.",
    ["负面效果是使用者将对自身实际力量产生误判，且在短期内对周围环境的感知能力将降低，容易丢失物品。"] = "The negative effect is that the user will misjudge their actual strength, and their perception of the surrounding environment will decrease in the short term, making it easy to lose items.",
    ["负面效果是使用者进入循环空间后，每一次循环，手上会随机出现一个机关谜题，需要在限定时间内解开，否则会被吞噬、转化为一个全新的机关谜题。"] = "The negative effect is that after the user enters the loop space, a mechanical puzzle randomly appears on their hand with each cycle. It must be solved within a limited time, otherwise, they will be devoured and transformed into a brand-new mechanical puzzle.",
    ["负面效果是只要佩戴着它，你就永远无法感受到凉爽，始终处于可怕的炎热里。"] = "The negative effect is that as long as you wear it, you will never be able to feel cool, always being in terrible heat.",
    ["负面效果是时刻头痛，恨不得撞墙。"] = "The negative effect is a constant headache, making one want to bang their head against a wall.",
    ["负面标记"] = "Negative Mark",
