    ["财富的堆砌已经过时了，它们应该好好待在保险柜里，以后，工艺才是流行风尚，而爱丽丝小姐在这方面的嗅觉一向敏锐。"] = "The accumulation of wealth is outdated; it should stay safely in the vault. From now on, craftsmanship is the trend, and Miss Alice has always had a keen nose for this.",
