    ["购买<h>黑麦面包</>"] = "Buy <h>rye bread</>",
    ["购买下列<Highlight_Yellow>任意礼包</>即可领取首充赠礼"] = "Purchase any of the following <Highlight_Yellow> gift packs </> to claim the first-purchase gift",
    ["购买单价"] = "Unit Price",
    ["购买后可将<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>豪华版升级为典藏版，可获得豪华版的全部奖励，且等级直接提升15级，并立即额外获得圣杯·绑、绑定金镑、转运水晶等丰厚奖励。"] = "Purchase to upgrade the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Deluxe Edition to the Collector's Edition. You will receive all rewards from the Deluxe Edition, instantly increase your level by 15, and immediately receive additional rich rewards such as Holy Grail (Bound), bound Gold Pounds, and Transmutation Crystals.",
    ["购买后可获得以下道具：<Highlight>银色狒狒背包</>、<Highlight>社交·运球</>、<Highlight>称号·狒狒之友</>和<Highlight>活力方糖</>1个。"] = "Purchase to receive the following items: <Highlight>Silver Baboon Backpack</>, <Highlight>Social: Dribble</>, <Highlight>Title: Friend of Baboons</>, and 1 <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cube</>.",
    ["购买后可获得以下道具：发型·<Highlight>自然柔顺</>、饰品·<Highlight>神秘硬皮笔记</>、待机动作·<Highlight>赞美愚者</>和<Highlight>活力方糖</>1个。"] = "Purchase to receive the following items: Hairstyle: <Highlight>Natural Softness</>, Accessory: <Highlight>Mysterious Hardcover Notebook</>, Idle Animation: <Highlight>Praise the Fool</>, and 1 <Highlight>Vitality Sugar Cube</>.",
    ["购买后可获得以下道具：时装·<Highlight>晚风中</>和<Highlight>活力方糖</>1个。"] = "Purchase to receive the following items: Outfit: <Highlight>In the Evening Breeze</> and <Highlight>1 Vitality Sugar Cube</>.",
    ["购买后将解锁<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>典藏版，可获得豪华版的全部奖励，且等级直接提升15级，并立即额外获得圣杯·绑、绑定金镑、转运水晶等丰厚奖励。"] = "Purchase to unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Collector's Edition. You will receive all rewards from the Deluxe Edition, instantly increase your level by 15, and immediately receive additional rich rewards such as Holy Grail (Bound), bound Gold Pounds, and Transmutation Crystals.",
    ["购买后将解锁<Highlight>命运的馈赠</>豪华版，可获得发票单据获取效率提升、背包数量上限增加等特权奖励，随等级提升还可领取限定时装、限定饰品、圣杯·绑、染色材料等丰厚奖励"] = "Purchase to unlock the <Highlight>Gift of Fate</> Deluxe Edition. You will receive privileges such as increased invoice acquisition efficiency and increased inventory capacity, and you can also claim rich rewards like limited outfits, limited accessories, Holy Grail (Bound), and dyeing materials as you level up.",
