    ["费内波特土豆 | 烟熏香肠 | 黑椒汁"] = "Feynapotter Potatoes | Smoked Sausage | Black Pepper Sauce",
    ["费内波特境内有大片的平原，盛产着咖啡、可可、烟草和各种粮食，费内波特面相当好吃，哦！大地母神的恩赐。"] = "There are vast plains within Feynapotter, rich in coffee, cocoa, tobacco, and various grains. Feynapotter noodles are quite delicious, oh! A gift from the Earth Mother.",
    ["费内波特小蓝莓|全脂牛奶|糖|巧克力豆"] = "Feynapotter Blueberries | Whole Milk | Sugar | Chocolate Chips",
    ["费内波特手工面|番茄酱汁|芝士奶酪酱|秘制香料"] = "Feynapotter Handmade Noodles | Tomato Sauce | Cheese Sauce | Secret Spices",
    ["费内波特椅子1"] = "Feynapot chair 1",
    ["费内波特椅子2"] = "Feysac chair 2",
    ["费内波特玉米 | 面粉 | 烟熏猪颈肉 | 欧芹"] = "Feynapotter Corn | Flour | Smoked Pork Neck | Parsley",
    ["费内波特王国"] = "Feynapotter Kingdom",
    ["费内波特王国是北大陆南部的大国，信仰着大地母神教会，这里温暖、潮湿，空气中洋溢着海风和费内波特琴曲的声音。"] = "The Feynapotter Kingdom is a major power in the south of the Northern Continent, believing in the Earth Mother Church. It is warm and humid here, and the air is filled with the sound of sea breezes and Feynapotter music.",
    ["费内波特的国王才叫好国王！整个廷根的黑面包，一半是从那边来的。 "] = "The King of Feysac is the only good king! Half of the black bread in all of Tingen comes from there.",
    ["费内波特素描大师大卫《灰谷》的仿品，柔和细腻的笔触晕染出河谷中朦胧的晨光。"] = "A replica of 'Grey Valley' by Feynapotter sketch master David; soft and delicate brushstrokes render the hazy morning light in the valley.",
    ["费内波特组件表演"] = "Feysac component performance",
    ["费内波特西红柿 | 炖牛尾 | 欧芹，蒜瓣 | 橄榄油"] = "Feynapotter Tomatoes | Stewed Oxtail | Parsley, Garlic Cloves | Olive Oil",
