    ["赛弗拉"] = "Sephra",
    ["赛弗拉，你听！约会……！泽维尔一说这词，我心里砰砰直跳，我什么也不记得了，连他说在哪个餐厅门口见面也不记得！"] = "Sephra, listen! A date...! Every time Xavier says that word, my heart beats wildly. I don't remember anything, not even which restaurant entrance he said to meet at!",
    ["赛弗拉，我这就去……！哦，不行，我一想到就脸滚烫，我，我有点迈不开步子……"] = "Sephra, I'm going now...! Oh, no, my face gets hot just thinking about it. I, I can't seem to take a step...",
    ["赛德勒"] = "Sadler",
    ["赛拉·"] = "Sela ",
    ["赛拉在贝克兰德当医生，忙得连信都没时间写，一年到头也回不来几次。"] = "Sarah works as a doctor in Backlund and is so busy she doesn't even have time to write letters, and she barely comes home a few times a year.",
    ["赛斯"] = "Seth",
    ["赛琳娜"] = "Selena",
    ["赛琳娜-锁血1%"] = "Selena-HP Lock 1%",
