    ["走了"] = "Left",
    ["走了这么久还没到，腿酸得很，烦死了。"] = "Walked for so long and still haven't arrived, my legs are sore, so annoying.",
    ["走什么，留下来！那些乌鸦每周都来糟蹋我的郁金香，刚才居然全飞了！日薪3苏勒，干不干？"] = "Why are you leaving? Stay! Those crows come every week to ruin my tulips, and just now they all flew away! 3 soli a day, are you in?",
    ["走位错误是不小心，还是想引人注目？"] = "Was that positioning error a mistake, or were you trying to attract attention?",
    ["走出了下午镇，没想到却在贝克兰德迷路了。"] = "I walked out of Tingen, but I didn't expect to get lost in Backlund.",
