    ["足以匹配您高贵品味的选择！这把枪用到了最新专利的螺旋膛线设计——能击落野鸭，也能在800码外将敌人送去见黑夜女神！"] = "A choice that matches your noble taste! This gun uses the latest patented spiral rifling design—it can shoot down wild ducks and send enemies to meet the Evernight Goddess from 800 yards away!",
    ["足够了。我有不小的把握，凶手通过制造死亡和恐惧，目的是召唤邪神，或者进行一场可怕的、大范围的诅咒。"] = "It is enough. I am quite certain that the murderer's goal in creating death and horror is to summon an evil god or to carry out a terrifying, large-scale curse.",
    ["足够了，你是一个敏捷的“信息捕手”。"] = "That's enough, you are an agile \"Information Catcher\".",
    ["足够深刻的记忆，有时会以意想不到的方式留存下来。在特定时刻拯救你，或是将你推入深渊。"] = "Memories that are profound enough sometimes remain in unexpected ways. They may save you at a specific moment or push you into the abyss.",
    ["足够的运气，和稳定的实力，成就铁路先锋的地位。参与铁路大亨玩法，获得周排行榜第2~10名。"] = "Enough luck and stable strength achieve the status of Railway Pioneer. Participate in Railway Tycoon and win 2nd-10th place in the weekly ranking.",
