    ["路径：长15米宽3米的范围"] = "Path: 15-meter long, 3-meter wide area",
    ["路德维尔这辈子——如果成为秘偶之后还能算作这辈子的延续——没见过这么多蚊子。\n它们围着他嗡嗡叫，像一群闻到大餐的饿鬼。但\"地狱上将\"面无表情。\n“绿华”戒指在他手指上闪着温润的光。\n对一位秘偶来说，这能治愈疾病的神奇物品，其副作用并不太大。\n克莱恩站在十米外，看着这幅画面，由衷地感叹：\"还好不是我戴。\"\n这就是秘偶大师的智慧：让不怕咬的人去戴招蚊子的戒指。分工明确，皆大欢喜。"] = "Ludwell had never seen so many mosquitoes in his life—if one could still call it a life after becoming a marionette. \n They buzzed around him like a group of hungry ghosts that had smelled a feast. But the \"Admiral of Hell\" was expressionless. \n The \"Green Bloom\" ring shone with a warm light on his finger. \n For a marionette, this mystical item that could cure diseases didn't have too great a side effect. \n Klein stood ten meters away, watching this scene, and sighed sincerely: \"It's a good thing I'm not the one wearing it.\" \n This is the wisdom of a Marionettist: let someone who isn't afraid of being bitten wear the ring that attracts mosquitoes. The division of labor is clear, and everyone is happy.",
