    ["蹲在头顶的笑意温暖你的发间。"] = "The smile crouching on your head warms your hair.",
    ["蹲在头顶的笑意温暖你的发间。\n重复获取将自动分解为绑定金镑×100。"] = "The smile squatting on the top of your head warms your hair. \n Duplicate acquisitions will automatically be dismantled into 100 Bound Pounds.",
    ["躁动之刺"] = "Thorn of Restlessness",
    ["躁动之刺·污染"] = "Thorn of Restlessness - Corruption",
    ["躁动的灵"] = "Restless Spirit",
    ["躁动音律"] = "Restless Rhythm",
    ["身上散发着烤鱼的香气，附近的小猫咪会忍不住向你靠拢。"] = "You exude the aroma of grilled fish, and nearby kittens cannot help but approach you.",
    ["身上的云币不足以支付修改费用，修改失败！"] = "Insufficient Cloud Coins to pay for the modification fee; modification failed!",
    ["身上的羊皮纸微微发烫"] = "The parchment on the body is slightly hot",
    ["身上这么多钥匙，肯定是房东弗兰奇。"] = "With so many keys on him, he must be the landlord, Frankie.",
    ["身为军人和虔诚的信徒，赛瑞斯在火与血，疯狂与未知中积累功勋。从普通步兵到非凡者，他获得的一切都来自军队。\n他不怀疑杀戮的意义，既然要为国家争夺利益，要为自己争夺荣誉，就不应该再感到怯懦与不忍——那将让他更容易死去。\n“再把枪擦亮，士兵。”1350年的一个深夜，赛瑞斯在战壕里低语：“既然休战的命令没有发布，我们仍要奋战到最后一刻，你和我的身后是祖国的期待，我们要拿下胜利，才有活着的可能。”\n“不要怕，神会注视着你。”\n“赞美太阳！”"] = "As a soldier and a devout believer, Cyrus accumulated merit amidst fire, blood, madness, and the unknown. From an ordinary infantryman to a Beyonder, everything he gained came from the army. \n He does not doubt the meaning of killing. Since he must fight for the country's interests and for his own honor, he should no longer feel cowardly or hesitant—that would only make him die more easily. \n \"Polish your rifle again, soldier.\" Late one night in 1350, Cyrus whispered in the trenches: \"Since the order to cease fire has not been issued, we must fight to the last moment. Behind you and me lies the expectation of our motherland; only by securing victory do we have a chance to live.\" \n \"Do not be afraid, God will watch over you.\" \n \"Praise the Sun!\"",
    ["身为战士，牺牲是我们的荣誉。"] = "As a Warrior, sacrifice is our honor.",
    ["身为皇家陆军上士的父亲牺牲后，他遗留的怀表成为了莫雷蒂一家最珍视的物品。\n送别父亲那天，廷根下了很大的雨，母亲在墓前放下一束百合，随后把三个小莫雷蒂紧紧地抱在怀里。\n每次拿起怀表，克莱恩好像回到了往日的雨幕中，想起母亲的拥抱、潮湿的百合花香，以及雨声中长久的，仿佛永不停息的指针轮转声。\n后来，母亲回归了女神的神国，银色的怀表也停下了。兄妹三人找钟表工匠修了几次，可怀表总会出问题，这让喜欢带上它抬高身份的班森屡次出糗，干脆丢在了家里。\n直到最近，梅丽莎鼓捣着把怀表修好，这件物品才回归实用。这让班森知道了，他肯定高兴坏了！\n不过，班森还是会选择把怀表留给克莱恩。刚进入社会的大学生，一定比自己更需要这份体面。"] = "After his father, a sergeant in the Royal Army, sacrificed himself, the pocket watch he left behind became the most cherished item of the Moretti family. \n On the day they said goodbye to their father, it rained heavily in Tingen. Mother placed a bouquet of lilies at the grave and then held the three little Morettis tightly in her arms. \n Every time he picked up the pocket watch, Klein seemed to return to the rain of the past, remembering his mother's hug, the scent of damp lilies, and the long, seemingly endless ticking of the hands in the rain. \n Later, his mother returned to the Goddess's divine kingdom, and the silver pocket watch stopped. The three siblings found a watchmaker to repair it several times, but the pocket watch always had problems, which made Benson, who liked to carry it to raise his status, make a fool of himself several times, so he simply left it at home. \n Until recently, Melissa tinkered with it and fixed the pocket watch, and this item returned to practical use. This made Benson know, and he must have been overjoyed! \n However, Benson would still choose to leave the pocket watch to Klein. A college student who had just entered society must need this decency more than he did.",
