    ["身居高位而博爱开明，赞美我主！"] = "Holding a high position while being benevolent and enlightened, praise my Lord!",
    ["身披羽毛的恶棍！长了翅膀的老鼠！我以女神的名义发誓，我要把你们整个家族驱逐！"] = "Feathered scoundrels! Winged rats! I swear in the name of the Goddess, I will drive your entire family out!",
    ["身披黎明，晨曦为剑，手握利刃只为守护荣耀。"] = "Clad in dawn, morning light as a sword, holding a sharp blade only to guard glory.",
    ["身旁的学员们陆续结队，完成了报名。"] = "The students beside them formed groups one after another and completed their registration.",
    ["身是心的囚笼，世界是身的囚笼。"] = "The body is the cage of the heart, and the world is the cage of the body.",
    ["身是心的囚笼，世界是身的囚笼，疯狂被束缚，欲望被压抑。"] = "The body is a cage for the heart, and the world is a cage for the body. Madness is bound, and desires are suppressed.",
    ["身法要像老鼠，快、小、灵活。打不过就跑，跑不过就绕。"] = "Your movement should be like a mouse: fast, small, and agile. If you can't win, run; if you can't outrun them, circle around.",
    ["身着值夜者服装，触发猎龙帮唯唯诺诺分支"] = "Wearing the Nighthawk uniform, trigger the 'Dragon Hunter Gang's Submissive' branch.",
    ["身着猎魔人服装，触发猎龙帮混混请喝酒分支"] = "Wearing the Demon Hunter outfit, trigger the 'Dragon Hunter Gang's Thugs Invite You for a Drink' branch.",
    ["身着长袍的女性，周身散发着柔和的微光。她静静伫立，似乎在无声地庇佑着此处。"] = "A woman in a robe, exuding a soft glow. She stands quietly, seemingly silently protecting this place.",
    ["身着雨披行于街角，让绵密的水珠从身侧滑落，你就是夜里一盏温暖的灯。"] = "Walking down the street corner in a raincoat, letting the dense droplets slide off your side, you are a warm lamp in the night.",
    ["身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "Dressed in mist and dust, searching for a sunny day of one's own in the corner of the City of Cities.",
