    ["车都很好……只是您若借用，用完最好按颜色放回原处。 上次有人把绿车停满了黑夜教堂前，两边教会那脸色……"] = "The carriages are all fine... but if you borrow one, it's best to return it to its original spot by color. Last time someone parked a bunch of green carriages in front of the Cathedral of the Night, the looks on the faces of the churches on both sides...",
    ["车都很好……只是您若借用，用完最好按颜色放回原处。 上次有人把黄车停满了圣赛琳娜教堂前，两边教会那脸色……"] = "The bikes are all good... but if you borrow them, it's best to return them to their original places by color. Last time someone parked yellow bikes all over the front of Saint Selena Cathedral, the look on the faces of the two churches...",
