    ["输出形态"] = "Offensive Stance",
    ["输出形态下<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">怒意猛击</>命中身上具有<HighLight>衰败</>的敌人时会造成额外小范围追击伤害，并使其身上的<HighLight>衰败</>时长延长5秒。"] = "In Offensive Stance, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Angry Slam</> deals additional small-area pursuit damage when hitting enemies affected by <HighLight>Decay</>, and extends the duration of <HighLight>Decay</> on them by 5 seconds.",
    ["输出形态下<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\">怒意猛击</>命中身上具有<HighLight>衰败</>的敌人时会造成额外小范围追击伤害，并使其身上的<HighLight>衰败</>时长延长5秒。\n输出形态下在猎魔瞬斩后释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">王庭号令</>时，也可击倒身前范围内的敌方，并且进入<HighLight>狂暴</>状态，持续6秒。<HighLight>狂暴</>状态下攻击命中敌人时，恢复自身生命值，此状态有<Highlight>1</>秒内置冷却时间。"] = "In Offensive Stance, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061080\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Angry Slam </> hitting enemies with <HighLight> Decay </> deals additional small-area pursuit damage and extends the duration of <HighLight> Decay </> by 5 seconds. \n In Offensive Stance, casting <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Royal Court Command </> after Hunter Instant Slash knocks down enemies in front and enters the <HighLight> Berserk </> state for 6 seconds. <HighLight> Berserk </> state attacks restore health upon hitting enemies, with a <Highlight> 1 </> second internal cooldown.",
    ["输出形态下在猎魔瞬斩后释放<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">王庭号令</>时，也可击倒身前范围内的敌方，并且进入<HighLight>狂暴</>状态，持续6秒。<HighLight>狂暴</>状态下攻击命中敌人时，恢复自身生命值，此状态有<Highlight>1</>秒内置冷却时间。"] = "In Offensive Stance, releasing <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061023\" color=\"#f4a067\">Royal Court Command</> after Demon Hunter Instant Slash also knocks down enemies in front and enters the <HighLight>Berserk</> state for 6 seconds. While in <HighLight>Berserk</>, attacks hitting enemies restore your health. This state has a <Highlight>1</>-second internal cooldown.",
    ["输出形态期间无法复活他人"] = "Cannot resurrect others while in Offensive Stance.",
