    ["达成“城市暗面”中“快手无痕惊诸神”成就，并领取成就奖励。"] = "Achieve the \"Quick Hands Leave No Trace to Amaze the Gods\" achievement in \"City's Dark Side\" and claim the achievement reward.",
    ["达成“城市暗面”中“无面之人”成就，并领取成就奖励。"] = "Achieve the \"Faceless\" achievement in \"City's Dark Side\" and claim the achievement reward.",
