    ["达米安"] = "Damien",
    ["达米尔·"] = "Damir ",
    ["达米尔港特产腌肉"] = "Damir Port Cured Meat",
    ["达米尔港的中央，有一座死火山，周围几个地洞则存在缝隙，有天然的热风吹拂，在那里晾制腌肉，能获得美妙而独特的风味，它可以作为礼物，送给朋友。"] = "In the center of Damir Harbor, there is a dormant volcano, and there are gaps in the surrounding caves where natural hot air blows. Curing meat there can achieve a wonderful and unique flavor, which can be given as a gift to friends.",
    ["达纳"] = "Dana",
    ["达维娜·"] = "Davina ",
