    ["近一半的学生被迫离开校舍出去租房！我们又不是满兜金币哗哗响的贵族！"] = "Nearly half of the students are forced to leave the dorms to rent apartments! We aren't nobles with pockets full of clinking gold coins!",
    ["近一点，再近一点"] = "Closer, a little closer",
    ["近六万人因为贝克兰德大雾霾失去生命，包括年幼的孩子，健壮的青年。"] = "Nearly sixty thousand people lost their lives due to the Great Smog of Backlund, including young children and robust youths.",
    ["近几个月来也没有出现过偷窃、行骗和拐卖的案件，您可以照常前往。"] = "There haven't been any cases of theft, fraud, or kidnapping in the last few months, so you can go as usual.",
