    ["近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。\n而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……"] = "Tingen has not been peaceful lately. As a newcomer to the Nighthawks squad, you have also been assigned a strange case. \n It points to a certain salon in the North District of Tingen, and the mysterious beauty residing within...",
    ["近日的廷根并不太平。作为值夜者小队的新人，你也被分派了一桩奇异的案件。而它指向的，是廷根北区的某个沙龙，以及留驻其中的神秘倩影……"] = "Tingen has not been peaceful lately. As a newcomer to the Nighthawk team, you have also been assigned a strange case. It points to a salon in Tingen's North District and the mysterious beauty lingering within...",
    ["近日，廷根出现了一种名叫“焦糖炸弹”的饮品，不知道会是什么风味？"] = "Recently, a drink called \"Caramel Bomb\" has appeared in Tingen; I wonder what it tastes like?",
    ["近日，廷根市有位<P_Yellow>黛西小姐</>忽然昏睡不醒，照顾她的两位女仆接连死亡，家中管家已经报案。<P_Yellow>丽埃娜</>上报了这起案子，怀疑有非凡因素的影响。"] = "Recently, a Miss <P_Yellow>Daisy</> in Tingen suddenly fell into a coma. The two maids who were taking care of her died one after another, and the butler at home has reported the case. <P_Yellow>Liana</> reported this case, suspecting the influence of Extraordinary factors.",
