    ["还不把它拿去倒掉！"] = "Go pour it out already!",
    ["还不明白吗？每个分身，都可能成为本体。"] = "Still don't understand? Every clone can become the main body.",
    ["还不是那些商业顾问告诉巴纳比队长，霍纳奇斯有古代文明留下的宝藏。"] = "It's because those business consultants told Captain Barnaby that Hornacis has treasures left behind by ancient civilizations.",
    ["还不用担心饿肚子，每天都有人来喂你们。"] = "And you don't have to worry about being hungry; someone comes to feed you every day.",
    ["还不确定"] = "Not sure yet",
    ["还不确定。但根据过去的经验，如果一个区域出现大量异常事件，大概率存在隐秘的高序列力量。"] = "It's not certain yet. But based on past experience, if a large number of anomalous events occur in an area, there is a high probability that hidden high-Sequence powers are present.",
    ["还不能立即确定，但库克不会承认这一失误。可能只有擅闯后厨这个办法了……"] = "It cannot be confirmed immediately, but Cook will not admit to this mistake. Perhaps the only way is to sneak into the kitchen...",
    ["还不能立即确定，但库克不会承认这一点。可能只有擅闯后厨这个办法了……"] = "Can't be sure yet, but Cook won't admit it. Maybe the only way is to break into the kitchen...",
    ["还不都是烧煤炼钢！"] = "Isn't it all just burning coal and smelting steel!",
    ["还不都是烧煤炼钢！艾比从小就喜欢跟着你在这跑来跑去的，原来是喜欢研究这些。"] = "It's all just for burning coal and smelting steel! Abby has loved following you around here since she was a child; turns out she likes studying these things.",
    ["还不错。"] = "Not bad.",
    ["还不错吧，但……是不是有点太华丽了？"] = "It's not bad, but... is it a bit too flashy?",
    ["还不错，但昨晚我在拉姆德输给了一辆车。"] = "Not bad, but last night I lost to a car at Lamud.",
    ["还不错，欢迎你下次来找我们交流时尚知识。"] = "Not bad, welcome to come find us to exchange fashion knowledge next time.",
    ["还书时下楼踩点"] = "Step on points when going downstairs to return books",
    ["还价乘客1"] = "Haggling Passenger 1",
    ["还价乘客2"] = "Haggling Passenger 2",
    ["还会医治一些城市顽疾。"] = "I also treat some urban ailments.",
    ["还会教导你如何靠自己去验证祂的话是否可信，因为世界上的一切都是证据。"] = "It will also teach you how to verify the credibility of His words on your own, because everything in the world is evidence.",
    ["还债"] = "Debt Repayment.",
    ["还全都是文法方面的书籍……在这些书籍面前，我感觉自己像只卷毛狒狒。"] = "And they are all books on grammar... in front of these books, I feel like a curly-haired baboon.",
    ["还剩 %s"] = "Remaining %s",
    ["还剩几筐棉纱？"] = "How many baskets of cotton yarn are left?",
    ["还剩最后 %s 秒逃离窗口"] = "Only %s seconds left to escape through the window",
    ["还原"] = "Restore",
    ["还原开膛手终结之夜的时间。"] = "Restore the time of the Ripper's final night.",
    ["还原男爵近日的经历。"] = "Restore the Baron's recent experiences.",
    ["还原税率"] = "Reset Tax Rate",
    ["还只是个小不点的时候，他就会拖着阔剑跑来跑去，勤奋地练习技艺，想要成为骑士。"] = "When he was still just a little one, he would drag a broadsword around, diligently practicing his skills, wanting to become a knight.",
    ["还可以授予%d人未俱乐部英雄，本次选择<Highlight>%d</>人"] = "You can still grant %d people the title of Club Hero; this time you have selected <Highlight> %d </> people.",
    ["还可以这样？"] = "It can be like this?",
    ["还因为什么？"] = "What else is it for?",
    ["还因为污染……"] = "Also because of corruption...",
    ["还在“焦糖炸弹”？你们两个，以后不要再随便向不知名的神灵祈祷了，这非常危险！"] = "Still on the \"Caramel Bomb\"? You two, don't pray to unknown deities casually in the future; it's very dangerous!",
    ["还在为无法准时起床焦虑吗？你需要一台音乐闹钟！嘟嘟叭哔嘟！"] = "Still anxious about not being able to wake up on time? You need a musical alarm clock! Doo-doo-ba-bee-doo!",
    ["还在做无谓的抵抗吗？就让你们见识一下……神明真正的力量！"] = "Still putting up a meaningless resistance? Let me show you... the true power of the gods!",
    ["还好"] = "It's alright.",
    ["还好主教大人降临，他一上甲板，风向就变了，火炮也没再出问题，指哪打哪，真是神了！"] = "Fortunately, the Bishop descended; as soon as he stepped on the deck, the wind direction changed, and the artillery stopped malfunctioning, hitting whatever it was aimed at, it was truly divine!",
    ["还好吧？可能是恶作剧？"] = "Are you okay? Could it be a prank?",
    ["还好是梦，你这么气人的家伙怎么会死呢，哈哈哈。"] = "It's a good thing it was just a dream. How could a guy as infuriating as you die? Hahaha.",
    ["还好有告解室。"] = "Good thing there's a confessional.",
    ["还好这本书不是赃物。也多亏丝巾那件事已经解释清楚，警察先生才放我出来……"] = "Fortunately, this book wasn't stolen property. Thanks to the silk scarf matter being explained, the police let me go...",
    ["还好这篇稿子也收了……"] = "At least this draft was accepted...",
    ["还好遇到了您，我对这趟旅程可是期待已久啊，做了很多准备。毕竟圣赛缪尔大教堂是鲁恩最知名的几个黑夜女神教堂之一！"] = "It's good that I met you. I've been looking forward to this trip for a long time and made many preparations. After all, Saint Samuel Cathedral is one of the most famous Evernight Goddess cathedrals in Loen!",
    ["还好邻居帮她度过了最难过的时候。"] = "It's fortunate that the neighbors helped her through the hardest times.",
    ["还好，先生，只可惜这一切最终没能用上，还给您。"] = "It's fine, sir. It's just a pity that all of this couldn't be used in the end. Returning it to you.",
    ["还好，我替你准备了。"] = "It's fine, I prepared one for you.",
    ["还好，谢谢你今天救我，国王说你变成我们的朋友了。"] = "I'm fine, thank you for saving me today. The King said you've become our friend.",
    ["还好，还好。学校有教基础理论，我只是……实践了一下。"] = "It's alright, it's alright. The school teaches the basic theory, I just... put it into practice.",
    ["还好，还好。我们是想来道谢的。"] = "We're fine, we're fine. We wanted to come and thank you.",
    ["还好，还好，你要拿去送人吗？难道……是女孩子？"] = "It's fine, it's fine. Are you going to give it to someone? Could it be... a girl?",
    ["还好，这次的感觉没有之前那么糟糕。"] = "Fortunately, the feeling this time wasn't as bad as before.",
    ["还寄来一个丑木雕？"] = "And you sent an ugly wood carving?",
    ["还差一位"] = "One more to go",
    ["还差一次复诊呢……真难办。"] = "Still one follow-up visit left... what a pain.",
    ["还差一步……我就能找到。"] = "Just one more step... and I'll find it.",
    ["还差很多呢。脚踏车得五金镑左右，听起来不算多……"] = "Still a long way off. A bicycle costs about five gold pounds, which doesn't sound like much...",
    ["还差最后一个物品，“一物隐蔽，绯红月辉照耀其上”？"] = "Only one item left, \"An object hidden, with the crimson moonlight shining upon it\"?",
    ["还差鬼鲨的血……"] = "Still missing the blood of a ghost shark...",
    ["还差鱿鱼先生？他在信里说晚点到，我们再等等。"] = "Still missing Mr. Squid? He said in his letter he'd be late; let's wait a bit longer.",
    ["还带着我们一起出来吃苦，是好事吗？你清醒点吧伙计。"] = "And she brought us out to suffer together. Is that a good thing? Wake up, buddy.",
    ["还强调不用执行任务？嗯……回去看看吧！"] = "He even emphasized that there was no mission? Hmm... I should go back and take a look.",
    ["还想尝尝别的特调吗？"] = "Do you want to try other special drinks?",
    ["还想拿我的钱去赌球？给我滚！"] = "Still want to take my money to bet on football? Get out of here!",
    ["还想晒太阳的人，怎么可能想死呢？ "] = "How could someone who still wants to bask in the Sun want to die?",
    ["还想碰瓷吗？ "] = "Still want to try to scam people?",
    ["还想讹钱吗？"] = "Still want to extort money?",
    ["还想问问邓恩……"] = "Still want to ask Dunn...",
    ["还把我喝醉的事报告给巴纳比队长！"] = "They even reported that I got drunk to Captain Barnaby!",
    ["还挺像的"] = "It actually looks quite similar",
    ["还挺神奇的。"] = "Quite magical.",
    ["还挺神秘……不会是要拿去做什么坏事吧？"] = "Quite mysterious... they aren't going to use it for something bad, are they?",
    ["还提前预支给我这么大一笔钱……得请梅丽莎他们吃顿好的！"] = "And they even advanced me such a large sum of money... I must treat Melissa and the others to a good meal!",
    ["还敢再尝试？"] = "Still dare to try again?",
    ["还是 太弱了"] = "Still too weak",
    ["还是……你来敲门吧。"] = "Or... you knock on the door.",
    ["还是……请你帮我敲门吧。"] = "Or... please knock on the door for me.",
    ["还是《背叛者指环》呢？是贝克兰德王国大剧院的原版。"] = "Or is it The Betrayer's Ring? It's the original version from the Backlund Kingdom Grand Theater.",
    ["还是上次那位？"] = "The same one as last time?",
    ["还是下次再问吧。"] = "I'd better ask next time.",
    ["还是下次吧"] = "Maybe next time",
    ["还是不了"] = "Better not",
    ["还是不对，你唱歌真难听。"] = "Still not right, you sing really badly.",
    ["还是不小心的？"] = "Or was it an accident?",
    ["还是不知道那本安提哥努斯笔记在哪里，队长让我到处走走，说不定就能找到线索。"] = "I still don't know where that Antigonus notebook is. The captain told me to walk around, maybe I can find clues.",
    ["还是不能下定决心。我怕女神从此不再眷顾于我。"] = "Still can't make up my mind. I'm afraid the Goddess will no longer favor me.",
    ["还是你希望用自己的金钱，去做这件事？"] = "Or would you prefer to use your own money to do this?",
    ["还是先去切斯庄园看看吧。"] = "I should probably go check out Chess Manor first.",
    ["还是先去西区济贫院探听一下情况……"] = "I should still go to the West District Poorhouse to scout out the situation first...",
    ["还是先好好复习吧，毕竟我连蜡烛都买不起，只能来这里凑合。"] = "Better focus on reviewing first. After all, I can't even afford candles, I have to make do here.",
    ["还是先好好学习，努力长大吧，那是大人的事。"] = "You should focus on your studies and grow up first; that's a matter for adults.",
    ["还是先离开吧，别打扰专心找东西的人。"] = "Better leave first, don't disturb someone focused on finding something.",
    ["还是先走吧"] = "Better leave first",
    ["还是别管了"] = "Better leave it alone",
    ["还是卡斯伯特俱乐部的蛋糕最软最香甜。"] = "Cuthbert Club's cakes are still the softest and sweetest.",
    ["还是去剧院看午夜伯爵呢？"] = "Or go to the theater to watch Midnight Earl?",
    ["还是去干点正事吧。"] = "Better go do some real work.",
    ["还是回去找找看吧……"] = "I'd better go back and look for them...",
    ["还是回营地收拾东西，尽早返回廷根吧。"] = "Better go back to the camp to pack up and return to Tingen as soon as possible.",
    ["还是大学的氛围令人愉悦啊。"] = "The atmosphere of the university is truly pleasant.",
    ["还是夸张一些的？"] = "Or should it be something more exaggerated?",
    ["还是年轻好，如果我晚上没睡好，就会听到一些<P_Yellow>莫名存在的低语</>。"] = "It's good to be young. If I don't sleep well at night, I will hear some <P_Yellow>whispers from inexplicable existences</>.",
    ["还是我应该说“请”呢？伟大的非凡者？"] = "Or should I say \"please\"? Great Beyonder?",
    ["还是把打探矿石消息的活分派给街头的混混，到时候我只需要去排查具体的位置。"] = "I'll just delegate the task of scouting for ore information to the street thugs; then I'll only need to go and verify the specific location.",
    ["还是拼图——这次是更多的雏菊？"] = "Another puzzle—this time it's more daisies?",
    ["还是无法交流……"] = "Still unable to communicate...",
    ["还是没有鼻息和脉搏……但体温依然稳定。"] = "Still no breath or pulse... but the body temperature remains stable.",
    ["还是等店家回来再说吧。"] = "I'll wait for the shopkeeper to come back.",
    ["还是简体字！"] = "And it's simplified characters!",
    ["还是算了"] = "Never mind",
    ["还是算了。"] = "Never mind.",
    ["还是算了吧"] = "Never mind",
    ["还是算了吧，结完婚后，他就变了，没有以前那么浪漫了。"] = "Forget it, he changed after we got married; he's not as romantic as he used to be.",
    ["还是算了吧，这钱我挣不了，你还是拿钱去看病吧。"] = "Forget it, I can't earn this money. You'd better take it and see a doctor.",
    ["还是算了，我不太喜欢喝酒。"] = "Forget it, I don't really like drinking.",
    ["还是舍不得放下吗？"] = "Still can't bear to let go?",
    ["还是被你发现了。"] = "So you found out after all.",
    ["还是走开吧。"] = "Better walk away.",
    ["还是这家的煎蛋最好吃呢……"] = "Still, the fried eggs here are the best...",
    ["还是这辆车躺着舒服。"] = "It's still more comfortable to lie down in this carriage.",
    ["还是那么完美！唉……我还是不能为它添加一些……比如雪中的花朵……"] = "Still as perfect as ever! Sigh... I still can't add some... for example, flowers in the snow...",
    ["还是那么完美！蒸汽在上，我——我这次可以请求为您洗出一些华美的花样吗？"] = "Still as perfect as ever! Steam above, I—can I request to wash out some gorgeous patterns for you this time?",
    ["还是那么完美！还多了模特所赋予的特殊风味！蒸汽在上，我——"] = "Still as perfect as ever! And it has the special flavor bestowed by the model! Steam above, I—",
    ["还有%s秒后才能发起就位确认"] = "You can initiate readiness confirmation in %s seconds.",
    ["还有4次提问机会，你找到方向了吗？"] = "You have 4 chances to ask questions remaining. Have you found the direction?",
    ["还有……别盯着任何人看太久。在这里，被注视的感觉并不好受。"] = "And... don't stare at anyone for too long. Here, the feeling of being watched is not pleasant.",
    ["还有……爸爸妈妈。"] = "And... Mom and Dad.",
    ["还有一些情报，一些关于你的伙伴的事情。"] = "And some other intelligence, some things about your partners.",
    ["还有一件事……其实写那封信时，我的手一直在颤抖。"] = "There is one more thing... Actually, when I was writing that letter, my hands were trembling the whole time.",
    ["还有一件事，“末日”是这个世界最核心的秘密之一，离开这里后不要轻易提起，否则容易引来危险。"] = "One more thing, the 'Apocalypse' is one of the core secrets of this world. Don't mention it easily after leaving here, otherwise, it's easy to attract danger.",
    ["还有一件事，给老子记住——"] = "And one more thing, you listen to me—",
    ["还有一堆贴不起邮票的家伙。"] = "And a bunch of guys who can't even afford stamps.",
    ["还有一家披肩店推出了联合消费券。好在在这家百货开业之前，我们还有很长的时间来计算出最划算的购买方案……"] = "There is also a shawl shop that launched joint consumption vouchers. Fortunately, before this department store opens, we still have plenty of time to calculate the most cost-effective purchasing plan...",
    ["还有一张照片？一位年轻的女士……"] = "Is there another photo? A young lady...",
    ["还有一杯！还有一杯！想尝尝吗？"] = "There's one more cup! One more cup! Want to try it?",
    ["还有一记响亮的耳光！"] = "And a loud slap in the face!",
    ["还有个更坏的消息。线索表明，知识皇冠的失踪地点很可能在廷根。"] = "There is even worse news. Clues indicate that the location where the Crown of Knowledge went missing is likely in Tingen.",
    ["还有人买了杂志看了几页就扔地上，真没礼貌！"] = "Someone even bought a magazine, read a few pages, and threw it on the ground. How rude!",
    ["还有人提议预算再增加40%，因为承包商表示需要特殊工艺处理贵族区的香水残留物。"] = "There is also a proposal to increase the budget by 40% because the contractor stated that special processes are needed to handle perfume residues in the aristocratic district.",
    ["还有人没上车吗！"] = "Is there anyone who hasn't boarded yet!",
    ["还有什么事吗？"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有什么事？"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有什么其他方式能进入“镜中国度”呢……"] = "What other ways are there to enter the \"Mirror Realm\"...",
    ["还有什么办法呢？"] = "What other way is there?",
    ["还有什么想知道的？"] = "Is there anything else you want to know?",
    ["还有什么想问的吗？"] = "Is there anything else you'd like to ask?",
    ["还有什么线索吗？"] = "Are there any other clues?",
    ["还有什么需要的吗？"] = "Is there anything else you need?",
    ["还有什么领域，是罗塞尔没有涉足过的吗？"] = "Is there any field that Roselle hasn't dabbled in?",
    ["还有介绍费？这……"] = "There's an introduction fee? This...",
    ["还有他说的“明珠”是什么猪？“鸣猪”……只听说过打鸣的公鸡，难道还有会打鸣的猪吗？"] = "And what is the \"Pearl\" pig he mentioned? \"Singing Pig\"... I've only heard of roosters that crow. Are there pigs that can crow?",
    ["还有伤口处理，不少人直接用不干净的水冲洗，或者随便找块布裹上，这反而容易化脓。正确的清洁、消毒和包扎，其实不难学。 "] = "And wound care. Many people wash it directly with dirty water or wrap it with a random piece of cloth, which actually makes it easier to fester. Proper cleaning, disinfection, and bandaging are actually not hard to learn.",
    ["还有你……你不是要去喊警察吗？你怎么只有自己来了？"] = "And you... weren't you going to call the police? How come you came alone?",
    ["还有你的小……兔子？熊？呃，鸭子？总之，无论是什么，奶奶都帮你修好了，和之前一模一样。"] = "And your little... rabbit? Bear? Uh, duck? Anyway, whatever it was, Grandma has fixed it for you, just like it was before.",
    ["还有你，看什么看？你对我的嗓音有意见？"] = "And you, what are you looking at? Do you have an opinion about my voice?",
    ["还有先生女士们容貌与气味的专项疾病……"] = "And specialized diseases related to the appearance and scent of ladies and gentlemen...",
    ["还有克莱恩！他是真正的占卜家！只看面相就救了我的命！"] = "And Klein! He is a true Seer! He saved my life just by looking at my face!",
    ["还有六只！我都数着呢！ "] = "There are six more! I've been counting!",
    ["还有其他特殊情况吗？"] = "Are there any other special circumstances?",
    ["还有其他的 我想想 明天你就得开始……（声音渐弱）"] = "There are others, let me think, you have to start tomorrow... (voice fades)",
    ["还有其他的吗"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有其他的吗？"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有几个人？"] = "How many people are left?",
    ["还有几批货 搬不完都别停工！"] = "There are still a few batches of goods, don't stop working until they're moved!",
    ["还有出不起安葬费而深夜在塔索克河抛尸的，怨魂真多啊。"] = "There are also those who can't afford the funeral expenses and dump bodies into the Tussock River late at night. There are so many Wraiths.",
    ["还有出行、聚餐、医药费……数不清的理由。"] = "And travel, dining, medical expenses... Countless excuses.",
    ["还有刚刚出炉的精选上等猪肉，经过秘制烟熏工艺，每一片都散发着浓郁的果木香气，嚼劲十足，适合任何时刻享用！"] = "There's also freshly baked premium pork, processed with a secret smoking technique, each slice exudes a rich fruitwood aroma, chewy and satisfying, suitable for any moment!",
    ["还有别的事"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有别的事，先走了。"] = "Have other things to do, leaving now.",
    ["还有别的可以看看吗？"] = "Is there anything else I can look at?",
    ["还有别的吗？"] = "Anything else?",
    ["还有别的想知道的吗？历代镇子管理员的资料？小镇周边交通地图？我这儿都有！"] = "Is there anything else you want to know? Information on past town administrators? Traffic maps around the town? I have it all here!",
    ["还有别的灵魂吗？"] = "Are there other souls?",
    ["还有剩余的属性点未使用"] = "There are remaining attribute points that have not been used.",
    ["还有办生日派对的闲情，看来他们应该过得不错。"] = "Still having the leisure to throw a birthday party; it seems they must be doing well.",
    ["还有劳维斯太太、索尔斯等人被夺走的“生命”。"] = "And the 'life' stolen from Mrs. Lowis, Sols, and others.",
    ["还有呼吸，不是那种情况。"] = "Still breathing, it's not that situation.",
    ["还有呼吸，老罗德只是失血昏迷了。"] = "He is still breathing; Old Rhode is just in a stun from blood loss.",
    ["还有因出不起安葬费而深夜在塔索克河抛尸的，最近怨魂出现得越来越频繁了。"] = "There are also those who dump bodies in the Tussock River at night because they can't afford burial fees; recently, wraiths have been appearing more and more frequently.",
    ["还有地图？让我看看。"] = "There's a map too? Let me see.",
    ["还有头上的伤，我竟然还能活着。这诡异的愈合速度，难道是穿越带来的治疗效果?"] = "And the wound on my head—I'm actually still alive. Could this eerie healing speed be a therapeutic effect brought on by my transmigration?",
    ["还有好多东西……一本新员工手册，好奇怪的名字？"] = "There's still so much stuff... A new employee handbook, what a strange name?",
    ["还有家乡……我甚至不知道家乡在哪里。"] = "And my hometown... I don't even know where my hometown is.",
    ["还有富家女爱上穷小子，可歌可泣的邮轮爱情故事！"] = "And a moving cruise ship romance about a rich girl falling for a poor boy!",
    ["还有小袋粉末，亮闪闪的。"] = "And small bags of powder, shiny ones.",
    ["还有很多人没有离开酒吧，大家似乎都很兴奋，或许可以找他们聊聊。"] = "Many people haven't left the bar yet, everyone seems very excited, maybe I can chat with them.",
    ["还有很多衣服没洗……嗯？这首歌……"] = "Still have a lot of laundry to do... hmm? This song...",
    ["还有想问的"] = "I have more questions",
    ["还有我的花！奇怪，它连三明治都不碰，就喜欢这些漂亮摆设。"] = "And my flowers! Strange, it doesn't even touch the sandwiches, it just likes these beautiful decorations.",
    ["还有我还有我！"] = "Me too, me too!",
    ["还有最近加入值夜者小队的克莱恩，害羞青涩的样子招人喜欢，但总被卷进非凡事件，是个倒霉的小家伙。"] = "And Klein, who recently joined the Nighthawks squad. His shy and naive appearance is endearing, but he is always getting involved in Beyonder incidents. He's an unlucky little guy.",
    ["还有残留的气味……是油漆？"] = "There's still a lingering smell... is it paint?",
    ["还有气息，但为什么会昏迷不醒？"] = "Still breathing, but why are they unconscious?",
    ["还有海妖之石1块或者歌唱葵1朵……"] = "Also 1 Siren Stone or 1 Singing Sunflower...",
    ["还有生活在罗塞尔推动的工业革命浪潮中的人们。"] = "There are also people living in the wave of the Industrial Revolution pushed by Roselle.",
    ["还有老师骂，说明还有人给你指导方向。也是一种幸福……"] = "Having a professor scold you means there's still someone guiding your direction. That's also a kind of happiness...",
    ["还有艾德的病，他明明一副要死的样子……"] = "And Ed's illness, he looked like he was about to die...",
    ["还有表情和口型，生动的剧情表演需要多模块的配合。"] = "There are also expressions and lip-syncing; vivid plot performances require the cooperation of multiple modules.",
    ["还有警察在湖畔巡逻，你要怎么带他们回家？"] = "There are still police patrolling the lake, how are you going to take them home?",
    ["还有警局门口，他被杀的地方。"] = "And the entrance to the police station, where he was killed.",
    ["还有谁来跟我打！"] = "Who else wants to fight me!",
    ["还有谁？"] = "Who else?",
    ["还有贝克兰德大桥，横跨塔索克河的钢铁桥。"] = "And the Backlund Bridge, the steel bridge spanning the Tussock River.",
    ["还有贝克兰德最近流行的玩偶和水果糖。"] = "And the dolls and fruit candies that are popular in Backlund lately.",
    ["还有贝克兰德的报纸？"] = "There are even Backlund newspapers?",
    ["还有这个"] = "And this.",
    ["还有这么多门道？"] = "There are so many ways to do things?",
    ["还有这儿，什么海盗女王救贵族小姐？根本没这回事！格尔曼救下的是一位被绑架的议员之子，哪来的什么小姐！"] = "And here, what Pirate Queen saving a noble lady? That never happened! Gehrman saved the son of a kidnapped senator, where did a lady come from!",
    ["还有这本亲签典藏小说《大冒险家》……这本书，我可是从二道贩子手里买的！"] = "And this autographed collector's edition novel, 'The Great Adventurer'... I bought this book from a scalper!",
    ["还有这本笔记，据说是某个古老笔记的翻版，里面记录了一些消息。"] = "And this notebook, it is said to be a copy of an ancient notebook, containing some information.",
    ["还有这种小巷，\r\n很适合听墙根。"] = "And this kind of alleyway,\nit's perfect for eavesdropping.",
    ["还有这种能力？怪不得好像没人注意到我们。"] = "There's such an ability? No wonder it seems like no one noticed us.",
    ["还有这种说法？"] = "There's such a thing?",
    ["还有这首，“窗外的紫藤，非常漂亮，漂亮得就像那——窗外的紫藤。”"] = "And this one: 'The wisteria outside the window, very beautiful, as beautiful as that—the wisteria outside the window.'",
    ["还有那些洋葱，总害我掉眼泪，二十年了，就不能换个地方挂吗！"] = "And those onions, they always make me shed tears. It's been twenty years, can't you hang them somewhere else!",
    ["还有那塞牙的炖肉和焦黑的煎蛋……<P_Heart>（反胃）</>够了够了，想想就已经要吐了！"] = "And that stringy stewed meat and burnt fried eggs... <P_Heart> (Nauseated) </> Enough, enough! Just thinking about it makes me want to throw up!",
    ["还有那封信——“等您来品尝完整的我”……天哪，我怎么会写出这样的话？这几天，我无时无刻不在后悔这个约定。"] = "And that letter—'Wait for you to taste the complete me'... Oh my god, how could I have written such words? These past few days, I have regretted this promise every moment.",
    ["还有那未知的声音"] = "And that unknown voice",
    ["还有那次买二手书桌……"] = "And that time I bought a second-hand desk...",
    ["还有鞋子和袜子 又软又绵 珍妮再也不用光着脚走路了！"] = "And shoes and socks, soft and fluffy, Jenny never has to walk barefoot again!",
    ["还有，“咸鱼翻身”也是大帝用过的比喻，形容一个身处底层的人突然结交了好运，变成了大人物。"] = "Also, \"a salted fish turning over\" is a metaphor the Emperor used to describe someone from the bottom of society suddenly having a stroke of good luck and becoming a big shot.",
    ["还有，“扫描”是什么意思？"] = "Also, what does 'scan' mean?",
    ["还有，买面包不要买刚出炉的。放了一晚的便宜四分之一，切片烤一烤，味道一样。"] = "Also, don't buy bread that's just come out of the oven. Bread that's been sitting for a night is a quarter cheaper; slice it and toast it, it tastes the same.",
    ["还有，如果是紧急情况，马上向你信仰的那位存在祈祷，要相信你的伙伴，也要相信伟大存在的作用。"] = "Also, if it is an emergency, pray to the existence you believe in immediately. You must trust your partners, and you must also trust the role of the Great Existence.",
    ["还有，小点声。"] = "Also, keep your voice down.",
    ["还有，我爸送的表放左口袋还是右口袋不容易被偷？这个得用星盘细算！ "] = "Also, should I put the watch my dad gave me in my left pocket or right pocket so it's less likely to be stolen? This needs to be calculated carefully with a star chart!",
    ["还有，杰斯你也该起来了，别躺在地上。"] = "Also, Jack, you should get up too. Don't lie on the ground.",
    ["还有，能以物换物就尽量不用现金。用不需要的非凡材料去换需要的，这样能省下中间的差价。"] = "Also, try to barter instead of using cash whenever possible. Use Beyonder materials you don't need to trade for those you do; this saves the middleman's markup.",
    ["还有，角落卡座里的那个男人，也神神秘秘的。"] = "Also, that man in the corner booth is acting all mysterious too.",
    ["还有，赚的钱要分配好，一部分用于日常开销，一部分存起来购买非凡材料。"] = "Also, money earned must be allocated properly: part for daily expenses, and part saved to purchase Beyonder materials.",
    ["还有，这是我们接下来会使用到的催化媒介。请随意查看，结束后放回仪式里即可，就在那边。"] = "Also, this is the catalytic medium we will use next. Please feel free to view it, and just put it back into the ritual after you are done. It's right over there.",
    ["还有，这是我们接下来会使用到的催化媒介。请随意检查，检查完放回仪式里即可，就在那边。"] = "Also, this is the catalytic medium we will use next. Please feel free to check it, and just put it back into the ritual after checking. It's right over there.",
    ["还有，那么大的怪物倒在路上，但周围的人像是看不见一样……"] = "Also, such a large monster fell on the road, but the people around seemed unable to see it...",
    ["还有，非凡事件真的太可怕了……但只有变强，才有应对危险的能力，不让更多的人受到伤害。"] = "Also, Beyonder incidents are truly terrifying... but only by becoming stronger can I have the ability to deal with danger and prevent more people from getting hurt.",
    ["还未获得该伙伴。"] = "Have not yet obtained this partner.",
    ["还未被收藏的邮件无法取消收藏！"] = "Unfavorited emails cannot be unfavorited!",
    ["还未达到解锁时间"] = "Unlock time has not been reached yet.",
    ["还未达到解锁该摊位的条件。"] = "Conditions for unlocking this stall have not been met.",
    ["还未选中任何对象，无法附身"] = "No target selected; cannot possess.",
    ["还没准备好"] = "Not ready yet",
    ["还没到工作的点，恕不接待！再见！"] = "It's not working hours yet, I refuse to serve you! Goodbye!",
    ["还没呢，听说票不太好买。 "] = "Not yet, heard the tickets aren't easy to buy.",
    ["还没好吗？"] = "Are you not done yet?",
    ["还没好吗？我想坐进咖啡店喝甜冰茶了。"] = "Not done yet? I want to sit in the cafe and drink sweet iced tea.",
    ["还没搬吗？你那个邻居怎么样了，还是每天半夜弹琴吗？"] = "Still haven't moved? How is that neighbor of yours, are they still playing the piano in the middle of the night?",
    ["还没改dia"] = "Dia not changed yet",
    ["还没有……线索太少了，您有再想起点什么吗？"] = "Not yet... There are too few clues, have you remembered anything else?",
    ["还没有摆好哦"] = "Not set up yet",
    ["还没来……她是忘了？不……"] = "She hasn't come yet... Did she forget? No...",
    ["还没等你问清楚，芬恩就急匆匆地跑开了。\n他跑得太急，没跑几步就撞在了别人身上，连忙道歉，低头跑开了。"] = "Before you could ask clearly, Finn hurried away. \nHe ran so fast that he bumped into someone after only a few steps, apologized in a hurry, and ran away with his head down.",
    ["还没那么快，再等等吧……不如你先看看这本《第二纪十大未解之谜》？里面都是一些神秘学故事。"] = "Not that fast yet, wait a little longer... Why don't you look at this 'Ten Unsolved Mysteries of the Second Epoch' first? It's full of occult stories.",
    ["还真是……简单粗暴。"] = "That is truly... simple and crude.",
    ["还真是棘手啊……"] = "This is really tricky...",
    ["还真是说来就来，那就让我看看你有什么本事吧！"] = "It really came as soon as it was said, then let me see what skills you have!",
    ["还算有礼貌。"] = "Still quite polite.",
    ["还给我……呜……"] = "Give it back to me... sob...",
    ["还缺一个常驻汤汁特效"] = "Still missing a persistent soup effect.",
    ["还能成本价购买午餐、晚餐、酒类饮料和一些占卜教材、占卜材料。"] = "You can also purchase lunch, dinner, alcoholic beverages, and some divination textbooks and materials at cost price.",
    ["还能有谁！菜上的青虫都跑到我的香肠上了！"] = "Who else! The caterpillars on the vegetables have all crawled onto my sausages!",
    ["还能等到吗？"] = "Is there still time to wait?",
    ["还能自我控制不伤害别人的人，就不用来这里，就像阿德米索那样的，工厂区的那个疯子。"] = "Those who can still control themselves and not harm others don't need to come here, like that guy Ademis, the madman in the factory district.",
    ["还能这样走在阳光下……真好。不知道是谁拨动了命运的指针，这份运气，我得好好接着。"] = "To still be able to walk in the sunlight like this... it's great. I don't know who moved the pointer of fate, but I must hold onto this luck well.",
    ["还行吧"] = "It's alright",
    ["还要了解哪些方面？"] = "What else would you like to know about?",
    ["还要再准备一下"] = "Need to prepare a bit more",
    ["还要再来一杯吗？"] = "Would you like another cup?",
    ["还要多久啊"] = "How much longer?",
    ["还要我继续念下去吗？"] = "Do you want me to continue reading?",
    ["还要排多长时间啊？"] = "How much longer do I have to wait in line?",
    ["还要等到下个月才能继续啊……"] = "Have to wait until next month to continue...",
    ["还要等多久……"] = "How much longer do I have to wait...",
    ["还要等多久啊……"] = "How much longer do I have to wait...",
    ["还要等多久？我腿都酸了！"] = "How much longer? My legs are sore!",
    ["还记得吗？我，二十一年前曾现身于廷根制造了数起连环杀人案——"] = "Remember? I, who appeared in Tingen twenty-one years ago and committed several serial murders—",
    ["还记得我们曾经的谈话么？"] = "Do you remember our conversation?",
    ["还记得我吗 伦纳德·米切尔 序列8的午夜诗人"] = "Do you still remember me? Leonard Mitchell, Sequence 8 Midnight Poet.",
    ["还记得那个贝尔丹来的穷小子吗？"] = "Remember that poor kid from Beldan?",
    ["还记得那个骑士说了什么吗？如果你再逃学，他会帮我看着你的。"] = "Do you remember what that knight said? If you skip school again, he'll help me keep an eye on you.",
    ["还记得，\r\n我的眼瞳是什么颜色吗？"] = "Do you still remember,\nwhat color my eyes are?",
    ["还说要给你介绍一位新的相亲对象……谁能预料，会有人当街行凶？警局换了好几队警员跟进，都没能抓住凶手。"] = "He even said he was going to introduce you to a new suitor... who could have predicted that someone would commit murder in the street? The police station sent several teams to follow up, but they couldn't catch the killer.",
    ["还这么说？"] = "And they still say that?",
    ["还钱前的偷听地点"] = "Eavesdropping location before paying back money",
    ["还钱后的偷听地点"] = "Eavesdropping Location After Repaying Debt",
    ["还钱！快还钱！"] = "Pay up! Pay me back now!",
    ["还需"] = "Still need",
    ["还需<%s>%d</>好友度可以达到下一阶段"] = "Need <%s>%d</> more Friendliness to reach the next stage",
    ["还需要最后一份能量。"] = "One last bit of energy is needed.",
    ["还需要照片，我们总需要知道任务对象的样子。"] = "We also need a photo; we always need to know what the target looks like.",
    ["还需要适应"] = "Still need to adapt",
    ["还需要配套的手套吗？我们有刻意做旧的款式，看起来像祖传的。"] = "Do you need matching gloves? We have styles that are deliberately aged, looking like heirlooms.",
    ["这 这么多钱……"] = "This, so much money...",
    ["这 这是什么？"] = "This, what is this?",
    ["这20个小时里，我将带大家从众神纪元的末期，一直走到黑铁纪元。"] = "In these 20 hours, I will take everyone from the end of the Age of Gods all the way to the Iron Age.",
    ["这2个副本的奖励次数共享，击杀任意一个副本的首领并拾取奖励后，另外副本的奖励次数也会被消耗"] = "The reward attempts for these 2 dungeons are shared. After killing the boss of either dungeon and collecting the rewards, the reward attempts for the other dungeon will also be consumed.",
    ["这“证据”可以是一份文件，一件封印物，或者……一句来自鹦鹉的证词。关键在于，要让谎言在逻辑的重压下自行崩溃。"] = "This \"evidence\" can be a document, a Sealed Artifact, or... a testimony from a parrot. The key is to let the lies collapse under the weight of logic.",
    ["这……"] = "This...",
    ["这……10镑，最低了！"] = "This... 10 pounds, that's the lowest!",
    ["这……下次、下次一定！我还有事得先走了！"] = "This... next time, next time for sure! I have things to do and must leave first!",
    ["这……不太好说出口。 "] = "This... is not easy to say out loud.",
    ["这……但我还是能冷静理智地思考啊？"] = "This... but I can still think calmly and rationally, right?",
    ["这……我保证，绝对没有，我快一个月没接到查理送来的货了。"] = "This... I guarantee, absolutely not, I haven't received any goods sent by Charlie for almost a month.",
    ["这……或许是那家进货商报价更高些吧……"] = "This... perhaps that supplier's quote was higher...",
    ["这……是……一……种……修……行……"] = "This... is... a... form... of... cultivation...",
    ["这……是你？"] = "This... is this you?",
    ["这……是我从家里带来的，用了好几年了。"] = "This... I brought it from home, I've been using it for several years.",
    ["这……清醒一点啊周明瑞！什么情况，我该不会穿越了吧？"] = "This... wake up, Zhou Mingrui! What is going on? Could I have transmigrated?",
    ["这……真的吗？难道我应该带他出来晒晒太阳？"] = "This... really? Should I take him out to bask in the sun?",
    ["这……还能做二十年邻居？"] = "This... and they could still be neighbors for twenty years?",
    ["这……这不方便说啊，你从那边上二楼，会有人给你答案的。"] = "This... this isn't convenient to say. If you go up to the second floor from over there, someone will give you the answer.",
    ["这……这又是什么？"] = "What... what is this again?",
    ["这……这对吗？"] = "This... is this right?",
    ["这……这是什么力量？一瞬间就……"] = "This... what kind of power is this? In an instant...",
    ["这……这是怎么回事？"] = "This... what is going on?",
    ["这……这是我家的油漆桶。昨天阿尔伯特把它借走了。"] = "This... this is my family's paint bucket. Albert borrowed it yesterday.",
    ["这……这没什么，害怕虫子是人之常情……"] = "This... this is nothing, being afraid of bugs is human nature...",
    ["这……这里是……玛丽与天使衣帽店……"] = "Th-this is... Mary and the Angel's Hat Shop...",
    ["这……这里是什么地方？"] = "Wh... where is this place?",
    ["这……需要不少钱吧？"] = "This... must cost quite a lot, right?",
    ["这、是营地的帐篷！"] = "Th-this is the camp's tent!",
    ["这、这一杯……敬南大陆！"] = "Th-this toast... is to the Southern Continent!",
    ["这、这个女孩……"] = "This, this girl...",
    ["这、这就打包……"] = "Th-this, I'll pack it up right away...",
    ["这、这是……！"] = "This, this is...!",
    ["这、这种书，似乎不那么光彩……我本来不应该随便透露，但是……"] = "Th-this kind of book doesn't seem very honorable... I shouldn't have revealed it casually, but...",
    ["这一丛浇一点点就好……"] = "Just a little bit of water for this cluster is enough...",
    ["这一丛需要多浇点水……"] = "This cluster needs a bit more water...",
    ["这一切成功让这个蠢货认为：泰利有一个名叫奥莉薇的美丽妻子。"] = "All this successfully made this fool believe: Terry had a beautiful wife named Olivia.",
    ["这一切都是源于这本笔记，虽然也有点好奇到底是为什么……算了，好奇心杀死猫。"] = "All of this stems from this notebook, although I'm a bit curious about why... forget it, curiosity killed the cat.",
    ["这一切都离不开具体的生活，身份，还有人。"] = "All of this is inseparable from concrete life, identity, and people.",
    ["这一切都过于巧合了吧……我得去告诉队长他们！"] = "This is all too much of a coincidence... I have to go tell the Captain and the others!",
    ["这一刻！"] = "This moment!",
    ["这一单也几乎没赚头啊……"] = "There's almost no profit in this order either...",
    ["这一回，连死亡也被愚弄"] = "This time, even death is fooled",
    ["这一场...这一场不行。我们换一个恐怖点的剧本。"] = "This one... this one won't do. Let's switch to a scarier script.",
    ["这一场不行，死法太普通了。我们换一个更能凸显您“英雄救美”英姿的惨剧。"] = "This one won't do, the method of death is too ordinary. Let's change to a tragedy that better highlights your heroic 'damsel in distress' rescue.",
    ["这一套做了改良，不会太华丽。"] = "This set has been improved; it won't be too flashy.",
    ["这一定是很有意义的信物吧。"] = "This must be a very meaningful token.",
    ["这一定是诗人说的话。"] = "This must be what a poet would say.",
    ["这一带的气氛，确实有些不同。"] = "The atmosphere in this area is indeed a bit different.",
    ["这一幕的角色是......<P_Yellow>穿洋装的少女</>。看我记忆力还不错吧？"] = "The role for this scene is... <P_Yellow>a young lady in a Western-style dress</>. See? My memory is still pretty good, right?",
    ["这一幕的角色是……<P_Yellow>穿长裙的少女</>。您选她就没错了。"] = "The character for this scene is... <P_Yellow>The girl in the long dress</>. You can't go wrong choosing her.",
    ["这一束是深眠花和月见草做的，这边的是深眠花和夜香草，都是女神喜爱的品种。"] = "This bouquet is made of sleep-flowers and evening primrose, and this one is sleep-flowers and night-scented grass, both are varieties the Goddess loves.",
    ["这一杯敬鲁恩王国！"] = "This toast is to the Loen Kingdom!",
    ["这一栏……呃，家庭背景？该怎么写？"] = "This column... uh, family background? How should I write this?",
    ["这一次 终于成功了"] = "This time, it finally succeeded.",
    ["这一次我势在必得！"] = "This time I am determined to win!",
    ["这一次，呓语对我的影响似乎降低了。因为我总会想到牺牲的市民，想到自己要去救人……"] = "This time, the influence of the whispers on me seems to have decreased. Because I always think of the sacrificed citizens, and think about how I need to save people...",
    ["这一次，我们的力量已无法压制，不过大地已经降下了启示……"] = "This time, our power can no longer be suppressed, but the Earth has already sent down a revelation...",
    ["这一次，没人再将你从梦中惊醒。"] = "This time, no one will wake you from your dream again.",
    ["这一次，转动钥匙，不是为了开启，而是为了锁住什么。"] = "This time, turning the key is not to unlock, but to lock something away.",
    ["这一沓有10000绑定苏勒。"] = "This stack contains 10,000 bound Sol.",
    ["这一点都不帅。"] = "This is not handsome at all.",
    ["这一片布了无镜sequence，优化场景请找@谢锐莹沟通~"] = "This area is laid out with no-mirror sequence; please contact @Xie Ruiying to optimize the scene~",
    ["这一片的位置，都有人。请你去别处，谢谢。"] = "This area is occupied. Please go somewhere else, thank you.",
    ["这一片，全是同一种。每年都有人来采。每年都有人死。"] = "This patch is all the same kind. Every year people come to pick them. Every year people die.",
    ["这一环可能可以根据职业做表现，现在先空着。"] = "This segment could potentially be expressed based on the profession; leaving it blank for now.",
    ["这一箱有60000苏勒。"] = "This box contains 60,000 Sol.",
    ["这一边雕刻着模糊的花朵。"] = "This side is carved with a blurry flower.",
    ["这一边雕刻着粗犷的蝴蝶。"] = "This side is carved with a rough butterfly.",
    ["这三周来我们一直在追踪封印物的下落，较为危险的那件，灵性波动隐秘，只能确定在廷根。"] = "For the past three weeks, we have been tracking the whereabouts of the Sealed Artifacts. The more dangerous one has hidden spiritual fluctuations, and we can only confirm it is in Tingen.",
    ["这三天，我每晚都梦到您。梦到您的声音，您的手……还有更多。"] = "For the past three days, I have dreamed of you every night. I dreamed of your voice, your hands... and more.",
    ["这三张牌 象征你的过去 现在 和未来"] = "These three cards symbolize your past, present, and future",
    ["这三条途径……"] = "These three pathways...",
    ["这三条途径的能力各有优劣，堪比不好也不坏的学生高考填志愿了……"] = "These three pathways have their own pros and cons, it's like a student filling out college entrance exam preferences without knowing if it's good or bad...",
    ["这上面有灵性的气息，用灵视看看她往哪去了吧。"] = "There's a trace of spirituality here. Let's use spirit vision to see where she went.",
    ["这上面的诗，他应该会喜欢吧……"] = "He should like the poem on this...",
    ["这下……你全都知道了。"] = "Now... you know everything.",
    ["这下……是真的结束了吧……"] = "This time... it's really over, right...",
    ["这下万事俱备了。"] = "Now everything is ready.",
    ["这下应该没问题了，好期待成果啊！"] = "It should be fine now; I'm looking forward to the results!",
    ["这下应该熟了，把汤锅拿去给老板看看吧。"] = "It should be cooked now, let's take the soup pot to show the boss.",
    ["这下老实了……芙拉女士，我们走！"] = "That's better... Ms. Fula, let's go!",
    ["这下要交逾期罚款了，我可怜的生活费……"] = "Now I have to pay an overdue fine. My poor living expenses...",
    ["这下黛丝应该安全了。"] = "Daisy should be safe now.",
    ["这不仅仅是对罪犯的指控，更是一种灵性层面的“宣判”，能有效震慑其背后的隐秘力量，迫使真相显形。"] = "This is not just an accusation against a criminal, but a \"judgment\" on a spiritual level, which can effectively deter the hidden forces behind them and force the truth to manifest.",
    ["这不公的命运……将由我亲自斩杀！"] = "This unfair fate... will be slashed by me personally!",
    ["这不可能……我也想不到他们这样做的理由，有线索吗？"] = "This is impossible... I can't think of any reason for them to do this. Are there any clues?",
    ["这不好，非常不好！我们要增加关税，让他们把钱乖乖还回来！"] = "This is bad, very bad! We must increase tariffs and make them pay the money back obediently!",
    ["这不就是QQ的在线和离线消息的区别嘛！"] = "Isn't this just the difference between online and offline messages on QQ!",
    ["这不就是偷吗？"] = "Isn't that just stealing?",
    ["这不幸，连“愚者”先生都为之叹息"] = "This misfortune is enough to make even Mr. Fool sigh",
    ["这不应该，为什么会有这么多矛盾，就像是……什么地方出现了<P_Yellow>错误</>一样。"] = "This shouldn't be. Why are there so many contradictions? It's as if... an <P_Yellow>error</> has appeared somewhere.",
    ["这不怪你们。战争就是如此，是弗萨克那些战争犯……"] = "That's not your fault. That's just how war is. It's those Feysac war criminals...",
    ["这不怪您……"] = "This isn't your fault...",
    ["这不是“入职培训”的内容。算了……顺便介绍一下吧。"] = "This isn't part of the 'onboarding training'. Never mind... let me introduce it briefly.",
    ["这不是传统意义上的隐身，而是“心理学隐身”——当认知被暗示引导时，真实也会从视野中滑落。"] = "This is not invisibility in the traditional sense, but 'Psychological Invisibility'—when cognition is guided by suggestion, reality also slips out of the field of vision.",
    ["这不是伪装，我们是官方组织，也是真正的警察。"] = "This is not a disguise; we are an official organization and also real police.",
    ["这不是你需要了解的事情，也不是你能够了解的事情，除非你成为我们的一员。"] = "This is not something you need to know, nor is it something you can know, unless you become one of us.",
    ["这不是去码头的路 你要去哪里？"] = "This isn't the way to the dock. Where are you going?",
    ["这不是好事吗？"] = "Isn't that a good thing?",
    ["这不是我们的代理厂长小福戈吗，你怎么来了……呃，还有工人先生们？"] = "Isn't this our acting factory manager, little Foga? Why are you here... uh, and the workers, too?",
    ["这不是我想要的！"] = "This is not what I wanted!",
    ["这不是我第一次遇到这种事情……"] = "This isn't the first time I've encountered this kind of thing...",
    ["这不是我要找的那个小孩吗？"] = "Isn't this the child I'm looking for?",
    ["这不是打算和未来的合伙人商量嘛，我们一起成为廷根商界新星！"] = "Isn't this just planning to discuss with future partners? Let's become the new stars of the Tingen business world together!",
    ["这不是斗地主吗？不过在这个世界里，它好像叫“斗邪恶”，玩法跟地球还挺像。"] = "Isn't this Fight the Landlord? But in this world, it seems to be called \"Fight the Evil\", and the gameplay is quite similar to Earth.",
    ["这不是针对您本人，只是有旁人靠近会影响仪式场域的纯净……啊，我是说，是研究性质的仪式。"] = "This is not directed at you personally, it's just that having others nearby will affect the purity of the ritual field... Ah, I mean, it's a research-based ritual.",
    ["这不是非常明显吗？"] = "Isn't that obvious?",
    ["这不符合罗塞尔大帝的作风。他绝不会错过任何一位美女，我得去寻觅她的芳踪。"] = "This is not in line with Emperor Roselle's style. He would never miss out on any beautiful woman, I must go and seek her trail.",
    ["这不能怪他，看看我，我偶尔也会为自己着迷！"] = "I can't blame him. Look at me; even I am occasionally fascinated by myself!",
    ["这不能怪我，一直以来我准备的角色都是格尔曼·斯帕罗，可到招新会前夜，迪文娜学姐才通知我之前准备的布料只够给兔子做衣服了。"] = "I can't be blamed for this. I had always prepared the role of Gehrman Sparrow, but it wasn't until the night before the recruitment meeting that Senior Divina informed me that the fabric I had prepared was only enough to make clothes for a rabbit.",
    ["这与我无关"] = "This has nothing to do with me",
    ["这世道啊……真是越来越看不懂了。您说呢？"] = "This world... is getting harder and harder to understand. Don't you think?",
    ["这东西会说人话？！"] = "This thing can talk?!",
    ["这东西味道一般，还花了不少钱，不值。"] = "This thing tastes average and cost quite a bit, not worth it.",
    ["这东西能拿去造纸？"] = "Can this be used to make paper?",
    ["这东西要多少钱？"] = "How much for this?",
    ["这丝瓜个个看着饱满新鲜，怎么会没人买呢——"] = "These loofahs all look plump and fresh, why is no one buying them—",
    ["这丝瓜我要买一点！"] = "I want to buy some of these loofahs!",
    ["这两个孩子的契约根本不合法，不生效，我随时可以带走他们。还是说，想让你的事迹出现在报纸上？"] = "The contracts for these two children are completely illegal and invalid. I can take them away at any time. Or do you want your deeds to appear in the newspapers?",
    ["这两位是……"] = "Who are these two?",
    ["这两位是恩马特港的值夜者同事，米拉和埃文。三周前，他们负责运送的两件封印物在途中失窃了。"] = "These two are Nighthawk colleagues from Enmat Port, Mira and Evan. Three weeks ago, the two Sealed Artifacts they were responsible for transporting were stolen on the way.",
    ["这两半灵魂，一半和“死神”途径的唯一性融合在一起，有了活化的趋势，被人造死神派所利用。"] = "These two halves of the soul, one half merged with the Uniqueness of the 'Death' pathway and had a tendency to become active, which was utilized by the Artificial Death sect.",
    ["这两天发生的事情让我感觉不是太好。"] = "The things that have happened over the last two days don't make me feel very good.",
    ["这两年脚踏车流行起来后，新员工都可以领一辆，方便执行任务。"] = "Since bicycles became popular in the last two years, new employees can receive one to facilitate their missions.",
    ["这个……"] = "This...",
    ["这个……好像又坏了。"] = "This... seems to be broken again.",
    ["这个……我也不太清楚。"] = "This... I'm not too sure either.",
    ["这个……我以为自己会是最特殊的那个，想马上试着破译和解读。"] = "This... I thought I would be the most special one and wanted to try deciphering and interpreting it immediately.",
    ["这个……费内波特面拌42号土豆泥。"] = "This one... Feysac noodles with No. 42 mashed potatoes.",
    ["这个……费内波特面拌42号土豆泥！"] = "This one... Feynapotter noodles with No. 42 mashed potatoes!",
    ["这个不算难，只要愿意，你肯定能学会……你的灵感应该非常高吧？"] = "This isn't too difficult; if you're willing, you can definitely learn it... Your inspiration must be very high, right?",
    ["这个世界……似乎到此为止了。"] = "This world... seems to have reached its end.",
    ["这个世界上为穷人准备了太多的陷阱，你们无法识破的！"] = "There are too many traps prepared for the poor in this world that you cannot see through!",
    ["这个世界上有很多特殊的人，总是能做到别人做不到的事情，比如说你，也比如说我。"] = "There are many special people in this world who can always do what others cannot, for example, you, and for example, me.",
    ["这个世界被看不见的冰山包围，冰山外藏着世界的真相，一切的终极。"] = "This world is surrounded by invisible icebergs, and beyond the icebergs lies the truth of the world, the ultimate of everything.",
    ["这个世界里存在着一些非凡隐秘的事件，例如转运仪式导向的神秘灰雾空间，真神奇啊……"] = "There are some extraordinary, secret incidents in this world, such as the mysterious gray fog space guided by the Fortune-Turning Ritual. It's truly amazing...",
    ["这个丝瓜汤太好喝了，我刚刚干嘛那么激动来着......"] = "This loofah soup is so delicious, why was I getting so worked up just now...",
    ["这个丝瓜汤太好喝了，我刚刚干嘛那么激动来着……"] = "This loofah soup is so delicious, why was I so agitated just now...",
    ["这个书签与奖杯窃贼有关系，这个书签与奖杯窃贼有关系……"] = "This bookmark is related to the trophy thief, this bookmark is related to the trophy thief...",
    ["这个人似乎喝醉了，把这里当成了马桶？"] = "This person seems drunk; did they mistake this place for a toilet?",
    ["这个仪式也是布兰登教你的？"] = "Did Brandon teach you this ritual too?",
    ["这个价格您也赚不了钱啊，还得倒贴。"] = "You can't even make money at this price; you're losing money.",
    ["这个价钱只能买最下等的材料，阳台会漏雨的。"] = "That price will only buy the lowest quality materials, the balcony will leak when it rains.",
    ["这个任务，我需要你的协助。"] = "I need your assistance with this quest.",
    ["这个光线和角度，一定能给克塞娜拍出最漂亮的结婚照！"] = "With this lighting and angle, I'll definitely be able to take the most beautiful wedding photo for Xena!",
    ["这个分身和他本人一样，总是喜欢欺诈的魔术和操控时间的把戏，如果你看不穿这些戏法，恐怕永远无法离开···"] = "This avatar, like himself, always enjoys magic tricks of deception and time-manipulation antics. If you cannot see through these tricks, I'm afraid you will never be able to leave...",
    ["这个动作能让我们第一时间发现问题，而只要及时解救就不会有生命危险。"] = "This action allows us to discover problems immediately, and as long as we rescue him in time, there will be no danger to his life.",
    ["这个动画我没有!!! 播不出!!! \n模型ID:%s\n动画ID:%s\n缺失动画:%s %s\nNPCID:%s"] = "I don't have this animation!!! Cannot play!!! \nModel ID:%s\nAnimation ID:%s\nMissing animation:%s %s\nNPC ID:%s",
    ["这个升降梯被蛛网完全缠绕卡住了，得先清理蛛网。（蛛网流程暂无）"] = "This elevator is completely tangled and stuck by spider webs. Must clear the spider webs first.",
    ["这个单词的意思是……"] = "The meaning of this word is...",
    ["这个发型，我特意去别地进修过，有什么不合适的吗？"] = "I specifically went elsewhere to study this hairstyle. Is there something unsuitable about it?",
    ["这个口风琴和乐谱，是他留在这个世上最后的痕迹了……"] = "This harmonica and the sheet music are the last traces he left in this world...",
    ["这个名字很奇怪吗？不过我们不是什么地下帮派，只是一些朋友们聚在一起的小团体。"] = "Is this name strange? But we aren't some underground gang, just a small group of friends gathered together.",
    ["这个吝啬老头，什么都想报销，单据积累了一沓，哪里都放不下。"] = "This stingy old man wants to be reimbursed for everything, the receipts have accumulated into a stack, and there's nowhere to put them.",
    ["这个呢，哈特领班应该喜欢这种风格吧……他平时戴什么表我也没注意看。"] = "As for this one, Foreman Hart should like this style... I haven't paid attention to what watch he usually wears.",
    ["这个味道……"] = "This taste...",
    ["这个味道……太美味了！我仿佛年轻了五百岁，充满了力量！"] = "This flavor... it's too delicious! I feel like I've become five hundred years younger, filled with strength!",
    ["这个味道……我怎么会忘记？我还要忘记多少次？"] = "This scent... how could I forget it? How many more times must I forget?",
    ["这个味道，是说谎的味道！"] = "This smell, it's the smell of a lie!",
    ["这个嘛……呃……不走寻常路不是更、更显风度吗？"] = "Well... uh... isn't it more... more stylish not to take the ordinary path?",
    ["这个嘛……咳咳，实话跟你说吧，老约翰。 "] = "As for that... *cough cough*, to tell you the truth, Old John.",
    ["这个嘛……她只喜欢乖小孩，比如会好好吃掉胡萝卜的那种！"] = "Well... she only likes good children, like the kind who will eat their carrots properly!",
    ["这个嘛……工艺算是上乘，依然是有收藏价值的……"] = "Well... the craftsmanship is top-tier, so it still has collector's value...",
    ["这个嘛……我有自己的办法，至少能保证你不迷路。你愿意相信我吗？"] = "Well... I have my own ways, at least enough to ensure you don't get lost. Are you willing to trust me?",
    ["这个嘛……首先，住宿方面——如果不是长期居住，旅馆选择那种2苏勒一晚的普通房间就足够了。"] = "Well... first of all, regarding accommodation—if you are not staying long-term, a regular room in a hotel for 2 soli a night is enough.",
    ["这个嘛，我们的渊源可以说到几千年前。说起来，那时候你和我们也是室友。"] = "Well, our origins can be traced back thousands of years. Come to think of it, you were our roommate back then too.",
    ["这个城堡主人很神秘，什么留言都没留下"] = "The owner of this castle is very mysterious and left no message.",
    ["这个声音？熟悉，又想不起来了……"] = "This voice? It's familiar, but I can't quite place it...",
    ["这个大小，遮挡血迹正合适。"] = "This size is just right for covering the bloodstains.",
    ["这个大石块后面好像有什么东西，炸开看看吧"] = "There seems to be something behind this big rock; blow it up and see.",
    ["这个天气，应该是尸体腐烂的味道，说明尸体还没下葬。"] = "In this weather, it should be the smell of rotting corpses, which means the bodies haven't been buried yet.",
    ["这个女孩……我在昨天的梦里见过她……"] = "This girl... I saw her in my dream yesterday...",
    ["这个孩子嘛，哎，真不让人省心。"] = "As for this child, sigh, it really doesn't give me any peace.",
    ["这个宅子里有两扇门，一扇在你前方。"] = "There are two doors in this mansion, one is in front of you.",
    ["这个宅子里还有其他人？"] = "Are there others in this mansion?",
    ["这个宝箱似乎有一个复杂的锁具。"] = "This treasure chest seems to have a complex lock.",
    ["这个封印物必须由序列7以上的非凡者使用才能抵抗住产生的幻觉啊。"] = "This Sealed Artifact must be used by a Beyonder of Sequence 7 or higher to resist the hallucinations it produces.",
    ["这个小铜镜……"] = "This little bronze mirror...",
    ["这个小镇都要没什么人吃鱼了！全怪那个该死的沼泽女巫！"] = "There's almost no one in this small town eating fish anymore! It's all the fault of that damn Swamp Witch!",
    ["这个少女应该就是赛琳娜。"] = "This young girl should be Selina.",
    ["这个就交给我吧,我来解开共感手铐。"] = "Leave this to me. I'll unlock the Empathy Handcuffs.",
    ["这个屏障由信息洪流和绯红污染构成，前者来自“知识皇冠”，后者来自堕落母神。"] = "This barrier is composed of a Torrent of Information and crimson corruption; the former comes from the 'Crown of Knowledge', and the latter from the Mother Goddess of Depravity.",
    ["这个幕后的凶手，不仅盗取了我孩子的墓葬，还扭曲了这些村民对死亡的想象。"] = "The mastermind behind this not only stole my child's grave but also twisted these villagers' imagination of death.",
    ["这个年纪，人思想成熟，也有些经济能力了，好选择！"] = "At this age, people are mature and have some financial stability. A good choice!",
    ["这个很实用！"] = "That's very practical!",
    ["这个怀表，您也可以叫它——“时空道标”。"] = "This pocket watch, you can also call it—the \"Space-Time Beacon.\"",
    ["这个怎么没有声音？要不……<P_Yellow>打个招呼</>试试？"] = "Why is there no sound from this? How about... <P_Yellow> saying hello </> to try?",
    ["这个我只在书里看到过，深海女巫用一双腿和美人鱼交换了她的嗓音。"] = "I've only seen that in books, where a deep-sea witch traded her voice for a pair of legs with a mermaid.",
    ["这个我还真没想过。从黑夜教会孤儿院出来后，加入教会似乎是理所应当的选择。"] = "I've never really thought about that. After leaving the Church of the Evernight orphanage, joining the Church seemed like the natural choice.",
    ["这个手包是纯正的鱼人鳞片制成，每一片都闪着不同的光泽。是我叔叔从南大陆远航带回来的。"] = "This handbag is made of genuine merman scales; each one shimmers with a different luster. My uncle brought it back from a long voyage to the Southern Continent.",
    ["这个手感……好像是木头？这边的是……海绵？"] = "This texture... feels like wood? And this side is... sponge?",
    ["这个承载着爱与希望口风琴和乐谱，是他留给你的祝福。"] = "This harmonica and sheet music, which carry love and hope, are his blessings left for you.",
    ["这个承载着爱与希望的口风琴和乐谱，是他留给你的祝福。"] = "This harmonica and score, carrying love and hope, are his blessings to you.",
    ["这个拥抱……对……原来你是这样希望的，爸爸知道了……"] = "This hug... yes... so that's what you hoped for, Daddy knows now...",
    ["这个拿点，那个也拿点……"] = "Take a little of this, take a little of that...",
    ["这个方向是……富人居住区？沿着灵卜结果赶去看看吧！"] = "This direction is... the wealthy residential area? Let's follow the divination result and hurry over to check!",
    ["这个方向的尽头就是警局总部……她是故意的。"] = "The end of this direction is the police headquarters... She did it on purpose.",
    ["这个日记，还有其他的吗？"] = "This diary, are there any others?",
    ["这个时代在变——蒸汽机、印刷机、新的机器每天都在出现。能学会新东西的人，不会被时代抛下。"] = "This era is changing—steam engines, printing presses, new machines appearing every day. Those who can learn new things will not be left behind by the era.",
    ["这个木头就喜欢到外面去画画。说好南瓜收获前回来……算了，不提了！"] = "This blockhead just loves to go outside to paint. He promised to be back before the pumpkin harvest... Forget it, let's not talk about it!",
    ["这个步骤不建议存档"] = "Saving is not recommended for this step",
    ["这个步骤不要存档，否则前一个文字板无法消散"] = "Do not save the game at this step, otherwise the previous text board will not disappear.",
    ["这个步骤千万不要存档"] = "Do not save at this step under any circumstances",
    ["这个气味……真是不管沉睡多久，都难以忘记啊！"] = "This smell... it's truly hard to forget, no matter how long you've been asleep!",
    ["这个水池被沼泽女巫诅咒了，碰到水的人会连做噩梦好几天！"] = "This pool was cursed by a Swamp Witch; anyone who touches the water will have nightmares for days!",
    ["这个没用……"] = "This one is useless...",
    ["这个活动的鬼屋做得真好，我第一次见到这么逼真的亡灵，感觉背上凉飕飕的。"] = "This event's haunted house is really well done. It's my first time seeing such realistic spirits; I feel a chill down my back.",
    ["这个火柴盒子里只剩下几根火柴了。"] = "There are only a few matches left in this matchbox.",
    ["这个灵恐怕十分强大，普通的感知已经无法维持！"] = "This spirit is likely very powerful, ordinary perception can no longer maintain it!",
    ["这个炮筒里…是有一个人吗？"] = "Is there... a person inside this cannon?",
    ["这个王子有点癫，有没有什么东西让他清醒下！"] = "This prince is a bit insane, is there anything to make him sober up!",
    ["这个班。一点。上不下去。真的是。"] = "This job. Seriously. Can't go on. Really.",
    ["这个班真的有用吗？"] = "Is this class really useful?",
    ["这个男人怎么了？"] = "What's wrong with this man?",
    ["这个百万项目，诡秘想投给你"] = "This million-dollar project, Mystery wants to invest in you.",
    ["这个盒子……你从哪里找到它的？你要拿它来做什么？"] = "This box... Where did you find it? What are you going to do with it?",
    ["这个盒子，是她准备送给邓恩的生日礼物吗？"] = "Is this box the birthday gift she prepared for Dunn?",
    ["这个秘密也被你发现了？我还有个小小的神奇物品…… "] = "This secret was discovered by you too? I also have a small mystical item...",
    ["这个空间也即将跟着恶灵一同湮灭了……尽快离开吧。"] = "This space is about to be annihilated along with the evil spirit... Leave as soon as possible.",
    ["这个箱子里面有很强的非凡气息，看来就是这个箱子了。"] = "This box has a very strong Beyonder aura. It seems this is the one.",
    ["这个胡萝卜蛋糕看起来也不错。"] = "This carrot cake looks pretty good too.",
    ["这个花房贩卖鲜花，也贩卖着虔诚。"] = "This flower shop sells fresh flowers, and it also sells piety.",
    ["这个花色本季很受欢迎，今天已经是第三位来问了。"] = "This pattern is very popular this season; you are already the third person to ask about it today.",
    ["这个菲利普显然已经崩溃了……"] = "This Philip has clearly had a breakdown...",
    ["这个蔬菜摊我盘下来了！改成肉摊了！为什么每天还会变回原样！"] = "I took over this vegetable stall! Changed it to a meat stall! Why does it change back to its original state every day!",
    ["这个蛋看起来……"] = "This egg looks...",
    ["这个蜡烛…怎么自己亮了？"] = "This candle... how did it light itself?",
    ["这个蜡烛烛芯是湿的。"] = "The wick of this candle is wet.",
    ["这个蠢货！希望他看人的眼神能比看狗好一点，不然在这里可混不下去。"] = "What an idiot! I hope he has a better eye for people than he does for dogs, or he won't last long here.",
    ["这个表盘读数是怎么回事？"] = "What's wrong with this dial reading?",
    ["这个被驴子干屁股的家伙，这个月已经来第三次了。"] = "This guy who got his ass kicked by a donkey has already come for the third time this month.",
    ["这个裂纹……"] = "This crack...",
    ["这个要2苏勒……还有更便宜的吗？"] = "This one is 2 Sol... is there anything cheaper?",
    ["这个诡异的符号是什么……搞不懂，太多不明白的事了……"] = "What is this eerie symbol... I don't get it, there are too many things I don't understand...",
    ["这个该死的地方，实在没法儿再呆下去了！"] = "I can't stay in this damn place any longer!",
    ["这个该死的地方，实在没法儿再待下去了！"] = "This damn place, I really can't stay here any longer!",
    ["这个说起来挺简单的。我从教会离开之后，在海上漂了一段时间，后来遇到了嘉德丽雅船长。"] = "That's quite simple to say. After I left the Church, I drifted on the sea for a while, and later I met Captain Cattleya.",
    ["这个谎言令人失望。"] = "This lie is disappointing.",
    ["这个距离足以让你与它肢足上所有的绒毛拥吻。"] = "This distance is enough for you to kiss all the fluff on its limbs.",
    ["这个送您，一枚小铜镜，戏剧节赞助商赠送的。"] = "This is for you, a small bronze mirror, a gift from the drama festival sponsor.",
    ["这个邮差不太冷"] = "The Postman Who Wasn't So Cold",
    ["这个酒瓶……在叫妈妈？"] = "This wine bottle... is it calling for its mother?",
    ["这个铜镜 太容易被忽略了"] = "This copper mirror is too easy to be overlooked.",
    ["这个锁看起来也很好打开……"] = "This lock also looks very easy to open...",
    ["这个问题就让库克回答你吧。我要先回去写稿，希望下次见面时我们还在品尝美食，再会。"] = "Let Cook answer this question for you. I have to go back to write my draft. I hope we will still be tasting delicious food when we meet next time. Goodbye.",
    ["这个问题我也问过，她说她觉得我很特别，和她之前见过的男士都不一样，给她一种疏离感。"] = "I've asked this question too, she said she feels I'm very special, different from the men she's met before, giving her a sense of detachment.",
    ["这个问题相当棘手。当然，我们必须要做点什么。"] = "This problem is quite tricky. Of course, we must do something.",
    ["这个问题，你要问军情大臣，他在那边的木桶上例行巡视。"] = "For that question, you have to ask the Minister of Military Intelligence, he's on routine patrol on the wooden barrel over there.",
    ["这个鬼地方害得我一直咳嗽！"] = "This godforsaken place is making me cough constantly!",
    ["这个，给你。"] = "This, for you.",
    ["这丰饶的气息似曾相识……是朋友还是敌人，是恩赐、祝福，还是背叛和诅咒？"] = "This scent of abundance feels familiar... Is it a friend or an enemy, a gift, a blessing, or a betrayal and a curse?",
    ["这么久的时间，您一定和“愚者”先生经历过许多不同寻常的事。"] = "Over such a long time, you must have experienced many extraordinary things with Mr. Fool.",
    ["这么久过去，看来你终于捕捉到了我的一丝踪迹，但这些在我眼里，不过是徒劳。"] = "So much time has passed, and it seems you have finally caught a trace of me, but in my eyes, this is all in vain.",
    ["这么久？都吵什么？"] = "That long? What were they arguing about?",
    ["这么劣质的香料，以前连盥洗室都不用……"] = "Such low-quality spices, I wouldn't even use them in the washroom before...",
    ["这么厉害？给我一瓶！"] = "That impressive? Give me a bottle!",
    ["这么厉害？给我也整一瓶。"] = "That good? Get me one too.",
    ["这么厚一沓报销单，都是尼尔先生的？"] = "Such a thick stack of reimbursement forms, are they all Mr. Neil's?",
    ["这么吓人！…那岂不是之后都要少一个节目了……"] = "That's so scary! ...Doesn't that mean there will be one less program from now on...",
    ["这么喜欢羊的话，来我家剪羊毛吧！这家伙的毛每周需要剪两次……"] = "If you like sheep so much, come to my house to shear wool! This guy's wool needs to be sheared twice a week...",
    ["这么多……每周四金镑，是炼钢厂工人薪资的三倍！"] = "So much... four gold pounds a week, three times the salary of a steel mill worker!",
    ["这么多人在排票……您看我还有机会吗？"] = "So many people are queuing for tickets... do you think I still have a chance?",
    ["这么多人排队，味道肯定很不错。"] = "With so many people queuing, the taste must be very good.",
    ["这么多先生和女士在场，你在说些什么！我们走！"] = "With so many gentlemen and ladies present, what are you saying! Let's go!",
    ["这么多动物的尸体……是用来干什么的？"] = "So many animal carcasses... What are they used for?",
    ["这么多尸体……他们在祭拜什么？"] = "So many corpses... what are they worshipping?",
    ["这么多年……会觉得工作辛苦吗？"] = "So many years... do you find the work hard?",
    ["这么多年了，这儿还是老样子。"] = "So many years have passed, and this place is still the same.",
    ["这么多年过去，老身快感受不到他们的力量了。你去帮我唤醒他们，作为回报，我会将大地留下的馈赠给予你。"] = "After so many years, I can barely feel their power anymore. Go and help me wake them up. As a reward, I will give you the gift left behind by the earth.",
    ["这么多年，这顶红帐篷还在这啊…"] = "After all these years, this red tent is still here...",
    ["这么多疑问，我却什么都不知道，只有羊皮纸上的启示……"] = "So many questions, yet I know nothing, only the revelations on the parchment...",
    ["这么多计划？找不到就找不到！"] = "So many plans? If you can't find it, you can't find it!",
    ["这么多酒全是他一个人喝的？难怪站不起来。"] = "Did he drink all this alcohol by himself? No wonder he can't stand up.",
    ["这么多面包也没人看着？"] = "So much bread and no one watching?",
    ["这么大的俱乐部，只有安洁莉卡的咖啡还是熟悉的味道。"] = "In such a big club, only Angelica's coffee has a familiar taste.",
    ["这么大的俱乐部，就找不到个能信任的占卜家吗？"] = "In such a big club, can't you find a reliable Seer?",
    ["这么大的变化要多长时间？况且，这里也看不出弗萨克军队出没的痕迹……"] = "How long would it take for such a big change? Besides, there are no signs of the Feysac army here...",
    ["这么大的船，要是撞上点什么就要命了，比如冰山……"] = "A ship this big, it would be fatal if it hit something, like an iceberg...",
    ["这么夸张的修辞，观众真的会喜欢吗？"] = "With such exaggerated rhetoric, will the audience really like it?",
    ["这么好的东西，就这样碎了，好可惜。"] = "Such a good thing, just shattered like this, what a pity.",
    ["这么好的时光，也许我们可以聊一些轻松的话题。作为你的心理医生，你可以在我面前畅所欲言。"] = "In such a wonderful time, perhaps we can talk about some lighthearted topics. As your psychiatrist, you can speak freely in front of me.",
    ["这么害怕高处的话，为什么要上来呢？"] = "If you're so afraid of heights, why did you come up?",
    ["这么小的孩子，每天要进行这样的体力劳动，实在是……"] = "Such a young child, having to do this kind of manual labor every day, it's truly...",
    ["这么巧，你也在这里。"] = "What a coincidence, you're here too.",
    ["这么干脆？不怕我拍出什么不该拍的东西吗？"] = "So straightforward? Aren't you afraid I'll snap something I shouldn't?",
    ["这么快 报完名就出发了？"] = "So soon? We're leaving right after signing up?",
    ["这么快就出事了？你确实应该成为非凡者，这样才能更从容地应对那些古怪诡异的事件。"] = "Something went wrong so soon? You really should become a Beyonder, so you can deal with those strange and eerie events more calmly.",
    ["这么快就到了？看来贝克兰德教区的那群家伙也没有那么古板。"] = "Here so soon? It seems those guys in the Backlund Diocese aren't that rigid after all.",
    ["这么快就看完了？没问题，老希罗多德批准你的归还。"] = "Finished reading it so soon? No problem, old Herodotus approves your return.",
    ["这么快，是个怎样的故事？"] = "So fast, what kind of story is it?",
    ["这么快，是什么故事？"] = "So fast, what story is it?",
    ["这么快？"] = "So fast?",
    ["这么快？你一定没有撒谎，对吧？"] = "So fast? You aren't lying, are you?",
    ["这么快？！马车都很难有这样的速度……"] = "So fast?! Even a carriage would have a hard time reaching that speed...",
    ["这么早就出门？"] = "Leaving so early?",
    ["这么晚了，扫烟囱吗？"] = "It's so late, you're sweeping chimneys?",
    ["这么晚了，还在想工作？路上小心。"] = "It's so late, still thinking about work? Be careful on the way.",
    ["这么神奇！"] = "How magical!",
    ["这么突然吗……<P_Heart>（不过确实有点好奇。）</>"] = "So sudden... <P_Heart> (But I am indeed a bit curious.) </>",
    ["这么说也没错，如果有健康的人突然莫名其妙地死亡，只要超过三起，就肯定会被关注。"] = "That is correct. If healthy people were to die inexplicably, it would certainly attract attention after more than three cases.",
    ["这么说也没错，如果有健康的人突然莫名奇妙地死亡，只要超过三起，就肯定会被关注。"] = "That's not wrong. If healthy people suddenly die for no reason, as long as there are more than three cases, it will definitely attract attention.",
    ["这么说来，{{他|她}}比你更适合一起航行……"] = "In that case, {{ he | she } } is more suitable for sailing with you than you are...",
    ["这么说，事情已经查清楚了？"] = "So, the matter has been cleared up?",
    ["这么说，你是非凡者？太棒了！"] = "So, you are a Beyonder? That's awesome!",
    ["这么说，你还有别的打算？"] = "So, do you have other plans?",
    ["这么说，您喜欢像大侦探一样，躲在角落，暗中观察周围的事物了？"] = "So, you like to hide in a corner like a great detective and observe the things around you?",
    ["这么说，确实过于巧合了。"] = "That is indeed too much of a coincidence.",
    ["这么贵的车票！那可都是我们的辛苦钱啊！"] = "Such expensive tickets! That's all our hard-earned money!",
    ["这么重的血腥味，你这南瓜里面到底装的什么，你心里清楚。"] = "With such a heavy smell of blood, you know very well what is inside these pumpkins.",
    ["这么隆重吗？"] = "Is it that grand?",
    ["这么难吃，还要这么多钱。"] = "So disgusting, and it costs so much money.",
    ["这么难喝？对不起，对不起，我、我果然还是没能学会老师真正擅长的东西！"] = "Is it that bad? I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I, I really couldn't learn what the teacher was truly good at!",
    ["这么高的佣金可不常见，他犯什么事了？"] = "Such a high commission is rare. What did he get into?",
    ["这也不是什么有罪的事情吧。"] = "That's not really a guilty thing, is it?",
    ["这也可以报销吗？"] = "Can this also be reimbursed?",
    ["这也太惨了"] = "That's too miserable",
    ["这也是为何……我必须要在这里除掉你……"] = "This is also why... I must eliminate you here...",
    ["这也是女神喜爱的植物，祝福您。"] = "This is also a plant loved by the Goddess. Bless you.",
    ["这也是工作的一部分！"] = "This is also part of the job!",
    ["这也是我带你来塔罗学院的原因，在这里你可以学到最基础也最重要的非凡知识。"] = "This is also why I brought you to the Tarot Academy; here, you can learn the most basic and important Beyonder knowledge.",
    ["这也是我的系列创作，“注视爱人”，大概会一直拍到我们七老八十。"] = "This is also part of my series, 'Gazing at a Lover.' I'll probably keep taking them until we're old and gray.",
    ["这也是梦吗？母亲到底是什么意思？"] = "Is this also a dream? What exactly does the Mother mean?",
    ["这也是祂的意志…"] = "This is also His will...",
    ["这也是艾登最希望看到的。"] = "This is also what Aiden most hopes to see.",
    ["这也是队长的打算。"] = "This is also the Captain's intention.",
    ["这也是非凡能力吗？"] = "Is this also a Beyonder ability?",
    ["这也正是我期待的……之后每个周一的下午三点，我会定期召唤你们来这里集会。"] = "This is exactly what I expected... After this, every Monday at three in the afternoon, I will regularly summon you here for gatherings.",
    ["这也能忘？！"] = "You can even forget that?!",
    ["这书真是看不进去啊。奥尔登好像也没认真看？不对，这一定是学霸独有的学习方式！还是不要打扰他了。"] = "I really can't get into this book. Alden doesn't seem to be reading seriously either? No, this must be a unique study method for top students! Better not disturb him.",
    ["这二者之间有什么关联？"] = "What is the connection between the two?",
    ["这五年来，非凡事件越来越高频，但多亏了大家，廷根市民每晚依旧可以安心入睡。"] = "Over these past five years, Beyonder incidents have become more frequent, but thanks to everyone, the citizens of Tingen can still sleep peacefully every night.",
    ["这些“<P_Yellow>内部资料</>”精准命中了考试范围，甚至押中了部分原题！"] = "These '<P_Yellow> insider materials </>' accurately hit the exam scope, and even predicted some of the original questions!",
    ["这些“内部资料”精准命中了考试范围，甚至押中了部分原题！"] = "These \"internal materials\" hit the exam scope precisely, and even predicted some of the original questions!",
    ["这些……似乎是那个失控的家伙留下的。"] = "These... seem to have been left behind by that guy who lost control.",
    ["这些……是星星吗？"] = "Are these... stars?",
    ["这些不是鱼线，是人的头发。"] = "These aren't fishing lines; they are human hair.",
    ["这些东西都有个共同点，你知道是什么吗？没人真的见过它们！"] = "These things all have one thing in common, do you know what it is? No one has ever actually seen them!",
    ["这些东西都有什么故事吗？"] = "Do these things have any stories?",
    ["这些事，就算是到了高序列也不容易改变。"] = "These things, even at a high Sequence, are not easy to change.",
    ["这些人……已经去世很久了。"] = "These people... have been dead for a long time.",
    ["这些人……都会死……全都会死……"] = "These people... will all die... they will all die...",
    ["这些人姿势各异，但嘴角微微上扬，表情凝固\n在一个近乎满足的弧度。 \n\n但都已经没有了呼吸，已经死去多时。"] = "These people have different postures, but the corners of their mouths are slightly raised, their expressions frozen \n in a near-satisfied arc. \n\n But they have all stopped breathing and have been dead for a long time.",
    ["这些人怎么变成这样？原始月亮已经完全侵蚀了他们的神志么？"] = "How did these people become like this? Has the Primordial Moon completely eroded their sanity?",
    ["这些人究竟是祂的信徒，还是祭品？"] = "Are these people His believers, or are they sacrifices?",
    ["这些侍女的哭声，让我感受到了庄园的绝望……"] = "The crying of these maids makes me feel the despair of the manor...",
    ["这些信中提到了一些你姐姐曾经去过的地方、见过的人。罗塞尔大帝曾说过，凡走过，必留下痕迹。"] = "These letters mention some places your sister visited and people she met. Emperor Roselle once said, 'Whatever is walked upon, leaves a trace.'",
    ["这些动作，好尴尬、好奇怪！"] = "These movements, so awkward and strange!",
    ["这些区域，代表着仪式能量的节点与通路。仪式的成功，依赖于引导者用自身的灵性，不重复地激活每一个区域，完成整个能量回路的构建。"] = "These areas represent the nodes and pathways of the ritual's energy. The success of the ritual depends on the guide using their own spirituality to activate each area without repetition, completing the construction of the entire energy circuit.",
    ["这些占卜著作还是太难，要是凡森特先生还在就好了。"] = "These divination books are still too difficult. If only Mr. Vincent were still here.",
    ["这些可恨的家伙，用爱情小说蛊惑少女们来赴死。"] = "These hateful creatures use romance novels to lure young girls to their deaths.",
    ["这些可恶的海鸥这辈子好像就只想干这一件事。"] = "These wretched seagulls seem to only want to do this one thing for the rest of their lives.",
    ["这些合同里也规定了吗？"] = "Is that also specified in these contracts?",
    ["这些图纸画得很好，还带有面包香气。"] = "These drawings are drawn very well, and they still have the aroma of bread.",
    ["这些奇妙的能力会不会跟我的穿越有关呢？"] = "Could these wonderful abilities be related to my transmigration?",
    ["这些孩子们手脚麻利，头脑灵活。您可以靠红帽子的特征找到我们，我们非常擅长跑腿和编织小工艺品。"] = "These children are quick-handed and sharp-minded. You can find us by the red hat feature; we are very good at running errands and weaving small crafts.",
    ["这些孩子，有一个共同点……"] = "These children have one thing in common...",
    ["这些宝物现在是你的了。它们不仅是物质上的奖励，更是你成功掌握第一个仪式魔法的见证。知识固然无价，但适当的激励也是必要的，不是吗？"] = "These treasures are now yours. They are not just material rewards, but also a testament to your successful mastery of your first Ritual Magic. Knowledge is priceless, but appropriate encouragement is also necessary, isn't it?",
    ["这些家伙……是把我当许愿机了吗！"] = "These guys... do they think I'm a wish-granting machine!",
    ["这些怪物的目的地……都是台阶之上？那里有什么？"] = "The destination of these monsters... is it all above the steps? What is there?",
    ["这些报纸看上去不太干净，有的皱得字迹模糊，有的沾满了干掉的水渍，日期都不是当天的。"] = "These newspapers don't look very clean; some are wrinkled with blurred text, some are covered with dried water stains, and the dates are not from today.",
    ["这些报销单怎么会在外面？"] = "Why are these reimbursement forms outside?",
    ["这些散落的日记里，还藏着记忆的力量！"] = "In these scattered diary pages, the power of memory is still hidden!",
    ["这些文字……是破除封印的密匙？似乎要把它们拼凑出来……"] = "These characters... are they the keys to breaking the seal? It seems I need to piece them together...",
    ["这些是它的功绩，也是它的罪证——\n有人倒在地上，抓挠着自己，抓下了皮肤和血肉，抓出了森森白骨；\n有人捂着脑袋，眼睛失去焦距，气息越来越虚弱；\n有人不断呕吐，吐到最后，抽搐着死去；\n有人突然大笑，笑得喘不过气来；\n有人和对手激战之中，突然双双停止，望向对方……\n接着，他们抱在了一起，亲在了一起。 "] = "These are its achievements, and also its evidence of guilt—\n Someone fell to the ground, scratching at themselves, tearing off skin and flesh, exposing ghastly white bone; \n Someone clutched their head, their eyes losing focus, their breathing growing weaker and weaker; \n Someone vomited incessantly, until finally, they died in convulsions; \n Someone suddenly laughed, laughing until they couldn't catch their breath; \n Someone, in the midst of a fierce battle with an opponent, suddenly stopped, both of them looking at each other... \n Then, they embraced and kissed.",
    ["这些月亮花开得真茂盛！"] = "These moonflowers are blooming so lushly!",
    ["这些材料或许能用来布置净化仪式。"] = "These materials might be used to set up a purification ritual.",
    ["这些村民好像在聊最近的怪事……"] = "These villagers seem to be talking about recent strange occurrences...",
    ["这些标记是“时天使”留下的，祂曾游荡在这片诅咒之地，被我主驯服。"] = "These marks were left by the \"Angel of Time\". He once wandered this cursed land and was tamed by my Lord.",
    ["这些植物，有的来自危险的苏尼亚海底，有的来自弗萨克边境雪地……当然，卖得最好的还是女神喜爱的夜香草和深眠花。"] = "These plants, some come from the dangerous Sonia Sea floor, some from the snowy lands of the Feysac border... Of course, the best sellers are still the Night-Fragrant Grass and Deep-Slumber Flower loved by the Goddess.",
    ["这些牌到底怎么走"] = "How exactly are these cards played",
    ["这些物品应该有用"] = "These items should be useful",
    ["这些物资，看起来是有人整理好，准备搬上车的。"] = "These supplies look like they were organized by someone, ready to be loaded onto a vehicle.",
    ["这些画……"] = "These paintings...",
    ["这些知识确实能帮到很多人。而且你看，你明明很擅长讲这些。 "] = "This knowledge can indeed help many people. And look, you're clearly very good at explaining these things.",
    ["这些碎片简直是浑然天成！我要用它们做一件雕塑——破碎的心……"] = "These fragments are simply natural! I want to use them to make a sculpture—a broken heart...",
    ["这些私酒贩子毫无底线可言，用工厂都看不上的工业原料酿酒，损人利己，您也千万要注意别上当受骗，如果碰到疑似私酒贩子的人，麻烦您告诉我。"] = "These bootleggers have no bottom line; they use industrial raw materials that even factories don't want to brew alcohol, harming others for their own benefit. You must also be careful not to be deceived. If you encounter someone suspected of being a bootlegger, please let me know.",
    ["这些粘液的来源明显不是人类，至少现在不是。"] = "The source of this mucus is clearly not human, at least not anymore.",
    ["这些红色的……是星辰吗？"] = "Are these red things... stars?",
    ["这些老维托都能帮你带到海上去，换个好价钱。"] = "Old Vito can help you take these to sea and exchange them for a good price.",
    ["这些花是哪里来的？"] = "Where did these flowers come from?",
    ["这些花都可以看看。"] = "Feel free to take a look at any of these flowers.",
    ["这些花都是我们从廷根东南边的一处村子附近挖来的，那里有一片很大的花海。"] = "These flowers were all dug up near a village southeast of Tingen, where there is a vast sea of flowers.",
    ["这些茉莉是我自己种的，您如果喜欢的话，我送您一些就好。"] = "I grow these jasmine flowers myself. If you like them, I can just give you some.",
    ["这些菜也是，不新鲜了就赶紧换，不然卖相不好。"] = "These vegetables too, if they aren't fresh, change them quickly, otherwise they don't look good.",
    ["这些葡萄……"] = "These grapes...",
    ["这些葡萄看上去好极了！"] = "These grapes look great!",
    ["这些蔬菜都是我亲手栽种的，口感很好，要来点吗？"] = "These vegetables were all grown by me; they taste great. Would you like some?",
    ["这些蕴含强大超凡力量的神奇材料，究竟是什么？"] = "What exactly are these magical materials that contain powerful Beyonder powers?",
    ["这些蝼蚁，救得完吗？"] = "These ants, can you save them all?",
    ["这些蠢猪难道不知道不能埋别人的墓碑吗？"] = "Don't these idiots know they shouldn't bury over other people's tombstones?",
    ["这些规矩现在还有人用吗？"] = "Do people still use these rules now?",
    ["这些话讲给外人听，多半会觉得十分荒唐。可那里之于这里，确实更像是一场美梦。"] = "Telling these things to outsiders, most would find it very absurd. But compared to here, it really feels more like a beautiful dream.",
    ["这些该死的老鼠！"] = "These damn rats!",
    ["这些贩子专门坑过路的。{{先生|女士}}，您别理他。"] = "These peddlers specialize in scamming passersby. {{Mr.| Ms.}}, don't pay any attention to him.",
    ["这些贵族老爷们哟……他们养着那么多位情人，每个月得花不少钱吧？"] = "These noble lords... they keep so many mistresses, they must spend a lot of money every month, right?",
    ["这些迷幻草好像沉浸在自己编织的美梦里了，这么近都没醒过来……"] = "These hallucinogenic herbs seem to be immersed in the sweet dreams they wove themselves; they haven't woken up even this close...",
    ["这些邻居都跑哪儿去了……"] = "Where have all these neighbors gone...",
    ["这些都发生在一周之内？真是令人唏嘘……"] = "All this happened within a week? It's truly lamentable...",
    ["这些都是什么？"] = "What are these?",
    ["这些都是什么？银质护身符、捕梦网、乱七八糟的法阵……法阵中心是一家三口的合照？"] = "What are these? Silver amulets, dreamcatchers, messy magic circles... is that a family photo of three in the center of the circle?",
    ["这些都是我的称号，好吗？好的。"] = "These are all my titles, okay? Okay.",
    ["这些钱你拿着吧。"] = "Take this money.",
    ["这些陈词滥调，只是运气好受欢迎罢了。"] = "These clichés are only popular because of good luck.",
    ["这些音符蕴含着浓烈的情绪，或者有着值得传唱的歌词。我希望你在碰到危险时保护它们。"] = "These notes contain intense emotions or have lyrics worth singing. I hope you will protect them when you encounter danger.",
    ["这些食材过去只进贡给宫廷，如今您可以尽情品尝。"] = "These ingredients were once reserved solely for the royal court, but now you may enjoy them to your heart's content.",
    ["这些鲜花也因您的美而自惭形秽，黯然枯萎，就像我的心……"] = "These flowers are also ashamed of their own beauty in front of you and wither away, just like my heart...",
    ["这些鲜花和他们的主人一起获得了自由，现在，我要带着它们去庆祝另一场自由……"] = "These flowers have gained freedom along with their owners. Now, I am going to take them to celebrate another freedom...",
    ["这些，这些我都说出来了，对不起……"] = "These, I've said all of these, I'm sorry...",
    ["这人真有意思。 不是吗？"] = "This person is really interesting, isn't he?",
    ["这件也好看，那件也合适……哎，家乡可没这么多款式，只能过过眼瘾了。 "] = "This one looks good, that one fits well... sigh, back home there aren't so many styles, can only feast my eyes.",
    ["这件事情需要尽快处理，这次我与你同行。"] = "This matter needs to be handled as soon as possible. I will accompany you this time.",
    ["这件事涉及的隐秘，连我都不一定能承受。"] = "The secrets involved in this matter are something even I might not be able to bear.",
    ["这件事，我想<P_Yellow>安洁莉卡</>比我更专业。"] = "Regarding this, I think <P_Yellow>Angelica</> is more professional than I am.",
    ["这件外衣早已布满伤痕，如同这一路的勋章。"] = "This garment is already covered in scars, like medals of this journey.",
    ["这件封印物，是给帕里克的。"] = "This Sealed Artifact is for Parick.",
    ["这件护身符多少钱？"] = "How much is this amulet?",
    ["这件是我们店里最时兴的款式了，领口的蕾丝是鲁恩王室同款…… "] = "This is the trendiest style in our shop; the lace on the collar is the same as the one worn by the Loen royal family...",
    ["这件礼服的颜色好！就像我心中燃烧的火焰——啊，我是说，我对亡夫深切的怀念之情。 "] = "The color of this gown is good! It's like the fire burning in my heart—ah, I mean, my deep longing for my late husband.",
    ["这件粉色是不是显得我有点傻？是不是上一件更好？"] = "Does this pink one make me look a bit silly? Was the previous one better?",
    ["这件衣服看起来还不错。"] = "This piece of clothing looks pretty good.",
    ["这件雕刻着天使羽毛的银质护身符还不错，用来避免厄运足够了。"] = "This silver amulet engraved with angel feathers is not bad; it's enough to avoid bad luck.",
    ["这件，这件，这件都不要，看起来都不够西区！"] = "Not this, not this, not this. None of these look 'West District' enough!",
    ["这份感谢，让我每年都会去拉斐尔墓园为他献上一束花。"] = "This gratitude makes me go to Raphael Cemetery every year to offer him a bouquet of flowers.",
    ["这份手稿似乎并<P_Yellow>不完整</>，许多地方的字迹已经看不清了，还有些页码是缺失的……"] = "This manuscript seems <P_Yellow> incomplete </>; the handwriting in many places is no longer legible, and some page numbers are missing...",
    ["这份报纸上刊登着新闻、广告、小说等，角落里挤着这条新闻：“杀害韦尔奇和娜娅的罪犯已全部落网，相信蔓延在廷根的恐慌气氛将得到极大的缓解。韦尔奇的父亲、银行家麦格文先生护送着他小儿子的尸体返回了康斯顿城，即将举行一场隆重的葬礼……”\n\n那场震惊了整个廷根的凶案就这样结束，葬礼并没有邀请韦尔奇的那位朋友，只有墓前的鲜花沉默着祭奠。"] = "This newspaper contains news, advertisements, novels, etc., and this news is squeezed into the corner: \"The criminals who murdered Welch and Naya have all been arrested, and it is believed that the panic spreading in Tingen will be greatly alleviated. Mr. McGovern, the banker and father of Welch, escorted his youngest son's body back to Conston City, where a grand funeral will be held...\" \n\n That murder case, which shocked all of Tingen, ended just like that. The funeral did not invite that friend of Welch's; only the flowers before the tomb silently paid tribute.",
    ["这份报纸给你。"] = "Here is this newspaper for you.",
    ["这份烤肠超合口味，真想再买一根尝尝！"] = "This roasted sausage is super tasty, really want to buy another one to try!",
    ["这份牵挂，化作了未竟的旋律，一直盘旋不愿离去，引领我找到你。"] = "This attachment turned into an unfinished melody, lingering and unwilling to leave, leading me to find you.",
    ["这份荣誉还是交给我们站在光明里的同事吧。"] = "It is better to leave this honor to our colleagues who stand in the light.",
    ["这份资料就在<P_Yellow>角落的保管箱</>里。不过，虽然会长已经赋予你特别权限……"] = "This document is in the <P_Yellow> storage box in the corner </>. However, although the President has granted you special permission...",
    ["这会不会太巧合了？"] = "Could this be too much of a coincidence?",
    ["这会不会有点不太礼貌？"] = "Wouldn't that be a bit impolite?",
    ["这会是一段令人振奋的旋律。"] = "This will be an uplifting melody.",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}！"] = "This {{ Mr.| Ms.}}!",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，你也是来做义工的吗？"] = "This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, are you here to volunteer as well?",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，坐车吗？不坐车的话，需要送货吗？"] = "This { { Mr. | Ms. } }, taking a carriage? If not, do you need delivery?",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，多谢您发现了异常，现在也许还来得及……看来您对非凡力量也有了解？"] = "This {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, thank you for discovering the anomaly. Perhaps it's not too late yet... It seems you also have some knowledge of Beyonder powers?",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，帮我排一下队行吗，我排了几个小时，实在忍不住了，得去一趟盥洗室……稍后我们可以一起用餐！"] = "This {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, could you help me hold my place in line? I've been waiting for hours and I really can't hold it anymore, I have to go to the restroom... We can have a meal together later!",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，您不要管她了，说不通的。"] = "Mr. {{Mr.|Ms.}}, don't mind her, it's impossible to reason with her.",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，您如此体贴又温柔，来自您的祝福一定会灵验的！"] = "This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you are so considerate and gentle; the blessings from you will surely come true!",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，您穿得很有意思。我和艾尔萨小姐在做设计采风。"] = "This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you are dressed very interestingly. Miss Elsa and I are doing some design research.",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，您说，作为医生怎么能不出诊呢？"] = "This {{ Mr.| Ms.}}, tell me, how can a doctor not make house calls?",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，来看看知识雕塑的纪念品吧！"] = "This {{sir|madam}}, come and see the souvenirs of the Sculpture of Knowledge!",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，能占用一下您的时间吗？我想给您讲一讲我主，“愚者”先生。"] = "This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, could I take a moment of your time? I'd like to tell you about my Lord, Mr. \"Fool\".",
    ["这位{{先生|女士}}，请问您认识戈多吗？"] = "This {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, may I ask if you know Godot?",
    ["这位{{先生|小姐}}您如此体贴又温柔，来自您的祝福一定会灵验的！"] = "This {{sir|miss}}, you are so thoughtful and gentle, the blessings from you will surely come true!",
    ["这位{{先生|小姐}}，您看，我们的曼妮莎从今天下午溜出门开始，就一直这么着急忙慌的。"] = "This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you see, our Manisha has been in such a rush ever since she slipped out this afternoon.",
    ["这位{{先生|小姐}}，或许您能帮帮曼妮莎……哦，可是您也并不知情呀！"] = "This {Mr.{ Ms.|}}, perhaps you could help Manisha... Oh, but you don't know anything about it either!",
    ["这位“工匠”显然有一件重要的执念……从这些就能看出来。"] = "This \"Artisan\" clearly had an important obsession... one can tell from these things.",
    ["这位……"] = "This...",
    ["这位仁慈的{{先生|女士}}，您为珍妮找到火柴了吗？"] = "Kind {{Mr.|Ms.}}, have you found the matches for Jenny?",
    ["这位传奇的因蒂斯皇帝使用自己发明的奇妙符号来记录信息，很多人认为这是他的笔记。"] = "This legendary Emperor of Intis used strange symbols he invented to record information, and many people believe this is his notebook.",
    ["这位先生……您这是？"] = "This gentleman... what are you doing?",
    ["这位先生实在太会砍价了！"] = "This gentleman is really too good at bargaining!",
    ["这位先生给村民开颠茄制剂来治疗病痛，结果超量服用颠茄的患者声称自己变成了狼，值夜者赶到的时候，半个村庄的人都患上了“临床变狼妄想症”。"] = "This gentleman prescribed belladonna preparations to villagers to treat their pain, but the patients who took an overdose claimed they had turned into wolves. By the time the Nighthawks arrived, half the village was suffering from 'clinical lycanthropy'.",
    ["这位先生，你是收发员吗？"] = "Sir, are you the dispatcher?",
    ["这位先生，您在大街上，马路边……抽烟？"] = "Sir, are you... smoking on the street, by the roadside?",
    ["这位先生，看起来你很需要帮助。"] = "Sir, you look like you are in need of help.",
    ["这位先生，这位女士，需要带路吗？"] = "Sir, Madam, do you need a guide?",
    ["这位先生，需要我帮你解读吗？"] = "Sir, do you need me to interpret it for you?",
    ["这位卧底的祖宅，他偶尔往里面藏点货。"] = "The undercover agent's ancestral home. He occasionally hid some goods there.",
    ["这位可怜的猎物走入了<P_Yellow>哪儿</>？故事在<P_Yellow>何时</>走向终局？又会有<P_Yellow>谁</>来见证她的死亡？"] = "Where did this poor prey walk into <P_Yellow>where</>? When will the story reach its end at <P_Yellow>when</>? And who will be there to witness her death <P_Yellow>who</>?",
    ["这位同学，想算算今天的运势吗？我是占卜俱乐部的会员，包你满意。"] = "This classmate, want to calculate today's fortune? I am a member of the Divination Club, I guarantee you'll be satisfied.",
    ["这位同学，遇到什么问题了吗？"] = "This student, have you encountered any problems?",
    ["这位圣徒被记载于各种圣典中，如果您读过《夜之启示录》，对这个名字一定不会陌生。"] = "This saint is recorded in various scriptures. If you have read the 'Revelations of the Night,' you will certainly be familiar with this name.",
    ["这位塔罗学派成员，回答我一个问题，如果你撒谎或回答不出，将接受我安排的任务或者被惩罚。根据对等原则，那之后你可以问我问题。"] = "Member of the Tarot Club, answer me a question. If you lie or cannot answer, you will accept a quest I arrange or be punished. According to the principle of reciprocity, you may ask me a question afterward.",
    ["这位士兵的战友们被困在了山上，我想先送去些食物和御寒的衣服。"] = "This soldier's comrades are trapped on the mountain, and I want to send them some food and warm clothes first.",
    ["这位太太，请问教堂现在为什么只接受现金捐赠了？"] = "Madam, may I ask why the church only accepts cash donations now?",
    ["这位夫人，请问教堂现在为什么只接受现金捐赠了？"] = "My lady, may I ask why the church only accepts cash donations now?",
    ["这位夫人，这株玫瑰正称您的美丽，您愿意带它回家吗？"] = "My lady, this rose matches your beauty. Would you like to take it home?",
    ["这位女士……"] = "This lady...",
    ["这位女士就交给我吧，会有专业人士来帮助她处理失控的。你做的很好。"] = "Leave this lady to me; professionals will come to help her deal with the loss of control. You did well.",
    ["这位女士，你怎么了？"] = "This lady, what's wrong with you?",
    ["这位女士，您看起来心事重重。"] = "My lady, you look troubled.",
    ["这位女士，您还好吗？"] = "My lady, are you alright?",
    ["这位客人，您也想与我共舞一曲吗？"] = "This guest, would you like to share a dance with me?",
    ["这位客人，要不要参与我们今天的试餐活动？"] = "Guest, would you like to participate in our tasting event today?",
    ["这位客人，请您不要质疑我作为通灵者的能力！只是我需要更多的……呃……苏勒，才能继续沟通！"] = "This guest, please do not question my ability as a Spirit Medium! It's just that I need more... uh... Sol, to continue communicating!",
    ["这位客人，这里是私密区域。"] = "This guest, this is a private area.",
    ["这位客官，您是在挑选一件装点样貌的饰品，还是在寻一件……有一些不可知力量的物品？"] = "This customer, are you looking for an accessory to adorn your appearance, or are you looking for an item... with some unknowable power?",
    ["这位客官，您是在挑选一件装点样貌的饰品，还是在寻一件……有不可知力量的物品？"] = "Sir, are you looking for an accessory to adorn your appearance, or are you seeking an... item with unknowable power?",
    ["这位小姐，你挡住我的光了。"] = "Miss, you're blocking my light.",
    ["这位小姐，您这样粗糙的涂改，实在有碍市容……"] = "Miss, such crude alterations are truly an eyesore to the city...",
    ["这位就是“焦糖炸弹”的创始人谢尔敏先生，他带来了最新改良款饮料，大家一起尝尝吧！"] = "This is the founder of 'Caramel Bomb', Mr. Shermin. He has brought the latest improved version of the drink, let's all try it!",
    ["这位就是黑荆棘的队长……"] = "This is the Captain of Blackthorn...",
    ["这位年轻人的眼窝青黑，最近一段时间，他都处于严重失眠状态。"] = "The young man's eye sockets are dark and blue; for some time recently, he has been in a state of severe insomnia.",
    ["这位慷慨仁慈的{{先生|女士}}，感谢您高贵的善举。祝您在女神的庇佑下，能够获得幸福。"] = "This generous and kind {{gentleman|lady}}, thank you for your noble act of kindness. May you be blessed with happiness under the Goddess's protection.",
    ["这位慷慨仁慈的{{先生|女士}}，珍妮希望能够与您一同分享这份喜悦，您愿意帮我划亮火柴吗？"] = "This generous and kind {{ Mr. | Ms. }}, Jenny hopes to share this joy with you. Would you be willing to help me strike a match?",
    ["这位护士身上有浓烈的香水气味，这可能是导致老先生不满的原因。"] = "This nurse has a strong scent of perfume on her, which might be the reason for the old gentleman's dissatisfaction.",
    ["这位是{{PlayerName}}警官，负责调查真相。"] = "This is Officer {{PlayerName}}, responsible for investigating the truth.",
    ["这位是“愚者”先生的使者——魔镜阿罗德斯。"] = "This is the messenger of Mr. Fool—the Magic Mirror, Arrodes.",
    ["这位是……"] = "This is...",
    ["这位是……？"] = "Who is this...?",
    ["这位是商会委派的专职列车员。他带来了“区域经销协议”，具体的经营规则，将由他为您介绍。"] = "This is the full-time conductor appointed by the Chamber of Commerce. He has brought the 'Regional Distribution Agreement,' and he will introduce the specific operating rules to you.",
    ["这位是新生吗？要不要加入我们“新世界旅行协会 ”？"] = "Is this a new student? Would you like to join our \"New World Travel Association\"?",
    ["这位是海纳斯·凡森特，我们这里最有名的占卜者。"] = "This is Haines Vincent, our most famous diviner here.",
    ["这位是负责这附近的警察，肯·托马斯。"] = "This is the police officer in charge of this area, Ken Thomas.",
    ["这位是？"] = "Who is this?",
    ["这位朋友，能不能耽搁您一会儿？我实在是没辙了。"] = "My friend, could you spare a moment? I'm truly at my wit's end.",
    ["这位朋友，进来瞧瞧？新到了一批布料，花色特别衬您。"] = "My friend, why not come in and take a look? We have a new batch of fabrics, the patterns would really suit you.",
    ["这位罗塞尔先生还发明了蒸汽机，改良了帆船，后来他将因蒂斯改成了帝国，自称“凯撒大帝”……"] = "This Mr. Roselle also invented the steam engine, improved sailing ships, and later he changed Intis into an empire, calling himself \"Caesar the Great\"...",
    ["这位美丽的小姐，我能为你写一首诗吗？"] = "Beautiful lady, may I write a poem for you?",
    ["这位老先生的肺部以太颜色异常，他似乎是肺部不适……"] = "The ether color of this old gentleman's lungs is abnormal; it seems he is suffering from lung discomfort...",
    ["这位警察先生郑重地拿出了几张……纸？我想也许这是值得珍重的心意。"] = "This police officer solemnly took out a few... papers? I think perhaps this is a sentiment worth cherishing.",
    ["这位路过的{{先生|女士}}，您也是来教堂参观的吗？"] = "This passing {{Mr.|Ms.}}, are you also here to visit the church?",
    ["这位达文西先生和这位{{先生|女士}}！"] = "This Mr. Da Vinci and this {Mr.{ Ms.|}}!",
    ["这你就不懂了！维亚是想他啦！"] = "You don't understand! Veya misses him!",
    ["这便是保持爱情新鲜度的窍门。你还太年轻呢。"] = "This is the secret to keeping love fresh. You are still too young.",
    ["这俱乐部里是要花钱的！我们家有一个浪费钱的蠢货就够了！"] = "It costs money to be in this club! It's enough to have one idiot in our family wasting money!",
    ["这傻小子一点防备都没有，手快拿麻袋把他套住，直接搜走他身上的钱……"] = "This silly kid has no guard up at all. Let's be quick, bag him, and take all the money on him...",
    ["这儿成天有人来，有人走的，我可不知道你说的是谁了。"] = "People are coming and going here all day, I don't know who you're talking about.",
    ["这儿有贝克兰德最流行的款式！"] = "We have the most popular styles from Backlund here!",
    ["这其中应该有什么奥秘……"] = "There must be some mystery to this...",
    ["这其实是相处久了之后，自然而然的事情。"] = "This is actually something that happens naturally after being together for a long time.",
    ["这再一次是，唯有秩序与混乱相交之时！"] = "This is once again the moment when only order and chaos intersect!",
    ["这再明显不过了！这是一种征服！大帝站在凡人所能触及的顶峰，向神明发出宣言。"] = "This couldn't be more obvious! This is a conquest! The Emperor stands at the peak that mortals can reach and issues a declaration to the gods.",
    ["这冒失鬼把枪弄丢了，正好让我捡到，这回一定要狠狠敲他一笔？"] = "This reckless fool lost his gun, and I just happened to find it. This time I'll definitely squeeze him for all he's worth!",
    ["这几个土豆挺新鲜的，正适合我老婆炖小牛尾汤，谢谢了。"] = "These potatoes are quite fresh, perfect for my wife's oxtail soup, thank you.",
    ["这几个月，已经发生了十四起这样的“自杀”案件了，自杀现场都有<P_Yellow>蜡烛</>。"] = "In these past few months, there have already been fourteen such \"suicide\" cases, and there were <P_Yellow>candles</> at every suicide scene.",
    ["这几个黄心土豆挺新鲜的，正适合我老婆炖小牛尾汤，谢谢了。"] = "These yellow-hearted potatoes are quite fresh; they're just right for my wife to make oxtail soup. Thank you.",
    ["这几句告解好像不一样"] = "These confessions seem different",
    ["这几天踩踩点，等过几天晚上搞一票！"] = "Scout the place these few days, and pull off a job in a few nights!",
    ["这几年我还会时不时想起他，今天不知怎么就走到这里了。"] = "I still think of him from time to time over these years, and today, I just happened to walk here.",
    ["这几年最火爆的小说你都不知道？我和你无话可说。去、去、排队去后面，别打扰我。"] = "You don't even know the most popular novel of these past few years? I have nothing to say to you. Go, go, queue up at the back, don't bother me.",
    ["这几年见到行长的次数渐渐少了，也许他已经放心把银行托付给希伯特少爷了。"] = "I've seen the bank manager less and less these past few years. Perhaps he has already felt at ease entrusting the bank to Young Master Hibbert.",
    ["这则预言是什么意思？"] = "What does this prophecy mean?",
    ["这到底……"] = "What on earth...",
    ["这到底是事实还是传说！写得太精彩了！要是能单独出书就好了。"] = "Is this fact or legend! It's written so brilliantly! It would be great if it were published as a standalone book.",
    ["这副情景，让我回想起当年被逼债的日子……"] = "This scene reminds me of the days when I was forced to pay debts...",
    ["这匹料子不错，格蕾丝应该会喜欢……就是这个价格，有些贵了。"] = "This fabric is nice, Grace would probably like it... It is just that the price is a bit high.",
    ["这匹料子做套装有点勉强了。"] = "This fabric is a bit of a stretch for a suit.",
    ["这匹马怎么突然受惊发疯，还好我及时跳下了马车。"] = "Why did this horse suddenly get spooked and go crazy? Luckily, I jumped off the carriage in time.",
    ["这十四天里，你一直在帮一只乌鸦收集历史痕迹。所以，严格来说，我应该替乌鸦向你当面道个谢。"] = "During these fourteen days, you've been helping a crow collect historical traces. So, strictly speaking, I should thank you on behalf of the crow in person.",
    ["这十四天里，你一直在帮一只乌鸦收集记忆碎片。所以，严格来说，我应该替乌鸦向你当面道个谢。"] = "Over these fourteen days, you have been helping a crow collect memory fragments. So, strictly speaking, I should thank you on behalf of the crow in person.",
    ["这卷心菜，紧实得像个守财奴的钱包，谁都别想掰开一片叶子！"] = "This cabbage is as tight as a miser's purse; no one is getting a single leaf off it!",
    ["这原本是老尼克的东西。"] = "This was originally Old Nick's.",
    ["这又不是什么稀奇事，你也想自杀？先喝两杯，喝完了还想死，就回家跟你老妈聊聊。"] = "That's nothing rare. Do you want to commit suicide too? Have a couple of drinks first. If you still want to die after you're done, go home and talk to your mother.",
    ["这双真实的眼睛，将一直注视着你……"] = "These eyes of truth will always be watching you...",
    ["这双靴子走过太多地方了，多到它能和自己的所有者和平共处。\n有人穿着它在婚礼的酒渍中起舞，有人带着它在庆典的花瓣中大笑，有人喜欢在潮声里踏入碎银般的海浪，有人怕它磨损，就装入玻璃做的展示盒。\n和女孩一起埋在废墟下时，它表面的符文还和刚附着时一样精美。\n“如果谁能记得我就好了。”\n它总觉得，很久以前也有人这么说过。"] = "These boots have walked through too many places, so many that they could coexist peacefully with their owners. \n Some wore them to dance amidst the wine stains of a wedding, some carried them to laugh among the petals of a celebration, some liked to step into the silver-like sea waves amidst the sound of the tide, and some were afraid of wearing them out, so they placed them in a glass display case. \n When buried under the ruins with the girl, the runes on their surface were as exquisite as when they were first attached. \n \"If only someone could remember me.\" \n It always felt that someone had said this a long time ago.",
    ["这双鞋，想必是诅咒的源头了。"] = "This pair of shoes must be the source of the curse.",
    ["这取决于序列层次。高序列的圣者或天使确实可能引发大范围的异常天象，但那通常意味着失控或神性外溢，是相当危险的现象。"] = "That depends on the sequence level. High-sequence Saints or Angels can indeed trigger large-scale abnormal weather phenomena, but that usually means loss of control or divinity overflow, which is a quite dangerous phenomenon.",
    ["这变化当然是个好事，我能轻易感应哪个物品比较贵重。"] = "This change was certainly a good thing; I could easily sense which items were more valuable.",
    ["这句祈祷词……"] = "This prayer...",
    ["这句话……库克还在迪西海湾时，经常对一个小女孩说。"] = "That sentence... Cook used to say it often to a little girl when he was still in Tisi Bay.",
    ["这句话……我好像在梦里听过"] = "This sentence... I seem to have heard it in a dream.",
    ["这句话，我一直记到现在。"] = "I have remembered that sentence until now.",
    ["这只乌鸦在干什么？"] = "What is this crow doing?",
    ["这只怀表，每个齿轮都是我亲手打磨。三年前，我带它去贝克兰德参赛，评委说它款式太旧，没有市场价值。"] = "This pocket watch, every gear was polished by my own hands. Three years ago, I took it to Backlund for a competition, and the judges said the style was too old and had no market value.",
    ["这只手套会把敌人的灵魂剥离到自己身边，吞噬后可获得其生前的能力或专攻强化。但它永不餍足——每一个被放牧的灵魂，都在压低你的生命上限。"] = "This glove will strip the enemy's soul to your side; after devouring it, you can obtain their abilities or specialization enhancements from before their death. But it is never satisfied—every marionette soul lowers your Health cap.",
    ["这只是一道历史痕迹，早晚会消散的。"] = "This is merely a trace of history; it will dissipate sooner or later.",
    ["这只是我从家里随便拿的一本杂志。"] = "This is just a magazine I brought from home.",
    ["这只是知识在扮演“你”。"] = "This is just knowledge acting as \"you\".",
    ["这只母猫在我家门口叫了三天！全家人都被它打搅得睡不着觉。"] = "This female cat has been meowing at my door for three days! My whole family is so disturbed by it that we can't sleep.",
    ["这只灵猫对人类的对话充满兴趣。\n你可以运用学识协助它整理内容，或与它闲聊一番，或许会获得一些神秘的奖励。"] = "This spirit cat is full of interest in human dialogue. \n You can use your knowledge to assist it in organizing content or chat with it; perhaps you will receive some mysterious rewards.",
    ["这只灵鸟是……卡萝队长？"] = "Is this spirit bird... Captain Daly?",
    ["这只狒狒为什么这么兴奋？"] = "Why is this baboon so excited?",
    ["这只狒狒怎么看着愁眉苦脸的？"] = "Why does this baboon look so miserable?",
    ["这只猪的嘴里咬着……珍珠项链？"] = "Is this pig biting... a pearl necklace?",
    ["这只猫好像在笑，会不会能听懂人的指令？"] = "This cat seems to be smiling. Could it understand human commands?",
    ["这只猫的名字是“甜冰茶”？"] = "Is this cat's name 'Sweet Iced Tea'?",
    ["这只猫的眼睛怎么看上去不一样大？"] = "Why do this cat's eyes look like they are different sizes?",
    ["这只老鼠看起来要和猫打起来了……"] = "This mouse looks like it's about to fight a cat...",
    ["这叫什么“特殊服务”？我穿得那么少，还踩着高跟鞋，在风口里排队……"] = "What kind of \"special service\" is this? I was dressed so scantily, wearing high heels, queuing in the wind...",
    ["这可不是我想出来的呀！是它们自己告诉我的，我面前的这一簇花叫大海，左边这棵高一点的树叫沙滩，右边矮一点的小树叫小精灵。"] = "I didn't come up with this! They told me themselves, this cluster of flowers in front of me is called Ocean, the taller tree on the left is called Beach, and the shorter little tree on the right is called Elf.",
    ["这可怎么办……我要到哪里去找一位占卜师……"] = "What should I do... where can I find a diviner...",
    ["这可是七十年前一位旅人带来的配方，金秋湖最出名的烈酒！"] = "This is a recipe brought by a traveler seventy years ago, the most famous strong liquor in Golden Autumn Lake!",
    ["这可是全廷根最高档的百货商店，关门期间也有不少人盯着它！"] = "This is the most high-end department store in all of Tingen, and many people have been eyeing it even while it's closed!",
    ["这可是各大酒馆里的招牌项目！"] = "This is a signature event in all the major taverns!",
    ["这可是在拍摄你的婚纱照！"] = "This is your wedding photo shoot!",
    ["这可是在鲁恩买不到的货呢，3金镑便宜你了。"] = "This is goods you can't buy in Loen; 3 pounds is a bargain for you.",
    ["这可是廷根最大的百货商店。"] = "This is the largest department store in Tingen.",
    ["这可是我祖母传下来的，据说是当年的王室赠品。"] = "This was passed down from my grandmother; it's said to be a gift from the royal family back then.",
    ["这可是最新科技，听说光是钢板就厚得吓人。而且你看这规模，十层甲板呢！"] = "This is the latest technology; I heard the steel plates alone are terrifyingly thick. And look at the scale, ten decks!",
    ["这可是真正的神迹！没想到如此高层次的事物就这样摆在最显眼的地方。"] = "This is a true miracle! I didn't expect such a high-level thing to be placed in the most conspicuous place.",
    ["这可是难得一见的稀罕东西，往常在港口就被餐厅抢购一空了。"] = "This is a rare find; usually, it gets snapped up by restaurants at the docks.",
    ["这可笑的杂技居然阻止了跟踪行动，惊魂未定的她终于在这<P_Yellow>黄昏</>的喧嚣中获救。"] = "This ridiculous stunt actually stopped the tracking, and she, still shaken, was finally rescued in the hustle and bustle of this <P_Yellow>twilight</>.",
    ["这可能也是你为什么不在现场、而是在家里自杀的原因。"] = "This might also be the reason why you weren't at the scene but committed suicide at home.",
    ["这可能是因为我来自贝克兰德的西区……抱歉，我的意思是，我接受的教育可能……不太一样……对不起，我不知道该怎么说……"] = "This might be because I come from the West District of Backlund... Sorry, I mean, the education I received might be... a bit different... I'm sorry, I don't know how to say it...",
    ["这合法吗？"] = "Is this legal?",
    ["这听起来……不太像普通人该碰的东西。"] = "This sounds... not like something an ordinary person should touch.",
    ["这听起来不是一个常见的苦恼。"] = "That doesn't sound like a common distress.",
    ["这听起来很正常。"] = "That sounds normal.",
    ["这告示是……"] = "This notice is...",
    ["这周他一直都在约同一位小姐，听说那位小姐出手也不低。唉，有钱真好啊。"] = "He has been asking the same lady out all week. I heard she has quite deep pockets too. Sigh, it's really nice to be rich.",
    ["这周工头又找借口扣我1便士！对K，压你！ "] = "The foreman deducted 1 penny from my pay this week for no reason! Pair of Kings, beat that!",
    ["这周干完我就去码头看看，炸弹！赢了！"] = "After I finish this week, I'm going to check out the docks. Bomb! I win!",
    ["这周的特调叫太阳圣水，喝了会浑身暖洋洋的！"] = "This week's special is called Sun Holy Water; you'll feel all warm and fuzzy after drinking it!",
    ["这周的特调叫太阳圣水，喝了会浑身暖洋洋的，有个常来的客人说就像在阳光下午睡一样？"] = "This week's special is called Sun Holy Water. Drinking it makes you feel warm all over. A regular customer said it's like taking a nap in the sun?",
    ["这周的薪水发下来，我就去买一杯南威尔啤酒！"] = "Once this week's salary comes in, I'm going to buy a glass of Southwell beer!",
    ["这和你的关系是……"] = "What is your relationship to this...",
    ["这和我当年吃到的芥末章鱼一样！也许真的是误会，库克没变。"] = "This is exactly the same as the wasabi octopus I ate back then! Maybe it really was a misunderstanding; Cook hasn't changed.",
    ["这和我笔记上的字好像啊！但我，我有点看不懂上面的意思了。"] = "This looks so much like the handwriting in my notes! But, I... I don't quite understand what it means anymore.",
    ["这和教会有什么关系？"] = "What does this have to do with the Church?",
    ["这和百货商店的联系是什么？"] = "What is the connection between this and the department store?",
    ["这啥啊哈哈哈哈哈"] = "What is this, hahahahaha.",
    ["这回又往右边吹了，该控制风往……"] = "This time it's blowing to the right again, should control the wind to...",
    ["这地儿也不安全，先冲出去，别废话。"] = "This place isn't safe either, let's charge out first, no more talk.",
    ["这地方不错……"] = "This place is not bad...",
    ["这地方可真不错，风吹不到，太阳也晒不到。"] = "This place is really nice, no wind, no sun.",
    ["这地方我待了三年，哪个角落的花几点开、什么光线最适合拍摄，我比蜜蜂还清楚！ "] = "I've been in this place for three years. I know which flowers bloom at what time in every corner, and what lighting is best for photography, better than the bees do!",
    ["这地方比我想象的还荒凉，连个像样的剧院都没有。"] = "This place is even more desolate than I imagined; there isn't even a decent theater.",
    ["这地方真是美，简直美得不真实！"] = "This place is truly beautiful, so beautiful it feels unreal!",
    ["这场仪式应该是临时组织的，为什么突然要献祭这么多人？"] = "This ritual must have been organized on the fly, why suddenly sacrifice so many people?",
    ["这场危机不止涉及“新生”，还涉及“知识”。我调查了一些罗塞尔大帝的狂热粉丝，发现有组织利用夜校、扫盲班传播污染的知识。"] = "This crisis involves not only \"New Life\" but also \"Knowledge\". I investigated some fanatical fans of Emperor Roselle and found that there are organizations using night schools and literacy classes to spread corrupted knowledge.",
    ["这场拳赛我可是期待了很久……"] = "I've been looking forward to this boxing match for a long time...",
    ["这场捉迷藏游戏缺少<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">扮演鬼的角色</>，四处散开的孩童们躲进死角，正捂着嘴等待别人来寻找；\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">与此同时，喷泉旁穿长裙的少女毫无防备，正开心地寻找着藏起来的玩伴，却不知道阴影里的开膛手正死死盯着少女，暗中观察着一切。</>\n\n扮演鬼的角色是：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">穿长裙的少女</>。"] = "This game of hide-and-seek is missing <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the role of the ghost</>. The children scattered everywhere hide in dead ends, covering their mouths while waiting for someone to find them;\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Meanwhile, the girl in the long dress by the fountain is completely unguarded, happily looking for her hidden playmates, not knowing that the Ripper in the shadows is staring fixedly at her, observing everything in secret.</>\n\nThe one playing the role of the ghost is:\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">the girl in the long dress</>.",
    ["这场捉迷藏游戏缺少<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">扮演鬼的角色</>，四处散开的孩童们躲进死角，正捂着嘴等待别人来寻找；\n与此同时，喷泉旁<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">穿长裙的少女毫无防备，正开心地寻找着藏起来的玩伴</>，却不知道阴影里的开膛手正死死盯着少女，暗中观察着一切。\n\n扮演鬼的角色是：\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">穿长裙的少女</>。"] = "This game of hide-and-seek is missing <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the role of the ghost</>. The children scattered everywhere hide in dead ends, covering their mouths while waiting for someone to find them;\nMeanwhile, the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">girl in the long dress by the fountain is completely unguarded, happily looking for her hidden playmates</>, not knowing that the Ripper in the shadows is staring fixedly at her, observing everything in secret.\n\nThe one playing the role of the ghost is:\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">the girl in the long dress</>.",
    ["这场捉迷藏游戏缺少<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">扮演鬼的角色</>，四处散开的孩童们躲进死角，正捂着嘴等待别人来寻找；\n与此同时，喷泉旁<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">穿长裙的少女毫无防备，正开心地寻找着藏起来的玩伴</>，却不知道阴影里的开膛手正死死盯着少女，暗中观察着一切。\n\n扮演鬼的角色是：\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">穿长裙的少女</>。"] = "This game of hide-and-seek is missing <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the role of the ghost</>. The children scattered everywhere hide in dead ends, covering their mouths while waiting for someone to find them;\nMeanwhile, the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">girl in the long dress by the fountain is completely unguarded, happily looking for her hidden playmates</>, not knowing that the Ripper in the shadows is staring fixedly at her, observing everything in secret.\n\nThe one playing the role of the ghost is:\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\">the girl in the long dress</>.",
    ["这场精心策划的尾随猎杀，最终，反倒成了凶手自投罗网的死局。"] = "This carefully planned tailing and hunt, in the end, turned into a trap where the murderer walked right into the net.",
    ["这场舞会里还有我不知道的东西。继续观察。"] = "There's still something about this ball I don't understand. Keep observing.",
    ["这块齿轮磨损成这样，主人平时是怎么上发条的……"] = "This gear is worn down like this; how does the owner usually wind it...",
    ["这城堡荒废了几百年，真有什么古董，能轮到他？"] = "The castle has been abandoned for hundreds of years. If there really were any antiques, would it be his turn to find them?",
    ["这城市烂透了。但总得有人去挖出这些烂肉——哪怕只剩我一个。"] = "This city is rotten to the core. But someone has to dig out this rotten flesh—even if I'm the only one left.",
    ["这声音是……"] = "This voice is...",
    ["这多亏了你的机警，这是属于你的功劳。"] = "This is all thanks to your alertness. This is your credit.",
    ["这够我们一家人吃的了 如果妈妈也在这儿就好了"] = "This is enough for our whole family to eat, if only Mom were here too",
    ["这大概是托特和西蒙最后的遗言……"] = "These are probably the last words of Tot and Simon...",
    ["这天气走路可不妙，我的马车又快又稳，还能遮雨！"] = "Walking in this weather isn't great. My carriage is fast and steady, and it can keep the rain off!",
    ["这太危险了，你到底惹到了谁？"] = "This is too dangerous. Who exactly did you provoke?",
    ["这太残酷"] = "This is too cruel",
    ["这太残酷了。"] = "That's too cruel.",
    ["这头看门犬，竟然能异变成如此体型……"] = "This guard dog was actually able to mutate to such a size...",
    ["这套不错，只是价格……"] = "This set is nice, but the price...",
    ["这套不错，很适合安保公司的工作人员，多少钱？"] = "This set is good, very suitable for security company staff. How much?",
    ["这套正装基础包含外套、裤子、马甲，衬衣和皮靴，一共9镑。"] = "This formal suit base includes a coat, trousers, vest, shirt, and leather boots, for a total of 9 pounds.",
    ["这套衣服名为“新叶”，据说设计师使用了春天新嫩绿叶的概念，整套气质清新活泼。"] = "This outfit is called 'New Leaf'. It's said the designer used the concept of fresh green leaves in spring, giving the whole set a fresh and lively temperament.",
    ["这女的是个弗萨克人……发动了该死战争的弗萨克人！"] = "This woman is a Feysacian... a Feysacian who started that damn war!",
    ["这好像不够符合鲁恩特色？"] = "Does this not seem to fit the Loen style?",
    ["这好像是罗塞尔象棋……但我好像不是很熟悉（洞悉检定失败）。"] = "This seems to be Roselle Chess... but I don't seem very familiar with it (Insight check failed).",
    ["这好像阿兹克先生啊……"] = "This looks like Mr. Azik...",
    ["这嫩豌豆炖羔羊肉越来越难吃了！"] = "This lamb stew with tender peas is getting worse and worse!",
    ["这孩子……因为我看了他的日记，他就要这样惩罚自己吗？"] = "This child... is he punishing himself just because I read his diary?",
    ["这孩子名叫吃不饱，你看这橘红的条纹，是不是很肥美？"] = "This child is named 'Can't Get Enough.' Look at these orange-red stripes, aren't they plump and beautiful?",
    ["这孩子虽然看着活泼，其实跑得可慢了，所以才坐在椅子上不肯动弹。"] = "Although this child looks lively, it actually runs very slowly, which is why it sits on the chair and refuses to move.",
    ["这家伙是在看守这里的货吗？"] = "Is this guy guarding the goods here?",
    ["这家伙机灵又凶悍，但凡是上了酒吧禁入名单的人，它一准能闻出来。"] = "This guy is clever and fierce; it can smell anyone who is on the bar's blacklist for sure.",
    ["这家伙欠了我一大笔钱。你看门口这些画，都是被他毁掉的！"] = "This guy owes me a huge sum of money. Look at these paintings at the door, they were all ruined by him!",
    ["这家伙的肩膀里还有子弹，不管了吗？"] = "There's still a bullet in this guy's shoulder, are we not going to do anything about it?",
    ["这家伙，滑得跟泥鳅似的，又让他逃走了。"] = "This guy, slippery as an eel, let him escape again.",
    ["这家店不把原来的厨师雇回来，我就赖在这不走了！"] = "If this shop doesn't hire the original chef back, I'm not leaving!",
    ["这家店是埃莉诺和托马斯一起开起来的，都几十年了。 "] = "This shop was opened by Eleanor and Thomas together, it's been decades.",
    ["这家拍卖行的商品是……"] = "The items at this auction house are...",
    ["这家的煎蛋最好吃……"] = "This place has the best fried eggs...",
    ["这家臭名昭著的餐厅，他们的招牌菜是……"] = "This notorious restaurant's signature dish is...",
    ["这家餐厅以前可从没免费送过汤，最近怎么突然这么大方？"] = "This restaurant has never given away free soup before, why are they suddenly so generous?",
    ["这家餐厅的环境还不错。"] = "The atmosphere of this restaurant is quite good.",
    ["这对你们有什么影响吗？"] = "Does this have any impact on you?",
    ["这对别人来说就是一间破屋子，卖不了几个钱。"] = "To others, this is just a dilapidated house; it won't fetch much money.",
    ["这对我们的新品牌有很大帮助，城市之间的时尚差异也是个很值得讨论的命题。"] = "This is a great help to our new brand. The fashion differences between cities are also a topic worth discussing.",
    ["这对认真学习的学生太不公平了！"] = "This is too unfair to students who study hard!",
    ["这寻人启事上说有人在农场附近失踪——"] = "This missing person notice says someone went missing near the farm—",
    ["这封信是寄给前屋主的吗？还不太能确定……"] = "Was this letter sent to the previous owner? It's not quite certain yet...",
    ["这将是我交的最后一笔房租！"] = "This will be the last rent I pay!",
    ["这小子，他偷我的火腿！"] = "This kid, he stole my ham!",
    ["这小家伙……浑身都湿透了。"] = "This little guy... it's soaked through.",
    ["这小家伙看起来挺喜欢你的。"] = "This little one seems to like you quite a bit.",
    ["这小家伙，看起来饿坏了…… "] = "This little guy looks like it's starving...",
    ["这小小的身体，依然充满着温暖……"] = "This small body is still filled with warmth...",
    ["这小破酒馆没有赏金猎人也不举办娱乐活动，愿意来两杯黑麦啤酒还是烈朗齐都随你的便。"] = "This little dive bar doesn't have bounty hunters or host any entertainment, so feel free to come in for a glass of rye beer or Tei-Lang-Chi as you please.",
    ["这小贼身上没有永暗蜡烛的气息，放他走吧。"] = "This little thief doesn't have the aura of the Candle of Eternal Darkness on him. Let him go.",
    ["这就去找找"] = "I'll go find it now",
    ["这就是{{Class}}途径序列9魔药？这个颜色，好像很难“一口气喝下去”？"] = "Is this the Sequence 9 potion for the {{Class}} pathway? This color... it seems hard to \"drink in one go\"?",
    ["这就是——“浸泡曼哈尔鱼眼珠的牛奶”？"] = "Is this—'Milk soaked with Manhar Fish eyeballs'?",
    ["这就是“愚者”先生提过的，在合适的时机和地点，金币会指引我……"] = "This is what Mr. Fool mentioned—that at the right time and place, the gold coin will guide me...",
    ["这就是“救赎”之路的尽头，神弃之地的结局，白银城的新生。"] = "This is the end of the road of \"Salvation\", the ending of the Forsaken Land of the Gods, the rebirth of the City of Silver.",
    ["这就是“旅行尖碑”了吧"] = "This must be the \"Traveler's Stele\"",
    ["这就是……巨龙的力量么……"] = "Is this... the power of a Giant Dragon...",
    ["这就是……灵性空间？真是……不可思议。"] = "Is this... the Spirit World? It's truly... incredible.",
    ["这就是《救赎圣典》中重现的神弃之地？与外界隔绝，没有白天，没有食物……"] = "Is this the Forsaken Land of the Gods recreated from the \"Book of Salvation\"? Isolated from the outside world, no daylight, no food...",
    ["这就是为什么我们叫“值夜者”。我们在黑夜里守护，也在黑暗中前行。"] = "This is why we are called 'Nighthawks'. We guard in the night and walk forward in the darkness.",
    ["这就是为什么我变成了流浪者，记者先生。"] = "That is why I became a wanderer, Mr. Reporter.",
    ["这就是他们虚伪的仁慈！"] = "This is their hypocritical kindness!",
    ["这就是你介绍的饭票！主人是个吃人血肉的怪物！"] = "This is the meal ticket you introduced! The master is a monster that eats human flesh and blood!",
    ["这就是你们最新潮的衣服？别戏弄我了，拜托。"] = "Is this your trendiest clothing? Stop teasing me, please.",
    ["这就是你刚才的推测？倒很敏锐，我猜弗莱队长也这样想的。"] = "Is that your speculation just now? Very sharp. I guess Captain Frye thinks the same way.",
    ["这就是你的极限了？"] = "Is this your limit?",
    ["这就是你的精彩表演？"] = "Is this your brilliant performance?",
    ["这就是你说的最佳取景点？"] = "Is this what you call the best spot for photos?",
    ["这就是光吗？"] = "Is this light?",
    ["这就是命运戏弄我的时刻了，但我的爱依旧真挚。"] = "This is the moment when fate mocks me, but my love remains sincere.",
    ["这就是墓园了，这是谁的棺材？"] = "This is the cemetery. Whose coffin is this?",
    ["这就是失控么……嘿嘿……"] = "Is this what losing control is... hehe...",
    ["这就是奥莉薇。"] = "This is Olivia.",
    ["这就是好日子？"] = "Is this what you call a good life?",
    ["这就是子爵夫人……她的身心已经完全被原始月亮侵蚀了。"] = "This is the Viscountess... her body and mind have been completely eroded by the Primordial Moon.",
    ["这就是宫殿！你懂吧？很华丽很大的那种。"] = "This is the palace! You know? The really magnificent and huge kind.",
    ["这就是常说的经济不景气吧！"] = "This is what is often called an economic downturn, right!",
    ["这就是库克现买的章鱼？还剩了一只？"] = "Is this the octopus Cook just bought? One left?",
    ["这就是廷根当地的美食吗？"] = "Is this the local delicacy of Tingen?",
    ["这就是心理医生的感受吗？我很喜欢。"] = "Is this what it feels like to be a psychiatrist? I like it very much.",
    ["这就是我们想要的收获，毕竟……那本笔记很重要。"] = "This is the harvest we want. After all... that notebook is very important.",
    ["这就是我们的宿命，这就是神的旨意……"] = "This is our fate; this is the will of God...",
    ["这就是我对你热烈的爱，请出来见一见我吧！"] = "This is my passionate love for you, please come out and meet me!",
    ["这就是我找你的原因，我听说你们处理过更棘手的事，你可以把这当作一种认可。"] = "That's why I came to you. I've heard you've handled trickier matters. You can take this as a form of recognition.",
    ["这就是我施展的奇迹。你想让我起死回生，报幕员便把我完好地还给了你。"] = "This is the miracle I performed. You wanted me to bring someone back from the dead, and the announcer returned me to you, safe and sound.",
    ["这就是我的活儿。有人闹事就拖出去，有人喝醉了就盯着，有人想上二楼……得确认他付得起那个价。"] = "That's my job. If someone causes trouble, I drag them out; if someone gets drunk, I keep an eye on them; if someone wants to go to the second floor... I have to confirm they can afford the price.",
    ["这就是房间内残留的瑞尔·比伯模样。赞美女神。"] = "This is the appearance of Ray Bieber remaining in the room. Praise the Goddess.",
    ["这就是旅行尖碑？怎么开启呢？"] = "So this is the Travel Stele? How do you activate it?",
    ["这就是炼钢工厂？"] = "Is this the steel factory?",
    ["这就是爱情……"] = "This is love...",
    ["这就是现实。而且，真正的穷人，从来不会出现在济贫院里。"] = "This is reality. Besides, the truly poor never appear in the poorhouse.",
    ["这就是白银之城，这就是我所知道的和经历的。"] = "This is the City of Silver, and this is what I know and have experienced.",
    ["这就是矛盾所在！壁画里显示这个国度的人民有关于死亡的风俗，却完全不涉及下葬的部分，就好像这里的居民不需要安葬，也不会死亡！"] = "That is the contradiction! The murals show that the people of this kingdom had customs regarding death, but they don't involve burial at all, as if the residents here didn't need to be buried and wouldn't die!",
    ["这就是答案。"] = "This is the answer.",
    ["这就是结局了吗……"] = "Is this the end...",
    ["这就是罗塞尔大帝未完成的伟大构想——斯蒂姆宫么。"] = "Is this the unfinished great concept of Emperor Roselle—the Steam Palace?",
    ["这就是要维持屈伸臂的原因，如果没有及时发现异常，你刚才就会被封印物2-049同化。"] = "This is the reason why we need to maintain the distance. If we hadn't discovered the abnormality in time, you would have been assimilated by Sealed Artifact 2-049 just now.",
    ["这就是谋杀！"] = "This is murder!",
    ["这就是贝克兰德的老爷——穿着最贵的衣服，晕最狠的船。"] = "This is a lord from Backlund—wearing the most expensive clothes, suffering from the worst seasickness.",
    ["这就是超自然的力量？我调查这么多年，终于……"] = "Is this supernatural power? After investigating for so many years, finally...",
    ["这就是邓恩队长的非凡能力吗，带敌人入梦？甚至捏造一个上次那样奇异的梦境……"] = "Is this Captain Dunn's extraordinary ability, bringing enemies into a dream? Even fabricating a strange dream like the last one...",
    ["这就是那份报告，有黛西小姐的<P_Yellow>住址</>，你看看。"] = "This is the report, it has Miss Daisy's <P_Yellow>address</>, take a look.",
    ["这就是那只古怪的笛子？必须赶紧控制住它。"] = "Is this that strange flute? We need to contain it quickly.",
    ["这就是青春啊……"] = "This is youth...",
    ["这就是飞艇……真是个神奇的时代"] = "This is an airship... what a magical era.",
    ["这就是马西莫写的文章？居然占了《廷根市老实人报》一整个版面！"] = "Is this the article Massimo wrote? It actually took up a whole page of the 'Tingen Honest Man'!",
    ["这就是，\r\n你的答案么？"] = "Is this,\nyour answer?",
    ["这就是，我们牺牲一切、坚持至今的意义。"] = "This is the meaning of everything we sacrificed and persisted for until now.",
    ["这就晕了？调查才开始，线索很少，你得学会分析，合理推测。"] = "Dizzy already? The investigation has only just begun, clues are scarce, you must learn to analyze and make reasonable deductions.",
    ["这就算是对外大使送给流浪王国的第一份礼物吧。"] = "This can be the first gift from the Ambassador of Foreign Affairs to the Wandering Kingdom.",
    ["这就被吓到了？你胆子也太小了吧！"] = "You were scared by that? You're too timid!",
    ["这届投影不行"] = "This projection is no good",
    ["这属于职业尊严问题，如果每次卡住都需要别人帮忙拽出来，我怎么还能够在海报上印 “勇敢者罗尔”！"] = "This is a matter of professional dignity. If I need someone to pull me out every time I get stuck, how can I still print 'The Brave Rollo' on the posters!",
    ["这工厂主，真敢拿工人的命赌啊……"] = "This factory owner, he really dares to gamble with the workers' lives...",
    ["这已经持续了至少十年了，阁下，一到阴雨天，我的膝盖就疼痛无比，而廷根的阴雨天占了大多数！"] = "This has been going on for at least ten years, sir. Every time it's a cloudy or rainy day, my knees ache terribly, and Tingen is cloudy and rainy most of the time!",
    ["这已经是我们最近住过环境最好的地方了，为此外交大臣和帽子帮谈判了很久。"] = "This is already the best environment we've lived in recently. For this, the Minister of Foreign Affairs negotiated with the Hat Gang for a long time.",
    ["这已经是最好的情况。"] = "This is already the best-case scenario.",
    ["这已经是码头区这个月内第五起工人跳河自杀的案件了。"] = "This is already the fifth case of a worker jumping into the river to commit suicide in the Dock area this month.",
    ["这帮家伙……还没受够教训？"] = "These guys... haven't they learned their lesson yet?",
    ["这帮穷学生一杯咖啡就能坐一天，我都快破产了！"] = "These poor students sit here all day over a single cup of coffee. I'm going bankrupt!",
    ["这帮穷学生一杯咖啡就能坐一天，我都快破产了！只能自己当服务员了……"] = "These poor students can sit for a whole day with just one cup of coffee, I'm almost bankrupt! I have to be the waiter myself...",
    ["这幅画……？"] = "This painting...?",
    ["这幅画的……光影，真是令人着迷。"] = "The... light and shadow of this painting is truly fascinating.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位……一只神色温和的金毛大狗。"] = "This portrait depicts a... a golden retriever with a gentle expression.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位不擅诗句的诗人。"] = "This portrait is of a poet who is not good at poetry.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位不曾背叛的心向光明之人。"] = "This portrait depicts a person who never betrayed and looked toward the light.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位坦诚而坚定的逐光者。"] = "This portrait depicts a frank and firm Light Chaser.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位总与死亡打交道的通灵者。"] = "This portrait depicts a Spirit Medium who always deals with death.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位恪守信条的老者。"] = "This portrait depicts an old man who strictly adheres to his creed.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位正在犯拖延症的作家。"] = "This portrait depicts a writer currently suffering from procrastination.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位正在犯拖延症的的作家。"] = "This portrait depicts a writer suffering from procrastination.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位永恒守望着的首席。"] = "This portrait depicts a Chief who watches eternally.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位沉静微笑的贵族少女。"] = "This portrait depicts a noble young lady with a serene smile.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位灰眸深邃的守护者。"] = "This portrait depicts a Guardian with deep gray eyes.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位热爱蘑菇的生物狂徒。"] = "This portrait depicts a biology fanatic who loves mushrooms.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位直面风暴的船长。"] = "This portrait depicts a captain facing the storm.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位精通机械技术的少女。"] = "This portrait depicts a young girl proficient in mechanical technology.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位苍白而沉默的值夜者。"] = "This portrait depicts a pale and silent Nighthawk.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位苍白而沉默的收尸人。"] = "This portrait depicts a pale and silent Corpse Collector.",
    ["这幅肖像画的是一位贝克兰德的聪慧上班族。"] = "This portrait depicts a clever office worker from Backlund.",
    ["这年头为了卖报也真是啥话都敢说，标题越来越离奇了。"] = "People really dare to say anything to sell newspapers these days; the headlines are getting more and more bizarre.",
    ["这年头金融官司可不好打！"] = "Financial lawsuits are hard to win these days!",
    ["这并非一起普通的案件，你是唯一的线索，关系着那本<P_Yellow>安提哥努斯家族笔记</>的下落。"] = "This is not an ordinary case. You are the only clue, and it concerns the whereabouts of that <P_Yellow>Antigonus Notebook</>.",
    ["这并非不可能。但作为医生，我从没有在判断生死上犯过错。"] = "That is not impossible. But as a doctor, I have never made a mistake in judging life and death.",
    ["这应该就是卡门的身体了……卡门，你自己出得去吗？"] = "This should be Carmen's body... Carmen, can you get out yourself?",
    ["这应该是她给我们留下的线索，她遇到麻烦了。"] = "This must be a clue she left for us; she's in trouble.",
    ["这应该是整套装置的控制台。"] = "This should be the control console for the entire device.",
    ["这应该是这位商人的梦境……哇怎么这么多行李箱。看来要找出真正属于他的箱子。"] = "This should be this merchant's dream... wow, why are there so many suitcases? Looks like I need to find the one that truly belongs to him.",
    ["这应该是这位园丁的梦境……好像出现了枯萎的植物。看来要让这些植物恢复生长。"] = "This must be the gardener's dream... withered plants seem to have appeared. It looks like I need to make these plants grow again.",
    ["这座城堡里曾经有一位夫人，终日望向城堡之外。"] = "There was once a lady in this castle who looked outside the castle all day long.",
    ["这座城市被流向东南入海口的塔索克河斜着分成了两个部分，由贝克兰德桥和渡船连接，拥有超过五百万的人口，是南北大陆最繁华的都市。"] = "This city is divided into two parts by the Tasso River, which flows into the estuary in the southeast, connected by the Backlund Bridge and ferries. It has a population of over five million and is the most prosperous metropolis in the Northern and Southern Continents.",
    ["这座小镇真是美极了，你不觉得吗？"] = "This small town is truly beautiful, don't you think?",
    ["这座山还有北坡没有普查。北坡的土壤成分和这边不一样，可能会有新种。"] = "The north slope of this mountain hasn't been surveyed yet. The soil composition on the north slope is different from here, there might be new species.",
    ["这座庄园曾是我家族的荣耀所在，纵使如今已被岁月洗礼，依旧充满了迷人的魅力。若不是我的儿子欠下巨额赌债又重病缠身，我也不会以低价出售庄园。"] = "This manor was once the glory of my family. Even though it has been washed by time, it is still full of charming appeal. If it weren't for my son owing a huge gambling debt and being seriously ill, I wouldn't have sold the manor at a low price.",
    ["这座教堂有着浓厚的黑夜女神教会风格，整体呈黑色，高高的钟塔和尖顶窗，巨大的扶壁，都是它的特色。"] = "This cathedral has a strong style of the Evernight Goddess Church; it is overall black, with high bell towers, pointed windows, and huge buttresses, all of which are its characteristics.",
    ["这座机械小屋，现在或许真的和它的前主人共用着相同的心跳吧。"] = "This Mechanical Hut might truly share the same heartbeat as its former master now.",
    ["这座机械屋本身"] = "This mechanical house itself",
    ["这座机械屋本身……"] = "This mechanical house itself...",
    ["这座机械屋本身？！"] = "This mechanical house itself?!",
    ["这座雕像刻的是一位尚在途中的旅行家。"] = "This statue depicts a traveler who is still on the way.",
    ["这建议太奢侈了。"] = "That suggestion is too extravagant.",
    ["这张地图上说的是......村庄外可以看到悬崖上孤零零的净化之地，而村庄的尽头又是归一之庭，某种最终的答案。这守序村内则是闲人勿进，武器也不可拿入......还画了村民们自己，他们在此长眠。"] = "This map says... outside the village, you can see the lonely Land of Purification on the cliff, and the end of the village is the Court of Unity, some kind of final answer. This Orderly Village is off-limits to idlers, and weapons cannot be brought in... It also depicts the villagers themselves; they sleep here forever.",
    ["这张地图上说的是......穿过荆棘之地，再来到无尽长廊，下方偶尔有积雨形成池塘，而上方的断路的尽头，就是混乱之地的封存圣地。"] = "This map says... pass through the Land of Thorns, then come to the Endless Corridor, where ponds are occasionally formed by accumulated rain below, and at the end of the broken road above is the sealed holy land of the Land of Chaos.",
    ["这张愚者牌，是我给你的馈赠。我将用它进行一次尝试——"] = "This Fool card is a gift from me to you. I will use it to make an attempt—",
    ["这张牌的意思是……终结，失败，最坏的结局。"] = "The meaning of this card is... finish, failure, the worst possible ending.",
    ["这张牌的意思是……贫困还会持续，处境艰难，需要很长的时间才能改善。"] = "The meaning of this card is... poverty will continue, the situation is difficult, and it will take a long time to improve.",
    ["这张突然出现的扑克牌封住了路……刚刚伊琳就是从这里消失的，她去了哪里？"] = "This playing card that appeared out of nowhere is blocking the path... Irene disappeared from here just now. Where did she go?",
    ["这张纸……好像是从上面飘下来的？"] = "This piece of paper... seems to have drifted down from above?",
    ["这张邮票有纪念意义，7便士，谢谢您再次惠顾。"] = "This stamp has commemorative significance, 7 pence. Thank you for your patronage again.",
    ["这当然也是我想要从政的重要原因之一，这时代变化很快，有人能跟上，有人也许会掉队。"] = "This is of course one of the important reasons why I want to enter politics. This era is changing fast, some people can keep up, some people might fall behind.",
    ["这很不幸"] = "That's unfortunate",
    ["这很伤人"] = "This is hurtful",
    ["这很危险"] = "This is dangerous",
    ["这很有帮助，谢谢队长的关心。"] = "This is very helpful, thank you for your concern, Captain.",
    ["这很符合我推测的发展，也符合类似事件的隐藏逻辑，但我也不知道你是怎么活下来的。"] = "This fits the development I inferred, and it also fits the hidden logic of similar events, but I don't know how you survived either.",
    ["这很让你意外吗？"] = "Does that surprise you?",
    ["这得感谢《谷物法案》的废除，感谢那些游行的人。"] = "You have the repeal of the Corn Laws to thank for that, and those who marched.",
    ["这必须尽快处理，你回基地包扎一下吧。"] = "This needs to be treated as soon as possible. Go back to the base and get it bandaged.",
    ["这快赶上一整袋面粉的价钱了吧？"] = "Isn't that almost the price of a whole bag of flour?",
    ["这怎么能一样……不过，知道连她都会收到退稿信，不知怎么的，反而觉得她更厉害了。"] = "How can that be the same... but knowing that even she receives rejection letters, for some reason, I feel she's even more impressive.",
    ["这怎么能一样……不过，知道连她都会收到退稿信，不知怎么的，反而觉得她更厉害了。 "] = "How can that be the same... but, knowing that even she receives rejection letters, for some reason, I feel she is even more amazing.",
    ["这怪不了别人，库尔斯完全是被自己的好奇心害死的。"] = "This is no one else's fault; Cours was killed entirely by his own curiosity.",
    ["这怪物居然还有同伙？真是麻烦。"] = "This monster actually has accomplices? What a nuisance.",
    ["这总让我想起莫雷蒂一家——那是我当年的邻居，那家的大哥参加了当年的第一届政府雇员考试，如今，他们已经搬到贝克兰德去了。"] = "This always reminds me of the Moretti family—they were my neighbors back then. The eldest son of that family took the first government employee exam that year, and now, they have moved to Backlund.",
    ["这恐怕不行，我上次一出门就把楼下的威廉先生吓晕了，差点被警察抓走。"] = "I'm afraid that won't work. The last time I went out, I scared Mr. William downstairs until he fainted, and I was almost caught by the police.",
    ["这意味着强大和……混乱。"] = "This means power and... chaos.",
    ["这或许是主动进入“镜中国度”的方式。我们都记住这句咒语，或许有用。"] = "This might be the way to actively enter the \"Mirror Realm.\" We should all remember this incantation, it might be useful.",
    ["这扇门……挺丑的，我没什么印象。"] = "This door... it's quite ugly, I don't have any impression of it.",
    ["这才哪到哪，等着瞧吧，接下来的剧情会更加劲爆！"] = "This is just the beginning, just wait and see, the following plot will be even more explosive!",
    ["这才对嘛！咱们一起加油，今天绝不迟到……明天！"] = "That's more like it! Let's work hard together, definitely not late today... tomorrow!",
    ["这才是学徒的本质"] = "This is the essence of an Apprentice",
    ["这才是我们需要的人！"] = "This is the person we need!",
    ["这才是真正的封印物“破晓号”。"] = "This is the real Sealed Artifact 'Dawn'.",
    ["这才是，玫瑰真正的女王。"] = "This is the true Queen of Roses.",
    ["这才有了现在的我，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "That is how I became who I am today, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["这批甜冰茶最近出乎意料地畅销呢……"] = "This batch of sweet iced tea has been unexpectedly popular lately...",
    ["这批缎布……放哪来着？"] = "This batch of satin... where did I put it?",
    ["这批货里的猎魔子弹有两箱……"] = "There are two boxes of Demon Hunter Bullet in this shipment...",
    ["这把剑里浓缩了一位骑士的一生。"] = "This sword encapsulates the life of a knight.",
    ["这把剪刀我用了十年了，非常好用，现在送给您。"] = "I've used these scissors for ten years; they work perfectly. I'll give them to you now.",
    ["这把我要了。"] = "I'll take this.",
    ["这把枪我已经改装过了，能对那帮复制体造成真实伤害。"] = "I've already modified this gun; it can deal real damage to those replicas.",
    ["这把武器，我曾在梦里见过。"] = "I have seen this weapon in my dreams.",
    ["这把稳了……"] = "This round is stable...",
    ["这招好。打不过就遛，遛到对方没力气，你就赢了。"] = "This move is good. If you can't beat them, wear them out; once they're exhausted, you win.",
    ["这新进的六臂纺织机吃线轴的速度，简直比蛇吞鸡蛋还快。"] = "The speed at which this new six-armed loom eats thread spools is faster than a snake swallowing an egg.",
    ["这既是对非凡能力的考察，也是对智慧和勇气的检验。"] = "This is both an examination of Beyonder abilities and a test of wisdom and courage.",
    ["这日子真是没法过了……听说附近有个草药店，要不要去看看？"] = "This life is truly unbearable... I heard there's a herb shop nearby, should we go take a look?",
    ["这时候如果被安提科勋爵知道白莉夫人和侠盗黑皇帝一起离开，一定会反咬一口，说白莉夫人背叛了婚姻，最后财产一定会被他全部拿走。"] = "If Lord Antigonus finds out that Lady Baily left with the Phantom Thief Black Emperor at this time, he will definitely bite back, claiming Lady Baily betrayed their marriage, and in the end, he will surely take all the property.",
    ["这时候，您还有心情开玩笑……您来雪山，到底是要做什么？"] = "At a time like this, you're still in the mood to joke... what exactly are you doing coming to the Snowy Mountain?",
    ["这时，从雾里传来了隐隐约约的歌声——是之前听唱诗班唱过的、黑夜女神的颂歌。"] = "At this moment, a faint singing voice drifts from the fog—it is the hymn to the Evernight Goddess that he heard the choir sing before.",
    ["这明明需要精准的控制。"] = "This clearly requires precise control.",
    ["这星期……三趟去火车站，两趟去纺织厂……"] = "This week... three trips to the Train Station, two trips to the textile factory...",
    ["这是 没有变化的"] = "This is unchanged",
    ["这是-100；0"] = "This is -100;0",
    ["这是0;-100； 仅使用WASD完成引导"] = "This is 0;-100; Use only WASD to complete the guide",
    ["这是0;100"] = "This is 0;100",
    ["这是0；0"] = "This is 0;0",
    ["这是100；0"] = "This is 100;0",
    ["这是<P_Yellow>罗塞尔·古斯塔夫</>的日记。"] = "This is the diary of <P_Yellow>Roselle Gustav</>.",
    ["这是——凯瑟琳的女儿。"] = "This is—Catherine's daughter.",
    ["这是——神明的奇迹。"] = "This is—a miracle of a god.",
    ["这是——！"] = "This is—!",
    ["这是“2-327”的资料。"] = "This is the information on '2-327'.",
    ["这是“学徒”途径序列序列8的魔药配方，我想到了……"] = "This is the potion formula for Sequence 8 of the Apprentice pathway, I remember now...",
    ["这是“愚者”先生对你的启示，你从梦里苏醒，代表末日有了新的希望。"] = "This is Mr. Fool's revelation to you. Your awakening from the dream represents a new hope for the apocalypse.",
    ["这是“愚者”先生曾经给予的神启——"] = "This is the divine revelation once given by Mr. Fool—",
    ["这是“绝望魔镜”的线索。"] = "This is a clue regarding the \"Magic Mirror of Despair.\"",
    ["这是……"] = "This is...",
    ["这是……一个铁制卷烟盒？"] = "Is this... an iron cigarette case?",
    ["这是……一块香帕？"] = "This is... a scented handkerchief?",
    ["这是……一盒火柴？不，有些不对劲。"] = "Is this... a box of matches? No, something is wrong.",
    ["这是……什么？"] = "What... is this?",
    ["这是……仪式残留的痕迹？看起来还没完全消散。"] = "Is this... traces left by the ritual? It doesn't seem to have completely dissipated yet.",
    ["这是……刚刚找到的钱夹的主人？"] = "Is this... the owner of the wallet I just found?",
    ["这是……变成封印物本体的样子了？看来卡萝队长的状态并不稳定。"] = "Is this... what it looks like after turning into the main body of a Sealed Artifact? It seems Captain Carol's state is not stable.",
    ["这是……哪里……"] = "Where... is this...",
    ["这是……我写给小巴特的曲子。"] = "This is... the song I wrote for little Bart.",
    ["这是……推荐书目？我看看有啥。"] = "This is... a recommended reading list? Let me see what's on it.",
    ["这是……有种特殊的感觉。"] = "This is... I have a special feeling about it.",
    ["这是……活祭？"] = "This is... human sacrifice?",
    ["这是……狼鱼罐头的味道！谁在吃这个？ 不知道今天码头有格尔曼主题活动吗，扰乱秩序！"] = "This is... the smell of wolf fish canned food! Who is eating this? Don't they know there's a Gehrman-themed event at the dock today? Disturbing the order!",
    ["这是……秘偶残留的记忆碎片？调查一下，或许有用。"] = "Is this... a memory fragment left by the marionette? Investigate it; it might be useful.",
    ["这是……血？！"] = "Is this... blood?!",
    ["这是……该死！"] = "This is... Damn it!",
    ["这是……贝茨太太？"] = "Is this... Mrs. Bates?",
    ["这是……辉光之纱？即便是最出名的设计师也没法发挥出它真正的价值，不如向“愚者”先生祈求帮助吧。"] = "This is... Glow Silk? Even the most famous designers cannot bring out its true value. It would be better to pray to Mr. Fool for help.",
    ["这是……辉光之纱？即便是最出名的设计师也没法发挥出它真正的价值，不如向愚者先生祈求帮助吧。"] = "This is... the Veil of Radiance? Even the most famous designers cannot bring out its true value. It would be better to pray to Mr. Fool for help.",
    ["这是……隐约能感觉到某种秩序。"] = "This is... I can vaguely feel a sense of order.",
    ["这是……项链？上面还有张旧相片。"] = "Is this... a necklace? There's an old photo on it too.",
    ["这是……魔女？不对，那些冰晶蜘蛛腿……她已经被母神彻底污染了！"] = "Is this... a Witch? No, those ice crystal spider legs... She has been completely corrupted by the Mother Goddess!",
    ["这是……魔药配方……那些怪物析出的？"] = "This is... a potion formula... precipitated by those monsters?",
    ["这是、这是我做给你的礼物，我本来打算给你一个惊喜的。"] = "This, this is a gift I made for you. I originally intended to give you a surprise.",
    ["这是一个临时道具。"] = "This is a temporary item.",
    ["这是一个创新点……我得抓紧科研，搞清楚这里的作物为什么长得这么快。"] = "This is an innovation point... I have to hurry up with the research and figure out why the crops here grow so fast.",
    ["这是一个妈妈对孩子的承诺。"] = "This is a mother's promise to her child.",
    ["这是一个学校？"] = "Is this a school?",
    ["这是一个怪物，让她真正安息吧。"] = "This is a monster. Let her truly rest in peace.",
    ["这是一个笑话？"] = "Is this a joke?",
    ["这是一个连环杀手，从议院治安队跑出来的，手上有十多起命案了。"] = "This is a serial killer who escaped from the Parliament Security Force. He has over a dozen murder cases on his hands.",
    ["这是一个邀请，你是历史系的学生，又足够幸运和聪明，我们确实需要你这样的人才。"] = "This is an invitation. You are a student of the History Department, and you are lucky and smart enough. We do need talent like you.",
    ["这是一件非常幸运的事，那个小丑出现了致命的判断失误。"] = "It was a very lucky thing; that Clown made a fatal misjudgment.",
    ["这是一众神灵行走世间的纪元，直到现在也有很多人热衷于挖掘第四纪元的历史……"] = "This is an era where many gods walk the world. Even now, many people are keen on excavating the history of the Fourth Epoch...",
    ["这是一场属于勇者的风暴追逐，以最快的速度冲过终点，就像一道席卷而过的风暴。"] = "This is a Storm Chasing challenge for the brave. Cross the finish line at top speed, like a storm sweeping through.",
    ["这是一块#CanMove巨大的#石头"] = "This is a #CanMove huge # stone",
    ["这是一块#Space5#石头"] = "This is a #Space5# stone",
    ["这是一块巨大的石头"] = "This is a huge stone",
    ["这是一座古典的木偶剧院，氛围诡异、阴森。该剧院拥有连通秘偶小镇的能力，它会不定期选取秘偶作为剧院的演员登场，而你拥有进入其中挑选属于自己秘偶的权利。"] = "This is a classical puppet theater with a strange and eerie atmosphere. The theater has the ability to connect to the Marionette Town. It will irregularly select marionettes to perform as actors in the theater, and you have the right to enter and choose your own marionette.",
    ["这是一座能……唔……撼动月亮的杰作！"] = "This is a masterpiece that can... ugh... shake the moon!",
    ["这是一张写满了姓名、联系方式的清单……等等，这一行是……非凡特性？"] = "This is a list filled with names and contact information... Wait, is this line... Beyonder characteristic?",
    ["这是一张照片，被死死攥在那个怪物的手心里。"] = "This is a photo, clutched tightly in the monster's hand.",
    ["这是一张纸片，看起来是日记的一部分。"] = "This is a piece of paper, it looks like part of a diary.",
    ["这是一本介绍女巫与黑魔法的书籍，不过这本书的上一位主人按照它调配魔法药剂，据说差点毁了一座村庄的平静生活。"] = "This is a book introducing witches and black magic. However, the previous owner of this book prepared magic potions according to it, and it is said that he almost destroyed the peaceful life of a village.",
    ["这是一条——从人到神的晋升之路 所以也叫“神之途径”"] = "This is a path—a path of advancement from human to god, so it is also called the 'God's Pathway'.",
    ["这是一条测试用的技能描述专有名词超链接"] = "This is a test hyperlink for skill description terminology.",
    ["这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本"] = "This is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text\nThis is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text\nThis is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text\nThis is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text",
    ["这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本,这是书的最后一页"] = "This is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text, this is the last page of the book.",
    ["这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本。这是书的第2页。\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本。这是书的第2页。\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本。这是书的第2页。\n这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本。这是书的第2页。"] = "This is a body of text for a book used only for testing purposes; please configure new text. This is page 2 of the book.\nThis is a body of text for a book used only for testing purposes; please configure new text. This is page 2 of the book.\nThis is a body of text for a book used only for testing purposes; please configure new text. This is page 2 of the book.\nThis is a body of text for a book used only for testing purposes; please configure new text. This is page 2 of the book.",
    ["这是一段仅用于测试的书籍正文，请配置新的文本。这是书的第一页"] = "This is a passage of book text used only for testing; please configure new text. This is the first page of the book.",
    ["这是一段令人振奋的旋律。"] = "This is an uplifting melody.",
    ["这是一段屏障前的战斗"] = "This is a battle before the barrier.",
    ["这是一段待包装的描述，你可以先脑补一些很酷的文字，对，就是那样"] = "This is a description waiting to be packaged. You can imagine some cool text first—yes, just like that.",
    ["这是一片落后的大陆，人们信奉着死神，最寻常的交通工具不是马车，是棺。"] = "This is a backward continent. People believe in the God of Death. The most common means of transportation is not a carriage, but a coffin.",
    ["这是一瓶特制的药剂，我需要你在赛前把它混进棕熊的酒里，毕竟他也很需要休息了。"] = "This is a special potion. I need you to mix it into the Brown Bear's drink before the match. After all, he really needs a rest.",
    ["这是一种敬畏"] = "This is a kind of awe",
    ["这是一种绝对安全的仪式，即使失败也不会有任何人受伤，但我们的教授和警察先生不这么认为。"] = "This is an absolutely safe ritual. Even if it fails, no one will be hurt, but our professor and the police officers don't think so.",
    ["这是一起恶性模仿案件，造成了恶劣的影响。我们已将涉案人员缉拿归案，并通知餐厅经理道格拉斯返回廷根接受审查，请市民减少恐慌……"] = "This is a malicious imitation case that has caused a bad impact. We have brought the involved personnel to justice and notified the restaurant manager, Douglas, to return to Tingen for investigation. Please ask citizens to reduce panic...",
    ["这是一面#CanMove长草的#墙"] = "This is a #CanMove grass-covered # wall",
    ["这是一首送战士出征的歌，战神信仰感染着这里的一切。"] = "This is a song for warriors going to war. The faith in the God of Combat infects everything here.",
    ["这是上次做木雕剩下的木块？钢琴也是木头做的……"] = "Is this a block of wood left over from the last wood carving? Pianos are made of wood too...",
    ["这是下葬的费用。案件结束后，就安排劳维斯太太下葬吧。"] = "This is the money for the burial. Once the case is closed, please arrange for Mrs. Lauwis's funeral.",
    ["这是不是你临时想出来的借口？如果你是因为这种原因而不消散，那么请安息吧，卡萝队长。"] = "Is this an excuse you came up with on the spot? If this is the reason you haven't dissipated, then please rest in peace, Captain Cara.",
    ["这是专业判断。"] = "This is professional judgment.",
    ["这是两码事……"] = "That's two different things...",
    ["这是个……人偶？是你自己做的吗？"] = "Is this a... doll? Did you make it yourself?",
    ["这是个令人心动的邀请。"] = "This is a tempting invitation.",
    ["这是个很长的故事，我会慢慢讲给你听的……"] = "This is a very long story, I will tell it to you slowly...",
    ["这是个怀旧的选择。橙皮和肉桂的香气会让您放松下来。"] = "This is a nostalgic choice. The aroma of orange peel and cinnamon will help you relax.",
    ["这是个惬意的地方，不过我当时的邻居们大多都搬走了，很遗憾……"] = "This is a cozy place, but most of my neighbors back then have moved away, it's a pity...",
    ["这是个纸牌组成的……混乱马戏团？"] = "Is this a... chaotic circus made of playing cards?",
    ["这是个逃走的好机会"] = "This is a good chance to escape.",
    ["这是临时起草的交接契约，您在这里签字就好。"] = "This is a temporarily drafted handover contract; you just need to sign here.",
    ["这是为了让森林之主记得我们取走的份额，庇佑我们丰收常在。"] = "This is to let the Lord of the Forest remember the share we took, and to bless us with a constant harvest.",
    ["这是为什么？"] = "Why is that?",
    ["这是亵渎！神明向你投来注视，但祂这次放过了你。"] = "This is blasphemy! The God casts a gaze upon you, but this time, He lets you go.",
    ["这是人生的终点站，每次从这里搭车离开，总会让我有不一样的感觉。"] = "This is the final stop of life. Every time I leave from here by carriage, it always gives me a different feeling.",
    ["这是什么……"] = "What is this...",
    ["这是什么……几张散纸，用绳子捆着，字写得乱七八糟的。"] = "What is this... a few loose sheets of paper tied with string, with messy handwriting.",
    ["这是什么……好像有一股力量？"] = "What is this... it feels like there is some power here?",
    ["这是什么东西！？"] = "What is this thing!?",
    ["这是什么东西？"] = "What is this?",
    ["这是什么书……"] = "What book is this...",
    ["这是什么怪物？但他刚刚出现的时候还是个人类。他现在看起来很痛苦……"] = "What kind of monster is this? But he was still human when he first appeared. He looks like he's in a lot of pain now...",
    ["这是什么情况"] = "What is going on?",
    ["这是什么情况……"] = "What is going on here...",
    ["这是什么意思？"] = "What does that mean?",
    ["这是什么流派的诗？"] = "What school of poetry is this?",
    ["这是什么营地？ "] = "What kind of camp is this?",
    ["这是什么，小猫，摸一下。"] = "What is this, kitten? Let me pet you.",
    ["这是什么？"] = "What is this?",
    ["这是什么？一个礼物？"] = "What is this? A gift?",
    ["这是什么？一条……鱼？！"] = "What is this? A... fish?!",
    ["这是什么？摸一下"] = "What is this? Touch it",
    ["这是什么？看起来很特别，不像是外面能买到的。"] = "What is this? It looks very special, not something you can buy outside.",
    ["这是什么？神神秘秘的。"] = "What is this? So mysterious.",
    ["这是今天的报纸……时间是<P_Yellow>1354年6月28日</>。"] = "This is today's newspaper... The date is <P_Yellow>June 28, 1354</>.",
    ["这是从恩马特港暴风雨夜捕鱼的故事里汲取的灵感，据说，鱼群从暴风雨中向空中跃起，宛如要从大海涌向辽远的红月。"] = "This was inspired by the story of fishing on a stormy night at Enmat Port. It is said that the schools of fish leap from the storm into the air, as if they want to surge from the sea toward the distant red moon.",
    ["这是从我师父那里突然接手的药草店，他走得很突然，很多药方我还没学会，神奇的药方。"] = "This is an herb shop I suddenly took over from my master. He left very suddenly, and there are many prescriptions I haven't learned yet—magical prescriptions.",
    ["这是他的日记，一本他已经渐渐看不懂的发明笔记。"] = "This is his diary, an invention notebook that he can no longer understand.",
    ["这是他的替身？"] = "Is this his double?",
    ["这是代表星辉的光点。靠近时，你的直觉变得格外敏锐，仿佛黑夜本身在替你过滤一切干扰。"] = "This represents a point of starlight. When you get close, your intuition becomes exceptionally sharp, as if the night itself is filtering out all interference for you.",
    ["这是令人欣喜的进展，对吧？"] = "This is gratifying progress, right?",
    ["这是伊琳的住址，她下午应该在家里。祝你好运。"] = "This is Irene's address; she should be home this afternoon. Good luck.",
    ["这是伦纳德，自称诗人但写诗水平很烂。队长正让他仔细研读《罗塞尔诗选》，先不打扰他了。"] = "This is Leonard, who calls himself a poet but writes terrible poetry. The Captain is having him study the 'Selected Poems of Roselle' carefully, so let's not disturb him for now.",
    ["这是佛尔思女士托我给您的，它能帮助您打开前进的通路。"] = "This is what Ms. Fors entrusted me to give you; it can help you open the path forward.",
    ["这是你们的……"] = "This is your...",
    ["这是你做的？"] = "Did you make this?",
    ["这是你写的诗吗？"] = "Is this a poem you wrote?",
    ["这是你当前的段位，无论是<Highlight>休闲</>，<Highlight>副本</>或者是<Highlight>竞技</>玩家，都可以在这里查看和领取段位奖励。"] = "This is your current rank. Whether you are a <Highlight>Leisure</>, <Highlight>Dungeon</>, or <Highlight>Competition</> player, you can view and claim rank rewards here.",
    ["这是你的猫吗？真可爱。"] = "Is this your cat? How cute.",
    ["这是你的荣幸，年轻的非凡者。"] = "This is your honor, young Beyonder.",
    ["这是佩里的日记本，他是我们的小队长。如果顺利回家，他可能已经是个画家了。"] = "This is Perry's diary. He was our squad leader. If he had made it home safely, he might have been a painter by now.",
    ["这是倒下的大楼"] = "This is the collapsed building",
    ["这是值得铭记的时刻。"] = "This is a moment worth remembering.",
    ["这是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，三人中唯一的幸存者，但遗失了记忆。"] = "This is Klein Moretti, the only survivor of the three, but he has lost his memory.",
    ["这是克莱恩·莫雷蒂，我们的新人，他和安提哥努斯家族的笔记间有着奇妙的感应。"] = "This is Klein Moretti, our newcomer. He has a strange resonance with the Antigonus Family notebook.",
    ["这是六便士，我们逛一会就来拿。"] = "This is a sixpence. We'll come back to collect it after we've walked around for a bit.",
    ["这是刚刚的那盒火柴……"] = "This is the box of matches from just now...",
    ["这是刚才的一位先生遗落的。"] = "This was left behind by a gentleman earlier.",
    ["这是刚才解锁的<Orange>尖碑传送点</>，你可以通过它在各地<Orange>旅行</>。"] = "This is the <Orange>Stele Teleport Point</> you just unlocked. You can use it to <Orange>Travel</> between locations.",
    ["这是卖什么的地方？"] = "What kind of place is this?",
    ["这是占卜俱乐部，不是疯人院！"] = "This is the Divination Club, not an asylum!",
    ["这是发生的第几起案件了？"] = "How many cases has this been now?",
    ["这是受害人"] = "This is the victim.",
    ["这是受害人。"] = "This is the victim.",
    ["这是只乌龟吧？"] = "This is a turtle, right?",
    ["这是可以说的吗？老天啊，你们什么也没说！我什么也没听见！咱们赶紧结束这个话题吧……"] = "Is this something we can talk about? Oh my god, you didn't say anything! I didn't hear anything! Let's end this topic quickly...",
    ["这是可以说的吗？老天，能不能来个人让他们闭嘴？"] = "Is this something that can be said? God, can someone make them shut up?",
    ["这是否是您梦想中的庄园？花园、森林、大种植园，您想要的，应有尽有！\n\n无需高昂费用，价格已至最低！您无法在廷根找到第二家实惠房产公司，这，就是我们萨莉亚的诚意！"] = "Is this the manor of your dreams? Gardens, forests, large plantations—everything you want, we have it all!\n\nNo exorbitant fees, the price is already at its lowest! You won't find another affordable real estate company in Tingen; this is the sincerity of us at Salia!",
    ["这是听谁说的？哪有这么神奇？你被骗了！"] = "Who did you hear that from? How could it be that magical? You've been scammed!",
    ["这是命运馈赠的礼物。"] = "This is a gift bestowed by fate.",
    ["这是哪儿……"] = "Where is this...",
    ["这是哪儿……好大的雾……"] = "Where is this... so much fog...",
    ["这是哪儿？"] = "Where is this?",
    ["这是哪家做的？"] = "Which house made this?",
    ["这是哪里"] = "Where is This",
    ["这是哪里……"] = "Where is this...",
    ["这是哪里来的小可怜，瞧瞧这身搭配……"] = "Where did this poor little thing come from? Look at this outfit...",
    ["这是哪里的歌谣？"] = "Where is this ballad from?",
    ["这是哪里？"] = "Where is this?",
    ["这是哪里？你们是谁？妈妈……妈妈……"] = "Where is this? Who are you? Mom... Mom...",
    ["这是哪里？去一下"] = "Where is this? Go take a look",
    ["这是哪？"] = "Where is this?",
    ["这是唯一的机会。去吧，把他的线，一根根斩断。"] = "This is the only chance. Go, cut his lines, one by one.",
    ["这是因为你身上有来自“伟大母亲”的污染，同时还有“愚者”先生使用权柄从未来命运中“嫁接”的力量。"] = "This is because you carry corruption from the 'Mother Tree of Desire,' as well as power 'grafted' from future fate by Mr. Fool using His authority.",
    ["这是因为它作为展示品，穿在人偶身上在橱窗放置了一段时间，绝不是什么旧衣服。"] = "That's because it was a display piece, worn by a mannequin in the window for a while. It's definitely not old clothes.",
    ["这是因为魔药的力量有溢出 并且你缺乏控制的办法"] = "This is because the potion's power is overflowing, and you lack a way to control it.",
    ["这是因为魔药的力量有溢出，并且你缺乏控制的办法。"] = "This is because the power of the potion has overflowed, and you lack a way to control it.",
    ["这是因为，是因为……"] = "That is because, because...",
    ["这是在……"] = "This is...",
    ["这是在排练什么新话剧吗？"] = "Is this a rehearsal for some new play?",
    ["这是塔罗会的开始，但我们依旧需要隐于历史与众人的背后。因此——"] = "This is the beginning of the Tarot Club, but we still need to remain hidden behind history and the masses. Therefore—",
    ["这是塔罗牌的第一张，愚者牌，象征新的开始和无限可能。"] = "This is the first card of the Tarot deck, The Fool, symbolizing new beginnings and infinite possibilities.",
    ["这是大事，得让我考虑考虑……"] = "This is a big deal, let me consider it...",
    ["这是失踪者们的资料。工人们收入微薄，没有留下照片，这里只有他们的基本信息。"] = "These are the files of the missing persons. The workers have meager incomes and didn't leave photos; here is only their basic information.",
    ["这是女神的七则祷词之一——《安眠祷文》。"] = "This is one of the seven prayers of the Goddess—the 'Prayer of Slumber'.",
    ["这是她最后一张工资条，上面有她留给我和小珍妮的话，你可以打开看看——如果你想的话。"] = "This is her last pay stub, it has the words she left for me and little Jenny. You can open it and look—if you want to.",
    ["这是宁静药剂，你服下之后，只要努力听我的声音，其他的什么都不要想。"] = "This is a Tranquility Potion. After you take it, just try to listen to my voice and don't think about anything else.",
    ["这是安提哥努斯笔记……这是让我借助安提哥努斯笔记来引出密修会，获得“小丑”配方，还是说笔记本身就记载了配方？"] = "This is the Antigonus Notebook... Is this asking me to use the Antigonus Notebook to lure out the Secret Order to obtain the 'Clown' formula, or does the notebook itself contain the formula?",
    ["这是安提格努斯笔记……这是让我借助安提格努斯笔记来引出密修会，获得“小丑”配方，还是说笔记本身就记载了配方？"] = "This is the Antigonus notebook... Is this meant to guide me to use the Antigonus notebook to draw out the Secret Order and obtain the 'Clown' formula, or does the notebook itself contain the formula?",
    ["这是安曼达纯露 赫密斯语里宁静的意思"] = "This is Amantha dew, which means tranquility in Hermes.",
    ["这是安魂诗社的邀请函。"] = "This is the invitation to the Requiem Poetry Society.",
    ["这是对食物的谋杀！煮过头的卷心菜、干硬的炖莴苣、像水一样的豌豆汤…… "] = "This is murder against food! Overcooked cabbage, dry and tough stewed lettuce, pea soup that tastes like water...",
    ["这是尤朵拉的资料。"] = "This is Yodora's information.",
    ["这是崔佛警官让我交给你的封印物“共感手铐”，他说用这个就可以暂时压制住她的失控进程。"] = "This is the Sealed Artifact \"Empathy Handcuffs\" that Officer Trevor asked me to give you. He said you can use this to temporarily suppress her loss of control process.",
    ["这是巨人们的某种仪式或秘术？"] = "Is this some kind of ritual or mysticism of the giants?",
    ["这是巨人王曾经的居所。纷争之后，古神陨落，王庭被遗忘。"] = "This is the former residence of the Giant King. After the strife, the ancient gods fell, and the Royal Court was forgotten.",
    ["这是常态，每个时段我们身边都会有不同的人陪伴。"] = "This is the norm. We will have different people accompanying us at different stages.",
    ["这是序列9的魔药配方？"] = "Is this the Sequence 9 potion formula?",
    ["这是廷根地图。"] = "This is the map of Tingen.",
    ["这是当今世界所处的纪元，四国统治着北大陆。"] = "This is the epoch the world is currently in, with four countries ruling the Northern Continent.",
    ["这是当然的，不过对于工薪阶层来说，花2便士喝上一杯还是他们为数不多能够承受的起的消遣。"] = "That is of course true, but for the working class, spending 2 pence for a drink is one of the few pastimes they can afford.",
    ["这是很少见的情况，但你有天赋，又有了这份功绩。"] = "This is a rare situation, but you have talent and now this merit.",
    ["这是必要的投资。"] = "This is a necessary investment.",
    ["这是必须的程序"] = "This is a necessary procedure",
    ["这是怎么了？"] = "What happened?",
    ["这是怎么做的？丝瓜还能这么好吃！"] = "How did you make this? Loofahs can actually taste this good!",
    ["这是怎么回事，哈灵顿家族是发生了什么突然的变故吗？"] = "What's going on? Did the Harrington family suffer some sudden change?",
    ["这是您的花园吗，很漂亮。"] = "Is this your garden? It's very beautiful.",
    ["这是我今日的告解……"] = "This is my confession for today...",
    ["这是我们仅有的找到睡莲仙女的线索，说什么都不能放弃！"] = "This is our only clue to finding the Water Lily Fairy; we cannot give up no matter what!",
    ["这是我们今天的关键人物应得到的奖励。"] = "This is the reward our key figure of the day deserves.",
    ["这是我们注定的命运吗？因为我们想要挣扎，所以受到了惩罚？"] = "Is this our destined fate? Because we want to struggle, we are being punished?",
    ["这是我们的职责，请您配合。"] = "This is our duty, please cooperate.",
    ["这是我们的荣幸，“愚者”先生。"] = "It is our honor, Mr. Fool.",
    ["这是我们的荣幸，愚者先生。"] = "It is our honor, Mr. Fool.",
    ["这是我们的许愿池呀，你不知道吗？"] = "This is our wishing pool, didn't you know?",
    ["这是我们第三次约会，也是你第三次迟到。"] = "This is our third date, and it's also your third time being late.",
    ["这是我们约定好的地方。"] = "This is the place we agreed upon.",
    ["这是我吗。这真的是我吗。"] = "Is this me? Is this really me?",
    ["这是我在湖边发现的。"] = "This is what I found by the lakeside.",
    ["这是我妹妹的学费！"] = "This is my sister's tuition!",
    ["这是我带过的最差一届乐团！"] = "This is the worst band I've ever led!",
    ["这是我攒了一个星期的钱买的榛果饼干，送给你！"] = "These are hazelnut cookies I bought with money I saved for a week, here you go!",
    ["这是我攒了一辈子的积蓄，足足有<P_Yellow>三百万金镑</>……"] = "These are my life's savings, a full <P_Yellow>three million gold pounds</>...",
    ["这是我最后的办法了……即使要使用这种邪恶的力量也在所不惜。"] = "This is my last resort... I will not hesitate, even if it means using this evil power.",
    ["这是我来看你的第一千零一天，我要告诉你，莉娜！我喜欢你！"] = "This is the 1001st day I've come to see you, I want to tell you, Lena! I love you!",
    ["这是我父亲表演用的帽子。小时候，他每次出门前，都会让我和母亲轮流戴一下这顶帽子。他说，这是表演前的准备。"] = "This is the hat my father used for performances. When I was a child, before he went out, he would let my mother and me take turns wearing this hat. He said it was preparation before the performance.",
    ["这是我画的大家，我们所有人，要永远都在一起！"] = "This is a drawing I made of everyone. We must all be together forever!",
    ["这是我的回合。"] = "This is my turn.",
    ["这是我的妹妹伊琳，她是《伯爵归来》里天才机械师的原型。"] = "This is my younger sister, Irene. She is the prototype for the genius mechanic in 'The Count Returns'.",
    ["这是我的情况，先生……"] = "This is my situation, sir...",
    ["这是我的感谢，希望你未来一切顺利。"] = "This is my thanks, I hope everything goes well for you in the future.",
    ["这是我的戒指，我找了一天的戒指……在我放计划书的口袋里。"] = "This is my ring, the ring I've been looking for all day... in the pocket where I keep my plan book.",
    ["这是我的证件，我要找保罗询问失踪案信息。"] = "This is my identification, I want to ask Paul for information about the missing persons case.",
    ["这是我第一天出来叫卖，一个客人都没有。我该怎么回去跟父亲交差啊。"] = "This is my first day out hawking, and I haven't had a single customer. How am I supposed to report back to my father?",
    ["这是我第一次见到羊……没想到摸起来这么软。"] = "This is my first time seeing a sheep... I didn't expect it to feel so soft.",
    ["这是我见过最差劲的小丑……我敢打赌，他今天赚不到一个便士。"] = "This is the worst clown I've ever seen... I bet he won't earn a penny today.",
    ["这是我设计的纺织机……"] = "This is the textile machine I designed...",
    ["这是我路过餐厅，随手拿的菜单，你先看看。"] = "This is a menu I picked up when I passed by the restaurant, take a look first.",
    ["这是拥有我部分意志的“灵之虫”，我们可以通过它交谈。"] = "This is a \"Bizarro Worm\" that possesses a portion of my will; we can talk through it.",
    ["这是指引你踏入非凡途径的最后一个问题。"] = "This is the final question to guide you onto your Beyonder pathway.",
    ["这是撤退玩法，要去大剧院"] = "This is the retreat gameplay; we need to go to the Grand Theater.",
    ["这是救赎，亦是维护世界平衡…"] = "This is redemption, and also maintaining the balance of the world...",
    ["这是新白银城的特产，黑面酒，可以帮我带给首席吗？"] = "This is a specialty of New Silver City, Black-Faced Wine. Can you help me bring it to the Chief?",
    ["这是昂贵的黄金马桶，除了老爷，还有谁能用？"] = "This is an expensive Golden Toilet. Besides the master, who else could use it?",
    ["这是星空秘密"] = "This is a secret of the starry sky",
    ["这是最后一件行李了吧？"] = "Is this the last piece of luggage?",
    ["这是最后一次……"] = "This is the last time...",
    ["这是最后的了，去买些新面包吧，梅丽莎刚刚也嘱咐过。"] = "This is the last of it; go buy some fresh bread. Melissa just reminded me as well.",
    ["这是最好的时代，也是最坏的时代。"] = "It is the best of times, it is the worst of times.",
    ["这是最好的时代，这是最坏的时代。"] = "It was the best of times, it was the worst of times.",
    ["这是最新款的蒸汽警车，看看这车身线条，多流畅！起步够快，追得上码头区最滑溜的贼。"] = "This is the latest model of the steam police car. Look at these body lines, how smooth! It starts fast enough to catch the slipperiest thieves in the Dock area.",
    ["这是查尼斯门，名字来源于值夜者体系的创立者查尼斯大主教。"] = "This is the Chanis Gate, named after Archbishop Chanis, the founder of the Nighthawk system.",
    ["这是根据《伯爵归来》改编的戏剧，但罗塞尔大帝的手稿有残缺的地方，导致这里缺少一句<P_Yellow>关键台词</>，只要能把它补全，演出一定就能继续。"] = "This is a play adapted from \"The Count's Return,\" but Emperor Roselle's manuscript is incomplete, leading to a missing <P_Yellow> key line </> here. As long as it can be filled in, the performance will surely continue.",
    ["这是梅丽莎的学费，这是家里的房租，这是餐桌上的面包和肉……"] = "This is Melissa's tuition, this is the family's rent, this is the bread and meat on the table...",
    ["这是正史吗？"] = "Is this official history?",
    ["这是正式的邀请函。若你愿意加入我们，便接下这封信。"] = "This is an official invitation. If you are willing to join us, take this letter.",
    ["这是污染 我拒绝……"] = "This is corruption, I refuse...",
    ["这是洛络塔女士，序列8的掘墓人，同时也是一位神枪手。"] = "This is Ms. Lorota, a Sequence 8 Gravedigger, and also a sharpshooter.",
    ["这是源自你未来命运中的力量。"] = "This is power originating from your future fate.",
    ["这是灵之眼 通灵的好帮手 也是迷人的花精"] = "This is the Eye of Spirit, a great helper for spirit mediumship, and also a charming flower spirit.",
    ["这是灵异事件。那些东西被埋起来，还配上墓碑……像是某种预兆。"] = "This is a supernatural event. Those things being buried, accompanied by tombstones... it's like some kind of omen.",
    ["这是灵性预兆？伦纳德之前说过，你很特殊。"] = "Is this a spiritual omen? Leonard said before that you are special.",
    ["这是灵界生物的召唤契约？还是一种很古老的契约，连接着远超你我想象的强大灵界生物。"] = "Is this a summoning contract for a Spirit World creature? And it's a very ancient contract, connecting to a powerful Spirit World creature far beyond what you or I can imagine.",
    ["这是点燃永暗蜡烛的代价，点燃后，蜡烛内的死亡力量会外泄，对周围的生灵造成伤害。"] = "This is the price for lighting the Candle of Eternal Darkness. Once lit, the power of death within the candle will leak out, causing harm to the living beings nearby.",
    ["这是献给勇敢者的专属料理。请慢用！"] = "This is a dish dedicated to the brave. Please enjoy!",
    ["这是献给甜蜜伴侣的专属料理。请慢用！"] = "This is a dish dedicated to sweet companions. Please enjoy!",
    ["这是用夜香草、深眠花、洋甘菊混合蒸馏萃取的纯露，有位女士命名为“安曼达”，在赫密斯语里是宁静的意思。"] = "This is a floral water distilled from a mixture of night-scented grass, deep-sleep flowers, and chamomile. A lady named it 'Amantha', which means tranquility in Hermes.",
    ["这是礼貌"] = "This Is Politeness",
    ["这是礼貌，毕竟是科恩导师推荐的工作机会。"] = "It's only polite, after all, it was a job opportunity recommended by Mentor Cohen.",
    ["这是神弃之地最深的秘密：救赎蔷薇的诅咒隐于壁画，米尔贡根守卫着沉睡的天使之王。击败王座上的暗天使萨斯利尔吧，你将见证白银城走出千年诅咒，迎接光明未来。"] = "This is the deepest secret of the Forsaken Land of the Gods: the curse of the Rose of Redemption is hidden in the murals, and Milgongen guards the sleeping King of Angels. Defeat the Dark Angel Sasrir on the throne, and you will witness the City of Silver emerging from a thousand-year curse to embrace a bright future.",
    ["这是种......很特别的疗法，似乎有效，只是需要一点点勇气。"] = "This is a... very special therapy. It seems effective, it just requires a little bit of courage.",
    ["这是种……很特别的疗法，似乎有效，只是需要一点点勇气。"] = "This is a... very special therapy. It seems effective, it just requires a little bit of courage.",
    ["这是秘制的丝瓜汤，不仅鲜美，还能去火气，调理身体呢！"] = "This is a secret loofah soup. Not only is it delicious, but it can also reduce internal heat and regulate the body!",
    ["这是秘密。你用灵视检查时，我也用灵视看了你，非凡者！"] = "That's a secret. When you checked with spirit vision, I also looked at you with spirit vision, Beyonder!",
    ["这是穿越者罗塞尔·古斯塔夫用简体中文写成的私人日记，记录了他的心路历程、非凡见闻与历史隐秘。对克莱恩而言，它是探寻世界真相与“回家”之路的关键线索。"] = "This is a private diary written in Simplified Chinese by the transmigrator Roselle Gustav, recording his inner journey, Beyonder experiences, and historical secrets. For Klein, it is a key clue to exploring the truth of the world and the path \"home\".",
    ["这是第一句。"] = "This is the first sentence.",
    ["这是第一枚金币。中央广场的金雨，从这里开始。准备好了就去触碰它吧。"] = "This is the first gold coin. The golden rain of Central Plaza starts here. Touch it when you are ready.",
    ["这是第一枚金币。中央广场的金雨，从这里开始。准备好了就去触碰它吧。-【迎接金雨】"] = "This is the first gold coin. The golden rain of Central Plaza starts here. Touch it when you are ready. -【Welcome the Golden Rain】",
    ["这是第三句。"] = "This is the third sentence.",
    ["这是第二句。"] = "This is the second sentence.",
    ["这是第几次了，这小家伙该不会也喜欢上我了吧？"] = "How many times has this been now? Could this little one have taken a liking to me too?",
    ["这是第几次了？！上次是玫瑰，上上次是蜡烛，这次又是什么？你以为自己是罗塞尔大帝写的情诗男主角吗？！"] = "How many times is this?! Last time it was roses, the time before that it was candles, what is it this time? Do you think you're the male lead of a romance novel written by Emperor Roselle?!",
    ["这是给孩子们留下的惊喜？"] = "Is this a surprise left for the children?",
    ["这是给谁准备的礼物吗？"] = "Are these gifts prepared for someone?",
    ["这是老尼尔所在的途径，“窥秘人”了解和掌握魔法、巫术、占星术等神秘领域，擅长仪式魔法。"] = "This is the pathway Old Neil belongs to. \"Mystery Pryers\" understand and master magic, witchcraft, astrology, and other mysterious fields, and are proficient in Ritual Magic.",
    ["这是老尼尔的途径，可以更好地学习神秘学的知识。"] = "This is Old Neil's pathway, which can better learn occult knowledge.",
    ["这是老爸的，这是老妈的，这是老妹的……齐了！"] = "This is Dad's, this is Mom's, this is my little sister's... all set!",
    ["这是脚踏车钥匙。罗塞尔大帝说过，要与时代潮流一同前进！"] = "This is a bicycle key. Emperor Roselle said, one must move forward with the trends of the era!",
    ["这是自然。我希望我们以后在除了利益之外的地方，还能发展一些友谊，亨特。"] = "This is natural. I hope that in the future, besides interests, we can also develop some friendship, Hunter.",
    ["这是莎莉丝特小姐留下的信件。"] = "This is the letter Miss Celeste left behind.",
    ["这是菲利普的怀表，哈？我就知道！"] = "This is Philip's pocket watch, huh? I knew it!",
    ["这是被动技能的动态描述"] = "This is a dynamic description for passive skills.",
    ["这是被可被技能表引用的描述:*s"] = "This is a description that can be referenced by the skill table:*s",
    ["这是被封印物控制的结果吗？观察一下老管家。"] = "Is this the result of being controlled by a Sealed Artifact? I should observe the old butler.",
    ["这是西尔维娅留下的？夹了很多叶片和干花的样子。"] = "Did Sylvia leave this behind? It seems to have many leaves and dried flowers tucked inside.",
    ["这是西迦，一位作家。另一位是科恩黎，他刚订婚，未婚妻是位非常美丽的小姐，最近他在努力攒钱……"] = "This is Xiga, a writer. The other one is Kenley; he just got engaged, his fiancée is a very beautiful lady, and he's been working hard to save money recently...",
    ["这是要干什么？"] = "What is this for?",
    ["这是观众途径的非凡能力——心理学隐身。"] = "This is the Extraordinary ability of the Spectator pathway—Psychological Invisibility.",
    ["这是解谜成功了？现在，可以探索记忆的更多角落了。"] = "Did the puzzle-solving succeed? Now, I can explore more corners of the memory.",
    ["这是诬陷！你就等着我的律师来找你麻烦吧！"] = "This is a frame-up! Just wait for my lawyer to come and give you trouble!",
    ["这是误会"] = "This is a misunderstanding",
    ["这是赛拉寄来的吗？"] = "Did Serra send this?",
    ["这是身为国王应尽的责任，不能让别人代劳。"] = "This is a responsibility that should be fulfilled by the King, I can't let others do it for me.",
    ["这是还未解锁的<Orange>传送点</>，你可以<Orange>靠近</>它解锁旅行功能。"] = "This is a locked <Orange>Teleport Point</>. You can <Orange>approach</> it to unlock the travel function.",
    ["这是遇上谁了？不管了，先躲起来看看情况。"] = "Who did I run into? Never mind, I'll hide and see what's going on first.",
    ["这是那位骑士的武器？看起来已经严重破损了。"] = "Is this the knight's weapon? It looks severely damaged.",
    ["这是队里刚做好的安魂符咒。万一……你或许会需要它。"] = "This is a Soul-Soothing Amulet just made by the team. Just in case... you might need it.",
    ["这是阿诺德·比舍普，他可能被卷进了最近的儿童失踪案。"] = "This is Arnold Bishop. He might have been involved in the recent child abduction cases.",
    ["这是非凡战斗，正面起冲突的话，很难保证普通人的生存。但里面还有人质，需要我们的解救，时间太紧张了……"] = "This is a Beyonder battle. If a direct conflict breaks out, it will be hard to guarantee the safety of the ordinary people. But there are hostages inside who need our rescue, and time is running out...",
    ["这是非凡战斗，正面起冲突的话，很难保证普通人的生存。但里面还有人质，需要我们解救，时间太紧张了……"] = "This is a Beyonder battle; if we clash head-on, it's hard to guarantee the survival of ordinary people. But there are hostages inside that we need to rescue, and time is too tight...",
    ["这是非凡，亦是神性的痕迹，万物皆有神性，万物皆从最初之中诞生，祂的烙印亦在万物之间。"] = "This is the extraordinary, and also the trace of divinity. All things have divinity, all things are born from the beginning, and His brand is also among all things.",
    ["这是鲁恩什么地方的口味……"] = "What kind of Loen taste is this...",
    ["这是黑荆棘安保公司，有什么能为您服务的吗？"] = "This is Blackthorn Security Company. Is there anything I can do for you?",
    ["这是！中文！"] = "This is! Chinese!",
    ["这是，枪声？"] = "Was that... a gunshot?",
    ["这是，这是奶茶！你不是要教我配催眠药剂的吗？"] = "This is, this is milk tea! Aren't you going to teach me how to prepare a Hypnosis potion?",
    ["这是，这是奶茶！你不是要教我配睡眠药剂的吗？"] = "This, this is milk tea! Weren't you supposed to teach me how to prepare a sleep potion?",
    ["这是？"] = "What's this?",
    ["这月第三趟了吧？啧。"] = "Third time this month, right? Tsk.",
    ["这有些……"] = "This is a bit...",
    ["这有什么……"] = "What does that have to do with...",
    ["这有贝克兰德里最流行的款式！"] = "This has the most popular styles in Backlund!",
    ["这未免也太多了吧？"] = "Isn't this a bit too much?",
    ["这本书……结局好吗？"] = "This book... does it have a good ending?",
    ["这本书上有伦纳德潦草的签名，似乎被翻看了很多次，但是书页上没有任何笔墨的痕迹。\n“每当我吟诵大帝的诗歌，都会被他打动。”伦纳德吟唱般赞美着这本诗集。\n“但你每次战斗都只背那一两首。”邓恩轻嗅着烟斗说。\n“队长，真正的午夜诗人或许要去创造诗，而不是重复他人的歌。”散漫的诗人笑着摊手，“但写作这件事，真得需要天赋。”"] = "This book has Leonard's scribbled signature and seems to have been flipped through many times, but there are no ink marks on the pages. \n 'Whenever I recite the Emperor's poems, I am moved by them,' Leonard praises this poetry collection as if chanting. \n 'But you only recite those one or two poems every time you fight,' Dunn said, sniffing his pipe. \n 'Captain, a true Midnight Poet should perhaps go to create poems, not repeat others' songs,' the laid-back poet smiled and spread his hands, 'But writing really requires talent.'",
    ["这本书不对……有灵性附着在上面。"] = "This book isn't right... there is spirituality attached to it.",
    ["这本笔记怎么办？"] = "What about this notebook?",
    ["这本贝克兰德旅行手册您可以拿去看看。"] = "You can take this Backlund travel guide to read.",
    ["这束花，是你的吗？"] = "Is this bouquet yours?",
    ["这束，鸢尾花的花语是\"请原谅我\"，她收到后会明白您的心意。"] = "This bouquet, the flower language of irises is \"please forgive me.\" She will understand your feelings when she receives them.",
    ["这条街的人是穷，但了解世界的心和其他人的没有差别。"] = "The people on this street are poor, but their desire to understand the world is no different from anyone else's.",
    ["这条裙子5苏勒。"] = "This skirt is 5 shillings.",
    ["这条路上的一切，我都看得见呀，我没有摔倒过，也没有坠崖。"] = "I can see everything on this road; I have never tripped, nor have I fallen off a cliff.",
    ["这条途径你应该比较熟悉，戴莉目前就是这条途径的序列7“通灵者”。"] = "You should be relatively familiar with this pathway. Daly is currently a Sequence 7 \"Spirit Medium\" of this pathway.",
    ["这条途径听起来很实用，似乎是三条途径中对敌最强力的选择。但是它并不符合我的需求，还是从其他两条途径里选吧。"] = "This pathway sounds very practical and seems to be the most powerful choice for combat among the three. But it doesn't meet my needs, so I'll choose from the other two.",
    ["这条途径我们了解的并不多，擅长占卜、灵视以及类似的能力，并且精通神秘学知识。"] = "We don't know much about this pathway. It is good at divination, spirit vision, and similar abilities, and is proficient in occult knowledge.",
    ["这条途径的信息最少，而且教会可能没有后续的魔药配方。但它可以让我精通神秘学知识……"] = "This pathway has the least information, and the church might not have the subsequent potion formulas. But it can make me proficient in mysticism knowledge...",
    ["这杯酒里带着古老的气息，至于是什么……抱歉，我只能保密。"] = "This glass of wine carries an ancient aura. As for what it is... sorry, I have to keep it a secret.",
    ["这杯酒，看起来和你很配。"] = "This drink looks like it suits you.",
    ["这杯饮品有一股浓郁的薰衣草香气，自己品尝时，它只是一杯爽口的茶。但如果请你爱的人喝下，那个人就会永远无药可救的爱着你。"] = "This drink has a rich lavender aroma. When you taste it yourself, it's just a refreshing tea. But if you invite the person you love to drink it, that person will love you hopelessly forever.",
    ["这枚四叶草护符在每次失败中悄悄编织着成功，但内心的幽暗也被无形放大。"] = "This four-leaf clover charm quietly weaves success into every failure, but the darkness within the heart is also invisibly magnified.",
    ["这枚宝石戒指一看就是好东西！要发财了！"] = "This gemstone ring is clearly a treasure! I'm going to be rich!",
    ["这枚金币，好神奇……"] = "This gold coin is so magical...",
    ["这架木雕钢琴，我见过很多次。"] = "I have seen this wooden piano many times.",
    ["这株黄水仙和他一样，来自因蒂斯，那是一个浪漫的国度，令人向往。"] = "This yellow narcissus, like him, comes from Intis. That is a romantic country, one that is truly yearning.",
    ["这样……他们的名字就不会被忘记了。"] = "This way... their names will not be forgotten.",
    ["这样一来，“正义”和“倒吊人”无论在哪里举行仪式，我只要进入灰雾之上，就能收到信息。"] = "In this way, no matter where Justice and The Hanged Man perform their rituals, I will be able to receive their messages as long as I enter the space above the gray fog.",
    ["这样一来，丰饶的危机也解决了吧。"] = "In that case, the crisis of the Abundance has been resolved as well.",
    ["这样一来，客人们来了商业街，想买些什么都方便。"] = "This way, it's convenient for customers to buy whatever they want when they come to the commercial street.",
    ["这样下去不行"] = "This can't go on",
    ["这样也是可以的吗……"] = "Is this really okay...",
    ["这样也行？"] = "That works too?",
    ["这样他身体的某个部位有可能会富集非凡，成为较高品质的材料。"] = "This way, a certain part of his body might have concentrated Beyonder characteristics, becoming a higher-quality material.",
    ["这样厉害的武器，我们还有很多！诚挚为您介绍……"] = "We have many more weapons as powerful as this! Allow me to sincerely introduce...",
    ["这样只顾睡觉不干活，万一被领导发现怎么办！"] = "If you just sleep and don't work, what will you do if your boss finds out!",
    ["这样吗？"] = "Like this?",
    ["这样吗？那正好，他们一定猜不到我们有火枪这种东西，正好方便我们行动。"] = "Is that so? That's perfect. They definitely won't guess that we have something like a musket, which will make our operation easier.",
    ["这样吧，我可以去试试！我、我算是见习小丑。"] = "How about this, I can try! I... I'm a trainee Clown.",
    ["这样啊……"] = "Is that so...",
    ["这样啊……没关系 换我来当一根健康的桅杆吧！"] = "I see... no matter, let me be a healthy mast instead!",
    ["这样啊……那看来没办法了，有时间的话，我们会去店里用餐的。"] = "I see... then it can't be helped. If we have time, we'll come to the shop to dine.",
    ["这样啊……那真是太好了……<P_Heart>（身形渐渐消散）</>不用为我难过，万物皆有尽头，我终于也能……回归大地的怀抱……"] = "I see... That's truly wonderful... <P_Heart>(Figure gradually dissipates)</> Don't be sad for me, all things have an end, and I can finally... return to the embrace of the Earth...",
    ["这样啊……那真是太好了……（身形渐渐消散）不用为我难过，万物皆有尽头，我终于也能……回归大地的怀抱……"] = "Is that so... That's wonderful... (Figure gradually dissipates) Don't be sad for me. Everything has an end, and I can finally... return to the embrace of the earth...",
    ["这样啊，我还在休假，工作的事以后再谈。"] = "I see. I'm still on vacation; we can talk about work later.",
    ["这样子啊。"] = "Is that so?",
    ["这样对待女士，实在太不礼貌了。"] = "Treating a lady like this is really impolite.",
    ["这样就不用担心有人打扰了。"] = "This way, we don't have to worry about anyone disturbing us.",
    ["这样就可以把灰雾和我捆绑在一起了。"] = "This way, I can bind the gray fog to myself.",
    ["这样就安全了……克莱恩，你对安提哥努斯家族的笔记肯定充满好奇，想弄清楚曾经遭遇的事情。"] = "That makes it safe... Klein, you must be full of curiosity about the Antigonus Family notebook and want to figure out what happened in the past.",
    ["这样就足够了。"] = "That is enough.",
    ["这样应该够干净了吧。"] = "This should be clean enough.",
    ["这样应该差不多了。"] = "That should be about right.",
    ["这样我会没法把你带回家的！"] = "Otherwise I won't be able to take you home!",
    ["这样才算“准备充分”，出发吧。"] = "Only then can it be considered \"fully prepared\", let's go.",
    ["这样是怎样？"] = "What is \"that\"?",
    ["这样最帅啊！你想想，从教堂顶一跃而下，你的背后是一轮巨大的红月！"] = "It's the coolest! Just imagine, leaping down from the top of the church with a huge red moon behind you!",
    ["这样没人敢合作吧？"] = "No one would dare to partner with you like that, right?",
    ["这样的人，整个廷根或许都找不到一个，就算有，谁会愿意放弃自己的头发呢？"] = "Such a person might not be found in all of Tingen, and even if there were, who would be willing to give up their hair?",
    ["这样的仪式会引来邪恶和危险！"] = "Such a ritual will attract evil and danger!",
    ["这样的曲子适合独自思考，帮助梳理纷乱的思绪。 "] = "Such a piece is suitable for thinking alone, helping to sort out chaotic thoughts.",
    ["这样的话，官方或野生非凡者，都很容易锁定你。"] = "In that case, official or wild Beyonders could easily lock onto you.",
    ["这样的话，当你觉得冷的时候，就可以翻开它，让它温暖你的心。"] = "That way, when you feel cold, you can open it and let it warm your heart.",
    ["这样说也没错。只不过后来有更多天才，比如伦纳德，比如克莱恩。但最早，我确实算是最聪明的。扮演法是我自己领悟出来的。"] = "That's not wrong either. It's just that later there were more geniuses, like Leonard, like Klein. But early on, I was indeed considered the smartest. I realized the Acting method myself.",
    ["这样说也没错。只不过后来有更多天才，比如伦纳德，比如克莱恩。但最早，我确实算是最聪明的。扮演法是我领悟出来的。"] = "That's also true. It's just that there were more geniuses later, like Leonard and Klein. But in the beginning, I was indeed the smartest. I was the one who realized the Acting Method.",
    ["这样隐秘的聚会正是我无数次想象过的事件。在这样的神秘组织里以代号相称，交流传奇的故事！"] = "Such a secret gathering is exactly the kind of event I have imagined countless times. To address each other by codenames in such a mysterious organization and exchange legendary stories!",
    ["这样，如果你愿意放过我，我告诉你xxx的秘密。"] = "How about this, if you are willing to let me go, I will tell you the secret of xxx.",
    ["这样？"] = "Like this?",
    ["这根本不重要。"] = "That's not important at all.",
    ["这根羽毛，曾划过灵界的边界。"] = "This feather once grazed the boundary of the Spirit World.",
    ["这根蜡烛需要大量亡魂的封印，我的儿子在战场上，满足这样的条件。而这个托马斯神父……想人为制造大量亡魂。"] = "This candle requires the sealing of many souls. My son was on the battlefield, which met the conditions. And this Father Thomas... wants to artificially create a large number of souls.",
    ["这桶黑啤酒我藏了三个月，就等着真英雄来开桶！"] = "I've hidden this barrel of dark beer for three months, just waiting for a true hero to tap it!",
    ["这棵树……我不记得了……你，你长得很像我儿子……"] = "This tree... I don't remember... You, you look a lot like my son...",
    ["这棵树上没有果子。"] = "There is no fruit on this tree.",
    ["这棵树上的也被摘完了。"] = "The ones on this tree have also been picked clean.",
    ["这棵树和这面墙好像有点问题，墙上似乎有个影子"] = "This tree and this wall seem to have a problem; there seems to be a shadow on the wall.",
    ["这次 我一定要……撞破冰山！"] = "This time, I must... break through the iceberg!",
    ["这次……大概两个月了吧？"] = "This time... about two months, I suppose?",
    ["这次一定……"] = "This time for sure...",
    ["这次一定要拿到她朋友的联系方式！"] = "This time I must get her friend's contact information!",
    ["这次一定说对，是哈兰德对吧？"] = "I'll get it right this time, it's Harland, right?",
    ["这次也不是意外，对吗？"] = "This wasn't an accident either, right?",
    ["这次他们竟然连一便士都不留给我，太过分了……"] = "This time they didn't even leave me a penny. That's too much...",
    ["这次任务你们处理得很好，尤其是克莱恩，你的“占卜家”能力在这类事件中很有用。"] = "You handled this mission very well, especially Klein. Your Seer ability is very useful in these types of events.",
    ["这次任务是净化被怨魂侵扰的梦境……这里的廷根好像有些不太一样？"] = "This mission is to purify a dream disturbed by a Wraith... Tingen seems a bit different here?",
    ["这次你出了钱，我们出力气，这很合理。"] = "You provided the money, and we'll provide the effort. That's fair.",
    ["这次准备好了？"] = "Are you ready this time?",
    ["这次出现的文字……"] = "The words that appeared this time...",
    ["这次危机中，我看到很多以前同事的身影，邓恩队长、老尼尔、科恩黎……"] = "In this crisis, I saw the figures of many former colleagues, Captain Dunn, Old Neil, Kenley...",
    ["这次又是什么委托？"] = "What kind of commission is it this time?",
    ["这次又要拍什么？"] = "What are we filming this time?",
    ["这次好像不一样了？"] = "It seems different this time?",
    ["这次委托金给的很多，或许，余下的钱我也可以找个人喝几杯？"] = "The commission this time is quite high, perhaps I can find someone to have a few drinks with the remaining money?",
    ["这次它又会把我带到哪里呢……"] = "Where will it take me this time...",
    ["这次密修会的行动失败了，但是他们可能会继续派人来跟踪你。一定要提高警惕、注意安全。"] = "This operation by the Psychology Alchemists failed, but they might continue to send people to track you. You must stay vigilant and be careful.",
    ["这次尝试的新发型超满意，感觉整个人都亮起来了！"] = "I'm super satisfied with this new hairstyle I tried, feel like my whole self has lit up!",
    ["这次形画得不太准……但这也是廷根的悠闲情调嘛！"] = "The shape isn't quite accurate this time... but that's just the leisurely vibe of Tingen, isn't it!",
    ["这次我也一起去！"] = "I'm coming with you this time!",
    ["这次我们在广场准备了一场考验，看他有没有给罗珊幸福的能力。"] = "This time we have prepared a test in the square to see if he has the ability to give Rozanne happiness.",
    ["这次我会和你一起，确保你不会丢掉性命。"] = "This time I will be with you to ensure you don't lose your life.",
    ["这次我画出来的可是绝世大作！"] = "The masterpiece I painted this time is peerless!",
    ["这次新生者翻开了笔记，被疯狂的力量扭曲而自杀。"] = "This time, the Newborn opened the notebook and committed suicide, twisted by the power of madness.",
    ["这次是我要上厕所。"] = "This time it's me who needs to go to the bathroom.",
    ["这次是摔伤了胳膊，他没准会逼我卧床休息……"] = "This time I sprained my arm, he might force me to stay in bed and rest...",
    ["这次是斧子，墓碑上是你的名字……"] = "This time it's an axe, and your name is on the tombstone...",
    ["这次是艾拉。"] = "This time it's Ella.",
    ["这次是队长 得去推醒他……"] = "This time it's the Captain. I need to go wake him up...",
    ["这次水晶的旋转会是顺时针，还是逆时针呢？"] = "Will the rotation of the Crystal be clockwise or counter-clockwise this time?",
    ["这次没有消失，让我仔细看看……"] = "It didn't disappear this time, let me take a closer look...",
    ["这次没看上，还有下次。您以后想要新鲜鱼，跟我打声招呼就行。"] = "If you didn't find anything this time, there's always next time. Just let me know if you want fresh fish in the future.",
    ["这次的任务总让我感到不安，我的小罗珊，我最放心不下的人。"] = "This mission always makes me feel uneasy, my little Rozanne, the person I worry about most.",
    ["这次的历史重历，要小心。"] = "Be careful during this historical reenactment.",
    ["这次的告解者是谁"] = "Who is the confessor this time",
    ["这次的拍摄计划，比之前都更为宏大，我希望能拍摄到您面对世间、睥睨一切的风姿！"] = "This filming plan is grander than before, I hope to capture your demeanor of facing the world and looking down on everything!",
    ["这次的拼图是……一朵雏菊？"] = "The puzzle this time is... a daisy?",
    ["这次的案件很不寻常……那些受害者临死前都在喃喃自语，说什么“黄金在呼唤”。"] = "This case is very unusual... The victims were all muttering to themselves before they died, saying something about 'the gold is calling'.",
    ["这次的气息异动提醒了我，或许……"] = "This aura fluctuation reminded me, perhaps...",
    ["这次的污染源在哪？"] = "Where is the source of corruption this time?",
    ["这次的谜题……又是什么？"] = "What is... the puzzle this time?",
    ["这次考古回去，我的博士论文就有着落了。等我通过副教授面试……就能给你更好的生活。"] = "After this archaeological trip, my doctoral thesis will be settled. Once I pass the associate professor interview... I can give you a better life.",
    ["这次行动严格保密，猎龙帮怎么会盯上我们？"] = "This operation is strictly confidential, how could the Dragon Hunter Gang have targeted us?",
    ["这次请目前好评如潮的海岸线餐厅，让我拍摄下您品尝美酒的珍贵影像。"] = "This time, please let the currently popular Coastline Restaurant allow me to film precious footage of you tasting fine wine.",
    ["这次谁敢说话试试！"] = "Let's see who dares to speak this time!",
    ["这次走得太匆忙，这片领地还来不及找到新的主人，恐怕要荒废了。"] = "This departure is too rushed, and there is no time to find a new owner for this land. I fear it will go to waste.",
    ["这次醒来多亏了克莱恩的信，让我回想起了很多。"] = "Waking up this time was thanks to Klein's letter, which helped me recall a lot.",
    ["这次金币的颤动，让人有一种不安的感觉……"] = "The vibration of the gold coin this time gives one an uneasy feeling...",
    ["这次非常简单，请您前往前方的椅子坐下……哦，请您小心一点！"] = "This time it's very simple, please go to the chair in front and sit down... Oh, please be careful!",
    ["这次，你看到了什么？"] = "What did you see this time?",
    ["这款药剂入口清甜，还有着植物汁液的微涩感。除了有优秀的治愈效果，也是一款可口的饮料。"] = "This potion tastes sweet and clear, with a slight bitterness from plant juices. Besides having excellent healing effects, it is also a delicious beverage.",
    ["这款药剂能唤醒沉寂的灵性，滋养枯竭的精神，是灵性最佳的补品。"] = "This potion can awaken dormant spirituality and nourish exhausted spirits. It is the best supplement for spirituality.",
    ["这款药剂能瞬间点燃全身潜能。除了短时间内大幅提升攻击，也能让你忘记什么叫疼痛。"] = "This potion can instantly ignite all potential in the body. Besides significantly increasing Attack for a short time, it also makes you forget what pain is.",
    ["这款设计得有新意……"] = "This design is quite innovative...",
    ["这款饮品只要让背叛你的对象喝下，他就会追悔莫及，回来向你道歉。"] = "As long as you let the person who betrayed you drink this, they will regret it and come back to apologize to you.",
    ["这正是医院的金字招牌！是最好的宣传！"] = "That is exactly the hospital's gold-standard reputation! It's the best promotion!",
    ["这正是我们希望的。“愚者”先生，请问对应的咒文是什么？"] = "That is exactly what we were hoping for. Mr. Fool, may I ask what the corresponding incantation is?",
    ["这正是我们希望的。愚者先生，请问对应的咒文是什么？"] = "This is exactly what we hoped for. Mr. Fool, may I ask what the corresponding incantation is?",
    ["这正是我需要的信息，谢谢你。"] = "This is exactly the information I need, thank you.",
    ["这段戏已经结束了，你怎么还沉浸在这里？醒醒，该下工了。"] = "This scene is already over, why are you still immersed in it? Wake up, it's time to clock out.",
    ["这段戏，您的想法……"] = "Your thoughts on this scene...",
    ["这段旋律并非我的创作，是多年前在贝克兰德偶然听到一个名叫特莉丝的甜美少女轻哼过。"] = "This melody is not my creation. I accidentally heard a sweet young girl named Trissy hum it in Backlund many years ago.",
    ["这段时间我和他，还有娜娅经常见面，解读和讨论他最近得到的一本第四纪文献。"] = "During this time, I, him, and Naya met frequently to interpret and discuss a Fourth Epoch document he had recently obtained.",
    ["这段时间，海岸线餐厅所有的菜都是我做的。这些年我几乎学会了库克每道菜的配比，要复刻不难。"] = "During this time, all the dishes at the Coastline Restaurant were made by me. Over the years, I have almost learned the proportions of every dish Cook makes, so it's not hard to replicate.",
    ["这段篇章叫做《夜访》。一位贵妇人的追求者，为了纪念自己被爱情俘获的时刻，采用《夜访》的旋律订制它作为礼物。"] = "This piece is called 'Night Visit.' A suitor of a noblewoman commissioned it as a gift, using the melody of 'Night Visit' to commemorate the moment he was captivated by love.",
    ["这段记忆......是谁放进来的？"] = "This memory... who put it in?",
    ["这段记忆……和我的天赋很契合。"] = "This memory... fits my talent very well.",
    ["这段记忆很快就要消散了——但如果你拍下来，它就能留下。"] = "This memory is about to dissipate soon — but if you take a picture of it, it can remain.",
    ["这段音乐旋律，蕴含着一些非凡力量。去调查一下吧。"] = "This musical melody contains some Beyonder power. Go and investigate it.",
    ["这没什么。别忘了，暂住领地的另一条代价是你们要给我们帽子帮让出一部分的跑腿利润。"] = "It's nothing. Don't forget, the other price for staying in the territory is that you have to give up a portion of the errand profits to our Hat Gang.",
    ["这没什么。我在文法学校读书时，母亲重病去世了。也就是在那时，我收到了父亲的来信，让我继承了贝克兰德的财产。"] = "It's nothing. When I was studying at grammar school, my mother passed away from a serious illness. That was when I received a letter from my father, asking me to inherit the property in Backlund.",
    ["这没什么，不过臣民是指旁边这个小男孩吗？"] = "It's nothing. But by subjects, do you mean this little boy next to you?",
    ["这没什么，我只是碰巧路过，没想到竟看到这样一出戏。"] = "It's nothing. I just happened to be passing by and didn't expect to see such a play.",
    ["这涉及廷根大量市民的安全，请您予以协助。"] = "This involves the safety of a large number of citizens in Tingen, please assist.",
    ["这清冽的口感，这隐约的香气，这就是文明的滋味吗？"] = "This crisp taste, this faint fragrance, is this the taste of civilization?",
    ["这湖里根本就没有能实现愿望的女神！"] = "There is no Goddess in this lake who can grant wishes at all!",
    ["这煎肉闻起来真好，有一种让人怀念的味道……也许是因为香草吧。我们这就尝尝！"] = "This seared meat smells so good, it has a nostalgic scent... maybe it's the herbs. Let's try it!",
    ["这照片上的人有些眼熟。"] = "The person in this photo looks somewhat familiar.",
    ["这片世界诞生于一片花海的湖下...."] = "This world was born beneath a lake of flowers...",
    ["这片冰湖原本是我选择的长眠之地，在我看到盛夏时的它时……可它现在冻住了。"] = "This icy lake was originally the resting place I chose when I saw it in midsummer... but it's frozen now.",
    ["这片区域不再堕落。 "] = "This area is no longer corrupted.",
    ["这片历史孔隙……为什么被点亮了？我不曾……"] = "This gap in history... why has it been lit up? I never...",
    ["这片能抵御严寒的花也开得好，戴维每次都要摘几朵。"] = "These flowers that can withstand the severe cold also bloom well. David would pick a few every time.",
    ["这片草坪……好像春天下雨时草腥味会很重。"] = "This lawn... it seems like it will have a very strong grassy smell when it rains in the spring.",
    ["这片镜中世界正是靠它构建的。有它在，带大家回到现实不是什么难事。"] = "This mirror world was built precisely because of it. With it here, bringing everyone back to reality isn't difficult.",
    ["这片领地似乎已经很久没有人拜访了，要去的乘客很少见呢。您要去这里的话，以后也可以随时找我上车。"] = "It seems no one has visited this land for a long time; passengers going there are quite rare. If you are going there, you can always find me to board the train in the future.",
    ["这玩意儿真管用？不会是那些神棍编出来骗钱的把戏吧？"] = "Does this thing really work? It wouldn't be some trick made up by those charlatans to swindle money, would it?",
    ["这瓶玫瑰烟草刚到，我觉得很好闻，可奈拉小姐说很一般。"] = "This bottle of Rose Tobacco just arrived. I think it smells great, but Miss Naila says it is very average.",
    ["这瓶药不会也有副作用吧？"] = "This bottle doesn't have side effects too, does it?",
    ["这真不像小孩说的话。"] = "That really doesn't sound like something a child would say.",
    ["这真是一次圆满的行动"] = "This was truly a successful operation",
    ["这真是一次奇妙的体验……嗯，我一直期待着类似的事情。我是说，我喜欢神秘，喜欢超越自然的奇迹。"] = "This is truly a wonderful experience... Well, I've always been looking forward to something like this. I mean, I like mystery, I like miracles that transcend nature.",
    ["这真是太过糟糕的死循环了。"] = "This is truly a terrible vicious cycle.",
    ["这真的很神奇。"] = "This is truly magical.",
    ["这码头的每艘船都挂着我家旗帜，尽管去让人事开了我——"] = "Every ship at this dock flies my family's flag, so go ahead and have HR fire me—",
    ["这破东西像从墓地里埋了五十年再挖出来，也能叫礼物？我是垃圾桶吗！"] = "This piece of junk looks like it was buried in a graveyard for fifty years before being dug up, and you call it a gift? Am I a trash can!",
    ["这确实不是拉姆齐的作品。"] = "This is indeed not Ramsay's work.",
    ["这确实值得期待。请把它定制为项圈吧，我想我的小猎犬正需要这样一件足够优雅的生日礼物。"] = "This is indeed worth looking forward to. Please customize it as a collar; I think my little hound needs such an elegant birthday gift.",
    ["这确实可以让父亲暂时继续支持我……但我还需要考虑，如果父亲再用这次的理由来削减盒饭的话……"] = "This can indeed make Father continue to support me for now... But I still need to consider, if Father uses this reason again to cut my meal allowance...",
    ["这确实很省……"] = "That is indeed very frugal...",
    ["这确实是片丰饶的土地，也许用南瓜作为设计主题……"] = "This is indeed a fertile land, maybe use pumpkins as the design theme...",
    ["这碎片……却透着一点奇怪的光。"] = "This fragment... emits a strange light.",
    ["这碎片，似乎还有意志的残留？"] = "This fragment seems to have remnants of will?",
    ["这种不属于模板中的对象，都需要通过新增镜头轨来实现哦。"] = "Objects like this that are not in the template need to be implemented by adding a new camera track.",
    ["这种东西可不能就这样放在桌子上。"] = "Something like this shouldn't just be left on the table.",
    ["这种事情……是应该记得很清楚吗？奇怪，那我怎么会不记得……"] = "Is this the kind of thing... that one should remember clearly? Strange, then why don't I remember...",
    ["这种事，本来也勉强不来。要不……我们再看看那本书里还写了什么？"] = "This kind of thing can't be forced anyway. How about... we see what else is written in that book?",
    ["这种传统的手艺活，怎么能叫骗呢？那些阔老爷们要的不就是刚挖出来的那种感觉吗？"] = "How can such traditional craftsmanship be called a scam? Isn't that just the feeling those rich gentlemen want—that it was just dug up?",
    ["这种副作用太残酷了。得尽快找到它。"] = "This side effect is too cruel. I must find it as soon as possible.",
    ["这种天气走小路，不会更危险吗？"] = "Wouldn't it be more dangerous to take a small path in this weather?",
    ["这种宁静的，只需要思考下一顿吃什么的生活，在来到塔罗学派之前，我连想都不敢想。"] = "This kind of peaceful life, where you only need to think about what to eat for the next meal, is something I didn't even dare to imagine before coming to the Tarot Club.",
    ["这种小事，你们可以自己拿主意。"] = "You can decide such trivial matters yourselves.",
    ["这种感觉还不错，虽然听到了一些奇怪的声音、看到了一些奇怪的事物……"] = "This feeling isn't bad, although I've heard some strange voices and seen some strange things...",
    ["这种时候剩下的不都是烂掉的吗？"] = "Aren't the ones left at that time all rotten?",
    ["这种时候，我好想回到因蒂斯……"] = "At times like this, I really want to return to Intis...",
    ["这种本能反应装不出来。"] = "This kind of instinctive reaction cannot be faked.",
    ["这种游刃有余的态度是否说明，她对今天的比赛志在必得呢？"] = "Does this composed attitude mean she is determined to win today's match?",
    ["这种游客最好骗，我说什么都信。什么古堡管理员，哈哈哈哈！"] = "These tourists are the easiest to scam, they believe whatever I say. 'Castle administrator', hahahaha!",
    ["这种灵异事件，还是上报给教会比较好……"] = "It's better to report this kind of supernatural event to the Church...",
    ["这种现象…… 有什么看不见的东西在试图控制他！"] = "This phenomenon... something invisible is trying to control him!",
    ["这种约定，很容易忘记吧"] = "Such a promise is easy to forget, right?",
    ["这种舞蠢透了。"] = "This dance is incredibly stupid.",
    ["这种药剂真的有效吗？或许我需要去准备些鸟饲料先拉近距离……"] = "Is this potion really effective? Perhaps I need to go prepare some bird feed to bridge the distance first...",
    ["这种过度的热爱，最终沦为了偏执……他多半已经因为失控而葬身此地。"] = "This excessive love eventually turned into paranoia... He most likely lost his life here due to a loss of control.",
    ["这种门可能费一点力气，\r\n但是我总想试试手艺……"] = "This kind of Door might take a bit of effort,\nbut I always like to test my skills...",
    ["这种风格的珠宝会大量运用曲线，材料的组合也往往足够绚丽，彩色宝石的价格都因此被炒高了。"] = "This style of jewelry uses a lot of curves, and the combination of materials is often quite gorgeous, which has driven up the prices of colored gemstones.",
    ["这笔账……我记住了。在廷根，没有人能赖掉我洛克·金的钱！"] = "This debt... I've noted it. In Tingen, no one can default on my, Rock King's, money!",
    ["这笔钱会用来干什么呢？"] = "What is this money used for?",
    ["这类子弹由银制成，细看有复杂眩目的花纹，底部铭刻有“黑底群星红半月”的小圣徽，对于污秽堕落类生物很有用，是值夜者们最常用的一种子弹。他们将一枚枚猎魔子弹射入黑夜的风中，悲鸣刚起，就被隐秘。\n\n愿廷根的市民们今夜依旧得享好梦。"] = "These bullets are made of silver and have complex, dazzling patterns when viewed closely, with a small holy emblem of \"black background, stars, and red crescent\" engraved on the bottom. They are very useful against filthy and fallen creatures and are the most commonly used type of bullet by Nighthawks. They fire Demon Hunter Bullets into the night wind, and the wailing is silenced as soon as it begins. \n\n May the citizens of Tingen enjoy a good dream tonight.",
    ["这类镜头不属于模板内容，需要根据具体需求，由策划来手k出来。一般来说，k的越细，效果越好。"] = "This type of camera does not belong to the template content and needs to be manually keyed by the planner according to specific needs. Generally speaking, the more detailed the keying, the better the effect.",
    ["这精灵的声音怪怪的……"] = "This elf's voice is weird...",
    ["这糟糕的一切……"] = "All this misery...",
    ["这糟糕的一切，这漏风的房子，这令人绝望的未来！"] = "All this misery, this drafty house, this hopeless future!",
    ["这纹路都是时间的痕迹……怎么可能是假……是仿制品！"] = "These patterns are all traces of time... how could it be fake... it's a replica!",
    ["这结构……我好像见过"] = "This structure... I think I've seen it",
    ["这缕残余中没有愤怒，没有怨恨，干净得像一块被雨水冲过的石头。"] = "There is no anger or resentment in this remnant; it is as clean as a stone washed by rain.",
    ["这缕灵性里残留着某种极度专注的烙印。"] = "This wisp of spirituality contains the imprint of extreme focus.",
    ["这缕知识一旦具象化，斯蒂姆宫出现于现实，可能带来另一场毁灭性的灾难，我必须尽快追回它。"] = "Once this strand of knowledge materializes and the Steam Palace appears in reality, it could bring about another devastating catastrophe. I must retrieve it as soon as possible.",
    ["这缕知识一旦具象化，斯蒂姆宫重现于现实，可能带来另一场毁灭性的灾难，我必须尽快追回它。"] = "Once this strand of knowledge manifests and the Steam Palace reappears in reality, it could bring about another devastating catastrophe. I must retrieve it as soon as possible.",
    ["这群人再不努力，我们乐团就要和镇子里的老年乐团沦为一个档次了！"] = "If this group doesn't work harder, our band will be on the same level as the town's senior citizens' band!",
    ["这群家伙就像下水道的老鼠一样善于躲藏，我们能抓住一只真是意外收获。"] = "These guys are as good at hiding as rats in the sewer. It was truly an unexpected harvest that we were able to catch one.",
    ["这群小家伙吵吵闹闹地要给你办生日派对。对了，我也赌你会忘记自己的生日，感谢配合。来吧克莱恩，十便士。"] = "These little ones were making a fuss about throwing you a birthday party. By the way, I also bet that you would forget your own birthday. Thanks for cooperating. Come on, Klein, ten pence.",
    ["这耗尽了她的力量，不得不陷入沉睡，但直到现在，她也在暗处守护着我们。"] = "This exhausted her strength, forcing her into a deep slumber, but even now, she continues to guard us from the shadows.",
    ["这肉都臭了，还能卖？不怕吃出问题吗？"] = "This meat is already rotten, can it still be sold? Aren't you afraid of causing health problems?",
    ["这股力量"] = "This power,",
    ["这股熟悉的气息……你们是？！"] = "This familiar aura... who are you?!",
    ["这能拍到什么？拍到她和经纪人下船上马车？"] = "What could this possibly capture? Her and her agent getting off the ship and into a carriage?",
    ["这艘船走的是热门航线，票一直挺抢手的，您要不考虑换种交通方式？或者再等等？"] = "This ship is on a popular route, and tickets are always in high demand. Would you consider another mode of transport? Or perhaps wait a little longer?",
    ["这花好看，那花也好看，这虫子可爱，那虫子也可爱！要不再去摘点葡萄吧……"] = "This flower is pretty, that flower is also pretty, this bug is cute, that bug is also cute! Maybe I should go pick some grapes instead...",
    ["这花香，闻着心里宁静得很。"] = "This floral scent, it makes my heart feel so peaceful.",
    ["这街上又人来人往的了，真棒啊，你说是不是？"] = "The street is bustling with people again, it's great, don't you think?",
    ["这表示有诡异的力量干扰了占卜，这件事不简单。"] = "This indicates that strange power interfered with the divination. This matter is not simple.",
    ["这要是能登出来了，我就发财了。"] = "If this gets published, I'll be rich.",
    ["这规矩你早懂的。"] = "You've known this rule for a long time.",
    ["这角度真是令人耳目一新。若是让您去给集市上的驴子做个批注，怕是能出一本厚厚的专著。"] = "This angle is truly refreshing. If you were allowed to annotate the donkeys at the market, I'm afraid you could produce a thick monograph.",
    ["这角落没人来，我的天，终于安静了。"] = "No one comes to this corner. My god, finally some peace and quiet.",
    ["这警局门口的氛围似乎有点紧张，发生了什么？"] = "The atmosphere at the police station entrance seems a bit tense. What happened?",
    ["这讨厌的积水差点弄湿了我新买的鞋子！"] = "This annoying puddle almost got my new shoes wet!",
    ["这让我期待起后面拍摄的内容了，呵呵，让我们下次再见。"] = "This makes me look forward to the content of the next shoot. Hehe, let's meet again next time.",
    ["这话之前问过一次了，不记得吗？"] = "I asked that once before, don't you remember?",
    ["这该死的小混蛋，躲去哪儿了！刚来就给我惹事！要是被我抓到，看我不宰了你！"] = "That damn little brat, where did he hide! Causing me trouble the moment he arrived! If I catch you, I'll kill you!",
    ["这该死的小混蛋，还敢躲！现在被我抓到了吧，看我不宰了你！"] = "You damn little brat, you dare to hide! Now that I've caught you, see if I don't slaughter you!",
    ["这该死的济贫院规定，将大人和孩子分开安置，害我白天的时候都找不到你。"] = "This damn poorhouse rule of separating adults and children makes it impossible for me to find you during the day.",
    ["这该死的编辑……有多少是进了他自己的口袋了。"] = "That damn editor... how much of it went into his own pocket.",
    ["这该死的船是沉到海底喂鱼了吗？"] = "Did this damn ship sink to the bottom of the ocean to feed the fish?",
    ["这该死的船是沉到海底喂鱼了吗？等得我都快睡着了。"] = "Did this damn ship sink to the bottom of the sea to feed the fish? I've been waiting so long I'm almost asleep.",
    ["这说明，童话里的都是真的，不是骗人的，它们真实发生过。所以，这个世界……"] = "This shows that everything in fairy tales is true, not a lie; they actually happened. Therefore, this world...",
    ["这说的……是我吗？"] = "Is this... talking about me?",
    ["这起儿童失踪案，可能没那么简单。"] = "This child abduction case might not be that simple.",
    ["这起初也有愚者的帮助。后来发现……<P_Heart>（眼神温和）</>这是保持人性最好的锚点之一。"] = "This initially had the help of The Fool as well. Later, I discovered... <P_Heart>(Eyes gentle)</> this is one of the best anchors to maintain humanity.",
    ["这起案件结束了，后续调查就交给我吧，非常感谢你。"] = "This case is closed. Leave the follow-up investigation to me. Thank you very much.",
    ["这趟路又长又险，一旦进去，就没法半路退出了。想好了再点头。"] = "This journey is long and dangerous; once you go in, there's no turning back halfway. Think it over before you nod.",
    ["这趟辛苦你了，走吧。那些工人……会有同事来善后的。"] = "You've worked hard this trip, let's go. Those workers... colleagues will come to handle the aftermath.",
    ["这跟佛尔思的《大冒险家》有什么关系？"] = "What does this have to do with Fors's \"The Great Adventurer\"?",
    ["这路都修了多久了？每天闹哄哄的，尘土乱飞！"] = "How long has this road been under construction? It's noisy every day, and dust is flying everywhere!",
    ["这车煤真重，推得我胳膊都快断了。"] = "This cart of coal is really heavy, my arms feel like they're about to break from pushing it.",
    ["这轮子的尺寸不太对啊……"] = "The size of this wheel isn't quite right...",
    ["这边是店里最热销的款式，正适合先生这样年轻帅气的绅士。如果买一整套，还有折扣优惠。"] = "These are our best-selling styles, perfect for a young and handsome gentleman like him. If you buy the whole set, there's a discount.",
    ["这边的宝箱被封印了。"] = "The treasure chest here is sealed.",
    ["这边的摊位，统统免费品尝！"] = "The stalls over here are all free to sample!",
    ["这边！来宝箱这边！"] = "Over here! Come to the treasure chest!",
    ["这还不是你现在该思考的问题。"] = "This is not a question you should be thinking about right now.",
    ["这还不能说明问题吗？"] = "Doesn't this explain the problem?",
    ["这还怎么做生意？"] = "How can I do business like this?",
    ["这道罗勒牛尾汤，可以预订送餐到我们公司吗？在佐特兰街36号，2楼。"] = "Can this oxtail soup with basil be ordered for delivery to our company? At 36 Zoutland Street, 2nd floor.",
    ["这道菜可以加入我们的餐食改良计划。"] = "This dish could be added to our meal improvement plan.",
    ["这道谜题我记得……"] = "I remember this puzzle...",
    ["这都不算什么，我这半年每顿两颗，水煮的、煎的……现在别说看见鸡蛋，光是听到“蛋”这个字，我的胃就开始抽抽。"] = "That's nothing. For the past six months, I've eaten two a day, boiled, fried... now, let alone seeing an egg, just hearing the word 'egg' makes my stomach churn.",
    ["这都是些什么东西？！"] = "What are these things?!",
    ["这都是你做的？"] = "Did you do all this?",
    ["这都是努力的结果，那现在感觉怎么样呢？"] = "These are all the results of hard work, so how do you feel now?",
    ["这都是我从有钱人那里拿来的，厉害吧？"] = "I got these from the rich, impressive, right?",
    ["这都是我找来的二手报纸。有钱人家的门廊、佐兰特街的垃圾桶、花园的躺椅，各种各样的地方。"] = "These are all second-hand newspapers I found. Porches of wealthy homes, trash cans on Zolat Street, lounge chairs in gardens—all sorts of places.",
    ["这都是猎龙帮的的秘密，不是什么人都有资格知道的。"] = "These are all secrets of the Dragon Hunting Gang; not just anyone is qualified to know them.",
    ["这都是猎龙帮的秘密，不是什么人都有资格知道的。"] = "These are all secrets of the Dragon Hunter Gang; not everyone is qualified to know.",
    ["这都是神奇物品的能力表现，我们官方一般称作<P_Yellow>封印物</>。嗯……之前我好像忘记解释了。"] = "These are all manifestations of the abilities of mystical items, which we officially call <P_Yellow>Sealed Artifacts</>. Hmm... I think I forgot to explain this earlier.",
    ["这酒的颜色，跟今天刷的那面墙差不多。"] = "The color of this wine is about the same as that wall painted today.",
    ["这酒鬼堵这好几天了！"] = "This drunkard has been blocking this for days!",
    ["这里“#Space5#”不生效。"] = "Here \"#Space5#\" does not take effect.",
    ["这里……"] = "Here...",
    ["这里……似乎藏着什么不愿被人发现的秘密。\n一个女孩正在等待，等待你将最后的心愿归还给她。"] = "Here... it seems to hide some secret that no one wants to be discovered. \n A girl is waiting, waiting for you to return her final wish to her.",
    ["这里……再加点粉色！"] = "Here... add a little more pink!",
    ["这里……环境的确很糟糕。"] = "This... environment is indeed very bad.",
    ["这里。"] = "Here.",
    ["这里一点声音都没有，不知道伊琳现在还好吗？"] = "There's not a sound here. I wonder if Irene is okay now?",
    ["这里不允许街头表演！"] = "Street performances are not allowed here!",
    ["这里不安全。"] = "It's not safe here.",
    ["这里不对劲！有、有什么东西？"] = "Something is wrong here! There's, there's something?",
    ["这里不欢迎你们！"] = "You are not welcome here!",
    ["这里不知还埋葬着多少生命。"] = "Who knows how many more lives are buried here.",
    ["这里不缺少一家店铺，但旷野中还缺少一个自由的灵魂。"] = "There is no shortage of shops here, but the wilderness still lacks a free soul.",
    ["这里为什么有口锅？"] = "Why is there a pot here?",
    ["这里也听不见。"] = "Can't hear here either.",
    ["这里交给我吧"] = "Leave this to me.",
    ["这里交给我吧，你去看看别的地方。"] = "Leave this to me; you go check elsewhere.",
    ["这里交给我，你去看看其他人吧。"] = "Leave this to me, you go check on the others.",
    ["这里交通很便利，稍微走几步就能到圣赛琳娜教堂，有轨马车也有站点，去其他教堂和火车站也很方便。"] = "The transportation here is very convenient. A short walk will take you to Saint Selena Cathedral. There is also a tram stop, and it's very convenient to go to other churches and the train station.",
    ["这里什么也没有。"] = "There is nothing here.",
    ["这里从不缺少美食、欢笑和永远未完待续的故事。"] = "There is never a shortage of good food, laughter, and stories that are always to be continued here.",
    ["这里以前是菜园？"] = "Was this a vegetable garden before?",
    ["这里似乎陷入了循环"] = "This place seems to be caught in a loop",
    ["这里依旧危险，有什么话回黑荆棘再说。"] = "It's still dangerous here, we'll talk about it once we're back at Blackthorn.",
    ["这里到处都是发狂的秘偶，真是太可怕了，但也只有这里，能搞到最多最好的秘偶精粹，喂，看你衣兜鼓囊囊的，想必这一路捡了不少吧？"] = "This place is crawling with maddened marionettes. It's truly terrifying, but this is also the only place where you can get the most and best marionette essence. Hey, looking at your bulging pockets, you must have picked up quite a lot along the way, right?",
    ["这里卖些什么？"] = "What do you sell here?",
    ["这里原本的灵都消失了，包括韦尔奇和娜娅的，现在的小家伙们什么都不知道。"] = "The spirits that were originally here have all disappeared, including Welch's and Naya's. The little ones here don't know anything.",
    ["这里又是什么地方……"] = "Where is this place again...",
    ["这里发生了什么事？你是怎么死的？"] = "What happened here? How did you die?",
    ["这里只是书中的一页，我们很快就会再见的。"] = "This is just a page in a book; we will meet again soon.",
    ["这里叫恶龙酒吧，我们就成立个猎龙帮！"] = "This place is called the Evil Dragon Bar, let's form a Dragon Hunter Gang!",
    ["这里可以打开/关闭<Orange>剧情模式</>，切换镜头远近"] = "Here you can enable/disable <Orange>Story Mode</> and switch camera distance.",
    ["这里可以打开/关闭<Orange>剧情模式</>，切换镜头远近。"] = "Here you can open/close <Orange>Plot Mode</> and switch the camera distance.",
    ["这里可以打开训练场试用药品界面。"] = "Here you can open the training ground potion trial interface.",
    ["这里可以接取<Highlight>叹息之种任务</>。"] = "Here you can accept the <Highlight>Seed of Sighs Quest</>.",
    ["这里可以查看<Highlight>城市暗面</>中可参与的事件。"] = "Here you can view events that can be participated in within the <Highlight>City Dark Side</>.",
    ["这里可以查看<Highlight>魔药配方</>。"] = "Here you can view the <Highlight>Potion Formula</>.",
    ["这里可以查看当前教团的属性、封印物与赐福效果。"] = "Here you can view the current cult's attributes, Sealed Artifacts, and blessing effects.",
    ["这里可以看到你当前的<Highlight>魔药消化度</>。"] = "Here you can see your current <Highlight>Potion Digestion Progress</>.",
    ["这里可以选择想使用的药品使用。"] = "Here you can select the medicine you want to use.",
    ["这里四下无人，还是凶杀事故的多发地，上过不少次老实人报呢。"] = "There's no one around here, and it's a frequent site for homicides; it's even been in the Honest Man newspaper quite a few times.",
    ["这里四处弥漫着诡异的气息。"] = "A strange aura permeates this place.",
    ["这里太多这样的情况了……我们只能努力帮他们找出真相，剩下只能指望议员们的良心了。"] = "There are too many such situations here... We can only try our best to help them find the truth, and the rest can only depend on the conscience of the councilors.",
    ["这里太热闹了，请跟我到文献室来。"] = "It's too noisy here, please follow me to the archives room.",
    ["这里好荒凉.....前面的断桥被荆丛挡住了，得想个办法清理它们……"] = "It's so desolate here... The broken bridge ahead is blocked by thorny thickets. I need to find a way to clear them...",
    ["这里好黑……要、要不，咱们还是回去吧……"] = "It's so dark here... H-how about we just go back...",
    ["这里存放着塔罗学派中大部分神奇物品，由学派内部的“看守者”轮值。"] = "Most of the mystical items in the Tarot Club are stored here, rotated by the 'Guardians' within the school.",
    ["这里实在有些糟糕，我可以帮你们安排其他地方过生日。"] = "It's really a bit terrible here. I can help you arrange another place to celebrate your birthday.",
    ["这里宽敞凉爽，还有树荫遮挡，我要睡觉了，请离开。"] = "It's spacious and cool here, with shade from the trees. I'm going to sleep, please leave.",
    ["这里就是仪式现场吗……那边似乎有什么东西？"] = "Is this the ritual site... does there seem to be something over there?",
    ["这里就是你说的教堂？他是……"] = "This is the church you mentioned? He is...",
    ["这里就是占卜俱乐部？"] = "Is this the Divination Club?",
    ["这里就是占卜俱乐部？……卢瑟那个白痴到底什么时候出来？"] = "Is this the Divination Club? ...When exactly is that idiot Luther coming out?",
    ["这里就是如此……我们已经习惯了和种种荒诞共存。它们并不都是恶意的，就像雪山上的所有其他事物一样寻常。"] = "This is how it is here... we are already used to coexisting with all kinds of absurdities. They are not all malicious, just as ordinary as everything else on the snowy mountain.",
    ["这里就是恶龙酒吧？"] = "Is this the Evil Dragon Bar?",
    ["这里就是我过去的办公室，在书架上，你还能看到我过去的书籍。"] = "This is my old office. On the bookshelf, you can still see my old books.",
    ["这里就是拉姆德小镇……风景如画，不愧是廷根人的度假首选。"] = "This is Lamud... picturesque, worthy of being the top vacation choice for Tingen residents.",
    ["这里就是花海，情侣约会圣地……"] = "This is the Sea of Flowers, a holy site for couples' dates...",
    ["这里居然有向下的侧间，向前看看吧。"] = "There's actually a side room leading downwards here, let's go forward and take a look.",
    ["这里展示了解锁此人脉可获得的技能。"] = "This displays the skills that can be obtained by unlocking this connection.",
    ["这里已经不剩什么难题了呢，快去迎接你的……"] = "There are no difficult problems left here, hurry up and meet your...",
    ["这里应该就是<P_Yellow>黛西小姐</>的家。"] = "This should be the home of <P_Yellow> Miss Daisy </>.",
    ["这里应该就是茶会会场了。"] = "This should be the Tea Party Venue.",
    ["这里应该就是茶会会场了。\r\n"] = "This should be the tea party venue.",
    ["这里很危险！开膛手杰斯就在附近，你们快离开吧！"] = "It's dangerous here! Jack the Ripper is nearby, you all should leave quickly!",
    ["这里很好"] = "It's nice here",
    ["这里很好-触发器"] = "It's nice here-Trigger",
    ["这里得小心，有块深红巨石挡路，从旁边绕过去。"] = "Be careful here, there's a deep red boulder blocking the way. Go around it.",
    ["这里怎么会有隐藏起来的亡灵？"] = "How could there be a hidden spirit here?",
    ["这里怎么会躲着一个狼人？"] = "How could a werewolf be hiding here?",
    ["这里怎么还有廷根大学社团的招募信息？"] = "Why is there recruitment information for a Tingen University club here?",
    ["这里总是汇聚着眼泪、愤怒、悲叹、绝望，还有掘墓人的秘密。"] = "This place always gathers tears, anger, lamentations, despair, and the secrets of the gravedigger.",
    ["这里恰好有火车站点，我立刻为您联系商会，或许可以借用铁轨进行一些行商贸易！请您稍微等待一些日子。"] = "There happens to be a train station here. I will contact the Chamber of Commerce for you immediately; perhaps we can borrow the tracks for some commercial trade! Please wait a few days.",
    ["这里所有追寻真理的求知者都是幸福的。"] = "All the seekers of knowledge here who pursue truth are happy.",
    ["这里手工业很发达，我准备去廷根联系一些老朋友，帮手工作坊找点出路。"] = "Handicrafts are well-developed here, and I plan to go to Tingen to contact some old friends and help the handicraft workshops find a way out.",
    ["这里拥有两所举世闻名的高等学府——廷根大学与霍伊大学。"] = "This place is home to two world-renowned institutions of higher learning—Tingen University and Hoy University.",
    ["这里播个离开的dialog，写任务自定义是因为我不知道dialog能不能存档"] = "Play a departure dialog here; I wrote it as a quest custom event because I don't know if dialog can save",
    ["这里放一个……"] = "Place one here...",
    ["这里斗邪恶缺一个人，克莱恩，要来一把吗？"] = "We're one person short for fighting evil, Klein, want to join in?",
    ["这里易守难攻，在这里安定下来应该是个不错的选择，至少可以抵挡那些怪物……"] = "This place is easy to defend and hard to attack; settling down here should be a good choice, at least it can block those monsters...",
    ["这里是......"] = "This is...",
    ["这里是<P_Yellow>科诺桑小镇</>？"] = "Is this <P_Yellow>Conosan Small Town</>?",
    ["这里是——"] = "This is—",
    ["这里是“愚者”先生启程的地方。"] = "This is where Mr. Fool began His journey.",
    ["这里是……"] = "This is...",
    ["这里是……一个梦境？它是用来装什么的？"] = "Is this... a dream? What is it used to contain?",
    ["这里是……什么地方？"] = "Where... is this place?",
    ["这里是……伦纳德先生救我的地方？"] = "Is this... where Mr. Leonard saved me?",
    ["这里是……哪里……"] = "Where... am I...",
    ["这里是……如此恢弘的建筑，怎么荒废成这样？"] = "Where is this... such a magnificent building, how did it become so desolate?",
    ["这里是……？"] = "Where is this...?",
    ["这里是……？<h></>"] = "Where is this...? <h></>",
    ["这里是一切的起点，无数命运波澜未抵达之前的旧梦，亦是最初人性坚定的锚点。愿你好梦，也愿你再度醒来，依旧如此，“愚者”先生。"] = "This is the starting point of everything, the old dream before countless waves of fate arrived, and also the firm anchor of the original humanity. May you have a good dream, and may you wake up again, still the same, Mr. \"Fool\".",
    ["这里是中央广场站。"] = "This is Central Plaza Station.",
    ["这里是丽贝卡开门玩法，众人努力前往大剧院"] = "This is the Rebecca door-opening gameplay, where everyone strives to reach the Grand Theater.",
    ["这里是亨利侦探事务所！有能为您效劳的地方吗？"] = "This is Henry Detective Agency! Is there anything I can do for you?",
    ["这里是他们说的地方吗？"] = "Is this the place they were talking about?",
    ["这里是你们的流浪王国。"] = "This is your wandering kingdom.",
    ["这里是公共空间……我认为，谁都可以在这里活动，不存在“妨碍”。"] = "This is a public space... I believe anyone can be active here, there is no such thing as 'disturbing'.",
    ["这里是剧院，这个女人与剧院的关系是……她是戏剧之母？或是一个平凡而伟大的观剧人。"] = "This is a theater; what is the relationship between this woman and the theater... Is she the mother of drama? Or an ordinary but great theatergoer.",
    ["这里是北大陆鲁恩王国的廷根市。"] = "This is Tingen City, in the Loen Kingdom of the Northern Continent.",
    ["这里是单值列描述: *d\n这里是简写描述:*f\n这里是非EffectList列无名参数描述:*.1f\n这里是非EffectList列有名参数描述:*.2f\n这里是非EffectList列公式计算描述:不合法\n这里是EffectList列无名参数描述: *.1f**\n这里是EffectList列有名参数描述: *s\n这里是EffectList列公式计算结果描述: *.2f**"] = "This is a single-value column description: *d\n This is a shorthand description: *f\n This is a non-EffectList column unnamed parameter description: *.1f\n This is a non-EffectList column named parameter description: *.2f\n This is a non-EffectList column formula calculation description: Invalid\n This is an EffectList column unnamed parameter description: *.1f**\n This is an EffectList column named parameter description: *s\n This is an EffectList column formula calculation result description: *.2f**",
    ["这里是可被技能表引用的描述:*s"] = "This is a description that can be referenced by the skill table:*s",
    ["这里是哪里……我怎么变成这样了？那个仪式果然有古怪！"] = "Where is this... why have I become like this? That ritual really was strange!",
    ["这里是哪里？"] = "Where is this?",
    ["这里是哪里？我们登顶了吗？"] = "Where is this? Did we reach the top?",
    ["这里是属于心灵、精神与意识的世界，个人意识如同岛屿漂浮在集体潜意识大海上，对于岛屿的影响也将投射到现实世界。在未知因素的作用下，集体潜意识大海的秩序崩塌，疯狂与混乱笼罩了越来越多的心灵岛屿。为了防止现实世界出现不可预知的危险，你决定接下奥黛丽的委托，前往风暴中心——那座巨龙盘旋的火山之上，调查与清除污染的根源。"] = "This is a world of mind, spirit, and consciousness. Individual consciousness floats like an island on the sea of collective subconsciousness, and influences on the island will also be projected into the real world. Under the influence of unknown factors, the order of the sea of collective subconsciousness has collapsed, and madness and chaos have shrouded more and more islands of the mind. To prevent unpredictable dangers in the real world, you decide to accept Audrey's commission and head to the center of the storm—the volcano where the giant dragon circles—to investigate and clear the source of the corruption.",
    ["这里是巴纳比队长组织的寻宝队。"] = "This is the treasure hunting team organized by Captain Barnaby.",
    ["这里是帽子帮的领地。"] = "This is the territory of the Hat Gang.",
    ["这里是廷根最大的书店，许多学生会来购买书籍。"] = "This is the largest bookstore in Tingen, and many students come here to buy books.",
    ["这里是我的国，欢迎你们，应邀而来的客人。<P_Heart>（他们似乎是刚才深红星辰带来的……嗯，就这么说！）</>"] = "This is my kingdom. Welcome, guests who have been invited. <P_Heart>(They seem to have been brought here by the crimson stars just now... well, let's just say that!)</>",
    ["这里是我的意识 你也属于我"] = "This is my consciousness, and you belong to me too.",
    ["这里是拉斐尔墓园吗？"] = "Is this the Raphael Cemetery?",
    ["这里是描述<h></>"] = "This is a description of <h></>",
    ["这里是敌人的埋骨之地，踏入即为“永眠”。 占领后可攻击战争石碑，固定每分钟获得30点资源。"] = "This is the burial ground of the enemy; stepping in means \"Eternal Slumber.\" After occupying, you can attack the War Stele to gain a fixed 30 resources per minute.",
    ["这里是有什么活动吗？"] = "Is there some event here?",
    ["这里是法术场动态描述模版"] = "This is the spell field dynamic description template",
    ["这里是海纳斯的梦境……看看有什么线索。"] = "This is Hynes's Dream... let's see if there are any clues.",
    ["这里是热恋中的人们最钟爱的胜地。"] = "This is a favorite destination for people in the throes of love.",
    ["这里是瞭望塔，监测真理号已离开冰山，回到港湾。"] = "This is the Watchtower, monitoring the Truth as it leaves the iceberg and returns to the harbor.",
    ["这里是秩序之地。你抬头眺望，这里的风光和混乱之地截然不同，崖壁、村庄、水渠、城堡……四周围绕着石柱，不知如何才能走下去。"] = "This is the Land of Order. You look up and gaze into the distance; the scenery here is completely different from the Land of Chaos—cliffs, villages, canals, castles... Surrounded by stone pillars, I wonder how to get down.",
    ["这里是第三小段"] = "This is the third paragraph",
    ["这里是第二小段"] = "This is the second paragraph",
    ["这里是规章惩罚描述"] = "This is the rule penalty description",
    ["这里是规章描述"] = "This is the rule description",
    ["这里是记忆回溯"] = "This is Memory Retrace",
    ["这里是贝克兰德，你是哪里来的？规定里禁止街头卖艺。"] = "This is Backlund, where are you from? Street performance is prohibited by regulation.",
    ["这里是贫民的聚集地，有许多无家可归的人在这里滞留，他们需要我们的帮助"] = "This is a gathering place for the poor, with many homeless people lingering here; they need our help",
    ["这里是陷阱动态描述模版"] = "This is the trap dynamic description template",
    ["这里是风暴教会的池子，干净得很，哪有什么鱼？"] = "This is the pond of the Church of Storms, it's very clean, where would there be any fish?",
    ["这里是鲁恩王国与因蒂斯王国的边界。"] = "This is the border between the Loen Kingdom and the Intis Republic.",
    ["这里是鲁恩，没有扎尔哈这种拜亚姆地方特产。"] = "This is Loen; there are no local specialties like Bayam's Zahar here.",
    ["这里是黑夜女神教会在廷根市的总部。"] = "This is the headquarters of the Church of the Evernight Goddess in Tingen City.",
    ["这里是黑夜女神教会在廷根市的总部，以活跃于古老第三纪的女神信徒，圣者圣赛琳娜命名。"] = "This is the headquarters of the Evernight Goddess Church in Tingen City, named after Saint Selena, a believer of the Goddess who was active in the ancient Third Epoch.",
    ["这里是？"] = "Where is this?",
    ["这里是？我只是开启了窥秘之眼，怎么会来到这里？"] = "Where is this? I only activated my spirit vision, how did I end up here?",
    ["这里曾是鲁恩历史上一对国王夫妻的定情之地。"] = "This was once the place where a king and queen in Loen history fell in love.",
    ["这里曾被规划为一片小小的城堡，可惜在许多遗憾后，它并没能最终落成。"] = "This place was planned as a small castle, but unfortunately, after many regrets, it was never finally completed.",
    ["这里有一位英俊美男子，渴求各位淑女的注视！"] = "There is a handsome man here, craving the attention of all the ladies!",
    ["这里有一只迷路的小羔羊。"] = "There is a lost little lamb here.",
    ["这里有一堆当季的报销单。"] = "There is a pile of current reimbursement forms here.",
    ["这里有两扇门……"] = "There are two doors here...",
    ["这里有人吗？"] = "Is anyone here?",
    ["这里有人被困！求救！"] = "Someone is trapped here! Help!",
    ["这里有什么东西，三个人都接触过……"] = "There is something here that all three of us have touched...",
    ["这里有六个字"] = "There are six characters here",
    ["这里有各种咖啡，红茶，还有专为小孩子准备的甜冰茶，小蛋糕和水果塔等等，保证让每位客人度过美好的时光。"] = "We have all kinds of coffee, black tea, and sweet iced tea specially prepared for children, small cakes, fruit tarts, and so on, ensuring every guest has a wonderful time.",
    ["这里有好多通道和房间，伦纳德先生会在哪里？"] = "There are so many passages and rooms here; where could Mr. Leonard be?",
    ["这里有廷根最新鲜的水果和蔬菜！"] = "Here are the freshest fruits and vegetables in Tingen!",
    ["这里有很多摊位，找找看有没有卖火柴的。"] = "There are many stalls here, let's look around to see if anyone is selling matches.",
    ["这里有掉在地上的画？"] = "Is there a painting dropped on the floor here?",
    ["这里有旅馆和教堂，居民多信仰黑夜女神。"] = "There are inns and churches here, and the residents mostly believe in the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["这里有残留的灵性痕迹，教会丢失的封印物应该还在这里！"] = "There are residual traces of spirituality here. The Sealed Artifact lost by the Church must still be here!",
    ["这里有残留的灵性痕迹，教会丢的东西应该还在这里！"] = "There are residual traces of spirituality here; the item lost by the Church should still be here!",
    ["这里有没有售卖一种，呃……小孩子会喜欢的面包？"] = "Do you sell any, uh... bread that children would like?",
    ["这里有许多不同尺寸的雕像。"] = "There are many statues of different sizes here.",
    ["这里有黑麦面包、廷根饼、柠檬蛋糕、甜冰茶……你可以选些喜欢的。"] = "Here we have rye bread, Tingen biscuits, lemon cake, sweet iced tea... you can choose some you like.",
    ["这里正在举办一场很特别的演出——叫做“诡节”。灵界和现实的帷幕在这个时候，会变得稀薄，薄到那些已经消散的历史会重新浮现。"] = "A very special performance is being held here—called the \"Weird Festival.\" The veil between the Spirit World and reality becomes thin at this time, so thin that those dissipated histories will re-emerge.",
    ["这里正在施工，别过去。"] = "Construction is underway here, don't go over there.",
    ["这里正好有个马车！上车快逃！"] = "There's a carriage right here! Get in and run!",
    ["这里水流很急，能钓到鱼吗？"] = "The current is very strong here. Can you catch any fish?",
    ["这里没你事，滚远点！"] = "None of your business, get lost!",
    ["这里没有人吗？"] = "Is there no one here?",
    ["这里没有更多线索了。先来分析一下，男爵最近遭遇了什么事？"] = "There are no more clues here. Let's analyze, what has the Baron encountered recently?",
    ["这里没有网络，没有空调，没有手机和电子游戏，在空调房里打游戏的愿望只能寄希望于古代学者的能力。你懂吗？"] = "There is no internet here, no air conditioning, no mobile phones, and no video games. The wish to play games in an air-conditioned room can only be pinned on the abilities of ancient scholars. Do you understand?",
    ["这里流传着一句谚语“撒谎者长长鼻子”。"] = "There is a proverb here: \"Liars have long noses.\"",
    ["这里灯光有点暗，要不凑近一点，让我先看清楚？"] = "The lighting is a bit dim here. Why don't you come closer so I can see you clearly?",
    ["这里玩家进门表演"] = "This is where the player enters to perform.",
    ["这里玩家进门表演1"] = "Player enters the door to perform 1",
    ["这里的一切不会真的夺走你的生命，但它们制造的恐惧是真实的。"] = "Everything here won't truly take your life, but the horror they create is real.",
    ["这里的人是绝对不会这么做的！大家都只管自己的死活……"] = "People here would never do that! Everyone only cares about their own survival...",
    ["这里的人相信生命不会真的消失，它会以另外的形式陪着您的。"] = "The people here believe that life does not truly disappear; it will accompany you in another form.",
    ["这里的剧本空缺应该填什么呢？该让剧情怎么发展呢？"] = "What should I fill in for the vacancy in the script here? How should the plot develop?",
    ["这里的土地很神奇，一年四季都有果实。"] = "The land here is magical; it bears fruit all year round.",
    ["这里的土壤有翻动过的痕迹，时间不会太久。"] = "There are signs that the soil here has been disturbed; it hasn't been long.",
    ["这里的土比老板画的饼还松软，好眠。"] = "The soil here is softer than the empty promises the boss makes; it's a good place to sleep.",
    ["这里的夜景一定很美！好想找位摄影师拍张纪念照呀。"] = "The night view here must be beautiful! I really want to find a photographer to take a souvenir photo.",
    ["这里的天空没有太阳，只有不变的黑暗和撕裂着一切的闪电。"] = "The sky here has no sun, only constant darkness and lightning that tears everything apart.",
    ["这里的布局，和弗兰奇公寓很像。"] = "The layout here is very similar to the Frankie Apartment.",
    ["这里的异常"] = "The abnormality here",
    ["这里的招牌菜是？"] = "What is the signature dish here?",
    ["这里的文明既崇敬又畏惧黑夜。"] = "The civilization here both respects and fears the night.",
    ["这里的服务是最顶尖的。"] = "The service here is top-tier.",
    ["这里的村民们崇拜着邪异的力量"] = "The villagers here worship evil powers",
    ["这里的每一瓶香水都是艺术品，打折是对它们的侮辱。"] = "Every bottle of perfume here is a work of art; discounting them is an insult to them.",
    ["这里的每杯酒都来自恶龙的珍藏，要来一杯吗？"] = "Every glass of wine here comes from the Evil Dragon's collection, would you like one?",
    ["这里的每杯酒都来自恶龙的馈赠……如果你点的这杯也算作酒的话。尽享美味吧，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Every glass of wine here comes from the gift of a dragon... if the glass you ordered counts as wine. Enjoy the deliciousness, {{Mr.|Ms.}}.",
    ["这里的每杯酒都来自恶龙的馈赠。尽享美味吧，{{先生|女士}}。"] = "Every drink here comes from the gift of the dragon. Enjoy the deliciousness, {{sir|madam}}.",
    ["这里的每杯酒都来自恶龙的馈赠。要来一杯吗？"] = "Every glass of wine here comes from the gift of the Evil Dragon. Want one?",
    ["这里的气息一如往常，只是普通的湖畔。"] = "The aura here is the same as always. It's just an ordinary lakeside.",
    ["这里的煤也得铲铲……"] = "I should shovel the coal here too...",
    ["这里的猫"] = "The Cat here",
    ["这里的环境总让人有些犯困，你不觉得吗？要是不叫“学派”而叫“沙龙”，一定会有趣得多。"] = "The environment here always makes people feel a bit sleepy, don't you think? If it weren't called a \"school\" but a \"salon\", it would definitely be much more interesting.",
    ["这里的生活真好……"] = "Life here is so good...",
    ["这里的积雪厚重，但营地没有被破坏，不像是遭遇了雪崩。"] = "The snow here is thick, but the camp hasn't been destroyed; it doesn't look like an avalanche occurred.",
    ["这里的花花草草长得还挺好，过去经过的时候怎么从来没发现呢？"] = "The flowers and plants here are growing quite well; why didn't I notice them when I passed by before?",
    ["这里的风尚从不追求张扬，而是在凛冬之中依旧保持从容，既然你来到这片冰雪之间，不如让我见识一下你的品鉴方式。"] = "Fashion here never seeks to be ostentatious, but rather to remain calm in the midst of winter. Since you've come to this ice and snow, why not let me see your way of appreciation.",
    ["这里的风景真不错。很适合坐下来，安静地喝一杯茶、看几页书……"] = "The scenery here is really nice. It's very suitable for sitting down, quietly having a cup of tea, and reading a few pages of a book...",
    ["这里的风景真不错，瞧，这样的地方还能看见灵体的痕迹，有趣。"] = "The scenery here is really nice. Look, to be able to see traces of spirit bodies in a place like this is interesting.",
    ["这里的风景真好，当年出差到这里，才侥幸躲过了那场大雾霾的灾难，也遇见了你。"] = "The scenery here is really nice. It was only because I was on a business trip here that I luckily escaped the disaster of that great smog, and also met you.",
    ["这里的风雪自那场战争后吹得更加猛烈，厚厚的雪，覆盖了很多痕迹。"] = "The wind and snow here have blown more fiercely since that war. The thick snow has covered many traces.",
    ["这里看起来很熟悉。"] = "This place looks familiar.",
    ["这里真的有墙，小心别撞上。"] = "There really is a wall here, be careful not to run into it.",
    ["这里真的有柱子，小心碰鼻子。"] = "There really is a pillar here, be careful not to bump your nose.",
    ["这里确实有不少有趣的东西。"] = "There are indeed quite a few interesting things here.",
    ["这里究竟发生过什么……"] = "What exactly happened here...",
    ["这里竟然有一个#Space4#！"] = "There is actually a #Space4# here!",
    ["这里经常有孩子的哭声……"] = "There is often the sound of children crying here...",
    ["这里绝对称不上是“公寓”……"] = "This place can hardly be called an \"apartment\"...",
    ["这里缠着的是……鱼线？"] = "What's wrapped around here is... fishing line?",
    ["这里能够在一定程度上抑制灵感，在外面我总会听不见别人听不见的声音，陷入恍惚的状态，在这里就不会，很舒服，很宁静。"] = "It can suppress my Inspiration to a certain extent here. Outside, I always hear voices that others cannot, falling into a trance. It doesn't happen here; it's very comfortable and peaceful.",
    ["这里能看到当前持有的魔药配方，<Highlight>更高序列的魔药配方</>可从<Highlight>进度奖励</>获取。"] = "Here you can see the potion formulas you currently hold. <Highlight>Higher Sequence Potion Formulas</> can be obtained from <Highlight>Progress Rewards</>.",
    ["这里能看到神性等级的规则，包括解锁天数，经验获取效率等"] = "Here you can see the rules for divinity levels, including unlock days, EXP acquisition efficiency, etc.",
    ["这里至少安静些，没有那些轰鸣声。"] = "It's at least quieter here, without those roaring sounds.",
    ["这里虽然条件艰苦，但至少能给那些无家可归的人一个遮风挡雨的地方。"] = "Although the conditions here are difficult, at least it can provide a shelter for those who are homeless.",
    ["这里被称为大学之城，是知识与智慧的摇篮。"] = "This place is known as the City of Universities, the cradle of knowledge and wisdom.",
    ["这里解锁自动寻路+弹弱提示"] = "Unlock auto-pathfinding + trigger weak prompts here",
    ["这里还可以继续打磨……"] = "It can still be polished here...",
    ["这里还存在一些特殊的痕迹……"] = "There are still some special traces here...",
    ["这里还算隐蔽，视野也很清晰，就在这儿埋伏吧。"] = "This place is quite hidden, and the view is clear, let's ambush here.",
    ["这里进出的货我都熟，唯独没见过这些，多半就是那些子弹了。"] = "I'm familiar with all the goods coming in and out of here, but I've never seen these. They are most likely those bullets.",
    ["这里配True后HitActions无效"] = "If True is configured here, HitActions are invalid",
    ["这里配True后，“Buff控制状态列表”的配置无效"] = "If True is configured here, the \"Buff Control Status List\" configuration is invalid",
    ["这里配True后，“受击列表”的配置无效"] = "If True is configured here, the \"Hit List\" configuration is invalid",
    ["这里配true后BuffControlStates无效"] = "If true is configured here, BuffControlStates are invalid",
    ["这里难道就是基地……"] = "Is this the base...",
    ["这里难道真是一场梦？我必须揭开真相，逃离噩梦？"] = "Is this really a dream? I must uncover the truth and escape this nightmare?",
    ["这里面可真大！"] = "It's really big in here!",
    ["这里风景优美，镇上也很温馨，最重要的是拉姆德古堡——来的人一定不会错过。"] = "The scenery here is beautiful, the town is cozy, and most importantly, Lamud Castle—visitors will definitely not miss it.",
    ["这里！在这里！"] = "Here! Over here!",
    ["这里，似乎有些不同寻常的痕迹……"] = "There seem to be some unusual traces here...",
    ["这里，可真是比舞会有趣多了！"] = "This place is really much more interesting than a Ball!",
    ["这里，是我的国度。"] = "This is my kingdom.",
    ["这钢丝绳的寿命早就超了！"] = "The lifespan of this steel cable has long since expired!",
    ["这镇子一年到头没几件新鲜事，我偶尔转转，帮帮初到此处的旅客。"] = "There are hardly any new things happening in this town all year round. I occasionally walk around and help travelers who are new to this place.",
    ["这间屋子里好像有什么……可能是错觉吧？"] = "There seems to be something in this room... maybe it's an illusion?",
    ["这附近就是铁十字街，找找看吧。"] = "Iron Cross Street is around here; let's look for it.",
    ["这附近尽是些酒鬼，他们的舌头已经被酒精毁了，甚至不能完整说完一句话。"] = "This neighborhood is full of drunks whose tongues have been ruined by alcohol; they can't even finish a single sentence properly.",
    ["这附近没有厨房，厨具该怎么办呢？"] = "There is no kitchen nearby; what should I do about the kitchenware?",
    ["这附近的灵……嘈杂又混乱，这里发生过不少事呢。"] = "The spirits around here... are noisy and chaotic. A lot has happened here.",
    ["这附近能躲的地方都不在，你该不会骗我吧！"] = "There's nowhere to hide around here. You better not be lying to me!",
    ["这附近都找遍了，难道是被谁捡走了？"] = "I've searched everywhere nearby; could someone have picked it up?",
    ["这难道不是赛斯在女神的神国谴责我吗？他和斐乐根本不认识啊！"] = "Isn't this Seth condemning me in the Goddess's Kingdom of God? He and Fela don't even know each other!",
    ["这难道是天使的羽毛？……不，远超天使的气息。"] = "Is this an Angel's feather? ...No, it's an aura far beyond an Angel.",
    ["这需要勇气。直面死亡，拥抱黑暗，守护秘密……这些并不容易。"] = "This requires courage. Facing death, embracing the darkness, guarding secrets... these are not easy.",
    ["这需要它<P_Yellow>吃掉</>……相当于十倍自身体重的食物？这不可能！"] = "This requires it to <P_Yellow>eat</>... the equivalent of ten times its own body weight in food? That's impossible!",
    ["这需要它吃掉……相当于十倍自身体重的食物？这不可能！"] = "That would require it to eat... food equivalent to ten times its own body weight? That's impossible!",
    ["这顶帽子很旧了，再找找有没有别的吧。"] = "This hat is very old, let's look for another one.",
    ["这顶帽子很重要吧？"] = "This hat is very important, isn't it?",
    ["这顶帽子是他亲手给我做的，我们还约好等他回来，要重新做一顶呢。"] = "This hat was made by him for me, and we even promised that when he returned, we would make a new one.",
    ["这顶帽子是我母亲亲手做的。我们家的食物、欢笑，还有那些好日子，都是从这顶帽子里变出来的。"] = "This hat was made by my mother herself. Our family's food, laughter, and those good days were all conjured from this hat.",
    ["这颗树上没有果子。"] = "There are no fruits on this tree.",
    ["这食堂再吃下去，我的胃怕是要趁我睡着的时候叛逃了！"] = "If I keep eating at this cafeteria, I'm afraid my stomach will try to defect while I'm asleep!",
    ["这首未完的乐曲，我一定会把它完成。当你再次听到这段旋律，就是我们相聚的那天。"] = "I will definitely finish this unfinished piece of music. When you hear this melody again, that will be the day we reunite.",
    ["这首歌曲，全都是真情实意。"] = "This song is filled with true feelings and sincerity.",
    ["这首诗很美，你从什么时候开始写诗的？"] = "This poem is beautiful, when did you start writing poetry?",
    ["这首诗是关于什么的？"] = "What is this poem about?",
    ["这马车稳吗？便宜点得了！"] = "Is this carriage stable? Make it cheaper!",
    ["这鬼地方！泥巴溅到我靴子上了，你知道吗？这双可是贝克兰德最好的皮匠手工定制的！ "] = "This godforsaken place! Mud splashed onto my boots, do you know that? These were custom-made by the best cobbler in Backlund!",
    ["这鳞片的光泽，这滑腻的手感，这锋利的鱼鳍……"] = "The luster of these scales, the slippery feel, these sharp fins...",
    ["这黑烟钻肺里比烈酒还烧得慌，上周又抬走两个咳血的可怜虫，大伙们可都看见了。 "] = "This black smoke burns the lungs more than strong liquor. Two poor wretches coughing up blood were carried away last week, everyone saw it.",
    ["这，就是神明的伟力！你们只有失败这一种结局！"] = "This is the great power of the gods! You only have one ending: failure!",
    ["这，我也没有食物……"] = "This, I don't have any food either...",
    ["这，这是……！"] = "This, this is...!",
    ["这，这是怎么回事？"] = "This, what is going on?",
    ["这，这样不好吧……<P_Heart>（害羞）</>"] = "Th-that wouldn't be good... <P_Heart>(shy)</>",
