    ["进入<Disable>阶段二</>后，星象仪者持续吸引星光守卫降落。星光守卫如果与星象仪者<Disable>距离过近</>，会产生范围辐射伤害。星光守卫<Disable>死亡时</>会引爆星光之力，对星象仪者<Disable>造成伤害</>。"] = "After entering <Disable> Phase 2 </>, the Astrolabe User continuously attracts Starlight Guards to descend. If a Starlight Guard is <Disable> too close </> to the Astrolabe User, it will generate area radiation damage. When a Starlight Guard <Disable> dies </>, it will detonate Starlight Power, <Disable> dealing damage </> to the Astrolabe User.",
    ["进入<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>状态并buffdisc(*id)，持续治疗周身范围内友方，每秒回复spellfielddisc(*id)点生命，持续6.5秒。\n技能施法期间可以移动，施法3秒后可以使用其它技能打断，被打断后治疗效果仍然生效。"] = "Enters <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> state and buffdisc(*id), continuously healing allies within range for spellfielddisc(*id) Health per second for 6.5 seconds. \n You can move while casting this skill; it can be interrupted by other skills after 3 seconds, and the healing effect will still persist after being interrupted.",
    ["进入<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>状态并buffdisc(*id)，持续治疗周身范围内友方，每秒回复spellfielddisc(*id)点生命，持续6.5秒。\n技能施法期间可以移动，施法短时间后可以使用闪避打断，3秒后可以使用其它技能打断，被打断后治疗效果仍然生效。"] = "Enter the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">Super Armor</> state and apply buffdisc(*id). Continuously heal allies within the surrounding area, restoring spellfielddisc(*id) HP per second for 6.5 seconds.\nYou can move while casting this skill. You can interrupt the cast with a dodge after a short delay, or with other skills after 3 seconds. The healing effect will persist even if the skill is interrupted.",
    ["进入<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>状态并buffdisc(*id)，持续治疗周身范围内友方，每秒回复spellfielddisc(*id)点生命，持续攻击范围内敌方，每秒造成spellfielddisc(*id)点伤害，持续<Highlight>6.5</>秒。"] = "Enters <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </> state and buffdisc(*id), continuously healing allies within range for spellfielddisc(*id) Health per second, while attacking enemies within range for spellfielddisc(*id) damage per second for <Highlight> 6.5 </> seconds.",
