    ["进入护盾内"] = "Enter the shield",
    ["进入持续*f秒的<HighLight>烈阳</>状态，获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\">霸体</>。\n获得被动效果<HighLight>烈阳之魂</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>烈阳</>：自身移动速度增加*f**，战斗技能获取<HighLight>太阳能量</>的效率增加，<HighLight>正义审判</>与<HighLight>异端裁决</>的触发难度降低；普通攻击<HighLight>烈阳斩</>、<HighLight>无暗之枪</>和<HighLight>惩戒</>获得强化。\n<FaintYellow>烈阳之魂</>：自身受到致命伤害时，保留1点生命并获得*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\">无敌</>，解除所受的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\">控制效果</>。期间每0.25秒获得5点<HighLight>太阳能量</>，<HighLight>无暗之枪</>的冷却时长缩减为0，增伤提升*f**（每多1名敌人，增伤额外提升*f**，最大提升mul(*f**,*d)）。自身获得<HighLight>80%</>的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"10\">重伤</>效果，每击败1名敌人<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"16\">固定回复</>20%生命。<HighLight>烈阳之魂</>拥有*f秒内置冷却。\n "] = "Enter the <HighLight> Blazing Sun </> state for *f seconds, gaining *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"11\"> Super Armor </>. \n Gain the passive effect <HighLight> Soul of the Blazing Sun </>. \n \n <FaintYellow> Blazing Sun </>: Movement speed increases by *f**, the efficiency of gaining <HighLight> Spirituality </> from combat skills increases, the trigger difficulty for <HighLight> Judgment of Justice </> and <HighLight> Heresy Verdict </> is reduced; Basic Attacks <HighLight> Blazing Sun Slash </>, <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </>, and <HighLight> Punishment </> are strengthened. \n <FaintYellow> Soul of the Blazing Sun </>: When taking fatal damage, retain 1 Health and gain *f seconds of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"1\"> Invincibility </>, removing any <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"3\"> Crowd Control </> effects. During this period, gain 5 points of <HighLight> Spirituality </> every 0.25 seconds, the cooldown of <HighLight> Unshadowed Spear </> is reduced to 0, and Damage Boost increases by *f** (for every additional enemy, Damage Boost increases by an extra *f**, up to a maximum of mul(*f**,*d)). You gain <HighLight> 80% </> <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"10\"> Grievous Injury </>, and defeating an enemy restores <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"16\"> a fixed </> 20% Health. <HighLight> Soul of the Blazing Sun </> has an internal cooldown of *f seconds. \n",
