    ["进入烈阳状态，移动速度和太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪）获取效率增加，持续8秒；同时自身霸体，持续6秒。\n被动效果烈阳之魂每120秒触发1次：受到致命伤害后，解控并获得4秒无敌、高额增伤与太阳能量（用于解锁惩戒和无暗之枪），期间无暗之枪冷却时长为0，受到治疗减少，根据击败的敌人数量回复自身生命。"] = "Enter the Blazing Sun state; movement speed and Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear) acquisition efficiency increase, lasting 8 seconds. Simultaneously, the user gains Super Armor, lasting 6 seconds. \n Passive effect Soul of the Blazing Sun triggers once every 120 seconds: After receiving fatal damage, remove control effects and gain 4 seconds of Invincibility, high Damage Boost, and Solar Energy (used to unlock Punishment and Unshadowed Spear). During this period, the cooldown of Unshadowed Spear is 0, healing received is reduced, and health is restored based on the number of enemies defeated.",
