    ["连续冲击三次，每次造成<HighLight>60%</>攻击伤害；第一击牵引敌人，自身恢复<HighLight>12%</>最大生命。"] = "Continuously impact three times, each dealing <HighLight>60%</> attack damage; the first hit pulls the enemy, and self recovers <HighLight>12%</> of maximum Health.",
