    ["连续好几篇罗塞尔大帝的报道了，我都要开始怀疑《廷根市老实人报》被因蒂斯暗中收购了……"] = "That's several reports on Emperor Roselle in a row. I'm starting to suspect that the 'Tingen Honest Man's Newspaper' has been secretly acquired by Intis...",
    ["连续好几篇罗塞尔大帝的报道了，我都要开始怀疑《廷根老实人报》被因蒂斯暗中收购了……"] = "That's several articles about Emperor Roselle in a row now. I'm starting to suspect that the Tingen Honest Reporter has been secretly bought out by Intis...",
    ["连续打开关闭邮件界面N次，填Count"] = "Open/close mail interface N times; enter Count.",
