    ["通过提交ID提交道具"] = "Submit item via submission ID",
    ["通过攻击和技能恢复生命！"] = "Restore health through attacks and skills!",
    ["通过旅行指南，感应残留的资产气息，继续深入调查"] = "Use the Travel Guide to sense the lingering aura of assets and continue the investigation",
    ["通过旅行指南，进入遗迹深处"] = "Use the Travel Guide to enter the deep ruins",
    ["通过晋升成为非凡者"] = "Become a Beyonder through advancement",
    ["通过服食魔药成为非凡者或晋升序列 可以提升生命层次"] = "By consuming potions to become a Beyonder or advancing in sequence, one can elevate their level of life.",
    ["通过梦中的试炼"] = "Pass the trial in the dream",
