    ["造梦大师"] = "Dream-Weaving Master",
    ["造物主从混沌中醒来，打破了幽暗，制造了第一缕光，自己则彻底融入宇宙，化身为万物……"] = "The Creator woke up from chaos, broke the darkness, created the first ray of light, and then completely merged into the universe, becoming all things...",
