    ["逻辑是台词，荒诞是剧本；现实在舞台亦真亦假地上演。"] = "Logic is the lines, absurdity is the script; reality is performed on the stage, both true and false.",
    ["逻辑服10001本地私服"] = "Logic Server 10001 Local Private Server",
