    ["逼"] = "Damn",
    ["逾期未归还公示"] = "Notice of Overdue Returns",
    ["遁入潜意识海洋，解除自身控制，召唤巨龙在目标区域盘旋，为范围内友方目标提供回复效果。"] = "Escape into the Subconscious Ocean, remove control effects on oneself, and summon a giant dragon to circle the target area, providing recovery effects to allies within range.",
    ["遁入灵界漫游，立即解除自身受到的控制效果并获得霸体，提高自身的移动速度和减伤，对周身敌人造成伤害和减速，随后可释放连招对敌人发动突袭，造成伤害、减速和击飞。"] = "Escape into the Spirit World to roam, immediately dispelling control effects on yourself and gaining super armor, increased movement speed, and damage reduction. Deals damage and slow to surrounding enemies, then you can trigger a combo to launch a surprise attack, dealing damage, slow, and knockup.",
    ["遁入黑暗"] = "Enter Darkness",
    ["遂宁"] = "Suining",
    ["遇上点小麻烦，我弟弟的午餐又不见了。"] = "Ran into a little trouble, my brother's lunch disappeared again.",
    ["遇到了一些考验，但运气还算不错，谜题都解开了。"] = "I encountered some tests, but my luck was decent, and the puzzles were all solved.",
    ["遇到些危险 但幸好赶来了"] = "Ran into some danger, but thankfully I made it.",
    ["遇到什么事了吗？"] = "Did something happen?",
    ["遇到危险情况，一定要及时报告，不要单独行动。"] = "If you encounter dangerous situations, be sure to report them in time; do not act alone.",
    ["遇到危险时，你可以这样向他祈祷，请求庇佑——"] = "When you encounter danger, you can pray to him like this to ask for protection—",
    ["遇到灵异事件，务必就近找附近的教堂上报。"] = "If you encounter supernatural events, be sure to report it to the nearest church.",
    ["遇到邮差"] = "Meet Postman",
    ["遇到魔女位置"] = "Location of Encounter with Witch",
    ["遇到麻烦去占卜一下，是廷根人的习惯。"] = "It's a habit for Tingen people to go for a divination when they encounter trouble.",
    ["遇到麻烦的话，我们习惯去占卜俱乐部，你知道的，遇到麻烦去占卜一下，是廷根人的习惯。"] = "If we encounter trouble, we are used to going to the Divination Club. You know, going for a divination when in trouble is a habit of the people of Tingen.",
    ["遇害的新闻……就是这张，把报纸带回去给她们吧。"] = "The news about the murder... this is the one. Take the newspaper back to them.",
    ["遇见伦纳德"] = "Meet Leonard",
    ["遇见困扰，我会一条一条地列出坏和好两方面内容，列完以后，再比较一下，就能得到应该怎么做的“提示”了。"] = "When I encounter trouble, I will list the bad and good aspects one by one. After listing them, I compare them, and I can get a “hint” on what to do.",
    ["遇见安提哥努斯家族后裔，封印物“2-049”会变得非常激动，能力明显提升。"] = "When encountering a descendant of the Antigonus family, the Sealed Artifact '2-049' will become very excited, and its abilities will significantly improve.",
    ["遇见薄荷可可"] = "Meet Mint Cocoa",
