    ["道奇"] = "Dodge",
    ["道奇已经开始清理了。希望一切顺利……"] = "Dodge has already started cleaning. Hope everything goes smoothly...",
    ["道奇离烟囱口越来越远，声音也听不太清。希望能平安无事……"] = "Dodge is getting further and further away from the chimney opening, and his voice is becoming hard to hear. I hope he's safe and sound...",
    ["道奇，你怎么样？你还好吗？"] = "Dodge, how are you? Are you alright?",
    ["道奇，我理解你必须拿到这笔钱。但就这样让你进去还是太危险了，你们平时是怎么做的？"] = "Dodge, I understand you must get this money. But it's still too dangerous to let you go in like this. How do you usually do it?",
    ["道奇，没事了，你们不会再受到雷克斯的威胁了。"] = "Dodge, it's alright now. You won't be threatened by Rex anymore.",
