    ["遗憾的是，首席科林.伊利亚特与长老洛薇娅·蒂芙尼倒在了黎明之前。"] = "Regrettably, Chief Colin Iliad and Elder Lovia Tiffany fell just before the dawn.",
    ["遗憾的是，首席科林·伊利亚特与长老洛薇娅·蒂芙尼倒在了黎明之前。"] = "Regrettably, Chief Colin Iliad and Elder Lovia Tiffany fell before the dawn.",
    ["遗憾通知您，由于长期不活跃，您已经移出<M_Orange>%s </>俱乐部\n您现在可以申请新的俱乐部。"] = "We regret to inform you that due to long-term inactivity, you have been removed from the <M_Orange>%s </> Club. \n You can now apply for a new club.",
    ["遗憾，你的犹豫消耗了太多时间……"] = "Regrettably, your hesitation consumed too much time...",
    ["遗憾？也许这一切都是女神的指引。"] = "Regret? Perhaps all of this is the Goddess's guidance.",
