    ["遥"] = "Yao",
    ["遥杆输入的方向和玩家自身方向的夹角是否在参数范围内"] = "Is the angle between the joystick input direction and the player's own direction within the parameter range?",
    ["遥知"] = "Yao Zhi",
    ["遨游星界，见证宇宙的真实。"] = "Travel the Astral World and witness the truth of the universe.",
    ["遨游潜意识大海，洞悉万物之心灵。"] = "Roaming the ocean of the subconscious, discerning the minds of all things.",
    ["遭受强力冲击，更易受到伤害，每层易伤20%。"] = "Suffering a powerful impact, more susceptible to damage, 20% vulnerability per stack.",
    ["遭受长戟重击，易伤200%。"] = "Suffering a heavy blow from a halberd, 200% vulnerability.",
    ["遭遇了那样的事件，你还能活着，这本身就足够特殊了。"] = "To have encountered such an event and still be alive is special enough in itself.",
    ["遭遇了那种事件，且没有第一时间接受我们的保护，却依然活着——这足以证明他的幸运。"] = "To have encountered such an incident and not immediately accepted our protection, yet still be alive—that was enough to prove his luck.",
    ["遭遇怪物1"] = "Encounter monster 1",
    ["遭遇怪物2"] = "Encounter monster 2",
    ["遭遇怪物3"] = "Encounter monster 3",
    ["遭遇战斗，自动退出拍照模式。"] = "Encountered battle; automatically exited photo mode.",
    ["遭遇背叛的暗天使不会永远沉睡，随着冒险者抵达王庭的最深处，千年前的恶意和疯狂苏醒了···"] = "The betrayed Dark Angel will not sleep forever. As adventurers reach the deepest part of the Royal Court, the malice and madness from a thousand years ago awaken...",
    ["遮挡出现特效-礁石克莱恩"] = "Occlusion Appearance Effect - Reef Klein",
    ["遮盖画特效"] = "Covering painting effect",
    ["遮盖纸-奥黛丽"] = "Cover paper - Audrey",
    ["遮盖纸-阿尔杰"] = "Cover Paper - Alger",
    ["遮盖纸们的灰雾"] = "Gray fog covering the papers",
    ["遮阳"] = "Shade Eyes",
    ["遮面的巨像传来低喃：“唯混乱与秩序相交……方能获得……我与剑的认可……”"] = "The veiled colossus whispers: \"Only when Chaos and Order intersect... can you obtain... the recognition of me and the sword...\"",
    ["遮面的巨像传来低喃：“想看到……另一个世界……我……的样子……”（提示：在秩序之地寻找与乱之巨像一模一样的【雕像】）"] = "The veiled colossus whispers: \"Want to see... the other world... my... appearance...\" (Hint: Find the [statue] in the Land of Order that is identical to the Colossus of Chaos)",
    ["遮面的巨像传来低喃：“这是……秩序之地的……我……原来小小的......”"] = "The veiled colossus whispers: \"This is... the Land of Order's... me... so small...\"",
    ["遵义"] = "Zunyi",
    ["遵从您的意志。"] = "I obey your will.",
    ["遵从王的审判，绞杀亵渎之人！"] = "Obey the King's judgment and strangle the blasphemer!",
    ["遵命"] = "As you command",
    ["遵命，警官。"] = "Understood, Officer.",
    ["遵循医嘱就是对我最好的感激，女士。"] = "Following the doctor's orders is the best way to thank me, madam.",
    ["遵循平等是什么意思？"] = "What does following equality mean?",
    ["遵循您的喜好或命运指引调制"] = "Prepared according to your preferences or the guidance of fate",
    ["遵循您的意志。"] = "Following your will.",
    ["避免触手射中队友"] = "Avoid having tentacles hit teammates",
    ["避免进入<Highlight>雕像法阵</>内受到范围伤害。"] = "Avoid entering the <Highlight>statue magic circle</> to take area damage.",
    ["避开墙的镜头后续换回中景！"] = "Camera avoiding the wall, switch back to medium shot afterwards!",
    ["邀人品尝美食永远都不会麻烦！而且真正的美食是有“花期”的，让更多人在花期内品尝是我的荣幸。"] = "Inviting people to taste delicious food is never a trouble! And true delicacies have a \"flowering period,\" it is my honor to let more people taste them within that period.",
    ["邀你入团"] = "Invites you to the team",
