    ["邓恩往韦尔奇家门走路线"] = "Dunn's route to Welch's house door",
    ["邓恩总是随身携带着这只烟斗，用烟丝和薄荷叶把它填满，然后深吸一口，看起来烟瘾很大，这似乎能帮他思考或者缓解焦虑。\n\n但他严格遵循值夜者小队的规定，绝不会在室内或工作的时候吸烟，有些人甚至没见过这只烟斗被点燃的样子。罗珊他们偷偷猜测队长可能根本不会抽烟、这个烟斗只是为了摆造型用的！\n\n“如果哪天他在公司里抽烟了，你们一定要告诉我。”听完罗珊的猜测后，戴莉这样回应了他们。"] = "Dunn always carries this pipe with him, filling it with tobacco and mint leaves, and then taking a deep puff. He seems to have a heavy smoking habit, which seems to help him think or relieve anxiety. \n\n But he strictly follows the Nighthawk team's regulations and never smokes indoors or while working. Some people have never even seen this pipe lit! Rozanne and the others secretly guessed that the Captain might not know how to smoke at all and that this pipe is just for show! \n\n 'If he ever smokes at the company, you must tell me,' Daly responded to them after hearing Rozanne's guess.",
    ["邓恩扮演·伦纳德"] = "Dunn Acting - Leonard",
    ["邓恩扮演·克莱恩"] = "Dunn Acting - Klein",
    ["邓恩扮演·老尼尔"] = "Dunn Acting - Old Neil",
    ["邓恩挠头"] = "Dunn scratches head",
    ["邓恩梦魇目标筛选"] = "Dunn Nightmare Target Filter",
    ["邓恩没有变成我的通灵对象，呵呵……等我知道的时候，他的灵早就消散了。哪里都找不到。"] = "Dunn didn't become an object for my Spirit Mediumship, haha... By the time I knew, his spirit had long since dissipated. I couldn't find it anywhere.",
    ["邓恩灵体"] = "Dunn spirit body",
    ["邓恩的墓碑"] = "Dunn's Tombstone",
    ["邓恩的字条"] = "Dunn's note",
    ["邓恩的幻象"] = "Dunn's Illusion",
    ["邓恩的邀请令人心动，去黑荆棘安保公司看看，人总是要工作的。"] = "Dunn's invitation is tempting. Go to Blackthorn Security Company and take a look; one always needs a job.",
    ["邓恩的邀请实在令人心动，去黑荆棘安保公司看看吧，人总是要工作的。"] = "Dunn's invitation is truly tempting. Let's go check out Blackthorn Security Company; one always needs a job.",
    ["邓恩的钱包"] = "Dunn's Wallet",
    ["邓恩瞄准射击时，会以携带该buff的单位为目标射击。"] = "When Dunn uses Aiming Shot, he will target the unit carrying this buff.",
    ["邓恩瞄准射击时，给雕像添加该buff，避免重复射击同一个单位"] = "When Dunn uses Aiming Shot, he adds this buff to the statue to avoid repeatedly shooting the same unit",
