    ["邓恩给克莱恩的药剂，瓶子小巧精致，内里的液体正缓缓流淌。"] = "Potion given to Klein by Dunn, the bottle is small and exquisite, and the liquid inside is flowing slowly.",
    ["邓恩被控制，帮助他躲开攻击！"] = "Dunn is being controlled; help him dodge the attacks!",
