    ["邓恩队长"] = "Captain Dunn",
    ["邓恩队长……"] = "Captain Dunn...",
    ["邓恩队长……我听说过他，一个很可靠的人。"] = "Captain Dunn... I've heard of him, a very reliable man.",
    ["邓恩队长和克莱恩……几年前的事情了，没想到你都还记得。"] = "Captain Dunn and Klein... that was years ago, I didn't expect you to still remember.",
    ["邓恩队长喜欢叼着烟斗想事情，老尼尔的报销单多到数不清，大家值夜的时候喜欢凑在一起斗邪恶。"] = "Captain Dunn liked to think while holding his pipe, Old Neil's reimbursement forms were too many to count, and everyone liked to get together to fight evil when on duty.",
    ["邓恩队长是廷根的上一任值夜者小队队长，他的性格非常温和，也是位富有经验的非凡者。"] = "Captain Dunn was the previous captain of the Tingen Nighthawks squad. He had a very gentle personality and was also an experienced Beyonder.",
    ["邓恩队长的办公室充满了回忆，我也经常想起那段日子……"] = "Captain Dunn's office is full of memories, and I often think back to those days...",
    ["邓恩队长虽然记性差，但很靠谱，公司的大家也都是很好的人……虽然伦纳德说话总是怪怪的。"] = "Captain Dunn may have a bad memory, but he's very reliable, and everyone at the company is a good person... even if Leonard always talks in a weird way.",
    ["邓恩队长让您安排我的工作，我该先解读哪些文献和书籍？"] = "Captain Dunn asked you to arrange my work. Which documents and books should I interpret first?",
    ["邓恩队长让我们等了这么久，希望他的咖啡里长蟑螂！"] = "Captain Dunn has kept us waiting for so long; I hope cockroaches grow in his coffee!",
    ["邓恩队长让我把这个交给你。"] = "Captain Dunn asked me to give this to you.",
    ["邓恩队长，“梦魇”有什么样的能力？"] = "Captain Dunn, what kind of abilities does a 'Nightmare' have?",
    ["邓恩队长，值夜者平时要做哪些工作？"] = "Captain Dunn, what kind of work do Nighthawks usually do?",
    ["邓恩队长，您工作之余有什么爱好吗？"] = "Captain Dunn, do you have any hobbies outside of work?",
    ["邓恩队长，您第一次见到克莱恩时，对他有什么印象？"] = "Captain Dunn, what was your impression of Klein when you first met him?",
    ["邓恩隐秘羁绊"] = "Dunn Secret Bond",
    ["邓恩隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Dunn secret bond reward.",
    ["邓恩需要瞄准3个单位才能释放瞄准射击"] = "Dunn needs to aim at 3 units to release Aiming Shot",
    ["邓恩韦尔奇家"] = "Dunn Welch's house",
    ["邓恩马车前"] = "In front of Dunn's carriage",
    ["邓恩马车吓人对话"] = "Dunn carriage scary dialogue",
    ["邓恩，你的语气太像审问了。"] = "Dunn, your tone is too much like an interrogation.",
    ["邓恩，听到了吗？"] = "Dunn, did you hear that?",
    ["邓恩：他入梦了，抓紧时间击破护盾！"] = "Dunn: He has entered a dream, hurry and break the shield!",
    ["邓恩：但更是守护者"] = "Dunn: But even more so, we are Guardians.",
    ["邓恩：再开一瓶迪西香槟。"] = "Dunn: Open another bottle of Dicy champagne.",
    ["邓恩：咳！"] = "Dunn: *Cough*!",
    ["邓恩：让我们欢迎新加入的正式成员，克莱恩·莫雷蒂，干杯！"] = "Dunn: Let us welcome our new official member, Klein Moretti, cheers!",
    ["邓恩？他看起来成熟了好多……"] = "Dunn? He looks so much more mature...",
    ["邓戴"] = "Dunn-Dai",
    ["邓戴支线"] = "Dunn Side Quest",
    ["邓戴支线·美梦成真"] = "Deng Dai Side Quest - Dreams Come True",
    ["邓戴支线·美梦成真·第一章"] = "Dunn-Daly Side Quest - Dreams Come True - Chapter 1",
    ["邓戴支线·美梦成真·第三章"] = "Dunn-Daly side quest-Dreams Come True-Chapter 3",
    ["邓戴支线·美梦成真·第二章"] = "Dunn side quest - Dreams Come True - Chapter 2",
    ["邓戴支线·美梦成真·第二章探案玩法"] = "Dunn side quest - Dreams Come True - Chapter 2 investigation gameplay",
    ["邓洛普"] = "Dunlop",
    ["邓炜恒"] = "Deng Weiheng",
    ["邓看窗外"] = "Dunn looks out the window",
    ["邓肯"] = "Duncan",
    ["邓肯·"] = "Duncan ",
    ["邢台"] = "Xingtai",
    ["那{{PlayerName}}，如果你是格尔曼，那个格尔曼，你想在什么样的地方掀起风浪呢？"] = "Then {{PlayerName}}, if you were Gehrman, that Gehrman, what kind of place would you want to stir up trouble in?",
    ["那{{大哥哥|大姐姐}}，等你有空的时候再来看我吧，说不定那时候我已经开出花啦。"] = "Then {{ big brother | big sister }}, come visit me again when you have time. Maybe by then, I'll have bloomed.",
    ["那“愚者”先生要归……"] = "Is Mr. Fool returning...",
    ["那“毒素专家”这个称号是怎么来的？"] = "Then where did the title \"Toxin Expert\" come from?",
    ["那“火种”呢？被偷走了？"] = "Then what about \"Kindling\"? Was it stolen?",
    ["那“祂”和伊妮德一起消失了吗？"] = "Then did \"He\" and Enid disappear together?",
    ["那……"] = "That...",
    ["那……也行！我哥哥好像就在那边，也许你们能遇见，这样就算你遇到危险也不怕，我哥哥可厉害了。"] = "That... works too! My brother seems to be over there; maybe you can meet him. That way, you won't have to worry even if you run into danger. My brother is very capable.",
    ["那……你们的薪水和待遇怎么样？"] = "Then... what about your salary and benefits?",
    ["那……你哥哥现在还好吗？"] = "Then... is your brother doing alright now?",
    ["那……奈拉小姐是一直在等缇苏小姐回来吗？"] = "Then... has Miss Naila been waiting for Miss Tisu to return?",
    ["那……就去把她的灵接出来吧，就当做晚间训练。"] = "Then... go and bring her spirit out, consider it evening training.",
    ["那……爸爸，你能教我操控风的方法吗？我、我真的很想和你去海上。"] = "Then... Dad, can you teach me how to control the wind? I, I really want to go to the sea with you.",
    ["那……缇苏小姐去哪了呢？"] = "Then... where did Miss Tisu go?",
    ["那……行 就来一把 现在是休息时间"] = "Well... okay, let's play a round, it's break time now.",
    ["那……行，就来一把，现在是休息时间。"] = "Well... fine, let's play one round, it's break time now.",
    ["那……那我加租一周。"] = "Then... then I'll add a week of rent.",
    ["那……难道是？！"] = "Then... could it be?!",
    ["那…我们去码头看真的！"] = "Then... let's go to the dock to see the real thing!",
    ["那、那个是？！"] = "Wh-what is that?!",
    ["那、那我再加半瓶黑兰德！这可是我最后的家当了！"] = "Th-then I'll add half a bottle of Black Land! This is all I have left!",
    ["那、那我该怎么报答您呢？"] = "T-then, how should I repay you?",
    ["那、那需要我做什么？"] = "W-what do I need to do?",
    ["那一刻的直觉告诉我，魔药彻底消化了。"] = "At that moment, my intuition told me that the potion had been completely digested.",
    ["那一刻，艾登就像一束光，照亮了我黑暗的生活，让我不再恐惧。只是我没想到，光也会有暗淡的时候……"] = "At that moment, Aiden was like a beam of light, illuminating my dark life and making me no longer afraid. I just didn't expect that light could also dim...",
    ["那一刻，艾登就像光，让我不再害怕夜晚。\n只是，光也会有暗淡的时候……"] = "At that moment, Aiden was like light, making me no longer fear the night. \n It's just that light also has its dim moments...",
    ["那一天，我突然听说……\r\n我父亲的真实身份！"] = "That day, I suddenly heard... \nthe truth about my father's identity!",
    ["那一定很辛苦……"] = "That must have been very hard...",
    ["那一定很辛苦吧。"] = "That must have been very hard.",
    ["那上周这出，也是他写的？"] = "So the one from last week was also written by him?",
    ["那上面都是些看不懂的鬼画符，我却差点因此死在下水道里。"] = "It was full of ghost symbols I couldn't understand, yet I almost died in the sewer because of it.",
    ["那下次吧。"] = "Then next time.",
    ["那不可能是蓝星，我妈妈专门用手指给我看的！"] = "That couldn't be the Blue Star, my mother specifically pointed it out to me with her finger!",
    ["那不就是研究咱们这里这些东西？"] = "Isn't that just studying the things we have here?",
    ["那不息的火光！"] = "That ceaseless flame!",
    ["那不是也挺厉害的？婚礼乐师那么多，会驱鸟的就你一个。"] = "Isn't that pretty amazing? There are so many wedding musicians, but you're the only one who can scare birds.",
    ["那不是你最喜欢的剧目吗？现在倒要怪我？"] = "Wasn't that your favorite play? Now you're blaming me?",
    ["那不是你的错。是封印物的副作用，是别人的阴谋。"] = "That wasn't your fault. It's the side effect of the Sealed Artifact, someone else's conspiracy.",
    ["那不是你的错，你被蜡烛引诱了。"] = "That was not your fault; you were lured by the candle.",
    ["那不是很好吗？"] = "Isn't that great?",
    ["那不是更应该死心吗。"] = "Doesn't that mean you should give up even more?",
    ["那不重要。靠岸的时候我又遇到了他，正好处理了那些腻人的点心。"] = "That's not important. I ran into him again when we docked, just as I was getting rid of those cloying pastries.",
    ["那东西会毁掉这里的一切！"] = "That thing will destroy everything here!",
    ["那两个人是……"] = "Those two are...",
    ["那两人想必就是白莉夫人和侠盗黑皇帝了……"] = "Those two must be Lady Beryl and the Phantom Thief Black Emperor...",
    ["那两位女仆，因为触碰黛西小姐手腕的符号，进入循环空间、没解开谜题而死？"] = "Did those two maids die because they touched the symbol on Miss Daisy's wrist, entered the loop space, and failed to solve the puzzle?",
    ["那两枚蛋斑点几乎分毫不差。差一点……"] = "Those two eggs' spots are almost identical. Just a little bit...",
    ["那个“它”正是……"] = "That \"it\" is precisely...",
    ["那个人……难道在做金币占卜？"] = "That person... could they be performing a gold coin divination?",
    ["那个人、那个男人说，只要这么做，我们就可以一起回家……家，我要回家……"] = "That person, that man said, as long as I did this, we could go home together... Home, I want to go home...",
    ["那个人好奇怪啊，从刚才到现在，怎么一直在那边自言自语？"] = "That person is so strange, why have they been talking to themselves over there since just now?",
    ["那个人并没有在意，反而露出了关切的神情。\n这是一张你熟悉的面孔——黑夜教会的托马斯神父。"] = "That person did not mind, instead revealing a concerned expression. \n This was a face you were familiar with—Father Thomas of the Church of the Night.",
    ["那个人是……"] = "That person is...",
    ["那个古董贩子跟你聊了什么，又是去看真品古董那套说辞？"] = "What did that antique dealer chat with you about? Was it that same old \"come see the real antiques\" spiel?",
    ["那个声音……好像是<h>梅丽莎</>"] = "That voice... it sounds like <h> Melissa </>",
    ["那个声音在说……火柴？"] = "That voice is saying... matches?",
    ["那个奇特的灰雾空间，也算是我的穿越“金手指”了。"] = "That peculiar gray fog space can be considered my transmigrator's \"cheat.\"",
    ["那个孩子，喜欢格斗，总是拖着一把阔剑跑来跑去，说想成为骑士。"] = "That child loved fighting, always dragging a broadsword around, saying he wanted to become a knight.",
    ["那个家伙…总以为自己是非凡的主宰，不知道一次失误就是万丈深渊。"] = "That guy... always thinks he is the master of the extraordinary, not knowing that one mistake is an abyss.",
    ["那个小女孩病得很重，现在最大的愿望就是想看一场小丑表演。唉，这么一个简单的承诺都被我搞砸了。"] = "That little girl is very ill, and her biggest wish right now is to see a Clown performance. Sigh, I messed up such a simple promise.",
    ["那个怪物"] = "That monster",
    ["那个怪物沿着这条路往前走了"] = "That monster went along this road",
    ["那个怪物！那个怪物往树林深处走了"] = "That monster! That monster went deep into the woods",
    ["那个探险家又来了，哦！女神庇佑，今天他千万不要点到我！"] = "That explorer is here again. Oh! Goddess Protection, I hope he doesn't pick me today!",
    ["那个时候，您不会觉得害怕吗？面对一位可能是神灵的存在？"] = "At that time, didn't you feel afraid? Facing an existence that might be a god?",
    ["那个时候，托马斯酿的麦芽酒香得能把隔壁镇子的酒鬼都勾过来。埃莉诺烤的派也是一绝，皮酥得咬一口能掉渣。 "] = "Back then, the ale Thomas brewed smelled so good it could lure drunks from the next town over. Eleanor's pies were also a masterpiece; the crust was so flaky it would crumble at a single bite.",
    ["那个没用……"] = "That one is useless...",
    ["那个灵魂生前是序列3的银骑士，死后……仍有序列4的实力。"] = "That soul was a Sequence 3 Silver Knight in life, and after death... it still has the strength of a Sequence 4.",
    ["那个烛台，我明明看着他拿走的！"] = "That candlestick, I clearly watched him take it away!",
    ["那个疯狂的戏剧家给我寄了张烧焦的戏票，约我在这个路口看演出。"] = "That crazy dramatist sent me a burnt theater ticket, asking me to watch a performance at this intersection.",
    ["那个瘸腿男人已经在门口转了十几圈了，鬼鬼祟祟的……要不待会跟师父说一声？"] = "That limping man has been circling the entrance a dozen times, acting all sneaky... should I tell the master later?",
    ["那个穿大衣的商人，开口就是三百金镑，说要把这里改成时髦的咖啡馆。 "] = "That merchant in the overcoat offered three hundred gold pounds right off the bat, saying he wanted to turn this place into a trendy cafe.",
    ["那个老东西又忘了拿药……"] = "That old thing forgot to take his medicine again...",
    ["那个能完成复仇的……“她”。"] = "The one who can complete the revenge... \"Her\".",
    ["那个艾登，整天打听他那失散的孩子，还幻想着找到孩子以后的生活。"] = "That Aiden, spending all day asking about his lost child, still fantasizing about what life would be like after finding them.",
    ["那个营销家庭美满、爱妻爱女的市长候选人，有个秘密情人，就在这个剧院当演员。"] = "That mayoral candidate who markets himself as having a happy family and loving his wife and daughter has a secret lover who is an actress at this theater.",
    ["那个角落比较隐蔽……去那边占卜好了。"] = "That corner is more secluded... I'll go there to perform divination.",
    ["那个计划也在进行了……虽然可能性很小。"] = "That plan is also underway... although the probability is very low.",
    ["那个计划也在进行了……虽然可能性很小，但工厂区的怨念与日俱增，末日将降临廷根，仪式也许会成功。"] = "That plan is also underway... although the possibility is small, the resentment in the factory district is growing day by day, and the apocalypse will descend upon Tingen. The ritual might succeed.",
    ["那个赌徒弟弟绝不是第一次管哥哥借钱。我可以想象，哥哥一次又一次地失望，然后绝望。"] = "That gambler brother of his definitely isn't borrowing money from him for the first time. I can imagine the brother being disappointed time and time again, and then falling into despair.",
    ["那个遮遮掩掩的家伙在找什么？线人？"] = "What is that sneaky guy looking for? An informant?",
    ["那个配方，应该永远不会被贴上苏勒的标签了。"] = "That formula will probably never be labeled with shillings.",
    ["那个骗子什么时候出来？"] = "When is that liar coming out?",
    ["那个黑影……真的是马丁的鬼魂吗？女神啊……"] = "That black shadow... is it really Martin's ghost? Goddess...",
    ["那个，我只是路过……"] = "Um, I'm just passing by...",
    ["那个？"] = "That?",
    ["那为什么会和“毒”扯上关系？"] = "Then why is it associated with \"poison\"?",
    ["那为什么会酗酒呢？"] = "Then why did he become an alcoholic?",
    ["那主石呢？"] = "And the main stone?",
    ["那么……"] = "Then...",
    ["那么……我出发了！"] = "Then... I'm off!",
    ["那么他看起来一定很严肃？"] = "Then he must look very serious?",
    ["那么周三？"] = "Then Wednesday?",
    ["那么周二？"] = "What about Tuesday?",
    ["那么多人为了国家战斗，可结果呢？大臣们签下了休战协议，哼！一切像个笑话……"] = "So many people fought for their country, but what was the result? The ministers signed an armistice agreement, hmph! Everything is like a joke...",
    ["那么多工厂，维斯塔选择送你去糖厂。明亮，温暖，甜蜜的东西才是生活的意义，也许这是他教你的最后一课。"] = "Of all the factories, Vista chose to send you to the sugar factory. Bright, warm, sweet things are the meaning of life; perhaps this was the last lesson he taught you.",
    ["那么大一个南瓜，我只是饿了，在底部挖了个孔，把南瓜软软的瓤掏光了而已啊……"] = "It was such a big pumpkin, I was just hungry, so I dug a hole in the bottom and scooped out the soft pulp...",
    ["那么当你读到这里 就打开留声机 播放我们喜欢的曲子"] = "Then when you read this, turn on the phonograph and play our favorite song.",
    ["那么我们对半分。"] = "Then we'll split them in half.",
    ["那么是正右侧还是斜右侧？"] = "Then is it directly to the right or diagonally to the right?",
    ["那么等会我们就在廷根湖的王国集合！"] = "Then we will meet at the Kingdom by Tingen Lake later!",
    ["那么请好好解释，不然明天我主编的桌上会摆着一份全新的评论稿！"] = "Then please explain yourself clearly, otherwise there will be a brand-new review draft on my editor-in-chief's desk tomorrow!",
    ["那么请尽情享受您的航程。船长希斯令·哈灵顿，愿为您效劳。"] = "Then please enjoy your voyage. Captain Hysling Harrington is at your service.",
    ["那么请问您们是否有兴趣……"] = "Then, may I ask if you are interested in...",
    ["那么请问行政大臣，廷根湖畔的杯子和火柴都是国库里的东西？"] = "Then may I ask, Minister of Administration, are the cups and matches by Tingen Lake items from the national treasury?",
    ["那么轻柔，又那么沉重……"] = "So gentle, yet so heavy...",
    ["那么这一切会给那些目光带来什么呢？"] = "Then what will all this bring to those gazes?",
    ["那么，3-888的下落……或许我已经找到了。"] = "Then, the whereabouts of 3-888... perhaps I have already found it.",
    ["那么，{{PlayerName}}，那时你闻到雏菊的清香了吗？\n<P_Yellow>（注意：不同的选择将让故事走向不同的结局。）</>"] = "Then, {{PlayerName}}, did you smell the fragrance of the daisies at that time? \n<P_Yellow> (Note: Different choices will lead the story to different endings.) </>",
    ["那么，{{PlayerName}}，那时你闻到雏菊的清香了吗？\\n<P_Yellow>（注意：不同的选择将让故事走向不同的结局。）</>"] = "Then, {{PlayerName}}, did you smell the faint scent of daisies back then?\\n<P_Yellow> (Note: Different choices will lead the story to different endings.)</>",
    ["那么，今天想聊些什么呢？"] = "So, what would you like to talk about today?",
    ["那么，再次被知识埋葬吧"] = "Then, be buried by knowledge once again",
    ["那么，对于这句诗，各位怎么看？"] = "So, what do you all think of this poem?",
    ["那么，我也该回家了……再次感谢您的帮助！"] = "Then, I should head home too... Thank you again for your help!",
    ["那么，我们开始吧……"] = "Then, let us begin...",
    ["那么，我该何时找您订购香水呢？"] = "Then, when should I come to you to order perfume?",
    ["那么，我这边还有一些工作要处理，先走一步了。"] = "Then, I have some work to deal with, I'll be going first.",
    ["那么，拿着这瓶醒神花露，它能帮黛西小姐恢复意识。"] = "Then, take this bottle of Awakening Flower Dew; it can help Miss Daisy regain consciousness.",
    ["那么，祝大家有个愉快的夜晚。"] = "Well then, I wish you all a pleasant evening.",
    ["那也是我的摊子，您需要些什么？"] = "That's my stall too, what do you need?",
    ["那也有可能是你根本就看错了，我反正才不会相信世界上有鬼魂。"] = "It's also possible that you were just mistaken. In any case, I won't believe there are ghosts in the world.",
    ["那也比一辈子困在码头上强！至少那些水手们、海盗们见识过真正的海上传奇！"] = "That's still better than being stuck on the docks for a lifetime! At least those sailors and pirates have witnessed true legends of the sea!",
    ["那也还是最后一步。"] = "That's still the last step.",
    ["那买束花带走吧！"] = "Then buy a bouquet to take with you!",
    ["那些亡灵没有智识，对你来说不会很危险。"] = "Those undead have no intellect, they won't be very dangerous to you.",
    ["那些人贩子——哔——我要是还活着——哔——"] = "Those human traffickers—beep—if I were still alive—beep—",
    ["那些人都被他吃了脑子……金狼必须死在这儿，现在。"] = "Those people all had their brains eaten by him... The Golden Wolf must die here, now.",
    ["那些坐在马车里的老爷？他们的日子可好过多了！"] = "Those gentlemen sitting in carriages? Their lives are much easier!",
    ["那些失踪的孩子们，还有我的小阿诺德就拜托你们了。毕竟我现在这副模样，似乎也做不了什么。"] = "Those missing children, and my little Arnold, I'll leave them to you. After all, in my current state, I don't seem to be able to do much.",
    ["那些失踪的孩子们，还有我的小阿诺德就拜托你们了。毕竟我现在这幅模样，似乎也做不了什么。"] = "I leave those missing children, and my little Arnold, to you. After all, in my current state, there doesn't seem to be much I can do.",
    ["那些工人们遇到的问题，最终结果会怎么样？"] = "What will be the final outcome for the problems those workers are facing?",
    ["那些年轻的孩子总想着去外面的世界，外面到底有什么好的！"] = "Those young children always think about going to the outside world. What is so good about the outside!",
    ["那些忙了一天、心里烦的人，来这儿坐一晚上，听她叫几声哥哥，走的时候脸上都是带着笑的。"] = "Those who have been busy all day and are troubled come here to sit for a night, hear her call them brother a few times, and they leave with smiles on their faces.",
    ["那些散落的日记，记载着过去斯卡纳的心声。"] = "Those scattered diaries record Skana's past inner voice.",
    ["那些数字？"] = "Those numbers?",
    ["那些是邓恩队长的，或许你听过他的事情，他是一个很好的人。"] = "Those are Captain Dunn's. Perhaps you've heard of him; he was a very good man.",
    ["那些有钱人就喜欢咱们这种没病痛，无牵挂的乡下姑娘。"] = "Those rich people just like us country girls who have no illnesses and no burdens.",
    ["那些爱情小说都是骗人的，吸血鬼会害人的！ "] = "Those romance novels are all lies; vampires will hurt people!",
    ["那些痴呆的议员拼命阻止法案的通过。"] = "Those senile councilors are desperately trying to stop the bill from passing.",
    ["那些看到最后一页的人，不是被知识杀死的。他们是看到了真理，然后满意地闭上了眼睛。这是求知者的幸福。"] = "Those who see the last page are not killed by knowledge. They see the truth and then close their eyes in satisfaction. This is the happiness of a seeker of knowledge.",
    ["那些绅士老爷们或许会嫌弃，但穿丝绸裙的女士有时候会心软。凯西娜，再教教他。"] = "Those gentlemen might look down on them, but ladies in silk dresses sometimes have soft hearts. Cassie, teach him again.",
    ["那些老爷太太们……"] = "Those gentlemen and ladies...",
    ["那些老爷太太们……应该一辈子都没吃过这种苦吧。"] = "Those masters and mistresses... they probably have never suffered like this in their entire lives.",
    ["那些老爷太太们应该一辈子都没吃过这种苦吧。"] = "Those masters and mistresses must have never suffered like this in their lives.",
    ["那些街上晃悠的行人全是欲望的化身——所以你尽管放手去干！干他个天翻地覆，用暴烈、疯狂的手段来维护这脆弱的秩序！"] = "Those pedestrians wandering the streets are all incarnations of desire—so feel free to go all out! Turn it upside down, and use violent, crazy means to maintain this fragile order!",
    ["那些被压榨的人还困在里面。我们得抓紧时间找到他！"] = "Those who are being exploited are still trapped inside. We must hurry and find him!",
    ["那些该死的野生非凡者，以为会变几个戏法就能逃脱法律的制裁？这次我绝不会让他们得逞，不允许发生任何意外！"] = "Those damn wild Beyonders, thinking they can escape legal sanctions just by knowing a few tricks? This time I will never let them succeed, and I will not allow any accidents to happen!",
    ["那些谜题的答案，是父亲曾经给我讲过的童话故事……"] = "The answers to those puzzles are the fairy tales my father used to tell me...",
    ["那些都是我的研究。"] = "Those are all part of my research.",
    ["那些隐藏空间，要通过隐藏的镜子进入，我已经找到它们，但没时间处理了……"] = "Those hidden spaces must be entered through hidden mirrors. I have already found them, but I don't have time to deal with them...",
    ["那今天去干嘛？"] = "Then what are we doing today?",
    ["那今晚，您只当被好好看着的人。"] = "Then tonight, you shall be the one who is properly looked at.",
    ["那他多半是个骗子。"] = "Then he's probably a swindler.",
    ["那他的孩子算不算相关物品？梅高欧丝怀上了他的孩子。我很遗憾，也很抱歉，当初以为兰尔乌斯是出众、卓越的年轻人，才介绍他们相识。"] = "Then does his child count as a related item? Megose is pregnant with his child. I am very sorry and regretful; I thought Ince Zangwill was an outstanding and excellent young man, which is why I introduced them.",
    ["那件事啊，懂的都懂，利益牵扯太大了。"] = "That matter, those who know, know; the interests involved are too great.",
    ["那件事啊，懂的都懂，利益牵扯太大了，里面水很深，你懂我意思吧？"] = "That matter, those who know, know; the interests involved are too great, the water is very deep, you know what I mean?",
    ["那件事情！"] = "That matter!",
    ["那件案子对你来说并不算危险。或许可以交给你，作为一次学习和历练。"] = "That case isn't dangerous for you. Perhaps I can leave it to you as a learning experience.",
    ["那件非凡物品吸引来了某种特殊存在，让霍克斯男爵察觉了异常，导致了霍克斯男爵的死亡。"] = "That Beyonder item attracted a certain special existence, which made Baron Hawkes notice the abnormality, leading to Baron Hawkes's death.",
    ["那件非凡物品让男爵察觉了异常，他发现自己被观察，发现某种东西藏在这座宅邸里。但也正因为它，吸引来了某种特殊的存在，导致了男爵的死。"] = "That Beyonder item made the Baron aware of the abnormality; he discovered he was being observed and found that something was hidden in this mansion. But it was precisely because of it that it attracted a certain special existence, leading to the Baron's death.",
    ["那会影响老师以后的创作吗？剧团里的演员还等着排练呢。"] = "Will that affect the teacher's future work? The actors in the troupe are waiting to rehearse.",
    ["那位主教……你们认识他多久了？"] = "That bishop... how long have you known him?",
    ["那位喝醉的是佛尔思小姐？她在这里做什么？"] = "Is that drunk person Miss Fors? What is she doing here?",
    ["那位大人物给我提了许多有益的修改建议，但即使我按照建议修改完毕，这依然是一篇平庸的新闻稿，只能在内页刊发。这是合理的。"] = "That big shot gave me many helpful suggestions for revisions, but even after I finished revising according to those suggestions, it remained a mediocre press release that could only be published on the inner pages. This is reasonable.",
    ["那位夫人……"] = "That lady...",
    ["那位夫人难道是退伍的女兵吗？但即使是黑夜女神的信徒，也很少有被征召入伍的情况……"] = "Could that lady be a retired soldier? But even among the believers of the Evernight Goddess, it is rare to be conscripted into the army...",
    ["那位女士怎么了？"] = "What's wrong with that lady?",
    ["那位女士，又来了啊。"] = "That lady is here again.",
    ["那位存在……难道说是——"] = "That existence... could it be—",
    ["那位富商的裙子挺精致的，但款式有点旧，像几十年前的。"] = "That wealthy merchant's dress is quite exquisite, but the style is a bit old, like something from decades ago.",
    ["那位小女孩，是您的……"] = "That little girl, is she your...",
    ["那位邪神不仅污染你，还正试图污染整个廷根。"] = "That evil god is not only corrupting you, but is also trying to corrupt the entire Tingen.",
    ["那位邪神从未放弃污染你。你身上的封印虽然稍有波动，但还算稳定。"] = "That evil god has never stopped trying to corrupt you. Although the seal on you has fluctuated slightly, it is still stable.",
    ["那位？"] = "That one?",
    ["那低序列者呢？"] = "What about low-sequence individuals?",
    ["那你不应该练习面试的问题吗？"] = "Then shouldn't you be practicing interview questions?",
    ["那你为什么不走？"] = "Then why don't you leave?",
    ["那你为什么在祭坛边跳舞？"] = "Then why are you dancing by the altar?",
    ["那你为什么要卖这些资料？"] = "Then why are you selling these materials?",
    ["那你为什么还去湖边许愿？"] = "Then why do you still go to the lake to make wishes?",
    ["那你为什么还在这里？"] = "Then why are you still here?",
    ["那你乖乖站在这里，哥哥给你准备了惊喜。"] = "Then you stand here obediently, big brother has prepared a surprise for you.",
    ["那你们刚才……"] = "Then what were you just...",
    ["那你们找到什么了？"] = "So what have you found?",
    ["那你先想办法攒点路费吧，别光说不做，天天喝酒打牌。"] = "Then you should find a way to save up some travel money instead of just talking, drinking, and playing cards all day.",
    ["那你出现在这里的原因是……"] = "Then the reason you are here is...",
    ["那你别通灵了，序列7转过来？"] = "Then stop doing spirit mediumship, why not switch to Sequence 7?",
    ["那你去找吧，找到我失踪很久的结婚戒指，找到了就给你。"] = "Then go look for it; find my long-lost wedding ring, and if you find it, I'll give it to you.",
    ["那你又为什么会出现在这里？嗯？"] = "Then why are you here? Hmm?",
    ["那你听说，这里每天要做奇怪的事情了吗？"] = "Then have you heard about the strange things that happen here every day?",
    ["那你呢，你也会爱上我吗？"] = "What about you? Will you fall in love with me too?",
    ["那你呢？"] = "What about you?",
    ["那你呢？你也会长大。"] = "What about you? You will grow up too.",
    ["那你呢？这才六点钟，这么早就出门？"] = "What about you? It's only six o'clock; why are you leaving so early?",
    ["那你喜欢什么样性格的呢？"] = "Then what kind of personality do you like?",
    ["那你对失控前的经历有印象么？"] = "Then do you have any impression of your experiences before losing control?",
    ["那你就是要解决爱情难题的特制饮品喽~ 保证解决你的所有恋爱问题！"] = "So you're the special drink that solves love problems~ I guarantee it will solve all your romantic troubles!",
    ["那你就跟着我。家里的空椅子、空盘子，正好给你用吧。"] = "Then you can follow me. The empty chair and empty bowl at home will be perfect for you.",
    ["那你就问对人了！这里是不错的旅游小镇，附近的城市——尤其是廷根市，有很多人愿意趁着周末过来走一趟呢。"] = "Then you've asked the right person! This is a great tourist town. Many people from nearby cities—especially Tingen—are willing to come over for a trip on the weekend.",
    ["那你快出来把钱给我！"] = "Then come out and give me the money!",
    ["那你怎么会来到海岸线餐厅，还和茜安合作？"] = "Then how did you come to the Coastline Restaurant and cooperate with Cian?",
    ["那你想好下次和安多约会的地方了吗？餐厅会不会有点老套？"] = "So, have you thought of a place for your next date with Andor? Would a restaurant be a bit cliché?",
    ["那你想让我找你吗？"] = "Then do you want me to come to see you?",
    ["那你或许可以尝试一下占卜，说不定可以给你带来新的解决办法。"] = "Then perhaps you can try divination; it might bring you a new solution.",
    ["那你打我干什么?奇了怪了，难道是出于正义？"] = "Then why did you hit me? How strange, was it out of justice?",
    ["那你打算单干吗？"] = "Are you planning to go solo then?",
    ["那你是谁？"] = "Then who are you?",
    ["那你是难过还是高兴？"] = "So are you sad or happy?",
    ["那你是难过！"] = "Then you are sad!",
    ["那你是高兴。"] = "Then you are happy.",
    ["那你来这里做什么？"] = "Then what are you doing here?",
    ["那你看下这份契约，现在大家喜欢叫合同。"] = "Take a look at this covenant. People like to call it a contract nowadays.",
    ["那你算是挑对了，这是今天早上我刚从我家地里摘的南瓜！我帮你切开打包！"] = "You've picked the right one; I just picked this from my field this morning! Let me cut it up and pack it for you!",
    ["那你算来对地方了。不过光看跳舞多没意思，要不要试试……让这里的先生陪你坐坐？"] = "Then you've come to the right place. But watching a dance is boring; why not try... having the gentlemen here sit with you?",
    ["那你练的这个是谁告诉你的？"] = "Then who told you to practice this?",
    ["那你觉得，剧本差在哪儿？"] = "Then where do you think the script failed?",
    ["那你说该怎么办吧。"] = "Then you tell me what we should do.",
    ["那你跑什么啊？"] = "Then why are you running?",
    ["那你躲开呀。"] = "Then move away.",
    ["那你还是先吃饭？"] = "Then should you eat first?",
    ["那你还是先完成手上的任务吧，现在追查“蒲公英”很可能遇到危险。"] = "Then you should finish the task at hand first. Tracking down \"Dandelion\" now is likely to be dangerous.",
    ["那你还跑？"] = "Then why are you running?",
    ["那你需要一杯 “梦想成真”。这款饮品入口时有蜂蜜般甜蜜柔软的味道，片刻之后烈酒基底则会慢慢上涌，让你心跳加速。"] = "Then you need a glass of 'Dream Come True'. This drink has a honey-like sweet and soft taste upon entry, and a moment later, the base of strong liquor will slowly rise, making your heart race.",
    ["那便永远\r\n记住我的声音吧。"] = "Then forever\nremember my voice.",
    ["那便陪伴她"] = "Then Accompany Her",
    ["那倒不用……我可以上台试试。"] = "That won't be necessary... I can go up and try.",
    ["那倒也是。"] = "That's true too.",
    ["那倒没有，弗莱队长派我调查核实几个失踪案信息。"] = "Not really, Captain Frye sent me to investigate and verify some information on the disappearance cases.",
    ["那倒霉的蜡烛！是教会<P_Yellow>济贫</>发的，我特意多抢了两根，结果根本点不着。"] = "That unlucky candle! It was distributed by the church for <P_Yellow> poverty relief </>. I specifically grabbed two extra, but they wouldn't light at all.",
    ["那儿有个人的行为好奇怪啊，用灵视看看吧"] = "That person's behavior is very strange. Use spirit vision to take a look.",
    ["那几个到处捣乱的混小子藏哪儿去了？等我逮到他们，非得让他们知道点规矩不可！"] = "Where did those troublemaking brats hide? Once I catch them, I'll make sure they learn a thing or two about rules!",
    ["那刚才怎么回事？你遇到麻烦了？"] = "Then what was that about just now? Are you in trouble?",
    ["那副作用呢？"] = "What about the side effects?",
    ["那副眼镜……我捡到它时，以为是女神给我的恩赐。以为用它就能让你“自然而然”同意捐赠土地。"] = "That pair of glasses... when I found it, I thought it was a gift from the Goddess. I thought using it would make you \"naturally\" agree to donate the land.",
    ["那副眼镜……镜片是水晶的。不是普通水晶，有灵性波动。"] = "That pair of glasses... the lenses are crystal. Not ordinary crystal; there's a fluctuation of spirituality.",
    ["那十五苏勒，也要三十只呢，可不好抓啊！"] = "Fifteen soli for thirty of them? That's not easy to catch!",
    ["那占卜的意义是？"] = "Then what is the meaning of divination?",
    ["那危机感有什么用？"] = "Then what's the use of a sense of crisis?",
    ["那又如何，我记得生前的一切，还能继续经营书店，和知识打交道。"] = "So what? I remember everything from before I died, and I can continue running the bookstore and dealing with knowledge.",
    ["那又怎么样？我是一只饿了很久的可怜小猫咪！"] = "So what? I am a poor little kitten who has been hungry for a long time!",
    ["那又怎样？我做的可是这个镇上最清闲的工作。"] = "So what? I have the most leisurely job in this town.",
    ["那口锅怎么不见了？"] = "Where did that pot go?",
    ["那只小猫再也见不到了，真的很舍不得。"] = "I'll never see that kitten again, I'm really reluctant.",
    ["那只是分身而已。下次寄生在你身上，怎么样？"] = "That was just a clone. How about I parasitize you next time?",
    ["那只是表面，实际上，他是猎龙帮的缔造者，也是第一位老大。"] = "That's just on the surface. In reality, he is the founder of the Dragon Hunter Gang and also the first boss.",
    ["那只章鱼，你也看到了？"] = "That octopus, you saw it too?",
    ["那只能等了……"] = "Then I guess I'll just have to wait...",
    ["那叫什么好呢？"] = "Then what should we call it?",
    ["那可不只是矛盾！"] = "That's not just a conflict!",
    ["那可不是一些容易说服的人，完全能猜想到您辛劳的处境，愿女神保佑您！"] = "Those are not easy people to persuade. I can fully imagine your difficult situation. May the Goddess bless you!",
    ["那可不是随随便便就能操控的，刚入塔罗学派的学生我都不推荐，毕竟那需要控制好冰和火的力量。"] = "That is not something you can control casually. I don't recommend it to students who have just joined the Tarot Club; after all, it requires controlling the powers of ice and fire well.",
    ["那可不是随随便便就能操控的，刚入塔罗学派的学生我都不推荐，毕竟那需要控制好冰霜和火焰的力量。"] = "That's not something you can just control casually. I don't recommend it for students who have just joined the Tarot Club; after all, that requires controlling the power of frost and fire.",
    ["那可不能错过！"] = "Then I can't miss that!",
    ["那可不行！我还打算趁学生们有热情，在晚上多开几节课呢！"] = "That won't do! I still intend to take advantage of the students' enthusiasm and hold a few more classes in the evening!",
    ["那可以看看文德尔街的公寓房，很适合您这样的单身精英人士，就在豪尔斯街的北侧，也是在富裕的北区。"] = "Then you can look at the apartment on Wendell Street. It is very suitable for a single elite like you. It's on the north side of Howls Street, also in the wealthy North District.",
    ["那可太多了，如果你拿了冠军，你会成为这一带的知名人物，上报纸头条，获得数之不尽的财富！"] = "There's so much to gain! If you win the championship, you'll become a well-known figure in this area, make the newspaper headlines, and gain endless wealth!",
    ["那可是不小的一笔钱，说不定我还可以给爸爸妈妈寄去一些。"] = "That's quite a sum of money. Maybe I can even send some to my mom and dad.",
    ["那可是我们鲁恩王国在苏尼亚海殖民统治的支点，数一数二的大城！是神灵许诺的流淌着奶和蜜酒的宝藏之地！"] = "That is the fulcrum of our Loen Kingdom's colonial rule in the Sonia Sea, one of the top major cities! It is the treasure land flowing with milk and honey promised by the gods!",
    ["那可是托人从贝克兰德最有名的钓具店买回来的！"] = "That was bought from the most famous fishing tackle shop in Backlund!",
    ["那可真够呛。对了，听说圣数教堂最近有免费的医疗救助，你可以去看看。"] = "That's really tough. By the way, I heard the Holy Number Cathedral has free medical aid recently, you should go check it out.",
    ["那可真是糟糕"] = "That's terrible",
    ["那可要努力了，那里住的都是有钱人。"] = "That will take some effort, only rich people live there.",
    ["那可说不准了。"] = "That's hard to say.",
    ["那名超凡者是律师途径序列X，能力是XXX，演讲区域已经被禁止使用超凡能力。"] = "That Beyonder is a Lawyer pathway Sequence X, with the ability XXX; the speech area has been prohibited from using Beyonder powers.",
    ["那名黑裙女士已经离开了。"] = "The lady in the black dress has already left.",
    ["那后天呢？"] = "Then the day after tomorrow?",
    ["那后来呢？"] = "And then what happened?",
    ["那后来呢？你换班的时候他还在吗？"] = "And then? Was he still there when you changed shifts?",
    ["那后来您是怎么成为船长的？"] = "Then how did you become a captain later?",
    ["那咆哮的海，是众神斟满的酒杯！"] = "That roaring sea is the wine glass filled by the gods!",
    ["那咋了"] = "So what?",
    ["那哪里能买到呢？你懂的，我也有个朋友需要。"] = "Then where can I buy it? You know, I have a friend who needs it too.",
    ["那团亮晶晶的光团是什么？"] = "What is that shimmering ball of light?",
    ["那在这里休息一下，一会我们再去教堂。"] = "Then rest here for a while, we'll go to the church later.",
    ["那块地我早就准备好了。不是因为你用封印物影响了我——因为那是你应得的。"] = "I had already prepared that piece of land. Not because you used the Sealed Artifact to influence me—but because it's what you deserve.",
    ["那块太阳很轻，就像一片羽毛的重量，但却点亮了她的整个梦。"] = "That piece of the sun was very light, like the weight of a feather, but it lit up her entire dream.",
    ["那块怀表，我猜一定和他一起下葬了。"] = "That pocket watch, I bet it was buried with him.",
    ["那块记忆碎片被锁在围栏里面！"] = "That memory fragment is locked inside the fence!",
    ["那外表斯文有礼，行动却疯狂的冒险家，有着令四王七将都恐惧的名字——格尔曼！没错，就是他，大冒险家，疯狂的海盗猎人，格尔曼·斯帕罗！"] = "That adventurer who looks gentle and polite but acts like a madman has a name that makes the Four Kings and Seven Generals fear him—Gehrman! That's right, it's him, the great adventurer, the mad pirate hunter, Gehrman Sparrow!",
    ["那天 两千年的黑暗 终被光明刺穿"] = "That day, the two thousand years of darkness were finally pierced by light.",
    ["那天他半夜撬我门，\r\n我都忍啦！"] = "He picked the lock to my door in the middle of the night that day,\nand I even tolerated that!",
    ["那天在海上，我开枪杀了他，并从他的尸体上拿到了这块怀表。所以我才从照片后的信息中知道了他叫贾斯汀，并找到了他的家，和他的妻子雪莉。"] = "That day at sea, I shot and killed him, and took this pocket watch from his corpse. That's why I knew his name was Justin from the information behind the photo, and found his home and his wife, Shirley.",
    ["那天我刚播下种子，知识教会的人就来偷袭了……后勤只有我一个人，所以……"] = "That day, I had just sown the seeds when the people from the Church of Knowledge launched a sneak attack... I was the only one in logistics, so...",
    ["那天我正垂头丧气地走在路上，\r\n想着我和梅兰妮白天吵的架。"] = "That day I was walking down the street, feeling dejected,\nthinking about the argument I had with Melanie during the day.",
    ["那天晚上她出现了——站在床边，像生前一样。什么都没说，就那么站着，站到天亮。"] = "That night, she appeared—standing by the bed, just like when she was alive. She didn't say anything, just stood there until dawn.",
    ["那天晚上，小姐发起了高烧，我们就请乔纳尔医生过来治疗。小姐服药后就睡着了，所以我们整晚都没去打扰。"] = "That night, the young lady developed a high fever, so we invited Dr. Jonar to treat her. After the young lady took the medicine, she fell asleep, so we didn't disturb her all night.",
    ["那天有个客人花高价点我，想让我提供“特殊服务”……"] = "The other day a guest paid a high price to book me, wanting me to provide 'special services'...",
    ["那天起 神不再回应我们"] = "From that day on, God no longer responded to us.",
    ["那天，我是故意要去\r\n试探山姆的！"] = "That day, I went to test Sam\non purpose!",
    ["那太好了！您一定很方便回俱乐部吧，能否请您将这些书带回去呢？"] = "That's great! It must be very convenient for you to return to the club, could you please take these books back?",
    ["那太好了，也许你很快就能买脚踏车了。"] = "That's great, maybe you'll be able to buy a bicycle soon.",
    ["那太好了，希望您一辈子不用来罗森民俗草药店。"] = "That's great, I hope you never have to come to the Rosen Folk Herbal Shop for the rest of your life.",
    ["那太好了，我去恶龙酒吧看看她。"] = "That's great, I'll go to the Evil Dragon Bar to see her.",
    ["那太遗憾了，我听说那是全大陆最繁华的城市，您以后有空可以去观光。"] = "That's a pity, I heard it's the most prosperous city on the continent; you can go sightseeing when you have time in the future.",
    ["那她去了哪里？有没有告诉你什么时候回来？"] = "Then where did she go? Did she tell you when she would be back?",
    ["那她实际上的身份呢？"] = "Then what is her actual identity?",
    ["那她还在等什么呢？"] = "Then what is she waiting for?",
    ["那好吧……"] = "Alright then...",
    ["那好吧。"] = "Alright then.",
    ["那如果快速摇扇呢？"] = "What if you shake the fan quickly?",
    ["那如果遇到必须花钱的情况呢？"] = "Then what if you encounter a situation where you must spend money?",
    ["那姑娘逃跑时，一只鞋卡在火炉口……"] = "When that girl ran away, one of her shoes got stuck in the fireplace...",
    ["那孩子胆子小，却很诚实，连偷懒被发现都会脸红一整天。"] = "That child is timid but very honest; he even blushes all day if he's caught slacking off.",
    ["那它可能是来找东西的！就像我上次找不到玩具熊那样着急。"] = "Then maybe it was looking for something! Just like how anxious I get when I can't find my teddy bear.",
    ["那它成功逗笑了多少人？"] = "Then how many people did it successfully make laugh?",
    ["那它的名字叫？"] = "Then what is its name?",
    ["那实在太感激了！麻烦您务必为我们争取一个考试名额。"] = "I would be so grateful! Please, you must secure an exam spot for us.",
    ["那实在是太好了，我不知道该如何感谢你！请拿着这个，这是老约翰的遗产，他没有孩子，现在都归你了。"] = "That is truly wonderful! I don't know how to thank you! Please take this; it is Old John's inheritance. He had no children, so it all belongs to you now.",
    ["那实在是太感激了！麻烦一定要为我们争取一个考试名额。"] = "I am truly grateful! Please, you must secure an examination spot for us.",
    ["那家伙在楼上站了半天了，不知道到底在干嘛？"] = "That guy has been standing upstairs for a long time, I wonder what he's actually doing?",
    ["那家伙很神秘……酒保亚历克斯告诉我，他是最近才出现在恶龙酒吧的，每次都是一个人坐在角落喃喃自语，有时候还会露出古怪的笑容。"] = "That guy is very mysterious... The bartender, Alex, told me that he only appeared at the Evil Dragon Bar recently. Every time, he sits alone in the corner muttering to himself, and sometimes he even shows a strange smile.",
    ["那家伙身上一股酸臭味，猫咪的嗅觉很灵敏的！相比他的痛苦，我只是更担心猫咪的痛苦！"] = "That guy smells sour and foul; a cat's sense of smell is very sensitive! Compared to his pain, I'm just more worried about the cat's pain!",
    ["那家店的暗号是“醉汉”！"] = "The password for that shop is \"Drunkard\"!",
    ["那对母子是在等谁吗？"] = "Is that mother and son waiting for someone?",
    ["那封信呢？"] = "What about that letter?",
    ["那小子刚露脸就冲自己脚底下砸了个破罐子，满世界浓烟臭得像个绝对不能打开的狼鱼罐头。等挥开这团糟臭的气体，就只剩轮胎尖叫的尾音了。行啊，喜欢玩赛跑是吧？今晚廷根的马路归我管！"] = "That kid smashed a jar at his own feet the moment he showed his face, and the thick smoke smelled like a can of wolf-fish that should never be opened. By the time the foul stench cleared, only the screech of tires remained. Fine, you want to race? The streets of Tingen are mine tonight!",
    ["那小家伙，难道又跑到书店去了？"] = "That little one, did he run off to the bookstore again?",
    ["那就——一起和安西娅玩游戏吧！"] = "Then—let's play a game with Anthea!",
    ["那就……再做一个梦！{{PlayerName}}，你真是个天才！"] = "Then... let's have another dream! {{PlayerName}}, you really are a genius!",
    ["那就……再来一把，最后一把！"] = "Then... one more round, the last one!",
    ["那就……让我看看你最近的成长吧！"] = "Then... let me see your recent growth!",
    ["那就买银色吧！不管怎样，从今天开始，我不用再问别人现在几点了！"] = "Then I'll buy the silver one! Regardless, from today on, I don't have to ask others what time it is!",
    ["那就买银色吧！不管怎样，从今天开始，我不用问别人现在几点了！"] = "Then I'll buy the silver one! Regardless, from today on, I don't have to ask others what time it is!",
    ["那就依次找找看你的报道。"] = "Then let's look for your reports one by one.",
    ["那就再让我见识一下，他守护的“勇气”与“牺牲”。"] = "Then let me see again the \"courage\" and \"sacrifice\" he protects.",
    ["那就别做白日梦了，即使有好运，也不会砸到我们头上。"] = "Then don't daydream. Even if there is good luck, it won't fall on our heads.",
    ["那就别计划了，天气好就晒太阳，下雨就睡懒觉，明天的事明天再说。"] = "Then stop planning. If the weather is nice, bask in the sun; if it rains, sleep in. Leave tomorrow's worries for tomorrow.",
    ["那就动手吧，爱管闲事的好心人。"] = "Then get to work, meddlesome kind-hearted person.",
    ["那就太感谢你了！"] = "Then thank you very much!",
    ["那就好"] = "That's good",
    ["那就好 我骑得还不熟练"] = "That's good. I'm not very skilled at riding yet.",
    ["那就好，今天天气好，出门晒晒太阳正合适。"] = "That's good. The weather is nice today, perfect for going out to soak up the sun.",
    ["那就好，你可千万不要出声，我在蹲守一件大新闻！"] = "That's good, you must not make a sound. I'm staking out a big scoop!",
    ["那就好，我骑得还不熟练。"] = "That's good, I'm not very skilled at riding yet.",
    ["那就好，记得收束起逸散的灵性。走吧，外面还有委托在等你。"] = "That's good. Remember to restrain your dissipating spirituality. Let's go, there are still commissions waiting for you outside.",
    ["那就对了。接下来几天保持克制，不要轻易触碰你“觉得自己能办到”的新能力。灵性需要磨合，就像新的肌肉需要适应使用方式。"] = "That's right. Keep it restrained for the next few days, and don't easily touch the new abilities you 'feel you can handle.' Spirituality needs to be broken in, just like new muscles need to adapt to how they are used.",
    ["那就帮我擦干净摊子。"] = "Then help me wipe the stall clean.",
    ["那就开始散步吧。"] = "Then let's start our walk.",
    ["那就把它留在这儿吧，比起我的破屋子，布丁一定更喜欢这里。"] = "Then let's leave it here. Compared to my broken house, Pudding must like it here better.",
    ["那就拍吧……虽然面对镜头总会让我有点不自在。不过你来拍的话，我好像能放松一些——这种时候，总得有个可信赖的人在场。"] = "Then take it... although facing the camera always makes me a bit uncomfortable. But if you are the one taking it, I seem to be able to relax a bit—at times like this, there must be someone trustworthy present.",
    ["那就拿起武器，跟上我，去战斗！"] = "Then pick up your weapons, follow me, and go fight!",
    ["那就是一个圆形了，哪里是正午呢？"] = "That would be a circle; where is noon?",
    ["那就是侠盗黑皇帝吗？几年前我就听说过他的事迹，处决人贩卡平真是大快人心！"] = "Is that the Vigilante Black Emperor? I heard about his deeds a few years ago. Executing the human trafficker Karpen was truly satisfying!",
    ["那就是复仇！"] = "That is revenge!",
    ["那就是我们大多数人的下场！这些该死的走私贩！"] = "That's the fate of most of us! These damn smugglers!",
    ["那就是我们常点的老维尔餐厅的老板，老维尔先生。"] = "That is Mr. Will, the owner of the Old Will Restaurant where we often eat.",
    ["那就是拉姆德古堡。游客都是为了这古堡来的。"] = "That is Lamud Castle. Tourists come here for this ancient castle.",
    ["那就是祈求女神的庇佑！女神不会放弃任何一个信徒！"] = "That is to pray for the Goddess's protection! The Goddess will not abandon any believer!",
    ["那就更不知道了，不过我估计着，应该和黑夜的值夜者差不多，是什么教会的官方人员吧。别的不说，我醒了以后，就喜欢在金秋湖四处转，杀那些失控非凡的东西，可带劲了。"] = "I have no idea about that either, but I reckon it's probably similar to the Nighthawks of the Evernight, some kind of official church personnel. Besides, ever since I woke up, I've enjoyed wandering around Golden Autumn Lake, killing those Beyonder creatures that have lost control. It's quite a thrill.",
    ["那就来！"] = "Then let's do it!",
    ["那就用你的方式，继续“打扫”下去。别让这座城市变得过于“安静”了。"] = "Then use your own way to continue 'cleaning'. Don't let this city become too 'quiet'.",
    ["那就直说，别绕弯子，女孩子都能听出来的。"] = "Then just say it directly, don't beat around the bush. Girls can tell what you mean.",
    ["那就看看谁会赢吧！"] = "Then let's see who wins!",
    ["那就等你们的好消息了。"] = "Then I'll wait for your good news.",
    ["那就等到我们有鱼竿，或者找杰克借鱼竿。"] = "Then we'll wait until we have one, or borrow one from Jack.",
    ["那就要看谢尔敏先生愿不愿意继续优化配方了……"] = "That depends on whether Mr. Shermin is willing to continue optimizing the formula...",
    ["那就让我们贯彻到底"] = "Then let us carry it through to the end",
    ["那就让我尝尝，你们血肉的味道！"] = "Then let me taste the flavor of your flesh and blood!",
    ["那就让我看尽一切吧。"] = "Then let me see everything.",
    ["那就试试罗塞尔大帝的《小星星》吧。"] = "Then let's try Emperor Roselle's 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star'.",
    ["那就这些吧，给你零钱。"] = "That's all then, here's the change.",
    ["那就麻烦你们了。"] = "Then I'll leave it to you.",
    ["那屋里的动静……今晚又该睡不着了。"] = "The commotion in that room... I won't be able to sleep again tonight.",
    ["那屋里的动静……今晚又该睡不着了。 "] = "The commotion in that room... I won't be able to sleep again tonight.",
    ["那屋里肯定有不干净的东西，难道没人能管一下吗！"] = "There must be something unclean in that room. Can't anyone do something about it!",
    ["那岂不是……比霍尔伯爵家的阿尔弗雷德先生序列还高了？"] = "Doesn't that mean... you have a higher Sequence than Mr. Alfred of the Earl Hall family?",
    ["那工人们遇到的问题，最终结果会怎么样？"] = "What will be the final outcome for the problems the workers are facing?",
    ["那工匠什么时候修好？"] = "When will the craftsman finish the repairs?",
    ["那平时认真学习的学生呢？他们付出了更多努力，得到的是相似的回报。"] = "What about the students who study diligently? They put in more effort, yet they receive similar rewards.",
    ["那年春天来临前，他们即将订婚，一场猛烈的肺病却将她带去了女神的神国。"] = "Before spring arrived that year, they were about to get engaged, but a violent lung disease took her to the Goddess's kingdom.",
    ["那座雕像……已经很残破了，甚至缺少一些部件。"] = "That statue... is already very broken, and even missing some parts.",
    ["那当然。再见，汤姆，也祝你一切顺利！"] = "Of course. Goodbye, Tom, and I wish you all the best too!",
    ["那当然。至少现在，我是您唯一的“演奏家”。 "] = "Of course. At least for now, I'm your only \"performer\".",
    ["那当然很好……"] = "That would certainly be nice...",
    ["那当然是因为……哦，那些乡下人的事我怎么会知道呢？我只关心能换多少便士，阁下。"] = "That's because... oh, how would I know about those country bumpkin matters? I only care about how many pennies I can get, my lord.",
    ["那当然！"] = "Of course!",
    ["那当然！蒸汽列车每天凌晨会把全国的报刊送到我们廷根，哪怕是凛冬郡的报纸也能帮您订阅。"] = "Of course! The steam train delivers newspapers from all over the country to our Tingen every morning. I can even help you subscribe to newspapers from Winter County.",
    ["那当然，我总结了一本《阿罗德斯问答攻略大全》，这可是一次次试出来的。资料证明，阿罗德斯大人不会太过为难学员的。"] = "Of course, I've compiled a \"Complete Guide to Arrodes' Q&A,\" which I tested time and time again. The data proves that Lord Arrodes won't make things too difficult for students.",
    ["那当然，我总结了一本《阿罗德斯问答攻略大全》，这可是一次次试出来的。资料证明，魔镜不会太过为难学员的。"] = "Of course, I've compiled a 'Complete Guide to Arrodes' Q&A', which was tested time and time again. Data proves that the magic mirror won't make things too difficult for students.",
    ["那当然，票我都让人买好了，双人连座。 "] = "Of course, I already had someone buy the tickets, two seats together.",
    ["那当然，老维尔餐厅价格实惠，味道也很不错。"] = "Of course, Old Will's Restaurant is affordable and tastes very good too.",
    ["那当然，这是戴里克主教大人给我布置的任务，编写《愚者圣典》的新章节。"] = "Of course, this is a quest assigned to me by Bishop Derrick, to write a new chapter for the \"Book of the Fool\".",
    ["那很好。"] = "That's great.",
    ["那很辛苦吧？"] = "That must be very hard, right?",
    ["那得看您怎么聊了。有的人，就真的只是聊天；有的人呢，聊高兴了就能谈成一笔生意；<P_Heart>（低声）</>还有的人，聊着聊着，就去二楼了。"] = "That depends on how you chat. Some people really just chat; some people, once they're in a good mood, can strike a business deal; <P_Heart>(Low voice)</> and some people, while chatting, end up going to the second floor.",
    ["那必须是这儿专门的拍照花墙！趁着阳光，拍出来别提会有多好看了！"] = "That has to be the special photo flower wall here! Take advantage of the sunlight, you can't imagine how beautiful it will look in photos!",
    ["那怎么不进去？"] = "Then why don't you go in?",
    ["那怎么办？"] = "Then what should I do?",
    ["那怎么还闷闷不乐？"] = "Then why are you still so gloomy?",
    ["那您……"] = "Then you...",
    ["那您为什么会离开黑荆棘？"] = "Then why did you leave Blackthorn?",
    ["那您之前也写过吗？"] = "Then did you write any before?",
    ["那您会怎么回答？"] = "Then how do you answer?",
    ["那您卖票吗？卖给我，高价回收。"] = "Then are you selling tickets? Sell them to me, I'll buy them at a high price.",
    ["那您呢？"] = "Then what about you?",
    ["那您呢？您选哪个？"] = "And you? Which one do you choose?",
    ["那您在这里钓鱼的意图是？"] = "Then what is your intention for fishing here?",
    ["那您打算怎么解决味道问题？"] = "Then how do you plan to solve the taste problem?",
    ["那您明天再来。"] = "Then come back tomorrow.",
    ["那您是否知道一位叫福戈的孩子，他是我们当中的一员吗？"] = "Then, do you know a child named Fogo? Is he one of us?",
    ["那您是怎么……"] = "Then how did you...",
    ["那您最常用的占卜方法是什么？"] = "Then what is your most commonly used divination method?",
    ["那您看……这件如何？这条羊毛裙外表是朴素的浅灰，内衬却用的东方进口丝绸，低调却又奢华。"] = "Then how about... this one? This wool skirt looks simple and light gray on the outside, but the lining is made of imported Eastern silk, low-key yet luxurious.",
    ["那您觉得最大的风险是什么？"] = "Then what do you think is the biggest risk?",
    ["那您觉得，他们真的能通过这个投机取巧的方式学到东西吗？"] = "Then do you think they can really learn anything through this shortcut?",
    ["那您面对尸体的时候，不会感到害怕吗？"] = "Then, when you face corpses, don't you feel afraid?",
    ["那意味着“请离我远些”。而把扇子竖直抵着下巴，是在说“我愿与您交谈”。"] = "That means 'Please stay away from me.' And holding the fan vertically against the chin is saying, 'I am willing to talk to you.'",
    ["那我7便士就够了！母亲病了，得靠这些钱买药。"] = "Then I'll do it for just 7 pence! My mother is sick, and I need the money to buy medicine.",
    ["那我……"] = "Then I...",
    ["那我……还能感觉到布丁吗？"] = "Then... can I still feel Pudding?",
    ["那我以后要去哪里找你？ "] = "Then where should I find you in the future?",
    ["那我们几个就不打扰你了，有空一起喝酒啊！"] = "Then we won't bother you anymore. Let's drink together when you have time!",
    ["那我们就是塔罗会了，而这是塔罗会的第一次集会。没问题吧，“愚者”先生？"] = "Then we are the Tarot Club, and this is the first gathering of the Tarot Club. No problem, Mr. Fool?",
    ["那我们开始吧！"] = "Then let's start!",
    ["那我们得……抓紧时间了。晚了，就什么都没了……"] = "Then we have to... hurry. If we're late, there will be nothing left...",
    ["那我们得赶紧离开，好不容易才救下大家……"] = "Then we must leave quickly. We worked so hard to save everyone...",
    ["那我们必须尽快阻止她！但是，她现在会在哪里呢……"] = "Then we must stop her as soon as possible! But where could she be now...",
    ["那我们快开始吧！"] = "Then let's get started quickly!",
    ["那我们拉钩。"] = "Then let's pinky swear.",
    ["那我们是不是也该给自己取个称号？毕竟不能用真实姓名交流。"] = "Then shouldn't we give ourselves titles? After all, we can't communicate using our real names.",
    ["那我们是不是变聪明了！"] = "Does that mean we've become smarter?",
    ["那我们是不是该给自己也取个称号？毕竟不能用真实姓名交流。"] = "Shouldn't we give ourselves titles, then? After all, we can't communicate using our real names.",
    ["那我们暂且在这里停驻片刻。 "] = "Then let's pause here for a moment.",
    ["那我们现在怎么办？"] = "Then what do we do now?",
    ["那我们继续，“坚持”这个单词……"] = "Then let's continue, the word \"persistence\"...",
    ["那我们还等什么？"] = "Then what are we waiting for?",
    ["那我先去看看，谢谢队长。"] = "Then I'll go take a look, thank you Captain.",
    ["那我再看看。"] = "Then I'll take another look.",
    ["那我再等等，我的心里现在只有格尔曼。噢，我多想亲自见他一面……"] = "Then I'll wait a bit longer. My heart is only filled with Gehrman right now. Oh, how I wish to meet him in person...",
    ["那我刚才……"] = "Then what was I just...",
    ["那我可得好好想想，等我写完了我会送你一本的，谢谢你！"] = "Then I'll have to think about it carefully. When I finish writing it, I'll send you a copy. Thank you!",
    ["那我可能会先趴下，摇摇尾巴，用最无辜的眼神看着他。"] = "Then I might lie down, wag my tail, and look at him with the most innocent eyes.",
    ["那我呢？"] = "What about me?",
    ["那我呢？作为黑荆棘安保公司新员工，我可以做点什么吗？"] = "What about me? As a new employee of Blackthorn Security Company, is there anything I can do?",
    ["那我就不客气了。"] = "Then I won't be polite.",
    ["那我就做对外大使吧。"] = "Then I'll be the Ambassador of Foreign Affairs.",
    ["那我就再说一遍——你们猎龙帮，惹到我了。"] = "Then I'll say it again—you Dragon Hunter Gang, you've provoked me.",
    ["那我就放心了，美食总是能治愈悲伤。"] = "Then I'm relieved. Good food can always heal sadness.",
    ["那我就狠狠踢你的坟墓！"] = "Then I'll kick your grave hard!",
    ["那我就算没白背这三脚架！"] = "Then I haven't carried this tripod in vain!",
    ["那我就说我养的是……一根会自己移动的皮带？"] = "Then I'll just say that what I'm keeping is... a belt that moves on its own?",
    ["那我希望听到这首乐曲的人，都能与失散的家人团聚。"] = "Then I hope that everyone who hears this piece of music can be reunited with their lost family.",
    ["那我得先学会预言……"] = "Then I'd have to learn how to prophesy...",
    ["那我怎么知道？我又不是工匠！"] = "How would I know? I'm not a craftsman!",
    ["那我换成四个二？"] = "Then should I swap it for four 2s?",
    ["那我推荐水仙花街北段的住宅，这里靠近北区和金梧桐区，房价也合适。"] = "Then I recommend the residences in the northern section of Daffodil Street. It's close to the North District and the Golden Indus area, and the housing prices are also reasonable.",
    ["那我推荐这位莫雷蒂先生。"] = "Then I recommend this Mr. Moretti.",
    ["那我是不是修改下咒文，让开头的描述指向<P_Yellow>我</>？"] = "Should I modify the incantation so that the opening description points to <P_Yellow> me </>?",
    ["那我是不是可以晋升下个序列了？"] = "Then can I advance to the next Sequence?",
    ["那我更要写信邀请她，就像以前一样！"] = "Then I must write a letter to invite her, just like before!",
    ["那我来帮你起个名字——"] = "Then let me give you a name—",
    ["那我留在这里，等黛西小姐醒来，或许可以问到有用的线索。"] = "Then I'll stay here and wait for Miss Daisy to wake up; perhaps I can ask for some useful clues.",
    ["那我给哥哥捏捏，捏完就不累了。"] = "Then let me massage you, brother, you won't be tired after I'm done.",
    ["那我继续去救人，先把大家带到安全屋里。"] = "Then I will continue to save people and bring everyone to the safe house first.",
    ["那我要开始表演了！"] = "Then I'm going to start the performance!",
    ["那我要开始讲啦……从前，有一个住在黑夜里的小女孩。"] = "Then I'll start telling it... Once upon a time, there was a little girl who lived in the dark night.",
    ["那我要怎么做？"] = "Then what should I do?",
    ["那我要怎么样才能见到她呢？她肯定很厉害吧！"] = "Then how can I see her? She must be very powerful!",
    ["那我试试"] = "Then I'll try",
    ["那我试试吧！"] = "Then I'll give it a try!",
    ["那我该怎么做？"] = "Then what should I do?",
    ["那我该怎么办？"] = "Then what should I do?",
    ["那我说说我的问题！"] = "Then let me tell you my questions!",
    ["那我辛苦研究了一晚上做的攻略算什么呢？"] = "Then what was the point of the guide I spent all night researching?",
    ["那我这一天……刷马桶、英雄救美、吃这个……全白忙活了？"] = "So my whole day... scrubbing toilets, saving the beauty, eating this... was all for nothing?",
    ["那我选择……"] = "Then I choose...",
    ["那我？"] = "What about me?",
    ["那托马斯神父的真正目的是什么……"] = "Then what is Father Thomas's true purpose...",
    ["那挺好的。"] = "That's good.",
    ["那接下来的事，就交给你了。"] = "Then I'll leave the rest to you.",
    ["那提前祝你生日快乐！"] = "Then happy birthday in advance!",
    ["那时候他不叫洛斯安，就叫安，睡桥洞，和我一起分半块馊了的黑面包，手脚比耗子还快。"] = "Back then, he wasn't called Losan, just An. He slept under bridges, shared half a piece of moldy black bread with me, and was faster with his hands and feet than a rat.",
    ["那时候您不相信“愚者”先生吗？"] = "Did you not believe in Mr. Fool back then?",
    ["那时候您不相信愚者先生吗？"] = "Did you not believe in Mr. Fool at that time?",
    ["那时候我刚上船，什么都不懂，只会用拳头说话。"] = "Back then, I had just boarded the ship, didn't know anything, and only knew how to use my fists to speak.",
    ["那时候我就知道，他能给白银城带来不一样的希望。"] = "Back then, I knew he could bring a different kind of hope to the City of Silver.",
    ["那时候我还没有柜台高呢，哈哈……"] = "Back then, I wasn't even as tall as the counter, haha...",
    ["那时候整个贝克兰德的古董市场，没人不认识“鹰眼”艾伯特。"] = "Back then, in the entire antique market of Backlund, there was no one who didn't know 'Eagle Eye' Albert.",
    ["那时候真好。作业、逃课、满嘴跑蒸汽火车……还以为日子会一直那样。"] = "Those were good times. Homework, skipping class, talking nonsense about steam trains... I thought days would always be like that.",
    ["那时候老爷每周都来，点名只要我跟着。我们坐在前排。"] = "Back then, the master came every week and specifically asked for me to follow. We sat in the front row.",
    ["那时候边境天旱，很多小村子都在闹饥荒。可这个村子里的所有人，肚子都鼓着。 "] = "At that time, there was a drought at the border, and many small villages were suffering from famine. But everyone in this village had a bulging belly.",
    ["那时候，它还很完整，有着坚固的外墙，有着高耸的尖顶。"] = "Back then, it was still intact, with sturdy outer walls and towering spires.",
    ["那时泰利正处于新手爸爸的幸福期，所有信都是以“给奥莉薇”作为开头。"] = "At that time, Terry was in the happy period of being a new father, and all the letters started with \"To Olivia.\"",
    ["那时的我已经流浪了很久，能感觉到的只有……平淡。"] = "I had been wandering for a long time by then, and all I could feel was... emptiness.",
    ["那明天呢？"] = "What about tomorrow?",
    ["那明明是姜汁汽水！"] = "That was clearly ginger ale!",
    ["那春天呢？"] = "And what about spring?",
    ["那是——罗塞尔大帝的影像！"] = "That is—an image of Emperor Roselle!",
    ["那是“窥秘人”途径的画家在灵性饱满时创作的。不过买这类画作要小心……"] = "That was created by a painter of the 'Mystery Pryer' pathway when their spirituality was full. However, be careful when buying such paintings...",
    ["那是……"] = "That is...",
    ["那是……一种未知的谜题吗？"] = "Is that... some kind of unknown puzzle?",
    ["那是……失踪的市民？他们怎么了？！"] = "Are those... the missing citizens? What happened to them?!",
    ["那是……小黛西？"] = "Is that... Little Daisy?",
    ["那是……我父亲的承诺。"] = "That is... my father's promise.",
    ["那是……活尸大军的操纵者？一个失控的被缚者！"] = "Is that... the controller of the zombie army? A Bound who has lost control!",
    ["那是……科恩黎？！"] = "Was that... Kenley?!",
    ["那是……罗塞尔大帝残存的意志……"] = "That is... the remnant will of Emperor Roselle...",
    ["那是一个本该美好，却戛然而止的故事……他们后来……"] = "It was a story that should have been beautiful, but it ended abruptly... what happened to them later...",
    ["那是一个连杀了五位少女的血腥屠夫……"] = "That was a bloody butcher who killed five young girls in a row...",
    ["那是一切的开始，\n鲁恩王国阿霍瓦郡廷根市值夜者小队，\n克莱恩和他最初的同伴们。"] = "That was the beginning of everything, \nthe Tingen Nighthawks squad of the Loen Kingdom's Awwa County, \nKlein and his initial companions.",
    ["那是一只很有灵性的黑猫，从前无论跑到哪里，都会在太阳落山前回家……"] = "It's a very spiritual black cat. In the past, no matter where it ran off to, it would always come home before sunset...",
    ["那是一只麻雀，亲爱的，它现在飞到了对面的房顶上。"] = "That's a sparrow, my dear, it just flew to the roof opposite.",
    ["那是一枚简陋的护符，黄铜的边框包裹着并不新鲜的叶片。\n丘纳斯·科尔格是一位狡诈的非凡者。他扭曲、贿赂、利用，他嘲弄着规则。\n失败并不只是失败——它带来更好的成功。这枚四叶草为这位非凡者积累着运气。\n“人类总是无法看穿命运的安排。”\n那场牌局散场后，他端着香槟走向道恩·唐泰斯，微笑着说出这句话。\n他不会知道，这位赢了近2000镑的富商，正是那个将在几天后取走他性命的人。而那枚积累了好运的幸运草，继续静静地躺在他的身边。\n有些馈赠，看似温柔，实则贪婪。\n幸运草从不创造运气，它只是把失败存起来，连本带利，在某个时刻一次性收回。"] = "It was a crude amulet, a brass frame wrapping a leaf that was not fresh. \n Qonas Kilgor was a cunning Beyonder. He distorted, bribed, utilized, and mocked the rules. \n Failure was not just failure—it brought about even greater success. This four-leaf clover accumulated luck for this Beyonder. \n \"Humans are always unable to see through the arrangements of fate.\" \n After that card game ended, he walked toward Dwayne Dantès with a glass of champagne, smiling as he spoke those words. \n He would never know that this wealthy merchant, who had won nearly 2,000 pounds, was the very person who would take his life a few days later. And that lucky clover, which had accumulated good fortune, continued to lie quietly by his side. \n Some gifts appear gentle, but are actually greedy. \n A lucky clover never creates luck; it merely stores up failures, and at a certain moment, collects them all back with interest.",
    ["那是一桌丰盛的晚餐"] = "That is a sumptuous dinner",
    ["那是一次……意外，也是命运的安排。"] = "That was an... accident, and also an arrangement of fate.",
    ["那是一种天真、纯净，无忧无虑和永远快乐的味道。"] = "It was a scent of innocence, purity, carefreeness, and eternal happiness.",
    ["那是一笔不小的数额，在他看来，严重拖累了廷根经济。"] = "That was a significant amount. In his view, it was a serious drag on Tingen's economy.",
    ["那是个顽劣的孩子，说谎使他的鼻子长得能当撬棍。大地母神包容了它，引导它成长为乖孩子。"] = "That was a naughty child whose nose would grow long enough to be a crowbar when he lied. The Earth Mother tolerated it and guided it to grow into a good child.",
    ["那是为了验证水下呼吸效果……算了，先不说那个。"] = "That was to verify the underwater breathing effect... Forget it, let's not talk about that.",
    ["那是为我儿子制作的。他长眠在拉姆德古堡——“<P_Yellow>初代拉姆德男爵的长子，一位骑士，一位真正的勇者</>”……"] = "That was made for my son. He rests in Lamud Castle—\"<P_Yellow> The eldest son of the first Baron Lamud, a knight, a true hero </>\"...",
    ["那是什么东西？"] = "What is that?",
    ["那是什么意思？"] = "What does that mean?",
    ["那是什么？"] = "What is that?",
    ["那是什么？一架由星光点亮的烛台！"] = "What is that? A candelabra lit by starlight!",
    ["那是什么？也是大帝残存的意志吗？"] = "What is that? Is it also the Emperor's residual will?",
    ["那是什么？也是大帝的意志吗？"] = "What is that? Is it also the will of the Emperor?",
    ["那是他们——而我，班纳，出名的老实人。您问常来这里的客人，都熟悉我的名字。"] = "That's them—but I, Banner, am a famously honest man. If you ask the regular customers here, they are all familiar with my name.",
    ["那是他们自己没本事！活该！"] = "That's because they are incompetent! They deserve it!",
    ["那是他送我的礼物，就在我家门口，你、你怎么知道的？"] = "That was a gift he gave me, it's right at my door. How, how did you know?",
    ["那是传说中的黄金树吗？请你们让我过去……"] = "Is that the legendary Golden Tree? Please let me pass...",
    ["那是你没见识。听说船上有游泳池、舞厅和壁球室。啧啧，简直就是海上的皇宫！等我攒够钱，非要上去看看。"] = "That's because you're ignorant. I heard there's a swimming pool, a ballroom, and a squash court on the ship. Tsk tsk, it's practically a palace on the sea! Once I save enough money, I'm definitely going to check it out.",
    ["那是别人乱喊的。我明明是个杂交学家、农业改良者。"] = "That's what others call me randomly. I am clearly a crossbreeder and agricultural improver.",
    ["那是和地下值班室连接的铃铛。"] = "That is the bell connected to the underground duty room.",
    ["那是她成为魔女时留下的“茧”。只要那东西还在，她就是不死的。"] = "That is the 'cocoon' she left behind when she became a Witch. As long as that thing exists, she is immortal.",
    ["那是安慰你的话，亲爱的。老板可不会这么想，他只会觉得我是个懒汉，说不定连这份工作都保不住。"] = "That was just to comfort you, my dear. The boss won't think that way. He'll only think I'm a lazy bum, and I might even lose this job.",
    ["那是家传戒指！父亲规定，我二十五岁还没用它求婚成功就无法继承家业，可我明天就二十五岁了！"] = "That's a family heirloom ring! Father stipulated that if I haven't successfully proposed with it by the time I'm twenty-five, I can't inherit the family business, and I turn twenty-five tomorrow!",
    ["那是弗莱 别看他这样 其实是个挺好的家伙 以后介绍给你认识"] = "That's Frye. Don't look at him like that; he's actually a pretty good guy. I'll introduce you later.",
    ["那是弗莱，别看他这样，其实是个挺好的家伙，以后介绍给你认识。"] = "That's Frye. Don't let his looks fool you; he's actually a pretty good guy. I'll introduce you later.",
    ["那是我们前任队长的烟斗，他已经牺牲快五年了……"] = "That is our former captain's pipe; he has been gone for almost five years now...",
    ["那是我唯一一次杀人。如果你看过一个人活着时的眼神，那你就永远忘不了他死后的脸。"] = "That was the only time I ever killed someone. If you have seen the look in a person's eyes while they were alive, you will never forget their face after they are dead.",
    ["那是我奶奶！她可厉害了，种出了鲁恩最大的南瓜！我们家的南瓜园是全金秋湖最出名的哦！  "] = "That's my grandmother! She was amazing; she grew the largest pumpkins in Loen! Our family's pumpkin patch is the most famous in all of Golden Autumn Lake!",
    ["那是我最喜欢的一部！不过，佛尔思小姐最近写了新的作品。"] = "That's my favorite one! However, Miss Fors has written new works recently.",
    ["那是我最宝贝的东西，在家里保存着呢。"] = "That is my most prized possession, kept safely at home.",
    ["那是旧的，当柴烧都费事，我才是最新的活路标。"] = "That one's old—it's not even good for firewood. I'm the latest living signpost.",
    ["那是最温暖最美好的地方，你一定会不想离开……"] = "That is the warmest and most wonderful place; you definitely won't want to leave...",
    ["那是白天的我，清醒的我，克制的我。但现在……酒精让我诚实。夜晚的我想要别的东西。"] = "That was the me of the daytime, the sober me, the restrained me. But now... alcohol makes me honest. The me of the night wants something else.",
    ["那是自然，这可是全廷根最有名的莴苣与肉类市场！不过摊子一多，一些不良的竞争也就多了。"] = "That goes without saying; this is the most famous lettuce and meat market in all of Tingen! However, with so many stalls, there's bound to be some unfair competition.",
    ["那是菲利普！他回家了。"] = "That's Philip! He's home.",
    ["那是被风吹落的树叶。"] = "Those are leaves blown down by the wind.",
    ["那是要去贝克兰德的大公司？"] = "That means going to a big company in Backlund?",
    ["那是队长的爱好吗？"] = "Is that the Captain's hobby?",
    ["那是马西莫对食物的态度足够严谨！"] = "That's Massimo's rigorous attitude towards food!",
    ["那是，我可是血族侯爵。对应序列3的召唤大师，能让灵界深处的强大生物来到现实世界。你可以试试这张残页，它应该还能用。"] = "That's right, I am a Sanguine Marquis. Corresponding to the Sequence 3 Summoning Master, I can bring powerful creatures from the depths of the Spirit World into the real world. You can try this scrap; it should still be usable.",
    ["那是？！还能算人吗？简直是个怪物！"] = "Is that?! Can that even be considered human? It's practically a monster!",
    ["那晚餐……"] = "Then dinner...",
    ["那曲"] = "Nagqu",
    ["那最后……"] = "And in the end...",
    ["那最近几年又出过什么事情吗？"] = "Have there been any incidents in recent years?",
    ["那月下的骏马，踏着永夜疾驰如雷！"] = "That steed under the moon gallops like thunder through the eternal night!",
    ["那有什么特别的？"] = "What's special about that?",
    ["那有没有可能，是饭菜本身不好吃呢？"] = "Then is it possible that the food itself just doesn't taste good?",
    ["那本《秦汉秘传方术纪要》！"] = "That \"Summary of Qin and Han Secret Arts\"!",
    ["那本《谜题破解法》……"] = "That \"Puzzle Solving Method\"...",
    ["那本异常的书籍在躁动，它想带我去哪里？"] = "That unusual book is restless. Where is it trying to take me?",
    ["那本笔记去哪了？"] = "Where did that notebook go?",
    ["那本笔记的名字叫——<P_Yellow>安提哥努斯家族笔记</>。"] = "The name of that notebook is—the <P_Yellow>Antigonus Family Notebook</>.",
    ["那本解谜手册，应该是他用来记录机械屋逐步活化的测试。万幸，残余的数据救了我一命。"] = "That puzzle manual must have been his record of the tests for the Mechanical Hut's gradual activation. Fortunately, the remaining data saved my life.",
    ["那枚宝石戒指……就它，拿到我就发了！"] = "That gemstone ring... that's the one. Once I get it, I'll be rich!",
    ["那枚护身符的微弱灵性也许只够维持你的存在，却不能让没有非凡力量的普通人察觉你。"] = "The faint spirituality of that amulet might only be enough to maintain your existence, but it cannot let ordinary people without Beyonder powers perceive you.",
    ["那架飞机上没有逃生舱！"] = "There are no escape pods on that plane!",
    ["那柄斧头几乎两三下碰撞就能制造出一道伤害性很强的闪电。"] = "That axe can create a very damaging lightning bolt with just two or three collisions.",
    ["那样幽深的地方，吸引我的目光……上厕所……要用……马桶……"] = "Such a deep, dark place, it draws my gaze... going to the bathroom... must use... the toilet...",
    ["那样狂热的感觉，就好像回到了醋栗成熟的那个雨夜——"] = "That fanatical feeling was as if I had returned to that rainy night when the gooseberries ripened—",
    ["那样的怪物是人类？他失控了？"] = "That kind of monster is a human? Did he lose control?",
    ["那样的生活一定很孤单。"] = "That kind of life must have been very lonely.",
    ["那样的老师，是绝不会想自杀的。"] = "Such a teacher would never want to commit suicide.",
    ["那棵树下很适合藏礼物，放在那里好了。"] = "That tree is a great place to hide a gift; I'll leave it there.",
    ["那段时间，我每天的睡眠严重不足，头发掉了一大把。"] = "During that time, I was severely sleep-deprived every day, and I lost a lot of hair.",
    ["那流年灵数呢？"] = "What about the annual number?",
    ["那流转的芬芳！"] = "That flowing fragrance!",
    ["那滋味，就像被一群矿工在脑子里敲敲打打！"] = "That feeling is like having a group of miners hammering away inside your head!",
    ["那点可怜的午休时间，也只有这家的出餐速度能赶上了。"] = "In that pathetic lunch break, this is the only place where the service is fast enough to make it back in time.",
    ["那爸爸给他们各捐一栋楼好了，这样我的宝贝有更多选择的余地。"] = "Then Dad will donate a building to each of them so my treasure has more room for choice.",
    ["那片大雾"] = "That thick fog",
    ["那现在“未来号”还在产奶吗？"] = "Is the \"Future\" still producing milk now?",
    ["那现在……"] = "So now...",
    ["那现在呢，陛下？"] = "And now, Your Majesty?",
    ["那现在宣传的这位编剧，干了什么？"] = "Then what did the playwright they're promoting now do?",
    ["那现在怎么办？"] = "What should we do now?",
    ["那现在轮到我来买东西了。"] = "Now it's my turn to buy something.",
    ["那畜生……再过两天就要被处理了吧？"] = "That beast... it's going to be dealt with in a couple of days, right?",
    ["那眉毛，那眼睛……确实像极了她早逝的弟弟啊。"] = "Those eyebrows, those eyes... they really do look just like her late younger brother.",
    ["那看来你还有机会继续学习他的神奇配方。"] = "Then it seems you still have a chance to continue learning his magical formulas.",
    ["那看看这个——朗齐酒可是在菜单的酒水推荐栏！"] = "Then look at this - Langqi wine is on the drink recommendation list of the menu!",
    ["那真可惜，劳拉可是刚从贝克兰德最好的礼仪学校毕业，她的用餐礼仪比某些南大陆暴发户好多了。"] = "That's a pity. Laura just graduated from the best etiquette school in Backlund, and her dining etiquette is better than some nouveau riche from the Southern Continent.",
    ["那真是一种奇妙的感觉，突然间就发生了。"] = "That was truly a strange feeling; it happened all of a sudden.",
    ["那真是太可惜了。"] = "That's a real pity.",
    ["那真是太好了！你马上就能跟孩子团聚了！"] = "That's wonderful! You'll be reunited with your child soon!",
    ["那真是太好了，咖啡师先生那边有很多糕点，可以随意挑选。"] = "That would be wonderful. The barista has plenty of pastries; feel free to choose whatever you like.",
    ["那真的太遗憾了！"] = "That is truly a pity!",
    ["那祝您生活愉快。小心，别碰这一桌的杯子，谢谢。"] = "Then I wish you a pleasant life. Careful, don't touch the cups on this table, thank you.",
    ["那离开吧"] = "Then let's leave",
    ["那种堕落的、被污染的气息我曾见过，在海纳斯·凡森特的梦中。而根据我们的调查，他的梦指向了邪神——真实造物主。"] = "I have encountered that kind of fallen, corrupted aura before, in the dream of Haines Vincent. And according to our investigation, his dream pointed to an evil god—the True Creator.",
    ["那种无力感……那种“如果我能更强”的悔恨。"] = "That sense of powerlessness... that regret of \"if only I were stronger\".",
    ["那种日子……<P_Heart>（摇头）</>我不想再经历了。"] = "That kind of life... <P_Heart>(Shakes head)</> I don't want to experience it again.",
    ["那种果酸味，每一口都能让身体暖暖的。"] = "That fruity, acidic scent—every bite made my body feel warm.",
    ["那种被注视的感觉没有消失 非凡者能跑得比马车还快？"] = "That feeling of being watched hasn't disappeared. Can a Beyonder run faster than a carriage?",
    ["那种香水的配方很珍贵，不懂行的人只会砍价，惹得奈拉小姐不高兴。"] = "The formula for that perfume is very precious, and people who don't know anything about it will only haggle, making Miss Naila unhappy.",
    ["那站好吧，首先声明——要是又掉进谁家烟囱里，记得帮我保密！"] = "Then stand still. First, a disclaimer—if I fall into someone's chimney again, remember to keep it a secret for me!",
    ["那第一次见到“愚者”先生时，您是什么感觉？"] = "When you first saw Mr. Fool, what did you feel?",
    ["那第一次见到愚者先生时，您是什么感觉？"] = "Then how did you feel when you first met Mr. Fool?",
    ["那等我攒攒钱，给我和玛丽各买一个吧。虽然这得让我少喝三个月的黑麦啤酒……"] = "Then when I save up some money, I'll buy one for Mary and me. Although this means I'll have to drink three months less rye beer...",
    ["那算了，谢谢。"] = "Never mind then, thanks.",
    ["那算什么，为了这次比赛，我连续购入了半年鸡蛋。"] = "That's nothing, for this competition, I've been buying eggs for half a year.",
    ["那算你运气好，今天号满了——都是些“我头晕，你给我开这点药怎么够”的主。"] = "Then you're lucky. The slots are full today—all of them are people who say, 'I'm dizzy, how is this little bit of medicine you prescribed enough?'",
    ["那箱子里装的东西……要是摔坏了，我们全家都赔不起……"] = "The things inside that crate... if they get broken, my whole family couldn't afford to pay for them...",
    ["那给我挑一个。不过，你这瓜保真吗？"] = "Then pick one for me. But, is this pumpkin of yours authentic?",
    ["那给阿德米索尔也吃一些，是不是就能恢复正常了？"] = "Then give some to Admisol too, will he be able to return to normal?",
    ["那群不需要睡眠的值夜者经常连夜打牌，钢铁的牌也禁不住这么用。"] = "Those Nighthawks who don't need sleep often play cards all night; even steel cards couldn't withstand that kind of use.",
    ["那群人像一堵堵高墙……"] = "That group of people are like high walls...",
    ["那群人有超过两米五的身高，站起来像一堵堵高墙。"] = "That group of people was over two and a half meters tall, standing there like high walls.",
    ["那群偷溜进来的臭小子，跑哪里去了……"] = "Where did those little brats who snuck in run off to...",
    ["那群可怕蚂蚁，就在转弯后的路边潜伏！"] = "That group of terrifying ants is lurking by the roadside after the turn!",
    ["那群猎杀学徒的黑帮，我会把他们全部消灭！"] = "As for that gang hunting Apprentices, I will wipe them all out!",
    ["那老头子死了也不做点好事！我就该多给他灌几口毒药！"] = "That old man didn't do a single good deed even after dying! I should have fed him a few more doses of poison!",
    ["那老师和卢卡斯？"] = "Then the teacher and Lucas?",
    ["那考试会很难吗？"] = "Was the exam difficult?",
    ["那股诡异的能量估计就是他造成的。"] = "That strange energy is likely caused by him.",
    ["那肯定！不然泼天的富贵可就便宜他那位小情人了。"] = "That's for sure! Otherwise, that massive fortune would just go to his little mistress.",
    ["那肯定，不赌怎么翻盘？"] = "That's for sure, how can you turn things around without gambling?",
    ["那艘船属于“红骷髅”，一群残忍狡诈的家伙，专门劫掠商船，杀人灭口。"] = "That ship belonged to the 'Red Skulls,' a group of cruel and cunning guys who specialized in plundering merchant ships and killing all witnesses.",
    ["那蘑菇需要什么？"] = "Then what do mushrooms need?",
    ["那要从费内波特开始说起了。让老身想想……有个来采风的学者提到过，叫“背誓之战”……"] = "That goes back to Feneport. Let me think... A scholar who came to collect folk customs mentioned it, calling it the 'War of Broken Oaths'...",
    ["那要取决于送什么人，挚友送青金石，心仪之人送红宝石，\n长辈送猫眼，各有讲究。"] = "That depends on who you're giving it to. Lapis lazuli for a close friend, rubies for someone you admire, \n cat's eye for an elder; each has its own etiquette.",
    ["那诅咒就永远在你身上了，你有尝试过逃跑吗？"] = "Then the curse will be on you forever. Have you tried running away?",
    ["那该死的火车还要等多久才会开？"] = "How much longer will that damn train take to start?",
    ["那请自便，我要在这里构思一阵子。"] = "Then please feel free; I need to brainstorm here for a while.",
    ["那走吧！跟我走！"] = "Then let's go! Follow me!",
    ["那起意外和我们无关！这是通过地下市场买来的，请你相信。"] = "That accident has nothing to do with us! This was bought through the underground market, please believe me.",
    ["那起案件怎么了？"] = "What happened to that case?",
    ["那起纵火案？我把它收进文献室了"] = "That arson case? I put it in the archives room.",
    ["那起纵火案？我把它收进文献室了。"] = "That arson case? I put it in the archives room.",
    ["那边……似乎有些混乱？"] = "Over there... does it seem a bit chaotic?",
    ["那边……我听见了第一段记忆。"] = "Over there... I heard the first segment of memory.",
    ["那边两位先生……似乎在很激烈地辩论？"] = "Those two gentlemen over there... seem to be debating quite intensely?",
    ["那边在闹什么？"] = "What's going on over there?",
    ["那边是食物吗？\r\n香香臭臭的，我吃一口……就一口。"] = "Is that food over there?\nIt smells fragrant yet foul, I'll take a bite... just one bite.",
    ["那边有个松鼠窝，走吧。"] = "There's a squirrel nest over there, let's go.",
    ["那边有人，过去问一问吧。"] = "There is someone over there, let's go ask them.",
    ["那边有什么"] = "What is over there?",
    ["那边有招工单，先看看要做什么，工资多少。"] = "There is a recruitment notice over there, take a look at what needs to be done and how much the salary is.",
    ["那边树下有一对父子，他们曾经在这里种过一棵树。"] = "There's a father and son under that tree; they once planted a tree here.",
    ["那边的人……好像有点眼熟？他看上去遇到了什么麻烦？"] = "That person over there... seems a bit familiar? Does he look like he's in some kind of trouble?",
    ["那边的会议室总是严肃得吓人，果然是因为阿尔杰先生吗……"] = "The conference room over there is always frighteningly serious; is it really because of Mr. Alger...",
    ["那边的墙上，好像贴着什么公告……"] = "There seems to be some kind of notice posted on the wall over there...",
    ["那边的女士，穿着公司的制服，难道是公司的前辈？"] = "The lady over there, wearing the company uniform, could she be a senior from the company?",
    ["那边的孩子还没有被蛊惑，去看看。"] = "The child over there hasn't been bewitched yet. Go take a look.",
    ["那边的情侣是不是想买票？"] = "Think that couple over there wants tickets?",
    ["那边的是洋甘菊和金手桔。"] = "Those over there are chamomile and kumquat.",
    ["那边的朋友，请过来帮我一下……"] = "Friend over there, please come over and help me...",
    ["那边的椅子……睡着个小孩。"] = "The chair over there... there's a child sleeping on it.",
    ["那边的椅子好像有点脏。"] = "The chair over there looks a bit dirty.",
    ["那边的牌子上写着“绯月派”，听起来是一道特别的料理。"] = "The sign over there says \"Crimson Moon Pie\"; it sounds like a special dish.",
    ["那边的玩偶……是失控的目标留下的？"] = "That doll over there... was it left behind by the target who lost control?",
    ["那边的芬利叔叔今天为他的哥哥庆生，我有热情送上祝福哦。"] = "Uncle Finley over there is celebrating his brother's birthday today, and I have enthusiastically sent my blessings.",
    ["那边的车夫会送你们到目的地，祝你们好运。"] = "The carriage driver over there will take you to your destination. Good luck.",
    ["那边的那位骑士倒是死得其所。至少有人记得他。"] = "That knight over there died as he should have. At least someone remembers him.",
    ["那边还有一只小家伙，想溜走？"] = "There's another little one over there, trying to slip away?",
    ["那边那个人是……"] = "That person over there is...",
    ["那边那个喝醉了，得看着点，不能让他耍酒疯。"] = "That guy over there is drunk, need to keep an eye on him, can't let him cause a scene.",
    ["那边？什么情况？"] = "Over there? What's going on?",
    ["那还不是因为……"] = "That's only because...",
    ["那还不是因为您的房子一切都好！"] = "That's because everything about your house is fine!",
    ["那还有什么办法吗？我们时间不多了……"] = "Is there any other way? We don't have much time...",
    ["那还说啥，直接干了"] = "What else to say, just do it",
    ["那这个能召唤什么？"] = "Then what can this summon?",
    ["那这么多年，我的使命……永远也完不成了吗？"] = "Then, for all these years, my mission... will it never be completed?",
    ["那这样的观察，让你获得了什么灵感？"] = "So, what kind of inspiration has this observation given you?",
    ["那道身影……不会是伊琳吧？"] = "That figure... could it be Irene?",
    ["那道香草白酱煎肉真不错，{{PlayerName}}下次来黑荆棘，我们一起吃饭吧。"] = "That Pan-Seared Meat with Herb White Sauce was really good, {{PlayerName}}, let's eat together next time you come to Blackthorn.",
    ["那邮差什么时候送来？"] = "When will the postman deliver it?",
    ["那都什么时候的事了……"] = "That was ages ago...",
    ["那里……能看到天空。难道那就是离开的路？"] = "There... I can see the sky. Could that be the way out?",
    ["那里以前只是座破城堡，不是现在这样……不是的……全变了。别进去，像那穿黑风衣的老爷们一样，不知道经历了什么！"] = "It used to be just a broken castle, not like it is now... no... everything has changed. Don't go in, just like those gentlemen in black trench coats, who knows what they went through!",
    ["那里发生的一切，<P_Yellow>都不会对现实造成直接的影响</>。"] = "Everything that happens there <P_Yellow>will not have a direct impact on reality</>.",
    ["那里可太棒了，长满香料的丛林、喷出黄金的土地、热辣的女孩儿和我面前这位棕色的朋友！"] = "It was absolutely fantastic there—jungles overflowing with spices, land that spewed gold, hot girls, and my brown-skinned friend here in front of me!",
    ["那里怎么了？"] = "What happened there?",
    ["那里是……琳达？！"] = "That is... Linda?!",
    ["那里有一些报销单。"] = "There are some reimbursement forms there.",
    ["那里有很多像堕落母神这样的强大邪神，正在觊觎我们的世界。"] = "There are many powerful evil gods like the Mother Goddess of Depravity out there, coveting our world.",
    ["那里有暖和的火，明亮的灯。"] = "There is a warm fire and bright lights there.",
    ["那里有阳光、有绿植、有正常的食物，孩子们不用再吃怪物肉了。"] = "There is sunlight, green plants, and normal food; the children don't have to eat monster meat anymore.",
    ["那里的孩子们在丰收季非常喜欢将果实投入筐里，从而在劳作中衍生出了一系列的规则。"] = "The children there loved throwing fruits into baskets during the harvest season, which led to a series of rules derived from their labor.",
    ["那里面可不是睡觉的好地方。"] = "That's not a good place to sleep.",
    ["那金秋湖有什么特别的吗？"] = "Is there anything special about Golden Autumn Lake?",
    ["那钓什么鱼？"] = "Then what fish to catch?",
    ["那队长第一次出任务的时候会紧张吗?"] = "So, does the captain get nervous when going on a mission for the first time?",
    ["那骑士是不是该帮它找东西，而不是打架……"] = "Then shouldn't the knight help it find what it's looking for instead of fighting...",
    ["那，她也会<P_Yellow>喝断片儿</>吗？"] = "Then, would she also <P_Yellow>black out</> from drinking?",
    ["那，我们先回黑荆棘吧。"] = "Then, let's head back to Blackthorn first.",
    ["那，我没有家。"] = "Then, I don't have a home.",
    ["那，请说？"] = "Well, please speak?",
    ["那，这块吧，7便士。"] = "Then, how about this piece? 7 pence.",
    ["那，那你……"] = "Th, then you...",
    ["邦妮"] = "Bonnie",
    ["邦妮·"] = "Bonnie ",
    ["邦妮薇"] = "Bonnevie",
    ["邦妮薇-酒瓶"] = "Bonnievi - Wine Bottle",
    ["邦尼"] = "Bonnie",
    ["邦尼-1星"] = "Bonnie - 1 Star",
    ["邦尼-2星"] = "Bonnie - 2 Star",
    ["邦尼-3星"] = "Bonnie - 3 Star",
    ["邦尼Boss"] = "Bonnie Boss",
    ["邦尼_捉迷藏藏"] = "Bonnie_Hide and Seek Hiding",
    ["邦尼·克劳德"] = "Bonnie Claude",
    ["邦尼出现Trigger"] = "Bonnie appearance Trigger",
    ["邦尼在里面下了“花种”，会让你的灵性遭受污染。"] = "Bonnie planted \"flower seeds\" in it, which will cause your spirituality to suffer corruption.",
    ["邦尼头顶灯光"] = "Bonnie's Overhead Light",
    ["邦尼将召唤3个<Disable>舞者分身</>，每个舞者<Disable>头顶</>将显示出一种<Disable>舞蹈名称</>，舞者会点名一位非凡者，一段时间后对该位非凡者<Disable>冲刺</>。"] = "Bonnie will summon 3 <Disable>Dancer projections</>. Each dancer will display a <Disable>dance name</> <Disable>above their head</>. The dancer will target one Beyonder and, after a period of time, <Disable>dash</> at that Beyonder.",
    ["邦尼将召唤3个<Disable>舞阵</>，每个舞阵将标注出一种<Disable>舞蹈名称</>，拥有这个种舞蹈的非凡者，需要进入舞阵内跳舞。否则邦尼将爆发全场伤害，惩罚扰乱舞场秩序的人们。"] = "Bonnie will summon 3 <Disable>dance formations</>. Each formation will be labeled with a <Disable>dance name</>. Beyonders who possess that dance must enter the formation to dance. Otherwise, Bonnie will unleash field-wide damage to punish those who disrupt the order of the dance floor.",
    ["邦尼将召唤出10个舞者分身，与其一起跳舞，但其中会有<Disable>4个舞者</>跳的舞蹈和其他舞者<Disable>不同</>，一定时间后，邦尼检测全场舞蹈，并造成全场伤害。"] = "Bonnie will summon 10 Dancer projections to dance with her, but <Disable>4 of the dancers</> will be performing a dance different from the others <Disable>different</>. After a certain period, Bonnie will check the dance of everyone on the field and deal field-wide damage.",
    ["邦尼将召唤出10个舞者分身，与其一起跳舞，但其中会有<Disable>4个舞者</>跳的舞蹈和其他舞者<Disable>不同</>，同时邦尼在自身周围，将召唤<Disable>2个舞阵</>，击杀任一跳错舞的舞者后，舞阵上会标注出<Disable>舞蹈名称</>。一定时间后，邦尼检测全场舞蹈，并造成全场伤害。"] = "Bonnie will summon 10 Dancer projections to dance with her, but <Disable>4 of the dancers</> will be performing a dance different from the others <Disable>different</>. At the same time, Bonnie will summon <Disable>2 dance formations</> around herself. After killing any dancer performing the wrong dance, the formation will be labeled with a <Disable>dance name</>. After a certain period, Bonnie will check the dance of everyone on the field and deal field-wide damage.",
    ["邦尼将召唤出6个<Disable>舞者分身</>，6个舞者会在3种舞蹈中进行跳舞，短暂延迟后，邦尼对会全场进行高额伤害"] = "Bonnie will summon 6 <Disable>Dancer projections</>. The 6 dancers will perform 3 types of dances. After a short delay, Bonnie will deal high damage to the entire field.",
    ["邦尼开酒吧，做人口买卖，身边永远围着漂亮女人，讨厌一切男人。没人关心她脖子上护符的来历，大家都认为她坏到骨子里。\n红宝石护符来自她曾经的舞蹈搭档，那个和她一起从街头跳舞跳进贝克兰德的男人。他们约好要一起站在最亮的聚光灯下，但名利场是一把裹着绸缎的刀。她在其中沉浮，与搭档渐行渐远。终于有一天，那人的刀尖刺向了她。\n有人问邦尼，你不恨吗，她说恨。\n那为什么还戴着护符？\n邦尼把护符塞进领口：“我这辈子，就信过那一个人。后来我亲手枪毙了他。”\n宝石还在，疤痕还在，恨也还在，像一片烧不完的余烬。"] = "Bonnie runs a bar, traffics people, is always surrounded by beautiful women, and hates all men. No one cares about the origin of the amulet on her neck; everyone thinks she is rotten to the core. \n The ruby amulet came from her former dance partner, the man who danced with her from the streets into Backlund. They promised to stand under the brightest spotlight together, but the vanity fair is a knife wrapped in silk. She drifted within it, growing distant from her partner. Finally, one day, that man's blade turned toward her. \n Someone asked Bonnie if she hated him, and she said she did. \n Then why still wear the amulet? \n Bonnie tucked the amulet into her neckline: \"In this life, I only trusted that one person. Later, I shot him dead with my own hands.\" \n The gem remains, the scars remain, and the hatred remains, like a pile of embers that can never be burned out.",
    ["邦尼恢复了状态！"] = "Bonnie has recovered!",
    ["邦尼战斗用"] = "For Bonnie combat",
    ["邦尼春夜沙龙事件（内场）"] = "Bonnie Spring Night Salon event (inner field)",
    ["邦尼是那里的主人，没人见过她真面目。莉莉是她的副手，管着里里外外。"] = "Bonnie is the master there; no one has ever seen her true face. Lily is her deputy, managing everything inside and out.",
    ["邦尼没骗我们——金狼真正的力量来自那些狂信徒的<P_Yellow>红线</>。"] = "Bonnie didn't lie to us—the Golden Wolf's true power comes from the <P_Yellow> red threads </> of those fanatics.",
    ["邦尼狂暴"] = "Bonnie Berserk",
    ["邦尼的“原始镜面”，她的力量源头。"] = "Bonnie's \"Primitive Mirror,\" the source of her power.",
    ["邦尼的残影消散，等待下一次浮现。"] = "Bonnie's afterimage dissipates, waiting for the next emergence.",
    ["邦尼的阴影从未散去，是时候做个了断了。"] = "Bonnie's shadow has never dissipated; it is time to put an end to it.",
    ["邦尼的面具即将发动魅惑能力，不可直视！"] = "Bonnie's mask is about to unleash a charm ability; do not look at it directly!",
    ["邦尼眩晕了，快使用临时技能疯狂输出"] = "Bonnie is stunned, quickly use the temporary skill to output madly.",
    ["邦尼终局-收尾"] = "Bonnie endgame - Conclusion",
    ["邦尼终局-落幕"] = "Bonnie Finale-Curtain Call",
    ["邦尼终局之战"] = "Bonnie endgame battle",
    ["邦尼终局之战-剧院摆件氛围"] = "Bonnie endgame-theater ornament atmosphere",
    ["邦尼陷入虚弱，尽快击破镜子！"] = "Bonnie has fallen into a state of weakness; break the mirror as soon as possible!",
    ["邦尼：两年前，你在铁十字街救走的那个小女孩，现在在我的花园里开得很漂亮。你想见她吗？"] = "Bonnie: Two years ago, the little girl you saved from Iron Cross Street is blooming beautifully in my garden now. Do you want to see her?",
    ["邦尼：从今往后，我将隐入阴影，化作利刃。 以牙还牙，以血偿血。"] = "Bonnie: From now on, I will hide in the shadows and become a blade. An eye for an eye, blood for blood.",
    ["邦尼：他的力量来自那些狂信徒——那些把他当成神一样崇拜的可怜虫。"] = "Bonnie: His power comes from those fanatics—those poor wretches who worship him like a god.",
    ["邦尼：但我不想杀你，至少现在不想。"] = "But I don't want to kill you, at least not now.",
    ["邦尼：你每伤我一分，它就替我承受一分痛楚，直到你精疲力竭。"] = "Every time you hurt me, it bears the pain for me, until you are exhausted.",
    ["邦尼：你看错了重点，莉莉。"] = "Bonnie: You're missing the point, Lily.",
    ["邦尼：你赢了，种子。"] = "Bonnie: You won, seed.",
    ["邦尼：别担心，我不会杀他。我需要一个观众……来见证你的蜕变。"] = "Bonnie: Don't worry, I won't kill him. I need an audience... to witness your transformation.",
    ["邦尼：动手吧。别让我，像那些复制体一样，变成没有意识的怪物。"] = "Bonnie: Do it. Don't let me become a mindless monster like those copies.",
    ["邦尼：哈哈哈哈哈……不错，你和花种融合得非常完美。但是……"] = "Bonnie: Hahahahaha... not bad, you have fused with the flower seed perfectly. However...",
    ["邦尼：在这里，只要这面镜子还在，我就是不死的。"] = "Bonnie: Here, as long as this mirror exists, I am immortal.",
    ["邦尼：够了，莉莉。"] = "Bonnie: That's enough, Lily.",
    ["邦尼：它告诉我，你很想了解我，了解真正的我。"] = "Bonnie: It tells me that you really want to understand me, to understand the real me.",
    ["邦尼：崔佛·墨菲，我等你很久了。"] = "Bonnie: Trevor Murphy, I've been waiting for you for a long time.",
    ["邦尼：我们很快会再见的……"] = "Bonnie: We will meet again soon...",
    ["邦尼：我救不了任何人，连最微弱的呼吸都守不住。 既然如此……"] = "Bonnie: I can't save anyone, I can't even protect the faintest breath. Since that's the case...",
    ["邦尼：我的……力量！还给我！"] = "Bonnie: My... power! Give it back to me!",
    ["邦尼：我花了二十年，从本杰明变成邦尼，最后还是输给了，一个外人。"] = "Bonnie: I spent twenty years going from Benjamin to Bonnie, and in the end, I still lost to an outsider.",
    ["邦尼：我要你明白，明白我为了这一切，付出了什么。"] = "I want you to understand, to understand what I have paid for all of this.",
    ["邦尼：斩断连线。让他再也听不见祈祷，看不见供奉……他就会失控，自我泯灭。"] = "Bonnie: Sever the connection. Make him unable to hear prayers or see offerings anymore... and he will lose control and self-destruct.",
    ["邦尼：来吧，向我证明，你具备培育的价值。"] = "Bonnie: Come, prove to me that you are worth cultivating.",
    ["邦尼：现在你知道了吗，{{PlayerName}}？"] = "Bonnie: Do you know now, {{PlayerName}}?",
    ["邦尼：终于来了。我的种子，还有，廷根的阴影。"] = "Bonnie: You've finally come. My seed, and the shadow of Tingen.",
    ["邦尼：至于你……你体内的花种，我能感觉到它在跳动。"] = "Bonnie: As for you... I can feel the flower seed inside you pulsing.",
    ["邦尼：让{{他|她}}走……我们才能听到更多心跳的声音。"] = "Bonnie: Let {{him|her}} go... so we can hear more heartbeats.",
    ["邦尼：让我，和这二十年的仇恨，一起埋葬。这是我，最后的请求……"] = "Bonnie: Let me be buried along with these twenty years of hatred. This is my final request...",
    ["邦尼：谢谢……"] = "Bonnie: Thank you...",
    ["邦尼：跑吧，种子。跑得越快，根扎得越深。"] = "Bonnie: Run, seed. The faster you run, the deeper your roots will grow.",
    ["邦尼：这是我……对死去之人的，唯一承诺。"] = "Bonnie: This is my... only promise to those who have died.",
    ["邦尼：进来吧，种子。看看邦尼是如何一步步走到今天的！"] = "Come in, seed. See how Bonnie has reached this point step by step!",
    ["邦尼：那个自以为是的政客。他的力量从来都不是他自己的。"] = "Bonnie: That self-righteous politician. His power was never his own.",
    ["邦尼：那么……"] = "Bonnie: So...",
    ["邦尼：镜子，碎了。我的力量，我的复仇，都结束了……"] = "Bonnie: The mirror is broken. My power, my revenge, it's all over...",
