    ["邪神神使正在蓄力，即将掀起亡风——"] = "The Evil God's Messenger is charging up and is about to stir up a death wind—",
    ["邪神！那是邪神！格调要高，别局限于这些小事。"] = "Evil god! That's an evil god! The style must be high; don't limit yourself to these trifles.",
