    ["邸尧"] = "Di Yao",
    ["邻居家的太太讲的睡前故事里，主角是一个住在梦幻岛上，用蘑菇当烟囱，和仙子、人鱼生活在一起，永远都不会长大的小男孩……"] = "In the bedtime story told by the neighbor's wife, the protagonist is a little boy who lives on Dream Island, uses a mushroom as a chimney, lives with fairies and mermaids, and will never grow up...",
    ["郊外一处遗迹附近。有人举报在这里多次看见邪教仪式。"] = "Near some ruins in the suburbs. Someone reported seeing cult rituals here multiple times.",
    ["郊外一隅"] = "A Corner of the Suburbs",
    ["郊外五月庄园有异常迹象，管家正在高薪招募大量短工，修剪苹果林。"] = "There are abnormal signs at May Manor in the suburbs; the butler is recruiting a large number of temporary workers at high wages to prune the apple orchard.",
    ["郊外山野"] = "Suburban Wilderness",
    ["郊外晨曲"] = "Suburban Morning Song",
    ["郊外？那不过是乡巴佬待的泥坑！"] = "The suburbs? That's just a mud pit for bumpkins!",
    ["郊野林地"] = "Suburban Woodland",
