    ["金币可用于购买棋子、升级人口，来源包括：\n 1. 基础：每回合结束时固定获得\n 2. 利息：每回合获得当前总金币10%的利息（最多为5金币）\n 3. 获胜：玩家对战获胜立刻获得1金币\n 4. 连胜/连败：根据连胜/连败场次获得额外金币（选秀与野怪回合不计入）"] = "Gold Coins can be used to purchase chess pieces and upgrade your population. Sources include: \n 1. Base: A fixed amount is granted at the end of each round. \n 2. Interest: Receive 10% of your current total Gold Coins as interest each round (up to a maximum of 5 Gold Coins). \n 3. Victory: Instantly receive 1 Gold Coin upon winning a player-versus-player battle. \n 4. Win/Loss Streaks: Receive additional Gold Coins based on your current win or loss streak (Draft and creep rounds do not count).",
    ["金币在发烫……这次它想把我带到哪里？"] = "The gold coin is burning hot... Where does it want to take me this time?",
