    ["金秋湖FB-buff占位\n84006100 ~ 84006699 请不占用"] = "Golden Autumn Lake FB-buff placeholder \n84006100 ~ 84006699 please do not occupy",
    ["金秋湖……如果那里真有某种非凡力量，可能会造成危险。得去看看。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake... if there really is some kind of Beyonder power there, it could be dangerous. I need to investigate.",
    ["金秋湖。用灵摆确认一下。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake. I'll confirm it with the pendulum.",
