    ["金秋湖乌龟-近距离击退"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Turtle - Close Range Knockback",
    ["金秋湖加工品"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Processed Product",
    ["金秋湖南瓜氛围"] = "Golden Autumn Lake pumpkin atmosphere",
    ["金秋湖历史悠久，时常吸引赏金猎人或者考古学家前往。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake has a long history and often attracts bounty hunters or archaeologists.",
    ["金秋湖发生了多起“德古拉新娘”命案，传说这与吸血鬼有关……"] = "Multiple \"Dracula's Bride\" murder cases have occurred at Golden Autumn Lake; legend has it that this is related to vampires...",
    ["金秋湖大南瓜"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Giant Pumpkin",
    ["金秋湖失控任务"] = "Golden Autumn Lake loss of control quest.",
    ["金秋湖失控非凡者-起始测试"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Loss of Control Beyonder - Initial Test",
    ["金秋湖导游"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Tour Guide",
    ["金秋湖岸最近接连有人失踪，有传言说和农场卖的一种“能让人梦想成真”的南瓜有关。\n提示：任务触发需SAN值低于40。"] = "People have been going missing near Golden Autumn Lake recently. Rumor has it that it's related to a type of \"dream-come-true\" pumpkin sold at the farm. \nTip: Quest trigger requires SAN value below 40.",
    ["金秋湖或许更适合你。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake might be more suitable for you.",
    ["金秋湖旅行专列启动"] = "Golden Autumn Lake travel train started",
    ["金秋湖无名小孩"] = "Unnamed Child of Golden Autumn Lake",
    ["金秋湖日出"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Sunrise",
    ["金秋湖是一片与世无争的田园乐土，常年处于令人愉悦的丰收季。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake is a peaceful pastoral paradise, permanently in a pleasant harvest season.",
    ["金秋湖有一只狒狒似乎陷入了某种烦恼中。"] = "At Golden Autumn Lake, a baboon seems to be caught in some kind of trouble.",
    ["金秋湖村庄中还流传过一则神秘预言——“<P_Yellow>当圣者的叹息声响起时，金色幼苗在此地苏醒，万物将迎接荒芜。</>”"] = "A mysterious prophecy has also circulated in the Golden Autumn Lake village—\"<P_Yellow>When the Saint's sigh sounds, the golden seedling awakens here, and all things will welcome desolation.</>\"",
    ["金秋湖村庄中还流传过一则神秘预言——“当圣者的叹息声响起时，金色幼苗将在此地苏醒，万物将迎接荒芜。”"] = "A mysterious prophecy has also circulated in the village of Golden Autumn Lake—'When the Saint's sigh sounds, the golden seedlings will wake up here, and all things will welcome desolation.'",
    ["金秋湖氛围-村庄传闻"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Atmosphere - Village Rumors",
    ["金秋湖氛围-车站-旅人"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Atmosphere - Station - Traveler",
    ["金秋湖氛围-车站-私奔的人"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Atmosphere - Station - Runaways",
    ["金秋湖火车站"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Train Station",
    ["金秋湖特产工艺品"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Specialty Crafts",
    ["金秋湖特产鱼类"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Specialty Fish",
    ["金秋湖男子"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Man",
    ["金秋湖畔"] = "Golden Autumn Lakeside",
    ["金秋湖畔有位失忆的年迈旅人，正在寻找自己散落的记忆。"] = "There is an elderly traveler with amnesia by Golden Autumn Lake, searching for their scattered memories.",
    ["金秋湖的人热爱和平，勤劳质朴，不主动探索周遭的神秘事物。"] = "The people of Golden Autumn Lake love peace, are hardworking and simple, and do not actively explore the mysterious things around them.",
    ["金秋湖的宝藏，据说是第四纪的东西。"] = "The treasure of Golden Autumn Lake is said to be from the Fourth Epoch.",
    ["金秋湖的观景拍照留念：\n位于鲁恩北部的金秋湖，是王国木材的供应地。\n丰饶之树长于废墟之上，静静见证着这片土地上的生生不息。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Sightseeing Photo: \nLocated in the north of Loen, Golden Autumn Lake is the kingdom's timber supply base. \nThe Tree of Abundance grows on the ruins, quietly witnessing the endless life on this land.",
    ["金秋湖秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reached 100%.",
    ["金秋湖秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 100%%",
    ["金秋湖秩序世界完成度达到30%%"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 30%%",
    ["金秋湖秩序世界完成度达到60%%"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Order World completion reaches 60%%",
    ["金秋湖葡萄氛围"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Grape Atmosphere",
    ["金秋湖跳舞"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Dance",
    ["金秋湖面破浪"] = "Golden Autumn Lake Surfing",
    ["金秋湖鲜鱼丰收，限时打折"] = "Golden Autumn Lake fresh fish harvest, limited-time discount",
    ["金秋湖，一片与世无争的田园乐土。\n这里有自然的恩赐、永恒的生长，在丰饶树的眷顾下，连绵不绝的金色丰收如同一副画卷——直到一场污染降临，让丰收变成了一种灾难。\n亩产千斤的葡萄、堆积成山的稻田、还有永远永远剪不完的羊毛……森林中的动物也受到影响，巨大的龟咆哮而出，狒狒们快乐起舞……人们接二连三地逃离金秋小镇，非凡者和值夜者们留了下来：“保护金秋湖，不能让污染毁掉这里！”\n  一场轰轰烈烈的金秋湖保卫战，就此拉开序幕。"] = "Golden Autumn Lake, a peaceful pastoral paradise. \n Here, there are the gifts of nature and eternal growth. Under the blessing of the Tree of Abundance, the endless golden harvest is like a painting—until a corruption descends, turning the harvest into a disaster. \n Grapes with a yield of thousands of pounds, mountains of rice paddies, and wool that can never be finished shearing... The animals in the forest are also affected; giant turtles roar, and baboons dance happily... People flee the town of Golden Autumn one after another, but the Beyonders and Nighthawks remain: \"Protect Golden Autumn Lake, we cannot let the corruption destroy this place!\" \n A grand battle to defend Golden Autumn Lake begins.",
    ["金秋湖，我的家乡。\n那里有老查克的酒馆， 有小柯莱的菜园， 有我熟悉的每一条路。\n以此旅行途中所得配方，献给老查克，实现我们的约定。\n——记于1284年秋天 帕利诺"] = "Golden Autumn Lake, my hometown.\nThere is Old Chuck's tavern, Little Colley's vegetable garden, and every road I am familiar with.\nWith the formula obtained during this trip, I dedicate it to Old Chuck to fulfill our promise.\n—Written in the autumn of 1284, Pallino",
    ["金秋的恩赐！"] = "The gift of golden autumn!",
