    ["金黄浓郁的南瓜汤冒着热气，奶香与肉桂交织，入口绵密甘甜，温暖直达心底。"] = "Golden, rich pumpkin soup steaming hot, with milk and cinnamon intertwined. The taste is dense and sweet, and the warmth reaches straight to the heart.",
    ["金黄的炸薯条，美味的鲷鱼饼，您劳累一天的最好报酬！"] = "Golden-brown french fries, delicious sea bream cakes—the best reward for your hard day's work!",
    ["金黄色的蛋糕体蓬松如云，酸香混着奶甜漫开，一口下去就开启一个幸福的一天。"] = "The golden cake body is as fluffy as a cloud, with a mix of sour and milky sweetness spreading out. One bite starts a happy day.",
    ["金黄饱满的南瓜，甜到你掉牙！"] = "Golden, plump pumpkins, sweet enough to make your teeth fall out!",
    ["鉴于你的礼貌，我免费向你赠送一些珍贵的知识。以后你再提问，可是要遵守“对等原则”的。"] = "In view of your politeness, I will gift you some precious knowledge for free. If you ask questions in the future, however, you must abide by the 'principle of equivalence.'",
    ["鉴定后发现是赝品。但更戏剧性的是——画家本人恰好在场，当场提出以一千镑买下，说这是“史上最成功的致敬之作”。"] = "After appraisal, it was found to be a fake. But what was even more dramatic was—the painter himself happened to be present and immediately offered to buy it for one thousand pounds, saying it was the 'most successful tribute in history.'",
