    ["铁匠铺的小伙计，打铁时偷偷把烧红的铁条凑近炭火暖手。"] = "The young apprentice at the blacksmith shop secretly held the red-hot iron bar close to the charcoal fire to warm his hands while forging.",
    ["铁十字平价钟表行"] = "Iron Cross Affordable Clock Shop",
    ["铁十字街"] = "Iron Cross Street",
    ["铁十字街\n路人们穿过街道，有的与摊主讨价还价，有的匆匆前行。\n一只猫从小摊的桌面上跑过。\n在角落里皮特带着伊妮德一闪而过。"] = "Iron Cross Street \n Passersby walk through the street, some bargaining with stall owners, others hurrying along. \n A cat runs across the table of a small stall. \n In the corner, Pete and Enid flash by.",
    ["铁十字街\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Iron Cross Street</>"] = "Iron Cross Street\r\n<LeonSubTitle size=\"38\">Iron Cross Street</>",
