    ["铁十字街人头攒动，似乎正在举办什么活动。"] = "Iron Cross Street is bustling with people; it seems some kind of event is being held.",
    ["铁十字街人头攒动，似乎正在举办什么活动。\n欢乐的气氛中，人们排成长队，使用【动作表情-四处观察】加入他们吧！"] = "Iron Cross Street is bustling, it seems like some event is being held. \nIn the joyful atmosphere, people are lining up, use [Action-Observe Around] to join them!",
