    ["铁十字街尽头有家水果摊，傍晚六点之后去。老板急着收摊，一苏勒能买一大袋。"] = "There is a fruit stand at the end of Iron Cross Street; go after six in the evening. The owner is in a hurry to close, and you can buy a big bag for one sol.",
