    ["铁十字街的观景拍照留念：\n以十字路口为核心，两条道路交错而成铁十字街。\n悲伤、喜悦、疲惫、轻快……黄昏平等地照耀在行人身上。\n无论上下，无论贫富，都将在路中汇聚。"] = "Iron Cross Street Sightseeing Photo: \nWith the intersection as its core, two roads crisscross to form Iron Cross Street. \nSadness, joy, exhaustion, lightness... the dusk shines equally upon every passerby. \nRegardless of status or wealth, everyone converges on this road.",
