    ["铁十字街，路人穿过街道，有的跟摊主讨价还价，有的匆匆前行。\n一只小猫从小摊的桌面跑过。\n角落里，皮特带伊妮德在人群中一闪而过。"] = "Iron Cross Street, passersby cross the street, some bargaining with stall owners, others hurrying along. \nA kitten runs across the table of a small stall. \nIn the corner, Pete and Islyn flash by in the crowd.",
    ["铁十字街？这里人太多，追踪的痕迹被冲淡了，再占卜一次吧。"] = "Iron Cross Street? There are too many people here, the tracking traces have been diluted. Let's divine again.",
