    ["镇上的人都说，你修好的钟，走得比新的还准。如果觉得这只怀表不够好，就修好它。"] = "Everyone in town says that the clocks you fix run more accurately than new ones. If you feel this pocket watch isn't good enough, then fix it.",
    ["镇子上也有两个小广场，据说以前也是古堡的领地。现在，大家喜欢在那些地方组织些活动，有时候很热闹呢。"] = "There are also two small squares in town, which are said to have been part of the castle's territory in the past. Now, everyone likes to organize activities in those places, and sometimes it's very lively.",
