    ["镜中廷根危机四伏，拯救廷根仍将继续。后续主线将在公测开启，敬请期待。"] = "The Mirror Tingen is fraught with crises, and the mission to save Tingen continues. The subsequent main storyline will be available when the public beta begins; please look forward to it.",
