    ["镶嵌红宝石的金戒指闪动光辉。濒死时从近处敌人身上汲取血肉，一次次从死亡边缘复生。但丢失理智的代价是，战斗中你偶尔会变得迟钝、移速降低。"] = "The gold ring inlaid with rubies flashes with brilliance. When near death, it draws flesh and blood from nearby enemies, resurrecting from the edge of death time and time again. But the price of losing sanity is that you will occasionally become slow and have reduced movement speed during battle.",
