    ["长了就割，割完又长。"] = "They get harvested when they grow, and they grow again after being harvested.",
    ["长交互选项"] = "Long Interaction Option",
    ["长出头发、渗出鲜血、诡异地转动，廷根东区的风车是否存在着隐秘的危险？"] = "Growing hair, oozing blood, turning eerily—does the windmill in Tingen's East District harbor hidden dangers?",
    ["长出完整人脸结构的异常玫瑰，常用于精神或诡秘仪式。"] = "An abnormal rose that has grown a complete human face structure, often used in mental or mysterious rituals.",
    ["长势真好！"] = "It's growing really well!",
