    ["长桌上用于纪念的帆船模型，仿佛能将远方的海域与风浪一并带入室内。"] = "The sailboat model on the long table seems to bring the distant seas and winds into the room.",
    ["长桌子"] = "Long table",
    ["长桌的烛光能照亮整座庄园，欢声笑语持续了一个又一个通宵！"] = "The candlelight at the long table could illuminate the entire manor, and the laughter lasted night after night!",
