    ["门2"] = "Door 2",
    ["门”领域对致命伤害的封印锁链缠绕你的心脏。单次受伤造成的生命值损失不得超过最大生命值的10%"] = "The sealing chains of the \"Door\" domain against fatal damage are wrapped around your heart. Damage taken from a single hit cannot exceed 10% of your maximum Health.",
    ["门上兽首低垂，凝视着所有踏足此处者。"] = "The beast head on the door hangs low, gazing at everyone who steps here.",
    ["门为什么关着？开门，开门啊！好痛，我的头要裂开了——"] = "Why is the door locked? Open the door, open it! It hurts, my head is splitting—",
