    ["闻一闻"] = "Sniff",
    ["闻一闻……"] = "Sniffing...",
    ["闻到战斗的气息，将军会化作恶灵定期现身，追踪仇敌的方向进行追踪攻击，造成伤害、眩晕并刻下仇敌印记。但要记得离它远一点，主人也是它的仇敌。"] = "Smelling the scent of battle, the General will turn into an Evil Spirit. and appear periodically, tracking the direction of the Enemy to perform tracking attacks, causing damage, Stun, and carving an Enemy Mark. But remember to stay away from it; the master is also its Enemy.",
    ["闻博"] = "Wenbo",
    ["闻宇"] = "Wenyu",
    ["闻知"] = "Wenzhi",
    ["闻花香的感觉？"] = "The feeling of smelling flowers?",
    ["闻起来很糟糕，肉的味道混合着一股酒气。"] = "Smells terrible, the scent of meat mixed with the smell of alcohol.",
