    ["闻闻杯中的牛奶"] = "Smell the milk in the cup",
    ["闻闻花香，驱散枪火血腥"] = "Smell the flowers and dispel the blood and gunpowder.",
    ["闻闻药剂……"] = "Smelling the potion...",
