    ["阀门"] = "Valve",
    ["阀门被击毁！核心失去5%的生命"] = "The valve has been destroyed! The core loses 5% of its Health.",
    ["阁下 这里是哪里？"] = "Your Excellency, where is this?",
    ["阁下……如果您愿意，可以将它卖给南边的造纸厂，这样不需要给垃圾大王中转费。"] = "My lord... if you are willing, you can sell it to the paper mill in the south, so you don't have to pay the middleman fee to the Trash King.",
    ["阁下是否确定签署此份契据，从此以<Highlight>%s</>之名立身于世，让<Highlight>%s</>成为您故事新的注脚？"] = "Are you sure you want to sign this deed and henceforth stand in the world under the name of <Highlight>%s</>, letting <Highlight>%s</> become a new footnote to your story?",
    ["阁下，可能过段时间……或是下周，或是明天，我可能就会消失……"] = "My lord, perhaps in a while... or next week, or tomorrow, I might disappear...",
    ["阁下，尝试结束了吗？可以让我们回去了吗？"] = "Your Excellency, is the attempt over? Can you let us go back?",
    ["阁下，您看起来并不常干这一行。"] = "My lord, you don't seem to do this often.",
    ["阁下，您能拉我们来到这里，拥有我们无法想象的伟力。您做的见证，不管是我，还是她，都不敢违背。"] = "Your Excellency, you can pull us here and possess power beyond our imagination. Neither I nor she would dare to violate the witness you provide.",
    ["阁下，我们该怎么称呼您？"] = "Your Excellency, how should we address you?",
    ["阁下，请问该怎么称呼您？"] = "Your Excellency, how should we address you?",
    ["阁楼只要一苏勒的租金，六便士的面包，至少还能留下半瓶酒……"] = "The attic only costs one sol in rent, six pence for bread, at least I can still have half a bottle of wine left...",
