    ["阿兹克-无敌"] = "Azik - Invincibility",
    ["阿兹克·艾格斯"] = "Azik Eggers",
    ["阿兹克·艾格斯为第四纪拜朗帝国死亡执政官，现为死神途径序列2天使。"] = "Azik Eggers was the Death Consul of the Balam Empire in the Fourth Epoch, and is now a Sequence 2 Angel of the Death Pathway.",
    ["阿兹克·艾格斯是霍伊大学的历史系教员，他也是第四纪就存在的拜朗帝国的“死亡执政官”，是收尸人途径的序列2天使。"] = "Azik Eggers is a history faculty member at Hoey University. He is also the \"Death Consul\" of the Balam Empire, which existed in the Fourth Epoch, and is a Sequence 2 Angel of the Corpse Collector Pathway.",
    ["阿兹克·艾格斯每次苏醒均会失去记忆，随着时间推移逐渐恢复后又再度死亡。"] = "Azik Eggers loses his memory every time he wakes up, and as time passes, he gradually recovers before dying again.",
    ["阿兹克·艾格斯的来信"] = "A Letter from Azik Eggers",
    ["阿兹克与克莱恩"] = "Azik and Klein",
    ["阿兹克与古堡（一）"] = "Azik and the Castle (I)",
    ["阿兹克与古堡（三）"] = "Azik and the Ancient Castle (III)",
    ["阿兹克与古堡（二）"] = "Azik and the Castle (II)",
    ["阿兹克二人的信"] = "Letter from Azik and his companion",
    ["阿兹克从冥界出来"] = "Azik comes out of the Underworld",
    ["阿兹克仰望古堡，恍惚间忆起梦境：马厩、水井、营房、田地，年幼的儿子拖着阔剑，妻子抱怨城堡太阴暗。\n往昔片段闪过，他扶住头，神情痛苦。"] = "Azik looks up at the castle, recalling a dream in a trance: stables, wells, barracks, fields, his young son dragging a broadsword, his wife complaining that the castle is too gloomy. \nFragments of the past flash by, he holds his head, his expression pained.",
    ["阿兹克任务减san"] = "Azik Quest Sanity loss",
    ["阿兹克任务出位面加san"] = "Azik Quest out of plane Sanity gain",
    ["阿兹克任务加san"] = "Azik Quest Sanity gain",
    ["阿兹克先生"] = "Mr. Azik",
    ["阿兹克先生——！"] = "Mr. Azik—!",
    ["阿兹克先生……"] = "Mr. Azik...",
    ["阿兹克先生在离开廷根之前，把一枚铜哨送给了我。"] = "Before Mr. Azik left Tingen, he gave me a copper whistle.",
    ["阿兹克先生的见识非常渊博，他总能给出准确而有用的建议。"] = "Mr. Azik is very knowledgeable, and he can always give accurate and useful advice.",
    ["阿兹克先生！我在古堡看到了一幅画像，与您长相相似，不，简直是一模一样！"] = "Mr. Azik! I saw a portrait in the old castle that looks similar to you, no, it's exactly the same!",
    ["阿兹克先生，你在担心什么吗？"] = "Mr. Azik, are you worried about something?",
    ["阿兹克先生，你的手看起来受伤了。"] = "Mr. Azik, your hand looks injured.",
    ["阿兹克先生，您之前是霍伊大学的历史系教师？"] = "Mr. Azik, were you previously a history teacher at Khoy University?",
    ["阿兹克先生，您是拜朗人？"] = "Mr. Azik, are you Balam?",
    ["阿兹克先生，您的不死能力，是来自序列4“不死者”的非凡能力吗？"] = "Mr. Azik, is your immortality ability from the Sequence 4 'Undying' Beyonder power?",
    ["阿兹克先生，我对你的状况有一个猜想。"] = "Mr. Azik, I have a hypothesis about your situation.",
    ["阿兹克先生，教典上写着，您是愚者座下陪伴最久的天使……"] = "Mr. Azik, the scriptures say that you are the Angel who has accompanied the Fool for the longest time...",
    ["阿兹克先生，老罗德迷糊了，举着蜡烛说要回归死亡！我喊不住他！"] = "Mr. Azik, Old Rhode is confused; he's holding a candle and saying he wants to return to death! I can't stop him!",
    ["阿兹克先生，芬恩让我告诉你，“庆典”今晚会在墓地广场举行。"] = "Mr. Azik, Finn asked me to tell you that the \"celebration\" will be held at the cemetery square tonight.",
    ["阿兹克先生，这里就是……冥界吗？"] = "Mr. Azik, is this... the Underworld?",
    ["阿兹克先生？"] = "Mr. Azik?",
    ["阿兹克去看日出"] = "Azik goes to watch the sunrise",
    ["阿兹克后效测试"] = "Azik Aftereffect Test",
    ["阿兹克向前走路点"] = "Azik Walk-to Waypoint",
    ["阿兹克回忆"] = "Azik memory",
    ["阿兹克妻子"] = "Azik's Wife",
    ["阿兹克妻子灵体"] = "Azik's Wife's Spirit Body",
    ["阿兹克妻子点位"] = "Azik's wife's point",
    ["阿兹克安慰芬恩"] = "Azik comforts Finn",
    ["阿兹克对目标召唤白骨信使的死亡之爪，造成*d点伤害。死亡之爪附加<HighLight>死亡侵蚀</>效果，持续4秒，每秒造成一定伤害。"] = "Azik summons the Death Claw of the Bone Messenger to the target, dealing *d damage. The Death Claw applies the <HighLight>Death Erosion</> effect for 4 seconds, dealing damage every second.",
    ["阿兹克对目标召唤白骨信使的死亡之爪，造成伤害。死亡之爪附加死亡侵蚀效果，每秒造成一定伤害。"] = "Azik summons the Death Claw of the Bone Messenger to the target, dealing damage. The Death Claw applies the Death Erosion effect, dealing damage every second.",
    ["阿兹克对目标造成少量伤害，若目标身上具有死亡侵蚀，则造成大量伤害。"] = "Azik deals a small amount of damage to the target. If the target is affected by Death Erosion, it deals a large amount of damage.",
    ["阿兹克将那只手套递给克莱恩时，他看见掌心裂开了一张嘴，白森森的牙齿在虚空中咬合。\n“它很强大，”阿兹克说，“但每次使用后，必须用一个活人的灵魂和血肉喂饱它。”\n克莱恩接过手套，感到一股永远无法填平的饥饿。\n那天晚上，他写下誓言：“我只放牧罪孽深重之人，我承诺让原本放牧的灵魂得到解脱。”\n从那以后，格尔曼·斯帕罗的名字开始在海上流传——那个戴着人皮手套的疯狂冒险家，专门猎杀海盗、奴隶贩子和罪犯。\n他解放原本囚禁的可怜灵魂，放牧曾犯下血债的罪孽之人。\n后来，手套在迷雾小镇与A先生融合，开始在克莱恩的脑海中赞美真实造物主。\n“早中晚各一次，”克莱恩拿出一把蘑菇，冷静地说，“赞颂前必须预先提醒。”\n手套剧烈颤抖——它从未想过，有一天会被蘑菇威胁。\n“成交。”\n从此，格尔曼·斯帕罗的口袋里总是装着几颗蘑菇。"] = "When Azik handed that glove to Klein, he saw a mouth split open in the palm, white teeth biting in the void. \n \"It is very powerful,\" Azik said, \"but after every use, it must be fed with the soul and flesh of a living person.\" \n Klein took the glove and felt a hunger that could never be satisfied. \n That night, he wrote a vow: \"I will only shepherd those who have committed grave sins; I promise to let the souls I shepherd find release.\" \n From then on, the name Gehrman Sparrow began to spread on the sea—the crazy adventurer wearing human-skin gloves who specialized in hunting pirates, slave traders, and criminals. \n He liberated the poor souls that were originally imprisoned and shepherded the sinners who had committed blood debts. \n Later, the glove fused with Mr. A in the Fog Town and began to praise the True Creator in Klein's mind. \n \"Once in the morning, noon, and night,\" Klein took out a mushroom and said calmly, \"you must give a warning before praising.\" \n The glove trembled violently—it had never imagined that one day it would be threatened by a mushroom. \n \"Deal.\" \n From then on, Gehrman Sparrow's pocket was always filled with a few mushrooms.",
    ["阿兹克支线"] = "Azik Side Quest",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法-最后阶段加速12%"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay - Final Stage Acceleration 12%",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法-隐形怪无敌不可选中"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay - Stealth Monster Invincibility Untargetable",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法传送"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay Teleport",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法指示用光效"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay Indicator Light Effect",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法烛光"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay Candlelight",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法红色灵体材质"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay Red Spirit Material",
    ["阿兹克支线-氛围玩法追击后效"] = "Azik Side Quest - Atmosphere Gameplay Pursuit Aftereffect",
    ["阿兹克支线—黑屏后效"] = "Azik Side Quest - Black Screen Aftereffect",
    ["阿兹克沉睡期间，克莱恩一直在给他写信。"] = "During Azik's slumber, Klein kept writing letters to him.",
    ["阿兹克登场时，战斗开始压制敌方全体。"] = "When Azik enters the field, suppress all enemies at the start of battle.",
    ["阿兹克的回忆"] = "Azik's memories",
    ["阿兹克离开路点"] = "Azik Leave Waypoint",
    ["阿兹克苏醒"] = "Azik awakens",
    ["阿兹克苏醒后看到的第一个画面是如雪花般覆盖着周围的信纸，\n他从中记起了自己是谁，也记起了许多往事。"] = "The first scene Azik saw after waking up was letter paper covering the surroundings like snowflakes, \nfrom which he remembered who he was and also remembered many past events.",
    ["阿兹克认为，自己可能活了很久，像游荡的幽灵，遗忘了本应铭记的过去。\n克莱恩推测，他的遗忘是循环的——每隔几十年死去一次，清空记忆，然后重生。"] = "Azik believes that he might have lived for a very long time, like a wandering ghost, having forgotten the past he should have remembered. \nKlein speculates that his forgetting is cyclical—dying once every few decades, clearing his memory, and then being reborn.",
    ["阿兹克说明天再汇合，先调查一下拉姆德古堡周围的居民。"] = "Azik said to meet up tomorrow; let's investigate the residents around Lamud Castle first.",
    ["阿兹克走到这里"] = "Azik walks to here",
    ["阿兹克走过去"] = "Azik Walks Over",
    ["阿兹克走进了办公室。"] = "Azik walks into the office.",
    ["阿兹克路径"] = "Azik path",
    ["阿兹克过肩"] = "Azik Over-the-Shoulder",
    ["阿兹克近景"] = "Azik Close-up",
    ["阿兹克隐秘羁绊奖励"] = "Azik secret bond reward.",
    ["阿兹克，你怎么还不进来？"] = "Azik, why haven't you come in yet?",
    ["阿兹克：你要知道，我并不是真正的占卜家。"] = "Azik: You have to know, I am not a real Seer.",
    ["阿兹克：克莱恩，我发现你的命运有不协调的地方。"] = "Azik: Klein, I found that there is an inconsistency in your fate.",
    ["阿兹克：再会。"] = "Azik: Farewell.",
    ["阿兹克：我只能看出一点不协调，其他什么也发现不了。"] = "Azik: I can only see a little inconsistency, I can't find anything else.",
    ["阿兹利尔·"] = "Azriel ",
    ["阿兹猫·"] = "AzCat ",
