    ["阿尔伯特"] = "Albert",
    ["阿尔伯特-中间"] = "Albert - Middle",
    ["阿尔伯特。你从未向我提过任何要求。一次都没有。"] = "Albert. You never made any requests of me. Not even once.",
    ["阿尔伯特。四十五年，你从未向我提过任何要求。一次都没有。"] = "Albert. For forty-five years, you have never asked me for anything. Not even once.",
    ["阿尔伯特在街角的风车那边搞了一些恶作剧，乱涂红漆、挂鱼线，还在半夜转动风车。"] = "Albert has been playing pranks at the windmill on the street corner, smearing red paint, hanging fishing lines, and turning the windmill in the middle of the night.",
    ["阿尔伯特家在哪里？"] = "Where is Albert's house?",
    ["阿尔伯特平时在后院干什么？"] = "What does Albert usually do in the backyard?",
    ["阿尔伯特的反应"] = "Albert's reaction",
    ["阿尔伯特的忏悔"] = "Albert's confession",
    ["阿尔伯特的父亲怎么了？"] = "What happened to Albert's father?",
    ["阿尔伯特站在大厅边缘，身体微颤，推了推鼻\n梁上的眼镜。\n\n灯光下，镜片折射出异样的光泽，似乎并不是\n普通玻璃。"] = "Albert stands at the edge of the Hall, his body trembling slightly as he pushes up the glasses on the bridge of his nose. \n\n\n Under the light, the lenses refract an unusual luster, as if they are not \n ordinary glass.",
    ["阿尔伯特站在大厅边缘，身体微颤，摘下眼镜擦拭眼角。"] = "Albert stood at the edge of the hall, his body trembling slightly, taking off his glasses to wipe the corners of his eyes.",
    ["阿尔伯特被丢给了姑妈玛里琳照顾，八九岁，正是爱恶作剧的年纪，玛里琳也很头痛吧。"] = "Albert was left to be looked after by his aunt Marilyn. At eight or nine years old, it's the age for mischief; Marilyn must have a headache too.",
    ["阿尔伯特身上有异常"] = "There is an abnormality with Albert",
    ["阿尔伯特这么想去海上，我却不了解他这个愿望……我也该承担起父亲的职责了。"] = "Albert wants to go to sea so much, yet I didn't understand his wish... I should also take on my responsibilities as a father.",
    ["阿尔伯特！"] = "Albert!",
    ["阿尔伯特，你还好吗？"] = "Albert, are you alright?",
    ["阿尔伯特：少爷，到我身后！"] = "Albert: Young Master, get behind me!",
    ["阿尔伯特：点上火就不黑了。"] = "Albert: Once the fire is lit, it won't be dark anymore.",
    ["阿尔伯特：请安息……我会找到让你们安息的地方……"] = "Albert: Please rest in peace... I will find a place for you to rest...",
    ["阿尔伯特：谢谢……谢谢你们。"] = "Albert: Thank you... thank you both.",
    ["阿尔伯特？噢，那个疯子水手吉瑞尔的孩子！哈，这个鱼线应该也是他家的。"] = "Albert? Oh, that madman sailor Girel's child! Ha, this fishing line must be from his house too.",
    ["阿尔博特"] = "Albert",
    ["阿尔吉"] = "Alger",
    ["阿尔弗雷德"] = "Alfred",
    ["阿尔文·"] = "Alvin ",
    ["阿尔杰"] = "Alger",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊"] = "Alger Wilson",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊-1星"] = "Alger Wilson - 1 Star",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊-2星"] = "Alger Wilson - 2 Star",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊-3星"] = "Alger Wilson - 3 Star",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊的历史投影，重现了原主的形态与部分能力。"] = "A historical projection of Alger Wilson, recreating the original's form and partial abilities.",
    ["阿尔杰·威尔逊，“幽蓝复仇者”号的船长，塔罗会的“倒吊人”。他出身风暴之主教会，从水手一步步成长为船长，深谙海上生存法则和非凡者世界的残酷。\n他沉稳、谨慎，善于观察，从不轻易暴露真实想法。在塔罗会创立之初，他抱着获取资源和信息的目的加入，对“愚者”保持着试探和交易的心态。\n然而，随着一次次见证“愚者”展现的力量，阿尔杰逐渐从质疑者变成了最虔诚的信徒。他开始用“这是我们的荣幸”代替讨价还价，用“遵从您的意志”回应“愚者”的每一个指示。\n但与此同时，他依然是那个会在船长室里冷静处理各种事件的船长，是那个会唱跑调“冲激”诗歌的海上冒险家，是置身于风暴之主教会与愚者教会之间的那位独特存在。"] = "Alger Wilson, captain of the \"Blue Avenger,\" is the \"The Hanged Man\" of the Tarot Club. Originating from the Church of the Lord of Storms, he rose from a sailor to a captain, deeply understanding the laws of survival at sea and the cruelty of the Beyonder world. \n He is composed, cautious, and observant, never easily revealing his true thoughts. At the inception of the Tarot Club, he joined with the goal of acquiring resources and information, maintaining a mindset of testing and bargaining toward \"The Fool.\" \n However, as he witnessed the power displayed by \"The Fool\" time and again, Alger gradually transformed from a skeptic into one of the most devout believers. He began replacing bargaining with \"It is our honor\" and responding to every instruction from \"The Fool\" with \"As you wish.\" \n Yet, at the same time, he remains the captain who calmly handles various incidents in his cabin, the maritime adventurer who sings off-key \"Surge\" poems, and that unique existence positioned between the Church of the Lord of Storms and the Church of The Fool.",
    ["阿尔杰伙伴技能-漩涡减速"] = "Alger Partner Skill - Vortex Slow",
    ["阿尔杰伙伴技能-漩涡拉扯"] = "Alger Partner Skill - Vortex Pull",
    ["阿尔杰伙伴技能-通路减速"] = "Alger Partner Skill - Path Slow",
    ["阿尔杰写的纸"] = "Paper written by Alger",
    ["阿尔杰属于哪个途径？"] = "Which pathway does Alger belong to?",
    ["阿尔杰站在甲板上，手上托着一个古怪的玻璃瓶，自言自语：“还差鬼鲨的血……”"] = "Alger stands on the deck, holding a strange glass bottle, muttering to himself: \"Still missing the blood of a Ghost Shark...\"",
