    ["阿蒙之翼"] = "Wings of Amon",
    ["阿蒙之翼-40攻击+150生命+20%暴击"] = "Amon's Wings - 40 Attack +150 Health +20% Critical Hit",
    ["阿蒙乌鸦"] = "Amon Crow",
    ["阿蒙兴致全无，倒转了时光……"] = "Amon has lost interest and reversed time...",
    ["阿蒙分身"] = "Amon Avatar",
    ["阿蒙分身召唤五个历史旋涡，需要<Disable>转火击杀</>，否则将造成<Disable>巨额全团伤害</>，阴影区的漩涡会获得<Disable>巨额免伤</>，玩家需要优先击杀非阴影区的漩涡；此外，阿蒙分身会在技能持续时间两次逆转时空，将场上的<Disable>阴影区和非阴影区调换</>，玩家需要及时赶往新的非阴影区击杀漩涡。"] = "The Amon Avatar summons five history vortexes that need to be <Disable>focused and killed</>, otherwise they will deal <Disable>massive raid-wide damage</>. Vortexes in shadow areas will gain <Disable>massive damage reduction</>, so players need to prioritize killing vortexes in non-shadow areas. Additionally, the Amon Avatar will reverse time twice during the skill's duration, swapping the <Disable>shadow areas and non-shadow areas</> on the field, and players need to rush to the new non-shadow areas in time to kill the vortexes.",
    ["阿蒙分身召唤六个分身，并化身光球在分身之间流转，<Disable>光球最终落点处的分身</>即为真身，限时内<Disable>找到并击破真身</>可让阿蒙分身陷入虚弱，若倒计时结束后真身仍存活，阿蒙分身将重新现身并<Disable>团灭玩家</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar summons six avatars and transforms into a ball of light that flows between them. The avatar <Disable>where the ball of light finally lands</> is the true body. <Disable>Finding and breaking the true body</> within the time limit will cause the Amon Avatar to fall into a weakened state. If the true body is still alive after the countdown ends, the Amon Avatar will reappear and <Disable>wipe out the players</>.",
    ["阿蒙分身召唤数个跟随并伤害玩家的时光涌流，需要玩家<Disable>将涌流引入阴影区</>才能将涌流消灭。"] = "The Amon Avatar summons several Time Surges that follow and damage players. Players need to <Disable>lure the surges into shadow areas</> to eliminate them.",
    ["阿蒙分身将禁忌的知识灌输给数位玩家，在<Disable>阴影区</>爆炸的知识将推进时针并生成一个<Disable>新的阴影区</>，在<Disable>非阴影区</>爆炸的知识将对所有玩家造成<Disable>巨大的伤害</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar instills forbidden knowledge into several players. Knowledge that explodes in a <Disable>shadow area</> will advance the clock hand and generate a <Disable>new shadow area</>, while knowledge that explodes in a <Disable>non-shadow area</> will deal <Disable>massive damage</> to all players.",
    ["阿蒙分身尝试占领玩家的身体，使玩家<Disable>逐渐失去控制</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar attempts to take over the player's body, causing the player to <Disable>gradually lose control</>.",
    ["阿蒙分身怪出生buff"] = "Amon avatar monster spawn buff",
    ["阿蒙分身怪真身buff"] = "Amon avatar true form buff",
    ["阿蒙分身本体从场上离开，化成千万阿蒙分身，对玩家<Disable>一齐发动攻击</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar leaves the field and transforms into thousands of Amon Avatars, <Disable>launching a collective attack</> on the players.",
    ["阿蒙分身死亡期间无敌不可选中buff"] = "Amon Avatar Invincible Untargetable Buff During Death",
    ["阿蒙分身流转特效buff"] = "Amon avatar flow effect buff",
    ["阿蒙分身监听死亡及锁血buff"] = "Amon Avatar Death and HP Lock Buff Monitor",
    ["阿蒙分身能够操纵时间的力量，持续在场上生成阴影区域；阿蒙分身在<Disable>阴影区中免疫伤害</>，玩家在阴影区中会<Disable>受到伤害</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar can manipulate the power of time, continuously generating shadow areas on the field; the Amon Avatar is <Disable>immune to damage in shadow areas</>, while players in shadow areas will <Disable>take damage</>.",
    ["阿蒙分身获得护盾并寄生两名玩家，持续造成伤害与控制，在被寄生期间死亡的玩家将爆炸并对所有玩家造成巨额伤害，<Disable>击破阿蒙分身护盾可解除对玩家的寄生</>。"] = "The Amon Avatar gains a shield and parasitizes two players, continuously dealing damage and controlling them. Players who die while parasitized will explode and deal massive damage to all players. <Disable>Breaking the Amon Avatar's shield can remove the parasitism on players</>.",
