    ["陌生人，这一切与你无关。"] = "Stranger, this has nothing to do with you.",
    ["陌生的？每天都会有陌生气息出现，这里可是墓园，笨蛋，好笨的人类！"] = "Strange? Strange auras appear every day. This is a cemetery, idiot, what a stupid human!",
