    ["陪伴的玩偶：安西娅登场时，召唤与安西娅星级相同的巴尼先生作为召唤物上阵。"] = "Companion Doll: When Anthea enters the field, summon Mr. Barney of the same star level as Anthea as a summon to join the battle.",
