    ["随从2点位"] = "Follower 2 point",
    ["随你怎么说，小鬼头，回家找你爸去。"] = "Whatever you say, kid, go home and find your dad.",
    ["随你降临的命运，将你引领至此的命运。"] = "The fate that descended with you, the fate that led you here.",
    ["随便吃点什么都行，没有特别想吃的。"] = "Anything to eat is fine, I don't have anything I particularly want.",
    ["随便喝点"] = "Just have a drink",
    ["随便来点好的。"] = "Just give me something good.",
    ["随便看看"] = "Just looking around",
    ["随便看看吧。虽然没什么客人，我也不会像那边那个懒货一样把摊子扔在这儿不管。"] = "Feel free to look around. Although there aren't many customers, I won't just abandon my stall like that lazy bum over there.",
    ["随便看，十苏勒一把。当装饰挂墙上挺好看的。"] = "Take a look at whatever you want, ten soli each. They look quite nice as decorations on the wall.",
    ["随便看，这里什么都有点。"] = "Take a look, there's a bit of everything here.",
    ["随便聊聊……"] = "Just chatting...",
    ["随便逛逛"] = "Wander around",
    ["随便问问"] = "Just asking",
    ["随军来到金秋湖后，乌莎最喜欢的东西，是一件当地流行的金色披风。\n那时她还不是灵体，还能握住锄头。她总会把披风铺在田垄上，让种子躺在披风上，对每一颗种子念一段祈祷词，再把它们埋进土里。她说，就像涂抹蜂蜜的面包会变得更好吃，这样种子就会记得，有人在等它们长大。\n她种过很多东西：水稻、大麦、豌豆、马铃薯，最后是奇异果。每换一种作物，她就在石碑上刻几行字。那些字是日记，也是愿望，许愿这次能种成，许愿战争能结束，许愿同伴们能活着回来吃上一顿饱饭。\n那些种子都长出来了，只是她没看到。知识教会的偷袭来得太快，她倒下的时候，手里还攥着披风的一角。\n如今这件披风被人披上时，偶尔会在风里轻轻鼓起来，像有人在田垄尽头扬起了一把麦粒。"] = "After coming to Golden Autumn Lake with the army, the thing Usha liked most was a golden cloak popular locally. \n At that time, she was not a spirit and could still hold a hoe. She would always spread the cloak on the ridge, let the seeds lie on the cloak, recite a prayer for each seed, and then bury them in the soil. She said that just as bread spread with honey would taste better, this way the seeds would remember that someone was waiting for them to grow up. \n She had planted many things: rice, barley, peas, potatoes, and finally kiwifruit. Every time she changed a crop, she would carve a few lines on the stone tablet. Those words were a diary and also a wish, wishing that this time it would grow, wishing that the war would end, and wishing that her companions could return alive to eat a full meal. \n Those seeds all grew, but she didn't see it. The sneak attack by the Church of Knowledge came too fast; when she fell, she was still clutching a corner of the cloak. \n Now, when someone puts on this cloak, it occasionally bulges gently in the wind, as if someone had thrown a handful of wheat grains at the end of the ridge.",
    ["随创世的洪流——堕落吧！"] = "Follow the torrent of creation—fall!",
    ["随卢娜走的玩家"] = "Player following Luna",
    ["随后世界中再次出现多个湖泊，湖下再次分裂出新的秩序世界"] = "Subsequently, multiple lakes appeared in the world again, and new orderly worlds split out from beneath the lakes.",
    ["随后，舞蹈的人群牵着手将你围住，你加入了他们，一同欢快地跳起舞来。"] = "Then, the dancing crowd held hands and surrounded you, and you joined them, dancing happily together.",
