    ["随机增益的增益效果提升75%。"] = "Random buff effect increased by 75%.",
    ["随机幻化伪装成一个场景物件10秒，期间无法移动、释放技能且不会受到任何伤害，期间可通过再次释放技能解除变身。"] = "Randomly transform and disguise as a scene object for 10 seconds. During this time, you cannot move or use skills and will not take any damage. You can cancel the transformation by using the skill again.",
