    ["随机重受击"] = "Random Heavy Hit",
    ["随机重温一件已经归档的黑荆棘事件。"] = "Randomly revisit an archived Nighthawk event.",
    ["随机闲逛点-鱼摊"] = "Random Roaming Point-Fish Stall",
    ["随着不断突破，防御装备将解锁越来越多的可选灵质。\n选择点亮不同的命运点，可以获得不同类型的属性。如果想要其他的属性类型，可以选择途径进行洗练。\n同时，对当前点亮方案不满意时，可以回退点亮进度，重新点亮不同的命运点。"] = "As you continue to break through, defensive equipment will unlock more and more optional spiritual qualities. \nChoosing to light up different fate points grants different types of attributes. If you want other attribute types, you can choose a pathway to refine. \nAt the same time, if you are not satisfied with the current lighting scheme, you can revert the lighting progress and re-light different fate points.",
    ["随着戴里克的讲述，白银之城的历史仿佛在克莱恩眼前缓缓展开。"] = "As Derrick narrates, the history of the City of Silver seems to slowly unfold before Klein's eyes.",
    ["随着文字追到告解室"] = "Follow the text to the confessional",
    ["随着生命体和事物混沌生长，被居民们称作“混乱世界”"] = "As life forms and things grew chaotically, it was called the \"Chaos World\" by the residents.",
    ["随着资历的提升，薪水会逐步增长。"] = "As seniority increases, the salary will gradually grow.",
    ["随着邓恩的讲述，克莱恩仿佛也步入了那个梦境。"] = "As Dunn narrates, Klein feels as if he has stepped into that dream as well.",
    ["随身女仆"] = "Personal Maid",
