    ["雕像在激活<Disable>法阵状态</>时会在自身周围生成一个法术场，处于法术场内的玩家会持续受到范围伤害。"] = "When the statues activate the <Disable>Spell Field state</>, they will generate a spell field around themselves. Players within the spell field will continuously take area damage.",
    ["雕像在激活<Disable>激光状态</>时会朝米尔贡根释放强化<Disable>激光射线</>，激光射线接触到米尔贡根时会周期性给米尔贡根添加<Disable>强化效果</>，激光可以被玩家拦截。"] = "When the statues activate the <Disable>Laser state</>, they will release a strengthened <Disable>Laser Ray</> toward Milgongen. When the laser ray touches Milgongen, it will periodically add a <Disable>strengthening effect</> to Milgongen. The laser can be intercepted by players.",
