    ["雾林眷族羁绊召唤物；不计入雾林眷族羁绊人数。"] = "Fog Forest Kinship summon; does not count towards Fog Forest Kinship headcount.",
    ["雾林眷族：【雾林眷族】棋子每次普攻获得<HighLight>1</>层【苔影汲取】，每层提升吸血和最大生命，最多叠加<HighLight>6</>层；<HighLight>3</>人时每层增益提高，并在每场玩家对战后获得<HighLight>1</>个随机雾林眷族棋子。"] = "Mist Forest Kin: Each Basic Attack from a [Mist Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack of [Moss Shadow Drain], with each stack increasing Life Steal and maximum Health, stacking up to a maximum of <HighLight>6</> layers; when there are <HighLight>3</> units, the bonus per stack is increased, and you gain <HighLight>1</> random Mist Forest Kin pieces after each player battle.",
    ["雾气……更浓重了。"] = "The mist... has become even thicker.",
