    ["雾海翻涌，四方震动，<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在四方联赛中已连斩超过<Chat_Highlight>%s</>名对手，新的传说正在加冕！"] = "The fog sea surges, the four directions tremble, <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> has consecutive kills of over <Chat_Highlight>%s</> opponents in the Four-Way League, a new legend is being crowned!",
