    ["霍根"] = "Hogan",
    ["霍格"] = "Hogg",
    ["霍森医生的医术比我家里的私人医生要高多了！但他一心坐诊，还说什么“许多来到这里的病人都是怀着最后的希望……我不能让他们失望”之类的。"] = "Dr. Horsen's medical skills are much higher than my private doctor at home! But he is dedicated to seeing patients, and he says things like, 'Many patients who come here are holding onto their last hope... I cannot let them down.'",
