    ["霍纳奇斯山脉秩序世界完成度达到80%%"] = "Hornacis Mountain Range Order World completion reaches 80%%",
    ["霍纳奇斯的主峰曾经高达六千米以上，某一天塌了。"] = "The main peak of Hornacis was once over 6,000 meters high, but one day it collapsed.",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海-风暴竞逐-冲浪"] = "Hornacis Flower Sea - Storm Chase - Surfing",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海-风暴竞逐-载具"] = "Hornacis Flower Sea - Storm Chase - Vehicle",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海的午后"] = "Afternoon at the Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海的观景拍照留念：\n霍纳奇斯花海，像是严寒山脉中一处被神眷顾的乐土。\n衣着体面的人们常常来此度假，只为在芬芳中暂歇，让城市的喧嚣与疲惫随风散去。"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Sightseeing Photo: \nThe Hornacis Sea of Flowers is like a paradise blessed by God in the frigid mountain range. \nWell-dressed people often come here for vacation, just to rest for a while in the fragrance and let the city's noise and fatigue drift away with the wind.",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度到达100%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reached 100%.",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到100%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 100%%",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到20%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 20%%",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到50%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 50%%",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海秩序世界完成度达到80%%"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers Order World completion reaches 80%%",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海，像是严寒山脉中一处被神眷顾的乐土。"] = "The Hornacis Sea of Flowers is like a paradise blessed by God in the frigid mountain range.",
    ["霍纳奇斯花海，约会和度假的圣地。在你散步时，从天而降的物品是——"] = "Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a holy place for dating and vacations. While you are walking, the item that falls from the sky is—",
    ["霍纳奇斯花船"] = "Hornacis Flower Boat",
    ["霍纳奇斯雪山。"] = "Hornacis Snowy Mountain.",
    ["霍纳奇斯雪山的观景拍照留念：\n厚重的雪常年笼罩着霍纳奇斯山脉，这里是一片没有四季的禁地。\n或许，唯有这里曾经的主人，与被命运指引至此的迷途者，才能在这片寂静里听见往日的回想。"] = "Hornacis Snowy Mountain Sightseeing Photo: \nThick snow covers the Hornacis Mountain Range all year round; this is a forbidden land without seasons. \nPerhaps only the former master of this place and the lost souls guided here by fate can hear the echoes of the past in this silence.",
    ["霍纳奇斯，还是老样子……上次是我输了，不过下次，我会带新的“玩具”，再来一场“欺诈的游戏”。"] = "Hornacis, still the same as always... I lost last time, but next time, I will bring new 'toys' and have another 'game of deception'.",
