    ["青蛙王子进入不可选中的状态，持续追逐灰姑娘试图索吻；他的耐心耗尽后，将会狂暴的攻击所有人。场地边缘会刷新出服务员、餐车。在<Disable>赶跑服务员</>后，玩家可以利用<Disable>场上的道具</>攻击青蛙王子，使其破防倒地。"] = "The Frog Prince enters an untargetable state, continuously chasing Cinderella in an attempt to kiss her; once his patience runs out, he will attack everyone in a berserk state. Waiters and carriages will spawn at the edge of the field. After <Disable>chasing away the waiters</>, players can use the <Disable>props on the field</> to attack the Frog Prince, breaking his defense and knocking him down.",
