    ["静谧深沉的愈创木与红茶的香气，裹挟着佛手柑略带凉意的气息逸散于空气中。"] = "The scent of quiet and deep guaiac wood and black tea, wrapped in the slightly cool breath of bergamot, escapes into the air.",
