    ["非凡材料每有1条词条格挡 +200"] = "Every 1 Affix on a Beyonder Material grants Block +200",
    ["非凡材料编织的绊索陷阱。非凡者将绊马索扔向先祖铠甲时，绊索将缠绕其坐骑四肢，以灵性之力封锁其行动节奏，使其移动速度大幅降低。"] = "A tripwire trap woven from Beyonder materials. When a Beyonder throws the tripwire at the Ancestor Armor, the wire will entangle the mount's limbs, sealing its movement rhythm with spiritual power and significantly reducing its movement speed.",
