    ["非防盗链域名"] = "Non-Anti-Leech Domain",
    ["非阴影区爆炸的禁忌知识为1个，时针将逆转1格"] = "There is 1 Forbidden Knowledge explosion in the non-shadow area; the hour hand will rotate counter-clockwise by 1 tick",
    ["非阴影区爆炸的禁忌知识为2个，时针将逆转2格"] = "There are 2 Forbidden Knowledge explosions in the non-shadow area; the hour hand will rotate counter-clockwise by 2 ticks",
    ["靠你了，我……已经没有力气了……"] = "It's up to you, I... have no strength left...",
    ["靠你们才对，现在的超凡事件越来越多了，搞得我们这群老家伙心惊胆战的，特别是那件事情之后。"] = "It depends on you all. There are more and more Beyonder incidents lately, making us old folks feel terrified, especially after that incident.",
