    ["靠近先祖铠甲虚影，增强技能！"] = "Approach the phantom of the Ancestor Armor to enhance your skills!",
    ["靠近公园入口，传来急促自行车铃声。\n单片眼镜邮差，骑车（豪华版）在面前刹停。\n邮差离开时，你看到一个身影在公园门口一闪而过，他让你回想起廷根湖仪式。"] = "As you approach the park entrance, the sound of a hurried bicycle bell rings out.\n A monocled postman brakes to a stop in front of you on his bike (deluxe version).\n As the postman leaves, you see a figure flash past the park entrance, reminding you of the Tingen Lake ritual.",
    ["靠近分担伤害"] = "Approach to Share Damage",
