    ["靠近周围的舞者，跳一支邦尼想看的舞蹈！"] = "Approach the nearby dancers and perform the dance Bonnie wants to see!",
    ["靠近和使用告解室的人都会不自觉被小道消息吸引，并主动地传播绯闻闲话。时间久了会失眠多梦、精神衰弱，精力不集中，容易出门撞到脑袋。"] = "Anyone who approaches or uses the confessional will be unconsciously attracted to gossip and actively spread rumors. Over time, they will suffer from insomnia, nightmares, neurasthenia, lack of concentration, and are prone to bumping their heads when going out.",
    ["靠近天台上的醉汉"] = "Approach the drunk on the rooftop",
    ["靠近它，你的视觉将暂时剥离于现实的表象。\n你的眼前，这片土地最辉煌的过往在你眼前重现。"] = "Approach it, and your vision will be temporarily stripped from the surface of reality. \n Before your eyes, the most glorious past of this land will reappear.",
