    ["领主大人！工坊的事可以提上日程了！"] = "Lord! The workshop project can be put on the agenda!",
    ["领主大人，城堡已经扩建完成！您可以选配更好的收藏品与家具，以城堡主人的名义邀请好友、拜访其它城堡了。"] = "My Lord, the castle expansion is complete! You can now choose better collectibles and furniture, and in the name of the castle owner, invite friends or visit other castles.",
    ["领主大人，容我正式说明一下——廷根商会看好这片领地的潜力，十分乐意将这条铁路的货运经营权委托给您。"] = "Lord, allow me to formally explain—the Tingen Chamber of Commerce is optimistic about the potential of this territory and is very willing to entrust the freight operation rights of this railway to you.",
    ["领主大人，感谢您为这片土地带来希望和明天。"] = "My Lord, thank you for bringing hope and a tomorrow to this land.",
    ["领主大人，感谢您为这片土地来带希望和明天。"] = "My Lord, thank you for bringing hope and a tomorrow to this land.",
    ["领主大人，让我们继续期待，城堡更加美好的明天吧！"] = "Lord, let us continue to look forward to a better tomorrow for the castle!",
