    ["风波平息后，我们回廷根到处打听，<P_Heart>（叹气）</>可他就像蒸发了一样……"] = "After the storm calmed down, we went back to Tingen to ask around everywhere, <P_Heart> (sighs) </> but he was like he had evaporated...",
