    ["风祝延绵"] = "Wind Blessing Extension",
    ["风语花田"] = "Wind Whisper Flower Field",
    ["风起时，杂质被带走，只留下最纯粹的战意。"] = "When the wind rises, impurities are carried away, leaving only the purest Battle Intent.",
    ["风车"] = "Windmill",
    ["风车·家门口"] = "Windmill - At Home",
    ["风车……风车！之前阿尔伯特在那边不是恶作剧，而是仪式魔法的演练！"] = "Windmill... The windmill! Albert wasn't playing pranks there before; it was a practice of Ritual Magic!",
    ["风车公园一隅，廷根小市民们充满活力的舞蹈，引得路人驻足加入。\n持续参与，将获得某些神秘存在的馈赠。"] = "In a corner of Windmill Park, the energetic dancing of Tingen's small-town citizens attracts passersby to stop and join in. \n Continue participating to receive gifts from certain mysterious existences.",
    ["风车公园氛围"] = "Windmill Park atmosphere",
    ["风车公园野餐氛围2"] = "Windmill Park picnic atmosphere 2",
    ["风车旁的"] = "By the Windmill",
    ["风车旁边的“血迹”，似乎是红色的油漆。"] = "The \"bloodstains\" next to the windmill appear to be red paint.",
    ["风车背面的“血迹”，似乎是红色的油漆。"] = "The 'bloodstains' on the back of the windmill appear to be red paint.",
