    ["首通队伍"] = "First Clear Team",
    ["首都贝克兰德被称作“希望之城”，风气却比因蒂斯要保守得多，婚外情会成为惊人的八卦。"] = "The capital, Backlund, is called the \"City of Hope,\" but its social atmosphere is much more conservative than Intis; extramarital affairs would become shocking gossip.",
