    ["香水摊摊主"] = "Perfume stall owner",
    ["香水是想象力的转化，廷根的特色地点印象都被我浓缩进了瓶子里，您要试试吗？"] = "Perfume is the transformation of imagination. The impressions of Tingen's characteristic locations have been condensed into bottles by me. Would you like to try them?",
