    ["马丁的菜摊-莫里梦游"] = "Martin's Vegetable Stall - Mori Sleepwalking",
    ["马丁的菜摊触发"] = "Martin's vegetable stall trigger",
    ["马丁走到家门口，回头看了一眼。路灯下，那个心理医生已经转身走了。他忽然觉得，今晚好像没那么难熬了。"] = "Martin walked to his front door and looked back. Under the streetlamp, the psychiatrist had already turned and walked away. He suddenly felt that tonight might not be so hard to endure after all.",
    ["马丁，你来得正好！快把你的菜筐搬远点！"] = "Martin, you're just in time! Move your vegetable basket further away!",
    ["马丁，胆小的探险家。\n死在鲁本的枪口下，子弹贯穿了他的心脏。"] = "Martin, a timid explorer.\nHe died at the muzzle of Ruben's gun, the bullet piercing his heart.",
    ["马丁，那天的事不是你的错。你救不了他，但你记得他。这够了。"] = "Martin, what happened that day was not your fault. You couldn't save him, but you remember him. That is enough.",
    ["马上就到选举了，希望您能为我投出宝贵的一票！"] = "The election is coming up soon; I hope you can cast your precious vote for me!",
    ["马上就好，马上就好，嘿嘿……"] = "Almost there, almost there, hehe...",
    ["马上就来。"] = "Coming right up.",
    ["马上就能做完！"] = "It'll be done in no time!",
    ["马上就要入夜了，在这里休息一晚吧！"] = "It's almost nightfall, let's rest here for the night!",
    ["马上就要进行演讲了，该怎么办……你！就是你！来帮我一个忙！"] = "I'm about to give a speech, what should I do... You! Yes, you! Come and do me a favor!",
    ["马上要上课了……"] = "Class is about to start...",
    ["马上跟着我们做这个动作，要一直保持，绝对不能停！"] = "Follow us and do this movement immediately, and keep it up, absolutely do not stop!",
    ["马上马上！"] = "Right away, right away!",
