    ["马戏团的演员能让猪排着队，一只一只又一只的跳过火圈！"] = "The circus performers can make pigs line up and jump through fire hoops one by one!",
    ["马戏团表演宣传"] = "Circus performance promotion",
    ["马戏团表演？梅丽莎应该会喜欢……不知道门票怎么收？"] = "Circus performance? Melissa should like it... I wonder how much the tickets are?",
    ["马戏团表演？梅丽莎应该会喜欢，不知道门票怎么收？"] = "Circus performance? Melissa would probably like that. I wonder how much the tickets are?",
    ["马戏这么有意思，你也不光是为了生存吧？我相信也有喜欢的因素，毕竟做家庭女仆或许更赚钱。"] = "The circus is so interesting, you're not just doing it for survival, right? I believe there's also a factor of liking it; after all, being a domestic maid might be more profitable.",
