    ["马桶无法抽水，应该是堵住了。"] = "The toilet won't flush; it must be clogged.",
    ["马桶是什么时候故障的？"] = "When did the toilet malfunction?",
    ["马桶里传来呓语，维修工神秘失踪……呓语的源头一定就在知识空间内，找到源头物品，就能破除空间！"] = "Gibberish is coming from the toilet, the repairman has mysteriously disappeared... The source of the gibberish must be within the knowledge space. Find the source item, and you can break the space!",
