    ["马蒂尼"] = "Martini",
    ["马西莫"] = "Massimo",
    ["马西莫冲出餐厅，外面传来呕吐声。"] = "Massimo rushes out of the restaurant, and the sound of vomiting comes from outside.",
    ["马西莫女士！好久不见，你不是去利蒙了吗？"] = "Ms. Massimo! Long time no see, didn't you go to Limon?",
    ["马西莫女士，借一步说话。"] = "Ms. Massimo, a word please.",
    ["马西莫女士，我过去看看。"] = "Ms. Massimo, I'll go over and take a look.",
    ["马西莫文笔毒辣，但敢于捍卫舌尖上的信念。若是让她发现我已经没有烹饪的能力……"] = "Massimo's writing is vicious, but she dares to defend her beliefs regarding taste. If she discovers that I no longer have the ability to cook...",
    ["马西莫是那个小女孩！"] = "Massimo is that little girl!",
    ["马西莫的嘴又刁又毒，她骂过的厨师能排到东拜朗，你说呢？"] = "Massimo's tongue is sharp and poisonous; the chefs she has scolded could line up to East Balam, what do you think?",
    ["马西莫的文章影响力真是惊人。"] = "Massimo's article has amazing influence.",
    ["马西莫离开"] = "Massimo leaves",
    ["马西莫说，两个人做菜，味道的确没受影响。但她希望你记得自己曾经说过的话“人们至少要在美食面前保持诚实”。"] = "Massimo said that the taste was indeed not affected by two people cooking. But she hopes you remember what you once said: 'People should at least be honest in front of food'.",
    ["马西莫走了。"] = "Massimo has left.",
    ["马西莫，有些不对劲，库克的状态，厨房的情况，他的解释……都不太对劲。"] = "Massimo, something is wrong. Cook's state, the situation in the kitchen, his explanation... none of it is quite right.",
    ["马西莫？那个以毒嘴闻名的美食家？她怎么可能写文章夸别人？"] = "Massimo? That gourmet known for her poisonous tongue? How could she write an article praising someone else?",
    ["马车"] = "Carriage",
    ["马车-配黑荆棘门口车夫"] = "Carriage - Match Blackthorn entrance coachman",
    ["马车1"] = "Carriage 1",
    ["马车2"] = "Carriage 2",
