    ["马车停在了廷根北区的街道。克莱恩下车，快速地往四周看了看。"] = "The carriage stops on a street in the North District of Tingen. Klein gets off and quickly looks around.",
    ["马车初始血量降低，使用修理道具可回复血量。"] = "The carriage's initial HP is reduced; use repair items to restore its HP.",
