    ["马车路过玩家正前方时，一阵颠簸，黛西小姐被颠起，手中的雏菊掉落在地。\n男士趁机搂住、扶稳黛西小姐，马车恢复平静，二人相视大笑。\n马车走远后消失，街上的行人一个个消失，只剩下地上的雏菊。"] = "When the carriage passed directly in front of the player, there was a bump, Miss Daisy was jolted, and the daisies in her hand fell to the ground. \nThe man took the opportunity to hug and steady Miss Daisy, the carriage returned to calm, and the two looked at each other and laughed.\n After the carriage drove away and disappeared, the pedestrians on the street disappeared one by one, leaving only the daisies on the ground.",
