    ["驾驭海浪的移动速度增加5%。"] = "Movement speed while riding the Sea Wave increased by 5%.",
    ["驾驭海浪，可以通过方向键调整冲锋方向，期间获得最高4秒霸体、5秒加速效果。冲锋结束或手动释放二段时，造成*d点伤害。\n装备技能获得被动：大世界中水上滑板和水中游泳速度增加5%。"] = "Ride the waves, using direction keys to adjust the charge direction, during which you gain up to 4 seconds of Super Armor and 5 seconds of acceleration. When the charge ends or the second stage is manually released, deal *d damage. \n Equipment skill passive: Increases water hoverboard and swimming speed in the open world by 5%.",
    ["驾驭海浪，获得霸体和加速效果，可以通过方向键调整冲锋方向。冲锋结束或手动释放二段时，对周身敌人发动攻击，装备技能可增加自身在水上滑板和水中游泳的速度。"] = "Ride the Sea Wave to gain Super Armor and Acceleration. You can adjust the Charge direction with the arrow keys. At the end of the Charge or upon manual activation of the second stage, launch an Attack on surrounding enemies. Equipping this skill increases your speed on water boards and while swimming.",
    ["驾驭蒸汽车疾驰于街巷，乘风破浪冲过险滩，借灵性之跃腾空飞越——追逐风暴之主的脚步，赢取独属于你的荣耀与馈赠。"] = "Drive a steam car to speed through the streets, ride the wind and waves to rush through dangerous shoals, and use the Leap of Spirituality to soar through the air—chase the footsteps of the Lord of Storms and win the glory and gifts that belong only to you.",
