    ["骗子……彻头彻尾的骗子……我丢了半副身家！……女神啊……"] = "Liar... a complete liar... I lost half my savings! ...Oh, Goddess...",
    ["骗子！\n"] = "Liar!\n",
    ["骗子！全是骗人的！“百分之五的慈善”？我呸！"] = "Liars! It's all a lie! 'Five percent charity'? Pfft!",
