    ["魅惑其他非凡者%d/50次。 "] = "Charm other Beyonders %d/50 times.",
    ["魅惑具体规则如下：\n1. 春夜舞会的成员可以向其他非凡者发起魅惑邀请，对方接受后双方进入魅惑对决流程，邀请时限内未操作/距离过远，则视为拒绝；\n2. 进入魅惑对决流程后，双方挑选外观进行搭配，对决的胜负结果将由双方最终评分高低决定；\n2.1 对决评分受外观风尚值和主题风格影响，主题风格由系统统一指定，并周期性更换，请挑选符合对决主题的外观进行搭配；\n2.2 搭配选定后将进入投骰环节，对方的魅力越高，投骰检定通过要求的数值越高，自身的魅力可对投骰结果产生加成。投骰成功可使最终的对决评分额外提升5%；\n2.3 若双方最终评分相同，则视为魅惑发起者失败（未能成功魅惑对手）；\n3. 魅惑对决结束后，失败方将获得持续15分钟的称号，提示其刚被指定非凡者的魅力征服过；\n4. 春夜舞会的成员每日可进行最多20次魅惑（未进入对决流程不计入次数），魅惑完成后可获得奖励；\n5. 在魅惑对决中失败可导致SAN值降低，SAN值过低时可寻找安魂诗社成员进行安魂。"] = "The specific rules for Charm are as follows: \n 1. Members of the Spring Night Ball can initiate Charm invitations to other Beyonders. If the other party accepts, both parties enter the Charm duel process. If there is no operation within the invitation time limit or the distance is too far, it is considered a refusal; \n 2. After entering the Charm duel process, both parties choose appearances to match. The outcome of the duel will be determined by the final scores of both parties; \n 2.1 The duel score is affected by appearance fashion value and theme style. The theme style is uniformly specified by the system and changed periodically. Please choose an appearance that matches the duel theme; \n 2.2 After the outfit is selected, you will enter the dice rolling stage. The higher the other party's charm, the higher the value required for the dice check to pass. Your own charm can provide a bonus to the dice result. A successful dice roll can increase the final duel score by an additional 5%; \n 2.3 If the final scores of both parties are the same, it is considered a failure for the Charm initiator (failed to successfully charm the opponent); \n 3. After the Charm duel ends, the loser will receive a title lasting 15 minutes, indicating that they have just been conquered by the charm of the designated Beyonder; \n 4. Members of the Spring Night Ball can perform Charm up to 20 times per day (not entering the duel process does not count towards the limit). Rewards can be obtained after the Charm is completed; \n 5. Failure in a Charm duel can lead to a decrease in SAN value. When the SAN value is too low, you can find a member of the Requiem Poetry Society to perform Requiem.",
    ["魅惑初学者"] = "Charm Beginner",
    ["魅惑大师级"] = "Charm Master",
