    ["魔镜碎裂，爆发出一阵巨大的能量，天上落下了无数的碎镜片。\n在场的黑荆棘众人陷入了巨大的危机中。"] = "The magic mirror shatters, erupting with a huge amount of energy, and countless mirror fragments fall from the sky.\n The Nighthawks present are plunged into a huge crisis.",
