    ["鱼人袖钉"] = "Merman Cufflinks",
    ["鱼人鳞片算什么，我的袖钉可是去间海郡度假时买的海妖之石，听说整个鲁恩都找不出第二对！"] = "What's a merman scale? My cufflinks are Siren Stones bought while vacationing in Midseashire. I hear you can't find a second pair in all of Loen!",
