    ["鱼骨拼接的木地板，脚下的秩序中带着细微的变化。"] = "Herringbone-patterned wooden floor, with subtle changes within the order underfoot.",
    ["鱿鱼带鱼比目鱼，生蚝牡蛎梭子蟹，应有尽有！"] = "Squid, hairtail, flounder, oysters, scallops, blue crabs, we have everything!",
    ["鱿鱼带鱼比目鱼，生蚝牡蛎梭子蟹，应有尽有，买三磅送一磅！"] = "Squid, hairtail, halibut, oysters, mussels, and swimming crabs—we have it all. Buy three pounds and get one free!",
    ["鲁"] = "Loen",
    ["鲁丝"] = "Ruth",
    ["鲁伯特"] = "Rupert",
    ["鲁伯特男爵根本没有生育能力他的儿子女儿私生子都不是自己的孩子！"] = "Baron Rupert is infertile, his sons, daughters, and illegitimate children are none of them his own!",
    ["鲁尔克"] = "Rourke",
    ["鲁恩"] = "Loen",
    ["鲁恩交际王"] = "Loen Socialite",
    ["鲁恩人比因蒂斯人更保守，更阴沉，我怀疑连绵的雨对鲁恩人的心灵健康有影响。不过，这些玩弄政治的贵族们，或许心都……"] = "Loen people are more conservative and gloomier than Intis people. I suspect that the continuous rain has an impact on the mental health of Loen people. However, these politicians and nobles, perhaps their hearts are...",
    ["鲁恩北方城市，有数十万人口、坐拥多所高级学府的“大学之城”。"] = "A city in northern Loen, the 'City of Universities' with hundreds of thousands of residents and numerous prestigious institutions.",
    ["鲁恩北部特产的蒸馏酒，其暴烈的酒劲能驱散任何凛冽的寒风。"] = "A distilled spirit specialty of northern Loen, its violent kick can dispel any biting cold wind.",
    ["鲁恩呢绒"] = "Loen Woolen",
    ["鲁恩和弗萨克的恩怨史\n鲁恩与弗萨克关系紧张……常见的考点除了战争外，还有双方的贸易变化……"] = "History of the Grudge between Loen and Feysac \n Relations between Loen and Feysac are tense... Common exam topics besides war include changes in trade between the two sides...",
    ["鲁恩商报"] = "Loen Commercial News",
    ["鲁恩国境内的原始森林有许多凶猛的野兽。"] = "There are many ferocious wild beasts in the primeval forests within Loen.",
    ["鲁恩国小猫"] = "Loen Kingdom Kitten",
    ["鲁恩式庭院在晨光中舒展，优雅从不喧嚣，但每一处陈设，都是无声的宣言。"] = "The Loen-style courtyard stretches out in the morning light; elegance is never noisy, but every piece of furniture is a silent declaration.",
    ["鲁恩慈善助学基金会宣"] = "Loen Charity Foundation Announcement",
    ["鲁恩慈善助学基金会，听说是从贝克兰德来的，他们可以资助孩子继续上学。"] = "The Loen Charity Foundation, I heard it came from Backlund; they can sponsor children to continue their schooling.",
    ["鲁恩慈善助学基金募捐"] = "Loen Charity Scholarship Fund Donation",
    ["鲁恩慈善助学基金宣传"] = "Loen Charity Scholarship Fund Promotion",
    ["鲁恩是位于北大陆的工业强国。西边和因蒂斯共和国以间海、霍纳奇斯山脉为界，北部与弗萨克帝国接壤，东邻苏尼亚海，南面是迪西海湾。"] = "Loen is an industrial power located in the Northern Continent. It is bordered by the Intis Republic to the west by the Midseashire and the Hornacis Mountain Range, borders the Feysac Empire to the north, is adjacent to the Sonia Sea to the east, and the Disi Bay to the south.",
    ["鲁恩最古老的教会之一在廷根的总部，风暴之主的信徒在此祷告。"] = "The Tingen headquarters of one of the oldest churches in Loen, where believers of the Lord of Storms pray.",
    ["鲁恩最大脚踏车公司推出的新款车型，配色独特，每一位拥抱潮流的时尚人士都会为它而侧目。此为胡桃配色。"] = "A new model launched by Loen's largest bicycle company, with a unique color scheme that catches the eye of every fashionista who embraces trends. This is the walnut color.",
    ["鲁恩最大脚踏车公司推出的新款车型，配色独特，每一位拥抱潮流的时尚人士都会为它而侧目。此为苔原配色。"] = "A new model launched by Loen's largest bicycle company, with a unique color scheme that will catch the eye of every fashion-forward person. This is the Tundra colorway.",
    ["鲁恩最大脚踏车公司推出的新款车型，配色独特，每一位拥抱潮流的时尚人士都会为它而侧目。此为铜青配色。"] = "A new model launched by the largest bicycle company in Loen, with a unique color scheme that will catch the eye of every fashionista embracing the trend. This is the bronze-green version.",
    ["鲁恩最大脚踏车公司推出的新款车型，配色独特，每一位拥抱潮流的时尚人士都会为它而侧目。此为麦金配色。"] = "A new model launched by Loen's largest bicycle company, with a unique color scheme that catches the eye of every fashionista embracing the trend. This is the Mckin colorway.",
    ["鲁恩最深情"] = "Most Affectionate in Loen",
    ["鲁恩王国"] = "Loen Kingdom",
    ["鲁恩王国主要信仰黑夜女神、风暴之主和大地母神。"] = "The Loen Kingdom mainly believes in the Evernight Goddess, the Lord of Storms, and the Earth Mother.",
    ["鲁恩王国是位于北大陆东部的强国，首都为贝克兰德。"] = "The Loen Kingdom is a powerful nation located in the eastern part of the Northern Continent, with Backlund as its capital.",
    ["鲁恩王国是南北大陆军事实力最强的国家。"] = "The Loen Kingdom has the strongest military power in the Northern and Southern Continents.",
    ["鲁恩王国有政府雇员统一考试。"] = "The Loen Kingdom has a unified examination for government employees.",
    ["鲁恩王国由奥古斯都家族统治。"] = "The Loen Kingdom is ruled by the Augustus family.",
    ["鲁恩王国的首都"] = "The capital of the Loen Kingdom.",
    ["鲁恩的"] = "Loen's",
    ["鲁恩的办事效率真是太低了！"] = "The efficiency of Loen's administration is really too low!",
    ["鲁恩的士兵永远不会忘记弗萨克做的一切。"] = "The soldiers of Loen will never forget what Feynapotter has done.",
    ["鲁恩的首都是贝克兰德，人们称之为伟大的“万都之都”。我曾听一个自称罗塞尔大帝同乡的非凡者说，贝克兰德很像“伦敦”。"] = "The capital of Loen is Backlund, which people call the great \"City of Cities\". I once heard a Beyonder who claimed to be a fellow townsman of Emperor Roselle say that Backlund is very much like \"London\".",
    ["鲁恩第一猹"] = "Loen's first groundhog",
    ["鲁恩纺织-触发器"] = "Loen Textile - Trigger",
    ["鲁恩组件消失表演"] = "Loen component disappearance performance.",
    ["鲁恩艺术——世界一绝——欢迎选购——"] = "Loen art—the best in the world—welcome to purchase—",
    ["鲁恩风尚"] = "Loen Fashion",
    ["鲁恩风尚打卡点"] = "Loen Style Photo Spot",
    ["鲁恩风格"] = "Loen style",
    ["鲁恩！作为一个伟大而强盛的帝国！"] = "Loen! As a great and powerful empire!",
    ["鲁恩！鲁恩！"] = "Loen! Loen!",
    ["鲁昕怡"] = "Lu Xinyi",
    ["鲁本"] = "Ruben",
    ["鲁本·"] = "Ruben ",
    ["鲁本把自己锁在里面，已经一刻钟了！他有怕黑的毛病，再这样下去会喘不上气的！"] = "Reuben locked himself inside a quarter of an hour ago! He has a fear of the dark; if this continues, he won't be able to breathe!",
