    ["黄昏即将降临。"] = "Twilight is about to descend.",
    ["黄昏天赋的战士推荐携带猎魔瞬斩，荣耀之斩，日暮飓风，巨剑斩击进行战斗。"] = "For a Warrior with the Twilight talent, it is recommended to carry Demon Hunter Instant Slash, Slash of Glory, Sunset Hurricane, and Greatsword Slash for combat.",
