    ["黄昏穿透树影，洒入幽深森林。连续受挫的开膛手独自徘徊，苦思作案之法。他无计可施，正焦灼等待着谁的降临？"] = "Twilight pierces through the tree shadows, spilling into the deep forest. The Ripper, having suffered consecutive setbacks, wanders alone, racking his brain for a way to commit his crime. He is at his wit's end, anxiously waiting for whose descent?",
