    ["黄水仙感觉没有以前长的旺盛了。"] = "The daffodils don't seem to be growing as vigorously as before.",
    ["黄水仙枯萎了，而他也不告而别，我们从未见面，却已灵魂相融……"] = "The daffodils have withered, and he has left without saying goodbye. We have never met, but our souls have already merged...",
    ["黄水晶占卜"] = "Yellow crystal divination",
    ["黄水晶吊坠停在那里，一动不动。\n……占卜受到了影响，无法获得结果……"] = "The yellow crystal pendant stops there, motionless. \n... The divination has been affected, and no result can be obtained...",
    ["黄水晶吊坠逆时针转动，速度很快。\n……答案是十分强烈的否定……"] = "The yellow crystal pendant rotates counter-clockwise, moving quickly. \n... The answer is a very strong negation...",
    ["黄水晶吊坠逆时针转动，速度很慢。\n……答案是否定……"] = "The yellow crystal pendant rotates counter-clockwise, moving slowly. \n... The answer is negation...",
    ["黄水晶吊坠顺时针转动，速度很快。\n……答案是十分强烈的肯定……"] = "The yellow crystal pendant rotates clockwise, moving quickly. \n... The answer is a very strong affirmation...",
    ["黄水晶吊坠顺时针转动，速度很慢。\n……答案是肯定……"] = "The yellow crystal pendant rotates clockwise, moving slowly. \n... The answer is affirmation...",
