    ["黑伍德庄园是什么情况，有资料吗？我该怎么潜入庄园？"] = "What is the situation with Heywood Manor, and is there any information available? How should I infiltrate the manor?",
    ["黑伍德庄园的大门为你敞开，水晶吊灯折射出华丽的光芒，舞池中的身影翩翩起舞……"] = "The gates of Heywood Manor are open for you, the crystal chandelier reflects gorgeous light, and the figures on the dance floor are dancing gracefully...",
    ["黑伍德男爵"] = "Baron Heywood",
    ["黑伍德男爵？还是另有其人？"] = "Baron Heywood? Or someone else?",
    ["黑兹"] = "Hayes",
    ["黑冠"] = "Black Crown",
    ["黑加仑、苦艾草与黑麝香，苦涩而微甘，神秘柔和而暗藏锋芒。"] = "Blackcurrant, wormwood, and black musk—bitter yet slightly sweet, mysterious and soft, with a hidden edge.",
