    ["黑夜与寂静，伴随您的灵魂"] = "Night and silence, accompany your soul",
    ["黑夜与猩红是缠绕在血族恒长生命上的荆棘，危险、 美丽，并使人刺痛不已。"] = "Night and scarlet are the thorns entwined around the eternal life of the Blood Clan; dangerous, beautiful, and stinging to the heart.",
    ["黑夜中安宁"] = "Peace in the Night",
    ["黑夜中的光芒"] = "Light in the Darkness",
    ["黑夜中的战车轰鸣前行，你是自己命运的主宰。以钢铁般的意志开道，荣耀即将到来。 "] = "The chariot roars forward in the dark night; you are the master of your own fate. Pave the way with an iron will; glory is coming.",
    ["黑夜之中的守护者，看管恐惧的不眠天使，侍奉隐秘的暗夜诗人，命运道标上的光芒，为迷惑之人导引方向的星星。"] = "The guardian in the night, the sleepless angel who watches over fear, the dark poet serving the secret, the light on the beacon of fate, the star guiding the way for the lost.",
    ["黑夜唱诗班"] = "Nighthawk Choir",
    ["黑夜处决"] = "Night Execution",
    ["黑夜奉献之灵"] = "Spirit of Evernight Devotion",
    ["黑夜女神"] = "Evernight Goddess",
    ["黑夜女神……看来这个世界的神灵不止一位。"] = "Evernight Goddess... It seems there is more than one deity in this world.",
    ["黑夜女神。祂的权柄与永暗之河相连，祂的祝福能让这件武器承载真正的神话形态。"] = "The Evernight Goddess. Her authority is connected to the River of Eternal Darkness, and Her blessing can allow this weapon to carry a true mythical form.",
    ["黑夜女神唱诗班招新"] = "Evernight Goddess Choir Recruitment",
    ["黑夜女神教会"] = "Evernight Goddess Church",
    ["黑夜女神教会值夜者，黑荆棘安保公司成员，黑荆棘值夜小队队长。"] = "Member of the Church of the Evernight Goddess, member of the Blackthorn Security Company, and captain of the Blackthorn Nighthawk team.",
    ["黑夜女神教会廷根市值夜者小队队长。\n他是将克莱恩带入非凡世界的领路人，以沉稳、体贴的个性著称，是廷根市值夜者心中永远的队长。"] = "Captain of the Tingen Nighthawks of the Church of the Evernight Goddess.\n He was the guide who led Klein into the Extraordinary World, known for his steady and considerate personality, and he remains the captain forever in the hearts of the Tingen Nighthawks.",
    ["黑夜女神教会成员"] = "Member of the Church of the Evernight Goddess",
    ["黑夜女神教会的圣典。"] = "The holy scripture of the Church of the Evernight Goddess.",
    ["黑夜女神教会的廷根总部，虔诚信徒所向往的神圣之地。"] = "The Tingen headquarters of the Evernight Goddess Church, a holy place yearned for by devout believers.",
    ["黑夜女神教会的节礼日并不多，最重要的是冬礼日，其次就是满月时的月亮弥撒。"] = "The Evernight Goddess Church doesn't have many festivals. The most important is the Winter Festival, followed by the Moon Mass during the full moon.",
    ["黑夜女神教会神父"] = "Priest of the Evernight Goddess Church",
    ["黑夜女神教会触摸光环"] = "Evernight Goddess Church touch halo",
    ["黑夜女神教会，风暴之主教会都在廷根拥有自己的教堂。"] = "The Church of the Evernight Goddess and the Church of the Lord of Storms both have their own churches in Tingen.",
    ["黑夜女神教堂"] = "Church of the Evernight Goddess",
    ["黑夜女神教堂传送点"] = "Church of the Evernight Goddess Teleport Point",
    ["黑夜女神的馈赠，月亮花与深眠草，你，值得拥有。"] = "The gift of the Goddess of Evernight, Moon Flowers and Deep Sleep Herbs—you are worth it.",
    ["黑夜女神纹章"] = "Evernight Goddess Emblem",
    ["黑夜女神虔诚的信徒\n铁十字街最棒的帽子店\n真诚的汉特一家，敬上"] = "Devout believer of the Evernight Goddess, \n the best hat shop on Iron Cross Street, \n sincerely, the Hunter family.",
    ["黑夜女神：战斗开始时，站在对应棋盘当中的【黑夜女神】棋子对敌方造成伤害时，若目标生命值低于阈值则直接斩杀。激活档位 (<HighLight>2</>)<HighLight>12%</> / (<HighLight>4</>)<HighLight>18%</> / (<HighLight>6</>)<HighLight>25%</>。"] = "Evernight Goddess: At the start of battle, [Evernight Goddess] pieces standing in the corresponding board positions execute targets if their Health is below the threshold when dealing damage. Activation tiers (<HighLight>2</>)<HighLight>12%</> / (<HighLight>4</>)<HighLight>18%</> / (<HighLight>6</>)<HighLight>25%</>.",
    ["黑夜守护者"] = "Nighthawk Guardian",
    ["黑夜将你带来又带走！"] = "The night brings you and takes you away!",
    ["黑夜庇护镜头"] = "Night Shelter Lens",
    ["黑夜攻速"] = "Night Attack Speed",
    ["黑夜教会主教"] = "Nighthawk Bishop",
    ["黑夜教会信徒"] = "Nighthawk Believer",
    ["黑夜教会女性"] = "Woman of the Church of the Evernight",
    ["黑夜教会封印用的铁箱？他们要这件封印物到底想干什么？"] = "An iron box used by the Church of the Night for sealing? What on earth do they want with this Sealed Artifact?",
    ["黑夜教会开设成人识字班"] = "Evernight Church Opens Adult Literacy Classes",
    ["黑夜教会成员"] = "Member of the Church of the Evernight",
    ["黑夜教会的人来了又走，他们把这里清理得很干净。现在你看，花廊多漂亮，一点痕迹都没留下。"] = "The people from the Church of the Evernight came and went, and they cleaned this place up very thoroughly. Now look, the flower corridor is so beautiful, not a trace left behind.",
    ["黑夜教会的常见低阶符咒，能有效地安抚鬼魂、幽影、僵尸和水鬼。"] = "A common low-level charm of the Church of the Night, which can effectively pacify ghosts, shadows, zombies, and water ghosts.",
    ["黑夜教会红发大叔"] = "Red-Haired Middle-Aged Man of the Church of the Evernight",
