    ["黑夜教堂入口"] = "Nighthawk Cathedral entrance",
    ["黑夜教堂加直觉氛围"] = "Add Intuition Atmosphere to Night Church",
    ["黑夜教堂宁静伫立，金币和马车轮在繁华的北区不息滚动。"] = "The Evernight Church stands quietly, while gold coins and carriage wheels roll endlessly in the bustling North Borough.",
