    ["黑夜漫漫，万物以短暂而存在。夜幕无边，万物以渺小而安宁。"] = "The night is long, and all things exist in transience. The night is boundless, and all things are peaceful in their insignificance.",
    ["黑夜祝福"] = "Night Blessing",
    ["黑夜给了我黑色的眼睛……我将用它来寻找诗句。"] = "The night gave me black eyes... I will use them to search for poetry.",
    ["黑夜给人带来宁静。"] = "The night brings peace to people.",
