    ["黑帮打手"] = "Gangster Thug",
    ["黑帮火并的常见武器，它的主人或许想借此自保，但镜中廷根的力量并非子弹可以对抗。"] = "A common weapon in gang fights; its owner might have wanted to use it for self-defense, but the power of Tingen in the Mirror cannot be countered by bullets.",
