    ["黑影闪烁的镜子"] = "Mirror with Flashing Black Shadow",
    ["黑手套·卡拉彭，这胖子把工人当耗材。他那儿经常死人，可他有句口头禅：“再招就是了。”他账本上每笔军火，都泡着人血。"] = "Black Glove Karapon, that fat man treats workers like expendable supplies. People die at his place often, but his catchphrase is: 'Just hire more.' Every entry of munitions in his ledger is soaked in human blood.",
    ["黑手套首领"] = "Black Glove Leader",
    ["黑手套首领\r\n胖子·卡拉彭"] = "Black Glove leader\r\nFatty Kalapong",
    ["黑手套？哼，他们只惦记你们口袋里的铜板。廷根好不好，他们才不关心。"] = "Black Gloves? Hmph, they only care about the copper coins in your pockets. They don't care at all whether Tingen is doing well or not.",
    ["黑暗"] = "Darkness",
    ["黑暗buff"] = "Darkness buff",
    ["黑暗……我需要更多的黑暗……"] = "Darkness... I need more darkness...",
    ["黑暗中的人，也会追求希望吗？"] = "Do people in the darkness also pursue hope?",
    ["黑暗中的灯塔"] = "Lighthouse in the darkness",
    ["黑暗中，这滴血仍在燃烧。"] = "In the darkness, this drop of blood is still burning.",
