    ["黑暗的羽翼笼罩大地却 再不能遮住祂的光"] = "The wings of darkness shroud the earth, but they can no longer hide His light.",
    ["黑暗纪元"] = "Dark Epoch",
    ["黑暗纪元之柱"] = "Pillar of the Dark Era",
    ["黑暗终将散去，来自观众的安抚如同黎明的第一缕光。"] = "Darkness will eventually dissipate; the pacification from the Spectator is like the first ray of dawn.",
    ["黑暗蘑菇"] = "Dark Mushroom",
    ["黑暗被撕裂……困兽般的嘶吼……"] = "Darkness is torn apart... roars like a trapped beast...",
