    ["黑暗降临"] = "Darkness Descent",
    ["黑松露 | 森林牛肝菌 | 黄油 | 欧芹 | 蒜片"] = "Black Truffle | Forest Porcini | Butter | Parsley | Garlic Slices",
    ["黑板"] = "Blackboard",
    ["黑板·神秘"] = "Blackboard · Mystery",
    ["黑板上写的是……"] = "What's written on the blackboard is...",
    ["黑板上的字迹"] = "Handwriting on the blackboard",
    ["黑板上的字迹和日记残片，都指向了“它”。这显然是一件神奇物品，而且“不会被卖出”。"] = "The handwriting on the blackboard and the diary fragment both point to 'it'. This is clearly a mystical item, and one that 'will not be sold'.",
    ["黑板上的字迹已经模糊不清了，依稀能够辨认出一些。"] = "The handwriting on the blackboard is already blurred, but some of it can still be vaguely identified.",
    ["黑板上的裂痕越来越多，终于彻底碎裂。布兰登向学生走去，而他和学生们的轮廓正逐渐消散。\n布兰登：这里必须有一所学校，必须有人点亮通往未来的那盏灯……"] = "The cracks on the blackboard increased, and it finally shattered completely. Brandon walked toward the students, and the outlines of him and the students were gradually dissipating. \nBrandon: There must be a school here, there must be someone to light that lamp leading to the future...",
    ["黑板上记录了关于“它”的执念。据说“所有神奇物品加起来，都比不上‘它’的壮丽……”？"] = "The blackboard records an obsession regarding 'it'. It is said that 'all mystical items combined cannot compare to the magnificence of 'it'...'?",
    ["黑板上遗留的文字"] = "Words left on the blackboard",
    ["黑板便签-材料"] = "Blackboard note-Materials",
    ["黑板便签-纯水"] = "Blackboard Note - Pure Water",
    ["黑板便签1"] = "Blackboard Note 1",
    ["黑板便签2"] = "Blackboard Note 2",
    ["黑板值决定层数"] = "Blackboard value determines layers",
    ["黑板值技能"] = "Blackboard value skill.",
    ["黑板的灵性异常"] = "The blackboard's spirituality is abnormal",
    ["黑板里依次冒出点点星光，组成模糊的人形——伊西多、乔伊斯、帕特里克的模糊轮廓坐在地上，听老师讲这最后一课。\n布兰登在黑板上的书写变得越来越有力，腰板也逐渐挺直，仿佛回到了在那个被阳光笼罩的小院子里，给孩子们讲课的日子。"] = "Specks of Starlight emerged from the blackboard one after another, forming vague human shapes—the blurry outlines of Isidor, Joyce, and Patrick sat on the ground, listening to their teacher give this final lesson. \n Brandon's writing on the blackboard became increasingly vigorous, and his back gradually straightened, as if he had returned to the days in that small courtyard bathed in sunlight, teaching the children.",
