    ["黑面草面包"] = "Black Bread",
    ["黑面草，一种生长在黑暗中的植物，这株怎么蔫哒哒的……是光照太足了吗？"] = "Black-faced grass, a plant that grows in the dark. Why is this one so wilted... Is there too much light?",
