    ["黑麦面包、廷根饼、柠檬蛋糕……嗯，看起来都是廷根的传统食物，听说您这儿的廷根饼在附近可是最好的。"] = "Rye bread, Tingen biscuits, lemon cake... hmm, they all seem to be traditional Tingen food. I heard your Tingen biscuits are the best in the neighborhood.",
