    ["（单位°）基于当前的朝向额外的旋转增量"] = "(Unit: °) Additional rotation increment based on current orientation.",
    ["（单位°）目标在左手方为负，在右手方为正，填写大于起始角度值，范围[-180,180]"] = "(Unit °) Target on the left is negative, on the right is positive; fill in a value greater than the start angle value, range [-180, 180].",
    ["（单位°）目标在左手方为负，在右手方为正，填写小于终止角度值"] = "(Unit °) Target on the left is negative, on the right is positive; fill in a value less than the end angle value.",
    ["（单位°）该旋转作用到上述偏移量上，但不作用到《NewBullet》表里的起始偏移量上。仰视为正，俯视为负。"] = "(Unit: °) This rotation applies to the aforementioned offset but does not apply to the initial offset in the \"NewBullet\" table. Looking up is positive, looking down is negative.",
    ["（单位°）该旋转作用到上述偏移量上，但不作用到《NewBullet》表里的起始偏移量上。逆时针为负，顺时针为正。"] = "(Unit: °) This rotation applies to the aforementioned offset but does not apply to the initial offset in the \"NewBullet\" table. Counter-clockwise is negative, clockwise is positive.",
    ["（占卜俱乐部里居然有争吵声，进去看看发生了什么吧。）"] = "(There is actually an argument in the Divination Club, let’s go in and see what happened.)",
    ["（即使承受着极端的痛苦，也要坚持记录吗？按理说应该劝说她停止追查，没收记录。）"] = "(Should I persist in recording even while enduring extreme pain? Logically, I should persuade her to stop investigating and confiscate the records.)",
    ["（历史迷雾中的那位穿越者前辈，他居然做了这么多事。）"] = "(That transmigrator predecessor in the Fog of History, he actually did so many things.)",
    ["（压低声音）要小心，这个镇子不对劲，一切都在重复。"] = "(Lowers voice) Be careful, this town is not right. Everything is repeating.",
    ["（原来，你叫艾登。真希望，我不是这世界上最后一个记住你名字的人，艾登先生。）"] = "(So, your name is Aiden. I truly hope I am not the last person in this world to remember your name, Mr. Aiden.)",
    ["（去向戴里克导师汇报这件事吧。）"] = "(Let's go report this to Mentor Derrick.)",
    ["（叫卖）自家种植，健康又卫生，便宜卖了！"] = "(Hawking) Home-grown, healthy and hygienic, selling them cheap!",
    ["（叫卖）走过路过不要错过，丝瓜汤免费品尝咯！去火气又健康！"] = "(Hawking) Step right up, don't miss out, free loofah soup tasting! Reduces internal heat and is healthy!",
    ["（叫卖）走过路过不要错过，都来看看新鲜的丝瓜吧！"] = "(Hawking) Step right up, don't miss out, come and see these fresh loofahs!",
    ["（召唤归属--%s）"] = "(Summon Ownership -- %s)",
    ["（可交易）"] = "(Tradable)",
    ["（可选）<h>离开瑞尔比伯家</>"] = "(Optional) <h>Leave Riel Bieber's house</>.",
    ["（可选）再和<h>戴莉</>聊聊"] = "(Optional) Chat with <h>Daly</> again",
    ["（可选）和<h>班森</>聊聊"] = "(Optional) Chat with <h>Benson</>",
    ["（可选）询问<h>老尼尔</>笔记的事"] = "(Optional) Ask <h>Old Neil</> about the notes",
    ["（叹气）……别问了，去把后边新进的依兰原料拿来吧，奈拉小姐说晚上该做些新东西了。"] = "(Sighs) ...Don't ask, go get the newly arrived ylang-ylang ingredients from the back, Miss Naila said we should make something new tonight.",
    ["（叹气）一定又去猎犬酒吧了。每次抬他回来，酒气都能飘一路。"] = "(Sighs) Must have gone to the Hound Bar again. Every time he's carried back, the smell of alcohol lingers the whole way.",
    ["（叹气）你从二十二岁就在最后一步了。现在你六十岁了。"] = "(Sighs) You've been at the final step since you were twenty-two. Now you are sixty.",
    ["（叹气）你们……王国最近有遇到事吗？"] = "(Sighs) You... has the kingdom encountered anything recently?",
    ["（叹气）好吧好吧，现在我还要花钱去买遮雨布了。"] = "(Sighs) Alright, alright, now I have to spend money to buy rain covers.",
    ["（叹气）父亲……你的老毛病又犯了。"] = "(Sighs) Father... your old condition is acting up again.",
    ["（听听他要说什么）"] = "(Listen to what he has to say)",
    ["（听听这次要干什么）"] = "(Listen to what we are doing this time)",
    ["（听起来，是个女孩的声音。）"] = "(Sounds like a girl's voice.)",
    ["（吸气）咳咳咳咳，这里的天气还是如此“迷人”。"] = "(Inhales) *Cough cough cough*, the weather here is still so 'charming'.",
    ["（呃 又和之前一样……但幸好没事）"] = "(Ugh, it's the same as before... but thankfully I'm fine.)",
    ["（呃 她说的……难道是我身上的污染？）"] = "(Uh, what she said... could it be the corruption on me?)",
    ["（呆呆地没说话）……"] = "(Stares blankly without speaking) ...",
    ["（告知即将下雨）"] = "(Inform that it will rain)",
    ["（告知将会晴天）"] = "(Inform that it will be sunny)",
    ["（告知结果）"] = "(Tell the result)",
    ["（告知船长会是晴天）"] = "(Tell the captain it will be sunny)",
    ["（告知船长即将下雨）"] = "(Tell the captain it will rain)",
    ["（告知那是蓝星）"] = "(Tell him that is the Blue Star)",
    ["（呼噜声）呼……呼……"] = "(Snoring) Snore... snore...",
    ["（和莉娜对视了，她这是……爱上了……我吗？）"] = "(I made eye contact with Lena. Is she... has she fallen in love with... me?)",
    ["（咕咕——咕）"] = "(Coo—coo)",
    ["（咕哝）也没说还要躺多久……但好歹算出手大方……"] = "(Muttering) Didn't say how much longer I had to lie here... but at least they're generous...",
    ["（咦，怎么没了？原来就是斯宾那奇的那副。）"] = "(Huh, why are they gone? It turns out they were just Spinach's pair.)",
    ["（哥哥班森还在出差，梅丽莎与这件事无关，应该不会受影响。）"] = "(My brother Benson is still away on business, and Melissa has nothing to do with this; she shouldn't be affected.)",
    ["（哦不……哪个倒霉蛋弄丢了车票？）"] = "(Oh no... which unlucky soul lost their ticket?)",
    ["（哭笑不得）这算是什么游戏……"] = "(Between laughter and tears) What kind of game is this...",
    ["（嘀咕）会长怎么成天讲些老掉牙的童话……"] = "(Muttering) Why does the president talk about old-fashioned fairy tales all day...",
    ["（嚼嚼嚼）也许它需要一些改进……"] = "(Chew chew chew) Maybe it needs some improvement...",
    ["（四）\n　　在山上找到了一颗琥珀，把佐治羡慕坏了。这是我在霍纳奇斯登山以来最特殊的一个登顶纪念品。\n　　奇怪的是，这颗琥珀是从什么时候到我手里的？我为什么会不记得？\n　　琥珀里还有一只小虫子，听说琥珀里面的虫子是跨越了千万年时间的“时间旅客”？千万年前的虫子长这样？"] = "(IV) \n　　Found an amber on the mountain, which made George very envious. This is the most special souvenir I've had since I started mountaineering in Hornacis. \n　　The strange thing is, when did this amber come into my hands? Why don't I remember? \n　　There is a small bug inside the amber. I heard that bugs in amber are \"time travelers\" that have crossed millions of years? Do bugs from millions of years ago look like this?",
    ["（四）有光的地方"] = "(IV) Where There Is Light",
    ["（回答名字）"] = "(State your name)",
    ["（因为动作还没到所以这里就先用黑屏替代一下后面补）"] = "(Because the action hasn't arrived yet, I'll use a black screen here as a placeholder and fill it in later)",
    ["（团队人数:%d/%d）"] = "(Group size: %d/%d)",
    ["（在命运面前，所有人都无能为力。但我想为他们带来笑容，哪怕只有一瞬……）"] = "(In the face of fate, everyone is powerless. But I want to bring them a smile, even if only for a moment...)",
    ["（基础移动专用，不建议技能内使用）"] = "(Basic movement exclusive, not recommended for use within skills).",
    ["（声音变大了一些，看来方向没错。）"] = "(The voice has gotten a bit louder; it seems I'm heading in the right direction.)",
    ["（声音开始发颤）可是，老师是守知派最后的导师，他一定知道“最后一页”的代价。"] = "(Voice begins to tremble) But, the teacher is the last mentor of the School of Knowledge. He must know the price of the \"last page.\"",
    ["（声音没有变化，似乎不是这个方向。）"] = "(The voice hasn't changed; it doesn't seem to be in this direction.)",
    ["（大喊）打人啦，有人在酒吧门口打人啦，快来看啊！"] = "(Shouts) Someone's fighting! Someone's fighting at the bar entrance, come look!",
