    ["（她很痛苦，像是正在忍受着非人的折磨。）"] = "(She is in great pain, as if enduring inhuman torment.)",
    ["（好强大的力量，是个非凡物品？不知道它的负面效果是什么……）"] = "(Such powerful strength, is it a Beyonder item? I wonder what its negative effect is...)",
    ["（好臭……）"] = "(It stinks...)",
    ["（如果是真正的古董，你家早就卖掉了……这家伙胆子很大嘛，警察都敢骗，等下要不要拔枪吓唬他？ ）"] = "(If it were a real antique, your family would have sold it long ago... This guy is quite bold, daring to lie to the police. Should I pull out my gun to scare him later?)",
    ["（如果这把押中了，就有钱交这个月的房租了。）"] = "(If I win this bet, I'll have money for this month's rent.)",
    ["（姐姐……是谁……）"] = "(Sister... who is...)",
