    ["（小声呢喃着什么……）"] = "(Whispering something...)",
    ["（小声嘀咕。的确是）相信我，你的记忆力一直都很好！"] = "（Whispering. It is indeed） Believe me, your memory has always been excellent!",
    ["（小声）你可以单独找我，她俩的审美糟糕极啦！"] = "(Whispering) You can find me alone, their aesthetic sense is terrible!",
    ["（小声）她那么能干，又招人喜欢，要是有一天觉得我太没用，离开我怎么办？"] = "(Whispering) She's so capable and well-liked. What if one day she thinks I'm too useless and leaves me?",
