    ["（我就是打了个小盹，怎么就不见了呢……唉。）"] = "(I just took a little nap, how did it disappear... sigh.)",
    ["（我被驯兽师占卜了命运？果然，天下没有免费的占卜。还是去干点正事吧。）"] = "(Was my fate divined by the Beast Tamer? As expected, there is no such thing as a free divination. Better get back to work.)",
