    ["（抬头）哈哈，你也被我逮到了！我要把你藏起来！"] = "(Looking up) Haha, I've caught you too! I'm going to hide you away!",
    ["（担心）还会有失败的概率吗？你们会有危险吗？"] = "(Worried) Is there still a chance of failure? Will you be in danger?",
    ["（拦住去路）哎，且慢，你要去哪。这位先生，恶龙酒吧门口不许寻衅滋事。"] = "(Blocking the way) Hey, hold on, where are you going? This gentleman, causing trouble at the entrance of the Dragon Bar is not allowed.",
    ["（指旁边）这一片，全是同一种。每年都有人来采。每年都有人死。"] = "(Pointing to the side) This entire area is the same kind. Every year people come to pick them. Every year people die.",
