    ["（歌颂者序列的戴里克导师应该知道如何解决波特的问题。）"] = "(Mentor Derrick of the Bard sequence should know how to solve Potter's problem.)",
    ["（此处有敲门声）"] = "(There is a knock on the door here)",
    ["（死而复活……我在扮演克莱恩，而且是穿越者？）"] = "(Resurrected from the dead... I am acting as Klein, and I'm a transmigrator?)",
    ["（沉思）这场危机还涉及知识与罗塞尔大帝，那我大概猜到那位女士的身份了。"] = "(Contemplating) This crisis also involves knowledge and Emperor Roselle, so I think I can guess the identity of that lady.",
    ["（没有被污染的痕迹，回荡不散的口风琴声，应该是来自艾登残留的念想。）"] = "(No traces of corruption, the lingering sound of the harmonica—it must be the residual thoughts of Aiden.)",
    ["（测试用）卜杖寻路未找到单位，请确认填写ID准确性！"] = "(For testing) Dowsing Rod Navigation. did not find the unit; please confirm the accuracy of the filled ID!",
    ["（深呼吸）只有喝下它，才能步入非凡世界，成为一个真正的非凡者。"] = "(Deep breath) Only by drinking it can I step into the Extraordinary World and become a true Beyonder.",
    ["（深呼吸）我能做到的……我可以的！是时候展现努力的成果了……"] = "(Deep breath) I can do it... I can! It's time to show the results of my hard work...",
    ["（激动地望向你）年轻人，你也是来投入新时代的建设的吗？！"] = "(Looking at you excitedly) Young person, are you also here to contribute to the construction of the new era?!",
    ["（灵体之线附身后）您好……"] = "(After being possessed by spirit body threads) Hello...",
    ["（灵性直觉让你下意识拒绝）不了，我自己去就可以。"] = "(Spiritual intuition makes you subconsciously refuse) No, I can go by myself.",
    ["（灵性追溯测试用）"] = "(For Spiritual Retrospection test)",
    ["（点头）"] = "(Nod)",
    ["（点头）他还以为自己真的已经踏进了上流社会。"] = "(Nods) He actually thought he had already stepped into high society.",
    ["（点完一盏，还有一盏……）"] = "(After lighting one lamp, there is still another...)",
    ["（犹豫）你到底想做什么？"] = "(Hesitates) What exactly do you want to do?",
    ["（犹豫）虽然很有气势，但实在是太难听了。"] = "(Hesitates) Although it was very imposing, it was truly terrible to listen to.",
    ["（玩家战损的面部特写）你的表情绝望崩溃"] = "(Player's battle-damaged face close-up) Your expression is desperate and broken",
    ["（环视一周）……显然没过过好日子的人是想象不出来华丽宫殿长什么样子的。"] = "(Looking around) ...Clearly, someone who has never lived a good life cannot imagine what a magnificent palace looks like.",
    ["（琳达从哪里拿了副拳套？）"] = "(Where did Linda get a pair of boxing gloves?)",
    ["（琳达的灵性状况是个普通人，没有成为非凡者。她的心情很愉快，还有些亢奋。）"] = "(Linda's spirituality status is that of an ordinary person, not a Beyonder. Her mood is very happy and a bit excited.)",
    ["（生气）喵呜！"] = "(Angry) Meow!",
    ["（用卜杖寻路，应该能找到琳达在哪。）"] = "(Using Dowsing Rod Navigation, I should be able to find where Linda is.)",
    ["（畅销书和校园话剧？历史学似乎也变得火热了起来。）"] = "(Best-selling books and campus plays? History seems to have become popular as well.)",
    ["（皮特已经不在了……得整理他遗留的物品。）"] = "(Pete is gone... need to organize the items he left behind.)",
    ["（皱眉）他家里不是不宽裕吗，哪来的钱天天喝酒？  "] = "(Frowns) Isn't his family not well-off? Where does he get the money to drink every day?",
    ["（皱眉）先去墓地广场看看。"] = "(Frowning) Let's go to the cemetery square first to take a look.",
    ["（目前支持坐骑16,互动技能7-10（包括坐骑技能和邀请同乘）有新需求@zhangfeng15）\n（哪些槽位被支持可参见文档https://docs.corp.kuaishou.com/s/home/fcACBLkzMeANRYSjc6F8yZqGP）"] = "(Currently supports mounts 16, interactive skills 7-10 (including mount skills and inviting Ride Along). New requirements @zhangfeng15) \n (Which slots are supported can be seen in the document https://docs.corp.kuaishou.com/s/home/fcACBLkzMeANRYSjc6F8yZqGP).",
    ["（盯……）"] = "(Stare...)",
    ["（看向玩家） 这位{{先生|女士}}，你也是来做义工的吗？"] = "(Looking at the player) This {{gentleman|lady}}, are you also here to volunteer?",
    ["（看来不用太担心他了）"] = "(It seems I don't need to worry about him too much.)",
    ["（看来他也暂时无法清醒，这周围也许有知识的谜题。）"] = "(It seems he cannot wake up for the time being; there might be a puzzle of knowledge around here.)",
    ["（看来是沉浸在创作之中了，暂时还是先不要打扰她吧。）"] = "(Looks like she is immersed in creation, better not disturb her for now.)",
    ["（真是太粗鲁了，不明白爸爸为什么喜欢来这个地方……）"] = "(It's so rude, I don't understand why Dad likes coming to this place...)",
    ["（真造，昏迷CS）"] = "(True Creator, Unconscious Cutscene)",
    ["（眼瞅着俩小孩一溜烟跑没影了）算了算了，就当是吃亏长见识了，这俩小崽子，下次让我在廷根见到了，非好好教训他们一顿！"] = "(Watching the two children run out of sight) Forget it, forget it. Just consider it a lesson learned. Those two little brats, if I see them in Tingen next time, I'll definitely teach them a good lesson!",
    ["（眼神不时地往右前方瞟，似乎无心看书）"] = "(Eyes glancing to the front right from time to time, seemingly not in the mood to read)",
    ["（眼神不时地往左前方瞟，似乎无心看书）"] = "(Eyes glancing to the front left from time to time, seemingly not in the mood to read)",
    ["（祝贺你，海默教授，看来你找到了更好的办法。）"] = "(Congratulations, Professor Hamer, it seems you have found a better way.)",
    ["（祝贺你，米勒教授，看来你找到了更好的办法。）"] = "(Congratulations, Professor Miller, it seems you have found a better way.)",
    ["（禁疗）"] = "(Healing Forbidden)",
    ["（空气中，传来一阵美妙的旋律……）"] = "(A beautiful melody drifts through the air...)",
    ["（窃取机制开始）"] = "(Theft mechanism started)",
    ["（窘迫）您眼光很好，只是……价格对于我们的家庭来说，有些昂贵。"] = "(Embarrassed) You have a good eye, it's just... the price is a bit expensive for our family.",
    ["（站起来）这座山还有北坡没有普查。北坡的土壤成分和这边不一样，可能会有新种。"] = "(Standing up) The north slope of this mountain hasn't been surveyed yet. The soil composition on the north slope is different from here; there might be new species.",
    ["（站起身）我答应过教你神秘学知识。"] = "(Standing up) I promised to teach you occult knowledge.",
    ["（笑）既然她不想暴露，就当我们不知道吧。"] = "(Smiling) Since she doesn't want to be exposed, let's pretend we don't know.",
    ["（笑）比起侠盗，你的语气更像一位哲学家，好心人。"] = "(Smiling) Rather than a chivalrous thief, your tone is more like a philosopher, kind soul.",
    ["（笑）苏茜女士真是厉害啊！"] = "(Laughing) Miss Susie is truly amazing!",
    ["（笑）麻雀也想变凤凰？少看点老掉牙的童话吧。 "] = "(Laughs) A sparrow wanting to become a phoenix? Stop reading those stale fairy tales.",
    ["（等等……施佩尔先生写的台词……）"] = "(Wait... the lines Mr. Speer wrote...)",
    ["（等等……这肖像右耳垂上的黑痣，跟阿兹克教员黑痣的位置一模一样！）"] = "(Wait... the mole on the right earlobe of this portrait is in the exact same position as the mole on Instructor Azik!)",
    ["（等等……那个拳套的灵性很强。难道是神奇物品？）"] = "(Wait... that pair of boxing gloves has strong spirituality. Could it be a mystical item?)",
    ["（精神或记忆领域的专家？会不会暴露更大的秘密？）"] = "(An expert in the field of mind or memory? Could this expose a bigger secret?)",
    ["（糟了，快制止他们。）"] = "(Oh no, stop them quickly.)",
    ["（红月，难道……是原始月亮……）"] = "(The Red Moon, could it be... the Primordial Moon...)",
    ["（缓缓摇了摇头）我都想起来了……我已经不需要消化魔药了，我……已经死了。"] = "(Slowly shaking head) I remember everything now... I no longer need to digest the potion. I... am already dead.",
    ["（罗塞尔）一月一日，弗洛纳尔夫人真是个尤物……\n（克莱恩）一月三日，当初的选择还是太草率了……"] = "(Roselle) January 1st, Lady Flonal is truly a stunner...\n (Klein) January 3rd, the initial choice was still too rash...",
    ["（罗塞尔）我的外交委员会的先生们都是蠢驴！\n（克莱恩）不管是学徒 还是占卜家 偷盗者 都更加地好"] = "(Roselle) The gentlemen on my diplomatic committee are all donkeys! \n (Klein) Whether it's an Apprentice, a Seer, or a Marauder, they are all much better",
    ["（罗珊捡）报销单"] = "(Picked up by Rozanne) Reimbursement Form",
    ["（翻开旧书，从书脊夹层中取出一叠泛黄的手稿，递给玩家）这个，给你。"] = "(Opening an old book, taking out a stack of yellowed manuscripts from the spine, and handing them to the player) This, for you.",
    ["（脚步声……有人走过来了。）"] = "(Footsteps... someone is coming over.)",
    ["（自己对照用）循声开始范围"] = "(For personal reference) Sound-tracking start range",
    ["（自用）preload范围调试"] = "(Self-use) Preload Range Debugging",
    ["（自由的声音）我承诺永远行于路上 永远追逐自由"] = "(Voice of Freedom) I promise to always walk on the road, always chasing freedom",
    ["（自由的声音）我祈愿获得旅行家的恩赐 我祈求获得穿梭的许可"] = "(Voice of Freedom) I pray to receive the Traveler's gift, I pray to receive the permission to traverse",
    ["（艾登……）"] = "(Aiden...)",
