    ["（表现气口）"] = "(Acting out the air intake)",
    ["（表现环）"] = "(Acting out the ring)",
    ["（被发现的话，扮演就失败了！呼，一定不能见专家。）"] = "(If discovered, the acting will fail! Phew, must not see the expert.)",
    ["（角色通用）控制抗性衰减被动"] = "(General Character) Crowd Control Resistance Decay Passive",
    ["（记忆中皮特还算懂事……不知道为什么会这样？）"] = "(In my memory, Pete was quite sensible... I don't know why it turned out like this?)",
    ["（记忆有些生疏，却会推动我去做一些事……）"] = "(The memories are a bit rusty, but they push me to do certain things...)",
    ["（诚恳）你要不要去报个歌唱班？我认识一个老师，教得挺好的。"] = "(Sincere) Would you like to sign up for a singing class? I know a teacher who teaches quite well.",
    ["（询问《调教的艺术》）"] = "(Ask about 'The Art of Discipline')",
    ["（该怎么把卡门从墙上弄下来呢？）"] = "(How should I get Carmen down from the wall?)",
    ["（该死！我差点被坑死，为什么还要管他？）"] = "(Damn it! I was almost killed because of him, why should I still care about him?)",
    ["（该死，记忆里的情感，好像越来越真实……）"] = "(Damn it, the emotions in my memory seem to be getting more and more real...)",
    ["（语气古怪）不过，能把这些事推到祂身上，某种程度上我也感谢祂。"] = "(Tone is strange) However, being able to push these things onto Him, to some extent, I am also grateful to Him.",
    ["（赛琳娜变异）"] = "(Selena Mutation)",
    ["（赛琳娜大概率是向邪恶的存在祈祷 这样下去她会变成恶灵 在场的所有人都有危险……最好立刻进行中断仪式）"] = "(Selena is most likely praying to an evil existence. If this continues, she will become an evil spirit, and everyone present will be in danger... it's best to perform an interrupted ritual immediately.)",
    ["（走到工作台旁）佐伊，学院来信了。你的课题占用教研室太久了，需要腾出来给新项目。"] = "(Walking to the workbench) Zoe, there's a letter from the academy. Your project has occupied the research room for too long; it needs to be cleared for a new project.",
    ["（跟随心愿凭空而起的建筑！赞美愚者！）"] = "(A building that rose from thin air following a wish! Praise the Fool!)",
    ["（轻微颔首）"] = "(Nod slightly)",
    ["（这个乐谱的旋律，似乎跟回荡的琴声有些相似……）"] = "(The melody of this sheet music seems somewhat similar to the echoing harmonica sound...)",
    ["（这个女人真是……不行，我怎么开始期待接下来会发生什么了？）"] = "(This woman is really... no, why am I starting to look forward to what happens next?)",
    ["（这个男子似乎有线索，但不愿意直说，用灵视观察一下……）"] = "(This man seems to have a clue but is unwilling to say it directly. Let me observe with Spirit Vision...)",
    ["（这位男性似乎在希望得到莉娜的垂爱，要不要跟着起哄呢？）"] = "(This man seems to be hoping to get Lena's favor, should I join in the fun?)",
    ["（这好像阿兹克先生啊……）"] = "(This looks like Mr. Azik...)",
    ["（这就是阿兹克先生！）"] = "(This is Mr. Azik!)",
    ["（这是……口风琴？上面还刻了字……）"] = "(Is this... a harmonica? There are even words engraved on it...)",
    ["（这是谁落下的战书？去猎犬酒吧附近找找看吧。）"] = "(Whose challenge letter is this? I should go look for it near the Hound Bar.)",
    ["（这样下去永无止尽……而且总感觉会被宰一笔……）我需要考虑一下再做决定。"] = "(This will go on forever... and I have a feeling I'm going to get ripped off...) I need to think about it before making a decision.",
    ["（这里可真是最佳观赏位。）"] = "(This is truly the best viewing spot.)",
    ["（这里接入sequence：罗珊和安多跑向入口，亡灵叫罗珊，大家出现解围，伦纳德催眠安多）"] = "(Here connects to sequence: Rozanne and Ando run to the entrance, the undead calls Rozanne, everyone appears to help, Leonard hypnotizes Ando)",
    ["（这里是洪流的开始点位"] = "(This is the starting point of the torrent",
    ["（这里是流浪汉住的地方吗……）"] = "(Is this where the homeless live...)",
    ["（这里有个徽章，有点熟悉……这里还有一行字……）"] = "(There's a badge here, it looks a bit familiar... and there's a line of text here too...)",
    ["（进入占卜俱乐部）"] = "(Entering the Divination Club)",
    ["（选项环）"] = "(Option ring)",
    ["（递过洪流）"] = "(Hands over the Torrent)",
    ["（那副拳套……和琳达的很像。老维德还有一副？）"] = "(That pair of gloves... they look a lot like Linda's. Does Old Wade have another pair?)",
    ["（那时候我还是个还没出过海的小水手呢。）"] = "(Back then, I was still a little sailor who hadn't been out to sea yet.)",
    ["（那种被注视的感觉没有消失，非凡者能跑的比马车还快？）"] = "(That feeling of being watched hasn't disappeared. Can Beyonders really run faster than a carriage?)",
    ["（郑重点头）我懂了。"] = "(Nods solemnly) I understand.",
    ["（都点亮了！这条路终于恢复光明了！过段时间再来看看吧）"] = "(They're all lit up! This path has finally been restored to light! I'll come back to check on it in a while.)",
    ["（钱真不禁花啊，之前真是辛苦班森了……）"] = "(Money really doesn't last long. Benson really had it hard before...)",
    ["（镜头转向环境）你站在一条通道上，两边布满雕像"] = "(Camera turns to the environment) You are standing in a corridor, filled with sculptures on both sides.",
