    ["（阿兹克先生，其实你真的可以慎重考虑下自己是否还在“人”这个范畴内……） "] = "(Mr. Azik, actually, you really should carefully consider whether you are still within the category of 'human'...)",
    ["（陌生的森林、脑子里的另一个声音、诡异血红的画面……）"] = "(A strange forest, another voice in my head, eerie blood-red scenes...)",
    ["（难怪“愚者”先生说，罗塞尔大帝没有给后来者留下任何装逼的机会。）"] = "(No wonder Mr. Fool said that Emperor Roselle didn't leave any chance for latecomers to show off.)",
    ["（难怪“星星”先生说，弗莱是一位值得信赖的队长。）"] = "(No wonder Mr. Star said that Frye is a trustworthy captain.)",
    ["（难道是……嫁接的非凡力量不太稳定？）"] = "(Could it be... that the Beyonder power of Grafting is unstable?)",
    ["（露出“我都懂”的笑容）好吧，那你记得转告你那位朋友。"] = "(Smiles with an \"I understand everything\" expression) Alright, then remember to pass the message on to your friend.",
    ["（露出怀念的神色）这是父亲的领带，我又怎么会认错呢？"] = "(Shows a nostalgic expression) This is my father's tie, how could I possibly mistake it?",
